INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_1","002_1_1","GEN","1","1","1","In the beginning God created the heavens and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_2","002_1_2","GEN","1","2","2","Now the earth was formless and void, and darkness was over the surface of the deep. And the Spirit of God was hovering over the surface of the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_3","002_1_3","GEN","1","3","3","And God said, “Let there be light,” and there was light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_4","002_1_4","GEN","1","4","4","And God saw that the light was good, and He separated the light from the darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_5","002_1_5","GEN","1","5","5","God called the light “day,” and the darkness He called “night.” And there was evening, and there was morning—the first day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_6","002_1_6","GEN","1","6","6","And God said, “Let there be an expanse between the waters, to separate the waters from the waters.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_7","002_1_7","GEN","1","7","7","So God made the expanse and separated the waters beneath it from the waters above. And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_8","002_1_8","GEN","1","8","8","God called the expanse “sky.” And there was evening, and there was morning—the second day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_9","002_1_9","GEN","1","9","9","And God said, “Let the waters under the sky be gathered into one place, so that the dry land may appear.” And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_10","002_1_10","GEN","1","10","10","God called the dry land “earth,” and the gathering of waters He called “seas.” And God saw that it was good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_11","002_1_11","GEN","1","11","11","Then God said, “Let the earth bring forth vegetation: seed-bearing plants and fruit trees, each bearing fruit with seed according to its kind.” And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_12","002_1_12","GEN","1","12","12","The earth produced vegetation: seed-bearing plants according to their kinds and trees bearing fruit with seed according to their kinds. And God saw that it was good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_13","002_1_13","GEN","1","13","13","And there was evening, and there was morning—the third day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_14","002_1_14","GEN","1","14","14","And God said, “Let there be lights in the expanse of the sky to distinguish between the day and the night, and let them be signs to mark the seasons and days and years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_15","002_1_15","GEN","1","15","15","And let them serve as lights in the expanse of the sky to shine upon the earth.” And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_16","002_1_16","GEN","1","16","16","God made two great lights: the greater light to rule the day and the lesser light to rule the night. And He made the stars as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_17","002_1_17","GEN","1","17","17","God set these lights in the expanse of the sky to shine upon the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_18","002_1_18","GEN","1","18","18","to preside over the day and the night, and to separate the light from the darkness. And God saw that it was good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_19","002_1_19","GEN","1","19","19","And there was evening, and there was morning—the fourth day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_20","002_1_20","GEN","1","20","20","And God said, “Let the waters teem with living creatures, and let birds fly above the earth in the open expanse of the sky.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_21","002_1_21","GEN","1","21","21","So God created the great sea creatures and every living thing that moves, with which the waters teemed according to their kinds, and every winged bird after its kind. And God saw that it was good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_22","002_1_22","GEN","1","22","22","Then God blessed them and said, “Be fruitful and multiply and fill the waters of the seas, and let birds multiply on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_23","002_1_23","GEN","1","23","23","And there was evening, and there was morning—the fifth day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_24","002_1_24","GEN","1","24","24","And God said, “Let the earth bring forth living creatures according to their kinds: livestock, land crawlers, and beasts of the earth according to their kinds.” And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_25","002_1_25","GEN","1","25","25","God made the beasts of the earth according to their kinds, the livestock according to their kinds, and everything that crawls upon the earth according to its kind. And God saw that it was good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_26","002_1_26","GEN","1","26","26","Then God said, “Let Us make man in Our image, after Our likeness, to rule over the fish of the sea and the birds of the air, over the livestock, and over all the earth itself and every creature that crawls upon it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_27","002_1_27","GEN","1","27","27","So God created man in His own image; in the image of God He created him; male and female He created them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_28","002_1_28","GEN","1","28","28","God blessed them and said to them, “Be fruitful and multiply, and fill the earth and subdue it; rule over the fish of the sea and the birds of the air and every creature that crawls upon the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_29","002_1_29","GEN","1","29","29","Then God said, “Behold, I have given you every seed-bearing plant on the face of all the earth, and every tree whose fruit contains seed. They will be yours for food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_30","002_1_30","GEN","1","30","30","And to every beast of the earth and every bird of the air and every creature that crawls upon the earth—everything that has the breath of life in it—I have given every green plant for food.” And it was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN1_31","002_1_31","GEN","1","31","31","And God looked upon all that He had made, and indeed, it was very good. And there was evening, and there was morning—the sixth day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_1","002_2_1","GEN","2","1","1","Thus the heavens and the earth were completed in all their vast array. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_2","002_2_2","GEN","2","2","2","And by the seventh day God had finished the work He had been doing; so on that day He rested from all His work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_3","002_2_3","GEN","2","3","3","Then God blessed the seventh day and sanctified it, because on that day He rested from all the work of creation that He had accomplished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_4","002_2_4","GEN","2","4","4","This is the account of the heavens and the earth when they were created, in the day that the LORD God made them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_5","002_2_5","GEN","2","5","5","Now no shrub of the field had yet appeared on the earth, nor had any plant of the field sprouted, for the LORD God had not yet sent rain upon the earth, and there was no man to cultivate the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_6","002_2_6","GEN","2","6","6","But springs welled up from the earth and watered the whole surface of the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_7","002_2_7","GEN","2","7","7","Then the LORD God formed man from the dust of the ground and breathed the breath of life into his nostrils, and the man became a living being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_8","002_2_8","GEN","2","8","8","And the LORD God planted a garden in Eden, in the east, where He placed the man He had formed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_9","002_2_9","GEN","2","9","9","Out of the ground the LORD God gave growth to every tree that is pleasing to the eye and good for food. And in the middle of the garden were the tree of life and the tree of the knowledge of good and evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_10","002_2_10","GEN","2","10","10","Now a river flowed out of Eden to water the garden, and from there it branched into four headwaters: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_11","002_2_11","GEN","2","11","11","The name of the first river is the Pishon; it winds through the whole land of Havilah, where there is gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_12","002_2_12","GEN","2","12","12","And the gold of that land is pure, and bdellium and onyx are found there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_13","002_2_13","GEN","2","13","13","The name of the second river is the Gihon; it winds through the whole land of Cush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_14","002_2_14","GEN","2","14","14","The name of the third river is the Tigris; it runs along the east side of Assyria. And the fourth river is the Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_15","002_2_15","GEN","2","15","15","Then the LORD God took the man and placed him in the Garden of Eden to cultivate and keep it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_16","002_2_16","GEN","2","16","16","And the LORD God commanded him, “You may eat freely from every tree of the garden, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_17","002_2_17","GEN","2","17","17","but you must not eat from the tree of the knowledge of good and evil; for in the day that you eat of it, you will surely die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_18","002_2_18","GEN","2","18","18","The LORD God also said, “It is not good for the man to be alone. I will make for him a suitable helper.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_19","002_2_19","GEN","2","19","19","And out of the ground the LORD God formed every beast of the field and every bird of the air, and He brought them to the man to see what he would name each one. And whatever the man called each living creature, that was its name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_20","002_2_20","GEN","2","20","20","The man gave names to all the livestock, to the birds of the air, and to every beast of the field. But for Adam no suitable helper was found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_21","002_2_21","GEN","2","21","21","So the LORD God caused the man to fall into a deep sleep, and while he slept, He took one of the man’s ribs and closed up the area with flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_22","002_2_22","GEN","2","22","22","And from the rib that the LORD God had taken from the man, He made a woman and brought her to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_23","002_2_23","GEN","2","23","23","And the man said: “This is now bone of my bones and flesh of my flesh; she shall be called ‘woman,’ for out of man she was taken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_24","002_2_24","GEN","2","24","24","For this reason a man will leave his father and mother and be united to his wife, and they will become one flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN2_25","002_2_25","GEN","2","25","25","And the man and his wife were both naked, and they were not ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_1","002_3_1","GEN","3","1","1","Now the serpent was more crafty than any beast of the field that the LORD God had made. And he said to the woman, “Did God really say, ‘You must not eat from any tree in the garden?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_2","002_3_2","GEN","3","2","2","The woman answered the serpent, “We may eat the fruit of the trees of the garden, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_3","002_3_3","GEN","3","3","3","but about the fruit of the tree in the middle of the garden, God has said, ‘You must not eat of it or touch it, or you will die.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_4","002_3_4","GEN","3","4","4","“You will not surely die,” the serpent told the woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_5","002_3_5","GEN","3","5","5","“For God knows that in the day you eat of it, your eyes will be opened and you will be like God, knowing good and evil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_6","002_3_6","GEN","3","6","6","When the woman saw that the tree was good for food and pleasing to the eyes, and that it was desirable for obtaining wisdom, she took the fruit and ate it. She also gave some to her husband who was with her, and he ate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_7","002_3_7","GEN","3","7","7","And the eyes of both of them were opened, and they knew that they were naked; so they sewed together fig leaves and made coverings for themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_8","002_3_8","GEN","3","8","8","Then the man and his wife heard the voice of the LORD God walking in the garden in the breeze of the day, and they hid themselves from the presence of the LORD God among the trees of the garden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_9","002_3_9","GEN","3","9","9","But the LORD God called out to the man, “Where are you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_10","002_3_10","GEN","3","10","10","“I heard Your voice in the garden,” he replied, “and I was afraid because I was naked; so I hid myself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_11","002_3_11","GEN","3","11","11","“Who told you that you were naked?” asked the LORD God. “Have you eaten from the tree of which I commanded you not to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_12","002_3_12","GEN","3","12","12","And the man answered, “The woman whom You gave me, she gave me fruit from the tree, and I ate it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_13","002_3_13","GEN","3","13","13","Then the LORD God said to the woman, “What is this you have done?” “The serpent deceived me,” she replied, “and I ate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_14","002_3_14","GEN","3","14","14","So the LORD God said to the serpent: “Because you have done this, cursed are you above all livestock and every beast of the field! On your belly will you go, and dust you will eat, all the days of your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_15","002_3_15","GEN","3","15","15","And I will put enmity between you and the woman, and between your seed and her seed. He will crush your head, and you will strike his heel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_16","002_3_16","GEN","3","16","16","To the woman He said: “I will sharply increase your pain in childbirth; in pain you will bring forth children. Your desire will be for your husband, and he will rule over you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_17","002_3_17","GEN","3","17","17","And to Adam He said: “Because you have listened to the voice of your wife and have eaten from the tree of which I commanded you not to eat, cursed is the ground because of you; through toil you will eat of it all the days of your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_18","002_3_18","GEN","3","18","18","Both thorns and thistles it will yield for you, and you will eat the plants of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_19","002_3_19","GEN","3","19","19","By the sweat of your brow you will eat your bread, until you return to the ground—because out of it were you taken. For dust you are, and to dust you shall return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_20","002_3_20","GEN","3","20","20","And Adam named his wife Eve, because she would be the mother of all the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_21","002_3_21","GEN","3","21","21","And the LORD God made garments of skin for Adam and his wife, and He clothed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_22","002_3_22","GEN","3","22","22","Then the LORD God said, “Behold, the man has become like one of Us, knowing good and evil. And now, lest he reach out his hand and take also from the tree of life, and eat, and live forever...” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_23","002_3_23","GEN","3","23","23","Therefore the LORD God banished him from the Garden of Eden to work the ground from which he had been taken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN3_24","002_3_24","GEN","3","24","24","So He drove out the man and stationed cherubim on the east side of the Garden of Eden, along with a whirling sword of flame to guard the way to the tree of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_1","002_4_1","GEN","4","1","1","And Adam had relations with his wife Eve, and she conceived and gave birth to Cain. “With the help of the LORD I have brought forth a man,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_2","002_4_2","GEN","4","2","2","Later she gave birth to Cain’s brother Abel. Now Abel was a keeper of sheep, while Cain was a tiller of the soil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_3","002_4_3","GEN","4","3","3","So in the course of time, Cain brought some of the fruit of the soil as an offering to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_4","002_4_4","GEN","4","4","4","while Abel brought the best portions of the firstborn of his flock. And the LORD looked with favor on Abel and his offering, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_5","002_4_5","GEN","4","5","5","but He had no regard for Cain and his offering. So Cain became very angry, and his countenance fell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_6","002_4_6","GEN","4","6","6","“Why are you angry,” said the LORD to Cain, “and why has your countenance fallen? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_7","002_4_7","GEN","4","7","7","If you do what is right, will you not be accepted? But if you refuse to do what is right, sin is crouching at your door; it desires you, but you must master it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_8","002_4_8","GEN","4","8","8","Then Cain said to his brother Abel, “Let us go out to the field.” And while they were in the field, Cain rose up against his brother Abel and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_9","002_4_9","GEN","4","9","9","And the LORD said to Cain, “Where is your brother Abel?” “I do not know!” he answered. “Am I my brother’s keeper?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_10","002_4_10","GEN","4","10","10","“What have you done?” replied the LORD. “The voice of your brother’s blood cries out to Me from the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_11","002_4_11","GEN","4","11","11","Now you are cursed and banished from the ground, which has opened its mouth to receive your brother’s blood from your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_12","002_4_12","GEN","4","12","12","When you till the ground, it will no longer yield its produce to you. You will be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_13","002_4_13","GEN","4","13","13","But Cain said to the LORD, “My punishment is greater than I can bear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_14","002_4_14","GEN","4","14","14","Behold, this day You have driven me from the face of the earth, and from Your face I will be hidden; I will be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth, and whoever finds me will kill me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_15","002_4_15","GEN","4","15","15","“Not so!” replied the LORD. “If anyone slays Cain, then Cain will be avenged sevenfold.” And the LORD placed a mark on Cain, so that no one who found him would kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_16","002_4_16","GEN","4","16","16","So Cain went out from the presence of the LORD and settled in the land of Nod, east of Eden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_17","002_4_17","GEN","4","17","17","And Cain had relations with his wife, and she conceived and gave birth to Enoch. Then Cain built a city and named it after his son Enoch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_18","002_4_18","GEN","4","18","18","Now to Enoch was born Irad, and Irad was the father of Mehujael, and Mehujael was the father of Methusael, and Methusael was the father of Lamech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_19","002_4_19","GEN","4","19","19","And Lamech married two women, one named Adah and the other Zillah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_20","002_4_20","GEN","4","20","20","Adah gave birth to Jabal; he was the father of those who dwell in tents and raise livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_21","002_4_21","GEN","4","21","21","And his brother’s name was Jubal; he was the father of all who play the harp and flute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_22","002_4_22","GEN","4","22","22","And Zillah gave birth to Tubal-cain, a forger of every implement of bronze and iron. And the sister of Tubal-cain was Naamah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_23","002_4_23","GEN","4","23","23","Then Lamech said to his wives: “Adah and Zillah, hear my voice; wives of Lamech, listen to my speech. For I have slain a man for wounding me, a young man for striking me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_24","002_4_24","GEN","4","24","24","If Cain is avenged sevenfold, then Lamech seventy-sevenfold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_25","002_4_25","GEN","4","25","25","And Adam again had relations with his wife, and she gave birth to a son and named him Seth, saying, “God has granted me another seed in place of Abel, since Cain killed him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN4_26","002_4_26","GEN","4","26","26","And to Seth also a son was born, and he called him Enosh. At that time men began to call upon the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_1","002_5_1","GEN","5","1","1","This is the book of the generations of Adam. In the day that God created man, He made him in His own likeness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_2","002_5_2","GEN","5","2","2","Male and female He created them, and He blessed them. And in the day they were created, He called them “man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_3","002_5_3","GEN","5","3","3","When Adam was 130 years old, he had a son in his own likeness, after his own image; and he named him Seth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_4","002_5_4","GEN","5","4","4","And after he had become the father of Seth, Adam lived 800 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_5","002_5_5","GEN","5","5","5","So Adam lived a total of 930 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_6","002_5_6","GEN","5","6","6","When Seth was 105 years old, he became the father of Enosh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_7","002_5_7","GEN","5","7","7","And after he had become the father of Enosh, Seth lived 807 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_8","002_5_8","GEN","5","8","8","So Seth lived a total of 912 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_9","002_5_9","GEN","5","9","9","When Enosh was 90 years old, he became the father of Kenan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_10","002_5_10","GEN","5","10","10","And after he had become the father of Kenan, Enosh lived 815 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_11","002_5_11","GEN","5","11","11","So Enosh lived a total of 905 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_12","002_5_12","GEN","5","12","12","When Kenan was 70 years old, he became the father of Mahalalel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_13","002_5_13","GEN","5","13","13","And after he had become the father of Mahalalel, Kenan lived 840 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_14","002_5_14","GEN","5","14","14","So Kenan lived a total of 910 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_15","002_5_15","GEN","5","15","15","When Mahalalel was 65 years old, he became the father of Jared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_16","002_5_16","GEN","5","16","16","And after he had become the father of Jared, Mahalalel lived 830 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_17","002_5_17","GEN","5","17","17","So Mahalalel lived a total of 895 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_18","002_5_18","GEN","5","18","18","When Jared was 162 years old, he became the father of Enoch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_19","002_5_19","GEN","5","19","19","And after he had become the father of Enoch, Jared lived 800 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_20","002_5_20","GEN","5","20","20","So Jared lived a total of 962 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_21","002_5_21","GEN","5","21","21","When Enoch was 65 years old, he became the father of Methuselah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_22","002_5_22","GEN","5","22","22","And after he had become the father of Methuselah, Enoch walked with God 300 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_23","002_5_23","GEN","5","23","23","So Enoch lived a total of 365 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_24","002_5_24","GEN","5","24","24","Enoch walked with God, and then he was no more, because God had taken him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_25","002_5_25","GEN","5","25","25","When Methuselah was 187 years old, he became the father of Lamech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_26","002_5_26","GEN","5","26","26","And after he had become the father of Lamech, Methuselah lived 782 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_27","002_5_27","GEN","5","27","27","So Methuselah lived a total of 969 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_28","002_5_28","GEN","5","28","28","When Lamech was 182 years old, he had a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_29","002_5_29","GEN","5","29","29","And he named him Noah, saying, “May this one comfort us in the labor and toil of our hands caused by the ground that the LORD has cursed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_30","002_5_30","GEN","5","30","30","And after he had become the father of Noah, Lamech lived 595 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_31","002_5_31","GEN","5","31","31","So Lamech lived a total of 777 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN5_32","002_5_32","GEN","5","32","32","After Noah was 500 years old, he became the father of Shem, Ham, and Japheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_1","002_6_1","GEN","6","1","1","Now when men began to multiply on the face of the earth and daughters were born to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_2","002_6_2","GEN","6","2","2","the sons of God saw that the daughters of men were beautiful, and they took as wives whomever they chose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_3","002_6_3","GEN","6","3","3","So the LORD said, “My Spirit will not contend with man forever, for he is mortal; his days shall be 120 years.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_4","002_6_4","GEN","6","4","4","The Nephilim were on the earth in those days—and afterward as well—when the sons of God had relations with the daughters of men. And they bore them children who became the mighty men of old, men of renown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_5","002_6_5","GEN","6","5","5","Then the LORD saw that the wickedness of man was great upon the earth, and that every inclination of the thoughts of his heart was altogether evil all the time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_6","002_6_6","GEN","6","6","6","And the LORD regretted that He had made man on the earth, and He was grieved in His heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_7","002_6_7","GEN","6","7","7","So the LORD said, “I will blot out man, whom I have created, from the face of the earth—every man and beast and crawling creature and bird of the air—for I am grieved that I have made them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_8","002_6_8","GEN","6","8","8","Noah, however, found favor in the eyes of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_9","002_6_9","GEN","6","9","9","This is the account of Noah. Noah was a righteous man, blameless in his generation; Noah walked with God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_10","002_6_10","GEN","6","10","10","And Noah had three sons: Shem, Ham, and Japheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_11","002_6_11","GEN","6","11","11","Now the earth was corrupt in the sight of God, and full of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_12","002_6_12","GEN","6","12","12","And God looked upon the earth and saw that it was corrupt; for all living creatures on the earth had corrupted their ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_13","002_6_13","GEN","6","13","13","Then God said to Noah, “The end of all living creatures has come before Me, because through them the earth is full of violence. Now behold, I will destroy both them and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_14","002_6_14","GEN","6","14","14","Make for yourself an ark of gopher wood; make rooms in the ark and coat it with pitch inside and out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_15","002_6_15","GEN","6","15","15","And this is how you are to build it: The ark is to be 300 cubits long, 50 cubits wide, and 30 cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_16","002_6_16","GEN","6","16","16","You are to make a roof for the ark, finish its walls a cubit from the top, place a door in the side of the ark, and build lower, middle, and upper decks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_17","002_6_17","GEN","6","17","17","And behold, I will bring floodwaters upon the earth to destroy every creature under the heavens that has the breath of life. Everything on the earth will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_18","002_6_18","GEN","6","18","18","But I will establish My covenant with you, and you will enter the ark—you and your sons and your wife and your sons’ wives with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_19","002_6_19","GEN","6","19","19","And you are to bring two of every living creature into the ark—male and female—to keep them alive with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_20","002_6_20","GEN","6","20","20","Two of every kind of bird and animal and crawling creature will come to you to be kept alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_21","002_6_21","GEN","6","21","21","You are also to take for yourself every kind of food that is eaten and gather it as food for yourselves and for the animals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN6_22","002_6_22","GEN","6","22","22","So Noah did everything precisely as God had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_1","002_7_1","GEN","7","1","1","Then the LORD said to Noah, “Go into the ark, you and all your family, because I have found you righteous in this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_2","002_7_2","GEN","7","2","2","You are to take with you seven pairs of every kind of clean animal, a male and its mate; a pair of every kind of unclean animal, a male and its mate; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_3","002_7_3","GEN","7","3","3","and seven pairs of every kind of bird of the air, male and female, to preserve their offspring on the face of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_4","002_7_4","GEN","7","4","4","For seven days from now I will send rain on the earth for forty days and forty nights, and I will wipe from the face of the earth every living thing I have made.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_5","002_7_5","GEN","7","5","5","And Noah did all that the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_6","002_7_6","GEN","7","6","6","Now Noah was 600 years old when the floodwaters came upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_7","002_7_7","GEN","7","7","7","And Noah and his wife, with his sons and their wives, entered the ark to escape the waters of the flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_8","002_7_8","GEN","7","8","8","The clean and unclean animals, the birds, and everything that crawls along the ground ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_9","002_7_9","GEN","7","9","9","came to Noah to enter the ark, two by two, male and female, as God had commanded Noah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_10","002_7_10","GEN","7","10","10","And after seven days the floodwaters came upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_11","002_7_11","GEN","7","11","11","In the six hundredth year of Noah’s life, on the seventeenth day of the second month, all the fountains of the great deep burst forth, and the floodgates of the heavens were opened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_12","002_7_12","GEN","7","12","12","And the rain fell upon the earth for forty days and forty nights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_13","002_7_13","GEN","7","13","13","On that very day Noah entered the ark, along with his sons Shem, Ham, and Japheth, and his wife, and the three wives of his sons— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_14","002_7_14","GEN","7","14","14","they and every kind of wild animal, livestock, crawling creature, bird, and winged creature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_15","002_7_15","GEN","7","15","15","They came to Noah to enter the ark, two by two of every creature with the breath of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_16","002_7_16","GEN","7","16","16","And they entered, the male and female of every living thing, as God had commanded Noah. Then the LORD shut him in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_17","002_7_17","GEN","7","17","17","For forty days the flood kept coming on the earth, and the waters rose and lifted the ark high above the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_18","002_7_18","GEN","7","18","18","So the waters continued to surge and rise greatly on the earth, and the ark floated on the surface of the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_19","002_7_19","GEN","7","19","19","Finally, the waters completely prevailed upon the earth, so that all the high mountains under all the heavens were covered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_20","002_7_20","GEN","7","20","20","The waters rose and covered the mountaintops to a depth of fifteen cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_21","002_7_21","GEN","7","21","21","And every living thing that moved upon the earth perished—birds, livestock, animals, every creature that swarms upon the earth, and all mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_22","002_7_22","GEN","7","22","22","Of all that was on dry land, everything that had the breath of life in its nostrils died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_23","002_7_23","GEN","7","23","23","And every living thing on the face of the earth was destroyed—man and livestock, crawling creatures and birds of the air; they were blotted out from the earth, and only Noah and those with him in the ark remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN7_24","002_7_24","GEN","7","24","24","And the waters prevailed upon the earth for 150 days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_1","002_8_1","GEN","8","1","1","But God remembered Noah and all the animals and livestock that were with him in the ark. And God sent a wind over the earth, and the waters began to subside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_2","002_8_2","GEN","8","2","2","The springs of the deep and the floodgates of the heavens were closed, and the rain from the sky was restrained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_3","002_8_3","GEN","8","3","3","The waters receded steadily from the earth, and after 150 days the waters had gone down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_4","002_8_4","GEN","8","4","4","On the seventeenth day of the seventh month, the ark came to rest on the mountains of Ararat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_5","002_8_5","GEN","8","5","5","And the waters continued to recede until the tenth month, and on the first day of the tenth month the tops of the mountains became visible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_6","002_8_6","GEN","8","6","6","After forty days Noah opened the window he had made in the ark ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_7","002_8_7","GEN","8","7","7","and sent out a raven. It kept flying back and forth until the waters had dried up from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_8","002_8_8","GEN","8","8","8","Then Noah sent out a dove to see if the waters had receded from the surface of the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_9","002_8_9","GEN","8","9","9","But the dove found no place to rest her foot, and she returned to him in the ark, because the waters were still covering the surface of all the earth. So he reached out his hand and brought her back inside the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_10","002_8_10","GEN","8","10","10","Noah waited seven more days and again sent out the dove from the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_11","002_8_11","GEN","8","11","11","And behold, the dove returned to him in the evening with a freshly plucked olive leaf in her beak. So Noah knew that the waters had receded from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_12","002_8_12","GEN","8","12","12","And Noah waited seven more days and sent out the dove again, but this time she did not return to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_13","002_8_13","GEN","8","13","13","In Noah’s six hundred and first year, on the first day of the first month, the waters had dried up from the earth. So Noah removed the covering from the ark and saw that the surface of the ground was dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_14","002_8_14","GEN","8","14","14","By the twenty-seventh day of the second month, the earth was fully dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_15","002_8_15","GEN","8","15","15","Then God said to Noah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_16","002_8_16","GEN","8","16","16","“Come out of the ark, you and your wife, along with your sons and their wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_17","002_8_17","GEN","8","17","17","Bring out all the living creatures that are with you—birds, livestock, and everything that crawls upon the ground—so that they can spread out over the earth and be fruitful and multiply upon it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_18","002_8_18","GEN","8","18","18","So Noah came out, along with his sons and his wife and his sons’ wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_19","002_8_19","GEN","8","19","19","Every living creature, every creeping thing, and every bird—everything that moves upon the earth—came out of the ark, kind by kind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_20","002_8_20","GEN","8","20","20","Then Noah built an altar to the LORD. And taking from every kind of clean animal and clean bird, he offered burnt offerings on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_21","002_8_21","GEN","8","21","21","When the LORD smelled the pleasing aroma, He said in His heart, “Never again will I curse the ground because of man, even though every inclination of his heart is evil from his youth. And never again will I destroy all living creatures as I have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN8_22","002_8_22","GEN","8","22","22","As long as the earth endures, seedtime and harvest, cold and heat, summer and winter, day and night shall never cease.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_1","002_9_1","GEN","9","1","1","And God blessed Noah and his sons and said to them, “Be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_2","002_9_2","GEN","9","2","2","The fear and dread of you will fall on every living creature on the earth, every bird of the air, every creature that crawls on the ground, and all the fish of the sea. They are delivered into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_3","002_9_3","GEN","9","3","3","Everything that lives and moves will be food for you; just as I gave you the green plants, I now give you all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_4","002_9_4","GEN","9","4","4","But you must not eat meat with its lifeblood still in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_5","002_9_5","GEN","9","5","5","And surely I will require the life of any man or beast by whose hand your lifeblood is shed. I will demand an accounting from anyone who takes the life of his fellow man: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_6","002_9_6","GEN","9","6","6","Whoever sheds the blood of man, by man his blood will be shed; for in His own image God has made mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_7","002_9_7","GEN","9","7","7","But as for you, be fruitful and multiply; spread out across the earth and multiply upon it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_8","002_9_8","GEN","9","8","8","Then God said to Noah and his sons with him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_9","002_9_9","GEN","9","9","9","“Behold, I now establish My covenant with you and your descendants after you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_10","002_9_10","GEN","9","10","10","and with every living creature that was with you—the birds, the livestock, and every beast of the earth—every living thing that came out of the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_11","002_9_11","GEN","9","11","11","And I establish My covenant with you: Never again will all life be cut off by the waters of a flood; never again will there be a flood to destroy the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_12","002_9_12","GEN","9","12","12","And God said, “This is the sign of the covenant I am making between Me and you and every living creature with you, a covenant for all generations to come: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_13","002_9_13","GEN","9","13","13","I have set My rainbow in the clouds, and it will be a sign of the covenant between Me and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_14","002_9_14","GEN","9","14","14","Whenever I form clouds over the earth and the rainbow appears in the clouds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_15","002_9_15","GEN","9","15","15","I will remember My covenant between Me and you and every living creature of every kind. Never again will the waters become a flood to destroy all life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_16","002_9_16","GEN","9","16","16","And whenever the rainbow appears in the clouds, I will see it and remember the everlasting covenant between God and every living creature of every kind that is on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_17","002_9_17","GEN","9","17","17","So God said to Noah, “This is the sign of the covenant that I have established between Me and every creature on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_18","002_9_18","GEN","9","18","18","The sons of Noah who came out of the ark were Shem, Ham, and Japheth. And Ham was the father of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_19","002_9_19","GEN","9","19","19","These three were the sons of Noah, and from them the whole earth was populated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_20","002_9_20","GEN","9","20","20","Now Noah, a man of the soil, proceeded to plant a vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_21","002_9_21","GEN","9","21","21","But when he drank some of its wine, he became drunk and uncovered himself inside his tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_22","002_9_22","GEN","9","22","22","And Ham, the father of Canaan, saw his father’s nakedness and told his two brothers outside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_23","002_9_23","GEN","9","23","23","Then Shem and Japheth took a garment and placed it across their shoulders, and walking backward, they covered their father’s nakedness. Their faces were turned away so that they did not see their father’s nakedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_24","002_9_24","GEN","9","24","24","When Noah awoke from his drunkenness and learned what his youngest son had done to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_25","002_9_25","GEN","9","25","25","he said, “Cursed be Canaan! A servant of servants shall he be to his brothers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_26","002_9_26","GEN","9","26","26","He also declared: “Blessed be the LORD, the God of Shem! May Canaan be the servant of Shem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_27","002_9_27","GEN","9","27","27","May God expand the territory of Japheth; may he dwell in the tents of Shem, and may Canaan be his servant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_28","002_9_28","GEN","9","28","28","After the flood, Noah lived 350 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN9_29","002_9_29","GEN","9","29","29","So Noah lived a total of 950 years, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_1","002_10_1","GEN","10","1","1","This is the account of Noah’s sons Shem, Ham, and Japheth, who also had sons after the flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_2","002_10_2","GEN","10","2","2","The sons of Japheth: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, and Tiras. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_3","002_10_3","GEN","10","3","3","The sons of Gomer: Ashkenaz, Riphath, and Togarmah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_4","002_10_4","GEN","10","4","4","And the sons of Javan: Elishah, Tarshish, the Kittites, and the Rodanites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_5","002_10_5","GEN","10","5","5","From these, the maritime peoples separated into their territories, according to their languages, by clans within their nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_6","002_10_6","GEN","10","6","6","The sons of Ham: Cush, Mizraim, Put, and Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_7","002_10_7","GEN","10","7","7","The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, and Sabteca. And the sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_8","002_10_8","GEN","10","8","8","Cush was the father of Nimrod, who began to be a mighty one on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_9","002_10_9","GEN","10","9","9","He was a mighty hunter before the LORD; so it is said, “Like Nimrod, a mighty hunter before the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_10","002_10_10","GEN","10","10","10","His kingdom began in Babylon, Erech, Accad, and Calneh, in the land of Shinar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_11","002_10_11","GEN","10","11","11","From that land he went forth into Assyria, where he built Nineveh, Rehoboth-Ir, Calah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_12","002_10_12","GEN","10","12","12","and Resen, which is between Nineveh and the great city of Calah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_13","002_10_13","GEN","10","13","13","Mizraim was the father of the Ludites, the Anamites, the Lehabites, the Naphtuhites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_14","002_10_14","GEN","10","14","14","the Pathrusites, the Casluhites (from whom the Philistines came), and the Caphtorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_15","002_10_15","GEN","10","15","15","And Canaan was the father of Sidon his firstborn, and of the Hittites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_16","002_10_16","GEN","10","16","16","the Jebusites, the Amorites, the Girgashites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_17","002_10_17","GEN","10","17","17","the Hivites, the Arkites, the Sinites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_18","002_10_18","GEN","10","18","18","the Arvadites, the Zemarites, and the Hamathites. Later the Canaanite clans were scattered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_19","002_10_19","GEN","10","19","19","and the borders of Canaan extended from Sidon toward Gerar as far as Gaza, and then toward Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah, and Zeboiim, as far as Lasha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_20","002_10_20","GEN","10","20","20","These are the sons of Ham according to their clans, languages, lands, and nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_21","002_10_21","GEN","10","21","21","And sons were also born to Shem, the older brother of Japheth; Shem was the forefather of all the sons of Eber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_22","002_10_22","GEN","10","22","22","The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arphaxad, Lud, and Aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_23","002_10_23","GEN","10","23","23","The sons of Aram: Uz, Hul, Gether, and Mash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_24","002_10_24","GEN","10","24","24","Arphaxad was the father of Shelah, and Shelah was the father of Eber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_25","002_10_25","GEN","10","25","25","Two sons were born to Eber: One was named Peleg, because in his days the earth was divided, and his brother was named Joktan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_26","002_10_26","GEN","10","26","26","And Joktan was the father of Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_27","002_10_27","GEN","10","27","27","Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_28","002_10_28","GEN","10","28","28","Obal, Abimael, Sheba, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_29","002_10_29","GEN","10","29","29","Ophir, Havilah, and Jobab. All these were sons of Joktan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_30","002_10_30","GEN","10","30","30","Their territory extended from Mesha to Sephar, in the eastern hill country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_31","002_10_31","GEN","10","31","31","These are the sons of Shem, according to their clans, languages, lands, and nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN10_32","002_10_32","GEN","10","32","32","All these are the clans of Noah’s sons, according to their generations and nations. From these the nations of the earth spread out after the flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_1","002_11_1","GEN","11","1","1","Now the whole world had one language and a common form of speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_2","002_11_2","GEN","11","2","2","And as people journeyed eastward, they found a plain in the land of Shinar and settled there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_3","002_11_3","GEN","11","3","3","And they said to one another, “Come, let us make bricks and bake them thoroughly.” So they used brick instead of stone, and tar instead of mortar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_4","002_11_4","GEN","11","4","4","“Come,” they said, “let us build for ourselves a city with a tower that reaches to the heavens, that we may make a name for ourselves and not be scattered over the face of all the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_5","002_11_5","GEN","11","5","5","Then the LORD came down to see the city and the tower that the sons of men were building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_6","002_11_6","GEN","11","6","6","And the LORD said, “If they have begun to do this as one people speaking the same language, then nothing they devise will be beyond them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_7","002_11_7","GEN","11","7","7","Come, let Us go down and confuse their language, so that they will not understand one another’s speech.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_8","002_11_8","GEN","11","8","8","So the LORD scattered them from there over the face of all the earth, and they stopped building the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_9","002_11_9","GEN","11","9","9","That is why it is called Babel, for there the LORD confused the language of the whole world, and from that place the LORD scattered them over the face of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_10","002_11_10","GEN","11","10","10","This is the account of Shem. Two years after the flood, when Shem was 100 years old, he became the father of Arphaxad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_11","002_11_11","GEN","11","11","11","And after he had become the father of Arphaxad, Shem lived 500 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_12","002_11_12","GEN","11","12","12","When Arphaxad was 35 years old, he became the father of Shelah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_13","002_11_13","GEN","11","13","13","And after he had become the father of Shelah, Arphaxad lived 403 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_14","002_11_14","GEN","11","14","14","When Shelah was 30 years old, he became the father of Eber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_15","002_11_15","GEN","11","15","15","And after he had become the father of Eber, Shelah lived 403 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_16","002_11_16","GEN","11","16","16","When Eber was 34 years old, he became the father of Peleg. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_17","002_11_17","GEN","11","17","17","And after he had become the father of Peleg, Eber lived 430 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_18","002_11_18","GEN","11","18","18","When Peleg was 30 years old, he became the father of Reu. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_19","002_11_19","GEN","11","19","19","And after he had become the father of Reu, Peleg lived 209 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_20","002_11_20","GEN","11","20","20","When Reu was 32 years old, he became the father of Serug. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_21","002_11_21","GEN","11","21","21","And after he had become the father of Serug, Reu lived 207 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_22","002_11_22","GEN","11","22","22","When Serug was 30 years old, he became the father of Nahor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_23","002_11_23","GEN","11","23","23","And after he had become the father of Nahor, Serug lived 200 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_24","002_11_24","GEN","11","24","24","When Nahor was 29 years old, he became the father of Terah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_25","002_11_25","GEN","11","25","25","And after he had become the father of Terah, Nahor lived 119 years and had other sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_26","002_11_26","GEN","11","26","26","When Terah was 70 years old, he became the father of Abram, Nahor, and Haran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_27","002_11_27","GEN","11","27","27","This is the account of Terah. Terah became the father of Abram, Nahor, and Haran. And Haran became the father of Lot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_28","002_11_28","GEN","11","28","28","During his father Terah’s lifetime, Haran died in his native land, in Ur of the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_29","002_11_29","GEN","11","29","29","And Abram and Nahor took wives for themselves. Abram’s wife was named Sarai, and Nahor’s wife was named Milcah; she was the daughter of Haran, who was the father of both Milcah and Iscah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_30","002_11_30","GEN","11","30","30","But Sarai was barren; she had no children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_31","002_11_31","GEN","11","31","31","And Terah took his son Abram, his grandson Lot son of Haran, and his daughter-in-law Sarai the wife of Abram, and they set out from Ur of the Chaldeans for the land of Canaan. But when they arrived in Haran, they settled there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN11_32","002_11_32","GEN","11","32","32","Terah lived 205 years, and he died in Haran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_1","002_12_1","GEN","12","1","1","Then the LORD said to Abram, “Leave your country, your kindred, and your father’s household, and go to the land I will show you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_2","002_12_2","GEN","12","2","2","I will make you into a great nation, and I will bless you; I will make your name great, so that you will be a blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_3","002_12_3","GEN","12","3","3","I will bless those who bless you and curse those who curse you; and all the families of the earth will be blessed through you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_4","002_12_4","GEN","12","4","4","So Abram departed, as the LORD had directed him, and Lot went with him. Abram was seventy-five years old when he left Haran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_5","002_12_5","GEN","12","5","5","And Abram took his wife Sarai, his nephew Lot, and all the possessions and people they had acquired in Haran, and set out for the land of Canaan. When they came to the land of Canaan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_6","002_12_6","GEN","12","6","6","Abram traveled through the land as far as the site of the Oak of Moreh at Shechem. And at that time the Canaanites were in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_7","002_12_7","GEN","12","7","7","Then the LORD appeared to Abram and said, “I will give this land to your offspring.” So Abram built an altar there to the LORD, who had appeared to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_8","002_12_8","GEN","12","8","8","From there Abram moved on to the hill country east of Bethel and pitched his tent, with Bethel to the west and Ai to the east. There he built an altar to the LORD, and he called on the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_9","002_12_9","GEN","12","9","9","And Abram journeyed on toward the Negev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_10","002_12_10","GEN","12","10","10","Now there was a famine in the land. So Abram went down to Egypt to live there for a while because the famine was severe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_11","002_12_11","GEN","12","11","11","As he was about to enter Egypt, he said to his wife Sarai, “Look, I know that you are a beautiful woman, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_12","002_12_12","GEN","12","12","12","and when the Egyptians see you, they will say, ‘This is his wife.’ Then they will kill me but will let you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_13","002_12_13","GEN","12","13","13","Please say you are my sister, so that I will be treated well for your sake, and on account of you my life will be spared.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_14","002_12_14","GEN","12","14","14","So when Abram entered Egypt, the Egyptians saw that the woman was very beautiful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_15","002_12_15","GEN","12","15","15","When Pharaoh’s officials saw Sarai, they commended her to him, and she was taken into the palace of Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_16","002_12_16","GEN","12","16","16","He treated Abram well on her account, and Abram acquired sheep and cattle, male and female donkeys, menservants and maidservants, and camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_17","002_12_17","GEN","12","17","17","The LORD, however, afflicted Pharaoh and his household with severe plagues because of Abram’s wife Sarai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_18","002_12_18","GEN","12","18","18","So Pharaoh summoned Abram and asked, “What have you done to me? Why didn’t you tell me she was your wife? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_19","002_12_19","GEN","12","19","19","Why did you say, ‘She is my sister,’ so that I took her as my wife? Now then, here is your wife. Take her and go!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN12_20","002_12_20","GEN","12","20","20","Then Pharaoh gave his men orders concerning Abram, and they sent him away with his wife and all his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_1","002_13_1","GEN","13","1","1","So Abram went up out of Egypt into the Negev—he and his wife and all his possessions—and Lot was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_2","002_13_2","GEN","13","2","2","And Abram had become extremely wealthy in livestock and silver and gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_3","002_13_3","GEN","13","3","3","From the Negev he journeyed from place to place toward Bethel, until he came to the place between Bethel and Ai where his tent had formerly been pitched, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_4","002_13_4","GEN","13","4","4","to the site where he had built the altar. And there Abram called on the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_5","002_13_5","GEN","13","5","5","Now Lot, who was traveling with Abram, also had flocks and herds and tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_6","002_13_6","GEN","13","6","6","But the land was unable to support both of them while they stayed together, for they had so many possessions that they were unable to coexist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_7","002_13_7","GEN","13","7","7","And there was discord between the herdsmen of Abram and the herdsmen of Lot. At that time the Canaanites and the Perizzites were also living in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_8","002_13_8","GEN","13","8","8","So Abram said to Lot, “Please let there be no contention between you and me, or between your herdsmen and my herdsmen. After all, we are kinsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_9","002_13_9","GEN","13","9","9","Is not the whole land before you? Now separate yourself from me. If you go to the left, I will go to the right; if you go to the right, I will go to the left.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_10","002_13_10","GEN","13","10","10","And Lot looked out and saw that the whole plain of the Jordan, all the way to Zoar, was well watered like the garden of the LORD, like the land of Egypt. (This was before the LORD destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_11","002_13_11","GEN","13","11","11","So Lot chose the whole plain of the Jordan for himself and set out toward the east. And Abram and Lot parted company. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_12","002_13_12","GEN","13","12","12","Abram lived in the land of Canaan, but Lot settled in the cities of the plain and pitched his tent toward Sodom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_13","002_13_13","GEN","13","13","13","But the men of Sodom were wicked, sinning greatly against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_14","002_13_14","GEN","13","14","14","After Lot had departed, the LORD said to Abram, “Now lift up your eyes from the place where you are, and look to the north and south and east and west, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_15","002_13_15","GEN","13","15","15","for all the land that you see, I will give to you and your offspring forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_16","002_13_16","GEN","13","16","16","I will make your offspring like the dust of the earth, so that if one could count the dust of the earth, then your offspring could be counted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_17","002_13_17","GEN","13","17","17","Get up and walk around the land, through its length and breadth, for I will give it to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN13_18","002_13_18","GEN","13","18","18","So Abram moved his tent and went to live near the Oaks of Mamre at Hebron, where he built an altar to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_1","002_14_1","GEN","14","1","1","In those days Amraphel king of Shinar, Arioch king of Ellasar, Chedorlaomer king of Elam, and Tidal king of Goiim ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_2","002_14_2","GEN","14","2","2","went to war against Bera king of Sodom, Birsha king of Gomorrah, Shinab king of Admah, Shemeber king of Zeboiim, and the king of Bela (that is, Zoar). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_3","002_14_3","GEN","14","3","3","The latter five came as allies to the Valley of Siddim (that is, the Salt Sea). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_4","002_14_4","GEN","14","4","4","For twelve years they had been subject to Chedorlaomer, but in the thirteenth year they rebelled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_5","002_14_5","GEN","14","5","5","In the fourteenth year, Chedorlaomer and the kings allied with him went out and defeated the Rephaites in Ashteroth-karnaim, the Zuzites in Ham, the Emites in Shaveh-kiriathaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_6","002_14_6","GEN","14","6","6","and the Horites in the area of Mount Seir, as far as El-paran, which is near the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_7","002_14_7","GEN","14","7","7","Then they turned back to invade En-mishpat (that is, Kadesh), and they conquered the whole territory of the Amalekites, as well as the Amorites who lived in Hazazon-tamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_8","002_14_8","GEN","14","8","8","Then the king of Sodom, the king of Gomorrah, the king of Admah, the king of Zeboiim, and the king of Bela (that is, Zoar) marched out and arrayed themselves for battle in the Valley of Siddim ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_9","002_14_9","GEN","14","9","9","against Chedorlaomer king of Elam, Tidal king of Goiim, Amraphel king of Shinar, and Arioch king of Ellasar—four kings against five. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_10","002_14_10","GEN","14","10","10","Now the Valley of Siddim was full of tar pits, and as the kings of Sodom and Gomorrah fled, some men fell into the pits, but the survivors fled to the hill country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_11","002_14_11","GEN","14","11","11","The four kings seized all the goods of Sodom and Gomorrah and all their food, and they went on their way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_12","002_14_12","GEN","14","12","12","They also carried off Abram’s nephew Lot and his possessions, since Lot was living in Sodom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_13","002_14_13","GEN","14","13","13","Then an escapee came and reported this to Abram the Hebrew. Now Abram was living near the Oaks of Mamre the Amorite, a brother of Eshcol and Aner, all of whom were bound by treaty to Abram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_14","002_14_14","GEN","14","14","14","And when Abram heard that his relative had been captured, he mobilized the 318 trained men born in his household, and they set out in pursuit as far as Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_15","002_14_15","GEN","14","15","15","During the night, Abram divided his forces and routed Chedorlaomer’s army, pursuing them as far as Hobah, north of Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_16","002_14_16","GEN","14","16","16","He retrieved all the goods, as well as his relative Lot and his possessions, together with the women and the rest of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_17","002_14_17","GEN","14","17","17","After Abram returned from defeating Chedorlaomer and the kings allied with him, the king of Sodom went out to meet him in the Valley of Shaveh (that is, the King’s Valley). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_18","002_14_18","GEN","14","18","18","Then Melchizedek king of Salem brought out bread and wine—since he was priest of God Most High— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_19","002_14_19","GEN","14","19","19","and he blessed Abram and said: “Blessed be Abram by God Most High, Creator of heaven and earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_20","002_14_20","GEN","14","20","20","and blessed be God Most High, who has delivered your enemies into your hand.” Then Abram gave Melchizedek a tenth of everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_21","002_14_21","GEN","14","21","21","The king of Sodom said to Abram, “Give me the people, but take the goods for yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_22","002_14_22","GEN","14","22","22","But Abram replied to the king of Sodom, “I have raised my hand to the LORD God Most High, Creator of heaven and earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_23","002_14_23","GEN","14","23","23","that I will not accept even a thread, or a strap of a sandal, or anything that belongs to you, lest you should say, ‘I have made Abram rich.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN14_24","002_14_24","GEN","14","24","24","I will accept nothing but what my men have eaten and the share for the men who went with me—Aner, Eshcol, and Mamre. They may take their portion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_1","002_15_1","GEN","15","1","1","After these events, the word of the LORD came to Abram in a vision: “Do not be afraid, Abram. I am your shield, your very great reward.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_2","002_15_2","GEN","15","2","2","But Abram replied, “O Lord GOD, what can You give me, since I remain childless, and the heir of my house is Eliezer of Damascus?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_3","002_15_3","GEN","15","3","3","Abram continued, “Behold, You have given me no offspring, so a servant in my household will be my heir.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_4","002_15_4","GEN","15","4","4","Then the word of the LORD came to Abram, saying, “This one will not be your heir, but one who comes from your own body will be your heir.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_5","002_15_5","GEN","15","5","5","And the LORD took him outside and said, “Now look to the heavens and count the stars, if you are able.” Then He told him, “So shall your offspring be.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_6","002_15_6","GEN","15","6","6","Abram believed the LORD, and it was credited to him as righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_7","002_15_7","GEN","15","7","7","The LORD also told him, “I am the LORD, who brought you out of Ur of the Chaldeans to give you this land to possess.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_8","002_15_8","GEN","15","8","8","But Abram replied, “Lord GOD, how can I know that I will possess it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_9","002_15_9","GEN","15","9","9","And the LORD said to him, “Bring Me a heifer, a goat, and a ram, each three years old, along with a turtledove and a young pigeon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_10","002_15_10","GEN","15","10","10","So Abram brought all these to Him, split each of them down the middle, and laid the halves opposite each other. The birds, however, he did not cut in half. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_11","002_15_11","GEN","15","11","11","And the birds of prey descended on the carcasses, but Abram drove them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_12","002_15_12","GEN","15","12","12","As the sun was setting, Abram fell into a deep sleep, and suddenly great terror and darkness overwhelmed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_13","002_15_13","GEN","15","13","13","Then the LORD said to Abram, “Know for certain that your descendants will be strangers in a land that is not their own, and they will be enslaved and mistreated four hundred years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_14","002_15_14","GEN","15","14","14","But I will judge the nation they serve as slaves, and afterward they will depart with many possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_15","002_15_15","GEN","15","15","15","You, however, will go to your fathers in peace and be buried at a ripe old age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_16","002_15_16","GEN","15","16","16","In the fourth generation your descendants will return here, for the iniquity of the Amorites is not yet complete.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_17","002_15_17","GEN","15","17","17","When the sun had set and darkness had fallen, behold, a smoking firepot and a flaming torch appeared and passed between the halves of the carcasses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_18","002_15_18","GEN","15","18","18","On that day the LORD made a covenant with Abram, saying, “To your descendants I have given this land—from the river of Egypt to the great River Euphrates— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_19","002_15_19","GEN","15","19","19","the land of the Kenites, Kenizzites, Kadmonites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_20","002_15_20","GEN","15","20","20","Hittites, Perizzites, Rephaites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN15_21","002_15_21","GEN","15","21","21","Amorites, Canaanites, Girgashites, and Jebusites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_1","002_16_1","GEN","16","1","1","Now Abram’s wife Sarai had borne him no children, but she had an Egyptian maidservant named Hagar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_2","002_16_2","GEN","16","2","2","So Sarai said to Abram, “Look now, the LORD has prevented me from bearing children. Please go to my maidservant; perhaps I can build a family by her.” And Abram listened to the voice of Sarai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_3","002_16_3","GEN","16","3","3","So after he had lived in Canaan for ten years, his wife Sarai took her Egyptian maidservant Hagar and gave her to Abram to be his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_4","002_16_4","GEN","16","4","4","And he slept with Hagar, and she conceived. But when Hagar realized that she was pregnant, she began to despise her mistress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_5","002_16_5","GEN","16","5","5","Then Sarai said to Abram, “May the wrong done to me be upon you! I delivered my servant into your arms, and ever since she saw that she was pregnant, she has treated me with contempt. May the LORD judge between you and me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_6","002_16_6","GEN","16","6","6","“Here,” said Abram, “your servant is in your hands. Do whatever you want with her.” Then Sarai treated Hagar so harshly that she fled from her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_7","002_16_7","GEN","16","7","7","Now the angel of the LORD found Hagar by a spring of water in the desert—the spring along the road to Shur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_8","002_16_8","GEN","16","8","8","“Hagar, servant of Sarai,” he said, “where have you come from, and where are you going?” “I am running away from my mistress Sarai,” she replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_9","002_16_9","GEN","16","9","9","So the angel of the LORD told her, “Return to your mistress and submit to her authority.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_10","002_16_10","GEN","16","10","10","Then the angel added, “I will greatly multiply your offspring so that they will be too numerous to count.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_11","002_16_11","GEN","16","11","11","The angel of the LORD proceeded: “Behold, you have conceived and will bear a son. And you shall name him Ishmael, for the LORD has heard your cry of affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_12","002_16_12","GEN","16","12","12","He will be a wild donkey of a man, and his hand will be against everyone, and everyone’s hand against him; he will live in hostility toward all his brothers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_13","002_16_13","GEN","16","13","13","So Hagar gave this name to the LORD who had spoken to her: “You are the God who sees me,” for she said, “Here I have seen the One who sees me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_14","002_16_14","GEN","16","14","14","Therefore the well was called Beer-lahai-roi. It is located between Kadesh and Bered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_15","002_16_15","GEN","16","15","15","And Hagar bore Abram a son, and Abram gave the name Ishmael to the son she had borne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN16_16","002_16_16","GEN","16","16","16","Abram was eighty-six years old when Hagar bore Ishmael to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_1","002_17_1","GEN","17","1","1","When Abram was ninety-nine years old, the LORD appeared to him and said, “I am God Almighty. Walk before Me and be blameless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_2","002_17_2","GEN","17","2","2","I will establish My covenant between Me and you, and I will multiply you exceedingly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_3","002_17_3","GEN","17","3","3","Then Abram fell facedown, and God said to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_4","002_17_4","GEN","17","4","4","“As for Me, this is My covenant with you: You will be the father of many nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_5","002_17_5","GEN","17","5","5","No longer will you be called Abram, but your name will be Abraham, for I have made you a father of many nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_6","002_17_6","GEN","17","6","6","I will make you exceedingly fruitful; I will make nations of you, and kings will descend from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_7","002_17_7","GEN","17","7","7","I will establish My covenant as an everlasting covenant between Me and you and your descendants after you, to be your God and the God of your descendants after you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_8","002_17_8","GEN","17","8","8","And to you and your descendants I will give the land where you are residing—all the land of Canaan—as an eternal possession; and I will be their God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_9","002_17_9","GEN","17","9","9","God also said to Abraham, “You must keep My covenant—you and your descendants in the generations after you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_10","002_17_10","GEN","17","10","10","This is My covenant with you and your descendants after you, which you are to keep: Every male among you must be circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_11","002_17_11","GEN","17","11","11","You are to circumcise the flesh of your foreskin, and this will be a sign of the covenant between Me and you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_12","002_17_12","GEN","17","12","12","Generation after generation, every male must be circumcised when he is eight days old, including those born in your household and those purchased from a foreigner—even those who are not your offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_13","002_17_13","GEN","17","13","13","Whether they are born in your household or purchased, they must be circumcised. My covenant in your flesh will be an everlasting covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_14","002_17_14","GEN","17","14","14","But if any male is not circumcised, he will be cut off from his people; he has broken My covenant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_15","002_17_15","GEN","17","15","15","Then God said to Abraham, “As for Sarai your wife, do not call her Sarai, for her name is to be Sarah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_16","002_17_16","GEN","17","16","16","And I will bless her and will surely give you a son by her. I will bless her, and she will be the mother of nations; kings of peoples will descend from her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_17","002_17_17","GEN","17","17","17","Abraham fell facedown. Then he laughed and said to himself, “Can a child be born to a man who is a hundred years old? Can Sarah give birth at the age of ninety?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_18","002_17_18","GEN","17","18","18","And Abraham said to God, “O that Ishmael might live under Your blessing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_19","002_17_19","GEN","17","19","19","But God replied, “Your wife Sarah will indeed bear you a son, and you are to name him Isaac. I will establish My covenant with him as an everlasting covenant for his descendants after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_20","002_17_20","GEN","17","20","20","As for Ishmael, I have heard you, and I will surely bless him; I will make him fruitful and multiply him greatly. He will become the father of twelve rulers, and I will make him into a great nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_21","002_17_21","GEN","17","21","21","But I will establish My covenant with Isaac, whom Sarah will bear to you at this time next year.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_22","002_17_22","GEN","17","22","22","When He had finished speaking with Abraham, God went up from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_23","002_17_23","GEN","17","23","23","On that very day Abraham took his son Ishmael and all those born in his household or purchased with his money—every male among the members of Abraham’s household—and he circumcised them, just as God had told him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_24","002_17_24","GEN","17","24","24","So Abraham was ninety-nine years old when he was circumcised, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_25","002_17_25","GEN","17","25","25","and his son Ishmael was thirteen; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_26","002_17_26","GEN","17","26","26","Abraham and his son Ishmael were circumcised on the same day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN17_27","002_17_27","GEN","17","27","27","And all the men of Abraham’s household—both servants born in his household and those purchased from foreigners—were circumcised with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_1","002_18_1","GEN","18","1","1","Then the LORD appeared to Abraham by the Oaks of Mamre in the heat of the day, while he was sitting at the entrance of his tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_2","002_18_2","GEN","18","2","2","And Abraham looked up and saw three men standing nearby. When he saw them, he ran from the entrance of his tent to meet them and bowed low to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_3","002_18_3","GEN","18","3","3","“My lord,” said Abraham, “if I have found favor in your sight, please do not pass your servant by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_4","002_18_4","GEN","18","4","4","Let a little water be brought, that you may wash your feet and rest yourselves under the tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_5","002_18_5","GEN","18","5","5","And I will bring a bit of bread so that you may refresh yourselves. This is why you have passed your servant’s way. After that, you may continue on your way.” “Yes,” they replied, “you may do as you have said.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_6","002_18_6","GEN","18","6","6","So Abraham hurried into the tent and said to Sarah, “Quick! Prepare three seahs of fine flour, knead it, and bake some bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_7","002_18_7","GEN","18","7","7","Meanwhile, Abraham ran to the herd, selected a tender and choice calf, and gave it to a servant, who hurried to prepare it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_8","002_18_8","GEN","18","8","8","Then Abraham brought curds and milk and the calf that had been prepared, and he set them before the men and stood by them under the tree as they ate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_9","002_18_9","GEN","18","9","9","“Where is your wife Sarah?” they asked. “There, in the tent,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_10","002_18_10","GEN","18","10","10","Then the LORD said, “I will surely return to you at this time next year, and your wife Sarah will have a son!” Now Sarah was behind him, listening at the entrance to the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_11","002_18_11","GEN","18","11","11","And Abraham and Sarah were already old and well along in years; Sarah had passed the age of childbearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_12","002_18_12","GEN","18","12","12","So she laughed to herself, saying, “After I am worn out and my master is old, will I now have this pleasure?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_13","002_18_13","GEN","18","13","13","And the LORD asked Abraham, “Why did Sarah laugh and say, ‘Can I really bear a child when I am old?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_14","002_18_14","GEN","18","14","14","Is anything too difficult for the LORD? At the appointed time I will return to you—in about a year—and Sarah will have a son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_15","002_18_15","GEN","18","15","15","But Sarah was afraid, so she denied it and said, “I did not laugh.” “No,” replied the LORD, “but you did laugh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_16","002_18_16","GEN","18","16","16","When the men got up to leave, they looked out over Sodom, and Abraham walked along with them to see them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_17","002_18_17","GEN","18","17","17","And the LORD said, “Shall I hide from Abraham what I am about to do? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_18","002_18_18","GEN","18","18","18","Abraham will surely become a great and powerful nation, and through him all the nations of the earth will be blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_19","002_18_19","GEN","18","19","19","For I have chosen him, so that he will command his children and his household after him to keep the way of the LORD by doing what is right and just, in order that the LORD may bring upon Abraham what He has promised.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_20","002_18_20","GEN","18","20","20","Then the LORD said, “The outcry against Sodom and Gomorrah is great. Because their sin is so grievous, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_21","002_18_21","GEN","18","21","21","I will go down to see if their actions fully justify the outcry that has reached Me. If not, I will find out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_22","002_18_22","GEN","18","22","22","And the two men turned away and went toward Sodom, but Abraham remained standing before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_23","002_18_23","GEN","18","23","23","Abraham stepped forward and said, “Will You really sweep away the righteous with the wicked? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_24","002_18_24","GEN","18","24","24","What if there are fifty righteous ones in the city? Will You really sweep it away and not spare the place for the sake of the fifty righteous ones who are there? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_25","002_18_25","GEN","18","25","25","Far be it from You to do such a thing—to kill the righteous with the wicked, so that the righteous and the wicked are treated alike. Far be it from You! Will not the Judge of all the earth do what is right?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_26","002_18_26","GEN","18","26","26","So the LORD replied, “If I find fifty righteous ones within the city of Sodom, on their account I will spare the whole place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_27","002_18_27","GEN","18","27","27","Then Abraham answered, “Now that I have ventured to speak to the Lord—though I am but dust and ashes— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_28","002_18_28","GEN","18","28","28","suppose the fifty righteous ones lack five. Will You destroy the whole city for the lack of five?” He replied, “If I find forty-five there, I will not destroy it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_29","002_18_29","GEN","18","29","29","Once again Abraham spoke to the LORD, “Suppose forty are found there?” He answered, “On account of the forty, I will not do it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_30","002_18_30","GEN","18","30","30","Then Abraham said, “May the Lord not be angry, but let me speak further. Suppose thirty are found there?” He replied, “If I find thirty there, I will not do it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_31","002_18_31","GEN","18","31","31","And Abraham said, “Now that I have ventured to speak to the Lord, suppose twenty are found there?” He answered, “On account of the twenty, I will not destroy it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_32","002_18_32","GEN","18","32","32","Finally, Abraham said, “May the Lord not be angry, but let me speak once more. Suppose ten are found there?” And He answered, “On account of the ten, I will not destroy it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN18_33","002_18_33","GEN","18","33","33","When the LORD had finished speaking with Abraham, He departed, and Abraham returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_1","002_19_1","GEN","19","1","1","Now the two angels arrived at Sodom in the evening, and Lot was sitting in the gateway of the city. When Lot saw them, he got up to meet them, bowed facedown, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_2","002_19_2","GEN","19","2","2","and said, “My lords, please turn aside into the house of your servant; wash your feet and spend the night. Then you can rise early and go on your way.” “No,” they answered, “we will spend the night in the square.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_3","002_19_3","GEN","19","3","3","But Lot insisted so strongly that they followed him into his house. He prepared a feast for them and baked unleavened bread, and they ate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_4","002_19_4","GEN","19","4","4","Before they had gone to bed, all the men of the city of Sodom, both young and old, surrounded the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_5","002_19_5","GEN","19","5","5","They called out to Lot, saying, “Where are the men who came to you tonight? Send them out to us so we can have relations with them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_6","002_19_6","GEN","19","6","6","Lot went outside to meet them, shutting the door behind him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_7","002_19_7","GEN","19","7","7","“Please, my brothers,” he pleaded, “don’t do such a wicked thing! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_8","002_19_8","GEN","19","8","8","Look, I have two daughters who have never slept with a man. Let me bring them to you, and you can do to them as you please. But do not do anything to these men, for they have come under the protection of my roof.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_9","002_19_9","GEN","19","9","9","“Get out of the way!” they replied. And they declared, “This one came here as a foreigner, and he is already acting like a judge! Now we will treat you worse than them.” And they pressed in on Lot and moved in to break down the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_10","002_19_10","GEN","19","10","10","But the men inside reached out, pulled Lot into the house with them, and shut the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_11","002_19_11","GEN","19","11","11","And they struck the men at the entrance, young and old, with blindness, so that they wearied themselves trying to find the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_12","002_19_12","GEN","19","12","12","Then the two men said to Lot, “Do you have anyone else here—a son-in-law, your sons or daughters, or anyone else in the city who belongs to you? Get them out of here, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_13","002_19_13","GEN","19","13","13","because we are about to destroy this place. For the outcry to the LORD against its people is so great that He has sent us to destroy it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_14","002_19_14","GEN","19","14","14","So Lot went out and spoke to the sons-in-law who were pledged in marriage to his daughters. “Get up,” he said. “Get out of this place, for the LORD is about to destroy the city!” But his sons-in-law thought he was joking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_15","002_19_15","GEN","19","15","15","At daybreak the angels hurried Lot along, saying, “Get up! Take your wife and your two daughters who are here, or you will be swept away in the punishment of the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_16","002_19_16","GEN","19","16","16","But when Lot hesitated, the men grabbed his hand and the hands of his wife and his two daughters. And they led them safely out of the city, because of the LORD’s compassion for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_17","002_19_17","GEN","19","17","17","As soon as the men had brought them out, one of them said, “Run for your lives! Do not look back, and do not stop anywhere on the plain! Flee to the mountains, or you will be swept away!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_18","002_19_18","GEN","19","18","18","But Lot replied, “No, my lords, please! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_19","002_19_19","GEN","19","19","19","Your servant has indeed found favor in your sight, and you have shown me great kindness by sparing my life. But I cannot run to the mountains; the disaster will overtake me, and I will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_20","002_19_20","GEN","19","20","20","Look, there is a town nearby where I can flee, and it is a small place. Please let me flee there—is it not a small place? Then my life will be saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_21","002_19_21","GEN","19","21","21","“Very well,” he answered, “I will grant this request as well, and will not demolish the town you indicate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_22","002_19_22","GEN","19","22","22","Hurry! Run there quickly, for I cannot do anything until you reach it.” That is why the town was called Zoar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_23","002_19_23","GEN","19","23","23","And by the time the sun had risen over the land, Lot had reached Zoar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_24","002_19_24","GEN","19","24","24","Then the LORD rained down sulfur and fire on Sodom and Gomorrah—from the LORD out of the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_25","002_19_25","GEN","19","25","25","Thus He destroyed these cities and the entire plain, including all the inhabitants of the cities and everything that grew on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_26","002_19_26","GEN","19","26","26","But Lot’s wife looked back, and she became a pillar of salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_27","002_19_27","GEN","19","27","27","Early the next morning, Abraham got up and returned to the place where he had stood before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_28","002_19_28","GEN","19","28","28","He looked down toward Sodom and Gomorrah and all the land of the plain, and he saw the smoke rising from the land like smoke from a furnace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_29","002_19_29","GEN","19","29","29","So when God destroyed the cities of the plain, He remembered Abraham, and He brought Lot out of the catastrophe that destroyed the cities where he had lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_30","002_19_30","GEN","19","30","30","Lot and his two daughters left Zoar and settled in the mountains—for he was afraid to stay in Zoar—where they lived in a cave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_31","002_19_31","GEN","19","31","31","One day the older daughter said to the younger, “Our father is old, and there is no man in the land to sleep with us, as is the custom over all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_32","002_19_32","GEN","19","32","32","Come, let us get our father drunk with wine so we can sleep with him and preserve his line.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_33","002_19_33","GEN","19","33","33","So that night they got their father drunk with wine, and the firstborn went in and slept with her father; he was not aware when she lay down or when she got up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_34","002_19_34","GEN","19","34","34","The next day the older daughter said to the younger, “Look, I slept with my father last night. Let us get him drunk with wine again tonight so you can go in and sleep with him and we can preserve our father’s line.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_35","002_19_35","GEN","19","35","35","So again that night they got their father drunk with wine, and the younger daughter went in and slept with him; he was not aware when she lay down or when she got up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_36","002_19_36","GEN","19","36","36","Thus both of Lot’s daughters became pregnant by their father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_37","002_19_37","GEN","19","37","37","The older daughter gave birth to a son and named him Moab. He is the father of the Moabites of today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN19_38","002_19_38","GEN","19","38","38","The younger daughter also gave birth to a son, and she named him Ben-ammi. He is the father of the Ammonites of today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_1","002_20_1","GEN","20","1","1","Now Abraham journeyed from there to the region of the Negev and settled between Kadesh and Shur. While he was staying in Gerar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_2","002_20_2","GEN","20","2","2","Abraham said of his wife Sarah, “She is my sister.” So Abimelech king of Gerar had Sarah brought to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_3","002_20_3","GEN","20","3","3","One night, however, God came to Abimelech in a dream and told him, “You are as good as dead because of the woman you have taken, for she is a married woman.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_4","002_20_4","GEN","20","4","4","Now Abimelech had not gone near her, so he replied, “Lord, would You destroy a nation even though it is innocent? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_5","002_20_5","GEN","20","5","5","Didn’t Abraham tell me, ‘She is my sister’? And she herself said, ‘He is my brother.’ I have done this in the integrity of my heart and the innocence of my hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_6","002_20_6","GEN","20","6","6","Then God said to Abimelech in the dream, “Yes, I know that you did this with a clear conscience, and so I have kept you from sinning against Me. That is why I did not let you touch her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_7","002_20_7","GEN","20","7","7","Now return the man’s wife, for he is a prophet; he will pray for you and you will live. But if you do not restore her, be aware that you will surely die—you and all who belong to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_8","002_20_8","GEN","20","8","8","Early the next morning Abimelech got up and summoned all his servants; and when he described to them all that had happened, the men were terrified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_9","002_20_9","GEN","20","9","9","Then Abimelech called Abraham and asked, “What have you done to us? How have I sinned against you, that you have brought such tremendous guilt upon me and my kingdom? You have done things to me that should not be done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_10","002_20_10","GEN","20","10","10","Abimelech also asked Abraham, “What prompted you to do such a thing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_11","002_20_11","GEN","20","11","11","Abraham replied, “I thought to myself, ‘Surely there is no fear of God in this place. They will kill me on account of my wife.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_12","002_20_12","GEN","20","12","12","Besides, she really is my sister, the daughter of my father—though not the daughter of my mother—and she became my wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_13","002_20_13","GEN","20","13","13","So when God had me journey from my father’s house, I said to Sarah, ‘This is how you can show your loyalty to me: Wherever we go, say of me, “He is my brother.”’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_14","002_20_14","GEN","20","14","14","So Abimelech brought sheep and cattle, menservants and maidservants, and he gave them to Abraham and restored his wife Sarah to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_15","002_20_15","GEN","20","15","15","And Abimelech said, “Look, my land is before you. Settle wherever you please.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_16","002_20_16","GEN","20","16","16","And he said to Sarah, “See, I am giving your brother a thousand pieces of silver. It is your vindication before all who are with you; you are completely cleared.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_17","002_20_17","GEN","20","17","17","Then Abraham prayed to God, and God healed Abimelech and his wife and his maidservants, so that they could again bear children— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN20_18","002_20_18","GEN","20","18","18","for on account of Abraham’s wife Sarah, the LORD had completely closed all the wombs in Abimelech’s household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_1","002_21_1","GEN","21","1","1","Now the LORD attended to Sarah as He had said, and the LORD did for Sarah what He had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_2","002_21_2","GEN","21","2","2","So Sarah conceived and bore a son to Abraham in his old age, at the very time God had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_3","002_21_3","GEN","21","3","3","And Abraham gave the name Isaac to the son Sarah bore to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_4","002_21_4","GEN","21","4","4","When his son Isaac was eight days old, Abraham circumcised him, as God had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_5","002_21_5","GEN","21","5","5","Abraham was a hundred years old when his son Isaac was born to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_6","002_21_6","GEN","21","6","6","Then Sarah said, “God has made me laugh, and everyone who hears of this will laugh with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_7","002_21_7","GEN","21","7","7","She added, “Who would have told Abraham that Sarah would nurse children? Yet I have borne him a son in his old age.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_8","002_21_8","GEN","21","8","8","So the child grew and was weaned, and Abraham held a great feast on the day Isaac was weaned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_9","002_21_9","GEN","21","9","9","But Sarah saw that the son whom Hagar the Egyptian had borne to Abraham was mocking her son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_10","002_21_10","GEN","21","10","10","and she said to Abraham, “Expel the slave woman and her son, for the slave woman’s son will never share in the inheritance with my son Isaac!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_11","002_21_11","GEN","21","11","11","Now this matter distressed Abraham greatly because it concerned his son Ishmael. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_12","002_21_12","GEN","21","12","12","But God said to Abraham, “Do not be distressed about the boy and your maidservant. Listen to everything that Sarah tells you, for through Isaac your offspring will be reckoned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_13","002_21_13","GEN","21","13","13","But I will also make a nation of the slave woman’s son, because he is your offspring.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_14","002_21_14","GEN","21","14","14","Early in the morning, Abraham got up, took bread and a skin of water, put them on Hagar’s shoulders, and sent her away with the boy. She left and wandered in the Wilderness of Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_15","002_21_15","GEN","21","15","15","When the water in the skin was gone, she left the boy under one of the bushes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_16","002_21_16","GEN","21","16","16","Then she went off and sat down nearby, about a bowshot away, for she said, “I cannot bear to watch the boy die!” And as she sat nearby, she lifted up her voice and wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_17","002_21_17","GEN","21","17","17","Then God heard the voice of the boy, and the angel of God called to Hagar from heaven, “What is wrong, Hagar? Do not be afraid, for God has heard the voice of the boy where he lies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_18","002_21_18","GEN","21","18","18","Get up, lift up the boy, and take him by the hand, for I will make him into a great nation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_19","002_21_19","GEN","21","19","19","Then God opened her eyes, and she saw a well of water. So she went and filled the skin with water and gave the boy a drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_20","002_21_20","GEN","21","20","20","And God was with the boy, and he grew up and settled in the wilderness and became a great archer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_21","002_21_21","GEN","21","21","21","And while he was dwelling in the Wilderness of Paran, his mother got a wife for him from the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_22","002_21_22","GEN","21","22","22","At that time Abimelech and Phicol the commander of his army said to Abraham, “God is with you in all that you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_23","002_21_23","GEN","21","23","23","Now, therefore, swear to me here before God that you will not deal falsely with me or my children or descendants. Show to me and to the country in which you reside the same kindness that I have shown to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_24","002_21_24","GEN","21","24","24","And Abraham replied, “I swear it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_25","002_21_25","GEN","21","25","25","But when Abraham complained to Abimelech about a well that Abimelech’s servants had seized, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_26","002_21_26","GEN","21","26","26","Abimelech replied, “I do not know who has done this. You did not tell me, so I have not heard about it until today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_27","002_21_27","GEN","21","27","27","So Abraham brought sheep and cattle and gave them to Abimelech, and the two men made a covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_28","002_21_28","GEN","21","28","28","Abraham separated seven ewe lambs from the flock, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_29","002_21_29","GEN","21","29","29","and Abimelech asked him, “Why have you set apart these seven ewe lambs?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_30","002_21_30","GEN","21","30","30","He replied, “You are to accept the seven ewe lambs from my hand as my witness that I dug this well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_31","002_21_31","GEN","21","31","31","So that place was called Beersheba, because it was there that the two of them swore an oath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_32","002_21_32","GEN","21","32","32","After they had made the covenant at Beersheba, Abimelech and Phicol the commander of his army got up and returned to the land of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_33","002_21_33","GEN","21","33","33","And Abraham planted a tamarisk tree in Beersheba, and there he called upon the name of the LORD, the Eternal God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN21_34","002_21_34","GEN","21","34","34","And Abraham resided in the land of the Philistines for a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_1","002_22_1","GEN","22","1","1","Some time later God tested Abraham and said to him, “Abraham!” “Here I am,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_2","002_22_2","GEN","22","2","2","“Take your son,” God said, “your only son Isaac, whom you love, and go to the land of Moriah. Offer him there as a burnt offering on one of the mountains, which I will show you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_3","002_22_3","GEN","22","3","3","So Abraham got up early the next morning, saddled his donkey, and took along two of his servants and his son Isaac. He split the wood for a burnt offering and set out for the place God had designated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_4","002_22_4","GEN","22","4","4","On the third day Abraham looked up and saw the place in the distance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_5","002_22_5","GEN","22","5","5","“Stay here with the donkey,” Abraham told his servants. “The boy and I will go over there to worship, and then we will return to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_6","002_22_6","GEN","22","6","6","Abraham took the wood for the burnt offering and placed it on his son Isaac. He himself carried the fire and the sacrificial knife, and the two of them walked on together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_7","002_22_7","GEN","22","7","7","Then Isaac said to his father Abraham, “My father!” “Here I am, my son,” he replied. “The fire and the wood are here,” said Isaac, “but where is the lamb for the burnt offering?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_8","002_22_8","GEN","22","8","8","Abraham answered, “God Himself will provide the lamb for the burnt offering, my son.” And the two walked on together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_9","002_22_9","GEN","22","9","9","When they arrived at the place God had designated, Abraham built the altar there and arranged the wood. He bound his son Isaac and placed him on the altar, atop the wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_10","002_22_10","GEN","22","10","10","Then Abraham reached out his hand and took the knife to slaughter his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_11","002_22_11","GEN","22","11","11","Just then the angel of the LORD called out to him from heaven, “Abraham, Abraham!” “Here I am,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_12","002_22_12","GEN","22","12","12","“Do not lay a hand on the boy or do anything to him,” said the angel, “for now I know that you fear God, since you have not withheld your only son from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_13","002_22_13","GEN","22","13","13","Then Abraham looked up and saw behind him a ram in a thicket, caught by its horns. So he went and took the ram and offered it as a burnt offering in place of his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_14","002_22_14","GEN","22","14","14","And Abraham called that place The LORD Will Provide. So to this day it is said, “On the mountain of the LORD it will be provided.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_15","002_22_15","GEN","22","15","15","And the angel of the LORD called to Abraham from heaven a second time, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_16","002_22_16","GEN","22","16","16","saying, “By Myself I have sworn, declares the LORD, that because you have done this and have not withheld your only son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_17","002_22_17","GEN","22","17","17","I will surely bless you, and I will multiply your descendants like the stars in the sky and the sand on the seashore. Your descendants will possess the gates of their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_18","002_22_18","GEN","22","18","18","And through your offspring all nations of the earth will be blessed, because you have obeyed My voice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_19","002_22_19","GEN","22","19","19","Abraham went back to his servants, and they got up and set out together for Beersheba. And Abraham settled in Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_20","002_22_20","GEN","22","20","20","Some time later, Abraham was told, “Milcah has also borne sons to your brother Nahor: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_21","002_22_21","GEN","22","21","21","Uz the firstborn, his brother Buz, Kemuel (the father of Aram), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_22","002_22_22","GEN","22","22","22","Chesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlaph, and Bethuel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_23","002_22_23","GEN","22","23","23","And Bethuel became the father of Rebekah. Milcah bore these eight sons to Abraham’s brother Nahor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN22_24","002_22_24","GEN","22","24","24","Moreover, Nahor’s concubine, whose name was Reumah, bore Tebah, Gaham, Tahash, and Maacah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_1","002_23_1","GEN","23","1","1","Now Sarah lived to be 127 years old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_2","002_23_2","GEN","23","2","2","She died in Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron) in the land of Canaan, and Abraham went out to mourn and to weep for her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_3","002_23_3","GEN","23","3","3","Then Abraham got up from beside his dead wife and said to the Hittites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_4","002_23_4","GEN","23","4","4","“I am a foreigner and an outsider among you. Give me a burial site among you so that I can bury my dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_5","002_23_5","GEN","23","5","5","The Hittites replied to Abraham, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_6","002_23_6","GEN","23","6","6","“Listen to us, sir. You are God’s chosen one among us. Bury your dead in the finest of our tombs. None of us will withhold his tomb for burying your dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_7","002_23_7","GEN","23","7","7","Then Abraham rose and bowed down before the people of the land, the Hittites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_8","002_23_8","GEN","23","8","8","“If you are willing for me to bury my dead,” he said to them, “listen to me, and approach Ephron son of Zohar on my behalf ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_9","002_23_9","GEN","23","9","9","to sell me the cave of Machpelah that belongs to him; it is at the end of his field. Let him sell it to me in your presence for full price, so that I may have a burial site.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_10","002_23_10","GEN","23","10","10","Now Ephron was sitting among the sons of Heth. So in the presence of all the Hittites who had come to the gate of his city, Ephron the Hittite answered Abraham, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_11","002_23_11","GEN","23","11","11","“No, my lord. Listen to me. I give you the field, and I give you the cave that is in it. I give it to you in the presence of my people. Bury your dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_12","002_23_12","GEN","23","12","12","Again Abraham bowed down before the people of the land ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_13","002_23_13","GEN","23","13","13","and said to Ephron in their presence, “If you will please listen to me, I will pay you the price of the field. Accept it from me, so that I may bury my dead there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_14","002_23_14","GEN","23","14","14","Ephron answered Abraham, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_15","002_23_15","GEN","23","15","15","“Listen to me, my lord. The land is worth four hundred shekels of silver, but what is that between you and me? Bury your dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_16","002_23_16","GEN","23","16","16","Abraham agreed to Ephron’s terms and weighed out for him the price he had named in the hearing of the Hittites: four hundred shekels of silver, according to the standard of the merchants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_17","002_23_17","GEN","23","17","17","So Ephron’s field at Machpelah near Mamre, the cave that was in it, and all the trees within the boundaries of the field were deeded over ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_18","002_23_18","GEN","23","18","18","to Abraham’s possession in the presence of all the Hittites who had come to the gate of his city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_19","002_23_19","GEN","23","19","19","After this, Abraham buried his wife Sarah in the cave of the field at Machpelah near Mamre (that is, Hebron) in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN23_20","002_23_20","GEN","23","20","20","So the field and its cave were deeded by the Hittites to Abraham as a burial site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_1","002_24_1","GEN","24","1","1","By now Abraham was old and well along in years, and the LORD had blessed him in every way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_2","002_24_2","GEN","24","2","2","So Abraham instructed the chief servant of his household, who managed all he owned, “Place your hand under my thigh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_3","002_24_3","GEN","24","3","3","and I will have you swear by the LORD, the God of heaven and the God of earth, that you will not take a wife for my son from the daughters of the Canaanites among whom I am dwelling, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_4","002_24_4","GEN","24","4","4","but will go to my country and my kindred to take a wife for my son Isaac.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_5","002_24_5","GEN","24","5","5","The servant asked him, “What if the woman is unwilling to follow me to this land? Shall I then take your son back to the land from which you came?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_6","002_24_6","GEN","24","6","6","Abraham replied, “Make sure that you do not take my son back there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_7","002_24_7","GEN","24","7","7","The LORD, the God of heaven, who brought me from my father’s house and my native land, who spoke to me and promised me on oath, saying, ‘To your offspring I will give this land’—He will send His angel before you so that you can take a wife for my son from there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_8","002_24_8","GEN","24","8","8","And if the woman is unwilling to follow you, then you are released from this oath of mine. Only do not take my son back there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_9","002_24_9","GEN","24","9","9","So the servant placed his hand under the thigh of his master Abraham and swore an oath to him concerning this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_10","002_24_10","GEN","24","10","10","Then the servant took ten of his master’s camels and departed with all manner of good things from his master in hand. And he set out for Nahor’s hometown in Aram-naharaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_11","002_24_11","GEN","24","11","11","As evening approached, he made the camels kneel down near the well outside the town at the time when the women went out to draw water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_12","002_24_12","GEN","24","12","12","“O LORD, God of my master Abraham,” he prayed, “please grant me success today, and show kindness to my master Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_13","002_24_13","GEN","24","13","13","Here I am, standing beside the spring, and the daughters of the townspeople are coming out to draw water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_14","002_24_14","GEN","24","14","14","Now may it happen that the girl to whom I say, ‘Please let down your jar that I may drink,’ and who responds, ‘Drink, and I will water your camels as well’—let her be the one You have appointed for Your servant Isaac. By this I will know that You have shown kindness to my master.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_15","002_24_15","GEN","24","15","15","Before the servant had finished praying, Rebekah came out with her jar on her shoulder. She was the daughter of Bethuel son of Milcah, the wife of Abraham’s brother Nahor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_16","002_24_16","GEN","24","16","16","Now the girl was very beautiful, a virgin who had not had relations with any man. She went down to the spring, filled her jar, and came up again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_17","002_24_17","GEN","24","17","17","So the servant ran to meet her and said, “Please let me have a little water from your jar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_18","002_24_18","GEN","24","18","18","“Drink, my lord,” she replied, and she quickly lowered her jar to her hands and gave him a drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_19","002_24_19","GEN","24","19","19","After she had given him a drink, she said, “I will also draw water for your camels, until they have had enough to drink.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_20","002_24_20","GEN","24","20","20","And she quickly emptied her jar into the trough and ran back to the well to draw water, until she had drawn water for all his camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_21","002_24_21","GEN","24","21","21","Meanwhile, the man watched her silently to see whether or not the LORD had made his journey a success. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_22","002_24_22","GEN","24","22","22","And after the camels had finished drinking, he took out a gold ring weighing a beka, and two gold bracelets for her wrists weighing ten shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_23","002_24_23","GEN","24","23","23","“Whose daughter are you?” he asked. “Please tell me, is there room in your father’s house for us to spend the night?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_24","002_24_24","GEN","24","24","24","She replied, “I am the daughter of Bethuel, the son that Milcah bore to Nahor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_25","002_24_25","GEN","24","25","25","Then she added, “We have plenty of straw and feed, as well as a place for you to spend the night.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_26","002_24_26","GEN","24","26","26","Then the man bowed down and worshiped the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_27","002_24_27","GEN","24","27","27","saying, “Blessed be the LORD, the God of my master Abraham, who has not withheld His kindness and faithfulness from my master. As for me, the LORD has led me on the journey to the house of my master’s relatives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_28","002_24_28","GEN","24","28","28","The girl ran and told her mother’s household about these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_29","002_24_29","GEN","24","29","29","Now Rebekah had a brother named Laban, and he rushed out to the man at the spring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_30","002_24_30","GEN","24","30","30","As soon as he saw the ring, and the bracelets on his sister’s wrists, and heard Rebekah’s words, “The man said this to me,” he went and found the man standing by the camels near the spring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_31","002_24_31","GEN","24","31","31","“Come, you who are blessed by the LORD,” said Laban. “Why are you standing out here? I have prepared the house and a place for the camels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_32","002_24_32","GEN","24","32","32","So the man came to the house, and the camels were unloaded. Straw and feed were brought to the camels, and water to wash his feet and the feet of his companions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_33","002_24_33","GEN","24","33","33","Then a meal was set before the man, but he said, “I will not eat until I have told you what I came to say.” So Laban said, “Please speak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_34","002_24_34","GEN","24","34","34","“I am Abraham’s servant,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_35","002_24_35","GEN","24","35","35","“The LORD has greatly blessed my master, and he has become rich. He has given him sheep and cattle, silver and gold, menservants and maidservants, camels and donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_36","002_24_36","GEN","24","36","36","My master’s wife Sarah has borne him a son in her old age, and my master has given him everything he owns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_37","002_24_37","GEN","24","37","37","My master made me swear an oath and said, ‘You shall not take a wife for my son from the daughters of the Canaanites in whose land I dwell, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_38","002_24_38","GEN","24","38","38","but you shall go to my father’s house and to my kindred to take a wife for my son.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_39","002_24_39","GEN","24","39","39","Then I asked my master, ‘What if the woman will not come back with me?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_40","002_24_40","GEN","24","40","40","And he told me, ‘The LORD, before whom I have walked, will send His angel with you and make your journey a success, so that you may take a wife for my son from my kindred and from my father’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_41","002_24_41","GEN","24","41","41","And when you go to my kindred, if they refuse to give her to you, then you will be released from my oath.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_42","002_24_42","GEN","24","42","42","So when I came to the spring today, I prayed: O LORD, God of my master Abraham, if only You would make my journey a success! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_43","002_24_43","GEN","24","43","43","Here I am, standing beside this spring. Now if a maiden comes out to draw water and I say to her, ‘Please let me drink a little water from your jar,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_44","002_24_44","GEN","24","44","44","and she replies, ‘Drink, and I will draw water for your camels as well,’ may she be the woman the LORD has appointed for my master’s son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_45","002_24_45","GEN","24","45","45","And before I had finished praying in my heart, there was Rebekah coming out with her jar on her shoulder, and she went down to the spring and drew water. So I said to her, ‘Please give me a drink.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_46","002_24_46","GEN","24","46","46","She quickly lowered her jar from her shoulder and said, ‘Drink, and I will water your camels as well.’ So I drank, and she also watered the camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_47","002_24_47","GEN","24","47","47","Then I asked her, ‘Whose daughter are you?’ She replied, ‘The daughter of Bethuel son of Nahor, whom Milcah bore to him.’ So I put the ring on her nose and the bracelets on her wrists. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_48","002_24_48","GEN","24","48","48","Then I bowed down and worshiped the LORD; and I blessed the LORD, the God of my master Abraham, who led me on the right road to take the granddaughter of my master’s brother for his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_49","002_24_49","GEN","24","49","49","Now if you will show kindness and faithfulness to my master, tell me; but if not, let me know, so that I may go elsewhere.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_50","002_24_50","GEN","24","50","50","Laban and Bethuel answered, “This is from the LORD; we have no choice in the matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_51","002_24_51","GEN","24","51","51","Rebekah is here before you. Take her and go, and let her become the wife of your master’s son, just as the LORD has decreed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_52","002_24_52","GEN","24","52","52","When Abraham’s servant heard their words, he bowed down to the ground before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_53","002_24_53","GEN","24","53","53","Then he brought out jewels of silver and gold, and articles of clothing, and he gave them to Rebekah. He also gave precious gifts to her brother and her mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_54","002_24_54","GEN","24","54","54","Then he and the men with him ate and drank and spent the night there. When they got up the next morning, he said, “Send me on my way to my master.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_55","002_24_55","GEN","24","55","55","But her brother and mother said, “Let the girl remain with us ten days or so. After that, she may go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_56","002_24_56","GEN","24","56","56","But he replied, “Do not delay me, since the LORD has made my journey a success. Send me on my way so that I may go to my master.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_57","002_24_57","GEN","24","57","57","So they said, “We will call the girl and ask her opinion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_58","002_24_58","GEN","24","58","58","They called Rebekah and asked her, “Will you go with this man?” “I will go,” she replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_59","002_24_59","GEN","24","59","59","So they sent their sister Rebekah on her way, along with her nurse and Abraham’s servant and his men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_60","002_24_60","GEN","24","60","60","And they blessed Rebekah and said to her, “Our sister, may you become the mother of thousands upon thousands. May your offspring possess the gates of their enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_61","002_24_61","GEN","24","61","61","Then Rebekah and her servant girls got ready, mounted the camels, and followed the man. So the servant took Rebekah and left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_62","002_24_62","GEN","24","62","62","Now Isaac had just returned from Beer-lahai-roi, for he was living in the Negev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_63","002_24_63","GEN","24","63","63","Early in the evening, Isaac went out to the field to meditate, and looking up, he saw the camels approaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_64","002_24_64","GEN","24","64","64","And when Rebekah looked up and saw Isaac, she got down from her camel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_65","002_24_65","GEN","24","65","65","and asked the servant, “Who is that man in the field coming to meet us?” “It is my master,” the servant answered. So she took her veil and covered herself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_66","002_24_66","GEN","24","66","66","Then the servant told Isaac all that he had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN24_67","002_24_67","GEN","24","67","67","And Isaac brought her into the tent of his mother Sarah and took Rebekah as his wife. And Isaac loved her and was comforted after his mother’s death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_1","002_25_1","GEN","25","1","1","Now Abraham had taken another wife, named Keturah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_2","002_25_2","GEN","25","2","2","and she bore him Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_3","002_25_3","GEN","25","3","3","Jokshan was the father of Sheba and Dedan. And the sons of Dedan were the Asshurites, the Letushites, and the Leummites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_4","002_25_4","GEN","25","4","4","The sons of Midian were Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were descendants of Keturah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_5","002_25_5","GEN","25","5","5","Abraham left everything he owned to Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_6","002_25_6","GEN","25","6","6","But while he was still alive, Abraham gave gifts to the sons of his concubines and sent them away from his son Isaac to the land of the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_7","002_25_7","GEN","25","7","7","Abraham lived a total of 175 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_8","002_25_8","GEN","25","8","8","And at a ripe old age he breathed his last and died, old and contented, and was gathered to his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_9","002_25_9","GEN","25","9","9","His sons Isaac and Ishmael buried him in the cave of Machpelah near Mamre, in the field of Ephron son of Zohar the Hittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_10","002_25_10","GEN","25","10","10","This was the field that Abraham had bought from the Hittites. Abraham was buried there with his wife Sarah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_11","002_25_11","GEN","25","11","11","After Abraham’s death, God blessed his son Isaac, who lived near Beer-lahai-roi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_12","002_25_12","GEN","25","12","12","This is the account of Abraham’s son Ishmael, whom Hagar the Egyptian, Sarah’s maidservant, bore to Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_13","002_25_13","GEN","25","13","13","These are the names of the sons of Ishmael in the order of their birth: Nebaioth the firstborn of Ishmael, then Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_14","002_25_14","GEN","25","14","14","Mishma, Dumah, Massa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_15","002_25_15","GEN","25","15","15","Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_16","002_25_16","GEN","25","16","16","These were the sons of Ishmael, and these were their names by their villages and encampments—twelve princes of their tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_17","002_25_17","GEN","25","17","17","Ishmael lived a total of 137 years. Then he breathed his last and died, and was gathered to his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_18","002_25_18","GEN","25","18","18","Ishmael’s descendants settled from Havilah to Shur, which is near the border of Egypt as you go toward Asshur. And they lived in hostility toward all their brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_19","002_25_19","GEN","25","19","19","This is the account of Abraham’s son Isaac. Abraham became the father of Isaac, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_20","002_25_20","GEN","25","20","20","and Isaac was forty years old when he married Rebekah, the daughter of Bethuel the Aramean from Paddan-aram and the sister of Laban the Aramean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_21","002_25_21","GEN","25","21","21","Later, Isaac prayed to the LORD on behalf of his wife, because she was barren. And the LORD heard his prayer, and his wife Rebekah conceived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_22","002_25_22","GEN","25","22","22","But the children inside her struggled with each other, and she said, “Why is this happening to me?” So Rebekah went to inquire of the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_23","002_25_23","GEN","25","23","23","and He declared to her: “Two nations are in your womb, and two peoples from within you will be separated; one people will be stronger than the other, and the older will serve the younger.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_24","002_25_24","GEN","25","24","24","When her time came to give birth, there were indeed twins in her womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_25","002_25_25","GEN","25","25","25","The first one came out red, covered with hair like a fur coat; so they named him Esau. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_26","002_25_26","GEN","25","26","26","After this, his brother came out grasping Esau’s heel; so he was named Jacob. And Isaac was sixty years old when the twins were born. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_27","002_25_27","GEN","25","27","27","When the boys grew up, Esau became a skillful hunter, a man of the field, while Jacob was a quiet man who stayed at home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_28","002_25_28","GEN","25","28","28","Because Isaac had a taste for wild game, he loved Esau; but Rebekah loved Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_29","002_25_29","GEN","25","29","29","One day, while Jacob was cooking some stew, Esau came in from the field and was famished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_30","002_25_30","GEN","25","30","30","He said to Jacob, “Let me eat some of that red stew, for I am famished.” (That is why he was also called Edom.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_31","002_25_31","GEN","25","31","31","“First sell me your birthright,” Jacob replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_32","002_25_32","GEN","25","32","32","“Look,” said Esau, “I am about to die, so what good is a birthright to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_33","002_25_33","GEN","25","33","33","“Swear to me first,” Jacob said. So Esau swore to Jacob and sold him the birthright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN25_34","002_25_34","GEN","25","34","34","Then Jacob gave some bread and lentil stew to Esau, who ate and drank and then got up and went away. Thus Esau despised his birthright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_1","002_26_1","GEN","26","1","1","Now there was another famine in the land, subsequent to the one that had occurred in Abraham’s time. And Isaac went to Abimelech king of the Philistines at Gerar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_2","002_26_2","GEN","26","2","2","The LORD appeared to Isaac and said, “Do not go down to Egypt. Settle in the land where I tell you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_3","002_26_3","GEN","26","3","3","Stay in this land as a foreigner, and I will be with you and bless you. For I will give all these lands to you and your offspring, and I will confirm the oath that I swore to your father Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_4","002_26_4","GEN","26","4","4","I will make your descendants as numerous as the stars in the sky, and I will give them all these lands, and through your offspring all nations of the earth will be blessed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_5","002_26_5","GEN","26","5","5","because Abraham listened to My voice and kept My charge, My commandments, My statutes, and My laws.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_6","002_26_6","GEN","26","6","6","So Isaac settled in Gerar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_7","002_26_7","GEN","26","7","7","But when the men of that place asked about his wife, he said, “She is my sister.” For he was afraid to say, “She is my wife,” since he thought to himself, “The men of this place will kill me on account of Rebekah, because she is so beautiful.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_8","002_26_8","GEN","26","8","8","When Isaac had been there a long time, Abimelech king of the Philistines looked down from the window and was surprised to see Isaac caressing his wife Rebekah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_9","002_26_9","GEN","26","9","9","Abimelech sent for Isaac and said, “So she is really your wife! How could you say, ‘She is my sister’?” Isaac replied, “Because I thought I might die on account of her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_10","002_26_10","GEN","26","10","10","“What is this you have done to us?” asked Abimelech. “One of the people could easily have slept with your wife, and you would have brought guilt upon us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_11","002_26_11","GEN","26","11","11","So Abimelech warned all the people, saying, “Whoever harms this man or his wife will surely be put to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_12","002_26_12","GEN","26","12","12","Now Isaac sowed seed in the land, and that very year he reaped a hundredfold. And the LORD blessed him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_13","002_26_13","GEN","26","13","13","and he became richer and richer, until he was exceedingly wealthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_14","002_26_14","GEN","26","14","14","He owned so many flocks and herds and servants that the Philistines envied him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_15","002_26_15","GEN","26","15","15","So the Philistines took dirt and stopped up all the wells that his father’s servants had dug in the days of his father Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_16","002_26_16","GEN","26","16","16","Then Abimelech said to Isaac, “Depart from us, for you are much too powerful for us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_17","002_26_17","GEN","26","17","17","So Isaac left that place and encamped in the Valley of Gerar and settled there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_18","002_26_18","GEN","26","18","18","Isaac reopened the wells that had been dug in the days of his father Abraham, which the Philistines had stopped up after Abraham died. And he gave these wells the same names his father had given them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_19","002_26_19","GEN","26","19","19","Then Isaac’s servants dug in the valley and found a well of fresh water there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_20","002_26_20","GEN","26","20","20","But the herdsmen of Gerar quarreled with Isaac’s herdsmen and said, “The water is ours!” So he named the well Esek, because they contended with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_21","002_26_21","GEN","26","21","21","Then they dug another well and quarreled over that one also; so he named it Sitnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_22","002_26_22","GEN","26","22","22","He moved on from there and dug another well, and they did not quarrel over it. He named it Rehoboth and said, “At last the LORD has made room for us, and we will be fruitful in the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_23","002_26_23","GEN","26","23","23","From there Isaac went up to Beersheba, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_24","002_26_24","GEN","26","24","24","and that night the LORD appeared to him and said, “I am the God of your father Abraham. Do not be afraid, for I am with you. I will bless you and multiply your descendants for the sake of My servant Abraham.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_25","002_26_25","GEN","26","25","25","So Isaac built an altar there and called on the name of the LORD, and he pitched his tent there. His servants also dug a well there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_26","002_26_26","GEN","26","26","26","Later, Abimelech came to Isaac from Gerar, with Ahuzzath his adviser and Phicol the commander of his army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_27","002_26_27","GEN","26","27","27","“Why have you come to me?” Isaac asked them. “You hated me and sent me away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_28","002_26_28","GEN","26","28","28","“We can plainly see that the LORD has been with you,” they replied. “We recommend that there should now be an oath between us and you. Let us make a covenant with you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_29","002_26_29","GEN","26","29","29","that you will not harm us, just as we have not harmed you but have done only good to you, sending you on your way in peace. And now you are blessed by the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_30","002_26_30","GEN","26","30","30","So Isaac prepared a feast for them, and they ate and drank. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_31","002_26_31","GEN","26","31","31","And they got up early the next morning and swore an oath to each other. Then Isaac sent them on their way, and they left him in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_32","002_26_32","GEN","26","32","32","On that same day, Isaac’s servants came and told him about the well they had dug. “We have found water!” they told him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_33","002_26_33","GEN","26","33","33","So he called it Shibah, and to this day the name of the city is Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_34","002_26_34","GEN","26","34","34","When Esau was forty years old, he took as his wives Judith daughter of Beeri the Hittite and Basemath daughter of Elon the Hittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN26_35","002_26_35","GEN","26","35","35","And they brought grief to Isaac and Rebekah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_1","002_27_1","GEN","27","1","1","When Isaac was old and his eyes were so weak that he could no longer see, he called his older son Esau and said to him, “My son.” “Here I am,” Esau replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_2","002_27_2","GEN","27","2","2","“Look,” said Isaac, “I am now old, and I do not know the day of my death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_3","002_27_3","GEN","27","3","3","Take your weapons—your quiver and bow—and go out into the field to hunt some game for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_4","002_27_4","GEN","27","4","4","Then prepare a tasty dish that I love and bring it to me to eat, so that I may bless you before I die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_5","002_27_5","GEN","27","5","5","Now Rebekah was listening to what Isaac told his son Esau. So when Esau went into the field to hunt game and bring it back, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_6","002_27_6","GEN","27","6","6","Rebekah said to her son Jacob, “Behold, I overheard your father saying to your brother Esau, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_7","002_27_7","GEN","27","7","7","‘Bring me some game and prepare me a tasty dish to eat, so that I may bless you in the presence of the LORD before I die.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_8","002_27_8","GEN","27","8","8","Now, my son, listen to my voice and do exactly as I tell you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_9","002_27_9","GEN","27","9","9","Go out to the flock and bring me two choice young goats, so that I can make them into a tasty dish for your father—the kind he loves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_10","002_27_10","GEN","27","10","10","Then take it to your father to eat, so that he may bless you before he dies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_11","002_27_11","GEN","27","11","11","Jacob answered his mother Rebekah, “Look, my brother Esau is a hairy man, but I am smooth-skinned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_12","002_27_12","GEN","27","12","12","What if my father touches me? Then I would be revealed to him as a deceiver, and I would bring upon myself a curse rather than a blessing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_13","002_27_13","GEN","27","13","13","His mother replied, “Your curse be on me, my son. Just obey my voice and go get them for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_14","002_27_14","GEN","27","14","14","So Jacob went and got two goats and brought them to his mother, who made the tasty food his father loved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_15","002_27_15","GEN","27","15","15","And Rebekah took the finest clothes in the house that belonged to her older son Esau, and she put them on her younger son Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_16","002_27_16","GEN","27","16","16","She also put the skins of the young goats on his hands and on the smooth part of his neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_17","002_27_17","GEN","27","17","17","Then she handed her son Jacob the tasty food and bread she had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_18","002_27_18","GEN","27","18","18","So Jacob went to his father and said, “My father.” “Here I am!” he answered. “Which one are you, my son?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_19","002_27_19","GEN","27","19","19","Jacob said to his father, “I am Esau, your firstborn. I have done as you told me. Please sit up and eat some of my game, so that you may bless me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_20","002_27_20","GEN","27","20","20","But Isaac asked his son, “How did you ever find it so quickly, my son?” “Because the LORD your God brought it to me,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_21","002_27_21","GEN","27","21","21","Then Isaac said to Jacob, “Please come closer so I can touch you, my son. Are you really my son Esau, or not?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_22","002_27_22","GEN","27","22","22","So Jacob came close to his father Isaac, who touched him and said, “The voice is the voice of Jacob, but the hands are the hands of Esau.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_23","002_27_23","GEN","27","23","23","Isaac did not recognize him, because his hands were hairy like those of his brother Esau; so he blessed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_24","002_27_24","GEN","27","24","24","Again he asked, “Are you really my son Esau?” And he replied, “I am.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_25","002_27_25","GEN","27","25","25","“Serve me,” said Isaac, “and let me eat some of my son’s game, so that I may bless you.” Jacob brought it to him, and he ate; then he brought him wine, and he drank. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_26","002_27_26","GEN","27","26","26","Then his father Isaac said to him, “Please come near and kiss me, my son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_27","002_27_27","GEN","27","27","27","So he came near and kissed him. When Isaac smelled his clothing, he blessed him and said: “Ah, the smell of my son is like the smell of a field that the LORD has blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_28","002_27_28","GEN","27","28","28","May God give to you the dew of heaven and the richness of the earth—an abundance of grain and new wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_29","002_27_29","GEN","27","29","29","May peoples serve you and nations bow down to you. May you be the master of your brothers, and may the sons of your mother bow down to you. May those who curse you be cursed, and those who bless you be blessed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_30","002_27_30","GEN","27","30","30","As soon as Isaac had finished blessing him and Jacob had left his father’s presence, his brother Esau returned from the hunt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_31","002_27_31","GEN","27","31","31","He too made some tasty food, brought it to his father, and said to him, “My father, sit up and eat of your son’s game, so that you may bless me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_32","002_27_32","GEN","27","32","32","But his father Isaac replied, “Who are you?” “I am Esau, your firstborn son,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_33","002_27_33","GEN","27","33","33","Isaac began to tremble violently and said, “Who was it, then, who hunted the game and brought it to me? Before you came in, I ate it all and blessed him—and indeed, he will be blessed!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_34","002_27_34","GEN","27","34","34","When Esau heard his father’s words, he let out a loud and bitter cry and said to his father, “Bless me too, O my father!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_35","002_27_35","GEN","27","35","35","But Isaac replied, “Your brother came deceitfully and took your blessing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_36","002_27_36","GEN","27","36","36","So Esau declared, “Is he not rightly named Jacob? For he has cheated me twice. He took my birthright, and now he has taken my blessing.” Then he asked, “Haven’t you saved a blessing for me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_37","002_27_37","GEN","27","37","37","But Isaac answered Esau: “Look, I have made him your master and given him all his relatives as servants; I have sustained him with grain and new wine. What is left that I can do for you, my son?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_38","002_27_38","GEN","27","38","38","Esau said to his father, “Do you have only one blessing, my father? Bless me too, O my father!” Then Esau wept aloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_39","002_27_39","GEN","27","39","39","His father Isaac answered him: “Behold, your dwelling place shall be away from the richness of the land, away from the dew of heaven above. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_40","002_27_40","GEN","27","40","40","You shall live by the sword and serve your brother. But when you rebel, you will tear his yoke from your neck.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_41","002_27_41","GEN","27","41","41","Esau held a grudge against Jacob because of the blessing his father had given him. And Esau said in his heart, “The days of mourning for my father are at hand; then I will kill my brother Jacob.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_42","002_27_42","GEN","27","42","42","When the words of her older son Esau were relayed to Rebekah, she sent for her younger son Jacob and told him, “Look, your brother Esau is consoling himself by plotting to kill you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_43","002_27_43","GEN","27","43","43","So now, my son, obey my voice and flee at once to my brother Laban in Haran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_44","002_27_44","GEN","27","44","44","Stay with him for a while, until your brother’s fury subsides— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_45","002_27_45","GEN","27","45","45","until your brother’s rage against you wanes and he forgets what you have done to him. Then I will send for you and bring you back from there. Why should I lose both of you in one day?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN27_46","002_27_46","GEN","27","46","46","Then Rebekah said to Isaac, “I am weary of my life because of these Hittite women. If Jacob takes a Hittite wife from among them, what good is my life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_1","002_28_1","GEN","28","1","1","So Isaac called for Jacob and blessed him. “Do not take a wife from the Canaanite women,” he commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_2","002_28_2","GEN","28","2","2","“Go at once to Paddan-aram, to the house of your mother’s father Bethuel, and take a wife from among the daughters of Laban, your mother’s brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_3","002_28_3","GEN","28","3","3","May God Almighty bless you and make you fruitful and multiply you, so that you may become a company of peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_4","002_28_4","GEN","28","4","4","And may He give the blessing of Abraham to you and your descendants, so that you may possess the land where you dwell as a foreigner, the land God gave to Abraham.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_5","002_28_5","GEN","28","5","5","So Isaac sent Jacob to Paddan-aram, to Laban son of Bethuel the Aramean, the brother of Rebekah, who was the mother of Jacob and Esau. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_6","002_28_6","GEN","28","6","6","Now Esau learned that Isaac had blessed Jacob and sent him to Paddan-aram to take a wife there, commanding him, “Do not marry a Canaanite woman,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_7","002_28_7","GEN","28","7","7","and that Jacob had obeyed his father and mother and gone to Paddan-aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_8","002_28_8","GEN","28","8","8","And seeing that his father Isaac disapproved of the Canaanite women, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_9","002_28_9","GEN","28","9","9","Esau went to Ishmael and married Mahalath, the sister of Nebaioth and daughter of Abraham’s son Ishmael, in addition to the wives he already had. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_10","002_28_10","GEN","28","10","10","Meanwhile Jacob left Beersheba and set out for Haran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_11","002_28_11","GEN","28","11","11","On reaching a certain place, he spent the night there because the sun had set. And taking one of the stones from that place, he put it under his head and lay down to sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_12","002_28_12","GEN","28","12","12","And Jacob had a dream about a ladder that rested on the earth with its top reaching up to heaven, and God’s angels were going up and down the ladder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_13","002_28_13","GEN","28","13","13","And there at the top the LORD was standing and saying, “I am the LORD, the God of your father Abraham and the God of Isaac. I will give you and your descendants the land on which you now lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_14","002_28_14","GEN","28","14","14","Your descendants will be like the dust of the earth, and you will spread out to the west and east and north and south. All the families of the earth will be blessed through you and your offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_15","002_28_15","GEN","28","15","15","Look, I am with you, and I will watch over you wherever you go, and I will bring you back to this land. For I will not leave you until I have done what I have promised you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_16","002_28_16","GEN","28","16","16","When Jacob woke up, he said, “Surely the LORD is in this place, and I was unaware of it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_17","002_28_17","GEN","28","17","17","And he was afraid and said, “How awesome is this place! This is none other than the house of God; this is the gate of heaven!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_18","002_28_18","GEN","28","18","18","Early the next morning, Jacob took the stone that he had placed under his head, and he set it up as a pillar. He poured oil on top of it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_19","002_28_19","GEN","28","19","19","and he called that place Bethel, though previously the city had been named Luz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_20","002_28_20","GEN","28","20","20","Then Jacob made a vow, saying, “If God will be with me and watch over me on this journey, and if He will provide me with food to eat and clothes to wear, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_21","002_28_21","GEN","28","21","21","so that I may return safely to my father’s house, then the LORD will be my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN28_22","002_28_22","GEN","28","22","22","And this stone I have set up as a pillar will be God’s house, and of all that You give me I will surely give You a tenth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_1","002_29_1","GEN","29","1","1","Jacob resumed his journey and came to the land of the people of the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_2","002_29_2","GEN","29","2","2","He looked and saw a well in the field, and near it lay three flocks of sheep, because the sheep were watered from this well. And a large stone covered the mouth of the well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_3","002_29_3","GEN","29","3","3","When all the flocks had been gathered there, the shepherds would roll away the stone from the mouth of the well and water the sheep. Then they would return the stone to its place over the mouth of the well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_4","002_29_4","GEN","29","4","4","“My brothers,” Jacob asked the shepherds, “where are you from?” “We are from Haran,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_5","002_29_5","GEN","29","5","5","“Do you know Laban the grandson of Nahor?” Jacob asked. “We know him,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_6","002_29_6","GEN","29","6","6","“Is he well?” Jacob inquired. “Yes,” they answered, “and here comes his daughter Rachel with his sheep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_7","002_29_7","GEN","29","7","7","“Look,” said Jacob, “it is still broad daylight; it is not yet time to gather the livestock. Water the sheep and take them back to pasture.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_8","002_29_8","GEN","29","8","8","But they replied, “We cannot, until all the flocks have been gathered and the stone has been rolled away from the mouth of the well. Then we will water the sheep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_9","002_29_9","GEN","29","9","9","While he was still speaking with them, Rachel arrived with her father’s sheep, for she was a shepherdess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_10","002_29_10","GEN","29","10","10","As soon as Jacob saw Rachel, the daughter of his mother’s brother Laban, with Laban’s sheep, he went up and rolled the stone away from the mouth of the well and watered his uncle’s sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_11","002_29_11","GEN","29","11","11","Then Jacob kissed Rachel and wept aloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_12","002_29_12","GEN","29","12","12","He told Rachel that he was Rebekah’s son, a relative of her father, and she ran and told her father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_13","002_29_13","GEN","29","13","13","When Laban heard the news about his sister’s son Jacob, he ran out to meet him. He embraced him and kissed him and brought him to his home, where Jacob told him all that had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_14","002_29_14","GEN","29","14","14","Then Laban declared, “You are indeed my own flesh and blood.” After Jacob had stayed with him a month, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_15","002_29_15","GEN","29","15","15","Laban said to him, “Just because you are my relative, should you work for nothing? Tell me what your wages should be.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_16","002_29_16","GEN","29","16","16","Now Laban had two daughters; the older was named Leah, and the younger was named Rachel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_17","002_29_17","GEN","29","17","17","Leah had weak eyes, but Rachel was shapely and beautiful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_18","002_29_18","GEN","29","18","18","Since Jacob loved Rachel, he answered, “I will serve you seven years for your younger daughter Rachel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_19","002_29_19","GEN","29","19","19","Laban replied, “Better that I give her to you than to another. Stay here with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_20","002_29_20","GEN","29","20","20","So Jacob served seven years for Rachel, yet it seemed but a few days because of his love for her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_21","002_29_21","GEN","29","21","21","Finally Jacob said to Laban, “Grant me my wife, for my time is complete, and I want to sleep with her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_22","002_29_22","GEN","29","22","22","So Laban invited all the men of that place and prepared a feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_23","002_29_23","GEN","29","23","23","But when evening came, Laban took his daughter Leah and gave her to Jacob, and he slept with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_24","002_29_24","GEN","29","24","24","And Laban gave his servant girl Zilpah to his daughter Leah as her maidservant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_25","002_29_25","GEN","29","25","25","When morning came, there was Leah! “What have you done to me?” Jacob said to Laban. “Wasn’t it for Rachel that I served you? Why have you deceived me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_26","002_29_26","GEN","29","26","26","Laban replied, “It is not our custom here to give the younger daughter in marriage before the older. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_27","002_29_27","GEN","29","27","27","Finish this week’s celebration, and we will give you the younger one in return for another seven years of work.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_28","002_29_28","GEN","29","28","28","And Jacob did just that. He finished the week’s celebration, and Laban gave him his daughter Rachel as his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_29","002_29_29","GEN","29","29","29","Laban also gave his servant girl Bilhah to his daughter Rachel as her maidservant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_30","002_29_30","GEN","29","30","30","Jacob slept with Rachel as well, and indeed, he loved Rachel more than Leah. So he worked for Laban another seven years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_31","002_29_31","GEN","29","31","31","When the LORD saw that Leah was unloved, He opened her womb; but Rachel was barren. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_32","002_29_32","GEN","29","32","32","And Leah conceived and gave birth to a son, and she named him Reuben, for she said, “The LORD has seen my affliction. Surely my husband will love me now.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_33","002_29_33","GEN","29","33","33","Again she conceived and gave birth to a son, and she said, “Because the LORD has heard that I am unloved, He has given me this son as well.” So she named him Simeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_34","002_29_34","GEN","29","34","34","Once again Leah conceived and gave birth to a son, and she said, “Now at last my husband will become attached to me, because I have borne him three sons.” So he was named Levi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN29_35","002_29_35","GEN","29","35","35","And once more she conceived and gave birth to a son and said, “This time I will praise the LORD.” So she named him Judah. Then Leah stopped having children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_1","002_30_1","GEN","30","1","1","When Rachel saw that she was not bearing any children for Jacob, she envied her sister. “Give me children, or I will die!” she said to Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_2","002_30_2","GEN","30","2","2","Jacob became angry with Rachel and said, “Am I in the place of God, who has withheld children from you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_3","002_30_3","GEN","30","3","3","Then she said, “Here is my maidservant Bilhah. Sleep with her, that she may bear children for me, so that through her I too can build a family.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_4","002_30_4","GEN","30","4","4","So Rachel gave Jacob her servant Bilhah as a wife, and he slept with her, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_5","002_30_5","GEN","30","5","5","and Bilhah conceived and bore him a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_6","002_30_6","GEN","30","6","6","Then Rachel said, “God has vindicated me; He has heard my plea and given me a son.” So she named him Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_7","002_30_7","GEN","30","7","7","And Rachel’s servant Bilhah conceived again and bore Jacob a second son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_8","002_30_8","GEN","30","8","8","Then Rachel said, “In my great struggles, I have wrestled with my sister and won.” So she named him Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_9","002_30_9","GEN","30","9","9","When Leah saw that she had stopped having children, she gave her servant Zilpah to Jacob as a wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_10","002_30_10","GEN","30","10","10","And Leah’s servant Zilpah bore Jacob a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_11","002_30_11","GEN","30","11","11","Then Leah said, “How fortunate!” So she named him Gad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_12","002_30_12","GEN","30","12","12","When Leah’s servant Zilpah bore Jacob a second son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_13","002_30_13","GEN","30","13","13","Leah said, “How happy I am! For the women call me happy.” So she named him Asher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_14","002_30_14","GEN","30","14","14","Now during the wheat harvest, Reuben went out and found some mandrakes in the field. When he brought them to his mother, Rachel begged Leah, “Please give me some of your son’s mandrakes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_15","002_30_15","GEN","30","15","15","But Leah replied, “Is it not enough that you have taken away my husband? Now you want to take my son’s mandrakes as well?” “Very well,” said Rachel, “he may sleep with you tonight in exchange for your son’s mandrakes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_16","002_30_16","GEN","30","16","16","When Jacob came in from the field that evening, Leah went out to meet him and said, “You must come with me, for I have hired you with my son’s mandrakes.” So he slept with her that night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_17","002_30_17","GEN","30","17","17","And God listened to Leah, and she conceived and bore a fifth son to Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_18","002_30_18","GEN","30","18","18","Then Leah said, “God has rewarded me for giving my maidservant to my husband.” So she named him Issachar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_19","002_30_19","GEN","30","19","19","Again Leah conceived and bore a sixth son to Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_20","002_30_20","GEN","30","20","20","“God has given me a good gift,” she said. “This time my husband will honor me, because I have borne him six sons.” And she named him Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_21","002_30_21","GEN","30","21","21","After that, Leah gave birth to a daughter and named her Dinah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_22","002_30_22","GEN","30","22","22","Then God remembered Rachel. He listened to her and opened her womb, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_23","002_30_23","GEN","30","23","23","and she conceived and gave birth to a son. “God has taken away my shame,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_24","002_30_24","GEN","30","24","24","She named him Joseph, and said, “May the LORD add to me another son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_25","002_30_25","GEN","30","25","25","Now after Rachel had given birth to Joseph, Jacob said to Laban, “Send me on my way so I can return to my homeland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_26","002_30_26","GEN","30","26","26","Give me my wives and children for whom I have served you, that I may go on my way. You know how hard I have worked for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_27","002_30_27","GEN","30","27","27","But Laban replied, “If I have found favor in your eyes, please stay. I have learned by divination that the LORD has blessed me because of you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_28","002_30_28","GEN","30","28","28","And he added, “Name your wages, and I will pay them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_29","002_30_29","GEN","30","29","29","Then Jacob answered, “You know how I have served you and how your livestock have thrived under my care. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_30","002_30_30","GEN","30","30","30","Indeed, you had very little before my arrival, but now your wealth has increased many times over. The LORD has blessed you wherever I set foot. But now, when may I also provide for my own household?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_31","002_30_31","GEN","30","31","31","“What can I give you?” Laban asked. “You do not need to give me anything,” Jacob replied. “If you do this one thing for me, I will keep on shepherding and keeping your flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_32","002_30_32","GEN","30","32","32","Let me go through all your flocks today and remove from them every speckled or spotted sheep, every dark-colored lamb, and every spotted or speckled goat. These will be my wages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_33","002_30_33","GEN","30","33","33","So my honesty will testify for me when you come to check on my wages in the future. If I have any goats that are not speckled or spotted, or any lambs that are not dark-colored, they will be considered stolen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_34","002_30_34","GEN","30","34","34","“Agreed,” said Laban. “Let it be as you have said.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_35","002_30_35","GEN","30","35","35","That very day Laban removed all the streaked or spotted male goats and every speckled or spotted female goat—every one that had any white on it—and every dark-colored lamb, and he placed them under the care of his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_36","002_30_36","GEN","30","36","36","Then he put a three-day journey between himself and Jacob, while Jacob was shepherding the rest of Laban’s flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_37","002_30_37","GEN","30","37","37","Jacob, however, took fresh branches of poplar, almond, and plane trees, and peeled the bark, exposing the white inner wood of the branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_38","002_30_38","GEN","30","38","38","Then he set the peeled branches in the watering troughs in front of the flocks coming in to drink. So when the flocks were in heat and came to drink, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_39","002_30_39","GEN","30","39","39","they mated in front of the branches. And they bore young that were streaked or speckled or spotted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_40","002_30_40","GEN","30","40","40","Jacob set apart the young, but made the rest face the streaked dark-colored sheep in Laban’s flocks. Then he set his own stock apart and did not put them with Laban’s animals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_41","002_30_41","GEN","30","41","41","Whenever the stronger females of the flock were in heat, Jacob would place the branches in the troughs, in full view of the animals, so that they would breed in front of the branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_42","002_30_42","GEN","30","42","42","But if the animals were weak, he did not set out the branches. So the weaker animals went to Laban and the stronger ones to Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN30_43","002_30_43","GEN","30","43","43","Thus Jacob became exceedingly prosperous. He owned large flocks, maidservants and menservants, and camels and donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_1","002_31_1","GEN","31","1","1","Now Jacob heard that Laban’s sons were saying, “Jacob has taken away all that belonged to our father and built all this wealth at our father’s expense.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_2","002_31_2","GEN","31","2","2","And Jacob saw from the countenance of Laban that his attitude toward him had changed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_3","002_31_3","GEN","31","3","3","Then the LORD said to Jacob, “Go back to the land of your fathers and to your kindred, and I will be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_4","002_31_4","GEN","31","4","4","So Jacob sent word and called Rachel and Leah to the field where his flocks were, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_5","002_31_5","GEN","31","5","5","and he told them, “I can see from your father’s countenance that his attitude toward me has changed; but the God of my father has been with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_6","002_31_6","GEN","31","6","6","You know that I have served your father with all my strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_7","002_31_7","GEN","31","7","7","And although he has cheated me and changed my wages ten times, God has not allowed him to harm me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_8","002_31_8","GEN","31","8","8","If he said, ‘The speckled will be your wages,’ then the whole flock bore speckled offspring. If he said, ‘The streaked will be your wages,’ then the whole flock bore streaked offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_9","002_31_9","GEN","31","9","9","Thus God has taken away your father’s livestock and given them to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_10","002_31_10","GEN","31","10","10","When the flocks were breeding, I saw in a dream that the streaked, spotted, and speckled males were mating with the females. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_11","002_31_11","GEN","31","11","11","In that dream the angel of God said to me, ‘Jacob!’ And I replied, ‘Here I am.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_12","002_31_12","GEN","31","12","12","‘Look up,’ he said, ‘and see that all the males that are mating with the flock are streaked, spotted, or speckled; for I have seen all that Laban has done to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_13","002_31_13","GEN","31","13","13","I am the God of Bethel, where you anointed the pillar and made a solemn vow to Me. Now get up, leave this land at once, and return to your native land.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_14","002_31_14","GEN","31","14","14","And Rachel and Leah replied, “Do we have any portion or inheritance left in our father’s house? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_15","002_31_15","GEN","31","15","15","Are we not regarded by him as outsiders? Not only has he sold us, but he has certainly squandered what was paid for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_16","002_31_16","GEN","31","16","16","Surely all the wealth that God has taken away from our father belongs to us and to our children. So do whatever God has told you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_17","002_31_17","GEN","31","17","17","Then Jacob got up and put his children and his wives on camels, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_18","002_31_18","GEN","31","18","18","and he drove all his livestock before him, along with all the possessions he had acquired in Paddan-aram, to go to his father Isaac in the land in Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_19","002_31_19","GEN","31","19","19","Now while Laban was out shearing his sheep, Rachel stole her father’s household idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_20","002_31_20","GEN","31","20","20","Moreover, Jacob deceived Laban the Aramean by not telling him that he was running away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_21","002_31_21","GEN","31","21","21","So he fled with all his possessions, crossed the Euphrates, and headed for the hill country of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_22","002_31_22","GEN","31","22","22","On the third day Laban was informed that Jacob had fled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_23","002_31_23","GEN","31","23","23","So he took his relatives with him, pursued Jacob for seven days, and overtook him in the hill country of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_24","002_31_24","GEN","31","24","24","But that night God came to Laban the Aramean in a dream and warned him, “Be careful not to say anything to Jacob, either good or bad.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_25","002_31_25","GEN","31","25","25","Now Jacob had pitched his tent in the hill country of Gilead when Laban overtook him, and Laban and his relatives camped there as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_26","002_31_26","GEN","31","26","26","Then Laban said to Jacob, “What have you done? You have deceived me and carried off my daughters like captives of war! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_27","002_31_27","GEN","31","27","27","Why did you run away secretly and deceive me, without even telling me? I would have sent you away with joy and singing, with tambourines and harps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_28","002_31_28","GEN","31","28","28","But you did not even let me kiss my grandchildren and my daughters goodbye. Now you have done a foolish thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_29","002_31_29","GEN","31","29","29","I have power to do you great harm, but last night the God of your father said to me, ‘Be careful not to say anything to Jacob, either good or bad.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_30","002_31_30","GEN","31","30","30","Now you have gone off because you long for your father’s house. But why have you stolen my gods?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_31","002_31_31","GEN","31","31","31","“I was afraid,” Jacob answered, “for I thought you would take your daughters from me by force. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_32","002_31_32","GEN","31","32","32","If you find your gods with anyone here, he shall not live! In the presence of our relatives, see for yourself if anything is yours, and take it back.” For Jacob did not know that Rachel had stolen the idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_33","002_31_33","GEN","31","33","33","So Laban went into Jacob’s tent, then Leah’s tent, and then the tents of the two maidservants, but he found nothing. Then he left Leah’s tent and entered Rachel’s tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_34","002_31_34","GEN","31","34","34","Now Rachel had taken Laban’s household idols, put them in the saddlebag of her camel, and was sitting on them. And Laban searched everything in the tent but found nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_35","002_31_35","GEN","31","35","35","Rachel said to her father, “Sir, do not be angry that I cannot stand up before you; for I am having my period.” So Laban searched but could not find the household idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_36","002_31_36","GEN","31","36","36","Then Jacob became incensed and challenged Laban. “What is my crime?” he said. “For what sin of mine have you so hotly pursued me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_37","002_31_37","GEN","31","37","37","You have searched all my goods! Have you found anything that belongs to you? Put it here before my brothers and yours, that they may judge between the two of us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_38","002_31_38","GEN","31","38","38","I have been with you for twenty years now. Your sheep and goats have not miscarried, nor have I eaten the rams of your flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_39","002_31_39","GEN","31","39","39","I did not bring you anything torn by wild beasts; I bore the loss myself. And you demanded payment from me for what was stolen by day or night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_40","002_31_40","GEN","31","40","40","As it was, the heat consumed me by day and the frost by night, and sleep fled from my eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_41","002_31_41","GEN","31","41","41","Thus for twenty years I have served in your household—fourteen years for your two daughters and six years for your flocks—and you have changed my wages ten times! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_42","002_31_42","GEN","31","42","42","If the God of my father, the God of Abraham and the Fear of Isaac, had not been with me, surely by now you would have sent me away empty-handed. But God has seen my affliction and the toil of my hands, and last night He rendered judgment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_43","002_31_43","GEN","31","43","43","But Laban answered Jacob, “These daughters are my daughters, these sons are my sons, and these flocks are my flocks! Everything you see is mine! Yet what can I do today about these daughters of mine or the children they have borne? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_44","002_31_44","GEN","31","44","44","Come now, let us make a covenant, you and I, and let it serve as a witness between you and me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_45","002_31_45","GEN","31","45","45","So Jacob picked out a stone and set it up as a pillar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_46","002_31_46","GEN","31","46","46","and he said to his relatives, “Gather some stones.” So they took stones and made a mound, and there by the mound they ate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_47","002_31_47","GEN","31","47","47","Laban called it Jegar-sahadutha, and Jacob called it Galeed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_48","002_31_48","GEN","31","48","48","Then Laban declared, “This mound is a witness between you and me this day.” Therefore the place was called Galeed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_49","002_31_49","GEN","31","49","49","It was also called Mizpah, because Laban said, “May the LORD keep watch between you and me when we are absent from each other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_50","002_31_50","GEN","31","50","50","If you mistreat my daughters or take other wives, although no one is with us, remember that God is a witness between you and me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_51","002_31_51","GEN","31","51","51","Laban also said to Jacob, “Here is the mound, and here is the pillar I have set up between you and me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_52","002_31_52","GEN","31","52","52","This mound is a witness, and this pillar is a witness, that I will not go past this mound to harm you, and you will not go past this mound and pillar to harm me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_53","002_31_53","GEN","31","53","53","May the God of Abraham and the God of Nahor, the God of their father, judge between us.” So Jacob swore by the Fear of his father Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_54","002_31_54","GEN","31","54","54","Then Jacob offered a sacrifice on the mountain and invited his relatives to eat a meal. And after they had eaten, they spent the night on the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN31_55","002_31_55","GEN","31","55","55","Early the next morning, Laban got up and kissed his grandchildren and daughters and blessed them. Then he left to return home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_1","002_32_1","GEN","32","1","1","Jacob also went on his way, and the angels of God met him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_2","002_32_2","GEN","32","2","2","When Jacob saw them, he said, “This is the camp of God.” So he named that place Mahanaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_3","002_32_3","GEN","32","3","3","Jacob sent messengers ahead of him to his brother Esau in the land of Seir, the country of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_4","002_32_4","GEN","32","4","4","He instructed them, “You are to say to my master Esau, ‘Your servant Jacob says: I have been staying with Laban and have remained there until now. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_5","002_32_5","GEN","32","5","5","I have oxen, donkeys, flocks, menservants, and maidservants. I have sent this message to inform my master, so that I may find favor in your sight.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_6","002_32_6","GEN","32","6","6","When the messengers returned to Jacob, they said, “We went to your brother Esau, and now he is coming to meet you—he and four hundred men with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_7","002_32_7","GEN","32","7","7","In great fear and distress, Jacob divided his people into two camps, as well as the flocks and herds and camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_8","002_32_8","GEN","32","8","8","He thought, “If Esau comes and attacks one camp, then the other camp can escape.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_9","002_32_9","GEN","32","9","9","Then Jacob declared, “O God of my father Abraham, God of my father Isaac, the LORD who told me, ‘Go back to your country and to your kindred, and I will make you prosper,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_10","002_32_10","GEN","32","10","10","I am unworthy of all the kindness and faithfulness You have shown Your servant. Indeed, with only my staff I came across the Jordan, but now I have become two camps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_11","002_32_11","GEN","32","11","11","Please deliver me from the hand of my brother Esau, for I am afraid that he may come and attack me and the mothers and children with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_12","002_32_12","GEN","32","12","12","But You have said, ‘I will surely make you prosper, and I will make your offspring like the sand of the sea, too numerous to count.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_13","002_32_13","GEN","32","13","13","Jacob spent the night there, and from what he had brought with him, he selected a gift for his brother Esau: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_14","002_32_14","GEN","32","14","14","200 female goats, 20 male goats, 200 ewes, 20 rams, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_15","002_32_15","GEN","32","15","15","30 milk camels with their young, 40 cows, 10 bulls, 20 female donkeys, and 10 male donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_16","002_32_16","GEN","32","16","16","He entrusted them to his servants in separate herds and told them, “Go on ahead of me, and keep some distance between the herds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_17","002_32_17","GEN","32","17","17","He instructed the one in the lead, “When my brother Esau meets you and asks, ‘To whom do you belong, where are you going, and whose animals are these before you?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_18","002_32_18","GEN","32","18","18","then you are to say, ‘They belong to your servant Jacob. They are a gift, sent to my lord Esau. And behold, Jacob is behind us.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_19","002_32_19","GEN","32","19","19","He also instructed the second, the third, and all those following behind the herds: “When you meet Esau, you are to say the same thing to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_20","002_32_20","GEN","32","20","20","You are also to say, ‘Look, your servant Jacob is right behind us.’” For he thought, “I will appease Esau with the gift that is going before me. After that I can face him, and perhaps he will accept me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_21","002_32_21","GEN","32","21","21","So Jacob’s gifts went on before him, while he spent the night in the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_22","002_32_22","GEN","32","22","22","During the night Jacob got up and took his two wives, his two maidservants, and his eleven sons, and crossed the ford of the Jabbok. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_23","002_32_23","GEN","32","23","23","He took them and sent them across the stream, along with all his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_24","002_32_24","GEN","32","24","24","So Jacob was left all alone, and there a man wrestled with him until daybreak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_25","002_32_25","GEN","32","25","25","When the man saw that he could not overpower Jacob, he struck the socket of Jacob’s hip and dislocated it as they wrestled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_26","002_32_26","GEN","32","26","26","Then the man said, “Let me go, for it is daybreak.” But Jacob replied, “I will not let you go unless you bless me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_27","002_32_27","GEN","32","27","27","“What is your name?” the man asked. “Jacob,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_28","002_32_28","GEN","32","28","28","Then the man said, “Your name will no longer be Jacob, but Israel, because you have struggled with God and with men, and you have prevailed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_29","002_32_29","GEN","32","29","29","And Jacob requested, “Please tell me your name.” But he replied, “Why do you ask my name?” Then he blessed Jacob there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_30","002_32_30","GEN","32","30","30","So Jacob named the place Peniel, saying, “Indeed, I have seen God face to face, and yet my life was spared.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_31","002_32_31","GEN","32","31","31","The sun rose above him as he passed by Penuel, and he was limping because of his hip. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN32_32","002_32_32","GEN","32","32","32","Therefore to this day the Israelites do not eat the tendon attached to the socket of the hip, because the socket of Jacob’s hip was struck near that tendon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_1","002_33_1","GEN","33","1","1","Now Jacob looked up and saw Esau coming toward him with four hundred men. So he divided the children among Leah, Rachel, and the two maidservants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_2","002_33_2","GEN","33","2","2","He put the maidservants and their children in front, Leah and her children next, and Rachel and Joseph at the rear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_3","002_33_3","GEN","33","3","3","But Jacob himself went on ahead and bowed to the ground seven times as he approached his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_4","002_33_4","GEN","33","4","4","Esau, however, ran to him and embraced him, threw his arms around his neck, and kissed him. And they both wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_5","002_33_5","GEN","33","5","5","When Esau looked up and saw the women and children, he asked, “Who are these with you?” Jacob answered, “These are the children God has graciously given your servant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_6","002_33_6","GEN","33","6","6","Then the maidservants and their children approached and bowed down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_7","002_33_7","GEN","33","7","7","Leah and her children also approached and bowed down, and then Joseph and Rachel approached and bowed down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_8","002_33_8","GEN","33","8","8","“What do you mean by sending this whole company to meet me?” asked Esau. “To find favor in your sight, my lord,” Jacob answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_9","002_33_9","GEN","33","9","9","“I already have plenty, my brother,” Esau replied. “Keep what belongs to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_10","002_33_10","GEN","33","10","10","But Jacob insisted, “No, please! If I have found favor in your sight, then receive this gift from my hand. For indeed, I have seen your face, and it is like seeing the face of God, since you have received me favorably. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_11","002_33_11","GEN","33","11","11","Please accept my gift that was brought to you, because God has been gracious to me and I have all I need.” So Jacob pressed him until he accepted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_12","002_33_12","GEN","33","12","12","Then Esau said, “Let us be on our way, and I will go ahead of you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_13","002_33_13","GEN","33","13","13","But Jacob replied, “My lord knows that the children are frail, and I must care for sheep and cattle that are nursing their young. If they are driven hard for even a day, all the animals will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_14","002_33_14","GEN","33","14","14","Please let my lord go ahead of his servant. I will continue on slowly, at a comfortable pace for the livestock and children, until I come to my lord at Seir.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_15","002_33_15","GEN","33","15","15","“Let me leave some of my people with you,” Esau said. But Jacob replied, “Why do that? Let me find favor in the sight of my lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_16","002_33_16","GEN","33","16","16","So that day Esau started on his way back to Seir, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_17","002_33_17","GEN","33","17","17","but Jacob went on to Succoth, where he built a house for himself and shelters for his livestock; that is why the place was called Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_18","002_33_18","GEN","33","18","18","After Jacob had come from Paddan-aram, he arrived safely at the city of Shechem in the land of Canaan, and he camped just outside the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_19","002_33_19","GEN","33","19","19","And the plot of ground where he pitched his tent, he purchased from the sons of Hamor, Shechem’s father, for a hundred pieces of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN33_20","002_33_20","GEN","33","20","20","There he set up an altar and called it El-Elohe-Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_1","002_34_1","GEN","34","1","1","Now Dinah, the daughter Leah had borne to Jacob, went out to visit the daughters of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_2","002_34_2","GEN","34","2","2","When Shechem son of Hamor the Hivite, the prince of the region, saw her, he took her and lay with her by force. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_3","002_34_3","GEN","34","3","3","And his soul was drawn to Dinah, the daughter of Jacob. He loved the young girl and spoke to her tenderly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_4","002_34_4","GEN","34","4","4","So Shechem told his father Hamor, “Get me this girl as a wife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_5","002_34_5","GEN","34","5","5","Jacob heard that Shechem had defiled his daughter Dinah, but since his sons were with his livestock in the field, he remained silent about it until they returned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_6","002_34_6","GEN","34","6","6","Meanwhile, Shechem’s father Hamor came to speak with Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_7","002_34_7","GEN","34","7","7","When Jacob’s sons heard what had happened, they returned from the field. They were filled with grief and fury, because Shechem had committed an outrage in Israel by lying with Jacob’s daughter—a thing that should not be done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_8","002_34_8","GEN","34","8","8","But Hamor said to them, “My son Shechem longs for your daughter. Please give her to him as his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_9","002_34_9","GEN","34","9","9","Intermarry with us; give us your daughters and take our daughters for yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_10","002_34_10","GEN","34","10","10","You may settle among us, and the land will be open to you. Live here, move about freely, and acquire your own property.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_11","002_34_11","GEN","34","11","11","Then Shechem said to Dinah’s father and brothers, “Grant me this favor, and I will give you whatever you ask. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_12","002_34_12","GEN","34","12","12","Demand a high dowry and an expensive gift, and I will give you whatever you ask. Only give me the girl as my wife!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_13","002_34_13","GEN","34","13","13","But because Shechem had defiled their sister Dinah, Jacob’s sons answered him and his father Hamor deceitfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_14","002_34_14","GEN","34","14","14","“We cannot do such a thing,” they said. “To give our sister to an uncircumcised man would be a disgrace to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_15","002_34_15","GEN","34","15","15","We will consent to this on one condition, that you become circumcised like us—every one of your males. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_16","002_34_16","GEN","34","16","16","Then we will give you our daughters and take your daughters for ourselves. We will dwell among you and become one people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_17","002_34_17","GEN","34","17","17","But if you will not agree to be circumcised, then we will take our sister and go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_18","002_34_18","GEN","34","18","18","Their offer seemed good to Hamor and his son Shechem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_19","002_34_19","GEN","34","19","19","The young man, who was the most respected of all his father’s household, did not hesitate to fulfill this request, because he was delighted with Jacob’s daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_20","002_34_20","GEN","34","20","20","So Hamor and his son Shechem went to the gate of their city and addressed the men of their city: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_21","002_34_21","GEN","34","21","21","“These men are at peace with us. Let them live and trade in our land; indeed, it is large enough for them. Let us take their daughters in marriage and give our daughters to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_22","002_34_22","GEN","34","22","22","But only on this condition will the men agree to dwell with us and be one people: if all our men are circumcised as they are. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_23","002_34_23","GEN","34","23","23","Will not their livestock, their possessions, and all their animals become ours? Only let us consent to them, and they will dwell among us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_24","002_34_24","GEN","34","24","24","All the men who went out of the city gate listened to Hamor and his son Shechem, and every male of the city was circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_25","002_34_25","GEN","34","25","25","Three days later, while they were still in pain, two of Jacob’s sons (Dinah’s brothers Simeon and Levi) took their swords, went into the unsuspecting city, and slaughtered every male. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_26","002_34_26","GEN","34","26","26","They killed Hamor and his son Shechem with their swords, took Dinah out of Shechem’s house, and went away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_27","002_34_27","GEN","34","27","27","Jacob’s other sons came upon the slaughter and looted the city, because their sister had been defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_28","002_34_28","GEN","34","28","28","They took their flocks and herds and donkeys, and everything else in the city or in the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_29","002_34_29","GEN","34","29","29","They carried off all their possessions and women and children, and they plundered everything in their houses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_30","002_34_30","GEN","34","30","30","Then Jacob said to Simeon and Levi, “You have brought trouble upon me by making me a stench to the Canaanites and Perizzites, the people of this land. We are few in number; if they unite against me and attack me, I and my household will be destroyed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN34_31","002_34_31","GEN","34","31","31","But they replied, “Should he have treated our sister like a prostitute?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_1","002_35_1","GEN","35","1","1","Then God said to Jacob, “Arise, go up to Bethel, and settle there. Build an altar there to the God who appeared to you when you fled from your brother Esau.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_2","002_35_2","GEN","35","2","2","So Jacob told his household and all who were with him, “Get rid of the foreign gods that are among you. Purify yourselves and change your garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_3","002_35_3","GEN","35","3","3","Then let us arise and go to Bethel. I will build an altar there to God, who answered me in my day of distress. He has been with me wherever I have gone.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_4","002_35_4","GEN","35","4","4","So they gave Jacob all their foreign gods and all their earrings, and Jacob buried them under the oak near Shechem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_5","002_35_5","GEN","35","5","5","As they set out, a terror from God fell over the surrounding cities, so that they did not pursue Jacob’s sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_6","002_35_6","GEN","35","6","6","So Jacob and everyone with him arrived in Luz (that is, Bethel) in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_7","002_35_7","GEN","35","7","7","There Jacob built an altar, and he called that place El-bethel, because it was there that God had revealed Himself to Jacob as he fled from his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_8","002_35_8","GEN","35","8","8","Now Deborah, Rebekah’s nurse, died and was buried under the oak below Bethel. So Jacob named it Allon-bacuth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_9","002_35_9","GEN","35","9","9","After Jacob had returned from Paddan-aram, God appeared to him again and blessed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_10","002_35_10","GEN","35","10","10","And God said to him, “Though your name is Jacob, you will no longer be called Jacob. Instead, your name will be Israel.” So God named him Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_11","002_35_11","GEN","35","11","11","And God told him, “I am God Almighty. Be fruitful and multiply. A nation—even a company of nations—shall come from you, and kings shall descend from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_12","002_35_12","GEN","35","12","12","The land that I gave to Abraham and Isaac I will give to you, and I will give this land to your descendants after you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_13","002_35_13","GEN","35","13","13","Then God went up from the place where He had spoken with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_14","002_35_14","GEN","35","14","14","So Jacob set up a pillar in the place where God had spoken with him—a stone marker—and he poured out a drink offering on it and anointed it with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_15","002_35_15","GEN","35","15","15","Jacob called the place where God had spoken with him Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_16","002_35_16","GEN","35","16","16","Later, they set out from Bethel, and while they were still some distance from Ephrath, Rachel began to give birth, and her labor was difficult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_17","002_35_17","GEN","35","17","17","During her severe labor, the midwife said to her, “Do not be afraid, for you are having another son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_18","002_35_18","GEN","35","18","18","And with her last breath—for she was dying—she named him Ben-oni. But his father called him Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_19","002_35_19","GEN","35","19","19","So Rachel died and was buried on the way to Ephrath (that is, Bethlehem). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_20","002_35_20","GEN","35","20","20","Jacob set up a pillar on her grave; it marks Rachel’s tomb to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_21","002_35_21","GEN","35","21","21","Israel again set out and pitched his tent beyond the Tower of Eder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_22","002_35_22","GEN","35","22","22","While Israel was living in that region, Reuben went in and slept with his father’s concubine Bilhah, and Israel heard about it. Jacob had twelve sons: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_23","002_35_23","GEN","35","23","23","The sons of Leah were Reuben the firstborn of Jacob, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, and Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_24","002_35_24","GEN","35","24","24","The sons of Rachel were Joseph and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_25","002_35_25","GEN","35","25","25","The sons of Rachel’s maidservant Bilhah were Dan and Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_26","002_35_26","GEN","35","26","26","And the sons of Leah’s maidservant Zilpah were Gad and Asher. These are the sons of Jacob, who were born to him in Paddan-aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_27","002_35_27","GEN","35","27","27","Jacob returned to his father Isaac at Mamre, near Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron), where Abraham and Isaac had stayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_28","002_35_28","GEN","35","28","28","And Isaac lived 180 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN35_29","002_35_29","GEN","35","29","29","Then he breathed his last and died and was gathered to his people, old and full of years. And his sons Esau and Jacob buried him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_1","002_36_1","GEN","36","1","1","This is the account of Esau (that is, Edom). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_2","002_36_2","GEN","36","2","2","Esau took his wives from the daughters of Canaan: Adah daughter of Elon the Hittite, Oholibamah daughter of Anah and granddaughter of Zibeon the Hivite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_3","002_36_3","GEN","36","3","3","and Basemath daughter of Ishmael and sister of Nebaioth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_4","002_36_4","GEN","36","4","4","And Adah bore Eliphaz to Esau, Basemath gave birth to Reuel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_5","002_36_5","GEN","36","5","5","and Oholibamah gave birth to Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. These were the sons of Esau, who were born to him in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_6","002_36_6","GEN","36","6","6","Later, Esau took his wives and sons and daughters and all the people of his household, along with his livestock, all his other animals, and all the property he had acquired in Canaan, and he moved to a land far away from his brother Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_7","002_36_7","GEN","36","7","7","For their possessions were too great for them to dwell together; the land where they stayed could not support them because of their livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_8","002_36_8","GEN","36","8","8","So Esau (that is, Edom) settled in the area of Mount Seir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_9","002_36_9","GEN","36","9","9","This is the account of Esau, the father of the Edomites, in the area of Mount Seir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_10","002_36_10","GEN","36","10","10","These are the names of Esau’s sons: Eliphaz son of Esau’s wife Adah, and Reuel son of Esau’s wife Basemath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_11","002_36_11","GEN","36","11","11","The sons of Eliphaz were Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, and Kenaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_12","002_36_12","GEN","36","12","12","Additionally, Timna, a concubine of Esau’s son Eliphaz, gave birth to Amalek. These are the grandsons of Esau’s wife Adah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_13","002_36_13","GEN","36","13","13","These are the sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah. They are the grandsons of Esau’s wife Basemath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_14","002_36_14","GEN","36","14","14","These are the sons of Esau’s wife Oholibamah (daughter of Anah and granddaughter of Zibeon) whom she bore to Esau: Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_15","002_36_15","GEN","36","15","15","These are the chiefs among the sons of Esau. The sons of Eliphaz the firstborn of Esau: Chiefs Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_16","002_36_16","GEN","36","16","16","Korah, Gatam, and Amalek. They are the chiefs of Eliphaz in the land of Edom, and they are the grandsons of Adah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_17","002_36_17","GEN","36","17","17","These are the sons of Esau’s son Reuel: Chiefs Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah. They are the chiefs descended from Reuel in the land of Edom, and they are the grandsons of Esau’s wife Basemath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_18","002_36_18","GEN","36","18","18","These are the sons of Esau’s wife Oholibamah: Chiefs Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. They are the chiefs descended from Esau’s wife Oholibamah, the daughter of Anah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_19","002_36_19","GEN","36","19","19","All these are the sons of Esau (that is, Edom), and they were their chiefs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_20","002_36_20","GEN","36","20","20","These are the sons of Seir the Horite, who were living in the land: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_21","002_36_21","GEN","36","21","21","Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. They are the chiefs of the Horites, the descendants of Seir in the land of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_22","002_36_22","GEN","36","22","22","The sons of Lotan were Hori and Hemam. Timna was Lotan’s sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_23","002_36_23","GEN","36","23","23","These are the sons of Shobal: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, and Onam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_24","002_36_24","GEN","36","24","24","These are the sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah. (This is the Anah who found the hot springs in the wilderness as he was pasturing the donkeys of his father Zibeon.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_25","002_36_25","GEN","36","25","25","These are the children of Anah: Dishon and Oholibamah daughter of Anah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_26","002_36_26","GEN","36","26","26","These are the sons of Dishon: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_27","002_36_27","GEN","36","27","27","These are the sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Akan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_28","002_36_28","GEN","36","28","28","These are the sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_29","002_36_29","GEN","36","29","29","These are the chiefs of the Horites: Chiefs Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_30","002_36_30","GEN","36","30","30","Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. They are the chiefs of the Horites, according to their divisions in the land of Seir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_31","002_36_31","GEN","36","31","31","These are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom before any king reigned over the Israelites: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_32","002_36_32","GEN","36","32","32","Bela son of Beor reigned in Edom; the name of his city was Dinhabah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_33","002_36_33","GEN","36","33","33","When Bela died, Jobab son of Zerah from Bozrah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_34","002_36_34","GEN","36","34","34","When Jobab died, Husham from the land of the Temanites reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_35","002_36_35","GEN","36","35","35","When Husham died, Hadad son of Bedad, who defeated Midian in the country of Moab, reigned in his place. And the name of his city was Avith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_36","002_36_36","GEN","36","36","36","When Hadad died, Samlah from Masrekah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_37","002_36_37","GEN","36","37","37","When Samlah died, Shaul from Rehoboth on the Euphrates reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_38","002_36_38","GEN","36","38","38","When Shaul died, Baal-hanan son of Achbor reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_39","002_36_39","GEN","36","39","39","When Baal-hanan son of Achbor died, Hadad reigned in his place. His city was named Pau, and his wife’s name was Mehetabel daughter of Matred, the daughter of Me-zahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_40","002_36_40","GEN","36","40","40","These are the names of Esau’s chiefs, according to their families and regions, by their names: Chiefs Timna, Alvah, Jetheth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_41","002_36_41","GEN","36","41","41","Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_42","002_36_42","GEN","36","42","42","Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN36_43","002_36_43","GEN","36","43","43","Magdiel, and Iram. These were the chiefs of Edom, according to their settlements in the land they possessed. Esau was the father of the Edomites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_1","002_37_1","GEN","37","1","1","Now Jacob lived in the land where his father had resided, the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_2","002_37_2","GEN","37","2","2","This is the account of Jacob. When Joseph was seventeen years old, he was tending the flock with his brothers, the sons of his father’s wives Bilhah and Zilpah, and he brought their father a bad report about them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_3","002_37_3","GEN","37","3","3","Now Israel loved Joseph more than his other sons, because Joseph had been born to him in his old age; so he made him a robe of many colors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_4","002_37_4","GEN","37","4","4","When Joseph’s brothers saw that their father loved him more than any of them, they hated him and could not speak a kind word to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_5","002_37_5","GEN","37","5","5","Then Joseph had a dream, and when he told it to his brothers, they hated him even more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_6","002_37_6","GEN","37","6","6","He said to them, “Listen to this dream I had: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_7","002_37_7","GEN","37","7","7","We were binding sheaves of grain in the field, and suddenly my sheaf rose and stood upright, while your sheaves gathered around and bowed down to mine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_8","002_37_8","GEN","37","8","8","“Do you intend to reign over us?” his brothers asked. “Will you actually rule us?” So they hated him even more because of his dream and his statements. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_9","002_37_9","GEN","37","9","9","Then Joseph had another dream and told it to his brothers. “Look,” he said, “I had another dream, and this time the sun and moon and eleven stars were bowing down to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_10","002_37_10","GEN","37","10","10","He told his father and brothers, but his father rebuked him and said, “What is this dream that you have had? Will your mother and brothers and I actually come and bow down to the ground before you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_11","002_37_11","GEN","37","11","11","And his brothers were jealous of him, but his father kept in mind what he had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_12","002_37_12","GEN","37","12","12","Some time later, Joseph’s brothers had gone to pasture their father’s flocks near Shechem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_13","002_37_13","GEN","37","13","13","Israel said to him, “Are not your brothers pasturing the flocks at Shechem? Get ready; I am sending you to them.” “I am ready,” Joseph replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_14","002_37_14","GEN","37","14","14","Then Israel told him, “Go now and see how your brothers and the flocks are faring, and bring word back to me.” So he sent him off from the Valley of Hebron. And when Joseph arrived in Shechem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_15","002_37_15","GEN","37","15","15","a man found him wandering in the field and asked, “What are you looking for?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_16","002_37_16","GEN","37","16","16","“I am looking for my brothers,” Joseph replied. “Can you please tell me where they are pasturing their flocks?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_17","002_37_17","GEN","37","17","17","“They have moved on from here,” the man answered. “I heard them say, ‘Let us go to Dothan.’” So Joseph set out after his brothers and found them at Dothan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_18","002_37_18","GEN","37","18","18","Now Joseph’s brothers saw him in the distance, and before he arrived, they plotted to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_19","002_37_19","GEN","37","19","19","“Here comes that dreamer!” they said to one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_20","002_37_20","GEN","37","20","20","“Come now, let us kill him and throw him into one of the pits. We can say that a vicious animal has devoured him. Then we shall see what becomes of his dreams!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_21","002_37_21","GEN","37","21","21","When Reuben heard this, he tried to rescue Joseph from their hands. “Let us not take his life,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_22","002_37_22","GEN","37","22","22","“Do not shed his blood. Throw him into this pit in the wilderness, but do not lay a hand on him.” Reuben said this so that he could rescue Joseph from their hands and return him to his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_23","002_37_23","GEN","37","23","23","So when Joseph came to his brothers, they stripped him of his robe—the robe of many colors he was wearing— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_24","002_37_24","GEN","37","24","24","and they took him and threw him into the pit. Now the pit was empty, with no water in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_25","002_37_25","GEN","37","25","25","And as they sat down to eat a meal, they looked up and saw a caravan of Ishmaelites coming from Gilead. Their camels were carrying spices, balm, and myrrh on their way down to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_26","002_37_26","GEN","37","26","26","Then Judah said to his brothers, “What profit will we gain if we kill our brother and cover up his blood? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_27","002_37_27","GEN","37","27","27","Come, let us sell him to the Ishmaelites and not lay a hand on him; for he is our brother, our own flesh.” And they agreed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_28","002_37_28","GEN","37","28","28","So when the Midianite traders passed by, his brothers pulled Joseph out of the pit and sold him for twenty shekels of silver to the Ishmaelites, who took him to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_29","002_37_29","GEN","37","29","29","When Reuben returned to the pit and saw that Joseph was not there, he tore his clothes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_30","002_37_30","GEN","37","30","30","returned to his brothers, and said, “The boy is gone! What am I going to do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_31","002_37_31","GEN","37","31","31","Then they took Joseph’s robe, slaughtered a young goat, and dipped the robe in its blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_32","002_37_32","GEN","37","32","32","They sent the robe of many colors to their father and said, “We found this. Examine it to see whether it is your son’s robe or not.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_33","002_37_33","GEN","37","33","33","His father recognized it and said, “It is my son’s robe! A vicious animal has devoured him. Joseph has surely been torn to pieces!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_34","002_37_34","GEN","37","34","34","Then Jacob tore his clothes, put sackcloth around his waist, and mourned for his son many days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_35","002_37_35","GEN","37","35","35","All his sons and daughters tried to comfort him, but he refused to be comforted. “No,” he said. “I will go down to Sheol mourning for my son.” So his father wept for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN37_36","002_37_36","GEN","37","36","36","Meanwhile, the Midianites sold Joseph in Egypt to Potiphar, an officer of Pharaoh and captain of the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_1","002_38_1","GEN","38","1","1","About that time, Judah left his brothers and settled near a man named Hirah, an Adullamite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_2","002_38_2","GEN","38","2","2","There Judah saw the daughter of a Canaanite man named Shua, and he took her as a wife and slept with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_3","002_38_3","GEN","38","3","3","So she conceived and gave birth to a son, and Judah named him Er. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_4","002_38_4","GEN","38","4","4","Again she conceived and gave birth to a son, and she named him Onan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_5","002_38_5","GEN","38","5","5","Then she gave birth to another son and named him Shelah; it was at Chezib that she gave birth to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_6","002_38_6","GEN","38","6","6","Now Judah acquired a wife for Er, his firstborn, and her name was Tamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_7","002_38_7","GEN","38","7","7","But Er, Judah’s firstborn, was wicked in the sight of the LORD; so the LORD put him to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_8","002_38_8","GEN","38","8","8","Then Judah said to Onan, “Sleep with your brother’s wife. Perform your duty as her brother-in-law and raise up offspring for your brother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_9","002_38_9","GEN","38","9","9","But Onan knew that the offspring would not belong to him; so whenever he would sleep with his brother’s wife, he would spill his seed on the ground so that he would not produce offspring for his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_10","002_38_10","GEN","38","10","10","What he did was wicked in the sight of the LORD, so He put Onan to death as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_11","002_38_11","GEN","38","11","11","Then Judah said to his daughter-in-law Tamar, “Live as a widow in your father’s house until my son Shelah grows up.” For he thought, “He may die too, like his brothers.” So Tamar went to live in her father’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_12","002_38_12","GEN","38","12","12","After a long time Judah’s wife, the daughter of Shua, died. When Judah had finished mourning, he and his friend Hirah the Adullamite went up to his sheepshearers at Timnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_13","002_38_13","GEN","38","13","13","When Tamar was told, “Your father-in-law is going up to Timnah to shear his sheep,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_14","002_38_14","GEN","38","14","14","she removed her widow’s garments, covered her face with a veil to disguise herself, and sat at the entrance to Enaim, which is on the way to Timnah. For she saw that although Shelah had grown up, she had not been given to him as a wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_15","002_38_15","GEN","38","15","15","When Judah saw her, he thought she was a prostitute because she had covered her face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_16","002_38_16","GEN","38","16","16","Not realizing that she was his daughter-in-law, he went over to her and said, “Come now, let me sleep with you.” “What will you give me for sleeping with you?” she inquired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_17","002_38_17","GEN","38","17","17","“I will send you a young goat from my flock,” Judah answered. But she replied, “Only if you leave me something as a pledge until you send it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_18","002_38_18","GEN","38","18","18","“What pledge should I give you?” he asked. She answered, “Your seal and your cord, and the staff in your hand.” So he gave them to her and slept with her, and she became pregnant by him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_19","002_38_19","GEN","38","19","19","Then Tamar got up and departed. And she removed her veil and put on her widow’s garments again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_20","002_38_20","GEN","38","20","20","Now when Judah sent his friend Hirah the Adullamite with the young goat to collect the items he had left with the woman, he could not find her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_21","002_38_21","GEN","38","21","21","He asked the men of that place, “Where is the shrine prostitute who was beside the road at Enaim?” “No shrine prostitute has been here,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_22","002_38_22","GEN","38","22","22","So Hirah returned to Judah and said, “I could not find her, and furthermore, the men of that place said, ‘No shrine prostitute has been here.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_23","002_38_23","GEN","38","23","23","“Let her keep the items,” Judah replied. “Otherwise we will become a laughingstock. After all, I did send her this young goat, but you could not find her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_24","002_38_24","GEN","38","24","24","About three months later, Judah was told, “Your daughter-in-law Tamar has prostituted herself, and now she is pregnant.” “Bring her out!” Judah replied. “Let her be burned to death!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_25","002_38_25","GEN","38","25","25","As she was being brought out, Tamar sent a message to her father-in-law: “I am pregnant by the man to whom these items belong.” And she added, “Please examine them. Whose seal and cord and staff are these?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_26","002_38_26","GEN","38","26","26","Judah recognized the items and said, “She is more righteous than I, since I did not give her to my son Shelah.” And he did not have relations with her again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_27","002_38_27","GEN","38","27","27","When the time came for Tamar to give birth, there were twins in her womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_28","002_38_28","GEN","38","28","28","And as she was giving birth, one of them put out his hand; so the midwife took a scarlet thread and tied it around his wrist. “This one came out first,” she announced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_29","002_38_29","GEN","38","29","29","But when he pulled his hand back and his brother came out, she said, “You have broken out first!” So he was named Perez. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN38_30","002_38_30","GEN","38","30","30","Then his brother came out with the scarlet thread around his wrist, and he was named Zerah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_1","002_39_1","GEN","39","1","1","Meanwhile, Joseph had been taken down to Egypt, where an Egyptian named Potiphar, an officer of Pharaoh and captain of the guard, bought him from the Ishmaelites who had taken him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_2","002_39_2","GEN","39","2","2","And the LORD was with Joseph, and he became a successful man, serving in the household of his Egyptian master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_3","002_39_3","GEN","39","3","3","When his master saw that the LORD was with him and made him prosper in all he did, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_4","002_39_4","GEN","39","4","4","Joseph found favor in his sight and became his personal attendant. Potiphar put him in charge of his household and entrusted him with everything he owned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_5","002_39_5","GEN","39","5","5","From the time that he put Joseph in charge of his household and all he owned, the LORD blessed the Egyptian’s household on account of him. The LORD’s blessing was on everything he owned, both in his house and in his field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_6","002_39_6","GEN","39","6","6","So Potiphar left all that he owned in Joseph’s care; he did not concern himself with anything except the food he ate. Now Joseph was well-built and handsome, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_7","002_39_7","GEN","39","7","7","and after some time his master’s wife cast her eyes upon Joseph and said, “Sleep with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_8","002_39_8","GEN","39","8","8","But he refused. “Look,” he said to his master’s wife, “with me here, my master does not concern himself with anything in his house, and he has entrusted everything he owns to my care. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_9","002_39_9","GEN","39","9","9","No one in this house is greater than I am. He has withheld nothing from me except you, because you are his wife. So how could I do such a great evil and sin against God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_10","002_39_10","GEN","39","10","10","Although Potiphar’s wife spoke to Joseph day after day, he refused to go to bed with her or even be near her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_11","002_39_11","GEN","39","11","11","One day, however, Joseph went into the house to attend to his work, and not a single household servant was inside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_12","002_39_12","GEN","39","12","12","She grabbed Joseph by his cloak and said, “Sleep with me!” But leaving his cloak in her hand, he escaped and ran outside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_13","002_39_13","GEN","39","13","13","When she saw that he had left his cloak in her hand and had run out of the house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_14","002_39_14","GEN","39","14","14","she called her household servants. “Look,” she said, “this Hebrew has been brought to us to make sport of us. He came to me so he could sleep with me, but I screamed as loud as I could. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_15","002_39_15","GEN","39","15","15","When he heard me scream for help, he left his cloak beside me and ran out of the house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_16","002_39_16","GEN","39","16","16","So Potiphar’s wife kept Joseph’s cloak beside her until his master came home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_17","002_39_17","GEN","39","17","17","Then she told him the same story: “The Hebrew slave you brought us came to me to make sport of me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_18","002_39_18","GEN","39","18","18","but when I screamed for help, he left his cloak beside me and ran out of the house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_19","002_39_19","GEN","39","19","19","When his master heard the story his wife told him, saying, “This is what your slave did to me,” he burned with anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_20","002_39_20","GEN","39","20","20","So Joseph’s master took him and had him thrown into the prison where the king’s prisoners were confined. While Joseph was there in the prison, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_21","002_39_21","GEN","39","21","21","the LORD was with him and extended kindness to him, granting him favor in the eyes of the prison warden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_22","002_39_22","GEN","39","22","22","And the warden put all the prisoners under Joseph’s care, so that he was responsible for all that was done in the prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN39_23","002_39_23","GEN","39","23","23","The warden did not concern himself with anything under Joseph’s care, because the LORD was with Joseph and gave him success in whatever he did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_1","002_40_1","GEN","40","1","1","Some time later, the king’s cupbearer and baker offended their master, the king of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_2","002_40_2","GEN","40","2","2","Pharaoh was angry with his two officers, the chief cupbearer and the chief baker, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_3","002_40_3","GEN","40","3","3","and imprisoned them in the house of the captain of the guard, the same prison where Joseph was confined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_4","002_40_4","GEN","40","4","4","The captain of the guard assigned them to Joseph, and he became their personal attendant. After they had been in custody for some time, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_5","002_40_5","GEN","40","5","5","both of these men—the Egyptian king’s cupbearer and baker, who were being held in the prison—had a dream on the same night, and each dream had its own meaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_6","002_40_6","GEN","40","6","6","When Joseph came to them in the morning, he saw that they were distraught. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_7","002_40_7","GEN","40","7","7","So he asked the officials of Pharaoh who were in custody with him in his master’s house, “Why are your faces so downcast today?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_8","002_40_8","GEN","40","8","8","“We both had dreams,” they replied, “but there is no one to interpret them.” Then Joseph said to them, “Don’t interpretations belong to God? Tell me your dreams.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_9","002_40_9","GEN","40","9","9","So the chief cupbearer told Joseph his dream: “In my dream there was a vine before me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_10","002_40_10","GEN","40","10","10","and on the vine were three branches. As it budded, its blossoms opened and its clusters ripened into grapes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_11","002_40_11","GEN","40","11","11","Pharaoh’s cup was in my hand, and I took the grapes, squeezed them into his cup, and placed the cup in his hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_12","002_40_12","GEN","40","12","12","Joseph replied, “This is the interpretation: The three branches are three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_13","002_40_13","GEN","40","13","13","Within three days Pharaoh will lift up your head and restore your position. You will put Pharaoh’s cup in his hand, just as you did when you were his cupbearer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_14","002_40_14","GEN","40","14","14","But when it goes well for you, please remember me and show me kindness by mentioning me to Pharaoh, that he might bring me out of this prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_15","002_40_15","GEN","40","15","15","For I was kidnapped from the land of the Hebrews, and even here I have done nothing for which they should have put me in this dungeon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_16","002_40_16","GEN","40","16","16","When the chief baker saw that the interpretation was favorable, he said to Joseph, “I too had a dream: There were three baskets of white bread on my head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_17","002_40_17","GEN","40","17","17","In the top basket were all sorts of baked goods for Pharaoh, but the birds were eating them out of the basket on my head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_18","002_40_18","GEN","40","18","18","Joseph replied, “This is the interpretation: The three baskets are three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_19","002_40_19","GEN","40","19","19","Within three days Pharaoh will lift off your head and hang you on a tree. Then the birds will eat the flesh of your body.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_20","002_40_20","GEN","40","20","20","On the third day, which was Pharaoh’s birthday, he held a feast for all his officials, and in their presence he lifted up the heads of the chief cupbearer and the chief baker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_21","002_40_21","GEN","40","21","21","Pharaoh restored the chief cupbearer to his position, so that he once again placed the cup in Pharaoh’s hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_22","002_40_22","GEN","40","22","22","But Pharaoh hanged the chief baker, just as Joseph had described to them in his interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN40_23","002_40_23","GEN","40","23","23","The chief cupbearer, however, did not remember Joseph; he forgot all about him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_1","002_41_1","GEN","41","1","1","After two full years had passed, Pharaoh had a dream: He was standing beside the Nile, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_2","002_41_2","GEN","41","2","2","when seven cows, sleek and well-fed, came up from the river and began to graze among the reeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_3","002_41_3","GEN","41","3","3","After them, seven other cows, sickly and thin, came up from the Nile and stood beside the well-fed cows on the bank of the river. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_4","002_41_4","GEN","41","4","4","And the cows that were sickly and thin devoured the seven sleek, well-fed cows. Then Pharaoh woke up, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_5","002_41_5","GEN","41","5","5","but he fell back asleep and dreamed a second time: Seven heads of grain, plump and ripe, came up on one stalk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_6","002_41_6","GEN","41","6","6","After them, seven other heads of grain sprouted, thin and scorched by the east wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_7","002_41_7","GEN","41","7","7","And the thin heads of grain swallowed up the seven plump, ripe ones. Then Pharaoh awoke and realized it was a dream. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_8","002_41_8","GEN","41","8","8","In the morning his spirit was troubled, so he summoned all the magicians and wise men of Egypt. Pharaoh told them his dreams, but no one could interpret them for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_9","002_41_9","GEN","41","9","9","Then the chief cupbearer said to Pharaoh, “Today I recall my failures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_10","002_41_10","GEN","41","10","10","Pharaoh was once angry with his servants, and he put me and the chief baker in the custody of the captain of the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_11","002_41_11","GEN","41","11","11","One night both the chief baker and I had dreams, and each dream had its own meaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_12","002_41_12","GEN","41","12","12","Now a young Hebrew was there with us, a servant of the captain of the guard. We told him our dreams and he interpreted them for us individually. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_13","002_41_13","GEN","41","13","13","And it happened to us just as he had interpreted: I was restored to my position, and the other man was hanged.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_14","002_41_14","GEN","41","14","14","So Pharaoh sent for Joseph, who was quickly brought out of the dungeon. After he had shaved and changed his clothes, he went in before Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_15","002_41_15","GEN","41","15","15","Pharaoh said to Joseph, “I had a dream, and no one can interpret it. But I have heard it said of you that when you hear a dream you can interpret it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_16","002_41_16","GEN","41","16","16","“I myself cannot do it,” Joseph replied, “but God will give Pharaoh a sound answer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_17","002_41_17","GEN","41","17","17","Then Pharaoh said to Joseph: “In my dream I was standing on the bank of the Nile, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_18","002_41_18","GEN","41","18","18","when seven cows, well-fed and sleek, came up from the river and began to graze among the reeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_19","002_41_19","GEN","41","19","19","After them, seven other cows—sickly, ugly, and thin—came up. I have never seen such ugly cows in all the land of Egypt! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_20","002_41_20","GEN","41","20","20","Then the thin, ugly cows devoured the seven well-fed cows that were there first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_21","002_41_21","GEN","41","21","21","When they had devoured them, however, no one could tell that they had done so; their appearance was as ugly as it had been before. Then I awoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_22","002_41_22","GEN","41","22","22","In my dream I also saw seven heads of grain, plump and ripe, growing on a single stalk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_23","002_41_23","GEN","41","23","23","After them, seven other heads of grain sprouted—withered, thin, and scorched by the east wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_24","002_41_24","GEN","41","24","24","And the thin heads of grain swallowed the seven plump ones. I told this dream to the magicians, but no one could explain it to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_25","002_41_25","GEN","41","25","25","At this, Joseph said to Pharaoh, “The dreams of Pharaoh are one and the same. God has revealed to Pharaoh what He is about to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_26","002_41_26","GEN","41","26","26","The seven good cows are seven years, and the seven ripe heads of grain are seven years. The dreams have the same meaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_27","002_41_27","GEN","41","27","27","Moreover, the seven thin, ugly cows that came up after them are seven years, and so are the seven worthless heads of grain scorched by the east wind—they are seven years of famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_28","002_41_28","GEN","41","28","28","It is just as I said to Pharaoh: God has shown Pharaoh what He is about to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_29","002_41_29","GEN","41","29","29","Behold, seven years of great abundance are coming throughout the land of Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_30","002_41_30","GEN","41","30","30","but seven years of famine will follow them. Then all the abundance in the land of Egypt will be forgotten, and the famine will devastate the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_31","002_41_31","GEN","41","31","31","The abundance in the land will not be remembered, since the famine that follows it will be so severe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_32","002_41_32","GEN","41","32","32","Moreover, because the dream was given to Pharaoh in two versions, the matter has been decreed by God, and He will carry it out shortly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_33","002_41_33","GEN","41","33","33","Now, therefore, Pharaoh should look for a discerning and wise man and set him over the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_34","002_41_34","GEN","41","34","34","Let Pharaoh take action and appoint commissioners over the land to take a fifth of the harvest of Egypt during the seven years of abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_35","002_41_35","GEN","41","35","35","Under the authority of Pharaoh, let them collect all the excess food from these good years, that they may come and lay up the grain to be preserved as food in the cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_36","002_41_36","GEN","41","36","36","This food will be a reserve for the land during the seven years of famine to come upon the land of Egypt. Then the country will not perish in the famine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_37","002_41_37","GEN","41","37","37","This proposal pleased Pharaoh and all his officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_38","002_41_38","GEN","41","38","38","So Pharaoh asked them, “Can we find anyone like this man, in whom the Spirit of God abides?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_39","002_41_39","GEN","41","39","39","Then Pharaoh said to Joseph, “Since God has made all this known to you, there is no one as discerning and wise as you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_40","002_41_40","GEN","41","40","40","You shall be in charge of my house, and all my people are to obey your commands. Only with regard to the throne will I be greater than you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_41","002_41_41","GEN","41","41","41","Pharaoh also told Joseph, “I hereby place you over all the land of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_42","002_41_42","GEN","41","42","42","Then Pharaoh removed the signet ring from his finger, put it on Joseph’s finger, clothed him in garments of fine linen, and placed a gold chain around his neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_43","002_41_43","GEN","41","43","43","He had Joseph ride in his second chariot, with men calling out before him, “Bow the knee!” So he placed him over all the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_44","002_41_44","GEN","41","44","44","And Pharaoh declared to Joseph, “I am Pharaoh, but without your permission, no one in all the land of Egypt shall lift his hand or foot.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_45","002_41_45","GEN","41","45","45","Pharaoh gave Joseph the name Zaphenath-paneah, and he gave him Asenath daughter of Potiphera, priest of On, to be his wife. And Joseph took charge of all the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_46","002_41_46","GEN","41","46","46","Now Joseph was thirty years old when he entered the service of Pharaoh king of Egypt. And Joseph left Pharaoh’s presence and traveled throughout the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_47","002_41_47","GEN","41","47","47","During the seven years of abundance, the land brought forth bountifully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_48","002_41_48","GEN","41","48","48","During those seven years, Joseph collected all the excess food in the land of Egypt and stored it in the cities. In every city he laid up the food from the fields around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_49","002_41_49","GEN","41","49","49","So Joseph stored up grain in such abundance, like the sand of the sea, that he stopped keeping track of it; for it was beyond measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_50","002_41_50","GEN","41","50","50","Before the years of famine arrived, two sons were born to Joseph by Asenath daughter of Potiphera, priest of On. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_51","002_41_51","GEN","41","51","51","Joseph named the firstborn Manasseh, saying, “God has made me forget all my hardship and all my father’s household.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_52","002_41_52","GEN","41","52","52","And the second son he named Ephraim, saying, “God has made me fruitful in the land of my affliction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_53","002_41_53","GEN","41","53","53","When the seven years of abundance in the land of Egypt came to an end, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_54","002_41_54","GEN","41","54","54","the seven years of famine began, just as Joseph had said. And although there was famine in every country, there was food throughout the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_55","002_41_55","GEN","41","55","55","When extreme hunger came to all the land of Egypt and the people cried out to Pharaoh for food, he told all the Egyptians, “Go to Joseph and do whatever he tells you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_56","002_41_56","GEN","41","56","56","When the famine had spread over all the land, Joseph opened up all the storehouses and sold grain to the Egyptians; for the famine was severe in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN41_57","002_41_57","GEN","41","57","57","And every nation came to Joseph in Egypt to buy grain, because the famine was severe over all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_1","002_42_1","GEN","42","1","1","When Jacob learned that there was grain in Egypt, he said to his sons, “Why are you staring at one another?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_2","002_42_2","GEN","42","2","2","“Look,” he added, “I have heard that there is grain in Egypt. Go down there and buy some for us, so that we may live and not die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_3","002_42_3","GEN","42","3","3","So ten of Joseph’s brothers went down to buy grain from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_4","002_42_4","GEN","42","4","4","But Jacob did not send Joseph’s brother Benjamin with his brothers, for he said, “I am afraid that harm might befall him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_5","002_42_5","GEN","42","5","5","So the sons of Israel were among those who came to buy grain, since the famine had also spread to the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_6","002_42_6","GEN","42","6","6","Now Joseph was the ruler of the land; he was the one who sold grain to all its people. So when his brothers arrived, they bowed down before him with their faces to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_7","002_42_7","GEN","42","7","7","And when Joseph saw his brothers, he recognized them, but he treated them as strangers and spoke harshly to them. “Where have you come from?” he asked. “From the land of Canaan,” they replied. “We are here to buy food.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_8","002_42_8","GEN","42","8","8","Although Joseph recognized his brothers, they did not recognize him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_9","002_42_9","GEN","42","9","9","Joseph remembered his dreams about them and said, “You are spies! You have come to see if our land is vulnerable.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_10","002_42_10","GEN","42","10","10","“Not so, my lord,” they replied. “Your servants have come to buy food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_11","002_42_11","GEN","42","11","11","We are all sons of one man. Your servants are honest men, not spies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_12","002_42_12","GEN","42","12","12","“No,” he told them. “You have come to see if our land is vulnerable.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_13","002_42_13","GEN","42","13","13","But they answered, “Your servants are twelve brothers, the sons of one man in the land of Canaan. The youngest is now with our father, and one is no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_14","002_42_14","GEN","42","14","14","Then Joseph declared, “Just as I said, you are spies! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_15","002_42_15","GEN","42","15","15","And this is how you will be tested: As surely as Pharaoh lives, you shall not leave this place unless your youngest brother comes here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_16","002_42_16","GEN","42","16","16","Send one of your number to get your brother; the rest of you will be confined so that the truth of your words may be tested. If they are untrue, then as surely as Pharaoh lives, you are spies!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_17","002_42_17","GEN","42","17","17","So Joseph imprisoned them for three days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_18","002_42_18","GEN","42","18","18","and on the third day he said to them, “I fear God. So do this and you will live: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_19","002_42_19","GEN","42","19","19","If you are honest, leave one of your brothers in custody while the rest of you go and take back grain to relieve the hunger of your households. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_20","002_42_20","GEN","42","20","20","Then bring your youngest brother to me so that your words can be verified, that you may not die.” And to this they consented. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_21","002_42_21","GEN","42","21","21","Then they said to one another, “Surely we are being punished because of our brother. We saw his anguish when he pleaded with us, but we would not listen. That is why this distress has come upon us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_22","002_42_22","GEN","42","22","22","And Reuben responded, “Didn’t I tell you not to sin against the boy? But you would not listen. Now we must account for his blood!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_23","002_42_23","GEN","42","23","23","They did not realize that Joseph understood them, since there was an interpreter between them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_24","002_42_24","GEN","42","24","24","And he turned away from them and wept. When he turned back and spoke to them, he took Simeon from them and had him bound before their eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_25","002_42_25","GEN","42","25","25","Then Joseph gave orders to fill their bags with grain, to return each man’s silver to his sack, and to give them provisions for their journey. This order was carried out, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_26","002_42_26","GEN","42","26","26","and they loaded the grain on their donkeys and departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_27","002_42_27","GEN","42","27","27","At the place where they lodged for the night, one of them opened his sack to get feed for his donkey, and he saw his silver in the mouth of the sack. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_28","002_42_28","GEN","42","28","28","“My silver has been returned!” he said to his brothers. “It is here in my sack.” Their hearts sank, and trembling, they turned to one another and said, “What is this that God has done to us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_29","002_42_29","GEN","42","29","29","When they reached their father Jacob in the land of Canaan, they described to him all that had happened to them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_30","002_42_30","GEN","42","30","30","“The man who is lord of the land spoke harshly to us and accused us of spying on the country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_31","002_42_31","GEN","42","31","31","But we told him, ‘We are honest men, not spies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_32","002_42_32","GEN","42","32","32","We are twelve brothers, sons of one father. One is no more, and the youngest is now with our father in the land of Canaan.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_33","002_42_33","GEN","42","33","33","Then the man who is lord of the land said to us, ‘This is how I will know whether you are honest: Leave one brother with me, take food to relieve the hunger of your households, and go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_34","002_42_34","GEN","42","34","34","But bring your youngest brother back to me so I will know that you are not spies but honest men. Then I will give your brother back to you, and you can trade in the land.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_35","002_42_35","GEN","42","35","35","As they began emptying their sacks, there in each man’s sack was his bag of silver! And when they and their father saw the bags of silver, they were dismayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_36","002_42_36","GEN","42","36","36","Their father Jacob said to them, “You have deprived me of my sons. Joseph is gone and Simeon is no more. Now you want to take Benjamin. Everything is going against me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_37","002_42_37","GEN","42","37","37","Then Reuben said to his father, “You may kill my two sons if I fail to bring him back to you. Put him in my care, and I will return him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN42_38","002_42_38","GEN","42","38","38","But Jacob replied, “My son will not go down there with you, for his brother is dead, and he alone is left. If any harm comes to him on your journey, you will bring my gray hair down to Sheol in sorrow.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_1","002_43_1","GEN","43","1","1","Now the famine was still severe in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_2","002_43_2","GEN","43","2","2","So when Jacob’s sons had eaten all the grain they had brought from Egypt, their father said to them, “Go back and buy us a little more food.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_3","002_43_3","GEN","43","3","3","But Judah replied, “The man solemnly warned us, ‘You will not see my face again unless your brother is with you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_4","002_43_4","GEN","43","4","4","If you will send our brother with us, we will go down and buy food for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_5","002_43_5","GEN","43","5","5","But if you will not send him, we will not go; for the man told us, ‘You will not see my face again unless your brother is with you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_6","002_43_6","GEN","43","6","6","“Why did you bring this trouble upon me?” Israel asked. “Why did you tell the man you had another brother?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_7","002_43_7","GEN","43","7","7","They replied, “The man questioned us in detail about ourselves and our family: ‘Is your father still alive? Do you have another brother?’ And we answered him accordingly. How could we possibly know that he would say, ‘Bring your brother here’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_8","002_43_8","GEN","43","8","8","And Judah said to his father Israel, “Send the boy with me, and we will go at once, so that we may live and not die—neither we, nor you, nor our children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_9","002_43_9","GEN","43","9","9","I will guarantee his safety. You may hold me personally responsible. If I do not bring him back and set him before you, then may I bear the guilt before you all my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_10","002_43_10","GEN","43","10","10","If we had not delayed, we could have come and gone twice by now.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_11","002_43_11","GEN","43","11","11","Then their father Israel said to them, “If it must be so, then do this: Put some of the best products of the land in your packs and carry them down as a gift for the man—a little balm and a little honey, spices and myrrh, pistachios and almonds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_12","002_43_12","GEN","43","12","12","Take double the silver with you so that you may return the silver that was put back into the mouths of your sacks. Perhaps it was a mistake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_13","002_43_13","GEN","43","13","13","Take your brother as well, and return to the man at once. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_14","002_43_14","GEN","43","14","14","May God Almighty grant you mercy before the man, that he may release your other brother along with Benjamin. As for me, if I am bereaved, I am bereaved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_15","002_43_15","GEN","43","15","15","So the men took these gifts, along with double the amount of silver, and Benjamin as well. Then they hurried down to Egypt and stood before Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_16","002_43_16","GEN","43","16","16","When Joseph saw Benjamin with his brothers, he said to the steward of his house, “Take these men to my house. Slaughter an animal and prepare it, for they shall dine with me at noon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_17","002_43_17","GEN","43","17","17","The man did as Joseph had commanded and took the brothers to Joseph’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_18","002_43_18","GEN","43","18","18","But the brothers were frightened that they had been taken to Joseph’s house. “We have been brought here because of the silver that was returned in our bags the first time,” they said. “They intend to overpower us and take us as slaves, along with our donkeys.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_19","002_43_19","GEN","43","19","19","So they approached Joseph’s steward and spoke to him at the entrance to the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_20","002_43_20","GEN","43","20","20","“Please, sir,” they said, “we really did come down here the first time to buy food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_21","002_43_21","GEN","43","21","21","But when we came to the place we lodged for the night, we opened our sacks and, behold, each of us found his silver in the mouth of his sack! It was the full amount of our silver, and we have brought it back with us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_22","002_43_22","GEN","43","22","22","We have brought additional silver with us to buy food. We do not know who put our silver in our sacks.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_23","002_43_23","GEN","43","23","23","“It is fine,” said the steward. “Do not be afraid. Your God, the God of your father, gave you the treasure that was in your sacks. I received your silver.” Then he brought Simeon out to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_24","002_43_24","GEN","43","24","24","And the steward took the men into Joseph’s house, gave them water to wash their feet, and provided food for their donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_25","002_43_25","GEN","43","25","25","Since the brothers had been told that they were going to eat a meal there, they prepared their gift for Joseph’s arrival at noon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_26","002_43_26","GEN","43","26","26","When Joseph came home, they presented him with the gifts they had brought, and they bowed to the ground before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_27","002_43_27","GEN","43","27","27","He asked if they were well, and then he asked, “How is your elderly father you told me about? Is he still alive?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_28","002_43_28","GEN","43","28","28","“Your servant our father is well,” they answered. “He is still alive.” And they bowed down to honor him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_29","002_43_29","GEN","43","29","29","When Joseph looked up and saw his brother Benjamin, his own mother’s son, he asked, “Is this your youngest brother, the one you told me about?” Then he declared, “May God be gracious to you, my son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_30","002_43_30","GEN","43","30","30","Joseph hurried out because he was moved to tears for his brother, and he went to a private room to weep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_31","002_43_31","GEN","43","31","31","Then he washed his face and came back out. Regaining his composure, he said, “Serve the meal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_32","002_43_32","GEN","43","32","32","They separately served Joseph, his brothers, and the Egyptians. They ate separately because the Egyptians would not eat with the Hebrews, since that was detestable to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_33","002_43_33","GEN","43","33","33","They were seated before Joseph in order by age, from the firstborn to the youngest, and the men looked at one another in astonishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN43_34","002_43_34","GEN","43","34","34","When the portions were served to them from Joseph’s table, Benjamin’s portion was five times larger than any of the others. So they feasted and drank freely with Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_1","002_44_1","GEN","44","1","1","Then Joseph instructed his steward: “Fill the men’s sacks with as much food as they can carry, and put each one’s silver in the mouth of his sack. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_2","002_44_2","GEN","44","2","2","Put my cup, the silver one, in the mouth of the youngest one’s sack, along with the silver for his grain.” So the steward did as Joseph had instructed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_3","002_44_3","GEN","44","3","3","At daybreak, the men were sent on their way with their donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_4","002_44_4","GEN","44","4","4","They had not gone far from the city when Joseph told his steward, “Pursue the men at once, and when you overtake them, ask, ‘Why have you repaid good with evil? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_5","002_44_5","GEN","44","5","5","Is this not the cup my master drinks from and uses for divination? What you have done is wicked!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_6","002_44_6","GEN","44","6","6","When the steward overtook them, he relayed these words to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_7","002_44_7","GEN","44","7","7","“Why does my lord say these things?” they asked. “Your servants could not possibly do such a thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_8","002_44_8","GEN","44","8","8","We even brought back to you from the land of Canaan the silver we found in the mouths of our sacks. Why would we steal silver or gold from your master’s house? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_9","002_44_9","GEN","44","9","9","If any of your servants is found to have it, he must die, and the rest will become slaves of my lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_10","002_44_10","GEN","44","10","10","“As you say,” replied the steward. “But only the one who is found with the cup will be my slave, and the rest of you shall be free of blame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_11","002_44_11","GEN","44","11","11","So each one quickly lowered his sack to the ground and opened it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_12","002_44_12","GEN","44","12","12","The steward searched, beginning with the oldest and ending with the youngest—and the cup was found in Benjamin’s sack. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_13","002_44_13","GEN","44","13","13","Then they all tore their clothes, loaded their donkeys, and returned to the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_14","002_44_14","GEN","44","14","14","When Judah and his brothers arrived at Joseph’s house, he was still there, and they fell to the ground before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_15","002_44_15","GEN","44","15","15","“What is this deed you have done?” Joseph declared. “Do you not know that a man like me can surely divine the truth?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_16","002_44_16","GEN","44","16","16","“What can we say to my lord?” Judah replied. “How can we plead? How can we justify ourselves? God has exposed the iniquity of your servants. We are now my lord’s slaves—both we and the one who was found with the cup.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_17","002_44_17","GEN","44","17","17","But Joseph replied, “Far be it from me to do this. The man who was found with the cup will be my slave. The rest of you may return to your father in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_18","002_44_18","GEN","44","18","18","Then Judah approached Joseph and said, “Sir, please let your servant speak personally to my lord. Do not be angry with your servant, for you are equal to Pharaoh himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_19","002_44_19","GEN","44","19","19","My lord asked his servants, ‘Do you have a father or a brother?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_20","002_44_20","GEN","44","20","20","And we answered, ‘We have an elderly father and a younger brother, the child of his old age. The boy’s brother is dead. He is the only one of his mother’s sons left, and his father loves him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_21","002_44_21","GEN","44","21","21","Then you told your servants, ‘Bring him down to me so that I can see him for myself.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_22","002_44_22","GEN","44","22","22","So we said to my lord, ‘The boy cannot leave his father. If he were to leave, his father would die.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_23","002_44_23","GEN","44","23","23","But you said to your servants, ‘Unless your younger brother comes down with you, you will not see my face again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_24","002_44_24","GEN","44","24","24","Now when we returned to your servant my father, we relayed your words to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_25","002_44_25","GEN","44","25","25","Then our father said, ‘Go back and buy us some food.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_26","002_44_26","GEN","44","26","26","But we answered, ‘We cannot go down there unless our younger brother goes with us. So if our younger brother is not with us, we cannot see the man.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_27","002_44_27","GEN","44","27","27","And your servant my father said to us, ‘You know that my wife bore me two sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_28","002_44_28","GEN","44","28","28","When one of them was gone, I said: “Surely he has been torn to pieces.” And I have not seen him since. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_29","002_44_29","GEN","44","29","29","Now if you also take this one from me and harm comes to him, you will bring my gray hair down to Sheol in sorrow.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_30","002_44_30","GEN","44","30","30","So if the boy is not with us when I return to your servant, and if my father, whose life is wrapped up in the boy’s life, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_31","002_44_31","GEN","44","31","31","sees that the boy is not with us, he will die. Then your servants will have brought the gray hair of your servant our father down to Sheol in sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_32","002_44_32","GEN","44","32","32","Indeed, your servant guaranteed the boy’s safety to my father, saying, ‘If I do not return him to you, I will bear the guilt before you, my father, all my life.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_33","002_44_33","GEN","44","33","33","Now please let your servant stay here as my lord’s slave in place of the boy. Let him return with his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN44_34","002_44_34","GEN","44","34","34","For how can I go back to my father without the boy? I could not bear to see the misery that would overwhelm him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_1","002_45_1","GEN","45","1","1","Then Joseph could no longer control himself before all his attendants, and he cried out, “Send everyone away from me!” So none of them were with Joseph when he made himself known to his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_2","002_45_2","GEN","45","2","2","But he wept so loudly that the Egyptians heard him, and Pharaoh’s household soon heard of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_3","002_45_3","GEN","45","3","3","Joseph said to his brothers, “I am Joseph! Is my father still alive?” But they were unable to answer him, because they were terrified in his presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_4","002_45_4","GEN","45","4","4","Then Joseph said to his brothers, “Please come near me.” And they did so. “I am Joseph, your brother,” he said, “the one you sold into Egypt! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_5","002_45_5","GEN","45","5","5","And now, do not be distressed or angry with yourselves that you sold me into this place, because it was to save lives that God sent me before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_6","002_45_6","GEN","45","6","6","For the famine has covered the land these two years, and there will be five more years without plowing or harvesting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_7","002_45_7","GEN","45","7","7","God sent me before you to preserve you as a remnant on the earth and to save your lives by a great deliverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_8","002_45_8","GEN","45","8","8","Therefore it was not you who sent me here, but God, who has made me a father to Pharaoh—lord of all his household and ruler over all the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_9","002_45_9","GEN","45","9","9","Now return quickly to my father and tell him, ‘This is what your son Joseph says: God has made me lord of all Egypt. Come down to me without delay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_10","002_45_10","GEN","45","10","10","You shall settle in the land of Goshen and be near me—you and your children and grandchildren, your flocks and herds, and everything you own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_11","002_45_11","GEN","45","11","11","And there I will provide for you, because there will be five more years of famine. Otherwise, you and your household and everything you own will come to destitution.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_12","002_45_12","GEN","45","12","12","Behold! You and my brother Benjamin can see that I, Joseph, am the one speaking with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_13","002_45_13","GEN","45","13","13","Tell my father about all my splendor in Egypt and everything you have seen. And bring my father down here quickly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_14","002_45_14","GEN","45","14","14","Then Joseph threw his arms around his brother Benjamin and wept, and Benjamin wept as they embraced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_15","002_45_15","GEN","45","15","15","Joseph kissed each of his brothers as he wept over them. And afterward his brothers talked with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_16","002_45_16","GEN","45","16","16","When the news reached Pharaoh’s house that Joseph’s brothers had come, Pharaoh and his servants were pleased. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_17","002_45_17","GEN","45","17","17","Pharaoh said to Joseph, “Tell your brothers, ‘Do as follows: Load your animals and return to the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_18","002_45_18","GEN","45","18","18","Then bring your father and your families and return to me. I will give you the best of the land of Egypt, and you shall eat from the fat of the land.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_19","002_45_19","GEN","45","19","19","You are also directed to tell them: ‘Take wagons from the land of Egypt for your young children and your wives, and bring your father and come back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_20","002_45_20","GEN","45","20","20","But pay no regard to your belongings, for the best of all the land of Egypt is yours.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_21","002_45_21","GEN","45","21","21","So the sons of Israel did as they were told. Joseph gave them wagons as Pharaoh had instructed, and he also gave them provisions for their journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_22","002_45_22","GEN","45","22","22","He gave new garments to each of them, but to Benjamin he gave three hundred shekels of silver and five sets of clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_23","002_45_23","GEN","45","23","23","And he sent to his father the following: ten donkeys loaded with the best of Egypt, and ten female donkeys loaded with grain and bread and provisions for his father’s journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_24","002_45_24","GEN","45","24","24","Then Joseph sent his brothers on their way, and as they were leaving, he said to them, “Do not quarrel on the way!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_25","002_45_25","GEN","45","25","25","So the brothers went up out of Egypt and came to their father Jacob in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_26","002_45_26","GEN","45","26","26","“Joseph is still alive,” they said, “and he is ruler over all the land of Egypt!” But Jacob was stunned, for he did not believe them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_27","002_45_27","GEN","45","27","27","However, when they relayed all that Joseph had told them, and when he saw the wagons that Joseph had sent to carry him back, the spirit of their father Jacob was revived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN45_28","002_45_28","GEN","45","28","28","“Enough!” declared Israel. “My son Joseph is still alive! I will go to see him before I die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_1","002_46_1","GEN","46","1","1","So Israel set out with all that he had, and when he came to Beersheba, he offered sacrifices to the God of his father Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_2","002_46_2","GEN","46","2","2","And that night God spoke to Israel in a vision: “Jacob, Jacob!” He said. “Here I am,” replied Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_3","002_46_3","GEN","46","3","3","“I am God,” He said, “the God of your father. Do not be afraid to go down to Egypt, for I will make you into a great nation there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_4","002_46_4","GEN","46","4","4","I will go down with you to Egypt, and I will surely bring you back. And Joseph’s own hands will close your eyes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_5","002_46_5","GEN","46","5","5","Then Jacob departed from Beersheba, and the sons of Israel took their father Jacob in the wagons Pharaoh had sent to carry him, along with their children and wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_6","002_46_6","GEN","46","6","6","They also took the livestock and possessions they had acquired in the land of Canaan, and Jacob and all his offspring went to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_7","002_46_7","GEN","46","7","7","Jacob took with him to Egypt his sons and grandsons, and his daughters and granddaughters—all his offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_8","002_46_8","GEN","46","8","8","Now these are the names of the sons of Israel (Jacob and his descendants) who went to Egypt: Reuben, Jacob’s firstborn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_9","002_46_9","GEN","46","9","9","The sons of Reuben: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_10","002_46_10","GEN","46","10","10","The sons of Simeon: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar, and Shaul the son of a Canaanite woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_11","002_46_11","GEN","46","11","11","The sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_12","002_46_12","GEN","46","12","12","The sons of Judah: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez, and Zerah; but Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan. The sons of Perez: Hezron and Hamul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_13","002_46_13","GEN","46","13","13","The sons of Issachar: Tola, Puvah, Job, and Shimron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_14","002_46_14","GEN","46","14","14","The sons of Zebulun: Sered, Elon, and Jahleel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_15","002_46_15","GEN","46","15","15","These are the sons of Leah born to Jacob in Paddan-aram, in addition to his daughter Dinah. The total number of sons and daughters was thirty-three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_16","002_46_16","GEN","46","16","16","The sons of Gad: Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, and Areli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_17","002_46_17","GEN","46","17","17","The children of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and their sister Serah. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_18","002_46_18","GEN","46","18","18","These are the sons of Jacob born to Zilpah—whom Laban gave to his daughter Leah—sixteen in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_19","002_46_19","GEN","46","19","19","The sons of Jacob’s wife Rachel: Joseph and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_20","002_46_20","GEN","46","20","20","Manasseh and Ephraim were born to Joseph in the land of Egypt by Asenath daughter of Potiphera, priest of On. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_21","002_46_21","GEN","46","21","21","The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_22","002_46_22","GEN","46","22","22","These are the sons of Rachel born to Jacob—fourteen in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_23","002_46_23","GEN","46","23","23","The son of Dan: Hushim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_24","002_46_24","GEN","46","24","24","The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_25","002_46_25","GEN","46","25","25","These are the sons of Jacob born to Bilhah, whom Laban gave to his daughter Rachel—seven in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_26","002_46_26","GEN","46","26","26","All those belonging to Jacob who came to Egypt—his direct descendants, besides the wives of Jacob’s sons—numbered sixty-six persons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_27","002_46_27","GEN","46","27","27","And with the two sons who had been born to Joseph in Egypt, the members of Jacob’s family who went to Egypt were seventy in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_28","002_46_28","GEN","46","28","28","Now Jacob had sent Judah ahead of him to Joseph to get directions to Goshen. When Jacob’s family arrived in the land of Goshen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_29","002_46_29","GEN","46","29","29","Joseph prepared his chariot and went there to meet his father Israel. Joseph presented himself to him, embraced him, and wept profusely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_30","002_46_30","GEN","46","30","30","Then Israel said to Joseph, “Finally I can die, now that I have seen your face and know that you are still alive!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_31","002_46_31","GEN","46","31","31","Joseph said to his brothers and to his father’s household, “I will go up and inform Pharaoh: ‘My brothers and my father’s household from the land of Canaan have come to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_32","002_46_32","GEN","46","32","32","The men are shepherds; they raise livestock, and they have brought their flocks and herds and all that they own.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_33","002_46_33","GEN","46","33","33","When Pharaoh summons you and asks, ‘What is your occupation?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN46_34","002_46_34","GEN","46","34","34","you are to say, ‘Your servants have raised livestock ever since our youth—both we and our fathers.’ Then you will be allowed to settle in the land of Goshen, since all shepherds are detestable to the Egyptians.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_1","002_47_1","GEN","47","1","1","So Joseph went and told Pharaoh: “My father and my brothers, with their flocks and herds and all they own, have come from the land of Canaan and are now in Goshen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_2","002_47_2","GEN","47","2","2","And he chose five of his brothers and presented them before Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_3","002_47_3","GEN","47","3","3","“What is your occupation?” Pharaoh asked Joseph’s brothers. “Your servants are shepherds,” they replied, “both we and our fathers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_4","002_47_4","GEN","47","4","4","Then they said to Pharaoh, “We have come to live in the land for a time, because there is no pasture for the flocks of your servants, since the famine in the land of Canaan has been severe. So now, please allow your servants to settle in the land of Goshen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_5","002_47_5","GEN","47","5","5","Pharaoh said to Joseph, “Now that your father and brothers have come to you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_6","002_47_6","GEN","47","6","6","the land of Egypt is before you; settle your father and brothers in the best part of the land. They may dwell in the land of Goshen. And if you know of any talented men among them, put them in charge of my own livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_7","002_47_7","GEN","47","7","7","Then Joseph brought in his father Jacob and presented him before Pharaoh, and Jacob blessed Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_8","002_47_8","GEN","47","8","8","“How many years have you lived?” Pharaoh asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_9","002_47_9","GEN","47","9","9","“My travels have lasted 130 years,” Jacob replied. “My years have been few and hard, and they have not matched the years of the travels of my fathers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_10","002_47_10","GEN","47","10","10","Then Jacob blessed Pharaoh and departed from his presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_11","002_47_11","GEN","47","11","11","So Joseph settled his father and brothers in the land of Egypt and gave them property in the best part of the land, the district of Rameses, as Pharaoh had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_12","002_47_12","GEN","47","12","12","Joseph also provided his father and brothers and all his father’s household with food for their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_13","002_47_13","GEN","47","13","13","There was no food, however, in all that region, because the famine was so severe; the lands of Egypt and Canaan had been exhausted by the famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_14","002_47_14","GEN","47","14","14","Joseph collected all the money to be found in the land of Egypt and the land of Canaan in exchange for the grain they were buying, and he brought it into Pharaoh’s palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_15","002_47_15","GEN","47","15","15","When the money from the lands of Egypt and Canaan was gone, all the Egyptians came to Joseph and said, “Give us food. Why should we die before your eyes? For our funds have run out!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_16","002_47_16","GEN","47","16","16","“Then bring me your livestock,” said Joseph. “Since the money is gone, I will sell you food in exchange for your livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_17","002_47_17","GEN","47","17","17","So they brought their livestock to Joseph, and he gave them food in exchange for their horses, their flocks and herds, and their donkeys. Throughout that year he provided them with food in exchange for all their livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_18","002_47_18","GEN","47","18","18","When that year was over, they came to him the second year and said, “We cannot hide from our lord that our money is gone and all our livestock belongs to you. There is nothing left for our lord except our bodies and our land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_19","002_47_19","GEN","47","19","19","Why should we perish before your eyes—we and our land as well? Purchase us and our land in exchange for food. Then we, along with our land, will be slaves to Pharaoh. Give us seed that we may live and not die, and that the land may not become desolate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_20","002_47_20","GEN","47","20","20","So Joseph acquired for Pharaoh all the land in Egypt; the Egyptians, one and all, sold their fields because the famine was so severe upon them. The land became Pharaoh’s, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_21","002_47_21","GEN","47","21","21","and Joseph reduced the people to servitude from one end of Egypt to the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_22","002_47_22","GEN","47","22","22","However, he did not acquire the priests’ portion of the land, for it had been given to them by Pharaoh. They ate the rations that Pharaoh supplied; so they did not sell their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_23","002_47_23","GEN","47","23","23","Then Joseph said to the people, “Now that I have acquired you and your land for Pharaoh this day, here is seed for you to sow in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_24","002_47_24","GEN","47","24","24","At harvest time, you are to give a fifth of it to Pharaoh, and four-fifths will be yours as seed for the field and food for yourselves and your households and children.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_25","002_47_25","GEN","47","25","25","“You have saved our lives,” they said. “We have found favor in our lord’s eyes, and we will be Pharaoh’s servants.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_26","002_47_26","GEN","47","26","26","So Joseph established a law that a fifth of the produce belongs to Pharaoh, and it is in effect in the land of Egypt to this day. Only the priests’ land does not belong to Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_27","002_47_27","GEN","47","27","27","Now the Israelites settled in the land of Egypt, in the region of Goshen. They acquired property there and became fruitful and increased greatly in number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_28","002_47_28","GEN","47","28","28","And Jacob lived in the land of Egypt seventeen years, and the length of his life was 147 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_29","002_47_29","GEN","47","29","29","When the time drew near for Israel to die, he called his son Joseph and said to him, “If I have found favor in your eyes, put your hand under my thigh and promise to show me kindness and faithfulness. Do not bury me in Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_30","002_47_30","GEN","47","30","30","but when I lie down with my fathers, carry me out of Egypt and bury me with them.” Joseph answered, “I will do as you have requested.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN47_31","002_47_31","GEN","47","31","31","“Swear to me,” Jacob said. So Joseph swore to him, and Israel bowed in worship at the head of his bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_1","002_48_1","GEN","48","1","1","Some time later Joseph was told, “Your father is ill.” So he set out with his two sons, Manasseh and Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_2","002_48_2","GEN","48","2","2","When Jacob was told, “Your son Joseph has come to you,” Israel rallied his strength and sat up in bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_3","002_48_3","GEN","48","3","3","Jacob said to Joseph, “God Almighty appeared to me at Luz in the land of Canaan, and there He blessed me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_4","002_48_4","GEN","48","4","4","and told me, ‘Behold, I will make you fruitful and multiply you; I will make you a multitude of peoples, and will give this land to your descendants after you as an everlasting possession.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_5","002_48_5","GEN","48","5","5","And now your two sons born to you in Egypt before I came to you here shall be reckoned as mine; Ephraim and Manasseh shall be mine, just as Reuben and Simeon are mine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_6","002_48_6","GEN","48","6","6","Any children born to you after them shall be yours, and they shall be called by the names of their brothers in the territory they inherit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_7","002_48_7","GEN","48","7","7","Now as for me, when I was returning from Paddan, to my sorrow Rachel died along the way in the land of Canaan, some distance from Ephrath. So I buried her there beside the road to Ephrath” (that is, Bethlehem). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_8","002_48_8","GEN","48","8","8","When Israel saw the sons of Joseph, he asked, “Who are these?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_9","002_48_9","GEN","48","9","9","Joseph said to his father, “They are the sons God has given me in this place.” So Jacob said, “Please bring them to me, that I may bless them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_10","002_48_10","GEN","48","10","10","Now Israel’s eyesight was poor because of old age; he could hardly see. Joseph brought his sons to him, and his father kissed them and embraced them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_11","002_48_11","GEN","48","11","11","“I never expected to see your face again,” Israel said to Joseph, “but now God has let me see your children as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_12","002_48_12","GEN","48","12","12","Then Joseph removed his sons from his father’s knees and bowed facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_13","002_48_13","GEN","48","13","13","And Joseph took both of them—with Ephraim in his right hand toward Israel’s left hand, and Manasseh in his left hand toward Israel’s right hand—and brought them close to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_14","002_48_14","GEN","48","14","14","But Israel stretched out his right hand and put it on the head of Ephraim, the younger; and crossing his hands, he put his left on Manasseh’s head, although Manasseh was the firstborn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_15","002_48_15","GEN","48","15","15","Then he blessed Joseph and said: “May the God before whom my fathers Abraham and Isaac walked, the God who has been my shepherd all my life to this day, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_16","002_48_16","GEN","48","16","16","the angel who has redeemed me from all harm—may He bless these boys. And may they be called by my name and the names of my fathers Abraham and Isaac, and may they grow into a multitude upon the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_17","002_48_17","GEN","48","17","17","When Joseph saw that his father had placed his right hand on Ephraim’s head, he was displeased and took his father’s hand to move it from Ephraim’s head to Manasseh’s. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_18","002_48_18","GEN","48","18","18","“Not so, my father!” Joseph said. “This one is the firstborn; put your right hand on his head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_19","002_48_19","GEN","48","19","19","But his father refused. “I know, my son, I know!” he said. “He too shall become a people, and he too shall be great; nevertheless, his younger brother shall be greater than he, and his offspring shall become a multitude of nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_20","002_48_20","GEN","48","20","20","So that day Jacob blessed them and said: “By you shall Israel pronounce this blessing: ‘May God make you like Ephraim and Manasseh.’” So he put Ephraim before Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_21","002_48_21","GEN","48","21","21","Then Israel said to Joseph, “Look, I am about to die, but God will be with you and bring you back to the land of your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN48_22","002_48_22","GEN","48","22","22","And to you, as one who is above your brothers, I give the ridge of land that I took from the Amorites with my sword and bow.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_1","002_49_1","GEN","49","1","1","Then Jacob called for his sons and said, “Gather around so that I can tell you what will happen to you in the days to come: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_2","002_49_2","GEN","49","2","2","Come together and listen, O sons of Jacob; listen to your father Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_3","002_49_3","GEN","49","3","3","Reuben, you are my firstborn, my might, and the beginning of my strength, excelling in honor, excelling in power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_4","002_49_4","GEN","49","4","4","Uncontrolled as the waters, you will no longer excel, because you went up to your father’s bed, onto my couch, and defiled it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_5","002_49_5","GEN","49","5","5","Simeon and Levi are brothers; their swords are weapons of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_6","002_49_6","GEN","49","6","6","May I never enter their council; may I never join their assembly. For they kill men in their anger, and hamstring oxen on a whim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_7","002_49_7","GEN","49","7","7","Cursed be their anger, for it is strong, and their wrath, for it is cruel! I will disperse them in Jacob and scatter them in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_8","002_49_8","GEN","49","8","8","Judah, your brothers shall praise you. Your hand shall be on the necks of your enemies; your father’s sons shall bow down to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_9","002_49_9","GEN","49","9","9","Judah is a young lion—my son, you return from the prey. Like a lion he crouches and lies down; like a lioness, who dares to rouse him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_10","002_49_10","GEN","49","10","10","The scepter will not depart from Judah, nor the staff from between his feet, until Shiloh comes and the allegiance of the nations is his. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_11","002_49_11","GEN","49","11","11","He ties his donkey to the vine, his colt to the choicest branch. He washes his garments in wine, his robes in the blood of grapes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_12","002_49_12","GEN","49","12","12","His eyes are darker than wine, and his teeth are whiter than milk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_13","002_49_13","GEN","49","13","13","Zebulun shall dwell by the seashore and become a harbor for ships; his border shall extend to Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_14","002_49_14","GEN","49","14","14","Issachar is a strong donkey, lying down between the sheepfolds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_15","002_49_15","GEN","49","15","15","He saw that his resting place was good and that his land was pleasant, so he bent his shoulder to the burden and submitted to labor as a servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_16","002_49_16","GEN","49","16","16","Dan shall provide justice for his people as one of the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_17","002_49_17","GEN","49","17","17","He will be a snake by the road, a viper in the path that bites the horse’s heels so that its rider tumbles backward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_18","002_49_18","GEN","49","18","18","I await Your salvation, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_19","002_49_19","GEN","49","19","19","Gad will be attacked by raiders, but he will attack their heels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_20","002_49_20","GEN","49","20","20","Asher’s food will be rich; he shall provide royal delicacies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_21","002_49_21","GEN","49","21","21","Naphtali is a doe set free that bears beautiful fawns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_22","002_49_22","GEN","49","22","22","Joseph is a fruitful vine—a fruitful vine by a spring, whose branches scale the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_23","002_49_23","GEN","49","23","23","The archers attacked him with bitterness; they aimed at him in hostility. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_24","002_49_24","GEN","49","24","24","Yet he steadied his bow, and his strong arms were tempered by the hands of the Mighty One of Jacob, in the name of the Shepherd, the Rock of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_25","002_49_25","GEN","49","25","25","by the God of your father who helps you, and by the Almighty who blesses you, with blessings of the heavens above, with blessings of the depths below, with blessings of the breasts and womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_26","002_49_26","GEN","49","26","26","The blessings of your father have surpassed the blessings of the ancient mountains and the bounty of the everlasting hills. May they rest on the head of Joseph, on the brow of the prince of his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_27","002_49_27","GEN","49","27","27","Benjamin is a ravenous wolf; in the morning he devours the prey, in the evening he divides the plunder.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_28","002_49_28","GEN","49","28","28","These are the tribes of Israel, twelve in all, and this was what their father said to them. He blessed them, and he blessed each one with a suitable blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_29","002_49_29","GEN","49","29","29","Then Jacob instructed them, “I am about to be gathered to my people. Bury me with my fathers in the cave in the field of Ephron the Hittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_30","002_49_30","GEN","49","30","30","The cave is in the field of Machpelah near Mamre, in the land of Canaan. This is the field Abraham purchased from Ephron the Hittite as a burial site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_31","002_49_31","GEN","49","31","31","There Abraham and his wife Sarah are buried, there Isaac and his wife Rebekah are buried, and there I buried Leah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_32","002_49_32","GEN","49","32","32","The field and the cave that is in it were purchased from the Hittites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN49_33","002_49_33","GEN","49","33","33","When Jacob had finished instructing his sons, he pulled his feet into the bed and breathed his last, and he was gathered to his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_1","002_50_1","GEN","50","1","1","Then Joseph fell upon his father’s face, wept over him, and kissed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_2","002_50_2","GEN","50","2","2","And Joseph directed the physicians in his service to embalm his father Israel. So they embalmed him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_3","002_50_3","GEN","50","3","3","taking the forty days required to complete the embalming. And the Egyptians mourned for him seventy days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_4","002_50_4","GEN","50","4","4","When the days of mourning had passed, Joseph said to Pharaoh’s court, “If I have found favor in your eyes, please tell Pharaoh that ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_5","002_50_5","GEN","50","5","5","my father made me swear an oath when he said, ‘I am about to die. You must bury me in the tomb that I dug for myself in the land of Canaan.’ Now let me go and bury my father, and then return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_6","002_50_6","GEN","50","6","6","Pharaoh replied, “Go up and bury your father, as he made you swear to do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_7","002_50_7","GEN","50","7","7","Then Joseph went to bury his father, and all the servants of Pharaoh accompanied him—the elders of Pharaoh’s household and all the elders of the land of Egypt— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_8","002_50_8","GEN","50","8","8","along with all of Joseph’s household, and his brothers, and his father’s household. Only their children and flocks and herds were left in Goshen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_9","002_50_9","GEN","50","9","9","Chariots and horsemen alike went up with him, and it was an exceedingly large procession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_10","002_50_10","GEN","50","10","10","When they reached the threshing floor of Atad, which is across the Jordan, they lamented and wailed loudly, and Joseph mourned for his father seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_11","002_50_11","GEN","50","11","11","When the Canaanites of the land saw the mourning at the threshing floor of Atad, they said, “This is a solemn ceremony of mourning by the Egyptians.” Thus the place across the Jordan is called Abel-mizraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_12","002_50_12","GEN","50","12","12","So Jacob’s sons did as he had charged them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_13","002_50_13","GEN","50","13","13","They carried him to the land of Canaan and buried him in the cave at Machpelah in the field near Mamre, which Abraham had purchased from Ephron the Hittite as a burial site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_14","002_50_14","GEN","50","14","14","After Joseph had buried his father, he returned to Egypt with his brothers and all who had gone with him to bury his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_15","002_50_15","GEN","50","15","15","When Joseph’s brothers saw that their father was dead, they said, “What if Joseph bears a grudge? Then he will surely repay us for all the evil that we did to him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_16","002_50_16","GEN","50","16","16","So they sent word to Joseph, saying, “Before he died, your father commanded, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_17","002_50_17","GEN","50","17","17","‘This is what you are to say to Joseph: I beg you, please forgive the transgression and sin of your brothers, for they did you wrong.’ So now, Joseph, please forgive the transgression of the servants of the God of your father.” When their message came to him, Joseph wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_18","002_50_18","GEN","50","18","18","His brothers also came to him, bowed down before him, and said, “We are your slaves!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_19","002_50_19","GEN","50","19","19","But Joseph replied, “Do not be afraid. Am I in the place of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_20","002_50_20","GEN","50","20","20","As for you, what you intended against me for evil, God intended for good, in order to accomplish a day like this—to preserve the lives of many people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_21","002_50_21","GEN","50","21","21","Therefore do not be afraid. I will provide for you and your little ones.” So Joseph reassured his brothers and spoke kindly to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_22","002_50_22","GEN","50","22","22","Now Joseph and his father’s household remained in Egypt, and Joseph lived to the age of 110. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_23","002_50_23","GEN","50","23","23","He saw Ephraim’s sons to the third generation, and indeed the sons of Machir son of Manasseh were brought up on Joseph’s knees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_24","002_50_24","GEN","50","24","24","Then Joseph said to his brothers, “I am about to die, but God will surely visit you and bring you up from this land to the land He promised on oath to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_25","002_50_25","GEN","50","25","25","And Joseph made the sons of Israel take an oath and said, “God will surely attend to you, and then you must carry my bones up from this place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GN50_26","002_50_26","GEN","50","26","26","So Joseph died at the age of 110. And they embalmed his body and placed it in a coffin in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_1","003_1_1","EXO","1","1","1","These are the names of the sons of Israel who went to Egypt with Jacob, each with his family: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_2","003_1_2","EXO","1","2","2","Reuben, Simeon, Levi, and Judah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_3","003_1_3","EXO","1","3","3","Issachar, Zebulun, and Benjamin; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_4","003_1_4","EXO","1","4","4","Dan and Naphtali; Gad and Asher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_5","003_1_5","EXO","1","5","5","The descendants of Jacob numbered seventy in all, including Joseph, who was already in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_6","003_1_6","EXO","1","6","6","Now Joseph and all his brothers and all that generation died, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_7","003_1_7","EXO","1","7","7","but the Israelites were fruitful and increased rapidly; they multiplied and became exceedingly numerous, so that the land was filled with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_8","003_1_8","EXO","1","8","8","Then a new king, who did not know Joseph, came to power in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_9","003_1_9","EXO","1","9","9","“Look,” he said to his people, “the Israelites have become too numerous and too powerful for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_10","003_1_10","EXO","1","10","10","Come, let us deal shrewdly with them, or they will increase even more; and if a war breaks out, they may join our enemies, fight against us, and leave the country.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_11","003_1_11","EXO","1","11","11","So the Egyptians appointed taskmasters over the Israelites to oppress them with forced labor. As a result, they built Pithom and Rameses as store cities for Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_12","003_1_12","EXO","1","12","12","But the more they were oppressed, the more they multiplied and flourished; so the Egyptians came to dread the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_13","003_1_13","EXO","1","13","13","They worked the Israelites ruthlessly ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_14","003_1_14","EXO","1","14","14","and made their lives bitter with hard labor in brick and mortar, and with all kinds of work in the fields. Every service they imposed was harsh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_15","003_1_15","EXO","1","15","15","Then the king of Egypt said to the Hebrew midwives, whose names were Shiphrah and Puah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_16","003_1_16","EXO","1","16","16","“When you help the Hebrew women give birth, observe them on the birthstools. If the child is a son, kill him; but if it is a daughter, let her live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_17","003_1_17","EXO","1","17","17","The midwives, however, feared God and did not do as the king of Egypt had instructed; they let the boys live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_18","003_1_18","EXO","1","18","18","So the king of Egypt summoned the midwives and asked them, “Why have you done this? Why have you let the boys live?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_19","003_1_19","EXO","1","19","19","The midwives answered Pharaoh, “The Hebrew women are not like the Egyptian women, for they are vigorous and give birth before a midwife arrives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_20","003_1_20","EXO","1","20","20","So God was good to the midwives, and the people multiplied and became even more numerous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_21","003_1_21","EXO","1","21","21","And because the midwives feared God, He gave them families of their own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX1_22","003_1_22","EXO","1","22","22","Then Pharaoh commanded all his people: “Every son born to the Hebrews you must throw into the Nile, but every daughter you may allow to live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_1","003_2_1","EXO","2","1","1","Now a man of the house of Levi married a Levite woman, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_2","003_2_2","EXO","2","2","2","and she conceived and gave birth to a son. When she saw that he was a beautiful child, she hid him for three months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_3","003_2_3","EXO","2","3","3","But when she could no longer hide him, she got him a papyrus basket and coated it with tar and pitch. Then she placed the child in the basket and set it among the reeds along the bank of the Nile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_4","003_2_4","EXO","2","4","4","And his sister stood at a distance to see what would happen to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_5","003_2_5","EXO","2","5","5","Soon the daughter of Pharaoh went down to bathe in the Nile, and her attendants were walking along the riverbank. And when she saw the basket among the reeds, she sent her maidservant to retrieve it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_6","003_2_6","EXO","2","6","6","When she opened it, she saw the child, and behold, the little boy was crying. So she had compassion on him and said, “This is one of the Hebrew children.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_7","003_2_7","EXO","2","7","7","Then his sister said to Pharaoh’s daughter, “Shall I go and call one of the Hebrew women to nurse the child for you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_8","003_2_8","EXO","2","8","8","“Go ahead,” Pharaoh’s daughter told her. And the girl went and called the boy’s mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_9","003_2_9","EXO","2","9","9","Pharaoh’s daughter said to her, “Take this child and nurse him for me, and I will pay your wages.” So the woman took the boy and nursed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_10","003_2_10","EXO","2","10","10","When the child had grown older, she brought him to Pharaoh’s daughter, and he became her son. She named him Moses and explained, “I drew him out of the water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_11","003_2_11","EXO","2","11","11","One day, after Moses had grown up, he went out to his own people and observed their hard labor. He saw an Egyptian beating a Hebrew, one of his own people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_12","003_2_12","EXO","2","12","12","After looking this way and that and seeing no one, he struck down the Egyptian and hid his body in the sand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_13","003_2_13","EXO","2","13","13","The next day Moses went out and saw two Hebrews fighting. He asked the one in the wrong, “Why are you attacking your companion?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_14","003_2_14","EXO","2","14","14","But the man replied, “Who made you ruler and judge over us? Are you planning to kill me as you killed the Egyptian?” Then Moses was afraid and thought, “This thing I have done has surely become known.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_15","003_2_15","EXO","2","15","15","When Pharaoh heard about this matter, he sought to kill Moses. But Moses fled from Pharaoh and settled in the land of Midian, where he sat down beside a well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_16","003_2_16","EXO","2","16","16","Now the priest of Midian had seven daughters, and they came to draw water and fill the troughs to water their father’s flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_17","003_2_17","EXO","2","17","17","And when some shepherds came along and drove them away, Moses rose up to help them and watered their flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_18","003_2_18","EXO","2","18","18","When the daughters returned to their father Reuel, he asked them, “Why have you returned so early today?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_19","003_2_19","EXO","2","19","19","“An Egyptian rescued us from the shepherds,” they replied. “He even drew water for us and watered the flock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_20","003_2_20","EXO","2","20","20","“So where is he?” their father asked. “Why did you leave the man behind? Invite him to have something to eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_21","003_2_21","EXO","2","21","21","Moses agreed to stay with the man, and he gave his daughter Zipporah to Moses in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_22","003_2_22","EXO","2","22","22","And she gave birth to a son, and Moses named him Gershom, saying, “I have become a foreigner in a foreign land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_23","003_2_23","EXO","2","23","23","After a long time, the king of Egypt died. The Israelites groaned and cried out under their burden of slavery, and their cry for deliverance from bondage ascended to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_24","003_2_24","EXO","2","24","24","So God heard their groaning, and He remembered His covenant with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX2_25","003_2_25","EXO","2","25","25","God saw the Israelites and took notice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_1","003_3_1","EXO","3","1","1","Meanwhile, Moses was shepherding the flock of his father-in-law Jethro, the priest of Midian. He led the flock to the far side of the wilderness and came to Horeb, the mountain of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_2","003_3_2","EXO","3","2","2","There the angel of the LORD appeared to him in a blazing fire from within a bush. Moses saw the bush ablaze with fire, but it was not consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_3","003_3_3","EXO","3","3","3","So Moses thought, “I must go over and see this marvelous sight. Why is the bush not burning up?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_4","003_3_4","EXO","3","4","4","When the LORD saw that he had gone over to look, God called out to him from within the bush, “Moses, Moses!” “Here I am,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_5","003_3_5","EXO","3","5","5","“Do not come any closer,” God said. “Take off your sandals, for the place where you are standing is holy ground.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_6","003_3_6","EXO","3","6","6","Then He said, “I am the God of your father, the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob.” At this, Moses hid his face, for he was afraid to look at God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_7","003_3_7","EXO","3","7","7","The LORD said, “I have indeed seen the affliction of My people in Egypt. I have heard them crying out because of their oppressors, and I am aware of their sufferings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_8","003_3_8","EXO","3","8","8","I have come down to rescue them from the hand of the Egyptians and to bring them up out of that land to a good and spacious land, a land flowing with milk and honey—the home of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_9","003_3_9","EXO","3","9","9","And now the cry of the Israelites has reached Me, and I have seen how severely the Egyptians are oppressing them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_10","003_3_10","EXO","3","10","10","Therefore, go! I am sending you to Pharaoh to bring My people the Israelites out of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_11","003_3_11","EXO","3","11","11","But Moses asked God, “Who am I, that I should go to Pharaoh and bring the Israelites out of Egypt?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_12","003_3_12","EXO","3","12","12","“I will surely be with you,” God said, “and this will be the sign to you that I have sent you: When you have brought the people out of Egypt, all of you will worship God on this mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_13","003_3_13","EXO","3","13","13","Then Moses asked God, “Suppose I go to the Israelites and say to them, ‘The God of your fathers has sent me to you,’ and they ask me, ‘What is His name?’ What should I tell them?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_14","003_3_14","EXO","3","14","14","God said to Moses, “I AM WHO I AM. This is what you are to say to the Israelites: ‘I AM has sent me to you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_15","003_3_15","EXO","3","15","15","God also told Moses, “Say to the Israelites, ‘The LORD, the God of your fathers—the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob—has sent me to you.’ This is My name forever, and this is how I am to be remembered in every generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_16","003_3_16","EXO","3","16","16","Go, assemble the elders of Israel and say to them, ‘The LORD, the God of your fathers—the God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob—has appeared to me and said: I have surely attended to you and have seen what has been done to you in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_17","003_3_17","EXO","3","17","17","And I have promised to bring you up out of your affliction in Egypt, into the land of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites—a land flowing with milk and honey.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_18","003_3_18","EXO","3","18","18","The elders of Israel will listen to what you say, and you must go with them to the king of Egypt and tell him, ‘The LORD, the God of the Hebrews, has met with us. Now please let us take a three-day journey into the wilderness, so that we may sacrifice to the LORD our God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_19","003_3_19","EXO","3","19","19","But I know that the king of Egypt will not allow you to go unless a mighty hand compels him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_20","003_3_20","EXO","3","20","20","So I will stretch out My hand and strike the Egyptians with all the wonders I will perform among them. And after that, he will release you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_21","003_3_21","EXO","3","21","21","And I will grant this people such favor in the sight of the Egyptians that when you leave, you will not go away empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX3_22","003_3_22","EXO","3","22","22","Every woman shall ask her neighbor and any woman staying in her house for silver and gold jewelry and clothing, and you will put them on your sons and daughters. So you will plunder the Egyptians.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_1","003_4_1","EXO","4","1","1","Then Moses answered, “What if they do not believe me or listen to my voice? For they may say, ‘The LORD has not appeared to you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_2","003_4_2","EXO","4","2","2","And the LORD asked him, “What is that in your hand?” “A staff,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_3","003_4_3","EXO","4","3","3","“Throw it on the ground,” said the LORD. So Moses threw it on the ground, and it became a snake, and he ran from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_4","003_4_4","EXO","4","4","4","“Stretch out your hand and grab it by the tail,” the LORD said to Moses, who reached out his hand and caught the snake, and it turned back into a staff in his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_5","003_4_5","EXO","4","5","5","“This is so that they may believe that the LORD, the God of their fathers—the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob—has appeared to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_6","003_4_6","EXO","4","6","6","Furthermore, the LORD said to Moses, “Put your hand inside your cloak.” So he put his hand inside his cloak, and when he took it out, his hand was leprous, white as snow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_7","003_4_7","EXO","4","7","7","“Put your hand back inside your cloak,” said the LORD. So Moses put his hand back inside his cloak, and when he took it out, it was restored, like the rest of his skin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_8","003_4_8","EXO","4","8","8","And the LORD said, “If they refuse to believe you or heed the witness of the first sign, they may believe that of the second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_9","003_4_9","EXO","4","9","9","But if they do not believe even these two signs or listen to your voice, take some water from the Nile and pour it on the dry ground. Then the water you take from the Nile will become blood on the ground.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_10","003_4_10","EXO","4","10","10","“Please, Lord,” Moses replied, “I have never been eloquent, neither in the past nor since You have spoken to Your servant, for I am slow of speech and tongue.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_11","003_4_11","EXO","4","11","11","And the LORD said to him, “Who gave man his mouth? Or who makes the mute or the deaf, the sighted or the blind? Is it not I, the LORD? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_12","003_4_12","EXO","4","12","12","Now go! I will help you as you speak, and I will teach you what to say.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_13","003_4_13","EXO","4","13","13","But Moses replied, “Please, Lord, send someone else.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_14","003_4_14","EXO","4","14","14","Then the anger of the LORD burned against Moses, and He said, “Is not Aaron the Levite your brother? I know that he can speak well, and he is now on his way to meet you. When he sees you, he will be glad in his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_15","003_4_15","EXO","4","15","15","You are to speak to him and put the words in his mouth. I will help both of you to speak, and I will teach you what to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_16","003_4_16","EXO","4","16","16","He will speak to the people for you. He will be your spokesman, and it will be as if you were God to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_17","003_4_17","EXO","4","17","17","But take this staff in your hand so you can perform signs with it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_18","003_4_18","EXO","4","18","18","Then Moses went back to his father-in-law Jethro and said to him, “Please let me return to my brothers in Egypt to see if they are still alive.” “Go in peace,” Jethro replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_19","003_4_19","EXO","4","19","19","Now the LORD had said to Moses in Midian, “Go back to Egypt, for all the men who sought to kill you are dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_20","003_4_20","EXO","4","20","20","So Moses took his wife and sons, put them on a donkey, and headed back to Egypt. And he took the staff of God in his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_21","003_4_21","EXO","4","21","21","The LORD instructed Moses, “When you go back to Egypt, see that you perform before Pharaoh all the wonders that I have put within your power. But I will harden his heart so that he will not let the people go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_22","003_4_22","EXO","4","22","22","Then tell Pharaoh that this is what the LORD says: ‘Israel is My firstborn son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_23","003_4_23","EXO","4","23","23","and I told you to let My son go so that he may worship Me. But since you have refused to let him go, behold, I will kill your firstborn son!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_24","003_4_24","EXO","4","24","24","Now at a lodging place along the way, the LORD met Moses and was about to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_25","003_4_25","EXO","4","25","25","But Zipporah took a flint knife, cut off her son’s foreskin, and touched it to Moses’ feet. “Surely you are a bridegroom of blood to me,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_26","003_4_26","EXO","4","26","26","So the LORD let him alone. (When she said, “bridegroom of blood,” she was referring to the circumcision.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_27","003_4_27","EXO","4","27","27","Meanwhile, the LORD had said to Aaron, “Go and meet Moses in the wilderness.” So he went and met Moses at the mountain of God and kissed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_28","003_4_28","EXO","4","28","28","And Moses told Aaron everything the LORD had sent him to say, and all the signs He had commanded him to perform. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_29","003_4_29","EXO","4","29","29","Then Moses and Aaron went and assembled all the elders of the Israelites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_30","003_4_30","EXO","4","30","30","and Aaron relayed everything the LORD had said to Moses. And Moses performed the signs before the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX4_31","003_4_31","EXO","4","31","31","and they believed. And when they heard that the LORD had attended to the Israelites and had seen their affliction, they bowed down and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_1","003_5_1","EXO","5","1","1","After that, Moses and Aaron went to Pharaoh and said, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Let My people go, so that they may hold a feast to Me in the wilderness.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_2","003_5_2","EXO","5","2","2","But Pharaoh replied, “Who is the LORD that I should obey His voice and let Israel go? I do not know the LORD, and I will not let Israel go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_3","003_5_3","EXO","5","3","3","“The God of the Hebrews has met with us,” they answered. “Please let us go on a three-day journey into the wilderness to sacrifice to the LORD our God, or He may strike us with plagues or with the sword.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_4","003_5_4","EXO","5","4","4","But the king of Egypt said to them, “Moses and Aaron, why do you draw the people away from their work? Get back to your labor!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_5","003_5_5","EXO","5","5","5","Pharaoh also said, “Look, the people of the land are now numerous, and you would be stopping them from their labor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_6","003_5_6","EXO","5","6","6","That same day Pharaoh commanded the taskmasters of the people and their foremen: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_7","003_5_7","EXO","5","7","7","“You shall no longer supply the people with straw for making bricks. They must go and gather their own straw. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_8","003_5_8","EXO","5","8","8","But require of them the same quota of bricks as before; do not reduce it. For they are lazy; that is why they are crying out, ‘Let us go and sacrifice to our God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_9","003_5_9","EXO","5","9","9","Make the work harder on the men so they will be occupied and pay no attention to these lies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_10","003_5_10","EXO","5","10","10","So the taskmasters and foremen of the people went out and said to them, “This is what Pharaoh says: ‘I am no longer giving you straw. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_11","003_5_11","EXO","5","11","11","Go and get your own straw wherever you can find it; but your workload will in no way be reduced.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_12","003_5_12","EXO","5","12","12","So the people scattered all over the land of Egypt to gather stubble for straw. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_13","003_5_13","EXO","5","13","13","The taskmasters kept pressing them, saying, “Fulfill your quota each day, just as you did when straw was provided.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_14","003_5_14","EXO","5","14","14","Then the Israelite foremen, whom Pharaoh’s taskmasters had set over the people, were beaten and asked, “Why have you not fulfilled your quota of bricks yesterday or today, as you did before?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_15","003_5_15","EXO","5","15","15","So the Israelite foremen went and appealed to Pharaoh: “Why are you treating your servants this way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_16","003_5_16","EXO","5","16","16","No straw has been given to your servants, yet we are told, ‘Make bricks!’ Look, your servants are being beaten, but the fault is with your own people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_17","003_5_17","EXO","5","17","17","“You are slackers!” Pharaoh replied. “Slackers! That is why you keep saying, ‘Let us go and sacrifice to the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_18","003_5_18","EXO","5","18","18","Now get to work. You will be given no straw, yet you must deliver the full quota of bricks.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_19","003_5_19","EXO","5","19","19","The Israelite foremen realized they were in trouble when they were told, “You must not reduce your daily quota of bricks.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_20","003_5_20","EXO","5","20","20","When they left Pharaoh, they confronted Moses and Aaron, who stood waiting to meet them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_21","003_5_21","EXO","5","21","21","“May the LORD look upon you and judge you,” the foremen said, “for you have made us a stench before Pharaoh and his officials; you have placed in their hand a sword to kill us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_22","003_5_22","EXO","5","22","22","So Moses returned to the LORD and asked, “Lord, why have You brought trouble upon this people? Is this why You sent me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX5_23","003_5_23","EXO","5","23","23","Ever since I went to Pharaoh to speak in Your name, he has brought trouble on this people, and You have not delivered Your people in any way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_1","003_6_1","EXO","6","1","1","But the LORD said to Moses, “Now you will see what I will do to Pharaoh, for because of My mighty hand he will let the people go; because of My strong hand he will drive them out of his land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_2","003_6_2","EXO","6","2","2","God also told Moses, “I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_3","003_6_3","EXO","6","3","3","I appeared to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob as God Almighty, but by My name the LORD I did not make Myself known to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_4","003_6_4","EXO","6","4","4","I also established My covenant with them to give them the land of Canaan, the land where they lived as foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_5","003_6_5","EXO","6","5","5","Furthermore, I have heard the groaning of the Israelites, whom the Egyptians are enslaving, and I have remembered My covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_6","003_6_6","EXO","6","6","6","Therefore tell the Israelites: ‘I am the LORD, and I will bring you out from under the yoke of the Egyptians and deliver you from their bondage. I will redeem you with an outstretched arm and with mighty acts of judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_7","003_6_7","EXO","6","7","7","I will take you as My own people, and I will be your God. Then you will know that I am the LORD your God, who brought you out from under the yoke of the Egyptians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_8","003_6_8","EXO","6","8","8","And I will bring you into the land that I swore to give to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. I will give it to you as a possession. I am the LORD!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_9","003_6_9","EXO","6","9","9","Moses relayed this message to the Israelites, but on account of their broken spirit and cruel bondage, they did not listen to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_10","003_6_10","EXO","6","10","10","So the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_11","003_6_11","EXO","6","11","11","“Go and tell Pharaoh king of Egypt to let the Israelites go out of his land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_12","003_6_12","EXO","6","12","12","But in the LORD’s presence Moses replied, “If the Israelites will not listen to me, then why would Pharaoh listen to me, since I am unskilled in speech?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_13","003_6_13","EXO","6","13","13","Then the LORD spoke to Moses and Aaron and gave them a charge concerning both the Israelites and Pharaoh king of Egypt, to bring the Israelites out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_14","003_6_14","EXO","6","14","14","These were the heads of their fathers’ houses: The sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel, were Hanoch and Pallu, Hezron and Carmi. These were the clans of Reuben. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_15","003_6_15","EXO","6","15","15","The sons of Simeon were Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar, and Shaul, the son of a Canaanite woman. These were the clans of Simeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_16","003_6_16","EXO","6","16","16","These were the names of the sons of Levi according to their records: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. Levi lived 137 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_17","003_6_17","EXO","6","17","17","The sons of Gershon were Libni and Shimei, by their clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_18","003_6_18","EXO","6","18","18","The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_19","003_6_19","EXO","6","19","19","The sons of Merari were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites according to their records. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_20","003_6_20","EXO","6","20","20","And Amram married his father’s sister Jochebed, and she bore him Aaron and Moses. Amram lived 137 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_21","003_6_21","EXO","6","21","21","The sons of Izhar were Korah, Nepheg, and Zichri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_22","003_6_22","EXO","6","22","22","The sons of Uzziel were Mishael, Elzaphan, and Sithri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_23","003_6_23","EXO","6","23","23","And Aaron married Elisheba, the daughter of Amminadab and sister of Nahshon, and she bore him Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_24","003_6_24","EXO","6","24","24","The sons of Korah were Assir, Elkanah, and Abiasaph. These were the clans of the Korahites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_25","003_6_25","EXO","6","25","25","Aaron’s son Eleazar married one of the daughters of Putiel, and she bore him Phinehas. These were the heads of the Levite families by their clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_26","003_6_26","EXO","6","26","26","It was this Aaron and Moses to whom the LORD said, “Bring the Israelites out of the land of Egypt by their divisions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_27","003_6_27","EXO","6","27","27","Moses and Aaron were the ones who spoke to Pharaoh king of Egypt in order to bring the Israelites out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_28","003_6_28","EXO","6","28","28","Now on the day that the LORD spoke to Moses in Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_29","003_6_29","EXO","6","29","29","He said to him, “I am the LORD; tell Pharaoh king of Egypt everything I say to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX6_30","003_6_30","EXO","6","30","30","But in the LORD’s presence Moses replied, “Since I am unskilled in speech, why would Pharaoh listen to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_1","003_7_1","EXO","7","1","1","The LORD answered Moses, “See, I have made you like God to Pharaoh, and your brother Aaron will be your prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_2","003_7_2","EXO","7","2","2","You are to speak all that I command you, and your brother Aaron is to tell Pharaoh to let the Israelites go out of his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_3","003_7_3","EXO","7","3","3","But I will harden Pharaoh’s heart, and though I will multiply My signs and wonders in the land of Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_4","003_7_4","EXO","7","4","4","Pharaoh will not listen to you. Then I will lay My hand on Egypt, and by mighty acts of judgment I will bring the divisions of My people the Israelites out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_5","003_7_5","EXO","7","5","5","And the Egyptians will know that I am the LORD, when I stretch out My hand against Egypt and bring the Israelites out from among them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_6","003_7_6","EXO","7","6","6","So Moses and Aaron did just as the LORD had commanded them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_7","003_7_7","EXO","7","7","7","Moses was eighty years old and Aaron was eighty-three when they spoke to Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_8","003_7_8","EXO","7","8","8","The LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_9","003_7_9","EXO","7","9","9","“When Pharaoh tells you, ‘Perform a miracle,’ you are to say to Aaron, ‘Take your staff and throw it down before Pharaoh,’ and it will become a serpent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_10","003_7_10","EXO","7","10","10","So Moses and Aaron went to Pharaoh and did just as the LORD had commanded. Aaron threw his staff down before Pharaoh and his officials, and it became a serpent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_11","003_7_11","EXO","7","11","11","But Pharaoh called the wise men and sorcerers and magicians of Egypt, and they also did the same things by their magic arts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_12","003_7_12","EXO","7","12","12","Each one threw down his staff, and it became a serpent. But Aaron’s staff swallowed up the other staffs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_13","003_7_13","EXO","7","13","13","Still, Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he would not listen to them, just as the LORD had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_14","003_7_14","EXO","7","14","14","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Pharaoh’s heart is unyielding; he refuses to let the people go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_15","003_7_15","EXO","7","15","15","Go to Pharaoh in the morning as you see him walking out to the water. Wait on the bank of the Nile to meet him, and take in your hand the staff that was changed into a snake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_16","003_7_16","EXO","7","16","16","Then say to him, ‘The LORD, the God of the Hebrews, has sent me to tell you: Let My people go, so that they may worship Me in the wilderness. But until now you have not listened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_17","003_7_17","EXO","7","17","17","This is what the LORD says: By this you will know that I am the LORD. Behold, with the staff in my hand I will strike the water of the Nile, and it will turn to blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_18","003_7_18","EXO","7","18","18","The fish in the Nile will die, the river will stink, and the Egyptians will be unable to drink its water.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_19","003_7_19","EXO","7","19","19","And the LORD said to Moses, “Tell Aaron, ‘Take your staff and stretch out your hand over the waters of Egypt—over their rivers and canals and ponds and all the reservoirs—that they may become blood.’ There will be blood throughout the land of Egypt, even in the vessels of wood and stone.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_20","003_7_20","EXO","7","20","20","Moses and Aaron did just as the LORD had commanded; in the presence of Pharaoh and his officials, Aaron raised the staff and struck the water of the Nile, and all the water was turned to blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_21","003_7_21","EXO","7","21","21","The fish in the Nile died, and the river smelled so bad that the Egyptians could not drink its water. And there was blood throughout the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_22","003_7_22","EXO","7","22","22","But the magicians of Egypt did the same things by their magic arts. So Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he would not listen to Moses and Aaron, just as the LORD had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_23","003_7_23","EXO","7","23","23","Instead, Pharaoh turned around, went into his palace, and did not take any of this to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_24","003_7_24","EXO","7","24","24","So all the Egyptians dug around the Nile for water to drink, because they could not drink the water from the river. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX7_25","003_7_25","EXO","7","25","25","And seven full days passed after the LORD had struck the Nile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_1","003_8_1","EXO","8","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go to Pharaoh and tell him that this is what the LORD says: ‘Let My people go, so that they may worship Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_2","003_8_2","EXO","8","2","2","But if you refuse to let them go, I will plague your whole country with frogs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_3","003_8_3","EXO","8","3","3","The Nile will teem with frogs, and they will come into your palace and up to your bedroom and onto your bed, into the houses of your officials and your people, and into your ovens and kneading bowls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_4","003_8_4","EXO","8","4","4","The frogs will come up on you and your people and all your officials.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_5","003_8_5","EXO","8","5","5","And the LORD said to Moses, “Tell Aaron, ‘Stretch out your hand with your staff over the rivers and canals and ponds, and cause the frogs to come up onto the land of Egypt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_6","003_8_6","EXO","8","6","6","So Aaron stretched out his hand over the waters of Egypt, and the frogs came up and covered the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_7","003_8_7","EXO","8","7","7","But the magicians did the same thing by their magic arts, and they also brought frogs up onto the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_8","003_8_8","EXO","8","8","8","Pharaoh summoned Moses and Aaron and said, “Pray to the LORD to take the frogs away from me and my people. Then I will let your people go, that they may sacrifice to the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_9","003_8_9","EXO","8","9","9","Moses said to Pharaoh, “You may have the honor over me. When shall I pray for you and your officials and your people that the frogs (except for those in the Nile) may be taken away from you and your houses?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_10","003_8_10","EXO","8","10","10","“Tomorrow,” Pharaoh answered. “May it be as you say,” Moses replied, “so that you may know that there is no one like the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_11","003_8_11","EXO","8","11","11","The frogs will depart from you and your houses and your officials and your people; they will remain only in the Nile.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_12","003_8_12","EXO","8","12","12","After Moses and Aaron had left Pharaoh, Moses cried out to the LORD for help with the frogs that He had brought against Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_13","003_8_13","EXO","8","13","13","And the LORD did as Moses requested, and the frogs in the houses, the courtyards, and the fields died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_14","003_8_14","EXO","8","14","14","They were piled into countless heaps, and there was a terrible stench in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_15","003_8_15","EXO","8","15","15","When Pharaoh saw that there was relief, however, he hardened his heart and would not listen to Moses and Aaron, just as the LORD had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_16","003_8_16","EXO","8","16","16","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Tell Aaron, ‘Stretch out your staff and strike the dust of the earth, that it may turn into swarms of gnats throughout the land of Egypt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_17","003_8_17","EXO","8","17","17","This they did, and when Aaron stretched out his hand with his staff and struck the dust of the earth, gnats came upon man and beast. All the dust of the earth turned into gnats throughout the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_18","003_8_18","EXO","8","18","18","The magicians tried to produce gnats using their magic arts, but they could not. And the gnats remained on man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_19","003_8_19","EXO","8","19","19","“This is the finger of God,” the magicians said to Pharaoh. But Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he would not listen to them, just as the LORD had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_20","003_8_20","EXO","8","20","20","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Get up early in the morning, and when Pharaoh goes out to the water, stand before him and tell him that this is what the LORD says: ‘Let My people go, so that they may worship Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_21","003_8_21","EXO","8","21","21","But if you will not let My people go, I will send swarms of flies upon you and your officials and your people and your houses. The houses of the Egyptians and even the ground where they stand will be full of flies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_22","003_8_22","EXO","8","22","22","But on that day I will give special treatment to the land of Goshen, where My people live; no swarms of flies will be found there. In this way you will know that I, the LORD, am in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_23","003_8_23","EXO","8","23","23","I will make a distinction between My people and your people. This sign will take place tomorrow.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_24","003_8_24","EXO","8","24","24","And the LORD did so. Thick swarms of flies poured into Pharaoh’s palace and into the houses of his officials. Throughout Egypt the land was ruined by swarms of flies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_25","003_8_25","EXO","8","25","25","Then Pharaoh summoned Moses and Aaron and said, “Go, sacrifice to your God within this land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_26","003_8_26","EXO","8","26","26","But Moses replied, “It would not be right to do that, because the sacrifices we offer to the LORD our God would be detestable to the Egyptians. If we offer sacrifices that are detestable before the Egyptians, will they not stone us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_27","003_8_27","EXO","8","27","27","We must make a three-day journey into the wilderness and sacrifice to the LORD our God as He commands us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_28","003_8_28","EXO","8","28","28","Pharaoh answered, “I will let you go and sacrifice to the LORD your God in the wilderness, but you must not go very far. Now pray for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_29","003_8_29","EXO","8","29","29","“As soon as I leave you,” Moses said, “I will pray to the LORD, so that tomorrow the swarms of flies will depart from Pharaoh and his officials and his people. But Pharaoh must not act deceitfully again by refusing to let the people go and sacrifice to the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_30","003_8_30","EXO","8","30","30","Then Moses left Pharaoh and prayed to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_31","003_8_31","EXO","8","31","31","and the LORD did as Moses requested. He removed the swarms of flies from Pharaoh and his officials and his people; not one fly remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX8_32","003_8_32","EXO","8","32","32","But Pharaoh hardened his heart this time as well, and he would not let the people go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_1","003_9_1","EXO","9","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go to Pharaoh and tell him that this is what the LORD, the God of the Hebrews, says: ‘Let My people go, so that they may worship Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_2","003_9_2","EXO","9","2","2","But if you continue to restrain them and refuse to let them go, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_3","003_9_3","EXO","9","3","3","then the hand of the LORD will bring a severe plague on your livestock in the field—on your horses, donkeys, camels, herds, and flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_4","003_9_4","EXO","9","4","4","But the LORD will make a distinction between the livestock of Israel and the livestock of Egypt, so that no animal belonging to the Israelites will die.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_5","003_9_5","EXO","9","5","5","The LORD set a time, saying, “Tomorrow the LORD will do this in the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_6","003_9_6","EXO","9","6","6","And the next day the LORD did just that. All the livestock of the Egyptians died, but not one animal belonging to the Israelites died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_7","003_9_7","EXO","9","7","7","Pharaoh sent officials and found that none of the livestock of the Israelites had died. But Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he would not let the people go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_8","003_9_8","EXO","9","8","8","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, “Take handfuls of soot from the furnace; in the sight of Pharaoh, Moses is to toss it into the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_9","003_9_9","EXO","9","9","9","It will become fine dust over all the land of Egypt, and festering boils will break out on man and beast throughout the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_10","003_9_10","EXO","9","10","10","So they took soot from the furnace and stood before Pharaoh. Moses tossed it into the air, and festering boils broke out on man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_11","003_9_11","EXO","9","11","11","The magicians could not stand before Moses, because the boils had broken out on them and on all the Egyptians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_12","003_9_12","EXO","9","12","12","But the LORD hardened Pharaoh’s heart, and he would not listen to them, just as the LORD had said to Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_13","003_9_13","EXO","9","13","13","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Get up early in the morning, stand before Pharaoh, and tell him that this is what the LORD, the God of the Hebrews, says: ‘Let My people go, so that they may worship Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_14","003_9_14","EXO","9","14","14","Otherwise, I will send all My plagues against you and your officials and your people, so you may know that there is no one like Me in all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_15","003_9_15","EXO","9","15","15","For by this time I could have stretched out My hand and struck you and your people with a plague to wipe you off the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_16","003_9_16","EXO","9","16","16","But I have raised you up for this very purpose, that I might display My power to you, and that My name might be proclaimed in all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_17","003_9_17","EXO","9","17","17","Still, you lord it over My people and do not allow them to go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_18","003_9_18","EXO","9","18","18","Behold, at this time tomorrow I will rain down the worst hail that has ever fallen on Egypt, from the day it was founded until now. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_19","003_9_19","EXO","9","19","19","So give orders now to shelter your livestock and everything you have in the field. Every man or beast that remains in the field and is not brought inside will die when the hail comes down upon them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_20","003_9_20","EXO","9","20","20","Those among Pharaoh’s officials who feared the word of the LORD hurried to bring their servants and livestock to shelter, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_21","003_9_21","EXO","9","21","21","but those who disregarded the word of the LORD left their servants and livestock in the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_22","003_9_22","EXO","9","22","22","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand toward heaven, so that hail may fall on all the land of Egypt—on man and beast and every plant of the field throughout the land of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_23","003_9_23","EXO","9","23","23","So Moses stretched out his staff toward heaven, and the LORD sent thunder and hail, and lightning struck the earth. So the LORD rained down hail upon the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_24","003_9_24","EXO","9","24","24","The hail fell and the lightning continued flashing through it. The hail was so severe that nothing like it had ever been seen in all the land of Egypt from the time it became a nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_25","003_9_25","EXO","9","25","25","Throughout the land of Egypt, the hail struck down everything in the field, both man and beast; it beat down every plant of the field and stripped every tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_26","003_9_26","EXO","9","26","26","The only place where it did not hail was in the land of Goshen, where the Israelites lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_27","003_9_27","EXO","9","27","27","Then Pharaoh summoned Moses and Aaron. “This time I have sinned,” he said. “The LORD is righteous, and I and my people are wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_28","003_9_28","EXO","9","28","28","Pray to the LORD, for there has been enough of God’s thunder and hail. I will let you go; you do not need to stay any longer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_29","003_9_29","EXO","9","29","29","Moses said to him, “When I have left the city, I will spread out my hands to the LORD. The thunder will cease, and there will be no more hail, so that you may know that the earth is the LORD’s. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_30","003_9_30","EXO","9","30","30","But as for you and your officials, I know that you still do not fear the LORD our God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_31","003_9_31","EXO","9","31","31","(Now the flax and barley were destroyed, since the barley was ripe and the flax was in bloom; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_32","003_9_32","EXO","9","32","32","but the wheat and spelt were not destroyed, because they are late crops.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_33","003_9_33","EXO","9","33","33","Then Moses departed from Pharaoh, went out of the city, and spread out his hands to the LORD. The thunder and hail ceased, and the rain no longer poured down on the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_34","003_9_34","EXO","9","34","34","When Pharaoh saw that the rain and hail and thunder had ceased, he sinned again and hardened his heart—he and his officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX9_35","003_9_35","EXO","9","35","35","So Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he would not let the Israelites go, just as the LORD had said through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_1","003_10_1","EXO","10","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go to Pharaoh, for I have hardened his heart and the hearts of his officials, that I may perform these miraculous signs of Mine among them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_2","003_10_2","EXO","10","2","2","and that you may tell your children and grandchildren how severely I dealt with the Egyptians when I performed miraculous signs among them, so that all of you may know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_3","003_10_3","EXO","10","3","3","So Moses and Aaron went to Pharaoh and told him, “This is what the LORD, the God of the Hebrews, says: ‘How long will you refuse to humble yourself before Me? Let My people go, so that they may worship Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_4","003_10_4","EXO","10","4","4","But if you refuse to let My people go, I will bring locusts into your territory tomorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_5","003_10_5","EXO","10","5","5","They will cover the face of the land so that no one can see it. They will devour whatever is left after the hail and eat every tree that grows in your fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_6","003_10_6","EXO","10","6","6","They will fill your houses and the houses of all your officials and every Egyptian—something neither your fathers nor your grandfathers have seen since the day they came into this land.’” Then Moses turned and left Pharaoh’s presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_7","003_10_7","EXO","10","7","7","Pharaoh’s officials asked him, “How long will this man be a snare to us? Let the people go, so that they may worship the LORD their God. Do you not yet realize that Egypt lies in ruins?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_8","003_10_8","EXO","10","8","8","So Moses and Aaron were brought back to Pharaoh. “Go, worship the LORD your God,” he said. “But who exactly will be going?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_9","003_10_9","EXO","10","9","9","“We will go with our young and old,” Moses replied. “We will go with our sons and daughters, and with our flocks and herds, for we must hold a feast to the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_10","003_10_10","EXO","10","10","10","Then Pharaoh told them, “May the LORD be with you if I ever let you go with your little ones. Clearly you are bent on evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_11","003_10_11","EXO","10","11","11","No, only the men may go and worship the LORD, since that is what you have been requesting.” And Moses and Aaron were driven from Pharaoh’s presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_12","003_10_12","EXO","10","12","12","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand over the land of Egypt, so that the locusts may swarm over it and devour every plant in the land—everything that the hail has left behind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_13","003_10_13","EXO","10","13","13","So Moses stretched out his staff over the land of Egypt, and throughout that day and night the LORD sent an east wind across the land. By morning the east wind had brought the locusts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_14","003_10_14","EXO","10","14","14","The locusts swarmed across the land and settled over the entire territory of Egypt. Never before had there been so many locusts, and never again will there be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_15","003_10_15","EXO","10","15","15","They covered the face of all the land until it was black, and they consumed all the plants on the ground and all the fruit on the trees that the hail had left behind. Nothing green was left on any tree or plant in all the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_16","003_10_16","EXO","10","16","16","Pharaoh quickly summoned Moses and Aaron and said, “I have sinned against the LORD your God and against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_17","003_10_17","EXO","10","17","17","Now please forgive my sin once more and appeal to the LORD your God, that He may remove this death from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_18","003_10_18","EXO","10","18","18","So Moses left Pharaoh’s presence and appealed to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_19","003_10_19","EXO","10","19","19","And the LORD changed the wind to a very strong west wind that carried off the locusts and blew them into the Red Sea. Not a single locust remained anywhere in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_20","003_10_20","EXO","10","20","20","But the LORD hardened Pharaoh’s heart, and he would not let the Israelites go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_21","003_10_21","EXO","10","21","21","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand toward heaven, so that darkness may spread over the land of Egypt—a palpable darkness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_22","003_10_22","EXO","10","22","22","So Moses stretched out his hand toward heaven, and total darkness covered all the land of Egypt for three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_23","003_10_23","EXO","10","23","23","No one could see anyone else, and for three days no one left his place. Yet all the Israelites had light in their dwellings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_24","003_10_24","EXO","10","24","24","Then Pharaoh summoned Moses and said, “Go, worship the LORD. Even your little ones may go with you; only your flocks and herds must stay behind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_25","003_10_25","EXO","10","25","25","But Moses replied, “You must also provide us with sacrifices and burnt offerings to present to the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_26","003_10_26","EXO","10","26","26","Even our livestock must go with us; not a hoof will be left behind, for we will need some of them to worship the LORD our God, and we will not know how we are to worship the LORD until we arrive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_27","003_10_27","EXO","10","27","27","But the LORD hardened Pharaoh’s heart, and he was unwilling to let them go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_28","003_10_28","EXO","10","28","28","“Depart from me!” Pharaoh said to Moses. “Make sure you never see my face again, for on the day you see my face, you will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX10_29","003_10_29","EXO","10","29","29","“As you say,” Moses replied, “I will never see your face again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_1","003_11_1","EXO","11","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “I will bring upon Pharaoh and Egypt one more plague. After that, he will allow you to leave this place. And when he lets you go, he will drive you out completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_2","003_11_2","EXO","11","2","2","Now announce to the people that men and women alike should ask their neighbors for articles of silver and gold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_3","003_11_3","EXO","11","3","3","And the LORD gave the people favor in the sight of the Egyptians. Moreover, Moses himself was highly regarded in Egypt by Pharaoh’s officials and by the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_4","003_11_4","EXO","11","4","4","So Moses declared, “This is what the LORD says: ‘About midnight I will go throughout Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_5","003_11_5","EXO","11","5","5","and every firstborn son in the land of Egypt will die, from the firstborn of Pharaoh who sits on his throne, to the firstborn of the servant girl behind the hand mill, as well as the firstborn of all the cattle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_6","003_11_6","EXO","11","6","6","Then a great cry will go out over all the land of Egypt. Such an outcry has never been heard before and will never be heard again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_7","003_11_7","EXO","11","7","7","But among all the Israelites, not even a dog will snarl at man or beast.’ Then you will know that the LORD makes a distinction between Egypt and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_8","003_11_8","EXO","11","8","8","And all these officials of yours will come and bow before me, saying, ‘Go, you and all the people who follow you!’ After that, I will depart.” And hot with anger, Moses left Pharaoh’s presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_9","003_11_9","EXO","11","9","9","The LORD said to Moses, “Pharaoh will not listen to you, so that My wonders may be multiplied in the land of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX11_10","003_11_10","EXO","11","10","10","Moses and Aaron did all these wonders before Pharaoh, but the LORD hardened Pharaoh’s heart so that he would not let the Israelites go out of his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_1","003_12_1","EXO","12","1","1","Now the LORD said to Moses and Aaron in the land of Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_2","003_12_2","EXO","12","2","2","“This month is the beginning of months for you; it shall be the first month of your year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_3","003_12_3","EXO","12","3","3","Tell the whole congregation of Israel that on the tenth day of this month each man must select a lamb for his family, one per household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_4","003_12_4","EXO","12","4","4","If the household is too small for a whole lamb, they are to share with the nearest neighbor based on the number of people, and apportion the lamb accordingly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_5","003_12_5","EXO","12","5","5","Your lamb must be an unblemished year-old male, and you may take it from the sheep or the goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_6","003_12_6","EXO","12","6","6","You must keep it until the fourteenth day of the month, when the whole assembly of the congregation of Israel will slaughter the animals at twilight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_7","003_12_7","EXO","12","7","7","They are to take some of the blood and put it on the sides and tops of the doorframes of the houses where they eat the lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_8","003_12_8","EXO","12","8","8","They are to eat the meat that night, roasted over the fire, along with unleavened bread and bitter herbs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_9","003_12_9","EXO","12","9","9","Do not eat any of the meat raw or cooked in boiling water, but only roasted over the fire—its head and legs and inner parts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_10","003_12_10","EXO","12","10","10","Do not leave any of it until morning; before the morning you must burn up any part that is left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_11","003_12_11","EXO","12","11","11","This is how you are to eat it: You must be fully dressed for travel, with your sandals on your feet and your staff in your hand. You are to eat in haste; it is the LORD’s Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_12","003_12_12","EXO","12","12","12","On that night I will pass through the land of Egypt and strike down every firstborn male, both man and beast, and I will execute judgment against all the gods of Egypt. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_13","003_12_13","EXO","12","13","13","The blood on the houses where you are staying will be a sign; when I see the blood, I will pass over you. No plague will fall on you to destroy you when I strike the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_14","003_12_14","EXO","12","14","14","And this day will be a memorial for you, and you are to celebrate it as a feast to the LORD, as a permanent statute for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_15","003_12_15","EXO","12","15","15","For seven days you must eat unleavened bread. On the first day you are to remove the leaven from your houses. Whoever eats anything leavened from the first day through the seventh must be cut off from Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_16","003_12_16","EXO","12","16","16","On the first day you are to hold a sacred assembly, and another on the seventh day. You must not do any work on those days, except to prepare the meals—that is all you may do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_17","003_12_17","EXO","12","17","17","So you are to keep the Feast of Unleavened Bread, for on this very day I brought your divisions out of the land of Egypt. You must keep this day as a permanent statute for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_18","003_12_18","EXO","12","18","18","In the first month you are to eat unleavened bread, from the evening of the fourteenth day until the evening of the twenty-first day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_19","003_12_19","EXO","12","19","19","For seven days there must be no leaven found in your houses. If anyone eats something leavened, that person, whether a foreigner or native of the land, must be cut off from the congregation of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_20","003_12_20","EXO","12","20","20","You are not to eat anything leavened; eat unleavened bread in all your homes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_21","003_12_21","EXO","12","21","21","Then Moses summoned all the elders of Israel and told them, “Go at once and select for yourselves a lamb for each family, and slaughter the Passover lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_22","003_12_22","EXO","12","22","22","Take a cluster of hyssop, dip it into the blood in the basin, and brush the blood on the top and sides of the doorframe. None of you shall go out the door of his house until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_23","003_12_23","EXO","12","23","23","When the LORD passes through to strike down the Egyptians, He will see the blood on the top and sides of the doorframe and will pass over that doorway; so He will not allow the destroyer to enter your houses and strike you down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_24","003_12_24","EXO","12","24","24","And you are to keep this command as a permanent statute for you and your descendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_25","003_12_25","EXO","12","25","25","When you enter the land that the LORD will give you as He promised, you are to keep this service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_26","003_12_26","EXO","12","26","26","When your children ask you, ‘What does this service mean to you?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_27","003_12_27","EXO","12","27","27","you are to reply, ‘It is the Passover sacrifice to the LORD, who passed over the houses of the Israelites in Egypt when He struck down the Egyptians and spared our homes.’” Then the people bowed down and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_28","003_12_28","EXO","12","28","28","And the Israelites went and did just what the LORD had commanded Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_29","003_12_29","EXO","12","29","29","Now at midnight the LORD struck down every firstborn male in the land of Egypt, from the firstborn of Pharaoh, who sat on his throne, to the firstborn of the prisoner in the dungeon, as well as all the firstborn among the livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_30","003_12_30","EXO","12","30","30","During the night Pharaoh got up—he and all his officials and all the Egyptians—and there was loud wailing in Egypt; for there was no house without someone dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_31","003_12_31","EXO","12","31","31","Then Pharaoh summoned Moses and Aaron by night and said, “Get up, leave my people, both you and the Israelites! Go, worship the LORD as you have requested. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_32","003_12_32","EXO","12","32","32","Take your flocks and herds as well, just as you have said, and depart! And bless me also.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_33","003_12_33","EXO","12","33","33","And in order to send them out of the land quickly, the Egyptians urged the people on. “For otherwise,” they said, “we are all going to die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_34","003_12_34","EXO","12","34","34","So the people took their dough before it was leavened, carrying it on their shoulders in kneading bowls wrapped in clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_35","003_12_35","EXO","12","35","35","Furthermore, the Israelites acted on Moses’ word and asked the Egyptians for articles of silver and gold, and for clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_36","003_12_36","EXO","12","36","36","And the LORD gave the people such favor in the sight of the Egyptians that they granted their request. In this way they plundered the Egyptians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_37","003_12_37","EXO","12","37","37","The Israelites journeyed from Rameses to Succoth with about 600,000 men on foot, besides women and children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_38","003_12_38","EXO","12","38","38","And a mixed multitude also went up with them, along with great droves of livestock, both flocks and herds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_39","003_12_39","EXO","12","39","39","Since their dough had no leaven, the people baked what they had brought out of Egypt into unleavened loaves. For when they had been driven out of Egypt, they could not delay and had not prepared any provisions for themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_40","003_12_40","EXO","12","40","40","Now the duration of the Israelites’ stay in Egypt was 430 years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_41","003_12_41","EXO","12","41","41","At the end of the 430 years, to the very day, all the LORD’s divisions went out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_42","003_12_42","EXO","12","42","42","Because the LORD kept a vigil that night to bring them out of the land of Egypt, this same night is to be a vigil to the LORD, to be observed by all the Israelites for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_43","003_12_43","EXO","12","43","43","And the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, “This is the statute of the Passover: No foreigner is to eat of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_44","003_12_44","EXO","12","44","44","But any slave who has been purchased may eat of it, after you have circumcised him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_45","003_12_45","EXO","12","45","45","A temporary resident or hired hand shall not eat the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_46","003_12_46","EXO","12","46","46","It must be eaten inside one house. You are not to take any of the meat outside the house, and you may not break any of the bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_47","003_12_47","EXO","12","47","47","The whole congregation of Israel must celebrate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_48","003_12_48","EXO","12","48","48","If a foreigner resides with you and wants to celebrate the LORD’s Passover, all the males in the household must be circumcised; then he may come near to celebrate it, and he shall be like a native of the land. But no uncircumcised man may eat of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_49","003_12_49","EXO","12","49","49","The same law shall apply to both the native and the foreigner who resides among you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_50","003_12_50","EXO","12","50","50","Then all the Israelites did this—they did just as the LORD had commanded Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX12_51","003_12_51","EXO","12","51","51","And on that very day the LORD brought the Israelites out of the land of Egypt by their divisions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_1","003_13_1","EXO","13","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_2","003_13_2","EXO","13","2","2","“Consecrate to Me every firstborn male. The firstborn from every womb among the Israelites belongs to Me, both of man and beast.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_3","003_13_3","EXO","13","3","3","So Moses told the people, “Remember this day, the day you came out of Egypt, out of the house of slavery; for the LORD brought you out of it by the strength of His hand. And nothing leavened shall be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_4","003_13_4","EXO","13","4","4","Today, in the month of Abib, you are leaving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_5","003_13_5","EXO","13","5","5","And when the LORD brings you into the land of the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Hivites, and Jebusites—the land He swore to your fathers that He would give you, a land flowing with milk and honey—you shall keep this service in this month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_6","003_13_6","EXO","13","6","6","For seven days you are to eat unleavened bread, and on the seventh day there shall be a feast to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_7","003_13_7","EXO","13","7","7","Unleavened bread shall be eaten during those seven days. Nothing leavened may be found among you, nor shall leaven be found anywhere within your borders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_8","003_13_8","EXO","13","8","8","And on that day you are to explain to your son, ‘This is because of what the LORD did for me when I came out of Egypt.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_9","003_13_9","EXO","13","9","9","It shall be a sign for you on your hand and a reminder on your forehead that the Law of the LORD is to be on your lips. For with a mighty hand the LORD brought you out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_10","003_13_10","EXO","13","10","10","Therefore you shall keep this statute at the appointed time year after year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_11","003_13_11","EXO","13","11","11","And after the LORD brings you into the land of the Canaanites and gives it to you, as He swore to you and your fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_12","003_13_12","EXO","13","12","12","you are to present to the LORD the firstborn male of every womb. All the firstborn males of your livestock belong to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_13","003_13_13","EXO","13","13","13","You must redeem every firstborn donkey with a lamb, and if you do not redeem it, you are to break its neck. And every firstborn of your sons you must redeem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_14","003_13_14","EXO","13","14","14","In the future, when your son asks you, ‘What does this mean?’ you are to tell him, ‘With a mighty hand the LORD brought us out of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_15","003_13_15","EXO","13","15","15","And when Pharaoh stubbornly refused to let us go, the LORD killed every firstborn in the land of Egypt, both of man and beast. This is why I sacrifice to the LORD the firstborn male of every womb, but I redeem all the firstborn of my sons.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_16","003_13_16","EXO","13","16","16","So it shall serve as a sign on your hand and a symbol on your forehead, for with a mighty hand the LORD brought us out of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_17","003_13_17","EXO","13","17","17","When Pharaoh let the people go, God did not lead them along the road through the land of the Philistines, though it was shorter. For God said, “If the people face war, they might change their minds and return to Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_18","003_13_18","EXO","13","18","18","So God led the people around by the way of the wilderness toward the Red Sea. And the Israelites left the land of Egypt arrayed for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_19","003_13_19","EXO","13","19","19","Moses took the bones of Joseph with him because Joseph had made the sons of Israel swear a solemn oath when he said, “God will surely attend to you, and then you must carry my bones with you from this place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_20","003_13_20","EXO","13","20","20","They set out from Succoth and camped at Etham on the edge of the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_21","003_13_21","EXO","13","21","21","And the LORD went before them in a pillar of cloud to guide their way by day, and in a pillar of fire to give them light by night, so that they could travel by day or night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX13_22","003_13_22","EXO","13","22","22","Neither the pillar of cloud by day nor the pillar of fire by night left its place before the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_1","003_14_1","EXO","14","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_2","003_14_2","EXO","14","2","2","“Tell the Israelites to turn back and encamp before Pi-hahiroth, between Migdol and the sea. You are to encamp by the sea, directly opposite Baal-zephon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_3","003_14_3","EXO","14","3","3","For Pharaoh will say of the Israelites, ‘They are wandering the land in confusion; the wilderness has boxed them in.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_4","003_14_4","EXO","14","4","4","And I will harden Pharaoh’s heart so that he will pursue them. But I will gain honor by means of Pharaoh and all his army, and the Egyptians will know that I am the LORD.” So this is what the Israelites did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_5","003_14_5","EXO","14","5","5","When the king of Egypt was told that the people had fled, Pharaoh and his officials changed their minds about them and said, “What have we done? We have released Israel from serving us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_6","003_14_6","EXO","14","6","6","So Pharaoh prepared his chariot and took his army with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_7","003_14_7","EXO","14","7","7","He took 600 of the best chariots, and all the other chariots of Egypt, with officers over all of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_8","003_14_8","EXO","14","8","8","And the LORD hardened the heart of Pharaoh king of Egypt so that he pursued the Israelites, who were marching out defiantly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_9","003_14_9","EXO","14","9","9","The Egyptians—all Pharaoh’s horses and chariots, horsemen and troops—pursued the Israelites and overtook them as they camped by the sea near Pi-hahiroth, opposite Baal-zephon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_10","003_14_10","EXO","14","10","10","As Pharaoh approached, the Israelites looked up and saw the Egyptians marching after them, and they were terrified and cried out to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_11","003_14_11","EXO","14","11","11","They said to Moses, “Was it because there were no graves in Egypt that you brought us into the wilderness to die? What have you done to us by bringing us out of Egypt? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_12","003_14_12","EXO","14","12","12","Did we not say to you in Egypt, ‘Leave us alone so that we may serve the Egyptians’? For it would have been better for us to serve the Egyptians than to die in the wilderness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_13","003_14_13","EXO","14","13","13","But Moses told the people, “Do not be afraid. Stand firm and you will see the LORD’s salvation, which He will accomplish for you today; for the Egyptians you see today, you will never see again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_14","003_14_14","EXO","14","14","14","The LORD will fight for you; you need only to be still.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_15","003_14_15","EXO","14","15","15","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Why are you crying out to Me? Tell the Israelites to go forward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_16","003_14_16","EXO","14","16","16","And as for you, lift up your staff and stretch out your hand over the sea and divide it, so that the Israelites can go through the sea on dry ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_17","003_14_17","EXO","14","17","17","And I will harden the hearts of the Egyptians so that they will go in after them. Then I will gain honor by means of Pharaoh and all his army and chariots and horsemen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_18","003_14_18","EXO","14","18","18","The Egyptians will know that I am the LORD when I am honored through Pharaoh, his chariots, and his horsemen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_19","003_14_19","EXO","14","19","19","And the angel of God, who had gone before the camp of Israel, withdrew and went behind them. The pillar of cloud also moved from before them and stood behind them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_20","003_14_20","EXO","14","20","20","so that it came between the camps of Egypt and Israel. The cloud was there in the darkness, but it lit up the night. So all night long neither camp went near the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_21","003_14_21","EXO","14","21","21","Then Moses stretched out his hand over the sea, and all that night the LORD drove back the sea with a strong east wind that turned it into dry land. So the waters were divided, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_22","003_14_22","EXO","14","22","22","and the Israelites went through the sea on dry ground, with walls of water on their right and on their left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_23","003_14_23","EXO","14","23","23","And the Egyptians chased after them—all Pharaoh’s horses, chariots, and horsemen—and followed them into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_24","003_14_24","EXO","14","24","24","At morning watch, however, the LORD looked down on the army of the Egyptians from the pillar of fire and cloud, and He threw their camp into confusion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_25","003_14_25","EXO","14","25","25","He caused their chariot wheels to wobble, so that they had difficulty driving. “Let us flee from the Israelites,” said the Egyptians, “for the LORD is fighting for them against Egypt!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_26","003_14_26","EXO","14","26","26","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand over the sea, so that the waters may flow back over the Egyptians and their chariots and horsemen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_27","003_14_27","EXO","14","27","27","So Moses stretched out his hand over the sea, and at daybreak the sea returned to its normal state. As the Egyptians were retreating, the LORD swept them into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_28","003_14_28","EXO","14","28","28","The waters flowed back and covered the chariots and horsemen—the entire army of Pharaoh that had chased the Israelites into the sea. Not one of them survived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_29","003_14_29","EXO","14","29","29","But the Israelites had walked through the sea on dry ground, with walls of water on their right and on their left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_30","003_14_30","EXO","14","30","30","That day the LORD saved Israel from the hand of the Egyptians, and Israel saw the Egyptians dead on the shore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX14_31","003_14_31","EXO","14","31","31","When Israel saw the great power that the LORD had exercised over the Egyptians, the people feared the LORD and believed in Him and in His servant Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_1","003_15_1","EXO","15","1","1","Then Moses and the Israelites sang this song to the LORD: “I will sing to the LORD, for He is highly exalted. The horse and rider He has thrown into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_2","003_15_2","EXO","15","2","2","The LORD is my strength and my song, and He has become my salvation. He is my God, and I will praise Him, my father’s God, and I will exalt Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_3","003_15_3","EXO","15","3","3","The LORD is a warrior, the LORD is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_4","003_15_4","EXO","15","4","4","Pharaoh’s chariots and army He has cast into the sea; the finest of his officers are drowned in the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_5","003_15_5","EXO","15","5","5","The depths have covered them; they sank there like a stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_6","003_15_6","EXO","15","6","6","Your right hand, O LORD, is majestic in power; Your right hand, O LORD, has shattered the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_7","003_15_7","EXO","15","7","7","You overthrew Your adversaries by Your great majesty. You unleashed Your burning wrath; it consumed them like stubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_8","003_15_8","EXO","15","8","8","At the blast of Your nostrils the waters piled up; like a wall the currents stood firm; the depths congealed in the heart of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_9","003_15_9","EXO","15","9","9","The enemy declared, ‘I will pursue, I will overtake. I will divide the spoils; I will gorge myself on them. I will draw my sword; my hand will destroy them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_10","003_15_10","EXO","15","10","10","But You blew with Your breath, and the sea covered them. They sank like lead in the mighty waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_11","003_15_11","EXO","15","11","11","Who among the gods is like You, O LORD? Who is like You—majestic in holiness, revered with praises, performing wonders? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_12","003_15_12","EXO","15","12","12","You stretched out Your right hand, and the earth swallowed them up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_13","003_15_13","EXO","15","13","13","With loving devotion You will lead the people You have redeemed; with Your strength You will guide them to Your holy dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_14","003_15_14","EXO","15","14","14","The nations will hear and tremble; anguish will grip the dwellers of Philistia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_15","003_15_15","EXO","15","15","15","Then the chiefs of Edom will be dismayed; trembling will seize the leaders of Moab; those who dwell in Canaan will melt away, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_16","003_15_16","EXO","15","16","16","and terror and dread will fall on them. By the power of Your arm they will be as still as a stone until Your people pass by, O LORD, until the people You have bought pass by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_17","003_15_17","EXO","15","17","17","You will bring them in and plant them on the mountain of Your inheritance—the place, O LORD, You have prepared for Your dwelling, the sanctuary, O Lord, Your hands have established. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_18","003_15_18","EXO","15","18","18","The LORD will reign forever and ever!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_19","003_15_19","EXO","15","19","19","For when Pharaoh’s horses, chariots, and horsemen went into the sea, the LORD brought the waters of the sea back over them. But the Israelites walked through the sea on dry ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_20","003_15_20","EXO","15","20","20","Then Miriam the prophetess, Aaron’s sister, took a tambourine in her hand, and all the women followed her with tambourines and dancing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_21","003_15_21","EXO","15","21","21","And Miriam sang back to them: “Sing to the LORD, for He is highly exalted; the horse and rider He has thrown into the sea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_22","003_15_22","EXO","15","22","22","Then Moses led Israel from the Red Sea, and they went out into the Desert of Shur. For three days they walked in the desert without finding water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_23","003_15_23","EXO","15","23","23","And when they came to Marah, they could not drink the water there because it was bitter. (That is why it was named Marah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_24","003_15_24","EXO","15","24","24","So the people grumbled against Moses, saying, “What are we to drink?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_25","003_15_25","EXO","15","25","25","And Moses cried out to the LORD, and the LORD showed him a log. And when he cast it into the waters, they were sweetened. There the LORD made for them a statute and an ordinance, and there He tested them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_26","003_15_26","EXO","15","26","26","saying, “If you will listen carefully to the voice of the LORD your God, and do what is right in His eyes, and pay attention to His commands, and keep all His statutes, then I will not bring on you any of the diseases I inflicted on the Egyptians. For I am the LORD who heals you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX15_27","003_15_27","EXO","15","27","27","Then they came to Elim, where there were twelve springs of water and seventy palm trees, and they camped there by the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_1","003_16_1","EXO","16","1","1","On the fifteenth day of the second month after they had left the land of Egypt, the whole congregation of Israel set out from Elim and came to the Desert of Sin, which is between Elim and Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_2","003_16_2","EXO","16","2","2","And there in the desert the whole congregation of Israel grumbled against Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_3","003_16_3","EXO","16","3","3","“If only we had died by the LORD’s hand in the land of Egypt!” they said. “There we sat by pots of meat and ate our fill of bread, but you have brought us into this desert to starve this whole assembly to death!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_4","003_16_4","EXO","16","4","4","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Behold, I will rain down bread from heaven for you. Each day the people are to go out and gather enough for that day. In this way I will test whether or not they will follow My instructions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_5","003_16_5","EXO","16","5","5","Then on the sixth day, when they prepare what they bring in, it will be twice as much as they gather on the other days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_6","003_16_6","EXO","16","6","6","So Moses and Aaron said to all the Israelites, “This evening you will know that it was the LORD who brought you out of the land of Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_7","003_16_7","EXO","16","7","7","and in the morning you will see the LORD’s glory, because He has heard your grumbling against Him. For who are we, that you should grumble against us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_8","003_16_8","EXO","16","8","8","And Moses added, “The LORD will give you meat to eat this evening and bread to fill you in the morning, for He has heard your grumbling against Him. Who are we? Your grumblings are not against us but against the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_9","003_16_9","EXO","16","9","9","Then Moses said to Aaron, “Tell the whole congregation of Israel, ‘Come before the LORD, for He has heard your grumbling.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_10","003_16_10","EXO","16","10","10","And as Aaron was speaking to the whole congregation of Israel, they looked toward the desert, and there in a cloud the glory of the LORD appeared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_11","003_16_11","EXO","16","11","11","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_12","003_16_12","EXO","16","12","12","“I have heard the grumbling of the Israelites. Tell them, ‘At twilight you will eat meat, and in the morning you will be filled with bread. Then you will know that I am the LORD your God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_13","003_16_13","EXO","16","13","13","That evening quail came and covered the camp, and in the morning there was a layer of dew around the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_14","003_16_14","EXO","16","14","14","When the layer of dew had evaporated, there were thin flakes on the desert floor, as fine as frost on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_15","003_16_15","EXO","16","15","15","When the Israelites saw it, they asked one another, “What is it?” For they did not know what it was. So Moses told them, “It is the bread that the LORD has given you to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_16","003_16_16","EXO","16","16","16","This is what the LORD has commanded: ‘Each one is to gather as much as he needs. You may take an omer for each person in your tent.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_17","003_16_17","EXO","16","17","17","So the Israelites did this. Some gathered more, and some less. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_18","003_16_18","EXO","16","18","18","When they measured it by the omer, he who gathered much had no excess, and he who gathered little had no shortfall. Each one gathered as much as he needed to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_19","003_16_19","EXO","16","19","19","Then Moses said to them, “No one may keep any of it until morning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_20","003_16_20","EXO","16","20","20","But they did not listen to Moses; some people left part of it until morning, and it became infested with maggots and began to smell. So Moses was angry with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_21","003_16_21","EXO","16","21","21","Every morning each one gathered as much as was needed, and when the sun grew hot, it melted away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_22","003_16_22","EXO","16","22","22","On the sixth day, they gathered twice as much food—two omers per person—and all the leaders of the congregation came and reported this to Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_23","003_16_23","EXO","16","23","23","He told them, “This is what the LORD has said: ‘Tomorrow is to be a day of complete rest, a holy Sabbath to the LORD. So bake what you want to bake, and boil what you want to boil. Then set aside whatever remains and keep it until morning.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_24","003_16_24","EXO","16","24","24","So they set it aside until morning as Moses had commanded, and it did not smell or contain any maggots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_25","003_16_25","EXO","16","25","25","“Eat it today,” Moses said, “because today is a Sabbath to the LORD. Today you will not find anything in the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_26","003_16_26","EXO","16","26","26","For six days you may gather, but on the seventh day, the Sabbath, it will not be there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_27","003_16_27","EXO","16","27","27","Yet on the seventh day some of the people went out to gather, but they did not find anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_28","003_16_28","EXO","16","28","28","Then the LORD said to Moses, “How long will you refuse to keep My commandments and instructions? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_29","003_16_29","EXO","16","29","29","Understand that the LORD has given you the Sabbath; that is why on the sixth day He will give you bread for two days. On the seventh day, everyone must stay where he is; no one may leave his place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_30","003_16_30","EXO","16","30","30","So the people rested on the seventh day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_31","003_16_31","EXO","16","31","31","Now the house of Israel called the bread manna. It was white like coriander seed and tasted like wafers made with honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_32","003_16_32","EXO","16","32","32","Moses said, “This is what the LORD has commanded: ‘Keep an omer of manna for the generations to come, so that they may see the bread I fed you in the wilderness when I brought you out of the land of Egypt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_33","003_16_33","EXO","16","33","33","So Moses told Aaron, “Take a jar and fill it with an omer of manna. Then place it before the LORD to be preserved for the generations to come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_34","003_16_34","EXO","16","34","34","And Aaron placed it in front of the Testimony, to be preserved just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_35","003_16_35","EXO","16","35","35","The Israelites ate manna forty years, until they came to a land where they could settle; they ate manna until they reached the border of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX16_36","003_16_36","EXO","16","36","36","(Now an omer is a tenth of an ephah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_1","003_17_1","EXO","17","1","1","Then the whole congregation of Israel left the Desert of Sin, moving from place to place as the LORD commanded. They camped at Rephidim, but there was no water for the people to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_2","003_17_2","EXO","17","2","2","So the people contended with Moses, “Give us water to drink.” “Why do you contend with me?” Moses replied. “Why do you test the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_3","003_17_3","EXO","17","3","3","But the people thirsted for water there, and they grumbled against Moses: “Why have you brought us out of Egypt—to make us and our children and livestock die of thirst?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_4","003_17_4","EXO","17","4","4","Then Moses cried out to the LORD, “What should I do with these people? A little more and they will stone me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_5","003_17_5","EXO","17","5","5","And the LORD said to Moses, “Walk on ahead of the people and take some of the elders of Israel with you. Take along in your hand the staff with which you struck the Nile, and go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_6","003_17_6","EXO","17","6","6","Behold, I will stand there before you by the rock at Horeb. And when you strike the rock, water will come out of it for the people to drink.” So Moses did this in the sight of the elders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_7","003_17_7","EXO","17","7","7","He named the place Massah and Meribah because the Israelites quarreled, and because they tested the LORD, saying, “Is the LORD among us or not?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_8","003_17_8","EXO","17","8","8","After this, the Amalekites came and attacked the Israelites at Rephidim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_9","003_17_9","EXO","17","9","9","So Moses said to Joshua, “Choose some of our men and go out to fight the Amalekites. Tomorrow I will stand on the hilltop with the staff of God in my hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_10","003_17_10","EXO","17","10","10","Joshua did as Moses had instructed him and fought against the Amalekites, while Moses, Aaron, and Hur went up to the top of the hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_11","003_17_11","EXO","17","11","11","As long as Moses held up his hands, Israel prevailed; but when he lowered them, Amalek prevailed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_12","003_17_12","EXO","17","12","12","When Moses’ hands grew heavy, they took a stone and put it under him, and he sat on it. Then Aaron and Hur held his hands up, one on each side, so that his hands remained steady until the sun went down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_13","003_17_13","EXO","17","13","13","So Joshua overwhelmed Amalek and his army with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_14","003_17_14","EXO","17","14","14","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Write this on a scroll as a reminder and recite it to Joshua, because I will utterly blot out the memory of Amalek from under heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_15","003_17_15","EXO","17","15","15","And Moses built an altar and named it The LORD Is My Banner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX17_16","003_17_16","EXO","17","16","16","“Indeed,” he said, “a hand was lifted up toward the throne of the LORD. The LORD will war against Amalek from generation to generation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_1","003_18_1","EXO","18","1","1","Now Moses’ father-in-law Jethro, the priest of Midian, heard about all that God had done for Moses and His people Israel, and how the LORD had brought Israel out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_2","003_18_2","EXO","18","2","2","After Moses had sent back his wife Zipporah, his father-in-law Jethro had received her, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_3","003_18_3","EXO","18","3","3","along with her two sons. One son was named Gershom, for Moses had said, “I have been a foreigner in a foreign land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_4","003_18_4","EXO","18","4","4","The other son was named Eliezer, for Moses had said, “The God of my father was my helper and delivered me from the sword of Pharaoh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_5","003_18_5","EXO","18","5","5","Moses’ father-in-law Jethro, along with Moses’ wife and sons, came to him in the desert, where he was encamped at the mountain of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_6","003_18_6","EXO","18","6","6","He sent word to Moses, “I, your father-in-law Jethro, am coming to you with your wife and her two sons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_7","003_18_7","EXO","18","7","7","So Moses went out to meet his father-in-law and bowed down and kissed him. They greeted each other and went into the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_8","003_18_8","EXO","18","8","8","Then Moses recounted to his father-in-law all that the LORD had done to Pharaoh and the Egyptians for Israel’s sake, all the hardships they had encountered along the way, and how the LORD had delivered them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_9","003_18_9","EXO","18","9","9","And Jethro rejoiced over all the good things the LORD had done for Israel, whom He had rescued from the hand of the Egyptians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_10","003_18_10","EXO","18","10","10","Jethro declared, “Blessed be the LORD, who has delivered you from the hand of the Egyptians and of Pharaoh, and who has delivered the people from the hand of the Egyptians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_11","003_18_11","EXO","18","11","11","Now I know that the LORD is greater than all other gods, for He did this when they treated Israel with arrogance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_12","003_18_12","EXO","18","12","12","Then Moses’ father-in-law Jethro brought a burnt offering and sacrifices to God, and Aaron came with all the elders of Israel to eat bread with Moses’ father-in-law in the presence of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_13","003_18_13","EXO","18","13","13","The next day Moses took his seat to judge the people, and they stood around him from morning until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_14","003_18_14","EXO","18","14","14","When his father-in-law saw all that Moses was doing for the people, he asked, “What is this that you are doing for the people? Why do you sit alone as judge, with all the people standing around you from morning till evening?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_15","003_18_15","EXO","18","15","15","“Because the people come to me to inquire of God,” Moses replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_16","003_18_16","EXO","18","16","16","“Whenever they have a dispute, it is brought to me to judge between one man and another, and I make known to them the statutes and laws of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_17","003_18_17","EXO","18","17","17","But Moses’ father-in-law said to him, “What you are doing is not good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_18","003_18_18","EXO","18","18","18","Surely you and these people with you will wear yourselves out, because the task is too heavy for you. You cannot handle it alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_19","003_18_19","EXO","18","19","19","Now listen to me; I will give you some advice, and may God be with you. You must be the people’s representative before God and bring their causes to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_20","003_18_20","EXO","18","20","20","Teach them the statutes and laws, and show them the way to live and the work they must do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_21","003_18_21","EXO","18","21","21","Furthermore, select capable men from among the people—God-fearing, trustworthy men who are averse to dishonest gain. Appoint them over the people as leaders of thousands, of hundreds, of fifties, and of tens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_22","003_18_22","EXO","18","22","22","Have these men judge the people at all times. Then they can bring you any major issue, but all minor cases they can judge on their own, so that your load may be lightened as they share it with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_23","003_18_23","EXO","18","23","23","If you follow this advice and God so directs you, then you will be able to endure, and all these people can go home in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_24","003_18_24","EXO","18","24","24","Moses listened to his father-in-law and did everything he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_25","003_18_25","EXO","18","25","25","So Moses chose capable men from all Israel and made them heads over the people as leaders of thousands, of hundreds, of fifties, and of tens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_26","003_18_26","EXO","18","26","26","And they judged the people at all times; they would bring the difficult cases to Moses, but any minor issue they would judge themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX18_27","003_18_27","EXO","18","27","27","Then Moses sent his father-in-law on his way, and Jethro returned to his own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_1","003_19_1","EXO","19","1","1","In the third month, on the same day of the month that the Israelites had left the land of Egypt, they came to the Wilderness of Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_2","003_19_2","EXO","19","2","2","After they had set out from Rephidim, they entered the Wilderness of Sinai, and Israel camped there in front of the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_3","003_19_3","EXO","19","3","3","Then Moses went up to God, and the LORD called to him from the mountain, “This is what you are to tell the house of Jacob and explain to the sons of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_4","003_19_4","EXO","19","4","4","‘You have seen for yourselves what I did to Egypt, and how I carried you on eagles’ wings and brought you to Myself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_5","003_19_5","EXO","19","5","5","Now if you will indeed obey My voice and keep My covenant, you will be My treasured possession out of all the nations—for the whole earth is Mine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_6","003_19_6","EXO","19","6","6","And unto Me you shall be a kingdom of priests and a holy nation.’ These are the words that you are to speak to the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_7","003_19_7","EXO","19","7","7","So Moses went back and summoned the elders of the people and set before them all these words that the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_8","003_19_8","EXO","19","8","8","And all the people answered together, “We will do everything that the LORD has spoken.” So Moses brought their words back to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_9","003_19_9","EXO","19","9","9","The LORD said to Moses, “Behold, I will come to you in a dense cloud, so that the people will hear when I speak with you, and they will always put their trust in you.” And Moses relayed to the LORD what the people had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_10","003_19_10","EXO","19","10","10","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go to the people and consecrate them today and tomorrow. They must wash their clothes ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_11","003_19_11","EXO","19","11","11","and be prepared by the third day, for on the third day the LORD will come down on Mount Sinai in the sight of all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_12","003_19_12","EXO","19","12","12","And you are to set up a boundary for the people around the mountain and tell them, ‘Be careful not to go up on the mountain or touch its base. Whoever touches the mountain shall surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_13","003_19_13","EXO","19","13","13","No hand shall touch him, but he shall surely be stoned or shot with arrows—whether man or beast, he must not live.’ Only when the ram’s horn sounds a long blast may they approach the mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_14","003_19_14","EXO","19","14","14","When Moses came down from the mountain to the people, he consecrated them, and they washed their clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_15","003_19_15","EXO","19","15","15","“Be prepared for the third day,” he said to the people. “Do not draw near to a woman.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_16","003_19_16","EXO","19","16","16","On the third day, when morning came, there was thunder and lightning. A thick cloud was upon the mountain, and a very loud blast of the ram’s horn went out, so that all the people in the camp trembled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_17","003_19_17","EXO","19","17","17","Then Moses brought the people out of the camp to meet with God, and they stood at the foot of the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_18","003_19_18","EXO","19","18","18","Mount Sinai was completely enveloped in smoke, because the LORD had descended on it in fire. And the smoke rose like the smoke of a furnace, and the whole mountain quaked violently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_19","003_19_19","EXO","19","19","19","And as the sound of the ram’s horn grew louder and louder, Moses spoke and God answered him in the thunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_20","003_19_20","EXO","19","20","20","The LORD descended to the top of Mount Sinai and called Moses to the summit. So Moses went up, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_21","003_19_21","EXO","19","21","21","and the LORD said to him, “Go down and warn the people not to break through to see the LORD, lest many of them perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_22","003_19_22","EXO","19","22","22","Even the priests who approach the LORD must consecrate themselves, or the LORD will break out against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_23","003_19_23","EXO","19","23","23","But Moses said to the LORD, “The people cannot come up Mount Sinai, for You solemnly warned us, ‘Put a boundary around the mountain and set it apart as holy.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_24","003_19_24","EXO","19","24","24","And the LORD replied, “Go down and bring Aaron with you. But the priests and the people must not break through to come up to the LORD, or He will break out against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX19_25","003_19_25","EXO","19","25","25","So Moses went down to the people and spoke to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_1","003_20_1","EXO","20","1","1","And God spoke all these words: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_2","003_20_2","EXO","20","2","2","“I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_3","003_20_3","EXO","20","3","3","You shall have no other gods before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_4","003_20_4","EXO","20","4","4","You shall not make for yourself an idol in the form of anything in the heavens above, on the earth below, or in the waters beneath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_5","003_20_5","EXO","20","5","5","You shall not bow down to them or worship them; for I, the LORD your God, am a jealous God, visiting the iniquity of the fathers on their children to the third and fourth generations of those who hate Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_6","003_20_6","EXO","20","6","6","but showing loving devotion to a thousand generations of those who love Me and keep My commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_7","003_20_7","EXO","20","7","7","You shall not take the name of the LORD your God in vain, for the LORD will not leave anyone unpunished who takes His name in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_8","003_20_8","EXO","20","8","8","Remember the Sabbath day by keeping it holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_9","003_20_9","EXO","20","9","9","Six days you shall labor and do all your work, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_10","003_20_10","EXO","20","10","10","but the seventh day is a Sabbath to the LORD your God, on which you must not do any work—neither you, nor your son or daughter, nor your manservant or maidservant or livestock, nor the foreigner within your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_11","003_20_11","EXO","20","11","11","For in six days the LORD made the heavens and the earth and the sea and all that is in them, but on the seventh day He rested. Therefore the LORD blessed the Sabbath day and set it apart as holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_12","003_20_12","EXO","20","12","12","Honor your father and mother, so that your days may be long in the land that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_13","003_20_13","EXO","20","13","13","You shall not murder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_14","003_20_14","EXO","20","14","14","You shall not commit adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_15","003_20_15","EXO","20","15","15","You shall not steal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_16","003_20_16","EXO","20","16","16","You shall not bear false witness against your neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_17","003_20_17","EXO","20","17","17","You shall not covet your neighbor’s house. You shall not covet your neighbor’s wife, or his manservant or maidservant, or his ox or donkey, or anything that belongs to your neighbor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_18","003_20_18","EXO","20","18","18","When all the people witnessed the thunder and lightning, the sounding of the ram’s horn, and the mountain enveloped in smoke, they trembled and stood at a distance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_19","003_20_19","EXO","20","19","19","“Speak to us yourself and we will listen,” they said to Moses. “But do not let God speak to us, or we will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_20","003_20_20","EXO","20","20","20","“Do not be afraid,” Moses replied. “For God has come to test you, so that the fear of Him may be before you, to keep you from sinning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_21","003_20_21","EXO","20","21","21","And the people stood at a distance as Moses approached the thick darkness where God was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_22","003_20_22","EXO","20","22","22","Then the LORD said to Moses, “This is what you are to tell the Israelites: ‘You have seen for yourselves that I have spoken to you from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_23","003_20_23","EXO","20","23","23","You are not to make any gods alongside Me; you are not to make for yourselves gods of silver or gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_24","003_20_24","EXO","20","24","24","You are to make for Me an altar of earth, and sacrifice on it your burnt offerings and peace offerings, your sheep and goats and cattle. In every place where I cause My name to be remembered, I will come to you and bless you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_25","003_20_25","EXO","20","25","25","Now if you make an altar of stones for Me, you must not build it with stones shaped by tools; for if you use a chisel on it, you will defile it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX20_26","003_20_26","EXO","20","26","26","And you must not go up to My altar on steps, lest your nakedness be exposed on it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_1","003_21_1","EXO","21","1","1","“These are the ordinances that you are to set before them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_2","003_21_2","EXO","21","2","2","If you buy a Hebrew servant, he is to serve you for six years. But in the seventh year, he shall go free without paying anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_3","003_21_3","EXO","21","3","3","If he arrived alone, he is to leave alone; if he arrived with a wife, she is to leave with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_4","003_21_4","EXO","21","4","4","If his master gives him a wife and she bears him sons or daughters, the woman and her children shall belong to her master, and only the man shall go free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_5","003_21_5","EXO","21","5","5","But if the servant declares, ‘I love my master and my wife and children; I do not want to go free,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_6","003_21_6","EXO","21","6","6","then his master is to bring him before the judges. And he shall take him to the door or doorpost and pierce his ear with an awl. Then he shall serve his master for life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_7","003_21_7","EXO","21","7","7","And if a man sells his daughter as a servant, she is not to go free as the menservants do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_8","003_21_8","EXO","21","8","8","If she is displeasing in the eyes of her master who had designated her for himself, he must allow her to be redeemed. He has no right to sell her to foreigners, since he has broken faith with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_9","003_21_9","EXO","21","9","9","And if he chooses her for his son, he must deal with her as with a daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_10","003_21_10","EXO","21","10","10","If he takes another wife, he must not reduce the food, clothing, or marital rights of his first wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_11","003_21_11","EXO","21","11","11","If, however, he does not provide her with these three things, she is free to go without monetary payment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_12","003_21_12","EXO","21","12","12","Whoever strikes and kills a man must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_13","003_21_13","EXO","21","13","13","If, however, he did not lie in wait, but God allowed it to happen, then I will appoint for you a place where he may flee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_14","003_21_14","EXO","21","14","14","But if a man schemes and acts willfully against his neighbor to kill him, you must take him away from My altar to be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_15","003_21_15","EXO","21","15","15","Whoever strikes his father or mother must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_16","003_21_16","EXO","21","16","16","Whoever kidnaps another man must be put to death, whether he sells him or the man is found in his possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_17","003_21_17","EXO","21","17","17","Anyone who curses his father or mother must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_18","003_21_18","EXO","21","18","18","If men are quarreling and one strikes the other with a stone or a fist, and he does not die but is confined to bed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_19","003_21_19","EXO","21","19","19","then the one who struck him shall go unpunished, as long as the other can get up and walk around outside with his staff. Nevertheless, he must compensate the man for his lost work and see that he is completely healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_20","003_21_20","EXO","21","20","20","If a man strikes his manservant or maidservant with a rod, and the servant dies by his hand, he shall surely be punished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_21","003_21_21","EXO","21","21","21","However, if the servant gets up after a day or two, the owner shall not be punished, since the servant is his property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_22","003_21_22","EXO","21","22","22","If men who are fighting strike a pregnant woman and her child is born prematurely, but there is no further injury, he shall surely be fined as the woman’s husband demands and as the court allows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_23","003_21_23","EXO","21","23","23","But if a serious injury results, then you must require a life for a life— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_24","003_21_24","EXO","21","24","24","eye for eye, tooth for tooth, hand for hand, foot for foot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_25","003_21_25","EXO","21","25","25","burn for burn, wound for wound, and stripe for stripe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_26","003_21_26","EXO","21","26","26","If a man strikes and blinds the eye of his manservant or maidservant, he must let the servant go free as compensation for the eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_27","003_21_27","EXO","21","27","27","And if he knocks out the tooth of his manservant or maidservant, he must let the servant go free as compensation for the tooth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_28","003_21_28","EXO","21","28","28","If an ox gores a man or woman to death, the ox must surely be stoned, and its meat must not be eaten. But the owner of the ox shall not be held responsible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_29","003_21_29","EXO","21","29","29","But if the ox has a habit of goring, and its owner has been warned yet does not restrain it, and it kills a man or woman, then the ox must be stoned and its owner must also be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_30","003_21_30","EXO","21","30","30","If payment is demanded of him instead, he may redeem his life by paying the full amount demanded of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_31","003_21_31","EXO","21","31","31","If the ox gores a son or a daughter, it shall be done to him according to the same rule. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_32","003_21_32","EXO","21","32","32","If the ox gores a manservant or maidservant, the owner must pay thirty shekels of silver to the master of that servant, and the ox must be stoned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_33","003_21_33","EXO","21","33","33","If a man opens or digs a pit and fails to cover it, and an ox or a donkey falls into it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_34","003_21_34","EXO","21","34","34","the owner of the pit shall make restitution; he must pay its owner, and the dead animal will be his. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_35","003_21_35","EXO","21","35","35","If a man’s ox injures his neighbor’s ox and it dies, they must sell the live one and divide the proceeds; they also must divide the dead animal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX21_36","003_21_36","EXO","21","36","36","But if it was known that the ox had a habit of goring, yet its owner failed to restrain it, he shall pay full compensation, ox for ox, and the dead animal will be his. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_1","003_22_1","EXO","22","1","1","“If a man steals an ox or a sheep and slaughters or sells it, he must repay five oxen for an ox and four sheep for a sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_2","003_22_2","EXO","22","2","2","If a thief is caught breaking in and is beaten to death, no one shall be guilty of bloodshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_3","003_22_3","EXO","22","3","3","But if it happens after sunrise, there is guilt for his bloodshed. A thief must make full restitution; if he has nothing, he himself shall be sold for his theft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_4","003_22_4","EXO","22","4","4","If what was stolen is actually found alive in his possession—whether ox or donkey or sheep—he must pay back double. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_5","003_22_5","EXO","22","5","5","If a man grazes his livestock in a field or vineyard and allows them to stray so that they graze in someone else’s field, he must make restitution from the best of his own field or vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_6","003_22_6","EXO","22","6","6","If a fire breaks out and spreads to thornbushes so that it consumes stacked or standing grain, or the whole field, the one who started the fire must make full restitution. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_7","003_22_7","EXO","22","7","7","If a man gives his neighbor money or goods for safekeeping and they are stolen from the neighbor’s house, the thief, if caught, must pay back double. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_8","003_22_8","EXO","22","8","8","If the thief is not found, the owner of the house must appear before the judges to determine whether he has taken his neighbor’s property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_9","003_22_9","EXO","22","9","9","In all cases of illegal possession of an ox, a donkey, a sheep, a garment, or any lost item that someone claims, ‘This is mine,’ both parties shall bring their cases before the judges. The one whom the judges find guilty must pay back double to his neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_10","003_22_10","EXO","22","10","10","If a man gives a donkey, an ox, a sheep, or any other animal to be cared for by his neighbor, but it dies or is injured or stolen while no one is watching, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_11","003_22_11","EXO","22","11","11","an oath before the LORD shall be made between the parties to determine whether or not the man has taken his neighbor’s property. The owner must accept the oath and require no restitution. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_12","003_22_12","EXO","22","12","12","But if the animal was actually stolen from the neighbor, he must make restitution to the owner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_13","003_22_13","EXO","22","13","13","If the animal was torn to pieces, he shall bring it as evidence; he need not make restitution for the torn carcass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_14","003_22_14","EXO","22","14","14","If a man borrows an animal from his neighbor and it is injured or dies while its owner is not present, he must make full restitution. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_15","003_22_15","EXO","22","15","15","If the owner was present, no restitution is required. If the animal was rented, the fee covers the loss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_16","003_22_16","EXO","22","16","16","If a man seduces a virgin who is not pledged in marriage and sleeps with her, he must pay the full dowry for her to be his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_17","003_22_17","EXO","22","17","17","If her father absolutely refuses to give her to him, the man still must pay an amount comparable to the bridal price of a virgin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_18","003_22_18","EXO","22","18","18","You must not allow a sorceress to live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_19","003_22_19","EXO","22","19","19","Whoever lies with an animal must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_20","003_22_20","EXO","22","20","20","If anyone sacrifices to any god other than the LORD alone, he must be set apart for destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_21","003_22_21","EXO","22","21","21","You must not exploit or oppress a foreign resident, for you yourselves were foreigners in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_22","003_22_22","EXO","22","22","22","You must not mistreat any widow or orphan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_23","003_22_23","EXO","22","23","23","If you do mistreat them, and they cry out to Me in distress, I will surely hear their cry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_24","003_22_24","EXO","22","24","24","My anger will be kindled, and I will kill you with the sword; then your wives will become widows and your children will be fatherless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_25","003_22_25","EXO","22","25","25","If you lend money to one of My people among you who is poor, you must not act as a creditor to him; you are not to charge him interest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_26","003_22_26","EXO","22","26","26","If you take your neighbor’s cloak as collateral, return it to him by sunset, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_27","003_22_27","EXO","22","27","27","because his cloak is the only covering he has for his body. What else will he sleep in? And if he cries out to Me, I will hear, for I am compassionate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_28","003_22_28","EXO","22","28","28","You must not blaspheme God or curse the ruler of your people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_29","003_22_29","EXO","22","29","29","You must not hold back offerings from your granaries or vats. You are to give Me the firstborn of your sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_30","003_22_30","EXO","22","30","30","You shall do likewise with your cattle and your sheep. Let them stay with their mothers for seven days, but on the eighth day you are to give them to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX22_31","003_22_31","EXO","22","31","31","You are to be My holy people. You must not eat the meat of a mauled animal found in the field; you are to throw it to the dogs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_1","003_23_1","EXO","23","1","1","“You shall not spread a false report. Do not join the wicked by being a malicious witness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_2","003_23_2","EXO","23","2","2","You shall not follow the crowd in wrongdoing. When you testify in a lawsuit, do not pervert justice by siding with the crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_3","003_23_3","EXO","23","3","3","And do not show favoritism to a poor man in his lawsuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_4","003_23_4","EXO","23","4","4","If you encounter your enemy’s stray ox or donkey, you must return it to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_5","003_23_5","EXO","23","5","5","If you see the donkey of one who hates you fallen under its load, do not leave it there; you must help him with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_6","003_23_6","EXO","23","6","6","You shall not deny justice to the poor in their lawsuits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_7","003_23_7","EXO","23","7","7","Stay far away from a false accusation. Do not kill the innocent or the just, for I will not acquit the guilty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_8","003_23_8","EXO","23","8","8","Do not accept a bribe, for a bribe blinds those who see and twists the words of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_9","003_23_9","EXO","23","9","9","Do not oppress a foreign resident, since you yourselves know how it feels to be foreigners; for you were foreigners in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_10","003_23_10","EXO","23","10","10","For six years you are to sow your land and gather its produce, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_11","003_23_11","EXO","23","11","11","but in the seventh year you must let it rest and lie fallow, so that the poor among your people may eat from the field and the wild animals may consume what they leave. Do the same with your vineyard and olive grove. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_12","003_23_12","EXO","23","12","12","For six days you are to do your work, but on the seventh day you must cease, so that your ox and your donkey may rest and the son of your maidservant may be refreshed, as well as the foreign resident. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_13","003_23_13","EXO","23","13","13","Pay close attention to everything I have said to you. You must not invoke the names of other gods; they must not be heard on your lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_14","003_23_14","EXO","23","14","14","Three times a year you are to celebrate a feast to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_15","003_23_15","EXO","23","15","15","You are to keep the Feast of Unleavened Bread as I commanded you: At the appointed time in the month of Abib you are to eat unleavened bread for seven days, because that was the month you came out of Egypt. No one may appear before Me empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_16","003_23_16","EXO","23","16","16","You are also to keep the Feast of Harvest with the firstfruits of the produce from what you sow in the field. And keep the Feast of Ingathering at the end of the year, when you gather your produce from the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_17","003_23_17","EXO","23","17","17","Three times a year all your males are to appear before the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_18","003_23_18","EXO","23","18","18","You must not offer the blood of My sacrifices with anything leavened, nor may the fat of My feast remain until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_19","003_23_19","EXO","23","19","19","Bring the best of the firstfruits of your soil to the house of the LORD your God. You must not cook a young goat in its mother’s milk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_20","003_23_20","EXO","23","20","20","Behold, I am sending an angel before you to protect you along the way and to bring you to the place I have prepared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_21","003_23_21","EXO","23","21","21","Pay attention to him and listen to his voice; do not defy him, for he will not forgive rebellion, since My Name is in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_22","003_23_22","EXO","23","22","22","But if you will listen carefully to his voice and do everything I say, I will be an enemy to your enemies and a foe to your foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_23","003_23_23","EXO","23","23","23","For My angel will go before you and bring you into the land of the Amorites, Hittites, Perizzites, Canaanites, Hivites, and Jebusites, and I will annihilate them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_24","003_23_24","EXO","23","24","24","You must not bow down to their gods or serve them or follow their practices. Instead, you are to demolish them and smash their sacred stones to pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_25","003_23_25","EXO","23","25","25","So you shall serve the LORD your God, and He will bless your bread and your water. And I will take away sickness from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_26","003_23_26","EXO","23","26","26","No woman in your land will miscarry or be barren; I will fulfill the number of your days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_27","003_23_27","EXO","23","27","27","I will send My terror ahead of you and throw into confusion every nation you encounter. I will make all your enemies turn and run. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_28","003_23_28","EXO","23","28","28","I will send the hornet before you to drive the Hivites and Canaanites and Hittites out of your way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_29","003_23_29","EXO","23","29","29","I will not drive them out before you in a single year; otherwise the land would become desolate and wild animals would multiply against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_30","003_23_30","EXO","23","30","30","Little by little I will drive them out ahead of you, until you become fruitful and possess the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_31","003_23_31","EXO","23","31","31","And I will establish your borders from the Red Sea to the Sea of the Philistines, and from the desert to the Euphrates. For I will deliver the inhabitants into your hand, and you will drive them out before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_32","003_23_32","EXO","23","32","32","You shall make no covenant with them or with their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX23_33","003_23_33","EXO","23","33","33","They must not remain in your land, lest they cause you to sin against Me. For if you serve their gods, it will surely be a snare to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_1","003_24_1","EXO","24","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Come up to the LORD—you and Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and seventy of Israel’s elders—and you are to worship at a distance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_2","003_24_2","EXO","24","2","2","Moses alone shall approach the LORD, but the others must not come near. And the people may not go up with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_3","003_24_3","EXO","24","3","3","When Moses came and told the people all the words and ordinances of the LORD, they all responded with one voice: “All the words that the LORD has spoken, we will do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_4","003_24_4","EXO","24","4","4","And Moses wrote down all the words of the LORD. Early the next morning he got up and built an altar at the base of the mountain, along with twelve pillars for the twelve tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_5","003_24_5","EXO","24","5","5","Then he sent out some young men of Israel, and they offered burnt offerings and sacrificed young bulls as peace offerings to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_6","003_24_6","EXO","24","6","6","Moses took half of the blood and put it in bowls, and the other half he splattered on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_7","003_24_7","EXO","24","7","7","Then he took the Book of the Covenant and read it to the people, who replied, “All that the LORD has spoken we will do, and we will be obedient.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_8","003_24_8","EXO","24","8","8","So Moses took the blood, splattered it on the people, and said, “This is the blood of the covenant that the LORD has made with you in accordance with all these words.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_9","003_24_9","EXO","24","9","9","Then Moses went up with Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and seventy of the elders of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_10","003_24_10","EXO","24","10","10","and they saw the God of Israel. Under His feet was a work like a pavement made of sapphire, as clear as the sky itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_11","003_24_11","EXO","24","11","11","But God did not lay His hand on the nobles of Israel; they saw Him, and they ate and drank. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_12","003_24_12","EXO","24","12","12","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Come up to Me on the mountain and stay here, so that I may give you the tablets of stone, with the law and commandments I have written for their instruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_13","003_24_13","EXO","24","13","13","So Moses set out with Joshua his attendant and went up on the mountain of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_14","003_24_14","EXO","24","14","14","And he said to the elders, “Wait here for us until we return to you. Aaron and Hur are here with you. Whoever has a dispute can go to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_15","003_24_15","EXO","24","15","15","When Moses went up on the mountain, the cloud covered it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_16","003_24_16","EXO","24","16","16","and the glory of the LORD settled on Mount Sinai. For six days the cloud covered it, and on the seventh day the LORD called to Moses from within the cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_17","003_24_17","EXO","24","17","17","And the sight of the glory of the LORD was like a consuming fire on the mountaintop in the eyes of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX24_18","003_24_18","EXO","24","18","18","Moses entered the cloud as he went up on the mountain, and he remained on the mountain forty days and forty nights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_1","003_25_1","EXO","25","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_2","003_25_2","EXO","25","2","2","“Tell the Israelites to bring Me an offering. You are to receive My offering from every man whose heart compels him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_3","003_25_3","EXO","25","3","3","This is the offering you are to accept from them: gold, silver, and bronze; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_4","003_25_4","EXO","25","4","4","blue, purple, and scarlet yarn; fine linen and goat hair; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_5","003_25_5","EXO","25","5","5","ram skins dyed red and fine leather; acacia wood; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_6","003_25_6","EXO","25","6","6","olive oil for the light; spices for the anointing oil and for the fragrant incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_7","003_25_7","EXO","25","7","7","and onyx stones and gemstones to be mounted on the ephod and breastpiece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_8","003_25_8","EXO","25","8","8","And they are to make a sanctuary for Me, so that I may dwell among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_9","003_25_9","EXO","25","9","9","You must make the tabernacle and design all its furnishings according to the pattern I show you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_10","003_25_10","EXO","25","10","10","And they are to construct an ark of acacia wood, two and a half cubits long, a cubit and a half wide, and a cubit and a half high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_11","003_25_11","EXO","25","11","11","Overlay it with pure gold both inside and out, and make a gold molding around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_12","003_25_12","EXO","25","12","12","Cast four gold rings for it and fasten them to its four feet, two rings on one side and two on the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_13","003_25_13","EXO","25","13","13","And make poles of acacia wood and overlay them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_14","003_25_14","EXO","25","14","14","Insert the poles into the rings on the sides of the ark, in order to carry it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_15","003_25_15","EXO","25","15","15","The poles are to remain in the rings of the ark; they must not be removed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_16","003_25_16","EXO","25","16","16","And place inside the ark the Testimony, which I will give you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_17","003_25_17","EXO","25","17","17","And you are to construct a mercy seat of pure gold, two and a half cubits long and a cubit and a half wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_18","003_25_18","EXO","25","18","18","Make two cherubim of hammered gold at the ends of the mercy seat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_19","003_25_19","EXO","25","19","19","one cherub on one end and one on the other, all made from one piece of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_20","003_25_20","EXO","25","20","20","And the cherubim are to have wings that spread upward, overshadowing the mercy seat. The cherubim are to face each other, looking toward the mercy seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_21","003_25_21","EXO","25","21","21","Set the mercy seat atop the ark and put the Testimony that I will give you into the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_22","003_25_22","EXO","25","22","22","And I will meet with you there above the mercy seat, between the two cherubim that are over the ark of the Testimony; I will speak with you about all that I command you regarding the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_23","003_25_23","EXO","25","23","23","You are also to make a table of acacia wood two cubits long, a cubit wide, and a cubit and a half high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_24","003_25_24","EXO","25","24","24","Overlay it with pure gold and make a gold molding around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_25","003_25_25","EXO","25","25","25","And make a rim around it a handbreadth wide and put a gold molding on the rim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_26","003_25_26","EXO","25","26","26","Make four gold rings for the table and fasten them to the four corners at its four legs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_27","003_25_27","EXO","25","27","27","The rings are to be close to the rim, to serve as holders for the poles used to carry the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_28","003_25_28","EXO","25","28","28","Make the poles of acacia wood and overlay them with gold, so that the table may be carried with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_29","003_25_29","EXO","25","29","29","You are also to make the plates and dishes, as well as the pitchers and bowls for pouring drink offerings. Make them out of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_30","003_25_30","EXO","25","30","30","And place the Bread of the Presence on the table before Me at all times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_31","003_25_31","EXO","25","31","31","Then you are to make a lampstand of pure, hammered gold. It shall be made of one piece, including its base and shaft, its cups, and its buds and petals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_32","003_25_32","EXO","25","32","32","Six branches are to extend from the sides of the lampstand—three on one side and three on the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_33","003_25_33","EXO","25","33","33","There are to be three cups shaped like almond blossoms on the first branch, each with buds and petals, three on the next branch, and the same for all six branches that extend from the lampstand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_34","003_25_34","EXO","25","34","34","And on the lampstand there shall be four cups shaped like almond blossoms with buds and petals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_35","003_25_35","EXO","25","35","35","For the six branches that extend from the lampstand, a bud must be under the first pair of branches, a bud under the second pair, and a bud under the third pair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_36","003_25_36","EXO","25","36","36","The buds and branches are to be all of one piece with the lampstand, hammered out of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_37","003_25_37","EXO","25","37","37","Make seven lamps and set them up on the lampstand so that they illuminate the area in front of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_38","003_25_38","EXO","25","38","38","The wick trimmers and their trays must be of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_39","003_25_39","EXO","25","39","39","The lampstand and all these utensils shall be made from a talent of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX25_40","003_25_40","EXO","25","40","40","See to it that you make everything according to the pattern shown you on the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_1","003_26_1","EXO","26","1","1","“You are to construct the tabernacle itself with ten curtains of finely spun linen, each with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and cherubim skillfully worked into them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_2","003_26_2","EXO","26","2","2","Each curtain shall be twenty-eight cubits long and four cubits wide—all curtains the same size. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_3","003_26_3","EXO","26","3","3","Five of the curtains are to be joined together, and the other five joined as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_4","003_26_4","EXO","26","4","4","Make loops of blue material on the edge of the end curtain in the first set, and do the same for the end curtain in the second set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_5","003_26_5","EXO","26","5","5","Make fifty loops on one curtain and fifty loops on the end curtain of the second set, so that the loops line up opposite one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_6","003_26_6","EXO","26","6","6","Make fifty gold clasps as well, and join the curtains together with the clasps, so that the tabernacle will be a unit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_7","003_26_7","EXO","26","7","7","You are to make curtains of goat hair for the tent over the tabernacle—eleven curtains in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_8","003_26_8","EXO","26","8","8","Each of the eleven curtains is to be the same size—thirty cubits long and four cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_9","003_26_9","EXO","26","9","9","Join five of the curtains into one set and the other six into another. Then fold the sixth curtain over double at the front of the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_10","003_26_10","EXO","26","10","10","Make fifty loops along the edge of the end curtain in the first set, and fifty loops along the edge of the corresponding curtain in the second set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_11","003_26_11","EXO","26","11","11","Make fifty bronze clasps and put them through the loops to join the tent together as a unit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_12","003_26_12","EXO","26","12","12","As for the overlap that remains of the tent curtains, the half curtain that is left over shall hang down over the back of the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_13","003_26_13","EXO","26","13","13","And the tent curtains will be a cubit longer on either side, and the excess will hang over the sides of the tabernacle to cover it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_14","003_26_14","EXO","26","14","14","Also make a covering for the tent out of ram skins dyed red, and over that a covering of fine leather. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_15","003_26_15","EXO","26","15","15","You are to construct upright frames of acacia wood for the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_16","003_26_16","EXO","26","16","16","Each frame is to be ten cubits long and a cubit and a half wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_17","003_26_17","EXO","26","17","17","Two tenons must be connected to each other for each frame. Make all the frames of the tabernacle in this way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_18","003_26_18","EXO","26","18","18","Construct twenty frames for the south side of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_19","003_26_19","EXO","26","19","19","with forty silver bases under the twenty frames—two bases for each frame, one under each tenon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_20","003_26_20","EXO","26","20","20","For the second side of the tabernacle, the north side, make twenty frames ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_21","003_26_21","EXO","26","21","21","and forty silver bases—two bases under each frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_22","003_26_22","EXO","26","22","22","Make six frames for the rear of the tabernacle, the west side, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_23","003_26_23","EXO","26","23","23","and two frames for the two back corners of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_24","003_26_24","EXO","26","24","24","coupled together from bottom to top and fitted into a single ring. These will serve as the two corners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_25","003_26_25","EXO","26","25","25","So there are to be eight frames and sixteen silver bases—two under each frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_26","003_26_26","EXO","26","26","26","You are also to make five crossbars of acacia wood for the frames on one side of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_27","003_26_27","EXO","26","27","27","five for those on the other side, and five for those on the rear side of the tabernacle, to the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_28","003_26_28","EXO","26","28","28","The central crossbar in the middle of the frames shall extend from one end to the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_29","003_26_29","EXO","26","29","29","Overlay the frames with gold and make gold rings to hold the crossbars. Also overlay the crossbars with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_30","003_26_30","EXO","26","30","30","So you are to set up the tabernacle according to the pattern shown you on the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_31","003_26_31","EXO","26","31","31","Make a veil of blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen, with cherubim skillfully worked into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_32","003_26_32","EXO","26","32","32","Hang it with gold hooks on four posts of acacia wood, overlaid with gold and standing on four silver bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_33","003_26_33","EXO","26","33","33","And hang the veil from the clasps and place the ark of the Testimony behind the veil. So the veil will separate the Holy Place from the Most Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_34","003_26_34","EXO","26","34","34","Put the mercy seat on the ark of the Testimony in the Most Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_35","003_26_35","EXO","26","35","35","And place the table outside the veil on the north side of the tabernacle, and put the lampstand opposite the table, on the south side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_36","003_26_36","EXO","26","36","36","For the entrance to the tent, you are to make a curtain embroidered with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX26_37","003_26_37","EXO","26","37","37","Make five posts of acacia wood for the curtain, overlay them with gold hooks, and cast five bronze bases for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_1","003_27_1","EXO","27","1","1","“You are to build an altar of acacia wood. The altar must be square, five cubits long, five cubits wide, and three cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_2","003_27_2","EXO","27","2","2","Make a horn on each of its four corners, so that the horns are of one piece, and overlay it with bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_3","003_27_3","EXO","27","3","3","Make all its utensils of bronze—its pots for removing ashes, its shovels, its sprinkling bowls, its meat forks, and its firepans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_4","003_27_4","EXO","27","4","4","Construct for it a grate of bronze mesh, and make a bronze ring at each of the four corners of the mesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_5","003_27_5","EXO","27","5","5","Set the grate beneath the ledge of the altar, so that the mesh comes halfway up the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_6","003_27_6","EXO","27","6","6","Additionally, make poles of acacia wood for the altar and overlay them with bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_7","003_27_7","EXO","27","7","7","The poles are to be inserted into the rings so that the poles are on two sides of the altar when it is carried. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_8","003_27_8","EXO","27","8","8","Construct the altar with boards so that it is hollow. It is to be made just as you were shown on the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_9","003_27_9","EXO","27","9","9","You are also to make a courtyard for the tabernacle. On the south side of the courtyard make curtains of finely spun linen, a hundred cubits long on one side, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_10","003_27_10","EXO","27","10","10","with twenty posts and twenty bronze bases, and silver hooks and bands on the posts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_11","003_27_11","EXO","27","11","11","Likewise there are to be curtains on the north side, a hundred cubits long, with twenty posts and twenty bronze bases, and with silver hooks and bands on the posts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_12","003_27_12","EXO","27","12","12","The curtains on the west side of the courtyard shall be fifty cubits wide, with ten posts and ten bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_13","003_27_13","EXO","27","13","13","The east side of the courtyard, toward the sunrise, is to be fifty cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_14","003_27_14","EXO","27","14","14","Make the curtains on one side fifteen cubits long, with three posts and three bases, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_15","003_27_15","EXO","27","15","15","and the curtains on the other side fifteen cubits long, with three posts and three bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_16","003_27_16","EXO","27","16","16","The gate of the courtyard shall be twenty cubits long, with a curtain embroidered with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen. It shall have four posts and four bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_17","003_27_17","EXO","27","17","17","All the posts around the courtyard shall have silver bands, silver hooks, and bronze bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_18","003_27_18","EXO","27","18","18","The entire courtyard shall be a hundred cubits long and fifty cubits wide, with curtains of finely spun linen five cubits high, and with bronze bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_19","003_27_19","EXO","27","19","19","All the utensils of the tabernacle for every use, including all its tent pegs and the tent pegs of the courtyard, shall be made of bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_20","003_27_20","EXO","27","20","20","And you are to command the Israelites to bring you pure oil of pressed olives for the light, to keep the lamps burning continually. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX27_21","003_27_21","EXO","27","21","21","In the Tent of Meeting, outside the veil that is in front of the Testimony, Aaron and his sons are to tend the lamps before the LORD from evening until morning. This is to be a permanent statute for the Israelites for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_1","003_28_1","EXO","28","1","1","“Next, have your brother Aaron brought to you from among the Israelites, along with his sons Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar, to serve Me as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_2","003_28_2","EXO","28","2","2","Make holy garments for your brother Aaron, to give him glory and splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_3","003_28_3","EXO","28","3","3","You are to instruct all the skilled craftsmen, whom I have filled with a spirit of wisdom, to make garments for Aaron’s consecration, so that he may serve Me as priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_4","003_28_4","EXO","28","4","4","These are the garments that they shall make: a breastpiece, an ephod, a robe, a woven tunic, a turban, and a sash. They are to make these holy garments for your brother Aaron and his sons, so that they may serve Me as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_5","003_28_5","EXO","28","5","5","They shall use gold, along with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and fine linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_6","003_28_6","EXO","28","6","6","They are to make the ephod of finely spun linen embroidered with gold, and with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_7","003_28_7","EXO","28","7","7","It shall have two shoulder pieces attached at two of its corners, so it can be fastened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_8","003_28_8","EXO","28","8","8","And the skillfully woven waistband of the ephod must be of one piece, of the same workmanship—with gold, with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and with finely spun linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_9","003_28_9","EXO","28","9","9","Take two onyx stones and engrave on them the names of the sons of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_10","003_28_10","EXO","28","10","10","six of their names on one stone and the remaining six on the other, in the order of their birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_11","003_28_11","EXO","28","11","11","Engrave the names of the sons of Israel on the two stones the way a gem cutter engraves a seal. Then mount the stones in gold filigree settings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_12","003_28_12","EXO","28","12","12","Fasten both stones on the shoulder pieces of the ephod as memorial stones for the sons of Israel. Aaron is to bear their names on his two shoulders as a memorial before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_13","003_28_13","EXO","28","13","13","Fashion gold filigree settings ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_14","003_28_14","EXO","28","14","14","and two chains of pure gold, made of braided cord work; and attach these chains to the settings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_15","003_28_15","EXO","28","15","15","You are also to make a breastpiece of judgment with the same workmanship as the ephod. Construct it with gold, with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and with finely spun linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_16","003_28_16","EXO","28","16","16","It must be square when folded over double, a span long and a span wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_17","003_28_17","EXO","28","17","17","And mount on it a setting of gemstones, four rows of stones: In the first row there shall be a ruby, a topaz, and an emerald; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_18","003_28_18","EXO","28","18","18","in the second row a turquoise, a sapphire, and a diamond; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_19","003_28_19","EXO","28","19","19","in the third row a jacinth, an agate, and an amethyst; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_20","003_28_20","EXO","28","20","20","and in the fourth row a beryl, an onyx, and a jasper. Mount these stones in gold filigree settings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_21","003_28_21","EXO","28","21","21","The twelve stones are to correspond to the names of the sons of Israel, each engraved like a seal with the name of one of the twelve tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_22","003_28_22","EXO","28","22","22","For the breastpiece, make braided chains like cords of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_23","003_28_23","EXO","28","23","23","You are also to make two gold rings and fasten them to the two corners of the breastpiece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_24","003_28_24","EXO","28","24","24","Then fasten the two gold chains to the two gold rings at the corners of the breastpiece, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_25","003_28_25","EXO","28","25","25","and fasten the other ends of the two chains to the two filigree settings, attaching them to the shoulder pieces of the ephod at the front. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_26","003_28_26","EXO","28","26","26","Make two more gold rings and attach them to the other two corners of the breastpiece, on the inside edge next to the ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_27","003_28_27","EXO","28","27","27","Make two additional gold rings and attach them to the bottom of the two shoulder pieces of the ephod, on its front, near its seam just above its woven waistband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_28","003_28_28","EXO","28","28","28","The rings of the breastpiece shall be tied to the rings of the ephod with a cord of blue yarn, so that the breastpiece is above the waistband of the ephod and does not swing out from the ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_29","003_28_29","EXO","28","29","29","Whenever Aaron enters the Holy Place, he shall bear the names of the sons of Israel over his heart on the breastpiece of judgment, as a continual reminder before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_30","003_28_30","EXO","28","30","30","And place the Urim and Thummim in the breastpiece of judgment, so that they will also be over Aaron’s heart whenever he comes before the LORD. Aaron will continually carry the judgment of the sons of Israel over his heart before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_31","003_28_31","EXO","28","31","31","You are to make the robe of the ephod entirely of blue cloth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_32","003_28_32","EXO","28","32","32","with an opening at its top in the center. Around the opening shall be a woven collar with an opening like that of a garment, so that it will not tear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_33","003_28_33","EXO","28","33","33","Make pomegranates of blue, purple, and scarlet yarn all the way around the lower hem, with gold bells between them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_34","003_28_34","EXO","28","34","34","alternating the gold bells and pomegranates around the lower hem of the robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_35","003_28_35","EXO","28","35","35","Aaron must wear the robe whenever he ministers, and its sound will be heard when he enters or exits the sanctuary before the LORD, so that he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_36","003_28_36","EXO","28","36","36","You are to make a plate of pure gold and engrave on it as on a seal: HOLY TO THE LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_37","003_28_37","EXO","28","37","37","Fasten to it a blue cord to mount it on the turban; it shall be on the front of the turban. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_38","003_28_38","EXO","28","38","38","And it will be worn on Aaron’s forehead, so that he may bear the iniquity of the holy things that the sons of Israel consecrate with regard to all their holy gifts. It shall always be on his forehead, so that they may be acceptable before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_39","003_28_39","EXO","28","39","39","You are to weave the tunic with fine linen, make the turban of fine linen, and fashion an embroidered sash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_40","003_28_40","EXO","28","40","40","Make tunics, sashes, and headbands for Aaron’s sons, to give them glory and splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_41","003_28_41","EXO","28","41","41","After you put these garments on your brother Aaron and his sons, anoint them, ordain them, and consecrate them so that they may serve Me as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_42","003_28_42","EXO","28","42","42","Make linen undergarments to cover their bare flesh, extending from waist to thigh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX28_43","003_28_43","EXO","28","43","43","Aaron and his sons must wear them whenever they enter the Tent of Meeting or approach the altar to minister in the Holy Place, so that they will not incur guilt and die. This is to be a permanent statute for Aaron and his descendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_1","003_29_1","EXO","29","1","1","“Now this is what you are to do to consecrate Aaron and his sons to serve Me as priests: Take a young bull and two rams without blemish, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_2","003_29_2","EXO","29","2","2","along with unleavened bread, unleavened cakes mixed with oil, and unleavened wafers anointed with oil. Make them out of fine wheat flour, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_3","003_29_3","EXO","29","3","3","put them in a basket, and present them in the basket, along with the bull and the two rams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_4","003_29_4","EXO","29","4","4","Then present Aaron and his sons at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting and wash them with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_5","003_29_5","EXO","29","5","5","Take the garments and clothe Aaron with the tunic, the robe of the ephod, the ephod itself, and the breastplate. Fasten the ephod on him with its woven waistband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_6","003_29_6","EXO","29","6","6","Put the turban on his head and attach the holy diadem to the turban. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_7","003_29_7","EXO","29","7","7","Then take the anointing oil and anoint him by pouring it on his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_8","003_29_8","EXO","29","8","8","Present his sons as well and clothe them with tunics. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_9","003_29_9","EXO","29","9","9","Wrap the sashes around Aaron and his sons and tie headbands on them. The priesthood shall be theirs by a permanent statute. In this way you are to ordain Aaron and his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_10","003_29_10","EXO","29","10","10","You are to present the bull at the front of the Tent of Meeting, and Aaron and his sons are to lay their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_11","003_29_11","EXO","29","11","11","And you shall slaughter the bull before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_12","003_29_12","EXO","29","12","12","Take some of the blood of the bull and put it on the horns of the altar with your finger; then pour out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_13","003_29_13","EXO","29","13","13","Take all the fat that covers the entrails and the lobe of the liver, and both kidneys with the fat on them, and burn them on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_14","003_29_14","EXO","29","14","14","But burn the flesh of the bull and its hide and dung outside the camp; it is a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_15","003_29_15","EXO","29","15","15","Take one of the rams, and Aaron and his sons shall lay their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_16","003_29_16","EXO","29","16","16","You are to slaughter the ram, take its blood, and splatter it on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_17","003_29_17","EXO","29","17","17","Cut the ram into pieces, wash the entrails and legs, and place them with its head and other pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_18","003_29_18","EXO","29","18","18","Then burn the entire ram on the altar; it is a burnt offering to the LORD, a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_19","003_29_19","EXO","29","19","19","Take the second ram, and Aaron and his sons are to lay their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_20","003_29_20","EXO","29","20","20","Slaughter the ram, take some of its blood, and put it on the right earlobes of Aaron and his sons, on the thumbs of their right hands, and on the big toes of their right feet. Splatter the remaining blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_21","003_29_21","EXO","29","21","21","And take some of the blood on the altar and some of the anointing oil and sprinkle it on Aaron and his garments, as well as on his sons and their garments. Then he and his garments will be consecrated, as well as his sons and their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_22","003_29_22","EXO","29","22","22","Take the fat from the ram, the fat tail, the fat covering the entrails, the lobe of the liver, both kidneys with the fat on them, and the right thigh (since this is a ram for ordination), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_23","003_29_23","EXO","29","23","23","along with one loaf of bread, one cake of bread made with oil, and one wafer from the basket of unleavened bread that is before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_24","003_29_24","EXO","29","24","24","Put all these in the hands of Aaron and his sons and wave them before the LORD as a wave offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_25","003_29_25","EXO","29","25","25","Then take them from their hands and burn them on the altar atop the burnt offering as a pleasing aroma before the LORD; it is a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_26","003_29_26","EXO","29","26","26","Take the breast of the ram of Aaron’s ordination and wave it before the LORD as a wave offering, and it will be your portion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_27","003_29_27","EXO","29","27","27","Consecrate for Aaron and his sons the breast of the wave offering that is waved and the thigh of the heave offering that is lifted up from the ram of ordination. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_28","003_29_28","EXO","29","28","28","This will belong to Aaron and his sons as a regular portion from the Israelites, for it is the heave offering the Israelites will make to the LORD from their peace offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_29","003_29_29","EXO","29","29","29","The holy garments that belong to Aaron will belong to his sons after him, so they can be anointed and ordained in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_30","003_29_30","EXO","29","30","30","The son who succeeds him as priest and enters the Tent of Meeting to minister in the Holy Place must wear them for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_31","003_29_31","EXO","29","31","31","You are to take the ram of ordination and boil its flesh in a holy place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_32","003_29_32","EXO","29","32","32","At the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, Aaron and his sons are to eat the meat of the ram and the bread that is in the basket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_33","003_29_33","EXO","29","33","33","They must eat those things by which atonement was made for their ordination and consecration. But no outsider may eat them, because these things are sacred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_34","003_29_34","EXO","29","34","34","And if any of the meat of ordination or any bread is left until the morning, you are to burn up the remainder. It must not be eaten, because it is sacred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_35","003_29_35","EXO","29","35","35","This is what you are to do for Aaron and his sons based on all that I have commanded you, taking seven days to ordain them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_36","003_29_36","EXO","29","36","36","Sacrifice a bull as a sin offering each day for atonement. Purify the altar by making atonement for it, and anoint it to consecrate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_37","003_29_37","EXO","29","37","37","For seven days you shall make atonement for the altar and consecrate it. Then the altar will become most holy; whatever touches the altar will be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_38","003_29_38","EXO","29","38","38","This is what you are to offer regularly on the altar, each day: two lambs that are a year old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_39","003_29_39","EXO","29","39","39","Offer one lamb in the morning and the other at twilight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_40","003_29_40","EXO","29","40","40","With the first lamb offer a tenth of an ephah of fine flour, mixed with a quarter hin of oil from pressed olives, and a drink offering of a quarter hin of wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_41","003_29_41","EXO","29","41","41","And offer the second lamb at twilight with the same grain offering and drink offering as in the morning, as a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_42","003_29_42","EXO","29","42","42","For the generations to come, this burnt offering shall be made regularly at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting before the LORD, where I will meet you to speak with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_43","003_29_43","EXO","29","43","43","I will also meet with the Israelites there, and that place will be consecrated by My glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_44","003_29_44","EXO","29","44","44","So I will consecrate the Tent of Meeting and the altar, and I will consecrate Aaron and his sons to serve Me as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_45","003_29_45","EXO","29","45","45","Then I will dwell among the Israelites and be their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX29_46","003_29_46","EXO","29","46","46","And they will know that I am the LORD their God, who brought them out of the land of Egypt so that I might dwell among them. I am the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_1","003_30_1","EXO","30","1","1","“You are also to make an altar of acacia wood for the burning of incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_2","003_30_2","EXO","30","2","2","It is to be square, a cubit long, a cubit wide, and two cubits high. Its horns must be of one piece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_3","003_30_3","EXO","30","3","3","Overlay with pure gold the top and all the sides and horns, and make a molding of gold around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_4","003_30_4","EXO","30","4","4","And make two gold rings below the molding on opposite sides to hold the poles used to carry it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_5","003_30_5","EXO","30","5","5","Make the poles of acacia wood and overlay them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_6","003_30_6","EXO","30","6","6","Place the altar in front of the veil that is before the ark of the Testimony—before the mercy seat that is over the Testimony—where I will meet with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_7","003_30_7","EXO","30","7","7","And Aaron is to burn fragrant incense on it every morning when he tends the lamps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_8","003_30_8","EXO","30","8","8","When Aaron sets up the lamps at twilight, he must burn the incense perpetually before the LORD for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_9","003_30_9","EXO","30","9","9","On this altar you must not offer unauthorized incense or a burnt offering or grain offering; nor are you to pour a drink offering on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_10","003_30_10","EXO","30","10","10","Once a year Aaron shall make atonement on the horns of the altar. Throughout your generations he shall make atonement on it annually with the blood of the sin offering of atonement. The altar is most holy to the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_11","003_30_11","EXO","30","11","11","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_12","003_30_12","EXO","30","12","12","“When you take a census of the Israelites to number them, each man must pay the LORD a ransom for his life when he is counted. Then no plague will come upon them when they are numbered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_13","003_30_13","EXO","30","13","13","Everyone who crosses over to those counted must pay a half shekel, according to the sanctuary shekel, which weighs twenty gerahs. This half shekel is an offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_14","003_30_14","EXO","30","14","14","Everyone twenty years of age or older who crosses over must give this offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_15","003_30_15","EXO","30","15","15","In making the offering to the LORD to atone for your lives, the rich shall not give more than a half shekel, nor shall the poor give less. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_16","003_30_16","EXO","30","16","16","Take the atonement money from the Israelites and use it for the service of the Tent of Meeting. It will serve as a memorial for the Israelites before the LORD to make atonement for your lives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_17","003_30_17","EXO","30","17","17","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_18","003_30_18","EXO","30","18","18","“You are to make a bronze basin with a bronze stand for washing. Set it between the Tent of Meeting and the altar, and put water in it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_19","003_30_19","EXO","30","19","19","with which Aaron and his sons are to wash their hands and feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_20","003_30_20","EXO","30","20","20","Whenever they enter the Tent of Meeting or approach the altar to minister by presenting a food offering to the LORD, they must wash with water so that they will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_21","003_30_21","EXO","30","21","21","Thus they are to wash their hands and feet so that they will not die; this shall be a permanent statute for Aaron and his descendants for the generations to come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_22","003_30_22","EXO","30","22","22","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_23","003_30_23","EXO","30","23","23","“Take the finest spices: 500 shekels of liquid myrrh, half that amount (250 shekels) of fragrant cinnamon, 250 shekels of fragrant cane, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_24","003_30_24","EXO","30","24","24","500 shekels of cassia—all according to the sanctuary shekel—and a hin of olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_25","003_30_25","EXO","30","25","25","Prepare from these a sacred anointing oil, a fragrant blend, the work of a perfumer; it will be a sacred anointing oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_26","003_30_26","EXO","30","26","26","Use this oil to anoint the Tent of Meeting, the ark of the Testimony, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_27","003_30_27","EXO","30","27","27","the table and all its utensils, the lampstand and its utensils, the altar of incense, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_28","003_30_28","EXO","30","28","28","the altar of burnt offering and all its utensils, and the basin with its stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_29","003_30_29","EXO","30","29","29","You are to consecrate them so that they will be most holy. Whatever touches them shall be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_30","003_30_30","EXO","30","30","30","Anoint Aaron and his sons and consecrate them to serve Me as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_31","003_30_31","EXO","30","31","31","And you are to tell the Israelites, ‘This will be My sacred anointing oil for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_32","003_30_32","EXO","30","32","32","It must not be used to anoint an ordinary man, and you must not make anything like it with the same formula. It is holy, and it must be holy to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_33","003_30_33","EXO","30","33","33","Anyone who mixes perfume like it or puts it on an outsider shall be cut off from his people.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_34","003_30_34","EXO","30","34","34","The LORD also said to Moses, “Take fragrant spices—gum resin, onycha, galbanum, and pure frankincense—in equal measures, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_35","003_30_35","EXO","30","35","35","and make a fragrant blend of incense, the work of a perfumer, seasoned with salt, pure and holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_36","003_30_36","EXO","30","36","36","Grind some of it into fine powder and place it in front of the Testimony in the Tent of Meeting, where I will meet with you. It shall be most holy to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_37","003_30_37","EXO","30","37","37","You are never to use this formula to make incense for yourselves; you shall regard it as holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX30_38","003_30_38","EXO","30","38","38","Anyone who makes something like it to enjoy its fragrance shall be cut off from his people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_1","003_31_1","EXO","31","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_2","003_31_2","EXO","31","2","2","“See, I have called by name Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_3","003_31_3","EXO","31","3","3","And I have filled him with the Spirit of God, with skill, ability, and knowledge in all kinds of craftsmanship, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_4","003_31_4","EXO","31","4","4","to design artistic works in gold, silver, and bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_5","003_31_5","EXO","31","5","5","to cut gemstones for settings, and to carve wood, so that he may be a master of every craft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_6","003_31_6","EXO","31","6","6","Moreover, I have selected Oholiab son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan, as his assistant. I have also given skill to all the craftsmen, that they may fashion all that I have commanded you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_7","003_31_7","EXO","31","7","7","the Tent of Meeting, the ark of the Testimony and the mercy seat upon it, and all the other furnishings of the tent— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_8","003_31_8","EXO","31","8","8","the table with its utensils, the pure gold lampstand with all its utensils, the altar of incense, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_9","003_31_9","EXO","31","9","9","the altar of burnt offering with all its utensils, and the basin with its stand— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_10","003_31_10","EXO","31","10","10","as well as the woven garments, both the holy garments for Aaron the priest and the garments for his sons to serve as priests, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_11","003_31_11","EXO","31","11","11","in addition to the anointing oil and fragrant incense for the Holy Place. They are to make them according to all that I have commanded you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_12","003_31_12","EXO","31","12","12","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_13","003_31_13","EXO","31","13","13","“Tell the Israelites, ‘Surely you must keep My Sabbaths, for this will be a sign between Me and you for the generations to come, so that you may know that I am the LORD who sanctifies you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_14","003_31_14","EXO","31","14","14","Keep the Sabbath, for it is holy to you. Anyone who profanes it must surely be put to death. Whoever does any work on that day must be cut off from among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_15","003_31_15","EXO","31","15","15","For six days work may be done, but the seventh day is a Sabbath of complete rest, holy to the LORD. Whoever does any work on the Sabbath day must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_16","003_31_16","EXO","31","16","16","The Israelites must keep the Sabbath, celebrating it as a permanent covenant for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_17","003_31_17","EXO","31","17","17","It is a sign between Me and the Israelites forever; for in six days the LORD made the heavens and the earth, but on the seventh day He rested and was refreshed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX31_18","003_31_18","EXO","31","18","18","When the LORD had finished speaking with Moses on Mount Sinai, He gave him the two tablets of the Testimony, tablets of stone inscribed by the finger of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_1","003_32_1","EXO","32","1","1","Now when the people saw that Moses was delayed in coming down from the mountain, they gathered around Aaron and said, “Come, make us gods who will go before us. As for this Moses who brought us up out of the land of Egypt, we do not know what has happened to him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_2","003_32_2","EXO","32","2","2","So Aaron told them, “Take off the gold earrings that are on your wives and sons and daughters, and bring them to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_3","003_32_3","EXO","32","3","3","Then all the people took off their gold earrings and brought them to Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_4","003_32_4","EXO","32","4","4","He took the gold from their hands, and with an engraving tool he fashioned it into a molten calf. And they said, “These, O Israel, are your gods, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_5","003_32_5","EXO","32","5","5","When Aaron saw this, he built an altar before the calf and proclaimed: “Tomorrow shall be a feast to the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_6","003_32_6","EXO","32","6","6","So the next day they arose, offered burnt offerings, and presented peace offerings. And the people sat down to eat and drink and got up to indulge in revelry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_7","003_32_7","EXO","32","7","7","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go down at once, for your people, whom you brought up out of the land of Egypt, have corrupted themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_8","003_32_8","EXO","32","8","8","How quickly they have turned aside from the way that I commanded them! They have made for themselves a molten calf and have bowed down to it. They have sacrificed to it and said, ‘These, O Israel, are your gods, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_9","003_32_9","EXO","32","9","9","The LORD also said to Moses, “I have seen this people, and they are indeed a stiff-necked people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_10","003_32_10","EXO","32","10","10","Now leave Me alone, so that My anger may burn against them and consume them. Then I will make you into a great nation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_11","003_32_11","EXO","32","11","11","But Moses sought the favor of the LORD his God, saying, “O LORD, why does Your anger burn against Your people, whom You brought out of the land of Egypt with great power and a mighty hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_12","003_32_12","EXO","32","12","12","Why should the Egyptians declare, ‘He brought them out with evil intent, to kill them in the mountains and wipe them from the face of the earth’? Turn from Your fierce anger and relent from doing harm to Your people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_13","003_32_13","EXO","32","13","13","Remember Your servants Abraham, Isaac, and Israel, to whom You swore by Your very self when You declared, ‘I will make your descendants as numerous as the stars in the sky, and I will give your descendants all this land that I have promised, and it shall be their inheritance forever.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_14","003_32_14","EXO","32","14","14","So the LORD relented from the calamity He had threatened to bring on His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_15","003_32_15","EXO","32","15","15","Then Moses turned and went down the mountain with the two tablets of the Testimony in his hands. They were inscribed on both sides, front and back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_16","003_32_16","EXO","32","16","16","The tablets were the work of God, and the writing was the writing of God, engraved on the tablets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_17","003_32_17","EXO","32","17","17","When Joshua heard the sound of the people shouting, he said to Moses, “The sound of war is in the camp.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_18","003_32_18","EXO","32","18","18","But Moses replied: “It is neither the cry of victory nor the cry of defeat; I hear the sound of singing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_19","003_32_19","EXO","32","19","19","As Moses approached the camp and saw the calf and the dancing, he burned with anger and threw the tablets out of his hands, shattering them at the base of the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_20","003_32_20","EXO","32","20","20","Then he took the calf they had made, burned it in the fire, ground it to powder, and scattered the powder over the face of the water. Then he forced the Israelites to drink it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_21","003_32_21","EXO","32","21","21","“What did this people do to you,” Moses asked Aaron, “that you have led them into so great a sin?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_22","003_32_22","EXO","32","22","22","“Do not be enraged, my lord,” Aaron replied. “You yourself know that the people are intent on evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_23","003_32_23","EXO","32","23","23","They told me, ‘Make us gods who will go before us. As for this Moses who brought us up out of the land of Egypt, we do not know what has happened to him!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_24","003_32_24","EXO","32","24","24","So I said to them, ‘Whoever has gold, let him take it off,’ and they gave it to me. And when I threw it into the fire, out came this calf!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_25","003_32_25","EXO","32","25","25","Moses saw that the people were out of control, for Aaron had let them run wild and become a laughingstock to their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_26","003_32_26","EXO","32","26","26","So Moses stood at the entrance to the camp and said, “Whoever is for the LORD, come to me.” And all the Levites gathered around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_27","003_32_27","EXO","32","27","27","He told them, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Each of you men is to fasten his sword to his side, go back and forth through the camp from gate to gate, and slay his brother, his friend, and his neighbor.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_28","003_32_28","EXO","32","28","28","The Levites did as Moses commanded, and that day about three thousand of the people fell dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_29","003_32_29","EXO","32","29","29","Afterward, Moses said, “Today you have been ordained for service to the LORD, since each man went against his son and his brother; so the LORD has bestowed a blessing on you this day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_30","003_32_30","EXO","32","30","30","The next day Moses said to the people, “You have committed a great sin. Now I will go up to the LORD; perhaps I can make atonement for your sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_31","003_32_31","EXO","32","31","31","So Moses returned to the LORD and said, “Oh, what a great sin these people have committed! They have made gods of gold for themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_32","003_32_32","EXO","32","32","32","Yet now, if You would only forgive their sin.... But if not, please blot me out of the book that You have written.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_33","003_32_33","EXO","32","33","33","The LORD replied to Moses, “Whoever has sinned against Me, I will blot out of My book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_34","003_32_34","EXO","32","34","34","Now go, lead the people to the place I described. Behold, My angel shall go before you. But on the day I settle accounts, I will punish them for their sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX32_35","003_32_35","EXO","32","35","35","And the LORD sent a plague on the people because of what they had done with the calf that Aaron had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_1","003_33_1","EXO","33","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Leave this place, you and the people you brought up out of the land of Egypt, and go to the land that I promised to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob when I said, ‘I will give it to your descendants.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_2","003_33_2","EXO","33","2","2","And I will send an angel before you, and I will drive out the Canaanites, Amorites, Hittites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_3","003_33_3","EXO","33","3","3","Go up to a land flowing with milk and honey. But I will not go with you, because you are a stiff-necked people; otherwise, I might destroy you on the way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_4","003_33_4","EXO","33","4","4","When the people heard this bad news, they went into mourning, and no one put on any of his jewelry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_5","003_33_5","EXO","33","5","5","For the LORD had said to Moses, “Tell the Israelites, ‘You are a stiff-necked people. If I should go with you for a single moment, I would destroy you. Now take off your jewelry, and I will decide what to do with you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_6","003_33_6","EXO","33","6","6","So the Israelites stripped themselves of their jewelry from Mount Horeb onward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_7","003_33_7","EXO","33","7","7","Now Moses used to take the tent and pitch it at a distance outside the camp. He called it the Tent of Meeting, and anyone inquiring of the LORD would go to the Tent of Meeting outside the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_8","003_33_8","EXO","33","8","8","Then, whenever Moses went out to the tent, all the people would stand at the entrances to their own tents and watch Moses until he entered the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_9","003_33_9","EXO","33","9","9","As Moses entered the tent, the pillar of cloud would come down and remain at the entrance, and the LORD would speak with Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_10","003_33_10","EXO","33","10","10","When all the people saw the pillar of cloud standing at the entrance to the tent, they would stand up and worship, each one at the entrance to his own tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_11","003_33_11","EXO","33","11","11","Thus the LORD would speak to Moses face to face, as a man speaks to his friend. Then Moses would return to the camp, but his young assistant Joshua son of Nun would not leave the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_12","003_33_12","EXO","33","12","12","Then Moses said to the LORD, “Look, You have been telling me, ‘Lead this people up,’ but You have not let me know whom You will send with me. Yet You have said, ‘I know you by name, and you have found favor in My sight.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_13","003_33_13","EXO","33","13","13","Now if indeed I have found favor in Your sight, please let me know Your ways, that I may know You and find favor in Your sight. Remember that this nation is Your people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_14","003_33_14","EXO","33","14","14","And the LORD answered, “My Presence will go with you, and I will give you rest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_15","003_33_15","EXO","33","15","15","“If Your Presence does not go with us,” Moses replied, “do not lead us up from here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_16","003_33_16","EXO","33","16","16","For how then can it be known that Your people and I have found favor in Your sight, unless You go with us? How else will we be distinguished from all the other people on the face of the earth?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_17","003_33_17","EXO","33","17","17","So the LORD said to Moses, “I will do this very thing you have asked, for you have found favor in My sight, and I know you by name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_18","003_33_18","EXO","33","18","18","Then Moses said, “Please show me Your glory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_19","003_33_19","EXO","33","19","19","“I will cause all My goodness to pass before you,” the LORD replied, “and I will proclaim My name—the LORD—in your presence. I will have mercy on whom I have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I have compassion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_20","003_33_20","EXO","33","20","20","But He added, “You cannot see My face, for no one can see Me and live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_21","003_33_21","EXO","33","21","21","The LORD continued, “There is a place near Me where you are to stand upon a rock, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_22","003_33_22","EXO","33","22","22","and when My glory passes by, I will put you in a cleft of the rock and cover you with My hand until I have passed by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX33_23","003_33_23","EXO","33","23","23","Then I will take My hand away, and you will see My back; but My face must not be seen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_1","003_34_1","EXO","34","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Chisel out two stone tablets like the originals, and I will write on them the words that were on the first tablets, which you broke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_2","003_34_2","EXO","34","2","2","Be ready in the morning, and come up on Mount Sinai to present yourself before Me on the mountaintop. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_3","003_34_3","EXO","34","3","3","No one may go up with you; in fact, no one may be seen anywhere on the mountain—not even the flocks or herds may graze in front of the mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_4","003_34_4","EXO","34","4","4","So Moses chiseled out two stone tablets like the originals. He rose early in the morning, and taking the two stone tablets in his hands, he went up Mount Sinai as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_5","003_34_5","EXO","34","5","5","And the LORD descended in a cloud, stood with him there, and proclaimed His name, the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_6","003_34_6","EXO","34","6","6","Then the LORD passed in front of Moses and called out: “The LORD, the LORD God, is compassionate and gracious, slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion and faithfulness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_7","003_34_7","EXO","34","7","7","maintaining loving devotion to a thousand generations, forgiving iniquity, transgression, and sin. Yet He will by no means leave the guilty unpunished; He will visit the iniquity of the fathers on their children and grandchildren to the third and fourth generations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_8","003_34_8","EXO","34","8","8","Moses immediately bowed down to the ground and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_9","003_34_9","EXO","34","9","9","“O Lord,” he said, “if I have indeed found favor in Your sight, my Lord, please go with us. Although this is a stiff-necked people, forgive our iniquity and sin, and take us as Your inheritance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_10","003_34_10","EXO","34","10","10","And the LORD said, “Behold, I am making a covenant. Before all your people I will perform wonders that have never been done in any nation in all the world. All the people among whom you live will see the LORD’s work, for it is an awesome thing that I am doing with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_11","003_34_11","EXO","34","11","11","Observe what I command you this day. I will drive out before you the Amorites, Canaanites, Hittites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_12","003_34_12","EXO","34","12","12","Be careful not to make a treaty with the inhabitants of the land you are entering, lest they become a snare in your midst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_13","003_34_13","EXO","34","13","13","Rather, you must tear down their altars, smash their sacred stones, and chop down their Asherah poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_14","003_34_14","EXO","34","14","14","For you must not worship any other god, for the LORD, whose name is Jealous, is a jealous God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_15","003_34_15","EXO","34","15","15","Do not make a covenant with the inhabitants of the land, for when they prostitute themselves to their gods and sacrifice to them, they will invite you, and you will eat their sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_16","003_34_16","EXO","34","16","16","And when you take some of their daughters as brides for your sons, their daughters will prostitute themselves to their gods and cause your sons to do the same. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_17","003_34_17","EXO","34","17","17","You shall make no molten gods for yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_18","003_34_18","EXO","34","18","18","You are to keep the Feast of Unleavened Bread. For seven days at the appointed time in the month of Abib, you are to eat unleavened bread as I commanded you. For in the month of Abib you came out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_19","003_34_19","EXO","34","19","19","The first offspring of every womb belongs to Me, including all the firstborn males among your livestock, whether cattle or sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_20","003_34_20","EXO","34","20","20","You must redeem the firstborn of a donkey with a lamb; but if you do not redeem it, you are to break its neck. You must redeem all the firstborn of your sons. No one shall appear before Me empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_21","003_34_21","EXO","34","21","21","Six days you shall labor, but on the seventh day you shall rest; even in the seasons of plowing and harvesting, you must rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_22","003_34_22","EXO","34","22","22","And you are to celebrate the Feast of Weeks with the firstfruits of the wheat harvest, and the Feast of Ingathering at the turn of the year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_23","003_34_23","EXO","34","23","23","Three times a year all your males are to appear before the Lord GOD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_24","003_34_24","EXO","34","24","24","For I will drive out the nations before you and enlarge your borders, and no one will covet your land when you go up three times a year to appear before the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_25","003_34_25","EXO","34","25","25","Do not offer the blood of a sacrifice to Me along with anything leavened, and do not let any of the sacrifice from the Passover Feast remain until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_26","003_34_26","EXO","34","26","26","Bring the best of the firstfruits of your soil to the house of the LORD your God. You must not cook a young goat in its mother’s milk.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_27","003_34_27","EXO","34","27","27","The LORD also said to Moses, “Write down these words, for in accordance with these words I have made a covenant with you and with Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_28","003_34_28","EXO","34","28","28","So Moses was there with the LORD forty days and forty nights without eating bread or drinking water. He wrote on the tablets the words of the covenant—the Ten Commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_29","003_34_29","EXO","34","29","29","And when Moses came down from Mount Sinai with the two tablets of the Testimony in his hands, he was unaware that his face had become radiant from speaking with the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_30","003_34_30","EXO","34","30","30","Aaron and all the Israelites looked at Moses, and behold, his face was radiant. And they were afraid to approach him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_31","003_34_31","EXO","34","31","31","But Moses called out to them; so Aaron and all the leaders of the congregation returned to him, and Moses spoke to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_32","003_34_32","EXO","34","32","32","And after this all the Israelites came near, and Moses commanded them to do everything that the LORD had told him on Mount Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_33","003_34_33","EXO","34","33","33","When Moses had finished speaking with them, he put a veil over his face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_34","003_34_34","EXO","34","34","34","But whenever Moses went in before the LORD to speak with Him, he would remove the veil until he came out. And when he came out, he would tell the Israelites what he had been commanded, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX34_35","003_34_35","EXO","34","35","35","and the Israelites would see that the face of Moses was radiant. So Moses would put the veil back over his face until he went in to speak with the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_1","003_35_1","EXO","35","1","1","Then Moses assembled the whole congregation of Israel and said to them, “These are the things that the LORD has commanded you to do: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_2","003_35_2","EXO","35","2","2","For six days work may be done, but the seventh day shall be your holy day, a Sabbath of complete rest to the LORD. Whoever does any work on that day must be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_3","003_35_3","EXO","35","3","3","Do not light a fire in any of your dwellings on the Sabbath day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_4","003_35_4","EXO","35","4","4","Moses also told the whole congregation of Israel, “This is what the LORD has commanded: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_5","003_35_5","EXO","35","5","5","Take from among you an offering to the LORD. Let everyone whose heart is willing bring an offering to the LORD: gold, silver, and bronze; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_6","003_35_6","EXO","35","6","6","blue, purple, and scarlet yarn; fine linen and goat hair; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_7","003_35_7","EXO","35","7","7","ram skins dyed red and fine leather; acacia wood; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_8","003_35_8","EXO","35","8","8","olive oil for the light; spices for the anointing oil and for the fragrant incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_9","003_35_9","EXO","35","9","9","and onyx stones and gemstones to be mounted on the ephod and breastpiece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_10","003_35_10","EXO","35","10","10","Let every skilled craftsman among you come and make everything that the LORD has commanded: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_11","003_35_11","EXO","35","11","11","the tabernacle with its tent and covering, its clasps and frames, its crossbars, posts, and bases; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_12","003_35_12","EXO","35","12","12","the ark with its poles and mercy seat, and the veil to shield it; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_13","003_35_13","EXO","35","13","13","the table with its poles, all its utensils, and the Bread of the Presence; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_14","003_35_14","EXO","35","14","14","the lampstand for light with its accessories and lamps and oil for the light; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_15","003_35_15","EXO","35","15","15","the altar of incense with its poles; the anointing oil and fragrant incense; the curtain for the doorway at the entrance to the tabernacle; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_16","003_35_16","EXO","35","16","16","the altar of burnt offering with its bronze grate, its poles, and all its utensils; the basin with its stand; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_17","003_35_17","EXO","35","17","17","the curtains of the courtyard with its posts and bases, and the curtain for the gate of the courtyard; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_18","003_35_18","EXO","35","18","18","the tent pegs for the tabernacle and for the courtyard, along with their ropes; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_19","003_35_19","EXO","35","19","19","and the woven garments for ministering in the holy place—both the holy garments for Aaron the priest and the garments for his sons to serve as priests.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_20","003_35_20","EXO","35","20","20","Then the whole congregation of Israel withdrew from the presence of Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_21","003_35_21","EXO","35","21","21","And everyone whose heart stirred him and whose spirit prompted him came and brought an offering to the LORD for the work on the Tent of Meeting, for all its services, and for the holy garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_22","003_35_22","EXO","35","22","22","So all who had willing hearts, both men and women, came and brought brooches and earrings, rings and necklaces, and all kinds of gold jewelry. And they all presented their gold as a wave offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_23","003_35_23","EXO","35","23","23","Everyone who had blue, purple, or scarlet yarn, or fine linen, goat hair, ram skins dyed red, or articles of fine leather, brought them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_24","003_35_24","EXO","35","24","24","And all who could present an offering of silver or bronze brought it as a contribution to the LORD. Also, everyone who had acacia wood for any part of the service brought it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_25","003_35_25","EXO","35","25","25","Every skilled woman spun with her hands and brought what she had spun: blue, purple, or scarlet yarn, or fine linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_26","003_35_26","EXO","35","26","26","And all the skilled women whose hearts were stirred spun the goat hair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_27","003_35_27","EXO","35","27","27","The leaders brought onyx stones and gemstones to mount on the ephod and breastpiece, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_28","003_35_28","EXO","35","28","28","as well as spices and olive oil for the light, for the anointing oil, and for the fragrant incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_29","003_35_29","EXO","35","29","29","So all the men and women of the Israelites whose hearts prompted them brought a freewill offering to the LORD for all the work that the LORD through Moses had commanded them to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_30","003_35_30","EXO","35","30","30","Then Moses said to the Israelites, “See, the LORD has called by name Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_31","003_35_31","EXO","35","31","31","And He has filled him with the Spirit of God, with skill, ability, and knowledge in all kinds of craftsmanship, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_32","003_35_32","EXO","35","32","32","to design artistic works in gold, silver, and bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_33","003_35_33","EXO","35","33","33","to cut gemstones for settings, and to carve wood, so that he may be a master of every artistic craft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_34","003_35_34","EXO","35","34","34","And the LORD has given both him and Oholiab son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan, the ability to teach others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX35_35","003_35_35","EXO","35","35","35","He has filled them with skill to do all kinds of work as engravers, designers, embroiderers in blue, purple, and scarlet yarn and fine linen, and as weavers—as artistic designers of every kind of craft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_1","003_36_1","EXO","36","1","1","“So Bezalel, Oholiab, and every skilled person are to carry out everything commanded by the LORD, who has given them skill and ability to know how to perform all the work of constructing the sanctuary.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_2","003_36_2","EXO","36","2","2","Then Moses summoned Bezalel, Oholiab, and every skilled person whom the LORD had gifted—everyone whose heart stirred him to come and do the work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_3","003_36_3","EXO","36","3","3","They received from Moses all the contributions that the Israelites had brought to carry out the service of constructing the sanctuary. Meanwhile, the people continued to bring freewill offerings morning after morning, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_4","003_36_4","EXO","36","4","4","so that all the skilled craftsmen who were doing all the work on the sanctuary left their work ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_5","003_36_5","EXO","36","5","5","and said to Moses, “The people are bringing more than enough for doing the work the LORD has commanded us to do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_6","003_36_6","EXO","36","6","6","After Moses had given an order, they sent a proclamation throughout the camp: “No man or woman should make anything else as an offering for the sanctuary.” So the people were restrained from bringing more, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_7","003_36_7","EXO","36","7","7","since what they already had was more than enough to perform all the work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_8","003_36_8","EXO","36","8","8","All the skilled craftsmen among the workmen made the ten curtains for the tabernacle. They were made of finely spun linen, as well as blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, with cherubim skillfully worked into them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_9","003_36_9","EXO","36","9","9","Each curtain was twenty-eight cubits long and four cubits wide; all the curtains were the same size. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_10","003_36_10","EXO","36","10","10","And he joined five of the curtains together, and the other five he joined as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_11","003_36_11","EXO","36","11","11","He made loops of blue material on the edge of the end curtain in the first set, and also on the end curtain in the second set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_12","003_36_12","EXO","36","12","12","He made fifty loops on one curtain and fifty loops on the end curtain of the second set, so that the loops lined up opposite one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_13","003_36_13","EXO","36","13","13","He also made fifty gold clasps to join the curtains together, so that the tabernacle was a unit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_14","003_36_14","EXO","36","14","14","He then made curtains of goat hair for the tent over the tabernacle—eleven curtains in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_15","003_36_15","EXO","36","15","15","Each of the eleven curtains was the same size—thirty cubits long and four cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_16","003_36_16","EXO","36","16","16","He joined five of the curtains into one set and the other six into another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_17","003_36_17","EXO","36","17","17","He made fifty loops along the edge of the end curtain in the first set, and fifty loops along the edge of the corresponding curtain in the second set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_18","003_36_18","EXO","36","18","18","He also made fifty bronze clasps to join the tent together as a unit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_19","003_36_19","EXO","36","19","19","Additionally, he made for the tent a covering of ram skins dyed red, and over that a covering of fine leather. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_20","003_36_20","EXO","36","20","20","Next, he constructed upright frames of acacia wood for the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_21","003_36_21","EXO","36","21","21","Each frame was ten cubits long and a cubit and a half wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_22","003_36_22","EXO","36","22","22","Two tenons were connected to each other for each frame. He made all the frames of the tabernacle in this way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_23","003_36_23","EXO","36","23","23","He constructed twenty frames for the south side of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_24","003_36_24","EXO","36","24","24","with forty silver bases to put under the twenty frames—two bases for each frame, one under each tenon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_25","003_36_25","EXO","36","25","25","For the second side of the tabernacle, the north side, he made twenty frames ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_26","003_36_26","EXO","36","26","26","and forty silver bases—two bases under each frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_27","003_36_27","EXO","36","27","27","He made six frames for the rear of the tabernacle, the west side, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_28","003_36_28","EXO","36","28","28","and two frames for the two back corners of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_29","003_36_29","EXO","36","29","29","coupled together from bottom to top and fitted into a single ring. He made both corners in this way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_30","003_36_30","EXO","36","30","30","So there were eight frames and sixteen silver bases—two under each frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_31","003_36_31","EXO","36","31","31","He also made five crossbars of acacia wood for the frames on one side of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_32","003_36_32","EXO","36","32","32","five for those on the other side, and five for those on the rear side of the tabernacle, to the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_33","003_36_33","EXO","36","33","33","He made the central crossbar to run through the center of the frames, from one end to the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_34","003_36_34","EXO","36","34","34","And he overlaid the frames with gold and made gold rings to hold the crossbars. He also overlaid the crossbars with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_35","003_36_35","EXO","36","35","35","Next, he made the veil of blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen, with cherubim skillfully worked into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_36","003_36_36","EXO","36","36","36","He also made four posts of acacia wood for it and overlaid them with gold, along with gold hooks; and he cast four silver bases for the posts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_37","003_36_37","EXO","36","37","37","For the entrance to the tent, he made a curtain embroidered with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX36_38","003_36_38","EXO","36","38","38","together with five posts and their hooks. He overlaid the tops of the posts and their bands with gold, and their five bases were bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_1","003_37_1","EXO","37","1","1","Bezalel went on to construct the ark of acacia wood, two and a half cubits long, a cubit and a half wide, and a cubit and a half high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_2","003_37_2","EXO","37","2","2","He overlaid it with pure gold, both inside and out, and made a gold molding around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_3","003_37_3","EXO","37","3","3","And he cast four gold rings for its four feet, two rings on one side and two on the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_4","003_37_4","EXO","37","4","4","Then he made poles of acacia wood and overlaid them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_5","003_37_5","EXO","37","5","5","He inserted the poles into the rings on the sides of the ark in order to carry it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_6","003_37_6","EXO","37","6","6","He constructed a mercy seat of pure gold, two and a half cubits long and a cubit and a half wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_7","003_37_7","EXO","37","7","7","He made two cherubim of hammered gold at the ends of the mercy seat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_8","003_37_8","EXO","37","8","8","one cherub on one end and one on the other, all made from one piece of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_9","003_37_9","EXO","37","9","9","And the cherubim had wings that spread upward, overshadowing the mercy seat. The cherubim faced each other, looking toward the mercy seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_10","003_37_10","EXO","37","10","10","He also made the table of acacia wood two cubits long, a cubit wide, and a cubit and a half high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_11","003_37_11","EXO","37","11","11","He overlaid it with pure gold and made a gold molding around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_12","003_37_12","EXO","37","12","12","And he made a rim around it a handbreadth wide and put a gold molding on the rim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_13","003_37_13","EXO","37","13","13","He cast four gold rings for the table and fastened them to the four corners at its four legs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_14","003_37_14","EXO","37","14","14","The rings were placed close to the rim, to serve as holders for the poles used to carry the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_15","003_37_15","EXO","37","15","15","He made the poles of acacia wood for carrying the table and overlaid them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_16","003_37_16","EXO","37","16","16","He also made the utensils for the table out of pure gold: its plates and dishes, as well as its bowls and pitchers for pouring drink offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_17","003_37_17","EXO","37","17","17","Then he made the lampstand out of pure hammered gold, all of one piece: its base and shaft, its cups, and its buds and petals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_18","003_37_18","EXO","37","18","18","Six branches extended from the sides, three on one side and three on the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_19","003_37_19","EXO","37","19","19","There were three cups shaped like almond blossoms on the first branch, each with buds and petals, three on the next branch, and the same for all six branches that extended from the lampstand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_20","003_37_20","EXO","37","20","20","And on the lampstand were four cups shaped like almond blossoms with buds and petals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_21","003_37_21","EXO","37","21","21","A bud was under the first pair of branches that extended from the lampstand, a bud under the second pair, and a bud under the third pair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_22","003_37_22","EXO","37","22","22","The buds and branches were all of one piece with the lampstand, hammered out of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_23","003_37_23","EXO","37","23","23","He also made its seven lamps, its wick trimmers, and trays of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_24","003_37_24","EXO","37","24","24","He made the lampstand and all its utensils from a talent of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_25","003_37_25","EXO","37","25","25","He made the altar of incense out of acacia wood. It was square, a cubit long, a cubit wide, and two cubits high. Its horns were of one piece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_26","003_37_26","EXO","37","26","26","And he overlaid with pure gold the top and all the sides and horns. Then he made a molding of gold around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_27","003_37_27","EXO","37","27","27","He made two gold rings below the molding on opposite sides to hold the poles used to carry it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_28","003_37_28","EXO","37","28","28","And he made the poles of acacia wood and overlaid them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX37_29","003_37_29","EXO","37","29","29","He also made the sacred anointing oil and the pure, fragrant incense, the work of a perfumer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_1","003_38_1","EXO","38","1","1","Bezalel constructed the altar of burnt offering from acacia wood. It was square, five cubits long, five cubits wide, and three cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_2","003_38_2","EXO","38","2","2","He made a horn at each of its four corners, so that the horns and altar were of one piece, and he overlaid the altar with bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_3","003_38_3","EXO","38","3","3","He made all the altar’s utensils of bronze—its pots, shovels, sprinkling bowls, meat forks, and firepans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_4","003_38_4","EXO","38","4","4","He made a grate of bronze mesh for the altar under its ledge, halfway up from the bottom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_5","003_38_5","EXO","38","5","5","At the four corners of the bronze grate he cast four rings as holders for the poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_6","003_38_6","EXO","38","6","6","And he made the poles of acacia wood and overlaid them with bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_7","003_38_7","EXO","38","7","7","Then he inserted the poles into the rings on the sides of the altar for carrying it. He made the altar with boards so that it was hollow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_8","003_38_8","EXO","38","8","8","Next he made the bronze basin and its stand from the mirrors of the women who served at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_9","003_38_9","EXO","38","9","9","Then he constructed the courtyard. The south side of the courtyard was a hundred cubits long and had curtains of finely spun linen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_10","003_38_10","EXO","38","10","10","with twenty posts and twenty bronze bases, and with silver hooks and bands on the posts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_11","003_38_11","EXO","38","11","11","The north side was also a hundred cubits long, with twenty posts and twenty bronze bases. The hooks and bands of the posts were silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_12","003_38_12","EXO","38","12","12","The west side was fifty cubits long and had curtains, with ten posts and ten bases. The hooks and bands of the posts were silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_13","003_38_13","EXO","38","13","13","And the east side, toward the sunrise, was also fifty cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_14","003_38_14","EXO","38","14","14","The curtains on one side of the entrance were fifteen cubits long, with three posts and three bases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_15","003_38_15","EXO","38","15","15","And the curtains on the other side were also fifteen cubits long, with three posts and three bases as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_16","003_38_16","EXO","38","16","16","All the curtains around the courtyard were made of finely spun linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_17","003_38_17","EXO","38","17","17","The bases for the posts were bronze, the hooks and bands were silver, and the plating for the tops of the posts was silver. So all the posts of the courtyard were banded with silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_18","003_38_18","EXO","38","18","18","The curtain for the entrance to the courtyard was embroidered with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and finely spun linen. It was twenty cubits long and, like the curtains of the courtyard, five cubits high, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_19","003_38_19","EXO","38","19","19","with four posts and four bronze bases. Their hooks were silver, as well as the bands and the plating of their tops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_20","003_38_20","EXO","38","20","20","All the tent pegs for the tabernacle and for the surrounding courtyard were bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_21","003_38_21","EXO","38","21","21","This is the inventory for the tabernacle, the tabernacle of the Testimony, as recorded at Moses’ command by the Levites under the direction of Ithamar son of Aaron the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_22","003_38_22","EXO","38","22","22","Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah, made everything that the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_23","003_38_23","EXO","38","23","23","With him was Oholiab son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan, an engraver, designer, and embroiderer in blue, purple, and scarlet yarn and fine linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_24","003_38_24","EXO","38","24","24","All the gold from the wave offering used for the work on the sanctuary totaled 29 talents and 730 shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_25","003_38_25","EXO","38","25","25","The silver from those numbered among the congregation totaled 100 talents and 1,775 shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_26","003_38_26","EXO","38","26","26","a beka per person, that is, half a shekel, according to the sanctuary shekel, from everyone twenty years of age or older who had crossed over to be numbered, a total of 603,550 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_27","003_38_27","EXO","38","27","27","The hundred talents of silver were used to cast the bases of the sanctuary and the bases of the veil—100 bases from the 100 talents, one talent per base. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_28","003_38_28","EXO","38","28","28","With the 1,775 shekels of silver he made the hooks for the posts, overlaid their tops, and supplied bands for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_29","003_38_29","EXO","38","29","29","The bronze from the wave offering totaled 70 talents and 2,400 shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_30","003_38_30","EXO","38","30","30","He used it to make the bases for the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, the bronze altar and its bronze grating, all the utensils for the altar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX38_31","003_38_31","EXO","38","31","31","the bases for the surrounding courtyard and its gate, and all the tent pegs for the tabernacle and its surrounding courtyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_1","003_39_1","EXO","39","1","1","From the blue, purple, and scarlet yarn they made specially woven garments for ministry in the sanctuary, as well as the holy garments for Aaron, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_2","003_39_2","EXO","39","2","2","Bezalel made the ephod of finely spun linen embroidered with gold, and with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_3","003_39_3","EXO","39","3","3","They hammered out thin sheets of gold and cut threads from them to interweave with the blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and fine linen—the work of a skilled craftsman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_4","003_39_4","EXO","39","4","4","They made shoulder pieces for the ephod, which were attached at two of its corners, so it could be fastened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_5","003_39_5","EXO","39","5","5","And the skillfully woven waistband of the ephod was of one piece with the ephod, of the same workmanship—with gold, with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and with finely spun linen, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_6","003_39_6","EXO","39","6","6","They mounted the onyx stones in gold filigree settings, engraved like a seal with the names of the sons of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_7","003_39_7","EXO","39","7","7","Then they fastened them on the shoulder pieces of the ephod as memorial stones for the sons of Israel, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_8","003_39_8","EXO","39","8","8","He made the breastpiece with the same workmanship as the ephod, with gold, with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, and with finely spun linen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_9","003_39_9","EXO","39","9","9","It was square when folded over double, a span long and a span wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_10","003_39_10","EXO","39","10","10","And they mounted on it four rows of gemstones: The first row had a ruby, a topaz, and an emerald; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_11","003_39_11","EXO","39","11","11","the second row had a turquoise, a sapphire, and a diamond; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_12","003_39_12","EXO","39","12","12","the third row had a jacinth, an agate, and an amethyst; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_13","003_39_13","EXO","39","13","13","and the fourth row had a beryl, an onyx, and a jasper. These stones were mounted in gold filigree settings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_14","003_39_14","EXO","39","14","14","The twelve stones corresponded to the names of the sons of Israel. Each stone was engraved like a seal with the name of one of the twelve tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_15","003_39_15","EXO","39","15","15","For the breastpiece they made braided chains like cords of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_16","003_39_16","EXO","39","16","16","They also made two gold filigree settings and two gold rings, and fastened the two rings to the two corners of the breastpiece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_17","003_39_17","EXO","39","17","17","Then they fastened the two gold chains to the two gold rings at the corners of the breastpiece, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_18","003_39_18","EXO","39","18","18","and they fastened the other ends of the two chains to the two filigree settings, attaching them to the shoulder pieces of the ephod at the front. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_19","003_39_19","EXO","39","19","19","They made two more gold rings and attached them to the other two corners of the breastpiece, on the inside edge next to the ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_20","003_39_20","EXO","39","20","20","They made two additional gold rings and attached them to the bottom of the two shoulder pieces of the ephod, on its front, near the seam just above its woven waistband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_21","003_39_21","EXO","39","21","21","Then they tied the rings of the breastpiece to the rings of the ephod with a cord of blue yarn, so that the breastpiece was above the waistband of the ephod and would not swing out from the ephod, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_22","003_39_22","EXO","39","22","22","They made the robe of the ephod entirely of blue cloth, the work of a weaver, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_23","003_39_23","EXO","39","23","23","with an opening in the center of the robe like that of a garment, with a collar around the opening so that it would not tear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_24","003_39_24","EXO","39","24","24","They made pomegranates of blue, purple, and scarlet yarn and finely spun linen on the lower hem of the robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_25","003_39_25","EXO","39","25","25","They also made bells of pure gold and attached them around the hem between the pomegranates, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_26","003_39_26","EXO","39","26","26","alternating the bells and pomegranates around the lower hem of the robe to be worn for ministry, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_27","003_39_27","EXO","39","27","27","For Aaron and his sons they made tunics of fine linen, the work of a weaver, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_28","003_39_28","EXO","39","28","28","as well as the turban of fine linen, the ornate headbands and undergarments of finely spun linen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_29","003_39_29","EXO","39","29","29","and the sash of finely spun linen, embroidered with blue, purple, and scarlet yarn, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_30","003_39_30","EXO","39","30","30","They also made the plate of the holy crown of pure gold, and they engraved on it, like an inscription on a seal: HOLY TO THE LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_31","003_39_31","EXO","39","31","31","Then they fastened to it a blue cord to mount it on the turban, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_32","003_39_32","EXO","39","32","32","So all the work for the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting, was completed. The Israelites did everything just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_33","003_39_33","EXO","39","33","33","Then they brought the tabernacle to Moses: the tent with all its furnishings, its clasps, its frames, its crossbars, and its posts and bases; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_34","003_39_34","EXO","39","34","34","the covering of ram skins dyed red, the covering of fine leather, and the veil of the covering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_35","003_39_35","EXO","39","35","35","the ark of the Testimony with its poles and the mercy seat; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_36","003_39_36","EXO","39","36","36","the table with all its utensils and the Bread of the Presence; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_37","003_39_37","EXO","39","37","37","the pure gold lampstand with its row of lamps and all its utensils, as well as the oil for the light; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_38","003_39_38","EXO","39","38","38","the gold altar, the anointing oil, the fragrant incense, and the curtain for the entrance to the tent; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_39","003_39_39","EXO","39","39","39","the bronze altar with its bronze grating, its poles, and all its utensils; the basin with its stand; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_40","003_39_40","EXO","39","40","40","the curtains of the courtyard with its posts and bases; the curtain for the gate of the courtyard, its ropes and tent pegs, and all the equipment for the service of the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_41","003_39_41","EXO","39","41","41","and the woven garments for ministering in the sanctuary, both the holy garments for Aaron the priest and the garments for his sons to serve as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_42","003_39_42","EXO","39","42","42","The Israelites had done all the work just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX39_43","003_39_43","EXO","39","43","43","And Moses inspected all the work and saw that they had accomplished it just as the LORD had commanded. So Moses blessed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_1","003_40_1","EXO","40","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_2","003_40_2","EXO","40","2","2","“On the first day of the first month you are to set up the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_3","003_40_3","EXO","40","3","3","Put the ark of the Testimony in it and screen off the ark with the veil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_4","003_40_4","EXO","40","4","4","Then bring in the table and set out its arrangement; bring in the lampstand as well, and set up its lamps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_5","003_40_5","EXO","40","5","5","Place the gold altar of incense in front of the ark of the Testimony, and hang the curtain at the entrance to the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_6","003_40_6","EXO","40","6","6","Place the altar of burnt offering in front of the entrance to the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_7","003_40_7","EXO","40","7","7","And place the basin between the Tent of Meeting and the altar, and put water in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_8","003_40_8","EXO","40","8","8","Set up the surrounding courtyard and hang the curtain for the entrance to the courtyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_9","003_40_9","EXO","40","9","9","Take the anointing oil and anoint the tabernacle and everything in it; consecrate it along with all its furnishings, and it shall be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_10","003_40_10","EXO","40","10","10","Anoint the altar of burnt offering and all its utensils; consecrate the altar, and it shall be most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_11","003_40_11","EXO","40","11","11","Anoint the basin and its stand and consecrate them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_12","003_40_12","EXO","40","12","12","Then bring Aaron and his sons to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting and wash them with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_13","003_40_13","EXO","40","13","13","And you are to clothe Aaron with the holy garments, anoint him, and consecrate him, so that he may serve Me as a priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_14","003_40_14","EXO","40","14","14","Bring his sons forward and clothe them with tunics. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_15","003_40_15","EXO","40","15","15","Anoint them just as you anointed their father, so that they may also serve Me as priests. Their anointing will qualify them for a permanent priesthood throughout their generations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_16","003_40_16","EXO","40","16","16","Moses did everything just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_17","003_40_17","EXO","40","17","17","So the tabernacle was set up on the first day of the first month of the second year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_18","003_40_18","EXO","40","18","18","When Moses set up the tabernacle, he laid its bases, positioned its frames, inserted its crossbars, and set up its posts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_19","003_40_19","EXO","40","19","19","Then he spread the tent over the tabernacle and put the covering over the tent, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_20","003_40_20","EXO","40","20","20","Moses took the Testimony and placed it in the ark, attaching the poles to the ark; and he set the mercy seat atop the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_21","003_40_21","EXO","40","21","21","Then he brought the ark into the tabernacle, put up the veil for the screen, and shielded off the ark of the Testimony, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_22","003_40_22","EXO","40","22","22","Moses placed the table in the Tent of Meeting on the north side of the tabernacle, outside the veil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_23","003_40_23","EXO","40","23","23","He arranged the bread on it before the LORD, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_24","003_40_24","EXO","40","24","24","He also placed the lampstand in the Tent of Meeting opposite the table on the south side of the tabernacle ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_25","003_40_25","EXO","40","25","25","and set up the lamps before the LORD, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_26","003_40_26","EXO","40","26","26","Moses placed the gold altar in the Tent of Meeting, in front of the veil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_27","003_40_27","EXO","40","27","27","and he burned fragrant incense on it, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_28","003_40_28","EXO","40","28","28","Then he put up the curtain at the entrance to the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_29","003_40_29","EXO","40","29","29","He placed the altar of burnt offering near the entrance to the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting, and offered on it the burnt offering and the grain offering, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_30","003_40_30","EXO","40","30","30","He placed the basin between the Tent of Meeting and the altar and put water in it for washing; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_31","003_40_31","EXO","40","31","31","and from it Moses, Aaron, and his sons washed their hands and feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_32","003_40_32","EXO","40","32","32","They washed whenever they entered the Tent of Meeting or approached the altar, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_33","003_40_33","EXO","40","33","33","And Moses set up the courtyard around the tabernacle and the altar, and he hung the curtain for the entrance to the courtyard. So Moses finished the work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_34","003_40_34","EXO","40","34","34","Then the cloud covered the Tent of Meeting, and the glory of the LORD filled the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_35","003_40_35","EXO","40","35","35","Moses was unable to enter the Tent of Meeting because the cloud had settled on it, and the glory of the LORD filled the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_36","003_40_36","EXO","40","36","36","Whenever the cloud was lifted from above the tabernacle, the Israelites would set out through all the stages of their journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_37","003_40_37","EXO","40","37","37","If the cloud was not lifted, they would not set out until the day it was taken up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EX40_38","003_40_38","EXO","40","38","38","For the cloud of the LORD was over the tabernacle by day, and fire was in the cloud by night, in the sight of all the house of Israel through all their journeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_1","004_1_1","LEV","1","1","1","Then the LORD called to Moses and spoke to him from the Tent of Meeting, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_2","004_1_2","LEV","1","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: When any of you brings an offering to the LORD, you may bring as your offering an animal from the herd or the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_3","004_1_3","LEV","1","3","3","If his offering is a burnt offering from the herd, he is to present an unblemished male. He must bring it to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting for its acceptance before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_4","004_1_4","LEV","1","4","4","He is to lay his hand on the head of the burnt offering, so it can be accepted on his behalf to make atonement for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_5","004_1_5","LEV","1","5","5","And he shall slaughter the young bull before the LORD, and Aaron’s sons the priests are to present the blood and splatter it on all sides of the altar at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_6","004_1_6","LEV","1","6","6","Next, he is to skin the burnt offering and cut it into pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_7","004_1_7","LEV","1","7","7","The sons of Aaron the priest shall put a fire on the altar and arrange wood on the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_8","004_1_8","LEV","1","8","8","Then Aaron’s sons the priests are to arrange the pieces, including the head and the fat, atop the burning wood on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_9","004_1_9","LEV","1","9","9","The entrails and legs must be washed with water, and the priest shall burn all of it on the altar as a burnt offering, a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_10","004_1_10","LEV","1","10","10","If, however, one’s offering is a burnt offering from the flock—from the sheep or goats—he is to present an unblemished male. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_11","004_1_11","LEV","1","11","11","He shall slaughter it on the north side of the altar before the LORD, and Aaron’s sons the priests are to splatter its blood against the altar on all sides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_12","004_1_12","LEV","1","12","12","He is to cut the animal into pieces, and the priest shall arrange them, including the head and fat, atop the burning wood that is on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_13","004_1_13","LEV","1","13","13","The entrails and legs must be washed with water, and the priest shall present all of it and burn it on the altar; it is a burnt offering, a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_14","004_1_14","LEV","1","14","14","If, instead, one’s offering to the LORD is a burnt offering of birds, he is to present a turtledove or a young pigeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_15","004_1_15","LEV","1","15","15","Then the priest shall bring it to the altar, twist off its head, and burn it on the altar; its blood should be drained out on the side of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_16","004_1_16","LEV","1","16","16","And he is to remove the crop with its contents and throw it to the east side of the altar, in the place for ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV1_17","004_1_17","LEV","1","17","17","He shall tear it open by its wings, without dividing the bird completely. And the priest is to burn it on the altar atop the burning wood. It is a burnt offering, a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_1","004_2_1","LEV","2","1","1","“When anyone brings a grain offering to the LORD, his offering must consist of fine flour. He is to pour olive oil on it, put frankincense on it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_2","004_2_2","LEV","2","2","2","and bring it to Aaron’s sons the priests. The priest shall take a handful of the flour and oil, together with all the frankincense, and burn this as a memorial portion on the altar, a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_3","004_2_3","LEV","2","3","3","The remainder of the grain offering shall belong to Aaron and his sons; it is a most holy part of the food offerings to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_4","004_2_4","LEV","2","4","4","Now if you bring an offering of grain baked in an oven, it must consist of fine flour, either unleavened cakes mixed with oil or unleavened wafers coated with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_5","004_2_5","LEV","2","5","5","If your offering is a grain offering prepared on a griddle, it must be unleavened bread made of fine flour mixed with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_6","004_2_6","LEV","2","6","6","Crumble it and pour oil on it; it is a grain offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_7","004_2_7","LEV","2","7","7","If your offering is a grain offering cooked in a pan, it must consist of fine flour with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_8","004_2_8","LEV","2","8","8","When you bring to the LORD the grain offering made in any of these ways, it is to be presented to the priest, and he shall take it to the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_9","004_2_9","LEV","2","9","9","The priest is to remove the memorial portion from the grain offering and burn it on the altar as a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_10","004_2_10","LEV","2","10","10","But the remainder of the grain offering shall belong to Aaron and his sons; it is a most holy part of the food offerings to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_11","004_2_11","LEV","2","11","11","No grain offering that you present to the LORD may be made with leaven, for you are not to burn any leaven or honey as a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_12","004_2_12","LEV","2","12","12","You may bring them to the LORD as an offering of firstfruits, but they must not go up on the altar as a pleasing aroma. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_13","004_2_13","LEV","2","13","13","And you shall season each of your grain offerings with salt. You must not leave the salt of the covenant of your God out of your grain offering; you are to add salt to each of your offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_14","004_2_14","LEV","2","14","14","If you bring a grain offering of firstfruits to the LORD, you shall offer crushed heads of new grain roasted on the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_15","004_2_15","LEV","2","15","15","And you are to put oil and frankincense on it; it is a grain offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV2_16","004_2_16","LEV","2","16","16","The priest shall then burn the memorial portion of the crushed grain and the oil, together with all its frankincense, as a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_1","004_3_1","LEV","3","1","1","“If one’s offering is a peace offering and he offers an animal from the herd, whether male or female, he must present it without blemish before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_2","004_3_2","LEV","3","2","2","He is to lay his hand on the head of the offering and slaughter it at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. Then Aaron’s sons the priests shall splatter the blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_3","004_3_3","LEV","3","3","3","From the peace offering he is to bring a food offering to the LORD: the fat that covers the entrails, all the fat that is on them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_4","004_3_4","LEV","3","4","4","both kidneys with the fat on them near the loins, and the lobe of the liver, which he is to remove with the kidneys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_5","004_3_5","LEV","3","5","5","Then Aaron’s sons are to burn it on the altar atop the burnt offering that is on the burning wood, as a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_6","004_3_6","LEV","3","6","6","If, however, one’s peace offering to the LORD is from the flock, he must present a male or female without blemish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_7","004_3_7","LEV","3","7","7","If he is presenting a lamb for his offering, he must present it before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_8","004_3_8","LEV","3","8","8","He is to lay his hand on the head of his offering and slaughter it in front of the Tent of Meeting. Then Aaron’s sons shall splatter its blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_9","004_3_9","LEV","3","9","9","And from the peace offering he shall bring a food offering to the LORD consisting of its fat: the entire fat tail cut off close to the backbone, the fat that covers the entrails, all the fat that is on them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_10","004_3_10","LEV","3","10","10","both kidneys with the fat on them near the loins, and the lobe of the liver, which he is to remove with the kidneys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_11","004_3_11","LEV","3","11","11","Then the priest is to burn them on the altar as food, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_12","004_3_12","LEV","3","12","12","If one’s offering is a goat, he is to present it before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_13","004_3_13","LEV","3","13","13","He must lay his hand on its head and slaughter it in front of the Tent of Meeting. Then Aaron’s sons shall splatter its blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_14","004_3_14","LEV","3","14","14","And from his offering he shall present a food offering to the LORD: the fat that covers the entrails, all the fat that is on them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_15","004_3_15","LEV","3","15","15","both kidneys with the fat on them near the loins, and the lobe of the liver, which he is to remove with the kidneys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_16","004_3_16","LEV","3","16","16","Then the priest is to burn the food on the altar as a food offering, a pleasing aroma. All the fat is the LORD’s. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV3_17","004_3_17","LEV","3","17","17","This is a permanent statute for the generations to come, wherever you live: You must not eat any fat or any blood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_1","004_4_1","LEV","4","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_2","004_4_2","LEV","4","2","2","“Tell the Israelites to do as follows with one who sins unintentionally against any of the LORD’s commandments and does what is forbidden by them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_3","004_4_3","LEV","4","3","3","If the anointed priest sins, bringing guilt on the people, he must bring to the LORD a young bull without blemish as a sin offering for the sin he has committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_4","004_4_4","LEV","4","4","4","He must bring the bull to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting before the LORD, lay his hand on the bull’s head, and slaughter it before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_5","004_4_5","LEV","4","5","5","Then the anointed priest shall take some of the bull’s blood and bring it into the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_6","004_4_6","LEV","4","6","6","The priest is to dip his finger in the blood and sprinkle some of it seven times before the LORD, in front of the veil of the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_7","004_4_7","LEV","4","7","7","The priest must then put some of the blood on the horns of the altar of fragrant incense that is before the LORD in the Tent of Meeting. And he is to pour out the rest of the bull’s blood at the base of the altar of burnt offering at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_8","004_4_8","LEV","4","8","8","Then he shall remove all the fat from the bull of the sin offering—the fat that covers the entrails, all the fat that is on them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_9","004_4_9","LEV","4","9","9","both kidneys with the fat on them near the loins, and the lobe of the liver, which he is to remove with the kidneys— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_10","004_4_10","LEV","4","10","10","just as the fat is removed from the ox of the peace offering. Then the priest shall burn them on the altar of burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_11","004_4_11","LEV","4","11","11","But the hide of the bull and all its flesh, with its head and legs and its entrails and dung— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_12","004_4_12","LEV","4","12","12","all the rest of the bull—he must take outside the camp to a ceremonially clean place where the ashes are poured out, and there he must burn it on a wood fire on the ash heap. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_13","004_4_13","LEV","4","13","13","Now if the whole congregation of Israel strays unintentionally and the matter escapes the notice of the assembly so that they violate any of the LORD’s commandments and incur guilt by doing what is forbidden, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_14","004_4_14","LEV","4","14","14","when they become aware of the sin they have committed, then the assembly must bring a young bull as a sin offering and present it before the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_15","004_4_15","LEV","4","15","15","The elders of the congregation are to lay their hands on the bull’s head before the LORD, and it shall be slaughtered before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_16","004_4_16","LEV","4","16","16","Then the anointed priest is to bring some of the bull’s blood into the Tent of Meeting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_17","004_4_17","LEV","4","17","17","and he is to dip his finger in the blood and sprinkle it seven times before the LORD in front of the veil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_18","004_4_18","LEV","4","18","18","He is also to put some of the blood on the horns of the altar that is before the LORD in the Tent of Meeting, and he must pour out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar of burnt offering at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_19","004_4_19","LEV","4","19","19","And he is to remove all the fat from it and burn it on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_20","004_4_20","LEV","4","20","20","He shall offer this bull just as he did the bull for the sin offering; in this way the priest will make atonement on their behalf, and they will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_21","004_4_21","LEV","4","21","21","Then he is to take the bull outside the camp and burn it, just as he burned the first bull. It is the sin offering for the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_22","004_4_22","LEV","4","22","22","When a leader sins unintentionally and does what is prohibited by any of the commandments of the LORD his God, he incurs guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_23","004_4_23","LEV","4","23","23","When he becomes aware of the sin he has committed, he must bring an unblemished male goat as his offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_24","004_4_24","LEV","4","24","24","He is to lay his hand on the head of the goat and slaughter it at the place where the burnt offering is slaughtered before the LORD. It is a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_25","004_4_25","LEV","4","25","25","Then the priest is to take some of the blood of the sin offering with his finger, put it on the horns of the altar of burnt offering, and pour out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_26","004_4_26","LEV","4","26","26","He must burn all its fat on the altar, like the fat of the peace offerings; thus the priest will make atonement for that man’s sin, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_27","004_4_27","LEV","4","27","27","And if one of the common people sins unintentionally and does what is prohibited by any of the LORD’s commandments, he incurs guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_28","004_4_28","LEV","4","28","28","When he becomes aware of the sin he has committed, he must bring an unblemished female goat as his offering for that sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_29","004_4_29","LEV","4","29","29","He is to lay his hand on the head of the sin offering and slaughter it at the place of the burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_30","004_4_30","LEV","4","30","30","Then the priest is to take some of its blood with his finger, put it on the horns of the altar of burnt offering, and pour out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_31","004_4_31","LEV","4","31","31","Then he is to remove all the fat, just as it is removed from the peace offering, and the priest is to burn it on the altar as a pleasing aroma to the LORD. In this way the priest will make atonement for him, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_32","004_4_32","LEV","4","32","32","If, however, he brings a lamb as a sin offering, he must bring an unblemished female. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_33","004_4_33","LEV","4","33","33","And he is to lay his hand on the head of the sin offering and slaughter it as a sin offering at the place where the burnt offering is slaughtered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_34","004_4_34","LEV","4","34","34","Then the priest is to take some of the blood of the sin offering with his finger, put it on the horns of the altar of burnt offering, and pour out the rest of its blood at the base of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV4_35","004_4_35","LEV","4","35","35","And he shall remove all the fat, just as the fat of the lamb is removed from the peace offerings, and he shall burn it on the altar along with the food offerings to the LORD. In this way the priest will make atonement for him for the sin he has committed, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_1","004_5_1","LEV","5","1","1","“If someone sins by failing to testify when he hears a public charge about something he has witnessed, whether he has seen it or learned of it, he shall bear the iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_2","004_5_2","LEV","5","2","2","Or if a person touches anything unclean—whether the carcass of any unclean wild animal or livestock or crawling creature—even if he is unaware of it, he is unclean and guilty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_3","004_5_3","LEV","5","3","3","Or if he touches human uncleanness—anything by which one becomes unclean—even if he is unaware of it, when he realizes it, he is guilty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_4","004_5_4","LEV","5","4","4","Or if someone swears thoughtlessly with his lips to do anything good or evil—in whatever matter a man may rashly pronounce an oath—even if he is unaware of it, when he realizes it, he is guilty in the matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_5","004_5_5","LEV","5","5","5","If someone incurs guilt in one of these ways, he must confess the sin he has committed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_6","004_5_6","LEV","5","6","6","and he must bring his guilt offering to the LORD for the sin he has committed: a female lamb or goat from the flock as a sin offering. And the priest will make atonement for him concerning his sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_7","004_5_7","LEV","5","7","7","If, however, he cannot afford a lamb, he may bring to the LORD as restitution for his sin two turtledoves or two young pigeons—one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_8","004_5_8","LEV","5","8","8","He is to bring them to the priest, who shall first present the one for the sin offering. He is to twist its head at the front of its neck without severing it; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_9","004_5_9","LEV","5","9","9","then he is to sprinkle some of the blood of the sin offering on the side of the altar, while the rest of the blood is drained out at the base of the altar. It is a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_10","004_5_10","LEV","5","10","10","And the priest must prepare the second bird as a burnt offering according to the ordinance. In this way the priest will make atonement for him for the sin he has committed, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_11","004_5_11","LEV","5","11","11","But if he cannot afford two turtledoves or two young pigeons, he may bring a tenth of an ephah of fine flour as a sin offering. He must not put olive oil or frankincense on it, because it is a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_12","004_5_12","LEV","5","12","12","He is to bring it to the priest, who shall take a handful from it as a memorial portion and burn it on the altar atop the food offerings to the LORD; it is a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_13","004_5_13","LEV","5","13","13","In this way the priest will make atonement for him for any of these sins he has committed, and he will be forgiven. The remainder will belong to the priest, like the grain offering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_14","004_5_14","LEV","5","14","14","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_15","004_5_15","LEV","5","15","15","“If someone acts unfaithfully and sins unintentionally against any of the LORD’s holy things, he must bring his guilt offering to the LORD: an unblemished ram from the flock, of proper value in silver shekels according to the sanctuary shekel; it is a guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_16","004_5_16","LEV","5","16","16","Regarding any holy thing he has harmed, he must make restitution by adding a fifth of its value to it and giving it to the priest, who will make atonement on his behalf with the ram as a guilt offering, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_17","004_5_17","LEV","5","17","17","If someone sins and violates any of the LORD’s commandments even though he was unaware, he is guilty and shall bear his punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_18","004_5_18","LEV","5","18","18","He is to bring to the priest an unblemished ram of proper value from the flock as a guilt offering. Then the priest will make atonement on his behalf for the wrong he has committed in ignorance, and he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV5_19","004_5_19","LEV","5","19","19","It is a guilt offering; he was certainly guilty before the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_1","004_6_1","LEV","6","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_2","004_6_2","LEV","6","2","2","“If someone sins and acts unfaithfully against the LORD by deceiving his neighbor in regard to a deposit or security entrusted to him or stolen, or if he extorts his neighbor ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_3","004_6_3","LEV","6","3","3","or finds lost property and lies about it and swears falsely, or if he commits any such sin that a man might commit— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_4","004_6_4","LEV","6","4","4","once he has sinned and becomes guilty, he must return what he has stolen or taken by extortion, or the deposit entrusted to him, or the lost property he found, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_5","004_6_5","LEV","6","5","5","or anything else about which he has sworn falsely. He must make restitution in full, add a fifth of the value, and pay it to the owner on the day he acknowledges his guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_6","004_6_6","LEV","6","6","6","Then he must bring to the priest his guilt offering to the LORD: an unblemished ram of proper value from the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_7","004_6_7","LEV","6","7","7","In this way the priest will make atonement for him before the LORD, and he will be forgiven for anything he may have done to incur guilt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_8","004_6_8","LEV","6","8","8","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_9","004_6_9","LEV","6","9","9","“Command Aaron and his sons that this is the law of the burnt offering: The burnt offering is to remain on the hearth of the altar all night, until morning, and the fire must be kept burning on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_10","004_6_10","LEV","6","10","10","And the priest shall put on his linen robe and linen undergarments, and he shall remove from the altar the ashes of the burnt offering that the fire has consumed and place them beside it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_11","004_6_11","LEV","6","11","11","Then he must take off his garments, put on other clothes, and carry the ashes outside the camp to a ceremonially clean place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_12","004_6_12","LEV","6","12","12","The fire on the altar shall be kept burning; it must not be extinguished. Every morning the priest is to add wood to the fire, arrange the burnt offering on it, and burn the fat portions of the peace offerings on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_13","004_6_13","LEV","6","13","13","The fire shall be kept burning on the altar continually; it must not be extinguished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_14","004_6_14","LEV","6","14","14","Now this is the law of the grain offering: Aaron’s sons shall present it before the LORD in front of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_15","004_6_15","LEV","6","15","15","The priest is to remove a handful of fine flour and olive oil, together with all the frankincense from the grain offering, and burn the memorial portion on the altar as a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_16","004_6_16","LEV","6","16","16","Aaron and his sons are to eat the remainder. It must be eaten without leaven in a holy place; they are to eat it in the courtyard of the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_17","004_6_17","LEV","6","17","17","It must not be baked with leaven; I have assigned it as their portion of My food offerings. It is most holy, like the sin offering and the guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_18","004_6_18","LEV","6","18","18","Any male among the sons of Aaron may eat it. This is a permanent portion from the food offerings to the LORD for the generations to come. Anything that touches them will become holy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_19","004_6_19","LEV","6","19","19","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_20","004_6_20","LEV","6","20","20","“This is the offering that Aaron and his sons must present to the LORD on the day he is anointed: a tenth of an ephah of fine flour as a regular grain offering, half of it in the morning and half in the evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_21","004_6_21","LEV","6","21","21","It shall be prepared with oil on a griddle; you are to bring it well-kneaded and present it as a grain offering broken in pieces, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_22","004_6_22","LEV","6","22","22","The priest, who is one of Aaron’s sons and will be anointed to take his place, is to prepare it. As a permanent portion for the LORD, it must be burned completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_23","004_6_23","LEV","6","23","23","Every grain offering for a priest shall be burned completely; it is not to be eaten.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_24","004_6_24","LEV","6","24","24","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_25","004_6_25","LEV","6","25","25","“Tell Aaron and his sons that this is the law of the sin offering: In the place where the burnt offering is slaughtered, the sin offering shall be slaughtered before the LORD; it is most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_26","004_6_26","LEV","6","26","26","The priest who offers it shall eat it; it must be eaten in a holy place, in the courtyard of the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_27","004_6_27","LEV","6","27","27","Anything that touches its flesh will become holy, and if any of the blood is spattered on a garment, you must wash it in a holy place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_28","004_6_28","LEV","6","28","28","The clay pot in which the sin offering is boiled must be broken; if it is boiled in a bronze pot, the pot must be scoured and rinsed with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_29","004_6_29","LEV","6","29","29","Any male among the priests may eat it; it is most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV6_30","004_6_30","LEV","6","30","30","But no sin offering may be eaten if its blood has been brought into the Tent of Meeting to make atonement in the Holy Place; it must be burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_1","004_7_1","LEV","7","1","1","“Now this is the law of the guilt offering, which is most holy: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_2","004_7_2","LEV","7","2","2","The guilt offering must be slaughtered in the place where the burnt offering is slaughtered, and the priest shall splatter its blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_3","004_7_3","LEV","7","3","3","And all the fat from it shall be offered: the fat tail, the fat that covers the entrails, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_4","004_7_4","LEV","7","4","4","both kidneys with the fat on them near the loins, and the lobe of the liver, which is to be removed with the kidneys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_5","004_7_5","LEV","7","5","5","The priest shall burn them on the altar as a food offering to the LORD; it is a guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_6","004_7_6","LEV","7","6","6","Every male among the priests may eat of it. It must be eaten in a holy place; it is most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_7","004_7_7","LEV","7","7","7","The guilt offering is like the sin offering; the same law applies to both. It belongs to the priest who makes atonement with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_8","004_7_8","LEV","7","8","8","As for the priest who presents a burnt offering for anyone, the hide of that offering belongs to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_9","004_7_9","LEV","7","9","9","Likewise, every grain offering that is baked in an oven or cooked in a pan or on a griddle belongs to the priest who presents it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_10","004_7_10","LEV","7","10","10","and every grain offering, whether dry or mixed with oil, belongs equally to all the sons of Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_11","004_7_11","LEV","7","11","11","Now this is the law of the peace offering that one may present to the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_12","004_7_12","LEV","7","12","12","If he offers it in thanksgiving, then along with the sacrifice of thanksgiving he shall offer unleavened cakes mixed with olive oil, unleavened wafers coated with oil, and well-kneaded cakes of fine flour mixed with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_13","004_7_13","LEV","7","13","13","Along with his peace offering of thanksgiving he is to present an offering with cakes of leavened bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_14","004_7_14","LEV","7","14","14","From the cakes he must present one portion of each offering as a contribution to the LORD. It belongs to the priest who sprinkles the blood of the peace offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_15","004_7_15","LEV","7","15","15","The meat of the sacrifice of his peace offering of thanksgiving must be eaten on the day he offers it; none of it may be left until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_16","004_7_16","LEV","7","16","16","If, however, the sacrifice he offers is a vow or a freewill offering, it shall be eaten on the day he presents his sacrifice, but the remainder may be eaten on the next day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_17","004_7_17","LEV","7","17","17","But any meat of the sacrifice remaining until the third day must be burned up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_18","004_7_18","LEV","7","18","18","If any of the meat from his peace offering is eaten on the third day, it will not be accepted. It will not be credited to the one who presented it; it shall be an abomination, and the one who eats of it shall bear his iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_19","004_7_19","LEV","7","19","19","Meat that touches anything unclean must not be eaten; it is to be burned up. As for any other meat, anyone who is ceremonially clean may eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_20","004_7_20","LEV","7","20","20","But if anyone who is unclean eats meat from the peace offering that belongs to the LORD, that person must be cut off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_21","004_7_21","LEV","7","21","21","If one touches anything unclean, whether human uncleanness, an unclean animal, or any unclean, detestable thing, and then eats any of the meat of the peace offering that belongs to the LORD, that person must be cut off from his people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_22","004_7_22","LEV","7","22","22","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_23","004_7_23","LEV","7","23","23","“Speak to the Israelites and say, ‘You are not to eat any of the fat of an ox, a sheep, or a goat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_24","004_7_24","LEV","7","24","24","The fat of an animal found dead or mauled by wild beasts may be used for any other purpose, but you must not eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_25","004_7_25","LEV","7","25","25","If anyone eats the fat of an animal from which a food offering may be presented to the LORD, the one who eats it must be cut off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_26","004_7_26","LEV","7","26","26","You must not eat the blood of any bird or animal in any of your dwellings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_27","004_7_27","LEV","7","27","27","If anyone eats blood, that person must be cut off from his people.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_28","004_7_28","LEV","7","28","28","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_29","004_7_29","LEV","7","29","29","“Speak to the Israelites and say, ‘Anyone who presents a peace offering to the LORD must bring it as his sacrifice to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_30","004_7_30","LEV","7","30","30","With his own hands he is to bring the food offerings to the LORD; he shall bring the fat, together with the breast, and wave the breast as a wave offering before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_31","004_7_31","LEV","7","31","31","The priest is to burn the fat on the altar, but the breast belongs to Aaron and his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_32","004_7_32","LEV","7","32","32","And you are to give the right thigh to the priest as a contribution from your peace offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_33","004_7_33","LEV","7","33","33","The son of Aaron who presents the blood and fat of the peace offering shall have the right thigh as a portion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_34","004_7_34","LEV","7","34","34","I have taken from the sons of Israel the breast of the wave offering and the thigh of the contribution of their peace offerings, and I have given them to Aaron the priest and his sons as a permanent portion from the sons of Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_35","004_7_35","LEV","7","35","35","This is the portion of the food offerings to the LORD for Aaron and his sons since the day they were presented to serve the LORD as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_36","004_7_36","LEV","7","36","36","On the day they were anointed, the LORD commanded that this be given them by the sons of Israel. It is a permanent portion for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_37","004_7_37","LEV","7","37","37","This is the law of the burnt offering, the grain offering, the sin offering, the guilt offering, the ordination offering, and the peace offering, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV7_38","004_7_38","LEV","7","38","38","which the LORD gave Moses on Mount Sinai on the day He commanded the Israelites to present their offerings to the LORD in the Wilderness of Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_1","004_8_1","LEV","8","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_2","004_8_2","LEV","8","2","2","“Take Aaron and his sons, their garments, the anointing oil, the bull of the sin offering, the two rams, and the basket of unleavened bread, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_3","004_8_3","LEV","8","3","3","and assemble the whole congregation at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_4","004_8_4","LEV","8","4","4","So Moses did as the LORD had commanded him, and the assembly gathered at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_5","004_8_5","LEV","8","5","5","And Moses said to them, “This is what the LORD has commanded to be done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_6","004_8_6","LEV","8","6","6","Then Moses presented Aaron and his sons and washed them with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_7","004_8_7","LEV","8","7","7","He put the tunic on Aaron, tied the sash around him, clothed him with the robe, and put the ephod on him. He tied the woven band of the ephod around him and fastened it to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_8","004_8_8","LEV","8","8","8","Then he put the breastpiece on him and placed the Urim and Thummim in the breastpiece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_9","004_8_9","LEV","8","9","9","Moses also put the turban on Aaron’s head and set the gold plate, the holy diadem, on the front of the turban, as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_10","004_8_10","LEV","8","10","10","Next, Moses took the anointing oil and anointed the tabernacle and everything in it; and so he consecrated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_11","004_8_11","LEV","8","11","11","He sprinkled some of the oil on the altar seven times, anointing the altar and all its utensils, and the basin with its stand, to consecrate them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_12","004_8_12","LEV","8","12","12","He also poured some of the anointing oil on Aaron’s head and anointed him to consecrate him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_13","004_8_13","LEV","8","13","13","Then Moses presented Aaron’s sons, put tunics on them, wrapped sashes around them, and tied headbands on them, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_14","004_8_14","LEV","8","14","14","Moses then brought the bull near for the sin offering, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_15","004_8_15","LEV","8","15","15","Moses slaughtered the bull, took some of the blood, and applied it with his finger to all four horns of the altar, purifying the altar. He poured out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar and consecrated it so that atonement could be made on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_16","004_8_16","LEV","8","16","16","Moses also took all the fat that was on the entrails, the lobe of the liver, and both kidneys and their fat, and burned it all on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_17","004_8_17","LEV","8","17","17","But the bull with its hide, flesh, and dung he burned outside the camp, as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_18","004_8_18","LEV","8","18","18","Then Moses presented the ram for the burnt offering, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_19","004_8_19","LEV","8","19","19","Moses slaughtered the ram and splattered the blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_20","004_8_20","LEV","8","20","20","He cut the ram into pieces and burned the head, the pieces, and the fat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_21","004_8_21","LEV","8","21","21","He washed the entrails and legs with water and burned the entire ram on the altar as a burnt offering, a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_22","004_8_22","LEV","8","22","22","After that, Moses presented the other ram, the ram of ordination, and Aaron and his sons laid their hands on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_23","004_8_23","LEV","8","23","23","Moses slaughtered the ram and took some of its blood and put it on Aaron’s right earlobe, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_24","004_8_24","LEV","8","24","24","Moses also presented Aaron’s sons and put some of the blood on their right earlobes, on the thumbs of their right hands, and on the big toes of their right feet. Then he splattered the blood on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_25","004_8_25","LEV","8","25","25","And Moses took the fat—the fat tail, all the fat that was on the entrails, the lobe of the liver, and both kidneys with their fat—as well as the right thigh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_26","004_8_26","LEV","8","26","26","And from the basket of unleavened bread that was before the LORD, he took one cake of unleavened bread, one cake of bread made with oil, and one wafer, and he placed them on the fat portions and on the right thigh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_27","004_8_27","LEV","8","27","27","He put all these in the hands of Aaron and his sons and waved them before the LORD as a wave offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_28","004_8_28","LEV","8","28","28","Then Moses took these from their hands and burned them on the altar with the burnt offering. This was an ordination offering, a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_29","004_8_29","LEV","8","29","29","He also took the breast—Moses’ portion of the ram of ordination—and waved it before the LORD as a wave offering, as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_30","004_8_30","LEV","8","30","30","Next, Moses took some of the anointing oil and some of the blood that was on the altar and sprinkled them on Aaron and his garments, and on his sons and their garments. So he consecrated Aaron and his garments, as well as Aaron’s sons and their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_31","004_8_31","LEV","8","31","31","And Moses said to Aaron and his sons, “Boil the meat at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting and eat it there with the bread that is in the basket of ordination offerings, as I commanded, saying, ‘Aaron and his sons are to eat it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_32","004_8_32","LEV","8","32","32","Then you must burn up the remainder of the meat and bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_33","004_8_33","LEV","8","33","33","You must not go outside the entrance to the Tent of Meeting for seven days, until the days of your ordination are complete; for it will take seven days to ordain you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_34","004_8_34","LEV","8","34","34","What has been done today has been commanded by the LORD in order to make atonement on your behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_35","004_8_35","LEV","8","35","35","You must remain at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting day and night for seven days and keep the LORD’s charge so that you will not die, for this is what I have been commanded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV8_36","004_8_36","LEV","8","36","36","So Aaron and his sons did everything the LORD had commanded through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_1","004_9_1","LEV","9","1","1","On the eighth day Moses summoned Aaron and his sons and the elders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_2","004_9_2","LEV","9","2","2","He said to Aaron, “Take for yourself a young bull for a sin offering and a ram for a burnt offering, both without blemish, and present them before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_3","004_9_3","LEV","9","3","3","Then speak to the Israelites and say, ‘Take a male goat for a sin offering, a calf and a lamb—both a year old and without blemish—for a burnt offering, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_4","004_9_4","LEV","9","4","4","an ox and a ram for a peace offering to sacrifice before the LORD, and a grain offering mixed with oil. For today the LORD will appear to you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_5","004_9_5","LEV","9","5","5","So they took what Moses had commanded to the front of the Tent of Meeting, and the whole congregation drew near and stood before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_6","004_9_6","LEV","9","6","6","And Moses said, “This is what the LORD has commanded you to do, so that the glory of the LORD may appear to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_7","004_9_7","LEV","9","7","7","Then Moses said to Aaron, “Approach the altar and sacrifice your sin offering and your burnt offering to make atonement for yourself and for the people. And sacrifice the people’s offering to make atonement for them, as the LORD has commanded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_8","004_9_8","LEV","9","8","8","So Aaron approached the altar and slaughtered the calf as a sin offering for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_9","004_9_9","LEV","9","9","9","The sons of Aaron brought the blood to him, and he dipped his finger in the blood and applied it to the horns of the altar. And he poured out the rest of the blood at the base of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_10","004_9_10","LEV","9","10","10","On the altar he burned the fat, the kidneys, and the lobe of the liver from the sin offering, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_11","004_9_11","LEV","9","11","11","But he burned up the flesh and the hide outside the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_12","004_9_12","LEV","9","12","12","Then Aaron slaughtered the burnt offering. His sons brought him the blood, and he splattered it on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_13","004_9_13","LEV","9","13","13","They brought him the burnt offering piece by piece, including the head, and he burned them on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_14","004_9_14","LEV","9","14","14","He washed the entrails and the legs and burned them atop the burnt offering on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_15","004_9_15","LEV","9","15","15","Aaron then presented the people’s offering. He took the male goat for the people’s sin offering, slaughtered it, and offered it for sin like the first one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_16","004_9_16","LEV","9","16","16","He presented the burnt offering and offered it according to the ordinance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_17","004_9_17","LEV","9","17","17","Next he presented the grain offering, took a handful of it, and burned it on the altar in addition to the morning’s burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_18","004_9_18","LEV","9","18","18","Then he slaughtered the ox and the ram as the people’s peace offering. His sons brought him the blood, and he splattered it on all sides of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_19","004_9_19","LEV","9","19","19","They also brought the fat portions from the ox and the ram—the fat tail, the fat covering the entrails, the kidneys, and the lobe of the liver— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_20","004_9_20","LEV","9","20","20","and placed these on the breasts. Aaron burned the fat portions on the altar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_21","004_9_21","LEV","9","21","21","but he waved the breasts and the right thigh as a wave offering before the LORD, as Moses had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_22","004_9_22","LEV","9","22","22","Aaron lifted up his hands toward the people and blessed them. And having made the sin offering, the burnt offering, and the peace offering, he stepped down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_23","004_9_23","LEV","9","23","23","Moses and Aaron then entered the Tent of Meeting. When they came out, they blessed the people, and the glory of the LORD appeared to all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV9_24","004_9_24","LEV","9","24","24","Fire came out from the presence of the LORD and consumed the burnt offering and the fat portions on the altar. And when all the people saw it, they shouted for joy and fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_1","004_10_1","LEV","10","1","1","Now Aaron’s sons Nadab and Abihu took their censers, put fire in them and added incense, and offered unauthorized fire before the LORD, contrary to His command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_2","004_10_2","LEV","10","2","2","So fire came out from the presence of the LORD and consumed them, and they died in the presence of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_3","004_10_3","LEV","10","3","3","Then Moses said to Aaron, “This is what the LORD meant when He said: ‘To those who come near Me I will show My holiness, and in the sight of all the people I will reveal My glory.’” But Aaron remained silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_4","004_10_4","LEV","10","4","4","Moses summoned Mishael and Elzaphan, sons of Aaron’s uncle Uzziel, and said to them, “Come here; carry the bodies of your cousins outside the camp, away from the front of the sanctuary.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_5","004_10_5","LEV","10","5","5","So they came forward and carried them, still in their tunics, outside the camp, as Moses had directed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_6","004_10_6","LEV","10","6","6","Then Moses said to Aaron and his sons Eleazar and Ithamar, “Do not let your hair become disheveled and do not tear your garments, or else you will die, and the LORD will be angry with the whole congregation. But your brothers, the whole house of Israel, may mourn on account of the fire that the LORD has ignited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_7","004_10_7","LEV","10","7","7","You shall not go outside the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, or you will die, for the LORD’s anointing oil is on you.” So they did as Moses instructed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_8","004_10_8","LEV","10","8","8","Then the LORD said to Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_9","004_10_9","LEV","10","9","9","“You and your sons are not to drink wine or strong drink when you enter the Tent of Meeting, or else you will die; this is a permanent statute for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_10","004_10_10","LEV","10","10","10","You must distinguish between the holy and the common, between the clean and the unclean, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_11","004_10_11","LEV","10","11","11","so that you may teach the Israelites all the statutes that the LORD has given them through Moses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_12","004_10_12","LEV","10","12","12","And Moses said to Aaron and his remaining sons, Eleazar and Ithamar, “Take the grain offering that remains from the food offerings to the LORD and eat it without leaven beside the altar, because it is most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_13","004_10_13","LEV","10","13","13","You shall eat it in a holy place, because it is your share and your sons’ share of the food offerings to the LORD; for this is what I have been commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_14","004_10_14","LEV","10","14","14","And you and your sons and daughters may eat the breast of the wave offering and the thigh of the contribution in a ceremonially clean place, because these portions have been assigned to you and your children from the peace offerings of the sons of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_15","004_10_15","LEV","10","15","15","They are to bring the thigh of the contribution and the breast of the wave offering, together with the fat portions of the food offerings, to wave as a wave offering before the LORD. It will belong permanently to you and your children, as the LORD has commanded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_16","004_10_16","LEV","10","16","16","Later, Moses searched carefully for the goat of the sin offering, and behold, it had been burned up. He was angry with Eleazar and Ithamar, Aaron’s remaining sons, and asked, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_17","004_10_17","LEV","10","17","17","“Why didn’t you eat the sin offering in the holy place? For it is most holy; it was given to you to take away the guilt of the congregation by making atonement for them before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_18","004_10_18","LEV","10","18","18","Since its blood was not brought inside the holy place, you should have eaten it in the sanctuary area, as I commanded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_19","004_10_19","LEV","10","19","19","But Aaron replied to Moses, “Behold, this very day they presented their sin offering and their burnt offering before the LORD. Since these things have happened to me, if I had eaten the sin offering today, would it have been acceptable in the sight of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV10_20","004_10_20","LEV","10","20","20","And when Moses heard this explanation, he was satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_1","004_11_1","LEV","11","1","1","The LORD spoke again to Moses and Aaron, telling them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_2","004_11_2","LEV","11","2","2","“Say to the Israelites, ‘Of all the beasts of the earth, these ones you may eat: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_3","004_11_3","LEV","11","3","3","You may eat any animal that has a split hoof completely divided and that chews the cud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_4","004_11_4","LEV","11","4","4","But of those that only chew the cud or only have a divided hoof, you are not to eat the following: The camel, though it chews the cud, does not have a divided hoof; it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_5","004_11_5","LEV","11","5","5","The rock badger, though it chews the cud, does not have a divided hoof; it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_6","004_11_6","LEV","11","6","6","The rabbit, though it chews the cud, does not have a divided hoof; it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_7","004_11_7","LEV","11","7","7","And the pig, though it has a split hoof completely divided, does not chew the cud; it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_8","004_11_8","LEV","11","8","8","You must not eat their meat or touch their carcasses; they are unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_9","004_11_9","LEV","11","9","9","Of all the creatures that live in the water, whether in the seas or in the streams, you may eat anything with fins and scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_10","004_11_10","LEV","11","10","10","But the following among all the teeming life and creatures in the water are detestable to you: everything in the seas or streams that does not have fins and scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_11","004_11_11","LEV","11","11","11","They shall be an abomination to you; you must not eat their meat, and you must detest their carcasses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_12","004_11_12","LEV","11","12","12","Everything in the water that does not have fins and scales shall be detestable to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_13","004_11_13","LEV","11","13","13","Additionally, you are to detest the following birds, and they must not be eaten because they are detestable: the eagle, the bearded vulture, the black vulture, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_14","004_11_14","LEV","11","14","14","the kite, any kind of falcon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_15","004_11_15","LEV","11","15","15","any kind of raven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_16","004_11_16","LEV","11","16","16","the ostrich, the screech owl, the gull, any kind of hawk, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_17","004_11_17","LEV","11","17","17","the little owl, the cormorant, the great owl, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_18","004_11_18","LEV","11","18","18","the white owl, the desert owl, the osprey, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_19","004_11_19","LEV","11","19","19","the stork, any kind of heron, the hoopoe, and the bat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_20","004_11_20","LEV","11","20","20","All flying insects that walk on all fours are detestable to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_21","004_11_21","LEV","11","21","21","However, you may eat the following kinds of flying insects that walk on all fours: those having jointed legs above their feet for hopping on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_22","004_11_22","LEV","11","22","22","Of these you may eat any kind of locust, katydid, cricket, or grasshopper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_23","004_11_23","LEV","11","23","23","All other flying insects that have four legs are detestable to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_24","004_11_24","LEV","11","24","24","These creatures will make you unclean. Whoever touches their carcasses will be unclean until evening, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_25","004_11_25","LEV","11","25","25","and whoever picks up one of their carcasses must wash his clothes, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_26","004_11_26","LEV","11","26","26","Every animal with hooves not completely divided or that does not chew the cud is unclean for you. Whoever touches any of them will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_27","004_11_27","LEV","11","27","27","All the four-footed animals that walk on their paws are unclean for you; whoever touches their carcasses will be unclean until evening, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_28","004_11_28","LEV","11","28","28","and anyone who picks up a carcass must wash his clothes, and he will be unclean until evening. They are unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_29","004_11_29","LEV","11","29","29","The following creatures that move along the ground are unclean for you: the mole, the mouse, any kind of great lizard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_30","004_11_30","LEV","11","30","30","the gecko, the monitor lizard, the common lizard, the skink, and the chameleon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_31","004_11_31","LEV","11","31","31","These animals are unclean for you among all the crawling creatures. Whoever touches them when they are dead shall be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_32","004_11_32","LEV","11","32","32","When one of them dies and falls on something, that article becomes unclean; any article of wood, clothing, leather, sackcloth, or any implement used for work must be rinsed with water and will remain unclean until evening; then it will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_33","004_11_33","LEV","11","33","33","If any of them falls into a clay pot, everything in it will be unclean; you must break the pot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_34","004_11_34","LEV","11","34","34","Any food coming into contact with water from that pot will be unclean, and any drink in such a container will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_35","004_11_35","LEV","11","35","35","Anything upon which one of their carcasses falls will be unclean. If it is an oven or cooking pot, it must be smashed; it is unclean and will remain unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_36","004_11_36","LEV","11","36","36","Nevertheless, a spring or cistern containing water will remain clean, but one who touches a carcass in it will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_37","004_11_37","LEV","11","37","37","If a carcass falls on any seed for sowing, the seed is clean; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_38","004_11_38","LEV","11","38","38","but if water has been put on the seed and a carcass falls on it, it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_39","004_11_39","LEV","11","39","39","If an animal that you may eat dies, anyone who touches the carcass will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_40","004_11_40","LEV","11","40","40","Whoever eats from the carcass must wash his clothes and will be unclean until evening, and anyone who picks up the carcass must wash his clothes and will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_41","004_11_41","LEV","11","41","41","Every creature that moves along the ground is detestable; it must not be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_42","004_11_42","LEV","11","42","42","Do not eat any creature that moves along the ground, whether it crawls on its belly or walks on four or more feet; for such creatures are detestable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_43","004_11_43","LEV","11","43","43","Do not defile yourselves by any crawling creature; do not become unclean or defiled by them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_44","004_11_44","LEV","11","44","44","For I am the LORD your God; consecrate yourselves, therefore, and be holy, because I am holy. You must not defile yourselves by any creature that crawls along the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_45","004_11_45","LEV","11","45","45","For I am the LORD, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt so that I would be your God; therefore be holy, because I am holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_46","004_11_46","LEV","11","46","46","This is the law regarding animals, birds, all living creatures that move in the water, and all creatures that crawl along the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV11_47","004_11_47","LEV","11","47","47","You must distinguish between the unclean and the clean, between animals that may be eaten and those that may not.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_1","004_12_1","LEV","12","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_2","004_12_2","LEV","12","2","2","“Say to the Israelites, ‘A woman who becomes pregnant and gives birth to a son will be unclean for seven days, as she is during the days of her menstruation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_3","004_12_3","LEV","12","3","3","And on the eighth day the flesh of the boy’s foreskin is to be circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_4","004_12_4","LEV","12","4","4","The woman shall continue in purification from her bleeding for thirty-three days. She must not touch anything sacred or go into the sanctuary until the days of her purification are complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_5","004_12_5","LEV","12","5","5","If, however, she gives birth to a daughter, the woman will be unclean for two weeks as she is during her menstruation. Then she must continue in purification from her bleeding for sixty-six days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_6","004_12_6","LEV","12","6","6","When the days of her purification are complete, whether for a son or for a daughter, she is to bring to the priest at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting a year-old lamb for a burnt offering and a young pigeon or a turtledove for a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_7","004_12_7","LEV","12","7","7","And the priest will present them before the LORD and make atonement for her; and she shall be ceremonially cleansed from her flow of blood. This is the law for a woman giving birth, whether to a male or to a female. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV12_8","004_12_8","LEV","12","8","8","But if she cannot afford a lamb, she shall bring two turtledoves or two young pigeons, one for a burnt offering and the other for a sin offering. Then the priest will make atonement for her, and she will be clean.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_1","004_13_1","LEV","13","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_2","004_13_2","LEV","13","2","2","“When someone has a swelling or rash or bright spot on his skin that may be an infectious skin disease, he must be brought to Aaron the priest or to one of his sons who is a priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_3","004_13_3","LEV","13","3","3","The priest is to examine the infection on his skin, and if the hair in the infection has turned white and the sore appears to be deeper than the skin, it is a skin disease. After the priest examines him, he must pronounce him unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_4","004_13_4","LEV","13","4","4","If, however, the spot on his skin is white and does not appear to be deeper than the skin, and the hair in it has not turned white, the priest shall isolate the infected person for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_5","004_13_5","LEV","13","5","5","On the seventh day the priest is to reexamine him, and if he sees that the infection is unchanged and has not spread on the skin, the priest must isolate him for another seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_6","004_13_6","LEV","13","6","6","The priest will examine him again on the seventh day, and if the sore has faded and has not spread on the skin, the priest shall pronounce him clean; it is a rash. The person must wash his clothes and be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_7","004_13_7","LEV","13","7","7","But if the rash spreads further on his skin after he has shown himself to the priest for his cleansing, he must present himself again to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_8","004_13_8","LEV","13","8","8","The priest will reexamine him, and if the rash has spread on the skin, the priest must pronounce him unclean; it is a skin disease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_9","004_13_9","LEV","13","9","9","When anyone develops a skin disease, he must be brought to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_10","004_13_10","LEV","13","10","10","The priest will examine him, and if there is a white swelling on the skin that has turned the hair white, and there is raw flesh in the swelling, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_11","004_13_11","LEV","13","11","11","it is a chronic skin disease and the priest must pronounce him unclean. He need not isolate him, for he is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_12","004_13_12","LEV","13","12","12","But if the skin disease breaks out all over his skin so that it covers all the skin of the infected person from head to foot, as far as the priest can see, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_13","004_13_13","LEV","13","13","13","the priest shall examine him, and if the disease has covered his entire body, he is to pronounce the infected person clean. Since it has all turned white, he is clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_14","004_13_14","LEV","13","14","14","But whenever raw flesh appears on someone, he will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_15","004_13_15","LEV","13","15","15","When the priest sees the raw flesh, he must pronounce him unclean. The raw flesh is unclean; it is a skin disease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_16","004_13_16","LEV","13","16","16","But if the raw flesh changes and turns white, he must go to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_17","004_13_17","LEV","13","17","17","The priest will reexamine him, and if the infection has turned white, the priest is to pronounce the infected person clean; then he is clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_18","004_13_18","LEV","13","18","18","When a boil appears on someone’s skin and it heals, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_19","004_13_19","LEV","13","19","19","and a white swelling or a reddish-white spot develops where the boil was, he must present himself to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_20","004_13_20","LEV","13","20","20","The priest shall examine it, and if it appears to be beneath the skin and the hair in it has turned white, the priest shall pronounce him unclean; it is a diseased infection that has broken out in the boil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_21","004_13_21","LEV","13","21","21","But when the priest examines it, if there is no white hair in it, and it is not beneath the skin and has faded, the priest shall isolate him for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_22","004_13_22","LEV","13","22","22","If it spreads any further on the skin, the priest must pronounce him unclean; it is an infection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_23","004_13_23","LEV","13","23","23","But if the spot remains unchanged and does not spread, it is only the scar from the boil, and the priest shall pronounce him clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_24","004_13_24","LEV","13","24","24","When there is a burn on someone’s skin and the raw area of the burn becomes reddish-white or white, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_25","004_13_25","LEV","13","25","25","the priest must examine it. If the hair in the spot has turned white and the spot appears to be deeper than the skin, it is a disease that has broken out in the burn. The priest must pronounce him unclean; it is a diseased infection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_26","004_13_26","LEV","13","26","26","But if the priest examines it and there is no white hair in the spot, and it is not beneath the skin but has faded, the priest shall isolate him for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_27","004_13_27","LEV","13","27","27","On the seventh day the priest is to reexamine him, and if it has spread further on the skin, the priest must pronounce him unclean; it is a diseased infection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_28","004_13_28","LEV","13","28","28","But if the spot is unchanged and has not spread on the skin but has faded, it is a swelling from the burn, and the priest is to pronounce him clean; for it is only the scar from the burn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_29","004_13_29","LEV","13","29","29","If a man or woman has an infection on the head or chin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_30","004_13_30","LEV","13","30","30","the priest shall examine the infection, and if it appears to be deeper than the skin and the hair in it is yellow and thin, the priest must pronounce him unclean; it is a scaly outbreak, an infectious disease of the head or chin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_31","004_13_31","LEV","13","31","31","But if the priest examines the scaly infection and it does not appear to be deeper than the skin, and there is no black hair in it, the priest shall isolate the infected person for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_32","004_13_32","LEV","13","32","32","On the seventh day the priest is to reexamine the infection, and if the scaly outbreak has not spread and there is no yellow hair in it, and it does not appear to be deeper than the skin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_33","004_13_33","LEV","13","33","33","then the person must shave himself except for the scaly area. Then the priest shall isolate him for another seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_34","004_13_34","LEV","13","34","34","On the seventh day the priest shall examine the scaly outbreak, and if it has not spread on the skin and does not appear to be deeper than the skin, the priest is to pronounce him clean. He must wash his clothes, and he will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_35","004_13_35","LEV","13","35","35","If, however, the scaly outbreak spreads further on the skin after his cleansing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_36","004_13_36","LEV","13","36","36","the priest is to examine him, and if the scaly outbreak has spread on the skin, the priest need not look for yellow hair; the person is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_37","004_13_37","LEV","13","37","37","If, however, in his sight the scaly outbreak is unchanged and black hair has grown in it, then it has healed. He is clean, and the priest is to pronounce him clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_38","004_13_38","LEV","13","38","38","When a man or a woman has white spots on the skin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_39","004_13_39","LEV","13","39","39","the priest shall examine them, and if the spots are dull white, it is a harmless rash that has broken out on the skin; the person is clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_40","004_13_40","LEV","13","40","40","Now if a man loses his hair and is bald, he is still clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_41","004_13_41","LEV","13","41","41","Or if his hairline recedes and he is bald on his forehead, he is still clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_42","004_13_42","LEV","13","42","42","But if there is a reddish-white sore on the bald head or forehead, it is an infectious disease breaking out on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_43","004_13_43","LEV","13","43","43","The priest is to examine him, and if the swelling of the infection on his bald head or forehead is reddish-white like a skin disease, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_44","004_13_44","LEV","13","44","44","the man is diseased; he is unclean. The priest must pronounce him unclean because of the infection on his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_45","004_13_45","LEV","13","45","45","A diseased person must wear torn clothes and let his hair hang loose, and he must cover his mouth and cry out, ‘Unclean, unclean!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_46","004_13_46","LEV","13","46","46","As long as he has the infection, he remains unclean. He must live alone in a place outside the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_47","004_13_47","LEV","13","47","47","If any fabric is contaminated with mildew—any wool or linen garment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_48","004_13_48","LEV","13","48","48","any weave or knit of linen or wool, or any article of leather— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_49","004_13_49","LEV","13","49","49","and if the mark in the fabric, leather, weave, knit, or leather article is green or red, then it is contaminated with mildew and must be shown to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_50","004_13_50","LEV","13","50","50","And the priest is to examine the mildew and isolate the contaminated fabric for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_51","004_13_51","LEV","13","51","51","On the seventh day the priest shall reexamine it, and if the mildew has spread in the fabric, weave, knit, or leather, then regardless of how it is used, it is a harmful mildew; the article is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_52","004_13_52","LEV","13","52","52","He is to burn the fabric, weave, or knit, whether the contaminated item is wool or linen or leather. Since the mildew is harmful, the article must be burned up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_53","004_13_53","LEV","13","53","53","But when the priest reexamines it, if the mildew has not spread in the fabric, weave, knit, or leather article, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_54","004_13_54","LEV","13","54","54","the priest is to order the contaminated article to be washed and isolated for another seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_55","004_13_55","LEV","13","55","55","After it has been washed, the priest is to reexamine it, and if the mildewed article has not changed in appearance, it is unclean. Even though the mildew has not spread, you must burn it, whether the rot is on the front or back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_56","004_13_56","LEV","13","56","56","If the priest examines it and the mildew has faded after it has been washed, he must cut the contaminated section out of the fabric, leather, weave, or knit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_57","004_13_57","LEV","13","57","57","But if it reappears in the fabric, weave, or knit, or on any leather article, it is spreading. You must burn the contaminated article. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_58","004_13_58","LEV","13","58","58","If the mildew disappears from the fabric, weave, or knit, or any leather article after washing, then it is to be washed again, and it will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV13_59","004_13_59","LEV","13","59","59","This is the law concerning a mildew contamination in wool or linen fabric, weave, or knit, or any leather article, for pronouncing it clean or unclean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_1","004_14_1","LEV","14","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_2","004_14_2","LEV","14","2","2","“This is the law for the one afflicted with a skin disease on the day of his cleansing, when he is brought to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_3","004_14_3","LEV","14","3","3","The priest is to go outside the camp to examine him, and if the skin disease of the afflicted person has healed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_4","004_14_4","LEV","14","4","4","the priest shall order that two live clean birds, cedar wood, scarlet yarn, and hyssop be brought for the one to be cleansed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_5","004_14_5","LEV","14","5","5","Then the priest shall command that one of the birds be slaughtered over fresh water in a clay pot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_6","004_14_6","LEV","14","6","6","And he is to take the live bird together with the cedar wood, scarlet yarn, and hyssop, and dip them into the blood of the bird that was slaughtered over the fresh water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_7","004_14_7","LEV","14","7","7","Seven times he shall sprinkle the one to be cleansed of the skin disease. Then he shall pronounce him clean and release the live bird into the open field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_8","004_14_8","LEV","14","8","8","The one being cleansed must wash his clothes, shave off all his hair, and bathe with water; then he will be ceremonially clean. Afterward, he may enter the camp, but he must remain outside his tent for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_9","004_14_9","LEV","14","9","9","On the seventh day he must shave off all his hair—his head, his beard, his eyebrows, and the rest of his hair. He must wash his clothes and bathe himself with water, and he will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_10","004_14_10","LEV","14","10","10","On the eighth day he is to bring two unblemished male lambs, an unblemished ewe lamb a year old, a grain offering of three-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with olive oil, and one log of olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_11","004_14_11","LEV","14","11","11","The priest who performs the cleansing shall present the one to be cleansed, together with these offerings, before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_12","004_14_12","LEV","14","12","12","Then the priest is to take one of the male lambs and present it as a guilt offering, along with the log of olive oil; and he must wave them as a wave offering before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_13","004_14_13","LEV","14","13","13","Then he is to slaughter the lamb in the sanctuary area where the sin offering and burnt offering are slaughtered. Like the sin offering, the guilt offering belongs to the priest; it is most holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_14","004_14_14","LEV","14","14","14","The priest is to take some of the blood from the guilt offering and put it on the right earlobe of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_15","004_14_15","LEV","14","15","15","Then the priest shall take some of the log of olive oil, pour it into his left palm, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_16","004_14_16","LEV","14","16","16","dip his right forefinger into the oil in his left palm, and sprinkle some of the oil with his finger seven times before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_17","004_14_17","LEV","14","17","17","And the priest is to put some of the oil remaining in his palm on the right earlobe of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot, on top of the blood of the guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_18","004_14_18","LEV","14","18","18","The rest of the oil in his palm, the priest is to put on the head of the one to be cleansed, to make atonement for him before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_19","004_14_19","LEV","14","19","19","Then the priest is to sacrifice the sin offering and make atonement for the one to be cleansed from his uncleanness. After that, the priest shall slaughter the burnt offering ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_20","004_14_20","LEV","14","20","20","and offer it on the altar, with the grain offering, to make atonement for him, and he will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_21","004_14_21","LEV","14","21","21","If, however, the person is poor and cannot afford these offerings, he is to take one male lamb as a guilt offering to be waved to make atonement for him, along with a tenth of an ephah of fine flour mixed with olive oil for a grain offering, a log of olive oil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_22","004_14_22","LEV","14","22","22","and two turtledoves or two young pigeons, whichever he can afford, one to be a sin offering and the other a burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_23","004_14_23","LEV","14","23","23","On the eighth day he is to bring them for his cleansing to the priest at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_24","004_14_24","LEV","14","24","24","The priest shall take the lamb for the guilt offering, along with the log of olive oil, and wave them as a wave offering before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_25","004_14_25","LEV","14","25","25","And after he slaughters the lamb for the guilt offering, the priest is to take some of the blood of the guilt offering and put it on the right earlobe of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_26","004_14_26","LEV","14","26","26","Then the priest is to pour some of the oil into his left palm ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_27","004_14_27","LEV","14","27","27","and sprinkle with his right forefinger some of the oil in his left palm seven times before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_28","004_14_28","LEV","14","28","28","The priest shall also put some of the oil in his palm on the right earlobe of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of his right hand, and on the big toe of his right foot—on the same places as the blood of the guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_29","004_14_29","LEV","14","29","29","The rest of the oil in his palm, the priest is to put on the head of the one to be cleansed, to make atonement for him before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_30","004_14_30","LEV","14","30","30","Then he must sacrifice the turtledoves or young pigeons, whichever he can afford, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_31","004_14_31","LEV","14","31","31","one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering, together with the grain offering. In this way the priest will make atonement before the LORD for the one to be cleansed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_32","004_14_32","LEV","14","32","32","This is the law for someone who has a skin disease and cannot afford the cost of his cleansing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_33","004_14_33","LEV","14","33","33","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_34","004_14_34","LEV","14","34","34","“When you enter the land of Canaan, which I am giving you as your possession, and I put a contamination of mildew into a house in that land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_35","004_14_35","LEV","14","35","35","the owner of the house shall come and tell the priest, ‘Something like mildew has appeared in my house.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_36","004_14_36","LEV","14","36","36","The priest must order that the house be cleared before he enters it to examine the mildew, so that nothing in the house will become unclean. After this, the priest shall go in to inspect the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_37","004_14_37","LEV","14","37","37","He is to examine the house, and if the mildew on the walls consists of green or red depressions that appear to be beneath the surface of the wall, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_38","004_14_38","LEV","14","38","38","the priest shall go outside the doorway of the house and close it up for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_39","004_14_39","LEV","14","39","39","On the seventh day the priest is to return and inspect the house. If the mildew has spread on the walls, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_40","004_14_40","LEV","14","40","40","he must order that the contaminated stones be pulled out and thrown into an unclean place outside the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_41","004_14_41","LEV","14","41","41","And he shall have the inside of the house scraped completely and the plaster that is scraped off dumped into an unclean place outside the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_42","004_14_42","LEV","14","42","42","So different stones must be obtained to replace the contaminated ones, as well as additional mortar to replaster the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_43","004_14_43","LEV","14","43","43","If the mildew reappears in the house after the stones have been torn out and the house has been scraped and replastered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_44","004_14_44","LEV","14","44","44","the priest must come and inspect it. If the mildew has spread in the house, it is a destructive mildew; the house is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_45","004_14_45","LEV","14","45","45","It must be torn down with its stones, its timbers, and all its plaster, and taken outside the city to an unclean place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_46","004_14_46","LEV","14","46","46","Anyone who enters the house during any of the days that it is closed up will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_47","004_14_47","LEV","14","47","47","And anyone who sleeps in the house or eats in it must wash his clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_48","004_14_48","LEV","14","48","48","If, however, the priest comes and inspects it, and the mildew has not spread after the house has been replastered, he shall pronounce the house clean, because the mildew is gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_49","004_14_49","LEV","14","49","49","He is to take two birds, cedar wood, scarlet yarn, and hyssop to purify the house; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_50","004_14_50","LEV","14","50","50","and he shall slaughter one of the birds over fresh water in a clay pot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_51","004_14_51","LEV","14","51","51","Then he shall take the cedar wood, the hyssop, the scarlet yarn, and the live bird, dip them in the blood of the slaughtered bird and the fresh water, and sprinkle the house seven times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_52","004_14_52","LEV","14","52","52","And he shall cleanse the house with the bird’s blood, the fresh water, the live bird, the cedar wood, the hyssop, and the scarlet yarn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_53","004_14_53","LEV","14","53","53","Finally, he is to release the live bird into the open fields outside the city. In this way he will make atonement for the house, and it will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_54","004_14_54","LEV","14","54","54","This is the law for any infectious skin disease, for a scaly outbreak, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_55","004_14_55","LEV","14","55","55","for mildew in clothing or in a house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_56","004_14_56","LEV","14","56","56","and for a swelling, rash, or spot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV14_57","004_14_57","LEV","14","57","57","to determine when something is clean or unclean. This is the law regarding skin diseases and mildew.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_1","004_15_1","LEV","15","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_2","004_15_2","LEV","15","2","2","“Say to the Israelites, ‘When any man has a bodily discharge, the discharge is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_3","004_15_3","LEV","15","3","3","This uncleanness is from his discharge, whether his body allows the discharge to flow or blocks it. So his discharge will bring about uncleanness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_4","004_15_4","LEV","15","4","4","Any bed on which the man with the discharge lies will be unclean, and any furniture on which he sits will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_5","004_15_5","LEV","15","5","5","Anyone who touches his bed must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_6","004_15_6","LEV","15","6","6","Whoever sits on furniture on which the man with the discharge was sitting must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_7","004_15_7","LEV","15","7","7","Whoever touches the body of the man with a discharge must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_8","004_15_8","LEV","15","8","8","If the man with the discharge spits on one who is clean, that person must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_9","004_15_9","LEV","15","9","9","Any saddle on which the man with the discharge rides will be unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_10","004_15_10","LEV","15","10","10","Whoever touches anything that was under him will be unclean until evening, and whoever carries such things must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_11","004_15_11","LEV","15","11","11","If the man with the discharge touches anyone without first rinsing his hands with water, the one who was touched must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_12","004_15_12","LEV","15","12","12","Any clay pot that the man with the discharge touches must be broken, and any wooden utensil must be rinsed with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_13","004_15_13","LEV","15","13","13","When the man has been cleansed from his discharge, he must count off seven days for his cleansing, wash his clothes, and bathe himself in fresh water, and he shall be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_14","004_15_14","LEV","15","14","14","On the eighth day he is to take two turtledoves or two young pigeons, come before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, and give them to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_15","004_15_15","LEV","15","15","15","The priest is to sacrifice them, one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering. In this way the priest will make atonement for the man before the LORD because of his discharge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_16","004_15_16","LEV","15","16","16","When a man has an emission of semen, he must bathe his whole body with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_17","004_15_17","LEV","15","17","17","Any clothing or leather on which there is an emission of semen must be washed with water, and it will remain unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_18","004_15_18","LEV","15","18","18","If a man lies with a woman and there is an emission of semen, both must bathe with water, and they will remain unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_19","004_15_19","LEV","15","19","19","When a woman has a discharge consisting of blood from her body, she will be unclean due to her menstruation for seven days, and anyone who touches her will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_20","004_15_20","LEV","15","20","20","Anything on which she lies or sits during her menstruation will be unclean, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_21","004_15_21","LEV","15","21","21","and anyone who touches her bed must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_22","004_15_22","LEV","15","22","22","Whoever touches any furniture on which she was sitting must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_23","004_15_23","LEV","15","23","23","And whether it is a bed or furniture on which she was sitting, whoever touches it will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_24","004_15_24","LEV","15","24","24","If a man lies with her and her menstrual flow touches him, he will be unclean for seven days, and any bed on which he lies will become unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_25","004_15_25","LEV","15","25","25","When a woman has a discharge of her blood for many days at a time other than her menstrual period, or if it continues beyond her period, she will be unclean all the days of her unclean discharge, just as she is during the days of her menstruation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_26","004_15_26","LEV","15","26","26","Any bed on which she lies or any furniture on which she sits during the days of her discharge will be unclean, like her bed during her menstrual period. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_27","004_15_27","LEV","15","27","27","Anyone who touches these things will be unclean; he must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_28","004_15_28","LEV","15","28","28","When a woman is cleansed of her discharge, she must count off seven days, and after that she will be ceremonially clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_29","004_15_29","LEV","15","29","29","On the eighth day she is to take two turtledoves or two young pigeons and bring them to the priest at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_30","004_15_30","LEV","15","30","30","The priest is to sacrifice one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering. In this way the priest will make atonement for her before the LORD for her unclean discharge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_31","004_15_31","LEV","15","31","31","You must keep the children of Israel separate from their uncleanness, so that they do not die by defiling My tabernacle, which is among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_32","004_15_32","LEV","15","32","32","This is the law of him who has a discharge, of the man who has an emission of semen whereby he is unclean, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV15_33","004_15_33","LEV","15","33","33","of a woman in her menstrual period, of any male or female who has a discharge, and of a man who lies with an unclean woman.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_1","004_16_1","LEV","16","1","1","Now the LORD spoke to Moses after the death of two of Aaron’s sons when they approached the presence of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_2","004_16_2","LEV","16","2","2","And the LORD said to Moses: “Tell your brother Aaron not to enter freely into the Most Holy Place behind the veil in front of the mercy seat on the ark, or else he will die, because I appear in the cloud above the mercy seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_3","004_16_3","LEV","16","3","3","This is how Aaron is to enter the Holy Place: with a young bull for a sin offering and a ram for a burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_4","004_16_4","LEV","16","4","4","He is to wear the sacred linen tunic, with linen undergarments. He must tie a linen sash around him and put on the linen turban. These are holy garments, and he must bathe himself with water before he wears them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_5","004_16_5","LEV","16","5","5","And he shall take from the congregation of Israel two male goats for a sin offering and one ram for a burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_6","004_16_6","LEV","16","6","6","Aaron is to present the bull for his sin offering and make atonement for himself and his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_7","004_16_7","LEV","16","7","7","Then he shall take the two goats and present them before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_8","004_16_8","LEV","16","8","8","After Aaron casts lots for the two goats, one for the LORD and the other for the scapegoat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_9","004_16_9","LEV","16","9","9","he shall present the goat chosen by lot for the LORD and sacrifice it as a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_10","004_16_10","LEV","16","10","10","But the goat chosen by lot as the scapegoat shall be presented alive before the LORD to make atonement by sending it into the wilderness as the scapegoat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_11","004_16_11","LEV","16","11","11","When Aaron presents the bull for his sin offering and makes atonement for himself and his household, he is to slaughter the bull for his own sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_12","004_16_12","LEV","16","12","12","Then he must take a censer full of burning coals from the altar before the LORD, and two handfuls of finely ground fragrant incense, and take them inside the veil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_13","004_16_13","LEV","16","13","13","He is to put the incense on the fire before the LORD, and the cloud of incense will cover the mercy seat above the Testimony, so that he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_14","004_16_14","LEV","16","14","14","And he is to take some of the bull’s blood and sprinkle it with his finger on the east side of the mercy seat; then he shall sprinkle some of it with his finger seven times before the mercy seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_15","004_16_15","LEV","16","15","15","Aaron shall then slaughter the goat for the sin offering for the people and bring its blood behind the veil, and with its blood he must do as he did with the bull’s blood: He is to sprinkle it against the mercy seat and in front of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_16","004_16_16","LEV","16","16","16","So he shall make atonement for the Most Holy Place because of the impurities and rebellious acts of the Israelites in regard to all their sins. He is to do the same for the Tent of Meeting which abides among them in the midst of their impurities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_17","004_16_17","LEV","16","17","17","No one may be in the Tent of Meeting from the time Aaron goes in to make atonement in the Most Holy Place until he leaves, after he has made atonement for himself, his household, and the whole assembly of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_18","004_16_18","LEV","16","18","18","Then he shall go out to the altar that is before the LORD and make atonement for it. He is to take some of the bull’s blood and some of the goat’s blood and put it on all the horns of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_19","004_16_19","LEV","16","19","19","He is to sprinkle some of the blood on it with his finger seven times to cleanse it and consecrate it from the uncleanness of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_20","004_16_20","LEV","16","20","20","When Aaron has finished purifying the Most Holy Place, the Tent of Meeting, and the altar, he is to bring forward the live goat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_21","004_16_21","LEV","16","21","21","Then he is to lay both hands on the head of the live goat and confess over it all the iniquities and rebellious acts of the Israelites in regard to all their sins. He is to put them on the goat’s head and send it away into the wilderness by the hand of a man appointed for the task. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_22","004_16_22","LEV","16","22","22","The goat will carry on itself all their iniquities into a solitary place, and the man will release it into the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_23","004_16_23","LEV","16","23","23","Then Aaron is to enter the Tent of Meeting, take off the linen garments he put on before entering the Most Holy Place, and leave them there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_24","004_16_24","LEV","16","24","24","He is to bathe himself with water in a holy place and put on his own clothes. Then he must go out and sacrifice his burnt offering and the people’s burnt offering to make atonement for himself and for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_25","004_16_25","LEV","16","25","25","He is also to burn the fat of the sin offering on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_26","004_16_26","LEV","16","26","26","The man who released the goat as the scapegoat must wash his clothes and bathe himself with water; afterward he may reenter the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_27","004_16_27","LEV","16","27","27","The bull for the sin offering and the goat for the sin offering, whose blood was brought into the Most Holy Place to make atonement, must be taken outside the camp; and their hides, flesh, and dung must be burned up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_28","004_16_28","LEV","16","28","28","The one who burns them must wash his clothes and bathe himself with water, and afterward he may reenter the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_29","004_16_29","LEV","16","29","29","This is to be a permanent statute for you: On the tenth day of the seventh month, you shall humble yourselves and not do any work—whether the native or the foreigner who resides among you— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_30","004_16_30","LEV","16","30","30","because on this day atonement will be made for you to cleanse you, and you will be clean from all your sins before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_31","004_16_31","LEV","16","31","31","It is a Sabbath of complete rest for you, that you may humble yourselves; it is a permanent statute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_32","004_16_32","LEV","16","32","32","The priest who is anointed and ordained to succeed his father as high priest shall make atonement. He will put on the sacred linen garments ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_33","004_16_33","LEV","16","33","33","and make atonement for the Most Holy Place, the Tent of Meeting, and the altar, and for the priests and all the people of the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV16_34","004_16_34","LEV","16","34","34","This is to be a permanent statute for you, to make atonement once a year for the Israelites because of all their sins.” And all this was done as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_1","004_17_1","LEV","17","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_2","004_17_2","LEV","17","2","2","“Speak to Aaron, his sons, and all the Israelites and tell them this is what the LORD has commanded: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_3","004_17_3","LEV","17","3","3","‘Anyone from the house of Israel who slaughters an ox, a lamb, or a goat in the camp or outside of it ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_4","004_17_4","LEV","17","4","4","instead of bringing it to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting to present it as an offering to the LORD before His tabernacle—that man shall incur bloodguilt. He has shed blood and must be cut off from among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_5","004_17_5","LEV","17","5","5","For this reason the Israelites will bring to the LORD the sacrifices they have been offering in the open fields. They are to bring them to the priest at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting and offer them as sacrifices of peace offerings to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_6","004_17_6","LEV","17","6","6","The priest will then splatter the blood on the altar of the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting and burn the fat as a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_7","004_17_7","LEV","17","7","7","They must no longer offer their sacrifices to the goat demons to which they have prostituted themselves. This will be a permanent statute for them for the generations to come.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_8","004_17_8","LEV","17","8","8","Tell them that if anyone from the house of Israel or any foreigner living among them offers a burnt offering or a sacrifice ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_9","004_17_9","LEV","17","9","9","but does not bring it to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting to sacrifice it to the LORD, that man must be cut off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_10","004_17_10","LEV","17","10","10","If anyone from the house of Israel or a foreigner living among them eats any blood, I will set My face against that person and cut him off from among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_11","004_17_11","LEV","17","11","11","For the life of the flesh is in the blood, and I have given it to you to make atonement for your souls upon the altar; for it is the blood that makes atonement for the soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_12","004_17_12","LEV","17","12","12","Therefore I say to the Israelites, ‘None of you may eat blood, nor may any foreigner living among you eat blood.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_13","004_17_13","LEV","17","13","13","And if any Israelite or foreigner living among them hunts down a wild animal or bird that may be eaten, he must drain its blood and cover it with dirt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_14","004_17_14","LEV","17","14","14","For the life of all flesh is its blood. Therefore I have told the Israelites, ‘You must not eat the blood of any living thing, because the life of all flesh is its blood; whoever eats it must be cut off.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_15","004_17_15","LEV","17","15","15","And any person, whether native or foreigner, who eats anything found dead or mauled by wild beasts must wash his clothes and bathe with water, and he will be unclean until evening; then he will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV17_16","004_17_16","LEV","17","16","16","But if he does not wash his clothes and bathe himself, then he shall bear his iniquity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_1","004_18_1","LEV","18","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_2","004_18_2","LEV","18","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_3","004_18_3","LEV","18","3","3","You must not follow the practices of the land of Egypt, where you used to live, and you must not follow the practices of the land of Canaan, into which I am bringing you. You must not walk in their customs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_4","004_18_4","LEV","18","4","4","You are to practice My judgments and keep My statutes by walking in them. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_5","004_18_5","LEV","18","5","5","Keep My statutes and My judgments, for the man who does these things will live by them. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_6","004_18_6","LEV","18","6","6","None of you are to approach any close relative to have sexual relations. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_7","004_18_7","LEV","18","7","7","You must not expose the nakedness of your father by having sexual relations with your mother. She is your mother; you must not have sexual relations with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_8","004_18_8","LEV","18","8","8","You must not have sexual relations with your father’s wife; it would dishonor your father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_9","004_18_9","LEV","18","9","9","You must not have sexual relations with your sister, either your father’s daughter or your mother’s daughter, whether she was born in the same home or elsewhere. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_10","004_18_10","LEV","18","10","10","You must not have sexual relations with your son’s daughter or your daughter’s daughter, for that would shame your family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_11","004_18_11","LEV","18","11","11","You must not have sexual relations with the daughter of your father’s wife, born to your father; she is your sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_12","004_18_12","LEV","18","12","12","You must not have sexual relations with your father’s sister; she is your father’s close relative. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_13","004_18_13","LEV","18","13","13","You must not have sexual relations with your mother’s sister, for she is your mother’s close relative. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_14","004_18_14","LEV","18","14","14","You must not dishonor your father’s brother by approaching his wife to have sexual relations with her; she is your aunt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_15","004_18_15","LEV","18","15","15","You must not have sexual relations with your daughter-in-law. She is your son’s wife; you are not to have sexual relations with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_16","004_18_16","LEV","18","16","16","You must not have sexual relations with your brother’s wife; that would shame your brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_17","004_18_17","LEV","18","17","17","You must not have sexual relations with both a woman and her daughter. You are not to marry her son’s daughter or her daughter’s daughter and have sexual relations with her. They are close relatives; it is depraved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_18","004_18_18","LEV","18","18","18","You must not take your wife’s sister as a rival wife and have sexual relations with her while your wife is still alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_19","004_18_19","LEV","18","19","19","You must not approach a woman to have sexual relations with her during her menstrual period. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_20","004_18_20","LEV","18","20","20","You must not lie carnally with your neighbor’s wife and thus defile yourself with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_21","004_18_21","LEV","18","21","21","You must not give any of your children to be sacrificed to Molech, for you must not profane the name of your God. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_22","004_18_22","LEV","18","22","22","You must not lie with a man as with a woman; that is an abomination. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_23","004_18_23","LEV","18","23","23","You must not lie carnally with any animal, thus defiling yourself with it; a woman must not stand before an animal to mate with it; that is a perversion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_24","004_18_24","LEV","18","24","24","Do not defile yourselves by any of these practices, for by all these things the nations I am driving out before you have defiled themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_25","004_18_25","LEV","18","25","25","Even the land has become defiled, so I am punishing it for its sin, and the land will vomit out its inhabitants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_26","004_18_26","LEV","18","26","26","But you are to keep My statutes and ordinances, and you must not commit any of these abominations—neither your native-born nor the foreigner who lives among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_27","004_18_27","LEV","18","27","27","For the men who were in the land before you committed all these abominations, and the land has become defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_28","004_18_28","LEV","18","28","28","So if you defile the land, it will vomit you out as it spewed out the nations before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_29","004_18_29","LEV","18","29","29","Therefore anyone who commits any of these abominations must be cut off from among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV18_30","004_18_30","LEV","18","30","30","You must keep My charge not to practice any of the abominable customs that were practiced before you, so that you do not defile yourselves by them. I am the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_1","004_19_1","LEV","19","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_2","004_19_2","LEV","19","2","2","“Speak to the whole congregation of Israel and tell them: Be holy because I, the LORD your God, am holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_3","004_19_3","LEV","19","3","3","Each of you must respect his mother and father, and you must keep My Sabbaths. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_4","004_19_4","LEV","19","4","4","Do not turn to idols or make for yourselves molten gods. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_5","004_19_5","LEV","19","5","5","When you sacrifice a peace offering to the LORD, you shall offer it for your acceptance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_6","004_19_6","LEV","19","6","6","It shall be eaten on the day you sacrifice it, or on the next day; but what remains on the third day must be burned up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_7","004_19_7","LEV","19","7","7","If any of it is eaten on the third day, it is tainted and will not be accepted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_8","004_19_8","LEV","19","8","8","Whoever eats it will bear his iniquity, for he has profaned what is holy to the LORD. That person must be cut off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_9","004_19_9","LEV","19","9","9","When you reap the harvest of your land, you are not to reap to the very edges of your field or gather the gleanings of your harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_10","004_19_10","LEV","19","10","10","You must not strip your vineyard bare or gather its fallen grapes. Leave them for the poor and the foreigner. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_11","004_19_11","LEV","19","11","11","You must not steal. You must not lie or deceive one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_12","004_19_12","LEV","19","12","12","You must not swear falsely by My name and so profane the name of your God. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_13","004_19_13","LEV","19","13","13","You must not defraud your neighbor or rob him. You must not withhold until morning the wages due a hired hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_14","004_19_14","LEV","19","14","14","You must not curse the deaf or place a stumbling block before the blind, but you shall fear your God. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_15","004_19_15","LEV","19","15","15","You must not pervert justice; you must not show partiality to the poor or favoritism to the rich; you are to judge your neighbor fairly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_16","004_19_16","LEV","19","16","16","You must not go about spreading slander among your people. You must not endanger the life of your neighbor. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_17","004_19_17","LEV","19","17","17","You must not harbor hatred against your brother in your heart. Directly rebuke your neighbor, so that you will not incur guilt on account of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_18","004_19_18","LEV","19","18","18","Do not seek revenge or bear a grudge against any of your people, but love your neighbor as yourself. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_19","004_19_19","LEV","19","19","19","You are to keep My statutes. You shall not crossbreed two different kinds of livestock; you shall not sow your fields with two kinds of seed; and you shall not wear clothing made of two kinds of material. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_20","004_19_20","LEV","19","20","20","If a man lies carnally with a slave girl promised to another man but who has not been redeemed or given her freedom, there must be due punishment. But they are not to be put to death, because she had not been freed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_21","004_19_21","LEV","19","21","21","The man, however, must bring a ram to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting as his guilt offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_22","004_19_22","LEV","19","22","22","The priest shall make atonement on his behalf before the LORD with the ram of the guilt offering for the sin he has committed, and he will be forgiven the sin he has committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_23","004_19_23","LEV","19","23","23","When you enter the land and plant any kind of tree for food, you shall regard the fruit as forbidden. For three years it will be forbidden to you and must not be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_24","004_19_24","LEV","19","24","24","In the fourth year all its fruit must be consecrated as a praise offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_25","004_19_25","LEV","19","25","25","But in the fifth year you may eat its fruit; thus your harvest will be increased. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_26","004_19_26","LEV","19","26","26","You must not eat anything with blood still in it. You must not practice divination or sorcery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_27","004_19_27","LEV","19","27","27","You must not cut off the hair at the sides of your head or clip off the edges of your beard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_28","004_19_28","LEV","19","28","28","You must not make any cuts in your bodies for the dead or put tattoo marks on yourselves. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_29","004_19_29","LEV","19","29","29","You must not defile your daughter by making her a prostitute, or the land will be prostituted and filled with depravity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_30","004_19_30","LEV","19","30","30","You must keep My Sabbaths and have reverence for My sanctuary. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_31","004_19_31","LEV","19","31","31","You must not turn to mediums or spiritists; do not seek them out, or you will be defiled by them. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_32","004_19_32","LEV","19","32","32","You are to rise in the presence of the elderly, honor the aged, and fear your God. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_33","004_19_33","LEV","19","33","33","When a foreigner resides with you in your land, you must not oppress him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_34","004_19_34","LEV","19","34","34","You must treat the foreigner living among you as native-born and love him as yourself, for you were foreigners in the land of Egypt. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_35","004_19_35","LEV","19","35","35","You must not use dishonest measures of length, weight, or volume. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_36","004_19_36","LEV","19","36","36","You shall maintain honest scales and weights, an honest ephah, and an honest hin. I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV19_37","004_19_37","LEV","19","37","37","You must keep all My statutes and all My ordinances and follow them. I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_1","004_20_1","LEV","20","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_2","004_20_2","LEV","20","2","2","“Tell the Israelites, ‘Any Israelite or foreigner living in Israel who gives any of his children to Molech must be put to death. The people of the land are to stone him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_3","004_20_3","LEV","20","3","3","And I will set My face against that man and cut him off from his people, because by giving his offspring to Molech, he has defiled My sanctuary and profaned My holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_4","004_20_4","LEV","20","4","4","And if the people of the land ever hide their eyes and fail to put to death the man who gives one of his children to Molech, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_5","004_20_5","LEV","20","5","5","then I will set My face against that man and his family and cut off from among their people both him and all who follow him in prostituting themselves with Molech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_6","004_20_6","LEV","20","6","6","Whoever turns to mediums or spiritists to prostitute himself with them, I will also set My face against that person and cut him off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_7","004_20_7","LEV","20","7","7","Consecrate yourselves, therefore, and be holy, because I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_8","004_20_8","LEV","20","8","8","And you shall keep My statutes and practice them. I am the LORD who sanctifies you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_9","004_20_9","LEV","20","9","9","If anyone curses his father or mother, he must be put to death. He has cursed his father or mother; his blood shall be upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_10","004_20_10","LEV","20","10","10","If a man commits adultery with another man’s wife—with the wife of his neighbor—both the adulterer and the adulteress must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_11","004_20_11","LEV","20","11","11","If a man lies with his father’s wife, he has uncovered his father’s nakedness. Both must surely be put to death; their blood is upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_12","004_20_12","LEV","20","12","12","If a man lies with his daughter-in-law, both must surely be put to death. They have acted perversely; their blood is upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_13","004_20_13","LEV","20","13","13","If a man lies with a man as with a woman, they have both committed an abomination. They must surely be put to death; their blood is upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_14","004_20_14","LEV","20","14","14","If a man marries both a woman and her mother, it is depraved. Both he and they must be burned in the fire, so that there will be no depravity among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_15","004_20_15","LEV","20","15","15","If a man lies carnally with an animal, he must be put to death. And you are also to kill the animal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_16","004_20_16","LEV","20","16","16","If a woman approaches any animal to mate with it, you must kill both the woman and the animal. They must surely be put to death; their blood is upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_17","004_20_17","LEV","20","17","17","If a man marries his sister, whether the daughter of his father or of his mother, and they have sexual relations, it is a disgrace. They must be cut off in the sight of their people. He has uncovered the nakedness of his sister; he shall bear his iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_18","004_20_18","LEV","20","18","18","If a man lies with a menstruating woman and has sexual relations with her, he has exposed the source of her flow, and she has uncovered the source of her blood. Both of them must be cut off from among their people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_19","004_20_19","LEV","20","19","19","You must not have sexual relations with the sister of your mother or your father, for it is exposing one’s own kin; both shall bear their iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_20","004_20_20","LEV","20","20","20","If a man lies with his uncle’s wife, he has uncovered the nakedness of his uncle. They will bear their sin; they shall die childless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_21","004_20_21","LEV","20","21","21","If a man marries his brother’s wife, it is an act of impurity. He has uncovered the nakedness of his brother; they shall be childless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_22","004_20_22","LEV","20","22","22","You are therefore to keep all My statutes and ordinances, so that the land where I am bringing you to live will not vomit you out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_23","004_20_23","LEV","20","23","23","You must not follow the statutes of the nations I am driving out before you. Because they did all these things, I abhorred them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_24","004_20_24","LEV","20","24","24","But I have told you that you will inherit their land, since I will give it to you as an inheritance—a land flowing with milk and honey. I am the LORD your God, who has set you apart from the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_25","004_20_25","LEV","20","25","25","You are therefore to distinguish between clean and unclean animals and birds. Do not become contaminated by any animal or bird, or by anything that crawls on the ground; I have set these apart as unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_26","004_20_26","LEV","20","26","26","You are to be holy to Me because I, the LORD, am holy, and I have set you apart from the nations to be My own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV20_27","004_20_27","LEV","20","27","27","A man or a woman who is a medium or spiritist must surely be put to death. They shall be stoned; their blood is upon them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_1","004_21_1","LEV","21","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Speak to Aaron’s sons, the priests, and tell them that a priest is not to defile himself for a dead person among his people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_2","004_21_2","LEV","21","2","2","except for his immediate family—his mother, father, son, daughter, or brother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_3","004_21_3","LEV","21","3","3","or his unmarried sister who is near to him, since she has no husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_4","004_21_4","LEV","21","4","4","He is not to defile himself for those related to him by marriage, and so profane himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_5","004_21_5","LEV","21","5","5","Priests must not make bald spots on their heads, shave off the edges of their beards, or make cuts in their bodies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_6","004_21_6","LEV","21","6","6","They must be holy to their God and not profane the name of their God. Because they present to the LORD the food offerings, the food of their God, they must be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_7","004_21_7","LEV","21","7","7","A priest must not marry a woman defiled by prostitution or divorced by her husband, for the priest is holy to his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_8","004_21_8","LEV","21","8","8","You are to regard him as holy, since he presents the food of your God. He shall be holy to you, because I the LORD am holy—I who set you apart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_9","004_21_9","LEV","21","9","9","If a priest’s daughter defiles herself by prostituting herself, she profanes her father; she must be burned in the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_10","004_21_10","LEV","21","10","10","The priest who is highest among his brothers, who has had the anointing oil poured on his head and has been ordained to wear the priestly garments, must not let his hair hang loose or tear his garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_11","004_21_11","LEV","21","11","11","He must not go near any dead body; he must not defile himself, even for his father or mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_12","004_21_12","LEV","21","12","12","He must not leave or desecrate the sanctuary of his God, for the consecration of the anointing oil of his God is on him. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_13","004_21_13","LEV","21","13","13","The woman he marries must be a virgin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_14","004_21_14","LEV","21","14","14","He is not to marry a widow, a divorced woman, or one defiled by prostitution. He is to marry a virgin from his own people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_15","004_21_15","LEV","21","15","15","so that he does not defile his offspring among his people, for I am the LORD who sanctifies him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_16","004_21_16","LEV","21","16","16","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_17","004_21_17","LEV","21","17","17","“Say to Aaron, ‘For the generations to come, none of your descendants who has a physical defect may approach to offer the food of his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_18","004_21_18","LEV","21","18","18","No man who has any defect may approach—no man who is blind, lame, disfigured, or deformed; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_19","004_21_19","LEV","21","19","19","no man who has a broken foot or hand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_20","004_21_20","LEV","21","20","20","or who is a hunchback or dwarf, or who has an eye defect, a festering rash, scabs, or a crushed testicle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_21","004_21_21","LEV","21","21","21","No descendant of Aaron the priest who has a defect shall approach to present the food offerings to the LORD. Since he has a defect, he is not to come near to offer the food of his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_22","004_21_22","LEV","21","22","22","He may eat the most holy food of his God as well as the holy food, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_23","004_21_23","LEV","21","23","23","but because he has a defect, he must not go near the veil or approach the altar, so as not to desecrate My sanctuaries. For I am the LORD who sanctifies them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV21_24","004_21_24","LEV","21","24","24","Moses told this to Aaron and his sons and to all the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_1","004_22_1","LEV","22","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_2","004_22_2","LEV","22","2","2","“Tell Aaron and his sons to treat with respect the sacred offerings that the Israelites have consecrated to Me, so that they do not profane My holy name. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_3","004_22_3","LEV","22","3","3","Tell them that for the generations to come, if any of their descendants in a state of uncleanness approaches the sacred offerings that the Israelites consecrate to the LORD, that person must be cut off from My presence. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_4","004_22_4","LEV","22","4","4","If a descendant of Aaron has a skin disease or a discharge, he may not eat the sacred offerings until he is clean. Whoever touches anything defiled by a corpse or by a man who has an emission of semen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_5","004_22_5","LEV","22","5","5","or whoever touches a crawling creature or a person that makes him unclean, whatever the uncleanness may be— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_6","004_22_6","LEV","22","6","6","the man who touches any of these will remain unclean until evening. He must not eat from the sacred offerings unless he has bathed himself with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_7","004_22_7","LEV","22","7","7","When the sun has set, he will become clean, and then he may eat from the sacred offerings, for they are his food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_8","004_22_8","LEV","22","8","8","He must not eat anything found dead or torn by wild animals, which would make him unclean. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_9","004_22_9","LEV","22","9","9","The priests must keep My charge, lest they bear the guilt and die because they profane it. I am the LORD who sanctifies them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_10","004_22_10","LEV","22","10","10","No one outside a priest’s family may eat the sacred offering, nor may the guest of a priest or his hired hand eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_11","004_22_11","LEV","22","11","11","But if a priest buys a slave with his own money, or if a slave is born in his household, that slave may eat his food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_12","004_22_12","LEV","22","12","12","If the priest’s daughter is married to a man other than a priest, she is not to eat of the sacred contributions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_13","004_22_13","LEV","22","13","13","But if a priest’s daughter with no children becomes widowed or divorced and returns to her father’s house, she may share her father’s food as in her youth. But no outsider may share it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_14","004_22_14","LEV","22","14","14","If anyone eats a sacred offering in error, he must add a fifth to its value and give the sacred offering to the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_15","004_22_15","LEV","22","15","15","The priests must not profane the sacred offerings that the Israelites present to the LORD ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_16","004_22_16","LEV","22","16","16","by allowing the people to eat the sacred offerings and thus to bear the punishment for guilt. For I am the LORD who sanctifies them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_17","004_22_17","LEV","22","17","17","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_18","004_22_18","LEV","22","18","18","“Speak to Aaron and his sons and all the Israelites and tell them, ‘Any man of the house of Israel or any foreign resident who presents a gift for a burnt offering to the LORD, whether to fulfill a vow or as a freewill offering, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_19","004_22_19","LEV","22","19","19","must offer an unblemished male from the cattle, sheep, or goats in order for it to be accepted on your behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_20","004_22_20","LEV","22","20","20","You must not present anything with a defect, because it will not be accepted on your behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_21","004_22_21","LEV","22","21","21","When a man presents a peace offering to the LORD from the herd or flock to fulfill a vow or as a freewill offering, it must be without blemish or defect to be acceptable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_22","004_22_22","LEV","22","22","22","You are not to present to the LORD any animal that is blind, injured, or maimed, or anything with a running sore, a festering rash, or a scab; you must not put any of these on the altar as a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_23","004_22_23","LEV","22","23","23","You may present as a freewill offering an ox or sheep that has a deformed or stunted limb, but it is not acceptable in fulfillment of a vow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_24","004_22_24","LEV","22","24","24","You are not to present to the LORD an animal whose testicles are bruised, crushed, torn, or cut; you are not to sacrifice them in your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_25","004_22_25","LEV","22","25","25","Neither you nor a foreigner shall present food to your God from any such animal. They will not be accepted on your behalf, because they are deformed and flawed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_26","004_22_26","LEV","22","26","26","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_27","004_22_27","LEV","22","27","27","“When an ox, a sheep, or a goat is born, it must remain with its mother for seven days. From the eighth day on, it will be acceptable as a food offering presented to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_28","004_22_28","LEV","22","28","28","But you must not slaughter an ox or a sheep on the same day as its young. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_29","004_22_29","LEV","22","29","29","When you sacrifice a thank offering to the LORD, offer it so that it may be acceptable on your behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_30","004_22_30","LEV","22","30","30","It must be eaten that same day. Do not leave any of it until morning. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_31","004_22_31","LEV","22","31","31","You are to keep My commandments and practice them. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_32","004_22_32","LEV","22","32","32","You must not profane My holy name. I must be acknowledged as holy among the Israelites. I am the LORD who sanctifies you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV22_33","004_22_33","LEV","22","33","33","who brought you out of the land of Egypt to be your God. I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_1","004_23_1","LEV","23","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_2","004_23_2","LEV","23","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and say to them, ‘These are My appointed feasts, the feasts of the LORD that you are to proclaim as sacred assemblies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_3","004_23_3","LEV","23","3","3","For six days work may be done, but the seventh day is a Sabbath of complete rest, a day of sacred assembly. You must not do any work; wherever you live, it is a Sabbath to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_4","004_23_4","LEV","23","4","4","These are the LORD’s appointed feasts, the sacred assemblies you are to proclaim at their appointed times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_5","004_23_5","LEV","23","5","5","The Passover to the LORD begins at twilight on the fourteenth day of the first month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_6","004_23_6","LEV","23","6","6","On the fifteenth day of the same month begins the Feast of Unleavened Bread to the LORD. For seven days you must eat unleavened bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_7","004_23_7","LEV","23","7","7","On the first day you are to hold a sacred assembly; you are not to do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_8","004_23_8","LEV","23","8","8","For seven days you are to present a food offering to the LORD. On the seventh day there shall be a sacred assembly; you must not do any regular work.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_9","004_23_9","LEV","23","9","9","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_10","004_23_10","LEV","23","10","10","“Speak to the Israelites and say, ‘When you enter the land that I am giving you and you reap its harvest, you are to bring to the priest a sheaf of the firstfruits of your harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_11","004_23_11","LEV","23","11","11","And he shall wave the sheaf before the LORD so that it may be accepted on your behalf; the priest is to wave it on the day after the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_12","004_23_12","LEV","23","12","12","On the day you wave the sheaf, you shall offer a year-old lamb without blemish as a burnt offering to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_13","004_23_13","LEV","23","13","13","along with its grain offering of two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil—a food offering to the LORD, a pleasing aroma—and its drink offering of a quarter hin of wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_14","004_23_14","LEV","23","14","14","You must not eat any bread or roasted or new grain until the very day you have brought this offering to your God. This is to be a permanent statute for the generations to come, wherever you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_15","004_23_15","LEV","23","15","15","From the day after the Sabbath, the day you brought the sheaf of the wave offering, you are to count off seven full weeks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_16","004_23_16","LEV","23","16","16","You shall count off fifty days until the day after the seventh Sabbath, and then present an offering of new grain to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_17","004_23_17","LEV","23","17","17","Bring two loaves of bread from your dwellings as a wave offering, each made from two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour, baked with leaven, as the firstfruits to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_18","004_23_18","LEV","23","18","18","Along with the bread you are to present seven unblemished male lambs a year old, one young bull, and two rams. They will be a burnt offering to the LORD, together with their grain offerings and drink offerings—a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_19","004_23_19","LEV","23","19","19","You shall also prepare one male goat as a sin offering and two male lambs a year old as a peace offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_20","004_23_20","LEV","23","20","20","The priest is to wave the lambs as a wave offering before the LORD, together with the bread of the firstfruits. The bread and the two lambs shall be holy to the LORD for the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_21","004_23_21","LEV","23","21","21","On that same day you are to proclaim a sacred assembly, and you must not do any regular work. This is to be a permanent statute wherever you live for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_22","004_23_22","LEV","23","22","22","When you reap the harvest of your land, do not reap all the way to the edges of your field or gather the gleanings of your harvest. Leave them for the poor and the foreign resident. I am the LORD your God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_23","004_23_23","LEV","23","23","23","The LORD also said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_24","004_23_24","LEV","23","24","24","“Speak to the Israelites and say, ‘On the first day of the seventh month you are to have a day of rest, a sacred assembly announced by trumpet blasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_25","004_23_25","LEV","23","25","25","You must not do any regular work, but you are to present a food offering to the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_26","004_23_26","LEV","23","26","26","Again the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_27","004_23_27","LEV","23","27","27","“The tenth day of this seventh month is the Day of Atonement. You shall hold a sacred assembly and humble yourselves, and present a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_28","004_23_28","LEV","23","28","28","On this day you are not to do any work, for it is the Day of Atonement, when atonement is made for you before the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_29","004_23_29","LEV","23","29","29","If anyone does not humble himself on this day, he must be cut off from his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_30","004_23_30","LEV","23","30","30","I will destroy from among his people anyone who does any work on this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_31","004_23_31","LEV","23","31","31","You are not to do any work at all. This is a permanent statute for the generations to come, wherever you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_32","004_23_32","LEV","23","32","32","It will be a Sabbath of complete rest for you, and you shall humble yourselves. From the evening of the ninth day of the month until the following evening you are to keep your Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_33","004_23_33","LEV","23","33","33","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_34","004_23_34","LEV","23","34","34","“Speak to the Israelites and say, ‘On the fifteenth day of the seventh month the Feast of Tabernacles to the LORD begins, and it continues for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_35","004_23_35","LEV","23","35","35","On the first day there shall be a sacred assembly. You must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_36","004_23_36","LEV","23","36","36","For seven days you are to present a food offering to the LORD. On the eighth day you are to hold a sacred assembly and present a food offering to the LORD. It is a solemn assembly; you must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_37","004_23_37","LEV","23","37","37","These are the LORD’s appointed feasts, which you are to proclaim as sacred assemblies for presenting food offerings to the LORD—burnt offerings and grain offerings, sacrifices and drink offerings, each on its designated day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_38","004_23_38","LEV","23","38","38","These offerings are in addition to the offerings for the LORD’s Sabbaths, and in addition to your gifts, to all your vow offerings, and to all the freewill offerings you give to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_39","004_23_39","LEV","23","39","39","On the fifteenth day of the seventh month, after you have gathered the produce of the land, you are to celebrate a feast to the LORD for seven days. There shall be complete rest on the first day and also on the eighth day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_40","004_23_40","LEV","23","40","40","On the first day you are to gather the fruit of majestic trees, the branches of palm trees, and the boughs of leafy trees and of willows of the brook. And you are to rejoice before the LORD your God for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_41","004_23_41","LEV","23","41","41","You are to celebrate this as a feast to the LORD for seven days each year. This is a permanent statute for the generations to come; you are to celebrate it in the seventh month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_42","004_23_42","LEV","23","42","42","You are to dwell in booths for seven days. All the native-born of Israel must dwell in booths, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_43","004_23_43","LEV","23","43","43","so that your descendants may know that I made the Israelites dwell in booths when I brought them out of the land of Egypt. I am the LORD your God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV23_44","004_23_44","LEV","23","44","44","So Moses announced to the Israelites the appointed feasts of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_1","004_24_1","LEV","24","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_2","004_24_2","LEV","24","2","2","“Command the Israelites to bring you pure oil of pressed olives for the light, to keep the lamps burning continually. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_3","004_24_3","LEV","24","3","3","Outside the veil of the Testimony in the Tent of Meeting, Aaron is to tend the lamps continually before the LORD from evening until morning. This is to be a permanent statute for the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_4","004_24_4","LEV","24","4","4","He shall tend the lamps on the pure gold lampstand before the LORD continually. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_5","004_24_5","LEV","24","5","5","You are also to take fine flour and bake twelve loaves, using two-tenths of an ephah for each loaf, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_6","004_24_6","LEV","24","6","6","and set them in two rows—six per row—on the table of pure gold before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_7","004_24_7","LEV","24","7","7","And you are to place pure frankincense near each row, so that it may serve as a memorial portion for the bread, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_8","004_24_8","LEV","24","8","8","Every Sabbath day the bread is to be set out before the LORD on behalf of the Israelites as a permanent covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_9","004_24_9","LEV","24","9","9","It belongs to Aaron and his sons, who are to eat it in a holy place; for it is to him a most holy part of the food offerings to the LORD—his portion forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_10","004_24_10","LEV","24","10","10","Now the son of an Israelite mother and an Egyptian father went out among the Israelites, and a fight broke out in the camp between him and an Israelite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_11","004_24_11","LEV","24","11","11","The son of the Israelite woman blasphemed the Name with a curse. So they brought him to Moses. (His mother’s name was Shelomith daughter of Dibri, of the tribe of Dan.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_12","004_24_12","LEV","24","12","12","They placed him in custody until the will of the LORD should be made clear to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_13","004_24_13","LEV","24","13","13","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_14","004_24_14","LEV","24","14","14","“Take the blasphemer outside the camp, and have all who heard him lay their hands on his head; then have the whole assembly stone him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_15","004_24_15","LEV","24","15","15","And you are to tell the Israelites, ‘If anyone curses his God, he shall bear the consequences of his sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_16","004_24_16","LEV","24","16","16","Whoever blasphemes the name of the LORD must surely be put to death; the whole assembly must surely stone him, whether he is a foreign resident or native; if he blasphemes the Name, he must be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_17","004_24_17","LEV","24","17","17","And if a man takes the life of anyone else, he must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_18","004_24_18","LEV","24","18","18","Whoever kills an animal must make restitution—life for life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_19","004_24_19","LEV","24","19","19","If anyone injures his neighbor, whatever he has done must be done to him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_20","004_24_20","LEV","24","20","20","fracture for fracture, eye for eye, tooth for tooth. Just as he injured the other person, the same must be inflicted on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_21","004_24_21","LEV","24","21","21","Whoever kills an animal must make restitution, but whoever kills a man must be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_22","004_24_22","LEV","24","22","22","You are to have the same standard of law for the foreign resident and the native; for I am the LORD your God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV24_23","004_24_23","LEV","24","23","23","Then Moses spoke to the Israelites, and they took the blasphemer outside the camp and stoned him. So the Israelites did as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_1","004_25_1","LEV","25","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses on Mount Sinai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_2","004_25_2","LEV","25","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and say to them: When you enter the land that I am giving you, the land itself must observe a Sabbath to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_3","004_25_3","LEV","25","3","3","For six years you may sow your field and prune your vineyard and gather its crops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_4","004_25_4","LEV","25","4","4","But in the seventh year there shall be a Sabbath of complete rest for the land—a Sabbath to the LORD. You are not to sow your field or prune your vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_5","004_25_5","LEV","25","5","5","You are not to reap the aftergrowth of your harvest or gather the grapes of your untended vines. The land must have a year of complete rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_6","004_25_6","LEV","25","6","6","Whatever the land yields during the Sabbath year shall be food for you—for yourself, your manservant and maidservant, the hired hand or foreigner who stays with you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_7","004_25_7","LEV","25","7","7","and for your livestock and the wild animals in your land. All its growth may serve as food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_8","004_25_8","LEV","25","8","8","And you shall count off seven Sabbaths of years—seven times seven years—so that the seven Sabbaths of years amount to forty-nine years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_9","004_25_9","LEV","25","9","9","Then you are to sound the horn far and wide on the tenth day of the seventh month, the Day of Atonement. You shall sound it throughout your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_10","004_25_10","LEV","25","10","10","So you are to consecrate the fiftieth year and proclaim liberty in the land for all its inhabitants. It shall be your Jubilee, when each of you is to return to his property and to his clan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_11","004_25_11","LEV","25","11","11","The fiftieth year will be a Jubilee for you; you are not to sow the land or reap its aftergrowth or harvest the untended vines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_12","004_25_12","LEV","25","12","12","For it is a Jubilee; it shall be holy to you. You may eat only the crops taken directly from the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_13","004_25_13","LEV","25","13","13","In this Year of Jubilee, each of you shall return to his own property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_14","004_25_14","LEV","25","14","14","If you make a sale to your neighbor or a purchase from him, you must not take advantage of each other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_15","004_25_15","LEV","25","15","15","You are to buy from your neighbor according to the number of years since the last Jubilee; he is to sell to you according to the number of harvest years remaining. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_16","004_25_16","LEV","25","16","16","You shall increase the price in proportion to a greater number of years, or decrease it in proportion to a lesser number of years; for he is selling you a given number of harvests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_17","004_25_17","LEV","25","17","17","Do not take advantage of each other, but fear your God; for I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_18","004_25_18","LEV","25","18","18","You are to keep My statutes and carefully observe My judgments, so that you may dwell securely in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_19","004_25_19","LEV","25","19","19","Then the land will yield its fruit, so that you can eat your fill and dwell in safety in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_20","004_25_20","LEV","25","20","20","Now you may wonder, ‘What will we eat in the seventh year if we do not sow or gather our produce?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_21","004_25_21","LEV","25","21","21","But I will send My blessing upon you in the sixth year, so that the land will yield a crop sufficient for three years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_22","004_25_22","LEV","25","22","22","While you are sowing in the eighth year, you will be eating from the previous harvest, until the ninth year’s harvest comes in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_23","004_25_23","LEV","25","23","23","The land must not be sold permanently, because it is Mine, and you are but foreigners and residents with Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_24","004_25_24","LEV","25","24","24","Thus for every piece of property you possess, you must provide for the redemption of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_25","004_25_25","LEV","25","25","25","If your brother becomes impoverished and sells some of his property, his nearest of kin may come and redeem what his brother has sold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_26","004_25_26","LEV","25","26","26","Or if a man has no one to redeem it for him, but he prospers and acquires enough to redeem his land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_27","004_25_27","LEV","25","27","27","he shall calculate the years since its sale, repay the balance to the man to whom he sold it, and return to his property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_28","004_25_28","LEV","25","28","28","But if he cannot obtain enough to repay him, what he sold will remain in possession of the buyer until the Year of Jubilee. In the Jubilee, however, it is to be released, so that he may return to his property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_29","004_25_29","LEV","25","29","29","If a man sells a house in a walled city, he retains his right of redemption until a full year after its sale; during that year it may be redeemed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_30","004_25_30","LEV","25","30","30","If it is not redeemed by the end of a full year, then the house in the walled city is permanently transferred to its buyer and his descendants. It is not to be released in the Jubilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_31","004_25_31","LEV","25","31","31","But houses in villages with no walls around them are to be considered as open fields. They may be redeemed, and they shall be released in the Jubilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_32","004_25_32","LEV","25","32","32","As for the cities of the Levites, the Levites always have the right to redeem their houses in the cities they possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_33","004_25_33","LEV","25","33","33","So whatever belongs to the Levites may be redeemed—a house sold in a city they possess—and must be released in the Jubilee, because the houses in the cities of the Levites are their possession among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_34","004_25_34","LEV","25","34","34","But the open pastureland around their cities may not be sold, for this is their permanent possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_35","004_25_35","LEV","25","35","35","Now if your countryman becomes destitute and cannot support himself among you, then you are to help him as you would a foreigner or stranger, so that he can continue to live among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_36","004_25_36","LEV","25","36","36","Do not take any interest or profit from him, but fear your God, that your countryman may live among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_37","004_25_37","LEV","25","37","37","You must not lend him your silver at interest or sell him your food for profit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_38","004_25_38","LEV","25","38","38","I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt to give you the land of Canaan and to be your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_39","004_25_39","LEV","25","39","39","If a countryman among you becomes destitute and sells himself to you, then you must not force him into slave labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_40","004_25_40","LEV","25","40","40","Let him stay with you as a hired worker or temporary resident; he is to work for you until the Year of Jubilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_41","004_25_41","LEV","25","41","41","Then he and his children are to be released, and he may return to his clan and to the property of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_42","004_25_42","LEV","25","42","42","Because the Israelites are My servants, whom I brought out of the land of Egypt, they are not to be sold as slaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_43","004_25_43","LEV","25","43","43","You are not to rule over them harshly, but you shall fear your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_44","004_25_44","LEV","25","44","44","Your menservants and maidservants shall come from the nations around you, from whom you may purchase them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_45","004_25_45","LEV","25","45","45","You may also purchase them from the foreigners residing among you or their clans living among you who are born in your land. These may become your property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_46","004_25_46","LEV","25","46","46","You may leave them to your sons after you to inherit as property; you can make them slaves for life. But as for your brothers, the Israelites, no man may rule harshly over his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_47","004_25_47","LEV","25","47","47","If a foreigner residing among you prospers, but your countryman dwelling near him becomes destitute and sells himself to the foreigner or to a member of his clan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_48","004_25_48","LEV","25","48","48","he retains the right of redemption after he has sold himself. One of his brothers may redeem him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_49","004_25_49","LEV","25","49","49","either his uncle or cousin or any close relative from his clan may redeem him. Or if he prospers, he may redeem himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_50","004_25_50","LEV","25","50","50","He and his purchaser will then count the time from the year he sold himself up to the Year of Jubilee. The price of his sale will be determined by the number of years, based on the daily wages of a hired hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_51","004_25_51","LEV","25","51","51","If many years remain, he must pay for his redemption in proportion to his purchase price. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_52","004_25_52","LEV","25","52","52","If only a few years remain until the Year of Jubilee, he is to calculate and pay his redemption according to his remaining years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_53","004_25_53","LEV","25","53","53","He shall be treated like a man hired from year to year, but a foreign owner must not rule over him harshly in your sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_54","004_25_54","LEV","25","54","54","Even if he is not redeemed in any of these ways, he and his children shall be released in the Year of Jubilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV25_55","004_25_55","LEV","25","55","55","For the Israelites are My servants. They are My servants, whom I brought out of the land of Egypt. I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_1","004_26_1","LEV","26","1","1","“You must not make idols for yourselves or set up a carved image or sacred pillar; you must not place a sculpted stone in your land to bow down to it. For I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_2","004_26_2","LEV","26","2","2","You must keep My Sabbaths and have reverence for My sanctuary. I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_3","004_26_3","LEV","26","3","3","If you follow My statutes and carefully keep My commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_4","004_26_4","LEV","26","4","4","I will give you rains in their season, and the land will yield its produce, and the trees of the field will bear their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_5","004_26_5","LEV","26","5","5","Your threshing will continue until the grape harvest, and the grape harvest will continue until sowing time; you will have your fill of food to eat and will dwell securely in your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_6","004_26_6","LEV","26","6","6","And I will give peace to the land, and you will lie down with nothing to fear. I will rid the land of dangerous animals, and no sword will pass through your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_7","004_26_7","LEV","26","7","7","You will pursue your enemies, and they will fall by the sword before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_8","004_26_8","LEV","26","8","8","Five of you will pursue a hundred, and a hundred of you will pursue ten thousand, and your enemies will fall by the sword before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_9","004_26_9","LEV","26","9","9","I will turn toward you and make you fruitful and multiply you, and I will establish My covenant with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_10","004_26_10","LEV","26","10","10","You will still be eating the old supply of grain when you need to clear it out to make room for the new. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_11","004_26_11","LEV","26","11","11","And I will make My dwelling place among you, and My soul will not despise you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_12","004_26_12","LEV","26","12","12","I will walk among you and be your God, and you will be My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_13","004_26_13","LEV","26","13","13","I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt so that you would no longer be slaves to the Egyptians. I broke the bars of your yoke and enabled you to walk in uprightness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_14","004_26_14","LEV","26","14","14","If, however, you fail to obey Me and to carry out all these commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_15","004_26_15","LEV","26","15","15","and if you reject My statutes, despise My ordinances, and neglect to carry out all My commandments, and so break My covenant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_16","004_26_16","LEV","26","16","16","then this is what I will do to you: I will bring upon you sudden terror, wasting disease, and fever that will destroy your sight and drain your life. You will sow your seed in vain, because your enemies will eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_17","004_26_17","LEV","26","17","17","And I will set My face against you, so that you will be defeated by your enemies. Those who hate you will rule over you, and you will flee when no one pursues you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_18","004_26_18","LEV","26","18","18","And if after all this you will not obey Me, I will proceed to punish you sevenfold for your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_19","004_26_19","LEV","26","19","19","I will break down your stubborn pride and make your sky like iron and your land like bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_20","004_26_20","LEV","26","20","20","and your strength will be spent in vain. For your land will not yield its produce, and the trees of the land will not bear their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_21","004_26_21","LEV","26","21","21","If you walk in hostility toward Me and refuse to obey Me, I will multiply your plagues seven times, according to your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_22","004_26_22","LEV","26","22","22","I will send wild animals against you to rob you of your children, destroy your livestock, and reduce your numbers, until your roads lie desolate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_23","004_26_23","LEV","26","23","23","And if in spite of these things you do not accept My discipline, but continue to walk in hostility toward Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_24","004_26_24","LEV","26","24","24","then I will act with hostility toward you, and I will strike you sevenfold for your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_25","004_26_25","LEV","26","25","25","And I will bring a sword against you to execute the vengeance of the covenant. Though you withdraw into your cities, I will send a plague among you, and you will be delivered into the hand of the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_26","004_26_26","LEV","26","26","26","When I cut off your supply of bread, ten women will bake your bread in a single oven and dole out your bread by weight, so that you will eat but not be satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_27","004_26_27","LEV","26","27","27","But if in spite of all this you do not obey Me, but continue to walk in hostility toward Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_28","004_26_28","LEV","26","28","28","then I will walk in fury against you, and I, even I, will punish you sevenfold for your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_29","004_26_29","LEV","26","29","29","You will eat the flesh of your own sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_30","004_26_30","LEV","26","30","30","I will destroy your high places, cut down your incense altars, and heap your lifeless bodies on the lifeless remains of your idols; and My soul will despise you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_31","004_26_31","LEV","26","31","31","I will reduce your cities to rubble and lay waste your sanctuaries, and I will refuse to smell the pleasing aroma of your sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_32","004_26_32","LEV","26","32","32","And I will lay waste the land, so that your enemies who dwell in it will be appalled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_33","004_26_33","LEV","26","33","33","But I will scatter you among the nations and will draw out a sword after you as your land becomes desolate and your cities are laid waste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_34","004_26_34","LEV","26","34","34","Then the land shall enjoy its Sabbaths all the days it lies desolate, while you are in the land of your enemies. At that time the land will rest and enjoy its Sabbaths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_35","004_26_35","LEV","26","35","35","As long as it lies desolate, the land will have the rest it did not receive during the Sabbaths when you lived in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_36","004_26_36","LEV","26","36","36","As for those of you who survive, I will send a faintness into their hearts in the lands of their enemies, so that even the sound of a windblown leaf will put them to flight. And they will flee as one flees the sword, and fall when no one pursues them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_37","004_26_37","LEV","26","37","37","They will stumble over one another as before the sword, though no one is behind them. So you will not be able to stand against your enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_38","004_26_38","LEV","26","38","38","You will perish among the nations, and the land of your enemies will consume you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_39","004_26_39","LEV","26","39","39","Those of you who survive in the lands of your enemies will waste away in their iniquity and will decay in the sins of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_40","004_26_40","LEV","26","40","40","But if they will confess their iniquity and that of their fathers in the unfaithfulness that they practiced against Me, by which they have also walked in hostility toward Me— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_41","004_26_41","LEV","26","41","41","and I acted with hostility toward them and brought them into the land of their enemies—and if their uncircumcised hearts will be humbled and they will make amends for their iniquity, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_42","004_26_42","LEV","26","42","42","then I will remember My covenant with Jacob and My covenant with Isaac and My covenant with Abraham, and I will remember the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_43","004_26_43","LEV","26","43","43","For the land will be abandoned by them, and it will enjoy its Sabbaths by lying desolate without them. And they will pay the penalty for their iniquity, because they rejected My ordinances and abhorred My statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_44","004_26_44","LEV","26","44","44","Yet in spite of this, when they are in the land of their enemies, I will not reject or despise them so as to destroy them and break My covenant with them; for I am the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_45","004_26_45","LEV","26","45","45","But for their sake I will remember the covenant with their fathers, whom I brought out of the land of Egypt in the sight of the nations, that I might be their God. I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV26_46","004_26_46","LEV","26","46","46","These are the statutes, ordinances, and laws that the LORD established between Himself and the Israelites through Moses on Mount Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_1","004_27_1","LEV","27","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_2","004_27_2","LEV","27","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and say to them, ‘When someone makes a special vow to the LORD involving the value of persons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_3","004_27_3","LEV","27","3","3","if the valuation concerns a male from twenty to sixty years of age, then your valuation shall be fifty shekels of silver, according to the sanctuary shekel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_4","004_27_4","LEV","27","4","4","Or if it is a female, then your valuation shall be thirty shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_5","004_27_5","LEV","27","5","5","And if the person is from five to twenty years of age, then your valuation for the male shall be twenty shekels, and for the female ten shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_6","004_27_6","LEV","27","6","6","Now if the person is from one month to five years of age, then your valuation for the male shall be five shekels of silver, and for the female three shekels of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_7","004_27_7","LEV","27","7","7","And if the person is sixty years of age or older, then your valuation shall be fifteen shekels for the male and ten shekels for the female. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_8","004_27_8","LEV","27","8","8","But if the one making the vow is too poor to pay the valuation, he is to present the person before the priest, who shall set the value according to what the one making the vow can afford. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_9","004_27_9","LEV","27","9","9","If he vows an animal that may be brought as an offering to the LORD, any such animal given to the LORD shall be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_10","004_27_10","LEV","27","10","10","He must not replace it or exchange it, either good for bad or bad for good. But if he does substitute one animal for another, both that animal and its substitute will be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_11","004_27_11","LEV","27","11","11","But if the vow involves any of the unclean animals that may not be brought as an offering to the LORD, the animal must be presented before the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_12","004_27_12","LEV","27","12","12","The priest shall set its value, whether high or low; as the priest values it, the price will be set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_13","004_27_13","LEV","27","13","13","If, however, the owner decides to redeem the animal, he must add a fifth to its value. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_14","004_27_14","LEV","27","14","14","Now if a man consecrates his house as holy to the LORD, then the priest shall value it either as good or bad. The price will stand just as the priest values it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_15","004_27_15","LEV","27","15","15","But if he who consecrated his house redeems it, he must add a fifth to the assessed value, and it will belong to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_16","004_27_16","LEV","27","16","16","If a man consecrates to the LORD a parcel of his land, then your valuation shall be proportional to the seed required for it—fifty shekels of silver for every homer of barley seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_17","004_27_17","LEV","27","17","17","If he consecrates his field during the Year of Jubilee, the price will stand according to your valuation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_18","004_27_18","LEV","27","18","18","But if he consecrates his field after the Jubilee, the priest is to calculate the price in proportion to the years left until the next Year of Jubilee, so that your valuation will be reduced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_19","004_27_19","LEV","27","19","19","And if the one who consecrated the field decides to redeem it, he must add a fifth to the assessed value, and it shall belong to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_20","004_27_20","LEV","27","20","20","If, however, he does not redeem the field, or if he has sold it to another man, it may no longer be redeemed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_21","004_27_21","LEV","27","21","21","When the field is released in the Jubilee, it will become holy, like a field devoted to the LORD; it becomes the property of the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_22","004_27_22","LEV","27","22","22","Now if a man consecrates to the LORD a field he has purchased, which is not a part of his own property, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_23","004_27_23","LEV","27","23","23","then the priest shall calculate for him the value up to the Year of Jubilee, and the man shall pay the assessed value on that day as a sacred offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_24","004_27_24","LEV","27","24","24","In the Year of Jubilee the field shall return to the one from whom it was bought—the original owner of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_25","004_27_25","LEV","27","25","25","Every valuation will be according to the sanctuary shekel, twenty gerahs to the shekel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_26","004_27_26","LEV","27","26","26","But no one may consecrate a firstborn of the livestock, because a firstborn belongs to the LORD. Whether it is an ox or a sheep, it is the LORD’s. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_27","004_27_27","LEV","27","27","27","But if it is among the unclean animals, then he may redeem it according to your valuation and add a fifth of its value. If it is not redeemed, then it shall be sold according to your valuation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_28","004_27_28","LEV","27","28","28","Nothing that a man sets apart to the LORD from all he owns—whether a man, an animal, or his inherited land—can be sold or redeemed; everything so devoted is most holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_29","004_27_29","LEV","27","29","29","No person set apart for destruction may be ransomed; he must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_30","004_27_30","LEV","27","30","30","Thus any tithe from the land, whether from the seed of the land or the fruit of the trees, belongs to the LORD; it is holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_31","004_27_31","LEV","27","31","31","If a man wishes to redeem part of his tithe, he must add a fifth to its value. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_32","004_27_32","LEV","27","32","32","Every tenth animal from the herd or flock that passes under the shepherd’s rod will be holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_33","004_27_33","LEV","27","33","33","He must not inspect whether it is good or bad, and he shall not make any substitution. But if he does make a substitution, both the animal and its substitute shall become holy; they cannot be redeemed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LV27_34","004_27_34","LEV","27","34","34","These are the commandments that the LORD gave to Moses for the Israelites on Mount Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_1","005_1_1","NUM","1","1","1","On the first day of the second month of the second year after the Israelites had come out of the land of Egypt, the LORD spoke to Moses in the Tent of Meeting in the Wilderness of Sinai. He said: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_2","005_1_2","NUM","1","2","2","“Take a census of the whole congregation of Israel by their clans and families, listing every man by name, one by one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_3","005_1_3","NUM","1","3","3","You and Aaron are to number those who are twenty years of age or older by their divisions—everyone who can serve in Israel’s army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_4","005_1_4","NUM","1","4","4","And one man from each tribe, the head of each family, must be there with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_5","005_1_5","NUM","1","5","5","These are the names of the men who are to assist you: From the tribe of Reuben, Elizur son of Shedeur; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_6","005_1_6","NUM","1","6","6","from Simeon, Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_7","005_1_7","NUM","1","7","7","from Judah, Nahshon son of Amminadab; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_8","005_1_8","NUM","1","8","8","from Issachar, Nethanel son of Zuar; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_9","005_1_9","NUM","1","9","9","from Zebulun, Eliab son of Helon; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_10","005_1_10","NUM","1","10","10","from the sons of Joseph: from Ephraim, Elishama son of Ammihud, and from Manasseh, Gamaliel son of Pedahzur; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_11","005_1_11","NUM","1","11","11","from Benjamin, Abidan son of Gideoni; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_12","005_1_12","NUM","1","12","12","from Dan, Ahiezer son of Ammishaddai; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_13","005_1_13","NUM","1","13","13","from Asher, Pagiel son of Ocran; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_14","005_1_14","NUM","1","14","14","from Gad, Eliasaph son of Deuel; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_15","005_1_15","NUM","1","15","15","and from Naphtali, Ahira son of Enan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_16","005_1_16","NUM","1","16","16","These men were appointed from the congregation; they were the leaders of the tribes of their fathers, the heads of the clans of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_17","005_1_17","NUM","1","17","17","So Moses and Aaron took these men who had been designated by name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_18","005_1_18","NUM","1","18","18","and on the first day of the second month they assembled the whole congregation and recorded their ancestry by clans and families, counting one by one the names of those twenty years of age or older, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_19","005_1_19","NUM","1","19","19","just as the LORD had commanded Moses. So Moses numbered them in the Wilderness of Sinai: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_20","005_1_20","NUM","1","20","20","From the sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel, according to the records of their clans and families, counting one by one the names of every male twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_21","005_1_21","NUM","1","21","21","those registered to the tribe of Reuben numbered 46,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_22","005_1_22","NUM","1","22","22","From the sons of Simeon, according to the records of their clans and families, counting one by one the names of every male twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_23","005_1_23","NUM","1","23","23","those registered to the tribe of Simeon numbered 59,300. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_24","005_1_24","NUM","1","24","24","From the sons of Gad, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_25","005_1_25","NUM","1","25","25","those registered to the tribe of Gad numbered 45,650. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_26","005_1_26","NUM","1","26","26","From the sons of Judah, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_27","005_1_27","NUM","1","27","27","those registered to the tribe of Judah numbered 74,600. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_28","005_1_28","NUM","1","28","28","From the sons of Issachar, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_29","005_1_29","NUM","1","29","29","those registered to the tribe of Issachar numbered 54,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_30","005_1_30","NUM","1","30","30","From the sons of Zebulun, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_31","005_1_31","NUM","1","31","31","those registered to the tribe of Zebulun numbered 57,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_32","005_1_32","NUM","1","32","32","From the sons of Joseph: From the sons of Ephraim, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_33","005_1_33","NUM","1","33","33","those registered to the tribe of Ephraim numbered 40,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_34","005_1_34","NUM","1","34","34","And from the sons of Manasseh, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_35","005_1_35","NUM","1","35","35","those registered to the tribe of Manasseh numbered 32,200. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_36","005_1_36","NUM","1","36","36","From the sons of Benjamin, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_37","005_1_37","NUM","1","37","37","those registered to the tribe of Benjamin numbered 35,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_38","005_1_38","NUM","1","38","38","From the sons of Dan, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_39","005_1_39","NUM","1","39","39","those registered to the tribe of Dan numbered 62,700. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_40","005_1_40","NUM","1","40","40","From the sons of Asher, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_41","005_1_41","NUM","1","41","41","those registered to the tribe of Asher numbered 41,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_42","005_1_42","NUM","1","42","42","From the sons of Naphtali, according to the records of their clans and families, counting the names of all those twenty years of age or older who could serve in the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_43","005_1_43","NUM","1","43","43","those registered to the tribe of Naphtali numbered 53,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_44","005_1_44","NUM","1","44","44","These were the men numbered by Moses and Aaron, with the assistance of the twelve leaders of Israel, each one representing his family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_45","005_1_45","NUM","1","45","45","So all the Israelites twenty years of age or older who could serve in Israel’s army were counted according to their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_46","005_1_46","NUM","1","46","46","And all those counted totaled 603,550. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_47","005_1_47","NUM","1","47","47","The Levites, however, were not numbered along with them by the tribe of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_48","005_1_48","NUM","1","48","48","For the LORD had said to Moses: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_49","005_1_49","NUM","1","49","49","“Do not number the tribe of Levi in the census with the other Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_50","005_1_50","NUM","1","50","50","Instead, you are to appoint the Levites over the tabernacle of the Testimony, all its furnishings, and everything in it. They shall carry the tabernacle and all its articles, care for it, and camp around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_51","005_1_51","NUM","1","51","51","Whenever the tabernacle is to move, the Levites are to take it down, and whenever it is to be pitched, the Levites are to set it up. Any outsider who goes near it must be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_52","005_1_52","NUM","1","52","52","The Israelites are to camp by their divisions, each man in his own camp and under his own standard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_53","005_1_53","NUM","1","53","53","But the Levites are to camp around the tabernacle of the Testimony and watch over it, so that no wrath will fall on the congregation of Israel. So the Levites are responsible for the tabernacle of the Testimony.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU1_54","005_1_54","NUM","1","54","54","Thus the Israelites did everything just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_1","005_2_1","NUM","2","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_2","005_2_2","NUM","2","2","2","“The Israelites are to camp around the Tent of Meeting at a distance from it, each man under his standard, with the banners of his family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_3","005_2_3","NUM","2","3","3","On the east side, toward the sunrise, the divisions of Judah are to camp under their standard: The leader of the Judahites is Nahshon son of Amminadab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_4","005_2_4","NUM","2","4","4","and his division numbers 74,600. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_5","005_2_5","NUM","2","5","5","The tribe of Issachar will camp next to it. The leader of the Issacharites is Nethanel son of Zuar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_6","005_2_6","NUM","2","6","6","and his division numbers 54,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_7","005_2_7","NUM","2","7","7","Next will be the tribe of Zebulun. The leader of the Zebulunites is Eliab son of Helon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_8","005_2_8","NUM","2","8","8","and his division numbers 57,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_9","005_2_9","NUM","2","9","9","The total number of men in the divisions of the camp of Judah is 186,400; they shall set out first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_10","005_2_10","NUM","2","10","10","On the south side, the divisions of Reuben are to camp under their standard: The leader of the Reubenites is Elizur son of Shedeur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_11","005_2_11","NUM","2","11","11","and his division numbers 46,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_12","005_2_12","NUM","2","12","12","The tribe of Simeon will camp next to it. The leader of the Simeonites is Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_13","005_2_13","NUM","2","13","13","and his division numbers 59,300. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_14","005_2_14","NUM","2","14","14","Next will be the tribe of Gad. The leader of the Gadites is Eliasaph son of Deuel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_15","005_2_15","NUM","2","15","15","and his division numbers 45,650. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_16","005_2_16","NUM","2","16","16","The total number of men in the divisions of the camp of Reuben is 151,450; they shall set out second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_17","005_2_17","NUM","2","17","17","In the middle of the camps, the Tent of Meeting is to travel with the camp of the Levites. They are to set out in the order they encamped, each in his own place under his standard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_18","005_2_18","NUM","2","18","18","On the west side, the divisions of Ephraim are to camp under their standard: The leader of the Ephraimites is Elishama son of Ammihud, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_19","005_2_19","NUM","2","19","19","and his division numbers 40,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_20","005_2_20","NUM","2","20","20","The tribe of Manasseh will be next to it. The leader of the Manassites is Gamaliel son of Pedahzur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_21","005_2_21","NUM","2","21","21","and his division numbers 32,200. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_22","005_2_22","NUM","2","22","22","Next will be the tribe of Benjamin. The leader of the Benjamites is Abidan son of Gideoni, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_23","005_2_23","NUM","2","23","23","and his division numbers 35,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_24","005_2_24","NUM","2","24","24","The total number of men in the divisions of the camp of Ephraim is 108,100; they shall set out third. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_25","005_2_25","NUM","2","25","25","On the north side, the divisions of Dan are to camp under their standard: The leader of the Danites is Ahiezer son of Ammishaddai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_26","005_2_26","NUM","2","26","26","and his division numbers 62,700. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_27","005_2_27","NUM","2","27","27","The tribe of Asher will camp next to it. The leader of the Asherites is Pagiel son of Ocran, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_28","005_2_28","NUM","2","28","28","and his division numbers 41,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_29","005_2_29","NUM","2","29","29","Next will be the tribe of Naphtali. The leader of the Naphtalites is Ahira son of Enan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_30","005_2_30","NUM","2","30","30","and his division numbers 53,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_31","005_2_31","NUM","2","31","31","The total number of men in the camp of Dan is 157,600; they shall set out last, under their standards.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_32","005_2_32","NUM","2","32","32","These are the Israelites, numbered according to their families. The total of those counted in the camps, by their divisions, was 603,550. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_33","005_2_33","NUM","2","33","33","But the Levites were not counted among the other Israelites, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU2_34","005_2_34","NUM","2","34","34","So the Israelites did everything the LORD commanded Moses; they camped under their standards in this way and set out in the same way, each man with his clan and his family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_1","005_3_1","NUM","3","1","1","This is the account of Aaron and Moses at the time the LORD spoke with Moses on Mount Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_2","005_3_2","NUM","3","2","2","These are the names of the sons of Aaron: Nadab the firstborn, then Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_3","005_3_3","NUM","3","3","3","These were Aaron’s sons, the anointed priests, who were ordained to serve as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_4","005_3_4","NUM","3","4","4","Nadab and Abihu, however, died in the presence of the LORD when they offered unauthorized fire before the LORD in the Wilderness of Sinai. And since they had no sons, only Eleazar and Ithamar served as priests during the lifetime of their father Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_5","005_3_5","NUM","3","5","5","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_6","005_3_6","NUM","3","6","6","“Bring the tribe of Levi and present them to Aaron the priest to assist him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_7","005_3_7","NUM","3","7","7","They are to perform duties for him and for the whole congregation before the Tent of Meeting, attending to the service of the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_8","005_3_8","NUM","3","8","8","They shall take care of all the furnishings of the Tent of Meeting and fulfill obligations for the Israelites by attending to the service of the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_9","005_3_9","NUM","3","9","9","Assign the Levites to Aaron and his sons; they have been given exclusively to him from among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_10","005_3_10","NUM","3","10","10","So you shall appoint Aaron and his sons to carry out the duties of the priesthood; but any outsider who approaches the tabernacle must be put to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_11","005_3_11","NUM","3","11","11","Again the LORD spoke to Moses, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_12","005_3_12","NUM","3","12","12","“Behold, I have taken the Levites from among the children of Israel in place of every firstborn Israelite from the womb. The Levites belong to Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_13","005_3_13","NUM","3","13","13","for all the firstborn are Mine. On the day I struck down every firstborn in the land of Egypt, I consecrated to Myself all the firstborn in Israel, both man and beast. They are Mine; I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_14","005_3_14","NUM","3","14","14","Then the LORD spoke to Moses in the Wilderness of Sinai, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_15","005_3_15","NUM","3","15","15","“Number the Levites by their families and clans. You are to count every male a month old or more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_16","005_3_16","NUM","3","16","16","So Moses numbered them according to the word of the LORD, as he had been commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_17","005_3_17","NUM","3","17","17","These were the sons of Levi by name: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_18","005_3_18","NUM","3","18","18","These were the names of the sons of Gershon by their clans: Libni and Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_19","005_3_19","NUM","3","19","19","The sons of Kohath by their clans were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_20","005_3_20","NUM","3","20","20","And the sons of Merari by their clans were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites, according to their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_21","005_3_21","NUM","3","21","21","From Gershon came the Libnite clan and the Shimeite clan; these were the Gershonite clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_22","005_3_22","NUM","3","22","22","The number of all the males a month old or more was 7,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_23","005_3_23","NUM","3","23","23","The Gershonite clans were to camp on the west, behind the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_24","005_3_24","NUM","3","24","24","and the leader of the families of the Gershonites was Eliasaph son of Lael. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_25","005_3_25","NUM","3","25","25","The duties of the Gershonites at the Tent of Meeting were the tabernacle and tent, its covering, the curtain for the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_26","005_3_26","NUM","3","26","26","the curtains of the courtyard, the curtain for the entrance to the courtyard that surrounds the tabernacle and altar, and the cords—all the service for these items. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_27","005_3_27","NUM","3","27","27","From Kohath came the clans of the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites, and the Uzzielites; these were the clans of the Kohathites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_28","005_3_28","NUM","3","28","28","The number of all the males a month old or more was 8,600. They were responsible for the duties of the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_29","005_3_29","NUM","3","29","29","The clans of the Kohathites were to camp on the south side of the tabernacle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_30","005_3_30","NUM","3","30","30","and the leader of the families of the Kohathites was Elizaphan son of Uzziel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_31","005_3_31","NUM","3","31","31","Their duties were the ark, the table, the lampstand, the altars, the articles of the sanctuary used with them, and the curtain—all the service for these items. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_32","005_3_32","NUM","3","32","32","The chief of the leaders of the Levites was Eleazar son of Aaron the priest; he oversaw those responsible for the duties of the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_33","005_3_33","NUM","3","33","33","From Merari came the clans of the Mahlites and Mushites; these were the Merarite clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_34","005_3_34","NUM","3","34","34","The number of all the males a month old or more was 6,200. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_35","005_3_35","NUM","3","35","35","The leader of the families of the Merarites was Zuriel son of Abihail; they were to camp on the north side of the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_36","005_3_36","NUM","3","36","36","The duties assigned to the sons of Merari were the tabernacle’s frames, crossbars, posts, bases, and all its equipment—all the service for these items, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_37","005_3_37","NUM","3","37","37","as well as the posts of the surrounding courtyard with their bases, tent pegs, and ropes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_38","005_3_38","NUM","3","38","38","Moses, Aaron, and Aaron’s sons were to camp to the east of the tabernacle, toward the sunrise, before the Tent of Meeting. They were to perform the duties of the sanctuary as a service on behalf of the Israelites; but any outsider who approached the sanctuary was to be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_39","005_3_39","NUM","3","39","39","The total number of Levites that Moses and Aaron counted by their clans at the LORD’s command, including all the males a month old or more, was 22,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_40","005_3_40","NUM","3","40","40","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Number every firstborn male of the Israelites a month old or more, and list their names. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_41","005_3_41","NUM","3","41","41","You are to take the Levites for Me—I am the LORD—in place of all the firstborn of Israel, and the livestock of the Levites in place of all the firstborn of the livestock of the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_42","005_3_42","NUM","3","42","42","So Moses numbered all the firstborn of the Israelites, as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_43","005_3_43","NUM","3","43","43","The total number of the firstborn males a month old or more, listed by name, was 22,273. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_44","005_3_44","NUM","3","44","44","Again the LORD spoke to Moses, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_45","005_3_45","NUM","3","45","45","“Take the Levites in place of all the firstborn of Israel, and the livestock of the Levites in place of their livestock. The Levites belong to Me; I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_46","005_3_46","NUM","3","46","46","To redeem the 273 firstborn Israelites who outnumber the Levites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_47","005_3_47","NUM","3","47","47","you are to collect five shekels for each one, according to the sanctuary shekel of twenty gerahs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_48","005_3_48","NUM","3","48","48","Give the money to Aaron and his sons as the redemption price for the excess among the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_49","005_3_49","NUM","3","49","49","So Moses collected the redemption money from those in excess of the number redeemed by the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_50","005_3_50","NUM","3","50","50","He collected the money from the firstborn of the Israelites: 1,365 shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU3_51","005_3_51","NUM","3","51","51","And Moses gave the redemption money to Aaron and his sons in obedience to the word of the LORD, just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_1","005_4_1","NUM","4","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_2","005_4_2","NUM","4","2","2","“Take a census of the Kohathites among the Levites by their clans and families, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_3","005_4_3","NUM","4","3","3","men from thirty to fifty years old—everyone who is qualified to serve in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_4","005_4_4","NUM","4","4","4","This service of the Kohathites at the Tent of Meeting regards the most holy things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_5","005_4_5","NUM","4","5","5","Whenever the camp sets out, Aaron and his sons are to go in, take down the veil of the curtain, and cover the ark of the Testimony with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_6","005_4_6","NUM","4","6","6","They are to place over this a covering of fine leather, spread a solid blue cloth over it, and insert its poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_7","005_4_7","NUM","4","7","7","Over the table of the Presence they are to spread a blue cloth and place the plates and cups on it, along with the bowls and pitchers for the drink offering. The regular bread offering is to remain on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_8","005_4_8","NUM","4","8","8","And they shall spread a scarlet cloth over them, cover them with fine leather, and insert the poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_9","005_4_9","NUM","4","9","9","They are to take a blue cloth and cover the lampstand used for light, together with its lamps, wick trimmers, and trays, as well as the jars of oil with which to supply it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_10","005_4_10","NUM","4","10","10","Then they shall wrap it and all its utensils inside a covering of fine leather and put it on the carrying frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_11","005_4_11","NUM","4","11","11","Over the gold altar they are to spread a blue cloth, cover it with fine leather, and insert the poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_12","005_4_12","NUM","4","12","12","They are to take all the utensils for serving in the sanctuary, place them in a blue cloth, cover them with fine leather, and put them on the carrying frame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_13","005_4_13","NUM","4","13","13","Then they shall remove the ashes from the bronze altar, spread a purple cloth over it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_14","005_4_14","NUM","4","14","14","and place on it all the vessels used to serve there: the firepans, meat forks, shovels, and sprinkling bowls—all the equipment of the altar. They are to spread over it a covering of fine leather and insert the poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_15","005_4_15","NUM","4","15","15","When Aaron and his sons have finished covering the holy objects and all their equipment, as soon as the camp is ready to move, the Kohathites shall come and do the carrying. But they must not touch the holy objects, or they will die. These are the transportation duties of the Kohathites regarding the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_16","005_4_16","NUM","4","16","16","Eleazar son of Aaron the priest shall oversee the oil for the light, the fragrant incense, the daily grain offering, and the anointing oil. He has oversight of the entire tabernacle and everything in it, including the holy objects and their utensils.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_17","005_4_17","NUM","4","17","17","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_18","005_4_18","NUM","4","18","18","“Do not allow the Kohathite tribal clans to be cut off from among the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_19","005_4_19","NUM","4","19","19","In order that they may live and not die when they come near the most holy things, do this for them: Aaron and his sons are to go in and assign each man his task and what he is to carry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_20","005_4_20","NUM","4","20","20","But the Kohathites are not to go in and look at the holy objects, even for a moment, or they will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_21","005_4_21","NUM","4","21","21","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_22","005_4_22","NUM","4","22","22","“Take a census of the Gershonites as well, by their families and clans, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_23","005_4_23","NUM","4","23","23","from thirty to fifty years old, counting everyone who comes to serve in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_24","005_4_24","NUM","4","24","24","This is the service of the Gershonite clans regarding work and transport: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_25","005_4_25","NUM","4","25","25","They are to carry the curtains of the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting with the covering of fine leather over it, the curtains for the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_26","005_4_26","NUM","4","26","26","the curtains of the courtyard, and the curtains for the entrance at the gate of the courtyard that surrounds the tabernacle and altar, along with their ropes and all the equipment for their service. The Gershonites will do all that needs to be done with these items. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_27","005_4_27","NUM","4","27","27","All the service of the Gershonites—all their transport duties and other work—is to be done at the direction of Aaron and his sons; you are to assign to them all that they are responsible to carry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_28","005_4_28","NUM","4","28","28","This is the service of the Gershonite clans at the Tent of Meeting, and their duties shall be under the direction of Ithamar son of Aaron the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_29","005_4_29","NUM","4","29","29","As for the sons of Merari, you are to number them by their clans and families, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_30","005_4_30","NUM","4","30","30","from thirty to fifty years old, counting everyone who comes to serve in the work of the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_31","005_4_31","NUM","4","31","31","This is the duty for all their service at the Tent of Meeting: to carry the frames of the tabernacle with its crossbars, posts, and bases, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_32","005_4_32","NUM","4","32","32","and the posts of the surrounding courtyard with their bases, tent pegs, and ropes, including all their equipment and everything related to their use. You shall assign by name the items that they are responsible to carry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_33","005_4_33","NUM","4","33","33","This is the service of the Merarite clans according to all their work at the Tent of Meeting, under the direction of Ithamar son of Aaron the priest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_34","005_4_34","NUM","4","34","34","So Moses, Aaron, and the leaders of the congregation numbered the Kohathites by their clans and families, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_35","005_4_35","NUM","4","35","35","everyone from thirty to fifty years old who came to serve in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_36","005_4_36","NUM","4","36","36","And those numbered by their clans totaled 2,750. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_37","005_4_37","NUM","4","37","37","These were counted from the Kohathite clans, everyone who could serve at the Tent of Meeting. Moses and Aaron numbered them according to the command of the LORD through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_38","005_4_38","NUM","4","38","38","Then the Gershonites were numbered by their clans and families, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_39","005_4_39","NUM","4","39","39","everyone from thirty to fifty years old who came to serve in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_40","005_4_40","NUM","4","40","40","And those numbered by their clans and families totaled 2,630. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_41","005_4_41","NUM","4","41","41","These were counted from the Gershonite clans who served at the Tent of Meeting, whom Moses and Aaron counted at the LORD’s command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_42","005_4_42","NUM","4","42","42","And the Merarites were numbered by their clans and families, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_43","005_4_43","NUM","4","43","43","everyone from thirty to fifty years old who came to serve in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_44","005_4_44","NUM","4","44","44","The men registered by their clans numbered 3,200. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_45","005_4_45","NUM","4","45","45","These were counted from the Merarite clans, whom Moses and Aaron numbered at the LORD’s command through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_46","005_4_46","NUM","4","46","46","So Moses, Aaron, and the leaders of Israel numbered by their clans and families all the Levites ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_47","005_4_47","NUM","4","47","47","from thirty to fifty years old who came to do the work of serving and carrying the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_48","005_4_48","NUM","4","48","48","And the number of men was 8,580. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU4_49","005_4_49","NUM","4","49","49","At the LORD’s command through Moses they were numbered, and each one was assigned his work and burden, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_1","005_5_1","NUM","5","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_2","005_5_2","NUM","5","2","2","“Command the Israelites to send away from the camp anyone with a skin disease, anyone who has a bodily discharge, and anyone who is defiled by a dead body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_3","005_5_3","NUM","5","3","3","You must send away male and female alike; send them outside the camp so they will not defile their camp, where I dwell among them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_4","005_5_4","NUM","5","4","4","So the Israelites did this, sending such people outside the camp. They did just as the LORD had instructed Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_5","005_5_5","NUM","5","5","5","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_6","005_5_6","NUM","5","6","6","“Tell the Israelites that when a man or woman acts unfaithfully against the LORD by committing any sin against another, that person is guilty ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_7","005_5_7","NUM","5","7","7","and must confess the sin he has committed. He must make full restitution, add a fifth to its value, and give all this to the one he has wronged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_8","005_5_8","NUM","5","8","8","But if the man has no relative to whom restitution can be made for the wrong, the restitution belongs to the LORD and must be given to the priest along with the ram of atonement, by which the atonement is made for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_9","005_5_9","NUM","5","9","9","Every sacred contribution the Israelites bring to the priest shall belong to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_10","005_5_10","NUM","5","10","10","Each man’s sacred gifts are his own, but whatever he gives to the priest will belong to the priest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_11","005_5_11","NUM","5","11","11","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_12","005_5_12","NUM","5","12","12","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them that if any man’s wife goes astray and is unfaithful to him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_13","005_5_13","NUM","5","13","13","by sleeping with another man, and it is concealed from her husband and her impurity is undetected (since there is no witness against her and she was not caught in the act), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_14","005_5_14","NUM","5","14","14","and if a feeling of jealousy comes over her husband and he suspects his wife who has defiled herself—or if a feeling of jealousy comes over him and he suspects her even though she has not defiled herself— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_15","005_5_15","NUM","5","15","15","then he is to bring his wife to the priest. He must also bring for her an offering of a tenth of an ephah of barley flour. He is not to pour oil over it or put frankincense on it, because it is a grain offering for jealousy, an offering of memorial as a reminder of iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_16","005_5_16","NUM","5","16","16","The priest is to bring the wife forward and have her stand before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_17","005_5_17","NUM","5","17","17","Then he is to take some holy water in a clay jar and put some of the dust from the tabernacle floor into the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_18","005_5_18","NUM","5","18","18","After the priest has the woman stand before the LORD, he is to let down her hair and place in her hands the grain offering of memorial, which is the grain offering for jealousy. The priest is to hold the bitter water that brings a curse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_19","005_5_19","NUM","5","19","19","And he is to put the woman under oath and say to her, ‘If no other man has slept with you and you have not gone astray and become defiled while under your husband’s authority, may you be immune to this bitter water that brings a curse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_20","005_5_20","NUM","5","20","20","But if you have gone astray while under your husband’s authority and have defiled yourself and lain carnally with a man other than your husband’— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_21","005_5_21","NUM","5","21","21","and the priest shall have the woman swear under the oath of the curse—‘then may the LORD make you an attested curse among your people by making your thigh shrivel and your belly swell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_22","005_5_22","NUM","5","22","22","May this water that brings a curse enter your stomach and cause your belly to swell and your thigh to shrivel.’ Then the woman is to say, ‘Amen, Amen.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_23","005_5_23","NUM","5","23","23","And the priest shall write these curses on a scroll and wash them off into the bitter water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_24","005_5_24","NUM","5","24","24","He is to have the woman drink the bitter water that brings a curse, and it will enter her and may cause her bitter suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_25","005_5_25","NUM","5","25","25","The priest shall take from her hand the grain offering for jealousy, wave it before the LORD, and bring it to the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_26","005_5_26","NUM","5","26","26","Then the priest is to take a handful of the grain offering as a memorial portion and burn it on the altar; after that he is to have the woman drink the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_27","005_5_27","NUM","5","27","27","When he has made her drink the water, if she has defiled herself and been unfaithful to her husband, then the water that brings a curse will enter her and cause bitter suffering; her belly will swell, her thigh will shrivel, and she will become accursed among her people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_28","005_5_28","NUM","5","28","28","But if the woman has not defiled herself and is clean, she will be unaffected and able to conceive children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_29","005_5_29","NUM","5","29","29","This is the law of jealousy when a wife goes astray and defiles herself while under her husband’s authority, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_30","005_5_30","NUM","5","30","30","or when a feeling of jealousy comes over a husband and he suspects his wife. He is to have the woman stand before the LORD, and the priest is to apply to her this entire law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU5_31","005_5_31","NUM","5","31","31","The husband will be free from guilt, but the woman shall bear her iniquity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_1","005_6_1","NUM","6","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_2","005_6_2","NUM","6","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them that if a man or woman makes a special vow, the vow of a Nazirite, to separate himself to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_3","005_6_3","NUM","6","3","3","he is to abstain from wine and strong drink. He must not drink vinegar made from wine or strong drink, and he must not drink any grape juice or eat fresh grapes or raisins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_4","005_6_4","NUM","6","4","4","All the days of his separation, he is not to eat anything that comes from the grapevine, not even the seeds or skins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_5","005_6_5","NUM","6","5","5","For the entire period of his vow of separation, no razor shall touch his head. He must be holy until the time of his separation to the LORD is complete; he must let the hair of his head grow long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_6","005_6_6","NUM","6","6","6","Throughout the days of his separation to the LORD, he must not go near a dead body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_7","005_6_7","NUM","6","7","7","Even if his father or mother or brother or sister should die, he is not to defile himself, because the symbol of consecration to his God is upon his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_8","005_6_8","NUM","6","8","8","Throughout the time of his separation, he is holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_9","005_6_9","NUM","6","9","9","If someone suddenly dies in his presence and defiles his consecrated head of hair, he must shave his head on the day of his cleansing—the seventh day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_10","005_6_10","NUM","6","10","10","On the eighth day he must bring two turtledoves or two young pigeons to the priest at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_11","005_6_11","NUM","6","11","11","And the priest is to offer one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering to make atonement for him, because he has sinned by being in the presence of the dead body. On that day he must consecrate his head again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_12","005_6_12","NUM","6","12","12","He must rededicate his time of separation to the LORD and bring a year-old male lamb as a guilt offering. But the preceding days shall not be counted, because his separation was defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_13","005_6_13","NUM","6","13","13","Now this is the law of the Nazirite when his time of separation is complete: He must be brought to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_14","005_6_14","NUM","6","14","14","and he is to present an offering to the LORD of an unblemished year-old male lamb as a burnt offering, an unblemished year-old female lamb as a sin offering, and an unblemished ram as a peace offering— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_15","005_6_15","NUM","6","15","15","together with their grain offerings and drink offerings—and a basket of unleavened cakes made from fine flour mixed with oil and unleavened wafers coated with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_16","005_6_16","NUM","6","16","16","The priest is to present all these before the LORD and make the sin offering and the burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_17","005_6_17","NUM","6","17","17","He shall also offer the ram as a peace offering to the LORD, along with the basket of unleavened bread. And the priest is to offer the accompanying grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_18","005_6_18","NUM","6","18","18","Then at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, the Nazirite is to shave his consecrated head, take the hair, and put it on the fire under the peace offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_19","005_6_19","NUM","6","19","19","And the priest is to take the boiled shoulder from the ram, one unleavened cake from the basket, and one unleavened wafer, and put them into the hands of the Nazirite who has just shaved the hair of his consecration. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_20","005_6_20","NUM","6","20","20","The priest shall then wave them as a wave offering before the LORD. This is a holy portion for the priest, in addition to the breast of the wave offering and the thigh that was presented. After that, the Nazirite may drink wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_21","005_6_21","NUM","6","21","21","This is the law of the Nazirite who vows his offering to the LORD for his separation, in addition to whatever else he can afford; he must fulfill whatever vow he makes, according to the law of his separation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_22","005_6_22","NUM","6","22","22","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_23","005_6_23","NUM","6","23","23","“Tell Aaron and his sons: This is how you are to bless the Israelites. Say to them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_24","005_6_24","NUM","6","24","24","‘May the LORD bless you and keep you; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_25","005_6_25","NUM","6","25","25","may the LORD cause His face to shine upon you and be gracious to you; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_26","005_6_26","NUM","6","26","26","may the LORD lift up His countenance toward you and give you peace.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU6_27","005_6_27","NUM","6","27","27","So they shall put My name on the Israelites, and I will bless them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_1","005_7_1","NUM","7","1","1","On the day Moses finished setting up the tabernacle, he anointed and consecrated it and all its furnishings, along with the altar and all its utensils. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_2","005_7_2","NUM","7","2","2","And the leaders of Israel, the heads of their families, presented an offering. These men were the tribal leaders who had supervised the registration. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_3","005_7_3","NUM","7","3","3","They brought as their offering before the LORD six covered carts and twelve oxen—an ox from each leader and a cart from every two leaders—and presented them before the tabernacle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_4","005_7_4","NUM","7","4","4","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_5","005_7_5","NUM","7","5","5","“Accept these gifts from them, that they may be used in the work of the Tent of Meeting. And give them to the Levites, to each man according to his service.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_6","005_7_6","NUM","7","6","6","So Moses took the carts and oxen and gave them to the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_7","005_7_7","NUM","7","7","7","He gave the Gershonites two carts and four oxen, as their service required, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_8","005_7_8","NUM","7","8","8","and he gave the Merarites four carts and eight oxen, as their service required, all under the direction of Ithamar son of Aaron the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_9","005_7_9","NUM","7","9","9","But he did not give any to the Kohathites, since they were to carry on their shoulders the holy objects for which they were responsible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_10","005_7_10","NUM","7","10","10","When the altar was anointed, the leaders approached with their offerings for its dedication and presented them before the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_11","005_7_11","NUM","7","11","11","And the LORD said to Moses, “Each day one leader is to present his offering for the dedication of the altar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_12","005_7_12","NUM","7","12","12","On the first day Nahshon son of Amminadab from the tribe of Judah drew near with his offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_13","005_7_13","NUM","7","13","13","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_14","005_7_14","NUM","7","14","14","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_15","005_7_15","NUM","7","15","15","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_16","005_7_16","NUM","7","16","16","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_17","005_7_17","NUM","7","17","17","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Nahshon son of Amminadab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_18","005_7_18","NUM","7","18","18","On the second day Nethanel son of Zuar, the leader of Issachar, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_19","005_7_19","NUM","7","19","19","The offering he presented was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_20","005_7_20","NUM","7","20","20","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_21","005_7_21","NUM","7","21","21","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_22","005_7_22","NUM","7","22","22","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_23","005_7_23","NUM","7","23","23","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Nethanel son of Zuar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_24","005_7_24","NUM","7","24","24","On the third day Eliab son of Helon, the leader of the Zebulunites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_25","005_7_25","NUM","7","25","25","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_26","005_7_26","NUM","7","26","26","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_27","005_7_27","NUM","7","27","27","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_28","005_7_28","NUM","7","28","28","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_29","005_7_29","NUM","7","29","29","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Eliab son of Helon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_30","005_7_30","NUM","7","30","30","On the fourth day Elizur son of Shedeur, the leader of the Reubenites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_31","005_7_31","NUM","7","31","31","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_32","005_7_32","NUM","7","32","32","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_33","005_7_33","NUM","7","33","33","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_34","005_7_34","NUM","7","34","34","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_35","005_7_35","NUM","7","35","35","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Elizur son of Shedeur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_36","005_7_36","NUM","7","36","36","On the fifth day Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai, the leader of the Simeonites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_37","005_7_37","NUM","7","37","37","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_38","005_7_38","NUM","7","38","38","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_39","005_7_39","NUM","7","39","39","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_40","005_7_40","NUM","7","40","40","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_41","005_7_41","NUM","7","41","41","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_42","005_7_42","NUM","7","42","42","On the sixth day Eliasaph son of Deuel, the leader of the Gadites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_43","005_7_43","NUM","7","43","43","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_44","005_7_44","NUM","7","44","44","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_45","005_7_45","NUM","7","45","45","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_46","005_7_46","NUM","7","46","46","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_47","005_7_47","NUM","7","47","47","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Eliasaph son of Deuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_48","005_7_48","NUM","7","48","48","On the seventh day Elishama son of Ammihud, the leader of the Ephraimites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_49","005_7_49","NUM","7","49","49","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_50","005_7_50","NUM","7","50","50","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_51","005_7_51","NUM","7","51","51","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_52","005_7_52","NUM","7","52","52","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_53","005_7_53","NUM","7","53","53","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Elishama son of Ammihud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_54","005_7_54","NUM","7","54","54","On the eighth day Gamaliel son of Pedahzur, the leader of the Manassites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_55","005_7_55","NUM","7","55","55","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_56","005_7_56","NUM","7","56","56","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_57","005_7_57","NUM","7","57","57","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_58","005_7_58","NUM","7","58","58","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_59","005_7_59","NUM","7","59","59","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Gamaliel son of Pedahzur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_60","005_7_60","NUM","7","60","60","On the ninth day Abidan son of Gideoni, the leader of the Benjamites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_61","005_7_61","NUM","7","61","61","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_62","005_7_62","NUM","7","62","62","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_63","005_7_63","NUM","7","63","63","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_64","005_7_64","NUM","7","64","64","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_65","005_7_65","NUM","7","65","65","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Abidan son of Gideoni. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_66","005_7_66","NUM","7","66","66","On the tenth day Ahiezer son of Ammishaddai, the leader of the Danites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_67","005_7_67","NUM","7","67","67","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_68","005_7_68","NUM","7","68","68","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_69","005_7_69","NUM","7","69","69","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_70","005_7_70","NUM","7","70","70","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_71","005_7_71","NUM","7","71","71","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Ahiezer son of Ammishaddai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_72","005_7_72","NUM","7","72","72","On the eleventh day Pagiel son of Ocran, the leader of the Asherites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_73","005_7_73","NUM","7","73","73","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_74","005_7_74","NUM","7","74","74","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_75","005_7_75","NUM","7","75","75","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_76","005_7_76","NUM","7","76","76","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_77","005_7_77","NUM","7","77","77","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Pagiel son of Ocran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_78","005_7_78","NUM","7","78","78","On the twelfth day Ahira son of Enan, the leader of the Naphtalites, drew near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_79","005_7_79","NUM","7","79","79","His offering was one silver platter weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel and filled with fine flour mixed with oil for a grain offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_80","005_7_80","NUM","7","80","80","one gold dish weighing ten shekels, filled with incense; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_81","005_7_81","NUM","7","81","81","one young bull, one ram, and one male lamb a year old for a burnt offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_82","005_7_82","NUM","7","82","82","one male goat for a sin offering; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_83","005_7_83","NUM","7","83","83","and a peace offering of two oxen, five rams, five male goats, and five male lambs a year old. This was the offering of Ahira son of Enan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_84","005_7_84","NUM","7","84","84","So these were the offerings from the leaders of Israel for the dedication of the altar when it was anointed: twelve silver platters, twelve silver bowls, and twelve gold dishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_85","005_7_85","NUM","7","85","85","Each silver platter weighed a hundred and thirty shekels, and each silver bowl seventy shekels. The total weight of the silver articles was two thousand four hundred shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_86","005_7_86","NUM","7","86","86","The twelve gold dishes filled with incense weighed ten shekels each, according to the sanctuary shekel. The total weight of the gold dishes was a hundred and twenty shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_87","005_7_87","NUM","7","87","87","All the livestock for the burnt offering totaled twelve bulls, twelve rams, and twelve male lambs a year old—together with their grain offerings—and twelve male goats for the sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_88","005_7_88","NUM","7","88","88","All the livestock sacrificed for the peace offering totaled twenty-four bulls, sixty rams, sixty male goats, and sixty male lambs a year old. This was the dedication offering for the altar after it was anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU7_89","005_7_89","NUM","7","89","89","When Moses entered the Tent of Meeting to speak with the LORD, he heard the voice speaking to him from between the two cherubim above the mercy seat on the ark of the Testimony. Thus the LORD spoke to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_1","005_8_1","NUM","8","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_2","005_8_2","NUM","8","2","2","“Speak to Aaron and tell him: ‘When you set up the seven lamps, they are to light the area in front of the lampstand.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_3","005_8_3","NUM","8","3","3","And Aaron did so; he set up the lamps facing toward the front of the lampstand, just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_4","005_8_4","NUM","8","4","4","This is how the lampstand was constructed: it was made of hammered gold from its base to its blossoms, fashioned according to the pattern the LORD had shown Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_5","005_8_5","NUM","8","5","5","Again the LORD spoke to Moses, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_6","005_8_6","NUM","8","6","6","“Take the Levites from among the Israelites and make them ceremonially clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_7","005_8_7","NUM","8","7","7","This is what you must do to cleanse them: Sprinkle them with the water of purification. Have them shave their whole bodies and wash their clothes, and so purify themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_8","005_8_8","NUM","8","8","8","Then have them take a young bull with its grain offering of fine flour mixed with oil, and you are to take a second young bull for a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_9","005_8_9","NUM","8","9","9","Bring the Levites before the Tent of Meeting and assemble the whole congregation of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_10","005_8_10","NUM","8","10","10","You are to present the Levites before the LORD and have the Israelites lay their hands upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_11","005_8_11","NUM","8","11","11","Aaron is to present the Levites before the LORD as a wave offering from the sons of Israel, so that they may perform the service of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_12","005_8_12","NUM","8","12","12","And the Levites are to lay their hands on the heads of the bulls, and offer to the LORD one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering, to make atonement for the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_13","005_8_13","NUM","8","13","13","You are to have the Levites stand before Aaron and his sons and then present them before the LORD as a wave offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_14","005_8_14","NUM","8","14","14","In this way you shall separate the Levites from the rest of the Israelites, and the Levites will belong to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_15","005_8_15","NUM","8","15","15","After you have cleansed them and presented them as a wave offering, they may come to serve at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_16","005_8_16","NUM","8","16","16","For the Levites have been wholly given to Me from among the sons of Israel. I have taken them for Myself in place of all who come first from the womb, the firstborn of all the sons of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_17","005_8_17","NUM","8","17","17","For every firstborn male in Israel is Mine, both man and beast. I set them apart for Myself on the day I struck down all the firstborn in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_18","005_8_18","NUM","8","18","18","But I have taken the Levites in place of all the firstborn among the sons of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_19","005_8_19","NUM","8","19","19","And I have given the Levites as a gift to Aaron and his sons from among the Israelites, to perform the service for the Israelites at the Tent of Meeting and to make atonement on their behalf, so that no plague will come against the Israelites when they approach the sanctuary.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_20","005_8_20","NUM","8","20","20","So Moses, Aaron, and the whole congregation of Israel did with the Levites everything that the LORD had commanded Moses they should do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_21","005_8_21","NUM","8","21","21","The Levites purified themselves and washed their clothes, and Aaron presented them as a wave offering before the LORD. Aaron also made atonement for them to cleanse them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_22","005_8_22","NUM","8","22","22","After that, the Levites came to perform their service at the Tent of Meeting in the presence of Aaron and his sons. Thus they did with the Levites just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_23","005_8_23","NUM","8","23","23","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_24","005_8_24","NUM","8","24","24","“This applies to the Levites: Men twenty-five years of age or older shall enter to perform the service in the work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_25","005_8_25","NUM","8","25","25","But at the age of fifty, they must retire from performing the work and no longer serve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU8_26","005_8_26","NUM","8","26","26","After that, they may assist their brothers in fulfilling their duties at the Tent of Meeting, but they themselves are not to do the work. This is how you are to assign responsibilities to the Levites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_1","005_9_1","NUM","9","1","1","In the first month of the second year after Israel had come out of the land of Egypt, the LORD spoke to Moses in the Wilderness of Sinai: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_2","005_9_2","NUM","9","2","2","“The Israelites are to observe the Passover at its appointed time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_3","005_9_3","NUM","9","3","3","You are to observe it at the appointed time, at twilight on the fourteenth day of this month, in accordance with its statutes and ordinances.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_4","005_9_4","NUM","9","4","4","So Moses told the Israelites to observe the Passover, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_5","005_9_5","NUM","9","5","5","and they did so in the Wilderness of Sinai, at twilight on the fourteenth day of the first month. The Israelites did everything just as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_6","005_9_6","NUM","9","6","6","But there were some men who were unclean due to a dead body, so they could not observe the Passover on that day. And they came before Moses and Aaron that same day ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_7","005_9_7","NUM","9","7","7","and said to Moses, “We are unclean because of a dead body, but why should we be excluded from presenting the LORD’s offering with the other Israelites at the appointed time?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_8","005_9_8","NUM","9","8","8","“Wait here until I find out what the LORD commands concerning you,” Moses replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_9","005_9_9","NUM","9","9","9","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_10","005_9_10","NUM","9","10","10","“Tell the Israelites: ‘When any one of you or your descendants is unclean because of a dead body, or is away on a journey, he may still observe the Passover to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_11","005_9_11","NUM","9","11","11","Such people are to observe it at twilight on the fourteenth day of the second month. They are to eat the lamb, together with unleavened bread and bitter herbs; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_12","005_9_12","NUM","9","12","12","they may not leave any of it until morning or break any of its bones. They must observe the Passover according to all its statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_13","005_9_13","NUM","9","13","13","But if a man who is ceremonially clean and is not on a journey still fails to observe the Passover, he must be cut off from his people, because he did not present the LORD’s offering at its appointed time. That man will bear the consequences of his sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_14","005_9_14","NUM","9","14","14","If a foreigner dwelling among you wants to observe the Passover to the LORD, he is to do so according to the Passover statute and its ordinances. You are to apply the same statute to both the foreigner and the native of the land.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_15","005_9_15","NUM","9","15","15","On the day that the tabernacle, the Tent of the Testimony, was set up, the cloud covered it and appeared like fire above the tabernacle from evening until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_16","005_9_16","NUM","9","16","16","It remained that way continually; the cloud would cover the tabernacle by day, and at night it would appear like fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_17","005_9_17","NUM","9","17","17","Whenever the cloud was lifted from above the Tent, the Israelites would set out, and wherever the cloud settled, there the Israelites would camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_18","005_9_18","NUM","9","18","18","At the LORD’s command the Israelites set out, and at the LORD’s command they camped. As long as the cloud remained over the tabernacle, they remained encamped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_19","005_9_19","NUM","9","19","19","Even when the cloud lingered over the tabernacle for many days, the Israelites kept the LORD’s charge and did not set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_20","005_9_20","NUM","9","20","20","Sometimes the cloud remained over the tabernacle for only a few days, and they would camp at the LORD’s command and set out at the LORD’s command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_21","005_9_21","NUM","9","21","21","Sometimes the cloud remained only from evening until morning, and when it lifted in the morning, they would set out. Whether it was by day or by night, when the cloud was taken up, they would set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_22","005_9_22","NUM","9","22","22","Whether the cloud lingered for two days, a month, or longer, the Israelites camped and did not set out as long as the cloud remained over the tabernacle; but when it was lifted, they would set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU9_23","005_9_23","NUM","9","23","23","They camped at the LORD’s command, and they set out at the LORD’s command; they carried out the LORD’s charge according to His command through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_1","005_10_1","NUM","10","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_2","005_10_2","NUM","10","2","2","“Make two trumpets of hammered silver to be used for calling the congregation and for having the camps set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_3","005_10_3","NUM","10","3","3","When both are sounded, the whole congregation is to assemble before you at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_4","005_10_4","NUM","10","4","4","But if only one is sounded, then the leaders, the heads of the clans of Israel, are to gather before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_5","005_10_5","NUM","10","5","5","When you sound short blasts, the camps that lie on the east side are to set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_6","005_10_6","NUM","10","6","6","When you sound the short blasts a second time, the camps that lie on the south side are to set out. The blasts are to signal them to set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_7","005_10_7","NUM","10","7","7","To convene the assembly, you are to sound long blasts, not short ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_8","005_10_8","NUM","10","8","8","The sons of Aaron, the priests, are to sound the trumpets. This shall be a permanent statute for you and the generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_9","005_10_9","NUM","10","9","9","When you enter into battle in your land against an adversary who attacks you, sound short blasts on the trumpets, and you will be remembered before the LORD your God and saved from your enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_10","005_10_10","NUM","10","10","10","And on your joyous occasions, your appointed feasts, and the beginning of each month, you are to blow the trumpets over your burnt offerings and peace offerings to serve as a reminder for you before your God. I am the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_11","005_10_11","NUM","10","11","11","On the twentieth day of the second month of the second year, the cloud was lifted from above the tabernacle of the Testimony, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_12","005_10_12","NUM","10","12","12","and the Israelites set out from the Wilderness of Sinai, traveling from place to place until the cloud settled in the Wilderness of Paran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_13","005_10_13","NUM","10","13","13","They set out this first time according to the LORD’s command through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_14","005_10_14","NUM","10","14","14","First, the divisions of the camp of Judah set out under their standard, with Nahshon son of Amminadab in command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_15","005_10_15","NUM","10","15","15","Nethanel son of Zuar was over the division of the tribe of Issachar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_16","005_10_16","NUM","10","16","16","and Eliab son of Helon was over the division of the tribe of Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_17","005_10_17","NUM","10","17","17","Then the tabernacle was taken down, and the Gershonites and the Merarites set out, transporting it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_18","005_10_18","NUM","10","18","18","Then the divisions of the camp of Reuben set out under their standard, with Elizur son of Shedeur in command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_19","005_10_19","NUM","10","19","19","Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai was over the division of the tribe of Simeon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_20","005_10_20","NUM","10","20","20","and Eliasaph son of Deuel was over the division of the tribe of Gad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_21","005_10_21","NUM","10","21","21","Then the Kohathites set out, transporting the holy objects; the tabernacle was to be set up before their arrival. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_22","005_10_22","NUM","10","22","22","Next, the divisions of the camp of Ephraim set out under their standard, with Elishama son of Ammihud in command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_23","005_10_23","NUM","10","23","23","Gamaliel son of Pedahzur was over the division of the tribe of Manasseh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_24","005_10_24","NUM","10","24","24","and Abidan son of Gideoni was over the division of the tribe of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_25","005_10_25","NUM","10","25","25","Finally, the divisions of the camp of Dan set out under their standard, serving as the rear guard for all units, with Ahiezer son of Ammishaddai in command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_26","005_10_26","NUM","10","26","26","Pagiel son of Ocran was over the division of the tribe of Asher, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_27","005_10_27","NUM","10","27","27","and Ahira son of Enan was over the division of the tribe of Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_28","005_10_28","NUM","10","28","28","This was the order of march for the Israelite divisions as they set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_29","005_10_29","NUM","10","29","29","Then Moses said to Hobab, the son of Moses’ father-in-law Reuel the Midianite, “We are setting out for the place of which the LORD said: ‘I will give it to you.’ Come with us, and we will treat you well, for the LORD has promised good things to Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_30","005_10_30","NUM","10","30","30","“I will not go,” Hobab replied. “Instead, I am going back to my own land and my own people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_31","005_10_31","NUM","10","31","31","“Please do not leave us,” Moses said, “since you know where we should camp in the wilderness, and you can serve as our eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_32","005_10_32","NUM","10","32","32","If you come with us, we will share with you whatever good things the LORD gives us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_33","005_10_33","NUM","10","33","33","So they set out on a three-day journey from the mountain of the LORD, with the ark of the covenant of the LORD traveling ahead of them for those three days to seek a resting place for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_34","005_10_34","NUM","10","34","34","And the cloud of the LORD was over them by day when they set out from the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_35","005_10_35","NUM","10","35","35","Whenever the ark set out, Moses would say, “Rise up, O LORD! May Your enemies be scattered; may those who hate You flee before You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU10_36","005_10_36","NUM","10","36","36","And when it came to rest, he would say: “Return, O LORD, to the countless thousands of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_1","005_11_1","NUM","11","1","1","Soon the people began to complain about their hardship in the hearing of the LORD, and when He heard them, His anger was kindled, and fire from the LORD blazed among them and consumed the outskirts of the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_2","005_11_2","NUM","11","2","2","And the people cried out to Moses, and he prayed to the LORD, and the fire died down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_3","005_11_3","NUM","11","3","3","So that place was called Taberah, because the fire of the LORD had burned among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_4","005_11_4","NUM","11","4","4","Meanwhile, the rabble among them had a strong craving for other food, and again the Israelites wept and said, “Who will feed us meat? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_5","005_11_5","NUM","11","5","5","We remember the fish we ate freely in Egypt, along with the cucumbers, melons, leeks, onions, and garlic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_6","005_11_6","NUM","11","6","6","But now our appetite is gone; there is nothing to see but this manna!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_7","005_11_7","NUM","11","7","7","Now the manna resembled coriander seed, and its appearance was like that of gum resin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_8","005_11_8","NUM","11","8","8","The people walked around and gathered it, ground it on a handmill or crushed it in a mortar, then boiled it in a cooking pot or shaped it into cakes. It tasted like pastry baked with fine oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_9","005_11_9","NUM","11","9","9","When the dew fell on the camp at night, the manna would fall with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_10","005_11_10","NUM","11","10","10","Then Moses heard the people of family after family weeping at the entrances to their tents, and the anger of the LORD was kindled greatly, and Moses was also displeased. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_11","005_11_11","NUM","11","11","11","So Moses asked the LORD, “Why have You brought this trouble on Your servant? Why have I not found favor in Your sight, that You have laid upon me the burden of all these people? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_12","005_11_12","NUM","11","12","12","Did I conceive all these people? Did I give them birth, so that You should tell me, ‘Carry them in your bosom, as a nurse carries an infant,’ to the land that You swore to give their fathers? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_13","005_11_13","NUM","11","13","13","Where can I get meat for all these people? For they keep crying out to me, ‘Give us meat to eat!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_14","005_11_14","NUM","11","14","14","I cannot carry all these people by myself; it is too burdensome for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_15","005_11_15","NUM","11","15","15","If this is how You are going to treat me, please kill me right now—if I have found favor in Your eyes—and let me not see my own wretchedness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_16","005_11_16","NUM","11","16","16","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Bring Me seventy of the elders of Israel known to you as leaders and officers of the people. Bring them to the Tent of Meeting and have them stand there with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_17","005_11_17","NUM","11","17","17","And I will come down and speak with you there, and I will take some of the Spirit that is on you and put that Spirit on them. They will help you bear the burden of the people, so that you do not have to bear it by yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_18","005_11_18","NUM","11","18","18","And say to the people: Consecrate yourselves for tomorrow, and you will eat meat, because you have cried out in the hearing of the LORD, saying: ‘Who will feed us meat? For we were better off in Egypt!’ Therefore the LORD will give you meat, and you will eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_19","005_11_19","NUM","11","19","19","You will eat it not for one or two days, nor for five or ten or twenty days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_20","005_11_20","NUM","11","20","20","but for a whole month—until it comes out of your nostrils and makes you nauseous—because you have rejected the LORD, who is among you, and have cried out before Him, saying, ‘Why did we ever leave Egypt?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_21","005_11_21","NUM","11","21","21","But Moses replied, “Here I am among 600,000 men on foot, yet You say, ‘I will give them meat, and they will eat for a month.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_22","005_11_22","NUM","11","22","22","If all our flocks and herds were slaughtered for them, would they have enough? Or if all the fish in the sea were caught for them, would they have enough?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_23","005_11_23","NUM","11","23","23","The LORD answered Moses, “Is the LORD’s arm too short? Now you will see whether or not My word will come to pass.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_24","005_11_24","NUM","11","24","24","So Moses went out and relayed to the people the words of the LORD, and he gathered seventy of the elders of the people and had them stand around the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_25","005_11_25","NUM","11","25","25","Then the LORD came down in the cloud and spoke to him, and He took some of the Spirit that was on Moses and placed that Spirit on the seventy elders. As the Spirit rested on them, they prophesied—but they never did so again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_26","005_11_26","NUM","11","26","26","Two men, however, had remained in the camp—one named Eldad and the other Medad—and the Spirit rested on them. They were among those listed, but they had not gone out to the tent, and they prophesied in the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_27","005_11_27","NUM","11","27","27","A young man ran and reported to Moses, “Eldad and Medad are prophesying in the camp.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_28","005_11_28","NUM","11","28","28","Joshua son of Nun, the attendant to Moses since youth, spoke up and said, “Moses, my lord, stop them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_29","005_11_29","NUM","11","29","29","But Moses replied, “Are you jealous on my account? I wish that all the LORD’s people were prophets and that the LORD would place His Spirit on them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_30","005_11_30","NUM","11","30","30","Then Moses returned to the camp, along with the elders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_31","005_11_31","NUM","11","31","31","Now a wind sent by the LORD came up, drove in quail from the sea, and brought them near the camp, about two cubits above the surface of the ground, for a day’s journey in every direction around the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_32","005_11_32","NUM","11","32","32","All that day and night, and all the next day, the people stayed up gathering the quail. No one gathered less than ten homers, and they spread them out all around the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_33","005_11_33","NUM","11","33","33","But while the meat was still between their teeth, before it was chewed, the anger of the LORD burned against the people, and the LORD struck them with a severe plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_34","005_11_34","NUM","11","34","34","So they called that place Kibroth-hattaavah, because there they buried the people who had craved other food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU11_35","005_11_35","NUM","11","35","35","From Kibroth-hattaavah the people moved on to Hazeroth, where they remained for some time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_1","005_12_1","NUM","12","1","1","Then Miriam and Aaron criticized Moses because of the Cushite woman he had married, for he had taken a Cushite wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_2","005_12_2","NUM","12","2","2","“Does the LORD speak only through Moses?” they said. “Does He not also speak through us?” And the LORD heard this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_3","005_12_3","NUM","12","3","3","Now Moses was a very humble man, more so than any man on the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_4","005_12_4","NUM","12","4","4","And suddenly the LORD said to Moses, Aaron, and Miriam, “You three, come out to the Tent of Meeting.” So the three went out, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_5","005_12_5","NUM","12","5","5","and the LORD came down in a pillar of cloud, stood at the entrance to the Tent, and summoned Aaron and Miriam. When both of them had stepped forward, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_6","005_12_6","NUM","12","6","6","He said, “Hear now My words: If there is a prophet among you, I, the LORD, will reveal Myself to him in a vision; I will speak to him in a dream. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_7","005_12_7","NUM","12","7","7","But this is not so with My servant Moses; he is faithful in all My house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_8","005_12_8","NUM","12","8","8","I speak with him face to face, clearly and not in riddles; he sees the form of the LORD. Why then were you unafraid to speak against My servant Moses?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_9","005_12_9","NUM","12","9","9","So the anger of the LORD burned against them, and He departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_10","005_12_10","NUM","12","10","10","As the cloud lifted from above the Tent, suddenly Miriam became leprous, white as snow. Aaron turned toward her, saw that she was leprous, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_11","005_12_11","NUM","12","11","11","and said to Moses, “My lord, please do not hold against us this sin we have so foolishly committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_12","005_12_12","NUM","12","12","12","Please do not let her be like a stillborn infant whose flesh is half consumed when he comes out of his mother’s womb.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_13","005_12_13","NUM","12","13","13","So Moses cried out to the LORD, “O God, please heal her!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_14","005_12_14","NUM","12","14","14","But the LORD answered Moses, “If her father had but spit in her face, would she not have been in disgrace for seven days? Let her be confined outside the camp for seven days; after that she may be brought back in.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_15","005_12_15","NUM","12","15","15","So Miriam was confined outside the camp for seven days, and the people did not move on until she was brought in again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU12_16","005_12_16","NUM","12","16","16","After that, the people set out from Hazeroth and camped in the Wilderness of Paran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_1","005_13_1","NUM","13","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_2","005_13_2","NUM","13","2","2","“Send out for yourself men to spy out the land of Canaan, which I am giving to the Israelites. From each of their fathers’ tribes send one man who is a leader among them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_3","005_13_3","NUM","13","3","3","So at the command of the LORD, Moses sent them out from the Wilderness of Paran. All the men were leaders of the Israelites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_4","005_13_4","NUM","13","4","4","and these were their names: From the tribe of Reuben, Shammua son of Zaccur; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_5","005_13_5","NUM","13","5","5","from the tribe of Simeon, Shaphat son of Hori; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_6","005_13_6","NUM","13","6","6","from the tribe of Judah, Caleb son of Jephunneh; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_7","005_13_7","NUM","13","7","7","from the tribe of Issachar, Igal son of Joseph; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_8","005_13_8","NUM","13","8","8","from the tribe of Ephraim, Hoshea son of Nun; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_9","005_13_9","NUM","13","9","9","from the tribe of Benjamin, Palti son of Raphu; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_10","005_13_10","NUM","13","10","10","from the tribe of Zebulun, Gaddiel son of Sodi; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_11","005_13_11","NUM","13","11","11","from the tribe of Manasseh (a tribe of Joseph), Gaddi son of Susi; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_12","005_13_12","NUM","13","12","12","from the tribe of Dan, Ammiel son of Gemalli; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_13","005_13_13","NUM","13","13","13","from the tribe of Asher, Sethur son of Michael; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_14","005_13_14","NUM","13","14","14","from the tribe of Naphtali, Nahbi son of Vophsi; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_15","005_13_15","NUM","13","15","15","and from the tribe of Gad, Geuel son of Machi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_16","005_13_16","NUM","13","16","16","These were the names of the men Moses sent to spy out the land; and Moses gave to Hoshea son of Nun the name Joshua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_17","005_13_17","NUM","13","17","17","When Moses sent them to spy out the land of Canaan, he told them, “Go up through the Negev and into the hill country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_18","005_13_18","NUM","13","18","18","See what the land is like and whether its people are strong or weak, few or many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_19","005_13_19","NUM","13","19","19","Is the land where they live good or bad? Are the cities where they dwell open camps or fortifications? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_20","005_13_20","NUM","13","20","20","Is the soil fertile or unproductive? Are there trees in it or not? Be courageous and bring back some of the fruit of the land.” (It was the season for the first ripe grapes.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_21","005_13_21","NUM","13","21","21","So they went up and spied out the land from the Wilderness of Zin as far as Rehob, toward Lebo-hamath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_22","005_13_22","NUM","13","22","22","They went up through the Negev and came to Hebron, where Ahiman, Sheshai, and Talmai, the descendants of Anak, dwelled. It had been built seven years before Zoan in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_23","005_13_23","NUM","13","23","23","When they came to the Valley of Eshcol, they cut down a branch with a single cluster of grapes, which they carried on a pole between two men. They also took some pomegranates and figs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_24","005_13_24","NUM","13","24","24","Because of the cluster of grapes the Israelites cut there, that place was called the Valley of Eshcol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_25","005_13_25","NUM","13","25","25","After forty days the men returned from spying out the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_26","005_13_26","NUM","13","26","26","and they went back to Moses, Aaron, and the whole congregation of Israel in the Wilderness of Paran at Kadesh. They brought back a report for the whole congregation and showed them the fruit of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_27","005_13_27","NUM","13","27","27","And they gave this account to Moses: “We went into the land to which you sent us, and indeed, it is flowing with milk and honey. Here is some of its fruit! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_28","005_13_28","NUM","13","28","28","Nevertheless, the people living in the land are strong, and the cities are large and fortified. We even saw the descendants of Anak there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_29","005_13_29","NUM","13","29","29","The Amalekites live in the land of the Negev; the Hittites, Jebusites, and Amorites live in the hill country; and the Canaanites live by the sea and along the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_30","005_13_30","NUM","13","30","30","Then Caleb quieted the people before Moses and said, “We must go up and take possession of the land, for we can certainly conquer it!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_31","005_13_31","NUM","13","31","31","But the men who had gone up with him replied, “We cannot go up against the people, for they are stronger than we are!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_32","005_13_32","NUM","13","32","32","So they gave the Israelites a bad report about the land that they had spied out: “The land we explored devours its inhabitants, and all the people we saw there are great in stature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU13_33","005_13_33","NUM","13","33","33","We even saw the Nephilim there—the descendants of Anak that come from the Nephilim! We seemed like grasshoppers in our own sight, and we must have seemed the same to them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_1","005_14_1","NUM","14","1","1","Then the whole congregation lifted up their voices and cried out, and that night the people wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_2","005_14_2","NUM","14","2","2","All the Israelites grumbled against Moses and Aaron, and the whole congregation said to them, “If only we had died in the land of Egypt, or if only we had died in this wilderness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_3","005_14_3","NUM","14","3","3","Why is the LORD bringing us into this land to fall by the sword? Our wives and children will become plunder. Would it not be better for us to go back to Egypt?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_4","005_14_4","NUM","14","4","4","So they said to one another, “Let us appoint a leader and return to Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_5","005_14_5","NUM","14","5","5","Then Moses and Aaron fell facedown before the whole assembly of the congregation of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_6","005_14_6","NUM","14","6","6","Joshua son of Nun and Caleb son of Jephunneh, who were among those who had spied out the land, tore their clothes ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_7","005_14_7","NUM","14","7","7","and said to the whole congregation of Israel, “The land we passed through and explored is an exceedingly good land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_8","005_14_8","NUM","14","8","8","If the LORD delights in us, He will bring us into this land, a land flowing with milk and honey, and He will give it to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_9","005_14_9","NUM","14","9","9","Only do not rebel against the LORD, and do not be afraid of the people of the land, for they will be like bread for us. Their protection has been removed, and the LORD is with us. Do not be afraid of them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_10","005_14_10","NUM","14","10","10","But the whole congregation threatened to stone Joshua and Caleb. Then the glory of the LORD appeared to all the Israelites at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_11","005_14_11","NUM","14","11","11","And the LORD said to Moses, “How long will this people treat Me with contempt? How long will they refuse to believe in Me, despite all the signs I have performed among them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_12","005_14_12","NUM","14","12","12","I will strike them with a plague and destroy them—and I will make you into a nation greater and mightier than they are.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_13","005_14_13","NUM","14","13","13","But Moses said to the LORD, “The Egyptians will hear of it, for by Your strength You brought this people from among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_14","005_14_14","NUM","14","14","14","And they will tell it to the inhabitants of this land. They have already heard that You, O LORD, are in the midst of this people, that You, O LORD, have been seen face to face, that Your cloud stands over them, and that You go before them in a pillar of cloud by day and a pillar of fire by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_15","005_14_15","NUM","14","15","15","If You kill this people as one man, the nations who have heard of Your fame will say, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_16","005_14_16","NUM","14","16","16","‘Because the LORD was unable to bring this people into the land He swore to give them, He has slaughtered them in the wilderness.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_17","005_14_17","NUM","14","17","17","So now I pray, may the power of my Lord be magnified, just as You have declared: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_18","005_14_18","NUM","14","18","18","‘The LORD is slow to anger and abounding in loving devotion, forgiving iniquity and transgression. Yet He will by no means leave the guilty unpunished; He will visit the iniquity of the fathers upon their children to the third and fourth generation.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_19","005_14_19","NUM","14","19","19","Pardon, I pray, the iniquity of this people, in keeping with the greatness of Your loving devotion, just as You have forgiven them ever since they left Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_20","005_14_20","NUM","14","20","20","“I have pardoned them as you requested,” the LORD replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_21","005_14_21","NUM","14","21","21","“Yet as surely as I live and as surely as the whole earth is filled with the glory of the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_22","005_14_22","NUM","14","22","22","not one of the men who have seen My glory and the signs I performed in Egypt and in the wilderness—yet have tested Me and disobeyed Me these ten times— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_23","005_14_23","NUM","14","23","23","not one will ever see the land that I swore to give their fathers. None of those who have treated Me with contempt will see it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_24","005_14_24","NUM","14","24","24","But because My servant Caleb has a different spirit and has followed Me wholeheartedly, I will bring him into the land he has entered, and his descendants will inherit it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_25","005_14_25","NUM","14","25","25","Now since the Amalekites and Canaanites are living in the valleys, turn back tomorrow and head for the wilderness along the route to the Red Sea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_26","005_14_26","NUM","14","26","26","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_27","005_14_27","NUM","14","27","27","“How long will this wicked congregation grumble against Me? I have heard the complaints that the Israelites are making against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_28","005_14_28","NUM","14","28","28","So tell them: As surely as I live, declares the LORD, I will do to you exactly as I heard you say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_29","005_14_29","NUM","14","29","29","Your bodies will fall in this wilderness—all who were numbered in the census, everyone twenty years of age or older—because you have grumbled against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_30","005_14_30","NUM","14","30","30","Surely none of you will enter the land in which I swore to settle you, except Caleb son of Jephunneh and Joshua son of Nun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_31","005_14_31","NUM","14","31","31","But I will bring your children, whom you said would become plunder, into the land you have rejected—and they will enjoy it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_32","005_14_32","NUM","14","32","32","As for you, however, your bodies will fall in this wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_33","005_14_33","NUM","14","33","33","Your children will be shepherds in the wilderness for forty years, and they will suffer for your unfaithfulness until the last of your bodies lies in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_34","005_14_34","NUM","14","34","34","In keeping with the forty days you spied out the land, you shall bear your guilt forty years—a year for each day—and you will experience My alienation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_35","005_14_35","NUM","14","35","35","I, the LORD, have spoken, and I will surely do these things to this entire wicked congregation, which has conspired against Me. They will meet their end in the wilderness, and there they will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_36","005_14_36","NUM","14","36","36","So the men Moses had sent to spy out the land, who had returned and made the whole congregation grumble against him by bringing out a bad report about the land— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_37","005_14_37","NUM","14","37","37","those men who had brought out the bad report about the land—were struck down by a plague before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_38","005_14_38","NUM","14","38","38","Of those men who had gone to spy out the land, only Joshua son of Nun and Caleb son of Jephunneh remained alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_39","005_14_39","NUM","14","39","39","And when Moses relayed these words to all the Israelites, the people mourned bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_40","005_14_40","NUM","14","40","40","Early the next morning they got up and went up toward the ridge of the hill country. “We have indeed sinned,” they said, “but we will go to the place the LORD has promised.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_41","005_14_41","NUM","14","41","41","But Moses said, “Why are you transgressing the commandment of the LORD? This will not succeed! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_42","005_14_42","NUM","14","42","42","Do not go up, lest you be struck down by your enemies, because the LORD is not among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_43","005_14_43","NUM","14","43","43","For there the Amalekites and Canaanites will face you, and you will fall by the sword. Because you have turned away from the LORD, He will not be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_44","005_14_44","NUM","14","44","44","But they dared to go up to the ridge of the hill country, though neither Moses nor the ark of the covenant of the LORD moved from the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU14_45","005_14_45","NUM","14","45","45","Then the Amalekites and Canaanites who lived in that part of the hill country came down, attacked them, and routed them all the way to Hormah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_1","005_15_1","NUM","15","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_2","005_15_2","NUM","15","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: After you enter the land that I am giving you as a home ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_3","005_15_3","NUM","15","3","3","and you present a food offering to the LORD from the herd or flock to produce a pleasing aroma to the LORD—either a burnt offering or a sacrifice, for a special vow or freewill offering or appointed feast— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_4","005_15_4","NUM","15","4","4","then the one presenting his offering to the LORD shall also present a grain offering of a tenth of an ephah of fine flour mixed with a quarter hin of olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_5","005_15_5","NUM","15","5","5","With the burnt offering or sacrifice of each lamb, you are to prepare a quarter hin of wine as a drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_6","005_15_6","NUM","15","6","6","With a ram you are to prepare a grain offering of two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with a third of a hin of olive oil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_7","005_15_7","NUM","15","7","7","and a third of a hin of wine as a drink offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_8","005_15_8","NUM","15","8","8","When you prepare a young bull as a burnt offering or sacrifice to fulfill a vow or as a peace offering to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_9","005_15_9","NUM","15","9","9","present with the bull a grain offering of three-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with half a hin of olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_10","005_15_10","NUM","15","10","10","Also present half a hin of wine as a drink offering. It is a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_11","005_15_11","NUM","15","11","11","This is to be done for each bull, ram, lamb, or goat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_12","005_15_12","NUM","15","12","12","This is how you must prepare each one, no matter how many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_13","005_15_13","NUM","15","13","13","Everyone who is native-born shall prepare these things in this way when he presents a food offering as a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_14","005_15_14","NUM","15","14","14","And for the generations to come, if a foreigner residing with you or someone else among you wants to prepare a food offering as a pleasing aroma to the LORD, he is to do exactly as you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_15","005_15_15","NUM","15","15","15","The assembly is to have the same statute both for you and for the foreign resident; it is a permanent statute for the generations to come. You and the foreigner shall be the same before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_16","005_15_16","NUM","15","16","16","The same law and the same ordinance will apply both to you and to the foreigner residing with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_17","005_15_17","NUM","15","17","17","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_18","005_15_18","NUM","15","18","18","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: When you enter the land to which I am bringing you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_19","005_15_19","NUM","15","19","19","and you eat the food of the land, you shall lift up an offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_20","005_15_20","NUM","15","20","20","From the first of your dough, you are to lift up a cake as a contribution; offer it just like an offering from the threshing floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_21","005_15_21","NUM","15","21","21","Throughout your generations, you are to give the LORD an offering from the first of your dough. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_22","005_15_22","NUM","15","22","22","Now if you stray unintentionally and do not obey all these commandments that the LORD has spoken to Moses— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_23","005_15_23","NUM","15","23","23","all that the LORD has commanded you through Moses from the day the LORD gave them and continuing through the generations to come— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_24","005_15_24","NUM","15","24","24","and if it was done unintentionally without the knowledge of the congregation, then the whole congregation is to prepare one young bull as a burnt offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD, with its grain offering and drink offering according to the regulation, and one male goat as a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_25","005_15_25","NUM","15","25","25","The priest is to make atonement for the whole congregation of Israel, so that they may be forgiven; for the sin was unintentional and they have brought to the LORD a food offering and a sin offering, presented before the LORD for their unintentional sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_26","005_15_26","NUM","15","26","26","Then the whole congregation of Israel and the foreigners residing among them will be forgiven, since it happened to all the people unintentionally. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_27","005_15_27","NUM","15","27","27","Also, if one person sins unintentionally, he is to present a year-old female goat as a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_28","005_15_28","NUM","15","28","28","And the priest shall make atonement before the LORD on behalf of the person who erred by sinning unintentionally; and when atonement has been made for him, he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_29","005_15_29","NUM","15","29","29","You shall have the same law for the one who acts in error, whether he is a native-born Israelite or a foreigner residing among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_30","005_15_30","NUM","15","30","30","But the person who sins defiantly, whether a native or foreigner, blasphemes the LORD. That person shall be cut off from among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_31","005_15_31","NUM","15","31","31","He shall certainly be cut off, because he has despised the word of the LORD and broken His commandment; his guilt remains on him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_32","005_15_32","NUM","15","32","32","While the Israelites were in the wilderness, a man was found gathering wood on the Sabbath day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_33","005_15_33","NUM","15","33","33","Those who found the man gathering wood brought him to Moses, Aaron, and the whole congregation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_34","005_15_34","NUM","15","34","34","and because it had not been declared what should be done to him, they placed him in custody. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_35","005_15_35","NUM","15","35","35","And the LORD said to Moses, “The man must surely be put to death. The whole congregation is to stone him outside the camp.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_36","005_15_36","NUM","15","36","36","So the whole congregation took the man outside the camp and stoned him to death, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_37","005_15_37","NUM","15","37","37","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_38","005_15_38","NUM","15","38","38","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them that throughout the generations to come they are to make for themselves tassels for the corners of their garments, with a blue cord on each tassel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_39","005_15_39","NUM","15","39","39","These will serve as tassels for you to look at, so that you may remember all the commandments of the LORD, that you may obey them and not prostitute yourselves by following your own heart and your own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_40","005_15_40","NUM","15","40","40","Then you will remember and obey all My commandments, and you will be holy to your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU15_41","005_15_41","NUM","15","41","41","I am the LORD your God who brought you out of the land of Egypt to be your God. I am the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_1","005_16_1","NUM","16","1","1","Now Korah son of Izhar, the son of Kohath son of Levi, along with some Reubenites—Dathan and Abiram, sons of Eliab, and On son of Peleth—conducted ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_2","005_16_2","NUM","16","2","2","a rebellion against Moses, along with 250 men of Israel renowned as leaders of the congregation and representatives in the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_3","005_16_3","NUM","16","3","3","They came together against Moses and Aaron and told them, “You have taken too much upon yourselves! For everyone in the entire congregation is holy, and the LORD is in their midst. Why then do you exalt yourselves above the assembly of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_4","005_16_4","NUM","16","4","4","When Moses heard this, he fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_5","005_16_5","NUM","16","5","5","Then he said to Korah and all his followers, “Tomorrow morning the LORD will reveal who belongs to Him and who is holy, and He will bring that person near to Himself. The one He chooses He will bring near to Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_6","005_16_6","NUM","16","6","6","You, Korah, and all your followers are to do as follows: Take censers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_7","005_16_7","NUM","16","7","7","and tomorrow you are to place fire and incense in them in the presence of the LORD. Then the man the LORD chooses will be the one who is holy. It is you sons of Levi who have taken too much upon yourselves!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_8","005_16_8","NUM","16","8","8","Moses also said to Korah, “Now listen, you sons of Levi! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_9","005_16_9","NUM","16","9","9","Is it not enough for you that the God of Israel has separated you from the congregation of Israel and brought you near to Himself to perform the work at the LORD’s tabernacle, and to stand before the congregation to minister to them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_10","005_16_10","NUM","16","10","10","He has brought you near, you and all your fellow Levites, but you are seeking the priesthood as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_11","005_16_11","NUM","16","11","11","Therefore, it is you and all your followers who have conspired against the LORD! As for Aaron, who is he that you should grumble against him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_12","005_16_12","NUM","16","12","12","Then Moses summoned Dathan and Abiram, the sons of Eliab, but they said, “We will not come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_13","005_16_13","NUM","16","13","13","Is it not enough that you have brought us up out of a land flowing with milk and honey to kill us in the wilderness? Must you also appoint yourself as ruler over us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_14","005_16_14","NUM","16","14","14","Moreover, you have not brought us into a land flowing with milk and honey or given us an inheritance of fields and vineyards. Will you gouge out the eyes of these men? No, we will not come!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_15","005_16_15","NUM","16","15","15","Then Moses became very angry and said to the LORD, “Do not regard their offering. I have not taken one donkey from them or mistreated a single one of them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_16","005_16_16","NUM","16","16","16","And Moses said to Korah, “You and all your followers are to appear before the LORD tomorrow—you and they and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_17","005_16_17","NUM","16","17","17","Each man is to take his censer, place incense in it, and present it before the LORD—250 censers. You and Aaron are to present your censers as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_18","005_16_18","NUM","16","18","18","So each man took his censer, put fire and incense in it, and stood with Moses and Aaron at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_19","005_16_19","NUM","16","19","19","When Korah had gathered his whole assembly against them at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, the glory of the LORD appeared to the whole congregation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_20","005_16_20","NUM","16","20","20","And the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_21","005_16_21","NUM","16","21","21","“Separate yourselves from this congregation so that I may consume them in an instant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_22","005_16_22","NUM","16","22","22","But Moses and Aaron fell facedown and said, “O God, the God of the spirits of all flesh, when one man sins, will You be angry with the whole congregation?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_23","005_16_23","NUM","16","23","23","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_24","005_16_24","NUM","16","24","24","“Tell the congregation to move away from the dwellings of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_25","005_16_25","NUM","16","25","25","So Moses got up and went to Dathan and Abiram, and the elders of Israel followed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_26","005_16_26","NUM","16","26","26","And he warned the congregation, “Move away now from the tents of these wicked men. Do not touch anything that belongs to them, or you will be swept away because of all their sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_27","005_16_27","NUM","16","27","27","So they moved away from the dwellings of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram. Meanwhile, Dathan and Abiram had come out and stood at the entrances to their tents with their wives and children and infants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_28","005_16_28","NUM","16","28","28","Then Moses said, “This is how you will know that the LORD has sent me to do all these things, for it was not my own doing: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_29","005_16_29","NUM","16","29","29","If these men die a natural death, or if they suffer the fate of all men, then the LORD has not sent me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_30","005_16_30","NUM","16","30","30","But if the LORD brings about something unprecedented, and the earth opens its mouth and swallows them and all that belongs to them so that they go down alive into Sheol, then you will know that these men have treated the LORD with contempt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_31","005_16_31","NUM","16","31","31","As soon as Moses had finished saying all this, the ground beneath them split open, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_32","005_16_32","NUM","16","32","32","and the earth opened its mouth and swallowed them and their households—all Korah’s men and all their possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_33","005_16_33","NUM","16","33","33","They went down alive into Sheol with all they owned. The earth closed over them, and they vanished from the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_34","005_16_34","NUM","16","34","34","At their cries, all the people of Israel who were around them fled, saying, “The earth may swallow us too!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_35","005_16_35","NUM","16","35","35","And fire came forth from the LORD and consumed the 250 men who were offering the incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_36","005_16_36","NUM","16","36","36","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_37","005_16_37","NUM","16","37","37","“Tell Eleazar son of Aaron the priest to remove the censers from the flames and to scatter the coals far away, because the censers are holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_38","005_16_38","NUM","16","38","38","As for the censers of those who sinned at the cost of their own lives, hammer them into sheets to overlay the altar, for these were presented before the LORD, and so have become holy. They will serve as a sign to the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_39","005_16_39","NUM","16","39","39","So Eleazar the priest took the bronze censers brought by those who had been burned up, and he had them hammered out to overlay the altar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_40","005_16_40","NUM","16","40","40","just as the LORD commanded him through Moses. This was to be a reminder to the Israelites that no outsider who is not a descendant of Aaron should approach to offer incense before the LORD, lest he become like Korah and his followers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_41","005_16_41","NUM","16","41","41","The next day the whole congregation of Israel grumbled against Moses and Aaron, saying, “You have killed the LORD’s people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_42","005_16_42","NUM","16","42","42","But when the congregation gathered against them, Moses and Aaron turned toward the Tent of Meeting, and suddenly the cloud covered it and the glory of the LORD appeared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_43","005_16_43","NUM","16","43","43","Then Moses and Aaron went to the front of the Tent of Meeting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_44","005_16_44","NUM","16","44","44","and the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_45","005_16_45","NUM","16","45","45","“Get away from this congregation so that I may consume them in an instant.” And Moses and Aaron fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_46","005_16_46","NUM","16","46","46","Moses said to Aaron, “Take your censer, place fire from the altar in it, and add incense. Go quickly to the congregation and make atonement for them, because wrath has come out from the LORD; the plague has begun.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_47","005_16_47","NUM","16","47","47","So Aaron took the censer as Moses had ordered and ran into the midst of the assembly. And seeing that the plague had begun among the people, he offered the incense and made atonement for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_48","005_16_48","NUM","16","48","48","He stood between the living and the dead, and the plague was halted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_49","005_16_49","NUM","16","49","49","But those who died from the plague numbered 14,700, in addition to those who had died on account of Korah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU16_50","005_16_50","NUM","16","50","50","Then Aaron returned to Moses at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, since the plague had been halted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_1","005_17_1","NUM","17","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_2","005_17_2","NUM","17","2","2","“Speak to the Israelites and take from them twelve staffs, one from the leader of each tribe. Write each man’s name on his staff, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_3","005_17_3","NUM","17","3","3","and write Aaron’s name on the staff of Levi, because there must be one staff for the head of each tribe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_4","005_17_4","NUM","17","4","4","Place the staffs in the Tent of Meeting in front of the Testimony, where I meet with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_5","005_17_5","NUM","17","5","5","The staff belonging to the man I choose will sprout, and I will rid Myself of the constant grumbling of the Israelites against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_6","005_17_6","NUM","17","6","6","So Moses spoke to the Israelites, and each of their leaders gave him a staff—one for each of the leaders of their tribes, twelve staffs in all. And Aaron’s staff was among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_7","005_17_7","NUM","17","7","7","Then Moses placed the staffs before the LORD in the Tent of the Testimony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_8","005_17_8","NUM","17","8","8","The next day Moses entered the Tent of the Testimony and saw that Aaron’s staff, representing the house of Levi, had sprouted, put forth buds, blossomed, and produced almonds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_9","005_17_9","NUM","17","9","9","Then Moses brought out all the staffs from the LORD’s presence to all the Israelites. They saw them, and each man took his own staff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_10","005_17_10","NUM","17","10","10","The LORD said to Moses, “Put Aaron’s staff back in front of the Testimony, to be kept as a sign for the rebellious, so that you may put an end to their grumbling against Me, lest they die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_11","005_17_11","NUM","17","11","11","So Moses did as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_12","005_17_12","NUM","17","12","12","Then the Israelites declared to Moses, “Look, we are perishing! We are lost; we are all lost! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU17_13","005_17_13","NUM","17","13","13","Anyone who comes near the tabernacle of the LORD will die. Are we all going to perish?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_1","005_18_1","NUM","18","1","1","So the LORD said to Aaron, “You and your sons and your father’s house must bear the iniquity involving the sanctuary. And you and your sons alone must bear the iniquity involving your priesthood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_2","005_18_2","NUM","18","2","2","But bring with you also your brothers from the tribe of Levi, the tribe of your father, that they may join you and assist you and your sons before the Tent of the Testimony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_3","005_18_3","NUM","18","3","3","And they shall attend to your duties and to all the duties of the Tent; but they must not come near to the furnishings of the sanctuary or the altar, or both they and you will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_4","005_18_4","NUM","18","4","4","They are to join you and attend to the duties of the Tent of Meeting, doing all the work at the Tent; but no outsider may come near you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_5","005_18_5","NUM","18","5","5","And you shall attend to the duties of the sanctuary and of the altar, so that wrath may not fall on the Israelites again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_6","005_18_6","NUM","18","6","6","Behold, I Myself have selected your fellow Levites from the Israelites as a gift to you, dedicated to the LORD to perform the service for the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_7","005_18_7","NUM","18","7","7","But only you and your sons shall attend to your priesthood for everything concerning the altar and what is inside the veil, and you are to perform that service. I am giving you the work of the priesthood as a gift, but any outsider who comes near the sanctuary must be put to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_8","005_18_8","NUM","18","8","8","Then the LORD said to Aaron, “Behold, I have put you in charge of My offerings. As for all the sacred offerings of the Israelites, I have given them to you and your sons as a portion and a permanent statute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_9","005_18_9","NUM","18","9","9","A portion of the most holy offerings reserved from the fire will be yours. From all the offerings they render to Me as most holy offerings, whether grain offerings or sin offerings or guilt offerings, that part belongs to you and your sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_10","005_18_10","NUM","18","10","10","You are to eat it as a most holy offering, and every male may eat it. You shall regard it as holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_11","005_18_11","NUM","18","11","11","And this is yours as well: the offering of their gifts, along with all the wave offerings of the Israelites. I have given this to you and your sons and daughters as a permanent statute. Every ceremonially clean person in your household may eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_12","005_18_12","NUM","18","12","12","I give you all the freshest olive oil and all the finest new wine and grain that the Israelites give to the LORD as their firstfruits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_13","005_18_13","NUM","18","13","13","The firstfruits of everything in their land that they bring to the LORD will belong to you. Every ceremonially clean person in your household may eat them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_14","005_18_14","NUM","18","14","14","Every devoted thing in Israel belongs to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_15","005_18_15","NUM","18","15","15","The firstborn of every womb, whether man or beast, that is offered to the LORD belongs to you. But you must surely redeem every firstborn son and every firstborn male of unclean animals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_16","005_18_16","NUM","18","16","16","You are to pay the redemption price for a month-old male according to your valuation: five shekels of silver, according to the sanctuary shekel, which is twenty gerahs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_17","005_18_17","NUM","18","17","17","But you must not redeem the firstborn of an ox, a sheep, or a goat; they are holy. You are to splatter their blood on the altar and burn their fat as a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_18","005_18_18","NUM","18","18","18","And their meat belongs to you, just as the breast and right thigh of the wave offering belong to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_19","005_18_19","NUM","18","19","19","All the holy offerings that the Israelites present to the LORD I give to you and to your sons and daughters as a permanent statute. It is a permanent covenant of salt before the LORD for you and your offspring.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_20","005_18_20","NUM","18","20","20","Then the LORD said to Aaron, “You will have no inheritance in their land, nor will you have any portion among them. I am your portion and your inheritance among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_21","005_18_21","NUM","18","21","21","Behold, I have given to the Levites all the tithes in Israel as an inheritance in return for the work they do, the service of the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_22","005_18_22","NUM","18","22","22","No longer may the Israelites come near to the Tent of Meeting, or they will incur guilt and die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_23","005_18_23","NUM","18","23","23","The Levites are to perform the work of the Tent of Meeting, and they must bear their iniquity. This is a permanent statute for the generations to come. The Levites will not receive an inheritance among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_24","005_18_24","NUM","18","24","24","For I have given to the Levites as their inheritance the tithe that the Israelites present to the LORD as a contribution. That is why I told them that they would not receive an inheritance among the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_25","005_18_25","NUM","18","25","25","And the LORD instructed Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_26","005_18_26","NUM","18","26","26","“Speak to the Levites and tell them: ‘When you receive from the Israelites the tithe that I have given you as your inheritance, you must present part of it as an offering to the LORD—a tithe of the tithe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_27","005_18_27","NUM","18","27","27","Your offering will be reckoned to you as grain from the threshing floor or juice from the winepress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_28","005_18_28","NUM","18","28","28","So you are to present an offering to the LORD from all the tithes you receive from the Israelites, and from these you are to give the LORD’s offering to Aaron the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_29","005_18_29","NUM","18","29","29","You must present the offering due the LORD from all the best of every gift, the holiest part of it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_30","005_18_30","NUM","18","30","30","Therefore say to the Levites, ‘When you have presented the best part, it will be reckoned to you as the produce of the threshing floor or winepress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_31","005_18_31","NUM","18","31","31","And you and your households may eat the rest of it anywhere; it is the compensation for your work at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU18_32","005_18_32","NUM","18","32","32","Once you have presented the best part of it, you will not incur guilt because of it. But you must not defile the sacred offerings of the Israelites, or else you will die.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_1","005_19_1","NUM","19","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_2","005_19_2","NUM","19","2","2","“This is the statute of the law that the LORD has commanded: Instruct the Israelites to bring you an unblemished red heifer that has no defect and has never been placed under a yoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_3","005_19_3","NUM","19","3","3","Give it to Eleazar the priest, and he will have it brought outside the camp and slaughtered in his presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_4","005_19_4","NUM","19","4","4","Eleazar the priest is to take some of its blood on his finger and sprinkle it seven times toward the front of the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_5","005_19_5","NUM","19","5","5","Then the heifer must be burned in his sight. Its hide, its flesh, and its blood are to be burned, along with its dung. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_6","005_19_6","NUM","19","6","6","The priest is to take cedar wood, hyssop, and scarlet wool and throw them onto the burning heifer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_7","005_19_7","NUM","19","7","7","Then the priest must wash his clothes and bathe his body in water; after that he may enter the camp, but he will be ceremonially unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_8","005_19_8","NUM","19","8","8","The one who burned the heifer must also wash his clothes and bathe his body in water, and he too will be ceremonially unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_9","005_19_9","NUM","19","9","9","Then a man who is ceremonially clean is to gather up the ashes of the heifer and store them in a ceremonially clean place outside the camp. They must be kept by the congregation of Israel for preparing the water of purification; this is for purification from sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_10","005_19_10","NUM","19","10","10","The man who has gathered up the ashes of the heifer must also wash his clothes, and he will be ceremonially unclean until evening. This is a permanent statute for the Israelites and for the foreigner residing among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_11","005_19_11","NUM","19","11","11","Whoever touches any dead body will be unclean for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_12","005_19_12","NUM","19","12","12","He must purify himself with the water on the third day and on the seventh day; then he will be clean. But if he does not purify himself on the third and seventh days, he will not be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_13","005_19_13","NUM","19","13","13","Anyone who touches a human corpse and fails to purify himself defiles the tabernacle of the LORD. That person must be cut off from Israel. He remains unclean, because the water of purification has not been sprinkled on him, and his uncleanness is still on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_14","005_19_14","NUM","19","14","14","This is the law when a person dies in a tent: Everyone who enters the tent and everyone already in the tent will be unclean for seven days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_15","005_19_15","NUM","19","15","15","and any open container without a lid fastened on it is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_16","005_19_16","NUM","19","16","16","Anyone in the open field who touches someone who has been killed by the sword or has died of natural causes, or anyone who touches a human bone or a grave, will be unclean for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_17","005_19_17","NUM","19","17","17","For the purification of the unclean person, take some of the ashes of the burnt sin offering, put them in a jar, and pour fresh water over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_18","005_19_18","NUM","19","18","18","Then a man who is ceremonially clean is to take some hyssop, dip it in the water, and sprinkle the tent, all the furnishings, and the people who were there. He is also to sprinkle the one who touched a bone, a grave, or a person who has died or been slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_19","005_19_19","NUM","19","19","19","The man who is ceremonially clean is to sprinkle the unclean person on the third day and on the seventh day. After he purifies the unclean person on the seventh day, the one being cleansed must wash his clothes and bathe in water, and that evening he will be clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_20","005_19_20","NUM","19","20","20","But if a person who is unclean does not purify himself, he will be cut off from the assembly, because he has defiled the sanctuary of the LORD. The water of purification has not been sprinkled on him; he is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_21","005_19_21","NUM","19","21","21","This is a permanent statute for the people: The one who sprinkles the water of purification must wash his clothes, and whoever touches the water of purification will be unclean until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU19_22","005_19_22","NUM","19","22","22","Anything the unclean person touches will become unclean, and anyone who touches it will be unclean until evening.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_1","005_20_1","NUM","20","1","1","In the first month, the whole congregation of Israel entered the Wilderness of Zin and stayed in Kadesh. There Miriam died and was buried. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_2","005_20_2","NUM","20","2","2","Now there was no water for the congregation, so they gathered against Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_3","005_20_3","NUM","20","3","3","The people quarreled with Moses and said, “If only we had perished with our brothers before the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_4","005_20_4","NUM","20","4","4","Why have you brought the LORD’s assembly into this wilderness for us and our livestock to die here? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_5","005_20_5","NUM","20","5","5","Why have you led us up out of Egypt to bring us to this wretched place? It is not a place of grain, figs, vines, or pomegranates—and there is no water to drink!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_6","005_20_6","NUM","20","6","6","Then Moses and Aaron went from the presence of the assembly to the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. They fell facedown, and the glory of the LORD appeared to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_7","005_20_7","NUM","20","7","7","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_8","005_20_8","NUM","20","8","8","“Take the staff and assemble the congregation. You and your brother Aaron are to speak to the rock while they watch, and it will pour out its water. You will bring out water from the rock and provide drink for the congregation and their livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_9","005_20_9","NUM","20","9","9","So Moses took the staff from the LORD’s presence, just as he had been commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_10","005_20_10","NUM","20","10","10","Then Moses and Aaron gathered the assembly in front of the rock, and Moses said to them, “Listen now, you rebels, must we bring you water out of this rock?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_11","005_20_11","NUM","20","11","11","Then Moses raised his hand and struck the rock twice with his staff, so that a great amount of water gushed out, and the congregation and their livestock were able to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_12","005_20_12","NUM","20","12","12","But the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, “Because you did not trust Me to show My holiness in the sight of the Israelites, you will not bring this assembly into the land that I have given them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_13","005_20_13","NUM","20","13","13","These were the waters of Meribah, where the Israelites quarreled with the LORD, and He showed His holiness among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_14","005_20_14","NUM","20","14","14","From Kadesh, Moses sent messengers to tell the king of Edom, “This is what your brother Israel says: You know all the hardship that has befallen us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_15","005_20_15","NUM","20","15","15","how our fathers went down to Egypt, where we lived many years. The Egyptians mistreated us and our fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_16","005_20_16","NUM","20","16","16","and when we cried out to the LORD, He heard our voice, sent an angel, and brought us out of Egypt. Now look, we are in Kadesh, a city on the edge of your territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_17","005_20_17","NUM","20","17","17","Please let us pass through your land. We will not go through any field or vineyard, or drink water from any well. We will stay on the King’s Highway; we will not turn to the right or to the left until we have passed through your territory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_18","005_20_18","NUM","20","18","18","But Edom answered, “You may not travel through our land, or we will come out and confront you with the sword.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_19","005_20_19","NUM","20","19","19","“We will stay on the main road,” the Israelites replied, “and if we or our herds drink your water, we will pay for it. There will be no problem; only let us pass through on foot.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_20","005_20_20","NUM","20","20","20","But Edom insisted, “You may not pass through.” And they came out to confront the Israelites with a large army and a strong hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_21","005_20_21","NUM","20","21","21","So Edom refused to allow Israel to pass through their territory, and Israel turned away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_22","005_20_22","NUM","20","22","22","After they had set out from Kadesh, the whole congregation of Israel came to Mount Hor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_23","005_20_23","NUM","20","23","23","And at Mount Hor, near the border of the land of Edom, the LORD said to Moses and Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_24","005_20_24","NUM","20","24","24","“Aaron will be gathered to his people; he will not enter the land that I have given the Israelites, because both of you rebelled against My command at the waters of Meribah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_25","005_20_25","NUM","20","25","25","Take Aaron and his son Eleazar and bring them up Mount Hor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_26","005_20_26","NUM","20","26","26","Remove Aaron’s priestly garments and put them on his son Eleazar. Aaron will be gathered to his people and will die there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_27","005_20_27","NUM","20","27","27","So Moses did as the LORD had commanded, and they climbed Mount Hor in the sight of the whole congregation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_28","005_20_28","NUM","20","28","28","After Moses had removed Aaron’s garments and put them on his son Eleazar, Aaron died there on top of the mountain. Then Moses and Eleazar came down from the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU20_29","005_20_29","NUM","20","29","29","When the whole congregation saw that Aaron had died, the entire house of Israel mourned for him thirty days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_1","005_21_1","NUM","21","1","1","When the Canaanite king of Arad, who lived in the Negev, heard that Israel was coming along the road to Atharim, he attacked Israel and captured some prisoners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_2","005_21_2","NUM","21","2","2","So Israel made a vow to the LORD: “If You will deliver this people into our hands, we will devote their cities to destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_3","005_21_3","NUM","21","3","3","And the LORD heard Israel’s plea and delivered up the Canaanites. Israel devoted them and their cities to destruction; so they named the place Hormah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_4","005_21_4","NUM","21","4","4","Then they set out from Mount Hor along the route to the Red Sea, in order to bypass the land of Edom. But the people grew impatient on the journey ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_5","005_21_5","NUM","21","5","5","and spoke against God and against Moses: “Why have you led us up out of Egypt to die in the wilderness? There is no bread or water, and we detest this wretched food!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_6","005_21_6","NUM","21","6","6","So the LORD sent venomous snakes among the people, and many of the Israelites were bitten and died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_7","005_21_7","NUM","21","7","7","Then the people came to Moses and said, “We have sinned by speaking against the LORD and against you. Intercede with the LORD so He will take the snakes away from us.” So Moses interceded for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_8","005_21_8","NUM","21","8","8","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Make a fiery serpent and mount it on a pole. When anyone who is bitten looks at it, he will live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_9","005_21_9","NUM","21","9","9","So Moses made a bronze snake and mounted it on a pole. If anyone who was bitten looked at the bronze snake, he would live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_10","005_21_10","NUM","21","10","10","Then the Israelites set out and camped at Oboth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_11","005_21_11","NUM","21","11","11","They journeyed from Oboth and camped at Iye-abarim in the wilderness opposite Moab to the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_12","005_21_12","NUM","21","12","12","From there they set out and camped in the Valley of Zered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_13","005_21_13","NUM","21","13","13","From there they moved on and camped on the other side of the Arnon, in the wilderness that extends into the Amorite territory. Now the Arnon is the border between the Moabites and the Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_14","005_21_14","NUM","21","14","14","Therefore it is stated in the Book of the Wars of the LORD: “Waheb in Suphah and the wadis of the Arnon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_15","005_21_15","NUM","21","15","15","even the slopes of the wadis that extend to the site of Ar and lie along the border of Moab.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_16","005_21_16","NUM","21","16","16","From there they went on to Beer, the well where the LORD said to Moses, “Gather the people so that I may give them water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_17","005_21_17","NUM","21","17","17","Then Israel sang this song: “Spring up, O well, all of you sing to it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_18","005_21_18","NUM","21","18","18","The princes dug the well; the nobles of the people hollowed it out with their scepters and with their staffs.” From the wilderness the Israelites went on to Mattanah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_19","005_21_19","NUM","21","19","19","and from Mattanah to Nahaliel, and from Nahaliel to Bamoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_20","005_21_20","NUM","21","20","20","and from Bamoth to the valley in Moab where the top of Pisgah overlooks the wasteland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_21","005_21_21","NUM","21","21","21","Then Israel sent messengers to Sihon king of the Amorites, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_22","005_21_22","NUM","21","22","22","“Let us pass through your land. We will not turn aside into any field or vineyard, or drink water from any well. We will stay on the King’s Highway until we have passed through your territory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_23","005_21_23","NUM","21","23","23","But Sihon would not let Israel pass through his territory. Instead, he gathered his whole army and went out to confront Israel in the wilderness. When he came to Jahaz, he fought against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_24","005_21_24","NUM","21","24","24","And Israel put him to the sword and took possession of his land, from the Arnon to the Jabbok—but only up to the border of the Ammonites, because it was fortified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_25","005_21_25","NUM","21","25","25","Israel captured all the cities of the Amorites and occupied them, including Heshbon and all its villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_26","005_21_26","NUM","21","26","26","Heshbon was the city of Sihon king of the Amorites, who had fought against the former king of Moab and taken all his land as far as the Arnon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_27","005_21_27","NUM","21","27","27","That is why the poets say: “Come to Heshbon, let it be rebuilt; let the city of Sihon be restored. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_28","005_21_28","NUM","21","28","28","For a fire went out from Heshbon, a blaze from the city of Sihon. It consumed Ar of Moab, the rulers of Arnon’s heights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_29","005_21_29","NUM","21","29","29","Woe to you, O Moab! You are destroyed, O people of Chemosh! He gave up his sons as refugees, and his daughters into captivity to Sihon king of the Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_30","005_21_30","NUM","21","30","30","But we have overthrown them; Heshbon is destroyed as far as Dibon. We demolished them as far as Nophah, which reaches to Medeba.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_31","005_21_31","NUM","21","31","31","So Israel lived in the land of the Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_32","005_21_32","NUM","21","32","32","After Moses had sent spies to Jazer, Israel captured its villages and drove out the Amorites who were there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_33","005_21_33","NUM","21","33","33","Then they turned and went up the road to Bashan, and Og king of Bashan and his whole army came out to meet them in battle at Edrei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_34","005_21_34","NUM","21","34","34","But the LORD said to Moses, “Do not fear him, for I have delivered him into your hand, along with all his people and his land. Do to him as you did to Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU21_35","005_21_35","NUM","21","35","35","So they struck down Og, along with his sons and his whole army, until no remnant was left. And they took possession of his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_1","005_22_1","NUM","22","1","1","Then the Israelites traveled on and camped in the plains of Moab near the Jordan, across from Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_2","005_22_2","NUM","22","2","2","Now Balak son of Zippor saw all that Israel had done to the Amorites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_3","005_22_3","NUM","22","3","3","and Moab was terrified of the people because they were numerous. Indeed, Moab dreaded the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_4","005_22_4","NUM","22","4","4","So the Moabites said to the elders of Midian, “This horde will devour everything around us, as an ox licks up the grass of the field.” Since Balak son of Zippor was king of Moab at that time, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_5","005_22_5","NUM","22","5","5","he sent messengers to summon Balaam son of Beor at Pethor, which is by the Euphrates in the land of his people. “Behold, a people has come out of Egypt,” said Balak. “They cover the face of the land and have settled next to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_6","005_22_6","NUM","22","6","6","So please come now and put a curse on this people, because they are too mighty for me. Perhaps I may be able to defeat them and drive them out of the land; for I know that those you bless are blessed, and those you curse are cursed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_7","005_22_7","NUM","22","7","7","The elders of Moab and Midian departed with the fees for divination in hand. They came to Balaam and relayed to him the words of Balak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_8","005_22_8","NUM","22","8","8","“Spend the night here,” Balaam replied, “and I will give you the answer that the LORD speaks to me.” So the princes of Moab stayed with Balaam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_9","005_22_9","NUM","22","9","9","Then God came to Balaam and asked, “Who are these men with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_10","005_22_10","NUM","22","10","10","And Balaam said to God, “Balak son of Zippor, king of Moab, sent me this message: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_11","005_22_11","NUM","22","11","11","‘Behold, a people has come out of Egypt, and they cover the face of the land. Now come and put a curse on them for me. Perhaps I may be able to fight against them and drive them away.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_12","005_22_12","NUM","22","12","12","But God said to Balaam, “Do not go with them. You are not to curse this people, for they are blessed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_13","005_22_13","NUM","22","13","13","So Balaam got up the next morning and said to Balak’s princes, “Go back to your homeland, because the LORD has refused to let me go with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_14","005_22_14","NUM","22","14","14","And the princes of Moab arose, returned to Balak, and said, “Balaam refused to come with us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_15","005_22_15","NUM","22","15","15","Then Balak sent other princes, more numerous and more distinguished than the first messengers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_16","005_22_16","NUM","22","16","16","They came to Balaam and said, “This is what Balak son of Zippor says: ‘Please let nothing hinder you from coming to me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_17","005_22_17","NUM","22","17","17","for I will honor you richly and do whatever you say. So please come and put a curse on this people for me!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_18","005_22_18","NUM","22","18","18","But Balaam replied to the servants of Balak, “If Balak were to give me his house full of silver and gold, I could not do anything small or great to go beyond the command of the LORD my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_19","005_22_19","NUM","22","19","19","So now, please stay here overnight as the others did, that I may find out what else the LORD has to tell me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_20","005_22_20","NUM","22","20","20","That night God came to Balaam and said, “Since these men have come to summon you, get up and go with them, but you must only do what I tell you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_21","005_22_21","NUM","22","21","21","So in the morning Balaam got up, saddled his donkey, and went with the princes of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_22","005_22_22","NUM","22","22","22","Then God’s anger was kindled because Balaam was going along, and the angel of the LORD stood in the road to oppose him. Balaam was riding his donkey, and his two servants were with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_23","005_22_23","NUM","22","23","23","When the donkey saw the angel of the LORD standing in the road with a drawn sword in his hand, she turned off the path and went into a field. So Balaam beat her to return her to the path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_24","005_22_24","NUM","22","24","24","Then the angel of the LORD stood in a narrow passage between two vineyards, with walls on either side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_25","005_22_25","NUM","22","25","25","And the donkey saw the angel of the LORD and pressed herself against the wall, crushing Balaam’s foot against it. So he beat her once again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_26","005_22_26","NUM","22","26","26","And the angel of the LORD moved on ahead and stood in a narrow place where there was no room to turn to the right or left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_27","005_22_27","NUM","22","27","27","When the donkey saw the angel of the LORD, she lay down under Balaam, and he became furious and beat her with his staff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_28","005_22_28","NUM","22","28","28","Then the LORD opened the donkey’s mouth, and she said to Balaam, “What have I done to you that you have beaten me these three times?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_29","005_22_29","NUM","22","29","29","Balaam answered the donkey, “You have made a fool of me! If I had a sword in my hand, I would kill you right now!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_30","005_22_30","NUM","22","30","30","But the donkey said to Balaam, “Am I not the donkey you have ridden all your life until today? Have I ever treated you this way before?” “No,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_31","005_22_31","NUM","22","31","31","Then the LORD opened Balaam’s eyes, and he saw the angel of the LORD standing in the road with a drawn sword in his hand. And Balaam bowed low and fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_32","005_22_32","NUM","22","32","32","The angel of the LORD asked him, “Why have you beaten your donkey these three times? Behold, I have come out to oppose you, because your way is perverse before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_33","005_22_33","NUM","22","33","33","The donkey saw me and turned away from me these three times. If she had not turned away, then by now I would surely have killed you and let her live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_34","005_22_34","NUM","22","34","34","“I have sinned,” Balaam said to the angel of the LORD, “for I did not realize that you were standing in the road to confront me. And now, if this is displeasing in your sight, I will go back home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_35","005_22_35","NUM","22","35","35","But the angel of the LORD said to Balaam, “Go with the men, but you are to speak only what I tell you.” So Balaam went with the princes of Balak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_36","005_22_36","NUM","22","36","36","When Balak heard that Balaam was coming, he went out to meet him at the Moabite city on the Arnon border, at the edge of his territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_37","005_22_37","NUM","22","37","37","And he said to Balaam, “Did I not send you an urgent summons? Why did you not come to me? Am I really not able to reward you richly?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_38","005_22_38","NUM","22","38","38","“See, I have come to you,” Balaam replied, “but can I say just anything? I must speak only the word that God puts in my mouth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_39","005_22_39","NUM","22","39","39","So Balaam accompanied Balak, and they came to Kiriath-huzoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_40","005_22_40","NUM","22","40","40","Balak sacrificed cattle and sheep, and he gave portions to Balaam and the princes who were with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU22_41","005_22_41","NUM","22","41","41","The next morning, Balak took Balaam and brought him up to Bamoth-baal. From there he could see the outskirts of the camp of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_1","005_23_1","NUM","23","1","1","Then Balaam said to Balak, “Build for me seven altars here, and prepare for me seven bulls and seven rams.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_2","005_23_2","NUM","23","2","2","So Balak did as Balaam had instructed, and Balak and Balaam offered a bull and a ram on each altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_3","005_23_3","NUM","23","3","3","“Stay here by your burnt offering while I am gone,” Balaam said to Balak. “Perhaps the LORD will meet with me. And whatever He reveals to me, I will tell you.” So Balaam went off to a barren height, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_4","005_23_4","NUM","23","4","4","and God met with him. “I have set up seven altars,” Balaam said, “and on each altar I have offered a bull and a ram.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_5","005_23_5","NUM","23","5","5","Then the LORD put a message in Balaam’s mouth, saying, “Return to Balak and give him this message.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_6","005_23_6","NUM","23","6","6","So he returned to Balak, who was standing there beside his burnt offering, with all the princes of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_7","005_23_7","NUM","23","7","7","And Balaam lifted up an oracle, saying: “Balak brought me from Aram, the king of Moab from the mountains of the east. ‘Come,’ he said, ‘put a curse on Jacob for me; come and denounce Israel!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_8","005_23_8","NUM","23","8","8","How can I curse those whom God has not cursed? How can I denounce those whom the LORD has not denounced? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_9","005_23_9","NUM","23","9","9","For I see them from atop the rocky cliffs, and I watch them from the hills. Behold, a people dwelling apart, not reckoning themselves among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_10","005_23_10","NUM","23","10","10","Who can count the dust of Jacob or number even a fourth of Israel? Let me die the death of the righteous; let my end be like theirs!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_11","005_23_11","NUM","23","11","11","Then Balak said to Balaam, “What have you done to me? I brought you here to curse my enemies, and behold, you have only blessed them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_12","005_23_12","NUM","23","12","12","But Balaam replied, “Should I not speak exactly what the LORD puts in my mouth?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_13","005_23_13","NUM","23","13","13","Then Balak said to him, “Please come with me to another place where you can see them. You will only see the outskirts of their camp—not all of them. And from there, curse them for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_14","005_23_14","NUM","23","14","14","So Balak took him to the field of Zophim, to the top of Pisgah, where he built seven altars and offered a bull and a ram on each altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_15","005_23_15","NUM","23","15","15","Balaam said to Balak, “Stay here beside your burnt offering while I meet the LORD over there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_16","005_23_16","NUM","23","16","16","And the LORD met with Balaam and put a message in his mouth, saying, “Return to Balak and speak what I tell you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_17","005_23_17","NUM","23","17","17","So he returned to Balak, who was standing there by his burnt offering with the princes of Moab. “What did the LORD say?” Balak asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_18","005_23_18","NUM","23","18","18","Then Balaam lifted up an oracle, saying: “Arise, O Balak, and listen; give ear to me, O son of Zippor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_19","005_23_19","NUM","23","19","19","God is not a man, that He should lie, or a son of man, that He should change His mind. Does He speak and not act? Does He promise and not fulfill? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_20","005_23_20","NUM","23","20","20","I have indeed received a command to bless; He has blessed, and I cannot change it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_21","005_23_21","NUM","23","21","21","He considers no disaster for Jacob; He sees no trouble for Israel. The LORD their God is with them, and the shout of the King is among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_22","005_23_22","NUM","23","22","22","God brought them out of Egypt with strength like a wild ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_23","005_23_23","NUM","23","23","23","For there is no spell against Jacob and no divination against Israel. It will now be said of Jacob and Israel, ‘What great things God has done!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_24","005_23_24","NUM","23","24","24","Behold, the people rise like a lioness; they rouse themselves like a lion, not resting until they devour their prey and drink the blood of the slain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_25","005_23_25","NUM","23","25","25","Now Balak said to Balaam, “Then neither curse them at all nor bless them at all!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_26","005_23_26","NUM","23","26","26","But Balaam replied, “Did I not tell you that whatever the LORD says, I must do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_27","005_23_27","NUM","23","27","27","“Please come,” said Balak, “I will take you to another place. Perhaps it will please God that you curse them for me from there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_28","005_23_28","NUM","23","28","28","And Balak took Balaam to the top of Peor, which overlooks the wasteland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_29","005_23_29","NUM","23","29","29","Then Balaam said, “Build for me seven altars here, and prepare for me seven bulls and seven rams.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU23_30","005_23_30","NUM","23","30","30","So Balak did as Balaam had instructed, and he offered a bull and a ram on each altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_1","005_24_1","NUM","24","1","1","And when Balaam saw that it pleased the LORD to bless Israel, he did not seek omens as on previous occasions, but he turned his face toward the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_2","005_24_2","NUM","24","2","2","When Balaam looked up and saw Israel encamped tribe by tribe, the Spirit of God came upon him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_3","005_24_3","NUM","24","3","3","and he lifted up an oracle, saying: “This is the prophecy of Balaam son of Beor, the prophecy of a man whose eyes are open, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_4","005_24_4","NUM","24","4","4","the prophecy of one who hears the words of God, who sees a vision from the Almighty, who bows down with eyes wide open: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_5","005_24_5","NUM","24","5","5","How lovely are your tents, O Jacob, your dwellings, O Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_6","005_24_6","NUM","24","6","6","They spread out like palm groves, like gardens beside a stream, like aloes the LORD has planted, like cedars beside the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_7","005_24_7","NUM","24","7","7","Water will flow from his buckets, and his seed will have abundant water. His king will be greater than Agag, and his kingdom will be exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_8","005_24_8","NUM","24","8","8","God brought him out of Egypt with strength like a wild ox, to devour hostile nations and crush their bones, to pierce them with arrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_9","005_24_9","NUM","24","9","9","He crouches, he lies down like a lion, like a lioness—who dares to rouse him? Blessed are those who bless you and cursed are those who curse you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_10","005_24_10","NUM","24","10","10","Then Balak’s anger burned against Balaam, and he struck his hands together and said to Balaam, “I summoned you to curse my enemies, but behold, you have persisted in blessing them these three times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_11","005_24_11","NUM","24","11","11","Therefore, flee at once to your home! I said I would reward you richly, but instead the LORD has denied your reward.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_12","005_24_12","NUM","24","12","12","Balaam answered Balak, “Did I not already tell the messengers you sent me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_13","005_24_13","NUM","24","13","13","that even if Balak were to give me his house full of silver and gold, I could not do anything of my own accord, good or bad, to go beyond the command of the LORD? I must speak whatever the LORD says. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_14","005_24_14","NUM","24","14","14","Now I am going back to my people, but come, let me warn you what this people will do to your people in the days to come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_15","005_24_15","NUM","24","15","15","Then Balaam lifted up an oracle, saying, “This is the prophecy of Balaam son of Beor, the prophecy of a man whose eyes are open, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_16","005_24_16","NUM","24","16","16","the prophecy of one who hears the words of God, who has knowledge from the Most High, who sees a vision from the Almighty, who bows down with eyes wide open: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_17","005_24_17","NUM","24","17","17","I see him, but not now; I behold him, but not near. A star will come forth from Jacob, and a scepter will arise from Israel. He will crush the skulls of Moab and strike down all the sons of Sheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_18","005_24_18","NUM","24","18","18","Edom will become a possession, as will Seir, his enemy; but Israel will perform with valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_19","005_24_19","NUM","24","19","19","A ruler will come from Jacob and destroy the survivors of the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_20","005_24_20","NUM","24","20","20","Then Balaam saw Amalek and lifted up an oracle, saying: “Amalek was first among the nations, but his end is destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_21","005_24_21","NUM","24","21","21","Next he saw the Kenites and lifted up an oracle, saying: “Your dwelling place is secure, and your nest is set in a cliff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_22","005_24_22","NUM","24","22","22","Yet Kain will be destroyed when Asshur takes you captive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_23","005_24_23","NUM","24","23","23","Once more Balaam lifted up an oracle, saying: “Ah, who can live unless God has ordained it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_24","005_24_24","NUM","24","24","24","Ships will come from the coasts of Cyprus; they will subdue Asshur and Eber, but they too will perish forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU24_25","005_24_25","NUM","24","25","25","Then Balaam arose and returned to his homeland, and Balak also went on his way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_1","005_25_1","NUM","25","1","1","While Israel was staying in Shittim, the men began to indulge in sexual immorality with the daughters of Moab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_2","005_25_2","NUM","25","2","2","who also invited them to the sacrifices for their gods. And the people ate and bowed down to these gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_3","005_25_3","NUM","25","3","3","So Israel joined in worshiping Baal of Peor, and the anger of the LORD burned against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_4","005_25_4","NUM","25","4","4","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Take all the leaders of the people and execute them in broad daylight before the LORD, so that His fierce anger may turn away from Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_5","005_25_5","NUM","25","5","5","So Moses told the judges of Israel, “Each of you must kill all of his men who have joined in worshiping Baal of Peor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_6","005_25_6","NUM","25","6","6","Just then an Israelite man brought to his family a Midianite woman in the sight of Moses and the whole congregation of Israel while they were weeping at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_7","005_25_7","NUM","25","7","7","On seeing this, Phinehas son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, got up from the assembly, took a spear in his hand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_8","005_25_8","NUM","25","8","8","followed the Israelite into his tent, and drove the spear through both of them—through the Israelite and on through the belly of the woman. So the plague against the Israelites was halted, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_9","005_25_9","NUM","25","9","9","but those who died in the plague numbered 24,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_10","005_25_10","NUM","25","10","10","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_11","005_25_11","NUM","25","11","11","“Phinehas son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, has turned My wrath away from the Israelites; for he was zealous for My sake among them, so that I did not consume the Israelites in My zeal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_12","005_25_12","NUM","25","12","12","Declare, therefore, that I am granting him My covenant of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_13","005_25_13","NUM","25","13","13","It will be a covenant of permanent priesthood for him and his descendants, because he was zealous for his God and made atonement for the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_14","005_25_14","NUM","25","14","14","The name of the Israelite who was slain with the Midianite woman was Zimri son of Salu, the leader of a Simeonite family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_15","005_25_15","NUM","25","15","15","And the name of the slain Midianite woman was Cozbi, the daughter of Zur, a tribal chief of a Midianite family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_16","005_25_16","NUM","25","16","16","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_17","005_25_17","NUM","25","17","17","“Attack the Midianites and strike them dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU25_18","005_25_18","NUM","25","18","18","For they assailed you deceitfully when they seduced you in the matter of Peor and their sister Cozbi, the daughter of the Midianite leader, the woman who was killed on the day the plague came because of Peor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_1","005_26_1","NUM","26","1","1","After the plague had ended, the LORD said to Moses and Eleazar son of Aaron the priest, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_2","005_26_2","NUM","26","2","2","“Take a census of the whole congregation of Israel by the houses of their fathers—all those twenty years of age or older who can serve in the army of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_3","005_26_3","NUM","26","3","3","So on the plains of Moab by the Jordan, across from Jericho, Moses and Eleazar the priest issued the instruction, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_4","005_26_4","NUM","26","4","4","“Take a census of the men twenty years of age or older, as the LORD has commanded Moses.” And these were the Israelites who came out of the land of Egypt: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_5","005_26_5","NUM","26","5","5","Reuben was the firstborn of Israel. These were the descendants of Reuben: The Hanochite clan from Hanoch, the Palluite clan from Pallu, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_6","005_26_6","NUM","26","6","6","the Hezronite clan from Hezron, and the Carmite clan from Carmi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_7","005_26_7","NUM","26","7","7","These were the clans of Reuben, and their registration numbered 43,730. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_8","005_26_8","NUM","26","8","8","Now the son of Pallu was Eliab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_9","005_26_9","NUM","26","9","9","and the sons of Eliab were Nemuel, Dathan, and Abiram. It was Dathan and Abiram, chosen by the congregation, who rebelled against Moses and Aaron with the followers of Korah who rebelled against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_10","005_26_10","NUM","26","10","10","And the earth opened its mouth and swallowed them along with Korah, whose followers died when the fire consumed 250 men. They serve as a warning sign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_11","005_26_11","NUM","26","11","11","However, the line of Korah did not die out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_12","005_26_12","NUM","26","12","12","These were the descendants of Simeon by their clans: The Nemuelite clan from Nemuel, the Jaminite clan from Jamin, the Jachinite clan from Jachin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_13","005_26_13","NUM","26","13","13","the Zerahite clan from Zerah, and the Shaulite clan from Shaul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_14","005_26_14","NUM","26","14","14","These were the clans of Simeon, and there were 22,200 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_15","005_26_15","NUM","26","15","15","These were the descendants of Gad by their clans: The Zephonite clan from Zephon, the Haggite clan from Haggi, the Shunite clan from Shuni, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_16","005_26_16","NUM","26","16","16","the Oznite clan from Ozni, the Erite clan from Eri, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_17","005_26_17","NUM","26","17","17","the Arodite clan from Arod, and the Arelite clan from Areli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_18","005_26_18","NUM","26","18","18","These were the clans of Gad, and their registration numbered 40,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_19","005_26_19","NUM","26","19","19","The sons of Judah were Er and Onan, but they died in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_20","005_26_20","NUM","26","20","20","These were the descendants of Judah by their clans: The Shelanite clan from Shelah, the Perezite clan from Perez, and the Zerahite clan from Zerah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_21","005_26_21","NUM","26","21","21","And these were the descendants of Perez: the Hezronite clan from Hezron and the Hamulite clan from Hamul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_22","005_26_22","NUM","26","22","22","These were the clans of Judah, and their registration numbered 76,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_23","005_26_23","NUM","26","23","23","These were the descendants of Issachar by their clans: The Tolaite clan from Tola, the Punite clan from Puvah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_24","005_26_24","NUM","26","24","24","the Jashubite clan from Jashub, and the Shimronite clan from Shimron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_25","005_26_25","NUM","26","25","25","These were the clans of Issachar, and their registration numbered 64,300. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_26","005_26_26","NUM","26","26","26","These were the descendants of Zebulun by their clans: The Seredite clan from Sered, the Elonite clan from Elon, and the Jahleelite clan from Jahleel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_27","005_26_27","NUM","26","27","27","These were the clans of Zebulun, and their registration numbered 60,500. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_28","005_26_28","NUM","26","28","28","The descendants of Joseph included the clans of Manasseh and Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_29","005_26_29","NUM","26","29","29","These were the descendants of Manasseh: The Machirite clan from Machir, the father of Gilead, and the Gileadite clan from Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_30","005_26_30","NUM","26","30","30","These were the descendants of Gilead: the Iezerite clan from Iezer, the Helekite clan from Helek, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_31","005_26_31","NUM","26","31","31","the Asrielite clan from Asriel, the Shechemite clan from Shechem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_32","005_26_32","NUM","26","32","32","the Shemidaite clan from Shemida, and the Hepherite clan from Hepher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_33","005_26_33","NUM","26","33","33","Now Zelophehad son of Hepher had no sons but only daughters. The names of his daughters were Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_34","005_26_34","NUM","26","34","34","These were the clans of Manasseh, and their registration numbered 52,700. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_35","005_26_35","NUM","26","35","35","These were the descendants of Ephraim by their clans: The Shuthelahite clan from Shuthelah, the Becherite clan from Becher, and the Tahanite clan from Tahan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_36","005_26_36","NUM","26","36","36","And the descendants of Shuthelah were the Eranite clan from Eran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_37","005_26_37","NUM","26","37","37","These were the clans of Ephraim, and their registration numbered 32,500. These clans were the descendants of Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_38","005_26_38","NUM","26","38","38","These were the descendants of Benjamin by their clans: The Belaite clan from Bela, the Ashbelite clan from Ashbel, the Ahiramite clan from Ahiram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_39","005_26_39","NUM","26","39","39","the Shuphamite clan from Shupham, and the Huphamite clan from Hupham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_40","005_26_40","NUM","26","40","40","And the descendants of Bela from Ard and Naaman were the Ardite clan from Ard and the Naamite clan from Naaman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_41","005_26_41","NUM","26","41","41","These were the clans of Benjamin, and their registration numbered 45,600. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_42","005_26_42","NUM","26","42","42","These were the descendants of Dan by their clans: The Shuhamite clan from Shuham. These were the clans of Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_43","005_26_43","NUM","26","43","43","All of them were Shuhamite clans, and their registration numbered 64,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_44","005_26_44","NUM","26","44","44","These were the descendants of Asher by their clans: The Imnite clan from Imnah, the Ishvite clan from Ishvi, and the Beriite clan from Beriah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_45","005_26_45","NUM","26","45","45","And these were the descendants of Beriah: the Heberite clan from Heber and the Malchielite clan from Malchiel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_46","005_26_46","NUM","26","46","46","And the name of Asher’s daughter was Serah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_47","005_26_47","NUM","26","47","47","These were the clans of Asher, and their registration numbered 53,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_48","005_26_48","NUM","26","48","48","These were the descendants of Naphtali by their clans: The Jahzeelite clan from Jahzeel, the Gunite clan from Guni, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_49","005_26_49","NUM","26","49","49","the Jezerite clan from Jezer, and the Shillemite clan from Shillem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_50","005_26_50","NUM","26","50","50","These were the clans of Naphtali, and their registration numbered 45,400. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_51","005_26_51","NUM","26","51","51","These men of Israel numbered 601,730 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_52","005_26_52","NUM","26","52","52","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_53","005_26_53","NUM","26","53","53","“The land is to be divided among the tribes as an inheritance, according to the number of names. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_54","005_26_54","NUM","26","54","54","Increase the inheritance for a large tribe and decrease it for a small one; each tribe is to receive its inheritance according to the number of those registered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_55","005_26_55","NUM","26","55","55","Indeed, the land must be divided by lot; they shall receive their inheritance according to the names of the tribes of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_56","005_26_56","NUM","26","56","56","Each inheritance is to be divided by lot among the larger and smaller tribes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_57","005_26_57","NUM","26","57","57","Now these were the Levites numbered by their clans: The Gershonite clan from Gershon, the Kohathite clan from Kohath, and the Merarite clan from Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_58","005_26_58","NUM","26","58","58","These were the families of the Levites: The Libnite clan, the Hebronite clan, the Mahlite clan, the Mushite clan, and the Korahite clan. Now Kohath was the father of Amram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_59","005_26_59","NUM","26","59","59","and Amram’s wife was named Jochebed. She was also a daughter of Levi, born to Levi in Egypt. To Amram she bore Aaron, Moses, and their sister Miriam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_60","005_26_60","NUM","26","60","60","Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar were born to Aaron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_61","005_26_61","NUM","26","61","61","but Nadab and Abihu died when they offered unauthorized fire before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_62","005_26_62","NUM","26","62","62","The registration of the Levites totaled 23,000, every male a month old or more; they were not numbered among the other Israelites, because no inheritance was given to them among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_63","005_26_63","NUM","26","63","63","These were the ones numbered by Moses and Eleazar the priest when they counted the Israelites on the plains of Moab by the Jordan, across from Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_64","005_26_64","NUM","26","64","64","Among all these, however, there was not one who had been numbered by Moses and Aaron the priest when they counted the Israelites in the Wilderness of Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU26_65","005_26_65","NUM","26","65","65","For the LORD had told them that they would surely die in the wilderness. Not one was left except Caleb son of Jephunneh and Joshua son of Nun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_1","005_27_1","NUM","27","1","1","Now the daughters of Zelophehad son of Hepher, the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh, belonged to the clans of Manasseh son of Joseph. These were the names of his daughters: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah. They approached ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_2","005_27_2","NUM","27","2","2","the entrance to the Tent of Meeting, stood before Moses, Eleazar the priest, the leaders, and the whole congregation, and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_3","005_27_3","NUM","27","3","3","“Our father died in the wilderness, but he was not among the followers of Korah who gathered together against the LORD. Instead, he died because of his own sin, and he had no sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_4","005_27_4","NUM","27","4","4","Why should the name of our father disappear from his clan because he had no sons? Give us property among our father’s brothers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_5","005_27_5","NUM","27","5","5","So Moses brought their case before the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_6","005_27_6","NUM","27","6","6","and the LORD answered him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_7","005_27_7","NUM","27","7","7","“The daughters of Zelophehad speak correctly. You certainly must give them property as an inheritance among their father’s brothers and transfer their father’s inheritance to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_8","005_27_8","NUM","27","8","8","Furthermore, you shall say to the Israelites, ‘If a man dies and leaves no son, you are to transfer his inheritance to his daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_9","005_27_9","NUM","27","9","9","If he has no daughter, give his inheritance to his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_10","005_27_10","NUM","27","10","10","If he has no brothers, give his inheritance to his father’s brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_11","005_27_11","NUM","27","11","11","And if his father has no brothers, give his inheritance to the next of kin from his clan, that he may take possession of it. This is to be a statutory ordinance for the Israelites, as the LORD has commanded Moses.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_12","005_27_12","NUM","27","12","12","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Go up this mountain of the Abarim range and see the land that I have given the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_13","005_27_13","NUM","27","13","13","After you have seen it, you too will be gathered to your people, as your brother Aaron was; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_14","005_27_14","NUM","27","14","14","for when the congregation contended in the Wilderness of Zin, both of you rebelled against My command to show My holiness in their sight regarding the waters.” Those were the waters of Meribah in Kadesh, in the Wilderness of Zin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_15","005_27_15","NUM","27","15","15","So Moses appealed to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_16","005_27_16","NUM","27","16","16","“May the LORD, the God of the spirits of all flesh, appoint a man over the congregation ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_17","005_27_17","NUM","27","17","17","who will go out and come in before them, and who will lead them out and bring them in, so that the congregation of the LORD will not be like sheep without a shepherd.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_18","005_27_18","NUM","27","18","18","And the LORD replied to Moses, “Take Joshua son of Nun, a man with the Spirit in him, and lay your hands on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_19","005_27_19","NUM","27","19","19","Have him stand before Eleazar the priest and the whole congregation, and commission him in their sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_20","005_27_20","NUM","27","20","20","Confer on him some of your authority, so that the whole congregation of Israel will obey him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_21","005_27_21","NUM","27","21","21","He shall stand before Eleazar the priest, who will seek counsel for him before the LORD by the judgment of the Urim. At his command, he and all the Israelites with him—the entire congregation—will go out and come in.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_22","005_27_22","NUM","27","22","22","Moses did as the LORD had commanded him. He took Joshua, had him stand before Eleazar the priest and the whole congregation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU27_23","005_27_23","NUM","27","23","23","and laid his hands on him and commissioned him, as the LORD had instructed through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_1","005_28_1","NUM","28","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_2","005_28_2","NUM","28","2","2","“Command the Israelites and say to them: See that you present to Me at its appointed time the food for My food offerings, as a pleasing aroma to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_3","005_28_3","NUM","28","3","3","And tell them that this is the food offering you are to present to the LORD as a regular burnt offering each day: two unblemished year-old male lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_4","005_28_4","NUM","28","4","4","Offer one lamb in the morning and the other at twilight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_5","005_28_5","NUM","28","5","5","along with a tenth of an ephah of fine flour as a grain offering, mixed with a quarter hin of oil from pressed olives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_6","005_28_6","NUM","28","6","6","This is a regular burnt offering established at Mount Sinai as a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_7","005_28_7","NUM","28","7","7","The drink offering accompanying each lamb shall be a quarter hin. Pour out the offering of fermented drink to the LORD in the sanctuary area. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_8","005_28_8","NUM","28","8","8","And offer the second lamb at twilight, with the same grain offering and drink offering as in the morning. It is a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_9","005_28_9","NUM","28","9","9","On the Sabbath day, present two unblemished year-old male lambs, accompanied by a grain offering of two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil, as well as a drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_10","005_28_10","NUM","28","10","10","This is the burnt offering for every Sabbath, in addition to the regular burnt offering and its drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_11","005_28_11","NUM","28","11","11","At the beginning of every month, you are to present to the LORD a burnt offering of two young bulls, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_12","005_28_12","NUM","28","12","12","along with three-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering with each bull, two-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering with the ram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_13","005_28_13","NUM","28","13","13","and a tenth of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering with each lamb. This is a burnt offering, a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_14","005_28_14","NUM","28","14","14","Their drink offerings shall be half a hin of wine with each bull, a third of a hin with the ram, and a quarter hin with each lamb. This is the monthly burnt offering to be made at each new moon throughout the year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_15","005_28_15","NUM","28","15","15","In addition to the regular burnt offering with its drink offering, one male goat is to be presented to the LORD as a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_16","005_28_16","NUM","28","16","16","The fourteenth day of the first month is the LORD’s Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_17","005_28_17","NUM","28","17","17","On the fifteenth day of this month, there shall be a feast; for seven days unleavened bread is to be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_18","005_28_18","NUM","28","18","18","On the first day there is to be a sacred assembly; you must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_19","005_28_19","NUM","28","19","19","Present to the LORD a food offering, a burnt offering of two young bulls, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old, all unblemished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_20","005_28_20","NUM","28","20","20","The grain offering shall consist of fine flour mixed with oil; offer three-tenths of an ephah with each bull, two-tenths of an ephah with the ram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_21","005_28_21","NUM","28","21","21","and a tenth of an ephah with each of the seven lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_22","005_28_22","NUM","28","22","22","Include one male goat as a sin offering to make atonement for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_23","005_28_23","NUM","28","23","23","You are to present these in addition to the regular morning burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_24","005_28_24","NUM","28","24","24","Offer the same food each day for seven days as a food offering, a pleasing aroma to the LORD. It is to be offered with its drink offering and the regular burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_25","005_28_25","NUM","28","25","25","On the seventh day you shall hold a sacred assembly; you must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_26","005_28_26","NUM","28","26","26","On the day of firstfruits, when you present an offering of new grain to the LORD during the Feast of Weeks, you are to hold a sacred assembly; you must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_27","005_28_27","NUM","28","27","27","Present a burnt offering of two young bulls, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old as a pleasing aroma to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_28","005_28_28","NUM","28","28","28","together with their grain offerings of fine flour mixed with oil—three-tenths of an ephah with each bull, two-tenths of an ephah with the ram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_29","005_28_29","NUM","28","29","29","and a tenth of an ephah with each of the seven lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_30","005_28_30","NUM","28","30","30","Include one male goat to make atonement for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU28_31","005_28_31","NUM","28","31","31","Offer them with their drink offerings in addition to the regular burnt offering and its grain offering. The animals must be unblemished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_1","005_29_1","NUM","29","1","1","“On the first day of the seventh month, you are to hold a sacred assembly, and you must not do any regular work. This will be a day for you to sound the trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_2","005_29_2","NUM","29","2","2","As a pleasing aroma to the LORD, you are to present a burnt offering of one young bull, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_3","005_29_3","NUM","29","3","3","together with their grain offerings of fine flour mixed with oil—three-tenths of an ephah with the bull, two-tenths of an ephah with the ram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_4","005_29_4","NUM","29","4","4","and a tenth of an ephah with each of the seven male lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_5","005_29_5","NUM","29","5","5","Include one male goat as a sin offering to make atonement for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_6","005_29_6","NUM","29","6","6","These are in addition to the monthly and daily burnt offerings with their prescribed grain offerings and drink offerings. They are a pleasing aroma, a food offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_7","005_29_7","NUM","29","7","7","On the tenth day of this seventh month, you are to hold a sacred assembly, and you shall humble yourselves; you must not do any work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_8","005_29_8","NUM","29","8","8","Present as a pleasing aroma to the LORD a burnt offering of one young bull, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_9","005_29_9","NUM","29","9","9","together with their grain offerings of fine flour mixed with oil—three-tenths of an ephah with the bull, two-tenths of an ephah with the ram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_10","005_29_10","NUM","29","10","10","and a tenth of an ephah with each of the seven lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_11","005_29_11","NUM","29","11","11","Include one male goat for a sin offering, in addition to the sin offering of atonement and the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_12","005_29_12","NUM","29","12","12","On the fifteenth day of the seventh month, you are to hold a sacred assembly; you must not do any regular work, and you shall observe a feast to the LORD for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_13","005_29_13","NUM","29","13","13","As a pleasing aroma to the LORD, you are to present a food offering, a burnt offering of thirteen young bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_14","005_29_14","NUM","29","14","14","along with the grain offering of three-tenths of an ephah of fine flour mixed with oil with each of the thirteen bulls, two-tenths of an ephah with each of the two rams, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_15","005_29_15","NUM","29","15","15","and a tenth of an ephah with each of the fourteen lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_16","005_29_16","NUM","29","16","16","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_17","005_29_17","NUM","29","17","17","On the second day you are to present twelve young bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_18","005_29_18","NUM","29","18","18","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_19","005_29_19","NUM","29","19","19","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_20","005_29_20","NUM","29","20","20","On the third day you are to present eleven bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_21","005_29_21","NUM","29","21","21","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_22","005_29_22","NUM","29","22","22","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_23","005_29_23","NUM","29","23","23","On the fourth day you are to present ten bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_24","005_29_24","NUM","29","24","24","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_25","005_29_25","NUM","29","25","25","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_26","005_29_26","NUM","29","26","26","On the fifth day you are to present nine bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_27","005_29_27","NUM","29","27","27","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_28","005_29_28","NUM","29","28","28","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_29","005_29_29","NUM","29","29","29","On the sixth day you are to present eight bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_30","005_29_30","NUM","29","30","30","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_31","005_29_31","NUM","29","31","31","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_32","005_29_32","NUM","29","32","32","On the seventh day you are to present seven bulls, two rams, and fourteen male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_33","005_29_33","NUM","29","33","33","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_34","005_29_34","NUM","29","34","34","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_35","005_29_35","NUM","29","35","35","On the eighth day you are to hold a solemn assembly; you must not do any regular work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_36","005_29_36","NUM","29","36","36","As a pleasing aroma to the LORD, you are to present a food offering, a burnt offering of one bull, one ram, and seven male lambs a year old, all unblemished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_37","005_29_37","NUM","29","37","37","along with the grain and drink offerings for the bulls, rams, and lambs, according to the number prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_38","005_29_38","NUM","29","38","38","Include one male goat as a sin offering, in addition to the regular burnt offering with its grain offering and drink offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_39","005_29_39","NUM","29","39","39","You are to present these offerings to the LORD at your appointed times, in addition to your vow and freewill offerings, whether burnt offerings, grain offerings, drink offerings, or peace offerings.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU29_40","005_29_40","NUM","29","40","40","So Moses spoke all this to the Israelites just as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_1","005_30_1","NUM","30","1","1","Then Moses said to the heads of the tribes of Israel, “This is what the LORD has commanded: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_2","005_30_2","NUM","30","2","2","If a man makes a vow to the LORD or swears an oath to obligate himself by a pledge, he must not break his word; he must do everything he has promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_3","005_30_3","NUM","30","3","3","And if a woman in her father’s house during her youth makes a vow to the LORD or obligates herself by a pledge, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_4","005_30_4","NUM","30","4","4","and her father hears about her vow or pledge but says nothing to her, then all the vows or pledges by which she has bound herself shall stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_5","005_30_5","NUM","30","5","5","But if her father prohibits her on the day he hears about it, then none of the vows or pledges by which she has bound herself shall stand. The LORD will absolve her because her father has prohibited her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_6","005_30_6","NUM","30","6","6","If a woman marries while under a vow or rash promise by which she has bound herself, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_7","005_30_7","NUM","30","7","7","and her husband hears of it but says nothing to her on that day, then the vows or pledges by which she has bound herself shall stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_8","005_30_8","NUM","30","8","8","But if her husband prohibits her when he hears of it, he nullifies the vow that binds her or the rash promise she has made, and the LORD will absolve her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_9","005_30_9","NUM","30","9","9","Every vow a widow or divorced woman pledges to fulfill is binding on her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_10","005_30_10","NUM","30","10","10","If a woman in her husband’s house has made a vow or put herself under an obligation with an oath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_11","005_30_11","NUM","30","11","11","and her husband hears of it but says nothing to her and does not prohibit her, then all the vows or pledges by which she has bound herself shall stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_12","005_30_12","NUM","30","12","12","But if her husband nullifies them on the day he hears of them, then nothing that came from her lips, whether her vows or pledges, shall stand. Her husband has nullified them, and the LORD will absolve her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_13","005_30_13","NUM","30","13","13","Her husband may confirm or nullify any vow or any sworn pledge to deny herself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_14","005_30_14","NUM","30","14","14","But if her husband says nothing to her from day to day, then he confirms all the vows and pledges that bind her. He has confirmed them, because he said nothing to her on the day he heard about them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_15","005_30_15","NUM","30","15","15","But if he nullifies them after he hears of them, then he will bear her iniquity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU30_16","005_30_16","NUM","30","16","16","These are the statutes that the LORD commanded Moses concerning the relationship between a man and his wife, and between a father and a young daughter still in his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_1","005_31_1","NUM","31","1","1","And the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_2","005_31_2","NUM","31","2","2","“Take vengeance on the Midianites for the Israelites. After that, you will be gathered to your people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_3","005_31_3","NUM","31","3","3","So Moses told the people, “Arm some of your men for war, that they may go against the Midianites and execute the LORD’s vengeance on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_4","005_31_4","NUM","31","4","4","Send into battle a thousand men from each tribe of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_5","005_31_5","NUM","31","5","5","So a thousand men were recruited from each tribe of Israel—twelve thousand armed for war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_6","005_31_6","NUM","31","6","6","And Moses sent the thousand from each tribe into battle, along with Phinehas son of Eleazar the priest, who took with him the vessels of the sanctuary and the trumpets for signaling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_7","005_31_7","NUM","31","7","7","Then they waged war against Midian, as the LORD had commanded Moses, and they killed every male. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_8","005_31_8","NUM","31","8","8","Among the slain were Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, and Reba—the five kings of Midian. They also killed Balaam son of Beor with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_9","005_31_9","NUM","31","9","9","The Israelites captured the Midianite women and their children, and they plundered all their herds, flocks, and goods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_10","005_31_10","NUM","31","10","10","Then they burned all the cities where the Midianites had lived, as well as all their encampments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_11","005_31_11","NUM","31","11","11","and carried away all the plunder and spoils, both people and animals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_12","005_31_12","NUM","31","12","12","They brought the captives, spoils, and plunder to Moses, to Eleazar the priest, and to the congregation of Israel at the camp on the plains of Moab, by the Jordan across from Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_13","005_31_13","NUM","31","13","13","And Moses, Eleazar the priest, and all the leaders of the congregation went to meet them outside the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_14","005_31_14","NUM","31","14","14","But Moses was angry with the officers of the army—the commanders of thousands and commanders of hundreds—who were returning from the battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_15","005_31_15","NUM","31","15","15","“Have you spared all the women?” he asked them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_16","005_31_16","NUM","31","16","16","“Look, these women caused the sons of Israel, through the counsel of Balaam, to turn unfaithfully against the LORD at Peor, so that the plague struck the congregation of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_17","005_31_17","NUM","31","17","17","So now, kill all the boys, as well as every woman who has had relations with a man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_18","005_31_18","NUM","31","18","18","but spare for yourselves every girl who has never had relations with a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_19","005_31_19","NUM","31","19","19","All of you who have killed a person or touched the dead are to remain outside the camp for seven days. On the third day and the seventh day you are to purify both yourselves and your captives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_20","005_31_20","NUM","31","20","20","And purify every garment and leather good, everything made of goat’s hair, and every article of wood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_21","005_31_21","NUM","31","21","21","Then Eleazar the priest said to the soldiers who had gone into battle, “This is the statute of the law which the LORD has commanded Moses: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_22","005_31_22","NUM","31","22","22","Only the gold, silver, bronze, iron, tin, and lead— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_23","005_31_23","NUM","31","23","23","everything that can withstand the fire—must be put through the fire, and it will be clean. But it must still be purified with the water of purification. And everything that cannot withstand the fire must pass through the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_24","005_31_24","NUM","31","24","24","On the seventh day you are to wash your clothes, and you will be clean. After that you may enter the camp.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_25","005_31_25","NUM","31","25","25","The LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_26","005_31_26","NUM","31","26","26","“You and Eleazar the priest and the family heads of the congregation are to take a count of what was captured, both of man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_27","005_31_27","NUM","31","27","27","Then divide the captives between the troops who went out to battle and the rest of the congregation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_28","005_31_28","NUM","31","28","28","Set aside a tribute for the LORD from what belongs to the soldiers who went into battle: one out of every five hundred, whether persons, cattle, donkeys, or sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_29","005_31_29","NUM","31","29","29","Take it from their half and give it to Eleazar the priest as an offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_30","005_31_30","NUM","31","30","30","From the Israelites’ half, take one out of every fifty, whether persons, cattle, donkeys, sheep, or other animals, and give them to the Levites who keep charge of the tabernacle of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_31","005_31_31","NUM","31","31","31","So Moses and Eleazar the priest did as the LORD had commanded Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_32","005_31_32","NUM","31","32","32","and this plunder remained from the spoils the soldiers had taken: 675,000 sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_33","005_31_33","NUM","31","33","33","72,000 cattle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_34","005_31_34","NUM","31","34","34","61,000 donkeys, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_35","005_31_35","NUM","31","35","35","and 32,000 women who had not slept with a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_36","005_31_36","NUM","31","36","36","This was the half portion for those who had gone to war: 337,500 sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_37","005_31_37","NUM","31","37","37","including a tribute to the LORD of 675, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_38","005_31_38","NUM","31","38","38","36,000 cattle, including a tribute to the LORD of 72, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_39","005_31_39","NUM","31","39","39","30,500 donkeys, including a tribute to the LORD of 61, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_40","005_31_40","NUM","31","40","40","and 16,000 people, including a tribute to the LORD of 32. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_41","005_31_41","NUM","31","41","41","Moses gave the tribute to Eleazar the priest as an offering for the LORD, as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_42","005_31_42","NUM","31","42","42","From the Israelites’ half, which Moses had set apart from the men who had gone to war, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_43","005_31_43","NUM","31","43","43","this half belonged to the congregation: 337,500 sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_44","005_31_44","NUM","31","44","44","36,000 cattle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_45","005_31_45","NUM","31","45","45","30,500 donkeys, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_46","005_31_46","NUM","31","46","46","and 16,000 people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_47","005_31_47","NUM","31","47","47","From the Israelites’ half, Moses took one out of every fifty persons and animals and gave them to the Levites who kept charge of the tabernacle of the LORD, as the LORD had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_48","005_31_48","NUM","31","48","48","Then the officers who were over the units of the army—the commanders of thousands and of hundreds—approached Moses ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_49","005_31_49","NUM","31","49","49","and said, “Your servants have counted the soldiers under our command, and not one of us is missing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_50","005_31_50","NUM","31","50","50","So we have brought to the LORD an offering of the gold articles each man acquired—armlets, bracelets, rings, earrings, and necklaces—to make atonement for ourselves before the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_51","005_31_51","NUM","31","51","51","So Moses and Eleazar the priest received from them all the articles made out of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_52","005_31_52","NUM","31","52","52","All the gold that the commanders of thousands and of hundreds presented as an offering to the LORD weighed 16,750 shekels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_53","005_31_53","NUM","31","53","53","Each of the soldiers had taken plunder for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU31_54","005_31_54","NUM","31","54","54","And Moses and Eleazar the priest received the gold from the commanders of thousands and of hundreds and brought it into the Tent of Meeting as a memorial for the Israelites before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_1","005_32_1","NUM","32","1","1","Now the Reubenites and Gadites, who had very large herds and flocks, surveyed the lands of Jazer and Gilead, and they saw that the region was suitable for livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_2","005_32_2","NUM","32","2","2","So the Gadites and Reubenites came to Moses, Eleazar the priest, and the leaders of the congregation, and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_3","005_32_3","NUM","32","3","3","“Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sebam, Nebo, and Beon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_4","005_32_4","NUM","32","4","4","which the LORD conquered before the congregation of Israel, are suitable for livestock—and your servants have livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_5","005_32_5","NUM","32","5","5","“If we have found favor in your sight,” they said, “let this land be given to your servants as a possession. Do not make us cross the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_6","005_32_6","NUM","32","6","6","But Moses asked the Gadites and Reubenites, “Shall your brothers go to war while you sit here? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_7","005_32_7","NUM","32","7","7","Why are you discouraging the Israelites from crossing into the land that the LORD has given them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_8","005_32_8","NUM","32","8","8","This is what your fathers did when I sent them from Kadesh-barnea to inspect the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_9","005_32_9","NUM","32","9","9","For when your fathers went up to the Valley of Eshcol and saw the land, they discouraged the Israelites from entering the land that the LORD had given them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_10","005_32_10","NUM","32","10","10","So the anger of the LORD was kindled that day, and He swore an oath, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_11","005_32_11","NUM","32","11","11","‘Because they did not follow Me wholeheartedly, not one of the men twenty years of age or older who came out of Egypt will see the land that I swore to give Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_12","005_32_12","NUM","32","12","12","not one except Caleb son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite and Joshua son of Nun—because they did follow the LORD wholeheartedly.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_13","005_32_13","NUM","32","13","13","The anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He made them wander in the wilderness forty years, until the whole generation who had done evil in His sight was gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_14","005_32_14","NUM","32","14","14","Now behold, you, a brood of sinners, have risen up in place of your fathers to further stoke the burning anger of the LORD against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_15","005_32_15","NUM","32","15","15","For if you turn away from following Him, He will once again leave this people in the wilderness, and you will be the cause of their destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_16","005_32_16","NUM","32","16","16","Then the Gadites and Reubenites approached Moses and said, “We want to build sheepfolds here for our livestock and cities for our little ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_17","005_32_17","NUM","32","17","17","But we will arm ourselves and be ready to go ahead of the Israelites until we have brought them into their place. Meanwhile, our little ones will remain in the fortified cities for protection from the inhabitants of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_18","005_32_18","NUM","32","18","18","We will not return to our homes until every Israelite has taken possession of his inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_19","005_32_19","NUM","32","19","19","Yet we will not have an inheritance with them across the Jordan and beyond, because our inheritance has come to us on the east side of the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_20","005_32_20","NUM","32","20","20","Moses replied, “If you will do this—if you will arm yourselves before the LORD for battle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_21","005_32_21","NUM","32","21","21","and if every one of your armed men crosses the Jordan before the LORD, until He has driven His enemies out before Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_22","005_32_22","NUM","32","22","22","then when the land is subdued before the LORD, you may return and be free of obligation to the LORD and to Israel. And this land will belong to you as a possession before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_23","005_32_23","NUM","32","23","23","But if you do not do this, you will certainly sin against the LORD—and be assured that your sin will find you out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_24","005_32_24","NUM","32","24","24","Build cities for your little ones and folds for your flocks, but do what you have promised.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_25","005_32_25","NUM","32","25","25","The Gadites and Reubenites said to Moses, “Your servants will do just as our lord commands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_26","005_32_26","NUM","32","26","26","Our children, our wives, our livestock, and all our animals will remain here in the cities of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_27","005_32_27","NUM","32","27","27","But your servants are equipped for war, and every man will cross over to the battle before the LORD, just as our lord says.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_28","005_32_28","NUM","32","28","28","So Moses gave orders about them to Eleazar the priest, to Joshua son of Nun, and to the family leaders of the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_29","005_32_29","NUM","32","29","29","And Moses said to them, “If the Gadites and Reubenites cross the Jordan with you, with every man armed for battle before the LORD, and the land is subdued before you, then you are to give them the land of Gilead as a possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_30","005_32_30","NUM","32","30","30","But if they do not arm themselves and go across with you, then they must accept their possession among you in the land of Canaan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_31","005_32_31","NUM","32","31","31","The Gadites and Reubenites replied, “As the LORD has spoken to your servants, so we will do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_32","005_32_32","NUM","32","32","32","We will cross over into the land of Canaan armed before the LORD, that we may have our inheritance on this side of the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_33","005_32_33","NUM","32","33","33","So Moses gave to the Gadites, to the Reubenites, and to the half-tribe of Manasseh son of Joseph the kingdom of Sihon king of the Amorites and the kingdom of Og king of Bashan—the land including its cities and the territory surrounding them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_34","005_32_34","NUM","32","34","34","And the Gadites built up Dibon, Ataroth, Aroer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_35","005_32_35","NUM","32","35","35","Atroth-shophan, Jazer, Jogbehah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_36","005_32_36","NUM","32","36","36","Beth-nimrah, and Beth-haran as fortified cities, and they built folds for their flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_37","005_32_37","NUM","32","37","37","The Reubenites built up Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_38","005_32_38","NUM","32","38","38","as well as Nebo and Baal-meon (whose names were changed), and Sibmah. And they renamed the cities they rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_39","005_32_39","NUM","32","39","39","The descendants of Machir son of Manasseh went to Gilead, captured it, and drove out the Amorites who were there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_40","005_32_40","NUM","32","40","40","So Moses gave Gilead to the clan of Machir son of Manasseh, and they settled there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_41","005_32_41","NUM","32","41","41","Jair, a descendant of Manasseh, went and captured their villages and called them Havvoth-jair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU32_42","005_32_42","NUM","32","42","42","And Nobah went and captured Kenath and its villages and called it Nobah, after his own name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_1","005_33_1","NUM","33","1","1","These are the journeys of the Israelites when they came out of the land of Egypt by their divisions under the leadership of Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_2","005_33_2","NUM","33","2","2","At the LORD’s command, Moses recorded the stages of their journey. These are the stages listed by their starting points: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_3","005_33_3","NUM","33","3","3","On the fifteenth day of the first month, on the day after the Passover, the Israelites set out from Rameses. They marched out defiantly in full view of all the Egyptians, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_4","005_33_4","NUM","33","4","4","who were burying all their firstborn, whom the LORD had struck down among them; for the LORD had executed judgment against their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_5","005_33_5","NUM","33","5","5","The Israelites set out from Rameses and camped at Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_6","005_33_6","NUM","33","6","6","They set out from Succoth and camped at Etham, on the edge of the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_7","005_33_7","NUM","33","7","7","They set out from Etham and turned back to Pi-hahiroth, opposite Baal-zephon, and they camped near Migdol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_8","005_33_8","NUM","33","8","8","They set out from Pi-hahiroth and crossed through the sea, into the wilderness, and they journeyed three days into the Wilderness of Etham and camped at Marah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_9","005_33_9","NUM","33","9","9","They set out from Marah and came to Elim, where there were twelve springs and seventy palm trees, and they camped there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_10","005_33_10","NUM","33","10","10","They set out from Elim and camped by the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_11","005_33_11","NUM","33","11","11","They set out from the Red Sea and camped in the Desert of Sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_12","005_33_12","NUM","33","12","12","They set out from the Desert of Sin and camped at Dophkah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_13","005_33_13","NUM","33","13","13","They set out from Dophkah and camped at Alush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_14","005_33_14","NUM","33","14","14","They set out from Alush and camped at Rephidim, where there was no water for the people to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_15","005_33_15","NUM","33","15","15","They set out from Rephidim and camped in the Wilderness of Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_16","005_33_16","NUM","33","16","16","They set out from the Wilderness of Sinai and camped at Kibroth-hattaavah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_17","005_33_17","NUM","33","17","17","They set out from Kibroth-hattaavah and camped at Hazeroth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_18","005_33_18","NUM","33","18","18","They set out from Hazeroth and camped at Rithmah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_19","005_33_19","NUM","33","19","19","They set out from Rithmah and camped at Rimmon-perez. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_20","005_33_20","NUM","33","20","20","They set out from Rimmon-perez and camped at Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_21","005_33_21","NUM","33","21","21","They set out from Libnah and camped at Rissah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_22","005_33_22","NUM","33","22","22","They set out from Rissah and camped at Kehelathah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_23","005_33_23","NUM","33","23","23","They set out from Kehelathah and camped at Mount Shepher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_24","005_33_24","NUM","33","24","24","They set out from Mount Shepher and camped at Haradah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_25","005_33_25","NUM","33","25","25","They set out from Haradah and camped at Makheloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_26","005_33_26","NUM","33","26","26","They set out from Makheloth and camped at Tahath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_27","005_33_27","NUM","33","27","27","They set out from Tahath and camped at Terah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_28","005_33_28","NUM","33","28","28","They set out from Terah and camped at Mithkah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_29","005_33_29","NUM","33","29","29","They set out from Mithkah and camped at Hashmonah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_30","005_33_30","NUM","33","30","30","They set out from Hashmonah and camped at Moseroth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_31","005_33_31","NUM","33","31","31","They set out from Moseroth and camped at Bene-jaakan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_32","005_33_32","NUM","33","32","32","They set out from Bene-jaakan and camped at Hor-haggidgad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_33","005_33_33","NUM","33","33","33","They set out from Hor-haggidgad and camped at Jotbathah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_34","005_33_34","NUM","33","34","34","They set out from Jotbathah and camped at Abronah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_35","005_33_35","NUM","33","35","35","They set out from Abronah and camped at Ezion-geber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_36","005_33_36","NUM","33","36","36","They set out from Ezion-geber and camped at Kadesh in the Wilderness of Zin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_37","005_33_37","NUM","33","37","37","They set out from Kadesh and camped at Mount Hor, on the outskirts of the land of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_38","005_33_38","NUM","33","38","38","At the LORD’s command, Aaron the priest climbed Mount Hor and died there on the first day of the fifth month, in the fortieth year after the Israelites had come out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_39","005_33_39","NUM","33","39","39","Aaron was 123 years old when he died on Mount Hor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_40","005_33_40","NUM","33","40","40","Now the Canaanite king of Arad, who lived in the Negev in the land of Canaan, heard that the Israelites were coming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_41","005_33_41","NUM","33","41","41","And the Israelites set out from Mount Hor and camped at Zalmonah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_42","005_33_42","NUM","33","42","42","They set out from Zalmonah and camped at Punon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_43","005_33_43","NUM","33","43","43","They set out from Punon and camped at Oboth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_44","005_33_44","NUM","33","44","44","They set out from Oboth and camped at Iye-abarim on the border of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_45","005_33_45","NUM","33","45","45","They set out from Iyim and camped at Dibon-gad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_46","005_33_46","NUM","33","46","46","They set out from Dibon-gad and camped at Almon-diblathaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_47","005_33_47","NUM","33","47","47","They set out from Almon-diblathaim and camped in the mountains of Abarim facing Nebo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_48","005_33_48","NUM","33","48","48","They set out from the mountains of Abarim and camped on the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_49","005_33_49","NUM","33","49","49","And there on the plains of Moab they camped by the Jordan, from Beth-jeshimoth to Abel-shittim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_50","005_33_50","NUM","33","50","50","On the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho, the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_51","005_33_51","NUM","33","51","51","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: When you cross the Jordan into the land of Canaan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_52","005_33_52","NUM","33","52","52","you must drive out before you all the inhabitants of the land, destroy all their carved images and cast idols, and demolish all their high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_53","005_33_53","NUM","33","53","53","You are to take possession of the land and settle in it, for I have given you the land to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_54","005_33_54","NUM","33","54","54","And you are to divide the land by lot according to your clans. Give a larger inheritance to a larger clan and a smaller inheritance to a smaller one. Whatever falls to each one by lot will be his. You will receive an inheritance according to the tribes of your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_55","005_33_55","NUM","33","55","55","But if you do not drive out the inhabitants of the land before you, those you allow to remain will become barbs in your eyes and thorns in your sides; they will harass you in the land where you settle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU33_56","005_33_56","NUM","33","56","56","And then I will do to you what I had planned to do to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_1","005_34_1","NUM","34","1","1","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_2","005_34_2","NUM","34","2","2","“Command the Israelites and say to them: When you enter the land of Canaan, it will be allotted to you as an inheritance with these boundaries: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_3","005_34_3","NUM","34","3","3","Your southern border will extend from the Wilderness of Zin along the border of Edom. On the east, your southern border will run from the end of the Salt Sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_4","005_34_4","NUM","34","4","4","cross south of the Ascent of Akrabbim, continue to Zin, and go south of Kadesh-barnea. Then it will go on to Hazar-addar and proceed to Azmon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_5","005_34_5","NUM","34","5","5","where it will turn from Azmon, join the Brook of Egypt, and end at the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_6","005_34_6","NUM","34","6","6","Your western border will be the coastline of the Great Sea; this will be your boundary on the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_7","005_34_7","NUM","34","7","7","Your northern border will run from the Great Sea directly to Mount Hor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_8","005_34_8","NUM","34","8","8","and from Mount Hor to Lebo-hamath, then extend to Zedad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_9","005_34_9","NUM","34","9","9","continue to Ziphron, and end at Hazar-enan. This will be your boundary on the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_10","005_34_10","NUM","34","10","10","And your eastern border will run straight from Hazar-enan to Shepham, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_11","005_34_11","NUM","34","11","11","then go down from Shepham to Riblah on the east side of Ain and continue along the slopes east of the Sea of Chinnereth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_12","005_34_12","NUM","34","12","12","Then the border will go down along the Jordan and end at the Salt Sea. This will be your land, defined by its borders on all sides.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_13","005_34_13","NUM","34","13","13","So Moses commanded the Israelites, “Apportion this land by lot as an inheritance. The LORD has commanded that it be given to the nine and a half tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_14","005_34_14","NUM","34","14","14","For the tribes of the Reubenites and Gadites, along with the half-tribe of Manasseh, have already received their inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_15","005_34_15","NUM","34","15","15","These two and a half tribes have received their inheritance across the Jordan from Jericho, toward the sunrise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_16","005_34_16","NUM","34","16","16","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_17","005_34_17","NUM","34","17","17","“These are the names of the men who are to assign the land as an inheritance for you: Eleazar the priest and Joshua son of Nun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_18","005_34_18","NUM","34","18","18","Appoint one leader from each tribe to distribute the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_19","005_34_19","NUM","34","19","19","These are their names: Caleb son of Jephunneh from the tribe of Judah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_20","005_34_20","NUM","34","20","20","Shemuel son of Ammihud from the tribe of Simeon; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_21","005_34_21","NUM","34","21","21","Elidad son of Chislon from the tribe of Benjamin; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_22","005_34_22","NUM","34","22","22","Bukki son of Jogli, a leader from the tribe of Dan; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_23","005_34_23","NUM","34","23","23","Hanniel son of Ephod, a leader from the tribe of Manasseh son of Joseph; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_24","005_34_24","NUM","34","24","24","Kemuel son of Shiphtan, a leader from the tribe of Ephraim; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_25","005_34_25","NUM","34","25","25","Eli-zaphan son of Parnach, a leader from the tribe of Zebulun; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_26","005_34_26","NUM","34","26","26","Paltiel son of Azzan, a leader from the tribe of Issachar; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_27","005_34_27","NUM","34","27","27","Ahihud son of Shelomi, a leader from the tribe of Asher; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_28","005_34_28","NUM","34","28","28","and Pedahel son of Ammihud, a leader from the tribe of Naphtali.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU34_29","005_34_29","NUM","34","29","29","These are the ones whom the LORD commanded to apportion the inheritance to the Israelites in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_1","005_35_1","NUM","35","1","1","Again the LORD spoke to Moses on the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_2","005_35_2","NUM","35","2","2","“Command the Israelites to give, from the inheritance they will possess, cities for the Levites to live in and pasturelands around the cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_3","005_35_3","NUM","35","3","3","The cities will be for them to live in, and the pasturelands will be for their herds, their flocks, and all their other livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_4","005_35_4","NUM","35","4","4","The pasturelands around the cities you are to give the Levites will extend a thousand cubits from the wall on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_5","005_35_5","NUM","35","5","5","You are also to measure two thousand cubits outside the city on the east, two thousand on the south, two thousand on the west, and two thousand on the north, with the city in the center. These areas will serve as larger pasturelands for the cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_6","005_35_6","NUM","35","6","6","Six of the cities you give the Levites are to be appointed as cities of refuge, to which a manslayer may flee. In addition to these, give the Levites forty-two other cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_7","005_35_7","NUM","35","7","7","The total number of cities you give the Levites will be forty-eight, with their corresponding pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_8","005_35_8","NUM","35","8","8","The cities that you apportion from the territory of the Israelites should be given to the Levites in proportion to the inheritance of each tribe: more from a larger tribe and less from a smaller one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_9","005_35_9","NUM","35","9","9","Then the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_10","005_35_10","NUM","35","10","10","“Speak to the Israelites and tell them: When you cross the Jordan into the land of Canaan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_11","005_35_11","NUM","35","11","11","designate cities to serve as your cities of refuge, so that a person who kills someone unintentionally may flee there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_12","005_35_12","NUM","35","12","12","You are to have these cities as a refuge from the avenger, so that the manslayer will not die until he stands trial before the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_13","005_35_13","NUM","35","13","13","The cities you select will be your six cities of refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_14","005_35_14","NUM","35","14","14","Select three cities across the Jordan and three in the land of Canaan as cities of refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_15","005_35_15","NUM","35","15","15","These six cities will serve as a refuge for the Israelites and for the foreigner or stranger among them, so that anyone who kills a person unintentionally may flee there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_16","005_35_16","NUM","35","16","16","If, however, anyone strikes a person with an iron object and kills him, he is a murderer; the murderer must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_17","005_35_17","NUM","35","17","17","Or if anyone has in his hand a stone of deadly size, and he strikes and kills another, he is a murderer; the murderer must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_18","005_35_18","NUM","35","18","18","If anyone has in his hand a deadly object of wood, and he strikes and kills another, he is a murderer; the murderer must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_19","005_35_19","NUM","35","19","19","The avenger of blood is to put the murderer to death; when he finds him, he is to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_20","005_35_20","NUM","35","20","20","Likewise, if anyone maliciously pushes another or intentionally throws an object at him and kills him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_21","005_35_21","NUM","35","21","21","or if in hostility he strikes him with his hand and he dies, the one who struck him must surely be put to death; he is a murderer. When the avenger of blood finds the murderer, he is to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_22","005_35_22","NUM","35","22","22","But if anyone pushes a person suddenly, without hostility, or throws an object at him unintentionally, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_23","005_35_23","NUM","35","23","23","or without looking drops a heavy stone that kills him, but he was not an enemy and did not intend to harm him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_24","005_35_24","NUM","35","24","24","then the congregation must judge between the slayer and the avenger of blood according to these ordinances. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_25","005_35_25","NUM","35","25","25","The assembly is to protect the manslayer from the hand of the avenger of blood. Then the assembly will return him to the city of refuge to which he fled, and he must live there until the death of the high priest, who was anointed with the holy oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_26","005_35_26","NUM","35","26","26","But if the manslayer ever goes outside the limits of the city of refuge to which he fled ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_27","005_35_27","NUM","35","27","27","and the avenger of blood finds him outside of his city of refuge and kills him, then the avenger will not be guilty of bloodshed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_28","005_35_28","NUM","35","28","28","because the manslayer must remain in his city of refuge until the death of the high priest. Only after the death of the high priest may he return to the land he owns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_29","005_35_29","NUM","35","29","29","This will be a statutory ordinance for you for the generations to come, wherever you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_30","005_35_30","NUM","35","30","30","If anyone kills a person, the murderer is to be put to death on the testimony of the witnesses. But no one is to be put to death based on the testimony of a lone witness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_31","005_35_31","NUM","35","31","31","You are not to accept a ransom for the life of a murderer who deserves to die; he must surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_32","005_35_32","NUM","35","32","32","Nor should you accept a ransom for the person who flees to a city of refuge and allow him to return and live on his own land before the death of the high priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_33","005_35_33","NUM","35","33","33","Do not pollute the land where you live, for bloodshed pollutes the land, and no atonement can be made for the land on which the blood is shed, except by the blood of the one who shed it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU35_34","005_35_34","NUM","35","34","34","Do not defile the land where you live and where I dwell. For I, the LORD, dwell among the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_1","005_36_1","NUM","36","1","1","Now the family heads of the clan of Gilead son of Machir son of Manasseh, one of the clans of Joseph, approached Moses and the leaders who were the heads of the Israelite families and addressed them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_2","005_36_2","NUM","36","2","2","saying, “When the LORD commanded my lord to give the land as an inheritance to the Israelites by lot, He also commanded him to give the inheritance of our brother Zelophehad to his daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_3","005_36_3","NUM","36","3","3","But if they marry any of the men from the other tribes of Israel, their inheritance will be withdrawn from the portion of our fathers and added to the tribe into which they marry. So our allotted inheritance would be taken away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_4","005_36_4","NUM","36","4","4","And when the Jubilee for the Israelites comes, their inheritance will be added to the tribe into which they marry and taken away from the tribe of our fathers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_5","005_36_5","NUM","36","5","5","So at the word of the LORD, Moses commanded the Israelites: “The tribe of the sons of Joseph speaks correctly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_6","005_36_6","NUM","36","6","6","This is what the LORD has commanded concerning the daughters of Zelophehad: They may marry anyone they please, provided they marry within a clan of the tribe of their father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_7","005_36_7","NUM","36","7","7","No inheritance in Israel may be transferred from tribe to tribe, because each of the Israelites is to retain the inheritance of the tribe of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_8","005_36_8","NUM","36","8","8","Every daughter who possesses an inheritance from any Israelite tribe must marry within a clan of the tribe of her father, so that every Israelite will possess the inheritance of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_9","005_36_9","NUM","36","9","9","No inheritance may be transferred from one tribe to another, for each tribe of Israel must retain its inheritance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_10","005_36_10","NUM","36","10","10","So the daughters of Zelophehad did as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_11","005_36_11","NUM","36","11","11","Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Noah, the daughters of Zelophehad, were married to cousins on their father’s side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_12","005_36_12","NUM","36","12","12","They married within the clans of the descendants of Manasseh son of Joseph, and their inheritance remained within the tribe of their father’s clan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NU36_13","005_36_13","NUM","36","13","13","These are the commandments and ordinances that the LORD gave the Israelites through Moses on the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_1","006_1_1","DEU","1","1","1","These are the words that Moses spoke to all Israel in the wilderness east of the Jordan—in the Arabah opposite Suph—between Paran and Tophel, Laban, Hazeroth, and Dizahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_2","006_1_2","DEU","1","2","2","It is an eleven-day journey from Horeb to Kadesh-barnea by way of Mount Seir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_3","006_1_3","DEU","1","3","3","In the fortieth year, on the first day of the eleventh month, Moses proclaimed to the Israelites all that the LORD had commanded him concerning them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_4","006_1_4","DEU","1","4","4","This was after he had defeated Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon, and then at Edrei had defeated Og king of Bashan, who lived in Ashtaroth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_5","006_1_5","DEU","1","5","5","On the east side of the Jordan in the land of Moab, Moses began to explain this law, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_6","006_1_6","DEU","1","6","6","The LORD our God said to us at Horeb: “You have stayed at this mountain long enough. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_7","006_1_7","DEU","1","7","7","Resume your journey and go to the hill country of the Amorites; go to all the neighboring peoples in the Arabah, in the hill country, in the foothills, in the Negev, and along the seacoast to the land of the Canaanites and to Lebanon, as far as the great River Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_8","006_1_8","DEU","1","8","8","See, I have placed the land before you. Enter and possess the land that the LORD swore He would give to your fathers Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, and to their descendants after them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_9","006_1_9","DEU","1","9","9","At that time I said to you, “I cannot carry the burden for you alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_10","006_1_10","DEU","1","10","10","The LORD your God has multiplied you, so that today you are as numerous as the stars in the sky. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_11","006_1_11","DEU","1","11","11","May the LORD, the God of your fathers, increase you a thousand times over and bless you as He has promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_12","006_1_12","DEU","1","12","12","But how can I bear your troubles, burdens, and disputes all by myself? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_13","006_1_13","DEU","1","13","13","Choose for yourselves wise, understanding, and respected men from each of your tribes, and I will appoint them as your leaders.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_14","006_1_14","DEU","1","14","14","And you answered me and said, “What you propose to do is good.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_15","006_1_15","DEU","1","15","15","So I took the leaders of your tribes, wise and respected men, and appointed them as leaders over you—as commanders of thousands, of hundreds, of fifties, and of tens, and as officers for your tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_16","006_1_16","DEU","1","16","16","At that time I charged your judges: “Hear the disputes between your brothers, and judge fairly between a man and his brother or a foreign resident. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_17","006_1_17","DEU","1","17","17","Show no partiality in judging; hear both small and great alike. Do not be intimidated by anyone, for judgment belongs to God. And bring to me any case too difficult for you, and I will hear it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_18","006_1_18","DEU","1","18","18","And at that time I commanded you all the things you were to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_19","006_1_19","DEU","1","19","19","And just as the LORD our God had commanded us, we set out from Horeb and went toward the hill country of the Amorites, through all the vast and terrifying wilderness you have seen. When we reached Kadesh-barnea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_20","006_1_20","DEU","1","20","20","I said: “You have reached the hill country of the Amorites, which the LORD our God is giving us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_21","006_1_21","DEU","1","21","21","See, the LORD your God has placed the land before you. Go up and take possession of it as the LORD, the God of your fathers, has told you. Do not be afraid or discouraged.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_22","006_1_22","DEU","1","22","22","Then all of you approached me and said, “Let us send men ahead of us to search out the land and bring us word of what route to follow and which cities to enter.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_23","006_1_23","DEU","1","23","23","The plan seemed good to me, so I selected twelve men from among you, one from each tribe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_24","006_1_24","DEU","1","24","24","They left and went up into the hill country, and came to the Valley of Eshcol and spied out the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_25","006_1_25","DEU","1","25","25","They took some of the fruit of the land in their hands, carried it down to us, and brought us word: “It is a good land that the LORD our God is giving us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_26","006_1_26","DEU","1","26","26","But you were unwilling to go up; you rebelled against the command of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_27","006_1_27","DEU","1","27","27","You grumbled in your tents and said, “Because the LORD hates us, He has brought us out of the land of Egypt to deliver us into the hand of the Amorites to be annihilated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_28","006_1_28","DEU","1","28","28","Where can we go? Our brothers have made our hearts melt, saying: ‘The people are larger and taller than we are; the cities are large, with walls up to the heavens. We even saw the descendants of the Anakim there.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_29","006_1_29","DEU","1","29","29","So I said to you: “Do not be terrified or afraid of them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_30","006_1_30","DEU","1","30","30","The LORD your God, who goes before you, will fight for you, just as you saw Him do for you in Egypt ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_31","006_1_31","DEU","1","31","31","and in the wilderness, where the LORD your God carried you, as a man carries his son, all the way by which you traveled until you reached this place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_32","006_1_32","DEU","1","32","32","But in spite of all this, you did not trust the LORD your God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_33","006_1_33","DEU","1","33","33","who went before you on the journey, in the fire by night and in the cloud by day, to seek out a place for you to camp and to show you the road to travel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_34","006_1_34","DEU","1","34","34","When the LORD heard your words, He grew angry and swore an oath, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_35","006_1_35","DEU","1","35","35","“Not one of the men of this evil generation shall see the good land I swore to give your fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_36","006_1_36","DEU","1","36","36","except Caleb son of Jephunneh. He will see it, and I will give him and his descendants the land on which he has set foot, because he followed the LORD wholeheartedly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_37","006_1_37","DEU","1","37","37","The LORD was also angry with me on your account, and He said, “Not even you shall enter the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_38","006_1_38","DEU","1","38","38","Joshua son of Nun, who stands before you, will enter it. Encourage him, for he will enable Israel to inherit the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_39","006_1_39","DEU","1","39","39","And the little ones you said would become captives—your children who on that day did not know good from evil—will enter the land that I will give them, and they will possess it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_40","006_1_40","DEU","1","40","40","But you are to turn back and head for the wilderness along the route to the Red Sea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_41","006_1_41","DEU","1","41","41","“We have sinned against the LORD,” you replied. “We will go up and fight, as the LORD our God has commanded us.” Then each of you put on his weapons of war, thinking it easy to go up into the hill country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_42","006_1_42","DEU","1","42","42","But the LORD said to me, “Tell them not to go up and fight, for I am not with you to keep you from defeat by your enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_43","006_1_43","DEU","1","43","43","So I spoke to you, but you would not listen. You rebelled against the command of the LORD and presumptuously went up into the hill country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_44","006_1_44","DEU","1","44","44","Then the Amorites who lived in the hills came out against you and chased you like a swarm of bees. They routed you from Seir all the way to Hormah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_45","006_1_45","DEU","1","45","45","And you returned and wept before the LORD, but He would not listen to your voice or give ear to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT1_46","006_1_46","DEU","1","46","46","For this reason you stayed in Kadesh for a long time—a very long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_1","006_2_1","DEU","2","1","1","Then we turned back and headed for the wilderness by way of the Red Sea, as the LORD had instructed me, and for many days we wandered around Mount Seir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_2","006_2_2","DEU","2","2","2","At this time the LORD said to me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_3","006_2_3","DEU","2","3","3","“You have been wandering around this hill country long enough; turn to the north ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_4","006_2_4","DEU","2","4","4","and command the people: ‘You will pass through the territory of your brothers, the descendants of Esau, who live in Seir. They will be afraid of you, so you must be very careful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_5","006_2_5","DEU","2","5","5","Do not provoke them, for I will not give you any of their land, not even a footprint, because I have given Mount Seir to Esau as his possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_6","006_2_6","DEU","2","6","6","You are to pay them in silver for the food you eat and the water you drink.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_7","006_2_7","DEU","2","7","7","Indeed, the LORD your God has blessed you in all the work of your hands. He has watched over your journey through this vast wilderness. The LORD your God has been with you these forty years, and you have lacked nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_8","006_2_8","DEU","2","8","8","So we passed by our brothers, the descendants of Esau, who live in Seir. We turned away from the Arabah road, which comes up from Elath and Ezion-geber, and traveled along the road of the Wilderness of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_9","006_2_9","DEU","2","9","9","Then the LORD said to me, “Do not harass the Moabites or provoke them to war, for I will not give you any of their land, because I have given Ar to the descendants of Lot as their possession.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_10","006_2_10","DEU","2","10","10","(The Emites used to live there, a people great and many, as tall as the Anakites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_11","006_2_11","DEU","2","11","11","Like the Anakites, they were also regarded as Rephaim, though the Moabites called them Emites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_12","006_2_12","DEU","2","12","12","The Horites used to live in Seir, but the descendants of Esau drove them out. They destroyed the Horites from before them and settled in their place, just as Israel did in the land that the LORD gave them as their possession.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_13","006_2_13","DEU","2","13","13","“Now arise and cross over the Brook of Zered.” So we crossed over the Brook of Zered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_14","006_2_14","DEU","2","14","14","The time we spent traveling from Kadesh-barnea until we crossed over the Brook of Zered was thirty-eight years, until that entire generation of fighting men had perished from the camp, as the LORD had sworn to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_15","006_2_15","DEU","2","15","15","Indeed, the LORD’s hand was against them, to eliminate them from the camp, until they had all perished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_16","006_2_16","DEU","2","16","16","Now when all the fighting men among the people had died, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_17","006_2_17","DEU","2","17","17","the LORD said to me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_18","006_2_18","DEU","2","18","18","“Today you are going to cross the border of Moab at Ar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_19","006_2_19","DEU","2","19","19","But when you get close to the Ammonites, do not harass them or provoke them, for I will not give you any of the land of the Ammonites. I have given it to the descendants of Lot as their possession.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_20","006_2_20","DEU","2","20","20","(That too was regarded as the land of the Rephaim, who used to live there, though the Ammonites called them Zamzummites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_21","006_2_21","DEU","2","21","21","They were a people great and many, as tall as the Anakites. But the LORD destroyed them from before the Ammonites, who drove them out and settled in their place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_22","006_2_22","DEU","2","22","22","just as He had done for the descendants of Esau who lived in Seir, when He destroyed the Horites from before them. They drove them out and have lived in their place to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_23","006_2_23","DEU","2","23","23","And the Avvim, who lived in villages as far as Gaza, were destroyed by the Caphtorites, who came out of Caphtor and settled in their place.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_24","006_2_24","DEU","2","24","24","“Arise, set out, and cross the Arnon Valley. See, I have delivered into your hand Sihon the Amorite, king of Heshbon, and his land. Begin to take possession of it and engage him in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_25","006_2_25","DEU","2","25","25","This very day I will begin to put the dread and fear of you upon all the nations under heaven. They will hear the reports of you and tremble in anguish because of you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_26","006_2_26","DEU","2","26","26","So from the Wilderness of Kedemoth I sent messengers with an offer of peace to Sihon king of Heshbon, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_27","006_2_27","DEU","2","27","27","“Let us pass through your land; we will stay on the main road. We will not turn to the right or to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_28","006_2_28","DEU","2","28","28","You can sell us food to eat and water to drink in exchange for silver. Only let us pass through on foot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_29","006_2_29","DEU","2","29","29","just as the descendants of Esau who live in Seir and the Moabites who live in Ar did for us, until we cross the Jordan into the land that the LORD our God is giving us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_30","006_2_30","DEU","2","30","30","But Sihon king of Heshbon would not let us pass through, for the LORD your God had made his spirit stubborn and his heart obstinate, that He might deliver him into your hand, as is the case this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_31","006_2_31","DEU","2","31","31","Then the LORD said to me, “See, I have begun to deliver Sihon and his land over to you. Now begin to conquer and possess his land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_32","006_2_32","DEU","2","32","32","So Sihon and his whole army came out for battle against us at Jahaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_33","006_2_33","DEU","2","33","33","And the LORD our God delivered him over to us, and we defeated him and his sons and his whole army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_34","006_2_34","DEU","2","34","34","At that time we captured all his cities and devoted to destruction the people of every city, including women and children. We left no survivors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_35","006_2_35","DEU","2","35","35","We carried off for ourselves only the livestock and the plunder from the cities we captured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_36","006_2_36","DEU","2","36","36","From Aroer on the rim of the Arnon Valley, along with the city in the valley, even as far as Gilead, not one city had walls too high for us. The LORD our God gave us all of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT2_37","006_2_37","DEU","2","37","37","But you did not go near the land of the Ammonites, or the land along the banks of the Jabbok River, or the cities of the hill country, or any place that the LORD our God had forbidden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_1","006_3_1","DEU","3","1","1","Then we turned and went up the road to Bashan, and Og king of Bashan and his whole army came out to meet us in battle at Edrei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_2","006_3_2","DEU","3","2","2","But the LORD said to me, “Do not fear him, for I have delivered him into your hand, along with all his people and his land. Do to him as you did to Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_3","006_3_3","DEU","3","3","3","So the LORD our God also delivered Og king of Bashan and his whole army into our hands. We struck them down until no survivor was left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_4","006_3_4","DEU","3","4","4","At that time we captured all sixty of his cities. There was not a single city we failed to take—the entire region of Argob, the kingdom of Og in Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_5","006_3_5","DEU","3","5","5","All these cities were fortified with high walls and gates and bars, and there were many more unwalled villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_6","006_3_6","DEU","3","6","6","We devoted them to destruction, as we had done to Sihon king of Heshbon, utterly destroying the men, women, and children of every city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_7","006_3_7","DEU","3","7","7","But all the livestock and plunder of the cities we carried off for ourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_8","006_3_8","DEU","3","8","8","At that time we took from the two kings of the Amorites the land across the Jordan, from the Arnon Valley as far as Mount Hermon— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_9","006_3_9","DEU","3","9","9","which the Sidonians call Sirion but the Amorites call Senir— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_10","006_3_10","DEU","3","10","10","all the cities of the plateau, all of Gilead, and all of Bashan as far as the cities of Salecah and Edrei in the kingdom of Og. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_11","006_3_11","DEU","3","11","11","(For only Og king of Bashan had remained of the remnant of the Rephaim. His bed of iron, nine cubits long and four cubits wide, is still in Rabbah of the Ammonites.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_12","006_3_12","DEU","3","12","12","So at that time we took possession of this land. To the Reubenites and Gadites I gave the land beyond Aroer along the Arnon Valley, and half the hill country of Gilead, along with its cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_13","006_3_13","DEU","3","13","13","To the half-tribe of Manasseh I gave the rest of Gilead and all of Bashan, the kingdom of Og. (The entire region of Argob, the whole territory of Bashan, used to be called the land of the Rephaim.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_14","006_3_14","DEU","3","14","14","Jair, a descendant of Manasseh, took the whole region of Argob as far as the border of the Geshurites and Maacathites. He renamed Bashan after himself, Havvoth-jair, by which it is called to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_15","006_3_15","DEU","3","15","15","To Machir I gave Gilead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_16","006_3_16","DEU","3","16","16","and to the Reubenites and Gadites I gave the territory from Gilead to the Arnon Valley (the middle of the valley was the border) and up to the Jabbok River, the border of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_17","006_3_17","DEU","3","17","17","The Jordan River in the Arabah bordered it from Chinnereth to the Sea of the Arabah (the Salt Sea) with the slopes of Pisgah to the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_18","006_3_18","DEU","3","18","18","At that time I commanded you: “The LORD your God has given you this land to possess. All your men of valor are to cross over, armed for battle, ahead of your brothers, the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_19","006_3_19","DEU","3","19","19","But your wives, your children, and your livestock—I know that you have much livestock—may remain in the cities I have given you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_20","006_3_20","DEU","3","20","20","until the LORD gives rest to your brothers as He has to you, and they too have taken possession of the land that the LORD your God is giving them across the Jordan. Then each of you may return to the possession I have given you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_21","006_3_21","DEU","3","21","21","And at that time I commanded Joshua: “Your own eyes have seen all that the LORD your God has done to these two kings. The LORD will do the same to all the kingdoms you are about to enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_22","006_3_22","DEU","3","22","22","Do not be afraid of them, for the LORD your God Himself will fight for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_23","006_3_23","DEU","3","23","23","At that time I also pleaded with the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_24","006_3_24","DEU","3","24","24","“O Lord GOD, You have begun to show Your greatness and power to Your servant. For what god in heaven or on earth can perform such works and mighty acts as Yours? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_25","006_3_25","DEU","3","25","25","Please let me cross over and see the good land beyond the Jordan—that pleasant hill country as well as Lebanon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_26","006_3_26","DEU","3","26","26","But the LORD was angry with me on account of you, and He would not listen to me. “That is enough,” the LORD said to me. “Do not speak to Me again about this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_27","006_3_27","DEU","3","27","27","Go to the top of Pisgah and look to the west and north and south and east. See the land with your own eyes, for you will not cross this Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_28","006_3_28","DEU","3","28","28","But commission Joshua, encourage him, and strengthen him, for he will cross over ahead of the people and enable them to inherit the land that you will see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT3_29","006_3_29","DEU","3","29","29","So we stayed in the valley opposite Beth-peor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_1","006_4_1","DEU","4","1","1","Hear now, O Israel, the statutes and ordinances I am teaching you to follow, so that you may live and may enter and take possession of the land that the LORD, the God of your fathers, is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_2","006_4_2","DEU","4","2","2","You must not add to or subtract from what I command you, so that you may keep the commandments of the LORD your God that I am giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_3","006_4_3","DEU","4","3","3","Your eyes have seen what the LORD did at Baal-peor, for the LORD your God destroyed from among you all who followed Baal of Peor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_4","006_4_4","DEU","4","4","4","But you who held fast to the LORD your God are alive to this day, every one of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_5","006_4_5","DEU","4","5","5","See, I have taught you statutes and ordinances just as the LORD my God has commanded me, so that you may follow them in the land that you are about to enter and possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_6","006_4_6","DEU","4","6","6","Observe them carefully, for this will show your wisdom and understanding in the sight of the peoples, who will hear of all these statutes and say, “Surely this great nation is a wise and understanding people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_7","006_4_7","DEU","4","7","7","For what nation is great enough to have a god as near to them as the LORD our God is to us whenever we call on Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_8","006_4_8","DEU","4","8","8","And what nation is great enough to have righteous statutes and ordinances like this entire law I set before you today? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_9","006_4_9","DEU","4","9","9","Only be on your guard and diligently watch yourselves, so that you do not forget the things your eyes have seen, and so that they do not slip from your heart as long as you live. Teach them to your children and grandchildren. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_10","006_4_10","DEU","4","10","10","The day you stood before the LORD your God at Horeb, the LORD said to me, “Gather the people before Me to hear My words, so that they may learn to fear Me all the days they live on the earth, and that they may teach them to their children.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_11","006_4_11","DEU","4","11","11","You came near and stood at the base of the mountain, a mountain blazing with fire to the heavens, with black clouds and deep darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_12","006_4_12","DEU","4","12","12","And the LORD spoke to you out of the fire. You heard the sound of the words but saw no form; there was only a voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_13","006_4_13","DEU","4","13","13","He declared to you His covenant, which He commanded you to follow—the Ten Commandments that He wrote on two tablets of stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_14","006_4_14","DEU","4","14","14","At that time the LORD commanded me to teach you the statutes and ordinances you are to follow in the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_15","006_4_15","DEU","4","15","15","So since you saw no form of any kind on the day the LORD spoke to you out of the fire at Horeb, be careful ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_16","006_4_16","DEU","4","16","16","that you do not act corruptly and make an idol for yourselves of any form or shape, whether in the likeness of a male or female, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_17","006_4_17","DEU","4","17","17","of any beast that is on the earth or bird that flies in the air, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_18","006_4_18","DEU","4","18","18","or of any creature that crawls on the ground or fish that is in the waters below. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_19","006_4_19","DEU","4","19","19","When you look to the heavens and see the sun and moon and stars—all the host of heaven—do not be enticed to bow down and worship what the LORD your God has apportioned to all the nations under heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_20","006_4_20","DEU","4","20","20","Yet the LORD has taken you and brought you out of the iron furnace, out of Egypt, to be the people of His inheritance, as you are today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_21","006_4_21","DEU","4","21","21","The LORD, however, was angry with me on account of you, and He swore that I would not cross the Jordan to enter the good land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_22","006_4_22","DEU","4","22","22","For I will not be crossing the Jordan, because I must die in this land. But you shall cross over and take possession of that good land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_23","006_4_23","DEU","4","23","23","Be careful that you do not forget the covenant of the LORD your God that He made with you; do not make an idol for yourselves in the form of anything He has forbidden you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_24","006_4_24","DEU","4","24","24","For the LORD your God is a consuming fire, a jealous God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_25","006_4_25","DEU","4","25","25","After you have children and grandchildren and you have been in the land a long time, if you then act corruptly and make an idol of any form—doing evil in the sight of the LORD your God and provoking Him to anger— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_26","006_4_26","DEU","4","26","26","I call heaven and earth as witnesses against you this day that you will quickly perish from the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess. You will not live long upon it, but will be utterly destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_27","006_4_27","DEU","4","27","27","Then the LORD will scatter you among the peoples, and only a few of you will survive among the nations to which the LORD will drive you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_28","006_4_28","DEU","4","28","28","And there you will serve man-made gods of wood and stone, which cannot see or hear or eat or smell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_29","006_4_29","DEU","4","29","29","But if from there you will seek the LORD your God, you will find Him if you seek Him with all your heart and with all your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_30","006_4_30","DEU","4","30","30","When you are in distress and all these things have happened to you, then in later days you will return to the LORD your God and listen to His voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_31","006_4_31","DEU","4","31","31","For the LORD your God is a merciful God; He will not abandon you or destroy you or forget the covenant with your fathers, which He swore to them by oath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_32","006_4_32","DEU","4","32","32","Indeed, ask now from one end of the heavens to the other about the days that long preceded you, from the day that God created man on earth: Has anything as great as this ever happened or been reported? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_33","006_4_33","DEU","4","33","33","Has a people ever heard the voice of God speaking out of the fire, as you have, and lived? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_34","006_4_34","DEU","4","34","34","Or has any god tried to take as his own a nation out of another nation—by trials, signs, wonders, and war, by a strong hand and an outstretched arm, and by great terrors—as the LORD your God did for you in Egypt, before your eyes? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_35","006_4_35","DEU","4","35","35","You were shown these things so that you would know that the LORD is God; there is no other besides Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_36","006_4_36","DEU","4","36","36","He let you hear His voice from heaven to discipline you, and on earth He showed you His great fire, and you heard His words out of the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_37","006_4_37","DEU","4","37","37","Because He loved your fathers, He chose their descendants after them and brought you out of Egypt by His presence and great power, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_38","006_4_38","DEU","4","38","38","to drive out before you nations greater and mightier than you, and to bring you into their land and give it to you for your inheritance, as it is this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_39","006_4_39","DEU","4","39","39","Know therefore this day and take to heart that the LORD is God in heaven above and on the earth below; there is no other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_40","006_4_40","DEU","4","40","40","Keep His statutes and commandments, which I am giving you today, so that you and your children after you may prosper, and that you may live long in the land that the LORD your God is giving you for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_41","006_4_41","DEU","4","41","41","Then Moses set aside three cities across the Jordan to the east ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_42","006_4_42","DEU","4","42","42","to which a manslayer could flee after killing his neighbor unintentionally without prior malice. To save one’s own life, he could flee to one of these cities: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_43","006_4_43","DEU","4","43","43","Bezer in the wilderness on the plateau belonging to the Reubenites, Ramoth in Gilead belonging to the Gadites, or Golan in Bashan belonging to the Manassites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_44","006_4_44","DEU","4","44","44","This is the law that Moses set before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_45","006_4_45","DEU","4","45","45","These are the testimonies, statutes, and ordinances that Moses proclaimed to them after they had come out of Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_46","006_4_46","DEU","4","46","46","while they were in the valley across the Jordan facing Beth-peor in the land of Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon and was defeated by Moses and the Israelites after they had come out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_47","006_4_47","DEU","4","47","47","They took possession of the land belonging to Sihon and to Og king of Bashan—the two Amorite kings across the Jordan to the east— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_48","006_4_48","DEU","4","48","48","extending from Aroer on the rim of the Arnon Valley as far as Mount Siyon (that is, Hermon), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT4_49","006_4_49","DEU","4","49","49","including all the Arabah on the east side of the Jordan and as far as the Sea of the Arabah, below the slopes of Pisgah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_1","006_5_1","DEU","5","1","1","Then Moses summoned all Israel and said to them: Hear, O Israel, the statutes and ordinances that I declare in your hearing this day. Learn them and observe them carefully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_2","006_5_2","DEU","5","2","2","The LORD our God made a covenant with us at Horeb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_3","006_5_3","DEU","5","3","3","He did not make this covenant with our fathers, but with all of us who are alive here today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_4","006_5_4","DEU","5","4","4","The LORD spoke with you face to face out of the fire on the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_5","006_5_5","DEU","5","5","5","At that time I was standing between the LORD and you to declare to you the word of the LORD, because you were afraid of the fire and would not go up the mountain. And He said: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_6","006_5_6","DEU","5","6","6","“I am the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_7","006_5_7","DEU","5","7","7","You shall have no other gods before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_8","006_5_8","DEU","5","8","8","You shall not make for yourself an idol in the form of anything in the heavens above, on the earth below, or in the waters beneath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_9","006_5_9","DEU","5","9","9","You shall not bow down to them or worship them; for I, the LORD your God, am a jealous God, visiting the iniquity of the fathers on their children to the third and fourth generations of those who hate Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_10","006_5_10","DEU","5","10","10","but showing loving devotion to a thousand generations of those who love Me and keep My commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_11","006_5_11","DEU","5","11","11","You shall not take the name of the LORD your God in vain, for the LORD will not leave anyone unpunished who takes His name in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_12","006_5_12","DEU","5","12","12","Observe the Sabbath day by keeping it holy, as the LORD your God has commanded you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_13","006_5_13","DEU","5","13","13","Six days you shall labor and do all your work, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_14","006_5_14","DEU","5","14","14","but the seventh day is a Sabbath to the LORD your God, on which you must not do any work—neither you, nor your son or daughter, nor your manservant or maidservant, nor your ox or donkey or any of your livestock, nor the foreigner within your gates, so that your manservant and maidservant may rest as you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_15","006_5_15","DEU","5","15","15","Remember that you were a slave in the land of Egypt, and that the LORD your God brought you out of there with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm. That is why the LORD your God has commanded you to keep the Sabbath day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_16","006_5_16","DEU","5","16","16","Honor your father and your mother, as the LORD your God has commanded you, so that your days may be long and that it may go well with you in the land that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_17","006_5_17","DEU","5","17","17","You shall not murder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_18","006_5_18","DEU","5","18","18","You shall not commit adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_19","006_5_19","DEU","5","19","19","You shall not steal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_20","006_5_20","DEU","5","20","20","You shall not bear false witness against your neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_21","006_5_21","DEU","5","21","21","You shall not covet your neighbor’s wife. You shall not covet your neighbor’s house or field, or his manservant or maidservant, or his ox or donkey, or anything that belongs to your neighbor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_22","006_5_22","DEU","5","22","22","The LORD spoke these commandments in a loud voice to your whole assembly out of the fire, the cloud, and the deep darkness on the mountain; He added nothing more. And He wrote them on two tablets of stone and gave them to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_23","006_5_23","DEU","5","23","23","And when you heard the voice out of the darkness while the mountain was blazing with fire, all the heads of your tribes and your elders approached me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_24","006_5_24","DEU","5","24","24","and you said, “Behold, the LORD our God has shown us His glory and greatness, and we have heard His voice out of the fire. Today we have seen that a man can live even if God speaks with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_25","006_5_25","DEU","5","25","25","But now, why should we die? For this great fire will consume us, and we will die, if we hear the voice of the LORD our God any longer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_26","006_5_26","DEU","5","26","26","For who of all flesh has heard the voice of the living God speaking out of the fire, as we have, and survived? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_27","006_5_27","DEU","5","27","27","Go near and listen to all that the LORD our God says. Then you can tell us everything the LORD our God tells you; we will listen and obey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_28","006_5_28","DEU","5","28","28","And the LORD heard the words you spoke to me, and He said to me, “I have heard the words that these people have spoken to you. They have done well in all that they have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_29","006_5_29","DEU","5","29","29","If only they had such a heart to fear Me and keep all My commandments always, so that it might be well with them and with their children forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_30","006_5_30","DEU","5","30","30","Go and tell them: ‘Return to your tents.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_31","006_5_31","DEU","5","31","31","But you stand here with Me, that I may speak to you all the commandments and statutes and ordinances you are to teach them to follow in the land that I am giving them to possess.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_32","006_5_32","DEU","5","32","32","So be careful to do as the LORD your God has commanded you; you are not to turn aside to the right or to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT5_33","006_5_33","DEU","5","33","33","You must walk in all the ways that the LORD your God has commanded you, so that you may live and prosper and prolong your days in the land that you will possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_1","006_6_1","DEU","6","1","1","These are the commandments and statutes and ordinances that the LORD your God has instructed me to teach you to follow in the land that you are about to enter and possess, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_2","006_6_2","DEU","6","2","2","so that you and your children and grandchildren may fear the LORD your God all the days of your lives by keeping all His statutes and commandments that I give you, and so that your days may be prolonged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_3","006_6_3","DEU","6","3","3","Hear, O Israel, and be careful to observe them, so that you may prosper and multiply greatly in a land flowing with milk and honey, just as the LORD, the God of your fathers, has promised you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_4","006_6_4","DEU","6","4","4","Hear, O Israel: The LORD our God, the LORD is One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_5","006_6_5","DEU","6","5","5","And you shall love the LORD your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_6","006_6_6","DEU","6","6","6","These words I am commanding you today are to be upon your hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_7","006_6_7","DEU","6","7","7","And you shall teach them diligently to your children and speak of them when you sit at home and when you walk along the road, when you lie down and when you get up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_8","006_6_8","DEU","6","8","8","Tie them as reminders on your hands and bind them on your foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_9","006_6_9","DEU","6","9","9","Write them on the doorposts of your houses and on your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_10","006_6_10","DEU","6","10","10","And when the LORD your God brings you into the land He swore to your fathers, to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, that He would give you—a land with great and splendid cities that you did not build, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_11","006_6_11","DEU","6","11","11","with houses full of every good thing with which you did not fill them, with wells that you did not dig, and with vineyards and olive groves that you did not plant—and when you eat and are satisfied, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_12","006_6_12","DEU","6","12","12","be careful not to forget the LORD who brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_13","006_6_13","DEU","6","13","13","Fear the LORD your God, serve Him only, and take your oaths in His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_14","006_6_14","DEU","6","14","14","Do not follow other gods, the gods of the peoples around you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_15","006_6_15","DEU","6","15","15","For the LORD your God, who is among you, is a jealous God. Otherwise the anger of the LORD your God will be kindled against you, and He will wipe you off the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_16","006_6_16","DEU","6","16","16","Do not test the LORD your God as you tested Him at Massah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_17","006_6_17","DEU","6","17","17","You are to diligently keep the commandments of the LORD your God and the testimonies and statutes He has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_18","006_6_18","DEU","6","18","18","Do what is right and good in the sight of the LORD, so that it may be well with you and that you may enter and possess the good land that the LORD your God swore to give your fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_19","006_6_19","DEU","6","19","19","driving out all your enemies before you, as the LORD has said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_20","006_6_20","DEU","6","20","20","In the future, when your son asks, “What is the meaning of the decrees and statutes and ordinances that the LORD our God has commanded you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_21","006_6_21","DEU","6","21","21","then you are to tell him, “We were slaves of Pharaoh in Egypt, but the LORD brought us out of Egypt with a mighty hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_22","006_6_22","DEU","6","22","22","Before our eyes the LORD inflicted great and devastating signs and wonders on Egypt, on Pharaoh, and on all his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_23","006_6_23","DEU","6","23","23","But He brought us out from there to lead us in and give us the land that He had sworn to our fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_24","006_6_24","DEU","6","24","24","And the LORD commanded us to observe all these statutes and to fear the LORD our God, that we may always be prosperous and preserved, as we are to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT6_25","006_6_25","DEU","6","25","25","And if we are careful to observe every one of these commandments before the LORD our God, as He has commanded us, then that will be our righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_1","006_7_1","DEU","7","1","1","When the LORD your God brings you into the land that you are entering to possess, and He drives out before you many nations—the Hittites, Girgashites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites, seven nations larger and stronger than you— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_2","006_7_2","DEU","7","2","2","and when the LORD your God has delivered them over to you to defeat them, then you must devote them to complete destruction. Make no treaty with them and show them no mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_3","006_7_3","DEU","7","3","3","Do not intermarry with them. Do not give your daughters to their sons or take their daughters for your sons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_4","006_7_4","DEU","7","4","4","because they will turn your sons away from following Me to serve other gods. Then the anger of the LORD will burn against you, and He will swiftly destroy you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_5","006_7_5","DEU","7","5","5","Instead, this is what you are to do to them: tear down their altars, smash their sacred pillars, cut down their Asherah poles, and burn their idols in the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_6","006_7_6","DEU","7","6","6","For you are a people holy to the LORD your God. The LORD your God has chosen you to be a people for His prized possession out of all peoples on the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_7","006_7_7","DEU","7","7","7","The LORD did not set His affection on you and choose you because you were more numerous than the other peoples, for you were the fewest of all peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_8","006_7_8","DEU","7","8","8","But because the LORD loved you and kept the oath He swore to your fathers, He brought you out with a mighty hand and redeemed you from the house of slavery, from the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_9","006_7_9","DEU","7","9","9","Know therefore that the LORD your God is God, the faithful God who keeps His covenant of loving devotion for a thousand generations of those who love Him and keep His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_10","006_7_10","DEU","7","10","10","But those who hate Him He repays to their faces with destruction; He will not hesitate to repay to his face the one who hates Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_11","006_7_11","DEU","7","11","11","So keep the commandments and statutes and ordinances that I am giving you to follow this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_12","006_7_12","DEU","7","12","12","If you listen to these ordinances and keep them carefully, then the LORD your God will keep His covenant and the loving devotion that He swore to your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_13","006_7_13","DEU","7","13","13","He will love you and bless you and multiply you. He will bless the fruit of your womb and the produce of your land—your grain, new wine, and oil, the young of your herds and the lambs of your flocks—in the land that He swore to your fathers to give you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_14","006_7_14","DEU","7","14","14","You will be blessed above all peoples; among you there will be no barren man or woman or livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_15","006_7_15","DEU","7","15","15","And the LORD will remove from you all sickness. He will not lay upon you any of the terrible diseases you knew in Egypt, but He will inflict them on all who hate you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_16","006_7_16","DEU","7","16","16","You must destroy all the peoples the LORD your God will deliver to you. Do not look on them with pity. Do not worship their gods, for that will be a snare to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_17","006_7_17","DEU","7","17","17","You may say in your heart, “These nations are greater than we are; how can we drive them out?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_18","006_7_18","DEU","7","18","18","But do not be afraid of them. Be sure to remember what the LORD your God did to Pharaoh and all Egypt: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_19","006_7_19","DEU","7","19","19","the great trials that you saw, the signs and wonders, and the mighty hand and outstretched arm by which the LORD your God brought you out. The LORD your God will do the same to all the peoples you now fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_20","006_7_20","DEU","7","20","20","Moreover, the LORD your God will send the hornet against them until even the survivors hiding from you have perished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_21","006_7_21","DEU","7","21","21","Do not be terrified by them, for the LORD your God, who is among you, is a great and awesome God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_22","006_7_22","DEU","7","22","22","The LORD your God will drive out these nations before you little by little. You will not be enabled to eliminate them all at once, or the wild animals would multiply around you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_23","006_7_23","DEU","7","23","23","But the LORD your God will give them over to you and throw them into great confusion, until they are destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_24","006_7_24","DEU","7","24","24","He will hand their kings over to you, and you will wipe out their names from under heaven. No one will be able to stand against you; you will annihilate them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_25","006_7_25","DEU","7","25","25","You must burn up the images of their gods; do not covet the silver and gold that is on them or take it for yourselves, or you will be ensnared by it; for it is detestable to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT7_26","006_7_26","DEU","7","26","26","And you must not bring any detestable thing into your house, or you, like it, will be set apart for destruction. You are to utterly detest and abhor it, because it is set apart for destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_1","006_8_1","DEU","8","1","1","You must carefully follow every commandment I am giving you today, so that you may live and multiply, and enter and possess the land that the LORD swore to give your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_2","006_8_2","DEU","8","2","2","Remember that these forty years the LORD your God led you all the way in the wilderness, so that He might humble you and test you in order to know what was in your heart, whether or not you would keep His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_3","006_8_3","DEU","8","3","3","He humbled you, and in your hunger He gave you manna to eat, which neither you nor your fathers had known, so that you might understand that man does not live on bread alone, but on every word that comes from the mouth of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_4","006_8_4","DEU","8","4","4","Your clothing did not wear out and your feet did not swell during these forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_5","006_8_5","DEU","8","5","5","So know in your heart that just as a man disciplines his son, so the LORD your God disciplines you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_6","006_8_6","DEU","8","6","6","Therefore you shall keep the commandments of the LORD your God, walking in His ways and fearing Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_7","006_8_7","DEU","8","7","7","For the LORD your God is bringing you into a good land, a land of brooks and fountains and springs that flow through the valleys and hills; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_8","006_8_8","DEU","8","8","8","a land of wheat, barley, vines, fig trees, and pomegranates; a land of olive oil and honey; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_9","006_8_9","DEU","8","9","9","a land where you will eat food without scarcity, where you will lack nothing; a land whose rocks are iron and whose hills are ready to be mined for copper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_10","006_8_10","DEU","8","10","10","When you eat and are satisfied, you are to bless the LORD your God for the good land that He has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_11","006_8_11","DEU","8","11","11","Be careful not to forget the LORD your God by failing to keep His commandments and ordinances and statutes, which I am giving you this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_12","006_8_12","DEU","8","12","12","Otherwise, when you eat and are satisfied, when you build fine houses in which to dwell, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_13","006_8_13","DEU","8","13","13","and when your herds and flocks grow large and your silver and gold increase and all that you have is multiplied, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_14","006_8_14","DEU","8","14","14","then your heart will become proud, and you will forget the LORD your God who brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_15","006_8_15","DEU","8","15","15","He led you through the vast and terrifying wilderness with its venomous snakes and scorpions, a thirsty and waterless land. He brought you water from the rock of flint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_16","006_8_16","DEU","8","16","16","He fed you in the wilderness with manna that your fathers had not known, in order to humble you and test you, so that in the end He might cause you to prosper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_17","006_8_17","DEU","8","17","17","You might say in your heart, “The power and strength of my hands have made this wealth for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_18","006_8_18","DEU","8","18","18","But remember that it is the LORD your God who gives you the power to gain wealth, in order to confirm His covenant that He swore to your fathers even to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_19","006_8_19","DEU","8","19","19","If you ever forget the LORD your God and go after other gods to worship and bow down to them, I testify against you today that you will surely perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT8_20","006_8_20","DEU","8","20","20","Like the nations that the LORD has destroyed before you, so you will perish if you do not obey the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_1","006_9_1","DEU","9","1","1","Hear, O Israel: Today you are about to cross the Jordan to go in and dispossess nations greater and stronger than you, with large cities fortified to the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_2","006_9_2","DEU","9","2","2","The people are strong and tall, the descendants of the Anakim. You know about them, and you have heard it said, “Who can stand up to the sons of Anak?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_3","006_9_3","DEU","9","3","3","But understand that today the LORD your God goes across ahead of you as a consuming fire; He will destroy them and subdue them before you. And you will drive them out and annihilate them swiftly, as the LORD has promised you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_4","006_9_4","DEU","9","4","4","When the LORD your God has driven them out before you, do not say in your heart, “Because of my righteousness the LORD has brought me in to possess this land.” Rather, the LORD is driving out these nations before you because of their wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_5","006_9_5","DEU","9","5","5","It is not because of your righteousness or uprightness of heart that you are going in to possess their land, but it is because of their wickedness that the LORD your God is driving out these nations before you, to keep the promise He swore to your fathers, to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_6","006_9_6","DEU","9","6","6","Understand, then, that it is not because of your righteousness that the LORD your God is giving you this good land to possess, for you are a stiff-necked people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_7","006_9_7","DEU","9","7","7","Remember this, and never forget how you provoked the LORD your God in the wilderness. From the day you left the land of Egypt until you reached this place, you have been rebelling against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_8","006_9_8","DEU","9","8","8","At Horeb you provoked the LORD, and He was angry enough to destroy you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_9","006_9_9","DEU","9","9","9","When I went up on the mountain to receive the tablets of stone, the tablets of the covenant that the LORD made with you, I stayed on the mountain forty days and forty nights. I ate no bread and drank no water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_10","006_9_10","DEU","9","10","10","Then the LORD gave me the two stone tablets, inscribed by the finger of God with the exact words that the LORD spoke to you out of the fire on the mountain on the day of the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_11","006_9_11","DEU","9","11","11","And at the end of forty days and forty nights, the LORD gave me the two stone tablets, the tablets of the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_12","006_9_12","DEU","9","12","12","And the LORD said to me, “Get up and go down from here at once, for your people, whom you brought out of Egypt, have corrupted themselves. How quickly they have turned aside from the way that I commanded them! They have made for themselves a molten image.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_13","006_9_13","DEU","9","13","13","The LORD also said to me, “I have seen this people, and they are indeed a stiff-necked people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_14","006_9_14","DEU","9","14","14","Leave Me alone, so that I may destroy them and blot out their name from under heaven. Then I will make you into a nation mightier and greater than they are.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_15","006_9_15","DEU","9","15","15","So I went back down the mountain while it was blazing with fire, with the two tablets of the covenant in my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_16","006_9_16","DEU","9","16","16","And I saw how you had sinned against the LORD your God; you had made for yourselves a molten calf. You had turned aside quickly from the way that the LORD had commanded you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_17","006_9_17","DEU","9","17","17","So I took the two tablets and threw them out of my hands, shattering them before your eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_18","006_9_18","DEU","9","18","18","Then I fell down before the LORD for forty days and forty nights, as I had done the first time. I did not eat bread or drink water because of all the sin you had committed in doing what was evil in the sight of the LORD and provoking Him to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_19","006_9_19","DEU","9","19","19","For I was afraid of the anger and wrath that the LORD had directed against you, enough to destroy you. But the LORD listened to me this time as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_20","006_9_20","DEU","9","20","20","The LORD was angry enough with Aaron to destroy him, but at that time I also prayed for Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_21","006_9_21","DEU","9","21","21","And I took that sinful thing, the calf you had made, and burned it in the fire. Then I crushed it and ground it to powder as fine as dust, and I cast it into the stream that came down from the mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_22","006_9_22","DEU","9","22","22","You continued to provoke the LORD at Taberah, at Massah, and at Kibroth-hattaavah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_23","006_9_23","DEU","9","23","23","And when the LORD sent you out from Kadesh-barnea, He said, “Go up and possess the land that I have given you.” But you rebelled against the command of the LORD your God. You neither believed Him nor obeyed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_24","006_9_24","DEU","9","24","24","You have been rebelling against the LORD since the day I came to know you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_25","006_9_25","DEU","9","25","25","So I fell down before the LORD for forty days and forty nights, because the LORD had said He would destroy you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_26","006_9_26","DEU","9","26","26","And I prayed to the LORD and said, “O Lord GOD, do not destroy Your people, Your inheritance, whom You redeemed through Your greatness and brought out of Egypt with a mighty hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_27","006_9_27","DEU","9","27","27","Remember Your servants Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. Overlook the stubbornness of this people and the wickedness of their sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_28","006_9_28","DEU","9","28","28","Otherwise, those in the land from which You brought us out will say, ‘Because the LORD was not able to bring them into the land He had promised them, and because He hated them, He has brought them out to kill them in the wilderness.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT9_29","006_9_29","DEU","9","29","29","But they are Your people, Your inheritance, whom You brought out by Your great power and outstretched arm.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_1","006_10_1","DEU","10","1","1","At that time the LORD said to me, “Chisel out two stone tablets like the originals, come up to Me on the mountain, and make an ark of wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_2","006_10_2","DEU","10","2","2","And I will write on the tablets the words that were on the first tablets, which you broke; and you are to place them in the ark.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_3","006_10_3","DEU","10","3","3","So I made an ark of acacia wood, chiseled out two stone tablets like the originals, and went up the mountain with the two tablets in my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_4","006_10_4","DEU","10","4","4","And the LORD wrote on the tablets what had been written previously, the Ten Commandments that He had spoken to you on the mountain out of the fire on the day of the assembly. The LORD gave them to me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_5","006_10_5","DEU","10","5","5","and I went back down the mountain and placed the tablets in the ark I had made, as the LORD had commanded me; and there they have remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_6","006_10_6","DEU","10","6","6","The Israelites traveled from Beeroth Bene-jaakan to Moserah, where Aaron died and was buried, and Eleazar his son succeeded him as priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_7","006_10_7","DEU","10","7","7","From there they traveled to Gudgodah, and from Gudgodah to Jotbathah, a land with streams of water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_8","006_10_8","DEU","10","8","8","At that time the LORD set apart the tribe of Levi to carry the ark of the covenant of the LORD, to stand before the LORD to serve Him, and to pronounce blessings in His name, as they do to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_9","006_10_9","DEU","10","9","9","That is why Levi has no portion or inheritance among his brothers; the LORD is his inheritance, as the LORD your God promised him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_10","006_10_10","DEU","10","10","10","I stayed on the mountain forty days and forty nights, like the first time, and that time the LORD again listened to me and agreed not to destroy you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_11","006_10_11","DEU","10","11","11","Then the LORD said to me, “Get up. Continue your journey ahead of the people, that they may enter and possess the land that I swore to their fathers to give them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_12","006_10_12","DEU","10","12","12","And now, O Israel, what does the LORD your God ask of you but to fear the LORD your God by walking in all His ways, to love Him, to serve the LORD your God with all your heart and with all your soul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_13","006_10_13","DEU","10","13","13","and to keep the commandments and statutes of the LORD that I am giving you this day for your own good? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_14","006_10_14","DEU","10","14","14","Behold, to the LORD your God belong the heavens, even the highest heavens, and the earth and everything in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_15","006_10_15","DEU","10","15","15","Yet the LORD has set His affection on your fathers and loved them. And He has chosen you, their descendants after them, above all the peoples, even to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_16","006_10_16","DEU","10","16","16","Circumcise your hearts, therefore, and stiffen your necks no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_17","006_10_17","DEU","10","17","17","For the LORD your God is God of gods and Lord of lords, the great, mighty, and awesome God, showing no partiality and accepting no bribe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_18","006_10_18","DEU","10","18","18","He executes justice for the fatherless and widow, and He loves the foreigner, giving him food and clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_19","006_10_19","DEU","10","19","19","So you also must love the foreigner, since you yourselves were foreigners in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_20","006_10_20","DEU","10","20","20","You are to fear the LORD your God and serve Him. Hold fast to Him and take your oaths in His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_21","006_10_21","DEU","10","21","21","He is your praise and He is your God, who has done for you these great and awesome wonders that your eyes have seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT10_22","006_10_22","DEU","10","22","22","Your fathers went down to Egypt, seventy in all, and now the LORD your God has made you as numerous as the stars in the sky. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_1","006_11_1","DEU","11","1","1","You shall therefore love the LORD your God and always keep His charge, His statutes, His ordinances, and His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_2","006_11_2","DEU","11","2","2","Know this day that it is not your children who have known and seen the discipline of the LORD your God: His greatness, His mighty hand, and His outstretched arm; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_3","006_11_3","DEU","11","3","3","the signs and works He did in Egypt to Pharaoh king of Egypt and all his land; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_4","006_11_4","DEU","11","4","4","what He did to the Egyptian army and horses and chariots when He made the waters of the Red Sea engulf them as they pursued you, and how He destroyed them completely, even to this day; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_5","006_11_5","DEU","11","5","5","what He did for you in the wilderness until you reached this place; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_6","006_11_6","DEU","11","6","6","and what He did in the midst of all the Israelites to Dathan and Abiram, the sons of Eliab the Reubenite, when the earth opened its mouth and swallowed them, their households, their tents, and every living thing that belonged to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_7","006_11_7","DEU","11","7","7","For it is your own eyes that have seen every great work that the LORD has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_8","006_11_8","DEU","11","8","8","You shall therefore keep every commandment I am giving you today, so that you may have the strength to go in and possess the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_9","006_11_9","DEU","11","9","9","and so that you may live long in the land that the LORD swore to your fathers to give them and their descendants, a land flowing with milk and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_10","006_11_10","DEU","11","10","10","For the land that you are entering to possess is not like the land of Egypt, from which you have come, where you sowed your seed and irrigated on foot, like a vegetable garden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_11","006_11_11","DEU","11","11","11","But the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess is a land of mountains and valleys that drinks in the rain from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_12","006_11_12","DEU","11","12","12","It is a land for which the LORD your God cares; the eyes of the LORD your God are always on it, from the beginning to the end of the year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_13","006_11_13","DEU","11","13","13","So if you carefully obey the commandments I am giving you today, to love the LORD your God and to serve Him with all your heart and with all your soul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_14","006_11_14","DEU","11","14","14","then I will provide rain for your land in season, the autumn and spring rains, that you may gather your grain, new wine, and oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_15","006_11_15","DEU","11","15","15","And I will provide grass in the fields for your livestock, and you will eat and be satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_16","006_11_16","DEU","11","16","16","But be careful that you are not enticed to turn aside to worship and bow down to other gods, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_17","006_11_17","DEU","11","17","17","or the anger of the LORD will be kindled against you. He will shut the heavens so that there will be no rain, nor will the land yield its produce, and you will soon perish from the good land that the LORD is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_18","006_11_18","DEU","11","18","18","Fix these words of mine in your hearts and minds; tie them as reminders on your hands and bind them on your foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_19","006_11_19","DEU","11","19","19","Teach them to your children, speaking about them when you sit at home and when you walk along the road, when you lie down and when you get up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_20","006_11_20","DEU","11","20","20","Write them on the doorposts of your houses and on your gates, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_21","006_11_21","DEU","11","21","21","so that as long as the heavens are above the earth, your days and those of your children may be multiplied in the land that the LORD swore to give your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_22","006_11_22","DEU","11","22","22","For if you carefully keep all these commandments I am giving you to follow—to love the LORD your God, to walk in all His ways, and to hold fast to Him— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_23","006_11_23","DEU","11","23","23","then the LORD will drive out all these nations before you, and you will dispossess nations greater and stronger than you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_24","006_11_24","DEU","11","24","24","Every place where the sole of your foot treads will be yours. Your territory will extend from the wilderness to Lebanon, and from the Euphrates River to the Western Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_25","006_11_25","DEU","11","25","25","No man will be able to stand against you; the LORD your God will put the fear and dread of you upon all the land, wherever you set foot, as He has promised you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_26","006_11_26","DEU","11","26","26","See, today I am setting before you a blessing and a curse— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_27","006_11_27","DEU","11","27","27","a blessing if you obey the commandments of the LORD your God that I am giving you today, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_28","006_11_28","DEU","11","28","28","but a curse if you disobey the commandments of the LORD your God and turn aside from the path I command you today by following other gods, which you have not known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_29","006_11_29","DEU","11","29","29","When the LORD your God brings you into the land you are entering to possess, you are to proclaim the blessing on Mount Gerizim and the curse on Mount Ebal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_30","006_11_30","DEU","11","30","30","Are not these mountains across the Jordan, west of the road toward the sunset, in the land of the Canaanites who live in the Arabah opposite Gilgal near the Oak of Moreh? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_31","006_11_31","DEU","11","31","31","For you are about to cross the Jordan to enter and possess the land that the LORD your God is giving you. When you take possession of it and settle in it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT11_32","006_11_32","DEU","11","32","32","be careful to follow all the statutes and ordinances that I am setting before you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_1","006_12_1","DEU","12","1","1","These are the statutes and ordinances you must be careful to follow all the days you live in the land that the LORD, the God of your fathers, has given you to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_2","006_12_2","DEU","12","2","2","Destroy completely all the places where the nations you are dispossessing have served their gods—atop the high mountains, on the hills, and under every green tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_3","006_12_3","DEU","12","3","3","Tear down their altars, smash their sacred pillars, burn up their Asherah poles, cut down the idols of their gods, and wipe out their names from every place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_4","006_12_4","DEU","12","4","4","You shall not worship the LORD your God in this way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_5","006_12_5","DEU","12","5","5","Instead, you must seek the place the LORD your God will choose from among all your tribes to establish as a dwelling for His Name, and there you must go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_6","006_12_6","DEU","12","6","6","To that place you are to bring your burnt offerings and sacrifices, your tithes and heave offerings, your vow offerings and freewill offerings, as well as the firstborn of your herds and flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_7","006_12_7","DEU","12","7","7","There, in the presence of the LORD your God, you and your households shall eat and rejoice in all you do, because the LORD your God has blessed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_8","006_12_8","DEU","12","8","8","You are not to do as we are doing here today, where everyone does what seems right in his own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_9","006_12_9","DEU","12","9","9","For you have not yet come to the resting place and the inheritance that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_10","006_12_10","DEU","12","10","10","When you cross the Jordan and live in the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, and He gives you rest from all the enemies around you and you dwell securely, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_11","006_12_11","DEU","12","11","11","then the LORD your God will choose a dwelling for His Name. And there you are to bring everything I command you: your burnt offerings and sacrifices, your tithes and special gifts, and all the choice offerings you vow to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_12","006_12_12","DEU","12","12","12","And you shall rejoice before the LORD your God—you, your sons and daughters, your menservants and maidservants, and the Levite within your gates, since he has no portion or inheritance among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_13","006_12_13","DEU","12","13","13","Be careful not to offer your burnt offerings in just any place you see; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_14","006_12_14","DEU","12","14","14","you must offer them only in the place the LORD will choose in one of your tribal territories, and there you shall do all that I command you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_15","006_12_15","DEU","12","15","15","But whenever you want, you may slaughter and eat meat within any of your gates, according to the blessing the LORD your God has given you. Both the ceremonially clean and unclean may eat it as they would a gazelle or deer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_16","006_12_16","DEU","12","16","16","but you must not eat the blood; pour it on the ground like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_17","006_12_17","DEU","12","17","17","Within your gates you must not eat the tithe of your grain or new wine or oil, the firstborn of your herds or flocks, any of the offerings that you have vowed to give, or your freewill offerings or special gifts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_18","006_12_18","DEU","12","18","18","Instead, you must eat them in the presence of the LORD your God at the place the LORD your God will choose—you, your sons and daughters, your menservants and maidservants, and the Levite within your gates. Rejoice before the LORD your God in all you do, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_19","006_12_19","DEU","12","19","19","and be careful not to neglect the Levites as long as you live in your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_20","006_12_20","DEU","12","20","20","When the LORD your God expands your territory as He has promised, and you crave meat and say, “I want to eat meat,” you may eat it whenever you want. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_21","006_12_21","DEU","12","21","21","If the place where the LORD your God chooses to put His Name is too far from you, then you may slaughter any of the herd or flock He has given you, as I have commanded you, and you may eat it within your gates whenever you want. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_22","006_12_22","DEU","12","22","22","Indeed, you may eat it as you would eat a gazelle or deer; both the ceremonially unclean and the clean may eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_23","006_12_23","DEU","12","23","23","Only be sure not to eat the blood, because the blood is the life, and you must not eat the life with the meat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_24","006_12_24","DEU","12","24","24","You must not eat the blood; pour it on the ground like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_25","006_12_25","DEU","12","25","25","Do not eat it, so that it may go well with you and your children after you, because you will be doing what is right in the eyes of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_26","006_12_26","DEU","12","26","26","But you are to take your holy things and your vow offerings and go to the place the LORD will choose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_27","006_12_27","DEU","12","27","27","Present the meat and blood of your burnt offerings on the altar of the LORD your God. The blood of your other sacrifices must be poured out beside the altar of the LORD your God, but you may eat the meat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_28","006_12_28","DEU","12","28","28","Be careful to obey all these things I command you, so that it may always go well with you and your children after you, because you will be doing what is good and right in the eyes of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_29","006_12_29","DEU","12","29","29","When the LORD your God cuts off before you the nations you are entering to dispossess, and you drive them out and live in their land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_30","006_12_30","DEU","12","30","30","be careful not to be ensnared by their ways after they have been destroyed before you. Do not inquire about their gods, asking, “How do these nations serve their gods? I will do likewise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_31","006_12_31","DEU","12","31","31","You must not worship the LORD your God in this way, because they practice for their gods every abomination which the LORD hates. They even burn their sons and daughters in the fire as sacrifices to their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT12_32","006_12_32","DEU","12","32","32","See that you do everything I command you; do not add to it or subtract from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_1","006_13_1","DEU","13","1","1","If a prophet or dreamer of dreams arises among you and proclaims a sign or wonder to you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_2","006_13_2","DEU","13","2","2","and if the sign or wonder he has spoken to you comes about, but he says, “Let us follow other gods (which you have not known) and let us worship them,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_3","006_13_3","DEU","13","3","3","you must not listen to the words of that prophet or dreamer. For the LORD your God is testing you to find out whether you love Him with all your heart and with all your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_4","006_13_4","DEU","13","4","4","You are to follow the LORD your God and fear Him. Keep His commandments and listen to His voice; serve Him and hold fast to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_5","006_13_5","DEU","13","5","5","Such a prophet or dreamer must be put to death, because he has advocated rebellion against the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt and redeemed you from the house of slavery; he has tried to turn you from the way in which the LORD your God has commanded you to walk. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_6","006_13_6","DEU","13","6","6","If your very own brother, or your son or daughter, or the wife you embrace, or your closest friend secretly entices you, saying, “Let us go and worship other gods” (which neither you nor your fathers have known, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_7","006_13_7","DEU","13","7","7","the gods of the peoples around you, whether near or far, whether from one end of the earth or the other), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_8","006_13_8","DEU","13","8","8","you must not yield to him or listen to him. Show him no pity, and do not spare him or shield him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_9","006_13_9","DEU","13","9","9","Instead, you must surely kill him. Your hand must be the first against him to put him to death, and then the hands of all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_10","006_13_10","DEU","13","10","10","Stone him to death for trying to turn you away from the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_11","006_13_11","DEU","13","11","11","Then all Israel will hear and be afraid, and will never again do such a wicked thing among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_12","006_13_12","DEU","13","12","12","If, regarding one of the cities the LORD your God is giving you to inhabit, you hear it said ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_13","006_13_13","DEU","13","13","13","that wicked men have arisen from among you and have led the people of their city astray, saying, “Let us go and serve other gods” (which you have not known), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_14","006_13_14","DEU","13","14","14","then you must inquire, investigate, and interrogate thoroughly. And if it is established with certainty that this abomination has been committed among you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_15","006_13_15","DEU","13","15","15","you must surely put the inhabitants of that city to the sword. Devote to destruction all its people and livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_16","006_13_16","DEU","13","16","16","And you are to gather all its plunder in the middle of the public square, and completely burn the city and all its plunder as a whole burnt offering to the LORD your God. The city must remain a mound of ruins forever, never to be rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_17","006_13_17","DEU","13","17","17","Nothing devoted to destruction shall cling to your hands, so that the LORD will turn from His fierce anger, grant you mercy, show you compassion, and multiply you as He swore to your fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT13_18","006_13_18","DEU","13","18","18","because you obey the LORD your God, keeping all His commandments I am giving you today and doing what is right in the eyes of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_1","006_14_1","DEU","14","1","1","You are sons of the LORD your God; do not cut yourselves or shave your foreheads on behalf of the dead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_2","006_14_2","DEU","14","2","2","for you are a people holy to the LORD your God. The LORD has chosen you to be a people for His prized possession out of all the peoples on the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_3","006_14_3","DEU","14","3","3","You must not eat any detestable thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_4","006_14_4","DEU","14","4","4","These are the animals that you may eat: The ox, the sheep, the goat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_5","006_14_5","DEU","14","5","5","the deer, the gazelle, the roe deer, the wild goat, the ibex, the antelope, and the mountain sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_6","006_14_6","DEU","14","6","6","You may eat any animal that has a split hoof divided in two and that chews the cud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_7","006_14_7","DEU","14","7","7","But of those that chew the cud or have a completely divided hoof, you are not to eat the following: the camel, the rabbit, or the rock badger. Although they chew the cud, they do not have a divided hoof. They are unclean for you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_8","006_14_8","DEU","14","8","8","as well as the pig; though it has a divided hoof, it does not chew the cud. It is unclean for you. You must not eat its meat or touch its carcass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_9","006_14_9","DEU","14","9","9","Of all the creatures that live in the water, you may eat anything with fins and scales, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_10","006_14_10","DEU","14","10","10","but you may not eat anything that does not have fins and scales; it is unclean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_11","006_14_11","DEU","14","11","11","You may eat any clean bird, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_12","006_14_12","DEU","14","12","12","but these you may not eat: the eagle, the bearded vulture, the black vulture, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_13","006_14_13","DEU","14","13","13","the red kite, the falcon, any kind of kite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_14","006_14_14","DEU","14","14","14","any kind of raven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_15","006_14_15","DEU","14","15","15","the ostrich, the screech owl, the gull, any kind of hawk, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_16","006_14_16","DEU","14","16","16","the little owl, the great owl, the white owl, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_17","006_14_17","DEU","14","17","17","the desert owl, the osprey, the cormorant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_18","006_14_18","DEU","14","18","18","the stork, any kind of heron, the hoopoe, or the bat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_19","006_14_19","DEU","14","19","19","All flying insects are unclean for you; they may not be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_20","006_14_20","DEU","14","20","20","But you may eat any clean bird. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_21","006_14_21","DEU","14","21","21","You are not to eat any carcass; you may give it to the foreigner residing within your gates, and he may eat it, or you may sell it to a foreigner. For you are a holy people belonging to the LORD your God. You must not cook a young goat in its mother’s milk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_22","006_14_22","DEU","14","22","22","You must be sure to set aside a tenth of all the produce brought forth each year from your fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_23","006_14_23","DEU","14","23","23","And you are to eat a tenth of your grain, new wine, and oil, and the firstborn of your herds and flocks, in the presence of the LORD your God at the place He will choose as a dwelling for His Name, so that you may learn to fear the LORD your God always. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_24","006_14_24","DEU","14","24","24","But if the distance is too great for you to carry that with which the LORD your God has blessed you, because the place where the LORD your God will choose to put His Name is too far away, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_25","006_14_25","DEU","14","25","25","then exchange it for money, take the money in your hand, and go to the place the LORD your God will choose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_26","006_14_26","DEU","14","26","26","Then you may spend the money on anything you desire: cattle, sheep, wine, strong drink, or anything you wish. You are to feast there in the presence of the LORD your God and rejoice with your household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_27","006_14_27","DEU","14","27","27","And do not neglect the Levite within your gates, since he has no portion or inheritance among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_28","006_14_28","DEU","14","28","28","At the end of every three years, bring a tenth of all your produce for that year and lay it up within your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT14_29","006_14_29","DEU","14","29","29","Then the Levite (because he has no portion or inheritance among you), the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow within your gates may come and eat and be satisfied. And the LORD your God will bless you in all the work of your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_1","006_15_1","DEU","15","1","1","At the end of every seven years you must cancel debts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_2","006_15_2","DEU","15","2","2","This is the manner of remission: Every creditor shall cancel what he has loaned to his neighbor. He is not to collect anything from his neighbor or brother, because the LORD’s time of release has been proclaimed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_3","006_15_3","DEU","15","3","3","You may collect something from a foreigner, but you must forgive whatever your brother owes you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_4","006_15_4","DEU","15","4","4","There will be no poor among you, however, because the LORD will surely bless you in the land that the LORD your God is giving you to possess as an inheritance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_5","006_15_5","DEU","15","5","5","if only you obey the LORD your God and are careful to follow all these commandments I am giving you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_6","006_15_6","DEU","15","6","6","When the LORD your God blesses you as He has promised, you will lend to many nations but borrow from none; you will rule over many nations but be ruled by none. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_7","006_15_7","DEU","15","7","7","If there is a poor man among your brothers within any of the gates in the land that the LORD your God is giving you, then you are not to harden your heart or shut your hand from your poor brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_8","006_15_8","DEU","15","8","8","Instead, you are to open your hand to him and freely loan him whatever he needs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_9","006_15_9","DEU","15","9","9","Be careful not to harbor this wicked thought in your heart: “The seventh year, the year of release, is near,” so that you look upon your poor brother begrudgingly and give him nothing. He will cry out to the LORD against you, and you will be guilty of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_10","006_15_10","DEU","15","10","10","Give generously to him, and do not let your heart be grieved when you do so. And because of this the LORD your God will bless you in all your work and in everything to which you put your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_11","006_15_11","DEU","15","11","11","For there will never cease to be poor in the land; that is why I am commanding you to open wide your hand to your brother and to the poor and needy in your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_12","006_15_12","DEU","15","12","12","If a fellow Hebrew, a man or a woman, is sold to you and serves you six years, then in the seventh year you must set him free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_13","006_15_13","DEU","15","13","13","And when you release him, do not send him away empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_14","006_15_14","DEU","15","14","14","You are to furnish him liberally from your flock, your threshing floor, and your winepress. You shall give to him as the LORD your God has blessed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_15","006_15_15","DEU","15","15","15","Remember that you were slaves in the land of Egypt, and the LORD your God redeemed you; that is why I am giving you this command today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_16","006_15_16","DEU","15","16","16","But if your servant says to you, ‘I do not want to leave you,’ because he loves you and your household and is well off with you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_17","006_15_17","DEU","15","17","17","then take an awl and pierce it through his ear into the door, and he will become your servant for life. And treat your maidservant the same way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_18","006_15_18","DEU","15","18","18","Do not regard it as a hardship to set your servant free, because his six years of service were worth twice the wages of a hired hand. And the LORD your God will bless you in all you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_19","006_15_19","DEU","15","19","19","You must set apart to the LORD your God every firstborn male produced by your herds and flocks. You are not to put the firstborn of your oxen to work, nor are you to shear the firstborn of your flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_20","006_15_20","DEU","15","20","20","Each year you and your household are to eat it before the LORD your God in the place the LORD will choose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_21","006_15_21","DEU","15","21","21","But if an animal has a defect, is lame or blind, or has any serious flaw, you must not sacrifice it to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_22","006_15_22","DEU","15","22","22","Eat it within your gates; both the ceremonially unclean and clean may eat it as they would a gazelle or a deer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT15_23","006_15_23","DEU","15","23","23","But you must not eat the blood; pour it on the ground like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_1","006_16_1","DEU","16","1","1","Observe the month of Abib and celebrate the Passover to the LORD your God, because in the month of Abib the LORD your God brought you out of Egypt by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_2","006_16_2","DEU","16","2","2","You are to offer to the LORD your God the Passover sacrifice from the herd or flock in the place the LORD will choose as a dwelling for His Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_3","006_16_3","DEU","16","3","3","You must not eat leavened bread with it; for seven days you are to eat with it unleavened bread, the bread of affliction, because you left the land of Egypt in haste—so that you may remember for the rest of your life the day you left the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_4","006_16_4","DEU","16","4","4","No leaven is to be found in all your land for seven days, and none of the meat you sacrifice in the evening of the first day shall remain until morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_5","006_16_5","DEU","16","5","5","You are not to sacrifice the Passover animal in any of the towns that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_6","006_16_6","DEU","16","6","6","You must only offer the Passover sacrifice at the place the LORD your God will choose as a dwelling for His Name. Do this in the evening as the sun sets, at the same time you departed from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_7","006_16_7","DEU","16","7","7","And you shall roast it and eat it in the place the LORD your God will choose, and in the morning you shall return to your tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_8","006_16_8","DEU","16","8","8","For six days you must eat unleavened bread, and on the seventh day you shall hold a solemn assembly to the LORD your God, and you must not do any work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_9","006_16_9","DEU","16","9","9","You are to count off seven weeks from the time you first put the sickle to the standing grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_10","006_16_10","DEU","16","10","10","And you shall celebrate the Feast of Weeks to the LORD your God with a freewill offering that you give in proportion to how the LORD your God has blessed you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_11","006_16_11","DEU","16","11","11","and you shall rejoice before the LORD your God in the place He will choose as a dwelling for His Name—you, your sons and daughters, your menservants and maidservants, and the Levite within your gates, as well as the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widows among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_12","006_16_12","DEU","16","12","12","Remember that you were slaves in Egypt, and carefully follow these statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_13","006_16_13","DEU","16","13","13","You are to celebrate the Feast of Tabernacles for seven days after you have gathered the produce of your threshing floor and your winepress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_14","006_16_14","DEU","16","14","14","And you shall rejoice in your feast—you, your sons and daughters, your menservants and maidservants, and the Levite, as well as the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widows among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_15","006_16_15","DEU","16","15","15","For seven days you shall celebrate a feast to the LORD your God in the place He will choose, because the LORD your God will bless you in all your produce and in all the work of your hands, so that your joy will be complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_16","006_16_16","DEU","16","16","16","Three times a year all your men are to appear before the LORD your God in the place He will choose: at the Feast of Unleavened Bread, the Feast of Weeks, and the Feast of Tabernacles. No one should appear before the LORD empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_17","006_16_17","DEU","16","17","17","Everyone must appear with a gift as he is able, according to the blessing the LORD your God has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_18","006_16_18","DEU","16","18","18","You are to appoint judges and officials for your tribes in every town that the LORD your God is giving you. They are to judge the people with righteous judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_19","006_16_19","DEU","16","19","19","Do not deny justice or show partiality. Do not accept a bribe, for a bribe blinds the eyes of the wise and twists the words of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_20","006_16_20","DEU","16","20","20","Pursue justice, and justice alone, so that you may live, and you may possess the land that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_21","006_16_21","DEU","16","21","21","Do not set up any wooden Asherah pole next to the altar you will build for the LORD your God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT16_22","006_16_22","DEU","16","22","22","and do not set up for yourselves a sacred pillar, which the LORD your God hates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_1","006_17_1","DEU","17","1","1","You shall not sacrifice to the LORD your God an ox or a sheep with any defect or serious flaw, for that is detestable to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_2","006_17_2","DEU","17","2","2","If a man or woman among you in one of the towns that the LORD your God gives you is found doing evil in the sight of the LORD your God by transgressing His covenant ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_3","006_17_3","DEU","17","3","3","and going to worship other gods, bowing down to them or to the sun or moon or any of the host of heaven—which I have forbidden— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_4","006_17_4","DEU","17","4","4","and if it is reported and you hear about it, you must investigate it thoroughly. If the report is true and such an abomination has happened in Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_5","006_17_5","DEU","17","5","5","you must bring out to your gates the man or woman who has done this evil thing, and you must stone that person to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_6","006_17_6","DEU","17","6","6","On the testimony of two or three witnesses a man shall be put to death, but he shall not be executed on the testimony of a lone witness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_7","006_17_7","DEU","17","7","7","The hands of the witnesses shall be the first in putting him to death, and after that, the hands of all the people. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_8","006_17_8","DEU","17","8","8","If a case is too difficult for you to judge, whether the controversy within your gates is regarding bloodshed, lawsuits, or assaults, you must go up to the place the LORD your God will choose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_9","006_17_9","DEU","17","9","9","You are to go to the Levitical priests and to the judge who presides at that time. Inquire of them, and they will give you a verdict in the case. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_10","006_17_10","DEU","17","10","10","You must abide by the verdict they give you at the place the LORD will choose. Be careful to do everything they instruct you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_11","006_17_11","DEU","17","11","11","according to the terms of law they give and the verdict they proclaim. Do not turn aside to the right or to the left from the decision they declare to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_12","006_17_12","DEU","17","12","12","But the man who acts presumptuously, refusing to listen either to the priest who stands there to serve the LORD your God, or to the judge, must be put to death. You must purge the evil from Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_13","006_17_13","DEU","17","13","13","Then all the people will hear and be afraid, and will no longer behave arrogantly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_14","006_17_14","DEU","17","14","14","When you enter the land that the LORD your God is giving you and have taken possession of it and settled in it, and you say, “Let us set a king over us like all the nations around us,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_15","006_17_15","DEU","17","15","15","you are to appoint over yourselves the king whom the LORD your God shall choose. Appoint a king from among your brothers; you are not to set over yourselves a foreigner who is not one of your brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_16","006_17_16","DEU","17","16","16","But the king must not acquire many horses for himself or send the people back to Egypt to acquire more horses, for the LORD has said, ‘You are never to go back that way again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_17","006_17_17","DEU","17","17","17","He must not take many wives for himself, lest his heart go astray. He must not accumulate for himself large amounts of silver and gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_18","006_17_18","DEU","17","18","18","When he is seated on his royal throne, he must write for himself a copy of this instruction on a scroll in the presence of the Levitical priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_19","006_17_19","DEU","17","19","19","It is to remain with him, and he is to read from it all the days of his life, so that he may learn to fear the LORD his God by carefully observing all the words of this instruction and these statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT17_20","006_17_20","DEU","17","20","20","Then his heart will not be exalted above his countrymen, and he will not turn aside from the commandment, to the right or to the left, in order that he and his sons may reign many years over his kingdom in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_1","006_18_1","DEU","18","1","1","The Levitical priests—indeed the whole tribe of Levi—shall have no portion or inheritance with Israel. They are to eat the food offerings to the LORD; that is their inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_2","006_18_2","DEU","18","2","2","Although they have no inheritance among their brothers, the LORD is their inheritance, as He promised them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_3","006_18_3","DEU","18","3","3","This shall be the priests’ share from the people who offer a sacrifice, whether a bull or a sheep: the priests are to be given the shoulder, the jowls, and the stomach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_4","006_18_4","DEU","18","4","4","You are to give them the firstfruits of your grain, new wine, and oil, and the first wool sheared from your flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_5","006_18_5","DEU","18","5","5","For the LORD your God has chosen Levi and his sons out of all your tribes to stand and minister in His name for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_6","006_18_6","DEU","18","6","6","Now if a Levite moves from any town of residence throughout Israel and comes in all earnestness to the place the LORD will choose, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_7","006_18_7","DEU","18","7","7","then he shall serve in the name of the LORD his God like all his fellow Levites who stand there before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_8","006_18_8","DEU","18","8","8","They shall eat equal portions, even though he has received money from the sale of his father’s estate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_9","006_18_9","DEU","18","9","9","When you enter the land that the LORD your God is giving you, do not imitate the detestable ways of the nations there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_10","006_18_10","DEU","18","10","10","Let no one be found among you who sacrifices his son or daughter in the fire, practices divination or conjury, interprets omens, practices sorcery, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_11","006_18_11","DEU","18","11","11","casts spells, consults a medium or spiritist, or inquires of the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_12","006_18_12","DEU","18","12","12","For whoever does these things is detestable to the LORD. And because of these detestable things, the LORD your God is driving out the nations before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_13","006_18_13","DEU","18","13","13","You must be blameless before the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_14","006_18_14","DEU","18","14","14","Though these nations, which you will dispossess, listen to conjurers and diviners, the LORD your God has not permitted you to do so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_15","006_18_15","DEU","18","15","15","The LORD your God will raise up for you a prophet like me from among your brothers. You must listen to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_16","006_18_16","DEU","18","16","16","This is what you asked of the LORD your God at Horeb on the day of the assembly, when you said, “Let us not hear the voice of the LORD our God or see this great fire anymore, so that we will not die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_17","006_18_17","DEU","18","17","17","Then the LORD said to me, “They have spoken well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_18","006_18_18","DEU","18","18","18","I will raise up for them a prophet like you from among their brothers. I will put My words in his mouth, and he will tell them everything I command him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_19","006_18_19","DEU","18","19","19","And I will hold accountable anyone who does not listen to My words that the prophet speaks in My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_20","006_18_20","DEU","18","20","20","But if any prophet dares to speak a message in My name that I have not commanded him to speak, or to speak in the name of other gods, that prophet must be put to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_21","006_18_21","DEU","18","21","21","You may ask in your heart, “How can we recognize a message that the LORD has not spoken?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT18_22","006_18_22","DEU","18","22","22","When a prophet speaks in the name of the LORD and the message does not come to pass or come true, that is a message the LORD has not spoken. The prophet has spoken presumptuously. Do not be afraid of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_1","006_19_1","DEU","19","1","1","When the LORD your God has cut off the nations whose land He is giving you, and when you have driven them out and settled in their cities and houses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_2","006_19_2","DEU","19","2","2","then you are to set apart for yourselves three cities within the land that the LORD your God is giving you to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_3","006_19_3","DEU","19","3","3","You are to build roads for yourselves and divide into three regions the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, so that any manslayer can flee to these cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_4","006_19_4","DEU","19","4","4","Now this is the situation regarding the manslayer who flees to one of these cities to save his life, having killed his neighbor accidentally, without intending to harm him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_5","006_19_5","DEU","19","5","5","If he goes into the forest with his neighbor to cut timber and swings his axe to chop down a tree, but the blade flies off the handle and strikes and kills his neighbor, he may flee to one of these cities to save his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_6","006_19_6","DEU","19","6","6","Otherwise, the avenger of blood might pursue the manslayer in a rage, overtake him if the distance is great, and strike him dead though he did not deserve to die, since he did not intend any harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_7","006_19_7","DEU","19","7","7","This is why I am commanding you to set apart for yourselves three cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_8","006_19_8","DEU","19","8","8","And if the LORD your God enlarges your territory, as He swore to your fathers, and gives you all the land He promised them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_9","006_19_9","DEU","19","9","9","and if you carefully keep all these commandments I am giving you today, loving the LORD your God and walking in His ways at all times, then you are to add three more cities to these three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_10","006_19_10","DEU","19","10","10","Thus innocent blood will not be shed in the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, so that you will not be guilty of bloodshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_11","006_19_11","DEU","19","11","11","If, however, a man hates his neighbor and lies in wait, attacks him and kills him, and then flees to one of these cities, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_12","006_19_12","DEU","19","12","12","the elders of his city must send for him, bring him back, and hand him over to the avenger of blood to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_13","006_19_13","DEU","19","13","13","You must show him no pity. You are to purge from Israel the guilt of shedding innocent blood, that it may go well with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_14","006_19_14","DEU","19","14","14","You must not move your neighbor’s boundary marker, which was set up by your ancestors to mark the inheritance you shall receive in the land that the LORD your God is giving you to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_15","006_19_15","DEU","19","15","15","A lone witness is not sufficient to establish any wrongdoing or sin against a man, regardless of what offense he may have committed. A matter must be established by the testimony of two or three witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_16","006_19_16","DEU","19","16","16","If a false witness testifies against someone, accusing him of a crime, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_17","006_19_17","DEU","19","17","17","both parties to the dispute must stand in the presence of the LORD, before the priests and judges who are in office at that time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_18","006_19_18","DEU","19","18","18","The judges shall investigate thoroughly, and if the witness is proven to be a liar who has falsely accused his brother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_19","006_19_19","DEU","19","19","19","you must do to him as he intended to do to his brother. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_20","006_19_20","DEU","19","20","20","Then the rest of the people will hear and be afraid, and they will never again do anything so evil among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT19_21","006_19_21","DEU","19","21","21","You must show no pity: life for life, eye for eye, tooth for tooth, hand for hand, and foot for foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_1","006_20_1","DEU","20","1","1","When you go out to war against your enemies and see horses, chariots, and an army larger than yours, do not be afraid of them; for the LORD your God, who brought you out of the land of Egypt, is with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_2","006_20_2","DEU","20","2","2","When you are about to go into battle, the priest is to come forward and address the army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_3","006_20_3","DEU","20","3","3","saying to them, “Hear, O Israel, today you are going into battle with your enemies. Do not be fainthearted or afraid; do not be alarmed or terrified because of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_4","006_20_4","DEU","20","4","4","For the LORD your God goes with you to fight for you against your enemies, to give you the victory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_5","006_20_5","DEU","20","5","5","Furthermore, the officers are to address the army, saying, “Has any man built a new house and not dedicated it? Let him return home, or he may die in battle and another man dedicate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_6","006_20_6","DEU","20","6","6","Has any man planted a vineyard and not begun to enjoy its fruit? Let him return home, or he may die in battle and another man enjoy its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_7","006_20_7","DEU","20","7","7","Has any man become pledged to a woman and not married her? Let him return home, or he may die in battle and another man marry her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_8","006_20_8","DEU","20","8","8","Then the officers shall speak further to the army, saying, “Is any man afraid or fainthearted? Let him return home, so that the hearts of his brothers will not melt like his own.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_9","006_20_9","DEU","20","9","9","When the officers have finished addressing the army, they are to appoint commanders to lead it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_10","006_20_10","DEU","20","10","10","When you approach a city to fight against it, you are to make an offer of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_11","006_20_11","DEU","20","11","11","If they accept your offer of peace and open their gates, all the people there will become forced laborers to serve you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_12","006_20_12","DEU","20","12","12","But if they refuse to make peace with you and wage war against you, lay siege to that city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_13","006_20_13","DEU","20","13","13","When the LORD your God has delivered it into your hand, you must put every male to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_14","006_20_14","DEU","20","14","14","But the women, children, livestock, and whatever else is in the city—all its spoil—you may take as plunder, and you shall use the spoil of your enemies that the LORD your God gives you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_15","006_20_15","DEU","20","15","15","This is how you are to treat all the cities that are far away from you and do not belong to the nations nearby. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_16","006_20_16","DEU","20","16","16","However, in the cities of the nations that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, you must not leave alive anything that breathes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_17","006_20_17","DEU","20","17","17","For you must devote them to complete destruction—the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites—as the LORD your God has commanded you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_18","006_20_18","DEU","20","18","18","so that they cannot teach you to do all the detestable things they do for their gods, and so cause you to sin against the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_19","006_20_19","DEU","20","19","19","When you lay siege to a city for an extended time while fighting against it to capture it, you must not destroy its trees by putting an axe to them, because you can eat their fruit. You must not cut them down. Are the trees of the field human, that you should besiege them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT20_20","006_20_20","DEU","20","20","20","But you may destroy the trees that you know do not produce fruit. Use them to build siege works against the city that is waging war against you, until it falls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_1","006_21_1","DEU","21","1","1","If one is found slain, lying in a field in the land that the LORD your God is giving you to possess, and it is not known who killed him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_2","006_21_2","DEU","21","2","2","your elders and judges must come out and measure the distance from the victim to the neighboring cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_3","006_21_3","DEU","21","3","3","Then the elders of the city nearest the victim shall take a heifer that has never been yoked or used for work, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_4","006_21_4","DEU","21","4","4","bring the heifer to a valley with running water that has not been plowed or sown, and break its neck there by the stream. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_5","006_21_5","DEU","21","5","5","And the priests, the sons of Levi, shall come forward, for the LORD your God has chosen them to serve Him and pronounce blessings in His name and to give a ruling in every dispute and case of assault. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_6","006_21_6","DEU","21","6","6","Then all the elders of the city nearest the victim shall wash their hands by the stream over the heifer whose neck has been broken, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_7","006_21_7","DEU","21","7","7","and they shall declare, “Our hands did not shed this blood, nor did our eyes see it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_8","006_21_8","DEU","21","8","8","Accept this atonement, O LORD, for Your people Israel whom You have redeemed, and do not hold the shedding of innocent blood against them.” And the bloodshed will be atoned for. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_9","006_21_9","DEU","21","9","9","So you shall purge from among you the guilt of shedding innocent blood, since you have done what is right in the eyes of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_10","006_21_10","DEU","21","10","10","When you go to war against your enemies and the LORD your God delivers them into your hand and you take them captive, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_11","006_21_11","DEU","21","11","11","if you see a beautiful woman among them, and you desire her and want to take her as your wife, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_12","006_21_12","DEU","21","12","12","then you shall bring her into your house. She must shave her head, trim her nails, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_13","006_21_13","DEU","21","13","13","and put aside the clothing of her captivity. After she has lived in your house a full month and mourned her father and mother, you may have relations with her and be her husband, and she shall be your wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_14","006_21_14","DEU","21","14","14","And if you are not pleased with her, you are to let her go wherever she wishes. But you must not sell her for money or treat her as a slave, since you have dishonored her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_15","006_21_15","DEU","21","15","15","If a man has two wives, one beloved and the other unloved, and both bear him sons, but the unloved wife has the firstborn son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_16","006_21_16","DEU","21","16","16","when that man assigns his inheritance to his sons he must not appoint the son of the beloved wife as the firstborn over the son of the unloved wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_17","006_21_17","DEU","21","17","17","Instead, he must acknowledge the firstborn, the son of his unloved wife, by giving him a double portion of all that he has. For that son is the firstfruits of his father’s strength; the right of the firstborn belongs to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_18","006_21_18","DEU","21","18","18","If a man has a stubborn and rebellious son who does not obey his father and mother and does not listen to them when disciplined, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_19","006_21_19","DEU","21","19","19","his father and mother are to lay hold of him and bring him to the elders of his city, to the gate of his hometown, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_20","006_21_20","DEU","21","20","20","and say to the elders, “This son of ours is stubborn and rebellious; he does not obey us. He is a glutton and a drunkard.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_21","006_21_21","DEU","21","21","21","Then all the men of his city will stone him to death. So you must purge the evil from among you, and all Israel will hear and be afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_22","006_21_22","DEU","21","22","22","If a man has committed a sin worthy of death, and he is executed, and you hang his body on a tree, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT21_23","006_21_23","DEU","21","23","23","you must not leave the body on the tree overnight, but you must be sure to bury him that day, because anyone who is hung on a tree is under God’s curse. You must not defile the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_1","006_22_1","DEU","22","1","1","If you see your brother’s ox or sheep straying, you must not ignore it; be sure to return it to your brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_2","006_22_2","DEU","22","2","2","If your brother does not live near you, or if you do not know who he is, you are to take the animal home to remain with you until your brother comes seeking it; then you can return it to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_3","006_22_3","DEU","22","3","3","And you shall do the same for his donkey, his cloak, or anything your brother has lost and you have found. You must not ignore it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_4","006_22_4","DEU","22","4","4","If you see your brother’s donkey or ox fallen on the road, you must not ignore it; you must help him lift it up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_5","006_22_5","DEU","22","5","5","A woman must not wear men’s clothing, and a man must not wear women’s clothing, for whoever does these things is detestable to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_6","006_22_6","DEU","22","6","6","If you come across a bird’s nest with chicks or eggs, either in a tree or on the ground along the road, and the mother is sitting on the chicks or eggs, you must not take the mother along with the young. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_7","006_22_7","DEU","22","7","7","You may take the young, but be sure to let the mother go, so that it may be well with you and that you may prolong your days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_8","006_22_8","DEU","22","8","8","If you build a new house, you are to construct a railing around your roof, so that you do not bring bloodguilt on your house if someone falls from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_9","006_22_9","DEU","22","9","9","Do not plant your vineyard with two types of seed; if you do, the entire harvest will be defiled—both the crop you plant and the fruit of your vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_10","006_22_10","DEU","22","10","10","Do not plow with an ox and a donkey yoked together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_11","006_22_11","DEU","22","11","11","Do not wear clothes of wool and linen woven together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_12","006_22_12","DEU","22","12","12","You are to make tassels on the four corners of the cloak you wear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_13","006_22_13","DEU","22","13","13","Suppose a man marries a woman, has relations with her, and comes to hate her, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_14","006_22_14","DEU","22","14","14","and he then accuses her of shameful conduct and gives her a bad name, saying, “I married this woman and had relations with her, but I discovered she was not a virgin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_15","006_22_15","DEU","22","15","15","Then the young woman’s father and mother shall bring the proof of her virginity to the city elders at the gate ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_16","006_22_16","DEU","22","16","16","and say to the elders, “I gave my daughter in marriage to this man, but he has come to hate her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_17","006_22_17","DEU","22","17","17","And now he has accused her of shameful conduct, saying, ‘I discovered that your daughter was not a virgin.’ But here is the proof of her virginity.” And they shall spread out the cloth before the city elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_18","006_22_18","DEU","22","18","18","Then the elders of that city shall take the man and punish him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_19","006_22_19","DEU","22","19","19","They are also to fine him a hundred shekels of silver and give them to the young woman’s father, because this man has given a virgin of Israel a bad name. And she shall remain his wife; he must not divorce her as long as he lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_20","006_22_20","DEU","22","20","20","If, however, this accusation is true, and no proof of the young woman’s virginity can be found, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_21","006_22_21","DEU","22","21","21","she shall be brought to the door of her father’s house, and there the men of her city will stone her to death. For she has committed an outrage in Israel by being promiscuous in her father’s house. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_22","006_22_22","DEU","22","22","22","If a man is found lying with another man’s wife, both the man who slept with her and the woman must die. You must purge the evil from Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_23","006_22_23","DEU","22","23","23","If there is a virgin pledged in marriage to a man, and another man encounters her in the city and sleeps with her, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_24","006_22_24","DEU","22","24","24","you must take both of them out to the gate of that city and stone them to death—the young woman because she did not cry out in the city, and the man because he has violated his neighbor’s wife. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_25","006_22_25","DEU","22","25","25","But if the man encounters a betrothed woman in the open country, and he overpowers her and lies with her, only the man who has done this must die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_26","006_22_26","DEU","22","26","26","Do nothing to the young woman, because she has committed no sin worthy of death. This case is just like one in which a man attacks his neighbor and murders him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_27","006_22_27","DEU","22","27","27","When he found her in the field, the betrothed woman cried out, but there was no one to save her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_28","006_22_28","DEU","22","28","28","If a man encounters a virgin who is not pledged in marriage, and he seizes her and lies with her, and they are discovered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_29","006_22_29","DEU","22","29","29","then the man who lay with her must pay the young woman’s father fifty shekels of silver, and she must become his wife because he has violated her. He must not divorce her as long as he lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT22_30","006_22_30","DEU","22","30","30","A man is not to marry his father’s wife, so that he will not dishonor his father’s marriage bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_1","006_23_1","DEU","23","1","1","No man with crushed or severed genitals may enter the assembly of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_2","006_23_2","DEU","23","2","2","No one of illegitimate birth may enter the assembly of the LORD, nor may any of his descendants, even to the tenth generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_3","006_23_3","DEU","23","3","3","No Ammonite or Moabite or any of their descendants may enter the assembly of the LORD, even to the tenth generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_4","006_23_4","DEU","23","4","4","For they did not meet you with food and water on your way out of Egypt, and they hired Balaam son of Beor from Pethor in Aram-naharaim to curse you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_5","006_23_5","DEU","23","5","5","Yet the LORD your God would not listen to Balaam, and the LORD your God turned the curse into a blessing for you, because the LORD your God loves you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_6","006_23_6","DEU","23","6","6","You are not to seek peace or prosperity from them as long as you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_7","006_23_7","DEU","23","7","7","Do not despise an Edomite, for he is your brother. Do not despise an Egyptian, because you lived as a foreigner in his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_8","006_23_8","DEU","23","8","8","The third generation of children born to them may enter the assembly of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_9","006_23_9","DEU","23","9","9","When you are encamped against your enemies, then you shall keep yourself from every wicked thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_10","006_23_10","DEU","23","10","10","If any man among you becomes unclean because of a nocturnal emission, he must leave the camp and stay outside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_11","006_23_11","DEU","23","11","11","When evening approaches, he must wash with water, and when the sun sets he may return to the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_12","006_23_12","DEU","23","12","12","You must have a place outside the camp to go and relieve yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_13","006_23_13","DEU","23","13","13","And you must have a digging tool in your equipment so that when you relieve yourself you can dig a hole and cover up your excrement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_14","006_23_14","DEU","23","14","14","For the LORD your God walks throughout your camp to protect you and deliver your enemies to you. Your camp must be holy, lest He see anything unclean among you and turn away from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_15","006_23_15","DEU","23","15","15","Do not return a slave to his master if he has taken refuge with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_16","006_23_16","DEU","23","16","16","Let him live among you wherever he chooses, in the town of his pleasing. Do not oppress him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_17","006_23_17","DEU","23","17","17","No daughter or son of Israel is to be a shrine prostitute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_18","006_23_18","DEU","23","18","18","You must not bring the wages of a prostitute, whether female or male, into the house of the LORD your God to fulfill any vow, because both are detestable to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_19","006_23_19","DEU","23","19","19","Do not charge your brother interest on money, food, or any other type of loan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_20","006_23_20","DEU","23","20","20","You may charge a foreigner interest, but not your brother, so that the LORD your God may bless you in everything to which you put your hand in the land that you are entering to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_21","006_23_21","DEU","23","21","21","If you make a vow to the LORD your God, do not be slow to keep it, because He will surely require it of you, and you will be guilty of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_22","006_23_22","DEU","23","22","22","But if you refrain from making a vow, you will not be guilty of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_23","006_23_23","DEU","23","23","23","Be careful to follow through on what comes from your lips, because you have freely vowed to the LORD your God with your own mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_24","006_23_24","DEU","23","24","24","When you enter your neighbor’s vineyard, you may eat your fill of grapes, but you must not put any in your basket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT23_25","006_23_25","DEU","23","25","25","When you enter your neighbor’s grainfield, you may pluck the heads of grain with your hand, but you must not put a sickle to your neighbor’s grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_1","006_24_1","DEU","24","1","1","If a man marries a woman, but she becomes displeasing to him because he finds some indecency in her, he may write her a certificate of divorce, hand it to her, and send her away from his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_2","006_24_2","DEU","24","2","2","If, after leaving his house, she goes and becomes another man’s wife, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_3","006_24_3","DEU","24","3","3","and the second man hates her, writes her a certificate of divorce, hands it to her, and sends her away from his house, or if he dies, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_4","006_24_4","DEU","24","4","4","then the husband who divorced her first may not remarry her after she has been defiled, for that is an abomination to the LORD. You must not bring sin upon the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_5","006_24_5","DEU","24","5","5","If a man is newly married, he must not be sent to war or be pressed into any duty. For one year he is free to stay at home and bring joy to the wife he has married. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_6","006_24_6","DEU","24","6","6","Do not take a pair of millstones or even an upper millstone as security for a debt, because that would be taking one’s livelihood as security. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_7","006_24_7","DEU","24","7","7","If a man is caught kidnapping one of his Israelite brothers, whether he treats him as a slave or sells him, the kidnapper must die. So you must purge the evil from among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_8","006_24_8","DEU","24","8","8","In cases of infectious skin diseases, be careful to diligently follow everything the Levitical priests instruct you. Be careful to do as I have commanded them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_9","006_24_9","DEU","24","9","9","Remember what the LORD your God did to Miriam on the journey after you came out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_10","006_24_10","DEU","24","10","10","When you lend anything to your neighbor, do not enter his house to collect security. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_11","006_24_11","DEU","24","11","11","You are to stand outside while the man to whom you are lending brings the security out to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_12","006_24_12","DEU","24","12","12","If he is a poor man, you must not go to sleep with the security in your possession; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_13","006_24_13","DEU","24","13","13","be sure to return it to him by sunset, so that he may sleep in his own cloak and bless you, and this will be credited to you as righteousness before the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_14","006_24_14","DEU","24","14","14","Do not oppress a hired hand who is poor and needy, whether he is a brother or a foreigner residing in one of your towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_15","006_24_15","DEU","24","15","15","You are to pay his wages each day before sunset, because he is poor and depends on them. Otherwise he may cry out to the LORD against you, and you will be guilty of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_16","006_24_16","DEU","24","16","16","Fathers shall not be put to death for their children, nor children for their fathers; each is to die for his own sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_17","006_24_17","DEU","24","17","17","Do not deny justice to the foreigner or the fatherless, and do not take a widow’s cloak as security. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_18","006_24_18","DEU","24","18","18","Remember that you were slaves in Egypt, and the LORD your God redeemed you from that place. Therefore I am commanding you to do this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_19","006_24_19","DEU","24","19","19","If you are harvesting in your field and forget a sheaf there, do not go back to get it. It is to be left for the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow, so that the LORD your God may bless you in all the work of your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_20","006_24_20","DEU","24","20","20","When you beat the olives from your trees, you must not go over the branches again. What remains will be for the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_21","006_24_21","DEU","24","21","21","When you gather the grapes of your vineyard, you must not go over the vines again. What remains will be for the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT24_22","006_24_22","DEU","24","22","22","Remember that you were slaves in the land of Egypt. Therefore I am commanding you to do this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_1","006_25_1","DEU","25","1","1","If there is a dispute between men, they are to go to court to be judged, so that the innocent may be acquitted and the guilty condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_2","006_25_2","DEU","25","2","2","If the guilty man deserves to be beaten, the judge shall have him lie down and be flogged in his presence with the number of lashes his crime warrants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_3","006_25_3","DEU","25","3","3","He may receive no more than forty lashes, lest your brother be beaten any more than that and be degraded in your sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_4","006_25_4","DEU","25","4","4","Do not muzzle an ox while it is treading out the grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_5","006_25_5","DEU","25","5","5","When brothers dwell together and one of them dies without a son, the widow must not marry outside the family. Her husband’s brother is to take her as his wife and fulfill the duty of a brother-in-law for her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_6","006_25_6","DEU","25","6","6","The first son she bears will carry on the name of the dead brother, so that his name will not be blotted out from Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_7","006_25_7","DEU","25","7","7","But if the man does not want to marry his brother’s widow, she is to go to the elders at the city gate and say, “My husband’s brother refuses to preserve his brother’s name in Israel. He is not willing to perform the duty of a brother-in-law for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_8","006_25_8","DEU","25","8","8","Then the elders of his city shall summon him and speak with him. If he persists and says, “I do not want to marry her,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_9","006_25_9","DEU","25","9","9","his brother’s widow shall go up to him in the presence of the elders, remove his sandal, spit in his face, and declare, “This is what is done to the man who will not maintain his brother’s line.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_10","006_25_10","DEU","25","10","10","And his family name in Israel will be called “The House of the Unsandaled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_11","006_25_11","DEU","25","11","11","If two men are fighting, and the wife of one comes to rescue her husband from the one striking him, and she reaches out her hand and grabs his genitals, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_12","006_25_12","DEU","25","12","12","you are to cut off her hand. You must show her no pity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_13","006_25_13","DEU","25","13","13","You shall not have two differing weights in your bag, one heavy and one light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_14","006_25_14","DEU","25","14","14","You shall not have two differing measures in your house, one large and one small. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_15","006_25_15","DEU","25","15","15","You must maintain accurate and honest weights and measures, so that you may live long in the land that the LORD your God is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_16","006_25_16","DEU","25","16","16","For everyone who behaves dishonestly in regard to these things is detestable to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_17","006_25_17","DEU","25","17","17","Remember what the Amalekites did to you along your way from Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_18","006_25_18","DEU","25","18","18","how they met you on your journey when you were tired and weary, and they attacked all your stragglers; they had no fear of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT25_19","006_25_19","DEU","25","19","19","When the LORD your God gives you rest from the enemies around you in the land that He is giving you to possess as an inheritance, you are to blot out the memory of Amalek from under heaven. Do not forget! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_1","006_26_1","DEU","26","1","1","When you enter the land that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, and you take possession of it and settle in it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_2","006_26_2","DEU","26","2","2","you are to take some of the firstfruits of all your produce from the soil of the land that the LORD your God is giving you and put them in a basket. Then go to the place the LORD your God will choose as a dwelling for His Name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_3","006_26_3","DEU","26","3","3","to the priest who is serving at that time, and say to him, “I declare today to the LORD your God that I have entered the land that the LORD swore to our fathers to give us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_4","006_26_4","DEU","26","4","4","Then the priest shall take the basket from your hands and place it before the altar of the LORD your God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_5","006_26_5","DEU","26","5","5","and you are to declare before the LORD your God, “My father was a wandering Aramean, and he went down to Egypt few in number and lived there and became a great nation, mighty and numerous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_6","006_26_6","DEU","26","6","6","But the Egyptians mistreated us and afflicted us, putting us to hard labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_7","006_26_7","DEU","26","7","7","So we called out to the LORD, the God of our fathers; and the LORD heard our voice and saw our affliction, toil, and oppression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_8","006_26_8","DEU","26","8","8","Then the LORD brought us out of Egypt with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm, with great terror, signs, and wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_9","006_26_9","DEU","26","9","9","And He brought us to this place and gave us this land, a land flowing with milk and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_10","006_26_10","DEU","26","10","10","And now, behold, I have brought the firstfruits of the land that You, O LORD, have given me.” Then you are to place the basket before the LORD your God and bow down before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_11","006_26_11","DEU","26","11","11","So you shall rejoice—you, the Levite, and the foreigner dwelling among you—in all the good things the LORD your God has given to you and your household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_12","006_26_12","DEU","26","12","12","When you have finished laying aside a tenth of all your produce in the third year, the year of the tithe, you are to give it to the Levite, the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow, that they may eat and be filled within your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_13","006_26_13","DEU","26","13","13","Then you shall declare in the presence of the LORD your God, “I have removed from my house the sacred portion and have given it to the Levite, the foreigner, the fatherless, and the widow, according to all the commandments You have given me. I have not transgressed or forgotten Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_14","006_26_14","DEU","26","14","14","I have not eaten any of the sacred portion while in mourning, or removed any of it while unclean, or offered any of it for the dead. I have obeyed the LORD my God; I have done everything You commanded me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_15","006_26_15","DEU","26","15","15","Look down from Your holy habitation, from heaven, and bless Your people Israel and the land You have given us as You swore to our fathers—a land flowing with milk and honey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_16","006_26_16","DEU","26","16","16","The LORD your God commands you this day to follow these statutes and ordinances. You must be careful to follow them with all your heart and with all your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_17","006_26_17","DEU","26","17","17","Today you have proclaimed that the LORD is your God and that you will walk in His ways, keep His statutes and commandments and ordinances, and listen to His voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_18","006_26_18","DEU","26","18","18","And today the LORD has proclaimed that you are His people and treasured possession as He promised, that you are to keep all His commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT26_19","006_26_19","DEU","26","19","19","that He will set you high in praise and name and honor above all the nations He has made, and that you will be a holy people to the LORD your God, as He has promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_1","006_27_1","DEU","27","1","1","Then Moses and the elders of Israel commanded the people: “Keep all the commandments I am giving you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_2","006_27_2","DEU","27","2","2","And on the day you cross the Jordan into the land that the LORD your God is giving you, set up large stones and coat them with plaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_3","006_27_3","DEU","27","3","3","Write on them all the words of this law when you have crossed over to enter the land that the LORD your God is giving you, a land flowing with milk and honey, just as the LORD, the God of your fathers, has promised you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_4","006_27_4","DEU","27","4","4","And when you have crossed the Jordan, you are to set up these stones on Mount Ebal, as I am commanding you today, and you are to coat them with plaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_5","006_27_5","DEU","27","5","5","Moreover, you are to build there an altar to the LORD your God, an altar of stones. You must not use any iron tool on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_6","006_27_6","DEU","27","6","6","You shall build the altar of the LORD your God with uncut stones and offer upon it burnt offerings to the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_7","006_27_7","DEU","27","7","7","There you are to sacrifice your peace offerings, eating them and rejoicing in the presence of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_8","006_27_8","DEU","27","8","8","And you shall write distinctly upon these stones all the words of this law.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_9","006_27_9","DEU","27","9","9","Then Moses and the Levitical priests spoke to all Israel: “Be silent, O Israel, and listen! This day you have become the people of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_10","006_27_10","DEU","27","10","10","You shall therefore obey the voice of the LORD your God and follow His commandments and statutes I am giving you today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_11","006_27_11","DEU","27","11","11","On that day Moses commanded the people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_12","006_27_12","DEU","27","12","12","“When you have crossed the Jordan, these tribes shall stand on Mount Gerizim to bless the people: Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Joseph, and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_13","006_27_13","DEU","27","13","13","And these tribes shall stand on Mount Ebal to deliver the curse: Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan, and Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_14","006_27_14","DEU","27","14","14","Then the Levites shall proclaim in a loud voice to every Israelite: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_15","006_27_15","DEU","27","15","15","‘Cursed is the man who makes a carved idol or molten image—an abomination to the LORD, the work of the hands of a craftsman—and sets it up in secret.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_16","006_27_16","DEU","27","16","16","‘Cursed is he who dishonors his father or mother.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_17","006_27_17","DEU","27","17","17","‘Cursed is he who moves his neighbor’s boundary stone.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_18","006_27_18","DEU","27","18","18","‘Cursed is he who lets a blind man wander in the road.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_19","006_27_19","DEU","27","19","19","‘Cursed is he who withholds justice from the foreigner, the fatherless, or the widow.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_20","006_27_20","DEU","27","20","20","‘Cursed is he who sleeps with his father’s wife, for he has violated his father’s marriage bed.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_21","006_27_21","DEU","27","21","21","‘Cursed is he who lies with any animal.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_22","006_27_22","DEU","27","22","22","‘Cursed is he who sleeps with his sister, the daughter of his father or the daughter of his mother.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_23","006_27_23","DEU","27","23","23","‘Cursed is he who sleeps with his mother-in-law.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_24","006_27_24","DEU","27","24","24","‘Cursed is he who strikes down his neighbor in secret.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_25","006_27_25","DEU","27","25","25","‘Cursed is he who accepts a bribe to kill an innocent person.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT27_26","006_27_26","DEU","27","26","26","‘Cursed is he who does not put the words of this law into practice.’ And let all the people say, ‘Amen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_1","006_28_1","DEU","28","1","1","“Now if you faithfully obey the voice of the LORD your God and are careful to follow all His commandments I am giving you today, the LORD your God will set you high above all the nations of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_2","006_28_2","DEU","28","2","2","And all these blessings will come upon you and overtake you, if you will obey the voice of the LORD your God: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_3","006_28_3","DEU","28","3","3","You will be blessed in the city and blessed in the country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_4","006_28_4","DEU","28","4","4","The fruit of your womb will be blessed, as well as the produce of your land and the offspring of your livestock—the calves of your herds and the lambs of your flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_5","006_28_5","DEU","28","5","5","Your basket and kneading bowl will be blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_6","006_28_6","DEU","28","6","6","You will be blessed when you come in and blessed when you go out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_7","006_28_7","DEU","28","7","7","The LORD will cause the enemies who rise up against you to be defeated before you. They will march out against you in one direction but flee from you in seven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_8","006_28_8","DEU","28","8","8","The LORD will decree a blessing on your barns and on everything to which you put your hand; the LORD your God will bless you in the land He is giving you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_9","006_28_9","DEU","28","9","9","The LORD will establish you as His holy people, just as He has sworn to you, if you keep the commandments of the LORD your God and walk in His ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_10","006_28_10","DEU","28","10","10","Then all the peoples of the earth will see that you are called by the name of the LORD, and they will stand in awe of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_11","006_28_11","DEU","28","11","11","The LORD will make you prosper abundantly—in the fruit of your womb, the offspring of your livestock, and the produce of your land—in the land that the LORD swore to your fathers to give you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_12","006_28_12","DEU","28","12","12","The LORD will open the heavens, His abundant storehouse, to send rain on your land in season and to bless all the work of your hands. You will lend to many nations, but borrow from none. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_13","006_28_13","DEU","28","13","13","The LORD will make you the head and not the tail; you will only move upward and never downward, if you hear and carefully follow the commandments of the LORD your God, which I am giving you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_14","006_28_14","DEU","28","14","14","Do not turn aside to the right or to the left from any of the words I command you today, and do not go after other gods to serve them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_15","006_28_15","DEU","28","15","15","If, however, you do not obey the LORD your God by carefully following all His commandments and statutes I am giving you today, all these curses will come upon you and overtake you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_16","006_28_16","DEU","28","16","16","You will be cursed in the city and cursed in the country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_17","006_28_17","DEU","28","17","17","Your basket and kneading bowl will be cursed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_18","006_28_18","DEU","28","18","18","The fruit of your womb will be cursed, as well as the produce of your land, the calves of your herds, and the lambs of your flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_19","006_28_19","DEU","28","19","19","You will be cursed when you come in and cursed when you go out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_20","006_28_20","DEU","28","20","20","The LORD will send curses upon you, confusion and reproof in all to which you put your hand, until you are destroyed and quickly perish because of the wickedness you have committed in forsaking Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_21","006_28_21","DEU","28","21","21","The LORD will make the plague cling to you until He has exterminated you from the land that you are entering to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_22","006_28_22","DEU","28","22","22","The LORD will strike you with wasting disease, with fever and inflammation, with scorching heat and drought, and with blight and mildew; these will pursue you until you perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_23","006_28_23","DEU","28","23","23","The sky over your head will be bronze, and the earth beneath you iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_24","006_28_24","DEU","28","24","24","The LORD will turn the rain of your land into dust and powder; it will descend on you from the sky until you are destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_25","006_28_25","DEU","28","25","25","The LORD will cause you to be defeated before your enemies. You will march out against them in one direction but flee from them in seven. You will be an object of horror to all the kingdoms of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_26","006_28_26","DEU","28","26","26","Your corpses will be food for all the birds of the air and beasts of the earth, with no one to scare them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_27","006_28_27","DEU","28","27","27","The LORD will afflict you with the boils of Egypt, with tumors and scabs and itch from which you cannot be cured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_28","006_28_28","DEU","28","28","28","The LORD will afflict you with madness, blindness, and confusion of mind, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_29","006_28_29","DEU","28","29","29","and at noon you will grope about like a blind man in the darkness. You will not prosper in your ways. Day after day you will be oppressed and plundered, with no one to save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_30","006_28_30","DEU","28","30","30","You will be pledged in marriage to a woman, but another man will violate her. You will build a house but will not live in it. You will plant a vineyard but will not enjoy its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_31","006_28_31","DEU","28","31","31","Your ox will be slaughtered before your eyes, but you will not eat any of it. Your donkey will be taken away and not returned to you. Your flock will be given to your enemies, and no one will save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_32","006_28_32","DEU","28","32","32","Your sons and daughters will be given to another nation, while your eyes grow weary looking for them day after day, with no power in your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_33","006_28_33","DEU","28","33","33","A people you do not know will eat the produce of your land and of all your toil. All your days you will be oppressed and crushed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_34","006_28_34","DEU","28","34","34","You will be driven mad by the sights you see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_35","006_28_35","DEU","28","35","35","The LORD will afflict you with painful, incurable boils on your knees and thighs, from the soles of your feet to the top of your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_36","006_28_36","DEU","28","36","36","The LORD will bring you and the king you appoint to a nation neither you nor your fathers have known, and there you will worship other gods—gods of wood and stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_37","006_28_37","DEU","28","37","37","You will become an object of horror, scorn, and ridicule among all the nations to which the LORD will drive you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_38","006_28_38","DEU","28","38","38","You will sow much seed in the field but harvest little, because the locusts will consume it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_39","006_28_39","DEU","28","39","39","You will plant and cultivate vineyards, but will neither drink the wine nor gather the grapes, because worms will eat them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_40","006_28_40","DEU","28","40","40","You will have olive trees throughout your territory but will never anoint yourself with oil, because the olives will drop off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_41","006_28_41","DEU","28","41","41","You will father sons and daughters, but they will not remain yours, because they will go into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_42","006_28_42","DEU","28","42","42","Swarms of locusts will consume all your trees and the produce of your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_43","006_28_43","DEU","28","43","43","The foreigner living among you will rise higher and higher above you, while you sink down lower and lower. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_44","006_28_44","DEU","28","44","44","He will lend to you, but you will not lend to him. He will be the head, and you will be the tail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_45","006_28_45","DEU","28","45","45","All these curses will come upon you. They will pursue you and overtake you until you are destroyed, since you did not obey the LORD your God and keep the commandments and statutes He gave you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_46","006_28_46","DEU","28","46","46","These curses will be a sign and a wonder upon you and your descendants forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_47","006_28_47","DEU","28","47","47","Because you did not serve the LORD your God with joy and gladness of heart in all your abundance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_48","006_28_48","DEU","28","48","48","you will serve your enemies the LORD will send against you in famine, thirst, nakedness, and destitution. He will place an iron yoke on your neck until He has destroyed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_49","006_28_49","DEU","28","49","49","The LORD will bring a nation from afar, from the ends of the earth, to swoop down upon you like an eagle—a nation whose language you will not understand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_50","006_28_50","DEU","28","50","50","a ruthless nation with no respect for the old and no pity for the young. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_51","006_28_51","DEU","28","51","51","They will eat the offspring of your livestock and the produce of your land until you are destroyed. They will leave you no grain or new wine or oil, no calves of your herds or lambs of your flocks, until they have caused you to perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_52","006_28_52","DEU","28","52","52","They will besiege all the cities throughout your land, until the high and fortified walls in which you trust have fallen. They will besiege all your cities throughout the land that the LORD your God has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_53","006_28_53","DEU","28","53","53","Then you will eat the fruit of your womb, the flesh of the sons and daughters whom the LORD your God has given you, in the siege and distress that your enemy will inflict on you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_54","006_28_54","DEU","28","54","54","The most gentle and refined man among you will begrudge his brother, the wife he embraces, and the rest of his children who have survived, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_55","006_28_55","DEU","28","55","55","refusing to share with any of them the flesh of his children he will eat because he has nothing left in the siege and distress that your enemy will inflict on you within all your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_56","006_28_56","DEU","28","56","56","The most gentle and refined woman among you, so gentle and refined she would not venture to set the sole of her foot on the ground, will begrudge the husband she embraces and her son and daughter ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_57","006_28_57","DEU","28","57","57","the afterbirth that comes from between her legs and the children she bears, because she will secretly eat them for lack of anything else in the siege and distress that your enemy will inflict on you within your gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_58","006_28_58","DEU","28","58","58","If you are not careful to observe all the words of this law which are written in this book, that you may fear this glorious and awesome name—the LORD your God— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_59","006_28_59","DEU","28","59","59","He will bring upon you and your descendants extraordinary disasters, severe and lasting plagues, and terrible and chronic sicknesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_60","006_28_60","DEU","28","60","60","He will afflict you again with all the diseases you dreaded in Egypt, and they will cling to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_61","006_28_61","DEU","28","61","61","The LORD will also bring upon you every sickness and plague not recorded in this Book of the Law, until you are destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_62","006_28_62","DEU","28","62","62","You who were as numerous as the stars in the sky will be left few in number, because you would not obey the voice of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_63","006_28_63","DEU","28","63","63","Just as it pleased the LORD to make you prosper and multiply, so also it will please Him to annihilate you and destroy you. And you will be uprooted from the land you are entering to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_64","006_28_64","DEU","28","64","64","Then the LORD will scatter you among all the nations, from one end of the earth to the other, and there you will worship other gods, gods of wood and stone, which neither you nor your fathers have known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_65","006_28_65","DEU","28","65","65","Among those nations you will find no repose, not even a resting place for the sole of your foot. There the LORD will give you a trembling heart, failing eyes, and a despairing soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_66","006_28_66","DEU","28","66","66","So your life will hang in doubt before you, and you will be afraid night and day, never certain of survival. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_67","006_28_67","DEU","28","67","67","In the morning you will say, ‘If only it were evening!’ and in the evening you will say, ‘If only it were morning!’—because of the dread in your hearts of the terrifying sights you will see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT28_68","006_28_68","DEU","28","68","68","The LORD will return you to Egypt in ships by a route that I said you should never see again. There you will sell yourselves to your enemies as male and female slaves, but no one will buy you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_1","006_29_1","DEU","29","1","1","These are the words of the covenant that the LORD commanded Moses to make with the Israelites in the land of Moab, in addition to the covenant He had made with them at Horeb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_2","006_29_2","DEU","29","2","2","Moses summoned all Israel and proclaimed to them, “You have seen with your own eyes everything the LORD did in Egypt to Pharaoh, to all his officials, and to all his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_3","006_29_3","DEU","29","3","3","You saw with your own eyes the great trials, and those miraculous signs and wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_4","006_29_4","DEU","29","4","4","Yet to this day the LORD has not given you a mind to understand, eyes to see, or ears to hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_5","006_29_5","DEU","29","5","5","For forty years I led you in the wilderness, yet your clothes and sandals did not wear out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_6","006_29_6","DEU","29","6","6","You ate no bread and drank no wine or strong drink, so that you might know that I am the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_7","006_29_7","DEU","29","7","7","When you reached this place, Sihon king of Heshbon and Og king of Bashan came out against us in battle, but we defeated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_8","006_29_8","DEU","29","8","8","We took their land and gave it as an inheritance to the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_9","006_29_9","DEU","29","9","9","So keep and follow the words of this covenant, that you may prosper in all you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_10","006_29_10","DEU","29","10","10","All of you are standing today before the LORD your God—you leaders of tribes, elders, officials, and all the men of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_11","006_29_11","DEU","29","11","11","your children and wives, and the foreigners in your camps who cut your wood and draw your water— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_12","006_29_12","DEU","29","12","12","so that you may enter into the covenant of the LORD your God, which He is making with you today, and into His oath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_13","006_29_13","DEU","29","13","13","and so that He may establish you today as His people, and He may be your God as He promised you and as He swore to your fathers, to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_14","006_29_14","DEU","29","14","14","I am making this covenant and this oath not only with you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_15","006_29_15","DEU","29","15","15","but also with those who are standing here with us today in the presence of the LORD our God, as well as with those who are not here today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_16","006_29_16","DEU","29","16","16","For you yourselves know how we lived in the land of Egypt and how we passed through the nations on the way here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_17","006_29_17","DEU","29","17","17","You saw the abominations and idols among them made of wood and stone, of silver and gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_18","006_29_18","DEU","29","18","18","Make sure there is no man or woman, clan or tribe among you today whose heart turns away from the LORD our God to go and worship the gods of those nations. Make sure there is no root among you that bears such poisonous and bitter fruit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_19","006_29_19","DEU","29","19","19","because when such a person hears the words of this oath, he invokes a blessing on himself, saying, ‘I will have peace, even though I walk in the stubbornness of my own heart.’ This will bring disaster on the watered land as well as the dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_20","006_29_20","DEU","29","20","20","The LORD will never be willing to forgive him. Instead, His anger and jealousy will burn against that man, and every curse written in this book will fall upon him. The LORD will blot out his name from under heaven ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_21","006_29_21","DEU","29","21","21","and single him out from all the tribes of Israel for disaster, according to all the curses of the covenant written in this Book of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_22","006_29_22","DEU","29","22","22","Then the generation to come—your sons who follow you and the foreigner who comes from a distant land—will see the plagues of the land and the sicknesses the LORD has inflicted on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_23","006_29_23","DEU","29","23","23","All its soil will be a burning waste of sulfur and salt, unsown and unproductive, with no plant growing on it, just like the destruction of Sodom and Gomorrah, Admah and Zeboiim, which the LORD overthrew in His fierce anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_24","006_29_24","DEU","29","24","24","So all the nations will ask, ‘Why has the LORD done such a thing to this land? Why this great outburst of anger?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_25","006_29_25","DEU","29","25","25","And the people will answer, ‘It is because they abandoned the covenant of the LORD, the God of their fathers, which He made with them when He brought them out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_26","006_29_26","DEU","29","26","26","They went and served other gods, and they worshiped gods they had not known—gods that the LORD had not given to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_27","006_29_27","DEU","29","27","27","Therefore the anger of the LORD burned against this land, and He brought upon it every curse written in this book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_28","006_29_28","DEU","29","28","28","The LORD uprooted them from their land in His anger, rage, and great wrath, and He cast them into another land, where they are today.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT29_29","006_29_29","DEU","29","29","29","The secret things belong to the LORD our God, but the things revealed belong to us and to our children forever, so that we may follow all the words of this law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_1","006_30_1","DEU","30","1","1","“When all these things come upon you—the blessings and curses I have set before you—and you call them to mind in all the nations to which the LORD your God has banished you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_2","006_30_2","DEU","30","2","2","and when you and your children return to the LORD your God and obey His voice with all your heart and all your soul according to everything I am giving you today, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_3","006_30_3","DEU","30","3","3","then He will restore you from captivity and have compassion on you and gather you from all the nations to which the LORD your God has scattered you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_4","006_30_4","DEU","30","4","4","Even if you have been banished to the farthest horizon, He will gather you and return you from there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_5","006_30_5","DEU","30","5","5","And the LORD your God will bring you into the land your fathers possessed, and you will take possession of it. He will cause you to prosper and multiply more than your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_6","006_30_6","DEU","30","6","6","The LORD your God will circumcise your hearts and the hearts of your descendants, and you will love Him with all your heart and with all your soul, so that you may live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_7","006_30_7","DEU","30","7","7","Then the LORD your God will put all these curses upon your enemies who hate you and persecute you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_8","006_30_8","DEU","30","8","8","And you will again obey the voice of the LORD and follow all His commandments I am giving you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_9","006_30_9","DEU","30","9","9","So the LORD your God will make you abound in all the work of your hands and in the fruit of your womb, the offspring of your livestock, and the produce of your land. Indeed, the LORD will again delight in your prosperity, as He delighted in that of your fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_10","006_30_10","DEU","30","10","10","if you obey the LORD your God by keeping His commandments and statutes that are written in this Book of the Law, and if you turn to Him with all your heart and with all your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_11","006_30_11","DEU","30","11","11","For this commandment I give you today is not too difficult for you or beyond your reach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_12","006_30_12","DEU","30","12","12","It is not in heaven, that you should need to ask, ‘Who will ascend into heaven to get it for us and proclaim it, that we may obey it?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_13","006_30_13","DEU","30","13","13","And it is not beyond the sea, that you should need to ask, ‘Who will cross the sea to get it for us and proclaim it, that we may obey it?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_14","006_30_14","DEU","30","14","14","But the word is very near you; it is in your mouth and in your heart, so that you may obey it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_15","006_30_15","DEU","30","15","15","See, I have set before you today life and prosperity, as well as death and disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_16","006_30_16","DEU","30","16","16","For I am commanding you today to love the LORD your God, to walk in His ways, and to keep His commandments, statutes, and ordinances, so that you may live and increase, and the LORD your God may bless you in the land that you are entering to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_17","006_30_17","DEU","30","17","17","But if your heart turns away and you do not listen, but are drawn away to bow down to other gods and worship them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_18","006_30_18","DEU","30","18","18","I declare to you today that you will surely perish; you shall not prolong your days in the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_19","006_30_19","DEU","30","19","19","I call heaven and earth as witnesses against you today that I have set before you life and death, blessing and cursing. Therefore choose life, so that you and your descendants may live, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT30_20","006_30_20","DEU","30","20","20","and that you may love the LORD your God, obey Him, and hold fast to Him. For He is your life, and He will prolong your life in the land that the LORD swore to give to your fathers, to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_1","006_31_1","DEU","31","1","1","When Moses had finished speaking these words to all Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_2","006_31_2","DEU","31","2","2","he said to them, “I am now a hundred and twenty years old; I am no longer able to come and go, and the LORD has said to me, ‘You shall not cross the Jordan.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_3","006_31_3","DEU","31","3","3","The LORD your God Himself will cross over ahead of you. He will destroy these nations before you, and you will dispossess them. Joshua will cross ahead of you, as the LORD has said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_4","006_31_4","DEU","31","4","4","And the LORD will do to them as He did to Sihon and Og, the kings of the Amorites, when He destroyed them along with their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_5","006_31_5","DEU","31","5","5","The LORD will deliver them over to you, and you must do to them exactly as I have commanded you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_6","006_31_6","DEU","31","6","6","Be strong and courageous; do not be afraid or terrified of them, for it is the LORD your God who goes with you; He will never leave you nor forsake you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_7","006_31_7","DEU","31","7","7","Then Moses called for Joshua and said to him in the presence of all Israel, “Be strong and courageous, for you will go with this people into the land that the LORD swore to their fathers to give them, and you shall give it to them as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_8","006_31_8","DEU","31","8","8","The LORD Himself goes before you; He will be with you. He will never leave you nor forsake you. Do not be afraid or discouraged.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_9","006_31_9","DEU","31","9","9","So Moses wrote down this law and gave it to the priests, the sons of Levi, who carried the ark of the covenant of the LORD, and to all the elders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_10","006_31_10","DEU","31","10","10","Then Moses commanded them, “At the end of every seven years, at the appointed time in the year of remission of debt, during the Feast of Tabernacles, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_11","006_31_11","DEU","31","11","11","when all Israel comes before the LORD your God at the place He will choose, you are to read this law in the hearing of all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_12","006_31_12","DEU","31","12","12","Assemble the people—men, women, children, and the foreigners within your gates—so that they may listen and learn to fear the LORD your God and to follow carefully all the words of this law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_13","006_31_13","DEU","31","13","13","Then their children who do not know the law will listen and learn to fear the LORD your God, as long as you live in the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_14","006_31_14","DEU","31","14","14","Then the LORD said to Moses, “Behold, the time of your death is near. Call Joshua and present yourselves at the Tent of Meeting, so that I may commission him.” So Moses and Joshua went and presented themselves at the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_15","006_31_15","DEU","31","15","15","Then the LORD appeared at the tent in a pillar of cloud, and the cloud stood over the entrance to the tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_16","006_31_16","DEU","31","16","16","And the LORD said to Moses, “You will soon rest with your fathers, and these people will rise up and prostitute themselves with the foreign gods of the land they are entering. They will forsake Me and break the covenant I have made with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_17","006_31_17","DEU","31","17","17","On that day My anger will burn against them, and I will abandon them and hide My face from them, so that they will be consumed, and many troubles and afflictions will befall them. On that day they will say, ‘Have not these disasters come upon us because our God is no longer with us?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_18","006_31_18","DEU","31","18","18","And on that day I will surely hide My face because of all the evil they have done by turning to other gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_19","006_31_19","DEU","31","19","19","Now therefore, write down for yourselves this song and teach it to the Israelites; have them recite it, so that it may be a witness for Me against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_20","006_31_20","DEU","31","20","20","When I have brought them into the land that I swore to give their fathers, a land flowing with milk and honey, they will eat their fill and prosper. Then they will turn to other gods and worship them, and they will reject Me and break My covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_21","006_31_21","DEU","31","21","21","And when many troubles and afflictions have come upon them, this song will testify against them, because it will not be forgotten from the lips of their descendants. For I know their inclination, even before I bring them into the land that I swore to give them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_22","006_31_22","DEU","31","22","22","So that very day Moses wrote down this song and taught it to the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_23","006_31_23","DEU","31","23","23","Then the LORD commissioned Joshua son of Nun and said, “Be strong and courageous, for you will bring the Israelites into the land that I swore to give them, and I will be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_24","006_31_24","DEU","31","24","24","When Moses had finished writing in a book the words of this law from beginning to end, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_25","006_31_25","DEU","31","25","25","he gave this command to the Levites who carried the ark of the covenant of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_26","006_31_26","DEU","31","26","26","“Take this Book of the Law and place it beside the ark of the covenant of the LORD your God, so that it may remain there as a witness against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_27","006_31_27","DEU","31","27","27","For I know how rebellious and stiff-necked you are. If you are already rebelling against the LORD while I am still alive, how much more will you rebel after my death! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_28","006_31_28","DEU","31","28","28","Assemble before me all the elders of your tribes and all your officers so that I may speak these words in their hearing and call heaven and earth to witness against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_29","006_31_29","DEU","31","29","29","For I know that after my death you will become utterly corrupt and turn from the path I have commanded you. And in the days to come, disaster will befall you because you will do evil in the sight of the LORD to provoke Him to anger by the work of your hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT31_30","006_31_30","DEU","31","30","30","Then Moses recited aloud to the whole assembly of Israel the words of this song from beginning to end: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_1","006_32_1","DEU","32","1","1","Give ear, O heavens, and I will speak; hear, O earth, the words of my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_2","006_32_2","DEU","32","2","2","Let my teaching fall like rain and my speech settle like dew, like gentle rain on new grass, like showers on tender plants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_3","006_32_3","DEU","32","3","3","For I will proclaim the name of the LORD. Ascribe greatness to our God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_4","006_32_4","DEU","32","4","4","He is the Rock, His work is perfect; all His ways are just. A God of faithfulness without injustice, righteous and upright is He. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_5","006_32_5","DEU","32","5","5","His people have acted corruptly toward Him; the blemish on them is not that of His children, but of a perverse and crooked generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_6","006_32_6","DEU","32","6","6","Is this how you repay the LORD, O foolish and senseless people? Is He not your Father and Creator? Has He not made you and established you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_7","006_32_7","DEU","32","7","7","Remember the days of old; consider the years long past. Ask your father, and he will tell you, your elders, and they will inform you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_8","006_32_8","DEU","32","8","8","When the Most High gave the nations their inheritance, when He divided the sons of man, He set the boundaries of the peoples according to the number of the sons of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_9","006_32_9","DEU","32","9","9","But the LORD’s portion is His people, Jacob His allotted inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_10","006_32_10","DEU","32","10","10","He found him in a desert land, in a barren, howling wilderness; He surrounded him, He instructed him, He guarded him as the apple of His eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_11","006_32_11","DEU","32","11","11","As an eagle stirs up its nest and hovers over its young, He spread His wings to catch them and carried them on His pinions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_12","006_32_12","DEU","32","12","12","The LORD alone led him, and no foreign god was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_13","006_32_13","DEU","32","13","13","He made him ride on the heights of the land and fed him the produce of the field. He nourished him with honey from the rock and oil from the flinty crag, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_14","006_32_14","DEU","32","14","14","with curds from the herd and milk from the flock, with the fat of lambs, with rams from Bashan, and goats, with the choicest grains of wheat. From the juice of the finest grapes you drank the wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_15","006_32_15","DEU","32","15","15","But Jeshurun grew fat and kicked—becoming fat, bloated, and gorged. He abandoned the God who made him and scorned the Rock of his salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_16","006_32_16","DEU","32","16","16","They provoked His jealousy with foreign gods; they enraged Him with abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_17","006_32_17","DEU","32","17","17","They sacrificed to demons, not to God, to gods they had not known, to newly arrived gods, which your fathers did not fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_18","006_32_18","DEU","32","18","18","You ignored the Rock who brought you forth; you forgot the God who gave you birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_19","006_32_19","DEU","32","19","19","When the LORD saw this, He rejected them, provoked to anger by His sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_20","006_32_20","DEU","32","20","20","He said: “I will hide My face from them; I will see what will be their end. For they are a perverse generation—children of unfaithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_21","006_32_21","DEU","32","21","21","They have provoked My jealousy by that which is not God; they have enraged Me with their worthless idols. So I will make them jealous by those who are not a people; I will make them angry by a nation without understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_22","006_32_22","DEU","32","22","22","For a fire has been kindled by My anger, and it burns to the depths of Sheol; it consumes the earth and its produce, and scorches the foundations of the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_23","006_32_23","DEU","32","23","23","I will heap disasters upon them; I will spend My arrows against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_24","006_32_24","DEU","32","24","24","They will be wasted from hunger and ravaged by pestilence and bitter plague; I will send the fangs of wild beasts against them, with the venom of vipers that slither in the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_25","006_32_25","DEU","32","25","25","Outside, the sword will take their children, and inside, terror will strike the young man and the young woman, the infant and the gray-haired man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_26","006_32_26","DEU","32","26","26","I would have said that I would cut them to pieces and blot out their memory from mankind, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_27","006_32_27","DEU","32","27","27","if I had not dreaded the taunt of the enemy, lest their adversaries misunderstand and say: ‘Our own hand has prevailed; it was not the LORD who did all this.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_28","006_32_28","DEU","32","28","28","Israel is a nation devoid of counsel, with no understanding among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_29","006_32_29","DEU","32","29","29","If only they were wise, they would understand it; they would comprehend their fate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_30","006_32_30","DEU","32","30","30","How could one man pursue a thousand, or two put ten thousand to flight, unless their Rock had sold them, unless the LORD had given them up? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_31","006_32_31","DEU","32","31","31","For their rock is not like our Rock, even our enemies concede. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_32","006_32_32","DEU","32","32","32","But their vine is from the vine of Sodom and from the fields of Gomorrah. Their grapes are poisonous; their clusters are bitter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_33","006_32_33","DEU","32","33","33","Their wine is the venom of serpents, the deadly poison of cobras. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_34","006_32_34","DEU","32","34","34","“Have I not stored up these things, sealed up within My vaults? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_35","006_32_35","DEU","32","35","35","Vengeance is Mine; I will repay. In due time their foot will slip; for their day of disaster is near, and their doom is coming quickly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_36","006_32_36","DEU","32","36","36","For the LORD will vindicate His people and have compassion on His servants when He sees that their strength is gone and no one remains, slave or free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_37","006_32_37","DEU","32","37","37","He will say: “Where are their gods, the rock in which they took refuge, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_38","006_32_38","DEU","32","38","38","which ate the fat of their sacrifices and drank the wine of their drink offerings? Let them rise up and help you; let them give you shelter! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_39","006_32_39","DEU","32","39","39","See now that I am He; there is no God besides Me. I bring death and I give life; I wound and I heal, and there is no one who can deliver from My hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_40","006_32_40","DEU","32","40","40","For I lift up My hand to heaven and declare: As surely as I live forever, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_41","006_32_41","DEU","32","41","41","when I sharpen My flashing sword, and My hand grasps it in judgment, I will take vengeance on My adversaries and repay those who hate Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_42","006_32_42","DEU","32","42","42","I will make My arrows drunk with blood, while My sword devours flesh—the blood of the slain and captives, the heads of the enemy leaders.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_43","006_32_43","DEU","32","43","43","Rejoice, O heavens, with Him, and let all God’s angels worship Him. Rejoice, O nations, with His people; for He will avenge the blood of His children. He will take vengeance on His adversaries and repay those who hate Him; He will cleanse His land and His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_44","006_32_44","DEU","32","44","44","Then Moses came with Joshua son of Nun and recited all the words of this song in the hearing of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_45","006_32_45","DEU","32","45","45","When Moses had finished reciting all these words to all Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_46","006_32_46","DEU","32","46","46","he said to them, “Take to heart all the words I have solemnly declared to you this day, so that you may command your children to carefully follow all the words of this law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_47","006_32_47","DEU","32","47","47","For they are not idle words to you, because they are your life, and by them you will live long in the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_48","006_32_48","DEU","32","48","48","On that same day the LORD said to Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_49","006_32_49","DEU","32","49","49","“Go up into the Abarim Range to Mount Nebo, in the land of Moab across from Jericho, and view the land of Canaan, which I am giving to the Israelites as their own possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_50","006_32_50","DEU","32","50","50","And there on the mountain that you climb, you will die and be gathered to your people, just as your brother Aaron died on Mount Hor and was gathered to his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_51","006_32_51","DEU","32","51","51","For at the waters of Meribah-kadesh in the Wilderness of Zin, both of you broke faith with Me among the Israelites by failing to treat Me as holy in their presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT32_52","006_32_52","DEU","32","52","52","Although you shall see from a distance the land that I am giving the Israelites, you shall not enter it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_1","006_33_1","DEU","33","1","1","This is the blessing that Moses the man of God pronounced upon the Israelites before his death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_2","006_33_2","DEU","33","2","2","He said: “The LORD came from Sinai and dawned upon us from Seir; He shone forth from Mount Paran and came with myriads of holy ones, with flaming fire at His right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_3","006_33_3","DEU","33","3","3","Surely You love the people; all the holy ones are in Your hand, and they sit down at Your feet; each receives Your words— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_4","006_33_4","DEU","33","4","4","the law that Moses gave us, the possession of the assembly of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_5","006_33_5","DEU","33","5","5","So the LORD became King in Jeshurun when the leaders of the people gathered, when the tribes of Israel came together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_6","006_33_6","DEU","33","6","6","Let Reuben live and not die, nor his men be few.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_7","006_33_7","DEU","33","7","7","And concerning Judah he said: “O LORD, hear the cry of Judah and bring him to his people. With his own hands he defends his cause, but may You be a help against his foes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_8","006_33_8","DEU","33","8","8","Concerning Levi he said: “Give Your Thummim to Levi and Your Urim to Your godly one, whom You tested at Massah and contested at the waters of Meribah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_9","006_33_9","DEU","33","9","9","He said of his father and mother, ‘I do not consider them.’ He disregarded his brothers and did not know his own sons, for he kept Your word and maintained Your covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_10","006_33_10","DEU","33","10","10","He will teach Your ordinances to Jacob and Your law to Israel; he will set incense before You and whole burnt offerings on Your altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_11","006_33_11","DEU","33","11","11","Bless his substance, O LORD, and accept the work of his hands. Smash the loins of those who rise against him, and of his foes so they can rise no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_12","006_33_12","DEU","33","12","12","Concerning Benjamin he said: “May the beloved of the LORD rest secure in Him; God shields him all day long, and upon His shoulders he rests.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_13","006_33_13","DEU","33","13","13","Concerning Joseph he said: “May his land be blessed by the LORD with the precious dew from heaven above and the deep waters that lie beneath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_14","006_33_14","DEU","33","14","14","with the bountiful harvest from the sun and the abundant yield of the seasons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_15","006_33_15","DEU","33","15","15","with the best of the ancient mountains and the bounty of the everlasting hills, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_16","006_33_16","DEU","33","16","16","with the choice gifts of the land and everything in it, and with the favor of Him who dwelt in the burning bush. May these rest on the head of Joseph and crown the brow of the prince of his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_17","006_33_17","DEU","33","17","17","His majesty is like a firstborn bull, and his horns are like those of a wild ox. With them he will gore the nations, even to the ends of the earth. Such are the myriads of Ephraim, and such are the thousands of Manasseh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_18","006_33_18","DEU","33","18","18","Concerning Zebulun he said: “Rejoice, Zebulun, in your journeys, and Issachar, in your tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_19","006_33_19","DEU","33","19","19","They will call the peoples to a mountain; there they will offer sacrifices of righteousness. For they will feast on the abundance of the seas and the hidden treasures of the sand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_20","006_33_20","DEU","33","20","20","Concerning Gad he said: “Blessed is he who enlarges the domain of Gad! He lies down like a lion and tears off an arm or a head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_21","006_33_21","DEU","33","21","21","He chose the best land for himself, because a ruler’s portion was reserved for him there. He came with the leaders of the people; he administered the LORD’s justice and His ordinances for Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_22","006_33_22","DEU","33","22","22","Concerning Dan he said: “Dan is a lion’s cub, leaping out of Bashan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_23","006_33_23","DEU","33","23","23","Concerning Naphtali he said: “Naphtali is abounding with favor, full of the blessing of the LORD; he shall take possession of the sea and the south.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_24","006_33_24","DEU","33","24","24","And concerning Asher he said: “May Asher be the most blessed of sons; may he be the most favored among his brothers and dip his foot in oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_25","006_33_25","DEU","33","25","25","May the bolts of your gate be iron and bronze, and may your strength match your days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_26","006_33_26","DEU","33","26","26","“There is none like the God of Jeshurun, who rides the heavens to your aid, and the clouds in His majesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_27","006_33_27","DEU","33","27","27","The eternal God is your dwelling place, and underneath are the everlasting arms. He drives out the enemy before you, giving the command, ‘Destroy him!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_28","006_33_28","DEU","33","28","28","So Israel dwells securely; the fountain of Jacob lives untroubled in a land of grain and new wine, where even the heavens drip with dew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT33_29","006_33_29","DEU","33","29","29","Blessed are you, O Israel! Who is like you, a people saved by the LORD? He is the shield that protects you, the sword in which you boast. Your enemies will cower before you, and you shall trample their high places.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_1","006_34_1","DEU","34","1","1","Then Moses went up from the plains of Moab to Mount Nebo, to the top of Pisgah, which faces Jericho. And the LORD showed him the whole land—from Gilead as far as Dan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_2","006_34_2","DEU","34","2","2","all of Naphtali, the land of Ephraim and Manasseh, all the land of Judah as far as the Western Sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_3","006_34_3","DEU","34","3","3","the Negev, and the region from the Valley of Jericho (the City of Palms) all the way to Zoar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_4","006_34_4","DEU","34","4","4","And the LORD said to him, “This is the land that I swore to give Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob when I said, ‘I will give it to your descendants.’ I have let you see it with your own eyes, but you will not cross into it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_5","006_34_5","DEU","34","5","5","So Moses the servant of the LORD died there in the land of Moab, as the LORD had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_6","006_34_6","DEU","34","6","6","And He buried him in a valley in the land of Moab facing Beth-peor, and no one to this day knows the location of his grave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_7","006_34_7","DEU","34","7","7","Moses was a hundred and twenty years old when he died, yet his eyes were not weak, and his vitality had not diminished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_8","006_34_8","DEU","34","8","8","The Israelites grieved for Moses in the plains of Moab thirty days, until the time of weeping and mourning for Moses came to an end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_9","006_34_9","DEU","34","9","9","Now Joshua son of Nun was filled with the spirit of wisdom because Moses had laid his hands on him. So the Israelites obeyed him and did as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_10","006_34_10","DEU","34","10","10","Since that time, no prophet has risen in Israel like Moses, whom the LORD knew face to face— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_11","006_34_11","DEU","34","11","11","no prophet who did all the signs and wonders that the LORD sent Moses to do in the land of Egypt to Pharaoh and to all his officials and all his land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DT34_12","006_34_12","DEU","34","12","12","and no prophet who performed all the mighty acts of power and awesome deeds that Moses did in the sight of all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_1","007_1_1","JOS","1","1","1","Now after the death of His servant Moses, the LORD spoke to Joshua son of Nun, Moses’ assistant, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_2","007_1_2","JOS","1","2","2","“Moses My servant is dead. Now therefore arise, you and all these people, and cross over the Jordan into the land that I am giving to the children of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_3","007_1_3","JOS","1","3","3","I have given you every place where the sole of your foot will tread, just as I promised to Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_4","007_1_4","JOS","1","4","4","Your territory shall extend from the wilderness and Lebanon to the great River Euphrates—all the land of the Hittites—and west as far as the Great Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_5","007_1_5","JOS","1","5","5","No one shall stand against you all the days of your life. As I was with Moses, so will I be with you; I will never leave you nor forsake you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_6","007_1_6","JOS","1","6","6","Be strong and courageous, for you shall give these people the inheritance of the land that I swore to their fathers I would give them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_7","007_1_7","JOS","1","7","7","Above all, be strong and very courageous. Be careful to observe all the law that My servant Moses commanded you. Do not turn from it to the right or to the left, so that you may prosper wherever you go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_8","007_1_8","JOS","1","8","8","This Book of the Law must not depart from your mouth; meditate on it day and night, so that you may be careful to do everything written in it. For then you will prosper and succeed in all you do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_9","007_1_9","JOS","1","9","9","Have I not commanded you to be strong and courageous? Do not be afraid; do not be discouraged, for the LORD your God is with you wherever you go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_10","007_1_10","JOS","1","10","10","Then Joshua commanded the officers of the people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_11","007_1_11","JOS","1","11","11","“Go through the camp and tell the people, ‘Prepare your provisions, for within three days you will cross the Jordan to go in and take possession of the land that the LORD your God is giving you to possess.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_12","007_1_12","JOS","1","12","12","But to the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh, Joshua said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_13","007_1_13","JOS","1","13","13","“Remember what Moses the servant of the LORD commanded you when he said, ‘The LORD your God will give you rest, and He will give you this land.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_14","007_1_14","JOS","1","14","14","Your wives, your young children, and your livestock may remain in the land that Moses gave you on this side of the Jordan. But all your mighty men of valor must be armed for battle to cross over ahead of your brothers and help them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_15","007_1_15","JOS","1","15","15","until the LORD gives them rest as He has done for you, and your brothers also possess the land that the LORD your God is giving them. Then you may return to the land of your inheritance and take possession of that which Moses the servant of the LORD gave you on the east side of the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_16","007_1_16","JOS","1","16","16","So they answered Joshua, “Everything you have commanded us we will do, and everywhere you send us we will go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_17","007_1_17","JOS","1","17","17","Just as we obeyed Moses in all things, so we will obey you. And may the LORD your God be with you, as He was with Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS1_18","007_1_18","JOS","1","18","18","Anyone who rebels against your order and does not obey your words, all that you command him, will be put to death. Above all, be strong and courageous!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_1","007_2_1","JOS","2","1","1","Then Joshua son of Nun secretly sent two spies from Shittim, saying, “Go, inspect the land, especially Jericho.” So they went and entered the house of a prostitute named Rahab and stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_2","007_2_2","JOS","2","2","2","And it was reported to the king of Jericho: “Behold, some men of Israel have come here tonight to spy out the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_3","007_2_3","JOS","2","3","3","So the king of Jericho sent to Rahab and said, “Bring out the men who came to you and entered your house, for they have come to spy out the whole land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_4","007_2_4","JOS","2","4","4","But the woman had taken the two men and hidden them. So she said, “Yes, the men did come to me, but I did not know where they had come from. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_5","007_2_5","JOS","2","5","5","At dusk, when the gate was about to close, the men went out, and I do not know which way they went. Pursue them quickly, and you may catch them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_6","007_2_6","JOS","2","6","6","(But Rahab had taken them up to the roof and hidden them among the stalks of flax that she had laid out there.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_7","007_2_7","JOS","2","7","7","So the king’s men set out in pursuit of the spies along the road to the fords of the Jordan, and as soon as they had gone out, the gate was shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_8","007_2_8","JOS","2","8","8","Before the spies lay down for the night, Rahab went up on the roof ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_9","007_2_9","JOS","2","9","9","and said to them, “I know that the LORD has given you this land and that the fear of you has fallen on us, so that all who dwell in the land are melting in fear of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_10","007_2_10","JOS","2","10","10","For we have heard how the LORD dried up the waters of the Red Sea before you when you came out of Egypt, and what you did to Sihon and Og, the two kings of the Amorites across the Jordan, whom you devoted to destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_11","007_2_11","JOS","2","11","11","When we heard this, our hearts melted and everyone’s courage failed because of you, for the LORD your God is God in the heavens above and on the earth below. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_12","007_2_12","JOS","2","12","12","Now therefore, please swear to me by the LORD that you will indeed show kindness to my family, because I showed kindness to you. Give me a sure sign ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_13","007_2_13","JOS","2","13","13","that you will spare the lives of my father and mother, my brothers and sisters, and all who belong to them, and that you will deliver us from death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_14","007_2_14","JOS","2","14","14","“Our lives for your lives!” the men agreed. “If you do not report our mission, we will show you kindness and faithfulness when the LORD gives us the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_15","007_2_15","JOS","2","15","15","Then Rahab let them down by a rope through the window, since the house where she lived was built into the wall of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_16","007_2_16","JOS","2","16","16","“Go to the hill country,” she said, “so that your pursuers will not find you. Hide yourselves there for three days until they have returned; then go on your way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_17","007_2_17","JOS","2","17","17","The men said to her, “We will not be bound by this oath you made us swear ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_18","007_2_18","JOS","2","18","18","unless, when we enter the land, you have tied this scarlet cord in the window through which you let us down, and unless you have brought your father and mother and brothers and all your family into your house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_19","007_2_19","JOS","2","19","19","If anyone goes out the door of your house into the street, his blood will be on his own head, and we will be innocent. But if a hand is laid on anyone with you in the house, his blood will be on our heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_20","007_2_20","JOS","2","20","20","And if you report our mission, we will be released from the oath you made us swear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_21","007_2_21","JOS","2","21","21","“Let it be as you say,” she replied, and she sent them away. And when they had gone, she tied the scarlet cord in the window. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_22","007_2_22","JOS","2","22","22","So the spies went out into the hill country and stayed there three days, until their pursuers had returned without finding them, having searched all along the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_23","007_2_23","JOS","2","23","23","Then the two men started back, came down from the hill country, and crossed the river. So they came to Joshua son of Nun and reported all that had happened to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS2_24","007_2_24","JOS","2","24","24","“The LORD has surely delivered the entire land into our hands,” they said to Joshua. “Indeed, all who dwell in the land are melting in fear of us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_1","007_3_1","JOS","3","1","1","Early the next morning Joshua got up and left Shittim with all the Israelites. They went as far as the Jordan, where they camped before crossing over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_2","007_3_2","JOS","3","2","2","After three days the officers went through the camp ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_3","007_3_3","JOS","3","3","3","and commanded the people: “When you see the ark of the covenant of the LORD your God being carried by the Levitical priests, you are to set out from your positions and follow it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_4","007_3_4","JOS","3","4","4","But keep a distance of about two thousand cubits between yourselves and the ark. Do not go near it, so that you can see the way to go, since you have never traveled this way before.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_5","007_3_5","JOS","3","5","5","Then Joshua told the people, “Consecrate yourselves, for tomorrow the LORD will do wonders among you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_6","007_3_6","JOS","3","6","6","And he said to the priests, “Take the ark of the covenant and go on ahead of the people.” So they carried the ark of the covenant and went ahead of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_7","007_3_7","JOS","3","7","7","Now the LORD said to Joshua, “Today I will begin to exalt you in the sight of all Israel, so they may know that I am with you just as I was with Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_8","007_3_8","JOS","3","8","8","Command the priests carrying the ark of the covenant: ‘When you reach the edge of the waters, stand in the Jordan.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_9","007_3_9","JOS","3","9","9","So Joshua told the Israelites, “Come here and listen to the words of the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_10","007_3_10","JOS","3","10","10","He continued, “This is how you will know that the living God is among you and that He will surely drive out before you the Canaanites, Hittites, Hivites, Perizzites, Girgashites, Amorites, and Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_11","007_3_11","JOS","3","11","11","Behold, the ark of the covenant of the Lord of all the earth will go ahead of you into the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_12","007_3_12","JOS","3","12","12","Now choose twelve men from the tribes of Israel, one from each tribe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_13","007_3_13","JOS","3","13","13","When the feet of the priests who carry the ark of the LORD—the Lord of all the earth—touch down in the waters of the Jordan, its flowing waters will be cut off and will stand up in a heap.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_14","007_3_14","JOS","3","14","14","So when the people broke camp to cross the Jordan, the priests carried the ark of the covenant ahead of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_15","007_3_15","JOS","3","15","15","Now the Jordan overflows its banks throughout the harvest season. But as soon as the priests carrying the ark reached the Jordan and their feet touched the water’s edge, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_16","007_3_16","JOS","3","16","16","the flowing water stood still. It backed up as far upstream as Adam, a city in the area of Zarethan, while the water flowing toward the Sea of the Arabah (the Salt Sea) was completely cut off. So the people crossed over opposite Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS3_17","007_3_17","JOS","3","17","17","The priests carrying the ark of the covenant of the LORD stood firm on dry ground in the middle of the Jordan, while all Israel crossed over the dry ground, until the entire nation had crossed the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_1","007_4_1","JOS","4","1","1","When the whole nation had finished crossing the Jordan, the LORD said to Joshua, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_2","007_4_2","JOS","4","2","2","“Choose twelve men from among the people, one from each tribe, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_3","007_4_3","JOS","4","3","3","and command them: ‘Take up for yourselves twelve stones from the middle of the Jordan where the priests were standing, carry them with you, and set them down in the place where you spend the night.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_4","007_4_4","JOS","4","4","4","So Joshua summoned the twelve men he had appointed from the Israelites, one from each tribe, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_5","007_4_5","JOS","4","5","5","and said to them, “Cross over before the ark of the LORD your God into the middle of the Jordan. Each of you is to take a stone upon his shoulder, according to the number of the tribes of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_6","007_4_6","JOS","4","6","6","to serve as a sign among you. In the future, when your children ask, ‘What do these stones mean to you?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_7","007_4_7","JOS","4","7","7","you are to tell them, ‘The waters of the Jordan were cut off before the ark of the covenant of the LORD. When it crossed the Jordan, the waters were cut off.’ Therefore these stones will be a memorial to the Israelites forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_8","007_4_8","JOS","4","8","8","Thus the Israelites did as Joshua had commanded them. They took up twelve stones from the middle of the Jordan, one for each tribe of Israel, just as the LORD had told Joshua; and they carried them to the camp, where they set them down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_9","007_4_9","JOS","4","9","9","Joshua also set up twelve stones in the middle of the Jordan, in the place where the priests who carried the ark of the covenant stood. And the stones are there to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_10","007_4_10","JOS","4","10","10","Now the priests who carried the ark remained standing in the middle of the Jordan until the people had completed everything the LORD had commanded Joshua to tell them, just as Moses had directed Joshua. The people hurried across, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_11","007_4_11","JOS","4","11","11","and after everyone had finished crossing, the priests with the ark of the LORD crossed in the sight of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_12","007_4_12","JOS","4","12","12","The Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh crossed over before the Israelites, armed for battle as Moses had instructed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_13","007_4_13","JOS","4","13","13","About 40,000 troops armed for battle crossed over before the LORD into the plains of Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_14","007_4_14","JOS","4","14","14","On that day the LORD exalted Joshua in the sight of all Israel, and they revered him all the days of his life, just as they had revered Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_15","007_4_15","JOS","4","15","15","Then the LORD said to Joshua, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_16","007_4_16","JOS","4","16","16","“Command the priests who carry the ark of the Testimony to come up from the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_17","007_4_17","JOS","4","17","17","So Joshua commanded the priests, “Come up from the Jordan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_18","007_4_18","JOS","4","18","18","When the priests carrying the ark of the covenant of the LORD came up out of the Jordan and their feet touched the dry land, the waters of the Jordan returned to their course and overflowed all the banks as before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_19","007_4_19","JOS","4","19","19","On the tenth day of the first month the people went up from the Jordan and camped at Gilgal on the eastern border of Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_20","007_4_20","JOS","4","20","20","And there at Gilgal Joshua set up the twelve stones they had taken from the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_21","007_4_21","JOS","4","21","21","Then Joshua said to the Israelites, “In the future, when your children ask their fathers, ‘What is the meaning of these stones?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_22","007_4_22","JOS","4","22","22","you are to tell them, ‘Israel crossed the Jordan on dry ground.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_23","007_4_23","JOS","4","23","23","For the LORD your God dried up the waters of the Jordan before you until you had crossed over, just as He did to the Red Sea, which He dried up before us until we had crossed over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS4_24","007_4_24","JOS","4","24","24","He did this so that all the peoples of the earth may know that the hand of the LORD is mighty, and so that you may always fear the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_1","007_5_1","JOS","5","1","1","Now when all the Amorite kings west of the Jordan and all the Canaanite kings along the coast heard how the LORD had dried up the waters of the Jordan before the Israelites until they had crossed over, their hearts melted and their spirits failed for fear of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_2","007_5_2","JOS","5","2","2","At that time the LORD said to Joshua, “Make flint knives and circumcise the sons of Israel once again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_3","007_5_3","JOS","5","3","3","So Joshua made flint knives and circumcised the sons of Israel at Gibeath-haaraloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_4","007_5_4","JOS","5","4","4","Now this is why Joshua circumcised them: All those who came out of Egypt—all the men of war—had died on the journey in the wilderness after they had left Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_5","007_5_5","JOS","5","5","5","Though all who had come out were circumcised, none of those born in the wilderness on the journey from Egypt had been circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_6","007_5_6","JOS","5","6","6","For the Israelites had wandered in the wilderness forty years, until all the nation’s men of war who had come out of Egypt had died, since they did not obey the LORD. So the LORD vowed never to let them see the land He had sworn to their fathers to give us, a land flowing with milk and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_7","007_5_7","JOS","5","7","7","And He raised up their sons in their place, and these were the ones Joshua circumcised. Until this time they were still uncircumcised, since they had not been circumcised along the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_8","007_5_8","JOS","5","8","8","And after all the nation had been circumcised, they stayed there in the camp until they were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_9","007_5_9","JOS","5","9","9","Then the LORD said to Joshua, “Today I have rolled away the reproach of Egypt from you.” So that place has been called Gilgal to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_10","007_5_10","JOS","5","10","10","On the evening of the fourteenth day of the month, while the Israelites were camped at Gilgal on the plains of Jericho, they kept the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_11","007_5_11","JOS","5","11","11","The day after the Passover, on that very day, they ate unleavened bread and roasted grain from the produce of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_12","007_5_12","JOS","5","12","12","And the day after they had eaten from the produce of the land, the manna ceased. There was no more manna for the Israelites, so that year they began to eat the crops of the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_13","007_5_13","JOS","5","13","13","Now when Joshua was near Jericho, he looked up and saw a man standing in front of him with a drawn sword in His hand. Joshua approached Him and asked, “Are You for us or for our enemies?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_14","007_5_14","JOS","5","14","14","“Neither,” He replied. “I have now come as Commander of the LORD’s army.” Then Joshua fell facedown in reverence and asked Him, “What does my Lord have to say to His servant?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS5_15","007_5_15","JOS","5","15","15","The Commander of the LORD’s army replied, “Take off your sandals, for the place where you are standing is holy.” And Joshua did so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_1","007_6_1","JOS","6","1","1","Now Jericho was tightly shut up because of the Israelites. No one went out and no one came in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_2","007_6_2","JOS","6","2","2","And the LORD said to Joshua, “Behold, I have delivered Jericho into your hand, along with its king and its mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_3","007_6_3","JOS","6","3","3","March around the city with all the men of war, circling the city one time. Do this for six days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_4","007_6_4","JOS","6","4","4","Have seven priests carry seven rams’ horns in front of the ark. Then on the seventh day, march around the city seven times, while the priests blow the horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_5","007_6_5","JOS","6","5","5","And when there is a long blast of the ram’s horn and you hear its sound, have all the people give a mighty shout. Then the wall of the city will collapse and all your people will charge straight into the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_6","007_6_6","JOS","6","6","6","So Joshua son of Nun summoned the priests and said, “Take up the ark of the covenant and have seven priests carry seven rams’ horns in front of the ark of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_7","007_6_7","JOS","6","7","7","And he told the people, “Advance and march around the city, with the armed troops going ahead of the ark of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_8","007_6_8","JOS","6","8","8","After Joshua had spoken to the people, seven priests carrying seven rams’ horns before the LORD advanced and blew the horns, and the ark of the covenant of the LORD followed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_9","007_6_9","JOS","6","9","9","While the horns continued to sound, the armed troops marched ahead of the priests who blew the horns, and the rear guard followed the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_10","007_6_10","JOS","6","10","10","But Joshua had commanded the people: “Do not give a battle cry or let your voice be heard; do not let one word come out of your mouth until the day I tell you to shout. Then you are to shout!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_11","007_6_11","JOS","6","11","11","So he had the ark of the LORD carried around the city, circling it once. And the people returned to the camp and spent the night there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_12","007_6_12","JOS","6","12","12","Joshua got up early the next morning, and the priests took the ark of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_13","007_6_13","JOS","6","13","13","And the seven priests carrying seven rams’ horns kept marching ahead of the ark of the LORD and blowing the horns. The armed troops went in front of them and the rear guard followed the ark of the LORD, while the horns kept sounding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_14","007_6_14","JOS","6","14","14","So on the second day they marched around the city once and returned to the camp. They did this for six days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_15","007_6_15","JOS","6","15","15","Then on the seventh day, they got up at dawn and marched around the city seven times in the same manner. That was the only day they circled the city seven times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_16","007_6_16","JOS","6","16","16","After the seventh time around, the priests blew the horns, and Joshua commanded the people, “Shout! For the LORD has given you the city! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_17","007_6_17","JOS","6","17","17","Now the city and everything in it must be devoted to the LORD for destruction. Only Rahab the prostitute and all those with her in her house will live, because she hid the spies we sent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_18","007_6_18","JOS","6","18","18","But keep away from the things devoted to destruction, lest you yourself be set apart for destruction. If you take any of these, you will set apart the camp of Israel for destruction and bring disaster upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_19","007_6_19","JOS","6","19","19","For all the silver and gold and all the articles of bronze and iron are holy to the LORD; they must go into His treasury.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_20","007_6_20","JOS","6","20","20","So when the rams’ horns sounded, the people shouted. When they heard the blast of the horn, the people gave a great shout, and the wall collapsed. Then all the people charged straight into the city and captured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_21","007_6_21","JOS","6","21","21","With the edge of the sword they devoted to destruction everything in the city—man and woman, young and old, oxen, sheep, and donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_22","007_6_22","JOS","6","22","22","Meanwhile, Joshua told the two men who had spied out the land, “Go into the house of the prostitute and bring out the woman and all who are with her, just as you promised her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_23","007_6_23","JOS","6","23","23","So the young spies went in and brought out Rahab, her father and mother and brothers, and all who belonged to her. They brought out her whole family and settled them outside the camp of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_24","007_6_24","JOS","6","24","24","Then the Israelites burned up the city and everything in it. However, they put the silver and gold and articles of bronze and iron into the treasury of the LORD’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_25","007_6_25","JOS","6","25","25","And Joshua spared Rahab the prostitute, with her father’s household and all who belonged to her, because she hid the men Joshua had sent to spy out Jericho. So she has lived among the Israelites to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_26","007_6_26","JOS","6","26","26","At that time Joshua invoked this solemn oath: “Cursed before the LORD is the man who rises up and rebuilds this city, Jericho; at the cost of his firstborn he will lay its foundations; at the cost of his youngest he will set up its gates.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS6_27","007_6_27","JOS","6","27","27","So the LORD was with Joshua, and his fame spread throughout the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_1","007_7_1","JOS","7","1","1","The Israelites, however, acted unfaithfully regarding the things devoted to destruction. Achan son of Carmi, the son of Zabdi, the son of Zerah, of the tribe of Judah, took some of what was set apart. So the anger of the LORD burned against the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_2","007_7_2","JOS","7","2","2","Meanwhile, Joshua sent men from Jericho to Ai, which is near Beth-aven to the east of Bethel, and told them, “Go up and spy out the land.” So the men went up and spied out Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_3","007_7_3","JOS","7","3","3","On returning to Joshua, they reported, “There is no need to send all the people; two or three thousand men are enough to go up and attack Ai. Since the people of Ai are so few, you need not wear out all our people there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_4","007_7_4","JOS","7","4","4","So about three thousand men went up, but they fled before the men of Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_5","007_7_5","JOS","7","5","5","And the men of Ai struck down about thirty-six of them, chasing them from the gate as far as the quarries and striking them down on the slopes. So the hearts of the people melted and became like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_6","007_7_6","JOS","7","6","6","Then Joshua tore his clothes and fell facedown before the ark of the LORD until evening, as did the elders of Israel; and they all sprinkled dust on their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_7","007_7_7","JOS","7","7","7","“O, Lord GOD,” Joshua said, “why did You ever bring this people across the Jordan to deliver us into the hand of the Amorites to be destroyed? If only we had been content to stay on the other side of the Jordan! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_8","007_7_8","JOS","7","8","8","O Lord, what can I say, now that Israel has turned its back and run from its enemies? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_9","007_7_9","JOS","7","9","9","When the Canaanites and all who live in the land hear about this, they will surround us and wipe out our name from the earth. Then what will You do for Your great name?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_10","007_7_10","JOS","7","10","10","But the LORD said to Joshua, “Stand up! Why have you fallen on your face? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_11","007_7_11","JOS","7","11","11","Israel has sinned; they have transgressed My covenant that I commanded them, and they have taken some of what was devoted to destruction. Indeed, they have stolen and lied, and they have put these things with their own possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_12","007_7_12","JOS","7","12","12","This is why the Israelites cannot stand against their enemies. They will turn their backs and run from their enemies, because they themselves have been set apart for destruction. I will no longer be with you unless you remove from among you whatever is devoted to destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_13","007_7_13","JOS","7","13","13","Get up and consecrate the people, saying, ‘Consecrate yourselves for tomorrow, for this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: Among you, O Israel, there are things devoted to destruction. You cannot stand against your enemies until you remove them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_14","007_7_14","JOS","7","14","14","In the morning you must present yourselves tribe by tribe. The tribe that the LORD selects shall come forward clan by clan, and the clan that the LORD selects shall come forward family by family, and the family that the LORD selects shall come forward man by man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_15","007_7_15","JOS","7","15","15","The one who is caught with the things devoted to destruction must be burned, along with all that belongs to him, because he has transgressed the covenant of the LORD and committed an outrage in Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_16","007_7_16","JOS","7","16","16","So Joshua arose early the next morning and had Israel come forward tribe by tribe, and the tribe of Judah was selected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_17","007_7_17","JOS","7","17","17","He had the clans of Judah come forward, and the clan of the Zerahites was selected. He had the clan of the Zerahites come forward, and the family of Zabdi was selected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_18","007_7_18","JOS","7","18","18","And he had the family of Zabdi come forward man by man, and Achan son of Carmi, the son of Zabdi, the son of Zerah, of the tribe of Judah, was selected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_19","007_7_19","JOS","7","19","19","So Joshua said to Achan, “My son, give glory to the LORD, the God of Israel, and make a confession to Him. I urge you to tell me what you have done; do not hide it from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_20","007_7_20","JOS","7","20","20","“It is true,” Achan replied, “I have sinned against the LORD, the God of Israel. This is what I did: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_21","007_7_21","JOS","7","21","21","When I saw among the spoils a beautiful cloak from Shinar, two hundred shekels of silver, and a bar of gold weighing fifty shekels, I coveted them and took them. They are hidden in the ground inside my tent, with the silver underneath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_22","007_7_22","JOS","7","22","22","So Joshua sent messengers who ran to the tent, and there it all was, hidden in his tent, with the silver underneath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_23","007_7_23","JOS","7","23","23","They took the things from inside the tent, brought them to Joshua and all the Israelites, and spread them out before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_24","007_7_24","JOS","7","24","24","Then Joshua, together with all Israel, took Achan son of Zerah, the silver, the cloak, the bar of gold, his sons and daughters, his oxen and donkeys and sheep, his tent, and everything else he owned, and brought them to the Valley of Achor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_25","007_7_25","JOS","7","25","25","“Why have you brought this trouble upon us?” said Joshua. “Today the LORD will bring trouble upon you!” And all Israel stoned him to death. Then they stoned the others and burned their bodies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS7_26","007_7_26","JOS","7","26","26","And they heaped over Achan a large pile of rocks that remains to this day. So the LORD turned from His burning anger. Therefore that place is called the Valley of Achor to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_1","007_8_1","JOS","8","1","1","Then the LORD said to Joshua, “Do not be afraid or discouraged. Take the whole army with you, and go up and attack Ai. See, I have delivered into your hand the king of Ai, his people, his city, and his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_2","007_8_2","JOS","8","2","2","And you shall do to Ai and its king as you did to Jericho and its king, except that you may carry off their plunder and livestock for yourselves. Set up an ambush behind the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_3","007_8_3","JOS","8","3","3","So Joshua and the whole army set out to attack Ai. Joshua chose 30,000 mighty men of valor and sent them out at night ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_4","007_8_4","JOS","8","4","4","with these orders: “Pay attention. You are to lie in ambush behind the city, not too far from it. All of you must be ready. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_5","007_8_5","JOS","8","5","5","Then I and all the troops with me will advance on the city. When they come out against us as they did the first time, we will flee from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_6","007_8_6","JOS","8","6","6","They will pursue us until we have drawn them away from the city, for they will say, ‘The Israelites are running away from us as they did before.’ So as we flee from them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_7","007_8_7","JOS","8","7","7","you are to rise from the ambush and seize the city, for the LORD your God will deliver it into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_8","007_8_8","JOS","8","8","8","And when you have taken the city, set it on fire. Do as the LORD has commanded! See, I have given you orders.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_9","007_8_9","JOS","8","9","9","So Joshua sent them out, and they went to the place of ambush and lay in wait between Bethel and Ai, to the west of Ai. But Joshua spent that night among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_10","007_8_10","JOS","8","10","10","Joshua got up early the next morning and mobilized his men, and he and the elders of Israel marched before them up to Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_11","007_8_11","JOS","8","11","11","Then all the troops who were with him marched up and approached the city. They arrived in front of Ai and camped to the north of it, with the valley between them and the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_12","007_8_12","JOS","8","12","12","Now Joshua had taken about five thousand men and set up an ambush between Bethel and Ai, to the west of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_13","007_8_13","JOS","8","13","13","So the forces were stationed with the main camp to the north of the city and the rear guard to the west of the city. And that night Joshua went into the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_14","007_8_14","JOS","8","14","14","When the king of Ai saw the Israelites, he hurried out early in the morning with the men of the city to engage them in battle at an appointed place overlooking the Arabah. But he did not know that an ambush had been set up against him behind the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_15","007_8_15","JOS","8","15","15","Joshua and all Israel let themselves be beaten back before them, and they fled toward the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_16","007_8_16","JOS","8","16","16","Then all the men of Ai were summoned to pursue them, and they followed Joshua and were drawn away from the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_17","007_8_17","JOS","8","17","17","Not a man was left in Ai or Bethel who did not go out after Israel, leaving the city wide open while they pursued Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_18","007_8_18","JOS","8","18","18","Then the LORD said to Joshua, “Hold out your battle lance toward Ai, for into your hand I will deliver the city.” So Joshua held out his battle lance toward Ai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_19","007_8_19","JOS","8","19","19","and as soon as he did so, the men in ambush rose quickly from their position. They rushed forward, entered the city, captured it, and immediately set it on fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_20","007_8_20","JOS","8","20","20","When the men of Ai turned and looked back, the smoke of the city was rising into the sky. They could not escape in any direction, and the troops who had fled to the wilderness now turned against their pursuers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_21","007_8_21","JOS","8","21","21","When Joshua and all Israel saw that the men in ambush had captured the city and that smoke was rising from it, they turned around and struck down the men of Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_22","007_8_22","JOS","8","22","22","Meanwhile, those in the ambush came out of the city against them, and the men of Ai were trapped between the Israelite forces on both sides. So Israel struck them down until no survivor or fugitive remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_23","007_8_23","JOS","8","23","23","But they took the king of Ai alive and brought him to Joshua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_24","007_8_24","JOS","8","24","24","When Israel had finished killing all the men of Ai who had pursued them into the field and wilderness, and when every last one of them had fallen by the sword, all the Israelites returned to Ai and put it to the sword as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_25","007_8_25","JOS","8","25","25","A total of twelve thousand men and women fell that day—all the people of Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_26","007_8_26","JOS","8","26","26","Joshua did not draw back the hand that held his battle lance until he had devoted to destruction all who lived in Ai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_27","007_8_27","JOS","8","27","27","Israel took for themselves only the cattle and plunder of that city, as the LORD had commanded Joshua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_28","007_8_28","JOS","8","28","28","So Joshua burned Ai and made it a permanent heap of ruins, a desolation to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_29","007_8_29","JOS","8","29","29","He hung the king of Ai on a tree until evening, and at sunset Joshua commanded that they take down the body from the tree and throw it down at the entrance of the city gate. And over it they raised a large pile of rocks, which remains to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_30","007_8_30","JOS","8","30","30","At that time Joshua built an altar on Mount Ebal to the LORD, the God of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_31","007_8_31","JOS","8","31","31","just as Moses the servant of the LORD had commanded the Israelites. He built it according to what is written in the Book of the Law of Moses: “an altar of uncut stones on which no iron tool has been used.” And on it they offered burnt offerings to the LORD, and they sacrificed peace offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_32","007_8_32","JOS","8","32","32","And there in the presence of the Israelites, Joshua inscribed on the stones a copy of the law of Moses, which he had written. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_33","007_8_33","JOS","8","33","33","All Israel, foreigners and citizens alike, with their elders, officers, and judges, stood on both sides of the ark of the covenant of the LORD facing the Levitical priests who carried it. Half of the people stood in front of Mount Gerizim and half of them in front of Mount Ebal, as Moses the servant of the LORD had commanded earlier, to bless the people of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_34","007_8_34","JOS","8","34","34","Afterward, Joshua read aloud all the words of the law—the blessings and the curses—according to all that is written in the Book of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS8_35","007_8_35","JOS","8","35","35","There was not a word of all that Moses had commanded that Joshua failed to read before the whole assembly of Israel, including the women, the little ones, and the foreigners who lived among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_1","007_9_1","JOS","9","1","1","Now when news of this reached all the kings west of the Jordan—those in the hill country, the foothills, and all along the coast of the Great Sea toward Lebanon (the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_2","007_9_2","JOS","9","2","2","they came together to wage war against Joshua and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_3","007_9_3","JOS","9","3","3","But the people of Gibeon, having heard what Joshua had done to Jericho and Ai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_4","007_9_4","JOS","9","4","4","acted deceptively and set out as envoys, carrying on their donkeys worn-out sacks and old wineskins, cracked and mended. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_5","007_9_5","JOS","9","5","5","They put worn, patched sandals on their feet and threadbare clothing on their bodies, and their whole supply of bread was dry and moldy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_6","007_9_6","JOS","9","6","6","They went to Joshua in the camp at Gilgal and said to him and the men of Israel, “We have come from a distant land; please make a treaty with us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_7","007_9_7","JOS","9","7","7","But the men of Israel said to the Hivites, “Perhaps you dwell near us. How can we make a treaty with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_8","007_9_8","JOS","9","8","8","“We are your servants,” they said to Joshua. Then Joshua asked them, “Who are you and where have you come from?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_9","007_9_9","JOS","9","9","9","“Your servants have come from a very distant land,” they replied, “because of the fame of the LORD your God. For we have heard the reports about Him: all that He did in Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_10","007_9_10","JOS","9","10","10","and all that He did to the two kings of the Amorites beyond the Jordan—Sihon king of Heshbon and Og king of Bashan, who reigned in Ashtaroth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_11","007_9_11","JOS","9","11","11","So the elders and inhabitants of our land told us, ‘Take provisions for your journey; go to meet them and say to them: We are your servants. Please make a treaty with us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_12","007_9_12","JOS","9","12","12","This bread of ours was warm when we packed it at home on the day we left to come to you. But look, it is now dry and moldy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_13","007_9_13","JOS","9","13","13","These wineskins were new when we filled them, but look, they are cracked. And these clothes and sandals are worn out from our very long journey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_14","007_9_14","JOS","9","14","14","Then the men of Israel sampled their provisions but did not seek the counsel of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_15","007_9_15","JOS","9","15","15","And Joshua made a treaty of peace with them to let them live, and the leaders of the congregation swore an oath to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_16","007_9_16","JOS","9","16","16","Three days after they had made the treaty with the Gibeonites, the Israelites learned that they were neighbors, living among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_17","007_9_17","JOS","9","17","17","So the Israelites set out and on the third day arrived at their cities—Gibeon, Chephirah, Beeroth, and Kiriath-jearim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_18","007_9_18","JOS","9","18","18","But the Israelites did not attack them, because the leaders of the congregation had sworn an oath to them by the LORD, the God of Israel. And the whole congregation grumbled against the leaders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_19","007_9_19","JOS","9","19","19","All the leaders answered, “We have sworn an oath to them by the LORD, the God of Israel, and now we cannot touch them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_20","007_9_20","JOS","9","20","20","This is how we will treat them: We will let them live, so that no wrath will fall on us because of the oath we swore to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_21","007_9_21","JOS","9","21","21","They continued, “Let them live, but let them be woodcutters and water carriers for the whole congregation.” So the leaders kept their promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_22","007_9_22","JOS","9","22","22","Then Joshua summoned the Gibeonites and said, “Why did you deceive us by telling us you live far away from us, when in fact you live among us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_23","007_9_23","JOS","9","23","23","Now therefore you are under a curse and will perpetually serve as woodcutters and water carriers for the house of my God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_24","007_9_24","JOS","9","24","24","The Gibeonites answered, “Your servants were told clearly that the LORD your God had commanded His servant Moses to give you all the land and wipe out all its inhabitants before you. So we greatly feared for our lives because of you, and that is why we have done this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_25","007_9_25","JOS","9","25","25","Now we are in your hands. Do to us whatever seems good and right to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_26","007_9_26","JOS","9","26","26","So Joshua did this and delivered them from the hands of the Israelites, and they did not kill the Gibeonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS9_27","007_9_27","JOS","9","27","27","On that day he made them woodcutters and water carriers, as they are to this day for the congregation of the LORD and for the altar at the place He would choose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_1","007_10_1","JOS","10","1","1","Now Adoni-zedek king of Jerusalem heard that Joshua had captured Ai and devoted it to destruction—doing to Ai and its king as he had done to Jericho and its king—and that the people of Gibeon had made peace with Israel and were living near them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_2","007_10_2","JOS","10","2","2","So Adoni-zedek and his people were greatly alarmed, because Gibeon was a great city, like one of the royal cities; it was larger than Ai, and all its men were mighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_3","007_10_3","JOS","10","3","3","Therefore Adoni-zedek king of Jerusalem sent word to Hoham king of Hebron, Piram king of Jarmuth, Japhia king of Lachish, and Debir king of Eglon, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_4","007_10_4","JOS","10","4","4","“Come up and help me. We will attack Gibeon, because they have made peace with Joshua and the Israelites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_5","007_10_5","JOS","10","5","5","So the five kings of the Amorites—the kings of Jerusalem, Hebron, Jarmuth, Lachish, and Eglon—joined forces and advanced with all their armies. They camped before Gibeon and made war against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_6","007_10_6","JOS","10","6","6","Then the men of Gibeon sent word to Joshua in the camp at Gilgal: “Do not abandon your servants. Come quickly and save us! Help us, because all the kings of the Amorites from the hill country have joined forces against us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_7","007_10_7","JOS","10","7","7","So Joshua and his whole army, including all the mighty men of valor, came from Gilgal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_8","007_10_8","JOS","10","8","8","The LORD said to Joshua, “Do not be afraid of them, for I have delivered them into your hand. Not one of them shall stand against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_9","007_10_9","JOS","10","9","9","After marching all night from Gilgal, Joshua caught them by surprise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_10","007_10_10","JOS","10","10","10","And the LORD threw them into confusion before Israel, who defeated them in a great slaughter at Gibeon, pursued them along the ascent to Beth-horon, and struck them down as far as Azekah and Makkedah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_11","007_10_11","JOS","10","11","11","As they fled before Israel along the descent from Beth-horon to Azekah, the LORD cast down on them large hailstones from the sky, and more of them were killed by the hailstones than by the swords of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_12","007_10_12","JOS","10","12","12","On the day that the LORD gave the Amorites over to the Israelites, Joshua spoke to the LORD in the presence of Israel: “O sun, stand still over Gibeon, O moon, over the Valley of Aijalon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_13","007_10_13","JOS","10","13","13","So the sun stood still and the moon stopped until the nation took vengeance upon its enemies. Is this not written in the Book of Jashar? “So the sun stopped in the middle of the sky and delayed going down about a full day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_14","007_10_14","JOS","10","14","14","There has been no day like it before or since, when the LORD listened to the voice of a man, because the LORD fought for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_15","007_10_15","JOS","10","15","15","Then Joshua returned with all Israel to the camp at Gilgal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_16","007_10_16","JOS","10","16","16","Now the five kings had fled and hidden in the cave at Makkedah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_17","007_10_17","JOS","10","17","17","And Joshua was informed: “The five kings have been found; they are hiding in the cave at Makkedah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_18","007_10_18","JOS","10","18","18","So Joshua said, “Roll large stones against the mouth of the cave, and post men there to guard them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_19","007_10_19","JOS","10","19","19","But you, do not stop there. Pursue your enemies and attack them from behind. Do not let them reach their cities, for the LORD your God has delivered them into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_20","007_10_20","JOS","10","20","20","So Joshua and the Israelites continued to inflict a terrible slaughter until they had finished them off, and the remaining survivors retreated to the fortified cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_21","007_10_21","JOS","10","21","21","The whole army returned safely to Joshua in the camp at Makkedah, and no one dared to utter a word against the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_22","007_10_22","JOS","10","22","22","Then Joshua said, “Open the mouth of the cave and bring those five kings out to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_23","007_10_23","JOS","10","23","23","So they brought the five kings out of the cave—the kings of Jerusalem, Hebron, Jarmuth, Lachish, and Eglon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_24","007_10_24","JOS","10","24","24","When they had brought the kings to Joshua, he summoned all the men of Israel and said to the army commanders who had accompanied him, “Come here and put your feet on the necks of these kings.” So the commanders came forward and put their feet on their necks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_25","007_10_25","JOS","10","25","25","“Do not be afraid or discouraged,” Joshua said. “Be strong and courageous, for the LORD will do this to all the enemies you fight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_26","007_10_26","JOS","10","26","26","After this, Joshua struck down and killed the kings, and he hung their bodies on five trees and left them there until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_27","007_10_27","JOS","10","27","27","At sunset Joshua ordered that they be taken down from the trees and thrown into the cave in which they had hidden. Then large stones were placed against the mouth of the cave, and the stones are there to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_28","007_10_28","JOS","10","28","28","On that day Joshua captured Makkedah and put it to the sword, along with its king. He devoted to destruction everyone in the city, leaving no survivors. So he did to the king of Makkedah as he had done to the king of Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_29","007_10_29","JOS","10","29","29","Then Joshua and all Israel with him moved on from Makkedah to Libnah and fought against Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_30","007_10_30","JOS","10","30","30","And the LORD also delivered that city and its king into the hand of Israel, and Joshua put all the people to the sword, leaving no survivors. And he did to the king of Libnah as he had done to the king of Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_31","007_10_31","JOS","10","31","31","And Joshua and all Israel with him moved on from Libnah to Lachish. They laid siege to it and fought against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_32","007_10_32","JOS","10","32","32","And the LORD delivered Lachish into the hand of Israel, and Joshua captured it on the second day. He put all the people to the sword, just as he had done to Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_33","007_10_33","JOS","10","33","33","At that time Horam king of Gezer went to help Lachish, but Joshua struck him down along with his people, leaving no survivors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_34","007_10_34","JOS","10","34","34","So Joshua moved on from Lachish to Eglon, and all Israel with him. They laid siege to it and fought against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_35","007_10_35","JOS","10","35","35","That day they captured Eglon and put it to the sword, and Joshua devoted to destruction everyone in the city, just as he had done to Lachish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_36","007_10_36","JOS","10","36","36","Then Joshua and all Israel with him went up from Eglon to Hebron and fought against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_37","007_10_37","JOS","10","37","37","They captured it and put to the sword its king, all its villages, and all the people. Joshua left no survivors, just as he had done at Eglon; he devoted to destruction Hebron and everyone in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_38","007_10_38","JOS","10","38","38","Finally Joshua and all Israel with him turned toward Debir and fought against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_39","007_10_39","JOS","10","39","39","And they captured Debir, its king, and all its villages. They put them to the sword and devoted to destruction everyone in the city, leaving no survivors. Joshua did to Debir and its king as he had done to Hebron and as he had done to Libnah and its king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_40","007_10_40","JOS","10","40","40","So Joshua conquered the whole region—the hill country, the Negev, the foothills, and the slopes, together with all their kings—leaving no survivors. He devoted to destruction everything that breathed, just as the LORD, the God of Israel, had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_41","007_10_41","JOS","10","41","41","Joshua conquered the area from Kadesh-barnea to Gaza, and the whole region of Goshen as far as Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_42","007_10_42","JOS","10","42","42","And because the LORD, the God of Israel, fought for Israel, Joshua captured all these kings and their land in one campaign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS10_43","007_10_43","JOS","10","43","43","Then Joshua returned with all Israel to the camp at Gilgal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_1","007_11_1","JOS","11","1","1","Now when Jabin king of Hazor heard about these things, he sent word to Jobab king of Madon; to the kings of Shimron and Achshaph; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_2","007_11_2","JOS","11","2","2","to the kings of the north in the mountains, in the Arabah south of Chinnereth, in the foothills, and in Naphoth-dor to the west; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_3","007_11_3","JOS","11","3","3","to the Canaanites in the east and west; to the Amorites, Hittites, Perizzites, and Jebusites in the hill country; and to the Hivites at the foot of Hermon in the land of Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_4","007_11_4","JOS","11","4","4","So these kings came out with all their armies, a multitude as numerous as the sand on the seashore, along with a great number of horses and chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_5","007_11_5","JOS","11","5","5","All these kings joined forces and encamped at the waters of Merom to fight against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_6","007_11_6","JOS","11","6","6","Then the LORD said to Joshua, “Do not be afraid of them, for by this time tomorrow I will deliver all of them slain before Israel. You are to hamstring their horses and burn up their chariots.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_7","007_11_7","JOS","11","7","7","So by the waters of Merom, Joshua and his whole army came upon them suddenly and attacked them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_8","007_11_8","JOS","11","8","8","and the LORD delivered them into the hand of Israel, who struck them down and pursued them all the way to Greater Sidon and Misrephoth-maim, and eastward as far as the Valley of Mizpeh. They struck them down, leaving no survivors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_9","007_11_9","JOS","11","9","9","Joshua treated them as the LORD had told him; he hamstrung their horses and burned up their chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_10","007_11_10","JOS","11","10","10","At that time Joshua turned back and captured Hazor and put its king to the sword, because Hazor was formerly the head of all these kingdoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_11","007_11_11","JOS","11","11","11","The Israelites put everyone in Hazor to the sword, devoting them to destruction. Nothing that breathed remained, and Joshua burned down Hazor itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_12","007_11_12","JOS","11","12","12","Joshua captured all these kings and their cities and put them to the sword. He devoted them to destruction, as Moses the LORD’s servant had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_13","007_11_13","JOS","11","13","13","Yet Israel did not burn any of the cities built on their mounds, except Hazor, which Joshua burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_14","007_11_14","JOS","11","14","14","The Israelites took for themselves all the plunder and livestock of these cities, but they put all the people to the sword until they had completely destroyed them, not sparing anyone who breathed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_15","007_11_15","JOS","11","15","15","As the LORD had commanded His servant Moses, so Moses commanded Joshua. That is what Joshua did, leaving nothing undone of all that the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_16","007_11_16","JOS","11","16","16","So Joshua took this entire region: the hill country, all the Negev, all the land of Goshen, the western foothills, the Arabah, and the mountains of Israel and their foothills, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_17","007_11_17","JOS","11","17","17","from Mount Halak, which rises toward Seir, as far as Baal-gad in the Valley of Lebanon at the foot of Mount Hermon. He captured all their kings and struck them down, putting them to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_18","007_11_18","JOS","11","18","18","Joshua waged war against all these kings for a long period of time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_19","007_11_19","JOS","11","19","19","No city made peace with the Israelites except the Hivites living in Gibeon; all others were taken in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_20","007_11_20","JOS","11","20","20","For it was of the LORD to harden their hearts to engage Israel in battle, so that they would be set apart for destruction and would receive no mercy, being annihilated as the LORD had commanded Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_21","007_11_21","JOS","11","21","21","At that time Joshua proceeded to eliminate the Anakim from the hill country of Hebron, Debir, and Anab, and from all the hill country of Judah and of Israel. Joshua devoted them to destruction, along with their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_22","007_11_22","JOS","11","22","22","No Anakim were left in the land of the Israelites; only in Gaza, Gath, and Ashdod did any survive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS11_23","007_11_23","JOS","11","23","23","So Joshua took the entire land, in keeping with all that the LORD had spoken to Moses. And Joshua gave it as an inheritance to Israel according to the allotments to their tribes. Then the land had rest from war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_1","007_12_1","JOS","12","1","1","Now these are the kings of the land whom the Israelites struck down and whose lands they took beyond the Jordan to the east, from the Arnon Valley to Mount Hermon, including all the Arabah eastward: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_2","007_12_2","JOS","12","2","2","Sihon king of the Amorites, who lived in Heshbon. He ruled from Aroer on the rim of the Arnon Valley, along the middle of the valley, up to the Jabbok River (the border of the Ammonites), that is, half of Gilead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_3","007_12_3","JOS","12","3","3","as well as the Arabah east of the Sea of Chinnereth to the Sea of the Arabah (the Salt Sea), eastward through Beth-jeshimoth, and southward below the slopes of Pisgah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_4","007_12_4","JOS","12","4","4","And Og king of Bashan, one of the remnant of the Rephaim, who lived in Ashtaroth and Edrei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_5","007_12_5","JOS","12","5","5","He ruled over Mount Hermon, Salecah, all of Bashan up to the border of the Geshurites and Maacathites, and half of Gilead to the border of Sihon king of Heshbon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_6","007_12_6","JOS","12","6","6","Moses, the servant of the LORD, and the Israelites had struck them down and given their land as an inheritance to the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_7","007_12_7","JOS","12","7","7","And these are the kings of the land that Joshua and the Israelites conquered beyond the Jordan to the west, from Baal-gad in the Valley of Lebanon to Mount Halak, which rises toward Seir (according to the allotments to the tribes of Israel, Joshua gave them as an inheritance ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_8","007_12_8","JOS","12","8","8","the hill country, the foothills, the Arabah, the slopes, the wilderness, and the Negev—the lands of the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites): ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_9","007_12_9","JOS","12","9","9","the king of Jericho, one; the king of Ai, which is near Bethel, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_10","007_12_10","JOS","12","10","10","the king of Jerusalem, one; the king of Hebron, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_11","007_12_11","JOS","12","11","11","the king of Jarmuth, one; the king of Lachish, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_12","007_12_12","JOS","12","12","12","the king of Eglon, one; the king of Gezer, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_13","007_12_13","JOS","12","13","13","the king of Debir, one; the king of Geder, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_14","007_12_14","JOS","12","14","14","the king of Hormah, one; the king of Arad, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_15","007_12_15","JOS","12","15","15","the king of Libnah, one; the king of Adullam, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_16","007_12_16","JOS","12","16","16","the king of Makkedah, one; the king of Bethel, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_17","007_12_17","JOS","12","17","17","the king of Tappuah, one; the king of Hepher, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_18","007_12_18","JOS","12","18","18","the king of Aphek, one; the king of Lasharon, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_19","007_12_19","JOS","12","19","19","the king of Madon, one; the king of Hazor, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_20","007_12_20","JOS","12","20","20","the king of Shimron-meron, one; the king of Achshaph, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_21","007_12_21","JOS","12","21","21","the king of Taanach, one; the king of Megiddo, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_22","007_12_22","JOS","12","22","22","the king of Kedesh, one; the king of Jokneam in Carmel, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_23","007_12_23","JOS","12","23","23","the king of Dor in Naphath-dor, one; the king of Goiim in Gilgal, one; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS12_24","007_12_24","JOS","12","24","24","and the king of Tirzah, one. So there were thirty-one kings in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_1","007_13_1","JOS","13","1","1","Now Joshua was old and well along in years, and the LORD said to him, “You are old and well along in years, but very much of the land remains to be possessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_2","007_13_2","JOS","13","2","2","This is the land that remains: All the territory of the Philistines and the Geshurites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_3","007_13_3","JOS","13","3","3","from the Shihor east of Egypt to the territory of Ekron on the north (considered to be Canaanite territory)—that of the five Philistine rulers of Gaza, Ashdod, Ashkelon, Gath, and Ekron, as well as that of the Avvites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_4","007_13_4","JOS","13","4","4","to the south, all the land of the Canaanites, from Mearah of the Sidonians to Aphek, as far as the border of the Amorites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_5","007_13_5","JOS","13","5","5","the land of the Gebalites; and all Lebanon to the east, from Baal-gad below Mount Hermon to Lebo-hamath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_6","007_13_6","JOS","13","6","6","All the inhabitants of the hill country from Lebanon to Misrephoth-maim—all the Sidonians—I Myself will drive out before the Israelites. Be sure to divide it by lot as an inheritance to Israel, as I have commanded you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_7","007_13_7","JOS","13","7","7","Now therefore divide this land as an inheritance to the nine tribes and the half-tribe of Manasseh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_8","007_13_8","JOS","13","8","8","The other half of Manasseh, along with the Reubenites and Gadites, had received the inheritance Moses had given them beyond the Jordan to the east, just as Moses the servant of the LORD had assigned to them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_9","007_13_9","JOS","13","9","9","The area from Aroer on the rim of the Arnon Valley, along with the city in the middle of the valley, the whole plateau of Medeba as far as Dibon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_10","007_13_10","JOS","13","10","10","and all the cities of Sihon king of the Amorites who reigned in Heshbon, as far as the border of the Ammonites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_11","007_13_11","JOS","13","11","11","also Gilead and the territory of the Geshurites and Maacathites, all of Mount Hermon, and all Bashan as far as Salecah— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_12","007_13_12","JOS","13","12","12","the whole kingdom of Og in Bashan, who had reigned in Ashtaroth and Edrei and had remained as a remnant of the Rephaim. Moses had struck them down and dispossessed them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_13","007_13_13","JOS","13","13","13","but the Israelites did not drive out the Geshurites or the Maacathites. So Geshur and Maacath dwell among the Israelites to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_14","007_13_14","JOS","13","14","14","To the tribe of Levi, however, Moses had given no inheritance. The food offerings to the LORD, the God of Israel, are their inheritance, just as He had promised them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_15","007_13_15","JOS","13","15","15","This is what Moses had given to the clans of the tribe of Reuben: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_16","007_13_16","JOS","13","16","16","The territory from Aroer on the rim of the Arnon Valley, along with the city in the middle of the valley, to the whole plateau beyond Medeba, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_17","007_13_17","JOS","13","17","17","to Heshbon and all its cities on the plateau, including Dibon, Bamoth-baal, Beth-baal-meon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_18","007_13_18","JOS","13","18","18","Jahaz, Kedemoth, Mephaath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_19","007_13_19","JOS","13","19","19","Kiriathaim, Sibmah, Zereth-shahar on the hill in the valley, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_20","007_13_20","JOS","13","20","20","Beth-peor, the slopes of Pisgah, and Beth-jeshimoth— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_21","007_13_21","JOS","13","21","21","all the cities of the plateau and all the kingdom of Sihon king of the Amorites, who reigned in Heshbon until Moses killed him and the chiefs of Midian (Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, and Reba), the princes of Sihon who lived in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_22","007_13_22","JOS","13","22","22","The Israelites also killed the diviner Balaam son of Beor along with the others they put to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_23","007_13_23","JOS","13","23","23","And the border of the Reubenites was the bank of the Jordan. This was the inheritance of the clans of the Reubenites, including the cities and villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_24","007_13_24","JOS","13","24","24","This is what Moses had given to the clans of the tribe of Gad: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_25","007_13_25","JOS","13","25","25","The territory of Jazer, all the cities of Gilead, and half the land of the Ammonites as far as Aroer, near Rabbah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_26","007_13_26","JOS","13","26","26","the territory from Heshbon to Ramath-mizpeh and Betonim, and from Mahanaim to the border of Debir; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_27","007_13_27","JOS","13","27","27","and in the valley, Beth-haram, Beth-nimrah, Succoth, and Zaphon, with the rest of the kingdom of Sihon king of Heshbon (the territory on the east side of the Jordan up to the edge of the Sea of Chinnereth). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_28","007_13_28","JOS","13","28","28","This was the inheritance of the clans of the Gadites, including the cities and villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_29","007_13_29","JOS","13","29","29","This is what Moses had given to the clans of the half-tribe of Manasseh, that is, to half the tribe of the descendants of Manasseh: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_30","007_13_30","JOS","13","30","30","The territory from Mahanaim through all Bashan—all the kingdom of Og king of Bashan, including all the towns of Jair that are in Bashan, sixty cities; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_31","007_13_31","JOS","13","31","31","half of Gilead; and Ashtaroth and Edrei, the royal cities of Og in Bashan. All this was for the clans of the descendants of Machir son of Manasseh, that is, half of the descendants of Machir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_32","007_13_32","JOS","13","32","32","These were the portions Moses had given them on the plains of Moab beyond the Jordan, east of Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS13_33","007_13_33","JOS","13","33","33","To the tribe of Levi, however, Moses had given no inheritance. The LORD, the God of Israel, is their inheritance, just as He had promised them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_1","007_14_1","JOS","14","1","1","Now these are the portions that the Israelites inherited in the land of Canaan, as distributed by Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the heads of the families of the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_2","007_14_2","JOS","14","2","2","Their inheritance was assigned by lot for the nine and a half tribes, as the LORD had commanded through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_3","007_14_3","JOS","14","3","3","For Moses had given the inheritance east of the Jordan to the other two and a half tribes. But he granted no inheritance among them to the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_4","007_14_4","JOS","14","4","4","The descendants of Joseph became two tribes, Manasseh and Ephraim. And no portion of the land was given to the Levites, except for cities in which to live, along with pasturelands for their flocks and herds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_5","007_14_5","JOS","14","5","5","So the Israelites did as the LORD had commanded Moses, and they divided the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_6","007_14_6","JOS","14","6","6","Then the sons of Judah approached Joshua at Gilgal, and Caleb son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite said to him, “You know what the LORD said to Moses the man of God at Kadesh-barnea about you and me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_7","007_14_7","JOS","14","7","7","I was forty years old when Moses the servant of the LORD sent me from Kadesh-barnea to spy out the land, and I brought back to him an honest report. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_8","007_14_8","JOS","14","8","8","Although my brothers who went with me made the hearts of the people melt with fear, I remained loyal to the LORD my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_9","007_14_9","JOS","14","9","9","On that day Moses swore to me, saying, ‘Surely the land on which you have set foot will be an inheritance to you and your children forever, because you have wholly followed the LORD my God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_10","007_14_10","JOS","14","10","10","Now behold, as the LORD promised, He has kept me alive these forty-five years since He spoke this word to Moses, while Israel wandered in the wilderness. So here I am today, eighty-five years old, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_11","007_14_11","JOS","14","11","11","still as strong today as I was the day Moses sent me out. As my strength was then, so it is now for war, for going out, and for coming in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_12","007_14_12","JOS","14","12","12","Now therefore give me this hill country that the LORD promised me on that day, for you yourself heard then that the Anakim were there, with great and fortified cities. Perhaps with the LORD’s help I will drive them out, as the LORD has spoken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_13","007_14_13","JOS","14","13","13","Then Joshua blessed Caleb son of Jephunneh and gave him Hebron as his inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_14","007_14_14","JOS","14","14","14","Therefore Hebron belongs to Caleb son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite as an inheritance to this day, because he wholly followed the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS14_15","007_14_15","JOS","14","15","15","(Hebron used to be called Kiriath-arba, after Arba, the greatest man among the Anakim.) Then the land had rest from war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_1","007_15_1","JOS","15","1","1","Now the allotment for the clans of the tribe of Judah extended to the border of Edom, to the Wilderness of Zin at the extreme southern boundary: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_2","007_15_2","JOS","15","2","2","Their southern border started at the bay on the southern tip of the Salt Sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_3","007_15_3","JOS","15","3","3","proceeded south of the Ascent of Akrabbim, continued on to Zin, went over to the south of Kadesh-barnea, ran past Hezron up to Addar, and curved toward Karka. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_4","007_15_4","JOS","15","4","4","It proceeded to Azmon, joined the Brook of Egypt, and ended at the Sea. This was their southern border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_5","007_15_5","JOS","15","5","5","The eastern border was the Salt Sea as far as the mouth of the Jordan. The northern border started from the bay of the sea at the mouth of the Jordan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_6","007_15_6","JOS","15","6","6","went up to Beth-hoglah, proceeded north of Beth-arabah, and went up to the Stone of Bohan son of Reuben. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_7","007_15_7","JOS","15","7","7","Then the border went up to Debir from the Valley of Achor, turning north to Gilgal, which faces the Ascent of Adummim south of the ravine. It continued along the waters of En-shemesh and came out at En-rogel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_8","007_15_8","JOS","15","8","8","From there the border went up the Valley of Ben-hinnom along the southern slope of the Jebusites (that is, Jerusalem) and ascended to the top of the hill that faces the Valley of Hinnom on the west, at the northern end of the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_9","007_15_9","JOS","15","9","9","From the hilltop the border curved to the spring of the Waters of Nephtoah, proceeded to the cities of Mount Ephron, and then bent around toward Baalah (that is, Kiriath-jearim). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_10","007_15_10","JOS","15","10","10","The border curled westward from Baalah to Mount Seir, ran along the northern slope of Mount Jearim (that is, Chesalon), went down to Beth-shemesh, and crossed to Timnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_11","007_15_11","JOS","15","11","11","Then it went out to the northern slope of Ekron, curved toward Shikkeron, proceeded to Mount Baalah, went on to Jabneel, and ended at the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_12","007_15_12","JOS","15","12","12","And the western border was the coastline of the Great Sea. These are the boundaries around the clans of the descendants of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_13","007_15_13","JOS","15","13","13","According to the LORD’s command to him, Joshua gave Caleb son of Jephunneh a portion among the sons of Judah—Kiriath-arba, that is, Hebron. (Arba was the forefather of Anak.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_14","007_15_14","JOS","15","14","14","And Caleb drove out from there the three sons of Anak—the descendants of Sheshai, Ahiman, and Talmai, the children of Anak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_15","007_15_15","JOS","15","15","15","From there he marched against the inhabitants of Debir (formerly known as Kiriath-sepher). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_16","007_15_16","JOS","15","16","16","And Caleb said, “To the man who strikes down Kiriath-sepher and captures it, I will give my daughter Acsah in marriage.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_17","007_15_17","JOS","15","17","17","So Othniel son of Caleb’s brother Kenaz captured the city, and Caleb gave his daughter Acsah to him in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_18","007_15_18","JOS","15","18","18","One day Acsah came to Othniel and urged him to ask her father for a field. When she got off her donkey, Caleb asked her, “What do you desire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_19","007_15_19","JOS","15","19","19","“Give me a blessing,” she answered. “Since you have given me land in the Negev, give me springs of water as well.” So Caleb gave her both the upper and lower springs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_20","007_15_20","JOS","15","20","20","This is the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_21","007_15_21","JOS","15","21","21","These were the southernmost cities of the tribe of Judah in the Negev toward the border of Edom: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_22","007_15_22","JOS","15","22","22","Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_23","007_15_23","JOS","15","23","23","Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_24","007_15_24","JOS","15","24","24","Ziph, Telem, Bealoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_25","007_15_25","JOS","15","25","25","Hazor-hadattah, Kerioth-hezron (that is, Hazor), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_26","007_15_26","JOS","15","26","26","Amam, Shema, Moladah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_27","007_15_27","JOS","15","27","27","Hazar-gaddah, Heshmon, Beth-pelet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_28","007_15_28","JOS","15","28","28","Hazar-shual, Beersheba, Biziothiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_29","007_15_29","JOS","15","29","29","Baalah, Iim, Ezem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_30","007_15_30","JOS","15","30","30","Eltolad, Chesil, Hormah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_31","007_15_31","JOS","15","31","31","Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_32","007_15_32","JOS","15","32","32","Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain, and Rimmon—twenty-nine cities in all, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_33","007_15_33","JOS","15","33","33","These were in the foothills: Eshtaol, Zorah, Ashnah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_34","007_15_34","JOS","15","34","34","Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_35","007_15_35","JOS","15","35","35","Jarmuth, Adullam, Socoh, Azekah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_36","007_15_36","JOS","15","36","36","Shaaraim, Adithaim, and Gederah (or Gederothaim)—fourteen cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_37","007_15_37","JOS","15","37","37","Zenan, Hadashah, Migdal-gad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_38","007_15_38","JOS","15","38","38","Dilan, Mizpeh, Joktheel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_39","007_15_39","JOS","15","39","39","Lachish, Bozkath, Eglon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_40","007_15_40","JOS","15","40","40","Cabbon, Lahmas, Chitlish, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_41","007_15_41","JOS","15","41","41","Gederoth, Beth-dagon, Naamah, and Makkedah—sixteen cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_42","007_15_42","JOS","15","42","42","Libnah, Ether, Ashan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_43","007_15_43","JOS","15","43","43","Iphtah, Ashnah, Nezib, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_44","007_15_44","JOS","15","44","44","Keilah, Achzib, and Mareshah—nine cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_45","007_15_45","JOS","15","45","45","Ekron, with its towns and villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_46","007_15_46","JOS","15","46","46","from Ekron to the sea, all the cities near Ashdod, along with their villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_47","007_15_47","JOS","15","47","47","Ashdod, with its towns and villages; Gaza, with its towns and villages, as far as the Brook of Egypt and the coastline of the Great Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_48","007_15_48","JOS","15","48","48","These were in the hill country: Shamir, Jattir, Socoh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_49","007_15_49","JOS","15","49","49","Dannah, Kiriath-sannah (that is, Debir), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_50","007_15_50","JOS","15","50","50","Anab, Eshtemoh, Anim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_51","007_15_51","JOS","15","51","51","Goshen, Holon, and Giloh—eleven cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_52","007_15_52","JOS","15","52","52","Arab, Dumah, Eshan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_53","007_15_53","JOS","15","53","53","Janim, Beth-tappuah, Aphekah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_54","007_15_54","JOS","15","54","54","Humtah, Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron), and Zior—nine cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_55","007_15_55","JOS","15","55","55","Maon, Carmel, Ziph, Juttah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_56","007_15_56","JOS","15","56","56","Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_57","007_15_57","JOS","15","57","57","Kain, Gibeah, and Timnah—ten cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_58","007_15_58","JOS","15","58","58","Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_59","007_15_59","JOS","15","59","59","Maarath, Beth-anoth, and Eltekon—six cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_60","007_15_60","JOS","15","60","60","Kiriath-baal (that is, Kiriath-jearim), and Rabbah—two cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_61","007_15_61","JOS","15","61","61","These were in the wilderness: Beth-arabah, Middin, Secacah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_62","007_15_62","JOS","15","62","62","Nibshan, the City of Salt, and En-gedi—six cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS15_63","007_15_63","JOS","15","63","63","But the descendants of Judah could not drive out the Jebusites living in Jerusalem. So to this day the Jebusites live there among the descendants of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_1","007_16_1","JOS","16","1","1","The allotment for the descendants of Joseph extended from the Jordan at Jericho to the waters of Jericho on the east, through the wilderness that goes up from Jericho into the hill country of Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_2","007_16_2","JOS","16","2","2","It went on from Bethel (that is, Luz) and proceeded to the border of the Archites in Ataroth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_3","007_16_3","JOS","16","3","3","Then it descended westward to the border of the Japhletites as far as the border of Lower Beth-horon and on to Gezer, and it ended at the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_4","007_16_4","JOS","16","4","4","So Ephraim and Manasseh, the sons of Joseph, received their inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_5","007_16_5","JOS","16","5","5","This was the territory of the descendants of Ephraim by their clans: The border of their inheritance went from Ataroth-addar in the east to Upper Beth-horon ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_6","007_16_6","JOS","16","6","6","and out toward the Sea. From Michmethath on the north it turned eastward toward Taanath-shiloh and passed by it to Janoah on the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_7","007_16_7","JOS","16","7","7","From Janoah it went down to Ataroth and Naarah, and then reached Jericho and came out at the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_8","007_16_8","JOS","16","8","8","From Tappuah the border went westward to the Brook of Kanah and ended at the Sea. This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Ephraim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_9","007_16_9","JOS","16","9","9","along with all the cities and villages set apart for the descendants of Ephraim within the inheritance of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS16_10","007_16_10","JOS","16","10","10","But they did not drive out the Canaanites who lived in Gezer. So the Canaanites dwell among the Ephraimites to this day, but they are forced laborers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_1","007_17_1","JOS","17","1","1","Now this was the allotment for the tribe of Manasseh as Joseph’s firstborn son, namely for Machir the firstborn of Manasseh and father of the Gileadites, who had received Gilead and Bashan because Machir was a man of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_2","007_17_2","JOS","17","2","2","So this allotment was for the rest of the descendants of Manasseh—the clans of Abiezer, Helek, Asriel, Shechem, Hepher, and Shemida. These are the other male descendants of the clans of Manasseh son of Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_3","007_17_3","JOS","17","3","3","But Zelophehad son of Hepher (the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh) had no sons but only daughters. These are the names of his daughters: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_4","007_17_4","JOS","17","4","4","They approached Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the leaders, and said, “The LORD commanded Moses to give us an inheritance among our brothers.” So Joshua gave them an inheritance among their father’s brothers, in keeping with the command of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_5","007_17_5","JOS","17","5","5","Thus ten shares fell to Manasseh, in addition to the land of Gilead and Bashan beyond the Jordan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_6","007_17_6","JOS","17","6","6","because the daughters of Manasseh received an inheritance among his sons. And the land of Gilead belonged to the rest of the sons of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_7","007_17_7","JOS","17","7","7","Now the border of Manasseh went from Asher to Michmethath near Shechem, then southward to include the inhabitants of En-tappuah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_8","007_17_8","JOS","17","8","8","The region of Tappuah belonged to Manasseh, but Tappuah itself, on the border of Manasseh, belonged to Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_9","007_17_9","JOS","17","9","9","From there the border continued southward to the Brook of Kanah. There were cities belonging to Ephraim among the cities of Manasseh, but the border of Manasseh was on the north side of the brook and ended at the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_10","007_17_10","JOS","17","10","10","Ephraim’s territory was to the south, and Manasseh’s was to the north, having the Sea as its border and adjoining Asher on the north and Issachar on the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_11","007_17_11","JOS","17","11","11","Within Issachar and Asher, Manasseh was assigned Beth-shean, Ibleam, Dor (that is, Naphath), Endor, Taanach, and Megiddo, each with their surrounding settlements. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_12","007_17_12","JOS","17","12","12","But the descendants of Manasseh were unable to occupy these cities, because the Canaanites were determined to stay in this land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_13","007_17_13","JOS","17","13","13","However, when the Israelites grew stronger, they put the Canaanites to forced labor; but they failed to drive them out completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_14","007_17_14","JOS","17","14","14","Then the sons of Joseph said to Joshua, “Why have you given us only one portion as an inheritance? We have many people, because the LORD has blessed us abundantly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_15","007_17_15","JOS","17","15","15","Joshua answered them, “If you have so many people that the hill country of Ephraim is too small for you, go to the forest and clear for yourself an area in the land of the Perizzites and the Rephaim.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_16","007_17_16","JOS","17","16","16","“The hill country is not enough for us,” they replied, “and all the Canaanites who live in the valley have iron chariots, both in Beth-shean with its towns and in the Valley of Jezreel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_17","007_17_17","JOS","17","17","17","So Joshua said to the house of Joseph—to Ephraim and Manasseh—“You have many people and great strength. You shall not have just one allotment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS17_18","007_17_18","JOS","17","18","18","because the hill country will be yours as well. It is a forest; clear it, and its farthest limits will be yours. Although the Canaanites have iron chariots and although they are strong, you can drive them out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_1","007_18_1","JOS","18","1","1","Then the whole congregation of Israel assembled at Shiloh and set up the Tent of Meeting there. And though the land was subdued before them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_2","007_18_2","JOS","18","2","2","there were still seven tribes of Israel who had not yet received their inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_3","007_18_3","JOS","18","3","3","So Joshua said to the Israelites, “How long will you put off entering and possessing the land that the LORD, the God of your fathers, has given you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_4","007_18_4","JOS","18","4","4","Appoint three men from each tribe, and I will send them out to survey the land and map it out, according to the inheritance of each. Then they will return to me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_5","007_18_5","JOS","18","5","5","and divide the land into seven portions. Judah shall remain in their territory in the south, and the house of Joseph shall remain in their territory in the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_6","007_18_6","JOS","18","6","6","When you have mapped out the seven portions of land and brought it to me, I will cast lots for you here in the presence of the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_7","007_18_7","JOS","18","7","7","The Levites, however, have no portion among you, because their inheritance is the priesthood of the LORD. And Gad, Reuben, and half the tribe of Manasseh have already received the inheritance that Moses the servant of the LORD gave them beyond the Jordan to the east.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_8","007_18_8","JOS","18","8","8","As the men got up to go out, Joshua commanded them to map out the land, saying, “Go and survey the land, map it out, and return to me. Then I will cast lots for you here in Shiloh in the presence of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_9","007_18_9","JOS","18","9","9","So the men departed and went throughout the land, mapping it city by city into seven portions. Then they returned with the document to Joshua at the camp in Shiloh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_10","007_18_10","JOS","18","10","10","And Joshua cast lots for them in the presence of the LORD at Shiloh, where he distributed the land to the Israelites according to their divisions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_11","007_18_11","JOS","18","11","11","The first lot came up for the clans of the tribe of Benjamin. Their allotted territory lay between the tribes of Judah and Joseph: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_12","007_18_12","JOS","18","12","12","On the north side their border began at the Jordan, went up past the northern slope of Jericho, headed west through the hill country, and came out at the wilderness of Beth-aven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_13","007_18_13","JOS","18","13","13","From there the border crossed over to the southern slope of Luz (that is, Bethel) and went down to Ataroth-addar on the hill south of Lower Beth-horon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_14","007_18_14","JOS","18","14","14","On the west side the border curved southward from the hill facing Beth-horon on the south and came out at Kiriath-baal (that is, Kiriath-jearim), a city of the sons of Judah. This was the western side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_15","007_18_15","JOS","18","15","15","On the south side the border began at the outskirts of Kiriath-jearim and extended westward to the spring at the Waters of Nephtoah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_16","007_18_16","JOS","18","16","16","Then it went down to the foot of the hill that faces the Valley of Ben-hinnom at the northern end of the Valley of Rephaim and ran down the Valley of Hinnom toward the southern slope of the Jebusites and downward to En-rogel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_17","007_18_17","JOS","18","17","17","From there it curved northward and proceeded to En-shemesh and on to Geliloth facing the Ascent of Adummim, and continued down to the Stone of Bohan son of Reuben. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_18","007_18_18","JOS","18","18","18","Then it went on to the northern slope of Beth-arabah and went down into the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_19","007_18_19","JOS","18","19","19","The border continued to the northern slope of Beth-hoglah and came out at the northern bay of the Salt Sea, at the mouth of the Jordan. This was the southern border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_20","007_18_20","JOS","18","20","20","On the east side the border was the Jordan. These were the borders around the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_21","007_18_21","JOS","18","21","21","These were the cities of the clans of the tribe of Benjamin: Jericho, Beth-hoglah, Emek-keziz, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_22","007_18_22","JOS","18","22","22","Beth-arabah, Zemaraim, Bethel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_23","007_18_23","JOS","18","23","23","Avvim, Parah, Ophrah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_24","007_18_24","JOS","18","24","24","Chephar-ammoni, Ophni, and Geba—twelve cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_25","007_18_25","JOS","18","25","25","Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_26","007_18_26","JOS","18","26","26","Mizpeh, Chephirah, Mozah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_27","007_18_27","JOS","18","27","27","Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS18_28","007_18_28","JOS","18","28","28","Zelah, Haeleph, Jebus (that is, Jerusalem), Gibeah, and Kiriath-jearim—fourteen cities, along with their villages. This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_1","007_19_1","JOS","19","1","1","The second lot came out for the clans of the tribe of Simeon: Their inheritance lay within the territory of Judah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_2","007_19_2","JOS","19","2","2","and included Beersheba (or Sheba), Moladah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_3","007_19_3","JOS","19","3","3","Hazar-shual, Balah, Ezem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_4","007_19_4","JOS","19","4","4","Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_5","007_19_5","JOS","19","5","5","Ziklag, Beth-marcaboth, Hazar-susah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_6","007_19_6","JOS","19","6","6","Beth-lebaoth, and Sharuhen—thirteen cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_7","007_19_7","JOS","19","7","7","Ain, Rimmon, Ether, and Ashan—four cities, along with their villages, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_8","007_19_8","JOS","19","8","8","and all the villages surrounding these cities as far as Baalath-beer (Ramah of the Negev). This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Simeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_9","007_19_9","JOS","19","9","9","The inheritance of the Simeonites was taken from the territory of Judah, because the share for Judah’s descendants was too large for them. So the Simeonites received an inheritance within Judah’s portion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_10","007_19_10","JOS","19","10","10","The third lot came up for the clans of the tribe of Zebulun: The border of their inheritance stretched as far as Sarid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_11","007_19_11","JOS","19","11","11","It went up westward to Maralah, reached Dabbesheth, and met the brook east of Jokneam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_12","007_19_12","JOS","19","12","12","From Sarid it turned eastward along the border of Chisloth-tabor and went on to Daberath and up to Japhia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_13","007_19_13","JOS","19","13","13","From there it crossed eastward to Gath-hepher and to Eth-kazin; it extended to Rimmon and curved around toward Neah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_14","007_19_14","JOS","19","14","14","Then the border circled around the north side of Neah to Hannathon and ended at the Valley of Iphtah-el. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_15","007_19_15","JOS","19","15","15","It also included Kattath, Nahalal, Shimron, Idalah, and Bethlehem. There were twelve cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_16","007_19_16","JOS","19","16","16","This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Zebulun, including these cities and their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_17","007_19_17","JOS","19","17","17","The fourth lot came out for the clans of the tribe of Issachar: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_18","007_19_18","JOS","19","18","18","Their territory included Jezreel, Chesulloth, Shunem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_19","007_19_19","JOS","19","19","19","Hapharaim, Shion, Anaharath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_20","007_19_20","JOS","19","20","20","Rabbith, Kishion, Ebez, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_21","007_19_21","JOS","19","21","21","Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah, and Beth-pazzez. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_22","007_19_22","JOS","19","22","22","The border reached Tabor, Shahazumah, and Beth-shemesh, and ended at the Jordan. There were sixteen cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_23","007_19_23","JOS","19","23","23","This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Issachar, including these cities and their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_24","007_19_24","JOS","19","24","24","The fifth lot came out for the clans of the tribe of Asher: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_25","007_19_25","JOS","19","25","25","Their territory included Helkath, Hali, Beten, Achshaph, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_26","007_19_26","JOS","19","26","26","Allammelech, Amad, and Mishal. On the west the border touched Carmel and Shihor-libnath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_27","007_19_27","JOS","19","27","27","then turned eastward toward Beth-dagon, touched Zebulun and the Valley of Iphtah-el, and went north to Beth-emek and Neiel, passing Cabul on the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_28","007_19_28","JOS","19","28","28","It went on to Ebron, Rehob, Hammon, and Kanah, as far as Greater Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_29","007_19_29","JOS","19","29","29","The border then turned back toward Ramah as far as the fortified city of Tyre, turned toward Hosah, and came out at the Sea in the region of Achzib, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_30","007_19_30","JOS","19","30","30","Ummah, Aphek, and Rehob. There were twenty-two cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_31","007_19_31","JOS","19","31","31","This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Asher, including these cities and their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_32","007_19_32","JOS","19","32","32","The sixth lot came out for the clans of the tribe of Naphtali: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_33","007_19_33","JOS","19","33","33","Their border started at Heleph and the great tree of Zaanannim, passing Adami-nekeb and Jabneel as far as Lakkum and ending at the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_34","007_19_34","JOS","19","34","34","Then the border turned westward to Aznoth-tabor and ran from there to Hukkok, touching Zebulun on the south side, Asher on the west, and Judah at the Jordan on the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_35","007_19_35","JOS","19","35","35","The fortified cities were Ziddim, Zer, Hammath, Rakkath, Chinnereth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_36","007_19_36","JOS","19","36","36","Adamah, Ramah, Hazor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_37","007_19_37","JOS","19","37","37","Kedesh, Edrei, En-hazor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_38","007_19_38","JOS","19","38","38","Iron, Migdal-el, Horem, Beth-anath, and Beth-shemesh. There were nineteen cities, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_39","007_19_39","JOS","19","39","39","This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Naphtali, including these cities and their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_40","007_19_40","JOS","19","40","40","The seventh lot came out for the clans of the tribe of Dan: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_41","007_19_41","JOS","19","41","41","The territory of their inheritance included Zorah, Eshtaol, Ir-shemesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_42","007_19_42","JOS","19","42","42","Shaalabbin, Aijalon, Ithlah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_43","007_19_43","JOS","19","43","43","Elon, Timnah, Ekron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_44","007_19_44","JOS","19","44","44","Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_45","007_19_45","JOS","19","45","45","Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimmon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_46","007_19_46","JOS","19","46","46","Me-jarkon, and Rakkon, including the territory across from Joppa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_47","007_19_47","JOS","19","47","47","(Later, when the territory of the Danites was lost to them, they went up and fought against Leshem, captured it, and put it to the sword. So they took possession of Leshem, settled there, and renamed it after their father Dan.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_48","007_19_48","JOS","19","48","48","This was the inheritance of the clans of the tribe of Dan, including these cities and their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_49","007_19_49","JOS","19","49","49","When they had finished distributing the land into its territories, the Israelites gave Joshua son of Nun an inheritance among them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_50","007_19_50","JOS","19","50","50","as the LORD had commanded. They gave him the city of Timnath-serah in the hill country of Ephraim, as he requested. He rebuilt the city and settled in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS19_51","007_19_51","JOS","19","51","51","These are the inheritances that Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the heads of the families distributed by lot to the tribes of Israel at Shiloh before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. So they finished dividing up the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_1","007_20_1","JOS","20","1","1","Then the LORD said to Joshua, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_2","007_20_2","JOS","20","2","2","“Tell the Israelites to designate the cities of refuge, as I instructed you through Moses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_3","007_20_3","JOS","20","3","3","so that anyone who kills another unintentionally or accidentally may flee there. These will be your refuge from the avenger of blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_4","007_20_4","JOS","20","4","4","When someone flees to one of these cities, stands at the entrance of the city gate, and states his case before its elders, they are to bring him into the city and give him a place to live among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_5","007_20_5","JOS","20","5","5","Now if the avenger of blood pursues him, they must not surrender the manslayer into his hand, because that man killed his neighbor accidentally without prior malice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_6","007_20_6","JOS","20","6","6","He is to stay in that city until he stands trial before the assembly and until the death of the high priest serving at that time. Then the manslayer may return to his own home in the city from which he fled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_7","007_20_7","JOS","20","7","7","So they set apart Kedesh in Galilee in the hill country of Naphtali, Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron) in the hill country of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_8","007_20_8","JOS","20","8","8","And beyond the Jordan, east of Jericho, they designated Bezer on the wilderness plateau from the tribe of Reuben, Ramoth in Gilead from the tribe of Gad, and Golan in Bashan from the tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS20_9","007_20_9","JOS","20","9","9","These are the cities appointed for all the Israelites and foreigners among them, so that anyone who kills a person unintentionally may flee there and not die by the hand of the avenger of blood prior to standing trial before the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_1","007_21_1","JOS","21","1","1","Now the family heads of the Levites approached Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the heads of the other tribes of Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_2","007_21_2","JOS","21","2","2","at Shiloh in the land of Canaan and said to them, “The LORD commanded through Moses that we be given cities in which to live, together with pasturelands for our livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_3","007_21_3","JOS","21","3","3","So by the command of the LORD, the Israelites gave the Levites these cities and their pasturelands out of their own inheritance: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_4","007_21_4","JOS","21","4","4","The first lot came out for the Kohathite clans. The Levites who were descendants of Aaron the priest received thirteen cities by lot from the tribes of Judah, Simeon, and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_5","007_21_5","JOS","21","5","5","The remaining descendants of Kohath received ten cities by lot from the tribes of Ephraim, Dan, and the half-tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_6","007_21_6","JOS","21","6","6","The descendants of Gershon received thirteen cities by lot from the tribes of Issachar, Asher, Naphtali, and the half-tribe of Manasseh in Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_7","007_21_7","JOS","21","7","7","And the descendants of Merari received twelve cities from the tribes of Reuben, Gad, and Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_8","007_21_8","JOS","21","8","8","So the Israelites allotted to the Levites these cities, together with their pasturelands, as the LORD had commanded through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_9","007_21_9","JOS","21","9","9","From the tribes of Judah and Simeon, they designated these cities by name ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_10","007_21_10","JOS","21","10","10","to the descendants of Aaron from the Kohathite clans of the Levites, because the first lot fell to them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_11","007_21_11","JOS","21","11","11","They gave them Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron), with its surrounding pasturelands, in the hill country of Judah. (Arba was the father of Anak.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_12","007_21_12","JOS","21","12","12","But they had given the fields and villages around the city to Caleb son of Jephunneh as his possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_13","007_21_13","JOS","21","13","13","So to the descendants of Aaron the priest they gave these cities, together with their pasturelands: Hebron, a city of refuge for the manslayer, Libnah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_14","007_21_14","JOS","21","14","14","Jattir, Eshtemoa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_15","007_21_15","JOS","21","15","15","Holon, Debir, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_16","007_21_16","JOS","21","16","16","Ain, Juttah, and Beth-shemesh—nine cities from these two tribes, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_17","007_21_17","JOS","21","17","17","And from the tribe of Benjamin they gave them Gibeon, Geba, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_18","007_21_18","JOS","21","18","18","Anathoth, and Almon—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_19","007_21_19","JOS","21","19","19","In all, thirteen cities, together with their pasturelands, were given to the priests, the descendants of Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_20","007_21_20","JOS","21","20","20","The remaining Kohathite clans of the Levites were allotted these cities: From the tribe of Ephraim ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_21","007_21_21","JOS","21","21","21","they were given Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim (a city of refuge for the manslayer), Gezer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_22","007_21_22","JOS","21","22","22","Kibzaim, and Beth-horon—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_23","007_21_23","JOS","21","23","23","From the tribe of Dan they were given Elteke, Gibbethon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_24","007_21_24","JOS","21","24","24","Aijalon, and Gath-rimmon—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_25","007_21_25","JOS","21","25","25","And from the half-tribe of Manasseh they were given Taanach and Gath-rimmon—two cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_26","007_21_26","JOS","21","26","26","In all, ten cities, together with their pasturelands, were given to the rest of the Kohathite clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_27","007_21_27","JOS","21","27","27","This is what the Levite clans of the Gershonites were given: From the half-tribe of Manasseh they were given Golan in Bashan, a city of refuge for the manslayer, and Beeshterah—two cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_28","007_21_28","JOS","21","28","28","From the tribe of Issachar they were given Kishion, Daberath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_29","007_21_29","JOS","21","29","29","Jarmuth, and En-gannim—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_30","007_21_30","JOS","21","30","30","From the tribe of Asher they were given Mishal, Abdon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_31","007_21_31","JOS","21","31","31","Helkath, and Rehob—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_32","007_21_32","JOS","21","32","32","And from the tribe of Naphtali they were given Kedesh in Galilee (a city of refuge for the manslayer), Hammoth-dor, and Kartan—three cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_33","007_21_33","JOS","21","33","33","In all, thirteen cities, together with their pasturelands, were given to the Gershonite clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_34","007_21_34","JOS","21","34","34","This is what the Merarite clan (the rest of the Levites) were given: From the tribe of Zebulun they were given Jokneam, Kartah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_35","007_21_35","JOS","21","35","35","Dimnah, and Nahalal—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_36","007_21_36","JOS","21","36","36","From the tribe of Reuben they were given Bezer, Jahaz, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_37","007_21_37","JOS","21","37","37","Kedemoth, and Mephaath—four cities, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_38","007_21_38","JOS","21","38","38","And from the tribe of Gad they were given Ramoth in Gilead, a city of refuge for the manslayer, Mahanaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_39","007_21_39","JOS","21","39","39","Heshbon, and Jazer—four cities in all, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_40","007_21_40","JOS","21","40","40","In all, twelve cities were allotted to the clans of Merari, the remaining Levite clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_41","007_21_41","JOS","21","41","41","For the Levites, then, there were forty-eight cities in all, together with their pasturelands, within the territory of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_42","007_21_42","JOS","21","42","42","Each of these cities had its own surrounding pasturelands; this was true for all the cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_43","007_21_43","JOS","21","43","43","Thus the LORD gave Israel all the land He had sworn to give their fathers, and they took possession of it and settled in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_44","007_21_44","JOS","21","44","44","And the LORD gave them rest on every side, just as He had sworn to their fathers. None of their enemies could stand against them, for the LORD delivered all their enemies into their hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS21_45","007_21_45","JOS","21","45","45","Not one of all the LORD’s good promises to the house of Israel had failed; everything was fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_1","007_22_1","JOS","22","1","1","Then Joshua summoned the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_2","007_22_2","JOS","22","2","2","and told them, “You have done all that Moses the servant of the LORD commanded you, and you have obeyed my voice in all that I commanded you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_3","007_22_3","JOS","22","3","3","All this time you have not deserted your brothers, up to this very day, but have kept the charge given you by the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_4","007_22_4","JOS","22","4","4","And now that the LORD your God has given your brothers rest as He promised them, you may return to your homes in the land that Moses the servant of the LORD gave you across the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_5","007_22_5","JOS","22","5","5","But be very careful to observe the commandment and the law that Moses the servant of the LORD gave you: to love the LORD your God, to walk in all His ways, to keep His commandments, to hold fast to Him, and to serve Him with all your heart and with all your soul.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_6","007_22_6","JOS","22","6","6","So Joshua blessed them and sent them on their way, and they went to their homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_7","007_22_7","JOS","22","7","7","(To the half-tribe of Manasseh Moses had given land in Bashan, and to the other half Joshua gave land on the west side of the Jordan among their brothers.) When Joshua sent them to their homes he blessed them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_8","007_22_8","JOS","22","8","8","saying, “Return to your homes with your great wealth, with immense herds of livestock, with silver, gold, bronze, iron, and very many clothes. Divide with your brothers the spoil of your enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_9","007_22_9","JOS","22","9","9","So the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh left the Israelites at Shiloh in the land of Canaan to return to their own land of Gilead, which they had acquired according to the command of the LORD through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_10","007_22_10","JOS","22","10","10","And when they came to Geliloth near the Jordan in the land of Canaan, the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh built an imposing altar there by the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_11","007_22_11","JOS","22","11","11","Then the Israelites received the report: “Behold, the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh have built an altar on the border of the land of Canaan, at Geliloth near the Jordan on the Israelite side.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_12","007_22_12","JOS","22","12","12","And when they heard this, the whole congregation of Israel assembled at Shiloh to go to war against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_13","007_22_13","JOS","22","13","13","The Israelites sent Phinehas son of Eleazar the priest to the land of Gilead, to the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_14","007_22_14","JOS","22","14","14","With him they sent ten chiefs—one family leader from each tribe of Israel, each the head of a family among the clans of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_15","007_22_15","JOS","22","15","15","They went to the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh in the land of Gilead and said to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_16","007_22_16","JOS","22","16","16","“This is what the whole congregation of the LORD says: ‘What is this breach of faith you have committed today against the God of Israel by turning away from the LORD and building for yourselves an altar, that you might rebel against the LORD this day? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_17","007_22_17","JOS","22","17","17","Was not the sin of Peor enough for us, from which we have not cleansed ourselves to this day? It even brought a plague upon the congregation of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_18","007_22_18","JOS","22","18","18","And now, would you turn away from the LORD? If you rebel today against the LORD, tomorrow He will be angry with the whole congregation of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_19","007_22_19","JOS","22","19","19","If indeed the land of your inheritance is unclean, then cross over to the land of the LORD’s possession, where the LORD’s tabernacle stands, and take possession of it among us. But do not rebel against the LORD or against us by building for yourselves an altar other than the altar of the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_20","007_22_20","JOS","22","20","20","Was not Achan son of Zerah unfaithful regarding what was set apart for destruction, bringing wrath upon the whole congregation of Israel? Yet it was not only Achan who perished because of his sin!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_21","007_22_21","JOS","22","21","21","Then the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh answered the leaders of the clans of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_22","007_22_22","JOS","22","22","22","“The LORD, the Mighty One, is God! The LORD, the Mighty One, is God! He knows, and may Israel also know. If this was in rebellion or breach of faith against the LORD, do not spare us today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_23","007_22_23","JOS","22","23","23","If we have built for ourselves an altar to turn away from Him and to offer burnt offerings and grain offerings on it, or to sacrifice peace offerings on it, may the LORD Himself hold us accountable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_24","007_22_24","JOS","22","24","24","But in fact we have done this for fear that in the future your descendants might say to ours, ‘What have you to do with the LORD, the God of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_25","007_22_25","JOS","22","25","25","For the LORD has made the Jordan a border between us and you Reubenites and Gadites. You have no share in the LORD!’ So your descendants could cause ours to stop fearing the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_26","007_22_26","JOS","22","26","26","That is why we said, ‘Let us take action and build an altar for ourselves, but not for burnt offerings or sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_27","007_22_27","JOS","22","27","27","Rather, let it be a witness between us and you and the generations to come, that we will worship the LORD in His presence with our burnt offerings, sacrifices, and peace offerings.’ Then in the future, your descendants cannot say to ours, ‘You have no share in the LORD!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_28","007_22_28","JOS","22","28","28","Therefore we said, ‘If they ever say this to us or to our descendants, we will answer: Look at the replica of the altar of the LORD that our fathers made, not for burnt offerings or sacrifices, but as a witness between us and you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_29","007_22_29","JOS","22","29","29","Far be it from us to rebel against the LORD and turn away from Him today by building an altar for burnt offerings, grain offerings, or sacrifices, other than the altar of the LORD our God, which stands before His tabernacle.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_30","007_22_30","JOS","22","30","30","When Phinehas the priest and the chiefs of the congregation—the heads of Israel’s clans who were with him—heard what the descendants of Reuben, Gad, and Manasseh had to say, they were satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_31","007_22_31","JOS","22","31","31","Phinehas son of Eleazar the priest said to the descendants of Reuben, Gad, and Manasseh, “Today we know that the LORD is among us, because you have not committed this breach of faith against Him. Consequently, you have delivered the Israelites from the hand of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_32","007_22_32","JOS","22","32","32","Then Phinehas son of Eleazar the priest, together with the other leaders, returned to the Israelites in the land of Canaan and brought back a report regarding the Reubenites and Gadites in the land of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_33","007_22_33","JOS","22","33","33","The Israelites were satisfied with the report, and they blessed God and spoke no more about going to war against them to destroy the land where the Reubenites and Gadites lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS22_34","007_22_34","JOS","22","34","34","So the Reubenites and Gadites named the altar Witness, for they said, “It is a witness between us that the LORD is God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_1","007_23_1","JOS","23","1","1","A long time after the LORD had given Israel rest from all the enemies around them, when Joshua was old and well along in years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_2","007_23_2","JOS","23","2","2","he summoned all Israel, including its elders, leaders, judges, and officers. “I am old and well along in years,” he said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_3","007_23_3","JOS","23","3","3","“and you have seen everything that the LORD your God has done to all these nations for your sake, because it was the LORD your God who fought for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_4","007_23_4","JOS","23","4","4","See, I have allotted as an inheritance to your tribes these remaining nations, including all the nations I have already cut off, from the Jordan westward to the Great Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_5","007_23_5","JOS","23","5","5","The LORD your God will push them out of your way and drive them out before you, so that you can take possession of their land, as the LORD your God promised you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_6","007_23_6","JOS","23","6","6","Be very strong, then, so that you can keep and obey all that is written in the Book of the Law of Moses, not turning aside from it to the right or to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_7","007_23_7","JOS","23","7","7","So you are not to associate with these nations that remain among you. You must not call on the names of their gods or swear by them, and you must not serve them or bow down to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_8","007_23_8","JOS","23","8","8","Instead, you shall hold fast to the LORD your God, as you have done to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_9","007_23_9","JOS","23","9","9","The LORD has driven out great and powerful nations before you, and to this day no one can stand against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_10","007_23_10","JOS","23","10","10","One of you can put a thousand to flight, because the LORD your God fights for you, just as He promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_11","007_23_11","JOS","23","11","11","Therefore watch yourselves carefully, that you love the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_12","007_23_12","JOS","23","12","12","For if you turn away and cling to the rest of these nations that remain among you, and if you intermarry and associate with them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_13","007_23_13","JOS","23","13","13","know for sure that the LORD your God will no longer drive out these nations before you. Instead, they will become for you a snare and a trap, a scourge in your sides and thorns in your eyes, until you perish from this good land that the LORD your God has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_14","007_23_14","JOS","23","14","14","Now behold, today I am going the way of all the earth, and you know with all your heart and soul that not one of the good promises the LORD your God made to you has failed. Everything was fulfilled for you; not one promise has failed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_15","007_23_15","JOS","23","15","15","But just as every good thing the LORD your God promised you has come to pass, likewise the LORD will bring upon you the calamity He has threatened, until He has destroyed you from this good land He has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS23_16","007_23_16","JOS","23","16","16","If you transgress the covenant of the LORD your God, which He commanded you, and go and serve other gods and bow down to them, then the anger of the LORD will burn against you, and you will quickly perish from this good land He has given you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_1","007_24_1","JOS","24","1","1","Then Joshua assembled all the tribes of Israel at Shechem. He summoned the elders, leaders, judges, and officers of Israel, and they presented themselves before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_2","007_24_2","JOS","24","2","2","And Joshua said to all the people, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Long ago your fathers, including Terah the father of Abraham and Nahor, lived beyond the Euphrates and worshiped other gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_3","007_24_3","JOS","24","3","3","But I took your father Abraham from beyond the Euphrates and led him through all the land of Canaan, and I multiplied his descendants. I gave him Isaac, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_4","007_24_4","JOS","24","4","4","and to Isaac I gave Jacob and Esau. I gave Esau Mount Seir to possess, but Jacob and his sons went down to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_5","007_24_5","JOS","24","5","5","Then I sent Moses and Aaron, and I afflicted the Egyptians by what I did there, and afterward I brought you out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_6","007_24_6","JOS","24","6","6","When I brought your fathers out of Egypt and you reached the Red Sea, the Egyptians pursued them with chariots and horsemen as far as the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_7","007_24_7","JOS","24","7","7","So your fathers cried out to the LORD, and He put darkness between you and the Egyptians, over whom He brought the sea and engulfed them. Your very eyes saw what I did to the Egyptians. Then you lived in the wilderness for a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_8","007_24_8","JOS","24","8","8","Later, I brought you to the land of the Amorites who lived beyond the Jordan. They fought against you, but I delivered them into your hand, that you should possess their land when I destroyed them before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_9","007_24_9","JOS","24","9","9","Then Balak son of Zippor, the king of Moab, set out to fight against Israel. He sent for Balaam son of Beor to curse you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_10","007_24_10","JOS","24","10","10","but I would not listen to Balaam. So he blessed you again and again, and I delivered you from his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_11","007_24_11","JOS","24","11","11","After this, you crossed the Jordan and came to Jericho. The people of Jericho fought against you, as did the Amorites, Perizzites, Canaanites, Hittites, Girgashites, Hivites, and Jebusites, and I delivered them into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_12","007_24_12","JOS","24","12","12","I sent the hornet ahead of you, and it drove out the two Amorite kings before you, but not by your own sword or bow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_13","007_24_13","JOS","24","13","13","So I gave you a land on which you did not toil and cities that you did not build, and now you live in them and eat from vineyards and olive groves that you did not plant.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_14","007_24_14","JOS","24","14","14","Now, therefore, fear the LORD and serve Him in sincerity and truth; cast aside the gods your fathers served beyond the Euphrates and in Egypt, and serve the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_15","007_24_15","JOS","24","15","15","But if it is unpleasing in your sight to serve the LORD, then choose for yourselves this day whom you will serve, whether the gods your fathers served beyond the Euphrates, or the gods of the Amorites in whose land you are living. As for me and my house, we will serve the LORD!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_16","007_24_16","JOS","24","16","16","The people replied, “Far be it from us to forsake the LORD to serve other gods! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_17","007_24_17","JOS","24","17","17","For the LORD our God brought us and our fathers out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery, and performed these great signs before our eyes. He also protected us throughout our journey and among all the nations through which we traveled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_18","007_24_18","JOS","24","18","18","And the LORD drove out before us all the nations, including the Amorites who lived in the land. We too will serve the LORD, because He is our God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_19","007_24_19","JOS","24","19","19","But Joshua said to the people, “You are not able to serve the LORD, for He is a holy God; He is a jealous God; He will not forgive your rebellion or your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_20","007_24_20","JOS","24","20","20","If you forsake the LORD and serve foreign gods, He will turn and bring disaster on you and consume you, even after He has been good to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_21","007_24_21","JOS","24","21","21","“No!” replied the people. “We will serve the LORD!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_22","007_24_22","JOS","24","22","22","Then Joshua told them, “You are witnesses against yourselves that you have chosen to serve the LORD.” “We are witnesses!” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_23","007_24_23","JOS","24","23","23","“Now, therefore,” he said, “get rid of the foreign gods among you and incline your hearts to the LORD, the God of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_24","007_24_24","JOS","24","24","24","So the people said to Joshua, “We will serve the LORD our God and obey His voice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_25","007_24_25","JOS","24","25","25","On that day Joshua made a covenant for the people, and there at Shechem he established for them a statute and ordinance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_26","007_24_26","JOS","24","26","26","Joshua recorded these things in the Book of the Law of God. Then he took a large stone and set it up there under the oak that was near the sanctuary of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_27","007_24_27","JOS","24","27","27","And Joshua said to all the people, “You see this stone. It will be a witness against us, for it has heard all the words the LORD has spoken to us, and it will be a witness against you if you ever deny your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_28","007_24_28","JOS","24","28","28","Then Joshua sent the people away, each to his own inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_29","007_24_29","JOS","24","29","29","Some time later, Joshua son of Nun, the servant of the LORD, died at the age of 110. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_30","007_24_30","JOS","24","30","30","And they buried him in the land of his inheritance, at Timnath-serah in the hill country of Ephraim, north of Mount Gaash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_31","007_24_31","JOS","24","31","31","Israel had served the LORD throughout the days of Joshua and of the elders who outlived him and who had experienced all the works that the LORD had done for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_32","007_24_32","JOS","24","32","32","And the bones of Joseph, which the Israelites had brought up out of Egypt, were buried at Shechem in the plot of land that Jacob had purchased from the sons of Hamor, Shechem’s father, for a hundred pieces of silver. So it became an inheritance for Joseph’s descendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JS24_33","007_24_33","JOS","24","33","33","Eleazar son of Aaron also died, and they buried him at Gibeah, which had been given to his son Phinehas in the hill country of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_1","008_1_1","JDG","1","1","1","After the death of Joshua, the Israelites inquired of the LORD, “Who will be the first to go up and fight for us against the Canaanites?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_2","008_1_2","JDG","1","2","2","“Judah shall go up,” answered the LORD. “Indeed, I have delivered the land into their hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_3","008_1_3","JDG","1","3","3","Then the men of Judah said to their brothers the Simeonites, “Come up with us to our allotted territory, and let us fight against the Canaanites. And we likewise will go with you to your territory.” So the Simeonites went with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_4","008_1_4","JDG","1","4","4","When Judah attacked, the LORD delivered the Canaanites and Perizzites into their hands, and they struck down ten thousand men at Bezek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_5","008_1_5","JDG","1","5","5","And there they found Adoni-bezek and fought against him, striking down the Canaanites and Perizzites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_6","008_1_6","JDG","1","6","6","As Adoni-bezek fled, they pursued him, seized him, and cut off his thumbs and big toes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_7","008_1_7","JDG","1","7","7","Then Adoni-bezek said, “Seventy kings with their thumbs and big toes cut off have gathered the scraps under my table. As I have done to them, so God has repaid me.” And they brought him to Jerusalem, where he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_8","008_1_8","JDG","1","8","8","Then the men of Judah fought against Jerusalem and captured it. They put the city to the sword and set it on fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_9","008_1_9","JDG","1","9","9","Afterward, the men of Judah marched down to fight against the Canaanites living in the hill country, in the Negev, and in the foothills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_10","008_1_10","JDG","1","10","10","Judah also marched against the Canaanites who were living in Hebron (formerly known as Kiriath-arba), and they struck down Sheshai, Ahiman, and Talmai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_11","008_1_11","JDG","1","11","11","From there they marched against the inhabitants of Debir (formerly known as Kiriath-sepher). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_12","008_1_12","JDG","1","12","12","And Caleb said, “To the man who strikes down Kiriath-sepher and captures it, I will give my daughter Acsah in marriage.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_13","008_1_13","JDG","1","13","13","So Othniel son of Caleb’s younger brother Kenaz captured the city, and Caleb gave his daughter Acsah to him in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_14","008_1_14","JDG","1","14","14","One day Acsah came to Othniel and urged him to ask her father for a field. When she got off her donkey, Caleb asked her, “What do you desire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_15","008_1_15","JDG","1","15","15","“Give me a blessing,” she answered. “Since you have given me land in the Negev, give me springs of water as well.” So Caleb gave her both the upper and lower springs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_16","008_1_16","JDG","1","16","16","Now the descendants of Moses’ father-in-law, the Kenite, went up with the men of Judah from the City of Palms to the Wilderness of Judah in the Negev near Arad. They went to live among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_17","008_1_17","JDG","1","17","17","Then the men of Judah went with their brothers the Simeonites, attacked the Canaanites living in Zephath, and devoted the city to destruction. So it was called Hormah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_18","008_1_18","JDG","1","18","18","And Judah also captured Gaza, Ashkelon, and Ekron—each with its territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_19","008_1_19","JDG","1","19","19","The LORD was with Judah, and they took possession of the hill country; but they could not drive out the inhabitants of the plains because they had chariots of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_20","008_1_20","JDG","1","20","20","Just as Moses had promised, Judah gave Hebron to Caleb, who drove out the descendants of the three sons of Anak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_21","008_1_21","JDG","1","21","21","The Benjamites, however, failed to drive out the Jebusites living in Jerusalem. So to this day the Jebusites live there among the Benjamites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_22","008_1_22","JDG","1","22","22","The house of Joseph also attacked Bethel, and the LORD was with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_23","008_1_23","JDG","1","23","23","They sent spies to Bethel (formerly known as Luz), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_24","008_1_24","JDG","1","24","24","and when the spies saw a man coming out of the city, they said to him, “Please show us how to get into the city, and we will treat you kindly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_25","008_1_25","JDG","1","25","25","So the man showed them the entrance to the city, and they put the city to the sword but released that man and all his family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_26","008_1_26","JDG","1","26","26","And the man went to the land of the Hittites, built a city, and called it Luz, which is its name to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_27","008_1_27","JDG","1","27","27","At that time Manasseh failed to drive out the inhabitants of Beth-shean, Taanach, Dor, Ibleam, Megiddo, and their villages; for the Canaanites were determined to dwell in that land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_28","008_1_28","JDG","1","28","28","When Israel became stronger, they pressed the Canaanites into forced labor, but they never drove them out completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_29","008_1_29","JDG","1","29","29","Ephraim also failed to drive out the Canaanites living in Gezer; so the Canaanites continued to dwell among them in Gezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_30","008_1_30","JDG","1","30","30","Zebulun failed to drive out the inhabitants of Kitron and Nahalol; so the Canaanites lived among them and served as forced laborers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_31","008_1_31","JDG","1","31","31","Asher failed to drive out the inhabitants of Acco, Sidon, Ahlab, Achzib, Helbah, Aphik, and Rehob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_32","008_1_32","JDG","1","32","32","So the Asherites lived among the Canaanite inhabitants of the land, because they did not drive them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_33","008_1_33","JDG","1","33","33","Naphtali failed to drive out the inhabitants of Beth-shemesh and Beth-anath. So the Naphtalites also lived among the Canaanite inhabitants of the land, but the inhabitants of Beth-shemesh and Beth-anath served them as forced laborers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_34","008_1_34","JDG","1","34","34","The Amorites forced the Danites into the hill country and did not allow them to come down into the plain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_35","008_1_35","JDG","1","35","35","And the Amorites were determined to dwell in Mount Heres, Aijalon, and Shaalbim. But when the house of Joseph grew in strength, they pressed the Amorites into forced labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG1_36","008_1_36","JDG","1","36","36","And the border of the Amorites extended from the Ascent of Akrabbim to Sela and beyond. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_1","008_2_1","JDG","2","1","1","Now the angel of the LORD went up from Gilgal to Bochim and said, “I brought you up out of Egypt and led you into the land that I had promised to your fathers, and I said, ‘I will never break My covenant with you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_2","008_2_2","JDG","2","2","2","and you are not to make a covenant with the people of this land, but you shall tear down their altars.’ Yet you have not obeyed My voice. What is this you have done? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_3","008_2_3","JDG","2","3","3","So now I tell you that I will not drive out these people before you; they will be thorns in your sides, and their gods will be a snare to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_4","008_2_4","JDG","2","4","4","When the angel of the LORD had spoken these words to all the Israelites, the people lifted up their voices and wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_5","008_2_5","JDG","2","5","5","So they called that place Bochim and offered sacrifices there to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_6","008_2_6","JDG","2","6","6","After Joshua had dismissed the people, the Israelites went out to take possession of the land, each to his own inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_7","008_2_7","JDG","2","7","7","And the people served the LORD throughout the days of Joshua and of the elders who outlived him, who had seen all the great works that the LORD had done for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_8","008_2_8","JDG","2","8","8","And Joshua son of Nun, the servant of the LORD, died at the age of 110. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_9","008_2_9","JDG","2","9","9","They buried him in the land of his inheritance, at Timnath-heres in the hill country of Ephraim, north of Mount Gaash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_10","008_2_10","JDG","2","10","10","After that whole generation had also been gathered to their fathers, another generation rose up who did not know the LORD or the works that He had done for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_11","008_2_11","JDG","2","11","11","And the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD and served the Baals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_12","008_2_12","JDG","2","12","12","Thus they forsook the LORD, the God of their fathers, who had brought them out of the land of Egypt, and they followed after various gods of the peoples around them. They bowed down to them and provoked the LORD to anger, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_13","008_2_13","JDG","2","13","13","for they forsook Him and served Baal and the Ashtoreths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_14","008_2_14","JDG","2","14","14","Then the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He delivered them into the hands of those who plundered them. He sold them into the hands of their enemies all around, whom they were no longer able to resist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_15","008_2_15","JDG","2","15","15","Wherever Israel marched out, the hand of the LORD was against them to bring calamity, just as He had sworn to them. So they were greatly distressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_16","008_2_16","JDG","2","16","16","Then the LORD raised up judges, who saved them from the hands of those who plundered them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_17","008_2_17","JDG","2","17","17","Israel, however, did not listen to their judges. Instead, they prostituted themselves with other gods and bowed down to them. They quickly turned from the way of their fathers, who had walked in obedience to the LORD’s commandments; they did not do as their fathers had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_18","008_2_18","JDG","2","18","18","Whenever the LORD raised up a judge for the Israelites, He was with that judge and saved them from the hands of their enemies while the judge was still alive; for the LORD was moved to pity by their groaning under those who oppressed them and afflicted them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_19","008_2_19","JDG","2","19","19","But when the judge died, the Israelites became even more corrupt than their fathers, going after other gods to serve them and bow down to them. They would not give up their evil practices and stubborn ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_20","008_2_20","JDG","2","20","20","So the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He said, “Because this nation has transgressed the covenant I laid down for their fathers and has not heeded My voice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_21","008_2_21","JDG","2","21","21","I will no longer drive out before them any of the nations Joshua left when he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_22","008_2_22","JDG","2","22","22","In this way I will test whether Israel will keep the way of the LORD by walking in it as their fathers did.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG2_23","008_2_23","JDG","2","23","23","That is why the LORD had left those nations in place and had not driven them out immediately by delivering them into the hand of Joshua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_1","008_3_1","JDG","3","1","1","These are the nations that the LORD left to test all the Israelites who had not known any of the wars in Canaan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_2","008_3_2","JDG","3","2","2","if only to teach warfare to the subsequent generations of Israel, especially to those who had not known it formerly: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_3","008_3_3","JDG","3","3","3","the five rulers of the Philistines, all the Canaanites, the Sidonians, and the Hivites who lived in the mountains of Lebanon from Mount Baal-hermon to Lebo-hamath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_4","008_3_4","JDG","3","4","4","These nations were left to test the Israelites, to find out whether they would keep the commandments of the LORD, which He had given their fathers through Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_5","008_3_5","JDG","3","5","5","Thus the Israelites continued to live among the Canaanites, Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_6","008_3_6","JDG","3","6","6","And they took the daughters of these people in marriage, gave their own daughters to their sons, and served their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_7","008_3_7","JDG","3","7","7","So the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD; they forgot the LORD their God and served the Baals and the Asherahs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_8","008_3_8","JDG","3","8","8","Then the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He sold them into the hand of Cushan-rishathaim king of Aram-naharaim, and the Israelites served him eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_9","008_3_9","JDG","3","9","9","But when the Israelites cried out to the LORD, He raised up Othniel son of Caleb’s younger brother Kenaz as a deliverer to save them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_10","008_3_10","JDG","3","10","10","The Spirit of the LORD came upon him, and he became Israel’s judge and went out to war. And the LORD delivered Cushan-rishathaim king of Aram into the hand of Othniel, who prevailed against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_11","008_3_11","JDG","3","11","11","So the land had rest for forty years, until Othniel son of Kenaz died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_12","008_3_12","JDG","3","12","12","Once again the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD. So He gave Eglon king of Moab power over Israel, because they had done evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_13","008_3_13","JDG","3","13","13","After enlisting the Ammonites and Amalekites to join forces with him, Eglon attacked and defeated Israel, taking possession of the City of Palms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_14","008_3_14","JDG","3","14","14","The Israelites served Eglon king of Moab eighteen years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_15","008_3_15","JDG","3","15","15","And again they cried out to the LORD, and He raised up Ehud son of Gera, a left-handed Benjamite, as their deliverer. So they sent him with tribute to Eglon king of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_16","008_3_16","JDG","3","16","16","Now Ehud had made for himself a double-edged sword a cubit long. He strapped it to his right thigh under his cloak ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_17","008_3_17","JDG","3","17","17","and brought the tribute to Eglon king of Moab, who was an obese man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_18","008_3_18","JDG","3","18","18","After Ehud had finished presenting the tribute, he ushered out those who had carried it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_19","008_3_19","JDG","3","19","19","But upon reaching the idols near Gilgal, he himself turned back and said, “I have a secret message for you, O king.” “Silence,” said the king, and all his attendants left him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_20","008_3_20","JDG","3","20","20","Then Ehud approached him while he was sitting alone in the coolness of his upper room. “I have a word from God for you,” Ehud said, and the king rose from his seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_21","008_3_21","JDG","3","21","21","And Ehud reached with his left hand, pulled the sword from his right thigh, and plunged it into Eglon’s belly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_22","008_3_22","JDG","3","22","22","Even the handle sank in after the blade, and Eglon’s fat closed in over it, so that Ehud did not withdraw the sword from his belly. And Eglon’s bowels emptied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_23","008_3_23","JDG","3","23","23","Then Ehud went out through the porch, closing and locking the doors of the upper room behind him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_24","008_3_24","JDG","3","24","24","After Ehud was gone, Eglon’s servants came in and found the doors of the upper room locked. “He must be relieving himself in the cool room,” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_25","008_3_25","JDG","3","25","25","So they waited until they became worried and saw that he had still not opened the doors of the upper room. Then they took the key and opened the doors—and there was their lord lying dead on the floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_26","008_3_26","JDG","3","26","26","Ehud, however, had escaped while the servants waited. He passed by the idols and escaped to Seirah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_27","008_3_27","JDG","3","27","27","On arriving in Seirah, he blew the ram’s horn throughout the hill country of Ephraim. The Israelites came down with him from the hills, and he became their leader. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_28","008_3_28","JDG","3","28","28","“Follow me,” he told them, “for the LORD has delivered your enemies the Moabites into your hand.” So they followed him down and seized the fords of the Jordan leading to Moab, and they did not allow anyone to cross over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_29","008_3_29","JDG","3","29","29","At that time they struck down about ten thousand Moabites, all robust and valiant men. Not one of them escaped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_30","008_3_30","JDG","3","30","30","So Moab was subdued under the hand of Israel that day, and the land had rest for eighty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG3_31","008_3_31","JDG","3","31","31","After Ehud came Shamgar son of Anath. And he too saved Israel, striking down six hundred Philistines with an oxgoad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_1","008_4_1","JDG","4","1","1","After Ehud died, the Israelites again did evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_2","008_4_2","JDG","4","2","2","So the LORD sold them into the hand of Jabin king of Canaan, who reigned in Hazor. The commander of his forces was Sisera, who lived in Harosheth-hagoyim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_3","008_4_3","JDG","4","3","3","Then the Israelites cried out to the LORD, because Jabin had nine hundred chariots of iron, and he had harshly oppressed the Israelites for twenty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_4","008_4_4","JDG","4","4","4","Now Deborah, a prophetess, the wife of Lappidoth, was judging Israel at that time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_5","008_4_5","JDG","4","5","5","And she would sit under the Palm of Deborah between Ramah and Bethel in the hill country of Ephraim, where the Israelites would go up to her for judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_6","008_4_6","JDG","4","6","6","She summoned Barak son of Abinoam from Kedesh in Naphtali and said to him, “Surely the LORD, the God of Israel, is commanding you: ‘Go and march to Mount Tabor, taking with you ten thousand men of Naphtali and Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_7","008_4_7","JDG","4","7","7","And I will draw out Sisera the commander of Jabin’s army, his chariots, and his troops to the River Kishon, and I will deliver him into your hand.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_8","008_4_8","JDG","4","8","8","Barak said to her, “If you will go with me, I will go; but if you will not go with me, I will not go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_9","008_4_9","JDG","4","9","9","“I will certainly go with you,” Deborah replied, “but the road you are taking will bring you no honor, because the LORD will be selling Sisera into the hand of a woman.” So Deborah got up and went with Barak to Kedesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_10","008_4_10","JDG","4","10","10","where he summoned Zebulun and Naphtali. Ten thousand men followed him, and Deborah also went with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_11","008_4_11","JDG","4","11","11","Now Heber the Kenite had moved away from the Kenites, the descendants of Hobab the father-in-law of Moses, and had pitched his tent by the great tree of Zaanannim, which was near Kedesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_12","008_4_12","JDG","4","12","12","When Sisera was told that Barak son of Abinoam had gone up Mount Tabor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_13","008_4_13","JDG","4","13","13","he summoned all nine hundred of his iron chariots and all the men with him, from Harosheth-hagoyim to the River Kishon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_14","008_4_14","JDG","4","14","14","Then Deborah said to Barak, “Arise, for this is the day that the LORD has delivered Sisera into your hand. Has not the LORD gone before you?” So Barak came down from Mount Tabor with ten thousand men following him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_15","008_4_15","JDG","4","15","15","And in front of him the LORD routed with the sword Sisera, all his charioteers, and all his army. Sisera abandoned his chariot and fled on foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_16","008_4_16","JDG","4","16","16","Then Barak pursued the chariots and army as far as Harosheth-hagoyim, and the whole army of Sisera fell by the sword; not a single man was left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_17","008_4_17","JDG","4","17","17","Meanwhile, Sisera had fled on foot to the tent of Jael, the wife of Heber the Kenite, because there was peace between Jabin king of Hazor and the house of Heber the Kenite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_18","008_4_18","JDG","4","18","18","Jael went out to greet Sisera and said to him, “Come in, my lord. Come in with me. Do not be afraid.” So he entered her tent, and she covered him with a blanket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_19","008_4_19","JDG","4","19","19","Sisera said to her, “Please give me a little water to drink, for I am thirsty.” So she opened a container of milk, gave him a drink, and covered him again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_20","008_4_20","JDG","4","20","20","“Stand at the entrance to the tent,” he said, “and if anyone comes and asks you, ‘Is there a man here?’ say, ‘No.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_21","008_4_21","JDG","4","21","21","But as he lay sleeping from exhaustion, Heber’s wife Jael took a tent peg, grabbed a hammer, and went silently to Sisera. She drove the peg through his temple and into the ground, and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_22","008_4_22","JDG","4","22","22","When Barak arrived in pursuit of Sisera, Jael went out to greet him and said to him, “Come, and I will show you the man you are seeking.” So he went in with her, and there lay Sisera dead, with a tent peg through his temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_23","008_4_23","JDG","4","23","23","On that day God subdued Jabin king of Canaan before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG4_24","008_4_24","JDG","4","24","24","And the hand of the Israelites grew stronger and stronger against Jabin king of Canaan until they destroyed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_1","008_5_1","JDG","5","1","1","On that day Deborah and Barak son of Abinoam sang this song: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_2","008_5_2","JDG","5","2","2","“When the princes take the lead in Israel, when the people volunteer, bless the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_3","008_5_3","JDG","5","3","3","Listen, O kings! Give ear, O princes! I will sing to the LORD; I will sing praise to the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_4","008_5_4","JDG","5","4","4","O LORD, when You went out from Seir, when You marched from the land of Edom, the earth trembled, the heavens poured out rain, and the clouds poured down water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_5","008_5_5","JDG","5","5","5","The mountains quaked before the LORD, the One of Sinai, before the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_6","008_5_6","JDG","5","6","6","In the days of Shamgar son of Anath, in the days of Jael, the highways were deserted and the travelers took the byways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_7","008_5_7","JDG","5","7","7","Life in the villages ceased; it ended in Israel, until I, Deborah, arose, a mother in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_8","008_5_8","JDG","5","8","8","When they chose new gods, then war came to their gates. Not a shield or spear was found among forty thousand in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_9","008_5_9","JDG","5","9","9","My heart is with the princes of Israel, with the volunteers among the people. Bless the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_10","008_5_10","JDG","5","10","10","You who ride white donkeys, who sit on saddle blankets, and you who travel the road, ponder ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_11","008_5_11","JDG","5","11","11","the voices of the singers at the watering places. There they shall recount the righteous acts of the LORD, the righteous deeds of His villagers in Israel. Then the people of the LORD went down to the gates: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_12","008_5_12","JDG","5","12","12","‘Awake, awake, O Deborah! Awake, awake, sing a song! Arise, O Barak, and take hold of your captives, O son of Abinoam!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_13","008_5_13","JDG","5","13","13","Then the survivors came down to the nobles; the people of the LORD came down to me against the mighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_14","008_5_14","JDG","5","14","14","Some came from Ephraim, with their roots in Amalek; Benjamin came with your people after you. The commanders came down from Machir, the bearers of the marshal’s staff from Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_15","008_5_15","JDG","5","15","15","The princes of Issachar were with Deborah, and Issachar was with Barak, rushing into the valley at his heels. In the clans of Reuben there was great indecision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_16","008_5_16","JDG","5","16","16","Why did you sit among the sheepfolds to hear the whistling for the flocks? In the clans of Reuben there was great indecision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_17","008_5_17","JDG","5","17","17","Gilead remained beyond the Jordan. Dan, why did you linger by the ships? Asher stayed at the coast and remained in his harbors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_18","008_5_18","JDG","5","18","18","Zebulun was a people who risked their lives; Naphtali, too, on the heights of the battlefield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_19","008_5_19","JDG","5","19","19","Kings came and fought; then the kings of Canaan fought at Taanach by the waters of Megiddo, but they took no plunder of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_20","008_5_20","JDG","5","20","20","From the heavens the stars fought; from their courses they fought against Sisera. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_21","008_5_21","JDG","5","21","21","The River Kishon swept them away, the ancient river, the River Kishon. March on, O my soul, in strength! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_22","008_5_22","JDG","5","22","22","Then the hooves of horses thundered—the mad galloping of his stallions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_23","008_5_23","JDG","5","23","23","‘Curse Meroz,’ says the angel of the LORD. ‘Bitterly curse her inhabitants; for they did not come to help the LORD, to help the LORD against the mighty.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_24","008_5_24","JDG","5","24","24","Most blessed among women is Jael, the wife of Heber the Kenite, most blessed of tent-dwelling women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_25","008_5_25","JDG","5","25","25","He asked for water, and she gave him milk. In a magnificent bowl she brought him curds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_26","008_5_26","JDG","5","26","26","She reached for the tent peg, her right hand for the workman’s hammer. She struck Sisera and crushed his skull; she shattered and pierced his temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_27","008_5_27","JDG","5","27","27","At her feet he collapsed, he fell, there he lay still; at her feet he collapsed, he fell; where he collapsed, there he fell dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_28","008_5_28","JDG","5","28","28","Sisera’s mother looked through the window; she peered through the lattice and lamented: ‘Why is his chariot so long in coming? What has delayed the clatter of his chariots?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_29","008_5_29","JDG","5","29","29","Her wisest ladies answer; indeed she keeps telling herself, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_30","008_5_30","JDG","5","30","30","‘Are they not finding and dividing the spoil—a girl or two for each warrior, a plunder of dyed garments for Sisera, the spoil of embroidered garments for the neck of the looter?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG5_31","008_5_31","JDG","5","31","31","So may all Your enemies perish, O LORD! But may those who love You shine like the sun at its brightest.” And the land had rest for forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_1","008_6_1","JDG","6","1","1","Again the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD; so He delivered them into the hand of Midian for seven years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_2","008_6_2","JDG","6","2","2","and the hand of Midian prevailed against Israel. Because of the Midianites, the Israelites prepared shelters for themselves in the mountains, caves, and strongholds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_3","008_6_3","JDG","6","3","3","Whenever the Israelites planted their crops, the Midianites, Amalekites, and other people of the east would come up and invade them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_4","008_6_4","JDG","6","4","4","encamping against them as far as Gaza and destroying the produce of the land. They left Israel with no sustenance, neither sheep nor oxen nor donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_5","008_6_5","JDG","6","5","5","For the Midianites came with their livestock and their tents like a great swarm of locusts. They and their camels were innumerable, and they entered the land to ravage it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_6","008_6_6","JDG","6","6","6","Israel was greatly impoverished by Midian, and the Israelites cried out to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_7","008_6_7","JDG","6","7","7","Now when the Israelites cried out to the LORD because of Midian, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_8","008_6_8","JDG","6","8","8","He sent them a prophet, who told them, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: I brought you up out of Egypt, out of the house of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_9","008_6_9","JDG","6","9","9","I delivered you out of the hands of Egypt and all your oppressors. I drove them out before you and gave you their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_10","008_6_10","JDG","6","10","10","And I said to you: ‘I am the LORD your God. You must not fear the gods of the Amorites, in whose land you dwell.’ But you did not obey Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_11","008_6_11","JDG","6","11","11","Then the angel of the LORD came and sat down under the oak in Ophrah that belonged to Joash the Abiezrite, where his son Gideon was threshing wheat in a winepress to hide it from the Midianites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_12","008_6_12","JDG","6","12","12","And the angel of the LORD appeared to Gideon and said, “The LORD is with you, O mighty man of valor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_13","008_6_13","JDG","6","13","13","“Please, my Lord,” Gideon replied, “if the LORD is with us, why has all this happened to us? And where are all His wonders of which our fathers told us, saying, ‘Has not the LORD brought us up out of Egypt?’ But now the LORD has forsaken us and delivered us into the hand of Midian.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_14","008_6_14","JDG","6","14","14","The LORD turned to him and said, “Go in the strength you have and save Israel from the hand of Midian. Am I not sending you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_15","008_6_15","JDG","6","15","15","“Please, my Lord,” Gideon replied, “how can I save Israel? Indeed, my clan is the weakest in Manasseh, and I am the youngest in my father’s house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_16","008_6_16","JDG","6","16","16","“Surely I will be with you,” the LORD replied, “and you will strike down all the Midianites as one man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_17","008_6_17","JDG","6","17","17","Gideon answered, “If I have found favor in Your sight, give me a sign that it is You speaking with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_18","008_6_18","JDG","6","18","18","Please do not depart from this place until I return to You. Let me bring my offering and set it before You.” And the LORD said, “I will stay until you return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_19","008_6_19","JDG","6","19","19","So Gideon went in and prepared a young goat and unleavened bread and an ephah of flour. He placed the meat in a basket and the broth in a pot and brought them out to present to Him under the oak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_20","008_6_20","JDG","6","20","20","And the angel of God said to him, “Take the meat and the unleavened bread, lay them on this rock, and pour out the broth.” And Gideon did so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_21","008_6_21","JDG","6","21","21","Then the angel of the LORD extended the tip of the staff that was in his hand and touched the meat and the unleavened bread. And fire flared from the rock and consumed the meat and the unleavened bread. Then the angel of the LORD vanished from his sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_22","008_6_22","JDG","6","22","22","When Gideon realized that it was the angel of the LORD, he said, “Oh no, Lord GOD! I have seen the angel of the LORD face to face!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_23","008_6_23","JDG","6","23","23","But the LORD said to him, “Peace be with you. Do not be afraid, for you will not die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_24","008_6_24","JDG","6","24","24","So Gideon built an altar to the LORD there and called it The LORD Is Peace. To this day it stands in Ophrah of the Abiezrites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_25","008_6_25","JDG","6","25","25","On that very night the LORD said to Gideon, “Take your father’s young bull and a second bull seven years old, tear down your father’s altar to Baal, and cut down the Asherah pole beside it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_26","008_6_26","JDG","6","26","26","Then build a proper altar to the LORD your God on the top of this stronghold. And with the wood of the Asherah pole you cut down, take the second bull and offer it as a burnt offering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_27","008_6_27","JDG","6","27","27","So Gideon took ten of his servants and did as the LORD had told him. But because he was too afraid of his father’s household and the men of the city, he did it by night rather than in the daytime. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_28","008_6_28","JDG","6","28","28","When the men of the city got up in the morning, there was Baal’s altar torn down, with the Asherah pole cut down beside it and the second bull offered up on the newly built altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_29","008_6_29","JDG","6","29","29","“Who did this?” they said to one another. And after they had investigated thoroughly, they were told, “Gideon son of Joash did it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_30","008_6_30","JDG","6","30","30","Then the men of the city said to Joash, “Bring out your son. He must die, because he has torn down Baal’s altar and cut down the Asherah pole beside it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_31","008_6_31","JDG","6","31","31","But Joash said to all who stood against him, “Are you contending for Baal? Are you trying to save him? Whoever pleads his case will be put to death by morning! If Baal is a god, let him contend for himself with the one who has torn down his altar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_32","008_6_32","JDG","6","32","32","So on that day Gideon was called Jerubbaal, that is to say, “Let Baal contend with him,” because he had torn down Baal’s altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_33","008_6_33","JDG","6","33","33","Then all the Midianites, Amalekites, and other people of the east gathered together, crossed over the Jordan, and camped in the Valley of Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_34","008_6_34","JDG","6","34","34","So the Spirit of the LORD came upon Gideon, who blew the ram’s horn and rallied the Abiezrites behind him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_35","008_6_35","JDG","6","35","35","Calling them to arms, Gideon sent messengers throughout Manasseh, as well as Asher, Zebulun, and Naphtali, so that they came up to meet him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_36","008_6_36","JDG","6","36","36","Then Gideon said to God, “If You are going to save Israel by my hand, as You have said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_37","008_6_37","JDG","6","37","37","then behold, I will place a fleece of wool on the threshing floor. If there is dew only on the fleece and all the ground is dry, then I will know that You are going to save Israel by my hand, as You have said.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_38","008_6_38","JDG","6","38","38","And that is what happened. When Gideon arose the next morning, he squeezed the fleece and wrung out the dew—a bowlful of water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_39","008_6_39","JDG","6","39","39","Then Gideon said to God, “Do not be angry with me; let me speak one more time. Please allow me one more test with the fleece. This time let it be dry, and the ground covered with dew.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG6_40","008_6_40","JDG","6","40","40","And that night God did so. Only the fleece was dry, and dew covered the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_1","008_7_1","JDG","7","1","1","Early in the morning Jerubbaal (that is, Gideon) and all the men with him camped beside the spring of Harod. And the camp of Midian was north of them in the valley near the hill of Moreh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_2","008_7_2","JDG","7","2","2","Then the LORD said to Gideon, “You have too many men for Me to deliver Midian into their hands, lest Israel glorify themselves over Me, saying, ‘My own hand has saved me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_3","008_7_3","JDG","7","3","3","Now, therefore, proclaim in the hearing of the men: ‘Whoever is fearful and trembling may turn back and leave Mount Gilead.’” So twenty-two thousand of them turned back, but ten thousand remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_4","008_7_4","JDG","7","4","4","Then the LORD said to Gideon, “There are still too many men. Take them down to the water, and I will sift them for you there. If I say to you, ‘This one shall go with you,’ he shall go. But if I say, ‘This one shall not go with you,’ he shall not go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_5","008_7_5","JDG","7","5","5","So Gideon brought the men down to the water, and the LORD said to him, “Separate those who lap the water with their tongues like a dog from those who kneel to drink.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_6","008_7_6","JDG","7","6","6","And the number of those who lapped the water with their hands to their mouths was three hundred men; all the others knelt to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_7","008_7_7","JDG","7","7","7","Then the LORD said to Gideon, “With the three hundred men who lapped the water I will save you and deliver the Midianites into your hand. But all the others are to go home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_8","008_7_8","JDG","7","8","8","So Gideon sent the rest of the Israelites to their tents but kept the three hundred men, who took charge of the provisions and rams’ horns of the others. And the camp of Midian lay below him in the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_9","008_7_9","JDG","7","9","9","That night the LORD said to Gideon, “Get up and go down against the camp, for I have delivered it into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_10","008_7_10","JDG","7","10","10","But if you are afraid to do so, then go down to the camp with your servant Purah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_11","008_7_11","JDG","7","11","11","and listen to what they are saying. Then your hands will be strengthened to attack the camp.” So he went with Purah his servant to the outposts where armed men were guarding the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_12","008_7_12","JDG","7","12","12","Now the Midianites, Amalekites, and all the other people of the east had settled in the valley like a swarm of locusts, and their camels were as countless as the sand on the seashore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_13","008_7_13","JDG","7","13","13","And as Gideon arrived, a man was telling his friend about a dream. “Behold, I had a dream,” he said, “and I saw a loaf of barley bread come tumbling into the Midianite camp. It struck the tent so hard that the tent overturned and collapsed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_14","008_7_14","JDG","7","14","14","His friend replied: “This is nothing less than the sword of Gideon son of Joash, the Israelite. God has delivered Midian and the whole camp into his hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_15","008_7_15","JDG","7","15","15","When Gideon heard the dream and its interpretation, he bowed in worship. He returned to the camp of Israel and said, “Get up, for the LORD has delivered the camp of Midian into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_16","008_7_16","JDG","7","16","16","And he divided the three hundred men into three companies and gave each man a ram’s horn in one hand and a large jar in the other, containing a torch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_17","008_7_17","JDG","7","17","17","“Watch me and do as I do,” Gideon said. “When I come to the outskirts of the camp, do exactly as I do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_18","008_7_18","JDG","7","18","18","When I and all who are with me blow our horns, then you are also to blow your horns from all around the camp and shout, ‘For the LORD and for Gideon!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_19","008_7_19","JDG","7","19","19","Gideon and the hundred men with him reached the outskirts of the camp at the beginning of the middle watch, just after the changing of the guard. They blew their horns and broke the jars that were in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_20","008_7_20","JDG","7","20","20","The three companies blew their horns and shattered their jars. Holding the torches in their left hands and the horns in their right hands, they shouted, “A sword for the LORD and for Gideon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_21","008_7_21","JDG","7","21","21","Each Israelite took his position around the camp, and the entire Midianite army fled, crying out as they ran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_22","008_7_22","JDG","7","22","22","And when the three hundred rams’ horns sounded, the LORD set all the men in the camp against one another with their swords. The army fled to Beth-shittah toward Zererah as far as the border of Abel-meholah near Tabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_23","008_7_23","JDG","7","23","23","Then the men of Israel were called out from Naphtali, Asher, and all Manasseh, and they pursued the Midianites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_24","008_7_24","JDG","7","24","24","Gideon sent messengers throughout the hill country of Ephraim to say, “Come down against the Midianites and seize the waters of the Jordan ahead of them as far as Beth-barah.” So all the men of Ephraim were called out, and they captured the waters of the Jordan as far as Beth-barah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG7_25","008_7_25","JDG","7","25","25","They also captured Oreb and Zeeb, the two princes of Midian; and they killed Oreb at the rock of Oreb and Zeeb at the winepress of Zeeb. So they pursued the Midianites and brought the heads of Oreb and Zeeb to Gideon on the other side of the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_1","008_8_1","JDG","8","1","1","Then the men of Ephraim said to Gideon, “Why have you done this to us? Why did you fail to call us when you went to fight against Midian?” And they contended with him violently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_2","008_8_2","JDG","8","2","2","But Gideon answered them, “Now what have I accomplished compared to you? Are not the gleanings of Ephraim better than the grape harvest of Abiezer? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_3","008_8_3","JDG","8","3","3","God has delivered Oreb and Zeeb, the two princes of Midian, into your hand. What was I able to do compared to you?” When he had said this, their anger against him subsided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_4","008_8_4","JDG","8","4","4","Then Gideon and his three hundred men came to the Jordan and crossed it, exhausted yet still in pursuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_5","008_8_5","JDG","8","5","5","So Gideon said to the men of Succoth, “Please give my troops some bread, for they are exhausted, and I am still pursuing Zebah and Zalmunna, the kings of Midian.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_6","008_8_6","JDG","8","6","6","But the leaders of Succoth asked, “Are the hands of Zebah and Zalmunna already in your possession, that we should give bread to your army?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_7","008_8_7","JDG","8","7","7","“Very well,” Gideon replied, “when the LORD has delivered Zebah and Zalmunna into my hand, I will tear your flesh with the thorns and briers of the wilderness!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_8","008_8_8","JDG","8","8","8","From there he went up to Penuel and asked the same from them, but the men of Penuel gave the same response as the men of Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_9","008_8_9","JDG","8","9","9","So Gideon told the men of Penuel, “When I return in triumph, I will tear down this tower!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_10","008_8_10","JDG","8","10","10","Now Zebah and Zalmunna were in Karkor with their army of about fifteen thousand men—all that were left of the armies of the people of the east. A hundred and twenty thousand swordsmen had already fallen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_11","008_8_11","JDG","8","11","11","And Gideon went up by way of the caravan route east of Nobah and Jogbehah, and he attacked their army, taking them by surprise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_12","008_8_12","JDG","8","12","12","When Zebah and Zalmunna fled, Gideon pursued and captured these two kings of Midian, routing their entire army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_13","008_8_13","JDG","8","13","13","After this, Gideon son of Joash returned from the battle along the Ascent of Heres. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_14","008_8_14","JDG","8","14","14","There he captured a young man of Succoth and interrogated him. The young man wrote down for him the names of the seventy-seven leaders and elders of Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_15","008_8_15","JDG","8","15","15","And Gideon went to the men of Succoth and said, “Here are Zebah and Zalmunna, about whom you taunted me, saying, ‘Are the hands of Zebah and Zalmunna already in your possession, that we should give bread to your weary men?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_16","008_8_16","JDG","8","16","16","Then he took the elders of the city, and using the thorns and briers of the wilderness, he disciplined the men of Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_17","008_8_17","JDG","8","17","17","He also pulled down the tower of Penuel and killed the men of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_18","008_8_18","JDG","8","18","18","Next, Gideon asked Zebah and Zalmunna, “What kind of men did you kill at Tabor?” “Men like you,” they answered, “each one resembling the son of a king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_19","008_8_19","JDG","8","19","19","“They were my brothers,” Gideon replied, “the sons of my mother! As surely as the LORD lives, if you had let them live, I would not kill you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_20","008_8_20","JDG","8","20","20","So he said to Jether, his firstborn, “Get up and kill them.” But the young man did not draw his sword; he was fearful because he was still a youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_21","008_8_21","JDG","8","21","21","Then Zebah and Zalmunna said, “Get up and kill us yourself, for as the man is, so is his strength.” So Gideon got up and killed Zebah and Zalmunna, and he took the crescent ornaments from the necks of their camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_22","008_8_22","JDG","8","22","22","Then the Israelites said to Gideon, “Rule over us—you and your son and grandson—for you have saved us from the hand of Midian.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_23","008_8_23","JDG","8","23","23","But Gideon replied, “I will not rule over you, nor will my son. The LORD shall rule over you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_24","008_8_24","JDG","8","24","24","Then he added, “Let me make a request of you, that each of you give me an earring from his plunder.” (For the enemies had gold earrings because they were Ishmaelites.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_25","008_8_25","JDG","8","25","25","“We will give them gladly,” they replied. So they spread out a garment, and each man threw an earring from his plunder onto it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_26","008_8_26","JDG","8","26","26","The weight of the gold earrings he had requested was 1,700 shekels, in addition to the crescent ornaments, the pendants, the purple garments of the kings of Midian, and the chains from the necks of their camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_27","008_8_27","JDG","8","27","27","From all this Gideon made an ephod, which he placed in Ophrah, his hometown. But soon all Israel prostituted themselves by worshiping it there, and it became a snare to Gideon and his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_28","008_8_28","JDG","8","28","28","In this way Midian was subdued before the Israelites and did not raise its head again. So the land had rest for forty years in the days of Gideon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_29","008_8_29","JDG","8","29","29","and he—Jerubbaal son of Joash—returned home and settled down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_30","008_8_30","JDG","8","30","30","Gideon had seventy sons of his own, since he had many wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_31","008_8_31","JDG","8","31","31","His concubine, who dwelt in Shechem, also bore him a son, and he named him Abimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_32","008_8_32","JDG","8","32","32","Later, Gideon son of Joash died at a ripe old age and was buried in the tomb of his father Joash in Ophrah of the Abiezrites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_33","008_8_33","JDG","8","33","33","And as soon as Gideon was dead, the Israelites turned and prostituted themselves with the Baals, and they set up Baal-berith as their god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_34","008_8_34","JDG","8","34","34","The Israelites failed to remember the LORD their God who had delivered them from the hands of all their enemies on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG8_35","008_8_35","JDG","8","35","35","They did not show kindness to the house of Jerubbaal (that is, Gideon) for all the good things he had done for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_1","008_9_1","JDG","9","1","1","Now Abimelech son of Jerubbaal went to his mother’s brothers at Shechem and said to them and to all the clan of his mother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_2","008_9_2","JDG","9","2","2","“Please ask all the leaders of Shechem, ‘Is it better for you that seventy men, all the sons of Jerubbaal, rule over you, or just one man?’ Remember that I am your own flesh and blood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_3","008_9_3","JDG","9","3","3","And when his mother’s brothers spoke all these words about him in the presence of all the leaders of Shechem, their hearts were inclined to follow Abimelech, for they said, “He is our brother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_4","008_9_4","JDG","9","4","4","So they gave him seventy shekels of silver from the temple of Baal-berith, with which Abimelech hired some worthless and reckless men to follow him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_5","008_9_5","JDG","9","5","5","He went to his father’s house in Ophrah, and on one stone murdered his seventy brothers, the sons of Jerubbaal. But Jotham, the youngest son of Jerubbaal, survived, because he hid himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_6","008_9_6","JDG","9","6","6","Then all the leaders of Shechem and Beth-millo gathered beside the oak at the pillar in Shechem and proceeded to make Abimelech their king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_7","008_9_7","JDG","9","7","7","When this was reported to Jotham, he climbed to the top of Mount Gerizim, raised his voice, and cried out: “Listen to me, O leaders of Shechem, and may God listen to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_8","008_9_8","JDG","9","8","8","One day the trees set out to anoint a king for themselves. They said to the olive tree, ‘Reign over us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_9","008_9_9","JDG","9","9","9","But the olive tree replied, ‘Should I stop giving my oil that honors both God and man, to hold sway over the trees?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_10","008_9_10","JDG","9","10","10","Then the trees said to the fig tree, ‘Come and reign over us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_11","008_9_11","JDG","9","11","11","But the fig tree replied, ‘Should I stop giving my sweetness and my good fruit, to hold sway over the trees?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_12","008_9_12","JDG","9","12","12","Then the trees said to the grapevine, ‘Come and reign over us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_13","008_9_13","JDG","9","13","13","But the grapevine replied, ‘Should I stop giving my wine that cheers both God and man, to hold sway over the trees?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_14","008_9_14","JDG","9","14","14","Finally all the trees said to the thornbush, ‘Come and reign over us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_15","008_9_15","JDG","9","15","15","But the thornbush replied, ‘If you really are anointing me as king over you, come and find refuge in my shade. But if not, may fire come out of the thornbush and consume the cedars of Lebanon.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_16","008_9_16","JDG","9","16","16","Now if you have acted faithfully and honestly in making Abimelech king, if you have done well by Jerubbaal and his family, and if you have done to him as he deserves— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_17","008_9_17","JDG","9","17","17","for my father fought for you and risked his life to deliver you from the hand of Midian, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_18","008_9_18","JDG","9","18","18","but you have risen up against my father’s house this day and killed his seventy sons on a single stone, and you have made Abimelech, the son of his maidservant, king over the leaders of Shechem because he is your brother— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_19","008_9_19","JDG","9","19","19","if you have acted faithfully and honestly toward Jerubbaal and his house this day, then may you rejoice in Abimelech, and he in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_20","008_9_20","JDG","9","20","20","But if not, may fire come from Abimelech and consume the leaders of Shechem and Beth-millo, and may fire come from the leaders of Shechem and Beth-millo and consume Abimelech.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_21","008_9_21","JDG","9","21","21","Then Jotham ran away, escaping to Beer, and he lived there for fear of his brother Abimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_22","008_9_22","JDG","9","22","22","After Abimelech had reigned over Israel for three years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_23","008_9_23","JDG","9","23","23","God sent a spirit of animosity between Abimelech and the leaders of Shechem and caused them to treat Abimelech deceitfully, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_24","008_9_24","JDG","9","24","24","in order that the crime against the seventy sons of Jerubbaal might come to justice and their blood be avenged on their brother Abimelech and on the leaders of Shechem, who had helped him murder his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_25","008_9_25","JDG","9","25","25","The leaders of Shechem set up an ambush against Abimelech on the hilltops, and they robbed all who passed by them on the road. So this was reported to Abimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_26","008_9_26","JDG","9","26","26","Meanwhile, Gaal son of Ebed came with his brothers and crossed into Shechem, and the leaders of Shechem put their confidence in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_27","008_9_27","JDG","9","27","27","And after they had gone out into the fields, gathered grapes from their vineyards, and trodden them, they held a festival and went into the house of their god; and as they ate and drank, they cursed Abimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_28","008_9_28","JDG","9","28","28","Then Gaal son of Ebed said, “Who is Abimelech, and who is Shechem, that we should serve him? Is he not the son of Jerubbaal, and is not Zebul his officer? You are to serve the men of Hamor, the father of Shechem. Why should we serve Abimelech? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_29","008_9_29","JDG","9","29","29","If only this people were under my authority, I would remove Abimelech; I would say to him, ‘Muster your army and come out!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_30","008_9_30","JDG","9","30","30","When Zebul the governor of the city heard the words of Gaal son of Ebed, he burned with anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_31","008_9_31","JDG","9","31","31","So he covertly sent messengers to Abimelech to say, “Look, Gaal son of Ebed and his brothers have come to Shechem and are stirring up the city against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_32","008_9_32","JDG","9","32","32","Now then, tonight you and the people with you are to come and lie in wait in the fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_33","008_9_33","JDG","9","33","33","And in the morning at sunrise, get up and advance against the city. When Gaal and his men come out against you, do to them whatever you are able.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_34","008_9_34","JDG","9","34","34","So Abimelech and all his troops set out by night and lay in wait against Shechem in four companies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_35","008_9_35","JDG","9","35","35","Now Gaal son of Ebed went out and stood at the entrance of the city gate just as Abimelech and his men came out from their hiding places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_36","008_9_36","JDG","9","36","36","When Gaal saw the people, he said to Zebul, “Look, people are coming down from the mountains!” But Zebul replied, “The shadows of the mountains look like men to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_37","008_9_37","JDG","9","37","37","Then Gaal spoke up again, “Look, people are coming down from the center of the land, and one company is coming by way of the Diviners’ Oak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_38","008_9_38","JDG","9","38","38","“Where is your gloating now?” Zebul replied. “You said, ‘Who is Abimelech that we should serve him?’ Are these not the people you ridiculed? Go out now and fight them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_39","008_9_39","JDG","9","39","39","So Gaal went out before the leaders of Shechem and fought against Abimelech, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_40","008_9_40","JDG","9","40","40","but Abimelech pursued him, and Gaal fled before him. And many Shechemites fell wounded all the way to the entrance of the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_41","008_9_41","JDG","9","41","41","Abimelech stayed in Arumah, and Zebul drove Gaal and his brothers out of Shechem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_42","008_9_42","JDG","9","42","42","The next day the people of Shechem went out into the fields, and this was reported to Abimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_43","008_9_43","JDG","9","43","43","So he took his men, divided them into three companies, and lay in wait in the fields. When he saw the people coming out of the city, he rose up against them and attacked them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_44","008_9_44","JDG","9","44","44","Then Abimelech and the companies with him rushed forward and took their stand at the entrance of the city gate. The other two companies rushed against all who were in the fields and struck them down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_45","008_9_45","JDG","9","45","45","And all that day Abimelech fought against the city until he had captured it and killed its people. Then he demolished the city and sowed it with salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_46","008_9_46","JDG","9","46","46","On hearing of this, all the leaders in the tower of Shechem entered the inner chamber of the temple of El-berith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_47","008_9_47","JDG","9","47","47","And when Abimelech was told that all the leaders in the tower of Shechem were gathered there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_48","008_9_48","JDG","9","48","48","he and all his men went up to Mount Zalmon. Abimelech took his axe in his hand and cut a branch from the trees, which he lifted to his shoulder, saying to his men, “Hurry and do what you have seen me do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_49","008_9_49","JDG","9","49","49","So each man also cut his own branch and followed Abimelech. Then they piled the branches against the inner chamber and set it on fire above them, killing everyone in the tower of Shechem, about a thousand men and women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_50","008_9_50","JDG","9","50","50","Then Abimelech went to Thebez, encamped against it, and captured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_51","008_9_51","JDG","9","51","51","But there was a strong tower inside the city, and all the men, women, and leaders of the city fled there. They locked themselves in and went up to the roof of the tower. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_52","008_9_52","JDG","9","52","52","When Abimelech came to attack the tower, he approached its entrance to set it on fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_53","008_9_53","JDG","9","53","53","But a woman dropped an upper millstone on Abimelech’s head, crushing his skull. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_54","008_9_54","JDG","9","54","54","He quickly called his armor-bearer, saying, “Draw your sword and kill me, lest they say of me, ‘A woman killed him.’” So Abimelech’s armor-bearer ran his sword through him, and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_55","008_9_55","JDG","9","55","55","And when the Israelites saw that Abimelech was dead, they all went home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_56","008_9_56","JDG","9","56","56","In this way God repaid the wickedness that Abimelech had done to his father in murdering his seventy brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG9_57","008_9_57","JDG","9","57","57","And God also brought all the wickedness of the men of Shechem back upon their own heads. So the curse of Jotham son of Jerubbaal came upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_1","008_10_1","JDG","10","1","1","After the time of Abimelech, a man of Issachar, Tola son of Puah, the son of Dodo, rose up to save Israel. He lived in Shamir, in the hill country of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_2","008_10_2","JDG","10","2","2","Tola judged Israel twenty-three years, and when he died, he was buried in Shamir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_3","008_10_3","JDG","10","3","3","Tola was followed by Jair the Gileadite, who judged Israel twenty-two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_4","008_10_4","JDG","10","4","4","He had thirty sons who rode on thirty donkeys. And they had thirty towns in the land of Gilead, which to this day are called Havvoth-jair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_5","008_10_5","JDG","10","5","5","When Jair died, he was buried in Kamon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_6","008_10_6","JDG","10","6","6","And again the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD. They served the Baals, the Ashtoreths, the gods of Aram, Sidon, and Moab, and the gods of the Ammonites and Philistines. Thus they forsook the LORD and did not serve Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_7","008_10_7","JDG","10","7","7","So the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He sold them into the hands of the Philistines and Ammonites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_8","008_10_8","JDG","10","8","8","who that very year harassed and oppressed the Israelites, and they did so for eighteen years to all the Israelites on the other side of the Jordan in Gilead, the land of the Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_9","008_10_9","JDG","10","9","9","The Ammonites also crossed the Jordan to fight against Judah, Benjamin, and the house of Ephraim, and Israel was in deep distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_10","008_10_10","JDG","10","10","10","Then the Israelites cried out to the LORD, saying, “We have sinned against You, for we have indeed forsaken our God and served the Baals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_11","008_10_11","JDG","10","11","11","The LORD replied, “When the Egyptians, Amorites, Ammonites, Philistines, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_12","008_10_12","JDG","10","12","12","Sidonians, Amalekites, and Maonites oppressed you and you cried out to Me, did I not save you from their hands? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_13","008_10_13","JDG","10","13","13","But you have forsaken Me and served other gods, so I will no longer save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_14","008_10_14","JDG","10","14","14","Go and cry out to the gods you have chosen. Let them save you in your time of trouble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_15","008_10_15","JDG","10","15","15","“We have sinned,” the Israelites said to the LORD. “Deal with us as You see fit; but please deliver us today!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_16","008_10_16","JDG","10","16","16","So they put away the foreign gods from among them and served the LORD, and He could no longer bear the misery of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_17","008_10_17","JDG","10","17","17","Then the Ammonites were called to arms and camped in Gilead, and the Israelites assembled and camped at Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG10_18","008_10_18","JDG","10","18","18","And the rulers of Gilead said to one another, “Whoever will launch the attack against the Ammonites will be the head of all who live in Gilead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_1","008_11_1","JDG","11","1","1","Now Jephthah the Gileadite was a mighty man of valor; he was the son of a prostitute, and Gilead was his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_2","008_11_2","JDG","11","2","2","And Gilead’s wife bore him sons who grew up, drove Jephthah out, and said to him, “You shall have no inheritance in our father’s house, because you are the son of another woman.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_3","008_11_3","JDG","11","3","3","So Jephthah fled from his brothers and settled in the land of Tob, where worthless men gathered around him and traveled with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_4","008_11_4","JDG","11","4","4","Some time later, when the Ammonites fought against Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_5","008_11_5","JDG","11","5","5","and made war with them, the elders of Gilead went to get Jephthah from the land of Tob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_6","008_11_6","JDG","11","6","6","“Come,” they said, “be our commander, so that we can fight against the Ammonites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_7","008_11_7","JDG","11","7","7","Jephthah replied to the elders of Gilead, “Did you not hate me and expel me from my father’s house? Why then have you come to me now, when you are in distress?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_8","008_11_8","JDG","11","8","8","They answered Jephthah, “This is why we now turn to you, that you may go with us, fight the Ammonites, and become leader over all of us who live in Gilead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_9","008_11_9","JDG","11","9","9","But Jephthah asked them, “If you take me back to fight the Ammonites and the LORD gives them to me, will I really be your leader?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_10","008_11_10","JDG","11","10","10","And the elders of Gilead said to Jephthah, “The LORD is our witness if we do not do as you say.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_11","008_11_11","JDG","11","11","11","So Jephthah went with the elders of Gilead, and the people made him their leader and commander. And Jephthah repeated all his terms in the presence of the LORD at Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_12","008_11_12","JDG","11","12","12","Then Jephthah sent messengers to the king of the Ammonites, saying, “What do you have against me that you have come to fight against my land?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_13","008_11_13","JDG","11","13","13","The king of the Ammonites answered Jephthah’s messengers, “When Israel came up out of Egypt, they seized my land, from the Arnon to the Jabbok and all the way to the Jordan. Now, therefore, restore it peaceably.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_14","008_11_14","JDG","11","14","14","Jephthah again sent messengers to the king of the Ammonites ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_15","008_11_15","JDG","11","15","15","to tell him, “This is what Jephthah says: Israel did not take away the land of Moab or of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_16","008_11_16","JDG","11","16","16","But when Israel came up out of Egypt, they traveled through the wilderness to the Red Sea and came to Kadesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_17","008_11_17","JDG","11","17","17","Then Israel sent messengers to the king of Edom, saying, ‘Please let us pass through your land,’ but the king of Edom would not listen. They also sent messengers to the king of Moab, but he would not consent. So Israel stayed in Kadesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_18","008_11_18","JDG","11","18","18","Then Israel traveled through the wilderness and bypassed the lands of Edom and Moab. They came to the east side of the land of Moab and camped on the other side of the Arnon. But they did not enter the territory of Moab, since the Arnon was its border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_19","008_11_19","JDG","11","19","19","And Israel sent messengers to Sihon king of the Amorites, who ruled in Heshbon, and said to him, ‘Please let us pass through your land into our own place.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_20","008_11_20","JDG","11","20","20","But Sihon would not trust Israel to pass through his territory. So he gathered all his people, encamped in Jahaz, and fought with Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_21","008_11_21","JDG","11","21","21","Then the LORD, the God of Israel, delivered Sihon and all his people into the hand of Israel, who defeated them. So Israel took possession of all the land of the Amorites who inhabited that country, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_22","008_11_22","JDG","11","22","22","seizing all the land from the Arnon to the Jabbok and from the wilderness to the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_23","008_11_23","JDG","11","23","23","Now since the LORD, the God of Israel, has driven out the Amorites from before His people Israel, should you now possess it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_24","008_11_24","JDG","11","24","24","Do you not possess whatever your god Chemosh grants you? So also, we possess whatever the LORD our God has granted us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_25","008_11_25","JDG","11","25","25","Are you now so much better than Balak son of Zippor, king of Moab? Did he ever contend with Israel or fight against them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_26","008_11_26","JDG","11","26","26","For three hundred years Israel has lived in Heshbon, Aroer, and their villages, as well as all the cities along the banks of the Arnon. Why did you not take them back during that time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_27","008_11_27","JDG","11","27","27","I have not sinned against you, but you have done me wrong by waging war against me. May the LORD, the Judge, decide today between the Israelites and the Ammonites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_28","008_11_28","JDG","11","28","28","But the king of the Ammonites paid no heed to the message Jephthah sent him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_29","008_11_29","JDG","11","29","29","Then the Spirit of the LORD came upon Jephthah, and he passed through Gilead and Manasseh, then through Mizpah of Gilead. And from there he advanced against the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_30","008_11_30","JDG","11","30","30","Jephthah made this vow to the LORD: “If indeed You will deliver the Ammonites into my hand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_31","008_11_31","JDG","11","31","31","then whatever comes out the door of my house to greet me on my triumphant return from the Ammonites will belong to the LORD, and I will offer it up as a burnt offering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_32","008_11_32","JDG","11","32","32","So Jephthah crossed over to the Ammonites to fight against them, and the LORD delivered them into his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_33","008_11_33","JDG","11","33","33","With a great blow he devastated twenty cities from Aroer to the vicinity of Minnith, as far as Abel-keramim. So the Ammonites were subdued before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_34","008_11_34","JDG","11","34","34","And when Jephthah returned home to Mizpah, there was his daughter coming out to meet him with tambourines and dancing! She was his only child; he had no son or daughter besides her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_35","008_11_35","JDG","11","35","35","As soon as Jephthah saw her, he tore his clothes and said, “No! Not my daughter! You have brought me to my knees! You have brought great misery upon me, for I have given my word to the LORD and cannot take it back.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_36","008_11_36","JDG","11","36","36","“My father,” she replied, “you have given your word to the LORD. Do to me as you have said, for the LORD has avenged you of your enemies, the Ammonites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_37","008_11_37","JDG","11","37","37","She also said to her father, “Let me do this one thing: Let me wander for two months through the mountains with my friends and mourn my virginity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_38","008_11_38","JDG","11","38","38","“Go,” he said. And he sent her away for two months. So she left with her friends and mourned her virginity upon the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_39","008_11_39","JDG","11","39","39","After two months, she returned to her father, and he did to her as he had vowed. And she had never had relations with a man. So it has become a custom in Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG11_40","008_11_40","JDG","11","40","40","that each year the young women of Israel go out for four days to lament the daughter of Jephthah the Gileadite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_1","008_12_1","JDG","12","1","1","Then the men of Ephraim assembled and crossed the Jordan to Zaphon. They said to Jephthah, “Why have you crossed over to fight the Ammonites without calling us to go with you? We will burn your house down with you inside!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_2","008_12_2","JDG","12","2","2","But Jephthah replied, “My people and I had a serious conflict with the Ammonites, and when I called, you did not save me out of their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_3","008_12_3","JDG","12","3","3","When I saw that you would not save me, I risked my life and crossed over to the Ammonites, and the LORD delivered them into my hand. Why then have you come today to fight against me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_4","008_12_4","JDG","12","4","4","Jephthah then gathered all the men of Gilead and fought against Ephraim. And the men of Gilead struck them down because the Ephraimites had said, “You Gileadites are fugitives in Ephraim, living in the territories of Ephraim and Manasseh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_5","008_12_5","JDG","12","5","5","The Gileadites captured the fords of the Jordan leading to Ephraim, and whenever a fugitive from Ephraim would say, “Let me cross over,” the Gileadites would ask him, “Are you an Ephraimite?” If he answered, “No,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_6","008_12_6","JDG","12","6","6","they told him, “Please say Shibboleth.” If he said, “Sibboleth,” because he could not pronounce it correctly, they seized him and killed him at the fords of the Jordan. So at that time 42,000 Ephraimites were killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_7","008_12_7","JDG","12","7","7","Jephthah judged Israel six years, and when he died, he was buried in one of the cities of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_8","008_12_8","JDG","12","8","8","After Jephthah, Ibzan of Bethlehem judged Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_9","008_12_9","JDG","12","9","9","He had thirty sons, as well as thirty daughters whom he gave in marriage to men outside his clan; and for his sons he brought back thirty wives from elsewhere. Ibzan judged Israel seven years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_10","008_12_10","JDG","12","10","10","Then Ibzan died, and he was buried in Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_11","008_12_11","JDG","12","11","11","After Ibzan, Elon the Zebulunite judged Israel ten years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_12","008_12_12","JDG","12","12","12","Then Elon the Zebulunite died, and he was buried in Aijalon in the land of Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_13","008_12_13","JDG","12","13","13","After Elon, Abdon son of Hillel, from Pirathon, judged Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_14","008_12_14","JDG","12","14","14","He had forty sons and thirty grandsons, who rode on seventy donkeys. And he judged Israel eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG12_15","008_12_15","JDG","12","15","15","Then Abdon son of Hillel, from Pirathon, died, and he was buried at Pirathon in Ephraim, in the hill country of the Amalekites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_1","008_13_1","JDG","13","1","1","Again the Israelites did evil in the sight of the LORD, so He delivered them into the hand of the Philistines for forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_2","008_13_2","JDG","13","2","2","Now there was a man from Zorah named Manoah, from the clan of the Danites, whose wife was barren and had no children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_3","008_13_3","JDG","13","3","3","The angel of the LORD appeared to the woman and said to her, “It is true that you are barren and have no children; but you will conceive and give birth to a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_4","008_13_4","JDG","13","4","4","Now please be careful not to drink wine or strong drink, and not to eat anything unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_5","008_13_5","JDG","13","5","5","For behold, you will conceive and give birth to a son. And no razor shall touch his head, because the boy will be a Nazirite to God from the womb, and he will begin the deliverance of Israel from the hand of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_6","008_13_6","JDG","13","6","6","So the woman went and told her husband, “A man of God came to me. His appearance was like the angel of God, exceedingly awesome. I did not ask him where he came from, and he did not tell me his name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_7","008_13_7","JDG","13","7","7","But he said to me, ‘Behold, you will conceive and give birth to a son. Now, therefore, do not drink wine or strong drink, and do not eat anything unclean, because the boy will be a Nazirite to God from the womb until the day of his death.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_8","008_13_8","JDG","13","8","8","Then Manoah prayed to the LORD, “Please, O Lord, let the man of God You sent us come to us again to teach us how to raise the boy who is to be born.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_9","008_13_9","JDG","13","9","9","And God listened to the voice of Manoah, and the angel of God returned to the woman as she was sitting in the field; but her husband Manoah was not with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_10","008_13_10","JDG","13","10","10","The woman ran quickly to tell her husband, “Behold, the man who came to me the other day has reappeared!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_11","008_13_11","JDG","13","11","11","So Manoah got up and followed his wife. When he came to the man, he asked, “Are you the man who spoke to my wife?” “I am,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_12","008_13_12","JDG","13","12","12","Then Manoah asked, “When your words come to pass, what will be the boy’s rule of life and mission?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_13","008_13_13","JDG","13","13","13","So the angel of the LORD answered Manoah, “Your wife is to do everything I told her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_14","008_13_14","JDG","13","14","14","She must not eat anything that comes from the vine, nor drink any wine or strong drink, nor eat anything unclean. She must do everything I have commanded her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_15","008_13_15","JDG","13","15","15","“Please stay here,” Manoah said to the angel of the LORD, “and we will prepare a young goat for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_16","008_13_16","JDG","13","16","16","And the angel of the LORD replied, “Even if I stay, I will not eat your food. But if you prepare a burnt offering, offer it to the LORD.” For Manoah did not know that it was the angel of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_17","008_13_17","JDG","13","17","17","Then Manoah said to the angel of the LORD, “What is your name, so that we may honor you when your word comes to pass?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_18","008_13_18","JDG","13","18","18","“Why do you ask my name,” said the angel of the LORD, “since it is beyond comprehension?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_19","008_13_19","JDG","13","19","19","Then Manoah took a young goat and a grain offering and offered them on a rock to the LORD. And as Manoah and his wife looked on, the LORD did a marvelous thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_20","008_13_20","JDG","13","20","20","When the flame went up from the altar to the sky, the angel of the LORD ascended in the flame. When Manoah and his wife saw this, they fell facedown to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_21","008_13_21","JDG","13","21","21","And when the angel of the LORD did not appear again to Manoah and his wife, Manoah realized that it had been the angel of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_22","008_13_22","JDG","13","22","22","“We are going to die,” he said to his wife, “for we have seen God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_23","008_13_23","JDG","13","23","23","But his wife replied, “If the LORD had intended to kill us, He would not have accepted the burnt offering and the grain offering from our hands, nor would He have shown us all these things or spoken to us this way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_24","008_13_24","JDG","13","24","24","So the woman gave birth to a son and named him Samson. The boy grew, and the LORD blessed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG13_25","008_13_25","JDG","13","25","25","And the Spirit of the LORD began to stir him at Mahaneh-dan, between Zorah and Eshtaol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_1","008_14_1","JDG","14","1","1","One day Samson went down to Timnah, where he saw a young Philistine woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_2","008_14_2","JDG","14","2","2","So he returned and told his father and mother, “I have seen a daughter of the Philistines in Timnah. Now get her for me as a wife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_3","008_14_3","JDG","14","3","3","But his father and mother replied, “Can’t you find a young woman among your relatives or among any of our people? Must you go to the uncircumcised Philistines to get a wife?” But Samson told his father, “Get her for me, for she is pleasing to my eyes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_4","008_14_4","JDG","14","4","4","(Now his father and mother did not know this was from the LORD, who was seeking an occasion to move against the Philistines; for at that time the Philistines were ruling over Israel.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_5","008_14_5","JDG","14","5","5","Then Samson went down to Timnah with his father and mother and came to the vineyards of Timnah. Suddenly a young lion came roaring at him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_6","008_14_6","JDG","14","6","6","and the Spirit of the LORD came powerfully upon him, and he tore the lion apart with his bare hands as one would tear a young goat. But he did not tell his father or mother what he had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_7","008_14_7","JDG","14","7","7","Then Samson continued on his way down and spoke to the woman, because she was pleasing to his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_8","008_14_8","JDG","14","8","8","When Samson returned later to take her, he left the road to see the lion’s carcass, and in it was a swarm of bees, along with their honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_9","008_14_9","JDG","14","9","9","So he scooped some honey into his hands and ate it as he went along. And when he returned to his father and mother, he gave some to them and they ate it. But he did not tell them that he had taken the honey from the lion’s carcass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_10","008_14_10","JDG","14","10","10","Then his father went to visit the woman, and Samson prepared a feast there, as was customary for the bridegroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_11","008_14_11","JDG","14","11","11","And when the Philistines saw him, they selected thirty men to accompany him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_12","008_14_12","JDG","14","12","12","“Let me tell you a riddle,” Samson said to them. “If you can solve it for me within the seven days of the feast, I will give you thirty linen garments and thirty sets of clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_13","008_14_13","JDG","14","13","13","But if you cannot solve it, you must give me thirty linen garments and thirty sets of clothes.” “Tell us your riddle,” they replied. “Let us hear it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_14","008_14_14","JDG","14","14","14","So he said to them: “Out of the eater came something to eat, and out of the strong came something sweet.” For three days they were unable to explain the riddle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_15","008_14_15","JDG","14","15","15","So on the fourth day they said to Samson’s wife, “Entice your husband to explain the riddle to us, or we will burn you and your father’s household to death. Did you invite us here to rob us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_16","008_14_16","JDG","14","16","16","Then Samson’s wife came to him, weeping, and said, “You hate me! You do not really love me! You have posed to my people a riddle, but have not explained it to me.” “Look,” he said, “I have not even explained it to my father or mother, so why should I explain it to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_17","008_14_17","JDG","14","17","17","She wept the whole seven days of the feast, and finally on the seventh day, because she had pressed him so much, he told her the answer. And in turn she explained the riddle to her people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_18","008_14_18","JDG","14","18","18","Before sunset on the seventh day, the men of the city said to Samson: “What is sweeter than honey? And what is stronger than a lion?” So he said to them: “If you had not plowed with my heifer, you would not have solved my riddle!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_19","008_14_19","JDG","14","19","19","Then the Spirit of the LORD came mightily upon him, and he went down to Ashkelon, killed thirty of their men, took their apparel, and gave their clothes to those who had solved the riddle. And burning with anger, Samson returned to his father’s house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG14_20","008_14_20","JDG","14","20","20","and his wife was given to one of the men who had accompanied him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_1","008_15_1","JDG","15","1","1","Later on, at the time of the wheat harvest, Samson took a young goat and went to visit his wife. “I want to go to my wife in her room,” he said. But her father would not let him enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_2","008_15_2","JDG","15","2","2","“I was sure that you thoroughly hated her,” said her father, “so I gave her to one of the men who accompanied you. Is not her younger sister more beautiful than she? Please take her instead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_3","008_15_3","JDG","15","3","3","Samson said to them, “This time I will be blameless in doing harm to the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_4","008_15_4","JDG","15","4","4","Then Samson went out and caught three hundred foxes. And he took torches, turned the foxes tail-to-tail, and fastened a torch between each pair of tails. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_5","008_15_5","JDG","15","5","5","Then he lit the torches and released the foxes into the standing grain of the Philistines, burning up the piles of grain and the standing grain, as well as the vineyards and olive groves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_6","008_15_6","JDG","15","6","6","“Who did this?” the Philistines demanded. “It was Samson, the son-in-law of the Timnite,” they were told. “For his wife was given to his companion.” So the Philistines went up and burned her and her father to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_7","008_15_7","JDG","15","7","7","And Samson told them, “Because you have done this, I will not rest until I have taken vengeance upon you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_8","008_15_8","JDG","15","8","8","And he struck them ruthlessly with a great slaughter, and then went down and stayed in the cave at the rock of Etam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_9","008_15_9","JDG","15","9","9","Then the Philistines went up, camped in Judah, and deployed themselves near the town of Lehi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_10","008_15_10","JDG","15","10","10","“Why have you attacked us?” said the men of Judah. The Philistines replied, “We have come to arrest Samson and pay him back for what he has done to us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_11","008_15_11","JDG","15","11","11","In response, three thousand men of Judah went to the cave at the rock of Etam, and they asked Samson, “Do you not realize that the Philistines rule over us? What have you done to us?” “I have done to them what they did to me,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_12","008_15_12","JDG","15","12","12","But they said to him, “We have come down to arrest you and hand you over to the Philistines.” Samson replied, “Swear to me that you will not kill me yourselves.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_13","008_15_13","JDG","15","13","13","“No,” they answered, “we will not kill you, but we will tie you up securely and hand you over to them.” So they bound him with two new ropes and led him up from the rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_14","008_15_14","JDG","15","14","14","When Samson arrived in Lehi, the Philistines came out shouting against him. And the Spirit of the LORD came mightily upon him. The ropes on his arms became like burnt flax, and the bonds broke loose from his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_15","008_15_15","JDG","15","15","15","He found the fresh jawbone of a donkey, reached out his hand and took it, and struck down a thousand men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_16","008_15_16","JDG","15","16","16","Then Samson said: “With the jawbone of a donkey I have piled them into heaps. With the jawbone of a donkey I have slain a thousand men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_17","008_15_17","JDG","15","17","17","And when Samson had finished speaking, he cast the jawbone from his hand; and he named that place Ramath-lehi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_18","008_15_18","JDG","15","18","18","And being very thirsty, Samson cried out to the LORD, “You have accomplished this great deliverance through Your servant. Must I now die of thirst and fall into the hands of the uncircumcised?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_19","008_15_19","JDG","15","19","19","So God opened up the hollow place in Lehi, and water came out of it. When Samson drank, his strength returned, and he was revived. That is why he named it En-hakkore, and it remains in Lehi to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG15_20","008_15_20","JDG","15","20","20","And Samson judged Israel for twenty years in the days of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_1","008_16_1","JDG","16","1","1","One day Samson went to Gaza, where he saw a prostitute and went in to spend the night with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_2","008_16_2","JDG","16","2","2","When the Gazites heard that Samson was there, they surrounded that place and lay in wait for him all night at the city gate. They were quiet throughout the night, saying, “Let us wait until dawn; then we will kill him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_3","008_16_3","JDG","16","3","3","But Samson lay there only until midnight, when he got up, took hold of the doors of the city gate and both gateposts, and pulled them out, bar and all. Then he put them on his shoulders and took them to the top of the mountain overlooking Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_4","008_16_4","JDG","16","4","4","Some time later, Samson fell in love with a woman in the Valley of Sorek, whose name was Delilah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_5","008_16_5","JDG","16","5","5","The lords of the Philistines went to her and said, “Entice him and find out the source of his great strength and how we can overpower him to tie him up and subdue him. Then each one of us will give you eleven hundred shekels of silver.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_6","008_16_6","JDG","16","6","6","So Delilah said to Samson, “Please tell me the source of your great strength and how you can be tied up and subdued.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_7","008_16_7","JDG","16","7","7","Samson told her, “If they tie me up with seven fresh bowstrings that have not been dried, I will become as weak as any other man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_8","008_16_8","JDG","16","8","8","So the lords of the Philistines brought her seven fresh bowstrings that had not been dried, and she tied him up with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_9","008_16_9","JDG","16","9","9","While the men were hidden in her room, she called out, “Samson, the Philistines are here!” But he snapped the bowstrings like a strand of yarn seared by a flame. So the source of his strength remained unknown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_10","008_16_10","JDG","16","10","10","Then Delilah said to Samson, “You have mocked me and lied to me! Now please tell me how you can be tied up.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_11","008_16_11","JDG","16","11","11","He replied, “If they tie me up with new ropes that have never been used, I will become as weak as any other man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_12","008_16_12","JDG","16","12","12","So Delilah took new ropes, tied him up with them, and called out, “Samson, the Philistines are here!” But while the men were hidden in her room, he snapped the ropes off his arms like they were threads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_13","008_16_13","JDG","16","13","13","Then Delilah said to Samson, “You have mocked me and lied to me all along! Tell me how you can be tied up.” He told her, “If you weave the seven braids of my head into the web of a loom and tighten it with a pin, I will become as weak as any other man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_14","008_16_14","JDG","16","14","14","So while he slept, Delilah took the seven braids of his hair and wove them into the web. Then she tightened it with a pin and called to him, “Samson, the Philistines are here!” But he awoke from his sleep and pulled out the pin with the loom and the web. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_15","008_16_15","JDG","16","15","15","“How can you say, ‘I love you,’” she asked, “when your heart is not with me? This is the third time you have mocked me and failed to reveal to me the source of your great strength!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_16","008_16_16","JDG","16","16","16","Finally, after she had pressed him daily with her words and pleaded until he was sick to death, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_17","008_16_17","JDG","16","17","17","Samson told her all that was in his heart: “My hair has never been cut, because I have been a Nazirite to God from my mother’s womb. If I am shaved, my strength will leave me, and I will become as weak as any other man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_18","008_16_18","JDG","16","18","18","When Delilah realized that he had revealed to her all that was in his heart, she sent this message to the lords of the Philistines: “Come up once more, for he has revealed to me all that is in his heart.” Then the lords of the Philistines came to her, bringing the money in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_19","008_16_19","JDG","16","19","19","And having lulled him to sleep on her lap, she called a man to shave off the seven braids of his head. In this way she began to subdue him, and his strength left him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_20","008_16_20","JDG","16","20","20","Then she called out, “Samson, the Philistines are here!” When Samson awoke from his sleep, he thought, “I will escape as I did before and shake myself free.” But he did not know that the LORD had departed from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_21","008_16_21","JDG","16","21","21","Then the Philistines seized him, gouged out his eyes, and brought him down to Gaza, where he was bound with bronze shackles and forced to grind grain in the prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_22","008_16_22","JDG","16","22","22","However, the hair of his head began to grow back after it had been shaved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_23","008_16_23","JDG","16","23","23","Now the lords of the Philistines gathered together to offer a great sacrifice to their god Dagon. They rejoiced and said, “Our god has delivered Samson our enemy into our hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_24","008_16_24","JDG","16","24","24","And when the people saw him, they praised their god, saying: “Our god has delivered into our hands our enemy who destroyed our land and multiplied our dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_25","008_16_25","JDG","16","25","25","And while their hearts were merry, they said, “Call for Samson to entertain us.” So they called Samson out of the prison to entertain them. And they stationed him between the pillars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_26","008_16_26","JDG","16","26","26","Samson said to the servant who held his hand, “Lead me where I can feel the pillars supporting the temple, so I can lean against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_27","008_16_27","JDG","16","27","27","Now the temple was full of men and women; all the lords of the Philistines were there, and about three thousand men and women were on the roof watching Samson entertain them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_28","008_16_28","JDG","16","28","28","Then Samson called out to the LORD: “O Lord GOD, please remember me. Strengthen me, O God, just once more, so that with one vengeful blow I may pay back the Philistines for my two eyes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_29","008_16_29","JDG","16","29","29","And Samson reached out for the two central pillars supporting the temple. Bracing himself against them with his right hand on one pillar and his left hand on the other, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_30","008_16_30","JDG","16","30","30","Samson said, “Let me die with the Philistines.” Then he pushed with all his might, and the temple fell on the lords and all the people in it. So in his death he killed more than he had killed in his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG16_31","008_16_31","JDG","16","31","31","Then Samson’s brothers and his father’s family came down, carried him back, and buried him between Zorah and Eshtaol in the tomb of his father Manoah. And he had judged Israel twenty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_1","008_17_1","JDG","17","1","1","Now a man named Micah from the hill country of Ephraim ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_2","008_17_2","JDG","17","2","2","said to his mother, “The eleven hundred shekels of silver that were taken from you and about which I heard you utter a curse—I have the silver here with me; I took it.” Then his mother said, “Blessed be my son by the LORD!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_3","008_17_3","JDG","17","3","3","And when he had returned the eleven hundred shekels of silver to his mother, she said, “I wholly dedicate the silver to the LORD for my son’s benefit, to make a graven image and a molten idol. Therefore I will now return it to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_4","008_17_4","JDG","17","4","4","So he returned the silver to his mother, and she took two hundred shekels of silver and gave them to a silversmith, who made them into a graven image and a molten idol. And they were placed in the house of Micah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_5","008_17_5","JDG","17","5","5","Now this man Micah had a shrine, and he made an ephod and some household idols, and ordained one of his sons as his priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_6","008_17_6","JDG","17","6","6","In those days there was no king in Israel; everyone did what was right in his own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_7","008_17_7","JDG","17","7","7","And there was a young Levite from Bethlehem in Judah who had been residing within the clan of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_8","008_17_8","JDG","17","8","8","This man left the city of Bethlehem in Judah to settle where he could find a place. And as he traveled, he came to Micah’s house in the hill country of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_9","008_17_9","JDG","17","9","9","“Where are you from?” Micah asked him. “I am a Levite from Bethlehem in Judah,” he replied, “and I am on my way to settle wherever I can find a place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_10","008_17_10","JDG","17","10","10","“Stay with me,” Micah said to him, “and be my father and priest, and I will give you ten shekels of silver per year, a suit of clothes, and your provisions.” So the Levite went in ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_11","008_17_11","JDG","17","11","11","and agreed to stay with him, and the young man became like a son to Micah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_12","008_17_12","JDG","17","12","12","Micah ordained the Levite, and the young man became his priest and lived in his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG17_13","008_17_13","JDG","17","13","13","Then Micah said, “Now I know that the LORD will be good to me, because a Levite has become my priest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_1","008_18_1","JDG","18","1","1","In those days there was no king in Israel, and the tribe of the Danites was looking for territory to occupy. For up to that time they had not come into an inheritance among the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_2","008_18_2","JDG","18","2","2","So the Danites sent out five men from their clans, men of valor from Zorah and Eshtaol, to spy out the land and explore it. “Go and explore the land,” they told them. The men entered the hill country of Ephraim and came to the house of Micah, where they spent the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_3","008_18_3","JDG","18","3","3","And while they were near Micah’s house, they recognized the voice of the young Levite; so they went over and asked him, “Who brought you here? What are you doing in this place? Why are you here?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_4","008_18_4","JDG","18","4","4","“Micah has done this and that for me,” he replied, “and he has hired me to be his priest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_5","008_18_5","JDG","18","5","5","Then they said to him, “Please inquire of God to determine whether we will have a successful journey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_6","008_18_6","JDG","18","6","6","And the priest told them, “Go in peace. The LORD is watching over your journey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_7","008_18_7","JDG","18","7","7","So the five men departed and came to Laish, where they saw that the people were living securely, like the Sidonians, quiet and unsuspecting. There was nothing lacking in the land and no oppressive ruler. And they were far away from the Sidonians and had no alliance with anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_8","008_18_8","JDG","18","8","8","When the men returned to Zorah and Eshtaol, their brothers asked them, “What did you find?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_9","008_18_9","JDG","18","9","9","They answered, “Come on, let us go up against them, for we have seen the land, and it is very good. Why would you fail to act? Do not hesitate to go there and take possession of the land! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_10","008_18_10","JDG","18","10","10","When you enter, you will come to an unsuspecting people and a spacious land, for God has delivered it into your hand. It is a place where nothing on earth is lacking.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_11","008_18_11","JDG","18","11","11","So six hundred Danites departed from Zorah and Eshtaol, armed with weapons of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_12","008_18_12","JDG","18","12","12","They went up and camped at Kiriath-jearim in Judah. That is why the place west of Kiriath-jearim is called Mahaneh-dan to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_13","008_18_13","JDG","18","13","13","And from there they traveled to the hill country of Ephraim and came to Micah’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_14","008_18_14","JDG","18","14","14","Then the five men who had gone to spy out the land of Laish said to their brothers, “Did you know that one of these houses has an ephod, household gods, a graven image, and a molten idol? Now think about what you should do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_15","008_18_15","JDG","18","15","15","So they turned aside there and went to the home of the young Levite, the house of Micah, and greeted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_16","008_18_16","JDG","18","16","16","The six hundred Danites stood at the entrance of the gate, armed with their weapons of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_17","008_18_17","JDG","18","17","17","And the five men who had gone to spy out the land went inside and took the graven image, the ephod, the household idols, and the molten idol, while the priest stood at the entrance of the gate with the six hundred armed men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_18","008_18_18","JDG","18","18","18","When they entered Micah’s house and took the graven image, the ephod, the household idols, and the molten idol, the priest said to them, “What are you doing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_19","008_18_19","JDG","18","19","19","“Be quiet,” they told him. “Put your hand over your mouth and come with us and be a father and a priest to us. Is it better for you to be a priest for the house of one person or a priest for a tribe and family in Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_20","008_18_20","JDG","18","20","20","So the priest was glad and took the ephod, the household idols, and the graven image, and went with the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_21","008_18_21","JDG","18","21","21","Putting their small children, their livestock, and their possessions in front of them, they turned and departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_22","008_18_22","JDG","18","22","22","After they were some distance from Micah’s house, the men in the houses near Micah’s house mobilized and overtook the Danites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_23","008_18_23","JDG","18","23","23","When they called out after them, the Danites turned to face them and said to Micah, “What is the matter with you that you have called out such a company?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_24","008_18_24","JDG","18","24","24","He replied, “You took the gods I had made, and my priest, and went away. What else do I have? How can you say to me, ‘What is the matter with you?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_25","008_18_25","JDG","18","25","25","The Danites said to him, “Do not raise your voice against us, or angry men will attack you, and you and your family will lose your lives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_26","008_18_26","JDG","18","26","26","So the Danites went on their way, and Micah turned to go back home, because he saw that they were too strong for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_27","008_18_27","JDG","18","27","27","After they had taken Micah’s idols and his priest, they went to Laish, to a quiet and unsuspecting people, and they struck them with their swords and burned down the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_28","008_18_28","JDG","18","28","28","There was no one to deliver them, because the city was far from Sidon and had no alliance with anyone; it was in a valley near Beth-rehob. And the Danites rebuilt the city and lived there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_29","008_18_29","JDG","18","29","29","They named it Dan, after their forefather Dan, who was born to Israel—though the city was formerly named Laish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_30","008_18_30","JDG","18","30","30","The Danites set up idols for themselves, and Jonathan son of Gershom, the son of Moses, and his sons were priests for the tribe of Dan until the day of the captivity of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG18_31","008_18_31","JDG","18","31","31","So they set up for themselves Micah’s graven image, and it was there the whole time the house of God was in Shiloh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_1","008_19_1","JDG","19","1","1","Now in those days, when there was no king in Israel, a Levite who lived in the remote hill country of Ephraim took for himself a concubine from Bethlehem in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_2","008_19_2","JDG","19","2","2","But she was unfaithful to him and left him to return to her father’s house in Bethlehem in Judah. After she had been there four months, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_3","008_19_3","JDG","19","3","3","her husband got up and went after her to speak kindly to her and bring her back, taking his servant and a pair of donkeys. So the girl brought him into her father’s house, and when her father saw him, he gladly welcomed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_4","008_19_4","JDG","19","4","4","His father-in-law, the girl’s father, persuaded him to stay, so he remained with him three days, eating, drinking, and lodging there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_5","008_19_5","JDG","19","5","5","On the fourth day, they got up early in the morning and prepared to depart, but the girl’s father said to his son-in-law, “Refresh your heart with a morsel of bread, and then you can go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_6","008_19_6","JDG","19","6","6","So they sat down and the two of them ate and drank together. Then the girl’s father said to the man, “Please agree to stay overnight and let your heart be merry.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_7","008_19_7","JDG","19","7","7","The man got up to depart, but his father-in-law persuaded him, so he stayed there that night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_8","008_19_8","JDG","19","8","8","On the fifth day, he got up early in the morning to depart, but the girl’s father said, “Please refresh your heart.” So they waited until late afternoon and the two of them ate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_9","008_19_9","JDG","19","9","9","When the man got up to depart with his concubine and his servant, his father-in-law, the girl’s father, said to him, “Look, the day is drawing to a close. Please spend the night. See, the day is almost over. Spend the night here, that your heart may be merry. Then you can get up early tomorrow for your journey home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_10","008_19_10","JDG","19","10","10","But the man was unwilling to spend the night. He got up and departed, and arrived opposite Jebus (that is, Jerusalem), with his two saddled donkeys and his concubine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_11","008_19_11","JDG","19","11","11","When they were near Jebus and the day was almost gone, the servant said to his master, “Please, let us stop at this Jebusite city and spend the night here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_12","008_19_12","JDG","19","12","12","But his master replied, “We will not turn aside to the city of foreigners, where there are no Israelites. We will go on to Gibeah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_13","008_19_13","JDG","19","13","13","He continued, “Come, let us try to reach one of these towns to spend the night in Gibeah or Ramah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_14","008_19_14","JDG","19","14","14","So they continued on their journey, and the sun set as they neared Gibeah in Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_15","008_19_15","JDG","19","15","15","They stopped to go in and lodge in Gibeah. The Levite went in and sat down in the city square, but no one would take them into his home for the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_16","008_19_16","JDG","19","16","16","That evening an old man from the hill country of Ephraim, who was residing in Gibeah (the men of that place were Benjamites), came in from his work in the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_17","008_19_17","JDG","19","17","17","When he looked up and saw the traveler in the city square, the old man asked, “Where are you going, and where have you come from?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_18","008_19_18","JDG","19","18","18","The Levite replied, “We are traveling from Bethlehem in Judah to the remote hill country of Ephraim, where I am from. I went to Bethlehem in Judah, and now I am going to the house of the LORD; but no one has taken me into his home, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_19","008_19_19","JDG","19","19","19","even though there is both straw and feed for our donkeys, and bread and wine for me and the maidservant and young man with me. There is nothing that we, your servants, lack.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_20","008_19_20","JDG","19","20","20","“Peace to you,” said the old man. “Let me supply everything you need. Only do not spend the night in the square.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_21","008_19_21","JDG","19","21","21","So he brought him to his house and fed his donkeys. And they washed their feet and ate and drank. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_22","008_19_22","JDG","19","22","22","While they were enjoying themselves, suddenly the wicked men of the city surrounded the house. Pounding on the door, they said to the old man who owned the house, “Bring out the man who came to your house, so we can have relations with him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_23","008_19_23","JDG","19","23","23","The owner of the house went out and said to them, “No, my brothers, do not do this wicked thing! After all, this man is a guest in my house. Do not commit this outrage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_24","008_19_24","JDG","19","24","24","Look, let me bring out my virgin daughter and the man’s concubine, and you can use them and do with them as you wish. But do not do such a vile thing to this man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_25","008_19_25","JDG","19","25","25","But the men would not listen to him. So the Levite took his concubine and sent her outside to them, and they raped her and abused her throughout the night, and at dawn they let her go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_26","008_19_26","JDG","19","26","26","Early that morning, the woman went back to the house where her master was staying, collapsed at the doorway, and lay there until it was light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_27","008_19_27","JDG","19","27","27","In the morning, when her master got up and opened the doors of the house to go out on his journey, there was his concubine, collapsed in the doorway of the house, with her hands on the threshold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_28","008_19_28","JDG","19","28","28","“Get up,” he told her. “Let us go.” But there was no response. So the man put her on his donkey and set out for home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_29","008_19_29","JDG","19","29","29","When he reached his house, he picked up a knife, took hold of his concubine, cut her limb by limb into twelve pieces, and sent her throughout the territory of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG19_30","008_19_30","JDG","19","30","30","And everyone who saw it said, “Nothing like this has been seen or done from the day the Israelites came out of the land of Egypt until this day. Think it over, take counsel, and speak up!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_1","008_20_1","JDG","20","1","1","Then all the Israelites from Dan to Beersheba and from the land of Gilead came out, and the congregation assembled as one man before the LORD at Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_2","008_20_2","JDG","20","2","2","The leaders of all the people and all the tribes of Israel presented themselves in the assembly of God’s people: 400,000 men on foot, armed with swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_3","008_20_3","JDG","20","3","3","(Meanwhile the Benjamites heard that the Israelites had gone up to Mizpah.) And the Israelites asked, “Tell us, how did this wicked thing happen?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_4","008_20_4","JDG","20","4","4","So the Levite, the husband of the murdered woman, answered: “I and my concubine came to Gibeah in Benjamin to spend the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_5","008_20_5","JDG","20","5","5","And during the night, the men of Gibeah rose up against me and surrounded the house. They intended to kill me, but they abused my concubine, and she died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_6","008_20_6","JDG","20","6","6","Then I took my concubine, cut her into pieces, and sent her throughout the land of Israel’s inheritance, because they had committed a lewd and disgraceful act in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_7","008_20_7","JDG","20","7","7","Behold, all you Israelites, give your advice and verdict here and now.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_8","008_20_8","JDG","20","8","8","Then all the people stood as one man and said, “Not one of us will return to his tent or to his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_9","008_20_9","JDG","20","9","9","Now this is what we will do to Gibeah: We will go against it as the lot dictates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_10","008_20_10","JDG","20","10","10","We will take ten men out of every hundred from all the tribes of Israel, and a hundred out of every thousand, and a thousand out of every ten thousand, to supply provisions for the army when they go to Gibeah in Benjamin to punish them for the atrocity they have committed in Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_11","008_20_11","JDG","20","11","11","So all the men of Israel gathered as one man, united against the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_12","008_20_12","JDG","20","12","12","And the tribes of Israel sent men throughout the tribe of Benjamin, saying, “What is this wickedness that has occurred among you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_13","008_20_13","JDG","20","13","13","Hand over the wicked men of Gibeah so we can put them to death and purge Israel of this evil.” But the Benjamites refused to heed the voice of their fellow Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_14","008_20_14","JDG","20","14","14","And from their cities they came together at Gibeah to go out and fight against the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_15","008_20_15","JDG","20","15","15","On that day the Benjamites mobilized 26,000 swordsmen from their cities, in addition to the 700 select men of Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_16","008_20_16","JDG","20","16","16","Among all these soldiers there were 700 select left-handers, each of whom could sling a stone at a hair without missing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_17","008_20_17","JDG","20","17","17","The Israelites, apart from Benjamin, mobilized 400,000 swordsmen, each one an experienced warrior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_18","008_20_18","JDG","20","18","18","The Israelites set out, went up to Bethel, and inquired of God, “Who of us shall go up first to fight against the Benjamites?” “Judah will be first,” the LORD replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_19","008_20_19","JDG","20","19","19","The next morning the Israelites set out and camped near Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_20","008_20_20","JDG","20","20","20","And the men of Israel went out to fight against Benjamin and took up their battle positions at Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_21","008_20_21","JDG","20","21","21","And the Benjamites came out of Gibeah and cut down 22,000 Israelites on the battlefield that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_22","008_20_22","JDG","20","22","22","But the Israelite army took courage and again took their battle positions in the same place where they had arrayed themselves on the first day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_23","008_20_23","JDG","20","23","23","They went up and wept before the LORD until evening, inquiring of Him, “Should we again draw near for battle against our brothers the Benjamites?” And the LORD answered, “Go up against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_24","008_20_24","JDG","20","24","24","On the second day the Israelites advanced against the Benjamites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_25","008_20_25","JDG","20","25","25","That same day the Benjamites came out against them from Gibeah and cut down another 18,000 Israelites, all of them armed with swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_26","008_20_26","JDG","20","26","26","Then the Israelites, all the people, went up to Bethel, where they sat weeping before the LORD. That day they fasted until evening and presented burnt offerings and peace offerings to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_27","008_20_27","JDG","20","27","27","And the Israelites inquired of the LORD. (In those days the ark of the covenant of God was there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_28","008_20_28","JDG","20","28","28","and Phinehas son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron, served before it.) The Israelites asked, “Should we again go out to battle against our brothers the Benjamites, or should we stop?” The LORD answered, “Fight, for tomorrow I will deliver them into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_29","008_20_29","JDG","20","29","29","So Israel set up an ambush around Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_30","008_20_30","JDG","20","30","30","On the third day the Israelites went up against the Benjamites and arrayed themselves against Gibeah as they had done before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_31","008_20_31","JDG","20","31","31","The Benjamites came out against them and were drawn away from the city. They began to attack the people as before, killing about thirty men of Israel in the fields and on the roads, one of which led up to Bethel and the other to Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_32","008_20_32","JDG","20","32","32","“We are defeating them as before,” said the Benjamites. But the Israelites said, “Let us retreat and draw them away from the city onto the roads.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_33","008_20_33","JDG","20","33","33","So all the men of Israel got up from their places and arrayed themselves at Baal-tamar, and the Israelites in ambush charged from their positions west of Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_34","008_20_34","JDG","20","34","34","Then 10,000 select men from all Israel made a frontal assault against Gibeah, and the battle was fierce. But the Benjamites did not realize that disaster was upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_35","008_20_35","JDG","20","35","35","The LORD defeated Benjamin in the presence of Israel, and on that day the Israelites slaughtered 25,100 Benjamites, all armed with swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_36","008_20_36","JDG","20","36","36","Then the Benjamites realized they had been defeated. Now the men of Israel had retreated before Benjamin because they were relying on the ambush they had set against Gibeah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_37","008_20_37","JDG","20","37","37","The men in ambush rushed suddenly against Gibeah; they advanced and put the whole city to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_38","008_20_38","JDG","20","38","38","The men of Israel had arranged a signal with the men in ambush: When they sent up a great cloud of smoke from the city, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_39","008_20_39","JDG","20","39","39","the men of Israel would turn in the battle. When the Benjamites had begun to strike them down, killing about thirty men of Israel, they said, “They are defeated before us as in the first battle.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_40","008_20_40","JDG","20","40","40","But when the column of smoke began to go up from the city, the Benjamites looked behind them and saw the whole city going up in smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_41","008_20_41","JDG","20","41","41","Then the men of Israel turned back on them, and the men of Benjamin were terrified when they realized that disaster had come upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_42","008_20_42","JDG","20","42","42","So they fled before the men of Israel toward the wilderness, but the battle overtook them, and the men coming out of the cities struck them down there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_43","008_20_43","JDG","20","43","43","They surrounded the Benjamites, pursued them, and easily overtook them in the vicinity of Gibeah on the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_44","008_20_44","JDG","20","44","44","And 18,000 Benjamites fell, all men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_45","008_20_45","JDG","20","45","45","Then the Benjamites turned and fled toward the wilderness to the rock of Rimmon, and Israel cut down 5,000 men on the roads. And they overtook them at Gidom and struck down 2,000 more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_46","008_20_46","JDG","20","46","46","That day 25,000 Benjamite swordsmen fell, all men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_47","008_20_47","JDG","20","47","47","But 600 men turned and fled into the wilderness to the rock of Rimmon, where they stayed four months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG20_48","008_20_48","JDG","20","48","48","And the men of Israel turned back against the other Benjamites and put to the sword all the cities, including the animals and everything else they found. And they burned down all the cities in their path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_1","008_21_1","JDG","21","1","1","Now the men of Israel had sworn an oath at Mizpah, saying, “Not one of us will give his daughter in marriage to a Benjamite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_2","008_21_2","JDG","21","2","2","So the people came to Bethel and sat there before God until evening, lifting up their voices and weeping bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_3","008_21_3","JDG","21","3","3","“Why, O LORD God of Israel,” they cried out, “has this happened in Israel? Today in Israel one tribe is missing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_4","008_21_4","JDG","21","4","4","The next day the people got up early, built an altar there, and presented burnt offerings and peace offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_5","008_21_5","JDG","21","5","5","The Israelites asked, “Who among all the tribes of Israel did not come to the assembly before the LORD?” For they had taken a solemn oath that anyone who failed to come up before the LORD at Mizpah would surely be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_6","008_21_6","JDG","21","6","6","And the Israelites grieved for their brothers, the Benjamites, and said, “Today a tribe is cut off from Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_7","008_21_7","JDG","21","7","7","What should we do about wives for the survivors, since we have sworn by the LORD not to give them our daughters in marriage?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_8","008_21_8","JDG","21","8","8","So they asked, “Which one of the tribes of Israel failed to come up before the LORD at Mizpah?” And, in fact, no one from Jabesh-gilead had come to the camp for the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_9","008_21_9","JDG","21","9","9","For when the people were counted, none of the residents of Jabesh-gilead were there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_10","008_21_10","JDG","21","10","10","So the congregation sent 12,000 of their most valiant men and commanded them: “Go and put to the sword those living in Jabesh-gilead, including women and children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_11","008_21_11","JDG","21","11","11","This is what you are to do: Devote to destruction every male, as well as every female who has had relations with a man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_12","008_21_12","JDG","21","12","12","So they found among the inhabitants of Jabesh-gilead four hundred young women who had not had relations with a man, and they brought them to the camp at Shiloh in the land of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_13","008_21_13","JDG","21","13","13","Then the whole congregation sent a message of peace to the Benjamites who were at the rock of Rimmon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_14","008_21_14","JDG","21","14","14","And at that time the Benjamites returned and were given the women who were spared from Jabesh-gilead. But there were not enough women for all of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_15","008_21_15","JDG","21","15","15","The people grieved for Benjamin, because the LORD had made a void in the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_16","008_21_16","JDG","21","16","16","Then the elders of the congregation said, “What should we do about wives for those who remain, since the women of Benjamin have been destroyed?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_17","008_21_17","JDG","21","17","17","They added, “There must be heirs for the survivors of Benjamin, so that a tribe of Israel will not be wiped out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_18","008_21_18","JDG","21","18","18","But we cannot give them our daughters as wives.” For the Israelites had sworn, “Cursed is he who gives a wife to a Benjamite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_19","008_21_19","JDG","21","19","19","“But look,” they said, “there is a yearly feast to the LORD in Shiloh, which is north of Bethel east of the road that goes up from Bethel to Shechem, and south of Lebonah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_20","008_21_20","JDG","21","20","20","So they commanded the Benjamites: “Go, hide in the vineyards ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_21","008_21_21","JDG","21","21","21","and watch. When you see the daughters of Shiloh come out to perform their dances, each of you is to come out of the vineyards, catch for himself a wife from the daughters of Shiloh, and go to the land of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_22","008_21_22","JDG","21","22","22","When their fathers or brothers come to us to complain, we will tell them, ‘Do us a favor by helping them, since we did not get wives for each of them in the war. Since you did not actually give them your daughters, you have no guilt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_23","008_21_23","JDG","21","23","23","The Benjamites did as instructed and carried away the number of women they needed from the dancers they caught. They went back to their own inheritance, rebuilt their cities, and settled in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_24","008_21_24","JDG","21","24","24","And at that time, each of the Israelites returned from there to his own tribe and clan, each to his own inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JG21_25","008_21_25","JDG","21","25","25","In those days there was no king in Israel; everyone did what was right in his own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_1","009_1_1","RUT","1","1","1","In the days when the judges ruled, there was a famine in the land. And a certain man from Bethlehem in Judah, with his wife and two sons, went to reside in the land of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_2","009_1_2","RUT","1","2","2","The man’s name was Elimelech, his wife’s name was Naomi, and the names of his two sons were Mahlon and Chilion. They were Ephrathites from Bethlehem in Judah, and they entered the land of Moab and settled there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_3","009_1_3","RUT","1","3","3","Then Naomi’s husband Elimelech died, and she was left with her two sons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_4","009_1_4","RUT","1","4","4","who took Moabite women as their wives, one named Orpah and the other named Ruth. And after they had lived in Moab about ten years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_5","009_1_5","RUT","1","5","5","both Mahlon and Chilion also died, and Naomi was left without her two sons and without her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_6","009_1_6","RUT","1","6","6","When Naomi heard in Moab that the LORD had attended to His people by providing them with food, she and her daughters-in-law prepared to leave the land of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_7","009_1_7","RUT","1","7","7","Accompanied by her two daughters-in-law, she left the place where she had been living and set out on the road leading back to the land of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_8","009_1_8","RUT","1","8","8","Then Naomi said to her two daughters-in-law, “Go back, each of you to your mother’s home. May the LORD show you loving devotion, as you have shown to your dead and to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_9","009_1_9","RUT","1","9","9","May the LORD enable each of you to find rest in the home of your new husband.” And she kissed them as they wept aloud ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_10","009_1_10","RUT","1","10","10","and said, “Surely we will return with you to your people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_11","009_1_11","RUT","1","11","11","But Naomi replied, “Return home, my daughters. Why would you go with me? Are there still sons in my womb to become your husbands? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_12","009_1_12","RUT","1","12","12","Return home, my daughters. Go on, for I am too old to have another husband. Even if I thought there was hope for me to have a husband tonight and to bear sons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_13","009_1_13","RUT","1","13","13","would you wait for them to grow up? Would you refrain from having husbands? No, my daughters, it is much more bitter for me than for you, because the hand of the LORD has gone out against me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_14","009_1_14","RUT","1","14","14","Again they wept aloud, and Orpah kissed her mother-in-law goodbye, but Ruth clung to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_15","009_1_15","RUT","1","15","15","“Look,” said Naomi, “your sister-in-law has gone back to her people and her gods; follow her back home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_16","009_1_16","RUT","1","16","16","But Ruth replied: “Do not urge me to leave you or to turn from following you. For wherever you go, I will go, and wherever you live, I will live; your people will be my people, and your God will be my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_17","009_1_17","RUT","1","17","17","Where you die, I will die, and there I will be buried. May the LORD punish me, and ever so severely, if anything but death separates you and me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_18","009_1_18","RUT","1","18","18","When Naomi saw that Ruth was determined to go with her, she stopped trying to persuade her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_19","009_1_19","RUT","1","19","19","So Naomi and Ruth traveled until they came to Bethlehem. When they entered Bethlehem, the whole town was stirred because of them, and the women of the town exclaimed, “Can this be Naomi?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_20","009_1_20","RUT","1","20","20","“Do not call me Naomi,” she replied. “Call me Mara, because the Almighty has dealt quite bitterly with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_21","009_1_21","RUT","1","21","21","I went away full, but the LORD has brought me back empty. Why call me Naomi? After all, the LORD has testified against me, and the Almighty has afflicted me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT1_22","009_1_22","RUT","1","22","22","So Naomi returned from the land of Moab with her daughter-in-law Ruth the Moabitess. And they arrived in Bethlehem at the beginning of the barley harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_1","009_2_1","RUT","2","1","1","Now Naomi had a relative on her husband’s side, a prominent man of noble character from the clan of Elimelech, whose name was Boaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_2","009_2_2","RUT","2","2","2","And Ruth the Moabitess said to Naomi, “Please let me go into the fields and glean heads of grain after someone in whose sight I may find favor.” “Go ahead, my daughter,” Naomi replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_3","009_2_3","RUT","2","3","3","So Ruth departed and went out into the field and gleaned after the harvesters. And she happened to come to the part of the field belonging to Boaz, who was from the clan of Elimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_4","009_2_4","RUT","2","4","4","Just then Boaz arrived from Bethlehem and said to the harvesters, “The LORD be with you.” “The LORD bless you,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_5","009_2_5","RUT","2","5","5","And Boaz asked the foreman of his harvesters, “Whose young woman is this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_6","009_2_6","RUT","2","6","6","The foreman answered, “She is the Moabitess who returned with Naomi from the land of Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_7","009_2_7","RUT","2","7","7","She has said, ‘Please let me glean and gather among the sheaves after the harvesters.’ So she came out and has continued from morning until now, except that she rested a short time in the shelter.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_8","009_2_8","RUT","2","8","8","Then Boaz said to Ruth, “Listen, my daughter. Do not go and glean in another field, and do not go away from this place, but stay here close to my servant girls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_9","009_2_9","RUT","2","9","9","Let your eyes be on the field they are harvesting, and follow along after these girls. Indeed, I have ordered the young men not to touch you. And when you are thirsty, go and drink from the jars the young men have filled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_10","009_2_10","RUT","2","10","10","At this, she fell on her face, bowing low to the ground, and said to him, “Why have I found such favor in your eyes that you should take notice of me, even though I am a foreigner?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_11","009_2_11","RUT","2","11","11","Boaz replied, “I have been made fully aware of all you have done for your mother-in-law since the death of your husband, how you left your father and mother and the land of your birth, and how you came to a people you did not know before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_12","009_2_12","RUT","2","12","12","May the LORD repay your work, and may you receive a rich reward from the LORD, the God of Israel, under whose wings you have taken refuge.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_13","009_2_13","RUT","2","13","13","“My lord,” she said, “may I continue to find favor in your eyes, for you have comforted and spoken kindly to your maidservant, though I am not like one of your servant girls.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_14","009_2_14","RUT","2","14","14","At mealtime Boaz said to her, “Come over here; have some bread and dip it into the vinegar sauce.” So she sat down beside the harvesters, and he offered her roasted grain, and she ate and was satisfied and had some left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_15","009_2_15","RUT","2","15","15","When Ruth got up to glean, Boaz ordered his young men, “Even if she gathers among the sheaves, do not insult her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_16","009_2_16","RUT","2","16","16","Rather, pull out for her some stalks from the bundles and leave them for her to gather. Do not rebuke her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_17","009_2_17","RUT","2","17","17","So Ruth gathered grain in the field until evening. And when she beat out what she had gleaned, it was about an ephah of barley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_18","009_2_18","RUT","2","18","18","She picked up the grain and went into the town, where her mother-in-law saw what she had gleaned. And she brought out what she had saved from her meal and gave it to Naomi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_19","009_2_19","RUT","2","19","19","Then her mother-in-law asked her, “Where did you glean today, and where did you work? Blessed be the man who noticed you.” So she told her mother-in-law where she had worked. “The name of the man I worked with today is Boaz,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_20","009_2_20","RUT","2","20","20","Then Naomi said to her daughter-in-law, “May he be blessed by the LORD, who has not withdrawn His kindness from the living or the dead.” Naomi continued, “The man is a close relative. He is one of our kinsman-redeemers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_21","009_2_21","RUT","2","21","21","Then Ruth the Moabitess said, “He also told me, ‘Stay with my young men until they have finished gathering all my harvest.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_22","009_2_22","RUT","2","22","22","And Naomi said to her daughter-in-law Ruth, “My daughter, it is good for you to work with his young women, so that nothing will happen to you in another field.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT2_23","009_2_23","RUT","2","23","23","So Ruth stayed close to the servant girls of Boaz to glean grain until the barley and wheat harvests were finished. And she lived with her mother-in-law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_1","009_3_1","RUT","3","1","1","One day Ruth’s mother-in-law Naomi said to her, “My daughter, should I not seek a resting place for you, that it may be well with you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_2","009_3_2","RUT","3","2","2","Now is not Boaz, with whose servant girls you have been working, a relative of ours? In fact, tonight he is winnowing barley on the threshing floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_3","009_3_3","RUT","3","3","3","Therefore wash yourself, put on perfume, and wear your best clothes. Go down to the threshing floor, but do not let the man know you are there until he has finished eating and drinking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_4","009_3_4","RUT","3","4","4","When he lies down, note the place where he lies. Then go in and uncover his feet, and lie down, and he will explain to you what you should do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_5","009_3_5","RUT","3","5","5","“I will do everything you say,” Ruth answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_6","009_3_6","RUT","3","6","6","So she went down to the threshing floor and did everything her mother-in-law had instructed her to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_7","009_3_7","RUT","3","7","7","After Boaz had finished eating and drinking and was in good spirits, he went to lie down at the end of the heap of grain. Then Ruth went in secretly, uncovered his feet, and lay down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_8","009_3_8","RUT","3","8","8","At midnight, Boaz was startled, turned over, and there lying at his feet was a woman! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_9","009_3_9","RUT","3","9","9","“Who are you?” he asked. “I am your servant Ruth,” she replied. “Spread the corner of your garment over me, for you are a kinsman-redeemer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_10","009_3_10","RUT","3","10","10","Then Boaz said, “May the LORD bless you, my daughter. You have shown more kindness now than before, because you have not run after the younger men, whether rich or poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_11","009_3_11","RUT","3","11","11","And now do not be afraid, my daughter. I will do for you whatever you request, since all my fellow townspeople know that you are a woman of noble character. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_12","009_3_12","RUT","3","12","12","Yes, it is true that I am a kinsman-redeemer, but there is a redeemer nearer than I. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_13","009_3_13","RUT","3","13","13","Stay here tonight, and in the morning, if he wants to redeem you, good. Let him redeem you. But if he does not want to redeem you, as surely as the LORD lives, I will. Now lie here until morning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_14","009_3_14","RUT","3","14","14","So she lay down at his feet until morning, but she got up before anyone else could recognize her. Then Boaz said, “Do not let it be known that a woman came to the threshing floor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_15","009_3_15","RUT","3","15","15","And he told her, “Bring the shawl you are wearing and hold it out.” When she did so, he poured in six measures of barley and placed it on her. Then he went into the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_16","009_3_16","RUT","3","16","16","When Ruth returned to her mother-in-law, Naomi asked her, “How did it go, my daughter?” Then Ruth told her all that Boaz had done for her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_17","009_3_17","RUT","3","17","17","And she said, “He gave me these six measures of barley, for he said, ‘Do not go back to your mother-in-law empty-handed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT3_18","009_3_18","RUT","3","18","18","“Wait, my daughter,” said Naomi, “until you find out how things go, for he will not rest unless he has resolved the matter today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_1","009_4_1","RUT","4","1","1","Meanwhile, Boaz went to the gate and sat down there. Soon the kinsman-redeemer of whom he had spoken came along, and Boaz said, “Come over here, my friend, and sit down.” So he went over and sat down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_2","009_4_2","RUT","4","2","2","Then Boaz took ten of the elders of the city and said, “Sit here,” and they did so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_3","009_4_3","RUT","4","3","3","And he said to the kinsman-redeemer, “Naomi, who has returned from the land of Moab, is selling the piece of land that belonged to our brother Elimelech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_4","009_4_4","RUT","4","4","4","I thought I should inform you that you may buy it back in the presence of those seated here and in the presence of the elders of my people. If you want to redeem it, do so. But if you will not redeem it, tell me so I may know, because there is no one but you to redeem it, and I am next after you.” “I will redeem it,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_5","009_4_5","RUT","4","5","5","Then Boaz said, “On the day you buy the land from Naomi and also from Ruth the Moabitess, you must also acquire the widow of the deceased in order to raise up the name of the deceased on his inheritance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_6","009_4_6","RUT","4","6","6","The kinsman-redeemer replied, “I cannot redeem it myself, or I would jeopardize my own inheritance. Take my right of redemption, because I cannot redeem it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_7","009_4_7","RUT","4","7","7","Now in former times in Israel, concerning the redemption or exchange of property, to make any matter legally binding a man would remove his sandal and give it to the other party, and this was a confirmation in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_8","009_4_8","RUT","4","8","8","So the kinsman-redeemer removed his sandal and said to Boaz, “Buy it for yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_9","009_4_9","RUT","4","9","9","At this, Boaz said to the elders and all the people, “You are witnesses today that I am buying from Naomi all that belonged to Elimelech, Chilion, and Mahlon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_10","009_4_10","RUT","4","10","10","Moreover, I have acquired Ruth the Moabitess, Mahlon’s widow, as my wife, to raise up the name of the deceased through his inheritance, so that his name will not disappear from among his brothers or from the gate of his home. You are witnesses today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_11","009_4_11","RUT","4","11","11","“We are witnesses,” said the elders and all the people at the gate. “May the LORD make the woman entering your home like Rachel and Leah, who together built up the house of Israel. May you be prosperous in Ephrathah and famous in Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_12","009_4_12","RUT","4","12","12","And may your house become like the house of Perez, whom Tamar bore to Judah, because of the offspring the LORD will give you by this young woman.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_13","009_4_13","RUT","4","13","13","So Boaz took Ruth, and she became his wife. And when he had relations with her, the LORD enabled her to conceive, and she gave birth to a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_14","009_4_14","RUT","4","14","14","Then the women said to Naomi, “Blessed be the LORD, who has not left you this day without a kinsman-redeemer. May his name become famous in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_15","009_4_15","RUT","4","15","15","He will renew your life and sustain you in your old age. For your daughter-in-law, who loves you and is better to you than seven sons, has given him birth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_16","009_4_16","RUT","4","16","16","And Naomi took the child, placed him on her lap, and became a nurse to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_17","009_4_17","RUT","4","17","17","The neighbor women said, “A son has been born to Naomi,” and they named him Obed. He became the father of Jesse, the father of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_18","009_4_18","RUT","4","18","18","Now these are the generations of Perez: Perez was the father of Hezron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_19","009_4_19","RUT","4","19","19","Hezron was the father of Ram, Ram was the father of Amminadab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_20","009_4_20","RUT","4","20","20","Amminadab was the father of Nahshon, Nahshon was the father of Salmon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_21","009_4_21","RUT","4","21","21","Salmon was the father of Boaz, Boaz was the father of Obed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RT4_22","009_4_22","RUT","4","22","22","Obed was the father of Jesse, and Jesse was the father of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_1","010_1_1","1SA","1","1","1","Now there was a man named Elkanah who was from Ramathaim-zophim in the hill country of Ephraim. He was the son of Jeroham, the son of Elihu, the son of Tohu, the son of Zuph, an Ephraimite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_2","010_1_2","1SA","1","2","2","He had two wives, one named Hannah and the other Peninnah. And Peninnah had children, but Hannah had none. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_3","010_1_3","1SA","1","3","3","Year after year Elkanah would go up from his city to worship and sacrifice to the LORD of Hosts at Shiloh, where Eli’s two sons, Hophni and Phinehas, were priests to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_4","010_1_4","1SA","1","4","4","And whenever the day came for Elkanah to present his sacrifice, he would give portions to his wife Peninnah and to all her sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_5","010_1_5","1SA","1","5","5","But to Hannah he would give a double portion, for he loved her even though the LORD had closed her womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_6","010_1_6","1SA","1","6","6","Because the LORD had closed Hannah’s womb, her rival would provoke her viciously to taunt her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_7","010_1_7","1SA","1","7","7","And this went on year after year. Whenever Hannah went up to the house of the LORD, her rival taunted her until she wept and would not eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_8","010_1_8","1SA","1","8","8","“Hannah, why are you crying?” her husband Elkanah asked. “Why won’t you eat? Why is your heart so grieved? Am I not better to you than ten sons?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_9","010_1_9","1SA","1","9","9","So after they had finished eating and drinking in Shiloh, Hannah stood up. Now Eli the priest was sitting on a chair by the doorpost of the temple of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_10","010_1_10","1SA","1","10","10","In her bitter distress, Hannah prayed to the LORD and wept with many tears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_11","010_1_11","1SA","1","11","11","And she made a vow, saying, “O LORD of Hosts, if only You will look upon the affliction of Your maidservant and remember me, not forgetting Your maidservant but giving her a son, then I will dedicate him to the LORD all the days of his life, and no razor shall ever touch his head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_12","010_1_12","1SA","1","12","12","As Hannah kept on praying before the LORD, Eli watched her mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_13","010_1_13","1SA","1","13","13","Hannah was praying in her heart, and though her lips were moving, her voice could not be heard. So Eli thought she was drunk ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_14","010_1_14","1SA","1","14","14","and said to her, “How long will you be drunk? Put away your wine!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_15","010_1_15","1SA","1","15","15","“No, my lord,” Hannah replied. “I am a woman troubled in spirit. I have not had any wine or strong drink, but I have poured out my soul before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_16","010_1_16","1SA","1","16","16","Do not take your servant for a wicked woman, for all this time I have been praying out of the depth of my anguish and grief.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_17","010_1_17","1SA","1","17","17","“Go in peace,” Eli replied, “and may the God of Israel grant the petition you have asked of Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_18","010_1_18","1SA","1","18","18","“May your maidservant find favor with you,” said Hannah. Then she went on her way, and she began to eat, and her face was no longer downcast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_19","010_1_19","1SA","1","19","19","The next morning they got up early to bow in worship before the LORD, and then they returned home to Ramah. And Elkanah had relations with his wife Hannah, and the LORD remembered her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_20","010_1_20","1SA","1","20","20","So in the course of time, Hannah conceived and gave birth to a son. She named him Samuel, saying, “Because I have asked for him from the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_21","010_1_21","1SA","1","21","21","Then Elkanah and all his house went up to make the annual sacrifice to the LORD and to fulfill his vow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_22","010_1_22","1SA","1","22","22","but Hannah did not go. “After the boy is weaned,” she said to her husband, “I will take him to appear before the LORD and to stay there permanently.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_23","010_1_23","1SA","1","23","23","“Do what you think is best,” her husband Elkanah replied, “and stay here until you have weaned him. Only may the LORD confirm His word.” So Hannah stayed and nursed her son until she had weaned him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_24","010_1_24","1SA","1","24","24","Once she had weaned him, Hannah took the boy with her, along with a three-year-old bull, an ephah of flour, and a skin of wine. Though the boy was still young, she brought him to the house of the LORD at Shiloh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_25","010_1_25","1SA","1","25","25","And when they had slaughtered the bull, they brought the boy to Eli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_26","010_1_26","1SA","1","26","26","“Please, my lord,” said Hannah, “as surely as you live, my lord, I am the woman who stood here beside you praying to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_27","010_1_27","1SA","1","27","27","I prayed for this boy, and since the LORD has granted me what I asked of Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S11_28","010_1_28","1SA","1","28","28","I now dedicate the boy to the LORD. For as long as he lives, he is dedicated to the LORD.” So they worshiped the LORD there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_1","010_2_1","1SA","2","1","1","At that time Hannah prayed: “My heart rejoices in the LORD; my horn is exalted in the LORD. My mouth speaks boldly against my enemies, for I rejoice in Your salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_2","010_2_2","1SA","2","2","2","There is no one holy like the LORD. Indeed, there is no one besides You! And there is no Rock like our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_3","010_2_3","1SA","2","3","3","Do not boast so proudly, or let arrogance come from your mouth, for the LORD is a God who knows, and by Him actions are weighed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_4","010_2_4","1SA","2","4","4","The bows of the mighty are broken, but the feeble are equipped with strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_5","010_2_5","1SA","2","5","5","The well-fed hire themselves out for food, but the starving hunger no more. The barren woman gives birth to seven, but she who has many sons pines away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_6","010_2_6","1SA","2","6","6","The LORD brings death and gives life; He brings down to Sheol and raises up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_7","010_2_7","1SA","2","7","7","The LORD sends poverty and wealth; He humbles and He exalts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_8","010_2_8","1SA","2","8","8","He raises the poor from the dust and lifts the needy from the ash heap. He seats them among princes and bestows on them a throne of honor. For the foundations of the earth are the LORD’s, and upon them He has set the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_9","010_2_9","1SA","2","9","9","He guards the steps of His faithful ones, but the wicked perish in darkness; for by his own strength shall no man prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_10","010_2_10","1SA","2","10","10","Those who oppose the LORD will be shattered. He will thunder from heaven against them. The LORD will judge the ends of the earth and will give power to His king. He will exalt the horn of His anointed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_11","010_2_11","1SA","2","11","11","Then Elkanah went home to Ramah, but the boy began ministering to the LORD before Eli the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_12","010_2_12","1SA","2","12","12","Now the sons of Eli were wicked men; they had no regard for the LORD ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_13","010_2_13","1SA","2","13","13","or for the custom of the priests with the people. When any man offered a sacrifice, the servant of the priest would come with a three-pronged meat fork while the meat was boiling ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_14","010_2_14","1SA","2","14","14","and plunge it into the pan or kettle or cauldron or cooking pot. And the priest would claim for himself whatever the meat fork brought up. This is how they treated all the Israelites who came to Shiloh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_15","010_2_15","1SA","2","15","15","Even before the fat was burned, the servant of the priest would come and say to the man who was sacrificing, “Give the priest some meat to roast, because he will not accept boiled meat from you, but only raw.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_16","010_2_16","1SA","2","16","16","And if any man said to him, “The fat must be burned first; then you may take whatever you want,” the servant would reply, “No, you must give it to me right now. If you refuse, I will take it by force!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_17","010_2_17","1SA","2","17","17","Thus the sin of these young men was severe in the sight of the LORD, for they were treating the LORD’s offering with contempt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_18","010_2_18","1SA","2","18","18","Now Samuel was ministering before the LORD—a boy wearing a linen ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_19","010_2_19","1SA","2","19","19","Each year his mother would make him a little robe and bring it to him when she went with her husband to offer the annual sacrifice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_20","010_2_20","1SA","2","20","20","And Eli would bless Elkanah and his wife, saying, “May the LORD give you children by this woman in place of the one she dedicated to the LORD.” Then they would go home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_21","010_2_21","1SA","2","21","21","So the LORD attended to Hannah, and she conceived and gave birth to three sons and two daughters. Meanwhile, the boy Samuel grew up in the presence of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_22","010_2_22","1SA","2","22","22","Now Eli was very old, and he heard about everything his sons were doing to all Israel and how they were sleeping with the women who served at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_23","010_2_23","1SA","2","23","23","“Why are you doing these things?” Eli said to his sons. “I hear about your wicked deeds from all these people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_24","010_2_24","1SA","2","24","24","No, my sons; it is not a good report I hear circulating among the LORD’s people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_25","010_2_25","1SA","2","25","25","If a man sins against another man, God can intercede for him; but if a man sins against the LORD, who can intercede for him?” But they would not listen to their father, since the LORD intended to put them to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_26","010_2_26","1SA","2","26","26","And the boy Samuel continued to grow in stature and in favor with the LORD and with man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_27","010_2_27","1SA","2","27","27","Then a man of God came to Eli and told him, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Did I not clearly reveal Myself to your father’s house when they were in Egypt under Pharaoh’s house? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_28","010_2_28","1SA","2","28","28","And out of all the tribes of Israel I selected your father to be My priest, to offer sacrifices on My altar, to burn incense, and to wear an ephod in My presence. I also gave to the house of your father all the food offerings of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_29","010_2_29","1SA","2","29","29","Why then do you kick at My sacrifice and offering that I have prescribed for My dwelling place? You have honored your sons more than Me by fattening yourselves with the best of all the offerings of My people Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_30","010_2_30","1SA","2","30","30","Therefore, the LORD, the God of Israel, declares: ‘I did indeed say that your house and the house of your father would walk before Me forever. But now the LORD declares: Far be it from Me! For I will honor those who honor Me, but those who despise Me will be disdained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_31","010_2_31","1SA","2","31","31","Behold, the days are coming when I will cut off your strength and the strength of your father’s house, so that no one in it will reach old age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_32","010_2_32","1SA","2","32","32","You will see distress in My dwelling place. Despite all that is good in Israel, no one in your house will ever again reach old age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_33","010_2_33","1SA","2","33","33","And every one of you that I do not cut off from My altar, I will cause your eyes to fail and your heart to grieve. All your descendants will die by the sword of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_34","010_2_34","1SA","2","34","34","And this sign shall come to you concerning your two sons Hophni and Phinehas: They will both die on the same day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_35","010_2_35","1SA","2","35","35","Then I will raise up for Myself a faithful priest. He will do whatever is in My heart and mind. And I will build for him an enduring house, and he will walk before My anointed one for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S12_36","010_2_36","1SA","2","36","36","And everyone left in your house will come and bow down to him for a piece of silver or a morsel of bread, pleading, “Please appoint me to some priestly office so that I can eat a piece of bread.”’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_1","010_3_1","1SA","3","1","1","And the boy Samuel ministered to the LORD before Eli. Now in those days the word of the LORD was rare, and visions were scarce. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_2","010_3_2","1SA","3","2","2","And at that time Eli, whose eyesight had grown so dim that he could not see, was lying in his room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_3","010_3_3","1SA","3","3","3","Before the lamp of God had gone out, Samuel was lying down in the temple of the LORD, where the ark of God was located. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_4","010_3_4","1SA","3","4","4","Then the LORD called to Samuel, and he answered, “Here I am.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_5","010_3_5","1SA","3","5","5","He ran to Eli and said, “Here I am, for you have called me.” “I did not call,” Eli replied. “Go back and lie down.” So he went and lay down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_6","010_3_6","1SA","3","6","6","Once again the LORD called, “Samuel!” So Samuel got up, went to Eli, and said, “Here I am, for you have called me.” “My son, I did not call,” Eli replied. “Go back and lie down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_7","010_3_7","1SA","3","7","7","Now Samuel did not yet know the LORD, because the word of the LORD had not yet been revealed to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_8","010_3_8","1SA","3","8","8","Once again, for the third time, the LORD called to Samuel. He got up, went to Eli, and said, “Here I am, for you have called me.” Then Eli realized that it was the LORD who was calling the boy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_9","010_3_9","1SA","3","9","9","“Go and lie down,” he said to Samuel, “and if He calls you, say, ‘Speak, LORD, for Your servant is listening.’” So Samuel went and lay down in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_10","010_3_10","1SA","3","10","10","Then the LORD came and stood there, calling as before, “Samuel! Samuel!” And Samuel answered, “Speak, for Your servant is listening.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_11","010_3_11","1SA","3","11","11","Then the LORD said to Samuel, “I am about to do something in Israel at which the ears of all who hear it will tingle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_12","010_3_12","1SA","3","12","12","On that day I will carry out against Eli everything I have spoken about his house, from beginning to end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_13","010_3_13","1SA","3","13","13","I told him that I would judge his house forever for the iniquity of which he knows, because his sons blasphemed God and he did not restrain them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_14","010_3_14","1SA","3","14","14","Therefore I have sworn to the house of Eli, ‘The iniquity of Eli’s house shall never be atoned for by sacrifice or offering.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_15","010_3_15","1SA","3","15","15","Samuel lay down until the morning; then he opened the doors of the house of the LORD. He was afraid to tell Eli the vision, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_16","010_3_16","1SA","3","16","16","but Eli called to him and said, “Samuel, my son.” “Here I am,” answered Samuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_17","010_3_17","1SA","3","17","17","“What was the message He gave you?” Eli asked. “Do not hide it from me. May God punish you, and ever so severely, if you hide from me anything He said to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_18","010_3_18","1SA","3","18","18","So Samuel told him everything and did not hide a thing from him. “He is the LORD,” replied Eli. “Let Him do what is good in His eyes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_19","010_3_19","1SA","3","19","19","And Samuel grew, and the LORD was with him, and He let none of Samuel’s words fall to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_20","010_3_20","1SA","3","20","20","So all Israel from Dan to Beersheba knew that Samuel was confirmed as a prophet of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S13_21","010_3_21","1SA","3","21","21","And the LORD continued to appear at Shiloh, because there He revealed Himself to Samuel by His word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_1","010_4_1","1SA","4","1","1","Thus the word of Samuel came to all Israel. Now the Israelites went out to meet the Philistines in battle and camped at Ebenezer, while the Philistines camped at Aphek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_2","010_4_2","1SA","4","2","2","The Philistines arrayed themselves against Israel, and as the battle spread, Israel was defeated by the Philistines, who struck down about four thousand men on the battlefield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_3","010_4_3","1SA","4","3","3","When the troops returned to the camp, the elders of Israel asked, “Why has the LORD brought defeat on us before the Philistines today? Let us bring the ark of the covenant of the LORD from Shiloh, so that it may go with us to save us from the hand of our enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_4","010_4_4","1SA","4","4","4","So the people sent men to Shiloh, and they brought back the ark of the covenant of the LORD of Hosts, who sits enthroned between the cherubim. And the two sons of Eli, Hophni and Phinehas, were there with the ark of the covenant of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_5","010_4_5","1SA","4","5","5","When the ark of the covenant of the LORD entered the camp, all the Israelites raised such a great shout that the ground shook. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_6","010_4_6","1SA","4","6","6","On hearing the noise of the shout, the Philistines asked, “What is this loud shouting in the camp of the Hebrews?” And when they realized that the ark of the LORD had entered the camp, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_7","010_4_7","1SA","4","7","7","the Philistines were afraid. “The gods have entered their camp!” they said. “Woe to us, for nothing like this has happened before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_8","010_4_8","1SA","4","8","8","Woe to us! Who will deliver us from the hand of these mighty gods? These are the gods who struck the Egyptians with all kinds of plagues in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_9","010_4_9","1SA","4","9","9","Take courage and be men, O Philistines! Otherwise, you will serve the Hebrews just as they served you. Now be men and fight!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_10","010_4_10","1SA","4","10","10","So the Philistines fought, and Israel was defeated, and each man fled to his tent. The slaughter was very great—thirty thousand foot soldiers of Israel fell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_11","010_4_11","1SA","4","11","11","The ark of God was captured, and Eli’s two sons, Hophni and Phinehas, died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_12","010_4_12","1SA","4","12","12","That same day a Benjamite ran from the battle line all the way to Shiloh, with his clothes torn and dirt on his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_13","010_4_13","1SA","4","13","13","When he arrived, there was Eli, sitting on his chair beside the road and watching, because his heart trembled for the ark of God. When the man entered the city to give a report, the whole city cried out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_14","010_4_14","1SA","4","14","14","Eli heard the outcry and asked, “Why this commotion?” So the man hurried over and reported to Eli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_15","010_4_15","1SA","4","15","15","Now Eli was ninety-eight years old, and his gaze was fixed because he could not see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_16","010_4_16","1SA","4","16","16","“I have just come from the battle,” the man said to Eli. “I fled from there today.” “What happened, my son?” Eli asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_17","010_4_17","1SA","4","17","17","The messenger answered, “Israel has fled before the Philistines, and there has been a great slaughter among the people. Your two sons, Hophni and Phinehas, are both dead, and the ark of God has been captured.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_18","010_4_18","1SA","4","18","18","As soon as the ark of God was mentioned, Eli fell backward from his chair by the city gate, and being old and heavy, he broke his neck and died. And Eli had judged Israel forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_19","010_4_19","1SA","4","19","19","Now Eli’s daughter-in-law, the wife of Phinehas, was pregnant and about to give birth. When she heard the news of the capture of God’s ark and the deaths of her father-in-law and her husband, she collapsed and gave birth, for her labor pains overtook her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_20","010_4_20","1SA","4","20","20","As she was dying, the women attending to her said, “Do not be afraid, for you have given birth to a son!” But she did not respond or pay any heed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_21","010_4_21","1SA","4","21","21","And she named the boy Ichabod, saying, “The glory has departed from Israel,” because the ark of God had been captured and her father-in-law and her husband had been killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S14_22","010_4_22","1SA","4","22","22","“The glory has departed from Israel,” she said, “for the ark of God has been captured.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_1","010_5_1","1SA","5","1","1","After the Philistines had captured the ark of God, they took it from Ebenezer to Ashdod, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_2","010_5_2","1SA","5","2","2","carried it into the temple of Dagon, and set it beside his statue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_3","010_5_3","1SA","5","3","3","When the people of Ashdod got up early the next morning, there was Dagon, fallen on his face before the ark of the LORD. So they took Dagon and returned him to his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_4","010_5_4","1SA","5","4","4","But when they got up early the next morning, there was Dagon, fallen on his face before the ark of the LORD, with his head and his hands broken off and lying on the threshold. Only the torso remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_5","010_5_5","1SA","5","5","5","That is why, to this day, the priests of Dagon and all who enter the temple of Dagon in Ashdod do not step on the threshold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_6","010_5_6","1SA","5","6","6","Now the hand of the LORD was heavy on the people of Ashdod and its vicinity, ravaging them and afflicting them with tumors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_7","010_5_7","1SA","5","7","7","And when the men of Ashdod saw what was happening, they said, “The ark of the God of Israel must not stay here with us, because His hand is heavy upon us and upon our god Dagon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_8","010_5_8","1SA","5","8","8","So they called together all the rulers of the Philistines and asked, “What shall we do with the ark of the God of Israel?” “It must be moved to Gath,” they replied. So they carried away the ark of the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_9","010_5_9","1SA","5","9","9","But after they had moved the ark to Gath, the LORD’s hand was also against that city, throwing it into great confusion and afflicting the men of the city, both young and old, with an outbreak of tumors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_10","010_5_10","1SA","5","10","10","So they sent the ark of God to Ekron, but as it arrived, the Ekronites cried out, “They have brought us the ark of the God of Israel in order to kill us and our people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_11","010_5_11","1SA","5","11","11","Then the Ekronites called together all the rulers of the Philistines and said, “Send away the ark of the God of Israel. It must return to its place, so that it will not kill us and our people!” For a deadly confusion had pervaded the city; the hand of God was very heavy upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S15_12","010_5_12","1SA","5","12","12","Those who did not die were afflicted with tumors, and the outcry of the city went up to heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_1","010_6_1","1SA","6","1","1","When the ark of the LORD had been in the land of the Philistines seven months, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_2","010_6_2","1SA","6","2","2","the Philistines summoned the priests and diviners, saying, “What shall we do with the ark of the LORD? Tell us how to send it back to its place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_3","010_6_3","1SA","6","3","3","They replied, “If you return the ark of the God of Israel, do not send it away empty, but by all means return it to Him with a guilt offering. Then you will be healed, and you will understand why His hand has not been lifted from you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_4","010_6_4","1SA","6","4","4","“What guilt offering should we send back to Him?” asked the Philistines. “Five gold tumors and five gold rats,” they said, “according to the number of rulers of the Philistines, since the same plague has struck both you and your rulers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_5","010_6_5","1SA","6","5","5","Make images of your tumors and of the rats that are ravaging the land. Give glory to the God of Israel, and perhaps He will lift His hand from you and your gods and your land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_6","010_6_6","1SA","6","6","6","Why harden your hearts as the Egyptians and Pharaoh hardened theirs? When He afflicted them, did they not send the people out so they could go on their way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_7","010_6_7","1SA","6","7","7","Now, therefore, prepare one new cart with two milk cows that have never been yoked. Hitch the cows to the cart, but take their calves away and pen them up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_8","010_6_8","1SA","6","8","8","Take the ark of the LORD, set it on the cart, and in a chest beside it put the gold objects you are sending back to Him as a guilt offering. Then send the ark on its way, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_9","010_6_9","1SA","6","9","9","but keep watching it. If it goes up the road to its homeland, toward Beth-shemesh, it is the LORD who has brought on us this great disaster. But if it does not, then we will know that it was not His hand that punished us and that it happened by chance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_10","010_6_10","1SA","6","10","10","So the men did as instructed. They took two milk cows, hitched them to the cart, and penned up their calves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_11","010_6_11","1SA","6","11","11","Then they put the ark of the LORD on the cart, along with the chest containing the gold rats and the images of the tumors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_12","010_6_12","1SA","6","12","12","And the cows headed straight up the road toward Beth-shemesh, staying on that one highway and lowing as they went, never straying to the right or to the left. The rulers of the Philistines followed behind them to the border of Beth-shemesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_13","010_6_13","1SA","6","13","13","Now the people of Beth-shemesh were harvesting wheat in the valley, and when they looked up and saw the ark, they were overjoyed at the sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_14","010_6_14","1SA","6","14","14","The cart came to the field of Joshua of Beth-shemesh and stopped there near a large rock. The people chopped up the cart and offered the cows as a burnt offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_15","010_6_15","1SA","6","15","15","And the Levites took down the ark of the LORD and the chest containing the gold objects, and they placed them on the large rock. That day the men of Beth-shemesh offered burnt offerings and made sacrifices to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_16","010_6_16","1SA","6","16","16","And when the five rulers of the Philistines saw this, they returned to Ekron that same day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_17","010_6_17","1SA","6","17","17","As a guilt offering to the LORD, the Philistines had sent back one gold tumor for each city: Ashdod, Gaza, Ashkelon, Gath, and Ekron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_18","010_6_18","1SA","6","18","18","The number of gold rats also corresponded to the number of Philistine cities belonging to the five rulers—the fortified cities and their outlying villages. And the large rock on which they placed the ark of the LORD stands to this day in the field of Joshua of Beth-shemesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_19","010_6_19","1SA","6","19","19","But God struck down some of the people of Beth-shemesh because they looked inside the ark of the LORD. He struck down seventy men, and the people mourned because the LORD had struck them with a great slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_20","010_6_20","1SA","6","20","20","The men of Beth-shemesh asked, “Who can stand in the presence of the LORD, this holy God? To whom should the ark go up from here?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S16_21","010_6_21","1SA","6","21","21","So they sent messengers to the people of Kiriath-jearim, saying, “The Philistines have returned the ark of the LORD. Come down and take it up with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_1","010_7_1","1SA","7","1","1","Then the men of Kiriath-jearim came for the ark of the LORD and took it into Abinadab’s house on the hill. And they consecrated his son Eleazar to guard the ark of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_2","010_7_2","1SA","7","2","2","And from that day a long time passed, twenty years in all, as the ark remained at Kiriath-jearim. And all the house of Israel mournfully sought the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_3","010_7_3","1SA","7","3","3","Then Samuel said to all the house of Israel, “If you are returning to the LORD with all your hearts, then put away the foreign gods and Ashtoreths among you, prepare your hearts for the LORD, and serve Him only. And He will deliver you from the hand of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_4","010_7_4","1SA","7","4","4","So the Israelites put away the Baals and Ashtoreths and served only the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_5","010_7_5","1SA","7","5","5","Then Samuel said, “Gather all Israel to Mizpah, and I will pray to the LORD on your behalf.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_6","010_7_6","1SA","7","6","6","When they had gathered at Mizpah, they drew water and poured it out before the LORD. On that day they fasted, and there they confessed, “We have sinned against the LORD.” And Samuel judged the Israelites at Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_7","010_7_7","1SA","7","7","7","When the Philistines heard that the Israelites had gathered at Mizpah, their rulers marched up toward Israel. And when the Israelites learned of this, they feared the Philistines ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_8","010_7_8","1SA","7","8","8","and said to Samuel, “Do not stop crying out to the LORD our God for us, that He may save us from the hand of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_9","010_7_9","1SA","7","9","9","Then Samuel took a suckling lamb and offered it as a whole burnt offering to the LORD. He cried out to the LORD on behalf of Israel, and the LORD answered him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_10","010_7_10","1SA","7","10","10","As the Philistines drew near to fight against Israel, Samuel was offering up the burnt offering. But that day the LORD thundered loudly against the Philistines and threw them into such confusion that they fled before Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_11","010_7_11","1SA","7","11","11","Then the men of Israel charged out of Mizpah and pursued the Philistines, striking them down all the way to an area below Beth-car. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_12","010_7_12","1SA","7","12","12","Afterward, Samuel took a stone and set it up between Mizpah and Shen. He named it Ebenezer, saying, “Thus far the LORD has helped us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_13","010_7_13","1SA","7","13","13","So the Philistines were subdued, and they stopped invading the territory of Israel. And the hand of the LORD was against the Philistines all the days of Samuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_14","010_7_14","1SA","7","14","14","The cities from Ekron to Gath, which the Philistines had taken, were restored to Israel, who also delivered the surrounding territory from the hand of the Philistines. And there was peace between the Israelites and the Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_15","010_7_15","1SA","7","15","15","So Samuel judged Israel all the days of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_16","010_7_16","1SA","7","16","16","Every year he would go on a circuit from Bethel to Gilgal to Mizpah, judging Israel in all these places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S17_17","010_7_17","1SA","7","17","17","Then he would return to Ramah because his home was there, and there he judged Israel and built an altar to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_1","010_8_1","1SA","8","1","1","When Samuel grew old, he appointed his sons as judges over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_2","010_8_2","1SA","8","2","2","The name of his firstborn son was Joel, and the name of his second was Abijah. They were judges in Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_3","010_8_3","1SA","8","3","3","But his sons did not walk in his ways; they turned aside toward dishonest gain, accepting bribes and perverting justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_4","010_8_4","1SA","8","4","4","So all the elders of Israel gathered together and came to Samuel at Ramah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_5","010_8_5","1SA","8","5","5","“Look,” they said, “you are old, and your sons do not walk in your ways. Now appoint a king to judge us like all the other nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_6","010_8_6","1SA","8","6","6","But when they said, “Give us a king to judge us,” their demand was displeasing in the sight of Samuel; so he prayed to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_7","010_8_7","1SA","8","7","7","And the LORD said to Samuel, “Listen to the voice of the people in all that they say to you. For it is not you they have rejected, but they have rejected Me as their king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_8","010_8_8","1SA","8","8","8","Just as they have done from the day I brought them up out of Egypt until this day, forsaking Me and serving other gods, so they are doing to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_9","010_8_9","1SA","8","9","9","Now listen to their voice; but you must solemnly warn them and show them the manner of the king who will reign over them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_10","010_8_10","1SA","8","10","10","So Samuel spoke all the words of the LORD to the people who were asking him for a king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_11","010_8_11","1SA","8","11","11","He said, “This will be the manner of the king who will reign over you: He will take your sons and appoint them to serve his own chariots and horses, and to run in front of his chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_12","010_8_12","1SA","8","12","12","He will appoint some for himself as commanders of thousands and of fifties, and others to plow his ground, to reap his harvest, and to make his weapons of war and equipment for his chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_13","010_8_13","1SA","8","13","13","And he will take your daughters to be perfumers, cooks, and bakers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_14","010_8_14","1SA","8","14","14","He will take the best of your fields and vineyards and olive groves and give them to his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_15","010_8_15","1SA","8","15","15","He will take a tenth of your grain and grape harvest and give it to his officials and servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_16","010_8_16","1SA","8","16","16","And he will take your menservants and maidservants and your best cattle and donkeys and put them to his own use. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_17","010_8_17","1SA","8","17","17","He will take a tenth of your flocks, and you yourselves will become his slaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_18","010_8_18","1SA","8","18","18","When that day comes, you will beg for relief from the king you have chosen, but the LORD will not answer you on that day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_19","010_8_19","1SA","8","19","19","Nevertheless, the people refused to listen to Samuel. “No!” they said. “We must have a king over us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_20","010_8_20","1SA","8","20","20","Then we will be like all the other nations, with a king to judge us, to go out before us, and to fight our battles.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_21","010_8_21","1SA","8","21","21","Samuel listened to all the words of the people and repeated them in the hearing of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S18_22","010_8_22","1SA","8","22","22","“Listen to their voice,” the LORD said to Samuel. “Appoint a king for them.” Then Samuel told the men of Israel, “Everyone must go back to his city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_1","010_9_1","1SA","9","1","1","Now there was a Benjamite, a powerful man, whose name was Kish son of Abiel, the son of Zeror, the son of Becorath, the son of Aphiah of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_2","010_9_2","1SA","9","2","2","And he had a son named Saul, choice and handsome, without equal among the Israelites—a head taller than any of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_3","010_9_3","1SA","9","3","3","One day the donkeys of Saul’s father Kish wandered off, and Kish said to his son Saul, “Take one of the servants and go look for the donkeys.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_4","010_9_4","1SA","9","4","4","So Saul passed through the hill country of Ephraim and then through the land of Shalishah, but they did not find the donkeys. He and the servant went through the region of Shaalim, but they were not there. Then they went through the land of Benjamin, and still they did not find them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_5","010_9_5","1SA","9","5","5","When they reached the land of Zuph, Saul said to his servant, “Come, let us go back, or my father will stop worrying about the donkeys and start worrying about us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_6","010_9_6","1SA","9","6","6","“Look,” said the servant, “in this city there is a man of God who is highly respected; everything he says surely comes to pass. Let us go there now. Perhaps he will tell us which way to go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_7","010_9_7","1SA","9","7","7","“If we do go,” Saul replied, “what can we give the man? For the bread in our packs is gone, and there is no gift to take to the man of God. What do we have?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_8","010_9_8","1SA","9","8","8","The servant answered him again. “Look,” he said, “I have here in my hand a quarter shekel of silver. I will give it to the man of God, and he will tell us our way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_9","010_9_9","1SA","9","9","9","(Formerly in Israel, a man on his way to inquire of God would say, “Come, let us go to the seer.” For the prophet of today was formerly called the seer.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_10","010_9_10","1SA","9","10","10","“Good,” said Saul to his servant. “Come, let us go.” So they set out for the city where the man of God was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_11","010_9_11","1SA","9","11","11","And as they were climbing the hill to the city, they met some young women coming out to draw water and asked, “Is the seer here?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_12","010_9_12","1SA","9","12","12","“Yes, he is ahead of you,” they answered. “Hurry now, for today he has come to the city because the people have a sacrifice on the high place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_13","010_9_13","1SA","9","13","13","As soon as you enter the city, you will find him before he goes up to the high place to eat. The people will not eat until he comes, because he must bless the sacrifice; after that, the guests will eat. Go up at once; you will find him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_14","010_9_14","1SA","9","14","14","So Saul and his servant went up toward the city, and as they were entering it, there was Samuel coming toward them on his way up to the high place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_15","010_9_15","1SA","9","15","15","Now on the day before Saul’s arrival, the LORD had revealed to Samuel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_16","010_9_16","1SA","9","16","16","“At this time tomorrow I will send you a man from the land of Benjamin, and you are to anoint him ruler over My people Israel; he will save them from the hand of the Philistines. For I have looked upon My people, because their cry has come to Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_17","010_9_17","1SA","9","17","17","When Samuel saw Saul, the LORD told him, “Here is the man of whom I spoke; he shall rule over My people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_18","010_9_18","1SA","9","18","18","Saul approached Samuel in the gateway and asked, “Would you please tell me where the seer’s house is?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_19","010_9_19","1SA","9","19","19","“I am the seer,” Samuel replied. “Go up before me to the high place, for you shall eat with me today. And when I send you off in the morning, I will tell you all that is in your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_20","010_9_20","1SA","9","20","20","As for the donkeys you lost three days ago, do not worry about them, for they have been found. And upon whom is all the desire of Israel, if not upon you and all your father’s house?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_21","010_9_21","1SA","9","21","21","Saul replied, “Am I not a Benjamite from the smallest tribe of Israel, and is not my clan the least of all the clans of Benjamin? So why would you say such a thing to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_22","010_9_22","1SA","9","22","22","Then Samuel took Saul and his servant, brought them into the hall, and seated them in the place of honor among those who were invited—about thirty in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_23","010_9_23","1SA","9","23","23","And Samuel said to the cook, “Bring the portion I gave you and told you to set aside.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_24","010_9_24","1SA","9","24","24","So the cook picked up the leg and what was attached to it and set it before Saul. Then Samuel said, “Here is what was kept back. It was set apart for you. Eat, for it has been kept for you for this occasion, from the time I said, ‘I have invited the people.’” So Saul dined with Samuel that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_25","010_9_25","1SA","9","25","25","And after they had come down from the high place into the city, Samuel spoke with Saul on the roof of his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_26","010_9_26","1SA","9","26","26","They got up early in the morning, and just before dawn Samuel called to Saul on the roof, “Get ready, and I will send you on your way!” So Saul got ready, and both he and Samuel went outside together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S19_27","010_9_27","1SA","9","27","27","As they were going down to the edge of the city, Samuel said to Saul, “Tell the servant to go on ahead of us, but you stay for a while, and I will reveal to you the word of God.” So the servant went on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_1","010_10_1","1SA","10","1","1","Then Samuel took a flask of oil, poured it on Saul’s head, kissed him, and said, “Has not the LORD anointed you ruler over His inheritance? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_2","010_10_2","1SA","10","2","2","When you leave me today, you will find two men at Rachel’s tomb in Zelzah on the border of Benjamin. They will say to you, ‘The donkeys you seek have been found, and now your father has stopped worrying about the donkeys and started worrying about you, asking, “What should I do about my son?”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_3","010_10_3","1SA","10","3","3","Then you will go on from there until you come to the Oak of Tabor. Three men going up to God at Bethel will meet you there, one carrying three young goats, another carrying three loaves of bread, and another carrying a skin of wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_4","010_10_4","1SA","10","4","4","They will greet you and give you two loaves of bread, which you will accept from their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_5","010_10_5","1SA","10","5","5","After that you will come to Gibeah of God, where the Philistines have an outpost. As you approach the city, you will meet a group of prophets coming down from the high place, preceded by harps, tambourines, flutes, and lyres, and they will be prophesying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_6","010_10_6","1SA","10","6","6","Then the Spirit of the LORD will rush upon you, and you will prophesy with them; and you will be transformed into a different person. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_7","010_10_7","1SA","10","7","7","When these signs have come, do as the occasion demands, for God is with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_8","010_10_8","1SA","10","8","8","And you shall go before me to Gilgal, and surely I will come to you to offer burnt offerings and to sacrifice peace offerings. Wait seven days until I come to you and show you what you are to do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_9","010_10_9","1SA","10","9","9","As Saul turned to leave Samuel, God changed Saul’s heart, and all the signs came to pass that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_10","010_10_10","1SA","10","10","10","When Saul and his servant arrived at Gibeah, a group of prophets met him. Then the Spirit of God rushed upon him, and he prophesied along with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_11","010_10_11","1SA","10","11","11","When all those who had formerly known Saul saw him prophesying with the prophets, they asked one another, “What has happened to the son of Kish? Is Saul also among the prophets?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_12","010_10_12","1SA","10","12","12","Then a man who lived there replied, “And who is their father?” So the saying became a proverb: “Is Saul also among the prophets?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_13","010_10_13","1SA","10","13","13","And when Saul had finished prophesying, he went up to the high place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_14","010_10_14","1SA","10","14","14","Now Saul’s uncle asked him and his servant, “Where did you go?” “To look for the donkeys,” Saul replied. “When we saw they were not to be found, we went to Samuel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_15","010_10_15","1SA","10","15","15","“Tell me,” Saul’s uncle asked, “what did Samuel say to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_16","010_10_16","1SA","10","16","16","And Saul replied, “He assured us that the donkeys had been found.” But Saul did not tell his uncle what Samuel had said about the kingship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_17","010_10_17","1SA","10","17","17","After this, Samuel summoned the people to the LORD at Mizpah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_18","010_10_18","1SA","10","18","18","and said to the Israelites, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I brought Israel up out of Egypt, and I rescued you from the hands of the Egyptians and of all the kingdoms that oppressed you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_19","010_10_19","1SA","10","19","19","But today you have rejected your God, who saves you from all your troubles and afflictions, and you have said to Him, ‘No, set a king over us.’ Now therefore present yourselves before the LORD by your tribes and clans.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_20","010_10_20","1SA","10","20","20","Thus Samuel had all the tribes of Israel come forward, and the tribe of Benjamin was selected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_21","010_10_21","1SA","10","21","21","Then he had the tribe of Benjamin come forward by its clans, and the clan of Matri was selected. Finally, Saul son of Kish was selected. But when they looked for him, they could not find him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_22","010_10_22","1SA","10","22","22","So again they inquired of the LORD, “Has the man come here yet?” And the LORD replied, “Behold, he has hidden himself among the baggage.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_23","010_10_23","1SA","10","23","23","So they ran and brought Saul, and when he stood among the people, he was a head taller than any of the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_24","010_10_24","1SA","10","24","24","Samuel said to all the people, “Do you see the one the LORD has chosen? There is no one like him among all the people.” And all the people shouted, “Long live the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_25","010_10_25","1SA","10","25","25","Then Samuel explained to the people the rights of kingship. He wrote them on a scroll and laid it up before the LORD. And Samuel sent all the people away, each to his own home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_26","010_10_26","1SA","10","26","26","Saul also went to his home in Gibeah, and the men of valor whose hearts God had touched went with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S110_27","010_10_27","1SA","10","27","27","But some worthless men said, “How can this man save us?” So they despised him and brought him no gifts; but Saul remained silent about it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_1","010_11_1","1SA","11","1","1","Then Nahash the Ammonite came up and laid siege to Jabesh-gilead. All the men of Jabesh said to him, “Make a treaty with us, and we will serve you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_2","010_11_2","1SA","11","2","2","But Nahash the Ammonite replied, “I will make a treaty with you on one condition, that I may put out everyone’s right eye and bring reproach upon all Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_3","010_11_3","1SA","11","3","3","“Hold off for seven days,” replied the elders of Jabesh, “and let us send messengers throughout Israel. If there is no one to save us, we will surrender to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_4","010_11_4","1SA","11","4","4","When the messengers came to Gibeah of Saul and relayed these words in the hearing of the people, they all wept aloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_5","010_11_5","1SA","11","5","5","Just then Saul was returning from the field, behind his oxen. “What troubles the people?” asked Saul. “Why are they weeping?” And they relayed to him the words of the men from Jabesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_6","010_11_6","1SA","11","6","6","When Saul heard their words, the Spirit of God rushed upon him, and he burned with great anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_7","010_11_7","1SA","11","7","7","He took a pair of oxen, cut them into pieces, and sent them by messengers throughout the land of Israel, proclaiming, “This is what will be done to the oxen of anyone who does not march behind Saul and Samuel.” Then the terror of the LORD fell upon the people, and they came out together as one man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_8","010_11_8","1SA","11","8","8","And when Saul numbered them at Bezek, there were 300,000 Israelites and 30,000 men of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_9","010_11_9","1SA","11","9","9","So they said to the messengers who had come, “Tell the men of Jabesh-gilead: ‘Deliverance will be yours tomorrow by the time the sun is hot.’” And when the messengers relayed this to the men of Jabesh, they rejoiced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_10","010_11_10","1SA","11","10","10","Then the men of Jabesh said to Nahash, “Tomorrow we will come out, and you can do with us whatever seems good to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_11","010_11_11","1SA","11","11","11","The next day Saul organized the troops into three divisions, and during the morning watch they invaded the camp of the Ammonites and slaughtered them, until the hottest part of the day. And the survivors were so scattered that no two of them were left together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_12","010_11_12","1SA","11","12","12","Then the people said to Samuel, “Who said that Saul should not reign over us? Bring those men here so we can kill them!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_13","010_11_13","1SA","11","13","13","But Saul ordered, “No one shall be put to death this day, for today the LORD has worked salvation in Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_14","010_11_14","1SA","11","14","14","Then Samuel said to the people, “Come, let us go to Gilgal and renew the kingship there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S111_15","010_11_15","1SA","11","15","15","So all the people went to Gilgal and confirmed Saul as king in the presence of the LORD. There they sacrificed peace offerings before the LORD, and Saul and all the Israelites rejoiced greatly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_1","010_12_1","1SA","12","1","1","Then Samuel said to all Israel, “I have listened to your voice in all that you have said to me, and I have set over you a king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_2","010_12_2","1SA","12","2","2","Now here is the king walking before you, and I am old and gray, and my sons are here with you. I have walked before you from my youth until this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_3","010_12_3","1SA","12","3","3","Here I am. Bear witness against me before the LORD and before His anointed: Whose ox or donkey have I taken? Whom have I cheated or oppressed? From whose hand have I accepted a bribe and closed my eyes? Tell me, and I will restore it to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_4","010_12_4","1SA","12","4","4","“You have not cheated us or oppressed us,” they replied, “nor have you taken anything from the hand of man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_5","010_12_5","1SA","12","5","5","Samuel said to them, “The LORD is a witness against you, and His anointed is a witness today, that you have not found anything in my hand.” “He is a witness,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_6","010_12_6","1SA","12","6","6","Then Samuel said to the people, “The LORD is the One who appointed Moses and Aaron, and who brought your fathers up out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_7","010_12_7","1SA","12","7","7","Now present yourselves, so that I may confront you before the LORD with all the righteous acts He has done for you and your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_8","010_12_8","1SA","12","8","8","When Jacob went to Egypt, your fathers cried out to the LORD, and He sent them Moses and Aaron, who brought your fathers out of Egypt and settled them in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_9","010_12_9","1SA","12","9","9","But they forgot the LORD their God, and He sold them into the hand of Sisera the commander of the army of Hazor, and into the hands of the Philistines and the king of Moab, who fought against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_10","010_12_10","1SA","12","10","10","Then they cried out to the LORD and said, ‘We have sinned, for we have forsaken the LORD and served the Baals and Ashtoreths. Now deliver us from the hands of our enemies, that we may serve You.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_11","010_12_11","1SA","12","11","11","So the LORD sent Jerubbaal, Barak, Jephthah, and Samuel, and He delivered you from the hands of your enemies on every side, and you dwelt securely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_12","010_12_12","1SA","12","12","12","But when you saw that Nahash king of the Ammonites was moving against you, you said to me, ‘No, we must have a king to rule over us’—even though the LORD your God was your king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_13","010_12_13","1SA","12","13","13","Now here is the king you have chosen, the one you requested. Behold, the LORD has placed a king over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_14","010_12_14","1SA","12","14","14","If you fear the LORD and serve Him and obey His voice, and if you do not rebel against the command of the LORD, and if both you and the king who rules over you follow the LORD your God, then all will be well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_15","010_12_15","1SA","12","15","15","But if you disobey the LORD and rebel against His command, then the hand of the LORD will be against you as it was against your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_16","010_12_16","1SA","12","16","16","Now, therefore, present yourselves and see this great thing that the LORD will do before your eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_17","010_12_17","1SA","12","17","17","Is it not the wheat harvest today? I will call on the LORD to send thunder and rain, so that you will know and see what a great evil you have committed in the sight of the LORD by asking for a king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_18","010_12_18","1SA","12","18","18","So Samuel called to the LORD, and on that day the LORD sent thunder and rain. As a result, all the people greatly feared the LORD and Samuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_19","010_12_19","1SA","12","19","19","They pleaded with Samuel, “Pray to the LORD your God for your servants so that we will not die! For we have added to all our sins the evil of asking for a king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_20","010_12_20","1SA","12","20","20","“Do not be afraid,” Samuel replied. “Even though you have committed all this evil, do not turn aside from following the LORD, but serve the LORD with all your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_21","010_12_21","1SA","12","21","21","Do not turn aside after worthless things that cannot profit you or deliver you, for they are empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_22","010_12_22","1SA","12","22","22","Indeed, for the sake of His great name, the LORD will not abandon His people, because He was pleased to make you His own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_23","010_12_23","1SA","12","23","23","As for me, far be it from me that I should sin against the LORD by ceasing to pray for you. And I will continue to teach you the good and right way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_24","010_12_24","1SA","12","24","24","Above all, fear the LORD and serve Him faithfully with all your heart; consider what great things He has done for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S112_25","010_12_25","1SA","12","25","25","But if you persist in doing evil, both you and your king will be swept away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_1","010_13_1","1SA","13","1","1","Saul was thirty years old when he became king, and he reigned over Israel forty-two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_2","010_13_2","1SA","13","2","2","He chose for himself three thousand men of Israel: Two thousand were with Saul at Michmash and in the hill country of Bethel, and a thousand were with Jonathan in Gibeah of Benjamin. And the rest of the troops he sent away, each to his own home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_3","010_13_3","1SA","13","3","3","Then Jonathan attacked the Philistine outpost at Geba, and the Philistines heard about it. So Saul blew the ram’s horn throughout the land, saying, “Let the Hebrews hear!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_4","010_13_4","1SA","13","4","4","And all Israel heard the news: “Saul has attacked an outpost of the Philistines, and now Israel has become a stench to the Philistines!” Then the people were summoned to join Saul at Gilgal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_5","010_13_5","1SA","13","5","5","Now the Philistines assembled to fight against Israel with three thousand chariots, six thousand horsemen, and troops as numerous as the sand on the seashore. They went up and camped at Michmash, east of Beth-aven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_6","010_13_6","1SA","13","6","6","Seeing that they were in danger because their troops were hard-pressed, the men of Israel hid in caves and thickets, among the rocks, and in cellars and cisterns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_7","010_13_7","1SA","13","7","7","Some Hebrews even crossed the Jordan into the land of Gad and Gilead. Saul, however, remained at Gilgal, and all his troops were quaking in fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_8","010_13_8","1SA","13","8","8","And Saul waited seven days for the time appointed by Samuel, but Samuel did not come to Gilgal, and the troops began to desert Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_9","010_13_9","1SA","13","9","9","So he said, “Bring me the burnt offering and the peace offerings.” And he offered up the burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_10","010_13_10","1SA","13","10","10","Just as he finished offering the burnt offering, Samuel arrived, and Saul went out to greet him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_11","010_13_11","1SA","13","11","11","“What have you done?” Samuel asked. And Saul replied, “When I saw that the troops were deserting me, and that you did not come at the appointed time and the Philistines were gathering at Michmash, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_12","010_13_12","1SA","13","12","12","I thought, ‘Now the Philistines will descend upon me at Gilgal, and I have not sought the favor of the LORD.’ So I felt compelled to offer the burnt offering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_13","010_13_13","1SA","13","13","13","“You have acted foolishly,” Samuel declared. “You have not kept the command that the LORD your God gave you; if you had, the LORD would have established your kingdom over Israel for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_14","010_13_14","1SA","13","14","14","But now your kingdom will not endure; the LORD has sought a man after His own heart and appointed him ruler over His people, because you have not kept the command of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_15","010_13_15","1SA","13","15","15","Then Samuel set out from Gilgal and went up to Gibeah in Benjamin. And Saul numbered the troops who were with him, about six hundred men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_16","010_13_16","1SA","13","16","16","Now Saul and Jonathan his son and the troops with them were staying in Geba of Benjamin, while the Philistines camped at Michmash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_17","010_13_17","1SA","13","17","17","And raiders went out of the Philistine camp in three divisions. One headed toward Ophrah in the land of Shual, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_18","010_13_18","1SA","13","18","18","another toward Beth-horon, and the third down the border road overlooking the Valley of Zeboim facing the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_19","010_13_19","1SA","13","19","19","And no blacksmith could be found in all the land of Israel, because the Philistines had said, “The Hebrews must not be allowed to make swords or spears.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_20","010_13_20","1SA","13","20","20","Instead, all the Israelites would go down to the Philistines to sharpen their plowshares, mattocks, axes, and sickles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_21","010_13_21","1SA","13","21","21","The charge was a pim for sharpening a plowshare or mattock, a third of a shekel for sharpening a pitchfork or an axe, and a third of a shekel for repointing an oxgoad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_22","010_13_22","1SA","13","22","22","So on the day of battle not a sword or spear could be found in the hands of the troops with Saul and Jonathan; only Saul and his son Jonathan had weapons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S113_23","010_13_23","1SA","13","23","23","And a garrison of the Philistines had gone out to the pass at Michmash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_1","010_14_1","1SA","14","1","1","One day Jonathan son of Saul said to the young man bearing his armor, “Come, let us cross over to the Philistine outpost on the other side.” But Jonathan did not tell his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_2","010_14_2","1SA","14","2","2","Meanwhile, Saul was staying under the pomegranate tree in Migron on the outskirts of Gibeah. And the troops who were with him numbered about six hundred men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_3","010_14_3","1SA","14","3","3","including Ahijah, who was wearing an ephod. He was the son of Ichabod’s brother Ahitub son of Phinehas, the son of Eli the priest of the LORD in Shiloh. But the troops did not know that Jonathan had left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_4","010_14_4","1SA","14","4","4","Now there were cliffs on both sides of the pass that Jonathan intended to cross to reach the Philistine outpost. One was named Bozez and the other Seneh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_5","010_14_5","1SA","14","5","5","One cliff stood to the north toward Michmash, and the other to the south toward Geba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_6","010_14_6","1SA","14","6","6","Jonathan said to the young man bearing his armor, “Come, let us cross over to the outpost of these uncircumcised men. Perhaps the LORD will work on our behalf. Nothing can hinder the LORD from saving, whether by many or by few.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_7","010_14_7","1SA","14","7","7","His armor-bearer replied, “Do all that is in your heart. Go ahead; I am with you heart and soul.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_8","010_14_8","1SA","14","8","8","“Very well,” said Jonathan, “we will cross over toward these men and show ourselves to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_9","010_14_9","1SA","14","9","9","If they say, ‘Wait until we come to you,’ then we will stay where we are and will not go up to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_10","010_14_10","1SA","14","10","10","But if they say, ‘Come on up,’ then we will go up, because this will be our sign that the LORD has delivered them into our hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_11","010_14_11","1SA","14","11","11","So the two of them showed themselves to the outpost of the Philistines, who exclaimed, “Look, the Hebrews are coming out of the holes in which they were hiding!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_12","010_14_12","1SA","14","12","12","So the men of the outpost called out to Jonathan and his armor-bearer, “Come on up, and we will teach you a lesson!” “Follow me,” Jonathan told his armor-bearer, “for the LORD has delivered them into the hand of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_13","010_14_13","1SA","14","13","13","So Jonathan climbed up on his hands and feet, with his armor-bearer behind him. And the Philistines fell before Jonathan, and his armor-bearer followed and finished them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_14","010_14_14","1SA","14","14","14","In that first assault, Jonathan and his armor-bearer struck down about twenty men in about half an acre of land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_15","010_14_15","1SA","14","15","15","Then panic struck the Philistines in the camp, in the field, and among all the people. Even those in the outposts and raiding parties trembled. Indeed, the earth quaked, and panic spread from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_16","010_14_16","1SA","14","16","16","Now when Saul’s watchmen at Gibeah in Benjamin looked and saw the troops melting away and scattering in every direction, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_17","010_14_17","1SA","14","17","17","Saul said to the troops who were with him, “Call the roll and see who has left us.” And when they had called the roll, they saw that Jonathan and his armor-bearer were not there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_18","010_14_18","1SA","14","18","18","Then Saul said to Ahijah, “Bring the ark of God.” (For at that time it was with the Israelites.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_19","010_14_19","1SA","14","19","19","While Saul was talking to the priest, the commotion in the Philistine camp continued to increase. So Saul said to the priest, “Withdraw your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_20","010_14_20","1SA","14","20","20","Then Saul and all his troops assembled and marched to the battle, and they found the Philistines in total confusion, with each man wielding the sword against his neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_21","010_14_21","1SA","14","21","21","And the Hebrews who had previously gone up into the surrounding camps to join the Philistines now went over to the Israelites who were with Saul and Jonathan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_22","010_14_22","1SA","14","22","22","When all the Israelites who had been hiding in the hill country of Ephraim heard that the Philistines were fleeing, they also joined the battle in close pursuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_23","010_14_23","1SA","14","23","23","So the LORD saved Israel that day, and the battle moved on beyond Beth-aven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_24","010_14_24","1SA","14","24","24","Now the men of Israel were in distress that day, for Saul had placed the troops under an oath, saying, “Cursed is the man who eats any food before evening, before I have taken vengeance on my enemies.” So none of the troops tasted any food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_25","010_14_25","1SA","14","25","25","Then all the troops entered the forest, and there was honey on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_26","010_14_26","1SA","14","26","26","And when they entered the forest and saw the flowing honey, not one of them put his hand to his mouth, because they feared the oath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_27","010_14_27","1SA","14","27","27","Jonathan, however, had not heard that his father had bound the people with the oath. So he reached out the end of the staff in his hand, dipped it into the honeycomb, and put his hand to his mouth, and his eyes brightened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_28","010_14_28","1SA","14","28","28","Then one of the soldiers told him, “Your father bound the troops with a solemn oath, saying, ‘Cursed is the man who eats food today.’ That is why the people are faint.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_29","010_14_29","1SA","14","29","29","“My father has brought trouble to the land,” Jonathan replied. “Just look at how my eyes have brightened because I tasted a little of this honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_30","010_14_30","1SA","14","30","30","How much better it would have been if the troops had eaten freely today from the plunder they took from their enemies! Would not the slaughter of the Philistines have been much greater?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_31","010_14_31","1SA","14","31","31","That day, after the Israelites had struck down the Philistines from Michmash to Aijalon, the people were very faint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_32","010_14_32","1SA","14","32","32","So they rushed greedily to the plunder, taking sheep, cattle, and calves. They slaughtered them on the ground and ate meat with the blood still in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_33","010_14_33","1SA","14","33","33","Then someone reported to Saul: “Look, the troops are sinning against the LORD by eating meat with the blood still in it.” “You have broken faith,” said Saul. “Roll a large stone over here at once.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_34","010_14_34","1SA","14","34","34","Then he said, “Go among the troops and tell them, ‘Each man must bring me his ox or his sheep, slaughter them in this place, and then eat. Do not sin against the LORD by eating meat with the blood still in it.’” So that night everyone brought his ox and slaughtered it there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_35","010_14_35","1SA","14","35","35","Then Saul built an altar to the LORD; it was the first time he had built an altar to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_36","010_14_36","1SA","14","36","36","And Saul said, “Let us go down after the Philistines by night and plunder them until dawn, leaving no man alive!” “Do what seems good to you,” the troops replied. But the priest said, “We must consult God here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_37","010_14_37","1SA","14","37","37","So Saul inquired of God, “Shall I go down after the Philistines? Will You give them into the hand of Israel?” But God did not answer him that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_38","010_14_38","1SA","14","38","38","Therefore Saul said, “Come here, all you leaders of the troops, and let us investigate how this sin has occurred today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_39","010_14_39","1SA","14","39","39","As surely as the LORD who saves Israel lives, even if it is my son Jonathan, he must die!” But not one of the troops said a word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_40","010_14_40","1SA","14","40","40","Then Saul said to all Israel, “You stand on one side, and I and my son Jonathan will stand on the other side.” “Do what seems good to you,” the troops replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_41","010_14_41","1SA","14","41","41","So Saul said to the LORD, the God of Israel, “Why have You not answered Your servant this day? If the fault is with me or my son Jonathan, respond with Urim, but if the fault is with the men of Israel, respond with Thummim.” And Jonathan and Saul were selected, but the people were cleared of the charge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_42","010_14_42","1SA","14","42","42","Then Saul said, “Cast the lot between me and my son Jonathan.” And Jonathan was selected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_43","010_14_43","1SA","14","43","43","“Tell me what you have done,” Saul commanded him. So Jonathan told him, “I only tasted a little honey with the end of the staff that was in my hand. And now I must die?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_44","010_14_44","1SA","14","44","44","And Saul declared, “May God punish me, and ever so severely, if you, Jonathan, do not surely die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_45","010_14_45","1SA","14","45","45","But the people said to Saul, “Must Jonathan die—he who accomplished such a great deliverance for Israel? Never! As surely as the LORD lives, not a hair of his head will fall to the ground, for with God’s help he has accomplished this today.” So the people rescued Jonathan, and he did not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_46","010_14_46","1SA","14","46","46","Then Saul gave up his pursuit of the Philistines, and the Philistines returned to their own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_47","010_14_47","1SA","14","47","47","After Saul had assumed the kingship over Israel, he fought against all his enemies on every side—the Moabites, the Ammonites, the Edomites, the kings of Zobah, and the Philistines. Wherever he turned, he routed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_48","010_14_48","1SA","14","48","48","He fought valiantly and defeated the Amalekites, delivering Israel from the hands of its plunderers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_49","010_14_49","1SA","14","49","49","Now the sons of Saul were Jonathan, Ishvi, and Malchishua. His two daughters were named Merab (his firstborn) and Michal (his younger daughter). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_50","010_14_50","1SA","14","50","50","His wife’s name was Ahinoam daughter of Ahimaaz. The name of the commander of his army was Abner, the son of Saul’s uncle Ner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_51","010_14_51","1SA","14","51","51","Saul’s father Kish and Abner’s father Ner were sons of Abiel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S114_52","010_14_52","1SA","14","52","52","And the war with the Philistines was fierce for all the days of Saul. So whenever he noticed any strong or brave man, Saul would enlist him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_1","010_15_1","1SA","15","1","1","Then Samuel said to Saul, “The LORD sent me to anoint you king over His people Israel. Now therefore, listen to the words of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_2","010_15_2","1SA","15","2","2","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘I witnessed what the Amalekites did to the Israelites when they opposed them on their way up from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_3","010_15_3","1SA","15","3","3","Now go and attack the Amalekites and devote to destruction all that belongs to them. Do not spare them, but put to death men and women, children and infants, oxen and sheep, camels and donkeys.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_4","010_15_4","1SA","15","4","4","So Saul summoned the troops and numbered them at Telaim—200,000 foot soldiers and 10,000 men of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_5","010_15_5","1SA","15","5","5","Saul came to the city of Amalek and lay in wait in the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_6","010_15_6","1SA","15","6","6","And he warned the Kenites, “Since you showed kindness to all the Israelites when they came up out of Egypt, go on and get away from the Amalekites. Otherwise I will sweep you away with them.” So the Kenites moved away from the Amalekites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_7","010_15_7","1SA","15","7","7","Then Saul struck down the Amalekites all the way from Havilah to Shur, which is east of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_8","010_15_8","1SA","15","8","8","He captured Agag king of Amalek alive, but devoted all the others to destruction with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_9","010_15_9","1SA","15","9","9","Saul and his troops spared Agag, along with the best of the sheep and cattle, the fat calves and lambs, and the best of everything else. They were unwilling to devote them to destruction, but they devoted to destruction all that was despised and worthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_10","010_15_10","1SA","15","10","10","Then the word of the LORD came to Samuel, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_11","010_15_11","1SA","15","11","11","“I regret that I have made Saul king, for he has turned away from following Me and has not carried out My instructions.” And Samuel was distressed and cried out to the LORD all that night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_12","010_15_12","1SA","15","12","12","Early in the morning Samuel got up to confront Saul, but he was told, “Saul has gone to Carmel, and behold, he has set up a monument for himself and has turned and gone down to Gilgal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_13","010_15_13","1SA","15","13","13","When Samuel reached him, Saul said to him, “May the LORD bless you. I have carried out the LORD’s instructions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_14","010_15_14","1SA","15","14","14","But Samuel replied, “Then what is this bleating of sheep and lowing of cattle that I hear?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_15","010_15_15","1SA","15","15","15","Saul answered, “The troops brought them from the Amalekites; they spared the best sheep and cattle to sacrifice to the LORD your God, but the rest we devoted to destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_16","010_15_16","1SA","15","16","16","“Stop!” exclaimed Samuel. “Let me tell you what the LORD said to me last night.” “Tell me,” Saul replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_17","010_15_17","1SA","15","17","17","And Samuel said, “Although you were once small in your own eyes, have you not become the head of the tribes of Israel? The LORD anointed you king over Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_18","010_15_18","1SA","15","18","18","and sent you on a mission, saying, ‘Go and devote to destruction the sinful Amalekites. Fight against them until you have wiped them out.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_19","010_15_19","1SA","15","19","19","So why did you not obey the LORD? Why did you rush upon the plunder and do evil in the sight of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_20","010_15_20","1SA","15","20","20","“But I did obey the LORD,” Saul replied. “I went on the mission that the LORD gave me. I brought back Agag king of Amalek and devoted the Amalekites to destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_21","010_15_21","1SA","15","21","21","The troops took sheep and cattle from the plunder, the best of the things devoted to destruction, in order to sacrifice them to the LORD your God at Gilgal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_22","010_15_22","1SA","15","22","22","But Samuel declared: “Does the LORD delight in burnt offerings and sacrifices as much as in obedience to His voice? Behold, obedience is better than sacrifice, and attentiveness is better than the fat of rams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_23","010_15_23","1SA","15","23","23","For rebellion is like the sin of divination, and arrogance is like the wickedness of idolatry. Because you have rejected the word of the LORD, He has rejected you as king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_24","010_15_24","1SA","15","24","24","Then Saul said to Samuel, “I have sinned; I have transgressed the LORD’s commandment and your instructions, because I feared the people and obeyed their voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_25","010_15_25","1SA","15","25","25","Now therefore, please forgive my sin and return with me so I can worship the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_26","010_15_26","1SA","15","26","26","“I will not return with you,” Samuel replied. “For you have rejected the word of the LORD, and He has rejected you as king over Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_27","010_15_27","1SA","15","27","27","As Samuel turned to go, Saul grabbed the hem of his robe, and it tore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_28","010_15_28","1SA","15","28","28","So Samuel said to him, “The LORD has torn the kingdom of Israel from you today and has given it to your neighbor who is better than you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_29","010_15_29","1SA","15","29","29","Moreover, the Glory of Israel does not lie or change His mind, for He is not a man, that He should change His mind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_30","010_15_30","1SA","15","30","30","“I have sinned,” Saul replied. “Please honor me now before the elders of my people and before Israel. Come back with me, so that I may worship the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_31","010_15_31","1SA","15","31","31","So Samuel went back with Saul, and Saul worshiped the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_32","010_15_32","1SA","15","32","32","Then Samuel said, “Bring me Agag king of the Amalekites.” Agag came to him cheerfully, for he thought, “Surely the bitterness of death is past.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_33","010_15_33","1SA","15","33","33","But Samuel declared: “As your sword has made women childless, so your mother will be childless among women.” And Samuel hacked Agag to pieces before the LORD at Gilgal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_34","010_15_34","1SA","15","34","34","Then Samuel went to Ramah, but Saul went up to his home in Gibeah of Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S115_35","010_15_35","1SA","15","35","35","And to the day of his death, Samuel never again visited Saul. Samuel mourned for Saul, and the LORD regretted that He had made Saul king over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_1","010_16_1","1SA","16","1","1","Now the LORD said to Samuel, “How long are you going to mourn for Saul, since I have rejected him as king over Israel? Fill your horn with oil and go. I am sending you to Jesse of Bethlehem, for I have selected from his sons a king for Myself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_2","010_16_2","1SA","16","2","2","“How can I go?” Samuel asked. “Saul will hear of it and kill me!” The LORD answered, “Take a heifer with you and say, ‘I have come to sacrifice to the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_3","010_16_3","1SA","16","3","3","Then invite Jesse to the sacrifice, and I will show you what you are to do. You are to anoint for Me the one I indicate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_4","010_16_4","1SA","16","4","4","So Samuel did what the LORD had said and went to Bethlehem. When the elders of the town met him, they trembled and asked, “Do you come in peace?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_5","010_16_5","1SA","16","5","5","“In peace,” he replied. “I have come to sacrifice to the LORD. Consecrate yourselves and come with me to the sacrifice.” Then he consecrated Jesse and his sons and invited them to the sacrifice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_6","010_16_6","1SA","16","6","6","When they arrived, Samuel saw Eliab and said, “Surely here before the LORD is His anointed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_7","010_16_7","1SA","16","7","7","But the LORD said to Samuel, “Do not consider his appearance or height, for I have rejected him; the LORD does not see as man does. For man sees the outward appearance, but the LORD sees the heart.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_8","010_16_8","1SA","16","8","8","Then Jesse called Abinadab and presented him to Samuel, who said, “The LORD has not chosen this one either.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_9","010_16_9","1SA","16","9","9","Next Jesse presented Shammah, but Samuel said, “The LORD has not chosen this one either.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_10","010_16_10","1SA","16","10","10","Thus Jesse made seven of his sons pass before Samuel, but Samuel told him, “The LORD has not chosen any of these.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_11","010_16_11","1SA","16","11","11","And Samuel asked him, “Are these all the sons you have?” “There is still the youngest,” Jesse replied, “but he is tending the sheep.” “Send for him,” Samuel replied. “For we will not sit down to eat until he arrives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_12","010_16_12","1SA","16","12","12","So Jesse sent for his youngest son and brought him in. He was ruddy, with beautiful eyes and a handsome appearance. And the LORD said, “Rise and anoint him, for he is the one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_13","010_16_13","1SA","16","13","13","So Samuel took the horn of oil and anointed him in the presence of his brothers, and the Spirit of the LORD rushed upon David from that day forward. Then Samuel set out and went to Ramah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_14","010_16_14","1SA","16","14","14","Now the Spirit of the LORD departed from Saul, and a spirit of distress from the LORD began to torment him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_15","010_16_15","1SA","16","15","15","Saul’s servants said to him, “Surely a spirit of distress from God is tormenting you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_16","010_16_16","1SA","16","16","16","Let our lord command your servants here to seek out someone who can skillfully play the harp. Whenever the spirit of distress from God is upon you, he is to play it, and you will be well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_17","010_16_17","1SA","16","17","17","And Saul commanded his servants, “Find me someone who plays well, and bring him to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_18","010_16_18","1SA","16","18","18","One of the servants answered, “I have seen a son of Jesse of Bethlehem who knows how to play the harp. He is a mighty man of valor, a warrior, eloquent and handsome, and the LORD is with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_19","010_16_19","1SA","16","19","19","So Saul sent messengers to Jesse and said, “Send me your son David, who is with the sheep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_20","010_16_20","1SA","16","20","20","And Jesse took a donkey loaded with bread, a skin of wine, and one young goat and sent them to Saul with his son David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_21","010_16_21","1SA","16","21","21","When David came to Saul and entered his service, Saul loved him very much, and David became his armor-bearer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_22","010_16_22","1SA","16","22","22","Then Saul sent word to Jesse, saying, “Let David remain in my service, for I am pleased with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S116_23","010_16_23","1SA","16","23","23","And whenever the spirit from God came upon Saul, David would pick up his harp and play. Then Saul would find relief and feel better, and the spirit of distress would depart from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_1","010_17_1","1SA","17","1","1","Now the Philistines gathered their forces for war at Socoh in Judah, and they camped between Socoh and Azekah in Ephes-dammim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_2","010_17_2","1SA","17","2","2","Saul and the men of Israel assembled and camped in the Valley of Elah, arraying themselves for battle against the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_3","010_17_3","1SA","17","3","3","The Philistines stood on one hill and the Israelites stood on another, with the valley between them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_4","010_17_4","1SA","17","4","4","Then a champion named Goliath, who was from Gath, came out from the Philistine camp. He was six cubits and a span in height, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_5","010_17_5","1SA","17","5","5","and he had a bronze helmet on his head. He wore a bronze coat of mail weighing five thousand shekels, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_6","010_17_6","1SA","17","6","6","and he had armor of bronze on his legs and a javelin of bronze slung between his shoulders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_7","010_17_7","1SA","17","7","7","The shaft of his spear was like a weaver’s beam, and its iron point weighed six hundred shekels. In addition, his shield bearer went before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_8","010_17_8","1SA","17","8","8","And Goliath stood and shouted to the ranks of Israel, “Why do you come out and array yourselves for battle? Am I not a Philistine, and are you not servants of Saul? Choose one of your men and have him come down against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_9","010_17_9","1SA","17","9","9","If he is able to fight me and kill me, then we will be your servants. But if I prevail against him and kill him, then you shall be our servants and work for us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_10","010_17_10","1SA","17","10","10","Then the Philistine said, “I defy the ranks of Israel this day! Give me a man to fight!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_11","010_17_11","1SA","17","11","11","On hearing the words of the Philistine, Saul and all the Israelites were dismayed and greatly afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_12","010_17_12","1SA","17","12","12","Now David was the son of a man named Jesse, an Ephrathite from Bethlehem of Judah who had eight sons. And in the days of Saul, Jesse was old and well along in years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_13","010_17_13","1SA","17","13","13","The three older sons of Jesse had followed Saul into battle: The firstborn was Eliab, the second was Abinadab, and the third was Shammah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_14","010_17_14","1SA","17","14","14","And David was the youngest. The three oldest had followed Saul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_15","010_17_15","1SA","17","15","15","but David went back and forth from Saul to tend his father’s sheep in Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_16","010_17_16","1SA","17","16","16","For forty days the Philistine came forward every morning and evening to take his stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_17","010_17_17","1SA","17","17","17","One day Jesse said to his son David, “Take this ephah of roasted grain and these ten loaves of bread for your brothers and hurry to their camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_18","010_17_18","1SA","17","18","18","Take also these ten portions of cheese to the commander of their unit. Check on the welfare of your brothers and bring back an assurance from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_19","010_17_19","1SA","17","19","19","They are with Saul and all the men of Israel in the Valley of Elah, fighting against the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_20","010_17_20","1SA","17","20","20","So David got up early in the morning, left the flock with a keeper, loaded up, and set out as Jesse had instructed him. He reached the camp as the army was marching out to its position and shouting the battle cry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_21","010_17_21","1SA","17","21","21","And Israel and the Philistines arrayed in formation against each other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_22","010_17_22","1SA","17","22","22","Then David left his supplies in the care of the quartermaster and ran to the battle line. When he arrived, he asked his brothers how they were doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_23","010_17_23","1SA","17","23","23","And as he was speaking with them, suddenly the champion named Goliath, the Philistine from Gath, came forward from the ranks of the Philistines and shouted his usual words, which David also heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_24","010_17_24","1SA","17","24","24","When all the men of Israel saw Goliath, they fled from him in great fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_25","010_17_25","1SA","17","25","25","Now the men of Israel had been saying, “Do you see how this man keeps coming out to defy Israel? To the man who kills him the king will give great riches. And he will give him his daughter in marriage and exempt his father’s house from taxation in Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_26","010_17_26","1SA","17","26","26","David asked the men who were standing with him, “What will be done for the man who kills this Philistine and removes this disgrace from Israel? Just who is this uncircumcised Philistine, that he should defy the armies of the living God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_27","010_17_27","1SA","17","27","27","The people told him about the offer, saying, “That is what will be done for the man who kills him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_28","010_17_28","1SA","17","28","28","Now when David’s oldest brother Eliab heard him speaking to the men, his anger burned against David. “Why have you come down here?” he asked. “And with whom did you leave those few sheep in the wilderness? I know your pride and wickedness of heart—you have come down to see the battle!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_29","010_17_29","1SA","17","29","29","“What have I done now?” said David. “Was it not just a question?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_30","010_17_30","1SA","17","30","30","Then he turned from him toward another and asked about the offer, and those people answered him just as the first ones had answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_31","010_17_31","1SA","17","31","31","Now David’s words were overheard and reported to Saul, who sent for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_32","010_17_32","1SA","17","32","32","And David said to Saul, “Let no man’s heart fail on account of this Philistine. Your servant will go and fight him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_33","010_17_33","1SA","17","33","33","But Saul replied, “You cannot go out against this Philistine to fight him. You are just a boy, and he has been a warrior from his youth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_34","010_17_34","1SA","17","34","34","David replied, “Your servant has been tending his father’s sheep, and whenever a lion or a bear came and carried off a lamb from the flock, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_35","010_17_35","1SA","17","35","35","I went after it, struck it down, and delivered the lamb from its mouth. If it reared up against me, I would grab it by its fur, strike it down, and kill it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_36","010_17_36","1SA","17","36","36","Your servant has killed lions and bears; this uncircumcised Philistine will be like one of them, for he has defied the armies of the living God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_37","010_17_37","1SA","17","37","37","David added, “The LORD, who delivered me from the claws of the lion and the bear, will deliver me from the hand of this Philistine.” “Go,” said Saul, “and may the LORD be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_38","010_17_38","1SA","17","38","38","Then Saul clothed David in his own tunic, put a bronze helmet on his head, and dressed him in armor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_39","010_17_39","1SA","17","39","39","David strapped his sword over the tunic and tried to walk, but he was not accustomed to them. “I cannot walk in these,” David said to Saul. “I am not accustomed to them.” So David took them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_40","010_17_40","1SA","17","40","40","And David took his staff in his hand, selected five smooth stones from the brook, and put them in the pouch of his shepherd’s bag. And with his sling in hand, he approached the Philistine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_41","010_17_41","1SA","17","41","41","Now the Philistine came closer and closer to David, with his shield-bearer before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_42","010_17_42","1SA","17","42","42","When the Philistine looked and saw David, he despised him because he was just a boy, ruddy and handsome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_43","010_17_43","1SA","17","43","43","“Am I a dog,” he said to David, “that you come at me with sticks?” And the Philistine cursed David by his gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_44","010_17_44","1SA","17","44","44","“Come here,” he called to David, “and I will give your flesh to the birds of the air and the beasts of the field!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_45","010_17_45","1SA","17","45","45","But David said to the Philistine, “You come against me with sword and spear and javelin, but I come against you in the name of the LORD of Hosts, the God of the armies of Israel, whom you have defied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_46","010_17_46","1SA","17","46","46","This day the LORD will deliver you into my hand. This day I will strike you down, cut off your head, and give the carcasses of the Philistine army to the birds of the air and the creatures of the earth. Then the whole world will know that there is a God in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_47","010_17_47","1SA","17","47","47","And all those assembled here will know that it is not by sword or spear that the LORD saves; for the battle is the LORD’s, and He will give all of you into our hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_48","010_17_48","1SA","17","48","48","As the Philistine started forward to attack him, David ran quickly toward the battle line to meet him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_49","010_17_49","1SA","17","49","49","Then David reached into his bag, took out a stone, and slung it, striking the Philistine on the forehead. The stone sank into his forehead, and he fell facedown on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_50","010_17_50","1SA","17","50","50","Thus David prevailed over the Philistine with a sling and a stone; without a sword in his hand he struck down the Philistine and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_51","010_17_51","1SA","17","51","51","David ran and stood over him. He grabbed the Philistine’s sword and pulled it from its sheath and killed him, and he cut off his head with the sword. When the Philistines saw that their hero was dead, they turned and ran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_52","010_17_52","1SA","17","52","52","Then the men of Israel and Judah charged forward with a shout and pursued the Philistines to the entrance of Gath and to the gates of Ekron. And the bodies of the Philistines were strewn along the Shaaraim road to Gath and Ekron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_53","010_17_53","1SA","17","53","53","When the Israelites returned from their pursuit of the Philistines, they plundered their camps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_54","010_17_54","1SA","17","54","54","David took the head of the Philistine and brought it to Jerusalem, and he put Goliath’s weapons in his own tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_55","010_17_55","1SA","17","55","55","As Saul had watched David going out to confront the Philistine, he said to Abner the commander of the army, “Abner, whose son is this young man?” “As surely as you live, O king,” Abner replied, “I do not know.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_56","010_17_56","1SA","17","56","56","“Find out whose son this young man is!” said the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_57","010_17_57","1SA","17","57","57","So when David returned from killing the Philistine, still holding his head in his hand, Abner took him and brought him before Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S117_58","010_17_58","1SA","17","58","58","“Whose son are you, young man?” asked Saul. “I am the son of your servant Jesse of Bethlehem,” David replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_1","010_18_1","1SA","18","1","1","After David had finished speaking with Saul, the souls of Jonathan and David were knit together, and Jonathan loved him as himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_2","010_18_2","1SA","18","2","2","And from that day Saul kept David with him and did not let him return to his father’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_3","010_18_3","1SA","18","3","3","Then Jonathan made a covenant with David because he loved him as himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_4","010_18_4","1SA","18","4","4","And Jonathan removed the robe he was wearing and gave it to David, along with his tunic, his sword, his bow, and his belt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_5","010_18_5","1SA","18","5","5","So David marched out and prospered in everything Saul sent him to do, and Saul set him over the men of war. And this was pleasing in the sight of all the people, and of Saul’s officers as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_6","010_18_6","1SA","18","6","6","As the troops were returning home after David had killed the Philistine, the women came out of all the cities of Israel to meet King Saul with singing and dancing, with joyful songs, and with tambourines and other instruments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_7","010_18_7","1SA","18","7","7","And as the women danced, they sang out: “Saul has slain his thousands, and David his tens of thousands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_8","010_18_8","1SA","18","8","8","And Saul was furious and resented this song. “They have ascribed tens of thousands to David,” he said, “but only thousands to me. What more can he have but the kingdom?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_9","010_18_9","1SA","18","9","9","And from that day forward Saul kept a jealous eye on David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_10","010_18_10","1SA","18","10","10","The next day a spirit of distress sent from God came upon Saul, and he prophesied inside the house while David played the harp as usual. Now Saul was holding a spear, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_11","010_18_11","1SA","18","11","11","and he hurled it, thinking, “I will pin David to the wall.” But David eluded him twice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_12","010_18_12","1SA","18","12","12","So Saul was afraid of David, because the LORD was with David but had departed from Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_13","010_18_13","1SA","18","13","13","Therefore Saul sent David away and gave him command of a thousand men. David led the troops out to battle and back, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_14","010_18_14","1SA","18","14","14","and he continued to prosper in all his ways, because the LORD was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_15","010_18_15","1SA","18","15","15","When Saul saw that David was very successful, he was afraid of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_16","010_18_16","1SA","18","16","16","But all Israel and Judah loved David, because he was leading them out to battle and back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_17","010_18_17","1SA","18","17","17","Then Saul said to David, “Here is my older daughter Merab. I will give her to you in marriage. Only be valiant for me and fight the LORD’s battles.” But Saul was thinking, “I need not raise my hand against him; let the hand of the Philistines be against him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_18","010_18_18","1SA","18","18","18","And David said to Saul, “Who am I, and what is my family or my father’s clan in Israel, that I should become the son-in-law of the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_19","010_18_19","1SA","18","19","19","So when it was time to give Saul’s daughter Merab to David, she was given in marriage to Adriel of Meholah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_20","010_18_20","1SA","18","20","20","Now Saul’s daughter Michal loved David, and when this was reported to Saul, it pleased him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_21","010_18_21","1SA","18","21","21","“I will give her to David,” Saul thought, “so that she may be a snare to him, and the hand of the Philistines may be against him.” So Saul said to David, “For a second time now you can be my son-in-law.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_22","010_18_22","1SA","18","22","22","Then Saul ordered his servants, “Speak to David privately and tell him, ‘Behold, the king is pleased with you, and all his servants love you. Now therefore, become his son-in-law.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_23","010_18_23","1SA","18","23","23","But when Saul’s servants relayed these words to David, he replied, “Does it seem trivial in your sight to be the son-in-law of the king? I am a poor man and lightly esteemed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_24","010_18_24","1SA","18","24","24","And the servants told Saul what David had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_25","010_18_25","1SA","18","25","25","Saul replied, “Say to David, ‘The king desires no other dowry but a hundred Philistine foreskins as revenge on his enemies.’” But Saul intended to cause David’s death at the hands of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_26","010_18_26","1SA","18","26","26","When the servants reported these terms to David, he was pleased to become the king’s son-in-law. Before the wedding day arrived, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_27","010_18_27","1SA","18","27","27","David and his men went out and killed two hundred Philistines. He brought their foreskins and presented them as payment in full to become the king’s son-in-law. Then Saul gave his daughter Michal to David in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_28","010_18_28","1SA","18","28","28","When Saul realized that the LORD was with David and that his daughter Michal loved David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_29","010_18_29","1SA","18","29","29","he grew even more afraid of David. So from then on Saul was David’s enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S118_30","010_18_30","1SA","18","30","30","Every time the Philistine commanders came out for battle, David was more successful than all of Saul’s officers, so that his name was highly esteemed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_1","010_19_1","1SA","19","1","1","Then Saul ordered his son Jonathan and all his servants to kill David. But Jonathan delighted greatly in David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_2","010_19_2","1SA","19","2","2","so he warned David, saying, “My father Saul intends to kill you. Be on your guard in the morning; find a secret place and hide there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_3","010_19_3","1SA","19","3","3","I will go out and stand beside my father in the field where you are, so I can ask about you. And if I find out anything, I will tell you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_4","010_19_4","1SA","19","4","4","Then Jonathan spoke well of David to his father Saul and said to him, “The king should not sin against his servant David; he has not sinned against you. In fact, his actions have been highly beneficial to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_5","010_19_5","1SA","19","5","5","He took his life in his hands when he struck down the Philistine, and the LORD worked a great salvation for all Israel. You saw it and rejoiced, so why would you sin against innocent blood by killing David for no reason?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_6","010_19_6","1SA","19","6","6","Saul listened to the voice of Jonathan and swore an oath: “As surely as the LORD lives, David will not be put to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_7","010_19_7","1SA","19","7","7","So Jonathan summoned David and told him all these things. Then Jonathan brought David to Saul, and David was with Saul as before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_8","010_19_8","1SA","19","8","8","When war broke out again, David went out and fought the Philistines and struck them with such a mighty blow that they fled before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_9","010_19_9","1SA","19","9","9","But as Saul was sitting in his house with his spear in his hand, a spirit of distress from the LORD came upon him. While David was playing the harp, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_10","010_19_10","1SA","19","10","10","Saul tried to pin him to the wall with his spear. But David eluded him and the spear struck the wall. And David fled and escaped that night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_11","010_19_11","1SA","19","11","11","Then Saul sent messengers to David’s house to watch him and kill him in the morning. But David’s wife Michal warned him, “If you do not run for your life tonight, tomorrow you will be dead!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_12","010_19_12","1SA","19","12","12","So Michal lowered David from the window, and he ran away and escaped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_13","010_19_13","1SA","19","13","13","Then Michal took a household idol and laid it in the bed, placed some goat hair on its head, and covered it with a garment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_14","010_19_14","1SA","19","14","14","When Saul sent the messengers to seize David, Michal said, “He is ill.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_15","010_19_15","1SA","19","15","15","But Saul sent the messengers back to see David and told them, “Bring him up to me in his bed so I can kill him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_16","010_19_16","1SA","19","16","16","And when the messengers entered, there was the idol in the bed with the goat hair on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_17","010_19_17","1SA","19","17","17","And Saul said to Michal, “Why did you deceive me like this? You sent my enemy away, and he has escaped!” Michal replied, “He said to me, ‘Help me get away, or I will kill you!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_18","010_19_18","1SA","19","18","18","So David ran away and escaped. And he went to Samuel at Ramah and told him all that Saul had done to him. Then he and Samuel went to Naioth and stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_19","010_19_19","1SA","19","19","19","When Saul was told that David was at Naioth in Ramah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_20","010_19_20","1SA","19","20","20","he sent messengers to seize him. But when they saw the group of prophets prophesying, with Samuel leading them, the Spirit of God came upon them, and Saul’s messengers also began to prophesy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_21","010_19_21","1SA","19","21","21","When this was reported to Saul, he sent more messengers, but they began to prophesy as well. So Saul tried again and sent messengers a third time, and even they began to prophesy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_22","010_19_22","1SA","19","22","22","Finally, Saul himself left for Ramah and came to the large cistern at Secu, where he asked, “Where are Samuel and David?” “At Naioth in Ramah,” he was told. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_23","010_19_23","1SA","19","23","23","So Saul went to Naioth in Ramah. But the Spirit of God came upon even Saul, and he walked along prophesying until he came to Naioth in Ramah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S119_24","010_19_24","1SA","19","24","24","Then Saul stripped off his robes and also prophesied before Samuel. And he collapsed and lay naked all that day and night. That is why it is said, “Is Saul also among the prophets?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_1","010_20_1","1SA","20","1","1","Then David fled from Naioth in Ramah. He came to Jonathan and asked, “What have I done? What is my iniquity? How have I sinned against your father, that he wants to take my life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_2","010_20_2","1SA","20","2","2","“Far from it!” Jonathan replied. “You will not die. Indeed, my father does nothing, great or small, without telling me. So why would he hide this matter from me? This cannot be true!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_3","010_20_3","1SA","20","3","3","But David again vowed, “Your father knows very well that I have found favor in your eyes, and he has said, ‘Jonathan must not know of this, or he will be grieved.’ As surely as the LORD lives and as you yourself live, there is but a step between me and death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_4","010_20_4","1SA","20","4","4","Then Jonathan said to David, “Whatever you desire, I will do for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_5","010_20_5","1SA","20","5","5","So David told him, “Look, tomorrow is the New Moon, and I am supposed to dine with the king. Instead, let me go and hide in the field until the third evening from now. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_6","010_20_6","1SA","20","6","6","If your father misses me at all, tell him, ‘David urgently requested my permission to hurry to Bethlehem, his hometown, because there is an annual sacrifice for his whole clan.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_7","010_20_7","1SA","20","7","7","If he says, ‘Good,’ then your servant is safe, but if he is enraged, you will know he has evil intentions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_8","010_20_8","1SA","20","8","8","Therefore show kindness to your servant, for you have brought me into a covenant with you before the LORD. If there is iniquity in me, then kill me yourself; why should you bring me to your father?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_9","010_20_9","1SA","20","9","9","“Never!” Jonathan replied. “If I ever found out that my father had evil intentions against you, would I not tell you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_10","010_20_10","1SA","20","10","10","Then David asked Jonathan, “Who will tell me if your father answers you harshly?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_11","010_20_11","1SA","20","11","11","“Come,” he replied, “let us go out to the field.” So the two of them went out into the field, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_12","010_20_12","1SA","20","12","12","and Jonathan said, “By the LORD, the God of Israel, I will sound out my father by this time tomorrow or the next day. If he is favorable toward you, will I not send for you and tell you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_13","010_20_13","1SA","20","13","13","But if my father intends to bring evil on you, then may the LORD punish me, and ever so severely, if I do not tell you and send you on your way in safety. May the LORD be with you, just as He has been with my father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_14","010_20_14","1SA","20","14","14","And as long as I live, treat me with the LORD’s loving devotion, that I may not die, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_15","010_20_15","1SA","20","15","15","and do not ever cut off your loving devotion from my household—not even when the LORD cuts off every one of David’s enemies from the face of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_16","010_20_16","1SA","20","16","16","So Jonathan made a covenant with the house of David, saying, “May the LORD hold David’s enemies accountable.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_17","010_20_17","1SA","20","17","17","And Jonathan had David reaffirm his vow out of love for him, for Jonathan loved David as he loved himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_18","010_20_18","1SA","20","18","18","Then Jonathan said to David, “Tomorrow is the New Moon, and you will be missed, because your seat will be empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_19","010_20_19","1SA","20","19","19","When you have stayed three days, hurry down to the place you hid on the day this trouble began, and remain beside the stone Ezel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_20","010_20_20","1SA","20","20","20","I will shoot three arrows to the side of it, as if I were aiming at a target. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_21","010_20_21","1SA","20","21","21","Then I will send a boy and say, ‘Go, find the arrows!’ Now, if I expressly say to him, ‘Look, the arrows are on this side of you; bring them,’ then come, because as surely as the LORD lives, it is safe for you, and there is no danger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_22","010_20_22","1SA","20","22","22","But if I say to the young man, ‘Look, the arrows are beyond you,’ then you must go, for the LORD has sent you away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_23","010_20_23","1SA","20","23","23","And as for the matter you and I have discussed, the LORD is a witness between you and me forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_24","010_20_24","1SA","20","24","24","So David hid in the field, and when the New Moon had come, the king sat down to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_25","010_20_25","1SA","20","25","25","He sat in his usual place by the wall, opposite Jonathan and beside Abner, but David’s place was empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_26","010_20_26","1SA","20","26","26","Saul said nothing that day because he thought, “Something has happened to David to make him ceremonially unclean—surely he is unclean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_27","010_20_27","1SA","20","27","27","But on the day after the New Moon, the second day, David’s place was still empty, and Saul asked his son Jonathan, “Why hasn’t the son of Jesse come to the meal either yesterday or today?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_28","010_20_28","1SA","20","28","28","Jonathan answered, “David urgently requested my permission to go to Bethlehem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_29","010_20_29","1SA","20","29","29","saying, ‘Please let me go, because our clan is holding a sacrifice in the city, and my brother has told me to be there. So now, if I have found favor in your eyes, please let me go and see my brothers.’ That is why he has not come to the king’s table.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_30","010_20_30","1SA","20","30","30","Then Saul’s anger burned against Jonathan, and he said to him, “You son of a perverse and rebellious woman! Do I not know that you have chosen the son of Jesse to your own shame and to the shame of the mother who bore you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_31","010_20_31","1SA","20","31","31","For as long as the son of Jesse lives on this earth, neither you nor your kingdom shall be established. Now send for him and bring him to me, for he must surely die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_32","010_20_32","1SA","20","32","32","“Why must he be put to death?” Jonathan replied. “What has he done?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_33","010_20_33","1SA","20","33","33","Then Saul hurled his spear at Jonathan to kill him. So Jonathan knew that his father was determined to kill David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_34","010_20_34","1SA","20","34","34","Jonathan got up from the table in fierce anger and did not eat any food that second day of the month, for he was grieved by his father’s shameful treatment of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_35","010_20_35","1SA","20","35","35","In the morning Jonathan went out to the field for the appointment with David, and a small boy was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_36","010_20_36","1SA","20","36","36","He said to the boy, “Run and find the arrows I shoot.” And as the boy ran, Jonathan shot an arrow beyond him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_37","010_20_37","1SA","20","37","37","When the boy reached the place where Jonathan’s arrow had fallen, Jonathan called to him, “Isn’t the arrow beyond you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_38","010_20_38","1SA","20","38","38","Then Jonathan cried out, “Hurry! Make haste! Do not delay!” So the boy picked up the arrow and returned to his master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_39","010_20_39","1SA","20","39","39","But the boy did not know anything; only Jonathan and David knew the arrangement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_40","010_20_40","1SA","20","40","40","Then Jonathan gave his equipment to the boy and said, “Go, take it back to the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_41","010_20_41","1SA","20","41","41","When the young man had gone, David got up from the south side of the stone, fell facedown, and bowed three times. Then he and Jonathan kissed each other and wept together—though David wept more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S120_42","010_20_42","1SA","20","42","42","And Jonathan said to David, “Go in peace, for the two of us have sworn in the name of the LORD, saying, ‘May the LORD be a witness between you and me, and between your descendants and mine forever.’” Then David got up and departed, and Jonathan went back into the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_1","010_21_1","1SA","21","1","1","Then David came to Nob, to Ahimelech the priest. And when Ahimelech met David, he trembled and asked him, “Why are you alone? Why is no one with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_2","010_21_2","1SA","21","2","2","“The king has given me a mission,” David replied. “He told me no one is to know about the mission on which I am sending you. And I have directed my young men to meet me at a certain place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_3","010_21_3","1SA","21","3","3","Now then, what do you have on hand? Give me five loaves of bread, or whatever can be found.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_4","010_21_4","1SA","21","4","4","“There is no common bread on hand,” the priest replied, “but there is some consecrated bread—provided that the young men have kept themselves from women.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_5","010_21_5","1SA","21","5","5","David answered, “Women have indeed been kept from us, as is usual when I set out. And the bodies of the young men are holy even on common missions. How much more so today!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_6","010_21_6","1SA","21","6","6","So the priest gave him the consecrated bread, since there was no bread there but the Bread of the Presence, which had been removed from before the LORD and replaced with hot bread on the day it was taken away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_7","010_21_7","1SA","21","7","7","Now one of Saul’s servants was there that day, detained before the LORD. And his name was Doeg the Edomite, the chief shepherd for Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_8","010_21_8","1SA","21","8","8","Then David asked Ahimelech, “Is there not a spear or sword on hand here? For I have brought neither my sword nor my weapons with me, because the king’s mission was urgent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_9","010_21_9","1SA","21","9","9","The priest replied, “The sword of Goliath the Philistine, whom you killed in the Valley of Elah, is here; it is wrapped in a cloth behind the ephod. If you want, you may take it. For there is no other but this one here.” And David said, “There is none like it; give it to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_10","010_21_10","1SA","21","10","10","That day David fled from Saul and went to Achish king of Gath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_11","010_21_11","1SA","21","11","11","But the servants of Achish said to him, “Is this not David, the king of the land? Did they not sing about him in their dances, saying: ‘Saul has slain his thousands, and David his tens of thousands’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_12","010_21_12","1SA","21","12","12","Now David took these words to heart and was very much afraid of Achish the king of Gath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_13","010_21_13","1SA","21","13","13","So he changed his behavior before them and feigned madness in their hands; he scratched on the doors of the gate and let his saliva run down his beard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_14","010_21_14","1SA","21","14","14","Then Achish said to his servants, “Look, you can see that the man is insane! Why have you brought him to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S121_15","010_21_15","1SA","21","15","15","Am I in need of madmen, that you have brought this man to rave in my presence? Must this man come into my house?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_1","010_22_1","1SA","22","1","1","So David left Gath and took refuge in the cave of Adullam. When his brothers and the rest of his father’s household heard about it, they went down to him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_2","010_22_2","1SA","22","2","2","And all who were distressed or indebted or discontented rallied around him, and he became their leader. About four hundred men were with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_3","010_22_3","1SA","22","3","3","From there David went to Mizpeh of Moab, where he said to the king of Moab, “Please let my father and mother stay with you until I learn what God will do for me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_4","010_22_4","1SA","22","4","4","So he left them in the care of the king of Moab, and they stayed with him the whole time David was in the stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_5","010_22_5","1SA","22","5","5","Then the prophet Gad said to David, “Do not stay in the stronghold. Depart and go into the land of Judah.” So David left and went to the forest of Hereth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_6","010_22_6","1SA","22","6","6","Soon Saul learned that David and his men had been discovered. At that time Saul was sitting under the tamarisk tree on the hill at Gibeah, with his spear in hand and all his servants standing around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_7","010_22_7","1SA","22","7","7","Then Saul said to his servants, “Listen, men of Benjamin! Is the son of Jesse giving all of you fields and vineyards and making you commanders of thousands or hundreds? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_8","010_22_8","1SA","22","8","8","Is that why all of you have conspired against me? Not one of you told me that my own son had made a covenant with the son of Jesse. Not one of you has shown concern for me or revealed to me that my son has stirred up my own servant to lie in wait against me, as is the case today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_9","010_22_9","1SA","22","9","9","But Doeg the Edomite, who had stationed himself with Saul’s servants, answered: “I saw the son of Jesse come to Ahimelech son of Ahitub at Nob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_10","010_22_10","1SA","22","10","10","Ahimelech inquired of the LORD for him and gave him provisions. He also gave him the sword of Goliath the Philistine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_11","010_22_11","1SA","22","11","11","Then the king sent messengers to summon Ahimelech the priest, the son of Ahitub, and his father’s whole family, who were priests at Nob. And all of them came to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_12","010_22_12","1SA","22","12","12","“Listen now, son of Ahitub,” said Saul. “Here I am, my lord,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_13","010_22_13","1SA","22","13","13","And Saul asked him, “Why have you and the son of Jesse conspired against me? You gave him bread and a sword and inquired of God for him so that he could rise up against me to lie in wait, as he is doing today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_14","010_22_14","1SA","22","14","14","Ahimelech answered the king, “Who among all your servants is as faithful as David, the king’s son-in-law, the captain of your bodyguard and honored in your house? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_15","010_22_15","1SA","22","15","15","Was that day the first time I inquired of God for him? Far be it from me! Let not the king accuse your servant or any of my father’s household, for your servant knew nothing of this whole affair—not in part or in whole.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_16","010_22_16","1SA","22","16","16","But the king replied, “You will surely die, Ahimelech, you and all your father’s house!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_17","010_22_17","1SA","22","17","17","Then the king ordered the guards at his side, “Turn and kill the priests of the LORD, because they too sided with David. For they knew he was fleeing, but they did not tell me.” But the king’s servants would not lift a hand to strike the priests of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_18","010_22_18","1SA","22","18","18","So the king ordered Doeg, “You turn and strike down the priests!” And Doeg the Edomite turned and struck down the priests himself. On that day he killed eighty-five men who wore the linen ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_19","010_22_19","1SA","22","19","19","He also put to the sword Nob, the city of the priests, with its men and women, children and infants, oxen, donkeys, and sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_20","010_22_20","1SA","22","20","20","But one of the sons of Ahimelech son of Ahitub escaped. His name was Abiathar, and he fled to David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_21","010_22_21","1SA","22","21","21","And Abiathar told David that Saul had killed the priests of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_22","010_22_22","1SA","22","22","22","Then David said to Abiathar, “I knew that Doeg the Edomite was there that day, and that he was sure to tell Saul. I myself am responsible for the lives of everyone in your father’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S122_23","010_22_23","1SA","22","23","23","Stay with me; do not be afraid, for he who seeks your life is seeking mine as well. You will be safe with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_1","010_23_1","1SA","23","1","1","Now it was reported to David, “Look, the Philistines are fighting against Keilah and looting the threshing floors.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_2","010_23_2","1SA","23","2","2","So David inquired of the LORD, “Should I go and attack these Philistines?” And the LORD said to David, “Go and attack the Philistines and save Keilah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_3","010_23_3","1SA","23","3","3","But David’s men said to him, “Look, we are afraid here in Judah; how much more if we go to Keilah against the armies of the Philistines?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_4","010_23_4","1SA","23","4","4","Once again, David inquired of the LORD, and the LORD answered him: “Go at once to Keilah, for I will deliver the Philistines into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_5","010_23_5","1SA","23","5","5","Then David and his men went to Keilah, fought against the Philistines, and carried off their livestock, striking them with a mighty blow. So David saved the people of Keilah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_6","010_23_6","1SA","23","6","6","(Now Abiathar son of Ahimelech had brought the ephod with him when he fled to David at Keilah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_7","010_23_7","1SA","23","7","7","When Saul was told that David had gone to Keilah, he said, “God has delivered him into my hand, for he has trapped himself by entering a town with gates and bars.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_8","010_23_8","1SA","23","8","8","Then Saul summoned all his troops to go to war at Keilah and besiege David and his men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_9","010_23_9","1SA","23","9","9","When David learned that Saul was plotting evil against him, he said to Abiathar the priest, “Bring the ephod.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_10","010_23_10","1SA","23","10","10","And David said, “O LORD, God of Israel, Your servant has heard that Saul intends to come to Keilah and destroy the city on my account. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_11","010_23_11","1SA","23","11","11","Will the citizens of Keilah surrender me into his hand? Will Saul come down, as Your servant has heard? O LORD, God of Israel, please tell Your servant.” “He will,” said the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_12","010_23_12","1SA","23","12","12","So David asked, “Will the citizens of Keilah surrender me and my men into the hand of Saul?” “They will,” said the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_13","010_23_13","1SA","23","13","13","Then David and his men, about six hundred strong, set out and departed from Keilah, moving from place to place. When Saul was told that David had escaped from Keilah, he declined to go forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_14","010_23_14","1SA","23","14","14","And David stayed in the wilderness strongholds and in the hill country of the Wilderness of Ziph. Day after day Saul searched for him, but God would not deliver David into his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_15","010_23_15","1SA","23","15","15","While David was in Horesh in the Wilderness of Ziph, he saw that Saul had come out to take his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_16","010_23_16","1SA","23","16","16","And Saul’s son Jonathan came to David in Horesh and strengthened his hand in God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_17","010_23_17","1SA","23","17","17","saying, “Do not be afraid, for my father Saul will never lay a hand on you. And you will be king over Israel, and I will be your second-in-command. Even my father Saul knows this is true.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_18","010_23_18","1SA","23","18","18","So the two of them made a covenant before the LORD. And David remained in Horesh, while Jonathan went home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_19","010_23_19","1SA","23","19","19","Then the Ziphites came up to Saul at Gibeah and said, “Is not David hiding among us in the strongholds at Horesh, on the hill of Hachilah south of Jeshimon? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_20","010_23_20","1SA","23","20","20","Now, O king, come down whenever your soul desires, and we will be responsible for delivering him into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_21","010_23_21","1SA","23","21","21","“May you be blessed by the LORD,” replied Saul, “for you have had compassion on me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_22","010_23_22","1SA","23","22","22","Please go and prepare further. Investigate and watch carefully where he goes and who has seen him there, for I am told that he is extremely cunning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_23","010_23_23","1SA","23","23","23","Observe and find out all the places where he hides. Then come back to me with certainty, and I will go with you. If he is in the land, I will search him out among all the clans of Judah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_24","010_23_24","1SA","23","24","24","So they set out and went to Ziph ahead of Saul. Now David and his men were in the Wilderness of Maon in the Arabah south of Jeshimon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_25","010_23_25","1SA","23","25","25","and Saul and his men went to seek him. When David was told about it, he went down to the rock and stayed in the Wilderness of Maon. And when Saul heard of this, he pursued David there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_26","010_23_26","1SA","23","26","26","Saul was proceeding along one side of the mountain, and David and his men along the other side. Even though David was hurrying to get away, Saul and his men were closing in on David and his men to capture them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_27","010_23_27","1SA","23","27","27","Then a messenger came to Saul, saying, “Come quickly, for the Philistines have raided the land!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_28","010_23_28","1SA","23","28","28","So Saul broke off his pursuit of David and went to meet the Philistines. That is why that place is called Sela-hammahlekoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S123_29","010_23_29","1SA","23","29","29","And David went up from there and lived in the strongholds of En-gedi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_1","010_24_1","1SA","24","1","1","After Saul had returned from pursuing the Philistines, he was told, “David is in the wilderness of En-gedi.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_2","010_24_2","1SA","24","2","2","So Saul took three thousand chosen men from all Israel and went to look for David and his men in the region of the Rocks of the Wild Goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_3","010_24_3","1SA","24","3","3","Soon Saul came to the sheepfolds along the road, where there was a cave, and he went in to relieve himself. And David and his men were hiding in the recesses of the cave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_4","010_24_4","1SA","24","4","4","So David’s men said to him, “This is the day about which the LORD said to you, ‘Behold, I will deliver your enemy into your hand, that you may do with him as you wish.’” Then David crept up and stealthily cut off a corner of Saul’s robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_5","010_24_5","1SA","24","5","5","Afterward, David’s conscience was stricken because he had cut off the corner of Saul’s robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_6","010_24_6","1SA","24","6","6","So he said to his men, “The LORD forbid that I should do such a thing to my master, the LORD’s anointed. May I never lift my hand against him, since he is the LORD’s anointed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_7","010_24_7","1SA","24","7","7","With these words David restrained his men, and he did not let them rise up against Saul. Then Saul left the cave and went on his way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_8","010_24_8","1SA","24","8","8","After that, David got up, went out of the cave, and called out to Saul, “My lord the king!” When Saul looked behind him, David bowed facedown in reverence ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_9","010_24_9","1SA","24","9","9","and said to Saul, “Why do you listen to the words of men who say, ‘Look, David intends to harm you’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_10","010_24_10","1SA","24","10","10","Behold, this day you have seen with your own eyes that the LORD delivered you into my hand in the cave. I was told to kill you, but I spared you and said, ‘I will not lift my hand against my lord, since he is the LORD’s anointed.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_11","010_24_11","1SA","24","11","11","See, my father, look at the corner of your robe in my hand. For I cut it off, but I did not kill you. Know and see that there is no evil or rebellion in my hands. I have not sinned against you, even though you are hunting me down to take my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_12","010_24_12","1SA","24","12","12","May the LORD judge between you and me, and may the LORD take vengeance on you, but my hand will never be against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_13","010_24_13","1SA","24","13","13","As the old proverb says, ‘Wickedness proceeds from the wicked.’ But my hand will never be against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_14","010_24_14","1SA","24","14","14","Against whom has the king of Israel come out? Whom are you pursuing? A dead dog? A flea? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_15","010_24_15","1SA","24","15","15","May the LORD be our judge and decide between you and me. May He take notice and plead my case and deliver me from your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_16","010_24_16","1SA","24","16","16","When David had finished saying these things, Saul called back, “Is that your voice, David my son?” Then Saul wept aloud ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_17","010_24_17","1SA","24","17","17","and said to David, “You are more righteous than I, for you have rewarded me with good, though I have rewarded you with evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_18","010_24_18","1SA","24","18","18","And you have declared this day how you have treated me well, for when the LORD delivered me into your hand, you did not kill me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_19","010_24_19","1SA","24","19","19","When a man finds his enemy, does he let him go away unharmed? May the LORD reward you with good for what you have done for me this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_20","010_24_20","1SA","24","20","20","Now I know for sure that you will be king and that the kingdom of Israel will be established in your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_21","010_24_21","1SA","24","21","21","So now, swear to me by the LORD that you will not cut off my descendants or wipe out my name from my father’s house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S124_22","010_24_22","1SA","24","22","22","So David gave his oath to Saul. Then Saul returned home, but David and his men went up to the stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_1","010_25_1","1SA","25","1","1","When Samuel died, all Israel gathered to mourn for him; and they buried him at his home in Ramah. Then David set out and went down to the Wilderness of Paran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_2","010_25_2","1SA","25","2","2","Now there was a man in Maon whose business was in Carmel. He was a very wealthy man with a thousand goats and three thousand sheep, which he was shearing in Carmel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_3","010_25_3","1SA","25","3","3","His name was Nabal, and his wife’s name was Abigail. She was an intelligent and beautiful woman, but her husband, a Calebite, was harsh and evil in his dealings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_4","010_25_4","1SA","25","4","4","While David was in the wilderness, he heard that Nabal was shearing sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_5","010_25_5","1SA","25","5","5","So David sent ten young men and instructed them, “Go up to Nabal at Carmel. Greet him in my name ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_6","010_25_6","1SA","25","6","6","and say to him, ‘Long life to you, and peace to you and to your house and to all that belongs to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_7","010_25_7","1SA","25","7","7","Now I hear that it is time for shearing. When your shepherds were with us, we did not harass them, and nothing of theirs was missing the whole time they were in Carmel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_8","010_25_8","1SA","25","8","8","Ask your young men, and they will tell you. So let my young men find favor with you, for we have come on the day of a feast. Please give whatever you can spare to your servants and to your son David.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_9","010_25_9","1SA","25","9","9","When David’s young men arrived, they relayed all these words to Nabal on behalf of David. Then they waited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_10","010_25_10","1SA","25","10","10","But Nabal asked them, “Who is David? Who is this son of Jesse? Many servants these days are breaking away from their masters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_11","010_25_11","1SA","25","11","11","Why should I take my bread and water and the meat I have slaughtered for my shearers, and give them to these men whose origin I do not know?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_12","010_25_12","1SA","25","12","12","So David’s men turned around and went back, and they relayed to him all these words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_13","010_25_13","1SA","25","13","13","And David said to his men, “Strap on your swords!” So David and all his men strapped on their swords, and about four hundred men followed David, while two hundred stayed with the supplies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_14","010_25_14","1SA","25","14","14","Meanwhile, one of Nabal’s young men informed Nabal’s wife Abigail, “Look, David sent messengers from the wilderness to greet our master, but he screamed at them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_15","010_25_15","1SA","25","15","15","Yet these men were very good to us. When we were in the field, we were not harassed, and nothing of ours went missing the whole time we lived among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_16","010_25_16","1SA","25","16","16","They were a wall around us, both day and night, the whole time we were herding our sheep near them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_17","010_25_17","1SA","25","17","17","Now consider carefully what you must do, because disaster looms over our master and all his household. For he is such a scoundrel that nobody can speak to him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_18","010_25_18","1SA","25","18","18","Then Abigail hurried and took two hundred loaves of bread, two skins of wine, five butchered sheep, five seahs of roasted grain, a hundred clusters of raisins, and two hundred cakes of figs. She loaded them on donkeys ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_19","010_25_19","1SA","25","19","19","and said to her young men, “Go ahead of me. I will be right behind you.” But she did not tell her husband Nabal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_20","010_25_20","1SA","25","20","20","As Abigail came riding her donkey into a mountain ravine, she saw David and his men coming down toward her, and she met them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_21","010_25_21","1SA","25","21","21","Now David had just said, “In vain I have protected all that belonged to this man in the wilderness. Nothing that belongs to him has gone missing, yet he has paid me back evil for good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_22","010_25_22","1SA","25","22","22","May God punish David, and ever so severely, if I let one male belonging to Nabal survive until morning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_23","010_25_23","1SA","25","23","23","When Abigail saw David, she quickly got off the donkey, fell facedown, and bowed before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_24","010_25_24","1SA","25","24","24","She fell at his feet and said, “My lord, may the blame be on me alone, but please let your servant speak to you; hear the words of your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_25","010_25_25","1SA","25","25","25","My lord should pay no attention to this scoundrel Nabal, for he lives up to his name: His name means Fool, and folly accompanies him. I, your servant, did not see my lord’s young men whom you sent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_26","010_25_26","1SA","25","26","26","Now, my lord, as surely as the LORD lives and you yourself live, since the LORD has held you back from bloodshed and from avenging yourself with your own hand, may your enemies and those who seek harm for my lord be like Nabal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_27","010_25_27","1SA","25","27","27","Now let this gift your servant has brought to my lord be given to the young men who follow you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_28","010_25_28","1SA","25","28","28","Please forgive your servant’s offense, for the LORD will surely make a lasting dynasty for my lord, because he fights the LORD’s battles. May no evil be found in you as long as you live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_29","010_25_29","1SA","25","29","29","And should someone pursue you and seek your life, then the life of my lord will be bound securely by the LORD your God in the bundle of the living. But He shall fling away the lives of your enemies like stones from a sling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_30","010_25_30","1SA","25","30","30","When the LORD has done for my lord all the good He promised, and when He has appointed you ruler over Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_31","010_25_31","1SA","25","31","31","then my lord will have no remorse or guilt of conscience over needless bloodshed and revenge. And when the LORD has dealt well with my lord, may you remember your servant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_32","010_25_32","1SA","25","32","32","Then David said to Abigail, “Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, who sent you to meet me this day! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_33","010_25_33","1SA","25","33","33","Blessed is your discernment, and blessed are you, because today you kept me from bloodshed and from avenging myself by my own hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_34","010_25_34","1SA","25","34","34","Otherwise, as surely as the LORD, the God of Israel, lives, who has restrained me from harming you, if you had not come quickly to meet me, then surely no male belonging to Nabal would have been left alive by morning light.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_35","010_25_35","1SA","25","35","35","Then David accepted from her hand what she had brought him, and he said to her, “Go home in peace. See, I have heeded your voice and granted your request.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_36","010_25_36","1SA","25","36","36","When Abigail returned to Nabal, there he was in the house, holding a feast fit for a king, in high spirits and very drunk. So she told him nothing until morning light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_37","010_25_37","1SA","25","37","37","In the morning when Nabal was sober, his wife told him about these events, and his heart failed within him, and he became like a stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_38","010_25_38","1SA","25","38","38","About ten days later, the LORD struck Nabal dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_39","010_25_39","1SA","25","39","39","On hearing that Nabal was dead, David said, “Blessed be the LORD, who has upheld my cause against the reproach of Nabal and has restrained His servant from evil. For the LORD has brought the wickedness of Nabal down upon his own head.” Then David sent word to Abigail, asking her to become his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_40","010_25_40","1SA","25","40","40","When his servants came to Abigail at Carmel, they said, “David has sent us to take you as his wife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_41","010_25_41","1SA","25","41","41","She arose, bowed facedown, and said, “Here is your servant, ready to serve and to wash the feet of my lord’s servants.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_42","010_25_42","1SA","25","42","42","So Abigail hurried and got on a donkey, and attended by five of her maidens, she followed David’s messengers and became his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_43","010_25_43","1SA","25","43","43","David had also married Ahinoam of Jezreel. So she and Abigail were both his wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S125_44","010_25_44","1SA","25","44","44","But Saul had given his daughter Michal, David’s wife, to Palti son of Laish, who was from Gallim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_1","010_26_1","1SA","26","1","1","Then the Ziphites came to Saul at Gibeah and said, “Is not David hiding on the hill of Hachilah, opposite Jeshimon?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_2","010_26_2","1SA","26","2","2","So Saul, accompanied by three thousand chosen men of Israel, went down to the Wilderness of Ziph to search for David there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_3","010_26_3","1SA","26","3","3","Saul camped beside the road at the hill of Hachilah opposite Jeshimon, but David was living in the wilderness. When he realized that Saul had followed him there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_4","010_26_4","1SA","26","4","4","David sent out spies to verify that Saul had arrived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_5","010_26_5","1SA","26","5","5","Then David set out and went to the place where Saul had camped. He saw the place where Saul and Abner son of Ner, the general of his army, had lain down. Saul was lying inside the inner circle of the camp, with the troops camped around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_6","010_26_6","1SA","26","6","6","And David asked Ahimelech the Hittite and Abishai son of Zeruiah, Joab’s brother, “Who will go down with me to Saul in the camp?” “I will go with you,” answered Abishai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_7","010_26_7","1SA","26","7","7","That night David and Abishai came to the troops, and Saul was lying there asleep in the inner circle of the camp, with his spear stuck in the ground by his head. And Abner and the troops were lying around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_8","010_26_8","1SA","26","8","8","Abishai said to David, “Today God has delivered your enemy into your hand. Now, therefore, please let me thrust the spear through him into the ground with one stroke. I will not need to strike him twice!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_9","010_26_9","1SA","26","9","9","But David said to Abishai, “Do not destroy him, for who can extend a hand against the LORD’s anointed and be guiltless?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_10","010_26_10","1SA","26","10","10","David added, “As surely as the LORD lives, the LORD Himself will strike him down; either his day will come and he will die, or he will go into battle and perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_11","010_26_11","1SA","26","11","11","But the LORD forbid that I should extend my hand against the LORD’s anointed. Instead, take the spear and water jug by his head, and let us go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_12","010_26_12","1SA","26","12","12","So David took the spear and water jug by Saul’s head, and they departed. No one saw them or knew about it, nor did anyone wake up; they all remained asleep, because a deep sleep from the LORD had fallen on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_13","010_26_13","1SA","26","13","13","Then David crossed to the other side and stood atop the mountain at a distance; there was a wide gulf between them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_14","010_26_14","1SA","26","14","14","And David shouted to the troops and to Abner son of Ner, “Will you not answer me, Abner?” “Who are you who calls to the king?” Abner replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_15","010_26_15","1SA","26","15","15","So David said to Abner, “You are a man, aren’t you? And who in Israel is your equal? Why then did you not protect your lord the king when one of the people came to destroy him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_16","010_26_16","1SA","26","16","16","This thing you have done is not good. As surely as the LORD lives, all of you deserve to die, since you did not protect your lord, the LORD’s anointed. Now look around. Where are the king’s spear and water jug that were by his head?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_17","010_26_17","1SA","26","17","17","Then Saul recognized David’s voice and asked, “Is that your voice, David my son?” “It is my voice, my lord and king,” David said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_18","010_26_18","1SA","26","18","18","And he continued, “Why is my lord pursuing his servant? What have I done? What evil is in my hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_19","010_26_19","1SA","26","19","19","Now please, may my lord the king hear the words of his servant: If the LORD has stirred you up against me, then may He accept an offering. But if men have done it, may they be cursed in the presence of the LORD! For today they have driven me away from sharing in the inheritance of the LORD, saying, ‘Go, serve other gods.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_20","010_26_20","1SA","26","20","20","So do not let my blood fall to the ground far from the presence of the LORD. For the king of Israel has come out to look for a flea, like one who hunts a partridge in the mountains.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_21","010_26_21","1SA","26","21","21","Then Saul replied, “I have sinned. Come back, David my son. I will never harm you again, because today you considered my life precious. I have played the fool and have committed a grave error!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_22","010_26_22","1SA","26","22","22","“Here is the king’s spear,” David answered. “Let one of the young men come over and get it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_23","010_26_23","1SA","26","23","23","May the LORD repay every man for his righteousness and faithfulness. For the LORD delivered you into my hand today, but I would not extend my hand against the LORD’s anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_24","010_26_24","1SA","26","24","24","As surely as I valued your life today, so may the LORD value my life and rescue me from all trouble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S126_25","010_26_25","1SA","26","25","25","Saul said to him, “May you be blessed, David my son. You will accomplish great things and will surely prevail.” So David went on his way, and Saul returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_1","010_27_1","1SA","27","1","1","David, however, said to himself, “One of these days now I will be swept away by the hand of Saul. There is nothing better for me than to escape to the land of the Philistines. Then Saul will stop searching for me all over Israel, and I will slip out of his hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_2","010_27_2","1SA","27","2","2","So David set out with his six hundred men and went to Achish son of Maoch, the king of Gath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_3","010_27_3","1SA","27","3","3","David and his men settled in Gath with Achish. Each man had his family with him, and David had his two wives: Ahinoam of Jezreel and Abigail of Carmel, the widow of Nabal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_4","010_27_4","1SA","27","4","4","And when Saul learned that David had fled to Gath, he no longer searched for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_5","010_27_5","1SA","27","5","5","Then David said to Achish, “If I have found favor in your eyes, let me be assigned a place in one of the outlying towns, so I can live there. For why should your servant live in the royal city with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_6","010_27_6","1SA","27","6","6","That day Achish gave him Ziklag, and to this day it still belongs to the kings of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_7","010_27_7","1SA","27","7","7","And the time that David lived in Philistine territory amounted to a year and four months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_8","010_27_8","1SA","27","8","8","Now David and his men went up and raided the Geshurites, the Girzites, and the Amalekites. (From ancient times these people had inhabited the land extending to Shur and Egypt.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_9","010_27_9","1SA","27","9","9","Whenever David attacked a territory, he did not leave a man or woman alive, but he took the flocks and herds, the donkeys, camels, and clothing. Then he would return to Achish, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_10","010_27_10","1SA","27","10","10","who would ask him, “What have you raided today?” And David would reply, “The Negev of Judah,” or “The Negev of Jerahmeel,” or “The Negev of the Kenites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_11","010_27_11","1SA","27","11","11","David did not leave a man or woman alive to be brought to Gath, for he said, “Otherwise they will report us, saying, ‘This is what David did.’” And this was David’s custom the whole time he lived in Philistine territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S127_12","010_27_12","1SA","27","12","12","So Achish trusted David, thinking, “Since he has made himself an utter stench to his people Israel, he will be my servant forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_1","010_28_1","1SA","28","1","1","Now in those days the Philistines gathered their forces for warfare against Israel. So Achish said to David, “You must understand that you and your men are to go out to battle with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_2","010_28_2","1SA","28","2","2","David replied, “Then you will come to know what your servant can do.” “Very well,” said Achish. “I will make you my bodyguard for life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_3","010_28_3","1SA","28","3","3","Now by this time Samuel had died, and all Israel had mourned for him and buried him in Ramah, his own city. And Saul had removed the mediums and spiritists from the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_4","010_28_4","1SA","28","4","4","The Philistines gathered together and camped at Shunem, while Saul gathered all Israel and camped at Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_5","010_28_5","1SA","28","5","5","When Saul saw the Philistine army, he was afraid and trembled violently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_6","010_28_6","1SA","28","6","6","He inquired of the LORD, but the LORD did not answer him by dreams or Urim or prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_7","010_28_7","1SA","28","7","7","Then Saul said to his servants, “Find me a woman who is a medium, so I can go and consult her.” “There is a medium at Endor,” his servants replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_8","010_28_8","1SA","28","8","8","So Saul disguised himself by putting on different clothes, and he set out with two of his men. They came to the woman at night, and Saul said, “Consult a spirit for me. Bring up for me the one I name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_9","010_28_9","1SA","28","9","9","But the woman replied, “Surely you know what Saul has done, how he has killed the mediums and spiritists in the land. Why have you set a trap to get me killed?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_10","010_28_10","1SA","28","10","10","Then Saul swore to her by the LORD: “As surely as the LORD lives, no punishment shall come upon you for this.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_11","010_28_11","1SA","28","11","11","“Whom shall I bring up for you?” the woman asked. “Bring up Samuel,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_12","010_28_12","1SA","28","12","12","But when the woman saw Samuel, she cried out in a loud voice and said to Saul, “Why have you deceived me? You are Saul!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_13","010_28_13","1SA","28","13","13","“Do not be afraid,” the king replied. “What do you see?” “I see a god coming up out of the earth,” the woman answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_14","010_28_14","1SA","28","14","14","“What does he look like?” asked Saul. “An old man is coming up,” she replied. “And he is wearing a robe.” So Saul knew that it was Samuel, and he bowed facedown in reverence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_15","010_28_15","1SA","28","15","15","Then Samuel said to Saul, “Why have you disturbed me by bringing me up?” “I am deeply distressed,” replied Saul. “The Philistines are fighting against me, and God has turned away from me. He no longer answers me, either by prophets or by dreams. So I have called on you to tell me what to do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_16","010_28_16","1SA","28","16","16","“Why do you consult me,” asked Samuel, “since the LORD has turned away from you and become your enemy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_17","010_28_17","1SA","28","17","17","He has done exactly what He spoke through me: The LORD has torn the kingdom out of your hand and given it to your neighbor David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_18","010_28_18","1SA","28","18","18","Because you did not obey the LORD or carry out His burning anger against Amalek, the LORD has done this to you today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_19","010_28_19","1SA","28","19","19","Moreover, the LORD will deliver Israel with you into the hand of the Philistines, and tomorrow you and your sons will be with me. And the LORD will deliver the army of Israel into the hand of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_20","010_28_20","1SA","28","20","20","Immediately Saul fell flat on the ground, terrified by the words of Samuel. And his strength was gone, because he had not eaten anything all that day and night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_21","010_28_21","1SA","28","21","21","When the woman came to Saul and saw how distraught he was, she said to him, “Look, your maidservant has obeyed your voice. I took my life in my hands and did as you told me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_22","010_28_22","1SA","28","22","22","Now please listen to your servant and let me set a morsel of bread before you so you may eat and have the strength to go on your way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_23","010_28_23","1SA","28","23","23","Saul refused, saying, “I will not eat.” But his servants joined the woman in urging him, and he heeded their voice. He got up from the ground and sat on the bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_24","010_28_24","1SA","28","24","24","The woman had a fattened calf at her house, and she quickly slaughtered it. She also took flour, kneaded it, and baked unleavened bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S128_25","010_28_25","1SA","28","25","25","She served it to Saul and his servants, and they ate. And that night they got up and left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_1","010_29_1","1SA","29","1","1","Now the Philistines brought all their forces together at Aphek, while Israel camped by the spring in Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_2","010_29_2","1SA","29","2","2","As the Philistine leaders marched out with their units of hundreds and thousands, David and his men marched behind them with Achish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_3","010_29_3","1SA","29","3","3","Then the commanders of the Philistines asked, “What about these Hebrews?” Achish replied, “Is this not David, the servant of King Saul of Israel? He has been with me all these days, even years, and from the day he defected until today I have found no fault in him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_4","010_29_4","1SA","29","4","4","But the commanders of the Philistines were angry with Achish and told him, “Send that man back and let him return to the place you assigned him. He must not go down with us into battle only to become our adversary during the war. What better way for him to regain the favor of his master than with the heads of our men? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_5","010_29_5","1SA","29","5","5","Is this not the David about whom they sing in their dances: ‘Saul has slain his thousands, and David his tens of thousands’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_6","010_29_6","1SA","29","6","6","So Achish summoned David and told him, “As surely as the LORD lives, you have been upright, and it seems right in my sight that you should march in and out with me in the army, because I have found no fault in you from the day you came to me until this day. But you are not good in the sight of the leaders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_7","010_29_7","1SA","29","7","7","Therefore turn back now and go in peace, so that you will not do anything to displease the leaders of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_8","010_29_8","1SA","29","8","8","“But what have I done?” David replied. “What have you found against your servant, from the day I came to you until today, to keep me from going along to fight against the enemies of my lord the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_9","010_29_9","1SA","29","9","9","Achish replied, “I know that you are as pleasing in my sight as an angel of God. But the commanders of the Philistines have said, ‘He must not go into battle with us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_10","010_29_10","1SA","29","10","10","Now then, get up early in the morning, along with your master’s servants who came with you, and go as soon as it is light.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S129_11","010_29_11","1SA","29","11","11","So David and his men got up early in the morning to return to the land of the Philistines. And the Philistines went up to Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_1","010_30_1","1SA","30","1","1","On the third day David and his men arrived in Ziklag, and the Amalekites had raided the Negev, attacked Ziklag, and burned it down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_2","010_30_2","1SA","30","2","2","They had taken captive the women and all who were there, both young and old. They had not killed anyone, but had carried them off as they went on their way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_3","010_30_3","1SA","30","3","3","When David and his men came to the city, they found it burned down and their wives and sons and daughters taken captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_4","010_30_4","1SA","30","4","4","So David and the troops with him lifted up their voices and wept until they had no strength left to weep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_5","010_30_5","1SA","30","5","5","David’s two wives, Ahinoam of Jezreel and Abigail the widow of Nabal of Carmel, had been taken captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_6","010_30_6","1SA","30","6","6","And David was greatly distressed because the people spoke of stoning him, because the soul of every man grieved for his sons and daughters. But David found strength in the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_7","010_30_7","1SA","30","7","7","Then David said to Abiathar the priest, the son of Ahimelech, “Bring me the ephod.” So Abiathar brought it to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_8","010_30_8","1SA","30","8","8","and David inquired of the LORD: “Should I pursue these raiders? Will I overtake them?” “Pursue them,” the LORD replied, “for you will surely overtake them and rescue the captives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_9","010_30_9","1SA","30","9","9","So David and his six hundred men went to the Brook of Besor, where some stayed behind ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_10","010_30_10","1SA","30","10","10","because two hundred men were too exhausted to cross the brook. But David and four hundred men continued in pursuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_11","010_30_11","1SA","30","11","11","Now his men found an Egyptian in the field and brought him to David. They gave the man water to drink and food to eat— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_12","010_30_12","1SA","30","12","12","a piece of a fig cake and two clusters of raisins. So he ate and was revived, for he had not had any food or water for three days and three nights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_13","010_30_13","1SA","30","13","13","Then David asked him, “To whom do you belong, and where are you from?” “I am an Egyptian,” he replied, “the slave of an Amalekite. My master abandoned me three days ago when I fell ill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_14","010_30_14","1SA","30","14","14","We raided the Negev of the Cherethites, the territory of Judah, and the Negev of Caleb, and we burned down Ziklag.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_15","010_30_15","1SA","30","15","15","“Will you lead me to these raiders?” David asked. And the man replied, “Swear to me by God that you will not kill me or deliver me into the hand of my master, and I will lead you to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_16","010_30_16","1SA","30","16","16","So he led David down, and there were the Amalekites spread out over all the land, eating, drinking, and celebrating the great amount of plunder they had taken from the land of the Philistines and the land of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_17","010_30_17","1SA","30","17","17","And David struck them down from twilight until the evening of the next day. Not a man escaped, except four hundred young men who fled, riding off on camels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_18","010_30_18","1SA","30","18","18","So David recovered everything the Amalekites had taken, including his two wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_19","010_30_19","1SA","30","19","19","Nothing was missing, young or old, son or daughter, or any of the plunder the Amalekites had taken. David brought everything back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_20","010_30_20","1SA","30","20","20","And he took all the flocks and herds, which his men drove ahead of the other livestock, calling out, “This is David’s plunder!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_21","010_30_21","1SA","30","21","21","When David came to the two hundred men who had been too exhausted to follow him and who were left behind at the Brook of Besor, they came out to meet him and the troops with him. As David approached the men, he greeted them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_22","010_30_22","1SA","30","22","22","but all the wicked and worthless men among those who had gone with David said, “Because they did not go with us, we will not share with them the plunder we recovered, except for each man’s wife and children. They may take them and go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_23","010_30_23","1SA","30","23","23","But David said, “My brothers, you must not do this with what the LORD has given us. He has protected us and delivered into our hands the raiders who came against us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_24","010_30_24","1SA","30","24","24","Who will listen to your proposal? The share of the one who went to battle will match the share of the one who stayed with the supplies. They will share alike.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_25","010_30_25","1SA","30","25","25","And so it has been from that day forward. David established this statute and ordinance for Israel to this very day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_26","010_30_26","1SA","30","26","26","When David arrived in Ziklag, he sent some of the plunder to his friends, the elders of Judah, saying, “Here is a gift for you from the plunder of the LORD’s enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_27","010_30_27","1SA","30","27","27","He sent gifts to those in Bethel, Ramoth Negev, and Jattir; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_28","010_30_28","1SA","30","28","28","to those in Aroer, Siphmoth, and Eshtemoa; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_29","010_30_29","1SA","30","29","29","to those in Racal and in the cities of the Jerahmeelites and Kenites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_30","010_30_30","1SA","30","30","30","to those in Hormah, Bor-ashan, and Athach; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S130_31","010_30_31","1SA","30","31","31","and to those in Hebron and in all the places where David and his men had roamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_1","010_31_1","1SA","31","1","1","Now the Philistines fought against Israel, and the men of Israel fled before them, and many fell slain on Mount Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_2","010_31_2","1SA","31","2","2","The Philistines hotly pursued Saul and his sons, and they killed Saul’s sons Jonathan, Abinadab, and Malchishua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_3","010_31_3","1SA","31","3","3","When the battle intensified against Saul, the archers overtook him and wounded him critically. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_4","010_31_4","1SA","31","4","4","Then Saul said to his armor-bearer, “Draw your sword and run me through with it, or these uncircumcised men will come and run me through and torture me!” But his armor-bearer was terrified and refused to do it. So Saul took his own sword and fell on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_5","010_31_5","1SA","31","5","5","When his armor-bearer saw that Saul was dead, he too fell on his own sword and died with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_6","010_31_6","1SA","31","6","6","So Saul, his three sons, his armor-bearer, and all his men died together that same day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_7","010_31_7","1SA","31","7","7","When the Israelites along the valley and those on the other side of the Jordan saw that the army of Israel had fled and that Saul and his sons had died, they abandoned their cities and ran away. So the Philistines came and occupied their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_8","010_31_8","1SA","31","8","8","The next day, when the Philistines came to strip the dead, they found Saul and his three sons fallen on Mount Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_9","010_31_9","1SA","31","9","9","They cut off Saul’s head, stripped off his armor, and sent messengers throughout the land of the Philistines to proclaim the news in the temples of their idols and among their people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_10","010_31_10","1SA","31","10","10","They put his armor in the temple of the Ashtoreths and hung his body on the wall of Beth-shan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_11","010_31_11","1SA","31","11","11","When the people of Jabesh-gilead heard what the Philistines had done to Saul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_12","010_31_12","1SA","31","12","12","all their men of valor set out, journeyed all night, and retrieved the bodies of Saul and his sons from the wall of Beth-shan. When they arrived at Jabesh, they burned the bodies there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S131_13","010_31_13","1SA","31","13","13","Then they took their bones and buried them under the tamarisk tree in Jabesh, and they fasted seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_1","011_1_1","2SA","1","1","1","After the death of Saul, David returned from the slaughter of the Amalekites and stayed in Ziklag two days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_2","011_1_2","2SA","1","2","2","On the third day a man with torn clothes and dust on his head arrived from Saul’s camp. When he came to David, he fell to the ground to pay him homage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_3","011_1_3","2SA","1","3","3","“Where have you come from?” David asked. “I have escaped from the Israelite camp,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_4","011_1_4","2SA","1","4","4","“What was the outcome?” David asked. “Please tell me.” “The troops fled from the battle,” he replied. “Many of them fell and died. And Saul and his son Jonathan are also dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_5","011_1_5","2SA","1","5","5","Then David asked the young man who had brought him the report, “How do you know that Saul and his son Jonathan are dead?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_6","011_1_6","2SA","1","6","6","“I happened to be on Mount Gilboa,” he replied, “and there was Saul, leaning on his spear, with the chariots and the cavalry closing in on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_7","011_1_7","2SA","1","7","7","When he turned around and saw me, he called out to me, and I answered, ‘Here I am!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_8","011_1_8","2SA","1","8","8","‘Who are you?’ he asked. So I told him, ‘I am an Amalekite.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_9","011_1_9","2SA","1","9","9","Then he begged me, ‘Stand over me and kill me, for agony has seized me, but my life still lingers.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_10","011_1_10","2SA","1","10","10","So I stood over him and killed him, because I knew that after he had fallen he could not survive. And I took the crown that was on his head and the band that was on his arm, and I have brought them here to my lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_11","011_1_11","2SA","1","11","11","Then David took hold of his own clothes and tore them, and all the men who were with him did the same. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_12","011_1_12","2SA","1","12","12","They mourned and wept and fasted until evening for Saul and his son Jonathan, and for the people of the LORD and the house of Israel, because they had fallen by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_13","011_1_13","2SA","1","13","13","And David inquired of the young man who had brought him the report, “Where are you from?” “I am the son of a foreigner,” he answered. “I am an Amalekite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_14","011_1_14","2SA","1","14","14","So David asked him, “Why were you not afraid to lift your hand to destroy the LORD’s anointed?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_15","011_1_15","2SA","1","15","15","Then David summoned one of the young men and said, “Go, execute him!” So the young man struck him down, and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_16","011_1_16","2SA","1","16","16","For David had said to the Amalekite, “Your blood be on your own head because your own mouth has testified against you, saying, ‘I killed the LORD’s anointed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_17","011_1_17","2SA","1","17","17","Then David took up this lament for Saul and his son Jonathan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_18","011_1_18","2SA","1","18","18","and he ordered that the sons of Judah be taught the Song of the Bow. It is written in the Book of Jashar: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_19","011_1_19","2SA","1","19","19","“Your glory, O Israel, lies slain on your heights. How the mighty have fallen! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_20","011_1_20","2SA","1","20","20","Tell it not in Gath; proclaim it not in the streets of Ashkelon, lest the daughters of the Philistines rejoice, and the daughters of the uncircumcised exult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_21","011_1_21","2SA","1","21","21","O mountains of Gilboa, may you have no dew or rain, no fields yielding offerings of grain. For there the shield of the mighty was defiled, the shield of Saul, no longer anointed with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_22","011_1_22","2SA","1","22","22","From the blood of the slain, from the fat of the mighty, the bow of Jonathan did not retreat, and the sword of Saul did not return empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_23","011_1_23","2SA","1","23","23","Saul and Jonathan, beloved and delightful in life, were not divided in death. They were swifter than eagles; they were stronger than lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_24","011_1_24","2SA","1","24","24","O daughters of Israel, weep for Saul, who clothed you in scarlet and luxury, who decked your garments with ornaments of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_25","011_1_25","2SA","1","25","25","How the mighty have fallen in the thick of battle! Jonathan lies slain on your heights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_26","011_1_26","2SA","1","26","26","I grieve for you, Jonathan, my brother. You were delightful to me; your love to me was extraordinary, surpassing the love of women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S21_27","011_1_27","2SA","1","27","27","How the mighty have fallen, and the weapons of war have perished!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_1","011_2_1","2SA","2","1","1","Some time later, David inquired of the LORD, “Should I go up to one of the towns of Judah?” “Go up,” the LORD answered. Then David asked, “Where should I go?” “To Hebron,” replied the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_2","011_2_2","2SA","2","2","2","So David went there with his two wives, Ahinoam of Jezreel and Abigail the widow of Nabal of Carmel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_3","011_2_3","2SA","2","3","3","David also took the men who were with him, each with his household, and they settled in the towns near Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_4","011_2_4","2SA","2","4","4","Then the men of Judah came to Hebron, and there they anointed David king over the house of Judah. And they told David, “It was the men of Jabesh-gilead who buried Saul.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_5","011_2_5","2SA","2","5","5","So David sent messengers to the men of Jabesh-gilead to tell them, “The LORD bless you, because you showed this kindness to Saul your lord when you buried him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_6","011_2_6","2SA","2","6","6","Now may the LORD show you loving devotion and faithfulness, and I will also show you the same favor because you have done this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_7","011_2_7","2SA","2","7","7","Now then, be strong and courageous, for though Saul your lord is dead, the house of Judah has anointed me as their king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_8","011_2_8","2SA","2","8","8","Meanwhile, Abner son of Ner, the commander of Saul’s army, took Saul’s son Ish-bosheth, moved him to Mahanaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_9","011_2_9","2SA","2","9","9","and made him king over Gilead, Asher, Jezreel, Ephraim, and Benjamin—over all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_10","011_2_10","2SA","2","10","10","Saul’s son Ish-bosheth was forty years old when he began to reign over Israel, and he reigned for two years. The house of Judah, however, followed David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_11","011_2_11","2SA","2","11","11","And the length of time that David was king in Hebron over the house of Judah was seven years and six months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_12","011_2_12","2SA","2","12","12","One day Abner son of Ner and the servants of Ish-bosheth son of Saul marched out from Mahanaim to Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_13","011_2_13","2SA","2","13","13","So Joab son of Zeruiah and the servants of David marched out and met them by the pool of Gibeon. And the two groups took up positions on opposite sides of the pool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_14","011_2_14","2SA","2","14","14","Then Abner said to Joab, “Let us have the young men get up and compete before us.” “Let them get up,” Joab replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_15","011_2_15","2SA","2","15","15","So they got up and were counted off—twelve for Benjamin and Ish-bosheth son of Saul, and twelve for David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_16","011_2_16","2SA","2","16","16","Then each man grabbed his opponent by the head and thrust his sword into his opponent’s side, and they all fell together. So this place, which is in Gibeon, is called Helkath-hazzurim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_17","011_2_17","2SA","2","17","17","The battle that day was intense, and Abner and the men of Israel were defeated by the servants of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_18","011_2_18","2SA","2","18","18","The three sons of Zeruiah were there: Joab, Abishai, and Asahel. Now Asahel was fleet of foot like a wild gazelle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_19","011_2_19","2SA","2","19","19","and he chased Abner, not turning to the right or to the left in his pursuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_20","011_2_20","2SA","2","20","20","And Abner glanced back and said, “Is that you, Asahel?” “It is,” Asahel replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_21","011_2_21","2SA","2","21","21","So Abner told him, “Turn to your right or to your left, seize one of the young men, and take his equipment for yourself.” But Asahel would not stop chasing him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_22","011_2_22","2SA","2","22","22","Once again, Abner warned Asahel, “Stop chasing me. Why should I strike you to the ground? How could I show my face to your brother Joab?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_23","011_2_23","2SA","2","23","23","But Asahel refused to turn away. So Abner thrust the butt of his spear into his stomach, and it came out his back, and he fell dead on the spot. And every man paused when he came to the place where Asahel had fallen and died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_24","011_2_24","2SA","2","24","24","But Joab and Abishai pursued Abner. By sunset, they had gone as far as the hill of Ammah opposite Giah on the way to the wilderness of Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_25","011_2_25","2SA","2","25","25","The Benjamites rallied to Abner, formed a single unit, and took their stand atop a hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_26","011_2_26","2SA","2","26","26","Then Abner called out to Joab: “Must the sword devour forever? Do you not realize that this will only end in bitterness? How long before you tell the troops to stop pursuing their brothers?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_27","011_2_27","2SA","2","27","27","“As surely as God lives,” Joab replied, “if you had not spoken up, the troops would have continued pursuing their brothers until morning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_28","011_2_28","2SA","2","28","28","So Joab blew the ram’s horn, and all the troops stopped; they no longer pursued Israel or continued to fight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_29","011_2_29","2SA","2","29","29","And all that night Abner and his men marched through the Arabah. They crossed the Jordan, marched all morning, and arrived at Mahanaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_30","011_2_30","2SA","2","30","30","When Joab returned from pursuing Abner, he gathered all the troops. In addition to Asahel, nineteen of David’s servants were missing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_31","011_2_31","2SA","2","31","31","but they had struck down 360 Benjamites who were with Abner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S22_32","011_2_32","2SA","2","32","32","And they took Asahel and buried him in his father’s tomb in Bethlehem. Then Joab and his men marched all night and reached Hebron at daybreak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_1","011_3_1","2SA","3","1","1","Now the war between the house of Saul and the house of David was protracted. And David grew stronger and stronger, while the house of Saul grew weaker and weaker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_2","011_3_2","2SA","3","2","2","And sons were born to David in Hebron: His firstborn was Amnon, by Ahinoam of Jezreel; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_3","011_3_3","2SA","3","3","3","his second was Chileab, by Abigail the widow of Nabal of Carmel; his third was Absalom, the son of Maacah daughter of King Talmai of Geshur; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_4","011_3_4","2SA","3","4","4","his fourth was Adonijah, the son of Haggith; his fifth was Shephatiah, the son of Abital; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_5","011_3_5","2SA","3","5","5","and his sixth was Ithream, by David’s wife Eglah. These sons were born to David in Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_6","011_3_6","2SA","3","6","6","During the war between the house of Saul and the house of David, Abner had continued to strengthen his position in the house of Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_7","011_3_7","2SA","3","7","7","Now Saul had a concubine named Rizpah, the daughter of Aiah. So Ish-bosheth questioned Abner, “Why did you sleep with my father’s concubine?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_8","011_3_8","2SA","3","8","8","Abner was furious over Ish-bosheth’s accusation. “Am I the head of a dog that belongs to Judah?” he asked. “All this time I have been loyal to the house of your father Saul, to his brothers, and to his friends. I have not delivered you into the hand of David, but now you accuse me of wrongdoing with this woman! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_9","011_3_9","2SA","3","9","9","May God punish Abner, and ever so severely, if I do not do for David what the LORD has sworn to him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_10","011_3_10","2SA","3","10","10","to transfer the kingdom from the house of Saul and to establish the throne of David over Israel and Judah, from Dan to Beersheba.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_11","011_3_11","2SA","3","11","11","And for fear of Abner, Ish-bosheth did not dare to say another word to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_12","011_3_12","2SA","3","12","12","Then Abner sent messengers on his behalf to say to David, “To whom does the land belong? Make your covenant with me, and surely my hand will be with you to bring all Israel over to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_13","011_3_13","2SA","3","13","13","“Good,” replied David, “I will make a covenant with you. But there is one thing I require of you: Do not appear before me unless you bring Saul’s daughter Michal when you come to see me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_14","011_3_14","2SA","3","14","14","Then David sent messengers to say to Ish-bosheth son of Saul, “Give me back my wife, Michal, whom I betrothed to myself for a hundred Philistine foreskins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_15","011_3_15","2SA","3","15","15","So Ish-bosheth sent and took Michal from her husband Paltiel son of Laish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_16","011_3_16","2SA","3","16","16","Her husband followed her, weeping all the way to Bahurim. Then Abner said to him, “Go back.” So he returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_17","011_3_17","2SA","3","17","17","Now Abner conferred with the elders of Israel and said, “In the past you sought David as your king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_18","011_3_18","2SA","3","18","18","Now take action, because the LORD has said to David, ‘Through My servant David I will save My people Israel from the hands of the Philistines and of all their enemies.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_19","011_3_19","2SA","3","19","19","Abner also spoke to the Benjamites. Then he went to Hebron to tell David all that seemed good to Israel and to the whole house of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_20","011_3_20","2SA","3","20","20","When Abner and twenty of his men came to David at Hebron, David held a feast for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_21","011_3_21","2SA","3","21","21","Then Abner said to David, “Let me go at once, and I will gather all Israel to my lord the king, that they may make a covenant with you, and that you may rule over all that your heart desires.” So David dismissed Abner, and he went in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_22","011_3_22","2SA","3","22","22","Just then David’s soldiers and Joab returned from a raid, bringing with them a great plunder. But Abner was not with David in Hebron, because David had sent him on his way in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_23","011_3_23","2SA","3","23","23","When Joab and all his troops arrived, he was informed, “Abner son of Ner came to see the king, who sent him on his way in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_24","011_3_24","2SA","3","24","24","So Joab went to the king and said, “What have you done? Look, Abner came to you. Why did you dismiss him? Now he is getting away! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_25","011_3_25","2SA","3","25","25","Surely you realize that Abner son of Ner came to deceive you and to track your movements and all that you are doing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_26","011_3_26","2SA","3","26","26","As soon as Joab had left David, he sent messengers after Abner, who brought him back from the well of Sirah. But David was unaware of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_27","011_3_27","2SA","3","27","27","When Abner returned to Hebron, Joab pulled him aside into the gateway, as if to speak to him privately, and there Joab stabbed him in the stomach. So Abner died on account of the blood of Joab’s brother Asahel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_28","011_3_28","2SA","3","28","28","Afterward, David heard about this and said, “I and my kingdom are forever guiltless before the LORD concerning the blood of Abner son of Ner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_29","011_3_29","2SA","3","29","29","May it whirl over the head of Joab and over the entire house of his father, and may the house of Joab never be without one having a discharge or skin disease, or one who leans on a staff or falls by the sword or lacks food.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_30","011_3_30","2SA","3","30","30","(Joab and his brother Abishai murdered Abner because he had killed their brother Asahel in the battle at Gibeon.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_31","011_3_31","2SA","3","31","31","Then David ordered Joab and all the people with him, “Tear your clothes, put on sackcloth, and mourn before Abner.” And King David himself walked behind the funeral bier. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_32","011_3_32","2SA","3","32","32","When they buried Abner in Hebron, the king wept aloud at Abner’s tomb, and all the people wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_33","011_3_33","2SA","3","33","33","And the king sang this lament for Abner: “Should Abner die the death of a fool? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_34","011_3_34","2SA","3","34","34","Your hands were not bound, your feet were not fettered. As a man falls before the wicked, so also you fell.” And all the people wept over him even more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_35","011_3_35","2SA","3","35","35","Then all the people came and urged David to eat something while it was still day, but David took an oath, saying, “May God punish me, and ever so severely, if I taste bread or anything else before the sun sets!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_36","011_3_36","2SA","3","36","36","All the people took note and were pleased. In fact, everything the king did pleased them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_37","011_3_37","2SA","3","37","37","So on that day all the troops and all Israel were convinced that the king had no part in the murder of Abner son of Ner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_38","011_3_38","2SA","3","38","38","Then the king said to his servants, “Do you not realize that a great prince has fallen today in Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S23_39","011_3_39","2SA","3","39","39","And I am weak this day, though anointed as king, and these men, the sons of Zeruiah, are too fierce for me. May the LORD repay the evildoer according to his evil!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_1","011_4_1","2SA","4","1","1","Now when Ish-bosheth son of Saul heard that Abner had died in Hebron, he lost courage, and all Israel was dismayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_2","011_4_2","2SA","4","2","2","Saul’s son had two men who were leaders of raiding parties. One was named Baanah and the other Rechab; they were sons of Rimmon the Beerothite of the tribe of Benjamin—Beeroth is considered part of Benjamin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_3","011_4_3","2SA","4","3","3","because the Beerothites fled to Gittaim and have lived there as foreigners to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_4","011_4_4","2SA","4","4","4","And Jonathan son of Saul had a son who was lame in his feet. He was five years old when the report about Saul and Jonathan came from Jezreel. His nurse picked him up and fled, but as she was hurrying to escape, he fell and became lame. His name was Mephibosheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_5","011_4_5","2SA","4","5","5","Now Rechab and Baanah, the sons of Rimmon the Beerothite, set out and arrived at the house of Ish-bosheth in the heat of the day, while the king was taking his midday nap. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_6","011_4_6","2SA","4","6","6","They entered the interior of the house as if to get some wheat, and they stabbed him in the stomach. Then Rechab and his brother Baanah slipped away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_7","011_4_7","2SA","4","7","7","They had entered the house while Ish-bosheth was lying on his bed, and having stabbed and killed him, they beheaded him, took his head, and traveled all night by way of the Arabah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_8","011_4_8","2SA","4","8","8","They brought the head of Ish-bosheth to David at Hebron and said to the king, “Here is the head of Ish-bosheth son of Saul, your enemy who sought your life. Today the LORD has granted vengeance to my lord the king against Saul and his offspring.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_9","011_4_9","2SA","4","9","9","But David answered Rechab and his brother Baanah, the sons of Rimmon the Beerothite, “As surely as the LORD lives, who has redeemed my life from all distress, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_10","011_4_10","2SA","4","10","10","when someone told me, ‘Look, Saul is dead,’ and thought he was a bearer of good news, I seized him and put him to death at Ziklag. That was his reward for his news! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_11","011_4_11","2SA","4","11","11","How much more, when wicked men kill a righteous man in his own house and on his own bed, shall I not now require his blood from your hands and remove you from the earth!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S24_12","011_4_12","2SA","4","12","12","So David commanded his young men, and they killed Rechab and Baanah. They cut off their hands and feet and hung their bodies by the pool in Hebron, but they took the head of Ish-bosheth and buried it in Abner’s tomb in Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_1","011_5_1","2SA","5","1","1","Then all the tribes of Israel came to David at Hebron and said, “Here we are, your own flesh and blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_2","011_5_2","2SA","5","2","2","Even in times past, while Saul was king over us, you were the one who led Israel out and brought them back. And to you the LORD said, ‘You will shepherd My people Israel, and you will be ruler over them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_3","011_5_3","2SA","5","3","3","So all the elders of Israel came to the king at Hebron, where King David made with them a covenant before the LORD. And they anointed him king over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_4","011_5_4","2SA","5","4","4","David was thirty years old when he became king, and he reigned forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_5","011_5_5","2SA","5","5","5","In Hebron he reigned over Judah seven years and six months, and in Jerusalem he reigned thirty-three years over all Israel and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_6","011_5_6","2SA","5","6","6","Now the king and his men marched to Jerusalem against the Jebusites who inhabited the land. The Jebusites said to David: “You will never get in here. Even the blind and lame can repel you.” For they thought, “David cannot get in here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_7","011_5_7","2SA","5","7","7","Nevertheless, David captured the fortress of Zion (that is, the City of David). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_8","011_5_8","2SA","5","8","8","On that day he said, “Whoever attacks the Jebusites must use the water shaft to reach the lame and blind who are despised by David.” That is why it is said, “The blind and the lame will never enter the palace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_9","011_5_9","2SA","5","9","9","So David took up residence in the fortress and called it the City of David. He built it up all the way around, from the supporting terraces inward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_10","011_5_10","2SA","5","10","10","And David became greater and greater, for the LORD God of Hosts was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_11","011_5_11","2SA","5","11","11","Now Hiram king of Tyre sent envoys to David, along with cedar logs, carpenters, and stonemasons, and they built a palace for David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_12","011_5_12","2SA","5","12","12","And David realized that the LORD had established him as king over Israel and had exalted his kingdom for the sake of His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_13","011_5_13","2SA","5","13","13","After he had arrived from Hebron, David took more concubines and wives from Jerusalem, and more sons and daughters were born to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_14","011_5_14","2SA","5","14","14","These are the names of the children born to him in Jerusalem: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_15","011_5_15","2SA","5","15","15","Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_16","011_5_16","2SA","5","16","16","Elishama, Eliada, and Eliphelet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_17","011_5_17","2SA","5","17","17","When the Philistines heard that David had been anointed king over Israel, they all went in search of him; but David learned of this and went down to the stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_18","011_5_18","2SA","5","18","18","Now the Philistines had come and spread out in the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_19","011_5_19","2SA","5","19","19","So David inquired of the LORD, “Should I go up against the Philistines? Will You deliver them into my hand?” “Go up,” replied the LORD, “for I will surely deliver the Philistines into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_20","011_5_20","2SA","5","20","20","So David went to Baal-perazim, where he defeated the Philistines and said, “Like a bursting flood, the LORD has burst out against my enemies before me.” So he called that place Baal-perazim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_21","011_5_21","2SA","5","21","21","There the Philistines abandoned their idols, and David and his men carried them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_22","011_5_22","2SA","5","22","22","Once again the Philistines came up and spread out in the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_23","011_5_23","2SA","5","23","23","So David inquired of the LORD, who answered, “Do not march straight up, but circle around behind them and attack them in front of the balsam trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_24","011_5_24","2SA","5","24","24","As soon as you hear the sound of marching in the tops of the balsam trees, move quickly, because this will mean that the LORD has gone out before you to strike the camp of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S25_25","011_5_25","2SA","5","25","25","So David did as the LORD had commanded him, and he struck down the Philistines all the way from Gibeon to Gezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_1","011_6_1","2SA","6","1","1","David again assembled the chosen men of Israel, thirty thousand in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_2","011_6_2","2SA","6","2","2","And he and all his troops set out for Baale of Judah to bring up from there the ark of God, which is called by the Name—the name of the LORD of Hosts, who is enthroned between the cherubim that are on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_3","011_6_3","2SA","6","3","3","They set the ark of God on a new cart and brought it from the house of Abinadab, which was on the hill. Uzzah and Ahio, the sons of Abinadab, were guiding the new cart, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_4","011_6_4","2SA","6","4","4","bringing with it the ark of God. And Ahio was walking in front of the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_5","011_6_5","2SA","6","5","5","David and all the house of Israel were celebrating before the LORD with all kinds of wood instruments, harps, stringed instruments, tambourines, sistrums, and cymbals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_6","011_6_6","2SA","6","6","6","When they came to the threshing floor of Nacon, Uzzah reached out and took hold of the ark of God, because the oxen had stumbled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_7","011_6_7","2SA","6","7","7","And the anger of the LORD burned against Uzzah, and God struck him down on the spot for his irreverence, and he died there beside the ark of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_8","011_6_8","2SA","6","8","8","Then David became angry because the LORD had burst forth against Uzzah. So he named that place Perez-uzzah, as it is called to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_9","011_6_9","2SA","6","9","9","That day David feared the LORD and asked, “How can the ark of the LORD ever come to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_10","011_6_10","2SA","6","10","10","So he was unwilling to move the ark of the LORD to the City of David; instead, he took it aside to the house of Obed-edom the Gittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_11","011_6_11","2SA","6","11","11","Thus the ark of the LORD remained in the house of Obed-edom the Gittite for three months, and the LORD blessed him and all his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_12","011_6_12","2SA","6","12","12","Now it was reported to King David, “The LORD has blessed the house of Obed-edom and all that belongs to him, because of the ark of God.” So David went and had the ark of God brought up from the house of Obed-edom into the City of David with rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_13","011_6_13","2SA","6","13","13","When those carrying the ark of the LORD had advanced six paces, he sacrificed an ox and a fattened calf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_14","011_6_14","2SA","6","14","14","And David, wearing a linen ephod, danced with all his might before the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_15","011_6_15","2SA","6","15","15","while he and all the house of Israel brought up the ark of the LORD with shouting and the sounding of the ram’s horn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_16","011_6_16","2SA","6","16","16","As the ark of the LORD was entering the City of David, Saul’s daughter Michal looked down from a window and saw King David leaping and dancing before the LORD, and she despised him in her heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_17","011_6_17","2SA","6","17","17","So they brought the ark of the LORD and set it in its place inside the tent that David had pitched for it. Then David offered burnt offerings and peace offerings before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_18","011_6_18","2SA","6","18","18","When David had finished sacrificing the burnt offerings and peace offerings, he blessed the people in the name of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_19","011_6_19","2SA","6","19","19","Then he distributed to every man and woman among the multitude of Israel a loaf of bread, a date cake, and a raisin cake. And all the people departed, each to his own home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_20","011_6_20","2SA","6","20","20","When David returned home to bless his own household, Saul’s daughter Michal came out to meet him. “How the king of Israel has distinguished himself today!” she said. “He has uncovered himself today in the sight of the maidservants of his subjects, like a vulgar person would do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_21","011_6_21","2SA","6","21","21","But David said to Michal, “I was dancing before the LORD, who chose me over your father and all his house when He appointed me ruler over the LORD’s people Israel. I will celebrate before the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_22","011_6_22","2SA","6","22","22","and I will humiliate and humble myself even more than this. Yet I will be honored by the maidservants of whom you have spoken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S26_23","011_6_23","2SA","6","23","23","And Michal the daughter of Saul had no children to the day of her death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_1","011_7_1","2SA","7","1","1","After the king had settled into his palace and the LORD had given him rest from all his enemies around him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_2","011_7_2","2SA","7","2","2","he said to Nathan the prophet, “Here I am, living in a house of cedar, while the ark of God remains in a tent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_3","011_7_3","2SA","7","3","3","And Nathan replied to the king, “Go and do all that is in your heart, for the LORD is with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_4","011_7_4","2SA","7","4","4","But that night the word of the LORD came to Nathan, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_5","011_7_5","2SA","7","5","5","“Go and tell My servant David that this is what the LORD says: Are you the one to build for Me a house to dwell in? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_6","011_7_6","2SA","7","6","6","For I have not dwelt in a house from the day I brought the Israelites up out of Egypt until this day, but I have moved about with a tent as My dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_7","011_7_7","2SA","7","7","7","In all My journeys with all the Israelites, have I ever asked any of the leaders I appointed to shepherd My people Israel, ‘Why haven’t you built Me a house of cedar?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_8","011_7_8","2SA","7","8","8","Now then, you are to tell My servant David that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: I took you from the pasture, from following the flock, to be the ruler over My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_9","011_7_9","2SA","7","9","9","I have been with you wherever you have gone, and I have cut off all your enemies from before you. Now I will make for you a name like that of the greatest in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_10","011_7_10","2SA","7","10","10","And I will provide a place for My people Israel and will plant them so that they may dwell in a place of their own and be disturbed no more. No longer will the sons of wickedness oppress them as they did at the beginning ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_11","011_7_11","2SA","7","11","11","and have done since the day I appointed judges over My people Israel. I will give you rest from all your enemies. The LORD declares to you that He Himself will establish a house for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_12","011_7_12","2SA","7","12","12","And when your days are fulfilled and you rest with your fathers, I will raise up your descendant after you, who will come from your own body, and I will establish his kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_13","011_7_13","2SA","7","13","13","He will build a house for My Name, and I will establish the throne of his kingdom forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_14","011_7_14","2SA","7","14","14","I will be his Father, and he will be My son. When he does wrong, I will discipline him with the rod of men and with the blows of the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_15","011_7_15","2SA","7","15","15","But My loving devotion will never be removed from him as I removed it from Saul, whom I removed from before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_16","011_7_16","2SA","7","16","16","Your house and kingdom will endure forever before Me, and your throne will be established forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_17","011_7_17","2SA","7","17","17","So Nathan relayed to David all the words of this entire revelation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_18","011_7_18","2SA","7","18","18","Then King David went in, sat before the LORD, and said, “Who am I, O Lord GOD, and what is my house, that You have brought me this far? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_19","011_7_19","2SA","7","19","19","And as if this was a small thing in Your eyes, O Lord GOD, You have also spoken about the future of the house of Your servant. Is this Your custom with man, O Lord GOD? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_20","011_7_20","2SA","7","20","20","What more can David say to You? For You know Your servant, O Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_21","011_7_21","2SA","7","21","21","For the sake of Your word and according to Your own heart, You have accomplished this great thing and revealed it to Your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_22","011_7_22","2SA","7","22","22","How great You are, O Lord GOD! For there is none like You, and there is no God but You, according to everything we have heard with our own ears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_23","011_7_23","2SA","7","23","23","And who is like Your people Israel—the one nation on earth whom God went out to redeem as a people for Himself and to make a name for Himself? You performed great and awesome wonders by driving out nations and their gods from before Your people, whom You redeemed for Yourself from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_24","011_7_24","2SA","7","24","24","For You have established Your people Israel as Your very own forever, and You, O LORD, have become their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_25","011_7_25","2SA","7","25","25","And now, O LORD God, confirm forever the word You have spoken concerning Your servant and his house. Do as You have promised, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_26","011_7_26","2SA","7","26","26","so that Your name will be magnified forever when it is said, ‘The LORD of Hosts is God over Israel.’ And the house of Your servant David will be established before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_27","011_7_27","2SA","7","27","27","For You, O LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, have revealed this to Your servant when You said, ‘I will build a house for you.’ Therefore Your servant has found the courage to offer this prayer to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_28","011_7_28","2SA","7","28","28","And now, O Lord GOD, You are God! Your words are true, and You have promised this goodness to Your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S27_29","011_7_29","2SA","7","29","29","Now therefore, may it please You to bless the house of Your servant, that it may continue forever before You. For You, O Lord GOD, have spoken, and with Your blessing the house of Your servant will be blessed forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_1","011_8_1","2SA","8","1","1","Some time later, David defeated the Philistines, subdued them, and took Metheg-ammah from the hand of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_2","011_8_2","2SA","8","2","2","David also defeated the Moabites, made them lie down on the ground, and measured them off with a cord. He measured off with two lengths those to be put to death, and with one length those to be spared. So the Moabites became subject to David and brought him tribute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_3","011_8_3","2SA","8","3","3","David also defeated Hadadezer son of Rehob, king of Zobah, who had marched out to restore his dominion along the Euphrates River. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_4","011_8_4","2SA","8","4","4","David captured from him a thousand chariots, seven thousand charioteers, and twenty thousand foot soldiers, and he hamstrung all the horses except a hundred he kept for the chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_5","011_8_5","2SA","8","5","5","When the Arameans of Damascus came to help King Hadadezer of Zobah, David struck down twenty-two thousand of their men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_6","011_8_6","2SA","8","6","6","Then he placed garrisons in Aram of Damascus, and the Arameans became subject to David and brought him tribute. So the LORD made David victorious wherever he went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_7","011_8_7","2SA","8","7","7","And David took the gold shields that belonged to the officers of Hadadezer and brought them to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_8","011_8_8","2SA","8","8","8","And from Betah and Berothai, cities of Hadadezer, King David took a large amount of bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_9","011_8_9","2SA","8","9","9","When King Toi of Hamath heard that David had defeated the entire army of Hadadezer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_10","011_8_10","2SA","8","10","10","he sent his son Joram to greet King David and bless him for fighting and defeating Hadadezer, who had been at war with Toi. Joram brought with him articles of silver and gold and bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_11","011_8_11","2SA","8","11","11","and King David dedicated these to the LORD, along with the silver and gold he had dedicated from all the nations he had subdued— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_12","011_8_12","2SA","8","12","12","from Edom and Moab, from the Ammonites and Philistines and Amalekites, and from the spoil of Hadadezer son of Rehob, king of Zobah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_13","011_8_13","2SA","8","13","13","And David made a name for himself when he returned from striking down eighteen thousand Edomites in the Valley of Salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_14","011_8_14","2SA","8","14","14","He placed garrisons throughout Edom, and all the Edomites were subject to David. So the LORD made David victorious wherever he went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_15","011_8_15","2SA","8","15","15","Thus David reigned over all Israel and administered justice and righteousness for all his people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_16","011_8_16","2SA","8","16","16","Joab son of Zeruiah was over the army; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_17","011_8_17","2SA","8","17","17","Zadok son of Ahitub and Ahimelech son of Abiathar were priests; Seraiah was the scribe; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S28_18","011_8_18","2SA","8","18","18","Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; and David’s sons were priestly leaders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_1","011_9_1","2SA","9","1","1","Then David asked, “Is there anyone left from the house of Saul to whom I can show kindness for the sake of Jonathan?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_2","011_9_2","2SA","9","2","2","And there was a servant of the house of Saul named Ziba. They summoned him to David, and the king inquired, “Are you Ziba?” “I am your servant,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_3","011_9_3","2SA","9","3","3","So the king asked, “Is there anyone left of the house of Saul to whom I can show the kindness of God?” Ziba answered, “There is still Jonathan’s son, who is lame in both feet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_4","011_9_4","2SA","9","4","4","“Where is he?” replied the king. And Ziba said, “Indeed, he is in Lo-debar at the house of Machir son of Ammiel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_5","011_9_5","2SA","9","5","5","So King David had him brought from the house of Machir son of Ammiel in Lo-debar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_6","011_9_6","2SA","9","6","6","And when Mephibosheth son of Jonathan, the son of Saul, came to David, he fell facedown in reverence. Then David said, “Mephibosheth!” “I am your servant,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_7","011_9_7","2SA","9","7","7","“Do not be afraid,” said David, “for surely I will show you kindness for the sake of your father Jonathan. I will restore to you all the land of your grandfather Saul, and you will always eat at my table.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_8","011_9_8","2SA","9","8","8","Mephibosheth bowed down and said, “What is your servant, that you should show regard for a dead dog like me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_9","011_9_9","2SA","9","9","9","Then the king summoned Saul’s servant Ziba and said to him, “I have given to your master’s grandson all that belonged to Saul and to all his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_10","011_9_10","2SA","9","10","10","You and your sons and servants are to work the ground for him and bring in the harvest, so that your master’s grandson may have food to eat. But Mephibosheth, your master’s grandson, is always to eat at my table.” Now Ziba had fifteen sons and twenty servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_11","011_9_11","2SA","9","11","11","And Ziba said to the king, “Your servant will do all that my lord the king has commanded.” So Mephibosheth ate at David’s table like one of the king’s own sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_12","011_9_12","2SA","9","12","12","And Mephibosheth had a young son named Mica, and all who dwelt in the house of Ziba were servants of Mephibosheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S29_13","011_9_13","2SA","9","13","13","So Mephibosheth lived in Jerusalem, because he always ate at the king’s table, and he was lame in both feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_1","011_10_1","2SA","10","1","1","Some time later, the king of the Ammonites died and was succeeded by his son Hanun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_2","011_10_2","2SA","10","2","2","And David said, “I will show kindness to Hanun son of Nahash, just as his father showed kindness to me.” So David sent some of his servants to console Hanun concerning his father. But when they arrived in the land of the Ammonites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_3","011_10_3","2SA","10","3","3","the princes of the Ammonites said to Hanun their lord, “Just because David has sent you comforters, do you really believe he is showing respect for your father? Has not David instead sent his servants to explore the city, spy it out, and overthrow it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_4","011_10_4","2SA","10","4","4","So Hanun took David’s servants, shaved off half of each man’s beard, cut off their garments at the hips, and sent them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_5","011_10_5","2SA","10","5","5","When this was reported to David, he sent messengers to meet the men, since they had been thoroughly humiliated. The king told them, “Stay in Jericho until your beards have grown back, and then return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_6","011_10_6","2SA","10","6","6","When the Ammonites realized that they had become a stench to David, they hired twenty thousand Aramean foot soldiers from Beth-rehob and Zoba, as well as a thousand men from the king of Maacah and twelve thousand men from Tob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_7","011_10_7","2SA","10","7","7","On hearing this, David sent Joab and the entire army of mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_8","011_10_8","2SA","10","8","8","The Ammonites marched out and arrayed themselves for battle at the entrance of the city gate, while the Arameans of Zobah and Rehob and the men of Tob and Maacah were by themselves in the open country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_9","011_10_9","2SA","10","9","9","When Joab saw the battle lines before him and behind him, he selected some of the best men of Israel and arrayed them against the Arameans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_10","011_10_10","2SA","10","10","10","And he placed the rest of the troops under the command of his brother Abishai, who arrayed them against the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_11","011_10_11","2SA","10","11","11","“If the Arameans are too strong for me,” said Joab, “then you will come to my rescue. And if the Ammonites are too strong for you, then I will come to your rescue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_12","011_10_12","2SA","10","12","12","Be strong and let us fight bravely for our people and for the cities of our God. May the LORD do what is good in His sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_13","011_10_13","2SA","10","13","13","So Joab and his troops advanced to fight the Arameans, who fled before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_14","011_10_14","2SA","10","14","14","When the Ammonites saw that the Arameans had fled, they too fled before Abishai, and they entered the city. So Joab returned from fighting against the Ammonites and came to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_15","011_10_15","2SA","10","15","15","When the Arameans saw that they had been defeated by Israel, they regrouped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_16","011_10_16","2SA","10","16","16","Hadadezer sent messengers to bring more Arameans from beyond the Euphrates, and they came to Helam with Shobach the commander of Hadadezer’s army leading them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_17","011_10_17","2SA","10","17","17","When this was reported to David, he gathered all Israel, crossed the Jordan, and went to Helam. Then the Arameans arrayed themselves against David and fought against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_18","011_10_18","2SA","10","18","18","But the Arameans fled before Israel, and David killed seven hundred charioteers and forty thousand foot soldiers. He also struck down Shobach the commander of their army, who died there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S210_19","011_10_19","2SA","10","19","19","When all the kings who were subject to Hadadezer saw that they had been defeated by Israel, they made peace with Israel and became subject to them. So the Arameans were afraid to help the Ammonites anymore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_1","011_11_1","2SA","11","1","1","In the spring, at the time when kings march out to war, David sent out Joab and his servants with the whole army of Israel. They destroyed the Ammonites and besieged Rabbah, but David remained in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_2","011_11_2","2SA","11","2","2","One evening David got up from his bed and strolled around on the roof of the palace. And from the roof he saw a woman bathing—a very beautiful woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_3","011_11_3","2SA","11","3","3","So David sent and inquired about the woman, and he was told, “This is Bathsheba, the daughter of Eliam and the wife of Uriah the Hittite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_4","011_11_4","2SA","11","4","4","Then David sent messengers to get her, and when she came to him, he slept with her. (Now she had just purified herself from her uncleanness.) Then she returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_5","011_11_5","2SA","11","5","5","And the woman conceived and sent word to David, saying, “I am pregnant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_6","011_11_6","2SA","11","6","6","At this, David sent orders to Joab: “Send me Uriah the Hittite.” So Joab sent him to David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_7","011_11_7","2SA","11","7","7","When Uriah came to him, David asked how Joab and the troops were doing and how the war was going. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_8","011_11_8","2SA","11","8","8","Then he said to Uriah, “Go down to your house and wash your feet.” So Uriah left the palace, and a gift from the king followed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_9","011_11_9","2SA","11","9","9","But Uriah slept at the door of the palace with all his master’s servants; he did not go down to his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_10","011_11_10","2SA","11","10","10","And David was told, “Uriah did not go home.” “Haven’t you just arrived from a journey?” David asked Uriah. “Why didn’t you go home?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_11","011_11_11","2SA","11","11","11","Uriah answered, “The ark and Israel and Judah are dwelling in tents, and my master Joab and his soldiers are camped in the open field. How can I go to my house to eat and drink and sleep with my wife? As surely as you live, and as your soul lives, I will not do such a thing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_12","011_11_12","2SA","11","12","12","“Stay here one more day,” David said to Uriah, “and tomorrow I will send you back.” So Uriah stayed in Jerusalem that day and the next. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_13","011_11_13","2SA","11","13","13","Then David invited Uriah to eat and drink with him, and he got Uriah drunk. And in the evening Uriah went out to lie down on his cot with his master’s servants, but he did not go home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_14","011_11_14","2SA","11","14","14","The next morning David wrote a letter to Joab and sent it with Uriah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_15","011_11_15","2SA","11","15","15","In the letter he wrote: “Put Uriah at the front of the fiercest battle; then withdraw from him, so that he may be struck down and killed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_16","011_11_16","2SA","11","16","16","So as Joab besieged the city, he assigned Uriah to a place where he knew the strongest enemy soldiers were. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_17","011_11_17","2SA","11","17","17","And when the men of the city came out and fought against Joab, some of David’s servants fell, and Uriah the Hittite also died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_18","011_11_18","2SA","11","18","18","Joab sent to David a full account of the battle ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_19","011_11_19","2SA","11","19","19","and instructed the messenger, “When you have finished giving the king a full account of the battle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_20","011_11_20","2SA","11","20","20","if the king’s anger flares, he may ask you, ‘Why did you get so close to the city to fight? Did you not realize they would shoot from atop the wall? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_21","011_11_21","2SA","11","21","21","Who struck Abimelech son of Jerubbesheth? Was it not a woman who dropped an upper millstone on him from the wall, so that he died in Thebez? Why did you get so close to the wall?’ If he asks you this, then you are to say, ‘Your servant Uriah the Hittite is dead as well.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_22","011_11_22","2SA","11","22","22","So the messenger set out and reported to David all that Joab had sent him to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_23","011_11_23","2SA","11","23","23","The messenger said to David, “The men overpowered us and came out against us in the field, but we drove them back to the entrance of the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_24","011_11_24","2SA","11","24","24","Then the archers shot at your servants from the wall, and some of the king’s servants were killed. And your servant Uriah the Hittite is dead as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_25","011_11_25","2SA","11","25","25","Then David told the messenger, “Say this to Joab: ‘Do not let this matter upset you, for the sword devours one as well as another. Strengthen your attack against the city and demolish it.’ Encourage him with these words.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_26","011_11_26","2SA","11","26","26","When Uriah’s wife heard that her husband was dead, she mourned for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S211_27","011_11_27","2SA","11","27","27","And when the time of mourning was over, David had her brought to his house, and she became his wife and bore him a son. But the thing that David had done was evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_1","011_12_1","2SA","12","1","1","Then the LORD sent Nathan to David, and when he arrived, he said, “There were two men in a certain city, one rich and the other poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_2","011_12_2","2SA","12","2","2","The rich man had a great number of sheep and cattle, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_3","011_12_3","2SA","12","3","3","but the poor man had nothing except one small ewe lamb that he had bought. He raised it, and it grew up with him and his children. It shared his food and drank from his cup; it slept in his arms and was like a daughter to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_4","011_12_4","2SA","12","4","4","Now a traveler came to the rich man, who refrained from taking one of his own sheep or cattle to prepare for the traveler who had come to him. Instead, he took the poor man’s lamb and prepared it for his guest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_5","011_12_5","2SA","12","5","5","David burned with anger against the man and said to Nathan: “As surely as the LORD lives, the man who did this deserves to die! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_6","011_12_6","2SA","12","6","6","Because he has done this thing and has shown no pity, he must pay for the lamb four times over.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_7","011_12_7","2SA","12","7","7","Then Nathan said to David, “You are that man! This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I anointed you king over Israel, and I delivered you from the hand of Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_8","011_12_8","2SA","12","8","8","I gave your master’s house to you and your master’s wives into your arms. I gave you the house of Israel and Judah, and if that was not enough, I would have given you even more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_9","011_12_9","2SA","12","9","9","Why then have you despised the command of the LORD by doing evil in His sight? You put Uriah the Hittite to the sword and took his wife as your own. You have slain him with the sword of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_10","011_12_10","2SA","12","10","10","Now, therefore, the sword will never depart from your house, because you have despised Me and have taken the wife of Uriah the Hittite to be your own.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_11","011_12_11","2SA","12","11","11","This is what the LORD says: ‘I will raise up adversity against you from your own house. Before your very eyes I will take your wives and give them to another, and he will lie with them in broad daylight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_12","011_12_12","2SA","12","12","12","You have acted in secret, but I will do this thing in broad daylight before all Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_13","011_12_13","2SA","12","13","13","Then David said to Nathan, “I have sinned against the LORD.” “The LORD has taken away your sin,” Nathan replied. “You will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_14","011_12_14","2SA","12","14","14","Nevertheless, because by this deed you have shown utter contempt for the word of the LORD, the son born to you will surely die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_15","011_12_15","2SA","12","15","15","After Nathan had gone home, the LORD struck the child that Uriah’s wife had borne to David, and he became ill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_16","011_12_16","2SA","12","16","16","David pleaded with God for the boy. He fasted and went into his house and spent the night lying in sackcloth on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_17","011_12_17","2SA","12","17","17","The elders of his household stood beside him to help him up from the ground, but he was unwilling and would not eat anything with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_18","011_12_18","2SA","12","18","18","On the seventh day the child died. But David’s servants were afraid to tell him that the child was dead, for they said, “Look, while the child was alive, we spoke to him, and he would not listen to us. So how can we tell him the child is dead? He may even harm himself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_19","011_12_19","2SA","12","19","19","When David saw that his servants were whispering to one another, he perceived that the child was dead. So he asked his servants, “Is the child dead?” “He is dead,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_20","011_12_20","2SA","12","20","20","Then David got up from the ground, washed and anointed himself, changed his clothes, and went into the house of the LORD and worshiped. Then he went to his own house, and at his request they set food before him, and he ate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_21","011_12_21","2SA","12","21","21","“What is this you have done?” his servants asked. “While the child was alive, you fasted and wept, but when he died, you got up and ate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_22","011_12_22","2SA","12","22","22","David answered, “While the child was alive, I fasted and wept, for I said, ‘Who knows? The LORD may be gracious to me and let him live.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_23","011_12_23","2SA","12","23","23","But now that he is dead, why should I fast? Can I bring him back again? I will go to him, but he will not return to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_24","011_12_24","2SA","12","24","24","Then David comforted his wife Bathsheba, and he went to her and lay with her. So she gave birth to a son, and they named him Solomon. Now the LORD loved the child ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_25","011_12_25","2SA","12","25","25","and sent word through Nathan the prophet to name him Jedidiah because the LORD loved him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_26","011_12_26","2SA","12","26","26","Meanwhile, Joab fought against Rabbah of the Ammonites and captured the royal fortress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_27","011_12_27","2SA","12","27","27","Then Joab sent messengers to David to say, “I have fought against Rabbah and have captured the water supply of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_28","011_12_28","2SA","12","28","28","Now, therefore, assemble the rest of the troops, lay siege to the city, and capture it. Otherwise I will capture the city, and it will be named after me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_29","011_12_29","2SA","12","29","29","So David assembled all the troops and went to Rabbah; and he fought against it and captured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_30","011_12_30","2SA","12","30","30","Then he took the crown from the head of their king. It weighed a talent of gold and was set with precious stones, and it was placed on David’s head. And David took a great amount of plunder from the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S212_31","011_12_31","2SA","12","31","31","David brought out the people who were there and put them to work with saws, iron picks, and axes, and he made them work at the brick kilns. He did the same to all the Ammonite cities. Then David and all his troops returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_1","011_13_1","2SA","13","1","1","After some time, David’s son Amnon fell in love with Tamar, the beautiful sister of David’s son Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_2","011_13_2","2SA","13","2","2","Amnon was sick with frustration over his sister Tamar, for she was a virgin, and it seemed implausible for him to do anything to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_3","011_13_3","2SA","13","3","3","Now Amnon had a friend named Jonadab, the son of David’s brother Shimeah. Jonadab was a very shrewd man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_4","011_13_4","2SA","13","4","4","and he asked Amnon, “Why are you, the son of the king, so depressed morning after morning? Won’t you tell me?” Amnon replied, “I am in love with Tamar, my brother Absalom’s sister.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_5","011_13_5","2SA","13","5","5","Jonadab told him, “Lie down on your bed and pretend you are ill. When your father comes to see you, say to him, ‘Please let my sister Tamar come and give me something to eat. Let her prepare it in my sight so I may watch her and eat it from her hand.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_6","011_13_6","2SA","13","6","6","So Amnon lay down and feigned illness. When the king came to see him, Amnon said, “Please let my sister Tamar come and make a couple of cakes in my sight, so that I may eat from her hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_7","011_13_7","2SA","13","7","7","Then David sent word to Tamar at the palace: “Please go to the house of Amnon your brother and prepare a meal for him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_8","011_13_8","2SA","13","8","8","So Tamar went to the house of her brother Amnon, who was lying down. She took some dough, kneaded it, made cakes in his sight, and baked them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_9","011_13_9","2SA","13","9","9","Then she brought the pan and set it down before him, but he refused to eat. “Send everyone away!” said Amnon. And everyone went out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_10","011_13_10","2SA","13","10","10","Then Amnon said to Tamar, “Bring the food into the bedroom, so that I may eat it from your hand.” Tamar took the cakes she had made and went to her brother Amnon’s bedroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_11","011_13_11","2SA","13","11","11","And when she had brought them to him to eat, he took hold of her and said, “Come lie with me, my sister!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_12","011_13_12","2SA","13","12","12","“No, my brother!” she cried. “Do not violate me, for such a thing should never be done in Israel. Do not do this disgraceful thing! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_13","011_13_13","2SA","13","13","13","Where could I ever take my shame? And you would be like one of the fools in Israel! Please speak to the king, for he will not withhold me from you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_14","011_13_14","2SA","13","14","14","But Amnon refused to listen to her, and being stronger, he violated her and lay with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_15","011_13_15","2SA","13","15","15","Then Amnon hated Tamar with such intensity that his hatred was greater than the love he previously had. “Get up!” he said to her. “Be gone!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_16","011_13_16","2SA","13","16","16","“No,” she replied, “sending me away is worse than this great wrong you have already done to me!” But he refused to listen to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_17","011_13_17","2SA","13","17","17","Instead, he called to his attendant and said, “Throw this woman out and bolt the door behind her!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_18","011_13_18","2SA","13","18","18","So Amnon’s attendant threw her out and bolted the door behind her. Now Tamar was wearing a robe of many colors, because this is what the king’s virgin daughters wore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_19","011_13_19","2SA","13","19","19","And Tamar put ashes on her head and tore her robe. And putting her hand on her head, she went away crying aloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_20","011_13_20","2SA","13","20","20","Her brother Absalom said to her, “Has your brother Amnon been with you? Be quiet for now, my sister. He is your brother. Do not take this thing to heart.” So Tamar lived as a desolate woman in the house of her brother Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_21","011_13_21","2SA","13","21","21","When King David heard all this, he was furious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_22","011_13_22","2SA","13","22","22","And Absalom never said a word to Amnon, either good or bad, because he hated Amnon for violating his sister Tamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_23","011_13_23","2SA","13","23","23","Two years later, when Absalom’s sheepshearers were at Baal-hazor near Ephraim, he invited all the sons of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_24","011_13_24","2SA","13","24","24","And he went to the king and said, “Your servant has just hired shearers. Will the king and his servants please come with me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_25","011_13_25","2SA","13","25","25","“No, my son,” the king replied, “we should not all go, or we would be a burden to you.” Although Absalom urged him, he was not willing to go, but gave him his blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_26","011_13_26","2SA","13","26","26","“If not,” said Absalom, “please let my brother Amnon go with us.” “Why should he go with you?” the king asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_27","011_13_27","2SA","13","27","27","But Absalom urged him, so the king sent Amnon and the rest of his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_28","011_13_28","2SA","13","28","28","Now Absalom had ordered his young men, “Watch Amnon until his heart is merry with wine, and when I order you to strike Amnon down, you are to kill him. Do not be afraid. Have I not commanded you? Be courageous and valiant!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_29","011_13_29","2SA","13","29","29","So Absalom’s young men did to Amnon just as Absalom had ordered. Then all the other sons of the king got up, and each one fled on his mule. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_30","011_13_30","2SA","13","30","30","While they were on the way, a report reached David: “Absalom has struck down all the sons of the king; not one of them is left!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_31","011_13_31","2SA","13","31","31","Then the king stood up, tore his clothes, and lay down on the ground. And all his servants stood by with their clothes torn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_32","011_13_32","2SA","13","32","32","But Jonadab, the son of David’s brother Shimeah, spoke up: “My lord must not think they have killed all the sons of the king, for only Amnon is dead. In fact, Absalom has planned this since the day Amnon violated his sister Tamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_33","011_13_33","2SA","13","33","33","So now, my lord the king, do not take to heart the report that all the sons of the king are dead. Only Amnon is dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_34","011_13_34","2SA","13","34","34","Meanwhile, Absalom had fled. When the young man standing watch looked up, he saw many people coming down the road west of him, along the side of the hill. And the watchman went and reported to the king, “I see men coming from the direction of Horonaim, along the side of the hill.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_35","011_13_35","2SA","13","35","35","So Jonadab said to the king, “Look, the sons of the king have arrived! It is just as your servant said.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_36","011_13_36","2SA","13","36","36","And as he finished speaking, the sons of the king came in, wailing loudly. Then the king and all his servants also wept very bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_37","011_13_37","2SA","13","37","37","Now Absalom fled and went to Talmai son of Ammihud, the king of Geshur. But David mourned for his son every day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_38","011_13_38","2SA","13","38","38","After Absalom had fled and gone to Geshur, he stayed there three years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S213_39","011_13_39","2SA","13","39","39","And King David longed to go to Absalom, for he had been consoled over Amnon’s death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_1","011_14_1","2SA","14","1","1","Now Joab son of Zeruiah perceived that the king’s heart longed for Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_2","011_14_2","2SA","14","2","2","So Joab sent to Tekoa to bring a wise woman from there. He told her, “Please pretend to be a mourner; put on clothes for mourning and do not anoint yourself with oil. Act like a woman who has mourned for the dead a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_3","011_14_3","2SA","14","3","3","Then go to the king and speak these words to him.” And Joab put the words in her mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_4","011_14_4","2SA","14","4","4","When the woman from Tekoa went to the king, she fell facedown in homage and said, “Help me, O king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_5","011_14_5","2SA","14","5","5","“What troubles you?” the king asked her. “Indeed,” she said, “I am a widow, for my husband is dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_6","011_14_6","2SA","14","6","6","And your maidservant had two sons who were fighting in the field with no one to separate them, and one struck the other and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_7","011_14_7","2SA","14","7","7","Now the whole clan has risen up against your maidservant and said, ‘Hand over the one who struck down his brother, that we may put him to death for the life of the brother whom he killed. Then we will cut off the heir as well!’ So they would extinguish my one remaining ember by not preserving my husband’s name or posterity on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_8","011_14_8","2SA","14","8","8","“Go home,” the king said to the woman, “and I will give orders on your behalf.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_9","011_14_9","2SA","14","9","9","But the woman of Tekoa said to the king, “My lord the king, may any blame be on me and on my father’s house, and may the king and his throne be guiltless.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_10","011_14_10","2SA","14","10","10","“If anyone speaks to you,” said the king, “bring him to me, and he will not trouble you again!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_11","011_14_11","2SA","14","11","11","“Please,” she replied, “may the king invoke the LORD your God to prevent the avenger of blood from increasing the devastation, so that my son may not be destroyed!” “As surely as the LORD lives,” he vowed, “not a hair of your son’s head will fall to the ground.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_12","011_14_12","2SA","14","12","12","Then the woman said, “Please, may your servant speak a word to my lord the king?” “Speak,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_13","011_14_13","2SA","14","13","13","The woman asked, “Why have you devised a thing like this against the people of God? When the king says this, does he not convict himself, since he has not brought back his own banished son? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_14","011_14_14","2SA","14","14","14","For we will surely die and be like water poured out on the ground, which cannot be recovered. Yet God does not take away a life, but He devises ways that the banished one may not be cast out from Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_15","011_14_15","2SA","14","15","15","Now therefore, I have come to present this matter to my lord the king because the people have made me afraid. Your servant thought, ‘I will speak to the king. Perhaps he will grant the request of his maidservant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_16","011_14_16","2SA","14","16","16","For the king will hear and deliver his maidservant from the hand of the man who would cut off both me and my son from God’s inheritance.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_17","011_14_17","2SA","14","17","17","And now your servant says, ‘May the word of my lord the king bring me rest, for my lord the king is able to discern good and evil, just like the angel of God. May the LORD your God be with you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_18","011_14_18","2SA","14","18","18","Then the king said to the woman, “I am going to ask you something; do not conceal it from me!” “Let my lord the king speak,” she replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_19","011_14_19","2SA","14","19","19","So the king asked, “Is the hand of Joab behind all this?” The woman answered, “As surely as you live, my lord the king, no one can turn to the right or to the left from anything that my lord the king says. Yes, your servant Joab is the one who gave me orders; he told your maidservant exactly what to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_20","011_14_20","2SA","14","20","20","Joab your servant has done this to bring about this change of affairs, but my lord has wisdom like the wisdom of the angel of God, to know everything that happens in the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_21","011_14_21","2SA","14","21","21","Then the king said to Joab, “I hereby grant this request. Go, bring back the young man Absalom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_22","011_14_22","2SA","14","22","22","Joab fell facedown in homage and blessed the king. “Today,” said Joab, “your servant knows that he has found favor in your eyes, my lord the king, because the king has granted his request.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_23","011_14_23","2SA","14","23","23","So Joab got up, went to Geshur, and brought Absalom to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_24","011_14_24","2SA","14","24","24","But the king added, “He may return to his house, but he must not see my face.” So Absalom returned to his own house, but he did not see the face of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_25","011_14_25","2SA","14","25","25","Now there was not a man in all Israel as handsome and highly praised as Absalom. From the sole of his foot to the top of his head, he did not have a single flaw. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_26","011_14_26","2SA","14","26","26","And when he cut the hair of his head—he shaved it every year because his hair got so heavy—he would weigh it out to be two hundred shekels, according to the royal standard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_27","011_14_27","2SA","14","27","27","Three sons were born to Absalom, and a daughter named Tamar, who was a beautiful woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_28","011_14_28","2SA","14","28","28","Now Absalom lived in Jerusalem two years without seeing the face of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_29","011_14_29","2SA","14","29","29","Then he sent for Joab to send him to the king, but Joab refused to come to him. So Absalom sent a second time, but Joab still would not come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_30","011_14_30","2SA","14","30","30","Then Absalom said to his servants, “Look, Joab’s field is next to mine, and he has barley there. Go and set it on fire!” And Absalom’s servants set the field on fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_31","011_14_31","2SA","14","31","31","Then Joab came to Absalom’s house and demanded, “Why did your servants set my field on fire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_32","011_14_32","2SA","14","32","32","“Look,” said Absalom, “I sent for you and said, ‘Come here. I want to send you to the king to ask: Why have I come back from Geshur? It would be better for me if I were still there.’ So now, let me see the king’s face, and if there is iniquity in me, let him kill me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S214_33","011_14_33","2SA","14","33","33","So Joab went and told the king, and David summoned Absalom, who came to him and bowed facedown before him. Then the king kissed Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_1","011_15_1","2SA","15","1","1","Some time later, Absalom provided for himself a chariot with horses and fifty men to run ahead of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_2","011_15_2","2SA","15","2","2","He would get up early and stand beside the road leading to the city gate. Whenever anyone had a grievance to bring before the king for a decision, Absalom would call out and ask, “What city are you from?” And if he replied, “Your servant is from one of the tribes of Israel,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_3","011_15_3","2SA","15","3","3","Absalom would say, “Look, your claims are good and right, but the king has no deputy to hear you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_4","011_15_4","2SA","15","4","4","And he would add, “If only someone would appoint me judge in the land, then everyone with a grievance or dispute could come to me, and I would give him justice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_5","011_15_5","2SA","15","5","5","Also, when anyone approached to bow down to him, Absalom would reach out his hand, take hold of him, and kiss him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_6","011_15_6","2SA","15","6","6","Absalom did this to all the Israelites who came to the king for justice. In this way he stole the hearts of the men of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_7","011_15_7","2SA","15","7","7","After four years had passed, Absalom said to the king, “Please let me go to Hebron to fulfill a vow I have made to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_8","011_15_8","2SA","15","8","8","For your servant made a vow while dwelling in Geshur of Aram, saying: ‘If indeed the LORD brings me back to Jerusalem, I will worship the LORD in Hebron.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_9","011_15_9","2SA","15","9","9","“Go in peace,” said the king. So Absalom got up and went to Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_10","011_15_10","2SA","15","10","10","Then Absalom sent spies throughout the tribes of Israel with this message: “When you hear the sound of the horn, you are to say, ‘Absalom reigns in Hebron!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_11","011_15_11","2SA","15","11","11","Two hundred men from Jerusalem accompanied Absalom. They had been invited as guests and they went along innocently, for they knew nothing about the matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_12","011_15_12","2SA","15","12","12","While Absalom was offering the sacrifices, he sent for Ahithophel the Gilonite, David’s counselor, to come from his hometown of Giloh. So the conspiracy gained strength, and Absalom’s following kept increasing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_13","011_15_13","2SA","15","13","13","Then a messenger came to David and reported, “The hearts of the men of Israel are with Absalom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_14","011_15_14","2SA","15","14","14","And David said to all the servants with him in Jerusalem, “Arise and let us flee, or we will not escape from Absalom! We must leave quickly, or he will soon overtake us, heap disaster on us, and put the city to the sword.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_15","011_15_15","2SA","15","15","15","The king’s servants replied, “Whatever our lord the king decides, we are your servants.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_16","011_15_16","2SA","15","16","16","Then the king set out, and his entire household followed him. But he left behind ten concubines to take care of the palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_17","011_15_17","2SA","15","17","17","So the king set out with all the people following him. He stopped at the last house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_18","011_15_18","2SA","15","18","18","and all his servants marched past him—all the Cherethites and Pelethites, and six hundred Gittites who had followed him from Gath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_19","011_15_19","2SA","15","19","19","Then the king said to Ittai the Gittite, “Why should you also go with us? Go back and stay with the new king, since you are both a foreigner and an exile from your homeland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_20","011_15_20","2SA","15","20","20","In fact, you arrived only yesterday; should I make you wander around with us today while I do not know where I am going? Go back and take your brothers with you. May the LORD show you loving devotion and faithfulness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_21","011_15_21","2SA","15","21","21","But Ittai answered the king, “As surely as the LORD lives, and as my lord the king lives, wherever my lord the king may be, whether it means life or death, there will your servant be!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_22","011_15_22","2SA","15","22","22","“March on then,” said David to Ittai. So Ittai the Gittite marched past with all his men and all the little ones who were with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_23","011_15_23","2SA","15","23","23","Everyone in the countryside was weeping loudly as all the people passed by. And as the king crossed the Kidron Valley, all the people also passed toward the way of the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_24","011_15_24","2SA","15","24","24","Zadok was also there, and all the Levites with him were carrying the ark of the covenant of God. And they set down the ark of God, and Abiathar offered sacrifices until all the people had passed out of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_25","011_15_25","2SA","15","25","25","Then the king said to Zadok, “Return the ark of God to the city. If I find favor in the eyes of the LORD, He will bring me back and let me see both it and His dwelling place again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_26","011_15_26","2SA","15","26","26","But if He should say, ‘I do not delight in you,’ then here I am; let Him do to me whatever seems good to Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_27","011_15_27","2SA","15","27","27","The king also said to Zadok the priest, “Are you not a seer? Return to the city in peace—you with your son Ahimaaz, and Abiathar with his son Jonathan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_28","011_15_28","2SA","15","28","28","See, I will wait at the fords of the wilderness until word comes from you to inform me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_29","011_15_29","2SA","15","29","29","So Zadok and Abiathar returned the ark of God to Jerusalem and stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_30","011_15_30","2SA","15","30","30","But David continued up the Mount of Olives, weeping as he went up. His head was covered, and he was walking barefoot. And all the people with him covered their heads and went up, weeping as they went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_31","011_15_31","2SA","15","31","31","Now someone told David: “Ahithophel is among the conspirators with Absalom.” So David pleaded, “O LORD, please turn the counsel of Ahithophel into foolishness!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_32","011_15_32","2SA","15","32","32","When David came to the summit, where he used to worship God, Hushai the Archite was there to meet him with his robe torn and dust on his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_33","011_15_33","2SA","15","33","33","David said to him, “If you go on with me, you will be a burden to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_34","011_15_34","2SA","15","34","34","But you can thwart the counsel of Ahithophel for me if you return to the city and say to Absalom: ‘I will be your servant, my king; in the past I was your father’s servant, but now I will be your servant.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_35","011_15_35","2SA","15","35","35","Will not Zadok and Abiathar the priests be there with you? Report to them everything you hear from the king’s palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_36","011_15_36","2SA","15","36","36","Indeed, their two sons, Ahimaaz son of Zadok and Jonathan son of Abiathar, are there with them. Send them to me with everything you hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S215_37","011_15_37","2SA","15","37","37","So David’s friend Hushai arrived in Jerusalem just as Absalom was entering the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_1","011_16_1","2SA","16","1","1","When David had gone a little beyond the summit, Ziba the servant of Mephibosheth was there to meet him. He had a pair of saddled donkeys loaded with two hundred loaves of bread, a hundred clusters of raisins, a hundred summer fruits, and a skin of wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_2","011_16_2","2SA","16","2","2","“Why do you have these?” asked the king. Ziba replied, “The donkeys are for the king’s household to ride, the bread and summer fruit are for the young men to eat, and the wine is to refresh those who become exhausted in the wilderness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_3","011_16_3","2SA","16","3","3","“Where is your master’s grandson?” asked the king. And Ziba answered, “Indeed, he is staying in Jerusalem, for he has said, ‘Today, the house of Israel will restore to me the kingdom of my grandfather.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_4","011_16_4","2SA","16","4","4","So the king said to Ziba, “All that belongs to Mephibosheth is now yours!” “I humbly bow before you,” said Ziba. “May I find favor in your eyes, my lord the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_5","011_16_5","2SA","16","5","5","As King David approached Bahurim, a man from the family of the house of Saul was just coming out. His name was Shimei son of Gera, and as he approached, he kept yelling out curses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_6","011_16_6","2SA","16","6","6","He threw stones at David and at all the servants of the king, though the troops and all the mighty men were on David’s right and left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_7","011_16_7","2SA","16","7","7","And as he yelled curses, Shimei said, “Get out, get out, you worthless man of bloodshed! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_8","011_16_8","2SA","16","8","8","The LORD has paid you back for all the blood of the house of Saul, in whose place you have reigned, and the LORD has delivered the kingdom into the hand of your son Absalom. See, you have come to ruin because you are a man of bloodshed!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_9","011_16_9","2SA","16","9","9","Then Abishai son of Zeruiah said to the king, “Why should this dead dog curse my lord the king? Let me go over and cut off his head!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_10","011_16_10","2SA","16","10","10","But the king replied, “What have I to do with you, O sons of Zeruiah? If he curses me because the LORD told him, ‘Curse David,’ who can ask, ‘Why did you do this?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_11","011_16_11","2SA","16","11","11","Then David said to Abishai and to all his servants, “Behold, my own son, my own flesh and blood, seeks my life. How much more, then, this Benjamite! Leave him alone and let him curse me, for the LORD has told him so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_12","011_16_12","2SA","16","12","12","Perhaps the LORD will see my affliction and repay me with good for the cursing I receive today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_13","011_16_13","2SA","16","13","13","So David and his men proceeded along the road as Shimei went along the ridge of the hill opposite him. As Shimei went, he yelled curses, threw stones, and flung dust at David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_14","011_16_14","2SA","16","14","14","Finally, the king and all the people with him arrived, exhausted. And there he refreshed himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_15","011_16_15","2SA","16","15","15","Then Absalom and all the men of Israel came to Jerusalem, and Ahithophel was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_16","011_16_16","2SA","16","16","16","And David’s friend Hushai the Archite went to Absalom and said to him, “Long live the king! Long live the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_17","011_16_17","2SA","16","17","17","“Is this the loyalty you show your friend?” Absalom replied. “Why did you not go with your friend?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_18","011_16_18","2SA","16","18","18","“Not at all,” Hushai answered. “For the one chosen by the LORD, by this people, and by all the men of Israel—his I will be, and with him I will remain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_19","011_16_19","2SA","16","19","19","Furthermore, whom should I serve if not his son? As I served in your father’s presence, so also I will serve in yours.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_20","011_16_20","2SA","16","20","20","Then Absalom said to Ahithophel, “Give me counsel. What should we do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_21","011_16_21","2SA","16","21","21","Ahithophel replied, “Sleep with your father’s concubines, whom he has left to take care of the palace. When all Israel hears that you have become a stench to your father, then the hands of all who are with you will be strengthened.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_22","011_16_22","2SA","16","22","22","So they pitched a tent for Absalom on the roof, and he slept with his father’s concubines in the sight of all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S216_23","011_16_23","2SA","16","23","23","Now in those days the advice of Ahithophel was like the consultation of the word of God. Such was the regard that both David and Absalom had for Ahithophel’s advice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_1","011_17_1","2SA","17","1","1","Furthermore, Ahithophel said to Absalom, “Let me choose twelve thousand men and set out tonight in pursuit of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_2","011_17_2","2SA","17","2","2","I will attack him while he is weak and weary; I will throw him into a panic, and all the people with him will flee; I will strike down only the king ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_3","011_17_3","2SA","17","3","3","and bring all the people back to you as a bride returning to her husband. You seek the life of only one man; then all the people will be at peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_4","011_17_4","2SA","17","4","4","This proposal seemed good to Absalom and all the elders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_5","011_17_5","2SA","17","5","5","Then Absalom said, “Summon Hushai the Archite as well, and let us hear what he too has to say.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_6","011_17_6","2SA","17","6","6","So Hushai came to Absalom, who told him, “Ahithophel has spoken this proposal. Should we carry it out? If not, what do you say?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_7","011_17_7","2SA","17","7","7","Hushai replied, “This time the advice of Ahithophel is not sound.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_8","011_17_8","2SA","17","8","8","He continued, “You know your father and his men. They are mighty men, and as fierce as a wild bear robbed of her cubs. Moreover, your father is a man of war who will not spend the night with the troops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_9","011_17_9","2SA","17","9","9","Surely by now he is hiding in a cave or some other location. If some of your troops fall first, whoever hears of it will say, ‘There has been a slaughter among the troops who follow Absalom.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_10","011_17_10","2SA","17","10","10","Then even the most valiant soldier with the heart of a lion will melt with fear, because all Israel knows that your father is a mighty man who has valiant men with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_11","011_17_11","2SA","17","11","11","Instead, I advise that all Israel from Dan to Beersheba—a multitude like the sand on the seashore—be gathered to you, and that you yourself lead them into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_12","011_17_12","2SA","17","12","12","Then we will attack David wherever we find him, and we will descend on him like dew on the ground. And of all the men with him, not even one will remain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_13","011_17_13","2SA","17","13","13","If he retreats to a city, all Israel will bring ropes to that city, and we will drag it down to the valley until not even a pebble can be found there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_14","011_17_14","2SA","17","14","14","Then Absalom and all the men of Israel said, “The advice of Hushai the Archite is better than that of Ahithophel.” For the LORD had purposed to thwart the good counsel of Ahithophel in order to bring disaster on Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_15","011_17_15","2SA","17","15","15","So Hushai told Zadok and Abiathar, the priests, “This is what Ahithophel has advised Absalom and the elders of Israel, and this is what I have advised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_16","011_17_16","2SA","17","16","16","Now send quickly and tell David, ‘Do not spend the night at the fords of the wilderness, but be sure to cross over. Otherwise the king and all the people with him will be swallowed up.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_17","011_17_17","2SA","17","17","17","Now Jonathan and Ahimaaz were staying at En-rogel, where a servant girl would come and pass along information to them. They in turn would go and inform King David, for they dared not be seen entering the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_18","011_17_18","2SA","17","18","18","But a young man did see them and told Absalom. So the two left quickly and came to the house of a man in Bahurim. He had a well in his courtyard, and they climbed down into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_19","011_17_19","2SA","17","19","19","Then the man’s wife took a covering, spread it over the mouth of the well, and scattered grain over it so nobody would know a thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_20","011_17_20","2SA","17","20","20","When Absalom’s servants came to the woman at the house, they asked, “Where are Ahimaaz and Jonathan?” “They have crossed over the brook,” she replied. The men searched but did not find them, so they returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_21","011_17_21","2SA","17","21","21","After the men had gone, Ahimaaz and Jonathan climbed up out of the well and went to inform King David, saying, “Get up and cross over the river at once, for Ahithophel has given this advice against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_22","011_17_22","2SA","17","22","22","So David and all the people with him got up and crossed the Jordan. By daybreak, there was no one left who had not crossed the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_23","011_17_23","2SA","17","23","23","When Ahithophel saw that his advice had not been followed, he saddled his donkey and set out for his house in his hometown. He put his affairs in order and hanged himself. So he died and was buried in his father’s tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_24","011_17_24","2SA","17","24","24","Then David went to Mahanaim, and Absalom crossed the Jordan with all the men of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_25","011_17_25","2SA","17","25","25","Absalom had appointed Amasa over the army in place of Joab. Amasa was the son of a man named Ithra, the Ishmaelite who had married Abigail, the daughter of Nahash and sister of Zeruiah the mother of Joab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_26","011_17_26","2SA","17","26","26","So the Israelites and Absalom camped in the land of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_27","011_17_27","2SA","17","27","27","When David came to Mahanaim, he was met by Shobi son of Nahash from Rabbah of the Ammonites, Machir son of Ammiel from Lo-debar, and Barzillai the Gileadite from Rogelim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_28","011_17_28","2SA","17","28","28","They brought beds, basins, and earthen vessels, as well as wheat, barley, flour, roasted grain, beans, lentils, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S217_29","011_17_29","2SA","17","29","29","honey, curds, sheep, and cheese from the herd for David and his people to eat. For they said, “The people have become hungry, exhausted, and thirsty in the wilderness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_1","011_18_1","2SA","18","1","1","Then David reviewed his troops and appointed over them commanders of thousands and of hundreds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_2","011_18_2","2SA","18","2","2","He sent out the troops, a third under Joab, a third under Joab’s brother Abishai son of Zeruiah, and a third under Ittai the Gittite. And the king said to the troops, “I will surely march out with you as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_3","011_18_3","2SA","18","3","3","But the people pleaded, “You must not go out! For if we have to flee, they will not care about us. Even if half of us die, they will not care. But you are worth ten thousand of us. It is better now if you support us from the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_4","011_18_4","2SA","18","4","4","“I will do whatever seems best to you,” the king replied. So he stood beside the gate, while all the troops marched out by hundreds and by thousands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_5","011_18_5","2SA","18","5","5","Now the king had commanded Joab, Abishai, and Ittai, “Treat the young man Absalom gently for my sake.” And all the people heard the king’s orders to each of the commanders regarding Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_6","011_18_6","2SA","18","6","6","So David’s army marched into the field to engage Israel, and the battle took place in the forest of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_7","011_18_7","2SA","18","7","7","There the people of Israel were defeated by David’s servants, and the slaughter was great that day—twenty thousand men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_8","011_18_8","2SA","18","8","8","The battle spread over the whole countryside, and that day the forest devoured more people than the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_9","011_18_9","2SA","18","9","9","Now Absalom was riding on his mule when he met the servants of David, and as the mule went under the thick branches of a large oak, Absalom’s head was caught fast in the tree. The mule under him kept going, so that he was suspended in midair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_10","011_18_10","2SA","18","10","10","When one of the men saw this, he told Joab, “I just saw Absalom hanging in an oak tree!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_11","011_18_11","2SA","18","11","11","“You just saw him!” Joab exclaimed. “Why did you not strike him to the ground right there? I would have given you ten shekels of silver and a warrior’s belt!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_12","011_18_12","2SA","18","12","12","The man replied, “Even if a thousand shekels of silver were weighed out into my hands, I would not raise my hand against the son of the king. For we heard the king command you and Abishai and Ittai, ‘Protect the young man Absalom for my sake.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_13","011_18_13","2SA","18","13","13","If I had jeopardized my own life—and nothing is hidden from the king—you would have abandoned me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_14","011_18_14","2SA","18","14","14","But Joab declared, “I am not going to wait like this with you!” And he took three spears in his hand and thrust them through the heart of Absalom while he was still alive in the oak tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_15","011_18_15","2SA","18","15","15","And ten young men who carried Joab’s armor surrounded Absalom, struck him, and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_16","011_18_16","2SA","18","16","16","Then Joab blew the ram’s horn, and the troops broke off their pursuit of Israel because Joab had restrained them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_17","011_18_17","2SA","18","17","17","They took Absalom, cast him into a large pit in the forest, and piled a huge mound of stones over him. Meanwhile, all the Israelites fled, each to his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_18","011_18_18","2SA","18","18","18","During his lifetime, Absalom had set up for himself a pillar in the King’s Valley, for he had said, “I have no son to preserve the memory of my name.” So he gave the pillar his name, and to this day it is called Absalom’s Monument. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_19","011_18_19","2SA","18","19","19","Then Ahimaaz son of Zadok said, “Please let me run and tell the king the good news that the LORD has avenged him of his enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_20","011_18_20","2SA","18","20","20","But Joab replied, “You are not the man to take good news today. You may do it another day, but you must not do so today, because the king’s son is dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_21","011_18_21","2SA","18","21","21","So Joab said to a Cushite, “Go, tell the king what you have seen.” The Cushite bowed to Joab and took off running. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_22","011_18_22","2SA","18","22","22","Ahimaaz son of Zadok, however, persisted and said to Joab, “No matter what, please let me also run behind the Cushite!” “My son,” Joab replied, “why do you want to run, since you will not receive a reward?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_23","011_18_23","2SA","18","23","23","“No matter what, I want to run!” he replied. “Then run!” Joab told him. So Ahimaaz ran by way of the plain and outran the Cushite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_24","011_18_24","2SA","18","24","24","Now David was sitting between the two gates when the watchman went up to the roof of the gateway by the wall, looked out, and saw a man running alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_25","011_18_25","2SA","18","25","25","So he called out and told the king. “If he is alone,” the king replied, “he bears good news.” As the first runner drew near, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_26","011_18_26","2SA","18","26","26","the watchman saw another man running, and he called out to the gatekeeper, “Look! Another man is running alone!” “This one also brings good news,” said the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_27","011_18_27","2SA","18","27","27","The watchman said, “The first man appears to me to be running like Ahimaaz son of Zadok.” “This is a good man,” said the king. “He comes with good news.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_28","011_18_28","2SA","18","28","28","Then Ahimaaz called out to the king, “All is well!” And he bowed facedown before the king. He continued, “Blessed be the LORD your God! He has delivered up the men who raised their hands against my lord the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_29","011_18_29","2SA","18","29","29","The king asked, “Is the young man Absalom all right?” And Ahimaaz replied, “When Joab sent the king’s servant and your servant, I saw a great tumult, but I do not know what it was.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_30","011_18_30","2SA","18","30","30","“Move aside,” said the king, “and stand here.” So he stepped aside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_31","011_18_31","2SA","18","31","31","Just then the Cushite came and said, “May my lord the king hear the good news: Today the LORD has avenged you of all who rose up against you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_32","011_18_32","2SA","18","32","32","The king asked the Cushite, “Is the young man Absalom all right?” And the Cushite replied, “May the enemies of my lord the king and all who rise up against you to harm you be like that young man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S218_33","011_18_33","2SA","18","33","33","The king was shaken and went up to the chamber over the gate and wept. And as he walked, he cried out, “O my son Absalom! My son, my son Absalom! If only I had died instead of you, O Absalom, my son, my son!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_1","011_19_1","2SA","19","1","1","Then it was reported to Joab, “The king is weeping and mourning over Absalom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_2","011_19_2","2SA","19","2","2","And that day’s victory was turned into mourning for all the people, because on that day they were told, “The king is grieving over his son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_3","011_19_3","2SA","19","3","3","So they returned to the city quietly that day, as people steal away in humiliation after fleeing a battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_4","011_19_4","2SA","19","4","4","But the king covered his face and cried out at the top of his voice, “O my son Absalom! O Absalom, my son, my son!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_5","011_19_5","2SA","19","5","5","Then Joab went into the house and said to the king, “Today you have disgraced all your servants who have saved your life and the lives of your sons and daughters, of your wives, and of your concubines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_6","011_19_6","2SA","19","6","6","You love those who hate you and hate those who love you! For you have made it clear today that the commanders and soldiers mean nothing to you. I know today that if Absalom were alive and all of us were dead, it would have pleased you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_7","011_19_7","2SA","19","7","7","Now therefore get up! Go out and speak comfort to your servants, for I swear by the LORD that if you do not go out, not a man will remain with you tonight. This will be worse for you than all the adversity that has befallen you from your youth until now!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_8","011_19_8","2SA","19","8","8","So the king got up and sat in the gate, and all the people were told: “Behold, the king is sitting in the gate.” So they all came before the king. Meanwhile, the Israelites had fled, each man to his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_9","011_19_9","2SA","19","9","9","And all the people throughout the tribes of Israel were arguing, “The king rescued us from the hand of our enemies and delivered us from the hand of the Philistines, but now he has fled the land because of Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_10","011_19_10","2SA","19","10","10","But Absalom, the man we anointed over us, has died in battle. So why do you say nothing about restoring the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_11","011_19_11","2SA","19","11","11","Then King David sent this message to Zadok and Abiathar, the priests: “Say to the elders of Judah, ‘Why should you be the last to restore the king to his palace, since the talk of all Israel has reached the king at his quarters? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_12","011_19_12","2SA","19","12","12","You are my brothers, my own flesh and blood. So why should you be the last to restore the king?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_13","011_19_13","2SA","19","13","13","And say to Amasa, ‘Aren’t you my flesh and blood? May God punish me, and ever so severely, if from now on you are not the commander of my army in place of Joab!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_14","011_19_14","2SA","19","14","14","So he swayed the hearts of all the men of Judah as though they were one man, and they sent word to the king: “Return, you and all your servants.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_15","011_19_15","2SA","19","15","15","So the king returned, and when he arrived at the Jordan, the men of Judah came to Gilgal to meet him and escort him across the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_16","011_19_16","2SA","19","16","16","Then Shimei son of Gera, a Benjamite from Bahurim, hurried down with the men of Judah to meet King David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_17","011_19_17","2SA","19","17","17","along with a thousand men of Benjamin, as well as Ziba the steward of the house of Saul and his fifteen sons and twenty servants. They rushed down to the Jordan before the king ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_18","011_19_18","2SA","19","18","18","and crossed at the ford to carry over the king’s household and to do what was good in his sight. When Shimei son of Gera crossed the Jordan, he fell down before the king ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_19","011_19_19","2SA","19","19","19","and said, “My lord, do not hold me guilty, and do not remember your servant’s wrongdoing on the day my lord the king left Jerusalem. May the king not take it to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_20","011_19_20","2SA","19","20","20","For your servant knows that I have sinned, so here I am today as the first of all the house of Joseph to come down to meet my lord the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_21","011_19_21","2SA","19","21","21","But Abishai son of Zeruiah said, “Shouldn’t Shimei be put to death for this, because he cursed the LORD’s anointed?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_22","011_19_22","2SA","19","22","22","And David replied, “Sons of Zeruiah, what have I to do with you, that you should be my adversaries today? Should any man be put to death in Israel today? Am I not indeed aware that today I am king over Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_23","011_19_23","2SA","19","23","23","So the king said to Shimei, “You shall not die.” And the king swore an oath to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_24","011_19_24","2SA","19","24","24","Then Mephibosheth, Saul’s grandson, went down to meet the king. He had not cared for his feet or trimmed his mustache or washed his clothes from the day the king had left until the day he returned safely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_25","011_19_25","2SA","19","25","25","And he came from Jerusalem to meet the king, who asked him, “Mephibosheth, why did you not go with me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_26","011_19_26","2SA","19","26","26","“My lord the king,” he replied, “because I am lame, I said, ‘I will have my donkey saddled so that I may ride on it and go with the king.’ But my servant Ziba deceived me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_27","011_19_27","2SA","19","27","27","and he has slandered your servant to my lord the king. Yet my lord the king is like the angel of God, so do what is good in your eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_28","011_19_28","2SA","19","28","28","For all the house of my grandfather deserves death from my lord the king, yet you have set your servant among those who eat at your table. What further right, then, do I have to keep appealing to the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_29","011_19_29","2SA","19","29","29","The king replied, “Why say any more? I hereby declare that you and Ziba are to divide the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_30","011_19_30","2SA","19","30","30","And Mephibosheth said to the king, “Instead, since my lord the king has safely come to his own house, let Ziba take it all!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_31","011_19_31","2SA","19","31","31","Now Barzillai the Gileadite had come down from Rogelim to cross the Jordan with the king and send him on his way from there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_32","011_19_32","2SA","19","32","32","Barzillai was quite old, eighty years of age, and since he was a very wealthy man, he had provided for the king while he stayed in Mahanaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_33","011_19_33","2SA","19","33","33","The king said to Barzillai, “Cross over with me, and I will provide for you at my side in Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_34","011_19_34","2SA","19","34","34","But Barzillai replied, “How many years of my life remain, that I should go up to Jerusalem with the king? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_35","011_19_35","2SA","19","35","35","I am now eighty years old. Can I discern what is good and what is not? Can your servant taste what he eats or drinks? Can I still hear the voice of singing men and women? Why should your servant be an added burden to my lord the king? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_36","011_19_36","2SA","19","36","36","Your servant will go with the king only a short distance past the Jordan; why should the king repay me with such a reward? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_37","011_19_37","2SA","19","37","37","Please let your servant return, that I may die in my own city near the tomb of my father and mother. But here is your servant Chimham. Let him cross over with my lord the king, and do for him what is good in your sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_38","011_19_38","2SA","19","38","38","The king replied, “Chimham will cross over with me, and I will do for him what is good in your sight, and I will do for you whatever you desire of me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_39","011_19_39","2SA","19","39","39","So all the people crossed the Jordan, and then the king crossed over. The king kissed Barzillai and blessed him, and Barzillai returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_40","011_19_40","2SA","19","40","40","Then the king crossed over to Gilgal, and Chimham crossed over with him. All the troops of Judah and half the troops of Israel escorted the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_41","011_19_41","2SA","19","41","41","Soon all the men of Israel came to the king and asked, “Why did our brothers, the men of Judah, take you away secretly and bring the king and his household across the Jordan, together with all of David’s men?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_42","011_19_42","2SA","19","42","42","And all the men of Judah replied to the men of Israel, “We did this because the king is our relative. Why does this anger you? Have we ever eaten at the king’s expense or received anything for ourselves?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S219_43","011_19_43","2SA","19","43","43","“We have ten shares in the king,” answered the men of Israel, “so we have more claim to David than you. Why then do you despise us? Were we not the first to speak of restoring our king?” But the men of Judah spoke more fiercely than the men of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_1","011_20_1","2SA","20","1","1","Now a worthless man named Sheba son of Bichri, a Benjamite, happened to be there, and he blew the ram’s horn and shouted: “We have no share in David, no inheritance in Jesse’s son. Every man to his tent, O Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_2","011_20_2","2SA","20","2","2","So all the men of Israel deserted David to follow Sheba son of Bichri. But the men of Judah stayed by their king all the way from the Jordan to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_3","011_20_3","2SA","20","3","3","When David returned to his palace in Jerusalem, he took the ten concubines he had left to take care of the palace, and he placed them in a house under guard. He provided for them, but he no longer slept with them. They were confined until the day of their death, living as widows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_4","011_20_4","2SA","20","4","4","Then the king said to Amasa, “Summon the men of Judah to come to me within three days, and be here yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_5","011_20_5","2SA","20","5","5","So Amasa went to summon Judah, but he took longer than the time allotted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_6","011_20_6","2SA","20","6","6","And David said to Abishai, “Now Sheba the son of Bichri will do us more harm than Absalom. Take your lord’s servants and pursue him, or he will find fortified cities and elude us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_7","011_20_7","2SA","20","7","7","So Joab’s men, along with the Cherethites, the Pelethites, and all the mighty men, marched out of Jerusalem in pursuit of Sheba son of Bichri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_8","011_20_8","2SA","20","8","8","And while they were at the great stone in Gibeon, Amasa joined them. Now Joab was dressed in military attire, with a dagger strapped to his belt. And as he stepped forward, he slipped the dagger from its sheath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_9","011_20_9","2SA","20","9","9","“Are you well, my brother?” Joab asked Amasa. And with his right hand Joab grabbed Amasa by the beard to kiss him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_10","011_20_10","2SA","20","10","10","Amasa was not on guard against the dagger in Joab’s hand, and Joab stabbed him in the stomach and spilled out his intestines on the ground. And Joab did not need to strike him again, for Amasa was dead. Then Joab and his brother Abishai pursued Sheba son of Bichri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_11","011_20_11","2SA","20","11","11","One of Joab’s young men stood near Amasa and said, “Whoever favors Joab, and whoever is for David, let him follow Joab!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_12","011_20_12","2SA","20","12","12","But Amasa wallowed in his blood in the middle of the road, and when the man saw that all the troops were stopping there, he dragged the body off the road into a field and threw a garment over it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_13","011_20_13","2SA","20","13","13","As soon as Amasa’s body was removed from the road, all the men went on with Joab to pursue Sheba son of Bichri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_14","011_20_14","2SA","20","14","14","Sheba passed through all the tribes of Israel to Abel-beth-maacah and through the entire region of the Berites, who gathered together and followed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_15","011_20_15","2SA","20","15","15","And Joab’s troops came and besieged Sheba in Abel-beth-maacah and built a siege ramp against the outer rampart of the city. As all the troops with Joab were battering the wall to topple it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_16","011_20_16","2SA","20","16","16","a wise woman called out from the city, “Listen! Listen! Please tell Joab to come here so that I may speak with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_17","011_20_17","2SA","20","17","17","When he had come near to her, the woman asked, “Are you Joab?” “I am,” he replied. “Listen to the words of your servant,” she said. “I am listening,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_18","011_20_18","2SA","20","18","18","Then the woman said, “Long ago they used to say, ‘Seek counsel at Abel,’ and that is how disputes were settled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_19","011_20_19","2SA","20","19","19","I am among the peaceable and faithful in Israel, but you are trying to destroy a city that is a mother in Israel. Why would you swallow up the LORD’s inheritance?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_20","011_20_20","2SA","20","20","20","“Far be it!” Joab declared. “Far be it from me to swallow up or destroy! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_21","011_20_21","2SA","20","21","21","That is not the case. But a man named Sheba son of Bichri, from the hill country of Ephraim, has lifted up his hand against the king, against David. Deliver him alone, and I will depart from the city.” “Look,” the woman replied, “his head will be thrown to you over the wall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_22","011_20_22","2SA","20","22","22","Then the woman went to all the people with her wise counsel, and they cut off the head of Sheba son of Bichri and threw it to Joab. So he blew the ram’s horn and his men dispersed from the city, each to his own home. And Joab returned to the king in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_23","011_20_23","2SA","20","23","23","Now Joab was over the whole army of Israel; Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_24","011_20_24","2SA","20","24","24","Adoram was in charge of the forced labor; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_25","011_20_25","2SA","20","25","25","Sheva was the scribe; Zadok and Abiathar were priests; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S220_26","011_20_26","2SA","20","26","26","and Ira the Jairite was David’s priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_1","011_21_1","2SA","21","1","1","During the reign of David there was a famine for three successive years, and David sought the face of the LORD. And the LORD said, “It is because of the blood shed by Saul and his family, because he killed the Gibeonites.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_2","011_21_2","2SA","21","2","2","At this, David summoned the Gibeonites and spoke to them. (Now the Gibeonites were not Israelites, but a remnant of the Amorites. The Israelites had taken an oath concerning them, but in his zeal for Israel and Judah, Saul had sought to kill them.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_3","011_21_3","2SA","21","3","3","So David asked the Gibeonites, “What shall I do for you? How can I make amends so that you may bless the inheritance of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_4","011_21_4","2SA","21","4","4","The Gibeonites said to him, “We need no silver or gold from Saul or his house, nor should you put to death anyone in Israel for us.” “Whatever you ask, I will do for you,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_5","011_21_5","2SA","21","5","5","And they answered the king, “As for the man who consumed us and plotted against us to exterminate us from existing within any border of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_6","011_21_6","2SA","21","6","6","let seven of his male descendants be delivered to us so that we may hang them before the LORD at Gibeah of Saul, the chosen of the LORD.” “I will give them to you,” said the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_7","011_21_7","2SA","21","7","7","Now the king spared Mephibosheth son of Jonathan, the son of Saul, because of the oath before the LORD between David and Jonathan son of Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_8","011_21_8","2SA","21","8","8","But the king took Armoni and Mephibosheth, the two sons whom Rizpah daughter of Aiah had borne to Saul, as well as the five sons whom Merab daughter of Saul had borne to Adriel son of Barzillai the Meholathite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_9","011_21_9","2SA","21","9","9","And he delivered them into the hands of the Gibeonites, and they hanged them on the hill before the LORD. So all seven of them fell together; they were put to death in the first days of the harvest, at the beginning of the barley harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_10","011_21_10","2SA","21","10","10","And Rizpah the daughter of Aiah took sackcloth and spread it out for herself on a rock. From the beginning of the harvest until the rain from heaven poured down on the bodies, she did not allow the birds of the air to rest on them by day, nor the beasts of the field by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_11","011_21_11","2SA","21","11","11","When David was told what Saul’s concubine Rizpah, daughter of Aiah, had done, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_12","011_21_12","2SA","21","12","12","he went and took the bones of Saul and his son Jonathan from the men of Jabesh-gilead, who had stolen them from the public square of Beth-shan where the Philistines had hung the bodies after they had struck down Saul at Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_13","011_21_13","2SA","21","13","13","So David had the bones of Saul and his son Jonathan brought from there, and they also gathered the bones of those who had been hanged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_14","011_21_14","2SA","21","14","14","And they buried the bones of Saul and his son Jonathan in Zela in the land of Benjamin, in the tomb of Saul’s father Kish. After they had done everything the king had commanded, God answered their prayers for the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_15","011_21_15","2SA","21","15","15","Once again the Philistines waged war against Israel, and David and his servants went down and fought against the Philistines. But David became exhausted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_16","011_21_16","2SA","21","16","16","Then Ishbi-benob, a descendant of Rapha, whose bronze spear weighed three hundred shekels and who was bearing a new sword, resolved to kill David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_17","011_21_17","2SA","21","17","17","But Abishai son of Zeruiah came to his aid, struck the Philistine, and killed him. Then David’s men swore to him, “You must never again go out with us to battle, so that the lamp of Israel may not be extinguished.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_18","011_21_18","2SA","21","18","18","Some time later at Gob, there was another battle with the Philistines. At that time Sibbecai the Hushathite killed Saph, a descendant of Rapha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_19","011_21_19","2SA","21","19","19","Once again there was a battle with the Philistines at Gob, and Elhanan son of Jair the Bethlehemite killed the brother of Goliath the Gittite, the shaft of whose spear was like a weaver’s beam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_20","011_21_20","2SA","21","20","20","And there was also a battle at Gath, where there was a man of great stature with six fingers on each hand and six toes on each foot—twenty-four in all. He too was descended from Rapha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_21","011_21_21","2SA","21","21","21","and when he taunted Israel, Jonathan the son of David’s brother Shimei killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S221_22","011_21_22","2SA","21","22","22","So these four descendants of Rapha in Gath fell at the hands of David and his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_1","011_22_1","2SA","22","1","1","And David sang this song to the LORD on the day the LORD had delivered him from the hand of all his enemies and from the hand of Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_2","011_22_2","2SA","22","2","2","He said: “The LORD is my rock, my fortress, and my deliverer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_3","011_22_3","2SA","22","3","3","My God is my rock, in whom I take refuge, my shield, and the horn of my salvation. My stronghold, my refuge, and my Savior, You save me from violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_4","011_22_4","2SA","22","4","4","I will call upon the LORD, who is worthy to be praised; so shall I be saved from my enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_5","011_22_5","2SA","22","5","5","For the waves of death engulfed me; the torrents of chaos overwhelmed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_6","011_22_6","2SA","22","6","6","The cords of Sheol entangled me; the snares of death confronted me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_7","011_22_7","2SA","22","7","7","In my distress I called upon the LORD; I cried out to my God. And from His temple He heard my voice, and my cry for help reached His ears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_8","011_22_8","2SA","22","8","8","Then the earth shook and quaked; the foundations of the heavens trembled; they were shaken because He burned with anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_9","011_22_9","2SA","22","9","9","Smoke rose from His nostrils, and consuming fire came from His mouth; glowing coals blazed forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_10","011_22_10","2SA","22","10","10","He parted the heavens and came down with dark clouds beneath His feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_11","011_22_11","2SA","22","11","11","He mounted a cherub and flew; He soared on the wings of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_12","011_22_12","2SA","22","12","12","He made darkness a canopy around Him, a gathering of water and thick clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_13","011_22_13","2SA","22","13","13","From the brightness of His presence coals of fire blazed forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_14","011_22_14","2SA","22","14","14","The LORD thundered from heaven; the voice of the Most High resounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_15","011_22_15","2SA","22","15","15","He shot His arrows and scattered the foes; He hurled lightning and routed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_16","011_22_16","2SA","22","16","16","The channels of the sea appeared, and the foundations of the world were exposed at the rebuke of the LORD, at the blast of the breath of His nostrils. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_17","011_22_17","2SA","22","17","17","He reached down from on high and took hold of me; He drew me out of deep waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_18","011_22_18","2SA","22","18","18","He rescued me from my powerful enemy, from foes too mighty for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_19","011_22_19","2SA","22","19","19","They confronted me in my day of calamity, but the LORD was my support. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_20","011_22_20","2SA","22","20","20","He brought me out into the open; He rescued me because He delighted in me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_21","011_22_21","2SA","22","21","21","The LORD has rewarded me according to my righteousness; He has repaid me according to the cleanness of my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_22","011_22_22","2SA","22","22","22","For I have kept the ways of the LORD and have not wickedly departed from my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_23","011_22_23","2SA","22","23","23","For all His ordinances are before me; I have not disregarded His statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_24","011_22_24","2SA","22","24","24","And I have been blameless before Him and kept myself from iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_25","011_22_25","2SA","22","25","25","So the LORD has repaid me according to my righteousness, according to my cleanness in His sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_26","011_22_26","2SA","22","26","26","To the faithful You show Yourself faithful, to the blameless You show Yourself blameless; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_27","011_22_27","2SA","22","27","27","to the pure You show Yourself pure, but to the crooked You show Yourself shrewd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_28","011_22_28","2SA","22","28","28","You save an afflicted people, but Your eyes are on the haughty to bring them down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_29","011_22_29","2SA","22","29","29","For You, O LORD, are my lamp; the LORD lights up my darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_30","011_22_30","2SA","22","30","30","For in You I can charge an army; with my God I can scale a wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_31","011_22_31","2SA","22","31","31","As for God, His way is perfect; the word of the LORD is flawless. He is a shield to all who take refuge in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_32","011_22_32","2SA","22","32","32","For who is God besides the LORD? And who is the Rock except our God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_33","011_22_33","2SA","22","33","33","God is my strong fortress, and He makes my way clear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_34","011_22_34","2SA","22","34","34","He makes my feet like those of a deer and stations me upon the heights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_35","011_22_35","2SA","22","35","35","He trains my hands for battle; my arms can bend a bow of bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_36","011_22_36","2SA","22","36","36","You have given me Your shield of salvation, and Your gentleness exalts me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_37","011_22_37","2SA","22","37","37","You broaden the path beneath me so that my ankles do not give way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_38","011_22_38","2SA","22","38","38","I pursued my enemies and destroyed them; I did not turn back until they were consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_39","011_22_39","2SA","22","39","39","I devoured and crushed them so they could not rise; they have fallen under my feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_40","011_22_40","2SA","22","40","40","You have armed me with strength for battle; You have subdued my foes beneath me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_41","011_22_41","2SA","22","41","41","You have made my enemies retreat before me; I destroyed those who hated me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_42","011_22_42","2SA","22","42","42","They looked, but there was no one to save them—to the LORD, but He did not answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_43","011_22_43","2SA","22","43","43","I ground them as the dust of the earth; I crushed and trampled them like mud in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_44","011_22_44","2SA","22","44","44","You have delivered me from the strife of my people; You have preserved me as the head of nations; a people I had not known shall serve me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_45","011_22_45","2SA","22","45","45","Foreigners cower before me; when they hear me, they obey me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_46","011_22_46","2SA","22","46","46","Foreigners lose heart and come trembling from their strongholds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_47","011_22_47","2SA","22","47","47","The LORD lives, and blessed be my Rock! And may God, the Rock of my salvation, be exalted— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_48","011_22_48","2SA","22","48","48","the God who avenges me and brings down nations beneath me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_49","011_22_49","2SA","22","49","49","who frees me from my enemies. You exalt me above my foes; You rescue me from violent men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_50","011_22_50","2SA","22","50","50","Therefore I will praise You, O LORD, among the nations; I will sing praises to Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S222_51","011_22_51","2SA","22","51","51","Great salvation He brings to His king. He shows loving devotion to His anointed, to David and his descendants forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_1","011_23_1","2SA","23","1","1","These are the last words of David: “The oracle of David son of Jesse, the oracle of the man raised on high, the one anointed by the God of Jacob, and the sweet psalmist of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_2","011_23_2","2SA","23","2","2","The Spirit of the LORD spoke through me; His word was on my tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_3","011_23_3","2SA","23","3","3","The God of Israel spoke; the Rock of Israel said to me, ‘He who rules the people with justice, who rules in the fear of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_4","011_23_4","2SA","23","4","4","is like the light of the morning at sunrise of a cloudless dawn, the glistening after the rain on the sprouting grass of the earth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_5","011_23_5","2SA","23","5","5","Is not my house right with God? For He has established with me an everlasting covenant, ordered and secured in every part. Will He not bring about my full salvation and my every desire? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_6","011_23_6","2SA","23","6","6","But the worthless are all like thorns raked aside, for they can never be gathered by hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_7","011_23_7","2SA","23","7","7","The man who touches them must be armed with iron or with the shaft of a spear. The fire burns them to ashes in the place where they lie.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_8","011_23_8","2SA","23","8","8","These are the names of David’s mighty men: Josheb-basshebeth the Tahchemonite was chief of the Three. He wielded his spear against eight hundred men, whom he killed at one time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_9","011_23_9","2SA","23","9","9","Next in command was Eleazar son of Dodo the Ahohite. As one of the three mighty men, he went with David to taunt the Philistines who had gathered for battle at Pas-dammim. The men of Israel retreated, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_10","011_23_10","2SA","23","10","10","but Eleazar stood his ground and struck the Philistines until his hand grew weary and stuck to his sword. The LORD brought about a great victory that day. Then the troops returned to him, but only to plunder the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_11","011_23_11","2SA","23","11","11","And after him was Shammah son of Agee the Hararite. When the Philistines had banded together near a field full of lentils, Israel’s troops fled from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_12","011_23_12","2SA","23","12","12","But Shammah took his stand in the middle of the field, defended it, and struck down the Philistines. So the LORD brought about a great victory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_13","011_23_13","2SA","23","13","13","At harvest time, three of the thirty chief men went down to David at the cave of Adullam, while a company of Philistines was encamped in the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_14","011_23_14","2SA","23","14","14","At that time David was in the stronghold, and the garrison of the Philistines was at Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_15","011_23_15","2SA","23","15","15","David longed for water and said, “Oh, that someone would get me a drink of water from the well near the gate of Bethlehem!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_16","011_23_16","2SA","23","16","16","So the three mighty men broke through the Philistine camp, drew water from the well near the gate of Bethlehem, and brought it back to David. But he refused to drink it; instead, he poured it out to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_17","011_23_17","2SA","23","17","17","saying, “Far be it from me, O LORD, to do this! Is this not the blood of the men who risked their lives?” So he refused to drink it. Such were the exploits of the three mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_18","011_23_18","2SA","23","18","18","Now Abishai, the brother of Joab and son of Zeruiah, was chief of the Three, and he wielded his spear against three hundred men, killed them, and won a name along with the Three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_19","011_23_19","2SA","23","19","19","Was he not more honored than the Three? And he became their commander, even though he was not included among the Three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_20","011_23_20","2SA","23","20","20","And Benaiah son of Jehoiada was a man of valor from Kabzeel, a man of many exploits. He struck down two champions of Moab, and on a snowy day he went down into a pit and killed a lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_21","011_23_21","2SA","23","21","21","He also struck down an Egyptian, a huge man. Although the Egyptian had a spear in his hand, Benaiah went against him with a club, snatched the spear from his hand, and killed the Egyptian with his own spear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_22","011_23_22","2SA","23","22","22","These were the exploits of Benaiah son of Jehoiada, who won a name along with the three mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_23","011_23_23","2SA","23","23","23","He was most honored among the Thirty, but he did not become one of the Three. And David appointed him over his guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_24","011_23_24","2SA","23","24","24","Now these were members of the Thirty: Asahel the brother of Joab, Elhanan son of Dodo of Bethlehem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_25","011_23_25","2SA","23","25","25","Shammah the Harodite, Elika the Harodite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_26","011_23_26","2SA","23","26","26","Helez the Paltite, Ira son of Ikkesh the Tekoite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_27","011_23_27","2SA","23","27","27","Abiezer the Anathothite, Mebunnai the Hushathite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_28","011_23_28","2SA","23","28","28","Zalmon the Ahohite, Maharai the Netophathite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_29","011_23_29","2SA","23","29","29","Heled son of Baanah the Netophathite, Ittai son of Ribai from Gibeah of the Benjamites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_30","011_23_30","2SA","23","30","30","Benaiah the Pirathonite, Hiddai from the brooks of Gaash, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_31","011_23_31","2SA","23","31","31","Abi-albon the Arbathite, Azmaveth the Barhumite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_32","011_23_32","2SA","23","32","32","Eliahba the Shaalbonite, the sons of Jashen, Jonathan ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_33","011_23_33","2SA","23","33","33","son of Shammah the Hararite, Ahiam son of Sharar the Hararite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_34","011_23_34","2SA","23","34","34","Eliphelet son of Ahasbai the Maacathite, Eliam son of Ahithophel the Gilonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_35","011_23_35","2SA","23","35","35","Hezro the Carmelite, Paarai the Arbite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_36","011_23_36","2SA","23","36","36","Igal son of Nathan of Zobah, Bani the Gadite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_37","011_23_37","2SA","23","37","37","Zelek the Ammonite, Naharai the Beerothite, the armor-bearer of Joab son of Zeruiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_38","011_23_38","2SA","23","38","38","Ira the Ithrite, Gareb the Ithrite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S223_39","011_23_39","2SA","23","39","39","and Uriah the Hittite. There were thirty-seven in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_1","011_24_1","2SA","24","1","1","Again the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He stirred up David against them, saying, “Go and take a census of Israel and Judah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_2","011_24_2","2SA","24","2","2","So the king said to Joab the commander of his army, who was with him, “Go now throughout the tribes of Israel from Dan to Beersheba and register the troops, so that I may know their number.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_3","011_24_3","2SA","24","3","3","But Joab replied to the king, “May the LORD your God multiply the troops a hundred times over, and may the eyes of my lord the king see it. But why does my lord the king want to do such a thing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_4","011_24_4","2SA","24","4","4","Nevertheless, the king’s word prevailed against Joab and against the commanders of the army. So Joab and the commanders of the army departed from the presence of the king to register the troops of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_5","011_24_5","2SA","24","5","5","They crossed the Jordan and camped near Aroer, south of the town in the middle of the valley, and proceeded toward Gad and Jazer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_6","011_24_6","2SA","24","6","6","Then they went to Gilead and the land of Tahtim-hodshi, and on to Dan-jaan and around to Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_7","011_24_7","2SA","24","7","7","They went toward the fortress of Tyre and all the cities of the Hivites and Canaanites. Finally, they went on to the Negev of Judah, to Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_8","011_24_8","2SA","24","8","8","At the end of nine months and twenty days, having gone through the whole land, they returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_9","011_24_9","2SA","24","9","9","And Joab reported to the king the total number of the troops. In Israel there were 800,000 men of valor who drew the sword, and in Judah there were 500,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_10","011_24_10","2SA","24","10","10","After David had numbered the troops, his conscience was stricken and he said to the LORD, “I have sinned greatly in what I have done. Now, O LORD, I beg You to take away the iniquity of Your servant, for I have acted very foolishly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_11","011_24_11","2SA","24","11","11","When David got up in the morning, the word of the LORD had come to Gad the prophet, David’s seer: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_12","011_24_12","2SA","24","12","12","“Go and tell David that this is what the LORD says: ‘I am offering you three options. Choose one of them, and I will carry it out against you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_13","011_24_13","2SA","24","13","13","So Gad went and said to David, “Do you choose to endure three years of famine in your land, three months of fleeing the pursuit of your enemies, or three days of plague upon your land? Now then, think it over and decide how I should reply to Him who sent me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_14","011_24_14","2SA","24","14","14","David answered Gad, “I am deeply distressed. Please, let us fall into the hand of the LORD, for His mercies are great; but do not let me fall into the hands of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_15","011_24_15","2SA","24","15","15","So the LORD sent a plague upon Israel from that morning until the appointed time, and seventy thousand of the people from Dan to Beersheba died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_16","011_24_16","2SA","24","16","16","But when the angel stretched out his hand to destroy Jerusalem, the LORD relented from the calamity and said to the angel who was destroying the people, “Enough! Withdraw your hand now!” At that time the angel of the LORD was by the threshing floor of Araunah the Jebusite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_17","011_24_17","2SA","24","17","17","When David saw the angel striking down the people, he said to the LORD, “Surely I, the shepherd, have sinned and acted wickedly. But these sheep, what have they done? Please, let Your hand fall upon me and my father’s house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_18","011_24_18","2SA","24","18","18","And that day Gad came to David and said to him, “Go up and build an altar to the LORD on the threshing floor of Araunah the Jebusite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_19","011_24_19","2SA","24","19","19","So David went up at the word of Gad, just as the LORD had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_20","011_24_20","2SA","24","20","20","When Araunah looked out and saw the king and his servants coming toward him, he went out and bowed facedown before the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_21","011_24_21","2SA","24","21","21","“Why has my lord the king come to his servant?” Araunah said. “To buy your threshing floor,” David replied, “that I may build an altar to the LORD, so that the plague upon the people may be halted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_22","011_24_22","2SA","24","22","22","Araunah said to David, “May my lord the king take whatever seems good to him and offer it up. Here are the oxen for a burnt offering and the threshing sledges and ox yokes for the wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_23","011_24_23","2SA","24","23","23","O king, Araunah gives all these to the king.” He also said to the king, “May the LORD your God accept you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_24","011_24_24","2SA","24","24","24","“No,” replied the king, “I insist on paying a price, for I will not offer to the LORD my God burnt offerings that cost me nothing.” So David bought the threshing floor and the oxen for fifty shekels of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("S224_25","011_24_25","2SA","24","25","25","And there he built an altar to the LORD and offered burnt offerings and peace offerings. Then the LORD answered the prayers on behalf of the land, and the plague upon Israel was halted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_1","012_1_1","1KI","1","1","1","Now King David was old and well along in years, and though they covered him with blankets, he could not keep warm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_2","012_1_2","1KI","1","2","2","So his servants said to him, “Let us search for a young virgin for our lord the king, to attend to him and care for him and lie by his side to keep him warm.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_3","012_1_3","1KI","1","3","3","Then they searched throughout Israel for a beautiful girl, and they found Abishag the Shunammite and brought her to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_4","012_1_4","1KI","1","4","4","The girl was unsurpassed in beauty; she cared for the king and served him, but he had no relations with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_5","012_1_5","1KI","1","5","5","At that time Adonijah, David’s son by Haggith, began to exalt himself, saying, “I will be king!” And he acquired chariots and horsemen and fifty men to run ahead of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_6","012_1_6","1KI","1","6","6","(His father had never once reprimanded him by saying, “Why do you act this way?” Adonijah was also very handsome, born next after Absalom.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_7","012_1_7","1KI","1","7","7","So Adonijah conferred with Joab son of Zeruiah and with Abiathar the priest, who supported him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_8","012_1_8","1KI","1","8","8","But Zadok the priest, Benaiah son of Jehoiada, Nathan the prophet, Shimei, Rei, and David’s mighty men would not join Adonijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_9","012_1_9","1KI","1","9","9","And Adonijah sacrificed sheep, oxen, and fattened calves near the stone of Zoheleth, which is next to En-rogel. He invited all his royal brothers and all the men of Judah who were servants of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_10","012_1_10","1KI","1","10","10","But he did not invite Nathan the prophet, Benaiah, the mighty men, or his brother Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_11","012_1_11","1KI","1","11","11","Then Nathan said to Bathsheba the mother of Solomon, “Have you not heard that Adonijah son of Haggith has become king, and our lord David does not know it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_12","012_1_12","1KI","1","12","12","Now please, come and let me advise you. Save your own life and the life of your son Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_13","012_1_13","1KI","1","13","13","Go at once to King David and say, ‘My lord the king, did you not swear to your maidservant, “Surely your son Solomon will reign after me, and he will sit on my throne”? Why then has Adonijah become king?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_14","012_1_14","1KI","1","14","14","Then, while you are still there speaking with the king, I will come in after you and confirm your words.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_15","012_1_15","1KI","1","15","15","So Bathsheba went to see the king in his bedroom. Since the king was very old, Abishag the Shunammite was serving him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_16","012_1_16","1KI","1","16","16","And Bathsheba bowed down in homage to the king, who asked, “What is your desire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_17","012_1_17","1KI","1","17","17","“My lord,” she replied, “you yourself swore to your maidservant by the LORD your God: ‘Surely your son Solomon will reign after me, and he will sit on my throne.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_18","012_1_18","1KI","1","18","18","But now, behold, Adonijah has become king, and you, my lord the king, do not know it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_19","012_1_19","1KI","1","19","19","And he has sacrificed an abundance of oxen, fattened calves, and sheep, and has invited all the other sons of the king, as well as Abiathar the priest and Joab the commander of the army. But he has not invited your servant Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_20","012_1_20","1KI","1","20","20","And as for you, my lord the king, the eyes of all Israel are upon you to tell them who will sit on the throne of my lord the king after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_21","012_1_21","1KI","1","21","21","Otherwise, when my lord the king rests with his fathers, I and my son Solomon will be counted as criminals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_22","012_1_22","1KI","1","22","22","And just then, while Bathsheba was still speaking with the king, Nathan the prophet arrived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_23","012_1_23","1KI","1","23","23","So the king was told, “Nathan the prophet is here.” And Nathan went in and bowed facedown before the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_24","012_1_24","1KI","1","24","24","“My lord the king,” said Nathan, “did you say, ‘Adonijah will reign after me, and he will sit on my throne’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_25","012_1_25","1KI","1","25","25","For today he has gone down and sacrificed an abundance of oxen, fattened calves, and sheep, and has invited all the sons of the king, the commanders of the army, and Abiathar the priest. And behold, they are eating and drinking before him, saying, ‘Long live King Adonijah!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_26","012_1_26","1KI","1","26","26","But me your servant he has not invited, nor Zadok the priest, nor Benaiah son of Jehoiada, nor your servant Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_27","012_1_27","1KI","1","27","27","Has my lord the king let this happen without informing your servant who should sit on the throne after my lord the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_28","012_1_28","1KI","1","28","28","Then King David said, “Call in Bathsheba for me.” So she came into the king’s presence and stood before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_29","012_1_29","1KI","1","29","29","And the king swore an oath, saying, “As surely as the LORD lives, who has redeemed my life from all distress, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_30","012_1_30","1KI","1","30","30","I will carry out this very day exactly what I swore to you by the LORD, the God of Israel: Surely your son Solomon will reign after me, and he will sit on my throne in my place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_31","012_1_31","1KI","1","31","31","Bathsheba bowed facedown in homage to the king and said, “May my lord King David live forever!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_32","012_1_32","1KI","1","32","32","Then King David said, “Call in for me Zadok the priest, Nathan the prophet, and Benaiah son of Jehoiada.” So they came before the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_33","012_1_33","1KI","1","33","33","“Take my servants with you,” said the king. “Set my son Solomon on my own mule and take him down to Gihon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_34","012_1_34","1KI","1","34","34","There Zadok the priest and Nathan the prophet are to anoint him king over Israel. You are to blow the ram’s horn and declare, ‘Long live King Solomon!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_35","012_1_35","1KI","1","35","35","Then you shall go up with him, and he is to come and sit on my throne and reign in my place. For I have appointed him ruler over Israel and Judah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_36","012_1_36","1KI","1","36","36","“Amen,” replied Benaiah son of Jehoiada. “May the LORD, the God of my lord the king, so declare it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_37","012_1_37","1KI","1","37","37","Just as the LORD was with my lord the king, so may He be with Solomon and make his throne even greater than that of my lord King David.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_38","012_1_38","1KI","1","38","38","Then Zadok the priest, Nathan the prophet, and Benaiah son of Jehoiada, along with the Cherethites and Pelethites, went down and set Solomon on King David’s mule, and they escorted him to Gihon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_39","012_1_39","1KI","1","39","39","Zadok the priest took the horn of oil from the tabernacle and anointed Solomon. Then they blew the ram’s horn, and all the people proclaimed, “Long live King Solomon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_40","012_1_40","1KI","1","40","40","All the people followed him, playing flutes and rejoicing with such a great joy that the earth was split by the sound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_41","012_1_41","1KI","1","41","41","Now Adonijah and all his guests were finishing their feast when they heard the sound of the ram’s horn. “Why is the city in such a loud uproar?” asked Joab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_42","012_1_42","1KI","1","42","42","As he was speaking, suddenly Jonathan the son of Abiathar the priest arrived. “Come in,” said Adonijah, “for you are a man of valor. You must be bringing good news.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_43","012_1_43","1KI","1","43","43","“Not at all,” Jonathan replied. “Our lord King David has made Solomon king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_44","012_1_44","1KI","1","44","44","And with Solomon, the king has sent Zadok the priest, Nathan the prophet, and Benaiah son of Jehoiada, along with the Cherethites and Pelethites, and they have set him on the king’s mule. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_45","012_1_45","1KI","1","45","45","Zadok the priest and Nathan the prophet have anointed him king at Gihon, and they have gone up from there with rejoicing that rings out in the city. That is the noise you hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_46","012_1_46","1KI","1","46","46","Moreover, Solomon has taken his seat on the royal throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_47","012_1_47","1KI","1","47","47","The king’s servants have also gone to congratulate our lord King David, saying, ‘May your God make the name of Solomon more famous than your own name, and may He make his throne greater than your throne.’ And the king has bowed in worship on his bed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_48","012_1_48","1KI","1","48","48","saying, ‘Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel! Today He has provided one to sit on my throne, and my eyes have seen it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_49","012_1_49","1KI","1","49","49","At this, all the guests of Adonijah arose in terror and scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_50","012_1_50","1KI","1","50","50","But Adonijah, in fear of Solomon, got up and went to take hold of the horns of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_51","012_1_51","1KI","1","51","51","It was reported to Solomon: “Behold, Adonijah fears King Solomon, and he has taken hold of the horns of the altar, saying, ‘Let King Solomon first swear to me not to put his servant to the sword.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_52","012_1_52","1KI","1","52","52","And Solomon replied, “If he is a man of character, not a single hair of his will fall to the ground. But if evil is found in him, he will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K11_53","012_1_53","1KI","1","53","53","So King Solomon summoned Adonijah down from the altar, and he came and bowed down before King Solomon, who said to him, “Go to your home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_1","012_2_1","1KI","2","1","1","As the time drew near for David to die, he charged his son Solomon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_2","012_2_2","1KI","2","2","2","“I am about to go the way of all the earth. So be strong and prove yourself a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_3","012_2_3","1KI","2","3","3","And keep the charge of the LORD your God to walk in His ways and to keep His statutes, commandments, ordinances, and decrees, as written in the Law of Moses, so that you may prosper in all you do and wherever you turn, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_4","012_2_4","1KI","2","4","4","and so that the LORD may fulfill His promise to me: ‘If your descendants take heed to walk faithfully before Me with all their heart and soul, you will never fail to have a man on the throne of Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_5","012_2_5","1KI","2","5","5","Moreover, you know what Joab son of Zeruiah did to me—what he did to Abner son of Ner and Amasa son of Jether, the two commanders of the armies of Israel. He killed them in peacetime to avenge the blood of war. He stained with the blood of war the belt around his waist and the sandals on his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_6","012_2_6","1KI","2","6","6","So act according to your wisdom, and do not let his gray head go down to Sheol in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_7","012_2_7","1KI","2","7","7","But show loving devotion to the sons of Barzillai the Gileadite, and let them be among those who eat at your table, because they stood by me when I fled from your brother Absalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_8","012_2_8","1KI","2","8","8","Keep an eye on Shimei the son of Gera, the Benjamite from Bahurim who is with you. He called down bitter curses against me on the day I went to Mahanaim, but when he came down to meet me at the Jordan, I swore to him by the LORD: ‘I will never put you to the sword.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_9","012_2_9","1KI","2","9","9","Now therefore, do not hold him guiltless, for you are a wise man. You know what you ought to do to him to bring his gray head down to Sheol in blood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_10","012_2_10","1KI","2","10","10","Then David rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_11","012_2_11","1KI","2","11","11","The length of David’s reign over Israel was forty years—seven years in Hebron and thirty-three years in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_12","012_2_12","1KI","2","12","12","So Solomon sat on the throne of his father David, and his kingdom was firmly established. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_13","012_2_13","1KI","2","13","13","Now Adonijah son of Haggith went to Bathsheba the mother of Solomon, and she asked, “Do you come in peace?” “Yes, in peace,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_14","012_2_14","1KI","2","14","14","Then he said, “I have something to tell you.” “Say it,” she answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_15","012_2_15","1KI","2","15","15","“You know that the kingship was mine,” he said. “All Israel expected that I should reign, but the kingship has turned to my brother, for it has come to him from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_16","012_2_16","1KI","2","16","16","So now I have just one request of you; do not deny me.” “State your request,” she told him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_17","012_2_17","1KI","2","17","17","Adonijah replied, “Please speak to King Solomon, since he will not turn you down. Let him give me Abishag the Shunammite as my wife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_18","012_2_18","1KI","2","18","18","“Very well,” Bathsheba replied. “I will speak to the king for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_19","012_2_19","1KI","2","19","19","So Bathsheba went to King Solomon to speak to him for Adonijah. The king stood up to greet her, bowed to her, and sat down on his throne. Then the king had a throne brought for his mother, who sat down at his right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_20","012_2_20","1KI","2","20","20","“I have just one small request of you,” she said. “Do not deny me.” “Make your request, my mother,” the king replied, “for I will not deny you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_21","012_2_21","1KI","2","21","21","So Bathsheba said, “Let Abishag the Shunammite be given to your brother Adonijah as his wife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_22","012_2_22","1KI","2","22","22","King Solomon answered his mother, “Why do you request Abishag the Shunammite for Adonijah? Since he is my older brother, you might as well request the kingdom for him and for Abiathar the priest and for Joab son of Zeruiah!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_23","012_2_23","1KI","2","23","23","Then King Solomon swore by the LORD: “May God punish me, and ever so severely, if Adonijah has not made this request at the expense of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_24","012_2_24","1KI","2","24","24","And now, as surely as the LORD lives—the One who established me, who set me on the throne of my father David, and who founded for me a dynasty as He promised—surely Adonijah shall be put to death today!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_25","012_2_25","1KI","2","25","25","So King Solomon gave orders to Benaiah son of Jehoiada, and he struck down Adonijah and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_26","012_2_26","1KI","2","26","26","Then the king said to Abiathar the priest, “Go back to your fields in Anathoth. Even though you deserve to die, I will not put you to death at this time, since you carried the ark of the Lord GOD before my father David, and you suffered through all that my father suffered.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_27","012_2_27","1KI","2","27","27","So Solomon banished Abiathar from the priesthood of the LORD and thus fulfilled the word that the LORD had spoken at Shiloh against the house of Eli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_28","012_2_28","1KI","2","28","28","When the news reached Joab, who had conspired with Adonijah but not with Absalom, he fled to the tent of the LORD and took hold of the horns of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_29","012_2_29","1KI","2","29","29","It was reported to King Solomon: “Joab has fled to the tent of the LORD and is now beside the altar.” So Solomon sent Benaiah son of Jehoiada, saying, “Go, strike him down!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_30","012_2_30","1KI","2","30","30","And Benaiah entered the tent of the LORD and said to Joab, “The king says, ‘Come out!’” But Joab replied, “No, I will die here.” So Benaiah relayed the message to the king, saying, “This is how Joab answered me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_31","012_2_31","1KI","2","31","31","And the king replied, “Do just as he says. Strike him down and bury him, and so remove from me and from the house of my father the innocent blood that Joab shed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_32","012_2_32","1KI","2","32","32","The LORD will bring his bloodshed back upon his own head, for without the knowledge of my father David he struck down two men more righteous and better than he when he put to the sword Abner son of Ner, commander of Israel’s army, and Amasa son of Jether, commander of Judah’s army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_33","012_2_33","1KI","2","33","33","Their blood will come back upon the heads of Joab and his descendants forever; but for David, his descendants, his house, and his throne, there shall be peace from the LORD forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_34","012_2_34","1KI","2","34","34","So Benaiah son of Jehoiada went up, struck down Joab, and killed him. He was buried at his own home in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_35","012_2_35","1KI","2","35","35","And the king appointed Benaiah son of Jehoiada in Joab’s place over the army, and he appointed Zadok the priest in Abiathar’s place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_36","012_2_36","1KI","2","36","36","Then the king summoned Shimei and said to him, “Build a house for yourself in Jerusalem and live there, but do not go anywhere else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_37","012_2_37","1KI","2","37","37","On the day you go out and cross the Kidron Valley, know for sure that you will die; your blood will be on your own head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_38","012_2_38","1KI","2","38","38","“The sentence is fair,” Shimei replied. “Your servant will do as my lord the king has spoken.” And Shimei lived in Jerusalem for a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_39","012_2_39","1KI","2","39","39","After three years, however, two of Shimei’s slaves ran away to Achish son of Maacah, king of Gath. And Shimei was told, “Look, your slaves are in Gath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_40","012_2_40","1KI","2","40","40","So Shimei saddled his donkey and set out to Achish at Gath in search of his slaves, and he brought them back from Gath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_41","012_2_41","1KI","2","41","41","When Solomon was told that Shimei had gone from Jerusalem to Gath and had returned, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_42","012_2_42","1KI","2","42","42","the king summoned Shimei and said to him, “Did I not make you swear by the LORD and warn you, ‘On the day you leave and go elsewhere, know for sure that you will die’? And you told me, ‘The sentence is fair; I will comply.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_43","012_2_43","1KI","2","43","43","So why have you not kept your oath to the LORD and the command that I gave you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_44","012_2_44","1KI","2","44","44","The king also said, “You know in your heart all the evil that you did to my father David. Therefore the LORD will bring your evil back upon your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_45","012_2_45","1KI","2","45","45","But King Solomon will be blessed and David’s throne will remain secure before the LORD forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K12_46","012_2_46","1KI","2","46","46","Then the king commanded Benaiah son of Jehoiada, and he went out and struck Shimei down, and he died. Thus the kingdom was firmly established in the hand of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_1","012_3_1","1KI","3","1","1","Later, Solomon formed an alliance with Pharaoh king of Egypt by marrying his daughter. Solomon brought her to the City of David until he had finished building his palace and the house of the LORD, as well as the wall around Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_2","012_3_2","1KI","3","2","2","The people, however, were still sacrificing on the high places because a house for the Name of the LORD had not yet been built. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_3","012_3_3","1KI","3","3","3","And Solomon loved the LORD and walked in the statutes of his father David, except that he sacrificed and burned incense on the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_4","012_3_4","1KI","3","4","4","Now the king went to Gibeon to sacrifice there, for it was the great high place. Solomon offered a thousand burnt offerings on the altar there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_5","012_3_5","1KI","3","5","5","One night at Gibeon the LORD appeared to Solomon in a dream, and God said, “Ask, and I will give it to you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_6","012_3_6","1KI","3","6","6","Solomon replied, “You have shown much loving devotion to Your servant, my father David, because he walked before You in faithfulness, righteousness, and uprightness of heart. And You have maintained this loving devotion by giving him a son to sit on his throne this very day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_7","012_3_7","1KI","3","7","7","And now, O LORD my God, You have made Your servant king in my father David’s place. But I am only a little child, not knowing how to go out or come in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_8","012_3_8","1KI","3","8","8","Your servant is here among the people You have chosen, a people too numerous to count or number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_9","012_3_9","1KI","3","9","9","Therefore give Your servant an understanding heart to judge Your people and to discern between good and evil. For who is able to govern this great people of Yours?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_10","012_3_10","1KI","3","10","10","Now it pleased the Lord that Solomon had made this request. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_11","012_3_11","1KI","3","11","11","So God said to him, “Since you have asked for this instead of requesting long life or wealth for yourself or death for your enemies—but you have asked for discernment to administer justice— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_12","012_3_12","1KI","3","12","12","behold, I will do what you have asked. I will give you a wise and discerning heart, so that there will never have been another like you, nor will there ever be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_13","012_3_13","1KI","3","13","13","Moreover, I will give you what you did not request—both riches and honor—so that during all your days no man in any kingdom will be your equal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_14","012_3_14","1KI","3","14","14","So if you walk in My ways and keep My statutes and commandments, just as your father David did, I will prolong your days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_15","012_3_15","1KI","3","15","15","Then Solomon awoke, and indeed it had been a dream. So he returned to Jerusalem, stood before the ark of the covenant of the Lord, and offered burnt offerings and peace offerings. Then he held a feast for all his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_16","012_3_16","1KI","3","16","16","At that time two prostitutes came to the king and stood before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_17","012_3_17","1KI","3","17","17","One woman said, “Please, my lord, this woman and I live in the same house, and I gave birth while she was in the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_18","012_3_18","1KI","3","18","18","On the third day after I gave birth, this woman also had a baby. We were alone, with no one in the house but the two of us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_19","012_3_19","1KI","3","19","19","During the night this woman’s son died because she rolled over on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_20","012_3_20","1KI","3","20","20","So she got up in the middle of the night and took my son from my side while I was asleep. She laid him in her bosom and put her dead son at my bosom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_21","012_3_21","1KI","3","21","21","The next morning, when I got up to nurse my son, I discovered he was dead. But when I examined him, I realized that he was not the son I had borne.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_22","012_3_22","1KI","3","22","22","“No,” said the other woman, “the living one is my son and the dead one is your son.” But the first woman insisted, “No, the dead one is yours and the living one is mine.” So they argued before the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_23","012_3_23","1KI","3","23","23","Then the king replied, “This woman says, ‘My son is alive and yours is dead,’ but that woman says, ‘No, your son is dead and mine is alive.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_24","012_3_24","1KI","3","24","24","The king continued, “Bring me a sword.” So they brought him a sword, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_25","012_3_25","1KI","3","25","25","and the king declared, “Cut the living child in two and give half to one and half to the other.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_26","012_3_26","1KI","3","26","26","Then the woman whose son was alive spoke to the king because she yearned with compassion for her son. “Please, my lord,” she said, “give her the living baby. Do not kill him!” But the other woman said, “He will be neither mine nor yours. Cut him in two!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_27","012_3_27","1KI","3","27","27","Then the king gave his ruling: “Give the living baby to the first woman. By no means should you kill him; she is his mother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K13_28","012_3_28","1KI","3","28","28","When all Israel heard of the judgment the king had given, they stood in awe of him, for they saw that the wisdom of God was in him to administer justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_1","012_4_1","1KI","4","1","1","So King Solomon ruled over Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_2","012_4_2","1KI","4","2","2","and these were his chief officials: Azariah son of Zadok was the priest; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_3","012_4_3","1KI","4","3","3","Elihoreph and Ahijah, the sons of Shisha, were secretaries; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_4","012_4_4","1KI","4","4","4","Benaiah son of Jehoiada was in charge of the army; Zadok and Abiathar were priests; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_5","012_4_5","1KI","4","5","5","Azariah son of Nathan was in charge of the governors; Zabud son of Nathan was a priest and adviser to the king; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_6","012_4_6","1KI","4","6","6","Ahishar was in charge of the palace; and Adoniram son of Abda was in charge of the forced labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_7","012_4_7","1KI","4","7","7","Solomon had twelve governors over all Israel to provide food for the king and his household. Each one would arrange provisions for one month of the year, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_8","012_4_8","1KI","4","8","8","and these were their names: Ben-hur in the hill country of Ephraim; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_9","012_4_9","1KI","4","9","9","Ben-deker in Makaz, in Shaalbim, in Beth-shemesh, and in Elon-beth-hanan; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_10","012_4_10","1KI","4","10","10","Ben-hesed in Arubboth (Socoh and all the land of Hepher belonged to him); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_11","012_4_11","1KI","4","11","11","Ben-abinadab in Naphath-dor (Taphath, a daughter of Solomon, was his wife); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_12","012_4_12","1KI","4","12","12","Baana son of Ahilud in Taanach, in Megiddo, and in all of Beth-shean next to Zarethan below Jezreel, from Beth-shean to Abel-meholah and on past Jokmeam; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_13","012_4_13","1KI","4","13","13","Ben-geber in Ramoth-gilead (the villages of Jair son of Manasseh in Gilead belonged to him, as well as the region of Argob in Bashan with its sixty great cities with walls and bronze bars); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_14","012_4_14","1KI","4","14","14","Ahinadab son of Iddo in Mahanaim; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_15","012_4_15","1KI","4","15","15","Ahimaaz in Naphtali (he had married Basemath, a daughter of Solomon); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_16","012_4_16","1KI","4","16","16","Baana son of Hushai in Asher and in Aloth; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_17","012_4_17","1KI","4","17","17","Jehoshaphat son of Paruah in Issachar; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_18","012_4_18","1KI","4","18","18","Shimei son of Ela in Benjamin; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_19","012_4_19","1KI","4","19","19","Geber son of Uri in the land of Gilead, including the territories of Sihon king of the Amorites and of Og king of Bashan. There was also one governor in the land of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_20","012_4_20","1KI","4","20","20","The people of Judah and Israel were as numerous as the sand on the seashore, and they were eating and drinking and rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_21","012_4_21","1KI","4","21","21","And Solomon reigned over all the kingdoms from the Euphrates to the land of the Philistines, as far as the border of Egypt. These kingdoms offered tribute and served Solomon all the days of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_22","012_4_22","1KI","4","22","22","Solomon’s provisions for a single day were thirty cors of fine flour, sixty cors of meal, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_23","012_4_23","1KI","4","23","23","ten fat oxen, twenty range oxen, and a hundred sheep, as well as deer, gazelles, roebucks, and fattened poultry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_24","012_4_24","1KI","4","24","24","For Solomon had dominion over everything west of the Euphrates—over all the kingdoms from Tiphsah to Gaza—and he had peace on all sides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_25","012_4_25","1KI","4","25","25","Throughout the days of Solomon, Judah and Israel dwelt securely from Dan to Beersheba, each man under his own vine and his own fig tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_26","012_4_26","1KI","4","26","26","Solomon had 4,000 stalls for his chariot horses and 12,000 horses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_27","012_4_27","1KI","4","27","27","Each month the governors in turn provided food for King Solomon and all who came to his table. They saw to it that nothing was lacking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_28","012_4_28","1KI","4","28","28","Each one also brought to the required place their quotas of barley and straw for the chariot horses and other horses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_29","012_4_29","1KI","4","29","29","And God gave Solomon wisdom, exceedingly deep insight, and understanding beyond measure, like the sand on the seashore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_30","012_4_30","1KI","4","30","30","Solomon’s wisdom was greater than that of all the men of the East, greater than all the wisdom of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_31","012_4_31","1KI","4","31","31","He was wiser than all men—wiser than Ethan the Ezrahite, and wiser than Heman, Calcol, and Darda, the sons of Mahol. And his fame spread throughout the surrounding nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_32","012_4_32","1KI","4","32","32","Solomon composed three thousand proverbs, and his songs numbered a thousand and five. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_33","012_4_33","1KI","4","33","33","He spoke of trees, from the cedar in Lebanon to the hyssop growing in the wall, and he taught about animals, birds, reptiles, and fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K14_34","012_4_34","1KI","4","34","34","So men of all nations came to listen to Solomon’s wisdom, sent by all the kings of the earth, who had heard of his wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_1","012_5_1","1KI","5","1","1","Now when Hiram king of Tyre heard that Solomon had been anointed king in his father’s place, he sent envoys to Solomon; for Hiram had always been a friend of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_2","012_5_2","1KI","5","2","2","And Solomon relayed this message to Hiram: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_3","012_5_3","1KI","5","3","3","“As you are well aware, due to the wars waged on all sides against my father David, he could not build a house for the Name of the LORD his God until the LORD had put his enemies under his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_4","012_5_4","1KI","5","4","4","But now the LORD my God has given me rest on every side, and there is no adversary or crisis. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_5","012_5_5","1KI","5","5","5","So behold, I plan to build a house for the Name of the LORD my God, according to what the LORD said to my father David: ‘I will put your son on your throne in your place, and he will build the house for My Name.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_6","012_5_6","1KI","5","6","6","Now therefore, order that cedars of Lebanon be cut down for me. My servants will be with your servants, and I will pay your servants whatever wages you set, for you know that there are none among us as skilled in logging as the Sidonians.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_7","012_5_7","1KI","5","7","7","When Hiram received Solomon’s message, he rejoiced greatly and said, “Blessed be the LORD this day! He has given David a wise son over this great people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_8","012_5_8","1KI","5","8","8","Then Hiram sent a reply to Solomon, saying: “I have received your message; I will do all you desire regarding the cedar and cypress timber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_9","012_5_9","1KI","5","9","9","My servants will haul the logs from Lebanon to the Sea, and I will float them as rafts by sea to the place you specify. There I will separate the logs, and you can take them away. And in exchange, you can meet my needs by providing my household with food.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_10","012_5_10","1KI","5","10","10","So Hiram provided Solomon with all the cedar and cypress timber he wanted, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_11","012_5_11","1KI","5","11","11","and year after year Solomon would provide Hiram with 20,000 cors of wheat as food for his household, as well as 20,000 baths of pure olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_12","012_5_12","1KI","5","12","12","And the LORD gave Solomon wisdom, as He had promised him. There was peace between Hiram and Solomon, and the two of them made a treaty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_13","012_5_13","1KI","5","13","13","Then King Solomon conscripted a labor force of 30,000 men from all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_14","012_5_14","1KI","5","14","14","He sent them to Lebanon in monthly shifts of 10,000 men, so that they would spend one month in Lebanon and two months at home. And Adoniram was in charge of the forced labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_15","012_5_15","1KI","5","15","15","Solomon had 70,000 porters and 80,000 stonecutters in the mountains, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_16","012_5_16","1KI","5","16","16","not including his 3,300 foremen who supervised the workers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_17","012_5_17","1KI","5","17","17","And the king commanded them to quarry large, costly stones to lay the foundation of the temple with dressed stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K15_18","012_5_18","1KI","5","18","18","So Solomon’s and Hiram’s builders, along with the Gebalites, quarried the stone and prepared the timber and stone for the construction of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_1","012_6_1","1KI","6","1","1","In the four hundred and eightieth year after the Israelites had come out of the land of Egypt, in the fourth year of Solomon’s reign over Israel, in the month of Ziv, the second month, he began to build the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_2","012_6_2","1KI","6","2","2","The house that King Solomon built for the LORD was sixty cubits long, twenty cubits wide, and thirty cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_3","012_6_3","1KI","6","3","3","The portico at the front of the main hall of the temple was twenty cubits long, extending across the width of the temple and projecting out ten cubits in front of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_4","012_6_4","1KI","6","4","4","He also had narrow windows framed high in the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_5","012_6_5","1KI","6","5","5","Against the walls of the temple and the inner sanctuary, Solomon built a chambered structure around the temple, in which he constructed the side rooms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_6","012_6_6","1KI","6","6","6","The bottom floor was five cubits wide, the middle floor six cubits, and the third floor seven cubits. He also placed offset ledges around the outside of the temple, so that nothing would be inserted into its walls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_7","012_6_7","1KI","6","7","7","The temple was constructed using finished stones cut at the quarry, so that no hammer or chisel or any other iron tool was heard in the temple while it was being built. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_8","012_6_8","1KI","6","8","8","The entrance to the bottom floor was on the south side of the temple. A stairway led up to the middle level, and from there to the third floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_9","012_6_9","1KI","6","9","9","So Solomon built the temple and finished it, roofing it with beams and planks of cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_10","012_6_10","1KI","6","10","10","He built chambers all along the temple, each five cubits high and attached to the temple with beams of cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_11","012_6_11","1KI","6","11","11","Then the word of the LORD came to Solomon, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_12","012_6_12","1KI","6","12","12","“As for this temple you are building, if you walk in My statutes, carry out My ordinances, and keep all My commandments by walking in them, I will fulfill through you the promise I made to your father David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_13","012_6_13","1KI","6","13","13","And I will dwell among the Israelites and will not abandon My people Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_14","012_6_14","1KI","6","14","14","So Solomon built the temple and finished it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_15","012_6_15","1KI","6","15","15","He lined the interior walls with cedar paneling from the floor of the temple to the ceiling, and he covered the floor with cypress boards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_16","012_6_16","1KI","6","16","16","He partitioned off the twenty cubits at the rear of the temple with cedar boards from floor to ceiling to form within the temple an inner sanctuary, the Most Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_17","012_6_17","1KI","6","17","17","And the main hall in front of this room was forty cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_18","012_6_18","1KI","6","18","18","The cedar paneling inside the temple was carved with gourds and open flowers. Everything was cedar; not a stone could be seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_19","012_6_19","1KI","6","19","19","Solomon also prepared the inner sanctuary within the temple to set the ark of the covenant of the LORD there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_20","012_6_20","1KI","6","20","20","The inner sanctuary was twenty cubits long, twenty cubits wide, and twenty cubits high. He overlaid the inside with pure gold, and he also overlaid the altar of cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_21","012_6_21","1KI","6","21","21","So Solomon overlaid the inside of the temple with pure gold, and he extended gold chains across the front of the inner sanctuary, which was overlaid with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_22","012_6_22","1KI","6","22","22","So he overlaid with gold the whole interior of the temple, until everything was completely finished. He also overlaid with gold the entire altar that belonged to the inner sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_23","012_6_23","1KI","6","23","23","In the inner sanctuary he made two cherubim, each ten cubits high, out of olive wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_24","012_6_24","1KI","6","24","24","One wing of the first cherub was five cubits long, and the other wing was five cubits long as well. So the full wingspan was ten cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_25","012_6_25","1KI","6","25","25","The second cherub also measured ten cubits; both cherubim had the same size and shape, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_26","012_6_26","1KI","6","26","26","and the height of each cherub was ten cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_27","012_6_27","1KI","6","27","27","And he placed the cherubim inside the innermost room of the temple. Since their wings were spread out, the wing of the first cherub touched one wall, while the wing of the second cherub touched the other wall, and in the middle of the room their wingtips touched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_28","012_6_28","1KI","6","28","28","He also overlaid the cherubim with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_29","012_6_29","1KI","6","29","29","Then he carved the walls all around the temple, in both the inner and outer sanctuaries, with carved engravings of cherubim, palm trees, and open flowers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_30","012_6_30","1KI","6","30","30","And he overlaid the temple floor with gold in both the inner and outer sanctuaries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_31","012_6_31","1KI","6","31","31","For the entrance to the inner sanctuary, Solomon constructed doors of olive wood with five-sided doorposts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_32","012_6_32","1KI","6","32","32","The double doors were made of olive wood, and he carved into them cherubim, palm trees, and open flowers and overlaid the cherubim and palm trees with hammered gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_33","012_6_33","1KI","6","33","33","In the same way he made four-sided doorposts of olive wood for the sanctuary entrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_34","012_6_34","1KI","6","34","34","The two doors were made of cypress wood, and each had two folding panels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_35","012_6_35","1KI","6","35","35","He carved into them cherubim, palm trees, and open flowers, and he overlaid them with gold hammered evenly over the carvings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_36","012_6_36","1KI","6","36","36","Solomon built the inner courtyard with three rows of dressed stone and one row of trimmed cedar beams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_37","012_6_37","1KI","6","37","37","The foundation of the house of the LORD was laid in the fourth year of Solomon’s reign, in the month of Ziv. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K16_38","012_6_38","1KI","6","38","38","In the eleventh year, in the month of Bul, the eighth month, the temple was finished in every detail and according to every specification. So he built the temple in seven years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_1","012_7_1","1KI","7","1","1","Solomon, however, took thirteen years to complete the construction of his entire palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_2","012_7_2","1KI","7","2","2","He built the House of the Forest of Lebanon a hundred cubits long, fifty cubits wide, and thirty cubits high, with four rows of cedar pillars supporting the cedar beams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_3","012_7_3","1KI","7","3","3","The house was roofed with cedar above the beams that rested on the pillars—forty-five beams, fifteen per row. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_4","012_7_4","1KI","7","4","4","There were three rows of high windows facing one another in three tiers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_5","012_7_5","1KI","7","5","5","All the doorways had rectangular frames, with the openings facing one another in three tiers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_6","012_7_6","1KI","7","6","6","Solomon made his colonnade fifty cubits long and thirty cubits wide, with a portico in front of it and a canopy with pillars in front of the portico. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_7","012_7_7","1KI","7","7","7","In addition, he built a hall for the throne, the Hall of Justice, where he was to judge. It was paneled with cedar from floor to ceiling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_8","012_7_8","1KI","7","8","8","And the palace where Solomon would live, set further back, was of similar construction. He also made a palace like this hall for Pharaoh’s daughter, whom he had married. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_9","012_7_9","1KI","7","9","9","All these buildings were constructed with costly stones, cut to size and trimmed with saws inside and out from the foundation to the eaves, and from the outside to the great courtyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_10","012_7_10","1KI","7","10","10","The foundations were laid with large, costly stones, some ten cubits long and some eight cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_11","012_7_11","1KI","7","11","11","Above these were costly stones, cut to size, and cedar beams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_12","012_7_12","1KI","7","12","12","The great courtyard was surrounded by three rows of dressed stone and a row of trimmed cedar beams, as were the inner courtyard and portico of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_13","012_7_13","1KI","7","13","13","Now King Solomon sent to bring Huram from Tyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_14","012_7_14","1KI","7","14","14","He was the son of a widow from the tribe of Naphtali, and his father was a man of Tyre, a craftsman in bronze. Huram had great skill, understanding, and knowledge for every kind of bronze work. So he came to King Solomon and carried out all his work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_15","012_7_15","1KI","7","15","15","He cast two pillars of bronze, each eighteen cubits high and twelve cubits in circumference. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_16","012_7_16","1KI","7","16","16","He also made two capitals of cast bronze to set on top of the pillars, each capital five cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_17","012_7_17","1KI","7","17","17","For the capitals on top of the pillars he made a network of lattice, with wreaths of chainwork, seven for each capital. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_18","012_7_18","1KI","7","18","18","Likewise, he made the pillars with two rows of pomegranates around each grating to cover each capital atop the pillars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_19","012_7_19","1KI","7","19","19","And the capitals atop the pillars in the portico were shaped like lilies, four cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_20","012_7_20","1KI","7","20","20","On the capitals of both pillars, just above the rounded projection next to the network, were the two hundred pomegranates in rows encircling each capital. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_21","012_7_21","1KI","7","21","21","Thus he set up the pillars at the portico of the temple. The pillar to the south he named Jachin, and the pillar to the north he named Boaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_22","012_7_22","1KI","7","22","22","And the tops of the pillars were shaped like lilies. So the work of the pillars was completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_23","012_7_23","1KI","7","23","23","He also made the Sea of cast metal. It was circular in shape, measuring ten cubits from rim to rim, five cubits in height, and thirty cubits in circumference. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_24","012_7_24","1KI","7","24","24","Below the rim, ornamental buds encircled it, ten per cubit all the way around the Sea, cast in two rows as a part of the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_25","012_7_25","1KI","7","25","25","The Sea stood on twelve oxen, three facing north, three facing west, three facing south, and three facing east. The Sea rested on them, with all their hindquarters toward the center. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_26","012_7_26","1KI","7","26","26","It was a handbreadth thick, and its rim was fashioned like the brim of a cup, like a lily blossom. It could hold two thousand baths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_27","012_7_27","1KI","7","27","27","In addition, he made ten movable stands of bronze, each four cubits long, four cubits wide, and three cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_28","012_7_28","1KI","7","28","28","This was the design of the stands: They had side panels attached to uprights, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_29","012_7_29","1KI","7","29","29","and on the panels between the uprights were lions, oxen, and cherubim. On the uprights was a pedestal above, and below the lions and oxen were wreaths of beveled work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_30","012_7_30","1KI","7","30","30","Each stand had four bronze wheels with bronze axles and a basin resting on four supports, with wreaths at each side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_31","012_7_31","1KI","7","31","31","The opening to each stand inside the crown at the top was one cubit deep, with a round opening like the design of a pedestal, a cubit and a half wide. And around its opening were engravings, but the panels of the stands were square, not round. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_32","012_7_32","1KI","7","32","32","There were four wheels under the panels, and the axles of the wheels were attached to the stand; each wheel was a cubit and a half in diameter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_33","012_7_33","1KI","7","33","33","The wheels were made like chariot wheels; their axles, rims, spokes, and hubs were all of cast metal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_34","012_7_34","1KI","7","34","34","Each stand had four handles, one for each corner, projecting from the stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_35","012_7_35","1KI","7","35","35","At the top of each stand was a circular band half a cubit high. The supports and panels were cast as a unit with the top of the stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_36","012_7_36","1KI","7","36","36","He engraved cherubim, lions, and palm trees on the surfaces of the supports and panels, wherever each had space, with wreaths all around. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_37","012_7_37","1KI","7","37","37","In this way he made the ten stands, each with the same casting, dimensions, and shape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_38","012_7_38","1KI","7","38","38","He also made ten bronze basins, each holding forty baths and measuring four cubits across, one basin for each of the ten stands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_39","012_7_39","1KI","7","39","39","He set five stands on the south side of the temple and five on the north, and he put the Sea on the south side, at the southeast corner of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_40","012_7_40","1KI","7","40","40","Additionally, Huram made the pots, shovels, and sprinkling bowls. So Huram finished all the work that he had undertaken for King Solomon in the house of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_41","012_7_41","1KI","7","41","41","the two pillars; the two bowl-shaped capitals atop the pillars; the two sets of network covering both bowls of the capitals atop the pillars; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_42","012_7_42","1KI","7","42","42","the four hundred pomegranates for the two sets of network (two rows of pomegranates for each network covering both the bowl-shaped capitals atop the pillars); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_43","012_7_43","1KI","7","43","43","the ten stands; the ten basins on the stands; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_44","012_7_44","1KI","7","44","44","the Sea; the twelve oxen underneath the Sea; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_45","012_7_45","1KI","7","45","45","and the pots, shovels, and sprinkling bowls. All the articles that Huram made for King Solomon in the house of the LORD were made of burnished bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_46","012_7_46","1KI","7","46","46","The king had them cast in clay molds in the plain of the Jordan between Succoth and Zarethan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_47","012_7_47","1KI","7","47","47","Solomon left all these articles unweighed, because there were so many. The weight of the bronze could not be determined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_48","012_7_48","1KI","7","48","48","Solomon also made all the furnishings for the house of the LORD: the golden altar; the golden table on which was placed the Bread of the Presence; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_49","012_7_49","1KI","7","49","49","the lampstands of pure gold in front of the inner sanctuary, five on the right side and five on the left; the gold flowers, lamps, and tongs; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_50","012_7_50","1KI","7","50","50","the pure gold basins, wick trimmers, sprinkling bowls, ladles, and censers; and the gold hinges for the doors of the inner temple (that is, the Most Holy Place) as well as for the doors of the main hall of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K17_51","012_7_51","1KI","7","51","51","So all the work that King Solomon had performed for the house of the LORD was completed. Then Solomon brought in the items his father David had dedicated—the silver, the gold, and the furnishings—and he placed them in the treasuries of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_1","012_8_1","1KI","8","1","1","At that time Solomon assembled before him in Jerusalem the elders of Israel—all the tribal heads and family leaders of the Israelites—to bring up the ark of the covenant of the LORD from Zion, the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_2","012_8_2","1KI","8","2","2","And all the men of Israel came together to King Solomon at the feast in the seventh month, the month of Ethanim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_3","012_8_3","1KI","8","3","3","When all the elders of Israel had arrived, the priests took up the ark, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_4","012_8_4","1KI","8","4","4","and they brought up the ark of the LORD and the Tent of Meeting with all its sacred furnishings. So the priests and Levites carried them up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_5","012_8_5","1KI","8","5","5","There, before the ark, King Solomon and the whole congregation of Israel who had assembled with him sacrificed so many sheep and oxen that they could not be counted or numbered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_6","012_8_6","1KI","8","6","6","Then the priests brought the ark of the covenant of the LORD to its place in the inner sanctuary of the temple, the Most Holy Place, beneath the wings of the cherubim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_7","012_8_7","1KI","8","7","7","For the cherubim spread their wings over the place of the ark and overshadowed the ark and its poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_8","012_8_8","1KI","8","8","8","The poles extended far enough that their ends were visible from the Holy Place in front of the inner sanctuary, but not from outside the Holy Place; and they are there to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_9","012_8_9","1KI","8","9","9","There was nothing in the ark except the two stone tablets that Moses had placed in it at Horeb, where the LORD had made a covenant with the Israelites after they had come out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_10","012_8_10","1KI","8","10","10","And when the priests came out of the Holy Place, the cloud filled the house of the LORD ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_11","012_8_11","1KI","8","11","11","so that the priests could not stand there to minister because of the cloud. For the glory of the LORD filled the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_12","012_8_12","1KI","8","12","12","Then Solomon declared: “The LORD has said that He would dwell in the thick cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_13","012_8_13","1KI","8","13","13","I have indeed built You an exalted house, a place for You to dwell forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_14","012_8_14","1KI","8","14","14","And as the whole assembly of Israel stood there, the king turned around and blessed them all ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_15","012_8_15","1KI","8","15","15","and said: “Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, who has fulfilled with His own hand what He spoke with His mouth to my father David, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_16","012_8_16","1KI","8","16","16","‘Since the day I brought My people Israel out of Egypt, I have not chosen a city from any tribe of Israel in which to build a house so that My Name would be there. But I have chosen David to be over My people Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_17","012_8_17","1KI","8","17","17","Now it was in the heart of my father David to build a house for the Name of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_18","012_8_18","1KI","8","18","18","But the LORD said to my father David, ‘Since it was in your heart to build a house for My Name, you have done well to have this in your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_19","012_8_19","1KI","8","19","19","Nevertheless, you are not the one to build it; but your son, your own offspring, will build the house for My Name.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_20","012_8_20","1KI","8","20","20","Now the LORD has fulfilled the word that He spoke. I have succeeded my father David, and I sit on the throne of Israel, as the LORD promised. I have built the house for the Name of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_21","012_8_21","1KI","8","21","21","And there I have provided a place for the ark, which contains the covenant of the LORD that He made with our fathers when He brought them out of the land of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_22","012_8_22","1KI","8","22","22","Then Solomon stood before the altar of the LORD in front of the whole assembly of Israel, spread out his hands toward heaven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_23","012_8_23","1KI","8","23","23","and said: “O LORD, God of Israel, there is no God like You in heaven above or on earth below, keeping Your covenant of loving devotion with Your servants who walk before You with all their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_24","012_8_24","1KI","8","24","24","You have kept Your promise to Your servant, my father David. What You spoke with Your mouth You have fulfilled with Your hand this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_25","012_8_25","1KI","8","25","25","Therefore now, O LORD, God of Israel, keep for Your servant, my father David, what You promised when You said: ‘You will never fail to have a man to sit before Me on the throne of Israel, if only your descendants guard their way to walk before Me as you have done.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_26","012_8_26","1KI","8","26","26","And now, O God of Israel, please confirm what You promised to Your servant, my father David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_27","012_8_27","1KI","8","27","27","But will God indeed dwell upon the earth? The heavens, even the highest heavens, cannot contain You, much less this temple I have built. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_28","012_8_28","1KI","8","28","28","Yet regard the prayer and plea of Your servant, O LORD my God, so that You may hear the cry and the prayer that Your servant is praying before You today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_29","012_8_29","1KI","8","29","29","May Your eyes be open toward this temple night and day, toward the place of which You said, ‘My Name shall be there,’ so that You may hear the prayer that Your servant prays toward this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_30","012_8_30","1KI","8","30","30","Hear the plea of Your servant and of Your people Israel when they pray toward this place. May You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place. May You hear and forgive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_31","012_8_31","1KI","8","31","31","When a man sins against his neighbor and is required to take an oath, and he comes to take an oath before Your altar in this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_32","012_8_32","1KI","8","32","32","then may You hear from heaven and act. May You judge Your servants, condemning the wicked man by bringing down on his own head what he has done, and justifying the righteous man by rewarding him according to his righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_33","012_8_33","1KI","8","33","33","When Your people Israel are defeated before an enemy because they have sinned against You, and they return to You and confess Your name, praying and pleading with You in this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_34","012_8_34","1KI","8","34","34","then may You hear from heaven and forgive the sin of Your people Israel. May You restore them to the land You gave to their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_35","012_8_35","1KI","8","35","35","When the skies are shut and there is no rain because Your people have sinned against You, and they pray toward this place and confess Your name, and they turn from their sins because You have afflicted them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_36","012_8_36","1KI","8","36","36","then may You hear from heaven and forgive the sin of Your servants, Your people Israel, so that You may teach them the good way in which they should walk. May You send rain on the land that You gave Your people as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_37","012_8_37","1KI","8","37","37","When famine or plague comes upon the land, or blight or mildew or locusts or grasshoppers, or when their enemy besieges them in their cities, whatever plague or sickness may come, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_38","012_8_38","1KI","8","38","38","then may whatever prayer or petition Your people Israel make—each knowing his own afflictions and spreading out his hands toward this temple— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_39","012_8_39","1KI","8","39","39","be heard by You from heaven, Your dwelling place. And may You forgive and act, and repay each man according to all his ways, since You know his heart—for You alone know the hearts of all men— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_40","012_8_40","1KI","8","40","40","so that they may fear You all the days they live in the land that You gave to our fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_41","012_8_41","1KI","8","41","41","And as for the foreigner who is not of Your people Israel but has come from a distant land because of Your name— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_42","012_8_42","1KI","8","42","42","for they will hear of Your great name and mighty hand and outstretched arm—when he comes and prays toward this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_43","012_8_43","1KI","8","43","43","then may You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place, and do according to all for which the foreigner calls to You. Then all the peoples of the earth will know Your name and fear You, as do Your people Israel, and they will know that this house I have built is called by Your Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_44","012_8_44","1KI","8","44","44","When Your people go to war against their enemies, wherever You send them, and when they pray to the LORD in the direction of the city You have chosen and the house I have built for Your Name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_45","012_8_45","1KI","8","45","45","then may You hear from heaven their prayer and their plea, and may You uphold their cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_46","012_8_46","1KI","8","46","46","When they sin against You—for there is no one who does not sin—and You become angry with them and deliver them to an enemy who takes them as captives to his own land, whether far or near, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_47","012_8_47","1KI","8","47","47","and when they come to their senses in the land to which they were taken, and they repent and plead with You in the land of their captors, saying, ‘We have sinned and done wrong; we have acted wickedly,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_48","012_8_48","1KI","8","48","48","and when they return to You with all their heart and soul in the land of the enemies who took them captive, and when they pray to You in the direction of the land that You gave to their fathers, the city You have chosen, and the house I have built for Your Name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_49","012_8_49","1KI","8","49","49","then may You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place, their prayer and petition, and may You uphold their cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_50","012_8_50","1KI","8","50","50","May You forgive Your people who have sinned against You and all the transgressions they have committed against You, and may You grant them compassion in the eyes of their captors to show them mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_51","012_8_51","1KI","8","51","51","For they are Your people and Your inheritance; You brought them out of Egypt, out of the furnace for iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_52","012_8_52","1KI","8","52","52","May Your eyes be open to the pleas of Your servant and of Your people Israel, and may You listen to them whenever they call to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_53","012_8_53","1KI","8","53","53","For You, O Lord GOD, have set them apart from all the peoples of the earth as Your inheritance, as You spoke through Your servant Moses when You brought our fathers out of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_54","012_8_54","1KI","8","54","54","Now when Solomon had finished praying this entire prayer and petition to the LORD, he got up before the altar of the LORD, where he had been kneeling with his hands spread out toward heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_55","012_8_55","1KI","8","55","55","And he stood and blessed the whole assembly of Israel in a loud voice, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_56","012_8_56","1KI","8","56","56","“Blessed be the LORD, who has given rest to His people Israel according to all that He promised. Not one word has failed of all the good promises He made through His servant Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_57","012_8_57","1KI","8","57","57","May the LORD our God be with us, as He was with our fathers. May He never leave us or forsake us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_58","012_8_58","1KI","8","58","58","May He incline our hearts to Himself, to walk in all His ways and to keep the commandments and statutes and ordinances He commanded our fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_59","012_8_59","1KI","8","59","59","And may these words with which I have made my petition before the LORD be near to the LORD our God day and night, so that He may uphold the cause of His servant and of His people Israel as each day requires, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_60","012_8_60","1KI","8","60","60","so that all the peoples of the earth may know that the LORD is God. There is no other! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_61","012_8_61","1KI","8","61","61","So let your heart be fully devoted to the LORD our God, as it is this day, to walk in His statutes and to keep His commandments.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_62","012_8_62","1KI","8","62","62","Then the king and all Israel with him offered sacrifices before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_63","012_8_63","1KI","8","63","63","And Solomon offered as peace offerings to the LORD 22,000 oxen and 120,000 sheep. So the king and all the Israelites dedicated the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_64","012_8_64","1KI","8","64","64","On that same day the king consecrated the middle of the courtyard in front of the house of the LORD, and there he offered the burnt offerings, the grain offerings, and the fat of the peace offerings, since the bronze altar before the LORD was too small to contain all these offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_65","012_8_65","1KI","8","65","65","So at that time Solomon and all Israel with him—a great assembly of people from Lebo-hamath to the Brook of Egypt—kept the feast before the LORD our God for seven days and seven more days—fourteen days in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K18_66","012_8_66","1KI","8","66","66","On the fifteenth day Solomon sent the people away. So they blessed the king and went home, joyful and glad in heart for all the good things that the LORD had done for His servant David and for His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_1","012_9_1","1KI","9","1","1","Now when Solomon had finished building the house of the LORD and the royal palace, and had achieved all that he had desired to do, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_2","012_9_2","1KI","9","2","2","the LORD appeared to him a second time, as He had appeared to him at Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_3","012_9_3","1KI","9","3","3","And the LORD said to him: “I have heard your prayer and petition before Me. I have consecrated this temple, which you have built, by putting My Name there forever; My eyes and My heart will be there for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_4","012_9_4","1KI","9","4","4","And as for you, if you walk before Me as your father David walked, with a heart of integrity and uprightness, doing all I have commanded you, and if you keep My statutes and ordinances, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_5","012_9_5","1KI","9","5","5","then I will establish your royal throne over Israel forever, as I promised your father David when I said, ‘You will never fail to have a man on the throne of Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_6","012_9_6","1KI","9","6","6","But if indeed you or your sons turn away from following Me and do not keep the commandments and statutes I have set before you, and if you go off to serve and worship other gods, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_7","012_9_7","1KI","9","7","7","then I will cut off Israel from the land that I have given them, and I will banish from My presence this temple I have sanctified for My Name. Then Israel will become an object of scorn and ridicule among all peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_8","012_9_8","1KI","9","8","8","And when this temple has become a heap of rubble, all who pass by it will be appalled and will hiss and say, ‘Why has the LORD done such a thing to this land and to this temple?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_9","012_9_9","1KI","9","9","9","And others will answer, ‘Because they have forsaken the LORD their God who brought their fathers out of the land of Egypt, and have embraced other gods, worshiping and serving them—because of this, the LORD has brought all this disaster upon them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_10","012_9_10","1KI","9","10","10","Now at the end of the twenty years during which Solomon built these two houses, the house of the LORD and the royal palace, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_11","012_9_11","1KI","9","11","11","King Solomon gave twenty towns in the land of Galilee to Hiram king of Tyre, who had supplied him with cedar and cypress logs and gold for his every desire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_12","012_9_12","1KI","9","12","12","So Hiram went out from Tyre to inspect the towns that Solomon had given him, but he was not pleased with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_13","012_9_13","1KI","9","13","13","“What are these towns you have given me, my brother?” asked Hiram, and he called them the Land of Cabul, as they are called to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_14","012_9_14","1KI","9","14","14","And Hiram had sent the king 120 talents of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_15","012_9_15","1KI","9","15","15","This is the account of the forced labor that King Solomon imposed to build the house of the LORD, his own palace, the supporting terraces, and the wall of Jerusalem, as well as Hazor, Megiddo, and Gezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_16","012_9_16","1KI","9","16","16","Pharaoh king of Egypt had attacked and captured Gezer. He had set it on fire, killed the Canaanites who lived in the city, and given it as a dowry to his daughter, Solomon’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_17","012_9_17","1KI","9","17","17","So Solomon rebuilt Gezer, Lower Beth-horon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_18","012_9_18","1KI","9","18","18","Baalath, and Tamar in the Wilderness of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_19","012_9_19","1KI","9","19","19","as well as all the store cities that Solomon had for his chariots and horses—whatever he desired to build in Jerusalem, Lebanon, and throughout the land of his dominion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_20","012_9_20","1KI","9","20","20","As for all the people who remained of the Amorites, Hittites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites (the people who were not Israelites)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_21","012_9_21","1KI","9","21","21","their descendants who remained in the land, those whom the Israelites were unable to devote to destruction—Solomon conscripted these people to be forced laborers, as they are to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_22","012_9_22","1KI","9","22","22","But Solomon did not consign any of the Israelites to slavery, because they were his men of war, his servants, his officers, his captains, and the commanders of his chariots and cavalry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_23","012_9_23","1KI","9","23","23","They were also the chief officers over Solomon’s projects: 550 supervisors over the people who did the work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_24","012_9_24","1KI","9","24","24","As soon as Pharaoh’s daughter had come up from the City of David to the palace that Solomon had built for her, he built the supporting terraces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_25","012_9_25","1KI","9","25","25","Three times a year Solomon offered burnt offerings and peace offerings on the altar he had built for the LORD, burning incense with them before the LORD. So he completed the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_26","012_9_26","1KI","9","26","26","King Solomon also assembled a fleet of ships at Ezion-geber, which is near Eloth in Edom, on the shore of the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_27","012_9_27","1KI","9","27","27","And Hiram sent his servants, sailors who knew the sea, to serve in the fleet with Solomon’s servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K19_28","012_9_28","1KI","9","28","28","They sailed to Ophir and imported gold from there—420 talents—and delivered it to Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_1","012_10_1","1KI","10","1","1","Now when the queen of Sheba heard about the fame of Solomon concerning the name of the LORD, she came to test him with difficult questions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_2","012_10_2","1KI","10","2","2","She arrived in Jerusalem with a very large caravan—with camels bearing spices, gold in great abundance, and precious stones. And she came to Solomon and spoke to him all that was on her mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_3","012_10_3","1KI","10","3","3","And Solomon answered all her questions; nothing was too difficult for the king to explain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_4","012_10_4","1KI","10","4","4","When the queen of Sheba saw all the wisdom of Solomon, the palace he had built, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_5","012_10_5","1KI","10","5","5","the food at his table, the seating of his servants, the service and attire of his attendants, his cupbearers, and the burnt offerings he presented at the house of the LORD, it took her breath away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_6","012_10_6","1KI","10","6","6","She said to the king, “The report I heard in my own country about your words and wisdom is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_7","012_10_7","1KI","10","7","7","But I did not believe these things until I came and saw with my own eyes. Indeed, not even half was told to me. Your wisdom and prosperity have far exceeded the report I heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_8","012_10_8","1KI","10","8","8","How blessed are your men! How blessed are these servants of yours who stand continually before you and hear your wisdom! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_9","012_10_9","1KI","10","9","9","Blessed be the LORD your God, who has delighted in you to set you on the throne of Israel. Because of the LORD’s eternal love for Israel, He has made you king to carry out justice and righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_10","012_10_10","1KI","10","10","10","Then she gave the king 120 talents of gold, a great quantity of spices, and precious stones. Never again were spices in such abundance brought in as those the queen of Sheba gave to King Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_11","012_10_11","1KI","10","11","11","(The fleet of Hiram that brought gold from Ophir also brought from Ophir a great cargo of almug wood and precious stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_12","012_10_12","1KI","10","12","12","The king made the almug wood into steps for the house of the LORD and for the king’s palace, and into lyres and harps for the singers. Never before had such almug wood been brought in, nor has such been seen again to this day.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_13","012_10_13","1KI","10","13","13","King Solomon gave the queen of Sheba all she desired—whatever she asked—besides what he had given her out of his royal bounty. Then she left and returned to her own country, along with her servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_14","012_10_14","1KI","10","14","14","The weight of gold that came to Solomon each year was 666 talents, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_15","012_10_15","1KI","10","15","15","not including the revenue from the merchants, traders, and all the Arabian kings and governors of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_16","012_10_16","1KI","10","16","16","King Solomon made two hundred large shields of hammered gold; six hundred shekels of gold went into each shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_17","012_10_17","1KI","10","17","17","He also made three hundred small shields of hammered gold; three minas of gold went into each shield. And the king put them in the House of the Forest of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_18","012_10_18","1KI","10","18","18","Additionally, the king made a great throne of ivory and overlaid it with pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_19","012_10_19","1KI","10","19","19","The throne had six steps, and its back had a rounded top. There were armrests on both sides of the seat, with a lion standing beside each armrest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_20","012_10_20","1KI","10","20","20","Twelve lions stood on the six steps, one at either end of each step. Nothing like this had ever been made for any kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_21","012_10_21","1KI","10","21","21","All King Solomon’s drinking cups were gold, and all the utensils of the House of the Forest of Lebanon were pure gold. There was no silver, because it was accounted as nothing in the days of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_22","012_10_22","1KI","10","22","22","For the king had the ships of Tarshish at sea with Hiram’s fleet, and once every three years the ships of Tarshish would arrive bearing gold, silver, ivory, apes, and peacocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_23","012_10_23","1KI","10","23","23","So King Solomon surpassed all the kings of the earth in riches and wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_24","012_10_24","1KI","10","24","24","The whole world sought an audience with Solomon to hear the wisdom that God had put in his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_25","012_10_25","1KI","10","25","25","Year after year, each visitor would bring his tribute: articles of silver and gold, clothing, weapons, spices, horses, and mules. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_26","012_10_26","1KI","10","26","26","Solomon accumulated 1,400 chariots and 12,000 horses, which he stationed in the chariot cities and also with him in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_27","012_10_27","1KI","10","27","27","The king made silver as common in Jerusalem as stones, and cedar as abundant as sycamore in the foothills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_28","012_10_28","1KI","10","28","28","Solomon’s horses were imported from Egypt and Kue; the royal merchants purchased them from Kue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K110_29","012_10_29","1KI","10","29","29","A chariot could be imported from Egypt for six hundred shekels of silver, and a horse for a hundred and fifty. Likewise, they exported them to all the kings of the Hittites and to the kings of Aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_1","012_11_1","1KI","11","1","1","King Solomon, however, loved many foreign women along with the daughter of Pharaoh—women of Moab, Ammon, Edom, and Sidon, as well as Hittite women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_2","012_11_2","1KI","11","2","2","These women were from the nations about which the LORD had told the Israelites, “You must not intermarry with them, for surely they will turn your hearts after their gods.” Yet Solomon clung to these women in love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_3","012_11_3","1KI","11","3","3","He had seven hundred wives of royal birth and three hundred concubines—and his wives turned his heart away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_4","012_11_4","1KI","11","4","4","For when Solomon grew old, his wives turned his heart after other gods, and he was not wholeheartedly devoted to the LORD his God, as his father David had been. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_5","012_11_5","1KI","11","5","5","Solomon followed Ashtoreth the goddess of the Sidonians and Milcom the abomination of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_6","012_11_6","1KI","11","6","6","So Solomon did evil in the sight of the LORD; unlike his father David, he did not follow the LORD completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_7","012_11_7","1KI","11","7","7","At that time on a hill east of Jerusalem, Solomon built a high place for Chemosh the abomination of Moab and for Molech the abomination of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_8","012_11_8","1KI","11","8","8","He did the same for all his foreign wives, who burned incense and sacrificed to their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_9","012_11_9","1KI","11","9","9","Now the LORD grew angry with Solomon, because his heart had turned away from the LORD, the God of Israel, who had appeared to him twice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_10","012_11_10","1KI","11","10","10","Although He had warned Solomon explicitly not to follow other gods, Solomon did not keep the LORD’s command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_11","012_11_11","1KI","11","11","11","Then the LORD said to Solomon, “Because you have done this and have not kept My covenant and My statutes, which I have commanded you, I will tear the kingdom away from you and give it to your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_12","012_11_12","1KI","11","12","12","Nevertheless, for the sake of your father David, I will not do it during your lifetime; I will tear it out of the hand of your son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_13","012_11_13","1KI","11","13","13","Yet I will not tear the whole kingdom away from him. I will give one tribe to your son for the sake of My servant David and for the sake of Jerusalem, which I have chosen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_14","012_11_14","1KI","11","14","14","Then the LORD raised up against Solomon an adversary, Hadad the Edomite, from the royal line of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_15","012_11_15","1KI","11","15","15","Earlier, when David was in Edom, Joab the commander of the army had gone to bury the dead and had struck down every male in Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_16","012_11_16","1KI","11","16","16","Joab and all Israel had stayed there six months, until he had killed every male in Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_17","012_11_17","1KI","11","17","17","But Hadad, still just a young boy, had fled to Egypt, along with some Edomites who were servants of his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_18","012_11_18","1KI","11","18","18","Hadad and his men set out from Midian and went to Paran. They took men from Paran with them and went to Egypt, to Pharaoh king of Egypt, who gave Hadad a house and land and provided him with food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_19","012_11_19","1KI","11","19","19","There Hadad found such great favor in the sight of Pharaoh that he gave to him in marriage the sister of Queen Tahpenes, his own wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_20","012_11_20","1KI","11","20","20","And the sister of Tahpenes bore Hadad a son named Genubath. Tahpenes herself weaned him in Pharaoh’s palace, and Genubath lived there among the sons of Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_21","012_11_21","1KI","11","21","21","When Hadad heard in Egypt that David had rested with his fathers and that Joab, the commander of the army, was dead, he said to Pharaoh, “Let me go, that I may return to my own country.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_22","012_11_22","1KI","11","22","22","But Pharaoh asked him, “What have you lacked here with me that you suddenly want to go back to your own country?” “Nothing,” Hadad replied, “but please let me go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_23","012_11_23","1KI","11","23","23","And God raised up against Solomon another adversary, Rezon the son of Eliada, who had fled from his master, Hadadezer king of Zobah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_24","012_11_24","1KI","11","24","24","and had gathered men to himself. When David killed the Zobaites, Rezon captained a band of raiders and went to Damascus, where they settled and gained control. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_25","012_11_25","1KI","11","25","25","Rezon was Israel’s enemy throughout the days of Solomon, adding to the trouble caused by Hadad. So Rezon ruled over Aram with hostility toward Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_26","012_11_26","1KI","11","26","26","Now Jeroboam son of Nebat was an Ephraimite from Zeredah whose mother was a widow named Zeruah. Jeroboam was a servant of Solomon, but he rebelled against the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_27","012_11_27","1KI","11","27","27","and this is the account of his rebellion against the king. Solomon had built the supporting terraces and repaired the gap in the wall of the city of his father David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_28","012_11_28","1KI","11","28","28","Now Jeroboam was a mighty man of valor. So when Solomon noticed that the young man was industrious, he put him in charge of the whole labor force of the house of Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_29","012_11_29","1KI","11","29","29","During that time, the prophet Ahijah the Shilonite met Jeroboam on the road as he was going out of Jerusalem. Now Ahijah had wrapped himself in a new cloak, and the two of them were alone in the open field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_30","012_11_30","1KI","11","30","30","And Ahijah took hold of the new cloak he was wearing, tore it into twelve pieces, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_31","012_11_31","1KI","11","31","31","and said to Jeroboam, “Take ten pieces for yourself, for this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Behold, I will tear the kingdom out of the hand of Solomon, and I will give you ten tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_32","012_11_32","1KI","11","32","32","But one tribe will remain for the sake of My servant David and for the sake of Jerusalem, the city I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_33","012_11_33","1KI","11","33","33","For they have forsaken Me to worship Ashtoreth the goddess of the Sidonians, Chemosh the god of the Moabites, and Milcom the god of the Ammonites. They have not walked in My ways, nor done what is right in My eyes, nor kept My statutes and judgments, as Solomon’s father David did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_34","012_11_34","1KI","11","34","34","Nevertheless, I will not take the whole kingdom out of Solomon’s hand, because I have made him ruler all the days of his life for the sake of David My servant, whom I chose because he kept My commandments and statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_35","012_11_35","1KI","11","35","35","But I will take ten tribes of the kingdom from the hand of his son and give them to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_36","012_11_36","1KI","11","36","36","I will give one tribe to his son, so that My servant David will always have a lamp before Me in Jerusalem, the city where I chose to put My Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_37","012_11_37","1KI","11","37","37","But as for you, I will take you, and you shall reign over all that your heart desires, and you will be king over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_38","012_11_38","1KI","11","38","38","If you listen to all that I command you, walk in My ways, and do what is right in My sight in order to keep My statutes and commandments as My servant David did, then I will be with you. I will build you a lasting dynasty just as I built for David, and I will give Israel to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_39","012_11_39","1KI","11","39","39","Because of this, I will humble David’s descendants—but not forever.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_40","012_11_40","1KI","11","40","40","Solomon therefore sought to kill Jeroboam. But Jeroboam arose and fled to Egypt, to Shishak king of Egypt, where he remained until the death of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_41","012_11_41","1KI","11","41","41","As for the rest of the acts of Solomon—all that he did, as well as his wisdom—are they not written in the Book of the Acts of Solomon? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_42","012_11_42","1KI","11","42","42","Thus the time that Solomon reigned in Jerusalem over all Israel was forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K111_43","012_11_43","1KI","11","43","43","And Solomon rested with his fathers and was buried in the city of his father David. And his son Rehoboam reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_1","012_12_1","1KI","12","1","1","Then Rehoboam went to Shechem, for all Israel had gone there to make him king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_2","012_12_2","1KI","12","2","2","When Jeroboam son of Nebat heard about this, he was still in Egypt where he had fled from King Solomon and had been living ever since. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_3","012_12_3","1KI","12","3","3","So they sent for Jeroboam, and he and the whole assembly of Israel came to Rehoboam and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_4","012_12_4","1KI","12","4","4","“Your father put a heavy yoke on us. But now you must lighten the burden of your father’s service and the heavy yoke he put on us, and we will serve you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_5","012_12_5","1KI","12","5","5","Rehoboam answered, “Go away for three days and then return to me.” So the people departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_6","012_12_6","1KI","12","6","6","Then King Rehoboam consulted with the elders who had served his father Solomon during his lifetime. “How do you advise me to respond to these people?” he asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_7","012_12_7","1KI","12","7","7","They replied, “If you will be a servant to these people and serve them this day, and if you will respond by speaking kind words to them, they will be your servants forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_8","012_12_8","1KI","12","8","8","But Rehoboam rejected the advice of the elders; instead, he consulted the young men who had grown up with him and served him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_9","012_12_9","1KI","12","9","9","He asked them, “What message do you advise that we send back to these people who have spoken to me, saying, ‘Lighten the yoke your father put on us’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_10","012_12_10","1KI","12","10","10","The young men who had grown up with him replied, “This is how you should answer these people who said to you, ‘Your father made our yoke heavy, but you must make it lighter.’ This is what you should tell them: ‘My little finger is thicker than my father’s waist! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_11","012_12_11","1KI","12","11","11","Whereas my father burdened you with a heavy yoke, I will add to your yoke. Whereas my father scourged you with whips, I will scourge you with scorpions.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_12","012_12_12","1KI","12","12","12","After three days, Jeroboam and all the people returned to Rehoboam, since the king had said, “Come back to me on the third day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_13","012_12_13","1KI","12","13","13","And the king answered the people harshly. He rejected the advice of the elders ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_14","012_12_14","1KI","12","14","14","and spoke to them as the young men had advised, saying, “Whereas my father made your yoke heavy, I will add to your yoke. Whereas my father scourged you with whips, I will scourge you with scorpions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_15","012_12_15","1KI","12","15","15","So the king did not listen to the people, and indeed this turn of events was from the LORD, to fulfill the word He had spoken to Jeroboam son of Nebat through Ahijah the Shilonite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_16","012_12_16","1KI","12","16","16","When all Israel saw that the king had refused to listen to them, they answered the king: “What portion do we have in David, and what inheritance in the son of Jesse? To your tents, O Israel! Look now to your own house, O David!” So the Israelites went home, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_17","012_12_17","1KI","12","17","17","but Rehoboam still reigned over the Israelites living in the cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_18","012_12_18","1KI","12","18","18","Then King Rehoboam sent out Adoram, who was in charge of the forced labor, but all Israel stoned him to death. And King Rehoboam mounted his chariot in haste and escaped to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_19","012_12_19","1KI","12","19","19","So to this day Israel has been in rebellion against the house of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_20","012_12_20","1KI","12","20","20","When all Israel heard that Jeroboam had returned, they summoned him to the assembly and made him king over all Israel. Only the tribe of Judah followed the house of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_21","012_12_21","1KI","12","21","21","And when Rehoboam arrived in Jerusalem, he mobilized the whole house of Judah and the tribe of Benjamin—180,000 chosen warriors—to fight against the house of Israel and restore the kingdom to Rehoboam son of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_22","012_12_22","1KI","12","22","22","But the word of God came to Shemaiah the man of God: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_23","012_12_23","1KI","12","23","23","“Tell Rehoboam son of Solomon king of Judah, all the house of Judah and Benjamin, and the rest of the people ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_24","012_12_24","1KI","12","24","24","that this is what the LORD says: ‘You are not to go up and fight against your brothers, the Israelites. Each of you must return home, for this is My doing.’” So they listened to the word of the LORD and turned back according to the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_25","012_12_25","1KI","12","25","25","Then Jeroboam built Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim and lived there. And from there he went out and built Penuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_26","012_12_26","1KI","12","26","26","Jeroboam said in his heart, “Now the kingdom might revert to the house of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_27","012_12_27","1KI","12","27","27","If these people go up to offer sacrifices in the house of the LORD at Jerusalem, their hearts will return to their lord, Rehoboam king of Judah; then they will kill me and return to Rehoboam king of Judah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_28","012_12_28","1KI","12","28","28","After seeking advice, the king made two golden calves and said to the people, “Going up to Jerusalem is too much for you. Here, O Israel, are your gods, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_29","012_12_29","1KI","12","29","29","One calf he set up in Bethel, and the other in Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_30","012_12_30","1KI","12","30","30","And this thing became a sin; the people walked as far as Dan to worship before one of the calves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_31","012_12_31","1KI","12","31","31","Jeroboam also built shrines on the high places and appointed from every class of people priests who were not Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_32","012_12_32","1KI","12","32","32","And Jeroboam ordained a feast on the fifteenth day of the eighth month, like the feast that was in Judah, and he offered sacrifices on the altar; he made this offering in Bethel to sacrifice to the calves he had set up, and he installed priests in Bethel for the high places he had set up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K112_33","012_12_33","1KI","12","33","33","On the fifteenth day of the eighth month, a month of his own choosing, Jeroboam offered sacrifices on the altar he had set up in Bethel. So he ordained a feast for the Israelites, offered sacrifices on the altar, and burned incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_1","012_13_1","1KI","13","1","1","Suddenly, as Jeroboam was standing beside the altar to burn incense, there came a man of God from Judah to Bethel by the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_2","012_13_2","1KI","13","2","2","And he cried out against the altar by the word of the LORD, “O altar, O altar, this is what the LORD says: ‘A son named Josiah will be born to the house of David, and upon you he will sacrifice the priests of the high places who burn incense upon you, and human bones will be burned upon you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_3","012_13_3","1KI","13","3","3","That day the man of God gave a sign, saying, “The LORD has spoken this sign: ‘Surely the altar will be split apart, and the ashes upon it will be poured out.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_4","012_13_4","1KI","13","4","4","Now when King Jeroboam, who was at the altar in Bethel, heard the word that the man of God had cried out against it, he stretched out his hand and said, “Seize him!” But the hand he stretched out toward him withered, so that he could not pull it back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_5","012_13_5","1KI","13","5","5","And the altar was split apart, and the ashes poured out, according to the sign that the man of God had given by the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_6","012_13_6","1KI","13","6","6","Then the king responded to the man of God, “Intercede with the LORD your God and pray for me that my hand may be restored.” So the man of God interceded with the LORD, and the king’s hand was restored to him as it was before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_7","012_13_7","1KI","13","7","7","Then the king said to the man of God, “Come home with me and refresh yourself, and I will give you a reward.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_8","012_13_8","1KI","13","8","8","But the man of God replied, “If you were to give me half your possessions, I still would not go with you, nor would I eat bread or drink water in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_9","012_13_9","1KI","13","9","9","For this is what I was commanded by the word of the LORD: ‘You must not eat bread or drink water or return by the way you came.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_10","012_13_10","1KI","13","10","10","So the man of God went another way and did not return by the way he had come to Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_11","012_13_11","1KI","13","11","11","Now a certain old prophet was living in Bethel, and his sons came and told him all the deeds that the man of God had done that day in Bethel. They also told their father the words that the man had spoken to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_12","012_13_12","1KI","13","12","12","“Which way did he go?” their father asked. And his sons showed him the way taken by the man of God, who had come from Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_13","012_13_13","1KI","13","13","13","So the prophet said to his sons, “Saddle the donkey for me.” Then they saddled the donkey for him, and he mounted it ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_14","012_13_14","1KI","13","14","14","and went after the man of God. He found him sitting under an oak tree and asked, “Are you the man of God who came from Judah?” “I am,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_15","012_13_15","1KI","13","15","15","So the prophet said to the man of God, “Come home with me and eat some bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_16","012_13_16","1KI","13","16","16","But the man replied, “I cannot go home with you, and I will not eat bread or drink water with you in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_17","012_13_17","1KI","13","17","17","For I have been told by the word of the LORD: ‘You must not eat bread or drink water there or return by the way you came.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_18","012_13_18","1KI","13","18","18","Then the prophet replied, “I too am a prophet like you, and an angel spoke to me by the word of the LORD, saying, ‘Bring him back with you to your house, so that he may eat bread and drink water.’” The old prophet was lying to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_19","012_13_19","1KI","13","19","19","but the man of God went back with him, ate bread in his house, and drank water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_20","012_13_20","1KI","13","20","20","While they were sitting at the table, the word of the LORD came to the prophet who had brought him back, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_21","012_13_21","1KI","13","21","21","and the prophet cried out to the man of God who had come from Judah, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Because you have defied the word of the LORD and have not kept the commandment that the LORD your God gave you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_22","012_13_22","1KI","13","22","22","but you went back and ate bread and drank water in the place where He told you not to do so, your body shall never reach the tomb of your fathers.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_23","012_13_23","1KI","13","23","23","And after the man of God had finished eating and drinking, the old prophet who had brought him back saddled the donkey for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_24","012_13_24","1KI","13","24","24","As he went on his way, a lion met him on the road and killed him, and his body was left lying in the road, with the donkey and the lion standing beside it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_25","012_13_25","1KI","13","25","25","And there were men passing by who saw the body lying in the road with the lion standing beside it, and they went and reported this in the city where the old prophet lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_26","012_13_26","1KI","13","26","26","When the prophet who had brought him back from his journey heard this, he said, “It is the man of God who disobeyed the command of the LORD. Therefore the LORD has delivered him to the lion, and it has mauled him and killed him, according to the word that the LORD had spoken to him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_27","012_13_27","1KI","13","27","27","Then the old prophet instructed his sons, “Saddle the donkey for me.” So they saddled it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_28","012_13_28","1KI","13","28","28","and he went and found the body lying in the road, with the donkey and the lion standing beside it. The lion had not eaten the body or mauled the donkey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_29","012_13_29","1KI","13","29","29","So the old prophet lifted up the body of the man of God, laid it on the donkey, and brought it back to his own city to mourn for him and bury him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_30","012_13_30","1KI","13","30","30","Then he laid the body in his own tomb, and they lamented over him, “Oh, my brother!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_31","012_13_31","1KI","13","31","31","After he had buried him, the prophet said to his sons, “When I die, you must bury me in the tomb where the man of God is buried. Lay my bones beside his bones, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_32","012_13_32","1KI","13","32","32","for the message that he cried out by the word of the LORD against the altar in Bethel and against all the shrines on the high places in the cities of Samaria will surely come to pass.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_33","012_13_33","1KI","13","33","33","Even after these events, Jeroboam did not repent of his evil ways, but again he appointed priests for the high places from every class of people. He ordained anyone who desired to be a priest of the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K113_34","012_13_34","1KI","13","34","34","And this was the sin of the house of Jeroboam that led to its extermination and destruction from the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_1","012_14_1","1KI","14","1","1","At that time Abijah son of Jeroboam became ill, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_2","012_14_2","1KI","14","2","2","and Jeroboam said to his wife, “Now get up, disguise yourself so they will not recognize you as my wife, and go to Shiloh. For Ahijah the prophet is there; it was he who spoke about my kingship over this people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_3","012_14_3","1KI","14","3","3","Take with you ten loaves of bread, some cakes, and a jar of honey, and go to him. He will tell you what will become of the boy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_4","012_14_4","1KI","14","4","4","Jeroboam’s wife did as instructed; she arose and went to Shiloh and arrived at Ahijah’s house. Now Ahijah could not see, for his eyes were dim because of his age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_5","012_14_5","1KI","14","5","5","But the LORD had said to Ahijah, “Behold, the wife of Jeroboam is coming to ask you about her son, for he is ill. You are to say such and such to her, because when she arrives, she will be disguised.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_6","012_14_6","1KI","14","6","6","So when Ahijah heard the sound of her feet entering the door, he said, “Come in, wife of Jeroboam! Why are you disguised? For I have been sent to you with bad news. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_7","012_14_7","1KI","14","7","7","Go, tell Jeroboam that this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I raised you up from among the people and appointed you ruler over My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_8","012_14_8","1KI","14","8","8","I tore the kingdom away from the house of David and gave it to you. But you have not been like My servant David, who kept My commandments and followed Me with all his heart, doing only what was right in My eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_9","012_14_9","1KI","14","9","9","You have done more evil than all who came before you. You have proceeded to make for yourself other gods and molten images to provoke Me, and you have flung Me behind your back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_10","012_14_10","1KI","14","10","10","Because of all this, behold, I am bringing disaster on the house of Jeroboam: I will cut off from Jeroboam every male, both slave and free, in Israel; I will burn up the house of Jeroboam as one burns up dung until it is gone! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_11","012_14_11","1KI","14","11","11","Anyone belonging to Jeroboam who dies in the city will be eaten by dogs, and anyone who dies in the field will be eaten by the birds of the air.’ For the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_12","012_14_12","1KI","14","12","12","As for you, get up and go home. When your feet enter the city, the child will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_13","012_14_13","1KI","14","13","13","All Israel will mourn for him and bury him. For this is the only one belonging to Jeroboam who will receive a proper burial, because only in him has the LORD, the God of Israel, found any good in the house of Jeroboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_14","012_14_14","1KI","14","14","14","Moreover, the LORD will raise up for Himself a king over Israel who will cut off the house of Jeroboam. This is the day—yes, even today! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_15","012_14_15","1KI","14","15","15","For the LORD will strike Israel as a reed is shaken in the water. He will uproot Israel from this good land that He gave their fathers, and He will scatter them beyond the Euphrates, because they have made their Asherah poles, provoking the LORD to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_16","012_14_16","1KI","14","16","16","So He will give Israel over on account of the sins Jeroboam has committed and has caused Israel to commit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_17","012_14_17","1KI","14","17","17","Then Jeroboam’s wife got up and departed for Tirzah, and as soon as she stepped over the threshold of the house, the boy died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_18","012_14_18","1KI","14","18","18","And they buried him, and all Israel mourned for him, according to the word that the LORD had spoken through His servant Ahijah the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_19","012_14_19","1KI","14","19","19","As for the rest of the acts of Jeroboam, how he waged war and how he reigned, they are indeed written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_20","012_14_20","1KI","14","20","20","And the length of Jeroboam’s reign was twenty-two years, and he rested with his fathers, and his son Nadab reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_21","012_14_21","1KI","14","21","21","Meanwhile, Rehoboam son of Solomon reigned in Judah. He was forty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned seventeen years in Jerusalem, the city the LORD had chosen from all the tribes of Israel in which to put His Name. His mother’s name was Naamah the Ammonite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_22","012_14_22","1KI","14","22","22","And Judah did evil in the sight of the LORD, and by the sins they committed they provoked Him to jealous anger more than all their fathers had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_23","012_14_23","1KI","14","23","23","They also built for themselves high places, sacred pillars, and Asherah poles on every high hill and under every green tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_24","012_14_24","1KI","14","24","24","There were even male shrine prostitutes in the land. They imitated all the abominations of the nations the LORD had driven out before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_25","012_14_25","1KI","14","25","25","In the fifth year of Rehoboam’s reign, Shishak king of Egypt attacked Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_26","012_14_26","1KI","14","26","26","He seized the treasures of the house of the LORD and of the royal palace. He took everything, including all the gold shields that Solomon had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_27","012_14_27","1KI","14","27","27","Then King Rehoboam made bronze shields in their place and committed them to the care of the captains of the guard on duty at the entrance to the royal palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_28","012_14_28","1KI","14","28","28","And whenever the king entered the house of the LORD, the guards would bear the shields, and later they would return them to the guardroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_29","012_14_29","1KI","14","29","29","As for the rest of the acts of Rehoboam, along with all that he did, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_30","012_14_30","1KI","14","30","30","There was war between Rehoboam and Jeroboam throughout their days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K114_31","012_14_31","1KI","14","31","31","And Rehoboam rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David; his mother’s name was Naamah the Ammonite. And his son Abijam reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_1","012_15_1","1KI","15","1","1","In the eighteenth year of the reign of Jeroboam son of Nebat, Abijam became king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_2","012_15_2","1KI","15","2","2","and he reigned in Jerusalem three years. His mother’s name was Maacah daughter of Abishalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_3","012_15_3","1KI","15","3","3","And Abijam walked in all the sins that his father before him had committed, and his heart was not as fully devoted to the LORD his God as the heart of David his forefather had been. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_4","012_15_4","1KI","15","4","4","Nevertheless, for the sake of David, the LORD his God gave him a lamp in Jerusalem by raising up a son to succeed him and to make Jerusalem strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_5","012_15_5","1KI","15","5","5","For David had done what was right in the eyes of the LORD and had not turned aside from anything the LORD commanded all the days of his life, except in the matter of Uriah the Hittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_6","012_15_6","1KI","15","6","6","And there was war between the houses of Rehoboam and Jeroboam all the days of Abijam’s life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_7","012_15_7","1KI","15","7","7","As for the rest of the acts of Abijam, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? And there was war between Abijam and Jeroboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_8","012_15_8","1KI","15","8","8","And Abijam rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David, and his son Asa reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_9","012_15_9","1KI","15","9","9","In the twentieth year of Jeroboam’s reign over Israel, Asa became king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_10","012_15_10","1KI","15","10","10","and he reigned in Jerusalem forty-one years. His grandmother’s name was Maacah daughter of Abishalom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_11","012_15_11","1KI","15","11","11","And Asa did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, as his father David had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_12","012_15_12","1KI","15","12","12","He banished the male shrine prostitutes from the land and removed all the idols that his fathers had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_13","012_15_13","1KI","15","13","13","He also removed his grandmother Maacah from her position as queen mother because she had made a detestable Asherah pole. Asa chopped down the pole and burned it in the Kidron Valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_14","012_15_14","1KI","15","14","14","The high places were not removed, but Asa’s heart was fully devoted to the LORD all his days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_15","012_15_15","1KI","15","15","15","And he brought into the house of the LORD the silver and gold and the articles that he and his father had dedicated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_16","012_15_16","1KI","15","16","16","Now there was war between Asa and Baasha king of Israel throughout their days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_17","012_15_17","1KI","15","17","17","Baasha king of Israel went to war against Judah and fortified Ramah to prevent anyone from leaving or entering the territory of Asa king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_18","012_15_18","1KI","15","18","18","So Asa withdrew all the silver and gold that remained in the treasuries of the house of the LORD and the royal palace. He entrusted it to his servants and sent them with this message to Ben-hadad son of Tabrimmon, the son of Hezion, the king of Aram, who was ruling in Damascus: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_19","012_15_19","1KI","15","19","19","“Let there be a treaty between me and you as there was between my father and your father. See, I have sent you a gift of silver and gold. Now go and break your treaty with Baasha king of Israel, so that he will withdraw from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_20","012_15_20","1KI","15","20","20","And Ben-hadad listened to King Asa and sent the commanders of his armies against the cities of Israel, conquering Ijon, Dan, Abel-beth-maacah, and the whole land of Naphtali, including the region of Chinnereth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_21","012_15_21","1KI","15","21","21","When Baasha learned of this, he stopped fortifying Ramah and withdrew to Tirzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_22","012_15_22","1KI","15","22","22","Then King Asa summoned all the men of Judah, with no exceptions, and they carried away the stones of Ramah and the timbers Baasha had used for building. And with these materials King Asa built up Geba of Benjamin, as well as Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_23","012_15_23","1KI","15","23","23","Now the rest of the acts of Asa, along with all his might, all his accomplishments, and the cities he built, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? In his old age, however, he became diseased in his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_24","012_15_24","1KI","15","24","24","And Asa rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the city of his father David, and his son Jehoshaphat reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_25","012_15_25","1KI","15","25","25","In the second year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Nadab son of Jeroboam became king of Israel, and he reigned two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_26","012_15_26","1KI","15","26","26","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and walked in the way of his father and in his sin, which he had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_27","012_15_27","1KI","15","27","27","Then Baasha son of Ahijah of the house of Issachar conspired against Nadab, and Baasha struck him down at Gibbethon of the Philistines while Nadab and all Israel were besieging the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_28","012_15_28","1KI","15","28","28","In the third year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Baasha killed Nadab and reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_29","012_15_29","1KI","15","29","29","As soon as Baasha became king, he struck down the entire household of Jeroboam. He did not leave to Jeroboam anyone who breathed, but destroyed them all according to the word that the LORD had spoken through His servant Ahijah the Shilonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_30","012_15_30","1KI","15","30","30","because of the sins Jeroboam had committed and had caused Israel to commit, and because he had provoked the LORD, the God of Israel, to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_31","012_15_31","1KI","15","31","31","As for the rest of the acts of Nadab, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_32","012_15_32","1KI","15","32","32","And there was war between Asa and Baasha king of Israel throughout their days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_33","012_15_33","1KI","15","33","33","In the third year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Baasha son of Ahijah became king of all Israel, and he reigned in Tirzah twenty-four years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K115_34","012_15_34","1KI","15","34","34","And Baasha did evil in the sight of the LORD and walked in the way of Jeroboam and in his sin, which he had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_1","012_16_1","1KI","16","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to Jehu son of Hanani against Baasha, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_2","012_16_2","1KI","16","2","2","“Even though I lifted you out of the dust and made you ruler over My people Israel, you have walked in the way of Jeroboam and have caused My people Israel to sin and to provoke Me to anger by their sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_3","012_16_3","1KI","16","3","3","So now I will consume Baasha and his house, and I will make your house like that of Jeroboam son of Nebat: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_4","012_16_4","1KI","16","4","4","Anyone belonging to Baasha who dies in the city will be eaten by dogs, and anyone who dies in the field will be eaten by the birds of the air.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_5","012_16_5","1KI","16","5","5","As for the rest of the acts of Baasha, along with his accomplishments and might, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_6","012_16_6","1KI","16","6","6","And Baasha rested with his fathers and was buried in Tirzah, and his son Elah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_7","012_16_7","1KI","16","7","7","Moreover, the word of the LORD came through the prophet Jehu son of Hanani against Baasha and his house, because of all the evil he had done in the sight of the LORD, provoking Him to anger with the work of his hands and becoming like the house of Jeroboam, and also because Baasha had struck down the house of Jeroboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_8","012_16_8","1KI","16","8","8","In the twenty-sixth year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Elah son of Baasha became king of Israel, and he reigned in Tirzah two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_9","012_16_9","1KI","16","9","9","However, while Elah was in Tirzah getting drunk in the house of Arza the steward of his household there, Elah’s servant Zimri, the commander of half his chariots, conspired against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_10","012_16_10","1KI","16","10","10","So in the twenty-seventh year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Zimri went in, struck Elah down, and killed him. And Zimri reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_11","012_16_11","1KI","16","11","11","As soon as Zimri began to reign and was seated on the throne, he struck down the entire household of Baasha. He did not leave a single male, whether a kinsman or friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_12","012_16_12","1KI","16","12","12","So Zimri destroyed the entire household of Baasha, according to the word that the LORD had spoken against Baasha through Jehu the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_13","012_16_13","1KI","16","13","13","This happened because of all the sins Baasha and his son Elah had committed and had caused Israel to commit, provoking the LORD, the God of Israel, to anger with their worthless idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_14","012_16_14","1KI","16","14","14","As for the rest of the acts of Elah, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_15","012_16_15","1KI","16","15","15","In the twenty-seventh year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Zimri reigned in Tirzah for seven days. Now the troops were encamped against Gibbethon of the Philistines, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_16","012_16_16","1KI","16","16","16","and the people in the camp heard that Zimri had conspired against the king and struck him down. So there in the camp that very day, all Israel proclaimed Omri, the commander of the army, king over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_17","012_16_17","1KI","16","17","17","Then Omri and all the Israelites marched up from Gibbethon and besieged Tirzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_18","012_16_18","1KI","16","18","18","When Zimri saw that the city was captured, he entered the citadel of the royal palace and burned it down upon himself. So he died ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_19","012_16_19","1KI","16","19","19","because of the sins he had committed, doing evil in the sight of the LORD and following the example of Jeroboam and the sin he had committed and had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_20","012_16_20","1KI","16","20","20","As for the rest of the acts of Zimri and the treason he committed, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_21","012_16_21","1KI","16","21","21","At that time the people of Israel were divided: Half of the people supported Tibni son of Ginath as king, and half supported Omri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_22","012_16_22","1KI","16","22","22","But the followers of Omri proved stronger than those of Tibni son of Ginath. So Tibni died and Omri became king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_23","012_16_23","1KI","16","23","23","In the thirty-first year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Omri became king of Israel, and he reigned twelve years, six of them in Tirzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_24","012_16_24","1KI","16","24","24","He bought the hill of Samaria from Shemer for two talents of silver and built a city there, calling it Samaria after the name of Shemer, who had owned the hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_25","012_16_25","1KI","16","25","25","But Omri did evil in the sight of the LORD and acted more wickedly than all who were before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_26","012_16_26","1KI","16","26","26","For he walked in all the ways of Jeroboam son of Nebat and in his sins, which he caused Israel to commit, provoking the LORD, the God of Israel, to anger with their worthless idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_27","012_16_27","1KI","16","27","27","As for the rest of the acts of Omri, along with his accomplishments and the might he exercised, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_28","012_16_28","1KI","16","28","28","And Omri rested with his fathers and was buried in Samaria, and his son Ahab reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_29","012_16_29","1KI","16","29","29","In the thirty-eighth year of Asa’s reign over Judah, Ahab son of Omri became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria twenty-two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_30","012_16_30","1KI","16","30","30","However, Ahab son of Omri did evil in the sight of the LORD, more than all who were before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_31","012_16_31","1KI","16","31","31","And as if it were not enough for him to walk in the sins of Jeroboam son of Nebat, he even married Jezebel the daughter of Ethbaal king of the Sidonians, and he then proceeded to serve and worship Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_32","012_16_32","1KI","16","32","32","First, Ahab set up an altar for Baal in the temple of Baal that he had built in Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_33","012_16_33","1KI","16","33","33","Then he set up an Asherah pole. Thus Ahab did more to provoke the LORD, the God of Israel, to anger than all the kings of Israel before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K116_34","012_16_34","1KI","16","34","34","In Ahab’s days, Hiel the Bethelite rebuilt Jericho. At the cost of Abiram his firstborn he laid its foundation, and at the cost of Segub his youngest he set up its gates, according to the word that the LORD had spoken through Joshua son of Nun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_1","012_17_1","1KI","17","1","1","Now Elijah the Tishbite, who was among the settlers of Gilead, said to Ahab, “As surely as the LORD, the God of Israel, lives, before whom I stand, there will be neither dew nor rain in these years except at my word!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_2","012_17_2","1KI","17","2","2","Then a revelation from the LORD came to Elijah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_3","012_17_3","1KI","17","3","3","“Leave here, turn eastward, and hide yourself by the Brook of Cherith, east of the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_4","012_17_4","1KI","17","4","4","And you are to drink from the brook, and I have commanded the ravens to feed you there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_5","012_17_5","1KI","17","5","5","So Elijah did what the LORD had told him, and he went and lived by the Brook of Cherith, east of the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_6","012_17_6","1KI","17","6","6","The ravens would bring him bread and meat in the morning and evening, and he would drink from the brook. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_7","012_17_7","1KI","17","7","7","Some time later, however, the brook dried up because there had been no rain in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_8","012_17_8","1KI","17","8","8","Then the word of the LORD came to Elijah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_9","012_17_9","1KI","17","9","9","“Get up and go to Zarephath of Sidon, and stay there. Behold, I have commanded a widow there to provide for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_10","012_17_10","1KI","17","10","10","So Elijah got up and went to Zarephath. When he arrived at the city gate, there was a widow gathering sticks. Elijah called to her and said, “Please bring me a little water in a cup, so that I may drink.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_11","012_17_11","1KI","17","11","11","And as she was going to get it, he called to her and said, “Please bring me a piece of bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_12","012_17_12","1KI","17","12","12","But she replied, “As surely as the LORD your God lives, I have no bread—only a handful of flour in a jar and a little oil in a jug. Look, I am gathering a couple of sticks to take home and prepare a meal for myself and my son, so that we may eat it and die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_13","012_17_13","1KI","17","13","13","“Do not be afraid,” Elijah said to her. “Go and do as you have said. But first make me a small cake of bread from what you have, and bring it out to me. Afterward, make some for yourself and your son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_14","012_17_14","1KI","17","14","14","for this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘The jar of flour will not be exhausted and the jug of oil will not run dry until the day the LORD sends rain upon the face of the earth.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_15","012_17_15","1KI","17","15","15","So she went and did according to the word of Elijah, and there was food every day for Elijah and the woman and her household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_16","012_17_16","1KI","17","16","16","The jar of flour was not exhausted and the jug of oil did not run dry, according to the word that the LORD had spoken through Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_17","012_17_17","1KI","17","17","17","Later, the son of the woman who owned the house became ill, and his sickness grew worse and worse, until no breath remained in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_18","012_17_18","1KI","17","18","18","“O man of God,” said the woman to Elijah, “what have you done to me? Have you come to remind me of my iniquity and cause the death of my son?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_19","012_17_19","1KI","17","19","19","But Elijah said to her, “Give me your son.” So he took him from her arms, carried him to the upper room where he was staying, and laid him on his own bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_20","012_17_20","1KI","17","20","20","Then he cried out to the LORD, “O LORD my God, have You also brought tragedy on this widow who has opened her home to me, by causing her son to die?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_21","012_17_21","1KI","17","21","21","Then he stretched himself out over the child three times and cried out to the LORD, “O LORD my God, please let this boy’s life return to him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_22","012_17_22","1KI","17","22","22","And the LORD listened to the voice of Elijah, and the child’s life returned to him, and he lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_23","012_17_23","1KI","17","23","23","Then Elijah took the child, brought him down from the upper room into the house, and gave him to his mother. “Look, your son is alive,” Elijah declared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K117_24","012_17_24","1KI","17","24","24","Then the woman said to Elijah, “Now I know that you are a man of God and that the word of the LORD from your mouth is truth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_1","012_18_1","1KI","18","1","1","After a long time, in the third year of the drought, the word of the LORD came to Elijah: “Go and present yourself to Ahab, and I will send rain upon the face of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_2","012_18_2","1KI","18","2","2","So Elijah went to present himself to Ahab. The famine was severe in Samaria, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_3","012_18_3","1KI","18","3","3","and Ahab summoned Obadiah, who was in charge of the palace. (Now Obadiah greatly feared the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_4","012_18_4","1KI","18","4","4","for when Jezebel had slaughtered the prophets of the LORD, Obadiah had taken a hundred prophets and hidden them, fifty men per cave, providing them with food and water.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_5","012_18_5","1KI","18","5","5","Then Ahab said to Obadiah, “Go throughout the land to every spring and every valley. Perhaps we will find grass to keep the horses and mules alive so that we will not have to destroy any livestock.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_6","012_18_6","1KI","18","6","6","So they divided the land to explore. Ahab went one way by himself, and Obadiah went the other way by himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_7","012_18_7","1KI","18","7","7","Now as Obadiah went on his way, Elijah suddenly met him. When Obadiah recognized him, he fell facedown and said, “Is it you, my lord Elijah?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_8","012_18_8","1KI","18","8","8","“It is I,” he answered. “Go tell your master, ‘Elijah is here!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_9","012_18_9","1KI","18","9","9","But Obadiah replied, “How have I sinned, that you are handing your servant over to Ahab to put me to death? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_10","012_18_10","1KI","18","10","10","As surely as the LORD your God lives, there is no nation or kingdom where my lord has not sent someone to search for you. When they said, ‘He is not here,’ he made that kingdom or nation swear that they had not found you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_11","012_18_11","1KI","18","11","11","And now you say, ‘Go tell your master that Elijah is here!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_12","012_18_12","1KI","18","12","12","I do not know where the Spirit of the LORD may carry you off when I leave you. Then when I go and tell Ahab and he does not find you, he will kill me. But I, your servant, have feared the LORD from my youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_13","012_18_13","1KI","18","13","13","Was it not reported to my lord what I did when Jezebel slaughtered the prophets of the LORD? I hid a hundred prophets of the LORD, fifty men per cave, and I provided them with food and water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_14","012_18_14","1KI","18","14","14","And now you say, ‘Go tell your lord that Elijah is here!’ He will kill me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_15","012_18_15","1KI","18","15","15","Then Elijah said, “As surely as the LORD of Hosts lives, before whom I stand, I will present myself to Ahab today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_16","012_18_16","1KI","18","16","16","So Obadiah went to inform Ahab, who went to meet Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_17","012_18_17","1KI","18","17","17","When Ahab saw Elijah, he said to him, “Is that you, O troubler of Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_18","012_18_18","1KI","18","18","18","“I have not troubled Israel,” Elijah replied, “but you and your father’s house have, for you have forsaken the commandments of the LORD and have followed the Baals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_19","012_18_19","1KI","18","19","19","Now summon all Israel to meet me on Mount Carmel, along with the four hundred and fifty prophets of Baal and the four hundred prophets of Asherah who eat at Jezebel’s table.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_20","012_18_20","1KI","18","20","20","So Ahab summoned all the Israelites and assembled the prophets on Mount Carmel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_21","012_18_21","1KI","18","21","21","Then Elijah approached all the people and said, “How long will you waver between two opinions? If the LORD is God, follow Him. But if Baal is God, follow him.” But the people did not answer a word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_22","012_18_22","1KI","18","22","22","Then Elijah said to the people, “I am the only remaining prophet of the LORD, but Baal has four hundred and fifty prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_23","012_18_23","1KI","18","23","23","Get two bulls for us. Let the prophets of Baal choose one bull for themselves, cut it into pieces, and place it on the wood but not light the fire. And I will prepare the other bull and place it on the wood but not light the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_24","012_18_24","1KI","18","24","24","Then you may call on the name of your god, and I will call on the name of the LORD. The God who answers by fire, He is God.” And all the people answered, “What you say is good.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_25","012_18_25","1KI","18","25","25","Then Elijah said to the prophets of Baal, “Since you are so numerous, choose for yourselves one bull and prepare it first. Then call on the name of your god, but do not light the fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_26","012_18_26","1KI","18","26","26","And they took the bull that was given them, prepared it, and called on the name of Baal from morning until noon, shouting, “O Baal, answer us!” But there was no sound, and no one answered as they leaped around the altar they had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_27","012_18_27","1KI","18","27","27","At noon Elijah began to taunt them, saying, “Shout louder, for he is a god! Perhaps he is deep in thought, or occupied, or on a journey. Perhaps he is sleeping and must be awakened!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_28","012_18_28","1KI","18","28","28","So they shouted louder and cut themselves with knives and lances, as was their custom, until the blood gushed over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_29","012_18_29","1KI","18","29","29","Midday passed, and they kept on raving until the time of the evening sacrifice. But there was no response; no one answered, no one paid attention. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_30","012_18_30","1KI","18","30","30","Then Elijah said to all the people, “Come near to me.” So all the people approached him, and he repaired the altar of the LORD that had been torn down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_31","012_18_31","1KI","18","31","31","And Elijah took twelve stones, one for each tribe of the sons of Jacob, to whom the word of the LORD had come and said, “Israel shall be your name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_32","012_18_32","1KI","18","32","32","And with the stones, Elijah built an altar in the name of the LORD. Then he dug a trench around the altar large enough to hold two seahs of seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_33","012_18_33","1KI","18","33","33","Next, he arranged the wood, cut up the bull, placed it on the wood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_34","012_18_34","1KI","18","34","34","and said, “Fill four waterpots and pour the water on the offering and on the wood.” “Do it a second time,” he said, and they did it a second time. “Do it a third time,” he said, and they did it a third time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_35","012_18_35","1KI","18","35","35","So the water ran down around the altar and even filled the trench. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_36","012_18_36","1KI","18","36","36","At the time of the evening sacrifice, Elijah the prophet approached the altar and said, “O LORD, God of Abraham, Isaac, and Israel, let it be known this day that You are God in Israel and that I am Your servant and have done all these things at Your command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_37","012_18_37","1KI","18","37","37","Answer me, O LORD! Answer me, so that this people will know that You, the LORD, are God, and that You have turned their hearts back again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_38","012_18_38","1KI","18","38","38","Then the fire of the LORD fell and consumed the sacrifice, the wood, the stones, and the dust, and it licked up the water in the trench. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_39","012_18_39","1KI","18","39","39","When all the people saw this, they fell facedown and said, “The LORD, He is God! The LORD, He is God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_40","012_18_40","1KI","18","40","40","Then Elijah ordered them, “Seize the prophets of Baal! Do not let a single one escape.” So they seized them, and Elijah brought them down to the Kishon Valley and slaughtered them there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_41","012_18_41","1KI","18","41","41","And Elijah said to Ahab, “Go up, eat and drink, for there is the sound of a heavy rain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_42","012_18_42","1KI","18","42","42","So Ahab went up to eat and drink. But Elijah climbed to the summit of Carmel, bent down on the ground, and put his face between his knees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_43","012_18_43","1KI","18","43","43","“Go and look toward the sea,” he said to his servant. So the servant went and looked, and he said, “There is nothing there.” Seven times Elijah said, “Go back.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_44","012_18_44","1KI","18","44","44","On the seventh time the servant reported, “There is a cloud as small as a man’s hand rising from the sea.” And Elijah replied, “Go and tell Ahab, ‘Prepare your chariot and go down before the rain stops you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_45","012_18_45","1KI","18","45","45","Meanwhile, the sky grew dark with clouds and wind, and a heavy rain began to fall. So Ahab rode away and went to Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K118_46","012_18_46","1KI","18","46","46","And the hand of the LORD came upon Elijah, and he tucked his cloak into his belt and ran ahead of Ahab all the way to Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_1","012_19_1","1KI","19","1","1","Now Ahab told Jezebel everything that Elijah had done and how he had killed all the prophets with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_2","012_19_2","1KI","19","2","2","So Jezebel sent a messenger to Elijah, saying, “May the gods deal with me, and ever so severely, if by this time tomorrow I have not made your life like the lives of those you killed!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_3","012_19_3","1KI","19","3","3","And Elijah was afraid and ran for his life. When he came to Beersheba in Judah, he left his servant there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_4","012_19_4","1KI","19","4","4","while he himself went a day’s journey into the wilderness. He sat down under a broom tree and prayed that he might die. “I have had enough, LORD,” he said. “Take my life, for I am no better than my fathers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_5","012_19_5","1KI","19","5","5","Then he lay down under the broom tree and fell asleep. Suddenly an angel touched him and said, “Get up and eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_6","012_19_6","1KI","19","6","6","And he looked around, and there by his head was a cake of bread baked over hot coals, and a jar of water. So he ate and drank and lay down again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_7","012_19_7","1KI","19","7","7","A second time the angel of the LORD returned and touched him, saying, “Get up and eat, or the journey will be too much for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_8","012_19_8","1KI","19","8","8","So he got up and ate and drank. And strengthened by that food, he walked forty days and forty nights until he reached Horeb, the mountain of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_9","012_19_9","1KI","19","9","9","There Elijah entered a cave and spent the night. And the word of the LORD came to him, saying, “What are you doing here, Elijah?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_10","012_19_10","1KI","19","10","10","“I have been very zealous for the LORD, the God of Hosts,” he replied, “but the Israelites have forsaken Your covenant, torn down Your altars, and killed Your prophets with the sword. I am the only one left, and they are seeking my life as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_11","012_19_11","1KI","19","11","11","Then the LORD said, “Go out and stand on the mountain before the LORD. Behold, the LORD is about to pass by.” And a great and mighty wind tore into the mountains and shattered the rocks before the LORD, but the LORD was not in the wind. After the wind there was an earthquake, but the LORD was not in the earthquake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_12","012_19_12","1KI","19","12","12","After the earthquake there was a fire, but the LORD was not in the fire. And after the fire came a still, small voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_13","012_19_13","1KI","19","13","13","When Elijah heard it, he wrapped his face in his cloak and went out and stood at the mouth of the cave. Suddenly a voice came to him and said, “What are you doing here, Elijah?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_14","012_19_14","1KI","19","14","14","“I have been very zealous for the LORD, the God of Hosts,” he replied, “but the Israelites have forsaken Your covenant, torn down Your altars, and killed Your prophets with the sword. I am the only one left, and they are seeking my life as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_15","012_19_15","1KI","19","15","15","Then the LORD said to him, “Go back by the way you came, and go to the Desert of Damascus. When you arrive, you are to anoint Hazael as king over Aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_16","012_19_16","1KI","19","16","16","You are also to anoint Jehu son of Nimshi as king over Israel and Elisha son of Shaphat from Abel-meholah to succeed you as prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_17","012_19_17","1KI","19","17","17","Then Jehu will put to death whoever escapes the sword of Hazael, and Elisha will put to death whoever escapes the sword of Jehu. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_18","012_19_18","1KI","19","18","18","Nevertheless, I have reserved seven thousand in Israel—all whose knees have not bowed to Baal and whose mouths have not kissed him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_19","012_19_19","1KI","19","19","19","So Elijah departed and found Elisha son of Shaphat. He was plowing with twelve teams of oxen, and he was with the twelfth team. Elijah passed by him and threw his cloak around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_20","012_19_20","1KI","19","20","20","So Elisha left the oxen, ran after Elijah, and said, “Please let me kiss my father and mother goodbye, and then I will follow you.” “Go on back,” Elijah replied, “for what have I done to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K119_21","012_19_21","1KI","19","21","21","So Elisha turned back from him, took his pair of oxen, and slaughtered them. Using the oxen’s equipment for fuel, he cooked the meat and gave it to the people, and they ate. Then he set out to follow and serve Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_1","012_20_1","1KI","20","1","1","Now Ben-hadad king of Aram assembled his entire army. Accompanied by thirty-two kings with their horses and chariots, he marched up, besieged Samaria, and waged war against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_2","012_20_2","1KI","20","2","2","Then he sent messengers into the city to Ahab king of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_3","012_20_3","1KI","20","3","3","saying, “This is what Ben-hadad says: ‘Your silver and gold are mine, and your best wives and children are mine!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_4","012_20_4","1KI","20","4","4","And the king of Israel replied, “Just as you say, my lord the king: I am yours, along with all that I have.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_5","012_20_5","1KI","20","5","5","The messengers came back and said, “This is what Ben-hadad says: ‘I have sent to you to demand your silver, your gold, your wives, and your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_6","012_20_6","1KI","20","6","6","But about this time tomorrow I will send my servants to search your palace and the houses of your servants. They will seize and carry away all that is precious to you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_7","012_20_7","1KI","20","7","7","Then the king of Israel summoned all the elders of the land and said, “Please take note and see that this man is looking for trouble, for when he demanded my wives, my children, my silver, and my gold, I did not deny him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_8","012_20_8","1KI","20","8","8","And the elders and the people all said, “Do not listen to him or consent to his terms.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_9","012_20_9","1KI","20","9","9","So Ahab answered the messengers of Ben-hadad, “Tell my lord the king, ‘All that you demanded of your servant the first time I will do, but this thing I cannot do.’” So the messengers departed and relayed the message to Ben-hadad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_10","012_20_10","1KI","20","10","10","Then Ben-hadad sent another message to Ahab: “May the gods deal with me, and ever so severely, if enough dust remains of Samaria for each of my men to have a handful.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_11","012_20_11","1KI","20","11","11","And the king of Israel replied, “Tell him: ‘The one putting on his armor should not boast like one taking it off.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_12","012_20_12","1KI","20","12","12","Ben-hadad received this message while he and the kings were drinking in their tents, and he said to his servants, “Take your positions.” So they stationed themselves against the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_13","012_20_13","1KI","20","13","13","Meanwhile a prophet approached Ahab king of Israel and declared, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Do you see this entire great army? Behold, I will deliver it into your hand this very day, and you will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_14","012_20_14","1KI","20","14","14","“By whom?” Ahab asked. And the prophet replied, “This is what the LORD says: ‘By the young officers of the district governors.’” “Who will start the battle?” asked Ahab. “You will,” answered the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_15","012_20_15","1KI","20","15","15","So Ahab assembled the young officers of the district governors, and there were 232 men. And after them, he assembled the rest of the Israelite troops, 7,000 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_16","012_20_16","1KI","20","16","16","They marched out at noon while Ben-hadad and the 32 kings allied with him were in their tents getting drunk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_17","012_20_17","1KI","20","17","17","And the young officers of the district governors marched out first. Now Ben-hadad had sent out scouts, who reported to him, “Men are marching out of Samaria.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_18","012_20_18","1KI","20","18","18","“If they have marched out in peace,” he said, “take them alive. Even if they have marched out for war, take them alive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_19","012_20_19","1KI","20","19","19","Meanwhile, these young officers of the district governors marched out of the city, with the army behind them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_20","012_20_20","1KI","20","20","20","and each one struck down his opponent. So the Arameans fled, with the Israelites in pursuit. But Ben-hadad king of Aram escaped on horseback with the cavalry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_21","012_20_21","1KI","20","21","21","Then the king of Israel marched out and attacked the horses and chariots, inflicting a great slaughter on the Arameans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_22","012_20_22","1KI","20","22","22","Afterward, the prophet approached the king of Israel and said, “Go and strengthen your position, and take note what you must do, for in the spring the king of Aram will come up against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_23","012_20_23","1KI","20","23","23","Meanwhile, the servants of the king of Aram said to him, “Their gods are gods of the hills. That is why they prevailed over us. Instead, we should fight them on the plains; surely then we will prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_24","012_20_24","1KI","20","24","24","So do this: Dismiss all the kings from their positions and replace them with other officers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_25","012_20_25","1KI","20","25","25","And you must raise an army like the one you have lost—horse for horse and chariot for chariot—so we can fight the Israelites on the plain, where we will surely prevail.” And the king approved their plan and acted accordingly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_26","012_20_26","1KI","20","26","26","In the spring, Ben-hadad mobilized the Arameans and went up to Aphek to fight against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_27","012_20_27","1KI","20","27","27","The Israelites also mobilized, gathered supplies, and marched out to meet them. The Israelites camped before them like two small flocks of goats, while the Arameans covered the countryside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_28","012_20_28","1KI","20","28","28","Then the man of God approached the king of Israel and said, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Because the Arameans have said that the LORD is a god of the hills and not of the valleys, I will deliver all this great army into your hand. Then you will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_29","012_20_29","1KI","20","29","29","For seven days the armies camped opposite each other, and on the seventh day the battle ensued, and the Israelites struck down the Arameans—a hundred thousand foot soldiers in one day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_30","012_20_30","1KI","20","30","30","The rest of them fled into the city of Aphek, where the wall fell on twenty-seven thousand of the remaining men. Ben-hadad also fled to the city and hid in an inner room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_31","012_20_31","1KI","20","31","31","Then the servants of Ben-hadad said to him, “Look now, we have heard that the kings of the house of Israel are merciful. Let us go out to the king of Israel with sackcloth around our waists and ropes around our heads. Perhaps he will spare your life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_32","012_20_32","1KI","20","32","32","So with sackcloth around their waists and ropes around their heads, they went to the king of Israel and said, “Your servant Ben-hadad says, ‘Please spare my life.’” And the king answered, “Is he still alive? He is my brother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_33","012_20_33","1KI","20","33","33","Now the men were looking for a sign of hope, and they quickly grasped at this word and replied, “Yes, your brother Ben-hadad.” “Go and get him!” said the king. Then Ben-hadad came out, and Ahab had him come up into his chariot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_34","012_20_34","1KI","20","34","34","Ben-hadad said to him, “I will restore the cities my father took from your father; you may set up your own marketplaces in Damascus, as my father did in Samaria.” “By this treaty I release you,” Ahab replied. So he made a treaty with him and sent him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_35","012_20_35","1KI","20","35","35","Meanwhile, by the word of the LORD, one of the sons of the prophets said to his companion, “Strike me, please!” But the man refused to strike him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_36","012_20_36","1KI","20","36","36","Then the prophet said to him, “Because you have not obeyed the voice of the LORD, as soon as you depart from me a lion will kill you.” And when he left, a lion found him and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_37","012_20_37","1KI","20","37","37","Then the prophet found another man and said, “Strike me, please!” So the man struck him and wounded him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_38","012_20_38","1KI","20","38","38","and the prophet went and waited on the road for the king, disguising himself with a bandage over his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_39","012_20_39","1KI","20","39","39","As the king passed by, he cried out to the king: “Your servant had marched out into the middle of the battle, when suddenly a man came over with a captive and told me, ‘Guard this man! If he goes missing for any reason, your life will be exchanged for his life, or you will weigh out a talent of silver.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_40","012_20_40","1KI","20","40","40","But while your servant was busy here and there, the man disappeared.” And the king of Israel said to him, “So shall your judgment be; you have pronounced it on yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_41","012_20_41","1KI","20","41","41","Then the prophet quickly removed the bandage from his eyes, and the king of Israel recognized him as one of the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_42","012_20_42","1KI","20","42","42","And the prophet said to the king, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Because you have let slip from your hand the man I had devoted to destruction, your life will be exchanged for his life, and your people for his people.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K120_43","012_20_43","1KI","20","43","43","Sullen and angry, the king of Israel went home to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_1","012_21_1","1KI","21","1","1","Some time after these events, Naboth the Jezreelite owned a vineyard in Jezreel next to the palace of Ahab king of Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_2","012_21_2","1KI","21","2","2","So Ahab said to Naboth, “Give me your vineyard to use as a vegetable garden, since it is next to my palace. I will give you a better vineyard in its place—or if you prefer, I will give you its value in silver.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_3","012_21_3","1KI","21","3","3","But Naboth replied, “The LORD forbid that I should give you the inheritance of my fathers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_4","012_21_4","1KI","21","4","4","So Ahab went to his palace, sullen and angry because Naboth the Jezreelite had told him, “I will not give you the inheritance of my fathers.” He lay down on his bed, turned his face away, and refused to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_5","012_21_5","1KI","21","5","5","Soon his wife Jezebel came in and asked, “Why are you so sullen that you refuse to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_6","012_21_6","1KI","21","6","6","Ahab answered, “Because I spoke to Naboth the Jezreelite and told him, ‘Give me your vineyard for silver, or if you wish, I will give you another vineyard in its place.’ And he replied, ‘I will not give you my vineyard!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_7","012_21_7","1KI","21","7","7","But his wife Jezebel said to him, “Do you not reign over Israel? Get up, eat some food, and be cheerful, for I will get you the vineyard of Naboth the Jezreelite.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_8","012_21_8","1KI","21","8","8","Then Jezebel wrote letters in Ahab’s name, sealed them with his seal, and sent them to the elders and nobles who lived with Naboth in his city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_9","012_21_9","1KI","21","9","9","In the letters she wrote: “Proclaim a fast and give Naboth a seat of honor among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_10","012_21_10","1KI","21","10","10","But seat two scoundrels opposite him and have them testify, ‘You have cursed both God and the king!’ Then take him out and stone him to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_11","012_21_11","1KI","21","11","11","So the elders and nobles who lived in Naboth’s city did as Jezebel had instructed in the letters she had written to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_12","012_21_12","1KI","21","12","12","They proclaimed a fast and gave Naboth a seat of honor among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_13","012_21_13","1KI","21","13","13","And the two scoundrels came in and sat opposite Naboth, and these men testified against him before the people, saying, “Naboth has cursed both God and the king!” So they took him outside the city and stoned him to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_14","012_21_14","1KI","21","14","14","Then they sent word to Jezebel: “Naboth has been stoned to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_15","012_21_15","1KI","21","15","15","When Jezebel heard that Naboth had been stoned to death, she said to Ahab, “Get up and take possession of the vineyard of Naboth the Jezreelite, who refused to give it to you for silver. For Naboth is no longer alive, but dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_16","012_21_16","1KI","21","16","16","And when Ahab heard that Naboth was dead, he got up and went down to take possession of the vineyard of Naboth the Jezreelite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_17","012_21_17","1KI","21","17","17","Then the word of the LORD came to Elijah the Tishbite, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_18","012_21_18","1KI","21","18","18","“Get up and go down to meet Ahab king of Israel, who is in Samaria. See, he is in the vineyard of Naboth, where he has gone to take possession of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_19","012_21_19","1KI","21","19","19","Tell him that this is what the LORD says: ‘Have you not murdered a man and seized his land?’ Then tell him that this is also what the LORD says: ‘In the place where the dogs licked up the blood of Naboth, there also the dogs will lick up your blood—yes, yours!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_20","012_21_20","1KI","21","20","20","When Elijah arrived, Ahab said to him, “So you have found me out, my enemy.” He replied, “I have found you out because you have sold yourself to do evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_21","012_21_21","1KI","21","21","21","This is what the LORD says: ‘I will bring calamity on you and consume your descendants; I will cut off from Ahab every male in Israel, both slave and free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_22","012_21_22","1KI","21","22","22","I will make your house like that of Jeroboam son of Nebat and like that of Baasha son of Ahijah, because you have provoked My anger and caused Israel to sin.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_23","012_21_23","1KI","21","23","23","And the LORD also speaks concerning Jezebel: ‘The dogs will devour Jezebel by the wall of Jezreel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_24","012_21_24","1KI","21","24","24","Anyone belonging to Ahab who dies in the city will be eaten by dogs, and anyone who dies in the field will be eaten by the birds of the air.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_25","012_21_25","1KI","21","25","25","(Surely there was never one like Ahab, who sold himself to do evil in the sight of the LORD, incited by his wife Jezebel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_26","012_21_26","1KI","21","26","26","He committed the most detestable acts by going after idols, just like the Amorites whom the LORD had driven out before the Israelites.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_27","012_21_27","1KI","21","27","27","When Ahab heard these words, he tore his clothes, put on sackcloth, and fasted. He lay down in sackcloth and walked around meekly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_28","012_21_28","1KI","21","28","28","Then the word of the LORD came to Elijah the Tishbite, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K121_29","012_21_29","1KI","21","29","29","“Have you seen how Ahab has humbled himself before Me? Because he has humbled himself before Me, I will not bring the calamity during his days, but I will bring it upon his house in the days of his son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_1","012_22_1","1KI","22","1","1","Then three years passed without war between Aram and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_2","012_22_2","1KI","22","2","2","However, in the third year, Jehoshaphat king of Judah went down to visit the king of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_3","012_22_3","1KI","22","3","3","who said to his servants, “Do you not know that Ramoth-gilead is ours, but we have failed to take it from the hand of the king of Aram?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_4","012_22_4","1KI","22","4","4","So he asked Jehoshaphat, “Will you go with me to fight against Ramoth-gilead?” Jehoshaphat answered the king of Israel, “I am as you are, my people are your people, and my horses are your horses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_5","012_22_5","1KI","22","5","5","But Jehoshaphat also said to the king of Israel, “Please inquire first for the word of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_6","012_22_6","1KI","22","6","6","So the king of Israel assembled the prophets, about four hundred men, and asked them, “Should I go to war against Ramoth-gilead, or should I refrain?” “Go up,” they replied, “and the Lord will deliver it into the hand of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_7","012_22_7","1KI","22","7","7","But Jehoshaphat asked, “Is there not still a prophet of the LORD here of whom we can inquire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_8","012_22_8","1KI","22","8","8","The king of Israel answered, “There is still one man through whom we can inquire of the LORD, but I hate him because he never prophesies anything good for me, but only bad. He is Micaiah son of Imlah.” “The king should not say that!” Jehoshaphat replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_9","012_22_9","1KI","22","9","9","So the king of Israel called one of his officials and said, “Bring Micaiah son of Imlah at once.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_10","012_22_10","1KI","22","10","10","Dressed in royal attire, the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat king of Judah were sitting on their thrones at the threshing floor by the entrance of the gate of Samaria, with all the prophets prophesying before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_11","012_22_11","1KI","22","11","11","Now Zedekiah son of Chenaanah had made for himself iron horns and declared, “This is what the LORD says: ‘With these you shall gore the Arameans until they are finished off.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_12","012_22_12","1KI","22","12","12","And all the prophets were prophesying the same, saying, “Go up to Ramoth-gilead and triumph, for the LORD will deliver it into the hand of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_13","012_22_13","1KI","22","13","13","Then the messenger who had gone to call Micaiah instructed him, “Behold now, with one accord the words of the prophets are favorable to the king. So please let your words be like theirs, and speak favorably.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_14","012_22_14","1KI","22","14","14","But Micaiah said, “As surely as the LORD lives, I will speak whatever the LORD tells me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_15","012_22_15","1KI","22","15","15","When Micaiah arrived, the king asked him, “Micaiah, should we go to war against Ramoth-gilead, or should we refrain?” “Go up and triumph,” Micaiah replied, “for the LORD will deliver it into the hand of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_16","012_22_16","1KI","22","16","16","But the king said to him, “How many times must I make you swear not to tell me anything but the truth in the name of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_17","012_22_17","1KI","22","17","17","So Micaiah declared: “I saw all Israel scattered on the hills like sheep without a shepherd. And the LORD said, ‘These people have no master; let each one return home in peace.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_18","012_22_18","1KI","22","18","18","Then the king of Israel said to Jehoshaphat, “Did I not tell you that he never prophesies good for me, but only bad?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_19","012_22_19","1KI","22","19","19","Micaiah continued, “Therefore hear the word of the LORD: I saw the LORD sitting on His throne, and all the host of heaven standing by Him on His right and on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_20","012_22_20","1KI","22","20","20","And the LORD said, ‘Who will entice Ahab to march up and fall at Ramoth-gilead?’ And one suggested this, and another that. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_21","012_22_21","1KI","22","21","21","Then a spirit came forward, stood before the LORD, and said, ‘I will entice him.’ ‘By what means?’ asked the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_22","012_22_22","1KI","22","22","22","And he replied, ‘I will go out and be a lying spirit in the mouths of all his prophets.’ ‘You will surely entice him and prevail,’ said the LORD. ‘Go and do it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_23","012_22_23","1KI","22","23","23","So you see, the LORD has put a lying spirit in the mouths of all these prophets of yours, and the LORD has pronounced disaster against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_24","012_22_24","1KI","22","24","24","Then Zedekiah son of Chenaanah went up, struck Micaiah in the face, and demanded, “Which way did the Spirit of the LORD go when He departed from me to speak with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_25","012_22_25","1KI","22","25","25","Micaiah replied, “You will soon see, on that day when you go and hide in an inner room.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_26","012_22_26","1KI","22","26","26","And the king of Israel declared, “Take Micaiah and return him to Amon the governor of the city and to Joash the king’s son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_27","012_22_27","1KI","22","27","27","and tell them that this is what the king says: ‘Put this man in prison and feed him only bread and water until I return safely.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_28","012_22_28","1KI","22","28","28","But Micaiah replied, “If you ever return safely, the LORD has not spoken through me.” Then he added, “Take heed, all you people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_29","012_22_29","1KI","22","29","29","So the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat king of Judah went up to Ramoth-gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_30","012_22_30","1KI","22","30","30","And the king of Israel said to Jehoshaphat, “I will disguise myself and go into battle, but you wear your royal robes.” So the king of Israel disguised himself and went into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_31","012_22_31","1KI","22","31","31","Now the king of Aram had ordered his thirty-two chariot commanders, “Do not fight with anyone, small or great, except the king of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_32","012_22_32","1KI","22","32","32","When the chariot commanders saw Jehoshaphat, they said, “Surely this is the king of Israel!” So they turned to fight against him, but Jehoshaphat cried out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_33","012_22_33","1KI","22","33","33","And when the chariot commanders saw that he was not the king of Israel, they turned back from pursuing him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_34","012_22_34","1KI","22","34","34","However, a certain man drew his bow without taking special aim, and he struck the king of Israel between the joints of his armor. So the king said to his charioteer, “Turn around and take me out of the battle, for I am badly wounded!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_35","012_22_35","1KI","22","35","35","The battle raged throughout that day, and the king was propped up in his chariot facing the Arameans. And the blood from his wound ran out onto the floor of the chariot, and that evening he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_36","012_22_36","1KI","22","36","36","As the sun was setting, the cry rang out in the army: “Every man to his own city, and every man to his own land!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_37","012_22_37","1KI","22","37","37","So the king died and was brought to Samaria, where they buried him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_38","012_22_38","1KI","22","38","38","And the chariot was washed at the pool of Samaria where the prostitutes bathed, and the dogs licked up Ahab’s blood, according to the word that the LORD had spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_39","012_22_39","1KI","22","39","39","As for the rest of the acts of Ahab, along with all his accomplishments and the ivory palace and all the cities he built, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_40","012_22_40","1KI","22","40","40","And Ahab rested with his fathers, and his son Ahaziah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_41","012_22_41","1KI","22","41","41","In the fourth year of Ahab’s reign over Israel, Jehoshaphat son of Asa became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_42","012_22_42","1KI","22","42","42","Jehoshaphat was thirty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-five years. His mother’s name was Azubah daughter of Shilhi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_43","012_22_43","1KI","22","43","43","And Jehoshaphat walked in all the ways of his father Asa; he did not turn away from them, but did what was right in the eyes of the LORD. The high places, however, were not removed; the people still sacrificed and burned incense on the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_44","012_22_44","1KI","22","44","44","Jehoshaphat also made peace with the king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_45","012_22_45","1KI","22","45","45","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoshaphat, along with the might he exercised and how he waged war, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_46","012_22_46","1KI","22","46","46","He banished from the land the male shrine prostitutes who remained from the days of his father Asa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_47","012_22_47","1KI","22","47","47","And there was no king in Edom; a deputy served as king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_48","012_22_48","1KI","22","48","48","Jehoshaphat built ships of Tarshish to go to Ophir for gold, but they never set sail, because they were wrecked at Ezion-geber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_49","012_22_49","1KI","22","49","49","At that time Ahaziah son of Ahab said to Jehoshaphat, “Let my servants sail with your servants,” but Jehoshaphat refused. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_50","012_22_50","1KI","22","50","50","And Jehoshaphat rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the city of his father David. And his son Jehoram reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_51","012_22_51","1KI","22","51","51","In the seventeenth year of Jehoshaphat’s reign over Judah, Ahaziah son of Ahab became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_52","012_22_52","1KI","22","52","52","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and walked in the ways of his father and mother and of Jeroboam son of Nebat, who had caused Israel to sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K122_53","012_22_53","1KI","22","53","53","Ahaziah served and worshiped Baal, provoking the LORD, the God of Israel, to anger, just as his father had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_1","013_1_1","2KI","1","1","1","After the death of Ahab, Moab rebelled against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_2","013_1_2","2KI","1","2","2","Now Ahaziah had fallen through the lattice of his upper room in Samaria and injured himself. So he sent messengers and instructed them: “Go inquire of Baal-zebub, the god of Ekron, whether I will recover from this injury.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_3","013_1_3","2KI","1","3","3","But the angel of the LORD said to Elijah the Tishbite, “Go up to meet the messengers of the king of Samaria and ask them, ‘Is it because there is no God in Israel that you are on your way to inquire of Baal-zebub, the god of Ekron?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_4","013_1_4","2KI","1","4","4","Therefore this is what the LORD says: ‘You will not get up from the bed on which you are lying. You will surely die.’” So Elijah departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_5","013_1_5","2KI","1","5","5","When the messengers returned to the king, he asked them, “Why have you returned?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_6","013_1_6","2KI","1","6","6","They replied, “A man came up to meet us and said, ‘Go back to the king who sent you and tell him that this is what the LORD says: Is it because there is no God in Israel that you are sending these men to inquire of Baal-zebub, the god of Ekron? Therefore you will not get up from the bed on which you are lying. You will surely die.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_7","013_1_7","2KI","1","7","7","The king asked them, “What sort of man came up to meet you and spoke these words to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_8","013_1_8","2KI","1","8","8","“He was a hairy man,” they answered, “with a leather belt around his waist.” “It was Elijah the Tishbite,” said the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_9","013_1_9","2KI","1","9","9","Then King Ahaziah sent to Elijah a captain with his company of fifty men. So the captain went up to Elijah, who was sitting on top of a hill, and said to him, “Man of God, the king declares, ‘Come down!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_10","013_1_10","2KI","1","10","10","Elijah answered the captain, “If I am a man of God, may fire come down from heaven and consume you and your fifty men.” And fire came down from heaven and consumed the captain and his fifty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_11","013_1_11","2KI","1","11","11","So the king sent to Elijah another captain with his fifty men. And the captain said to Elijah, “Man of God, the king declares, ‘Come down at once!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_12","013_1_12","2KI","1","12","12","Again Elijah replied, “If I am a man of God, may fire come down from heaven and consume you and your fifty men.” And the fire of God came down from heaven and consumed the captain and his fifty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_13","013_1_13","2KI","1","13","13","So the king sent a third captain with his fifty men. And the third captain went up, fell on his knees before Elijah, and begged him, “Man of God, may my life and the lives of these fifty servants of yours please be precious in your sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_14","013_1_14","2KI","1","14","14","Behold, fire has come down from heaven and consumed the first two captains of fifty, with all their men. But now may my life be precious in your sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_15","013_1_15","2KI","1","15","15","Then the angel of the LORD said to Elijah, “Go down with him. Do not be afraid of him.” So Elijah got up and went down with him to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_16","013_1_16","2KI","1","16","16","And Elijah said to King Ahaziah, “This is what the LORD says: Is there really no God in Israel for you to inquire of His word? Is that why you have sent messengers to inquire of Baal-zebub, the god of Ekron? Therefore you will not get up from the bed on which you are lying. You will surely die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_17","013_1_17","2KI","1","17","17","So Ahaziah died according to the word of the LORD that Elijah had spoken. And since he had no son, Jehoram succeeded him in the second year of the reign of Jehoram son of Jehoshaphat over Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K21_18","013_1_18","2KI","1","18","18","As for the rest of the acts of Ahaziah, along with his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_1","013_2_1","2KI","2","1","1","Shortly before the LORD took Elijah up to heaven in a whirlwind, Elijah and Elisha were on their way from Gilgal, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_2","013_2_2","2KI","2","2","2","and Elijah said to Elisha, “Please stay here, for the LORD has sent me on to Bethel.” But Elisha replied, “As surely as the LORD lives and as you yourself live, I will not leave you.” So they went down to Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_3","013_2_3","2KI","2","3","3","Then the sons of the prophets at Bethel came out to Elisha and said, “Do you know that the LORD will take your master away from you today?” “Yes, I know,” he replied. “Do not speak of it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_4","013_2_4","2KI","2","4","4","And Elijah said to Elisha, “Please stay here, for the LORD has sent me on to Jericho.” But Elisha replied, “As surely as the LORD lives and as you yourself live, I will not leave you.” So they went to Jericho. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_5","013_2_5","2KI","2","5","5","Then the sons of the prophets at Jericho came up to Elisha and said, “Do you know that the LORD will take your master away from you today?” “Yes, I know,” he replied. “Do not speak of it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_6","013_2_6","2KI","2","6","6","And Elijah said to Elisha, “Please stay here, for the LORD has sent me on to the Jordan.” But Elisha replied, “As surely as the LORD lives and as you yourself live, I will not leave you.” So the two of them went on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_7","013_2_7","2KI","2","7","7","Then a company of fifty of the sons of the prophets went and stood at a distance, facing Elijah and Elisha as the two of them stood by the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_8","013_2_8","2KI","2","8","8","And Elijah took his cloak, rolled it up, and struck the waters, which parted to the right and to the left, so that the two of them crossed over on dry ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_9","013_2_9","2KI","2","9","9","After they had crossed over, Elijah said to Elisha, “Tell me, what can I do for you before I am taken away from you?” “Please, let me inherit a double portion of your spirit,” Elisha replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_10","013_2_10","2KI","2","10","10","“You have requested a difficult thing,” said Elijah. “Nevertheless, if you see me as I am taken from you, it will be yours. But if not, then it will not be so.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_11","013_2_11","2KI","2","11","11","As they were walking along and talking together, suddenly a chariot of fire with horses of fire appeared and separated the two of them, and Elijah went up into heaven in a whirlwind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_12","013_2_12","2KI","2","12","12","As Elisha watched, he cried out, “My father, my father, the chariots and horsemen of Israel!” And he saw Elijah no more. So taking hold of his own clothes, he tore them in two. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_13","013_2_13","2KI","2","13","13","Elisha also picked up the cloak that had fallen from Elijah, and he went back and stood on the bank of the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_14","013_2_14","2KI","2","14","14","Then he took the cloak of Elijah that had fallen from him and struck the waters. “Where now is the LORD, the God of Elijah?” he asked. And when he had struck the waters, they parted to the right and to the left, and Elisha crossed over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_15","013_2_15","2KI","2","15","15","When the sons of the prophets who were watching him from Jericho saw what had happened, they said, “The spirit of Elijah rests on Elisha.” And they went to meet him and bowed down to the ground before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_16","013_2_16","2KI","2","16","16","“Look now,” they said to Elisha, “we your servants have fifty valiant men. Please let them go and search for your master. Perhaps the Spirit of the LORD has taken him up and put him on one of the mountains or in one of the valleys.” “Do not send them,” Elisha replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_17","013_2_17","2KI","2","17","17","But when they pressed him to the point of embarrassment, he said, “Send them.” And they sent fifty men, who searched for three days but did not find Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_18","013_2_18","2KI","2","18","18","When they returned to Elisha, who was staying in Jericho, he said to them, “Didn’t I tell you not to go?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_19","013_2_19","2KI","2","19","19","Then the men of the city said to Elisha, “Please note, our lord, that the city’s location is good, as you can see. But the water is bad and the land is unfruitful.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_20","013_2_20","2KI","2","20","20","“Bring me a new bowl,” he replied, “and put some salt in it.” So they brought it to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_21","013_2_21","2KI","2","21","21","and Elisha went out to the spring, cast the salt into it, and said, “This is what the LORD says: ‘I have healed this water. No longer will it cause death or unfruitfulness.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_22","013_2_22","2KI","2","22","22","And the waters there have been healthy to this day, according to the word spoken by Elisha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_23","013_2_23","2KI","2","23","23","From there, Elisha went up to Bethel, and as he was walking up the road, a group of boys came out of the city and jeered at him, chanting, “Go up, you baldhead! Go up, you baldhead!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_24","013_2_24","2KI","2","24","24","Then he turned around, looked at them, and called down a curse on them in the name of the LORD. Suddenly two female bears came out of the woods and mauled forty-two of the boys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K22_25","013_2_25","2KI","2","25","25","And Elisha went on to Mount Carmel, and from there he returned to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_1","013_3_1","2KI","3","1","1","In the eighteenth year of Jehoshaphat’s reign over Judah, Jehoram son of Ahab became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria twelve years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_2","013_3_2","2KI","3","2","2","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, but not as his father and mother had done. He removed the sacred pillar of Baal that his father had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_3","013_3_3","2KI","3","3","3","Nevertheless, he clung to the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit; he did not turn away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_4","013_3_4","2KI","3","4","4","Now Mesha king of Moab was a sheep breeder, and he would render to the king of Israel a hundred thousand lambs and the wool of a hundred thousand rams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_5","013_3_5","2KI","3","5","5","But after the death of Ahab, the king of Moab rebelled against the king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_6","013_3_6","2KI","3","6","6","So at that time King Jehoram set out from Samaria and mobilized all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_7","013_3_7","2KI","3","7","7","And he sent a message to Jehoshaphat king of Judah: “The king of Moab has rebelled against me. Will you go with me to fight against Moab?” “I will go,” replied Jehoshaphat. “I am as you are, my people are your people, and my horses are your horses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_8","013_3_8","2KI","3","8","8","Then he asked, “Which way shall we go up?” “By way of the Desert of Edom,” replied Joram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_9","013_3_9","2KI","3","9","9","So the king of Israel, the king of Judah, and the king of Edom set out, and after they had traveled a roundabout route for seven days, they had no water for their army or for their animals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_10","013_3_10","2KI","3","10","10","“Alas,” said the king of Israel, “for the LORD has summoned these three kings to deliver them into the hand of Moab!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_11","013_3_11","2KI","3","11","11","But Jehoshaphat asked, “Is there no prophet of the LORD here? Let us inquire of the LORD through him.” And one of the servants of the king of Israel answered, “Elisha son of Shaphat is here. He used to pour water on the hands of Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_12","013_3_12","2KI","3","12","12","Jehoshaphat affirmed, “The word of the LORD is with him.” So the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat and the king of Edom went down to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_13","013_3_13","2KI","3","13","13","Elisha, however, said to the king of Israel, “What have we to do with each other? Go to the prophets of your father and of your mother!” “No,” replied the king of Israel, “for it is the LORD who has summoned these three kings to deliver them into the hand of Moab.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_14","013_3_14","2KI","3","14","14","Then Elisha said, “As surely as the LORD of Hosts lives, before whom I stand, were it not for my regard for the presence of Jehoshaphat king of Judah, I would not look at you or acknowledge you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_15","013_3_15","2KI","3","15","15","But now, bring me a harpist.” And while the harpist played, the hand of the LORD came upon Elisha ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_16","013_3_16","2KI","3","16","16","and he said, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Dig this valley full of ditches.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_17","013_3_17","2KI","3","17","17","For the LORD says, ‘You will not see wind or rain, but the valley will be filled with water, and you will drink—you and your cattle and your animals.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_18","013_3_18","2KI","3","18","18","This is a simple matter in the sight of the LORD, and He will also deliver the Moabites into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_19","013_3_19","2KI","3","19","19","And you shall attack every fortified city and every city of importance. You shall cut down every good tree, stop up every spring, and ruin every good field with stones.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_20","013_3_20","2KI","3","20","20","The next morning, at the time of the morning sacrifice, water suddenly flowed from the direction of Edom and filled the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_21","013_3_21","2KI","3","21","21","Now all the Moabites had heard that the kings had come up to fight against them. So all who could bear arms, young and old, were summoned and stationed at the border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_22","013_3_22","2KI","3","22","22","When they got up early in the morning, the sun was shining on the water, and it looked as red as blood to the Moabites across the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_23","013_3_23","2KI","3","23","23","“This is blood!” they exclaimed. “The kings have clashed swords and slaughtered one another. Now to the plunder, Moab!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_24","013_3_24","2KI","3","24","24","But when the Moabites came to the camp of Israel, the Israelites rose up and attacked them, and they fled before them. So the Israelites invaded their land and struck down the Moabites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_25","013_3_25","2KI","3","25","25","They destroyed the cities, and each man threw stones on every good field until it was covered. They stopped up every spring and cut down every good tree. Only Kir-haraseth was left with stones in place, but men with slings surrounded it and attacked it as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_26","013_3_26","2KI","3","26","26","When the king of Moab saw that the battle was too fierce for him, he took with him seven hundred swordsmen to break through to the king of Edom, but they could not prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K23_27","013_3_27","2KI","3","27","27","So he took his firstborn son, who was to succeed him, and offered him as a burnt offering on the city wall. And there was great fury against the Israelites, so they withdrew and returned to their own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_1","013_4_1","2KI","4","1","1","Now the wife of one of the sons of the prophets cried out to Elisha, “Your servant, my husband, is dead, and you know that your servant feared the LORD. And now his creditor is coming to take my two children as his slaves!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_2","013_4_2","2KI","4","2","2","“How can I help you?” asked Elisha. “Tell me, what do you have in the house?” She answered, “Your servant has nothing in the house but a jar of oil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_3","013_4_3","2KI","4","3","3","“Go,” said Elisha, “borrow empty jars from all your neighbors. Do not gather just a few. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_4","013_4_4","2KI","4","4","4","Then go inside, shut the door behind you and your sons, and pour oil into all these jars, setting the full ones aside.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_5","013_4_5","2KI","4","5","5","So she left him, and after she had shut the door behind her and her sons, they kept bringing jars to her, and she kept pouring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_6","013_4_6","2KI","4","6","6","When all the jars were full, she said to her son, “Bring me another.” But he replied, “There are no more jars.” Then the oil stopped flowing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_7","013_4_7","2KI","4","7","7","She went and told the man of God, and he said, “Go, sell the oil, and pay your debt. Then you and your sons can live on the remainder.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_8","013_4_8","2KI","4","8","8","One day Elisha went to Shunem, and a prominent woman who lived there persuaded him to have a meal. So whenever he would pass by, he would stop there to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_9","013_4_9","2KI","4","9","9","Then the woman said to her husband, “Behold, now I know that the one who often comes our way is a holy man of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_10","013_4_10","2KI","4","10","10","Please let us make a small room upstairs and put in it a bed, a table, a chair, and a lamp for him. Then when he comes to us, he can stay there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_11","013_4_11","2KI","4","11","11","One day Elisha came to visit and went to his upper room to lie down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_12","013_4_12","2KI","4","12","12","And he said to Gehazi his servant, “Call the Shunammite woman.” And when he had called her, she stood before him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_13","013_4_13","2KI","4","13","13","and Elisha said to Gehazi, “Now tell her, ‘Look, you have gone to all this trouble for us. What can we do for you? Can we speak on your behalf to the king or the commander of the army?’” “I have a home among my own people,” she replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_14","013_4_14","2KI","4","14","14","So he asked, “Then what should be done for her?” “Well, she has no son,” Gehazi replied, “and her husband is old.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_15","013_4_15","2KI","4","15","15","“Call her,” said Elisha. So Gehazi called her, and she stood in the doorway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_16","013_4_16","2KI","4","16","16","And Elisha declared, “At this time next year, you will hold a son in your arms.” “No, my lord,” she said. “Do not lie to your maidservant, O man of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_17","013_4_17","2KI","4","17","17","But the woman did conceive, and at that time the next year she gave birth to a son, just as Elisha had told her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_18","013_4_18","2KI","4","18","18","And the child grew, and one day he went out to his father, who was with the harvesters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_19","013_4_19","2KI","4","19","19","“My head! My head!” he complained to his father. So his father told a servant, “Carry him to his mother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_20","013_4_20","2KI","4","20","20","After the servant had picked him up and carried him to his mother, the boy sat on her lap until noon, and then he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_21","013_4_21","2KI","4","21","21","And she went up and laid him on the bed of the man of God. Then she shut the door and went out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_22","013_4_22","2KI","4","22","22","And the woman called her husband and said, “Please send me one of the servants and one of the donkeys, that I may go quickly to the man of God and return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_23","013_4_23","2KI","4","23","23","“Why would you go to him today?” he replied. “It is not a New Moon or a Sabbath.” “Everything is all right,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_24","013_4_24","2KI","4","24","24","Then she saddled the donkey and told her servant, “Drive onward; do not slow the pace for me unless I tell you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_25","013_4_25","2KI","4","25","25","So she set out and went to the man of God at Mount Carmel. When the man of God saw her at a distance, he said to his servant Gehazi, “Look, there is the Shunammite woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_26","013_4_26","2KI","4","26","26","Please run out now to meet her and ask, ‘Are you all right? Is your husband all right? Is your child all right?’” And she answered, “Everything is all right.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_27","013_4_27","2KI","4","27","27","When she reached the man of God at the mountain, she clung to his feet. Gehazi came over to push her away, but the man of God said, “Leave her alone, for her soul is in deep distress, and the LORD has hidden it from me and has not told me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_28","013_4_28","2KI","4","28","28","Then she said, “Did I ask you for a son, my lord? Didn’t I say, ‘Do not deceive me?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_29","013_4_29","2KI","4","29","29","So Elisha said to Gehazi, “Tie up your garment, take my staff in your hand, and go! If you meet anyone, do not greet him, and if anyone greets you, do not answer him. Then lay my staff on the boy’s face.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_30","013_4_30","2KI","4","30","30","And the mother of the boy said, “As surely as the LORD lives and as you yourself live, I will not leave you.” So he got up and followed her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_31","013_4_31","2KI","4","31","31","Gehazi went on ahead of them and laid the staff on the boy’s face, but there was no sound or response. So he went back to meet Elisha and told him, “The boy has not awakened.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_32","013_4_32","2KI","4","32","32","When Elisha reached the house, there was the boy lying dead on his bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_33","013_4_33","2KI","4","33","33","So he went in, closed the door behind the two of them, and prayed to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_34","013_4_34","2KI","4","34","34","Then Elisha got on the bed and lay on the boy, mouth to mouth, eye to eye, and hand to hand. As he stretched himself out over him, the boy’s body became warm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_35","013_4_35","2KI","4","35","35","Elisha turned away and paced back and forth across the room. Then he got on the bed and stretched himself out over the boy again, and the boy sneezed seven times and opened his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_36","013_4_36","2KI","4","36","36","Elisha summoned Gehazi and said, “Call the Shunammite woman.” So he called her and she came. Then Elisha said, “Pick up your son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_37","013_4_37","2KI","4","37","37","She came in, fell at his feet, and bowed to the ground. Then she picked up her son and went out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_38","013_4_38","2KI","4","38","38","When Elisha returned to Gilgal, there was a famine in the land. As the sons of the prophets were sitting at his feet, he said to his attendant, “Put on the large pot and boil some stew for the sons of the prophets.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_39","013_4_39","2KI","4","39","39","One of them went out to the field to gather herbs, and he found a wild vine from which he gathered as many wild gourds as his garment could hold. Then he came back and cut them up into the pot of stew, though no one knew what they were. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_40","013_4_40","2KI","4","40","40","And they poured it out for the men to eat, but when they tasted the stew they cried out, “There is death in the pot, O man of God!” And they could not eat it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_41","013_4_41","2KI","4","41","41","Then Elisha said, “Get some flour.” He threw it into the pot and said, “Pour it out for the people to eat.” And there was nothing harmful in the pot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_42","013_4_42","2KI","4","42","42","Now a man from Baal-shalishah came to the man of God with a sack of twenty loaves of barley bread from the first ripe grain. “Give it to the people to eat,” said Elisha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_43","013_4_43","2KI","4","43","43","But his servant asked, “How am I to set twenty loaves before a hundred men?” “Give it to the people to eat,” said Elisha, “for this is what the LORD says: ‘They will eat and have some left over.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K24_44","013_4_44","2KI","4","44","44","So he set it before them, and they ate and had some left over, according to the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_1","013_5_1","2KI","5","1","1","Now Naaman, the commander of the army of the king of Aram, was a great man in his master’s sight and highly regarded, for through him the LORD had given victory to Aram. And he was a mighty man of valor, but he was a leper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_2","013_5_2","2KI","5","2","2","At this time the Arameans had gone out in bands and had taken a young girl from the land of Israel, and she was serving Naaman’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_3","013_5_3","2KI","5","3","3","She said to her mistress, “If only my master would go to the prophet who is in Samaria, he would cure him of his leprosy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_4","013_5_4","2KI","5","4","4","And Naaman went and told his master what the girl from the land of Israel had said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_5","013_5_5","2KI","5","5","5","“Go now,” said the king of Aram, “and I will send you with a letter to the king of Israel.” So Naaman departed, taking with him ten talents of silver, six thousand shekels of gold, and ten sets of clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_6","013_5_6","2KI","5","6","6","And the letter that he took to the king of Israel stated: “With this letter I am sending my servant Naaman, so that you may cure him of his leprosy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_7","013_5_7","2KI","5","7","7","When the king of Israel read the letter, he tore his clothes and asked, “Am I God, killing and giving life, that this man expects me to cure a leper? Surely you can see that he is seeking a quarrel with me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_8","013_5_8","2KI","5","8","8","Now when Elisha the man of God heard that the king of Israel had torn his clothes, he sent a message to the king: “Why have you torn your clothes? Please let the man come to me, and he will know that there is a prophet in Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_9","013_5_9","2KI","5","9","9","So Naaman came with his horses and chariots and stood at the door of Elisha’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_10","013_5_10","2KI","5","10","10","Then Elisha sent him a messenger, who said, “Go and wash yourself seven times in the Jordan, and your flesh will be restored, and you will be clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_11","013_5_11","2KI","5","11","11","But Naaman went away angry, saying, “I thought that he would surely come out, stand and call on the name of the LORD his God, and wave his hand over the spot to cure my leprosy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_12","013_5_12","2KI","5","12","12","Are not the Abanah and Pharpar, the rivers of Damascus, better than all the waters of Israel? Could I not have washed in them and been cleansed?” So he turned and went away in a rage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_13","013_5_13","2KI","5","13","13","Naaman’s servants, however, approached him and said, “My father, if the prophet had told you to do some great thing, would you not have done it? How much more, then, when he tells you, ‘Wash and be cleansed’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_14","013_5_14","2KI","5","14","14","So Naaman went down and dipped himself in the Jordan seven times, according to the word of the man of God, and his flesh was restored and became like that of a little child, and he was clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_15","013_5_15","2KI","5","15","15","Then Naaman and all his attendants went back to the man of God, stood before him, and declared, “Now I know for sure that there is no God in all the earth except in Israel. So please accept a gift from your servant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_16","013_5_16","2KI","5","16","16","But Elisha replied, “As surely as the LORD lives, before whom I stand, I will not accept it.” And although Naaman urged him to accept it, he refused. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_17","013_5_17","2KI","5","17","17","“If you will not,” said Naaman, “please let me, your servant, be given as much soil as a pair of mules can carry. For your servant will never again make a burnt offering or a sacrifice to any other god but the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_18","013_5_18","2KI","5","18","18","Yet may the LORD forgive your servant this one thing: When my master goes into the temple of Rimmon to worship there, and he leans on my arm, and I bow down in the temple of Rimmon, may the LORD forgive your servant in this matter.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_19","013_5_19","2KI","5","19","19","“Go in peace,” said Elisha. But after Naaman had traveled a short distance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_20","013_5_20","2KI","5","20","20","Gehazi, the servant of Elisha the man of God, said, “Look, my master has spared this Aramean, Naaman, by not accepting what he brought. As surely as the LORD lives, I will run after him and get something from him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_21","013_5_21","2KI","5","21","21","So Gehazi pursued Naaman. And when Naaman saw him running toward him, he got down from the chariot to meet him and asked, “Is everything all right?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_22","013_5_22","2KI","5","22","22","“Everything is all right,” Gehazi replied. “My master has sent me to say, ‘Look, two young men from the sons of the prophets have just now come to me from the hill country of Ephraim. Please give them a talent of silver and two sets of clothing.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_23","013_5_23","2KI","5","23","23","But Naaman insisted, “Please, take two talents.” And he urged Gehazi to accept them. Then he tied up two talents of silver in two bags along with two sets of clothing and gave them to two of his servants, who carried them ahead of Gehazi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_24","013_5_24","2KI","5","24","24","When Gehazi came to the hill, he took the gifts from the servants and stored them in the house. Then he dismissed the men, and they departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_25","013_5_25","2KI","5","25","25","When Gehazi went in and stood before his master, Elisha asked him, “Gehazi, where have you been?” “Your servant did not go anywhere,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_26","013_5_26","2KI","5","26","26","But Elisha questioned him, “Did not my spirit go with you when the man got down from his chariot to meet you? Is this the time to accept money and clothing, olive groves and vineyards, sheep and oxen, menservants and maidservants? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K25_27","013_5_27","2KI","5","27","27","Therefore, the leprosy of Naaman will cling to you and your descendants forever!” And as Gehazi left his presence, he was leprous—as white as snow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_1","013_6_1","2KI","6","1","1","Now the sons of the prophets said to Elisha, “Please take note that the place where we meet with you is too small for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_2","013_6_2","2KI","6","2","2","Please let us go to the Jordan, where each of us can get a log so we can build ourselves a place to live there.” “Go,” said Elisha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_3","013_6_3","2KI","6","3","3","Then one of them said, “Please come with your servants.” “I will come,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_4","013_6_4","2KI","6","4","4","So Elisha went with them, and when they came to the Jordan, they began to cut down some trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_5","013_6_5","2KI","6","5","5","As one of them was cutting down a tree, the iron axe head fell into the water. “Oh, my master,” he cried out, “it was borrowed!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_6","013_6_6","2KI","6","6","6","“Where did it fall?” asked the man of God. And when he showed him the place, the man of God cut a stick, threw it there, and made the iron float. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_7","013_6_7","2KI","6","7","7","“Lift it out,” he said, and the man reached out his hand and took it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_8","013_6_8","2KI","6","8","8","Now the king of Aram was at war against Israel. After consulting with his servants, he said, “My camp will be in such and such a place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_9","013_6_9","2KI","6","9","9","Then the man of God sent word to the king of Israel: “Be careful not to pass by this place, for the Arameans are going down there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_10","013_6_10","2KI","6","10","10","So the king of Israel sent word to the place the man of God had pointed out. Time and again Elisha warned the king, so that he was on his guard in such places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_11","013_6_11","2KI","6","11","11","For this reason the king of Aram became enraged and called his servants to demand of them, “Tell me, which one of us is on the side of the king of Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_12","013_6_12","2KI","6","12","12","But one of his servants replied, “No one, my lord the king. For Elisha, the prophet in Israel, tells the king of Israel the very words you speak in your bedroom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_13","013_6_13","2KI","6","13","13","So the king said, “Go and see where he is, that I may send men to capture him.” On receiving the report, “Elisha is in Dothan,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_14","013_6_14","2KI","6","14","14","the king of Aram sent horses, chariots, and a great army. They went there by night and surrounded the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_15","013_6_15","2KI","6","15","15","When the servant of the man of God got up and went out early in the morning, behold, an army with horses and chariots had surrounded the city. So he asked Elisha, “Oh, my master, what are we to do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_16","013_6_16","2KI","6","16","16","“Do not be afraid,” Elisha answered, “for those who are with us are more than those who are with them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_17","013_6_17","2KI","6","17","17","Then Elisha prayed, “O LORD, please open his eyes that he may see.” And the LORD opened the eyes of the young man, and he saw that the hills were full of horses and chariots of fire all around Elisha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_18","013_6_18","2KI","6","18","18","As the Arameans came down against him, Elisha prayed to the LORD, “Please strike these people with blindness.” So He struck them with blindness, according to the word of Elisha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_19","013_6_19","2KI","6","19","19","And Elisha told them, “This is not the way, and this is not the city. Follow me, and I will take you to the man you are seeking.” And he led them to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_20","013_6_20","2KI","6","20","20","When they had entered Samaria, Elisha said, “O LORD, open the eyes of these men that they may see.” Then the LORD opened their eyes, and they looked around and discovered that they were in Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_21","013_6_21","2KI","6","21","21","And when the king of Israel saw them, he asked Elisha, “My father, shall I kill them? Shall I kill them?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_22","013_6_22","2KI","6","22","22","“Do not kill them,” he replied. “Would you kill those you have captured with your own sword or bow? Set food and water before them, that they may eat and drink and then return to their master.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_23","013_6_23","2KI","6","23","23","So the king prepared a great feast for them, and after they had finished eating and drinking, he sent them away, and they returned to their master. And the Aramean raiders did not come into the land of Israel again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_24","013_6_24","2KI","6","24","24","Some time later, Ben-hadad king of Aram assembled his entire army and marched up to besiege Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_25","013_6_25","2KI","6","25","25","So there was a great famine in Samaria. Indeed, they besieged the city so long that a donkey’s head sold for eighty shekels of silver, and a quarter cab of dove’s dung sold for five shekels of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_26","013_6_26","2KI","6","26","26","As the king of Israel was passing by on the wall, a woman cried out to him, “Help me, my lord the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_27","013_6_27","2KI","6","27","27","He answered, “If the LORD does not help you, where can I find help for you? From the threshing floor or the winepress?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_28","013_6_28","2KI","6","28","28","Then the king asked her, “What is the matter?” And she answered, “This woman said to me, ‘Give up your son, that we may eat him, and tomorrow we will eat my son.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_29","013_6_29","2KI","6","29","29","So we boiled my son and ate him, and the next day I said to her, ‘Give up your son, that we may eat him.’ But she had hidden her son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_30","013_6_30","2KI","6","30","30","When the king heard the words of the woman, he tore his clothes. And as he passed by on the wall, the people saw the sackcloth under his clothes next to his skin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_31","013_6_31","2KI","6","31","31","He announced, “May God punish me, and ever so severely, if the head of Elisha son of Shaphat remains on his shoulders through this day!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_32","013_6_32","2KI","6","32","32","Now Elisha was sitting in his house, and the elders were sitting with him. The king sent a messenger ahead, but before he arrived, Elisha said to the elders, “Do you see how this murderer has sent someone to cut off my head? Look, when the messenger comes, shut the door to keep him out. Is not the sound of his master’s footsteps behind him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K26_33","013_6_33","2KI","6","33","33","While Elisha was still speaking with them, the messenger came down to him. And the king said, “This calamity is from the LORD. Why should I wait for the LORD any longer?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_1","013_7_1","2KI","7","1","1","Then Elisha said, “Hear the word of the LORD! This is what the LORD says: ‘About this time tomorrow at the gate of Samaria, a seah of fine flour will sell for a shekel, and two seahs of barley will sell for a shekel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_2","013_7_2","2KI","7","2","2","But the officer on whose arm the king leaned answered the man of God, “Look, even if the LORD were to make windows in heaven, could this really happen?” “You will see it with your own eyes,” replied Elisha, “but you will not eat any of it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_3","013_7_3","2KI","7","3","3","Now there were four men with leprosy at the entrance of the city gate, and they said to one another, “Why just sit here until we die? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_4","013_7_4","2KI","7","4","4","If we say, ‘Let us go into the city,’ we will die there from the famine in the city; but if we sit here, we will also die. So come now, let us go over to the camp of the Arameans. If they let us live, we will live; if they kill us, we will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_5","013_7_5","2KI","7","5","5","So they arose at twilight and went to the camp of the Arameans. But when they came to the outskirts of the camp, there was not a man to be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_6","013_7_6","2KI","7","6","6","For the Lord had caused the Arameans to hear the sound of chariots, horses, and a great army, so that they said to one another, “Look, the king of Israel must have hired the kings of the Hittites and Egyptians to attack us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_7","013_7_7","2KI","7","7","7","Thus the Arameans had arisen and fled at twilight, abandoning their tents and horses and donkeys. The camp was intact, and they had run for their lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_8","013_7_8","2KI","7","8","8","When the lepers reached the edge of the camp, they went into a tent to eat and drink. Then they carried off the silver, gold, and clothing, and went and hid them. On returning, they entered another tent, carried off some items from there, and hid them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_9","013_7_9","2KI","7","9","9","Finally, they said to one another, “We are not doing what is right. Today is a day of good news. If we are silent and wait until morning light, our sin will overtake us. Now, therefore, let us go and tell the king’s household.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_10","013_7_10","2KI","7","10","10","So they went and called out to the gatekeepers of the city, saying, “We went to the Aramean camp and no one was there—not a trace—only tethered horses and donkeys, and the tents were intact.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_11","013_7_11","2KI","7","11","11","The gatekeepers shouted the news, and it was reported to the king’s household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_12","013_7_12","2KI","7","12","12","So the king got up in the night and said to his servants, “Let me tell you what the Arameans have done to us. They know we are starving, so they have left the camp to hide in the field, thinking, ‘When they come out of the city, we will take them alive and enter the city.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_13","013_7_13","2KI","7","13","13","But one of his servants replied, “Please, have scouts take five of the horses that remain in the city. Their plight will be no worse than all the Israelites who are left here. You can see that all the Israelites here are doomed. So let us send them and find out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_14","013_7_14","2KI","7","14","14","Then the scouts took two chariots with horses, and the king sent them after the Aramean army, saying, “Go and see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_15","013_7_15","2KI","7","15","15","And they tracked them as far as the Jordan, and indeed, the whole way was littered with the clothing and equipment the Arameans had thrown off in haste. So the scouts returned and told the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_16","013_7_16","2KI","7","16","16","Then the people went out and plundered the camp of the Arameans. It was then that a seah of fine flour sold for a shekel, and two seahs of barley sold for a shekel, according to the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_17","013_7_17","2KI","7","17","17","Now the king had appointed the officer on whose arm he leaned to be in charge of the gate, but the people trampled him in the gateway, and he died, just as the man of God had foretold when the king had come to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_18","013_7_18","2KI","7","18","18","It happened just as the man of God had told the king: “About this time tomorrow at the gate of Samaria, two seahs of barley will sell for a shekel, and a seah of fine flour will sell for a shekel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_19","013_7_19","2KI","7","19","19","And the officer had answered the man of God, “Look, even if the LORD were to make windows in heaven, could this really happen?” So Elisha had replied, “You will see it with your own eyes, but you will not eat any of it!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K27_20","013_7_20","2KI","7","20","20","And that is just what happened to him. The people trampled him in the gateway, and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_1","013_8_1","2KI","8","1","1","Now Elisha had said to the woman whose son he had restored to life, “Arise, you and your household; go and live as a foreigner wherever you can. For the LORD has decreed that a seven-year famine will come to the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_2","013_8_2","2KI","8","2","2","So the woman had proceeded to do as the man of God had instructed. And she and her household lived as foreigners for seven years in the land of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_3","013_8_3","2KI","8","3","3","At the end of seven years, when the woman returned from the land of the Philistines, she went to the king to appeal for her house and her land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_4","013_8_4","2KI","8","4","4","Now the king had been speaking to Gehazi, the servant of the man of God, saying, “Please relate to me all the great things Elisha has done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_5","013_8_5","2KI","8","5","5","And Gehazi was telling the king how Elisha had brought the dead back to life. Just then the woman whose son Elisha had revived came to appeal to the king for her house and her land. So Gehazi said, “My lord the king, this is the woman, and this is the son Elisha restored to life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_6","013_8_6","2KI","8","6","6","When the king asked the woman, she confirmed it. So the king appointed for her an officer, saying, “Restore all that was hers, along with all the proceeds of the field from the day that she left the country until now.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_7","013_8_7","2KI","8","7","7","Then Elisha came to Damascus while Ben-hadad king of Aram was sick, and the king was told, “The man of God has come here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_8","013_8_8","2KI","8","8","8","So the king said to Hazael, “Take a gift in your hand, go to meet the man of God, and inquire of the LORD through him, ‘Will I recover from this illness?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_9","013_8_9","2KI","8","9","9","So Hazael went to meet Elisha, taking with him a gift of forty camel loads of every good thing from Damascus. And he went in and stood before him and said, “Your son Ben-hadad king of Aram has sent me to ask, ‘Will I recover from this illness?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_10","013_8_10","2KI","8","10","10","Elisha answered, “Go and tell him, ‘You will surely recover.’ But the LORD has shown me that in fact he will die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_11","013_8_11","2KI","8","11","11","Elisha fixed his gaze steadily on him until Hazael became uncomfortable. Then the man of God began to weep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_12","013_8_12","2KI","8","12","12","“Why is my lord weeping?” asked Hazael. “Because I know the evil you will do to the Israelites,” Elisha replied. “You will set fire to their fortresses, kill their young men with the sword, dash their little ones to pieces, and rip open their pregnant women.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_13","013_8_13","2KI","8","13","13","“But how could your servant, a mere dog, do such a monstrous thing?” said Hazael. And Elisha answered, “The LORD has shown me that you will be king over Aram.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_14","013_8_14","2KI","8","14","14","So Hazael left Elisha and went to his master, who asked him, “What did Elisha say to you?” And he replied, “He told me that you would surely recover.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_15","013_8_15","2KI","8","15","15","But the next day Hazael took a thick cloth, dipped it in water, and spread it over the king’s face. So Ben-hadad died, and Hazael reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_16","013_8_16","2KI","8","16","16","In the fifth year of the reign of Joram son of Ahab over Israel, Jehoram son of Jehoshaphat succeeded his father as king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_17","013_8_17","2KI","8","17","17","Jehoram was thirty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_18","013_8_18","2KI","8","18","18","And Jehoram walked in the ways of the kings of Israel, just as the house of Ahab had done. For he married a daughter of Ahab and did evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_19","013_8_19","2KI","8","19","19","Yet for the sake of His servant David, the LORD was unwilling to destroy Judah, since He had promised to maintain a lamp for David and his descendants forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_20","013_8_20","2KI","8","20","20","In the days of Jehoram, Edom rebelled against the hand of Judah and appointed their own king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_21","013_8_21","2KI","8","21","21","So Jehoram crossed over to Zair with all his chariots. When the Edomites surrounded him and his chariot commanders, he rose up and attacked by night. His troops, however, fled to their homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_22","013_8_22","2KI","8","22","22","So to this day Edom has been in rebellion against the hand of Judah. Likewise, Libnah rebelled at the same time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_23","013_8_23","2KI","8","23","23","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoram, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_24","013_8_24","2KI","8","24","24","And Jehoram rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David. And his son Ahaziah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_25","013_8_25","2KI","8","25","25","In the twelfth year of the reign of Joram son of Ahab over Israel, Ahaziah son of Jehoram became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_26","013_8_26","2KI","8","26","26","Ahaziah was twenty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem one year. His mother’s name was Athaliah, the granddaughter of Omri king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_27","013_8_27","2KI","8","27","27","And Ahaziah walked in the ways of the house of Ahab and did evil in the sight of the LORD like the house of Ahab, for he was a son-in-law of the house of Ahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_28","013_8_28","2KI","8","28","28","Then Ahaziah went with Joram son of Ahab to fight against Hazael king of Aram at Ramoth-gilead, and the Arameans wounded Joram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K28_29","013_8_29","2KI","8","29","29","So King Joram returned to Jezreel to recover from the wounds that the Arameans had inflicted on him at Ramah when he fought against Hazael king of Aram. Then Ahaziah son of Jehoram king of Judah went down to Jezreel to visit Joram son of Ahab, because Joram had been wounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_1","013_9_1","2KI","9","1","1","Now Elisha the prophet summoned one of the sons of the prophets and said to him, “Tuck your cloak under your belt, take this flask of oil, and go to Ramoth-gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_2","013_9_2","2KI","9","2","2","When you arrive, look for Jehu son of Jehoshaphat, the son of Nimshi. Go in, get him away from his companions, and take him to an inner room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_3","013_9_3","2KI","9","3","3","Then take the flask of oil, pour it on his head, and declare, ‘This is what the LORD says: I anoint you king over Israel.’ Then open the door and run. Do not delay!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_4","013_9_4","2KI","9","4","4","So the young prophet went to Ramoth-gilead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_5","013_9_5","2KI","9","5","5","and when he arrived, the army commanders were sitting there. “I have a message for you, commander,” he said. “For which of us?” asked Jehu. “For you, commander,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_6","013_9_6","2KI","9","6","6","So Jehu got up and went into the house, where the young prophet poured the oil on his head and declared, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I anoint you king over the LORD’s people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_7","013_9_7","2KI","9","7","7","And you are to strike down the house of your master Ahab, so that I may avenge the blood of My servants the prophets and the blood of all the servants of the LORD shed by the hand of Jezebel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_8","013_9_8","2KI","9","8","8","The whole house of Ahab will perish, and I will cut off from Ahab every male, both slave and free, in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_9","013_9_9","2KI","9","9","9","I will make the house of Ahab like the houses of Jeroboam son of Nebat and Baasha son of Ahijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_10","013_9_10","2KI","9","10","10","And on the plot of ground at Jezreel the dogs will devour Jezebel, and there will be no one to bury her.’” Then the young prophet opened the door and ran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_11","013_9_11","2KI","9","11","11","When Jehu went out to the servants of his master, they asked, “Is everything all right? Why did this madman come to you?” “You know his kind and their babble,” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_12","013_9_12","2KI","9","12","12","“That is a lie!” they said. “Tell us now!” So Jehu answered, “He talked to me about this and that, saying, ‘This is what the LORD says: I anoint you king over Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_13","013_9_13","2KI","9","13","13","Quickly, each man took his garment and put it under Jehu on the bare steps. Then they blew the ram’s horn and proclaimed, “Jehu is king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_14","013_9_14","2KI","9","14","14","Thus Jehu son of Jehoshaphat, the son of Nimshi, conspired against Joram. (Now Joram and all Israel had been defending Ramoth-gilead against Hazael king of Aram, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_15","013_9_15","2KI","9","15","15","but King Joram had returned to Jezreel to recover from the wounds he had suffered at the hands of the Arameans in the battle against Hazael their king.) So Jehu said, “If you commanders wish to make me king, then do not let anyone escape from the city to go and tell it in Jezreel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_16","013_9_16","2KI","9","16","16","Then Jehu got into his chariot and went to Jezreel, because Joram was laid up there. And Ahaziah king of Judah had gone down to see him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_17","013_9_17","2KI","9","17","17","Now the watchman standing on the tower in Jezreel saw Jehu’s troops approaching, and he called out, “I see a company of troops!” “Choose a rider,” Joram commanded. “Send him out to meet them and ask, ‘Have you come in peace?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_18","013_9_18","2KI","9","18","18","So a horseman rode off to meet Jehu and said, “This is what the king asks: ‘Have you come in peace?’” “What do you know about peace?” Jehu replied. “Fall in behind me.” And the watchman reported, “The messenger reached them, but he is not coming back.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_19","013_9_19","2KI","9","19","19","So the king sent out a second horseman, who went to them and said, “This is what the king asks: ‘Have you come in peace?’” “What do you know about peace?” Jehu replied. “Fall in behind me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_20","013_9_20","2KI","9","20","20","Again the watchman reported, “He reached them, but he is not coming back. And the charioteer is driving like Jehu son of Nimshi—he is driving like a madman!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_21","013_9_21","2KI","9","21","21","“Harness!” Joram shouted, and they harnessed his chariot. Then Joram king of Israel and Ahaziah king of Judah set out, each in his own chariot, and met Jehu on the property of Naboth the Jezreelite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_22","013_9_22","2KI","9","22","22","When Joram saw Jehu, he asked, “Have you come in peace, Jehu?” “How can there be peace,” he replied, “as long as the idolatry and witchcraft of your mother Jezebel abound?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_23","013_9_23","2KI","9","23","23","Joram turned around and fled, calling out to Ahaziah, “Treachery, Ahaziah!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_24","013_9_24","2KI","9","24","24","Then Jehu drew his bow and shot Joram between the shoulders. The arrow pierced his heart, and he slumped down in his chariot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_25","013_9_25","2KI","9","25","25","And Jehu said to Bidkar his officer, “Pick him up and throw him into the field of Naboth the Jezreelite. For remember that when you and I were riding together behind his father Ahab, the LORD lifted up this burden against him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_26","013_9_26","2KI","9","26","26","‘As surely as I saw the blood of Naboth and the blood of his sons yesterday, declares the LORD, so will I repay you on this plot of ground, declares the LORD.’ Now then, according to the word of the LORD, pick him up and throw him on the plot of ground.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_27","013_9_27","2KI","9","27","27","When King Ahaziah of Judah saw this, he fled up the road toward Beth-haggan. And Jehu pursued him, shouting, “Shoot him too!” So they shot Ahaziah in his chariot on the Ascent of Gur, near Ibleam, and he fled to Megiddo and died there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_28","013_9_28","2KI","9","28","28","Then his servants carried him by chariot to Jerusalem and buried him with his fathers in his tomb in the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_29","013_9_29","2KI","9","29","29","(In the eleventh year of Joram son of Ahab, Ahaziah had become king over Judah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_30","013_9_30","2KI","9","30","30","Now when Jehu arrived in Jezreel, Jezebel heard of it. So she painted her eyes, adorned her head, and looked down from a window. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_31","013_9_31","2KI","9","31","31","And as Jehu entered the gate, she asked, “Have you come in peace, O Zimri, murderer of your master?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_32","013_9_32","2KI","9","32","32","He looked up at the window and called out, “Who is on my side? Who?” And two or three eunuchs looked down at him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_33","013_9_33","2KI","9","33","33","“Throw her down!” yelled Jehu. So they threw her down, and her blood splattered on the wall and on the horses as they trampled her underfoot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_34","013_9_34","2KI","9","34","34","Then Jehu went in and ate and drank. “Take care of this cursed woman,” he said, “and bury her, for she was the daughter of a king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_35","013_9_35","2KI","9","35","35","But when they went out to bury her, they found nothing but her skull, her feet, and the palms of her hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_36","013_9_36","2KI","9","36","36","So they went back and told Jehu, who replied, “This is the word of the LORD, which He spoke through His servant Elijah the Tishbite: ‘On the plot of ground at Jezreel the dogs will devour the flesh of Jezebel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K29_37","013_9_37","2KI","9","37","37","And Jezebel’s body will lie like dung in the field on the plot of ground at Jezreel, so that no one can say: This is Jezebel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_1","013_10_1","2KI","10","1","1","Now Ahab had seventy sons in Samaria. So Jehu wrote letters and sent them to Samaria to the officials of Jezreel, to the elders, and to the guardians of the sons of Ahab, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_2","013_10_2","2KI","10","2","2","“When this letter arrives, since your master’s sons are with you and you have chariots and horses, a fortified city and weaponry, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_3","013_10_3","2KI","10","3","3","select the best and most worthy son of your master, set him on his father’s throne, and fight for your master’s house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_4","013_10_4","2KI","10","4","4","But they were terrified and reasoned, “If two kings could not stand against him, how can we?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_5","013_10_5","2KI","10","5","5","So the palace administrator, the overseer of the city, the elders, and the guardians sent a message to Jehu: “We are your servants, and we will do whatever you say. We will not make anyone king. Do whatever is good in your sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_6","013_10_6","2KI","10","6","6","Then Jehu wrote them a second letter and said: “If you are on my side, and if you will obey me, then bring the heads of your master’s sons to me at Jezreel by this time tomorrow.” Now the sons of the king, seventy in all, were being brought up by the leading men of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_7","013_10_7","2KI","10","7","7","And when the letter arrived, they took the sons of the king and slaughtered all seventy of them. They put their heads in baskets and sent them to Jehu at Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_8","013_10_8","2KI","10","8","8","When the messenger arrived, he told Jehu, “They have brought the heads of the sons of the king.” And Jehu ordered, “Pile them in two heaps at the entrance of the gate until morning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_9","013_10_9","2KI","10","9","9","The next morning, Jehu went out and stood before all the people and said, “You are innocent. It was I who conspired against my master and killed him. But who killed all these? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_10","013_10_10","2KI","10","10","10","Know, then, that not a word the LORD has spoken against the house of Ahab will fail, for the LORD has done what He promised through His servant Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_11","013_10_11","2KI","10","11","11","So Jehu killed everyone in Jezreel who remained of the house of Ahab, as well as all his great men and close friends and priests, leaving him without a single survivor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_12","013_10_12","2KI","10","12","12","Then Jehu set out toward Samaria. At Beth-eked of the Shepherds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_13","013_10_13","2KI","10","13","13","Jehu met some relatives of Ahaziah king of Judah and asked, “Who are you?” “We are relatives of Ahaziah,” they answered, “and we have come down to greet the sons of the king and of the queen mother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_14","013_10_14","2KI","10","14","14","Then Jehu ordered, “Take them alive.” So his men took them alive, then slaughtered them at the well of Beth-eked—forty-two men. He spared none of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_15","013_10_15","2KI","10","15","15","When he left there, he found Jehonadab son of Rechab, who was coming to meet him. Jehu greeted him and asked, “Is your heart as true to mine as my heart is to yours?” “It is!” Jehonadab replied. “If it is,” said Jehu, “give me your hand.” So he gave him his hand, and Jehu helped him into his chariot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_16","013_10_16","2KI","10","16","16","saying, “Come with me and see my zeal for the LORD!” So he had him ride in his chariot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_17","013_10_17","2KI","10","17","17","When Jehu came to Samaria, he struck down everyone belonging to Ahab who remained there, until he had destroyed them, according to the word that the LORD had spoken to Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_18","013_10_18","2KI","10","18","18","Then Jehu brought all the people together and said, “Ahab served Baal a little, but Jehu will serve him a lot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_19","013_10_19","2KI","10","19","19","Now, therefore, summon to me all the prophets of Baal, all his servants, and all his priests. See that no one is missing, for I have a great sacrifice for Baal. Whoever is missing will not live.” But Jehu was acting deceptively in order to destroy the servants of Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_20","013_10_20","2KI","10","20","20","And Jehu commanded, “Proclaim a solemn assembly for Baal.” So they announced it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_21","013_10_21","2KI","10","21","21","Then Jehu sent word throughout Israel, and all the servants of Baal came; there was not a man who failed to show. They entered the temple of Baal, and it was filled from end to end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_22","013_10_22","2KI","10","22","22","And Jehu said to the keeper of the wardrobe, “Bring out garments for all the servants of Baal.” So he brought out garments for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_23","013_10_23","2KI","10","23","23","Next, Jehu and Jehonadab son of Rechab entered the temple of Baal, and Jehu said to the servants of Baal, “Look around to see that there are no servants of the LORD here among you—only servants of Baal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_24","013_10_24","2KI","10","24","24","And they went in to offer sacrifices and burnt offerings. Now Jehu had stationed eighty men outside and warned them, “If anyone allows one of the men I am delivering into your hands to escape, he will forfeit his life for theirs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_25","013_10_25","2KI","10","25","25","When he had finished making the burnt offering, Jehu said to the guards and officers, “Go in and kill them. Do not let anyone out.” So the guards and officers put them to the sword, threw the bodies out, and went into the inner room of the temple of Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_26","013_10_26","2KI","10","26","26","They brought out the sacred pillar of the temple of Baal and burned it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_27","013_10_27","2KI","10","27","27","They also demolished the sacred pillar of Baal. Then they tore down the temple of Baal and made it into a latrine, which it is to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_28","013_10_28","2KI","10","28","28","Thus Jehu eradicated Baal from Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_29","013_10_29","2KI","10","29","29","but he did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit—the worship of the golden calves at Bethel and Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_30","013_10_30","2KI","10","30","30","Nevertheless, the LORD said to Jehu, “Because you have done well in carrying out what is right in My sight and have done to the house of Ahab all that was in My heart, four generations of your sons will sit on the throne of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_31","013_10_31","2KI","10","31","31","Yet Jehu was not careful to follow the instruction of the LORD, the God of Israel, with all his heart. He did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_32","013_10_32","2KI","10","32","32","In those days the LORD began to reduce the size of Israel. Hazael defeated the Israelites throughout their territory ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_33","013_10_33","2KI","10","33","33","from the Jordan eastward through all the land of Gilead (the region of Gad, Reuben, and Manasseh), and from Aroer by the Arnon Valley through Gilead to Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_34","013_10_34","2KI","10","34","34","As for the rest of the acts of Jehu, along with all his accomplishments and all his might, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_35","013_10_35","2KI","10","35","35","And Jehu rested with his fathers and was buried in Samaria, and his son Jehoahaz reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K210_36","013_10_36","2KI","10","36","36","So the duration of Jehu’s reign over Israel in Samaria was twenty-eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_1","013_11_1","2KI","11","1","1","When Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she proceeded to annihilate all the royal heirs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_2","013_11_2","2KI","11","2","2","But Jehosheba daughter of King Joram, the sister of Ahaziah, took Joash son of Ahaziah and stole him away from among the sons of the king who were being murdered. She put him and his nurse in a bedroom to hide him from Athaliah, and he was not killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_3","013_11_3","2KI","11","3","3","And Joash remained hidden with his nurse in the house of the LORD for six years while Athaliah ruled the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_4","013_11_4","2KI","11","4","4","Then in the seventh year, Jehoiada sent for the commanders of hundreds, the Carites, and the guards, and had them brought into the house of the LORD. There he made a covenant with them and put them under oath. He showed them the king’s son ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_5","013_11_5","2KI","11","5","5","and commanded them, “This is what you are to do: A third of you who come on duty on the Sabbath shall guard the royal palace, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_6","013_11_6","2KI","11","6","6","a third shall be at the gate of Sur, and a third at the gate behind the guards. You are to take turns guarding the temple— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_7","013_11_7","2KI","11","7","7","the two divisions that would go off duty on the Sabbath are to guard the house of the LORD for the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_8","013_11_8","2KI","11","8","8","You must surround the king with weapons in hand, and anyone who approaches the ranks must be put to death. You must stay close to the king wherever he goes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_9","013_11_9","2KI","11","9","9","So the commanders of hundreds did everything that Jehoiada the priest had ordered. Each of them took his men—those coming on duty on the Sabbath and those going off duty—and came to Jehoiada the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_10","013_11_10","2KI","11","10","10","Then the priest gave to the commanders of hundreds the spears and shields of King David from the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_11","013_11_11","2KI","11","11","11","And the guards stood with weapons in hand surrounding the king by the altar and the temple, from the south side to the north side of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_12","013_11_12","2KI","11","12","12","Then Jehoiada brought out the king’s son, put the crown on him, presented him with the Testimony, and proclaimed him king. They anointed him, and the people clapped their hands and declared, “Long live the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_13","013_11_13","2KI","11","13","13","When Athaliah heard the noise from the guards and the people, she went out to the people in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_14","013_11_14","2KI","11","14","14","And she looked out and saw the king standing by the pillar, according to the custom. The officers and trumpeters were beside the king, and all the people of the land were rejoicing and blowing trumpets. Then Athaliah tore her clothes and screamed, “Treason! Treason!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_15","013_11_15","2KI","11","15","15","And Jehoiada the priest ordered the commanders of hundreds in charge of the army, “Bring her out between the ranks, and put to the sword anyone who follows her.” For the priest had said, “She must not be put to death in the house of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_16","013_11_16","2KI","11","16","16","So they seized Athaliah as she reached the horses’ entrance to the palace grounds, and there she was put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_17","013_11_17","2KI","11","17","17","Then Jehoiada made a covenant between the LORD and the king and the people that they would be the LORD’s people. He also made a covenant between the king and the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_18","013_11_18","2KI","11","18","18","So all the people of the land went to the temple of Baal and tore it down. They smashed the altars and idols to pieces, and they killed Mattan the priest of Baal in front of the altars. And Jehoiada the priest posted guards for the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_19","013_11_19","2KI","11","19","19","He took with him the commanders of hundreds, the Carites, the guards, and all the people of the land, and they brought the king down from the house of the LORD and entered the royal palace by way of the Gate of the Guards. Then Joash took his seat on the royal throne, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_20","013_11_20","2KI","11","20","20","and all the people of the land rejoiced. And the city was quiet, because Athaliah had been put to the sword at the royal palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K211_21","013_11_21","2KI","11","21","21","Joash was seven years old when he became king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_1","013_12_1","2KI","12","1","1","In the seventh year of Jehu, Joash became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem forty years. His mother’s name was Zibiah; she was from Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_2","013_12_2","2KI","12","2","2","And Joash did what was right in the eyes of the LORD all the days he was instructed by Jehoiada the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_3","013_12_3","2KI","12","3","3","Nevertheless, the high places were not removed; the people continued sacrificing and burning incense there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_4","013_12_4","2KI","12","4","4","Then Joash said to the priests, “Collect all the money brought as sacred gifts into the house of the LORD—the census money, the money from vows, and the money brought voluntarily into the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_5","013_12_5","2KI","12","5","5","Let every priest receive it from his constituency, and let it be used to repair any damage found in the temple.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_6","013_12_6","2KI","12","6","6","By the twenty-third year of the reign of Joash, however, the priests had not yet repaired the damage to the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_7","013_12_7","2KI","12","7","7","So King Joash called Jehoiada and the other priests and said, “Why have you not repaired the damage to the temple? Now, therefore, take no more money from your constituency, but hand it over for the repair of the temple.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_8","013_12_8","2KI","12","8","8","So the priests agreed that they would not receive money from the people and that they would not repair the temple themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_9","013_12_9","2KI","12","9","9","Then Jehoiada the priest took a chest, bored a hole in its lid, and set it beside the altar on the right side as one enters the house of the LORD. There the priests who guarded the threshold put all the money brought into the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_10","013_12_10","2KI","12","10","10","Whenever they saw that there was a large amount of money in the chest, the royal scribe and the high priest would go up, count the money brought into the house of the LORD, and tie it up in bags. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_11","013_12_11","2KI","12","11","11","Then they would put the counted money into the hands of those who supervised the work on the house of the LORD, who in turn would pay those doing the work—the carpenters, builders, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_12","013_12_12","2KI","12","12","12","masons, and stonecutters. They also purchased timber and dressed stone to repair the damage to the house of the LORD, and they paid the other expenses of the temple repairs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_13","013_12_13","2KI","12","13","13","However, the money brought into the house of the LORD was not used for making silver basins, wick trimmers, sprinkling bowls, trumpets, or any articles of gold or silver for the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_14","013_12_14","2KI","12","14","14","Instead, it was paid to those doing the work, and with it they repaired the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_15","013_12_15","2KI","12","15","15","No accounting was required from the men who received the money to pay the workmen, because they acted with integrity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_16","013_12_16","2KI","12","16","16","The money from the guilt offerings and sin offerings was not brought into the house of the LORD; it belonged to the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_17","013_12_17","2KI","12","17","17","At that time Hazael king of Aram marched up and fought against Gath and captured it. Then he decided to attack Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_18","013_12_18","2KI","12","18","18","So King Joash of Judah took all the sacred objects dedicated by his fathers—Jehoshaphat, Jehoram, and Ahaziah, the kings of Judah—along with his own consecrated items and all the gold found in the treasuries of the house of the LORD and the royal palace, and he sent them to Hazael king of Aram. So Hazael withdrew from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_19","013_12_19","2KI","12","19","19","As for the rest of the acts of Joash, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_20","013_12_20","2KI","12","20","20","And the servants of Joash rose up and formed a conspiracy and killed him at Beth-millo, on the road down to Silla. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K212_21","013_12_21","2KI","12","21","21","His servants Jozabad son of Shimeath and Jehozabad son of Shomer struck him down, and he died. And they buried him with his fathers in the City of David, and his son Amaziah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_1","013_13_1","2KI","13","1","1","In the twenty-third year of the reign of Joash son of Ahaziah over Judah, Jehoahaz son of Jehu became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria seventeen years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_2","013_13_2","2KI","13","2","2","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and followed the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit; he did not turn away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_3","013_13_3","2KI","13","3","3","So the anger of the LORD burned against Israel, and He delivered them continually into the hands of Hazael king of Aram and his son Ben-hadad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_4","013_13_4","2KI","13","4","4","Then Jehoahaz sought the favor of the LORD, and the LORD listened to him because He saw the oppression that the king of Aram had inflicted on Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_5","013_13_5","2KI","13","5","5","So the LORD gave Israel a deliverer, and they escaped the power of the Arameans. Then the people of Israel lived in their own homes as they had before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_6","013_13_6","2KI","13","6","6","Nevertheless, they did not turn away from the sins that the house of Jeroboam had caused Israel to commit, but they continued to walk in them. The Asherah pole even remained standing in Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_7","013_13_7","2KI","13","7","7","Jehoahaz had no army left, except fifty horsemen, ten chariots, and ten thousand foot soldiers, because the king of Aram had destroyed them and made them like the dust at threshing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_8","013_13_8","2KI","13","8","8","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoahaz, along with all his accomplishments and his might, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_9","013_13_9","2KI","13","9","9","And Jehoahaz rested with his fathers and was buried in Samaria. And his son Jehoash reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_10","013_13_10","2KI","13","10","10","In the thirty-seventh year of the reign of Joash over Judah, Jehoash son of Jehoahaz became king of Israel in Samaria, and he reigned sixteen years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_11","013_13_11","2KI","13","11","11","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and did not turn away from all the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit, but he walked in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_12","013_13_12","2KI","13","12","12","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoash, along with all his accomplishments and his might, including his war against Amaziah king of Judah, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_13","013_13_13","2KI","13","13","13","And Jehoash rested with his fathers, and Jeroboam succeeded him on the throne. Jehoash was buried in Samaria with the kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_14","013_13_14","2KI","13","14","14","When Elisha had fallen sick with the illness from which he would die, Jehoash king of Israel came down to him and wept over him, saying, “My father, my father, the chariots and horsemen of Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_15","013_13_15","2KI","13","15","15","Elisha told him, “Take a bow and some arrows.” So Jehoash took a bow and some arrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_16","013_13_16","2KI","13","16","16","Then Elisha said to the king of Israel, “Put your hand on the bow.” So the king put his hand on the bow, and Elisha put his hands on the king’s hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_17","013_13_17","2KI","13","17","17","“Open the east window,” said Elisha. So he opened it and Elisha said, “Shoot!” So he shot. And Elisha declared: “This is the LORD’s arrow of victory, the arrow of victory over Aram, for you shall strike the Arameans in Aphek until you have put an end to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_18","013_13_18","2KI","13","18","18","Then Elisha said, “Take the arrows!” So he took them, and Elisha said to the king of Israel, “Strike the ground!” So he struck the ground three times and stopped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_19","013_13_19","2KI","13","19","19","But the man of God was angry with him and said, “You should have struck the ground five or six times. Then you would have struck down Aram until you had put an end to it. But now you will strike down Aram only three times.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_20","013_13_20","2KI","13","20","20","And Elisha died and was buried. Now the Moabite raiders used to come into the land every spring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_21","013_13_21","2KI","13","21","21","Once, as the Israelites were burying a man, suddenly they saw a band of raiders, so they threw the man’s body into Elisha’s tomb. And as soon as his body touched the bones of Elisha, the man was revived and stood up on his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_22","013_13_22","2KI","13","22","22","And Hazael king of Aram oppressed Israel throughout the reign of Jehoahaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_23","013_13_23","2KI","13","23","23","But the LORD was gracious to Israel and had compassion on them, and He turned toward them because of His covenant with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. And to this day, the LORD has been unwilling to destroy them or cast them from His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_24","013_13_24","2KI","13","24","24","When Hazael king of Aram died, his son Ben-hadad reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K213_25","013_13_25","2KI","13","25","25","Then Jehoash son of Jehoahaz took back from Ben-hadad son of Hazael the cities that Hazael had taken in battle from his father Jehoahaz. Jehoash defeated Ben-hadad three times, and so recovered the cities of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_1","013_14_1","2KI","14","1","1","In the second year of the reign of Jehoash son of Jehoahaz over Israel, Amaziah son of Joash became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_2","013_14_2","2KI","14","2","2","He was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-nine years. His mother’s name was Jehoaddan; she was from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_3","013_14_3","2KI","14","3","3","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, but not as his father David had done. He did everything as his father Joash had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_4","013_14_4","2KI","14","4","4","Nevertheless, the high places were not taken away, and the people continued sacrificing and burning incense on the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_5","013_14_5","2KI","14","5","5","As soon as the kingdom was firmly in his grasp, Amaziah executed the servants who had murdered his father the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_6","013_14_6","2KI","14","6","6","Yet he did not put the sons of the murderers to death, but acted according to what is written in the Book of the Law of Moses, where the LORD commanded: “Fathers must not be put to death for their children, and children must not be put to death for their fathers; each is to die for his own sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_7","013_14_7","2KI","14","7","7","Amaziah struck down 10,000 Edomites in the Valley of Salt. He took Sela in battle and called it Joktheel, which is its name to this very day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_8","013_14_8","2KI","14","8","8","Then Amaziah sent messengers to the king of Israel Jehoash son of Jehoahaz, the son of Jehu. “Come, let us meet face to face,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_9","013_14_9","2KI","14","9","9","But Jehoash king of Israel replied to Amaziah king of Judah: “A thistle in Lebanon sent a message to a cedar in Lebanon, saying, ‘Give your daughter to my son in marriage.’ Then a wild beast in Lebanon came along and trampled the thistle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_10","013_14_10","2KI","14","10","10","You have indeed defeated Edom, and your heart has become proud. Glory in that and stay at home. Why should you stir up trouble so that you fall—you and Judah with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_11","013_14_11","2KI","14","11","11","But Amaziah would not listen, so Jehoash king of Israel advanced. He and King Amaziah of Judah faced each other at Beth-shemesh in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_12","013_14_12","2KI","14","12","12","And Judah was routed before Israel, and every man fled to his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_13","013_14_13","2KI","14","13","13","There at Beth-shemesh, Jehoash king of Israel captured Amaziah king of Judah, the son of Joash, the son of Ahaziah. Then Jehoash went to Jerusalem and broke down the wall of Jerusalem from the Ephraim Gate to the Corner Gate—a section of four hundred cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_14","013_14_14","2KI","14","14","14","He took all the gold and silver and all the articles found in the house of the LORD and in the treasuries of the royal palace, as well as some hostages. Then he returned to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_15","013_14_15","2KI","14","15","15","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoash, along with his accomplishments, his might, and how he waged war against Amaziah king of Judah, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_16","013_14_16","2KI","14","16","16","And Jehoash rested with his fathers and was buried in Samaria with the kings of Israel. And his son Jeroboam reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_17","013_14_17","2KI","14","17","17","Amaziah son of Joash king of Judah lived for fifteen years after the death of Jehoash son of Jehoahaz king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_18","013_14_18","2KI","14","18","18","As for the rest of the acts of Amaziah, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_19","013_14_19","2KI","14","19","19","And conspirators plotted against Amaziah in Jerusalem, and he fled to Lachish. But men were sent after him to Lachish, and they killed him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_20","013_14_20","2KI","14","20","20","They carried him back on horses and buried him in Jerusalem with his fathers in the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_21","013_14_21","2KI","14","21","21","Then all the people of Judah took Azariah, who was sixteen years old, and made him king in place of his father Amaziah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_22","013_14_22","2KI","14","22","22","Azariah was the one who rebuilt Elath and restored it to Judah after King Amaziah rested with his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_23","013_14_23","2KI","14","23","23","In the fifteenth year of the reign of Amaziah son of Joash over Judah, Jeroboam son of Jehoash became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria forty-one years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_24","013_14_24","2KI","14","24","24","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and did not turn away from all the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_25","013_14_25","2KI","14","25","25","This Jeroboam restored the boundary of Israel from Lebo-hamath to the Sea of the Arabah, according to the word that the LORD, the God of Israel, had spoken through His servant Jonah son of Amittai, the prophet from Gath-hepher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_26","013_14_26","2KI","14","26","26","For the LORD saw that the affliction of the Israelites, both slave and free, was very bitter. There was no one to help Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_27","013_14_27","2KI","14","27","27","and since the LORD had said that He would not blot out the name of Israel from under heaven, He saved them by the hand of Jeroboam son of Jehoash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_28","013_14_28","2KI","14","28","28","As for the rest of the acts of Jeroboam, along with all his accomplishments and might, and how he waged war and recovered both Damascus and Hamath for Israel from Judah, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K214_29","013_14_29","2KI","14","29","29","And Jeroboam rested with his fathers, the kings of Israel. And his son Zechariah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_1","013_15_1","2KI","15","1","1","In the twenty-seventh year of Jeroboam’s reign over Israel, Azariah son of Amaziah became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_2","013_15_2","2KI","15","2","2","He was sixteen years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-two years. His mother’s name was Jecoliah; she was from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_3","013_15_3","2KI","15","3","3","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father Amaziah had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_4","013_15_4","2KI","15","4","4","Nevertheless, the high places were not taken away; the people continued sacrificing and burning incense there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_5","013_15_5","2KI","15","5","5","And the LORD afflicted the king with leprosy until the day he died, so that he lived in a separate house while his son Jotham had charge of the palace and governed the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_6","013_15_6","2KI","15","6","6","As for the rest of the acts of Azariah, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_7","013_15_7","2KI","15","7","7","And Azariah rested with his fathers and was buried near them in the City of David. And his son Jotham reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_8","013_15_8","2KI","15","8","8","In the thirty-eighth year of Azariah’s reign over Judah, Zechariah son of Jeroboam became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria six months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_9","013_15_9","2KI","15","9","9","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, as his fathers had done. He did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_10","013_15_10","2KI","15","10","10","Then Shallum son of Jabesh conspired against Zechariah, struck him down and killed him in front of the people, and reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_11","013_15_11","2KI","15","11","11","As for the rest of the acts of Zechariah, they are indeed written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_12","013_15_12","2KI","15","12","12","So the word of the LORD spoken to Jehu was fulfilled: “Four generations of your sons will sit on the throne of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_13","013_15_13","2KI","15","13","13","In the thirty-ninth year of Uzziah’s reign over Judah, Shallum son of Jabesh became king, and he reigned in Samaria one full month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_14","013_15_14","2KI","15","14","14","Then Menahem son of Gadi went up from Tirzah to Samaria, struck down and killed Shallum son of Jabesh, and reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_15","013_15_15","2KI","15","15","15","As for the rest of the acts of Shallum, along with the conspiracy he led, they are indeed written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_16","013_15_16","2KI","15","16","16","At that time Menahem, starting from Tirzah, attacked Tiphsah and everyone in its vicinity, because they would not open their gates. So he attacked Tiphsah and ripped open all the pregnant women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_17","013_15_17","2KI","15","17","17","In the thirty-ninth year of Azariah’s reign over Judah, Menahem son of Gadi became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria ten years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_18","013_15_18","2KI","15","18","18","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, and throughout his reign he did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_19","013_15_19","2KI","15","19","19","Then Pul king of Assyria invaded the land, and Menahem gave Pul a thousand talents of silver in order to gain his support and strengthen his own grip on the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_20","013_15_20","2KI","15","20","20","Menahem exacted this money from each of the wealthy men of Israel—fifty shekels of silver from each man—to give to the king of Assyria. So the king of Assyria withdrew and did not remain in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_21","013_15_21","2KI","15","21","21","As for the rest of the acts of Menahem, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_22","013_15_22","2KI","15","22","22","And Menahem rested with his fathers, and his son Pekahiah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_23","013_15_23","2KI","15","23","23","In the fiftieth year of Azariah’s reign over Judah, Pekahiah son of Menahem became king of Israel and reigned in Samaria two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_24","013_15_24","2KI","15","24","24","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_25","013_15_25","2KI","15","25","25","Then his officer, Pekah son of Remaliah, conspired against him along with Argob, Arieh, and fifty men of Gilead. And at the citadel of the king’s palace in Samaria, Pekah struck down and killed Pekahiah and reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_26","013_15_26","2KI","15","26","26","As for the rest of the acts of Pekahiah, along with all his accomplishments, they are indeed written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_27","013_15_27","2KI","15","27","27","In the fifty-second year of Azariah’s reign over Judah, Pekah son of Remaliah became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria twenty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_28","013_15_28","2KI","15","28","28","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD and did not turn away from the sins that Jeroboam son of Nebat had caused Israel to commit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_29","013_15_29","2KI","15","29","29","In the days of Pekah king of Israel, Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria came and captured Ijon, Abel-beth-maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, and Galilee, including all the land of Naphtali, and he took the people as captives to Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_30","013_15_30","2KI","15","30","30","Then Hoshea son of Elah led a conspiracy against Pekah son of Remaliah. In the twentieth year of Jotham son of Uzziah, Hoshea attacked Pekah, killed him, and reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_31","013_15_31","2KI","15","31","31","As for the rest of the acts of Pekah, along with all his accomplishments, they are indeed written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_32","013_15_32","2KI","15","32","32","In the second year of the reign of Pekah son of Remaliah over Israel, Jotham son of Uzziah became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_33","013_15_33","2KI","15","33","33","He was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem sixteen years. His mother’s name was Jerusha daughter of Zadok. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_34","013_15_34","2KI","15","34","34","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father Uzziah had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_35","013_15_35","2KI","15","35","35","Nevertheless, the high places were not taken away; the people continued sacrificing and burning incense there. Jotham rebuilt the Upper Gate of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_36","013_15_36","2KI","15","36","36","As for the rest of the acts of Jotham, along with his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_37","013_15_37","2KI","15","37","37","(In those days the LORD began to send Rezin king of Aram and Pekah son of Remaliah against Judah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K215_38","013_15_38","2KI","15","38","38","And Jotham rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David his father. And his son Ahaz reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_1","013_16_1","2KI","16","1","1","In the seventeenth year of Pekah son of Remaliah, Ahaz son of Jotham became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_2","013_16_2","2KI","16","2","2","Ahaz was twenty years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem sixteen years. And unlike David his father, he did not do what was right in the eyes of the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_3","013_16_3","2KI","16","3","3","Instead, he walked in the ways of the kings of Israel and even sacrificed his son in the fire, according to the abominations of the nations that the LORD had driven out before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_4","013_16_4","2KI","16","4","4","And he sacrificed and burned incense on the high places, on the hills, and under every green tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_5","013_16_5","2KI","16","5","5","Then Rezin king of Aram and Pekah son of Remaliah king of Israel came up to wage war against Jerusalem. They besieged Ahaz but could not overcome him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_6","013_16_6","2KI","16","6","6","At that time Rezin king of Aram recovered Elath for Aram, drove out the men of Judah, and sent the Edomites into Elath, where they live to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_7","013_16_7","2KI","16","7","7","So Ahaz sent messengers to Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria, saying, “I am your servant and your son. Come up and save me from the hands of the kings of Aram and Israel, who are rising up against me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_8","013_16_8","2KI","16","8","8","Ahaz also took the silver and gold found in the house of the LORD and in the treasuries of the king’s palace, and he sent it as a gift to the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_9","013_16_9","2KI","16","9","9","So the king of Assyria responded to him, marched up to Damascus, and captured it. He took its people to Kir as captives and put Rezin to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_10","013_16_10","2KI","16","10","10","Then King Ahaz went to Damascus to meet Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria. On seeing the altar in Damascus, King Ahaz sent Uriah the priest a model of the altar and complete plans for its construction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_11","013_16_11","2KI","16","11","11","And Uriah the priest built the altar according to all the instructions King Ahaz had sent from Damascus, and he completed it before King Ahaz returned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_12","013_16_12","2KI","16","12","12","When the king came back from Damascus and saw the altar, he approached it and presented offerings on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_13","013_16_13","2KI","16","13","13","He offered his burnt offering and his grain offering, poured out his drink offering, and splattered the blood of his peace offerings on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_14","013_16_14","2KI","16","14","14","He also took the bronze altar that stood before the LORD from the front of the temple (between the new altar and the house of the LORD) and he put it on the north side of the new altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_15","013_16_15","2KI","16","15","15","Then King Ahaz commanded Uriah the priest, “Offer on the great altar the morning burnt offering, the evening grain offering, and the king’s burnt offering and grain offering, as well as the burnt offerings, grain offerings, and drink offerings of all the people of the land. Splatter on the altar all the blood of the burnt offerings and sacrifices. But I will use the bronze altar to seek guidance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_16","013_16_16","2KI","16","16","16","So Uriah the priest did just as King Ahaz had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_17","013_16_17","2KI","16","17","17","King Ahaz also cut off the frames of the movable stands and removed the bronze basin from each of them. He took down the Sea from the bronze oxen that were under it and put it on a stone base. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_18","013_16_18","2KI","16","18","18","And on account of the king of Assyria, he removed the Sabbath canopy they had built in the temple and closed the royal entryway outside the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_19","013_16_19","2KI","16","19","19","As for the rest of the acts of Ahaz, along with his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K216_20","013_16_20","2KI","16","20","20","And Ahaz rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David, and his son Hezekiah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_1","013_17_1","2KI","17","1","1","In the twelfth year of the reign of Ahaz over Judah, Hoshea son of Elah became king of Israel, and he reigned in Samaria nine years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_2","013_17_2","2KI","17","2","2","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, but not like the kings of Israel who preceded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_3","013_17_3","2KI","17","3","3","Shalmaneser king of Assyria attacked him, and Hoshea became his vassal and paid him tribute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_4","013_17_4","2KI","17","4","4","But the king of Assyria discovered that Hoshea had conspired to send envoys to King So of Egypt, and that he had not paid tribute to the king of Assyria as in previous years. Therefore the king of Assyria arrested Hoshea and put him in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_5","013_17_5","2KI","17","5","5","Then the king of Assyria invaded the whole land, marched up to Samaria, and besieged it for three years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_6","013_17_6","2KI","17","6","6","In the ninth year of Hoshea, the king of Assyria captured Samaria and carried away the Israelites to Assyria, where he settled them in Halah, in Gozan by the Habor River, and in the cities of the Medes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_7","013_17_7","2KI","17","7","7","All this happened because the people of Israel had sinned against the LORD their God, who had brought them out of the land of Egypt from under the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt. They had worshiped other gods ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_8","013_17_8","2KI","17","8","8","and walked in the customs of the nations that the LORD had driven out before the Israelites, as well as in the practices introduced by the kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_9","013_17_9","2KI","17","9","9","The Israelites secretly did things against the LORD their God that were not right. From watchtower to fortified city, they built high places in all their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_10","013_17_10","2KI","17","10","10","They set up for themselves sacred pillars and Asherah poles on every high hill and under every green tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_11","013_17_11","2KI","17","11","11","They burned incense on all the high places like the nations that the LORD had driven out before them. They did wicked things, provoking the LORD to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_12","013_17_12","2KI","17","12","12","They served idols, although the LORD had told them, “You shall not do this thing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_13","013_17_13","2KI","17","13","13","Yet through all His prophets and seers, the LORD warned Israel and Judah, saying, “Turn from your wicked ways and keep My commandments and statutes, according to the entire Law that I commanded your fathers and delivered to you through My servants the prophets.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_14","013_17_14","2KI","17","14","14","But they would not listen, and they stiffened their necks like their fathers, who did not believe the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_15","013_17_15","2KI","17","15","15","They rejected His statutes and the covenant He had made with their fathers, as well as the decrees He had given them. They pursued worthless idols and became worthless themselves, going after the surrounding nations that the LORD had commanded them not to imitate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_16","013_17_16","2KI","17","16","16","They abandoned all the commandments of the LORD their God and made for themselves two cast idols of calves and an Asherah pole. They bowed down to all the host of heaven and served Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_17","013_17_17","2KI","17","17","17","They sacrificed their sons and daughters in the fire and practiced divination and soothsaying. They devoted themselves to doing evil in the sight of the LORD, provoking Him to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_18","013_17_18","2KI","17","18","18","So the LORD was very angry with Israel, and He removed them from His presence. Only the tribe of Judah remained, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_19","013_17_19","2KI","17","19","19","and even Judah did not keep the commandments of the LORD their God, but lived according to the customs Israel had introduced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_20","013_17_20","2KI","17","20","20","So the LORD rejected all the descendants of Israel. He afflicted them and delivered them into the hands of plunderers, until He had banished them from His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_21","013_17_21","2KI","17","21","21","When the LORD had torn Israel away from the house of David, they made Jeroboam son of Nebat king, and Jeroboam led Israel away from following the LORD and caused them to commit a great sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_22","013_17_22","2KI","17","22","22","The Israelites persisted in all the sins that Jeroboam had committed and did not turn away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_23","013_17_23","2KI","17","23","23","Finally, the LORD removed Israel from His presence, as He had declared through all His servants the prophets. So Israel was exiled from their homeland into Assyria, where they are to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_24","013_17_24","2KI","17","24","24","Then the king of Assyria brought people from Babylon, Cuthah, Avva, Hamath, and Sepharvaim and settled them in the towns of Samaria to replace the Israelites. They took possession of Samaria and lived in its towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_25","013_17_25","2KI","17","25","25","Now when the settlers first lived there, they did not worship the LORD, so He sent lions among them, which killed some of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_26","013_17_26","2KI","17","26","26","So they spoke to the king of Assyria, saying, “The peoples that you have removed and placed in the cities of Samaria do not know the requirements of the God of the land. Because of this, He has sent lions among them, which are indeed killing them off.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_27","013_17_27","2KI","17","27","27","Then the king of Assyria commanded: “Send back one of the priests you carried off from Samaria, and have him go back to live there and teach the requirements of the God of the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_28","013_17_28","2KI","17","28","28","Thus one of the priests they had carried away came and lived in Bethel, and he began to teach them how they should worship the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_29","013_17_29","2KI","17","29","29","Nevertheless, the people of each nation continued to make their own gods in the cities where they had settled, and they set them up in the shrines that the people of Samaria had made on the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_30","013_17_30","2KI","17","30","30","The men of Babylon made Succoth-benoth, the men of Cuth made Nergal, the men of Hamath made Ashima, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_31","013_17_31","2KI","17","31","31","the Avvites made Nibhaz and Tartak, and the Sepharvites burned their children in the fire to Adrammelech and Anammelech the gods of Sepharvaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_32","013_17_32","2KI","17","32","32","So the new residents worshiped the LORD, but they also appointed for themselves priests of all sorts to serve in the shrines of the high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_33","013_17_33","2KI","17","33","33","They worshiped the LORD, but they also served their own gods according to the customs of the nations from which they had been carried away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_34","013_17_34","2KI","17","34","34","To this day they are still practicing their former customs. None of them worship the LORD or observe the statutes, ordinances, laws, and commandments that the LORD gave the descendants of Jacob, whom He named Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_35","013_17_35","2KI","17","35","35","For the LORD had made a covenant with the Israelites and commanded them, “Do not worship other gods or bow down to them; do not serve them or sacrifice to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_36","013_17_36","2KI","17","36","36","Instead, worship the LORD, who brought you out of the land of Egypt with great power and an outstretched arm. You are to bow down to Him and offer sacrifices to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_37","013_17_37","2KI","17","37","37","And you must always be careful to observe the statutes, ordinances, laws, and commandments He wrote for you. Do not worship other gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_38","013_17_38","2KI","17","38","38","Do not forget the covenant I have made with you. Do not worship other gods, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_39","013_17_39","2KI","17","39","39","but worship the LORD your God, and He will deliver you from the hands of all your enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_40","013_17_40","2KI","17","40","40","But they would not listen, and they persisted in their former customs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K217_41","013_17_41","2KI","17","41","41","So these nations worshiped the LORD but also served their idols, and to this day their children and grandchildren continue to do as their fathers did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_1","013_18_1","2KI","18","1","1","In the third year of the reign of Hoshea son of Elah over Israel, Hezekiah son of Ahaz became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_2","013_18_2","2KI","18","2","2","He was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-nine years. His mother’s name was Abi, the daughter of Zechariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_3","013_18_3","2KI","18","3","3","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father David had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_4","013_18_4","2KI","18","4","4","He removed the high places, shattered the sacred pillars, and cut down the Asherah poles. He also demolished the bronze snake called Nehushtan that Moses had made, for up to that time the Israelites had burned incense to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_5","013_18_5","2KI","18","5","5","Hezekiah trusted in the LORD, the God of Israel. No king of Judah was like him, either before him or after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_6","013_18_6","2KI","18","6","6","He remained faithful to the LORD and did not turn from following Him; he kept the commandments that the LORD had given Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_7","013_18_7","2KI","18","7","7","And the LORD was with Hezekiah, and he prospered wherever he went. He rebelled against the king of Assyria and refused to serve him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_8","013_18_8","2KI","18","8","8","He defeated the Philistines as far as Gaza and its borders, from watchtower to fortified city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_9","013_18_9","2KI","18","9","9","In the fourth year of Hezekiah’s reign, which was the seventh year of the reign of Hoshea son of Elah over Israel, Shalmaneser king of Assyria marched against Samaria and besieged it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_10","013_18_10","2KI","18","10","10","And at the end of three years, the Assyrians captured it. So Samaria was captured in the sixth year of Hezekiah, which was the ninth year of Hoshea king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_11","013_18_11","2KI","18","11","11","The king of Assyria exiled the Israelites to Assyria and settled them in Halah, in Gozan by the Habor River, and in the cities of the Medes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_12","013_18_12","2KI","18","12","12","This happened because they did not listen to the voice of the LORD their God, but violated His covenant—all that Moses the servant of the LORD had commanded—and would neither listen nor obey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_13","013_18_13","2KI","18","13","13","In the fourteenth year of Hezekiah’s reign, Sennacherib king of Assyria attacked and captured all the fortified cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_14","013_18_14","2KI","18","14","14","So Hezekiah king of Judah sent word to the king of Assyria at Lachish, saying, “I have done wrong; withdraw from me, and I will pay whatever you demand from me.” And the king of Assyria exacted from Hezekiah king of Judah three hundred talents of silver and thirty talents of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_15","013_18_15","2KI","18","15","15","Hezekiah gave him all the silver that was found in the house of the LORD and in the treasuries of the royal palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_16","013_18_16","2KI","18","16","16","At that time Hezekiah stripped the gold with which he had plated the doors and doorposts of the temple of the LORD, and he gave it to the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_17","013_18_17","2KI","18","17","17","Nevertheless, the king of Assyria sent the Tartan, the Rabsaris, and the Rabshakeh, along with a great army, from Lachish to King Hezekiah at Jerusalem. They advanced up to Jerusalem and stationed themselves by the aqueduct of the upper pool, on the road to the Launderer’s Field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_18","013_18_18","2KI","18","18","18","Then they called for the king. And Eliakim son of Hilkiah the palace administrator, Shebnah the scribe, and Joah son of Asaph the recorder, went out to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_19","013_18_19","2KI","18","19","19","The Rabshakeh said to them, “Tell Hezekiah that this is what the great king, the king of Assyria, says: What is the basis of this confidence of yours? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_20","013_18_20","2KI","18","20","20","You claim to have a strategy and strength for war, but these are empty words. In whom are you now trusting, that you have rebelled against me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_21","013_18_21","2KI","18","21","21","Look now, you are trusting in Egypt, that splintered reed of a staff that will pierce the hand of anyone who leans on it. Such is Pharaoh king of Egypt to all who trust in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_22","013_18_22","2KI","18","22","22","But if you say to me, ‘We trust in the LORD our God,’ is He not the One whose high places and altars Hezekiah has removed, saying to Judah and Jerusalem: ‘You must worship before this altar in Jerusalem’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_23","013_18_23","2KI","18","23","23","Now, therefore, make a bargain with my master, the king of Assyria. I will give you two thousand horses—if you can put riders on them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_24","013_18_24","2KI","18","24","24","For how can you repel a single officer among the least of my master’s servants when you depend on Egypt for chariots and horsemen? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_25","013_18_25","2KI","18","25","25","So now, was it apart from the LORD that I have come up against this place to destroy it? The LORD Himself said to me, ‘Go up against this land and destroy it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_26","013_18_26","2KI","18","26","26","Then Eliakim son of Hilkiah, along with Shebnah and Joah, said to the Rabshakeh, “Please speak to your servants in Aramaic, since we understand it. Do not speak with us in Hebrew in the hearing of the people on the wall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_27","013_18_27","2KI","18","27","27","But the Rabshakeh replied, “Has my master sent me to speak these words only to you and your master, and not to the men sitting on the wall, who are destined with you to eat their own dung and drink their own urine?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_28","013_18_28","2KI","18","28","28","Then the Rabshakeh stood and called out loudly in Hebrew: “Hear the word of the great king, the king of Assyria! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_29","013_18_29","2KI","18","29","29","This is what the king says: Do not let Hezekiah deceive you; he cannot deliver you from my hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_30","013_18_30","2KI","18","30","30","Do not let Hezekiah persuade you to trust in the LORD when he says, ‘The LORD will surely deliver us; this city will not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_31","013_18_31","2KI","18","31","31","Do not listen to Hezekiah, for this is what the king of Assyria says: Make peace with me and come out to me. Then every one of you will eat from his own vine and his own fig tree and drink water from his own cistern, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_32","013_18_32","2KI","18","32","32","until I come and take you away to a land like your own—a land of grain and new wine, a land of bread and vineyards, a land of olive trees and honey—so that you may live and not die. But do not listen to Hezekiah, for he misleads you when he says, ‘The LORD will deliver us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_33","013_18_33","2KI","18","33","33","Has the god of any nation ever delivered his land from the hand of the king of Assyria? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_34","013_18_34","2KI","18","34","34","Where are the gods of Hamath and Arpad? Where are the gods of Sepharvaim, Hena, and Ivvah? Have they delivered Samaria from my hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_35","013_18_35","2KI","18","35","35","Who among all the gods of these lands has delivered his land from my hand? How then can the LORD deliver Jerusalem from my hand?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_36","013_18_36","2KI","18","36","36","But the people remained silent and did not answer a word, for Hezekiah had commanded, “Do not answer him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K218_37","013_18_37","2KI","18","37","37","Then Hilkiah’s son Eliakim the palace administrator, Shebna the scribe, and Asaph’s son Joah the recorder came to Hezekiah with their clothes torn, and they relayed to him the words of the Rabshakeh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_1","013_19_1","2KI","19","1","1","On hearing this report, King Hezekiah tore his clothes, put on sackcloth, and entered the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_2","013_19_2","2KI","19","2","2","And he sent Eliakim the palace administrator, Shebna the scribe, and the leading priests, all wearing sackcloth, to the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_3","013_19_3","2KI","19","3","3","to tell him, “This is what Hezekiah says: Today is a day of distress, rebuke, and disgrace; for children have come to the point of birth, but there is no strength to deliver them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_4","013_19_4","2KI","19","4","4","Perhaps the LORD your God will hear all the words of the Rabshakeh, whom his master the king of Assyria has sent to defy the living God, and He will rebuke him for the words that the LORD your God has heard. Therefore lift up a prayer for the remnant that still survives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_5","013_19_5","2KI","19","5","5","So the servants of King Hezekiah went to Isaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_6","013_19_6","2KI","19","6","6","who replied, “Tell your master that this is what the LORD says: ‘Do not be afraid of the words you have heard, with which the servants of the king of Assyria have blasphemed Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_7","013_19_7","2KI","19","7","7","Behold, I will put a spirit in him so that he will hear a rumor and return to his own land, where I will cause him to fall by the sword.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_8","013_19_8","2KI","19","8","8","When the Rabshakeh heard that the king of Assyria had left Lachish, he withdrew and found the king fighting against Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_9","013_19_9","2KI","19","9","9","Now Sennacherib had been warned about Tirhakah king of Cush: “Look, he has set out to fight against you.” So Sennacherib again sent messengers to Hezekiah, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_10","013_19_10","2KI","19","10","10","“Give this message to Hezekiah king of Judah: ‘Do not let your God, in whom you trust, deceive you by saying that Jerusalem will not be delivered into the hand of the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_11","013_19_11","2KI","19","11","11","Surely you have heard what the kings of Assyria have done to all the other countries, devoting them to destruction. Will you then be spared? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_12","013_19_12","2KI","19","12","12","Did the gods of the nations destroyed by my fathers rescue those nations—the gods of Gozan, Haran, and Rezeph, and of the people of Eden in Telassar? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_13","013_19_13","2KI","19","13","13","Where are the kings of Hamath, Arpad, Sepharvaim, Hena, and Ivvah?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_14","013_19_14","2KI","19","14","14","So Hezekiah received the letter from the messengers, read it, and went up to the house of the LORD and spread it out before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_15","013_19_15","2KI","19","15","15","And Hezekiah prayed before the LORD: “O LORD, God of Israel, enthroned between the cherubim, You alone are God over all the kingdoms of the earth. You made the heavens and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_16","013_19_16","2KI","19","16","16","Incline Your ear, O LORD, and hear; open Your eyes, O LORD, and see. Listen to the words that Sennacherib has sent to defy the living God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_17","013_19_17","2KI","19","17","17","Truly, O LORD, the kings of Assyria have laid waste these nations and their lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_18","013_19_18","2KI","19","18","18","They have cast their gods into the fire and destroyed them, for they were not gods, but only wood and stone—the work of human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_19","013_19_19","2KI","19","19","19","And now, O LORD our God, please save us from his hand, so that all the kingdoms of the earth may know that You alone, O LORD, are God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_20","013_19_20","2KI","19","20","20","Then Isaiah son of Amoz sent a message to Hezekiah: “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: I have heard your prayer concerning Sennacherib king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_21","013_19_21","2KI","19","21","21","This is the word that the LORD has spoken against him: ‘The Virgin Daughter of Zion despises you and mocks you; the Daughter of Jerusalem shakes her head behind you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_22","013_19_22","2KI","19","22","22","Whom have you taunted and blasphemed? Against whom have you raised your voice and lifted your eyes in pride? Against the Holy One of Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_23","013_19_23","2KI","19","23","23","Through your servants you have taunted the Lord, and you have said: “With my many chariots I have ascended to the heights of the mountains, to the remote peaks of Lebanon. I have cut down its tallest cedars, the finest of its cypresses. I have reached its farthest outposts, the densest of its forests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_24","013_19_24","2KI","19","24","24","I have dug wells and drunk foreign waters. With the soles of my feet I have dried up all the streams of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_25","013_19_25","2KI","19","25","25","Have you not heard? Long ago I ordained it; in days of old I planned it. Now I have brought it to pass, that you should crush fortified cities into piles of rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_26","013_19_26","2KI","19","26","26","Therefore their inhabitants, devoid of power, are dismayed and ashamed. They are like plants in the field, tender green shoots, grass on the rooftops, scorched before it is grown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_27","013_19_27","2KI","19","27","27","But I know your sitting down, your going out and coming in, and your raging against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_28","013_19_28","2KI","19","28","28","Because your rage and arrogance against Me have reached My ears, I will put My hook in your nose and My bit in your mouth; I will send you back the way you came.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_29","013_19_29","2KI","19","29","29","And this will be a sign to you, O Hezekiah: This year you will eat what grows on its own, and in the second year what springs from the same. But in the third year you will sow and reap; you will plant vineyards and eat their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_30","013_19_30","2KI","19","30","30","And the surviving remnant of the house of Judah will again take root below and bear fruit above. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_31","013_19_31","2KI","19","31","31","For a remnant will go forth from Jerusalem, and survivors from Mount Zion. The zeal of the LORD of Hosts will accomplish this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_32","013_19_32","2KI","19","32","32","So this is what the LORD says about the king of Assyria: ‘He will not enter this city or shoot an arrow into it. He will not come before it with a shield or build up a siege ramp against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_33","013_19_33","2KI","19","33","33","He will go back the way he came, and he will not enter this city, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_34","013_19_34","2KI","19","34","34","I will defend this city and save it for My own sake and for the sake of My servant David.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_35","013_19_35","2KI","19","35","35","And that very night the angel of the LORD went out and struck down 185,000 men in the camp of the Assyrians. When the people got up the next morning, there were all the dead bodies! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_36","013_19_36","2KI","19","36","36","So Sennacherib king of Assyria broke camp and withdrew. He returned to Nineveh and stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K219_37","013_19_37","2KI","19","37","37","One day, while he was worshiping in the temple of his god Nisroch, his sons Adrammelech and Sharezer put him to the sword and escaped to the land of Ararat. And his son Esar-haddon reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_1","013_20_1","2KI","20","1","1","In those days Hezekiah became mortally ill. The prophet Isaiah son of Amoz came to him and said, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Put your house in order, for you are about to die; you will not recover.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_2","013_20_2","2KI","20","2","2","Then Hezekiah turned his face to the wall and prayed to the LORD, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_3","013_20_3","2KI","20","3","3","“Please, O LORD, remember how I have walked before You faithfully and with wholehearted devotion; I have done what is good in Your sight.” And Hezekiah wept bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_4","013_20_4","2KI","20","4","4","Before Isaiah had left the middle courtyard, the word of the LORD came to him, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_5","013_20_5","2KI","20","5","5","“Go back and tell Hezekiah the leader of My people that this is what the LORD, the God of your father David, says: ‘I have heard your prayer; I have seen your tears. I will surely heal you. On the third day from now you will go up to the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_6","013_20_6","2KI","20","6","6","I will add fifteen years to your life. And I will deliver you and this city from the hand of the king of Assyria. I will defend this city for My sake and for the sake of My servant David.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_7","013_20_7","2KI","20","7","7","Then Isaiah said, “Prepare a poultice of figs.” So they brought it and applied it to the boil, and Hezekiah recovered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_8","013_20_8","2KI","20","8","8","Now Hezekiah had asked Isaiah, “What will be the sign that the LORD will heal me and that I will go up to the house of the LORD on the third day?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_9","013_20_9","2KI","20","9","9","And Isaiah had replied, “This will be a sign to you from the LORD that He will do what He has promised: Would you like the shadow to go forward ten steps, or back ten steps?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_10","013_20_10","2KI","20","10","10","“It is easy for the shadow to lengthen ten steps,” answered Hezekiah, “but not for it to go back ten steps.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_11","013_20_11","2KI","20","11","11","So Isaiah the prophet called out to the LORD, and He brought the shadow back the ten steps it had descended on the stairway of Ahaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_12","013_20_12","2KI","20","12","12","At that time Merodach-baladan son of Baladan king of Babylon sent letters and a gift to Hezekiah, for he had heard about Hezekiah’s illness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_13","013_20_13","2KI","20","13","13","And Hezekiah received the envoys and showed them all that was in his treasure house—the silver, the gold, the spices, and the precious oil, as well as his armory—all that was found in his storehouses. There was nothing in his palace or in all his dominion that Hezekiah did not show them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_14","013_20_14","2KI","20","14","14","Then the prophet Isaiah went to King Hezekiah and asked, “Where did those men come from, and what did they say to you?” “They came from a distant land,” Hezekiah replied, “from Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_15","013_20_15","2KI","20","15","15","“What have they seen in your palace?” Isaiah asked. “They have seen everything in my palace,” answered Hezekiah. “There is nothing among my treasures that I did not show them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_16","013_20_16","2KI","20","16","16","Then Isaiah said to Hezekiah, “Hear the word of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_17","013_20_17","2KI","20","17","17","The time will surely come when everything in your palace and all that your fathers have stored up until this day will be carried off to Babylon. Nothing will be left, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_18","013_20_18","2KI","20","18","18","And some of your descendants, your own flesh and blood, will be taken away to be eunuchs in the palace of the king of Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_19","013_20_19","2KI","20","19","19","But Hezekiah said to Isaiah, “The word of the LORD that you have spoken is good.” For he thought, “Will there not at least be peace and security in my lifetime?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_20","013_20_20","2KI","20","20","20","As for the rest of the acts of Hezekiah, along with all his might and how he constructed the pool and the tunnel to bring water into the city, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K220_21","013_20_21","2KI","20","21","21","And Hezekiah rested with his fathers, and his son Manasseh reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_1","013_21_1","2KI","21","1","1","Manasseh was twelve years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-five years. His mother’s name was Hephzibah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_2","013_21_2","2KI","21","2","2","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD by following the abominations of the nations that the LORD had driven out before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_3","013_21_3","2KI","21","3","3","For he rebuilt the high places that his father Hezekiah had destroyed, and he raised up altars for Baal. He made an Asherah pole, as King Ahab of Israel had done, and he worshiped and served all the host of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_4","013_21_4","2KI","21","4","4","Manasseh also built altars in the house of the LORD, of which the LORD had said, “In Jerusalem I will put My Name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_5","013_21_5","2KI","21","5","5","In both courtyards of the house of the LORD, he built altars to all the host of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_6","013_21_6","2KI","21","6","6","He sacrificed his own son in the fire, practiced sorcery and divination, and consulted mediums and spiritists. He did great evil in the sight of the LORD, provoking Him to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_7","013_21_7","2KI","21","7","7","Manasseh even took the carved Asherah pole he had made and set it up in the temple, of which the LORD had said to David and his son Solomon, “In this temple and in Jerusalem, which I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel, I will establish My Name forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_8","013_21_8","2KI","21","8","8","I will never again cause the feet of the Israelites to wander from the land that I gave to their fathers, if only they are careful to do all I have commanded them—the whole Law that My servant Moses commanded them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_9","013_21_9","2KI","21","9","9","But the people did not listen and Manasseh led them astray, so that they did greater evil than the nations that the LORD had destroyed before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_10","013_21_10","2KI","21","10","10","And the LORD spoke through His servants the prophets, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_11","013_21_11","2KI","21","11","11","“Since Manasseh king of Judah has committed all these abominations, acting more wickedly than the Amorites who preceded him, and with his idols has caused Judah to sin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_12","013_21_12","2KI","21","12","12","this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Behold, I am bringing such calamity upon Jerusalem and Judah that the news will reverberate in the ears of all who hear it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_13","013_21_13","2KI","21","13","13","I will stretch out over Jerusalem the measuring line used against Samaria and the plumb line used against the house of Ahab, and I will wipe out Jerusalem as one wipes out a bowl—wiping it and turning it upside down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_14","013_21_14","2KI","21","14","14","So I will forsake the remnant of My inheritance and deliver them into the hands of their enemies. And they will become plunder and spoil to all their enemies, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_15","013_21_15","2KI","21","15","15","because they have done evil in My sight and have provoked Me to anger from the day their fathers came out of Egypt until this day.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_16","013_21_16","2KI","21","16","16","Moreover, Manasseh shed so much innocent blood that he filled Jerusalem from end to end, in addition to the sin that he had caused Judah to commit, doing evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_17","013_21_17","2KI","21","17","17","As for the rest of the acts of Manasseh, along with all his accomplishments and the sin that he committed, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_18","013_21_18","2KI","21","18","18","And Manasseh rested with his fathers and was buried in his palace garden, the garden of Uzza. And his son Amon reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_19","013_21_19","2KI","21","19","19","Amon was twenty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem two years. His mother’s name was Meshullemeth daughter of Haruz; she was from Jotbah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_20","013_21_20","2KI","21","20","20","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, as his father Manasseh had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_21","013_21_21","2KI","21","21","21","He walked in all the ways of his father, and he served and worshiped the idols his father had served. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_22","013_21_22","2KI","21","22","22","He abandoned the LORD, the God of his fathers, and did not walk in the way of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_23","013_21_23","2KI","21","23","23","Then the servants of Amon conspired against him and killed the king in his palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_24","013_21_24","2KI","21","24","24","But the people of the land killed all those who had conspired against King Amon, and they made his son Josiah king in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_25","013_21_25","2KI","21","25","25","As for the rest of the acts of Amon, along with his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K221_26","013_21_26","2KI","21","26","26","And he was buried in his tomb in the garden of Uzza, and his son Josiah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_1","013_22_1","2KI","22","1","1","Josiah was eight years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem thirty-one years. His mother’s name was Jedidah daughter of Adaiah; she was from Bozkath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_2","013_22_2","2KI","22","2","2","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD and walked in all the ways of his father David; he did not turn aside to the right or to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_3","013_22_3","2KI","22","3","3","Now in the eighteenth year of his reign, King Josiah sent the scribe, Shaphan son of Azaliah, the son of Meshullam, to the house of the LORD, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_4","013_22_4","2KI","22","4","4","“Go up to Hilkiah the high priest and have him count the money that has been brought into the house of the LORD, which the doorkeepers have collected from the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_5","013_22_5","2KI","22","5","5","And let them deliver it into the hands of the supervisors of those doing the work on the house of the LORD, who in turn are to give it to the workmen repairing the damages to the house of the LORD— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_6","013_22_6","2KI","22","6","6","to the carpenters, builders, and masons—to buy timber and dressed stone to repair the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_7","013_22_7","2KI","22","7","7","But they need not account for the money put into their hands, since they work with integrity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_8","013_22_8","2KI","22","8","8","Then Hilkiah the high priest said to Shaphan the scribe, “I have found the Book of the Law in the house of the LORD!” And he gave it to Shaphan, who read it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_9","013_22_9","2KI","22","9","9","And Shaphan the scribe went to the king and reported, “Your servants have paid out the money that was found in the temple and have put it into the hands of the workers and supervisors of the house of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_10","013_22_10","2KI","22","10","10","Moreover, Shaphan the scribe told the king, “Hilkiah the priest has given me a book.” And Shaphan read it in the presence of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_11","013_22_11","2KI","22","11","11","When the king heard the words of the Book of the Law, he tore his clothes ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_12","013_22_12","2KI","22","12","12","and commanded Hilkiah the priest, Ahikam son of Shaphan, Achbor son of Micaiah, Shaphan the scribe, and Asaiah the servant of the king: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_13","013_22_13","2KI","22","13","13","“Go and inquire of the LORD for me, for the people, and for all Judah concerning the words in this book that has been found. For great is the wrath of the LORD that burns against us because our fathers have not obeyed the words of this book by doing all that is written about us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_14","013_22_14","2KI","22","14","14","So Hilkiah the priest, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan, and Asaiah went and spoke to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum son of Tikvah, the son of Harhas, the keeper of the wardrobe. She lived in Jerusalem, in the Second District. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_15","013_22_15","2KI","22","15","15","And Huldah said to them, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Tell the man who sent you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_16","013_22_16","2KI","22","16","16","that this is what the LORD says: I am about to bring calamity on this place and on its people, according to all the words of the book that the king of Judah has read, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_17","013_22_17","2KI","22","17","17","because they have forsaken Me and burned incense to other gods, that they might provoke Me to anger with all the works of their hands. My wrath will be kindled against this place and will not be quenched.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_18","013_22_18","2KI","22","18","18","But as for the king of Judah, who sent you to inquire of the LORD, tell him that this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘As for the words that you heard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_19","013_22_19","2KI","22","19","19","because your heart was tender and you humbled yourself before the LORD when you heard what I spoke against this place and against its people, that they would become a desolation and a curse, and because you have torn your clothes and wept before Me, I have heard you,’ declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K222_20","013_22_20","2KI","22","20","20","‘Therefore I will indeed gather you to your fathers, and you will be gathered to your grave in peace. Your eyes will not see all the calamity that I will bring on this place.’” So they brought her answer back to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_1","013_23_1","2KI","23","1","1","Then the king summoned all the elders of Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_2","013_23_2","2KI","23","2","2","And he went up to the house of the LORD with all the people of Judah and Jerusalem, as well as the priests and the prophets—all the people small and great—and in their hearing he read all the words of the Book of the Covenant that had been found in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_3","013_23_3","2KI","23","3","3","So the king stood by the pillar and made a covenant before the LORD to follow the LORD and to keep His commandments, decrees, and statutes with all his heart and all his soul, and to carry out the words of the covenant that were written in this book. And all the people entered into the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_4","013_23_4","2KI","23","4","4","Then the king commanded Hilkiah the high priest, the priests second in rank, and the doorkeepers to remove from the temple of the LORD all the articles made for Baal, Asherah, and all the host of heaven. And he burned them outside Jerusalem in the fields of Kidron and carried their ashes to Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_5","013_23_5","2KI","23","5","5","Josiah also did away with the idolatrous priests ordained by the kings of Judah to burn incense on the high places of the cities of Judah and in the places all around Jerusalem—those who had burned incense to Baal, to the sun and moon, to the constellations, and to all the host of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_6","013_23_6","2KI","23","6","6","He brought the Asherah pole from the house of the LORD to the Kidron Valley outside Jerusalem, and there he burned it, ground it to powder, and threw its dust on the graves of the common people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_7","013_23_7","2KI","23","7","7","He also tore down the quarters of the male shrine prostitutes that were in the house of the LORD, where the women had woven tapestries for Asherah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_8","013_23_8","2KI","23","8","8","Then Josiah brought all the priests from the cities of Judah and desecrated the high places, from Geba to Beersheba, where the priests had burned incense. He tore down the high places of the gates at the entrance of the gate of Joshua the governor of the city, which was to the left of the city gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_9","013_23_9","2KI","23","9","9","Although the priests of the high places did not come up to the altar of the LORD in Jerusalem, they ate unleavened bread with their fellow priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_10","013_23_10","2KI","23","10","10","He also desecrated Topheth in the Valley of Ben-hinnom so that no one could sacrifice his son or daughter in the fire to Molech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_11","013_23_11","2KI","23","11","11","And he removed from the entrance to the house of the LORD the horses that the kings of Judah had dedicated to the sun. They were in the court near the chamber of an official named Nathan-melech. And Josiah burned up the chariots of the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_12","013_23_12","2KI","23","12","12","He pulled down the altars that the kings of Judah had set up on the roof near the upper chamber of Ahaz, and the altars that Manasseh had set up in the two courtyards of the house of the LORD. The king pulverized them there and threw their dust into the Kidron Valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_13","013_23_13","2KI","23","13","13","The king also desecrated the high places east of Jerusalem, to the south of the Mount of Corruption, which King Solomon of Israel had built for Ashtoreth the abomination of the Sidonians, for Chemosh the abomination of the Moabites, and for Milcom the abomination of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_14","013_23_14","2KI","23","14","14","He smashed the sacred pillars to pieces, cut down the Asherah poles, and covered the sites with human bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_15","013_23_15","2KI","23","15","15","He even pulled down the altar at Bethel, the high place set up by Jeroboam son of Nebat, who had caused Israel to sin. Then he burned the high place, ground it to powder, and burned the Asherah pole. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_16","013_23_16","2KI","23","16","16","And as Josiah turned, he saw the tombs there on the hillside, and he sent someone to take the bones out of the tombs, and he burned them on the altar to defile it, according to the word of the LORD proclaimed by the man of God who had foretold these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_17","013_23_17","2KI","23","17","17","Then the king asked, “What is this monument I see?” And the men of the city replied, “It is the tomb of the man of God who came from Judah and proclaimed these things that you have done to the altar of Bethel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_18","013_23_18","2KI","23","18","18","“Let him rest,” said Josiah. “Do not let anyone disturb his bones.” So they left his bones undisturbed, along with those of the prophet who had come from Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_19","013_23_19","2KI","23","19","19","Just as Josiah had done at Bethel, so also in the cities of Samaria he removed all the shrines of the high places set up by the kings of Israel who had provoked the LORD to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_20","013_23_20","2KI","23","20","20","On the altars he slaughtered all the priests of the high places, and he burned human bones on them. Then he returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_21","013_23_21","2KI","23","21","21","The king commanded all the people, “Keep the Passover of the LORD your God, as it is written in this Book of the Covenant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_22","013_23_22","2KI","23","22","22","No such Passover had been observed from the days of the judges who had governed Israel through all the days of the kings of Israel and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_23","013_23_23","2KI","23","23","23","But in the eighteenth year of Josiah’s reign, this Passover was observed to the LORD in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_24","013_23_24","2KI","23","24","24","Furthermore, Josiah removed the mediums and spiritists, the household gods and idols, and all the abominations that were seen in the land of Judah and in Jerusalem. He did this to carry out the words of the law written in the book that Hilkiah the priest had found in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_25","013_23_25","2KI","23","25","25","Neither before nor after Josiah was there any king like him, who turned to the LORD with all his heart and with all his soul and with all his strength, according to all the Law of Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_26","013_23_26","2KI","23","26","26","Nevertheless, the LORD did not turn away from the fury of His burning anger, which was kindled against Judah because of all that Manasseh had done to provoke Him to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_27","013_23_27","2KI","23","27","27","For the LORD had said, “I will remove Judah from My sight, just as I removed Israel. I will reject this city Jerusalem, which I chose, and the temple of which I said, ‘My Name shall be there.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_28","013_23_28","2KI","23","28","28","As for the rest of the acts of Josiah and all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_29","013_23_29","2KI","23","29","29","During Josiah’s reign, Pharaoh Neco king of Egypt marched up to help the king of Assyria at the Euphrates River. King Josiah went out to confront him, but Neco faced him and killed him at Megiddo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_30","013_23_30","2KI","23","30","30","From Megiddo his servants carried his body in a chariot, brought him to Jerusalem, and buried him in his own tomb. Then the people of the land took Jehoahaz son of Josiah, anointed him, and made him king in place of his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_31","013_23_31","2KI","23","31","31","Jehoahaz was twenty-three years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem three months. His mother’s name was Hamutal daughter of Jeremiah; she was from Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_32","013_23_32","2KI","23","32","32","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, just as his fathers had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_33","013_23_33","2KI","23","33","33","And Pharaoh Neco imprisoned Jehoahaz at Riblah in the land of Hamath so that he could not reign in Jerusalem, and he imposed on Judah a levy of a hundred talents of silver and a talent of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_34","013_23_34","2KI","23","34","34","Then Pharaoh Neco made Eliakim son of Josiah king in place of his father Josiah, and he changed Eliakim’s name to Jehoiakim. But Neco took Jehoahaz and carried him off to Egypt, where he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_35","013_23_35","2KI","23","35","35","So Jehoiakim paid the silver and gold to Pharaoh Neco, but to meet Pharaoh’s demand he taxed the land and exacted the silver and the gold from the people, each according to his wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_36","013_23_36","2KI","23","36","36","Jehoiakim was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eleven years. His mother’s name was Zebidah daughter of Pedaiah; she was from Rumah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K223_37","013_23_37","2KI","23","37","37","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, just as his fathers had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_1","013_24_1","2KI","24","1","1","During Jehoiakim’s reign, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon invaded. So Jehoiakim became his vassal for three years, until he turned and rebelled against Nebuchadnezzar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_2","013_24_2","2KI","24","2","2","And the LORD sent Chaldean, Aramean, Moabite, and Ammonite raiders against Jehoiakim in order to destroy Judah, according to the word that the LORD had spoken through His servants the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_3","013_24_3","2KI","24","3","3","Surely this happened to Judah at the LORD’s command, to remove them from His presence because of the sins of Manasseh and all that he had done, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_4","013_24_4","2KI","24","4","4","and also for the innocent blood he had shed. For he had filled Jerusalem with innocent blood, and the LORD was unwilling to forgive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_5","013_24_5","2KI","24","5","5","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoiakim, along with all his accomplishments, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_6","013_24_6","2KI","24","6","6","And Jehoiakim rested with his fathers, and his son Jehoiachin reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_7","013_24_7","2KI","24","7","7","Now the king of Egypt did not march out of his land again, because the king of Babylon had taken all his territory, from the Brook of Egypt to the Euphrates River. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_8","013_24_8","2KI","24","8","8","Jehoiachin was eighteen years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem three months. His mother’s name was Nehushta daughter of Elnathan; she was from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_9","013_24_9","2KI","24","9","9","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, just as his father had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_10","013_24_10","2KI","24","10","10","At that time the servants of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon marched up to Jerusalem, and the city came under siege. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_11","013_24_11","2KI","24","11","11","And Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon came to the city while his servants were besieging it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_12","013_24_12","2KI","24","12","12","Jehoiachin king of Judah, his mother, his servants, his commanders, and his officials all surrendered to the king of Babylon. So in the eighth year of his reign, the king of Babylon took him captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_13","013_24_13","2KI","24","13","13","As the LORD had declared, Nebuchadnezzar also carried off all the treasures from the house of the LORD and the royal palace, and he cut into pieces all the gold articles that Solomon king of Israel had made in the temple of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_14","013_24_14","2KI","24","14","14","He carried into exile all Jerusalem—all the commanders and mighty men of valor, all the craftsmen and metalsmiths—ten thousand captives in all. Only the poorest people of the land remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_15","013_24_15","2KI","24","15","15","Nebuchadnezzar carried away Jehoiachin to Babylon, as well as the king’s mother, his wives, his officials, and the leading men of the land. He took them into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_16","013_24_16","2KI","24","16","16","The king of Babylon also brought into exile to Babylon all seven thousand men of valor and a thousand craftsmen and metalsmiths—all strong and fit for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_17","013_24_17","2KI","24","17","17","Then the king of Babylon made Mattaniah, Jehoiachin’s uncle, king in his place and changed his name to Zedekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_18","013_24_18","2KI","24","18","18","Zedekiah was twenty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eleven years. His mother’s name was Hamutal daughter of Jeremiah; she was from Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_19","013_24_19","2KI","24","19","19","And Zedekiah did evil in the sight of the LORD, just as Jehoiakim had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K224_20","013_24_20","2KI","24","20","20","For because of the anger of the LORD, all this happened in Jerusalem and Judah, until He finally banished them from His presence. And Zedekiah also rebelled against the king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_1","013_25_1","2KI","25","1","1","So in the ninth year of Zedekiah’s reign, on the tenth day of the tenth month, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon marched against Jerusalem with his entire army. They encamped outside the city and built a siege wall all around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_2","013_25_2","2KI","25","2","2","And the city was kept under siege until King Zedekiah’s eleventh year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_3","013_25_3","2KI","25","3","3","By the ninth day of the fourth month, the famine in the city was so severe that the people of the land had no food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_4","013_25_4","2KI","25","4","4","Then the city was breached; and though the Chaldeans had surrounded the city, all the men of war fled by night by way of the gate between the two walls near the king’s garden. They headed toward the Arabah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_5","013_25_5","2KI","25","5","5","but the army of the Chaldeans pursued the king and overtook him in the plains of Jericho, and his whole army deserted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_6","013_25_6","2KI","25","6","6","The Chaldeans seized the king and brought him up to the king of Babylon at Riblah, where they pronounced judgment on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_7","013_25_7","2KI","25","7","7","And they slaughtered the sons of Zedekiah before his eyes. Then they put out his eyes, bound him with bronze shackles, and took him to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_8","013_25_8","2KI","25","8","8","On the seventh day of the fifth month, in the nineteenth year of Nebuchadnezzar’s reign over Babylon, Nebuzaradan captain of the guard, a servant of the king of Babylon, entered Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_9","013_25_9","2KI","25","9","9","He burned down the house of the LORD, the royal palace, and all the houses of Jerusalem—every significant building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_10","013_25_10","2KI","25","10","10","And the whole army of the Chaldeans under the captain of the guard broke down the walls around Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_11","013_25_11","2KI","25","11","11","Then Nebuzaradan captain of the guard carried into exile the people who remained in the city, along with the deserters who had defected to the king of Babylon and the rest of the population. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_12","013_25_12","2KI","25","12","12","But the captain of the guard left behind some of the poorest of the land to tend the vineyards and fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_13","013_25_13","2KI","25","13","13","Moreover, the Chaldeans broke up the bronze pillars and stands and the bronze Sea in the house of the LORD, and they carried the bronze to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_14","013_25_14","2KI","25","14","14","They also took away the pots, shovels, wick trimmers, dishes, and all the articles of bronze used in the temple service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_15","013_25_15","2KI","25","15","15","The captain of the guard also took away the censers and sprinkling bowls—anything made of pure gold or fine silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_16","013_25_16","2KI","25","16","16","As for the two pillars, the Sea, and the movable stands that Solomon had made for the house of the LORD, the weight of the bronze from all these articles was beyond measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_17","013_25_17","2KI","25","17","17","Each pillar was eighteen cubits tall. The bronze capital atop one pillar was three cubits high, with a network of bronze pomegranates all around. The second pillar, with its network, was similar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_18","013_25_18","2KI","25","18","18","The captain of the guard also took away Seraiah the chief priest, Zephaniah the priest of second rank, and the three doorkeepers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_19","013_25_19","2KI","25","19","19","Of those still in the city, he took a court official who had been appointed over the men of war, as well as five royal advisors. He also took the scribe of the captain of the army, who had enlisted the people of the land, and sixty men who were found in the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_20","013_25_20","2KI","25","20","20","Nebuzaradan captain of the guard took them and brought them to the king of Babylon at Riblah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_21","013_25_21","2KI","25","21","21","There at Riblah in the land of Hamath, the king of Babylon struck them down and put them to death. So Judah was taken into exile, away from its own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_22","013_25_22","2KI","25","22","22","Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon appointed Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, over the people he had left behind in the land of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_23","013_25_23","2KI","25","23","23","When all the commanders of the armies and their men heard that the king of Babylon had appointed Gedaliah as governor, they came to Gedaliah at Mizpah—Ishmael son of Nethaniah, Johanan son of Kareah, Seraiah son of Tanhumeth the Netophathite, and Jaazaniah son of the Maacathite, as well as their men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_24","013_25_24","2KI","25","24","24","And Gedaliah took an oath before them and their men, assuring them, “Do not be afraid of the servants of the Chaldeans. Live in the land and serve the king of Babylon, and it will be well with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_25","013_25_25","2KI","25","25","25","In the seventh month, however, Ishmael son of Nethaniah, the son of Elishama, who was a member of the royal family, came with ten men and struck down and killed Gedaliah, along with the Judeans and Chaldeans who were with him at Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_26","013_25_26","2KI","25","26","26","Then all the people small and great, together with the commanders of the army, arose and fled to Egypt for fear of the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_27","013_25_27","2KI","25","27","27","On the twenty-seventh day of the twelfth month of the thirty-seventh year of the exile of Judah’s King Jehoiachin, in the year Evil-merodach became king of Babylon, he released King Jehoiachin of Judah from prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_28","013_25_28","2KI","25","28","28","And he spoke kindly to Jehoiachin and set his throne above the thrones of the other kings who were with him in Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_29","013_25_29","2KI","25","29","29","So Jehoiachin changed out of his prison clothes, and he dined regularly at the king’s table for the rest of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("K225_30","013_25_30","2KI","25","30","30","And the king provided Jehoiachin a daily portion for the rest of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_1","014_1_1","1CH","1","1","1","Adam, Seth, Enosh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_2","014_1_2","1CH","1","2","2","Kenan, Mahalalel, Jared, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_3","014_1_3","1CH","1","3","3","Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech, Noah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_4","014_1_4","1CH","1","4","4","The sons of Noah: Shem, Ham, and Japheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_5","014_1_5","1CH","1","5","5","The sons of Japheth: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, and Tiras. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_6","014_1_6","1CH","1","6","6","The sons of Gomer: Ashkenaz, Riphath, and Togarmah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_7","014_1_7","1CH","1","7","7","And the sons of Javan: Elishah, Tarshish, the Kittites, and the Rodanites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_8","014_1_8","1CH","1","8","8","The sons of Ham: Cush, Mizraim, Put, and Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_9","014_1_9","1CH","1","9","9","The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raamah, and Sabteca. The sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_10","014_1_10","1CH","1","10","10","Cush was the father of Nimrod, who began to be a mighty one on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_11","014_1_11","1CH","1","11","11","Mizraim was the father of the Ludites, the Anamites, the Lehabites, the Naphtuhites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_12","014_1_12","1CH","1","12","12","the Pathrusites, the Casluhites (from whom the Philistines came), and the Caphtorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_13","014_1_13","1CH","1","13","13","And Canaan was the father of Sidon his firstborn, and of the Hittites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_14","014_1_14","1CH","1","14","14","the Jebusites, the Amorites, the Girgashites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_15","014_1_15","1CH","1","15","15","the Hivites, the Arkites, the Sinites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_16","014_1_16","1CH","1","16","16","the Arvadites, the Zemarites, and the Hamathites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_17","014_1_17","1CH","1","17","17","The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arphaxad, Lud, and Aram. The sons of Aram: Uz, Hul, Gether, and Meshech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_18","014_1_18","1CH","1","18","18","Arphaxad was the father of Shelah, and Shelah was the father of Eber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_19","014_1_19","1CH","1","19","19","Two sons were born to Eber: One was named Peleg, because in his days the earth was divided, and his brother was named Joktan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_20","014_1_20","1CH","1","20","20","And Joktan was the father of Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_21","014_1_21","1CH","1","21","21","Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_22","014_1_22","1CH","1","22","22","Obal, Abimael, Sheba, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_23","014_1_23","1CH","1","23","23","Ophir, Havilah, and Jobab. All these were sons of Joktan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_24","014_1_24","1CH","1","24","24","So from Shem came Arphaxad, Shelah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_25","014_1_25","1CH","1","25","25","Eber, Peleg, Reu, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_26","014_1_26","1CH","1","26","26","Serug, Nahor, Terah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_27","014_1_27","1CH","1","27","27","and Abram (that is, Abraham). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_28","014_1_28","1CH","1","28","28","The sons of Abraham were Isaac and Ishmael. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_29","014_1_29","1CH","1","29","29","These are their genealogies: Nebaioth the firstborn of Ishmael, then Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_30","014_1_30","1CH","1","30","30","Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_31","014_1_31","1CH","1","31","31","Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. These were the sons of Ishmael. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_32","014_1_32","1CH","1","32","32","The sons born to Keturah, Abraham’s concubine: Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. The sons of Jokshan: Sheba and Dedan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_33","014_1_33","1CH","1","33","33","The sons of Midian: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All of these were Keturah’s sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_34","014_1_34","1CH","1","34","34","Abraham was the father of Isaac. The sons of Isaac: Esau and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_35","014_1_35","1CH","1","35","35","The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_36","014_1_36","1CH","1","36","36","The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, and Kenaz; and by Timna, Amalek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_37","014_1_37","1CH","1","37","37","The sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_38","014_1_38","1CH","1","38","38","The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_39","014_1_39","1CH","1","39","39","The sons of Lotan: Hori and Homam. Timna was Lotan’s sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_40","014_1_40","1CH","1","40","40","The sons of Shobal: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, and Onam. The sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_41","014_1_41","1CH","1","41","41","The son of Anah: Dishon. The sons of Dishon: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_42","014_1_42","1CH","1","42","42","The sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Akan. The sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_43","014_1_43","1CH","1","43","43","These are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom before any king reigned over the Israelites: Bela son of Beor. His city was named Dinhabah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_44","014_1_44","1CH","1","44","44","When Bela died, Jobab son of Zerah from Bozrah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_45","014_1_45","1CH","1","45","45","When Jobab died, Husham from the land of the Temanites reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_46","014_1_46","1CH","1","46","46","When Husham died, Hadad son of Bedad, who defeated Midian in the country of Moab, reigned in his place. And the name of his city was Avith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_47","014_1_47","1CH","1","47","47","When Hadad died, Samlah from Masrekah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_48","014_1_48","1CH","1","48","48","When Samlah died, Shaul from Rehoboth on the Euphrates reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_49","014_1_49","1CH","1","49","49","When Shaul died, Baal-hanan son of Achbor reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_50","014_1_50","1CH","1","50","50","When Baal-hanan died, Hadad reigned in his place. His city was named Pau, and his wife’s name was Mehetabel daughter of Matred, the daughter of Me-zahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_51","014_1_51","1CH","1","51","51","Then Hadad died. Now the chiefs of Edom were Timna, Alvah, Jetheth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_52","014_1_52","1CH","1","52","52","Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_53","014_1_53","1CH","1","53","53","Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R11_54","014_1_54","1CH","1","54","54","Magdiel, and Iram. These were the chiefs of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_1","014_2_1","1CH","2","1","1","These were the sons of Israel: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_2","014_2_2","1CH","2","2","2","Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad, and Asher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_3","014_2_3","1CH","2","3","3","The sons of Judah: Er, Onan, and Shelah. These three were born to him by Bath-shua the Canaanite. Er, Judah’s firstborn, was wicked in the sight of the LORD. So the LORD put him to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_4","014_2_4","1CH","2","4","4","Tamar, Judah’s daughter-in-law, bore to him Perez and Zerah. Judah had five sons in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_5","014_2_5","1CH","2","5","5","The sons of Perez: Hezron and Hamul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_6","014_2_6","1CH","2","6","6","The sons of Zerah: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, and Dara—five in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_7","014_2_7","1CH","2","7","7","The son of Carmi: Achar, who brought trouble upon Israel by violating the ban on devoted things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_8","014_2_8","1CH","2","8","8","The son of Ethan: Azariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_9","014_2_9","1CH","2","9","9","The sons who were born to Hezron: Jerahmeel, Ram, and Caleb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_10","014_2_10","1CH","2","10","10","Ram was the father of Amminadab, and Amminadab was the father of Nahshon, a leader of the descendants of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_11","014_2_11","1CH","2","11","11","Nahshon was the father of Salmon, and Salmon was the father of Boaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_12","014_2_12","1CH","2","12","12","Boaz was the father of Obed, and Obed was the father of Jesse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_13","014_2_13","1CH","2","13","13","Jesse was the father of Eliab his firstborn; Abinadab was born second, Shimea third, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_14","014_2_14","1CH","2","14","14","Nethanel fourth, Raddai fifth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_15","014_2_15","1CH","2","15","15","Ozem sixth, and David seventh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_16","014_2_16","1CH","2","16","16","Their sisters were Zeruiah and Abigail. And the three sons of Zeruiah were Abishai, Joab, and Asahel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_17","014_2_17","1CH","2","17","17","Abigail was the mother of Amasa, whose father was Jether the Ishmaelite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_18","014_2_18","1CH","2","18","18","Caleb son of Hezron had children by his wife Azubah and by Jerioth. These were the sons of Azubah: Jesher, Shobab, and Ardon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_19","014_2_19","1CH","2","19","19","When Azubah died, Caleb married Ephrath, who bore to him Hur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_20","014_2_20","1CH","2","20","20","Hur was the father of Uri, and Uri was the father of Bezalel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_21","014_2_21","1CH","2","21","21","Later, Hezron slept with the daughter of Machir the father of Gilead. He had married her when he was sixty years old, and she bore to him Segub. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_22","014_2_22","1CH","2","22","22","Segub was the father of Jair, who had twenty-three cities in the land of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_23","014_2_23","1CH","2","23","23","But Geshur and Aram captured Havvoth-jair, along with Kenath and its sixty surrounding villages. All these were descendants of Machir the father of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_24","014_2_24","1CH","2","24","24","After Hezron died in Caleb-ephrathah, his wife Abijah bore to him Ashhur the father of Tekoa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_25","014_2_25","1CH","2","25","25","The sons of Jerahmeel the firstborn of Hezron: Ram his firstborn, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, and Ahijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_26","014_2_26","1CH","2","26","26","Jerahmeel had another wife named Atarah, who was the mother of Onam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_27","014_2_27","1CH","2","27","27","The sons of Ram the firstborn of Jerahmeel: Maaz, Jamin, and Eker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_28","014_2_28","1CH","2","28","28","The sons of Onam: Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai: Nadab and Abishur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_29","014_2_29","1CH","2","29","29","Abishur’s wife was named Abihail, and she bore to him Ahban and Molid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_30","014_2_30","1CH","2","30","30","The sons of Nadab: Seled and Appaim. Seled died without children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_31","014_2_31","1CH","2","31","31","The son of Appaim: Ishi. The son of Ishi: Sheshan. The son of Sheshan: Ahlai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_32","014_2_32","1CH","2","32","32","The sons of Jada the brother of Shammai: Jether and Jonathan. Jether died without children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_33","014_2_33","1CH","2","33","33","The sons of Jonathan: Peleth and Zaza. These were the descendants of Jerahmeel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_34","014_2_34","1CH","2","34","34","Sheshan had no sons, but only daughters. He also had an Egyptian servant named Jarha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_35","014_2_35","1CH","2","35","35","Sheshan gave his daughter in marriage to his servant Jarha, and she bore to him Attai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_36","014_2_36","1CH","2","36","36","Attai was the father of Nathan, Nathan was the father of Zabad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_37","014_2_37","1CH","2","37","37","Zabad was the father of Ephlal, Ephlal was the father of Obed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_38","014_2_38","1CH","2","38","38","Obed was the father of Jehu, Jehu was the father of Azariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_39","014_2_39","1CH","2","39","39","Azariah was the father of Helez, Helez was the father of Elasah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_40","014_2_40","1CH","2","40","40","Elasah was the father of Sismai, Sismai was the father of Shallum, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_41","014_2_41","1CH","2","41","41","Shallum was the father of Jekamiah, and Jekamiah was the father of Elishama. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_42","014_2_42","1CH","2","42","42","The sons of Caleb the brother of Jerahmeel: Mesha his firstborn, who was the father of Ziph, and Mareshah his second son, who was the father of Hebron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_43","014_2_43","1CH","2","43","43","The sons of Hebron: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem, and Shema. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_44","014_2_44","1CH","2","44","44","Shema was the father of Raham the father of Jorkeam, and Rekem was the father of Shammai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_45","014_2_45","1CH","2","45","45","The son of Shammai was Maon, and Maon was the father of Beth-zur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_46","014_2_46","1CH","2","46","46","Caleb’s concubine Ephah was the mother of Haran, Moza, and Gazez. Haran was the father of Gazez. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_47","014_2_47","1CH","2","47","47","The sons of Jahdai: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_48","014_2_48","1CH","2","48","48","Caleb’s concubine Maacah was the mother of Sheber and Tirhanah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_49","014_2_49","1CH","2","49","49","She was also the mother of Shaaph father of Madmannah, and of Sheva father of Machbenah and Gibea. Caleb’s daughter was Acsah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_50","014_2_50","1CH","2","50","50","These were the descendants of Caleb. The sons of Hur the firstborn of Ephrathah: Shobal the father of Kiriath-jearim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_51","014_2_51","1CH","2","51","51","Salma the father of Bethlehem, and Hareph the father of Beth-gader. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_52","014_2_52","1CH","2","52","52","These were the descendants of Shobal the father of Kiriath-jearim: Haroeh, half the Manahathites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_53","014_2_53","1CH","2","53","53","and the clans of Kiriath-jearim—the Ithrites, Puthites, Shumathites, and Mishraites. From these descended the Zorathites and Eshtaolites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_54","014_2_54","1CH","2","54","54","The descendants of Salma: Bethlehem, the Netophathites, Atroth-beth-joab, half the Manahathites, the Zorites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R12_55","014_2_55","1CH","2","55","55","and the clans of the scribes who lived at Jabez—the Tirathites, Shimeathites, and Sucathites. These are the Kenites who came from Hammath, the father of the house of Rechab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_1","014_3_1","1CH","3","1","1","These were the sons of David who were born to him in Hebron: The firstborn was Amnon by Ahinoam of Jezreel; the second was Daniel by Abigail of Carmel; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_2","014_3_2","1CH","3","2","2","the third was Absalom the son of Maacah daughter of King Talmai of Geshur; the fourth was Adonijah the son of Haggith; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_3","014_3_3","1CH","3","3","3","the fifth was Shephatiah by Abital; and the sixth was Ithream by his wife Eglah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_4","014_3_4","1CH","3","4","4","These six sons were born to David in Hebron, where he reigned seven years and six months. And David reigned in Jerusalem thirty-three years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_5","014_3_5","1CH","3","5","5","and these sons were born to him in Jerusalem: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan, and Solomon. These four were born to him by Bathsheba daughter of Ammiel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_6","014_3_6","1CH","3","6","6","David’s other sons were Ibhar, Elishua, Eliphelet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_7","014_3_7","1CH","3","7","7","Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_8","014_3_8","1CH","3","8","8","Elishama, Eliada, and Eliphelet—nine in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_9","014_3_9","1CH","3","9","9","These were all the sons of David, besides the sons by his concubines. And Tamar was their sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_10","014_3_10","1CH","3","10","10","Solomon’s son was Rehoboam: Abijah was his son, Asa his son, Jehoshaphat his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_11","014_3_11","1CH","3","11","11","Joram his son, Ahaziah his son, Joash his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_12","014_3_12","1CH","3","12","12","Amaziah his son, Azariah his son, Jotham his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_13","014_3_13","1CH","3","13","13","Ahaz his son, Hezekiah his son, Manasseh his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_14","014_3_14","1CH","3","14","14","Amon his son, and Josiah his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_15","014_3_15","1CH","3","15","15","The sons of Josiah: Johanan was the firstborn, Jehoiakim the second, Zedekiah the third, and Shallum the fourth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_16","014_3_16","1CH","3","16","16","The successors of Jehoiakim: Jeconiah his son, and Zedekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_17","014_3_17","1CH","3","17","17","The descendants of Jeconiah the captive: Shealtiel his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_18","014_3_18","1CH","3","18","18","Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama, and Nedabiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_19","014_3_19","1CH","3","19","19","The sons of Pedaiah: Zerubbabel and Shimei. The children of Zerubbabel: Meshullam and Hananiah, their sister Shelomith, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_20","014_3_20","1CH","3","20","20","and five others: Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, and Jushab-hesed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_21","014_3_21","1CH","3","21","21","The descendants of Hananiah: Pelatiah, Jeshaiah, and the sons of Rephaiah, of Arnan, of Obadiah, and of Shecaniah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_22","014_3_22","1CH","3","22","22","The six descendants of Shecaniah were Shemaiah and his sons: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, and Shaphat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_23","014_3_23","1CH","3","23","23","The sons of Neariah: Elioenai, Hizkiah, and Azrikam—three in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R13_24","014_3_24","1CH","3","24","24","The sons of Elioenai: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, and Anani—seven in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_1","014_4_1","1CH","4","1","1","The descendants of Judah: Perez, Hezron, Carmi, Hur, and Shobal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_2","014_4_2","1CH","4","2","2","Reaiah son of Shobal was the father of Jahath, and Jahath was the father of Ahumai and Lahad. These were the clans of the Zorathites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_3","014_4_3","1CH","4","3","3","These were the sons of Etam: Jezreel, Ishma, and Idbash. And their sister was named Hazzelelponi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_4","014_4_4","1CH","4","4","4","Penuel was the father of Gedor, and Ezer was the father of Hushah. These were the descendants of Hur, the firstborn of Ephrathah and the father of Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_5","014_4_5","1CH","4","5","5","Ashhur the father of Tekoa had two wives, Helah and Naarah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_6","014_4_6","1CH","4","6","6","Naarah bore to him Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, and Haahashtari. These were the descendants of Naarah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_7","014_4_7","1CH","4","7","7","The sons of Helah were Zereth, Zohar, Ethnan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_8","014_4_8","1CH","4","8","8","and Koz, who was the father of Anub and Zobebah and of the clans of Aharhel son of Harum. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_9","014_4_9","1CH","4","9","9","Now Jabez was more honorable than his brothers. His mother had named him Jabez, saying, “Because I bore him in pain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_10","014_4_10","1CH","4","10","10","And Jabez called out to the God of Israel, “If only You would bless me and enlarge my territory! May Your hand be with me and keep me from harm, so that I will be free from pain.” And God granted the request of Jabez. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_11","014_4_11","1CH","4","11","11","Chelub the brother of Shuhah was the father of Mehir, who was the father of Eshton. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_12","014_4_12","1CH","4","12","12","Eshton was the father of Beth-rapha, of Paseah, and of Tehinnah the father of Ir-nahash. These were the men of Recah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_13","014_4_13","1CH","4","13","13","The sons of Kenaz: Othniel and Seraiah. The sons of Othniel: Hathath and Meonothai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_14","014_4_14","1CH","4","14","14","Meonothai was the father of Ophrah, and Seraiah was the father of Joab, the father of those living in Ge-harashim, which was given this name because its people were craftsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_15","014_4_15","1CH","4","15","15","The sons of Caleb son of Jephunneh: Iru, Elah, and Naam. The son of Elah: Kenaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_16","014_4_16","1CH","4","16","16","The sons of Jehallelel: Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria, and Asarel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_17","014_4_17","1CH","4","17","17","The sons of Ezrah: Jether, Mered, Epher, and Jalon. And Mered’s wife Bithiah gave birth to Miriam, Shammai, and Ishbah the father of Eshtemoa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_18","014_4_18","1CH","4","18","18","These were the children of Pharaoh’s daughter Bithiah. Mered also took a Judean wife, who gave birth to Jered the father of Gedor, Heber the father of Soco, and Jekuthiel the father of Zanoah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_19","014_4_19","1CH","4","19","19","The sons of Hodiah’s wife, the sister of Naham, were the fathers of Keilah the Garmite and of Eshtemoa the Maacathite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_20","014_4_20","1CH","4","20","20","The sons of Shimon: Amnon, Rinnah, Ben-hanan, and Tilon. The descendants of Ishi: Zoheth and Ben-zoheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_21","014_4_21","1CH","4","21","21","The sons of Shelah son of Judah: Er the father of Lecah, Laadah the father of Mareshah and the clans of the linen workers at Beth-ashbea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_22","014_4_22","1CH","4","22","22","Jokim, the men of Cozeba, and Joash and Saraph, who ruled in Moab and Jashubi-lehem. (These names are from ancient records.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_23","014_4_23","1CH","4","23","23","These were the potters who lived at Netaim and Gederah. They lived there in the service of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_24","014_4_24","1CH","4","24","24","The descendants of Simeon: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah, and Shaul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_25","014_4_25","1CH","4","25","25","The sons of Shaul: Shallum, Mibsam, and Mishma. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_26","014_4_26","1CH","4","26","26","The sons of Mishma: Hammuel, Zaccur, and Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_27","014_4_27","1CH","4","27","27","Shimei had sixteen sons and six daughters, but his brothers did not have many children, so their whole clan did not become as numerous as the sons of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_28","014_4_28","1CH","4","28","28","They lived in Beersheba, Moladah, Hazar-shual, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_29","014_4_29","1CH","4","29","29","Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_30","014_4_30","1CH","4","30","30","Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_31","014_4_31","1CH","4","31","31","Beth-marcaboth, Hazar-susim, Beth-biri, and Shaaraim. These were their cities until the reign of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_32","014_4_32","1CH","4","32","32","And their villages were Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Tochen, and Ashan—five towns— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_33","014_4_33","1CH","4","33","33","and all their surrounding villages as far as Baal. These were their settlements, and they kept a genealogical record: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_34","014_4_34","1CH","4","34","34","Meshobab, Jamlech, Joshah son of Amaziah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_35","014_4_35","1CH","4","35","35","Joel, Jehu son of Joshibiah (son of Seraiah, son of Asiel), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_36","014_4_36","1CH","4","36","36","Elioenai, Jaakobah, Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_37","014_4_37","1CH","4","37","37","and Ziza son of Shiphi (son of Allon, son of Jedaiah, son of Shimri, son of Shemaiah). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_38","014_4_38","1CH","4","38","38","These men listed by name were the leaders of their clans. Their families increased greatly, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_39","014_4_39","1CH","4","39","39","and they journeyed to the entrance of Gedor, to the east side of the valley, in search of pasture for their flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_40","014_4_40","1CH","4","40","40","There they found rich, good pasture, and the land was spacious, peaceful, and quiet; for some Hamites had lived there formerly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_41","014_4_41","1CH","4","41","41","These who were noted by name came in the days of Hezekiah king of Judah. They attacked the Hamites in their dwellings as well as the Meunites who were there, devoting them to destruction even to this day. Then they settled in their place, because there was pasture for their flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_42","014_4_42","1CH","4","42","42","And five hundred of these Simeonites led by Pelatiah, Neariah, Rephaiah, and Uzziel, the sons of Ishi, went to Mount Seir ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R14_43","014_4_43","1CH","4","43","43","and struck down the remnant of the Amalekites who had escaped. And they have lived there to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_1","014_5_1","1CH","5","1","1","These were the sons of Reuben the firstborn of Israel. Though he was the firstborn, his birthright was given to the sons of Joseph son of Israel, because Reuben defiled his father’s bed. So he is not reckoned according to birthright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_2","014_5_2","1CH","5","2","2","And though Judah prevailed over his brothers and a ruler came from him, the birthright belonged to Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_3","014_5_3","1CH","5","3","3","The sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_4","014_5_4","1CH","5","4","4","The descendants of Joel: Shemaiah his son, Gog his son, Shimei his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_5","014_5_5","1CH","5","5","5","Micah his son, Reaiah his son, Baal his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_6","014_5_6","1CH","5","6","6","and Beerah his son, whom Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria carried into exile. Beerah was a leader of the Reubenites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_7","014_5_7","1CH","5","7","7","His relatives by their clans are recorded in their genealogy: Jeiel the chief, Zechariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_8","014_5_8","1CH","5","8","8","and Bela son of Azaz, the son of Shema, the son of Joel. They settled in Aroer and as far as Nebo and Baal-meon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_9","014_5_9","1CH","5","9","9","They also settled in the east as far as the edge of the desert that extends to the Euphrates River, because their livestock had increased in the land of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_10","014_5_10","1CH","5","10","10","During the days of Saul they waged war against the Hagrites, who were defeated at their hands, and they occupied the dwellings of the Hagrites throughout the region east of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_11","014_5_11","1CH","5","11","11","The descendants of Gad lived next to the Reubenites in the land of Bashan, as far as Salecah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_12","014_5_12","1CH","5","12","12","Joel was the chief, Shapham the second, then Jaanai and Shaphat, who lived in Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_13","014_5_13","1CH","5","13","13","Their kinsmen by families were Michael, Meshullam, Sheba, Jorai, Jacan, Zia, and Eber—seven in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_14","014_5_14","1CH","5","14","14","These were the sons of Abihail son of Huri, the son of Jaroah, the son of Gilead, the son of Michael, the son of Jeshishai, the son of Jahdo, the son of Buz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_15","014_5_15","1CH","5","15","15","Ahi son of Abdiel, the son of Guni, was head of their family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_16","014_5_16","1CH","5","16","16","They lived in Gilead, in Bashan and its towns, and throughout the pasturelands of Sharon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_17","014_5_17","1CH","5","17","17","All of them were recorded in the genealogies during the reigns of Jotham king of Judah and Jeroboam king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_18","014_5_18","1CH","5","18","18","The Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh had 44,760 warriors—valiant men who carried the shield and sword, drew the bow, and were trained for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_19","014_5_19","1CH","5","19","19","They waged war against the Hagrites, as well as Jetur, Naphish, and Nodab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_20","014_5_20","1CH","5","20","20","And because they cried out to God in battle, they were helped against their enemies, and the Hagrites and all their allies were delivered into their hands. Because they put their trust in God, He answered their prayers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_21","014_5_21","1CH","5","21","21","They seized the livestock of the Hagrites—50,000 camels, 250,000 sheep, and 2,000 donkeys. They also took 100,000 captives, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_22","014_5_22","1CH","5","22","22","and many others fell slain, because the battle belonged to God. And they occupied the land until the exile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_23","014_5_23","1CH","5","23","23","Now the people of the half-tribe of Manasseh were numerous. They settled in the land from Bashan to Baal-hermon (that is, Senir, also known as Mount Hermon). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_24","014_5_24","1CH","5","24","24","These were the heads of their families: Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah, and Jahdiel. They were mighty men of valor, famous men, and heads of their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_25","014_5_25","1CH","5","25","25","But they were unfaithful to the God of their fathers, and they prostituted themselves with the gods of the peoples of the land, whom God had destroyed before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R15_26","014_5_26","1CH","5","26","26","So the God of Israel stirred up the spirit of Pul king of Assyria (that is, Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria) to take the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh into exile. And he brought them to Halah, Habor, Hara, and the river of Gozan, where they remain to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_1","014_6_1","1CH","6","1","1","The sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_2","014_6_2","1CH","6","2","2","The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_3","014_6_3","1CH","6","3","3","The children of Amram: Aaron, Moses, and Miriam. The sons of Aaron: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_4","014_6_4","1CH","6","4","4","Eleazar was the father of Phinehas, Phinehas was the father of Abishua, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_5","014_6_5","1CH","6","5","5","Abishua was the father of Bukki, Bukki was the father of Uzzi, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_6","014_6_6","1CH","6","6","6","Uzzi was the father of Zerahiah, Zerahiah was the father of Meraioth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_7","014_6_7","1CH","6","7","7","Meraioth was the father of Amariah, Amariah was the father of Ahitub, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_8","014_6_8","1CH","6","8","8","Ahitub was the father of Zadok, Zadok was the father of Ahimaaz, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_9","014_6_9","1CH","6","9","9","Ahimaaz was the father of Azariah, Azariah was the father of Johanan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_10","014_6_10","1CH","6","10","10","Johanan was the father of Azariah, who served as priest in the temple that Solomon built in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_11","014_6_11","1CH","6","11","11","Azariah was the father of Amariah, Amariah was the father of Ahitub, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_12","014_6_12","1CH","6","12","12","Ahitub was the father of Zadok, Zadok was the father of Shallum, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_13","014_6_13","1CH","6","13","13","Shallum was the father of Hilkiah, Hilkiah was the father of Azariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_14","014_6_14","1CH","6","14","14","Azariah was the father of Seraiah, and Seraiah was the father of Jehozadak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_15","014_6_15","1CH","6","15","15","Jehozadak went into captivity when the LORD sent Judah and Jerusalem into exile by the hand of Nebuchadnezzar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_16","014_6_16","1CH","6","16","16","The sons of Levi: Gershom, Kohath, and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_17","014_6_17","1CH","6","17","17","These are the names of the sons of Gershom: Libni and Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_18","014_6_18","1CH","6","18","18","The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_19","014_6_19","1CH","6","19","19","The sons of Merari: Mahli and Mushi. These are the clans of the Levites listed according to their fathers: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_20","014_6_20","1CH","6","20","20","Of Gershom: Libni his son, Jahath his son, Zimmah his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_21","014_6_21","1CH","6","21","21","Joah his son, Iddo his son, Zerah his son, and Jeatherai his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_22","014_6_22","1CH","6","22","22","The descendants of Kohath: Amminadab his son, Korah his son, Assir his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_23","014_6_23","1CH","6","23","23","Elkanah his son, Ebiasaph his son, Assir his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_24","014_6_24","1CH","6","24","24","Tahath his son, Uriel his son, Uzziah his son, and Shaul his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_25","014_6_25","1CH","6","25","25","The descendants of Elkanah: Amasai, Ahimoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_26","014_6_26","1CH","6","26","26","Elkanah his son, Zophai his son, Nahath his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_27","014_6_27","1CH","6","27","27","Eliab his son, Jeroham his son, and Elkanah his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_28","014_6_28","1CH","6","28","28","The sons of Samuel: Joel his firstborn and Abijah his second son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_29","014_6_29","1CH","6","29","29","The descendants of Merari: Mahli, Libni his son, Shimei his son, Uzzah his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_30","014_6_30","1CH","6","30","30","Shimea his son, Haggiah his son, and Asaiah his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_31","014_6_31","1CH","6","31","31","These are the men David put in charge of the music in the house of the LORD after the ark rested there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_32","014_6_32","1CH","6","32","32","They ministered with song before the tabernacle, the Tent of Meeting, until Solomon built the house of the LORD in Jerusalem. And they performed their duties according to the regulations given them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_33","014_6_33","1CH","6","33","33","These are the men who served, together with their sons. From the Kohathites: Heman the singer, the son of Joel, the son of Samuel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_34","014_6_34","1CH","6","34","34","the son of Elkanah, the son of Jeroham, the son of Eliel, the son of Toah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_35","014_6_35","1CH","6","35","35","the son of Zuph, the son of Elkanah, the son of Mahath, the son of Amasai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_36","014_6_36","1CH","6","36","36","the son of Elkanah, the son of Joel, the son of Azariah, the son of Zephaniah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_37","014_6_37","1CH","6","37","37","the son of Tahath, the son of Assir, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_38","014_6_38","1CH","6","38","38","the son of Izhar, the son of Kohath, the son of Levi, the son of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_39","014_6_39","1CH","6","39","39","Heman’s kinsman was Asaph, who served at his right hand: Asaph the son of Berechiah, the son of Shimea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_40","014_6_40","1CH","6","40","40","the son of Michael, the son of Baaseiah, the son of Malchijah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_41","014_6_41","1CH","6","41","41","the son of Ethni, the son of Zerah, the son of Adaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_42","014_6_42","1CH","6","42","42","the son of Ethan, the son of Zimmah, the son of Shimei, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_43","014_6_43","1CH","6","43","43","the son of Jahath, the son of Gershom, the son of Levi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_44","014_6_44","1CH","6","44","44","On the left were their kinsmen, the sons of Merari: Ethan the son of Kishi, the son of Abdi, the son of Malluch, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_45","014_6_45","1CH","6","45","45","the son of Hashabiah, the son of Amaziah, the son of Hilkiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_46","014_6_46","1CH","6","46","46","the son of Amzi, the son of Bani, the son of Shemer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_47","014_6_47","1CH","6","47","47","the son of Mahli, the son of Mushi, the son of Merari, the son of Levi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_48","014_6_48","1CH","6","48","48","Their fellow Levites were assigned to every kind of service of the tabernacle, the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_49","014_6_49","1CH","6","49","49","But Aaron and his sons did all the work of the Most Holy Place. They presented the offerings on the altar of burnt offering and on the altar of incense to make atonement for Israel, according to all that Moses the servant of God had commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_50","014_6_50","1CH","6","50","50","These were the descendants of Aaron: Eleazar his son, Phinehas his son, Abishua his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_51","014_6_51","1CH","6","51","51","Bukki his son, Uzzi his son, Zerahiah his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_52","014_6_52","1CH","6","52","52","Meraioth his son, Amariah his son, Ahitub his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_53","014_6_53","1CH","6","53","53","Zadok his son, and Ahimaaz his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_54","014_6_54","1CH","6","54","54","Now these were the territories assigned to the descendants of Aaron from the Kohathite clan for their settlements, because the first lot fell to them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_55","014_6_55","1CH","6","55","55","They were given Hebron in the land of Judah and its surrounding pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_56","014_6_56","1CH","6","56","56","But the fields and villages around the city were given to Caleb son of Jephunneh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_57","014_6_57","1CH","6","57","57","So the descendants of Aaron were given Hebron (a city of refuge), Libnah, Jattir, Eshtemoa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_58","014_6_58","1CH","6","58","58","Hilen, Debir, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_59","014_6_59","1CH","6","59","59","Ashan, Juttah, and Beth-shemesh, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_60","014_6_60","1CH","6","60","60","And from the tribe of Benjamin they were given Gibeon, Geba, Alemeth, and Anathoth, together with their pasturelands. So they had thirteen cities in all among their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_61","014_6_61","1CH","6","61","61","To the rest of the Kohathites, ten cities were allotted from the half-tribe of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_62","014_6_62","1CH","6","62","62","The Gershomites, according to their clans, were allotted thirteen cities from the tribes of Issachar, Asher, Naphtali, and Manasseh in Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_63","014_6_63","1CH","6","63","63","The Merarites, according to their clans, were allotted twelve cities from the tribes of Reuben, Gad, and Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_64","014_6_64","1CH","6","64","64","So the Israelites gave to the Levites these cities and their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_65","014_6_65","1CH","6","65","65","They assigned by lot the cities named above from the tribes of Judah, Simeon, and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_66","014_6_66","1CH","6","66","66","And some of the clans of the Kohathites were given cities from the tribe of Ephraim for their territory: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_67","014_6_67","1CH","6","67","67","They were given Shechem (a city of refuge) with its pasturelands in the hill country of Ephraim, and Gezer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_68","014_6_68","1CH","6","68","68","Jokmeam, Beth-horon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_69","014_6_69","1CH","6","69","69","Aijalon, and Gath-rimmon, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_70","014_6_70","1CH","6","70","70","And from the half-tribe of Manasseh the rest of the clans of the Kohathites were given Aner and Bileam, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_71","014_6_71","1CH","6","71","71","The Gershomites received the following: From the clan of the half-tribe of Manasseh they were given Golan in Bashan and also Ashtaroth, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_72","014_6_72","1CH","6","72","72","From the tribe of Issachar they were given Kedesh, Daberath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_73","014_6_73","1CH","6","73","73","Ramoth, and Anem, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_74","014_6_74","1CH","6","74","74","From the tribe of Asher they were given Mashal, Abdon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_75","014_6_75","1CH","6","75","75","Hukok, and Rehob, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_76","014_6_76","1CH","6","76","76","And from the tribe of Naphtali they were given Kedesh in Galilee, Hammon, and Kiriathaim, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_77","014_6_77","1CH","6","77","77","The Merarites (the rest of the Levites) received the following: From the tribe of Zebulun they were given Rimmono and Tabor, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_78","014_6_78","1CH","6","78","78","From the tribe of Reuben east of the Jordan opposite Jericho they were given Bezer in the wilderness, Jahzah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_79","014_6_79","1CH","6","79","79","Kedemoth, and Mephaath, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_80","014_6_80","1CH","6","80","80","And from the tribe of Gad they were given Ramoth in Gilead, Mahanaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R16_81","014_6_81","1CH","6","81","81","Heshbon, and Jazer, together with their pasturelands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_1","014_7_1","1CH","7","1","1","The sons of Issachar: Tola, Puah, Jashub, and Shimron—four in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_2","014_7_2","1CH","7","2","2","The sons of Tola: Uzzi, Rephaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam, and Shemuel, the heads of their families. In the days of David, 22,600 descendants of Tola were numbered in their genealogies as mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_3","014_7_3","1CH","7","3","3","The son of Uzzi: Izrahiah. The sons of Izrahiah: Michael, Obadiah, Joel, and Isshiah. All five of them were chiefs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_4","014_7_4","1CH","7","4","4","In addition to them, according to their genealogy, they had 36,000 troops for battle, for they had many wives and children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_5","014_7_5","1CH","7","5","5","Their kinsmen belonging to all the families of Issachar who were mighty men of valor totaled 87,000, as listed in their genealogies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_6","014_7_6","1CH","7","6","6","The three sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, and Jediael. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_7","014_7_7","1CH","7","7","7","The sons of Bela: Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth, and Iri, heads of their families—five in all. There were 22,034 mighty men of valor listed in their genealogies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_8","014_7_8","1CH","7","8","8","The sons of Becher: Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth, and Alemeth; all these were Becher’s sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_9","014_7_9","1CH","7","9","9","Their genealogies were recorded according to the heads of their families—20,200 mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_10","014_7_10","1CH","7","10","10","The son of Jediael: Bilhan. The sons of Bilhan: Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Chenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish, and Ahishahar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_11","014_7_11","1CH","7","11","11","All these sons of Jediael were heads of their families, mighty men of valor; there were 17,200 fit for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_12","014_7_12","1CH","7","12","12","The Shuppites and Huppites were descendants of Ir, and the Hushites were descendants of Aher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_13","014_7_13","1CH","7","13","13","The sons of Naphtali: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer, and Shallum—the descendants of Bilhah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_14","014_7_14","1CH","7","14","14","The descendants of Manasseh: Asriel through his Aramean concubine. She also gave birth to Machir the father of Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_15","014_7_15","1CH","7","15","15","Machir took a wife from among the Huppites and Shuppites. The name of his sister was Maacah. Another descendant was named Zelophehad, who had only daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_16","014_7_16","1CH","7","16","16","Machir’s wife Maacah gave birth to a son, and she named him Peresh. His brother was named Sheresh, and his sons were Ulam and Rekem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_17","014_7_17","1CH","7","17","17","The son of Ulam: Bedan. These were the sons of Gilead son of Machir, the son of Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_18","014_7_18","1CH","7","18","18","His sister Hammolecheth gave birth to Ishhod, Abiezer, and Mahlah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_19","014_7_19","1CH","7","19","19","And these were the sons of Shemida: Ahian, Shechem, Likhi, and Aniam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_20","014_7_20","1CH","7","20","20","The descendants of Ephraim: Shuthelah, Bered his son, Tahath his son, Eleadah his son, Tahath his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_21","014_7_21","1CH","7","21","21","Zabad his son, and Shuthelah his son. Ezer and Elead were killed by the natives of Gath, because they went down to steal their livestock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_22","014_7_22","1CH","7","22","22","Their father Ephraim mourned for many days, and his relatives came to comfort him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_23","014_7_23","1CH","7","23","23","And again he slept with his wife, and she conceived and gave birth to a son. So he named him Beriah, because tragedy had come upon his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_24","014_7_24","1CH","7","24","24","His daughter was Sheerah, who built Lower and Upper Beth-horon, as well as Uzzen-sheerah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_25","014_7_25","1CH","7","25","25","Additionally, Rephah was his son, Resheph his son, Telah his son, Tahan his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_26","014_7_26","1CH","7","26","26","Ladan his son, Ammihud his son, Elishama his son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_27","014_7_27","1CH","7","27","27","Nun his son, and Joshua his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_28","014_7_28","1CH","7","28","28","Their holdings and settlements included Bethel and its villages, Naaran to the east, Gezer and its villages to the west, and Shechem and its villages as far as Ayyah and its villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_29","014_7_29","1CH","7","29","29","And along the borders of Manasseh were Beth-shean, Taanach, Megiddo, and Dor, together with their villages. The descendants of Joseph son of Israel lived in these towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_30","014_7_30","1CH","7","30","30","The children of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and their sister Serah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_31","014_7_31","1CH","7","31","31","The sons of Beriah: Heber, as well as Malchiel, who was the father of Birzaith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_32","014_7_32","1CH","7","32","32","Heber was the father of Japhlet, Shomer, and Hotham, and of their sister Shua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_33","014_7_33","1CH","7","33","33","The sons of Japhlet: Pasach, Bimhal, and Ashvath. These were Japhlet’s sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_34","014_7_34","1CH","7","34","34","The sons of Shemer: Ahi, Rohgah, Hubbah, and Aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_35","014_7_35","1CH","7","35","35","The sons of his brother Helem: Zophah, Imna, Shelesh, and Amal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_36","014_7_36","1CH","7","36","36","The sons of Zophah: Suah, Harnepher, Shual, Beri, Imrah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_37","014_7_37","1CH","7","37","37","Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran, and Beera. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_38","014_7_38","1CH","7","38","38","The sons of Jether: Jephunneh, Pispa, and Ara. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_39","014_7_39","1CH","7","39","39","The sons of Ulla: Arah, Hanniel, and Rizia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R17_40","014_7_40","1CH","7","40","40","All these were the descendants of Asher—heads of their families, choice and mighty men of valor, and chiefs among the leaders. The number of men fit for battle, recorded in their genealogies, was 26,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_1","014_8_1","1CH","8","1","1","Benjamin was the father of Bela his firstborn, Ashbel the second, Aharah the third, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_2","014_8_2","1CH","8","2","2","Nohah the fourth, and Rapha the fifth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_3","014_8_3","1CH","8","3","3","The sons of Bela: Addar, Gera, Abihud, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_4","014_8_4","1CH","8","4","4","Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_5","014_8_5","1CH","8","5","5","Gera, Shephuphan, and Huram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_6","014_8_6","1CH","8","6","6","These were the descendants of Ehud who were the heads of the families living in Geba and were exiled to Manahath: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_7","014_8_7","1CH","8","7","7","Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera, who carried them into exile and who was the father of Uzza and Ahihud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_8","014_8_8","1CH","8","8","8","Shaharaim had sons in the country of Moab after he had divorced his wives Hushim and Baara. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_9","014_8_9","1CH","8","9","9","His sons by his wife Hodesh: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_10","014_8_10","1CH","8","10","10","Jeuz, Sachia, and Mirmah. These were his sons, heads of families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_11","014_8_11","1CH","8","11","11","He also had sons by Hushim: Abitub and Elpaal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_12","014_8_12","1CH","8","12","12","The sons of Elpaal: Eber, Misham, Shemed (who built Ono and Lod with its villages), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_13","014_8_13","1CH","8","13","13","and Beriah and Shema (who were the heads of families living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_14","014_8_14","1CH","8","14","14","Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_15","014_8_15","1CH","8","15","15","Zebadiah, Arad, Eder, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_16","014_8_16","1CH","8","16","16","Michael, Ishpah, and Joha were the sons of Beriah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_17","014_8_17","1CH","8","17","17","Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_18","014_8_18","1CH","8","18","18","Ishmerai, Izliah, and Jobab were the sons of Elpaal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_19","014_8_19","1CH","8","19","19","Jakim, Zichri, Zabdi, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_20","014_8_20","1CH","8","20","20","Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_21","014_8_21","1CH","8","21","21","Adaiah, Beraiah, and Shimrath were the sons of Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_22","014_8_22","1CH","8","22","22","Ishpan, Eber, Eliel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_23","014_8_23","1CH","8","23","23","Abdon, Zichri, Hanan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_24","014_8_24","1CH","8","24","24","Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_25","014_8_25","1CH","8","25","25","Iphdeiah, and Penuel were the sons of Shashak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_26","014_8_26","1CH","8","26","26","Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_27","014_8_27","1CH","8","27","27","Jaareshiah, Elijah, and Zichri were the sons of Jeroham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_28","014_8_28","1CH","8","28","28","All these were heads of families, the chiefs according to their genealogies, and they lived in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_29","014_8_29","1CH","8","29","29","Jeiel the father of Gibeon lived in Gibeon. His wife’s name was Maacah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_30","014_8_30","1CH","8","30","30","and Abdon was his firstborn son, then Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_31","014_8_31","1CH","8","31","31","Gedor, Ahio, Zecher, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_32","014_8_32","1CH","8","32","32","and Mikloth, who was the father of Shimeah. They too lived alongside their relatives in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_33","014_8_33","1CH","8","33","33","Ner was the father of Kish, Kish was the father of Saul, and Saul was the father of Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, and Esh-baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_34","014_8_34","1CH","8","34","34","The son of Jonathan: Merib-baal, and Merib-baal was the father of Micah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_35","014_8_35","1CH","8","35","35","The sons of Micah: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, and Ahaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_36","014_8_36","1CH","8","36","36","Ahaz was the father of Jehoaddah, Jehoaddah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri, and Zimri was the father of Moza. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_37","014_8_37","1CH","8","37","37","Moza was the father of Binea. Raphah was his son, Eleasah his son, and Azel his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_38","014_8_38","1CH","8","38","38","Azel had six sons, and these were their names: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. All these were the sons of Azel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_39","014_8_39","1CH","8","39","39","The sons of his brother Eshek: Ulam was his firstborn, Jeush second, and Eliphelet third. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R18_40","014_8_40","1CH","8","40","40","The sons of Ulam were mighty men of valor, archers, and they had many sons and grandsons—150 in all. All these were the descendants of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_1","014_9_1","1CH","9","1","1","So all Israel was recorded in the genealogies written in the Book of the Kings of Israel. But Judah was exiled to Babylon because of their unfaithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_2","014_9_2","1CH","9","2","2","Now the first to resettle their own property in their cities were Israelites, priests, Levites, and temple servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_3","014_9_3","1CH","9","3","3","Some of the descendants of Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim, and Manasseh lived in Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_4","014_9_4","1CH","9","4","4","Uthai son of Ammihud, the son of Omri, the son of Imri, the son of Bani, a descendant of Perez son of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_5","014_9_5","1CH","9","5","5","From the Shilonites: Asaiah the firstborn and his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_6","014_9_6","1CH","9","6","6","From the Zerahites: Jeuel and 690 relatives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_7","014_9_7","1CH","9","7","7","From the Benjamites: Sallu son of Meshullam, the son of Hodaviah, the son of Hassenuah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_8","014_9_8","1CH","9","8","8","Ibneiah son of Jeroham; Elah son of Uzzi, the son of Michri; Meshullam son of Shephatiah, the son of Reuel, the son of Ibnijah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_9","014_9_9","1CH","9","9","9","and 956 of their relatives according to their genealogy. All these men were heads of their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_10","014_9_10","1CH","9","10","10","From the priests: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, and Jachin; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_11","014_9_11","1CH","9","11","11","Azariah son of Hilkiah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Zadok, the son of Meraioth, the son of Ahitub, the chief official of God’s temple; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_12","014_9_12","1CH","9","12","12","Adaiah son of Jeroham, the son of Pashhur, the son of Malchijah; Maasai son of Adiel, the son of Jahzerah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Meshillemith, the son of Immer; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_13","014_9_13","1CH","9","13","13","and 1,760 of their relatives, the heads of their families, able men for the work of the service of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_14","014_9_14","1CH","9","14","14","From the Levites: Shemaiah son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, a descendant of Merari; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_15","014_9_15","1CH","9","15","15","Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah son of Mica, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_16","014_9_16","1CH","9","16","16","Obadiah son of Shemaiah, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun; and Berechiah son of Asa, the son of Elkanah, who lived in the villages of the Netophathites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_17","014_9_17","1CH","9","17","17","These were the gatekeepers: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their relatives. Shallum was their chief; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_18","014_9_18","1CH","9","18","18","he was previously stationed at the King’s Gate on the east side. These were the gatekeepers from the camp of the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_19","014_9_19","1CH","9","19","19","Shallum son of Kore, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, and his relatives from the Korahites were assigned to guard the thresholds of the Tent, just as their fathers had been assigned to guard the entrance to the dwelling of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_20","014_9_20","1CH","9","20","20","In earlier times Phinehas son of Eleazar had been in charge of the gatekeepers, and the LORD was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_21","014_9_21","1CH","9","21","21","Zechariah son of Meshelemiah was the gatekeeper at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_22","014_9_22","1CH","9","22","22","The number of those chosen to be gatekeepers at the thresholds was 212. They were registered by genealogy in their villages. David and Samuel the seer had appointed them to their positions of trust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_23","014_9_23","1CH","9","23","23","So they and their descendants were assigned to guard the gates of the house of the LORD—the house called the Tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_24","014_9_24","1CH","9","24","24","The gatekeepers were stationed on the four sides: east, west, north, and south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_25","014_9_25","1CH","9","25","25","Their relatives came from their villages at fixed times to serve with them for seven-day periods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_26","014_9_26","1CH","9","26","26","But the four chief gatekeepers, who were Levites, were entrusted with the rooms and the treasuries of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_27","014_9_27","1CH","9","27","27","They would spend the night stationed around the house of God, because they were responsible for guarding it and opening it every morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_28","014_9_28","1CH","9","28","28","Some of them were in charge of the articles used in worship, to count them whenever they were brought in or taken out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_29","014_9_29","1CH","9","29","29","Others were put in charge of the furnishings and other articles of the sanctuary, as well as the fine flour, wine, oil, frankincense, and spices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_30","014_9_30","1CH","9","30","30","And some of the sons of the priests mixed the spices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_31","014_9_31","1CH","9","31","31","A Levite named Mattithiah, the firstborn son of Shallum the Korahite, was entrusted with baking the bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_32","014_9_32","1CH","9","32","32","Some of their Kohathite relatives were responsible for preparing the rows of the showbread every Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_33","014_9_33","1CH","9","33","33","Those who were musicians, the heads of Levite families, stayed in the temple chambers and were exempt from other duties because they were on duty day and night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_34","014_9_34","1CH","9","34","34","All these were heads of Levite families, chiefs according to their genealogies, and they lived in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_35","014_9_35","1CH","9","35","35","Jeiel the father of Gibeon lived in Gibeon. His wife’s name was Maacah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_36","014_9_36","1CH","9","36","36","Abdon was his firstborn son, then Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_37","014_9_37","1CH","9","37","37","Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, and Mikloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_38","014_9_38","1CH","9","38","38","Mikloth was the father of Shimeam. They too lived alongside their relatives in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_39","014_9_39","1CH","9","39","39","Ner was the father of Kish, Kish was the father of Saul, and Saul was the father of Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, and Esh-baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_40","014_9_40","1CH","9","40","40","The son of Jonathan: Merib-baal, who was the father of Micah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_41","014_9_41","1CH","9","41","41","The sons of Micah: Pithon, Melech, Tahrea, and Ahaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_42","014_9_42","1CH","9","42","42","Ahaz was the father of Jarah; Jarah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri; and Zimri was the father of Moza. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_43","014_9_43","1CH","9","43","43","Moza was the father of Binea. Rephaiah was his son, Elasah his son, and Azel his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R19_44","014_9_44","1CH","9","44","44","And Azel had six sons, and these were their names: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. These were the sons of Azel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_1","014_10_1","1CH","10","1","1","Now the Philistines fought against Israel, and the men of Israel fled before them, and many fell slain on Mount Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_2","014_10_2","1CH","10","2","2","The Philistines followed hard after Saul and his sons, and they killed Saul’s sons Jonathan, Abinadab, and Malchishua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_3","014_10_3","1CH","10","3","3","When the battle intensified against Saul, the archers overtook him and wounded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_4","014_10_4","1CH","10","4","4","Then Saul said to his armor-bearer, “Draw your sword and run me through with it, or these uncircumcised men will come and torture me!” But his armor-bearer was terrified and refused to do it. So Saul took his own sword and fell on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_5","014_10_5","1CH","10","5","5","When his armor-bearer saw that Saul was dead, he too fell on his own sword and died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_6","014_10_6","1CH","10","6","6","So Saul died together with his three sons and all his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_7","014_10_7","1CH","10","7","7","When all the Israelites in the valley saw that the army had fled and that Saul and his sons had died, they abandoned their cities and ran away. So the Philistines came and occupied their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_8","014_10_8","1CH","10","8","8","The next day, when the Philistines came to strip the dead, they found Saul and his sons fallen on Mount Gilboa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_9","014_10_9","1CH","10","9","9","They stripped Saul, cut off his head, took his armor, and sent messengers throughout the land of the Philistines to proclaim the news in the temple of their idols and among their people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_10","014_10_10","1CH","10","10","10","They put his armor in the temple of their gods and hung his head in the temple of Dagon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_11","014_10_11","1CH","10","11","11","When all the people of Jabesh-gilead heard about everything the Philistines had done to Saul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_12","014_10_12","1CH","10","12","12","all their men of valor set out and retrieved the bodies of Saul and his sons and brought them to Jabesh. And they buried their bones under the oak in Jabesh and fasted seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_13","014_10_13","1CH","10","13","13","So Saul died for his unfaithfulness to the LORD, because he did not keep the word of the LORD and even consulted a medium for guidance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R110_14","014_10_14","1CH","10","14","14","and he failed to inquire of the LORD. So the LORD put him to death and turned the kingdom over to David son of Jesse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_1","014_11_1","1CH","11","1","1","Then all Israel came together to David at Hebron and said, “Here we are, your own flesh and blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_2","014_11_2","1CH","11","2","2","Even in times past, while Saul was king, you were the one who led Israel out and brought them back. And the LORD your God said, ‘You will shepherd My people Israel, and you will be ruler over them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_3","014_11_3","1CH","11","3","3","So all the elders of Israel came to the king at Hebron, where David made a covenant with them before the LORD. And they anointed him king over Israel, according to the word of the LORD through Samuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_4","014_11_4","1CH","11","4","4","Then David and all the Israelites marched to Jerusalem (that is, Jebus), where the Jebusites inhabited the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_5","014_11_5","1CH","11","5","5","The people of Jebus said to David, “You will never get in here.” Nevertheless, David captured the fortress of Zion (that is, the City of David). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_6","014_11_6","1CH","11","6","6","Now David had said, “Whoever is the first to strike down a Jebusite will become chief commander.” And Joab son of Zeruiah went up first, and he became the chief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_7","014_11_7","1CH","11","7","7","So David took up residence in the fortress; that is why it was called the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_8","014_11_8","1CH","11","8","8","He built up the city around it, from the supporting terraces to the surrounding wall, while Joab restored the rest of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_9","014_11_9","1CH","11","9","9","And David became greater and greater, for the LORD of Hosts was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_10","014_11_10","1CH","11","10","10","Now these were the chiefs of David’s mighty men, who, together with all Israel, bolstered and strengthened his kingdom, according to the word of the LORD concerning Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_11","014_11_11","1CH","11","11","11","This is the list of David’s mighty men: Jashobeam son of Hachmoni was chief of the officers; he wielded his spear against three hundred men, whom he killed at one time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_12","014_11_12","1CH","11","12","12","Next in command was Eleazar son of Dodo the Ahohite, one of the three mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_13","014_11_13","1CH","11","13","13","He was with David at Pas-dammim when the Philistines gathered there for battle. At a place with a field full of barley, the troops fled from the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_14","014_11_14","1CH","11","14","14","But Eleazar and David stationed themselves in the middle of the field and defended it. They struck down the Philistines, and the LORD brought about a great victory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_15","014_11_15","1CH","11","15","15","Three of the thirty chief men went down to David, to the rock at the cave of Adullam, while a company of Philistines was encamped in the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_16","014_11_16","1CH","11","16","16","At that time David was in the stronghold, and the garrison of the Philistines was at Bethlehem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_17","014_11_17","1CH","11","17","17","David longed for water and said, “Oh, that someone would get me a drink of water from the well near the gate of Bethlehem!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_18","014_11_18","1CH","11","18","18","So the Three broke through the Philistine camp, drew water from the well at the gate of Bethlehem, and brought it back to David. But he refused to drink it; instead, he poured it out to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_19","014_11_19","1CH","11","19","19","saying, “Far be it from me, my God, to do this! How can I drink the blood of these men who risked their lives?” Because they had brought it at the risk of their lives, David refused to drink it. Such were the exploits of the three mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_20","014_11_20","1CH","11","20","20","Now Abishai, the brother of Joab, was chief of the Three, and he wielded his spear against three hundred men, killed them, and won a name along with the Three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_21","014_11_21","1CH","11","21","21","He was doubly honored above the Three, and he became their commander, even though he was not included among the Three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_22","014_11_22","1CH","11","22","22","And Benaiah son of Jehoiada was a man of valor from Kabzeel, a man of many exploits. He struck down two champions of Moab, and on a snowy day he went down into a pit and killed a lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_23","014_11_23","1CH","11","23","23","He also struck down an Egyptian, a huge man five cubits tall. Although the Egyptian had a spear like a weaver’s beam in his hand, Benaiah went against him with a club, snatched the spear from his hand, and killed the Egyptian with his own spear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_24","014_11_24","1CH","11","24","24","These were the exploits of Benaiah son of Jehoiada, who won a name along with the three mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_25","014_11_25","1CH","11","25","25","He was most honored among the Thirty, but he did not become one of the Three. And David appointed him over his guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_26","014_11_26","1CH","11","26","26","Now these were the mighty men: Asahel the brother of Joab, Elhanan son of Dodo of Bethlehem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_27","014_11_27","1CH","11","27","27","Shammoth the Harorite, Helez the Pelonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_28","014_11_28","1CH","11","28","28","Ira son of Ikkesh the Tekoite, Abiezer the Anathothite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_29","014_11_29","1CH","11","29","29","Sibbecai the Hushathite, Ilai the Ahohite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_30","014_11_30","1CH","11","30","30","Maharai the Netophathite, Heled son of Baanah the Netophathite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_31","014_11_31","1CH","11","31","31","Ithai son of Ribai from Gibeah of the Benjamites, Benaiah the Pirathonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_32","014_11_32","1CH","11","32","32","Hurai from the brooks of Gaash, Abiel the Arbathite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_33","014_11_33","1CH","11","33","33","Azmaveth the Baharumite, Eliahba the Shaalbonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_34","014_11_34","1CH","11","34","34","the sons of Hashem the Gizonite, Jonathan son of Shagee the Hararite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_35","014_11_35","1CH","11","35","35","Ahiam son of Sachar the Hararite, Eliphal son of Ur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_36","014_11_36","1CH","11","36","36","Hepher the Mecherathite, Ahijah the Pelonite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_37","014_11_37","1CH","11","37","37","Hezro the Carmelite, Naarai son of Ezbai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_38","014_11_38","1CH","11","38","38","Joel the brother of Nathan, Mibhar son of Hagri, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_39","014_11_39","1CH","11","39","39","Zelek the Ammonite, Naharai the Beerothite, the armor-bearer of Joab son of Zeruiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_40","014_11_40","1CH","11","40","40","Ira the Ithrite, Gareb the Ithrite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_41","014_11_41","1CH","11","41","41","Uriah the Hittite, Zabad son of Ahlai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_42","014_11_42","1CH","11","42","42","Adina son of Shiza the Reubenite, chief of the Reubenites, and the thirty with him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_43","014_11_43","1CH","11","43","43","Hanan son of Maacah, Joshaphat the Mithnite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_44","014_11_44","1CH","11","44","44","Uzzia the Ashterathite, Shama and Jeiel the sons of Hotham the Aroerite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_45","014_11_45","1CH","11","45","45","Jediael son of Shimri and his brother Joha the Tizite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_46","014_11_46","1CH","11","46","46","Eliel the Mahavite, Jeribai and Joshaviah, the sons of Elnaam, Ithmah the Moabite, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R111_47","014_11_47","1CH","11","47","47","Eliel, Obed, and Jaasiel the Mezobaite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_1","014_12_1","1CH","12","1","1","Now these were the men who came to David at Ziklag, while he was still banished from the presence of Saul son of Kish (they were among the mighty men who helped him in battle; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_2","014_12_2","1CH","12","2","2","they were archers using both the right and left hands to sling stones and shoot arrows; and they were Saul’s kinsmen from Benjamin): ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_3","014_12_3","1CH","12","3","3","Ahiezer their chief and Joash, who were the sons of Shemaah the Gibeathite; Jeziel and Pelet, the sons of Azmaveth; Beracah; Jehu the Anathothite; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_4","014_12_4","1CH","12","4","4","Ishmaiah the Gibeonite, a mighty man among the Thirty and a leader over the Thirty; Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan, and Jozabad the Gederathite; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_5","014_12_5","1CH","12","5","5","Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, and Shephatiah the Haruphite; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_6","014_12_6","1CH","12","6","6","Elkanah, Isshiah, Azarel, Joezer, and Jashobeam, who were Korahites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_7","014_12_7","1CH","12","7","7","and Joelah and Zebadiah, the sons of Jeroham from Gedor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_8","014_12_8","1CH","12","8","8","Some Gadites defected to David at his stronghold in the wilderness. They were mighty men of valor, trained for battle, experts with the shield and spear, whose faces were like the faces of lions and who were as swift as gazelles on the mountains: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_9","014_12_9","1CH","12","9","9","Ezer the chief, Obadiah the second in command, Eliab the third, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_10","014_12_10","1CH","12","10","10","Mishmannah the fourth, Jeremiah the fifth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_11","014_12_11","1CH","12","11","11","Attai the sixth, Eliel the seventh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_12","014_12_12","1CH","12","12","12","Johanan the eighth, Elzabad the ninth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_13","014_12_13","1CH","12","13","13","Jeremiah the tenth, and Machbanai the eleventh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_14","014_12_14","1CH","12","14","14","These Gadites were army commanders, the least of whom was a match for a hundred, and the greatest for a thousand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_15","014_12_15","1CH","12","15","15","These are the ones who crossed the Jordan in the first month when it was overflowing all its banks, and they put to flight all those in the valleys, both to the east and to the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_16","014_12_16","1CH","12","16","16","Other Benjamites and some men from Judah also came to David in his stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_17","014_12_17","1CH","12","17","17","And David went out to meet them, saying, “If you have come to me in peace to help me, my heart will be united with you; but if you have come to betray me to my enemies when my hands are free of violence, may the God of our fathers see it and judge you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_18","014_12_18","1CH","12","18","18","Then the Spirit came upon Amasai, the chief of the Thirty, and he said: “We are yours, O David! We are with you, O son of Jesse! Peace, peace to you, and peace to your helpers, for your God helps you.” So David received them and made them leaders of his troops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_19","014_12_19","1CH","12","19","19","Some from Manasseh defected to David when he went with the Philistines to fight against Saul. (They did not help the Philistines because the Philistine rulers consulted and sent David away, saying, “It will cost us our heads if he defects to his master Saul.”) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_20","014_12_20","1CH","12","20","20","When David went to Ziklag, these men of Manasseh defected to him: Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu, and Zillethai, chiefs of thousands in Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_21","014_12_21","1CH","12","21","21","They helped David against the raiders, for they were all mighty men of valor and commanders in the army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_22","014_12_22","1CH","12","22","22","For at that time men came to David day after day to help him, until he had a great army, like the army of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_23","014_12_23","1CH","12","23","23","Now these are the numbers of men armed for battle who came to David at Hebron to turn Saul’s kingdom over to him, in accordance with the word of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_24","014_12_24","1CH","12","24","24","From Judah: 6,800 armed troops bearing shields and spears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_25","014_12_25","1CH","12","25","25","From Simeon: 7,100 mighty men of valor, ready for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_26","014_12_26","1CH","12","26","26","From Levi: 4,600, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_27","014_12_27","1CH","12","27","27","including Jehoiada, leader of the house of Aaron, with 3,700 men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_28","014_12_28","1CH","12","28","28","and Zadok, a mighty young man of valor, with 22 commanders from his own family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_29","014_12_29","1CH","12","29","29","From Benjamin, the kinsmen of Saul: 3,000, most of whom had remained loyal to the house of Saul up to that time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_30","014_12_30","1CH","12","30","30","From Ephraim: 20,800 mighty men of valor, famous among their own clans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_31","014_12_31","1CH","12","31","31","From the half-tribe of Manasseh: 18,000 designated by name to come and make David king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_32","014_12_32","1CH","12","32","32","From Issachar, men who understood the times and knew what Israel should do: 200 chiefs with all their kinsmen at their command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_33","014_12_33","1CH","12","33","33","From Zebulun: 50,000 fit for service, trained for battle with all kinds of weapons of war, who with one purpose were devoted to David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_34","014_12_34","1CH","12","34","34","From Naphtali: 1,000 commanders, accompanied by 37,000 men with shield and spear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_35","014_12_35","1CH","12","35","35","From Dan: 28,600 prepared for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_36","014_12_36","1CH","12","36","36","From Asher: 40,000 fit for service, prepared for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_37","014_12_37","1CH","12","37","37","And from east of the Jordan, from Reuben, Gad, and the half-tribe of Manasseh there: 120,000 armed with every kind of weapon of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_38","014_12_38","1CH","12","38","38","All these men of war, arrayed for battle, came to Hebron fully determined to make David king over all Israel. And all the rest of the Israelites were of one mind to make David king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_39","014_12_39","1CH","12","39","39","They spent three days there eating and drinking with David, for their relatives had provided for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R112_40","014_12_40","1CH","12","40","40","And their neighbors from as far away as Issachar, Zebulun, and Naphtali came bringing food on donkeys, camels, mules, and oxen—abundant supplies of flour, fig cakes and raisin cakes, wine and oil, oxen and sheep. Indeed, there was joy in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_1","014_13_1","1CH","13","1","1","Then David conferred with all his leaders, the commanders of thousands and of hundreds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_2","014_13_2","1CH","13","2","2","And he said to the whole assembly of Israel, “If it seems good to you, and if this is of the LORD our God, let us send word far and wide to the rest of our brothers in all the land of Israel, and also to the priests and Levites in their cities and pasturelands, so that they may join us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_3","014_13_3","1CH","13","3","3","Then let us bring back the ark of our God, for we did not inquire of Him in the days of Saul.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_4","014_13_4","1CH","13","4","4","And because this proposal seemed right to all the people, the whole assembly agreed to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_5","014_13_5","1CH","13","5","5","So David assembled all Israel, from the River Shihor in Egypt to Lebo-hamath, to bring the ark of God from Kiriath-jearim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_6","014_13_6","1CH","13","6","6","David and all Israel went up to Baalah of Judah (that is, Kiriath-jearim) to bring up from there the ark of God the LORD, who is enthroned between the cherubim—the ark that is called by the Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_7","014_13_7","1CH","13","7","7","So they carried the ark of God from the house of Abinadab on a new cart, with Uzzah and Ahio guiding the cart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_8","014_13_8","1CH","13","8","8","David and all the Israelites were celebrating before God with all their might, with songs and on harps and lyres, with tambourines, cymbals, and trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_9","014_13_9","1CH","13","9","9","When they came to the threshing floor of Chidon, Uzzah reached out and took hold of the ark, because the oxen had stumbled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_10","014_13_10","1CH","13","10","10","And the anger of the LORD burned against Uzzah, and He struck him down because he had put his hand on the ark. So he died there before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_11","014_13_11","1CH","13","11","11","Then David became angry because the LORD had burst forth against Uzzah. So he named that place Perez-uzzah, as it is called to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_12","014_13_12","1CH","13","12","12","That day David feared God and asked, “How can I ever bring the ark of God to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_13","014_13_13","1CH","13","13","13","So he did not move the ark with him to the City of David; instead, he took it aside to the house of Obed-edom the Gittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R113_14","014_13_14","1CH","13","14","14","Thus the ark of God remained with the family of Obed-edom in his house for three months, and the LORD blessed his household and everything he owned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_1","014_14_1","1CH","14","1","1","Now Hiram king of Tyre sent envoys to David, along with cedar logs, stonemasons, and carpenters, to build a palace for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_2","014_14_2","1CH","14","2","2","And David realized that the LORD had established him as king over Israel and had highly exalted his kingdom for the sake of His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_3","014_14_3","1CH","14","3","3","And David took more wives in Jerusalem and became the father of more sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_4","014_14_4","1CH","14","4","4","These are the names of the children born to him in Jerusalem: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_5","014_14_5","1CH","14","5","5","Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_6","014_14_6","1CH","14","6","6","Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_7","014_14_7","1CH","14","7","7","Elishama, Beeliada, and Eliphelet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_8","014_14_8","1CH","14","8","8","When the Philistines heard that David had been anointed king over all Israel, they all went in search of him; but David learned of this and went out to face them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_9","014_14_9","1CH","14","9","9","Now the Philistines had come and raided the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_10","014_14_10","1CH","14","10","10","So David inquired of God, “Should I go up against the Philistines? Will You deliver them into my hand?” “Go,” replied the LORD, “for I will deliver them into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_11","014_14_11","1CH","14","11","11","So David and his men went up to Baal-perazim, where he defeated the Philistines and said, “Like a bursting flood, God has burst out against my enemies by my hand.” So they called that place Baal-perazim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_12","014_14_12","1CH","14","12","12","There the Philistines abandoned their gods, and David ordered that they be burned in the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_13","014_14_13","1CH","14","13","13","Once again the Philistines raided the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_14","014_14_14","1CH","14","14","14","So David again inquired of God, who answered him, “Do not march up after them, but circle around them and attack them in front of the balsam trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_15","014_14_15","1CH","14","15","15","As soon as you hear the sound of marching in the tops of the balsam trees, move out to battle, because this will mean that God has gone out before you to strike the camp of the Philistines.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_16","014_14_16","1CH","14","16","16","So David did as God had commanded him, and they struck down the army of the Philistines all the way from Gibeon to Gezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R114_17","014_14_17","1CH","14","17","17","And David’s fame went out into every land, and the LORD caused all nations to fear him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_1","014_15_1","1CH","15","1","1","David constructed buildings for himself in the City of David, and he prepared a place for the ark of God and pitched a tent for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_2","014_15_2","1CH","15","2","2","Then David said, “No one but the Levites may carry the ark of God, because the LORD has chosen them to carry the ark of the LORD and to minister before Him forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_3","014_15_3","1CH","15","3","3","And David assembled all Israel in Jerusalem to bring up the ark of the LORD to the place he had prepared for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_4","014_15_4","1CH","15","4","4","Then he gathered together the descendants of Aaron and the Levites: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_5","014_15_5","1CH","15","5","5","From the Kohathites, Uriel the chief and 120 of his relatives; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_6","014_15_6","1CH","15","6","6","from the Merarites, Asaiah the chief and 220 of his relatives; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_7","014_15_7","1CH","15","7","7","from the Gershomites, Joel the chief and 130 of his relatives; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_8","014_15_8","1CH","15","8","8","from the Elizaphanites, Shemaiah the chief and 200 of his relatives; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_9","014_15_9","1CH","15","9","9","from the Hebronites, Eliel the chief and 80 of his relatives; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_10","014_15_10","1CH","15","10","10","and from the Uzzielites, Amminadab the chief and 112 of his relatives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_11","014_15_11","1CH","15","11","11","David summoned the priests Zadok and Abiathar and the Levites Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel, and Amminadab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_12","014_15_12","1CH","15","12","12","And he said to them, “You are the heads of the Levitical families. You and your relatives must consecrate yourselves so that you may bring the ark of the LORD, the God of Israel, to the place I have prepared for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_13","014_15_13","1CH","15","13","13","It was because you Levites were not with us the first time that the LORD our God burst forth in anger against us. For we did not consult Him about the proper order.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_14","014_15_14","1CH","15","14","14","So the priests and Levites consecrated themselves to bring up the ark of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_15","014_15_15","1CH","15","15","15","And the Levites carried the ark of God on their shoulders with the poles, as Moses had commanded in accordance with the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_16","014_15_16","1CH","15","16","16","David also told the leaders of the Levites to appoint their relatives as singers to lift up their voices with joy, accompanied by musical instruments—harps, lyres, and cymbals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_17","014_15_17","1CH","15","17","17","So the Levites appointed Heman son of Joel; from his brothers, Asaph son of Berechiah; from their brothers the Merarites, Ethan son of Kushaiah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_18","014_15_18","1CH","15","18","18","and with them their brothers next in rank: Zechariah, Jaaziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, and the gatekeepers Obed-edom and Jeiel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_19","014_15_19","1CH","15","19","19","The musicians Heman, Asaph, and Ethan were to sound the bronze cymbals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_20","014_15_20","1CH","15","20","20","Zechariah, Aziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah, and Benaiah were to play the harps according to Alamoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_21","014_15_21","1CH","15","21","21","And Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, Obed-edom, Jeiel, and Azaziah were to lead the music with lyres according to Sheminith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_22","014_15_22","1CH","15","22","22","Chenaniah the head Levite was the director of the music because he was highly skilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_23","014_15_23","1CH","15","23","23","Berechiah and Elkanah were to be guardians of the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_24","014_15_24","1CH","15","24","24","Shebaniah, Joshaphat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zechariah, Benaiah, and Eliezer—the priests—were to blow the trumpets before the ark of God. Obed-edom and Jehiah were also to be guardians of the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_25","014_15_25","1CH","15","25","25","So David, the elders of Israel, and the commanders of thousands went with rejoicing to bring the ark of the covenant of the LORD from the house of Obed-edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_26","014_15_26","1CH","15","26","26","And because God helped the Levites who were carrying the ark of the covenant of the LORD, they sacrificed seven bulls and seven rams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_27","014_15_27","1CH","15","27","27","Now David was dressed in a robe of fine linen, as were all the Levites who were carrying the ark, as well as the singers and Chenaniah, the director of music for the singers. David also wore a linen ephod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_28","014_15_28","1CH","15","28","28","So all Israel brought up the ark of the covenant of the LORD with shouting, with the sounding of rams’ horns and trumpets, and with cymbals and the music of harps and lyres. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R115_29","014_15_29","1CH","15","29","29","As the ark of the covenant of the LORD was entering the City of David, Saul’s daughter Michal looked down from a window and saw King David dancing and celebrating, and she despised him in her heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_1","014_16_1","1CH","16","1","1","So they brought the ark of God and placed it inside the tent that David had pitched for it. And they presented burnt offerings and peace offerings before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_2","014_16_2","1CH","16","2","2","When David had finished sacrificing the burnt offerings and peace offerings, he blessed the people in the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_3","014_16_3","1CH","16","3","3","Then he distributed to every man and woman of Israel a loaf of bread, a date cake, and a raisin cake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_4","014_16_4","1CH","16","4","4","David appointed some of the Levites to minister before the ark of the LORD, to celebrate, to give thanks, and to praise the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_5","014_16_5","1CH","16","5","5","Asaph was the chief, Zechariah was second, then Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed-edom, and Jeiel. They were to play the harps and lyres, while Asaph sounded the cymbals ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_6","014_16_6","1CH","16","6","6","and the priests Benaiah and Jahaziel blew the trumpets regularly before the ark of the covenant of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_7","014_16_7","1CH","16","7","7","On that day David first committed to Asaph and his associates this song of thanksgiving to the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_8","014_16_8","1CH","16","8","8","“Give thanks to the LORD; call upon His name; make known His deeds among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_9","014_16_9","1CH","16","9","9","Sing to Him, sing praises to Him; tell of all His wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_10","014_16_10","1CH","16","10","10","Glory in His holy name; let the hearts of those who seek the LORD rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_11","014_16_11","1CH","16","11","11","Seek out the LORD and His strength; seek His face always. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_12","014_16_12","1CH","16","12","12","Remember the wonders He has done, His marvels, and the judgments He has pronounced, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_13","014_16_13","1CH","16","13","13","O offspring of His servant Israel, O sons of Jacob, His chosen ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_14","014_16_14","1CH","16","14","14","He is the LORD our God; His judgments carry throughout the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_15","014_16_15","1CH","16","15","15","Remember His covenant forever, the word He ordained for a thousand generations— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_16","014_16_16","1CH","16","16","16","the covenant He made with Abraham, and the oath He swore to Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_17","014_16_17","1CH","16","17","17","He confirmed it to Jacob as a decree, to Israel as an everlasting covenant: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_18","014_16_18","1CH","16","18","18","‘I will give you the land of Canaan as the portion of your inheritance.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_19","014_16_19","1CH","16","19","19","When they were few in number, few indeed, and strangers in the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_20","014_16_20","1CH","16","20","20","they wandered from nation to nation, from one kingdom to another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_21","014_16_21","1CH","16","21","21","He let no man oppress them; He rebuked kings on their behalf: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_22","014_16_22","1CH","16","22","22","‘Do not touch My anointed ones! Do no harm to My prophets!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_23","014_16_23","1CH","16","23","23","Sing to the LORD, all the earth. Proclaim His salvation day after day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_24","014_16_24","1CH","16","24","24","Declare His glory among the nations, His wonders among all peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_25","014_16_25","1CH","16","25","25","For great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised; He is to be feared above all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_26","014_16_26","1CH","16","26","26","For all the gods of the nations are idols, but it is the LORD who made the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_27","014_16_27","1CH","16","27","27","Splendor and majesty are before Him; strength and joy fill His dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_28","014_16_28","1CH","16","28","28","Ascribe to the LORD, O families of the nations, ascribe to the LORD glory and strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_29","014_16_29","1CH","16","29","29","Ascribe to the LORD the glory due His name; bring an offering and come before Him. Worship the LORD in the splendor of His holiness; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_30","014_16_30","1CH","16","30","30","tremble before Him, all the earth. The world is firmly established; it cannot be moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_31","014_16_31","1CH","16","31","31","Let the heavens be glad, and the earth rejoice. Let them say among the nations, ‘The LORD reigns!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_32","014_16_32","1CH","16","32","32","Let the sea resound, and all that fills it; let the fields exult, and all that is in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_33","014_16_33","1CH","16","33","33","Then the trees of the forest will sing for joy before the LORD, for He is coming to judge the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_34","014_16_34","1CH","16","34","34","Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good; His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_35","014_16_35","1CH","16","35","35","Then cry out: ‘Save us, O God of our salvation; gather and deliver us from the nations, that we may give thanks to Your holy name, that we may glory in Your praise.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_36","014_16_36","1CH","16","36","36","Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, from everlasting to everlasting.” Then all the people said, “Amen!” and “Praise the LORD!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_37","014_16_37","1CH","16","37","37","So David left Asaph and his associates there before the ark of the covenant of the LORD, to minister there regularly according to the daily requirements, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_38","014_16_38","1CH","16","38","38","along with Obed-edom and his sixty-eight relatives. Obed-edom son of Jeduthun, and also Hosah, were to be gatekeepers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_39","014_16_39","1CH","16","39","39","And David left Zadok the priest and his fellow priests before the tabernacle of the LORD at the high place in Gibeon ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_40","014_16_40","1CH","16","40","40","to regularly present burnt offerings to the LORD on the altar of burnt offerings, morning and evening, according to all that was written in the Law of the LORD, which He had commanded Israel to keep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_41","014_16_41","1CH","16","41","41","With them were Heman, Jeduthun, and the rest of those chosen and designated by name to give thanks to the LORD, for “His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_42","014_16_42","1CH","16","42","42","Heman and Jeduthun had with them trumpets and cymbals for the music and instruments for the songs of God. And the sons of Jeduthun were stationed at the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R116_43","014_16_43","1CH","16","43","43","Then all the people departed for their homes, and David returned home to bless his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_1","014_17_1","1CH","17","1","1","After David had settled into his palace, he said to Nathan the prophet, “Here I am, living in a house of cedar, while the ark of the covenant of the LORD is under a tent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_2","014_17_2","1CH","17","2","2","And Nathan replied to David, “Do all that is in your heart, for God is with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_3","014_17_3","1CH","17","3","3","But that night the word of God came to Nathan, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_4","014_17_4","1CH","17","4","4","“Go and tell My servant David that this is what the LORD says: You are not the one to build Me a house in which to dwell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_5","014_17_5","1CH","17","5","5","For I have not dwelt in a house from the day I brought Israel up out of Egypt until this day, but I have moved from tent to tent and dwelling to dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_6","014_17_6","1CH","17","6","6","In all My journeys with all the Israelites, have I ever asked any of the leaders I appointed to shepherd My people, ‘Why haven’t you built Me a house of cedar?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_7","014_17_7","1CH","17","7","7","Now then, you are to tell My servant David that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: I took you from the pasture, from following the flock, to be the ruler over My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_8","014_17_8","1CH","17","8","8","I have been with you wherever you have gone, and I have cut off all your enemies from before you. Now I will make for you a name like that of the greatest in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_9","014_17_9","1CH","17","9","9","And I will provide a place for My people Israel and will plant them so that they may dwell in a place of their own and be disturbed no more. No longer will the sons of wickedness oppress them as they did at the beginning ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_10","014_17_10","1CH","17","10","10","and have done since the day I appointed judges over My people Israel. And I will subdue all your enemies. Moreover, I declare to you that the LORD will build a house for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_11","014_17_11","1CH","17","11","11","And when your days are fulfilled and you go to be with your fathers, I will raise up your descendant after you, one of your own sons, and I will establish his kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_12","014_17_12","1CH","17","12","12","He will build a house for Me, and I will establish his throne forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_13","014_17_13","1CH","17","13","13","I will be his Father, and he will be My son. And I will never remove My loving devotion from him as I removed it from your predecessor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_14","014_17_14","1CH","17","14","14","But I will set him over My house and My kingdom forever, and his throne will be established forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_15","014_17_15","1CH","17","15","15","So Nathan relayed to David all the words of this entire revelation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_16","014_17_16","1CH","17","16","16","Then King David went in, sat before the LORD, and said, “Who am I, O LORD God, and what is my house, that You have brought me this far? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_17","014_17_17","1CH","17","17","17","And as if this was a small thing in Your eyes, O God, You have spoken about the future of the house of Your servant and have regarded me as a man of great distinction, O LORD God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_18","014_17_18","1CH","17","18","18","What more can David say to You for honoring Your servant? For You know Your servant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_19","014_17_19","1CH","17","19","19","O LORD. For the sake of Your servant and according to Your own heart, You have accomplished this great thing and made known all these great promises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_20","014_17_20","1CH","17","20","20","O LORD, there is none like You, and there is no God but You, according to everything we have heard with our own ears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_21","014_17_21","1CH","17","21","21","And who is like Your people Israel—the one nation on earth whom God went out to redeem as a people for Himself? You made a name for Yourself through great and awesome wonders by driving out nations from before Your people, whom You redeemed from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_22","014_17_22","1CH","17","22","22","For You have made Your people Israel Your very own forever, and You, O LORD, have become their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_23","014_17_23","1CH","17","23","23","And now, O LORD, let the word You have spoken concerning Your servant and his house be established forever. Do as You have promised, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_24","014_17_24","1CH","17","24","24","so that Your name will be established and magnified forever when it is said, ‘The LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, is God over Israel.’ And may the house of Your servant David be established before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_25","014_17_25","1CH","17","25","25","For You, my God, have revealed to Your servant that You will build a house for him. Therefore Your servant has found the courage to pray before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_26","014_17_26","1CH","17","26","26","And now, O LORD, You are God! And You have promised this goodness to Your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R117_27","014_17_27","1CH","17","27","27","So now You have been pleased to bless the house of Your servant, that it may continue forever before You. For You, O LORD, have blessed it, and it will be blessed forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_1","014_18_1","1CH","18","1","1","Some time later, David defeated the Philistines, subdued them, and took Gath and its villages from the hand of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_2","014_18_2","1CH","18","2","2","David also defeated the Moabites, and they became subject to David and brought him tribute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_3","014_18_3","1CH","18","3","3","As far as Hamath, David also defeated King Hadadezer of Zobah, who had marched out to establish his dominion along the Euphrates River. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_4","014_18_4","1CH","18","4","4","David captured from him a thousand chariots, seven thousand charioteers, and twenty thousand foot soldiers, and he hamstrung all the horses except a hundred he kept for the chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_5","014_18_5","1CH","18","5","5","When the Arameans of Damascus came to help King Hadadezer of Zobah, David struck down twenty-two thousand of their men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_6","014_18_6","1CH","18","6","6","Then he placed garrisons in Aram of Damascus, and the Arameans became subject to David and brought him tribute. So the LORD made David victorious wherever he went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_7","014_18_7","1CH","18","7","7","And David took the gold shields that belonged to the officers of Hadadezer and brought them to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_8","014_18_8","1CH","18","8","8","And from Tibhath and Cun, cities of Hadadezer, David took a large amount of bronze, with which Solomon made the bronze Sea, the pillars, and various bronze articles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_9","014_18_9","1CH","18","9","9","When King Tou of Hamath heard that David had defeated the entire army of Hadadezer king of Zobah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_10","014_18_10","1CH","18","10","10","he sent his son Hadoram to greet King David and bless him for fighting and defeating Hadadezer, who had been at war with Tou. Hadoram brought all kinds of articles of gold and silver and bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_11","014_18_11","1CH","18","11","11","and King David dedicated these to the LORD, along with the silver and gold he had carried off from all these nations—from Edom and Moab, and from the Ammonites, Philistines, and Amalekites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_12","014_18_12","1CH","18","12","12","Moreover, Abishai son of Zeruiah struck down eighteen thousand Edomites in the Valley of Salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_13","014_18_13","1CH","18","13","13","He placed garrisons in Edom, and all the Edomites were subject to David. So the LORD made David victorious wherever he went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_14","014_18_14","1CH","18","14","14","Thus David reigned over all Israel and administered justice and righteousness for all his people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_15","014_18_15","1CH","18","15","15","Joab son of Zeruiah was over the army; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_16","014_18_16","1CH","18","16","16","Zadok son of Ahitub and Ahimelech son of Abiathar were priests; Shavsha was the scribe; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R118_17","014_18_17","1CH","18","17","17","Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; and David’s sons were chief officials at the king’s side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_1","014_19_1","1CH","19","1","1","Some time later, Nahash king of the Ammonites died and was succeeded by his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_2","014_19_2","1CH","19","2","2","And David said, “I will show kindness to Hanun son of Nahash, because his father showed kindness to me.” So David sent messengers to console Hanun concerning his father. But when David’s servants arrived in the land of the Ammonites to console him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_3","014_19_3","1CH","19","3","3","the princes of the Ammonites said to Hanun, “Just because David has sent you comforters, do you really believe he is showing respect for your father? Have not his servants come to you to explore the land, spy it out, and overthrow it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_4","014_19_4","1CH","19","4","4","So Hanun took David’s servants, shaved their beards, cut off their garments at the hips, and sent them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_5","014_19_5","1CH","19","5","5","When someone came and told David about his men, he sent messengers to meet them, since the men had been thoroughly humiliated. The king told them, “Stay in Jericho until your beards have grown back, and then return.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_6","014_19_6","1CH","19","6","6","When the Ammonites realized that they had become a stench to David, Hanun and the Ammonites sent a thousand talents of silver to hire for themselves chariots and horsemen from Aram-naharaim, Aram-maacah, and Zobah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_7","014_19_7","1CH","19","7","7","So they hired for themselves thirty-two thousand chariots, as well as the king of Maacah with his troops, who came and camped near Medeba while the Ammonites were mustered from their cities and marched out for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_8","014_19_8","1CH","19","8","8","On hearing this, David sent Joab and the entire army of mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_9","014_19_9","1CH","19","9","9","The Ammonites marched out and arrayed themselves for battle at the entrance to the city, while the kings who had come stayed by themselves in the open country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_10","014_19_10","1CH","19","10","10","When Joab saw the battle lines before him and behind him, he selected some of the best men of Israel and arrayed them against the Arameans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_11","014_19_11","1CH","19","11","11","And he placed the rest of the troops under the command of his brother Abishai, who arrayed them against the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_12","014_19_12","1CH","19","12","12","“If the Arameans are too strong for me,” said Joab, “then you will come to my rescue. And if the Ammonites are too strong for you, then I will come to your rescue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_13","014_19_13","1CH","19","13","13","Be strong and let us fight bravely for our people and for the cities of our God. May the LORD do what is good in His sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_14","014_19_14","1CH","19","14","14","So Joab and his troops advanced to fight the Arameans, who fled before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_15","014_19_15","1CH","19","15","15","When the Ammonites saw that the Arameans had fled, they too fled before Joab’s brother Abishai, and they entered the city. So Joab went back to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_16","014_19_16","1CH","19","16","16","When the Arameans saw that they had been defeated by Israel, they sent messengers to bring more Arameans from beyond the Euphrates, with Shophach the commander of Hadadezer’s army leading them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_17","014_19_17","1CH","19","17","17","When this was reported to David, he gathered all Israel, crossed the Jordan, advanced toward the Arameans, and arrayed for battle against them. When David lined up to engage them in battle, they fought against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_18","014_19_18","1CH","19","18","18","But the Arameans fled before Israel, and David killed seven thousand of their charioteers and forty thousand foot soldiers. He also killed Shophach the commander of their army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R119_19","014_19_19","1CH","19","19","19","When Hadadezer’s subjects saw that they had been defeated by Israel, they made peace with David and became subject to him. So the Arameans were unwilling to help the Ammonites anymore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_1","014_20_1","1CH","20","1","1","In the spring, at the time when kings march out to war, Joab led out the army and ravaged the land of the Ammonites. He came to Rabbah and besieged it, but David remained in Jerusalem. And Joab attacked Rabbah and demolished it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_2","014_20_2","1CH","20","2","2","Then David took the crown from the head of their king. It was found to weigh a talent of gold and was set with precious stones, and it was placed on David’s head. And David took a great amount of plunder from the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_3","014_20_3","1CH","20","3","3","David brought out the people who were there and put them to work with saws, iron picks, and axes. And he did the same to all the Ammonite cities. Then David and all his troops returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_4","014_20_4","1CH","20","4","4","Some time later, war broke out with the Philistines at Gezer. At that time Sibbecai the Hushathite killed Sippai, a descendant of the Rephaim, and the Philistines were subdued. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_5","014_20_5","1CH","20","5","5","Once again there was a battle with the Philistines, and Elhanan son of Jair killed Lahmi the brother of Goliath the Gittite, the shaft of whose spear was like a weaver’s beam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_6","014_20_6","1CH","20","6","6","And there was also a battle at Gath, where there was a man of great stature with six fingers on each hand and six toes on each foot—twenty-four in all. He too was descended from Rapha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_7","014_20_7","1CH","20","7","7","and when he taunted Israel, Jonathan the son of David’s brother Shimei killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R120_8","014_20_8","1CH","20","8","8","So these descendants of Rapha in Gath fell at the hands of David and his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_1","014_21_1","1CH","21","1","1","Then Satan rose up against Israel and incited David to take a census of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_2","014_21_2","1CH","21","2","2","So David said to Joab and the commanders of the troops, “Go and count the Israelites from Beersheba to Dan and bring me a report, so that I may know their number.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_3","014_21_3","1CH","21","3","3","But Joab replied, “May the LORD multiply His troops a hundred times over. My lord the king, are they not all servants of my lord? Why does my lord want to do this? Why should he bring guilt on Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_4","014_21_4","1CH","21","4","4","Nevertheless, the king’s word prevailed against Joab. So Joab departed and traveled throughout Israel, and then he returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_5","014_21_5","1CH","21","5","5","And Joab reported to David the total number of the troops. In all Israel there were 1,100,000 men who drew the sword, including 470,000 in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_6","014_21_6","1CH","21","6","6","But Joab did not include Levi and Benjamin in the count, because the king’s command was detestable to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_7","014_21_7","1CH","21","7","7","This command was also evil in the sight of God; so He struck Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_8","014_21_8","1CH","21","8","8","Then David said to God, “I have sinned greatly because I have done this thing. Now I beg You to take away the iniquity of Your servant, for I have acted very foolishly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_9","014_21_9","1CH","21","9","9","And the LORD instructed Gad, David’s seer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_10","014_21_10","1CH","21","10","10","“Go and tell David that this is what the LORD says: ‘I am offering you three options. Choose one of them, and I will carry it out against you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_11","014_21_11","1CH","21","11","11","So Gad went and said to David, “This is what the LORD says: ‘You must choose ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_12","014_21_12","1CH","21","12","12","between three years of famine, three months of being swept away before your enemies and overtaken by their swords, or three days of the sword of the LORD—days of plague upon the land, with the angel of the LORD ravaging every part of Israel.’ Now then, decide how I should reply to Him who sent me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_13","014_21_13","1CH","21","13","13","David answered Gad, “I am deeply distressed. Please, let me fall into the hand of the LORD, for His mercies are very great; but do not let me fall into the hands of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_14","014_21_14","1CH","21","14","14","So the LORD sent a plague upon Israel, and seventy thousand men of Israel fell dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_15","014_21_15","1CH","21","15","15","Then God sent an angel to destroy Jerusalem, but as the angel was doing so, the LORD saw it and relented from the calamity, and He said to the angel who was destroying the people, “Enough! Withdraw your hand now!” At that time the angel of the LORD was standing by the threshing floor of Ornan the Jebusite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_16","014_21_16","1CH","21","16","16","When David lifted up his eyes and saw the angel of the LORD standing between heaven and earth, with a drawn sword in his hand stretched out over Jerusalem, David and the elders, clothed in sackcloth, fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_17","014_21_17","1CH","21","17","17","And David said to God, “Was it not I who gave the order to count the people? I am the one who has sinned and acted wickedly. But these sheep, what have they done? O LORD my God, please let Your hand fall upon me and my father’s house, but do not let this plague remain upon Your people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_18","014_21_18","1CH","21","18","18","Then the angel of the LORD ordered Gad to tell David to go up and build an altar to the LORD on the threshing floor of Ornan the Jebusite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_19","014_21_19","1CH","21","19","19","So David went up at the word that Gad had spoken in the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_20","014_21_20","1CH","21","20","20","Now Ornan was threshing wheat when he turned and saw the angel; and his four sons who were with him hid themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_21","014_21_21","1CH","21","21","21","David came to Ornan, and when Ornan looked out and saw David, he left the threshing floor and bowed facedown before David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_22","014_21_22","1CH","21","22","22","Then David said to Ornan, “Grant me the site of this threshing floor, that I may build an altar to the LORD. Sell it to me for the full price, so that the plague upon the people may be halted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_23","014_21_23","1CH","21","23","23","Ornan said to David, “Take it! May my lord the king do whatever seems good to him. Look, I will give the oxen for the burnt offerings, the threshing sledges for the wood, and the wheat for the grain offering—I will give it all.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_24","014_21_24","1CH","21","24","24","“No,” replied King David, “I insist on paying the full price, for I will not take for the LORD what belongs to you, nor will I offer burnt offerings that cost me nothing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_25","014_21_25","1CH","21","25","25","So David paid Ornan six hundred shekels of gold for the site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_26","014_21_26","1CH","21","26","26","And there he built an altar to the LORD and offered burnt offerings and peace offerings. He called upon the LORD, who answered him with fire from heaven on the altar of burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_27","014_21_27","1CH","21","27","27","Then the LORD spoke to the angel, who put his sword back into its sheath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_28","014_21_28","1CH","21","28","28","At that time, when David saw that the LORD had answered him at the threshing floor of Ornan the Jebusite, he offered sacrifices there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_29","014_21_29","1CH","21","29","29","For the tabernacle of the LORD that Moses had made in the wilderness and the altar of burnt offering were presently at the high place in Gibeon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R121_30","014_21_30","1CH","21","30","30","but David could not go before it to inquire of God, because he was afraid of the sword of the angel of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_1","014_22_1","1CH","22","1","1","Then David said, “Here shall be the house of the LORD God, as well as the altar of burnt offering for Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_2","014_22_2","1CH","22","2","2","So David gave orders to gather the foreigners in the land of Israel, from whom he appointed stonecutters to prepare finished stones for building the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_3","014_22_3","1CH","22","3","3","David provided a large quantity of iron to make the nails for the doors of the gateways and for the fittings, together with more bronze than could be weighed ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_4","014_22_4","1CH","22","4","4","and more cedar logs than could be counted; for the Sidonians and Tyrians had brought a large quantity of cedar logs to David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_5","014_22_5","1CH","22","5","5","And David said, “My son Solomon is young and inexperienced, and the house to be built for the LORD must be exceedingly magnificent—famous and glorious throughout all lands. Therefore I must make preparations for it.” So David made lavish preparations before his death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_6","014_22_6","1CH","22","6","6","Then David called for his son Solomon and instructed him to build a house for the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_7","014_22_7","1CH","22","7","7","“My son,” said David to Solomon, “it was in my heart to build a house for the Name of the LORD my God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_8","014_22_8","1CH","22","8","8","but this word of the LORD came to me: ‘You have shed much blood and waged great wars. You are not to build a house for My Name because you have shed so much blood on the ground before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_9","014_22_9","1CH","22","9","9","But a son will be born to you who will be a man of rest. I will give him rest from all his enemies on every side; for his name will be Solomon, and I will grant to Israel peace and quiet during his reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_10","014_22_10","1CH","22","10","10","He is the one who will build a house for My Name. He will be My son, and I will be his Father. And I will establish the throne of his kingdom over Israel forever.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_11","014_22_11","1CH","22","11","11","Now, my son, may the LORD be with you, and may you succeed in building the house of the LORD your God, as He said you would. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_12","014_22_12","1CH","22","12","12","Above all, may the LORD give you insight and understanding when He puts you in command over Israel, so that you may keep the Law of the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_13","014_22_13","1CH","22","13","13","Then you will succeed, if you carefully follow the statutes and ordinances that the LORD commanded Moses for Israel. Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid or discouraged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_14","014_22_14","1CH","22","14","14","Now behold, I have taken great pains to provide for the house of the LORD—100,000 talents of gold, 1,000,000 talents of silver, and bronze and iron too great to be weighed. I have also provided timber and stone, and you may add to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_15","014_22_15","1CH","22","15","15","You also have many workers: stonecutters, masons, carpenters, and men skilled in every kind of work— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_16","014_22_16","1CH","22","16","16","in gold and silver, bronze and iron—craftsmen beyond number. Now begin the work, and may the LORD be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_17","014_22_17","1CH","22","17","17","Then David ordered all the leaders of Israel to help his son Solomon: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_18","014_22_18","1CH","22","18","18","“Is not the LORD your God with you, and has He not granted you rest on every side? For He has given the inhabitants of the land into my hand, and the land has been subdued before the LORD and His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R122_19","014_22_19","1CH","22","19","19","Now set your heart and soul to seek the LORD your God. Begin building the sanctuary of the LORD God, so that you may bring the ark of the covenant of the LORD and the holy articles of God into the temple that will be built for the Name of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_1","014_23_1","1CH","23","1","1","When David was old and full of years, he installed his son Solomon as king over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_2","014_23_2","1CH","23","2","2","Then he gathered all the leaders of Israel, as well as the priests and Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_3","014_23_3","1CH","23","3","3","The Levites thirty years of age or older were counted, and the total number of men was 38,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_4","014_23_4","1CH","23","4","4","“Of these,” said David, “24,000 are to oversee the work of the house of the LORD, 6,000 are to be officers and judges, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_5","014_23_5","1CH","23","5","5","4,000 are to be gatekeepers, and 4,000 are to praise the LORD with the instruments I have made for giving praise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_6","014_23_6","1CH","23","6","6","Then David divided the Levites into divisions according to the sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_7","014_23_7","1CH","23","7","7","The Gershonites: Ladan and Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_8","014_23_8","1CH","23","8","8","The sons of Ladan: Jehiel the first, Zetham, and Joel—three in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_9","014_23_9","1CH","23","9","9","The sons of Shimei: Shelomoth, Haziel, and Haran—three in all. These were the heads of the families of Ladan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_10","014_23_10","1CH","23","10","10","And the sons of Shimei: Jahath, Zina, Jeush, and Beriah. These were the sons of Shimei—four in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_11","014_23_11","1CH","23","11","11","Jahath was the first and Zizah was the second; but Jeush and Beriah did not have many sons, so they were counted as one family and received a single assignment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_12","014_23_12","1CH","23","12","12","The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel—four in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_13","014_23_13","1CH","23","13","13","The sons of Amram: Aaron and Moses. Aaron and his descendants were set apart forever to consecrate the most holy things, to burn incense before the LORD, to minister before Him, and to pronounce blessings in His name forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_14","014_23_14","1CH","23","14","14","As for Moses the man of God, his sons were named among the tribe of Levi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_15","014_23_15","1CH","23","15","15","The sons of Moses: Gershom and Eliezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_16","014_23_16","1CH","23","16","16","The descendants of Gershom: Shebuel was the first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_17","014_23_17","1CH","23","17","17","The descendants of Eliezer: Rehabiah was the first. Eliezer did not have any other sons, but the sons of Rehabiah were very numerous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_18","014_23_18","1CH","23","18","18","The sons of Izhar: Shelomith was the first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_19","014_23_19","1CH","23","19","19","The sons of Hebron: Jeriah was the first, Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, and Jekameam the fourth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_20","014_23_20","1CH","23","20","20","The sons of Uzziel: Micah was the first and Isshiah the second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_21","014_23_21","1CH","23","21","21","The sons of Merari: Mahli and Mushi. The sons of Mahli: Eleazar and Kish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_22","014_23_22","1CH","23","22","22","Eleazar died without having any sons; he had only daughters. Their cousins, the sons of Kish, married them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_23","014_23_23","1CH","23","23","23","The sons of Mushi: Mahli, Eder, and Jeremoth—three in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_24","014_23_24","1CH","23","24","24","These were the descendants of Levi by their families—the heads of families, registered individually by name—those twenty years of age or older who worked in the service of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_25","014_23_25","1CH","23","25","25","For David had said, “The LORD, the God of Israel, has given rest to His people and has come to dwell in Jerusalem forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_26","014_23_26","1CH","23","26","26","So now the Levites no longer need to carry the tabernacle or any of the articles for its service.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_27","014_23_27","1CH","23","27","27","For according to the final instructions of David, the Levites twenty years of age or older were counted, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_28","014_23_28","1CH","23","28","28","but their duty was to assist the descendants of Aaron with the service of the house of the LORD, being responsible for the courts and chambers, the purification of all the holy things, and the work of the service of the house of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_29","014_23_29","1CH","23","29","29","as well as for the rows of the showbread, the fine flour for the grain offering, the wafers of unleavened bread, the baking, the mixing, and all measurements of quantity and size. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_30","014_23_30","1CH","23","30","30","They were also to stand every morning to give thanks and praise to the LORD, and likewise in the evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_31","014_23_31","1CH","23","31","31","Whenever burnt offerings were presented to the LORD on the Sabbaths, New Moons, and appointed feasts, they were to serve regularly before the LORD in the numbers prescribed for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R123_32","014_23_32","1CH","23","32","32","So the Levites were to carry out the responsibilities for the Tent of Meeting and the Holy Place, and, under their brothers the descendants of Aaron, the service of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_1","014_24_1","1CH","24","1","1","These were the divisions of the descendants of Aaron. The sons of Aaron were Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_2","014_24_2","1CH","24","2","2","But Nadab and Abihu died before their father did, and they had no sons; so Eleazar and Ithamar served as priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_3","014_24_3","1CH","24","3","3","With the help of Eleazar’s descendant Zadok and Ithamar’s descendant Ahimelech, David divided them according to the offices of their service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_4","014_24_4","1CH","24","4","4","Since more leaders were found among Eleazar’s descendants than those of Ithamar, they were divided accordingly. There were sixteen heads of families from the descendants of Eleazar and eight from the descendants of Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_5","014_24_5","1CH","24","5","5","Thus they were divided by lot, for there were officers of the sanctuary and officers of God among both Eleazar’s and Ithamar’s descendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_6","014_24_6","1CH","24","6","6","The scribe, Shemaiah son of Nethanel, a Levite, recorded their names in the presence of the king and of the officers: Zadok the priest, Ahimelech son of Abiathar, and the heads of families of the priests and the Levites—one family being taken from Eleazar, and then one from Ithamar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_7","014_24_7","1CH","24","7","7","The first lot fell to Jehoiarib, the second to Jedaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_8","014_24_8","1CH","24","8","8","the third to Harim, the fourth to Seorim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_9","014_24_9","1CH","24","9","9","the fifth to Malchijah, the sixth to Mijamin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_10","014_24_10","1CH","24","10","10","the seventh to Hakkoz, the eighth to Abijah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_11","014_24_11","1CH","24","11","11","the ninth to Jeshua, the tenth to Shecaniah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_12","014_24_12","1CH","24","12","12","the eleventh to Eliashib, the twelfth to Jakim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_13","014_24_13","1CH","24","13","13","the thirteenth to Huppah, the fourteenth to Jeshebeab, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_14","014_24_14","1CH","24","14","14","the fifteenth to Bilgah, the sixteenth to Immer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_15","014_24_15","1CH","24","15","15","the seventeenth to Hezir, the eighteenth to Happizzez, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_16","014_24_16","1CH","24","16","16","the nineteenth to Pethahiah, the twentieth to Jehezkel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_17","014_24_17","1CH","24","17","17","the twenty-first to Jachin, the twenty-second to Gamul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_18","014_24_18","1CH","24","18","18","the twenty-third to Delaiah, and the twenty-fourth to Maaziah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_19","014_24_19","1CH","24","19","19","This was their appointed order for service when they entered the house of the LORD, according to the regulations prescribed for them by their forefather Aaron, as the LORD, the God of Israel, had commanded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_20","014_24_20","1CH","24","20","20","Now these were the rest of the descendants of Levi: From the sons of Amram: Shubael; from the sons of Shubael: Jehdeiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_21","014_24_21","1CH","24","21","21","As for Rehabiah, from his sons: The first was Isshiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_22","014_24_22","1CH","24","22","22","From the Izharites: Shelomoth; from the sons of Shelomoth: Jahath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_23","014_24_23","1CH","24","23","23","From the sons of Hebron: Jeriah was the first, Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, and Jekameam the fourth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_24","014_24_24","1CH","24","24","24","From the sons of Uzziel: Micah; from the sons of Micah: Shamir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_25","014_24_25","1CH","24","25","25","The brother of Micah: Isshiah; from the sons of Isshiah: Zechariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_26","014_24_26","1CH","24","26","26","The sons of Merari: Mahli and Mushi. The son of Jaaziah: Beno. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_27","014_24_27","1CH","24","27","27","The descendants of Merari from Jaaziah: Beno, Shoham, Zaccur, and Ibri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_28","014_24_28","1CH","24","28","28","From Mahli: Eleazar, who had no sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_29","014_24_29","1CH","24","29","29","From Kish: Jerahmeel the son of Kish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_30","014_24_30","1CH","24","30","30","And the sons of Mushi: Mahli, Eder, and Jerimoth. These were the sons of the Levites, according to their families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R124_31","014_24_31","1CH","24","31","31","As their brothers the descendants of Aaron did, they also cast lots in the presence of King David and of Zadok, Ahimelech, and the heads of the families of the priests and Levites—the family heads and their younger brothers alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_1","014_25_1","1CH","25","1","1","Additionally, David and the commanders of the army set apart some of the sons of Asaph, Heman, and Jeduthun to prophesy with the accompaniment of lyres, harps, and cymbals. The following is the list of the men who performed this service: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_2","014_25_2","1CH","25","2","2","From the sons of Asaph: Zaccur, Joseph, Nethaniah, and Asarelah. These sons of Asaph were under the direction of Asaph, who prophesied under the direction of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_3","014_25_3","1CH","25","3","3","From the sons of Jeduthun: Gedaliah, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah, and Mattithiah—six in all—under the direction of their father Jeduthun, who prophesied with the harp, giving thanks and praise to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_4","014_25_4","1CH","25","4","4","From the sons of Heman: Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel, Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, Romamti-ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, and Mahazioth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_5","014_25_5","1CH","25","5","5","All these sons of Heman the king’s seer were given him through the promises of God to exalt him, for God had given Heman fourteen sons and three daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_6","014_25_6","1CH","25","6","6","All these were under the direction of their fathers for the music of the house of the LORD with cymbals, harps, and lyres, for the service of the house of God. Asaph, Jeduthun, and Heman were under the direction of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_7","014_25_7","1CH","25","7","7","Together with their relatives, who were all trained and skillful in the songs of the LORD, they numbered 288. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_8","014_25_8","1CH","25","8","8","They cast lots for their duties, young and old alike, teacher as well as pupil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_9","014_25_9","1CH","25","9","9","The first lot, which was for Asaph, fell to Joseph, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; the second to Gedaliah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_10","014_25_10","1CH","25","10","10","the third to Zaccur, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_11","014_25_11","1CH","25","11","11","the fourth to Izri, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_12","014_25_12","1CH","25","12","12","the fifth to Nethaniah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_13","014_25_13","1CH","25","13","13","the sixth to Bukkiah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_14","014_25_14","1CH","25","14","14","the seventh to Jesarelah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_15","014_25_15","1CH","25","15","15","the eighth to Jeshaiah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_16","014_25_16","1CH","25","16","16","the ninth to Mattaniah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_17","014_25_17","1CH","25","17","17","the tenth to Shimei, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_18","014_25_18","1CH","25","18","18","the eleventh to Azarel, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_19","014_25_19","1CH","25","19","19","the twelfth to Hashabiah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_20","014_25_20","1CH","25","20","20","the thirteenth to Shubael, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_21","014_25_21","1CH","25","21","21","the fourteenth to Mattithiah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_22","014_25_22","1CH","25","22","22","the fifteenth to Jeremoth, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_23","014_25_23","1CH","25","23","23","the sixteenth to Hananiah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_24","014_25_24","1CH","25","24","24","the seventeenth to Joshbekashah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_25","014_25_25","1CH","25","25","25","the eighteenth to Hanani, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_26","014_25_26","1CH","25","26","26","the nineteenth to Mallothi, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_27","014_25_27","1CH","25","27","27","the twentieth to Eliathah, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_28","014_25_28","1CH","25","28","28","the twenty-first to Hothir, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_29","014_25_29","1CH","25","29","29","the twenty-second to Giddalti, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_30","014_25_30","1CH","25","30","30","the twenty-third to Mahazioth, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R125_31","014_25_31","1CH","25","31","31","and the twenty-fourth to Romamti-ezer, his sons, and his brothers—12 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_1","014_26_1","1CH","26","1","1","These were the divisions of the gatekeepers: From the Korahites: Meshelemiah son of Kore, one of the sons of Asaph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_2","014_26_2","1CH","26","2","2","Meshelemiah had sons: Zechariah the firstborn, Jediael the second, Zebadiah the third, Jathniel the fourth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_3","014_26_3","1CH","26","3","3","Elam the fifth, Jehohanan the sixth, and Eliehoenai the seventh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_4","014_26_4","1CH","26","4","4","And Obed-edom also had sons: Shemaiah the firstborn, Jehozabad the second, Joah the third, Sachar the fourth, Nethanel the fifth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_5","014_26_5","1CH","26","5","5","Ammiel the sixth, Issachar the seventh, and Peullethai the eighth. For God had blessed Obed-edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_6","014_26_6","1CH","26","6","6","Also to his son Shemaiah were born sons who ruled over their families because they were strong, capable men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_7","014_26_7","1CH","26","7","7","Shemaiah’s sons were Othni, Rephael, Obed, and Elzabad; his brothers were Elihu and Semachiah, also capable men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_8","014_26_8","1CH","26","8","8","All these were descendants of Obed-edom; they and their sons and brothers were capable men with strength to do the work—62 in all from Obed-edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_9","014_26_9","1CH","26","9","9","Meshelemiah also had sons and brothers who were capable men—18 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_10","014_26_10","1CH","26","10","10","Hosah the Merarite also had sons: Shimri the first (although he was not the firstborn, his father had appointed him as the first), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_11","014_26_11","1CH","26","11","11","Hilkiah the second, Tebaliah the third, and Zechariah the fourth. The sons and brothers of Hosah numbered 13 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_12","014_26_12","1CH","26","12","12","These divisions of the gatekeepers, through their chief men, had duties for ministering in the house of the LORD, just as their relatives did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_13","014_26_13","1CH","26","13","13","They cast lots for each gate, according to their families, young and old alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_14","014_26_14","1CH","26","14","14","The lot for the East Gate fell to Shelemiah. Then lots were cast for his son Zechariah, a wise counselor, and the lot for the North Gate fell to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_15","014_26_15","1CH","26","15","15","The lot for the South Gate fell to Obed-edom, and the lot for the storehouses to his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_16","014_26_16","1CH","26","16","16","The lots for the West Gate and the Shallecheth Gate on the ascending highway fell to Shuppim and Hosah. There were guards stationed at every watch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_17","014_26_17","1CH","26","17","17","Each day there were six Levites on the east, four on the north, four on the south, and two pairs at the storehouse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_18","014_26_18","1CH","26","18","18","As for the court on the west, there were four at the highway and two at the court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_19","014_26_19","1CH","26","19","19","These were the divisions of the gatekeepers who were descendants of Korah and Merari. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_20","014_26_20","1CH","26","20","20","Now their fellow Levites were in charge of the treasuries of the house of God and the treasuries of the dedicated things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_21","014_26_21","1CH","26","21","21","From the descendants of Ladan, who were Gershonites through Ladan and heads of the families of Ladan the Gershonite, were Jehieli, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_22","014_26_22","1CH","26","22","22","the sons of Jehieli, Zetham, and his brother Joel. They were in charge of the treasuries of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_23","014_26_23","1CH","26","23","23","From the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites, and the Uzzielites: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_24","014_26_24","1CH","26","24","24","Shebuel, a descendant of Gershom son of Moses, was the officer in charge of the treasuries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_25","014_26_25","1CH","26","25","25","His relatives through Eliezer included Rehabiah his son, Jeshaiah his son, Joram his son, Zichri his son, and Shelomith his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_26","014_26_26","1CH","26","26","26","This Shelomith and his brothers were in charge of all the treasuries for the things dedicated by King David, by the heads of families who were the commanders of thousands and of hundreds, and by the army commanders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_27","014_26_27","1CH","26","27","27","They had dedicated some of the plunder from their battles to the repair of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_28","014_26_28","1CH","26","28","28","Everything that had been dedicated by Samuel the seer, Saul son of Kish, Abner son of Ner, and Joab son of Zeruiah, along with everything else that was dedicated, was under the care of Shelomith and his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_29","014_26_29","1CH","26","29","29","From the Izharites, Chenaniah and his sons had the outside duties as officers and judges over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_30","014_26_30","1CH","26","30","30","From the Hebronites, Hashabiah and his relatives, 1,700 capable men, had charge of the affairs of Israel west of the Jordan for all the work of the LORD and for the service of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_31","014_26_31","1CH","26","31","31","As for the Hebronites, Jerijah was the chief of the Hebronites, according to the genealogies of his ancestors. In the fortieth year of David’s reign the records were searched, and strong, capable men were found among the Hebronites at Jazer in Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R126_32","014_26_32","1CH","26","32","32","Among Jerijah’s relatives there were 2,700 capable men who were heads of families. King David appointed them over the Reubenites, the Gadites, and the half-tribe of Manasseh for every matter pertaining to God and for the affairs of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_1","014_27_1","1CH","27","1","1","This is the list of the Israelites—the heads of families, the commanders of thousands and of hundreds, and their officers who served the king in every matter concerning the divisions on rotating military duty each month throughout the year. There were 24,000 men in each division: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_2","014_27_2","1CH","27","2","2","Jashobeam son of Zabdiel was in charge of the first division, which was assigned the first month. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_3","014_27_3","1CH","27","3","3","He was a descendant of Perez and chief of all the army commanders for the first month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_4","014_27_4","1CH","27","4","4","Dodai the Ahohite was in charge of the division for the second month, and Mikloth was the leader. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_5","014_27_5","1CH","27","5","5","The third army commander, as chief for the third month, was Benaiah son of Jehoiada the priest. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_6","014_27_6","1CH","27","6","6","This Benaiah was mighty among the Thirty and was over the Thirty, and his son Ammizabad was in charge of his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_7","014_27_7","1CH","27","7","7","The fourth, for the fourth month, was Joab’s brother Asahel, and his son Zebadiah was commander after him. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_8","014_27_8","1CH","27","8","8","The fifth, for the fifth month, was the commander Shamhuth the Izrahite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_9","014_27_9","1CH","27","9","9","The sixth, for the sixth month, was Ira son of Ikkesh the Tekoite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_10","014_27_10","1CH","27","10","10","The seventh, for the seventh month, was Helez the Pelonite, an Ephraimite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_11","014_27_11","1CH","27","11","11","The eighth, for the eighth month, was Sibbecai the Hushathite, a Zerahite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_12","014_27_12","1CH","27","12","12","The ninth, for the ninth month, was Abiezer the Anathothite, a Benjamite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_13","014_27_13","1CH","27","13","13","The tenth, for the tenth month, was Maharai the Netophathite, a Zerahite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_14","014_27_14","1CH","27","14","14","The eleventh, for the eleventh month, was Benaiah the Pirathonite, an Ephraimite. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_15","014_27_15","1CH","27","15","15","The twelfth, for the twelfth month, was Heldai the Netophathite, from the family of Othniel. There were 24,000 men in his division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_16","014_27_16","1CH","27","16","16","These officers were in charge of the tribes of Israel: Over the Reubenites was Eliezer son of Zichri; over the Simeonites was Shephatiah son of Maacah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_17","014_27_17","1CH","27","17","17","over Levi was Hashabiah son of Kemuel; over Aaron was Zadok; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_18","014_27_18","1CH","27","18","18","over Judah was Elihu, one of David’s brothers; over Issachar was Omri son of Michael; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_19","014_27_19","1CH","27","19","19","over Zebulun was Ishmaiah son of Obadiah; over Naphtali was Jerimoth son of Azriel; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_20","014_27_20","1CH","27","20","20","over the Ephraimites was Hoshea son of Azaziah; over one of the half-tribes of Manasseh was Joel son of Pedaiah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_21","014_27_21","1CH","27","21","21","over the half-tribe of Manasseh in Gilead was Iddo son of Zechariah; over Benjamin was Jaasiel son of Abner; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_22","014_27_22","1CH","27","22","22","and over Dan was Azarel son of Jeroham. These were the leaders of the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_23","014_27_23","1CH","27","23","23","David did not count the men aged twenty or under, because the LORD had said that He would make Israel as numerous as the stars of the sky. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_24","014_27_24","1CH","27","24","24","Joab son of Zeruiah began to count the men but did not finish. For because of this census wrath came upon Israel, and the number was not entered in the Book of the Chronicles of King David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_25","014_27_25","1CH","27","25","25","Azmaveth son of Adiel was in charge of the royal storehouses. Jonathan son of Uzziah was in charge of the storehouses in the country, in the cities, in the villages, and in the fortresses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_26","014_27_26","1CH","27","26","26","Ezri son of Chelub was in charge of the workers in the fields who tilled the soil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_27","014_27_27","1CH","27","27","27","Shimei the Ramathite was in charge of the vineyards. Zabdi the Shiphmite was in charge of the produce of the vineyards for the wine vats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_28","014_27_28","1CH","27","28","28","Baal-hanan the Gederite was in charge of the olive and sycamore trees in the foothills. Joash was in charge of the stores of olive oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_29","014_27_29","1CH","27","29","29","Shitrai the Sharonite was in charge of the herds grazing in Sharon. Shaphat son of Adlai was in charge of the herds in the valleys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_30","014_27_30","1CH","27","30","30","Obil the Ishmaelite was in charge of the camels. Jehdeiah the Meronothite was in charge of the donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_31","014_27_31","1CH","27","31","31","Jaziz the Hagrite was in charge of the flocks. All these officials were in charge of King David’s property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_32","014_27_32","1CH","27","32","32","David’s uncle Jonathan was a counselor; he was a man of insight and a scribe. Jehiel son of Hachmoni attended to the sons of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_33","014_27_33","1CH","27","33","33","Ahithophel was the king’s counselor. Hushai the Archite was the king’s friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R127_34","014_27_34","1CH","27","34","34","Ahithophel was succeeded by Jehoiada son of Benaiah, then by Abiathar. Joab was the commander of the king’s army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_1","014_28_1","1CH","28","1","1","Now David summoned all the leaders of Israel to Jerusalem: the leaders of the tribes, the leaders of the divisions in the king’s service, the commanders of thousands and of hundreds, and the officials in charge of all the property and cattle of the king and his sons, along with the court officials and mighty men—every mighty man of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_2","014_28_2","1CH","28","2","2","Then King David rose to his feet and said, “Listen to me, my brothers and my people. It was in my heart to build a house as a resting place for the ark of the covenant of the LORD and as a footstool for our God. I had made preparations to build it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_3","014_28_3","1CH","28","3","3","but God said to me, ‘You are not to build a house for My Name, because you are a man of war who has shed blood.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_4","014_28_4","1CH","28","4","4","Yet the LORD, the God of Israel, chose me out of all my father’s house to be king over Israel forever. For He chose Judah as leader, and from the house of Judah He chose my father’s household, and from my father’s sons He was pleased to make me king over all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_5","014_28_5","1CH","28","5","5","And of all my sons—for the LORD has given me many sons—He has chosen Solomon my son to sit on the throne of the kingdom of the LORD over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_6","014_28_6","1CH","28","6","6","And He said to me, ‘Solomon your son is the one who will build My house and My courts, for I have chosen him as My son, and I will be his Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_7","014_28_7","1CH","28","7","7","I will establish his kingdom forever, if he resolutely carries out My commandments and ordinances, as is being done this day.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_8","014_28_8","1CH","28","8","8","So now in the sight of all Israel, the assembly of the LORD, and in the hearing of our God, keep and seek out all the commandments of the LORD your God, so that you may possess this good land and leave it as an inheritance to your descendants forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_9","014_28_9","1CH","28","9","9","As for you, Solomon my son, know the God of your father and serve Him wholeheartedly and with a willing mind, for the LORD searches every heart and understands the intent of every thought. If you seek Him, He will be found by you; but if you forsake Him, He will reject you forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_10","014_28_10","1CH","28","10","10","Consider now that the LORD has chosen you to build a house for the sanctuary. Be strong and do it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_11","014_28_11","1CH","28","11","11","Then David gave his son Solomon the plans for the portico of the temple, its buildings, storehouses, upper rooms, inner rooms, and the room for the mercy seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_12","014_28_12","1CH","28","12","12","The plans contained everything David had in mind for the courts of the house of the LORD, for all the surrounding rooms, for the treasuries of the house of God and of the dedicated things, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_13","014_28_13","1CH","28","13","13","for the divisions of the priests and Levites, for all the work of service in the house of the LORD, and for all the articles of service in the house of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_14","014_28_14","1CH","28","14","14","the weight of all the gold articles for every kind of service; the weight of all the silver articles for every kind of service; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_15","014_28_15","1CH","28","15","15","the weight of the gold lampstands and their lamps, including the weight of each lampstand and its lamps; the weight of each silver lampstand and its lamps, according to the use of each lampstand; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_16","014_28_16","1CH","28","16","16","the weight of gold for each table of showbread, and of silver for the silver tables; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_17","014_28_17","1CH","28","17","17","the weight of the pure gold for the forks, sprinkling bowls, and pitchers; the weight of each gold dish; the weight of each silver bowl; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_18","014_28_18","1CH","28","18","18","the weight of the refined gold for the altar of incense; and the plans for the chariot of the gold cherubim that spread their wings and overshadowed the ark of the covenant of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_19","014_28_19","1CH","28","19","19","“All this,” said David, “all the details of this plan, the LORD has made clear to me in writing by His hand upon me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_20","014_28_20","1CH","28","20","20","David also said to Solomon his son, “Be strong and courageous, and do it. Do not be afraid or discouraged, for the LORD God, my God, is with you. He will neither fail you nor forsake you before all the work for the service of the house of the LORD is finished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R128_21","014_28_21","1CH","28","21","21","The divisions of the priests and Levites are ready for all the service of the house of God, and every willing man of every skill will be at your disposal for the work. The officials and all the people are fully at your command.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_1","014_29_1","1CH","29","1","1","Then King David said to the whole assembly, “My son Solomon, the one whom God has chosen, is young and inexperienced. The task is great because this palace is not for man, but for the LORD God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_2","014_29_2","1CH","29","2","2","Now with all my ability I have made provision for the house of my God—gold for the gold articles, silver for the silver, bronze for the bronze, iron for the iron, and wood for the wood, as well as onyx for the settings, turquoise, stones of various colors, all kinds of precious stones, and slabs of marble—all in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_3","014_29_3","1CH","29","3","3","Moreover, because of my delight in the house of my God, I now give for it my personal treasures of gold and silver, over and above all that I have provided for this holy temple: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_4","014_29_4","1CH","29","4","4","three thousand talents of gold (the gold of Ophir) and seven thousand talents of refined silver, to overlay the walls of the buildings, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_5","014_29_5","1CH","29","5","5","for the gold work and the silver work, and for all the work to be done by the craftsmen. Now who is willing to consecrate himself to the LORD today?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_6","014_29_6","1CH","29","6","6","Then the leaders of the families, the officers of the tribes of Israel, the commanders of thousands and of hundreds, and the officials in charge of the king’s work gave willingly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_7","014_29_7","1CH","29","7","7","Toward the service of God’s house they gave 5,000 talents and 10,000 darics of gold, 10,000 talents of silver, 18,000 talents of bronze, and 100,000 talents of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_8","014_29_8","1CH","29","8","8","Whoever had precious stones gave them to the treasury of the house of the LORD, under the care of Jehiel the Gershonite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_9","014_29_9","1CH","29","9","9","And the people rejoiced at the willing response of their leaders, for they had given to the LORD freely and wholeheartedly. And King David also rejoiced greatly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_10","014_29_10","1CH","29","10","10","Then David blessed the LORD in the sight of all the assembly and said: “May You be blessed, O LORD, God of our father Israel, from everlasting to everlasting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_11","014_29_11","1CH","29","11","11","Yours, O LORD, is the greatness and the power and the glory and the splendor and the majesty, for everything in heaven and on earth belongs to You. Yours, O LORD, is the kingdom, and You are exalted as head over all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_12","014_29_12","1CH","29","12","12","Both riches and honor come from You, and You are the ruler over all. In Your hands are power and might to exalt and give strength to all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_13","014_29_13","1CH","29","13","13","Now therefore, our God, we give You thanks, and we praise Your glorious name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_14","014_29_14","1CH","29","14","14","But who am I, and who are my people, that we should be able to give as generously as this? For everything comes from You, and from Your own hand we have given to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_15","014_29_15","1CH","29","15","15","For we are foreigners and strangers in Your presence, as were all our forefathers. Our days on earth are like a shadow, without hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_16","014_29_16","1CH","29","16","16","O LORD our God, from Your hand comes all this abundance that we have provided to build You a house for Your holy Name, and all of it belongs to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_17","014_29_17","1CH","29","17","17","I know, my God, that You test the heart and delight in uprightness. All these things I have given willingly and with an upright heart, and now I have seen Your people who are present here giving joyfully and willingly to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_18","014_29_18","1CH","29","18","18","O LORD, God of our fathers Abraham, Isaac, and Israel, keep this desire forever in the intentions of the hearts of Your people, and direct their hearts toward You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_19","014_29_19","1CH","29","19","19","And give my son Solomon a whole heart to keep and carry out all Your commandments, decrees, and statutes, and to build Your palace for which I have made provision.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_20","014_29_20","1CH","29","20","20","Then David said to the whole assembly, “Bless the LORD your God.” So the whole assembly blessed the LORD, the God of their fathers. They bowed down and paid homage to the LORD and to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_21","014_29_21","1CH","29","21","21","The next day they offered sacrifices and presented burnt offerings to the LORD: a thousand bulls, a thousand rams, and a thousand lambs, along with their drink offerings, and other sacrifices in abundance for all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_22","014_29_22","1CH","29","22","22","That day they ate and drank with great joy in the presence of the LORD. Then, for a second time, they designated David’s son Solomon as king, anointing him before the LORD as ruler, and Zadok as the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_23","014_29_23","1CH","29","23","23","So Solomon sat on the throne of the LORD as king in place of his father David. He prospered, and all Israel obeyed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_24","014_29_24","1CH","29","24","24","All the officials and mighty men, as well as all of King David’s sons, pledged their allegiance to King Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_25","014_29_25","1CH","29","25","25","The LORD highly exalted Solomon in the sight of all Israel and bestowed on him royal majesty such as had not been bestowed on any king in Israel before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_26","014_29_26","1CH","29","26","26","David son of Jesse was king over all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_27","014_29_27","1CH","29","27","27","The length of David’s reign over Israel was forty years—seven years in Hebron and thirty-three years in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_28","014_29_28","1CH","29","28","28","He died at a ripe old age, full of years, riches, and honor, and his son Solomon reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_29","014_29_29","1CH","29","29","29","Now the acts of King David, from first to last, are indeed written in the Chronicles of Samuel the Seer, the Chronicles of Nathan the Prophet, and the Chronicles of Gad the Seer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R129_30","014_29_30","1CH","29","30","30","together with all the details of his reign, his might, and the circumstances that came upon him and Israel and all the kingdoms of the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_1","015_1_1","2CH","1","1","1","Now Solomon son of David established himself securely over his kingdom, and the LORD his God was with him and highly exalted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_2","015_1_2","2CH","1","2","2","Then Solomon spoke to all Israel, to the commanders of thousands and of hundreds, to the judges, and to every leader in all Israel—the heads of the families. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_3","015_1_3","2CH","1","3","3","And Solomon and the whole assembly went to the high place at Gibeon because it was the location of God’s Tent of Meeting, which Moses the servant of the LORD had made in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_4","015_1_4","2CH","1","4","4","Now David had brought the ark of God from Kiriath-jearim to the place he had prepared for it, because he had pitched a tent for it in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_5","015_1_5","2CH","1","5","5","But the bronze altar made by Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, was in Gibeon before the tabernacle of the LORD. So Solomon and the assembly inquired of Him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_6","015_1_6","2CH","1","6","6","Solomon offered sacrifices there before the LORD on the bronze altar at the Tent of Meeting, where he offered a thousand burnt offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_7","015_1_7","2CH","1","7","7","That night God appeared to Solomon and said, “Ask, and I will give it to you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_8","015_1_8","2CH","1","8","8","Solomon replied to God: “You have shown much loving devotion to my father David, and You have made me king in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_9","015_1_9","2CH","1","9","9","Now, O LORD God, let Your promise to my father David be fulfilled. For You have made me king over a people as numerous as the dust of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_10","015_1_10","2CH","1","10","10","Now grant me wisdom and knowledge, so that I may lead this people. For who is able to govern this great people of Yours?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_11","015_1_11","2CH","1","11","11","God said to Solomon, “Since this was in your heart instead of requesting riches or wealth or honor for yourself or death for your enemies—and since you have not even requested long life but have asked for wisdom and knowledge to govern My people over whom I have made you king— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_12","015_1_12","2CH","1","12","12","therefore wisdom and knowledge have been granted to you. And I will also give you riches and wealth and honor unlike anything given to the kings before you or after you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_13","015_1_13","2CH","1","13","13","So Solomon went to Jerusalem from the high place in Gibeon, from before the Tent of Meeting, and he reigned over Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_14","015_1_14","2CH","1","14","14","Solomon accumulated 1,400 chariots and 12,000 horses, which he stationed in the chariot cities and also with him in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_15","015_1_15","2CH","1","15","15","The king made silver and gold as common in Jerusalem as stones, and cedar as abundant as sycamore in the foothills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_16","015_1_16","2CH","1","16","16","Solomon’s horses were imported from Egypt and Kue; the royal merchants purchased them from Kue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R21_17","015_1_17","2CH","1","17","17","A chariot could be imported from Egypt for six hundred shekels of silver, and a horse for a hundred and fifty. Likewise, they exported them to all the kings of the Hittites and to the kings of Aram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_1","015_2_1","2CH","2","1","1","Now Solomon purposed to build a house for the Name of the LORD and a royal palace for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_2","015_2_2","2CH","2","2","2","So he conscripted 70,000 porters, 80,000 stonecutters in the mountains, and 3,600 supervisors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_3","015_2_3","2CH","2","3","3","Then Solomon sent word to Hiram king of Tyre: “Do for me as you did for my father David when you sent him cedars to build himself a house to live in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_4","015_2_4","2CH","2","4","4","Behold, I am about to build a house for the Name of the LORD my God to dedicate to Him for burning fragrant incense before Him, for displaying the showbread continuously, and for making burnt offerings every morning and evening as well as on the Sabbaths, New Moons, and appointed feasts of the LORD our God. This is ordained for Israel forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_5","015_2_5","2CH","2","5","5","The house that I am building will be great, for our God is greater than all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_6","015_2_6","2CH","2","6","6","But who is able to build a house for Him, since the heavens, even the highest heavens, cannot contain Him? Who then am I, that I should build a house for Him, except as a place to burn sacrifices before Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_7","015_2_7","2CH","2","7","7","Send me, therefore, a craftsman skilled in engraving to work with gold and silver, with bronze and iron, and with purple, crimson, and blue yarn. He will work with my craftsmen in Judah and Jerusalem, whom my father David provided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_8","015_2_8","2CH","2","8","8","Send me also cedar, cypress, and algum logs from Lebanon, for I know that your servants have skill to cut timber there. And indeed, my servants will work with yours ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_9","015_2_9","2CH","2","9","9","to prepare for me timber in abundance, because the temple I am building will be great and wonderful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_10","015_2_10","2CH","2","10","10","I will pay your servants, the woodcutters, 20,000 cors of ground wheat, 20,000 cors of barley, 20,000 baths of wine, and 20,000 baths of olive oil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_11","015_2_11","2CH","2","11","11","Then Hiram king of Tyre wrote a letter in reply to Solomon: “Because the LORD loves His people, He has set you over them as king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_12","015_2_12","2CH","2","12","12","And Hiram added: “Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, who made the heavens and the earth! He has given King David a wise son with insight and understanding, who will build a temple for the LORD and a royal palace for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_13","015_2_13","2CH","2","13","13","So now I am sending you Huram-abi, a skillful man endowed with creativity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_14","015_2_14","2CH","2","14","14","He is the son of a woman from the daughters of Dan, and his father is a man of Tyre. He is skilled in work with gold and silver, bronze and iron, stone and wood, purple, blue, and crimson yarn, and fine linen. He is experienced in every kind of engraving and can execute any design that is given him. He will work with your craftsmen and with those of my lord, your father David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_15","015_2_15","2CH","2","15","15","Now let my lord send to his servants the wheat, barley, olive oil, and wine he promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_16","015_2_16","2CH","2","16","16","We will cut logs from Lebanon, as many as you need, and we will float them to you as rafts by sea down to Joppa. Then you can take them up to Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_17","015_2_17","2CH","2","17","17","Solomon numbered all the foreign men in the land of Israel following the census his father David had conducted, and there were found to be 153,600 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R22_18","015_2_18","2CH","2","18","18","Solomon made 70,000 of them porters, 80,000 stonecutters in the mountains, and 3,600 supervisors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_1","015_3_1","2CH","3","1","1","Then Solomon began to build the house of the LORD in Jerusalem on Mount Moriah, where the LORD had appeared to his father David. This was the place that David had prepared on the threshing floor of Ornan the Jebusite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_2","015_3_2","2CH","3","2","2","Solomon began construction on the second day of the second month in the fourth year of his reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_3","015_3_3","2CH","3","3","3","The foundation that Solomon laid for the house of God was sixty cubits long and twenty cubits wide, according to the old standard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_4","015_3_4","2CH","3","4","4","The portico at the front, extending across the width of the temple, was twenty cubits long and twenty cubits high. He overlaid the inside with pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_5","015_3_5","2CH","3","5","5","He paneled the main room with cypress, which he overlaid with fine gold and decorated with palm trees and chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_6","015_3_6","2CH","3","6","6","He adorned the temple with precious stones for beauty, and its gold was from Parvaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_7","015_3_7","2CH","3","7","7","He overlaid its beams, thresholds, walls, and doors with gold, and he carved cherubim on the walls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_8","015_3_8","2CH","3","8","8","Then he made the Most Holy Place; its length corresponded to the width of the temple—twenty cubits long and twenty cubits wide. And he overlaid the inside with six hundred talents of fine gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_9","015_3_9","2CH","3","9","9","The weight of the nails was fifty shekels of gold. He also overlaid the upper rooms with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_10","015_3_10","2CH","3","10","10","In the Most Holy Place he made two cherubim of sculptured work, and he overlaid them with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_11","015_3_11","2CH","3","11","11","The total wingspan of the cherubim was twenty cubits. One wing of the first cherub was five cubits long and touched the wall of the temple, and its other wing was five cubits long and touched the wing of the other cherub. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_12","015_3_12","2CH","3","12","12","The wing of the second cherub also measured five cubits and touched the wall of the temple, while its other wing measured five cubits and touched the wing of the first cherub. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_13","015_3_13","2CH","3","13","13","So the total wingspan of these cherubim was twenty cubits. They stood on their feet, facing the main room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_14","015_3_14","2CH","3","14","14","He made the veil of blue, purple, and crimson yarn and fine linen, with cherubim woven into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_15","015_3_15","2CH","3","15","15","In front of the temple he made two pillars, which together were thirty-five cubits high, each with a capital on top measuring five cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_16","015_3_16","2CH","3","16","16","He made interwoven chains and put them on top of the pillars. He made a hundred pomegranates and fastened them into the chainwork. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R23_17","015_3_17","2CH","3","17","17","Then he set up the pillars in front of the temple, one on the south and one on the north. The pillar on the south he named Jachin, and the pillar on the north he named Boaz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_1","015_4_1","2CH","4","1","1","He made a bronze altar twenty cubits long, twenty cubits wide, and ten cubits high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_2","015_4_2","2CH","4","2","2","He also made the Sea of cast metal. It was circular in shape, measuring ten cubits from rim to rim, five cubits in height, and thirty cubits in circumference. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_3","015_4_3","2CH","4","3","3","Below the rim, figures of oxen encircled it, ten per cubit all the way around the Sea, cast in two rows as a part of the Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_4","015_4_4","2CH","4","4","4","The Sea stood on twelve oxen, three facing north, three facing west, three facing south, and three facing east. The Sea rested on them, with all their hindquarters toward the center. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_5","015_4_5","2CH","4","5","5","It was a handbreadth thick, and its rim was fashioned like the brim of a cup, like a lily blossom. It could hold three thousand baths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_6","015_4_6","2CH","4","6","6","He also made ten basins for washing and placed five on the south side and five on the north. The parts of the burnt offering were rinsed in them, but the priests used the Sea for washing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_7","015_4_7","2CH","4","7","7","He made ten gold lampstands according to their specifications and placed them in the temple, five on the south side and five on the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_8","015_4_8","2CH","4","8","8","Additionally, he made ten tables and placed them in the temple, five on the south side and five on the north. He also made a hundred gold bowls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_9","015_4_9","2CH","4","9","9","He made the courtyard of the priests and the large court with its doors, and he overlaid the doors with bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_10","015_4_10","2CH","4","10","10","He put the Sea on the south side, at the southeast corner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_11","015_4_11","2CH","4","11","11","Additionally, Huram made the pots, shovels, and sprinkling bowls. So Huram finished the work that he had undertaken for King Solomon in the house of God: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_12","015_4_12","2CH","4","12","12","the two pillars; the two bowl-shaped capitals atop the pillars; the two sets of network covering both bowls of the capitals atop the pillars; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_13","015_4_13","2CH","4","13","13","the four hundred pomegranates for the two sets of network (two rows of pomegranates for each network covering both the bowl-shaped capitals atop the pillars); ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_14","015_4_14","2CH","4","14","14","the stands; the basins on the stands; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_15","015_4_15","2CH","4","15","15","the Sea; the twelve oxen underneath the Sea; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_16","015_4_16","2CH","4","16","16","and the pots, shovels, meat forks, and all the other articles. All these objects that Huram-abi made for King Solomon for the house of the LORD were of polished bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_17","015_4_17","2CH","4","17","17","The king had them cast in clay molds in the plain of the Jordan between Succoth and Zeredah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_18","015_4_18","2CH","4","18","18","Solomon made all these articles in such great abundance that the weight of the bronze could not be determined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_19","015_4_19","2CH","4","19","19","Solomon also made all the furnishings for the house of God: the golden altar; the tables on which was placed the Bread of the Presence; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_20","015_4_20","2CH","4","20","20","the lampstands of pure gold and their lamps, to burn in front of the inner sanctuary as prescribed; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_21","015_4_21","2CH","4","21","21","the flowers, lamps, and tongs of gold—of purest gold; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R24_22","015_4_22","2CH","4","22","22","the wick trimmers, sprinkling bowls, ladles, and censers of pure gold; and the gold doors of the temple: the inner doors to the Most Holy Place as well as the doors of the main hall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_1","015_5_1","2CH","5","1","1","So all the work that Solomon had performed for the house of the LORD was completed. Then Solomon brought in the items his father David had dedicated—the silver, the gold, and all the furnishings—and he placed them in the treasuries of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_2","015_5_2","2CH","5","2","2","At that time Solomon assembled in Jerusalem the elders of Israel—all the tribal heads and family leaders of the Israelites—to bring up the ark of the covenant of the LORD from Zion, the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_3","015_5_3","2CH","5","3","3","So all the men of Israel came together to the king at the feast in the seventh month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_4","015_5_4","2CH","5","4","4","When all the elders of Israel had arrived, the Levites took up the ark, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_5","015_5_5","2CH","5","5","5","and they brought up the ark and the Tent of Meeting with all its sacred furnishings. The Levitical priests carried them up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_6","015_5_6","2CH","5","6","6","There, before the ark, King Solomon and the whole congregation of Israel who had assembled with him sacrificed so many sheep and oxen that they could not be counted or numbered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_7","015_5_7","2CH","5","7","7","Then the priests brought the ark of the covenant of the LORD to its place in the inner sanctuary of the temple, the Most Holy Place, beneath the wings of the cherubim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_8","015_5_8","2CH","5","8","8","For the cherubim spread their wings over the place of the ark and overshadowed the ark and its poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_9","015_5_9","2CH","5","9","9","The poles of the ark extended far enough that their ends were visible from in front of the inner sanctuary, but not from outside the Holy Place; and they are there to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_10","015_5_10","2CH","5","10","10","There was nothing in the ark except the two tablets that Moses had placed in it at Horeb, where the LORD had made a covenant with the Israelites after they had come out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_11","015_5_11","2CH","5","11","11","Now all the priests who were present had consecrated themselves regardless of their divisions. And when the priests came out of the Holy Place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_12","015_5_12","2CH","5","12","12","all the Levitical singers—Asaph, Heman, Jeduthun, and their sons and relatives—stood on the east side of the altar, dressed in fine linen and playing cymbals, harps, and lyres, accompanied by 120 priests sounding trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_13","015_5_13","2CH","5","13","13","The trumpeters and singers joined together to praise and thank the LORD with one voice. They lifted up their voices, accompanied by trumpets, cymbals, and musical instruments, in praise to the LORD: “For He is good; His loving devotion endures forever.” And the temple, the house of the LORD, was filled with a cloud ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R25_14","015_5_14","2CH","5","14","14","so that the priests could not stand there to minister because of the cloud. For the glory of the LORD filled the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_1","015_6_1","2CH","6","1","1","Then Solomon declared: “The LORD has said that He would dwell in the thick cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_2","015_6_2","2CH","6","2","2","But I have built You an exalted house, a place for You to dwell forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_3","015_6_3","2CH","6","3","3","And as the whole assembly of Israel stood there, the king turned around and blessed them all ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_4","015_6_4","2CH","6","4","4","and said: “Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, who has fulfilled with His own hand what He spoke with His mouth to my father David, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_5","015_6_5","2CH","6","5","5","‘Since the day I brought My people out of the land of Egypt, I have not chosen a city from any tribe of Israel in which to build a house so that My Name would be there, nor have I chosen anyone to be ruler over My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_6","015_6_6","2CH","6","6","6","But now I have chosen Jerusalem for My Name to be there, and I have chosen David to be over My people Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_7","015_6_7","2CH","6","7","7","Now it was in the heart of my father David to build a house for the Name of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_8","015_6_8","2CH","6","8","8","But the LORD said to my father David, ‘Since it was in your heart to build a house for My Name, you have done well to have this in your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_9","015_6_9","2CH","6","9","9","Nevertheless, you are not the one to build it; but your son, your own offspring, will build the house for My Name.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_10","015_6_10","2CH","6","10","10","Now the LORD has fulfilled the word that He spoke. I have succeeded my father David, and I sit on the throne of Israel, as the LORD promised. I have built the house for the Name of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_11","015_6_11","2CH","6","11","11","And there I have placed the ark, which contains the covenant of the LORD that He made with the children of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_12","015_6_12","2CH","6","12","12","Then Solomon stood before the altar of the LORD in front of the whole assembly of Israel and spread out his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_13","015_6_13","2CH","6","13","13","Now Solomon had made a bronze platform five cubits long, five cubits wide, and three cubits high and had placed it in the middle of the courtyard. He stood on it, knelt down before the whole assembly of Israel, spread out his hands toward heaven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_14","015_6_14","2CH","6","14","14","and said: “O LORD, God of Israel, there is no God like You in heaven or on earth, keeping Your covenant of loving devotion with Your servants who walk before You with all their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_15","015_6_15","2CH","6","15","15","You have kept Your promise to Your servant, my father David. What You spoke with Your mouth You have fulfilled with Your hand this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_16","015_6_16","2CH","6","16","16","Therefore now, O LORD, God of Israel, keep for Your servant, my father David, what You promised when You said: ‘You will never fail to have a man to sit before Me on the throne of Israel, if only your descendants guard their way to walk in My law as you have walked before Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_17","015_6_17","2CH","6","17","17","And now, O LORD, God of Israel, please confirm what You promised to Your servant David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_18","015_6_18","2CH","6","18","18","But will God indeed dwell with man upon the earth? The heavens, even the highest heavens, cannot contain You, much less this temple I have built. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_19","015_6_19","2CH","6","19","19","Yet regard the prayer and plea of Your servant, O LORD my God, so that You may hear the cry and the prayer that Your servant is praying before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_20","015_6_20","2CH","6","20","20","May Your eyes be open toward this temple day and night, toward the place where You said You would put Your Name, so that You may hear the prayer that Your servant prays toward this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_21","015_6_21","2CH","6","21","21","Hear the plea of Your servant and of Your people Israel when they pray toward this place. May You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place. May You hear and forgive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_22","015_6_22","2CH","6","22","22","When a man sins against his neighbor and is required to take an oath, and he comes to take an oath before Your altar in this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_23","015_6_23","2CH","6","23","23","then may You hear from heaven and act. May You judge Your servants, condemning the wicked man by bringing down on his own head what he has done, and justifying the righteous man by rewarding him according to his righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_24","015_6_24","2CH","6","24","24","When Your people Israel are defeated before an enemy because they have sinned against You, and they return to You and confess Your name, praying and pleading before You in this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_25","015_6_25","2CH","6","25","25","then may You hear from heaven and forgive the sin of Your people Israel. May You restore them to the land You gave to them and their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_26","015_6_26","2CH","6","26","26","When the skies are shut and there is no rain because Your people have sinned against You, and they pray toward this place and confess Your name, and they turn from their sins because You have afflicted them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_27","015_6_27","2CH","6","27","27","then may You hear from heaven and forgive the sin of Your servants, Your people Israel, so that You may teach them the good way in which they should walk. May You send rain on the land that You gave Your people as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_28","015_6_28","2CH","6","28","28","When famine or plague comes upon the land, or blight or mildew or locusts or grasshoppers, or when their enemies besiege them in their cities, whatever plague or sickness may come, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_29","015_6_29","2CH","6","29","29","then may whatever prayer or plea Your people Israel make—each knowing his own afflictions and spreading out his hands toward this temple— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_30","015_6_30","2CH","6","30","30","be heard by You from heaven, Your dwelling place. And may You forgive and repay each man according to all his ways, since You know his heart—for You alone know the hearts of men— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_31","015_6_31","2CH","6","31","31","so that they may fear You and walk in Your ways all the days they live in the land that You gave to our fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_32","015_6_32","2CH","6","32","32","And as for the foreigner who is not of Your people Israel but has come from a distant land because of Your great name and Your mighty hand and outstretched arm—when he comes and prays toward this temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_33","015_6_33","2CH","6","33","33","then may You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place, and do according to all for which the foreigner calls to You. Then all the peoples of the earth will know Your name and fear You, as do Your people Israel, and they will know that this house I have built is called by Your Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_34","015_6_34","2CH","6","34","34","When Your people go to war against their enemies, wherever You send them, and when they pray to You in the direction of this city You have chosen and the house I have built for Your Name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_35","015_6_35","2CH","6","35","35","then may You hear from heaven their prayer and their plea, and may You uphold their cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_36","015_6_36","2CH","6","36","36","When they sin against You—for there is no one who does not sin—and You become angry with them and deliver them to an enemy who takes them as captives to a land far or near, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_37","015_6_37","2CH","6","37","37","and when they come to their senses in the land to which they were taken, and they repent and plead with You in the land of their captors, saying, ‘We have sinned and done wrong; we have acted wickedly,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_38","015_6_38","2CH","6","38","38","and when they return to You with all their heart and soul in the land of the enemies who took them captive, and when they pray in the direction of the land that You gave to their fathers, the city You have chosen, and the house I have built for Your Name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_39","015_6_39","2CH","6","39","39","then may You hear from heaven, Your dwelling place, their prayer and pleas, and may You uphold their cause. May You forgive Your people who sinned against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_40","015_6_40","2CH","6","40","40","Now, my God, may Your eyes be open and Your ears attentive to the prayer offered in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_41","015_6_41","2CH","6","41","41","Now therefore, arise, O LORD God, and enter Your resting place, You and the ark of Your might. May Your priests, O LORD God, be clothed with salvation, and may Your godly ones rejoice in goodness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R26_42","015_6_42","2CH","6","42","42","O LORD God, do not reject Your anointed one. Remember Your loving devotion to Your servant David.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_1","015_7_1","2CH","7","1","1","When Solomon had finished praying, fire came down from heaven and consumed the burnt offering and the sacrifices, and the glory of the LORD filled the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_2","015_7_2","2CH","7","2","2","The priests were unable to enter the house of the LORD, because the glory of the LORD had filled it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_3","015_7_3","2CH","7","3","3","When all the Israelites saw the fire coming down and the glory of the LORD above the temple, they bowed down on the pavement with their faces to the ground, and they worshiped and gave thanks to the LORD: “For He is good; His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_4","015_7_4","2CH","7","4","4","Then the king and all the people offered sacrifices before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_5","015_7_5","2CH","7","5","5","And King Solomon offered a sacrifice of 22,000 oxen and 120,000 sheep. So the king and all the people dedicated the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_6","015_7_6","2CH","7","6","6","The priests stood at their posts, as did the Levites with the musical instruments of the LORD, which King David had made for giving thanks to the LORD and with which David had offered praise, saying, “For His loving devotion endures forever.” Across from the Levites, the priests sounded trumpets, and all the Israelites were standing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_7","015_7_7","2CH","7","7","7","Then Solomon consecrated the middle of the courtyard in front of the house of the LORD, and there he offered the burnt offerings and the fat of the peace offerings, since the bronze altar he had made could not hold all these offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_8","015_7_8","2CH","7","8","8","So at that time Solomon and all Israel with him—a very great assembly of people from Lebo-hamath to the Brook of Egypt—kept the feast for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_9","015_7_9","2CH","7","9","9","On the eighth day they held a solemn assembly, for the dedication of the altar had lasted seven days, and the feast seven days more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_10","015_7_10","2CH","7","10","10","On the twenty-third day of the seventh month, Solomon sent the people away to their homes, joyful and glad of heart for the good things that the LORD had done for David, for Solomon, and for His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_11","015_7_11","2CH","7","11","11","When Solomon had finished the house of the LORD and the royal palace, successfully carrying out all that was in his heart to do for the house of the LORD and for his own palace, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_12","015_7_12","2CH","7","12","12","the LORD appeared to him at night and said to him: “I have heard your prayer and have chosen this place for Myself as a house of sacrifice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_13","015_7_13","2CH","7","13","13","If I close the sky so there is no rain, or if I command the locust to devour the land, or if I send a plague among My people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_14","015_7_14","2CH","7","14","14","and if My people who are called by My name humble themselves and pray and seek My face and turn from their wicked ways, then I will hear from heaven, forgive their sin, and heal their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_15","015_7_15","2CH","7","15","15","Now My eyes will be open and My ears attentive to the prayers offered in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_16","015_7_16","2CH","7","16","16","For I have now chosen and consecrated this temple so that My Name may be there forever. My eyes and My heart will be there for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_17","015_7_17","2CH","7","17","17","And as for you, if you walk before Me as your father David walked, doing all I have commanded you, and if you keep My statutes and ordinances, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_18","015_7_18","2CH","7","18","18","then I will establish your royal throne, as I covenanted with your father David when I said, ‘You will never fail to have a man to rule over Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_19","015_7_19","2CH","7","19","19","But if you turn away and forsake the statutes and commandments I have set before you, and if you go off to serve and worship other gods, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_20","015_7_20","2CH","7","20","20","then I will uproot Israel from the soil I have given them, and I will banish from My presence this temple I have sanctified for My Name. I will make it an object of scorn and ridicule among all the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_21","015_7_21","2CH","7","21","21","And when this temple has become a heap of rubble, all who pass by it will be appalled and say, ‘Why has the LORD done such a thing to this land and to this temple?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R27_22","015_7_22","2CH","7","22","22","And others will answer, ‘Because they have forsaken the LORD, the God of their fathers, who brought them out of the land of Egypt, and have embraced other gods, worshiping and serving them—because of this, He has brought all this disaster upon them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_1","015_8_1","2CH","8","1","1","Now at the end of the twenty years during which Solomon had built the house of the LORD and his own palace, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_2","015_8_2","2CH","8","2","2","Solomon rebuilt the cities Hiram had given him and settled Israelites there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_3","015_8_3","2CH","8","3","3","Then Solomon went to Hamath-zobah and captured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_4","015_8_4","2CH","8","4","4","He built Tadmor in the wilderness, in addition to all the store cities that he had built in Hamath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_5","015_8_5","2CH","8","5","5","He rebuilt Upper and Lower Beth-horon as fortified cities with walls, gates, and bars, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_6","015_8_6","2CH","8","6","6","as well as Baalath, all the store cities that belonged to Solomon, and all the cities for his chariots and horses—whatever he desired to build in Jerusalem, Lebanon, and throughout the land of his dominion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_7","015_8_7","2CH","8","7","7","As for all the people who remained of the Hittites, Amorites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites (these people were not Israelites)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_8","015_8_8","2CH","8","8","8","their descendants who remained in the land, those whom the Israelites had not destroyed—Solomon conscripted these people to be forced laborers, as they are to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_9","015_8_9","2CH","8","9","9","But Solomon did not consign any of the Israelites to slave labor, because they were his men of war, the leaders of his captains, and the commanders of his chariots and cavalry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_10","015_8_10","2CH","8","10","10","They were also the chief officers for King Solomon: 250 supervisors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_11","015_8_11","2CH","8","11","11","Solomon brought the daughter of Pharaoh up from the City of David to the palace he had built for her. For he said, “My wife must not live in the house of David king of Israel, because the places the ark of the LORD has entered are holy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_12","015_8_12","2CH","8","12","12","At that time Solomon offered burnt offerings to the LORD on the altar of the LORD he had built in front of the portico. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_13","015_8_13","2CH","8","13","13","He observed the daily requirement for offerings according to the commandment of Moses for Sabbaths, New Moons, and the three annual appointed feasts—the Feast of Unleavened Bread, the Feast of Weeks, and the Feast of Tabernacles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_14","015_8_14","2CH","8","14","14","In keeping with the ordinances of his father David, Solomon appointed the divisions of the priests over their service, and the Levites for their duties to offer praise and to minister before the priests according to the daily requirement. He also appointed gatekeepers by their divisions at each gate, for this had been the command of David, the man of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_15","015_8_15","2CH","8","15","15","They did not turn aside from the king’s command regarding the priests or the Levites in any matter, including that of the treasuries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_16","015_8_16","2CH","8","16","16","Thus all the work of Solomon was carried out, from the day the foundation was laid for the house of the LORD until it was finished. So the house of the LORD was completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_17","015_8_17","2CH","8","17","17","Then Solomon went to Ezion-geber and to Eloth on the coast of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R28_18","015_8_18","2CH","8","18","18","So Hiram sent him ships captained by his servants, along with crews of experienced sailors. They went with Solomon’s servants to Ophir and acquired from there 450 talents of gold, which they delivered to King Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_1","015_9_1","2CH","9","1","1","Now when the queen of Sheba heard about the fame of Solomon, she came to test him with difficult questions. She arrived in Jerusalem with a very large caravan—with camels bearing spices, gold in abundance, and precious stones. And she came to Solomon and spoke with him about all that was on her mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_2","015_9_2","2CH","9","2","2","And Solomon answered all her questions; nothing was too difficult for him to explain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_3","015_9_3","2CH","9","3","3","When the queen of Sheba saw the wisdom of Solomon, the palace he had built, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_4","015_9_4","2CH","9","4","4","the food at his table, the seating of his servants, the service and attire of his attendants, the attire of his cupbearers, and the burnt offerings he presented at the house of the LORD, it took her breath away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_5","015_9_5","2CH","9","5","5","She said to the king, “The report I heard in my own country about your words and wisdom is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_6","015_9_6","2CH","9","6","6","But I did not believe the reports until I came and saw with my own eyes. Indeed, not half of the greatness of your wisdom was told to me. You have far exceeded the report I heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_7","015_9_7","2CH","9","7","7","How blessed are your men! How blessed are these servants of yours who stand continually before you and hear your wisdom! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_8","015_9_8","2CH","9","8","8","Blessed be the LORD your God, who has delighted in you to set you on His throne to be king for the LORD your God. Because your God loved Israel enough to establish them forever, He has made you king over them to carry out justice and righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_9","015_9_9","2CH","9","9","9","Then she gave the king 120 talents of gold, a great quantity of spices, and precious stones. There had never been such spices as those the queen of Sheba gave to King Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_10","015_9_10","2CH","9","10","10","(The servants of Hiram and of Solomon who brought gold from Ophir also brought algum wood and precious stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_11","015_9_11","2CH","9","11","11","The king made the algum wood into steps for the house of the LORD and for the king’s palace, and into lyres and harps for the singers. Never before had anything like them been seen in the land of Judah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_12","015_9_12","2CH","9","12","12","King Solomon gave the queen of Sheba all she desired—whatever she asked—far more than she had brought the king. Then she left and returned to her own country, along with her servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_13","015_9_13","2CH","9","13","13","The weight of gold that came to Solomon each year was 666 talents, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_14","015_9_14","2CH","9","14","14","not including the revenue from the merchants and traders. And all the Arabian kings and governors of the land also brought gold and silver to Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_15","015_9_15","2CH","9","15","15","King Solomon made two hundred large shields of hammered gold; six hundred shekels of hammered gold went into each shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_16","015_9_16","2CH","9","16","16","He also made three hundred small shields of hammered gold; three hundred shekels of gold went into each shield. And the king put them in the House of the Forest of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_17","015_9_17","2CH","9","17","17","Additionally, the king made a great throne of ivory and overlaid it with pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_18","015_9_18","2CH","9","18","18","The throne had six steps, and a footstool of gold was attached to it. There were armrests on both sides of the seat, with a lion standing beside each armrest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_19","015_9_19","2CH","9","19","19","Twelve lions stood on the six steps, one at either end of each step. Nothing like this had ever been made for any kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_20","015_9_20","2CH","9","20","20","All King Solomon’s drinking cups were gold, and all the utensils of the House of the Forest of Lebanon were pure gold. There was no silver, because it was accounted as nothing in the days of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_21","015_9_21","2CH","9","21","21","For the king had the ships of Tarshish that went with Hiram’s servants, and once every three years the ships of Tarshish would arrive bearing gold, silver, ivory, apes, and peacocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_22","015_9_22","2CH","9","22","22","So King Solomon surpassed all the kings of the earth in riches and wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_23","015_9_23","2CH","9","23","23","All the kings of the earth sought an audience with Solomon to hear the wisdom that God had put in his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_24","015_9_24","2CH","9","24","24","Year after year, each visitor would bring his tribute: articles of silver and gold, clothing, weapons, spices, horses, and mules. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_25","015_9_25","2CH","9","25","25","Solomon had 4,000 stalls for horses and chariots, and 12,000 horses, which he stationed in the chariot cities and also with him in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_26","015_9_26","2CH","9","26","26","He reigned over all the kings from the Euphrates to the land of the Philistines, as far as the border of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_27","015_9_27","2CH","9","27","27","The king made silver as common in Jerusalem as stones, and cedar as abundant as sycamore in the foothills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_28","015_9_28","2CH","9","28","28","Solomon’s horses were imported from Egypt and from all the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_29","015_9_29","2CH","9","29","29","As for the rest of the acts of Solomon, from beginning to end, are they not written in the Records of Nathan the Prophet, in the Prophecy of Ahijah the Shilonite, and in the Visions of Iddo the Seer concerning Jeroboam son of Nebat? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_30","015_9_30","2CH","9","30","30","Solomon reigned in Jerusalem over all Israel forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R29_31","015_9_31","2CH","9","31","31","And Solomon rested with his fathers and was buried in the city of his father David. And his son Rehoboam reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_1","015_10_1","2CH","10","1","1","Then Rehoboam went to Shechem, for all Israel had gone there to make him king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_2","015_10_2","2CH","10","2","2","When Jeroboam son of Nebat heard about this, he returned from Egypt, where he had fled from King Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_3","015_10_3","2CH","10","3","3","So they sent for Jeroboam, and he and all Israel came to Rehoboam and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_4","015_10_4","2CH","10","4","4","“Your father put a heavy yoke on us. But now you must lighten the burden of your father’s service and the heavy yoke he put on us, and we will serve you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_5","015_10_5","2CH","10","5","5","Rehoboam answered, “Come back to me in three days.” So the people departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_6","015_10_6","2CH","10","6","6","Then King Rehoboam consulted with the elders who had served his father Solomon during his lifetime. “How do you advise me to respond to these people?” he asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_7","015_10_7","2CH","10","7","7","They replied, “If you will be kind to these people and please them by speaking kind words to them, they will be your servants forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_8","015_10_8","2CH","10","8","8","But Rehoboam rejected the advice of the elders; instead, he consulted the young men who had grown up with him and served him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_9","015_10_9","2CH","10","9","9","He asked them, “What message do you advise that we send back to these people who have spoken to me, saying, ‘Lighten the yoke your father put on us’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_10","015_10_10","2CH","10","10","10","The young men who had grown up with him replied, “This is how you should answer these people who said to you, ‘Your father made our yoke heavy, but you must make it lighter.’ This is what you should tell them: ‘My little finger is thicker than my father’s waist! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_11","015_10_11","2CH","10","11","11","Whereas my father burdened you with a heavy yoke, I will add to your yoke. Whereas my father scourged you with whips, I will scourge you with scorpions.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_12","015_10_12","2CH","10","12","12","After three days, Jeroboam and all the people returned to Rehoboam, since the king had said, “Come back to me on the third day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_13","015_10_13","2CH","10","13","13","And the king answered them harshly. King Rehoboam rejected the advice of the elders ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_14","015_10_14","2CH","10","14","14","and spoke to them as the young men had advised, saying, “Whereas my father made your yoke heavy, I will add to your yoke. Whereas my father scourged you with whips, I will scourge you with scorpions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_15","015_10_15","2CH","10","15","15","So the king did not listen to the people, and indeed this turn of events was from God, in order that the LORD might fulfill the word that He had spoken through Ahijah the Shilonite to Jeroboam son of Nebat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_16","015_10_16","2CH","10","16","16","When all Israel saw that the king had refused to listen to them, they answered the king: “What portion do we have in David, and what inheritance in the son of Jesse? To your tents, O Israel! Look now to your own house, O David!” So all the Israelites went home, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_17","015_10_17","2CH","10","17","17","but Rehoboam still reigned over the Israelites living in the cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_18","015_10_18","2CH","10","18","18","Then King Rehoboam sent out Hadoram, who was in charge of the forced labor, but the Israelites stoned him to death. And King Rehoboam mounted his chariot in haste and escaped to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R210_19","015_10_19","2CH","10","19","19","So to this day Israel has been in rebellion against the house of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_1","015_11_1","2CH","11","1","1","When Rehoboam arrived in Jerusalem, he mobilized the house of Judah and Benjamin—180,000 chosen warriors—to fight against Israel and restore the kingdom to Rehoboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_2","015_11_2","2CH","11","2","2","But the word of the LORD came to Shemaiah the man of God: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_3","015_11_3","2CH","11","3","3","“Tell Rehoboam son of Solomon king of Judah and all the Israelites in Judah and Benjamin ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_4","015_11_4","2CH","11","4","4","that this is what the LORD says: ‘You are not to go up and fight against your brothers. Each of you must return home, for this is My doing.’” So they listened to the words of the LORD and turned back from going against Jeroboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_5","015_11_5","2CH","11","5","5","Rehoboam lived in Jerusalem, and he built up cities for defense in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_6","015_11_6","2CH","11","6","6","He built up Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_7","015_11_7","2CH","11","7","7","Beth-zur, Soco, Adullam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_8","015_11_8","2CH","11","8","8","Gath, Mareshah, Ziph, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_9","015_11_9","2CH","11","9","9","Adoraim, Lachish, Azekah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_10","015_11_10","2CH","11","10","10","Zorah, Aijalon, and Hebron, the fortified cities in Judah and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_11","015_11_11","2CH","11","11","11","He strengthened their fortifications and put officers in them, with supplies of food, oil, and wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_12","015_11_12","2CH","11","12","12","He also put shields and spears in all the cities and strengthened them greatly. So Judah and Benjamin belonged to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_13","015_11_13","2CH","11","13","13","Moreover, the priests and Levites from all their districts throughout Israel stood with Rehoboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_14","015_11_14","2CH","11","14","14","For the Levites left their pasturelands and their possessions and went to Judah and Jerusalem, because Jeroboam and his sons had rejected them as priests of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_15","015_11_15","2CH","11","15","15","And Jeroboam appointed his own priests for the high places and for the goat demons and calf idols he had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_16","015_11_16","2CH","11","16","16","Those from every tribe of Israel who had set their hearts to seek the LORD their God followed the Levites to Jerusalem to sacrifice to the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_17","015_11_17","2CH","11","17","17","So they strengthened the kingdom of Judah and supported Rehoboam son of Solomon for three years, because they walked for three years in the way of David and Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_18","015_11_18","2CH","11","18","18","And Rehoboam married Mahalath, who was the daughter of David’s son Jerimoth and of Abihail, the daughter of Jesse’s son Eliab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_19","015_11_19","2CH","11","19","19","She bore sons to him: Jeush, Shemariah, and Zaham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_20","015_11_20","2CH","11","20","20","After her, he married Maacah daughter of Absalom, and she bore to him Abijah, Attai, Ziza, and Shelomith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_21","015_11_21","2CH","11","21","21","Rehoboam loved Maacah daughter of Absalom more than all his wives and concubines. In all, he had eighteen wives and sixty concubines, and he was the father of twenty-eight sons and sixty daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_22","015_11_22","2CH","11","22","22","Rehoboam appointed Abijah son of Maacah as chief prince among his brothers, intending to make him king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R211_23","015_11_23","2CH","11","23","23","Rehoboam also acted wisely by dispersing some of his sons throughout the districts of Judah and Benjamin, and to all the fortified cities. He gave them abundant provisions and sought many wives for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_1","015_12_1","2CH","12","1","1","After Rehoboam had established his sovereignty and royal power, he and all Israel with him forsook the Law of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_2","015_12_2","2CH","12","2","2","In the fifth year of Rehoboam’s reign, because they had been unfaithful to the LORD, Shishak king of Egypt attacked Jerusalem ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_3","015_12_3","2CH","12","3","3","with 1,200 chariots, 60,000 horsemen, and countless troops who came with him out of Egypt—Libyans, Sukkites, and Cushites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_4","015_12_4","2CH","12","4","4","He captured the fortified cities of Judah and came as far as Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_5","015_12_5","2CH","12","5","5","Then Shemaiah the prophet came to Rehoboam and the leaders of Judah who had gathered at Jerusalem because of Shishak, and he said to them, “This is what the LORD says: ‘You have forsaken Me; therefore, I have forsaken you into the hand of Shishak.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_6","015_12_6","2CH","12","6","6","So the leaders of Israel and the king humbled themselves and said, “The LORD is righteous.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_7","015_12_7","2CH","12","7","7","When the LORD saw that they had humbled themselves, the word of the LORD came to Shemaiah, saying, “They have humbled themselves; I will not destroy them, but will soon grant them deliverance. My wrath will not be poured out on Jerusalem through Shishak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_8","015_12_8","2CH","12","8","8","Nevertheless, they will become his servants, so that they may learn the difference between serving Me and serving the kings of other lands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_9","015_12_9","2CH","12","9","9","So King Shishak of Egypt attacked Jerusalem and seized the treasures of the house of the LORD and of the royal palace. He took everything, including the gold shields that Solomon had made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_10","015_12_10","2CH","12","10","10","Then King Rehoboam made bronze shields in their place and committed them to the care of the captains of the guard on duty at the entrance to the royal palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_11","015_12_11","2CH","12","11","11","And whenever the king entered the house of the LORD, the guards would go with him, bearing the shields, and later they would return them to the guardroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_12","015_12_12","2CH","12","12","12","Because Rehoboam humbled himself, the anger of the LORD turned away from him, and He did not destroy him completely. Indeed, conditions were good in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_13","015_12_13","2CH","12","13","13","Thus King Rehoboam established himself in Jerusalem and reigned. He was forty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned seventeen years in Jerusalem, the city the LORD had chosen from all the tribes of Israel in which to put His Name. His mother’s name was Naamah the Ammonite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_14","015_12_14","2CH","12","14","14","And Rehoboam did evil because he did not set his heart to seek the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_15","015_12_15","2CH","12","15","15","Now the acts of Rehoboam, from first to last, are they not written in the records of Shemaiah the Prophet and of Iddo the Seer concerning the genealogies? There was war between Rehoboam and Jeroboam throughout their days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R212_16","015_12_16","2CH","12","16","16","And Rehoboam rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David. And his son Abijah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_1","015_13_1","2CH","13","1","1","In the eighteenth year of Jeroboam’s reign, Abijah became king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_2","015_13_2","2CH","13","2","2","and he reigned in Jerusalem three years. His mother’s name was Micaiah daughter of Uriel; she was from Gibeah. And there was war between Abijah and Jeroboam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_3","015_13_3","2CH","13","3","3","Abijah went into battle with an army of 400,000 chosen men, while Jeroboam drew up in formation against him with 800,000 chosen and mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_4","015_13_4","2CH","13","4","4","Then Abijah stood on Mount Zemaraim in the hill country of Ephraim and said, “Hear me, O Jeroboam and all Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_5","015_13_5","2CH","13","5","5","Do you not know that the LORD, the God of Israel, has given the kingship of Israel to David and his descendants forever by a covenant of salt? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_6","015_13_6","2CH","13","6","6","Yet Jeroboam son of Nebat, a servant of Solomon son of David, rose up and rebelled against his master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_7","015_13_7","2CH","13","7","7","Then worthless and wicked men gathered around him to resist Rehoboam son of Solomon when he was young, inexperienced, and unable to resist them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_8","015_13_8","2CH","13","8","8","And now you think you can resist the kingdom of the LORD, which is in the hands of David’s descendants. You are indeed a vast army, and you have with you the golden calves that Jeroboam made for you as gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_9","015_13_9","2CH","13","9","9","But did you not drive out the priests of the LORD, the sons of Aaron, and the Levites? And did you not make priests for yourselves as do the peoples of other lands? Now whoever comes to consecrate himself with a young bull and seven rams can become a priest of things that are not gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_10","015_13_10","2CH","13","10","10","But as for us, the LORD is our God. We have not forsaken Him; the priests who minister to the LORD are sons of Aaron, and the Levites attend to their duties. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_11","015_13_11","2CH","13","11","11","Every morning and every evening they present burnt offerings and fragrant incense to the LORD. They set out the rows of showbread on the ceremonially clean table, and every evening they light the lamps of the gold lampstand. We are carrying out the requirements of the LORD our God, while you have forsaken Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_12","015_13_12","2CH","13","12","12","Now behold, God Himself is with us as our head, and His priests with their trumpets sound the battle call against you. O children of Israel, do not fight against the LORD, the God of your fathers, for you will not succeed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_13","015_13_13","2CH","13","13","13","Now Jeroboam had sent troops around to ambush from the rear, so that while he was in front of Judah, the ambush was behind them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_14","015_13_14","2CH","13","14","14","When Judah turned and discovered that the battle was both before and behind them, they cried out to the LORD. Then the priests blew the trumpets, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_15","015_13_15","2CH","13","15","15","and the men of Judah raised the battle cry. And when they raised the cry, God routed Jeroboam and all Israel before Abijah and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_16","015_13_16","2CH","13","16","16","So the Israelites fled before Judah, and God delivered them into their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_17","015_13_17","2CH","13","17","17","Then Abijah and his people struck them with a mighty blow, and 500,000 chosen men of Israel fell slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_18","015_13_18","2CH","13","18","18","Thus the Israelites were subdued at that time, and the men of Judah prevailed because they relied on the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_19","015_13_19","2CH","13","19","19","Abijah pursued Jeroboam and captured some cities from him: Bethel, Jeshanah, and Ephron, along with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_20","015_13_20","2CH","13","20","20","Jeroboam did not again recover his power during the days of Abijah, and the LORD struck him down and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_21","015_13_21","2CH","13","21","21","But Abijah grew strong, married fourteen wives, and became the father of twenty-two sons and sixteen daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R213_22","015_13_22","2CH","13","22","22","Now the rest of the acts of Abijah, along with his ways and his words, are written in the Treatise of the Prophet Iddo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_1","015_14_1","2CH","14","1","1","Then Abijah rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David. And his son Asa reigned in his place, and in his days the land was at peace for ten years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_2","015_14_2","2CH","14","2","2","And Asa did what was good and right in the eyes of the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_3","015_14_3","2CH","14","3","3","He removed the foreign altars and high places, shattered the sacred pillars, and chopped down the Asherah poles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_4","015_14_4","2CH","14","4","4","He commanded the people of Judah to seek the LORD, the God of their fathers, and to observe the law and the commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_5","015_14_5","2CH","14","5","5","He also removed the high places and incense altars from all the cities of Judah, and under him the kingdom was at peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_6","015_14_6","2CH","14","6","6","Because the land was at peace, Asa built fortified cities in Judah. In those days no one made war with him, because the LORD had given him rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_7","015_14_7","2CH","14","7","7","So he said to the people of Judah, “Let us build these cities and surround them with walls and towers, with doors and bars. The land is still ours because we have sought the LORD our God. We have sought Him, and He has given us rest on every side.” So they built and prospered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_8","015_14_8","2CH","14","8","8","Asa had an army of 300,000 men from Judah bearing large shields and spears, and 280,000 men from Benjamin bearing small shields and drawing the bow. All these were mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_9","015_14_9","2CH","14","9","9","Then Zerah the Cushite came against them with an army of 1,000,000 men and 300 chariots, and they advanced as far as Mareshah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_10","015_14_10","2CH","14","10","10","So Asa marched out against him and lined up in battle formation in the Valley of Zephathah near Mareshah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_11","015_14_11","2CH","14","11","11","Then Asa cried out to the LORD his God: “O LORD, there is no one besides You to help the powerless against the mighty. Help us, O LORD our God, for we rely on You, and in Your name we have come against this multitude. O LORD, You are our God. Do not let a mere mortal prevail against You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_12","015_14_12","2CH","14","12","12","So the LORD struck down the Cushites before Asa and Judah, and the Cushites fled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_13","015_14_13","2CH","14","13","13","Then Asa and his army pursued them as far as Gerar. The Cushites fell and could not recover, for they were crushed before the LORD and His army. So the people of Judah carried off a great amount of plunder ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_14","015_14_14","2CH","14","14","14","and attacked all the cities around Gerar, because the terror of the LORD had fallen upon them. They plundered all the cities, since there was much plunder there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R214_15","015_14_15","2CH","14","15","15","They also attacked the tents of the herdsmen and carried off many sheep and camels. Then they returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_1","015_15_1","2CH","15","1","1","Now the Spirit of God came upon Azariah son of Oded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_2","015_15_2","2CH","15","2","2","So he went out to meet Asa and said to him, “Listen to me, Asa and all Judah and Benjamin. The LORD is with you when you are with Him. If you seek Him, He will be found by you, but if you forsake Him, He will forsake you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_3","015_15_3","2CH","15","3","3","For many years Israel has been without the true God, without a priest to instruct them, and without the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_4","015_15_4","2CH","15","4","4","But in their distress they turned to the LORD, the God of Israel, and sought Him, and He was found by them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_5","015_15_5","2CH","15","5","5","In those days there was no safety for travelers, because the residents of the lands had many conflicts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_6","015_15_6","2CH","15","6","6","Nation was crushed by nation, and city by city, for God afflicted them with all kinds of adversity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_7","015_15_7","2CH","15","7","7","But as for you, be strong; do not be discouraged, for your work will be rewarded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_8","015_15_8","2CH","15","8","8","When Asa heard these words and the prophecy of Azariah son of Oded the prophet, he took courage and removed the detestable idols from the whole land of Judah and Benjamin and from the cities he had captured in the hill country of Ephraim. He then restored the altar of the LORD that was in front of the portico of the LORD’s temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_9","015_15_9","2CH","15","9","9","And he assembled all Judah and Benjamin, along with those from the tribes of Ephraim, Manasseh, and Simeon who had settled among them, for great numbers had come over to him from Israel when they saw that the LORD his God was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_10","015_15_10","2CH","15","10","10","So they gathered together in Jerusalem in the third month of the fifteenth year of Asa’s reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_11","015_15_11","2CH","15","11","11","At that time they sacrificed to the LORD seven hundred oxen and seven thousand sheep from all the plunder they had brought back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_12","015_15_12","2CH","15","12","12","Then they entered into a covenant to seek the LORD, the God of their fathers, with all their heart and soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_13","015_15_13","2CH","15","13","13","And whoever would not seek the LORD, the God of Israel, would be put to death, whether young or old, man or woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_14","015_15_14","2CH","15","14","14","They took an oath to the LORD with a loud voice, with shouting, trumpets, and rams’ horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_15","015_15_15","2CH","15","15","15","And all Judah rejoiced over the oath, for they had sworn it with all their heart. They had sought Him earnestly, and He was found by them. So the LORD gave them rest on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_16","015_15_16","2CH","15","16","16","King Asa also removed his grandmother Maacah from her position as queen mother because she had made a detestable Asherah pole. Asa chopped down the pole, crushed it, and burned it in the Kidron Valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_17","015_15_17","2CH","15","17","17","The high places were not removed from Israel, but Asa’s heart was fully devoted all his days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_18","015_15_18","2CH","15","18","18","And he brought into the house of God the silver and gold and the articles that he and his father had dedicated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R215_19","015_15_19","2CH","15","19","19","And there was no war until the thirty-fifth year of Asa’s reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_1","015_16_1","2CH","16","1","1","In the thirty-sixth year of Asa’s reign, Baasha king of Israel went up against Judah and fortified Ramah to prevent anyone from leaving or entering the territory of Asa king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_2","015_16_2","2CH","16","2","2","So Asa withdrew the silver and gold from the treasuries of the house of the LORD and the royal palace, and he sent it with this message to Ben-hadad king of Aram, who was ruling in Damascus: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_3","015_16_3","2CH","16","3","3","“Let there be a treaty between me and you as there was between my father and your father. See, I have sent you silver and gold. Now go and break your treaty with Baasha king of Israel, so that he will withdraw from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_4","015_16_4","2CH","16","4","4","And Ben-hadad listened to King Asa and sent the commanders of his armies against the cities of Israel, conquering Ijon, Dan, Abel-maim, and all the store cities of Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_5","015_16_5","2CH","16","5","5","When Baasha learned of this, he stopped fortifying Ramah and abandoned his work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_6","015_16_6","2CH","16","6","6","Then King Asa brought all the men of Judah, and they carried away the stones of Ramah and the timbers Baasha had used for building. And with these materials he built up Geba and Mizpah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_7","015_16_7","2CH","16","7","7","At that time Hanani the seer came to King Asa of Judah and told him, “Because you have relied on the king of Aram and not on the LORD your God, the army of the king of Aram has escaped from your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_8","015_16_8","2CH","16","8","8","Were not the Cushites and Libyans a vast army with many chariots and horsemen? Yet because you relied on the LORD, He delivered them into your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_9","015_16_9","2CH","16","9","9","For the eyes of the LORD roam to and fro over all the earth, to show Himself strong on behalf of those whose hearts are fully devoted to Him. You have acted foolishly in this matter. From now on, therefore, you will be at war.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_10","015_16_10","2CH","16","10","10","Asa was angry with the seer and became so enraged over this matter that he put the man in prison. And at the same time Asa oppressed some of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_11","015_16_11","2CH","16","11","11","Now the acts of Asa, from beginning to end, are indeed written in the Book of the Kings of Judah and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_12","015_16_12","2CH","16","12","12","In the thirty-ninth year of his reign, Asa became diseased in his feet, and his disease became increasingly severe. Yet even in his illness he did not seek the LORD, but only the physicians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_13","015_16_13","2CH","16","13","13","So in the forty-first year of his reign, Asa died and rested with his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R216_14","015_16_14","2CH","16","14","14","And he was buried in the tomb that he had cut out for himself in the City of David. They laid him on a bier that was full of spices and various blended perfumes; then they made a great fire in his honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_1","015_17_1","2CH","17","1","1","Asa’s son Jehoshaphat reigned in his place, and he strengthened himself against Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_2","015_17_2","2CH","17","2","2","He stationed troops in every fortified city of Judah and put garrisons in the land of Judah and in the cities of Ephraim that his father Asa had captured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_3","015_17_3","2CH","17","3","3","Now the LORD was with Jehoshaphat because he walked in the earlier ways of his father David. He did not seek the Baals, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_4","015_17_4","2CH","17","4","4","but he sought the God of his father and walked by His commandments rather than the practices of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_5","015_17_5","2CH","17","5","5","So the LORD established the kingdom in his hand, and all Judah brought him tribute, so that he had an abundance of riches and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_6","015_17_6","2CH","17","6","6","And his heart took delight in the ways of the LORD; furthermore, he removed the high places and Asherah poles from Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_7","015_17_7","2CH","17","7","7","In the third year of his reign, Jehoshaphat sent his officials Ben-hail, Obadiah, Zechariah, Nethanel, and Micaiah to teach in the cities of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_8","015_17_8","2CH","17","8","8","accompanied by certain Levites—Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah, and Tob-adonijah—along with the priests Elishama and Jehoram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_9","015_17_9","2CH","17","9","9","They taught throughout Judah, taking with them the Book of the Law of the LORD. They went throughout the towns of Judah and taught the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_10","015_17_10","2CH","17","10","10","And the dread of the LORD fell upon all the kingdoms of the lands that surrounded Judah, so that they did not make war against Jehoshaphat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_11","015_17_11","2CH","17","11","11","Some Philistines also brought gifts and silver as tribute to Jehoshaphat, and the Arabs brought him 7,700 rams and 7,700 goats from their flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_12","015_17_12","2CH","17","12","12","Jehoshaphat grew stronger and stronger, and he built fortresses and store cities in Judah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_13","015_17_13","2CH","17","13","13","and kept vast supplies in the cities of Judah. He also had warriors in Jerusalem who were mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_14","015_17_14","2CH","17","14","14","These are their numbers according to the houses of their fathers: From Judah, the commanders of thousands: Adnah the commander, and with him 300,000 mighty men of valor; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_15","015_17_15","2CH","17","15","15","next to him, Jehohanan the commander, and with him 280,000; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_16","015_17_16","2CH","17","16","16","and next to him, Amasiah son of Zichri, the volunteer for the LORD, and with him 200,000 mighty men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_17","015_17_17","2CH","17","17","17","From Benjamin: Eliada, a mighty man of valor, and with him 200,000 armed with bows and shields; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_18","015_17_18","2CH","17","18","18","and next to him, Jehozabad, and with him 180,000 armed for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R217_19","015_17_19","2CH","17","19","19","These were the men who served the king, besides those he stationed in the fortified cities throughout Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_1","015_18_1","2CH","18","1","1","Now Jehoshaphat had an abundance of riches and honor, and he allied himself with Ahab by marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_2","015_18_2","2CH","18","2","2","And some years later he went down to visit Ahab in Samaria, where Ahab sacrificed many sheep and cattle for him and the people with him and urged him to march up to Ramoth-gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_3","015_18_3","2CH","18","3","3","Ahab king of Israel asked Jehoshaphat king of Judah, “Will you go with me against Ramoth-gilead?” And Jehoshaphat replied, “I am as you are, and my people are your people; we will join you in the war.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_4","015_18_4","2CH","18","4","4","But Jehoshaphat also said to the king of Israel, “Please inquire first for the word of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_5","015_18_5","2CH","18","5","5","So the king of Israel assembled the prophets, four hundred men, and asked them, “Should we go to war against Ramoth-gilead, or should we refrain?” “Go up,” they replied, “and God will deliver it into the hand of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_6","015_18_6","2CH","18","6","6","But Jehoshaphat asked, “Is there not still a prophet of the LORD here of whom we can inquire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_7","015_18_7","2CH","18","7","7","The king of Israel answered, “There is still one man through whom we can inquire of the LORD, but I hate him because he never prophesies anything good for me, but only bad. He is Micaiah son of Imlah.” “The king should not say that!” Jehoshaphat replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_8","015_18_8","2CH","18","8","8","So the king of Israel called one of his officials and said, “Bring Micaiah son of Imlah at once.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_9","015_18_9","2CH","18","9","9","Dressed in royal attire, the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat king of Judah were sitting on their thrones at the threshing floor by the entrance of the gate of Samaria, with all the prophets prophesying before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_10","015_18_10","2CH","18","10","10","Now Zedekiah son of Chenaanah had made for himself iron horns and declared, “This is what the LORD says: ‘With these you shall gore the Arameans until they are finished off.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_11","015_18_11","2CH","18","11","11","And all the prophets were prophesying the same, saying, “Go up to Ramoth-gilead and triumph, for the LORD will deliver it into the hand of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_12","015_18_12","2CH","18","12","12","Then the messenger who had gone to call Micaiah instructed him, “Behold, with one accord the words of the prophets are favorable to the king. So please let your words be like theirs, and speak favorably.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_13","015_18_13","2CH","18","13","13","But Micaiah said, “As surely as the LORD lives, I will speak whatever my God tells me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_14","015_18_14","2CH","18","14","14","When Micaiah arrived, the king asked him, “Micaiah, should we go to war against Ramoth-gilead, or should we refrain?” “Go up and triumph,” Micaiah replied, “for they will be delivered into your hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_15","015_18_15","2CH","18","15","15","But the king said to him, “How many times must I make you swear not to tell me anything but the truth in the name of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_16","015_18_16","2CH","18","16","16","So Micaiah declared: “I saw all Israel scattered on the hills like sheep without a shepherd. And the LORD said, ‘These people have no master; let each one return home in peace.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_17","015_18_17","2CH","18","17","17","Then the king of Israel said to Jehoshaphat, “Did I not tell you that he never prophesies good for me, but only bad?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_18","015_18_18","2CH","18","18","18","Micaiah continued, “Therefore hear the word of the LORD: I saw the LORD sitting on His throne, and all the host of heaven standing on His right and on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_19","015_18_19","2CH","18","19","19","And the LORD said, ‘Who will entice Ahab king of Israel to march up and fall at Ramoth-gilead?’ And one suggested this, and another that. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_20","015_18_20","2CH","18","20","20","Then a spirit came forward, stood before the LORD, and said, ‘I will entice him.’ ‘By what means?’ asked the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_21","015_18_21","2CH","18","21","21","And he replied, ‘I will go out and be a lying spirit in the mouths of all his prophets.’ ‘You will surely entice him and prevail,’ said the LORD. ‘Go and do it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_22","015_18_22","2CH","18","22","22","So you see, the LORD has put a lying spirit in the mouths of these prophets of yours, and the LORD has pronounced disaster against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_23","015_18_23","2CH","18","23","23","Then Zedekiah son of Chenaanah went up, struck Micaiah in the face, and demanded, “Which way did the Spirit of the LORD go when He departed from me to speak with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_24","015_18_24","2CH","18","24","24","Micaiah replied, “You will soon see, on that day when you go and hide in an inner room.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_25","015_18_25","2CH","18","25","25","And the king of Israel declared, “Take Micaiah and return him to Amon the governor of the city and to Joash the king’s son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_26","015_18_26","2CH","18","26","26","and tell them that this is what the king says: ‘Put this man in prison and feed him only bread and water until I return safely.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_27","015_18_27","2CH","18","27","27","But Micaiah replied, “If you ever return safely, the LORD has not spoken through me.” Then he added, “Take heed, all you people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_28","015_18_28","2CH","18","28","28","So the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat king of Judah went up to Ramoth-gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_29","015_18_29","2CH","18","29","29","And the king of Israel said to Jehoshaphat, “I will disguise myself and go into battle, but you wear your royal robes.” So the king of Israel disguised himself and went into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_30","015_18_30","2CH","18","30","30","Now the king of Aram had ordered his chariot commanders, “Do not fight with anyone, small or great, except the king of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_31","015_18_31","2CH","18","31","31","When the chariot commanders saw Jehoshaphat, they said, “This is the king of Israel!” So they turned to fight against him, but Jehoshaphat cried out, and the LORD helped him. God drew them away from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_32","015_18_32","2CH","18","32","32","And when the chariot commanders saw that he was not the king of Israel, they turned back from pursuing him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_33","015_18_33","2CH","18","33","33","However, a certain man drew his bow without taking special aim, and he struck the king of Israel between the joints of his armor. So the king said to his charioteer, “Turn around and take me out of the battle, for I am badly wounded!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R218_34","015_18_34","2CH","18","34","34","The battle raged throughout that day, and the king of Israel propped himself up in his chariot facing the Arameans until evening. And at sunset he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_1","015_19_1","2CH","19","1","1","When Jehoshaphat king of Judah had returned safely to his home in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_2","015_19_2","2CH","19","2","2","Jehu son of Hanani the seer went out to confront him and said to King Jehoshaphat, “Should you help the wicked and love those who hate the LORD? Because of this, the wrath of the LORD is upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_3","015_19_3","2CH","19","3","3","However, some good is found in you, for you have removed the Asherah poles from the land and have set your heart on seeking God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_4","015_19_4","2CH","19","4","4","Jehoshaphat lived in Jerusalem, and once again he went out among the people from Beersheba to the hill country of Ephraim and turned them back to the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_5","015_19_5","2CH","19","5","5","He appointed judges in the land, in each of the fortified cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_6","015_19_6","2CH","19","6","6","Then he said to the judges, “Consider carefully what you do, for you are not judging for man, but for the LORD, who is with you when you render judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_7","015_19_7","2CH","19","7","7","And now, may the fear of the LORD be upon you. Be careful what you do, for with the LORD our God there is no injustice or partiality or bribery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_8","015_19_8","2CH","19","8","8","Moreover, Jehoshaphat appointed in Jerusalem some of the Levites, priests, and heads of the Israelite families to judge on behalf of the LORD and to settle disputes. And they lived in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_9","015_19_9","2CH","19","9","9","He commanded them, saying, “You must serve faithfully and wholeheartedly in the fear of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_10","015_19_10","2CH","19","10","10","For every dispute that comes before you from your brothers who dwell in their cities—whether it regards bloodshed or some other violation of law, commandments, statutes, or ordinances—you are to warn them, so that they will not incur guilt before the LORD and wrath will not come upon you and your brothers. Do this, and you will not incur guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R219_11","015_19_11","2CH","19","11","11","Note that Amariah, the chief priest, will be over you in all that pertains to the LORD, and Zebadiah son of Ishmael, the ruler of the house of Judah, in all that pertains to the king. And the Levites will serve as officers before you. Act resolutely; may the LORD be with the upright!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_1","015_20_1","2CH","20","1","1","After this, the Moabites and Ammonites, together with some of the Meunites, came to make war against Jehoshaphat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_2","015_20_2","2CH","20","2","2","Then some men came and told Jehoshaphat, “A vast army is coming against you from Edom, from beyond the Sea; they are already in Hazazon-tamar” (that is, En-gedi). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_3","015_20_3","2CH","20","3","3","Jehoshaphat was alarmed and set his face to seek the LORD. And he proclaimed a fast throughout Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_4","015_20_4","2CH","20","4","4","So the people of Judah gathered to seek the LORD, and indeed, they came from all the cities of Judah to seek Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_5","015_20_5","2CH","20","5","5","Then Jehoshaphat stood in the assembly of Judah and Jerusalem in the house of the LORD in front of the new courtyard ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_6","015_20_6","2CH","20","6","6","and said, “O LORD, God of our fathers, are You not the God who is in heaven, and do You not rule over all the kingdoms of the nations? Power and might are in Your hand, and no one can stand against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_7","015_20_7","2CH","20","7","7","Our God, did You not drive out the inhabitants of this land before Your people Israel and give it forever to the descendants of Abraham Your friend? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_8","015_20_8","2CH","20","8","8","They have lived in the land and have built in it a sanctuary for Your Name, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_9","015_20_9","2CH","20","9","9","‘If disaster comes upon us—whether sword or judgment, plague or famine—we will stand before this temple and before You, for Your Name is in this temple. We will cry out to You in our distress, and You will hear us and save us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_10","015_20_10","2CH","20","10","10","And now, here are the men of Ammon, Moab, and Mount Seir, whom You did not let Israel invade when they came out of the land of Egypt. So Israel turned away from them and did not destroy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_11","015_20_11","2CH","20","11","11","See how they are repaying us by coming to drive us out of the possession that You gave us as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_12","015_20_12","2CH","20","12","12","Our God, will You not judge them? For we are powerless before this vast army that comes against us. We do not know what to do, but our eyes are upon You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_13","015_20_13","2CH","20","13","13","Meanwhile all the men of Judah, with their wives and children and little ones, were standing before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_14","015_20_14","2CH","20","14","14","Then the Spirit of the LORD came upon Jahaziel son of Zechariah, the son of Benaiah, the son of Jeiel, the son of Mattaniah, a Levite from Asaph’s descendants, as he stood in the midst of the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_15","015_20_15","2CH","20","15","15","And he said, “Listen, all you people of Judah and Jerusalem! Listen, King Jehoshaphat! This is what the LORD says: ‘Do not be afraid or discouraged because of this vast army, for the battle does not belong to you, but to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_16","015_20_16","2CH","20","16","16","Tomorrow you are to march down against them. You will see them coming up the Ascent of Ziz, and you will find them at the end of the valley facing the Wilderness of Jeruel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_17","015_20_17","2CH","20","17","17","You need not fight this battle. Take up your positions, stand firm, and see the salvation of the LORD on your behalf, O Judah and Jerusalem. Do not be afraid or discouraged. Go out and face them tomorrow, for the LORD is with you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_18","015_20_18","2CH","20","18","18","Then Jehoshaphat bowed facedown, and all the people of Judah and Jerusalem fell down before the LORD to worship Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_19","015_20_19","2CH","20","19","19","And the Levites from the Kohathites and Korahites stood up to praise the LORD, the God of Israel, shouting in a very loud voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_20","015_20_20","2CH","20","20","20","Early in the morning they got up and left for the Wilderness of Tekoa. As they set out, Jehoshaphat stood up and said, “Hear me, O people of Judah and Jerusalem. Believe in the LORD your God, and you will be upheld; believe in His prophets, and you will succeed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_21","015_20_21","2CH","20","21","21","Then Jehoshaphat consulted with the people and appointed those who would sing to the LORD and praise the splendor of His holiness. As they went out before the army, they were singing: “Give thanks to the LORD, for His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_22","015_20_22","2CH","20","22","22","The moment they began their shouts and praises, the LORD set ambushes against the men of Ammon, Moab, and Mount Seir who had come against Judah, and they were defeated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_23","015_20_23","2CH","20","23","23","The Ammonites and Moabites rose up against the inhabitants of Mount Seir, devoting them to destruction. And when they had finished off the inhabitants of Seir, they helped to destroy one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_24","015_20_24","2CH","20","24","24","When the men of Judah came to a place overlooking the wilderness, they looked for the vast army, but there were only corpses lying on the ground; no one had escaped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_25","015_20_25","2CH","20","25","25","Then Jehoshaphat and his people went to carry off the plunder, and they found on the bodies an abundance of goods and valuables—more than they could carry away. They were gathering the plunder for three days because there was so much. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_26","015_20_26","2CH","20","26","26","On the fourth day they assembled in the Valley of Beracah, where they blessed the LORD. Therefore that place is called the Valley of Beracah to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_27","015_20_27","2CH","20","27","27","Then all the men of Judah and Jerusalem, with Jehoshaphat at their head, returned joyfully to Jerusalem, for the LORD had made them rejoice over their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_28","015_20_28","2CH","20","28","28","So they entered Jerusalem and went into the house of the LORD with harps, lyres, and trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_29","015_20_29","2CH","20","29","29","And the fear of God came upon all the kingdoms of the lands when they heard that the LORD had fought against the enemies of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_30","015_20_30","2CH","20","30","30","Then Jehoshaphat’s kingdom was at peace, for his God had given him rest on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_31","015_20_31","2CH","20","31","31","So Jehoshaphat reigned over Judah. He was thirty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-five years. His mother’s name was Azubah daughter of Shilhi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_32","015_20_32","2CH","20","32","32","And Jehoshaphat walked in the way of his father Asa and did not turn away from it; he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_33","015_20_33","2CH","20","33","33","The high places, however, were not removed; the people had not yet set their hearts on the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_34","015_20_34","2CH","20","34","34","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoshaphat, from beginning to end, they are indeed written in the Chronicles of Jehu son of Hanani, which are recorded in the Book of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_35","015_20_35","2CH","20","35","35","Later, Jehoshaphat king of Judah made an alliance with Ahaziah king of Israel, who acted wickedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_36","015_20_36","2CH","20","36","36","They agreed to make ships to go to Tarshish, and these were built in Ezion-geber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R220_37","015_20_37","2CH","20","37","37","Then Eliezer son of Dodavahu of Mareshah prophesied against Jehoshaphat, saying, “Because you have allied yourself with Ahaziah, the LORD has destroyed your works.” So the ships were wrecked and were unable to sail to Tarshish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_1","015_21_1","2CH","21","1","1","And Jehoshaphat rested with his fathers and was buried with them in the City of David. And his son Jehoram reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_2","015_21_2","2CH","21","2","2","Jehoram’s brothers, the sons of Jehoshaphat, were Azariah, Jehiel, Zechariah, Azariah, Michael, and Shephatiah; these were all sons of Jehoshaphat king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_3","015_21_3","2CH","21","3","3","Their father had given them many gifts of silver and gold and precious things, as well as the fortified cities in Judah; but he gave the kingdom to Jehoram because he was the firstborn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_4","015_21_4","2CH","21","4","4","When Jehoram had established himself over his father’s kingdom, he strengthened himself by putting to the sword all his brothers along with some of the princes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_5","015_21_5","2CH","21","5","5","Jehoram was thirty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_6","015_21_6","2CH","21","6","6","And Jehoram walked in the ways of the kings of Israel, just as the house of Ahab had done. For he married a daughter of Ahab and did evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_7","015_21_7","2CH","21","7","7","Yet the LORD was unwilling to destroy the house of David, because of the covenant He had made with David, and since He had promised to maintain a lamp for David and his descendants forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_8","015_21_8","2CH","21","8","8","In the days of Jehoram, Edom rebelled against the hand of Judah and appointed their own king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_9","015_21_9","2CH","21","9","9","So Jehoram crossed into Edom with his officers and all his chariots. When the Edomites surrounded him and his chariot commanders, he rose up and attacked by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_10","015_21_10","2CH","21","10","10","So to this day Edom has been in rebellion against the hand of Judah. Likewise, Libnah rebelled against his hand at the same time, because Jehoram had forsaken the LORD, the God of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_11","015_21_11","2CH","21","11","11","Jehoram had also built high places on the hills of Judah; he had caused the people of Jerusalem to prostitute themselves and had led Judah astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_12","015_21_12","2CH","21","12","12","Then a letter came to Jehoram from Elijah the prophet, which stated: “This is what the LORD, the God of your father David, says: ‘You have not walked in the ways of your father Jehoshaphat or of Asa king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_13","015_21_13","2CH","21","13","13","but you have walked in the ways of the kings of Israel and have caused Judah and the people of Jerusalem to prostitute themselves, just as the house of Ahab prostituted itself. You have also killed your brothers, your father’s family, who were better than you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_14","015_21_14","2CH","21","14","14","So behold, the LORD is about to strike your people, your sons, your wives, and all your possessions with a serious blow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_15","015_21_15","2CH","21","15","15","And day after day you yourself will suffer from a severe illness, a disease of your bowels, until it causes your bowels to come out.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_16","015_21_16","2CH","21","16","16","Then the LORD stirred against Jehoram the spirit of the Philistines and Arabs who lived near the Cushites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_17","015_21_17","2CH","21","17","17","So they went to war against Judah, invaded it, and carried off all the possessions found in the king’s palace, along with his sons and wives; not a son was left to him except Jehoahaz, his youngest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_18","015_21_18","2CH","21","18","18","After all this, the LORD afflicted Jehoram with an incurable disease of the bowels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_19","015_21_19","2CH","21","19","19","This continued day after day until two full years had passed. Finally, his intestines came out because of his disease, and he died in severe pain. And his people did not make a fire in his honor as they had done for his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R221_20","015_21_20","2CH","21","20","20","Jehoram was thirty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eight years. He died, to no one’s regret, and was buried in the City of David, but not in the tombs of the kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_1","015_22_1","2CH","22","1","1","Then the people of Jerusalem made Ahaziah, the youngest son of Jehoram, king in his place, since the raiders who had come into the camp with the Arabs had killed all the older sons. So Ahaziah son of Jehoram became king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_2","015_22_2","2CH","22","2","2","Ahaziah was twenty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem one year. His mother’s name was Athaliah, the granddaughter of Omri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_3","015_22_3","2CH","22","3","3","Ahaziah also walked in the ways of the house of Ahab, for his mother was his counselor in wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_4","015_22_4","2CH","22","4","4","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, as the house of Ahab had done, for to his destruction they were his counselors after the death of his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_5","015_22_5","2CH","22","5","5","Ahaziah also followed their counsel and went with Joram son of Ahab king of Israel to fight against Hazael king of Aram at Ramoth-gilead. But the Arameans wounded Joram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_6","015_22_6","2CH","22","6","6","So he returned to Jezreel to recover from the wounds they had inflicted on him at Ramah when he fought against Hazael king of Aram. Then Ahaziah son of Jehoram king of Judah went down to Jezreel to visit Joram son of Ahab, because Joram had been wounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_7","015_22_7","2CH","22","7","7","Ahaziah’s downfall came from God when he went to visit Joram. When Ahaziah arrived, he went out with Joram to meet Jehu son of Nimshi, whom the LORD had anointed to destroy the house of Ahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_8","015_22_8","2CH","22","8","8","So while Jehu was executing judgment on the house of Ahab, he found the rulers of Judah and the sons of Ahaziah’s brothers who were serving Ahaziah, and he killed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_9","015_22_9","2CH","22","9","9","Then Jehu looked for Ahaziah, and Jehu’s soldiers captured him while he was hiding in Samaria. So Ahaziah was brought to Jehu and put to death. They buried him, for they said, “He is the grandson of Jehoshaphat, who sought the LORD with all his heart.” So no one was left from the house of Ahaziah with the strength to rule the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_10","015_22_10","2CH","22","10","10","When Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she proceeded to annihilate all the royal heirs of the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_11","015_22_11","2CH","22","11","11","But Jehoshabeath daughter of King Jehoram took Joash son of Ahaziah and stole him away from among the sons of the king who were being murdered, and she put him and his nurse in a bedroom. Because Jehoshabeath, the daughter of King Jehoram and the wife of Jehoiada the priest, was Ahaziah’s sister, she hid Joash from Athaliah so that she could not kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R222_12","015_22_12","2CH","22","12","12","And Joash remained hidden with them in the house of God for six years while Athaliah ruled the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_1","015_23_1","2CH","23","1","1","Then in the seventh year, Jehoiada strengthened himself and made a covenant with the commanders of hundreds—with Azariah son of Jeroham, Ishmael son of Jehohanan, Azariah son of Obed, Maaseiah son of Adaiah, and Elishaphat son of Zichri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_2","015_23_2","2CH","23","2","2","So they went throughout Judah and gathered the Levites from all the cities of Judah and the heads of the families of Israel. And when they came to Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_3","015_23_3","2CH","23","3","3","the whole assembly made a covenant with the king in the house of God. “Behold, the king’s son!” said Jehoiada. “He must reign, just as the LORD promised concerning the descendants of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_4","015_23_4","2CH","23","4","4","This is what you are to do: A third of you priests and Levites who come on duty on the Sabbath shall keep watch at the doors, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_5","015_23_5","2CH","23","5","5","a third shall be at the royal palace, and a third at the Foundation Gate, while all the others are to be in the courtyards of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_6","015_23_6","2CH","23","6","6","No one is to enter the house of the LORD except the priests and those Levites who serve; they may enter because they are consecrated, but all the people are to obey the requirement of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_7","015_23_7","2CH","23","7","7","The Levites must surround the king with weapons in hand, and anyone who enters the temple must be put to death. You must stay close to the king wherever he goes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_8","015_23_8","2CH","23","8","8","So the Levites and all Judah did everything that Jehoiada the priest had ordered. Each of them took his men—those coming on duty on the Sabbath and those going off duty—for Jehoiada the priest had not released any of the divisions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_9","015_23_9","2CH","23","9","9","Then Jehoiada the priest gave to the commanders of hundreds the spears and the large and small shields of King David that were in the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_10","015_23_10","2CH","23","10","10","He stationed all the troops, with their weapons in hand, surrounding the king by the altar and the temple, from the south side to the north side of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_11","015_23_11","2CH","23","11","11","Then Jehoiada and his sons brought out the king’s son, put the crown on him, presented him with the Testimony, and proclaimed him king. They anointed him and shouted, “Long live the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_12","015_23_12","2CH","23","12","12","When Athaliah heard the noise of the people running and cheering the king, she went out to them in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_13","015_23_13","2CH","23","13","13","And she looked and saw the king standing by his pillar at the entrance. The officers and trumpeters were beside the king, and all the people of the land were rejoicing and blowing trumpets, while the singers with musical instruments were leading the praises. Then Athaliah tore her clothes and screamed, “Treason, treason!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_14","015_23_14","2CH","23","14","14","And Jehoiada the priest sent out the commanders of hundreds in charge of the army, saying, “Bring her out between the ranks, and put to the sword anyone who follows her.” For the priest had said, “She must not be put to death in the house of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_15","015_23_15","2CH","23","15","15","So they seized Athaliah as she reached the entrance of the Horse Gate on the palace grounds, and there they put her to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_16","015_23_16","2CH","23","16","16","Then Jehoiada made a covenant between himself and the king and the people that they would be the LORD’s people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_17","015_23_17","2CH","23","17","17","So all the people went to the temple of Baal and tore it down. They smashed the altars and idols to pieces and killed Mattan the priest of Baal in front of the altars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_18","015_23_18","2CH","23","18","18","Moreover, Jehoiada put the oversight of the house of the LORD into the hands of the Levitical priests, whom David had appointed over the house of the LORD, to offer burnt offerings to the LORD as written in the Law of Moses, with rejoicing and song, as ordained by David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_19","015_23_19","2CH","23","19","19","He stationed gatekeepers at the gates of the house of the LORD, so that no one who was in any way unclean could enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_20","015_23_20","2CH","23","20","20","And he took with him the commanders of hundreds, the nobles, the rulers of the people, and all the people of the land, and they brought the king down from the house of the LORD and entered the royal palace through the Upper Gate. They seated King Joash on the royal throne, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R223_21","015_23_21","2CH","23","21","21","and all the people of the land rejoiced. And the city was quiet, because Athaliah had been put to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_1","015_24_1","2CH","24","1","1","Joash was seven years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem forty years. His mother’s name was Zibiah; she was from Beersheba. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_2","015_24_2","2CH","24","2","2","And Joash did what was right in the eyes of the LORD all the days of Jehoiada the priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_3","015_24_3","2CH","24","3","3","Jehoiada took for him two wives, and he had sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_4","015_24_4","2CH","24","4","4","Some time later, Joash set his heart on repairing the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_5","015_24_5","2CH","24","5","5","So he gathered the priests and Levites and said, “Go out to the cities of Judah and collect the money due annually from all Israel, to repair the house of your God. Do it quickly.” The Levites, however, did not make haste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_6","015_24_6","2CH","24","6","6","So the king called Jehoiada the high priest and said, “Why have you not required the Levites to bring from Judah and Jerusalem the tax imposed by Moses the servant of the LORD and by the assembly of Israel for the Tent of the Testimony?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_7","015_24_7","2CH","24","7","7","For the sons of that wicked woman Athaliah had broken into the house of God and had even used the sacred objects of the house of the LORD for the Baals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_8","015_24_8","2CH","24","8","8","At the king’s command a chest was made and placed outside, at the gate of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_9","015_24_9","2CH","24","9","9","And a proclamation was issued in Judah and Jerusalem that they were to bring to the LORD the tax imposed by Moses the servant of God on Israel in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_10","015_24_10","2CH","24","10","10","All the officers and all the people rejoiced and brought their contributions, and they dropped them in the chest until it was full. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_11","015_24_11","2CH","24","11","11","Whenever the chest was brought by the Levites to the king’s overseers and they saw that there was a large amount of money, the royal scribe and the officer of the high priest would come and empty the chest and carry it back to its place. They did this daily and gathered the money in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_12","015_24_12","2CH","24","12","12","Then the king and Jehoiada would give the money to those who supervised the labor on the house of the LORD to hire stonecutters and carpenters to restore the house of the LORD, as well as workers in iron and bronze to repair the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_13","015_24_13","2CH","24","13","13","So the workmen labored, and in their hands the repair work progressed. They restored the house of God according to its specifications, and they reinforced it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_14","015_24_14","2CH","24","14","14","When they were finished, they brought the rest of the money to the king and Jehoiada, and with it were made articles for the house of the LORD—utensils for the service and for the burnt offerings, dishes, and other objects of gold and silver. Throughout the days of Jehoiada, burnt offerings were presented regularly in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_15","015_24_15","2CH","24","15","15","When Jehoiada was old and full of years, he died at the age of 130. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_16","015_24_16","2CH","24","16","16","And Jehoiada was buried with the kings in the City of David, because he had done what was good in Israel for God and His temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_17","015_24_17","2CH","24","17","17","After the death of Jehoiada, however, the officials of Judah came and paid homage to the king, and he listened to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_18","015_24_18","2CH","24","18","18","They abandoned the house of the LORD, the God of their fathers, and served the Asherah poles and idols. So wrath came upon Judah and Jerusalem for this guilt of theirs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_19","015_24_19","2CH","24","19","19","Nevertheless, the LORD sent prophets to bring the people back to Him and to testify against them, but they would not listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_20","015_24_20","2CH","24","20","20","Then the Spirit of God came upon Zechariah son of Jehoiada the priest, who stood up before the people and said to them, “This is what God says: ‘Why do you transgress the commandments of the LORD so that you cannot prosper? Because you have forsaken the LORD, He has forsaken you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_21","015_24_21","2CH","24","21","21","But they conspired against Zechariah, and by order of the king, they stoned him in the courtyard of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_22","015_24_22","2CH","24","22","22","Thus King Joash failed to remember the kindness that Zechariah’s father Jehoiada had extended to him. Instead, Joash killed Jehoiada’s son. As he lay dying, Zechariah said, “May the LORD see this and call you to account.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_23","015_24_23","2CH","24","23","23","In the spring, the army of Aram went to war against Joash. They entered Judah and Jerusalem and destroyed all the leaders of the people, and they sent all the plunder to their king in Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_24","015_24_24","2CH","24","24","24","Although the Aramean army had come with only a few men, the LORD delivered into their hand a very great army. Because Judah had forsaken the LORD, the God of their fathers, judgment was executed on Joash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_25","015_24_25","2CH","24","25","25","And when the Arameans had withdrawn, they left Joash severely wounded. His own servants conspired against him for shedding the blood of the son of Jehoiada the priest, and they killed him on his bed. So he died and was buried in the City of David, but not in the tombs of the kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_26","015_24_26","2CH","24","26","26","Those who conspired against Joash were Zabad son of Shimeath the Ammonitess and Jehozabad son of Shimrith the Moabitess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R224_27","015_24_27","2CH","24","27","27","The accounts of the sons of Joash and the many pronouncements about him, and of the restoration of the house of God, are indeed written in the Treatise of the Book of the Kings. And his son Amaziah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_1","015_25_1","2CH","25","1","1","Amaziah was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-nine years. His mother’s name was Jehoaddan; she was from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_2","015_25_2","2CH","25","2","2","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, but not wholeheartedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_3","015_25_3","2CH","25","3","3","As soon as the kingdom was firmly in his grasp, Amaziah executed the servants who had murdered his father the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_4","015_25_4","2CH","25","4","4","Yet he did not put their sons to death, but acted according to what is written in the Law, in the Book of Moses, where the LORD commanded: “Fathers must not be put to death for their children, and children must not be put to death for their fathers; each is to die for his own sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_5","015_25_5","2CH","25","5","5","Then Amaziah gathered the people of Judah and assigned them according to their families to commanders of thousands and of hundreds. And he numbered those twenty years of age or older throughout Judah and Benjamin and found 300,000 chosen men able to serve in the army, bearing the spear and shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_6","015_25_6","2CH","25","6","6","He also hired 100,000 mighty men of valor from Israel for a hundred talents of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_7","015_25_7","2CH","25","7","7","But a man of God came to him and said, “O king, do not let the army of Israel go with you, for the LORD is not with Israel—not with any of the Ephraimites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_8","015_25_8","2CH","25","8","8","Even if you go and fight bravely in battle, God will overthrow you before the enemy, for God has power to help and power to overthrow.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_9","015_25_9","2CH","25","9","9","Amaziah asked the man of God, “What should I do about the hundred talents I have given to the troops of Israel?” And the man of God replied, “The LORD is able to give you much more than this.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_10","015_25_10","2CH","25","10","10","So Amaziah dismissed the troops who had come to him from Ephraim and sent them home. And they were furious with Judah and returned home in great anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_11","015_25_11","2CH","25","11","11","Amaziah, however, summoned his strength and led his troops to the Valley of Salt, where he struck down 10,000 men of Seir, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_12","015_25_12","2CH","25","12","12","and the army of Judah also captured 10,000 men alive. They took them to the top of a cliff and threw them down so that all were dashed to pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_13","015_25_13","2CH","25","13","13","Meanwhile the troops that Amaziah had dismissed from battle raided the cities of Judah, from Samaria to Beth-horon. They struck down 3,000 people and carried off a great deal of plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_14","015_25_14","2CH","25","14","14","When Amaziah returned from the slaughter of the Edomites, he brought back the gods of the Seirites, set them up as his own gods, bowed before them, and burned sacrifices to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_15","015_25_15","2CH","25","15","15","Therefore the anger of the LORD burned against Amaziah, and He sent him a prophet, who said, “Why have you sought this people’s gods, which could not deliver them from your hand?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_16","015_25_16","2CH","25","16","16","While he was still speaking, the king asked, “Have we made you the counselor to the king? Stop! Why be struck down?” So the prophet stopped, but he said, “I know that God has determined to destroy you, because you have done this and have not heeded my advice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_17","015_25_17","2CH","25","17","17","Then Amaziah king of Judah took counsel and sent word to the king of Israel Jehoash son of Jehoahaz, the son of Jehu. “Come, let us meet face to face,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_18","015_25_18","2CH","25","18","18","But Jehoash king of Israel replied to Amaziah king of Judah: “A thistle in Lebanon sent a message to a cedar in Lebanon, saying, ‘Give your daughter to my son in marriage.’ Then a wild beast in Lebanon came along and trampled the thistle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_19","015_25_19","2CH","25","19","19","You have said, ‘Look, I have defeated Edom,’ and your heart has become proud and boastful. Now stay at home. Why should you stir up trouble so that you fall—you and Judah with you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_20","015_25_20","2CH","25","20","20","But Amaziah would not listen, for this had come from God in order to deliver them into the hand of Jehoash, because they had sought the gods of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_21","015_25_21","2CH","25","21","21","So Jehoash king of Israel advanced, and he and Amaziah king of Judah faced each other at Beth-shemesh in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_22","015_25_22","2CH","25","22","22","And Judah was routed before Israel, and every man fled to his own home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_23","015_25_23","2CH","25","23","23","There at Beth-shemesh, Jehoash king of Israel captured Amaziah king of Judah, the son of Joash, the son of Jehoahaz. Then Jehoash brought him to Jerusalem and broke down the wall of Jerusalem from the Ephraim Gate to the Corner Gate—a section of four hundred cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_24","015_25_24","2CH","25","24","24","He took all the gold and silver and all the articles found in the house of God with Obed-edom and in the treasuries of the royal palace, as well as some hostages. Then he returned to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_25","015_25_25","2CH","25","25","25","Amaziah son of Joash king of Judah lived for fifteen years after the death of Jehoash son of Jehoahaz king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_26","015_25_26","2CH","25","26","26","As for the rest of the acts of Amaziah, from beginning to end, are they not written in the Book of the Kings of Judah and Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_27","015_25_27","2CH","25","27","27","From the time that Amaziah turned from following the LORD, a conspiracy was formed against him in Jerusalem, and he fled to Lachish. But men were sent after him to Lachish, and they killed him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R225_28","015_25_28","2CH","25","28","28","They carried him back on horses and buried him with his fathers in the City of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_1","015_26_1","2CH","26","1","1","All the people of Judah took Uzziah, who was sixteen years old, and made him king in place of his father Amaziah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_2","015_26_2","2CH","26","2","2","Uzziah was the one who rebuilt Eloth and restored it to Judah after King Amaziah rested with his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_3","015_26_3","2CH","26","3","3","Uzziah was sixteen years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-two years. His mother’s name was Jecoliah; she was from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_4","015_26_4","2CH","26","4","4","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father Amaziah had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_5","015_26_5","2CH","26","5","5","He sought God throughout the days of Zechariah, who instructed him in the fear of God. And as long as he sought the LORD, God gave him success. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_6","015_26_6","2CH","26","6","6","Uzziah went out to wage war against the Philistines, and he tore down the walls of Gath, Jabneh, and Ashdod. Then he built cities near Ashdod and among the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_7","015_26_7","2CH","26","7","7","God helped him against the Philistines, against the Arabs living in Gur-baal, and against the Meunites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_8","015_26_8","2CH","26","8","8","The Ammonites brought tribute to Uzziah, and his fame spread as far as the border of Egypt, for he had become exceedingly powerful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_9","015_26_9","2CH","26","9","9","Uzziah built towers in Jerusalem at the Corner Gate, the Valley Gate, and the angle in the wall, and he fortified them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_10","015_26_10","2CH","26","10","10","Since he had much livestock in the foothills and in the plain, he built towers in the desert and dug many cisterns. And since he was a lover of the soil, he had farmers and vinedressers in the hill country and in the fertile fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_11","015_26_11","2CH","26","11","11","Uzziah had an army ready for battle that went out to war by assigned divisions, as recorded by Jeiel the scribe and Maaseiah the officer under the direction of Hananiah, one of the royal officers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_12","015_26_12","2CH","26","12","12","The total number of family leaders of the mighty men of valor was 2,600. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_13","015_26_13","2CH","26","13","13","Under their authority was an army of 307,500 trained for war, a powerful force to support the king against his enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_14","015_26_14","2CH","26","14","14","Uzziah supplied the entire army with shields, spears, helmets, armor, bows, and slingstones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_15","015_26_15","2CH","26","15","15","And in Jerusalem he made skillfully designed devices to shoot arrows and catapult large stones from the towers and corners. So his fame spread far and wide, for he was helped tremendously until he became powerful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_16","015_26_16","2CH","26","16","16","But when Uzziah became powerful, his arrogance led to his own destruction. He was unfaithful to the LORD his God, for he entered the temple of the LORD to burn incense on the altar of incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_17","015_26_17","2CH","26","17","17","Then Azariah the priest, along with eighty brave priests of the LORD, went in after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_18","015_26_18","2CH","26","18","18","They took their stand against King Uzziah and said, “Uzziah, you have no right to offer incense to the LORD. Only the priests, the descendants of Aaron, are consecrated to burn incense. Leave the sanctuary, for you have acted unfaithfully; you will not receive honor from the LORD God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_19","015_26_19","2CH","26","19","19","Uzziah, with a censer in his hand to offer incense, was enraged. But while he raged against the priests in their presence in the house of the LORD before the altar of incense, leprosy broke out on his forehead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_20","015_26_20","2CH","26","20","20","When Azariah the chief priest and all the priests turned to him and saw his leprous forehead, they rushed him out. Indeed, he himself hurried to get out, because the LORD had afflicted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_21","015_26_21","2CH","26","21","21","So King Uzziah was a leper until the day of his death. He lived in isolation, leprous and cut off from the house of the LORD, while his son Jotham had charge of the royal palace and governed the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_22","015_26_22","2CH","26","22","22","As for the rest of the acts of Uzziah, from beginning to end, they are recorded by the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R226_23","015_26_23","2CH","26","23","23","And Uzziah rested with his fathers and was buried near them in a field of burial that belonged to the kings, for the people said, “He was a leper.” And his son Jotham reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_1","015_27_1","2CH","27","1","1","Jotham was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem sixteen years. His mother’s name was Jerushah daughter of Zadok. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_2","015_27_2","2CH","27","2","2","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father Uzziah had done. In addition, he did not enter the temple of the LORD. But the people still behaved corruptly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_3","015_27_3","2CH","27","3","3","Jotham rebuilt the Upper Gate of the house of the LORD, and he worked extensively on the wall at the hill of Ophel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_4","015_27_4","2CH","27","4","4","He also built cities in the hill country of Judah and fortresses and towers in the forests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_5","015_27_5","2CH","27","5","5","Jotham waged war against the king of the Ammonites and defeated them, and that year they gave him a hundred talents of silver, ten thousand cors of wheat, and ten thousand cors of barley. They paid him the same in the second and third years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_6","015_27_6","2CH","27","6","6","So Jotham grew powerful because he ordered his ways before the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_7","015_27_7","2CH","27","7","7","As for the rest of the acts of Jotham, along with all his wars and his ways, they are indeed written in the Book of the Kings of Israel and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_8","015_27_8","2CH","27","8","8","He was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem sixteen years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R227_9","015_27_9","2CH","27","9","9","And Jotham rested with his fathers and was buried in the City of David. And his son Ahaz reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_1","015_28_1","2CH","28","1","1","Ahaz was twenty years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem sixteen years. And unlike David his father, he did not do what was right in the eyes of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_2","015_28_2","2CH","28","2","2","Instead, he walked in the ways of the kings of Israel and even made cast images of the Baals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_3","015_28_3","2CH","28","3","3","Moreover, Ahaz burned incense in the Valley of Ben-hinnom and sacrificed his sons in the fire, according to the abominations of the nations that the LORD had driven out before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_4","015_28_4","2CH","28","4","4","And he sacrificed and burned incense on the high places, on the hills, and under every green tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_5","015_28_5","2CH","28","5","5","So the LORD his God delivered Ahaz into the hand of the king of Aram, who attacked him and took many captives to Damascus. Ahaz was also delivered into the hand of the king of Israel, who struck him with great force. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_6","015_28_6","2CH","28","6","6","For in one day Pekah son of Remaliah killed 120,000 valiant men in Judah. This happened because they had forsaken the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_7","015_28_7","2CH","28","7","7","Zichri, a mighty man of Ephraim, killed Maaseiah the son of the king, Azrikam the governor of the palace, and Elkanah the second to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_8","015_28_8","2CH","28","8","8","Then the Israelites took 200,000 captives from their kinsmen—women, sons, and daughters. They also carried off a great deal of plunder and brought it to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_9","015_28_9","2CH","28","9","9","But a prophet of the LORD named Oded was there, and he went out to meet the army that returned to Samaria. “Look,” he said to them, “because of His wrath against Judah, the LORD, the God of your fathers, has delivered them into your hand. But you have slaughtered them in a rage that reaches up to heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_10","015_28_10","2CH","28","10","10","And now you intend to reduce to slavery the men and women of Judah and Jerusalem. But are you not also guilty before the LORD your God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_11","015_28_11","2CH","28","11","11","Now therefore, listen to me and return the captives you took from your kinsmen, for the fierce anger of the LORD is upon you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_12","015_28_12","2CH","28","12","12","Then some of the leaders of the Ephraimites—Azariah son of Jehohanan, Berechiah son of Meshillemoth, Jehizkiah son of Shallum, and Amasa son of Hadlai—stood in opposition to those arriving from the war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_13","015_28_13","2CH","28","13","13","“You must not bring the captives here,” they said, “for you are proposing to bring guilt upon us from the LORD and to add to our sins and our guilt. For our guilt is great, and fierce anger is upon Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_14","015_28_14","2CH","28","14","14","So the armed men left the captives and the plunder before the leaders and all the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_15","015_28_15","2CH","28","15","15","Then the men who were designated by name arose, took charge of the captives, and provided from the plunder clothing for the naked. They clothed them, gave them sandals and food and drink, anointed their wounds, and put all the feeble on donkeys. So they brought them to Jericho, the City of Palms, to their brothers. Then they returned to Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_16","015_28_16","2CH","28","16","16","At that time King Ahaz sent for help from the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_17","015_28_17","2CH","28","17","17","The Edomites had again come and attacked Judah and carried away captives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_18","015_28_18","2CH","28","18","18","The Philistines had also raided the cities of the foothills and the Negev of Judah, capturing and occupying Beth-shemesh, Aijalon, and Gederoth, as well as Soco, Timnah, and Gimzo with their villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_19","015_28_19","2CH","28","19","19","For the LORD humbled Judah because Ahaz king of Israel had thrown off restraint in Judah and had been most unfaithful to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_20","015_28_20","2CH","28","20","20","Then Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria came to Ahaz but afflicted him rather than strengthening him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_21","015_28_21","2CH","28","21","21","Although Ahaz had taken a portion from the house of the LORD, from the royal palace, and from the princes and had presented it to the king of Assyria, it did not help him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_22","015_28_22","2CH","28","22","22","In the time of his distress, King Ahaz became even more unfaithful to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_23","015_28_23","2CH","28","23","23","He sacrificed to the gods of Damascus, who had defeated him, and he said, “Because the gods of the kings of Aram have helped them, I will sacrifice to them that they may help me.” But these gods were the downfall of Ahaz and of all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_24","015_28_24","2CH","28","24","24","Then Ahaz gathered up the articles of the house of God, cut them into pieces, shut the doors of the house of the LORD, and set up altars of his own on every street corner in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_25","015_28_25","2CH","28","25","25","In every city of Judah he built high places to offer incense to other gods, and so he provoked the LORD, the God of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_26","015_28_26","2CH","28","26","26","As for the rest of the acts of Ahaz and all his ways, from beginning to end, they are indeed written in the Book of the Kings of Judah and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R228_27","015_28_27","2CH","28","27","27","And Ahaz rested with his fathers and was buried in the city of Jerusalem, but he was not placed in the tombs of the kings of Israel. And his son Hezekiah reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_1","015_29_1","2CH","29","1","1","Hezekiah was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem twenty-nine years. His mother’s name was Abijah, the daughter of Zechariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_2","015_29_2","2CH","29","2","2","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD, just as his father David had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_3","015_29_3","2CH","29","3","3","In the first month of the first year of his reign, Hezekiah opened and repaired the doors of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_4","015_29_4","2CH","29","4","4","Then he brought in the priests and Levites and gathered them in the square on the east side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_5","015_29_5","2CH","29","5","5","“Listen to me, O Levites,” he said. “Consecrate yourselves now and consecrate the house of the LORD, the God of your fathers. Remove from the Holy Place every impurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_6","015_29_6","2CH","29","6","6","For our fathers were unfaithful and did evil in the sight of the LORD our God. They abandoned Him, turned their faces away from the dwelling place of the LORD, and turned their backs on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_7","015_29_7","2CH","29","7","7","They also shut the doors of the portico and extinguished the lamps. They did not burn incense or present burnt offerings in the Holy Place of the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_8","015_29_8","2CH","29","8","8","Therefore, the wrath of the LORD has fallen upon Judah and Jerusalem, and He has made them an object of terror, horror, and scorn, as you can see with your own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_9","015_29_9","2CH","29","9","9","For behold, this is why our fathers have fallen by the sword, and our sons and daughters and wives are in captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_10","015_29_10","2CH","29","10","10","Now it is in my heart to make a covenant with the LORD, the God of Israel, so that His fierce anger will turn away from us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_11","015_29_11","2CH","29","11","11","Now, my sons, do not be negligent, for the LORD has chosen you to stand before Him, to serve Him, to minister before Him, and to burn incense.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_12","015_29_12","2CH","29","12","12","Then the Levites set to work: Mahath son of Amasai and Joel son of Azariah from the Kohathites; Kish son of Abdi and Azariah son of Jehallelel from the Merarites; Joah son of Zimmah and Eden son of Joah from the Gershonites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_13","015_29_13","2CH","29","13","13","Shimri and Jeuel from the Elizaphanites; Zechariah and Mattaniah from the Asaphites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_14","015_29_14","2CH","29","14","14","Jehiel and Shimei from the Hemanites; and Shemaiah and Uzziel from the Jeduthunites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_15","015_29_15","2CH","29","15","15","When they had assembled their brothers and consecrated themselves, they went in to cleanse the house of the LORD, according to the command of the king by the words of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_16","015_29_16","2CH","29","16","16","So the priests went inside the house of the LORD to cleanse it, and they brought out to the courtyard all the unclean things that they found in the temple of the LORD. Then the Levites took these things and carried them out to the Kidron Valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_17","015_29_17","2CH","29","17","17","They began the consecration on the first day of the first month, and on the eighth day of the month they reached the portico of the LORD. For eight more days they consecrated the house of the LORD itself, finishing on the sixteenth day of the first month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_18","015_29_18","2CH","29","18","18","Then they went in to King Hezekiah and reported, “We have cleansed the entire house of the LORD, the altar of burnt offering with all its utensils, and the table of the showbread with all its utensils. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_19","015_29_19","2CH","29","19","19","Moreover, we have prepared and consecrated all the articles that King Ahaz in his unfaithfulness cast aside during his reign. They are now in front of the altar of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_20","015_29_20","2CH","29","20","20","Early the next morning King Hezekiah gathered the city officials and went up to the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_21","015_29_21","2CH","29","21","21","They brought seven bulls, seven rams, seven lambs, and seven male goats as a sin offering for the kingdom, for the sanctuary, and for Judah. And the king commanded the priests, the descendants of Aaron, to offer them on the altar of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_22","015_29_22","2CH","29","22","22","So they slaughtered the bulls, and the priests took the blood and splattered it on the altar. They slaughtered the rams and splattered the blood on the altar. And they slaughtered the lambs and splattered the blood on the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_23","015_29_23","2CH","29","23","23","Then they brought the goats for the sin offering before the king and the assembly, who laid their hands on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_24","015_29_24","2CH","29","24","24","And the priests slaughtered the goats and put their blood on the altar for a sin offering, to make atonement for all Israel, because the king had ordered the burnt offering and the sin offering for all Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_25","015_29_25","2CH","29","25","25","Hezekiah stationed the Levites in the house of the LORD with cymbals, harps, and lyres according to the command of David, of Gad the king’s seer, and of Nathan the prophet. For the command had come from the LORD through His prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_26","015_29_26","2CH","29","26","26","The Levites stood with the instruments of David, and the priests with the trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_27","015_29_27","2CH","29","27","27","And Hezekiah ordered that the burnt offering be sacrificed on the altar. When the burnt offering began, the song of the LORD and the trumpets began as well, accompanied by the instruments of David king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_28","015_29_28","2CH","29","28","28","The whole assembly was worshiping, the singers were singing, and the trumpeters were playing. All this continued until the burnt offering was completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_29","015_29_29","2CH","29","29","29","When the offerings were completed, the king and all those present with him bowed down and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_30","015_29_30","2CH","29","30","30","Then King Hezekiah and his officials ordered the Levites to sing praises to the LORD in the words of David and of Asaph the seer. So they sang praises with gladness and bowed down and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_31","015_29_31","2CH","29","31","31","Then Hezekiah said, “Now that you have consecrated yourselves to the LORD, come near and bring sacrifices and thank offerings to the house of the LORD.” So the assembly brought sacrifices and thank offerings, and all whose hearts were willing brought burnt offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_32","015_29_32","2CH","29","32","32","The number of burnt offerings the assembly brought was seventy bulls, a hundred rams, and two hundred lambs; all these were for a burnt offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_33","015_29_33","2CH","29","33","33","And the consecrated offerings were six hundred bulls and three thousand sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_34","015_29_34","2CH","29","34","34","However, since there were not enough priests to skin all the burnt offerings, their Levite brothers helped them until the work was finished and until the priests had consecrated themselves. For the Levites had been more diligent in consecrating themselves than the priests had been. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_35","015_29_35","2CH","29","35","35","Furthermore, the burnt offerings were abundant, along with the fat of the peace offerings and the drink offerings for the burnt offerings. So the service of the house of the LORD was established. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R229_36","015_29_36","2CH","29","36","36","Then Hezekiah and all the people rejoiced at what God had prepared for the people, because everything had been accomplished so quickly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_1","015_30_1","2CH","30","1","1","Then Hezekiah sent word throughout all Israel and Judah, and he also wrote letters to Ephraim and Manasseh inviting them to come to the house of the LORD in Jerusalem to keep the Passover of the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_2","015_30_2","2CH","30","2","2","For the king and his officials and the whole assembly in Jerusalem had decided to keep the Passover in the second month, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_3","015_30_3","2CH","30","3","3","since they had been unable to keep it at the regular time, because not enough priests had consecrated themselves and the people had not been gathered in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_4","015_30_4","2CH","30","4","4","This plan pleased the king and the whole assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_5","015_30_5","2CH","30","5","5","So they established a decree to circulate a proclamation throughout Israel, from Beersheba to Dan, that the people should come to keep the Passover of the LORD, the God of Israel, in Jerusalem. For they had not observed it in great numbers as prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_6","015_30_6","2CH","30","6","6","At the command of the king, the couriers went throughout Israel and Judah with letters from the king and his officials, which read: “Children of Israel, return to the LORD, the God of Abraham, Isaac, and Israel, so that He may return to those of you who remain, who have escaped the grasp of the kings of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_7","015_30_7","2CH","30","7","7","Do not be like your fathers and brothers who were unfaithful to the LORD, the God of their fathers, so that He made them an object of horror, as you can see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_8","015_30_8","2CH","30","8","8","Now do not stiffen your necks as your fathers did. Submit to the LORD and come to His sanctuary, which He has consecrated forever. Serve the LORD your God, so that His fierce anger will turn away from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_9","015_30_9","2CH","30","9","9","For if you return to the LORD, your brothers and sons will receive mercy in the presence of their captors and will return to this land. For the LORD your God is gracious and merciful; He will not turn His face away from you if you return to Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_10","015_30_10","2CH","30","10","10","And the couriers traveled from city to city through the land of Ephraim and Manasseh as far as Zebulun, but the people scorned and mocked them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_11","015_30_11","2CH","30","11","11","Nevertheless, some from Asher, Manasseh, and Zebulun humbled themselves and came to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_12","015_30_12","2CH","30","12","12","Moreover, the power of God was on the people in Judah to give them one heart to obey the command of the king and his officials according to the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_13","015_30_13","2CH","30","13","13","In the second month, a very great assembly gathered in Jerusalem to celebrate the Feast of Unleavened Bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_14","015_30_14","2CH","30","14","14","They proceeded to remove the altars in Jerusalem and to take away the incense altars and throw them into the Kidron Valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_15","015_30_15","2CH","30","15","15","And on the fourteenth day of the second month they slaughtered the Passover lamb. The priests and Levites were ashamed, and they consecrated themselves and brought burnt offerings to the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_16","015_30_16","2CH","30","16","16","They stood at their prescribed posts, according to the Law of Moses the man of God. The priests splattered the blood, which they received from the hand of the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_17","015_30_17","2CH","30","17","17","Since there were many in the assembly who had not consecrated themselves, the Levites were in charge of slaughtering the Passover lambs for every unclean person to consecrate the lambs to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_18","015_30_18","2CH","30","18","18","A large number of the people—many from Ephraim, Manasseh, Issachar, and Zebulun—had not purified themselves, yet they ate the Passover, contrary to what was written. But Hezekiah interceded for them, saying, “May the LORD, who is good, provide atonement for everyone ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_19","015_30_19","2CH","30","19","19","who sets his heart on seeking God—the LORD, the God of his fathers—even if he is not cleansed according to the purification rules of the sanctuary.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_20","015_30_20","2CH","30","20","20","And the LORD heard Hezekiah and healed the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_21","015_30_21","2CH","30","21","21","The Israelites who were present in Jerusalem celebrated the Feast of Unleavened Bread for seven days with great joy, and the Levites and priests praised the LORD day after day, accompanied by loud instruments of praise to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_22","015_30_22","2CH","30","22","22","And Hezekiah encouraged all the Levites who performed skillfully before the LORD. For seven days they ate their assigned portion, sacrificing peace offerings and giving thanks to the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_23","015_30_23","2CH","30","23","23","The whole assembly agreed to observe seven more days, so they observed seven days with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_24","015_30_24","2CH","30","24","24","For Hezekiah king of Judah contributed a thousand bulls and seven thousand sheep for the assembly, and the officials contributed a thousand bulls and ten thousand sheep for the assembly, and a great number of priests consecrated themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_25","015_30_25","2CH","30","25","25","Then the whole assembly of Judah rejoiced along with the priests and Levites and the whole assembly that had come from Israel, including the foreigners who had come from Israel and those who lived in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_26","015_30_26","2CH","30","26","26","So there was great rejoicing in Jerusalem, for nothing like this had happened there since the days of Solomon son of David king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R230_27","015_30_27","2CH","30","27","27","Then the priests and the Levites stood to bless the people, and God heard their voice, and their prayer came into His holy dwelling place in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_1","015_31_1","2CH","31","1","1","When all this had ended, the Israelites in attendance went out to the cities of Judah and broke up the sacred pillars, chopped down the Asherah poles, and tore down the high places and altars throughout Judah and Benjamin, as well as in Ephraim and Manasseh, until they had utterly destroyed them all. Then all the Israelites returned to their cities, each to his own property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_2","015_31_2","2CH","31","2","2","Hezekiah reestablished the divisions of the priests and Levites—each of them according to their duties as priests or Levites—for the burnt offerings and peace offerings, for ministry, for giving thanks, and for singing praises at the gates of the LORD’s dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_3","015_31_3","2CH","31","3","3","The king contributed from his own possessions for the regular morning and evening burnt offerings and for the burnt offerings on the Sabbaths, New Moons, and appointed feasts, as written in the Law of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_4","015_31_4","2CH","31","4","4","Moreover, he commanded the people living in Jerusalem to make a contribution for the priests and Levites so that they could devote themselves to the Law of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_5","015_31_5","2CH","31","5","5","As soon as the order went out, the Israelites generously provided the firstfruits of the grain, new wine, oil, and honey, and of all the produce of the field, and they brought in an abundance—a tithe of everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_6","015_31_6","2CH","31","6","6","And the Israelites and Judahites who lived in the cities of Judah also brought a tithe of their herds and flocks and a tithe of the holy things consecrated to the LORD their God, and they laid them in large heaps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_7","015_31_7","2CH","31","7","7","In the third month they began building up the heaps, and they finished in the seventh month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_8","015_31_8","2CH","31","8","8","When Hezekiah and his officials came and viewed the heaps, they blessed the LORD and His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_9","015_31_9","2CH","31","9","9","Then Hezekiah questioned the priests and Levites about the heaps, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_10","015_31_10","2CH","31","10","10","and Azariah, the chief priest of the household of Zadok, answered him, “Since the people began to bring their contributions into the house of the LORD, we have had enough to eat, and there is plenty left over, because the LORD has blessed His people; this great abundance is what is left over.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_11","015_31_11","2CH","31","11","11","Then Hezekiah commanded them to prepare storerooms in the house of the LORD, and they did so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_12","015_31_12","2CH","31","12","12","And they faithfully brought in the contributions, tithes, and dedicated gifts. Conaniah the Levite was the officer in charge of them, and his brother Shimei was second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_13","015_31_13","2CH","31","13","13","Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismachiah, Mahath, and Benaiah were overseers under the authority of Conaniah and his brother Shimei, by appointment of King Hezekiah and of Azariah the chief official of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_14","015_31_14","2CH","31","14","14","Kore son of Imnah the Levite, the keeper of the East Gate, was in charge of the freewill offerings given to God, distributing the contributions to the LORD and the consecrated gifts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_15","015_31_15","2CH","31","15","15","Under his authority, Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah, and Shecaniah faithfully distributed portions to their fellow priests in their cities, according to their divisions, old and young alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_16","015_31_16","2CH","31","16","16","In addition, they distributed portions to the males registered by genealogy who were three years of age or older—to all who would enter the house of the LORD for their daily duties for service in the responsibilities of their divisions— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_17","015_31_17","2CH","31","17","17","and to the priests enrolled according to their families in the genealogy, as well as to the Levites twenty years of age or older, according to their responsibilities and divisions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_18","015_31_18","2CH","31","18","18","The genealogy included all the little ones, wives, sons, and daughters of the whole assembly. For they had faithfully consecrated themselves as holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_19","015_31_19","2CH","31","19","19","As for the priests, the descendants of Aaron, who lived on the farmlands around each of their cities or in any other city, men were designated by name to distribute a portion to every male among the priests and to every Levite listed by the genealogies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_20","015_31_20","2CH","31","20","20","So this is what Hezekiah did throughout Judah. He did what was good and upright and true before the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R231_21","015_31_21","2CH","31","21","21","He acted with all his heart in every work that he began in the service of the house of God, and in the law and the commandments, in order to seek his God. And so he prospered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_1","015_32_1","2CH","32","1","1","After all these acts of faithfulness, Sennacherib king of Assyria came and invaded Judah. He laid siege to the fortified cities, intending to conquer them for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_2","015_32_2","2CH","32","2","2","When Hezekiah saw that Sennacherib had come to make war against Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_3","015_32_3","2CH","32","3","3","he consulted with his leaders and mighty men about stopping up the waters of the springs outside the city, and they helped him carry it out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_4","015_32_4","2CH","32","4","4","Many people assembled and stopped up all the springs and the stream that flowed through the land. “Why should the kings of Assyria come and find plenty of water?” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_5","015_32_5","2CH","32","5","5","Then Hezekiah worked resolutely to rebuild all the broken sections of the wall and to raise up towers on it. He also built an outer wall and reinforced the supporting terraces of the City of David, and he produced an abundance of weapons and shields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_6","015_32_6","2CH","32","6","6","Hezekiah appointed military commanders over the people and gathered the people in the square of the city gate. Then he encouraged them, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_7","015_32_7","2CH","32","7","7","“Be strong and courageous! Do not be afraid or discouraged before the king of Assyria and the vast army with him, for there is a greater One with us than with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_8","015_32_8","2CH","32","8","8","With him is only the arm of flesh, but with us is the LORD our God to help us and to fight our battles.” So the people were strengthened by the words of Hezekiah king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_9","015_32_9","2CH","32","9","9","Later, as Sennacherib king of Assyria and all his forces besieged Lachish, he sent his servants to Jerusalem with a message for King Hezekiah of Judah and all the people of Judah who were in Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_10","015_32_10","2CH","32","10","10","“This is what Sennacherib king of Assyria says: What is the basis of your confidence, that you remain in Jerusalem under siege? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_11","015_32_11","2CH","32","11","11","Is not Hezekiah misleading you to give you over to death by famine and thirst when he says, ‘The LORD our God will deliver us from the hand of the king of Assyria?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_12","015_32_12","2CH","32","12","12","Did not Hezekiah himself remove His high places and His altars and say to Judah and Jerusalem, ‘You must worship before one altar, and on it you shall burn sacrifices’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_13","015_32_13","2CH","32","13","13","Do you not know what I and my fathers have done to all the peoples of the lands? Have the gods of these nations ever been able to deliver their land from my hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_14","015_32_14","2CH","32","14","14","Who among all the gods of these nations that my fathers devoted to destruction has been able to deliver his people from my hand? How then can your God deliver you from my hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_15","015_32_15","2CH","32","15","15","So now, do not let Hezekiah deceive you, and do not let him mislead you like this. Do not believe him, for no god of any nation or kingdom has been able to deliver his people from my hand or from the hand of my fathers. How much less will your God deliver you from my hand!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_16","015_32_16","2CH","32","16","16","And the servants of Sennacherib spoke further against the LORD God and against His servant Hezekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_17","015_32_17","2CH","32","17","17","He also wrote letters mocking the LORD, the God of Israel, and saying against Him: “Just as the gods of the nations did not deliver their people from my hand, so the God of Hezekiah will not deliver His people from my hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_18","015_32_18","2CH","32","18","18","Then the Assyrians called out loudly in Hebrew to the people of Jerusalem who were on the wall, to frighten and terrify them in order to capture the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_19","015_32_19","2CH","32","19","19","They spoke against the God of Jerusalem as they had spoken against the gods of the peoples of the earth—the work of human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_20","015_32_20","2CH","32","20","20","In response, King Hezekiah and the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz cried out to heaven in prayer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_21","015_32_21","2CH","32","21","21","and the LORD sent an angel who annihilated every mighty man of valor and every leader and commander in the camp of the king of Assyria. So he withdrew to his own land in disgrace. And when he entered the temple of his god, some of his own sons struck him down with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_22","015_32_22","2CH","32","22","22","So the LORD saved Hezekiah and the people of Jerusalem from the hands of King Sennacherib of Assyria and all others, and He gave them rest on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_23","015_32_23","2CH","32","23","23","Many brought offerings to Jerusalem for the LORD and valuable gifts for Hezekiah king of Judah, and from then on he was exalted in the eyes of all nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_24","015_32_24","2CH","32","24","24","In those days Hezekiah became mortally ill. So he prayed to the LORD, who spoke to him and gave him a sign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_25","015_32_25","2CH","32","25","25","But because his heart was proud, Hezekiah did not repay the favor shown to him. Therefore wrath came upon him and upon Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_26","015_32_26","2CH","32","26","26","Then Hezekiah humbled the pride of his heart—he and the people of Jerusalem—so that the wrath of the LORD did not come upon them during the days of Hezekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_27","015_32_27","2CH","32","27","27","Hezekiah had very great riches and honor, and he made treasuries for his silver, gold, precious stones, spices, shields, and all kinds of valuable articles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_28","015_32_28","2CH","32","28","28","He also made storehouses for the harvest of grain and new wine and oil, stalls for all kinds of livestock, and pens for the flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_29","015_32_29","2CH","32","29","29","He made cities for himself, and he acquired herds of sheep and cattle in abundance, for God gave him very great wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_30","015_32_30","2CH","32","30","30","It was Hezekiah who blocked the upper outlet of the Spring of Gihon and channeled it down to the west side of the City of David. And Hezekiah prospered in all that he did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_31","015_32_31","2CH","32","31","31","And so when ambassadors of the rulers of Babylon were sent to him to inquire about the wonder that had happened in the land, God left him alone to test him, that He might know all that was in Hezekiah’s heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_32","015_32_32","2CH","32","32","32","As for the rest of the acts of Hezekiah and his deeds of loving devotion, they are indeed written in the vision of the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz in the Book of the Kings of Judah and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R232_33","015_32_33","2CH","32","33","33","And Hezekiah rested with his fathers and was buried in the upper tombs of David’s descendants. All Judah and the people of Jerusalem paid him honor at his death. And his son Manasseh reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_1","015_33_1","2CH","33","1","1","Manasseh was twelve years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-five years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_2","015_33_2","2CH","33","2","2","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD by following the abominations of the nations that the LORD had driven out before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_3","015_33_3","2CH","33","3","3","For he rebuilt the high places that his father Hezekiah had torn down, and he raised up altars for the Baals and made Asherah poles. And he worshiped and served all the host of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_4","015_33_4","2CH","33","4","4","Manasseh also built altars in the house of the LORD, of which the LORD had said, “My Name will remain in Jerusalem forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_5","015_33_5","2CH","33","5","5","In both courtyards of the house of the LORD, he built altars to all the host of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_6","015_33_6","2CH","33","6","6","He sacrificed his sons in the fire in the Valley of Ben-hinnom. He practiced sorcery, divination, and witchcraft, and consulted mediums and spiritists. He did great evil in the sight of the LORD, provoking Him to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_7","015_33_7","2CH","33","7","7","Manasseh even took the carved image he had made and set it up in the house of God, of which God had said to David and his son Solomon, “In this temple and in Jerusalem, which I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel, I will establish My Name forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_8","015_33_8","2CH","33","8","8","I will never again cause the feet of the Israelites to leave the land that I assigned to your fathers, if only they are careful to do all that I have commanded them through Moses—all the laws, statutes, and judgments.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_9","015_33_9","2CH","33","9","9","So Manasseh led the people of Judah and Jerusalem astray, so that they did greater evil than the nations that the LORD had destroyed before the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_10","015_33_10","2CH","33","10","10","And the LORD spoke to Manasseh and his people, but they did not listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_11","015_33_11","2CH","33","11","11","So the LORD brought against them the military commanders of the king of Assyria, who captured Manasseh, put a hook in his nose, bound him with bronze shackles, and took him to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_12","015_33_12","2CH","33","12","12","And in his distress, Manasseh sought the favor of the LORD his God and earnestly humbled himself before the God of his fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_13","015_33_13","2CH","33","13","13","And when he prayed to Him, the LORD received his plea and heard his petition. So He brought him back to Jerusalem and to his kingdom. Then Manasseh knew that the LORD is God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_14","015_33_14","2CH","33","14","14","After this, Manasseh rebuilt the outer wall of the City of David from west of Gihon in the valley to the entrance of the Fish Gate, and he brought it around the hill of Ophel and heightened it considerably. He also stationed military commanders in all the fortified cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_15","015_33_15","2CH","33","15","15","He removed the foreign gods and the idol from the house of the LORD, along with all the altars he had built on the temple mount and in Jerusalem, and he dumped them outside the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_16","015_33_16","2CH","33","16","16","Then he restored the altar of the LORD and sacrificed peace offerings and thank offerings on it, and he told Judah to serve the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_17","015_33_17","2CH","33","17","17","Nevertheless, the people still sacrificed at the high places, but only to the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_18","015_33_18","2CH","33","18","18","As for the rest of the acts of Manasseh, along with his prayer to his God and the words of the seers who spoke to him in the name of the LORD, the God of Israel, they are indeed written in the Chronicles of the Kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_19","015_33_19","2CH","33","19","19","His prayer and how God received his plea, as well as all his sin and unfaithfulness, and the sites where he built high places and set up Asherah poles and idols before he humbled himself, they are indeed written in the Records of the Seers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_20","015_33_20","2CH","33","20","20","And Manasseh rested with his fathers and was buried at his palace. And his son Amon reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_21","015_33_21","2CH","33","21","21","Amon was twenty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem two years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_22","015_33_22","2CH","33","22","22","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD, as his father Manasseh had done. Amon served and sacrificed to all the idols that his father Manasseh had made, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_23","015_33_23","2CH","33","23","23","but he did not humble himself before the LORD as his father Manasseh had done; instead, Amon increased his guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_24","015_33_24","2CH","33","24","24","Then the servants of Amon conspired against him and killed him in his palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R233_25","015_33_25","2CH","33","25","25","But the people of the land killed all those who had conspired against King Amon, and they made his son Josiah king in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_1","015_34_1","2CH","34","1","1","Josiah was eight years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem thirty-one years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_2","015_34_2","2CH","34","2","2","And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD and walked in the ways of his father David; he did not turn aside to the right or to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_3","015_34_3","2CH","34","3","3","In the eighth year of his reign, while he was still young, Josiah began to seek the God of his father David, and in the twelfth year he began to cleanse Judah and Jerusalem of the high places, the Asherah poles, the carved idols, and the cast images. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_4","015_34_4","2CH","34","4","4","Then in his presence the altars of the Baals were torn down, and he cut to pieces the incense altars that were above them. He shattered the Asherah poles, the carved idols, and the cast images, crushed them to dust, and scattered them over the graves of those who had sacrificed to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_5","015_34_5","2CH","34","5","5","Then he burned the bones of the priests on their altars. So he cleansed Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_6","015_34_6","2CH","34","6","6","Josiah did the same in the cities of Manasseh, Ephraim, and Simeon, as far as Naphtali, and in the ruins around them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_7","015_34_7","2CH","34","7","7","He tore down the altars and Asherah poles, crushed the idols to powder, and cut to pieces all the incense altars throughout the land of Israel. Then he returned to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_8","015_34_8","2CH","34","8","8","Now in the eighteenth year of his reign, in order to cleanse the land and the temple, Josiah sent Shaphan son of Azaliah, Maaseiah the governor of the city, and Joah son of Joahaz, the recorder, to repair the house of the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_9","015_34_9","2CH","34","9","9","So they went to Hilkiah the high priest and gave him the money that had been brought into the house of God, which the Levites who guarded the doors had collected from the people of Manasseh and Ephraim, from all the remnant of Israel, from all Judah and Benjamin, and from the people of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_10","015_34_10","2CH","34","10","10","They put it into the hands of those supervising the work in the house of the LORD, who in turn gave it to the workmen restoring and repairing the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_11","015_34_11","2CH","34","11","11","They also gave money to the carpenters and builders to buy dressed stone, as well as timbers for couplings and beams for the buildings that the kings of Judah had allowed to deteriorate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_12","015_34_12","2CH","34","12","12","And the men did the work faithfully. The Levites overseeing them were Jahath and Obadiah, descendants of Merari, and Zechariah and Meshullam, descendants of Kohath. Other Levites, all skilled with musical instruments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_13","015_34_13","2CH","34","13","13","were over the laborers and supervised all who did the work, task by task. Some of the Levites were secretaries, officers, and gatekeepers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_14","015_34_14","2CH","34","14","14","While they were bringing out the money that had been taken into the house of the LORD, Hilkiah the priest found the Book of the Law of the LORD given by Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_15","015_34_15","2CH","34","15","15","And Hilkiah said to Shaphan the scribe, “I have found the Book of the Law in the house of the LORD!” And he gave it to Shaphan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_16","015_34_16","2CH","34","16","16","Then Shaphan brought the book to the king and reported, “Your servants are doing all that has been placed in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_17","015_34_17","2CH","34","17","17","They have paid out the money that was found in the house of the LORD and have put it into the hands of the supervisors and workers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_18","015_34_18","2CH","34","18","18","Moreover, Shaphan the scribe told the king, “Hilkiah the priest has given me a book.” And Shaphan read it in the presence of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_19","015_34_19","2CH","34","19","19","When the king heard the words of the Law, he tore his clothes ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_20","015_34_20","2CH","34","20","20","and commanded Hilkiah, Ahikam son of Shaphan, Abdon son of Micah, Shaphan the scribe, and Asaiah the servant of the king: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_21","015_34_21","2CH","34","21","21","“Go and inquire of the LORD for me and for those remaining in Israel and Judah concerning the words in the book that has been found. For great is the wrath of the LORD that has been poured out on us because our fathers have not kept the word of the LORD by doing all that is written in this book.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_22","015_34_22","2CH","34","22","22","So Hilkiah and those the king had designated went and spoke to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum son of Tokhath, the son of Hasrah, the keeper of the wardrobe. She lived in Jerusalem, in the Second District. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_23","015_34_23","2CH","34","23","23","And Huldah said to them, “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Tell the man who sent you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_24","015_34_24","2CH","34","24","24","that this is what the LORD says: I am about to bring calamity on this place and on its people, according to all the curses written in the book that has been read in the presence of the king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_25","015_34_25","2CH","34","25","25","because they have forsaken Me and burned incense to other gods, that they might provoke Me to anger with all the works of their hands. My wrath will be poured out upon this place and will not be quenched.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_26","015_34_26","2CH","34","26","26","But as for the king of Judah, who sent you to inquire of the LORD, tell him that this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘As for the words that you heard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_27","015_34_27","2CH","34","27","27","because your heart was tender and you humbled yourself before God when you heard His words against this place and against its people, and because you have humbled yourself before Me and have torn your clothes and wept before Me, I have heard you,’ declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_28","015_34_28","2CH","34","28","28","‘Now I will indeed gather you to your fathers, and you will be gathered to your grave in peace. Your eyes will not see all the calamity that I will bring on this place and on its people.’” So they brought her answer back to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_29","015_34_29","2CH","34","29","29","Then the king summoned all the elders of Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_30","015_34_30","2CH","34","30","30","And he went up to the house of the LORD with all the people of Judah and Jerusalem, as well as the priests and the Levites—all the people great and small—and in their hearing he read all the words of the Book of the Covenant that had been found in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_31","015_34_31","2CH","34","31","31","So the king stood by the pillar and made a covenant before the LORD to follow the LORD and to keep His commandments, decrees, and statutes with all his heart and all his soul, and to carry out the words of the covenant that were written in this book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_32","015_34_32","2CH","34","32","32","Then he had everyone in Jerusalem and Benjamin take a stand in agreement to it. So all the people of Jerusalem carried out the covenant of God, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R234_33","015_34_33","2CH","34","33","33","And Josiah removed all the abominations from all the lands belonging to the Israelites, and he required everyone in Israel to serve the LORD their God. Throughout his reign they did not turn aside from following the LORD, the God of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_1","015_35_1","2CH","35","1","1","Then Josiah kept the Passover to the LORD in Jerusalem, and the Passover lamb was slaughtered on the fourteenth day of the first month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_2","015_35_2","2CH","35","2","2","He appointed the priests to their duties and encouraged them in the service of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_3","015_35_3","2CH","35","3","3","To the Levites who taught all Israel and were holy to the LORD, Josiah said: “Put the holy ark in the temple built by Solomon son of David king of Israel. It is not to be carried around on your shoulders. Now serve the LORD your God and His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_4","015_35_4","2CH","35","4","4","Prepare yourselves by families in your divisions, according to the instructions written by David king of Israel and Solomon his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_5","015_35_5","2CH","35","5","5","Moreover, stand in the Holy Place by the divisions of the families of your kinsmen the lay people, and by the divisions of the families of the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_6","015_35_6","2CH","35","6","6","Slaughter the Passover lambs, consecrate yourselves, and make preparations for your fellow countrymen to carry out the word of the LORD given by Moses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_7","015_35_7","2CH","35","7","7","From his own flocks and herds Josiah contributed 30,000 lambs and goats plus 3,000 bulls for the Passover offerings for all the people who were present. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_8","015_35_8","2CH","35","8","8","His officials also contributed willingly to the people and priests and Levites. Hilkiah, Zechariah, and Jehiel, the chief officials of the house of God, gave the priests 2,600 Passover offerings and 300 bulls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_9","015_35_9","2CH","35","9","9","Additionally, Conaniah and his brothers Shemaiah and Nethanel, as well as Hashabiah, Jeiel, and Jozabad, officers of the Levites, contributed to the Levites 5,000 Passover offerings and 500 bulls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_10","015_35_10","2CH","35","10","10","So the service was prepared; the priests stood in their places and the Levites in their divisions according to the king’s command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_11","015_35_11","2CH","35","11","11","And they slaughtered the Passover lambs, while the priests splattered the blood handed to them and the Levites skinned the animals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_12","015_35_12","2CH","35","12","12","They set aside the burnt offerings to be given to the divisions of the families of the people to offer to the LORD, as it is written in the Book of Moses. And they did the same with the bulls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_13","015_35_13","2CH","35","13","13","They roasted the Passover animals on the fire according to the regulation, and they boiled the other holy offerings in pots, kettles, and bowls and quickly brought them to all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_14","015_35_14","2CH","35","14","14","Afterward, they made preparations for themselves and for the priests, since the priests, the descendants of Aaron, were offering up burnt offerings and fat until nightfall. So the Levites made preparations for themselves and for the priests, the descendants of Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_15","015_35_15","2CH","35","15","15","The singers, the descendants of Asaph, were at their stations according to the command of David, Asaph, Heman, and Jeduthun the king’s seer. And the gatekeepers at each gate did not need to leave their posts, because their fellow Levites made preparations for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_16","015_35_16","2CH","35","16","16","So on that day the entire service of the LORD was carried out for celebrating the Passover and offering burnt offerings on the altar of the LORD, according to the command of King Josiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_17","015_35_17","2CH","35","17","17","The Israelites who were present also observed the Passover at that time, as well as the Feast of Unleavened Bread for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_18","015_35_18","2CH","35","18","18","No such Passover had been observed in Israel since the days of Samuel the prophet. None of the kings of Israel ever observed a Passover like the one that Josiah observed with the priests, the Levites, all Judah, the Israelites who were present, and the people of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_19","015_35_19","2CH","35","19","19","In the eighteenth year of Josiah’s reign, this Passover was observed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_20","015_35_20","2CH","35","20","20","After all this, when Josiah had set the temple in order, Neco king of Egypt marched up to fight at Carchemish by the Euphrates, and Josiah went out to confront him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_21","015_35_21","2CH","35","21","21","But Neco sent messengers to him, saying, “What is the issue between you and me, O king of Judah? I have not come against you today, but I am fighting another dynasty, and God has told me to hurry. So stop opposing God, who is with me, or He will destroy you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_22","015_35_22","2CH","35","22","22","Josiah, however, did not turn away from him; instead, in order to engage him in battle, he disguised himself. He did not listen to Neco’s words from the mouth of God, but went to fight him on the Plain of Megiddo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_23","015_35_23","2CH","35","23","23","There the archers shot King Josiah, who said to his servants, “Take me away, for I am badly wounded!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_24","015_35_24","2CH","35","24","24","So his servants took him out of his chariot, put him in his second chariot, and brought him to Jerusalem, where he died. And Josiah was buried in the tomb of his fathers, and all Judah and Jerusalem mourned for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_25","015_35_25","2CH","35","25","25","Then Jeremiah lamented over Josiah, and to this day all the male and female singers recite laments over Josiah. They established them as a statute for Israel, and indeed they are written in the Book of Laments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_26","015_35_26","2CH","35","26","26","As for the rest of the acts of Josiah and his deeds of loving devotion according to what is written in the Law of the LORD— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R235_27","015_35_27","2CH","35","27","27","his acts from beginning to end—they are indeed written in the Book of the Kings of Israel and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_1","015_36_1","2CH","36","1","1","Then the people of the land took Jehoahaz son of Josiah and made him king in Jerusalem in place of his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_2","015_36_2","2CH","36","2","2","Jehoahaz was twenty-three years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem three months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_3","015_36_3","2CH","36","3","3","And the king of Egypt dethroned him in Jerusalem and imposed on Judah a levy of a hundred talents of silver and a talent of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_4","015_36_4","2CH","36","4","4","Then Neco king of Egypt made Eliakim brother of Jehoahaz king over Judah and Jerusalem, and he changed Eliakim’s name to Jehoiakim. But Neco took Eliakim’s brother Jehoahaz and carried him off to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_5","015_36_5","2CH","36","5","5","Jehoiakim was twenty-five years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eleven years. And he did evil in the sight of the LORD his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_6","015_36_6","2CH","36","6","6","Then Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon came up against Jehoiakim and bound him with bronze shackles to take him to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_7","015_36_7","2CH","36","7","7","Nebuchadnezzar also took to Babylon some of the articles from the house of the LORD, and he put them in his temple in Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_8","015_36_8","2CH","36","8","8","As for the rest of the acts of Jehoiakim, the abominations he committed, and all that was found against him, they are indeed written in the Book of the Kings of Israel and Judah. And his son Jehoiachin reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_9","015_36_9","2CH","36","9","9","Jehoiachin was eighteen years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem three months and ten days. And he did evil in the sight of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_10","015_36_10","2CH","36","10","10","In the spring, King Nebuchadnezzar summoned Jehoiachin and brought him to Babylon, along with the articles of value from the house of the LORD. And he made Jehoiachin’s relative Zedekiah king over Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_11","015_36_11","2CH","36","11","11","Zedekiah was twenty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eleven years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_12","015_36_12","2CH","36","12","12","And he did evil in the sight of the LORD his God and did not humble himself before Jeremiah the prophet, who spoke for the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_13","015_36_13","2CH","36","13","13","He also rebelled against King Nebuchadnezzar, who had made him swear by God. But Zedekiah stiffened his neck and hardened his heart against turning to the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_14","015_36_14","2CH","36","14","14","Furthermore, all the leaders of the priests and the people multiplied their unfaithful deeds, following all the abominations of the nations, and they defiled the house of the LORD, which He had consecrated in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_15","015_36_15","2CH","36","15","15","Again and again the LORD, the God of their fathers, sent word to His people through His messengers because He had compassion on them and on His dwelling place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_16","015_36_16","2CH","36","16","16","But they mocked the messengers of God, despising His words and scoffing at His prophets, until the wrath of the LORD against His people was stirred up beyond remedy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_17","015_36_17","2CH","36","17","17","So He brought up against them the king of the Chaldeans, who put their young men to the sword in the sanctuary, sparing neither young men nor young women, neither elderly nor infirm. God gave them all into the hand of Nebuchadnezzar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_18","015_36_18","2CH","36","18","18","who carried off everything to Babylon—all the articles of the house of God, both large and small, and the treasures of the house of the LORD and of the king and his officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_19","015_36_19","2CH","36","19","19","Then the Chaldeans set fire to the house of God and broke down the wall of Jerusalem. They burned down all the palaces and destroyed every article of value. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_20","015_36_20","2CH","36","20","20","Those who escaped the sword were carried by Nebuchadnezzar into exile in Babylon, and they became servants to him and his sons until the kingdom of Persia came to power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_21","015_36_21","2CH","36","21","21","So the land enjoyed its Sabbath rest all the days of the desolation, until seventy years were completed, in fulfillment of the word of the LORD spoken through Jeremiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_22","015_36_22","2CH","36","22","22","In the first year of Cyrus king of Persia, to fulfill the word of the LORD spoken through Jeremiah, the LORD stirred the spirit of Cyrus king of Persia to send a proclamation throughout his kingdom and to put it in writing as follows: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("R236_23","015_36_23","2CH","36","23","23","“This is what Cyrus king of Persia says: ‘The LORD, the God of heaven, who has given me all the kingdoms of the earth, has appointed me to build a house for Him at Jerusalem in Judah. Whoever among you belongs to His people, may the LORD his God be with him, and may he go up.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_1","016_1_1","EZR","1","1","1","In the first year of Cyrus king of Persia, to fulfill the word of the LORD spoken through Jeremiah, the LORD stirred the spirit of Cyrus king of Persia to send a proclamation throughout his kingdom and to put it in writing as follows: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_2","016_1_2","EZR","1","2","2","“This is what Cyrus king of Persia says: ‘The LORD, the God of heaven, who has given me all the kingdoms of the earth, has appointed me to build a house for Him at Jerusalem in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_3","016_1_3","EZR","1","3","3","Whoever among you belongs to His people, may his God be with him, and may he go to Jerusalem in Judah and build the house of the LORD, the God of Israel; He is the God who is in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_4","016_1_4","EZR","1","4","4","And let every survivor, wherever he lives, be assisted by the men of that region with silver, gold, goods, and livestock, along with a freewill offering for the house of God in Jerusalem.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_5","016_1_5","EZR","1","5","5","So the family heads of Judah and Benjamin, along with the priests and Levites—everyone whose spirit God had stirred—prepared to go up and rebuild the house of the LORD in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_6","016_1_6","EZR","1","6","6","And all their neighbors supported them with articles of silver and gold, with goods and livestock, and with valuables, in addition to all their freewill offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_7","016_1_7","EZR","1","7","7","King Cyrus also brought out the articles belonging to the house of the LORD that Nebuchadnezzar had carried away from Jerusalem and placed in the temple of his gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_8","016_1_8","EZR","1","8","8","Cyrus king of Persia had them brought out by the hand of Mithredath the treasurer, who counted them out to Sheshbazzar the prince of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_9","016_1_9","EZR","1","9","9","This was the inventory: 30 gold dishes, 1,000 silver dishes, 29 silver utensils, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_10","016_1_10","EZR","1","10","10","30 gold bowls, 410 matching silver bowls, and 1,000 other articles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER1_11","016_1_11","EZR","1","11","11","In all, there were 5,400 gold and silver articles. Sheshbazzar brought all these along when the exiles went up from Babylon to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_1","016_2_1","EZR","2","1","1","Now these are the people of the province who came up from the captivity of the exiles carried away to Babylon by Nebuchadnezzar its king. They returned to Jerusalem and Judah, each to his own town, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_2","016_2_2","EZR","2","2","2","accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, and Baanah. This is the count of the men of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_3","016_2_3","EZR","2","3","3","the descendants of Parosh, 2,172; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_4","016_2_4","EZR","2","4","4","the descendants of Shephatiah, 372; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_5","016_2_5","EZR","2","5","5","the descendants of Arah, 775; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_6","016_2_6","EZR","2","6","6","the descendants of Pahath-moab (through the line of Jeshua and Joab), 2,812; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_7","016_2_7","EZR","2","7","7","the descendants of Elam, 1,254; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_8","016_2_8","EZR","2","8","8","the descendants of Zattu, 945; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_9","016_2_9","EZR","2","9","9","the descendants of Zaccai, 760; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_10","016_2_10","EZR","2","10","10","the descendants of Bani, 642; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_11","016_2_11","EZR","2","11","11","the descendants of Bebai, 623; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_12","016_2_12","EZR","2","12","12","the descendants of Azgad, 1,222; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_13","016_2_13","EZR","2","13","13","the descendants of Adonikam, 666; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_14","016_2_14","EZR","2","14","14","the descendants of Bigvai, 2,056; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_15","016_2_15","EZR","2","15","15","the descendants of Adin, 454; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_16","016_2_16","EZR","2","16","16","the descendants of Ater (through Hezekiah), 98; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_17","016_2_17","EZR","2","17","17","the descendants of Bezai, 323; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_18","016_2_18","EZR","2","18","18","the descendants of Jorah, 112; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_19","016_2_19","EZR","2","19","19","the descendants of Hashum, 223; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_20","016_2_20","EZR","2","20","20","the descendants of Gibbar, 95; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_21","016_2_21","EZR","2","21","21","the men of Bethlehem, 123; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_22","016_2_22","EZR","2","22","22","the men of Netophah, 56; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_23","016_2_23","EZR","2","23","23","the men of Anathoth, 128; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_24","016_2_24","EZR","2","24","24","the descendants of Azmaveth, 42; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_25","016_2_25","EZR","2","25","25","the men of Kiriath-jearim, Chephirah, and Beeroth, 743; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_26","016_2_26","EZR","2","26","26","the men of Ramah and Geba, 621; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_27","016_2_27","EZR","2","27","27","the men of Michmash, 122; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_28","016_2_28","EZR","2","28","28","the men of Bethel and Ai, 223; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_29","016_2_29","EZR","2","29","29","the descendants of Nebo, 52; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_30","016_2_30","EZR","2","30","30","the descendants of Magbish, 156; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_31","016_2_31","EZR","2","31","31","the descendants of the other Elam, 1,254; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_32","016_2_32","EZR","2","32","32","the descendants of Harim, 320; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_33","016_2_33","EZR","2","33","33","the men of Lod, Hadid, and Ono, 725; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_34","016_2_34","EZR","2","34","34","the men of Jericho, 345; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_35","016_2_35","EZR","2","35","35","and the descendants of Senaah, 3,630. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_36","016_2_36","EZR","2","36","36","The priests: The descendants of Jedaiah (through the house of Jeshua), 973; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_37","016_2_37","EZR","2","37","37","the descendants of Immer, 1,052; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_38","016_2_38","EZR","2","38","38","the descendants of Pashhur, 1,247; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_39","016_2_39","EZR","2","39","39","and the descendants of Harim, 1,017. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_40","016_2_40","EZR","2","40","40","The Levites: the descendants of Jeshua and Kadmiel (through the line of Hodaviah), 74. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_41","016_2_41","EZR","2","41","41","The singers: the descendants of Asaph, 128. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_42","016_2_42","EZR","2","42","42","The gatekeepers: the descendants of Shallum, the descendants of Ater, the descendants of Talmon, the descendants of Akkub, the descendants of Hatita, and the descendants of Shobai, 139 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_43","016_2_43","EZR","2","43","43","The temple servants: the descendants of Ziha, the descendants of Hasupha, the descendants of Tabbaoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_44","016_2_44","EZR","2","44","44","the descendants of Keros, the descendants of Siaha, the descendants of Padon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_45","016_2_45","EZR","2","45","45","the descendants of Lebanah, the descendants of Hagabah, the descendants of Akkub, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_46","016_2_46","EZR","2","46","46","the descendants of Hagab, the descendants of Shalmai, the descendants of Hanan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_47","016_2_47","EZR","2","47","47","the descendants of Giddel, the descendants of Gahar, the descendants of Reaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_48","016_2_48","EZR","2","48","48","the descendants of Rezin, the descendants of Nekoda, the descendants of Gazzam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_49","016_2_49","EZR","2","49","49","the descendants of Uzza, the descendants of Paseah, the descendants of Besai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_50","016_2_50","EZR","2","50","50","the descendants of Asnah, the descendants of Meunim, the descendants of Nephusim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_51","016_2_51","EZR","2","51","51","the descendants of Bakbuk, the descendants of Hakupha, the descendants of Harhur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_52","016_2_52","EZR","2","52","52","the descendants of Bazluth, the descendants of Mehida, the descendants of Harsha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_53","016_2_53","EZR","2","53","53","the descendants of Barkos, the descendants of Sisera, the descendants of Temah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_54","016_2_54","EZR","2","54","54","the descendants of Neziah, and the descendants of Hatipha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_55","016_2_55","EZR","2","55","55","The descendants of the servants of Solomon: the descendants of Sotai, the descendants of Hassophereth, the descendants of Peruda, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_56","016_2_56","EZR","2","56","56","the descendants of Jaala, the descendants of Darkon, the descendants of Giddel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_57","016_2_57","EZR","2","57","57","the descendants of Shephatiah, the descendants of Hattil, the descendants of Pochereth-hazzebaim, and the descendants of Ami. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_58","016_2_58","EZR","2","58","58","The temple servants and descendants of the servants of Solomon numbered 392 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_59","016_2_59","EZR","2","59","59","The following came up from Tel-melah, Tel-harsha, Cherub, Addan, and Immer, but they could not prove that their families were descended from Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_60","016_2_60","EZR","2","60","60","the descendants of Delaiah, the descendants of Tobiah, and the descendants of Nekoda, 652 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_61","016_2_61","EZR","2","61","61","And from among the priests: the descendants of Hobaiah, the descendants of Hakkoz, and the descendants of Barzillai (who had married a daughter of Barzillai the Gileadite and was called by their name). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_62","016_2_62","EZR","2","62","62","These men searched for their family records, but they could not find them and so were excluded from the priesthood as unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_63","016_2_63","EZR","2","63","63","The governor ordered them not to eat the most holy things until there was a priest to consult the Urim and Thummim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_64","016_2_64","EZR","2","64","64","The whole assembly numbered 42,360, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_65","016_2_65","EZR","2","65","65","in addition to their 7,337 menservants and maidservants, as well as their 200 male and female singers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_66","016_2_66","EZR","2","66","66","They had 736 horses, 245 mules, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_67","016_2_67","EZR","2","67","67","435 camels, and 6,720 donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_68","016_2_68","EZR","2","68","68","When they arrived at the house of the LORD in Jerusalem, some of the heads of the families gave freewill offerings to rebuild the house of God on its original site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_69","016_2_69","EZR","2","69","69","According to their ability, they gave to the treasury for this work 61,000 darics of gold, 5,000 minas of silver, and 100 priestly garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER2_70","016_2_70","EZR","2","70","70","So the priests, the Levites, the singers, the gatekeepers, and the temple servants, along with some of the people, settled in their own towns; and the rest of the Israelites settled in their towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_1","016_3_1","EZR","3","1","1","By the seventh month, the Israelites had settled in their towns, and the people assembled as one man in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_2","016_3_2","EZR","3","2","2","Then Jeshua son of Jozadak and his fellow priests, along with Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and his associates, began to build the altar of the God of Israel to sacrifice burnt offerings on it, as it is written in the Law of Moses the man of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_3","016_3_3","EZR","3","3","3","They set up the altar on its foundation and sacrificed burnt offerings on it to the LORD—both the morning and evening burnt offerings—even though they feared the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_4","016_3_4","EZR","3","4","4","They also celebrated the Feast of Tabernacles in accordance with what is written, and they offered burnt offerings daily based on the number prescribed for each day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_5","016_3_5","EZR","3","5","5","After that, they presented the regular burnt offerings and those for New Moons and for all the appointed sacred feasts of the LORD, as well as all the freewill offerings brought to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_6","016_3_6","EZR","3","6","6","On the first day of the seventh month, the Israelites began to offer burnt offerings to the LORD, although the foundation of the temple of the LORD had not been laid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_7","016_3_7","EZR","3","7","7","They gave money to the masons and carpenters, and food and drink and oil to the people of Sidon and Tyre to bring cedar logs from Lebanon to Joppa by sea, as authorized by Cyrus king of Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_8","016_3_8","EZR","3","8","8","In the second month of the second year after they had arrived at the house of God in Jerusalem, Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, Jeshua son of Jozadak, and the rest of their associates including the priests, the Levites, and all who had returned to Jerusalem from the captivity, began the work. They appointed Levites twenty years of age or older to supervise the construction of the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_9","016_3_9","EZR","3","9","9","So Jeshua and his sons and brothers, Kadmiel and his sons (descendants of Yehudah), and the sons of Henadad and their sons and brothers—all Levites—joined together to supervise those working on the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_10","016_3_10","EZR","3","10","10","When the builders had laid the foundation of the temple of the LORD, the priests in their apparel with trumpets, and the Levites (the sons of Asaph) with cymbals, took their positions to praise the LORD, as David king of Israel had prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_11","016_3_11","EZR","3","11","11","And they sang responsively with praise and thanksgiving to the LORD: “For He is good; for His loving devotion to Israel endures forever.” Then all the people gave a great shout of praise to the LORD, because the foundation of the house of the LORD had been laid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_12","016_3_12","EZR","3","12","12","But many of the older priests, Levites, and family heads who had seen the first temple wept loudly when they saw the foundation of this temple. Still, many others shouted joyfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER3_13","016_3_13","EZR","3","13","13","The people could not distinguish the shouts of joy from the sound of weeping, because the people were making so much noise. And the sound was heard from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_1","016_4_1","EZR","4","1","1","When the enemies of Judah and Benjamin heard that the exiles were building a temple for the LORD, the God of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_2","016_4_2","EZR","4","2","2","they approached Zerubbabel and the heads of the families, saying, “Let us build with you because, like you, we seek your God and have been sacrificing to Him since the time of King Esar-haddon of Assyria, who brought us here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_3","016_4_3","EZR","4","3","3","But Zerubbabel, Jeshua, and the other heads of the families of Israel replied, “You have no part with us in building a house for our God, since we alone must build it for the LORD, the God of Israel, as Cyrus king of Persia has commanded us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_4","016_4_4","EZR","4","4","4","Then the people of the land set out to discourage the people of Judah and make them afraid to build. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_5","016_4_5","EZR","4","5","5","They hired counselors against them to frustrate their plans throughout the reign of Cyrus king of Persia and down to the reign of Darius king of Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_6","016_4_6","EZR","4","6","6","At the beginning of the reign of Xerxes, an accusation was lodged against the people of Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_7","016_4_7","EZR","4","7","7","And in the days of Artaxerxes king of Persia, Bishlam, Mithredath, Tabeel, and the rest of his associates wrote a letter to Artaxerxes. It was written in Aramaic and then translated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_8","016_4_8","EZR","4","8","8","Rehum the commander and Shimshai the scribe wrote the letter against Jerusalem to King Artaxerxes as follows: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_9","016_4_9","EZR","4","9","9","From Rehum the commander, Shimshai the scribe, and the rest of their associates—the judges and officials over Tripolis, Persia, Erech and Babylon, the Elamites of Susa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_10","016_4_10","EZR","4","10","10","and the rest of the peoples whom the great and honorable Ashurbanipal deported and settled in the cities of Samaria and elsewhere west of the Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_11","016_4_11","EZR","4","11","11","(This is the text of the letter they sent to him.) To King Artaxerxes, From your servants, the men west of the Euphrates: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_12","016_4_12","EZR","4","12","12","Let it be known to the king that the Jews who came from you to us have returned to Jerusalem and are rebuilding that rebellious and wicked city. They are restoring its walls and repairing its foundations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_13","016_4_13","EZR","4","13","13","Let it now be known to the king that if that city is rebuilt and its walls are restored, they will not pay tribute, duty, or toll, and the royal treasury will suffer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_14","016_4_14","EZR","4","14","14","Now because we are in the service of the palace and it is not fitting for us to allow the king to be dishonored, we have sent to inform the king ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_15","016_4_15","EZR","4","15","15","that a search should be made of the record books of your fathers. In these books you will discover and verify that the city is a rebellious city, harmful to kings and provinces, inciting sedition from ancient times. That is why this city was destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_16","016_4_16","EZR","4","16","16","We advise the king that if this city is rebuilt and its walls are restored, you will have no dominion west of the Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_17","016_4_17","EZR","4","17","17","Then the king sent this reply: To Rehum the commander, Shimshai the scribe, and the rest of your associates living in Samaria and elsewhere in the region west of the Euphrates: Greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_18","016_4_18","EZR","4","18","18","The letter you sent us has been translated and read in my presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_19","016_4_19","EZR","4","19","19","I issued a decree, and a search was conducted. It was discovered that this city has revolted against kings from ancient times, engaging in rebellion and sedition. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_20","016_4_20","EZR","4","20","20","And mighty kings have ruled over Jerusalem and exercised authority over the whole region west of the Euphrates; and tribute, duty, and toll were paid to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_21","016_4_21","EZR","4","21","21","Now, therefore, issue an order for these men to stop, so that this city will not be rebuilt until I so order. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_22","016_4_22","EZR","4","22","22","See that you do not neglect this matter. Why allow this threat to increase and the royal interests to suffer? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_23","016_4_23","EZR","4","23","23","When the text of the letter from King Artaxerxes was read to Rehum, Shimshai the scribe, and their associates, they went immediately to the Jews in Jerusalem and forcibly stopped them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER4_24","016_4_24","EZR","4","24","24","Thus the construction of the house of God in Jerusalem ceased, and it remained at a standstill until the second year of the reign of Darius king of Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_1","016_5_1","EZR","5","1","1","Later, the prophets Haggai and Zechariah son of Iddo prophesied to the Jews in Judah and Jerusalem in the name of the God of Israel, who was over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_2","016_5_2","EZR","5","2","2","Then Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and Jeshua son of Jozadak rose up and began to rebuild the house of God in Jerusalem. And the prophets of God were with them, helping them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_3","016_5_3","EZR","5","3","3","At that time Tattenai the governor of the region west of the Euphrates, Shethar-bozenai, and their associates went to the Jews and asked, “Who authorized you to rebuild this temple and restore this structure?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_4","016_5_4","EZR","5","4","4","They also asked, “What are the names of the men who are constructing this building?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_5","016_5_5","EZR","5","5","5","But the eye of their God was on the elders of the Jews, so that they were not stopped until a report was sent to Darius and written instructions about this matter were returned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_6","016_5_6","EZR","5","6","6","This is the text of the letter that Tattenai the governor of the region west of the Euphrates, Shethar-bozenai, and their associates, the officials in the region, sent to King Darius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_7","016_5_7","EZR","5","7","7","The report they sent him read as follows: To King Darius: All peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_8","016_5_8","EZR","5","8","8","Let it be known to the king that we went into the province of Judah, to the house of the great God. The people are rebuilding it with large stones and placing timbers in the walls. This work is being carried out diligently and is prospering in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_9","016_5_9","EZR","5","9","9","So we questioned the elders and asked, “Who authorized you to rebuild this temple and restore this structure?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_10","016_5_10","EZR","5","10","10","We also asked for their names, so that we could write down the names of their leaders for your information. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_11","016_5_11","EZR","5","11","11","And this is the answer they returned: “We are servants of the God of heaven and earth, and we are rebuilding the temple that was built many years ago, which a great king of Israel built and completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_12","016_5_12","EZR","5","12","12","But since our fathers angered the God of heaven, He delivered them into the hand of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, the Chaldean who destroyed this temple and carried away the people to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_13","016_5_13","EZR","5","13","13","In the first year of his reign, however, Cyrus king of Babylon issued a decree to rebuild this house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_14","016_5_14","EZR","5","14","14","He also removed from the temple of Babylon the gold and silver articles belonging to the house of God, which Nebuchadnezzar had taken and carried there from the temple in Jerusalem. King Cyrus gave these articles to a man named Sheshbazzar, whom he appointed governor ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_15","016_5_15","EZR","5","15","15","and instructed, ‘Take these articles, put them in the temple in Jerusalem, and let the house of God be rebuilt on its original site.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_16","016_5_16","EZR","5","16","16","So this Sheshbazzar came and laid the foundation of the house of God in Jerusalem, and from that time until now it has been under construction, but it has not yet been completed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER5_17","016_5_17","EZR","5","17","17","Now, therefore, if it pleases the king, let a search be made of the royal archives in Babylon to see if King Cyrus did indeed issue a decree to rebuild the house of God in Jerusalem. Then let the king send us his decision in this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_1","016_6_1","EZR","6","1","1","Thus King Darius ordered a search of the archives stored in the treasury of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_2","016_6_2","EZR","6","2","2","And a scroll was found in the fortress of Ecbatana, in the province of Media, with the following written on it: Memorandum: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_3","016_6_3","EZR","6","3","3","In the first year of King Cyrus, he issued a decree concerning the house of God in Jerusalem: Let the house be rebuilt as a place for offering sacrifices, and let its foundations be firmly laid. It is to be sixty cubits high and sixty cubits wide, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_4","016_6_4","EZR","6","4","4","with three layers of cut stones and one of timbers. The costs are to be paid from the royal treasury. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_5","016_6_5","EZR","6","5","5","Furthermore, the gold and silver articles of the house of God, which Nebuchadnezzar took from the temple in Jerusalem and carried to Babylon, must also be returned to the temple in Jerusalem and deposited in the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_6","016_6_6","EZR","6","6","6","Therefore Darius decreed: To Tattenai governor of the region west of the Euphrates, Shethar-bozenai, and your associates and officials in the region: You must stay away from that place! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_7","016_6_7","EZR","6","7","7","Leave this work on the house of God alone. Let the governor and elders of the Jews rebuild this house of God on its original site. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_8","016_6_8","EZR","6","8","8","I hereby decree what you must do for these elders of the Jews who are rebuilding this house of God: The cost is to be paid in full to these men from the royal treasury out of the taxes of the provinces west of the Euphrates, so that the work will not be hindered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_9","016_6_9","EZR","6","9","9","Whatever is needed—young bulls, rams, and lambs for burnt offerings to the God of heaven, as well as wheat, salt, wine, and oil, as requested by the priests in Jerusalem—must be given to them daily without fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_10","016_6_10","EZR","6","10","10","Then they will be able to offer sacrifices of a sweet aroma to the God of heaven and to pray for the lives of the king and his sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_11","016_6_11","EZR","6","11","11","I also decree that if any man interferes with this directive, a beam is to be torn from his house and raised up, and he is to be impaled on it. And his own house shall be made a pile of rubble for this offense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_12","016_6_12","EZR","6","12","12","May God, who has caused His Name to dwell there, overthrow any king or people who lifts a hand to alter this decree or to destroy this house of God in Jerusalem. I, Darius, have issued the decree. Let it be carried out with diligence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_13","016_6_13","EZR","6","13","13","In response, Tattenai the governor of the region west of the Euphrates, Shethar-bozenai, and their associates diligently carried out what King Darius had decreed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_14","016_6_14","EZR","6","14","14","So the Jewish elders built and prospered through the prophesying of Haggai the prophet and Zechariah son of Iddo. They finished building according to the command of the God of Israel and the decrees of Cyrus, Darius, and Artaxerxes, kings of Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_15","016_6_15","EZR","6","15","15","And this temple was completed on the third day of the month of Adar, in the sixth year of the reign of King Darius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_16","016_6_16","EZR","6","16","16","Then the people of Israel—the priests, the Levites, and the rest of the exiles—celebrated the dedication of the house of God with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_17","016_6_17","EZR","6","17","17","For the dedication of the house of God they offered a hundred bulls, two hundred rams, four hundred lambs, and a sin offering for all Israel of twelve male goats, one for each tribe of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_18","016_6_18","EZR","6","18","18","They also appointed the priests by their divisions and the Levites by their groups to the service of God in Jerusalem, according to what is written in the Book of Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_19","016_6_19","EZR","6","19","19","On the fourteenth day of the first month, the exiles kept the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_20","016_6_20","EZR","6","20","20","All the priests and Levites had purified themselves and were ceremonially clean. And the Levites slaughtered the Passover lamb for all the exiles, for their priestly brothers, and for themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_21","016_6_21","EZR","6","21","21","The Israelites who had returned from exile ate it, together with all who had separated themselves from the uncleanness of the peoples of the land to seek the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER6_22","016_6_22","EZR","6","22","22","For seven days they kept the Feast of Unleavened Bread with joy, because the LORD had made them joyful and turned the heart of the king of Assyria toward them to strengthen their hands in the work on the house of the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_1","016_7_1","EZR","7","1","1","Many years later, during the reign of Artaxerxes king of Persia, Ezra son of Seraiah, the son of Azariah, the son of Hilkiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_2","016_7_2","EZR","7","2","2","the son of Shallum, the son of Zadok, the son of Ahitub, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_3","016_7_3","EZR","7","3","3","the son of Amariah, the son of Azariah, the son of Meraioth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_4","016_7_4","EZR","7","4","4","the son of Zerahiah, the son of Uzzi, the son of Bukki, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_5","016_7_5","EZR","7","5","5","the son of Abishua, the son of Phinehas, the son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the chief priest— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_6","016_7_6","EZR","7","6","6","this Ezra came up from Babylon. He was a scribe skilled in the Law of Moses, which the LORD, the God of Israel, had given. The king had granted Ezra all his requests, for the hand of the LORD his God was upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_7","016_7_7","EZR","7","7","7","So in the seventh year of King Artaxerxes, he went up to Jerusalem with some of the Israelites, including priests, Levites, singers, gatekeepers, and temple servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_8","016_7_8","EZR","7","8","8","Ezra arrived in Jerusalem in the fifth month of the seventh year of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_9","016_7_9","EZR","7","9","9","He had begun the journey from Babylon on the first day of the first month, and he arrived in Jerusalem on the first day of the fifth month, for the gracious hand of his God was upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_10","016_7_10","EZR","7","10","10","For Ezra had set his heart to study the Law of the LORD, to practice it, and to teach its statutes and ordinances in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_11","016_7_11","EZR","7","11","11","This is the text of the letter King Artaxerxes had given to Ezra the priest and scribe, an expert in the commandments and statutes of the LORD to Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_12","016_7_12","EZR","7","12","12","Artaxerxes, king of kings. To Ezra the priest, the scribe of the Law of the God of heaven: Greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_13","016_7_13","EZR","7","13","13","I hereby decree that any volunteers among the Israelites in my kingdom, including the priests and Levites, may go up with you to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_14","016_7_14","EZR","7","14","14","You are sent by the king and his seven counselors to evaluate Judah and Jerusalem according to the Law of your God, which is in your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_15","016_7_15","EZR","7","15","15","Moreover, you are to take with you the silver and gold that the king and his counselors have freely offered to the God of Israel, whose dwelling is in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_16","016_7_16","EZR","7","16","16","together with all the silver and gold you may find in all the province of Babylon, as well as the freewill offerings of the people and priests to the house of their God in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_17","016_7_17","EZR","7","17","17","With this money, therefore, you are to buy as many bulls, rams, and lambs as needed, together with their grain offerings and drink offerings, and offer them on the altar at the house of your God in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_18","016_7_18","EZR","7","18","18","You and your brothers may do whatever seems best with the rest of the silver and gold, according to the will of your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_19","016_7_19","EZR","7","19","19","You must deliver to the God of Jerusalem all the articles given to you for the service of the house of your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_20","016_7_20","EZR","7","20","20","And if anything else is needed for the house of your God that you may have occasion to supply, you may pay for it from the royal treasury. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_21","016_7_21","EZR","7","21","21","I, King Artaxerxes, decree to all the treasurers west of the Euphrates: Whatever Ezra the priest, the scribe of the Law of the God of heaven, may require of you, it must be provided promptly, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_22","016_7_22","EZR","7","22","22","up to a hundred talents of silver, a hundred cors of wheat, a hundred baths of wine, a hundred baths of olive oil, and salt without limit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_23","016_7_23","EZR","7","23","23","Whatever is commanded by the God of heaven must be done diligently for His house. For why should wrath fall on the realm of the king and his sons? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_24","016_7_24","EZR","7","24","24","And be advised that you have no authority to impose tribute, duty, or toll on any of the priests, Levites, singers, doorkeepers, temple servants, or other servants of this house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_25","016_7_25","EZR","7","25","25","And you, Ezra, according to the wisdom of your God, which you possess, are to appoint magistrates and judges to judge all the people west of the Euphrates—all who know the laws of your God. And you are to teach these laws to anyone who does not know them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_26","016_7_26","EZR","7","26","26","If anyone does not keep the law of your God and the law of the king, let a strict judgment be executed against him, whether death, banishment, confiscation of property, or imprisonment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_27","016_7_27","EZR","7","27","27","Blessed be the LORD, the God of our fathers, who has put into the heart of the king to so honor the house of the LORD in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER7_28","016_7_28","EZR","7","28","28","and who has shown me favor before the king, his counselors, and all his powerful officials. And because the hand of the LORD my God was upon me, I took courage and gathered the leaders of Israel to return with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_1","016_8_1","EZR","8","1","1","These are the family heads and genealogical records of those who returned with me from Babylon during the reign of King Artaxerxes: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_2","016_8_2","EZR","8","2","2","from the descendants of Phinehas, Gershom; from the descendants of Ithamar, Daniel; from the descendants of David, Hattush ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_3","016_8_3","EZR","8","3","3","of the descendants of Shecaniah; from the descendants of Parosh, Zechariah, and with him were registered 150 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_4","016_8_4","EZR","8","4","4","from the descendants of Pahath-Moab, Eliehoenai son of Zerahiah, and with him 200 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_5","016_8_5","EZR","8","5","5","from the descendants of Zattu, Shecaniah son of Jahaziel, and with him 300 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_6","016_8_6","EZR","8","6","6","from the descendants of Adin, Ebed son of Jonathan, and with him 50 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_7","016_8_7","EZR","8","7","7","from the descendants of Elam, Jeshaiah son of Athaliah, and with him 70 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_8","016_8_8","EZR","8","8","8","from the descendants of Shephatiah, Zebadiah son of Michael, and with him 80 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_9","016_8_9","EZR","8","9","9","from the descendants of Joab, Obadiah son of Jehiel, and with him 218 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_10","016_8_10","EZR","8","10","10","from the descendants of Bani, Shelomith son of Josiphiah, and with him 160 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_11","016_8_11","EZR","8","11","11","from the descendants of Bebai, Zechariah son of Bebai, and with him 28 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_12","016_8_12","EZR","8","12","12","from the descendants of Azgad, Johanan son of Hakkatan, and with him 110 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_13","016_8_13","EZR","8","13","13","from the later descendants of Adonikam, these were their names: Eliphelet, Jeiel, and Shemaiah, and with them 60 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_14","016_8_14","EZR","8","14","14","and from the descendants of Bigvai, both Uthai and Zaccur, and with them 70 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_15","016_8_15","EZR","8","15","15","Now I assembled these exiles at the canal that flows to Ahava, and we camped there three days. And when I searched among the people and priests, I found no Levites there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_16","016_8_16","EZR","8","16","16","Then I summoned the leaders: Eliezer, Ariel, Shemaiah, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zechariah, and Meshullam, as well as the teachers Joiarib and Elnathan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_17","016_8_17","EZR","8","17","17","And I sent them to Iddo, the leader at Casiphia, with a message for him and his kinsmen, the temple servants at Casiphia, that they should bring to us ministers for the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_18","016_8_18","EZR","8","18","18","And since the gracious hand of our God was upon us, they brought us Sherebiah—a man of insight from the descendants of Mahli son of Levi, the son of Israel—along with his sons and brothers, 18 men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_19","016_8_19","EZR","8","19","19","also Hashabiah, together with Jeshaiah, from the descendants of Merari, and his brothers and their sons, 20 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_20","016_8_20","EZR","8","20","20","They also brought 220 of the temple servants, all designated by name. David and the officials had appointed them to assist the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_21","016_8_21","EZR","8","21","21","And there by the Ahava Canal I proclaimed a fast, so that we might humble ourselves before our God and ask Him for a safe journey for us and our children, with all our possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_22","016_8_22","EZR","8","22","22","For I was ashamed to ask the king for an escort of soldiers and horsemen to protect us from our enemies on the road, since we had told him, “The hand of our God is gracious to all who seek Him, but His great anger is against all who forsake Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_23","016_8_23","EZR","8","23","23","So we fasted and petitioned our God about this, and He granted our request. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_24","016_8_24","EZR","8","24","24","Then I set apart twelve of the leading priests, together with Sherebiah, Hashabiah, and ten of their brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_25","016_8_25","EZR","8","25","25","and I weighed out to them the contribution of silver and gold and the articles that the king, his counselors, his leaders, and all the Israelites there had offered for the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_26","016_8_26","EZR","8","26","26","I weighed out into their hands 650 talents of silver, articles of silver weighing 100 talents, 100 talents of gold, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_27","016_8_27","EZR","8","27","27","20 gold bowls valued at 1,000 darics, and two articles of fine polished bronze, as precious as gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_28","016_8_28","EZR","8","28","28","Then I told them, “You are holy to the LORD, and these articles are holy. The silver and gold are a freewill offering to the LORD, the God of your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_29","016_8_29","EZR","8","29","29","Guard them carefully until you weigh them out in the chambers of the house of the LORD in Jerusalem before the leading priests, Levites, and heads of the Israelite families.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_30","016_8_30","EZR","8","30","30","So the priests and Levites took charge of the silver and gold and sacred articles that had been weighed out to be taken to the house of our God in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_31","016_8_31","EZR","8","31","31","On the twelfth day of the first month we set out from the Ahava Canal to go to Jerusalem, and the hand of our God was upon us to protect us from the hands of the enemies and bandits along the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_32","016_8_32","EZR","8","32","32","So we arrived at Jerusalem and rested there for three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_33","016_8_33","EZR","8","33","33","On the fourth day, in the house of our God, we weighed out the silver and gold and sacred articles into the hand of Meremoth son of Uriah, the priest. Eleazar son of Phinehas was with him, along with the Levites Jozabad son of Jeshua and Noadiah son of Binnui. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_34","016_8_34","EZR","8","34","34","Everything was verified by number and weight, and the total weight was recorded at that time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_35","016_8_35","EZR","8","35","35","Then the exiles who had returned from captivity sacrificed burnt offerings to the God of Israel: 12 bulls for all Israel, 96 rams, 77 lambs, and a sin offering of 12 male goats. All this was a burnt offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER8_36","016_8_36","EZR","8","36","36","They also delivered the king’s edicts to the royal satraps and governors of the region west of the Euphrates, who proceeded to assist the people and the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_1","016_9_1","EZR","9","1","1","After these things had been accomplished, the leaders approached me and said, “The people of Israel, including the priests and Levites, have not kept themselves separate from the surrounding peoples whose abominations are like those of the Canaanites, Hittites, Perizzites, Jebusites, Ammonites, Moabites, Egyptians, and Amorites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_2","016_9_2","EZR","9","2","2","Indeed, the Israelites have taken some of their daughters as wives for themselves and their sons, so that the holy seed has been mixed with the people of the land. And the leaders and officials have taken the lead in this unfaithfulness!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_3","016_9_3","EZR","9","3","3","When I heard this report, I tore my tunic and cloak, pulled out some hair from my head and beard, and sat down in horror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_4","016_9_4","EZR","9","4","4","Then everyone who trembled at the words of the God of Israel gathered around me because of the unfaithfulness of the exiles, while I sat there in horror until the evening offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_5","016_9_5","EZR","9","5","5","At the evening offering, I got up from my humiliation with my tunic and cloak torn, and I fell on my knees, spread out my hands to the LORD my God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_6","016_9_6","EZR","9","6","6","and said: “O my God, I am ashamed and embarrassed to lift up my face to You, my God, because our iniquities are higher than our heads, and our guilt has reached the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_7","016_9_7","EZR","9","7","7","From the days of our fathers to this day, our guilt has been great. Because of our iniquities, we and our kings and priests have been delivered into the hands of the kings of the earth and subjected to the sword and to captivity, to pillage and humiliation, as we are this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_8","016_9_8","EZR","9","8","8","But now, for a brief moment, grace has come from the LORD our God to preserve for us a remnant and to give us a stake in His holy place. Even in our bondage, our God has given us new life and light to our eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_9","016_9_9","EZR","9","9","9","Though we are slaves, our God has not forsaken us in our bondage, but He has extended to us grace in the sight of the kings of Persia, giving us new life to rebuild the house of our God and repair its ruins, and giving us a wall of protection in Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_10","016_9_10","EZR","9","10","10","And now, our God, what can we say after this? For we have forsaken the commandments ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_11","016_9_11","EZR","9","11","11","that You gave through Your servants the prophets, saying: ‘The land that you are entering to possess is a land polluted by the impurity of its peoples and the abominations with which they have filled it from end to end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_12","016_9_12","EZR","9","12","12","Now, therefore, do not give your daughters in marriage to their sons or take their daughters for your sons. Never seek their peace or prosperity, so that you may be strong and may eat the good things of the land, leaving it as an inheritance to your sons forever.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_13","016_9_13","EZR","9","13","13","After all that has come upon us because of our evil deeds and our great guilt (though You, our God, have punished us less than our iniquities deserve and have given us such a remnant as this), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_14","016_9_14","EZR","9","14","14","shall we again break Your commandments and intermarry with the peoples who commit these abominations? Would You not become so angry with us as to wipe us out, leaving no remnant or survivor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER9_15","016_9_15","EZR","9","15","15","O LORD, God of Israel, You are righteous! For we remain this day as a remnant. Here we are before You in our guilt, though because of it no one can stand before You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_1","016_10_1","EZR","10","1","1","While Ezra prayed and made this confession, weeping and falling facedown before the house of God, a very large assembly of Israelites—men, women, and children—gathered around him, and the people wept bitterly as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_2","016_10_2","EZR","10","2","2","Then Shecaniah son of Jehiel, an Elamite, said to Ezra: “We have been unfaithful to our God by marrying foreign women from the people of the land, yet in spite of this, there is hope for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_3","016_10_3","EZR","10","3","3","So now let us make a covenant before our God to send away all the foreign wives and their children, according to the counsel of my lord and of those who tremble at the command of our God. Let it be done according to the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_4","016_10_4","EZR","10","4","4","Get up, for this matter is your responsibility, and we will support you. Be strong and take action!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_5","016_10_5","EZR","10","5","5","So Ezra got up and made the leading priests, Levites, and all Israel take an oath to do what had been said. And they took the oath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_6","016_10_6","EZR","10","6","6","Then Ezra withdrew from before the house of God and walked to the chamber of Jehohanan son of Eliashib. And while he stayed there, he ate no food and drank no water, because he was mourning over the unfaithfulness of the exiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_7","016_10_7","EZR","10","7","7","And a proclamation was issued throughout Judah and Jerusalem that all the exiles should gather at Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_8","016_10_8","EZR","10","8","8","Whoever failed to appear within three days would forfeit all his property, according to the counsel of the leaders and elders, and would himself be expelled from the assembly of the exiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_9","016_10_9","EZR","10","9","9","So within the three days, all the men of Judah and Benjamin assembled in Jerusalem, and on the twentieth day of the ninth month, all the people sat in the square at the house of God, trembling regarding this matter and because of the heavy rain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_10","016_10_10","EZR","10","10","10","Then Ezra the priest stood up and said to them, “You have been unfaithful by marrying foreign women, adding to the guilt of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_11","016_10_11","EZR","10","11","11","Now, therefore, make a confession to the LORD, the God of your fathers, and do His will. Separate yourselves from the people of the land and from your foreign wives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_12","016_10_12","EZR","10","12","12","And the whole assembly responded in a loud voice: “Truly we must do as you say! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_13","016_10_13","EZR","10","13","13","But there are many people here, and it is the rainy season. We are not able to stay out in the open. Nor is this the work of one or two days, for we have transgressed greatly in this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_14","016_10_14","EZR","10","14","14","Let our leaders represent the whole assembly. Then let everyone in our towns who has married a foreign woman come at an appointed time, together with the elders and judges of each town, until the fierce anger of our God in this matter is turned away from us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_15","016_10_15","EZR","10","15","15","(Only Jonathan son of Asahel and Jahzeiah son of Tikvah, supported by Meshullam and Shabbethai the Levite, opposed this plan.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_16","016_10_16","EZR","10","16","16","So the exiles did as proposed. Ezra the priest selected men who were family heads, each of them identified by name, to represent their families. On the first day of the tenth month they launched the investigation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_17","016_10_17","EZR","10","17","17","and by the first day of the first month they had dealt with all the men who had married foreign women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_18","016_10_18","EZR","10","18","18","Among the descendants of the priests who had married foreign women were found these descendants of Jeshua son of Jozadak and his brothers: Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib, and Gedaliah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_19","016_10_19","EZR","10","19","19","They pledged to send their wives away, and for their guilt they presented a ram from the flock as a guilt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_20","016_10_20","EZR","10","20","20","From the descendants of Immer: Hanani and Zebadiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_21","016_10_21","EZR","10","21","21","From the descendants of Harim: Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel, and Uzziah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_22","016_10_22","EZR","10","22","22","From the descendants of Pashhur: Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethanel, Jozabad, and Elasah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_23","016_10_23","EZR","10","23","23","Among the Levites: Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah (that is, Kelita), Pethahiah, Judah, and Eliezer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_24","016_10_24","EZR","10","24","24","From the singers: Eliashib. From the gatekeepers: Shallum, Telem, and Uri. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_25","016_10_25","EZR","10","25","25","And among the other Israelites, from the descendants of Parosh: Ramiah, Izziah, Malchijah, Mijamin, Eleazar, Malchijah, and Benaiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_26","016_10_26","EZR","10","26","26","From the descendants of Elam: Mattaniah, Zechariah, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth, and Elijah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_27","016_10_27","EZR","10","27","27","From the descendants of Zattu: Elioenai, Eliashib, Mattaniah, Jeremoth, Zabad, and Aziza. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_28","016_10_28","EZR","10","28","28","From the descendants of Bebai: Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai, and Athlai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_29","016_10_29","EZR","10","29","29","From the descendants of Bani: Meshullam, Malluch, Adaiah, Jashub, Sheal, and Jeremoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_30","016_10_30","EZR","10","30","30","From the descendants of Pahath-moab: Adna, Chelal, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattaniah, Bezalel, Binnui, and Manasseh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_31","016_10_31","EZR","10","31","31","From the descendants of Harim: Eliezer, Isshijah, Malchijah, Shemaiah, Shimeon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_32","016_10_32","EZR","10","32","32","Benjamin, Malluch, and Shemariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_33","016_10_33","EZR","10","33","33","From the descendants of Hashum: Mattenai, Mattattah, Zabad, Eliphelet, Jeremai, Manasseh, and Shimei. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_34","016_10_34","EZR","10","34","34","From the descendants of Bani: Maadai, Amram, Uel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_35","016_10_35","EZR","10","35","35","Benaiah, Bedeiah, Cheluhi, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_36","016_10_36","EZR","10","36","36","Vaniah, Meremoth, Eliashib, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_37","016_10_37","EZR","10","37","37","Mattaniah, Mattenai, and Jaasu. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_38","016_10_38","EZR","10","38","38","From the descendants of Binnui: Shimei, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_39","016_10_39","EZR","10","39","39","Shelemiah, Nathan, Adaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_40","016_10_40","EZR","10","40","40","Machnadebai, Shashai, Sharai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_41","016_10_41","EZR","10","41","41","Azarel, Shelemiah, Shemariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_42","016_10_42","EZR","10","42","42","Shallum, Amariah, and Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_43","016_10_43","EZR","10","43","43","And from the descendants of Nebo: Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Jaddai, Joel, and Benaiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ER10_44","016_10_44","EZR","10","44","44","All these men had married foreign women, and some of them had children by these wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_1","017_1_1","NEH","1","1","1","These are the words of Nehemiah son of Hacaliah: In the month of Chislev, in the twentieth year, while I was in the citadel of Susa, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_2","017_1_2","NEH","1","2","2","Hanani, one of my brothers, arrived with men from Judah. So I questioned them about the remnant of the Jews who had survived the exile, and also about Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_3","017_1_3","NEH","1","3","3","And they told me, “The remnant who survived the exile are there in the province, in great trouble and disgrace. The wall of Jerusalem is broken down, and its gates have been burned with fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_4","017_1_4","NEH","1","4","4","When I heard these words, I sat down and wept. I mourned for days, fasting and praying before the God of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_5","017_1_5","NEH","1","5","5","Then I said: “O LORD, God of heaven, the great and awesome God who keeps His covenant of loving devotion with those who love Him and keep His commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_6","017_1_6","NEH","1","6","6","let Your eyes be open and Your ears attentive to hear the prayer that I, Your servant, now pray before You day and night for Your servants, the Israelites. I confess the sins that we Israelites have committed against You. Both I and my father’s house have sinned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_7","017_1_7","NEH","1","7","7","We have behaved corruptly against You and have not kept the commandments, statutes, and ordinances that You gave Your servant Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_8","017_1_8","NEH","1","8","8","Remember, I pray, the word that You commanded Your servant Moses when You said, ‘If you are unfaithful, I will scatter you among the nations, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_9","017_1_9","NEH","1","9","9","but if you return to Me and keep and practice My commandments, then even if your exiles have been banished to the farthest horizon, I will gather them from there and bring them to the place I have chosen as a dwelling for My Name.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_10","017_1_10","NEH","1","10","10","They are Your servants and Your people. You redeemed them by Your great power and mighty hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH1_11","017_1_11","NEH","1","11","11","O Lord, may Your ear be attentive to my prayer and to the prayers of Your servants who delight to revere Your name. Give Your servant success this day, I pray, and grant him mercy in the sight of this man.” (At that time I was the cupbearer to the king.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_1","017_2_1","NEH","2","1","1","Now in the month of Nisan, in the twentieth year of King Artaxerxes, when wine was set before him, I took the wine and gave it to the king. I had never been sad in his presence, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_2","017_2_2","NEH","2","2","2","so the king said to me, “Why is your face sad, though you are not ill? This could only be sadness of the heart.” I was overwhelmed with fear ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_3","017_2_3","NEH","2","3","3","and replied to the king, “May the king live forever! Why should I not be sad when the city where my fathers are buried lies in ruins, and its gates have been destroyed by fire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_4","017_2_4","NEH","2","4","4","“What is your request?” replied the king. So I prayed to the God of heaven ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_5","017_2_5","NEH","2","5","5","and answered the king, “If it pleases the king, and if your servant has found favor in your sight, I ask that you send me to Judah, to the city where my fathers are buried, so that I may rebuild it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_6","017_2_6","NEH","2","6","6","Then the king, with the queen seated beside him, asked me, “How long will your journey take, and when will you return?” So it pleased the king to send me, and I set a time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_7","017_2_7","NEH","2","7","7","I also said to him, “If it pleases the king, may letters be given to me for the governors west of the Euphrates, so that they will grant me safe passage until I reach Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_8","017_2_8","NEH","2","8","8","And may I have a letter to Asaph, keeper of the king’s forest, so that he will give me timber to make beams for the gates of the citadel to the temple, for the city wall, and for the house I will occupy.” And because the gracious hand of my God was upon me, the king granted my requests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_9","017_2_9","NEH","2","9","9","Then I went to the governors west of the Euphrates and gave them the king’s letters. The king had also sent army officers and cavalry with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_10","017_2_10","NEH","2","10","10","But when Sanballat the Horonite and Tobiah the Ammonite official heard about this, they were deeply disturbed that someone had come to seek the well-being of the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_11","017_2_11","NEH","2","11","11","After I had arrived in Jerusalem and had been there three days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_12","017_2_12","NEH","2","12","12","I set out at night with a few men. I did not tell anyone what my God had laid on my heart to do for Jerusalem. The only animal with me was the one on which I was riding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_13","017_2_13","NEH","2","13","13","So I went out at night through the Valley Gate toward the Well of the Serpent and the Dung Gate, and I inspected the walls of Jerusalem that had been broken down and the gates that had been destroyed by fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_14","017_2_14","NEH","2","14","14","Then I went on to the Fountain Gate and the King’s Pool, but there was no room for the animal under me to get through; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_15","017_2_15","NEH","2","15","15","so I went up the valley by night and inspected the wall. Then I headed back and reentered through the Valley Gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_16","017_2_16","NEH","2","16","16","The officials did not know where I had gone or what I was doing, for I had not yet told the Jews or priests or nobles or officials or any other workers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_17","017_2_17","NEH","2","17","17","Then I said to them, “You see the trouble we are in. Jerusalem lies in ruins, and its gates have been burned down. Come, let us rebuild the wall of Jerusalem, so that we will no longer be a disgrace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_18","017_2_18","NEH","2","18","18","I also told them about the gracious hand of my God upon me, and what the king had said to me. “Let us start rebuilding,” they replied, and they set their hands to this good work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_19","017_2_19","NEH","2","19","19","But when Sanballat the Horonite, Tobiah the Ammonite official, and Geshem the Arab heard about this, they mocked us and ridiculed us, saying, “What is this you are doing? Are you rebelling against the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH2_20","017_2_20","NEH","2","20","20","So I answered them and said, “The God of heaven is the One who will grant us success. We, His servants, will start rebuilding, but you have no portion, right, or claim in Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_1","017_3_1","NEH","3","1","1","At the Sheep Gate, Eliashib the high priest and his fellow priests began rebuilding. They dedicated it and installed its doors. After building as far as the Tower of the Hundred and the Tower of Hananel, they dedicated the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_2","017_3_2","NEH","3","2","2","The men of Jericho built next to Eliashib, and Zaccur son of Imri built next to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_3","017_3_3","NEH","3","3","3","The Fish Gate was rebuilt by the sons of Hassenaah. They laid its beams and installed its doors, bolts, and bars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_4","017_3_4","NEH","3","4","4","Next to them, Meremoth son of Uriah, the son of Hakkoz, made repairs. Next to him, Meshullam son of Berechiah, the son of Meshezabel, made repairs; and next to him, Zadok son of Baana made repairs as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_5","017_3_5","NEH","3","5","5","Next to him, the Tekoites made repairs, but their nobles did not put their shoulders to the work under their supervisors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_6","017_3_6","NEH","3","6","6","The Jeshanah Gate was repaired by Joiada son of Paseah and Meshullam son of Besodeiah. They laid its beams and installed its doors, bolts, and bars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_7","017_3_7","NEH","3","7","7","Next to them, repairs were made by Melatiah the Gibeonite, Jadon the Meronothite, and the men of Gibeon and Mizpah, who were under the authority of the governor of the region west of the Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_8","017_3_8","NEH","3","8","8","Next to them, Uzziel son of Harhaiah, one of the goldsmiths, made repairs. And next to him, Hananiah, one of the perfumers, made repairs. They fortified Jerusalem as far as the Broad Wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_9","017_3_9","NEH","3","9","9","Next to them, Rephaiah son of Hur, ruler of a half-district of Jerusalem, made repairs; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_10","017_3_10","NEH","3","10","10","next to him, Jedaiah son of Harumaph made repairs across from his house; and next to him, Hattush son of Hashabneiah made repairs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_11","017_3_11","NEH","3","11","11","Malchijah son of Harim and Hasshub son of Pahath-moab repaired another section, as well as the Tower of the Ovens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_12","017_3_12","NEH","3","12","12","And next to them, Shallum son of Hallohesh, ruler of the other half-district of Jerusalem, made repairs, with the help of his daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_13","017_3_13","NEH","3","13","13","The Valley Gate was repaired by Hanun and the residents of Zanoah. They rebuilt it, installed its doors, bolts, and bars, and repaired a thousand cubits of the wall as far as the Dung Gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_14","017_3_14","NEH","3","14","14","The Dung Gate was repaired by Malchijah son of Rechab, ruler of the district of Beth-haccherem. He rebuilt it and installed its doors, bolts, and bars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_15","017_3_15","NEH","3","15","15","The Fountain Gate was repaired by Shallun son of Col-hozeh, ruler of the district of Mizpah. He rebuilt it, roofed it, and installed its doors, bolts, and bars. He also repaired the wall of the Pool of Shelah near the king’s garden, as far as the stairs that descend from the City of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_16","017_3_16","NEH","3","16","16","Beyond him, Nehemiah son of Azbuk, ruler of a half-district of Beth-zur, made repairs up to a point opposite the tombs of David, as far as the artificial pool and the House of the Mighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_17","017_3_17","NEH","3","17","17","Next to him, the Levites made repairs under Rehum son of Bani, and next to him, Hashabiah, ruler of a half-district of Keilah, made repairs for his district. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_18","017_3_18","NEH","3","18","18","Next to him, their countrymen made repairs under Binnui son of Henadad, ruler of the other half-district of Keilah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_19","017_3_19","NEH","3","19","19","And next to him, Ezer son of Jeshua, ruler of Mizpah, repaired another section opposite the ascent to the armory, near the angle in the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_20","017_3_20","NEH","3","20","20","Next to him, Baruch son of Zabbai diligently repaired another section, from the angle to the doorway of the house of Eliashib the high priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_21","017_3_21","NEH","3","21","21","Next to him, Meremoth son of Uriah, the son of Hakkoz, repaired another section, from the doorway of the house of Eliashib to the end of the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_22","017_3_22","NEH","3","22","22","And next to him, the priests from the surrounding area made repairs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_23","017_3_23","NEH","3","23","23","Beyond them, Benjamin and Hasshub made repairs in front of their house, and next to them, Azariah son of Maaseiah, the son of Ananiah, made repairs beside his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_24","017_3_24","NEH","3","24","24","After him, Binnui son of Henadad repaired another section, from the house of Azariah to the angle and the corner, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_25","017_3_25","NEH","3","25","25","and Palal son of Uzai made repairs opposite the angle and the tower that juts out from the upper palace of the king near the courtyard of the guard. Next to him, Pedaiah son of Parosh ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_26","017_3_26","NEH","3","26","26","and the temple servants living on the hill of Ophel made repairs opposite the Water Gate toward the east and the tower that juts out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_27","017_3_27","NEH","3","27","27","And next to them, the Tekoites repaired another section, from a point opposite the great tower that juts out to the wall of Ophel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_28","017_3_28","NEH","3","28","28","Above the Horse Gate, each of the priests made repairs in front of his own house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_29","017_3_29","NEH","3","29","29","Next to them, Zadok son of Immer made repairs opposite his house, and next to him, Shemaiah son of Shecaniah, the guard of the East Gate, made repairs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_30","017_3_30","NEH","3","30","30","Next to him, Hananiah son of Shelemiah, as well as Hanun the sixth son of Zalaph, repaired another section. Next to them, Meshullam son of Berechiah made repairs opposite his own quarters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_31","017_3_31","NEH","3","31","31","Next to him, Malchijah, one of the goldsmiths, made repairs as far as the house of the temple servants and the merchants, opposite the Inspection Gate, and as far as the upper room above the corner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH3_32","017_3_32","NEH","3","32","32","And between the upper room above the corner and the Sheep Gate, the goldsmiths and merchants made repairs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_1","017_4_1","NEH","4","1","1","Now when Sanballat heard that we were rebuilding the wall, he was furious and filled with indignation. He ridiculed the Jews ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_2","017_4_2","NEH","4","2","2","before his associates and the army of Samaria, saying, “What are these feeble Jews doing? Can they restore the wall by themselves? Will they offer sacrifices? Will they complete it in a day? Can they bring these burnt stones back to life from the mounds of rubble?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_3","017_4_3","NEH","4","3","3","Then Tobiah the Ammonite, who was beside him, said, “If even a fox were to climb up on what they are building, it would break down their wall of stones!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_4","017_4_4","NEH","4","4","4","Hear us, O God, for we are despised. Turn their scorn back upon their own heads, and let them be taken as plunder to a land of captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_5","017_4_5","NEH","4","5","5","Do not cover up their iniquity or let their sin be blotted out from Your sight, for they have provoked the builders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_6","017_4_6","NEH","4","6","6","So we rebuilt the wall until all of it was joined together up to half its height, for the people had a mind to work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_7","017_4_7","NEH","4","7","7","When Sanballat and Tobiah, together with the Arabs, Ammonites, and Ashdodites, heard that the repair to the walls of Jerusalem was progressing and that the gaps were being closed, they were furious, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_8","017_4_8","NEH","4","8","8","and all of them conspired to come and fight against Jerusalem and create a hindrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_9","017_4_9","NEH","4","9","9","So we prayed to our God and posted a guard against them day and night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_10","017_4_10","NEH","4","10","10","Meanwhile, the people of Judah said: “The strength of the laborer fails, and there is so much rubble that we will never be able to rebuild the wall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_11","017_4_11","NEH","4","11","11","And our enemies said, “Before they know or see a thing, we will come into their midst, kill them, and put an end to the work.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_12","017_4_12","NEH","4","12","12","At that time the Jews who lived nearby came and told us ten times over, “Wherever you turn, they will attack us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_13","017_4_13","NEH","4","13","13","So I stationed men behind the lowest sections of the wall, at the vulnerable areas. I stationed them by families with their swords, spears, and bows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_14","017_4_14","NEH","4","14","14","After I had made an inspection, I stood up and said to the nobles, the officials, and the rest of the people, “Do not be afraid of them. Remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your brothers, your sons and your daughters, your wives and your homes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_15","017_4_15","NEH","4","15","15","When our enemies heard that we were aware of their scheme and that God had frustrated it, each of us returned to his own work on the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_16","017_4_16","NEH","4","16","16","And from that day on, half of my servants did the work while the other half held spears, shields, bows, and armor. The officers stationed themselves behind all the people of Judah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_17","017_4_17","NEH","4","17","17","who were rebuilding the wall. The laborers who carried materials worked with one hand and held a weapon with the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_18","017_4_18","NEH","4","18","18","And each of the builders worked with his sword strapped at his side. But the trumpeter stayed beside me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_19","017_4_19","NEH","4","19","19","Then I said to the nobles, the officials, and the rest of the people: “The work is great and extensive, and we are spread out far from one another along the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_20","017_4_20","NEH","4","20","20","Wherever you hear the sound of the horn, rally to us there. Our God will fight for us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_21","017_4_21","NEH","4","21","21","So we continued the work, while half of the men held spears from the break of dawn until the stars came out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_22","017_4_22","NEH","4","22","22","At that time I also said to the people, “Let every man and his servant spend the night inside Jerusalem, so that they can stand guard by night and work by day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH4_23","017_4_23","NEH","4","23","23","So neither I nor my brothers nor my servants nor the guards with me changed out of our clothes; each carried his weapon, even to go for water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_1","017_5_1","NEH","5","1","1","About that time there was a great outcry from the people and their wives against their fellow Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_2","017_5_2","NEH","5","2","2","Some were saying, “We and our sons and daughters are numerous. We must get grain in order to eat and stay alive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_3","017_5_3","NEH","5","3","3","Others were saying, “We are mortgaging our fields, our vineyards, and our homes to get grain during the famine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_4","017_5_4","NEH","5","4","4","Still others were saying, “We have borrowed money to pay the king’s tax on our fields and vineyards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_5","017_5_5","NEH","5","5","5","We and our children are just like our countrymen and their children, yet we are subjecting our sons and daughters to slavery. Some of our daughters are already enslaved, but we are powerless to redeem them because our fields and vineyards belong to others.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_6","017_5_6","NEH","5","6","6","When I heard their outcry and these complaints, I became extremely angry, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_7","017_5_7","NEH","5","7","7","and after serious thought I rebuked the nobles and officials, saying, “You are exacting usury from your own brothers!” So I called a large assembly against them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_8","017_5_8","NEH","5","8","8","and said, “We have done our best to buy back our Jewish brothers who were sold to foreigners, but now you are selling your own brothers, that they may be sold back to us!” But they remained silent, for they could find nothing to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_9","017_5_9","NEH","5","9","9","So I continued, “What you are doing is not right. Shouldn’t you walk in the fear of our God to avoid the reproach of our foreign enemies? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_10","017_5_10","NEH","5","10","10","I, as well as my brothers and my servants, have been lending the people money and grain. Please, let us stop this usury. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_11","017_5_11","NEH","5","11","11","Please restore to them immediately their fields, vineyards, olive groves, and houses, along with the percentage of the money, grain, new wine, and oil that you have been assessing them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_12","017_5_12","NEH","5","12","12","“We will restore it,” they replied, “and will require nothing more from them. We will do as you say.” So I summoned the priests and required of the nobles and officials an oath that they would do what they had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_13","017_5_13","NEH","5","13","13","I also shook out the folds of my robe and said, “May God likewise shake out of his house and possessions every man who does not keep this promise. May such a man be shaken out and have nothing!” The whole assembly said, “Amen,” and they praised the LORD. And the people did as they had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_14","017_5_14","NEH","5","14","14","Furthermore, from the day King Artaxerxes appointed me to be their governor in the land of Judah, from his twentieth year until his thirty-second year (twelve years total), neither I nor my brothers ate the food allotted to the governor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_15","017_5_15","NEH","5","15","15","The governors before me had heavily burdened the people, taking from them bread and wine plus forty shekels of silver. Their servants also oppressed the people. But I did not do this, because of my fear of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_16","017_5_16","NEH","5","16","16","Instead, I devoted myself to the construction of the wall, and all my servants were gathered there for the work; we did not acquire any land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_17","017_5_17","NEH","5","17","17","There were 150 Jews and officials at my table, besides the guests from the surrounding nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_18","017_5_18","NEH","5","18","18","Each day one ox, six choice sheep, and some fowl were prepared for me, and once every ten days an abundance of all kinds of wine was provided. But I did not demand the food allotted to the governor, because the burden on the people was so heavy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH5_19","017_5_19","NEH","5","19","19","Remember me favorably, O my God, for all that I have done for this people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_1","017_6_1","NEH","6","1","1","When Sanballat, Tobiah, Geshem the Arab, and the rest of our enemies heard that I had rebuilt the wall and not a gap was left—though to that time I had not yet installed the doors in the gates— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_2","017_6_2","NEH","6","2","2","Sanballat and Geshem sent me this message: “Come, let us meet together in one of the villages on the plain of Ono.” But they were planning to harm me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_3","017_6_3","NEH","6","3","3","So I sent messengers to them, saying, “I am doing a great work and cannot come down. Why should the work stop while I leave it to go down to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_4","017_6_4","NEH","6","4","4","Four times they sent me the same message, and each time I gave the same reply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_5","017_6_5","NEH","6","5","5","The fifth time, Sanballat sent me this same message by his young servant, who had in his hand an unsealed letter ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_6","017_6_6","NEH","6","6","6","that read: “It is reported among the nations—and Geshem agrees—that you and the Jews are plotting to revolt, and this is why you are building the wall. According to these reports, you are to become their king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_7","017_6_7","NEH","6","7","7","and you have even appointed prophets in Jerusalem to proclaim on your behalf: ‘There is a king in Judah.’ Soon these rumors will reach the ears of the king. So come, let us confer together.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_8","017_6_8","NEH","6","8","8","Then I sent him this reply: “There is nothing to these rumors you are spreading; you are inventing them in your own mind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_9","017_6_9","NEH","6","9","9","For they were all trying to frighten us, saying, “Their hands will be weakened in the work, and it will never be finished.” But now, my God, strengthen my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_10","017_6_10","NEH","6","10","10","Later, I went to the house of Shemaiah son of Delaiah, the son of Mehetabel, who was confined to his house. He said: “Let us meet at the house of God inside the temple. Let us shut the temple doors because they are coming to kill you—by night they are coming to kill you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_11","017_6_11","NEH","6","11","11","But I replied, “Should a man like me run away? Should one like me go into the temple to save his own life? I will not go!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_12","017_6_12","NEH","6","12","12","I realized that God had not sent him, but that he had uttered this prophecy against me because Tobiah and Sanballat had hired him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_13","017_6_13","NEH","6","13","13","He had been hired to intimidate me so that I would sin by doing as he suggested, so they could give me a bad name in order to discredit me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_14","017_6_14","NEH","6","14","14","O my God, remember Tobiah and Sanballat for what they have done, and also Noadiah the prophetess and the other prophets who tried to intimidate me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_15","017_6_15","NEH","6","15","15","So the wall was completed in fifty-two days, on the twenty-fifth of Elul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_16","017_6_16","NEH","6","16","16","When all our enemies heard about this, all the surrounding nations were afraid and disheartened, for they realized that this task had been accomplished by our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_17","017_6_17","NEH","6","17","17","Also in those days, the nobles of Judah sent many letters to Tobiah, and Tobiah’s letters kept coming to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_18","017_6_18","NEH","6","18","18","For many in Judah were bound by oath to him, since he was a son-in-law of Shecaniah son of Arah, and his son Jehohanan had married the daughter of Meshullam son of Berechiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH6_19","017_6_19","NEH","6","19","19","Moreover, these nobles kept reporting to me Tobiah’s good deeds, and they relayed my words to him. And Tobiah sent letters to intimidate me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_1","017_7_1","NEH","7","1","1","When the wall had been rebuilt and I had set the doors in place, the gatekeepers, singers, and Levites were appointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_2","017_7_2","NEH","7","2","2","Then I put my brother Hanani in charge of Jerusalem, along with Hananiah the commander of the fortress, because he was a faithful man who feared God more than most. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_3","017_7_3","NEH","7","3","3","And I told them, “Do not open the gates of Jerusalem until the sun is hot. While the guards are on duty, keep the doors shut and securely fastened. And appoint the residents of Jerusalem as guards, some at their posts and some at their own homes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_4","017_7_4","NEH","7","4","4","Now the city was large and spacious, but there were few people in it, and the houses had not yet been rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_5","017_7_5","NEH","7","5","5","Then my God put it into my heart to assemble the nobles, the officials, and the people to be enrolled by genealogy. I found the genealogical register of those who had first returned, and I found the following written in it: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_6","017_7_6","NEH","7","6","6","These are the people of the province who came up from the captivity of the exiles carried away to Babylon by Nebuchadnezzar its king. They returned to Jerusalem and Judah, each to his own town, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_7","017_7_7","NEH","7","7","7","accompanied by Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, and Baanah. This is the count of the men of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_8","017_7_8","NEH","7","8","8","the descendants of Parosh, 2,172; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_9","017_7_9","NEH","7","9","9","the descendants of Shephatiah, 372; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_10","017_7_10","NEH","7","10","10","the descendants of Arah, 652; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_11","017_7_11","NEH","7","11","11","the descendants of Pahath-moab (through the line of Jeshua and Joab), 2,818; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_12","017_7_12","NEH","7","12","12","the descendants of Elam, 1,254; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_13","017_7_13","NEH","7","13","13","the descendants of Zattu, 845; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_14","017_7_14","NEH","7","14","14","the descendants of Zaccai, 760; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_15","017_7_15","NEH","7","15","15","the descendants of Binnui, 648; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_16","017_7_16","NEH","7","16","16","the descendants of Bebai, 628; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_17","017_7_17","NEH","7","17","17","the descendants of Azgad, 2,322; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_18","017_7_18","NEH","7","18","18","the descendants of Adonikam, 667; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_19","017_7_19","NEH","7","19","19","the descendants of Bigvai, 2,067; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_20","017_7_20","NEH","7","20","20","the descendants of Adin, 655; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_21","017_7_21","NEH","7","21","21","the descendants of Ater (through Hezekiah), 98; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_22","017_7_22","NEH","7","22","22","the descendants of Hashum, 328; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_23","017_7_23","NEH","7","23","23","the descendants of Bezai, 324; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_24","017_7_24","NEH","7","24","24","the descendants of Hariph, 112; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_25","017_7_25","NEH","7","25","25","the descendants of Gibeon, 95; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_26","017_7_26","NEH","7","26","26","the men of Bethlehem and Netophah, 188; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_27","017_7_27","NEH","7","27","27","the men of Anathoth, 128; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_28","017_7_28","NEH","7","28","28","the men of Beth-azmaveth, 42; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_29","017_7_29","NEH","7","29","29","the men of Kiriath-jearim, Chephirah, and Beeroth, 743; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_30","017_7_30","NEH","7","30","30","the men of Ramah and Geba, 621; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_31","017_7_31","NEH","7","31","31","the men of Michmash, 122; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_32","017_7_32","NEH","7","32","32","the men of Bethel and Ai, 123; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_33","017_7_33","NEH","7","33","33","the men of the other Nebo, 52; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_34","017_7_34","NEH","7","34","34","the descendants of the other Elam, 1,254; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_35","017_7_35","NEH","7","35","35","the descendants of Harim, 320; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_36","017_7_36","NEH","7","36","36","the men of Jericho, 345; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_37","017_7_37","NEH","7","37","37","the men of Lod, Hadid, and Ono, 721; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_38","017_7_38","NEH","7","38","38","and the descendants of Senaah, 3,930. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_39","017_7_39","NEH","7","39","39","The priests: the descendants of Jedaiah (through the house of Jeshua), 973; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_40","017_7_40","NEH","7","40","40","the descendants of Immer, 1,052; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_41","017_7_41","NEH","7","41","41","the descendants of Pashhur, 1,247; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_42","017_7_42","NEH","7","42","42","and the descendants of Harim, 1,017. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_43","017_7_43","NEH","7","43","43","The Levites: the descendants of Jeshua (through Kadmiel, through the line of Hodevah), 74. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_44","017_7_44","NEH","7","44","44","The singers: the descendants of Asaph, 148. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_45","017_7_45","NEH","7","45","45","The gatekeepers: the descendants of Shallum, the descendants of Ater, the descendants of Talmon, the descendants of Akkub, the descendants of Hatita, and the descendants of Shobai, 138 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_46","017_7_46","NEH","7","46","46","The temple servants: the descendants of Ziha, the descendants of Hasupha, the descendants of Tabbaoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_47","017_7_47","NEH","7","47","47","the descendants of Keros, the descendants of Sia, the descendants of Padon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_48","017_7_48","NEH","7","48","48","the descendants of Lebanah, the descendants of Hagabah, the descendants of Shalmai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_49","017_7_49","NEH","7","49","49","the descendants of Hanan, the descendants of Giddel, the descendants of Gahar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_50","017_7_50","NEH","7","50","50","the descendants of Reaiah, the descendants of Rezin, the descendants of Nekoda, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_51","017_7_51","NEH","7","51","51","the descendants of Gazzam, the descendants of Uzza, the descendants of Paseah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_52","017_7_52","NEH","7","52","52","the descendants of Besai, the descendants of Meunim, the descendants of Nephushesim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_53","017_7_53","NEH","7","53","53","the descendants of Bakbuk, the descendants of Hakupha, the descendants of Harhur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_54","017_7_54","NEH","7","54","54","the descendants of Bazlith, the descendants of Mehida, the descendants of Harsha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_55","017_7_55","NEH","7","55","55","the descendants of Barkos, the descendants of Sisera, the descendants of Temah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_56","017_7_56","NEH","7","56","56","the descendants of Neziah, and the descendants of Hatipha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_57","017_7_57","NEH","7","57","57","The descendants of the servants of Solomon: the descendants of Sotai, the descendants of Sophereth, the descendants of Perida, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_58","017_7_58","NEH","7","58","58","the descendants of Jaala, the descendants of Darkon, the descendants of Giddel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_59","017_7_59","NEH","7","59","59","the descendants of Shephatiah, the descendants of Hattil, the descendants of Pochereth-hazzebaim, and the descendants of Amon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_60","017_7_60","NEH","7","60","60","The temple servants and descendants of the servants of Solomon numbered 392 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_61","017_7_61","NEH","7","61","61","The following came up from Tel-melah, Tel-harsha, Cherub, Addon, and Immer, but they could not prove that their families were descended from Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_62","017_7_62","NEH","7","62","62","the descendants of Delaiah, the descendants of Tobiah, and the descendants of Nekoda, 642 in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_63","017_7_63","NEH","7","63","63","And from among the priests: the descendants of Hobaiah, the descendants of Hakkoz, and the descendants of Barzillai (who had married a daughter of Barzillai the Gileadite and was called by their name). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_64","017_7_64","NEH","7","64","64","These men searched for their family records, but they could not find them and so were excluded from the priesthood as unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_65","017_7_65","NEH","7","65","65","The governor ordered them not to eat the most holy things until there was a priest to consult the Urim and Thummim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_66","017_7_66","NEH","7","66","66","The whole assembly numbered 42,360, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_67","017_7_67","NEH","7","67","67","in addition to their 7,337 menservants and maidservants, as well as their 245 male and female singers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_68","017_7_68","NEH","7","68","68","They had 736 horses, 245 mules, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_69","017_7_69","NEH","7","69","69","435 camels, and 6,720 donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_70","017_7_70","NEH","7","70","70","Some of the heads of the families contributed to the project. The governor gave to the treasury 1,000 darics of gold, 50 bowls, and 530 priestly garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_71","017_7_71","NEH","7","71","71","And some of the heads of the families gave to the treasury for the project 20,000 darics of gold and 2,200 minas of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_72","017_7_72","NEH","7","72","72","The rest of the people gave a total of 20,000 darics of gold, 2,000 minas of silver, and 67 priestly garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH7_73","017_7_73","NEH","7","73","73","So the priests, Levites, gatekeepers, singers, and temple servants, along with some of the people and the rest of the Israelites, settled in their own towns. And by the seventh month the Israelites had settled in their towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_1","017_8_1","NEH","8","1","1","At that time all the people gathered together in the square before the Water Gate, and they asked Ezra the scribe to bring out the Book of the Law of Moses, which the LORD had commanded for Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_2","017_8_2","NEH","8","2","2","On the first day of the seventh month, Ezra the priest brought the Law before the assembly of men and women and all who could listen and understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_3","017_8_3","NEH","8","3","3","So Ezra read it aloud from daybreak until noon as he faced the square before the Water Gate, in front of the men and women and those who could understand. And all the people listened attentively to the Book of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_4","017_8_4","NEH","8","4","4","Ezra the scribe stood on a high wooden platform built for this occasion. At his right side stood Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah, and Maaseiah, and at his left were Pedaiah, Mishael, Malchijah, Hashum, Hash-baddanah, Zechariah, and Meshullam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_5","017_8_5","NEH","8","5","5","Ezra opened the book in full view of all the people, since he was standing above them all, and as he opened it, all the people stood up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_6","017_8_6","NEH","8","6","6","Then Ezra blessed the LORD, the great God, and with their hands uplifted, all the people said, “Amen, Amen!” Then they bowed down and worshiped the LORD with their faces to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_7","017_8_7","NEH","8","7","7","The Levites—Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan, and Pelaiah—instructed the people in the Law as they stood in their places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_8","017_8_8","NEH","8","8","8","So they read from the Book of the Law of God, explaining it and giving insight, so that the people could understand what was being read. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_9","017_8_9","NEH","8","9","9","Nehemiah the governor, Ezra the priest and scribe, and the Levites who were instructing the people said to all of them, “This day is holy to the LORD your God. Do not mourn or weep.” For all the people were weeping as they heard the words of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_10","017_8_10","NEH","8","10","10","Then Nehemiah told them, “Go and eat what is rich, drink what is sweet, and send out portions to those who have nothing prepared, since today is holy to our Lord. Do not grieve, for the joy of the LORD is your strength.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_11","017_8_11","NEH","8","11","11","And the Levites calmed all the people, saying, “Be still, since today is holy. Do not grieve.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_12","017_8_12","NEH","8","12","12","Then all the people began to eat and drink, to send out portions, and to rejoice greatly, because they understood the words that had been made known to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_13","017_8_13","NEH","8","13","13","On the second day of the month, the heads of all the families, along with the priests and Levites, gathered around Ezra the scribe to study the words of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_14","017_8_14","NEH","8","14","14","And they found written in the Law, which the LORD had commanded through Moses, that the Israelites were to dwell in booths during the feast of the seventh month, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_15","017_8_15","NEH","8","15","15","and that they should proclaim this message and spread it throughout their towns and in Jerusalem, saying, “Go out to the hill country and bring back branches of olive, wild olive, myrtle, palm, and other leafy trees, to make booths, as it is written.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_16","017_8_16","NEH","8","16","16","And the people went out, brought back branches, and made booths on their own rooftops, in their courtyards, in the courts of the house of God, and in the squares by the Water Gate and by the Gate of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_17","017_8_17","NEH","8","17","17","The whole assembly that had returned from exile made booths and lived in them. From the days of Joshua son of Nun until that day, the Israelites had not celebrated like this. And there was great rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH8_18","017_8_18","NEH","8","18","18","Day after day, from the first day to the last, Ezra read from the Book of the Law of God. The Israelites kept the feast for seven days, and on the eighth day they held an assembly, according to the ordinance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_1","017_9_1","NEH","9","1","1","On the twenty-fourth day of the same month, the Israelites gathered together, fasting and wearing sackcloth, with dust on their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_2","017_9_2","NEH","9","2","2","Those of Israelite descent separated themselves from all the foreigners, and they stood and confessed their sins and the iniquities of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_3","017_9_3","NEH","9","3","3","While they stood in their places, they read from the Book of the Law of the LORD their God for a quarter of the day, and they spent another quarter of the day in confession and worship of the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_4","017_9_4","NEH","9","4","4","And the Levites—Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani, and Chenani—stood on the raised platform and cried out in a loud voice to the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_5","017_9_5","NEH","9","5","5","Then the Levites—Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah, and Pethahiah—said, “Stand up and bless the LORD your God from everlasting to everlasting: Blessed be Your glorious name, and may it be exalted above all blessing and praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_6","017_9_6","NEH","9","6","6","You alone are the LORD. You created the heavens, the highest heavens with all their host, the earth and all that is on it, the seas and all that is in them. You give life to all things, and the host of heaven worships You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_7","017_9_7","NEH","9","7","7","You are the LORD, the God who chose Abram, who brought him out of Ur of the Chaldeans and gave him the name Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_8","017_9_8","NEH","9","8","8","You found his heart faithful before You, and made a covenant with him to give the land of the Canaanites and Hittites, of the Amorites and Perizzites, of the Jebusites and Girgashites—to give it to his descendants. You have kept Your promise, because You are righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_9","017_9_9","NEH","9","9","9","You saw the affliction of our fathers in Egypt; You heard their cry at the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_10","017_9_10","NEH","9","10","10","You performed signs and wonders against Pharaoh, all his officials, and all the people of his land, for You knew they had acted with arrogance against our fathers. You made a name for Yourself that endures to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_11","017_9_11","NEH","9","11","11","You divided the sea before them, and they crossed through it on dry ground. You hurled their pursuers into the depths like a stone into raging waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_12","017_9_12","NEH","9","12","12","You led them with a pillar of cloud by day and a pillar of fire by night, to light for them the way in which they should travel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_13","017_9_13","NEH","9","13","13","You came down on Mount Sinai and spoke with them from heaven. You gave them just ordinances, true laws, and good statutes and commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_14","017_9_14","NEH","9","14","14","You revealed to them Your holy Sabbath and gave them commandments and statutes and laws through Your servant Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_15","017_9_15","NEH","9","15","15","In their hunger You gave them bread from heaven; in their thirst You brought them water from the rock. You told them to go in and possess the land that You had sworn to give them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_16","017_9_16","NEH","9","16","16","But they and our fathers became arrogant and stiff-necked and did not obey Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_17","017_9_17","NEH","9","17","17","They refused to listen and failed to remember the wonders You performed among them. They stiffened their necks and appointed a leader to return them to their bondage in Egypt. But You are a forgiving God, gracious and compassionate, slow to anger and rich in loving devotion, and You did not forsake them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_18","017_9_18","NEH","9","18","18","Even when they cast for themselves an image of a calf and said, ‘This is your God who brought you up out of Egypt,’ and when they committed terrible blasphemies, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_19","017_9_19","NEH","9","19","19","You in Your great compassion did not forsake them in the wilderness. By day the pillar of cloud never turned away from guiding them on their path; and by the night the pillar of fire illuminated the way they should go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_20","017_9_20","NEH","9","20","20","You gave Your good Spirit to instruct them. You did not withhold Your manna from their mouths, and You gave them water for their thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_21","017_9_21","NEH","9","21","21","For forty years You sustained them in the wilderness, so that they lacked nothing. Their clothes did not wear out and their feet did not swell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_22","017_9_22","NEH","9","22","22","You gave them kingdoms and peoples and allotted to them every corner of the land. So they took the land of Sihon king of Heshbon and of Og king of Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_23","017_9_23","NEH","9","23","23","You multiplied their descendants like the stars of heaven and brought them to the land You had told their fathers to enter and possess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_24","017_9_24","NEH","9","24","24","So their descendants went in and possessed the land; You subdued before them the Canaanites dwelling in the land. You delivered into their hands the kings and peoples of the land, to do with them as they wished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_25","017_9_25","NEH","9","25","25","They captured fortified cities and fertile land and took houses full of all goods, wells already dug, vineyards, olive groves, and fruit trees in abundance. So they ate and were filled; they grew fat and delighted in Your great goodness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_26","017_9_26","NEH","9","26","26","But they were disobedient and rebelled against You; they flung Your law behind their backs. They killed Your prophets, who had admonished them to return to You. They committed terrible blasphemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_27","017_9_27","NEH","9","27","27","So You delivered them into the hands of enemies who oppressed them, and in their time of distress they cried out to You. From heaven You heard them, and in Your great compassion You gave them deliverers who saved them from the hands of their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_28","017_9_28","NEH","9","28","28","But as soon as they had rest, they again did evil in Your sight. So You abandoned them to the hands of their enemies, who had dominion over them. When they cried out to You again, You heard from heaven, and You delivered them many times in Your compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_29","017_9_29","NEH","9","29","29","You admonished them to turn back to Your law, but they were arrogant and disobeyed Your commandments. They sinned against Your ordinances, by which a man will live if he practices them. They turned a stubborn shoulder; they stiffened their necks and would not obey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_30","017_9_30","NEH","9","30","30","You were patient with them for many years, and Your Spirit admonished them through Your prophets. Yet they would not listen, so You gave them into the hands of the neighboring peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_31","017_9_31","NEH","9","31","31","But in Your great compassion, You did not put an end to them; nor did You forsake them, for You are a gracious and compassionate God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_32","017_9_32","NEH","9","32","32","So now, our God, the great and mighty and awesome God who keeps His gracious covenant, do not view lightly all the hardship that has come upon us, and upon our kings and leaders, our priests and prophets, our ancestors and all Your people, from the days of the kings of Assyria until today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_33","017_9_33","NEH","9","33","33","You are just in all that has befallen us, because You have acted faithfully, while we have acted wickedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_34","017_9_34","NEH","9","34","34","Our kings and leaders and priests and fathers did not obey Your law or listen to Your commandments and warnings that You gave them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_35","017_9_35","NEH","9","35","35","For even while they were in their kingdom, with the abundant goodness that You had given them, and in the spacious and fertile land that You had set before them, they would not serve You or turn from their wicked ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_36","017_9_36","NEH","9","36","36","So here we are today as slaves in the land You gave our fathers to enjoy its fruit and goodness—here we are as slaves! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_37","017_9_37","NEH","9","37","37","Its abundant harvest goes to the kings You have set over us because of our sins. And they rule over our bodies and our livestock as they please. We are in great distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH9_38","017_9_38","NEH","9","38","38","In view of all this, we make a binding agreement, putting it in writing and sealing it with the names of our leaders, Levites, and priests.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_1","017_10_1","NEH","10","1","1","Now these were the ones who sealed the document: Nehemiah the governor, son of Hacaliah, and also Zedekiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_2","017_10_2","NEH","10","2","2","Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_3","017_10_3","NEH","10","3","3","Pashhur, Amariah, Malchijah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_4","017_10_4","NEH","10","4","4","Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluch, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_5","017_10_5","NEH","10","5","5","Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_6","017_10_6","NEH","10","6","6","Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_7","017_10_7","NEH","10","7","7","Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_8","017_10_8","NEH","10","8","8","Maaziah, Bilgai, and Shemaiah. These were the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_9","017_10_9","NEH","10","9","9","The Levites: Jeshua son of Azaniah, Binnui of the sons of Henadad, Kadmiel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_10","017_10_10","NEH","10","10","10","and their associates: Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_11","017_10_11","NEH","10","11","11","Mica, Rehob, Hashabiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_12","017_10_12","NEH","10","12","12","Zaccur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_13","017_10_13","NEH","10","13","13","Hodiah, Bani, and Beninu. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_14","017_10_14","NEH","10","14","14","And the leaders of the people: Parosh, Pahath-moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_15","017_10_15","NEH","10","15","15","Bunni, Azgad, Bebai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_16","017_10_16","NEH","10","16","16","Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_17","017_10_17","NEH","10","17","17","Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_18","017_10_18","NEH","10","18","18","Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_19","017_10_19","NEH","10","19","19","Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_20","017_10_20","NEH","10","20","20","Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_21","017_10_21","NEH","10","21","21","Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_22","017_10_22","NEH","10","22","22","Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_23","017_10_23","NEH","10","23","23","Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_24","017_10_24","NEH","10","24","24","Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_25","017_10_25","NEH","10","25","25","Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_26","017_10_26","NEH","10","26","26","Ahijah, Hanan, Anan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_27","017_10_27","NEH","10","27","27","Malluch, Harim, and Baanah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_28","017_10_28","NEH","10","28","28","“The rest of the people—the priests, Levites, gatekeepers, singers, temple servants, and all who had separated themselves from the people of the land to obey the Law of God—along with their wives and all their sons and daughters who are able to understand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_29","017_10_29","NEH","10","29","29","hereby join with their noble brothers and commit themselves with a sworn oath to follow the Law of God given through His servant Moses and to obey carefully all the commandments, ordinances, and statutes of the LORD our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_30","017_10_30","NEH","10","30","30","We will not give our daughters in marriage to the people of the land, and we will not take their daughters for our sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_31","017_10_31","NEH","10","31","31","When the people of the land bring merchandise or any kind of grain to sell on the Sabbath day, we will not buy from them on a Sabbath or holy day. Every seventh year we will let the fields lie fallow and will cancel every debt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_32","017_10_32","NEH","10","32","32","We also place ourselves under the obligation to contribute a third of a shekel yearly for the service of the house of our God: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_33","017_10_33","NEH","10","33","33","for the showbread, for the regular grain offerings and burnt offerings, for the Sabbath offerings, for the New Moons and appointed feasts, for the holy offerings, for the sin offerings to make atonement for Israel, and for all the duties of the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_34","017_10_34","NEH","10","34","34","We have cast lots among the priests, Levites, and people for the donation of wood by our families at the appointed times each year. They are to bring it to the house of our God to burn on the altar of the LORD our God, as it is written in the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_35","017_10_35","NEH","10","35","35","We will also bring the firstfruits of our land and of every fruit tree to the house of the LORD year by year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_36","017_10_36","NEH","10","36","36","And we will bring the firstborn of our sons and our livestock, as it is written in the Law, and will bring the firstborn of our herds and flocks to the house of our God, to the priests who minister in the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_37","017_10_37","NEH","10","37","37","Moreover, we will bring to the priests at the storerooms of the house of our God the firstfruits of our dough, of our grain offerings, of the fruit of all our trees, and of our new wine and oil. A tenth of our produce belongs to the Levites, so that they shall receive tithes in all the towns where we labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_38","017_10_38","NEH","10","38","38","A priest of Aaron’s line is to accompany the Levites when they collect the tenth, and the Levites are to bring a tenth of these tithes to the storerooms of the treasury in the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH10_39","017_10_39","NEH","10","39","39","For the Israelites and the Levites are to bring the contributions of grain, new wine, and oil to the storerooms where the articles of the sanctuary are kept and where the ministering priests, the gatekeepers, and the singers stay. Thus we will not neglect the house of our God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_1","017_11_1","NEH","11","1","1","Now the leaders of the people settled in Jerusalem, and the rest of the people cast lots to bring one out of ten to live in the holy city of Jerusalem, while the remaining nine were to dwell in their own towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_2","017_11_2","NEH","11","2","2","And the people blessed all the men who volunteered to live in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_3","017_11_3","NEH","11","3","3","These are the heads of the provinces who settled in Jerusalem. (In the villages of Judah, however, each lived on his own property in their towns—the Israelites, priests, Levites, temple servants, and descendants of Solomon’s servants— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_4","017_11_4","NEH","11","4","4","while some of the descendants of Judah and Benjamin settled in Jerusalem.) From the descendants of Judah: Athaiah son of Uzziah, the son of Zechariah, the son of Amariah, the son of Shephatiah, the son of Mahalalel, a descendant of Perez; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_5","017_11_5","NEH","11","5","5","and Maaseiah son of Baruch, the son of Col-hozeh, the son of Hazaiah, the son of Adaiah, the son of Joiarib, the son of Zechariah, a descendant of Shelah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_6","017_11_6","NEH","11","6","6","The descendants of Perez who settled in Jerusalem totaled 468 men of valor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_7","017_11_7","NEH","11","7","7","From the descendants of Benjamin: Sallu son of Meshullam, the son of Joed, the son of Pedaiah, the son of Kolaiah, the son of Maaseiah, the son of Ithiel, the son of Jeshaiah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_8","017_11_8","NEH","11","8","8","and his followers Gabbai and Sallai—928 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_9","017_11_9","NEH","11","9","9","Joel son of Zichri was the officer over them, and Judah son of Hassenuah was over the Second District of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_10","017_11_10","NEH","11","10","10","From the priests: Jedaiah son of Joiarib; Jachin; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_11","017_11_11","NEH","11","11","11","Seraiah son of Hilkiah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Zadok, the son of Meraioth, the son of Ahitub, the chief official of the house of God; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_12","017_11_12","NEH","11","12","12","and their associates who did the work at the temple—822 men; Adaiah son of Jeroham, the son of Pelaliah, the son of Amzi, the son of Zechariah, the son of Pashhur, the son of Malchijah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_13","017_11_13","NEH","11","13","13","and his associates, the leaders of families—242 men; Amashai son of Azarel, the son of Ahzai, the son of Meshillemoth, the son of Immer; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_14","017_11_14","NEH","11","14","14","and his associates—128 mighty men of valor. Zabdiel son of Haggedolim was their overseer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_15","017_11_15","NEH","11","15","15","From the Levites: Shemaiah son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, the son of Bunni; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_16","017_11_16","NEH","11","16","16","Shabbethai and Jozabad, two leaders of the Levites, who supervised the work outside the house of God; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_17","017_11_17","NEH","11","17","17","Mattaniah son of Mica, the son of Zabdi, the son of Asaph, who led in thanksgiving and prayer; Bakbukiah, second among his associates; and Abda son of Shammua, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_18","017_11_18","NEH","11","18","18","The Levites in the holy city totaled 284. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_19","017_11_19","NEH","11","19","19","And the gatekeepers: Akkub, Talmon, and their associates, who kept watch at the gates—172 men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_20","017_11_20","NEH","11","20","20","The rest of the Israelites, with the priests and Levites, were in all the villages of Judah, each on his own inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_21","017_11_21","NEH","11","21","21","The temple servants lived on the hill of Ophel, with Ziha and Gishpa over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_22","017_11_22","NEH","11","22","22","Now the overseer of the Levites in Jerusalem was Uzzi son of Bani, the son of Hashabiah, the son of Mattaniah, the son of Mica. He was one of Asaph’s descendants, who were the singers in charge of the service of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_23","017_11_23","NEH","11","23","23","For there was a command from the king concerning the singers, an ordinance regulating their daily activities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_24","017_11_24","NEH","11","24","24","Pethahiah son of Meshezabel, a descendant of Zerah son of Judah, was the king’s agent in every matter concerning the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_25","017_11_25","NEH","11","25","25","As for the villages with their fields, some of the people of Judah lived in Kiriath-arba, Dibon, Jekabzeel, and their villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_26","017_11_26","NEH","11","26","26","in Jeshua, Moladah, and Beth-pelet; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_27","017_11_27","NEH","11","27","27","in Hazar-shual; in Beersheba and its villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_28","017_11_28","NEH","11","28","28","in Ziklag; in Meconah and its villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_29","017_11_29","NEH","11","29","29","in En-rimmon, Zorah, Jarmuth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_30","017_11_30","NEH","11","30","30","Zanoah, Adullam, and their villages; in Lachish and its fields; and in Azekah and its villages. So they settled from Beersheba all the way to the Valley of Hinnom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_31","017_11_31","NEH","11","31","31","The descendants of Benjamin from Geba lived in Michmash, Aija, and Bethel with its villages; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_32","017_11_32","NEH","11","32","32","in Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_33","017_11_33","NEH","11","33","33","Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_34","017_11_34","NEH","11","34","34","Hadid, Zeboim, Neballat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_35","017_11_35","NEH","11","35","35","Lod, and Ono; and in the Valley of the Craftsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH11_36","017_11_36","NEH","11","36","36","And some divisions of the Levites of Judah settled in Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_1","017_12_1","NEH","12","1","1","Now these are the priests and Levites who went up with Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and with Jeshua: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_2","017_12_2","NEH","12","2","2","Amariah, Malluch, Hattush, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_3","017_12_3","NEH","12","3","3","Shecaniah, Rehum, Meremoth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_4","017_12_4","NEH","12","4","4","Iddo, Ginnethon, Abijah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_5","017_12_5","NEH","12","5","5","Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_6","017_12_6","NEH","12","6","6","Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_7","017_12_7","NEH","12","7","7","Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, and Jedaiah. These were the leaders of the priests and their associates in the days of Jeshua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_8","017_12_8","NEH","12","8","8","The Levites were Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah, and Mattaniah, who, with his associates, led the songs of thanksgiving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_9","017_12_9","NEH","12","9","9","Bakbukiah and Unni, their associates, stood across from them in the services. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_10","017_12_10","NEH","12","10","10","Jeshua was the father of Joiakim, Joiakim was the father of Eliashib, Eliashib was the father of Joiada, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_11","017_12_11","NEH","12","11","11","Joiada was the father of Jonathan, and Jonathan was the father of Jaddua. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_12","017_12_12","NEH","12","12","12","In the days of Joiakim, these were the heads of the priestly families: of the family of Seraiah, Meraiah; of Jeremiah, Hananiah; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_13","017_12_13","NEH","12","13","13","of Ezra, Meshullam; of Amariah, Jehohanan; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_14","017_12_14","NEH","12","14","14","of Malluchi, Jonathan; of Shebaniah, Joseph; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_15","017_12_15","NEH","12","15","15","of Harim, Adna; of Meraioth, Helkai; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_16","017_12_16","NEH","12","16","16","of Iddo, Zechariah; of Ginnethon, Meshullam; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_17","017_12_17","NEH","12","17","17","of Abijah, Zichri; of Miniamin and of Moadiah, Piltai; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_18","017_12_18","NEH","12","18","18","of Bilgah, Shammua; of Shemaiah, Jonathan; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_19","017_12_19","NEH","12","19","19","of Joiarib, Mattenai; of Jedaiah, Uzzi; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_20","017_12_20","NEH","12","20","20","of Sallai, Kallai; of Amok, Eber; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_21","017_12_21","NEH","12","21","21","of Hilkiah, Hashabiah; and of Jedaiah, Nethanel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_22","017_12_22","NEH","12","22","22","In the days of Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan, and Jaddua, during the reign of Darius the Persian, the heads of the families of the Levites and priests were recorded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_23","017_12_23","NEH","12","23","23","As for the descendants of Levi, the family heads up to the days of Johanan son of Eliashib were recorded in the Book of the Chronicles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_24","017_12_24","NEH","12","24","24","The leaders of the Levites were Hashabiah, Sherebiah, and Jeshua son of Kadmiel, along with their associates, who stood across from them to give praise and thanksgiving as one section alternated with the other, as prescribed by David the man of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_25","017_12_25","NEH","12","25","25","Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon, and Akkub were gatekeepers who guarded the storerooms at the gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_26","017_12_26","NEH","12","26","26","They served in the days of Joiakim son of Jeshua, the son of Jozadak, and in the days of Nehemiah the governor and Ezra the priest and scribe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_27","017_12_27","NEH","12","27","27","At the dedication of the wall of Jerusalem, the Levites were sought out from all their homes and brought to Jerusalem to celebrate the joyous dedication with thanksgiving and singing, accompanied by cymbals, harps, and lyres. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_28","017_12_28","NEH","12","28","28","The singers were also assembled from the region around Jerusalem, from the villages of the Netophathites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_29","017_12_29","NEH","12","29","29","from Beth-gilgal, and from the fields of Geba and Azmaveth, for they had built villages for themselves around Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_30","017_12_30","NEH","12","30","30","After the priests and Levites had purified themselves, they purified the people, the gates, and the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_31","017_12_31","NEH","12","31","31","Then I brought the leaders of Judah up on the wall, and I appointed two great thanksgiving choirs. One was to proceed along the top of the wall to the right, toward the Dung Gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_32","017_12_32","NEH","12","32","32","Hoshaiah and half the leaders of Judah followed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_33","017_12_33","NEH","12","33","33","along with Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_34","017_12_34","NEH","12","34","34","Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah, Jeremiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_35","017_12_35","NEH","12","35","35","and some of the priests with trumpets, and also Zechariah son of Jonathan, the son of Shemaiah, the son of Mattaniah, the son of Micaiah, the son of Zaccur, the son of Asaph, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_36","017_12_36","NEH","12","36","36","and his associates—Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah, and Hanani—with the musical instruments prescribed by David the man of God. Ezra the scribe led the procession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_37","017_12_37","NEH","12","37","37","At the Fountain Gate they went directly up the steps of the City of David on the ascent to the wall and passed above the house of David to the Water Gate on the east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_38","017_12_38","NEH","12","38","38","The second thanksgiving choir proceeded to the left, and I followed it with half the people along the top of the wall, past the Tower of the Ovens to the Broad Wall, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_39","017_12_39","NEH","12","39","39","over the Gate of Ephraim, the Jeshanah Gate, the Fish Gate, the Tower of Hananel, and the Tower of the Hundred, as far as the Sheep Gate. And they stopped at the Gate of the Guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_40","017_12_40","NEH","12","40","40","The two thanksgiving choirs then stood in the house of God, as did I, along with the half of the officials accompanying me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_41","017_12_41","NEH","12","41","41","as well as the priests with their trumpets—Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Micaiah, Elioenai, Zechariah, and Hananiah— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_42","017_12_42","NEH","12","42","42","and also Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malchijah, Elam, and Ezer. Then the choirs sang out under the direction of Jezrahiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_43","017_12_43","NEH","12","43","43","On that day they offered great sacrifices, rejoicing because God had given them great joy. The women and children also rejoiced, so that the joy of Jerusalem was heard from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_44","017_12_44","NEH","12","44","44","And on that same day men were appointed over the rooms that housed the supplies, contributions, firstfruits, and tithes. The portions specified by the Law for the priests and Levites were gathered into these storerooms from the fields of the villages, because Judah rejoiced over the priests and Levites who were serving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_45","017_12_45","NEH","12","45","45","They performed the service of their God and the service of purification, along with the singers and gatekeepers, as David and his son Solomon had prescribed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_46","017_12_46","NEH","12","46","46","For long ago, in the days of David and Asaph, there were directors for the singers and for the songs of praise and thanksgiving to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH12_47","017_12_47","NEH","12","47","47","So in the days of Zerubbabel and Nehemiah, all Israel contributed the daily portions for the singers and gatekeepers. They also set aside daily portions for the Levites, and the Levites set aside daily portions for the descendants of Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_1","017_13_1","NEH","13","1","1","At that time the Book of Moses was read aloud in the hearing of the people, and in it they found the passage stating that no Ammonite or Moabite should ever enter the assembly of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_2","017_13_2","NEH","13","2","2","because they had not met the Israelites with food and water, but had hired Balaam to call down a curse against them (although our God had turned the curse into a blessing). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_3","017_13_3","NEH","13","3","3","As soon as the people heard this law, they excluded from Israel all of foreign descent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_4","017_13_4","NEH","13","4","4","Now before this, Eliashib the priest, a relative of Tobiah, had been put in charge of the storerooms of the house of our God ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_5","017_13_5","NEH","13","5","5","and had prepared for Tobiah a large room where they had previously stored the grain offerings, the frankincense, the temple articles, and the tithes of grain, new wine, and oil prescribed for the Levites, singers, and gatekeepers, along with the contributions for the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_6","017_13_6","NEH","13","6","6","While all this was happening, I was not in Jerusalem, because I had returned to Artaxerxes king of Babylon in the thirty-second year of his reign. Some time later I obtained leave from the king ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_7","017_13_7","NEH","13","7","7","to return to Jerusalem. Then I discovered the evil that Eliashib had done on behalf of Tobiah by providing him a room in the courts of the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_8","017_13_8","NEH","13","8","8","And I was greatly displeased and threw all of Tobiah’s household goods out of the room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_9","017_13_9","NEH","13","9","9","Then I ordered that the rooms be purified, and I had the articles of the house of God restored to them, along with the grain offerings and frankincense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_10","017_13_10","NEH","13","10","10","I also learned that because the portions for the Levites had not been given to them, all the Levites and singers responsible for performing the service had gone back to their own fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_11","017_13_11","NEH","13","11","11","So I rebuked the officials and asked, “Why has the house of God been neglected?” Then I gathered the Levites and singers together and stationed them at their posts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_12","017_13_12","NEH","13","12","12","and all Judah brought a tenth of the grain, new wine, and oil into the storerooms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_13","017_13_13","NEH","13","13","13","I appointed as treasurers over the storerooms Shelemiah the priest, Zadok the scribe, and Pedaiah of the Levites, with Hanan son of Zaccur, the son of Mattaniah, to assist them, because they were considered trustworthy. They were responsible for distributing the supplies to their fellow Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_14","017_13_14","NEH","13","14","14","Remember me for this, O my God, and do not blot out my deeds of loving devotion for the house of my God and for its services. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_15","017_13_15","NEH","13","15","15","In those days I saw people in Judah treading winepresses on the Sabbath and bringing in grain and loading it on donkeys, along with wine, grapes, and figs. All kinds of goods were being brought into Jerusalem on the Sabbath day. So I warned them against selling food on that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_16","017_13_16","NEH","13","16","16","Additionally, men of Tyre who lived there were importing fish and all kinds of merchandise and selling them on the Sabbath to the people of Judah in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_17","017_13_17","NEH","13","17","17","Then I rebuked the nobles of Judah and asked, “What is this evil you are doing—profaning the Sabbath day? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_18","017_13_18","NEH","13","18","18","Did not your forefathers do the same things, so that our God brought all this disaster on us and on this city? And now you are rekindling His wrath against Israel by profaning the Sabbath!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_19","017_13_19","NEH","13","19","19","When the evening shadows began to fall on the gates of Jerusalem, just before the Sabbath, I ordered that the gates be shut and not opened until after the Sabbath. I posted some of my servants at the gates so that no load could enter on the Sabbath day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_20","017_13_20","NEH","13","20","20","Once or twice, the merchants and those who sell all kinds of goods camped outside Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_21","017_13_21","NEH","13","21","21","but I warned them, “Why are you camping in front of the wall? If you do it again, I will lay hands on you.” From that time on, they did not return on the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_22","017_13_22","NEH","13","22","22","Then I instructed the Levites to purify themselves and guard the gates in order to keep the Sabbath day holy. Remember me for this as well, O my God, and show me mercy according to Your abundant loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_23","017_13_23","NEH","13","23","23","In those days I also saw Jews who had married women from Ashdod, Ammon, and Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_24","017_13_24","NEH","13","24","24","Half of their children spoke the language of Ashdod or of the other peoples, but could not speak the language of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_25","017_13_25","NEH","13","25","25","I rebuked them and called down curses on them. I beat some of these men and pulled out their hair. Then I made them take an oath before God and said, “You must not give your daughters in marriage to their sons or take their daughters as wives for your sons or for yourselves! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_26","017_13_26","NEH","13","26","26","Did not King Solomon of Israel sin in matters like this? There was not a king like him among many nations, and he was loved by his God, who made him king over all Israel—yet foreign women drew him into sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_27","017_13_27","NEH","13","27","27","Must we now hear that you too are doing all this terrible evil and acting unfaithfully against our God by marrying foreign women?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_28","017_13_28","NEH","13","28","28","Even one of the sons of Jehoiada son of Eliashib the high priest had become a son-in-law to Sanballat the Horonite. Therefore I drove him away from me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_29","017_13_29","NEH","13","29","29","Remember them, O my God, because they have defiled the priesthood and the covenant of the priesthood and of the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_30","017_13_30","NEH","13","30","30","Thus I purified the priests and Levites from everything foreign, and I assigned specific duties to each of the priests and Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NH13_31","017_13_31","NEH","13","31","31","I also arranged for contributions of wood at the appointed times, and for the firstfruits. Remember me, O my God, with favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_1","018_1_1","EST","1","1","1","This is what happened in the days of Xerxes, who reigned over 127 provinces from India to Cush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_2","018_1_2","EST","1","2","2","In those days King Xerxes sat on his royal throne in the citadel of Susa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_3","018_1_3","EST","1","3","3","In the third year of his reign, Xerxes held a feast for all his officials and servants. The military leaders of Persia and Media were there, along with the nobles and princes of the provinces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_4","018_1_4","EST","1","4","4","And for a full 180 days he displayed the glorious riches of his kingdom and the magnificent splendor of his greatness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_5","018_1_5","EST","1","5","5","At the end of this time, in the garden court of the royal palace, the king held a seven-day feast for all the people in the citadel of Susa, from the least to the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_6","018_1_6","EST","1","6","6","Hangings of white and blue linen were fastened with cords of fine white and purple material to silver rings on the marble pillars. Gold and silver couches were arranged on a mosaic pavement of porphyry, marble, mother-of-pearl, and other costly stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_7","018_1_7","EST","1","7","7","Beverages were served in an array of goblets of gold, each with a different design, and the royal wine flowed freely, according to the king’s bounty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_8","018_1_8","EST","1","8","8","By order of the king, no limit was placed on the drinking, and every official of his household was to serve each man whatever he desired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_9","018_1_9","EST","1","9","9","Queen Vashti also gave a banquet for the women in the royal palace of King Xerxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_10","018_1_10","EST","1","10","10","On the seventh day, when the king’s heart was merry with wine, he ordered the seven eunuchs who served him—Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zethar, and Carkas— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_11","018_1_11","EST","1","11","11","to bring Queen Vashti before him, wearing her royal crown, to display her beauty to the people and officials. For she was beautiful to behold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_12","018_1_12","EST","1","12","12","Queen Vashti, however, refused to come at the king’s command brought by his eunuchs. And the king became furious, and his anger burned within him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_13","018_1_13","EST","1","13","13","Then the king consulted the wise men who knew the times, for it was customary for him to confer with the experts in law and justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_14","018_1_14","EST","1","14","14","His closest advisors were Carshena, Shethar, Admatha, Tarshish, Meres, Marsena, and Memucan, the seven princes of Persia and Media who had personal access to the king and ranked highest in the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_15","018_1_15","EST","1","15","15","“According to law,” he asked, “what should be done with Queen Vashti, since she refused to obey the command of King Xerxes delivered by the eunuchs?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_16","018_1_16","EST","1","16","16","And in the presence of the king and his princes, Memucan replied, “Queen Vashti has wronged not only the king, but all the princes and the peoples in all the provinces of King Xerxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_17","018_1_17","EST","1","17","17","For the conduct of the queen will become known to all women, causing them to despise their husbands and say, ‘King Xerxes ordered Queen Vashti to be brought before him, but she did not come.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_18","018_1_18","EST","1","18","18","This very day the noble women of Persia and Media who have heard about the queen’s conduct will say the same thing to all the king’s officials, resulting in much contempt and wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_19","018_1_19","EST","1","19","19","So if it pleases the king, let him issue a royal decree, and let it be recorded in the laws of Persia and Media so that it cannot be repealed, that Vashti shall never again enter the presence of King Xerxes, and that her royal position shall be given to a woman better than she. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_20","018_1_20","EST","1","20","20","The edict the king issues will be heard throughout his vast kingdom—and so all women, from the least to the greatest, will honor their husbands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_21","018_1_21","EST","1","21","21","The king and his princes were pleased with this counsel; so the king did as Memucan advised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET1_22","018_1_22","EST","1","22","22","He sent letters to all the provinces of the kingdom, to each province in its own script and to each people in their own language, proclaiming that every man should be master of his own household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_1","018_2_1","EST","2","1","1","Some time later, when the anger of King Xerxes had subsided, he remembered Vashti and what she had done, and what had been decreed against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_2","018_2_2","EST","2","2","2","Then the king’s attendants proposed, “Let a search be made for beautiful young virgins for the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_3","018_2_3","EST","2","3","3","and let the king appoint commissioners in each province of his kingdom to assemble all the beautiful young women into the harem at the citadel of Susa. Let them be placed under the care of Hegai, the king’s eunuch in charge of the women, and let them be given beauty treatments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_4","018_2_4","EST","2","4","4","Then let the young woman who pleases the king become queen in place of Vashti.” This suggestion pleased the king, and he acted accordingly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_5","018_2_5","EST","2","5","5","Now there was at the citadel of Susa a Jewish man from the tribe of Benjamin named Mordecai son of Jair, the son of Shimei, the son of Kish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_6","018_2_6","EST","2","6","6","He had been carried into exile from Jerusalem by Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon among those taken captive with Jeconiah king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_7","018_2_7","EST","2","7","7","And Mordecai had brought up Hadassah (that is, Esther), the daughter of his uncle, because she did not have a father or mother. The young woman was lovely in form and appearance, and when her father and mother had died, Mordecai had taken her as his own daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_8","018_2_8","EST","2","8","8","When the king’s command and edict had been proclaimed, many young women gathered at the citadel of Susa under the care of Hegai. Esther was also taken to the palace and placed under the care of Hegai, the custodian of the women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_9","018_2_9","EST","2","9","9","And the young woman pleased him and obtained his favor, so he quickly provided her with beauty treatments and the special diet. He assigned to her seven select maidservants from the palace and transferred her with them to the best place in the harem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_10","018_2_10","EST","2","10","10","Esther did not reveal her people or her lineage, because Mordecai had instructed her not to do so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_11","018_2_11","EST","2","11","11","And every day Mordecai would walk back and forth in front of the court of the harem to learn about Esther’s welfare and what was happening to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_12","018_2_12","EST","2","12","12","In the twelve months before her turn to go to King Xerxes, the harem regulation required each young woman to receive beauty treatments with oil of myrrh for six months, and then with perfumes and cosmetics for another six months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_13","018_2_13","EST","2","13","13","When the young woman would go to the king, she was given whatever she requested to take with her from the harem to the king’s palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_14","018_2_14","EST","2","14","14","She would go there in the evening, and in the morning she would return to a second harem under the care of Shaashgaz, the king’s eunuch in charge of the concubines. She would not return to the king unless he delighted in her and summoned her by name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_15","018_2_15","EST","2","15","15","Now Esther was the daughter of Abihail, the uncle from whom Mordecai had adopted her as his own daughter. And when it was her turn to go to the king, she did not ask for anything except what Hegai, the king’s trusted official in charge of the harem, had advised. And Esther found favor in the eyes of everyone who saw her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_16","018_2_16","EST","2","16","16","She was taken to King Xerxes in the royal palace in the tenth month, the month of Tebeth, in the seventh year of his reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_17","018_2_17","EST","2","17","17","And the king loved Esther more than all the other women, and she found grace and favor in his sight more than all of the other virgins. So he placed the royal crown upon her head and made her queen in place of Vashti. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_18","018_2_18","EST","2","18","18","Then the king held a great banquet, Esther’s banquet, for all his officials and servants. He proclaimed a tax holiday in the provinces and gave gifts worthy of the king’s bounty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_19","018_2_19","EST","2","19","19","When the virgins were assembled a second time, Mordecai was sitting at the king’s gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_20","018_2_20","EST","2","20","20","Esther still had not revealed her lineage or her people, just as Mordecai had instructed. She obeyed Mordecai’s command, as she had done under his care. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_21","018_2_21","EST","2","21","21","In those days, while Mordecai was sitting at the king’s gate, Bigthan and Teresh, two of the king’s eunuchs who guarded the entrance, grew angry and conspired to assassinate King Xerxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_22","018_2_22","EST","2","22","22","When Mordecai learned of the plot, he reported it to Queen Esther, and she informed the king on Mordecai’s behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET2_23","018_2_23","EST","2","23","23","After the report had been investigated and verified, both officials were hanged on the gallows. And all this was recorded in the Book of the Chronicles in the presence of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_1","018_3_1","EST","3","1","1","After these events, King Xerxes honored Haman son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, elevating him to a position above all the princes who were with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_2","018_3_2","EST","3","2","2","All the royal servants at the king’s gate bowed down and paid homage to Haman, because the king had commanded that this be done for him. But Mordecai would not bow down or pay homage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_3","018_3_3","EST","3","3","3","Then the royal servants at the king’s gate asked Mordecai, “Why do you disobey the command of the king?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_4","018_3_4","EST","3","4","4","Day after day they warned him, but he would not comply. So they reported it to Haman to see whether Mordecai’s behavior would be tolerated, since he had told them he was a Jew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_5","018_3_5","EST","3","5","5","When Haman saw that Mordecai would not bow down or pay him homage, he was filled with rage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_6","018_3_6","EST","3","6","6","And when he learned the identity of Mordecai’s people, he scorned the notion of laying hands on Mordecai alone. Instead, he sought to destroy all of Mordecai’s people, the Jews, throughout the kingdom of Xerxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_7","018_3_7","EST","3","7","7","In the twelfth year of King Xerxes, in the first month, the month of Nisan, the Pur (that is, the lot) was cast before Haman to determine a day and month. And the lot fell on the twelfth month, the month of Adar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_8","018_3_8","EST","3","8","8","Then Haman informed King Xerxes, “There is a certain people scattered and dispersed among the peoples of every province of your kingdom. Their laws are different from everyone else’s, and they do not obey the king’s laws. So it is not in the king’s best interest to tolerate them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_9","018_3_9","EST","3","9","9","If it pleases the king, let a decree be issued to destroy them, and I will deposit ten thousand talents of silver into the royal treasury to pay those who carry it out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_10","018_3_10","EST","3","10","10","So the king removed the signet ring from his finger and gave it to Haman son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, the enemy of the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_11","018_3_11","EST","3","11","11","“Keep your money,” said the king to Haman. “These people are given to you to do with them as you please.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_12","018_3_12","EST","3","12","12","On the thirteenth day of the first month, the royal scribes were summoned and the order was written exactly as Haman commanded the royal satraps, the governors of each province, and the officials of each people, in the script of each province and the language of every people. It was written in the name of King Xerxes and sealed with the royal signet ring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_13","018_3_13","EST","3","13","13","And the letters were sent by couriers to each of the royal provinces with the order to destroy, kill, and annihilate all the Jews—young and old, women and children—and to plunder their possessions on a single day, the thirteenth day of Adar, the twelfth month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_14","018_3_14","EST","3","14","14","A copy of the text of the edict was to be issued in every province and published to all the people, so that they would be ready on that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET3_15","018_3_15","EST","3","15","15","The couriers left, spurred on by the king’s command, and the edict was issued in the citadel of Susa. Then the king and Haman sat down to drink, but the city of Susa was in confusion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_1","018_4_1","EST","4","1","1","When Mordecai learned of all that had happened, he tore his clothes, put on sackcloth and ashes, and went out into the middle of the city, wailing loudly and bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_2","018_4_2","EST","4","2","2","But he went only as far as the king’s gate, because the law prohibited anyone wearing sackcloth from entering that gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_3","018_4_3","EST","4","3","3","In every province to which the king’s command and edict came, there was great mourning among the Jews. They fasted, wept, and lamented, and many lay in sackcloth and ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_4","018_4_4","EST","4","4","4","When Esther’s maidens and eunuchs came and told her about Mordecai, the queen was overcome with distress. She sent clothes for Mordecai to wear instead of his sackcloth, but he would not accept them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_5","018_4_5","EST","4","5","5","Then Esther summoned Hathach, one of the king’s eunuchs appointed to her, and she dispatched him to Mordecai to learn what was troubling him and why. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_6","018_4_6","EST","4","6","6","So Hathach went out to Mordecai in the city square in front of the king’s gate, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_7","018_4_7","EST","4","7","7","and Mordecai told him all that had happened to him, including the exact amount of money that Haman had promised to pay into the royal treasury in order to destroy the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_8","018_4_8","EST","4","8","8","Mordecai also gave Hathach a copy of the written decree issued in Susa for the destruction of the Jews, to show and explain to Esther, urging her to approach the king, implore his favor, and plead before him for her people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_9","018_4_9","EST","4","9","9","So Hathach went back and relayed Mordecai’s response to Esther. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_10","018_4_10","EST","4","10","10","Then Esther spoke to Hathach and instructed him to tell Mordecai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_11","018_4_11","EST","4","11","11","“All the royal officials and the people of the king’s provinces know that one law applies to every man or woman who approaches the king in the inner court without being summoned—that he be put to death. Only if the king extends the gold scepter may that person live. But I have not been summoned to appear before the king for the past thirty days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_12","018_4_12","EST","4","12","12","When Esther’s words were relayed to Mordecai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_13","018_4_13","EST","4","13","13","he sent back to her this reply: “Do not imagine that because you are in the king’s palace you alone will escape the fate of all the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_14","018_4_14","EST","4","14","14","For if you remain silent at this time, relief and deliverance for the Jews will arise from another place, but you and your father’s house will perish. And who knows if perhaps you have come to the kingdom for such a time as this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_15","018_4_15","EST","4","15","15","Then Esther sent this reply to Mordecai: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_16","018_4_16","EST","4","16","16","“Go and assemble all the Jews who can be found in Susa, and fast for me. Do not eat or drink for three days, night or day, and I and my maidens will fast as you do. After that, I will go to the king, even though it is against the law. And if I perish, I perish!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET4_17","018_4_17","EST","4","17","17","So Mordecai went and did all that Esther had instructed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_1","018_5_1","EST","5","1","1","On the third day, Esther put on her royal robes and stood in the inner court of the palace across from the king’s quarters. The king was sitting on his royal throne in the royal courtroom, facing the entrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_2","018_5_2","EST","5","2","2","As soon as the king saw Queen Esther standing in the court, she found favor in his sight. The king extended the gold scepter in his hand toward Esther, and she approached and touched the tip of the scepter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_3","018_5_3","EST","5","3","3","“What is it, Queen Esther?” the king inquired. “What is your request? Even up to half the kingdom, it will be given to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_4","018_5_4","EST","5","4","4","“If it pleases the king,” Esther replied, “may the king and Haman come today to the banquet I have prepared for the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_5","018_5_5","EST","5","5","5","“Hurry,” commanded the king, “and bring Haman, so we can do as Esther has requested.” So the king and Haman went to the banquet that Esther had prepared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_6","018_5_6","EST","5","6","6","And as they drank their wine, the king said to Esther, “What is your petition? It will be given to you. What is your request? Even up to half the kingdom, it will be fulfilled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_7","018_5_7","EST","5","7","7","Esther replied, “This is my petition and my request: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_8","018_5_8","EST","5","8","8","If I have found favor in the sight of the king, and if it pleases the king to grant my petition and fulfill my request, may the king and Haman come tomorrow to the banquet I will prepare for them. Then I will answer the king’s question.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_9","018_5_9","EST","5","9","9","That day Haman went out full of joy and glad of heart. At the king’s gate, however, he saw Mordecai, who did not rise or tremble in fear at his presence. And Haman was filled with rage toward Mordecai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_10","018_5_10","EST","5","10","10","Nevertheless, Haman restrained himself and went home. And calling for his friends and his wife Zeresh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_11","018_5_11","EST","5","11","11","Haman recounted to them his glorious wealth, his many sons, and all the ways the king had honored and promoted him over the other officials and servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_12","018_5_12","EST","5","12","12","“What is more,” Haman added, “Queen Esther invited no one but me to join the king at the banquet she prepared, and I am invited back tomorrow along with the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_13","018_5_13","EST","5","13","13","Yet none of this satisfies me as long as I see Mordecai the Jew sitting at the king’s gate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET5_14","018_5_14","EST","5","14","14","His wife Zeresh and all his friends told him, “Have them build a gallows fifty cubits high, and ask the king in the morning to have Mordecai hanged on it. Then go to the banquet with the king and enjoy yourself.” The advice pleased Haman, and he had the gallows constructed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_1","018_6_1","EST","6","1","1","That night sleep escaped the king; so he ordered the Book of Records, the Chronicles, to be brought in and read to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_2","018_6_2","EST","6","2","2","And there it was found recorded that Mordecai had exposed Bigthana and Teresh, two of the eunuchs who guarded the king’s entrance, when they had conspired to assassinate King Xerxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_3","018_6_3","EST","6","3","3","The king inquired, “What honor or dignity has been bestowed on Mordecai for this act?” “Nothing has been done for him,” replied the king’s attendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_4","018_6_4","EST","6","4","4","“Who is in the court?” the king asked. Now Haman had just entered the outer court of the palace to ask the king to hang Mordecai on the gallows he had prepared for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_5","018_6_5","EST","6","5","5","So the king’s attendants answered him, “Haman is there, standing in the court.” “Bring him in,” ordered the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_6","018_6_6","EST","6","6","6","Haman entered, and the king asked him, “What should be done for the man whom the king is delighted to honor?” Now Haman thought to himself, “Whom would the king be delighted to honor more than me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_7","018_6_7","EST","6","7","7","And Haman told the king, “For the man whom the king is delighted to honor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_8","018_6_8","EST","6","8","8","have them bring a royal robe that the king himself has worn and a horse on which the king himself has ridden—one with a royal crest placed on its head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_9","018_6_9","EST","6","9","9","Let the robe and the horse be entrusted to one of the king’s most noble princes. Let them array the man the king wants to honor and parade him on the horse through the city square, proclaiming before him, ‘This is what is done for the man whom the king is delighted to honor!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_10","018_6_10","EST","6","10","10","“Hurry,” said the king to Haman, “and do just as you proposed. Take the robe and the horse to Mordecai the Jew, who is sitting at the king’s gate. Do not neglect anything that you have suggested.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_11","018_6_11","EST","6","11","11","So Haman took the robe and the horse, arrayed Mordecai, and paraded him through the city square, crying out before him, “This is what is done for the man whom the king is delighted to honor!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_12","018_6_12","EST","6","12","12","Then Mordecai returned to the king’s gate. But Haman rushed home, with his head covered in grief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_13","018_6_13","EST","6","13","13","Haman told his wife Zeresh and all his friends everything that had happened. His advisers and his wife Zeresh said to him, “Since Mordecai, before whom your downfall has begun, is Jewish, you will not prevail against him—for surely you will fall before him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET6_14","018_6_14","EST","6","14","14","While they were still speaking with Haman, the king’s eunuchs arrived and rushed him to the banquet that Esther had prepared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_1","018_7_1","EST","7","1","1","So the king and Haman went to dine with Esther the queen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_2","018_7_2","EST","7","2","2","and as they drank their wine on that second day, the king asked once more, “Queen Esther, what is your petition? It will be given to you. What is your request? Even up to half the kingdom, it will be fulfilled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_3","018_7_3","EST","7","3","3","Queen Esther replied, “If I have found favor in your sight, O king, and if it pleases the king, grant me my life as my petition, and the lives of my people as my request. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_4","018_7_4","EST","7","4","4","For my people and I have been sold out to destruction, death, and annihilation. If we had merely been sold as menservants and maidservants, I would have remained silent, because no such distress would justify burdening the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_5","018_7_5","EST","7","5","5","Then King Xerxes spoke up and asked Queen Esther, “Who is this, and where is the one who would devise such a scheme?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_6","018_7_6","EST","7","6","6","Esther replied, “The adversary and enemy is this wicked man—Haman!” And Haman stood in terror before the king and queen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_7","018_7_7","EST","7","7","7","In his fury, the king arose from drinking his wine and went to the palace garden, while Haman stayed behind to beg Queen Esther for his life, for he realized that the king was planning a terrible fate for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_8","018_7_8","EST","7","8","8","Just as the king returned from the palace garden to the banquet hall, Haman was falling on the couch where Esther was reclining. The king exclaimed, “Would he actually assault the queen while I am in the palace?” As soon as the words had left the king’s mouth, they covered Haman’s face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_9","018_7_9","EST","7","9","9","Then Harbonah, one of the eunuchs attending the king, said: “There is a gallows fifty cubits high at Haman’s house. He had it built for Mordecai, who gave the report that saved the king.” “Hang him on it!” declared the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET7_10","018_7_10","EST","7","10","10","So they hanged Haman on the gallows he had prepared for Mordecai. Then the fury of the king subsided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_1","018_8_1","EST","8","1","1","That same day King Xerxes awarded Queen Esther the estate of Haman, the enemy of the Jews. And Mordecai entered the king’s presence because Esther had revealed his relation to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_2","018_8_2","EST","8","2","2","The king removed the signet ring he had recovered from Haman and presented it to Mordecai. And Esther appointed Mordecai over the estate of Haman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_3","018_8_3","EST","8","3","3","And once again, Esther addressed the king. She fell at his feet weeping and begged him to revoke the evil scheme of Haman the Agagite, which he had devised against the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_4","018_8_4","EST","8","4","4","The king extended the gold scepter toward Esther, and she arose and stood before the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_5","018_8_5","EST","8","5","5","“If it pleases the king,” she said, “and if I have found favor in his sight, and the matter seems proper to the king, and I am pleasing in his sight, may an order be written to revoke the letters that the scheming Haman son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, wrote to destroy the Jews in all the king’s provinces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_6","018_8_6","EST","8","6","6","For how could I bear to see the disaster that would befall my people? How could I bear to see the destruction of my kindred?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_7","018_8_7","EST","8","7","7","So King Xerxes said to Esther the Queen and Mordecai the Jew, “Behold, I have given Haman’s estate to Esther, and he was hanged on the gallows because he attacked the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_8","018_8_8","EST","8","8","8","Now you may write in the king’s name as you please regarding the Jews, and seal it with the royal signet ring. For a decree that is written in the name of the king and sealed with the royal signet ring cannot be revoked.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_9","018_8_9","EST","8","9","9","At once the royal scribes were summoned, and on the twenty-third day of the third month (the month of Sivan), they recorded all of Mordecai’s orders to the Jews and to the satraps, governors, and princes of the 127 provinces from India to Cush—writing to each province in its own script, to every people in their own language, and to the Jews in their own script and language. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_10","018_8_10","EST","8","10","10","Mordecai wrote in the name of King Xerxes and sealed it with the royal signet ring. He sent the documents by mounted couriers riding on swift horses bred from the royal mares. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_11","018_8_11","EST","8","11","11","By these letters the king permitted the Jews in each and every city the right to assemble and defend themselves, to destroy, kill, and annihilate all the forces of any people or province hostile to them, including women and children, and to plunder their possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_12","018_8_12","EST","8","12","12","The single day appointed throughout all the provinces of King Xerxes was the thirteenth day of the twelfth month, the month of Adar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_13","018_8_13","EST","8","13","13","A copy of the text of the edict was to be issued in every province and published to all the people, so that the Jews would be ready on that day to avenge themselves on their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_14","018_8_14","EST","8","14","14","The couriers rode out in haste on their royal horses, pressed on by the command of the king. And the edict was also issued in the citadel of Susa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_15","018_8_15","EST","8","15","15","Mordecai went out from the presence of the king in royal garments of blue and white, with a large gold crown and a purple robe of fine linen. And the city of Susa shouted and rejoiced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_16","018_8_16","EST","8","16","16","For the Jews it was a time of light and gladness, of joy and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET8_17","018_8_17","EST","8","17","17","In every province and every city, wherever the king’s edict and decree reached, there was joy and gladness among the Jews, with feasting and celebrating. And many of the people of the land themselves became Jews, because the fear of the Jews had fallen upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_1","018_9_1","EST","9","1","1","On the thirteenth day of the twelfth month, the month of Adar, the king’s command and edict were to be executed. On this day the enemies of the Jews had hoped to overpower them, but their plan was overturned and the Jews overpowered those who hated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_2","018_9_2","EST","9","2","2","In each of the provinces of King Xerxes, the Jews assembled in their cities to attack those who sought to harm them. No man could withstand them, because the fear of them had fallen upon all peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_3","018_9_3","EST","9","3","3","And all the officials of the provinces, the satraps, the governors, and the king’s administrators helped the Jews, because the fear of Mordecai had fallen upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_4","018_9_4","EST","9","4","4","For Mordecai exercised great power in the palace, and his fame spread throughout the provinces as he became more and more powerful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_5","018_9_5","EST","9","5","5","The Jews put all their enemies to the sword, killing and destroying them, and they did as they pleased to those who hated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_6","018_9_6","EST","9","6","6","In the citadel of Susa, the Jews killed and destroyed five hundred men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_7","018_9_7","EST","9","7","7","including Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_8","018_9_8","EST","9","8","8","Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_9","018_9_9","EST","9","9","9","Parmashta, Arisai, Aridai, and Vaizatha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_10","018_9_10","EST","9","10","10","They killed these ten sons of Haman son of Hammedatha, the enemy of the Jews, but they did not lay a hand on the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_11","018_9_11","EST","9","11","11","On that day the number of those killed in the citadel of Susa was reported to the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_12","018_9_12","EST","9","12","12","who said to Queen Esther, “In the citadel of Susa the Jews have killed and destroyed five hundred men, including Haman’s ten sons. What have they done in the rest of the royal provinces? Now what is your petition? It will be given to you. And what further do you request? It will be fulfilled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_13","018_9_13","EST","9","13","13","Esther replied, “If it pleases the king, may the Jews in Susa also have tomorrow to carry out today’s edict, and may the bodies of Haman’s ten sons be hanged on the gallows.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_14","018_9_14","EST","9","14","14","So the king commanded that this be done. An edict was issued in Susa, and they hanged the ten sons of Haman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_15","018_9_15","EST","9","15","15","On the fourteenth day of the month of Adar, the Jews in Susa came together again and put to death three hundred men there, but they did not lay a hand on the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_16","018_9_16","EST","9","16","16","The rest of the Jews in the royal provinces also assembled to defend themselves and rid themselves of their enemies. They killed 75,000 who hated them, but they did not lay a hand on the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_17","018_9_17","EST","9","17","17","This was done on the thirteenth day of the month of Adar, and on the fourteenth day they rested, making it a day of feasting and joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_18","018_9_18","EST","9","18","18","The Jews in Susa, however, had assembled on the thirteenth and the fourteenth days of the month. So they rested on the fifteenth day, making it a day of feasting and joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_19","018_9_19","EST","9","19","19","This is why the rural Jews, who live in the villages, observe the fourteenth day of the month of Adar as a day of joy and feasting. It is a holiday for sending gifts to one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_20","018_9_20","EST","9","20","20","Mordecai recorded these events and sent letters to all the Jews in all the provinces of King Xerxes, both near and far, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_21","018_9_21","EST","9","21","21","to establish among them an annual celebration on the fourteenth and fifteenth days of the month of Adar ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_22","018_9_22","EST","9","22","22","as the days on which the Jews gained rest from their enemies and the month in which their sorrow turned to joy and their mourning into a holiday. He wrote that these were to be days of feasting and joy, of sending gifts to one another and to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_23","018_9_23","EST","9","23","23","So the Jews agreed to continue the custom they had started, as Mordecai had written to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_24","018_9_24","EST","9","24","24","For Haman son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, the enemy of all the Jews, had plotted against the Jews to destroy them and had cast the Pur (that is, the lot) to crush and destroy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_25","018_9_25","EST","9","25","25","But when it came before the king, he commanded by letter that the wicked scheme which Haman had devised against the Jews should come back upon his own head, and that he and his sons should be hanged on the gallows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_26","018_9_26","EST","9","26","26","Therefore these days are called Purim, from the word Pur. Because of all the instructions in this letter, and because of all they had seen and experienced, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_27","018_9_27","EST","9","27","27","the Jews bound themselves to establish the custom that they and their descendants and all who join them should not fail to celebrate these two days at the appointed time each and every year, according to their regulation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_28","018_9_28","EST","9","28","28","These days should be remembered and celebrated by every generation, family, province, and city, so that these days of Purim should not fail to be observed among the Jews, nor should the memory of them fade from their descendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_29","018_9_29","EST","9","29","29","So Queen Esther daughter of Abihail, along with Mordecai the Jew, wrote with full authority to confirm this second letter concerning Purim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_30","018_9_30","EST","9","30","30","And Mordecai sent letters with words of peace and truth to all the Jews in the 127 provinces of the kingdom of Xerxes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_31","018_9_31","EST","9","31","31","in order to confirm these days of Purim at their appointed time, just as Mordecai the Jew and Queen Esther had established them and had committed themselves and their descendants to the times of fasting and lamentation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET9_32","018_9_32","EST","9","32","32","So Esther’s decree confirmed these regulations about Purim, which were written into the record. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET10_1","018_10_1","EST","10","1","1","Now King Xerxes imposed tribute throughout the land, even to its farthest shores. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET10_2","018_10_2","EST","10","2","2","And all of Mordecai’s powerful and magnificent accomplishments, together with the full account of the greatness to which the king had raised him, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Media and Persia? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ET10_3","018_10_3","EST","10","3","3","For Mordecai the Jew was second only to King Xerxes, preeminent among the Jews and highly favored by his many kinsmen, seeking the good of his people and speaking peace to all his countrymen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_1","019_1_1","JOB","1","1","1","There was a man in the land of Uz whose name was Job. And this man was blameless and upright, fearing God and shunning evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_2","019_1_2","JOB","1","2","2","He had seven sons and three daughters, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_3","019_1_3","JOB","1","3","3","and he owned 7,000 sheep, 3,000 camels, 500 yoke of oxen, 500 female donkeys, and a very large number of servants. Job was the greatest man of all the people of the East. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_4","019_1_4","JOB","1","4","4","Job’s sons would take turns holding feasts in their homes, and they would invite their three sisters to eat and drink with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_5","019_1_5","JOB","1","5","5","And when the days of feasting were over, Job would send for his children to purify them, rising early in the morning to offer burnt offerings for all of them. For Job thought, “Perhaps my children have sinned and cursed God in their hearts.” This was Job’s regular practice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_6","019_1_6","JOB","1","6","6","One day the sons of God came to present themselves before the LORD, and Satan also came with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_7","019_1_7","JOB","1","7","7","“Where have you come from?” said the LORD to Satan. “From roaming through the earth,” he replied, “and walking back and forth in it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_8","019_1_8","JOB","1","8","8","Then the LORD said to Satan, “Have you considered My servant Job? For there is no one on earth like him, a man who is blameless and upright, who fears God and shuns evil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_9","019_1_9","JOB","1","9","9","Satan answered the LORD, “Does Job fear God for nothing? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_10","019_1_10","JOB","1","10","10","Have You not placed a hedge on every side around him and his household and all that he owns? You have blessed the work of his hands, and his possessions have increased in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_11","019_1_11","JOB","1","11","11","But stretch out Your hand and strike all that he has, and he will surely curse You to Your face.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_12","019_1_12","JOB","1","12","12","“Very well,” said the LORD to Satan. “Everything he has is in your hands, but you must not lay a hand on the man himself.” Then Satan went out from the presence of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_13","019_1_13","JOB","1","13","13","One day, while Job’s sons and daughters were eating and drinking wine in their oldest brother’s house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_14","019_1_14","JOB","1","14","14","a messenger came and reported to Job: “While the oxen were plowing and the donkeys were grazing nearby, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_15","019_1_15","JOB","1","15","15","the Sabeans swooped down and took them away. They put the servants to the sword, and I alone have escaped to tell you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_16","019_1_16","JOB","1","16","16","While he was still speaking, another messenger came and reported: “The fire of God fell from heaven. It burned and consumed the sheep and the servants, and I alone have escaped to tell you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_17","019_1_17","JOB","1","17","17","While he was still speaking, another messenger came and reported: “The Chaldeans formed three bands, raided the camels, and took them away. They put the servants to the sword, and I alone have escaped to tell you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_18","019_1_18","JOB","1","18","18","While he was still speaking, another messenger came and reported: “Your sons and daughters were eating and drinking wine in their oldest brother’s house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_19","019_1_19","JOB","1","19","19","when suddenly a mighty wind swept in from the desert and struck the four corners of the house. It collapsed on the young people and they are dead, and I alone have escaped to tell you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_20","019_1_20","JOB","1","20","20","Then Job stood up, tore his robe, and shaved his head. He fell to the ground and worshiped, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_21","019_1_21","JOB","1","21","21","saying: “Naked I came from my mother’s womb, and naked I will return. The LORD gave, and the LORD has taken away. Blessed be the name of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB1_22","019_1_22","JOB","1","22","22","In all this, Job did not sin or charge God with wrongdoing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_1","019_2_1","JOB","2","1","1","On another day the sons of God came to present themselves before the LORD, and Satan also came with them to present himself before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_2","019_2_2","JOB","2","2","2","“Where have you come from?” said the LORD to Satan. “From roaming through the earth,” he replied, “and walking back and forth in it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_3","019_2_3","JOB","2","3","3","Then the LORD said to Satan, “Have you considered My servant Job? For there is no one on earth like him, a man who is blameless and upright, who fears God and shuns evil. He still retains his integrity, even though you incited Me against him to ruin him without cause.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_4","019_2_4","JOB","2","4","4","“Skin for skin!” Satan replied. “A man will give up all he owns in exchange for his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_5","019_2_5","JOB","2","5","5","But stretch out Your hand and strike his flesh and bones, and he will surely curse You to Your face.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_6","019_2_6","JOB","2","6","6","“Very well,” said the LORD to Satan. “He is in your hands, but you must spare his life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_7","019_2_7","JOB","2","7","7","So Satan went out from the presence of the LORD and infected Job with terrible boils from the soles of his feet to the crown of his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_8","019_2_8","JOB","2","8","8","And Job took a piece of broken pottery to scrape himself as he sat among the ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_9","019_2_9","JOB","2","9","9","Then Job’s wife said to him, “Do you still retain your integrity? Curse God and die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_10","019_2_10","JOB","2","10","10","“You speak as a foolish woman speaks,” he told her. “Should we accept from God only good and not adversity?” In all this, Job did not sin in what he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_11","019_2_11","JOB","2","11","11","Now when Job’s three friends—Eliphaz the Temanite, Bildad the Shuhite, and Zophar the Naamathite—heard about all this adversity that had come upon him, each of them came from his home, and they met together to go and sympathize with Job and comfort him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_12","019_2_12","JOB","2","12","12","When they lifted up their eyes from afar, they could barely recognize Job. They began to weep aloud, and each man tore his robe and threw dust in the air over his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB2_13","019_2_13","JOB","2","13","13","Then they sat on the ground with him for seven days and seven nights, but no one spoke a word to him because they saw how intense his suffering was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_1","019_3_1","JOB","3","1","1","After this, Job opened his mouth and cursed the day of his birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_2","019_3_2","JOB","3","2","2","And this is what he said: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_3","019_3_3","JOB","3","3","3","“May the day of my birth perish, and the night it was said, ‘A boy is conceived.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_4","019_3_4","JOB","3","4","4","If only that day had turned to darkness! May God above disregard it; may no light shine upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_5","019_3_5","JOB","3","5","5","May darkness and gloom reclaim it, and a cloud settle over it; may the blackness of the day overwhelm it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_6","019_3_6","JOB","3","6","6","If only darkness had taken that night away! May it not appear among the days of the year; may it never be entered in any of the months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_7","019_3_7","JOB","3","7","7","Behold, may that night be barren; may no joyful voice come into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_8","019_3_8","JOB","3","8","8","May it be cursed by those who curse the day—those prepared to rouse Leviathan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_9","019_3_9","JOB","3","9","9","May its morning stars grow dark; may it wait in vain for daylight; may it not see the breaking of dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_10","019_3_10","JOB","3","10","10","For that night did not shut the doors of the womb to hide the sorrow from my eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_11","019_3_11","JOB","3","11","11","Why did I not perish at birth; why did I not die as I came from the womb? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_12","019_3_12","JOB","3","12","12","Why were there knees to receive me, and breasts that I should be nursed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_13","019_3_13","JOB","3","13","13","For now I would be lying down in peace; I would be asleep and at rest ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_14","019_3_14","JOB","3","14","14","with kings and counselors of the earth, who built for themselves cities now in ruins, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_15","019_3_15","JOB","3","15","15","or with princes who had gold, who filled their houses with silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_16","019_3_16","JOB","3","16","16","Or why was I not hidden like a stillborn child, like an infant who never sees daylight? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_17","019_3_17","JOB","3","17","17","There the wicked cease from raging, and there the weary find rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_18","019_3_18","JOB","3","18","18","The captives enjoy their ease; they do not hear the voice of the oppressor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_19","019_3_19","JOB","3","19","19","Both small and great are there, and the slave is freed from his master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_20","019_3_20","JOB","3","20","20","Why is light given to the miserable, and life to the bitter of soul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_21","019_3_21","JOB","3","21","21","who long for death that does not come, and search for it like hidden treasure, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_22","019_3_22","JOB","3","22","22","who rejoice and greatly exult when they reach the grave? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_23","019_3_23","JOB","3","23","23","Why is life given to a man whose way is hidden, whom God has hedged in? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_24","019_3_24","JOB","3","24","24","I sigh when food is put before me, and my groans pour out like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_25","019_3_25","JOB","3","25","25","For the thing I feared has overtaken me, and what I dreaded has befallen me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB3_26","019_3_26","JOB","3","26","26","I am not at ease or quiet; I have no rest, for trouble has come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_1","019_4_1","JOB","4","1","1","Then Eliphaz the Temanite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_2","019_4_2","JOB","4","2","2","“If one ventures a word with you, will you be wearied? Yet who can keep from speaking? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_3","019_4_3","JOB","4","3","3","Surely you have instructed many, and have strengthened their feeble hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_4","019_4_4","JOB","4","4","4","Your words have steadied those who stumbled; you have braced the knees that were buckling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_5","019_4_5","JOB","4","5","5","But now trouble has come upon you, and you are weary. It strikes you, and you are dismayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_6","019_4_6","JOB","4","6","6","Is your reverence not your confidence, and the uprightness of your ways your hope? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_7","019_4_7","JOB","4","7","7","Consider now, I plead: Who, being innocent, has ever perished? Or where have the upright been destroyed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_8","019_4_8","JOB","4","8","8","As I have observed, those who plow iniquity and those who sow trouble reap the same. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_9","019_4_9","JOB","4","9","9","By the breath of God they perish, and by the blast of His anger they are consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_10","019_4_10","JOB","4","10","10","The lion may roar, and the fierce lion may growl, yet the teeth of the young lions are broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_11","019_4_11","JOB","4","11","11","The old lion perishes for lack of prey, and the cubs of the lioness are scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_12","019_4_12","JOB","4","12","12","Now a word came to me secretly; my ears caught a whisper of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_13","019_4_13","JOB","4","13","13","In disquieting visions in the night, when deep sleep falls on men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_14","019_4_14","JOB","4","14","14","fear and trembling came over me and made all my bones shudder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_15","019_4_15","JOB","4","15","15","Then a spirit glided past my face, and the hair on my body bristled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_16","019_4_16","JOB","4","16","16","It stood still, but I could not discern its appearance; a form loomed before my eyes, and I heard a whispering voice: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_17","019_4_17","JOB","4","17","17","‘Can a mortal be more righteous than God, or a man more pure than his Maker? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_18","019_4_18","JOB","4","18","18","If God puts no trust in His servants, and He charges His angels with error, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_19","019_4_19","JOB","4","19","19","how much more those who dwell in houses of clay, whose foundations are in the dust, who can be crushed like a moth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_20","019_4_20","JOB","4","20","20","They are smashed to pieces from dawn to dusk; unnoticed, they perish forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB4_21","019_4_21","JOB","4","21","21","Are not their tent cords pulled up, so that they die without wisdom?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_1","019_5_1","JOB","5","1","1","“Call out if you please, but who will answer? To which of the holy ones will you turn? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_2","019_5_2","JOB","5","2","2","For resentment kills a fool, and envy slays the simple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_3","019_5_3","JOB","5","3","3","I have seen a fool taking root, but suddenly his house was cursed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_4","019_5_4","JOB","5","4","4","His sons are far from safety, crushed in court without a defender. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_5","019_5_5","JOB","5","5","5","The hungry consume his harvest, taking it even from the thorns, and the thirsty pant after his wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_6","019_5_6","JOB","5","6","6","For distress does not spring from the dust, and trouble does not sprout from the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_7","019_5_7","JOB","5","7","7","Yet man is born to trouble as surely as sparks fly upward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_8","019_5_8","JOB","5","8","8","However, if I were you, I would appeal to God and lay my cause before Him— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_9","019_5_9","JOB","5","9","9","the One who does great and unsearchable things, wonders without number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_10","019_5_10","JOB","5","10","10","He gives rain to the earth and sends water upon the fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_11","019_5_11","JOB","5","11","11","He sets the lowly on high, so that mourners are lifted to safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_12","019_5_12","JOB","5","12","12","He thwarts the schemes of the crafty, so that their hands find no success. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_13","019_5_13","JOB","5","13","13","He catches the wise in their craftiness, and sweeps away the plans of the cunning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_14","019_5_14","JOB","5","14","14","They encounter darkness by day and grope at noon as in the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_15","019_5_15","JOB","5","15","15","He saves the needy from the sword in their mouth and from the clutches of the powerful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_16","019_5_16","JOB","5","16","16","So the poor have hope, and injustice shuts its mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_17","019_5_17","JOB","5","17","17","Blessed indeed is the man whom God corrects; so do not despise the discipline of the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_18","019_5_18","JOB","5","18","18","For He wounds, but He also binds; He strikes, but His hands also heal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_19","019_5_19","JOB","5","19","19","He will rescue you from six calamities; no harm will touch you in seven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_20","019_5_20","JOB","5","20","20","In famine He will redeem you from death, and in battle from the stroke of the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_21","019_5_21","JOB","5","21","21","You will be hidden from the scourge of the tongue, and will not fear havoc when it comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_22","019_5_22","JOB","5","22","22","You will laugh at destruction and famine, and need not fear the beasts of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_23","019_5_23","JOB","5","23","23","For you will have a covenant with the stones of the field, and the wild animals will be at peace with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_24","019_5_24","JOB","5","24","24","You will know that your tent is secure, and find nothing amiss when inspecting your home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_25","019_5_25","JOB","5","25","25","You will know that your offspring will be many, your descendants like the grass of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_26","019_5_26","JOB","5","26","26","You will come to the grave in full vigor, like a sheaf of grain gathered in season. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB5_27","019_5_27","JOB","5","27","27","Indeed, we have investigated, and it is true! So hear it and know for yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_1","019_6_1","JOB","6","1","1","Then Job replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_2","019_6_2","JOB","6","2","2","“If only my grief could be weighed and placed with my calamity on the scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_3","019_6_3","JOB","6","3","3","For then it would outweigh the sand of the seas—no wonder my words have been rash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_4","019_6_4","JOB","6","4","4","For the arrows of the Almighty have pierced me; my spirit drinks in their poison; the terrors of God are arrayed against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_5","019_6_5","JOB","6","5","5","Does a wild donkey bray over fresh grass, or an ox low over its fodder? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_6","019_6_6","JOB","6","6","6","Is tasteless food eaten without salt, or is there flavor in the white of an egg? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_7","019_6_7","JOB","6","7","7","My soul refuses to touch them; they are loathsome food to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_8","019_6_8","JOB","6","8","8","If only my request were granted and God would fulfill my hope: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_9","019_6_9","JOB","6","9","9","that God would be willing to crush me, to unleash His hand and cut me off! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_10","019_6_10","JOB","6","10","10","It still brings me comfort, and joy through unrelenting pain, that I have not denied the words of the Holy One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_11","019_6_11","JOB","6","11","11","What strength do I have, that I should still hope? What is my future, that I should be patient? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_12","019_6_12","JOB","6","12","12","Is my strength like that of stone, or my flesh made of bronze? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_13","019_6_13","JOB","6","13","13","Is there any help within me now that success is driven from me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_14","019_6_14","JOB","6","14","14","A despairing man should have the kindness of his friend, even if he forsakes the fear of the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_15","019_6_15","JOB","6","15","15","But my brothers are as faithless as wadis, as seasonal streams that overflow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_16","019_6_16","JOB","6","16","16","darkened because of the ice and the inflow of melting snow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_17","019_6_17","JOB","6","17","17","but ceasing in the dry season and vanishing from their channels in the heat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_18","019_6_18","JOB","6","18","18","Caravans turn aside from their routes; they go into the wasteland and perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_19","019_6_19","JOB","6","19","19","The caravans of Tema look for water; the travelers of Sheba hope to find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_20","019_6_20","JOB","6","20","20","They are confounded because they had hoped; their arrival brings disappointment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_21","019_6_21","JOB","6","21","21","For now you are of no help; you see terror, and you are afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_22","019_6_22","JOB","6","22","22","Have I ever said, ‘Give me something; offer me a bribe from your wealth; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_23","019_6_23","JOB","6","23","23","deliver me from the hand of the enemy; redeem me from the grasp of the ruthless’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_24","019_6_24","JOB","6","24","24","Teach me, and I will be silent. Help me understand how I have erred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_25","019_6_25","JOB","6","25","25","How painful are honest words! But what does your argument prove? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_26","019_6_26","JOB","6","26","26","Do you intend to correct my words, and treat as wind my cry of despair? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_27","019_6_27","JOB","6","27","27","You would even cast lots for an orphan and barter away your friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_28","019_6_28","JOB","6","28","28","But now, please look at me. Would I lie to your face? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_29","019_6_29","JOB","6","29","29","Reconsider; do not be unjust. Reconsider, for my righteousness is at stake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB6_30","019_6_30","JOB","6","30","30","Is there iniquity on my tongue? Can my mouth not discern malice? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_1","019_7_1","JOB","7","1","1","“Is not man consigned to labor on earth? Are not his days like those of a hired hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_2","019_7_2","JOB","7","2","2","Like a slave he longs for shade; like a hireling he waits for his wages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_3","019_7_3","JOB","7","3","3","So I am allotted months of futility, and nights of misery are appointed to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_4","019_7_4","JOB","7","4","4","When I lie down I think: ‘When will I get up?’ But the night drags on, and I toss and turn until dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_5","019_7_5","JOB","7","5","5","My flesh is clothed with worms and encrusted with dirt; my skin is cracked and festering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_6","019_7_6","JOB","7","6","6","My days are swifter than a weaver’s shuttle; they come to an end without hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_7","019_7_7","JOB","7","7","7","Remember that my life is but a breath. My eyes will never again see happiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_8","019_7_8","JOB","7","8","8","The eye that beholds me will no longer see me. You will look for me, but I will be no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_9","019_7_9","JOB","7","9","9","As a cloud vanishes and is gone, so he who goes down to Sheol does not come back up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_10","019_7_10","JOB","7","10","10","He never returns to his house; his place remembers him no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_11","019_7_11","JOB","7","11","11","Therefore I will not restrain my mouth; I will speak in the anguish of my spirit; I will complain in the bitterness of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_12","019_7_12","JOB","7","12","12","Am I the sea, or the monster of the deep, that You must keep me under guard? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_13","019_7_13","JOB","7","13","13","When I think my bed will comfort me and my couch will ease my complaint, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_14","019_7_14","JOB","7","14","14","then You frighten me with dreams and terrify me with visions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_15","019_7_15","JOB","7","15","15","so that I would prefer strangling and death over my life in this body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_16","019_7_16","JOB","7","16","16","I loathe my life! I would not live forever. Leave me alone, for my days are but a breath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_17","019_7_17","JOB","7","17","17","What is man that You should exalt him, that You should set Your heart upon him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_18","019_7_18","JOB","7","18","18","that You attend to him every morning, and test him every moment? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_19","019_7_19","JOB","7","19","19","Will You never look away from me, or leave me alone to swallow my spittle? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_20","019_7_20","JOB","7","20","20","If I have sinned, what have I done to You, O watcher of mankind? Why have You made me Your target, so that I am a burden to You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB7_21","019_7_21","JOB","7","21","21","Why do You not pardon my transgression and take away my iniquity? For soon I will lie down in the dust; You will seek me, but I will be no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_1","019_8_1","JOB","8","1","1","Then Bildad the Shuhite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_2","019_8_2","JOB","8","2","2","“How long will you go on saying such things? The words of your mouth are a blustering wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_3","019_8_3","JOB","8","3","3","Does God pervert justice? Does the Almighty pervert what is right? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_4","019_8_4","JOB","8","4","4","When your children sinned against Him, He gave them over to their rebellion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_5","019_8_5","JOB","8","5","5","But if you would earnestly seek God and ask the Almighty for mercy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_6","019_8_6","JOB","8","6","6","if you are pure and upright, even now He will rouse Himself on your behalf and restore your righteous estate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_7","019_8_7","JOB","8","7","7","Though your beginnings were modest, your latter days will flourish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_8","019_8_8","JOB","8","8","8","Please inquire of past generations and consider the discoveries of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_9","019_8_9","JOB","8","9","9","For we were born yesterday and know nothing; our days on earth are but a shadow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_10","019_8_10","JOB","8","10","10","Will they not teach you and tell you, and speak from their understanding? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_11","019_8_11","JOB","8","11","11","Does papyrus grow where there is no marsh? Do reeds flourish without water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_12","019_8_12","JOB","8","12","12","While the shoots are still uncut, they dry up more quickly than grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_13","019_8_13","JOB","8","13","13","Such is the destiny of all who forget God; so the hope of the godless will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_14","019_8_14","JOB","8","14","14","His confidence is fragile; his security is in a spider’s web. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_15","019_8_15","JOB","8","15","15","He leans on his web, but it gives way; he holds fast, but it does not endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_16","019_8_16","JOB","8","16","16","He is a well-watered plant in the sunshine, spreading its shoots over the garden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_17","019_8_17","JOB","8","17","17","His roots wrap around the rock heap; he looks for a home among the stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_18","019_8_18","JOB","8","18","18","If he is uprooted from his place, it will disown him, saying, ‘I never saw you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_19","019_8_19","JOB","8","19","19","Surely this is the joy of his way; yet others will spring from the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_20","019_8_20","JOB","8","20","20","Behold, God does not reject the blameless, nor will He strengthen the hand of evildoers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_21","019_8_21","JOB","8","21","21","He will yet fill your mouth with laughter, and your lips with a shout of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB8_22","019_8_22","JOB","8","22","22","Your enemies will be clothed in shame, and the tent of the wicked will be no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_1","019_9_1","JOB","9","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_2","019_9_2","JOB","9","2","2","“Yes, I know that it is so, but how can a mortal be righteous before God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_3","019_9_3","JOB","9","3","3","If one wished to contend with God, he could not answer Him one time out of a thousand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_4","019_9_4","JOB","9","4","4","God is wise in heart and mighty in strength. Who has resisted Him and prospered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_5","019_9_5","JOB","9","5","5","He moves mountains without their knowledge and overturns them in His anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_6","019_9_6","JOB","9","6","6","He shakes the earth from its place, so that its foundations tremble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_7","019_9_7","JOB","9","7","7","He commands the sun not to shine; He seals off the stars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_8","019_9_8","JOB","9","8","8","He alone stretches out the heavens and treads on the waves of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_9","019_9_9","JOB","9","9","9","He is the Maker of the Bear and Orion, of the Pleiades and the constellations of the south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_10","019_9_10","JOB","9","10","10","He does great things beyond searching out, and wonders without number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_11","019_9_11","JOB","9","11","11","Were He to pass by me, I would not see Him; were He to move, I would not recognize Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_12","019_9_12","JOB","9","12","12","If He takes away, who can stop Him? Who dares to ask Him, ‘What are You doing?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_13","019_9_13","JOB","9","13","13","God does not restrain His anger; the helpers of Rahab cower beneath Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_14","019_9_14","JOB","9","14","14","How then can I answer Him or choose my arguments against Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_15","019_9_15","JOB","9","15","15","For even if I were right, I could not answer. I could only beg my Judge for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_16","019_9_16","JOB","9","16","16","If I summoned Him and He answered me, I do not believe He would listen to my voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_17","019_9_17","JOB","9","17","17","For He would crush me with a tempest and multiply my wounds without cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_18","019_9_18","JOB","9","18","18","He does not let me catch my breath, but overwhelms me with bitterness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_19","019_9_19","JOB","9","19","19","If it is a matter of strength, He is indeed mighty! If it is a matter of justice, who can summon Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_20","019_9_20","JOB","9","20","20","Even if I were righteous, my mouth would condemn me; if I were blameless, it would declare me guilty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_21","019_9_21","JOB","9","21","21","Though I am blameless, I have no concern for myself; I despise my own life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_22","019_9_22","JOB","9","22","22","It is all the same, and so I say, ‘He destroys both the blameless and the wicked.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_23","019_9_23","JOB","9","23","23","When the scourge brings sudden death, He mocks the despair of the innocent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_24","019_9_24","JOB","9","24","24","The earth is given into the hand of the wicked; He blindfolds its judges. If it is not He, then who is it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_25","019_9_25","JOB","9","25","25","My days are swifter than a runner; they flee without seeing good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_26","019_9_26","JOB","9","26","26","They sweep by like boats of papyrus, like an eagle swooping down on its prey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_27","019_9_27","JOB","9","27","27","If I were to say, ‘I will forget my complaint and change my expression and smile,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_28","019_9_28","JOB","9","28","28","I would still dread all my sufferings; I know that You will not acquit me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_29","019_9_29","JOB","9","29","29","Since I am already found guilty, why should I labor in vain? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_30","019_9_30","JOB","9","30","30","If I should wash myself with snow and cleanse my hands with lye, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_31","019_9_31","JOB","9","31","31","then You would plunge me into the pit, and even my own clothes would despise me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_32","019_9_32","JOB","9","32","32","For He is not a man like me, that I can answer Him, that we can take each other to court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_33","019_9_33","JOB","9","33","33","Nor is there a mediator between us, to lay his hand upon us both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_34","019_9_34","JOB","9","34","34","Let Him remove His rod from me, so that His terror will no longer frighten me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB9_35","019_9_35","JOB","9","35","35","Then I would speak without fear of Him. But as it is, I am on my own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_1","019_10_1","JOB","10","1","1","“I loathe my own life; I will express my complaint and speak in the bitterness of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_2","019_10_2","JOB","10","2","2","I will say to God: Do not condemn me! Let me know why You prosecute me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_3","019_10_3","JOB","10","3","3","Does it please You to oppress me, to reject the work of Your hands and favor the schemes of the wicked? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_4","019_10_4","JOB","10","4","4","Do You have eyes of flesh? Do You see as man sees? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_5","019_10_5","JOB","10","5","5","Are Your days like those of a mortal, or Your years like those of a man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_6","019_10_6","JOB","10","6","6","that You should seek my iniquity and search out my sin— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_7","019_10_7","JOB","10","7","7","though You know that I am not guilty, and there is no deliverance from Your hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_8","019_10_8","JOB","10","8","8","Your hands shaped me and altogether formed me. Would You now turn and destroy me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_9","019_10_9","JOB","10","9","9","Please remember that You molded me like clay. Would You now return me to dust? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_10","019_10_10","JOB","10","10","10","Did You not pour me out like milk, and curdle me like cheese? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_11","019_10_11","JOB","10","11","11","You clothed me with skin and flesh, and knit me together with bones and sinews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_12","019_10_12","JOB","10","12","12","You have granted me life and loving devotion, and Your care has preserved my spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_13","019_10_13","JOB","10","13","13","Yet You concealed these things in Your heart, and I know that this was in Your mind: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_14","019_10_14","JOB","10","14","14","If I sinned, You would take note, and would not acquit me of my iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_15","019_10_15","JOB","10","15","15","If I am guilty, woe to me! And even if I am righteous, I cannot lift my head. I am full of shame and aware of my affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_16","019_10_16","JOB","10","16","16","Should I hold my head high, You would hunt me like a lion, and again display Your power against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_17","019_10_17","JOB","10","17","17","You produce new witnesses against me and multiply Your anger toward me. Hardships assault me in wave after wave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_18","019_10_18","JOB","10","18","18","Why then did You bring me from the womb? Oh, that I had died, and no eye had seen me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_19","019_10_19","JOB","10","19","19","If only I had never come to be, but had been carried from the womb to the grave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_20","019_10_20","JOB","10","20","20","Are my days not few? Withdraw from me, that I may have a little comfort, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_21","019_10_21","JOB","10","21","21","before I go—never to return—to a land of darkness and gloom, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB10_22","019_10_22","JOB","10","22","22","to a land of utter darkness, of deep shadow and disorder, where even the light is like darkness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_1","019_11_1","JOB","11","1","1","Then Zophar the Naamathite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_2","019_11_2","JOB","11","2","2","“Should this stream of words go unanswered and such a speaker be vindicated? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_3","019_11_3","JOB","11","3","3","Should your babbling put others to silence? Will you scoff without rebuke? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_4","019_11_4","JOB","11","4","4","You have said, ‘My doctrine is sound, and I am pure in Your sight.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_5","019_11_5","JOB","11","5","5","But if only God would speak and open His lips against you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_6","019_11_6","JOB","11","6","6","and disclose to you the secrets of wisdom, for true wisdom has two sides. Know then that God exacts from you less than your iniquity deserves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_7","019_11_7","JOB","11","7","7","Can you fathom the deep things of God or discover the limits of the Almighty? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_8","019_11_8","JOB","11","8","8","They are higher than the heavens—what can you do? They are deeper than Sheol—what can you know? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_9","019_11_9","JOB","11","9","9","Their measure is longer than the earth and wider than the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_10","019_11_10","JOB","11","10","10","If He comes along to imprison you, or convenes a court, who can stop Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_11","019_11_11","JOB","11","11","11","Surely He knows the deceit of men. If He sees iniquity, does He not take note? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_12","019_11_12","JOB","11","12","12","But a witless man can no more become wise than the colt of a wild donkey can be born a man! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_13","019_11_13","JOB","11","13","13","As for you, if you direct your heart and lift up your hands to Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_14","019_11_14","JOB","11","14","14","if you put away the iniquity in your hand, and allow no injustice to dwell in your tents, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_15","019_11_15","JOB","11","15","15","then indeed you will lift up your face without blemish; you will stand firm and unafraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_16","019_11_16","JOB","11","16","16","For you will forget your misery, recalling it only as waters gone by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_17","019_11_17","JOB","11","17","17","Your life will be brighter than noonday; its darkness will be like the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_18","019_11_18","JOB","11","18","18","You will be secure, because there is hope, and you will look around and lie down in safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_19","019_11_19","JOB","11","19","19","You will lie down without fear, and many will court your favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB11_20","019_11_20","JOB","11","20","20","But the eyes of the wicked will fail, and escape will elude them; they will hope for their last breath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_1","019_12_1","JOB","12","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_2","019_12_2","JOB","12","2","2","“Truly then you are the people with whom wisdom itself will die! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_3","019_12_3","JOB","12","3","3","But I also have a mind; I am not inferior to you. Who does not know such things as these? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_4","019_12_4","JOB","12","4","4","I am a laughingstock to my friends, though I called on God, and He answered. The righteous and upright man is a laughingstock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_5","019_12_5","JOB","12","5","5","The one at ease scorns misfortune as the fate of those whose feet are slipping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_6","019_12_6","JOB","12","6","6","The tents of robbers are safe, and those who provoke God are secure—those who carry their god in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_7","019_12_7","JOB","12","7","7","But ask the animals, and they will instruct you; ask the birds of the air, and they will tell you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_8","019_12_8","JOB","12","8","8","Or speak to the earth, and it will teach you; let the fish of the sea inform you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_9","019_12_9","JOB","12","9","9","Which of all these does not know that the hand of the LORD has done this? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_10","019_12_10","JOB","12","10","10","The life of every living thing is in His hand, as well as the breath of all mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_11","019_12_11","JOB","12","11","11","Does not the ear test words as the tongue tastes its food? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_12","019_12_12","JOB","12","12","12","Wisdom is found with the elderly, and understanding comes with long life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_13","019_12_13","JOB","12","13","13","Wisdom and strength belong to God; counsel and understanding are His. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_14","019_12_14","JOB","12","14","14","What He tears down cannot be rebuilt; the man He imprisons cannot be released. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_15","019_12_15","JOB","12","15","15","If He holds back the waters, they dry up, and if He releases them, they overwhelm the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_16","019_12_16","JOB","12","16","16","True wisdom and power belong to Him. The deceived and the deceiver are His. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_17","019_12_17","JOB","12","17","17","He leads counselors away barefoot and makes fools of judges. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_18","019_12_18","JOB","12","18","18","He loosens the bonds placed by kings and fastens a belt around their waists. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_19","019_12_19","JOB","12","19","19","He leads priests away barefoot and overthrows the established. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_20","019_12_20","JOB","12","20","20","He deprives the trusted of speech and takes away the discernment of elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_21","019_12_21","JOB","12","21","21","He pours out contempt on nobles and disarms the mighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_22","019_12_22","JOB","12","22","22","He reveals the deep things of darkness and brings deep shadows into light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_23","019_12_23","JOB","12","23","23","He makes nations great and destroys them; He enlarges nations, then disperses them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_24","019_12_24","JOB","12","24","24","He deprives the earth’s leaders of reason and makes them wander in a trackless wasteland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB12_25","019_12_25","JOB","12","25","25","They grope in the darkness without light; He makes them stagger like drunkards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_1","019_13_1","JOB","13","1","1","“Indeed, my eyes have seen all this; my ears have heard and understood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_2","019_13_2","JOB","13","2","2","What you know, I also know; I am not inferior to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_3","019_13_3","JOB","13","3","3","Yet I desire to speak to the Almighty and argue my case before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_4","019_13_4","JOB","13","4","4","You, however, smear with lies; you are all worthless physicians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_5","019_13_5","JOB","13","5","5","If only you would remain silent; for that would be your wisdom! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_6","019_13_6","JOB","13","6","6","Hear now my argument, and listen to the plea of my lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_7","019_13_7","JOB","13","7","7","Will you speak wickedly on God’s behalf or speak deceitfully for Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_8","019_13_8","JOB","13","8","8","Would you show Him partiality or argue in His defense? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_9","019_13_9","JOB","13","9","9","Would it be well when He examined you? Could you deceive Him as you would deceive a man? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_10","019_13_10","JOB","13","10","10","Surely He would rebuke you if you secretly showed partiality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_11","019_13_11","JOB","13","11","11","Would His majesty not terrify you? Would the dread of Him not fall upon you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_12","019_13_12","JOB","13","12","12","Your maxims are proverbs of ashes; your defenses are defenses of clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_13","019_13_13","JOB","13","13","13","Be silent, and I will speak. Then let come to me what may. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_14","019_13_14","JOB","13","14","14","Why do I put myself at risk and take my life in my own hands? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_15","019_13_15","JOB","13","15","15","Though He slay me, I will hope in Him. I will still defend my ways to His face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_16","019_13_16","JOB","13","16","16","Moreover, this will be my salvation, for no godless man can appear before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_17","019_13_17","JOB","13","17","17","Listen carefully to my words; let my declaration ring in your ears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_18","019_13_18","JOB","13","18","18","See now, I have prepared my case; I know that I will be vindicated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_19","019_13_19","JOB","13","19","19","Can anyone indict me? If so, I will be silent and die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_20","019_13_20","JOB","13","20","20","Only grant these two things to me, so that I need not hide from You: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_21","019_13_21","JOB","13","21","21","Withdraw Your hand from me, and do not let Your terror frighten me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_22","019_13_22","JOB","13","22","22","Then call me, and I will answer, or let me speak, and You can reply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_23","019_13_23","JOB","13","23","23","How many are my iniquities and sins? Reveal to me my transgression and sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_24","019_13_24","JOB","13","24","24","Why do You hide Your face and consider me as Your enemy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_25","019_13_25","JOB","13","25","25","Would You frighten a windblown leaf? Would You chase after dry chaff? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_26","019_13_26","JOB","13","26","26","For You record bitter accusations against me and bequeath to me the iniquities of my youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_27","019_13_27","JOB","13","27","27","You put my feet in the stocks and stand watch over all my paths; You set a limit for the soles of my feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB13_28","019_13_28","JOB","13","28","28","So man wastes away like something rotten, like a moth-eaten garment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_1","019_14_1","JOB","14","1","1","“Man, who is born of woman, is short of days and full of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_2","019_14_2","JOB","14","2","2","Like a flower, he comes forth, then withers away; like a fleeting shadow, he does not endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_3","019_14_3","JOB","14","3","3","Do You open Your eyes to one like this? Will You bring him into judgment before You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_4","019_14_4","JOB","14","4","4","Who can bring out clean from unclean? No one! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_5","019_14_5","JOB","14","5","5","Since his days are determined and the number of his months is with You, and since You have set limits that he cannot exceed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_6","019_14_6","JOB","14","6","6","look away from him and let him rest, so he can enjoy his day as a hired hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_7","019_14_7","JOB","14","7","7","For there is hope for a tree: If it is cut down, it will sprout again, and its tender shoots will not fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_8","019_14_8","JOB","14","8","8","If its roots grow old in the ground and its stump dies in the soil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_9","019_14_9","JOB","14","9","9","at the scent of water it will bud and put forth twigs like a sapling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_10","019_14_10","JOB","14","10","10","But a man dies and is laid low; he breathes his last, and where is he? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_11","019_14_11","JOB","14","11","11","As water disappears from the sea and a river becomes parched and dry, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_12","019_14_12","JOB","14","12","12","so a man lies down and does not rise. Until the heavens are no more, he will not be awakened or roused from sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_13","019_14_13","JOB","14","13","13","If only You would hide me in Sheol and conceal me until Your anger has passed! If only You would appoint a time for me and then remember me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_14","019_14_14","JOB","14","14","14","When a man dies, will he live again? All the days of my hard service I will wait, until my renewal comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_15","019_14_15","JOB","14","15","15","You will call, and I will answer; You will desire the work of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_16","019_14_16","JOB","14","16","16","For then You would count my steps, but would not keep track of my sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_17","019_14_17","JOB","14","17","17","My transgression would be sealed in a bag, and You would cover over my iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_18","019_14_18","JOB","14","18","18","But as a mountain erodes and crumbles and a rock is dislodged from its place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_19","019_14_19","JOB","14","19","19","as water wears away the stones and torrents wash away the soil, so You destroy a man’s hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_20","019_14_20","JOB","14","20","20","You forever overpower him, and he passes on; You change his countenance and send him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_21","019_14_21","JOB","14","21","21","If his sons receive honor, he does not know it; if they are brought low, he is unaware. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB14_22","019_14_22","JOB","14","22","22","He feels only the pain of his own body and mourns only for himself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_1","019_15_1","JOB","15","1","1","Then Eliphaz the Temanite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_2","019_15_2","JOB","15","2","2","“Does a wise man answer with empty counsel or fill his belly with the hot east wind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_3","019_15_3","JOB","15","3","3","Should he argue with useless words or speeches that serve no purpose? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_4","019_15_4","JOB","15","4","4","But you even undermine the fear of God and hinder meditation before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_5","019_15_5","JOB","15","5","5","For your iniquity instructs your mouth, and you choose the language of the crafty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_6","019_15_6","JOB","15","6","6","Your own mouth, not mine, condemns you; your own lips testify against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_7","019_15_7","JOB","15","7","7","Were you the first man ever born? Were you brought forth before the hills? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_8","019_15_8","JOB","15","8","8","Do you listen in on the council of God or limit wisdom to yourself? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_9","019_15_9","JOB","15","9","9","What do you know that we do not? What do you understand that is not clear to us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_10","019_15_10","JOB","15","10","10","Both the gray-haired and the aged are on our side—men much older than your father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_11","019_15_11","JOB","15","11","11","Are the consolations of God not enough for you, even words spoken gently to you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_12","019_15_12","JOB","15","12","12","Why has your heart carried you away, and why do your eyes flash, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_13","019_15_13","JOB","15","13","13","so that you turn your spirit against God and pour such words from your mouth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_14","019_15_14","JOB","15","14","14","What is man, that he should be pure, or one born of woman, that he should be righteous? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_15","019_15_15","JOB","15","15","15","If God puts no trust in His holy ones, if even the heavens are not pure in His eyes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_16","019_15_16","JOB","15","16","16","how much less man, who is vile and corrupt, who drinks injustice like water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_17","019_15_17","JOB","15","17","17","Listen to me and I will inform you. I will describe what I have seen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_18","019_15_18","JOB","15","18","18","what was declared by wise men and was not concealed from their fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_19","019_15_19","JOB","15","19","19","to whom alone the land was given when no foreigner passed among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_20","019_15_20","JOB","15","20","20","A wicked man writhes in pain all his days; only a few years are reserved for the ruthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_21","019_15_21","JOB","15","21","21","Sounds of terror fill his ears; in his prosperity the destroyer attacks him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_22","019_15_22","JOB","15","22","22","He despairs of his return from darkness; he is marked for the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_23","019_15_23","JOB","15","23","23","He wanders about as food for vultures; he knows the day of darkness is at hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_24","019_15_24","JOB","15","24","24","Distress and anguish terrify him, overwhelming him like a king poised to attack. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_25","019_15_25","JOB","15","25","25","For he has stretched out his hand against God and has vaunted himself against the Almighty, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_26","019_15_26","JOB","15","26","26","rushing headlong at Him with a thick, studded shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_27","019_15_27","JOB","15","27","27","Though his face is covered with fat and his waistline bulges with flesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_28","019_15_28","JOB","15","28","28","he will dwell in ruined cities, in abandoned houses destined to become rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_29","019_15_29","JOB","15","29","29","He will no longer be rich; his wealth will not endure. His possessions will not overspread the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_30","019_15_30","JOB","15","30","30","He will not escape from the darkness; the flame will wither his shoots, and the breath of God’s mouth will carry him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_31","019_15_31","JOB","15","31","31","Let him not deceive himself with trust in emptiness, for emptiness will be his reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_32","019_15_32","JOB","15","32","32","It will be paid in full before his time, and his branch will not flourish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_33","019_15_33","JOB","15","33","33","He will be like a vine stripped of its unripe grapes, like an olive tree that sheds its blossoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_34","019_15_34","JOB","15","34","34","For the company of the godless will be barren, and fire will consume the tents of bribery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB15_35","019_15_35","JOB","15","35","35","They conceive trouble and give birth to evil; their womb is pregnant with deceit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_1","019_16_1","JOB","16","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_2","019_16_2","JOB","16","2","2","“I have heard many things like these; miserable comforters are you all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_3","019_16_3","JOB","16","3","3","Is there no end to your long-winded speeches? What provokes you to continue testifying? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_4","019_16_4","JOB","16","4","4","I could also speak like you if you were in my place; I could heap up words against you and shake my head at you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_5","019_16_5","JOB","16","5","5","But I would encourage you with my mouth, and the consolation of my lips would bring relief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_6","019_16_6","JOB","16","6","6","Even if I speak, my pain is not relieved, and if I hold back, how will it go away? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_7","019_16_7","JOB","16","7","7","Surely He has now exhausted me; You have devastated all my family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_8","019_16_8","JOB","16","8","8","You have bound me, and it has become a witness; my frailty rises up and testifies against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_9","019_16_9","JOB","16","9","9","His anger has torn me and opposed me; He gnashes His teeth at me. My adversary pierces me with His eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_10","019_16_10","JOB","16","10","10","They open their mouths against me and strike my cheeks with contempt; they join together against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_11","019_16_11","JOB","16","11","11","God has delivered me to unjust men; He has thrown me to the clutches of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_12","019_16_12","JOB","16","12","12","I was at ease, but He shattered me; He seized me by the neck and crushed me. He has set me up as His target; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_13","019_16_13","JOB","16","13","13","His archers surround me. He pierces my kidneys without mercy and spills my gall on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_14","019_16_14","JOB","16","14","14","He breaks me with wound upon wound; He rushes me like a mighty warrior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_15","019_16_15","JOB","16","15","15","I have sewn sackcloth over my skin; I have buried my horn in the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_16","019_16_16","JOB","16","16","16","My face is red with weeping, and deep shadows ring my eyes; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_17","019_16_17","JOB","16","17","17","yet my hands are free of violence and my prayer is pure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_18","019_16_18","JOB","16","18","18","O earth, do not cover my blood; may my cry for help never be laid to rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_19","019_16_19","JOB","16","19","19","Even now my witness is in heaven, and my advocate is on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_20","019_16_20","JOB","16","20","20","My friends are my scoffers as my eyes pour out tears to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_21","019_16_21","JOB","16","21","21","Oh, that a man might plead with God as he pleads with his neighbor! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB16_22","019_16_22","JOB","16","22","22","For when only a few years are past I will go the way of no return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_1","019_17_1","JOB","17","1","1","“My spirit is broken; my days are extinguished; the grave awaits me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_2","019_17_2","JOB","17","2","2","Surely mockers surround me, and my eyes must gaze at their rebellion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_3","019_17_3","JOB","17","3","3","Give me, I pray, the pledge You demand. Who else will be my guarantor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_4","019_17_4","JOB","17","4","4","You have closed their minds to understanding; therefore You will not exalt them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_5","019_17_5","JOB","17","5","5","If a man denounces his friends for a price, the eyes of his children will fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_6","019_17_6","JOB","17","6","6","He has made me a byword among the people, a man in whose face they spit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_7","019_17_7","JOB","17","7","7","My eyes have grown dim with grief, and my whole body is but a shadow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_8","019_17_8","JOB","17","8","8","The upright are appalled at this, and the innocent are stirred against the godless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_9","019_17_9","JOB","17","9","9","Yet a righteous one holds to his way, and the one with clean hands grows stronger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_10","019_17_10","JOB","17","10","10","But come back and try again, all of you. For I will not find a wise man among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_11","019_17_11","JOB","17","11","11","My days have passed; my plans are broken off—even the desires of my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_12","019_17_12","JOB","17","12","12","They have turned night into day, making light seem near in the face of darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_13","019_17_13","JOB","17","13","13","If I look for Sheol as my home, if I spread out my bed in darkness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_14","019_17_14","JOB","17","14","14","and say to corruption, ‘You are my father,’ and to the worm, ‘My mother,’ or ‘My sister,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_15","019_17_15","JOB","17","15","15","where then is my hope? Who can see any hope for me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB17_16","019_17_16","JOB","17","16","16","Will it go down to the gates of Sheol? Will we go down together into the dust?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_1","019_18_1","JOB","18","1","1","Then Bildad the Shuhite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_2","019_18_2","JOB","18","2","2","“How long until you end these speeches? Show some sense, and then we can talk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_3","019_18_3","JOB","18","3","3","Why are we regarded as cattle, as stupid in your sight? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_4","019_18_4","JOB","18","4","4","You who tear yourself in anger—should the earth be forsaken on your account, or the rocks be moved from their place? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_5","019_18_5","JOB","18","5","5","Indeed, the lamp of the wicked is extinguished; the flame of his fire does not glow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_6","019_18_6","JOB","18","6","6","The light in his tent grows dark, and the lamp beside him goes out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_7","019_18_7","JOB","18","7","7","His vigorous stride is shortened, and his own schemes trip him up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_8","019_18_8","JOB","18","8","8","For his own feet lead him into a net, and he wanders into its mesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_9","019_18_9","JOB","18","9","9","A trap seizes his heel; a snare grips him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_10","019_18_10","JOB","18","10","10","A noose is hidden in the ground, and a trap lies in his path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_11","019_18_11","JOB","18","11","11","Terrors frighten him on every side and harass his every step. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_12","019_18_12","JOB","18","12","12","His strength is depleted, and calamity is ready at his side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_13","019_18_13","JOB","18","13","13","It devours patches of his skin; the firstborn of death devours his limbs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_14","019_18_14","JOB","18","14","14","He is torn from the shelter of his tent and is marched off to the king of terrors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_15","019_18_15","JOB","18","15","15","Fire resides in his tent; burning sulfur rains down on his dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_16","019_18_16","JOB","18","16","16","The roots beneath him dry up, and the branches above him wither away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_17","019_18_17","JOB","18","17","17","The memory of him perishes from the earth, and he has no name in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_18","019_18_18","JOB","18","18","18","He is driven from light into darkness and is chased from the inhabited world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_19","019_18_19","JOB","18","19","19","He has no offspring or posterity among his people, no survivor where he once lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_20","019_18_20","JOB","18","20","20","Those in the west are appalled at his fate, while those in the east tremble in horror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB18_21","019_18_21","JOB","18","21","21","Surely such is the dwelling of the wicked and the place of one who does not know God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_1","019_19_1","JOB","19","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_2","019_19_2","JOB","19","2","2","“How long will you torment me and crush me with your words? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_3","019_19_3","JOB","19","3","3","Ten times now you have reproached me; you shamelessly mistreat me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_4","019_19_4","JOB","19","4","4","Even if I have truly gone astray, my error concerns me alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_5","019_19_5","JOB","19","5","5","If indeed you would exalt yourselves above me and use my disgrace against me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_6","019_19_6","JOB","19","6","6","then understand that it is God who has wronged me and drawn His net around me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_7","019_19_7","JOB","19","7","7","Though I cry out, ‘Violence!’ I get no response; though I call for help, there is no justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_8","019_19_8","JOB","19","8","8","He has blocked my way so I cannot pass; He has veiled my paths with darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_9","019_19_9","JOB","19","9","9","He has stripped me of my honor and removed the crown from my head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_10","019_19_10","JOB","19","10","10","He tears me down on every side until I am gone; He uproots my hope like a tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_11","019_19_11","JOB","19","11","11","His anger burns against me, and He counts me among His enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_12","019_19_12","JOB","19","12","12","His troops advance together; they construct a ramp against me and encamp around my tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_13","019_19_13","JOB","19","13","13","He has removed my brothers from me; my acquaintances have abandoned me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_14","019_19_14","JOB","19","14","14","My kinsmen have failed me, and my friends have forgotten me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_15","019_19_15","JOB","19","15","15","My guests and maidservants count me as a stranger; I am a foreigner in their sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_16","019_19_16","JOB","19","16","16","I call for my servant, but he does not answer, though I implore him with my own mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_17","019_19_17","JOB","19","17","17","My breath is repulsive to my wife, and I am loathsome to my own family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_18","019_19_18","JOB","19","18","18","Even little boys scorn me; when I appear, they deride me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_19","019_19_19","JOB","19","19","19","All my best friends despise me, and those I love have turned against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_20","019_19_20","JOB","19","20","20","My skin and flesh cling to my bones; I have escaped by the skin of my teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_21","019_19_21","JOB","19","21","21","Have pity on me, my friends, have pity, for the hand of God has struck me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_22","019_19_22","JOB","19","22","22","Why do you persecute me as God does? Will you never get enough of my flesh? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_23","019_19_23","JOB","19","23","23","I wish that my words were recorded and inscribed in a book, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_24","019_19_24","JOB","19","24","24","by an iron stylus on lead, or chiseled in stone forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_25","019_19_25","JOB","19","25","25","But I know that my Redeemer lives, and in the end He will stand upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_26","019_19_26","JOB","19","26","26","Even after my skin has been destroyed, yet in my flesh I will see God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_27","019_19_27","JOB","19","27","27","I will see Him for myself; my eyes will behold Him, and not as a stranger. How my heart yearns within me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_28","019_19_28","JOB","19","28","28","If you say, ‘Let us persecute him, since the root of the matter lies with him,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB19_29","019_19_29","JOB","19","29","29","then you should fear the sword yourselves, because wrath brings punishment by the sword, so that you may know there is a judgment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_1","019_20_1","JOB","20","1","1","Then Zophar the Naamathite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_2","019_20_2","JOB","20","2","2","“So my anxious thoughts compel me to answer, because of the turmoil within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_3","019_20_3","JOB","20","3","3","I have heard a rebuke that insults me, and my understanding prompts a reply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_4","019_20_4","JOB","20","4","4","Do you not know that from antiquity, since man was placed on the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_5","019_20_5","JOB","20","5","5","the triumph of the wicked has been brief and the joy of the godless momentary? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_6","019_20_6","JOB","20","6","6","Though his arrogance reaches the heavens, and his head touches the clouds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_7","019_20_7","JOB","20","7","7","he will perish forever, like his own dung; those who had seen him will ask, ‘Where is he?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_8","019_20_8","JOB","20","8","8","He will fly away like a dream, never to be found; he will be chased away like a vision in the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_9","019_20_9","JOB","20","9","9","The eye that saw him will see him no more, and his place will no longer behold him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_10","019_20_10","JOB","20","10","10","His sons will seek the favor of the poor, for his own hands must return his wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_11","019_20_11","JOB","20","11","11","The youthful vigor that fills his bones will lie down with him in the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_12","019_20_12","JOB","20","12","12","Though evil is sweet in his mouth and he conceals it under his tongue, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_13","019_20_13","JOB","20","13","13","though he cannot bear to let it go and keeps it in his mouth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_14","019_20_14","JOB","20","14","14","yet in his stomach his food sours into the venom of cobras within him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_15","019_20_15","JOB","20","15","15","He swallows wealth but vomits it out; God will force it from his stomach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_16","019_20_16","JOB","20","16","16","He will suck the poison of cobras; the fangs of a viper will kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_17","019_20_17","JOB","20","17","17","He will not enjoy the streams, the rivers flowing with honey and cream. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_18","019_20_18","JOB","20","18","18","He must return the fruit of his labor without consuming it; he cannot enjoy the profits of his trading. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_19","019_20_19","JOB","20","19","19","For he has oppressed and forsaken the poor; he has seized houses he did not build. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_20","019_20_20","JOB","20","20","20","Because his appetite is never satisfied, he cannot escape with his treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_21","019_20_21","JOB","20","21","21","Nothing is left for him to consume; thus his prosperity will not endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_22","019_20_22","JOB","20","22","22","In the midst of his plenty, he will be distressed; the full force of misery will come upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_23","019_20_23","JOB","20","23","23","When he has filled his stomach, God will vent His fury upon him, raining it down on him as he eats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_24","019_20_24","JOB","20","24","24","Though he flees from an iron weapon, a bronze-tipped arrow will pierce him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_25","019_20_25","JOB","20","25","25","It is drawn out of his back, the gleaming point from his liver. Terrors come over him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_26","019_20_26","JOB","20","26","26","Total darkness is reserved for his treasures. A fire unfanned will consume him and devour what is left in his tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_27","019_20_27","JOB","20","27","27","The heavens will expose his iniquity, and the earth will rise up against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_28","019_20_28","JOB","20","28","28","The possessions of his house will be removed, flowing away on the day of God’s wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB20_29","019_20_29","JOB","20","29","29","This is the wicked man’s portion from God, the inheritance God has appointed him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_1","019_21_1","JOB","21","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_2","019_21_2","JOB","21","2","2","“Listen carefully to my words; let this be your consolation to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_3","019_21_3","JOB","21","3","3","Bear with me while I speak; then, after I have spoken, you may go on mocking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_4","019_21_4","JOB","21","4","4","Is my complaint against a man? Then why should I not be impatient? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_5","019_21_5","JOB","21","5","5","Look at me and be appalled; put your hand over your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_6","019_21_6","JOB","21","6","6","When I remember, terror takes hold, and my body trembles in horror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_7","019_21_7","JOB","21","7","7","Why do the wicked live on, growing old and increasing in power? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_8","019_21_8","JOB","21","8","8","Their descendants are established around them, and their offspring before their eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_9","019_21_9","JOB","21","9","9","Their homes are safe from fear; no rod of punishment from God is upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_10","019_21_10","JOB","21","10","10","Their bulls breed without fail; their cows bear calves and do not miscarry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_11","019_21_11","JOB","21","11","11","They send forth their little ones like a flock; their children skip about, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_12","019_21_12","JOB","21","12","12","singing to the tambourine and lyre and making merry at the sound of the flute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_13","019_21_13","JOB","21","13","13","They spend their days in prosperity and go down to Sheol in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_14","019_21_14","JOB","21","14","14","Yet they say to God: ‘Leave us alone! For we have no desire to know Your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_15","019_21_15","JOB","21","15","15","Who is the Almighty, that we should serve Him, and what would we gain if we pray to Him?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_16","019_21_16","JOB","21","16","16","Still, their prosperity is not in their own hands, so I stay far from the counsel of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_17","019_21_17","JOB","21","17","17","How often is the lamp of the wicked put out? Does disaster come upon them? Does God, in His anger, apportion destruction? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_18","019_21_18","JOB","21","18","18","Are they like straw before the wind, like chaff swept away by a storm? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_19","019_21_19","JOB","21","19","19","It is said that God lays up one’s punishment for his children. Let God repay the man himself, so he will know it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_20","019_21_20","JOB","21","20","20","Let his eyes see his own destruction; let him drink for himself the wrath of the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_21","019_21_21","JOB","21","21","21","For what does he care about his household after him, when the number of his months has run out? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_22","019_21_22","JOB","21","22","22","Can anyone teach knowledge to God, since He judges those on high? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_23","019_21_23","JOB","21","23","23","One man dies full of vigor, completely secure and at ease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_24","019_21_24","JOB","21","24","24","His body is well nourished, and his bones are rich with marrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_25","019_21_25","JOB","21","25","25","Yet another man dies in the bitterness of his soul, having never tasted prosperity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_26","019_21_26","JOB","21","26","26","But together they lie down in the dust, and worms cover them both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_27","019_21_27","JOB","21","27","27","Behold, I know your thoughts full well, the schemes by which you would wrong me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_28","019_21_28","JOB","21","28","28","For you say, ‘Where now is the nobleman’s house, and where are the tents in which the wicked dwell?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_29","019_21_29","JOB","21","29","29","Have you never asked those who travel the roads? Do you not accept their reports? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_30","019_21_30","JOB","21","30","30","Indeed, the evil man is spared from the day of calamity, delivered from the day of wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_31","019_21_31","JOB","21","31","31","Who denounces his behavior to his face? Who repays him for what he has done? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_32","019_21_32","JOB","21","32","32","He is carried to the grave, and watch is kept over his tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_33","019_21_33","JOB","21","33","33","The clods of the valley are sweet to him; everyone follows behind him, and those before him are without number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB21_34","019_21_34","JOB","21","34","34","So how can you comfort me with empty words? For your answers remain full of falsehood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_1","019_22_1","JOB","22","1","1","Then Eliphaz the Temanite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_2","019_22_2","JOB","22","2","2","“Can a man be of use to God? Can even a wise man benefit Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_3","019_22_3","JOB","22","3","3","Does it delight the Almighty that you are righteous? Does He profit if your ways are blameless? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_4","019_22_4","JOB","22","4","4","Is it for your reverence that He rebukes you and enters into judgment against you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_5","019_22_5","JOB","22","5","5","Is not your wickedness great? Are not your iniquities endless? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_6","019_22_6","JOB","22","6","6","For you needlessly demanded security from your brothers and deprived the naked of their clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_7","019_22_7","JOB","22","7","7","You gave no water to the weary and withheld food from the famished, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_8","019_22_8","JOB","22","8","8","while the land belonged to a mighty man, and a man of honor lived on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_9","019_22_9","JOB","22","9","9","You sent widows away empty-handed, and the strength of the fatherless was crushed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_10","019_22_10","JOB","22","10","10","Therefore snares surround you, and sudden peril terrifies you; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_11","019_22_11","JOB","22","11","11","it is so dark you cannot see, and a flood of water covers you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_12","019_22_12","JOB","22","12","12","Is not God as high as the heavens? Look at the highest stars, how lofty they are! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_13","019_22_13","JOB","22","13","13","Yet you say: ‘What does God know? Does He judge through thick darkness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_14","019_22_14","JOB","22","14","14","Thick clouds veil Him so He does not see us as He traverses the vault of heaven.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_15","019_22_15","JOB","22","15","15","Will you stay on the ancient path that wicked men have trod? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_16","019_22_16","JOB","22","16","16","They were snatched away before their time, and their foundations were swept away by a flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_17","019_22_17","JOB","22","17","17","They said to God, ‘Depart from us. What can the Almighty do to us?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_18","019_22_18","JOB","22","18","18","But it was He who filled their houses with good things; so I stay far from the counsel of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_19","019_22_19","JOB","22","19","19","The righteous see it and are glad; the innocent mock them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_20","019_22_20","JOB","22","20","20","‘Surely our foes are destroyed, and fire has consumed their excess.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_21","019_22_21","JOB","22","21","21","Reconcile now and be at peace with Him; thereby good will come to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_22","019_22_22","JOB","22","22","22","Receive instruction from His mouth, and lay up His words in your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_23","019_22_23","JOB","22","23","23","If you return to the Almighty, you will be restored. If you remove injustice from your tents ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_24","019_22_24","JOB","22","24","24","and consign your gold to the dust and the gold of Ophir to the stones of the ravines, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_25","019_22_25","JOB","22","25","25","then the Almighty will be your gold and the finest silver for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_26","019_22_26","JOB","22","26","26","Surely then you will delight in the Almighty and lift up your face to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_27","019_22_27","JOB","22","27","27","You will pray to Him, and He will hear you, and you will fulfill your vows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_28","019_22_28","JOB","22","28","28","Your decisions will be carried out, and light will shine on your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_29","019_22_29","JOB","22","29","29","When men are brought low and you say, ‘Lift them up!’ then He will save the lowly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB22_30","019_22_30","JOB","22","30","30","He will deliver even one who is not innocent, rescuing him through the cleanness of your hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_1","019_23_1","JOB","23","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_2","019_23_2","JOB","23","2","2","“Even today my complaint is bitter. His hand is heavy despite my groaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_3","019_23_3","JOB","23","3","3","If only I knew where to find Him, so that I could go to His seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_4","019_23_4","JOB","23","4","4","I would plead my case before Him and fill my mouth with arguments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_5","019_23_5","JOB","23","5","5","I would learn how He would answer, and consider what He would say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_6","019_23_6","JOB","23","6","6","Would He contend with me in His great power? No, He would certainly take note of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_7","019_23_7","JOB","23","7","7","Then an upright man could reason with Him, and I would be delivered forever from my Judge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_8","019_23_8","JOB","23","8","8","If I go east, He is not there, and if I go west, I cannot find Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_9","019_23_9","JOB","23","9","9","When He is at work in the north, I cannot behold Him; when He turns to the south, I cannot see Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_10","019_23_10","JOB","23","10","10","Yet He knows the way I have taken; when He has tested me, I will come forth as gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_11","019_23_11","JOB","23","11","11","My feet have followed in His tracks; I have kept His way without turning aside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_12","019_23_12","JOB","23","12","12","I have not departed from the command of His lips; I have treasured the words of His mouth more than my daily bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_13","019_23_13","JOB","23","13","13","But He is unchangeable, and who can oppose Him? He does what He desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_14","019_23_14","JOB","23","14","14","For He carries out His decree against me, and He has many such plans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_15","019_23_15","JOB","23","15","15","Therefore I am terrified in His presence; when I consider this, I fear Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_16","019_23_16","JOB","23","16","16","God has made my heart faint; the Almighty has terrified me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB23_17","019_23_17","JOB","23","17","17","Yet I am not silenced by the darkness, by the thick darkness that covers my face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_1","019_24_1","JOB","24","1","1","“Why does the Almighty not reserve times for judgment? Why may those who know Him never see His days? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_2","019_24_2","JOB","24","2","2","Men move boundary stones; they pasture stolen flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_3","019_24_3","JOB","24","3","3","They drive away the donkey of the fatherless and take the widow’s ox in pledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_4","019_24_4","JOB","24","4","4","They push the needy off the road and force all the poor of the land into hiding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_5","019_24_5","JOB","24","5","5","Indeed, like wild donkeys in the desert, the poor go to work foraging for food; the wasteland is food for their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_6","019_24_6","JOB","24","6","6","They gather fodder in the fields and glean the vineyards of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_7","019_24_7","JOB","24","7","7","Without clothing, they spend the night naked; they have no covering against the cold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_8","019_24_8","JOB","24","8","8","Drenched by mountain rains, they huddle against the rocks for want of shelter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_9","019_24_9","JOB","24","9","9","The fatherless infant is snatched from the breast; the nursing child of the poor is seized for a debt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_10","019_24_10","JOB","24","10","10","Without clothing, they wander about naked. They carry the sheaves, but still go hungry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_11","019_24_11","JOB","24","11","11","They crush olives within their walls; they tread the winepresses, but go thirsty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_12","019_24_12","JOB","24","12","12","From the city, men groan, and the souls of the wounded cry out, yet God charges no one with wrongdoing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_13","019_24_13","JOB","24","13","13","Then there are those who rebel against the light, not knowing its ways or staying on its paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_14","019_24_14","JOB","24","14","14","When daylight is gone, the murderer rises to kill the poor and needy; in the night he is like a thief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_15","019_24_15","JOB","24","15","15","The eye of the adulterer watches for twilight. Thinking, ‘No eye will see me,’ he covers his face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_16","019_24_16","JOB","24","16","16","In the dark they dig through houses; by day they shut themselves in, never to experience the light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_17","019_24_17","JOB","24","17","17","For to them, deep darkness is their morning; surely they are friends with the terrors of darkness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_18","019_24_18","JOB","24","18","18","They are but foam on the surface of the water; their portion of the land is cursed, so that no one turns toward their vineyards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_19","019_24_19","JOB","24","19","19","As drought and heat consume the melting snow, so Sheol steals those who have sinned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_20","019_24_20","JOB","24","20","20","The womb forgets them; the worm feeds on them; they are remembered no more. So injustice is broken like a tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_21","019_24_21","JOB","24","21","21","They prey on the barren and childless, and show no kindness to the widow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_22","019_24_22","JOB","24","22","22","Yet by His power, God drags away the mighty; though rising up, they have no assurance of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_23","019_24_23","JOB","24","23","23","He gives them a sense of security, but His eyes are on their ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_24","019_24_24","JOB","24","24","24","They are exalted for a moment, then they are gone; they are brought low and gathered up like all others; they are cut off like heads of grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB24_25","019_24_25","JOB","24","25","25","If this is not so, then who can prove me a liar and reduce my words to nothing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_1","019_25_1","JOB","25","1","1","Then Bildad the Shuhite replied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_2","019_25_2","JOB","25","2","2","“Dominion and awe belong to God; He establishes harmony in the heights of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_3","019_25_3","JOB","25","3","3","Can His troops be numbered? On whom does His light not rise? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_4","019_25_4","JOB","25","4","4","How then can a man be just before God? How can one born of woman be pure? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_5","019_25_5","JOB","25","5","5","If even the moon does not shine, and the stars are not pure in His sight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB25_6","019_25_6","JOB","25","6","6","how much less man, who is but a maggot, and the son of man, who is but a worm!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_1","019_26_1","JOB","26","1","1","Then Job answered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_2","019_26_2","JOB","26","2","2","“How you have helped the powerless and saved the arm that is feeble! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_3","019_26_3","JOB","26","3","3","How you have counseled the unwise and provided fully sound insight! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_4","019_26_4","JOB","26","4","4","To whom have you uttered these words? And whose spirit spoke through you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_5","019_26_5","JOB","26","5","5","The dead tremble—those beneath the waters and those who dwell in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_6","019_26_6","JOB","26","6","6","Sheol is naked before God, and Abaddon has no covering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_7","019_26_7","JOB","26","7","7","He stretches out the north over empty space; He hangs the earth upon nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_8","019_26_8","JOB","26","8","8","He wraps up the waters in His clouds, yet the clouds do not burst under their own weight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_9","019_26_9","JOB","26","9","9","He covers the face of the full moon, spreading over it His cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_10","019_26_10","JOB","26","10","10","He has inscribed a horizon on the face of the waters at the boundary between light and darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_11","019_26_11","JOB","26","11","11","The foundations of heaven quake, astounded at His rebuke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_12","019_26_12","JOB","26","12","12","By His power He stirred the sea; by His understanding He shattered Rahab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_13","019_26_13","JOB","26","13","13","By His breath the skies were cleared; His hand pierced the fleeing serpent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB26_14","019_26_14","JOB","26","14","14","Indeed, these are but the fringes of His ways; how faint is the whisper we hear of Him! Who then can understand the thunder of His power?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_1","019_27_1","JOB","27","1","1","Job continued his discourse: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_2","019_27_2","JOB","27","2","2","“As surely as God lives, who has deprived me of justice—the Almighty, who has embittered my soul— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_3","019_27_3","JOB","27","3","3","as long as my breath is still within me and the breath of God remains in my nostrils, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_4","019_27_4","JOB","27","4","4","my lips will not speak wickedness, and my tongue will not utter deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_5","019_27_5","JOB","27","5","5","I will never say that you are right; I will maintain my integrity until I die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_6","019_27_6","JOB","27","6","6","I will cling to my righteousness and never let go. As long as I live, my conscience will not accuse me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_7","019_27_7","JOB","27","7","7","May my enemy be like the wicked and my opponent like the unjust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_8","019_27_8","JOB","27","8","8","For what is the hope of the godless when he is cut off, when God takes away his life? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_9","019_27_9","JOB","27","9","9","Will God hear his cry when distress comes upon him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_10","019_27_10","JOB","27","10","10","Will he delight in the Almighty? Will he call upon God at all times? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_11","019_27_11","JOB","27","11","11","I will instruct you in the power of God. I will not conceal the ways of the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_12","019_27_12","JOB","27","12","12","Surely all of you have seen it for yourselves. Why then do you keep up this empty talk? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_13","019_27_13","JOB","27","13","13","This is the wicked man’s portion from God—the heritage the ruthless receive from the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_14","019_27_14","JOB","27","14","14","Though his sons are many, they are destined for the sword; and his offspring will never have enough food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_15","019_27_15","JOB","27","15","15","His survivors will be buried by the plague, and their widows will not weep for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_16","019_27_16","JOB","27","16","16","Though he heaps up silver like dust and piles up a wardrobe like clay, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_17","019_27_17","JOB","27","17","17","what he lays up, the righteous will wear, and his silver will be divided by the innocent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_18","019_27_18","JOB","27","18","18","The house he built is like a moth’s cocoon, like a hut set up by a watchman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_19","019_27_19","JOB","27","19","19","He lies down wealthy, but will do so no more; when he opens his eyes, all is gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_20","019_27_20","JOB","27","20","20","Terrors overtake him like a flood; a tempest sweeps him away in the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_21","019_27_21","JOB","27","21","21","The east wind carries him away, and he is gone; it sweeps him out of his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_22","019_27_22","JOB","27","22","22","It hurls itself against him without mercy as he flees headlong from its power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB27_23","019_27_23","JOB","27","23","23","It claps its hands at him and hisses him out of his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_1","019_28_1","JOB","28","1","1","“Surely there is a mine for silver and a place where gold is refined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_2","019_28_2","JOB","28","2","2","Iron is taken from the earth, and copper is smelted from ore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_3","019_28_3","JOB","28","3","3","Man puts an end to the darkness; he probes the farthest recesses for ore in deepest darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_4","019_28_4","JOB","28","4","4","Far from human habitation he cuts a shaft in places forgotten by the foot of man. Far from men he dangles and sways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_5","019_28_5","JOB","28","5","5","Food may come from the earth, but from below it is transformed as by fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_6","019_28_6","JOB","28","6","6","Its rocks are the source of sapphires, containing flecks of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_7","019_28_7","JOB","28","7","7","No bird of prey knows that path; no falcon’s eye has seen it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_8","019_28_8","JOB","28","8","8","Proud beasts have never trodden it; no lion has ever prowled over it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_9","019_28_9","JOB","28","9","9","The miner strikes the flint; he overturns mountains at their base. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_10","019_28_10","JOB","28","10","10","He hews out channels in the rocks, and his eyes spot every treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_11","019_28_11","JOB","28","11","11","He stops up the sources of the streams to bring what is hidden to light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_12","019_28_12","JOB","28","12","12","But where can wisdom be found, and where does understanding dwell? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_13","019_28_13","JOB","28","13","13","No man can know its value, nor is it found in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_14","019_28_14","JOB","28","14","14","The ocean depths say, ‘It is not in me,’ while the sea declares, ‘It is not with me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_15","019_28_15","JOB","28","15","15","It cannot be bought with gold, nor can its price be weighed out in silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_16","019_28_16","JOB","28","16","16","It cannot be valued in the gold of Ophir, in precious onyx or sapphire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_17","019_28_17","JOB","28","17","17","Neither gold nor crystal can compare to it, nor jewels of fine gold be exchanged for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_18","019_28_18","JOB","28","18","18","Coral and quartz are unworthy of mention; the price of wisdom is beyond rubies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_19","019_28_19","JOB","28","19","19","Topaz from Cush cannot compare to it, nor can it be valued in pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_20","019_28_20","JOB","28","20","20","From where, then, does wisdom come, and where does understanding dwell? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_21","019_28_21","JOB","28","21","21","It is hidden from the eyes of every living thing and concealed from the birds of the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_22","019_28_22","JOB","28","22","22","Abaddon and Death say, ‘We have heard a rumor about it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_23","019_28_23","JOB","28","23","23","But God understands its way, and He knows its place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_24","019_28_24","JOB","28","24","24","For He looks to the ends of the earth and sees everything under the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_25","019_28_25","JOB","28","25","25","When God fixed the weight of the wind and measured out the waters, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_26","019_28_26","JOB","28","26","26","when He set a limit for the rain and a path for the thunderbolt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_27","019_28_27","JOB","28","27","27","then He looked at wisdom and appraised it; He established it and searched it out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB28_28","019_28_28","JOB","28","28","28","And He said to man, ‘Behold, the fear of the Lord, that is wisdom, and to turn away from evil is understanding.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_1","019_29_1","JOB","29","1","1","And Job continued his discourse: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_2","019_29_2","JOB","29","2","2","“How I long for the months gone by, for the days when God watched over me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_3","019_29_3","JOB","29","3","3","when His lamp shone above my head, and by His light I walked through the darkness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_4","019_29_4","JOB","29","4","4","when I was in my prime, when the friendship of God rested on my tent, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_5","019_29_5","JOB","29","5","5","when the Almighty was still with me and my children were around me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_6","019_29_6","JOB","29","6","6","when my steps were bathed in cream and the rock poured out for me streams of oil! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_7","019_29_7","JOB","29","7","7","When I went out to the city gate and took my seat in the public square, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_8","019_29_8","JOB","29","8","8","the young men saw me and withdrew, and the old men rose to their feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_9","019_29_9","JOB","29","9","9","The princes refrained from speaking and covered their mouths with their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_10","019_29_10","JOB","29","10","10","The voices of the nobles were hushed, and their tongues stuck to the roofs of their mouths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_11","019_29_11","JOB","29","11","11","For those who heard me called me blessed, and those who saw me commended me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_12","019_29_12","JOB","29","12","12","because I rescued the poor who cried out and the fatherless who had no helper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_13","019_29_13","JOB","29","13","13","The dying man blessed me, and I made the widow’s heart sing for joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_14","019_29_14","JOB","29","14","14","I put on righteousness, and it clothed me; justice was my robe and my turban. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_15","019_29_15","JOB","29","15","15","I served as eyes to the blind and as feet to the lame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_16","019_29_16","JOB","29","16","16","I was a father to the needy, and I took up the case of the stranger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_17","019_29_17","JOB","29","17","17","I shattered the fangs of the unjust and snatched the prey from his teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_18","019_29_18","JOB","29","18","18","So I thought: ‘I will die in my nest and multiply my days as the sand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_19","019_29_19","JOB","29","19","19","My roots will spread out to the waters, and the dew will rest nightly on my branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_20","019_29_20","JOB","29","20","20","My glory is ever new within me, and my bow is renewed in my hand.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_21","019_29_21","JOB","29","21","21","Men listened to me with expectation, waiting silently for my counsel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_22","019_29_22","JOB","29","22","22","After my words, they spoke no more; my speech settled on them like dew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_23","019_29_23","JOB","29","23","23","They waited for me as for rain and drank in my words like spring showers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_24","019_29_24","JOB","29","24","24","If I smiled at them, they did not believe it; the light of my countenance was precious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB29_25","019_29_25","JOB","29","25","25","I chose their course and presided as chief. So I dwelt as a king among his troops, as a comforter of the mourners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_1","019_30_1","JOB","30","1","1","“But now they mock me, men younger than I am, whose fathers I would have refused to put with my sheep dogs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_2","019_30_2","JOB","30","2","2","What use to me was the strength of their hands, since their vigor had left them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_3","019_30_3","JOB","30","3","3","Gaunt from poverty and hunger, they gnawed the dry land, and the desolate wasteland by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_4","019_30_4","JOB","30","4","4","They plucked mallow among the shrubs, and the roots of the broom tree were their food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_5","019_30_5","JOB","30","5","5","They were banished from among men, shouted at like thieves, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_6","019_30_6","JOB","30","6","6","so that they lived on the slopes of the wadis, among the rocks and in holes in the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_7","019_30_7","JOB","30","7","7","They cried out among the shrubs and huddled beneath the nettles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_8","019_30_8","JOB","30","8","8","A senseless and nameless brood, they were driven off the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_9","019_30_9","JOB","30","9","9","And now they mock me in song; I have become a byword among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_10","019_30_10","JOB","30","10","10","They abhor me and keep far from me; they do not hesitate to spit in my face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_11","019_30_11","JOB","30","11","11","Because God has unstrung my bow and afflicted me, they have cast off restraint in my presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_12","019_30_12","JOB","30","12","12","The rabble arises at my right; they lay snares for my feet and build siege ramps against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_13","019_30_13","JOB","30","13","13","They tear up my path; they profit from my destruction, with no one to restrain them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_14","019_30_14","JOB","30","14","14","They advance as through a wide breach; through the ruins they keep rolling in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_15","019_30_15","JOB","30","15","15","Terrors are turned loose against me; they drive away my dignity as by the wind, and my prosperity has passed like a cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_16","019_30_16","JOB","30","16","16","And now my soul is poured out within me; days of affliction grip me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_17","019_30_17","JOB","30","17","17","Night pierces my bones, and my gnawing pains never rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_18","019_30_18","JOB","30","18","18","With great force He grasps my garment; He seizes me by the collar of my tunic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_19","019_30_19","JOB","30","19","19","He throws me into the mud, and I have become like dust and ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_20","019_30_20","JOB","30","20","20","I cry out to You for help, but You do not answer; when I stand up, You merely look at me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_21","019_30_21","JOB","30","21","21","You have ruthlessly turned on me; You oppose me with Your strong hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_22","019_30_22","JOB","30","22","22","You snatch me up into the wind and drive me before it; You toss me about in the storm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_23","019_30_23","JOB","30","23","23","Yes, I know that You will bring me down to death, to the place appointed for all the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_24","019_30_24","JOB","30","24","24","Yet no one stretches out his hand against a ruined man when he cries for help in his distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_25","019_30_25","JOB","30","25","25","Have I not wept for those in trouble? Has my soul not grieved for the needy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_26","019_30_26","JOB","30","26","26","But when I hoped for good, evil came; when I looked for light, darkness fell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_27","019_30_27","JOB","30","27","27","I am churning within and cannot rest; days of affliction confront me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_28","019_30_28","JOB","30","28","28","I go about blackened, but not by the sun. I stand up in the assembly and cry for help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_29","019_30_29","JOB","30","29","29","I have become a brother of jackals, a companion of ostriches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_30","019_30_30","JOB","30","30","30","My skin grows black and peels, and my bones burn with fever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB30_31","019_30_31","JOB","30","31","31","My harp is tuned to mourning and my flute to the sound of weeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_1","019_31_1","JOB","31","1","1","“I have made a covenant with my eyes. How then could I gaze with desire at a virgin? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_2","019_31_2","JOB","31","2","2","For what is the allotment of God from above, or the heritage from the Almighty on high? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_3","019_31_3","JOB","31","3","3","Does not disaster come to the unjust and calamity to the workers of iniquity? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_4","019_31_4","JOB","31","4","4","Does He not see my ways and count my every step? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_5","019_31_5","JOB","31","5","5","If I have walked in falsehood or my foot has rushed to deceit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_6","019_31_6","JOB","31","6","6","let God weigh me with honest scales, that He may know my integrity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_7","019_31_7","JOB","31","7","7","If my steps have turned from the path, if my heart has followed my eyes, or if impurity has stuck to my hands, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_8","019_31_8","JOB","31","8","8","then may another eat what I have sown, and may my crops be uprooted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_9","019_31_9","JOB","31","9","9","If my heart has been enticed by my neighbor’s wife, or I have lurked at his door, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_10","019_31_10","JOB","31","10","10","then may my own wife grind grain for another, and may other men sleep with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_11","019_31_11","JOB","31","11","11","For that would be a heinous crime, an iniquity to be judged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_12","019_31_12","JOB","31","12","12","For it is a fire that burns down to Abaddon; it would root out my entire harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_13","019_31_13","JOB","31","13","13","If I have rejected the cause of my manservant or maidservant when they made a complaint against me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_14","019_31_14","JOB","31","14","14","what will I do when God rises to judge? How will I answer when called to account? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_15","019_31_15","JOB","31","15","15","Did not He who made me in the womb also make them? Did not the same One form us in the womb? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_16","019_31_16","JOB","31","16","16","If I have denied the desires of the poor or allowed the widow’s eyes to fail, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_17","019_31_17","JOB","31","17","17","if I have eaten my morsel alone, not sharing it with the fatherless— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_18","019_31_18","JOB","31","18","18","though from my youth I reared him as would a father, and from my mother’s womb I guided the widow— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_19","019_31_19","JOB","31","19","19","if I have seen one perish for lack of clothing, or a needy man without a cloak, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_20","019_31_20","JOB","31","20","20","if his heart has not blessed me for warming him with the fleece of my sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_21","019_31_21","JOB","31","21","21","if I have lifted up my hand against the fatherless because I saw that I had support in the gate, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_22","019_31_22","JOB","31","22","22","then may my arm fall from my shoulder and be torn from its socket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_23","019_31_23","JOB","31","23","23","For calamity from God terrifies me, and His splendor I cannot overpower. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_24","019_31_24","JOB","31","24","24","If I have put my trust in gold or called pure gold my security, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_25","019_31_25","JOB","31","25","25","if I have rejoiced in my great wealth because my hand had gained so much, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_26","019_31_26","JOB","31","26","26","if I have beheld the sun in its radiance or the moon moving in splendor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_27","019_31_27","JOB","31","27","27","so that my heart was secretly enticed and my hand threw a kiss from my mouth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_28","019_31_28","JOB","31","28","28","this would also be an iniquity to be judged, for I would have denied God on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_29","019_31_29","JOB","31","29","29","If I have rejoiced in my enemy’s ruin, or exulted when evil befell him— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_30","019_31_30","JOB","31","30","30","I have not allowed my mouth to sin by asking for his life with a curse— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_31","019_31_31","JOB","31","31","31","if the men of my house have not said, ‘Who is there who has not had his fill?’— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_32","019_31_32","JOB","31","32","32","but no stranger had to lodge on the street, for my door has been open to the traveler— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_33","019_31_33","JOB","31","33","33","if I have covered my transgressions like Adam by hiding my guilt in my heart, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_34","019_31_34","JOB","31","34","34","because I greatly feared the crowds and the contempt of the clans terrified me, so that I kept silent and would not go outside— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_35","019_31_35","JOB","31","35","35","(Oh, that I had one to hear me! Here is my signature. Let the Almighty answer me; let my accuser compose an indictment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_36","019_31_36","JOB","31","36","36","Surely I would carry it on my shoulder and wear it like a crown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_37","019_31_37","JOB","31","37","37","I would give account of all my steps; I would approach Him like a prince.)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_38","019_31_38","JOB","31","38","38","if my land cries out against me and its furrows weep together, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_39","019_31_39","JOB","31","39","39","if I have devoured its produce without payment or broken the spirit of its tenants, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB31_40","019_31_40","JOB","31","40","40","then let briers grow instead of wheat and stinkweed instead of barley.” Thus conclude the words of Job. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_1","019_32_1","JOB","32","1","1","So these three men stopped answering Job, because he was righteous in his own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_2","019_32_2","JOB","32","2","2","This kindled the anger of Elihu son of Barachel the Buzite, of the family of Ram. He burned with anger against Job for justifying himself rather than God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_3","019_32_3","JOB","32","3","3","and he burned with anger against Job’s three friends because they had failed to refute Job, and yet had condemned him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_4","019_32_4","JOB","32","4","4","Now Elihu had waited to speak to Job because the others were older than he. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_5","019_32_5","JOB","32","5","5","But when he saw that the three men had no further reply, his anger was kindled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_6","019_32_6","JOB","32","6","6","So Elihu son of Barachel the Buzite declared: “I am young in years, while you are old; that is why I was timid and afraid to tell you what I know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_7","019_32_7","JOB","32","7","7","I thought that age should speak, and many years should teach wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_8","019_32_8","JOB","32","8","8","But there is a spirit in a man, the breath of the Almighty, that gives him understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_9","019_32_9","JOB","32","9","9","It is not only the old who are wise, or the elderly who understand justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_10","019_32_10","JOB","32","10","10","Therefore I say, ‘Listen to me; I too will declare what I know.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_11","019_32_11","JOB","32","11","11","Indeed, I waited while you spoke; I listened to your reasoning; as you searched for words, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_12","019_32_12","JOB","32","12","12","I paid you full attention. But no one proved Job wrong; not one of you rebutted his arguments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_13","019_32_13","JOB","32","13","13","So do not claim, ‘We have found wisdom; let God, not man, refute him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_14","019_32_14","JOB","32","14","14","But Job has not directed his words against me, and I will not answer him with your arguments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_15","019_32_15","JOB","32","15","15","Job’s friends are dismayed, with no more to say; words have escaped them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_16","019_32_16","JOB","32","16","16","Must I wait, now that they are silent, now that they stand and no longer reply? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_17","019_32_17","JOB","32","17","17","I too will answer; yes, I will declare what I know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_18","019_32_18","JOB","32","18","18","For I am full of words, and my spirit within me compels me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_19","019_32_19","JOB","32","19","19","Behold, my belly is like unvented wine; it is about to burst like a new wineskin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_20","019_32_20","JOB","32","20","20","I must speak and find relief; I must open my lips and respond. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_21","019_32_21","JOB","32","21","21","I will be partial to no one, nor will I flatter any man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB32_22","019_32_22","JOB","32","22","22","For I do not know how to flatter, or my Maker would remove me in an instant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_1","019_33_1","JOB","33","1","1","“But now, O Job, hear my speech, and listen to all my words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_2","019_33_2","JOB","33","2","2","Behold, I will open my mouth; my address is on the tip of my tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_3","019_33_3","JOB","33","3","3","My words are from an upright heart, and my lips speak sincerely what I know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_4","019_33_4","JOB","33","4","4","The Spirit of God has made me, and the breath of the Almighty gives me life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_5","019_33_5","JOB","33","5","5","Refute me if you can; prepare your case and confront me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_6","019_33_6","JOB","33","6","6","I am just like you before God; I was also formed from clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_7","019_33_7","JOB","33","7","7","Surely no fear of me should terrify you; nor will my hand be heavy upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_8","019_33_8","JOB","33","8","8","Surely you have spoken in my hearing, and I have heard these very words: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_9","019_33_9","JOB","33","9","9","‘I am pure, without transgression; I am clean, with no iniquity in me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_10","019_33_10","JOB","33","10","10","Yet God finds occasions against me; He counts me as His enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_11","019_33_11","JOB","33","11","11","He puts my feet in the stocks; He watches over all my paths.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_12","019_33_12","JOB","33","12","12","Behold, you are not right in this matter. I will answer you, for God is greater than man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_13","019_33_13","JOB","33","13","13","Why do you complain to Him that He answers nothing a man asks? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_14","019_33_14","JOB","33","14","14","For God speaks in one way and in another, yet no one notices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_15","019_33_15","JOB","33","15","15","In a dream, in a vision in the night, when deep sleep falls upon men as they slumber on their beds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_16","019_33_16","JOB","33","16","16","He opens their ears and terrifies them with warnings ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_17","019_33_17","JOB","33","17","17","to turn a man from wrongdoing and keep him from pride, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_18","019_33_18","JOB","33","18","18","to preserve his soul from the Pit and his life from perishing by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_19","019_33_19","JOB","33","19","19","A man is also chastened on his bed with pain and constant distress in his bones, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_20","019_33_20","JOB","33","20","20","so that he detests his bread, and his soul loathes his favorite food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_21","019_33_21","JOB","33","21","21","His flesh wastes away from sight, and his hidden bones protrude. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_22","019_33_22","JOB","33","22","22","He draws near to the Pit, and his life to the messengers of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_23","019_33_23","JOB","33","23","23","Yet if there is a messenger on his side, one mediator in a thousand, to tell a man what is right for him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_24","019_33_24","JOB","33","24","24","to be gracious to him and say, ‘Spare him from going down to the Pit; I have found his ransom,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_25","019_33_25","JOB","33","25","25","then his flesh is refreshed like a child’s; he returns to the days of his youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_26","019_33_26","JOB","33","26","26","He prays to God and finds favor; he sees God’s face and shouts for joy, and God restores His righteousness to that man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_27","019_33_27","JOB","33","27","27","Then he sings before men with these words: ‘I have sinned and perverted what was right; yet I did not get what I deserved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_28","019_33_28","JOB","33","28","28","He redeemed my soul from going down to the Pit, and I will live to see the light.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_29","019_33_29","JOB","33","29","29","Behold, all these things God does to a man, two or even three times, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_30","019_33_30","JOB","33","30","30","to bring back his soul from the Pit, that he may be enlightened with the light of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_31","019_33_31","JOB","33","31","31","Pay attention, Job, and listen to me; be silent, and I will speak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_32","019_33_32","JOB","33","32","32","But if you have something to say, answer me; speak up, for I would like to vindicate you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB33_33","019_33_33","JOB","33","33","33","But if not, then listen to me; be quiet, and I will teach you wisdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_1","019_34_1","JOB","34","1","1","Then Elihu continued: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_2","019_34_2","JOB","34","2","2","“Hear my words, O wise men; give ear to me, O men of learning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_3","019_34_3","JOB","34","3","3","For the ear tests words as the mouth tastes food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_4","019_34_4","JOB","34","4","4","Let us choose for ourselves what is right; let us learn together what is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_5","019_34_5","JOB","34","5","5","For Job has declared, ‘I am righteous, yet God has deprived me of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_6","019_34_6","JOB","34","6","6","Would I lie about my case? My wound is incurable, though I am without transgression.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_7","019_34_7","JOB","34","7","7","What man is like Job, who drinks up derision like water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_8","019_34_8","JOB","34","8","8","He keeps company with evildoers and walks with wicked men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_9","019_34_9","JOB","34","9","9","For he has said, ‘It profits a man nothing that he should delight in God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_10","019_34_10","JOB","34","10","10","Therefore listen to me, O men of understanding. Far be it from God to do wrong, and from the Almighty to act unjustly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_11","019_34_11","JOB","34","11","11","For according to a man’s deeds He repays him; according to a man’s ways He brings consequences. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_12","019_34_12","JOB","34","12","12","Indeed, it is true that God does not act wickedly, and the Almighty does not pervert justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_13","019_34_13","JOB","34","13","13","Who gave Him charge over the earth? Who appointed Him over the whole world? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_14","019_34_14","JOB","34","14","14","If He were to set His heart to it and withdraw His Spirit and breath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_15","019_34_15","JOB","34","15","15","all flesh would perish together and mankind would return to the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_16","019_34_16","JOB","34","16","16","If you have understanding, hear this; listen to my words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_17","019_34_17","JOB","34","17","17","Could one who hates justice govern? Will you condemn the just and mighty One, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_18","019_34_18","JOB","34","18","18","who says to kings, ‘You are worthless!’ and to nobles, ‘You are wicked,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_19","019_34_19","JOB","34","19","19","who is not partial to princes and does not favor rich over poor? For they are all the work of His hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_20","019_34_20","JOB","34","20","20","They die in an instant, in the middle of the night. The people convulse and pass away; the mighty are removed without human hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_21","019_34_21","JOB","34","21","21","For His eyes are on the ways of a man, and He sees his every step. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_22","019_34_22","JOB","34","22","22","There is no darkness or deep shadow where the workers of iniquity can hide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_23","019_34_23","JOB","34","23","23","For God need not examine a man further or have him approach for judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_24","019_34_24","JOB","34","24","24","He shatters the mighty without inquiry and sets up others in their place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_25","019_34_25","JOB","34","25","25","Therefore, He recognizes their deeds; He overthrows them in the night and they are crushed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_26","019_34_26","JOB","34","26","26","He strikes them for their wickedness in full view, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_27","019_34_27","JOB","34","27","27","because they turned aside from Him and had no regard for any of His ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_28","019_34_28","JOB","34","28","28","They caused the cry of the poor to come before Him, and He heard the outcry of the afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_29","019_34_29","JOB","34","29","29","But when He remains silent, who can condemn Him? When He hides His face, who can see Him? Yet He watches over both man and nation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_30","019_34_30","JOB","34","30","30","that godless men should not rule or lay snares for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_31","019_34_31","JOB","34","31","31","Suppose someone says to God, ‘I have endured my punishment; I will offend no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_32","019_34_32","JOB","34","32","32","Teach me what I cannot see; if I have done wrong, I will not do it again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_33","019_34_33","JOB","34","33","33","Should God repay you on your own terms when you have disavowed Him? You must choose, not I; so tell me what you know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_34","019_34_34","JOB","34","34","34","Men of understanding will declare to me, and the wise men who hear me will say: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_35","019_34_35","JOB","34","35","35","‘Job speaks without knowledge; his words lack insight.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_36","019_34_36","JOB","34","36","36","If only Job were tried to the utmost for answering like a wicked man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB34_37","019_34_37","JOB","34","37","37","For he adds rebellion to his sin; he claps his hands among us and multiplies his words against God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_1","019_35_1","JOB","35","1","1","And Elihu went on to say: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_2","019_35_2","JOB","35","2","2","“Do you think this is just? You say, ‘I am more righteous than God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_3","019_35_3","JOB","35","3","3","For you ask, ‘What does it profit me, and what benefit do I gain apart from sin?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_4","019_35_4","JOB","35","4","4","I will reply to you and to your friends as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_5","019_35_5","JOB","35","5","5","Look to the heavens and see; gaze at the clouds high above you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_6","019_35_6","JOB","35","6","6","If you sin, what do you accomplish against Him? If you multiply your transgressions, what do you do to Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_7","019_35_7","JOB","35","7","7","If you are righteous, what do you give Him, or what does He receive from your hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_8","019_35_8","JOB","35","8","8","Your wickedness affects only a man like yourself, and your righteousness only a son of man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_9","019_35_9","JOB","35","9","9","Men cry out under great oppression; they plead for relief from the arm of the mighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_10","019_35_10","JOB","35","10","10","But no one asks, ‘Where is God my Maker, who gives us songs in the night, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_11","019_35_11","JOB","35","11","11","who teaches us more than the beasts of the earth and makes us wiser than the birds of the air?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_12","019_35_12","JOB","35","12","12","There they cry out, but He does not answer, because of the pride of evil men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_13","019_35_13","JOB","35","13","13","Surely God does not listen to empty pleas, and the Almighty does not take note of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_14","019_35_14","JOB","35","14","14","How much less, then, when you say that you do not see Him, that your case is before Him and you must wait for Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_15","019_35_15","JOB","35","15","15","and further, that in His anger He has not punished or taken much notice of folly! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB35_16","019_35_16","JOB","35","16","16","So Job opens his mouth in vain and multiplies words without knowledge.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_1","019_36_1","JOB","36","1","1","And Elihu continued: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_2","019_36_2","JOB","36","2","2","“Bear with me a little longer, and I will show you that there is more to be said on God’s behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_3","019_36_3","JOB","36","3","3","I get my knowledge from afar, and I will ascribe justice to my Maker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_4","019_36_4","JOB","36","4","4","For truly my words are free of falsehood; one perfect in knowledge is with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_5","019_36_5","JOB","36","5","5","Indeed, God is mighty, but He despises no one; He is mighty in strength of understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_6","019_36_6","JOB","36","6","6","He does not keep the wicked alive, but He grants justice to the afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_7","019_36_7","JOB","36","7","7","He does not take His eyes off the righteous, but He enthrones them with kings and exalts them forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_8","019_36_8","JOB","36","8","8","And if men are bound with chains, caught in cords of affliction, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_9","019_36_9","JOB","36","9","9","then He tells them their deeds and how arrogantly they have transgressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_10","019_36_10","JOB","36","10","10","He opens their ears to correction and commands that they turn from iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_11","019_36_11","JOB","36","11","11","If they obey and serve Him, then they end their days in prosperity and their years in happiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_12","019_36_12","JOB","36","12","12","But if they do not obey, then they perish by the sword and die without knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_13","019_36_13","JOB","36","13","13","The godless in heart harbor resentment; even when He binds them, they do not cry for help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_14","019_36_14","JOB","36","14","14","They die in their youth, among the male shrine prostitutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_15","019_36_15","JOB","36","15","15","God rescues the afflicted by their affliction and opens their ears in oppression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_16","019_36_16","JOB","36","16","16","Indeed, He drew you from the jaws of distress to a spacious and broad place, to a table full of richness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_17","019_36_17","JOB","36","17","17","But now you are laden with the judgment due the wicked; judgment and justice have seized you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_18","019_36_18","JOB","36","18","18","Be careful that no one lures you with riches; do not let a large bribe lead you astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_19","019_36_19","JOB","36","19","19","Can your wealth or all your mighty effort keep you from distress? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_20","019_36_20","JOB","36","20","20","Do not long for the night, when people vanish from their homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_21","019_36_21","JOB","36","21","21","Be careful not to turn to iniquity, for this you have preferred to affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_22","019_36_22","JOB","36","22","22","Behold, God is exalted in His power. Who is a teacher like Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_23","019_36_23","JOB","36","23","23","Who has appointed His way for Him, or told Him, ‘You have done wrong’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_24","019_36_24","JOB","36","24","24","Remember to magnify His work, which men have praised in song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_25","019_36_25","JOB","36","25","25","All mankind has seen it; men behold it from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_26","019_36_26","JOB","36","26","26","Indeed, God is great—beyond our knowledge; the number of His years is unsearchable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_27","019_36_27","JOB","36","27","27","For He draws up drops of water which distill the rain from the mist, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_28","019_36_28","JOB","36","28","28","which the clouds pour out and shower abundantly on mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_29","019_36_29","JOB","36","29","29","Furthermore, who can understand how the clouds spread out, how the thunder roars from His pavilion? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_30","019_36_30","JOB","36","30","30","See how He scatters His lightning around Him and covers the depths of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_31","019_36_31","JOB","36","31","31","For by these He judges the nations and provides food in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_32","019_36_32","JOB","36","32","32","He fills His hands with lightning and commands it to strike its mark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB36_33","019_36_33","JOB","36","33","33","The thunder declares His presence; even the cattle regard the rising storm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_1","019_37_1","JOB","37","1","1","“At this my heart also pounds and leaps from its place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_2","019_37_2","JOB","37","2","2","Listen closely to the thunder of His voice and the rumbling that comes from His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_3","019_37_3","JOB","37","3","3","He unleashes His lightning beneath the whole sky and sends it to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_4","019_37_4","JOB","37","4","4","Then there comes a roaring sound; He thunders with His majestic voice. He does not restrain the lightning when His voice resounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_5","019_37_5","JOB","37","5","5","God thunders wondrously with His voice; He does great things we cannot comprehend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_6","019_37_6","JOB","37","6","6","For He says to the snow, ‘Fall on the earth,’ and to the gentle rain, ‘Pour out a mighty downpour.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_7","019_37_7","JOB","37","7","7","He seals up the hand of every man, so that all men may know His work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_8","019_37_8","JOB","37","8","8","The wild animals enter their lairs; they settle down in their dens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_9","019_37_9","JOB","37","9","9","The tempest comes from its chamber, and the cold from the driving north winds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_10","019_37_10","JOB","37","10","10","By the breath of God the ice is formed and the watery expanses are frozen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_11","019_37_11","JOB","37","11","11","He loads the clouds with moisture; He scatters His lightning through them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_12","019_37_12","JOB","37","12","12","They swirl about, whirling at His direction, accomplishing all that He commands over the face of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_13","019_37_13","JOB","37","13","13","Whether for punishment or for His land, He accomplishes this in His loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_14","019_37_14","JOB","37","14","14","Listen to this, O Job; stand still and consider the wonders of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_15","019_37_15","JOB","37","15","15","Do you know how God dispatches the clouds or makes the lightning flash? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_16","019_37_16","JOB","37","16","16","Do you understand how the clouds float, those wonders of Him who is perfect in knowledge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_17","019_37_17","JOB","37","17","17","You whose clothes get hot when the land lies hushed under the south wind, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_18","019_37_18","JOB","37","18","18","can you, like Him, spread out the skies, as strong as a mirror of bronze? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_19","019_37_19","JOB","37","19","19","Teach us what we should say to Him; we cannot draw up our case because of our darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_20","019_37_20","JOB","37","20","20","Should He be told that I want to speak? Would a man ask to be swallowed up? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_21","019_37_21","JOB","37","21","21","Now no one can gaze at the sun when it is bright in the skies after the wind has swept them clean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_22","019_37_22","JOB","37","22","22","Out of the north He comes in golden splendor; awesome majesty surrounds Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_23","019_37_23","JOB","37","23","23","The Almighty is beyond our reach; He is exalted in power! In His justice and great righteousness He does not oppress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB37_24","019_37_24","JOB","37","24","24","Therefore, men fear Him, for He is not partial to the wise in heart.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_1","019_38_1","JOB","38","1","1","Then the LORD answered Job out of the whirlwind and said: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_2","019_38_2","JOB","38","2","2","“Who is this who obscures My counsel by words without knowledge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_3","019_38_3","JOB","38","3","3","Now brace yourself like a man; I will question you, and you shall inform Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_4","019_38_4","JOB","38","4","4","Where were you when I laid the foundations of the earth? Tell Me, if you have understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_5","019_38_5","JOB","38","5","5","Who fixed its measurements? Surely you know! Or who stretched a measuring line across it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_6","019_38_6","JOB","38","6","6","On what were its foundations set, or who laid its cornerstone, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_7","019_38_7","JOB","38","7","7","while the morning stars sang together and all the sons of God shouted for joy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_8","019_38_8","JOB","38","8","8","Who enclosed the sea behind doors when it burst forth from the womb, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_9","019_38_9","JOB","38","9","9","when I made the clouds its garment and thick darkness its blanket, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_10","019_38_10","JOB","38","10","10","when I fixed its boundaries and set in place its bars and doors, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_11","019_38_11","JOB","38","11","11","and I declared: ‘You may come this far, but no farther; here your proud waves must stop’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_12","019_38_12","JOB","38","12","12","In your days, have you commanded the morning or assigned the dawn its place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_13","019_38_13","JOB","38","13","13","that it might spread to the ends of the earth and shake the wicked out of it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_14","019_38_14","JOB","38","14","14","The earth takes shape like clay under a seal; its hills stand out like the folds of a garment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_15","019_38_15","JOB","38","15","15","Light is withheld from the wicked, and their upraised arm is broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_16","019_38_16","JOB","38","16","16","Have you journeyed to the vents of the sea or walked in the trenches of the deep? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_17","019_38_17","JOB","38","17","17","Have the gates of death been revealed to you? Have you seen the gates of the shadow of death? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_18","019_38_18","JOB","38","18","18","Have you surveyed the extent of the earth? Tell Me, if you know all this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_19","019_38_19","JOB","38","19","19","Where is the way to the home of light? Do you know where darkness resides, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_20","019_38_20","JOB","38","20","20","so you can lead it back to its border? Do you know the paths to its home? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_21","019_38_21","JOB","38","21","21","Surely you know, for you were already born! And the number of your days is great! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_22","019_38_22","JOB","38","22","22","Have you entered the storehouses of snow or observed the storehouses of hail, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_23","019_38_23","JOB","38","23","23","which I hold in reserve for times of trouble, for the day of war and battle? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_24","019_38_24","JOB","38","24","24","In which direction is the lightning dispersed, or the east wind scattered over the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_25","019_38_25","JOB","38","25","25","Who cuts a channel for the flood or clears a path for the thunderbolt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_26","019_38_26","JOB","38","26","26","to bring rain on a barren land, on a desert where no man lives, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_27","019_38_27","JOB","38","27","27","to satisfy the parched wasteland and make it sprout with tender grass? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_28","019_38_28","JOB","38","28","28","Does the rain have a father? Who has begotten the drops of dew? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_29","019_38_29","JOB","38","29","29","From whose womb does the ice emerge? Who gives birth to the frost from heaven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_30","019_38_30","JOB","38","30","30","when the waters become hard as stone and the surface of the deep is frozen? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_31","019_38_31","JOB","38","31","31","Can you bind the chains of the Pleiades or loosen the belt of Orion? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_32","019_38_32","JOB","38","32","32","Can you bring forth the constellations in their seasons or lead out the Bear and her cubs? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_33","019_38_33","JOB","38","33","33","Do you know the laws of the heavens? Can you set their dominion over the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_34","019_38_34","JOB","38","34","34","Can you command the clouds so that a flood of water covers you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_35","019_38_35","JOB","38","35","35","Can you send the lightning bolts on their way? Do they report to you, ‘Here we are’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_36","019_38_36","JOB","38","36","36","Who has put wisdom in the heart or given understanding to the mind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_37","019_38_37","JOB","38","37","37","Who has the wisdom to count the clouds? Or who can tilt the water jars of the heavens ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_38","019_38_38","JOB","38","38","38","when the dust hardens into a mass and the clods of earth stick together? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_39","019_38_39","JOB","38","39","39","Can you hunt the prey for a lioness or satisfy the hunger of young lions ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_40","019_38_40","JOB","38","40","40","when they crouch in their dens and lie in wait in the thicket? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB38_41","019_38_41","JOB","38","41","41","Who provides food for the raven when its young cry out to God as they wander about for lack of food? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_1","019_39_1","JOB","39","1","1","“Do you know when mountain goats give birth? Have you watched the doe bear her fawn? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_2","019_39_2","JOB","39","2","2","Can you count the months they are pregnant? Do you know the time they give birth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_3","019_39_3","JOB","39","3","3","They crouch down and bring forth their young; they deliver their newborn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_4","019_39_4","JOB","39","4","4","Their young ones thrive and grow up in the open field; they leave and do not return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_5","019_39_5","JOB","39","5","5","Who set the wild donkey free? Who released the swift donkey from the harness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_6","019_39_6","JOB","39","6","6","I made the wilderness his home and the salt flats his dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_7","019_39_7","JOB","39","7","7","He scorns the tumult of the city and never hears the shouts of a driver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_8","019_39_8","JOB","39","8","8","He roams the mountains for pasture, searching for any green thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_9","019_39_9","JOB","39","9","9","Will the wild ox consent to serve you? Will he stay by your manger at night? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_10","019_39_10","JOB","39","10","10","Can you hold him to the furrow with a harness? Will he plow the valleys behind you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_11","019_39_11","JOB","39","11","11","Can you rely on his great strength? Will you leave your hard work to him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_12","019_39_12","JOB","39","12","12","Can you trust him to bring in your grain and gather it to your threshing floor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_13","019_39_13","JOB","39","13","13","The wings of the ostrich flap joyfully, but cannot match the pinions and feathers of the stork. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_14","019_39_14","JOB","39","14","14","For she leaves her eggs on the ground and lets them warm in the sand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_15","019_39_15","JOB","39","15","15","She forgets that a foot may crush them, or a wild animal may trample them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_16","019_39_16","JOB","39","16","16","She treats her young harshly, as if not her own, with no concern that her labor was in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_17","019_39_17","JOB","39","17","17","For God has deprived her of wisdom; He has not endowed her with understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_18","019_39_18","JOB","39","18","18","Yet when she proudly spreads her wings, she laughs at the horse and its rider. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_19","019_39_19","JOB","39","19","19","Do you give strength to the horse or adorn his neck with a mane? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_20","019_39_20","JOB","39","20","20","Do you make him leap like a locust, striking terror with his proud snorting? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_21","019_39_21","JOB","39","21","21","He paws in the valley and rejoices in his strength; he charges into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_22","019_39_22","JOB","39","22","22","He laughs at fear, frightened of nothing; he does not turn back from the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_23","019_39_23","JOB","39","23","23","A quiver rattles at his side, along with a flashing spear and lance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_24","019_39_24","JOB","39","24","24","Trembling with excitement, he devours the distance; he cannot stand still when the ram’s horn sounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_25","019_39_25","JOB","39","25","25","At the blast of the horn, he snorts with fervor. He catches the scent of battle from afar, the shouts of captains and the cry of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_26","019_39_26","JOB","39","26","26","Does the hawk take flight by your understanding and spread his wings toward the south? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_27","019_39_27","JOB","39","27","27","Does the eagle soar at your command and make his nest on high? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_28","019_39_28","JOB","39","28","28","He dwells on a cliff and lodges there; his stronghold is on a rocky crag. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_29","019_39_29","JOB","39","29","29","From there he spies out food; his eyes see it from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB39_30","019_39_30","JOB","39","30","30","His young ones feast on blood; and where the slain are, there he is.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_1","019_40_1","JOB","40","1","1","And the LORD said to Job: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_2","019_40_2","JOB","40","2","2","“Will the faultfinder contend with the Almighty? Let him who argues with God give an answer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_3","019_40_3","JOB","40","3","3","Then Job answered the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_4","019_40_4","JOB","40","4","4","“Behold, I am insignificant. How can I reply to You? I place my hand over my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_5","019_40_5","JOB","40","5","5","I have spoken once, but I have no answer—twice, but I have nothing to add.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_6","019_40_6","JOB","40","6","6","Then the LORD answered Job out of the whirlwind and said: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_7","019_40_7","JOB","40","7","7","“Now brace yourself like a man; I will question you, and you shall inform Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_8","019_40_8","JOB","40","8","8","Would you really annul My justice? Would you condemn Me to justify yourself? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_9","019_40_9","JOB","40","9","9","Do you have an arm like God’s? Can you thunder with a voice like His? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_10","019_40_10","JOB","40","10","10","Then adorn yourself with majesty and splendor, and clothe yourself with honor and glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_11","019_40_11","JOB","40","11","11","Unleash the fury of your wrath; look on every proud man and bring him low. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_12","019_40_12","JOB","40","12","12","Look on every proud man and humble him; trample the wicked where they stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_13","019_40_13","JOB","40","13","13","Bury them together in the dust; imprison them in the grave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_14","019_40_14","JOB","40","14","14","Then I will confess to you that your own right hand can save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_15","019_40_15","JOB","40","15","15","Look at Behemoth, which I made along with you. He feeds on grass like an ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_16","019_40_16","JOB","40","16","16","See the strength of his loins and the power in the muscles of his belly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_17","019_40_17","JOB","40","17","17","His tail sways like a cedar; the sinews of his thighs are tightly knit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_18","019_40_18","JOB","40","18","18","His bones are tubes of bronze; his limbs are rods of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_19","019_40_19","JOB","40","19","19","He is the foremost of God’s works; only his Maker can draw the sword against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_20","019_40_20","JOB","40","20","20","The hills yield him their produce, while all the beasts of the field play nearby. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_21","019_40_21","JOB","40","21","21","He lies under the lotus plants, hidden among the reeds of the marsh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_22","019_40_22","JOB","40","22","22","The lotus plants conceal him in their shade; the willows of the brook surround him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_23","019_40_23","JOB","40","23","23","Though the river rages, Behemoth is unafraid; he remains secure, though the Jordan surges to his mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB40_24","019_40_24","JOB","40","24","24","Can anyone capture him as he looks on, or pierce his nose with a snare? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_1","019_41_1","JOB","41","1","1","“Can you pull in Leviathan with a hook or tie down his tongue with a rope? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_2","019_41_2","JOB","41","2","2","Can you put a cord through his nose or pierce his jaw with a hook? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_3","019_41_3","JOB","41","3","3","Will he beg you for mercy or speak to you softly? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_4","019_41_4","JOB","41","4","4","Will he make a covenant with you to take him as a slave for life? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_5","019_41_5","JOB","41","5","5","Can you pet him like a bird or put him on a leash for your maidens? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_6","019_41_6","JOB","41","6","6","Will traders barter for him or divide him among the merchants? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_7","019_41_7","JOB","41","7","7","Can you fill his hide with harpoons or his head with fishing spears? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_8","019_41_8","JOB","41","8","8","If you lay a hand on him, you will remember the battle and never repeat it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_9","019_41_9","JOB","41","9","9","Surely hope of overcoming him is false. Is not the sight of him overwhelming? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_10","019_41_10","JOB","41","10","10","No one is so fierce as to rouse Leviathan. Then who is able to stand against Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_11","019_41_11","JOB","41","11","11","Who has given to Me that I should repay him? Everything under heaven is Mine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_12","019_41_12","JOB","41","12","12","I cannot keep silent about his limbs, his power and graceful form. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_13","019_41_13","JOB","41","13","13","Who can strip off his outer coat? Who can approach him with a bridle? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_14","019_41_14","JOB","41","14","14","Who can open his jaws, ringed by his fearsome teeth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_15","019_41_15","JOB","41","15","15","His rows of scales are his pride, tightly sealed together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_16","019_41_16","JOB","41","16","16","One scale is so near to another that no air can pass between them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_17","019_41_17","JOB","41","17","17","They are joined to one another; they clasp and cannot be separated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_18","019_41_18","JOB","41","18","18","His snorting flashes with light, and his eyes are like the rays of dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_19","019_41_19","JOB","41","19","19","Firebrands stream from his mouth; fiery sparks shoot forth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_20","019_41_20","JOB","41","20","20","Smoke billows from his nostrils as from a boiling pot over burning reeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_21","019_41_21","JOB","41","21","21","His breath sets coals ablaze, and flames pour from his mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_22","019_41_22","JOB","41","22","22","Strength resides in his neck, and dismay leaps before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_23","019_41_23","JOB","41","23","23","The folds of his flesh are tightly joined; they are firm and immovable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_24","019_41_24","JOB","41","24","24","His chest is as hard as a rock, as hard as a lower millstone! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_25","019_41_25","JOB","41","25","25","When Leviathan rises up, the mighty are terrified; they withdraw before his thrashing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_26","019_41_26","JOB","41","26","26","The sword that reaches him has no effect, nor does the spear or dart or arrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_27","019_41_27","JOB","41","27","27","He regards iron as straw and bronze as rotten wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_28","019_41_28","JOB","41","28","28","No arrow can make him flee; slingstones become like chaff to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_29","019_41_29","JOB","41","29","29","A club is regarded as straw, and he laughs at the sound of the lance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_30","019_41_30","JOB","41","30","30","His undersides are jagged potsherds, spreading out the mud like a threshing sledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_31","019_41_31","JOB","41","31","31","He makes the depths seethe like a cauldron; he makes the sea like a jar of ointment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_32","019_41_32","JOB","41","32","32","He leaves a glistening wake behind him; one would think the deep had white hair! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_33","019_41_33","JOB","41","33","33","Nothing on earth is his equal—a creature devoid of fear! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB41_34","019_41_34","JOB","41","34","34","He looks down on all the haughty; he is king over all the proud.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_1","019_42_1","JOB","42","1","1","Then Job replied to the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_2","019_42_2","JOB","42","2","2","“I know that You can do all things and that no plan of Yours can be thwarted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_3","019_42_3","JOB","42","3","3","You asked, ‘Who is this who conceals My counsel without knowledge?’ Surely I spoke of things I did not understand, things too wonderful for me to know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_4","019_42_4","JOB","42","4","4","You said, ‘Listen now, and I will speak. I will question you, and you shall inform Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_5","019_42_5","JOB","42","5","5","My ears had heard of You, but now my eyes have seen You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_6","019_42_6","JOB","42","6","6","Therefore I despise myself, and I repent in dust and ashes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_7","019_42_7","JOB","42","7","7","After the LORD had spoken these words to Job, He said to Eliphaz the Temanite, “My wrath is kindled against you and your two friends. For you have not spoken about Me accurately, as My servant Job has. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_8","019_42_8","JOB","42","8","8","So now, take seven bulls and seven rams, go to My servant Job, and sacrifice a burnt offering for yourselves. Then My servant Job will pray for you, for I will accept his prayer and not deal with you according to your folly. For you have not spoken accurately about Me, as My servant Job has.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_9","019_42_9","JOB","42","9","9","So Eliphaz the Temanite, Bildad the Shuhite, and Zophar the Naamathite went and did as the LORD had told them; and the LORD accepted Job’s prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_10","019_42_10","JOB","42","10","10","After Job had prayed for his friends, the LORD restored his prosperity and doubled his former possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_11","019_42_11","JOB","42","11","11","All his brothers and sisters and prior acquaintances came and dined with him in his house. They consoled him and comforted him over all the adversity that the LORD had brought upon him. And each one gave him a piece of silver and a gold ring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_12","019_42_12","JOB","42","12","12","So the LORD blessed Job’s latter days more than his first. He owned 14,000 sheep, 6,000 camels, 1,000 yoke of oxen, and 1,000 female donkeys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_13","019_42_13","JOB","42","13","13","And he also had seven sons and three daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_14","019_42_14","JOB","42","14","14","He named his first daughter Jemimah, his second Keziah, and his third Keren-happuch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_15","019_42_15","JOB","42","15","15","No women as beautiful as Job’s daughters could be found in all the land, and their father granted them an inheritance among their brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_16","019_42_16","JOB","42","16","16","After this, Job lived 140 years and saw his children and their children to the fourth generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JB42_17","019_42_17","JOB","42","17","17","And so Job died, old and full of years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_1","020_1_1","PSA","1","1","1","Blessed is the man who does not walk in the counsel of the wicked, or set foot on the path of sinners, or sit in the seat of mockers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_2","020_1_2","PSA","1","2","2","But his delight is in the Law of the LORD, and on His law he meditates day and night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_3","020_1_3","PSA","1","3","3","He is like a tree planted by streams of water, yielding its fruit in season, whose leaf does not wither, and who prospers in all he does. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_4","020_1_4","PSA","1","4","4","Not so the wicked! For they are like chaff driven off by the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_5","020_1_5","PSA","1","5","5","Therefore the wicked will not stand in the judgment, nor sinners in the assembly of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS1_6","020_1_6","PSA","1","6","6","For the LORD guards the path of the righteous, but the way of the wicked will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_1","020_2_1","PSA","2","1","1","Why do the nations rage and the peoples plot in vain? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_2","020_2_2","PSA","2","2","2","The kings of the earth take their stand and the rulers gather together, against the LORD and against His Anointed One: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_3","020_2_3","PSA","2","3","3","“Let us break Their chains and cast away Their cords.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_4","020_2_4","PSA","2","4","4","The One enthroned in heaven laughs; the Lord taunts them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_5","020_2_5","PSA","2","5","5","Then He rebukes them in His anger, and terrifies them in His fury: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_6","020_2_6","PSA","2","6","6","“I have installed My King on Zion, upon My holy mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_7","020_2_7","PSA","2","7","7","I will proclaim the decree spoken to Me by the LORD: “You are My Son; today I have become Your Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_8","020_2_8","PSA","2","8","8","Ask Me, and I will make the nations Your inheritance, the ends of the earth Your possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_9","020_2_9","PSA","2","9","9","You will break them with an iron scepter; You will shatter them like pottery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_10","020_2_10","PSA","2","10","10","Therefore be wise, O kings; be admonished, O judges of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_11","020_2_11","PSA","2","11","11","Serve the LORD with fear, and rejoice with trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS2_12","020_2_12","PSA","2","12","12","Kiss the Son, lest He be angry and you perish in your rebellion, when His wrath ignites in an instant. Blessed are all who take refuge in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_1","020_3_1","PSA","3","1","1","A Psalm of David, when he fled from his son Absalom. O LORD, how my foes have increased! How many rise up against me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_2","020_3_2","PSA","3","2","2","Many say of me, “God will not deliver him.” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_3","020_3_3","PSA","3","3","3","But You, O LORD, are a shield around me, my glory, and the One who lifts my head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_4","020_3_4","PSA","3","4","4","To the LORD I cry aloud, and He answers me from His holy mountain. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_5","020_3_5","PSA","3","5","5","I lie down and sleep; I wake again, for the LORD sustains me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_6","020_3_6","PSA","3","6","6","I will not fear the myriads set against me on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_7","020_3_7","PSA","3","7","7","Arise, O LORD! Save me, O my God! Strike all my enemies on the jaw; break the teeth of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS3_8","020_3_8","PSA","3","8","8","Salvation belongs to the LORD; may Your blessing be on Your people. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_1","020_4_1","PSA","4","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. A Psalm of David. Answer me when I call, O God of my righteousness! You have relieved my distress; show me grace and hear my prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_2","020_4_2","PSA","4","2","2","How long, O men, will my honor be maligned? How long will you love vanity and seek after lies? Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_3","020_4_3","PSA","4","3","3","Know that the LORD has set apart the godly for Himself; the LORD hears when I call to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_4","020_4_4","PSA","4","4","4","Be angry, yet do not sin; on your bed, search your heart and be still. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_5","020_4_5","PSA","4","5","5","Offer the sacrifices of the righteous and trust in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_6","020_4_6","PSA","4","6","6","Many ask, “Who can show us the good?” Shine the light of Your face upon us, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_7","020_4_7","PSA","4","7","7","You have filled my heart with more joy than when grain and new wine abound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS4_8","020_4_8","PSA","4","8","8","I will lie down and sleep in peace, for You alone, O LORD, make me dwell in safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_1","020_5_1","PSA","5","1","1","For the choirmaster, to be accompanied by flutes. A Psalm of David. Give ear to my words, O LORD; consider my groaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_2","020_5_2","PSA","5","2","2","Attend to the sound of my cry, my King and my God, for to You I pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_3","020_5_3","PSA","5","3","3","In the morning, O LORD, You hear my voice; at daybreak I lay my plea before You and wait in expectation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_4","020_5_4","PSA","5","4","4","For You are not a God who delights in wickedness; no evil can dwell with You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_5","020_5_5","PSA","5","5","5","The boastful cannot stand in Your presence; You hate all workers of iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_6","020_5_6","PSA","5","6","6","You destroy those who tell lies; the LORD abhors the man of bloodshed and deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_7","020_5_7","PSA","5","7","7","But I will enter Your house by the abundance of Your loving devotion; in reverence I will bow down toward Your holy temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_8","020_5_8","PSA","5","8","8","Lead me, O LORD, in Your righteousness because of my enemies; make straight Your way before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_9","020_5_9","PSA","5","9","9","For not a word they speak can be trusted; destruction lies within them. Their throats are open graves; their tongues practice deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_10","020_5_10","PSA","5","10","10","Declare them guilty, O God; let them fall by their own devices. Drive them out for their many transgressions, for they have rebelled against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_11","020_5_11","PSA","5","11","11","But let all who take refuge in You rejoice; let them ever shout for joy. May You shelter them, that those who love Your name may rejoice in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS5_12","020_5_12","PSA","5","12","12","For surely You, O LORD, bless the righteous; You surround them with the shield of Your favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_1","020_6_1","PSA","6","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments, according to Sheminith. A Psalm of David. O LORD, do not rebuke me in Your anger or discipline me in Your wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_2","020_6_2","PSA","6","2","2","Be merciful to me, O LORD, for I am frail; heal me, O LORD, for my bones are in agony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_3","020_6_3","PSA","6","3","3","My soul is deeply distressed. How long, O LORD, how long? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_4","020_6_4","PSA","6","4","4","Turn, O LORD, and deliver my soul; save me because of Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_5","020_6_5","PSA","6","5","5","For there is no mention of You in death; who can praise You from Sheol? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_6","020_6_6","PSA","6","6","6","I am weary from groaning; all night I flood my bed with weeping and drench my couch with tears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_7","020_6_7","PSA","6","7","7","My eyes fail from grief; they grow dim because of all my foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_8","020_6_8","PSA","6","8","8","Depart from me, all you workers of iniquity, for the LORD has heard my weeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_9","020_6_9","PSA","6","9","9","The LORD has heard my cry for mercy; the LORD accepts my prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS6_10","020_6_10","PSA","6","10","10","All my enemies will be ashamed and dismayed; they will turn back in sudden disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_1","020_7_1","PSA","7","1","1","A Shiggaion of David, which he sang to the LORD concerning the words of Cush, a Benjamite. O LORD my God, I take refuge in You; save me and deliver me from all my pursuers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_2","020_7_2","PSA","7","2","2","or they will shred my soul like a lion and tear me to pieces with no one to rescue me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_3","020_7_3","PSA","7","3","3","O LORD my God, if I have done this, if injustice is on my hands, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_4","020_7_4","PSA","7","4","4","if I have rewarded my ally with evil, if I have plundered my foe without cause, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_5","020_7_5","PSA","7","5","5","then may my enemy pursue me and overtake me; may he trample me to the ground and leave my honor in the dust. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_6","020_7_6","PSA","7","6","6","Arise, O LORD, in Your anger; rise up against the fury of my enemies. Awake, my God, and ordain judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_7","020_7_7","PSA","7","7","7","Let the assembled peoples gather around You; take Your seat over them on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_8","020_7_8","PSA","7","8","8","The LORD judges the peoples; vindicate me, O LORD, according to my righteousness and integrity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_9","020_7_9","PSA","7","9","9","Put an end to the evil of the wicked, but establish the righteous, O righteous God who searches hearts and minds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_10","020_7_10","PSA","7","10","10","My shield is with God, who saves the upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_11","020_7_11","PSA","7","11","11","God is a righteous judge and a God who feels indignation each day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_12","020_7_12","PSA","7","12","12","If one does not repent, God will sharpen His sword; He has bent and strung His bow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_13","020_7_13","PSA","7","13","13","He has prepared His deadly weapons; He ordains His arrows with fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_14","020_7_14","PSA","7","14","14","Behold, the wicked man travails with evil; he conceives trouble and births falsehood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_15","020_7_15","PSA","7","15","15","He has dug a hole and hollowed it out; he has fallen into a pit of his own making. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_16","020_7_16","PSA","7","16","16","His trouble recoils on himself, and his violence falls on his own head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS7_17","020_7_17","PSA","7","17","17","I will thank the LORD for His righteousness and sing praise to the name of the LORD Most High. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_1","020_8_1","PSA","8","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Gittith. A Psalm of David. O LORD, our Lord, how majestic is Your name in all the earth! You have set Your glory above the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_2","020_8_2","PSA","8","2","2","From the mouths of children and infants You have ordained praise on account of Your adversaries, to silence the enemy and avenger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_3","020_8_3","PSA","8","3","3","When I behold Your heavens, the work of Your fingers, the moon and the stars, which You have set in place— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_4","020_8_4","PSA","8","4","4","what is man that You are mindful of him, or the son of man that You care for him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_5","020_8_5","PSA","8","5","5","You made him a little lower than the angels; You crowned him with glory and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_6","020_8_6","PSA","8","6","6","You made him ruler of the works of Your hands; You have placed everything under his feet: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_7","020_8_7","PSA","8","7","7","all sheep and oxen, and even the beasts of the field, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_8","020_8_8","PSA","8","8","8","the birds of the air and the fish of the sea, all that swim the paths of the seas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS8_9","020_8_9","PSA","8","9","9","O LORD, our Lord, how majestic is Your name in all the earth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_1","020_9_1","PSA","9","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Death of the Son.” A Psalm of David. I will give thanks to the LORD with all my heart; I will recount all Your wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_2","020_9_2","PSA","9","2","2","I will be glad and rejoice in You; I will sing praise to Your name, O Most High. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_3","020_9_3","PSA","9","3","3","When my enemies retreat, they stumble and perish before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_4","020_9_4","PSA","9","4","4","For You have upheld my just cause; You sit on Your throne judging righteously. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_5","020_9_5","PSA","9","5","5","You have rebuked the nations; You have destroyed the wicked; You have erased their name forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_6","020_9_6","PSA","9","6","6","The enemy has come to eternal ruin, and You have uprooted their cities; the very memory of them has vanished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_7","020_9_7","PSA","9","7","7","But the LORD abides forever; He has established His throne for judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_8","020_9_8","PSA","9","8","8","He judges the world with justice; He governs the people with equity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_9","020_9_9","PSA","9","9","9","The LORD is a refuge for the oppressed, a stronghold in times of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_10","020_9_10","PSA","9","10","10","Those who know Your name trust in You, for You, O LORD, have not forsaken those who seek You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_11","020_9_11","PSA","9","11","11","Sing praises to the LORD, who dwells in Zion; proclaim His deeds among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_12","020_9_12","PSA","9","12","12","For the Avenger of bloodshed remembers; He does not ignore the cry of the afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_13","020_9_13","PSA","9","13","13","Be merciful to me, O LORD; see how my enemies afflict me! Lift me up from the gates of death, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_14","020_9_14","PSA","9","14","14","that I may declare all Your praises—that within the gates of Daughter Zion I may rejoice in Your salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_15","020_9_15","PSA","9","15","15","The nations have fallen into a pit of their making; their feet are caught in the net they have hidden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_16","020_9_16","PSA","9","16","16","The LORD is known by the justice He brings; the wicked are ensnared by the work of their hands. Higgaion Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_17","020_9_17","PSA","9","17","17","The wicked will return to Sheol—all the nations who forget God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_18","020_9_18","PSA","9","18","18","For the needy will not always be forgotten; nor the hope of the oppressed forever dashed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_19","020_9_19","PSA","9","19","19","Rise up, O LORD, do not let man prevail; let the nations be judged in Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS9_20","020_9_20","PSA","9","20","20","Lay terror upon them, O LORD; let the nations know they are but men. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_1","020_10_1","PSA","10","1","1","Why, O LORD, do You stand far off? Why do You hide in times of trouble? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_2","020_10_2","PSA","10","2","2","In pride the wicked pursue the needy; let them be caught in the schemes they devise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_3","020_10_3","PSA","10","3","3","For the wicked man boasts in the cravings of his heart; he blesses the greedy and reviles the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_4","020_10_4","PSA","10","4","4","In his pride the wicked man does not seek Him; in all his schemes there is no God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_5","020_10_5","PSA","10","5","5","He is secure in his ways at all times; Your lofty judgments are far from him; he sneers at all his foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_6","020_10_6","PSA","10","6","6","He says to himself, “I will not be moved; from age to age I am free of distress.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_7","020_10_7","PSA","10","7","7","His mouth is full of cursing, deceit, and violence; trouble and malice are under his tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_8","020_10_8","PSA","10","8","8","He lies in wait near the villages; in ambush he slays the innocent; his eyes watch in stealth for the helpless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_9","020_10_9","PSA","10","9","9","He lies in wait like a lion in a thicket; he lurks to seize the oppressed; he catches the lowly in his net. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_10","020_10_10","PSA","10","10","10","They are crushed and beaten down; the helpless fall prey to his strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_11","020_10_11","PSA","10","11","11","He says to himself, “God has forgotten; He hides His face and never sees.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_12","020_10_12","PSA","10","12","12","Arise, O LORD! Lift up Your hand, O God! Do not forget the helpless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_13","020_10_13","PSA","10","13","13","Why has the wicked man renounced God? He says to himself, “You will never call me to account.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_14","020_10_14","PSA","10","14","14","But You have regarded trouble and grief; You see to repay it by Your hand. The victim entrusts himself to You; You are the helper of the fatherless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_15","020_10_15","PSA","10","15","15","Break the arm of the wicked and evildoer; call him to account for his wickedness until none is left to be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_16","020_10_16","PSA","10","16","16","The LORD is King forever and ever; the nations perish from His land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_17","020_10_17","PSA","10","17","17","You have heard, O LORD, the desire of the humble; You will strengthen their hearts. You will incline Your ear, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS10_18","020_10_18","PSA","10","18","18","to vindicate the fatherless and oppressed, that the men of the earth may strike terror no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_1","020_11_1","PSA","11","1","1","For the choirmaster. Of David. In the LORD I take refuge. How then can you say to me: “Flee like a bird to your mountain! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_2","020_11_2","PSA","11","2","2","For behold, the wicked bend their bows. They set their arrow on the string to shoot from the shadows at the upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_3","020_11_3","PSA","11","3","3","If the foundations are destroyed, what can the righteous do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_4","020_11_4","PSA","11","4","4","The LORD is in His holy temple; the LORD is on His heavenly throne. His eyes are watching closely; they examine the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_5","020_11_5","PSA","11","5","5","The LORD tests the righteous and the wicked; His soul hates the lover of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_6","020_11_6","PSA","11","6","6","On the wicked He will rain down fiery coals and sulfur; a scorching wind will be their portion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS11_7","020_11_7","PSA","11","7","7","For the LORD is righteous; He loves justice. The upright will see His face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_1","020_12_1","PSA","12","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Sheminith. A Psalm of David. Help, O LORD, for the godly are no more; the faithful have vanished from among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_2","020_12_2","PSA","12","2","2","They lie to one another; they speak with flattering lips and a double heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_3","020_12_3","PSA","12","3","3","May the LORD cut off all flattering lips and every boastful tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_4","020_12_4","PSA","12","4","4","They say, “With our tongues we will prevail. We own our lips—who can be our master?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_5","020_12_5","PSA","12","5","5","“For the cause of the oppressed and for the groaning of the needy, I will now arise,” says the LORD. “I will bring safety to him who yearns.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_6","020_12_6","PSA","12","6","6","The words of the LORD are flawless, like silver refined in a furnace, like gold purified sevenfold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_7","020_12_7","PSA","12","7","7","You, O LORD, will keep us; You will forever guard us from this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS12_8","020_12_8","PSA","12","8","8","The wicked wander freely, and vileness is exalted among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_1","020_13_1","PSA","13","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. How long, O LORD? Will You forget me forever? How long will You hide Your face from me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_2","020_13_2","PSA","13","2","2","How long must I wrestle in my soul, with sorrow in my heart each day? How long will my enemy dominate me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_3","020_13_3","PSA","13","3","3","Consider me and respond, O LORD my God. Give light to my eyes, lest I sleep in death, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_4","020_13_4","PSA","13","4","4","lest my enemy say, “I have overcome him,” and my foes rejoice when I fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_5","020_13_5","PSA","13","5","5","But I have trusted in Your loving devotion; my heart will rejoice in Your salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS13_6","020_13_6","PSA","13","6","6","I will sing to the LORD, for He has been good to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_1","020_14_1","PSA","14","1","1","For the choirmaster. Of David. The fool says in his heart, “There is no God.” They are corrupt; their acts are vile. There is no one who does good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_2","020_14_2","PSA","14","2","2","The LORD looks down from heaven upon the sons of men to see if any understand, if any seek God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_3","020_14_3","PSA","14","3","3","All have turned away, they have together become corrupt; there is no one who does good, not even one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_4","020_14_4","PSA","14","4","4","Will the workers of iniquity never learn? They devour my people like bread; they refuse to call upon the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_5","020_14_5","PSA","14","5","5","There they are, overwhelmed with dread, for God is in the company of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_6","020_14_6","PSA","14","6","6","You sinners frustrate the plans of the oppressed, yet the LORD is their shelter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS14_7","020_14_7","PSA","14","7","7","Oh, that the salvation of Israel would come from Zion! When the LORD restores His captive people, let Jacob rejoice, let Israel be glad! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS15_1","020_15_1","PSA","15","1","1","A Psalm of David. O LORD, who may abide in Your tent? Who may dwell on Your holy mountain? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS15_2","020_15_2","PSA","15","2","2","He who walks with integrity and practices righteousness, who speaks the truth from his heart, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS15_3","020_15_3","PSA","15","3","3","who has no slander on his tongue, who does no harm to his neighbor, who casts no scorn on his friend, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS15_4","020_15_4","PSA","15","4","4","who despises the vile but honors those who fear the LORD, who does not revise a costly oath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS15_5","020_15_5","PSA","15","5","5","who lends his money without interest and refuses a bribe against the innocent. He who does these things will never be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_1","020_16_1","PSA","16","1","1","A Miktam of David. Preserve me, O God, for in You I take refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_2","020_16_2","PSA","16","2","2","I said to the LORD, “You are my Lord; apart from You I have no good thing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_3","020_16_3","PSA","16","3","3","As for the saints in the land, they are the excellence in whom all my delight resides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_4","020_16_4","PSA","16","4","4","Sorrows will multiply to those who chase other gods. I will not pour out their libations of blood, or speak their names with my lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_5","020_16_5","PSA","16","5","5","The LORD is my chosen portion and my cup; You have made my lot secure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_6","020_16_6","PSA","16","6","6","The lines of my boundary have fallen in pleasant places; surely my inheritance is delightful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_7","020_16_7","PSA","16","7","7","I will bless the LORD who counsels me; even at night my conscience instructs me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_8","020_16_8","PSA","16","8","8","I have set the LORD always before me. Because He is at my right hand, I will not be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_9","020_16_9","PSA","16","9","9","Therefore my heart is glad and my tongue rejoices; my body also will dwell securely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_10","020_16_10","PSA","16","10","10","For You will not abandon my soul to Sheol, nor will You let Your Holy One see decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS16_11","020_16_11","PSA","16","11","11","You have made known to me the path of life; You will fill me with joy in Your presence, with eternal pleasures at Your right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_1","020_17_1","PSA","17","1","1","A prayer of David. Hear, O LORD, my righteous plea; listen to my cry. Give ear to my prayer—it comes from lips free of deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_2","020_17_2","PSA","17","2","2","May my vindication come from Your presence; may Your eyes see what is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_3","020_17_3","PSA","17","3","3","You have tried my heart; You have visited me in the night. You have tested me and found no evil; I have resolved not to sin with my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_4","020_17_4","PSA","17","4","4","As for the deeds of men—by the word of Your lips I have avoided the ways of the violent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_5","020_17_5","PSA","17","5","5","My steps have held to Your paths; my feet have not slipped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_6","020_17_6","PSA","17","6","6","I call on You, O God, for You will answer me. Incline Your ear to me; hear my words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_7","020_17_7","PSA","17","7","7","Show the wonders of Your loving devotion, You who save by Your right hand those who seek refuge from their foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_8","020_17_8","PSA","17","8","8","Keep me as the apple of Your eye; hide me in the shadow of Your wings ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_9","020_17_9","PSA","17","9","9","from the wicked who assail me, from my mortal enemies who surround me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_10","020_17_10","PSA","17","10","10","They have closed their callous hearts; their mouths speak with arrogance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_11","020_17_11","PSA","17","11","11","They have tracked us down, and now surround us; their eyes are set to cast us to the ground, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_12","020_17_12","PSA","17","12","12","like a lion greedy for prey, like a young lion lurking in ambush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_13","020_17_13","PSA","17","13","13","Arise, O LORD, confront them! Bring them to their knees; deliver me from the wicked by Your sword, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_14","020_17_14","PSA","17","14","14","from such men, O LORD, by Your hand—from men of the world whose portion is in this life. May You fill the bellies of Your treasured ones and satisfy their sons, so they leave their abundance to their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS17_15","020_17_15","PSA","17","15","15","As for me, I will behold Your face in righteousness; when I awake, I will be satisfied in Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_1","020_18_1","PSA","18","1","1","For the choirmaster. Of David the servant of the LORD, who sang this song to the LORD on the day the LORD had delivered him from the hand of all his enemies and from the hand of Saul. He said: I love You, O LORD, my strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_2","020_18_2","PSA","18","2","2","The LORD is my rock, my fortress, and my deliverer. My God is my rock, in whom I take refuge, my shield, and the horn of my salvation, my stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_3","020_18_3","PSA","18","3","3","I will call upon the LORD, who is worthy to be praised; so shall I be saved from my enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_4","020_18_4","PSA","18","4","4","The cords of death encompassed me; the torrents of chaos overwhelmed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_5","020_18_5","PSA","18","5","5","The cords of Sheol entangled me; the snares of death confronted me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_6","020_18_6","PSA","18","6","6","In my distress I called upon the LORD; I cried to my God for help. From His temple He heard my voice, and my cry for His help reached His ears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_7","020_18_7","PSA","18","7","7","Then the earth shook and quaked, and the foundations of the mountains trembled; they were shaken because He burned with anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_8","020_18_8","PSA","18","8","8","Smoke rose from His nostrils, and consuming fire came from His mouth; glowing coals blazed forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_9","020_18_9","PSA","18","9","9","He parted the heavens and came down with dark clouds beneath His feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_10","020_18_10","PSA","18","10","10","He mounted a cherub and flew; He soared on the wings of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_11","020_18_11","PSA","18","11","11","He made darkness His hiding place, and storm clouds a canopy around Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_12","020_18_12","PSA","18","12","12","From the brightness of His presence His clouds advanced—hailstones and coals of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_13","020_18_13","PSA","18","13","13","The LORD thundered from heaven; the voice of the Most High resounded—hailstones and coals of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_14","020_18_14","PSA","18","14","14","He shot His arrows and scattered the foes; He hurled lightning and routed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_15","020_18_15","PSA","18","15","15","The channels of the sea appeared, and the foundations of the world were exposed, at Your rebuke, O LORD, at the blast of the breath of Your nostrils. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_16","020_18_16","PSA","18","16","16","He reached down from on high and took hold of me; He drew me out of deep waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_17","020_18_17","PSA","18","17","17","He rescued me from my powerful enemy, from foes too mighty for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_18","020_18_18","PSA","18","18","18","They confronted me in my day of calamity, but the LORD was my support. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_19","020_18_19","PSA","18","19","19","He brought me out into the open; He rescued me because He delighted in me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_20","020_18_20","PSA","18","20","20","The LORD has rewarded me according to my righteousness; He has repaid me according to the cleanness of my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_21","020_18_21","PSA","18","21","21","For I have kept the ways of the LORD and have not wickedly departed from my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_22","020_18_22","PSA","18","22","22","For all His ordinances are before me; I have not disregarded His statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_23","020_18_23","PSA","18","23","23","And I have been blameless before Him and kept myself from iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_24","020_18_24","PSA","18","24","24","So the LORD has repaid me according to my righteousness, according to the cleanness of my hands in His sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_25","020_18_25","PSA","18","25","25","To the faithful You show Yourself faithful, to the blameless You show Yourself blameless; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_26","020_18_26","PSA","18","26","26","to the pure You show Yourself pure, but to the crooked You show Yourself shrewd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_27","020_18_27","PSA","18","27","27","For You save an afflicted people, but You humble those with haughty eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_28","020_18_28","PSA","18","28","28","For You, O LORD, light my lamp; my God lights up my darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_29","020_18_29","PSA","18","29","29","For in You I can charge an army, and with my God I can scale a wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_30","020_18_30","PSA","18","30","30","As for God, His way is perfect; the word of the LORD is flawless. He is a shield to all who take refuge in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_31","020_18_31","PSA","18","31","31","For who is God besides the LORD? And who is the Rock except our God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_32","020_18_32","PSA","18","32","32","It is God who arms me with strength and makes my way clear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_33","020_18_33","PSA","18","33","33","He makes my feet like those of a deer and stations me upon the heights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_34","020_18_34","PSA","18","34","34","He trains my hands for battle; my arms can bend a bow of bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_35","020_18_35","PSA","18","35","35","You have given me Your shield of salvation; Your right hand upholds me, and Your gentleness exalts me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_36","020_18_36","PSA","18","36","36","You broaden the path beneath me so that my ankles do not give way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_37","020_18_37","PSA","18","37","37","I pursued my enemies and overtook them; I did not turn back until they were consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_38","020_18_38","PSA","18","38","38","I crushed them so they could not rise; they have fallen under my feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_39","020_18_39","PSA","18","39","39","You have armed me with strength for battle; You have subdued my foes beneath me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_40","020_18_40","PSA","18","40","40","You have made my enemies retreat before me; I destroyed those who hated me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_41","020_18_41","PSA","18","41","41","They cried for help, but there was no one to save them—to the LORD, but He did not answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_42","020_18_42","PSA","18","42","42","I ground them as dust in the face of the wind; I trampled them like mud in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_43","020_18_43","PSA","18","43","43","You have delivered me from the strife of the people; You have made me the head of nations; a people I had not known shall serve me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_44","020_18_44","PSA","18","44","44","When they hear me, they obey me; foreigners cower before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_45","020_18_45","PSA","18","45","45","Foreigners lose heart and come trembling from their strongholds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_46","020_18_46","PSA","18","46","46","The LORD lives, and blessed be my Rock! And may the God of my salvation be exalted— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_47","020_18_47","PSA","18","47","47","the God who avenges me and subdues nations beneath me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_48","020_18_48","PSA","18","48","48","who delivers me from my enemies. You exalt me above my foes; You rescue me from violent men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_49","020_18_49","PSA","18","49","49","Therefore I will praise You, O LORD, among the nations; I will sing praises to Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS18_50","020_18_50","PSA","18","50","50","Great salvation He brings to His king. He shows loving devotion to His anointed, to David and his descendants forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_1","020_19_1","PSA","19","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. The heavens declare the glory of God; the skies proclaim the work of His hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_2","020_19_2","PSA","19","2","2","Day after day they pour forth speech; night after night they reveal knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_3","020_19_3","PSA","19","3","3","Without speech or language, without a sound to be heard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_4","020_19_4","PSA","19","4","4","their voice has gone out into all the earth, their words to the ends of the world. In the heavens He has pitched a tent for the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_5","020_19_5","PSA","19","5","5","Like a bridegroom emerging from his chamber, like a champion rejoicing to run his course, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_6","020_19_6","PSA","19","6","6","it rises at one end of the heavens and runs its circuit to the other; nothing is deprived of its warmth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_7","020_19_7","PSA","19","7","7","The Law of the LORD is perfect, reviving the soul; the testimony of the LORD is trustworthy, making wise the simple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_8","020_19_8","PSA","19","8","8","The precepts of the LORD are right, bringing joy to the heart; the commandments of the LORD are radiant, giving light to the eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_9","020_19_9","PSA","19","9","9","The fear of the LORD is pure, enduring forever; the judgments of the LORD are true, being altogether righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_10","020_19_10","PSA","19","10","10","They are more precious than gold, than much pure gold; they are sweeter than honey, than honey from the comb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_11","020_19_11","PSA","19","11","11","By them indeed Your servant is warned; in keeping them is great reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_12","020_19_12","PSA","19","12","12","Who can discern his own errors? Cleanse me from my hidden faults. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_13","020_19_13","PSA","19","13","13","Keep Your servant also from willful sins; may they not rule over me. Then I will be blameless and cleansed of great transgression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS19_14","020_19_14","PSA","19","14","14","May the words of my mouth and the meditation of my heart be pleasing in Your sight, O LORD, my Rock and my Redeemer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_1","020_20_1","PSA","20","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. May the LORD answer you in the day of trouble; may the name of the God of Jacob protect you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_2","020_20_2","PSA","20","2","2","May He send you help from the sanctuary and sustain you from Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_3","020_20_3","PSA","20","3","3","May He remember all your gifts and look favorably on your burnt offerings. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_4","020_20_4","PSA","20","4","4","May He give you the desires of your heart and make all your plans succeed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_5","020_20_5","PSA","20","5","5","May we shout for joy at your victory and raise a banner in the name of our God. May the LORD grant all your petitions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_6","020_20_6","PSA","20","6","6","Now I know that the LORD saves His anointed; He answers him from His holy heaven with the saving power of His right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_7","020_20_7","PSA","20","7","7","Some trust in chariots and others in horses, but we trust in the name of the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_8","020_20_8","PSA","20","8","8","They collapse and fall, but we rise up and stand firm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS20_9","020_20_9","PSA","20","9","9","O LORD, save the king. Answer us on the day we call. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_1","020_21_1","PSA","21","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. O LORD, the king rejoices in Your strength. How greatly he exults in Your salvation! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_2","020_21_2","PSA","21","2","2","You have granted his heart’s desire and have not withheld the request of his lips. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_3","020_21_3","PSA","21","3","3","For You welcomed him with rich blessings; You placed on his head a crown of pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_4","020_21_4","PSA","21","4","4","He asked You for life, and You granted it—length of days, forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_5","020_21_5","PSA","21","5","5","Great is his glory in Your salvation; You bestow on him splendor and majesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_6","020_21_6","PSA","21","6","6","For You grant him blessings forever; You cheer him with joy in Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_7","020_21_7","PSA","21","7","7","For the king trusts in the LORD; through the loving devotion of the Most High, he will not be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_8","020_21_8","PSA","21","8","8","Your hand will apprehend all Your enemies; Your right hand will seize those who hate You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_9","020_21_9","PSA","21","9","9","You will place them in a fiery furnace at the time of Your appearing. In His wrath the LORD will engulf them, and the fire will consume them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_10","020_21_10","PSA","21","10","10","You will wipe their descendants from the earth, and their offspring from the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_11","020_21_11","PSA","21","11","11","Though they intend You harm, the schemes they devise will not prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_12","020_21_12","PSA","21","12","12","For You will put them to flight when Your bow is trained upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS21_13","020_21_13","PSA","21","13","13","Be exalted, O LORD, in Your strength; we will sing and praise Your power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_1","020_22_1","PSA","22","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Doe of the Dawn.” A Psalm of David. My God, my God, why have You forsaken me? Why are You so far from saving me, so far from my words of groaning? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_2","020_22_2","PSA","22","2","2","I cry out by day, O my God, but You do not answer, and by night, but I have no rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_3","020_22_3","PSA","22","3","3","Yet You are holy, enthroned on the praises of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_4","020_22_4","PSA","22","4","4","In You our fathers trusted; they trusted and You delivered them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_5","020_22_5","PSA","22","5","5","They cried out to You and were set free; they trusted in You and were not disappointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_6","020_22_6","PSA","22","6","6","But I am a worm and not a man, scorned by men and despised by the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_7","020_22_7","PSA","22","7","7","All who see me mock me; they sneer and shake their heads: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_8","020_22_8","PSA","22","8","8","“He trusts in the LORD, let the LORD deliver him; let the LORD rescue him, since He delights in him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_9","020_22_9","PSA","22","9","9","Yet You brought me forth from the womb; You made me secure at my mother’s breast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_10","020_22_10","PSA","22","10","10","From birth I was cast upon You; from my mother’s womb You have been my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_11","020_22_11","PSA","22","11","11","Be not far from me, for trouble is near and there is no one to help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_12","020_22_12","PSA","22","12","12","Many bulls surround me; strong bulls of Bashan encircle me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_13","020_22_13","PSA","22","13","13","They open their jaws against me like lions that roar and maul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_14","020_22_14","PSA","22","14","14","I am poured out like water, and all my bones are disjointed. My heart is like wax; it melts away within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_15","020_22_15","PSA","22","15","15","My strength is dried up like a potsherd, and my tongue sticks to the roof of my mouth. You lay me in the dust of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_16","020_22_16","PSA","22","16","16","For dogs surround me; a band of evil men encircles me; they have pierced my hands and feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_17","020_22_17","PSA","22","17","17","I can count all my bones; they stare and gloat over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_18","020_22_18","PSA","22","18","18","They divide my garments among them and cast lots for my clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_19","020_22_19","PSA","22","19","19","But You, O LORD, be not far off; O my Strength, come quickly to help me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_20","020_22_20","PSA","22","20","20","Deliver my soul from the sword, my precious life from the power of wild dogs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_21","020_22_21","PSA","22","21","21","Save me from the mouth of the lion; at the horns of the wild oxen You have answered me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_22","020_22_22","PSA","22","22","22","I will proclaim Your name to my brothers; I will praise You in the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_23","020_22_23","PSA","22","23","23","You who fear the LORD, praise Him! All descendants of Jacob, honor Him! All offspring of Israel, revere Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_24","020_22_24","PSA","22","24","24","For He has not despised or detested the torment of the afflicted. He has not hidden His face from him, but has attended to his cry for help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_25","020_22_25","PSA","22","25","25","My praise for You resounds in the great assembly; I will fulfill my vows before those who fear You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_26","020_22_26","PSA","22","26","26","The poor will eat and be satisfied; those who seek the LORD will praise Him. May your hearts live forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_27","020_22_27","PSA","22","27","27","All the ends of the earth will remember and turn to the LORD. All the families of the nations will bow down before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_28","020_22_28","PSA","22","28","28","For dominion belongs to the LORD and He rules over the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_29","020_22_29","PSA","22","29","29","All the rich of the earth will feast and worship; all who go down to the dust will kneel before Him—even those unable to preserve their lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_30","020_22_30","PSA","22","30","30","Posterity will serve Him; they will declare the Lord to a new generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS22_31","020_22_31","PSA","22","31","31","They will come and proclaim His righteousness to a people yet unborn—all that He has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_1","020_23_1","PSA","23","1","1","A Psalm of David. The LORD is my shepherd; I shall not want. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_2","020_23_2","PSA","23","2","2","He makes me lie down in green pastures; He leads me beside quiet waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_3","020_23_3","PSA","23","3","3","He restores my soul; He guides me in the paths of righteousness for the sake of His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_4","020_23_4","PSA","23","4","4","Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for You are with me; Your rod and Your staff, they comfort me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_5","020_23_5","PSA","23","5","5","You prepare a table before me in the presence of my enemies. You anoint my head with oil; my cup overflows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS23_6","020_23_6","PSA","23","6","6","Surely goodness and mercy will follow me all the days of my life, and I will dwell in the house of the LORD forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_1","020_24_1","PSA","24","1","1","A Psalm of David. The earth is the LORD’s, and the fullness thereof, the world and all who dwell therein. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_2","020_24_2","PSA","24","2","2","For He has founded it upon the seas and established it upon the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_3","020_24_3","PSA","24","3","3","Who may ascend the hill of the LORD? Who may stand in His holy place? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_4","020_24_4","PSA","24","4","4","He who has clean hands and a pure heart, who does not lift up his soul to an idol or swear deceitfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_5","020_24_5","PSA","24","5","5","He will receive blessing from the LORD and vindication from the God of his salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_6","020_24_6","PSA","24","6","6","Such is the generation of those who seek Him, who seek Your face, O God of Jacob. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_7","020_24_7","PSA","24","7","7","Lift up your heads, O gates! Be lifted up, O ancient doors, that the King of Glory may enter! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_8","020_24_8","PSA","24","8","8","Who is this King of Glory? The LORD strong and mighty, the LORD mighty in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_9","020_24_9","PSA","24","9","9","Lift up your heads, O gates! Be lifted up, O ancient doors, that the King of Glory may enter! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS24_10","020_24_10","PSA","24","10","10","Who is He, this King of Glory? The LORD of Hosts—He is the King of Glory. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_1","020_25_1","PSA","25","1","1","Of David. To You, O LORD, I lift up my soul; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_2","020_25_2","PSA","25","2","2","in You, my God, I trust. Do not let me be put to shame; do not let my enemies exult over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_3","020_25_3","PSA","25","3","3","Surely none who wait for You will be put to shame; but those who engage in treachery without cause will be disgraced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_4","020_25_4","PSA","25","4","4","Show me Your ways, O LORD; teach me Your paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_5","020_25_5","PSA","25","5","5","Guide me in Your truth and teach me, for You are the God of my salvation; all day long I wait for You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_6","020_25_6","PSA","25","6","6","Remember, O LORD, Your compassion and loving devotion, for they are from age to age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_7","020_25_7","PSA","25","7","7","Remember not the sins of my youth, nor my rebellious acts; remember me according to Your loving devotion, because of Your goodness, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_8","020_25_8","PSA","25","8","8","Good and upright is the LORD; therefore He shows sinners the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_9","020_25_9","PSA","25","9","9","He guides the humble in what is right and teaches them His way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_10","020_25_10","PSA","25","10","10","All the LORD’s ways are loving and faithful to those who keep His covenant and His decrees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_11","020_25_11","PSA","25","11","11","For the sake of Your name, O LORD, forgive my iniquity, for it is great. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_12","020_25_12","PSA","25","12","12","Who is the man who fears the LORD? He will instruct him in the path chosen for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_13","020_25_13","PSA","25","13","13","His soul will dwell in prosperity, and his descendants will inherit the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_14","020_25_14","PSA","25","14","14","The LORD confides in those who fear Him, and reveals His covenant to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_15","020_25_15","PSA","25","15","15","My eyes are always on the LORD, for He will free my feet from the mesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_16","020_25_16","PSA","25","16","16","Turn to me and be gracious, for I am lonely and afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_17","020_25_17","PSA","25","17","17","The troubles of my heart increase; free me from my distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_18","020_25_18","PSA","25","18","18","Consider my affliction and trouble, and take away all my sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_19","020_25_19","PSA","25","19","19","Consider my enemies, for they are many, and they hate me with vicious hatred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_20","020_25_20","PSA","25","20","20","Guard my soul and deliver me; let me not be put to shame, for I take refuge in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_21","020_25_21","PSA","25","21","21","May integrity and uprightness preserve me, because I wait for You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS25_22","020_25_22","PSA","25","22","22","Redeem Israel, O God, from all its distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_1","020_26_1","PSA","26","1","1","Of David. Vindicate me, O LORD! For I have walked with integrity; I have trusted in the LORD without wavering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_2","020_26_2","PSA","26","2","2","Test me, O LORD, and try me; examine my heart and mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_3","020_26_3","PSA","26","3","3","For Your loving devotion is before my eyes, and I have walked in Your truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_4","020_26_4","PSA","26","4","4","I do not sit with deceitful men, nor keep company with hypocrites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_5","020_26_5","PSA","26","5","5","I hate the mob of evildoers, and refuse to sit with the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_6","020_26_6","PSA","26","6","6","I wash my hands in innocence that I may go about Your altar, O LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_7","020_26_7","PSA","26","7","7","to raise my voice in thanksgiving and declare all Your wonderful works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_8","020_26_8","PSA","26","8","8","O LORD, I love the house where You dwell, the place where Your glory resides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_9","020_26_9","PSA","26","9","9","Do not take my soul away with sinners, or my life with men of bloodshed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_10","020_26_10","PSA","26","10","10","in whose hands are wicked schemes, whose right hands are full of bribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_11","020_26_11","PSA","26","11","11","But I will walk with integrity; redeem me and be merciful to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS26_12","020_26_12","PSA","26","12","12","My feet stand on level ground; in the congregations I will bless the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_1","020_27_1","PSA","27","1","1","Of David. The LORD is my light and my salvation—whom shall I fear? The LORD is the stronghold of my life—whom shall I dread? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_2","020_27_2","PSA","27","2","2","When the wicked came upon me to devour my flesh, my enemies and foes stumbled and fell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_3","020_27_3","PSA","27","3","3","Though an army encamps around me, my heart will not fear; though a war breaks out against me, I will keep my trust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_4","020_27_4","PSA","27","4","4","One thing I have asked of the LORD; this is what I desire: to dwell in the house of the LORD all the days of my life, to gaze on the beauty of the LORD and seek Him in His temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_5","020_27_5","PSA","27","5","5","For in the day of trouble He will hide me in His shelter; He will conceal me under the cover of His tent; He will set me high upon a rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_6","020_27_6","PSA","27","6","6","Then my head will be held high above my enemies around me. At His tabernacle I will offer sacrifices with shouts of joy; I will sing and make music to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_7","020_27_7","PSA","27","7","7","Hear, O LORD, my voice when I call; be merciful and answer me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_8","020_27_8","PSA","27","8","8","My heart said, “Seek His face.” Your face, O LORD, I will seek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_9","020_27_9","PSA","27","9","9","Hide not Your face from me, nor turn away Your servant in anger. You have been my helper; do not leave me or forsake me, O God of my salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_10","020_27_10","PSA","27","10","10","Though my father and mother forsake me, the LORD will receive me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_11","020_27_11","PSA","27","11","11","Teach me Your way, O LORD, and lead me on a level path, because of my oppressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_12","020_27_12","PSA","27","12","12","Do not hand me over to the will of my foes, for false witnesses rise up against me, breathing out violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_13","020_27_13","PSA","27","13","13","Still I am certain to see the goodness of the LORD in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS27_14","020_27_14","PSA","27","14","14","Wait patiently for the LORD; be strong and courageous. Wait patiently for the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_1","020_28_1","PSA","28","1","1","Of David. To You, O LORD, I call; be not deaf to me, O my Rock. For if You remain silent, I will be like those descending to the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_2","020_28_2","PSA","28","2","2","Hear my cry for mercy when I call to You for help, when I lift up my hands toward Your holy sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_3","020_28_3","PSA","28","3","3","Do not drag me away with the wicked, and with the workers of iniquity, who speak peace to their neighbors while malice is in their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_4","020_28_4","PSA","28","4","4","Repay them according to their deeds and for their works of evil. Repay them for what their hands have done; bring back on them what they deserve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_5","020_28_5","PSA","28","5","5","Since they show no regard for the works of the LORD or what His hands have done, He will tear them down and never rebuild them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_6","020_28_6","PSA","28","6","6","Blessed be the LORD, for He has heard my cry for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_7","020_28_7","PSA","28","7","7","The LORD is my strength and my shield; my heart trusts in Him, and I am helped. Therefore my heart rejoices, and I give thanks to Him with my song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_8","020_28_8","PSA","28","8","8","The LORD is the strength of His people, a stronghold of salvation for His anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS28_9","020_28_9","PSA","28","9","9","Save Your people and bless Your inheritance; shepherd them and carry them forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_1","020_29_1","PSA","29","1","1","A Psalm of David. Ascribe to the LORD, O heavenly beings, ascribe to the LORD glory and strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_2","020_29_2","PSA","29","2","2","Ascribe to the LORD the glory due His name; worship the LORD in the splendor of His holiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_3","020_29_3","PSA","29","3","3","The voice of the LORD is over the waters; the God of glory thunders; the LORD is heard over many waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_4","020_29_4","PSA","29","4","4","The voice of the LORD is powerful; the voice of the LORD is majestic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_5","020_29_5","PSA","29","5","5","The voice of the LORD breaks the cedars; the LORD shatters the cedars of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_6","020_29_6","PSA","29","6","6","He makes Lebanon skip like a calf, and Sirion like a young wild ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_7","020_29_7","PSA","29","7","7","The voice of the LORD strikes with flames of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_8","020_29_8","PSA","29","8","8","The voice of the LORD shakes the wilderness; the LORD shakes the Wilderness of Kadesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_9","020_29_9","PSA","29","9","9","The voice of the LORD twists the oaks and strips the forests bare. And in His temple all cry, “Glory!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_10","020_29_10","PSA","29","10","10","The LORD sits enthroned over the flood; the LORD is enthroned as King forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS29_11","020_29_11","PSA","29","11","11","The LORD gives His people strength; the LORD blesses His people with peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_1","020_30_1","PSA","30","1","1","A Psalm. A song for the dedication of the temple. Of David. I will exalt You, O LORD, for You have lifted me up and have not allowed my foes to rejoice over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_2","020_30_2","PSA","30","2","2","O LORD my God, I cried to You for help, and You healed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_3","020_30_3","PSA","30","3","3","O LORD, You pulled me up from Sheol; You spared me from descending into the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_4","020_30_4","PSA","30","4","4","Sing to the LORD, O you His saints, and praise His holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_5","020_30_5","PSA","30","5","5","For His anger is fleeting, but His favor lasts a lifetime. Weeping may stay the night, but joy comes in the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_6","020_30_6","PSA","30","6","6","In prosperity I said, “I will never be shaken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_7","020_30_7","PSA","30","7","7","O LORD, You favored me; You made my mountain stand strong. When You hid Your face, I was dismayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_8","020_30_8","PSA","30","8","8","To You, O LORD, I called, and I begged my Lord for mercy: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_9","020_30_9","PSA","30","9","9","“What gain is there in my bloodshed, in my descent to the Pit? Will the dust praise You? Will it proclaim Your faithfulness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_10","020_30_10","PSA","30","10","10","Hear me, O LORD, and have mercy; O LORD, be my helper.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_11","020_30_11","PSA","30","11","11","You turned my mourning into dancing; You peeled off my sackcloth and clothed me with joy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS30_12","020_30_12","PSA","30","12","12","that my heart may sing Your praises and not be silent. O LORD my God, I will give thanks forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_1","020_31_1","PSA","31","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. In You, O LORD, I have taken refuge; let me never be put to shame; save me by Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_2","020_31_2","PSA","31","2","2","Incline Your ear to me; come quickly to my rescue. Be my rock of refuge, the stronghold of my deliverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_3","020_31_3","PSA","31","3","3","For You are my rock and my fortress; lead me and guide me for the sake of Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_4","020_31_4","PSA","31","4","4","You free me from the net laid out for me, for You are my refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_5","020_31_5","PSA","31","5","5","Into Your hands I commit my spirit; You have redeemed me, O LORD, God of truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_6","020_31_6","PSA","31","6","6","I hate those who cling to worthless idols, but in the LORD I trust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_7","020_31_7","PSA","31","7","7","I will be glad and rejoice in Your loving devotion, for You have seen my affliction; You have known the anguish of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_8","020_31_8","PSA","31","8","8","You have not delivered me to the enemy; You have set my feet in the open. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_9","020_31_9","PSA","31","9","9","Be merciful to me, O LORD, for I am in distress; my eyes fail from sorrow, my soul and body as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_10","020_31_10","PSA","31","10","10","For my life is consumed with grief and my years with groaning; my iniquity has drained my strength, and my bones are wasting away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_11","020_31_11","PSA","31","11","11","Among all my enemies I am a disgrace, and among my neighbors even more. I am dreaded by my friends—they flee when they see me on the street. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_12","020_31_12","PSA","31","12","12","I am forgotten like a dead man, out of mind. I am like a broken vessel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_13","020_31_13","PSA","31","13","13","For I hear the slander of many; there is terror on every side. They conspire against me and plot to take my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_14","020_31_14","PSA","31","14","14","But I trust in You, O LORD; I say, “You are my God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_15","020_31_15","PSA","31","15","15","My times are in Your hands; deliver me from my enemies and from those who pursue me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_16","020_31_16","PSA","31","16","16","Make Your face shine on Your servant; save me by Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_17","020_31_17","PSA","31","17","17","O LORD, let me not be ashamed, for I have called on You. Let the wicked be put to shame; let them lie silent in Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_18","020_31_18","PSA","31","18","18","May lying lips be silenced—lips that speak with arrogance against the righteous, full of pride and contempt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_19","020_31_19","PSA","31","19","19","How great is Your goodness which You have laid up for those who fear You, which You have bestowed before the sons of men on those who take refuge in You! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_20","020_31_20","PSA","31","20","20","You hide them in the secret place of Your presence from the schemes of men. You conceal them in Your shelter from accusing tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_21","020_31_21","PSA","31","21","21","Blessed be the LORD, for He has shown me His loving devotion in a city under siege. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_22","020_31_22","PSA","31","22","22","In my alarm I said, “I am cut off from Your sight!” But You heard my plea for mercy when I called to You for help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_23","020_31_23","PSA","31","23","23","Love the LORD, all His saints. The LORD preserves the faithful, but fully repays the arrogant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS31_24","020_31_24","PSA","31","24","24","Be strong and courageous, all you who hope in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_1","020_32_1","PSA","32","1","1","Of David. A Maskil. Blessed is he whose transgressions are forgiven, whose sins are covered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_2","020_32_2","PSA","32","2","2","Blessed is the man whose iniquity the LORD does not count against him, in whose spirit there is no deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_3","020_32_3","PSA","32","3","3","When I kept silent, my bones became brittle from my groaning all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_4","020_32_4","PSA","32","4","4","For day and night Your hand was heavy upon me; my strength was drained as in the summer heat. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_5","020_32_5","PSA","32","5","5","Then I acknowledged my sin to You and did not hide my iniquity. I said, “I will confess my transgressions to the LORD,” and You forgave the guilt of my sin. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_6","020_32_6","PSA","32","6","6","Therefore let all the godly pray to You while You may be found. Surely when great waters rise, they will not come near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_7","020_32_7","PSA","32","7","7","You are my hiding place. You protect me from trouble; You surround me with songs of deliverance. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_8","020_32_8","PSA","32","8","8","I will instruct you and teach you the way you should go; I will give you counsel and watch over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_9","020_32_9","PSA","32","9","9","Do not be like the horse or mule, which have no understanding; they must be controlled with bit and bridle to make them come to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_10","020_32_10","PSA","32","10","10","Many are the sorrows of the wicked, but loving devotion surrounds him who trusts in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS32_11","020_32_11","PSA","32","11","11","Be glad in the LORD and rejoice, O righteous ones; shout for joy, all you upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_1","020_33_1","PSA","33","1","1","Rejoice in the LORD, O righteous ones; it is fitting for the upright to praise Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_2","020_33_2","PSA","33","2","2","Praise the LORD with the harp; make music to Him with ten strings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_3","020_33_3","PSA","33","3","3","Sing to Him a new song; play skillfully with a shout of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_4","020_33_4","PSA","33","4","4","For the word of the LORD is upright, and all His work is trustworthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_5","020_33_5","PSA","33","5","5","The LORD loves righteousness and justice; the earth is full of His loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_6","020_33_6","PSA","33","6","6","By the word of the LORD the heavens were made, and all the stars by the breath of His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_7","020_33_7","PSA","33","7","7","He piles up the waters of the sea; He puts the depths into storehouses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_8","020_33_8","PSA","33","8","8","Let all the earth fear the LORD; let all the people of the world revere Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_9","020_33_9","PSA","33","9","9","For He spoke, and it came to be; He commanded, and it stood firm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_10","020_33_10","PSA","33","10","10","The LORD frustrates the plans of the nations; He thwarts the devices of the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_11","020_33_11","PSA","33","11","11","The counsel of the LORD stands forever, the purposes of His heart to all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_12","020_33_12","PSA","33","12","12","Blessed is the nation whose God is the LORD, the people He has chosen as His inheritance! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_13","020_33_13","PSA","33","13","13","The LORD looks down from heaven; He sees all the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_14","020_33_14","PSA","33","14","14","From His dwelling place He gazes on all who inhabit the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_15","020_33_15","PSA","33","15","15","He shapes the hearts of each; He considers all their works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_16","020_33_16","PSA","33","16","16","No king is saved by his vast army; no warrior is delivered by his great strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_17","020_33_17","PSA","33","17","17","A horse is a vain hope for salvation; even its great strength cannot save. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_18","020_33_18","PSA","33","18","18","Surely the eyes of the LORD are on those who fear Him, on those whose hope is in His loving devotion ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_19","020_33_19","PSA","33","19","19","to deliver them from death and keep them alive in famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_20","020_33_20","PSA","33","20","20","Our soul waits for the LORD; He is our help and our shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_21","020_33_21","PSA","33","21","21","For our hearts rejoice in Him, since we trust in His holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS33_22","020_33_22","PSA","33","22","22","May Your loving devotion rest on us, O LORD, as we put our hope in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_1","020_34_1","PSA","34","1","1","Of David, when he pretended to be insane before Abimelech, so that the king drove him away. I will bless the LORD at all times; His praise will always be on my lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_2","020_34_2","PSA","34","2","2","My soul boasts in the LORD; let the oppressed hear and rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_3","020_34_3","PSA","34","3","3","Magnify the LORD with me; let us exalt His name together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_4","020_34_4","PSA","34","4","4","I sought the LORD, and He answered me; He delivered me from all my fears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_5","020_34_5","PSA","34","5","5","Those who look to Him are radiant with joy; their faces shall never be ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_6","020_34_6","PSA","34","6","6","This poor man called out, and the LORD heard him; He saved him from all his troubles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_7","020_34_7","PSA","34","7","7","The angel of the LORD encamps around those who fear Him, and he delivers them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_8","020_34_8","PSA","34","8","8","Taste and see that the LORD is good; blessed is the man who takes refuge in Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_9","020_34_9","PSA","34","9","9","Fear the LORD, you His saints, for those who fear Him lack nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_10","020_34_10","PSA","34","10","10","Young lions go lacking and hungry, but those who seek the LORD lack no good thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_11","020_34_11","PSA","34","11","11","Come, children, listen to me; I will teach you the fear of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_12","020_34_12","PSA","34","12","12","Who is the man who delights in life, who desires to see good days? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_13","020_34_13","PSA","34","13","13","Keep your tongue from evil and your lips from deceitful speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_14","020_34_14","PSA","34","14","14","Turn away from evil and do good; seek peace and pursue it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_15","020_34_15","PSA","34","15","15","The eyes of the LORD are on the righteous, and His ears are inclined to their cry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_16","020_34_16","PSA","34","16","16","But the face of the LORD is against those who do evil, to wipe out all memory of them from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_17","020_34_17","PSA","34","17","17","The righteous cry out, and the LORD hears; He delivers them from all their troubles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_18","020_34_18","PSA","34","18","18","The LORD is near to the brokenhearted; He saves the contrite in spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_19","020_34_19","PSA","34","19","19","Many are the afflictions of the righteous, but the LORD delivers him from them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_20","020_34_20","PSA","34","20","20","He protects all his bones; not one of them will be broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_21","020_34_21","PSA","34","21","21","Evil will slay the wicked, and the haters of the righteous will be condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS34_22","020_34_22","PSA","34","22","22","The LORD redeems His servants, and none who take refuge in Him will be condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_1","020_35_1","PSA","35","1","1","Of David. Contend with my opponents, O LORD; fight against those who fight against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_2","020_35_2","PSA","35","2","2","Take up Your shield and buckler; arise and come to my aid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_3","020_35_3","PSA","35","3","3","Draw the spear and javelin against my pursuers; say to my soul: “I am your salvation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_4","020_35_4","PSA","35","4","4","May those who seek my life be disgraced and put to shame; may those who plan to harm me be driven back and confounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_5","020_35_5","PSA","35","5","5","May they be like chaff in the wind, as the angel of the LORD drives them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_6","020_35_6","PSA","35","6","6","May their path be dark and slick, as the angel of the LORD pursues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_7","020_35_7","PSA","35","7","7","For without cause they laid their net for me; without reason they dug a pit for my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_8","020_35_8","PSA","35","8","8","May ruin befall them by surprise; may the net they hid ensnare them; may they fall into the hazard they created. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_9","020_35_9","PSA","35","9","9","Then my soul will rejoice in the LORD and exult in His salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_10","020_35_10","PSA","35","10","10","All my bones will exclaim, “Who is like You, O LORD, who delivers the afflicted from the aggressor, the poor and needy from the robber?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_11","020_35_11","PSA","35","11","11","Hostile witnesses come forward; they make charges I know nothing about. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_12","020_35_12","PSA","35","12","12","They repay me evil for good, to the bereavement of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_13","020_35_13","PSA","35","13","13","Yet when they were ill, I put on sackcloth; I humbled myself with fasting, but my prayers returned unanswered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_14","020_35_14","PSA","35","14","14","I paced about as for my friend or brother; I was bowed down with grief, like one mourning for his mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_15","020_35_15","PSA","35","15","15","But when I stumbled, they assembled in glee; they gathered together against me. Assailants I did not know slandered me without ceasing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_16","020_35_16","PSA","35","16","16","Like godless jesters at a feast, they gnashed their teeth at me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_17","020_35_17","PSA","35","17","17","How long, O Lord, will You look on? Rescue my soul from their ravages, my precious life from these lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_18","020_35_18","PSA","35","18","18","Then I will give You thanks in the great assembly; I will praise You among many people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_19","020_35_19","PSA","35","19","19","Let not my enemies gloat over me without cause, nor those who hate me without reason wink in malice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_20","020_35_20","PSA","35","20","20","For they do not speak peace, but they devise deceitful schemes against those who live quietly in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_21","020_35_21","PSA","35","21","21","They gape at me and say, “Aha, aha! Our eyes have seen!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_22","020_35_22","PSA","35","22","22","O LORD, You have seen it; be not silent. O Lord, be not far from me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_23","020_35_23","PSA","35","23","23","Awake and rise to my defense, to my cause, my God and my Lord! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_24","020_35_24","PSA","35","24","24","Vindicate me by Your righteousness, O LORD my God, and do not let them gloat over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_25","020_35_25","PSA","35","25","25","Let them not say in their hearts, “Aha, just what we wanted!” Let them not say, “We have swallowed him up!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_26","020_35_26","PSA","35","26","26","May those who gloat in my distress be ashamed and confounded; may those who exalt themselves over me be clothed in shame and reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_27","020_35_27","PSA","35","27","27","May those who favor my vindication shout for joy and gladness; may they always say, “Exalted be the LORD who delights in His servant’s well-being.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS35_28","020_35_28","PSA","35","28","28","Then my tongue will proclaim Your righteousness and Your praises all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_1","020_36_1","PSA","36","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David, the servant of the LORD. An oracle is in my heart regarding the transgression of the wicked man: There is no fear of God before his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_2","020_36_2","PSA","36","2","2","For his eyes are too full of conceit to detect or hate his own sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_3","020_36_3","PSA","36","3","3","The words of his mouth are wicked and deceitful; he has ceased to be wise and well-doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_4","020_36_4","PSA","36","4","4","Even on his bed he plots wickedness; he sets himself on a path that is not good; he fails to reject evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_5","020_36_5","PSA","36","5","5","Your loving devotion, O LORD, reaches to the heavens, Your faithfulness to the clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_6","020_36_6","PSA","36","6","6","Your righteousness is like the highest mountains; Your judgments are like the deepest sea. O LORD, You preserve man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_7","020_36_7","PSA","36","7","7","How precious is Your loving devotion, O God, that the children of men take refuge in the shadow of Your wings! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_8","020_36_8","PSA","36","8","8","They feast on the abundance of Your house, and You give them drink from Your river of delights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_9","020_36_9","PSA","36","9","9","For with You is the fountain of life; in Your light we see light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_10","020_36_10","PSA","36","10","10","Extend Your loving devotion to those who know You, and Your righteousness to the upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_11","020_36_11","PSA","36","11","11","Let not the foot of the proud come against me, nor the hand of the wicked drive me away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS36_12","020_36_12","PSA","36","12","12","There the evildoers lie fallen, thrown down and unable to rise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_1","020_37_1","PSA","37","1","1","Of David. Do not fret over those who do evil; do not envy those who do wrong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_2","020_37_2","PSA","37","2","2","For they wither quickly like grass and wilt like tender plants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_3","020_37_3","PSA","37","3","3","Trust in the LORD and do good; dwell in the land and cultivate faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_4","020_37_4","PSA","37","4","4","Delight yourself in the LORD, and He will give you the desires of your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_5","020_37_5","PSA","37","5","5","Commit your way to the LORD; trust in Him, and He will do it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_6","020_37_6","PSA","37","6","6","He will bring forth your righteousness like the dawn, your justice like the noonday sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_7","020_37_7","PSA","37","7","7","Be still before the LORD and wait patiently for Him; do not fret when men prosper in their ways, when they carry out wicked schemes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_8","020_37_8","PSA","37","8","8","Refrain from anger and abandon wrath; do not fret—it can only bring harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_9","020_37_9","PSA","37","9","9","For the evildoers will be cut off, but those who hope in the LORD will inherit the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_10","020_37_10","PSA","37","10","10","Yet a little while, and the wicked will be no more; though you look for them, they will not be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_11","020_37_11","PSA","37","11","11","But the meek will inherit the land and delight in abundant prosperity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_12","020_37_12","PSA","37","12","12","The wicked scheme against the righteous and gnash their teeth at them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_13","020_37_13","PSA","37","13","13","but the Lord laughs, seeing that their day is coming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_14","020_37_14","PSA","37","14","14","The wicked have drawn the sword and bent the bow to bring down the poor and needy, to slay those whose ways are upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_15","020_37_15","PSA","37","15","15","But their swords will pierce their own hearts, and their bows will be broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_16","020_37_16","PSA","37","16","16","Better is the little of the righteous than the abundance of many who are wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_17","020_37_17","PSA","37","17","17","For the arms of the wicked will be broken, but the LORD upholds the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_18","020_37_18","PSA","37","18","18","The LORD knows the days of the blameless, and their inheritance will last forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_19","020_37_19","PSA","37","19","19","In the time of evil they will not be ashamed, and in the days of famine they will be satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_20","020_37_20","PSA","37","20","20","But the wicked and enemies of the LORD will perish like the glory of the fields. They will vanish; like smoke they will fade away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_21","020_37_21","PSA","37","21","21","The wicked borrow and do not repay, but the righteous are gracious and giving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_22","020_37_22","PSA","37","22","22","Surely those He blesses will inherit the land, but the cursed will be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_23","020_37_23","PSA","37","23","23","The steps of a man are ordered by the LORD who takes delight in his journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_24","020_37_24","PSA","37","24","24","Though he falls, he will not be overwhelmed, for the LORD is holding his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_25","020_37_25","PSA","37","25","25","I once was young and now am old, yet never have I seen the righteous abandoned or their children begging for bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_26","020_37_26","PSA","37","26","26","They are ever generous and quick to lend, and their children are a blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_27","020_37_27","PSA","37","27","27","Turn away from evil and do good, so that you will abide forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_28","020_37_28","PSA","37","28","28","For the LORD loves justice and will not forsake His saints. They are preserved forever, but the offspring of the wicked will be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_29","020_37_29","PSA","37","29","29","The righteous will inherit the land and dwell in it forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_30","020_37_30","PSA","37","30","30","The mouth of the righteous man utters wisdom, and his tongue speaks justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_31","020_37_31","PSA","37","31","31","The law of his God is in his heart; his steps do not falter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_32","020_37_32","PSA","37","32","32","Though the wicked lie in wait for the righteous, and seek to slay them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_33","020_37_33","PSA","37","33","33","the LORD will not leave them in their power or let them be condemned under judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_34","020_37_34","PSA","37","34","34","Wait for the LORD and keep His way, and He will raise you up to inherit the land. When the wicked are cut off, you will see it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_35","020_37_35","PSA","37","35","35","I have seen a wicked, ruthless man flourishing like a well-rooted native tree, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_36","020_37_36","PSA","37","36","36","yet he passed away and was no more; though I searched, he could not be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_37","020_37_37","PSA","37","37","37","Consider the blameless and observe the upright, for posterity awaits the man of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_38","020_37_38","PSA","37","38","38","But the transgressors will all be destroyed; the future of the wicked will be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_39","020_37_39","PSA","37","39","39","The salvation of the righteous is from the LORD; He is their stronghold in time of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS37_40","020_37_40","PSA","37","40","40","The LORD helps and delivers them; He rescues and saves them from the wicked, because they take refuge in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_1","020_38_1","PSA","38","1","1","A Psalm of David, for remembrance. O LORD, do not rebuke me in Your anger or discipline me in Your wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_2","020_38_2","PSA","38","2","2","For Your arrows have pierced me deeply, and Your hand has pressed down on me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_3","020_38_3","PSA","38","3","3","There is no soundness in my body because of Your anger; there is no rest in my bones because of my sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_4","020_38_4","PSA","38","4","4","For my iniquities have overwhelmed me; they are a burden too heavy to bear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_5","020_38_5","PSA","38","5","5","My wounds are foul and festering because of my sinful folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_6","020_38_6","PSA","38","6","6","I am bent and brought low; all day long I go about mourning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_7","020_38_7","PSA","38","7","7","For my loins are full of burning pain, and no soundness remains in my body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_8","020_38_8","PSA","38","8","8","I am numb and badly crushed; I groan in anguish of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_9","020_38_9","PSA","38","9","9","O Lord, my every desire is before You; my groaning is not hidden from You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_10","020_38_10","PSA","38","10","10","My heart pounds, my strength fails, and even the light of my eyes has faded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_11","020_38_11","PSA","38","11","11","My beloved and friends shun my disease, and my kinsmen stand at a distance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_12","020_38_12","PSA","38","12","12","Those who seek my life lay snares; those who wish me harm speak destruction, plotting deceit all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_13","020_38_13","PSA","38","13","13","But like a deaf man, I do not hear; and like a mute man, I do not open my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_14","020_38_14","PSA","38","14","14","I am like a man who cannot hear, whose mouth offers no reply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_15","020_38_15","PSA","38","15","15","I wait for You, O LORD; You will answer, O Lord my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_16","020_38_16","PSA","38","16","16","For I said, “Let them not gloat over me—those who taunt me when my foot slips.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_17","020_38_17","PSA","38","17","17","For I am ready to fall, and my pain is ever with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_18","020_38_18","PSA","38","18","18","Yes, I confess my iniquity; I am troubled by my sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_19","020_38_19","PSA","38","19","19","Many are my enemies without cause, and many hate me without reason. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_20","020_38_20","PSA","38","20","20","Those who repay my good with evil attack me for pursuing the good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_21","020_38_21","PSA","38","21","21","Do not forsake me, O LORD; be not far from me, O my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS38_22","020_38_22","PSA","38","22","22","Come quickly to help me, O Lord my Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_1","020_39_1","PSA","39","1","1","For the choirmaster. For Jeduthun. A Psalm of David. I said, “I will watch my ways so that I will not sin with my tongue; I will guard my mouth with a muzzle as long as the wicked are present.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_2","020_39_2","PSA","39","2","2","I was speechless and still; I remained silent, even from speaking good, and my sorrow was stirred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_3","020_39_3","PSA","39","3","3","My heart grew hot within me; as I mused, the fire burned. Then I spoke with my tongue: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_4","020_39_4","PSA","39","4","4","“Show me, O LORD, my end and the measure of my days. Let me know how fleeting my life is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_5","020_39_5","PSA","39","5","5","You, indeed, have made my days as handbreadths, and my lifetime as nothing before You. Truly each man at his best exists as but a breath. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_6","020_39_6","PSA","39","6","6","Surely every man goes about like a phantom; surely he bustles in vain; he heaps up riches not knowing who will haul them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_7","020_39_7","PSA","39","7","7","And now, O Lord, for what do I wait? My hope is in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_8","020_39_8","PSA","39","8","8","Deliver me from all my transgressions; do not make me the reproach of fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_9","020_39_9","PSA","39","9","9","I have become mute; I do not open my mouth because of what You have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_10","020_39_10","PSA","39","10","10","Remove Your scourge from me; I am perishing by the force of Your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_11","020_39_11","PSA","39","11","11","You discipline and correct a man for his iniquity, consuming like a moth what he holds dear; surely each man is but a vapor. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_12","020_39_12","PSA","39","12","12","Hear my prayer, O LORD, and give ear to my cry for help; do not be deaf to my weeping. For I am a foreigner dwelling with You, a stranger like all my fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS39_13","020_39_13","PSA","39","13","13","Turn Your gaze away from me, that I may again be cheered before I depart and am no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_1","020_40_1","PSA","40","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. I waited patiently for the LORD; He inclined to me and heard my cry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_2","020_40_2","PSA","40","2","2","He lifted me up from the pit of despair, out of the miry clay; He set my feet upon a rock, and made my footsteps firm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_3","020_40_3","PSA","40","3","3","He put a new song in my mouth, a hymn of praise to our God. Many will see and fear and put their trust in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_4","020_40_4","PSA","40","4","4","Blessed is the man who has made the LORD his trust, who has not turned to the proud, nor to those who lapse into falsehood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_5","020_40_5","PSA","40","5","5","Many, O LORD my God, are the wonders You have done, and the plans You have for us—none can compare to You—if I proclaim and declare them, they are more than I can count. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_6","020_40_6","PSA","40","6","6","Sacrifice and offering You did not desire, but my ears You have opened. Burnt offerings and sin offerings You did not require. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_7","020_40_7","PSA","40","7","7","Then I said, “Here I am, I have come—it is written about me in the scroll: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_8","020_40_8","PSA","40","8","8","I delight to do Your will, O my God; Your law is within my heart.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_9","020_40_9","PSA","40","9","9","I proclaim righteousness in the great assembly; behold, I do not seal my lips, as You, O LORD, do know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_10","020_40_10","PSA","40","10","10","I have not covered up Your righteousness in my heart; I have declared Your faithfulness and salvation; I have not concealed Your loving devotion and faithfulness from the great assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_11","020_40_11","PSA","40","11","11","O LORD, do not withhold Your mercy from me; Your loving devotion and faithfulness will always guard me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_12","020_40_12","PSA","40","12","12","For evils without number surround me; my sins have overtaken me, so that I cannot see. They are more than the hairs of my head, and my heart has failed within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_13","020_40_13","PSA","40","13","13","Be pleased, O LORD, to deliver me; hurry, O LORD, to help me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_14","020_40_14","PSA","40","14","14","May those who seek my life be ashamed and confounded; may those who wish me harm be repelled and humiliated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_15","020_40_15","PSA","40","15","15","May those who say to me, “Aha, aha!” be appalled at their own shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_16","020_40_16","PSA","40","16","16","May all who seek You rejoice and be glad in You; may those who love Your salvation always say, “The LORD be magnified!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS40_17","020_40_17","PSA","40","17","17","But I am poor and needy; may the Lord think of me. You are my helper and deliverer; O my God, do not delay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_1","020_41_1","PSA","41","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. Blessed is the one who cares for the poor; the LORD will deliver him in the day of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_2","020_41_2","PSA","41","2","2","The LORD will protect and preserve him; He will bless him in the land and refuse to give him over to the will of his foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_3","020_41_3","PSA","41","3","3","The LORD will sustain him on his bed of illness and restore him from his bed of sickness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_4","020_41_4","PSA","41","4","4","I said, “O LORD, be gracious to me; heal me, for I have sinned against You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_5","020_41_5","PSA","41","5","5","My enemies say with malice: “When will he die and be forgotten?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_6","020_41_6","PSA","41","6","6","My visitor speaks falsehood; he gathers slander in his heart; he goes out and spreads it abroad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_7","020_41_7","PSA","41","7","7","All who hate me whisper against me; they imagine the worst for me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_8","020_41_8","PSA","41","8","8","“A vile disease has been poured into him; he will never get up from where he lies!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_9","020_41_9","PSA","41","9","9","Even my close friend whom I trusted, the one who shared my bread, has lifted up his heel against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_10","020_41_10","PSA","41","10","10","But You, O LORD, be gracious to me and raise me up, that I may repay them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_11","020_41_11","PSA","41","11","11","By this I know that You delight in me, for my enemy does not triumph over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_12","020_41_12","PSA","41","12","12","In my integrity You uphold me and set me in Your presence forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS41_13","020_41_13","PSA","41","13","13","Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, from everlasting to everlasting. Amen and Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_1","020_42_1","PSA","42","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Maskil of the sons of Korah. As the deer pants for streams of water, so my soul longs after You, O God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_2","020_42_2","PSA","42","2","2","My soul thirsts for God, the living God. When shall I come and appear in God’s presence? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_3","020_42_3","PSA","42","3","3","My tears have been my food both day and night, while men ask me all day long, “Where is your God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_4","020_42_4","PSA","42","4","4","These things come to mind as I pour out my soul: how I walked with the multitude, leading the festive procession to the house of God with shouts of joy and praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_5","020_42_5","PSA","42","5","5","Why are you downcast, O my soul? Why the unease within me? Put your hope in God, for I will yet praise Him for the salvation of His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_6","020_42_6","PSA","42","6","6","O my God, my soul despairs within me. Therefore I remember You from the land of Jordan and the peaks of Hermon—even from Mount Mizar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_7","020_42_7","PSA","42","7","7","Deep calls to deep in the roar of Your waterfalls; all Your breakers and waves have rolled over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_8","020_42_8","PSA","42","8","8","The LORD decrees His loving devotion by day, and at night His song is with me as a prayer to the God of my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_9","020_42_9","PSA","42","9","9","I say to God my Rock, “Why have You forgotten me? Why must I walk in sorrow because of the enemy’s oppression?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_10","020_42_10","PSA","42","10","10","Like the crushing of my bones, my enemies taunt me, while they say to me all day long, “Where is your God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS42_11","020_42_11","PSA","42","11","11","Why are you downcast, O my soul? Why the unease within me? Put your hope in God, for I will yet praise Him, my Savior and my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS43_1","020_43_1","PSA","43","1","1","Vindicate me, O God, and plead my case against an ungodly nation; deliver me from deceitful and unjust men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS43_2","020_43_2","PSA","43","2","2","For You are the God of my refuge. Why have You rejected me? Why must I walk in sorrow because of the enemy’s oppression? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS43_3","020_43_3","PSA","43","3","3","Send out Your light and Your truth; let them lead me. Let them bring me to Your holy mountain and to the place where You dwell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS43_4","020_43_4","PSA","43","4","4","Then I will go to the altar of God, to God, my greatest joy. I will praise You with the harp, O God, my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS43_5","020_43_5","PSA","43","5","5","Why are you downcast, O my soul? Why the unease within me? Put your hope in God, for I will yet praise Him, my Savior and my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_1","020_44_1","PSA","44","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Maskil of the sons of Korah. We have heard with our ears, O God; our fathers have told us the work You did in their days, in the days of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_2","020_44_2","PSA","44","2","2","With Your hand You drove out the nations and planted our fathers there; You crushed the peoples and cast them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_3","020_44_3","PSA","44","3","3","For it was not by their sword that they took the land; their arm did not bring them victory. It was by Your right hand, Your arm, and the light of Your face, because You favored them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_4","020_44_4","PSA","44","4","4","You are my King, O God, who ordains victories for Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_5","020_44_5","PSA","44","5","5","Through You we repel our foes; through Your name we trample our enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_6","020_44_6","PSA","44","6","6","For I do not trust in my bow, nor does my sword save me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_7","020_44_7","PSA","44","7","7","For You save us from our enemies; You put those who hate us to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_8","020_44_8","PSA","44","8","8","In God we have boasted all day long, and Your name we will praise forever. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_9","020_44_9","PSA","44","9","9","But You have rejected and humbled us; You no longer go forth with our armies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_10","020_44_10","PSA","44","10","10","You have made us retreat from the foe, and those who hate us have plundered us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_11","020_44_11","PSA","44","11","11","You have given us up as sheep to be devoured; You have scattered us among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_12","020_44_12","PSA","44","12","12","You sell Your people for nothing; no profit do You gain from their sale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_13","020_44_13","PSA","44","13","13","You have made us a reproach to our neighbors, a mockery and derision to those around us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_14","020_44_14","PSA","44","14","14","You have made us a byword among the nations, a laughingstock among the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_15","020_44_15","PSA","44","15","15","All day long my disgrace is before me, and shame has covered my face, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_16","020_44_16","PSA","44","16","16","at the voice of the scorner and reviler, because of the enemy, bent on revenge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_17","020_44_17","PSA","44","17","17","All this has come upon us, though we have not forgotten You or betrayed Your covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_18","020_44_18","PSA","44","18","18","Our hearts have not turned back; our steps have not strayed from Your path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_19","020_44_19","PSA","44","19","19","But You have crushed us in the lair of jackals; You have covered us with deepest darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_20","020_44_20","PSA","44","20","20","If we had forgotten the name of our God or spread out our hands to a foreign god, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_21","020_44_21","PSA","44","21","21","would not God have discovered, since He knows the secrets of the heart? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_22","020_44_22","PSA","44","22","22","Yet for Your sake we face death all day long; we are considered as sheep to be slaughtered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_23","020_44_23","PSA","44","23","23","Wake up, O Lord! Why are You sleeping? Arise! Do not reject us forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_24","020_44_24","PSA","44","24","24","Why do You hide Your face and forget our affliction and oppression? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_25","020_44_25","PSA","44","25","25","For our soul has sunk to the dust; our bodies cling to the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS44_26","020_44_26","PSA","44","26","26","Rise up; be our help! Redeem us on account of Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_1","020_45_1","PSA","45","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Lilies.” A Maskil of the sons of Korah. A love song. My heart is stirred by a noble theme as I recite my verses to the king; my tongue is the pen of a skillful writer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_2","020_45_2","PSA","45","2","2","You are the most handsome of men; grace has anointed your lips; therefore God has blessed you forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_3","020_45_3","PSA","45","3","3","Strap your sword at your side, O mighty warrior; appear in your majesty and splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_4","020_45_4","PSA","45","4","4","In your splendor ride forth in victory on behalf of truth and humility and justice; may your right hand show your awesome deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_5","020_45_5","PSA","45","5","5","Your arrows pierce the hearts of the king’s foes; the nations fall beneath your feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_6","020_45_6","PSA","45","6","6","Your throne, O God, endures forever and ever, and justice is the scepter of Your kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_7","020_45_7","PSA","45","7","7","You have loved righteousness and hated wickedness; therefore God, your God, has anointed you above your companions with the oil of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_8","020_45_8","PSA","45","8","8","All your garments are fragrant with myrrh and aloes and cassia; from palaces of ivory the harps make you glad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_9","020_45_9","PSA","45","9","9","The daughters of kings are among your honored women; the queen stands at your right hand, adorned with the gold of Ophir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_10","020_45_10","PSA","45","10","10","Listen, O daughter! Consider and incline your ear: Forget your people and your father’s house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_11","020_45_11","PSA","45","11","11","and the king will desire your beauty; bow to him, for he is your lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_12","020_45_12","PSA","45","12","12","The Daughter of Tyre will come with a gift; men of wealth will seek your favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_13","020_45_13","PSA","45","13","13","All glorious is the princess in her chamber; her gown is embroidered with gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_14","020_45_14","PSA","45","14","14","In colorful garments she is led to the king; her virgin companions are brought before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_15","020_45_15","PSA","45","15","15","They are led in with joy and gladness; they enter the palace of the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_16","020_45_16","PSA","45","16","16","Your sons will succeed your fathers; you will make them princes throughout the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS45_17","020_45_17","PSA","45","17","17","I will commemorate your name through all generations; therefore the nations will praise you forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_1","020_46_1","PSA","46","1","1","For the choirmaster. Of the sons of Korah. According to Alamoth. A song. God is our refuge and strength, an ever-present help in times of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_2","020_46_2","PSA","46","2","2","Therefore we will not fear, though the earth is transformed and the mountains are toppled into the depths of the seas, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_3","020_46_3","PSA","46","3","3","though their waters roar and foam and the mountains quake in the surge. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_4","020_46_4","PSA","46","4","4","There is a river whose streams delight the city of God, the holy place where the Most High dwells. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_5","020_46_5","PSA","46","5","5","God is within her; she will not be moved. God will help her when morning dawns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_6","020_46_6","PSA","46","6","6","Nations rage, kingdoms crumble; the earth melts when He lifts His voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_7","020_46_7","PSA","46","7","7","The LORD of Hosts is with us; the God of Jacob is our fortress. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_8","020_46_8","PSA","46","8","8","Come, see the works of the LORD, who brings devastation upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_9","020_46_9","PSA","46","9","9","He makes wars to cease throughout the earth; He breaks the bow and shatters the spear; He burns the shields in the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_10","020_46_10","PSA","46","10","10","“Be still and know that I am God; I will be exalted among the nations, I will be exalted over the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS46_11","020_46_11","PSA","46","11","11","The LORD of Hosts is with us; the God of Jacob is our fortress. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_1","020_47_1","PSA","47","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. Clap your hands, all you peoples; shout unto God with a voice of triumph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_2","020_47_2","PSA","47","2","2","How awesome is the LORD Most High, the great King over all the earth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_3","020_47_3","PSA","47","3","3","He subdues nations beneath us, and peoples under our feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_4","020_47_4","PSA","47","4","4","He chooses our inheritance for us, the pride of Jacob, whom He loves. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_5","020_47_5","PSA","47","5","5","God has ascended amid shouts of joy, the LORD with the sound of the horn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_6","020_47_6","PSA","47","6","6","Sing praises to God, sing praises; sing praises to our King, sing praises! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_7","020_47_7","PSA","47","7","7","For God is King of all the earth; sing to Him a psalm of praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_8","020_47_8","PSA","47","8","8","God reigns over the nations; God is seated on His holy throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS47_9","020_47_9","PSA","47","9","9","The nobles of the nations have assembled as the people of the God of Abraham; for the shields of the earth belong to God; He is highly exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_1","020_48_1","PSA","48","1","1","A song. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. Great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised in the city of our God, His holy mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_2","020_48_2","PSA","48","2","2","Beautiful in loftiness, the joy of all the earth, like the peaks of Zaphon is Mount Zion, the city of the great King. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_3","020_48_3","PSA","48","3","3","God is in her citadels; He has shown Himself to be a fortress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_4","020_48_4","PSA","48","4","4","For behold, the kings assembled; they all advanced together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_5","020_48_5","PSA","48","5","5","They saw and were astounded; they fled in terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_6","020_48_6","PSA","48","6","6","Trembling seized them there, anguish like a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_7","020_48_7","PSA","48","7","7","With a wind from the east You wrecked the ships of Tarshish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_8","020_48_8","PSA","48","8","8","As we have heard, so we have seen in the city of the LORD of Hosts, in the city of our God: God will establish her forever. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_9","020_48_9","PSA","48","9","9","Within Your temple, O God, we contemplate Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_10","020_48_10","PSA","48","10","10","Your name, O God, like Your praise, reaches to the ends of the earth; Your right hand is full of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_11","020_48_11","PSA","48","11","11","Mount Zion is glad, the daughters of Judah rejoice, on account of Your judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_12","020_48_12","PSA","48","12","12","March around Zion, encircle her, count her towers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_13","020_48_13","PSA","48","13","13","consider her ramparts, tour her citadels, that you may tell the next generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS48_14","020_48_14","PSA","48","14","14","For this God is our God forever and ever; He will be our guide even till death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_1","020_49_1","PSA","49","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. Hear this, all you peoples; listen, all inhabitants of the world, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_2","020_49_2","PSA","49","2","2","both low and high, rich and poor alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_3","020_49_3","PSA","49","3","3","My mouth will impart wisdom, and the meditation of my heart will bring understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_4","020_49_4","PSA","49","4","4","I will incline my ear to a proverb; I will express my riddle with the harp: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_5","020_49_5","PSA","49","5","5","Why should I fear in times of trouble, when wicked usurpers surround me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_6","020_49_6","PSA","49","6","6","They trust in their wealth and boast in their great riches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_7","020_49_7","PSA","49","7","7","No man can possibly redeem his brother or pay his ransom to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_8","020_49_8","PSA","49","8","8","For the redemption of his soul is costly, and never can payment suffice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_9","020_49_9","PSA","49","9","9","that he should live on forever and not see decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_10","020_49_10","PSA","49","10","10","For it is clear that wise men die, and the foolish and the senseless both perish and leave their wealth to others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_11","020_49_11","PSA","49","11","11","Their graves are their eternal homes—their dwellings for endless generations—even though their lands were their namesakes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_12","020_49_12","PSA","49","12","12","But a man, despite his wealth, cannot endure; he is like the beasts that perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_13","020_49_13","PSA","49","13","13","This is the fate of the foolish and their followers who endorse their sayings. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_14","020_49_14","PSA","49","14","14","Like sheep they are destined for Sheol. Death will be their shepherd. The upright will rule them in the morning, and their form will decay in Sheol, far from their lofty abode. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_15","020_49_15","PSA","49","15","15","But God will redeem my life from Sheol, for He will surely take me to Himself. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_16","020_49_16","PSA","49","16","16","Do not be afraid when a man grows rich, when the splendor of his house increases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_17","020_49_17","PSA","49","17","17","For when he dies, he will carry nothing away; his abundance will not follow him down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_18","020_49_18","PSA","49","18","18","Though in his lifetime he blesses his soul—and men praise you when you prosper— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_19","020_49_19","PSA","49","19","19","he will join the generation of his fathers, who will never see the light of day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS49_20","020_49_20","PSA","49","20","20","A man who has riches without understanding is like the beasts that perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_1","020_50_1","PSA","50","1","1","A Psalm of Asaph. The Mighty One, God the LORD, speaks and summons the earth from where the sun rises to where it sets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_2","020_50_2","PSA","50","2","2","From Zion, perfect in beauty, God shines forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_3","020_50_3","PSA","50","3","3","Our God approaches and will not be silent! Consuming fire precedes Him, and a tempest rages around Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_4","020_50_4","PSA","50","4","4","He summons the heavens above, and the earth, that He may judge His people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_5","020_50_5","PSA","50","5","5","“Gather to Me My saints, who made a covenant with Me by sacrifice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_6","020_50_6","PSA","50","6","6","And the heavens proclaim His righteousness, for God Himself is Judge. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_7","020_50_7","PSA","50","7","7","“Hear, O My people, and I will speak, O Israel, and I will testify against you: I am God, your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_8","020_50_8","PSA","50","8","8","I do not rebuke you for your sacrifices, and your burnt offerings are ever before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_9","020_50_9","PSA","50","9","9","I have no need for a bull from your stall or goats from your pens, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_10","020_50_10","PSA","50","10","10","for every beast of the forest is Mine—the cattle on a thousand hills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_11","020_50_11","PSA","50","11","11","I know every bird in the mountains, and the creatures of the field are Mine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_12","020_50_12","PSA","50","12","12","If I were hungry, I would not tell you, for the world is Mine, and the fullness thereof. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_13","020_50_13","PSA","50","13","13","Do I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_14","020_50_14","PSA","50","14","14","Sacrifice a thank offering to God, and fulfill your vows to the Most High. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_15","020_50_15","PSA","50","15","15","Call upon Me in the day of trouble; I will deliver you, and you will honor Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_16","020_50_16","PSA","50","16","16","To the wicked, however, God says, “What right have you to recite My statutes and to bear My covenant on your lips? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_17","020_50_17","PSA","50","17","17","For you hate My instruction and cast My words behind you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_18","020_50_18","PSA","50","18","18","When you see a thief, you befriend him, and throw in your lot with adulterers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_19","020_50_19","PSA","50","19","19","You unleash your mouth for evil and harness your tongue to deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_20","020_50_20","PSA","50","20","20","You sit and malign your brother; you slander your own mother’s son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_21","020_50_21","PSA","50","21","21","You have done these things, and I kept silent; you thought I was just like you. But now I rebuke you and accuse you to your face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_22","020_50_22","PSA","50","22","22","Now consider this, you who forget God, lest I tear you to pieces, with no one to rescue you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS50_23","020_50_23","PSA","50","23","23","He who sacrifices a thank offering honors Me, and to him who rightly orders his way, I will show the salvation of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_1","020_51_1","PSA","51","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. When Nathan the prophet came to him after his adultery with Bathsheba. Have mercy on me, O God, according to Your loving devotion; according to Your great compassion, blot out my transgressions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_2","020_51_2","PSA","51","2","2","Wash me clean of my iniquity and cleanse me from my sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_3","020_51_3","PSA","51","3","3","For I know my transgressions, and my sin is always before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_4","020_51_4","PSA","51","4","4","Against You, You only, have I sinned and done what is evil in Your sight, so that You may be proved right when You speak and blameless when You judge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_5","020_51_5","PSA","51","5","5","Surely I was brought forth in iniquity; I was sinful when my mother conceived me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_6","020_51_6","PSA","51","6","6","Surely You desire truth in the inmost being; You teach me wisdom in the inmost place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_7","020_51_7","PSA","51","7","7","Purify me with hyssop, and I will be clean; wash me, and I will be whiter than snow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_8","020_51_8","PSA","51","8","8","Let me hear joy and gladness; let the bones You have crushed rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_9","020_51_9","PSA","51","9","9","Hide Your face from my sins and blot out all my iniquities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_10","020_51_10","PSA","51","10","10","Create in me a clean heart, O God, and renew a right spirit within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_11","020_51_11","PSA","51","11","11","Cast me not away from Your presence; take not Your Holy Spirit from me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_12","020_51_12","PSA","51","12","12","Restore to me the joy of Your salvation, and sustain me with a willing spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_13","020_51_13","PSA","51","13","13","Then I will teach transgressors Your ways, and sinners will return to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_14","020_51_14","PSA","51","14","14","Deliver me from bloodguilt, O God, the God of my salvation, and my tongue will sing of Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_15","020_51_15","PSA","51","15","15","O Lord, open my lips, and my mouth will declare Your praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_16","020_51_16","PSA","51","16","16","For You do not delight in sacrifice, or I would bring it; You take no pleasure in burnt offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_17","020_51_17","PSA","51","17","17","The sacrifices of God are a broken spirit; a broken and a contrite heart, O God, You will not despise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_18","020_51_18","PSA","51","18","18","In Your good pleasure, cause Zion to prosper; build up the walls of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS51_19","020_51_19","PSA","51","19","19","Then You will delight in righteous sacrifices, in whole burnt offerings; then bulls will be offered on Your altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_1","020_52_1","PSA","52","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Maskil of David. After Doeg the Edomite went to Saul and told him, “David has gone to the house of Ahimelech.” Why do you boast of evil, O mighty man? The loving devotion of God endures all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_2","020_52_2","PSA","52","2","2","Your tongue devises destruction like a sharpened razor, O worker of deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_3","020_52_3","PSA","52","3","3","You love evil more than good, falsehood more than speaking truth. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_4","020_52_4","PSA","52","4","4","You love every word that devours, O deceitful tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_5","020_52_5","PSA","52","5","5","Surely God will bring you down to everlasting ruin; He will snatch you up and tear you away from your tent; He will uproot you from the land of the living. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_6","020_52_6","PSA","52","6","6","The righteous will see and fear; they will mock the evildoer, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_7","020_52_7","PSA","52","7","7","“Look at the man who did not make God his refuge, but trusted in the abundance of his wealth and strengthened himself by destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_8","020_52_8","PSA","52","8","8","But I am like an olive tree flourishing in the house of God; I trust in the loving devotion of God forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS52_9","020_52_9","PSA","52","9","9","I will praise You forever, because You have done it. I will wait on Your name—for it is good—in the presence of Your saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_1","020_53_1","PSA","53","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Mahalath. A Maskil of David. The fool says in his heart, “There is no God.” They are corrupt; their ways are vile. There is no one who does good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_2","020_53_2","PSA","53","2","2","God looks down from heaven upon the sons of men to see if any understand, if any seek God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_3","020_53_3","PSA","53","3","3","All have turned away, they have together become corrupt; there is no one who does good, not even one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_4","020_53_4","PSA","53","4","4","Will the workers of iniquity never learn? They devour my people like bread; they refuse to call upon God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_5","020_53_5","PSA","53","5","5","There they are, overwhelmed with dread, where there was nothing to fear. For God has scattered the bones of those who besieged you. You put them to shame, for God has despised them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS53_6","020_53_6","PSA","53","6","6","Oh, that the salvation of Israel would come from Zion! When God restores His captive people, let Jacob rejoice, let Israel be glad! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_1","020_54_1","PSA","54","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. A Maskil of David. When the Ziphites went to Saul and said, “Is David not hiding among us?” Save me, O God, by Your name, and vindicate me by Your might! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_2","020_54_2","PSA","54","2","2","Hear my prayer, O God; listen to the words of my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_3","020_54_3","PSA","54","3","3","For strangers rise up against me, and ruthless men seek my life—men with no regard for God. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_4","020_54_4","PSA","54","4","4","Surely God is my helper; the Lord is the sustainer of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_5","020_54_5","PSA","54","5","5","He will reward my enemies with evil. In Your faithfulness, destroy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_6","020_54_6","PSA","54","6","6","Freely I will sacrifice to You; I will praise Your name, O LORD, for it is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS54_7","020_54_7","PSA","54","7","7","For He has delivered me from every trouble, and my eyes have looked in triumph on my foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_1","020_55_1","PSA","55","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. A Maskil of David. Listen to my prayer, O God, and do not ignore my plea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_2","020_55_2","PSA","55","2","2","Attend to me and answer me. I am restless in my complaint, and distraught ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_3","020_55_3","PSA","55","3","3","at the voice of the enemy, at the pressure of the wicked. For they bring down disaster upon me and resent me in their anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_4","020_55_4","PSA","55","4","4","My heart pounds within me, and the terrors of death assail me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_5","020_55_5","PSA","55","5","5","Fear and trembling grip me, and horror has overwhelmed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_6","020_55_6","PSA","55","6","6","I said, “Oh, that I had wings like a dove! I would fly away and find rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_7","020_55_7","PSA","55","7","7","How far away I would flee! In the wilderness I would remain. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_8","020_55_8","PSA","55","8","8","I would hurry to my shelter, far from this raging tempest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_9","020_55_9","PSA","55","9","9","O Lord, confuse and confound their speech, for I see violence and strife in the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_10","020_55_10","PSA","55","10","10","Day and night they encircle the walls, while malice and trouble lie within. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_11","020_55_11","PSA","55","11","11","Destruction is within; oppression and deceit never leave the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_12","020_55_12","PSA","55","12","12","For it is not an enemy who insults me; that I could endure. It is not a foe who rises against me; from him I could hide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_13","020_55_13","PSA","55","13","13","But it is you, a man like myself, my companion and close friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_14","020_55_14","PSA","55","14","14","We shared sweet fellowship together; we walked with the crowd into the house of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_15","020_55_15","PSA","55","15","15","Let death seize them by surprise; let them go down to Sheol alive, for evil is with them in their homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_16","020_55_16","PSA","55","16","16","But I call to God, and the LORD saves me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_17","020_55_17","PSA","55","17","17","Morning, noon, and night, I cry out in distress, and He hears my voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_18","020_55_18","PSA","55","18","18","He redeems my soul in peace from the battle waged against me, even though many oppose me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_19","020_55_19","PSA","55","19","19","God will hear and humiliate them—the One enthroned for the ages—Selah because they do not change and they have no fear of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_20","020_55_20","PSA","55","20","20","My companion attacks his friends; he violates his covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_21","020_55_21","PSA","55","21","21","His speech is smooth as butter, but war is in his heart. His words are softer than oil, yet they are swords unsheathed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_22","020_55_22","PSA","55","22","22","Cast your burden upon the LORD and He will sustain you; He will never let the righteous be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS55_23","020_55_23","PSA","55","23","23","But You, O God, will bring them down to the Pit of destruction; men of bloodshed and deceit will not live out half their days. But I will trust in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_1","020_56_1","PSA","56","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “A Dove on Distant Oaks.” A Miktam of David, when the Philistines seized him in Gath. Be merciful to me, O God, for men are hounding me; all day they press their attack. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_2","020_56_2","PSA","56","2","2","My enemies pursue me all day long, for many proudly assail me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_3","020_56_3","PSA","56","3","3","When I am afraid, I put my trust in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_4","020_56_4","PSA","56","4","4","In God, whose word I praise—in God I trust. I will not be afraid. What can man do to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_5","020_56_5","PSA","56","5","5","All day long they twist my words; all their thoughts are on my demise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_6","020_56_6","PSA","56","6","6","They conspire, they lurk, they watch my steps while they wait to take my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_7","020_56_7","PSA","56","7","7","In spite of such sin, will they escape? In Your anger, O God, cast down the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_8","020_56_8","PSA","56","8","8","You have taken account of my wanderings. Put my tears in Your bottle—are they not in Your book? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_9","020_56_9","PSA","56","9","9","Then my enemies will retreat on the day I cry for help. By this I will know that God is on my side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_10","020_56_10","PSA","56","10","10","In God, whose word I praise, in the LORD, whose word I praise, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_11","020_56_11","PSA","56","11","11","in God I trust; I will not be afraid. What can man do to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_12","020_56_12","PSA","56","12","12","Your vows are upon me, O God; I will render thank offerings to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS56_13","020_56_13","PSA","56","13","13","For You have delivered my soul from death, and my feet from stumbling, that I may walk before God in the light of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_1","020_57_1","PSA","57","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A Miktam of David, when he fled from Saul into the cave. Have mercy on me, O God, have mercy, for in You my soul takes refuge. In the shadow of Your wings I will take shelter until the danger has passed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_2","020_57_2","PSA","57","2","2","I cry out to God Most High, to God who fulfills His purpose for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_3","020_57_3","PSA","57","3","3","He reaches down from heaven and saves me; He rebukes those who trample me. Selah God sends forth His loving devotion and His truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_4","020_57_4","PSA","57","4","4","My soul is among the lions; I lie down with ravenous beasts—with men whose teeth are spears and arrows, whose tongues are sharp swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_5","020_57_5","PSA","57","5","5","Be exalted, O God, above the heavens; may Your glory cover all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_6","020_57_6","PSA","57","6","6","They spread a net for my feet; my soul was despondent. They dug a pit before me, but they themselves have fallen into it! Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_7","020_57_7","PSA","57","7","7","My heart is steadfast, O God, my heart is steadfast. I will sing and make music. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_8","020_57_8","PSA","57","8","8","Awake, my glory! Awake, O harp and lyre! I will awaken the dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_9","020_57_9","PSA","57","9","9","I will praise You, O Lord, among the nations; I will sing Your praises among the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_10","020_57_10","PSA","57","10","10","For Your loving devotion reaches to the heavens, and Your faithfulness to the clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS57_11","020_57_11","PSA","57","11","11","Be exalted, O God, above the heavens; may Your glory cover all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_1","020_58_1","PSA","58","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A Miktam of David. Do you indeed speak justly, O rulers? Do you judge uprightly, O sons of men? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_2","020_58_2","PSA","58","2","2","No, in your hearts you devise injustice; with your hands you mete out violence on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_3","020_58_3","PSA","58","3","3","The wicked are estranged from the womb; the liars go astray from birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_4","020_58_4","PSA","58","4","4","Their venom is like the venom of a snake, like a cobra that shuts its ears, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_5","020_58_5","PSA","58","5","5","refusing to hear the tune of the charmer who skillfully weaves his spell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_6","020_58_6","PSA","58","6","6","O God, shatter their teeth in their mouths; O LORD, tear out the fangs of the lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_7","020_58_7","PSA","58","7","7","May they vanish like water that runs off; when they draw the bow, may their arrows be blunted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_8","020_58_8","PSA","58","8","8","Like a slug that dissolves in its slime, like a woman’s stillborn child, may they never see the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_9","020_58_9","PSA","58","9","9","Before your pots can feel the burning thorns—whether green or dry—He will sweep them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_10","020_58_10","PSA","58","10","10","The righteous will rejoice when they see they are avenged; they will wash their feet in the blood of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS58_11","020_58_11","PSA","58","11","11","Then men will say, “There is surely a reward for the righteous! There is surely a God who judges the earth!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_1","020_59_1","PSA","59","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A Miktam of David, when Saul sent men to watch David’s house in order to kill him. Deliver me from my enemies, O my God; protect me from those who rise against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_2","020_59_2","PSA","59","2","2","Deliver me from workers of iniquity, and save me from men of bloodshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_3","020_59_3","PSA","59","3","3","See how they lie in wait for me. Fierce men conspire against me for no transgression or sin of my own, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_4","020_59_4","PSA","59","4","4","For no fault of my own, they move swiftly to attack me. Arise to help me, and take notice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_5","020_59_5","PSA","59","5","5","O LORD God of Hosts, the God of Israel, rouse Yourself to punish all the nations; show no mercy to the wicked traitors. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_6","020_59_6","PSA","59","6","6","They return in the evening, snarling like dogs and prowling around the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_7","020_59_7","PSA","59","7","7","See what they spew from their mouths—sharp words from their lips: “For who can hear us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_8","020_59_8","PSA","59","8","8","But You, O LORD, laugh at them; You scoff at all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_9","020_59_9","PSA","59","9","9","I will keep watch for You, O my strength, because You, O God, are my fortress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_10","020_59_10","PSA","59","10","10","My God of loving devotion will come to meet me; God will let me stare down my foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_11","020_59_11","PSA","59","11","11","Do not kill them, or my people will forget. Scatter them by Your power, and bring them down, O Lord, our shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_12","020_59_12","PSA","59","12","12","By the sins of their mouths and the words of their lips, let them be trapped in their pride, in the curses and lies they utter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_13","020_59_13","PSA","59","13","13","Consume them in wrath; consume them till they are no more, so it may be known to the ends of the earth that God rules over Jacob. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_14","020_59_14","PSA","59","14","14","They return in the evening, snarling like dogs and prowling around the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_15","020_59_15","PSA","59","15","15","They scavenge for food, and growl if they are not satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_16","020_59_16","PSA","59","16","16","But I will sing of Your strength and proclaim Your loving devotion in the morning. For You are my fortress, my refuge in times of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS59_17","020_59_17","PSA","59","17","17","To You, O my strength, I sing praises, for You, O God, are my fortress, my God of loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_1","020_60_1","PSA","60","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Lily of the Covenant.” A Miktam of David for instruction. When he fought Aram-naharaim and Aram-zobah, and Joab returned and struck down 12,000 Edomites in the Valley of Salt. You have rejected us, O God; You have broken us; You have been angry; restore us! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_2","020_60_2","PSA","60","2","2","You have shaken the land and torn it open. Heal its fractures, for it is quaking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_3","020_60_3","PSA","60","3","3","You have shown Your people hardship; we are staggered from the wine You made us drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_4","020_60_4","PSA","60","4","4","You have raised a banner for those who fear You, that they may flee the bow. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_5","020_60_5","PSA","60","5","5","Respond and save us with Your right hand, that Your beloved may be delivered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_6","020_60_6","PSA","60","6","6","God has spoken from His sanctuary: “I will triumph! I will parcel out Shechem and apportion the Valley of Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_7","020_60_7","PSA","60","7","7","Gilead is Mine, and Manasseh is Mine; Ephraim is My helmet, Judah is My scepter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_8","020_60_8","PSA","60","8","8","Moab is My washbasin; upon Edom I toss My sandal; over Philistia I shout in triumph.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_9","020_60_9","PSA","60","9","9","Who will bring me to the fortified city? Who will lead me to Edom? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_10","020_60_10","PSA","60","10","10","Have You not rejected us, O God? Will You no longer march out, O God, with our armies? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_11","020_60_11","PSA","60","11","11","Give us aid against the enemy, for the help of man is worthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS60_12","020_60_12","PSA","60","12","12","With God we will perform with valor, and He will trample our enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_1","020_61_1","PSA","61","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. Of David. Hear my cry, O God; attend to my prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_2","020_61_2","PSA","61","2","2","From the ends of the earth I call out to You whenever my heart is faint. Lead me to the rock that is higher than I. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_3","020_61_3","PSA","61","3","3","For You have been my refuge, a tower of strength against the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_4","020_61_4","PSA","61","4","4","Let me dwell in Your tent forever and take refuge in the shelter of Your wings. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_5","020_61_5","PSA","61","5","5","For You have heard my vows, O God; You have given me the inheritance reserved for those who fear Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_6","020_61_6","PSA","61","6","6","Increase the days of the king’s life; may his years span many generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_7","020_61_7","PSA","61","7","7","May he sit enthroned in God’s presence forever; appoint Your loving devotion and Your faithfulness to guard him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS61_8","020_61_8","PSA","61","8","8","Then I will ever sing praise to Your name and fulfill my vows day by day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_1","020_62_1","PSA","62","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Jeduthun. A Psalm of David. In God alone my soul finds rest; my salvation comes from Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_2","020_62_2","PSA","62","2","2","He alone is my rock and my salvation. He is my fortress; I will never be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_3","020_62_3","PSA","62","3","3","How long will you threaten a man? Will all of you throw him down like a leaning wall or a tottering fence? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_4","020_62_4","PSA","62","4","4","They fully intend to cast him down from his lofty perch; they delight in lies; with their mouths they bless, but inwardly they curse. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_5","020_62_5","PSA","62","5","5","Rest in God alone, O my soul, for my hope comes from Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_6","020_62_6","PSA","62","6","6","He alone is my rock and my salvation; He is my fortress; I will not be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_7","020_62_7","PSA","62","7","7","My salvation and my honor rest on God, my strong rock; my refuge is in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_8","020_62_8","PSA","62","8","8","Trust in Him at all times, O people; pour out your hearts before Him. God is our refuge. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_9","020_62_9","PSA","62","9","9","Lowborn men are but a vapor; the exalted are but a lie. Weighed on the scale, they go up; together they are but a vapor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_10","020_62_10","PSA","62","10","10","Place no trust in extortion or false hope in stolen goods. If your riches increase, do not set your heart upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_11","020_62_11","PSA","62","11","11","God has spoken once; I have heard this twice: that power belongs to God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS62_12","020_62_12","PSA","62","12","12","and loving devotion to You, O Lord. For You will repay each man according to his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_1","020_63_1","PSA","63","1","1","A Psalm of David, when he was in the Wilderness of Judah. O God, You are my God. Earnestly I seek You; my soul thirsts for You. My body yearns for You in a dry and weary land without water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_2","020_63_2","PSA","63","2","2","So I have seen You in the sanctuary and beheld Your power and glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_3","020_63_3","PSA","63","3","3","Because Your loving devotion is better than life, my lips will glorify You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_4","020_63_4","PSA","63","4","4","So I will bless You as long as I live; in Your name I will lift my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_5","020_63_5","PSA","63","5","5","My soul is satisfied as with the richest of foods; with joyful lips my mouth will praise You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_6","020_63_6","PSA","63","6","6","When I remember You on my bed, I think of You through the watches of the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_7","020_63_7","PSA","63","7","7","For You are my help; I will sing for joy in the shadow of Your wings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_8","020_63_8","PSA","63","8","8","My soul clings to You; Your right hand upholds me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_9","020_63_9","PSA","63","9","9","But those who seek my life to destroy it will go into the depths of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_10","020_63_10","PSA","63","10","10","They will fall to the power of the sword; they will become a portion for foxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS63_11","020_63_11","PSA","63","11","11","But the king will rejoice in God; all who swear by Him will exult, for the mouths of liars will be shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_1","020_64_1","PSA","64","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. Hear, O God, my voice of complaint; preserve my life from dread of the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_2","020_64_2","PSA","64","2","2","Hide me from the scheming of the wicked, from the mob of workers of iniquity, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_3","020_64_3","PSA","64","3","3","who sharpen their tongues like swords and aim their bitter words like arrows, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_4","020_64_4","PSA","64","4","4","ambushing the innocent in seclusion, shooting suddenly, without fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_5","020_64_5","PSA","64","5","5","They hold fast to their evil purpose; they speak of hiding their snares. “Who will see them?” they say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_6","020_64_6","PSA","64","6","6","They devise injustice and say, “We have perfected a secret plan.” For the inner man and the heart are mysterious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_7","020_64_7","PSA","64","7","7","But God will shoot them with arrows; suddenly they will be wounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_8","020_64_8","PSA","64","8","8","They will be made to stumble, their own tongues turned against them. All who see will shake their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_9","020_64_9","PSA","64","9","9","Then all mankind will fear and proclaim the work of God; so they will ponder what He has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS64_10","020_64_10","PSA","64","10","10","Let the righteous rejoice in the LORD and take refuge in Him; let all the upright in heart exult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_1","020_65_1","PSA","65","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. A song. Praise awaits You, O God, in Zion; to You our vows will be fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_2","020_65_2","PSA","65","2","2","O You who listen to prayer, all people will come to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_3","020_65_3","PSA","65","3","3","When iniquities prevail against me, You atone for our transgressions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_4","020_65_4","PSA","65","4","4","Blessed is the one You choose and bring near to dwell in Your courts! We are filled with the goodness of Your house, the holiness of Your temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_5","020_65_5","PSA","65","5","5","With awesome deeds of righteousness You answer us, O God of our salvation, the hope of all the ends of the earth and of the farthest seas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_6","020_65_6","PSA","65","6","6","You formed the mountains by Your power, having girded Yourself with might. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_7","020_65_7","PSA","65","7","7","You stilled the roaring of the seas, the pounding of their waves, and the tumult of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_8","020_65_8","PSA","65","8","8","Those who live far away fear Your wonders; You make the dawn and sunset shout for joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_9","020_65_9","PSA","65","9","9","You attend to the earth and water it; with abundance You enrich it. The streams of God are full of water, for You prepare our grain by providing for the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_10","020_65_10","PSA","65","10","10","You soak its furrows and level its ridges; You soften it with showers and bless its growth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_11","020_65_11","PSA","65","11","11","You crown the year with Your bounty, and Your paths overflow with plenty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_12","020_65_12","PSA","65","12","12","The pastures of the wilderness overflow; the hills are robed with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS65_13","020_65_13","PSA","65","13","13","The pastures are clothed with flocks, and the valleys are decked with grain. They shout in triumph; indeed, they sing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_1","020_66_1","PSA","66","1","1","For the choirmaster. A song. A Psalm. Make a joyful noise to God, all the earth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_2","020_66_2","PSA","66","2","2","Sing the glory of His name; make His praise glorious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_3","020_66_3","PSA","66","3","3","Say to God, “How awesome are Your deeds! So great is Your power that Your enemies cower before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_4","020_66_4","PSA","66","4","4","All the earth bows down to You; they sing praise to You; they sing praise to Your name.” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_5","020_66_5","PSA","66","5","5","Come and see the works of God; how awesome are His deeds toward mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_6","020_66_6","PSA","66","6","6","He turned the sea into dry land; they passed through the waters on foot; there we rejoiced in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_7","020_66_7","PSA","66","7","7","He rules forever by His power; His eyes watch the nations. Do not let the rebellious exalt themselves. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_8","020_66_8","PSA","66","8","8","Bless our God, O peoples; let the sound of His praise be heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_9","020_66_9","PSA","66","9","9","He preserves our lives and keeps our feet from slipping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_10","020_66_10","PSA","66","10","10","For You, O God, have tested us; You have refined us like silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_11","020_66_11","PSA","66","11","11","You led us into the net; You laid burdens on our backs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_12","020_66_12","PSA","66","12","12","You let men ride over our heads; we went through fire and water, but You brought us into abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_13","020_66_13","PSA","66","13","13","I will enter Your house with burnt offerings; I will fulfill my vows to You— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_14","020_66_14","PSA","66","14","14","the vows that my lips promised and my mouth spoke in my distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_15","020_66_15","PSA","66","15","15","I will offer You fatlings as burnt offerings, with the fragrant smoke of rams; I will offer bulls and goats. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_16","020_66_16","PSA","66","16","16","Come and listen, all you who fear God, and I will declare what He has done for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_17","020_66_17","PSA","66","17","17","I cried out to Him with my mouth and praised Him with my tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_18","020_66_18","PSA","66","18","18","If I had cherished iniquity in my heart, the Lord would not have listened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_19","020_66_19","PSA","66","19","19","But God has surely heard; He has attended to the sound of my prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS66_20","020_66_20","PSA","66","20","20","Blessed be God, who has not rejected my prayer or withheld from me His loving devotion! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_1","020_67_1","PSA","67","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. A Psalm. A song. May God be gracious to us and bless us, and cause His face to shine upon us, Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_2","020_67_2","PSA","67","2","2","that Your ways may be known on earth, Your salvation among all nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_3","020_67_3","PSA","67","3","3","Let the peoples praise You, O God; let all the peoples praise You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_4","020_67_4","PSA","67","4","4","Let the nations be glad and sing for joy, for You judge the peoples justly and lead the nations of the earth. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_5","020_67_5","PSA","67","5","5","Let the peoples praise You, O God; let all the peoples praise You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_6","020_67_6","PSA","67","6","6","The earth has yielded its harvest; God, our God, blesses us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS67_7","020_67_7","PSA","67","7","7","God blesses us, that all the ends of the earth shall fear Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_1","020_68_1","PSA","68","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. A song. God arises. His enemies are scattered, and those who hate Him flee His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_2","020_68_2","PSA","68","2","2","As smoke is blown away, You will drive them out; as wax melts before the fire, the wicked will perish in the presence of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_3","020_68_3","PSA","68","3","3","But the righteous will be glad and rejoice before God; they will celebrate with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_4","020_68_4","PSA","68","4","4","Sing to God! Sing praises to His name. Exalt Him who rides on the clouds—His name is the LORD—and rejoice before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_5","020_68_5","PSA","68","5","5","A father of the fatherless and a defender of widows is God in His holy habitation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_6","020_68_6","PSA","68","6","6","God settles the lonely in families; He leads the prisoners out to prosperity, but the rebellious dwell in a sun-scorched land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_7","020_68_7","PSA","68","7","7","O God, when You went out before Your people, when You marched through the wasteland, Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_8","020_68_8","PSA","68","8","8","the earth shook and the heavens poured down rain before God, the One on Sinai, before God, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_9","020_68_9","PSA","68","9","9","You sent abundant rain, O God; You refreshed Your weary inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_10","020_68_10","PSA","68","10","10","Your flock settled therein; O God, from Your bounty You provided for the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_11","020_68_11","PSA","68","11","11","The Lord gives the command; a great company of women proclaim it: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_12","020_68_12","PSA","68","12","12","“Kings and their armies flee in haste; she who waits at home divides the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_13","020_68_13","PSA","68","13","13","Though you lie down among the sheepfolds, the wings of the dove are covered with silver, and her feathers with shimmering gold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_14","020_68_14","PSA","68","14","14","When the Almighty scattered the kings in the land, it was like the snow falling on Zalmon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_15","020_68_15","PSA","68","15","15","A mountain of God is Mount Bashan; a mountain of many peaks is Mount Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_16","020_68_16","PSA","68","16","16","Why do you gaze in envy, O mountains of many peaks? This is the mountain God chose for His dwelling, where the LORD will surely dwell forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_17","020_68_17","PSA","68","17","17","The chariots of God are tens of thousands—thousands of thousands are they; the Lord is in His sanctuary as He was at Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_18","020_68_18","PSA","68","18","18","You have ascended on high; You have led captives away. You have received gifts from men, even from the rebellious, that the LORD God may dwell there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_19","020_68_19","PSA","68","19","19","Blessed be the Lord, who daily bears our burden, the God of our salvation. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_20","020_68_20","PSA","68","20","20","Our God is a God of deliverance; the Lord GOD is our rescuer from death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_21","020_68_21","PSA","68","21","21","Surely God will crush the heads of His enemies, the hairy crowns of those who persist in guilty ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_22","020_68_22","PSA","68","22","22","The Lord said, “I will retrieve them from Bashan, I will bring them up from the depths of the sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_23","020_68_23","PSA","68","23","23","that your foot may be dipped in the blood of your foes—the tongues of your dogs in the same.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_24","020_68_24","PSA","68","24","24","They have seen Your procession, O God—the march of my God and King into the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_25","020_68_25","PSA","68","25","25","The singers lead the way, the musicians follow after, among the maidens playing tambourines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_26","020_68_26","PSA","68","26","26","Bless God in the great congregation; bless the LORD from the fountain of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_27","020_68_27","PSA","68","27","27","There is Benjamin, the youngest, ruling them, the princes of Judah in their company, the princes of Zebulun and of Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_28","020_68_28","PSA","68","28","28","Summon Your power, O God; show Your strength, O God, which You have exerted on our behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_29","020_68_29","PSA","68","29","29","Because of Your temple at Jerusalem kings will bring You gifts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_30","020_68_30","PSA","68","30","30","Rebuke the beast in the reeds, the herd of bulls among the calves of the nations, until it submits, bringing bars of silver. Scatter the nations who delight in war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_31","020_68_31","PSA","68","31","31","Envoys will arrive from Egypt; Cush will stretch out her hands to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_32","020_68_32","PSA","68","32","32","Sing to God, O kingdoms of the earth; sing praises to the Lord—Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_33","020_68_33","PSA","68","33","33","to Him who rides upon the highest heavens of old; behold, His mighty voice resounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_34","020_68_34","PSA","68","34","34","Ascribe the power to God, whose majesty is over Israel, whose strength is in the skies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS68_35","020_68_35","PSA","68","35","35","O God, You are awesome in Your sanctuary; the God of Israel Himself gives strength and power to His people. Blessed be God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_1","020_69_1","PSA","69","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “Lilies.” Of David. Save me, O God, for the waters are up to my neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_2","020_69_2","PSA","69","2","2","I have sunk into the miry depths, where there is no footing; I have drifted into deep waters, where the flood engulfs me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_3","020_69_3","PSA","69","3","3","I am weary from my crying; my throat is parched. My eyes fail, looking for my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_4","020_69_4","PSA","69","4","4","Those who hate me without cause outnumber the hairs of my head; many are those who would destroy me—my enemies for no reason. Though I did not steal, I must repay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_5","020_69_5","PSA","69","5","5","You know my folly, O God, and my guilt is not hidden from You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_6","020_69_6","PSA","69","6","6","May those who hope in You not be ashamed through me, O Lord GOD of Hosts; may those who seek You not be dishonored through me, O God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_7","020_69_7","PSA","69","7","7","For I have endured scorn for Your sake, and shame has covered my face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_8","020_69_8","PSA","69","8","8","I have become a stranger to my brothers and a foreigner to my mother’s sons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_9","020_69_9","PSA","69","9","9","because zeal for Your house has consumed me, and the insults of those who insult You have fallen on me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_10","020_69_10","PSA","69","10","10","I wept and fasted, but it brought me reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_11","020_69_11","PSA","69","11","11","I made sackcloth my clothing, and I was sport to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_12","020_69_12","PSA","69","12","12","Those who sit at the gate mock me, and I am the song of drunkards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_13","020_69_13","PSA","69","13","13","But my prayer to You, O LORD, is for a time of favor. In Your abundant loving devotion, O God, answer me with Your sure salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_14","020_69_14","PSA","69","14","14","Rescue me from the mire and do not let me sink; deliver me from my foes and out of the deep waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_15","020_69_15","PSA","69","15","15","Do not let the floods engulf me or the depths swallow me up; let not the Pit close its mouth over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_16","020_69_16","PSA","69","16","16","Answer me, O LORD, for Your loving devotion is good; turn to me in keeping with Your great compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_17","020_69_17","PSA","69","17","17","Hide not Your face from Your servant, for I am in distress. Answer me quickly! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_18","020_69_18","PSA","69","18","18","Draw near to my soul and redeem me; ransom me because of my foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_19","020_69_19","PSA","69","19","19","You know my reproach, my shame and disgrace. All my adversaries are before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_20","020_69_20","PSA","69","20","20","Insults have broken my heart, and I am in despair. I looked for sympathy, but there was none, for comforters, but I found no one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_21","020_69_21","PSA","69","21","21","They poisoned my food with gall and gave me vinegar to quench my thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_22","020_69_22","PSA","69","22","22","May their table become a snare; may it be a retribution and a trap. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_23","020_69_23","PSA","69","23","23","May their eyes be darkened so they cannot see, and their backs be bent forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_24","020_69_24","PSA","69","24","24","Pour out Your wrath upon them, and let Your burning anger overtake them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_25","020_69_25","PSA","69","25","25","May their place be deserted; let there be no one to dwell in their tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_26","020_69_26","PSA","69","26","26","For they persecute the one You struck and recount the pain of those You wounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_27","020_69_27","PSA","69","27","27","Add iniquity to their iniquity; let them not share in Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_28","020_69_28","PSA","69","28","28","May they be blotted out of the Book of Life and not listed with the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_29","020_69_29","PSA","69","29","29","But I am in pain and distress; let Your salvation protect me, O God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_30","020_69_30","PSA","69","30","30","I will praise God’s name in song and exalt Him with thanksgiving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_31","020_69_31","PSA","69","31","31","And this will please the LORD more than an ox, more than a bull with horns and hooves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_32","020_69_32","PSA","69","32","32","The humble will see and rejoice. You who seek God, let your hearts be revived! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_33","020_69_33","PSA","69","33","33","For the LORD listens to the needy and does not despise His captive people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_34","020_69_34","PSA","69","34","34","Let heaven and earth praise Him, the seas and everything that moves in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_35","020_69_35","PSA","69","35","35","For God will save Zion and rebuild the cities of Judah, that they may dwell there and possess it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS69_36","020_69_36","PSA","69","36","36","The descendants of His servants will inherit it, and those who love His name will settle in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS70_1","020_70_1","PSA","70","1","1","For the choirmaster. Of David. To bring remembrance. Make haste, O God, to deliver me! Hurry, O LORD, to help me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS70_2","020_70_2","PSA","70","2","2","May those who seek my life be ashamed and confounded; may those who wish me harm be repelled and humiliated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS70_3","020_70_3","PSA","70","3","3","May those who say, “Aha, aha!” retreat because of their shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS70_4","020_70_4","PSA","70","4","4","May all who seek You rejoice and be glad in You; may those who love Your salvation always say, “Let God be magnified!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS70_5","020_70_5","PSA","70","5","5","But I am poor and needy; hurry to me, O God. You are my help and my deliverer; O LORD, do not delay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_1","020_71_1","PSA","71","1","1","In You, O LORD, I have taken refuge; let me never be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_2","020_71_2","PSA","71","2","2","In Your justice, rescue and deliver me; incline Your ear and save me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_3","020_71_3","PSA","71","3","3","Be my rock of refuge, where I can always go. Give the command to save me, for You are my rock and my fortress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_4","020_71_4","PSA","71","4","4","Deliver me, O my God, from the hand of the wicked, from the grasp of the unjust and ruthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_5","020_71_5","PSA","71","5","5","For You are my hope, O Lord GOD, my confidence from my youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_6","020_71_6","PSA","71","6","6","I have leaned on You since birth; You pulled me from my mother’s womb. My praise is always for You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_7","020_71_7","PSA","71","7","7","I have become a portent to many, but You are my strong refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_8","020_71_8","PSA","71","8","8","My mouth is filled with Your praise and with Your splendor all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_9","020_71_9","PSA","71","9","9","Do not discard me in my old age; do not forsake me when my strength fails. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_10","020_71_10","PSA","71","10","10","For my enemies speak against me, and those who lie in wait for my life conspire, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_11","020_71_11","PSA","71","11","11","saying, “God has forsaken him; pursue him and seize him, for there is no one to rescue him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_12","020_71_12","PSA","71","12","12","Be not far from me, O God. Hurry, O my God, to help me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_13","020_71_13","PSA","71","13","13","May the accusers of my soul be ashamed and consumed; may those who seek my harm be covered with scorn and disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_14","020_71_14","PSA","71","14","14","But I will always hope and will praise You more and more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_15","020_71_15","PSA","71","15","15","My mouth will declare Your righteousness and Your salvation all day long, though I cannot know their full measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_16","020_71_16","PSA","71","16","16","I will come in the strength of the Lord GOD; I will proclaim Your righteousness—Yours alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_17","020_71_17","PSA","71","17","17","O God, You have taught me from my youth, and to this day I proclaim Your marvelous deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_18","020_71_18","PSA","71","18","18","Even when I am old and gray, do not forsake me, O God, until I proclaim Your power to the next generation, Your might to all who are to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_19","020_71_19","PSA","71","19","19","Your righteousness reaches to the heavens, O God, You who have done great things. Who, O God, is like You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_20","020_71_20","PSA","71","20","20","Though You have shown me many troubles and misfortunes, You will revive me once again. Even from the depths of the earth You will bring me back up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_21","020_71_21","PSA","71","21","21","You will increase my honor and comfort me once again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_22","020_71_22","PSA","71","22","22","So I will praise You with the harp for Your faithfulness, O my God; I will sing praise to You with the lyre, O Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_23","020_71_23","PSA","71","23","23","When I sing praise to You my lips will shout for joy, along with my soul, which You have redeemed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS71_24","020_71_24","PSA","71","24","24","My tongue will indeed proclaim Your righteousness all day long, for those who seek my harm are disgraced and confounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_1","020_72_1","PSA","72","1","1","Of Solomon. Endow the king with Your justice, O God, and the son of the king with Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_2","020_72_2","PSA","72","2","2","May he judge Your people with righteousness and Your afflicted with justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_3","020_72_3","PSA","72","3","3","May the mountains bring peace to the people, and the hills bring righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_4","020_72_4","PSA","72","4","4","May he vindicate the afflicted among the people; may he save the children of the needy and crush the oppressor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_5","020_72_5","PSA","72","5","5","May they fear him as long as the sun shines, as long as the moon remains, through all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_6","020_72_6","PSA","72","6","6","May he be like rain that falls on freshly cut grass, like spring showers that water the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_7","020_72_7","PSA","72","7","7","May the righteous flourish in his days and prosperity abound until the moon is no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_8","020_72_8","PSA","72","8","8","May he rule from sea to sea, and from the Euphrates to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_9","020_72_9","PSA","72","9","9","May the nomads bow before him, and his enemies lick the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_10","020_72_10","PSA","72","10","10","May the kings of Tarshish and distant shores bring tribute; may the kings of Sheba and Seba offer gifts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_11","020_72_11","PSA","72","11","11","May all kings bow down to him and all nations serve him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_12","020_72_12","PSA","72","12","12","For he will deliver the needy who cry out and the afflicted who have no helper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_13","020_72_13","PSA","72","13","13","He will take pity on the poor and needy and save the lives of the oppressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_14","020_72_14","PSA","72","14","14","He will redeem them from oppression and violence, for their blood is precious in his sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_15","020_72_15","PSA","72","15","15","Long may he live! May gold from Sheba be given him. May people ever pray for him; may they bless him all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_16","020_72_16","PSA","72","16","16","May there be an abundance of grain in the land; may it sway atop the hills. May its fruit trees flourish like the forests of Lebanon, the people of its cities like the grass of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_17","020_72_17","PSA","72","17","17","May his name endure forever; may his name continue as long as the sun shines. In him may all nations be blessed; may they call him blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_18","020_72_18","PSA","72","18","18","Blessed be the LORD God, the God of Israel, who alone does marvelous deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_19","020_72_19","PSA","72","19","19","And blessed be His glorious name forever; may all the earth be filled with His glory. Amen and amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS72_20","020_72_20","PSA","72","20","20","Thus conclude the prayers of David son of Jesse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_1","020_73_1","PSA","73","1","1","A Psalm of Asaph. Surely God is good to Israel, to those who are pure in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_2","020_73_2","PSA","73","2","2","But as for me, my feet had almost stumbled; my steps had nearly slipped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_3","020_73_3","PSA","73","3","3","For I envied the arrogant when I saw the prosperity of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_4","020_73_4","PSA","73","4","4","They have no struggle in their death; their bodies are well-fed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_5","020_73_5","PSA","73","5","5","They are free of the burdens others carry; they are not afflicted like other men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_6","020_73_6","PSA","73","6","6","Therefore pride is their necklace; a garment of violence covers them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_7","020_73_7","PSA","73","7","7","From their prosperity proceeds iniquity; the imaginations of their hearts run wild. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_8","020_73_8","PSA","73","8","8","They mock and speak with malice; with arrogance they threaten oppression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_9","020_73_9","PSA","73","9","9","They set their mouths against the heavens, and their tongues strut across the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_10","020_73_10","PSA","73","10","10","So their people return to this place and drink up waters in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_11","020_73_11","PSA","73","11","11","The wicked say, “How can God know? Does the Most High have knowledge?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_12","020_73_12","PSA","73","12","12","Behold, these are the wicked—always carefree as they increase their wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_13","020_73_13","PSA","73","13","13","Surely in vain I have kept my heart pure; in innocence I have washed my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_14","020_73_14","PSA","73","14","14","For I am afflicted all day long and punished every morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_15","020_73_15","PSA","73","15","15","If I had said, “I will speak this way,” then I would have betrayed Your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_16","020_73_16","PSA","73","16","16","When I tried to understand all this, it was troublesome in my sight ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_17","020_73_17","PSA","73","17","17","until I entered God’s sanctuary; then I discerned their end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_18","020_73_18","PSA","73","18","18","Surely You set them on slick ground; You cast them down into ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_19","020_73_19","PSA","73","19","19","How suddenly they are laid waste, completely swept away by terrors! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_20","020_73_20","PSA","73","20","20","Like one waking from a dream, so You, O Lord, awaken and despise their form. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_21","020_73_21","PSA","73","21","21","When my heart was grieved and I was pierced within, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_22","020_73_22","PSA","73","22","22","I was senseless and ignorant; I was a brute beast before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_23","020_73_23","PSA","73","23","23","Yet I am always with You; You hold my right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_24","020_73_24","PSA","73","24","24","You guide me with Your counsel, and later receive me in glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_25","020_73_25","PSA","73","25","25","Whom have I in heaven but You? And on earth I desire no one besides You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_26","020_73_26","PSA","73","26","26","My flesh and my heart may fail, but God is the strength of my heart and my portion forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_27","020_73_27","PSA","73","27","27","Those far from You will surely perish; You destroy all who are unfaithful to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS73_28","020_73_28","PSA","73","28","28","But as for me, it is good to draw near to God. I have made the Lord GOD my refuge, that I may proclaim all Your works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_1","020_74_1","PSA","74","1","1","A Maskil of Asaph. Why have You rejected us forever, O God? Why does Your anger smolder against the sheep of Your pasture? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_2","020_74_2","PSA","74","2","2","Remember Your congregation, which You purchased long ago and redeemed as the tribe of Your inheritance—Mount Zion, where You dwell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_3","020_74_3","PSA","74","3","3","Turn Your steps to the everlasting ruins, to everything in the sanctuary the enemy has destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_4","020_74_4","PSA","74","4","4","Your foes have roared within Your meeting place; they have unfurled their banners as signs, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_5","020_74_5","PSA","74","5","5","like men wielding axes in a thicket of trees ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_6","020_74_6","PSA","74","6","6","and smashing all the carvings with hatchets and picks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_7","020_74_7","PSA","74","7","7","They have burned Your sanctuary to the ground; they have defiled the dwelling place of Your Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_8","020_74_8","PSA","74","8","8","They said in their hearts, “We will crush them completely.” They burned down every place where God met us in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_9","020_74_9","PSA","74","9","9","There are no signs for us to see. There is no longer any prophet. And none of us knows how long this will last. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_10","020_74_10","PSA","74","10","10","How long, O God, will the enemy taunt You? Will the foe revile Your name forever? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_11","020_74_11","PSA","74","11","11","Why do You withdraw Your strong right hand? Stretch it out to destroy them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_12","020_74_12","PSA","74","12","12","Yet God is my King from ancient times, working salvation on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_13","020_74_13","PSA","74","13","13","You divided the sea by Your strength; You smashed the heads of the dragons of the sea; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_14","020_74_14","PSA","74","14","14","You crushed the heads of Leviathan; You fed him to the creatures of the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_15","020_74_15","PSA","74","15","15","You broke open the fountain and the flood; You dried up the ever-flowing rivers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_16","020_74_16","PSA","74","16","16","The day is Yours, and also the night; You established the moon and the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_17","020_74_17","PSA","74","17","17","You set all the boundaries of the earth; You made the summer and winter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_18","020_74_18","PSA","74","18","18","Remember how the enemy has mocked You, O LORD, how a foolish people has spurned Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_19","020_74_19","PSA","74","19","19","Do not deliver the soul of Your dove to beasts; do not forget the lives of Your afflicted forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_20","020_74_20","PSA","74","20","20","Consider Your covenant, for haunts of violence fill the dark places of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_21","020_74_21","PSA","74","21","21","Do not let the oppressed retreat in shame; may the poor and needy praise Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_22","020_74_22","PSA","74","22","22","Rise up, O God; defend Your cause! Remember how the fool mocks You all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS74_23","020_74_23","PSA","74","23","23","Do not disregard the clamor of Your adversaries, the uproar of Your enemies that ascends continually. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_1","020_75_1","PSA","75","1","1","For the choirmaster: To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A Psalm of Asaph. A song. We give thanks to You, O God; we give thanks, for Your Name is near. The people declare Your wondrous works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_2","020_75_2","PSA","75","2","2","“When I choose a time, I will judge fairly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_3","020_75_3","PSA","75","3","3","When the earth and all its dwellers quake, it is I who bear up its pillars. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_4","020_75_4","PSA","75","4","4","I say to the proud, ‘Do not boast,’ and to the wicked, ‘Do not lift up your horn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_5","020_75_5","PSA","75","5","5","Do not lift up your horn against heaven or speak with an outstretched neck.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_6","020_75_6","PSA","75","6","6","For exaltation comes neither from east nor west, nor out of the desert, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_7","020_75_7","PSA","75","7","7","but it is God who judges; He brings down one and exalts another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_8","020_75_8","PSA","75","8","8","For a cup is in the hand of the LORD, full of foaming wine mixed with spices. He pours from His cup, and all the wicked of the earth drink it down to the dregs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_9","020_75_9","PSA","75","9","9","But I will proclaim Him forever; I will sing praise to the God of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS75_10","020_75_10","PSA","75","10","10","“All the horns of the wicked I will cut off, but the horns of the righteous will be exalted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_1","020_76_1","PSA","76","1","1","For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. A Psalm of Asaph. A song. God is known in Judah; His name is great in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_2","020_76_2","PSA","76","2","2","His tent is in Salem, His dwelling place in Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_3","020_76_3","PSA","76","3","3","There He shattered the flaming arrows, the shield and sword and weapons of war. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_4","020_76_4","PSA","76","4","4","You are resplendent with light, more majestic than mountains filled with game. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_5","020_76_5","PSA","76","5","5","The valiant lie plundered; they sleep their last sleep. No men of might could lift a hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_6","020_76_6","PSA","76","6","6","At Your rebuke, O God of Jacob, both horse and rider lie stunned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_7","020_76_7","PSA","76","7","7","You alone are to be feared. When You are angry, who can stand before You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_8","020_76_8","PSA","76","8","8","From heaven You pronounced judgment, and the earth feared and was still ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_9","020_76_9","PSA","76","9","9","when God rose up to judge, to save all the lowly of the earth. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_10","020_76_10","PSA","76","10","10","Even the wrath of man shall praise You; with the survivors of wrath You will clothe Yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_11","020_76_11","PSA","76","11","11","Make and fulfill your vows to the LORD your God; let all the neighboring lands bring tribute to Him who is to be feared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS76_12","020_76_12","PSA","76","12","12","He breaks the spirits of princes; He is feared by the kings of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_1","020_77_1","PSA","77","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Jeduthun. A Psalm of Asaph. I cried out to God; I cried aloud to God to hear me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_2","020_77_2","PSA","77","2","2","In the day of trouble I sought the Lord; through the night my outstretched hands did not grow weary; my soul refused to be comforted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_3","020_77_3","PSA","77","3","3","I remembered You, O God, and I groaned; I mused and my spirit grew faint. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_4","020_77_4","PSA","77","4","4","You have kept my eyes from closing; I am too troubled to speak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_5","020_77_5","PSA","77","5","5","I considered the days of old, the years long in the past. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_6","020_77_6","PSA","77","6","6","At night I remembered my song; in my heart I mused, and my spirit pondered: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_7","020_77_7","PSA","77","7","7","“Will the Lord spurn us forever and never show His favor again? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_8","020_77_8","PSA","77","8","8","Is His loving devotion gone forever? Has His promise failed for all time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_9","020_77_9","PSA","77","9","9","Has God forgotten to be gracious? Has His anger shut off His compassion?” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_10","020_77_10","PSA","77","10","10","So I said, “I am grieved that the right hand of the Most High has changed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_11","020_77_11","PSA","77","11","11","I will remember the works of the LORD; yes, I will remember Your wonders of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_12","020_77_12","PSA","77","12","12","I will reflect on all You have done and ponder Your mighty deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_13","020_77_13","PSA","77","13","13","Your way, O God, is holy. What god is so great as our God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_14","020_77_14","PSA","77","14","14","You are the God who works wonders; You display Your strength among the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_15","020_77_15","PSA","77","15","15","With power You redeemed Your people, the sons of Jacob and Joseph. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_16","020_77_16","PSA","77","16","16","The waters saw You, O God; the waters saw You and swirled; even the depths were shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_17","020_77_17","PSA","77","17","17","The clouds poured down water; the skies resounded with thunder; Your arrows flashed back and forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_18","020_77_18","PSA","77","18","18","Your thunder resounded in the whirlwind; the lightning lit up the world; the earth trembled and quaked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_19","020_77_19","PSA","77","19","19","Your path led through the sea, Your way through the mighty waters, but Your footprints were not to be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS77_20","020_77_20","PSA","77","20","20","You led Your people like a flock by the hand of Moses and Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_1","020_78_1","PSA","78","1","1","A Maskil of Asaph. Give ear, O my people, to my instruction; listen to the words of my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_2","020_78_2","PSA","78","2","2","I will open my mouth in parables; I will utter things hidden from the beginning, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_3","020_78_3","PSA","78","3","3","that we have heard and known and our fathers have relayed to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_4","020_78_4","PSA","78","4","4","We will not hide them from their children but will declare to the next generation the praises of the LORD and His might and the wonders He has performed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_5","020_78_5","PSA","78","5","5","For He established a testimony in Jacob and appointed a law in Israel, which He commanded our fathers to teach to their children, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_6","020_78_6","PSA","78","6","6","that the coming generation would know them—even children yet to be born—to arise and tell their own children ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_7","020_78_7","PSA","78","7","7","that they should put their confidence in God, not forgetting His works, but keeping His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_8","020_78_8","PSA","78","8","8","Then they will not be like their fathers, a stubborn and rebellious generation, whose heart was not loyal, whose spirit was not faithful to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_9","020_78_9","PSA","78","9","9","The archers of Ephraim turned back on the day of battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_10","020_78_10","PSA","78","10","10","They failed to keep God’s covenant and refused to live by His law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_11","020_78_11","PSA","78","11","11","They forgot what He had done, the wonders He had shown them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_12","020_78_12","PSA","78","12","12","He worked wonders before their fathers in the land of Egypt, in the region of Zoan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_13","020_78_13","PSA","78","13","13","He split the sea and brought them through; He set the waters upright like a wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_14","020_78_14","PSA","78","14","14","He led them with a cloud by day and with a light of fire all night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_15","020_78_15","PSA","78","15","15","He split the rocks in the wilderness and gave them drink as abundant as the seas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_16","020_78_16","PSA","78","16","16","He brought streams from the stone and made water flow down like rivers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_17","020_78_17","PSA","78","17","17","But they continued to sin against Him, rebelling in the desert against the Most High. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_18","020_78_18","PSA","78","18","18","They willfully tested God by demanding the food they craved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_19","020_78_19","PSA","78","19","19","They spoke against God, saying, “Can God really prepare a table in the wilderness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_20","020_78_20","PSA","78","20","20","When He struck the rock, water gushed out and torrents raged. But can He also give bread or supply His people with meat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_21","020_78_21","PSA","78","21","21","Therefore the LORD heard and was filled with wrath; so a fire was kindled against Jacob, and His anger flared against Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_22","020_78_22","PSA","78","22","22","because they did not believe God or rely on His salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_23","020_78_23","PSA","78","23","23","Yet He commanded the clouds above and opened the doors of the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_24","020_78_24","PSA","78","24","24","He rained down manna for them to eat; He gave them grain from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_25","020_78_25","PSA","78","25","25","Man ate the bread of angels; He sent them food in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_26","020_78_26","PSA","78","26","26","He stirred the east wind from the heavens and drove the south wind by His might. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_27","020_78_27","PSA","78","27","27","He rained meat on them like dust, and winged birds like the sand of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_28","020_78_28","PSA","78","28","28","He felled them in the midst of their camp, all around their dwellings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_29","020_78_29","PSA","78","29","29","So they ate and were well filled, for He gave them what they craved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_30","020_78_30","PSA","78","30","30","Yet before they had filled their desire, with the food still in their mouths, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_31","020_78_31","PSA","78","31","31","God’s anger flared against them, and He put to death their strongest and subdued the young men of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_32","020_78_32","PSA","78","32","32","In spite of all this, they kept on sinning; despite His wonderful works, they did not believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_33","020_78_33","PSA","78","33","33","So He ended their days in futility, and their years in sudden terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_34","020_78_34","PSA","78","34","34","When He slew them, they would seek Him; they repented and searched for God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_35","020_78_35","PSA","78","35","35","And they remembered that God was their Rock, that God Most High was their Redeemer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_36","020_78_36","PSA","78","36","36","But they deceived Him with their mouths, and lied to Him with their tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_37","020_78_37","PSA","78","37","37","Their hearts were disloyal to Him, and they were unfaithful to His covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_38","020_78_38","PSA","78","38","38","And yet He was compassionate; He forgave their iniquity and did not destroy them. He often restrained His anger and did not unleash His full wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_39","020_78_39","PSA","78","39","39","He remembered that they were but flesh, a passing breeze that does not return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_40","020_78_40","PSA","78","40","40","How often they disobeyed Him in the wilderness and grieved Him in the desert! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_41","020_78_41","PSA","78","41","41","Again and again they tested God and provoked the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_42","020_78_42","PSA","78","42","42","They did not remember His power—the day He redeemed them from the adversary, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_43","020_78_43","PSA","78","43","43","when He performed His signs in Egypt and His wonders in the fields of Zoan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_44","020_78_44","PSA","78","44","44","He turned their rivers to blood, and from their streams they could not drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_45","020_78_45","PSA","78","45","45","He sent swarms of flies that devoured them, and frogs that devastated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_46","020_78_46","PSA","78","46","46","He gave their crops to the grasshopper, the fruit of their labor to the locust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_47","020_78_47","PSA","78","47","47","He killed their vines with hailstones and their sycamore-figs with sleet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_48","020_78_48","PSA","78","48","48","He abandoned their cattle to the hail and their livestock to bolts of lightning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_49","020_78_49","PSA","78","49","49","He unleashed His fury against them, wrath, indignation, and calamity—a band of destroying angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_50","020_78_50","PSA","78","50","50","He cleared a path for His anger; He did not spare them from death but delivered their lives to the plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_51","020_78_51","PSA","78","51","51","He struck all the firstborn of Egypt, the virility in the tents of Ham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_52","020_78_52","PSA","78","52","52","He led out His people like sheep and guided them like a flock in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_53","020_78_53","PSA","78","53","53","He led them safely, so they did not fear, but the sea engulfed their enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_54","020_78_54","PSA","78","54","54","He brought them to His holy land, to the mountain His right hand had acquired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_55","020_78_55","PSA","78","55","55","He drove out nations before them and apportioned their inheritance; He settled the tribes of Israel in their tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_56","020_78_56","PSA","78","56","56","But they tested and disobeyed God Most High, for they did not keep His decrees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_57","020_78_57","PSA","78","57","57","They turned back and were faithless like their fathers, twisted like a faulty bow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_58","020_78_58","PSA","78","58","58","They enraged Him with their high places and provoked His jealousy with their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_59","020_78_59","PSA","78","59","59","On hearing it, God was furious and rejected Israel completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_60","020_78_60","PSA","78","60","60","He abandoned the tabernacle of Shiloh, the tent He had pitched among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_61","020_78_61","PSA","78","61","61","He delivered His strength to captivity, and His splendor to the hand of the adversary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_62","020_78_62","PSA","78","62","62","He surrendered His people to the sword because He was enraged by His heritage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_63","020_78_63","PSA","78","63","63","Fire consumed His young men, and their maidens were left without wedding songs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_64","020_78_64","PSA","78","64","64","His priests fell by the sword, but their widows could not lament. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_65","020_78_65","PSA","78","65","65","Then the Lord awoke as from sleep, like a mighty warrior overcome by wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_66","020_78_66","PSA","78","66","66","He beat back His foes; He put them to everlasting shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_67","020_78_67","PSA","78","67","67","He rejected the tent of Joseph and refused the tribe of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_68","020_78_68","PSA","78","68","68","But He chose the tribe of Judah, Mount Zion, which He loved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_69","020_78_69","PSA","78","69","69","He built His sanctuary like the heights, like the earth He has established forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_70","020_78_70","PSA","78","70","70","He chose David His servant and took him from the sheepfolds; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_71","020_78_71","PSA","78","71","71","from tending the ewes He brought him to be shepherd of His people Jacob, of Israel His inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS78_72","020_78_72","PSA","78","72","72","So David shepherded them with integrity of heart and guided them with skillful hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_1","020_79_1","PSA","79","1","1","A Psalm of Asaph. The nations, O God, have invaded Your inheritance; they have defiled Your holy temple and reduced Jerusalem to rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_2","020_79_2","PSA","79","2","2","They have given the corpses of Your servants as food to the birds of the air, the flesh of Your saints to the beasts of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_3","020_79_3","PSA","79","3","3","They have poured out their blood like water all around Jerusalem, and there is no one to bury the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_4","020_79_4","PSA","79","4","4","We have become a reproach to our neighbors, a scorn and derision to those around us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_5","020_79_5","PSA","79","5","5","How long, O LORD? Will You be angry forever? Will Your jealousy burn like fire? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_6","020_79_6","PSA","79","6","6","Pour out Your wrath on the nations that do not acknowledge You, on the kingdoms that refuse to call on Your name, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_7","020_79_7","PSA","79","7","7","for they have devoured Jacob and devastated his homeland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_8","020_79_8","PSA","79","8","8","Do not hold past sins against us; let Your compassion come quickly, for we are brought low. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_9","020_79_9","PSA","79","9","9","Help us, O God of our salvation, for the glory of Your name; deliver us and atone for our sins, for the sake of Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_10","020_79_10","PSA","79","10","10","Why should the nations ask, “Where is their God?” Before our eyes, make known among the nations Your vengeance for the bloodshed of Your servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_11","020_79_11","PSA","79","11","11","May the groans of the captives reach You; by the strength of Your arm preserve those condemned to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_12","020_79_12","PSA","79","12","12","Pay back into the laps of our neighbors sevenfold the reproach they hurled at You, O Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS79_13","020_79_13","PSA","79","13","13","Then we Your people, the sheep of Your pasture, will thank You forever; from generation to generation we will declare Your praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_1","020_80_1","PSA","80","1","1","For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Lilies of the Covenant.” A Psalm of Asaph. Hear us, O Shepherd of Israel, who leads Joseph like a flock; You who sit enthroned between the cherubim, shine forth ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_2","020_80_2","PSA","80","2","2","before Ephraim, Benjamin, and Manasseh. Rally Your mighty power and come to save us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_3","020_80_3","PSA","80","3","3","Restore us, O God, and cause Your face to shine upon us, that we may be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_4","020_80_4","PSA","80","4","4","O LORD God of Hosts, how long will Your anger smolder against the prayers of Your people? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_5","020_80_5","PSA","80","5","5","You fed them with the bread of tears and made them drink the full measure of their tears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_6","020_80_6","PSA","80","6","6","You make us contend with our neighbors; our enemies mock us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_7","020_80_7","PSA","80","7","7","Restore us, O God of Hosts, and cause Your face to shine upon us, that we may be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_8","020_80_8","PSA","80","8","8","You uprooted a vine from Egypt; You drove out the nations and transplanted it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_9","020_80_9","PSA","80","9","9","You cleared the ground for it, and it took root and filled the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_10","020_80_10","PSA","80","10","10","The mountains were covered by its shade, and the mighty cedars with its branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_11","020_80_11","PSA","80","11","11","It sent out its branches to the Sea, and its shoots toward the River. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_12","020_80_12","PSA","80","12","12","Why have You broken down its walls, so that all who pass by pick its fruit? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_13","020_80_13","PSA","80","13","13","The boar from the forest ravages it, and the creatures of the field feed upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_14","020_80_14","PSA","80","14","14","Return, O God of Hosts, we pray! Look down from heaven and see! Attend to this vine— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_15","020_80_15","PSA","80","15","15","the root Your right hand has planted, the son You have raised up for Yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_16","020_80_16","PSA","80","16","16","Your vine has been cut down and burned; they perish at the rebuke of Your countenance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_17","020_80_17","PSA","80","17","17","Let Your hand be upon the man at Your right hand, on the son of man You have raised up for Yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_18","020_80_18","PSA","80","18","18","Then we will not turn away from You; revive us, and we will call on Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS80_19","020_80_19","PSA","80","19","19","Restore us, O LORD God of Hosts; cause Your face to shine upon us, that we may be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_1","020_81_1","PSA","81","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Gittith. Of Asaph. Sing for joy to God our strength; make a joyful noise to the God of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_2","020_81_2","PSA","81","2","2","Lift up a song, strike the tambourine, play the sweet-sounding harp and lyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_3","020_81_3","PSA","81","3","3","Sound the ram’s horn at the New Moon, and at the full moon on the day of our Feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_4","020_81_4","PSA","81","4","4","For this is a statute for Israel, an ordinance of the God of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_5","020_81_5","PSA","81","5","5","He ordained it as a testimony for Joseph when he went out over the land of Egypt, where I heard an unfamiliar language: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_6","020_81_6","PSA","81","6","6","“I relieved his shoulder of the burden; his hands were freed from the basket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_7","020_81_7","PSA","81","7","7","You called out in distress, and I rescued you; I answered you from the cloud of thunder; I tested you at the waters of Meribah. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_8","020_81_8","PSA","81","8","8","Hear, O My people, and I will warn you: O Israel, if only you would listen to Me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_9","020_81_9","PSA","81","9","9","There must be no strange god among you, nor shall you bow to a foreign god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_10","020_81_10","PSA","81","10","10","I am the LORD your God, who brought you up out of Egypt. Open wide your mouth, and I will fill it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_11","020_81_11","PSA","81","11","11","But My people would not listen to Me, and Israel would not obey Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_12","020_81_12","PSA","81","12","12","So I gave them up to their stubborn hearts to follow their own devices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_13","020_81_13","PSA","81","13","13","If only My people would listen to Me, if Israel would follow My ways, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_14","020_81_14","PSA","81","14","14","how soon I would subdue their enemies and turn My hand against their foes! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_15","020_81_15","PSA","81","15","15","Those who hate the LORD would feign obedience, and their doom would last forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS81_16","020_81_16","PSA","81","16","16","But I would feed you the finest wheat; with honey from the rock I would satisfy you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_1","020_82_1","PSA","82","1","1","A Psalm of Asaph. God presides in the divine assembly; He renders judgment among the gods: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_2","020_82_2","PSA","82","2","2","“How long will you judge unjustly and show partiality to the wicked? Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_3","020_82_3","PSA","82","3","3","Defend the cause of the weak and fatherless; uphold the rights of the afflicted and oppressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_4","020_82_4","PSA","82","4","4","Rescue the weak and needy; save them from the hand of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_5","020_82_5","PSA","82","5","5","They do not know or understand; they wander in the darkness; all the foundations of the earth are shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_6","020_82_6","PSA","82","6","6","I have said, ‘You are gods; you are all sons of the Most High.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_7","020_82_7","PSA","82","7","7","But like mortals you will die, and like rulers you will fall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS82_8","020_82_8","PSA","82","8","8","Arise, O God, judge the earth, for all the nations are Your inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_1","020_83_1","PSA","83","1","1","A song. A Psalm of Asaph. O God, be not silent; be not speechless; be not still, O God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_2","020_83_2","PSA","83","2","2","See how Your enemies rage, how Your foes have reared their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_3","020_83_3","PSA","83","3","3","With cunning they scheme against Your people and conspire against those You cherish, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_4","020_83_4","PSA","83","4","4","saying, “Come, let us erase them as a nation; may the name of Israel be remembered no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_5","020_83_5","PSA","83","5","5","For with one mind they plot together; they form an alliance against You— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_6","020_83_6","PSA","83","6","6","the tents of Edom and the Ishmaelites, of Moab and the Hagrites, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_7","020_83_7","PSA","83","7","7","of Gebal, Ammon, and Amalek, of Philistia with the people of Tyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_8","020_83_8","PSA","83","8","8","Even Assyria has joined them, lending strength to the sons of Lot. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_9","020_83_9","PSA","83","9","9","Do to them as You did to Midian, as to Sisera and Jabin at the River Kishon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_10","020_83_10","PSA","83","10","10","who perished at Endor and became like dung on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_11","020_83_11","PSA","83","11","11","Make their nobles like Oreb and Zeeb, and all their princes like Zebah and Zalmunna, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_12","020_83_12","PSA","83","12","12","who said, “Let us possess for ourselves the pastures of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_13","020_83_13","PSA","83","13","13","Make them like tumbleweed, O my God, like chaff before the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_14","020_83_14","PSA","83","14","14","As fire consumes a forest, as a flame sets the mountains ablaze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_15","020_83_15","PSA","83","15","15","so pursue them with Your tempest, and terrify them with Your storm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_16","020_83_16","PSA","83","16","16","Cover their faces with shame, that they may seek Your name, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_17","020_83_17","PSA","83","17","17","May they be ever ashamed and terrified; may they perish in disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS83_18","020_83_18","PSA","83","18","18","May they know that You alone, whose name is the LORD, are Most High over all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_1","020_84_1","PSA","84","1","1","For the choirmaster. According to Gittith. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. How lovely is Your dwelling place, O LORD of Hosts! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_2","020_84_2","PSA","84","2","2","My soul longs, even faints, for the courts of the LORD; my heart and my flesh cry out for the living God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_3","020_84_3","PSA","84","3","3","Even the sparrow has found a home, and the swallow a nest for herself, where she places her young near Your altars, O LORD of Hosts, my King and my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_4","020_84_4","PSA","84","4","4","How blessed are those who dwell in Your house! They are ever praising You. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_5","020_84_5","PSA","84","5","5","Blessed are those whose strength is in You, whose hearts are set on pilgrimage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_6","020_84_6","PSA","84","6","6","As they pass through the Valley of Baca, they make it a place of springs; even the autumn rain covers it with pools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_7","020_84_7","PSA","84","7","7","They go from strength to strength, until each appears before God in Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_8","020_84_8","PSA","84","8","8","O LORD God of Hosts, hear my prayer; give ear, O God of Jacob. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_9","020_84_9","PSA","84","9","9","Take notice of our shield, O God, and look with favor on the face of Your anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_10","020_84_10","PSA","84","10","10","For better is one day in Your courts than a thousand elsewhere. I would rather be a doorkeeper in the house of my God than dwell in the tents of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_11","020_84_11","PSA","84","11","11","For the LORD God is a sun and a shield; the LORD gives grace and glory; He withholds no good thing from those who walk with integrity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS84_12","020_84_12","PSA","84","12","12","O LORD of Hosts, how blessed is the man who trusts in You! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_1","020_85_1","PSA","85","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. You showed favor to Your land, O LORD; You restored Jacob from captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_2","020_85_2","PSA","85","2","2","You forgave the iniquity of Your people; You covered all their sin. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_3","020_85_3","PSA","85","3","3","You withheld all Your fury; You turned from Your burning anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_4","020_85_4","PSA","85","4","4","Restore us, O God of our salvation, and put away Your displeasure toward us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_5","020_85_5","PSA","85","5","5","Will You be angry with us forever? Will You draw out Your anger to all generations? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_6","020_85_6","PSA","85","6","6","Will You not revive us again, that Your people may rejoice in You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_7","020_85_7","PSA","85","7","7","Show us Your loving devotion, O LORD, and grant us Your salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_8","020_85_8","PSA","85","8","8","I will listen to what God the LORD will say; for He will surely speak peace to His people and His saints; He will not let them return to folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_9","020_85_9","PSA","85","9","9","Surely His salvation is near to those who fear Him, that His glory may dwell in our land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_10","020_85_10","PSA","85","10","10","Loving devotion and faithfulness have joined together; righteousness and peace have kissed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_11","020_85_11","PSA","85","11","11","Faithfulness sprouts from the earth, and righteousness looks down from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_12","020_85_12","PSA","85","12","12","The LORD will indeed provide what is good, and our land will yield its increase. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS85_13","020_85_13","PSA","85","13","13","Righteousness will go before Him to prepare the way for His steps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_1","020_86_1","PSA","86","1","1","A prayer of David. Incline Your ear, O LORD, and answer me, for I am poor and needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_2","020_86_2","PSA","86","2","2","Preserve my soul, for I am godly. You are my God; save Your servant who trusts in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_3","020_86_3","PSA","86","3","3","Be merciful to me, O Lord, for I call to You all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_4","020_86_4","PSA","86","4","4","Bring joy to Your servant, for to You, O Lord, I lift up my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_5","020_86_5","PSA","86","5","5","For You, O Lord, are kind and forgiving, rich in loving devotion to all who call on You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_6","020_86_6","PSA","86","6","6","Hear my prayer, O LORD, and attend to my plea for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_7","020_86_7","PSA","86","7","7","In the day of my distress I call on You, because You answer me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_8","020_86_8","PSA","86","8","8","O Lord, there is none like You among the gods, nor any works like Yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_9","020_86_9","PSA","86","9","9","All the nations You have made will come and bow before You, O Lord, and they will glorify Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_10","020_86_10","PSA","86","10","10","For You are great and perform wonders; You alone are God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_11","020_86_11","PSA","86","11","11","Teach me Your way, O LORD, that I may walk in Your truth. Give me an undivided heart, that I may fear Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_12","020_86_12","PSA","86","12","12","I will praise You, O Lord my God, with all my heart; I will glorify Your name forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_13","020_86_13","PSA","86","13","13","For great is Your loving devotion to me; You have delivered me from the depths of Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_14","020_86_14","PSA","86","14","14","The arrogant rise against me, O God; a band of ruthless men seeks my life; they have no regard for You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_15","020_86_15","PSA","86","15","15","But You, O Lord, are a compassionate and gracious God, slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion and faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_16","020_86_16","PSA","86","16","16","Turn to me and have mercy; grant Your strength to Your servant; save the son of Your maidservant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS86_17","020_86_17","PSA","86","17","17","Show me a sign of Your goodness, that my enemies may see and be ashamed; for You, O LORD, have helped me and comforted me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_1","020_87_1","PSA","87","1","1","A Psalm of the sons of Korah. A song. He has founded His city on the holy mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_2","020_87_2","PSA","87","2","2","The LORD loves the gates of Zion more than all the dwellings of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_3","020_87_3","PSA","87","3","3","Glorious things are ascribed to you, O city of God. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_4","020_87_4","PSA","87","4","4","“I will mention Rahab and Babylon among those who know Me—along with Philistia, Tyre, and Cush—when I say, ‘This one was born in Zion.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_5","020_87_5","PSA","87","5","5","And it will be said of Zion: “This one and that one were born in her, and the Most High Himself will establish her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_6","020_87_6","PSA","87","6","6","The LORD will record in the register of the peoples: “This one was born in Zion.” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS87_7","020_87_7","PSA","87","7","7","Singers and pipers will proclaim, “All my springs of joy are in You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_1","020_88_1","PSA","88","1","1","A song. A Psalm of the sons of Korah. For the choirmaster. According to Mahalath Leannoth. A Maskil of Heman the Ezrahite. O LORD, the God of my salvation, day and night I cry out before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_2","020_88_2","PSA","88","2","2","May my prayer come before You; incline Your ear to my cry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_3","020_88_3","PSA","88","3","3","For my soul is full of troubles, and my life draws near to Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_4","020_88_4","PSA","88","4","4","I am counted among those descending to the Pit. I am like a man without strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_5","020_88_5","PSA","88","5","5","I am forsaken among the dead, like the slain who lie in the grave, whom You remember no more, who are cut off from Your care. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_6","020_88_6","PSA","88","6","6","You have laid me in the lowest Pit, in the darkest of the depths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_7","020_88_7","PSA","88","7","7","Your wrath weighs heavily upon me; all Your waves have submerged me. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_8","020_88_8","PSA","88","8","8","You have removed my friends from me; You have made me repulsive to them; I am confined and cannot escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_9","020_88_9","PSA","88","9","9","My eyes grow dim with grief. I call to You daily, O LORD; I spread out my hands to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_10","020_88_10","PSA","88","10","10","Do You work wonders for the dead? Do departed spirits rise up to praise You? Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_11","020_88_11","PSA","88","11","11","Can Your loving devotion be proclaimed in the grave, Your faithfulness in Abaddon? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_12","020_88_12","PSA","88","12","12","Will Your wonders be known in the darkness, or Your righteousness in the land of oblivion? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_13","020_88_13","PSA","88","13","13","But to You, O LORD, I cry for help; in the morning my prayer comes before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_14","020_88_14","PSA","88","14","14","Why, O LORD, do You reject me? Why do You hide Your face from me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_15","020_88_15","PSA","88","15","15","From my youth I was afflicted and near death. I have borne Your terrors; I am in despair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_16","020_88_16","PSA","88","16","16","Your wrath has swept over me; Your terrors have destroyed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_17","020_88_17","PSA","88","17","17","All day long they engulf me like water; they enclose me on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS88_18","020_88_18","PSA","88","18","18","You have removed my beloved and my friend; darkness is my closest companion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_1","020_89_1","PSA","89","1","1","A Maskil of Ethan the Ezrahite. I will sing of the loving devotion of the LORD forever; with my mouth I will proclaim Your faithfulness to all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_2","020_89_2","PSA","89","2","2","For I have said, “Loving devotion is built up forever; in the heavens You establish Your faithfulness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_3","020_89_3","PSA","89","3","3","You said, “I have made a covenant with My chosen one, I have sworn to David My servant: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_4","020_89_4","PSA","89","4","4","‘I will establish your offspring forever and build up your throne for all generations.’” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_5","020_89_5","PSA","89","5","5","The heavens praise Your wonders, O LORD—Your faithfulness as well—in the assembly of the holy ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_6","020_89_6","PSA","89","6","6","For who in the skies can compare with the LORD? Who among the heavenly beings is like the LORD? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_7","020_89_7","PSA","89","7","7","In the council of the holy ones, God is greatly feared, and awesome above all who surround Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_8","020_89_8","PSA","89","8","8","O LORD God of Hosts, who is like You? O mighty LORD, Your faithfulness surrounds You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_9","020_89_9","PSA","89","9","9","You rule the raging sea; when its waves mount up, You still them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_10","020_89_10","PSA","89","10","10","You crushed Rahab like a carcass; You scattered Your enemies with Your mighty arm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_11","020_89_11","PSA","89","11","11","The heavens are Yours, and also the earth. The earth and its fullness You founded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_12","020_89_12","PSA","89","12","12","North and south You created; Tabor and Hermon shout for joy at Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_13","020_89_13","PSA","89","13","13","Mighty is Your arm; strong is Your hand. Your right hand is exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_14","020_89_14","PSA","89","14","14","Righteousness and justice are the foundation of Your throne; loving devotion and faithfulness go before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_15","020_89_15","PSA","89","15","15","Blessed are those who know the joyful sound, who walk, O LORD, in the light of Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_16","020_89_16","PSA","89","16","16","They rejoice in Your name all day long, and in Your righteousness they exult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_17","020_89_17","PSA","89","17","17","For You are the glory of their strength, and by Your favor our horn is exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_18","020_89_18","PSA","89","18","18","Surely our shield belongs to the LORD, and our king to the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_19","020_89_19","PSA","89","19","19","You once spoke in a vision; to Your godly ones You said, “I have bestowed help on a warrior; I have exalted one chosen from the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_20","020_89_20","PSA","89","20","20","I have found My servant David; with My sacred oil I have anointed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_21","020_89_21","PSA","89","21","21","My hand will sustain him; surely My arm will strengthen him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_22","020_89_22","PSA","89","22","22","No enemy will exact tribute; no wicked man will oppress him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_23","020_89_23","PSA","89","23","23","I will crush his foes before him and strike down those who hate him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_24","020_89_24","PSA","89","24","24","My faithfulness and loving devotion will be with him, and through My name his horn will be exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_25","020_89_25","PSA","89","25","25","I will set his hand over the sea, and his right hand upon the rivers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_26","020_89_26","PSA","89","26","26","He will call to Me, ‘You are my Father, my God, the Rock of my salvation.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_27","020_89_27","PSA","89","27","27","I will indeed appoint him as My firstborn, the highest of the kings of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_28","020_89_28","PSA","89","28","28","I will forever preserve My loving devotion for him, and My covenant with him will stand fast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_29","020_89_29","PSA","89","29","29","I will establish his line forever, his throne as long as the heavens endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_30","020_89_30","PSA","89","30","30","If his sons forsake My law and do not walk in My judgments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_31","020_89_31","PSA","89","31","31","if they violate My statutes and fail to keep My commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_32","020_89_32","PSA","89","32","32","I will attend to their transgression with the rod, and to their iniquity with stripes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_33","020_89_33","PSA","89","33","33","But I will not withdraw My loving devotion from him, nor ever betray My faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_34","020_89_34","PSA","89","34","34","I will not violate My covenant or alter the utterance of My lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_35","020_89_35","PSA","89","35","35","Once and for all I have sworn by My holiness—I will not lie to David— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_36","020_89_36","PSA","89","36","36","his offspring shall endure forever, and his throne before Me like the sun, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_37","020_89_37","PSA","89","37","37","like the moon, established forever, a faithful witness in the sky.” Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_38","020_89_38","PSA","89","38","38","Now, however, You have spurned and rejected him; You are enraged by Your anointed one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_39","020_89_39","PSA","89","39","39","You have renounced the covenant with Your servant and sullied his crown in the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_40","020_89_40","PSA","89","40","40","You have broken down all his walls; You have reduced his strongholds to rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_41","020_89_41","PSA","89","41","41","All who pass by plunder him; he has become a reproach to his neighbors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_42","020_89_42","PSA","89","42","42","You have exalted the right hand of his foes; You have made all his enemies rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_43","020_89_43","PSA","89","43","43","You have bent the edge of his sword and have not sustained him in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_44","020_89_44","PSA","89","44","44","You have ended his splendor and cast his throne to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_45","020_89_45","PSA","89","45","45","You have cut short the days of his youth; You have covered him with shame. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_46","020_89_46","PSA","89","46","46","How long, O LORD? Will You hide Yourself forever? Will Your wrath keep burning like fire? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_47","020_89_47","PSA","89","47","47","Remember the briefness of my lifespan! For what futility You have created all men! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_48","020_89_48","PSA","89","48","48","What man can live and never see death? Can he deliver his soul from the power of Sheol? Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_49","020_89_49","PSA","89","49","49","Where, O Lord, is Your loving devotion of old, which You faithfully swore to David? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_50","020_89_50","PSA","89","50","50","Remember, O Lord, the reproach of Your servants, which I bear in my heart from so many people— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_51","020_89_51","PSA","89","51","51","how Your enemies have taunted, O LORD, and have mocked every step of Your anointed one! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS89_52","020_89_52","PSA","89","52","52","Blessed be the LORD forever! Amen and amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_1","020_90_1","PSA","90","1","1","A prayer of Moses the man of God. Lord, You have been our dwelling place through all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_2","020_90_2","PSA","90","2","2","Before the mountains were born or You brought forth the earth and the world, from everlasting to everlasting You are God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_3","020_90_3","PSA","90","3","3","You return man to dust, saying, “Return, O sons of mortals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_4","020_90_4","PSA","90","4","4","For in Your sight a thousand years are but a day that passes, or a watch of the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_5","020_90_5","PSA","90","5","5","You sweep them away in their sleep; they are like the new grass of the morning— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_6","020_90_6","PSA","90","6","6","in the morning it springs up new, but by evening it fades and withers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_7","020_90_7","PSA","90","7","7","For we are consumed by Your anger and terrified by Your wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_8","020_90_8","PSA","90","8","8","You have set our iniquities before You, our secret sins in the light of Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_9","020_90_9","PSA","90","9","9","For all our days decline in Your fury; we finish our years with a sigh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_10","020_90_10","PSA","90","10","10","The length of our days is seventy years—or eighty if we are strong—yet their pride is but labor and sorrow, for they quickly pass, and we fly away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_11","020_90_11","PSA","90","11","11","Who knows the power of Your anger? Your wrath matches the fear You are due. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_12","020_90_12","PSA","90","12","12","So teach us to number our days, that we may present a heart of wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_13","020_90_13","PSA","90","13","13","Return, O LORD! How long will it be? Have compassion on Your servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_14","020_90_14","PSA","90","14","14","Satisfy us in the morning with Your loving devotion, that we may sing for joy and be glad all our days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_15","020_90_15","PSA","90","15","15","Make us glad for as many days as You have afflicted us, for as many years as we have seen evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_16","020_90_16","PSA","90","16","16","May Your work be shown to Your servants, and Your splendor to their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS90_17","020_90_17","PSA","90","17","17","May the favor of the Lord our God rest upon us; establish for us the work of our hands—yes, establish the work of our hands! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_1","020_91_1","PSA","91","1","1","He who dwells in the shelter of the Most High will abide in the shadow of the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_2","020_91_2","PSA","91","2","2","I will say to the LORD, “You are my refuge and my fortress, my God, in whom I trust.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_3","020_91_3","PSA","91","3","3","Surely He will deliver you from the snare of the fowler, and from the deadly plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_4","020_91_4","PSA","91","4","4","He will cover you with His feathers; under His wings you will find refuge; His faithfulness is a shield and rampart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_5","020_91_5","PSA","91","5","5","You will not fear the terror of the night, nor the arrow that flies by day, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_6","020_91_6","PSA","91","6","6","nor the pestilence that stalks in the darkness, nor the calamity that destroys at noon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_7","020_91_7","PSA","91","7","7","Though a thousand may fall at your side, and ten thousand at your right hand, no harm will come near you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_8","020_91_8","PSA","91","8","8","You will only see it with your eyes and witness the punishment of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_9","020_91_9","PSA","91","9","9","Because you have made the LORD your dwelling—my refuge, the Most High— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_10","020_91_10","PSA","91","10","10","no evil will befall you, no plague will approach your tent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_11","020_91_11","PSA","91","11","11","For He will command His angels concerning you to guard you in all your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_12","020_91_12","PSA","91","12","12","They will lift you up in their hands, so that you will not strike your foot against a stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_13","020_91_13","PSA","91","13","13","You will tread on the lion and cobra; you will trample the young lion and serpent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_14","020_91_14","PSA","91","14","14","“Because he loves Me, I will deliver him; because he knows My name, I will protect him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_15","020_91_15","PSA","91","15","15","When he calls out to Me, I will answer him; I will be with him in trouble. I will deliver him and honor him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS91_16","020_91_16","PSA","91","16","16","With long life I will satisfy him and show him My salvation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_1","020_92_1","PSA","92","1","1","A Psalm. A song for the Sabbath day. It is good to praise the LORD, and to sing praises to Your name, O Most High, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_2","020_92_2","PSA","92","2","2","to proclaim Your loving devotion in the morning and Your faithfulness at night ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_3","020_92_3","PSA","92","3","3","with the ten-stringed harp and the melody of the lyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_4","020_92_4","PSA","92","4","4","For You, O LORD, have made me glad by Your deeds; I sing for joy at the works of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_5","020_92_5","PSA","92","5","5","How great are Your works, O LORD, how deep are Your thoughts! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_6","020_92_6","PSA","92","6","6","A senseless man does not know, and a fool does not understand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_7","020_92_7","PSA","92","7","7","that though the wicked sprout like grass, and all evildoers flourish, they will be forever destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_8","020_92_8","PSA","92","8","8","But You, O LORD, are exalted forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_9","020_92_9","PSA","92","9","9","For surely Your enemies, O LORD, surely Your enemies will perish; all evildoers will be scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_10","020_92_10","PSA","92","10","10","But You have exalted my horn like that of a wild ox; with fine oil I have been anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_11","020_92_11","PSA","92","11","11","My eyes see the downfall of my enemies; my ears hear the wailing of my wicked foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_12","020_92_12","PSA","92","12","12","The righteous will flourish like a palm tree, and grow like a cedar in Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_13","020_92_13","PSA","92","13","13","Planted in the house of the LORD, they will flourish in the courts of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_14","020_92_14","PSA","92","14","14","In old age they will still bear fruit; healthy and green they will remain, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS92_15","020_92_15","PSA","92","15","15","to proclaim, “The LORD is upright; He is my Rock, and in Him there is no unrighteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS93_1","020_93_1","PSA","93","1","1","The LORD reigns! He is robed in majesty; the LORD has clothed and armed Himself with strength. The world indeed is firmly established; it cannot be moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS93_2","020_93_2","PSA","93","2","2","Your throne was established long ago; You are from all eternity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS93_3","020_93_3","PSA","93","3","3","The floodwaters have risen, O LORD; the rivers have raised their voice; the seas lift up their pounding waves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS93_4","020_93_4","PSA","93","4","4","Above the roar of many waters—the mighty breakers of the sea—the LORD on high is majestic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS93_5","020_93_5","PSA","93","5","5","Your testimonies are fully confirmed; holiness adorns Your house, O LORD, for all the days to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_1","020_94_1","PSA","94","1","1","O LORD, God of vengeance, O God of vengeance, shine forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_2","020_94_2","PSA","94","2","2","Rise up, O Judge of the earth; render a reward to the proud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_3","020_94_3","PSA","94","3","3","How long will the wicked, O LORD, how long will the wicked exult? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_4","020_94_4","PSA","94","4","4","They pour out arrogant words; all workers of iniquity boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_5","020_94_5","PSA","94","5","5","They crush Your people, O LORD; they oppress Your heritage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_6","020_94_6","PSA","94","6","6","They kill the widow and the foreigner; they murder the fatherless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_7","020_94_7","PSA","94","7","7","They say, “The LORD does not see; the God of Jacob pays no heed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_8","020_94_8","PSA","94","8","8","Take notice, O senseless among the people! O fools, when will you be wise? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_9","020_94_9","PSA","94","9","9","He who affixed the ear, can He not hear? He who formed the eye, can He not see? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_10","020_94_10","PSA","94","10","10","He who admonishes the nations, does He not discipline? He who teaches man, does He lack knowledge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_11","020_94_11","PSA","94","11","11","The LORD knows the thoughts of man, that they are futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_12","020_94_12","PSA","94","12","12","Blessed is the man You discipline, O LORD, and teach from Your law, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_13","020_94_13","PSA","94","13","13","to grant him relief from days of trouble, until a pit is dug for the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_14","020_94_14","PSA","94","14","14","For the LORD will not forsake His people; He will never abandon His heritage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_15","020_94_15","PSA","94","15","15","Surely judgment will again be righteous, and all the upright in heart will follow it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_16","020_94_16","PSA","94","16","16","Who will rise up for me against the wicked? Who will stand for me against the workers of iniquity? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_17","020_94_17","PSA","94","17","17","Unless the LORD had been my helper, I would soon have dwelt in the abode of silence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_18","020_94_18","PSA","94","18","18","If I say, “My foot is slipping,” Your loving devotion, O LORD, supports me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_19","020_94_19","PSA","94","19","19","When anxiety overwhelms me, Your consolation delights my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_20","020_94_20","PSA","94","20","20","Can a corrupt throne be Your ally—one devising mischief by decree? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_21","020_94_21","PSA","94","21","21","They band together against the righteous and condemn the innocent to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_22","020_94_22","PSA","94","22","22","But the LORD has been my stronghold, and my God is my rock of refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS94_23","020_94_23","PSA","94","23","23","He will bring upon them their own iniquity and destroy them for their wickedness. The LORD our God will destroy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_1","020_95_1","PSA","95","1","1","Come, let us sing for joy to the LORD; let us shout to the Rock of our salvation! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_2","020_95_2","PSA","95","2","2","Let us enter His presence with thanksgiving; let us make a joyful noise to Him in song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_3","020_95_3","PSA","95","3","3","For the LORD is a great God, a great King above all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_4","020_95_4","PSA","95","4","4","In His hand are the depths of the earth, and the mountain peaks belong to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_5","020_95_5","PSA","95","5","5","The sea is His, for He made it, and His hands formed the dry land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_6","020_95_6","PSA","95","6","6","O come, let us worship and bow down; let us kneel before the LORD our Maker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_7","020_95_7","PSA","95","7","7","For He is our God, and we are the people of His pasture, the sheep under His care. Today, if you hear His voice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_8","020_95_8","PSA","95","8","8","do not harden your hearts as you did at Meribah, in the day at Massah in the wilderness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_9","020_95_9","PSA","95","9","9","where your fathers tested and tried Me, though they had seen My work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_10","020_95_10","PSA","95","10","10","For forty years I was angry with that generation, and I said, “They are a people whose hearts go astray, and they have not known My ways.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS95_11","020_95_11","PSA","95","11","11","So I swore on oath in My anger, “They shall never enter My rest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_1","020_96_1","PSA","96","1","1","Sing to the LORD a new song; sing to the LORD, all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_2","020_96_2","PSA","96","2","2","Sing to the LORD, bless His name; proclaim His salvation day after day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_3","020_96_3","PSA","96","3","3","Declare His glory among the nations, His wonders among all peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_4","020_96_4","PSA","96","4","4","For great is the LORD, and greatly to be praised; He is to be feared above all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_5","020_96_5","PSA","96","5","5","For all the gods of the nations are idols, but it is the LORD who made the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_6","020_96_6","PSA","96","6","6","Splendor and majesty are before Him; strength and beauty fill His sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_7","020_96_7","PSA","96","7","7","Ascribe to the LORD, O families of the nations, ascribe to the LORD glory and strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_8","020_96_8","PSA","96","8","8","Ascribe to the LORD the glory due His name; bring an offering and enter His courts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_9","020_96_9","PSA","96","9","9","Worship the LORD in the splendor of His holiness; tremble before Him, all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_10","020_96_10","PSA","96","10","10","Declare among the nations: “The LORD reigns!” The world is firmly established; it cannot be moved; He will judge the peoples with equity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_11","020_96_11","PSA","96","11","11","Let the heavens be glad and the earth rejoice; let the sea resound, and all that fills it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_12","020_96_12","PSA","96","12","12","Let the fields exult, and all that is in them. Then all the trees of the forest will sing for joy ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS96_13","020_96_13","PSA","96","13","13","before the LORD, for He is coming—He is coming to judge the earth. He will judge the world in righteousness and the peoples in His faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_1","020_97_1","PSA","97","1","1","The LORD reigns, let the earth rejoice; let the distant shores be glad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_2","020_97_2","PSA","97","2","2","Clouds and darkness surround Him; righteousness and justice are His throne’s foundation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_3","020_97_3","PSA","97","3","3","Fire goes before Him and consumes His foes on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_4","020_97_4","PSA","97","4","4","His lightning illuminates the world; the earth sees and trembles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_5","020_97_5","PSA","97","5","5","The mountains melt like wax at the presence of the LORD, before the Lord of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_6","020_97_6","PSA","97","6","6","The heavens proclaim His righteousness; all the peoples see His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_7","020_97_7","PSA","97","7","7","All worshipers of images are put to shame—those who boast in idols. Worship Him, all you gods! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_8","020_97_8","PSA","97","8","8","Zion hears and rejoices, and the towns of Judah exult because of Your judgments, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_9","020_97_9","PSA","97","9","9","For You, O LORD, are Most High over all the earth; You are exalted far above all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_10","020_97_10","PSA","97","10","10","Hate evil, O you who love the LORD! He preserves the souls of His saints; He delivers them from the hand of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_11","020_97_11","PSA","97","11","11","Light shines on the righteous, gladness on the upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS97_12","020_97_12","PSA","97","12","12","Rejoice in the LORD, you righteous ones, and praise His holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_1","020_98_1","PSA","98","1","1","A Psalm. Sing to the LORD a new song, for He has done wonders; His right hand and holy arm have gained Him the victory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_2","020_98_2","PSA","98","2","2","The LORD has proclaimed His salvation and revealed His righteousness to the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_3","020_98_3","PSA","98","3","3","He has remembered His love and faithfulness to the house of Israel; all the ends of the earth have seen the salvation of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_4","020_98_4","PSA","98","4","4","Make a joyful noise to the LORD, all the earth; break forth—let your cry ring out, and sing praises! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_5","020_98_5","PSA","98","5","5","Sing praises to the LORD with the lyre, in melodious song with the harp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_6","020_98_6","PSA","98","6","6","With trumpets and the blast of the ram’s horn shout for joy before the LORD, the King. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_7","020_98_7","PSA","98","7","7","Let the sea resound, and all that fills it, the world, and all who dwell in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_8","020_98_8","PSA","98","8","8","Let the rivers clap their hands, let the mountains sing together for joy ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS98_9","020_98_9","PSA","98","9","9","before the LORD, for He comes to judge the earth. He will judge the world with righteousness and the peoples with equity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_1","020_99_1","PSA","99","1","1","The LORD reigns; let the nations tremble! He is enthroned above the cherubim; let the earth quake! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_2","020_99_2","PSA","99","2","2","Great is the LORD in Zion; He is exalted above all the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_3","020_99_3","PSA","99","3","3","Let them praise Your great and awesome name—He is holy! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_4","020_99_4","PSA","99","4","4","The mighty King loves justice. You have established equity; You have exercised justice and righteousness in Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_5","020_99_5","PSA","99","5","5","Exalt the LORD our God, and worship at His footstool; He is holy! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_6","020_99_6","PSA","99","6","6","Moses and Aaron were among His priests; Samuel was among those who called on His name. They called to the LORD and He answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_7","020_99_7","PSA","99","7","7","He spoke to them from the pillar of cloud; they kept His decrees and the statutes He gave them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_8","020_99_8","PSA","99","8","8","O LORD our God, You answered them. You were a forgiving God to them, yet an avenger of their misdeeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS99_9","020_99_9","PSA","99","9","9","Exalt the LORD our God and worship at His holy mountain, for the LORD our God is holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS100_1","020_100_1","PSA","100","1","1","A Psalm of thanksgiving. Make a joyful noise to the LORD, all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS100_2","020_100_2","PSA","100","2","2","Serve the LORD with gladness; come into His presence with joyful songs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS100_3","020_100_3","PSA","100","3","3","Know that the LORD is God. It is He who made us, and we are His; we are His people, and the sheep of His pasture. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS100_4","020_100_4","PSA","100","4","4","Enter His gates with thanksgiving and His courts with praise; give thanks to Him and bless His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS100_5","020_100_5","PSA","100","5","5","For the LORD is good, and His loving devotion endures forever; His faithfulness continues to all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_1","020_101_1","PSA","101","1","1","A Psalm of David. I will sing of Your loving devotion and justice; to You, O LORD, I will sing praises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_2","020_101_2","PSA","101","2","2","I will ponder the way that is blameless—when will You come to me? I will walk in my house with integrity of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_3","020_101_3","PSA","101","3","3","I will set no worthless thing before my eyes. I hate the work of those who fall away; it shall not cling to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_4","020_101_4","PSA","101","4","4","A perverse heart shall depart from me; I will know nothing of evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_5","020_101_5","PSA","101","5","5","Whoever slanders his neighbor in secret, I will put to silence; the one with haughty eyes and a proud heart, I will not endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_6","020_101_6","PSA","101","6","6","My eyes favor the faithful of the land, that they may dwell with me; he who walks in the way of integrity shall minister to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_7","020_101_7","PSA","101","7","7","No one who practices deceit shall dwell in my house; no one who tells lies shall stand in my presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS101_8","020_101_8","PSA","101","8","8","Every morning I will remove all the wicked of the land, that I may cut off every evildoer from the city of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_1","020_102_1","PSA","102","1","1","A prayer of one who is afflicted, when he grows faint and pours out his lament before the LORD. Hear my prayer, O LORD; let my cry for help come before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_2","020_102_2","PSA","102","2","2","Do not hide Your face from me in my day of distress. Incline Your ear to me; answer me quickly when I call. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_3","020_102_3","PSA","102","3","3","For my days vanish like smoke, and my bones burn like glowing embers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_4","020_102_4","PSA","102","4","4","My heart is afflicted, and withered like grass; I even forget to eat my bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_5","020_102_5","PSA","102","5","5","Through my loud groaning my skin hangs on my bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_6","020_102_6","PSA","102","6","6","I am like a desert owl, like an owl among the ruins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_7","020_102_7","PSA","102","7","7","I lie awake; I am like a lone bird on a housetop. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_8","020_102_8","PSA","102","8","8","All day long my enemies taunt me; they ridicule me and curse me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_9","020_102_9","PSA","102","9","9","For I have eaten ashes like bread and mixed my drink with tears ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_10","020_102_10","PSA","102","10","10","because of Your indignation and wrath, for You have picked me up and cast me aside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_11","020_102_11","PSA","102","11","11","My days are like lengthening shadows, and I wither away like grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_12","020_102_12","PSA","102","12","12","But You, O LORD, sit enthroned forever; Your renown endures to all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_13","020_102_13","PSA","102","13","13","You will rise up and have compassion on Zion, for it is time to show her favor—the appointed time has come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_14","020_102_14","PSA","102","14","14","For Your servants delight in her stones and take pity on her dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_15","020_102_15","PSA","102","15","15","So the nations will fear the name of the LORD, and all the kings of the earth will fear Your glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_16","020_102_16","PSA","102","16","16","For the LORD will rebuild Zion; He has appeared in His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_17","020_102_17","PSA","102","17","17","He will turn toward the prayer of the destitute; He will not despise their prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_18","020_102_18","PSA","102","18","18","Let this be written for the generation to come, so that a people not yet created may praise the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_19","020_102_19","PSA","102","19","19","For He looked down from the heights of His sanctuary; the LORD gazed out from heaven to earth ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_20","020_102_20","PSA","102","20","20","to hear a prisoner’s groaning, to release those condemned to death, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_21","020_102_21","PSA","102","21","21","that they may proclaim the name of the LORD in Zion and praise Him in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_22","020_102_22","PSA","102","22","22","when peoples and kingdoms assemble to serve the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_23","020_102_23","PSA","102","23","23","He has broken my strength on the way; He has cut short my days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_24","020_102_24","PSA","102","24","24","I say: “O my God, do not take me in the midst of my days! Your years go on through all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_25","020_102_25","PSA","102","25","25","In the beginning You laid the foundations of the earth, and the heavens are the work of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_26","020_102_26","PSA","102","26","26","They will perish, but You remain; they will all wear out like a garment. Like clothing You will change them, and they will be passed on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_27","020_102_27","PSA","102","27","27","But You remain the same, and Your years will never end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS102_28","020_102_28","PSA","102","28","28","The children of Your servants will dwell securely, and their descendants will be established before You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_1","020_103_1","PSA","103","1","1","Of David. Bless the LORD, O my soul; all that is within me, bless His holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_2","020_103_2","PSA","103","2","2","Bless the LORD, O my soul, and do not forget all His kind deeds— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_3","020_103_3","PSA","103","3","3","He who forgives all your iniquities and heals all your diseases, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_4","020_103_4","PSA","103","4","4","who redeems your life from the Pit and crowns you with loving devotion and compassion, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_5","020_103_5","PSA","103","5","5","who satisfies you with good things, so that your youth is renewed like the eagle’s. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_6","020_103_6","PSA","103","6","6","The LORD executes righteousness and justice for all the oppressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_7","020_103_7","PSA","103","7","7","He made known His ways to Moses, His deeds to the people of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_8","020_103_8","PSA","103","8","8","The LORD is compassionate and gracious, slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_9","020_103_9","PSA","103","9","9","He will not always accuse us, nor harbor His anger forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_10","020_103_10","PSA","103","10","10","He has not dealt with us according to our sins or repaid us according to our iniquities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_11","020_103_11","PSA","103","11","11","For as high as the heavens are above the earth, so great is His loving devotion for those who fear Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_12","020_103_12","PSA","103","12","12","As far as the east is from the west, so far has He removed our transgressions from us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_13","020_103_13","PSA","103","13","13","As a father has compassion on his children, so the LORD has compassion on those who fear Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_14","020_103_14","PSA","103","14","14","For He knows our frame; He is mindful that we are dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_15","020_103_15","PSA","103","15","15","As for man, his days are like grass—he blooms like a flower of the field; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_16","020_103_16","PSA","103","16","16","when the wind passes over, it vanishes, and its place remembers it no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_17","020_103_17","PSA","103","17","17","But from everlasting to everlasting the loving devotion of the LORD extends to those who fear Him, and His righteousness to their children’s children— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_18","020_103_18","PSA","103","18","18","to those who keep His covenant and remember to obey His precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_19","020_103_19","PSA","103","19","19","The LORD has established His throne in heaven, and His kingdom rules over all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_20","020_103_20","PSA","103","20","20","Bless the LORD, all His angels mighty in strength who carry out His word, who hearken to the voice of His command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_21","020_103_21","PSA","103","21","21","Bless the LORD, all His hosts, you servants who do His will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS103_22","020_103_22","PSA","103","22","22","Bless the LORD, all His works in all places of His dominion. Bless the LORD, O my soul! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_1","020_104_1","PSA","104","1","1","Bless the LORD, O my soul! O LORD my God, You are very great; You are clothed with splendor and majesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_2","020_104_2","PSA","104","2","2","He wraps Himself in light as with a garment; He stretches out the heavens like a tent, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_3","020_104_3","PSA","104","3","3","laying the beams of His chambers in the waters above, making the clouds His chariot, walking on the wings of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_4","020_104_4","PSA","104","4","4","He makes the winds His messengers, flames of fire His servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_5","020_104_5","PSA","104","5","5","He set the earth on its foundations, never to be moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_6","020_104_6","PSA","104","6","6","You covered it with the deep like a garment; the waters stood above the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_7","020_104_7","PSA","104","7","7","At Your rebuke the waters fled; at the sound of Your thunder they hurried away— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_8","020_104_8","PSA","104","8","8","the mountains rose and the valleys sank to the place You assigned for them— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_9","020_104_9","PSA","104","9","9","You set a boundary they cannot cross, that they may never again cover the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_10","020_104_10","PSA","104","10","10","He sends forth springs in the valleys; they flow between the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_11","020_104_11","PSA","104","11","11","They give drink to every beast of the field; the wild donkeys quench their thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_12","020_104_12","PSA","104","12","12","The birds of the air nest beside the springs; they sing among the branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_13","020_104_13","PSA","104","13","13","He waters the mountains from His chambers; the earth is satisfied by the fruit of His works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_14","020_104_14","PSA","104","14","14","He makes the grass grow for the livestock and provides crops for man to cultivate, bringing forth food from the earth: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_15","020_104_15","PSA","104","15","15","wine that gladdens the heart of man, oil that makes his face to shine, and bread that sustains his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_16","020_104_16","PSA","104","16","16","The trees of the LORD have their fill, the cedars of Lebanon that He planted, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_17","020_104_17","PSA","104","17","17","where the birds build their nests; the stork makes her home in the cypresses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_18","020_104_18","PSA","104","18","18","The high mountains are for the wild goats, the cliffs a refuge for the rock badgers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_19","020_104_19","PSA","104","19","19","He made the moon to mark the seasons; the sun knows when to set. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_20","020_104_20","PSA","104","20","20","You bring darkness, and it becomes night, when all the beasts of the forest prowl. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_21","020_104_21","PSA","104","21","21","The young lions roar for their prey and seek their food from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_22","020_104_22","PSA","104","22","22","The sun rises, and they withdraw; they lie down in their dens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_23","020_104_23","PSA","104","23","23","Man goes forth to his work and to his labor until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_24","020_104_24","PSA","104","24","24","How many are Your works, O LORD! In wisdom You have made them all; the earth is full of Your creatures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_25","020_104_25","PSA","104","25","25","Here is the sea, vast and wide, teeming with creatures beyond number, living things both great and small. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_26","020_104_26","PSA","104","26","26","There the ships pass, and Leviathan, which You formed to frolic there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_27","020_104_27","PSA","104","27","27","All creatures look to You to give them their food in due season. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_28","020_104_28","PSA","104","28","28","When You give it to them, they gather it up; when You open Your hand, they are satisfied with good things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_29","020_104_29","PSA","104","29","29","When You hide Your face, they are terrified; when You take away their breath, they die and return to dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_30","020_104_30","PSA","104","30","30","When You send Your Spirit, they are created, and You renew the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_31","020_104_31","PSA","104","31","31","May the glory of the LORD endure forever; may the LORD rejoice in His works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_32","020_104_32","PSA","104","32","32","He looks on the earth, and it trembles; He touches the mountains, and they smolder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_33","020_104_33","PSA","104","33","33","I will sing to the LORD all my life; I will sing praise to my God while I have my being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_34","020_104_34","PSA","104","34","34","May my meditation be pleasing to Him, for I rejoice in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS104_35","020_104_35","PSA","104","35","35","May sinners vanish from the earth and the wicked be no more. Bless the LORD, O my soul. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_1","020_105_1","PSA","105","1","1","Give thanks to the LORD, call upon His name; make known His deeds among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_2","020_105_2","PSA","105","2","2","Sing to Him, sing praises to Him; tell of all His wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_3","020_105_3","PSA","105","3","3","Glory in His holy name; let the hearts of those who seek the LORD rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_4","020_105_4","PSA","105","4","4","Seek out the LORD and His strength; seek His face always. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_5","020_105_5","PSA","105","5","5","Remember the wonders He has done, His marvels, and the judgments He has pronounced, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_6","020_105_6","PSA","105","6","6","O offspring of His servant Abraham, O sons of Jacob, His chosen ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_7","020_105_7","PSA","105","7","7","He is the LORD our God; His judgments carry throughout the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_8","020_105_8","PSA","105","8","8","He remembers His covenant forever, the word He ordained for a thousand generations— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_9","020_105_9","PSA","105","9","9","the covenant He made with Abraham, and the oath He swore to Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_10","020_105_10","PSA","105","10","10","He confirmed it to Jacob as a decree, to Israel as an everlasting covenant: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_11","020_105_11","PSA","105","11","11","“I will give you the land of Canaan as the portion of your inheritance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_12","020_105_12","PSA","105","12","12","When they were few in number, few indeed, and strangers in the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_13","020_105_13","PSA","105","13","13","they wandered from nation to nation, from one kingdom to another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_14","020_105_14","PSA","105","14","14","He let no man oppress them; He rebuked kings on their behalf: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_15","020_105_15","PSA","105","15","15","“Do not touch My anointed ones! Do no harm to My prophets!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_16","020_105_16","PSA","105","16","16","He called down famine on the land and cut off all their supplies of food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_17","020_105_17","PSA","105","17","17","He sent a man before them—Joseph, sold as a slave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_18","020_105_18","PSA","105","18","18","They bruised his feet with shackles and placed his neck in irons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_19","020_105_19","PSA","105","19","19","until his prediction came true and the word of the LORD proved him right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_20","020_105_20","PSA","105","20","20","The king sent and released him; the ruler of peoples set him free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_21","020_105_21","PSA","105","21","21","He made him master of his household, ruler over all his substance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_22","020_105_22","PSA","105","22","22","to instruct his princes as he pleased and teach his elders wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_23","020_105_23","PSA","105","23","23","Then Israel entered Egypt; Jacob dwelt in the land of Ham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_24","020_105_24","PSA","105","24","24","And the LORD made His people very fruitful, more numerous than their foes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_25","020_105_25","PSA","105","25","25","whose hearts He turned to hate His people, to conspire against His servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_26","020_105_26","PSA","105","26","26","He sent Moses His servant, and Aaron, whom He had chosen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_27","020_105_27","PSA","105","27","27","They performed His miraculous signs among them, and wonders in the land of Ham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_28","020_105_28","PSA","105","28","28","He sent darkness, and it became dark—yet they defied His words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_29","020_105_29","PSA","105","29","29","He turned their waters to blood and caused their fish to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_30","020_105_30","PSA","105","30","30","Their land teemed with frogs, even in their royal chambers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_31","020_105_31","PSA","105","31","31","He spoke, and insects swarmed—gnats throughout their country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_32","020_105_32","PSA","105","32","32","He gave them hail for rain, with lightning throughout their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_33","020_105_33","PSA","105","33","33","He struck their vines and fig trees and shattered the trees of their country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_34","020_105_34","PSA","105","34","34","He spoke, and the locusts came—young locusts without number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_35","020_105_35","PSA","105","35","35","They devoured every plant in their land and consumed the produce of their soil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_36","020_105_36","PSA","105","36","36","Then He struck all the firstborn in their land, the firstfruits of all their vigor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_37","020_105_37","PSA","105","37","37","He brought Israel out with silver and gold, and none among His tribes stumbled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_38","020_105_38","PSA","105","38","38","Egypt was glad when they departed, for the dread of Israel had fallen on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_39","020_105_39","PSA","105","39","39","He spread a cloud as a covering and a fire to light up the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_40","020_105_40","PSA","105","40","40","They asked, and He brought quail and satisfied them with the bread of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_41","020_105_41","PSA","105","41","41","He opened a rock, and water gushed out; it flowed like a river in the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_42","020_105_42","PSA","105","42","42","For He remembered His holy promise to Abraham His servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_43","020_105_43","PSA","105","43","43","He brought forth His people with rejoicing, His chosen with shouts of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_44","020_105_44","PSA","105","44","44","He gave them the lands of the nations, that they might inherit the fruit of others’ labor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS105_45","020_105_45","PSA","105","45","45","that they might keep His statutes and obey His laws. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_1","020_106_1","PSA","106","1","1","Hallelujah! Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good; His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_2","020_106_2","PSA","106","2","2","Who can describe the mighty acts of the LORD or fully proclaim His praise? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_3","020_106_3","PSA","106","3","3","Blessed are those who uphold justice, who practice righteousness at all times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_4","020_106_4","PSA","106","4","4","Remember me, O LORD, in Your favor to Your people; visit me with Your salvation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_5","020_106_5","PSA","106","5","5","that I may see the prosperity of Your chosen ones, and rejoice in the gladness of Your nation, and give glory with Your inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_6","020_106_6","PSA","106","6","6","We have sinned like our fathers; we have done wrong and acted wickedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_7","020_106_7","PSA","106","7","7","Our fathers in Egypt did not grasp Your wonders or remember Your abundant kindness; but they rebelled by the sea, there at the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_8","020_106_8","PSA","106","8","8","Yet He saved them for the sake of His name, to make His power known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_9","020_106_9","PSA","106","9","9","He rebuked the Red Sea, and it dried up; He led them through the depths as through a desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_10","020_106_10","PSA","106","10","10","He saved them from the hand that hated them; He redeemed them from the hand of the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_11","020_106_11","PSA","106","11","11","The waters covered their foes; not one of them remained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_12","020_106_12","PSA","106","12","12","Then they believed His promises and sang His praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_13","020_106_13","PSA","106","13","13","Yet they soon forgot His works and failed to wait for His counsel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_14","020_106_14","PSA","106","14","14","They craved intensely in the wilderness and tested God in the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_15","020_106_15","PSA","106","15","15","So He granted their request, but sent a wasting disease upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_16","020_106_16","PSA","106","16","16","In the camp they envied Moses, as well as Aaron, the holy one of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_17","020_106_17","PSA","106","17","17","The earth opened up and swallowed Dathan; it covered the assembly of Abiram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_18","020_106_18","PSA","106","18","18","Then fire blazed through their company; flames consumed the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_19","020_106_19","PSA","106","19","19","At Horeb they made a calf and worshiped a molten image. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_20","020_106_20","PSA","106","20","20","They exchanged their Glory for the image of a grass-eating ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_21","020_106_21","PSA","106","21","21","They forgot God their Savior, who did great things in Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_22","020_106_22","PSA","106","22","22","wondrous works in the land of Ham, and awesome deeds by the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_23","020_106_23","PSA","106","23","23","So He said He would destroy them—had not Moses His chosen one stood before Him in the breach to divert His wrath from destroying them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_24","020_106_24","PSA","106","24","24","They despised the pleasant land; they did not believe His promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_25","020_106_25","PSA","106","25","25","They grumbled in their tents and did not listen to the voice of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_26","020_106_26","PSA","106","26","26","So He raised His hand and swore to cast them down in the wilderness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_27","020_106_27","PSA","106","27","27","to disperse their offspring among the nations and scatter them throughout the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_28","020_106_28","PSA","106","28","28","They yoked themselves to Baal of Peor and ate sacrifices offered to lifeless gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_29","020_106_29","PSA","106","29","29","So they provoked the LORD to anger with their deeds, and a plague broke out among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_30","020_106_30","PSA","106","30","30","But Phinehas stood and intervened, and the plague was restrained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_31","020_106_31","PSA","106","31","31","It was credited to him as righteousness for endless generations to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_32","020_106_32","PSA","106","32","32","At the waters of Meribah they angered the LORD, and trouble came to Moses because of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_33","020_106_33","PSA","106","33","33","For they rebelled against His Spirit, and Moses spoke rashly with his lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_34","020_106_34","PSA","106","34","34","They did not destroy the peoples as the LORD had commanded them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_35","020_106_35","PSA","106","35","35","but they mingled with the nations and adopted their customs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_36","020_106_36","PSA","106","36","36","They worshiped their idols, which became a snare to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_37","020_106_37","PSA","106","37","37","They sacrificed their sons and their daughters to demons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_38","020_106_38","PSA","106","38","38","They shed innocent blood—the blood of their sons and daughters, whom they sacrificed to the idols of Canaan, and the land was polluted with blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_39","020_106_39","PSA","106","39","39","They defiled themselves by their actions and prostituted themselves by their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_40","020_106_40","PSA","106","40","40","So the anger of the LORD burned against His people, and He abhorred His own inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_41","020_106_41","PSA","106","41","41","He delivered them into the hand of the nations, and those who hated them ruled over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_42","020_106_42","PSA","106","42","42","Their enemies oppressed them and subdued them under their hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_43","020_106_43","PSA","106","43","43","Many times He rescued them, but they were bent on rebellion and sank down in their iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_44","020_106_44","PSA","106","44","44","Nevertheless He heard their cry; He took note of their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_45","020_106_45","PSA","106","45","45","And He remembered His covenant with them, and relented by the abundance of His loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_46","020_106_46","PSA","106","46","46","He made them objects of compassion to all who held them captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_47","020_106_47","PSA","106","47","47","Save us, O LORD our God, and gather us from the nations, that we may give thanks to Your holy name, that we may glory in Your praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS106_48","020_106_48","PSA","106","48","48","Blessed be the LORD, the God of Israel, from everlasting to everlasting. Let all the people say, “Amen!” Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_1","020_107_1","PSA","107","1","1","Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good; His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_2","020_107_2","PSA","107","2","2","Let the redeemed of the LORD say so, whom He has redeemed from the hand of the enemy ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_3","020_107_3","PSA","107","3","3","and gathered from the lands, from east and west, from north and south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_4","020_107_4","PSA","107","4","4","Some wandered in desert wastelands, finding no path to a city in which to dwell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_5","020_107_5","PSA","107","5","5","They were hungry and thirsty; their soul fainted within them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_6","020_107_6","PSA","107","6","6","Then they cried out to the LORD in their trouble, and He delivered them from their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_7","020_107_7","PSA","107","7","7","He led them on a straight path to reach a city where they could live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_8","020_107_8","PSA","107","8","8","Let them give thanks to the LORD for His loving devotion and His wonders to the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_9","020_107_9","PSA","107","9","9","For He satisfies the thirsty and fills the hungry with good things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_10","020_107_10","PSA","107","10","10","Some sat in darkness and in the shadow of death, prisoners in affliction and chains, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_11","020_107_11","PSA","107","11","11","because they rebelled against the words of God and despised the counsel of the Most High. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_12","020_107_12","PSA","107","12","12","He humbled their hearts with hard labor; they stumbled, and there was no one to help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_13","020_107_13","PSA","107","13","13","Then they cried out to the LORD in their trouble, and He saved them from their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_14","020_107_14","PSA","107","14","14","He brought them out of darkness and the shadow of death and broke away their chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_15","020_107_15","PSA","107","15","15","Let them give thanks to the LORD for His loving devotion and His wonders to the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_16","020_107_16","PSA","107","16","16","For He has broken down the gates of bronze and cut through the bars of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_17","020_107_17","PSA","107","17","17","Fools, in their rebellious ways, and through their iniquities, suffered affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_18","020_107_18","PSA","107","18","18","They loathed all food and drew near to the gates of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_19","020_107_19","PSA","107","19","19","Then they cried out to the LORD in their trouble, and He saved them from their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_20","020_107_20","PSA","107","20","20","He sent forth His word and healed them; He rescued them from the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_21","020_107_21","PSA","107","21","21","Let them give thanks to the LORD for His loving devotion and His wonders to the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_22","020_107_22","PSA","107","22","22","Let them offer sacrifices of thanksgiving and declare His works with rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_23","020_107_23","PSA","107","23","23","Others went out to sea in ships, conducting trade on the mighty waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_24","020_107_24","PSA","107","24","24","They saw the works of the LORD, and His wonders in the deep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_25","020_107_25","PSA","107","25","25","For He spoke and raised a tempest that lifted the waves of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_26","020_107_26","PSA","107","26","26","They mounted up to the heavens, then sunk to the depths; their courage melted in their anguish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_27","020_107_27","PSA","107","27","27","They reeled and staggered like drunkards, and all their skill was useless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_28","020_107_28","PSA","107","28","28","Then they cried out to the LORD in their trouble, and He brought them out of their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_29","020_107_29","PSA","107","29","29","He calmed the storm to a whisper, and the waves of the sea were hushed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_30","020_107_30","PSA","107","30","30","They rejoiced in the silence, and He guided them to the harbor they desired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_31","020_107_31","PSA","107","31","31","Let them give thanks to the LORD for His loving devotion and His wonders to the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_32","020_107_32","PSA","107","32","32","Let them exalt Him in the assembly of the people and praise Him in the council of the elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_33","020_107_33","PSA","107","33","33","He turns rivers into deserts, springs of water into thirsty ground, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_34","020_107_34","PSA","107","34","34","and fruitful land into fields of salt, because of the wickedness of its dwellers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_35","020_107_35","PSA","107","35","35","He turns a desert into pools of water and a dry land into flowing springs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_36","020_107_36","PSA","107","36","36","He causes the hungry to settle there, that they may establish a city in which to dwell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_37","020_107_37","PSA","107","37","37","They sow fields and plant vineyards that yield a fruitful harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_38","020_107_38","PSA","107","38","38","He blesses them, and they multiply greatly; He does not let their herds diminish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_39","020_107_39","PSA","107","39","39","When they are decreased and humbled by oppression, evil, and sorrow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_40","020_107_40","PSA","107","40","40","He pours out contempt on the nobles and makes them wander in a trackless wasteland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_41","020_107_41","PSA","107","41","41","But He lifts the needy from affliction and increases their families like flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_42","020_107_42","PSA","107","42","42","The upright see and rejoice, and all iniquity shuts its mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS107_43","020_107_43","PSA","107","43","43","Let him who is wise pay heed to these things and consider the loving devotion of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_1","020_108_1","PSA","108","1","1","A song. A Psalm of David. My heart is steadfast, O God; I will sing and make music with all my being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_2","020_108_2","PSA","108","2","2","Awake, O harp and lyre! I will awaken the dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_3","020_108_3","PSA","108","3","3","I will praise You, O LORD, among the nations; I will sing Your praises among the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_4","020_108_4","PSA","108","4","4","For Your loving devotion extends beyond the heavens, and Your faithfulness reaches to the clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_5","020_108_5","PSA","108","5","5","Be exalted, O God, above the heavens; may Your glory cover all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_6","020_108_6","PSA","108","6","6","Respond and save us with Your right hand, that Your beloved may be delivered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_7","020_108_7","PSA","108","7","7","God has spoken from His sanctuary: “I will triumph! I will parcel out Shechem and apportion the Valley of Succoth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_8","020_108_8","PSA","108","8","8","Gilead is Mine, and Manasseh is Mine; Ephraim is My helmet, Judah is My scepter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_9","020_108_9","PSA","108","9","9","Moab is My washbasin; upon Edom I toss My sandal; over Philistia I shout in triumph.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_10","020_108_10","PSA","108","10","10","Who will bring me to the fortified city? Who will lead me to Edom? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_11","020_108_11","PSA","108","11","11","Have You not rejected us, O God? Will You no longer march out, O God, with our armies? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_12","020_108_12","PSA","108","12","12","Give us aid against the enemy, for the help of man is worthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS108_13","020_108_13","PSA","108","13","13","With God we will perform with valor, and He will trample our enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_1","020_109_1","PSA","109","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. O God of my praise, be not silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_2","020_109_2","PSA","109","2","2","For wicked and deceitful mouths open against me; they speak against me with lying tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_3","020_109_3","PSA","109","3","3","They surround me with hateful words and attack me without cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_4","020_109_4","PSA","109","4","4","In return for my love they accuse me, but I am a man of prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_5","020_109_5","PSA","109","5","5","They repay me evil for good, and hatred for my love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_6","020_109_6","PSA","109","6","6","Set over him a wicked man; let an accuser stand at his right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_7","020_109_7","PSA","109","7","7","When he is tried, let him be found guilty, and may his prayer be regarded as sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_8","020_109_8","PSA","109","8","8","May his days be few; may another take his position. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_9","020_109_9","PSA","109","9","9","May his children be fatherless and his wife a widow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_10","020_109_10","PSA","109","10","10","May his children wander as beggars, seeking sustenance far from their ruined homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_11","020_109_11","PSA","109","11","11","May the creditor seize all he owns, and strangers plunder the fruits of his labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_12","020_109_12","PSA","109","12","12","May there be no one to extend kindness to him, and no one to favor his fatherless children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_13","020_109_13","PSA","109","13","13","May his descendants be cut off; may their name be blotted out from the next generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_14","020_109_14","PSA","109","14","14","May the iniquity of his fathers be remembered before the LORD, and the sin of his mother never be blotted out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_15","020_109_15","PSA","109","15","15","May their sins always remain before the LORD, that He may cut off their memory from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_16","020_109_16","PSA","109","16","16","For he never thought to show kindness, but pursued the poor and needy and brokenhearted, even to their death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_17","020_109_17","PSA","109","17","17","The cursing that he loved, may it fall on him; the blessing in which he refused to delight, may it be far from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_18","020_109_18","PSA","109","18","18","The cursing that he wore like a coat, may it soak into his body like water, and into his bones like oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_19","020_109_19","PSA","109","19","19","May it be like a robe wrapped about him, like a belt tied forever around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_20","020_109_20","PSA","109","20","20","May this be the LORD’s reward to my accusers, to those who speak evil against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_21","020_109_21","PSA","109","21","21","But You, O GOD, the Lord, deal kindly with me for the sake of Your name; deliver me by the goodness of Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_22","020_109_22","PSA","109","22","22","For I am poor and needy; my heart is wounded within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_23","020_109_23","PSA","109","23","23","I am fading away like a lengthening shadow; I am shaken off like a locust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_24","020_109_24","PSA","109","24","24","My knees are weak from fasting, and my body grows lean and gaunt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_25","020_109_25","PSA","109","25","25","I am an object of scorn to my accusers; when they see me, they shake their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_26","020_109_26","PSA","109","26","26","Help me, O LORD my God; save me according to Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_27","020_109_27","PSA","109","27","27","Let them know that this is Your hand, that You, O LORD, have done it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_28","020_109_28","PSA","109","28","28","Though they curse, You will bless. When they rise up, they will be put to shame, but Your servant will rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_29","020_109_29","PSA","109","29","29","May my accusers be clothed with disgrace; may they wear their shame like a robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_30","020_109_30","PSA","109","30","30","With my mouth I will thank the LORD profusely; I will praise Him in the presence of many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS109_31","020_109_31","PSA","109","31","31","For He stands at the right hand of the needy one, to save him from the condemners of his soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_1","020_110_1","PSA","110","1","1","A Psalm of David. The LORD said to my Lord: “Sit at My right hand until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_2","020_110_2","PSA","110","2","2","The LORD extends Your mighty scepter from Zion: “Rule in the midst of Your enemies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_3","020_110_3","PSA","110","3","3","Your people shall be willing on Your day of battle. Arrayed in holy splendor, from the womb of the dawn, to You belongs the dew of Your youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_4","020_110_4","PSA","110","4","4","The LORD has sworn and will not change His mind: “You are a priest forever in the order of Melchizedek.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_5","020_110_5","PSA","110","5","5","The Lord is at Your right hand; He will crush kings in the day of His wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_6","020_110_6","PSA","110","6","6","He will judge the nations, heaping up the dead; He will crush the leaders far and wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS110_7","020_110_7","PSA","110","7","7","He will drink from the brook by the road; therefore He will lift up His head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_1","020_111_1","PSA","111","1","1","Hallelujah! I will give thanks to the LORD with all my heart in the council of the upright and in the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_2","020_111_2","PSA","111","2","2","Great are the works of the LORD; they are pondered by all who delight in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_3","020_111_3","PSA","111","3","3","Splendid and majestic is His work; His righteousness endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_4","020_111_4","PSA","111","4","4","He has caused His wonders to be remembered; the LORD is gracious and compassionate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_5","020_111_5","PSA","111","5","5","He provides food for those who fear Him; He remembers His covenant forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_6","020_111_6","PSA","111","6","6","He has shown His people the power of His works by giving them the inheritance of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_7","020_111_7","PSA","111","7","7","The works of His hands are truth and justice; all His precepts are trustworthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_8","020_111_8","PSA","111","8","8","They are upheld forever and ever, enacted in truth and uprightness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_9","020_111_9","PSA","111","9","9","He has sent redemption to His people; He has ordained His covenant forever; holy and awesome is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS111_10","020_111_10","PSA","111","10","10","The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom; all who follow His precepts gain rich understanding. His praise endures forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_1","020_112_1","PSA","112","1","1","Hallelujah! Blessed is the man who fears the LORD, who greatly delights in His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_2","020_112_2","PSA","112","2","2","His descendants will be mighty in the land; the generation of the upright will be blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_3","020_112_3","PSA","112","3","3","Wealth and riches are in his house, and his righteousness endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_4","020_112_4","PSA","112","4","4","Light dawns in the darkness for the upright—for the gracious, compassionate, and righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_5","020_112_5","PSA","112","5","5","It is well with the man who is generous and lends freely, whose affairs are guided by justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_6","020_112_6","PSA","112","6","6","Surely he will never be shaken; the righteous man will be remembered forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_7","020_112_7","PSA","112","7","7","He does not fear bad news; his heart is steadfast, trusting in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_8","020_112_8","PSA","112","8","8","His heart is assured; he does not fear, until he looks in triumph on his foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_9","020_112_9","PSA","112","9","9","He has scattered abroad his gifts to the poor; his righteousness endures forever; his horn will be lifted high in honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS112_10","020_112_10","PSA","112","10","10","The wicked man will see and be grieved; he will gnash his teeth and waste away; the desires of the wicked will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_1","020_113_1","PSA","113","1","1","Hallelujah! Give praise, O servants of the LORD; praise the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_2","020_113_2","PSA","113","2","2","Blessed be the name of the LORD both now and forevermore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_3","020_113_3","PSA","113","3","3","From where the sun rises to where it sets, the name of the LORD is praised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_4","020_113_4","PSA","113","4","4","The LORD is exalted over all the nations, His glory above the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_5","020_113_5","PSA","113","5","5","Who is like the LORD our God, the One enthroned on high? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_6","020_113_6","PSA","113","6","6","He humbles Himself to behold the heavens and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_7","020_113_7","PSA","113","7","7","He raises the poor from the dust and lifts the needy from the dump ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_8","020_113_8","PSA","113","8","8","to seat them with nobles, with the princes of His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS113_9","020_113_9","PSA","113","9","9","He settles the barren woman in her home as a joyful mother to her children. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_1","020_114_1","PSA","114","1","1","When Israel departed from Egypt, the house of Jacob from a people of foreign tongue, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_2","020_114_2","PSA","114","2","2","Judah became God’s sanctuary, Israel His dominion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_3","020_114_3","PSA","114","3","3","The sea observed and fled; the Jordan turned back; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_4","020_114_4","PSA","114","4","4","the mountains skipped like rams, the hills like lambs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_5","020_114_5","PSA","114","5","5","Why was it, O sea, that you fled, O Jordan, that you turned back, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_6","020_114_6","PSA","114","6","6","O mountains, that you skipped like rams, O hills, like lambs? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_7","020_114_7","PSA","114","7","7","Tremble, O earth, at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS114_8","020_114_8","PSA","114","8","8","who turned the rock into a pool, the flint into a fountain of water! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_1","020_115_1","PSA","115","1","1","Not to us, O LORD, not to us, but to Your name be the glory, because of Your loving devotion, because of Your faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_2","020_115_2","PSA","115","2","2","Why should the nations say, “Where is their God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_3","020_115_3","PSA","115","3","3","Our God is in heaven; He does as He pleases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_4","020_115_4","PSA","115","4","4","Their idols are silver and gold, made by the hands of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_5","020_115_5","PSA","115","5","5","They have mouths, but cannot speak; they have eyes, but cannot see; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_6","020_115_6","PSA","115","6","6","they have ears, but cannot hear; they have noses, but cannot smell; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_7","020_115_7","PSA","115","7","7","they have hands, but cannot feel; they have feet, but cannot walk; they cannot even clear their throats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_8","020_115_8","PSA","115","8","8","Those who make them become like them, as do all who trust in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_9","020_115_9","PSA","115","9","9","O Israel, trust in the LORD! He is their help and shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_10","020_115_10","PSA","115","10","10","O house of Aaron, trust in the LORD! He is their help and shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_11","020_115_11","PSA","115","11","11","You who fear the LORD, trust in the LORD! He is their help and shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_12","020_115_12","PSA","115","12","12","The LORD is mindful of us; He will bless us. He will bless the house of Israel; He will bless the house of Aaron; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_13","020_115_13","PSA","115","13","13","He will bless those who fear the LORD—small and great alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_14","020_115_14","PSA","115","14","14","May the LORD give you increase, both you and your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_15","020_115_15","PSA","115","15","15","May you be blessed by the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_16","020_115_16","PSA","115","16","16","The highest heavens belong to the LORD, but the earth He has given to mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_17","020_115_17","PSA","115","17","17","It is not the dead who praise the LORD, nor any who descend into silence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS115_18","020_115_18","PSA","115","18","18","But it is we who will bless the LORD, both now and forevermore. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_1","020_116_1","PSA","116","1","1","I love the LORD, for He has heard my voice—my appeal for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_2","020_116_2","PSA","116","2","2","Because He has inclined His ear to me, I will call on Him as long as I live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_3","020_116_3","PSA","116","3","3","The ropes of death entangled me; the anguish of Sheol overcame me; I was confronted by trouble and sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_4","020_116_4","PSA","116","4","4","Then I called on the name of the LORD: “O LORD, deliver my soul!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_5","020_116_5","PSA","116","5","5","The LORD is gracious and righteous; our God is full of compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_6","020_116_6","PSA","116","6","6","The LORD preserves the simplehearted; I was helpless, and He saved me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_7","020_116_7","PSA","116","7","7","Return to your rest, O my soul, for the LORD has been good to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_8","020_116_8","PSA","116","8","8","For You have delivered my soul from death, my eyes from tears, my feet from stumbling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_9","020_116_9","PSA","116","9","9","I will walk before the LORD in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_10","020_116_10","PSA","116","10","10","I believed, therefore I said, “I am greatly afflicted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_11","020_116_11","PSA","116","11","11","In my alarm I said, “All men are liars!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_12","020_116_12","PSA","116","12","12","How can I repay the LORD for all His goodness to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_13","020_116_13","PSA","116","13","13","I will lift the cup of salvation and call on the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_14","020_116_14","PSA","116","14","14","I will fulfill my vows to the LORD in the presence of all His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_15","020_116_15","PSA","116","15","15","Precious in the sight of the LORD is the death of His saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_16","020_116_16","PSA","116","16","16","Truly, O LORD, I am Your servant; I am Your servant, the son of Your maidservant; You have broken my bonds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_17","020_116_17","PSA","116","17","17","I will offer to You a sacrifice of thanksgiving and call on the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_18","020_116_18","PSA","116","18","18","I will fulfill my vows to the LORD in the presence of all His people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS116_19","020_116_19","PSA","116","19","19","in the courts of the LORD’s house, in your midst, O Jerusalem. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS117_1","020_117_1","PSA","117","1","1","Praise the LORD, all you nations! Extol Him, all you peoples! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS117_2","020_117_2","PSA","117","2","2","For great is His loving devotion toward us, and the faithfulness of the LORD endures forever. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_1","020_118_1","PSA","118","1","1","Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good; His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_2","020_118_2","PSA","118","2","2","Let Israel say, “His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_3","020_118_3","PSA","118","3","3","Let the house of Aaron say, “His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_4","020_118_4","PSA","118","4","4","Let those who fear the LORD say, “His loving devotion endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_5","020_118_5","PSA","118","5","5","In my distress I called to the LORD, and He answered and set me free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_6","020_118_6","PSA","118","6","6","The LORD is on my side; I will not be afraid. What can man do to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_7","020_118_7","PSA","118","7","7","The LORD is on my side; He is my helper. Therefore I will look in triumph on those who hate me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_8","020_118_8","PSA","118","8","8","It is better to take refuge in the LORD than to trust in man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_9","020_118_9","PSA","118","9","9","It is better to take refuge in the LORD than to trust in princes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_10","020_118_10","PSA","118","10","10","All the nations surrounded me, but in the name of the LORD I cut them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_11","020_118_11","PSA","118","11","11","They surrounded me on every side, but in the name of the LORD I cut them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_12","020_118_12","PSA","118","12","12","They swarmed around me like bees, but they were extinguished like burning thorns; in the name of the LORD I cut them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_13","020_118_13","PSA","118","13","13","I was pushed so hard I was falling, but the LORD helped me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_14","020_118_14","PSA","118","14","14","The LORD is my strength and my song, and He has become my salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_15","020_118_15","PSA","118","15","15","Shouts of joy and salvation resound in the tents of the righteous: “The right hand of the LORD performs with valor! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_16","020_118_16","PSA","118","16","16","The right hand of the LORD is exalted! The right hand of the LORD performs with valor!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_17","020_118_17","PSA","118","17","17","I will not die, but I will live and proclaim what the LORD has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_18","020_118_18","PSA","118","18","18","The LORD disciplined me severely, but He has not given me over to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_19","020_118_19","PSA","118","19","19","Open to me the gates of righteousness, that I may enter and give thanks to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_20","020_118_20","PSA","118","20","20","This is the gate of the LORD; the righteous shall enter through it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_21","020_118_21","PSA","118","21","21","I will give You thanks, for You have answered me, and You have become my salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_22","020_118_22","PSA","118","22","22","The stone the builders rejected has become the cornerstone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_23","020_118_23","PSA","118","23","23","This is from the LORD, and it is marvelous in our eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_24","020_118_24","PSA","118","24","24","This is the day that the LORD has made; we will rejoice and be glad in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_25","020_118_25","PSA","118","25","25","O LORD, save us, we pray. We beseech You, O LORD, cause us to prosper! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_26","020_118_26","PSA","118","26","26","Blessed is he who comes in the name of the LORD. From the house of the LORD we bless you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_27","020_118_27","PSA","118","27","27","The LORD is God; He has made His light to shine upon us. Bind the festal sacrifice with cords to the horns of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_28","020_118_28","PSA","118","28","28","You are my God, and I will give You thanks. You are my God, and I will exalt You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS118_29","020_118_29","PSA","118","29","29","Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good; His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_1","020_119_1","PSA","119","1","1","Blessed are those whose way is blameless, who walk in the Law of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_2","020_119_2","PSA","119","2","2","Blessed are those who keep His testimonies and seek Him with all their heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_3","020_119_3","PSA","119","3","3","They do no iniquity; they walk in His ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_4","020_119_4","PSA","119","4","4","You have ordained Your precepts, that we should keep them diligently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_5","020_119_5","PSA","119","5","5","Oh, that my ways were committed to keeping Your statutes! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_6","020_119_6","PSA","119","6","6","Then I would not be ashamed when I consider all Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_7","020_119_7","PSA","119","7","7","I will praise You with an upright heart when I learn Your righteous judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_8","020_119_8","PSA","119","8","8","I will keep Your statutes; do not utterly forsake me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_9","020_119_9","PSA","119","9","9","How can a young man keep his way pure? By guarding it according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_10","020_119_10","PSA","119","10","10","With all my heart I have sought You; do not let me stray from Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_11","020_119_11","PSA","119","11","11","I have hidden Your word in my heart that I might not sin against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_12","020_119_12","PSA","119","12","12","Blessed are You, O LORD; teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_13","020_119_13","PSA","119","13","13","With my lips I proclaim all the judgments of Your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_14","020_119_14","PSA","119","14","14","I rejoice in the way of Your testimonies as much as in all riches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_15","020_119_15","PSA","119","15","15","I will meditate on Your precepts and regard Your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_16","020_119_16","PSA","119","16","16","I will delight in Your statutes; I will not forget Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_17","020_119_17","PSA","119","17","17","Deal bountifully with Your servant, that I may live and keep Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_18","020_119_18","PSA","119","18","18","Open my eyes that I may see wondrous things from Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_19","020_119_19","PSA","119","19","19","I am a stranger on the earth; do not hide Your commandments from me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_20","020_119_20","PSA","119","20","20","My soul is consumed with longing for Your judgments at all times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_21","020_119_21","PSA","119","21","21","You rebuke the arrogant—the cursed who stray from Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_22","020_119_22","PSA","119","22","22","Remove my scorn and contempt, for I have kept Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_23","020_119_23","PSA","119","23","23","Though rulers sit and slander me, Your servant meditates on Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_24","020_119_24","PSA","119","24","24","Your testimonies are indeed my delight; they are my counselors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_25","020_119_25","PSA","119","25","25","My soul cleaves to the dust; revive me according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_26","020_119_26","PSA","119","26","26","I recounted my ways, and You answered me; teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_27","020_119_27","PSA","119","27","27","Make clear to me the way of Your precepts; then I will meditate on Your wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_28","020_119_28","PSA","119","28","28","My soul melts with sorrow; strengthen me according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_29","020_119_29","PSA","119","29","29","Remove me from the path of deceit and graciously grant me Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_30","020_119_30","PSA","119","30","30","I have chosen the way of truth; I have set Your ordinances before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_31","020_119_31","PSA","119","31","31","I cling to Your testimonies, O LORD; let me not be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_32","020_119_32","PSA","119","32","32","I run in the path of Your commandments, for You will enlarge my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_33","020_119_33","PSA","119","33","33","Teach me, O LORD, the way of Your statutes, and I will keep them to the end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_34","020_119_34","PSA","119","34","34","Give me understanding that I may obey Your law, and follow it with all my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_35","020_119_35","PSA","119","35","35","Direct me in the path of Your commandments, for there I find delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_36","020_119_36","PSA","119","36","36","Turn my heart to Your testimonies and not to covetous gain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_37","020_119_37","PSA","119","37","37","Turn my eyes away from worthless things; revive me with Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_38","020_119_38","PSA","119","38","38","Establish Your word to Your servant, to produce reverence for You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_39","020_119_39","PSA","119","39","39","Turn away the disgrace I dread, for Your judgments are good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_40","020_119_40","PSA","119","40","40","How I long for Your precepts! Revive me in Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_41","020_119_41","PSA","119","41","41","May Your loving devotion come to me, O LORD, Your salvation, according to Your promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_42","020_119_42","PSA","119","42","42","Then I can answer him who taunts, for I trust in Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_43","020_119_43","PSA","119","43","43","Never take Your word of truth from my mouth, for I hope in Your judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_44","020_119_44","PSA","119","44","44","I will always obey Your law, forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_45","020_119_45","PSA","119","45","45","And I will walk in freedom, for I have sought Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_46","020_119_46","PSA","119","46","46","I will speak of Your testimonies before kings, and I will not be ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_47","020_119_47","PSA","119","47","47","I delight in Your commandments because I love them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_48","020_119_48","PSA","119","48","48","I lift up my hands to Your commandments, which I love, and I meditate on Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_49","020_119_49","PSA","119","49","49","Remember Your word to Your servant, upon which You have given me hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_50","020_119_50","PSA","119","50","50","This is my comfort in affliction, that Your promise has given me life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_51","020_119_51","PSA","119","51","51","The arrogant utterly deride me, but I do not turn from Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_52","020_119_52","PSA","119","52","52","I remember Your judgments of old, O LORD, and in them I find comfort. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_53","020_119_53","PSA","119","53","53","Rage has taken hold of me because of the wicked who reject Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_54","020_119_54","PSA","119","54","54","Your statutes are songs to me in the house of my pilgrimage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_55","020_119_55","PSA","119","55","55","In the night, O LORD, I remember Your name, that I may keep Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_56","020_119_56","PSA","119","56","56","This is my practice, for I obey Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_57","020_119_57","PSA","119","57","57","The LORD is my portion; I have promised to keep Your words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_58","020_119_58","PSA","119","58","58","I have sought Your face with all my heart; be gracious to me according to Your promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_59","020_119_59","PSA","119","59","59","I considered my ways and turned my steps to Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_60","020_119_60","PSA","119","60","60","I hurried without hesitating to keep Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_61","020_119_61","PSA","119","61","61","Though the ropes of the wicked bind me, I do not forget Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_62","020_119_62","PSA","119","62","62","At midnight I rise to give You thanks for Your righteous judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_63","020_119_63","PSA","119","63","63","I am a friend to all who fear You, and to those who keep Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_64","020_119_64","PSA","119","64","64","The earth is filled with Your loving devotion, O LORD; teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_65","020_119_65","PSA","119","65","65","You are good to Your servant, O LORD, according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_66","020_119_66","PSA","119","66","66","Teach me good judgment and knowledge, for I believe in Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_67","020_119_67","PSA","119","67","67","Before I was afflicted, I went astray; but now I keep Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_68","020_119_68","PSA","119","68","68","You are good, and You do what is good; teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_69","020_119_69","PSA","119","69","69","Though the arrogant have smeared me with lies, I keep Your precepts with all my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_70","020_119_70","PSA","119","70","70","Their hearts are callous and insensitive, but I delight in Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_71","020_119_71","PSA","119","71","71","It was good for me to be afflicted, that I might learn Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_72","020_119_72","PSA","119","72","72","The law from Your mouth is more precious to me than thousands of pieces of gold and silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_73","020_119_73","PSA","119","73","73","Your hands have made me and fashioned me; give me understanding to learn Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_74","020_119_74","PSA","119","74","74","May those who fear You see me and rejoice, for I have hoped in Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_75","020_119_75","PSA","119","75","75","I know, O LORD, that Your judgments are righteous, and that in faithfulness You have afflicted me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_76","020_119_76","PSA","119","76","76","May Your loving devotion comfort me, I pray, according to Your promise to Your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_77","020_119_77","PSA","119","77","77","May Your compassion come to me, that I may live, for Your law is my delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_78","020_119_78","PSA","119","78","78","May the arrogant be put to shame for subverting me with a lie; I will meditate on Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_79","020_119_79","PSA","119","79","79","May those who fear You turn to me, those who know Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_80","020_119_80","PSA","119","80","80","May my heart be blameless in Your statutes, that I may not be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_81","020_119_81","PSA","119","81","81","My soul faints for Your salvation; I wait for Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_82","020_119_82","PSA","119","82","82","My eyes fail, looking for Your promise; I ask, “When will You comfort me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_83","020_119_83","PSA","119","83","83","Though I am like a wineskin dried up by smoke, I do not forget Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_84","020_119_84","PSA","119","84","84","How many days must Your servant wait? When will You execute judgment on my persecutors? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_85","020_119_85","PSA","119","85","85","The arrogant have dug pits for me in violation of Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_86","020_119_86","PSA","119","86","86","All Your commandments are faithful; I am persecuted without cause—help me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_87","020_119_87","PSA","119","87","87","They almost wiped me from the earth, but I have not forsaken Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_88","020_119_88","PSA","119","88","88","Revive me according to Your loving devotion, that I may obey the testimony of Your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_89","020_119_89","PSA","119","89","89","Your word, O LORD, is everlasting; it is firmly fixed in the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_90","020_119_90","PSA","119","90","90","Your faithfulness continues through all generations; You established the earth, and it endures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_91","020_119_91","PSA","119","91","91","Your ordinances stand to this day, for all things are servants to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_92","020_119_92","PSA","119","92","92","If Your law had not been my delight, then I would have perished in my affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_93","020_119_93","PSA","119","93","93","I will never forget Your precepts, for by them You have revived me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_94","020_119_94","PSA","119","94","94","I am Yours; save me, for I have sought Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_95","020_119_95","PSA","119","95","95","The wicked wait to destroy me, but I will ponder Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_96","020_119_96","PSA","119","96","96","I have seen a limit to all perfection, but Your commandment is without limit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_97","020_119_97","PSA","119","97","97","Oh, how I love Your law! All day long it is my meditation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_98","020_119_98","PSA","119","98","98","Your commandments make me wiser than my enemies, for they are always with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_99","020_119_99","PSA","119","99","99","I have more insight than all my teachers, for Your testimonies are my meditation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_100","020_119_100","PSA","119","100","100","I discern more than the elders, for I obey Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_101","020_119_101","PSA","119","101","101","I have kept my feet from every evil path, that I may keep Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_102","020_119_102","PSA","119","102","102","I have not departed from Your ordinances, for You Yourself have taught me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_103","020_119_103","PSA","119","103","103","How sweet are Your words to my taste—sweeter than honey in my mouth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_104","020_119_104","PSA","119","104","104","I gain understanding from Your precepts; therefore I hate every false way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_105","020_119_105","PSA","119","105","105","Your word is a lamp to my feet and a light to my path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_106","020_119_106","PSA","119","106","106","I have sworn and confirmed that I will keep Your righteous judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_107","020_119_107","PSA","119","107","107","I am severely afflicted, O LORD; revive me through Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_108","020_119_108","PSA","119","108","108","Accept the freewill offerings of my mouth, O LORD, and teach me Your judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_109","020_119_109","PSA","119","109","109","I constantly take my life in my hands, yet I do not forget Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_110","020_119_110","PSA","119","110","110","The wicked have set a snare for me, but I have not strayed from Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_111","020_119_111","PSA","119","111","111","Your testimonies are my heritage forever, for they are the joy of my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_112","020_119_112","PSA","119","112","112","I have inclined my heart to perform Your statutes, even to the very end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_113","020_119_113","PSA","119","113","113","The double-minded I despise, but Your law I love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_114","020_119_114","PSA","119","114","114","You are my hiding place and my shield; I put my hope in Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_115","020_119_115","PSA","119","115","115","Depart from me, you evildoers, that I may obey the commandments of my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_116","020_119_116","PSA","119","116","116","Sustain me as You promised, that I may live; let me not be ashamed of my hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_117","020_119_117","PSA","119","117","117","Uphold me, and I will be saved, that I may always regard Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_118","020_119_118","PSA","119","118","118","You reject all who stray from Your statutes, for their deceitfulness is in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_119","020_119_119","PSA","119","119","119","All the wicked on earth You discard like dross; therefore I love Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_120","020_119_120","PSA","119","120","120","My flesh trembles in awe of You; I stand in fear of Your judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_121","020_119_121","PSA","119","121","121","I have done what is just and right; do not leave me to my oppressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_122","020_119_122","PSA","119","122","122","Ensure Your servant’s well-being; do not let the arrogant oppress me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_123","020_119_123","PSA","119","123","123","My eyes fail, looking for Your salvation, and for Your righteous promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_124","020_119_124","PSA","119","124","124","Deal with Your servant according to Your loving devotion, and teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_125","020_119_125","PSA","119","125","125","I am Your servant; give me understanding, that I may know Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_126","020_119_126","PSA","119","126","126","It is time for the LORD to act, for they have broken Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_127","020_119_127","PSA","119","127","127","Therefore I love Your commandments more than gold, even the purest gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_128","020_119_128","PSA","119","128","128","Therefore I admire all Your precepts and hate every false way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_129","020_119_129","PSA","119","129","129","Wonderful are Your testimonies; therefore I obey them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_130","020_119_130","PSA","119","130","130","The unfolding of Your words gives light; it informs the simple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_131","020_119_131","PSA","119","131","131","I open my mouth and pant, longing for Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_132","020_119_132","PSA","119","132","132","Turn to me and show me mercy, as You do to those who love Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_133","020_119_133","PSA","119","133","133","Order my steps in Your word; let no sin rule over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_134","020_119_134","PSA","119","134","134","Redeem me from the oppression of man, that I may keep Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_135","020_119_135","PSA","119","135","135","Make Your face shine upon Your servant, and teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_136","020_119_136","PSA","119","136","136","My eyes shed streams of tears because Your law is not obeyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_137","020_119_137","PSA","119","137","137","Righteous are You, O LORD, and upright are Your judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_138","020_119_138","PSA","119","138","138","The testimonies You have laid down are righteous and altogether faithful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_139","020_119_139","PSA","119","139","139","My zeal has consumed me because my foes forget Your words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_140","020_119_140","PSA","119","140","140","Your promise is completely pure; therefore Your servant loves it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_141","020_119_141","PSA","119","141","141","I am lowly and despised, but I do not forget Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_142","020_119_142","PSA","119","142","142","Your righteousness is everlasting and Your law is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_143","020_119_143","PSA","119","143","143","Trouble and distress have found me, but Your commandments are my delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_144","020_119_144","PSA","119","144","144","Your testimonies are righteous forever. Give me understanding, that I may live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_145","020_119_145","PSA","119","145","145","I call with all my heart; answer me, O LORD! I will obey Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_146","020_119_146","PSA","119","146","146","I call to You; save me, that I may keep Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_147","020_119_147","PSA","119","147","147","I rise before dawn and cry for help; in Your word I have put my hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_148","020_119_148","PSA","119","148","148","My eyes anticipate the watches of night, that I may meditate on Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_149","020_119_149","PSA","119","149","149","Hear my voice, O LORD, according to Your loving devotion; give me life according to Your justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_150","020_119_150","PSA","119","150","150","Those who follow after wickedness draw near; they are far from Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_151","020_119_151","PSA","119","151","151","You are near, O LORD, and all Your commandments are true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_152","020_119_152","PSA","119","152","152","Long ago I learned from Your testimonies that You have established them forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_153","020_119_153","PSA","119","153","153","Look upon my affliction and rescue me, for I have not forgotten Your law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_154","020_119_154","PSA","119","154","154","Defend my cause and redeem me; revive me according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_155","020_119_155","PSA","119","155","155","Salvation is far from the wicked because they do not seek Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_156","020_119_156","PSA","119","156","156","Great are Your mercies, O LORD; revive me according to Your ordinances. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_157","020_119_157","PSA","119","157","157","Though my persecutors and foes are many, I have not turned from Your testimonies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_158","020_119_158","PSA","119","158","158","I look on the faithless with loathing because they do not keep Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_159","020_119_159","PSA","119","159","159","Consider how I love Your precepts, O LORD; give me life according to Your loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_160","020_119_160","PSA","119","160","160","The entirety of Your word is truth, and all Your righteous judgments endure forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_161","020_119_161","PSA","119","161","161","Rulers persecute me without cause, but my heart fears only Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_162","020_119_162","PSA","119","162","162","I rejoice in Your promise like one who finds great spoil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_163","020_119_163","PSA","119","163","163","I hate and abhor falsehood, but Your law I love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_164","020_119_164","PSA","119","164","164","Seven times a day I praise You for Your righteous judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_165","020_119_165","PSA","119","165","165","Abundant peace belongs to those who love Your law; nothing can make them stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_166","020_119_166","PSA","119","166","166","I wait for Your salvation, O LORD, and I carry out Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_167","020_119_167","PSA","119","167","167","I obey Your testimonies and love them greatly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_168","020_119_168","PSA","119","168","168","I obey Your precepts and Your testimonies, for all my ways are before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_169","020_119_169","PSA","119","169","169","May my cry come before You, O LORD; give me understanding according to Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_170","020_119_170","PSA","119","170","170","May my plea come before You; rescue me according to Your promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_171","020_119_171","PSA","119","171","171","My lips pour forth praise, for You teach me Your statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_172","020_119_172","PSA","119","172","172","My tongue sings of Your word, for all Your commandments are righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_173","020_119_173","PSA","119","173","173","May Your hand be ready to help me, for I have chosen Your precepts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_174","020_119_174","PSA","119","174","174","I long for Your salvation, O LORD, and Your law is my delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_175","020_119_175","PSA","119","175","175","Let me live to praise You; may Your judgments sustain me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS119_176","020_119_176","PSA","119","176","176","I have strayed like a lost sheep; seek Your servant, for I have not forgotten Your commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_1","020_120_1","PSA","120","1","1","A song of ascents. In my distress I cried to the LORD, and He answered me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_2","020_120_2","PSA","120","2","2","Deliver my soul, O LORD, from lying lips and a deceitful tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_3","020_120_3","PSA","120","3","3","What will He do to you, and what will be added to you, O deceitful tongue? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_4","020_120_4","PSA","120","4","4","Sharp arrows will come from the warrior, with burning coals of the broom tree! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_5","020_120_5","PSA","120","5","5","Woe to me that I dwell in Meshech, that I live among the tents of Kedar! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_6","020_120_6","PSA","120","6","6","Too long have I dwelt among those who hate peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS120_7","020_120_7","PSA","120","7","7","I am in favor of peace; but when I speak, they want war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_1","020_121_1","PSA","121","1","1","A song of ascents. I lift up my eyes to the hills. From where does my help come? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_2","020_121_2","PSA","121","2","2","My help comes from the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_3","020_121_3","PSA","121","3","3","He will not allow your foot to slip; your Protector will not slumber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_4","020_121_4","PSA","121","4","4","Behold, the Protector of Israel will neither slumber nor sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_5","020_121_5","PSA","121","5","5","The LORD is your keeper; the LORD is the shade on your right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_6","020_121_6","PSA","121","6","6","The sun will not strike you by day, nor the moon by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_7","020_121_7","PSA","121","7","7","The LORD will guard you from all evil; He will preserve your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS121_8","020_121_8","PSA","121","8","8","The LORD will watch over your coming and going, both now and forevermore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_1","020_122_1","PSA","122","1","1","A song of ascents. Of David. I was glad when they said to me, “Let us go to the house of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_2","020_122_2","PSA","122","2","2","Our feet are standing in your gates, O Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_3","020_122_3","PSA","122","3","3","Jerusalem is built up as a city united together, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_4","020_122_4","PSA","122","4","4","where the tribes go up, the tribes of the LORD, as a testimony for Israel, to give thanks to the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_5","020_122_5","PSA","122","5","5","For there the thrones of judgment stand, the thrones of the house of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_6","020_122_6","PSA","122","6","6","Pray for the peace of Jerusalem: “May those who love you prosper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_7","020_122_7","PSA","122","7","7","May there be peace within your walls, and prosperity inside your fortresses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_8","020_122_8","PSA","122","8","8","For the sake of my brothers and friends, I will say, “Peace be within you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS122_9","020_122_9","PSA","122","9","9","For the sake of the house of the LORD our God, I will seek your prosperity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS123_1","020_123_1","PSA","123","1","1","A song of ascents. I lift up my eyes to You, the One enthroned in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS123_2","020_123_2","PSA","123","2","2","As the eyes of servants look to the hand of their master, as the eyes of a maidservant look to the hand of her mistress, so our eyes are on the LORD our God until He shows us mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS123_3","020_123_3","PSA","123","3","3","Have mercy on us, O LORD, have mercy, for we have endured much contempt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS123_4","020_123_4","PSA","123","4","4","We have endured much scorn from the arrogant, much contempt from the proud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_1","020_124_1","PSA","124","1","1","A song of ascents. Of David. If the LORD had not been on our side—let Israel now declare— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_2","020_124_2","PSA","124","2","2","if the LORD had not been on our side when men attacked us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_3","020_124_3","PSA","124","3","3","when their anger flared against us, then they would have swallowed us alive, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_4","020_124_4","PSA","124","4","4","then the floods would have engulfed us, then the torrent would have overwhelmed us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_5","020_124_5","PSA","124","5","5","then the raging waters would have swept us away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_6","020_124_6","PSA","124","6","6","Blessed be the LORD, who has not given us as prey to their teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_7","020_124_7","PSA","124","7","7","We have escaped like a bird from the snare of the fowler; the net is torn, and we have slipped away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS124_8","020_124_8","PSA","124","8","8","Our help is in the name of the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS125_1","020_125_1","PSA","125","1","1","A song of ascents. Those who trust in the LORD are like Mount Zion. It cannot be moved; it abides forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS125_2","020_125_2","PSA","125","2","2","As the mountains surround Jerusalem, so the LORD surrounds His people, both now and forevermore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS125_3","020_125_3","PSA","125","3","3","For the scepter of the wicked will not rest upon the land allotted to the righteous, so that the righteous will not put forth their hands to injustice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS125_4","020_125_4","PSA","125","4","4","Do good, O LORD, to those who are good, and to the upright in heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS125_5","020_125_5","PSA","125","5","5","But those who turn to crooked ways the LORD will banish with the evildoers. Peace be upon Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_1","020_126_1","PSA","126","1","1","A song of ascents. When the LORD restored the captives of Zion, we were like dreamers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_2","020_126_2","PSA","126","2","2","Then our mouths were filled with laughter, our tongues with shouts of joy. Then it was said among the nations, “The LORD has done great things for them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_3","020_126_3","PSA","126","3","3","The LORD has done great things for us; we are filled with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_4","020_126_4","PSA","126","4","4","Restore our captives, O LORD, like streams in the Negev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_5","020_126_5","PSA","126","5","5","Those who sow in tears will reap with shouts of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS126_6","020_126_6","PSA","126","6","6","He who goes out weeping, bearing a trail of seed, will surely return with shouts of joy, carrying sheaves of grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS127_1","020_127_1","PSA","127","1","1","A song of ascents. Of Solomon. Unless the LORD builds the house, its builders labor in vain; unless the LORD protects the city, its watchmen stand guard in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS127_2","020_127_2","PSA","127","2","2","In vain you rise early and stay up late, toiling for bread to eat—for He gives sleep to His beloved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS127_3","020_127_3","PSA","127","3","3","Children are indeed a heritage from the LORD, and the fruit of the womb is His reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS127_4","020_127_4","PSA","127","4","4","Like arrows in the hand of a warrior, so are children born in one’s youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS127_5","020_127_5","PSA","127","5","5","Blessed is the man whose quiver is full of them. He will not be put to shame when he confronts the enemies at the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_1","020_128_1","PSA","128","1","1","A song of ascents. Blessed are all who fear the LORD, who walk in His ways! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_2","020_128_2","PSA","128","2","2","For when you eat the fruit of your labor, blessings and prosperity will be yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_3","020_128_3","PSA","128","3","3","Your wife will be like a fruitful vine flourishing within your house, your sons like olive shoots sitting around your table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_4","020_128_4","PSA","128","4","4","In this way indeed shall blessing come to the man who fears the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_5","020_128_5","PSA","128","5","5","May the LORD bless you from Zion, that you may see the prosperity of Jerusalem all the days of your life, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS128_6","020_128_6","PSA","128","6","6","that you may see your children’s children. Peace be upon Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_1","020_129_1","PSA","129","1","1","A song of ascents. Many a time they have persecuted me from my youth—let Israel now declare— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_2","020_129_2","PSA","129","2","2","many a time they have persecuted me from my youth, but they have not prevailed against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_3","020_129_3","PSA","129","3","3","The plowmen plowed over my back; they made their furrows long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_4","020_129_4","PSA","129","4","4","The LORD is righteous; He has cut me from the cords of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_5","020_129_5","PSA","129","5","5","May all who hate Zion be turned back in shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_6","020_129_6","PSA","129","6","6","May they be like grass on the rooftops, which withers before it can grow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_7","020_129_7","PSA","129","7","7","unable to fill the hands of the reaper, or the arms of the binder of sheaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS129_8","020_129_8","PSA","129","8","8","May none who pass by say to them, “The blessing of the LORD be on you; we bless you in the name of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_1","020_130_1","PSA","130","1","1","A song of ascents. Out of the depths I cry to You, O LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_2","020_130_2","PSA","130","2","2","O Lord, hear my voice; let Your ears be attentive to my plea for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_3","020_130_3","PSA","130","3","3","If You, O LORD, kept track of iniquities, then who, O Lord, could stand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_4","020_130_4","PSA","130","4","4","But with You there is forgiveness, so that You may be feared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_5","020_130_5","PSA","130","5","5","I wait for the LORD; my soul does wait, and in His word I put my hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_6","020_130_6","PSA","130","6","6","My soul waits for the Lord more than watchmen wait for the morning—more than watchmen wait for the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_7","020_130_7","PSA","130","7","7","O Israel, put your hope in the LORD, for with the LORD is loving devotion, and with Him is redemption in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS130_8","020_130_8","PSA","130","8","8","And He will redeem Israel from all iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS131_1","020_131_1","PSA","131","1","1","A song of ascents. Of David. My heart is not proud, O LORD, my eyes are not haughty. I do not aspire to great things or matters too lofty for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS131_2","020_131_2","PSA","131","2","2","Surely I have stilled and quieted my soul; like a weaned child with his mother, like a weaned child is my soul within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS131_3","020_131_3","PSA","131","3","3","O Israel, put your hope in the LORD, both now and forevermore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_1","020_132_1","PSA","132","1","1","A song of ascents. O LORD, remember on behalf of David all the hardships he endured, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_2","020_132_2","PSA","132","2","2","how he swore an oath to the LORD, and vowed to the Mighty One of Jacob: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_3","020_132_3","PSA","132","3","3","“I will not enter my house or get into my bed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_4","020_132_4","PSA","132","4","4","I will not give sleep to my eyes or slumber to my eyelids, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_5","020_132_5","PSA","132","5","5","until I find a place for the LORD, a dwelling for the Mighty One of Jacob.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_6","020_132_6","PSA","132","6","6","We heard that the ark was in Ephrathah; we found it in the fields of Jaar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_7","020_132_7","PSA","132","7","7","Let us go to His dwelling place; let us worship at His footstool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_8","020_132_8","PSA","132","8","8","Arise, O LORD, to Your resting place, You and the ark of Your strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_9","020_132_9","PSA","132","9","9","May Your priests be clothed with righteousness, and Your saints shout for joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_10","020_132_10","PSA","132","10","10","For the sake of Your servant David, do not reject Your anointed one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_11","020_132_11","PSA","132","11","11","The LORD swore an oath to David, a promise He will not revoke: “One of your descendants I will place on your throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_12","020_132_12","PSA","132","12","12","If your sons keep My covenant and the testimony I will teach them, then their sons will also sit on your throne forever and ever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_13","020_132_13","PSA","132","13","13","For the LORD has chosen Zion; He has desired it for His home: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_14","020_132_14","PSA","132","14","14","“This is My resting place forever and ever; here I will dwell, for I have desired this home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_15","020_132_15","PSA","132","15","15","I will bless her with abundant provisions; I will satisfy her poor with bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_16","020_132_16","PSA","132","16","16","I will clothe her priests with salvation, and her saints will sing out in joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_17","020_132_17","PSA","132","17","17","There I will make a horn grow for David; I have prepared a lamp for My anointed one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS132_18","020_132_18","PSA","132","18","18","I will clothe his enemies with shame, but the crown upon him will gleam.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS133_1","020_133_1","PSA","133","1","1","A song of ascents. Of David. Behold, how good and pleasant it is when brothers live together in harmony! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS133_2","020_133_2","PSA","133","2","2","It is like fine oil on the head, running down on the beard, running down Aaron’s beard over the collar of his robes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS133_3","020_133_3","PSA","133","3","3","It is like the dew of Hermon falling on the mountains of Zion. For there the LORD has bestowed the blessing of life forevermore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS134_1","020_134_1","PSA","134","1","1","A song of ascents. Come, bless the LORD, all you servants of the LORD who serve by night in the house of the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS134_2","020_134_2","PSA","134","2","2","Lift up your hands to the sanctuary and bless the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS134_3","020_134_3","PSA","134","3","3","May the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth, bless you from Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_1","020_135_1","PSA","135","1","1","Hallelujah! Praise the name of the LORD. Give praise, O servants of the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_2","020_135_2","PSA","135","2","2","who stand in the house of the LORD, in the courts of the house of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_3","020_135_3","PSA","135","3","3","Hallelujah, for the LORD is good; sing praises to His name, for it is lovely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_4","020_135_4","PSA","135","4","4","For the LORD has chosen Jacob as His own, Israel as His treasured possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_5","020_135_5","PSA","135","5","5","For I know that the LORD is great; our Lord is above all gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_6","020_135_6","PSA","135","6","6","The LORD does all that pleases Him in the heavens and on the earth, in the seas and in all their depths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_7","020_135_7","PSA","135","7","7","He causes the clouds to rise from the ends of the earth. He generates the lightning with the rain and brings forth the wind from His storehouses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_8","020_135_8","PSA","135","8","8","He struck down the firstborn of Egypt, of both man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_9","020_135_9","PSA","135","9","9","He sent signs and wonders into your midst, O Egypt, against Pharaoh and all his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_10","020_135_10","PSA","135","10","10","He struck down many nations and slaughtered mighty kings: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_11","020_135_11","PSA","135","11","11","Sihon king of the Amorites, Og king of Bashan, and all the kings of Canaan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_12","020_135_12","PSA","135","12","12","He gave their land as an inheritance, as a heritage to His people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_13","020_135_13","PSA","135","13","13","Your name, O LORD, endures forever, Your renown, O LORD, through all generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_14","020_135_14","PSA","135","14","14","For the LORD will vindicate His people and will have compassion on His servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_15","020_135_15","PSA","135","15","15","The idols of the nations are silver and gold, made by the hands of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_16","020_135_16","PSA","135","16","16","They have mouths, but cannot speak; they have eyes, but cannot see; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_17","020_135_17","PSA","135","17","17","they have ears, but cannot hear; nor is there breath in their mouths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_18","020_135_18","PSA","135","18","18","Those who make them become like them, as do all who trust in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_19","020_135_19","PSA","135","19","19","O house of Israel, bless the LORD; O house of Aaron, bless the LORD; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_20","020_135_20","PSA","135","20","20","O house of Levi, bless the LORD; you who fear the LORD, bless the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS135_21","020_135_21","PSA","135","21","21","Blessed be the LORD from Zion—He who dwells in Jerusalem. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_1","020_136_1","PSA","136","1","1","Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_2","020_136_2","PSA","136","2","2","Give thanks to the God of gods. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_3","020_136_3","PSA","136","3","3","Give thanks to the Lord of lords. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_4","020_136_4","PSA","136","4","4","He alone does great wonders. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_5","020_136_5","PSA","136","5","5","By His insight He made the heavens. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_6","020_136_6","PSA","136","6","6","He spread out the earth upon the waters. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_7","020_136_7","PSA","136","7","7","He made the great lights—His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_8","020_136_8","PSA","136","8","8","the sun to rule the day, His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_9","020_136_9","PSA","136","9","9","the moon and stars to govern the night. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_10","020_136_10","PSA","136","10","10","He struck down the firstborn of Egypt His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_11","020_136_11","PSA","136","11","11","and brought Israel out from among them His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_12","020_136_12","PSA","136","12","12","with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_13","020_136_13","PSA","136","13","13","He divided the Red Sea in two His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_14","020_136_14","PSA","136","14","14","and led Israel through the midst, His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_15","020_136_15","PSA","136","15","15","but swept Pharaoh and his army into the Red Sea. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_16","020_136_16","PSA","136","16","16","He led His people through the wilderness. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_17","020_136_17","PSA","136","17","17","He struck down great kings His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_18","020_136_18","PSA","136","18","18","and slaughtered mighty kings—His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_19","020_136_19","PSA","136","19","19","Sihon king of the Amorites His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_20","020_136_20","PSA","136","20","20","and Og king of Bashan—His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_21","020_136_21","PSA","136","21","21","and He gave their land as an inheritance, His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_22","020_136_22","PSA","136","22","22","a heritage to His servant Israel. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_23","020_136_23","PSA","136","23","23","He remembered us in our low estate His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_24","020_136_24","PSA","136","24","24","and freed us from our enemies. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_25","020_136_25","PSA","136","25","25","He gives food to every creature. His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS136_26","020_136_26","PSA","136","26","26","Give thanks to the God of heaven! His loving devotion endures forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_1","020_137_1","PSA","137","1","1","By the rivers of Babylon we sat and wept when we remembered Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_2","020_137_2","PSA","137","2","2","There on the willows we hung our harps, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_3","020_137_3","PSA","137","3","3","for there our captors requested a song; our tormentors demanded songs of joy: “Sing us a song of Zion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_4","020_137_4","PSA","137","4","4","How can we sing a song of the LORD in a foreign land? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_5","020_137_5","PSA","137","5","5","If I forget you, O Jerusalem, may my right hand cease to function. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_6","020_137_6","PSA","137","6","6","May my tongue cling to the roof of my mouth if I do not remember you, if I do not exalt Jerusalem as my greatest joy! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_7","020_137_7","PSA","137","7","7","Remember, O LORD, the sons of Edom on the day Jerusalem fell: “Destroy it,” they said, “tear it down to its foundations!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_8","020_137_8","PSA","137","8","8","O Daughter of Babylon, doomed to destruction, blessed is he who repays you as you have done to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS137_9","020_137_9","PSA","137","9","9","Blessed is he who seizes your infants and dashes them against the rocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_1","020_138_1","PSA","138","1","1","Of David. I give You thanks with all my heart; before the gods I sing Your praises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_2","020_138_2","PSA","138","2","2","I bow down toward Your holy temple and give thanks to Your name for Your loving devotion and Your faithfulness; You have exalted Your name and Your word above all else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_3","020_138_3","PSA","138","3","3","On the day I called, You answered me; You emboldened me and strengthened my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_4","020_138_4","PSA","138","4","4","All the kings of the earth will give You thanks, O LORD, when they hear the words of Your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_5","020_138_5","PSA","138","5","5","They will sing of the ways of the LORD, for the glory of the LORD is great. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_6","020_138_6","PSA","138","6","6","Though the LORD is on high, He attends to the lowly; but the proud He knows from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_7","020_138_7","PSA","138","7","7","If I walk in the midst of trouble, You preserve me from the anger of my foes; You extend Your hand, and Your right hand saves me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS138_8","020_138_8","PSA","138","8","8","The LORD will fulfill His purpose for me. O LORD, Your loving devotion endures forever—do not abandon the works of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_1","020_139_1","PSA","139","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. O LORD, You have searched me and known me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_2","020_139_2","PSA","139","2","2","You know when I sit and when I rise; You understand my thoughts from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_3","020_139_3","PSA","139","3","3","You search out my path and my lying down; You are aware of all my ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_4","020_139_4","PSA","139","4","4","Even before a word is on my tongue, You know all about it, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_5","020_139_5","PSA","139","5","5","You hem me in behind and before; You have laid Your hand upon me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_6","020_139_6","PSA","139","6","6","Such knowledge is too wonderful for me, too lofty for me to attain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_7","020_139_7","PSA","139","7","7","Where can I go to escape Your Spirit? Where can I flee from Your presence? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_8","020_139_8","PSA","139","8","8","If I ascend to the heavens, You are there; if I make my bed in Sheol, You are there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_9","020_139_9","PSA","139","9","9","If I rise on the wings of the dawn, if I settle by the farthest sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_10","020_139_10","PSA","139","10","10","even there Your hand will guide me; Your right hand will hold me fast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_11","020_139_11","PSA","139","11","11","If I say, “Surely the darkness will hide me, and the light become night around me”— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_12","020_139_12","PSA","139","12","12","even the darkness is not dark to You, but the night shines like the day, for darkness is as light to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_13","020_139_13","PSA","139","13","13","For You formed my inmost being; You knit me together in my mother’s womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_14","020_139_14","PSA","139","14","14","I praise You, for I am fearfully and wonderfully made. Marvelous are Your works, and I know this very well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_15","020_139_15","PSA","139","15","15","My frame was not hidden from You when I was made in secret, when I was woven together in the depths of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_16","020_139_16","PSA","139","16","16","Your eyes saw my unformed body; all my days were written in Your book and ordained for me before one of them came to be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_17","020_139_17","PSA","139","17","17","How precious to me are Your thoughts, O God, how vast is their sum! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_18","020_139_18","PSA","139","18","18","If I were to count them, they would outnumber the grains of sand; and when I awake, I am still with You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_19","020_139_19","PSA","139","19","19","O God, that You would slay the wicked—away from me, you bloodthirsty men— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_20","020_139_20","PSA","139","20","20","who speak of You deceitfully; Your enemies take Your name in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_21","020_139_21","PSA","139","21","21","Do I not hate those who hate You, O LORD, and detest those who rise against You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_22","020_139_22","PSA","139","22","22","I hate them with perfect hatred; I count them as my enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_23","020_139_23","PSA","139","23","23","Search me, O God, and know my heart; test me and know my concerns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS139_24","020_139_24","PSA","139","24","24","See if there is any offensive way in me; lead me in the way everlasting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_1","020_140_1","PSA","140","1","1","For the choirmaster. A Psalm of David. Rescue me, O LORD, from evil men. Protect me from men of violence, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_2","020_140_2","PSA","140","2","2","who devise evil in their hearts and stir up war all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_3","020_140_3","PSA","140","3","3","They sharpen their tongues like snakes; the venom of vipers is on their lips. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_4","020_140_4","PSA","140","4","4","Guard me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked. Keep me safe from men of violence who scheme to make me stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_5","020_140_5","PSA","140","5","5","The proud hide a snare for me; the cords of their net are spread along the path, and lures are set out for me. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_6","020_140_6","PSA","140","6","6","I say to the LORD, “You are my God.” Hear, O LORD, my cry for help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_7","020_140_7","PSA","140","7","7","O GOD the Lord, the strength of my salvation, You shield my head in the day of battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_8","020_140_8","PSA","140","8","8","Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked; do not promote their evil plans, lest they be exalted. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_9","020_140_9","PSA","140","9","9","May the heads of those who surround me be covered in the trouble their lips have caused. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_10","020_140_10","PSA","140","10","10","May burning coals fall on them; may they be thrown into the fire, into the miry pits, never to rise again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_11","020_140_11","PSA","140","11","11","May no slanderer be established in the land; may calamity hunt down the man of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_12","020_140_12","PSA","140","12","12","I know that the LORD upholds justice for the poor and defends the cause of the needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS140_13","020_140_13","PSA","140","13","13","Surely the righteous will praise Your name; the upright will dwell in Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_1","020_141_1","PSA","141","1","1","A Psalm of David. I call upon You, O LORD; come quickly to me. Hear my voice when I call to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_2","020_141_2","PSA","141","2","2","May my prayer be set before You like incense; my uplifted hands, like the evening offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_3","020_141_3","PSA","141","3","3","Set a guard, O LORD, over my mouth; keep watch at the door of my lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_4","020_141_4","PSA","141","4","4","Do not let my heart be drawn to any evil thing or take part in works of wickedness with men who do iniquity; let me not feast on their delicacies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_5","020_141_5","PSA","141","5","5","Let the righteous man strike me; let his rebuke be an act of loving devotion. It is oil for my head; let me not refuse it. For my prayer is ever against the deeds of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_6","020_141_6","PSA","141","6","6","When their rulers are thrown down from the cliffs, the people will listen to my words, for they are pleasant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_7","020_141_7","PSA","141","7","7","As when one plows and breaks up the soil, so our bones have been scattered at the mouth of Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_8","020_141_8","PSA","141","8","8","But my eyes are fixed on You, O GOD the Lord. In You I seek refuge; do not leave my soul defenseless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_9","020_141_9","PSA","141","9","9","Keep me from the snares they have laid for me, and from the lures of evildoers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS141_10","020_141_10","PSA","141","10","10","Let the wicked fall into their own nets, while I pass by in safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_1","020_142_1","PSA","142","1","1","A Maskil of David, when he was in the cave. A prayer. I cry aloud to the LORD; I lift my voice to the LORD for mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_2","020_142_2","PSA","142","2","2","I pour out my complaint before Him; I reveal my trouble to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_3","020_142_3","PSA","142","3","3","Although my spirit grows faint within me, You know my way. Along the path I travel they have hidden a snare for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_4","020_142_4","PSA","142","4","4","Look to my right and see; no one attends to me. There is no refuge for me; no one cares for my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_5","020_142_5","PSA","142","5","5","I cry to You, O LORD: “You are my refuge, my portion in the land of the living.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_6","020_142_6","PSA","142","6","6","Listen to my cry, for I am brought quite low. Rescue me from my pursuers, for they are too strong for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS142_7","020_142_7","PSA","142","7","7","Free my soul from prison, that I may praise Your name. The righteous will gather around me because of Your goodness to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_1","020_143_1","PSA","143","1","1","A Psalm of David. O LORD, hear my prayer. In Your faithfulness, give ear to my plea; in Your righteousness, answer me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_2","020_143_2","PSA","143","2","2","Do not bring Your servant into judgment, for no one alive is righteous before You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_3","020_143_3","PSA","143","3","3","For the enemy has pursued my soul, crushing my life to the ground, making me dwell in darkness like those long since dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_4","020_143_4","PSA","143","4","4","My spirit grows faint within me; my heart is dismayed inside me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_5","020_143_5","PSA","143","5","5","I remember the days of old; I meditate on all Your works; I consider the work of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_6","020_143_6","PSA","143","6","6","I stretch out my hands to You; my soul thirsts for You like a parched land. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_7","020_143_7","PSA","143","7","7","Answer me quickly, O LORD; my spirit fails. Do not hide Your face from me, or I will be like those who descend to the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_8","020_143_8","PSA","143","8","8","Let me hear Your loving devotion in the morning, for I have put my trust in You. Teach me the way I should walk, for to You I lift up my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_9","020_143_9","PSA","143","9","9","Deliver me from my enemies, O LORD; I flee to You for refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_10","020_143_10","PSA","143","10","10","Teach me to do Your will, for You are my God. May Your good Spirit lead me on level ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_11","020_143_11","PSA","143","11","11","For the sake of Your name, O LORD, revive me. In Your righteousness, bring my soul out of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS143_12","020_143_12","PSA","143","12","12","And in Your loving devotion, cut off my enemies. Destroy all who afflict me, for I am Your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_1","020_144_1","PSA","144","1","1","Of David. Blessed be the LORD, my Rock, who trains my hands for war, my fingers for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_2","020_144_2","PSA","144","2","2","He is my steadfast love and my fortress, my stronghold and my deliverer. He is my shield, in whom I take refuge, who subdues peoples under me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_3","020_144_3","PSA","144","3","3","O LORD, what is man, that You regard him, the son of man that You think of him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_4","020_144_4","PSA","144","4","4","Man is like a breath; his days are like a passing shadow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_5","020_144_5","PSA","144","5","5","Part Your heavens, O LORD, and come down; touch the mountains, that they may smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_6","020_144_6","PSA","144","6","6","Flash forth Your lightning and scatter them; shoot Your arrows and rout them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_7","020_144_7","PSA","144","7","7","Reach down from on high; set me free and rescue me from the deep waters, from the grasp of foreigners, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_8","020_144_8","PSA","144","8","8","whose mouths speak falsehood, whose right hands are deceitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_9","020_144_9","PSA","144","9","9","I will sing to You a new song, O God; on a harp of ten strings I will make music to You— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_10","020_144_10","PSA","144","10","10","to Him who gives victory to kings, who frees His servant David from the deadly sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_11","020_144_11","PSA","144","11","11","Set me free and rescue me from the grasp of foreigners, whose mouths speak falsehood, whose right hands are deceitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_12","020_144_12","PSA","144","12","12","Then our sons will be like plants nurtured in their youth, our daughters like corner pillars carved to adorn a palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_13","020_144_13","PSA","144","13","13","Our storehouses will be full, supplying all manner of produce; our flocks will bring forth thousands, tens of thousands in our fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_14","020_144_14","PSA","144","14","14","Our oxen will bear great loads. There will be no breach in the walls, no going into captivity, and no cry of lament in our streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS144_15","020_144_15","PSA","144","15","15","Blessed are the people of whom this is so; blessed are the people whose God is the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_1","020_145_1","PSA","145","1","1","A Psalm of praise. Of David. I will exalt You, my God and King; I will bless Your name forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_2","020_145_2","PSA","145","2","2","Every day I will bless You, and I will praise Your name forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_3","020_145_3","PSA","145","3","3","Great is the LORD and greatly to be praised; His greatness is unsearchable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_4","020_145_4","PSA","145","4","4","One generation will commend Your works to the next, and will proclaim Your mighty acts— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_5","020_145_5","PSA","145","5","5","the glorious splendor of Your majesty. And I will meditate on Your wondrous works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_6","020_145_6","PSA","145","6","6","They will proclaim the power of Your awesome deeds, and I will declare Your greatness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_7","020_145_7","PSA","145","7","7","They will extol the fame of Your abundant goodness and sing joyfully of Your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_8","020_145_8","PSA","145","8","8","The LORD is gracious and compassionate, slow to anger and abounding in loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_9","020_145_9","PSA","145","9","9","The LORD is good to all; His compassion rests on all He has made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_10","020_145_10","PSA","145","10","10","All You have made will give You thanks, O LORD, and Your saints will bless You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_11","020_145_11","PSA","145","11","11","They will tell of the glory of Your kingdom and speak of Your might, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_12","020_145_12","PSA","145","12","12","to make known to men Your mighty acts and the glorious splendor of Your kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_13","020_145_13","PSA","145","13","13","Your kingdom is an everlasting kingdom, and Your dominion endures through all generations. The LORD is faithful in all His words and kind in all His actions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_14","020_145_14","PSA","145","14","14","The LORD upholds all who fall and lifts up all who are bowed down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_15","020_145_15","PSA","145","15","15","The eyes of all look to You, and You give them their food in season. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_16","020_145_16","PSA","145","16","16","You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_17","020_145_17","PSA","145","17","17","The LORD is righteous in all His ways and kind in all His deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_18","020_145_18","PSA","145","18","18","The LORD is near to all who call on Him, to all who call out to Him in truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_19","020_145_19","PSA","145","19","19","He fulfills the desires of those who fear Him; He hears their cry and saves them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_20","020_145_20","PSA","145","20","20","The LORD preserves all who love Him, but all the wicked He will destroy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS145_21","020_145_21","PSA","145","21","21","My mouth will declare the praise of the LORD; let every creature bless His holy name forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_1","020_146_1","PSA","146","1","1","Hallelujah! Praise the LORD, O my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_2","020_146_2","PSA","146","2","2","I will praise the LORD all my life; I will sing praises to my God while I have my being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_3","020_146_3","PSA","146","3","3","Put not your trust in princes, in mortal man, who cannot save. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_4","020_146_4","PSA","146","4","4","When his spirit departs, he returns to the ground; on that very day his plans perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_5","020_146_5","PSA","146","5","5","Blessed is he whose help is the God of Jacob, whose hope is in the LORD his God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_6","020_146_6","PSA","146","6","6","the Maker of heaven and earth, the sea, and everything in them. He remains faithful forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_7","020_146_7","PSA","146","7","7","He executes justice for the oppressed and gives food to the hungry. The LORD sets the prisoners free, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_8","020_146_8","PSA","146","8","8","the LORD opens the eyes of the blind, the LORD lifts those who are weighed down, the LORD loves the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_9","020_146_9","PSA","146","9","9","The LORD protects foreigners; He sustains the fatherless and the widow, but the ways of the wicked He frustrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS146_10","020_146_10","PSA","146","10","10","The LORD reigns forever, your God, O Zion, for all generations. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_1","020_147_1","PSA","147","1","1","Hallelujah! How good it is to sing praises to our God, how pleasant and lovely to praise Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_2","020_147_2","PSA","147","2","2","The LORD builds up Jerusalem; He gathers the exiles of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_3","020_147_3","PSA","147","3","3","He heals the brokenhearted and binds up their wounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_4","020_147_4","PSA","147","4","4","He determines the number of the stars; He calls them each by name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_5","020_147_5","PSA","147","5","5","Great is our Lord, and mighty in power; His understanding has no limit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_6","020_147_6","PSA","147","6","6","The LORD sustains the humble, but casts the wicked to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_7","020_147_7","PSA","147","7","7","Sing to the LORD with thanksgiving; make music on the harp to our God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_8","020_147_8","PSA","147","8","8","who covers the sky with clouds, who prepares rain for the earth, who makes grass to grow on the hills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_9","020_147_9","PSA","147","9","9","He provides food for the animals, and for the young ravens when they call. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_10","020_147_10","PSA","147","10","10","He does not delight in the strength of the horse; He takes no pleasure in the legs of a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_11","020_147_11","PSA","147","11","11","The LORD is pleased with those who fear Him, who hope in His loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_12","020_147_12","PSA","147","12","12","Exalt the LORD, O Jerusalem; praise your God, O Zion! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_13","020_147_13","PSA","147","13","13","For He strengthens the bars of your gates and blesses the children within you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_14","020_147_14","PSA","147","14","14","He makes peace at your borders; He fills you with the finest wheat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_15","020_147_15","PSA","147","15","15","He sends forth His command to the earth; His word runs swiftly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_16","020_147_16","PSA","147","16","16","He spreads the snow like wool; He scatters the frost like ashes; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_17","020_147_17","PSA","147","17","17","He casts forth His hail like pebbles. Who can withstand His icy blast? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_18","020_147_18","PSA","147","18","18","He sends forth His word and melts them; He unleashes His winds, and the waters flow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_19","020_147_19","PSA","147","19","19","He declares His word to Jacob, His statutes and judgments to Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS147_20","020_147_20","PSA","147","20","20","He has done this for no other nation; they do not know His judgments. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_1","020_148_1","PSA","148","1","1","Hallelujah! Praise the LORD from the heavens; praise Him in the highest places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_2","020_148_2","PSA","148","2","2","Praise Him, all His angels; praise Him, all His heavenly hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_3","020_148_3","PSA","148","3","3","Praise Him, O sun and moon; praise Him, all you shining stars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_4","020_148_4","PSA","148","4","4","Praise Him, O highest heavens, and you waters above the skies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_5","020_148_5","PSA","148","5","5","Let them praise the name of the LORD, for He gave the command and they were created. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_6","020_148_6","PSA","148","6","6","He established them forever and ever; He issued a decree that will never pass away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_7","020_148_7","PSA","148","7","7","Praise the LORD from the earth, all great sea creatures and ocean depths, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_8","020_148_8","PSA","148","8","8","lightning and hail, snow and clouds, powerful wind fulfilling His word, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_9","020_148_9","PSA","148","9","9","mountains and all hills, fruit trees and all cedars, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_10","020_148_10","PSA","148","10","10","wild animals and all cattle, crawling creatures and flying birds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_11","020_148_11","PSA","148","11","11","kings of the earth and all peoples, princes and all rulers of the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_12","020_148_12","PSA","148","12","12","young men and maidens, old and young together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_13","020_148_13","PSA","148","13","13","Let them praise the name of the LORD, for His name alone is exalted; His splendor is above the earth and the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS148_14","020_148_14","PSA","148","14","14","He has raised up a horn for His people, the praise of all His saints, of Israel, a people near to Him. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_1","020_149_1","PSA","149","1","1","Hallelujah! Sing to the LORD a new song—His praise in the assembly of the godly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_2","020_149_2","PSA","149","2","2","Let Israel rejoice in their Maker; let the children of Zion rejoice in their King. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_3","020_149_3","PSA","149","3","3","Let them praise His name with dancing, and make music to Him with tambourine and harp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_4","020_149_4","PSA","149","4","4","For the LORD takes pleasure in His people; He adorns the afflicted with salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_5","020_149_5","PSA","149","5","5","Let the saints exult in glory; let them shout for joy upon their beds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_6","020_149_6","PSA","149","6","6","May the high praises of God be in their mouths, and a double-edged sword in their hands, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_7","020_149_7","PSA","149","7","7","to inflict vengeance on the nations and punishment on the peoples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_8","020_149_8","PSA","149","8","8","to bind their kings with chains and their nobles with shackles of iron, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS149_9","020_149_9","PSA","149","9","9","to execute the judgment written against them. This honor is for all His saints. Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_1","020_150_1","PSA","150","1","1","Hallelujah! Praise God in His sanctuary. Praise Him in His mighty heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_2","020_150_2","PSA","150","2","2","Praise Him for His mighty acts; praise Him for His excellent greatness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_3","020_150_3","PSA","150","3","3","Praise Him with the sound of the horn; praise Him with the harp and lyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_4","020_150_4","PSA","150","4","4","Praise Him with tambourine and dancing; praise Him with strings and flute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_5","020_150_5","PSA","150","5","5","Praise Him with clashing cymbals; praise Him with resounding cymbals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PS150_6","020_150_6","PSA","150","6","6","Let everything that has breath praise the LORD! Hallelujah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_1","021_1_1","PRO","1","1","1","These are the proverbs of Solomon son of David, king of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_2","021_1_2","PRO","1","2","2","for gaining wisdom and discipline, for comprehending words of insight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_3","021_1_3","PRO","1","3","3","and for receiving instruction in wise living and in righteousness, justice, and equity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_4","021_1_4","PRO","1","4","4","To impart prudence to the simple and knowledge and discretion to the young, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_5","021_1_5","PRO","1","5","5","let the wise listen and gain instruction, and the discerning acquire wise counsel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_6","021_1_6","PRO","1","6","6","by understanding the proverbs and parables, the sayings and riddles of the wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_7","021_1_7","PRO","1","7","7","The fear of the LORD is the beginning of knowledge, but fools despise wisdom and discipline. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_8","021_1_8","PRO","1","8","8","Listen, my son, to your father’s instruction, and do not forsake the teaching of your mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_9","021_1_9","PRO","1","9","9","For they are a garland of grace on your head and a pendant around your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_10","021_1_10","PRO","1","10","10","My son, if sinners entice you, do not yield to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_11","021_1_11","PRO","1","11","11","If they say, “Come along, let us lie in wait for blood, let us ambush the innocent without cause, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_12","021_1_12","PRO","1","12","12","let us swallow them alive like Sheol, and whole like those descending into the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_13","021_1_13","PRO","1","13","13","We will find all manner of precious goods; we will fill our houses with plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_14","021_1_14","PRO","1","14","14","Throw in your lot with us; let us all share one purse”— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_15","021_1_15","PRO","1","15","15","my son, do not walk the road with them or set foot upon their path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_16","021_1_16","PRO","1","16","16","For their feet run to evil, and they are swift to shed blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_17","021_1_17","PRO","1","17","17","How futile it is to spread the net where any bird can see it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_18","021_1_18","PRO","1","18","18","But they lie in wait for their own blood; they ambush their own lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_19","021_1_19","PRO","1","19","19","Such is the fate of all who are greedy, whose unjust gain takes the lives of its possessors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_20","021_1_20","PRO","1","20","20","Wisdom calls out in the street, she lifts her voice in the square; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_21","021_1_21","PRO","1","21","21","in the main concourse she cries aloud, at the city gates she makes her speech: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_22","021_1_22","PRO","1","22","22","“How long, O simple ones, will you love your simple ways? How long will scoffers delight in their scorn and fools hate knowledge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_23","021_1_23","PRO","1","23","23","If you had repented at my rebuke, then surely I would have poured out my spirit on you; I would have made my words known to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_24","021_1_24","PRO","1","24","24","Because you refused my call, and no one took my outstretched hand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_25","021_1_25","PRO","1","25","25","because you neglected all my counsel, and wanted none of my correction, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_26","021_1_26","PRO","1","26","26","in turn I will mock your calamity; I will sneer when terror strikes you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_27","021_1_27","PRO","1","27","27","when your dread comes like a storm, and your destruction like a whirlwind, when distress and anguish overwhelm you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_28","021_1_28","PRO","1","28","28","Then they will call on me, but I will not answer; they will earnestly seek me, but will not find me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_29","021_1_29","PRO","1","29","29","For they hated knowledge and chose not to fear the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_30","021_1_30","PRO","1","30","30","They accepted none of my counsel; they despised all my reproof. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_31","021_1_31","PRO","1","31","31","So they will eat the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own devices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_32","021_1_32","PRO","1","32","32","For the waywardness of the simple will slay them, and the complacency of fools will destroy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR1_33","021_1_33","PRO","1","33","33","But whoever listens to me will dwell in safety, secure from the fear of evil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_1","021_2_1","PRO","2","1","1","My son, if you accept my words and hide my commandments within you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_2","021_2_2","PRO","2","2","2","if you incline your ear to wisdom and direct your heart to understanding, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_3","021_2_3","PRO","2","3","3","if you truly call out to insight and lift your voice to understanding, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_4","021_2_4","PRO","2","4","4","if you seek it like silver and search it out like hidden treasure, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_5","021_2_5","PRO","2","5","5","then you will discern the fear of the LORD and discover the knowledge of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_6","021_2_6","PRO","2","6","6","For the LORD gives wisdom; from His mouth come knowledge and understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_7","021_2_7","PRO","2","7","7","He stores up sound wisdom for the upright; He is a shield to those who walk with integrity, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_8","021_2_8","PRO","2","8","8","to guard the paths of justice and protect the way of His saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_9","021_2_9","PRO","2","9","9","Then you will discern righteousness and justice and equity—every good path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_10","021_2_10","PRO","2","10","10","For wisdom will enter your heart, and knowledge will delight your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_11","021_2_11","PRO","2","11","11","Discretion will watch over you, and understanding will guard you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_12","021_2_12","PRO","2","12","12","to deliver you from the way of evil, from the man who speaks perversity, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_13","021_2_13","PRO","2","13","13","from those who leave the straight paths to walk in the ways of darkness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_14","021_2_14","PRO","2","14","14","from those who enjoy doing evil and rejoice in the twistedness of evil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_15","021_2_15","PRO","2","15","15","whose paths are crooked and whose ways are devious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_16","021_2_16","PRO","2","16","16","It will rescue you from the forbidden woman, from the stranger with seductive words ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_17","021_2_17","PRO","2","17","17","who abandons the partner of her youth and forgets the covenant of her God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_18","021_2_18","PRO","2","18","18","For her house sinks down to death, and her tracks to the departed spirits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_19","021_2_19","PRO","2","19","19","None who go to her return or negotiate the paths of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_20","021_2_20","PRO","2","20","20","So you will follow in the ways of the good, and keep to the paths of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_21","021_2_21","PRO","2","21","21","For the upright will inhabit the land, and the blameless will remain in it; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR2_22","021_2_22","PRO","2","22","22","but the wicked will be cut off from the land, and the unfaithful will be uprooted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_1","021_3_1","PRO","3","1","1","My son, do not forget my teaching, but let your heart keep my commandments; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_2","021_3_2","PRO","3","2","2","for they will add length to your days, years and peace to your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_3","021_3_3","PRO","3","3","3","Never let loving devotion or faithfulness leave you; bind them around your neck, write them on the tablet of your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_4","021_3_4","PRO","3","4","4","Then you will find favor and high regard in the sight of God and man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_5","021_3_5","PRO","3","5","5","Trust in the LORD with all your heart, and lean not on your own understanding; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_6","021_3_6","PRO","3","6","6","in all your ways acknowledge Him, and He will make your paths straight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_7","021_3_7","PRO","3","7","7","Be not wise in your own eyes; fear the LORD and turn away from evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_8","021_3_8","PRO","3","8","8","This will bring healing to your body and refreshment to your bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_9","021_3_9","PRO","3","9","9","Honor the LORD with your wealth and with the firstfruits of all your crops; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_10","021_3_10","PRO","3","10","10","then your barns will be filled with plenty, and your vats will overflow with new wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_11","021_3_11","PRO","3","11","11","My son, do not reject the discipline of the LORD, and do not loathe His rebuke; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_12","021_3_12","PRO","3","12","12","for the LORD disciplines the one He loves, as does a father the son in whom he delights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_13","021_3_13","PRO","3","13","13","Blessed is the man who finds wisdom, the man who acquires understanding, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_14","021_3_14","PRO","3","14","14","for she is more profitable than silver, and her gain is better than fine gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_15","021_3_15","PRO","3","15","15","She is more precious than rubies; nothing you desire compares with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_16","021_3_16","PRO","3","16","16","Long life is in her right hand; in her left hand are riches and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_17","021_3_17","PRO","3","17","17","All her ways are pleasant, and all her paths are peaceful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_18","021_3_18","PRO","3","18","18","She is a tree of life to those who embrace her, and those who lay hold of her are blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_19","021_3_19","PRO","3","19","19","The LORD founded the earth by wisdom and established the heavens by understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_20","021_3_20","PRO","3","20","20","By His knowledge the watery depths were broken open, and the clouds dripped with dew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_21","021_3_21","PRO","3","21","21","My son, do not lose sight of this: Preserve sound judgment and discernment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_22","021_3_22","PRO","3","22","22","They will be life to your soul and adornment to your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_23","021_3_23","PRO","3","23","23","Then you will go on your way in safety, and your foot will not stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_24","021_3_24","PRO","3","24","24","When you lie down, you will not be afraid; when you rest, your sleep will be sweet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_25","021_3_25","PRO","3","25","25","Do not fear sudden danger or the ruin that overtakes the wicked, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_26","021_3_26","PRO","3","26","26","for the LORD will be your confidence and will keep your foot from the snare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_27","021_3_27","PRO","3","27","27","Do not withhold good from the deserving when it is within your power to act. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_28","021_3_28","PRO","3","28","28","Do not tell your neighbor, “Come back tomorrow and I will provide”—when you already have the means. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_29","021_3_29","PRO","3","29","29","Do not devise evil against your neighbor, for he trustfully dwells beside you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_30","021_3_30","PRO","3","30","30","Do not accuse a man without cause, when he has done you no harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_31","021_3_31","PRO","3","31","31","Do not envy a violent man or choose any of his ways; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_32","021_3_32","PRO","3","32","32","for the LORD detests the perverse, but He is a friend to the upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_33","021_3_33","PRO","3","33","33","The curse of the LORD is on the house of the wicked, but He blesses the home of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_34","021_3_34","PRO","3","34","34","He mocks the mockers, but gives grace to the humble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR3_35","021_3_35","PRO","3","35","35","The wise will inherit honor, but fools are held up to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_1","021_4_1","PRO","4","1","1","Listen, my sons, to a father’s instruction; pay attention and gain understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_2","021_4_2","PRO","4","2","2","For I give you sound teaching; do not abandon my directive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_3","021_4_3","PRO","4","3","3","When I was a son to my father, tender and the only child of my mother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_4","021_4_4","PRO","4","4","4","he taught me and said, “Let your heart lay hold of my words; keep my commands and you will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_5","021_4_5","PRO","4","5","5","Get wisdom, get understanding; do not forget my words or turn from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_6","021_4_6","PRO","4","6","6","Do not forsake wisdom, and she will preserve you; love her, and she will guard you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_7","021_4_7","PRO","4","7","7","Wisdom is supreme; so acquire wisdom. And whatever you may acquire, gain understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_8","021_4_8","PRO","4","8","8","Prize her, and she will exalt you; if you embrace her, she will honor you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_9","021_4_9","PRO","4","9","9","She will set a garland of grace on your head; she will present you with a crown of beauty.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_10","021_4_10","PRO","4","10","10","Listen, my son, and receive my words, and the years of your life will be many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_11","021_4_11","PRO","4","11","11","I will guide you in the way of wisdom; I will lead you on straight paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_12","021_4_12","PRO","4","12","12","When you walk, your steps will not be impeded; when you run, you will not stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_13","021_4_13","PRO","4","13","13","Hold on to instruction; do not let go. Guard it, for it is your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_14","021_4_14","PRO","4","14","14","Do not set foot on the path of the wicked or walk in the way of evildoers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_15","021_4_15","PRO","4","15","15","Avoid it; do not travel on it. Turn from it and pass on by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_16","021_4_16","PRO","4","16","16","For they cannot sleep unless they do evil; they are deprived of slumber until they make someone fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_17","021_4_17","PRO","4","17","17","For they eat the bread of wickedness and drink the wine of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_18","021_4_18","PRO","4","18","18","The path of the righteous is like the first gleam of dawn, shining brighter and brighter until midday. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_19","021_4_19","PRO","4","19","19","But the way of the wicked is like the darkest gloom; they do not know what makes them stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_20","021_4_20","PRO","4","20","20","My son, pay attention to my words; incline your ear to my sayings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_21","021_4_21","PRO","4","21","21","Do not lose sight of them; keep them within your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_22","021_4_22","PRO","4","22","22","For they are life to those who find them, and health to the whole body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_23","021_4_23","PRO","4","23","23","Guard your heart with all diligence, for from it flow springs of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_24","021_4_24","PRO","4","24","24","Put away deception from your mouth; keep your lips from perverse speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_25","021_4_25","PRO","4","25","25","Let your eyes look forward; fix your gaze straight ahead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_26","021_4_26","PRO","4","26","26","Make a level path for your feet, and all your ways will be sure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR4_27","021_4_27","PRO","4","27","27","Do not swerve to the right or to the left; turn your feet away from evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_1","021_5_1","PRO","5","1","1","My son, pay attention to my wisdom; incline your ear to my insight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_2","021_5_2","PRO","5","2","2","that you may maintain discretion and your lips may preserve knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_3","021_5_3","PRO","5","3","3","Though the lips of the forbidden woman drip honey and her speech is smoother than oil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_4","021_5_4","PRO","5","4","4","in the end she is bitter as wormwood, sharp as a double-edged sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_5","021_5_5","PRO","5","5","5","Her feet go down to death; her steps lead straight to Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_6","021_5_6","PRO","5","6","6","She does not consider the path of life; she does not know that her ways are unstable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_7","021_5_7","PRO","5","7","7","So now, my sons, listen to me, and do not turn aside from the words of my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_8","021_5_8","PRO","5","8","8","Keep your path far from her; do not go near the door of her house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_9","021_5_9","PRO","5","9","9","lest you concede your vigor to others, and your years to one who is cruel; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_10","021_5_10","PRO","5","10","10","lest strangers feast on your wealth, and your labors enrich the house of a foreigner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_11","021_5_11","PRO","5","11","11","At the end of your life you will groan when your flesh and your body are spent, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_12","021_5_12","PRO","5","12","12","and you will say, “How I hated discipline, and my heart despised reproof! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_13","021_5_13","PRO","5","13","13","I did not listen to the voice of my teachers or incline my ear to my mentors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_14","021_5_14","PRO","5","14","14","I am on the brink of utter ruin in the midst of the whole assembly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_15","021_5_15","PRO","5","15","15","Drink water from your own cistern, and running water from your own well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_16","021_5_16","PRO","5","16","16","Why should your springs flow in the streets, your streams of water in the public squares? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_17","021_5_17","PRO","5","17","17","Let them be yours alone, never to be shared with strangers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_18","021_5_18","PRO","5","18","18","May your fountain be blessed, and may you rejoice in the wife of your youth: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_19","021_5_19","PRO","5","19","19","A loving doe, a graceful fawn—may her breasts satisfy you always; may you be captivated by her love forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_20","021_5_20","PRO","5","20","20","Why be captivated, my son, by an adulteress, or embrace the bosom of a stranger? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_21","021_5_21","PRO","5","21","21","For a man’s ways are before the eyes of the LORD, and the LORD examines all his paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_22","021_5_22","PRO","5","22","22","The iniquities of a wicked man entrap him; the cords of his sin entangle him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR5_23","021_5_23","PRO","5","23","23","He dies for lack of discipline, led astray by his own great folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_1","021_6_1","PRO","6","1","1","My son, if you have put up security for your neighbor, if you have struck hands in pledge with a stranger, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_2","021_6_2","PRO","6","2","2","if you have been trapped by the words of your lips, ensnared by the words of your mouth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_3","021_6_3","PRO","6","3","3","then do this, my son, to free yourself, for you have fallen into your neighbor’s hands: Go, humble yourself, and press your plea with your neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_4","021_6_4","PRO","6","4","4","Allow no sleep to your eyes or slumber to your eyelids. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_5","021_6_5","PRO","6","5","5","Free yourself, like a gazelle from the hand of the hunter, like a bird from the snare of the fowler. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_6","021_6_6","PRO","6","6","6","Walk in the manner of the ant, O slacker; observe its ways and become wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_7","021_6_7","PRO","6","7","7","Without a commander, without an overseer or ruler, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_8","021_6_8","PRO","6","8","8","it prepares its provisions in summer; it gathers its food at harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_9","021_6_9","PRO","6","9","9","How long will you lie there, O slacker? When will you get up from your sleep? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_10","021_6_10","PRO","6","10","10","A little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to rest, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_11","021_6_11","PRO","6","11","11","and poverty will come upon you like a robber, and need like a bandit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_12","021_6_12","PRO","6","12","12","A worthless person, a wicked man, walks with a perverse mouth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_13","021_6_13","PRO","6","13","13","winking his eyes, speaking with his feet, and pointing with his fingers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_14","021_6_14","PRO","6","14","14","With deceit in his heart he devises evil; he continually sows discord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_15","021_6_15","PRO","6","15","15","Therefore calamity will come upon him suddenly; in an instant he will be shattered beyond recovery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_16","021_6_16","PRO","6","16","16","There are six things that the LORD hates, seven that are detestable to Him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_17","021_6_17","PRO","6","17","17","haughty eyes, a lying tongue, hands that shed innocent blood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_18","021_6_18","PRO","6","18","18","a heart that devises wicked schemes, feet that run swiftly to evil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_19","021_6_19","PRO","6","19","19","a false witness who gives false testimony, and one who stirs up discord among brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_20","021_6_20","PRO","6","20","20","My son, keep your father’s commandment, and do not forsake your mother’s teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_21","021_6_21","PRO","6","21","21","Bind them always upon your heart; tie them around your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_22","021_6_22","PRO","6","22","22","When you walk, they will guide you; when you lie down, they will watch over you; when you awake, they will speak to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_23","021_6_23","PRO","6","23","23","For this commandment is a lamp, this teaching is a light, and the reproofs of discipline are the way to life, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_24","021_6_24","PRO","6","24","24","to keep you from the evil woman, from the smooth tongue of the adulteress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_25","021_6_25","PRO","6","25","25","Do not lust in your heart for her beauty or let her captivate you with her eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_26","021_6_26","PRO","6","26","26","For the levy of the prostitute is poverty, and the adulteress preys upon your very life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_27","021_6_27","PRO","6","27","27","Can a man embrace fire and his clothes not be burned? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_28","021_6_28","PRO","6","28","28","Can a man walk on hot coals without scorching his feet? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_29","021_6_29","PRO","6","29","29","So is he who sleeps with another man’s wife; no one who touches her will go unpunished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_30","021_6_30","PRO","6","30","30","Men do not despise the thief if he steals to satisfy his hunger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_31","021_6_31","PRO","6","31","31","Yet if caught, he must pay sevenfold; he must give up all the wealth of his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_32","021_6_32","PRO","6","32","32","He who commits adultery lacks judgment; whoever does so destroys himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_33","021_6_33","PRO","6","33","33","Wounds and dishonor will befall him, and his reproach will never be wiped away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_34","021_6_34","PRO","6","34","34","For jealousy enrages a husband, and he will show no mercy in the day of vengeance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR6_35","021_6_35","PRO","6","35","35","He will not be appeased by any ransom, or persuaded by lavish gifts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_1","021_7_1","PRO","7","1","1","My son, keep my words and treasure my commandments within you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_2","021_7_2","PRO","7","2","2","Keep my commandments and live; guard my teachings as the apple of your eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_3","021_7_3","PRO","7","3","3","Tie them to your fingers; write them on the tablet of your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_4","021_7_4","PRO","7","4","4","Say to wisdom, “You are my sister,” and call understanding your kinsman, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_5","021_7_5","PRO","7","5","5","that they may keep you from the adulteress, from the stranger with seductive words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_6","021_7_6","PRO","7","6","6","For at the window of my house I looked through the lattice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_7","021_7_7","PRO","7","7","7","I saw among the simple, I noticed among the youths, a young man lacking judgment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_8","021_7_8","PRO","7","8","8","crossing the street near her corner, strolling down the road to her house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_9","021_7_9","PRO","7","9","9","at twilight, as the day was fading into the dark of the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_10","021_7_10","PRO","7","10","10","Then a woman came out to meet him, with the attire of a harlot and cunning of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_11","021_7_11","PRO","7","11","11","She is loud and defiant; her feet do not remain at home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_12","021_7_12","PRO","7","12","12","Now in the street, now in the squares, she lurks at every corner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_13","021_7_13","PRO","7","13","13","She seizes him and kisses him; she brazenly says to him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_14","021_7_14","PRO","7","14","14","“I have made my peace offerings; today I have paid my vows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_15","021_7_15","PRO","7","15","15","So I came out to meet you; I sought you, and I have found you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_16","021_7_16","PRO","7","16","16","I have decked my bed with coverings, with colored linen from Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_17","021_7_17","PRO","7","17","17","I have perfumed my bed with myrrh, with aloes, and with cinnamon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_18","021_7_18","PRO","7","18","18","Come, let us take our fill of love till morning. Let us delight in loving caresses! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_19","021_7_19","PRO","7","19","19","For my husband is not at home; he has gone on a long journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_20","021_7_20","PRO","7","20","20","He took with him a bag of money and will not return till the moon is full.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_21","021_7_21","PRO","7","21","21","With her great persuasion she entices him; with her flattering lips she lures him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_22","021_7_22","PRO","7","22","22","He follows her on impulse, like an ox going to the slaughter, like a deer bounding into a trap, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_23","021_7_23","PRO","7","23","23","until an arrow pierces his liver, like a bird darting into a snare—not knowing it will cost him his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_24","021_7_24","PRO","7","24","24","Now, my sons, listen to me, and attend to the words of my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_25","021_7_25","PRO","7","25","25","Do not let your heart turn aside to her ways; do not stray into her paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_26","021_7_26","PRO","7","26","26","For she has brought many down to death; her slain are many in number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR7_27","021_7_27","PRO","7","27","27","Her house is the road to Sheol, descending to the chambers of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_1","021_8_1","PRO","8","1","1","Does not wisdom call out, and understanding raise her voice? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_2","021_8_2","PRO","8","2","2","On the heights overlooking the road, at the crossroads she takes her stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_3","021_8_3","PRO","8","3","3","Beside the gates to the city, at the entrances she cries out: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_4","021_8_4","PRO","8","4","4","“To you, O men, I call out, and my cry is to the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_5","021_8_5","PRO","8","5","5","O simple ones, learn to be shrewd; O fools, gain understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_6","021_8_6","PRO","8","6","6","Listen, for I speak of noble things, and the opening of my lips will reveal right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_7","021_8_7","PRO","8","7","7","For my mouth will speak the truth, and wickedness is detestable to my lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_8","021_8_8","PRO","8","8","8","All the words of my mouth are righteous; none are crooked or perverse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_9","021_8_9","PRO","8","9","9","They are all plain to the discerning, and upright to those who find knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_10","021_8_10","PRO","8","10","10","Receive my instruction instead of silver, and knowledge rather than pure gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_11","021_8_11","PRO","8","11","11","For wisdom is more precious than rubies, and nothing you desire compares with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_12","021_8_12","PRO","8","12","12","I, wisdom, dwell together with prudence, and I find knowledge and discretion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_13","021_8_13","PRO","8","13","13","To fear the LORD is to hate evil; I hate arrogant pride, evil conduct, and perverse speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_14","021_8_14","PRO","8","14","14","Counsel and sound judgment are mine; I have insight and strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_15","021_8_15","PRO","8","15","15","By me kings reign, and rulers enact just laws; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_16","021_8_16","PRO","8","16","16","By me princes rule, and all nobles who govern justly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_17","021_8_17","PRO","8","17","17","I love those who love me, and those who seek me early shall find me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_18","021_8_18","PRO","8","18","18","With me are riches and honor, enduring wealth and righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_19","021_8_19","PRO","8","19","19","My fruit is better than gold, pure gold, and my harvest surpasses choice silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_20","021_8_20","PRO","8","20","20","I walk in the way of righteousness, along the paths of justice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_21","021_8_21","PRO","8","21","21","bestowing wealth on those who love me and making their treasuries full. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_22","021_8_22","PRO","8","22","22","The LORD created me as His first course, before His works of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_23","021_8_23","PRO","8","23","23","From everlasting I was established, from the beginning, before the earth began. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_24","021_8_24","PRO","8","24","24","When there were no watery depths, I was brought forth, when no springs were overflowing with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_25","021_8_25","PRO","8","25","25","Before the mountains were settled, before the hills, I was brought forth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_26","021_8_26","PRO","8","26","26","before He made the land or fields, or any of the dust of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_27","021_8_27","PRO","8","27","27","I was there when He established the heavens, when He inscribed a circle on the face of the deep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_28","021_8_28","PRO","8","28","28","when He established the clouds above, when the fountains of the deep gushed forth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_29","021_8_29","PRO","8","29","29","when He set a boundary for the sea, so that the waters would not surpass His command, when He marked out the foundations of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_30","021_8_30","PRO","8","30","30","Then I was a skilled craftsman at His side, and His delight day by day, rejoicing always in His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_31","021_8_31","PRO","8","31","31","I was rejoicing in His whole world, delighting together in the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_32","021_8_32","PRO","8","32","32","Now therefore, my sons, listen to me, for blessed are those who keep my ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_33","021_8_33","PRO","8","33","33","Listen to instruction and be wise; do not ignore it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_34","021_8_34","PRO","8","34","34","Blessed is the man who listens to me, watching daily at my doors, waiting at the posts of my doorway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_35","021_8_35","PRO","8","35","35","For whoever finds me finds life and obtains the favor of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR8_36","021_8_36","PRO","8","36","36","But he who fails to find me harms himself; all who hate me love death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_1","021_9_1","PRO","9","1","1","Wisdom has built her house; she has carved out her seven pillars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_2","021_9_2","PRO","9","2","2","She has prepared her meat and mixed her wine; she has also set her table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_3","021_9_3","PRO","9","3","3","She has sent out her maidservants; she calls out from the heights of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_4","021_9_4","PRO","9","4","4","“Whoever is simple, let him turn in here!” she says to him who lacks judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_5","021_9_5","PRO","9","5","5","“Come, eat my bread and drink the wine I have mixed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_6","021_9_6","PRO","9","6","6","Leave your folly behind, and you will live; walk in the way of understanding.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_7","021_9_7","PRO","9","7","7","He who corrects a mocker brings shame on himself; he who rebukes a wicked man taints himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_8","021_9_8","PRO","9","8","8","Do not rebuke a mocker, or he will hate you; rebuke a wise man, and he will love you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_9","021_9_9","PRO","9","9","9","Instruct a wise man, and he will be wiser still; teach a righteous man, and he will increase his learning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_10","021_9_10","PRO","9","10","10","The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom, and knowledge of the Holy One is understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_11","021_9_11","PRO","9","11","11","For through wisdom your days will be multiplied, and years will be added to your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_12","021_9_12","PRO","9","12","12","If you are wise, you are wise to your own advantage; but if you scoff, you alone will bear the consequences. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_13","021_9_13","PRO","9","13","13","The woman named Folly is loud; she is naive and knows nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_14","021_9_14","PRO","9","14","14","She sits at the door of her house, on a seat in the heights of the city, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_15","021_9_15","PRO","9","15","15","calling out to those who pass by, who make their paths straight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_16","021_9_16","PRO","9","16","16","“Whoever is simple, let him turn in here!” she says to him who lacks judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_17","021_9_17","PRO","9","17","17","“Stolen water is sweet, and bread eaten in secret is tasty!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR9_18","021_9_18","PRO","9","18","18","But they do not know that the dead are there, that her guests are in the depths of Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_1","021_10_1","PRO","10","1","1","The proverbs of Solomon: A wise son brings joy to his father, but a foolish son grief to his mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_2","021_10_2","PRO","10","2","2","Ill-gotten treasures profit nothing, but righteousness brings deliverance from death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_3","021_10_3","PRO","10","3","3","The LORD does not let the righteous go hungry, but He denies the craving of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_4","021_10_4","PRO","10","4","4","Idle hands make one poor, but diligent hands bring wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_5","021_10_5","PRO","10","5","5","He who gathers in summer is a wise son, but he who sleeps during harvest is a disgraceful son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_6","021_10_6","PRO","10","6","6","Blessings are on the head of the righteous, but the mouth of the wicked conceals violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_7","021_10_7","PRO","10","7","7","The memory of the righteous is a blessing, but the name of the wicked will rot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_8","021_10_8","PRO","10","8","8","A wise heart will receive commandments, but foolish lips will come to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_9","021_10_9","PRO","10","9","9","He who walks in integrity walks securely, but he who perverts his ways will be found out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_10","021_10_10","PRO","10","10","10","He who winks the eye causes grief, and foolish lips will come to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_11","021_10_11","PRO","10","11","11","The mouth of the righteous is a fountain of life, but the mouth of the wicked conceals violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_12","021_10_12","PRO","10","12","12","Hatred stirs up dissension, but love covers all transgressions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_13","021_10_13","PRO","10","13","13","Wisdom is found on the lips of the discerning, but a rod is for the back of him who lacks judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_14","021_10_14","PRO","10","14","14","The wise store up knowledge, but the mouth of the fool invites destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_15","021_10_15","PRO","10","15","15","The wealth of the rich man is his fortified city, but poverty is the ruin of the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_16","021_10_16","PRO","10","16","16","The labor of the righteous leads to life, but the gain of the wicked brings punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_17","021_10_17","PRO","10","17","17","Whoever heeds instruction is on the path to life, but he who ignores reproof goes astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_18","021_10_18","PRO","10","18","18","The one who conceals hatred has lying lips, and whoever spreads slander is a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_19","021_10_19","PRO","10","19","19","When words are many, sin is unavoidable, but he who restrains his lips is wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_20","021_10_20","PRO","10","20","20","The tongue of the righteous is choice silver, but the heart of the wicked has little worth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_21","021_10_21","PRO","10","21","21","The lips of the righteous feed many, but fools die for lack of judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_22","021_10_22","PRO","10","22","22","The blessing of the LORD enriches, and He adds no sorrow to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_23","021_10_23","PRO","10","23","23","The fool delights in shameful conduct, but a man of understanding has wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_24","021_10_24","PRO","10","24","24","What the wicked man dreads will overtake him, but the desire of the righteous will be granted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_25","021_10_25","PRO","10","25","25","When the whirlwind passes, the wicked are no more, but the righteous are secure forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_26","021_10_26","PRO","10","26","26","Like vinegar to the teeth and smoke to the eyes, so is the slacker to those who send him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_27","021_10_27","PRO","10","27","27","The fear of the LORD prolongs life, but the years of the wicked will be cut short. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_28","021_10_28","PRO","10","28","28","The hope of the righteous is joy, but the expectations of the wicked will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_29","021_10_29","PRO","10","29","29","The way of the LORD is a refuge to the upright, but destruction awaits those who do evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_30","021_10_30","PRO","10","30","30","The righteous will never be shaken, but the wicked will not inhabit the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_31","021_10_31","PRO","10","31","31","The mouth of the righteous brings forth wisdom, but a perverse tongue will be cut out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR10_32","021_10_32","PRO","10","32","32","The lips of the righteous know what is fitting, but the mouth of the wicked is perverse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_1","021_11_1","PRO","11","1","1","Dishonest scales are an abomination to the LORD, but an accurate weight is His delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_2","021_11_2","PRO","11","2","2","When pride comes, disgrace follows, but with humility comes wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_3","021_11_3","PRO","11","3","3","The integrity of the upright guides them, but the perversity of the faithless destroys them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_4","021_11_4","PRO","11","4","4","Riches are worthless in the day of wrath, but righteousness brings deliverance from death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_5","021_11_5","PRO","11","5","5","The righteousness of the blameless directs their path, but the wicked fall by their own wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_6","021_11_6","PRO","11","6","6","The righteousness of the upright delivers them, but the faithless are trapped by their own desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_7","021_11_7","PRO","11","7","7","When the wicked man dies, his hope perishes, and the hope of his strength vanishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_8","021_11_8","PRO","11","8","8","The righteous man is delivered from trouble; in his place the wicked man goes in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_9","021_11_9","PRO","11","9","9","With his mouth the ungodly man destroys his neighbor, but through knowledge the righteous are rescued. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_10","021_11_10","PRO","11","10","10","When the righteous thrive, the city rejoices, and when the wicked perish, there are shouts of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_11","021_11_11","PRO","11","11","11","By the blessing of the upright a city is built up, but by the mouth of the wicked it is torn down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_12","021_11_12","PRO","11","12","12","Whoever shows contempt for his neighbor lacks judgment, but a man of understanding remains silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_13","021_11_13","PRO","11","13","13","A gossip reveals a secret, but a trustworthy person keeps a confidence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_14","021_11_14","PRO","11","14","14","For lack of guidance, a nation falls, but with many counselors comes deliverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_15","021_11_15","PRO","11","15","15","He who puts up security for a stranger will surely suffer, but the one who hates indebtedness is secure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_16","021_11_16","PRO","11","16","16","A gracious woman attains honor, but ruthless men gain only wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_17","021_11_17","PRO","11","17","17","A kind man benefits himself, but a cruel man brings trouble on himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_18","021_11_18","PRO","11","18","18","The wicked man earns an empty wage, but he who sows righteousness reaps a true reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_19","021_11_19","PRO","11","19","19","Genuine righteousness leads to life, but the pursuit of evil brings death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_20","021_11_20","PRO","11","20","20","The perverse in heart are an abomination to the LORD, but the blameless in their walk are His delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_21","021_11_21","PRO","11","21","21","Be assured that the wicked will not go unpunished, but the offspring of the righteous will escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_22","021_11_22","PRO","11","22","22","Like a gold ring in a pig’s snout is a beautiful woman who lacks discretion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_23","021_11_23","PRO","11","23","23","The desire of the righteous leads only to good, but the hope of the wicked brings wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_24","021_11_24","PRO","11","24","24","One gives freely, yet gains even more; another withholds what is right, only to become poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_25","021_11_25","PRO","11","25","25","A generous soul will prosper, and he who refreshes others will himself be refreshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_26","021_11_26","PRO","11","26","26","The people will curse the hoarder of grain, but blessing will crown the one who sells it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_27","021_11_27","PRO","11","27","27","He who searches out good finds favor, but evil will come to him who seeks it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_28","021_11_28","PRO","11","28","28","He who trusts in his riches will fall, but the righteous will thrive like foliage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_29","021_11_29","PRO","11","29","29","He who brings trouble on his house will inherit the wind, and the fool will be servant to the wise of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_30","021_11_30","PRO","11","30","30","The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life, and he who wins souls is wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR11_31","021_11_31","PRO","11","31","31","If the righteous receive their due on earth, how much more the ungodly and the sinner! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_1","021_12_1","PRO","12","1","1","Whoever loves discipline loves knowledge, but he who hates correction is stupid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_2","021_12_2","PRO","12","2","2","The good man obtains favor from the LORD, but the LORD condemns a man who devises evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_3","021_12_3","PRO","12","3","3","A man cannot be established through wickedness, but the righteous cannot be uprooted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_4","021_12_4","PRO","12","4","4","A wife of noble character is her husband’s crown, but she who causes shame is like decay in his bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_5","021_12_5","PRO","12","5","5","The plans of the righteous are just, but the counsel of the wicked leads to deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_6","021_12_6","PRO","12","6","6","The words of the wicked lie in wait for blood, but the speech of the upright rescues them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_7","021_12_7","PRO","12","7","7","The wicked are overthrown and perish, but the house of the righteous will stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_8","021_12_8","PRO","12","8","8","A man is praised according to his wisdom, but a twisted mind is despised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_9","021_12_9","PRO","12","9","9","Better to be lightly esteemed yet have a servant, than to be self-important but lack food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_10","021_12_10","PRO","12","10","10","A righteous man regards the life of his animal, but the tender mercies of the wicked are only cruelty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_11","021_12_11","PRO","12","11","11","The one who works his land will have plenty of food, but whoever chases fantasies lacks judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_12","021_12_12","PRO","12","12","12","The wicked desire the plunder of evil men, but the root of the righteous flourishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_13","021_12_13","PRO","12","13","13","An evil man is trapped by his rebellious speech, but a righteous man escapes from trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_14","021_12_14","PRO","12","14","14","By fruitful speech a man is filled with good things, and the work of his hands returns to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_15","021_12_15","PRO","12","15","15","The way of a fool is right in his own eyes, but a wise man listens to counsel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_16","021_12_16","PRO","12","16","16","A fool’s anger is known at once, but a prudent man overlooks an insult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_17","021_12_17","PRO","12","17","17","He who speaks the truth declares what is right, but a false witness speaks deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_18","021_12_18","PRO","12","18","18","Speaking rashly is like a piercing sword, but the tongue of the wise brings healing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_19","021_12_19","PRO","12","19","19","Truthful lips endure forever, but a lying tongue lasts only a moment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_20","021_12_20","PRO","12","20","20","Deceit is in the hearts of those who devise evil, but the counselors of peace have joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_21","021_12_21","PRO","12","21","21","No harm befalls the righteous, but the wicked are filled with trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_22","021_12_22","PRO","12","22","22","Lying lips are detestable to the LORD, but those who deal faithfully are His delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_23","021_12_23","PRO","12","23","23","A shrewd man keeps his knowledge to himself, but a foolish heart proclaims its folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_24","021_12_24","PRO","12","24","24","The hand of the diligent will rule, but laziness ends in forced labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_25","021_12_25","PRO","12","25","25","Anxiety weighs down the heart of a man, but a good word cheers it up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_26","021_12_26","PRO","12","26","26","A righteous man is cautious in friendship, but the ways of the wicked lead them astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_27","021_12_27","PRO","12","27","27","A lazy man does not roast his game, but a diligent man prizes his possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR12_28","021_12_28","PRO","12","28","28","There is life in the path of righteousness, but another path leads to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_1","021_13_1","PRO","13","1","1","A wise son heeds his father’s discipline, but a mocker does not listen to rebuke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_2","021_13_2","PRO","13","2","2","From the fruit of his lips a man enjoys good things, but the desire of the faithless is violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_3","021_13_3","PRO","13","3","3","He who guards his mouth protects his life, but the one who opens his lips invites his own ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_4","021_13_4","PRO","13","4","4","The slacker craves yet has nothing, but the soul of the diligent is fully satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_5","021_13_5","PRO","13","5","5","The righteous hate falsehood, but the wicked bring shame and disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_6","021_13_6","PRO","13","6","6","Righteousness guards the man of integrity, but wickedness undermines the sinner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_7","021_13_7","PRO","13","7","7","One pretends to be rich, but has nothing; another pretends to be poor, yet has great wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_8","021_13_8","PRO","13","8","8","Riches may ransom a man’s life, but a poor man hears no threat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_9","021_13_9","PRO","13","9","9","The light of the righteous shines brightly, but the lamp of the wicked is extinguished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_10","021_13_10","PRO","13","10","10","Arrogance leads only to strife, but wisdom is with the well-advised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_11","021_13_11","PRO","13","11","11","Dishonest wealth will dwindle, but what is earned through hard work will be multiplied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_12","021_13_12","PRO","13","12","12","Hope deferred makes the heart sick, but desire fulfilled is a tree of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_13","021_13_13","PRO","13","13","13","He who despises instruction will pay the penalty, but the one who respects a command will be rewarded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_14","021_13_14","PRO","13","14","14","The teaching of the wise is a fountain of life, turning one from the snares of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_15","021_13_15","PRO","13","15","15","Good understanding wins favor, but the way of the faithless is difficult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_16","021_13_16","PRO","13","16","16","Every prudent man acts with knowledge, but a fool displays his folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_17","021_13_17","PRO","13","17","17","A wicked messenger falls into trouble, but a faithful envoy brings healing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_18","021_13_18","PRO","13","18","18","Poverty and shame come to him who ignores discipline, but whoever heeds correction is honored. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_19","021_13_19","PRO","13","19","19","Desire fulfilled is sweet to the soul, but turning from evil is detestable to fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_20","021_13_20","PRO","13","20","20","He who walks with the wise will become wise, but the companion of fools will be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_21","021_13_21","PRO","13","21","21","Disaster pursues sinners, but prosperity is the reward of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_22","021_13_22","PRO","13","22","22","A good man leaves an inheritance to his children’s children, but the sinner’s wealth is passed to the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_23","021_13_23","PRO","13","23","23","Abundant food is in the fallow ground of the poor, but without justice it is swept away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_24","021_13_24","PRO","13","24","24","He who spares the rod hates his son, but he who loves him disciplines him diligently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR13_25","021_13_25","PRO","13","25","25","A righteous man eats to his heart’s content, but the stomach of the wicked is empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_1","021_14_1","PRO","14","1","1","Every wise woman builds her house, but a foolish one tears it down with her own hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_2","021_14_2","PRO","14","2","2","He who walks in uprightness fears the LORD, but the one who is devious in his ways despises Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_3","021_14_3","PRO","14","3","3","The proud speech of a fool brings a rod to his back, but the lips of the wise protect them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_4","021_14_4","PRO","14","4","4","Where there are no oxen, the manger is empty, but an abundant harvest comes through the strength of the ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_5","021_14_5","PRO","14","5","5","An honest witness does not deceive, but a dishonest witness pours forth lies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_6","021_14_6","PRO","14","6","6","A mocker seeks wisdom and finds none, but knowledge comes easily to the discerning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_7","021_14_7","PRO","14","7","7","Stay away from a foolish man; you will gain no knowledge from his speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_8","021_14_8","PRO","14","8","8","The wisdom of the prudent is to discern his way, but the folly of fools deceives them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_9","021_14_9","PRO","14","9","9","Fools mock the making of amends, but goodwill is found among the upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_10","021_14_10","PRO","14","10","10","The heart knows its own bitterness, and no stranger shares in its joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_11","021_14_11","PRO","14","11","11","The house of the wicked will be destroyed, but the tent of the upright will flourish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_12","021_14_12","PRO","14","12","12","There is a way that seems right to a man, but its end is the way of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_13","021_14_13","PRO","14","13","13","Even in laughter the heart may ache, and joy may end in sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_14","021_14_14","PRO","14","14","14","The backslider in heart receives the fill of his own ways, but a good man is rewarded for his ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_15","021_14_15","PRO","14","15","15","The simple man believes every word, but the prudent man watches his steps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_16","021_14_16","PRO","14","16","16","A wise man fears and turns from evil, but a fool is careless and reckless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_17","021_14_17","PRO","14","17","17","A quick-tempered man acts foolishly, and a devious man is hated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_18","021_14_18","PRO","14","18","18","The simple inherit folly, but the prudent are crowned with knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_19","021_14_19","PRO","14","19","19","The evil bow before the good, and the wicked at the gates of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_20","021_14_20","PRO","14","20","20","The poor man is hated even by his neighbor, but many are those who love the rich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_21","021_14_21","PRO","14","21","21","He who despises his neighbor sins, but blessed is he who shows kindness to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_22","021_14_22","PRO","14","22","22","Do not those who contrive evil go astray? But those who plan goodness find loving devotion and faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_23","021_14_23","PRO","14","23","23","There is profit in all labor, but mere talk leads only to poverty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_24","021_14_24","PRO","14","24","24","The crown of the wise is their wealth, but the effort of fools is folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_25","021_14_25","PRO","14","25","25","A truthful witness saves lives, but one who utters lies is deceitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_26","021_14_26","PRO","14","26","26","He who fears the LORD is secure in confidence, and his children shall have a place of refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_27","021_14_27","PRO","14","27","27","The fear of the LORD is a fountain of life, turning a man from the snares of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_28","021_14_28","PRO","14","28","28","A large population is a king’s splendor, but a lack of subjects is a prince’s ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_29","021_14_29","PRO","14","29","29","A patient man has great understanding, but a quick-tempered man promotes folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_30","021_14_30","PRO","14","30","30","A tranquil heart is life to the body, but envy rots the bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_31","021_14_31","PRO","14","31","31","Whoever oppresses the poor taunts their Maker, but whoever is kind to the needy honors Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_32","021_14_32","PRO","14","32","32","The wicked man is thrown down by his own sin, but the righteous man has a refuge even in death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_33","021_14_33","PRO","14","33","33","Wisdom rests in the heart of the discerning; even among fools she is known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_34","021_14_34","PRO","14","34","34","Righteousness exalts a nation, but sin is a disgrace to any people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR14_35","021_14_35","PRO","14","35","35","A king delights in a wise servant, but his anger falls on the shameful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_1","021_15_1","PRO","15","1","1","A gentle answer turns away wrath, but a harsh word stirs up anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_2","021_15_2","PRO","15","2","2","The tongue of the wise commends knowledge, but the mouth of the fool spouts folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_3","021_15_3","PRO","15","3","3","The eyes of the LORD are in every place, observing the evil and the good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_4","021_15_4","PRO","15","4","4","A soothing tongue is a tree of life, but a perverse tongue crushes the spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_5","021_15_5","PRO","15","5","5","A fool rejects his father’s discipline, but whoever heeds correction is prudent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_6","021_15_6","PRO","15","6","6","The house of the righteous has great treasure, but the income of the wicked is trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_7","021_15_7","PRO","15","7","7","The lips of the wise spread knowledge, but not so the hearts of fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_8","021_15_8","PRO","15","8","8","The sacrifice of the wicked is detestable to the LORD, but the prayer of the upright is His delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_9","021_15_9","PRO","15","9","9","The LORD detests the way of the wicked, but He loves those who pursue righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_10","021_15_10","PRO","15","10","10","Discipline is harsh for him who leaves the path; he who hates correction will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_11","021_15_11","PRO","15","11","11","Sheol and Abaddon lie open before the LORD—how much more the hearts of men! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_12","021_15_12","PRO","15","12","12","A mocker does not love to be reproved, nor will he consult the wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_13","021_15_13","PRO","15","13","13","A joyful heart makes a cheerful countenance, but sorrow of the heart crushes the spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_14","021_15_14","PRO","15","14","14","A discerning heart seeks knowledge, but the mouth of a fool feeds on folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_15","021_15_15","PRO","15","15","15","All the days of the oppressed are bad, but a cheerful heart has a continual feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_16","021_15_16","PRO","15","16","16","Better a little with the fear of the LORD than great treasure with turmoil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_17","021_15_17","PRO","15","17","17","Better a dish of vegetables where there is love than a fattened ox with hatred. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_18","021_15_18","PRO","15","18","18","A hot-tempered man stirs up strife, but he who is slow to anger calms dispute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_19","021_15_19","PRO","15","19","19","The way of the slacker is like a hedge of thorns, but the path of the upright is a highway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_20","021_15_20","PRO","15","20","20","A wise son brings joy to his father, but a foolish man despises his mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_21","021_15_21","PRO","15","21","21","Folly is joy to one who lacks judgment, but a man of understanding walks a straight path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_22","021_15_22","PRO","15","22","22","Plans fail for lack of counsel, but with many advisers they succeed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_23","021_15_23","PRO","15","23","23","A man takes joy in a fitting reply—and how good is a timely word! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_24","021_15_24","PRO","15","24","24","The path of life leads upward for the wise, that he may avoid going down to Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_25","021_15_25","PRO","15","25","25","The LORD tears down the house of the proud, but He protects the boundaries of the widow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_26","021_15_26","PRO","15","26","26","The LORD detests the thoughts of the wicked, but the words of the pure are pleasant to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_27","021_15_27","PRO","15","27","27","He who is greedy for unjust gain brings trouble on his household, but he who hates bribes will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_28","021_15_28","PRO","15","28","28","The heart of the righteous ponders how to answer, but the mouth of the wicked blurts out evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_29","021_15_29","PRO","15","29","29","The LORD is far from the wicked, but He hears the prayer of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_30","021_15_30","PRO","15","30","30","The light of the eyes cheers the heart, and good news nourishes the bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_31","021_15_31","PRO","15","31","31","He who listens to life-giving reproof will dwell among the wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_32","021_15_32","PRO","15","32","32","He who ignores discipline despises himself, but whoever heeds correction gains understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR15_33","021_15_33","PRO","15","33","33","The fear of the LORD is the instruction of wisdom, and humility comes before honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_1","021_16_1","PRO","16","1","1","The plans of the heart belong to man, but the reply of the tongue is from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_2","021_16_2","PRO","16","2","2","All a man’s ways are pure in his own eyes, but his motives are weighed out by the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_3","021_16_3","PRO","16","3","3","Commit your works to the LORD and your plans will be achieved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_4","021_16_4","PRO","16","4","4","The LORD has made everything for His purpose—even the wicked for the day of disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_5","021_16_5","PRO","16","5","5","Everyone who is proud in heart is detestable to the LORD; be assured that he will not go unpunished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_6","021_16_6","PRO","16","6","6","By loving devotion and faithfulness iniquity is atoned for, and by the fear of the LORD one turns aside from evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_7","021_16_7","PRO","16","7","7","When a man’s ways please the LORD, He makes even the man’s enemies live at peace with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_8","021_16_8","PRO","16","8","8","Better a little with righteousness than great gain with injustice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_9","021_16_9","PRO","16","9","9","A man’s heart plans his course, but the LORD determines his steps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_10","021_16_10","PRO","16","10","10","A divine verdict is on the lips of a king; his mouth must not betray justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_11","021_16_11","PRO","16","11","11","Honest scales and balances are from the LORD; all the weights in the bag are His concern. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_12","021_16_12","PRO","16","12","12","Wicked behavior is detestable for kings, for a throne is established through righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_13","021_16_13","PRO","16","13","13","Righteous lips are a king’s delight, and he who speaks honestly is beloved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_14","021_16_14","PRO","16","14","14","The wrath of a king is a messenger of death, but a wise man will pacify it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_15","021_16_15","PRO","16","15","15","When a king’s face brightens, there is life; his favor is like a rain cloud in spring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_16","021_16_16","PRO","16","16","16","How much better to acquire wisdom than gold! To gain understanding is more desirable than silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_17","021_16_17","PRO","16","17","17","The highway of the upright leads away from evil; he who guards his way protects his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_18","021_16_18","PRO","16","18","18","Pride goes before destruction, and a haughty spirit before a fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_19","021_16_19","PRO","16","19","19","It is better to be lowly in spirit among the humble than to divide the spoil with the proud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_20","021_16_20","PRO","16","20","20","Whoever heeds instruction will find success, and blessed is he who trusts in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_21","021_16_21","PRO","16","21","21","The wise in heart are called discerning, and pleasant speech promotes instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_22","021_16_22","PRO","16","22","22","Understanding is a fountain of life to its possessor, but the discipline of fools is folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_23","021_16_23","PRO","16","23","23","The heart of the wise man instructs his mouth and adds persuasiveness to his lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_24","021_16_24","PRO","16","24","24","Pleasant words are a honeycomb, sweet to the soul and healing to the bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_25","021_16_25","PRO","16","25","25","There is a way that seems right to a man, but its end is the way of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_26","021_16_26","PRO","16","26","26","A worker’s appetite works for him because his hunger drives him onward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_27","021_16_27","PRO","16","27","27","A worthless man digs up evil, and his speech is like a scorching fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_28","021_16_28","PRO","16","28","28","A perverse man spreads dissension, and a gossip divides close friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_29","021_16_29","PRO","16","29","29","A violent man entices his neighbor and leads him down a path that is not good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_30","021_16_30","PRO","16","30","30","He who winks his eye devises perversity; he who purses his lips is bent on evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_31","021_16_31","PRO","16","31","31","Gray hair is a crown of glory; it is attained along the path of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_32","021_16_32","PRO","16","32","32","He who is slow to anger is better than a warrior, and he who controls his temper is greater than one who captures a city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR16_33","021_16_33","PRO","16","33","33","The lot is cast into the lap, but its every decision is from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_1","021_17_1","PRO","17","1","1","Better a dry morsel in quietness than a house full of feasting with strife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_2","021_17_2","PRO","17","2","2","A wise servant will rule over a disgraceful son and share his inheritance as one of the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_3","021_17_3","PRO","17","3","3","A crucible for silver and a furnace for gold, but the LORD is the tester of hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_4","021_17_4","PRO","17","4","4","A wicked man listens to evil lips; a liar gives ear to a destructive tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_5","021_17_5","PRO","17","5","5","He who mocks the poor insults their Maker; whoever gloats over calamity will not go unpunished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_6","021_17_6","PRO","17","6","6","Grandchildren are the crown of the aged, and the glory of a son is his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_7","021_17_7","PRO","17","7","7","Eloquent words are unfit for a fool; how much worse are lying lips to a ruler! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_8","021_17_8","PRO","17","8","8","A bribe is a charm to its giver; wherever he turns, he succeeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_9","021_17_9","PRO","17","9","9","Whoever conceals an offense promotes love, but he who brings it up separates friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_10","021_17_10","PRO","17","10","10","A rebuke cuts into a man of discernment deeper than a hundred lashes cut into a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_11","021_17_11","PRO","17","11","11","An evil man seeks only rebellion; a cruel messenger will be sent against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_12","021_17_12","PRO","17","12","12","It is better to meet a bear robbed of her cubs than a fool in his folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_13","021_17_13","PRO","17","13","13","If anyone returns evil for good, evil will never leave his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_14","021_17_14","PRO","17","14","14","To start a quarrel is to release a flood; so abandon the dispute before it breaks out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_15","021_17_15","PRO","17","15","15","Acquitting the guilty and condemning the righteous—both are detestable to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_16","021_17_16","PRO","17","16","16","Why should the fool have money in his hand with no intention of buying wisdom? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_17","021_17_17","PRO","17","17","17","A friend loves at all times, and a brother is born for adversity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_18","021_17_18","PRO","17","18","18","A man lacking judgment strikes hands in pledge and puts up security for his neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_19","021_17_19","PRO","17","19","19","He who loves transgression loves strife; he who builds his gate high invites destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_20","021_17_20","PRO","17","20","20","The one with a perverse heart finds no good, and he whose tongue is deceitful falls into trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_21","021_17_21","PRO","17","21","21","A man fathers a fool to his own grief; the father of a fool has no joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_22","021_17_22","PRO","17","22","22","A joyful heart is good medicine, but a broken spirit dries up the bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_23","021_17_23","PRO","17","23","23","A wicked man takes a covert bribe to subvert the course of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_24","021_17_24","PRO","17","24","24","Wisdom is the focus of the discerning, but the eyes of a fool wander to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_25","021_17_25","PRO","17","25","25","A foolish son brings grief to his father and bitterness to her who bore him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_26","021_17_26","PRO","17","26","26","It is surely not good to punish the innocent or to flog a noble for his honesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_27","021_17_27","PRO","17","27","27","A man of knowledge restrains his words, and a man of understanding maintains a calm spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR17_28","021_17_28","PRO","17","28","28","Even a fool is considered wise if he keeps silent, and discerning when he holds his tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_1","021_18_1","PRO","18","1","1","He who isolates himself pursues selfish desires; he rebels against all sound judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_2","021_18_2","PRO","18","2","2","A fool does not delight in understanding, but only in airing his opinions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_3","021_18_3","PRO","18","3","3","With a wicked man comes contempt as well, and shame is accompanied by disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_4","021_18_4","PRO","18","4","4","The words of a man’s mouth are deep waters; the fountain of wisdom is a bubbling brook. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_5","021_18_5","PRO","18","5","5","Showing partiality to the wicked is not good, nor is depriving the innocent of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_6","021_18_6","PRO","18","6","6","A fool’s lips bring him strife, and his mouth invites a beating. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_7","021_18_7","PRO","18","7","7","A fool’s mouth is his ruin, and his lips are a snare to his soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_8","021_18_8","PRO","18","8","8","The words of a gossip are like choice morsels that go down into the inmost being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_9","021_18_9","PRO","18","9","9","Whoever is slothful in his work is brother to him who destroys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_10","021_18_10","PRO","18","10","10","The name of the LORD is a strong tower; the righteous run to it and are safe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_11","021_18_11","PRO","18","11","11","A rich man’s wealth is his fortified city; it is like a high wall in his imagination. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_12","021_18_12","PRO","18","12","12","Before his downfall a man’s heart is proud, but humility comes before honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_13","021_18_13","PRO","18","13","13","He who answers a matter before he hears it—this is folly and disgrace to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_14","021_18_14","PRO","18","14","14","The spirit of a man can endure his sickness, but who can survive a broken spirit? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_15","021_18_15","PRO","18","15","15","The heart of the discerning acquires knowledge, and the ear of the wise seeks it out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_16","021_18_16","PRO","18","16","16","A man’s gift opens doors for him, and brings him before great men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_17","021_18_17","PRO","18","17","17","The first to state his case seems right until another comes and cross-examines him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_18","021_18_18","PRO","18","18","18","Casting the lot ends quarrels and separates strong opponents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_19","021_18_19","PRO","18","19","19","An offended brother is harder to win than a fortified city, and disputes are like the bars of a castle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_20","021_18_20","PRO","18","20","20","From the fruit of his mouth a man’s belly is filled; with the harvest from his lips he is satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_21","021_18_21","PRO","18","21","21","Life and death are in the power of the tongue, and those who love it will eat its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_22","021_18_22","PRO","18","22","22","He who finds a wife finds a good thing and obtains favor from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_23","021_18_23","PRO","18","23","23","The poor man pleads for mercy, but the rich man answers harshly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR18_24","021_18_24","PRO","18","24","24","A man of many companions may come to ruin, but there is a friend who stays closer than a brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_1","021_19_1","PRO","19","1","1","Better a poor man who walks with integrity than a fool whose lips are perverse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_2","021_19_2","PRO","19","2","2","Even zeal is no good without knowledge, and he who hurries his footsteps misses the mark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_3","021_19_3","PRO","19","3","3","A man’s own folly subverts his way, yet his heart rages against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_4","021_19_4","PRO","19","4","4","Wealth attracts many friends, but a poor man is deserted by his friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_5","021_19_5","PRO","19","5","5","A false witness will not go unpunished, and one who utters lies will not escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_6","021_19_6","PRO","19","6","6","Many seek the favor of the prince, and everyone is a friend of the gift giver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_7","021_19_7","PRO","19","7","7","All the brothers of a poor man hate him—how much more do his friends avoid him! He may pursue them with pleading, but they are nowhere to be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_8","021_19_8","PRO","19","8","8","He who acquires wisdom loves himself; one who safeguards understanding will find success. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_9","021_19_9","PRO","19","9","9","A false witness will not go unpunished, and one who pours out lies will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_10","021_19_10","PRO","19","10","10","Luxury is unseemly for a fool—how much worse for a slave to rule over princes! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_11","021_19_11","PRO","19","11","11","A man’s insight gives him patience, and his virtue is to overlook an offense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_12","021_19_12","PRO","19","12","12","A king’s rage is like the roar of a lion, but his favor is like dew on the grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_13","021_19_13","PRO","19","13","13","A foolish son is his father’s ruin, and a quarrelsome wife is like a constant dripping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_14","021_19_14","PRO","19","14","14","Houses and wealth are inherited from fathers, but a prudent wife is from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_15","021_19_15","PRO","19","15","15","Laziness brings on deep sleep, and an idle soul will suffer hunger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_16","021_19_16","PRO","19","16","16","He who keeps a commandment preserves his soul, but he who is careless in his ways will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_17","021_19_17","PRO","19","17","17","Kindness to the poor is a loan to the LORD, and He will repay the lender. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_18","021_19_18","PRO","19","18","18","Discipline your son, for in that there is hope; do not be party to his death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_19","021_19_19","PRO","19","19","19","A man of great anger must pay the penalty; if you rescue him, you will have to do so again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_20","021_19_20","PRO","19","20","20","Listen to counsel and accept discipline, that you may be wise the rest of your days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_21","021_19_21","PRO","19","21","21","Many plans are in a man’s heart, but the purpose of the LORD will prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_22","021_19_22","PRO","19","22","22","The desire of a man is loving devotion; better to be poor than a liar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_23","021_19_23","PRO","19","23","23","The fear of the LORD leads to life, that one may rest content, without visitation from harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_24","021_19_24","PRO","19","24","24","The slacker buries his hand in the dish; he will not even bring it back to his mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_25","021_19_25","PRO","19","25","25","Strike a mocker, and the simple will beware; rebuke the discerning man, and he will gain knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_26","021_19_26","PRO","19","26","26","He who assaults his father or evicts his mother is a son who brings shame and disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_27","021_19_27","PRO","19","27","27","If you cease to hear instruction, my son, you will stray from the words of knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_28","021_19_28","PRO","19","28","28","A corrupt witness mocks justice, and a wicked mouth swallows iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR19_29","021_19_29","PRO","19","29","29","Judgments are prepared for mockers, and beatings for the backs of fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_1","021_20_1","PRO","20","1","1","Wine is a mocker, strong drink is a brawler, and whoever is led astray by them is not wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_2","021_20_2","PRO","20","2","2","The terror of a king is like the roar of a lion; whoever provokes him forfeits his own life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_3","021_20_3","PRO","20","3","3","It is honorable for a man to resolve a dispute, but any fool will quarrel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_4","021_20_4","PRO","20","4","4","The slacker does not plow in season; at harvest time he looks, but nothing is there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_5","021_20_5","PRO","20","5","5","The intentions of a man’s heart are deep waters, but a man of understanding draws them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_6","021_20_6","PRO","20","6","6","Many a man proclaims his loving devotion, but who can find a trustworthy man? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_7","021_20_7","PRO","20","7","7","The righteous man walks with integrity; blessed are his children after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_8","021_20_8","PRO","20","8","8","A king who sits on a throne to judge sifts out all evil with his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_9","021_20_9","PRO","20","9","9","Who can say, “I have kept my heart pure; I am cleansed from my sin”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_10","021_20_10","PRO","20","10","10","Differing weights and unequal measures—both are detestable to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_11","021_20_11","PRO","20","11","11","Even a young man is known by his actions—whether his conduct is pure and upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_12","021_20_12","PRO","20","12","12","Ears that hear and eyes that see—the LORD has made them both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_13","021_20_13","PRO","20","13","13","Do not love sleep, or you will grow poor; open your eyes, and you will have plenty of food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_14","021_20_14","PRO","20","14","14","“Worthless, worthless!” says the buyer, but on the way out, he gloats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_15","021_20_15","PRO","20","15","15","There is an abundance of gold and rubies, but lips of knowledge are a rare treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_16","021_20_16","PRO","20","16","16","Take the garment of the one who posts security for a stranger; get collateral if it is for a foreigner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_17","021_20_17","PRO","20","17","17","Food gained by fraud is sweet to a man, but later his mouth is full of gravel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_18","021_20_18","PRO","20","18","18","Set plans by consultation, and wage war under sound guidance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_19","021_20_19","PRO","20","19","19","He who reveals secrets is a constant gossip; avoid the one who babbles with his lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_20","021_20_20","PRO","20","20","20","Whoever curses his father or mother, his lamp will be extinguished in deepest darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_21","021_20_21","PRO","20","21","21","An inheritance gained quickly will not be blessed in the end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_22","021_20_22","PRO","20","22","22","Do not say, “I will avenge this evil!” Wait on the LORD, and He will save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_23","021_20_23","PRO","20","23","23","Unequal weights are detestable to the LORD, and dishonest scales are no good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_24","021_20_24","PRO","20","24","24","A man’s steps are from the LORD, so how can anyone understand his own way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_25","021_20_25","PRO","20","25","25","It is a trap for a man to dedicate something rashly, only later to reconsider his vows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_26","021_20_26","PRO","20","26","26","A wise king separates out the wicked and drives the threshing wheel over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_27","021_20_27","PRO","20","27","27","The spirit of a man is the lamp of the LORD, searching out his inmost being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_28","021_20_28","PRO","20","28","28","Loving devotion and faithfulness preserve a king; by these he maintains his throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_29","021_20_29","PRO","20","29","29","The glory of young men is their strength, and gray hair is the splendor of the old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR20_30","021_20_30","PRO","20","30","30","Lashes and wounds scour evil, and beatings cleanse the inmost parts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_1","021_21_1","PRO","21","1","1","The king’s heart is a waterway in the hand of the LORD; He directs it where He pleases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_2","021_21_2","PRO","21","2","2","All a man’s ways seem right to him, but the LORD weighs the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_3","021_21_3","PRO","21","3","3","To do righteousness and justice is more desirable to the LORD than sacrifice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_4","021_21_4","PRO","21","4","4","Haughty eyes and a proud heart—the guides of the wicked—are sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_5","021_21_5","PRO","21","5","5","The plans of the diligent bring plenty, as surely as haste leads to poverty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_6","021_21_6","PRO","21","6","6","Making a fortune by a lying tongue is a vanishing mist, a deadly pursuit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_7","021_21_7","PRO","21","7","7","The violence of the wicked will sweep them away because they refuse to do what is just. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_8","021_21_8","PRO","21","8","8","The way of a guilty man is crooked, but the conduct of the innocent is upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_9","021_21_9","PRO","21","9","9","Better to live on a corner of the roof than to share a house with a quarrelsome wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_10","021_21_10","PRO","21","10","10","The soul of the wicked man craves evil; his neighbor finds no favor in his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_11","021_21_11","PRO","21","11","11","When a mocker is punished, the simple gain wisdom; and when a wise man is instructed, he acquires knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_12","021_21_12","PRO","21","12","12","The Righteous One considers the house of the wicked and brings the wicked to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_13","021_21_13","PRO","21","13","13","Whoever shuts his ears to the cry of the poor, he too shall cry out and receive no answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_14","021_21_14","PRO","21","14","14","A gift in secret soothes anger, and a covert bribe pacifies great wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_15","021_21_15","PRO","21","15","15","Justice executed is a joy to the righteous, but a terror to the workers of iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_16","021_21_16","PRO","21","16","16","The man who strays from the path of understanding will rest in the assembly of the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_17","021_21_17","PRO","21","17","17","He who loves pleasure will become poor; the one who loves wine and oil will never be rich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_18","021_21_18","PRO","21","18","18","The wicked become a ransom for the righteous, and the faithless for the upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_19","021_21_19","PRO","21","19","19","Better to live in the desert than with a contentious and ill-tempered wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_20","021_21_20","PRO","21","20","20","Precious treasures and oil are in the dwelling of the wise, but a foolish man consumes them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_21","021_21_21","PRO","21","21","21","He who pursues righteousness and loving devotion finds life, righteousness, and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_22","021_21_22","PRO","21","22","22","A wise man scales the city of the mighty and pulls down the stronghold in which they trust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_23","021_21_23","PRO","21","23","23","He who guards his mouth and tongue keeps his soul from distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_24","021_21_24","PRO","21","24","24","Mocker is the name of the proud and arrogant man—of him who acts with excessive pride. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_25","021_21_25","PRO","21","25","25","The craving of the slacker kills him because his hands refuse to work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_26","021_21_26","PRO","21","26","26","All day long he covets more, but the righteous give without restraint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_27","021_21_27","PRO","21","27","27","The sacrifice of the wicked is detestable—how much more so when brought with ill intent! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_28","021_21_28","PRO","21","28","28","A lying witness will perish, but the man who listens to truth will speak forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_29","021_21_29","PRO","21","29","29","A wicked man hardens his face, but the upright man makes his way sure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_30","021_21_30","PRO","21","30","30","There is no wisdom, no understanding, no counsel that can prevail against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR21_31","021_21_31","PRO","21","31","31","A horse is prepared for the day of battle, but victory is of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_1","021_22_1","PRO","22","1","1","A good name is more desirable than great riches; favor is better than silver and gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_2","021_22_2","PRO","22","2","2","The rich and the poor have this in common: The LORD is Maker of them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_3","021_22_3","PRO","22","3","3","The prudent see danger and take cover, but the simple keep going and suffer the consequences. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_4","021_22_4","PRO","22","4","4","The rewards of humility and the fear of the LORD are wealth and honor and life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_5","021_22_5","PRO","22","5","5","Thorns and snares lie on the path of the perverse; he who guards his soul stays far from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_6","021_22_6","PRO","22","6","6","Train up a child in the way he should go, and when he is old he will not depart from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_7","021_22_7","PRO","22","7","7","The rich rule over the poor, and the borrower is slave to the lender. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_8","021_22_8","PRO","22","8","8","He who sows injustice will reap disaster, and the rod of his fury will be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_9","021_22_9","PRO","22","9","9","A generous man will be blessed, for he shares his bread with the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_10","021_22_10","PRO","22","10","10","Drive out the mocker, and conflict will depart; even quarreling and insults will cease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_11","021_22_11","PRO","22","11","11","He who loves a pure heart and gracious lips will have the king for a friend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_12","021_22_12","PRO","22","12","12","The LORD’s eyes keep watch over knowledge, but He frustrates the words of the faithless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_13","021_22_13","PRO","22","13","13","The slacker says, “There is a lion outside! I will be slain in the streets!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_14","021_22_14","PRO","22","14","14","The mouth of an adulteress is a deep pit; he who is under the wrath of the LORD will fall into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_15","021_22_15","PRO","22","15","15","Foolishness is bound up in the heart of a child, but the rod of discipline drives it far from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_16","021_22_16","PRO","22","16","16","Oppressing the poor to enrich oneself or giving gifts to the rich will surely lead to poverty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_17","021_22_17","PRO","22","17","17","Incline your ear and hear the words of the wise—apply your mind to my knowledge— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_18","021_22_18","PRO","22","18","18","for it is pleasing when you keep them within you and they are constantly on your lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_19","021_22_19","PRO","22","19","19","So that your trust may be in the LORD, I instruct you today—yes, you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_20","021_22_20","PRO","22","20","20","Have I not written for you thirty sayings about counsel and knowledge, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_21","021_22_21","PRO","22","21","21","to show you true and reliable words, that you may soundly answer those who sent you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_22","021_22_22","PRO","22","22","22","Do not rob a poor man because he is poor, and do not crush the afflicted at the gate, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_23","021_22_23","PRO","22","23","23","for the LORD will take up their case and will plunder those who rob them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_24","021_22_24","PRO","22","24","24","Do not make friends with an angry man, and do not associate with a hot-tempered man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_25","021_22_25","PRO","22","25","25","or you may learn his ways and entangle yourself in a snare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_26","021_22_26","PRO","22","26","26","Do not be one who gives pledges, who puts up security for debts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_27","021_22_27","PRO","22","27","27","If you have nothing with which to pay, why should your bed be taken from under you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_28","021_22_28","PRO","22","28","28","Do not move an ancient boundary stone which your fathers have placed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR22_29","021_22_29","PRO","22","29","29","Do you see a man skilled in his work? He will be stationed in the presence of kings; he will not stand before obscure men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_1","021_23_1","PRO","23","1","1","When you sit down to dine with a ruler, consider carefully what is set before you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_2","021_23_2","PRO","23","2","2","and put a knife to your throat if you possess a great appetite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_3","021_23_3","PRO","23","3","3","Do not crave his delicacies, for that food is deceptive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_4","021_23_4","PRO","23","4","4","Do not wear yourself out to get rich; be wise enough to restrain yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_5","021_23_5","PRO","23","5","5","When you glance at wealth, it disappears, for it makes wings for itself and flies like an eagle to the sky. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_6","021_23_6","PRO","23","6","6","Do not eat the bread of a stingy man, and do not crave his delicacies; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_7","021_23_7","PRO","23","7","7","for he is keeping track, inwardly counting the cost. “Eat and drink,” he says to you, but his heart is not with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_8","021_23_8","PRO","23","8","8","You will vomit up what little you have eaten and waste your pleasant words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_9","021_23_9","PRO","23","9","9","Do not speak to a fool, for he will despise the wisdom of your words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_10","021_23_10","PRO","23","10","10","Do not move an ancient boundary stone or encroach on the fields of the fatherless, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_11","021_23_11","PRO","23","11","11","for their Redeemer is strong; He will take up their case against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_12","021_23_12","PRO","23","12","12","Apply your heart to instruction and your ears to words of knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_13","021_23_13","PRO","23","13","13","Do not withhold discipline from a child; although you strike him with a rod, he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_14","021_23_14","PRO","23","14","14","Strike him with a rod, and you will deliver his soul from Sheol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_15","021_23_15","PRO","23","15","15","My son, if your heart is wise, my own heart will indeed rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_16","021_23_16","PRO","23","16","16","My inmost being will rejoice when your lips speak what is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_17","021_23_17","PRO","23","17","17","Do not let your heart envy sinners, but always continue in the fear of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_18","021_23_18","PRO","23","18","18","For surely there is a future, and your hope will not be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_19","021_23_19","PRO","23","19","19","Listen, my son, and be wise, and guide your heart on the right course. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_20","021_23_20","PRO","23","20","20","Do not join those who drink too much wine or gorge themselves on meat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_21","021_23_21","PRO","23","21","21","For the drunkard and the glutton will come to poverty, and drowsiness will clothe them in rags. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_22","021_23_22","PRO","23","22","22","Listen to your father who gave you life, and do not despise your mother when she is old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_23","021_23_23","PRO","23","23","23","Invest in truth and never sell it—in wisdom and instruction and understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_24","021_23_24","PRO","23","24","24","The father of a righteous man will greatly rejoice, and he who fathers a wise son will delight in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_25","021_23_25","PRO","23","25","25","May your father and mother be glad, and may she who gave you birth rejoice! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_26","021_23_26","PRO","23","26","26","My son, give me your heart, and let your eyes delight in my ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_27","021_23_27","PRO","23","27","27","For a prostitute is a deep pit, and an adulteress is a narrow well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_28","021_23_28","PRO","23","28","28","Like a robber she lies in wait and multiplies the faithless among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_29","021_23_29","PRO","23","29","29","Who has woe? Who has sorrow? Who has contentions? Who has complaints? Who has needless wounds? Who has bloodshot eyes? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_30","021_23_30","PRO","23","30","30","Those who linger over wine, who go to taste mixed drinks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_31","021_23_31","PRO","23","31","31","Do not gaze at wine while it is red, when it sparkles in the cup and goes down smoothly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_32","021_23_32","PRO","23","32","32","In the end it bites like a snake and stings like a viper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_33","021_23_33","PRO","23","33","33","Your eyes will see strange things, and your mind will utter perversities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_34","021_23_34","PRO","23","34","34","You will be like one sleeping on the high seas or lying on the top of a mast: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR23_35","021_23_35","PRO","23","35","35","“They struck me, but I feel no pain! They beat me, but I did not know it! When can I wake up to search for another drink?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_1","021_24_1","PRO","24","1","1","Do not envy wicked men or desire their company; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_2","021_24_2","PRO","24","2","2","for their hearts devise violence, and their lips declare trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_3","021_24_3","PRO","24","3","3","By wisdom a house is built and by understanding it is established; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_4","021_24_4","PRO","24","4","4","through knowledge its rooms are filled with every precious and beautiful treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_5","021_24_5","PRO","24","5","5","A wise man is strong, and a man of knowledge enhances his strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_6","021_24_6","PRO","24","6","6","Only with sound guidance should you wage war, and victory lies in a multitude of counselors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_7","021_24_7","PRO","24","7","7","Wisdom is too high for a fool; he does not open his mouth in the meeting place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_8","021_24_8","PRO","24","8","8","He who plots evil will be called a schemer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_9","021_24_9","PRO","24","9","9","A foolish scheme is sin, and a mocker is detestable to men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_10","021_24_10","PRO","24","10","10","If you faint in the day of distress, how small is your strength! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_11","021_24_11","PRO","24","11","11","Rescue those being led away to death, and restrain those stumbling toward the slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_12","021_24_12","PRO","24","12","12","If you say, “Behold, we did not know about this,” does not He who weighs hearts consider it? Does not the One who guards your life know? Will He not repay a man according to his deeds? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_13","021_24_13","PRO","24","13","13","Eat honey, my son, for it is good, and the honeycomb is sweet to your taste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_14","021_24_14","PRO","24","14","14","Know therefore that wisdom is sweet to your soul. If you find it, there is a future for you, and your hope will never be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_15","021_24_15","PRO","24","15","15","Do not lie in wait, O wicked man, near the dwelling of the righteous; do not destroy his resting place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_16","021_24_16","PRO","24","16","16","For though a righteous man may fall seven times, he still gets up; but the wicked stumble in bad times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_17","021_24_17","PRO","24","17","17","Do not gloat when your enemy falls, and do not let your heart rejoice when he stumbles, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_18","021_24_18","PRO","24","18","18","or the LORD will see and disapprove, and turn His wrath away from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_19","021_24_19","PRO","24","19","19","Do not fret over evildoers, and do not be envious of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_20","021_24_20","PRO","24","20","20","For the evil man has no future; the lamp of the wicked will be extinguished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_21","021_24_21","PRO","24","21","21","My son, fear the LORD and the king, and do not associate with the rebellious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_22","021_24_22","PRO","24","22","22","For they will bring sudden destruction. Who knows what ruin they can bring? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_23","021_24_23","PRO","24","23","23","These also are sayings of the wise: To show partiality in judgment is not good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_24","021_24_24","PRO","24","24","24","Whoever tells the guilty, “You are innocent”—peoples will curse him, and nations will denounce him; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_25","021_24_25","PRO","24","25","25","but it will go well with those who convict the guilty, and rich blessing will come upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_26","021_24_26","PRO","24","26","26","An honest answer given is like a kiss on the lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_27","021_24_27","PRO","24","27","27","Complete your outdoor work and prepare your field; after that, you may build your house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_28","021_24_28","PRO","24","28","28","Do not testify against your neighbor without cause, and do not deceive with your lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_29","021_24_29","PRO","24","29","29","Do not say, “I will do to him as he has done to me; I will repay the man according to his work.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_30","021_24_30","PRO","24","30","30","I went past the field of a slacker and by the vineyard of a man lacking judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_31","021_24_31","PRO","24","31","31","Thorns had grown up everywhere, thistles had covered the ground, and the stone wall was broken down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_32","021_24_32","PRO","24","32","32","I observed and took it to heart; I looked and received instruction: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_33","021_24_33","PRO","24","33","33","A little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to rest, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR24_34","021_24_34","PRO","24","34","34","and poverty will come upon you like a robber, and need like a bandit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_1","021_25_1","PRO","25","1","1","These are additional proverbs of Solomon, which were copied by the men of Hezekiah king of Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_2","021_25_2","PRO","25","2","2","It is the glory of God to conceal a matter and the glory of kings to search it out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_3","021_25_3","PRO","25","3","3","As the heavens are high and the earth is deep, so the hearts of kings cannot be searched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_4","021_25_4","PRO","25","4","4","Remove the dross from the silver, and a vessel for a silversmith will come forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_5","021_25_5","PRO","25","5","5","Remove the wicked from the king’s presence, and his throne will be established in righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_6","021_25_6","PRO","25","6","6","Do not exalt yourself in the presence of the king, and do not stand in the place of great men; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_7","021_25_7","PRO","25","7","7","for it is better to be told, “Come up here!” than to be demoted in the presence of the prince. Even what you have seen with your own eyes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_8","021_25_8","PRO","25","8","8","do not bring hastily to court. Otherwise, what will you do in the end when your neighbor puts you to shame? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_9","021_25_9","PRO","25","9","9","Argue your case with your neighbor without betraying another’s confidence, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_10","021_25_10","PRO","25","10","10","lest he who hears you bring shame upon you, and your infamy never go away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_11","021_25_11","PRO","25","11","11","A word fitly spoken is like apples of gold in settings of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_12","021_25_12","PRO","25","12","12","Like an earring of gold or an ornament of fine gold is a wise man’s rebuke to a listening ear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_13","021_25_13","PRO","25","13","13","Like the cold of snow in the time of harvest is a trustworthy messenger to those who send him; he refreshes the soul of his masters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_14","021_25_14","PRO","25","14","14","Like clouds and wind without rain is the man who boasts of gifts never given. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_15","021_25_15","PRO","25","15","15","Through patience a ruler can be persuaded, and a gentle tongue can break a bone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_16","021_25_16","PRO","25","16","16","If you find honey, eat just what you need, lest you have too much and vomit it up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_17","021_25_17","PRO","25","17","17","Seldom set foot in your neighbor’s house, lest he grow weary and hate you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_18","021_25_18","PRO","25","18","18","Like a club or sword or sharp arrow is a man who bears false witness against his neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_19","021_25_19","PRO","25","19","19","Like a broken tooth or a foot out of joint is confidence in a faithless man in time of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_20","021_25_20","PRO","25","20","20","Like one who removes a garment on a cold day or vinegar poured on a wound is one who sings songs to a heavy heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_21","021_25_21","PRO","25","21","21","If your enemy is hungry, give him food to eat, and if he is thirsty, give him water to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_22","021_25_22","PRO","25","22","22","For in so doing, you will heap burning coals on his head, and the LORD will reward you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_23","021_25_23","PRO","25","23","23","As the north wind brings forth rain, so a backbiting tongue brings angry looks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_24","021_25_24","PRO","25","24","24","Better to live on a corner of the roof than to share a house with a quarrelsome wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_25","021_25_25","PRO","25","25","25","Like cold water to a weary soul is good news from a distant land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_26","021_25_26","PRO","25","26","26","Like a muddied spring or a polluted well is a righteous man who gives way to the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_27","021_25_27","PRO","25","27","27","It is not good to eat too much honey or to search out one’s own glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR25_28","021_25_28","PRO","25","28","28","Like a city whose walls are broken down is a man who does not control his temper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_1","021_26_1","PRO","26","1","1","Like snow in summer and rain at harvest, honor does not befit a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_2","021_26_2","PRO","26","2","2","Like a fluttering sparrow or darting swallow, an undeserved curse does not come to rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_3","021_26_3","PRO","26","3","3","A whip for the horse, a bridle for the donkey, and a rod for the backs of fools! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_4","021_26_4","PRO","26","4","4","Do not answer a fool according to his folly, or you yourself will be like him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_5","021_26_5","PRO","26","5","5","Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he become wise in his own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_6","021_26_6","PRO","26","6","6","Like cutting off one’s own feet or drinking violence is the sending of a message by the hand of a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_7","021_26_7","PRO","26","7","7","Like lame legs hanging limp is a proverb in the mouth of a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_8","021_26_8","PRO","26","8","8","Like binding a stone into a sling is the giving of honor to a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_9","021_26_9","PRO","26","9","9","Like a thorn that goes into the hand of a drunkard is a proverb in the mouth of a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_10","021_26_10","PRO","26","10","10","Like an archer who wounds at random is he who hires a fool or passerby. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_11","021_26_11","PRO","26","11","11","As a dog returns to its vomit, so a fool repeats his folly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_12","021_26_12","PRO","26","12","12","Do you see a man who is wise in his own eyes? There is more hope for a fool than for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_13","021_26_13","PRO","26","13","13","The slacker says, “A lion is in the road! A fierce lion roams the public square!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_14","021_26_14","PRO","26","14","14","As a door turns on its hinges, so the slacker turns on his bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_15","021_26_15","PRO","26","15","15","The slacker buries his hand in the dish; it wearies him to bring it back to his mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_16","021_26_16","PRO","26","16","16","The slacker is wiser in his own eyes than seven men who answer discreetly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_17","021_26_17","PRO","26","17","17","Like one who grabs a dog by the ears is a passerby who meddles in a quarrel not his own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_18","021_26_18","PRO","26","18","18","Like a madman shooting firebrands and deadly arrows, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_19","021_26_19","PRO","26","19","19","so is the man who deceives his neighbor and says, “I was only joking!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_20","021_26_20","PRO","26","20","20","Without wood, a fire goes out; without gossip, a conflict ceases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_21","021_26_21","PRO","26","21","21","Like charcoal for embers and wood for fire, so is a quarrelsome man for kindling strife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_22","021_26_22","PRO","26","22","22","The words of a gossip are like choice morsels that go down into the inmost being. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_23","021_26_23","PRO","26","23","23","Like glaze covering an earthen vessel are burning lips and a wicked heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_24","021_26_24","PRO","26","24","24","A hateful man disguises himself with his speech, but he lays up deceit in his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_25","021_26_25","PRO","26","25","25","When he speaks graciously, do not believe him, for seven abominations fill his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_26","021_26_26","PRO","26","26","26","Though his hatred is concealed by deception, his wickedness will be exposed in the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_27","021_26_27","PRO","26","27","27","He who digs a pit will fall into it, and he who rolls a stone will have it roll back on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR26_28","021_26_28","PRO","26","28","28","A lying tongue hates those it crushes, and a flattering mouth causes ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_1","021_27_1","PRO","27","1","1","Do not boast about tomorrow, for you do not know what a day may bring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_2","021_27_2","PRO","27","2","2","Let another praise you, and not your own mouth—a stranger, and not your own lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_3","021_27_3","PRO","27","3","3","A stone is heavy and sand is a burden, but aggravation from a fool outweighs them both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_4","021_27_4","PRO","27","4","4","Wrath is cruel and anger is like a flood, but who can withstand jealousy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_5","021_27_5","PRO","27","5","5","Better an open rebuke than love that is concealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_6","021_27_6","PRO","27","6","6","The wounds of a friend are faithful, but the kisses of an enemy are deceitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_7","021_27_7","PRO","27","7","7","The soul that is full loathes honey, but to a hungry soul, any bitter thing is sweet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_8","021_27_8","PRO","27","8","8","Like a bird that strays from its nest is a man who wanders from his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_9","021_27_9","PRO","27","9","9","Oil and incense bring joy to the heart, and the counsel of a friend is sweetness to the soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_10","021_27_10","PRO","27","10","10","Do not forsake your friend or your father’s friend, and do not go to your brother’s house in the day of your calamity; better a neighbor nearby than a brother far away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_11","021_27_11","PRO","27","11","11","Be wise, my son, and bring joy to my heart, so that I can answer him who taunts me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_12","021_27_12","PRO","27","12","12","The prudent see danger and take cover, but the simple keep going and pay the penalty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_13","021_27_13","PRO","27","13","13","Take the garment of him who posts security for a stranger; get collateral if it is for a foreigner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_14","021_27_14","PRO","27","14","14","If one blesses his neighbor with a loud voice early in the morning, it will be counted to him as a curse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_15","021_27_15","PRO","27","15","15","A constant dripping on a rainy day and a contentious woman are alike— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_16","021_27_16","PRO","27","16","16","restraining her is like holding back the wind or grasping oil with one’s right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_17","021_27_17","PRO","27","17","17","As iron sharpens iron, so one man sharpens another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_18","021_27_18","PRO","27","18","18","Whoever tends a fig tree will eat its fruit, and he who looks after his master will be honored. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_19","021_27_19","PRO","27","19","19","As water reflects the face, so the heart reflects the true man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_20","021_27_20","PRO","27","20","20","Sheol and Abaddon are never satisfied; so the eyes of man are never satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_21","021_27_21","PRO","27","21","21","A crucible for silver and a furnace for gold, but a man is tested by the praise accorded him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_22","021_27_22","PRO","27","22","22","Though you grind a fool like grain with mortar and a pestle, yet his folly will not depart from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_23","021_27_23","PRO","27","23","23","Be sure to know the state of your flocks, and pay close attention to your herds; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_24","021_27_24","PRO","27","24","24","for riches are not forever, nor does a crown endure to every generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_25","021_27_25","PRO","27","25","25","When hay is removed and new growth appears and the grass from the hills is gathered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_26","021_27_26","PRO","27","26","26","the lambs will provide you with clothing, and the goats with the price of a field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR27_27","021_27_27","PRO","27","27","27","You will have plenty of goats’ milk to feed you—food for your household and nourishment for your maidservants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_1","021_28_1","PRO","28","1","1","The wicked flee when no one pursues, but the righteous are as bold as a lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_2","021_28_2","PRO","28","2","2","A land in rebellion has many rulers, but a man of understanding and knowledge maintains order. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_3","021_28_3","PRO","28","3","3","A destitute leader who oppresses the poor is like a driving rain that leaves no food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_4","021_28_4","PRO","28","4","4","Those who forsake the law praise the wicked, but those who keep the law resist them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_5","021_28_5","PRO","28","5","5","Evil men do not understand justice, but those who seek the LORD comprehend fully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_6","021_28_6","PRO","28","6","6","Better a poor man who walks with integrity than a rich man whose ways are perverse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_7","021_28_7","PRO","28","7","7","A discerning son keeps the law, but a companion of gluttons disgraces his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_8","021_28_8","PRO","28","8","8","He who increases his wealth by interest and usury lays it up for one who is kind to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_9","021_28_9","PRO","28","9","9","Whoever turns his ear away from hearing the law, even his prayer is detestable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_10","021_28_10","PRO","28","10","10","He who leads the upright along the path of evil will fall into his own pit, but the blameless will inherit what is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_11","021_28_11","PRO","28","11","11","A rich man is wise in his own eyes, but a poor man with discernment sees through him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_12","021_28_12","PRO","28","12","12","When the righteous triumph, there is great glory, but when the wicked rise, men hide themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_13","021_28_13","PRO","28","13","13","He who conceals his sins will not prosper, but whoever confesses and renounces them will find mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_14","021_28_14","PRO","28","14","14","Blessed is the man who is always reverent, but he who hardens his heart falls into trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_15","021_28_15","PRO","28","15","15","Like a roaring lion or a charging bear is a wicked ruler over a helpless people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_16","021_28_16","PRO","28","16","16","A leader who lacks judgment is also a great oppressor, but he who hates dishonest profit will prolong his days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_17","021_28_17","PRO","28","17","17","A man burdened by bloodguilt will flee into the Pit; let no one support him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_18","021_28_18","PRO","28","18","18","He who walks with integrity will be kept safe, but whoever is perverse in his ways will suddenly fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_19","021_28_19","PRO","28","19","19","The one who works his land will have plenty of food, but whoever chases fantasies will have his fill of poverty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_20","021_28_20","PRO","28","20","20","A faithful man will abound with blessings, but one eager to be rich will not go unpunished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_21","021_28_21","PRO","28","21","21","To show partiality is not good, yet a man will do wrong for a piece of bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_22","021_28_22","PRO","28","22","22","A stingy man hastens after wealth and does not know that poverty awaits him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_23","021_28_23","PRO","28","23","23","He who rebukes a man will later find more favor than one who flatters with his tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_24","021_28_24","PRO","28","24","24","He who robs his father or mother, saying, “It is not wrong,” is a companion to the man who destroys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_25","021_28_25","PRO","28","25","25","A greedy man stirs up strife, but he who trusts in the LORD will prosper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_26","021_28_26","PRO","28","26","26","He who trusts in himself is a fool, but one who walks in wisdom will be safe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_27","021_28_27","PRO","28","27","27","Whoever gives to the poor will not be in need, but he who hides his eyes will receive many curses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR28_28","021_28_28","PRO","28","28","28","When the wicked come to power, people hide themselves; but when they perish, the righteous flourish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_1","021_29_1","PRO","29","1","1","A man who remains stiff-necked after much reproof will suddenly be shattered beyond recovery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_2","021_29_2","PRO","29","2","2","When the righteous flourish, the people rejoice, but when the wicked rule, the people groan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_3","021_29_3","PRO","29","3","3","A man who loves wisdom brings joy to his father, but a companion of prostitutes squanders his wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_4","021_29_4","PRO","29","4","4","By justice a king brings stability to the land, but a man who exacts tribute demolishes it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_5","021_29_5","PRO","29","5","5","A man who flatters his neighbor spreads a net for his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_6","021_29_6","PRO","29","6","6","An evil man is caught by his own sin, but a righteous one sings and rejoices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_7","021_29_7","PRO","29","7","7","The righteous consider the cause of the poor, but the wicked have no regard for such concerns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_8","021_29_8","PRO","29","8","8","Mockers inflame a city, but the wise turn away anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_9","021_29_9","PRO","29","9","9","If a wise man goes to court with a fool, there will be raving and laughing with no resolution. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_10","021_29_10","PRO","29","10","10","Men of bloodshed hate a blameless man, but the upright care for his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_11","021_29_11","PRO","29","11","11","A fool vents all his anger, but a wise man holds it back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_12","021_29_12","PRO","29","12","12","If a ruler listens to lies, all his officials will be wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_13","021_29_13","PRO","29","13","13","The poor man and the oppressor have this in common: The LORD gives light to the eyes of both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_14","021_29_14","PRO","29","14","14","A king who judges the poor with fairness—his throne will be established forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_15","021_29_15","PRO","29","15","15","A rod of correction imparts wisdom, but a child left to himself disgraces his mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_16","021_29_16","PRO","29","16","16","When the wicked thrive, rebellion increases; but the righteous will see their downfall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_17","021_29_17","PRO","29","17","17","Discipline your son, and he will give you rest; he will bring delight to your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_18","021_29_18","PRO","29","18","18","Where there is no vision, the people cast off restraint; but blessed is he who keeps the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_19","021_29_19","PRO","29","19","19","A servant cannot be corrected by words alone; though he understands, he will not respond. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_20","021_29_20","PRO","29","20","20","Do you see a man who speaks in haste? There is more hope for a fool than for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_21","021_29_21","PRO","29","21","21","A servant pampered from his youth will bring grief in the end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_22","021_29_22","PRO","29","22","22","An angry man stirs up dissension, and a hot-tempered man abounds in transgression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_23","021_29_23","PRO","29","23","23","A man’s pride will bring him low, but a humble spirit will obtain honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_24","021_29_24","PRO","29","24","24","A partner to a thief hates his own soul; he receives the oath but does not testify. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_25","021_29_25","PRO","29","25","25","The fear of man is a snare, but whoever trusts in the LORD is set securely on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_26","021_29_26","PRO","29","26","26","Many seek the ruler’s favor, but a man receives justice from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR29_27","021_29_27","PRO","29","27","27","An unjust man is detestable to the righteous, and one whose way is upright is detestable to the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_1","021_30_1","PRO","30","1","1","These are the words of Agur son of Jakeh—the burden that this man declared to Ithiel: “I am weary, O God, and worn out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_2","021_30_2","PRO","30","2","2","Surely I am the most ignorant of men, and I lack the understanding of a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_3","021_30_3","PRO","30","3","3","I have not learned wisdom, and I have no knowledge of the Holy One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_4","021_30_4","PRO","30","4","4","Who has ascended to heaven and come down? Who has gathered the wind in His hands? Who has bound up the waters in His cloak? Who has established all the ends of the earth? What is His name, and what is the name of His Son—surely you know! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_5","021_30_5","PRO","30","5","5","Every word of God is flawless; He is a shield to those who take refuge in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_6","021_30_6","PRO","30","6","6","Do not add to His words, lest He rebuke you and prove you a liar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_7","021_30_7","PRO","30","7","7","Two things I ask of You—do not refuse me before I die: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_8","021_30_8","PRO","30","8","8","Keep falsehood and deceitful words far from me. Give me neither poverty nor riches; feed me with the bread that is my portion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_9","021_30_9","PRO","30","9","9","Otherwise, I may have too much and deny You, saying, ‘Who is the LORD?’ Or I may become poor and steal, profaning the name of my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_10","021_30_10","PRO","30","10","10","Do not slander a servant to his master, or he will curse you, and you will bear the guilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_11","021_30_11","PRO","30","11","11","There is a generation of those who curse their fathers and do not bless their mothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_12","021_30_12","PRO","30","12","12","There is a generation of those who are pure in their own eyes and yet unwashed of their filth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_13","021_30_13","PRO","30","13","13","There is a generation—how haughty are their eyes and pretentious are their glances— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_14","021_30_14","PRO","30","14","14","there is a generation whose teeth are swords and whose jaws are knives, devouring the oppressed from the earth and the needy from among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_15","021_30_15","PRO","30","15","15","The leech has two daughters: Give and Give. There are three things that are never satisfied, four that never say, ‘Enough!’: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_16","021_30_16","PRO","30","16","16","Sheol, the barren womb, land never satisfied with water, and fire that never says, ‘Enough!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_17","021_30_17","PRO","30","17","17","As for the eye that mocks a father and scorns obedience to a mother, may the ravens of the valley pluck it out and young vultures devour it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_18","021_30_18","PRO","30","18","18","There are three things too wonderful for me, four that I cannot understand: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_19","021_30_19","PRO","30","19","19","the way of an eagle in the sky, the way of a snake on a rock, the way of a ship at sea, and the way of a man with a maiden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_20","021_30_20","PRO","30","20","20","This is the way of an adulteress: She eats and wipes her mouth and says, ‘I have done nothing wrong.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_21","021_30_21","PRO","30","21","21","Under three things the earth trembles, under four it cannot bear up: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_22","021_30_22","PRO","30","22","22","a servant who becomes king, a fool who is filled with food, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_23","021_30_23","PRO","30","23","23","an unloved woman who marries, and a maidservant who supplants her mistress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_24","021_30_24","PRO","30","24","24","Four things on earth are small, yet they are exceedingly wise: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_25","021_30_25","PRO","30","25","25","The ants are creatures of little strength, yet they store up their food in the summer; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_26","021_30_26","PRO","30","26","26","the rock badgers are creatures of little power, yet they make their homes in the rocks; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_27","021_30_27","PRO","30","27","27","the locusts have no king, yet they all advance in formation; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_28","021_30_28","PRO","30","28","28","and the lizard can be caught in one’s hands, yet it is found in the palaces of kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_29","021_30_29","PRO","30","29","29","There are three things that are stately in their stride, and four that are impressive in their walk: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_30","021_30_30","PRO","30","30","30","a lion, mighty among beasts, refusing to retreat before anything; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_31","021_30_31","PRO","30","31","31","a strutting rooster; a he-goat; and a king with his army around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_32","021_30_32","PRO","30","32","32","If you have foolishly exalted yourself or if you have plotted evil, put your hand over your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR30_33","021_30_33","PRO","30","33","33","For as the churning of milk yields butter, and the twisting of the nose draws blood, so the stirring of anger brings forth strife.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_1","021_31_1","PRO","31","1","1","These are the words of King Lemuel—the burden that his mother taught him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_2","021_31_2","PRO","31","2","2","What shall I say, O my son? What, O son of my womb? What, O son of my vows? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_3","021_31_3","PRO","31","3","3","Do not spend your strength on women or your vigor on those who ruin kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_4","021_31_4","PRO","31","4","4","It is not for kings, O Lemuel, it is not for kings to drink wine, or for rulers to crave strong drink, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_5","021_31_5","PRO","31","5","5","lest they drink and forget what is decreed, depriving all the oppressed of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_6","021_31_6","PRO","31","6","6","Give strong drink to one who is perishing, and wine to the bitter in soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_7","021_31_7","PRO","31","7","7","Let him drink and forget his poverty, and remember his misery no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_8","021_31_8","PRO","31","8","8","Open your mouth for those with no voice, for the cause of all the dispossessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_9","021_31_9","PRO","31","9","9","Open your mouth, judge righteously, and defend the cause of the poor and needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_10","021_31_10","PRO","31","10","10","A wife of noble character, who can find? She is far more precious than rubies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_11","021_31_11","PRO","31","11","11","The heart of her husband trusts in her, and he lacks nothing of value. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_12","021_31_12","PRO","31","12","12","She brings him good and not harm all the days of her life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_13","021_31_13","PRO","31","13","13","She selects wool and flax and works with eager hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_14","021_31_14","PRO","31","14","14","She is like the merchant ships, bringing her food from afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_15","021_31_15","PRO","31","15","15","She rises while it is still night to provide food for her household and portions for her maidservants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_16","021_31_16","PRO","31","16","16","She appraises a field and buys it; from her earnings she plants a vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_17","021_31_17","PRO","31","17","17","She girds herself with strength and shows that her arms are strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_18","021_31_18","PRO","31","18","18","She sees that her gain is good, and her lamp is not extinguished at night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_19","021_31_19","PRO","31","19","19","She stretches out her hands to the distaff and grasps the spindle with her fingers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_20","021_31_20","PRO","31","20","20","She opens her arms to the poor and reaches out her hands to the needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_21","021_31_21","PRO","31","21","21","When it snows, she has no fear for her household, for they are all clothed in scarlet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_22","021_31_22","PRO","31","22","22","She makes coverings for her bed; her clothing is fine linen and purple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_23","021_31_23","PRO","31","23","23","Her husband is known at the city gates, where he sits among the elders of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_24","021_31_24","PRO","31","24","24","She makes linen garments and sells them; she delivers sashes to the merchants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_25","021_31_25","PRO","31","25","25","Strength and honor are her clothing, and she can laugh at the days to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_26","021_31_26","PRO","31","26","26","She opens her mouth with wisdom, and faithful instruction is on her tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_27","021_31_27","PRO","31","27","27","She watches over the affairs of her household and does not eat the bread of idleness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_28","021_31_28","PRO","31","28","28","Her children rise up and call her blessed; her husband praises her as well: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_29","021_31_29","PRO","31","29","29","“Many daughters have done noble things, but you surpass them all!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_30","021_31_30","PRO","31","30","30","Charm is deceptive and beauty is fleeting, but a woman who fears the LORD is to be praised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PR31_31","021_31_31","PRO","31","31","31","Give her the fruit of her hands, and let her works praise her at the gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_1","022_1_1","ECC","1","1","1","These are the words of the Teacher, the son of David, king in Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_2","022_1_2","ECC","1","2","2","“Futility of futilities,” says the Teacher, “futility of futilities! Everything is futile!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_3","022_1_3","ECC","1","3","3","What does a man gain from all his labor, at which he toils under the sun? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_4","022_1_4","ECC","1","4","4","Generations come and generations go, but the earth remains forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_5","022_1_5","ECC","1","5","5","The sun rises and the sun sets; it hurries back to where it rises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_6","022_1_6","ECC","1","6","6","The wind blows southward, then turns northward; round and round it swirls, ever returning on its course. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_7","022_1_7","ECC","1","7","7","All the rivers flow into the sea, yet the sea is never full; to the place from which the streams come, there again they flow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_8","022_1_8","ECC","1","8","8","All things are wearisome, more than one can describe; the eye is not satisfied with seeing, nor the ear content with hearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_9","022_1_9","ECC","1","9","9","What has been will be again, and what has been done will be done again; there is nothing new under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_10","022_1_10","ECC","1","10","10","Is there a case where one can say, “Look, this is new”? It has already existed in the ages before us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_11","022_1_11","ECC","1","11","11","There is no remembrance of those who came before, and those yet to come will not be remembered by those who follow after. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_12","022_1_12","ECC","1","12","12","I, the Teacher, was king over Israel in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_13","022_1_13","ECC","1","13","13","And I set my mind to seek and explore by wisdom all that is done under heaven. What a miserable task God has laid upon the sons of men to occupy them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_14","022_1_14","ECC","1","14","14","I have seen all the things that are done under the sun, and have found them all to be futile, a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_15","022_1_15","ECC","1","15","15","What is crooked cannot be straightened, and what is lacking cannot be counted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_16","022_1_16","ECC","1","16","16","I said to myself, “Behold, I have grown and increased in wisdom beyond all those before me who were over Jerusalem, and my mind has observed a wealth of wisdom and knowledge.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_17","022_1_17","ECC","1","17","17","So I set my mind to know wisdom and madness and folly; I learned that this, too, is a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC1_18","022_1_18","ECC","1","18","18","For with much wisdom comes much sorrow, and as knowledge grows, grief increases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_1","022_2_1","ECC","2","1","1","I said to myself, “Come now, I will test you with pleasure; enjoy what is good!” But it proved to be futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_2","022_2_2","ECC","2","2","2","I said of laughter, “It is folly,” and of pleasure, “What does it accomplish?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_3","022_2_3","ECC","2","3","3","I sought to cheer my body with wine and to embrace folly—my mind still guiding me with wisdom—until I could see what was worthwhile for men to do under heaven during the few days of their lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_4","022_2_4","ECC","2","4","4","I expanded my pursuits. I built houses and planted vineyards for myself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_5","022_2_5","ECC","2","5","5","I made gardens and parks for myself, where I planted all kinds of fruit trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_6","022_2_6","ECC","2","6","6","I built reservoirs to water my groves of flourishing trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_7","022_2_7","ECC","2","7","7","I acquired menservants and maidservants, and servants were born in my house. I also owned more herds and flocks than anyone in Jerusalem before me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_8","022_2_8","ECC","2","8","8","and I accumulated for myself silver and gold and the treasure of kings and provinces. I gathered to myself male and female singers, and the delights of the sons of men—many concubines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_9","022_2_9","ECC","2","9","9","So I became great and surpassed all in Jerusalem who had preceded me; and my wisdom remained with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_10","022_2_10","ECC","2","10","10","Anything my eyes desired, I did not deny myself. I refused my heart no pleasure. For my heart took delight in all my work, and this was the reward for all my labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_11","022_2_11","ECC","2","11","11","Yet when I considered all the works that my hands had accomplished and what I had toiled to achieve, I found everything to be futile, a pursuit of the wind; there was nothing to be gained under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_12","022_2_12","ECC","2","12","12","Then I turned to consider wisdom and madness and folly; for what more can the king’s successor do than what has already been accomplished? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_13","022_2_13","ECC","2","13","13","And I saw that wisdom exceeds folly, just as light exceeds darkness: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_14","022_2_14","ECC","2","14","14","The wise man has eyes in his head, but the fool walks in darkness. Yet I also came to realize that one fate overcomes them both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_15","022_2_15","ECC","2","15","15","So I said to myself, “The fate of the fool will also befall me. What then have I gained by being wise?” And I said to myself that this too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_16","022_2_16","ECC","2","16","16","For there is no lasting remembrance of the wise, just as with the fool, seeing that both will be forgotten in the days to come. Alas, the wise man will die just like the fool! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_17","022_2_17","ECC","2","17","17","So I hated life, because the work that is done under the sun was grievous to me. For everything is futile and a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_18","022_2_18","ECC","2","18","18","I hated all for which I had toiled under the sun, because I must leave it to the man who comes after me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_19","022_2_19","ECC","2","19","19","And who knows whether that man will be wise or foolish? Yet he will take over all the labor at which I have worked skillfully under the sun. This too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_20","022_2_20","ECC","2","20","20","So my heart began to despair over all the labor that I had done under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_21","022_2_21","ECC","2","21","21","When there is a man who has labored with wisdom, knowledge, and skill, and he must give his portion to a man who has not worked for it, this too is futile and a great evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_22","022_2_22","ECC","2","22","22","For what does a man get for all the toil and striving with which he labors under the sun? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_23","022_2_23","ECC","2","23","23","Indeed, all his days are filled with grief, and his task is sorrowful; even at night, his mind does not rest. This too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_24","022_2_24","ECC","2","24","24","Nothing is better for a man than to eat and drink and enjoy his work. I have also seen that this is from the hand of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_25","022_2_25","ECC","2","25","25","For apart from Him, who can eat and who can find enjoyment? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC2_26","022_2_26","ECC","2","26","26","To the man who is pleasing in His sight, He gives wisdom and knowledge and joy, but to the sinner He assigns the task of gathering and accumulating that which he will hand over to one who pleases God. This too is futile and a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_1","022_3_1","ECC","3","1","1","To everything there is a season, and a time for every purpose under heaven: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_2","022_3_2","ECC","3","2","2","a time to be born and a time to die, a time to plant and a time to uproot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_3","022_3_3","ECC","3","3","3","a time to kill and a time to heal, a time to break down and a time to build, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_4","022_3_4","ECC","3","4","4","a time to weep and a time to laugh, a time to mourn and a time to dance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_5","022_3_5","ECC","3","5","5","a time to cast away stones and a time to gather stones together, a time to embrace and a time to refrain from embracing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_6","022_3_6","ECC","3","6","6","a time to search and a time to count as lost, a time to keep and a time to discard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_7","022_3_7","ECC","3","7","7","a time to tear and a time to mend, a time to be silent and a time to speak, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_8","022_3_8","ECC","3","8","8","a time to love and a time to hate, a time for war and a time for peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_9","022_3_9","ECC","3","9","9","What does the worker gain from his toil? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_10","022_3_10","ECC","3","10","10","I have seen the burden that God has laid upon the sons of men to occupy them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_11","022_3_11","ECC","3","11","11","He has made everything beautiful in its time. He has also set eternity in the hearts of men, yet they cannot fathom the work that God has done from beginning to end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_12","022_3_12","ECC","3","12","12","I know that there is nothing better for them than to rejoice and do good while they live, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_13","022_3_13","ECC","3","13","13","and also that every man should eat and drink and find satisfaction in all his labor—this is the gift of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_14","022_3_14","ECC","3","14","14","I know that everything God does endures forever; nothing can be added to it or taken from it. God does it so that they should fear Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_15","022_3_15","ECC","3","15","15","What exists has already been, and what will be has already been, for God will call to account what has passed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_16","022_3_16","ECC","3","16","16","Furthermore, I saw under the sun that in the place of judgment there is wickedness, and in the place of righteousness there is wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_17","022_3_17","ECC","3","17","17","I said in my heart, “God will judge the righteous and the wicked, since there is a time for every activity and every deed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_18","022_3_18","ECC","3","18","18","I said to myself, “As for the sons of men, God tests them so that they may see for themselves that they are but beasts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_19","022_3_19","ECC","3","19","19","For the fates of both men and beasts are the same: As one dies, so dies the other—they all have the same breath. Man has no advantage over the animals, since everything is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_20","022_3_20","ECC","3","20","20","All go to one place; all come from dust, and all return to dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_21","022_3_21","ECC","3","21","21","Who knows if the spirit of man rises upward and the spirit of the animal descends into the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC3_22","022_3_22","ECC","3","22","22","I have seen that there is nothing better for a man than to enjoy his work, because that is his lot. For who can bring him to see what will come after him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_1","022_4_1","ECC","4","1","1","Again I looked, and I considered all the oppression taking place under the sun. I saw the tears of the oppressed, and they had no comforter; the power lay in the hands of their oppressors, and there was no comforter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_2","022_4_2","ECC","4","2","2","So I admired the dead, who had already died, above the living, who are still alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_3","022_4_3","ECC","4","3","3","But better than both is he who has not yet existed, who has not seen the evil that is done under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_4","022_4_4","ECC","4","4","4","I saw that all labor and success spring from a man’s envy of his neighbor. This too is futile and a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_5","022_4_5","ECC","4","5","5","The fool folds his hands and consumes his own flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_6","022_4_6","ECC","4","6","6","Better one handful with tranquility than two handfuls with toil and pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_7","022_4_7","ECC","4","7","7","Again, I saw futility under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_8","022_4_8","ECC","4","8","8","There is a man all alone, without even a son or brother. And though there is no end to his labor, his eyes are still not content with his wealth: “For whom do I toil and bereave my soul of enjoyment?” This too is futile—a miserable task. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_9","022_4_9","ECC","4","9","9","Two are better than one, because they have a good return for their labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_10","022_4_10","ECC","4","10","10","For if one falls down, his companion can lift him up; but pity the one who falls without another to help him up! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_11","022_4_11","ECC","4","11","11","Again, if two lie down together, they will keep warm; but how can one keep warm alone? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_12","022_4_12","ECC","4","12","12","And though one may be overpowered, two can resist. Moreover, a cord of three strands is not quickly broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_13","022_4_13","ECC","4","13","13","Better is a poor but wise youth than an old but foolish king who no longer knows how to take a warning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_14","022_4_14","ECC","4","14","14","For the youth has come from the prison to the kingship, though he was born poor in his own kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_15","022_4_15","ECC","4","15","15","I saw that all who lived and walked under the sun followed this second one, the youth who succeeded the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC4_16","022_4_16","ECC","4","16","16","There is no limit to all the people who were before them. Yet the successor will not be celebrated by those who come even later. This too is futile and a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_1","022_5_1","ECC","5","1","1","Guard your steps when you go to the house of God. Draw near to listen rather than to offer the sacrifice of fools, who do not know that they do wrong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_2","022_5_2","ECC","5","2","2","Do not be quick to speak, and do not be hasty in your heart to utter a word before God. For God is in heaven and you are on earth. So let your words be few. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_3","022_5_3","ECC","5","3","3","As a dream comes through many cares, so the speech of a fool comes with many words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_4","022_5_4","ECC","5","4","4","When you make a vow to God, do not delay in fulfilling it, because He takes no pleasure in fools. Fulfill your vow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_5","022_5_5","ECC","5","5","5","It is better not to vow than to make a vow and not fulfill it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_6","022_5_6","ECC","5","6","6","Do not let your mouth cause your flesh to sin, and do not tell the messenger that your vow was a mistake. Why should God be angry with your words and destroy the work of your hands? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_7","022_5_7","ECC","5","7","7","For as many dreams bring futility, so do many words. Therefore, fear God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_8","022_5_8","ECC","5","8","8","If you see the oppression of the poor and the denial of justice and righteousness in the province, do not be astonished at the matter; for one official is watched by a superior, and others higher still are over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_9","022_5_9","ECC","5","9","9","The produce of the earth is taken by all; the king himself profits from the fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_10","022_5_10","ECC","5","10","10","He who loves money is never satisfied by money, and he who loves wealth is never satisfied by income. This too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_11","022_5_11","ECC","5","11","11","When good things increase, so do those who consume them; what then is the profit to the owner, except to behold them with his eyes? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_12","022_5_12","ECC","5","12","12","The sleep of the worker is sweet, whether he eats little or much, but the abundance of the rich man permits him no sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_13","022_5_13","ECC","5","13","13","There is a grievous evil I have seen under the sun: wealth hoarded to the harm of its owner, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_14","022_5_14","ECC","5","14","14","or wealth lost in a failed venture, so when that man has a son there is nothing to pass on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_15","022_5_15","ECC","5","15","15","As a man came from his mother’s womb, so he will depart again, naked as he arrived. He takes nothing for his labor to carry in his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_16","022_5_16","ECC","5","16","16","This too is a grievous affliction: Exactly as a man is born, so he will depart. What does he gain as he toils for the wind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_17","022_5_17","ECC","5","17","17","Moreover, all his days he eats in darkness, with much sorrow, sickness, and anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_18","022_5_18","ECC","5","18","18","Here is what I have seen to be good and fitting: to eat and drink, and to find satisfaction in all the labor one does under the sun during the few days of life that God has given him—for this is his lot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_19","022_5_19","ECC","5","19","19","Furthermore, God has given riches and wealth to every man, and He has enabled him to enjoy them, to accept his lot, and to rejoice in his labor. This is a gift from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC5_20","022_5_20","ECC","5","20","20","For a man seldom considers the days of his life, because God keeps him occupied with the joy of his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_1","022_6_1","ECC","6","1","1","There is another evil I have seen under the sun, and it weighs heavily upon mankind: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_2","022_6_2","ECC","6","2","2","God gives a man riches, wealth, and honor, so that he lacks nothing his heart desires; but God does not allow him to enjoy them. Instead, a stranger will enjoy them. This is futile and a grievous affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_3","022_6_3","ECC","6","3","3","A man may father a hundred children and live for many years; yet no matter how long he lives, if he is unsatisfied with his prosperity and does not even receive a proper burial, I say that a stillborn child is better off than he. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_4","022_6_4","ECC","6","4","4","For a stillborn child enters in futility and departs in darkness, and his name is shrouded in obscurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_5","022_6_5","ECC","6","5","5","The child, though neither seeing the sun nor knowing anything, has more rest than that man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_6","022_6_6","ECC","6","6","6","even if he lives a thousand years twice over but fails to enjoy his prosperity. Do not all go to the same place? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_7","022_6_7","ECC","6","7","7","All a man’s labor is for his mouth, yet his appetite is never satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_8","022_6_8","ECC","6","8","8","What advantage, then, has the wise man over the fool? What gain comes to the poor man who knows how to conduct himself before others? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_9","022_6_9","ECC","6","9","9","Better what the eye can see than the wandering of desire. This too is futile and a pursuit of the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_10","022_6_10","ECC","6","10","10","Whatever exists was named long ago, and it is known what man is; but he cannot contend with one stronger than he. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_11","022_6_11","ECC","6","11","11","For the more words, the more futility—and how does that profit anyone? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC6_12","022_6_12","ECC","6","12","12","For who knows what is good for a man during the few days in which he passes through his fleeting life like a shadow? Who can tell a man what will come after him under the sun? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_1","022_7_1","ECC","7","1","1","A good name is better than fine perfume, and one’s day of death is better than his day of birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_2","022_7_2","ECC","7","2","2","It is better to enter a house of mourning than a house of feasting, since death is the end of every man, and the living should take this to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_3","022_7_3","ECC","7","3","3","Sorrow is better than laughter, for a sad countenance is good for the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_4","022_7_4","ECC","7","4","4","The heart of the wise is in the house of mourning, but the heart of fools is in the house of pleasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_5","022_7_5","ECC","7","5","5","It is better to heed a wise man’s rebuke than to listen to the song of fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_6","022_7_6","ECC","7","6","6","For like the crackling of thorns under the pot, so is the laughter of the fool. This too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_7","022_7_7","ECC","7","7","7","Surely extortion turns a wise man into a fool, and a bribe corrupts the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_8","022_7_8","ECC","7","8","8","The end of a matter is better than the beginning, and a patient spirit is better than a proud one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_9","022_7_9","ECC","7","9","9","Do not be quickly provoked in your spirit, for anger settles in the lap of a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_10","022_7_10","ECC","7","10","10","Do not say, “Why were the old days better than these?” For it is unwise of you to ask about this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_11","022_7_11","ECC","7","11","11","Wisdom, like an inheritance, is good, and it benefits those who see the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_12","022_7_12","ECC","7","12","12","For wisdom, like money, is a shelter, and the advantage of knowledge is that wisdom preserves the life of its owner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_13","022_7_13","ECC","7","13","13","Consider the work of God: Who can straighten what He has bent? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_14","022_7_14","ECC","7","14","14","In the day of prosperity, be joyful, but in the day of adversity, consider this: God has made one of these along with the other, so that a man cannot discover anything that will come after him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_15","022_7_15","ECC","7","15","15","In my futile life I have seen both of these: A righteous man perishing in his righteousness, and a wicked man living long in his wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_16","022_7_16","ECC","7","16","16","Do not be overly righteous, and do not make yourself too wise. Why should you destroy yourself? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_17","022_7_17","ECC","7","17","17","Do not be excessively wicked, and do not be a fool. Why should you die before your time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_18","022_7_18","ECC","7","18","18","It is good to grasp the one and not let the other slip from your hand. For he who fears God will follow both warnings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_19","022_7_19","ECC","7","19","19","Wisdom makes the wise man stronger than ten rulers in a city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_20","022_7_20","ECC","7","20","20","Surely there is no righteous man on earth who does good and never sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_21","022_7_21","ECC","7","21","21","Do not pay attention to every word that is spoken, or you may hear your servant cursing you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_22","022_7_22","ECC","7","22","22","For you know in your heart that many times you yourself have cursed others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_23","022_7_23","ECC","7","23","23","All this I tested by wisdom, saying, “I resolve to be wise.” But it was beyond me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_24","022_7_24","ECC","7","24","24","What exists is out of reach and very deep. Who can fathom it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_25","022_7_25","ECC","7","25","25","I directed my mind to understand, to explore, to search out wisdom and explanations, and to understand the stupidity of wickedness and the folly of madness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_26","022_7_26","ECC","7","26","26","And I find more bitter than death the woman who is a snare, whose heart is a net, and whose hands are chains. The man who pleases God escapes her, but the sinner is ensnared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_27","022_7_27","ECC","7","27","27","“Behold,” says the Teacher, “I have discovered this by adding one thing to another to find an explanation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_28","022_7_28","ECC","7","28","28","While my soul was still searching but not finding, among a thousand I have found one upright man, but among all these I have not found one such woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC7_29","022_7_29","ECC","7","29","29","Only this have I found: I have discovered that God made mankind upright, but they have sought out many schemes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_1","022_8_1","ECC","8","1","1","Who is like the wise man? Who knows the interpretation of a matter? A man’s wisdom brightens his face, and the sternness of his face is changed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_2","022_8_2","ECC","8","2","2","Keep the king’s command, I say, because of your oath before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_3","022_8_3","ECC","8","3","3","Do not hasten to leave his presence, and do not persist in a bad cause, for he will do whatever he pleases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_4","022_8_4","ECC","8","4","4","For the king’s word is supreme, and who can say to him, “What are you doing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_5","022_8_5","ECC","8","5","5","Whoever keeps his command will come to no harm, and a wise heart knows the right time and procedure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_6","022_8_6","ECC","8","6","6","For there is a right time and procedure to every purpose, though a man’s misery weighs heavily upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_7","022_8_7","ECC","8","7","7","Since no one knows what will happen, who can tell him what is to come? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_8","022_8_8","ECC","8","8","8","As no man has power over the wind to contain it, so no one has authority over his day of death. As no one can be discharged in wartime, so wickedness will not release those who practice it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_9","022_8_9","ECC","8","9","9","All this I have seen, applying my mind to every deed that is done under the sun; there is a time when one man lords it over another to his own detriment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_10","022_8_10","ECC","8","10","10","Then too, I saw the burial of the wicked who used to go in and out of the holy place, and they were praised in the city where they had done so. This too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_11","022_8_11","ECC","8","11","11","When the sentence for a crime is not speedily executed, the hearts of men become fully set on doing evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_12","022_8_12","ECC","8","12","12","Although a sinner does evil a hundred times and still lives long, yet I also know that it will go well with those who fear God, who are reverent in His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_13","022_8_13","ECC","8","13","13","Yet because the wicked do not fear God, it will not go well with them, and their days will not lengthen like a shadow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_14","022_8_14","ECC","8","14","14","There is a futility that is done on the earth: There are righteous men who get what the actions of the wicked deserve, and there are wicked men who get what the actions of the righteous deserve. I say that this too is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_15","022_8_15","ECC","8","15","15","So I commended the enjoyment of life, because there is nothing better for a man under the sun than to eat and drink and be merry. For this joy will accompany him in his labor during the days of his life that God gives him under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_16","022_8_16","ECC","8","16","16","When I applied my mind to know wisdom and to observe the task that one performs on the earth—though his eyes do not see sleep in the day or even in the night— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC8_17","022_8_17","ECC","8","17","17","I saw every work of God, and that a man is unable to comprehend the work that is done under the sun. Despite his efforts to search it out, he cannot find its meaning; even if the wise man claims to know, he is unable to comprehend. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_1","022_9_1","ECC","9","1","1","So I took all this to heart and concluded that the righteous and the wise, as well as their deeds, are in God’s hands. Man does not know what lies ahead, whether love or hate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_2","022_9_2","ECC","9","2","2","It is the same for all: There is a common fate for the righteous and the wicked, for the good and the bad, for the clean and the unclean, for the one who sacrifices and the one who does not. As it is for the good, so it is for the sinner; as it is for the one who makes a vow, so it is for the one who refuses to take a vow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_3","022_9_3","ECC","9","3","3","This is an evil in everything that is done under the sun: There is one fate for everyone. Furthermore, the hearts of men are full of evil and madness while they are alive, and afterward they join the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_4","022_9_4","ECC","9","4","4","There is hope, however, for anyone who is among the living; for even a live dog is better than a dead lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_5","022_9_5","ECC","9","5","5","For the living know that they will die, but the dead know nothing. They have no further reward, because the memory of them is forgotten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_6","022_9_6","ECC","9","6","6","Their love, their hate, and their envy have already vanished, and they will never again have a share in all that is done under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_7","022_9_7","ECC","9","7","7","Go, eat your bread with joy, and drink your wine with a cheerful heart, for God has already approved your works: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_8","022_9_8","ECC","9","8","8","Let your garments always be white, and never spare the oil for your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_9","022_9_9","ECC","9","9","9","Enjoy life with your beloved wife all the days of the fleeting life that God has given you under the sun—all your fleeting days. For this is your portion in life and in your labor under the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_10","022_9_10","ECC","9","10","10","Whatever you find to do with your hands, do it with all your might, for in Sheol, where you are going, there is no work or planning or knowledge or wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_11","022_9_11","ECC","9","11","11","I saw something else under the sun: The race is not to the swift, nor the battle to the strong; neither is the bread to the wise, nor the wealth to the intelligent, nor the favor to the skillful. For time and chance happen to all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_12","022_9_12","ECC","9","12","12","For surely no man knows his time: Like fish caught in a cruel net or birds trapped in a snare, so men are ensnared in an evil time that suddenly falls upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_13","022_9_13","ECC","9","13","13","I have also seen this wisdom under the sun, and it was great to me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_14","022_9_14","ECC","9","14","14","There was a small city with few men. A mighty king came against it, surrounded it, and built large siege ramps against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_15","022_9_15","ECC","9","15","15","Now a poor wise man was found in the city, and he saved the city by his wisdom. Yet no one remembered that poor man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_16","022_9_16","ECC","9","16","16","And I said, “Wisdom is better than strength, but the wisdom of the poor man is despised, and his words are not heeded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_17","022_9_17","ECC","9","17","17","The calm words of the wise are heeded over the shouts of a ruler among fools. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC9_18","022_9_18","ECC","9","18","18","Wisdom is better than weapons of war, but one sinner destroys much good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_1","022_10_1","ECC","10","1","1","As dead flies bring a stench to the perfumer’s oil, so a little folly outweighs wisdom and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_2","022_10_2","ECC","10","2","2","A wise man’s heart inclines to the right, but the heart of a fool to the left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_3","022_10_3","ECC","10","3","3","Even as the fool walks along the road, his sense is lacking, and he shows everyone that he is a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_4","022_10_4","ECC","10","4","4","If the ruler’s temper flares against you, do not abandon your post, for calmness lays great offenses to rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_5","022_10_5","ECC","10","5","5","There is an evil I have seen under the sun—an error that proceeds from the ruler: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_6","022_10_6","ECC","10","6","6","Folly is appointed to great heights, but the rich sit in lowly positions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_7","022_10_7","ECC","10","7","7","I have seen slaves on horseback, while princes go on foot like slaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_8","022_10_8","ECC","10","8","8","He who digs a pit may fall into it, and he who breaches a wall may be bitten by a snake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_9","022_10_9","ECC","10","9","9","The one who quarries stones may be injured by them, and he who splits logs endangers himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_10","022_10_10","ECC","10","10","10","If the axe is dull and the blade unsharpened, more strength must be exerted, but skill produces success. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_11","022_10_11","ECC","10","11","11","If the snake bites before it is charmed, there is no profit for the charmer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_12","022_10_12","ECC","10","12","12","The words of a wise man’s mouth are gracious, but the lips of a fool consume him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_13","022_10_13","ECC","10","13","13","The beginning of his talk is folly, and the end of his speech is evil madness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_14","022_10_14","ECC","10","14","14","Yet the fool multiplies words. No one knows what is coming, and who can tell him what will come after him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_15","022_10_15","ECC","10","15","15","The toil of a fool wearies him, for he does not know the way to the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_16","022_10_16","ECC","10","16","16","Woe to you, O land whose king is a youth, and whose princes feast in the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_17","022_10_17","ECC","10","17","17","Blessed are you, O land whose king is a son of nobles, and whose princes feast at the proper time—for strength and not for drunkenness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_18","022_10_18","ECC","10","18","18","Through laziness the roof caves in, and in the hands of the idle, the house leaks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_19","022_10_19","ECC","10","19","19","A feast is prepared for laughter, and wine makes life merry, but money is the answer for everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC10_20","022_10_20","ECC","10","20","20","Do not curse the king even in your thoughts, or curse the rich even in your bedroom, for a bird of the air may carry your words, and a winged creature may report your speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_1","022_11_1","ECC","11","1","1","Cast your bread upon the waters, for after many days you will find it again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_2","022_11_2","ECC","11","2","2","Divide your portion among seven, or even eight, for you do not know what disaster may befall the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_3","022_11_3","ECC","11","3","3","If the clouds are full, they will pour out rain upon the earth; whether a tree falls to the south or to the north, in the place where it falls, there it will lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_4","022_11_4","ECC","11","4","4","He who watches the wind will fail to sow, and he who observes the clouds will fail to reap. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_5","022_11_5","ECC","11","5","5","As you do not know the path of the wind, or how the bones are formed in a mother’s womb, so you cannot understand the work of God, the Maker of all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_6","022_11_6","ECC","11","6","6","Sow your seed in the morning, and do not rest your hands in the evening, for you do not know which will succeed, whether this or that, or if both will equally prosper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_7","022_11_7","ECC","11","7","7","Light is sweet, and it pleases the eyes to see the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_8","022_11_8","ECC","11","8","8","So if a man lives many years, let him rejoice in them all. But let him remember the days of darkness, for they will be many. Everything to come is futile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_9","022_11_9","ECC","11","9","9","Rejoice, O young man, while you are young, and let your heart be glad in the days of your youth. Walk in the ways of your heart and in the sight of your eyes, but know that for all these things God will bring you to judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC11_10","022_11_10","ECC","11","10","10","So banish sorrow from your heart, and cast off pain from your body, for youth and vigor are fleeting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_1","022_12_1","ECC","12","1","1","Remember your Creator in the days of your youth, before the days of adversity come and the years approach of which you will say, “I find no pleasure in them,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_2","022_12_2","ECC","12","2","2","before the light of the sun, moon, and stars is darkened, and the clouds return after the rain, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_3","022_12_3","ECC","12","3","3","on the day the keepers of the house tremble and the strong men stoop, when those grinding cease because they are few and those watching through windows see dimly, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_4","022_12_4","ECC","12","4","4","when the doors to the street are shut and the sound of the mill fades away, when one rises at the sound of a bird and all the daughters of song grow faint, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_5","022_12_5","ECC","12","5","5","when men fear the heights and dangers of the road, when the almond tree blossoms, the grasshopper loses its spring, and the caper berry shrivels—for then man goes to his eternal home and mourners walk the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_6","022_12_6","ECC","12","6","6","Remember Him before the silver cord is snapped and the golden bowl is crushed, before the pitcher is shattered at the spring and the wheel is broken at the well, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_7","022_12_7","ECC","12","7","7","before the dust returns to the ground from which it came and the spirit returns to God who gave it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_8","022_12_8","ECC","12","8","8","“Futility of futilities,” says the Teacher. “Everything is futile!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_9","022_12_9","ECC","12","9","9","Not only was the Teacher wise, but he also taught the people knowledge; he pondered, searched out, and arranged many proverbs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_10","022_12_10","ECC","12","10","10","The Teacher searched to find delightful sayings and to record accurate words of truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_11","022_12_11","ECC","12","11","11","The words of the wise are like goads, and the anthologies of the masters are like firmly embedded nails driven by a single Shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_12","022_12_12","ECC","12","12","12","And by these, my son, be further warned: There is no end to the making of many books, and much study wearies the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_13","022_12_13","ECC","12","13","13","When all has been heard, the conclusion of the matter is this: Fear God and keep His commandments, because this is the whole duty of man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EC12_14","022_12_14","ECC","12","14","14","For God will bring every deed into judgment, along with every hidden thing, whether good or evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_1","023_1_1","SNG","1","1","1","This is Solomon’s Song of Songs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_2","023_1_2","SNG","1","2","2","Let him kiss me with the kisses of his mouth! For your love is more delightful than wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_3","023_1_3","SNG","1","3","3","The fragrance of your perfume is pleasing; your name is like perfume poured out. No wonder the maidens adore you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_4","023_1_4","SNG","1","4","4","Take me away with you—let us hurry! May the king bring me to his chambers. We will rejoice and delight in you; we will praise your love more than wine. It is only right that they adore you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_5","023_1_5","SNG","1","5","5","I am dark, yet lovely, O daughters of Jerusalem, like the tents of Kedar, like the curtains of Solomon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_6","023_1_6","SNG","1","6","6","Do not stare because I am dark, for the sun has gazed upon me. My mother’s sons were angry with me; they made me a keeper of the vineyards, but my own vineyard I have neglected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_7","023_1_7","SNG","1","7","7","Tell me, O one I love, where do you pasture your sheep? Where do you rest them at midday? Why should I be like a veiled woman beside the flocks of your companions? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_8","023_1_8","SNG","1","8","8","If you do not know, O fairest of women, follow the tracks of the flock, and graze your young goats near the tents of the shepherds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_9","023_1_9","SNG","1","9","9","I compare you, my darling, to a mare among Pharaoh’s chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_10","023_1_10","SNG","1","10","10","Your cheeks are beautiful with ornaments, your neck with strings of jewels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_11","023_1_11","SNG","1","11","11","We will make you ornaments of gold, studded with beads of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_12","023_1_12","SNG","1","12","12","While the king was at his table, my perfume spread its fragrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_13","023_1_13","SNG","1","13","13","My beloved is to me a sachet of myrrh resting between my breasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_14","023_1_14","SNG","1","14","14","My beloved is to me a cluster of henna blossoms in the vineyards of En-gedi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_15","023_1_15","SNG","1","15","15","How beautiful you are, my darling! Oh, how very beautiful! Your eyes are like doves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_16","023_1_16","SNG","1","16","16","How handsome you are, my beloved! Oh, how delightful! The soft grass is our bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS1_17","023_1_17","SNG","1","17","17","The beams of our house are cedars; our rafters are fragrant firs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_1","023_2_1","SNG","2","1","1","I am a rose of Sharon, a lily of the valley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_2","023_2_2","SNG","2","2","2","Like a lily among the thorns is my darling among the maidens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_3","023_2_3","SNG","2","3","3","Like an apple tree among the trees of the forest is my beloved among the young men. I delight to sit in his shade, and his fruit is sweet to my taste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_4","023_2_4","SNG","2","4","4","He has brought me to the house of wine, and his banner over me is love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_5","023_2_5","SNG","2","5","5","Sustain me with raisins; refresh me with apples, for I am faint with love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_6","023_2_6","SNG","2","6","6","His left hand is under my head, and his right arm embraces me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_7","023_2_7","SNG","2","7","7","O daughters of Jerusalem, I adjure you by the gazelles and does of the field: Do not arouse or awaken love until the time is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_8","023_2_8","SNG","2","8","8","Listen! My beloved approaches. Look! Here he comes, leaping across the mountains, bounding over the hills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_9","023_2_9","SNG","2","9","9","My beloved is like a gazelle or a young stag. Look, he stands behind our wall, gazing through the windows, peering through the lattice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_10","023_2_10","SNG","2","10","10","My beloved calls to me, “Arise, my darling. Come away with me, my beautiful one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_11","023_2_11","SNG","2","11","11","For now the winter is past; the rain is over and gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_12","023_2_12","SNG","2","12","12","The flowers have appeared in the countryside; the season of singing has come, and the cooing of turtledoves is heard in our land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_13","023_2_13","SNG","2","13","13","The fig tree ripens its figs; the blossoming vines spread their fragrance. Arise, come away, my darling; come away with me, my beautiful one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_14","023_2_14","SNG","2","14","14","O my dove in the clefts of the rock, in the crevices of the cliff, let me see your face, let me hear your voice; for your voice is sweet, and your countenance is lovely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_15","023_2_15","SNG","2","15","15","Catch for us the foxes—the little foxes that ruin the vineyards—for our vineyards are in bloom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_16","023_2_16","SNG","2","16","16","My beloved is mine and I am his; he pastures his flock among the lilies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS2_17","023_2_17","SNG","2","17","17","Before the day breaks and shadows flee, turn, my beloved, and be like a gazelle or a young stag on the mountains of Bether. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_1","023_3_1","SNG","3","1","1","On my bed at night I sought the one I love; I sought him, but did not find him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_2","023_3_2","SNG","3","2","2","I will arise now and go about the city, through the streets and squares. I will seek the one I love. So I sought him but did not find him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_3","023_3_3","SNG","3","3","3","I encountered the watchmen on their rounds of the city: “Have you seen the one I love?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_4","023_3_4","SNG","3","4","4","I had just passed them when I found the one I love. I held him and would not let go until I had brought him to my mother’s house, to the chamber of the one who conceived me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_5","023_3_5","SNG","3","5","5","O daughters of Jerusalem, I adjure you by the gazelles and does of the field: Do not arouse or awaken love until the time is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_6","023_3_6","SNG","3","6","6","Who is this coming up from the wilderness like a column of smoke, scented with myrrh and frankincense from all the spices of the merchant? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_7","023_3_7","SNG","3","7","7","Behold, it is Solomon’s carriage, escorted by sixty of the mightiest men of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_8","023_3_8","SNG","3","8","8","All are skilled with the sword, experienced in warfare. Each has his sword at his side prepared for the terror of the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_9","023_3_9","SNG","3","9","9","King Solomon has made his carriage out of the timber of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_10","023_3_10","SNG","3","10","10","He has made its posts of silver, its base of gold, its seat of purple fabric. Its interior is inlaid with love by the daughters of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS3_11","023_3_11","SNG","3","11","11","Come out, O daughters of Zion, and gaze at King Solomon, wearing the crown with which his mother crowned him on the day of his wedding—the day of his heart’s rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_1","023_4_1","SNG","4","1","1","How beautiful you are, my darling—how very beautiful! Your eyes are like doves behind your veil. Your hair is like a flock of goats streaming down Mount Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_2","023_4_2","SNG","4","2","2","Your teeth are like a flock of newly shorn sheep coming up from the washing; each has its twin, and not one of them is lost. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_3","023_4_3","SNG","4","3","3","Your lips are like a scarlet ribbon, and your mouth is lovely. Your brow behind your veil is like a slice of pomegranate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_4","023_4_4","SNG","4","4","4","Your neck is like the tower of David, built with rows of stones; on it hang a thousand shields, all of them shields of warriors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_5","023_4_5","SNG","4","5","5","Your breasts are like two fawns, twins of a gazelle grazing among the lilies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_6","023_4_6","SNG","4","6","6","Before the day breaks and the shadows flee, I will make my way to the mountain of myrrh and to the hill of frankincense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_7","023_4_7","SNG","4","7","7","You are altogether beautiful, my darling; in you there is no flaw. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_8","023_4_8","SNG","4","8","8","Come with me from Lebanon, my bride, come with me from Lebanon! Descend from the peak of Amana, from the summits of Senir and Hermon, from the dens of the lions, from the mountains of the leopards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_9","023_4_9","SNG","4","9","9","You have captured my heart, my sister, my bride; you have stolen my heart with one glance of your eyes, with one jewel of your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_10","023_4_10","SNG","4","10","10","How delightful is your love, my sister, my bride! Your love is much better than wine, and the fragrance of your perfume than all spices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_11","023_4_11","SNG","4","11","11","Your lips, my bride, drip sweetness like the honeycomb; honey and milk are under your tongue, and the fragrance of your garments is like the aroma of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_12","023_4_12","SNG","4","12","12","My sister, my bride, you are a garden locked up, a spring enclosed, a fountain sealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_13","023_4_13","SNG","4","13","13","Your branches are an orchard of pomegranates with the choicest of fruits, with henna and nard, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_14","023_4_14","SNG","4","14","14","with nard and saffron, with calamus and cinnamon, with every kind of frankincense tree, with myrrh and aloes, with all the finest spices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_15","023_4_15","SNG","4","15","15","You are a garden spring, a well of fresh water flowing down from Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS4_16","023_4_16","SNG","4","16","16","Awake, O north wind, and come, O south wind. Breathe on my garden and spread the fragrance of its spices. Let my beloved come into his garden and taste its choicest fruits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_1","023_5_1","SNG","5","1","1","I have come to my garden, my sister, my bride; I have gathered my myrrh with my spice. I have eaten my honeycomb with my honey; I have drunk my wine with my milk. Eat, O friends, and drink; drink freely, O beloved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_2","023_5_2","SNG","5","2","2","I sleep, but my heart is awake. A sound! My beloved is knocking: “Open to me, my sister, my darling, my dove, my flawless one. My head is drenched with dew, my hair with the dampness of the night.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_3","023_5_3","SNG","5","3","3","I have taken off my robe—must I put it back on? I have washed my feet—must I soil them again? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_4","023_5_4","SNG","5","4","4","My beloved put his hand to the latch; my heart pounded for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_5","023_5_5","SNG","5","5","5","I rose up to open for my beloved. My hands dripped with myrrh, my fingers with flowing myrrh on the handles of the bolt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_6","023_5_6","SNG","5","6","6","I opened for my beloved, but he had turned and gone. My heart sank at his departure. I sought him but did not find him. I called, but he did not answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_7","023_5_7","SNG","5","7","7","I encountered the watchmen on their rounds of the city. They beat me and bruised me; they took away my cloak, those guardians of the walls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_8","023_5_8","SNG","5","8","8","O daughters of Jerusalem, I adjure you, if you find my beloved, tell him I am sick with love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_9","023_5_9","SNG","5","9","9","How is your beloved better than others, O most beautiful among women? How is your beloved better than another, that you charge us so? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_10","023_5_10","SNG","5","10","10","My beloved is dazzling and ruddy, outstanding among ten thousand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_11","023_5_11","SNG","5","11","11","His head is purest gold; his hair is wavy and black as a raven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_12","023_5_12","SNG","5","12","12","His eyes are like doves beside the streams of water, bathed in milk and mounted like jewels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_13","023_5_13","SNG","5","13","13","His cheeks are like beds of spice, towers of perfume. His lips are like lilies, dripping with flowing myrrh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_14","023_5_14","SNG","5","14","14","His arms are rods of gold set with beryl. His body is polished ivory bedecked with sapphires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_15","023_5_15","SNG","5","15","15","His legs are pillars of marble set on bases of pure gold. His appearance is like Lebanon, as majestic as the cedars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS5_16","023_5_16","SNG","5","16","16","His mouth is most sweet; he is altogether lovely. This is my beloved, and this is my friend, O daughters of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_1","023_6_1","SNG","6","1","1","Where has your beloved gone, O most beautiful among women? Which way has he turned? We will seek him with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_2","023_6_2","SNG","6","2","2","My beloved has gone down to his garden, to the beds of spices, to pasture his flock in the gardens and to gather lilies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_3","023_6_3","SNG","6","3","3","I belong to my beloved and he belongs to me; he pastures his flock among the lilies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_4","023_6_4","SNG","6","4","4","You are as beautiful, my darling, as Tirzah, as lovely as Jerusalem, as majestic as troops with banners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_5","023_6_5","SNG","6","5","5","Turn your eyes away from me, for they have overcome me. Your hair is like a flock of goats streaming down from Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_6","023_6_6","SNG","6","6","6","Your teeth are like a flock of sheep coming up from the washing; each has its twin, and not one of them is lost. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_7","023_6_7","SNG","6","7","7","Your brow behind your veil is like a slice of pomegranate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_8","023_6_8","SNG","6","8","8","There are sixty queens and eighty concubines, and maidens without number, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_9","023_6_9","SNG","6","9","9","but my dove, my perfect one, is unique, the favorite of the mother who bore her. The maidens see her and call her blessed; the queens and concubines sing her praises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_10","023_6_10","SNG","6","10","10","Who is this who shines like the dawn, as fair as the moon, as bright as the sun, as majestic as the stars in procession? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_11","023_6_11","SNG","6","11","11","I went down to the walnut grove to see the blossoms of the valley, to see if the vines were budding or the pomegranates were in bloom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_12","023_6_12","SNG","6","12","12","Before I realized it, my desire had set me among the royal chariots of my people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS6_13","023_6_13","SNG","6","13","13","Come back, come back, O Shulammite! Come back, come back, that we may gaze upon you. Why do you look at the Shulammite, as on the dance of Mahanaim? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_1","023_7_1","SNG","7","1","1","How beautiful are your sandaled feet, O daughter of the prince! The curves of your thighs are like jewels, the handiwork of a master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_2","023_7_2","SNG","7","2","2","Your navel is a rounded goblet; it never lacks blended wine. Your waist is a mound of wheat encircled by the lilies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_3","023_7_3","SNG","7","3","3","Your breasts are like two fawns, twins of a gazelle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_4","023_7_4","SNG","7","4","4","Your neck is like a tower made of ivory; your eyes are like the pools of Heshbon by the gate of Bath-rabbim; your nose is like the tower of Lebanon, facing toward Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_5","023_7_5","SNG","7","5","5","Your head crowns you like Mount Carmel, the hair of your head like purple threads; the king is captured in your tresses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_6","023_7_6","SNG","7","6","6","How fair and pleasant you are, O love, with your delights! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_7","023_7_7","SNG","7","7","7","Your stature is like a palm tree; your breasts are clusters of fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_8","023_7_8","SNG","7","8","8","I said, “I will climb the palm tree; I will take hold of its fruit.” May your breasts be like clusters of the vine, the fragrance of your breath like apples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_9","023_7_9","SNG","7","9","9","and your mouth like the finest wine. May it flow smoothly to my beloved, gliding gently over lips and teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_10","023_7_10","SNG","7","10","10","I belong to my beloved, and his desire is for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_11","023_7_11","SNG","7","11","11","Come, my beloved, let us go to the countryside; let us spend the night among the wildflowers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_12","023_7_12","SNG","7","12","12","Let us go early to the vineyards to see if the vine has budded, if the blossom has opened, if the pomegranates are in bloom—there I will give you my love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS7_13","023_7_13","SNG","7","13","13","The mandrakes send forth a fragrance, and at our door is every delicacy, new as well as old, that I have treasured up for you, my beloved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_1","023_8_1","SNG","8","1","1","O that you were to me like a brother who nursed at my mother’s breasts! If I found you outdoors, I would kiss you, and no one would despise me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_2","023_8_2","SNG","8","2","2","I would lead you and bring you to the house of my mother who taught me. I would give you spiced wine to drink, the nectar of my pomegranates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_3","023_8_3","SNG","8","3","3","His left hand is under my head, and his right arm embraces me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_4","023_8_4","SNG","8","4","4","O daughters of Jerusalem, I adjure you: Do not arouse or awaken love until the time is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_5","023_8_5","SNG","8","5","5","Who is this coming up from the wilderness, leaning on her beloved? I roused you under the apple tree; there your mother conceived you; there she travailed and brought you forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_6","023_8_6","SNG","8","6","6","Set me as a seal over your heart, as a seal upon your arm. For love is as strong as death, its jealousy as unrelenting as Sheol. Its sparks are fiery flames, the fiercest blaze of all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_7","023_8_7","SNG","8","7","7","Mighty waters cannot quench love; rivers cannot sweep it away. If a man were to give all the wealth of his house for love, his offer would be utterly scorned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_8","023_8_8","SNG","8","8","8","We have a little sister, and her breasts are not yet grown. What shall we do for our sister on the day she is spoken for? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_9","023_8_9","SNG","8","9","9","If she is a wall, we will build a tower of silver upon her. If she is a door, we will enclose her with panels of cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_10","023_8_10","SNG","8","10","10","I am a wall, and my breasts are like towers. So I have become in his eyes like one who brings peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_11","023_8_11","SNG","8","11","11","Solomon had a vineyard in Baal-hamon. He leased it to the tenants. For its fruit, each was to bring a thousand shekels of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_12","023_8_12","SNG","8","12","12","But my own vineyard is mine to give; the thousand shekels are for you, O Solomon, and two hundred are for those who tend its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_13","023_8_13","SNG","8","13","13","You who dwell in the gardens, my companions are listening for your voice. Let me hear it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("SS8_14","023_8_14","SNG","8","14","14","Come away, my beloved, and be like a gazelle or a young stag on the mountains of spices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_1","024_1_1","ISA","1","1","1","This is the vision concerning Judah and Jerusalem that Isaiah son of Amoz saw during the reigns of Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah, kings of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_2","024_1_2","ISA","1","2","2","Listen, O heavens, and give ear, O earth, for the LORD has spoken: “I have raised children and brought them up, but they have rebelled against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_3","024_1_3","ISA","1","3","3","The ox knows its owner, and the donkey its master’s manger, but Israel does not know; My people do not understand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_4","024_1_4","ISA","1","4","4","Alas, O sinful nation, a people laden with iniquity, a brood of evildoers, children who act corruptly! They have forsaken the LORD; they have despised the Holy One of Israel and turned their backs on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_5","024_1_5","ISA","1","5","5","Why do you want more beatings? Why do you keep rebelling? Your head has a massive wound, and your whole heart is afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_6","024_1_6","ISA","1","6","6","From the sole of your foot to the top of your head, there is no soundness—only wounds and welts and festering sores neither cleansed nor bandaged nor soothed with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_7","024_1_7","ISA","1","7","7","Your land is desolate; your cities are burned with fire. Foreigners devour your fields before you—a desolation demolished by strangers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_8","024_1_8","ISA","1","8","8","And the Daughter of Zion is abandoned like a shelter in a vineyard, like a shack in a cucumber field, like a city besieged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_9","024_1_9","ISA","1","9","9","Unless the LORD of Hosts had left us a few survivors, we would have become like Sodom, we would have resembled Gomorrah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_10","024_1_10","ISA","1","10","10","Hear the word of the LORD, you rulers of Sodom; listen to the instruction of our God, you people of Gomorrah! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_11","024_1_11","ISA","1","11","11","“What good to Me is your multitude of sacrifices?” says the LORD. “I am full from the burnt offerings of rams and the fat of well-fed cattle; I take no delight in the blood of bulls and lambs and goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_12","024_1_12","ISA","1","12","12","When you come to appear before Me, who has required this of you—this trampling of My courts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_13","024_1_13","ISA","1","13","13","Bring your worthless offerings no more; your incense is detestable to Me. New Moons, Sabbaths, and convocations—I cannot endure iniquity in a solemn assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_14","024_1_14","ISA","1","14","14","I hate your New Moons and your appointed feasts. They have become a burden to Me; I am weary of bearing them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_15","024_1_15","ISA","1","15","15","When you spread out your hands in prayer, I will hide My eyes from you; even though you multiply your prayers, I will not listen. Your hands are covered with blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_16","024_1_16","ISA","1","16","16","Wash and cleanse yourselves. Remove your evil deeds from My sight. Stop doing evil! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_17","024_1_17","ISA","1","17","17","Learn to do right; seek justice and correct the oppressor. Defend the fatherless and plead the case of the widow.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_18","024_1_18","ISA","1","18","18","“Come now, let us reason together,” says the LORD. “Though your sins are like scarlet, they will be as white as snow; though they are as red as crimson, they will become like wool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_19","024_1_19","ISA","1","19","19","If you are willing and obedient, you will eat the best of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_20","024_1_20","ISA","1","20","20","But if you resist and rebel, you will be devoured by the sword.” For the mouth of the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_21","024_1_21","ISA","1","21","21","See how the faithful city has become a harlot! She once was full of justice; righteousness resided within her, but now only murderers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_22","024_1_22","ISA","1","22","22","Your silver has become dross; your fine wine is diluted with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_23","024_1_23","ISA","1","23","23","Your rulers are rebels, friends of thieves. They all love bribes and chasing after rewards. They do not defend the fatherless, and the plea of the widow never comes before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_24","024_1_24","ISA","1","24","24","Therefore the Lord GOD of Hosts, the Mighty One of Israel, declares: “Ah, I will be relieved of My foes and avenge Myself on My enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_25","024_1_25","ISA","1","25","25","I will turn My hand against you; I will thoroughly purge your dross; I will remove all your impurities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_26","024_1_26","ISA","1","26","26","I will restore your judges as at first, and your counselors as at the beginning. After that you will be called the City of Righteousness, the Faithful City.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_27","024_1_27","ISA","1","27","27","Zion will be redeemed with justice, her repentant ones with righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_28","024_1_28","ISA","1","28","28","But rebels and sinners will together be shattered, and those who forsake the LORD will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_29","024_1_29","ISA","1","29","29","Surely you will be ashamed of the sacred oaks in which you have delighted; you will be embarrassed by the gardens that you have chosen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_30","024_1_30","ISA","1","30","30","For you will become like an oak whose leaves are withered, like a garden without water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS1_31","024_1_31","ISA","1","31","31","The strong man will become tinder and his work will be a spark; both will burn together, with no one to quench the flames. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_1","024_2_1","ISA","2","1","1","This is the message that was revealed to Isaiah son of Amoz concerning Judah and Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_2","024_2_2","ISA","2","2","2","In the last days the mountain of the house of the LORD will be established as the chief of the mountains; it will be raised above the hills, and all nations will stream to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_3","024_2_3","ISA","2","3","3","And many peoples will come and say: “Come, let us go up to the mountain of the LORD, to the house of the God of Jacob. He will teach us His ways so that we may walk in His paths.” For the law will go forth from Zion, and the word of the LORD from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_4","024_2_4","ISA","2","4","4","Then He will judge between the nations and arbitrate for many peoples. They will beat their swords into plowshares and their spears into pruning hooks. Nation will no longer take up the sword against nation, nor train anymore for war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_5","024_2_5","ISA","2","5","5","Come, O house of Jacob, let us walk in the light of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_6","024_2_6","ISA","2","6","6","For You have abandoned Your people, the house of Jacob, because they are filled with influences from the east; they are soothsayers like the Philistines; they strike hands with the children of foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_7","024_2_7","ISA","2","7","7","Their land is full of silver and gold, with no limit to their treasures; their land is full of horses, with no limit to their chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_8","024_2_8","ISA","2","8","8","Their land is full of idols; they bow down to the work of their hands, to what their fingers have made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_9","024_2_9","ISA","2","9","9","So mankind is brought low, and man is humbled—do not forgive them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_10","024_2_10","ISA","2","10","10","Go into the rocks and hide in the dust from the terror of the LORD and the splendor of His majesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_11","024_2_11","ISA","2","11","11","The proud look of man will be humbled, and the loftiness of men brought low; the LORD alone will be exalted in that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_12","024_2_12","ISA","2","12","12","For the Day of the LORD of Hosts will come against all the proud and lofty, against all that is exalted—it will be humbled— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_13","024_2_13","ISA","2","13","13","against all the cedars of Lebanon, lofty and lifted up, against all the oaks of Bashan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_14","024_2_14","ISA","2","14","14","against all the tall mountains, against all the high hills, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_15","024_2_15","ISA","2","15","15","against every high tower, against every fortified wall, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_16","024_2_16","ISA","2","16","16","against every ship of Tarshish, and against every stately vessel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_17","024_2_17","ISA","2","17","17","So the pride of man will be brought low, and the loftiness of men will be humbled; the LORD alone will be exalted in that day, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_18","024_2_18","ISA","2","18","18","and the idols will vanish completely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_19","024_2_19","ISA","2","19","19","Men will flee to caves in the rocks and holes in the ground, away from the terror of the LORD and from the splendor of His majesty, when He rises to shake the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_20","024_2_20","ISA","2","20","20","In that day men will cast away to the moles and bats their idols of silver and gold—the idols they made to worship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_21","024_2_21","ISA","2","21","21","They will flee to caverns in the rocks and crevices in the cliffs, away from the terror of the LORD and from the splendor of His majesty, when He rises to shake the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS2_22","024_2_22","ISA","2","22","22","Put no more trust in man, who has only the breath in his nostrils. Of what account is he? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_1","024_3_1","ISA","3","1","1","For behold, the Lord GOD of Hosts is about to remove from Jerusalem and Judah both supply and support: the whole supply of food and water, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_2","024_3_2","ISA","3","2","2","the mighty man and the warrior, the judge and the prophet, the soothsayer and the elder, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_3","024_3_3","ISA","3","3","3","the commander of fifty and the dignitary, the counselor, the cunning magician, and the clever enchanter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_4","024_3_4","ISA","3","4","4","“I will make mere lads their leaders, and children will rule over them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_5","024_3_5","ISA","3","5","5","The people will oppress one another, man against man, neighbor against neighbor; the young will rise up against the old, and the base against the honorable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_6","024_3_6","ISA","3","6","6","A man will seize his brother within his father’s house: “You have a cloak—you be our leader! Take charge of this heap of rubble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_7","024_3_7","ISA","3","7","7","On that day he will cry aloud: “I am not a healer. I have no food or clothing in my house. Do not make me leader of the people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_8","024_3_8","ISA","3","8","8","For Jerusalem has stumbled and Judah has fallen because they spoke and acted against the LORD, defying His glorious presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_9","024_3_9","ISA","3","9","9","The expression on their faces testifies against them, and like Sodom they flaunt their sin; they do not conceal it. Woe to them, for they have brought disaster upon themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_10","024_3_10","ISA","3","10","10","Tell the righteous it will be well with them, for they will enjoy the fruit of their labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_11","024_3_11","ISA","3","11","11","Woe to the wicked; disaster is upon them! For they will be repaid with what their hands have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_12","024_3_12","ISA","3","12","12","Youths oppress My people, and women rule over them. O My people, your guides mislead you; they turn you from your paths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_13","024_3_13","ISA","3","13","13","The LORD arises to contend; He stands to judge the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_14","024_3_14","ISA","3","14","14","The LORD brings this charge against the elders and leaders of His people: “You have devoured the vineyard; the plunder of the poor is in your houses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_15","024_3_15","ISA","3","15","15","Why do you crush My people and grind the faces of the poor?” declares the Lord GOD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_16","024_3_16","ISA","3","16","16","The LORD also says: “Because the daughters of Zion are haughty—walking with heads held high and wanton eyes, prancing and skipping as they go, jingling the bracelets on their ankles— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_17","024_3_17","ISA","3","17","17","the Lord will bring sores on the heads of the daughters of Zion, and the LORD will make their foreheads bare.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_18","024_3_18","ISA","3","18","18","In that day the Lord will take away their finery: their anklets and headbands and crescents; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_19","024_3_19","ISA","3","19","19","their pendants, bracelets, and veils; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_20","024_3_20","ISA","3","20","20","their headdresses, ankle chains, and sashes; their perfume bottles and charms; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_21","024_3_21","ISA","3","21","21","their signet rings and nose rings; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_22","024_3_22","ISA","3","22","22","their festive robes, capes, cloaks, and purses; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_23","024_3_23","ISA","3","23","23","and their mirrors, linen garments, tiaras, and shawls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_24","024_3_24","ISA","3","24","24","Instead of fragrance there will be a stench; instead of a belt, a rope; instead of styled hair, baldness; instead of fine clothing, sackcloth; instead of beauty, shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_25","024_3_25","ISA","3","25","25","Your men will fall by the sword, and your warriors in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS3_26","024_3_26","ISA","3","26","26","And the gates of Zion will lament and mourn; destitute, she will sit on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_1","024_4_1","ISA","4","1","1","In that day seven women will take hold of one man and say, “We will eat our own bread and provide our own clothes. Just let us be called by your name. Take away our disgrace!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_2","024_4_2","ISA","4","2","2","On that day the Branch of the LORD will be beautiful and glorious, and the fruit of the land will be the pride and glory of Israel’s survivors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_3","024_4_3","ISA","4","3","3","Whoever remains in Zion and whoever is left in Jerusalem will be called holy—all in Jerusalem who are recorded among the living— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_4","024_4_4","ISA","4","4","4","when the Lord has washed away the filth of the daughters of Zion and cleansed the bloodstains from the heart of Jerusalem by a spirit of judgment and a spirit of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_5","024_4_5","ISA","4","5","5","Then the LORD will create over all of Mount Zion and over her assemblies a cloud of smoke by day and a glowing flame of fire by night. For over all the glory there will be a canopy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS4_6","024_4_6","ISA","4","6","6","a shelter to give shade from the heat by day, and a refuge and hiding place from the storm and the rain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_1","024_5_1","ISA","5","1","1","I will sing for my beloved a song of his vineyard: My beloved had a vineyard on a very fertile hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_2","024_5_2","ISA","5","2","2","He dug it up and cleared the stones and planted the finest vines. He built a watchtower in the middle and dug out a winepress as well. He waited for the vineyard to yield good grapes, but the fruit it produced was sour! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_3","024_5_3","ISA","5","3","3","“And now, O dwellers of Jerusalem and men of Judah, I exhort you to judge between Me and My vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_4","024_5_4","ISA","5","4","4","What more could have been done for My vineyard than I have done for it? Why, when I expected sweet grapes, did it bring forth sour fruit? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_5","024_5_5","ISA","5","5","5","Now I will tell you what I am about to do to My vineyard: I will take away its hedge, and it will be consumed; I will tear down its wall, and it will be trampled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_6","024_5_6","ISA","5","6","6","I will make it a wasteland, neither pruned nor cultivated, and thorns and briers will grow up. I will command the clouds that rain shall not fall on it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_7","024_5_7","ISA","5","7","7","For the vineyard of the LORD of Hosts is the house of Israel, and the men of Judah are the plant of His delight. He looked for justice, but saw bloodshed; for righteousness, but heard a cry of distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_8","024_5_8","ISA","5","8","8","Woe to you who add house to house and join field to field until no place is left and you live alone in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_9","024_5_9","ISA","5","9","9","I heard the LORD of Hosts declare: “Surely many houses will become desolate, great mansions left unoccupied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_10","024_5_10","ISA","5","10","10","For ten acres of vineyard will yield but a bath of wine, and a homer of seed only an ephah of grain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_11","024_5_11","ISA","5","11","11","Woe to those who rise early in the morning in pursuit of strong drink, who linger into the evening, to be inflamed by wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_12","024_5_12","ISA","5","12","12","At their feasts are the lyre and harp, tambourines and flutes and wine. They disregard the actions of the LORD and fail to see the work of His hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_13","024_5_13","ISA","5","13","13","Therefore My people will go into exile for their lack of understanding; their dignitaries are starving and their masses are parched with thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_14","024_5_14","ISA","5","14","14","Therefore Sheol enlarges its throat and opens wide its enormous jaws, and down go Zion’s nobles and masses, her revelers and carousers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_15","024_5_15","ISA","5","15","15","So mankind will be brought low, and each man humbled; the arrogant will lower their eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_16","024_5_16","ISA","5","16","16","But the LORD of Hosts will be exalted by His justice, and the holy God will show Himself holy in righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_17","024_5_17","ISA","5","17","17","Lambs will graze as in their own pastures, and strangers will feed in the ruins of the wealthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_18","024_5_18","ISA","5","18","18","Woe to those who draw iniquity with cords of deceit and pull sin along with cart ropes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_19","024_5_19","ISA","5","19","19","to those who say, “Let Him hurry and hasten His work so that we may see it! Let the plan of the Holy One of Israel come so that we may know it!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_20","024_5_20","ISA","5","20","20","Woe to those who call evil good and good evil, who turn darkness to light and light to darkness, who replace bitter with sweet and sweet with bitter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_21","024_5_21","ISA","5","21","21","Woe to those who are wise in their own eyes and clever in their own sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_22","024_5_22","ISA","5","22","22","Woe to those who are heroes in drinking wine and champions in mixing strong drink, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_23","024_5_23","ISA","5","23","23","who acquit the guilty for a bribe and deprive the innocent of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_24","024_5_24","ISA","5","24","24","Therefore, as a tongue of fire consumes the straw, and as dry grass shrivels in the flame, so their roots will decay and their blossoms will blow away like dust; for they have rejected the instruction of the LORD of Hosts and despised the word of the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_25","024_5_25","ISA","5","25","25","Therefore the anger of the LORD burns against His people; His hand is raised against them to strike them down. The mountains quake, and the corpses lie like refuse in the streets. Despite all this, His anger is not turned away; His hand is still upraised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_26","024_5_26","ISA","5","26","26","He lifts a banner for the distant nations and whistles for those at the ends of the earth. Behold—how speedily and swiftly they come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_27","024_5_27","ISA","5","27","27","None of them grows weary or stumbles; no one slumbers or sleeps. No belt is loose and no sandal strap is broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_28","024_5_28","ISA","5","28","28","Their arrows are sharpened, and all their bows are strung. The hooves of their horses are like flint; their chariot wheels are like a whirlwind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_29","024_5_29","ISA","5","29","29","Their roaring is like that of a lion; they roar like young lions. They growl and seize their prey; they carry it away, and no one can rescue it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS5_30","024_5_30","ISA","5","30","30","In that day they will roar over it, like the roaring of the sea. If one looks over the land, he will see darkness and distress; even the light will be obscured by clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_1","024_6_1","ISA","6","1","1","In the year that King Uzziah died, I saw the Lord seated on a throne, high and exalted; and the train of His robe filled the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_2","024_6_2","ISA","6","2","2","Above Him stood seraphim, each having six wings: With two wings they covered their faces, with two they covered their feet, and with two they were flying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_3","024_6_3","ISA","6","3","3","And they were calling out to one another: “Holy, holy, holy is the LORD of Hosts; all the earth is full of His glory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_4","024_6_4","ISA","6","4","4","At the sound of their voices the doorposts and thresholds shook, and the temple was filled with smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_5","024_6_5","ISA","6","5","5","Then I said: “Woe is me, for I am ruined, because I am a man of unclean lips dwelling among a people of unclean lips; for my eyes have seen the King, the LORD of Hosts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_6","024_6_6","ISA","6","6","6","Then one of the seraphim flew to me, and in his hand was a glowing coal that he had taken with tongs from the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_7","024_6_7","ISA","6","7","7","And with it he touched my mouth and said: “Now that this has touched your lips, your iniquity is removed and your sin is atoned for.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_8","024_6_8","ISA","6","8","8","Then I heard the voice of the Lord saying: “Whom shall I send? Who will go for Us?” And I said: “Here am I. Send me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_9","024_6_9","ISA","6","9","9","And He replied: “Go and tell this people, ‘Be ever hearing, but never understanding; be ever seeing, but never perceiving.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_10","024_6_10","ISA","6","10","10","Make the hearts of this people calloused; deafen their ears and close their eyes. Otherwise they might see with their eyes, hear with their ears, understand with their hearts, and turn and be healed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_11","024_6_11","ISA","6","11","11","Then I asked: “How long, O Lord?” And He replied: “Until the cities lie ruined and without inhabitant, until the houses are left unoccupied and the land is desolate and ravaged, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_12","024_6_12","ISA","6","12","12","until the LORD has driven men far away and the land is utterly forsaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS6_13","024_6_13","ISA","6","13","13","And though a tenth remains in the land, it will be burned again. As the terebinth and oak leave stumps when felled, so the holy seed will be a stump in the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_1","024_7_1","ISA","7","1","1","Now in the days that Ahaz son of Jotham, the son of Uzziah, was king of Judah, Rezin king of Aram marched up to wage war against Jerusalem. He was accompanied by Pekah son of Remaliah the king of Israel, but he could not overpower the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_2","024_7_2","ISA","7","2","2","When it was reported to the house of David that Aram was in league with Ephraim, the hearts of Ahaz and his people trembled like trees in the forest shaken by the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_3","024_7_3","ISA","7","3","3","Then the LORD said to Isaiah, “Go out with your son Shear-jashub to meet Ahaz at the end of the aqueduct that feeds the upper pool, on the road to the Launderer’s Field, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_4","024_7_4","ISA","7","4","4","and say to him: Calm down and be quiet. Do not be afraid or disheartened over these two smoldering stubs of firewood—over the fierce anger of Rezin and Aram and of the son of Remaliah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_5","024_7_5","ISA","7","5","5","For Aram, along with Ephraim and the son of Remaliah, has plotted your ruin, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_6","024_7_6","ISA","7","6","6","‘Let us invade Judah, terrorize it, and divide it among ourselves. Then we can install the son of Tabeal over it as king.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_7","024_7_7","ISA","7","7","7","But this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘It will not arise; it will not happen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_8","024_7_8","ISA","7","8","8","For the head of Aram is Damascus, and the head of Damascus is Rezin. Within sixty-five years Ephraim will be shattered as a people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_9","024_7_9","ISA","7","9","9","The head of Ephraim is Samaria, and the head of Samaria is the son of Remaliah. If you do not stand firm in your faith, then you will not stand at all.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_10","024_7_10","ISA","7","10","10","Again the LORD spoke to Ahaz, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_11","024_7_11","ISA","7","11","11","“Ask for a sign from the LORD your God, whether from the depths of Sheol or the heights of heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_12","024_7_12","ISA","7","12","12","But Ahaz replied, “I will not ask; I will not test the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_13","024_7_13","ISA","7","13","13","Then Isaiah said, “Hear now, O house of David! Is it not enough to try the patience of men? Will you try the patience of my God as well? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_14","024_7_14","ISA","7","14","14","Therefore the Lord Himself will give you a sign: Behold, the virgin will be with child and give birth to a son, and will call Him Immanuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_15","024_7_15","ISA","7","15","15","By the time He knows enough to reject evil and choose good, He will be eating curds and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_16","024_7_16","ISA","7","16","16","For before the boy knows enough to reject evil and choose good, the land of the two kings you dread will be laid waste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_17","024_7_17","ISA","7","17","17","The LORD will bring on you and on your people and on the house of your father a time unlike any since the day Ephraim separated from Judah—He will bring the king of Assyria.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_18","024_7_18","ISA","7","18","18","On that day the LORD will whistle to the flies at the farthest streams of the Nile and to the bees in the land of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_19","024_7_19","ISA","7","19","19","And they will all come and settle in the steep ravines and clefts of the rocks, in all the thornbushes and watering holes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_20","024_7_20","ISA","7","20","20","On that day the Lord will use a razor hired from beyond the Euphrates—the king of Assyria—to shave your head and the hair of your legs, and to remove your beard as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_21","024_7_21","ISA","7","21","21","On that day a man will raise a young cow and two sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_22","024_7_22","ISA","7","22","22","and from the abundance of milk they give, he will eat curds; for all who remain in the land will eat curds and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_23","024_7_23","ISA","7","23","23","And on that day, in every place that had a thousand vines worth a thousand shekels of silver, only briers and thorns will be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_24","024_7_24","ISA","7","24","24","Men will go there with bow and arrow, for the land will be covered with briers and thorns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS7_25","024_7_25","ISA","7","25","25","For fear of the briers and thorns, you will no longer traverse the hills once tilled by the hoe; they will become places for oxen to graze and sheep to trample. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_1","024_8_1","ISA","8","1","1","Then the LORD said to me, “Take a large scroll and write on it with an ordinary stylus: Maher-shalal-hash-baz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_2","024_8_2","ISA","8","2","2","And I will appoint for Myself trustworthy witnesses—Uriah the priest and Zechariah son of Jeberekiah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_3","024_8_3","ISA","8","3","3","And I had relations with the prophetess, and she conceived and gave birth to a son. The LORD said to me, “Name him Maher-shalal-hash-baz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_4","024_8_4","ISA","8","4","4","For before the boy knows how to cry ‘Father’ or ‘Mother,’ the wealth of Damascus and the plunder of Samaria will be carried off by the king of Assyria.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_5","024_8_5","ISA","8","5","5","And the LORD spoke to me further: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_6","024_8_6","ISA","8","6","6","“Because this people has rejected the gently flowing waters of Shiloah and rejoiced in Rezin and the son of Remaliah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_7","024_8_7","ISA","8","7","7","the Lord will surely bring against them the mighty floodwaters of the Euphrates—the king of Assyria and all his pomp. It will overflow its channels and overrun its banks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_8","024_8_8","ISA","8","8","8","It will pour into Judah, swirling and sweeping over it, reaching up to the neck; its spreading streams will cover your entire land, O Immanuel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_9","024_8_9","ISA","8","9","9","Huddle together, O peoples, and be shattered; pay attention, all you distant lands; prepare for battle, and be shattered; prepare for battle, and be shattered! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_10","024_8_10","ISA","8","10","10","Devise a plan, but it will be thwarted; state a proposal, but it will not happen. For God is with us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_11","024_8_11","ISA","8","11","11","For this is what the LORD has spoken to me with a strong hand, instructing me not to walk in the way of this people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_12","024_8_12","ISA","8","12","12","“Do not call conspiracy everything these people regard as conspiracy. Do not fear what they fear; do not live in dread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_13","024_8_13","ISA","8","13","13","The LORD of Hosts is the One you shall regard as holy. Only He should be feared; only He should be dreaded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_14","024_8_14","ISA","8","14","14","And He will be a sanctuary—but to both houses of Israel a stone of stumbling and a rock of offense, to the dwellers of Jerusalem a trap and a snare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_15","024_8_15","ISA","8","15","15","Many will stumble over these; they will fall and be broken; they will be ensnared and captured.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_16","024_8_16","ISA","8","16","16","Bind up the testimony and seal the law among my disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_17","024_8_17","ISA","8","17","17","I will wait for the LORD, who is hiding His face from the house of Jacob. I will put my trust in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_18","024_8_18","ISA","8","18","18","Here am I, and the children the LORD has given me as signs and symbols in Israel from the LORD of Hosts, who dwells on Mount Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_19","024_8_19","ISA","8","19","19","When men tell you to consult mediums and spiritists who whisper and mutter, shouldn’t a people consult their God instead? Why consult the dead on behalf of the living? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_20","024_8_20","ISA","8","20","20","To the law and to the testimony! If they do not speak according to this word, they have no light of dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_21","024_8_21","ISA","8","21","21","They will roam the land, dejected and hungry. When they are famished, they will become enraged; and looking upward, they will curse their king and their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS8_22","024_8_22","ISA","8","22","22","Then they will look to the earth and see only distress and darkness and the gloom of anguish. And they will be driven into utter darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_1","024_9_1","ISA","9","1","1","Nevertheless, there will be no more gloom for those in distress. In the past He humbled the land of Zebulun and the land of Naphtali, but in the future He will honor the Way of the Sea, beyond the Jordan, Galilee of the nations: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_2","024_9_2","ISA","9","2","2","The people walking in darkness have seen a great light; on those living in the land of the shadow of death, a light has dawned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_3","024_9_3","ISA","9","3","3","You have enlarged the nation and increased its joy. The people rejoice before You as they rejoice at harvest time, as men rejoice in dividing the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_4","024_9_4","ISA","9","4","4","For as in the day of Midian You have shattered the yoke of their burden, the bar across their shoulders, and the rod of their oppressor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_5","024_9_5","ISA","9","5","5","For every trampling boot of battle and every garment rolled in blood will be burned as fuel for the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_6","024_9_6","ISA","9","6","6","For unto us a child is born, unto us a son is given, and the government will be upon His shoulders. And He will be called Wonderful Counselor, Mighty God, Everlasting Father, Prince of Peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_7","024_9_7","ISA","9","7","7","Of the increase of His government and peace there will be no end. He will reign on the throne of David and over his kingdom, to establish and sustain it with justice and righteousness from that time and forevermore. The zeal of the LORD of Hosts will accomplish this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_8","024_9_8","ISA","9","8","8","The Lord has sent a message against Jacob, and it has fallen upon Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_9","024_9_9","ISA","9","9","9","All the people will know it—Ephraim and the dwellers of Samaria. With pride and arrogance of heart they will say: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_10","024_9_10","ISA","9","10","10","“The bricks have fallen, but we will rebuild with finished stone; the sycamores have been felled, but we will replace them with cedars.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_11","024_9_11","ISA","9","11","11","The LORD has raised up the foes of Rezin against him and joined his enemies together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_12","024_9_12","ISA","9","12","12","Aram from the east and Philistia from the west have devoured Israel with open mouths. Despite all this, His anger is not turned away; His hand is still upraised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_13","024_9_13","ISA","9","13","13","But the people did not return to Him who struck them; they did not seek the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_14","024_9_14","ISA","9","14","14","So the LORD will cut off Israel’s head and tail, both palm branch and reed in a single day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_15","024_9_15","ISA","9","15","15","The head is the elder and honorable man, and the tail is the prophet who teaches lies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_16","024_9_16","ISA","9","16","16","For those who guide this people mislead them, and those they mislead are swallowed up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_17","024_9_17","ISA","9","17","17","Therefore the Lord takes no pleasure in their young men; He has no compassion on their fatherless and widows. For every one of them is godless and wicked, and every mouth speaks folly. Despite all this, His anger is not turned away; His hand is still upraised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_18","024_9_18","ISA","9","18","18","For wickedness burns like a fire that consumes the thorns and briers and kindles the forest thickets, which roll upward in billows of smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_19","024_9_19","ISA","9","19","19","By the wrath of the LORD of Hosts the land is scorched, and the people are fuel for the fire. No man even spares his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_20","024_9_20","ISA","9","20","20","They carve out what is on the right, but they are still hungry; they eat what is on the left, but they are still not satisfied. Each one devours the flesh of his own offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS9_21","024_9_21","ISA","9","21","21","Manasseh devours Ephraim, and Ephraim Manasseh; together they turn against Judah. Despite all this, His anger is not turned away; His hand is still upraised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_1","024_10_1","ISA","10","1","1","Woe to those who enact unjust statutes and issue oppressive decrees, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_2","024_10_2","ISA","10","2","2","to deprive the poor of fair treatment and withhold justice from the oppressed of My people, to make widows their prey and orphans their plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_3","024_10_3","ISA","10","3","3","What will you do on the day of reckoning when devastation comes from afar? To whom will you flee for help? Where will you leave your wealth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_4","024_10_4","ISA","10","4","4","Nothing will remain but to crouch among the captives or fall among the slain. Despite all this, His anger is not turned away; His hand is still upraised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_5","024_10_5","ISA","10","5","5","Woe to Assyria, the rod of My anger; the staff in their hands is My wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_6","024_10_6","ISA","10","6","6","I will send him against a godless nation; I will dispatch him against a people destined for My rage, to take spoils and seize plunder, and to trample them down like clay in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_7","024_10_7","ISA","10","7","7","But this is not his intention; this is not his plan. For it is in his heart to destroy and cut off many nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_8","024_10_8","ISA","10","8","8","“Are not all my commanders kings?” he says. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_9","024_10_9","ISA","10","9","9","“Is not Calno like Carchemish? Is not Hamath like Arpad? Is not Samaria like Damascus? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_10","024_10_10","ISA","10","10","10","As my hand seized the idolatrous kingdoms whose images surpassed those of Jerusalem and Samaria, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_11","024_10_11","ISA","10","11","11","and as I have done to Samaria and its idols, will I not also do to Jerusalem and her idols?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_12","024_10_12","ISA","10","12","12","So when the Lord has completed all His work against Mount Zion and Jerusalem, He will say, “I will punish the king of Assyria for the fruit of his arrogant heart and the proud look in his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_13","024_10_13","ISA","10","13","13","For he says: ‘By the strength of my hand I have done this, and by my wisdom, for I am clever. I have removed the boundaries of nations and plundered their treasures; like a mighty one I subdued their rulers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_14","024_10_14","ISA","10","14","14","My hand reached as into a nest to seize the wealth of the nations. Like one gathering abandoned eggs, I gathered all the earth. No wing fluttered, no beak opened or chirped.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_15","024_10_15","ISA","10","15","15","Does an axe raise itself above the one who swings it? Does a saw boast over him who saws with it? It would be like a rod waving the one who lifts it, or a staff lifting him who is not wood! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_16","024_10_16","ISA","10","16","16","Therefore the Lord GOD of Hosts will send a wasting disease among Assyria’s stout warriors, and under his pomp will be kindled a fire like a burning flame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_17","024_10_17","ISA","10","17","17","And the Light of Israel will become a fire, and its Holy One a flame. In a single day it will burn and devour Assyria’s thorns and thistles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_18","024_10_18","ISA","10","18","18","The splendor of its forests and orchards, both soul and body, it will completely destroy, as a sickness consumes a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_19","024_10_19","ISA","10","19","19","The remaining trees of its forests will be so few that a child could count them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_20","024_10_20","ISA","10","20","20","On that day the remnant of Israel and the survivors of the house of Jacob will no longer depend on him who struck them, but they will truly rely on the LORD, the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_21","024_10_21","ISA","10","21","21","A remnant will return—a remnant of Jacob—to the Mighty God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_22","024_10_22","ISA","10","22","22","Though your people, O Israel, be like the sand of the sea, only a remnant will return. Destruction has been decreed, overflowing with righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_23","024_10_23","ISA","10","23","23","For the Lord GOD of Hosts will carry out the destruction decreed upon the whole land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_24","024_10_24","ISA","10","24","24","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD of Hosts says: “O My people who dwell in Zion, do not fear Assyria, who strikes you with a rod and lifts his staff against you as the Egyptians did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_25","024_10_25","ISA","10","25","25","For in just a little while My fury against you will subside, and My anger will turn to their destruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_26","024_10_26","ISA","10","26","26","And the LORD of Hosts will brandish a whip against them, as when He struck Midian at the rock of Oreb. He will raise His staff over the sea, as He did in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_27","024_10_27","ISA","10","27","27","On that day the burden will be lifted from your shoulders, and the yoke from your neck. The yoke will be broken because your neck will be too large. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_28","024_10_28","ISA","10","28","28","Assyria has entered Aiath and passed through Migron, storing their supplies at Michmash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_29","024_10_29","ISA","10","29","29","They have crossed at the ford: “We will spend the night at Geba.” Ramah trembles; Gibeah of Saul flees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_30","024_10_30","ISA","10","30","30","Cry aloud, O Daughter of Gallim! Listen, O Laishah! O wretched Anathoth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_31","024_10_31","ISA","10","31","31","Madmenah flees; the people of Gebim take refuge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_32","024_10_32","ISA","10","32","32","Yet today they will halt at Nob, shaking a fist at the mount of Daughter Zion, at the hill of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_33","024_10_33","ISA","10","33","33","Behold, the Lord GOD of Hosts will lop off the branches with terrifying power. The tall trees will be cut down, the lofty ones will be felled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS10_34","024_10_34","ISA","10","34","34","He will clear the forest thickets with an axe, and Lebanon will fall before the Mighty One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_1","024_11_1","ISA","11","1","1","Then a shoot will spring up from the stump of Jesse, and a Branch from his roots will bear fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_2","024_11_2","ISA","11","2","2","The Spirit of the LORD will rest on Him—the Spirit of wisdom and understanding, the Spirit of counsel and strength, the Spirit of knowledge and fear of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_3","024_11_3","ISA","11","3","3","And He will delight in the fear of the LORD. He will not judge by what His eyes see, and He will not decide by what His ears hear, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_4","024_11_4","ISA","11","4","4","but with righteousness He will judge the poor, and with equity He will decide for the lowly of the earth. He will strike the earth with the rod of His mouth and slay the wicked with the breath of His lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_5","024_11_5","ISA","11","5","5","Righteousness will be the belt around His hips, and faithfulness the sash around His waist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_6","024_11_6","ISA","11","6","6","The wolf will live with the lamb, and the leopard will lie down with the goat; the calf and young lion and fatling will be together, and a little child will lead them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_7","024_11_7","ISA","11","7","7","The cow will graze with the bear, their young will lie down together, and the lion will eat straw like the ox. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_8","024_11_8","ISA","11","8","8","The infant will play by the cobra’s den, and the toddler will reach into the viper’s nest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_9","024_11_9","ISA","11","9","9","They will neither harm nor destroy on all My holy mountain, for the earth will be full of the knowledge of the LORD as the sea is full of water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_10","024_11_10","ISA","11","10","10","On that day the Root of Jesse will stand as a banner for the peoples. The nations will seek Him, and His place of rest will be glorious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_11","024_11_11","ISA","11","11","11","On that day the Lord will extend His hand a second time to recover the remnant of His people from Assyria, from Egypt, from Pathros, from Cush, from Elam, from Shinar, from Hamath, and from the islands of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_12","024_11_12","ISA","11","12","12","He will raise a banner for the nations and gather the exiles of Israel; He will collect the scattered of Judah from the four corners of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_13","024_11_13","ISA","11","13","13","Then the jealousy of Ephraim will depart, and the adversaries of Judah will be cut off. Ephraim will no longer envy Judah, nor will Judah harass Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_14","024_11_14","ISA","11","14","14","They will swoop down on the slopes of the Philistines to the west; together they will plunder the sons of the east. They will lay their hands on Edom and Moab, and the Ammonites will be subject to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_15","024_11_15","ISA","11","15","15","The LORD will devote to destruction the gulf of the Sea of Egypt; with a scorching wind He will sweep His hand over the Euphrates. He will split it into seven streams for men to cross with dry sandals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS11_16","024_11_16","ISA","11","16","16","There will be a highway for the remnant of His people who remain from Assyria, as there was for Israel when they came up from the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_1","024_12_1","ISA","12","1","1","In that day you will say: “O LORD, I will praise You. Although You were angry with me, Your anger has turned away, and You have comforted me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_2","024_12_2","ISA","12","2","2","Surely God is my salvation; I will trust and not be afraid. For the LORD GOD is my strength and my song, and He also has become my salvation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_3","024_12_3","ISA","12","3","3","With joy you will draw water from the springs of salvation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_4","024_12_4","ISA","12","4","4","and on that day you will say: “Give praise to the LORD; proclaim His name! Make His works known among the peoples; declare that His name is exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_5","024_12_5","ISA","12","5","5","Sing to the LORD, for He has done glorious things. Let this be known in all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS12_6","024_12_6","ISA","12","6","6","Cry out and sing, O citizen of Zion, for great among you is the Holy One of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_1","024_13_1","ISA","13","1","1","This is the burden against Babylon that Isaiah son of Amoz received: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_2","024_13_2","ISA","13","2","2","Raise a banner on a barren hilltop; call aloud to them. Wave your hand, that they may enter the gates of the nobles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_3","024_13_3","ISA","13","3","3","I have commanded My sanctified ones; I have even summoned My warriors to execute My wrath and exult in My triumph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_4","024_13_4","ISA","13","4","4","Listen, a tumult on the mountains, like that of a great multitude! Listen, an uproar among the kingdoms, like nations gathered together! The LORD of Hosts is mobilizing an army for war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_5","024_13_5","ISA","13","5","5","They are coming from faraway lands, from the ends of the heavens—the LORD and the weapons of His wrath—to destroy the whole country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_6","024_13_6","ISA","13","6","6","Wail, for the Day of the LORD is near; it will come as destruction from the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_7","024_13_7","ISA","13","7","7","Therefore all hands will fall limp, and every man’s heart will melt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_8","024_13_8","ISA","13","8","8","Terror, pain, and anguish will seize them; they will writhe like a woman in labor. They will look at one another, their faces flushed with fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_9","024_13_9","ISA","13","9","9","Behold, the Day of the LORD is coming—cruel, with fury and burning anger—to make the earth a desolation and to destroy the sinners within it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_10","024_13_10","ISA","13","10","10","For the stars of heaven and their constellations will not give their light. The rising sun will be darkened, and the moon will not give its light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_11","024_13_11","ISA","13","11","11","I will punish the world for its evil and the wicked for their iniquity. I will end the haughtiness of the arrogant and lay low the pride of the ruthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_12","024_13_12","ISA","13","12","12","I will make man scarcer than pure gold, and mankind rarer than the gold of Ophir. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_13","024_13_13","ISA","13","13","13","Therefore I will make the heavens tremble, and the earth will be shaken from its place at the wrath of the LORD of Hosts on the day of His burning anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_14","024_13_14","ISA","13","14","14","Like a hunted gazelle, like a sheep without a shepherd, each will return to his own people, each will flee to his native land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_15","024_13_15","ISA","13","15","15","Whoever is caught will be stabbed, and whoever is captured will die by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_16","024_13_16","ISA","13","16","16","Their infants will be dashed to pieces before their eyes, their houses will be looted, and their wives will be ravished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_17","024_13_17","ISA","13","17","17","Behold, I will stir up against them the Medes, who have no regard for silver and no desire for gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_18","024_13_18","ISA","13","18","18","Their bows will dash young men to pieces; they will have no mercy on the fruit of the womb; they will not look with pity on the children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_19","024_13_19","ISA","13","19","19","And Babylon, the jewel of the kingdoms, the glory of the pride of the Chaldeans, will be overthrown by God like Sodom and Gomorrah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_20","024_13_20","ISA","13","20","20","She will never be inhabited or settled from generation to generation; no nomad will pitch his tent there, no shepherd will rest his flock there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_21","024_13_21","ISA","13","21","21","But desert creatures will lie down there, and howling creatures will fill her houses. Ostriches will dwell there, and wild goats will leap about. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS13_22","024_13_22","ISA","13","22","22","Hyenas will howl in her fortresses and jackals in her luxurious palaces. Babylon’s time is at hand, and her days will not be prolonged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_1","024_14_1","ISA","14","1","1","For the LORD will have compassion on Jacob; once again He will choose Israel and settle them in their own land. The foreigner will join them and unite with the house of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_2","024_14_2","ISA","14","2","2","The nations will escort Israel and bring it to its homeland. Then the house of Israel will possess the nations as menservants and maidservants in the LORD’s land. They will make captives of their captors and rule over their oppressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_3","024_14_3","ISA","14","3","3","On the day that the LORD gives you rest from your pain and torment, and from the hard labor into which you were forced, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_4","024_14_4","ISA","14","4","4","you will sing this song of contempt against the king of Babylon: How the oppressor has ceased, and how his fury has ended! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_5","024_14_5","ISA","14","5","5","The LORD has broken the staff of the wicked, the scepter of the rulers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_6","024_14_6","ISA","14","6","6","It struck the peoples in anger with unceasing blows; it subdued the nations in rage with relentless persecution. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_7","024_14_7","ISA","14","7","7","All the earth is at peace and at rest; they break out in song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_8","024_14_8","ISA","14","8","8","Even the cypresses and cedars of Lebanon exult over you: “Since you have been laid low, no woodcutter comes against us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_9","024_14_9","ISA","14","9","9","Sheol beneath is eager to meet you upon your arrival. It stirs the spirits of the dead to greet you—all the rulers of the earth. It makes all the kings of the nations rise from their thrones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_10","024_14_10","ISA","14","10","10","They will all respond to you, saying, “You too have become weak, as we are; you have become like us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_11","024_14_11","ISA","14","11","11","Your pomp has been brought down to Sheol, along with the music of your harps. Maggots are your bed and worms your blanket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_12","024_14_12","ISA","14","12","12","How you have fallen from heaven, O day star, son of the dawn! You have been cut down to the ground, O destroyer of nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_13","024_14_13","ISA","14","13","13","You said in your heart: “I will ascend to the heavens; I will raise my throne above the stars of God. I will sit on the mount of assembly, in the far reaches of the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_14","024_14_14","ISA","14","14","14","I will ascend above the tops of the clouds; I will make myself like the Most High.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_15","024_14_15","ISA","14","15","15","But you will be brought down to Sheol, to the lowest depths of the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_16","024_14_16","ISA","14","16","16","Those who see you will stare; they will ponder your fate: “Is this the man who shook the earth and made the kingdoms tremble, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_17","024_14_17","ISA","14","17","17","who turned the world into a desert and destroyed its cities, who refused to let the captives return to their homes?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_18","024_14_18","ISA","14","18","18","All the kings of the nations lie in state, each in his own tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_19","024_14_19","ISA","14","19","19","But you are cast out of your grave like a rejected branch, covered by those slain with the sword, and dumped into a rocky pit like a carcass trampled underfoot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_20","024_14_20","ISA","14","20","20","You will not join them in burial, since you have destroyed your land and slaughtered your own people. The offspring of the wicked will never again be mentioned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_21","024_14_21","ISA","14","21","21","Prepare a place to slaughter his sons for the iniquities of their forefathers. They will never rise up to possess a land or cover the earth with their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_22","024_14_22","ISA","14","22","22","“I will rise up against them,” declares the LORD of Hosts. “I will cut off from Babylon her name and her remnant, her offspring and her posterity,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_23","024_14_23","ISA","14","23","23","“I will make her a place for owls and for swamplands; I will sweep her away with the broom of destruction,” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_24","024_14_24","ISA","14","24","24","The LORD of Hosts has sworn: “Surely, as I have planned, so will it be; as I have purposed, so will it stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_25","024_14_25","ISA","14","25","25","I will break Assyria in My land; I will trample him on My mountain. His yoke will be taken off My people, and his burden removed from their shoulders.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_26","024_14_26","ISA","14","26","26","This is the plan devised for the whole earth, and this is the hand stretched out over all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_27","024_14_27","ISA","14","27","27","The LORD of Hosts has purposed, and who can thwart Him? His hand is outstretched, so who can turn it back? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_28","024_14_28","ISA","14","28","28","In the year that King Ahaz died, this burden was received: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_29","024_14_29","ISA","14","29","29","Do not rejoice, all you Philistines, that the rod that struck you is broken. For a viper will spring from the root of the snake, and a flying serpent from its egg. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_30","024_14_30","ISA","14","30","30","Then the firstborn of the poor will find pasture, and the needy will lie down in safety, but I will kill your root by famine, and your remnant will be slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_31","024_14_31","ISA","14","31","31","Wail, O gate! Cry out, O city! Melt away, all you Philistines! For a cloud of smoke comes from the north, and there are no stragglers in its ranks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS14_32","024_14_32","ISA","14","32","32","What answer will be given to the envoys of that nation? “The LORD has founded Zion, where His afflicted people will find refuge.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_1","024_15_1","ISA","15","1","1","This is the burden against Moab: Ar in Moab is ruined, destroyed in a night! Kir in Moab is devastated, destroyed in a night! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_2","024_15_2","ISA","15","2","2","Dibon goes up to its temple to weep at its high places. Moab wails over Nebo, as well as over Medeba. Every head is shaved, every beard is cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_3","024_15_3","ISA","15","3","3","In its streets they wear sackcloth; on the rooftops and in the public squares they all wail, falling down weeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_4","024_15_4","ISA","15","4","4","Heshbon and Elealeh cry out; their voices are heard as far as Jahaz. Therefore the soldiers of Moab cry out; their souls tremble within. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_5","024_15_5","ISA","15","5","5","My heart cries out over Moab; her fugitives flee as far as Zoar, as far as Eglath-shelishiyah. With weeping they ascend the slope of Luhith; they lament their destruction on the road to Horonaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_6","024_15_6","ISA","15","6","6","The waters of Nimrim are dried up, and the grass is withered; the vegetation is gone, and the greenery is no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_7","024_15_7","ISA","15","7","7","So they carry their wealth and belongings over the Brook of the Willows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_8","024_15_8","ISA","15","8","8","For their outcry echoes to the border of Moab. Their wailing reaches Eglaim; it is heard in Beer-elim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS15_9","024_15_9","ISA","15","9","9","The waters of Dimon are full of blood, but I will bring more upon Dimon—a lion upon the fugitives of Moab and upon the remnant of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_1","024_16_1","ISA","16","1","1","Send the tribute lambs to the ruler of the land, from Sela in the desert to the mount of Daughter Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_2","024_16_2","ISA","16","2","2","Like fluttering birds pushed out of the nest, so are the daughters of Moab at the fords of the Arnon: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_3","024_16_3","ISA","16","3","3","“Give us counsel; render a decision. Shelter us at noonday with shade as dark as night. Hide the refugees; do not betray the one who flees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_4","024_16_4","ISA","16","4","4","Let my fugitives stay with you; be a refuge for Moab from the destroyer.” When the oppressor has gone, destruction has ceased, and the oppressors have vanished from the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_5","024_16_5","ISA","16","5","5","in loving devotion a throne will be established in the tent of David. A judge seeking justice and hastening righteousness will sit on it in faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_6","024_16_6","ISA","16","6","6","We have heard of Moab’s pomposity, his exceeding pride and conceit, his overflowing arrogance. But his boasting is empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_7","024_16_7","ISA","16","7","7","Therefore let Moab wail; let them wail together for Moab. Moan for the raisin cakes of Kir-hareseth, you who are utterly stricken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_8","024_16_8","ISA","16","8","8","For the fields of Heshbon have withered, along with the grapevines of Sibmah. The rulers of the nations have trampled its choicest vines, which had reached as far as Jazer and spread toward the desert. Their shoots had spread out and passed over the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_9","024_16_9","ISA","16","9","9","So I weep with Jazer for the vines of Sibmah; I drench Heshbon and Elealeh with my tears. Triumphant shouts have fallen silent over your summer fruit and your harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_10","024_16_10","ISA","16","10","10","Joy and gladness are removed from the orchard; no one sings or shouts in the vineyards. No one tramples the grapes in the winepresses; I have put an end to the cheering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_11","024_16_11","ISA","16","11","11","Therefore my heart laments for Moab like a harp, my inmost being for Kir-heres. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_12","024_16_12","ISA","16","12","12","When Moab appears on the high place, when he wearies himself and enters his sanctuary to pray, it will do him no good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_13","024_16_13","ISA","16","13","13","This is the message that the LORD spoke earlier concerning Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS16_14","024_16_14","ISA","16","14","14","And now the LORD says, “In three years, as a hired worker counts the years, Moab’s splendor will become an object of contempt, with all her many people. And those who are left will be few and feeble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_1","024_17_1","ISA","17","1","1","This is the burden against Damascus: “Behold, Damascus is no longer a city; it has become a heap of ruins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_2","024_17_2","ISA","17","2","2","The cities of Aroer are forsaken; they will be left to the flocks, which will lie down with no one to fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_3","024_17_3","ISA","17","3","3","The fortress will disappear from Ephraim, and the sovereignty from Damascus. The remnant of Aram will be like the splendor of the Israelites,” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_4","024_17_4","ISA","17","4","4","“In that day the splendor of Jacob will fade, and the fat of his body will waste away, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_5","024_17_5","ISA","17","5","5","as the reaper gathers the standing grain and harvests the ears with his arm, as one gleans heads of grain in the Valley of Rephaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_6","024_17_6","ISA","17","6","6","Yet gleanings will remain, like an olive tree that has been beaten—two or three berries atop the tree, four or five on its fruitful branches,” declares the LORD, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_7","024_17_7","ISA","17","7","7","In that day men will look to their Maker and turn their eyes to the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_8","024_17_8","ISA","17","8","8","They will not look to the altars they have fashioned with their hands or to the Asherahs and incense altars they have made with their fingers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_9","024_17_9","ISA","17","9","9","In that day their strong cities will be like forsaken thickets and summits, abandoned to the Israelites and to utter desolation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_10","024_17_10","ISA","17","10","10","For you have forgotten the God of your salvation and failed to remember the Rock of your refuge. Therefore, though you cultivate delightful plots and set out cuttings from exotic vines— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_11","024_17_11","ISA","17","11","11","though on the day you plant you make them grow, and on that morning you help your seed sprout—yet the harvest will vanish on the day of disease and incurable pain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_12","024_17_12","ISA","17","12","12","Alas, the tumult of many peoples; they rage like the roaring seas and clamoring nations; they rumble like the crashing of mighty waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_13","024_17_13","ISA","17","13","13","The nations rage like the rush of many waters. He rebukes them, and they flee far away, driven before the wind like chaff on the hills, like tumbleweeds before a gale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS17_14","024_17_14","ISA","17","14","14","In the evening, there is sudden terror! Before morning, they are no more! This is the portion of those who loot us and the lot of those who plunder us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_1","024_18_1","ISA","18","1","1","Woe to the land of whirring wings, along the rivers of Cush, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_2","024_18_2","ISA","18","2","2","which sends couriers by sea, in papyrus vessels on the waters. Go, swift messengers, to a people tall and smooth-skinned, to a people widely feared, to a powerful nation of strange speech, whose land is divided by rivers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_3","024_18_3","ISA","18","3","3","All you people of the world and dwellers of the earth, when a banner is raised on the mountains, you will see it; when a ram’s horn sounds, you will hear it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_4","024_18_4","ISA","18","4","4","For this is what the LORD has told me: “I will quietly look on from My dwelling place, like shimmering heat in the sunshine, like a cloud of dew in the heat of harvest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_5","024_18_5","ISA","18","5","5","For before the harvest, when the blossom is gone and the flower becomes a ripening grape, He will cut off the shoots with a pruning knife and remove and discard the branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_6","024_18_6","ISA","18","6","6","They will all be left to the mountain birds of prey, and to the beasts of the land. The birds will feed on them in summer, and all the wild animals in winter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS18_7","024_18_7","ISA","18","7","7","At that time gifts will be brought to the LORD of Hosts—from a people tall and smooth-skinned, from a people widely feared, from a powerful nation of strange speech, whose land is divided by rivers—to Mount Zion, the place of the Name of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_1","024_19_1","ISA","19","1","1","This is the burden against Egypt: Behold, the LORD rides on a swift cloud; He is coming to Egypt. The idols of Egypt will tremble before Him, and the hearts of the Egyptians will melt within them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_2","024_19_2","ISA","19","2","2","“So I will incite Egyptian against Egyptian; brother will fight against brother, neighbor against neighbor, city against city, and kingdom against kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_3","024_19_3","ISA","19","3","3","Then the spirit of the Egyptians will be emptied out from among them, and I will frustrate their plans, so that they will resort to idols and spirits of the dead, to mediums and spiritists. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_4","024_19_4","ISA","19","4","4","I will deliver the Egyptians into the hands of a harsh master, and a fierce king will rule over them,” declares the Lord GOD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_5","024_19_5","ISA","19","5","5","The waters of the Nile will dry up, and the riverbed will be parched and empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_6","024_19_6","ISA","19","6","6","The canals will stink; the streams of Egypt will trickle and dry up; the reeds and rushes will wither. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_7","024_19_7","ISA","19","7","7","The bulrushes by the Nile, by the mouth of the river, and all the fields sown along the Nile, will wither, blow away, and be no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_8","024_19_8","ISA","19","8","8","Then the fishermen will mourn, all who cast a hook into the Nile will lament, and those who spread nets on the waters will pine away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_9","024_19_9","ISA","19","9","9","The workers in flax will be dismayed, and the weavers of fine linen will turn pale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_10","024_19_10","ISA","19","10","10","The workers in cloth will be dejected, and all the hired workers will be sick at heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_11","024_19_11","ISA","19","11","11","The princes of Zoan are mere fools; Pharaoh’s wise counselors give senseless advice. How can you say to Pharaoh, “I am one of the wise, a son of eastern kings”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_12","024_19_12","ISA","19","12","12","Where are your wise men now? Let them tell you and reveal what the LORD of Hosts has planned against Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_13","024_19_13","ISA","19","13","13","The princes of Zoan have become fools; the princes of Memphis are deceived. The cornerstones of her tribes have led Egypt astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_14","024_19_14","ISA","19","14","14","The LORD has poured into her a spirit of confusion. Egypt has been led astray in all she does, as a drunkard staggers through his own vomit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_15","024_19_15","ISA","19","15","15","There is nothing Egypt can do—head or tail, palm or reed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_16","024_19_16","ISA","19","16","16","In that day the Egyptians will be like women. They will tremble with fear beneath the uplifted hand of the LORD of Hosts, when He brandishes it against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_17","024_19_17","ISA","19","17","17","The land of Judah will bring terror to Egypt; whenever Judah is mentioned, Egypt will tremble over what the LORD of Hosts has planned against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_18","024_19_18","ISA","19","18","18","In that day five cities in the land of Egypt will speak the language of Canaan and swear allegiance to the LORD of Hosts. One of them will be called the City of the Sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_19","024_19_19","ISA","19","19","19","In that day there will be an altar to the LORD in the center of the land of Egypt, and a pillar to the LORD near her border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_20","024_19_20","ISA","19","20","20","It will be a sign and a witness to the LORD of Hosts in the land of Egypt. When they cry out to the LORD because of their oppressors, He will send them a savior and defender to rescue them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_21","024_19_21","ISA","19","21","21","The LORD will make Himself known to Egypt, and on that day Egypt will acknowledge the LORD. They will worship with sacrifices and offerings; they will make vows to the LORD and fulfill them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_22","024_19_22","ISA","19","22","22","And the LORD will strike Egypt with a plague; He will strike them but heal them. They will turn to the LORD, and He will hear their prayers and heal them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_23","024_19_23","ISA","19","23","23","In that day there will be a highway from Egypt to Assyria. The Assyrians will go to Egypt, and the Egyptians to Assyria. The Egyptians and Assyrians will worship together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_24","024_19_24","ISA","19","24","24","In that day Israel will join a three-party alliance with Egypt and Assyria—a blessing upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS19_25","024_19_25","ISA","19","25","25","The LORD of Hosts will bless them, saying, “Blessed be Egypt My people, Assyria My handiwork, and Israel My inheritance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_1","024_20_1","ISA","20","1","1","Before the year that the chief commander, sent by Sargon king of Assyria, came to Ashdod and attacked and captured it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_2","024_20_2","ISA","20","2","2","the LORD had already spoken through Isaiah son of Amoz, saying, “Go, remove the sackcloth from your waist and the sandals from your feet.” And Isaiah did so, walking around naked and barefoot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_3","024_20_3","ISA","20","3","3","Then the LORD said, “Just as My servant Isaiah has gone naked and barefoot for three years as a sign and omen against Egypt and Cush, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_4","024_20_4","ISA","20","4","4","so the king of Assyria will lead away the captives of Egypt and the exiles of Cush, young and old alike, naked and barefoot, with bared buttocks—to Egypt’s shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_5","024_20_5","ISA","20","5","5","Those who made Cush their hope and Egypt their boast will be dismayed and ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS20_6","024_20_6","ISA","20","6","6","And on that day the dwellers of this coastland will say, ‘See what has happened to our source of hope, those to whom we fled for help and deliverance from the king of Assyria! How then can we escape?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_1","024_21_1","ISA","21","1","1","This is the burden against the Desert by the Sea: Like whirlwinds sweeping through the Negev, an invader comes from the desert, from a land of terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_2","024_21_2","ISA","21","2","2","A dire vision is declared to me: “The traitor still betrays, and the destroyer still destroys. Go up, O Elam! Lay siege, O Media! I will put an end to all her groaning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_3","024_21_3","ISA","21","3","3","Therefore my body is filled with anguish. Pain grips me, like the pains of a woman in labor. I am bewildered to hear, I am dismayed to see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_4","024_21_4","ISA","21","4","4","My heart falters; fear makes me tremble. The twilight I desired has turned to horror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_5","024_21_5","ISA","21","5","5","They prepare a table, they lay out a carpet, they eat, they drink! Rise up, O princes, oil the shields! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_6","024_21_6","ISA","21","6","6","For this is what the Lord says to me: “Go, post a lookout and have him report what he sees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_7","024_21_7","ISA","21","7","7","When he sees chariots with teams of horsemen, riders on donkeys, riders on camels, he must be alert, fully alert.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_8","024_21_8","ISA","21","8","8","Then the lookout shouted: “Day after day, my lord, I stand on the watchtower; night after night I stay at my post. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_9","024_21_9","ISA","21","9","9","Look, here come the riders, horsemen in pairs.” And one answered, saying: “Fallen, fallen is Babylon! All the images of her gods lie shattered on the ground!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_10","024_21_10","ISA","21","10","10","O my people, crushed on the threshing floor, I tell you what I have heard from the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_11","024_21_11","ISA","21","11","11","This is the burden against Dumah: One calls to me from Seir, “Watchman, what is left of the night? Watchman, what is left of the night?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_12","024_21_12","ISA","21","12","12","The watchman replies, “Morning has come, but also the night. If you would inquire, then inquire. Come back yet again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_13","024_21_13","ISA","21","13","13","This is the burden against Arabia: In the thickets of Arabia you must lodge, O caravans of Dedanites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_14","024_21_14","ISA","21","14","14","Bring water for the thirsty, O dwellers of Tema; meet the refugees with food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_15","024_21_15","ISA","21","15","15","For they flee from the sword—the sword that is drawn—from the bow that is bent, and from the stress of battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_16","024_21_16","ISA","21","16","16","For this is what the Lord says to me: “Within one year, as a hired worker would count it, all the glory of Kedar will be gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS21_17","024_21_17","ISA","21","17","17","The remaining archers, the warriors of Kedar, will be few.” For the LORD, the God of Israel, has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_1","024_22_1","ISA","22","1","1","This is the burden against the Valley of Vision: What ails you now, that you have all gone up to the rooftops, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_2","024_22_2","ISA","22","2","2","O city of commotion, O town of revelry? Your slain did not die by the sword, nor were they killed in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_3","024_22_3","ISA","22","3","3","All your rulers have fled together, captured without a bow. All your fugitives were captured together, having fled to a distant place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_4","024_22_4","ISA","22","4","4","Therefore I said, “Turn away from me, let me weep bitterly! Do not try to console me over the destruction of the daughter of my people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_5","024_22_5","ISA","22","5","5","For the Lord GOD of Hosts has set a day of tumult and trampling and confusion in the Valley of Vision—of breaking down the walls and crying to the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_6","024_22_6","ISA","22","6","6","Elam takes up a quiver, with chariots and horsemen, and Kir uncovers the shield. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_7","024_22_7","ISA","22","7","7","Your choicest valleys are full of chariots, and horsemen are posted at the gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_8","024_22_8","ISA","22","8","8","He has uncovered the defenses of Judah. On that day you looked to the weapons in the House of the Forest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_9","024_22_9","ISA","22","9","9","You saw that there were many breaches in the walls of the City of David. You collected water from the lower pool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_10","024_22_10","ISA","22","10","10","You counted the houses of Jerusalem and tore them down to strengthen the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_11","024_22_11","ISA","22","11","11","You built a reservoir between the walls for the waters of the ancient pool, but you did not look to the One who made it, or consider Him who planned it long ago. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_12","024_22_12","ISA","22","12","12","On that day the Lord GOD of Hosts called for weeping and wailing, for shaven heads and the wearing of sackcloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_13","024_22_13","ISA","22","13","13","But look, there is joy and gladness, butchering of cattle and slaughtering of sheep, eating of meat and drinking of wine: “Let us eat and drink, for tomorrow we die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_14","024_22_14","ISA","22","14","14","The LORD of Hosts has revealed in my hearing: “Until your dying day, this sin of yours will never be atoned for,” says the Lord GOD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_15","024_22_15","ISA","22","15","15","This is what the Lord GOD of Hosts says: “Go, say to Shebna, the steward in charge of the palace: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_16","024_22_16","ISA","22","16","16","What are you doing here, and who authorized you to carve out a tomb for yourself here—to chisel your tomb in the height and cut your resting place in the rock? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_17","024_22_17","ISA","22","17","17","Look, O mighty man! The LORD is about to shake you violently. He will take hold of you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_18","024_22_18","ISA","22","18","18","roll you into a ball, and sling you into a wide land. There you will die, and there your glorious chariots will remain—a disgrace to the house of your master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_19","024_22_19","ISA","22","19","19","I will remove you from office, and you will be ousted from your position. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_20","024_22_20","ISA","22","20","20","On that day I will summon My servant, Eliakim son of Hilkiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_21","024_22_21","ISA","22","21","21","I will clothe him with your robe and tie your sash around him. I will put your authority in his hand, and he will be a father to the dwellers of Jerusalem and to the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_22","024_22_22","ISA","22","22","22","I will place on his shoulder the key to the house of David. What he opens no one can shut, and what he shuts no one can open. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_23","024_22_23","ISA","22","23","23","I will drive him like a peg into a firm place, and he will be a throne of glory for the house of his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_24","024_22_24","ISA","22","24","24","So they will hang on him all the glory of his father’s house: the descendants and the offshoots—all the lesser vessels, from bowls to every kind of jar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS22_25","024_22_25","ISA","22","25","25","In that day, declares the LORD of Hosts, the peg driven into a firm place will give way; it will be sheared off and fall, and the load upon it will be cut down.” Indeed, the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_1","024_23_1","ISA","23","1","1","This is the burden against Tyre: Wail, O ships of Tarshish, for Tyre is laid waste, without house or harbor. Word has reached them from the land of Cyprus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_2","024_23_2","ISA","23","2","2","Be silent, O dwellers of the coastland, you merchants of Sidon, whose traders have crossed the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_3","024_23_3","ISA","23","3","3","On the great waters came the grain of Shihor; the harvest of the Nile was the revenue of Tyre; she was the merchant of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_4","024_23_4","ISA","23","4","4","Be ashamed, O Sidon, the stronghold of the sea, for the sea has spoken: “I have not been in labor or given birth. I have not raised young men or brought up young women.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_5","024_23_5","ISA","23","5","5","When the report reaches Egypt, they will writhe in agony over the news of Tyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_6","024_23_6","ISA","23","6","6","Cross over to Tarshish; wail, O inhabitants of the coastland! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_7","024_23_7","ISA","23","7","7","Is this your jubilant city, whose origin is from antiquity, whose feet have taken her to settle far away? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_8","024_23_8","ISA","23","8","8","Who planned this against Tyre, the bestower of crowns, whose traders are princes, whose merchants are renowned on the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_9","024_23_9","ISA","23","9","9","The LORD of Hosts planned it, to defile all its glorious beauty, to disgrace all the renowned of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_10","024_23_10","ISA","23","10","10","Cultivate your land like the Nile, O Daughter of Tarshish; there is no longer a harbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_11","024_23_11","ISA","23","11","11","The LORD has stretched out His hand over the sea; He has made kingdoms tremble. He has given a command that the strongholds of Canaan be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_12","024_23_12","ISA","23","12","12","He said, “You shall rejoice no more, O oppressed Virgin Daughter of Sidon. Get up and cross over to Cyprus—even there you will find no rest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_13","024_23_13","ISA","23","13","13","Look at the land of the Chaldeans—a people now of no account. The Assyrians destined it for the desert creatures; they set up their siege towers and stripped its palaces. They brought it to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_14","024_23_14","ISA","23","14","14","Wail, O ships of Tarshish, for your harbor has been destroyed! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_15","024_23_15","ISA","23","15","15","At that time Tyre will be forgotten for seventy years—the span of a king’s life. But at the end of seventy years, it will happen to Tyre as in the song of the harlot: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_16","024_23_16","ISA","23","16","16","“Take up your harp, stroll through the city, O forgotten harlot. Make sweet melody, sing many a song, so you will be remembered.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_17","024_23_17","ISA","23","17","17","And at the end of seventy years, the LORD will restore Tyre. Then she will return to hire as a prostitute and sell herself to all the kingdoms on the face of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS23_18","024_23_18","ISA","23","18","18","Yet her profits and wages will be set apart to the LORD; they will not be stored or saved, for her profit will go to those who live before the LORD, for abundant food and fine clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_1","024_24_1","ISA","24","1","1","Behold, the LORD lays waste the earth and leaves it in ruins. He will twist its surface and scatter its inhabitants— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_2","024_24_2","ISA","24","2","2","people and priest alike, servant and master, maid and mistress, buyer and seller, lender and borrower, creditor and debtor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_3","024_24_3","ISA","24","3","3","The earth will be utterly laid waste and thoroughly plundered. For the LORD has spoken this word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_4","024_24_4","ISA","24","4","4","The earth mourns and withers; the world languishes and fades; the exalted of the earth waste away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_5","024_24_5","ISA","24","5","5","The earth is defiled by its people; they have transgressed the laws; they have overstepped the decrees and broken the everlasting covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_6","024_24_6","ISA","24","6","6","Therefore a curse has consumed the earth, and its inhabitants must bear the guilt; the earth’s dwellers have been burned, and only a few survive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_7","024_24_7","ISA","24","7","7","The new wine dries up, the vine withers. All the merrymakers now groan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_8","024_24_8","ISA","24","8","8","The joyful tambourines have ceased; the noise of revelers has stopped; the joyful harp is silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_9","024_24_9","ISA","24","9","9","They no longer sing and drink wine; strong drink is bitter to those who consume it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_10","024_24_10","ISA","24","10","10","The city of chaos is shattered; every house is closed to entry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_11","024_24_11","ISA","24","11","11","In the streets they cry out for wine. All joy turns to gloom; rejoicing is exiled from the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_12","024_24_12","ISA","24","12","12","The city is left in ruins; its gate is reduced to rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_13","024_24_13","ISA","24","13","13","So will it be on the earth and among the nations, like a harvested olive tree, like a gleaning after a grape harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_14","024_24_14","ISA","24","14","14","They raise their voices, they shout for joy; from the west they proclaim the majesty of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_15","024_24_15","ISA","24","15","15","Therefore glorify the LORD in the east. Extol the name of the LORD, the God of Israel in the islands of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_16","024_24_16","ISA","24","16","16","From the ends of the earth we hear singing: “Glory to the Righteous One.” But I said, “I am wasting away! I am wasting away! Woe is me.” The treacherous betray; the treacherous deal in treachery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_17","024_24_17","ISA","24","17","17","Terror and pit and snare await you, O dweller of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_18","024_24_18","ISA","24","18","18","Whoever flees the sound of panic will fall into the pit, and whoever climbs from the pit will be caught in the snare. For the windows of heaven are open, and the foundations of the earth are shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_19","024_24_19","ISA","24","19","19","The earth is utterly broken apart, the earth is split open, the earth is shaken violently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_20","024_24_20","ISA","24","20","20","The earth staggers like a drunkard and sways like a shack. Earth’s rebellion weighs it down, and it falls, never to rise again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_21","024_24_21","ISA","24","21","21","In that day the LORD will punish the host of heaven above and the kings of the earth below. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_22","024_24_22","ISA","24","22","22","They will be gathered together like prisoners in a pit. They will be confined to a dungeon and punished after many days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS24_23","024_24_23","ISA","24","23","23","The moon will be confounded and the sun will be ashamed; for the LORD of Hosts will reign on Mount Zion and in Jerusalem, and before His elders with great glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_1","024_25_1","ISA","25","1","1","O LORD, You are my God! I will exalt You; I will praise Your name. For You have worked wonders—plans formed long ago—in perfect faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_2","024_25_2","ISA","25","2","2","Indeed, You have made the city a heap of rubble, the fortified town a ruin. The fortress of strangers is a city no more; it will never be rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_3","024_25_3","ISA","25","3","3","Therefore, a strong people will honor You. The cities of ruthless nations will revere You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_4","024_25_4","ISA","25","4","4","For You have been a refuge for the poor, a stronghold for the needy in distress, a refuge from the storm, a shade from the heat. For the breath of the ruthless is like rain against a wall, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_5","024_25_5","ISA","25","5","5","like heat in a dry land. You subdue the uproar of foreigners. As the shade of a cloud cools the heat, so the song of the ruthless is silenced. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_6","024_25_6","ISA","25","6","6","On this mountain the LORD of Hosts will prepare a lavish banquet for all the peoples, a feast of aged wine, of choice meat, of finely aged wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_7","024_25_7","ISA","25","7","7","On this mountain He will swallow up the shroud that enfolds all peoples, the sheet that covers all nations; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_8","024_25_8","ISA","25","8","8","He will swallow up death forever. The Lord GOD will wipe away the tears from every face and remove the disgrace of His people from the whole earth. For the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_9","024_25_9","ISA","25","9","9","And in that day it will be said, “Surely this is our God; we have waited for Him, and He has saved us. This is the LORD for whom we have waited. Let us rejoice and be glad in His salvation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_10","024_25_10","ISA","25","10","10","For the hand of the LORD will rest on this mountain. But Moab will be trampled in his place as straw is trodden into the dung pile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_11","024_25_11","ISA","25","11","11","He will spread out his hands within it, as a swimmer spreads his arms to swim. His pride will be brought low, despite the skill of his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS25_12","024_25_12","ISA","25","12","12","The high-walled fortress will be brought down, cast to the ground, into the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_1","024_26_1","ISA","26","1","1","In that day this song will be sung in the land of Judah: We have a strong city; salvation is established as its walls and ramparts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_2","024_26_2","ISA","26","2","2","Open the gates so a righteous nation may enter—one that remains faithful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_3","024_26_3","ISA","26","3","3","You will keep in perfect peace the steadfast of mind, because he trusts in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_4","024_26_4","ISA","26","4","4","Trust in the LORD forever, because GOD the LORD is the Rock eternal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_5","024_26_5","ISA","26","5","5","For He has humbled those who dwell on high; He lays the lofty city low. He brings it down to the ground; He casts it into the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_6","024_26_6","ISA","26","6","6","Feet trample it down—the feet of the oppressed, the steps of the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_7","024_26_7","ISA","26","7","7","The path of the righteous is level; You clear a straight path for the upright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_8","024_26_8","ISA","26","8","8","Yes, we wait for You, O LORD; we walk in the path of Your judgments. Your name and renown are the desire of our souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_9","024_26_9","ISA","26","9","9","My soul longs for You in the night; indeed, my spirit seeks You at dawn. For when Your judgments come upon the earth, the people of the world learn righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_10","024_26_10","ISA","26","10","10","Though grace is shown to the wicked man, he does not learn righteousness. In the land of righteousness he acts unjustly and fails to see the majesty of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_11","024_26_11","ISA","26","11","11","O LORD, Your hand is upraised, but they do not see it. They will see Your zeal for Your people and be put to shame. The fire set for Your enemies will consume them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_12","024_26_12","ISA","26","12","12","O LORD, You will establish peace for us. For all that we have accomplished, You have done for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_13","024_26_13","ISA","26","13","13","O LORD our God, other lords besides You have ruled over us, but Your name alone do we confess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_14","024_26_14","ISA","26","14","14","The dead will not live; the departed spirits will not rise. Therefore You have punished and destroyed them; You have wiped out all memory of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_15","024_26_15","ISA","26","15","15","You have enlarged the nation, O LORD; You have enlarged the nation. You have gained glory for Yourself; You have extended all the borders of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_16","024_26_16","ISA","26","16","16","O LORD, they sought You in their distress; when You disciplined them, they poured out a quiet prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_17","024_26_17","ISA","26","17","17","As a woman with child about to give birth writhes and cries out in pain, so were we in Your presence, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_18","024_26_18","ISA","26","18","18","We were with child; we writhed in pain; but we gave birth to wind. We have given no salvation to the earth, nor brought any life into the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_19","024_26_19","ISA","26","19","19","Your dead will live; their bodies will rise. Awake and sing, you who dwell in the dust! For your dew is like the dew of the morning, and the earth will bring forth her dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_20","024_26_20","ISA","26","20","20","Go, my people, enter your rooms and shut your doors behind you. Hide yourselves a little while until the wrath has passed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS26_21","024_26_21","ISA","26","21","21","For behold, the LORD is coming out of His dwelling to punish the inhabitants of the earth for their iniquity. The earth will reveal her bloodshed and will no longer conceal her slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_1","024_27_1","ISA","27","1","1","In that day the LORD will take His sharp, great, and mighty sword, and bring judgment on Leviathan the fleeing serpent—Leviathan the coiling serpent—and He will slay the dragon of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_2","024_27_2","ISA","27","2","2","In that day: “Sing about a fruitful vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_3","024_27_3","ISA","27","3","3","I, the LORD, am its keeper; I water it continually. I guard it night and day so no one can disturb it; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_4","024_27_4","ISA","27","4","4","I am not angry. If only thorns and briers confronted Me, I would march and trample them, I would burn them to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_5","024_27_5","ISA","27","5","5","Or let them lay claim to My protection; let them make peace with Me—yes, let them make peace with Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_6","024_27_6","ISA","27","6","6","In the days to come, Jacob will take root. Israel will bud and blossom and fill the whole world with fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_7","024_27_7","ISA","27","7","7","Has the LORD struck Israel as He struck her oppressors? Was she killed like those who slayed her? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_8","024_27_8","ISA","27","8","8","By warfare and exile You contended with her and removed her with a fierce wind, as on the day the east wind blows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_9","024_27_9","ISA","27","9","9","Therefore Jacob’s guilt will be atoned for, and the full fruit of the removal of his sin will be this: When he makes all the altar stones like crushed bits of chalk, no Asherah poles or incense altars will remain standing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_10","024_27_10","ISA","27","10","10","For the fortified city lies deserted—a homestead abandoned, a wilderness forsaken. There the calves graze, and there they lie down; they strip its branches bare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_11","024_27_11","ISA","27","11","11","When its limbs are dry, they are broken off. Women come and use them for kindling; for this is a people without understanding. Therefore their Maker has no compassion on them, and their Creator shows them no favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_12","024_27_12","ISA","27","12","12","In that day the LORD will thresh from the flowing Euphrates to the Wadi of Egypt, and you, O Israelites, will be gathered one by one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS27_13","024_27_13","ISA","27","13","13","And in that day a great ram’s horn will sound, and those who were perishing in Assyria will come forth with those who were exiles in Egypt. And they will worship the LORD on the holy mountain in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_1","024_28_1","ISA","28","1","1","Woe to the majestic crown of Ephraim’s drunkards, to the fading flower of his glorious splendor, set on the summit above the fertile valley, the pride of those overcome by wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_2","024_28_2","ISA","28","2","2","Behold, the Lord has one who is strong and mighty. Like a hailstorm or destructive tempest, like a driving rain or flooding downpour, he will smash that crown to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_3","024_28_3","ISA","28","3","3","The majestic crown of Ephraim’s drunkards will be trampled underfoot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_4","024_28_4","ISA","28","4","4","The fading flower of his beautiful splendor, set on the summit above the fertile valley, will be like a ripe fig before the summer harvest: Whoever sees it will take it in his hand and swallow it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_5","024_28_5","ISA","28","5","5","On that day the LORD of Hosts will be a crown of glory, a diadem of splendor to the remnant of His people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_6","024_28_6","ISA","28","6","6","a spirit of justice to him who sits in judgment, and a strength to those who repel the onslaught at the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_7","024_28_7","ISA","28","7","7","These also stagger from wine and stumble from strong drink: Priests and prophets reel from strong drink and are befuddled by wine. They stumble because of strong drink, muddled in their visions and stumbling in their judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_8","024_28_8","ISA","28","8","8","For all their tables are covered with vomit; there is not a place without filth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_9","024_28_9","ISA","28","9","9","Whom is He trying to teach? To whom is He explaining His message? To infants just weaned from milk? To babies removed from the breast? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_10","024_28_10","ISA","28","10","10","For they hear: “Order on order, order on order, line on line, line on line; a little here, a little there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_11","024_28_11","ISA","28","11","11","Indeed, with mocking lips and foreign tongues, He will speak to this people ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_12","024_28_12","ISA","28","12","12","to whom He has said: “This is the place of rest, let the weary rest; this is the place of repose.” But they would not listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_13","024_28_13","ISA","28","13","13","Then the word of the LORD to them will become: “Order on order, order on order, line on line, line on line; a little here, a little there,” so that they will go stumbling backward and will be injured, ensnared, and captured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_14","024_28_14","ISA","28","14","14","Therefore hear the word of the LORD, O scoffers who rule this people in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_15","024_28_15","ISA","28","15","15","For you said, “We have made a covenant with death; we have fashioned an agreement with Sheol. When the overwhelming scourge passes through it will not touch us, because we have made lies our refuge and falsehood our hiding place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_16","024_28_16","ISA","28","16","16","So this is what the Lord GOD says: “See, I lay a stone in Zion, a tested stone, a precious cornerstone, a sure foundation; the one who believes will never be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_17","024_28_17","ISA","28","17","17","I will make justice the measuring line and righteousness the level. Hail will sweep away your refuge of lies, and water will flood your hiding place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_18","024_28_18","ISA","28","18","18","Your covenant with death will be dissolved, and your agreement with Sheol will not stand. When the overwhelming scourge passes through, you will be trampled by it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_19","024_28_19","ISA","28","19","19","As often as it passes through, it will carry you away; it will sweep through morning after morning, by day and by night.” The understanding of this message will bring sheer terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_20","024_28_20","ISA","28","20","20","Indeed, the bed is too short to stretch out on, and the blanket too small to wrap around you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_21","024_28_21","ISA","28","21","21","For the LORD will rise up as at Mount Perazim. He will rouse Himself as in the Valley of Gibeon, to do His work, His strange work, and to perform His task, His disturbing task. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_22","024_28_22","ISA","28","22","22","So now, do not mock, or your shackles will become heavier. Indeed, I have heard from the Lord GOD of Hosts a decree of destruction against the whole land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_23","024_28_23","ISA","28","23","23","Listen and hear my voice. Pay attention and hear what I say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_24","024_28_24","ISA","28","24","24","Does the plowman plow for planting every day? Does he continuously loosen and harrow the soil? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_25","024_28_25","ISA","28","25","25","When he has leveled its surface, does he not sow caraway and scatter cumin? He plants wheat in rows and barley in plots, and rye within its border. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_26","024_28_26","ISA","28","26","26","For his God instructs and teaches him properly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_27","024_28_27","ISA","28","27","27","Surely caraway is not threshed with a sledge, and the wheel of a cart is not rolled over the cumin. But caraway is beaten out with a stick, and cumin with a rod. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_28","024_28_28","ISA","28","28","28","Grain for bread must be ground, but it is not endlessly threshed. Though the wheels of the cart roll over it, the horses do not crush it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS28_29","024_28_29","ISA","28","29","29","This also comes from the LORD of Hosts, who is wonderful in counsel and excellent in wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_1","024_29_1","ISA","29","1","1","Woe to you, O Ariel, the city of Ariel where David camped! Year upon year let your festivals recur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_2","024_29_2","ISA","29","2","2","And I will constrain Ariel, and there will be mourning and lamentation; she will be like an altar hearth before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_3","024_29_3","ISA","29","3","3","I will camp in a circle around you; I will besiege you with towers and set up siege works against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_4","024_29_4","ISA","29","4","4","You will be brought low, you will speak from the ground, and out of the dust your words will be muffled. Your voice will be like a spirit from the ground; your speech will whisper out of the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_5","024_29_5","ISA","29","5","5","But your many foes will be like fine dust, the multitude of the ruthless like blowing chaff. Then suddenly, in an instant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_6","024_29_6","ISA","29","6","6","you will be visited by the LORD of Hosts with thunder and earthquake and loud noise, with windstorm and tempest and consuming flame of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_7","024_29_7","ISA","29","7","7","All the many nations going out to battle against Ariel—even all who war against her, laying siege and attacking her—will be like a dream, like a vision in the night, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_8","024_29_8","ISA","29","8","8","as when a hungry man dreams he is eating, then awakens still hungry; as when a thirsty man dreams he is drinking, then awakens faint and parched. So will it be for all the many nations who go to battle against Mount Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_9","024_29_9","ISA","29","9","9","Stop and be astonished; blind yourselves and be sightless; be drunk, but not with wine; stagger, but not from strong drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_10","024_29_10","ISA","29","10","10","For the LORD has poured out on you a spirit of deep sleep. He has shut your eyes, O prophets; He has covered your heads, O seers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_11","024_29_11","ISA","29","11","11","And the entire vision will be to you like the words sealed in a scroll. If it is handed to someone to read, he will say, “I cannot, because it is sealed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_12","024_29_12","ISA","29","12","12","Or if the scroll is handed to one unable to read, he will say, “I cannot read.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_13","024_29_13","ISA","29","13","13","Therefore the Lord said: “These people draw near to Me with their mouths and honor Me with their lips, but their hearts are far from Me. Their worship of Me is but rules taught by men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_14","024_29_14","ISA","29","14","14","Therefore I will again confound these people with wonder upon wonder. The wisdom of the wise will vanish, and the intelligence of the intelligent will be hidden.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_15","024_29_15","ISA","29","15","15","Woe to those who dig deep to hide their plans from the LORD. In darkness they do their works and say, “Who sees us, and who will know?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_16","024_29_16","ISA","29","16","16","You have turned things upside down, as if the potter were regarded as clay. Shall what is formed say to him who formed it, “He did not make me”? Can the pottery say of the potter, “He has no understanding”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_17","024_29_17","ISA","29","17","17","In a very short time, will not Lebanon become an orchard, and the orchard seem like a forest? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_18","024_29_18","ISA","29","18","18","On that day the deaf will hear the words of the scroll, and out of the deep darkness the eyes of the blind will see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_19","024_29_19","ISA","29","19","19","The humble will increase their joy in the LORD, and the poor among men will rejoice in the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_20","024_29_20","ISA","29","20","20","For the ruthless will vanish, the mockers will disappear, and all who look for evil will be cut down— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_21","024_29_21","ISA","29","21","21","those who indict a man with a word, who ensnare the mediator at the gate, and who with false charges deprive the innocent of justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_22","024_29_22","ISA","29","22","22","Therefore the LORD who redeemed Abraham says of the house of Jacob: “No longer will Jacob be ashamed and no more will his face grow pale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_23","024_29_23","ISA","29","23","23","For when he sees his children around him, the work of My hands, they will honor My name, they will sanctify the Holy One of Jacob, and they will stand in awe of the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS29_24","024_29_24","ISA","29","24","24","Then the wayward in spirit will come to understanding, and those who grumble will accept instruction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_1","024_30_1","ISA","30","1","1","“Woe to the rebellious children,” declares the LORD, “to those who carry out a plan that is not Mine, who form an alliance, but against My will, heaping up sin upon sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_2","024_30_2","ISA","30","2","2","They set out to go down to Egypt without asking My advice, to seek shelter under Pharaoh’s protection and take refuge in Egypt’s shade. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_3","024_30_3","ISA","30","3","3","But Pharaoh’s protection will become your shame, and the refuge of Egypt’s shade your disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_4","024_30_4","ISA","30","4","4","For though their princes are at Zoan and their envoys have arrived in Hanes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_5","024_30_5","ISA","30","5","5","everyone will be put to shame because of a people useless to them. They bring neither help nor benefit, but only shame and disgrace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_6","024_30_6","ISA","30","6","6","This is the burden against the beasts of the Negev: Through a land of hardship and distress, of lioness and lion, of viper and flying serpent, they carry their wealth on the backs of donkeys and their treasures on the humps of camels, to a people of no profit to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_7","024_30_7","ISA","30","7","7","Egypt’s help is futile and empty; therefore I have called her Rahab Who Sits Still. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_8","024_30_8","ISA","30","8","8","Go now, write it on a tablet in their presence and inscribe it on a scroll; it will be for the days to come, a witness forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_9","024_30_9","ISA","30","9","9","These are rebellious people, deceitful children, children unwilling to obey the LORD’s instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_10","024_30_10","ISA","30","10","10","They say to the seers, “Stop seeing visions!” and to the prophets, “Do not prophesy to us the truth! Speak to us pleasant words; prophesy illusions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_11","024_30_11","ISA","30","11","11","Get out of the way; turn off the road. Rid us of the Holy One of Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_12","024_30_12","ISA","30","12","12","Therefore this is what the Holy One of Israel says: “Because you have rejected this message, trusting in oppression and relying on deceit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_13","024_30_13","ISA","30","13","13","this iniquity of yours is like a breach about to fail, a bulge in a high wall, whose collapse will come suddenly—in an instant! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_14","024_30_14","ISA","30","14","14","It will break in pieces like a potter’s jar, shattered so that no fragment can be found. Not a shard will be found in the dust large enough to scoop the coals from a hearth or to skim the water from a cistern.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_15","024_30_15","ISA","30","15","15","For the Lord GOD, the Holy One of Israel, has said: “By repentance and rest you would be saved; your strength would lie in quiet confidence—but you were not willing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_16","024_30_16","ISA","30","16","16","“No,” you say, “we will flee on horses.” Therefore you will flee! “We will ride swift horses,” but your pursuers will be faster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_17","024_30_17","ISA","30","17","17","A thousand will flee at the threat of one; at the threat of five you will all flee, until you are left alone like a pole on a mountaintop, like a banner on a hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_18","024_30_18","ISA","30","18","18","Therefore the LORD longs to be gracious to you; therefore He rises to show you compassion, for the LORD is a just God. Blessed are all who wait for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_19","024_30_19","ISA","30","19","19","O people in Zion who dwell in Jerusalem, you will weep no more. He will surely be gracious when you cry for help; when He hears, He will answer you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_20","024_30_20","ISA","30","20","20","The Lord will give you the bread of adversity and the water of affliction, but your Teacher will no longer hide Himself—with your own eyes you will see Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_21","024_30_21","ISA","30","21","21","And whether you turn to the right or to the left, your ears will hear this command behind you: “This is the way. Walk in it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_22","024_30_22","ISA","30","22","22","So you will desecrate your silver-plated idols and your gold-plated images. You will throw them away like menstrual cloths, saying to them, “Be gone!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_23","024_30_23","ISA","30","23","23","Then He will send rain for the seed that you have sown in the ground, and the food that comes from your land will be rich and plentiful. On that day your cattle will graze in open pastures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_24","024_30_24","ISA","30","24","24","The oxen and donkeys that work the ground will eat salted fodder, winnowed with shovel and pitchfork. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_25","024_30_25","ISA","30","25","25","And from every high mountain and every raised hill, streams of water will flow in the day of great slaughter, when the towers fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_26","024_30_26","ISA","30","26","26","The light of the moon will be as bright as the sun, and the light of the sun will be seven times brighter—like the light of seven days—on the day that the LORD binds up the brokenness of His people and heals the wounds He has inflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_27","024_30_27","ISA","30","27","27","Behold, the Name of the LORD comes from afar, with burning anger and dense smoke. His lips are full of fury, and His tongue is like a consuming fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_28","024_30_28","ISA","30","28","28","His breath is like a rushing torrent that rises to the neck. He comes to sift the nations in a sieve of destruction; He bridles the jaws of the peoples to lead them astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_29","024_30_29","ISA","30","29","29","You will sing as on the night of a holy festival, and your heart will rejoice like one who walks to the music of a flute, going up to the mountain of the LORD, to the Rock of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_30","024_30_30","ISA","30","30","30","And the LORD will cause His majestic voice to be heard and His mighty arm to be revealed, striking in angry wrath with a flame of consuming fire, and with cloudburst, storm, and hailstones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_31","024_30_31","ISA","30","31","31","For Assyria will be shattered at the voice of the LORD; He will strike them with His scepter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_32","024_30_32","ISA","30","32","32","And with every stroke of the rod of punishment that the LORD brings down on them, the tambourines and lyres will sound as He battles with weapons brandished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS30_33","024_30_33","ISA","30","33","33","For Topheth has long been prepared; it has been made ready for the king. Its funeral pyre is deep and wide, with plenty of fire and wood. The breath of the LORD, like a torrent of burning sulfur, sets it ablaze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_1","024_31_1","ISA","31","1","1","Woe to those who go down to Egypt for help, who rely on horses, who trust in their abundance of chariots and in their multitude of horsemen. They do not look to the Holy One of Israel; they do not seek the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_2","024_31_2","ISA","31","2","2","Yet He too is wise and brings disaster; He does not call back His words. He will rise up against the house of the wicked and against the allies of evildoers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_3","024_31_3","ISA","31","3","3","But the Egyptians are men, not God; their horses are flesh, not spirit. When the LORD stretches out His hand, the helper will stumble, and the one he helps will fall; both will perish together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_4","024_31_4","ISA","31","4","4","For this is what the LORD has said to me: “Like a lion roaring or a young lion over its prey—and though a band of shepherds is called out against it, it is not terrified by their shouting or subdued by their clamor—so the LORD of Hosts will come down to do battle on Mount Zion and its heights. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_5","024_31_5","ISA","31","5","5","Like birds hovering overhead, so the LORD of Hosts will protect Jerusalem. He will shield it and deliver it; He will pass over it and preserve it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_6","024_31_6","ISA","31","6","6","Return to the One against whom you have so blatantly rebelled, O children of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_7","024_31_7","ISA","31","7","7","For on that day, every one of you will reject the idols of silver and gold that your own hands have sinfully made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_8","024_31_8","ISA","31","8","8","“Then Assyria will fall, but not by the sword of man; a sword will devour them, but not one made by mortals. They will flee before the sword, and their young men will be put to forced labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS31_9","024_31_9","ISA","31","9","9","Their rock will pass away for fear, and their princes will panic at the sight of the battle standard,” declares the LORD, whose fire is in Zion, whose furnace is in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_1","024_32_1","ISA","32","1","1","Behold, a king will reign in righteousness, and princes will rule with justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_2","024_32_2","ISA","32","2","2","Each will be like a shelter from the wind, a refuge from the storm, like streams of water in a dry land, like the shadow of a great rock in an arid land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_3","024_32_3","ISA","32","3","3","Then the eyes of those who see will no longer be closed, and the ears of those who hear will listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_4","024_32_4","ISA","32","4","4","The mind of the rash will know and understand, and the stammering tongue will speak clearly and fluently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_5","024_32_5","ISA","32","5","5","No longer will a fool be called noble, nor a scoundrel be respected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_6","024_32_6","ISA","32","6","6","For a fool speaks foolishness; his mind plots iniquity. He practices ungodliness and speaks falsely about the LORD; he leaves the hungry empty and deprives the thirsty of drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_7","024_32_7","ISA","32","7","7","The weapons of the scoundrel are destructive; he hatches plots to destroy the poor with lies, even when the plea of the needy is just. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_8","024_32_8","ISA","32","8","8","But a noble man makes honorable plans; he stands up for worthy causes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_9","024_32_9","ISA","32","9","9","Stand up, you complacent women; listen to me. Give ear to my word, you overconfident daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_10","024_32_10","ISA","32","10","10","In a little more than a year you will tremble, O secure ones. For the grape harvest will fail and the fruit harvest will not arrive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_11","024_32_11","ISA","32","11","11","Shudder, you ladies of leisure; tremble, you daughters of complacency. Strip yourselves bare and put sackcloth around your waists. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_12","024_32_12","ISA","32","12","12","Beat your breasts for the pleasant fields, for the fruitful vines, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_13","024_32_13","ISA","32","13","13","and for the land of my people, overgrown with thorns and briers—even for every house of merriment in this city of revelry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_14","024_32_14","ISA","32","14","14","For the palace will be forsaken, the busy city abandoned. The hill and the watchtower will become caves forever—the delight of wild donkeys and a pasture for flocks— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_15","024_32_15","ISA","32","15","15","until the Spirit is poured out upon us from on high. Then the desert will be an orchard, and the orchard will seem like a forest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_16","024_32_16","ISA","32","16","16","Then justice will inhabit the wilderness, and righteousness will dwell in the fertile field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_17","024_32_17","ISA","32","17","17","The work of righteousness will be peace; the service of righteousness will be quiet confidence forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_18","024_32_18","ISA","32","18","18","Then my people will dwell in a peaceful place, in safe and secure places of rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_19","024_32_19","ISA","32","19","19","But hail will level the forest, and the city will sink to the depths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS32_20","024_32_20","ISA","32","20","20","Blessed are those who sow beside abundant waters, who let the ox and donkey range freely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_1","024_33_1","ISA","33","1","1","Woe to you, O destroyer never destroyed, O traitor never betrayed! When you have finished destroying, you will be destroyed. When you have finished betraying, you will be betrayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_2","024_33_2","ISA","33","2","2","O LORD, be gracious to us! We wait for You. Be our strength every morning and our salvation in time of trouble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_3","024_33_3","ISA","33","3","3","The peoples flee the thunder of Your voice; the nations scatter when You rise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_4","024_33_4","ISA","33","4","4","Your spoil, O nations, is gathered as by locusts; like a swarm of locusts men sweep over it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_5","024_33_5","ISA","33","5","5","The LORD is exalted, for He dwells on high; He has filled Zion with justice and righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_6","024_33_6","ISA","33","6","6","He will be the sure foundation for your times, a storehouse of salvation, wisdom, and knowledge. The fear of the LORD is Zion’s treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_7","024_33_7","ISA","33","7","7","Behold, their valiant ones cry aloud in the streets; the envoys of peace weep bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_8","024_33_8","ISA","33","8","8","The highways are deserted; travel has ceased. The treaty has been broken, the witnesses are despised, and human life is disregarded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_9","024_33_9","ISA","33","9","9","The land mourns and languishes; Lebanon is ashamed and decayed. Sharon is like a desert; Bashan and Carmel shake off their leaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_10","024_33_10","ISA","33","10","10","“Now I will arise,” says the LORD. “Now I will lift Myself up. Now I will be exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_11","024_33_11","ISA","33","11","11","You conceive chaff; you give birth to stubble. Your breath is a fire that will consume you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_12","024_33_12","ISA","33","12","12","The peoples will be burned to ashes, like thorns cut down and set ablaze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_13","024_33_13","ISA","33","13","13","You who are far off, hear what I have done; you who are near, acknowledge My might.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_14","024_33_14","ISA","33","14","14","The sinners in Zion are afraid; trembling grips the ungodly: “Who of us can dwell with a consuming fire? Who of us can dwell with everlasting flames?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_15","024_33_15","ISA","33","15","15","He who walks righteously and speaks with sincerity, who refuses gain from extortion, whose hand never takes a bribe, who stops his ears against murderous plots and shuts his eyes tightly against evil— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_16","024_33_16","ISA","33","16","16","he will dwell on the heights; the mountain fortress will be his refuge; his food will be provided and his water assured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_17","024_33_17","ISA","33","17","17","Your eyes will see the King in His beauty and behold a land that stretches afar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_18","024_33_18","ISA","33","18","18","Your mind will ponder the former terror: “Where is he who tallies? Where is he who weighs? Where is he who counts the towers?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_19","024_33_19","ISA","33","19","19","You will no longer see the insolent, a people whose speech is unintelligible, who stammer in a language you cannot understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_20","024_33_20","ISA","33","20","20","Look upon Zion, the city of our appointed feasts. Your eyes will see Jerusalem, a peaceful pasture, a tent that does not wander; its tent pegs will not be pulled up, nor will any of its cords be broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_21","024_33_21","ISA","33","21","21","But there the Majestic One, our LORD, will be for us a place of rivers and wide canals, where no galley with oars will row, and no majestic vessel will pass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_22","024_33_22","ISA","33","22","22","For the LORD is our Judge, the LORD is our lawgiver, the LORD is our King. It is He who will save us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_23","024_33_23","ISA","33","23","23","Your ropes are slack; they cannot secure the mast or spread the sail. Then an abundance of spoils will be divided, and even the lame will carry off plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS33_24","024_33_24","ISA","33","24","24","And no resident of Zion will say, “I am sick.” The people who dwell there will be forgiven of iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_1","024_34_1","ISA","34","1","1","Come near, O nations, to listen; pay attention, O peoples. Let the earth hear, and all that fills it, the world and all that springs from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_2","024_34_2","ISA","34","2","2","The LORD is angry with all the nations and furious with all their armies. He will devote them to destruction; He will give them over to slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_3","024_34_3","ISA","34","3","3","Their slain will be left unburied, and the stench of their corpses will rise; the mountains will flow with their blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_4","024_34_4","ISA","34","4","4","All the stars of heaven will be dissolved. The skies will be rolled up like a scroll, and all their stars will fall like withered leaves from the vine, like foliage from the fig tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_5","024_34_5","ISA","34","5","5","When My sword has drunk its fill in the heavens, then it will come down upon Edom, upon the people I have devoted to destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_6","024_34_6","ISA","34","6","6","The sword of the LORD is bathed in blood. It drips with fat—with the blood of lambs and goats, with the fat of the kidneys of rams. For the LORD has a sacrifice in Bozrah, a great slaughter in the land of Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_7","024_34_7","ISA","34","7","7","And the wild oxen will fall with them, the young bulls with the strong ones. Their land will be drenched with blood, and their soil will be soaked with fat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_8","024_34_8","ISA","34","8","8","For the LORD has a day of vengeance, a year of recompense for the cause of Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_9","024_34_9","ISA","34","9","9","Edom’s streams will be turned to tar, and her soil to sulfur; her land will become a blazing pitch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_10","024_34_10","ISA","34","10","10","It will not be quenched—day or night. Its smoke will ascend forever. From generation to generation it will lie desolate; no one will ever again pass through it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_11","024_34_11","ISA","34","11","11","The desert owl and screech owl will possess it, and the great owl and raven will dwell in it. The LORD will stretch out over Edom a measuring line of chaos and a plumb line of destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_12","024_34_12","ISA","34","12","12","No nobles will be left to proclaim a king, and all her princes will come to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_13","024_34_13","ISA","34","13","13","Her towers will be overgrown with thorns, her fortresses with thistles and briers. She will become a haunt for jackals, an abode for ostriches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_14","024_34_14","ISA","34","14","14","The desert creatures will meet with hyenas, and one wild goat will call to another. There the night creature will settle and find her place of repose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_15","024_34_15","ISA","34","15","15","There the owl will make her nest; she will lay and hatch her eggs and gather her brood under her shadow. Even there the birds of prey will gather, each with its mate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_16","024_34_16","ISA","34","16","16","Search and read the scroll of the LORD: Not one of these will go missing, not one will lack her mate, because He has ordered it by His mouth, and He will gather them by His Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS34_17","024_34_17","ISA","34","17","17","He has allotted their portion; His hand has distributed it by measure. They will possess it forever; they will dwell in it from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_1","024_35_1","ISA","35","1","1","The wilderness and the dry land will be glad; the desert will rejoice and blossom like a rose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_2","024_35_2","ISA","35","2","2","It will bloom profusely and rejoice with joy and singing. The glory of Lebanon will be given to it, the splendor of Carmel and Sharon. They will see the glory of the LORD, the splendor of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_3","024_35_3","ISA","35","3","3","Strengthen the limp hands and steady the feeble knees! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_4","024_35_4","ISA","35","4","4","Say to those with anxious hearts: “Be strong, do not fear! Behold, your God will come with vengeance. With divine retribution He will come to save you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_5","024_35_5","ISA","35","5","5","Then the eyes of the blind will be opened and the ears of the deaf unstopped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_6","024_35_6","ISA","35","6","6","Then the lame will leap like a deer and the mute tongue will shout for joy. For waters will gush forth in the wilderness, and streams in the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_7","024_35_7","ISA","35","7","7","The parched ground will become a pool, the thirsty land springs of water. In the haunt where jackals once lay, there will be grass and reeds and papyrus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_8","024_35_8","ISA","35","8","8","And there will be a highway called the Way of Holiness. The unclean will not travel it—only those who walk in the Way—and fools will not stray onto it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_9","024_35_9","ISA","35","9","9","No lion will be there, and no vicious beast will go up on it. Such will not be found there, but the redeemed will walk upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS35_10","024_35_10","ISA","35","10","10","So the redeemed of the LORD will return and enter Zion with singing, crowned with everlasting joy. Gladness and joy will overtake them, and sorrow and sighing will flee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_1","024_36_1","ISA","36","1","1","In the fourteenth year of Hezekiah’s reign, Sennacherib king of Assyria attacked and captured all the fortified cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_2","024_36_2","ISA","36","2","2","And the king of Assyria sent the Rabshakeh, with a great army, from Lachish to King Hezekiah at Jerusalem. And he stopped by the aqueduct of the upper pool, on the road to the Launderer’s Field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_3","024_36_3","ISA","36","3","3","Then Eliakim son of Hilkiah the palace administrator, Shebna the scribe, and Joah son of Asaph the recorder, went out to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_4","024_36_4","ISA","36","4","4","The Rabshakeh said to them, “Tell Hezekiah that this is what the great king, the king of Assyria, says: What is the basis of this confidence of yours? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_5","024_36_5","ISA","36","5","5","You claim to have a strategy and strength for war, but these are empty words. In whom are you now trusting, that you have rebelled against me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_6","024_36_6","ISA","36","6","6","Look now, you are trusting in Egypt, that splintered reed of a staff that will pierce the hand of anyone who leans on it. Such is Pharaoh king of Egypt to all who trust in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_7","024_36_7","ISA","36","7","7","But if you say to me, ‘We trust in the LORD our God,’ is He not the One whose high places and altars Hezekiah has removed, saying to Judah and Jerusalem, ‘You must worship before this altar’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_8","024_36_8","ISA","36","8","8","Now, therefore, make a bargain with my master, the king of Assyria. I will give you two thousand horses—if you can put riders on them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_9","024_36_9","ISA","36","9","9","For how can you repel a single officer among the least of my master’s servants when you depend on Egypt for chariots and horsemen? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_10","024_36_10","ISA","36","10","10","So now, was it apart from the LORD that I have come up against this land to destroy it? The LORD Himself said to me, ‘Go up against this land and destroy it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_11","024_36_11","ISA","36","11","11","Then Eliakim, Shebna, and Joah said to the Rabshakeh, “Please speak to your servants in Aramaic, since we understand it. Do not speak to us in Hebrew in the hearing of the people on the wall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_12","024_36_12","ISA","36","12","12","But the Rabshakeh replied, “Has my master sent me to speak these words only to you and your master, and not to the men sitting on the wall, who are destined with you to eat their own dung and drink their own urine?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_13","024_36_13","ISA","36","13","13","Then the Rabshakeh stood and called out loudly in Hebrew: “Hear the words of the great king, the king of Assyria! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_14","024_36_14","ISA","36","14","14","This is what the king says: Do not let Hezekiah deceive you, for he cannot deliver you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_15","024_36_15","ISA","36","15","15","Do not let Hezekiah persuade you to trust in the LORD when he says, ‘The LORD will surely deliver us; this city will not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_16","024_36_16","ISA","36","16","16","Do not listen to Hezekiah, for this is what the king of Assyria says: Make peace with me and come out to me. Then every one of you will eat from his own vine and his own fig tree, and drink water from his own cistern, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_17","024_36_17","ISA","36","17","17","until I come and take you away to a land like your own—a land of grain and new wine, a land of bread and vineyards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_18","024_36_18","ISA","36","18","18","Do not let Hezekiah mislead you when he says, ‘The LORD will deliver us.’ Has the god of any nation ever delivered his land from the hand of the king of Assyria? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_19","024_36_19","ISA","36","19","19","Where are the gods of Hamath and Arpad? Where are the gods of Sepharvaim? Have they delivered Samaria from my hand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_20","024_36_20","ISA","36","20","20","Who among all the gods of these lands has delivered his land from my hand? How then can the LORD deliver Jerusalem from my hand?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_21","024_36_21","ISA","36","21","21","But the people remained silent and did not answer a word, for Hezekiah had commanded, “Do not answer him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS36_22","024_36_22","ISA","36","22","22","Then Hilkiah’s son Eliakim the palace administrator, Shebna the scribe, and Asaph’s son Joah the recorder came to Hezekiah with their clothes torn, and they relayed to him the words of the Rabshakeh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_1","024_37_1","ISA","37","1","1","On hearing this report, King Hezekiah tore his clothes, put on sackcloth, and entered the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_2","024_37_2","ISA","37","2","2","And he sent Eliakim the palace administrator, Shebna the scribe, and the leading priests, all wearing sackcloth, to the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_3","024_37_3","ISA","37","3","3","to tell him, “This is what Hezekiah says: Today is a day of distress, rebuke, and disgrace; for children have come to the point of birth, but there is no strength to deliver them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_4","024_37_4","ISA","37","4","4","Perhaps the LORD your God will hear the words of the Rabshakeh, whom his master the king of Assyria has sent to defy the living God, and He will rebuke him for the words that the LORD your God has heard. Therefore lift up a prayer for the remnant that still survives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_5","024_37_5","ISA","37","5","5","So the servants of King Hezekiah went to Isaiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_6","024_37_6","ISA","37","6","6","who replied, “Tell your master that this is what the LORD says: ‘Do not be afraid of the words you have heard, with which the servants of the king of Assyria have blasphemed Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_7","024_37_7","ISA","37","7","7","Behold, I will put a spirit in him so that he will hear a rumor and return to his own land, where I will cause him to fall by the sword.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_8","024_37_8","ISA","37","8","8","When the Rabshakeh heard that the king of Assyria had left Lachish, he withdrew and found the king fighting against Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_9","024_37_9","ISA","37","9","9","Now Sennacherib had been warned about Tirhakah king of Cush: “He has set out to fight against you.” On hearing this, Sennacherib sent messengers to Hezekiah, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_10","024_37_10","ISA","37","10","10","“Give this message to Hezekiah king of Judah: ‘Do not let your God, in whom you trust, deceive you by saying that Jerusalem will not be delivered into the hand of the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_11","024_37_11","ISA","37","11","11","Surely you have heard what the kings of Assyria have done to all the other countries, devoting them to destruction. Will you then be spared? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_12","024_37_12","ISA","37","12","12","Did the gods of the nations destroyed by my fathers rescue those nations—the gods of Gozan, Haran, and Rezeph, and of the people of Eden in Telassar? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_13","024_37_13","ISA","37","13","13","Where are the kings of Hamath, Arpad, Sepharvaim, Hena, and Ivvah?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_14","024_37_14","ISA","37","14","14","So Hezekiah received the letter from the messengers, read it, and went up to the house of the LORD and spread it out before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_15","024_37_15","ISA","37","15","15","And Hezekiah prayed to the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_16","024_37_16","ISA","37","16","16","“O LORD of Hosts, God of Israel, enthroned above the cherubim, You alone are God over all the kingdoms of the earth. You made the heavens and the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_17","024_37_17","ISA","37","17","17","Incline Your ear, O LORD, and hear; open Your eyes, O LORD, and see. Listen to all the words that Sennacherib has sent to defy the living God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_18","024_37_18","ISA","37","18","18","Truly, O LORD, the kings of Assyria have laid waste all these countries and their lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_19","024_37_19","ISA","37","19","19","They have cast their gods into the fire and destroyed them, for they were not gods, but only wood and stone—the work of human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_20","024_37_20","ISA","37","20","20","And now, O LORD our God, save us from his hand, so that all the kingdoms of the earth may know that You alone, O LORD, are God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_21","024_37_21","ISA","37","21","21","Then Isaiah son of Amoz sent a message to Hezekiah: “This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: Because you have prayed to Me concerning Sennacherib king of Assyria, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_22","024_37_22","ISA","37","22","22","this is the word that the LORD has spoken against him: ‘The Virgin Daughter of Zion despises you and mocks you; the Daughter of Jerusalem shakes her head behind you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_23","024_37_23","ISA","37","23","23","Whom have you taunted and blasphemed? Against whom have you raised your voice and lifted your eyes in pride? Against the Holy One of Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_24","024_37_24","ISA","37","24","24","Through your servants you have taunted the Lord, and you have said: “With my many chariots I have ascended to the heights of the mountains, to the remote peaks of Lebanon. I have cut down its tallest cedars, the finest of its cypresses. I have reached its farthest heights, the densest of its forests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_25","024_37_25","ISA","37","25","25","I have dug wells and drunk foreign waters. With the soles of my feet I have dried up all the streams of Egypt.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_26","024_37_26","ISA","37","26","26","Have you not heard? Long ago I ordained it; in days of old I planned it. Now I have brought it to pass, that you should crush fortified cities into piles of rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_27","024_37_27","ISA","37","27","27","Therefore their inhabitants, devoid of power, are dismayed and ashamed. They are like plants in the field, tender green shoots, grass on the rooftops, scorched before it is grown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_28","024_37_28","ISA","37","28","28","But I know your sitting down, your going out and coming in, and your raging against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_29","024_37_29","ISA","37","29","29","Because your rage and arrogance against Me have reached My ears, I will put My hook in your nose and My bit in your mouth; I will send you back the way you came.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_30","024_37_30","ISA","37","30","30","And this will be a sign to you, O Hezekiah: This year you will eat what grows on its own, and in the second year what springs from the same. But in the third year you will sow and reap; you will plant vineyards and eat their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_31","024_37_31","ISA","37","31","31","And the surviving remnant of the house of Judah will again take root below and bear fruit above. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_32","024_37_32","ISA","37","32","32","For a remnant will go forth from Jerusalem, and survivors from Mount Zion. The zeal of the LORD of Hosts will accomplish this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_33","024_37_33","ISA","37","33","33","So this is what the LORD says about the king of Assyria: ‘He will not enter this city or shoot an arrow into it. He will not come before it with a shield or build up a siege ramp against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_34","024_37_34","ISA","37","34","34","He will go back the way he came, and he will not enter this city,’ declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_35","024_37_35","ISA","37","35","35","‘I will defend this city and save it for My own sake and for the sake of My servant David.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_36","024_37_36","ISA","37","36","36","Then the angel of the LORD went out and struck down 185,000 men in the camp of the Assyrians. When the people got up the next morning, there were all the dead bodies! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_37","024_37_37","ISA","37","37","37","So Sennacherib king of Assyria broke camp and withdrew. He returned to Nineveh and stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS37_38","024_37_38","ISA","37","38","38","One day, while he was worshiping in the temple of his god Nisroch, his sons Adrammelech and Sharezer put him to the sword and escaped to the land of Ararat. And his son Esar-haddon reigned in his place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_1","024_38_1","ISA","38","1","1","In those days Hezekiah became mortally ill. The prophet Isaiah son of Amoz came to him and said, “This is what the LORD says: ‘Put your house in order, for you are about to die; you will not recover.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_2","024_38_2","ISA","38","2","2","Then Hezekiah turned his face to the wall and prayed to the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_3","024_38_3","ISA","38","3","3","saying, “Please, O LORD, remember how I have walked before You faithfully and with wholehearted devotion; I have done what is good in Your sight.” And Hezekiah wept bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_4","024_38_4","ISA","38","4","4","And the word of the LORD came to Isaiah, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_5","024_38_5","ISA","38","5","5","“Go and tell Hezekiah that this is what the LORD, the God of your father David, says: ‘I have heard your prayer; I have seen your tears. Behold, I will add fifteen years to your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_6","024_38_6","ISA","38","6","6","And I will deliver you and this city from the hand of the king of Assyria. I will defend this city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_7","024_38_7","ISA","38","7","7","This will be a sign to you from the LORD that He will do what He has promised: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_8","024_38_8","ISA","38","8","8","I will make the sun’s shadow that falls on the stairway of Ahaz go back ten steps.’” So the sunlight went back the ten steps it had descended. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_9","024_38_9","ISA","38","9","9","This is a writing by Hezekiah king of Judah after his illness and recovery: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_10","024_38_10","ISA","38","10","10","I said, “In the prime of my life I must go through the gates of Sheol and be deprived of the remainder of my years.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_11","024_38_11","ISA","38","11","11","I said, “I will never again see the LORD, even the LORD, in the land of the living; I will no longer look on mankind with those who dwell in this world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_12","024_38_12","ISA","38","12","12","My dwelling has been picked up and removed from me like a shepherd’s tent. I have rolled up my life like a weaver; He cuts me off from the loom; from day until night You make an end of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_13","024_38_13","ISA","38","13","13","I composed myself until the morning. Like a lion He breaks all my bones; from day until night You make an end of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_14","024_38_14","ISA","38","14","14","I chirp like a swallow or crane; I moan like a dove. My eyes grow weak as I look upward. O Lord, I am oppressed; be my security.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_15","024_38_15","ISA","38","15","15","What can I say? He has spoken to me, and He Himself has done this. I will walk slowly all my years because of the anguish of my soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_16","024_38_16","ISA","38","16","16","O Lord, by such things men live, and in all of them my spirit finds life. You have restored me to health and have let me live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_17","024_38_17","ISA","38","17","17","Surely for my own welfare I had such great anguish; but Your love has delivered me from the pit of oblivion, for You have cast all my sins behind Your back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_18","024_38_18","ISA","38","18","18","For Sheol cannot thank You; Death cannot praise You. Those who descend to the Pit cannot hope for Your faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_19","024_38_19","ISA","38","19","19","The living, only the living, can thank You, as I do today; fathers will tell their children about Your faithfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_20","024_38_20","ISA","38","20","20","The LORD will save me; we will play songs on stringed instruments all the days of our lives in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_21","024_38_21","ISA","38","21","21","Now Isaiah had said, “Prepare a lump of pressed figs and apply it to the boil, and he will recover.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS38_22","024_38_22","ISA","38","22","22","And Hezekiah had asked, “What will be the sign that I will go up to the house of the LORD?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_1","024_39_1","ISA","39","1","1","At that time Merodach-baladan son of Baladan king of Babylon sent letters and a gift to Hezekiah, for he had heard about Hezekiah’s illness and recovery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_2","024_39_2","ISA","39","2","2","And Hezekiah welcomed the envoys gladly and showed them what was in his treasure house—the silver, the gold, the spices, and the precious oil, as well as his entire armory—all that was found in his storehouses. There was nothing in his palace or in all his dominion that Hezekiah did not show them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_3","024_39_3","ISA","39","3","3","Then the prophet Isaiah went to King Hezekiah and asked, “Where did those men come from, and what did they say to you?” “They came to me from a distant land,” Hezekiah replied, “from Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_4","024_39_4","ISA","39","4","4","“What have they seen in your palace?” Isaiah asked. “They have seen everything in my palace,” answered Hezekiah. “There is nothing among my treasures that I did not show them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_5","024_39_5","ISA","39","5","5","Then Isaiah said to Hezekiah, “Hear the word of the LORD of Hosts: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_6","024_39_6","ISA","39","6","6","The time will surely come when everything in your palace and all that your fathers have stored up until this day will be carried off to Babylon. Nothing will be left, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_7","024_39_7","ISA","39","7","7","And some of your descendants, your own flesh and blood, will be taken away to be eunuchs in the palace of the king of Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS39_8","024_39_8","ISA","39","8","8","But Hezekiah said to Isaiah, “The word of the LORD that you have spoken is good.” For he thought, “At least there will be peace and security in my lifetime.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_1","024_40_1","ISA","40","1","1","“Comfort, comfort My people,” says your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_2","024_40_2","ISA","40","2","2","“Speak tenderly to Jerusalem, and proclaim to her that her forced labor has been completed; her iniquity has been pardoned. For she has received from the hand of the LORD double for all her sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_3","024_40_3","ISA","40","3","3","A voice of one calling: “Prepare the way for the LORD in the wilderness; make a straight highway for our God in the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_4","024_40_4","ISA","40","4","4","Every valley shall be lifted up, and every mountain and hill made low; the uneven ground will become smooth, and the rugged land a plain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_5","024_40_5","ISA","40","5","5","And the glory of the LORD will be revealed, and all humanity together will see it.” For the mouth of the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_6","024_40_6","ISA","40","6","6","A voice says, “Cry out!” And I asked, “What should I cry out?” “All flesh is like grass, and all its glory like the flowers of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_7","024_40_7","ISA","40","7","7","The grass withers and the flowers fall when the breath of the LORD blows on them; indeed, the people are grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_8","024_40_8","ISA","40","8","8","The grass withers and the flowers fall, but the word of our God stands forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_9","024_40_9","ISA","40","9","9","Go up on a high mountain, O Zion, herald of good news. Raise your voice loudly, O Jerusalem, herald of good news. Lift it up, do not be afraid! Say to the cities of Judah, “Here is your God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_10","024_40_10","ISA","40","10","10","Behold, the Lord GOD comes with might, and His arm establishes His rule. His reward is with Him, and His recompense accompanies Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_11","024_40_11","ISA","40","11","11","He tends His flock like a shepherd; He gathers the lambs in His arms and carries them close to His heart. He gently leads the nursing ewes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_12","024_40_12","ISA","40","12","12","Who has measured the waters in the hollow of his hand, or marked off the heavens with the span of his hand? Who has held the dust of the earth in a basket, or weighed the mountains on a scale and the hills with a balance? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_13","024_40_13","ISA","40","13","13","Who has directed the Spirit of the LORD, or informed Him as His counselor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_14","024_40_14","ISA","40","14","14","Whom did He consult to enlighten Him, and who taught Him the paths of justice? Who imparted knowledge to Him and showed Him the way of understanding? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_15","024_40_15","ISA","40","15","15","Surely the nations are like a drop in a bucket; they are considered a speck of dust on the scales; He lifts up the islands like fine dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_16","024_40_16","ISA","40","16","16","Lebanon is not sufficient for fuel, nor its animals enough for a burnt offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_17","024_40_17","ISA","40","17","17","All the nations are as nothing before Him; He regards them as nothingness and emptiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_18","024_40_18","ISA","40","18","18","To whom will you liken God? To what image will you compare Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_19","024_40_19","ISA","40","19","19","To an idol that a craftsman casts and a metalworker overlays with gold and fits with silver chains? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_20","024_40_20","ISA","40","20","20","One lacking such an offering chooses wood that will not rot. He seeks a skilled craftsman to set up an idol that will not topple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_21","024_40_21","ISA","40","21","21","Do you not know? Have you not heard? Has it not been declared to you from the beginning? Have you not understood since the foundation of the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_22","024_40_22","ISA","40","22","22","He sits enthroned above the circle of the earth; its dwellers are like grasshoppers. He stretches out the heavens like a curtain, and spreads them out like a tent to dwell in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_23","024_40_23","ISA","40","23","23","He brings the princes to nothing and makes the rulers of the earth meaningless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_24","024_40_24","ISA","40","24","24","No sooner are they planted, no sooner are they sown, no sooner have their stems taken root in the ground, than He blows on them and they wither, and a whirlwind sweeps them away like stubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_25","024_40_25","ISA","40","25","25","“To whom will you liken Me, or who is My equal?” asks the Holy One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_26","024_40_26","ISA","40","26","26","Lift up your eyes on high: Who created all these? He leads forth the starry host by number; He calls each one by name. Because of His great power and mighty strength, not one of them is missing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_27","024_40_27","ISA","40","27","27","Why do you say, O Jacob, and why do you assert, O Israel, “My way is hidden from the LORD, and my claim is ignored by my God”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_28","024_40_28","ISA","40","28","28","Do you not know? Have you not heard? The LORD is the everlasting God, the Creator of the ends of the earth. He will not grow tired or weary; His understanding is beyond searching out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_29","024_40_29","ISA","40","29","29","He gives power to the faint and increases the strength of the weak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_30","024_40_30","ISA","40","30","30","Even youths grow tired and weary, and young men stumble and fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS40_31","024_40_31","ISA","40","31","31","But those who wait upon the LORD will renew their strength; they will mount up with wings like eagles; they will run and not grow weary, they will walk and not faint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_1","024_41_1","ISA","41","1","1","“Be silent before Me, O islands, and let the peoples renew their strength. Let them come forward and testify; let us together draw near for judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_2","024_41_2","ISA","41","2","2","Who has aroused one from the east and called him to his feet in righteousness? He hands nations over to him and subdues kings before him. He turns them to dust with his sword, to windblown chaff with his bow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_3","024_41_3","ISA","41","3","3","He pursues them, going on safely, hardly touching the path with his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_4","024_41_4","ISA","41","4","4","Who has performed this and carried it out, calling forth the generations from the beginning? I, the LORD—the first and the last—I am He.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_5","024_41_5","ISA","41","5","5","The islands see and fear; the ends of the earth tremble. They approach and come forward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_6","024_41_6","ISA","41","6","6","Each one helps the other and says to his brother, “Be strong!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_7","024_41_7","ISA","41","7","7","The craftsman encourages the goldsmith, and he who wields the hammer cheers him who strikes the anvil, saying of the welding, “It is good.” He nails it down so it will not be toppled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_8","024_41_8","ISA","41","8","8","“But you, O Israel, My servant, Jacob, whom I have chosen, descendant of Abraham My friend— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_9","024_41_9","ISA","41","9","9","I brought you from the ends of the earth and called you from its farthest corners. I said, ‘You are My servant.’ I have chosen and not rejected you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_10","024_41_10","ISA","41","10","10","Do not fear, for I am with you; do not be afraid, for I am your God. I will strengthen you; I will surely help you; I will uphold you with My righteous right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_11","024_41_11","ISA","41","11","11","Behold, all who rage against you will be ashamed and disgraced; those who contend with you will be reduced to nothing and will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_12","024_41_12","ISA","41","12","12","You will seek them but will not find them. Those who wage war against you will come to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_13","024_41_13","ISA","41","13","13","For I am the LORD your God, who takes hold of your right hand and tells you: Do not fear, I will help you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_14","024_41_14","ISA","41","14","14","Do not fear, O Jacob, you worm, O few men of Israel. I will help you,” declares the LORD. “Your Redeemer is the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_15","024_41_15","ISA","41","15","15","Behold, I will make you into a threshing sledge, new and sharp, with many teeth. You will thresh the mountains and crush them, and reduce the hills to chaff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_16","024_41_16","ISA","41","16","16","You will winnow them, and a wind will carry them away; a gale will scatter them. But you will rejoice in the LORD; you will glory in the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_17","024_41_17","ISA","41","17","17","The poor and needy seek water, but there is none; their tongues are parched with thirst. I, the LORD, will answer them; I, the God of Israel, will not forsake them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_18","024_41_18","ISA","41","18","18","I will open rivers on the barren heights, and fountains in the middle of the valleys. I will turn the desert into a pool of water, and the dry land into flowing springs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_19","024_41_19","ISA","41","19","19","I will plant cedars in the wilderness, acacias, myrtles, and olive trees. I will set cypresses in the desert, elms and boxwood together, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_20","024_41_20","ISA","41","20","20","so that all may see and know, may consider and understand, that the hand of the LORD has done this and the Holy One of Israel has created it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_21","024_41_21","ISA","41","21","21","“Present your case,” says the LORD. “Submit your arguments,” says the King of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_22","024_41_22","ISA","41","22","22","“Let them come and tell us what will happen. Tell the former things, so that we may reflect on them and know the outcome. Or announce to us what is coming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_23","024_41_23","ISA","41","23","23","Tell us the things that are to come, so that we may know that you are gods. Yes, do something good or evil, that we may look on together in dismay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_24","024_41_24","ISA","41","24","24","Behold, you are nothing and your work is of no value. Anyone who chooses you is detestable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_25","024_41_25","ISA","41","25","25","I have raised up one from the north, and he has come—one from the east who calls on My name. He will march over rulers as if they were mortar, like a potter who treads the clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_26","024_41_26","ISA","41","26","26","Who has declared this from the beginning, so that we may know, and from times past, so that we may say: ‘He was right’? No one announced it, no one foretold it, no one heard your words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_27","024_41_27","ISA","41","27","27","I was the first to tell Zion: ‘Look, here they are!’ And I gave to Jerusalem a herald of good news. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_28","024_41_28","ISA","41","28","28","When I look, there is no one; there is no counselor among them; when I ask them, they have nothing to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS41_29","024_41_29","ISA","41","29","29","See, they are all a delusion; their works amount to nothing; their images are as empty as the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_1","024_42_1","ISA","42","1","1","“Here is My Servant, whom I uphold, My Chosen One, in whom My soul delights. I will put My Spirit on Him, and He will bring justice to the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_2","024_42_2","ISA","42","2","2","He will not cry out or raise His voice, nor make His voice heard in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_3","024_42_3","ISA","42","3","3","A bruised reed He will not break and a smoldering wick He will not extinguish; He will faithfully bring forth justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_4","024_42_4","ISA","42","4","4","He will not grow weak or discouraged before He has established justice on the earth. In His law the islands will put their hope.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_5","024_42_5","ISA","42","5","5","This is what God the LORD says—He who created the heavens and stretched them out, who spread out the earth and its offspring, who gives breath to the people on it and life to those who walk in it: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_6","024_42_6","ISA","42","6","6","“I, the LORD, have called you for a righteous purpose, and I will take hold of your hand. I will keep you and appoint you to be a covenant for the people and a light to the nations, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_7","024_42_7","ISA","42","7","7","to open the eyes of the blind, to bring prisoners out of the dungeon and those sitting in darkness out from the prison house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_8","024_42_8","ISA","42","8","8","I am the LORD; that is My name! I will not yield My glory to another or My praise to idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_9","024_42_9","ISA","42","9","9","Behold, the former things have happened, and now I declare new things. Before they spring forth I proclaim them to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_10","024_42_10","ISA","42","10","10","Sing to the LORD a new song—His praise from the ends of the earth—you who go down to the sea, and all that is in it, you islands, and all who dwell in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_11","024_42_11","ISA","42","11","11","Let the desert and its cities raise their voices; let the villages of Kedar cry aloud. Let the people of Sela sing for joy; let them cry out from the mountaintops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_12","024_42_12","ISA","42","12","12","Let them give glory to the LORD and declare His praise in the islands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_13","024_42_13","ISA","42","13","13","The LORD goes forth like a mighty one; He stirs up His zeal like a warrior. He shouts; yes, He roars in triumph over His enemies: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_14","024_42_14","ISA","42","14","14","“I have kept silent from ages past; I have remained quiet and restrained. But now I will groan like a woman in labor; I will at once gasp and pant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_15","024_42_15","ISA","42","15","15","I will lay waste the mountains and hills and dry up all their vegetation. I will turn the rivers into dry land and drain the marshes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_16","024_42_16","ISA","42","16","16","I will lead the blind by a way they did not know; I will guide them on unfamiliar paths. I will turn darkness into light before them and rough places into level ground. These things I will do for them, and I will not forsake them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_17","024_42_17","ISA","42","17","17","But those who trust in idols and say to molten images, ‘You are our gods!’ will be turned back in utter shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_18","024_42_18","ISA","42","18","18","Listen, you deaf ones; look, you blind ones, that you may see! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_19","024_42_19","ISA","42","19","19","Who is blind but My servant, or deaf like the messenger I am sending? Who is blind like My covenant partner, or blind like the servant of the LORD? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_20","024_42_20","ISA","42","20","20","Though seeing many things, you do not keep watch. Though your ears are open, you do not hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_21","024_42_21","ISA","42","21","21","The LORD was pleased, for the sake of His righteousness, to magnify His law and make it glorious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_22","024_42_22","ISA","42","22","22","But this is a people plundered and looted, all trapped in caves or imprisoned in dungeons. They have become plunder with no one to rescue them, and loot with no one to say, “Send them back!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_23","024_42_23","ISA","42","23","23","Who among you will pay attention to this? Who will listen and obey hereafter? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_24","024_42_24","ISA","42","24","24","Who gave Jacob up for spoil, and Israel to the plunderers? Was it not the LORD, against whom we have sinned? They were unwilling to walk in His ways, and they would not obey His law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS42_25","024_42_25","ISA","42","25","25","So He poured out on them His furious anger and the fierceness of battle. It enveloped them in flames, but they did not understand; it consumed them, but they did not take it to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_1","024_43_1","ISA","43","1","1","But now, this is what the LORD says—He who created you, O Jacob, and He who formed you, O Israel: “Do not fear, for I have redeemed you; I have called you by your name; you are Mine! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_2","024_43_2","ISA","43","2","2","When you pass through the waters, I will be with you; and when you go through the rivers, they will not overwhelm you. When you walk through the fire, you will not be scorched; the flames will not set you ablaze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_3","024_43_3","ISA","43","3","3","For I am the LORD your God, the Holy One of Israel, your Savior; I give Egypt for your ransom, Cush and Seba in your place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_4","024_43_4","ISA","43","4","4","Because you are precious and honored in My sight, and because I love you, I will give men in exchange for you and nations in place of your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_5","024_43_5","ISA","43","5","5","Do not be afraid, for I am with you; I will bring your offspring from the east and gather you from the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_6","024_43_6","ISA","43","6","6","I will say to the north, ‘Give them up!’ and to the south, ‘Do not hold them back!’ Bring My sons from afar, and My daughters from the ends of the earth— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_7","024_43_7","ISA","43","7","7","everyone called by My name and created for My glory, whom I have indeed formed and made.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_8","024_43_8","ISA","43","8","8","Bring out a people who have eyes but are blind, and who have ears but are deaf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_9","024_43_9","ISA","43","9","9","All the nations gather together and the peoples assemble. Who among them can declare this, and proclaim to us the former things? Let them present their witnesses to vindicate them, so that others may hear and say, “It is true.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_10","024_43_10","ISA","43","10","10","“You are My witnesses,” declares the LORD, “and My servant whom I have chosen, so that you may consider and believe Me and understand that I am He. Before Me no god was formed, and after Me none will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_11","024_43_11","ISA","43","11","11","I, yes I, am the LORD, and there is no Savior but Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_12","024_43_12","ISA","43","12","12","I alone decreed and saved and proclaimed—I, and not some foreign god among you. So you are My witnesses,” declares the LORD, “that I am God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_13","024_43_13","ISA","43","13","13","Even from eternity I am He, and none can deliver out of My hand. When I act, who can reverse it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_14","024_43_14","ISA","43","14","14","Thus says the LORD your Redeemer, the Holy One of Israel: “For your sake, I will send to Babylon and bring them all as fugitives, even the Chaldeans, in the ships in which they rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_15","024_43_15","ISA","43","15","15","I am the LORD, your Holy One, the Creator of Israel, and your King.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_16","024_43_16","ISA","43","16","16","Thus says the LORD, who makes a way in the sea and a path through the surging waters, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_17","024_43_17","ISA","43","17","17","who brings out the chariots and horses, the armies and warriors together, to lie down, never to rise again; to be extinguished, snuffed out like a wick: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_18","024_43_18","ISA","43","18","18","“Do not call to mind the former things; pay no attention to the things of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_19","024_43_19","ISA","43","19","19","Behold, I am about to do something new; even now it is coming. Do you not see it? Indeed, I will make a way in the wilderness and streams in the desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_20","024_43_20","ISA","43","20","20","The beasts of the field will honor Me, the jackals and the ostriches, because I provide water in the wilderness and rivers in the desert, to give drink to My chosen people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_21","024_43_21","ISA","43","21","21","The people I formed for Myself will declare My praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_22","024_43_22","ISA","43","22","22","But you have not called on Me, O Jacob, because you have grown weary of Me, O Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_23","024_43_23","ISA","43","23","23","You have not brought Me sheep for burnt offerings, nor honored Me with your sacrifices. I have not burdened you with offerings, nor wearied you with frankincense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_24","024_43_24","ISA","43","24","24","You have not bought Me sweet cane with your silver, nor satisfied Me with the fat of your sacrifices. But you have burdened Me with your sins; you have wearied Me with your iniquities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_25","024_43_25","ISA","43","25","25","I, yes I, am He who blots out your transgressions for My own sake and remembers your sins no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_26","024_43_26","ISA","43","26","26","Remind Me, let us argue the matter together. State your case, so that you may be vindicated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_27","024_43_27","ISA","43","27","27","Your first father sinned, and your spokesmen rebelled against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS43_28","024_43_28","ISA","43","28","28","So I will disgrace the princes of your sanctuary, and I will devote Jacob to destruction and Israel to reproach.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_1","024_44_1","ISA","44","1","1","But now listen, O Jacob My servant, Israel, whom I have chosen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_2","024_44_2","ISA","44","2","2","This is the word of the LORD, your Maker, who formed you from the womb and who will help you: “Do not be afraid, O Jacob My servant, Jeshurun, whom I have chosen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_3","024_44_3","ISA","44","3","3","For I will pour water on the thirsty land, and currents on the dry ground. I will pour out My Spirit on your descendants, and My blessing on your offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_4","024_44_4","ISA","44","4","4","They will sprout among the grass like willows by flowing streams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_5","024_44_5","ISA","44","5","5","One will say, ‘I belong to the LORD,’ another will call himself by the name of Jacob, and still another will write on his hand, ‘The LORD’s,’ and will take the name of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_6","024_44_6","ISA","44","6","6","Thus says the LORD, the King and Redeemer of Israel, the LORD of Hosts: “I am the first and I am the last, and there is no God but Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_7","024_44_7","ISA","44","7","7","Who then is like Me? Let him say so! Let him declare his case before Me, since I established an ancient people. Let him foretell the things to come, and what is to take place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_8","024_44_8","ISA","44","8","8","Do not tremble or fear. Have I not told you and declared it long ago? You are My witnesses! Is there any God but Me? There is no other Rock; I know not one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_9","024_44_9","ISA","44","9","9","All makers of idols are nothing, and the things they treasure are worthless. Their witnesses fail to see or comprehend, so they are put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_10","024_44_10","ISA","44","10","10","Who fashions a god or casts an idol which profits him nothing? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_11","024_44_11","ISA","44","11","11","Behold, all his companions will be put to shame, for the craftsmen themselves are only human. Let them all assemble and take their stand; they will all be brought to terror and shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_12","024_44_12","ISA","44","12","12","The blacksmith takes a tool and labors over the coals; he fashions an idol with hammers and forges it with his strong arms. Yet he grows hungry and loses his strength; he fails to drink water and grows faint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_13","024_44_13","ISA","44","13","13","The woodworker extends a measuring line; he marks it out with a stylus; he shapes it with chisels and outlines it with a compass. He fashions it in the likeness of man, like man in all his glory, that it may dwell in a shrine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_14","024_44_14","ISA","44","14","14","He cuts down cedars or retrieves a cypress or oak. He lets it grow strong among the trees of the forest. He plants a laurel, and the rain makes it grow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_15","024_44_15","ISA","44","15","15","It serves as fuel for man. He takes some of it to warm himself, and he kindles a fire and bakes his bread. He also fashions it into a god and worships it; he makes an idol and bows down to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_16","024_44_16","ISA","44","16","16","He burns half of it in the fire, and he roasts meat on that half. He eats the roast and is satisfied. Indeed, he warms himself and says, “Ah! I am warm; I see the fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_17","024_44_17","ISA","44","17","17","From the rest he makes a god, his graven image. He bows down to it and worships; he prays to it and says, “Save me, for you are my god.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_18","024_44_18","ISA","44","18","18","They do not comprehend or discern, for He has shut their eyes so they cannot see and closed their minds so they cannot understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_19","024_44_19","ISA","44","19","19","And no one considers in his heart, no one has the knowledge or insight to say, “I burned half of it in the fire, and I baked bread on its coals; I roasted meat and I ate. Shall I make something detestable with the rest of it? Shall I bow down to a block of wood?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_20","024_44_20","ISA","44","20","20","He feeds on ashes. His deluded heart has led him astray, and he cannot deliver himself or say, “Is not this thing in my right hand a lie?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_21","024_44_21","ISA","44","21","21","Remember these things, O Jacob, for you are My servant, O Israel. I have made you, and you are My servant; O Israel, I will never forget you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_22","024_44_22","ISA","44","22","22","I have blotted out your transgressions like a cloud, and your sins like a mist. Return to Me, for I have redeemed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_23","024_44_23","ISA","44","23","23","Sing for joy, O heavens, for the LORD has done this; shout aloud, O depths of the earth. Break forth in song, O mountains, you forests and all your trees. For the LORD has redeemed Jacob, and revealed His glory in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_24","024_44_24","ISA","44","24","24","Thus says the LORD, your Redeemer who formed you from the womb: “I am the LORD, who has made all things, who alone stretched out the heavens, who by Myself spread out the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_25","024_44_25","ISA","44","25","25","who foils the signs of false prophets and makes fools of diviners, who confounds the wise and turns their knowledge into nonsense, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_26","024_44_26","ISA","44","26","26","who confirms the message of His servant and fulfills the counsel of His messengers, who says of Jerusalem, ‘She will be inhabited,’ and of the cities of Judah, ‘They will be rebuilt, and I will restore their ruins,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_27","024_44_27","ISA","44","27","27","who says to the depths of the sea, ‘Be dry, and I will dry up your currents,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS44_28","024_44_28","ISA","44","28","28","who says of Cyrus, ‘My shepherd will fulfill all that I desire,’ who says of Jerusalem, ‘She will be rebuilt,’ and of the temple, ‘Let its foundation be laid.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_1","024_45_1","ISA","45","1","1","This is what the LORD says to Cyrus His anointed, whose right hand I have grasped to subdue nations before him, to disarm kings, to open the doors before him, so that the gates will not be shut: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_2","024_45_2","ISA","45","2","2","“I will go before you and level the mountains; I will break down the gates of bronze and cut through the bars of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_3","024_45_3","ISA","45","3","3","I will give you the treasures of darkness and the riches hidden in secret places, so that you may know that I am the LORD, the God of Israel, who calls you by name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_4","024_45_4","ISA","45","4","4","For the sake of Jacob My servant and Israel My chosen one, I call you by name; I have given you a title of honor, though you have not known Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_5","024_45_5","ISA","45","5","5","I am the LORD, and there is no other; there is no God but Me. I will equip you for battle, though you have not known Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_6","024_45_6","ISA","45","6","6","so that all may know, from where the sun rises to where it sets, that there is none but Me; I am the LORD, and there is no other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_7","024_45_7","ISA","45","7","7","I form the light and create the darkness; I bring prosperity and create calamity. I, the LORD, do all these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_8","024_45_8","ISA","45","8","8","Drip down, O heavens, from above, and let the skies pour down righteousness. Let the earth open up that salvation may sprout and righteousness spring up with it; I, the LORD, have created it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_9","024_45_9","ISA","45","9","9","Woe to him who quarrels with his Maker—one clay pot among many. Does the clay ask the potter, ‘What are you making?’ Does your work say, ‘He has no hands’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_10","024_45_10","ISA","45","10","10","Woe to him who says to his father, ‘What have you begotten?’ or to his mother, ‘What have you brought forth?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_11","024_45_11","ISA","45","11","11","Thus says the LORD, the Holy One of Israel, and its Maker: “Concerning things to come, do you question Me about My sons, or instruct Me in the work of My hands? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_12","024_45_12","ISA","45","12","12","It is I who made the earth and created man upon it. It was My hands that stretched out the heavens, and I ordained all their host. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_13","024_45_13","ISA","45","13","13","I will raise up Cyrus in righteousness, and I will make all his ways straight. He will rebuild My city and set My exiles free, but not for payment or reward, says the LORD of Hosts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_14","024_45_14","ISA","45","14","14","This is what the LORD says: “The products of Egypt and the merchandise of Cush, along with the Sabeans, men of stature, will come over to you and will be yours; they will trudge behind you; they will come over in chains and bow down to you. They will confess to you: ‘God is indeed with you, and there is no other; there is no other God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_15","024_45_15","ISA","45","15","15","Truly You are a God who hides Himself, O God of Israel, the Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_16","024_45_16","ISA","45","16","16","They will all be put to shame and humiliated; the makers of idols will depart together in disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_17","024_45_17","ISA","45","17","17","But Israel will be saved by the LORD with an everlasting salvation; you will not be put to shame or humiliated, to ages everlasting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_18","024_45_18","ISA","45","18","18","For thus says the LORD, who created the heavens—He is God; He formed the earth and fashioned it; He established it; He did not create it to be empty, but formed it to be inhabited: “I am the LORD, and there is no other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_19","024_45_19","ISA","45","19","19","I have not spoken in secret, from a place in a land of darkness. I did not say to the descendants of Jacob, ‘Seek Me in a wasteland.’ I, the LORD, speak the truth; I say what is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_20","024_45_20","ISA","45","20","20","Come, gather together, and draw near, you fugitives from the nations. Ignorant are those who carry idols of wood and pray to a god that cannot save. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_21","024_45_21","ISA","45","21","21","Speak up and present your case—yes, let them take counsel together. Who foretold this long ago? Who announced it from ancient times? Was it not I, the LORD? There is no other God but Me, a righteous God and Savior; there is none but Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_22","024_45_22","ISA","45","22","22","Turn to Me and be saved, all the ends of the earth; for I am God, and there is no other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_23","024_45_23","ISA","45","23","23","By Myself I have sworn; truth has gone out from My mouth, a word that will not be revoked: Every knee will bow before Me, every tongue will swear allegiance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_24","024_45_24","ISA","45","24","24","Surely they will say of Me, ‘In the LORD alone are righteousness and strength.’” All who rage against Him will come to Him and be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS45_25","024_45_25","ISA","45","25","25","In the LORD all descendants of Israel will be justified and will exult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_1","024_46_1","ISA","46","1","1","Bel crouches; Nebo cowers. Their idols weigh down beasts and cattle. The images you carry are burdensome, a load to the weary animal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_2","024_46_2","ISA","46","2","2","The gods cower; they crouch together, unable to relieve the burden; but they themselves go into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_3","024_46_3","ISA","46","3","3","“Listen to Me, O house of Jacob, all the remnant of the house of Israel, who have been sustained from the womb, carried along since birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_4","024_46_4","ISA","46","4","4","Even to your old age, I will be the same, and I will bear you up when you turn gray. I have made you, and I will carry you; I will sustain you and deliver you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_5","024_46_5","ISA","46","5","5","To whom will you liken Me or count Me equal? To whom will you compare Me, that we should be alike? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_6","024_46_6","ISA","46","6","6","They pour out their bags of gold and weigh out silver on scales; they hire a goldsmith to fashion it into a god, so they can bow down and worship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_7","024_46_7","ISA","46","7","7","They lift it to their shoulder and carry it along; they set it in its place, and there it stands, not budging from that spot. They cry out to it, but it does not answer; it saves no one from his troubles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_8","024_46_8","ISA","46","8","8","Remember this and be brave; take it to heart, you transgressors! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_9","024_46_9","ISA","46","9","9","Remember what happened long ago, for I am God, and there is no other; I am God, and there is none like Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_10","024_46_10","ISA","46","10","10","I declare the end from the beginning, and from ancient times what is still to come. I say, ‘My purpose will stand, and all My good pleasure I will accomplish.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_11","024_46_11","ISA","46","11","11","I summon a bird of prey from the east, a man for My purpose from a far-off land. Truly I have spoken, and truly I will bring it to pass. I have planned it, and I will surely do it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_12","024_46_12","ISA","46","12","12","Listen to Me, you stubborn people, far removed from righteousness: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS46_13","024_46_13","ISA","46","13","13","I am bringing My righteousness near; it is not far away, and My salvation will not be delayed. I will grant salvation to Zion and adorn Israel with My splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_1","024_47_1","ISA","47","1","1","“Go down and sit in the dust, O Virgin Daughter of Babylon. Sit on the ground without a throne, O Daughter of the Chaldeans! For you will no longer be called tender or delicate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_2","024_47_2","ISA","47","2","2","Take millstones and grind flour; remove your veil; strip off your skirt, bare your thigh, and wade through the streams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_3","024_47_3","ISA","47","3","3","Your nakedness will be uncovered and your shame will be exposed. I will take vengeance; I will spare no one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_4","024_47_4","ISA","47","4","4","Our Redeemer—the LORD of Hosts is His name—is the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_5","024_47_5","ISA","47","5","5","“Sit in silence and go into darkness, O Daughter of the Chaldeans. For you will no longer be called the queen of kingdoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_6","024_47_6","ISA","47","6","6","I was angry with My people; I profaned My heritage, and I placed them under your control. You showed them no mercy; even on the elderly you laid a most heavy yoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_7","024_47_7","ISA","47","7","7","You said, ‘I will be queen forever.’ You did not take these things to heart or consider their outcome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_8","024_47_8","ISA","47","8","8","So now hear this, O lover of luxury who sits securely, who says to herself, ‘I am, and there is none besides me. I will never be a widow or know the loss of children.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_9","024_47_9","ISA","47","9","9","These two things will overtake you in a moment, in a single day: loss of children, and widowhood. They will come upon you in full measure, in spite of your many sorceries and the potency of your spells. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_10","024_47_10","ISA","47","10","10","You were secure in your wickedness; you said, ‘No one sees me.’ Your wisdom and knowledge led you astray; you told yourself, ‘I am, and there is none besides me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_11","024_47_11","ISA","47","11","11","But disaster will come upon you; you will not know how to charm it away. A calamity will befall you that you will be unable to ward off. Devastation will happen to you suddenly and unexpectedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_12","024_47_12","ISA","47","12","12","So take your stand with your spells and with your many sorceries, with which you have wearied yourself from your youth. Perhaps you will succeed; perhaps you will inspire terror! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_13","024_47_13","ISA","47","13","13","You are wearied by your many counselors; let them come forward now and save you—your astrologers who observe the stars, who monthly predict your fate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_14","024_47_14","ISA","47","14","14","Surely they are like stubble; the fire will burn them up. They cannot deliver themselves from the power of the flame. There will be no coals to warm them or fire to sit beside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS47_15","024_47_15","ISA","47","15","15","This is what they are to you—those with whom you have labored and traded from youth—each one strays in his own direction; not one of them can save you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_1","024_48_1","ISA","48","1","1","“Listen to this, O house of Jacob, you who are called by the name of Israel, who have descended from the line of Judah, who swear by the name of the LORD, who invoke the God of Israel—but not in truth or righteousness— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_2","024_48_2","ISA","48","2","2","who indeed call yourselves after the holy city and lean on the God of Israel; the LORD of Hosts is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_3","024_48_3","ISA","48","3","3","I foretold the former things long ago; they came out of My mouth and I proclaimed them. Suddenly I acted, and they came to pass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_4","024_48_4","ISA","48","4","4","For I knew that you are stubborn; your neck is iron and your forehead is bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_5","024_48_5","ISA","48","5","5","Therefore I declared it to you long ago; I announced it before it came to pass, so that you could not claim, ‘My idol has done this; my carved image and molten god has ordained it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_6","024_48_6","ISA","48","6","6","You have heard these things; look at them all. Will you not acknowledge them? From now on I will tell you of new things, hidden things unknown to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_7","024_48_7","ISA","48","7","7","They are created now, and not long ago; you have not heard of them before today. So you cannot claim, ‘I already knew them!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_8","024_48_8","ISA","48","8","8","You have never heard; you have never understood; for a long time your ears have not been open. For I knew how deceitful you are; you have been called a rebel from birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_9","024_48_9","ISA","48","9","9","For the sake of My name I will delay My wrath; for the sake of My praise I will restrain it, so that you will not be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_10","024_48_10","ISA","48","10","10","See, I have refined you, but not as silver; I have tested you in the furnace of affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_11","024_48_11","ISA","48","11","11","For My own sake, My very own sake, I will act; for how can I let Myself be defamed? I will not yield My glory to another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_12","024_48_12","ISA","48","12","12","Listen to Me, O Jacob, and Israel, whom I have called: I am He; I am the first, and I am the last. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_13","024_48_13","ISA","48","13","13","Surely My own hand founded the earth, and My right hand spread out the heavens; when I summon them, they stand up together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_14","024_48_14","ISA","48","14","14","Come together, all of you, and listen: Which of the idols has foretold these things? The LORD’s chosen ally will carry out His desire against Babylon, and His arm will be against the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_15","024_48_15","ISA","48","15","15","I, even I, have spoken; yes, I have called him. I have brought him, and he will succeed in his mission. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_16","024_48_16","ISA","48","16","16","Come near to Me and listen to this: From the beginning I have not spoken in secret; from the time it happened, I was there.” And now the Lord GOD has sent me, accompanied by His Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_17","024_48_17","ISA","48","17","17","Thus says the LORD your Redeemer, the Holy One of Israel: “I am the LORD your God, who teaches you for your benefit, who directs you in the way you should go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_18","024_48_18","ISA","48","18","18","If only you had paid attention to My commandments, your peace would have been like a river, and your righteousness like waves of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_19","024_48_19","ISA","48","19","19","Your descendants would have been as countless as the sand, and your offspring as numerous as its grains; their name would never be cut off or eliminated from My presence.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_20","024_48_20","ISA","48","20","20","Leave Babylon! Flee from the Chaldeans! Declare it with a shout of joy, proclaim it, let it go out to the ends of the earth, saying, “The LORD has redeemed His servant Jacob!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_21","024_48_21","ISA","48","21","21","They did not thirst when He led them through the deserts; He made water flow for them from the rock; He split the rock, and water gushed out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS48_22","024_48_22","ISA","48","22","22","“There is no peace,” says the LORD, “for the wicked.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_1","024_49_1","ISA","49","1","1","Listen to Me, O islands; pay attention, O distant peoples: The LORD called Me from the womb; from the body of My mother He named Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_2","024_49_2","ISA","49","2","2","He made My mouth like a sharp sword; He hid Me in the shadow of His hand. He made Me like a polished arrow; He hid Me in His quiver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_3","024_49_3","ISA","49","3","3","He said to Me, “You are My Servant, Israel, in whom I will display My glory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_4","024_49_4","ISA","49","4","4","But I said, “I have labored in vain, I have spent My strength in futility and vanity; yet My vindication is with the LORD, and My reward is with My God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_5","024_49_5","ISA","49","5","5","And now says the LORD, who formed Me from the womb to be His Servant, to bring Jacob back to Him, that Israel might be gathered to Him—for I am honored in the sight of the LORD, and My God is My strength— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_6","024_49_6","ISA","49","6","6","He says: “It is not enough for You to be My Servant, to raise up the tribes of Jacob, and to restore the protected ones of Israel. I will also make You a light for the nations, to bring My salvation to the ends of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_7","024_49_7","ISA","49","7","7","Thus says the LORD, the Redeemer and Holy One of Israel, to Him who was despised and abhorred by the nation, to the Servant of rulers: “Kings will see You and rise, and princes will bow down, because of the LORD, who is faithful, the Holy One of Israel, who has chosen You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_8","024_49_8","ISA","49","8","8","This is what the LORD says: “In the time of favor I will answer You, and in the day of salvation I will help You; I will keep You and appoint You to be a covenant for the people, to restore the land, to apportion its desolate inheritances, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_9","024_49_9","ISA","49","9","9","to say to the prisoners, ‘Come out,’ and to those in darkness, ‘Show yourselves.’ They will feed along the pathways, and find pasture on every barren hill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_10","024_49_10","ISA","49","10","10","They will not hunger or thirst, nor will scorching heat or sun beat down on them. For He who has compassion on them will guide them and lead them beside springs of water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_11","024_49_11","ISA","49","11","11","I will turn all My mountains into roads, and My highways will be raised up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_12","024_49_12","ISA","49","12","12","Behold, they will come from far away, from the north and from the west, and from the land of Aswan.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_13","024_49_13","ISA","49","13","13","Shout for joy, O heavens; rejoice, O earth; break forth in song, O mountains! For the LORD has comforted His people, and He will have compassion on His afflicted ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_14","024_49_14","ISA","49","14","14","But Zion said, “The LORD has forsaken me; the Lord has forgotten me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_15","024_49_15","ISA","49","15","15","“Can a woman forget her nursing child, or lack compassion for the son of her womb? Even if she could forget, I will not forget you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_16","024_49_16","ISA","49","16","16","Behold, I have inscribed you on the palms of My hands; your walls are ever before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_17","024_49_17","ISA","49","17","17","Your builders hasten back; your destroyers and wreckers depart from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_18","024_49_18","ISA","49","18","18","Lift up your eyes and look around. They all gather together; they come to you. As surely as I live,” declares the LORD, “you will wear them all as jewelry and put them on like a bride. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_19","024_49_19","ISA","49","19","19","For your ruined and desolate places and your ravaged land will now indeed be too small for your people, and those who devoured you will be far away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_20","024_49_20","ISA","49","20","20","Yet the children of your bereavement will say in your hearing, ‘This place is too small for us; make room for us to live here.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_21","024_49_21","ISA","49","21","21","Then you will say in your heart, ‘Who has begotten these for me? I was bereaved and barren; I was exiled and rejected. So who has reared them? Look, I was left all alone, so where did they come from?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_22","024_49_22","ISA","49","22","22","This is what the Lord GOD says: “Behold, I will lift up My hand to the nations, and raise My banner to the peoples. They will bring your sons in their arms and carry your daughters on their shoulders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_23","024_49_23","ISA","49","23","23","Kings will be your foster fathers, and their queens your nursing mothers. They will bow to you facedown and lick the dust at your feet. Then you will know that I am the LORD; those who hope in Me will never be put to shame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_24","024_49_24","ISA","49","24","24","Can the plunder be snatched from the mighty, or the captives of a tyrant be delivered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_25","024_49_25","ISA","49","25","25","Indeed, this is what the LORD says: “Even the captives of the mighty will be taken away, and the plunder of the tyrant will be retrieved; I will contend with those who contend with you, and I will save your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS49_26","024_49_26","ISA","49","26","26","I will make your oppressors eat their own flesh; they will be drunk on their own blood, as with wine. Then all mankind will know that I, the LORD, am your Savior and your Redeemer, the Mighty One of Jacob.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_1","024_50_1","ISA","50","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Where is your mother’s certificate of divorce with which I sent her away? Or to which of My creditors did I sell you? Look, you were sold for your iniquities, and for your transgressions your mother was sent away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_2","024_50_2","ISA","50","2","2","Why was no one there when I arrived? Why did no one answer when I called? Is My hand too short to redeem you? Or do I lack the strength to deliver you? Behold, My rebuke dries up the sea; I turn the rivers into a desert; the fish rot for lack of water and die of thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_3","024_50_3","ISA","50","3","3","I clothe the heavens in black and make sackcloth their covering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_4","024_50_4","ISA","50","4","4","The Lord GOD has given Me the tongue of discipleship, to sustain the weary with a word. He awakens Me morning by morning; He awakens My ear to listen as a disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_5","024_50_5","ISA","50","5","5","The Lord GOD has opened My ears, and I have not been rebellious, nor have I turned back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_6","024_50_6","ISA","50","6","6","I offered My back to those who struck Me, and My cheeks to those who tore out My beard. I did not hide My face from scorn and spittle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_7","024_50_7","ISA","50","7","7","Because the Lord GOD helps Me, I have not been disgraced; therefore I have set My face like flint, and I know that I will not be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_8","024_50_8","ISA","50","8","8","The One who vindicates Me is near. Who will dare to contend with Me? Let us confront each other! Who has a case against Me? Let him approach Me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_9","024_50_9","ISA","50","9","9","Surely the Lord GOD helps Me. Who is there to condemn Me? See, they will all wear out like a garment; the moths will devour them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_10","024_50_10","ISA","50","10","10","Who among you fears the LORD and obeys the voice of His Servant? Who among you walks in darkness and has no light? Let him trust in the name of the LORD; let him lean on his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS50_11","024_50_11","ISA","50","11","11","Behold, all you who kindle a fire, who array yourselves with firebrands, walk in the light of your fire and of the firebrands you have lit! This is what you will receive from My hand: You will lie down in a place of torment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_1","024_51_1","ISA","51","1","1","“Listen to Me, you who pursue righteousness, you who seek the LORD: Look to the rock from which you were cut, and to the quarry from which you were hewn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_2","024_51_2","ISA","51","2","2","Look to Abraham your father, and to Sarah who gave you birth. When I called him, he was but one; then I blessed him and multiplied him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_3","024_51_3","ISA","51","3","3","For the LORD will comfort Zion and will look with compassion on all her ruins; He will make her wilderness like Eden and her desert like the garden of the LORD. Joy and gladness will be found in her, thanksgiving and melodious song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_4","024_51_4","ISA","51","4","4","Pay attention to Me, My people, and listen to Me, My nation; for a law will go out from Me, and My justice will become a light to the nations; I will bring it about quickly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_5","024_51_5","ISA","51","5","5","My righteousness draws near, My salvation is on the way, and My arms will bring justice to the nations. The islands will look for Me and wait in hope for My arm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_6","024_51_6","ISA","51","6","6","Lift up your eyes to the heavens, and look at the earth below; for the heavens will vanish like smoke, the earth will wear out like a garment, and its people will die like gnats. But My salvation will last forever, and My righteousness will never fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_7","024_51_7","ISA","51","7","7","Listen to Me, you who know what is right, you people with My law in your hearts: Do not fear the scorn of men; do not be broken by their insults. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_8","024_51_8","ISA","51","8","8","For the moth will devour them like a garment, and the worm will eat them like wool. But My righteousness will last forever, My salvation through all generations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_9","024_51_9","ISA","51","9","9","Awake, awake, put on strength, O arm of the LORD. Wake up as in days past, as in generations of old. Was it not You who cut Rahab to pieces, who pierced through the dragon? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_10","024_51_10","ISA","51","10","10","Was it not You who dried up the sea, the waters of the great deep, who made a road in the depths of the sea for the redeemed to cross over? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_11","024_51_11","ISA","51","11","11","So the redeemed of the LORD will return and enter Zion with singing, crowned with everlasting joy. Gladness and joy will overtake them, and sorrow and sighing will flee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_12","024_51_12","ISA","51","12","12","“I, even I, am He who comforts you. Why should you be afraid of mortal man, of a son of man who withers like grass? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_13","024_51_13","ISA","51","13","13","But you have forgotten the LORD, your Maker, who stretched out the heavens and laid the foundations of the earth. You live in terror all day long because of the fury of the oppressor who is bent on destruction. But where is the fury of the oppressor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_14","024_51_14","ISA","51","14","14","The captive will soon be freed; he will not die in the dungeon, and his bread will not be lacking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_15","024_51_15","ISA","51","15","15","For I am the LORD your God who stirs up the sea so that its waves roar—the LORD of Hosts is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_16","024_51_16","ISA","51","16","16","I have put My words in your mouth, and covered you with the shadow of My hand, to establish the heavens, to found the earth, and to say to Zion, ‘You are My people.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_17","024_51_17","ISA","51","17","17","Awake, awake! Rise up, O Jerusalem, you who have drunk from the hand of the LORD the cup of His fury; you who have drained the goblet to the dregs—the cup that makes men stagger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_18","024_51_18","ISA","51","18","18","Among all the sons she bore, there is no one to guide her; among all the sons she brought up, there is no one to take her hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_19","024_51_19","ISA","51","19","19","These pairs have befallen you: devastation and destruction, famine and sword. Who will grieve for you? Who can comfort you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_20","024_51_20","ISA","51","20","20","Your sons have fainted; they lie at the head of every street, like an antelope in a net. They are full of the wrath of the LORD, the rebuke of your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_21","024_51_21","ISA","51","21","21","Therefore now hear this, you afflicted one, drunken, but not with wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_22","024_51_22","ISA","51","22","22","Thus says your Lord, the LORD, even your God, who defends His people: “See, I have removed from your hand the cup of staggering. From that goblet, the cup of My fury, you will never drink again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS51_23","024_51_23","ISA","51","23","23","I will place it in the hands of your tormentors, who told you: ‘Lie down, so we can walk over you,’ so that you made your back like the ground, like a street to be traversed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_1","024_52_1","ISA","52","1","1","Awake, awake, clothe yourself with strength, O Zion! Put on your garments of splendor, O Jerusalem, holy city! For the uncircumcised and unclean will no longer enter you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_2","024_52_2","ISA","52","2","2","Shake off your dust! Rise up and sit on your throne, O Jerusalem. Remove the chains from your neck, O captive Daughter of Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_3","024_52_3","ISA","52","3","3","For this is what the LORD says: “You were sold for nothing, and without money you will be redeemed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_4","024_52_4","ISA","52","4","4","For this is what the Lord GOD says: “At first My people went down to Egypt to live, then Assyria oppressed them without cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_5","024_52_5","ISA","52","5","5","And now what have I here? declares the LORD. For My people have been taken without cause; those who rule them taunt, declares the LORD, and My name is blasphemed continually all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_6","024_52_6","ISA","52","6","6","Therefore My people will know My name; therefore they will know on that day that I am He who speaks. Here I am!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_7","024_52_7","ISA","52","7","7","How beautiful on the mountains are the feet of those who bring good news, who proclaim peace, who bring good tidings, who proclaim salvation, who say to Zion, “Your God reigns!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_8","024_52_8","ISA","52","8","8","Listen! Your watchmen lift up their voices, together they shout for joy. For every eye will see when the LORD returns to Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_9","024_52_9","ISA","52","9","9","Break forth in joy, sing together, O ruins of Jerusalem, for the LORD has comforted His people; He has redeemed Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_10","024_52_10","ISA","52","10","10","The LORD has bared His holy arm in the sight of all the nations; all the ends of the earth will see the salvation of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_11","024_52_11","ISA","52","11","11","Depart, depart, go out from there! Touch no unclean thing; come out from it, purify yourselves, you who carry the vessels of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_12","024_52_12","ISA","52","12","12","For you will not leave in a hurry nor flee in haste, for the LORD goes before you, and the God of Israel is your rear guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_13","024_52_13","ISA","52","13","13","Behold, My Servant will prosper; He will be raised and lifted up and highly exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_14","024_52_14","ISA","52","14","14","Just as many were appalled at Him—His appearance was disfigured beyond that of any man, and His form was marred beyond human likeness— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS52_15","024_52_15","ISA","52","15","15","so He will sprinkle many nations. Kings will shut their mouths because of Him. For they will see what they have not been told, and they will understand what they have not heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_1","024_53_1","ISA","53","1","1","Who has believed our message? And to whom has the arm of the LORD been revealed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_2","024_53_2","ISA","53","2","2","He grew up before Him like a tender shoot, and like a root out of dry ground. He had no stately form or majesty to attract us, no beauty that we should desire Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_3","024_53_3","ISA","53","3","3","He was despised and rejected by men, a man of sorrows, acquainted with grief. Like one from whom men hide their faces, He was despised, and we esteemed Him not. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_4","024_53_4","ISA","53","4","4","Surely He took up our infirmities and carried our sorrows; yet we considered Him stricken, struck down by God, and afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_5","024_53_5","ISA","53","5","5","But He was pierced for our transgressions, He was crushed for our iniquities; the punishment that brought us peace was upon Him, and by His stripes we are healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_6","024_53_6","ISA","53","6","6","We all like sheep have gone astray, each one has turned to his own way; and the LORD has laid upon Him the iniquity of us all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_7","024_53_7","ISA","53","7","7","He was oppressed and afflicted, yet He did not open His mouth. He was led like a lamb to the slaughter, and as a sheep before her shearers is silent, so He did not open His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_8","024_53_8","ISA","53","8","8","By oppression and judgment He was taken away, and who can recount His descendants? For He was cut off from the land of the living; He was stricken for the transgression of My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_9","024_53_9","ISA","53","9","9","He was assigned a grave with the wicked, and with a rich man in His death, although He had done no violence, nor was any deceit in His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_10","024_53_10","ISA","53","10","10","Yet it was the LORD’s will to crush Him and to cause Him to suffer; and when His soul is made a guilt offering, He will see His offspring, He will prolong His days, and the good pleasure of the LORD will prosper in His hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_11","024_53_11","ISA","53","11","11","After the anguish of His soul, He will see the light of life and be satisfied. By His knowledge My righteous Servant will justify many, and He will bear their iniquities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS53_12","024_53_12","ISA","53","12","12","Therefore I will allot Him a portion with the great, and He will divide the spoils with the strong, because He has poured out His life unto death, and He was numbered with the transgressors. Yet He bore the sin of many and made intercession for the transgressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_1","024_54_1","ISA","54","1","1","“Shout for joy, O barren woman, who bears no children; break forth in song and cry aloud, you who have never travailed; because more are the children of the desolate woman than of her who has a husband,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_2","024_54_2","ISA","54","2","2","“Enlarge the site of your tent, stretch out the curtains of your dwellings, do not hold back. Lengthen your ropes and drive your stakes in deep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_3","024_54_3","ISA","54","3","3","For you will spread out to the right and left; your descendants will dispossess the nations and inhabit the desolate cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_4","024_54_4","ISA","54","4","4","Do not be afraid, for you will not be put to shame; do not be intimidated, for you will not be humiliated. For you will forget the shame of your youth and will remember no more the reproach of your widowhood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_5","024_54_5","ISA","54","5","5","For your husband is your Maker—the LORD of Hosts is His name—the Holy One of Israel is your Redeemer; He is called the God of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_6","024_54_6","ISA","54","6","6","For the LORD has called you back, like a wife deserted and wounded in spirit, like the rejected wife of one’s youth,” says your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_7","024_54_7","ISA","54","7","7","“For a brief moment I forsook you, but with great compassion I will bring you back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_8","024_54_8","ISA","54","8","8","In a surge of anger I hid My face from you for a moment, but with everlasting kindness I will have compassion on you,” says the LORD your Redeemer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_9","024_54_9","ISA","54","9","9","“For to Me this is like the days of Noah, when I swore that the waters of Noah would never again cover the earth. So I have sworn that I will not be angry with you or rebuke you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_10","024_54_10","ISA","54","10","10","Though the mountains may be removed and the hills may be shaken, My loving devotion will not depart from you, and My covenant of peace will not be broken,” says the LORD, who has compassion on you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_11","024_54_11","ISA","54","11","11","“O afflicted city, lashed by storms, without solace, surely I will set your stones in antimony and lay your foundations with sapphires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_12","024_54_12","ISA","54","12","12","I will make your pinnacles of rubies, your gates of sparkling jewels, and all your walls of precious stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_13","024_54_13","ISA","54","13","13","Then all your sons will be taught by the LORD, and great will be their prosperity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_14","024_54_14","ISA","54","14","14","In righteousness you will be established, far from oppression, for you will have no fear. Terror will be far removed, for it will not come near you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_15","024_54_15","ISA","54","15","15","If anyone attacks you, it is not from Me; whoever assails you will fall before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_16","024_54_16","ISA","54","16","16","Behold, I have created the craftsman who fans the coals into flame and forges a weapon fit for its task; and I have created the destroyer to wreak havoc. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS54_17","024_54_17","ISA","54","17","17","No weapon formed against you shall prosper, and you will refute every tongue that accuses you. This is the heritage of the servants of the LORD, and their vindication is from Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_1","024_55_1","ISA","55","1","1","“Come, all you who are thirsty, come to the waters; and you without money, come, buy, and eat! Come, buy wine and milk without money and without cost! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_2","024_55_2","ISA","55","2","2","Why spend money on that which is not bread, and your labor on that which does not satisfy? Listen carefully to Me, and eat what is good, and your soul will delight in the richest of foods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_3","024_55_3","ISA","55","3","3","Incline your ear and come to Me; listen, so that your soul may live. I will make with you an everlasting covenant—My loving devotion promised to David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_4","024_55_4","ISA","55","4","4","Behold, I have made him a witness to the nations, a leader and commander of the peoples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_5","024_55_5","ISA","55","5","5","Surely you will summon a nation you do not know, and nations who do not know you will run to you. For the LORD your God, the Holy One of Israel, has bestowed glory on you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_6","024_55_6","ISA","55","6","6","Seek the LORD while He may be found; call on Him while He is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_7","024_55_7","ISA","55","7","7","Let the wicked man forsake his way and the unrighteous man his thoughts; let him return to the LORD, that He may have compassion, and to our God, for He will freely pardon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_8","024_55_8","ISA","55","8","8","“For My thoughts are not your thoughts, neither are your ways My ways,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_9","024_55_9","ISA","55","9","9","“For as the heavens are higher than the earth, so My ways are higher than your ways and My thoughts than your thoughts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_10","024_55_10","ISA","55","10","10","For just as rain and snow fall from heaven and do not return without watering the earth, making it bud and sprout, and providing seed to sow and food to eat, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_11","024_55_11","ISA","55","11","11","so My word that proceeds from My mouth will not return to Me empty, but it will accomplish what I please, and it will prosper where I send it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_12","024_55_12","ISA","55","12","12","You will indeed go out with joy and be led forth in peace; the mountains and hills will burst into song before you, and all the trees of the field will clap their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS55_13","024_55_13","ISA","55","13","13","Instead of the thornbush, the cypress will grow, and instead of the brier, the myrtle will spring up; this will make a name for the LORD, an everlasting sign, never to be destroyed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_1","024_56_1","ISA","56","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Maintain justice and do what is right, for My salvation is coming soon, and My righteousness will be revealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_2","024_56_2","ISA","56","2","2","Blessed is the man who does this, and the son of man who holds it fast, who keeps the Sabbath without profaning it and keeps his hand from doing any evil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_3","024_56_3","ISA","56","3","3","Let no foreigner who has joined himself to the LORD say, “The LORD will utterly exclude me from His people.” And let the eunuch not say, “I am but a dry tree.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_4","024_56_4","ISA","56","4","4","For this is what the LORD says: “To the eunuchs who keep My Sabbaths, who choose what pleases Me and hold fast to My covenant— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_5","024_56_5","ISA","56","5","5","I will give them, in My house and within My walls, a memorial and a name better than that of sons and daughters. I will give them an everlasting name that will not be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_6","024_56_6","ISA","56","6","6","And the foreigners who join themselves to the LORD to minister to Him, to love the name of the LORD, and to be His servants—all who keep the Sabbath without profaning it and who hold fast to My covenant— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_7","024_56_7","ISA","56","7","7","I will bring them to My holy mountain and make them joyful in My house of prayer. Their burnt offerings and sacrifices will be accepted on My altar, for My house will be called a house of prayer for all the nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_8","024_56_8","ISA","56","8","8","Thus declares the Lord GOD, who gathers the dispersed of Israel: “I will gather to them still others besides those already gathered.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_9","024_56_9","ISA","56","9","9","Come, all you beasts of the field; eat greedily, all you beasts of the forest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_10","024_56_10","ISA","56","10","10","Israel’s watchmen are blind, they are all oblivious; they are all mute dogs, they cannot bark; they are dreamers lying around, loving to slumber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_11","024_56_11","ISA","56","11","11","Like ravenous dogs, they are never satisfied. They are shepherds with no discernment; they all turn to their own way, each one seeking his own gain: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS56_12","024_56_12","ISA","56","12","12","“Come, let me get the wine, let us imbibe the strong drink, and tomorrow will be like today, only far better!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_1","024_57_1","ISA","57","1","1","The righteous perish, and no one takes it to heart; devout men are taken away, while no one considers that the righteous are taken away from the presence of evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_2","024_57_2","ISA","57","2","2","Those who walk uprightly enter into peace; they find rest, lying down in death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_3","024_57_3","ISA","57","3","3","“But come here, you sons of a sorceress, you offspring of adulterers and prostitutes! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_4","024_57_4","ISA","57","4","4","Whom are you mocking? At whom do you sneer and stick out your tongue? Are you not children of transgression, offspring of deceit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_5","024_57_5","ISA","57","5","5","who burn with lust among the oaks, under every luxuriant tree, who slaughter your children in the valleys, under the clefts of the rocks? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_6","024_57_6","ISA","57","6","6","Your portion is among the smooth stones of the valley; indeed, they are your lot. Even to them you have poured out a drink offering and offered a grain offering. Should I relent because of these? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_7","024_57_7","ISA","57","7","7","On a high and lofty hill you have made your bed, and there you went up to offer sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_8","024_57_8","ISA","57","8","8","Behind the door and doorpost you have set up your memorial. Forsaking Me, you uncovered your bed; you climbed up and opened it wide. And you have made a pact with those whose bed you have loved; you have gazed upon their nakedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_9","024_57_9","ISA","57","9","9","You went to Molech with oil and multiplied your perfumes. You have sent your envoys a great distance; you have descended even to Sheol itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_10","024_57_10","ISA","57","10","10","You are wearied by your many journeys, but you did not say, “There is no hope!” You found renewal of your strength; therefore you did not grow weak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_11","024_57_11","ISA","57","11","11","Whom have you dreaded and feared, so that you lied and failed to remember Me or take this to heart? Is it not because I have long been silent that you do not fear Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_12","024_57_12","ISA","57","12","12","I will expose your righteousness and your works, and they will not profit you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_13","024_57_13","ISA","57","13","13","When you cry out, let your companies of idols deliver you! Yet the wind will carry off all of them, a breath will take them away. But he who seeks refuge in Me will inherit the land and possess My holy mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_14","024_57_14","ISA","57","14","14","And it will be said, “Build it up, build it up, prepare the way, take every obstacle out of the way of My people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_15","024_57_15","ISA","57","15","15","For thus says the One who is high and lifted up, who inhabits eternity, whose name is Holy: “I dwell in a high and holy place, and with the oppressed and humble in spirit, to restore the spirit of the lowly and revive the heart of the contrite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_16","024_57_16","ISA","57","16","16","For I will not accuse you forever, nor will I always be angry; for then the spirit of man would grow weak before Me—the breath of life I have made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_17","024_57_17","ISA","57","17","17","I was enraged by his sinful greed, so I struck him and hid My face in anger; yet he kept turning back to the desires of his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_18","024_57_18","ISA","57","18","18","I have seen his ways, but I will heal him; I will guide him and restore comfort to him and his mourners, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_19","024_57_19","ISA","57","19","19","bringing praise to their lips. Peace, peace to those far and near,” says the LORD, “and I will heal them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_20","024_57_20","ISA","57","20","20","But the wicked are like the storm-tossed sea, for it cannot be still, and its waves churn up mire and muck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS57_21","024_57_21","ISA","57","21","21","“There is no peace,” says my God, “for the wicked.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_1","024_58_1","ISA","58","1","1","“Cry aloud, do not hold back! Raise your voice like a ram’s horn. Declare to My people their transgression and to the house of Jacob their sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_2","024_58_2","ISA","58","2","2","For day after day they seek Me and delight to know My ways, like a nation that does what is right and does not forsake the justice of their God. They ask Me for righteous judgments; they delight in the nearness of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_3","024_58_3","ISA","58","3","3","“Why have we fasted, and You have not seen? Why have we humbled ourselves, and You have not noticed?” “Behold, on the day of your fast, you do as you please, and you oppress all your workers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_4","024_58_4","ISA","58","4","4","You fast with contention and strife to strike viciously with your fist. You cannot fast as you do today and have your voice be heard on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_5","024_58_5","ISA","58","5","5","Is this the fast I have chosen: a day for a man to deny himself, to bow his head like a reed, and to spread out sackcloth and ashes? Will you call this a fast and a day acceptable to the LORD? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_6","024_58_6","ISA","58","6","6","Isn’t this the fast that I have chosen: to break the chains of wickedness, to untie the cords of the yoke, to set the oppressed free and tear off every yoke? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_7","024_58_7","ISA","58","7","7","Isn’t it to share your bread with the hungry, to bring the poor and homeless into your home, to clothe the naked when you see him, and not to turn away from your own flesh and blood? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_8","024_58_8","ISA","58","8","8","Then your light will break forth like the dawn, and your healing will come quickly. Your righteousness will go before you, and the glory of the LORD will be your rear guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_9","024_58_9","ISA","58","9","9","Then you will call, and the LORD will answer; you will cry out, and He will say, ‘Here I am.’ If you remove the yoke from your midst, the pointing of the finger and malicious talk, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_10","024_58_10","ISA","58","10","10","and if you give yourself to the hungry and satisfy the afflicted soul, then your light will go forth in the darkness, and your night will be like noonday. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_11","024_58_11","ISA","58","11","11","The LORD will always guide you; He will satisfy you in a sun-scorched land and strengthen your frame. You will be like a well-watered garden, like a spring whose waters never fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_12","024_58_12","ISA","58","12","12","Your people will rebuild the ancient ruins; you will restore the age-old foundations; you will be called Repairer of the Breach, Restorer of the Streets of Dwelling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_13","024_58_13","ISA","58","13","13","If you turn your foot from breaking the Sabbath, from doing as you please on My holy day, if you call the Sabbath a delight, and the LORD’s holy day honorable, if you honor it by not going your own way or seeking your own pleasure or speaking idle words, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS58_14","024_58_14","ISA","58","14","14","then you will delight yourself in the LORD, and I will make you ride on the heights of the land and feed you with the heritage of your father Jacob.” For the mouth of the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_1","024_59_1","ISA","59","1","1","Surely the arm of the LORD is not too short to save, nor His ear too dull to hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_2","024_59_2","ISA","59","2","2","But your iniquities have built barriers between you and your God, and your sins have hidden His face from you, so that He does not hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_3","024_59_3","ISA","59","3","3","For your hands are stained with blood, and your fingers with iniquity; your lips have spoken lies, and your tongue mutters injustice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_4","024_59_4","ISA","59","4","4","No one calls for justice; no one pleads his case honestly. They rely on empty pleas; they tell lies; they conceive mischief and give birth to iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_5","024_59_5","ISA","59","5","5","They hatch the eggs of vipers and weave a spider’s web. Whoever eats their eggs will die; crack one open, and a viper is hatched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_6","024_59_6","ISA","59","6","6","Their cobwebs cannot be made into clothing, and they cannot cover themselves with their works. Their deeds are sinful deeds, and acts of violence are in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_7","024_59_7","ISA","59","7","7","Their feet run to evil; they are swift to shed innocent blood. Their thoughts are sinful thoughts; ruin and destruction lie in their wake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_8","024_59_8","ISA","59","8","8","The way of peace they have not known, and there is no justice in their tracks. They have turned them into crooked paths; no one who treads on them will know peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_9","024_59_9","ISA","59","9","9","Therefore justice is far from us, and righteousness does not reach us. We hope for light, but there is darkness; for brightness, but we walk in gloom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_10","024_59_10","ISA","59","10","10","Like the blind, we feel our way along the wall, groping like those without eyes. We stumble at midday as in the twilight; among the vigorous we are like the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_11","024_59_11","ISA","59","11","11","We all growl like bears and moan like doves. We hope for justice, but find none, for salvation, but it is far from us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_12","024_59_12","ISA","59","12","12","For our transgressions are multiplied before You, and our sins testify against us. Our transgressions are indeed with us, and we know our iniquities: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_13","024_59_13","ISA","59","13","13","rebelling and denying the LORD, turning away from our God, speaking oppression and revolt, conceiving and uttering lies from the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_14","024_59_14","ISA","59","14","14","So justice is turned away, and righteousness stands at a distance. For truth has stumbled in the public square, and honesty cannot enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_15","024_59_15","ISA","59","15","15","Truth is missing, and whoever turns from evil becomes prey. The LORD looked and was displeased that there was no justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_16","024_59_16","ISA","59","16","16","He saw that there was no man; He was amazed that there was no one to intercede. So His own arm brought salvation, and His own righteousness sustained Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_17","024_59_17","ISA","59","17","17","He put on righteousness like a breastplate, and the helmet of salvation on His head; He put on garments of vengeance and wrapped Himself in a cloak of zeal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_18","024_59_18","ISA","59","18","18","So He will repay according to their deeds: fury to His enemies, retribution to His foes, and recompense to the islands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_19","024_59_19","ISA","59","19","19","So shall they fear the name of the LORD where the sun sets, and His glory where it rises. For He will come like a raging flood, driven by the breath of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_20","024_59_20","ISA","59","20","20","“The Redeemer will come to Zion, to those in Jacob who turn from transgression,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS59_21","024_59_21","ISA","59","21","21","“As for Me, this is My covenant with them,” says the LORD. “My Spirit will not depart from you, and My words that I have put in your mouth will not depart from your mouth or from the mouths of your children and grandchildren, from now on and forevermore,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_1","024_60_1","ISA","60","1","1","Arise, shine, for your light has come, and the glory of the LORD rises upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_2","024_60_2","ISA","60","2","2","For behold, darkness covers the earth, and thick darkness is over the peoples; but the LORD will rise upon you, and His glory will appear over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_3","024_60_3","ISA","60","3","3","Nations will come to your light, and kings to the brightness of your dawn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_4","024_60_4","ISA","60","4","4","Lift up your eyes and look around: They all gather and come to you; your sons will come from afar, and your daughters will be carried on the arm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_5","024_60_5","ISA","60","5","5","Then you will look and be radiant, and your heart will tremble and swell with joy, because the riches of the sea will be brought to you, and the wealth of the nations will come to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_6","024_60_6","ISA","60","6","6","Caravans of camels will cover your land, young camels of Midian and Ephah, and all from Sheba will come, bearing gold and frankincense and proclaiming the praises of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_7","024_60_7","ISA","60","7","7","All the flocks of Kedar will be gathered to you; the rams of Nebaioth will serve you and go up on My altar with acceptance; I will adorn My glorious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_8","024_60_8","ISA","60","8","8","Who are these who fly like clouds, like doves to their shelters? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_9","024_60_9","ISA","60","9","9","Surely the islands will wait for Me, with the ships of Tarshish in the lead, to bring your children from afar, with their silver and gold, to the honor of the LORD your God, the Holy One of Israel, for He has glorified you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_10","024_60_10","ISA","60","10","10","Foreigners will rebuild your walls, and their kings will serve you. Although I struck you in anger, yet in favor I will show you mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_11","024_60_11","ISA","60","11","11","Your gates will always stand open; they will never be shut, day or night, so that the wealth of the nations may be brought into you, with their kings being led in procession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_12","024_60_12","ISA","60","12","12","For the nation or kingdom that will not serve you will perish; it will be utterly destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_13","024_60_13","ISA","60","13","13","The glory of Lebanon will come to you—its cypress, elm, and boxwood together—to adorn the place of My sanctuary, and I will glorify the place of My feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_14","024_60_14","ISA","60","14","14","The sons of your oppressors will come and bow down to you; all who reviled you will fall facedown at your feet and call you the City of the LORD, Zion of the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_15","024_60_15","ISA","60","15","15","Whereas you have been forsaken and despised, with no one passing through, I will make you an everlasting pride, a joy from age to age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_16","024_60_16","ISA","60","16","16","You will drink the milk of nations and nurse at the breasts of royalty; you will know that I, the LORD, am your Savior and your Redeemer, the Mighty One of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_17","024_60_17","ISA","60","17","17","Instead of bronze I will bring you gold; I will bring silver in place of iron, bronze instead of wood, and iron instead of stones. I will appoint peace as your governor and righteousness as your ruler. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_18","024_60_18","ISA","60","18","18","No longer will violence be heard in your land, nor ruin or destruction within your borders. But you will name your walls Salvation and your gates Praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_19","024_60_19","ISA","60","19","19","No longer will the sun be your light by day, nor the brightness of the moon shine on your night; for the LORD will be your everlasting light, and your God will be your splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_20","024_60_20","ISA","60","20","20","Your sun will no longer set, and your moon will not wane; for the LORD will be your everlasting light, and the days of your sorrow will cease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_21","024_60_21","ISA","60","21","21","Then all your people will be righteous; they will possess the land forever; they are the branch of My planting, the work of My hands, so that I may be glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS60_22","024_60_22","ISA","60","22","22","The least of you will become a thousand, and the smallest a mighty nation. I am the LORD; in its time I will accomplish it quickly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_1","024_61_1","ISA","61","1","1","The Spirit of the Lord GOD is on Me, because the LORD has anointed Me to preach good news to the poor. He has sent Me to bind up the brokenhearted, to proclaim liberty to the captives and freedom to the prisoners, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_2","024_61_2","ISA","61","2","2","to proclaim the year of the LORD’s favor and the day of our God’s vengeance, to comfort all who mourn, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_3","024_61_3","ISA","61","3","3","to console the mourners in Zion—to give them a crown of beauty for ashes, the oil of joy for mourning, and a garment of praise for a spirit of despair. So they will be called oaks of righteousness, the planting of the LORD, that He may be glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_4","024_61_4","ISA","61","4","4","They will rebuild the ancient ruins; they will restore the places long devastated; they will renew the ruined cities, the desolations of many generations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_5","024_61_5","ISA","61","5","5","Strangers will stand and feed your flocks, and foreigners will be your plowmen and vinedressers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_6","024_61_6","ISA","61","6","6","But you will be called the priests of the LORD; they will speak of you as ministers of our God; you will feed on the wealth of nations, and you will boast in their riches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_7","024_61_7","ISA","61","7","7","Instead of shame, My people will have a double portion, and instead of humiliation, they will rejoice in their share; and so they will inherit a double portion in their land, and everlasting joy will be theirs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_8","024_61_8","ISA","61","8","8","For I, the LORD, love justice; I hate robbery and iniquity; in My faithfulness I will give them their recompense and make an everlasting covenant with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_9","024_61_9","ISA","61","9","9","Their descendants will be known among the nations, and their offspring among the peoples. All who see them will acknowledge that they are a people the LORD has blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_10","024_61_10","ISA","61","10","10","I will rejoice greatly in the LORD, my soul will exult in my God; for He has clothed me with garments of salvation and wrapped me in a robe of righteousness, as a bridegroom wears a priestly headdress, as a bride adorns herself with her jewels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS61_11","024_61_11","ISA","61","11","11","For as the earth brings forth its growth, and as a garden enables seed to spring up, so the Lord GOD will cause righteousness and praise to spring up before all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_1","024_62_1","ISA","62","1","1","For Zion’s sake I will not keep silent, and for Jerusalem’s sake I will not keep still, until her righteousness shines like a bright light, her salvation like a blazing torch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_2","024_62_2","ISA","62","2","2","Nations will see your righteousness, and all kings your glory. You will be called by a new name that the mouth of the LORD will bestow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_3","024_62_3","ISA","62","3","3","You will be a crown of glory in the hand of the LORD, a royal diadem in the palm of your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_4","024_62_4","ISA","62","4","4","No longer will you be called Forsaken, nor your land named Desolate; but you will be called Hephzibah, and your land Beulah; for the LORD will take delight in you, and your land will be His bride. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_5","024_62_5","ISA","62","5","5","For as a young man marries a young woman, so your sons will marry you; and as a bridegroom rejoices over his bride, so your God will rejoice over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_6","024_62_6","ISA","62","6","6","On your walls, O Jerusalem, I have posted watchmen; they will never be silent day or night. You who call on the LORD shall take no rest for yourselves, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_7","024_62_7","ISA","62","7","7","nor give Him any rest until He establishes Jerusalem and makes her the praise of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_8","024_62_8","ISA","62","8","8","The LORD has sworn by His right hand and by His mighty arm: “Never again will I give your grain to your enemies for food, nor will foreigners drink the new wine for which you have toiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_9","024_62_9","ISA","62","9","9","For those who harvest grain will eat it and praise the LORD, and those who gather grapes will drink the wine in My holy courts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_10","024_62_10","ISA","62","10","10","Go out, go out through the gates; prepare the way for the people! Build it up, build up the highway; clear away the stones; raise a banner for the nations! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_11","024_62_11","ISA","62","11","11","Behold, the LORD has proclaimed to the ends of the earth, “Say to Daughter Zion: See, your Savior comes! Look, His reward is with Him, and His recompense goes before Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS62_12","024_62_12","ISA","62","12","12","And they will be called the Holy People, the Redeemed of The LORD; and you will be called Sought Out, A City Not Forsaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_1","024_63_1","ISA","63","1","1","Who is this coming from Edom, from Bozrah with crimson-stained garments? Who is this robed in splendor, marching in the greatness of His strength? “It is I, proclaiming vindication, mighty to save.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_2","024_63_2","ISA","63","2","2","Why are Your clothes red, and Your garments like one who treads the winepress? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_3","024_63_3","ISA","63","3","3","“I have trodden the winepress alone, and no one from the nations was with Me. I trampled them in My anger and trod them down in My fury; their blood spattered My garments, and all My clothes were stained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_4","024_63_4","ISA","63","4","4","For the day of vengeance was in My heart, and the year of My redemption had come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_5","024_63_5","ISA","63","5","5","I looked, but there was no one to help; I was appalled that no one assisted. So My arm brought Me salvation, and My own wrath upheld Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_6","024_63_6","ISA","63","6","6","I trampled the nations in My anger; in My wrath I made them drunk and poured out their blood on the ground.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_7","024_63_7","ISA","63","7","7","I will make known the LORD’s loving devotion and His praiseworthy acts, because of all that the LORD has done for us—the many good things for the house of Israel according to His great compassion and loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_8","024_63_8","ISA","63","8","8","For He said, “They are surely My people, sons who will not be disloyal.” So He became their Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_9","024_63_9","ISA","63","9","9","In all their distress, He too was afflicted, and the Angel of His Presence saved them. In His love and compassion He redeemed them; He lifted them up and carried them all the days of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_10","024_63_10","ISA","63","10","10","But they rebelled and grieved His Holy Spirit. So He turned and became their enemy, and He Himself fought against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_11","024_63_11","ISA","63","11","11","Then His people remembered the days of old, the days of Moses. Where is He who brought them through the sea with the shepherds of His flock? Where is the One who set His Holy Spirit among them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_12","024_63_12","ISA","63","12","12","who sent His glorious arm to lead them by the right hand of Moses, who divided the waters before them to gain for Himself everlasting renown, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_13","024_63_13","ISA","63","13","13","who led them through the depths like a horse in the wilderness, so that they did not stumble? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_14","024_63_14","ISA","63","14","14","Like cattle going down to the valley, the Spirit of the LORD gave them rest. You led Your people this way to make for Yourself a glorious name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_15","024_63_15","ISA","63","15","15","Look down from heaven and see, from Your holy and glorious habitation. Where are Your zeal and might? Your yearning and compassion for me are restrained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_16","024_63_16","ISA","63","16","16","Yet You are our Father, though Abraham does not know us and Israel does not acknowledge us. You, O LORD, are our Father; our Redeemer from Everlasting is Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_17","024_63_17","ISA","63","17","17","Why, O LORD, do You make us stray from Your ways and harden our hearts from fearing You? Return, for the sake of Your servants, the tribes of Your heritage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_18","024_63_18","ISA","63","18","18","For a short while Your people possessed Your holy place, but our enemies have trampled Your sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS63_19","024_63_19","ISA","63","19","19","We have become like those You never ruled, like those not called by Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_1","024_64_1","ISA","64","1","1","If only You would rend the heavens and come down, so that mountains would quake at Your presence, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_2","024_64_2","ISA","64","2","2","as fire kindles the brushwood and causes the water to boil, to make Your name known to Your enemies, so that the nations will tremble at Your presence! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_3","024_64_3","ISA","64","3","3","When You did awesome works that we did not expect, You came down, and the mountains trembled at Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_4","024_64_4","ISA","64","4","4","From ancient times no one has heard, no ear has perceived, no eye has seen any God besides You, who acts on behalf of those who wait for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_5","024_64_5","ISA","64","5","5","You welcome those who gladly do right, who remember Your ways. Surely You were angry, for we sinned. How can we be saved if we remain in our sins? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_6","024_64_6","ISA","64","6","6","Each of us has become like something unclean, and all our righteous acts are like filthy rags; we all wither like a leaf, and our iniquities carry us away like the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_7","024_64_7","ISA","64","7","7","No one calls on Your name or strives to take hold of You. For You have hidden Your face from us and delivered us into the hand of our iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_8","024_64_8","ISA","64","8","8","But now, O LORD, You are our Father; we are the clay, and You are the potter; we are all the work of Your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_9","024_64_9","ISA","64","9","9","Do not be angry, O LORD, beyond measure; do not remember our iniquity forever. Oh, look upon us, we pray; we are all Your people! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_10","024_64_10","ISA","64","10","10","Your holy cities have become a wilderness. Zion has become a wasteland and Jerusalem a desolation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_11","024_64_11","ISA","64","11","11","Our holy and beautiful temple, where our fathers praised You, has been burned with fire, and all that was dear to us lies in ruins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS64_12","024_64_12","ISA","64","12","12","After all this, O LORD, will You restrain Yourself? Will You keep silent and afflict us beyond measure? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_1","024_65_1","ISA","65","1","1","“I revealed Myself to those who did not ask for Me; I was found by those who did not seek Me. To a nation that did not call My name, I said, ‘Here I am! Here I am!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_2","024_65_2","ISA","65","2","2","All day long I have held out My hands to an obstinate people who walk in the wrong path, who follow their own imaginations, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_3","024_65_3","ISA","65","3","3","to a people who continually provoke Me to My face, sacrificing in the gardens and burning incense on altars of brick, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_4","024_65_4","ISA","65","4","4","sitting among the graves, spending nights in secret places, eating the meat of pigs and polluted broth from their bowls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_5","024_65_5","ISA","65","5","5","They say, ‘Keep to yourself; do not come near me, for I am holier than you!’ Such people are smoke in My nostrils, a fire that burns all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_6","024_65_6","ISA","65","6","6","Behold, it is written before Me: I will not keep silent, but I will repay; I will pay it back into their laps, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_7","024_65_7","ISA","65","7","7","both for your iniquities and for those of your fathers,” says the LORD. “Because they burned incense on the mountains and scorned Me on the hills, I will measure into their laps full payment for their former deeds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_8","024_65_8","ISA","65","8","8","This is what the LORD says: “As the new wine is found in a cluster of grapes, and men say, ‘Do not destroy it, for it contains a blessing,’ so I will act on behalf of My servants; I will not destroy them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_9","024_65_9","ISA","65","9","9","And I will bring forth descendants from Jacob, and heirs from Judah; My elect will possess My mountains, and My servants will dwell there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_10","024_65_10","ISA","65","10","10","Sharon will become a pasture for flocks, and the Valley of Achor a resting place for herds, for My people who seek Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_11","024_65_11","ISA","65","11","11","But you who forsake the LORD, who forget My holy mountain, who set a table for Fortune and fill bowls of mixed wine for Destiny, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_12","024_65_12","ISA","65","12","12","I will destine you for the sword, and you will all kneel down to be slaughtered, because I called and you did not answer, I spoke and you did not listen; you did evil in My sight and chose that in which I did not delight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_13","024_65_13","ISA","65","13","13","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: “My servants will eat, but you will go hungry; My servants will drink, but you will go thirsty; My servants will rejoice, but you will be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_14","024_65_14","ISA","65","14","14","My servants will shout for joy with a glad heart, but you will cry out with a heavy heart and wail with a broken spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_15","024_65_15","ISA","65","15","15","You will leave behind your name as a curse for My chosen ones, and the Lord GOD will slay you; but to His servants He will give another name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_16","024_65_16","ISA","65","16","16","Whoever invokes a blessing in the land will do so by the God of truth, and whoever takes an oath in the land will swear by the God of truth. For the former troubles will be forgotten and hidden from My sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_17","024_65_17","ISA","65","17","17","For behold, I will create new heavens and a new earth. The former things will not be remembered, nor will they come to mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_18","024_65_18","ISA","65","18","18","But be glad and rejoice forever in what I create; for I will create Jerusalem to be a joy and its people to be a delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_19","024_65_19","ISA","65","19","19","I will rejoice in Jerusalem and take delight in My people. The sounds of weeping and crying will no longer be heard in her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_20","024_65_20","ISA","65","20","20","No longer will a nursing infant live but a few days, or an old man fail to live out his years. For the youth will die at a hundred years, and he who fails to reach a hundred will be considered accursed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_21","024_65_21","ISA","65","21","21","They will build houses and dwell in them; they will plant vineyards and eat their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_22","024_65_22","ISA","65","22","22","No longer will they build houses for others to inhabit, nor plant for others to eat. For as is the lifetime of a tree, so will be the days of My people, and My chosen ones will fully enjoy the work of their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_23","024_65_23","ISA","65","23","23","They will not labor in vain or bear children doomed to disaster; for they will be a people blessed by the LORD—they and their descendants with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_24","024_65_24","ISA","65","24","24","Even before they call, I will answer, and while they are still speaking, I will hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS65_25","024_65_25","ISA","65","25","25","The wolf and the lamb will feed together, and the lion will eat straw like the ox, but the food of the serpent will be dust. They will neither harm nor destroy on all My holy mountain,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_1","024_66_1","ISA","66","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Heaven is My throne, and earth is My footstool. What kind of house will you build for Me? Or where will My place of repose be? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_2","024_66_2","ISA","66","2","2","Has not My hand made all these things? And so they came into being,” declares the LORD. “This is the one I will esteem: he who is humble and contrite in spirit, who trembles at My word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_3","024_66_3","ISA","66","3","3","Whoever slaughters an ox is like one who slays a man; whoever sacrifices a lamb is like one who breaks a dog’s neck; whoever presents a grain offering is like one who offers pig’s blood; whoever offers frankincense is like one who blesses an idol. Indeed, they have chosen their own ways and delighted in their abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_4","024_66_4","ISA","66","4","4","So I will choose their punishment and I will bring terror upon them, because I called and no one answered, I spoke and no one listened. But they did evil in My sight and chose that in which I did not delight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_5","024_66_5","ISA","66","5","5","You who tremble at His word, hear the word of the LORD: “Your brothers who hate you and exclude you because of My name have said, ‘Let the LORD be glorified that we may see your joy!’ But they will be put to shame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_6","024_66_6","ISA","66","6","6","Hear the uproar from the city; listen to the voice from the temple! It is the voice of the LORD, repaying His enemies what they deserve! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_7","024_66_7","ISA","66","7","7","“Before she was in labor, she gave birth; before she was in pain, she delivered a boy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_8","024_66_8","ISA","66","8","8","Who has heard of such as this? Who has seen such things? Can a country be born in a day or a nation be delivered in an instant? Yet as soon as Zion was in labor, she gave birth to her children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_9","024_66_9","ISA","66","9","9","Shall I bring a baby to the point of birth and not deliver it?” says the LORD. “Or will I who deliver close the womb?” says your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_10","024_66_10","ISA","66","10","10","Be glad for Jerusalem and rejoice over her, all who love her. Rejoice greatly with her, all who mourn over her, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_11","024_66_11","ISA","66","11","11","so that you may nurse and be satisfied at her comforting breasts; you may drink deeply and delight yourselves in her glorious abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_12","024_66_12","ISA","66","12","12","For this is what the LORD says: “I will extend peace to her like a river, and the wealth of nations like a flowing stream; you will nurse and be carried on her arm, and bounced upon her knees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_13","024_66_13","ISA","66","13","13","As a mother comforts her son, so will I comfort you, and you will be consoled over Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_14","024_66_14","ISA","66","14","14","When you see, you will rejoice, and you will flourish like grass; then the hand of the LORD will be revealed to His servants, but His wrath will be shown to His enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_15","024_66_15","ISA","66","15","15","For behold, the LORD will come with fire—His chariots are like a whirlwind—to execute His anger with fury and His rebuke with flames of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_16","024_66_16","ISA","66","16","16","For by fire and by His sword, the LORD will execute judgment on all flesh, and many will be slain by the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_17","024_66_17","ISA","66","17","17","“Those who consecrate and purify themselves to enter the groves—to follow one in the center of those who eat the flesh of swine and vermin and rats—will perish together,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_18","024_66_18","ISA","66","18","18","“And I, knowing their deeds and thoughts, am coming to gather all nations and tongues, and they will come and see My glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_19","024_66_19","ISA","66","19","19","I will establish a sign among them, and I will send survivors from among them to the nations—to Tarshish, Put, and the archers of Lud; to Tubal, Javan, and the islands far away who have not heard of My fame or seen My glory. So they will proclaim My glory among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_20","024_66_20","ISA","66","20","20","And they will bring all your brothers from all the nations as a gift to the LORD on horses and chariots and wagons, on mules and camels, to My holy mountain Jerusalem,” says the LORD, “just as the Israelites bring an offering in a clean vessel to the house of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_21","024_66_21","ISA","66","21","21","“And I will select some of them as priests and Levites,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_22","024_66_22","ISA","66","22","22","“For just as the new heavens and the new earth, which I will make, will endure before Me,” declares the LORD, “so your descendants and your name will endure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_23","024_66_23","ISA","66","23","23","From one New Moon to another and from one Sabbath to another, all mankind will come to worship before Me,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("IS66_24","024_66_24","ISA","66","24","24","“As they go forth, they will see the corpses of the men who have rebelled against Me; for their worm will never die, their fire will never be quenched, and they will be a horror to all mankind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_1","025_1_1","JER","1","1","1","These are the words of Jeremiah son of Hilkiah, one of the priests in Anathoth in the territory of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_2","025_1_2","JER","1","2","2","The word of the LORD came to Jeremiah in the thirteenth year of the reign of Josiah son of Amon king of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_3","025_1_3","JER","1","3","3","and through the days of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah, until the fifth month of the eleventh year of Zedekiah son of Josiah king of Judah, when the people of Jerusalem went into exile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_4","025_1_4","JER","1","4","4","The word of the LORD came to me, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_5","025_1_5","JER","1","5","5","“Before I formed you in the womb I knew you, and before you were born I set you apart and appointed you as a prophet to the nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_6","025_1_6","JER","1","6","6","“Ah, Lord GOD,” I said, “I surely do not know how to speak, for I am only a child!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_7","025_1_7","JER","1","7","7","But the LORD told me: “Do not say, ‘I am only a child.’ For to everyone I send you, you must go, and all that I command you, you must speak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_8","025_1_8","JER","1","8","8","Do not be afraid of them, for I am with you to deliver you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_9","025_1_9","JER","1","9","9","Then the LORD reached out His hand, touched my mouth, and said to me: “Behold, I have put My words in your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_10","025_1_10","JER","1","10","10","See, I have appointed you today over nations and kingdoms to uproot and tear down, to destroy and overthrow, to build and plant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_11","025_1_11","JER","1","11","11","And the word of the LORD came to me, asking, “Jeremiah, what do you see?” “I see a branch of an almond tree,” I replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_12","025_1_12","JER","1","12","12","“You have observed correctly,” said the LORD, “for I am watching over My word to accomplish it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_13","025_1_13","JER","1","13","13","Again the word of the LORD came to me, asking, “What do you see?” “I see a boiling pot,” I replied, “and it is tilting toward us from the north.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_14","025_1_14","JER","1","14","14","Then the LORD said to me, “Disaster from the north will be poured out on all who live in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_15","025_1_15","JER","1","15","15","For I am about to summon all the clans and kingdoms of the north,” declares the LORD. “Their kings will come and set up their thrones at the entrance of the gates of Jerusalem. They will attack all her surrounding walls and all the other cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_16","025_1_16","JER","1","16","16","I will pronounce My judgments against them for all their wickedness, because they have forsaken Me, and they have burned incense to other gods and worshiped the works of their own hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_17","025_1_17","JER","1","17","17","Get yourself ready. Stand up and tell them everything that I command you. Do not be intimidated by them, or I will terrify you before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_18","025_1_18","JER","1","18","18","Now behold, this day I have made you like a fortified city, an iron pillar, and bronze walls against the whole land—against the kings of Judah, its officials, its priests, and the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR1_19","025_1_19","JER","1","19","19","They will fight against you but will never overcome you, since I am with you to deliver you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_1","025_2_1","JER","2","1","1","Now the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_2","025_2_2","JER","2","2","2","“Go and proclaim in the hearing of Jerusalem that this is what the LORD says: ‘I remember the devotion of your youth, your love as a bride, how you followed Me in the wilderness, in a land not sown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_3","025_2_3","JER","2","3","3","Israel was holy to the LORD, the firstfruits of His harvest. All who devoured her were found guilty; disaster came upon them,’” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_4","025_2_4","JER","2","4","4","Hear the word of the LORD, O house of Jacob, and all you families of the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_5","025_2_5","JER","2","5","5","This is what the LORD says: “What fault did your fathers find in Me that they strayed so far from Me? They followed worthless idols, and became worthless themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_6","025_2_6","JER","2","6","6","They did not ask, ‘Where is the LORD who brought us up from the land of Egypt, who led us through the wilderness, through a land of deserts and pits, a land of drought and darkness, a land where no one travels and no one lives?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_7","025_2_7","JER","2","7","7","I brought you into a fertile land to eat its fruit and bounty, but you came and defiled My land and made My inheritance detestable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_8","025_2_8","JER","2","8","8","The priests did not ask, ‘Where is the LORD?’ The experts in the law no longer knew Me, and the leaders rebelled against Me. The prophets prophesied by Baal and followed useless idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_9","025_2_9","JER","2","9","9","Therefore, I will contend with you again, declares the LORD, and I will bring a case against your children’s children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_10","025_2_10","JER","2","10","10","Cross over to the coasts of Cyprus and take a look; send to Kedar and consider carefully; see if there has ever been anything like this: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_11","025_2_11","JER","2","11","11","Has a nation ever changed its gods? (Yet they are not gods at all.) But My people have exchanged their Glory for useless idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_12","025_2_12","JER","2","12","12","Be stunned by this, O heavens; be shocked and utterly appalled,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_13","025_2_13","JER","2","13","13","“For My people have committed two evils: They have forsaken Me, the fountain of living water, and they have dug their own cisterns—broken cisterns that cannot hold water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_14","025_2_14","JER","2","14","14","Is Israel a slave? Was he born into slavery? Why then has he become prey? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_15","025_2_15","JER","2","15","15","The young lions have roared at him; they have sounded their voices. They have laid waste his land; his cities lie in ruins, without inhabitant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_16","025_2_16","JER","2","16","16","The men of Memphis and Tahpanhes have shaved the crown of your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_17","025_2_17","JER","2","17","17","Have you not brought this on yourself by forsaking the LORD your God when He led you in the way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_18","025_2_18","JER","2","18","18","Now what will you gain on your way to Egypt to drink the waters of the Nile? What will you gain on your way to Assyria to drink the waters of the Euphrates? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_19","025_2_19","JER","2","19","19","Your own evil will discipline you; your own apostasies will reprimand you. Consider and realize how evil and bitter it is for you to forsake the LORD your God and to have no fear of Me,” declares the Lord GOD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_20","025_2_20","JER","2","20","20","“For long ago you broke your yoke and tore off your chains, saying, ‘I will not serve!’ Indeed, on every high hill and under every green tree you lay down as a prostitute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_21","025_2_21","JER","2","21","21","I had planted you like a choice vine from the very best seed. How could you turn yourself before Me into a rotten, wild vine? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_22","025_2_22","JER","2","22","22","Although you wash with lye and use an abundance of soap, the stain of your guilt is still before Me,” declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_23","025_2_23","JER","2","23","23","“How can you say, ‘I am not defiled; I have not run after the Baals’? Look at your behavior in the valley; acknowledge what you have done. You are a swift young she-camel galloping here and there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_24","025_2_24","JER","2","24","24","a wild donkey at home in the wilderness, sniffing the wind in the heat of her desire. Who can restrain her passion? All who seek her need not weary themselves; in mating season they will find her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_25","025_2_25","JER","2","25","25","You should have kept your feet from going bare and your throat from being thirsty. But you said, ‘It is hopeless! For I love foreign gods, and I must go after them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_26","025_2_26","JER","2","26","26","As the thief is ashamed when he is caught, so the house of Israel is disgraced. They, their kings, their officials, their priests, and their prophets ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_27","025_2_27","JER","2","27","27","say to a tree, ‘You are my father,’ and to a stone, ‘You gave me birth.’ They have turned their backs to Me and not their faces. Yet in the time of trouble, they say, ‘Rise up and save us!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_28","025_2_28","JER","2","28","28","But where are the gods you made for yourselves? Let them rise up in your time of trouble and save you if they can; for your gods are as numerous as your cities, O Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_29","025_2_29","JER","2","29","29","Why do you bring a case against Me? You have all rebelled against Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_30","025_2_30","JER","2","30","30","“I have struck your sons in vain; they accepted no discipline. Your own sword has devoured your prophets like a voracious lion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_31","025_2_31","JER","2","31","31","You people of this generation, consider the word of the LORD: “Have I been a wilderness to Israel or a land of dense darkness? Why do My people say, ‘We are free to roam; we will come to You no more’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_32","025_2_32","JER","2","32","32","Does a maiden forget her jewelry or a bride her wedding sash? Yet My people have forgotten Me for days without number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_33","025_2_33","JER","2","33","33","How skillfully you pursue love! Even the most immoral of women could learn from your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_34","025_2_34","JER","2","34","34","Moreover, your skirts are stained with the blood of the innocent poor, though you did not find them breaking in. But in spite of all these things ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_35","025_2_35","JER","2","35","35","you say, ‘I am innocent. Surely His anger will turn from me.’ Behold, I will judge you, because you say, ‘I have not sinned.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_36","025_2_36","JER","2","36","36","How impulsive you are, constantly changing your ways! You will be disappointed by Egypt just as you were by Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR2_37","025_2_37","JER","2","37","37","Moreover, you will leave that place with your hands on your head, for the LORD has rejected those you trust; you will not prosper by their help.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_1","025_3_1","JER","3","1","1","“If a man divorces his wife and she leaves him to marry another, can he ever return to her? Would not such a land be completely defiled? But you have played the harlot with many lovers—and you would return to Me?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_2","025_3_2","JER","3","2","2","“Lift up your eyes to the barren heights and see. Is there any place where you have not been violated? You sat beside the highways waiting for your lovers, like a nomad in the desert. You have defiled the land with your prostitution and wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_3","025_3_3","JER","3","3","3","Therefore the showers have been withheld, and no spring rains have fallen. Yet you have the brazen look of a prostitute; you refuse to be ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_4","025_3_4","JER","3","4","4","Have you not just called to Me, ‘My Father, You are my friend from youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_5","025_3_5","JER","3","5","5","Will He be angry forever? Will He be indignant to the end?’ This you have spoken, but you keep doing all the evil you can.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_6","025_3_6","JER","3","6","6","Now in the days of King Josiah, the LORD said to me, “Have you seen what faithless Israel has done? She has gone up on every high hill and under every green tree to prostitute herself there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_7","025_3_7","JER","3","7","7","I thought that after she had done all these things, she would return to Me. But she did not return, and her unfaithful sister Judah saw it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_8","025_3_8","JER","3","8","8","She saw that because faithless Israel had committed adultery, I gave her a certificate of divorce and sent her away. Yet that unfaithful sister Judah had no fear and prostituted herself as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_9","025_3_9","JER","3","9","9","Indifferent to her own infidelity, Israel had defiled the land and committed adultery with stones and trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_10","025_3_10","JER","3","10","10","Yet in spite of all this, her unfaithful sister Judah did not return to Me with all her heart, but only in pretense,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_11","025_3_11","JER","3","11","11","And the LORD said to me, “Faithless Israel has shown herself more righteous than unfaithful Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_12","025_3_12","JER","3","12","12","Go, proclaim this message toward the north: ‘Return, O faithless Israel,’ declares the LORD. ‘I will no longer look on you with anger, for I am merciful,’ declares the LORD. ‘I will not be angry forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_13","025_3_13","JER","3","13","13","Only acknowledge your guilt, that you have rebelled against the LORD your God. You have scattered your favors to foreign gods under every green tree and have not obeyed My voice,’” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_14","025_3_14","JER","3","14","14","“Return, O faithless children,” declares the LORD, “for I am your master, and I will take you—one from a city and two from a family—and bring you to Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_15","025_3_15","JER","3","15","15","Then I will give you shepherds after My own heart, who will feed you with knowledge and understanding.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_16","025_3_16","JER","3","16","16","“In those days, when you multiply and increase in the land,” declares the LORD, “they will no longer discuss the ark of the covenant of the LORD. It will never come to mind, and no one will remember it or miss it, nor will another one be made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_17","025_3_17","JER","3","17","17","At that time they will call Jerusalem The Throne of the LORD, and all the nations will be gathered in Jerusalem to honor the name of the LORD. They will no longer follow the stubbornness of their evil hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_18","025_3_18","JER","3","18","18","In those days the house of Judah will walk with the house of Israel, and they will come together from the land of the north to the land that I gave to your fathers as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_19","025_3_19","JER","3","19","19","Then I said, ‘How I long to make you My sons and give you a desirable land, the most beautiful inheritance of all the nations!’ I thought you would call Me ‘Father’ and never turn away from following Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_20","025_3_20","JER","3","20","20","But as a woman may betray her husband, so you have betrayed Me, O house of Israel,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_21","025_3_21","JER","3","21","21","A voice is heard on the barren heights, the children of Israel weeping and begging for mercy, because they have perverted their ways and forgotten the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_22","025_3_22","JER","3","22","22","“Return, O faithless children, and I will heal your faithlessness.” “Here we are. We come to You, for You are the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_23","025_3_23","JER","3","23","23","Surely deception comes from the hills, and commotion from the mountains. Surely the salvation of Israel is in the LORD our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_24","025_3_24","JER","3","24","24","From our youth, that shameful god has consumed what our fathers have worked for—their flocks and herds, their sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR3_25","025_3_25","JER","3","25","25","Let us lie down in our shame; let our disgrace cover us. We have sinned against the LORD our God, both we and our fathers; from our youth even to this day we have not obeyed the voice of the LORD our God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_1","025_4_1","JER","4","1","1","“If you will return, O Israel, return to Me,” declares the LORD. “If you will remove your detestable idols from My sight and no longer waver, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_2","025_4_2","JER","4","2","2","and if you can swear, ‘As surely as the LORD lives,’ in truth, in justice, and in righteousness, then the nations will be blessed by Him, and in Him they will glory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_3","025_4_3","JER","4","3","3","For this is what the LORD says to the men of Judah and Jerusalem: “Break up your unplowed ground, and do not sow among the thorns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_4","025_4_4","JER","4","4","4","Circumcise yourselves to the LORD, and remove the foreskins of your hearts, O men of Judah and people of Jerusalem. Otherwise, My wrath will break out like fire and burn with no one to extinguish it, because of your evil deeds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_5","025_4_5","JER","4","5","5","Announce in Judah, proclaim in Jerusalem, and say: “Blow the ram’s horn throughout the land. Cry aloud and say, ‘Assemble yourselves and let us flee to the fortified cities.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_6","025_4_6","JER","4","6","6","Raise a signal flag toward Zion. Seek refuge! Do not delay! For I am bringing disaster from the north, and terrible destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_7","025_4_7","JER","4","7","7","A lion has gone up from his thicket, and a destroyer of nations has set out. He has left his lair to lay waste your land. Your cities will be reduced to ruins and lie uninhabited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_8","025_4_8","JER","4","8","8","So put on sackcloth, mourn and wail, for the fierce anger of the LORD has not turned away from us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_9","025_4_9","JER","4","9","9","“In that day,” declares the LORD, “the king and officials will lose their courage. The priests will tremble in fear, and the prophets will be astounded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_10","025_4_10","JER","4","10","10","Then I said, “Ah, Lord GOD, how completely You have deceived this people and Jerusalem by saying, ‘You will have peace,’ while a sword is at our throats.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_11","025_4_11","JER","4","11","11","At that time it will be said to this people and to Jerusalem, “A searing wind from the barren heights in the desert blows toward the daughter of My people, but not to winnow or to sift; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_12","025_4_12","JER","4","12","12","a wind too strong for that comes from Me. Now I also pronounce judgments against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_13","025_4_13","JER","4","13","13","Behold, he advances like the clouds, his chariots like the whirlwind. His horses are swifter than eagles. Woe to us, for we are ruined! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_14","025_4_14","JER","4","14","14","Wash the evil from your heart, O Jerusalem, so that you may be saved. How long will you harbor wicked thoughts within you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_15","025_4_15","JER","4","15","15","For a voice resounds from Dan, proclaiming disaster from the hills of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_16","025_4_16","JER","4","16","16","Warn the nations now! Proclaim to Jerusalem: “A besieging army comes from a distant land; they raise their voices against the cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_17","025_4_17","JER","4","17","17","They surround her like men guarding a field, because she has rebelled against Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_18","025_4_18","JER","4","18","18","“Your ways and deeds have brought this upon you. This is your punishment; how bitter it is, because it pierces to the heart!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_19","025_4_19","JER","4","19","19","My anguish, my anguish! I writhe in pain! Oh, the pain in my chest! My heart pounds within me; I cannot be silent. For I have heard the sound of the horn, the alarm of battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_20","025_4_20","JER","4","20","20","Disaster after disaster is proclaimed, for the whole land is laid waste. My tents are destroyed in an instant, my curtains in a moment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_21","025_4_21","JER","4","21","21","How long must I see the signal flag and hear the sound of the horn? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_22","025_4_22","JER","4","22","22","“For My people are fools; they have not known Me. They are foolish children, without understanding. They are skilled in doing evil, but they know not how to do good.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_23","025_4_23","JER","4","23","23","I looked at the earth, and it was formless and void; I looked to the heavens, and they had no light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_24","025_4_24","JER","4","24","24","I looked at the mountains, and behold, they were quaking; all the hills were swaying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_25","025_4_25","JER","4","25","25","I looked, and no man was left; all the birds of the air had fled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_26","025_4_26","JER","4","26","26","I looked, and the fruitful land was a desert. All its cities were torn down before the LORD, before His fierce anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_27","025_4_27","JER","4","27","27","For this is what the LORD says: “The whole land will be desolate, but I will not finish its destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_28","025_4_28","JER","4","28","28","Therefore the earth will mourn and the heavens above will grow dark. I have spoken, I have planned, and I will not relent or turn back.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_29","025_4_29","JER","4","29","29","Every city flees at the sound of the horseman and archer. They enter the thickets and climb among the rocks. Every city is abandoned; no inhabitant is left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_30","025_4_30","JER","4","30","30","And you, O devastated one, what will you do, though you dress yourself in scarlet, though you adorn yourself with gold jewelry, though you enlarge your eyes with paint? You adorn yourself in vain; your lovers despise you; they want to take your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR4_31","025_4_31","JER","4","31","31","For I hear a cry like a woman in labor, a cry of anguish like one bearing her first child—the cry of the Daughter of Zion gasping for breath, stretching out her hands to say, “Woe is me, for my soul faints before the murderers!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_1","025_5_1","JER","5","1","1","“Go up and down the streets of Jerusalem. Look now and take note; search her squares. If you can find a single person, anyone who acts justly, anyone who seeks the truth, then I will forgive the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_2","025_5_2","JER","5","2","2","Although they say, ‘As surely as the LORD lives,’ they are swearing falsely.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_3","025_5_3","JER","5","3","3","O LORD, do not Your eyes look for truth? You struck them, but they felt no pain. You finished them off, but they refused to accept discipline. They have made their faces harder than stone and refused to repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_4","025_5_4","JER","5","4","4","Then I said, “They are only the poor; they have played the fool, for they do not know the way of the LORD, the justice of their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_5","025_5_5","JER","5","5","5","I will go to the powerful and speak to them. Surely they know the way of the LORD, the justice of their God.” But they too, with one accord, had broken the yoke and torn off the chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_6","025_5_6","JER","5","6","6","Therefore a lion from the forest will strike them down, a wolf from the desert will ravage them. A leopard will lie in wait near their cities, and everyone who ventures out will be torn to pieces. For their rebellious acts are many, and their unfaithful deeds are numerous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_7","025_5_7","JER","5","7","7","“Why should I forgive you? Your children have forsaken Me and sworn by gods that are not gods. I satisfied their needs, yet they committed adultery and assembled at the houses of prostitutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_8","025_5_8","JER","5","8","8","They are well-fed, lusty stallions, each neighing after his neighbor’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_9","025_5_9","JER","5","9","9","Should I not punish them for these things?” declares the LORD. “Should I not avenge Myself on such a nation as this? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_10","025_5_10","JER","5","10","10","Go up through her vineyards and ravage them, but do not finish them off. Strip off her branches, for they do not belong to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_11","025_5_11","JER","5","11","11","For the house of Israel and the house of Judah have been utterly unfaithful to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_12","025_5_12","JER","5","12","12","They have lied about the LORD and said: “He will not do anything; harm will not come to us; we will not see sword or famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_13","025_5_13","JER","5","13","13","The prophets are but wind, for the word is not in them. So let their own predictions befall them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_14","025_5_14","JER","5","14","14","Therefore this is what the LORD God of Hosts says: “Because you have spoken this word, I will make My words a fire in your mouth and this people the wood it consumes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_15","025_5_15","JER","5","15","15","Behold, I am bringing a distant nation against you, O house of Israel,” declares the LORD. “It is an established nation, an ancient nation, a nation whose language you do not know and whose speech you do not understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_16","025_5_16","JER","5","16","16","Their quivers are like open graves; they are all mighty men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_17","025_5_17","JER","5","17","17","They will devour your harvest and food; they will consume your sons and daughters; they will eat up your flocks and herds; they will feed on your vines and fig trees. With the sword they will destroy the fortified cities in which you trust.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_18","025_5_18","JER","5","18","18","“Yet even in those days,” declares the LORD, “I will not make a full end of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_19","025_5_19","JER","5","19","19","And when the people ask, ‘For what offense has the LORD our God done all these things to us?’ You are to tell them, ‘Just as you have forsaken Me and served foreign gods in your land, so will you serve foreigners in a land that is not your own.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_20","025_5_20","JER","5","20","20","Declare this in the house of Jacob and proclaim it in Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_21","025_5_21","JER","5","21","21","“Hear this, O foolish and senseless people, who have eyes but do not see, who have ears but do not hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_22","025_5_22","JER","5","22","22","Do you not fear Me?” declares the LORD. “Do you not tremble before Me, the One who set the sand as the boundary for the sea, an enduring barrier it cannot cross? The waves surge, but they cannot prevail. They roar but cannot cross it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_23","025_5_23","JER","5","23","23","But these people have stubborn and rebellious hearts. They have turned aside and gone away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_24","025_5_24","JER","5","24","24","They have not said in their hearts, ‘Let us fear the LORD our God, who gives the rains, both autumn and spring, in season, who keeps for us the appointed weeks of harvest.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_25","025_5_25","JER","5","25","25","Your iniquities have diverted these from you; your sins have deprived you of My bounty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_26","025_5_26","JER","5","26","26","For among My people are wicked men; they watch like fowlers lying in wait; they set a trap to catch men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_27","025_5_27","JER","5","27","27","Like cages full of birds, so their houses are full of deceit. Therefore they have become powerful and rich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_28","025_5_28","JER","5","28","28","They have grown fat and sleek, and have excelled in the deeds of the wicked. They have not taken up the cause of the fatherless, that they might prosper; nor have they defended the rights of the needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_29","025_5_29","JER","5","29","29","Should I not punish them for these things?” declares the LORD. “Should I not avenge Myself on such a nation as this? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_30","025_5_30","JER","5","30","30","A horrible and shocking thing has happened in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR5_31","025_5_31","JER","5","31","31","The prophets prophesy falsely, and the priests rule by their own authority. My people love it so, but what will you do in the end? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_1","025_6_1","JER","6","1","1","“Run for cover, O sons of Benjamin; flee from Jerusalem! Sound the ram’s horn in Tekoa; send up a signal over Beth-haccherem, for disaster looms from the north, even great destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_2","025_6_2","JER","6","2","2","Though she is beautiful and delicate, I will destroy the Daughter of Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_3","025_6_3","JER","6","3","3","Shepherds and their flocks will come against her; they will pitch their tents all around her, each tending his own portion: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_4","025_6_4","JER","6","4","4","‘Prepare for battle against her; rise up, let us attack at noon. Woe to us, for the daylight is fading; the evening shadows grow long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_5","025_6_5","JER","6","5","5","Rise up, let us attack by night and destroy her fortresses!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_6","025_6_6","JER","6","6","6","For this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Cut down the trees and raise a siege ramp against Jerusalem. This city must be punished; there is nothing but oppression in her midst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_7","025_6_7","JER","6","7","7","As a well gushes its water, so she pours out her evil. Violence and destruction resound in her; sickness and wounds are ever before Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_8","025_6_8","JER","6","8","8","Be forewarned, O Jerusalem, or I will turn away from you; I will make you a desolation, a land without inhabitant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_9","025_6_9","JER","6","9","9","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Glean the remnant of Israel as thoroughly as a vine. Pass your hand once more like a grape gatherer over the branches.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_10","025_6_10","JER","6","10","10","To whom can I give this warning? Who will listen to me? Look, their ears are closed, so they cannot hear. See, the word of the LORD has become offensive to them; they find no pleasure in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_11","025_6_11","JER","6","11","11","But I am full of the LORD’s wrath; I am tired of holding it back. “Pour it out on the children in the street, and on the young men gathered together. For both husband and wife will be captured, the old and the very old alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_12","025_6_12","JER","6","12","12","Their houses will be turned over to others, their fields and wives as well, for I will stretch out My hand against the inhabitants of the land,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_13","025_6_13","JER","6","13","13","“For from the least of them to the greatest, all are greedy for gain; from prophet to priest, all practice deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_14","025_6_14","JER","6","14","14","They dress the wound of My people with very little care, saying, ‘Peace, peace,’ when there is no peace at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_15","025_6_15","JER","6","15","15","Are they ashamed of the abomination they have committed? No, they have no shame at all; they do not even know how to blush. So they will fall among the fallen; when I punish them, they will collapse,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_16","025_6_16","JER","6","16","16","This is what the LORD says: “Stand at the crossroads and look. Ask for the ancient paths: ‘Where is the good way?’ Then walk in it, and you will find rest for your souls. But they said, ‘We will not walk in it!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_17","025_6_17","JER","6","17","17","I appointed watchmen over you and said, ‘Listen for the sound of the ram’s horn.’ But they answered, ‘We will not listen!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_18","025_6_18","JER","6","18","18","Therefore hear, O nations, and learn, O congregations, what will happen to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_19","025_6_19","JER","6","19","19","Hear, O earth! I am bringing disaster on this people, the fruit of their own schemes, because they have paid no attention to My word and have rejected My instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_20","025_6_20","JER","6","20","20","What use to Me is frankincense from Sheba or sweet cane from a distant land? Your burnt offerings are not acceptable; your sacrifices do not please Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_21","025_6_21","JER","6","21","21","Therefore this is what the LORD says: “I will lay stumbling blocks before this people; fathers and sons alike will be staggered; friends and neighbors will perish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_22","025_6_22","JER","6","22","22","This is what the LORD says: “Behold, an army is coming from the land of the north; a great nation is stirred up from the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_23","025_6_23","JER","6","23","23","They grasp the bow and spear; they are cruel and merciless. Their voice roars like the sea, and they ride upon horses, lined up like men in formation against you, O Daughter of Zion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_24","025_6_24","JER","6","24","24","We have heard the report; our hands hang limp. Anguish has gripped us, pain like that of a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_25","025_6_25","JER","6","25","25","Do not go out to the fields; do not walk the road. For the enemy has a sword; terror is on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_26","025_6_26","JER","6","26","26","O daughter of my people, dress yourselves in sackcloth and roll in ashes. Mourn with bitter wailing, as you would for an only son, for suddenly the destroyer will come upon us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_27","025_6_27","JER","6","27","27","“I have appointed you to examine My people like ore, so you may know and try their ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_28","025_6_28","JER","6","28","28","All are hardened rebels, walking around as slanderers. They are bronze and iron; all of them are corrupt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_29","025_6_29","JER","6","29","29","The bellows blow fiercely, blasting away the lead with fire. The refining proceeds in vain, for the wicked are not purged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR6_30","025_6_30","JER","6","30","30","They are called rejected silver, because the LORD has rejected them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_1","025_7_1","JER","7","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_2","025_7_2","JER","7","2","2","“Stand in the gate of the house of the LORD and proclaim this message: Hear the word of the LORD, all you people of Judah who enter through these gates to worship the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_3","025_7_3","JER","7","3","3","Thus says the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel: Correct your ways and deeds, and I will let you live in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_4","025_7_4","JER","7","4","4","Do not trust in deceptive words, saying: ‘This is the temple of the LORD, the temple of the LORD, the temple of the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_5","025_7_5","JER","7","5","5","For if you really correct your ways and deeds, if you act justly toward one another, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_6","025_7_6","JER","7","6","6","if you no longer oppress the foreigner and the fatherless and the widow, and if you no longer shed innocent blood in this place or follow other gods to your own harm, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_7","025_7_7","JER","7","7","7","then I will let you live in this place, in the land that I gave to your fathers forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_8","025_7_8","JER","7","8","8","But look, you keep trusting in deceptive words to no avail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_9","025_7_9","JER","7","9","9","Will you steal and murder, commit adultery and perjury, burn incense to Baal, and follow other gods that you have not known, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_10","025_7_10","JER","7","10","10","and then come and stand before Me in this house, which bears My Name, and say, ‘We are delivered, so we can continue with all these abominations’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_11","025_7_11","JER","7","11","11","Has this house, which bears My Name, become a den of robbers in your sight? Yes, I too have seen it, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_12","025_7_12","JER","7","12","12","But go now to the place in Shiloh where I first made a dwelling for My Name, and see what I did to it because of the wickedness of My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_13","025_7_13","JER","7","13","13","And now, because you have done all these things, declares the LORD, and because I have spoken to you again and again but you would not listen, and I have called to you but you would not answer, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_14","025_7_14","JER","7","14","14","therefore what I did to Shiloh I will now do to the house that bears My Name, the house in which you trust, the place that I gave to you and your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_15","025_7_15","JER","7","15","15","And I will cast you out of My presence, just as I have cast out all your brothers, all the descendants of Ephraim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_16","025_7_16","JER","7","16","16","As for you, do not pray for these people, do not offer a plea or petition on their behalf, and do not beg Me, for I will not listen to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_17","025_7_17","JER","7","17","17","Do you not see what they are doing in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_18","025_7_18","JER","7","18","18","The sons gather wood, the fathers light the fire, and the women knead the dough to make cakes for the Queen of Heaven; they pour out drink offerings to other gods to provoke Me to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_19","025_7_19","JER","7","19","19","But am I the One they are provoking? declares the LORD. Is it not themselves they spite, to their own shame? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_20","025_7_20","JER","7","20","20","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, My anger and My fury will be poured out on this place, on man and beast, on the trees of the field and the produce of the land, and it will burn and not be extinguished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_21","025_7_21","JER","7","21","21","This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Add your burnt offerings to your other sacrifices and eat the meat yourselves! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_22","025_7_22","JER","7","22","22","For when I brought your fathers out of the land of Egypt, I did not merely command them about burnt offerings and sacrifices, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_23","025_7_23","JER","7","23","23","but this is what I commanded them: Obey Me, and I will be your God, and you will be My people. You must walk in all the ways I have commanded you, so that it may go well with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_24","025_7_24","JER","7","24","24","Yet they did not listen or incline their ear, but they followed the stubborn inclinations of their own evil hearts. They went backward and not forward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_25","025_7_25","JER","7","25","25","From the day your fathers came out of the land of Egypt until this day, I have sent you all My servants the prophets again and again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_26","025_7_26","JER","7","26","26","Yet they would not listen to Me or incline their ear, but they stiffened their necks and did more evil than their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_27","025_7_27","JER","7","27","27","When you tell them all these things, they will not listen to you. When you call to them, they will not answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_28","025_7_28","JER","7","28","28","Therefore you must say to them, ‘This is the nation that would not listen to the voice of the LORD their God and would not receive correction. Truth has perished; it has disappeared from their lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_29","025_7_29","JER","7","29","29","Cut off your hair and throw it away. Raise up a lamentation on the barren heights, for the LORD has rejected and forsaken the generation of His wrath.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_30","025_7_30","JER","7","30","30","For the people of Judah have done evil in My sight, declares the LORD. They have set up their abominations in the house that bears My Name, and so have defiled it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_31","025_7_31","JER","7","31","31","They have built the high places of Topheth in the Valley of Ben-hinnom so they could burn their sons and daughters in the fire—something I never commanded, nor did it even enter My mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_32","025_7_32","JER","7","32","32","So behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when this place will no longer be called Topheth and the Valley of Ben-hinnom, but the Valley of Slaughter. For they will bury the dead in Topheth until there is no more room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_33","025_7_33","JER","7","33","33","The corpses of this people will become food for the birds of the air and the beasts of the earth, and there will be no one to scare them away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR7_34","025_7_34","JER","7","34","34","I will remove from the cities of Judah and the streets of Jerusalem the sounds of joy and gladness and the voices of the bride and bridegroom, for the land will become a wasteland.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_1","025_8_1","JER","8","1","1","“At that time,” declares the LORD, “the bones of the kings of Judah, the bones of the officials, the bones of the priests, the bones of the prophets, and the bones of the people of Jerusalem will be removed from their graves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_2","025_8_2","JER","8","2","2","They will be exposed to the sun and moon, and to all the host of heaven which they have loved, served, followed, consulted, and worshiped. Their bones will not be gathered up or buried, but will become like dung lying on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_3","025_8_3","JER","8","3","3","And wherever I have banished them, the remnant of this evil family will choose death over life,” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_4","025_8_4","JER","8","4","4","So you are to tell them this is what the LORD says: “Do men fall and not get up again? Does one turn away and not return? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_5","025_8_5","JER","8","5","5","Why then have these people turned away? Why does Jerusalem always turn away? They cling to deceit; they refuse to return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_6","025_8_6","JER","8","6","6","I have listened and heard; they do not speak what is right. No one repents of his wickedness, asking, ‘What have I done?’ Everyone has pursued his own course like a horse charging into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_7","025_8_7","JER","8","7","7","Even the stork in the sky knows her appointed seasons. The turtledove, the swift, and the thrush keep their time of migration, but My people do not know the requirements of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_8","025_8_8","JER","8","8","8","How can you say, ‘We are wise, and the Law of the LORD is with us,’ when in fact the lying pen of the scribes has produced a deception? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_9","025_8_9","JER","8","9","9","The wise will be put to shame; they will be dismayed and trapped. Since they have rejected the word of the LORD, what wisdom do they really have? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_10","025_8_10","JER","8","10","10","Therefore I will give their wives to other men and their fields to new owners. For from the least of them to the greatest, all are greedy for gain; from prophet to priest, all practice deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_11","025_8_11","JER","8","11","11","They dress the wound of the daughter of My people with very little care, saying, ‘Peace, peace,’ when there is no peace at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_12","025_8_12","JER","8","12","12","Are they ashamed of the abomination they have committed? No, they have no shame at all; they do not even know how to blush. So they will fall among the fallen; when I punish them, they will collapse, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_13","025_8_13","JER","8","13","13","I will take away their harvest, declares the LORD. There will be no grapes on the vine, nor figs on the tree, and even the leaf will wither. Whatever I have given them will be lost to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_14","025_8_14","JER","8","14","14","Why are we just sitting here? Gather together, let us flee to the fortified cities and perish there, for the LORD our God has doomed us. He has given us poisoned water to drink, because we have sinned against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_15","025_8_15","JER","8","15","15","We hoped for peace, but no good has come, for a time of healing, but there was only terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_16","025_8_16","JER","8","16","16","The snorting of enemy horses is heard from Dan. At the sound of the neighing of mighty steeds, the whole land quakes. They come to devour the land and everything in it, the city and all who dwell in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_17","025_8_17","JER","8","17","17","“For behold, I will send snakes among you, vipers that cannot be charmed, and they will bite you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_18","025_8_18","JER","8","18","18","My sorrow is beyond healing; my heart is faint within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_19","025_8_19","JER","8","19","19","Listen to the cry of the daughter of my people from a land far away: “Is the LORD no longer in Zion? Is her King no longer there?” “Why have they provoked Me to anger with their carved images, with their worthless foreign idols?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_20","025_8_20","JER","8","20","20","“The harvest has passed, the summer has ended, but we have not been saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_21","025_8_21","JER","8","21","21","For the brokenness of the daughter of my people I am crushed. I mourn; horror has gripped me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR8_22","025_8_22","JER","8","22","22","Is there no balm in Gilead? Is no physician there? Why then has the health of the daughter of my people not been restored? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_1","025_9_1","JER","9","1","1","Oh, that my head were a spring of water, and my eyes a fountain of tears! I would weep day and night over the slain daughter of my people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_2","025_9_2","JER","9","2","2","If only I had a traveler’s lodge in the wilderness, I would abandon my people and depart from them, for they are all adulterers, a crowd of faithless people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_3","025_9_3","JER","9","3","3","“They bend their tongues like bows; lies prevail over truth in the land. For they proceed from evil to evil, and they do not take Me into account,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_4","025_9_4","JER","9","4","4","“Let everyone guard against his neighbor; do not trust any brother, for every brother deals craftily, and every friend spreads slander. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_5","025_9_5","JER","9","5","5","Each one betrays his friend; no one tells the truth. They have taught their tongues to lie; they wear themselves out committing iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_6","025_9_6","JER","9","6","6","You dwell in the midst of deception; in their deceit they refuse to know Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_7","025_9_7","JER","9","7","7","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Behold, I will refine them and test them, for what else can I do because of the daughter of My people? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_8","025_9_8","JER","9","8","8","Their tongues are deadly arrows; they speak deception. With his mouth a man speaks peace to his neighbor, but in his heart he sets a trap for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_9","025_9_9","JER","9","9","9","Should I not punish them for these things? declares the LORD. Should I not avenge Myself on such a nation as this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_10","025_9_10","JER","9","10","10","I will take up a weeping and wailing for the mountains, a dirge over the wilderness pasture, for they have been scorched so no one passes through, and the lowing of cattle is not heard. Both the birds of the air and the beasts have fled; they have gone away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_11","025_9_11","JER","9","11","11","“And I will make Jerusalem a heap of rubble, a haunt for jackals; and I will make the cities of Judah a desolation, without inhabitant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_12","025_9_12","JER","9","12","12","Who is the man wise enough to understand this? To whom has the mouth of the LORD spoken, that he may explain it? Why is the land destroyed and scorched like a desert, so no one can pass through it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_13","025_9_13","JER","9","13","13","And the LORD answered, “It is because they have forsaken My law, which I set before them; they have not walked in it or obeyed My voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_14","025_9_14","JER","9","14","14","Instead, they have followed the stubbornness of their hearts and gone after the Baals, as their fathers taught them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_15","025_9_15","JER","9","15","15","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “Behold, I will feed this people wormwood and give them poisoned water to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_16","025_9_16","JER","9","16","16","I will scatter them among the nations that neither they nor their fathers have known, and I will send a sword after them until I have finished them off.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_17","025_9_17","JER","9","17","17","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Take note, and summon the wailing women; send for the most skillful among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_18","025_9_18","JER","9","18","18","Let them come quickly and take up a lament over us, that our eyes may overflow with tears, and our eyelids may gush with water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_19","025_9_19","JER","9","19","19","For the sound of wailing is heard from Zion: ‘How devastated we are! How great is our shame! For we have abandoned the land because our dwellings have been torn down.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_20","025_9_20","JER","9","20","20","Now, O women, hear the word of the LORD. Open your ears to the word of His mouth. Teach your daughters to wail, and one another to lament. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_21","025_9_21","JER","9","21","21","For death has climbed in through our windows; it has entered our fortresses to cut off the children from the streets, the young men from the town squares. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_22","025_9_22","JER","9","22","22","Declare that this is what the LORD says: “The corpses of men will fall like dung upon the open field, like newly cut grain behind the reaper, with no one to gather it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_23","025_9_23","JER","9","23","23","This is what the LORD says: “Let not the wise man boast in his wisdom, nor the strong man in his strength, nor the wealthy man in his riches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_24","025_9_24","JER","9","24","24","But let him who boasts boast in this, that he understands and knows Me, that I am the LORD, who exercises loving devotion, justice and righteousness on the earth—for I delight in these things,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_25","025_9_25","JER","9","25","25","“Behold, the days are coming,” declares the LORD, “when I will punish all who are circumcised only in the flesh— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR9_26","025_9_26","JER","9","26","26","Egypt, Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab, and all the inhabitants of the desert who clip the hair of their temples. For all these nations are uncircumcised, and the whole house of Israel is uncircumcised in heart.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_1","025_10_1","JER","10","1","1","Hear the word that the LORD speaks to you, O house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_2","025_10_2","JER","10","2","2","This is what the LORD says: “Do not learn the ways of the nations or be terrified by the signs in the heavens, though the nations themselves are terrified by them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_3","025_10_3","JER","10","3","3","For the customs of the peoples are worthless; they cut down a tree from the forest; it is shaped with a chisel by the hands of a craftsman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_4","025_10_4","JER","10","4","4","They adorn it with silver and gold and fasten it with hammer and nails, so that it will not totter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_5","025_10_5","JER","10","5","5","Like scarecrows in a cucumber patch, their idols cannot speak. They must be carried because they cannot walk. Do not fear them, for they can do no harm, and neither can they do any good.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_6","025_10_6","JER","10","6","6","There is none like You, O LORD. You are great, and Your name is mighty in power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_7","025_10_7","JER","10","7","7","Who would not fear You, O King of nations? This is Your due. For among all the wise men of the nations, and in all their kingdoms, there is none like You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_8","025_10_8","JER","10","8","8","But they are altogether senseless and foolish, instructed by worthless idols made of wood! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_9","025_10_9","JER","10","9","9","Hammered silver is brought from Tarshish, and gold from Uphaz—the work of a craftsman from the hands of a goldsmith. Their clothes are blue and purple, all fashioned by skilled workers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_10","025_10_10","JER","10","10","10","But the LORD is the true God; He is the living God and eternal King. The earth quakes at His wrath, and the nations cannot endure His indignation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_11","025_10_11","JER","10","11","11","Thus you are to tell them: “These gods, who have made neither the heavens nor the earth, will perish from this earth and from under these heavens.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_12","025_10_12","JER","10","12","12","The LORD made the earth by His power; He established the world by His wisdom and stretched out the heavens by His understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_13","025_10_13","JER","10","13","13","When He thunders, the waters in the heavens roar; He causes the clouds to rise from the ends of the earth. He generates the lightning with the rain and brings forth the wind from His storehouses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_14","025_10_14","JER","10","14","14","Every man is senseless and devoid of knowledge; every goldsmith is put to shame by his idols. For his molten images are a fraud, and there is no breath in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_15","025_10_15","JER","10","15","15","They are worthless, a work to be mocked. In the time of their punishment they will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_16","025_10_16","JER","10","16","16","The Portion of Jacob is not like these, for He is the Maker of all things, and Israel is the tribe of His inheritance—the LORD of Hosts is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_17","025_10_17","JER","10","17","17","Gather up your belongings from this land, you who live under siege. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_18","025_10_18","JER","10","18","18","For this is what the LORD says: “Behold, at this time I will sling out the inhabitants of the land and bring distress upon them so that they may be captured.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_19","025_10_19","JER","10","19","19","Woe to me because of my brokenness; my wound is grievous! But I said, “This is truly my sickness, and I must bear it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_20","025_10_20","JER","10","20","20","My tent is destroyed, and all its ropes are snapped. My sons have departed from me and are no more. I have no one left to pitch my tent or set up my curtains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_21","025_10_21","JER","10","21","21","For the shepherds have become senseless; they do not seek the LORD. Therefore they have not prospered, and all their flock is scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_22","025_10_22","JER","10","22","22","Listen! The sound of a report is coming—a great commotion from the land to the north. It will make the cities of Judah a desolation, a haunt for jackals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_23","025_10_23","JER","10","23","23","I know, O LORD, that a man’s way is not his own; no one who walks directs his own steps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_24","025_10_24","JER","10","24","24","Correct me, O LORD, but only with justice—not in Your anger, or You will bring me to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR10_25","025_10_25","JER","10","25","25","Pour out Your wrath on the nations that do not acknowledge You, and on the families that do not call on Your name. For they have devoured Jacob; they have consumed him and finished him off; they have devastated his homeland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_1","025_11_1","JER","11","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_2","025_11_2","JER","11","2","2","“Listen to the words of this covenant and tell them to the men of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_3","025_11_3","JER","11","3","3","You must tell them that this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: Cursed is the man who does not obey the words of this covenant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_4","025_11_4","JER","11","4","4","which I commanded your forefathers when I brought them out of the land of Egypt, out of the iron furnace, saying, ‘Obey Me, and do everything I command you, and you will be My people, and I will be your God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_5","025_11_5","JER","11","5","5","This was in order to establish the oath I swore to your forefathers, to give them a land flowing with milk and honey, as it is to this day.” “Amen, LORD,” I answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_6","025_11_6","JER","11","6","6","Then the LORD said to me, “Proclaim all these words in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem, saying: Hear the words of this covenant and carry them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_7","025_11_7","JER","11","7","7","For from the time I brought your fathers out of the land of Egypt until today, I strongly warned them again and again, saying, ‘Obey My voice.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_8","025_11_8","JER","11","8","8","Yet they would not obey or incline their ears, but each one followed the stubbornness of his evil heart. So I brought on them all the curses of this covenant I had commanded them to follow but they did not keep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_9","025_11_9","JER","11","9","9","And the LORD told me, “There is a conspiracy among the men of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_10","025_11_10","JER","11","10","10","They have returned to the sins of their forefathers who refused to obey My words. They have followed other gods to serve them. The house of Israel and the house of Judah have broken the covenant I made with their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_11","025_11_11","JER","11","11","11","Therefore this is what the LORD says: ‘I am about to bring upon them a disaster that they cannot escape. They will cry out to Me, but I will not listen to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_12","025_11_12","JER","11","12","12","Then the cities of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem will go and cry out to the gods to which they have been burning incense, but these gods certainly will not save them in their time of disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_13","025_11_13","JER","11","13","13","Your gods are indeed as numerous as your cities, O Judah; the altars of shame you have set up—the altars to burn incense to Baal—are as many as the streets of Jerusalem.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_14","025_11_14","JER","11","14","14","As for you, do not pray for these people. Do not raise up a cry or a prayer on their behalf, for I will not be listening when they call out to Me in their time of disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_15","025_11_15","JER","11","15","15","What right has My beloved in My house, having carried out so many evil schemes? Can consecrated meat avert your doom? When you are wicked, then you rejoice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_16","025_11_16","JER","11","16","16","The LORD once called you a flourishing olive tree, beautiful with well-formed fruit. But with a mighty roar He will set it on fire, and its branches will be consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_17","025_11_17","JER","11","17","17","The LORD of Hosts, who planted you, has decreed disaster against you on account of the evil that the house of Israel and the house of Judah have brought upon themselves, provoking Me to anger by burning incense to Baal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_18","025_11_18","JER","11","18","18","And the LORD informed me, so I knew. Then You showed me their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_19","025_11_19","JER","11","19","19","For I was like a gentle lamb led to slaughter; I did not know that they had plotted against me: “Let us destroy the tree with its fruit; let us cut him off from the land of the living, that his name may be remembered no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_20","025_11_20","JER","11","20","20","O LORD of Hosts, who judges righteously, who examines the heart and mind, let me see Your vengeance upon them, for to You I have committed my cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_21","025_11_21","JER","11","21","21","Therefore this is what the LORD says concerning the people of Anathoth who are seeking your life and saying, “You must not prophesy in the name of the LORD, or you will die by our hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_22","025_11_22","JER","11","22","22","So this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “I will punish them. Their young men will die by the sword, their sons and daughters by famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR11_23","025_11_23","JER","11","23","23","There will be no remnant, for I will bring disaster on the people of Anathoth in the year of their punishment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_1","025_12_1","JER","12","1","1","Righteous are You, O LORD, when I plead before You. Yet about Your judgments I wish to contend with You: Why does the way of the wicked prosper? Why do all the faithless live at ease? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_2","025_12_2","JER","12","2","2","You planted them, and they have taken root. They have grown and produced fruit. You are ever on their lips, but far from their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_3","025_12_3","JER","12","3","3","But You know me, O LORD; You see me and test my heart toward You. Drag away the wicked like sheep to the slaughter and set them apart for the day of carnage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_4","025_12_4","JER","12","4","4","How long will the land mourn and the grass of every field be withered? Because of the evil of its residents, the animals and birds have been swept away, for the people have said, “He cannot see what our end will be.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_5","025_12_5","JER","12","5","5","“If you have raced with men on foot and they have worn you out, how can you compete with horses? If you stumble in a peaceful land, how will you do in the thickets of the Jordan? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_6","025_12_6","JER","12","6","6","Even your brothers—your own father’s household—even they have betrayed you; even they have cried aloud against you. Do not trust them, though they speak well of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_7","025_12_7","JER","12","7","7","I have forsaken My house; I have abandoned My inheritance. I have given the beloved of My soul into the hands of her enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_8","025_12_8","JER","12","8","8","My inheritance has become to Me like a lion in the forest. She has roared against Me; therefore I hate her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_9","025_12_9","JER","12","9","9","Is not My inheritance to Me like a speckled bird of prey with other birds of prey circling against her? Go, gather all the beasts of the field; bring them to devour her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_10","025_12_10","JER","12","10","10","Many shepherds have destroyed My vineyard; they have trampled My plot of ground. They have turned My pleasant field into a desolate wasteland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_11","025_12_11","JER","12","11","11","They have made it a desolation; desolate before Me, it mourns. All the land is laid waste, but no man takes it to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_12","025_12_12","JER","12","12","12","Over all the barren heights in the wilderness the destroyers have come, for the sword of the LORD devours from one end of the earth to the other. No flesh has peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_13","025_12_13","JER","12","13","13","They have sown wheat but harvested thorns. They have exhausted themselves to no avail. Bear the shame of your harvest because of the fierce anger of the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_14","025_12_14","JER","12","14","14","This is what the LORD says: “As for all My evil neighbors who attack the inheritance that I bequeathed to My people Israel, I am about to uproot them from their land, and I will uproot the house of Judah from among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_15","025_12_15","JER","12","15","15","But after I have uprooted them, I will once again have compassion on them and return each one to his inheritance and to his land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_16","025_12_16","JER","12","16","16","And if they will diligently learn the ways of My people and swear by My name, saying, ‘As surely as the LORD lives’—just as they once taught My people to swear by Baal—then they will be established among My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR12_17","025_12_17","JER","12","17","17","But if they will not obey, then I will uproot that nation; I will uproot it and destroy it, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_1","025_13_1","JER","13","1","1","This is what the LORD said to me: “Go and buy yourself a linen loincloth and put it around your waist, but do not let it touch water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_2","025_13_2","JER","13","2","2","So I bought a loincloth in accordance with the word of the LORD, and I put it around my waist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_3","025_13_3","JER","13","3","3","Then the word of the LORD came to me a second time: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_4","025_13_4","JER","13","4","4","“Take the loincloth that you bought and are wearing, and go at once to Perath and hide it there in a crevice of the rocks.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_5","025_13_5","JER","13","5","5","So I went and hid it at Perath, as the LORD had commanded me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_6","025_13_6","JER","13","6","6","Many days later the LORD said to me, “Arise, go to Perath, and get the loincloth that I commanded you to hide there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_7","025_13_7","JER","13","7","7","So I went to Perath and dug up the loincloth, and I took it from the place where I had hidden it. But now it was ruined—of no use at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_8","025_13_8","JER","13","8","8","Then the word of the LORD came to me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_9","025_13_9","JER","13","9","9","“This is what the LORD says: In the same way I will ruin the pride of Judah and the great pride of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_10","025_13_10","JER","13","10","10","These evil people, who refuse to listen to My words, who follow the stubbornness of their own hearts, and who go after other gods to serve and worship them, they will be like this loincloth—of no use at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_11","025_13_11","JER","13","11","11","For just as a loincloth clings to a man’s waist, so I have made the whole house of Israel and the whole house of Judah cling to Me, declares the LORD, so that they might be My people for My renown and praise and glory. But they did not listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_12","025_13_12","JER","13","12","12","Therefore you are to tell them that this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Every wineskin shall be filled with wine.’ And when they reply, ‘Don’t we surely know that every wineskin should be filled with wine?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_13","025_13_13","JER","13","13","13","then you are to tell them that this is what the LORD says: ‘I am going to fill with drunkenness all who live in this land—the kings who sit on David’s throne, the priests, the prophets, and all the people of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_14","025_13_14","JER","13","14","14","I will smash them against one another, fathers and sons alike, declares the LORD. I will allow no mercy or pity or compassion to keep Me from destroying them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_15","025_13_15","JER","13","15","15","Listen and give heed. Do not be arrogant, for the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_16","025_13_16","JER","13","16","16","Give glory to the LORD your God before He brings darkness, before your feet stumble on the dusky mountains. You wait for light, but He turns it into deep gloom and thick darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_17","025_13_17","JER","13","17","17","But if you do not listen, I will weep in secret because of your pride. My eyes will overflow with tears, because the LORD’s flock has been taken captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_18","025_13_18","JER","13","18","18","Say to the king and to the queen mother: “Take a lowly seat, for your glorious crowns have fallen from your heads.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_19","025_13_19","JER","13","19","19","The cities of the Negev have been shut tight, and no one can open them. All Judah has been carried into exile, wholly taken captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_20","025_13_20","JER","13","20","20","Lift up your eyes and see those coming from the north. Where is the flock entrusted to you, the sheep that were your pride? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_21","025_13_21","JER","13","21","21","What will you say when He sets over you close allies whom you yourself trained? Will not pangs of anguish grip you, as they do a woman in labor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_22","025_13_22","JER","13","22","22","And if you ask yourself, “Why has this happened to me?” It is because of the magnitude of your iniquity that your skirts have been stripped off and your body has been exposed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_23","025_13_23","JER","13","23","23","Can the Ethiopian change his skin, or the leopard his spots? Neither are you able to do good—you who are accustomed to doing evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_24","025_13_24","JER","13","24","24","“I will scatter you like chaff driven by the desert wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_25","025_13_25","JER","13","25","25","This is your lot, the portion I have measured to you,” declares the LORD, “because you have forgotten Me and trusted in falsehood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_26","025_13_26","JER","13","26","26","So I will pull your skirts up over your face, that your shame may be seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR13_27","025_13_27","JER","13","27","27","Your adulteries and lustful neighings, your shameless prostitution on the hills and in the fields—I have seen your detestable acts. Woe to you, O Jerusalem! How long will you remain unclean?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_1","025_14_1","JER","14","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Jeremiah concerning the drought: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_2","025_14_2","JER","14","2","2","“Judah mourns and her gates languish. Her people wail for the land, and a cry goes up from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_3","025_14_3","JER","14","3","3","The nobles send their servants for water; they go to the cisterns, but find no water; their jars return empty. They are ashamed and humiliated; they cover their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_4","025_14_4","JER","14","4","4","The ground is cracked because no rain has fallen on the land. The farmers are ashamed; they cover their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_5","025_14_5","JER","14","5","5","Even the doe in the field deserts her newborn fawn because there is no grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_6","025_14_6","JER","14","6","6","Wild donkeys stand on barren heights; they pant for air like jackals; their eyes fail for lack of pasture.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_7","025_14_7","JER","14","7","7","Although our iniquities testify against us, O LORD, act for the sake of Your name. Indeed, our rebellions are many; we have sinned against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_8","025_14_8","JER","14","8","8","O Hope of Israel, its Savior in times of distress, why are You like a stranger in the land, like a traveler who stays but a night? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_9","025_14_9","JER","14","9","9","Why are You like a man taken by surprise, like a warrior powerless to save? Yet You are among us, O LORD, and we are called by Your name. Do not forsake us! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_10","025_14_10","JER","14","10","10","This is what the LORD says about this people: “Truly they love to wander; they have not restrained their feet. So the LORD does not accept them; He will now remember their iniquity and punish them for their sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_11","025_14_11","JER","14","11","11","Then the LORD said to me, “Do not pray for the well-being of this people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_12","025_14_12","JER","14","12","12","Although they may fast, I will not listen to their cry; although they may offer burnt offerings and grain offerings, I will not accept them. Instead, I will finish them off by sword and famine and plague.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_13","025_14_13","JER","14","13","13","“Ah, Lord GOD!” I replied, “Look, the prophets are telling them, ‘You will not see the sword or suffer famine, but I will give you lasting peace in this place.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_14","025_14_14","JER","14","14","14","“The prophets are prophesying lies in My name,” replied the LORD. “I did not send them or appoint them or speak to them. They are prophesying to you a false vision, a worthless divination, the futility and delusion of their own minds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_15","025_14_15","JER","14","15","15","Therefore this is what the LORD says about the prophets who prophesy in My name: I did not send them, yet they say, ‘No sword or famine will touch this land.’ By sword and famine these very prophets will meet their end! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_16","025_14_16","JER","14","16","16","And the people to whom they prophesy will be thrown into the streets of Jerusalem because of famine and sword. There will be no one to bury them or their wives, their sons or their daughters. I will pour out their own evil upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_17","025_14_17","JER","14","17","17","You are to speak this word to them: ‘My eyes overflow with tears; day and night they do not cease, for the virgin daughter of my people has been shattered by a crushing blow, a severely grievous wound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_18","025_14_18","JER","14","18","18","If I go out to the country, I see those slain by the sword; if I enter the city, I see those ravaged by famine! For both prophet and priest travel to a land they do not know.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_19","025_14_19","JER","14","19","19","Have You rejected Judah completely? Do You despise Zion? Why have You stricken us so that we are beyond healing? We hoped for peace, but no good has come, and for the time of healing, but there was only terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_20","025_14_20","JER","14","20","20","We acknowledge our wickedness, O LORD, the guilt of our fathers; indeed, we have sinned against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_21","025_14_21","JER","14","21","21","For the sake of Your name do not despise us; do not disgrace Your glorious throne. Remember Your covenant with us; do not break it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR14_22","025_14_22","JER","14","22","22","Can the worthless idols of the nations bring rain? Do the skies alone send showers? Is this not by You, O LORD our God? So we put our hope in You, for You have done all these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_1","025_15_1","JER","15","1","1","Then the LORD said to me: “Even if Moses and Samuel should stand before Me, My heart would not go out to this people. Send them from My presence, and let them go! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_2","025_15_2","JER","15","2","2","If they ask you, ‘Where shall we go?’ you are to tell them that this is what the LORD says: ‘Those destined for death, to death; those destined for the sword, to the sword; those destined for famine, to famine; and those destined for captivity, to captivity.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_3","025_15_3","JER","15","3","3","I will appoint over them four kinds of destroyers, declares the LORD: the sword to kill, the dogs to drag away, and the birds of the air and beasts of the earth to devour and destroy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_4","025_15_4","JER","15","4","4","I will make them a horror to all the kingdoms of the earth because of what Manasseh son of Hezekiah king of Judah did in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_5","025_15_5","JER","15","5","5","Who will have pity on you, O Jerusalem? Who will mourn for you? Who will turn aside to ask about your welfare? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_6","025_15_6","JER","15","6","6","You have forsaken Me, declares the LORD. You have turned your back. So I will stretch out My hand against you and I will destroy you; I am weary of showing compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_7","025_15_7","JER","15","7","7","I will scatter them with a winnowing fork at the gates of the land. I will bereave and destroy My people who have not turned from their ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_8","025_15_8","JER","15","8","8","I will make their widows more numerous than the sand of the sea. I will bring a destroyer at noon against the mothers of young men. I will suddenly bring upon them anguish and dismay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_9","025_15_9","JER","15","9","9","The mother of seven will grow faint; she will breathe her last breath. Her sun will set while it is still day; she will be disgraced and humiliated. And the rest I will put to the sword in the presence of their enemies,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_10","025_15_10","JER","15","10","10","Woe to me, my mother, that you have borne me, a man of strife and conflict in all the land. I have neither lent nor borrowed, yet everyone curses me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_11","025_15_11","JER","15","11","11","The LORD said: “Surely I will deliver you for a good purpose; surely I will intercede with your enemy in your time of trouble, in your time of distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_12","025_15_12","JER","15","12","12","Can anyone smash iron—iron from the north—or bronze? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_13","025_15_13","JER","15","13","13","Your wealth and your treasures I will give up as plunder, without charge for all your sins within all your borders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_14","025_15_14","JER","15","14","14","Then I will enslave you to your enemies in a land you do not know, for My anger will kindle a fire that will burn against you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_15","025_15_15","JER","15","15","15","You understand, O LORD; remember me and attend to me. Avenge me against my persecutors. In Your patience, do not take me away. Know that I endure reproach for Your honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_16","025_15_16","JER","15","16","16","Your words were found, and I ate them. Your words became my joy and my heart’s delight. For I bear Your name, O LORD God of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_17","025_15_17","JER","15","17","17","I never sat with the band of revelers, nor did I celebrate with them. Because Your hand was on me, I sat alone, for You have filled me with indignation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_18","025_15_18","JER","15","18","18","Why is my pain unending, and my wound incurable, refusing to be healed? You have indeed become like a mirage to me—water that is not there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_19","025_15_19","JER","15","19","19","Therefore this is what the LORD says: “If you return, I will restore you; you will stand in My presence. And if you speak words that are noble instead of worthless, you will be My spokesman. It is they who must turn to you, but you must not turn to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_20","025_15_20","JER","15","20","20","Then I will make you a wall to this people, a fortified wall of bronze; they will fight against you but will not overcome you, for I am with you to save and deliver you, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR15_21","025_15_21","JER","15","21","21","I will deliver you from the hand of the wicked and redeem you from the grasp of the ruthless.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_1","025_16_1","JER","16","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_2","025_16_2","JER","16","2","2","“You must not marry or have sons or daughters in this place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_3","025_16_3","JER","16","3","3","For this is what the LORD says concerning the sons and daughters born in this place, and the mothers who bore them, and the fathers who fathered them in this land: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_4","025_16_4","JER","16","4","4","“They will die from deadly diseases. They will not be mourned or buried, but will lie like dung on the ground. They will be finished off by sword and famine, and their corpses will become food for the birds of the air and beasts of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_5","025_16_5","JER","16","5","5","Indeed, this is what the LORD says: “Do not enter a house where there is a funeral meal. Do not go to mourn or show sympathy, for I have removed from this people My peace, My loving devotion, and My compassion,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_6","025_16_6","JER","16","6","6","“Both great and small will die in this land. They will not be buried or mourned, nor will anyone cut himself or shave his head for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_7","025_16_7","JER","16","7","7","No food will be offered to comfort those who mourn the dead; not even a cup of consolation will be given for the loss of a father or mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_8","025_16_8","JER","16","8","8","You must not enter a house where there is feasting and sit down with them to eat and drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_9","025_16_9","JER","16","9","9","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: I am going to remove from this place, before your very eyes and in your days, the sounds of joy and gladness, the voices of the bride and bridegroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_10","025_16_10","JER","16","10","10","When you tell these people all these things, they will ask you, ‘Why has the LORD pronounced all this great disaster against us? What is our iniquity? What is the sin that we have committed against the LORD our God?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_11","025_16_11","JER","16","11","11","Then you are to answer them: ‘It is because your fathers have forsaken Me, declares the LORD, and followed other gods, and served and worshiped them. They abandoned Me and did not keep My instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_12","025_16_12","JER","16","12","12","And you have done more evil than your fathers. See how each of you follows the stubbornness of his evil heart instead of obeying Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_13","025_16_13","JER","16","13","13","So I will cast you out of this land into a land that neither you nor your fathers have known. There you will serve other gods day and night, for I will show you no favor.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_14","025_16_14","JER","16","14","14","Yet behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when they will no longer say, ‘As surely as the LORD lives, who brought the Israelites up out of the land of Egypt.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_15","025_16_15","JER","16","15","15","Instead they will say, ‘As surely as the LORD lives, who brought the Israelites up out of the land of the north and all the other lands to which He had banished them.’ For I will return them to their land that I gave to their forefathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_16","025_16_16","JER","16","16","16","But for now I will send for many fishermen, declares the LORD, and they will catch them. After that I will send for many hunters, and they will hunt them down on every mountain and hill, even from the clefts of the rocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_17","025_16_17","JER","16","17","17","For My eyes are on all their ways. They are not hidden from My face, and their guilt is not concealed from My eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_18","025_16_18","JER","16","18","18","And I will first repay them double their iniquity and their sin, because they have defiled My land with the carcasses of their detestable idols, and they have filled My inheritance with their abominations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_19","025_16_19","JER","16","19","19","O LORD, my strength and my fortress, my refuge in the day of distress, the nations will come to You from the ends of the earth, and they will say, “Our fathers inherited nothing but lies, worthless idols of no benefit at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_20","025_16_20","JER","16","20","20","Can man make gods for himself? Such are not gods!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR16_21","025_16_21","JER","16","21","21","“Therefore behold, I will inform them, and this time I will make them know My power and My might; then they will know that My name is the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_1","025_17_1","JER","17","1","1","“The sin of Judah is written with an iron stylus, engraved with a diamond point on the tablets of their hearts and on the horns of their altars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_2","025_17_2","JER","17","2","2","Even their children remember their altars and Asherah poles by the green trees and on the high hills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_3","025_17_3","JER","17","3","3","O My mountain in the countryside, I will give over your wealth and all your treasures as plunder, because of the sin of your high places, within all your borders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_4","025_17_4","JER","17","4","4","And you yourself will relinquish the inheritance that I gave you. I will enslave you to your enemies in a land that you do not know, for you have kindled My anger; it will burn forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_5","025_17_5","JER","17","5","5","This is what the LORD says: “Cursed is the man who trusts in mankind, who makes mere flesh his strength and turns his heart from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_6","025_17_6","JER","17","6","6","He will be like a shrub in the desert; he will not see when prosperity comes. He will dwell in the parched places of the desert, in a salt land where no one lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_7","025_17_7","JER","17","7","7","But blessed is the man who trusts in the LORD, whose confidence is in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_8","025_17_8","JER","17","8","8","He is like a tree planted by the waters that sends out its roots toward the stream. It does not fear when the heat comes, and its leaves are always green. It does not worry in a year of drought, nor does it cease to produce fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_9","025_17_9","JER","17","9","9","The heart is deceitful above all things and beyond cure. Who can understand it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_10","025_17_10","JER","17","10","10","I, the LORD, search the heart; I examine the mind to reward a man according to his way, by what his deeds deserve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_11","025_17_11","JER","17","11","11","Like a partridge hatching eggs it did not lay is the man who makes a fortune unjustly. In the middle of his days his riches will desert him, and in the end he will be the fool.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_12","025_17_12","JER","17","12","12","A glorious throne, exalted from the beginning, is the place of our sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_13","025_17_13","JER","17","13","13","O LORD, the hope of Israel, all who abandon You will be put to shame. All who turn away will be written in the dust, for they have abandoned the LORD, the fountain of living water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_14","025_17_14","JER","17","14","14","Heal me, O LORD, and I will be healed; save me, and I will be saved, for You are my praise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_15","025_17_15","JER","17","15","15","Behold, they keep saying to me, “Where is the word of the LORD? Let it come now!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_16","025_17_16","JER","17","16","16","But I have not run away from being Your shepherd; I have not desired the day of despair. You know that the utterance of my lips was spoken in Your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_17","025_17_17","JER","17","17","17","Do not become a terror to me; You are my refuge in the day of disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_18","025_17_18","JER","17","18","18","Let my persecutors be put to shame, but do not let me be put to shame. Let them be terrified, but do not let me be terrified. Bring upon them the day of disaster and shatter them with double destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_19","025_17_19","JER","17","19","19","This is what the LORD said to me: “Go and stand at the gate of the people, through which the kings of Judah go in and out; and stand at all the other gates of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_20","025_17_20","JER","17","20","20","Say to them, ‘Hear the word of the LORD, O kings of Judah, all people of Judah and Jerusalem who enter through these gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_21","025_17_21","JER","17","21","21","This is what the LORD says: Take heed for yourselves; do not carry a load or bring it through the gates of Jerusalem on the Sabbath day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_22","025_17_22","JER","17","22","22","You must not carry a load out of your houses or do any work on the Sabbath day, but you must keep the Sabbath day holy, just as I commanded your forefathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_23","025_17_23","JER","17","23","23","Yet they would not listen or incline their ear, but they stiffened their necks and would not listen or receive My discipline. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_24","025_17_24","JER","17","24","24","If, however, you listen carefully to Me, says the LORD, and bring no load through the gates of this city on the Sabbath day, and keep the Sabbath day holy, and do no work on it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_25","025_17_25","JER","17","25","25","then kings and princes will enter through the gates of this city. They will sit on the throne of David, riding in chariots and on horses with their officials, along with the men of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem, and this city will be inhabited forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_26","025_17_26","JER","17","26","26","And people will come from the cities of Judah and the places around Jerusalem, from the land of Benjamin, and from the foothills, the hill country, and the Negev, bringing burnt offerings and sacrifices, grain offerings and frankincense, and thank offerings to the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR17_27","025_17_27","JER","17","27","27","But if you do not listen to Me to keep the Sabbath day holy by not carrying a load while entering the gates of Jerusalem on the Sabbath day, then I will kindle an unquenchable fire in its gates to consume the citadels of Jerusalem.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_1","025_18_1","JER","18","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_2","025_18_2","JER","18","2","2","“Go down at once to the potter’s house, and there I will give you My message.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_3","025_18_3","JER","18","3","3","So I went down to the potter’s house and saw him working at the wheel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_4","025_18_4","JER","18","4","4","But the vessel that he was shaping from the clay became flawed in his hand; so he formed it into another vessel, as it seemed best for him to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_5","025_18_5","JER","18","5","5","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_6","025_18_6","JER","18","6","6","“O house of Israel, declares the LORD, can I not treat you as this potter treats his clay? Just like clay in the potter’s hand, so are you in My hand, O house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_7","025_18_7","JER","18","7","7","At any time I might announce that a nation or kingdom will be uprooted, torn down, and destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_8","025_18_8","JER","18","8","8","But if that nation I warned turns from its evil, then I will relent of the disaster I had planned to bring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_9","025_18_9","JER","18","9","9","And if at another time I announce that I will build up and establish a nation or kingdom, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_10","025_18_10","JER","18","10","10","and if it does evil in My sight and does not listen to My voice, then I will relent of the good I had intended for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_11","025_18_11","JER","18","11","11","Now therefore, tell the men of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem that this is what the LORD says: ‘Behold, I am planning a disaster for you and devising a plan against you. Turn now, each of you, from your evil ways, and correct your ways and deeds.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_12","025_18_12","JER","18","12","12","But they will reply, ‘It is hopeless. We will follow our own plans, and each of us will act according to the stubbornness of his evil heart.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_13","025_18_13","JER","18","13","13","Therefore this is what the LORD says: “Inquire among the nations: Who has ever heard things like these? Virgin Israel has done a most terrible thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_14","025_18_14","JER","18","14","14","Does the snow of Lebanon ever leave its rocky slopes? Or do its cool waters flowing from a distance ever run dry? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_15","025_18_15","JER","18","15","15","Yet My people have forgotten Me. They burn incense to worthless idols that make them stumble in their ways, leaving the ancient roads to walk on rutted bypaths instead of on the highway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_16","025_18_16","JER","18","16","16","They have made their land a desolation, a perpetual object of scorn; all who pass by will be appalled and shake their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_17","025_18_17","JER","18","17","17","I will scatter them before the enemy like the east wind. I will show them My back and not My face in the day of their calamity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_18","025_18_18","JER","18","18","18","Then some said, “Come, let us make plans against Jeremiah, for the law will never be lost to the priest, nor counsel to the wise, nor an oracle to the prophet. Come, let us denounce him and pay no heed to any of his words.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_19","025_18_19","JER","18","19","19","Attend to me, O LORD. Hear what my accusers are saying! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_20","025_18_20","JER","18","20","20","Should good be repaid with evil? Yet they have dug a pit for me. Remember how I stood before You to speak good on their behalf, to turn Your wrath from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_21","025_18_21","JER","18","21","21","Therefore, hand their children over to famine; pour out the power of the sword upon them. Let their wives become childless and widowed; let their husbands be slain by disease, their young men struck down by the sword in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_22","025_18_22","JER","18","22","22","Let a cry be heard from their houses when You suddenly bring raiders against them, for they have dug a pit to capture me and have hidden snares for my feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR18_23","025_18_23","JER","18","23","23","But You, O LORD, know all their deadly plots against me. Do not wipe out their guilt or blot out their sin from Your sight. Let them be overthrown before You; deal with them in the time of Your anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_1","025_19_1","JER","19","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Go and buy a clay jar from a potter. Take some of the elders of the people and leaders of the priests, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_2","025_19_2","JER","19","2","2","and go out to the Valley of Ben-hinnom near the entrance of the Potsherd Gate. Proclaim there the words I speak to you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_3","025_19_3","JER","19","3","3","saying, ‘Hear the word of the LORD, O kings of Judah and residents of Jerusalem. This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: I am going to bring such disaster on this place that the ears of all who hear of it will ring, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_4","025_19_4","JER","19","4","4","because they have abandoned Me and made this a foreign place. They have burned incense in this place to other gods that neither they nor their fathers nor the kings of Judah have ever known. They have filled this place with the blood of the innocent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_5","025_19_5","JER","19","5","5","They have built high places to Baal on which to burn their children in the fire as offerings to Baal—something I never commanded or mentioned, nor did it even enter My mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_6","025_19_6","JER","19","6","6","So behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when this place will no longer be called Topheth or the Valley of Ben-hinnom, but the Valley of Slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_7","025_19_7","JER","19","7","7","And in this place I will ruin the plans of Judah and Jerusalem. I will make them fall by the sword before their enemies, by the hands of those who seek their lives, and I will give their carcasses as food to the birds of the air and the beasts of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_8","025_19_8","JER","19","8","8","I will make this city a desolation and an object of scorn. All who pass by will be appalled and will scoff at all her wounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_9","025_19_9","JER","19","9","9","I will make them eat the flesh of their sons and daughters, and they will eat one another’s flesh in the siege and distress inflicted on them by their enemies who seek their lives.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_10","025_19_10","JER","19","10","10","Then you are to shatter the jar in the presence of the men who accompany you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_11","025_19_11","JER","19","11","11","and you are to proclaim to them that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: I will shatter this nation and this city, like one shatters a potter’s jar that can never again be repaired. They will bury the dead in Topheth until there is no more room to bury them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_12","025_19_12","JER","19","12","12","This is what I will do to this place and to its residents, declares the LORD. I will make this city like Topheth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_13","025_19_13","JER","19","13","13","The houses of Jerusalem and the houses of the kings of Judah will be defiled like that place, Topheth—all the houses on whose rooftops they burned incense to all the host of heaven and poured out drink offerings to other gods.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_14","025_19_14","JER","19","14","14","Then Jeremiah returned from Topheth, where the LORD had sent him to prophesy, and he stood in the courtyard of the house of the LORD and proclaimed to all the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR19_15","025_19_15","JER","19","15","15","“This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘Behold, I am about to bring on this city and on all the villages around it every disaster I have pronounced against them, because they have stiffened their necks so as not to heed My words.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_1","025_20_1","JER","20","1","1","When Pashhur the priest, the son of Immer and the chief official in the house of the LORD, heard Jeremiah prophesying these things, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_2","025_20_2","JER","20","2","2","he had Jeremiah the prophet beaten and put in the stocks at the Upper Gate of Benjamin, which was by the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_3","025_20_3","JER","20","3","3","The next day, when Pashhur released Jeremiah from the stocks, Jeremiah said to him, “The LORD does not call you Pashhur, but Magor-missabib. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_4","025_20_4","JER","20","4","4","For this is what the LORD says: ‘I will make you a terror to yourself and to all your friends. They will fall by the sword of their enemies before your very eyes. And I will hand Judah over to the king of Babylon, and he will carry them away to Babylon and put them to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_5","025_20_5","JER","20","5","5","I will give away all the wealth of this city—all its products and valuables, and all the treasures of the kings of Judah—to their enemies. They will plunder them, seize them, and carry them off to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_6","025_20_6","JER","20","6","6","And you, Pashhur, and all who live in your house, will go into captivity. You will go to Babylon, and there you will die and be buried—you and all your friends to whom you have prophesied these lies.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_7","025_20_7","JER","20","7","7","You have deceived me, O LORD, and I was deceived. You have overcome me and prevailed. I am a laughingstock all day long; everyone mocks me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_8","025_20_8","JER","20","8","8","For whenever I speak, I cry out; I proclaim violence and destruction. For the word of the LORD has become to me a reproach and derision all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_9","025_20_9","JER","20","9","9","If I say, “I will not mention Him or speak any more in His name,” His message becomes a fire burning in my heart, shut up in my bones, and I become weary of holding it in, and I cannot prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_10","025_20_10","JER","20","10","10","For I have heard the whispering of many: “Terror is on every side! Report him; let us report him!” All my trusted friends watch for my fall: “Perhaps he will be deceived so that we may prevail against him and take our vengeance upon him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_11","025_20_11","JER","20","11","11","But the LORD is with me like a fearsome warrior. Therefore, my persecutors will stumble and will not prevail. Since they have not succeeded, they will be utterly put to shame, with an everlasting disgrace that will never be forgotten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_12","025_20_12","JER","20","12","12","O LORD of Hosts, who examines the righteous, who sees the heart and mind, let me see Your vengeance upon them, for to You I have committed my cause. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_13","025_20_13","JER","20","13","13","Sing to the LORD! Praise the LORD! For He rescues the life of the needy from the hands of evildoers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_14","025_20_14","JER","20","14","14","Cursed be the day I was born! May the day my mother bore me never be blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_15","025_20_15","JER","20","15","15","Cursed be the man who brought my father the news, saying, “A son is born to you,” bringing him great joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_16","025_20_16","JER","20","16","16","May that man be like the cities that the LORD overthrew without compassion. May he hear an outcry in the morning and a battle cry at noon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_17","025_20_17","JER","20","17","17","because he did not kill me in the womb so that my mother might have been my grave, and her womb forever enlarged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR20_18","025_20_18","JER","20","18","18","Why did I come out of the womb to see only trouble and sorrow, and to end my days in shame? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_1","025_21_1","JER","21","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD when King Zedekiah sent to him Pashhur son of Malchijah and the priest Zephaniah son of Maaseiah. They said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_2","025_21_2","JER","21","2","2","“Please inquire of the LORD on our behalf, since Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon is waging war against us. Perhaps the LORD will perform for us something like all His past wonders, so that Nebuchadnezzar will withdraw from us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_3","025_21_3","JER","21","3","3","But Jeremiah answered, “You are to tell Zedekiah that ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_4","025_21_4","JER","21","4","4","this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘I will turn against you the weapons of war in your hands, with which you are fighting the king of Babylon and the Chaldeans who besiege you outside the wall, and I will assemble their forces in the center of this city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_5","025_21_5","JER","21","5","5","And I Myself will fight against you with an outstretched hand and a mighty arm, with anger, fury, and great wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_6","025_21_6","JER","21","6","6","I will strike down the residents of this city, both man and beast. They will die in a terrible plague.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_7","025_21_7","JER","21","7","7","‘After that,’ declares the LORD, ‘I will hand over Zedekiah king of Judah, his officers, and the people in this city who survive the plague and sword and famine, to Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon and to their enemies who seek their lives. He will put them to the sword; he will not spare them or show pity or compassion.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_8","025_21_8","JER","21","8","8","Furthermore, you are to tell this people that this is what the LORD says: ‘Behold, I set before you the way of life and the way of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_9","025_21_9","JER","21","9","9","Whoever stays in this city will die by sword and famine and plague, but whoever goes out and surrenders to the Chaldeans who besiege you will live; he will retain his life like a spoil of war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_10","025_21_10","JER","21","10","10","For I have set My face against this city to bring disaster and not good, declares the LORD. It will be delivered into the hand of the king of Babylon, who will destroy it with fire.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_11","025_21_11","JER","21","11","11","Moreover, tell the house of the king of Judah to hear the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_12","025_21_12","JER","21","12","12","O house of David, this is what the LORD says: ‘Administer justice every morning, and rescue the victim of robbery from the hand of his oppressor, or My wrath will go forth like fire and burn with no one to extinguish it because of their evil deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_13","025_21_13","JER","21","13","13","Behold, I am against you who dwell above the valley, atop the rocky plateau—declares the LORD—you who say, “Who can come against us? Who can enter our dwellings?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR21_14","025_21_14","JER","21","14","14","I will punish you as your deeds deserve, declares the LORD. I will kindle a fire in your forest that will consume everything around you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_1","025_22_1","JER","22","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Go down to the palace of the king of Judah and proclaim this message there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_2","025_22_2","JER","22","2","2","saying, ‘Hear the word of the LORD, O king of Judah, who sits on the throne of David—you and your officials and your people who enter these gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_3","025_22_3","JER","22","3","3","This is what the LORD says: Administer justice and righteousness. Rescue the victim of robbery from the hand of his oppressor. Do no wrong or violence to the foreigner, the fatherless, or the widow. Do not shed innocent blood in this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_4","025_22_4","JER","22","4","4","For if you will indeed carry out these commands, then kings who sit on David’s throne will enter through the gates of this palace riding on chariots and horses—they and their officials and their people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_5","025_22_5","JER","22","5","5","But if you do not obey these words, then I swear by Myself, declares the LORD, that this house will become a pile of rubble.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_6","025_22_6","JER","22","6","6","For this is what the LORD says concerning the house of the king of Judah: “You are like Gilead to Me, like the summit of Lebanon; but I will surely turn you into a desert, like cities that are uninhabited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_7","025_22_7","JER","22","7","7","I will appoint destroyers against you, each man with his weapons, and they will cut down the choicest of your cedars and throw them into the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_8","025_22_8","JER","22","8","8","And many nations will pass by this city and ask one another, ‘Why has the LORD done such a thing to this great city?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_9","025_22_9","JER","22","9","9","Then people will reply, ‘Because they have forsaken the covenant of the LORD their God and have worshiped and served other gods.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_10","025_22_10","JER","22","10","10","Do not weep for him who is dead; do not mourn his loss. Weep bitterly for him who is exiled, for he will never return to see his native land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_11","025_22_11","JER","22","11","11","For this is what the LORD says concerning Shallum son of Josiah, king of Judah, who succeeded his father Josiah but has gone forth from this place: “He will never return, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_12","025_22_12","JER","22","12","12","but he will die in the place to which he was exiled; he will never see this land again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_13","025_22_13","JER","22","13","13","“Woe to him who builds his palace by unrighteousness, and his upper rooms without justice, who makes his countrymen serve without pay, and fails to pay their wages, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_14","025_22_14","JER","22","14","14","who says, ‘I will build myself a great palace, with spacious upper rooms.’ So he cuts windows in it, panels it with cedar, and paints it with vermilion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_15","025_22_15","JER","22","15","15","Does it make you a king to excel in cedar? Did not your father have food and drink? He administered justice and righteousness, and so it went well with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_16","025_22_16","JER","22","16","16","He took up the cause of the poor and needy, and so it went well with him. Is this not what it means to know Me?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_17","025_22_17","JER","22","17","17","“But your eyes and heart are set on nothing except your own dishonest gain, on shedding innocent blood, on practicing extortion and oppression.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_18","025_22_18","JER","22","18","18","Therefore this is what the LORD says concerning Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah: “They will not mourn for him: ‘Alas, my brother! Alas, my sister!’ They will not mourn for him: ‘Alas, my master! Alas, his splendor!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_19","025_22_19","JER","22","19","19","He will be buried like a donkey, dragged away and thrown outside the gates of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_20","025_22_20","JER","22","20","20","Go up to Lebanon and cry out; raise your voice in Bashan; cry out from Abarim, for all your lovers have been crushed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_21","025_22_21","JER","22","21","21","I warned you when you were secure. You said, ‘I will not listen.’ This has been your way from youth, that you have not obeyed My voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_22","025_22_22","JER","22","22","22","The wind will drive away all your shepherds, and your lovers will go into captivity. Then you will be ashamed and humiliated because of all your wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_23","025_22_23","JER","22","23","23","O inhabitant of Lebanon, nestled in the cedars, how you will groan when pangs of anguish come upon you, agony like a woman in labor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_24","025_22_24","JER","22","24","24","“As surely as I live,” declares the LORD, “even if you, Coniah son of Jehoiakim king of Judah, were a signet ring on My right hand, I would pull you off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_25","025_22_25","JER","22","25","25","In fact, I will hand you over to those you dread, who want to take your life—to Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon and to the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_26","025_22_26","JER","22","26","26","I will hurl you and the mother who gave you birth into another land, where neither of you were born—and there you both will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_27","025_22_27","JER","22","27","27","You will never return to the land for which you long.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_28","025_22_28","JER","22","28","28","Is this man Coniah a despised and shattered pot, a jar that no one wants? Why are he and his descendants hurled out and cast into a land they do not know? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_29","025_22_29","JER","22","29","29","O land, land, land, hear the word of the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR22_30","025_22_30","JER","22","30","30","This is what the LORD says: “Enroll this man as childless, a man who will not prosper in his lifetime. None of his descendants will prosper to sit on the throne of David or to rule again in Judah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_1","025_23_1","JER","23","1","1","“Woe to the shepherds who destroy and scatter the sheep of My pasture!” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_2","025_23_2","JER","23","2","2","Therefore this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says about the shepherds who tend My people: “You have scattered My flock and driven them away, and have not attended to them. Behold, I will attend to you for the evil of your deeds, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_3","025_23_3","JER","23","3","3","Then I Myself will gather the remnant of My flock from all the lands to which I have banished them, and I will return them to their pasture, where they will be fruitful and multiply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_4","025_23_4","JER","23","4","4","I will raise up shepherds over them who will tend them, and they will no longer be afraid or dismayed, nor will any go missing, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_5","025_23_5","JER","23","5","5","Behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will raise up for David a righteous Branch, and He will reign wisely as King and will administer justice and righteousness in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_6","025_23_6","JER","23","6","6","In His days Judah will be saved, and Israel will dwell securely. And this is His name by which He will be called: The LORD Our Righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_7","025_23_7","JER","23","7","7","So behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when they will no longer say, ‘As surely as the LORD lives, who brought the Israelites up out of the land of Egypt.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_8","025_23_8","JER","23","8","8","Instead they will say, ‘As surely as the LORD lives, who brought and led the descendants of the house of Israel up out of the land of the north and all the other lands to which He had banished them.’ Then they will dwell once more in their own land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_9","025_23_9","JER","23","9","9","As for the prophets: My heart is broken within me, and all my bones tremble. I have become like a drunkard, like a man overcome by wine, because of the LORD, because of His holy words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_10","025_23_10","JER","23","10","10","For the land is full of adulterers—because of the curse, the land mourns and the pastures of the wilderness have dried up—their course is evil and their power is misused. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_11","025_23_11","JER","23","11","11","“For both prophet and priest are ungodly; even in My house I have found their wickedness,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_12","025_23_12","JER","23","12","12","“Therefore their path will become slick; they will be driven away into the darkness and fall into it. For I will bring disaster upon them in the year of their punishment,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_13","025_23_13","JER","23","13","13","“Among the prophets of Samaria I saw an offensive thing: They prophesied by Baal and led My people Israel astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_14","025_23_14","JER","23","14","14","And among the prophets of Jerusalem I have seen a horrible thing: They commit adultery and walk in lies. They strengthen the hands of evildoers, so that no one turns his back on wickedness. They are all like Sodom to Me; the people of Jerusalem are like Gomorrah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_15","025_23_15","JER","23","15","15","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts says concerning the prophets: “I will feed them wormwood and give them poisoned water to drink, for from the prophets of Jerusalem ungodliness has spread throughout the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_16","025_23_16","JER","23","16","16","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Do not listen to the words of the prophets who prophesy to you. They are filling you with false hopes. They speak visions from their own minds, not from the mouth of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_17","025_23_17","JER","23","17","17","They keep saying to those who despise Me, ‘The LORD says that you will have peace,’ and to everyone who walks in the stubbornness of his own heart, ‘No harm will come to you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_18","025_23_18","JER","23","18","18","But which of them has stood in the council of the LORD to see and hear His word? Who has given heed to His word and obeyed it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_19","025_23_19","JER","23","19","19","Behold, the storm of the LORD has gone out with fury, a whirlwind swirling down upon the heads of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_20","025_23_20","JER","23","20","20","The anger of the LORD will not turn back until He has fully accomplished the purposes of His heart. In the days to come you will understand this clearly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_21","025_23_21","JER","23","21","21","I did not send these prophets, yet they have run with their message; I did not speak to them, yet they have prophesied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_22","025_23_22","JER","23","22","22","But if they had stood in My council, they would have proclaimed My words to My people and turned them back from their evil ways and deeds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_23","025_23_23","JER","23","23","23","“Am I only a God nearby,” declares the LORD, “and not a God far away?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_24","025_23_24","JER","23","24","24","“Can a man hide in secret places where I cannot see him?” declares the LORD. “Do I not fill the heavens and the earth?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_25","025_23_25","JER","23","25","25","“I have heard the sayings of the prophets who prophesy lies in My name: ‘I had a dream! I had a dream!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_26","025_23_26","JER","23","26","26","How long will this continue in the hearts of these prophets who prophesy falsehood, these prophets of the delusion of their own minds? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_27","025_23_27","JER","23","27","27","They suppose the dreams that they tell one another will make My people forget My name, just as their fathers forgot My name through the worship of Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_28","025_23_28","JER","23","28","28","Let the prophet who has a dream retell it, but let him who has My word speak it truthfully. For what is straw compared to grain?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_29","025_23_29","JER","23","29","29","“Is not My word like fire,” declares the LORD, “and like a hammer that smashes a rock?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_30","025_23_30","JER","23","30","30","“Therefore behold,” declares the LORD, “I am against the prophets who steal from one another words they attribute to Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_31","025_23_31","JER","23","31","31","“Yes,” declares the LORD, “I am against the prophets who wag their own tongues and proclaim, ‘The LORD declares it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_32","025_23_32","JER","23","32","32","“Indeed,” declares the LORD, “I am against those who prophesy false dreams and retell them to lead My people astray with their reckless lies. It was not I who sent them or commanded them, and they are of no benefit at all to these people,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_33","025_23_33","JER","23","33","33","“Now when this people or a prophet or priest asks you, ‘What is the burden of the LORD?’ you are to say to them, ‘What burden? I will forsake you, declares the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_34","025_23_34","JER","23","34","34","As for the prophet or priest or anyone who claims, ‘This is the burden of the LORD,’ I will punish that man and his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_35","025_23_35","JER","23","35","35","This is what each man is to say to his friend and to his brother: ‘What has the LORD answered?’ or ‘What has the LORD spoken?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_36","025_23_36","JER","23","36","36","But refer no more to the burden of the LORD, for each man’s word becomes the burden, so that you pervert the words of the living God, the LORD of Hosts, our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_37","025_23_37","JER","23","37","37","Thus you are to say to the prophet: ‘What has the LORD answered you?’ and ‘What has the LORD spoken?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_38","025_23_38","JER","23","38","38","But if you claim, ‘This is the burden of the LORD,’ then this is what the LORD says: Because you have said, ‘This is the burden of the LORD,’ and I specifically told you not to make this claim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_39","025_23_39","JER","23","39","39","therefore I will surely forget you and will cast you out of My presence, both you and the city that I gave to you and your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR23_40","025_23_40","JER","23","40","40","And I will bring upon you everlasting shame and perpetual humiliation that will never be forgotten.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_1","025_24_1","JER","24","1","1","After Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon had carried away Jeconiah son of Jehoiakim king of Judah, as well as the officials of Judah and the craftsmen and metalsmiths from Jerusalem, and had brought them to Babylon, the LORD showed me two baskets of figs placed in front of the temple of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_2","025_24_2","JER","24","2","2","One basket had very good figs, like those that ripen early, but the other basket contained very poor figs, so bad they could not be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_3","025_24_3","JER","24","3","3","“Jeremiah,” the LORD asked, “what do you see?” “Figs!” I replied. “The good figs are very good, but the bad figs are very bad, so bad they cannot be eaten.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_4","025_24_4","JER","24","4","4","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_5","025_24_5","JER","24","5","5","“This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Like these good figs, so I regard as good the exiles from Judah, whom I have sent away from this place to the land of the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_6","025_24_6","JER","24","6","6","I will keep My eyes on them for good and will return them to this land. I will build them up and not tear them down; I will plant them and not uproot them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_7","025_24_7","JER","24","7","7","I will give them a heart to know Me, that I am the LORD. They will be My people, and I will be their God, for they will return to Me with all their heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_8","025_24_8","JER","24","8","8","But like the bad figs, so bad they cannot be eaten,’ says the LORD, ‘so will I deal with Zedekiah king of Judah, his officials, and the remnant of Jerusalem—those remaining in this land and those living in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_9","025_24_9","JER","24","9","9","I will make them a horror and an offense to all the kingdoms of the earth, a disgrace and an object of scorn, ridicule, and cursing wherever I have banished them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR24_10","025_24_10","JER","24","10","10","And I will send against them sword and famine and plague, until they have perished from the land that I gave to them and their fathers.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_1","025_25_1","JER","25","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah concerning all the people of Judah in the fourth year of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah, which was the first year of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_2","025_25_2","JER","25","2","2","So the prophet Jeremiah spoke to all the people of Judah and all the residents of Jerusalem as follows: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_3","025_25_3","JER","25","3","3","“From the thirteenth year of Josiah son of Amon king of Judah until this very day—twenty-three years—the word of the LORD has come to me, and I have spoken to you again and again, but you have not listened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_4","025_25_4","JER","25","4","4","And the LORD has sent all His servants the prophets to you again and again, but you have not listened or inclined your ear to hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_5","025_25_5","JER","25","5","5","The prophets told you, ‘Turn now, each of you, from your evil ways and deeds, and you can dwell in the land that the LORD has given to you and your fathers forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_6","025_25_6","JER","25","6","6","Do not follow other gods to serve and worship them, and do not provoke Me to anger with the works of your hands. Then I will do you no harm.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_7","025_25_7","JER","25","7","7","‘But to your own harm, you have not listened to Me,’ declares the LORD, ‘so you have provoked Me to anger with the works of your hands.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_8","025_25_8","JER","25","8","8","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Because you have not obeyed My words, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_9","025_25_9","JER","25","9","9","behold, I will summon all the families of the north, declares the LORD, and I will send for My servant Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, whom I will bring against this land, against its residents, and against all the surrounding nations. So I will devote them to destruction and make them an object of horror and contempt, an everlasting desolation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_10","025_25_10","JER","25","10","10","Moreover, I will banish from them the sounds of joy and gladness, the voices of the bride and bridegroom, the sound of the millstones, and the light of the lamp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_11","025_25_11","JER","25","11","11","And this whole land will become a desolate wasteland, and these nations will serve the king of Babylon for seventy years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_12","025_25_12","JER","25","12","12","But when seventy years are complete, I will punish the king of Babylon and that nation, the land of the Chaldeans, for their guilt, declares the LORD, and I will make it an everlasting desolation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_13","025_25_13","JER","25","13","13","I will bring upon that land all the words I have pronounced against it, all that is written in this book, which Jeremiah has prophesied against all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_14","025_25_14","JER","25","14","14","For many nations and great kings will enslave them, and I will repay them according to their deeds and according to the work of their hands.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_15","025_25_15","JER","25","15","15","This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, said to me: “Take from My hand this cup of the wine of wrath, and make all the nations to whom I send you drink from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_16","025_25_16","JER","25","16","16","And they will drink and stagger and go out of their minds, because of the sword that I will send among them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_17","025_25_17","JER","25","17","17","So I took the cup from the LORD’s hand and made all the nations drink from it, each one to whom the LORD had sent me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_18","025_25_18","JER","25","18","18","to make them a ruin, an object of horror and contempt and cursing, as they are to this day—Jerusalem and the cities of Judah, its kings and officials; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_19","025_25_19","JER","25","19","19","Pharaoh king of Egypt, his officials, his leaders, and all his people; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_20","025_25_20","JER","25","20","20","all the mixed tribes; all the kings of Uz; all the kings of the Philistines: Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron, and the remnant of Ashdod; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_21","025_25_21","JER","25","21","21","Edom, Moab, and the Ammonites; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_22","025_25_22","JER","25","22","22","all the kings of Tyre and Sidon; the kings of the coastlands across the sea; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_23","025_25_23","JER","25","23","23","Dedan, Tema, Buz, and all who cut the corners of their hair; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_24","025_25_24","JER","25","24","24","all the kings of Arabia, and all the kings of the mixed tribes who dwell in the desert; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_25","025_25_25","JER","25","25","25","all the kings of Zimri, Elam, and Media; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_26","025_25_26","JER","25","26","26","all the kings of the north, both near and far, one after another—all the kingdoms on the face of the earth. And after all of them, the king of Sheshach will drink it too. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_27","025_25_27","JER","25","27","27","“Then you are to tell them that this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘Drink, get drunk, and vomit. Fall down and never get up again, because of the sword I will send among you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_28","025_25_28","JER","25","28","28","If they refuse to take the cup from your hand and drink it, you are to tell them that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘You most certainly must drink it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_29","025_25_29","JER","25","29","29","For behold, I am beginning to bring disaster on the city that bears My Name, so how could you possibly go unpunished? You will not go unpunished, for I am calling down a sword upon all the inhabitants of the earth, declares the LORD of Hosts.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_30","025_25_30","JER","25","30","30","So you are to prophesy all these words against them and say to them: ‘The LORD will roar from on high; He will raise His voice from His holy habitation. He will roar loudly over His pasture; like those who tread the grapes, He will call out with a shout against all the inhabitants of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_31","025_25_31","JER","25","31","31","The tumult will resound to the ends of the earth because the LORD brings a charge against the nations. He brings judgment on all mankind and puts the wicked to the sword,’” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_32","025_25_32","JER","25","32","32","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Behold! Disaster is spreading from nation to nation; a mighty storm is rising from the ends of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_33","025_25_33","JER","25","33","33","Those slain by the LORD on that day will be spread from one end of the earth to the other. They will not be mourned, gathered, or buried. They will be like dung lying on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_34","025_25_34","JER","25","34","34","Wail, you shepherds, and cry out; roll in the dust, you leaders of the flock. For the days of your slaughter have come; you will fall and be shattered like fine pottery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_35","025_25_35","JER","25","35","35","Flight will evade the shepherds, and escape will elude the leaders of the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_36","025_25_36","JER","25","36","36","Hear the cry of the shepherds, the wailing of the leaders of the flock, for the LORD is destroying their pasture. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_37","025_25_37","JER","25","37","37","The peaceful meadows have been silenced because of the LORD’s burning anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR25_38","025_25_38","JER","25","38","38","He has left His den like a lion, for their land has been made a desolation by the sword of the oppressor, and because of the fierce anger of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_1","025_26_1","JER","26","1","1","At the beginning of the reign of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah, this word came from the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_2","025_26_2","JER","26","2","2","“This is what the LORD says: Stand in the courtyard of the house of the LORD and speak all the words I have commanded you to speak to all the cities of Judah who come to worship there. Do not omit a word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_3","025_26_3","JER","26","3","3","Perhaps they will listen and turn—each from his evil way of life—so that I may relent of the disaster I am planning to bring upon them because of the evil of their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_4","025_26_4","JER","26","4","4","And you are to tell them that this is what the LORD says: ‘If you do not listen to Me and walk in My law, which I have set before you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_5","025_26_5","JER","26","5","5","and if you do not listen to the words of My servants the prophets, whom I have sent you again and again even though you did not listen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_6","025_26_6","JER","26","6","6","then I will make this house like Shiloh, and I will make this city an object of cursing among all the nations of the earth.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_7","025_26_7","JER","26","7","7","Now the priests and prophets and all the people heard Jeremiah speaking these words in the house of the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_8","025_26_8","JER","26","8","8","and as soon as he had finished telling all the people everything the LORD had commanded him to say, the priests and prophets and all the people seized him, shouting, “You must surely die! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_9","025_26_9","JER","26","9","9","How dare you prophesy in the name of the LORD that this house will become like Shiloh and this city will be desolate and deserted!” And all the people assembled against Jeremiah in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_10","025_26_10","JER","26","10","10","When the officials of Judah heard these things, they went up from the king’s palace to the house of the LORD and sat there at the entrance of the New Gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_11","025_26_11","JER","26","11","11","Then the priests and prophets said to the officials and all the people, “This man is worthy of death, for he has prophesied against this city, as you have heard with your own ears!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_12","025_26_12","JER","26","12","12","But Jeremiah said to all the officials and all the people, “The LORD sent me to prophesy against this house and against this city all the words that you have heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_13","025_26_13","JER","26","13","13","So now, correct your ways and deeds, and obey the voice of the LORD your God, so that He might relent of the disaster He has pronounced against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_14","025_26_14","JER","26","14","14","As for me, here I am in your hands; do to me what you think is good and right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_15","025_26_15","JER","26","15","15","But know for certain that if you put me to death, you will bring innocent blood upon yourselves, upon this city, and upon its residents; for truly the LORD has sent me to speak all these words in your hearing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_16","025_26_16","JER","26","16","16","Then the officials and all the people told the priests and prophets, “This man is not worthy of death, for he has spoken to us in the name of the LORD our God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_17","025_26_17","JER","26","17","17","Some of the elders of the land stood up and said to the whole assembly of the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_18","025_26_18","JER","26","18","18","“Micah the Moreshite prophesied in the days of Hezekiah king of Judah and told all the people of Judah that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Zion will be plowed like a field, Jerusalem will become a heap of rubble, and the temple mount a wooded ridge.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_19","025_26_19","JER","26","19","19","Did Hezekiah king of Judah or anyone else in Judah put him to death? Did Hezekiah not fear the LORD and seek His favor, and did not the LORD relent of the disaster He had pronounced against them? But we are about to bring great harm on ourselves!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_20","025_26_20","JER","26","20","20","Now there was another man prophesying in the name of the LORD, Uriah son of Shemaiah from Kiriath-jearim. He prophesied against this city and against this land the same things that Jeremiah did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_21","025_26_21","JER","26","21","21","King Jehoiakim and all his mighty men and officials heard his words, and the king sought to put him to death. But when Uriah found out about it, he fled in fear and went to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_22","025_26_22","JER","26","22","22","Then King Jehoiakim sent men to Egypt: Elnathan son of Achbor along with some other men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_23","025_26_23","JER","26","23","23","They brought Uriah out of Egypt and took him to King Jehoiakim, who had him put to the sword and his body thrown into the burial place of the common people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR26_24","025_26_24","JER","26","24","24","Nevertheless, Ahikam son of Shaphan supported Jeremiah, so he was not handed over to the people to be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_1","025_27_1","JER","27","1","1","At the beginning of the reign of Zedekiah son of Josiah king of Judah, this word came to Jeremiah from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_2","025_27_2","JER","27","2","2","This is what the LORD said to me: “Make for yourself a yoke out of leather straps and put it on your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_3","025_27_3","JER","27","3","3","Send word to the kings of Edom, Moab, Ammon, Tyre, and Sidon through the envoys who have come to Jerusalem to Zedekiah king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_4","025_27_4","JER","27","4","4","Give them a message from the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, to relay to their masters: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_5","025_27_5","JER","27","5","5","By My great power and outstretched arm, I made the earth and the men and beasts on the face of it, and I give it to whom I please. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_6","025_27_6","JER","27","6","6","So now I have placed all these lands under the authority of My servant Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon. I have even made the beasts of the field subject to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_7","025_27_7","JER","27","7","7","All nations will serve him and his son and grandson, until the time of his own land comes; then many nations and great kings will enslave him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_8","025_27_8","JER","27","8","8","As for the nation or kingdom that does not serve Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon and does not place its neck under his yoke, I will punish that nation by sword and famine and plague, declares the LORD, until I have destroyed it by his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_9","025_27_9","JER","27","9","9","But as for you, do not listen to your prophets, your diviners, your interpreters of dreams, your mediums, or your sorcerers who declare, ‘You will not serve the king of Babylon.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_10","025_27_10","JER","27","10","10","For they prophesy to you a lie that will serve to remove you from your land; I will banish you and you will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_11","025_27_11","JER","27","11","11","But the nation that will put its neck under the yoke of the king of Babylon and serve him, I will leave in its own land, to cultivate it and reside in it, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_12","025_27_12","JER","27","12","12","And to Zedekiah king of Judah I spoke the same message: “Put your necks under the yoke of the king of Babylon; serve him and his people, and live! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_13","025_27_13","JER","27","13","13","Why should you and your people die by sword and famine and plague, as the LORD has decreed against any nation that does not serve the king of Babylon? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_14","025_27_14","JER","27","14","14","Do not listen to the words of the prophets who say, ‘You must not serve the king of Babylon,’ for they are prophesying to you a lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_15","025_27_15","JER","27","15","15","For I have not sent them, declares the LORD, and yet they are prophesying falsely in My name; therefore I will banish you, and you will perish—you and the prophets who prophesy to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_16","025_27_16","JER","27","16","16","Then I said to the priests and to all this people, “This is what the LORD says: Do not listen to the words of your prophets who prophesy to you, saying, ‘Look, very soon now the articles from the house of the LORD will be brought back from Babylon.’ They are prophesying to you a lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_17","025_27_17","JER","27","17","17","Do not listen to them. Serve the king of Babylon and live! Why should this city become a ruin? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_18","025_27_18","JER","27","18","18","If they are indeed prophets and the word of the LORD is with them, let them now plead with the LORD of Hosts that the articles remaining in the house of the LORD, in the palace of the king of Judah, and in Jerusalem, not be taken to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_19","025_27_19","JER","27","19","19","For this is what the LORD of Hosts says about the pillars, the sea, the bases, and the rest of the articles that remain in this city, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_20","025_27_20","JER","27","20","20","which Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon did not take when he carried Jeconiah son of Jehoiakim king of Judah into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon, along with all the nobles of Judah and Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_21","025_27_21","JER","27","21","21","Yes, this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says about the articles that remain in the house of the LORD, in the palace of the king of Judah, and in Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR27_22","025_27_22","JER","27","22","22","‘They will be carried to Babylon and will remain there until the day I attend to them again,’ declares the LORD. ‘Then I will bring them back and restore them to this place.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_1","025_28_1","JER","28","1","1","In the fifth month of that same year, the fourth year, near the beginning of the reign of King Zedekiah of Judah, the prophet Hananiah son of Azzur, who was from Gibeon, said to me in the house of the LORD in the presence of the priests and all the people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_2","025_28_2","JER","28","2","2","“This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘I have broken the yoke of the king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_3","025_28_3","JER","28","3","3","Within two years I will restore to this place all the articles of the house of the LORD that Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon removed from here and carried to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_4","025_28_4","JER","28","4","4","And I will restore to this place Jeconiah son of Jehoiakim king of Judah, along with all the exiles from Judah who went to Babylon,’ declares the LORD, ‘for I will break the yoke of the king of Babylon.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_5","025_28_5","JER","28","5","5","Then the prophet Jeremiah replied to the prophet Hananiah in the presence of the priests and all the people who were standing in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_6","025_28_6","JER","28","6","6","“Amen!” Jeremiah said. “May the LORD do so! May the LORD fulfill the words you have prophesied, and may He restore the articles of His house and all the exiles back to this place from Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_7","025_28_7","JER","28","7","7","Nevertheless, listen now to this message I am speaking in your hearing and in the hearing of all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_8","025_28_8","JER","28","8","8","The prophets of old who preceded you and me prophesied war, disaster, and plague against many lands and great kingdoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_9","025_28_9","JER","28","9","9","As for the prophet who prophesies peace, only if the word of the prophet comes true will the prophet be recognized as one the LORD has truly sent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_10","025_28_10","JER","28","10","10","Then the prophet Hananiah took the yoke off the neck of Jeremiah the prophet and broke it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_11","025_28_11","JER","28","11","11","And in the presence of all the people Hananiah proclaimed, “This is what the LORD says: ‘In this way, within two years I will break the yoke of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon off the neck of all the nations.’” At this, Jeremiah the prophet went on his way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_12","025_28_12","JER","28","12","12","But shortly after Hananiah the prophet had broken the yoke off his neck, the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_13","025_28_13","JER","28","13","13","“Go and tell Hananiah that this is what the LORD says: ‘You have broken a yoke of wood, but in its place you have fashioned a yoke of iron.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_14","025_28_14","JER","28","14","14","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘I have put a yoke of iron on the neck of all these nations to make them serve Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, and they will serve him. I have even given him control of the beasts of the field.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_15","025_28_15","JER","28","15","15","Then the prophet Jeremiah said to the prophet Hananiah, “Listen, Hananiah! The LORD did not send you, but you have persuaded this people to trust in a lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_16","025_28_16","JER","28","16","16","Therefore this is what the LORD says: ‘I am about to remove you from the face of the earth. You will die this year because you have preached rebellion against the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR28_17","025_28_17","JER","28","17","17","And in the seventh month of that very year, the prophet Hananiah died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_1","025_29_1","JER","29","1","1","This is the text of the letter that Jeremiah the prophet sent from Jerusalem to the surviving elders among the exiles and to the priests, the prophets, and all the others Nebuchadnezzar had carried into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_2","025_29_2","JER","29","2","2","(This was after King Jeconiah, the queen mother, the court officials, the officials of Judah and Jerusalem, the craftsmen, and the metalsmiths had been exiled from Jerusalem.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_3","025_29_3","JER","29","3","3","The letter was entrusted to Elasah son of Shaphan and Gemariah son of Hilkiah, whom Zedekiah king of Judah sent to King Nebuchadnezzar in Babylon. It stated: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_4","025_29_4","JER","29","4","4","This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says to all the exiles who were carried away from Jerusalem to Babylon: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_5","025_29_5","JER","29","5","5","“Build houses and settle down. Plant gardens and eat their produce. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_6","025_29_6","JER","29","6","6","Take wives and have sons and daughters. Take wives for your sons and give your daughters in marriage, so that they too may have sons and daughters. Multiply there; do not decrease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_7","025_29_7","JER","29","7","7","Seek the prosperity of the city to which I have sent you as exiles. Pray to the LORD on its behalf, for if it prospers, you too will prosper.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_8","025_29_8","JER","29","8","8","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “Do not be deceived by the prophets and diviners among you, and do not listen to the dreams you elicit from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_9","025_29_9","JER","29","9","9","For they are falsely prophesying to you in My name; I have not sent them, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_10","025_29_10","JER","29","10","10","For this is what the LORD says: “When Babylon’s seventy years are complete, I will attend to you and confirm My promise to restore you to this place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_11","025_29_11","JER","29","11","11","For I know the plans I have for you, declares the LORD, plans to prosper you and not to harm you, to give you a future and a hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_12","025_29_12","JER","29","12","12","Then you will call upon Me and come and pray to Me, and I will listen to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_13","025_29_13","JER","29","13","13","You will seek Me and find Me when you search for Me with all your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_14","025_29_14","JER","29","14","14","I will be found by you, declares the LORD, and I will restore you from captivity and gather you from all the nations and places to which I have banished you, declares the LORD. I will restore you to the place from which I sent you into exile.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_15","025_29_15","JER","29","15","15","Because you may say, “The LORD has raised up for us prophets in Babylon,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_16","025_29_16","JER","29","16","16","this is what the LORD says about the king who sits on David’s throne and all the people who remain in this city, your brothers who did not go with you into exile— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_17","025_29_17","JER","29","17","17","this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “I will send against them sword and famine and plague, and I will make them like rotten figs, so bad they cannot be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_18","025_29_18","JER","29","18","18","I will pursue them with sword and famine and plague. I will make them a horror to all the kingdoms of the earth—a curse, a desolation, and an object of scorn and reproach among all the nations to which I banish them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_19","025_29_19","JER","29","19","19","I will do this because they have not listened to My words, declares the LORD, which I sent to them again and again through My servants the prophets. And neither have you exiles listened, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_20","025_29_20","JER","29","20","20","So hear the word of the LORD, all you exiles I have sent away from Jerusalem to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_21","025_29_21","JER","29","21","21","This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says about Ahab son of Kolaiah and Zedekiah son of Maaseiah, who are prophesying to you lies in My name: “I will deliver them to Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, and he will kill them before your very eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_22","025_29_22","JER","29","22","22","Because of them, all the exiles of Judah who are in Babylon will use this curse: ‘May the LORD make you like Zedekiah and Ahab, whom the king of Babylon roasted in the fire!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_23","025_29_23","JER","29","23","23","For they have committed an outrage in Israel by committing adultery with the wives of their neighbors and speaking lies in My name, which I did not command them to do. I am He who knows, and I am a witness, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_24","025_29_24","JER","29","24","24","You are to tell Shemaiah the Nehelamite that ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_25","025_29_25","JER","29","25","25","this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “In your own name you have sent out letters to all the people of Jerusalem, to the priest Zephaniah son of Maaseiah, and to all the priests. You said to Zephaniah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_26","025_29_26","JER","29","26","26","‘The LORD has appointed you priest in place of Jehoiada, to be the chief officer in the house of the LORD, responsible for any madman who acts like a prophet—you must put him in stocks and neck irons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_27","025_29_27","JER","29","27","27","So now, why have you not rebuked Jeremiah of Anathoth, who poses as a prophet among you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_28","025_29_28","JER","29","28","28","For he has sent to us in Babylon, claiming: Since the exile will be lengthy, build houses and settle down; plant gardens and eat their produce.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_29","025_29_29","JER","29","29","29","(Zephaniah the priest, however, had read this letter to Jeremiah the prophet.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_30","025_29_30","JER","29","30","30","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_31","025_29_31","JER","29","31","31","“Send a message telling all the exiles what the LORD says concerning Shemaiah the Nehelamite. Because Shemaiah has prophesied to you—though I did not send him—and has made you trust in a lie, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR29_32","025_29_32","JER","29","32","32","this is what the LORD says: ‘I will surely punish Shemaiah the Nehelamite and his descendants. He will have no one left among this people, nor will he see the good that I will bring to My people, declares the LORD, for he has preached rebellion against the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_1","025_30_1","JER","30","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_2","025_30_2","JER","30","2","2","“This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ‘Write in a book all the words that I have spoken to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_3","025_30_3","JER","30","3","3","For behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will restore from captivity My people Israel and Judah, declares the LORD. I will restore them to the land that I gave to their fathers, and they will possess it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_4","025_30_4","JER","30","4","4","These are the words that the LORD spoke concerning Israel and Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_5","025_30_5","JER","30","5","5","Yes, this is what the LORD says: “A cry of panic is heard—a cry of terror, not of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_6","025_30_6","JER","30","6","6","Ask now, and see: Can a male give birth? Why then do I see every man with his hands on his stomach like a woman in labor and every face turned pale? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_7","025_30_7","JER","30","7","7","How awful that day will be! None will be like it! It is the time of Jacob’s distress, but he will be saved out of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_8","025_30_8","JER","30","8","8","On that day, declares the LORD of Hosts, I will break the yoke off their necks and tear off their bonds, and no longer will strangers enslave them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_9","025_30_9","JER","30","9","9","Instead, they will serve the LORD their God and David their king, whom I will raise up for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_10","025_30_10","JER","30","10","10","As for you, O Jacob My servant, do not be afraid, declares the LORD, and do not be dismayed, O Israel. For I will surely save you out of a distant place, your descendants from the land of their captivity! Jacob will return to quiet and ease, with no one to make him afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_11","025_30_11","JER","30","11","11","For I am with you to save you, declares the LORD. Though I will completely destroy all the nations to which I have scattered you, I will not completely destroy you. Yet I will discipline you justly, and will by no means leave you unpunished.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_12","025_30_12","JER","30","12","12","For this is what the LORD says: “Your injury is incurable; your wound is grievous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_13","025_30_13","JER","30","13","13","There is no one to plead your cause, no remedy for your sores, no recovery for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_14","025_30_14","JER","30","14","14","All your lovers have forgotten you; they no longer seek you, for I have struck you as an enemy would, with the discipline of someone cruel, because of your great iniquity and your numerous sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_15","025_30_15","JER","30","15","15","Why do you cry out over your wound? Your pain has no cure! Because of your great iniquity and your numerous sins I have done these things to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_16","025_30_16","JER","30","16","16","Nevertheless, all who devour you will be devoured, and all your adversaries—every one of them—will go off into exile. Those who plundered you will be plundered, and all who raided you will be raided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_17","025_30_17","JER","30","17","17","But I will restore your health and heal your wounds, declares the LORD, because they call you an outcast, Zion, for whom no one cares.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_18","025_30_18","JER","30","18","18","This is what the LORD says: “I will restore the fortunes of Jacob’s tents and have compassion on his dwellings. And the city will be rebuilt on her own ruins, and the palace will stand in its rightful place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_19","025_30_19","JER","30","19","19","Thanksgiving will proceed from them, a sound of celebration. I will multiply them, and they will not be decreased; I will honor them, and they will not be belittled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_20","025_30_20","JER","30","20","20","Their children will be as in days of old, and their congregation will be established before Me; and I will punish all their oppressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_21","025_30_21","JER","30","21","21","Their leader will be one of their own, and their ruler will arise from their midst. And I will bring him near, and he will approach Me, for who would dare on his own to approach Me?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_22","025_30_22","JER","30","22","22","“And you will be My people, and I will be your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_23","025_30_23","JER","30","23","23","Behold, the storm of the LORD has gone out with fury, a whirlwind swirling down upon the heads of the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR30_24","025_30_24","JER","30","24","24","The fierce anger of the LORD will not turn back until He has fully accomplished the purposes of His heart. In the days to come you will understand this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_1","025_31_1","JER","31","1","1","“At that time,” declares the LORD, “I will be the God of all the families of Israel, and they will be My people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_2","025_31_2","JER","31","2","2","This is what the LORD says: “The people who survived the sword found favor in the wilderness when Israel went to find rest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_3","025_31_3","JER","31","3","3","The LORD appeared to us in the past, saying: “I have loved you with an everlasting love; therefore I have drawn you with loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_4","025_31_4","JER","31","4","4","Again I will build you, and you will be rebuilt, O Virgin Israel. Again you will take up your tambourines and go out in joyful dancing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_5","025_31_5","JER","31","5","5","Again you will plant vineyards on the hills of Samaria; the farmers will plant and enjoy the fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_6","025_31_6","JER","31","6","6","For there will be a day when watchmen will call out on the hills of Ephraim, ‘Arise, let us go up to Zion, to the LORD our God!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_7","025_31_7","JER","31","7","7","For this is what the LORD says: “Sing with joy for Jacob; shout for the foremost of the nations! Make your praises heard, and say, ‘O LORD, save Your people, the remnant of Israel!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_8","025_31_8","JER","31","8","8","Behold, I will bring them from the land of the north and gather them from the farthest parts of the earth, including the blind and the lame, expectant mothers and women in labor. They will return as a great assembly! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_9","025_31_9","JER","31","9","9","They will come with weeping, and by their supplication I will lead them; I will make them walk beside streams of waters, on a level path where they will not stumble. For I am Israel’s Father, and Ephraim is My firstborn.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_10","025_31_10","JER","31","10","10","Hear, O nations, the word of the LORD, and proclaim it in distant coastlands: “The One who scattered Israel will gather them and keep them as a shepherd keeps his flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_11","025_31_11","JER","31","11","11","For the LORD has ransomed Jacob and redeemed him from the hand that had overpowered him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_12","025_31_12","JER","31","12","12","They will come and shout for joy on the heights of Zion; they will be radiant over the bounty of the LORD—the grain, new wine, and oil, and the young of the flocks and herds. Their life will be like a well-watered garden, and never again will they languish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_13","025_31_13","JER","31","13","13","Then the maidens will rejoice with dancing, young men and old as well. I will turn their mourning into joy, and give them comfort and joy for their sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_14","025_31_14","JER","31","14","14","I will fill the souls of the priests abundantly, and will fill My people with My goodness,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_15","025_31_15","JER","31","15","15","This is what the LORD says: “A voice is heard in Ramah, mourning and great weeping, Rachel weeping for her children and refusing to be comforted, because they are no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_16","025_31_16","JER","31","16","16","This is what the LORD says: “Keep your voice from weeping and your eyes from tears, for the reward for your work will come, declares the LORD. Then your children will return from the land of the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_17","025_31_17","JER","31","17","17","So there is hope for your future, declares the LORD, and your children will return to their own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_18","025_31_18","JER","31","18","18","I have surely heard Ephraim’s moaning: ‘You disciplined me severely, like an untrained calf. Restore me, that I may return, for You are the LORD my God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_19","025_31_19","JER","31","19","19","After I returned, I repented; and after I was instructed, I struck my thigh in grief. I was ashamed and humiliated because I bore the disgrace of my youth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_20","025_31_20","JER","31","20","20","Is not Ephraim a precious son to Me, a delightful child? Though I often speak against him, I still remember him. Therefore My heart yearns for him; I have great compassion for him,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_21","025_31_21","JER","31","21","21","“Set up the road markers, put up the signposts. Keep the highway in mind, the road you have traveled. Return, O Virgin Israel, return to these cities of yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_22","025_31_22","JER","31","22","22","How long will you wander, O faithless daughter? For the LORD has created a new thing in the land—a woman will shelter a man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_23","025_31_23","JER","31","23","23","This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “When I restore them from captivity, they will once again speak this word in the land of Judah and in its cities: ‘May the LORD bless you, O righteous dwelling place, O holy mountain.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_24","025_31_24","JER","31","24","24","And Judah and all its cities will dwell together in the land, the farmers and those who move with the flocks, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_25","025_31_25","JER","31","25","25","for I will refresh the weary soul and replenish all who are weak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_26","025_31_26","JER","31","26","26","At this I awoke and looked around. My sleep had been most pleasant to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_27","025_31_27","JER","31","27","27","“The days are coming,” declares the LORD, “when I will sow the house of Israel and the house of Judah with the seed of man and of beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_28","025_31_28","JER","31","28","28","Just as I watched over them to uproot and tear down, to demolish, destroy, and bring disaster, so I will watch over them to build and to plant,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_29","025_31_29","JER","31","29","29","“In those days, it will no longer be said: ‘The fathers have eaten sour grapes, and the teeth of the children are set on edge.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_30","025_31_30","JER","31","30","30","Instead, each will die for his own iniquity. If anyone eats the sour grapes, his own teeth will be set on edge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_31","025_31_31","JER","31","31","31","Behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will make a new covenant with the house of Israel and with the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_32","025_31_32","JER","31","32","32","It will not be like the covenant I made with their fathers when I took them by the hand to lead them out of the land of Egypt—a covenant they broke, though I was a husband to them,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_33","025_31_33","JER","31","33","33","“But this is the covenant I will make with the house of Israel after those days, declares the LORD. I will put My law in their minds and inscribe it on their hearts. And I will be their God, and they will be My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_34","025_31_34","JER","31","34","34","No longer will each man teach his neighbor or his brother, saying, ‘Know the LORD,’ because they will all know Me, from the least of them to the greatest, declares the LORD. For I will forgive their iniquities and will remember their sins no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_35","025_31_35","JER","31","35","35","Thus says the LORD, who gives the sun for light by day, who sets in order the moon and stars for light by night, who stirs up the sea so that its waves roar—the LORD of Hosts is His name: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_36","025_31_36","JER","31","36","36","“Only if this fixed order departed from My presence, declares the LORD, would Israel’s descendants ever cease to be a nation before Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_37","025_31_37","JER","31","37","37","This is what the LORD says: “Only if the heavens above could be measured and the foundations of the earth below searched out would I reject all of Israel’s descendants because of all they have done,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_38","025_31_38","JER","31","38","38","“The days are coming,” declares the LORD, “when this city will be rebuilt for Me, from the tower of Hananel to the Corner Gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_39","025_31_39","JER","31","39","39","The measuring line will once again stretch out straight to the hill of Gareb and then turn toward Goah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR31_40","025_31_40","JER","31","40","40","The whole valley of the dead bodies and ashes, and all the fields as far as the Kidron Valley, to the corner of the Horse Gate to the east, will be holy to the LORD. It will never again be uprooted or demolished.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_1","025_32_1","JER","32","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD in the tenth year of Zedekiah king of Judah, which was the eighteenth year of Nebuchadnezzar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_2","025_32_2","JER","32","2","2","At that time the army of the king of Babylon was besieging Jerusalem, and Jeremiah the prophet was imprisoned in the courtyard of the guard, which was in the palace of the king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_3","025_32_3","JER","32","3","3","For Zedekiah king of Judah had imprisoned him, saying: “Why are you prophesying like this? You claim that the LORD says, ‘Behold, I am about to deliver this city into the hand of the king of Babylon, and he will capture it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_4","025_32_4","JER","32","4","4","Zedekiah king of Judah will not escape from the hands of the Chaldeans, but he will surely be delivered into the hand of the king of Babylon, and will speak with him face to face and see him eye to eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_5","025_32_5","JER","32","5","5","He will take Zedekiah to Babylon, where he will stay until I attend to him, declares the LORD. If you fight against the Chaldeans, you will not succeed.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_6","025_32_6","JER","32","6","6","Jeremiah replied, “The word of the LORD came to me, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_7","025_32_7","JER","32","7","7","Behold! Hanamel, the son of your uncle Shallum, is coming to you to say, ‘Buy for yourself my field in Anathoth, for you have the right of redemption to buy it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_8","025_32_8","JER","32","8","8","Then, as the LORD had said, my cousin Hanamel came to me in the courtyard of the guard and urged me, ‘Please buy my field in Anathoth in the land of Benjamin, for you own the right of inheritance and redemption. Buy it for yourself.’” Then I knew that this was the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_9","025_32_9","JER","32","9","9","So I bought the field in Anathoth from my cousin Hanamel, and I weighed out seventeen shekels of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_10","025_32_10","JER","32","10","10","I signed and sealed the deed, called in witnesses, and weighed out the silver on the scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_11","025_32_11","JER","32","11","11","Then I took the deed of purchase—the sealed copy with its terms and conditions, as well as the open copy— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_12","025_32_12","JER","32","12","12","and I gave this deed to Baruch son of Neriah, the son of Mahseiah, in the sight of my cousin Hanamel and the witnesses who were signing the purchase agreement and all the Jews sitting in the courtyard of the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_13","025_32_13","JER","32","13","13","In their sight I instructed Baruch, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_14","025_32_14","JER","32","14","14","“This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Take these deeds—both the sealed copy and the open copy of the deed of purchase—and put them in a clay jar to preserve them for a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_15","025_32_15","JER","32","15","15","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Houses, fields, and vineyards will again be bought in this land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_16","025_32_16","JER","32","16","16","After I had given the deed of purchase to Baruch son of Neriah, I prayed to the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_17","025_32_17","JER","32","17","17","“Oh, Lord GOD! You have made the heavens and the earth by Your great power and outstretched arm. Nothing is too difficult for You! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_18","025_32_18","JER","32","18","18","You show loving devotion to thousands but lay the iniquity of the fathers into the laps of their children after them, O great and mighty God whose name is the LORD of Hosts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_19","025_32_19","JER","32","19","19","the One great in counsel and mighty in deed, whose eyes are on all the ways of the sons of men, to reward each one according to his ways and according to the fruit of his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_20","025_32_20","JER","32","20","20","You performed signs and wonders in the land of Egypt, and You do so to this very day, both in Israel and among all mankind. And You have made a name for Yourself, as is the case to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_21","025_32_21","JER","32","21","21","You brought Your people Israel out of the land of Egypt with signs and wonders, with a strong hand and an outstretched arm, and with great terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_22","025_32_22","JER","32","22","22","You gave them this land that You had sworn to give their fathers, a land flowing with milk and honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_23","025_32_23","JER","32","23","23","They came in and possessed it, but they did not obey Your voice or walk in Your law. They failed to perform all that You commanded them to do, and so You have brought upon them all this disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_24","025_32_24","JER","32","24","24","See how the siege ramps are mounted against the city to capture it. And by sword and famine and plague, the city has been given into the hands of the Chaldeans who are fighting against it. What You have spoken has happened, as You now see! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_25","025_32_25","JER","32","25","25","Yet You, O Lord GOD, have said to me, ‘Buy for yourself the field with silver and call in witnesses, even though the city has been delivered into the hands of the Chaldeans!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_26","025_32_26","JER","32","26","26","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_27","025_32_27","JER","32","27","27","“Behold, I am the LORD, the God of all flesh. Is anything too difficult for Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_28","025_32_28","JER","32","28","28","Therefore this is what the LORD says: Behold, I am about to deliver this city into the hands of the Chaldeans and of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, who will capture it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_29","025_32_29","JER","32","29","29","And the Chaldeans who are fighting against this city will come in, set it on fire, and burn it, along with the houses of those who provoked Me to anger by burning incense to Baal on their rooftops and by pouring out drink offerings to other gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_30","025_32_30","JER","32","30","30","For the children of Israel and of Judah have done nothing but evil in My sight from their youth; indeed, they have done nothing but provoke Me to anger by the work of their hands, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_31","025_32_31","JER","32","31","31","For this city has aroused My wrath and fury from the day it was built until now. Therefore I will remove it from My presence ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_32","025_32_32","JER","32","32","32","because of all the evil the children of Israel and of Judah have done to provoke Me to anger—they, their kings, their officials, their priests and prophets, the men of Judah, and the residents of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_33","025_32_33","JER","32","33","33","They have turned their backs to Me and not their faces. Though I taught them again and again, they would not listen or respond to discipline. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_34","025_32_34","JER","32","34","34","They have placed their abominations in the house that bears My Name, and so have defiled it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_35","025_32_35","JER","32","35","35","They have built the high places of Baal in the Valley of Ben-hinnom to make their sons and daughters pass through the fire to Molech—something I never commanded them, nor had it ever entered My mind, that they should commit such an abomination and cause Judah to sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_36","025_32_36","JER","32","36","36","Now therefore, about this city of which you say, ‘It will be delivered into the hand of the king of Babylon by sword and famine and plague,’ this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_37","025_32_37","JER","32","37","37","I will surely gather My people from all the lands to which I have banished them in My furious anger and great wrath, and I will return them to this place and make them dwell in safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_38","025_32_38","JER","32","38","38","They will be My people, and I will be their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_39","025_32_39","JER","32","39","39","I will give them one heart and one way, so that they will always fear Me for their own good and for the good of their children after them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_40","025_32_40","JER","32","40","40","I will make an everlasting covenant with them: I will never turn away from doing good to them, and I will put My fear in their hearts, so that they will never turn away from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_41","025_32_41","JER","32","41","41","Yes, I will rejoice in doing them good, and I will faithfully plant them in this land with all My heart and with all My soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_42","025_32_42","JER","32","42","42","For this is what the LORD says: Just as I have brought all this great disaster on this people, so I will bring on them all the good I have promised them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_43","025_32_43","JER","32","43","43","And fields will be bought in this land about which you are saying, ‘It is a desolation, without man or beast; it has been delivered into the hands of the Chaldeans.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR32_44","025_32_44","JER","32","44","44","Fields will be purchased with silver, and deeds will be signed, sealed, and witnessed in the land of Benjamin, in the areas surrounding Jerusalem, and in the cities of Judah—the cities of the hill country, the foothills, and the Negev—because I will restore them from captivity, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_1","025_33_1","JER","33","1","1","While Jeremiah was still confined in the courtyard of the guard, the word of the LORD came to him a second time: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_2","025_33_2","JER","33","2","2","“Thus says the LORD who made the earth, the LORD who formed it and established it, the LORD is His name: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_3","025_33_3","JER","33","3","3","Call to Me, and I will answer and show you great and unsearchable things you do not know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_4","025_33_4","JER","33","4","4","For this is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says about the houses of this city and the palaces of the kings of Judah that have been torn down for defense against the siege ramps and the sword: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_5","025_33_5","JER","33","5","5","The Chaldeans are coming to fight and to fill those places with the corpses of the men I will strike down in My anger and in My wrath. I have hidden My face from this city because of all its wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_6","025_33_6","JER","33","6","6","Nevertheless, I will bring to it health and healing, and I will heal its people and reveal to them the abundance of peace and truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_7","025_33_7","JER","33","7","7","I will restore Judah and Israel from captivity and will rebuild them as in former times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_8","025_33_8","JER","33","8","8","And I will cleanse them from all the iniquity they have committed against Me, and will forgive all their sins of rebellion against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_9","025_33_9","JER","33","9","9","So this city will bring Me renown, joy, praise, and glory before all the nations of the earth, who will hear of all the good I do for it. They will tremble in awe because of all the goodness and prosperity that I will provide for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_10","025_33_10","JER","33","10","10","This is what the LORD says: In this place you say is a wasteland without man or beast, in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem that are deserted—inhabited by neither man nor beast—there will be heard again ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_11","025_33_11","JER","33","11","11","the sounds of joy and gladness, the voices of the bride and bridegroom, and the voices of those bringing thank offerings into the house of the LORD, saying: ‘Give thanks to the LORD of Hosts, for the LORD is good; His loving devotion endures forever.’ For I will restore the land from captivity as in former times, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_12","025_33_12","JER","33","12","12","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: In this desolate place, without man or beast, and in all its cities, there will once more be pastures for shepherds to rest their flocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_13","025_33_13","JER","33","13","13","In the cities of the hill country, the foothills, and the Negev, in the land of Benjamin and the cities surrounding Jerusalem, and in the cities of Judah, the flocks will again pass under the hands of the one who counts them, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_14","025_33_14","JER","33","14","14","Behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will fulfill the gracious promise that I have spoken to the house of Israel and the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_15","025_33_15","JER","33","15","15","In those days and at that time I will cause to sprout for David a righteous Branch, and He will administer justice and righteousness in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_16","025_33_16","JER","33","16","16","In those days Judah will be saved, and Jerusalem will dwell securely, and this is the name by which it will be called: The LORD Our Righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_17","025_33_17","JER","33","17","17","For this is what the LORD says: David will never lack a man to sit on the throne of the house of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_18","025_33_18","JER","33","18","18","nor will the priests who are Levites ever fail to have a man before Me to offer burnt offerings, to burn grain offerings, and to present sacrifices.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_19","025_33_19","JER","33","19","19","And the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_20","025_33_20","JER","33","20","20","“This is what the LORD says: If you can break My covenant with the day and My covenant with the night, so that day and night cease to occupy their appointed time, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_21","025_33_21","JER","33","21","21","then My covenant may also be broken with David My servant and with My ministers the Levites who are priests, so that David will not have a son to reign on his throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_22","025_33_22","JER","33","22","22","As the hosts of heaven cannot be counted and as the sand on the seashore cannot be measured, so too will I multiply the descendants of My servant David and the Levites who minister before Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_23","025_33_23","JER","33","23","23","Moreover, the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_24","025_33_24","JER","33","24","24","“Have you not noticed what these people are saying: ‘The LORD has rejected the two families He had chosen’? So they despise My people and no longer regard them as a nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_25","025_33_25","JER","33","25","25","This is what the LORD says: If I have not established My covenant with the day and the night and the fixed order of heaven and earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR33_26","025_33_26","JER","33","26","26","then I would also reject the descendants of Jacob and of My servant David, so as not to take from his descendants rulers over the descendants of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. For I will restore them from captivity and will have compassion on them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_1","025_34_1","JER","34","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD when Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, all his army, all the earthly kingdoms under his control, and all the other nations were fighting against Jerusalem and all its surrounding cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_2","025_34_2","JER","34","2","2","The LORD, the God of Israel, told Jeremiah to go and speak to Zedekiah king of Judah and tell him that this is what the LORD says: “Behold, I am about to deliver this city into the hand of the king of Babylon, and he will burn it down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_3","025_34_3","JER","34","3","3","And you yourself will not escape his grasp, but will surely be captured and delivered into his hand. You will see the king of Babylon eye to eye and speak with him face to face; and you will go to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_4","025_34_4","JER","34","4","4","Yet hear the word of the LORD, O Zedekiah king of Judah. This is what the LORD says concerning you: You will not die by the sword; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_5","025_34_5","JER","34","5","5","you will die in peace. As spices were burned for your fathers, the former kings who preceded you, so people will burn spices for you and lament, ‘Alas, O master!’ For I Myself have spoken this word, declares the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_6","025_34_6","JER","34","6","6","In Jerusalem, then, Jeremiah the prophet relayed all these words to Zedekiah king of Judah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_7","025_34_7","JER","34","7","7","as the army of the king of Babylon was fighting against Jerusalem and the remaining cities of Judah—against Lachish and Azekah. For these were the only fortified cities remaining in Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_8","025_34_8","JER","34","8","8","After King Zedekiah had made a covenant with all the people in Jerusalem to proclaim liberty, the word came to Jeremiah from the LORD ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_9","025_34_9","JER","34","9","9","that each man should free his Hebrew slaves, both male and female, and no one should hold his fellow Jew in bondage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_10","025_34_10","JER","34","10","10","So all the officials and all the people who entered into this covenant agreed that they would free their menservants and maidservants and no longer hold them in bondage. They obeyed and released them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_11","025_34_11","JER","34","11","11","but later they changed their minds and took back the menservants and maidservants they had freed, and they forced them to become slaves again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_12","025_34_12","JER","34","12","12","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah from the LORD, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_13","025_34_13","JER","34","13","13","“This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says: I made a covenant with your forefathers when I brought them out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of slavery, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_14","025_34_14","JER","34","14","14","Every seventh year, each of you must free his Hebrew brother who has sold himself to you. He may serve you six years, but then you must let him go free. But your fathers did not listen or incline their ear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_15","025_34_15","JER","34","15","15","Recently you repented and did what pleased Me; each of you proclaimed freedom for his neighbor. You made a covenant before Me in the house that bears My Name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_16","025_34_16","JER","34","16","16","But now you have changed your minds and profaned My name. Each of you has taken back the menservants and maidservants whom you had set at liberty to go wherever they wanted, and you have again forced them to be your slaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_17","025_34_17","JER","34","17","17","Therefore this is what the LORD says: You have not obeyed Me; you have not proclaimed freedom, each man for his brother and for his neighbor. So now I proclaim freedom for you, declares the LORD—freedom to fall by sword, by plague, and by famine! I will make you a horror to all the kingdoms of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_18","025_34_18","JER","34","18","18","And those who have transgressed My covenant and have not fulfilled the terms of the covenant they made before Me, I will treat like the calf they cut in two in order to pass between its pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_19","025_34_19","JER","34","19","19","The officials of Judah and Jerusalem, the court officials, the priests, and all the people of the land who passed between the pieces of the calf, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_20","025_34_20","JER","34","20","20","I will deliver into the hands of their enemies who seek their lives. Their corpses will become food for the birds of the air and the beasts of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_21","025_34_21","JER","34","21","21","And I will deliver Zedekiah king of Judah and his officials into the hands of their enemies who seek their lives, to the army of the king of Babylon that had withdrawn from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR34_22","025_34_22","JER","34","22","22","Behold, I am going to give the command, declares the LORD, and I will bring them back to this city. They will fight against it, capture it, and burn it down. And I will make the cities of Judah a desolation, without inhabitant.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_1","025_35_1","JER","35","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD in the days of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_2","025_35_2","JER","35","2","2","“Go to the house of the Rechabites, speak to them, and bring them to one of the chambers of the house of the LORD to offer them a drink of wine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_3","025_35_3","JER","35","3","3","So I took Jaazaniah son of Jeremiah, the son of Habazziniah, and his brothers and all his sons—the entire house of the Rechabites— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_4","025_35_4","JER","35","4","4","and I brought them into the house of the LORD, to a chamber occupied by the sons of Hanan son of Igdaliah, a man of God. This room was near the chamber of the officials, which was above the chamber of Maaseiah son of Shallum the doorkeeper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_5","025_35_5","JER","35","5","5","Then I set pitchers full of wine and some cups before the men of the house of the Rechabites, and I said to them, “Drink some wine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_6","025_35_6","JER","35","6","6","“We do not drink wine,” they replied, “for our forefather Jonadab son of Rechab commanded us, ‘Neither you nor your descendants are ever to drink wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_7","025_35_7","JER","35","7","7","Nor are you ever to build a house or sow seed or plant a vineyard. Those things are not for you. Instead, you must live in tents all your lives, so that you may live a long time in the land where you wander.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_8","025_35_8","JER","35","8","8","And we have obeyed the voice of our forefather Jonadab son of Rechab in all he commanded us. So we have not drunk wine all our lives—neither we nor our wives nor our sons and daughters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_9","025_35_9","JER","35","9","9","Nor have we built houses in which to live, and we have not owned any vineyards or fields or crops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_10","025_35_10","JER","35","10","10","But we have lived in tents and have obeyed and done exactly as our forefather Jonadab commanded us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_11","025_35_11","JER","35","11","11","So when Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon marched into the land, we said: ‘Come, let us go into Jerusalem to escape the armies of the Chaldeans and the Arameans.’ So we have remained in Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_12","025_35_12","JER","35","12","12","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_13","025_35_13","JER","35","13","13","“This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Go and tell the men of Judah and the residents of Jerusalem: ‘Will you not accept discipline and obey My words?’ declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_14","025_35_14","JER","35","14","14","The words of Jonadab son of Rechab have been carried out. He commanded his sons not to drink wine, and they have not drunk it to this very day because they have obeyed the command of their forefather. But I have spoken to you again and again, and you have not obeyed Me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_15","025_35_15","JER","35","15","15","Again and again I have sent you all My servants the prophets, proclaiming: ‘Turn now, each of you, from your wicked ways, and correct your actions. Do not go after other gods to serve them. Live in the land that I have given to you and your fathers.’ But you have not inclined your ear or listened to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_16","025_35_16","JER","35","16","16","Yes, the sons of Jonadab son of Rechab carried out the command their forefather gave them, but these people have not listened to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_17","025_35_17","JER","35","17","17","Therefore this is what the LORD God of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘Behold, I will bring to Judah and to all the residents of Jerusalem all the disaster I have pronounced against them, because I have spoken to them but they have not obeyed, and I have called to them but they have not answered.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_18","025_35_18","JER","35","18","18","Then Jeremiah said to the house of the Rechabites: “This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘Because you have obeyed the command of your forefather Jonadab and have kept all his commandments and have done all that he charged you to do, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR35_19","025_35_19","JER","35","19","19","this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Jonadab son of Rechab will never fail to have a man to stand before Me.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_1","025_36_1","JER","36","1","1","In the fourth year of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah, this word came to Jeremiah from the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_2","025_36_2","JER","36","2","2","“Take a scroll and write on it all the words I have spoken to you concerning Israel, Judah, and all the nations, from the day I first spoke to you during the reign of Josiah until today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_3","025_36_3","JER","36","3","3","Perhaps when the people of Judah hear about all the calamity I plan to bring upon them, each of them will turn from his wicked way. Then I will forgive their iniquity and their sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_4","025_36_4","JER","36","4","4","So Jeremiah called Baruch son of Neriah, and at the dictation of Jeremiah, Baruch wrote on a scroll all the words that the LORD had spoken to Jeremiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_5","025_36_5","JER","36","5","5","Then Jeremiah commanded Baruch, “I am restricted; I cannot enter the house of the LORD; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_6","025_36_6","JER","36","6","6","so you are to go to the house of the LORD on a day of fasting, and in the hearing of the people you are to read the words of the LORD from the scroll you have written at my dictation. Read them in the hearing of all the people of Judah who are coming from their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_7","025_36_7","JER","36","7","7","Perhaps they will bring their petition before the LORD, and each one will turn from his wicked way; for great are the anger and fury that the LORD has pronounced against this people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_8","025_36_8","JER","36","8","8","So Baruch son of Neriah did everything that Jeremiah the prophet had commanded him. In the house of the LORD he read the words of the LORD from the scroll. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_9","025_36_9","JER","36","9","9","Now in the ninth month of the fifth year of Jehoiakim son of Josiah king of Judah, a fast before the LORD was proclaimed to all the people of Jerusalem and all who had come there from the cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_10","025_36_10","JER","36","10","10","From the chamber of Gemariah son of Shaphan the scribe, which was in the upper courtyard at the opening of the New Gate of the house of the LORD, Baruch read from the scroll the words of Jeremiah in the hearing of all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_11","025_36_11","JER","36","11","11","When Micaiah son of Gemariah, the son of Shaphan, heard all the words of the LORD from the scroll, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_12","025_36_12","JER","36","12","12","he went down to the scribe’s chamber in the king’s palace, where all the officials were sitting: Elishama the scribe, Delaiah son of Shemaiah, Elnathan son of Achbor, Gemariah son of Shaphan, Zedekiah son of Hananiah, and all the other officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_13","025_36_13","JER","36","13","13","And Micaiah reported to them all the words he had heard Baruch read from the scroll in the hearing of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_14","025_36_14","JER","36","14","14","Then all the officials sent word to Baruch through Jehudi son of Nethaniah, the son of Shelemiah, the son of Cushi, saying, “Bring the scroll that you read in the hearing of the people, and come here.” So Baruch son of Neriah took the scroll and went to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_15","025_36_15","JER","36","15","15","“Please sit down,” they said, “and read it in our hearing.” So Baruch read it in their hearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_16","025_36_16","JER","36","16","16","When they had heard all these words, they turned to one another in fear and said to Baruch, “Surely we must report all these words to the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_17","025_36_17","JER","36","17","17","“Tell us now,” they asked Baruch, “how did you write all these words? Was it at Jeremiah’s dictation?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_18","025_36_18","JER","36","18","18","“It was at his dictation,” Baruch replied. “He recited all these words to me and I wrote them in ink on the scroll.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_19","025_36_19","JER","36","19","19","Then the officials said to Baruch, “You and Jeremiah must hide yourselves and tell no one where you are.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_20","025_36_20","JER","36","20","20","So the officials went to the king in the courtyard. And having stored the scroll in the chamber of Elishama the scribe, they reported everything to the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_21","025_36_21","JER","36","21","21","Then the king sent Jehudi to get the scroll, and he took it from the chamber of Elishama the scribe. And Jehudi read it in the hearing of the king and all the officials who were standing beside him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_22","025_36_22","JER","36","22","22","Since it was the ninth month, the king was sitting in his winter quarters with a fire burning before him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_23","025_36_23","JER","36","23","23","And as soon as Jehudi had read three or four columns, Jehoiakim would cut them off with a scribe’s knife and throw them into the firepot, until the entire scroll had been consumed by the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_24","025_36_24","JER","36","24","24","Yet in hearing all these words, the king and his servants did not become frightened or tear their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_25","025_36_25","JER","36","25","25","Even though Elnathan, Delaiah, and Gemariah urged the king not to burn the scroll, he would not listen to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_26","025_36_26","JER","36","26","26","Instead, the king commanded Jerahmeel, a son of the king, as well as Seraiah son of Azriel and Shelemiah son of Abdeel, to seize Baruch the scribe and Jeremiah the prophet. But the LORD had hidden them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_27","025_36_27","JER","36","27","27","After the king had burned the scroll containing the words that Baruch had written at Jeremiah’s dictation, the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_28","025_36_28","JER","36","28","28","“Take another scroll and rewrite on it the very words that were on the original scroll, which Jehoiakim king of Judah has burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_29","025_36_29","JER","36","29","29","You are to proclaim concerning Jehoiakim king of Judah that this is what the LORD says: You have burned the scroll and said, ‘Why have you written on it that the king of Babylon would surely come and destroy this land and deprive it of man and beast?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_30","025_36_30","JER","36","30","30","Therefore this is what the LORD says about Jehoiakim king of Judah: He will have no one to sit on David’s throne, and his body will be thrown out and exposed to heat by day and frost by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_31","025_36_31","JER","36","31","31","I will punish him and his descendants and servants for their iniquity. I will bring on them, on the residents of Jerusalem, and on the men of Judah, all the calamity about which I warned them but they did not listen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR36_32","025_36_32","JER","36","32","32","Then Jeremiah took another scroll and gave it to the scribe Baruch son of Neriah, and at Jeremiah’s dictation he wrote on it all the words of the scroll that Jehoiakim king of Judah had burned in the fire. And many similar words were added to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_1","025_37_1","JER","37","1","1","Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon made Zedekiah son of Josiah the king of Judah, and he reigned in place of Coniah son of Jehoiakim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_2","025_37_2","JER","37","2","2","But he and his officers and the people of the land refused to obey the words that the LORD had spoken through Jeremiah the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_3","025_37_3","JER","37","3","3","Yet King Zedekiah sent Jehucal son of Shelemiah and Zephaniah the priest, the son of Maaseiah, to Jeremiah the prophet with the message, “Please pray to the LORD our God for us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_4","025_37_4","JER","37","4","4","Now Jeremiah was free to come and go among the people, for they had not yet put him in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_5","025_37_5","JER","37","5","5","Pharaoh’s army had left Egypt, and when the Chaldeans who were besieging Jerusalem heard the report, they withdrew from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_6","025_37_6","JER","37","6","6","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah the prophet: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_7","025_37_7","JER","37","7","7","“This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says that you are to tell the king of Judah, who sent you to Me: Behold, Pharaoh’s army, which has marched out to help you, will go back to its own land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_8","025_37_8","JER","37","8","8","Then the Chaldeans will return and fight against this city. They will capture it and burn it down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_9","025_37_9","JER","37","9","9","This is what the LORD says: Do not deceive yourselves by saying, ‘The Chaldeans will go away for good,’ for they will not! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_10","025_37_10","JER","37","10","10","Indeed, if you were to strike down the entire army of the Chaldeans that is fighting against you, and only wounded men remained in their tents, they would still get up and burn this city down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_11","025_37_11","JER","37","11","11","When the Chaldean army withdrew from Jerusalem for fear of Pharaoh’s army, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_12","025_37_12","JER","37","12","12","Jeremiah started to leave Jerusalem to go to the land of Benjamin to claim his portion there among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_13","025_37_13","JER","37","13","13","But when he reached the Gate of Benjamin, the captain of the guard, whose name was Irijah son of Shelemiah, the son of Hananiah, seized him and said, “You are deserting to the Chaldeans!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_14","025_37_14","JER","37","14","14","“That is a lie,” Jeremiah replied. “I am not deserting to the Chaldeans!” But Irijah would not listen to him; instead, he arrested Jeremiah and took him to the officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_15","025_37_15","JER","37","15","15","The officials were angry with Jeremiah, and they beat him and placed him in jail in the house of Jonathan the scribe, for it had been made into a prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_16","025_37_16","JER","37","16","16","So Jeremiah went into a cell in the dungeon and remained there a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_17","025_37_17","JER","37","17","17","Later, King Zedekiah sent for Jeremiah and received him in his palace, where he asked him privately, “Is there a word from the LORD?” “There is,” Jeremiah replied. “You will be delivered into the hand of the king of Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_18","025_37_18","JER","37","18","18","Then Jeremiah asked King Zedekiah, “How have I sinned against you or your servants or these people, that you have put me in prison? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_19","025_37_19","JER","37","19","19","Where are your prophets who prophesied to you, claiming, ‘The king of Babylon will not come against you or this land’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_20","025_37_20","JER","37","20","20","But now please listen, O my lord the king. May my petition come before you. Do not send me back to the house of Jonathan the scribe, or I will die there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR37_21","025_37_21","JER","37","21","21","So King Zedekiah gave orders for Jeremiah to be placed in the courtyard of the guard and given a loaf of bread daily from the street of the bakers, until all the bread in the city was gone. So Jeremiah remained in the courtyard of the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_1","025_38_1","JER","38","1","1","Now Shephatiah son of Mattan, Gedaliah son of Pashhur, Jucal son of Shelemiah, and Pashhur son of Malchijah heard that Jeremiah had been telling all the people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_2","025_38_2","JER","38","2","2","“This is what the LORD says: Whoever stays in this city will die by sword and famine and plague, but whoever surrenders to the Chaldeans will live; he will retain his life like a spoil of war, and he will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_3","025_38_3","JER","38","3","3","This is what the LORD says: This city will surely be delivered into the hands of the army of the king of Babylon, and he will capture it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_4","025_38_4","JER","38","4","4","Then the officials said to the king, “This man ought to die, for he is discouraging the warriors who remain in this city, as well as all the people, by speaking such words to them; this man is not seeking the well-being of these people, but their ruin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_5","025_38_5","JER","38","5","5","“Here he is,” replied King Zedekiah. “He is in your hands, since the king can do nothing to stop you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_6","025_38_6","JER","38","6","6","So they took Jeremiah and dropped him into the cistern of Malchiah, the king’s son, which was in the courtyard of the guard. They lowered Jeremiah with ropes into the cistern, which had no water but only mud, and Jeremiah sank down into the mud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_7","025_38_7","JER","38","7","7","Now Ebed-melech the Cushite, a court official in the royal palace, heard that Jeremiah had been put into the cistern. While the king was sitting at the Gate of Benjamin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_8","025_38_8","JER","38","8","8","Ebed-melech went out from the king’s palace and said to the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_9","025_38_9","JER","38","9","9","“My lord the king, these men have acted wickedly in all that they have done to Jeremiah the prophet. They have dropped him into the cistern, where he will starve to death, for there is no more bread in the city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_10","025_38_10","JER","38","10","10","So the king commanded Ebed-melech the Cushite, “Take thirty men from here with you and pull Jeremiah the prophet out of the cistern before he dies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_11","025_38_11","JER","38","11","11","Then Ebed-melech took the men with him and went to the king’s palace, to a place below the storehouse. From there he took old rags and worn-out clothes and lowered them with ropes to Jeremiah in the cistern. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_12","025_38_12","JER","38","12","12","Ebed-melech the Cushite cried out to Jeremiah, “Put these worn-out rags and clothes under your arms to pad the ropes.” Jeremiah did so, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_13","025_38_13","JER","38","13","13","and they pulled him up with the ropes and lifted him out of the cistern. And Jeremiah remained in the courtyard of the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_14","025_38_14","JER","38","14","14","Then King Zedekiah sent for Jeremiah the prophet and received him at the third entrance to the house of the LORD. “I am going to ask you something,” said the king to Jeremiah. “Do not hide anything from me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_15","025_38_15","JER","38","15","15","“If I tell you,” Jeremiah replied, “you will surely put me to death. And even if I give you advice, you will not listen to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_16","025_38_16","JER","38","16","16","But King Zedekiah swore secretly to Jeremiah, “As surely as the LORD lives, who has given us this life, I will not kill you, nor will I deliver you into the hands of these men who are seeking your life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_17","025_38_17","JER","38","17","17","Then Jeremiah said to Zedekiah, “This is what the LORD God of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘If you indeed surrender to the officers of the king of Babylon, then you will live, this city will not be burned down, and you and your household will survive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_18","025_38_18","JER","38","18","18","But if you do not surrender to the officers of the king of Babylon, then this city will be delivered into the hands of the Chaldeans. They will burn it down, and you yourself will not escape their grasp.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_19","025_38_19","JER","38","19","19","But King Zedekiah said to Jeremiah, “I am afraid of the Jews who have deserted to the Chaldeans, for the Chaldeans may deliver me into their hands to abuse me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_20","025_38_20","JER","38","20","20","“They will not hand you over,” Jeremiah replied. “Obey the voice of the LORD in what I am telling you, that it may go well with you and you may live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_21","025_38_21","JER","38","21","21","But if you refuse to surrender, this is the word that the LORD has shown me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_22","025_38_22","JER","38","22","22","All the women who remain in the palace of the king of Judah will be brought out to the officials of the king of Babylon, and those women will say: ‘They misled you and overcame you—those trusted friends of yours. Your feet sank into the mire, and they deserted you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_23","025_38_23","JER","38","23","23","All your wives and children will be brought out to the Chaldeans. And you yourself will not escape their grasp, for you will be seized by the king of Babylon, and this city will be burned down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_24","025_38_24","JER","38","24","24","Then Zedekiah warned Jeremiah, “Do not let anyone know about this conversation, or you will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_25","025_38_25","JER","38","25","25","If the officials hear that I have spoken with you, and they come and demand of you, ‘Tell us what you said to the king and what he said to you; do not hide it from us, or we will kill you,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_26","025_38_26","JER","38","26","26","then tell them, ‘I was presenting to the king my petition that he not return me to the house of Jonathan to die there.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_27","025_38_27","JER","38","27","27","When all the officials came to Jeremiah and questioned him, he relayed to them the exact words the king had commanded him to say. So they said no more to him, for no one had overheard the conversation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR38_28","025_38_28","JER","38","28","28","And Jeremiah remained in the courtyard of the guard until the day Jerusalem was captured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_1","025_39_1","JER","39","1","1","In the ninth year of Zedekiah king of Judah, in the tenth month, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon marched against Jerusalem with his entire army and laid siege to the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_2","025_39_2","JER","39","2","2","And on the ninth day of the fourth month of Zedekiah’s eleventh year, the city was breached. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_3","025_39_3","JER","39","3","3","Then all the officials of the king of Babylon entered and sat in the Middle Gate: Nergal-sharezer of Samgar, Nebo-sarsekim the Rabsaris, Nergal-sharezer the Rabmag, and all the rest of the officials of the king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_4","025_39_4","JER","39","4","4","When Zedekiah king of Judah and all the soldiers saw them, they fled. They left the city at night by way of the king’s garden, through the gate between the two walls, and they went out along the route to the Arabah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_5","025_39_5","JER","39","5","5","But the army of the Chaldeans pursued them and overtook Zedekiah in the plains of Jericho. They seized him and brought him up to Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon at Riblah in the land of Hamath, where he pronounced judgment on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_6","025_39_6","JER","39","6","6","There at Riblah the king of Babylon slaughtered the sons of Zedekiah before his eyes, and he also killed all the nobles of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_7","025_39_7","JER","39","7","7","Then he put out Zedekiah’s eyes and bound him with bronze chains to take him to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_8","025_39_8","JER","39","8","8","The Chaldeans set fire to the palace of the king and to the houses of the people, and they broke down the walls of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_9","025_39_9","JER","39","9","9","Then Nebuzaradan captain of the guard carried away to Babylon the remnant of the people who had remained in the city, along with the deserters who had defected to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_10","025_39_10","JER","39","10","10","But Nebuzaradan left behind in the land of Judah some of the poor people who had no property, and at that time he gave them vineyards and fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_11","025_39_11","JER","39","11","11","Now Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon had given orders about Jeremiah through Nebuzaradan captain of the guard, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_12","025_39_12","JER","39","12","12","“Take him, look after him, and do not let any harm come to him; do for him whatever he says.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_13","025_39_13","JER","39","13","13","So Nebuzaradan captain of the guard, Nebushazban the Rabsaris, Nergal-sharezer the Rabmag, and all the captains of the king of Babylon ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_14","025_39_14","JER","39","14","14","had Jeremiah brought from the courtyard of the guard, and they turned him over to Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, to take him home. So Jeremiah remained among his own people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_15","025_39_15","JER","39","15","15","And while Jeremiah had been confined in the courtyard of the guard, the word of the LORD had come to him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_16","025_39_16","JER","39","16","16","“Go and tell Ebed-melech the Cushite that this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘I am about to fulfill My words against this city for harm and not for good, and on that day they will be fulfilled before your eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_17","025_39_17","JER","39","17","17","But I will deliver you on that day, declares the LORD, and you will not be delivered into the hands of the men whom you fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR39_18","025_39_18","JER","39","18","18","For I will surely rescue you so that you do not fall by the sword. Because you have trusted in Me, you will escape with your life like a spoil of war, declares the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_1","025_40_1","JER","40","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the LORD after Nebuzaradan captain of the guard had released him at Ramah, having found him bound in chains among all the captives of Jerusalem and Judah who were being exiled to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_2","025_40_2","JER","40","2","2","The captain of the guard found Jeremiah and said to him, “The LORD your God decreed this disaster on this place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_3","025_40_3","JER","40","3","3","and now the LORD has fulfilled it; He has done just as He said. Because you people have sinned against the LORD and have not obeyed His voice, this thing has happened to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_4","025_40_4","JER","40","4","4","But now, behold, I am freeing you today from the chains that were on your wrists. If it pleases you to come with me to Babylon, then come, and I will take care of you. But if it seems wrong to you to come with me to Babylon, go no farther. Look, the whole land is before you. Wherever it seems good and right to you, go there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_5","025_40_5","JER","40","5","5","But before Jeremiah turned to go, Nebuzaradan added, “Return to Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, whom the king of Babylon has appointed over the cities of Judah, and stay with him among the people, or go anywhere else that seems right.” Then the captain of the guard gave him a ration and a gift and released him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_6","025_40_6","JER","40","6","6","So Jeremiah went to Gedaliah son of Ahikam at Mizpah and stayed with him among the people who were left in the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_7","025_40_7","JER","40","7","7","When all the commanders and men of the armies in the field heard that the king of Babylon had appointed Gedaliah son of Ahikam over the land and that he had put him in charge of the men, women, and children who were the poorest of the land and had not been exiled to Babylon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_8","025_40_8","JER","40","8","8","they came to Gedaliah at Mizpah—Ishmael son of Nethaniah, Johanan and Jonathan the sons of Kareah, Seraiah son of Tanhumeth, the sons of Ephai the Netophathite, and Jezaniah son of the Maacathite—they and their men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_9","025_40_9","JER","40","9","9","Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, swore an oath to them and their men, assuring them, “Do not be afraid to serve the Chaldeans. Live in the land and serve the king of Babylon, and it will go well with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_10","025_40_10","JER","40","10","10","As for me, I will stay in Mizpah to represent you before the Chaldeans who come to us. As for you, gather wine grapes, summer fruit, and oil, place them in your storage jars, and live in the cities you have taken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_11","025_40_11","JER","40","11","11","When all the Jews in Moab, Ammon, Edom, and all the other lands heard that the king of Babylon had left a remnant in Judah and had appointed Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, over them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_12","025_40_12","JER","40","12","12","they all returned from all the places to which they had been banished and came to the land of Judah, to Gedaliah at Mizpah. And they gathered an abundance of wine grapes and summer fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_13","025_40_13","JER","40","13","13","Meanwhile, Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the armies in the field came to Gedaliah at Mizpah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_14","025_40_14","JER","40","14","14","and said to him, “Are you aware that Baalis king of the Ammonites has sent Ishmael son of Nethaniah to take your life?” But Gedaliah son of Ahikam did not believe them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_15","025_40_15","JER","40","15","15","Then Johanan son of Kareah spoke privately to Gedaliah at Mizpah. “Let me go and kill Ishmael son of Nethaniah,” he said. “No one will know it. Why should he take your life and scatter all the people of Judah who have gathered to you, so that the remnant of Judah would perish?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR40_16","025_40_16","JER","40","16","16","But Gedaliah son of Ahikam said to Johanan son of Kareah, “Do not do such a thing! What you are saying about Ishmael is a lie.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_1","025_41_1","JER","41","1","1","In the seventh month, Ishmael son of Nethaniah, the son of Elishama, who was a member of the royal family and one of the king’s chief officers, came with ten men to Gedaliah son of Ahikam at Mizpah, and they ate a meal together there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_2","025_41_2","JER","41","2","2","Then Ishmael son of Nethaniah and the ten men who were with him got up and struck down Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, with the sword, killing the one whom the king of Babylon had appointed to govern the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_3","025_41_3","JER","41","3","3","Ishmael also killed all the Jews who were with Gedaliah at Mizpah, as well as the Chaldean soldiers who were there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_4","025_41_4","JER","41","4","4","On the second day after the murder of Gedaliah, when no one yet knew about it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_5","025_41_5","JER","41","5","5","eighty men who had shaved off their beards, torn their garments, and cut themselves came from Shechem, Shiloh, and Samaria, carrying grain offerings and frankincense for the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_6","025_41_6","JER","41","6","6","And Ishmael son of Nethaniah went out from Mizpah to meet them, weeping as he went. When Ishmael encountered the men, he said, “Come to Gedaliah son of Ahikam.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_7","025_41_7","JER","41","7","7","And when they came into the city, Ishmael son of Nethaniah and the men with him slaughtered them and threw them into a cistern. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_8","025_41_8","JER","41","8","8","But ten of the men among them said to Ishmael, “Do not kill us, for we have hidden treasure in the field—wheat, barley, oil, and honey!” So he refrained from killing them with the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_9","025_41_9","JER","41","9","9","Now the cistern into which Ishmael had thrown all the bodies of the men he had struck down along with Gedaliah was a large one that King Asa had made for fear of Baasha king of Israel. Ishmael son of Nethaniah filled it with the slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_10","025_41_10","JER","41","10","10","Then Ishmael took captive all the remnant of the people of Mizpah—the daughters of the king along with all the others who remained in Mizpah—over whom Nebuzaradan captain of the guard had appointed Gedaliah son of Ahikam. Ishmael son of Nethaniah took them captive and set off to cross over to the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_11","025_41_11","JER","41","11","11","When Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the armies with him heard of all the crimes that Ishmael son of Nethaniah had committed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_12","025_41_12","JER","41","12","12","they took all their men and went to fight Ishmael son of Nethaniah. And they found him near the great pool in Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_13","025_41_13","JER","41","13","13","When all the people with Ishmael saw Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the army with him, they rejoiced, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_14","025_41_14","JER","41","14","14","and all the people whom Ishmael had taken captive at Mizpah turned and went over to Johanan son of Kareah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_15","025_41_15","JER","41","15","15","But Ishmael son of Nethaniah and eight of his men escaped from Johanan and went to the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_16","025_41_16","JER","41","16","16","Then Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the armies with him took the whole remnant of the people from Mizpah whom he had recovered from Ishmael son of Nethaniah after Ishmael had killed Gedaliah son of Ahikam: the soldiers, women, children, and court officials he had brought back from Gibeon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_17","025_41_17","JER","41","17","17","And they went and stayed in Geruth Chimham, near Bethlehem, in order to proceed into Egypt ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR41_18","025_41_18","JER","41","18","18","to escape the Chaldeans. For they were afraid of the Chaldeans because Ishmael son of Nethaniah had struck down Gedaliah son of Ahikam, whom the king of Babylon had appointed over the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_1","025_42_1","JER","42","1","1","Then all the commanders of the forces, along with Johanan son of Kareah, Jezaniah son of Hoshaiah, and all the people from the least to the greatest, approached ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_2","025_42_2","JER","42","2","2","Jeremiah the prophet and said, “May our petition come before you; pray to the LORD your God on behalf of this entire remnant. For few of us remain of the many, as you can see with your own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_3","025_42_3","JER","42","3","3","Pray that the LORD your God will tell us the way we should walk and the thing we should do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_4","025_42_4","JER","42","4","4","“I have heard you,” replied Jeremiah the prophet. “I will surely pray to the LORD your God as you request, and I will tell you everything that the LORD answers. I will not withhold a word from you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_5","025_42_5","JER","42","5","5","Then they said to Jeremiah, “May the LORD be a true and faithful witness against us if we do not act upon every word that the LORD your God sends you to tell us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_6","025_42_6","JER","42","6","6","Whether it is pleasant or unpleasant, we will obey the voice of the LORD our God to whom we are sending you, so that it may go well with us when we obey the voice of the LORD our God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_7","025_42_7","JER","42","7","7","After ten days the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_8","025_42_8","JER","42","8","8","and he summoned Johanan son of Kareah, all the commanders of the forces who were with him, and all the people from the least to the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_9","025_42_9","JER","42","9","9","Jeremiah told them, “Thus says the LORD, the God of Israel, to whom you sent me to present your petition: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_10","025_42_10","JER","42","10","10","‘If you will indeed stay in this land, then I will build you up and not tear you down; I will plant you and not uproot you, for I will relent of the disaster I have brought upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_11","025_42_11","JER","42","11","11","Do not be afraid of the king of Babylon, whom you now fear; do not be afraid of him, declares the LORD, for I am with you to save you and deliver you from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_12","025_42_12","JER","42","12","12","And I will show you compassion, and he will have compassion on you and restore you to your own land.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_13","025_42_13","JER","42","13","13","But if you say, ‘We will not stay in this land,’ and you thus disobey the voice of the LORD your God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_14","025_42_14","JER","42","14","14","and if you say, ‘No, but we will go to the land of Egypt and live there, where we will not see war or hear the sound of the ram’s horn or hunger for bread,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_15","025_42_15","JER","42","15","15","then hear the word of the LORD, O remnant of Judah! This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘If you are determined to go to Egypt and reside there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_16","025_42_16","JER","42","16","16","then the sword you fear will overtake you there, and the famine you dread will follow on your heels into Egypt, and you will die there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_17","025_42_17","JER","42","17","17","So all who resolve to go to Egypt to reside there will die by sword and famine and plague. Not one of them will survive or escape the disaster I will bring upon them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_18","025_42_18","JER","42","18","18","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘Just as My anger and wrath were poured out on the residents of Jerusalem, so will My wrath be poured out on you if you go to Egypt. You will become an object of cursing and horror, of vilification and disgrace, and you will never see this place again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_19","025_42_19","JER","42","19","19","The LORD has told you, O remnant of Judah, ‘Do not go to Egypt.’ Know for sure that I have warned you today! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_20","025_42_20","JER","42","20","20","For you have deceived yourselves by sending me to the LORD your God, saying, ‘Pray to the LORD our God on our behalf, and as for all that the LORD our God says, tell it to us and we will do it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_21","025_42_21","JER","42","21","21","For I have told you today, but you have not obeyed the voice of the LORD your God in all He has sent me to tell you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR42_22","025_42_22","JER","42","22","22","Now therefore, know for sure that by sword and famine and plague you will die in the place where you desire to go to reside.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_1","025_43_1","JER","43","1","1","When Jeremiah had finished telling all the people all the words of the LORD their God—everything that the LORD had sent him to say— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_2","025_43_2","JER","43","2","2","Azariah son of Hoshaiah, Johanan son of Kareah, and all the arrogant men said to Jeremiah, “You are lying! The LORD our God has not sent you to say, ‘You must not go to Egypt to reside there.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_3","025_43_3","JER","43","3","3","Rather, Baruch son of Neriah is inciting you against us to deliver us into the hands of the Chaldeans, so that they may put us to death or exile us to Babylon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_4","025_43_4","JER","43","4","4","So Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the forces disobeyed the command of the LORD to stay in the land of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_5","025_43_5","JER","43","5","5","Instead, Johanan son of Kareah and all the commanders of the forces took the whole remnant of Judah, those who had returned to the land of Judah from all the nations to which they had been scattered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_6","025_43_6","JER","43","6","6","the men, the women, the children, the king’s daughters, and everyone whom Nebuzaradan captain of the guard had allowed to remain with Gedaliah son of Ahikam, the son of Shaphan, as well as Jeremiah the prophet and Baruch son of Neriah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_7","025_43_7","JER","43","7","7","So they entered the land of Egypt because they did not obey the voice of the LORD, and they went as far as Tahpanhes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_8","025_43_8","JER","43","8","8","Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah at Tahpanhes: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_9","025_43_9","JER","43","9","9","“In the sight of the Jews, pick up some large stones and bury them in the clay of the brick pavement at the entrance to Pharaoh’s palace at Tahpanhes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_10","025_43_10","JER","43","10","10","Then tell them that this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: ‘I will send for My servant Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, and I will set his throne over these stones that I have embedded, and he will spread his royal pavilion over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_11","025_43_11","JER","43","11","11","He will come and strike down the land of Egypt, bringing death to those destined for death, captivity to those destined for captivity, and the sword to those destined for the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_12","025_43_12","JER","43","12","12","I will kindle a fire in the temples of the gods of Egypt, and Nebuchadnezzar will burn those temples and take their gods as captives. So he will wrap himself with the land of Egypt as a shepherd wraps himself in his garment, and he will depart from there unscathed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR43_13","025_43_13","JER","43","13","13","He will demolish the sacred pillars of the temple of the sun in the land of Egypt, and he will burn down the temples of the gods of Egypt.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_1","025_44_1","JER","44","1","1","This is the word that came to Jeremiah concerning all the Jews living in the land of Egypt—in Migdol, Tahpanhes, and Memphis—and in the land of Pathros: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_2","025_44_2","JER","44","2","2","“This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: You have seen all the disaster that I brought against Jerusalem and all the cities of Judah; and behold, they lie today in ruins and desolation ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_3","025_44_3","JER","44","3","3","because of the evil they have done. They provoked Me to anger by continuing to burn incense and to serve other gods that neither they nor you nor your fathers ever knew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_4","025_44_4","JER","44","4","4","Yet I sent you all My servants the prophets again and again, saying: ‘Do not do this detestable thing that I hate.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_5","025_44_5","JER","44","5","5","But they did not listen or incline their ears; they did not turn from their wickedness or stop burning incense to other gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_6","025_44_6","JER","44","6","6","Therefore My wrath and anger poured out and burned in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem, so that they have become the desolate ruin they are today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_7","025_44_7","JER","44","7","7","So now, this is what the LORD God of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: Why are you doing such great harm to yourselves by cutting off from Judah man and woman, child and infant, leaving yourselves without a remnant? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_8","025_44_8","JER","44","8","8","Why are you provoking Me to anger by the work of your hands by burning incense to other gods in the land of Egypt, where you have gone to reside? As a result, you will be cut off and will become an object of cursing and reproach among all the nations of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_9","025_44_9","JER","44","9","9","Have you forgotten the wickedness of your fathers and of the kings of Judah and their wives, as well as the wickedness that you and your wives committed in the land of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_10","025_44_10","JER","44","10","10","To this day they have not humbled themselves or shown reverence, nor have they followed My instruction or the statutes that I set before you and your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_11","025_44_11","JER","44","11","11","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: I will set My face to bring disaster and to cut off all Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_12","025_44_12","JER","44","12","12","And I will take away the remnant of Judah who have resolved to go to the land of Egypt to reside there; they will meet their end. They will all fall by the sword or be consumed by famine. From the least to the greatest, they will die by sword or famine; and they will become an object of cursing and horror, of vilification and reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_13","025_44_13","JER","44","13","13","I will punish those who live in the land of Egypt, just as I punished Jerusalem, by sword and famine and plague, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_14","025_44_14","JER","44","14","14","so that none of the remnant of Judah who have gone to reside in Egypt will escape or survive to return to the land of Judah, where they long to return and live; for none will return except a few fugitives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_15","025_44_15","JER","44","15","15","Then all the men who knew that their wives were burning incense to other gods, and all the women standing by—a great assembly—along with all the people living in the land of Egypt and in Pathros, said to Jeremiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_16","025_44_16","JER","44","16","16","“As for the word you have spoken to us in the name of the LORD, we will not listen to you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_17","025_44_17","JER","44","17","17","Instead, we will do everything we vowed to do: We will burn incense to the Queen of Heaven and offer drink offerings to her, just as we, our fathers, our kings, and our officials did in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem. At that time we had plenty of food and good things, and we saw no disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_18","025_44_18","JER","44","18","18","But from the time we stopped burning incense to the Queen of Heaven and pouring out drink offerings to her, we have lacked everything and have been perishing by sword and famine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_19","025_44_19","JER","44","19","19","“Moreover,” said the women, “when we burned incense to the Queen of Heaven and poured out drink offerings to her, was it without our husbands’ knowledge that we made sacrificial cakes in her image and poured out drink offerings to her?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_20","025_44_20","JER","44","20","20","Then Jeremiah said to all the people, both men and women, who were answering him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_21","025_44_21","JER","44","21","21","“As for the incense you burned in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem—you, your fathers, your kings, your officials, and the people of the land—did the LORD not remember and bring this to mind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_22","025_44_22","JER","44","22","22","So the LORD could no longer endure the evil deeds and detestable acts you committed, and your land became a desolation, a horror, and an object of cursing, without inhabitant, as it is this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_23","025_44_23","JER","44","23","23","Because you burned incense and sinned against the LORD and did not obey the voice of the LORD or walk in His instruction, His statutes, and His testimonies, this disaster has befallen you, as you see today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_24","025_44_24","JER","44","24","24","Then Jeremiah said to all the people, including all the women, “Hear the word of the LORD, all those of Judah who are in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_25","025_44_25","JER","44","25","25","This is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: As for you and your wives, you have spoken with your mouths and fulfilled with your hands your words: ‘We will surely perform our vows that we have made to burn incense to the Queen of Heaven and to pour out drink offerings to her.’ Go ahead, then, do what you have promised! Keep your vows! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_26","025_44_26","JER","44","26","26","Nevertheless, hear the word of the LORD, all you people of Judah living in Egypt: Behold, I have sworn by My great name, says the LORD, that never again will any man of Judah living in the land of Egypt invoke My name or say, ‘As surely as the Lord GOD lives.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_27","025_44_27","JER","44","27","27","I am watching over them for harm and not for good, and every man of Judah who is in the land of Egypt will meet his end by sword or famine, until they are finished off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_28","025_44_28","JER","44","28","28","Those who escape the sword will return from Egypt to Judah, few in number, and the whole remnant of Judah who went to dwell in the land of Egypt will know whose word will stand, Mine or theirs! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_29","025_44_29","JER","44","29","29","This will be a sign to you that I will punish you in this place, declares the LORD, so that you may know that My threats of harm against you will surely stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR44_30","025_44_30","JER","44","30","30","This is what the LORD says: Behold, I will deliver Pharaoh Hophra king of Egypt into the hands of his enemies who seek his life, just as I delivered Zedekiah king of Judah into the hand of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, the enemy who was seeking his life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR45_1","025_45_1","JER","45","1","1","This is the word that Jeremiah the prophet spoke to Baruch son of Neriah when he wrote these words on a scroll at the dictation of Jeremiah in the fourth year of Jehoiakim son of Josiah, king of Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR45_2","025_45_2","JER","45","2","2","“This is what the LORD, the God of Israel, says to you, Baruch: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR45_3","025_45_3","JER","45","3","3","You have said, ‘Woe is me because the LORD has added sorrow to my pain! I am worn out with groaning and have found no rest.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR45_4","025_45_4","JER","45","4","4","Thus Jeremiah was to say to Baruch: “This is what the LORD says: Throughout the land I will demolish what I have built and uproot what I have planted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR45_5","025_45_5","JER","45","5","5","But as for you, do you seek great things for yourself? Stop seeking! For I will bring disaster on every living creature, declares the LORD, but wherever you go, I will grant your life as a spoil of war.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_1","025_46_1","JER","46","1","1","This is the word of the LORD about the nations—the word that came to Jeremiah the prophet ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_2","025_46_2","JER","46","2","2","concerning Egypt and the army of Pharaoh Neco king of Egypt, which was defeated at Carchemish on the Euphrates River by Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_3","025_46_3","JER","46","3","3","“Deploy your shields, small and large; advance for battle! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_4","025_46_4","JER","46","4","4","Harness the horses; mount the steeds; take your positions with helmets on! Polish your spears; put on armor! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_5","025_46_5","JER","46","5","5","Why am I seeing this? They are terrified, they are retreating; their warriors are defeated, they flee in haste without looking back; terror is on every side!” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_6","025_46_6","JER","46","6","6","“The swift cannot flee, and the warrior cannot escape! In the north by the River Euphrates they stumble and fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_7","025_46_7","JER","46","7","7","Who is this, rising like the Nile, like rivers whose waters churn? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_8","025_46_8","JER","46","8","8","Egypt rises like the Nile, and its waters churn like rivers, boasting, ‘I will rise and cover the earth; I will destroy the cities and their people.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_9","025_46_9","JER","46","9","9","Advance, O horses! Race furiously, O chariots! Let the warriors come forth—Cush and Put carrying their shields, men of Lydia drawing the bow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_10","025_46_10","JER","46","10","10","For that day belongs to the Lord GOD of Hosts, a day of vengeance against His foes. The sword will devour until it is satisfied, until it is quenched with their blood. For the Lord GOD of Hosts will hold a sacrifice in the land of the north by the River Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_11","025_46_11","JER","46","11","11","Go up to Gilead for balm, O Virgin Daughter of Egypt! In vain you try many remedies, but for you there is no healing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_12","025_46_12","JER","46","12","12","The nations have heard of your shame, and your outcry fills the earth, because warrior stumbles over warrior and both of them have fallen together.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_13","025_46_13","JER","46","13","13","This is the word that the LORD spoke to Jeremiah the prophet about the coming of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon to strike the land of Egypt: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_14","025_46_14","JER","46","14","14","“Announce it in Egypt, and proclaim it in Migdol; proclaim it in Memphis and Tahpanhes: ‘Take your positions and prepare yourself, for the sword devours those around you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_15","025_46_15","JER","46","15","15","Why have your warriors been laid low? They cannot stand, for the LORD has thrust them down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_16","025_46_16","JER","46","16","16","They continue to stumble; indeed, they have fallen over one another. They say, ‘Get up! Let us return to our people and to the land of our birth, away from the sword of the oppressor.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_17","025_46_17","JER","46","17","17","There they will cry out: ‘Pharaoh king of Egypt was all noise; he has let the appointed time pass him by.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_18","025_46_18","JER","46","18","18","As surely as I live, declares the King, whose name is the LORD of Hosts, there will come one who is like Tabor among the mountains and like Carmel by the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_19","025_46_19","JER","46","19","19","Pack your bags for exile, O daughter dwelling in Egypt! For Memphis will be laid waste, destroyed and uninhabited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_20","025_46_20","JER","46","20","20","Egypt is a beautiful heifer, but a gadfly from the north is coming against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_21","025_46_21","JER","46","21","21","Even the mercenaries among her are like fattened calves. They too will turn back; together they will flee, they will not stand their ground, for the day of calamity is coming upon them—the time of their punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_22","025_46_22","JER","46","22","22","Egypt will hiss like a fleeing serpent, for the enemy will advance in force; with axes they will come against her like woodsmen cutting down trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_23","025_46_23","JER","46","23","23","They will chop down her forest, declares the LORD, dense though it may be, for they are more numerous than locusts; they cannot be counted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_24","025_46_24","JER","46","24","24","The Daughter of Egypt will be put to shame; she will be delivered into the hands of the people of the north.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_25","025_46_25","JER","46","25","25","The LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “Behold, I am about to punish Amon god of Thebes, along with Pharaoh, Egypt with her gods and kings, and those who trust in Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_26","025_46_26","JER","46","26","26","I will deliver them into the hands of those who seek their lives—of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon and his officers. But after this, Egypt will be inhabited as in days of old, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_27","025_46_27","JER","46","27","27","But you, O Jacob My servant, do not be afraid, and do not be dismayed, O Israel. For I will surely save you out of a distant place, your descendants from the land of their captivity! Jacob will return to quiet and ease, with no one to make him afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR46_28","025_46_28","JER","46","28","28","And you, My servant Jacob, do not be afraid, declares the LORD, for I am with you. Though I will completely destroy all the nations to which I have banished you, I will not completely destroy you. Yet I will discipline you justly, and will by no means leave you unpunished.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_1","025_47_1","JER","47","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Jeremiah the prophet about the Philistines before Pharaoh struck down Gaza. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_2","025_47_2","JER","47","2","2","This is what the LORD says: “See how the waters are rising from the north and becoming an overflowing torrent. They will overflow the land and its fullness, the cities and their inhabitants. The people will cry out, and all who dwell in the land will wail ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_3","025_47_3","JER","47","3","3","at the sound of the galloping hooves of stallions, the rumbling of chariots, and the clatter of their wheels. The fathers will not turn back for their sons; their hands will hang limp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_4","025_47_4","JER","47","4","4","For the day has come to destroy all the Philistines, to cut off from Tyre and Sidon every remaining ally. Indeed, the LORD is about to destroy the Philistines, the remnant from the coasts of Caphtor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_5","025_47_5","JER","47","5","5","The people of Gaza will shave their heads in mourning; Ashkelon will be silenced. O remnant of their valley, how long will you gash yourself? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_6","025_47_6","JER","47","6","6","‘Alas, O sword of the LORD, how long until you rest? Return to your sheath; cease and be still!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR47_7","025_47_7","JER","47","7","7","How can it rest when the LORD has commanded it? He has appointed it against Ashkelon and the shore of its coastland.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_1","025_48_1","JER","48","1","1","Concerning Moab, this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “Woe to Nebo, for it will be devastated. Kiriathaim will be captured and disgraced; the fortress will be shattered and dismantled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_2","025_48_2","JER","48","2","2","There is no longer praise for Moab; in Heshbon they devise evil against her: ‘Come, let us cut her off from nationhood.’ You too, O people of Madmen, will be silenced; the sword will pursue you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_3","025_48_3","JER","48","3","3","A voice cries out from Horonaim: ‘Devastation and great destruction!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_4","025_48_4","JER","48","4","4","Moab will be shattered; her little ones will cry out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_5","025_48_5","JER","48","5","5","For on the ascent to Luhith they weep bitterly as they go, and on the descent to Horonaim cries of distress resound over the destruction: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_6","025_48_6","JER","48","6","6","‘Flee! Run for your lives! Become like a juniper in the desert.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_7","025_48_7","JER","48","7","7","Because you trust in your works and treasures, you too will be captured, and Chemosh will go into exile with his priests and officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_8","025_48_8","JER","48","8","8","The destroyer will move against every city, and not one town will escape. The valley will also be ruined, and the high plain will be destroyed, as the LORD has said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_9","025_48_9","JER","48","9","9","Put salt on Moab, for she will be laid waste; her cities will become desolate, with no one to dwell in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_10","025_48_10","JER","48","10","10","Cursed is the one who is remiss in doing the work of the LORD, and cursed is he who withholds his sword from bloodshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_11","025_48_11","JER","48","11","11","Moab has been at ease from youth, settled like wine on its dregs; he has not been poured from vessel to vessel or gone into exile. So his flavor has remained the same, and his aroma is unchanged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_12","025_48_12","JER","48","12","12","Therefore behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will send to him wanderers, who will pour him out. They will empty his vessels and shatter his jars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_13","025_48_13","JER","48","13","13","Then Moab will be ashamed of Chemosh, just as the house of Israel was ashamed when they trusted in Bethel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_14","025_48_14","JER","48","14","14","How can you say, ‘We are warriors, mighty men ready for battle’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_15","025_48_15","JER","48","15","15","Moab has been destroyed and its towns have been invaded; the best of its young men have gone down in the slaughter, declares the King, whose name is the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_16","025_48_16","JER","48","16","16","Moab’s calamity is at hand, and his affliction is rushing swiftly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_17","025_48_17","JER","48","17","17","Mourn for him, all you who surround him, everyone who knows his name; tell how the mighty scepter is shattered—the glorious staff! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_18","025_48_18","JER","48","18","18","Come down from your glory; sit on parched ground, O daughter dwelling in Dibon, for the destroyer of Moab has come against you; he has destroyed your fortresses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_19","025_48_19","JER","48","19","19","Stand by the road and watch, O dweller of Aroer! Ask the man fleeing or the woman escaping, ‘What has happened?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_20","025_48_20","JER","48","20","20","Moab is put to shame, for it has been shattered. Wail and cry out! Declare by the Arnon that Moab is destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_21","025_48_21","JER","48","21","21","Judgment has come upon the high plain—upon Holon, Jahzah, and Mephaath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_22","025_48_22","JER","48","22","22","upon Dibon, Nebo, and Beth-diblathaim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_23","025_48_23","JER","48","23","23","upon Kiriathaim, Beth-gamul, and Beth-meon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_24","025_48_24","JER","48","24","24","upon Kerioth, Bozrah, and all the towns of Moab, those far and near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_25","025_48_25","JER","48","25","25","The horn of Moab has been cut off, and his arm is broken,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_26","025_48_26","JER","48","26","26","“Make him drunk, because he has magnified himself against the LORD; so Moab will wallow in his own vomit, and he will also become a laughingstock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_27","025_48_27","JER","48","27","27","Was not Israel your object of ridicule? Was he ever found among thieves? For whenever you speak of him you shake your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_28","025_48_28","JER","48","28","28","Abandon the towns and settle among the rocks, O dwellers of Moab! Be like a dove that nests at the mouth of a cave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_29","025_48_29","JER","48","29","29","We have heard of Moab’s pomposity, his exceeding pride and conceit, his proud arrogance and haughtiness of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_30","025_48_30","JER","48","30","30","I know his insolence,” declares the LORD, “but it is futile. His boasting is as empty as his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_31","025_48_31","JER","48","31","31","Therefore I will wail for Moab; I will cry out for all of Moab; I will moan for the men of Kir-heres. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_32","025_48_32","JER","48","32","32","I will weep for you, O vine of Sibmah, more than I weep for Jazer. Your tendrils have extended to the sea; they reach even to Jazer. The destroyer has descended on your summer fruit and grape harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_33","025_48_33","JER","48","33","33","Joy and gladness are removed from the orchard and from the fields of Moab. I have stopped the flow of wine from the presses; no one treads them with shouts of joy; their shouts are not for joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_34","025_48_34","JER","48","34","34","There is a cry from Heshbon to Elealeh; they raise their voices to Jahaz, from Zoar to Horonaim and Eglath-shelishiyah; for even the waters of Nimrim have dried up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_35","025_48_35","JER","48","35","35","In Moab, declares the LORD, I will bring an end to those who make offerings on the high places and burn incense to their gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_36","025_48_36","JER","48","36","36","Therefore My heart laments like a flute for Moab; it laments like a flute for the men of Kir-heres, because the wealth they acquired has perished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_37","025_48_37","JER","48","37","37","For every head is shaved and every beard is clipped; on every hand is a gash, and around every waist is sackcloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_38","025_48_38","JER","48","38","38","On all the rooftops of Moab and in the public squares, everyone is mourning; for I have shattered Moab like an unwanted jar,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_39","025_48_39","JER","48","39","39","“How shattered it is! How they wail! How Moab has turned his back in shame! Moab has become an object of ridicule and horror to all those around him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_40","025_48_40","JER","48","40","40","For this is what the LORD says: “Behold, an eagle swoops down and spreads his wings against Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_41","025_48_41","JER","48","41","41","Kirioth has been taken, and the strongholds seized. In that day the heart of Moab’s warriors will be like the heart of a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_42","025_48_42","JER","48","42","42","Moab will be destroyed as a nation because he vaunted himself against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_43","025_48_43","JER","48","43","43","Terror and pit and snare await you, O dweller of Moab,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_44","025_48_44","JER","48","44","44","“Whoever flees the panic will fall into the pit, and whoever climbs from the pit will be caught in the snare. For I will bring upon Moab the year of their punishment,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_45","025_48_45","JER","48","45","45","“Those who flee will stand helpless in Heshbon’s shadow, because fire has gone forth from Heshbon and a flame from within Sihon. It devours the foreheads of Moab and the skulls of the sons of tumult. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_46","025_48_46","JER","48","46","46","Woe to you, O Moab! The people of Chemosh have perished; for your sons have been taken into exile and your daughters have gone into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR48_47","025_48_47","JER","48","47","47","Yet in the latter days I will restore Moab from captivity,” declares the LORD. Here ends the judgment on Moab. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_1","025_49_1","JER","49","1","1","Concerning the Ammonites, this is what the LORD says: “Has Israel no sons? Is he without heir? Why then has Milcom taken possession of Gad? Why have his people settled in their cities? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_2","025_49_2","JER","49","2","2","Therefore, behold, the days are coming, declares the LORD, when I will sound the battle cry against Rabbah of the Ammonites. It will become a heap of ruins, and its villages will be burned. Then Israel will drive out their dispossessors, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_3","025_49_3","JER","49","3","3","Wail, O Heshbon, for Ai has been destroyed; cry out, O daughters of Rabbah! Put on sackcloth and mourn; run back and forth within your walls, for Milcom will go into exile together with his priests and officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_4","025_49_4","JER","49","4","4","Why do you boast of your valleys—your valleys so fruitful, O faithless daughter? You trust in your riches and say, ‘Who can come against me?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_5","025_49_5","JER","49","5","5","Behold, I am about to bring terror upon you, declares the Lord GOD of Hosts, from all those around you. You will each be driven headlong, with no one to regather the fugitives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_6","025_49_6","JER","49","6","6","Yet afterward I will restore the Ammonites from captivity,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_7","025_49_7","JER","49","7","7","Concerning Edom, this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Is there no longer wisdom in Teman? Has counsel perished from the prudent? Has their wisdom decayed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_8","025_49_8","JER","49","8","8","Turn and run! Lie low, O dwellers of Dedan, for I will bring disaster on Esau at the time I punish him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_9","025_49_9","JER","49","9","9","If grape gatherers came to you, would they not leave some gleanings? Were thieves to come in the night, would they not steal only what they wanted? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_10","025_49_10","JER","49","10","10","But I will strip Esau bare; I will uncover his hiding places, and he will be unable to conceal himself. His descendants will be destroyed along with his relatives and neighbors, and he will be no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_11","025_49_11","JER","49","11","11","Abandon your orphans; I will preserve their lives. Let your widows trust in Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_12","025_49_12","JER","49","12","12","For this is what the LORD says: “If those who do not deserve to drink the cup must drink it, can you possibly remain unpunished? You will not go unpunished, for you must drink it too. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_13","025_49_13","JER","49","13","13","For by Myself I have sworn, declares the LORD, that Bozrah will become a desolation, a disgrace, a ruin, and a curse, and all her cities will be in ruins forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_14","025_49_14","JER","49","14","14","I have heard a message from the LORD; an envoy has been sent to the nations: “Assemble yourselves to march against her! Rise up for battle!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_15","025_49_15","JER","49","15","15","“For behold, I will make you small among nations, despised among men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_16","025_49_16","JER","49","16","16","The terror you cause and the pride of your heart have deceived you, O dwellers in the clefts of the rocks, O occupiers of the mountain summit. Though you elevate your nest like the eagle, even from there I will bring you down,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_17","025_49_17","JER","49","17","17","“Edom will become an object of horror. All who pass by will be appalled and will scoff at all her wounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_18","025_49_18","JER","49","18","18","As Sodom and Gomorrah were overthrown along with their neighbors,” says the LORD, “no one will dwell there; no man will abide there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_19","025_49_19","JER","49","19","19","Behold, one will come up like a lion from the thickets of the Jordan to the watered pasture. For in an instant I will chase Edom from her land. Who is the chosen one I will appoint for this? For who is like Me, and who can challenge Me? What shepherd can stand against Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_20","025_49_20","JER","49","20","20","Therefore hear the plans that the LORD has drawn up against Edom and the strategies He has devised against the people of Teman: Surely the little ones of the flock will be dragged away; certainly their pasture will be made desolate because of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_21","025_49_21","JER","49","21","21","At the sound of their fall the earth will quake; their cry will resound to the Red Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_22","025_49_22","JER","49","22","22","Look! An eagle will soar and swoop down, spreading its wings over Bozrah. In that day the hearts of Edom’s mighty men will be like the heart of a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_23","025_49_23","JER","49","23","23","Concerning Damascus: “Hamath and Arpad are put to shame, for they have heard a bad report; they are agitated like the sea; their anxiety cannot be calmed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_24","025_49_24","JER","49","24","24","Damascus has become feeble; she has turned to flee. Panic has gripped her; anguish and pain have seized her like a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_25","025_49_25","JER","49","25","25","How is the city of praise not forsaken, the town that brings Me joy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_26","025_49_26","JER","49","26","26","For her young men will fall in the streets, and all her warriors will be silenced in that day,” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_27","025_49_27","JER","49","27","27","“I will set fire to the walls of Damascus; it will consume the fortresses of Ben-hadad.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_28","025_49_28","JER","49","28","28","Concerning Kedar and the kingdoms of Hazor, which Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon defeated, this is what the LORD says: “Rise up, advance against Kedar, and destroy the people of the east! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_29","025_49_29","JER","49","29","29","They will take their tents and flocks, their tent curtains and all their goods. They will take their camels for themselves. They will shout to them: ‘Terror is on every side!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_30","025_49_30","JER","49","30","30","Run! Escape quickly! Lie low, O residents of Hazor,” declares the LORD, “for Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon has drawn up a plan against you; he has devised a strategy against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_31","025_49_31","JER","49","31","31","Rise up, advance against a nation at ease, one that dwells securely,” declares the LORD. “They have no gates or bars; they live alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_32","025_49_32","JER","49","32","32","Their camels will become plunder, and their large herds will be spoil. I will scatter to the wind in every direction those who shave their temples; I will bring calamity on them from all sides,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_33","025_49_33","JER","49","33","33","“Hazor will become a haunt for jackals, a desolation forever. No one will dwell there; no man will abide there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_34","025_49_34","JER","49","34","34","This is the word of the LORD that came to Jeremiah the prophet concerning Elam at the beginning of the reign of Zedekiah king of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_35","025_49_35","JER","49","35","35","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Behold, I will shatter Elam’s bow, the mainstay of their might. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_36","025_49_36","JER","49","36","36","I will bring the four winds against Elam from the four corners of the heavens, and I will scatter them to all these winds. There will not be a nation to which Elam’s exiles will not go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_37","025_49_37","JER","49","37","37","So I will shatter Elam before their foes, before those who seek their lives. I will bring disaster upon them, even My fierce anger,” declares the LORD. “I will send out the sword after them until I finish them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_38","025_49_38","JER","49","38","38","I will set My throne in Elam, and destroy its king and officials,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR49_39","025_49_39","JER","49","39","39","“Yet in the last days, I will restore Elam from captivity,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_1","025_50_1","JER","50","1","1","This is the word that the LORD spoke through Jeremiah the prophet concerning Babylon and the land of the Chaldeans: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_2","025_50_2","JER","50","2","2","“Announce and declare to the nations; lift up a banner and proclaim it; hold nothing back when you say, ‘Babylon is captured; Bel is put to shame; Marduk is shattered, her images are disgraced, her idols are broken in pieces.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_3","025_50_3","JER","50","3","3","For a nation from the north will come against her; it will make her land a desolation. No one will live in it; both man and beast will flee.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_4","025_50_4","JER","50","4","4","“In those days and at that time, declares the LORD, the children of Israel and the children of Judah will come together, weeping as they come, and will seek the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_5","025_50_5","JER","50","5","5","They will ask the way to Zion and turn their faces toward it. They will come and join themselves to the LORD in an everlasting covenant that will never be forgotten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_6","025_50_6","JER","50","6","6","My people are lost sheep; their shepherds have led them astray, causing them to roam the mountains. They have wandered from mountain to hill; they have forgotten their resting place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_7","025_50_7","JER","50","7","7","All who found them devoured them, and their enemies said, ‘We are not guilty, for they have sinned against the LORD, their true pasture, the LORD, the hope of their fathers.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_8","025_50_8","JER","50","8","8","Flee from the midst of Babylon; depart from the land of the Chaldeans; be like the he-goats that lead the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_9","025_50_9","JER","50","9","9","For behold, I stir up and bring against Babylon an assembly of great nations from the land of the north. They will line up against her; from the north she will be captured. Their arrows will be like skilled warriors who do not return empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_10","025_50_10","JER","50","10","10","Chaldea will be plundered; all who plunder her will have their fill,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_11","025_50_11","JER","50","11","11","“Because you rejoice, because you sing in triumph—you who plunder My inheritance—because you frolic like a heifer treading grain and neigh like stallions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_12","025_50_12","JER","50","12","12","your mother will be greatly ashamed; she who bore you will be disgraced. Behold, she will be the least of the nations, a wilderness, a dry land, and a desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_13","025_50_13","JER","50","13","13","Because of the wrath of the LORD, she will not be inhabited; she will become completely desolate. All who pass through Babylon will be horrified and will hiss at all her wounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_14","025_50_14","JER","50","14","14","Line up in formation around Babylon, all you who draw the bow! Shoot at her! Spare no arrows! For she has sinned against the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_15","025_50_15","JER","50","15","15","Raise a war cry against her on every side! She has thrown up her hands in surrender; her towers have fallen; her walls are torn down. Since this is the vengeance of the LORD, take out your vengeance upon her; as she has done, do the same to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_16","025_50_16","JER","50","16","16","Cut off the sower from Babylon, and the one who wields the sickle at harvest time. In the face of the oppressor’s sword, each will turn to his own people, each will flee to his own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_17","025_50_17","JER","50","17","17","Israel is a scattered flock, chased away by lions. The first to devour him was the king of Assyria; the last to crush his bones was Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_18","025_50_18","JER","50","18","18","Therefore this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “I will punish the king of Babylon and his land as I punished the king of Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_19","025_50_19","JER","50","19","19","I will return Israel to his pasture, and he will graze on Carmel and Bashan; his soul will be satisfied on the hills of Ephraim and Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_20","025_50_20","JER","50","20","20","In those days and at that time, declares the LORD, a search will be made for Israel’s guilt, but there will be none, and for Judah’s sins, but they will not be found; for I will forgive the remnant I preserve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_21","025_50_21","JER","50","21","21","Go up against the land of Merathaim, and against the residents of Pekod. Kill them and devote them to destruction. Do all that I have commanded you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_22","025_50_22","JER","50","22","22","“The noise of battle is in the land—the noise of great destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_23","025_50_23","JER","50","23","23","How the hammer of the whole earth lies broken and shattered! What a horror Babylon has become among the nations! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_24","025_50_24","JER","50","24","24","I laid a snare for you, O Babylon, and you were caught before you knew it. You were found and captured because you challenged the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_25","025_50_25","JER","50","25","25","The LORD has opened His armory and brought out His weapons of wrath, for this is the work of the Lord GOD of Hosts in the land of the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_26","025_50_26","JER","50","26","26","Come against her from the farthest border. Break open her granaries; pile her up like mounds of grain. Devote her to destruction; leave her no survivors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_27","025_50_27","JER","50","27","27","Kill all her young bulls; let them go down to the slaughter. Woe to them, for their day has come—the time of their punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_28","025_50_28","JER","50","28","28","Listen to the fugitives and refugees from the land of Babylon, declaring in Zion the vengeance of the LORD our God, the vengeance for His temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_29","025_50_29","JER","50","29","29","Summon the archers against Babylon, all who string the bow. Encamp all around her; let no one escape. Repay her according to her deeds; do to her as she has done. For she has defied the LORD, the Holy One of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_30","025_50_30","JER","50","30","30","Therefore, her young men will fall in the streets, and all her warriors will be silenced in that day,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_31","025_50_31","JER","50","31","31","“Behold, I am against you, O arrogant one,” declares the Lord GOD of Hosts, “for your day has come, the time when I will punish you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_32","025_50_32","JER","50","32","32","The arrogant one will stumble and fall with no one to pick him up. And I will kindle a fire in his cities to consume all those around him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_33","025_50_33","JER","50","33","33","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “The sons of Israel are oppressed, and the sons of Judah as well. All their captors hold them fast, refusing to release them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_34","025_50_34","JER","50","34","34","Their Redeemer is strong; the LORD of Hosts is His name. He will fervently plead their case so that He may bring rest to the earth, but turmoil to those who live in Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_35","025_50_35","JER","50","35","35","A sword is against the Chaldeans, declares the LORD, against those who live in Babylon, and against her officials and wise men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_36","025_50_36","JER","50","36","36","A sword is against her false prophets, and they will become fools. A sword is against her warriors, and they will be filled with terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_37","025_50_37","JER","50","37","37","A sword is against her horses and chariots and against all the foreigners in her midst, and they will become like women. A sword is against her treasuries, and they will be plundered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_38","025_50_38","JER","50","38","38","A drought is upon her waters, and they will be dried up. For it is a land of graven images, and the people go mad over idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_39","025_50_39","JER","50","39","39","So the desert creatures and hyenas will live there and ostriches will dwell there. It will never again be inhabited or lived in from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_40","025_50_40","JER","50","40","40","As God overthrew Sodom and Gomorrah along with their neighbors,” declares the LORD, “no one will dwell there; no man will abide there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_41","025_50_41","JER","50","41","41","Behold, an army is coming from the north; a great nation and many kings are stirred up from the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_42","025_50_42","JER","50","42","42","They grasp the bow and spear; they are cruel and merciless. Their voice roars like the sea, and they ride upon horses, lined up like men in formation against you, O Daughter of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_43","025_50_43","JER","50","43","43","The king of Babylon has heard the report, and his hands hang limp. Anguish has gripped him, pain like that of a woman in labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_44","025_50_44","JER","50","44","44","Behold, one will come up like a lion from the thickets of the Jordan to the watered pasture. For in an instant I will chase Babylon from her land. Who is the chosen one I will appoint for this? For who is like Me, and who can challenge Me? What shepherd can stand against Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_45","025_50_45","JER","50","45","45","Therefore hear the plans that the LORD has drawn up against Babylon and the strategies He has devised against the land of the Chaldeans: Surely the little ones of the flock will be dragged away; certainly their pasture will be made desolate because of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR50_46","025_50_46","JER","50","46","46","At the sound of Babylon’s capture the earth will quake; a cry will be heard among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_1","025_51_1","JER","51","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “Behold, I will stir up against Babylon and against the people of Leb-kamai the spirit of a destroyer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_2","025_51_2","JER","51","2","2","I will send strangers to Babylon to winnow her and empty her land; for they will come against her from every side in her day of disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_3","025_51_3","JER","51","3","3","Do not let the archer bend his bow or put on his armor. Do not spare her young men; devote all her army to destruction! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_4","025_51_4","JER","51","4","4","And they will fall slain in the land of the Chaldeans, and pierced through in her streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_5","025_51_5","JER","51","5","5","For Israel and Judah have not been abandoned by their God, the LORD of Hosts, though their land is full of guilt before the Holy One of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_6","025_51_6","JER","51","6","6","Flee from Babylon! Escape with your lives! Do not be destroyed in her punishment. For this is the time of the LORD’s vengeance; He will pay her what she deserves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_7","025_51_7","JER","51","7","7","Babylon was a gold cup in the hand of the LORD, making the whole earth drunk. The nations drank her wine; therefore the nations have gone mad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_8","025_51_8","JER","51","8","8","Suddenly Babylon has fallen and been shattered. Wail for her; get her balm for her pain; perhaps she can be healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_9","025_51_9","JER","51","9","9","“We tried to heal Babylon, but she could not be healed. Abandon her! Let each of us go to his own land, for her judgment extends to the sky and reaches to the clouds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_10","025_51_10","JER","51","10","10","“The LORD has brought forth our vindication; come, let us tell in Zion what the LORD our God has accomplished.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_11","025_51_11","JER","51","11","11","Sharpen the arrows! Fill the quivers! The LORD has aroused the spirit of the kings of the Medes, because His plan is aimed at Babylon to destroy her, for it is the vengeance of the LORD—vengeance for His temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_12","025_51_12","JER","51","12","12","Raise a banner against the walls of Babylon; post the guard; station the watchmen; prepare the ambush. For the LORD has both devised and accomplished what He spoke against the people of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_13","025_51_13","JER","51","13","13","You who dwell by many waters, rich in treasures, your end has come; the thread of your life is cut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_14","025_51_14","JER","51","14","14","The LORD of Hosts has sworn by Himself: “Surely I will fill you up with men as with locusts, and they will shout in triumph over you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_15","025_51_15","JER","51","15","15","The LORD made the earth by His power; He established the world by His wisdom and stretched out the heavens by His understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_16","025_51_16","JER","51","16","16","When He thunders, the waters in the heavens roar; He causes the clouds to rise from the ends of the earth. He generates the lightning with the rain and brings forth the wind from His storehouses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_17","025_51_17","JER","51","17","17","Every man is senseless and devoid of knowledge; every goldsmith is put to shame by his idols. For his molten images are a fraud, and there is no breath in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_18","025_51_18","JER","51","18","18","They are worthless, a work to be mocked. In the time of their punishment they will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_19","025_51_19","JER","51","19","19","The Portion of Jacob is not like these, for He is the Maker of all things, and of the tribe of His inheritance—the LORD of Hosts is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_20","025_51_20","JER","51","20","20","“You are My war club, My weapon for battle. With you I shatter nations; with you I bring kingdoms to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_21","025_51_21","JER","51","21","21","With you I shatter the horse and rider; with you I shatter the chariot and driver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_22","025_51_22","JER","51","22","22","With you I shatter man and woman; with you I shatter the old man and the youth; with you I shatter the young man and the maiden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_23","025_51_23","JER","51","23","23","With you I shatter the shepherd and his flock; with you I shatter the farmer and his oxen; with you I shatter the governors and officials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_24","025_51_24","JER","51","24","24","Before your very eyes I will repay Babylon and all the dwellers of Chaldea for all the evil they have done in Zion,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_25","025_51_25","JER","51","25","25","“Behold, I am against you, O destroying mountain, you who devastate the whole earth, declares the LORD. I will stretch out My hand against you; I will roll you over the cliffs and turn you into a charred mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_26","025_51_26","JER","51","26","26","No one shall retrieve from you a cornerstone or a foundation stone, because you will become desolate forever,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_27","025_51_27","JER","51","27","27","“Raise a banner in the land! Blow the ram’s horn among the nations! Prepare the nations against her. Summon the kingdoms against her—Ararat, Minni, and Ashkenaz. Appoint a captain against her; bring up horses like swarming locusts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_28","025_51_28","JER","51","28","28","Prepare the nations for battle against her—the kings of the Medes, their governors and all their officials, and all the lands they rule. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_29","025_51_29","JER","51","29","29","The earth quakes and writhes because the LORD’s intentions against Babylon stand: to make the land of Babylon a desolation, without inhabitant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_30","025_51_30","JER","51","30","30","The warriors of Babylon have stopped fighting; they sit in their strongholds. Their strength is exhausted; they have become like women. Babylon’s homes have been set ablaze, the bars of her gates are broken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_31","025_51_31","JER","51","31","31","One courier races to meet another, and messenger follows messenger, to announce to the king of Babylon that his city has been captured from end to end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_32","025_51_32","JER","51","32","32","The fords have been seized, the marshes set on fire, and the soldiers are terrified.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_33","025_51_33","JER","51","33","33","For this is what the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: “The Daughter of Babylon is like a threshing floor at the time it is trampled. In just a little while her harvest time will come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_34","025_51_34","JER","51","34","34","“Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon has devoured me; he has crushed me. He has set me aside like an empty vessel; he has swallowed me like a monster; he filled his belly with my delicacies and vomited me out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_35","025_51_35","JER","51","35","35","May the violence done to me and to my flesh be upon Babylon,” says the dweller of Zion. “May my blood be on the dwellers of Chaldea,” says Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_36","025_51_36","JER","51","36","36","Therefore this is what the LORD says: “Behold, I will plead your case and take vengeance on your behalf; I will dry up her sea and make her springs run dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_37","025_51_37","JER","51","37","37","Babylon will become a heap of rubble, a haunt for jackals, an object of horror and scorn, without inhabitant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_38","025_51_38","JER","51","38","38","They will roar together like young lions; they will growl like lion cubs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_39","025_51_39","JER","51","39","39","While they are flushed with heat, I will serve them a feast, and I will make them drunk so that they may revel; then they will fall asleep forever and never wake up, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_40","025_51_40","JER","51","40","40","I will bring them down like lambs to the slaughter, like rams with male goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_41","025_51_41","JER","51","41","41","How Sheshach has been captured! The praise of all the earth has been seized. What a horror Babylon has become among the nations! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_42","025_51_42","JER","51","42","42","The sea has come up over Babylon; she is covered in turbulent waves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_43","025_51_43","JER","51","43","43","Her cities have become a desolation, a dry and arid land, a land where no one lives, where no son of man passes through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_44","025_51_44","JER","51","44","44","I will punish Bel in Babylon. I will make him spew out what he swallowed. The nations will no longer stream to him; even the wall of Babylon will fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_45","025_51_45","JER","51","45","45","Come out of her, My people! Save your lives, each of you, from the fierce anger of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_46","025_51_46","JER","51","46","46","Do not let your heart grow faint, and do not be afraid when the rumor is heard in the land; for a rumor will come one year—and then another the next year—of violence in the land and of ruler against ruler. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_47","025_51_47","JER","51","47","47","Therefore, behold, the days are coming when I will punish the idols of Babylon. Her entire land will suffer shame, and all her slain will lie fallen within her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_48","025_51_48","JER","51","48","48","Then heaven and earth and all that is in them will shout for joy over Babylon because the destroyers from the north will come against her,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_49","025_51_49","JER","51","49","49","“Babylon must fall on account of the slain of Israel, just as the slain of all the earth have fallen because of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_50","025_51_50","JER","51","50","50","You who have escaped the sword, depart and do not linger! Remember the LORD from far away, and let Jerusalem come to mind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_51","025_51_51","JER","51","51","51","“We are ashamed because we have heard reproach; disgrace has covered our faces, because foreigners have entered the holy places of the LORD’s house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_52","025_51_52","JER","51","52","52","“Therefore, behold, the days are coming,” declares the LORD, “when I will punish her idols, and throughout her land the wounded will groan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_53","025_51_53","JER","51","53","53","Even if Babylon ascends to the heavens and fortifies her lofty stronghold, the destroyers I send will come against her,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_54","025_51_54","JER","51","54","54","“The sound of a cry comes from Babylon, the sound of great destruction from the land of the Chaldeans! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_55","025_51_55","JER","51","55","55","For the LORD will destroy Babylon; He will silence her mighty voice. The waves will roar like great waters; the tumult of their voices will resound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_56","025_51_56","JER","51","56","56","For a destroyer is coming against her—against Babylon. Her warriors will be captured, and their bows will be broken, for the LORD is a God of retribution; He will repay in full. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_57","025_51_57","JER","51","57","57","I will make her princes and wise men drunk, along with her governors, officials, and warriors. Then they will fall asleep forever and not wake up,” declares the King, whose name is the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_58","025_51_58","JER","51","58","58","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Babylon’s thick walls will be leveled, and her high gates consumed by fire. So the labor of the people will be for nothing; the nations will exhaust themselves to fuel the flames.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_59","025_51_59","JER","51","59","59","This is the message that Jeremiah the prophet gave to the quartermaster Seraiah son of Neriah, the son of Mahseiah, when he went to Babylon with King Zedekiah of Judah in the fourth year of Zedekiah’s reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_60","025_51_60","JER","51","60","60","Jeremiah had written on a single scroll about all the disaster that would come upon Babylon—all these words that had been written concerning Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_61","025_51_61","JER","51","61","61","And Jeremiah said to Seraiah, “When you get to Babylon, see that you read all these words aloud, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_62","025_51_62","JER","51","62","62","and say, ‘O LORD, You have promised to cut off this place so that no one will remain—neither man nor beast. Indeed, it will be desolate forever.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_63","025_51_63","JER","51","63","63","When you finish reading this scroll, tie a stone to it and cast it into the Euphrates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR51_64","025_51_64","JER","51","64","64","Then you are to say, ‘In the same way Babylon will sink and never rise again, because of the disaster I will bring upon her. And her people will grow weary.’” Here end the words of Jeremiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_1","025_52_1","JER","52","1","1","Zedekiah was twenty-one years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem eleven years. His mother’s name was Hamutal daughter of Jeremiah; she was from Libnah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_2","025_52_2","JER","52","2","2","And Zedekiah did evil in the sight of the LORD, just as Jehoiakim had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_3","025_52_3","JER","52","3","3","For because of the anger of the LORD, all this happened in Jerusalem and Judah, until He finally banished them from His presence. And Zedekiah also rebelled against the king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_4","025_52_4","JER","52","4","4","So in the ninth year of Zedekiah’s reign, on the tenth day of the tenth month, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon marched against Jerusalem with his entire army. They encamped outside the city and built a siege wall all around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_5","025_52_5","JER","52","5","5","And the city was kept under siege until King Zedekiah’s eleventh year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_6","025_52_6","JER","52","6","6","By the ninth day of the fourth month, the famine in the city was so severe that the people of the land had no food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_7","025_52_7","JER","52","7","7","Then the city was breached; and though the Chaldeans had surrounded the city, all the men of war fled the city by night by way of the gate between the two walls near the king’s garden. They headed toward the Arabah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_8","025_52_8","JER","52","8","8","but the army of the Chaldeans pursued the king and overtook Zedekiah in the plains of Jericho, and his whole army deserted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_9","025_52_9","JER","52","9","9","The Chaldeans seized the king and brought him up to the king of Babylon at Riblah in the land of Hamath, where he pronounced judgment on Zedekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_10","025_52_10","JER","52","10","10","There at Riblah the king of Babylon slaughtered the sons of Zedekiah before his eyes, and he also killed all the officials of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_11","025_52_11","JER","52","11","11","Then he put out Zedekiah’s eyes, bound him with bronze shackles, and took him to Babylon, where he kept him in custody until his dying day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_12","025_52_12","JER","52","12","12","On the tenth day of the fifth month, in the nineteenth year of Nebuchadnezzar’s reign over Babylon, Nebuzaradan captain of the guard, a servant of the king of Babylon, entered Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_13","025_52_13","JER","52","13","13","He burned down the house of the LORD, the royal palace, and all the houses of Jerusalem—every significant building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_14","025_52_14","JER","52","14","14","And the whole army of the Chaldeans under the captain of the guard broke down all the walls around Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_15","025_52_15","JER","52","15","15","Then Nebuzaradan captain of the guard carried into exile some of the poorest people and those who remained in the city, along with the deserters who had defected to the king of Babylon and the rest of the craftsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_16","025_52_16","JER","52","16","16","But Nebuzaradan captain of the guard left behind some of the poorest of the land to tend the vineyards and fields. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_17","025_52_17","JER","52","17","17","Moreover, the Chaldeans broke up the bronze pillars and stands and the bronze Sea in the house of the LORD, and they carried all the bronze to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_18","025_52_18","JER","52","18","18","They also took away the pots, shovels, wick trimmers, sprinkling bowls, dishes, and all the articles of bronze used in the temple service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_19","025_52_19","JER","52","19","19","The captain of the guard also took away the basins, censers, sprinkling bowls, pots, lampstands, pans, and drink offering bowls—anything made of pure gold or fine silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_20","025_52_20","JER","52","20","20","As for the two pillars, the Sea, the twelve bronze bulls under it, and the movable stands that King Solomon had made for the house of the LORD, the weight of the bronze from all these articles was beyond measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_21","025_52_21","JER","52","21","21","Each pillar was eighteen cubits tall and twelve cubits in circumference; each was hollow, four fingers thick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_22","025_52_22","JER","52","22","22","The bronze capital atop one pillar was five cubits high, with a network of bronze pomegranates all around. The second pillar, with its pomegranates, was similar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_23","025_52_23","JER","52","23","23","Each capital had ninety-six pomegranates on the sides, and a total of a hundred pomegranates were above the surrounding network. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_24","025_52_24","JER","52","24","24","The captain of the guard also took away Seraiah the chief priest, Zephaniah the priest of second rank, and the three doorkeepers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_25","025_52_25","JER","52","25","25","Of those still in the city, he took a court official who had been appointed over the men of war, as well as seven trusted royal advisers. He also took the scribe of the captain of the army, who had enlisted the people of the land, and sixty men who were found in the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_26","025_52_26","JER","52","26","26","Nebuzaradan captain of the guard took them and brought them to the king of Babylon at Riblah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_27","025_52_27","JER","52","27","27","There at Riblah in the land of Hamath, the king of Babylon struck them down and put them to death. So Judah was taken into exile, away from its own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_28","025_52_28","JER","52","28","28","These are the people Nebuchadnezzar carried away: in the seventh year, 3,023 Jews; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_29","025_52_29","JER","52","29","29","in Nebuchadnezzar’s eighteenth year, 832 people from Jerusalem; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_30","025_52_30","JER","52","30","30","in Nebuchadnezzar’s twenty-third year, Nebuzaradan captain of the guard carried away 745 Jews. So in all, 4,600 people were taken away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_31","025_52_31","JER","52","31","31","On the twenty-fifth day of the twelfth month of the thirty-seventh year of the exile of Jehoiachin king of Judah, in the first year of the reign of Evil-merodach king of Babylon, he pardoned Jehoiachin king of Judah and released him from prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_32","025_52_32","JER","52","32","32","And he spoke kindly to Jehoiachin and set his throne above the thrones of the other kings who were with him in Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_33","025_52_33","JER","52","33","33","So Jehoiachin changed out of his prison clothes, and he dined regularly at the king’s table for the rest of his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JR52_34","025_52_34","JER","52","34","34","And the king of Babylon provided Jehoiachin a daily portion for the rest of his life, until the day of his death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_1","026_1_1","LAM","1","1","1","How lonely lies the city, once so full of people! She who was great among the nations has become a widow. The princess of the provinces has become a slave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_2","026_1_2","LAM","1","2","2","She weeps aloud in the night, with tears upon her cheeks. Among all her lovers there is no one to comfort her. All her friends have betrayed her; they have become her enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_3","026_1_3","LAM","1","3","3","Judah has gone into exile under affliction and harsh slavery; she dwells among the nations but finds no place to rest. All her pursuers have overtaken her in the midst of her distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_4","026_1_4","LAM","1","4","4","The roads to Zion mourn, because no one comes to her appointed feasts. All her gates are deserted; her priests groan, her maidens grieve, and she herself is bitter with anguish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_5","026_1_5","LAM","1","5","5","Her foes have become her masters; her enemies are at ease. For the LORD has brought her grief because of her many transgressions. Her children have gone away as captives before the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_6","026_1_6","LAM","1","6","6","All the splendor has departed from the Daughter of Zion. Her princes are like deer that find no pasture; they lack the strength to flee in the face of the hunter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_7","026_1_7","LAM","1","7","7","In the days of her affliction and wandering Jerusalem remembers all the treasures that were hers in days of old. When her people fell into enemy hands she received no help. Her enemies looked upon her, laughing at her downfall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_8","026_1_8","LAM","1","8","8","Jerusalem has sinned greatly; therefore she has become an object of scorn. All who honored her now despise her, for they have seen her nakedness; she herself groans and turns away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_9","026_1_9","LAM","1","9","9","Her uncleanness stains her skirts; she did not consider her end. Her downfall was astounding; there was no one to comfort her. Look, O LORD, on my affliction, for the enemy has triumphed! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_10","026_1_10","LAM","1","10","10","The adversary has seized all her treasures. For she has seen the nations enter her sanctuary—those You had forbidden to enter Your assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_11","026_1_11","LAM","1","11","11","All her people groan as they search for bread. They have traded their treasures for food to keep themselves alive. Look, O LORD, and consider, for I have become despised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_12","026_1_12","LAM","1","12","12","Is this nothing to you, all you who pass by? Look around and see! Is there any sorrow like mine, which was inflicted on me, which the LORD made me suffer on the day of His fierce anger? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_13","026_1_13","LAM","1","13","13","He sent fire from on high, and it overpowered my bones. He spread a net for my feet and turned me back. He made me desolate, faint all the day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_14","026_1_14","LAM","1","14","14","My transgressions are bound into a yoke, knit together by His hand; they are draped over my neck, and the Lord has broken my strength. He has delivered me into the hands of those I cannot withstand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_15","026_1_15","LAM","1","15","15","The Lord has rejected all the mighty men in my midst; He has summoned an army against me to crush my young warriors. Like grapes in a winepress, the Lord has trampled the Virgin Daughter of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_16","026_1_16","LAM","1","16","16","For these things I weep; my eyes flow with tears. For there is no one nearby to comfort me, no one to revive my soul. My children are destitute because the enemy has prevailed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_17","026_1_17","LAM","1","17","17","Zion stretches out her hands, but there is no one to comfort her. The LORD has decreed against Jacob that his neighbors become his foes. Jerusalem has become an unclean thing among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_18","026_1_18","LAM","1","18","18","The LORD is righteous, yet I rebelled against His command. Listen, all you people; look upon my suffering. My young men and maidens have gone into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_19","026_1_19","LAM","1","19","19","I called out to my lovers, but they have betrayed me. My priests and elders perished in the city while they searched for food to keep themselves alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_20","026_1_20","LAM","1","20","20","See, O LORD, how distressed I am! I am churning within; my heart is pounding within me, for I have been most rebellious. Outside, the sword bereaves; inside, there is death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_21","026_1_21","LAM","1","21","21","People have heard my groaning, but there is no one to comfort me. All my enemies have heard of my trouble; they are glad that You have caused it. May You bring the day You have announced, so that they may become like me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM1_22","026_1_22","LAM","1","22","22","Let all their wickedness come before You, and deal with them as You have dealt with me because of all my transgressions. For my groans are many, and my heart is faint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_1","026_2_1","LAM","2","1","1","How the Lord has covered the Daughter of Zion with the cloud of His anger! He has cast the glory of Israel from heaven to earth. He has abandoned His footstool in the day of His anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_2","026_2_2","LAM","2","2","2","Without pity the Lord has swallowed up all the dwellings of Jacob. In His wrath He has demolished the fortified cities of the Daughter of Judah. He brought to the ground and defiled her kingdom and its princes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_3","026_2_3","LAM","2","3","3","In fierce anger He has cut off every horn of Israel and withdrawn His right hand at the approach of the enemy. He has burned in Jacob like a flaming fire that consumes everything around it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_4","026_2_4","LAM","2","4","4","He has bent His bow like an enemy; His right hand is positioned. Like a foe He has killed all who were pleasing to the eye; He has poured out His wrath like fire on the tent of the Daughter of Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_5","026_2_5","LAM","2","5","5","The Lord is like an enemy; He has swallowed up Israel. He has swallowed up all her palaces and destroyed her strongholds. He has multiplied mourning and lamentation for the Daughter of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_6","026_2_6","LAM","2","6","6","He has laid waste His tabernacle like a garden booth; He has destroyed His place of meeting. The LORD has made Zion forget her appointed feasts and Sabbaths. In His fierce anger He has despised both king and priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_7","026_2_7","LAM","2","7","7","The Lord has rejected His altar; He has abandoned His sanctuary; He has delivered the walls of her palaces into the hand of the enemy. They have raised a shout in the house of the LORD as on the day of an appointed feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_8","026_2_8","LAM","2","8","8","The LORD determined to destroy the wall of the Daughter of Zion. He stretched out a measuring line and did not withdraw His hand from destroying. He made the ramparts and walls lament; together they waste away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_9","026_2_9","LAM","2","9","9","Her gates have sunk into the ground; He has destroyed and shattered their bars. Her king and her princes are exiled among the nations, the law is no more, and even her prophets find no vision from the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_10","026_2_10","LAM","2","10","10","The elders of the Daughter of Zion sit on the ground in silence. They have thrown dust on their heads and put on sackcloth. The young women of Jerusalem have bowed their heads to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_11","026_2_11","LAM","2","11","11","My eyes fail from weeping; I am churning within. My heart is poured out in grief over the destruction of the daughter of my people, because children and infants faint in the streets of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_12","026_2_12","LAM","2","12","12","They cry out to their mothers: “Where is the grain and wine?” as they faint like the wounded in the streets of the city, as their lives fade away in the arms of their mothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_13","026_2_13","LAM","2","13","13","What can I say for you? To what can I compare you, O Daughter of Jerusalem? To what can I liken you, that I may console you, O Virgin Daughter of Zion? For your wound is as deep as the sea. Who can ever heal you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_14","026_2_14","LAM","2","14","14","The visions of your prophets were empty and deceptive; they did not expose your guilt to ward off your captivity. The burdens they envisioned for you were empty and misleading. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_15","026_2_15","LAM","2","15","15","All who pass by clap their hands at you in scorn. They hiss and shake their heads at the Daughter of Jerusalem: “Is this the city that was called the perfection of beauty, the joy of all the earth?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_16","026_2_16","LAM","2","16","16","All your enemies open their mouths against you. They hiss and gnash their teeth, saying, “We have swallowed her up. This is the day for which we have waited. We have lived to see it!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_17","026_2_17","LAM","2","17","17","The LORD has done what He planned; He has accomplished His decree, which He ordained in days of old; He has overthrown you without pity. He has let the enemy gloat over you and exalted the horn of your foes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_18","026_2_18","LAM","2","18","18","The hearts of the people cry out to the Lord. O wall of the Daughter of Zion, let your tears run down like a river day and night. Give yourself no relief, and your eyes no rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_19","026_2_19","LAM","2","19","19","Arise, cry out in the night from the first watch of the night. Pour out your heart like water in the presence of the Lord. Lift up your hands to Him for the lives of your children who are fainting from hunger on the corner of every street. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_20","026_2_20","LAM","2","20","20","Look, O LORD, and consider: Whom have You ever treated like this? Should women eat their offspring, the infants they have nurtured? Should priests and prophets be killed in the sanctuary of the Lord? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_21","026_2_21","LAM","2","21","21","Both young and old lie together in the dust of the streets. My young men and maidens have fallen by the sword. You have slain them in the day of Your anger; You have slaughtered them without compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM2_22","026_2_22","LAM","2","22","22","You summoned my terrors on every side, as for the day of an appointed feast. In the day of the LORD’s anger no one escaped or survived; my enemy has destroyed those I nurtured and reared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_1","026_3_1","LAM","3","1","1","I am the man who has seen affliction under the rod of God’s wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_2","026_3_2","LAM","3","2","2","He has driven me away and made me walk in darkness instead of light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_3","026_3_3","LAM","3","3","3","Indeed, He keeps turning His hand against me all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_4","026_3_4","LAM","3","4","4","He has worn away my flesh and skin; He has shattered my bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_5","026_3_5","LAM","3","5","5","He has besieged me and surrounded me with bitterness and hardship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_6","026_3_6","LAM","3","6","6","He has made me dwell in darkness like those dead for ages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_7","026_3_7","LAM","3","7","7","He has walled me in so I cannot escape; He has weighed me down with chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_8","026_3_8","LAM","3","8","8","Even when I cry out and plead for help, He shuts out my prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_9","026_3_9","LAM","3","9","9","He has barred my ways with cut stones; He has made my paths crooked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_10","026_3_10","LAM","3","10","10","He is a bear lying in wait, a lion hiding in ambush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_11","026_3_11","LAM","3","11","11","He forced me off my path and tore me to pieces; He left me without help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_12","026_3_12","LAM","3","12","12","He bent His bow and set me as the target for His arrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_13","026_3_13","LAM","3","13","13","He pierced my kidneys with His arrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_14","026_3_14","LAM","3","14","14","I am a laughingstock to all my people; they mock me in song all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_15","026_3_15","LAM","3","15","15","He has filled me with bitterness; He has intoxicated me with wormwood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_16","026_3_16","LAM","3","16","16","He has ground my teeth with gravel and trampled me in the dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_17","026_3_17","LAM","3","17","17","My soul has been deprived of peace; I have forgotten what prosperity is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_18","026_3_18","LAM","3","18","18","So I say, “My strength has perished, along with my hope from the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_19","026_3_19","LAM","3","19","19","Remember my affliction and wandering, the wormwood and the gall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_20","026_3_20","LAM","3","20","20","Surely my soul remembers and is humbled within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_21","026_3_21","LAM","3","21","21","Yet I call this to mind, and therefore I have hope: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_22","026_3_22","LAM","3","22","22","Because of the loving devotion of the LORD we are not consumed, for His mercies never fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_23","026_3_23","LAM","3","23","23","They are new every morning; great is Your faithfulness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_24","026_3_24","LAM","3","24","24","“The LORD is my portion,” says my soul, “therefore I will hope in Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_25","026_3_25","LAM","3","25","25","The LORD is good to those who wait for Him, to the soul who seeks Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_26","026_3_26","LAM","3","26","26","It is good to wait quietly for the salvation of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_27","026_3_27","LAM","3","27","27","It is good for a man to bear the yoke while he is still young. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_28","026_3_28","LAM","3","28","28","Let him sit alone in silence, for the LORD has laid it upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_29","026_3_29","LAM","3","29","29","Let him bury his face in the dust—perhaps there is still hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_30","026_3_30","LAM","3","30","30","Let him offer his cheek to the one who would strike him; let him be filled with reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_31","026_3_31","LAM","3","31","31","For the Lord will not cast us off forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_32","026_3_32","LAM","3","32","32","Even if He causes grief, He will show compassion according to His abundant loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_33","026_3_33","LAM","3","33","33","For He does not willingly afflict or grieve the sons of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_34","026_3_34","LAM","3","34","34","To crush underfoot all the prisoners of the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_35","026_3_35","LAM","3","35","35","to deny a man justice before the Most High, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_36","026_3_36","LAM","3","36","36","to subvert a man in his lawsuit—of these the Lord does not approve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_37","026_3_37","LAM","3","37","37","Who has spoken and it came to pass, unless the Lord has ordained it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_38","026_3_38","LAM","3","38","38","Do not both adversity and good come from the mouth of the Most High? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_39","026_3_39","LAM","3","39","39","Why should any mortal man complain, in view of his sins? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_40","026_3_40","LAM","3","40","40","Let us examine and test our ways, and turn back to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_41","026_3_41","LAM","3","41","41","Let us lift up our hearts and hands to God in heaven: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_42","026_3_42","LAM","3","42","42","“We have sinned and rebelled; You have not forgiven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_43","026_3_43","LAM","3","43","43","You have covered Yourself in anger and pursued us; You have killed without pity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_44","026_3_44","LAM","3","44","44","You have covered Yourself with a cloud that no prayer can pass through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_45","026_3_45","LAM","3","45","45","You have made us scum and refuse among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_46","026_3_46","LAM","3","46","46","All our enemies open their mouths against us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_47","026_3_47","LAM","3","47","47","Panic and pitfall have come upon us—devastation and destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_48","026_3_48","LAM","3","48","48","Streams of tears flow from my eyes over the destruction of the daughter of my people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_49","026_3_49","LAM","3","49","49","My eyes overflow unceasingly, without relief, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_50","026_3_50","LAM","3","50","50","until the LORD looks down from heaven and sees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_51","026_3_51","LAM","3","51","51","My eyes bring grief to my soul because of all the daughters of my city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_52","026_3_52","LAM","3","52","52","Without cause my enemies hunted me like a bird. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_53","026_3_53","LAM","3","53","53","They dropped me alive into a pit and cast stones upon me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_54","026_3_54","LAM","3","54","54","The waters flowed over my head, and I thought I was going to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_55","026_3_55","LAM","3","55","55","I called on Your name, O LORD, out of the depths of the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_56","026_3_56","LAM","3","56","56","You heard my plea: “Do not ignore my cry for relief.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_57","026_3_57","LAM","3","57","57","You drew near when I called on You; You said, “Do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_58","026_3_58","LAM","3","58","58","You defend my cause, O Lord; You redeem my life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_59","026_3_59","LAM","3","59","59","You have seen, O LORD, the wrong done to me; vindicate my cause! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_60","026_3_60","LAM","3","60","60","You have seen all their malice, all their plots against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_61","026_3_61","LAM","3","61","61","O LORD, You have heard their insults, all their plots against me— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_62","026_3_62","LAM","3","62","62","the slander and murmuring of my assailants against me all day long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_63","026_3_63","LAM","3","63","63","When they sit and when they rise, see how they mock me in song. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_64","026_3_64","LAM","3","64","64","You will pay them back what they deserve, O LORD, according to the work of their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_65","026_3_65","LAM","3","65","65","Put a veil of anguish over their hearts; may Your curse be upon them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM3_66","026_3_66","LAM","3","66","66","You will pursue them in anger and exterminate them from under Your heavens, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_1","026_4_1","LAM","4","1","1","How the gold has become tarnished, the pure gold has become dull! The gems of the temple lie scattered on every street corner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_2","026_4_2","LAM","4","2","2","How the precious sons of Zion, once worth their weight in pure gold, are now esteemed as jars of clay, the work of a potter’s hands! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_3","026_4_3","LAM","4","3","3","Even jackals offer their breasts to nurse their young, but the daughter of my people has become cruel, like an ostrich in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_4","026_4_4","LAM","4","4","4","The nursing infant’s tongue clings in thirst to the roof of his mouth. Little children beg for bread, but no one gives them any. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_5","026_4_5","LAM","4","5","5","Those who once ate delicacies are destitute in the streets; those brought up in crimson huddle in ash heaps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_6","026_4_6","LAM","4","6","6","The punishment of the daughter of my people is greater than that of Sodom, which was overthrown in an instant without a hand turned to help her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_7","026_4_7","LAM","4","7","7","Her dignitaries were brighter than snow, whiter than milk; their bodies were more ruddy than rubies, their appearance like sapphires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_8","026_4_8","LAM","4","8","8","But now their appearance is blacker than soot; they are not recognized in the streets. Their skin has shriveled on their bones; it has become as dry as a stick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_9","026_4_9","LAM","4","9","9","Those slain by the sword are better off than those who die of hunger, who waste away, pierced with pain because the fields lack produce. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_10","026_4_10","LAM","4","10","10","The hands of compassionate women have cooked their own children, who became their food in the destruction of the daughter of my people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_11","026_4_11","LAM","4","11","11","The LORD has exhausted His wrath; He has poured out His fierce anger; He has kindled a fire in Zion, and it has consumed her foundations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_12","026_4_12","LAM","4","12","12","The kings of the earth did not believe, nor any people of the world, that an enemy or a foe could enter the gates of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_13","026_4_13","LAM","4","13","13","But this was for the sins of her prophets and the guilt of her priests, who shed the blood of the righteous in her midst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_14","026_4_14","LAM","4","14","14","They wandered blind in the streets, defiled by this blood, so that no one dared to touch their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_15","026_4_15","LAM","4","15","15","“Go away! Unclean!” men shouted at them. “Away, away! Do not touch us!” So they fled and wandered. Among the nations it was said, “They can stay here no longer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_16","026_4_16","LAM","4","16","16","The presence of the LORD has scattered them; He regards them no more. The priests are shown no honor; the elders find no favor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_17","026_4_17","LAM","4","17","17","All the while our eyes were failing as we looked in vain for help. We watched from our towers for a nation that could not save us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_18","026_4_18","LAM","4","18","18","They stalked our every step, so that we could not walk in our streets. Our end drew near, our time ran out, for our end had come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_19","026_4_19","LAM","4","19","19","Those who chased us were swifter than the eagles in the sky; they pursued us over the mountains and ambushed us in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_20","026_4_20","LAM","4","20","20","The LORD’s anointed, the breath of our life, was captured in their pits. We had said of him, “Under his shadow we will live among the nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_21","026_4_21","LAM","4","21","21","So rejoice and be glad, O Daughter of Edom, you who dwell in the land of Uz. Yet the cup will pass to you as well; you will get drunk and expose yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM4_22","026_4_22","LAM","4","22","22","O Daughter of Zion, your punishment is complete; He will not prolong your exile. But He will punish your iniquity, O Daughter of Edom; He will expose your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_1","026_5_1","LAM","5","1","1","Remember, O LORD, what has happened to us. Look and see our disgrace! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_2","026_5_2","LAM","5","2","2","Our inheritance has been turned over to strangers, our houses to foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_3","026_5_3","LAM","5","3","3","We have become fatherless orphans; our mothers are widows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_4","026_5_4","LAM","5","4","4","We must buy the water we drink; our wood comes at a price. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_5","026_5_5","LAM","5","5","5","We are closely pursued; we are weary and find no rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_6","026_5_6","LAM","5","6","6","We submitted to Egypt and Assyria to get enough bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_7","026_5_7","LAM","5","7","7","Our fathers sinned and are no more, but we bear their punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_8","026_5_8","LAM","5","8","8","Slaves rule over us; there is no one to deliver us from their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_9","026_5_9","LAM","5","9","9","We get our bread at the risk of our lives because of the sword in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_10","026_5_10","LAM","5","10","10","Our skin is as hot as an oven with fever from our hunger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_11","026_5_11","LAM","5","11","11","Women have been ravished in Zion, virgins in the cities of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_12","026_5_12","LAM","5","12","12","Princes have been hung up by their hands; elders receive no respect. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_13","026_5_13","LAM","5","13","13","Young men toil at millstones; boys stagger under loads of wood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_14","026_5_14","LAM","5","14","14","The elders have left the city gate; the young men have stopped their music. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_15","026_5_15","LAM","5","15","15","Joy has left our hearts; our dancing has turned to mourning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_16","026_5_16","LAM","5","16","16","The crown has fallen from our head. Woe to us, for we have sinned! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_17","026_5_17","LAM","5","17","17","Because of this, our hearts are faint; because of these, our eyes grow dim— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_18","026_5_18","LAM","5","18","18","because of Mount Zion, which lies desolate, patrolled by foxes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_19","026_5_19","LAM","5","19","19","You, O LORD, reign forever; Your throne endures from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_20","026_5_20","LAM","5","20","20","Why have You forgotten us forever? Why have You forsaken us for so long? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_21","026_5_21","LAM","5","21","21","Restore us to Yourself, O LORD, so we may return; renew our days as of old, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LM5_22","026_5_22","LAM","5","22","22","unless You have utterly rejected us and remain angry with us beyond measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_1","027_1_1","EZK","1","1","1","In the thirtieth year, on the fifth day of the fourth month, while I was among the exiles by the River Kebar, the heavens opened and I saw visions of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_2","027_1_2","EZK","1","2","2","On the fifth day of the month—it was the fifth year of the exile of King Jehoiachin— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_3","027_1_3","EZK","1","3","3","the word of the LORD came directly to Ezekiel the priest, the son of Buzi, in the land of the Chaldeans by the River Kebar. And there the LORD’s hand was upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_4","027_1_4","EZK","1","4","4","I looked and saw a whirlwind coming from the north, a great cloud with fire flashing back and forth and brilliant light all around it. In the center of the fire was a gleam like amber, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_5","027_1_5","EZK","1","5","5","and within it was the form of four living creatures. And this was their appearance: They had a human form, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_6","027_1_6","EZK","1","6","6","but each had four faces and four wings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_7","027_1_7","EZK","1","7","7","Their legs were straight, and the soles of their feet were like the hooves of a calf, gleaming like polished bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_8","027_1_8","EZK","1","8","8","Under their wings on their four sides they had human hands. All four living creatures had faces and wings, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_9","027_1_9","EZK","1","9","9","and their wings were touching one another. They did not turn as they moved; each one went straight ahead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_10","027_1_10","EZK","1","10","10","The form of their faces was that of a man, and each of the four had the face of a lion on the right side, the face of an ox on the left side, and also the face of an eagle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_11","027_1_11","EZK","1","11","11","Such were their faces. Their wings were spread upward; each had two wings touching the wings of the creature on either side, and two wings covering its body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_12","027_1_12","EZK","1","12","12","Each creature went straight ahead. Wherever the spirit would go, they would go, without turning as they moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_13","027_1_13","EZK","1","13","13","In the midst of the living creatures was the appearance of glowing coals of fire, or of torches. Fire moved back and forth between the living creatures; it was bright, and lightning flashed out of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_14","027_1_14","EZK","1","14","14","The creatures were darting back and forth as quickly as flashes of lightning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_15","027_1_15","EZK","1","15","15","When I looked at the living creatures, I saw a wheel on the ground beside each creature with its four faces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_16","027_1_16","EZK","1","16","16","The workmanship of the wheels looked like the gleam of beryl, and all four had the same likeness. Their workmanship looked like a wheel within a wheel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_17","027_1_17","EZK","1","17","17","As they moved, they went in any of the four directions, without pivoting as they moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_18","027_1_18","EZK","1","18","18","Their rims were high and awesome, and all four rims were full of eyes all around. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_19","027_1_19","EZK","1","19","19","So as the living creatures moved, the wheels moved beside them, and when the creatures rose from the ground, the wheels also rose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_20","027_1_20","EZK","1","20","20","Wherever the spirit would go, they would go, and the wheels would rise alongside them, because the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_21","027_1_21","EZK","1","21","21","When the creatures moved, the wheels moved; when the creatures stood still, the wheels stood still; and when the creatures rose from the ground, the wheels rose alongside them, because the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_22","027_1_22","EZK","1","22","22","Spread out above the heads of the living creatures was the likeness of an awesome expanse, gleaming like crystal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_23","027_1_23","EZK","1","23","23","And under the expanse, their wings stretched out toward one another. Each one also had two wings covering its body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_24","027_1_24","EZK","1","24","24","When the creatures moved, I heard the sound of their wings like the roar of many waters, like the voice of the Almighty, like the tumult of an army. When they stood still, they lowered their wings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_25","027_1_25","EZK","1","25","25","And there came a voice from above the expanse over their heads as they stood still with their wings lowered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_26","027_1_26","EZK","1","26","26","Above the expanse over their heads was the likeness of a throne with the appearance of sapphire, and on the throne high above was a figure like that of a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_27","027_1_27","EZK","1","27","27","From what seemed to be His waist up, I saw a gleam like amber, with what looked like fire within it all around. And from what seemed to be His waist down, I saw what looked like fire; and brilliant light surrounded Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK1_28","027_1_28","EZK","1","28","28","The appearance of the brilliant light all around Him was like that of a rainbow in a cloud on a rainy day. This was the appearance of the likeness of the glory of the LORD. And when I saw it, I fell facedown and heard a voice speaking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_1","027_2_1","EZK","2","1","1","“Son of man,” He said to me, “stand up on your feet and I will speak to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_2","027_2_2","EZK","2","2","2","And as He spoke to me, the Spirit entered me and set me on my feet, and I heard Him speaking to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_3","027_2_3","EZK","2","3","3","“Son of man,” He said to me, “I am sending you to the Israelites, to a rebellious nation that has rebelled against Me. To this very day they and their fathers have rebelled against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_4","027_2_4","EZK","2","4","4","They are obstinate and stubborn children. I am sending you to them, and you are to say to them, ‘This is what the Lord GOD says.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_5","027_2_5","EZK","2","5","5","And whether they listen or refuse to listen—for they are a rebellious house—they will know that a prophet has been among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_6","027_2_6","EZK","2","6","6","But you, son of man, do not be afraid of them or their words. Do not be afraid, though briers and thorns surround you, and you dwell among scorpions. Do not be afraid of their words or dismayed by their presence, though they are a rebellious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_7","027_2_7","EZK","2","7","7","But speak My words to them, whether they listen or refuse to listen, for they are rebellious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_8","027_2_8","EZK","2","8","8","And you, son of man, listen to what I tell you. Do not be rebellious like that rebellious house. Open your mouth and eat what I give you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_9","027_2_9","EZK","2","9","9","Then I looked and saw a hand reaching out to me, and in it was a scroll, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK2_10","027_2_10","EZK","2","10","10","which He unrolled before me. And written on the front and back of it were words of lamentation, mourning, and woe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_1","027_3_1","EZK","3","1","1","“Son of man,” He said to me, “eat what you find here. Eat this scroll, then go and speak to the house of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_2","027_3_2","EZK","3","2","2","So I opened my mouth, and He fed me the scroll. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_3","027_3_3","EZK","3","3","3","“Son of man,” He said to me, “eat and fill your stomach with this scroll I am giving you.” So I ate, and it was as sweet as honey in my mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_4","027_3_4","EZK","3","4","4","Then He said to me, “Son of man, go now to the house of Israel and speak My words to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_5","027_3_5","EZK","3","5","5","For you are not being sent to a people of unfamiliar speech or difficult language, but to the house of Israel— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_6","027_3_6","EZK","3","6","6","not to the many peoples of unfamiliar speech and difficult language whose words you cannot understand. Surely if I had sent you to them, they would have listened to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_7","027_3_7","EZK","3","7","7","But the house of Israel will be unwilling to listen to you, since they are unwilling to listen to Me. For the whole house of Israel is hard-headed and hard-hearted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_8","027_3_8","EZK","3","8","8","Behold, I will make your face as hard as their faces, and your forehead as hard as their foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_9","027_3_9","EZK","3","9","9","I will make your forehead like a diamond, harder than flint. Do not be afraid of them or dismayed at their presence, even though they are a rebellious house.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_10","027_3_10","EZK","3","10","10","“Son of man,” He added, “listen carefully to all the words I speak to you, and take them to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_11","027_3_11","EZK","3","11","11","Go to your people, the exiles; speak to them and tell them, ‘This is what the Lord GOD says,’ whether they listen or refuse to listen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_12","027_3_12","EZK","3","12","12","Then the Spirit lifted me up, and I heard a great rumbling sound behind me: “Blessed be the glory of the LORD in His dwelling place!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_13","027_3_13","EZK","3","13","13","It was the sound of the wings of the living creatures brushing against one another and the sound of the wheels beside them, a great rumbling sound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_14","027_3_14","EZK","3","14","14","So the Spirit lifted me up and took me away, and I went in bitterness and in the anger of my spirit, with the strong hand of the LORD upon me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_15","027_3_15","EZK","3","15","15","I came to the exiles at Tel-abib who dwelt by the River Kebar. And for seven days I sat where they sat and remained there among them, overwhelmed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_16","027_3_16","EZK","3","16","16","At the end of seven days the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_17","027_3_17","EZK","3","17","17","“Son of man, I have made you a watchman for the house of Israel. Whenever you hear a word from My mouth, give them a warning from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_18","027_3_18","EZK","3","18","18","If I say to the wicked man, ‘You will surely die,’ but you do not warn him or speak out to warn him from his wicked way to save his life, that wicked man will die in his iniquity, and I will hold you responsible for his blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_19","027_3_19","EZK","3","19","19","But if you warn a wicked man and he does not turn from his wickedness and his wicked way, he will die in his iniquity, but you will have saved yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_20","027_3_20","EZK","3","20","20","Now if a righteous man turns from his righteousness and commits iniquity, and I put a stumbling block before him, he will die. If you did not warn him, he will die in his sin, and the righteous acts he did will not be remembered. And I will hold you responsible for his blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_21","027_3_21","EZK","3","21","21","But if you warn the righteous man not to sin, and he does not sin, he will indeed live because he heeded your warning, and you will have saved yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_22","027_3_22","EZK","3","22","22","And there the hand of the LORD was upon me, and He said to me, “Get up, go out to the plain, and there I will speak with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_23","027_3_23","EZK","3","23","23","So I got up and went out to the plain, and behold, the glory of the LORD was present there, like the glory I had seen by the River Kebar, and I fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_24","027_3_24","EZK","3","24","24","Then the Spirit entered me and set me on my feet. He spoke with me and said, “Go, shut yourself inside your house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_25","027_3_25","EZK","3","25","25","And you, son of man, they will tie with ropes, and you will be bound so that you cannot go out among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_26","027_3_26","EZK","3","26","26","I will make your tongue stick to the roof of your mouth, and you will be silent and unable to rebuke them, though they are a rebellious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK3_27","027_3_27","EZK","3","27","27","But when I speak with you, I will open your mouth, and you are to tell them, ‘This is what the Lord GOD says.’ Whoever listens, let him listen; and whoever refuses, let him refuse, for they are a rebellious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_1","027_4_1","EZK","4","1","1","“Now you, son of man, take a brick, place it before you, and draw on it the city of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_2","027_4_2","EZK","4","2","2","Then lay siege against it: Construct a siege wall, build a ramp to it, set up camps against it, and place battering rams around it on all sides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_3","027_4_3","EZK","4","3","3","Then take an iron plate and set it up as an iron wall between yourself and the city. Turn your face toward it so that it is under siege, and besiege it. This will be a sign to the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_4","027_4_4","EZK","4","4","4","Then lie down on your left side and place the iniquity of the house of Israel upon yourself. You are to bear their iniquity for the number of days you lie on your side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_5","027_4_5","EZK","4","5","5","For I have assigned to you 390 days, according to the number of years of their iniquity. So you shall bear the iniquity of the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_6","027_4_6","EZK","4","6","6","When you have completed these days, lie down again, but on your right side, and bear the iniquity of the house of Judah. I have assigned to you 40 days, a day for each year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_7","027_4_7","EZK","4","7","7","You must turn your face toward the siege of Jerusalem with your arm bared, and prophesy against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_8","027_4_8","EZK","4","8","8","Now behold, I will tie you up with ropes so you cannot turn from side to side until you have finished the days of your siege. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_9","027_4_9","EZK","4","9","9","But take wheat, barley, beans, lentils, millet, and spelt; put them in a single container and make them into bread for yourself. This is what you are to eat during the 390 days you lie on your side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_10","027_4_10","EZK","4","10","10","You are to weigh out twenty shekels of food to eat each day, and you are to eat it at set times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_11","027_4_11","EZK","4","11","11","You are also to measure out a sixth of a hin of water to drink, and you are to drink it at set times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_12","027_4_12","EZK","4","12","12","And you shall eat the food as you would a barley cake, after you bake it over dried human excrement in the sight of the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_13","027_4_13","EZK","4","13","13","Then the LORD said, “This is how the Israelites will eat their defiled bread among the nations to which I will banish them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_14","027_4_14","EZK","4","14","14","“Ah, Lord GOD,” I said, “I have never defiled myself. From my youth until now I have not eaten anything found dead or mauled by wild beasts. No unclean meat has ever entered my mouth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_15","027_4_15","EZK","4","15","15","“Look,” He replied, “I will let you use cow dung instead of human excrement, and you may bake your bread over that.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_16","027_4_16","EZK","4","16","16","Then He told me, “Son of man, I am going to cut off the supply of food in Jerusalem. They will anxiously eat bread rationed by weight, and in despair they will drink water by measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK4_17","027_4_17","EZK","4","17","17","So they will lack food and water; they will be appalled at the sight of one another wasting away in their iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_1","027_5_1","EZK","5","1","1","“As for you, son of man, take a sharp sword, use it as a barber’s razor, and shave your head and beard. Then take a set of scales and divide the hair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_2","027_5_2","EZK","5","2","2","When the days of the siege have ended, you are to burn up a third of the hair inside the city; you are also to take a third and slash it with the sword all around the city; and you are to scatter a third to the wind. For I will unleash a sword behind them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_3","027_5_3","EZK","5","3","3","But you are to take a few strands of hair and secure them in the folds of your garment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_4","027_5_4","EZK","5","4","4","Again, take a few of these, throw them into the fire, and burn them. From there a fire will spread to the whole house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_5","027_5_5","EZK","5","5","5","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘This is Jerusalem, which I have set in the center of the nations, with countries all around her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_6","027_5_6","EZK","5","6","6","But she has rebelled against My ordinances more wickedly than the nations, and against My statutes worse than the countries around her. For her people have rejected My ordinances and have not walked in My statutes.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_7","027_5_7","EZK","5","7","7","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘You have been more insubordinate than the nations around you; you have not walked in My statutes or kept My ordinances, nor have you even conformed to the ordinances of the nations around you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_8","027_5_8","EZK","5","8","8","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, I Myself am against you, Jerusalem, and I will execute judgments among you in the sight of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_9","027_5_9","EZK","5","9","9","Because of all your abominations, I will do to you what I have never done before and will never do again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_10","027_5_10","EZK","5","10","10","As a result, fathers among you will eat their sons, and sons will eat their fathers. I will execute judgments against you and scatter all your remnant to every wind.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_11","027_5_11","EZK","5","11","11","Therefore as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, because you have defiled My sanctuary with all your detestable idols and abominations, I Myself will withdraw My favor; I will not look upon you with pity, nor will I spare you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_12","027_5_12","EZK","5","12","12","A third of your people will die by plague or be consumed by famine within you, a third will fall by the sword outside your walls, and a third I will scatter to every wind and unleash a sword behind them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_13","027_5_13","EZK","5","13","13","And when My anger is spent and I have vented My wrath against them, I will be appeased. And when I have spent My wrath on them, they will know that I, the LORD, in My zeal have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_14","027_5_14","EZK","5","14","14","I will make you a ruin and a disgrace among the nations around you, in the sight of all who pass by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_15","027_5_15","EZK","5","15","15","So you will be a reproach and a taunt, a warning and a horror to the nations around you, when I execute judgments against you in anger, wrath, and raging fury. I, the LORD, have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_16","027_5_16","EZK","5","16","16","When I shower you with the deadly arrows of famine and destruction that I will send to destroy you, I will intensify the famine against you and cut off your supply of food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK5_17","027_5_17","EZK","5","17","17","I will send famine and wild beasts against you, and they will leave you childless. Plague and bloodshed will sweep through you, and I will bring a sword against you. I, the LORD, have spoken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_1","027_6_1","EZK","6","1","1","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_2","027_6_2","EZK","6","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against the mountains of Israel and prophesy against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_3","027_6_3","EZK","6","3","3","You are to say: ‘O mountains of Israel, hear the word of the Lord GOD! This is what the Lord GOD says to the mountains and hills, to the ravines and valleys: I am about to bring a sword against you, and I will destroy your high places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_4","027_6_4","EZK","6","4","4","Your altars will be demolished and your incense altars will be smashed; and I will cast down your slain before your idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_5","027_6_5","EZK","6","5","5","I will lay the corpses of the Israelites before their idols and scatter your bones around your altars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_6","027_6_6","EZK","6","6","6","Wherever you live, the cities will be laid waste and the high places will be demolished, so that your altars will be laid waste and desecrated, your idols smashed and obliterated, your incense altars cut down, and your works blotted out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_7","027_6_7","EZK","6","7","7","The slain will fall among you, and you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_8","027_6_8","EZK","6","8","8","Yet I will leave a remnant, for some of you will escape the sword when you are scattered among the nations and throughout the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_9","027_6_9","EZK","6","9","9","Then in the nations to which they have been carried captive, your survivors will remember Me—how I have been grieved by their adulterous hearts that turned away from Me, and by their eyes that lusted after idols. So they will loathe themselves for the evil they have done and for all their abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_10","027_6_10","EZK","6","10","10","And they will know that I am the LORD; I did not declare in vain that I would bring this calamity upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_11","027_6_11","EZK","6","11","11","This is what the Lord GOD says: Clap your hands, stomp your feet, and cry out “Alas!” because of all the wicked abominations of the house of Israel, who will fall by sword and famine and plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_12","027_6_12","EZK","6","12","12","He who is far off will die by the plague, he who is near will fall by the sword, and he who remains will die by famine. So I will vent My fury upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_13","027_6_13","EZK","6","13","13","Then you will know that I am the LORD, when their slain lie among their idols around their altars, on every high hill, on all the mountaintops, and under every green tree and leafy oak—the places where they offered fragrant incense to all their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK6_14","027_6_14","EZK","6","14","14","I will stretch out My hand against them, and wherever they live I will make the land a desolate waste, from the wilderness to Diblah. Then they will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_1","027_7_1","EZK","7","1","1","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_2","027_7_2","EZK","7","2","2","“O son of man, this is what the Lord GOD says to the land of Israel: ‘The end! The end has come upon the four corners of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_3","027_7_3","EZK","7","3","3","The end is now upon you, and I will unleash My anger against you. I will judge you according to your ways and repay you for all your abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_4","027_7_4","EZK","7","4","4","I will not look on you with pity, nor will I spare you, but I will punish you for your ways and for the abominations among you. Then you will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_5","027_7_5","EZK","7","5","5","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Disaster! An unprecedented disaster—behold, it is coming! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_6","027_7_6","EZK","7","6","6","The end has come! The end has come! It has roused itself against you. Behold, it has come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_7","027_7_7","EZK","7","7","7","Doom has come to you, O inhabitants of the land. The time has come; the day is near; there is panic on the mountains instead of shouts of joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_8","027_7_8","EZK","7","8","8","Very soon I will pour out My wrath upon you and vent My anger against you; I will judge you according to your ways and repay you for all your abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_9","027_7_9","EZK","7","9","9","I will not look on you with pity, nor will I spare you, but I will punish you for your ways and for the abominations among you. Then you will know that it is I, the LORD, who strikes the blow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_10","027_7_10","EZK","7","10","10","Behold, the day is here! It has come! Doom has gone out, the rod has budded, arrogance has bloomed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_11","027_7_11","EZK","7","11","11","Their violence has grown into a rod to punish their wickedness. None of them will remain: none of their multitude, none of their wealth, and nothing of value. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_12","027_7_12","EZK","7","12","12","The time has come; the day has arrived. Let the buyer not rejoice and the seller not mourn, for wrath is upon the whole multitude. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_13","027_7_13","EZK","7","13","13","The seller will surely not recover what he sold while both remain alive. For the vision concerning the whole multitude will not be revoked, and because of their iniquity, not one of them will preserve his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_14","027_7_14","EZK","7","14","14","They have blown the trumpet and made everything ready, but no one goes to war, for My wrath is upon the whole multitude. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_15","027_7_15","EZK","7","15","15","The sword is outside; plague and famine are within. Those in the country will die by the sword, and those in the city will be devoured by famine and plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_16","027_7_16","EZK","7","16","16","The survivors will escape and live in the mountains, moaning like doves of the valley, each for his own iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_17","027_7_17","EZK","7","17","17","Every hand will go limp, and every knee will turn to water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_18","027_7_18","EZK","7","18","18","They will put on sackcloth, and terror will overwhelm them. Shame will cover all their faces, and all their heads will be shaved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_19","027_7_19","EZK","7","19","19","They will throw their silver into the streets, and their gold will seem unclean. Their silver and gold cannot save them in the day of the wrath of the LORD. They cannot satisfy their appetites or fill their stomachs with wealth, for it became the stumbling block that brought their iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_20","027_7_20","EZK","7","20","20","His beautiful ornaments they transformed into pride and used them to fashion their vile images and detestable idols. Therefore I will make these into something unclean for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_21","027_7_21","EZK","7","21","21","And I will hand these things over as plunder to foreigners and loot to the wicked of the earth, who will defile them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_22","027_7_22","EZK","7","22","22","I will turn My face away from them, and they will defile My treasured place. Violent men will enter it, and they will defile it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_23","027_7_23","EZK","7","23","23","Forge the chain, for the land is full of crimes of bloodshed, and the city is full of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_24","027_7_24","EZK","7","24","24","So I will bring the most wicked of nations to take possession of their houses. I will end the pride of the mighty, and their holy places will be profaned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_25","027_7_25","EZK","7","25","25","Anguish is coming! They will seek peace, but find none. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_26","027_7_26","EZK","7","26","26","Disaster upon disaster will come, and rumor after rumor. Then they will seek a vision from a prophet, but instruction from the priests will perish, as will counsel from the elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK7_27","027_7_27","EZK","7","27","27","The king will mourn, the prince will be clothed with despair, and the hands of the people of the land will tremble. I will deal with them according to their conduct, and I will judge them by their own standards. Then they will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_1","027_8_1","EZK","8","1","1","In the sixth year, on the fifth day of the sixth month, I was sitting in my house, and the elders of Judah were sitting before me; and there the hand of the Lord GOD fell upon me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_2","027_8_2","EZK","8","2","2","Then I looked and saw a figure like that of a man. From His waist down His appearance was like fire, and from His waist up He was as bright as the gleam of amber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_3","027_8_3","EZK","8","3","3","He stretched out what looked like a hand and took me by the hair of my head. Then the Spirit lifted me up between earth and heaven and carried me in visions of God to Jerusalem, to the entrance of the north gate of the inner court, where the idol that provokes jealousy was seated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_4","027_8_4","EZK","8","4","4","And there I saw the glory of the God of Israel, like the vision I had seen in the plain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_5","027_8_5","EZK","8","5","5","“Son of man,” He said to me, “now lift up your eyes to the north.” So I lifted up my eyes to the north, and in the entrance north of the Altar Gate I saw this idol of jealousy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_6","027_8_6","EZK","8","6","6","“Son of man,” He said to me, “do you see what they are doing—the great abominations that the house of Israel is committing—to drive Me far from My sanctuary? Yet you will see even greater abominations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_7","027_8_7","EZK","8","7","7","Then He brought me to the entrance to the court, and I looked and saw a hole in the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_8","027_8_8","EZK","8","8","8","“Son of man,” He told me, “dig through the wall.” So I dug through the wall and discovered a doorway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_9","027_8_9","EZK","8","9","9","Then He said to me, “Go in and see the wicked abominations they are committing here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_10","027_8_10","EZK","8","10","10","So I went in and looked, and engraved all around the wall was every kind of crawling creature and detestable beast, along with all the idols of the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_11","027_8_11","EZK","8","11","11","Before them stood seventy elders of the house of Israel, with Jaazaniah son of Shaphan standing among them. Each had a censer in his hand, and a fragrant cloud of incense was rising. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_12","027_8_12","EZK","8","12","12","“Son of man,” He said to me, “do you see what the elders of the house of Israel are doing in the darkness, each at the shrine of his own idol? For they are saying, ‘The LORD does not see us; the LORD has forsaken the land.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_13","027_8_13","EZK","8","13","13","Again, He told me, “You will see them committing even greater abominations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_14","027_8_14","EZK","8","14","14","Then He brought me to the entrance of the north gate of the house of the LORD, and I saw women sitting there, weeping for Tammuz. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_15","027_8_15","EZK","8","15","15","“Son of man,” He said to me, “do you see this? Yet you will see even greater abominations than these.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_16","027_8_16","EZK","8","16","16","So He brought me to the inner court of the house of the LORD, and there at the entrance to the temple of the LORD, between the portico and the altar, were about twenty-five men with their backs to the temple of the LORD and their faces toward the east; and they were bowing to the east in worship of the sun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_17","027_8_17","EZK","8","17","17","“Son of man,” He said to me, “do you see this? Is it not enough for the house of Judah to commit the abominations they are practicing here, that they must also fill the land with violence and continually provoke Me to anger? Look, they are even putting the branch to their nose! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK8_18","027_8_18","EZK","8","18","18","Therefore I will respond with wrath. I will not look on them with pity, nor will I spare them. Although they shout loudly in My ears, I will not listen to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_1","027_9_1","EZK","9","1","1","Then I heard Him call out in a loud voice, saying, “Draw near, O executioners of the city, each with a weapon of destruction in hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_2","027_9_2","EZK","9","2","2","And I saw six men coming from the direction of the Upper Gate, which faces north, each with a weapon of slaughter in his hand. With them was another man clothed in linen who had a writing kit at his side. And they came in and stood beside the bronze altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_3","027_9_3","EZK","9","3","3","Then the glory of the God of Israel rose from above the cherubim, where it had been, and moved to the threshold of the temple. And He called to the man clothed in linen who had the writing kit at his side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_4","027_9_4","EZK","9","4","4","“Go throughout the city of Jerusalem,” said the LORD, “and put a mark on the foreheads of the men sighing and groaning over all the abominations committed there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_5","027_9_5","EZK","9","5","5","And as I listened, He said to the others, “Follow him through the city and start killing; do not show pity or spare anyone! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_6","027_9_6","EZK","9","6","6","Slaughter the old men, the young men and maidens, the women and children; but do not go near anyone who has the mark. Now begin at My sanctuary.” So they began with the elders who were before the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_7","027_9_7","EZK","9","7","7","Then He told them, “Defile the temple and fill the courts with the slain. Go forth!” So they went out and began killing throughout the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_8","027_9_8","EZK","9","8","8","While they were killing, I was left alone. And I fell facedown and cried out, “Oh, Lord GOD, when You pour out Your wrath on Jerusalem, will You destroy the entire remnant of Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_9","027_9_9","EZK","9","9","9","He replied, “The iniquity of the house of Israel and Judah is exceedingly great. The land is full of bloodshed, and the city is full of perversity. For they say, ‘The LORD has forsaken the land; the LORD does not see.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_10","027_9_10","EZK","9","10","10","But as for Me, I will not look on them with pity, nor will I spare them. I will bring their deeds down upon their own heads.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK9_11","027_9_11","EZK","9","11","11","Then the man clothed in linen with the writing kit at his side reported back, “I have done as You commanded.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_1","027_10_1","EZK","10","1","1","And I looked and saw above the expanse, above the heads of the cherubim, the likeness of a throne of sapphire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_2","027_10_2","EZK","10","2","2","And the LORD said to the man clothed in linen, “Go inside the wheelwork beneath the cherubim. Fill your hands with burning coals from among the cherubim and scatter them over the city.” And as I watched, he went in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_3","027_10_3","EZK","10","3","3","Now when the man went in, the cherubim were standing on the south side of the temple, and a cloud filled the inner court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_4","027_10_4","EZK","10","4","4","Then the glory of the LORD rose from above the cherubim and stood over the threshold of the temple. The temple was filled with the cloud, and the court was filled with the brightness of the glory of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_5","027_10_5","EZK","10","5","5","The sound of the wings of the cherubim could be heard as far as the outer court, like the voice of God Almighty when He speaks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_6","027_10_6","EZK","10","6","6","When the LORD commanded the man clothed in linen, saying, “Take fire from within the wheelwork, from among the cherubim,” the man went in and stood beside a wheel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_7","027_10_7","EZK","10","7","7","Then one of the cherubim reached out his hand and took some of the fire that was among them. And he put it into the hands of the man clothed in linen, who received it and went out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_8","027_10_8","EZK","10","8","8","(The cherubim appeared to have the form of human hands under their wings.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_9","027_10_9","EZK","10","9","9","Then I looked and saw four wheels beside the cherubim, one wheel beside each cherub. And the wheels gleamed like a beryl stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_10","027_10_10","EZK","10","10","10","As for their appearance, all four had the same form, like a wheel within a wheel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_11","027_10_11","EZK","10","11","11","When they moved, they would go in any of the four directions, without turning as they moved. For wherever the head faced, the cherubim would go in that direction, without turning as they moved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_12","027_10_12","EZK","10","12","12","Their entire bodies, including their backs, hands, and wings, were full of eyes all around, as were their four wheels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_13","027_10_13","EZK","10","13","13","I heard the wheels being called “the whirling wheels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_14","027_10_14","EZK","10","14","14","Each of the cherubim had four faces: the first face was that of a cherub, the second that of a man, the third that of a lion, and the fourth that of an eagle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_15","027_10_15","EZK","10","15","15","Then the cherubim rose upward. These were the living creatures I had seen by the River Kebar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_16","027_10_16","EZK","10","16","16","When the cherubim moved, the wheels moved beside them, and even when they spread their wings to rise from the ground, the wheels did not veer away from their side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_17","027_10_17","EZK","10","17","17","When the cherubim stood still, the wheels also stood still, and when they ascended, the wheels ascended with them, for the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_18","027_10_18","EZK","10","18","18","Then the glory of the LORD moved away from the threshold of the temple and stood above the cherubim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_19","027_10_19","EZK","10","19","19","As I watched, the cherubim lifted their wings and rose up from the ground, with the wheels beside them as they went. And they stopped at the entrance of the east gate of the house of the LORD, with the glory of the God of Israel above them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_20","027_10_20","EZK","10","20","20","These were the living creatures I had seen beneath the God of Israel by the River Kebar, and I knew that they were cherubim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_21","027_10_21","EZK","10","21","21","Each had four faces and four wings, with what looked like human hands under their wings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK10_22","027_10_22","EZK","10","22","22","Their faces looked like the faces I had seen by the River Kebar. Each creature went straight ahead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_1","027_11_1","EZK","11","1","1","Then the Spirit lifted me up and brought me to the gate of the house of the LORD that faces east. And there at the entrance of the gate were twenty-five men. Among them I saw Jaazaniah son of Azzur and Pelatiah son of Benaiah, who were leaders of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_2","027_11_2","EZK","11","2","2","And the LORD said to me, “Son of man, these are the men who plot evil and give wicked counsel in this city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_3","027_11_3","EZK","11","3","3","They are saying, ‘Is not the time near to build houses? The city is the cooking pot, and we are the meat.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_4","027_11_4","EZK","11","4","4","Therefore prophesy against them; prophesy, O son of man!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_5","027_11_5","EZK","11","5","5","And the Spirit of the LORD fell upon me and told me to declare that this is what the LORD says: “That is what you are thinking, O house of Israel; and I know the thoughts that arise in your minds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_6","027_11_6","EZK","11","6","6","You have multiplied those you killed in this city and filled its streets with the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_7","027_11_7","EZK","11","7","7","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: The slain you have laid within this city are the meat, and the city is the pot; but I will remove you from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_8","027_11_8","EZK","11","8","8","You fear the sword, so I will bring the sword against you, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_9","027_11_9","EZK","11","9","9","I will bring you out of the city and deliver you into the hands of foreigners, and I will execute judgments against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_10","027_11_10","EZK","11","10","10","You will fall by the sword, and I will judge you even to the borders of Israel. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_11","027_11_11","EZK","11","11","11","The city will not be a pot for you, nor will you be the meat within it. I will judge you even to the borders of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_12","027_11_12","EZK","11","12","12","Then you will know that I am the LORD. For you have neither followed My statutes nor practiced My ordinances, but you have conformed to the ordinances of the nations around you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_13","027_11_13","EZK","11","13","13","Now as I was prophesying, Pelatiah son of Benaiah died. Then I fell facedown and cried out in a loud voice, “Oh, Lord GOD, will You bring the remnant of Israel to a complete end?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_14","027_11_14","EZK","11","14","14","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_15","027_11_15","EZK","11","15","15","“Son of man, your brothers—your relatives, your fellow exiles, and the whole house of Israel—are those of whom the people of Jerusalem have said, ‘They are far away from the LORD; this land has been given to us as a possession.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_16","027_11_16","EZK","11","16","16","Therefore declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Although I sent them far away among the nations and scattered them among the countries, yet for a little while I have been a sanctuary for them in the countries to which they have gone.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_17","027_11_17","EZK","11","17","17","Therefore declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will gather you from the peoples and assemble you from the countries to which you have been scattered, and I will give back to you the land of Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_18","027_11_18","EZK","11","18","18","When they return to it, they will remove all its detestable things and all its abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_19","027_11_19","EZK","11","19","19","And I will give them singleness of heart and put a new spirit within them; I will remove their heart of stone and give them a heart of flesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_20","027_11_20","EZK","11","20","20","so that they may follow My statutes, keep My ordinances, and practice them. Then they will be My people, and I will be their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_21","027_11_21","EZK","11","21","21","But as for those whose hearts pursue detestable things and abominations, I will bring their conduct down upon their own heads, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_22","027_11_22","EZK","11","22","22","Then the cherubim, with the wheels beside them, spread their wings, and the glory of the God of Israel was above them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_23","027_11_23","EZK","11","23","23","And the glory of the LORD rose up from within the city and stood over the mountain east of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_24","027_11_24","EZK","11","24","24","And the Spirit lifted me up and carried me back to Chaldea, to the exiles in the vision given by the Spirit of God. After the vision had gone up from me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK11_25","027_11_25","EZK","11","25","25","I told the exiles everything the LORD had shown me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_1","027_12_1","EZK","12","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_2","027_12_2","EZK","12","2","2","“Son of man, you are living in a rebellious house. They have eyes to see but do not see, and ears to hear but do not hear, for they are a rebellious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_3","027_12_3","EZK","12","3","3","Therefore, son of man, pack your bags for exile. In broad daylight, set out from your place and go to another as they watch. Perhaps they will understand, though they are a rebellious house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_4","027_12_4","EZK","12","4","4","Bring out your baggage for exile by day, as they watch. Then in the evening, as they watch, go out like those who go into exile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_5","027_12_5","EZK","12","5","5","As they watch, dig through the wall and carry your belongings out through it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_6","027_12_6","EZK","12","6","6","And as they watch, lift your bags to your shoulder and take them out at dusk; cover your face so that you cannot see the land. For I have made you a sign to the house of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_7","027_12_7","EZK","12","7","7","So I did as I was commanded. I brought out my bags for exile by day, and in the evening I dug through the wall by hand. I took my belongings out at dusk, carrying them on my shoulder as they watched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_8","027_12_8","EZK","12","8","8","And in the morning the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_9","027_12_9","EZK","12","9","9","“Son of man, hasn’t the rebellious house of Israel asked you, ‘What are you doing?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_10","027_12_10","EZK","12","10","10","Tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘This burden concerns the prince in Jerusalem and all the house of Israel who are there.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_11","027_12_11","EZK","12","11","11","You are to say, ‘I am a sign to you.’ Just as it happened here, so will it be done to them; they will go into exile as captives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_12","027_12_12","EZK","12","12","12","And at dusk the prince among them will lift his bags to his shoulder and go out. They will dig through the wall to bring him out. He will cover his face so he cannot see the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_13","027_12_13","EZK","12","13","13","But I will spread My net over him, and he will be caught in My snare. I will bring him to Babylon, the land of the Chaldeans; yet he will not see it, and there he will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_14","027_12_14","EZK","12","14","14","And I will scatter to every wind all the attendants around him and all his troops, and I will draw a sword to chase after them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_15","027_12_15","EZK","12","15","15","And they will know that I am the LORD, when I disperse them among the nations and scatter them throughout the countries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_16","027_12_16","EZK","12","16","16","But I will spare a few of them from sword and famine and plague, so that in the nations to which they go, they can recount all their abominations. Then they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_17","027_12_17","EZK","12","17","17","Moreover, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_18","027_12_18","EZK","12","18","18","“Son of man, eat your bread with trembling, and drink your water with quivering and anxiety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_19","027_12_19","EZK","12","19","19","Then tell the people of the land that this is what the Lord GOD says about those living in Jerusalem and in the land of Israel: ‘They will eat their bread with anxiety and drink their water in dread, for their land will be stripped of everything in it because of the violence of all who dwell in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_20","027_12_20","EZK","12","20","20","The inhabited cities will be laid waste, and the land will become desolate. Then you will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_21","027_12_21","EZK","12","21","21","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_22","027_12_22","EZK","12","22","22","“Son of man, what is this proverb that you have in the land of Israel: ‘The days go by, and every vision fails’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_23","027_12_23","EZK","12","23","23","Therefore tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will put an end to this proverb, and in Israel they will no longer recite it.’ But say to them: ‘The days are at hand when every vision will be fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_24","027_12_24","EZK","12","24","24","For there will be no more false visions or flattering divinations within the house of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_25","027_12_25","EZK","12","25","25","because I, the LORD, will speak whatever word I speak, and it will be fulfilled without delay. For in your days, O rebellious house, I will speak a message and bring it to pass, declares the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_26","027_12_26","EZK","12","26","26","Furthermore, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_27","027_12_27","EZK","12","27","27","“Son of man, take note that the house of Israel is saying, ‘The vision that he sees is for many years from now; he prophesies about the distant future.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK12_28","027_12_28","EZK","12","28","28","Therefore tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘None of My words will be delayed any longer. The message I speak will be fulfilled, declares the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_1","027_13_1","EZK","13","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_2","027_13_2","EZK","13","2","2","“Son of man, prophesy against the prophets of Israel who are now prophesying. Tell those who prophesy out of their own imagination: Hear the word of the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_3","027_13_3","EZK","13","3","3","This is what the Lord GOD says: Woe to the foolish prophets who follow their own spirit yet have seen nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_4","027_13_4","EZK","13","4","4","Your prophets, O Israel, are like foxes among the ruins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_5","027_13_5","EZK","13","5","5","You did not go up to the gaps or restore the wall around the house of Israel so that it would stand in the battle on the Day of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_6","027_13_6","EZK","13","6","6","They see false visions and speak lying divinations. They claim, ‘Thus declares the LORD,’ when the LORD did not send them; yet they wait for the fulfillment of their message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_7","027_13_7","EZK","13","7","7","Haven’t you seen a false vision and spoken a lying divination when you proclaim, ‘Thus declares the LORD,’ even though I have not spoken? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_8","027_13_8","EZK","13","8","8","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Because you have uttered vain words and seen false visions, I am against you, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_9","027_13_9","EZK","13","9","9","My hand will be against the prophets who see false visions and speak lying divinations. They will not belong to the council of My people or be recorded in the register of the house of Israel, nor will they enter the land of Israel. Then you will know that I am the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_10","027_13_10","EZK","13","10","10","Because they have led My people astray, saying, ‘Peace,’ when there is no peace, and whitewashing any flimsy wall that is built, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_11","027_13_11","EZK","13","11","11","tell those whitewashing the wall that it will fall. Rain will come in torrents, I will send hailstones plunging down, and a windstorm will burst forth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_12","027_13_12","EZK","13","12","12","Surely when the wall has fallen, you will not be asked, ‘Where is the whitewash with which you covered it?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_13","027_13_13","EZK","13","13","13","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: In My wrath I will release a windstorm, and in My anger torrents of rain and hail will fall with destructive fury. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_14","027_13_14","EZK","13","14","14","I will tear down the wall you whitewashed and level it to the ground, so that its foundation is exposed. The city will fall, and you will be destroyed within it. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_15","027_13_15","EZK","13","15","15","And after I have vented My wrath against the wall and against those who whitewashed it, I will say to you: ‘The wall is gone, and so are those who whitewashed it— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_16","027_13_16","EZK","13","16","16","those prophets of Israel who prophesied to Jerusalem and saw a vision of peace for her when there was no peace, declares the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_17","027_13_17","EZK","13","17","17","Now, O son of man, set your face against the daughters of your people who prophesy out of their own imagination. Prophesy against them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_18","027_13_18","EZK","13","18","18","and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: Woe to the women who sew magic charms on their wrists and make veils for the heads of people of every height, in order to ensnare their souls. Will you ensnare the souls of My people but preserve your own? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_19","027_13_19","EZK","13","19","19","You have profaned Me among My people for handfuls of barley and scraps of bread. By lying to My people who would listen, you have killed those who should not have died and spared those who should not have lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_20","027_13_20","EZK","13","20","20","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: See, I am against the magic charms with which you ensnare souls like birds, and I will tear them from your arms. So I will free the souls you have ensnared like birds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_21","027_13_21","EZK","13","21","21","I will also tear off your veils and deliver My people from your hands, so that they will no longer be prey in your hands. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_22","027_13_22","EZK","13","22","22","Because you have disheartened the righteous with your lies, even though I have caused them no grief, and because you have encouraged the wicked not to turn from their evil ways to save their lives, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK13_23","027_13_23","EZK","13","23","23","therefore you will no longer see false visions or practice divination. I will deliver My people from your hands. Then you will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_1","027_14_1","EZK","14","1","1","Then some of the elders of Israel came and sat down before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_2","027_14_2","EZK","14","2","2","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_3","027_14_3","EZK","14","3","3","“Son of man, these men have set up idols in their hearts and put wicked stumbling blocks before their faces. Should I consult with them in any way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_4","027_14_4","EZK","14","4","4","Therefore speak to them and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘When any Israelite sets up idols in his heart and puts a wicked stumbling block before his face, and then comes to the prophet, I the LORD will answer him according to his great idolatry, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_5","027_14_5","EZK","14","5","5","so that I may take hold of the hearts of the people of Israel. For because of their idols, they are all estranged from Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_6","027_14_6","EZK","14","6","6","Therefore tell the house of Israel that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Repent and turn away from your idols; turn your faces away from all your abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_7","027_14_7","EZK","14","7","7","For when any Israelite or any foreigner dwelling in Israel separates himself from Me, sets up idols in his heart, and puts a wicked stumbling block before his face, and then comes to the prophet to inquire of Me, I the LORD will answer him Myself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_8","027_14_8","EZK","14","8","8","I will set My face against that man and make him a sign and a proverb; I will cut him off from among My people. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_9","027_14_9","EZK","14","9","9","But if the prophet is enticed to speak a message, then it was I the LORD who enticed him, and I will stretch out My hand against him and destroy him from among My people Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_10","027_14_10","EZK","14","10","10","They will bear their punishment—the punishment of the inquirer will be the same as that of the prophet— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_11","027_14_11","EZK","14","11","11","in order that the house of Israel may no longer stray from Me and no longer defile themselves with all their transgressions. Then they will be My people and I will be their God, declares the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_12","027_14_12","EZK","14","12","12","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_13","027_14_13","EZK","14","13","13","“Son of man, if a land sins against Me by acting unfaithfully, and I stretch out My hand against it to cut off its supply of food, to send famine upon it, and to cut off from it both man and beast, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_14","027_14_14","EZK","14","14","14","then even if these three men—Noah, Daniel, and Job—were in it, their righteousness could deliver only themselves, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_15","027_14_15","EZK","14","15","15","Or if I send wild beasts through the land to leave it childless and desolate, with no man passing through it for fear of the beasts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_16","027_14_16","EZK","14","16","16","then as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, even if these three men were in it, they could not deliver their own sons or daughters. They alone would be delivered, but the land would be desolate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_17","027_14_17","EZK","14","17","17","Or if I bring a sword against that land and say, ‘Let a sword pass through it,’ so that I cut off from it both man and beast, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_18","027_14_18","EZK","14","18","18","then as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, even if these three men were in it, they could not deliver their own sons or daughters. They alone would be delivered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_19","027_14_19","EZK","14","19","19","Or if I send a plague into that land and pour out My wrath upon it through bloodshed, cutting off from it both man and beast, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_20","027_14_20","EZK","14","20","20","then as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, even if Noah, Daniel, and Job were in it, they could not deliver their own sons or daughters. Their righteousness could deliver only themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_21","027_14_21","EZK","14","21","21","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘How much worse will it be when I send against Jerusalem My four dire judgments—sword, famine, wild beasts, and plague—in order to cut off from it both man and beast? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_22","027_14_22","EZK","14","22","22","Yet, behold, some survivors will be left in it—sons and daughters who will be brought out. They will come out to you, and when you see their conduct and actions, you will be comforted regarding the disaster I have brought upon Jerusalem—all that I have brought upon it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK14_23","027_14_23","EZK","14","23","23","They will bring you consolation when you see their conduct and actions, and you will know that it was not without cause that I have done all these things within it,’ declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_1","027_15_1","EZK","15","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_2","027_15_2","EZK","15","2","2","“Son of man, how does the wood of the vine surpass any other branch among the trees in the forest? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_3","027_15_3","EZK","15","3","3","Can wood be taken from it to make something useful? Or can one make from it a peg on which to hang utensils? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_4","027_15_4","EZK","15","4","4","No, it is cast into the fire for fuel. The fire devours both ends, and the middle is charred. Can it be useful for anything? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_5","027_15_5","EZK","15","5","5","Even when it was whole, it could not be made useful. How much less can it ever be useful when the fire has consumed it and charred it! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_6","027_15_6","EZK","15","6","6","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Like the wood of the vine among the trees of the forest, which I have given to the fire for fuel, so I will give up the people of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_7","027_15_7","EZK","15","7","7","And I will set My face against them. Though they may have escaped the fire, yet another fire will consume them. And when I set My face against them, you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK15_8","027_15_8","EZK","15","8","8","Thus I will make the land desolate, because they have acted unfaithfully,’ declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_1","027_16_1","EZK","16","1","1","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_2","027_16_2","EZK","16","2","2","“Son of man, confront Jerusalem with her abominations ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_3","027_16_3","EZK","16","3","3","and tell her that this is what the Lord GOD says to Jerusalem: Your origin and your birth were in the land of the Canaanites. Your father was an Amorite and your mother a Hittite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_4","027_16_4","EZK","16","4","4","On the day of your birth your cord was not cut, nor were you washed with water for cleansing. You were not rubbed with salt or wrapped in cloths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_5","027_16_5","EZK","16","5","5","No one cared enough for you to do even one of these things out of compassion for you. Instead, you were thrown out into the open field, because you were despised on the day of your birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_6","027_16_6","EZK","16","6","6","Then I passed by and saw you wallowing in your blood, and as you lay there in your blood I said to you, ‘Live!’ There I said to you, ‘Live!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_7","027_16_7","EZK","16","7","7","I made you thrive like a plant of the field. You grew up and matured and became very beautiful. Your breasts were formed and your hair grew, but you were naked and bare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_8","027_16_8","EZK","16","8","8","Then I passed by and saw you, and you were indeed old enough for love. So I spread My cloak over you and covered your nakedness. I pledged Myself to you, entered into a covenant with you, and you became Mine, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_9","027_16_9","EZK","16","9","9","Then I bathed you with water, rinsed off your blood, and anointed you with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_10","027_16_10","EZK","16","10","10","I clothed you in embroidered cloth and gave you sandals of fine leather. I wrapped you in fine linen and covered you with silk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_11","027_16_11","EZK","16","11","11","I adorned you with jewelry, and I put bracelets on your wrists and a chain around your neck. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_12","027_16_12","EZK","16","12","12","I put a ring in your nose, earrings on your ears, and a beautiful crown upon your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_13","027_16_13","EZK","16","13","13","So you were adorned with gold and silver, and your clothing was made of fine linen, silk, and embroidered cloth. You ate fine flour, honey, and oil. You became very beautiful and rose to be queen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_14","027_16_14","EZK","16","14","14","Your fame spread among the nations on account of your beauty, for it was perfect in the splendor I bestowed on you, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_15","027_16_15","EZK","16","15","15","But because of your fame, you trusted in your beauty and played the harlot. You lavished your favors on everyone who passed by, and your beauty was theirs for the asking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_16","027_16_16","EZK","16","16","16","You took some of your garments and made colorful high places for yourself, and on them you prostituted yourself. Such things should not have happened; never should they have occurred! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_17","027_16_17","EZK","16","17","17","You also took the fine jewelry of gold and silver I had given you, and you made male idols with which to prostitute yourself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_18","027_16_18","EZK","16","18","18","You took your embroidered garments to cover them, and you set My oil and incense before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_19","027_16_19","EZK","16","19","19","And you set before them as a pleasing aroma the food I had given you—the fine flour, oil, and honey that I had fed you. That is what happened, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_20","027_16_20","EZK","16","20","20","You even took the sons and daughters you bore to Me and sacrificed them as food to idols. Was your prostitution not enough? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_21","027_16_21","EZK","16","21","21","You slaughtered My children and delivered them up through the fire to idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_22","027_16_22","EZK","16","22","22","And in all your abominations and acts of prostitution, you did not remember the days of your youth when you were naked and bare, wallowing in your own blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_23","027_16_23","EZK","16","23","23","Woe! Woe to you, declares the Lord GOD. And in addition to all your other wickedness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_24","027_16_24","EZK","16","24","24","you built yourself a mound and made yourself a lofty shrine in every public square. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_25","027_16_25","EZK","16","25","25","At the head of every street you built your lofty shrines and degraded your beauty. With increasing promiscuity, you spread your legs to all who passed by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_26","027_16_26","EZK","16","26","26","You prostituted yourself with your lustful neighbors, the Egyptians, and increased your promiscuity to provoke Me to anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_27","027_16_27","EZK","16","27","27","Therefore I stretched out My hand against you and reduced your portion. I gave you over to the desire of those who hate you, the daughters of the Philistines, who were ashamed of your lewd conduct. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_28","027_16_28","EZK","16","28","28","Then you prostituted yourself with the Assyrians, because you were not yet satisfied. Even after that, you were still not satisfied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_29","027_16_29","EZK","16","29","29","So you extended your promiscuity to Chaldea, the land of merchants—but even with this you were not satisfied! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_30","027_16_30","EZK","16","30","30","How weak-willed is your heart, declares the Lord GOD, while you do all these things, the acts of a shameless prostitute! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_31","027_16_31","EZK","16","31","31","But when you built your mounds at the head of every street and made your lofty shrines in every public square, you were not even like a prostitute, because you scorned payment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_32","027_16_32","EZK","16","32","32","You adulterous wife! You receive strangers instead of your own husband! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_33","027_16_33","EZK","16","33","33","Men give gifts to all their prostitutes, but you gave gifts to all your lovers. You bribed them to come to you from everywhere for your illicit favors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_34","027_16_34","EZK","16","34","34","So your prostitution is the opposite of that of other women: No one solicited your favors, and you paid a fee instead of receiving one; so you are the very opposite! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_35","027_16_35","EZK","16","35","35","Therefore, O prostitute, hear the word of the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_36","027_16_36","EZK","16","36","36","This is what the Lord GOD says: Because you poured out your wealth and exposed your nakedness in your promiscuity with your lovers and with all your detestable idols, and because of the blood of your children which you gave to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_37","027_16_37","EZK","16","37","37","therefore I will surely gather all the lovers with whom you found pleasure, all those you loved and all those you hated. I will gather them against you from all around and expose you before them, and they will see you completely naked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_38","027_16_38","EZK","16","38","38","And I will sentence you to the punishment of women who commit adultery and those who shed blood; so I will bring upon you the wrath of your bloodshed and jealousy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_39","027_16_39","EZK","16","39","39","Then I will deliver you into the hands of your lovers, and they will level your mounds and tear down your lofty shrines. They will strip off your clothes, take your fine jewelry, and leave you naked and bare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_40","027_16_40","EZK","16","40","40","They will bring a mob against you, who will stone you and cut you to pieces with their swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_41","027_16_41","EZK","16","41","41","Then they will burn down your houses and execute judgment against you in the sight of many women. I will put an end to your prostitution, and you will never again pay your lovers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_42","027_16_42","EZK","16","42","42","So I will lay to rest My wrath against you, and My jealousy will turn away from you. Then I will be calm and no longer angry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_43","027_16_43","EZK","16","43","43","Because you did not remember the days of your youth, but enraged Me with all these things, I will surely bring your deeds down upon your own head, declares the Lord GOD. Have you not committed this lewdness on top of all your other abominations? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_44","027_16_44","EZK","16","44","44","Behold, all who speak in proverbs will quote this proverb about you: ‘Like mother, like daughter.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_45","027_16_45","EZK","16","45","45","You are the daughter of your mother, who despised her husband and children. You are the sister of your sisters, who despised their husbands and children. Your mother was a Hittite and your father an Amorite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_46","027_16_46","EZK","16","46","46","Your older sister was Samaria, who lived with her daughters to your north; and your younger sister was Sodom, who lived with her daughters to your south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_47","027_16_47","EZK","16","47","47","And you not only walked in their ways and practiced their abominations, but soon you were more depraved than they were. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_48","027_16_48","EZK","16","48","48","As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, your sister Sodom and her daughters never did as you and your daughters have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_49","027_16_49","EZK","16","49","49","Now this was the iniquity of your sister Sodom: She and her daughters were arrogant, overfed, and complacent; they did not help the poor and needy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_50","027_16_50","EZK","16","50","50","Thus they were haughty and committed abominations before Me. Therefore I removed them, as you have seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_51","027_16_51","EZK","16","51","51","Furthermore, Samaria did not commit half the sins you did. You have multiplied your abominations beyond theirs, and all the abominations you have committed have made your sisters appear righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_52","027_16_52","EZK","16","52","52","So now you must bear your disgrace, since you have brought justification for your sisters. For they appear more righteous than you, because your sins were more vile than theirs. So you too must bear your shame and disgrace, since you have made your sisters appear righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_53","027_16_53","EZK","16","53","53","But I will restore Sodom and her daughters from captivity, as well as Samaria and her daughters. And I will restore you along with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_54","027_16_54","EZK","16","54","54","So you will bear your disgrace and be ashamed of all you did to comfort them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_55","027_16_55","EZK","16","55","55","And your sisters, Sodom with her daughters and Samaria with her daughters, will return to their former state. You and your daughters will also return to your former state. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_56","027_16_56","EZK","16","56","56","Did you not treat your sister Sodom as an object of scorn in the day of your pride, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_57","027_16_57","EZK","16","57","57","before your wickedness was uncovered? Even so, you are now scorned by the daughters of Edom and all those around her, and by the daughters of the Philistines—all those around you who despise you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_58","027_16_58","EZK","16","58","58","You will bear the consequences of your lewdness and your abominations, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_59","027_16_59","EZK","16","59","59","For this is what the Lord GOD says: I will deal with you according to your deeds, since you have despised the oath by breaking the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_60","027_16_60","EZK","16","60","60","But I will remember the covenant I made with you in the days of your youth, and I will establish an everlasting covenant with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_61","027_16_61","EZK","16","61","61","Then you will remember your ways and be ashamed when you receive your older and younger sisters. I will give them to you as daughters, but not because of My covenant with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_62","027_16_62","EZK","16","62","62","So I will establish My covenant with you, and you will know that I am the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK16_63","027_16_63","EZK","16","63","63","so that when I make atonement for all you have done, you will remember and be ashamed and never again open your mouth because of your disgrace, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_1","027_17_1","EZK","17","1","1","Now the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_2","027_17_2","EZK","17","2","2","“Son of man, pose a riddle; speak a parable to the house of Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_3","027_17_3","EZK","17","3","3","and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘A great eagle with great wings and long pinions, full of feathers of many colors, came to Lebanon and took away the top of the cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_4","027_17_4","EZK","17","4","4","He plucked off its topmost shoot, carried it to the land of merchants, and planted it in a city of traders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_5","027_17_5","EZK","17","5","5","He took some of the seed of the land and planted it in fertile soil; he placed it by abundant waters and set it out like a willow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_6","027_17_6","EZK","17","6","6","It sprouted and became a spreading vine, low in height, with branches turned toward him; yet its roots remained where it stood. So it became a vine and yielded branches and sent out shoots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_7","027_17_7","EZK","17","7","7","But there was another great eagle with great wings and many feathers. And behold, this vine bent its roots toward him. It stretched out its branches to him from its planting bed, so that he might water it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_8","027_17_8","EZK","17","8","8","It had been planted in good soil by abundant waters in order to yield branches and bear fruit and become a splendid vine.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_9","027_17_9","EZK","17","9","9","So you are to tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Will it flourish? Will it not be uprooted and stripped of its fruit so that it shrivels? All its foliage will wither! It will not take a strong arm or many people to pull it up by its roots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_10","027_17_10","EZK","17","10","10","Even if it is transplanted, will it flourish? Will it not completely wither when the east wind strikes? It will wither on the bed where it sprouted.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_11","027_17_11","EZK","17","11","11","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_12","027_17_12","EZK","17","12","12","“Now say to this rebellious house: ‘Do you not know what these things mean?’ Tell them, ‘Behold, the king of Babylon came to Jerusalem, carried off its king and officials, and brought them back with him to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_13","027_17_13","EZK","17","13","13","He took a member of the royal family and made a covenant with him, putting him under oath. Then he carried away the leading men of the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_14","027_17_14","EZK","17","14","14","so that the kingdom would be brought low, unable to lift itself up, surviving only by keeping his covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_15","027_17_15","EZK","17","15","15","But this king rebelled against Babylon by sending his envoys to Egypt to ask for horses and a large army. Will he flourish? Will the one who does such things escape? Can he break a covenant and yet escape?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_16","027_17_16","EZK","17","16","16","‘As surely as I live,’ declares the Lord GOD, ‘he will die in Babylon, in the land of the king who enthroned him, whose oath he despised and whose covenant he broke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_17","027_17_17","EZK","17","17","17","Pharaoh with his mighty army and vast horde will not help him in battle, when ramps are built and siege walls constructed to destroy many lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_18","027_17_18","EZK","17","18","18","He despised the oath by breaking the covenant. Seeing that he gave his hand in pledge yet did all these things, he will not escape!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_19","027_17_19","EZK","17","19","19","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘As surely as I live, I will bring down upon his head My oath that he despised and My covenant that he broke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_20","027_17_20","EZK","17","20","20","I will spread My net over him and catch him in My snare. I will bring him to Babylon and execute judgment upon him there for the treason he committed against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_21","027_17_21","EZK","17","21","21","All his choice troops will fall by the sword, and those who survive will be scattered to every wind. Then you will know that I, the LORD, have spoken.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_22","027_17_22","EZK","17","22","22","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will take a shoot from the lofty top of the cedar, and I will set it out. I will pluck a tender sprig from its topmost shoots, and I will plant it on a high and lofty mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_23","027_17_23","EZK","17","23","23","I will plant it on the mountain heights of Israel so that it will bear branches; it will yield fruit and become a majestic cedar. Birds of every kind will nest under it, taking shelter in the shade of its branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK17_24","027_17_24","EZK","17","24","24","Then all the trees of the field will know that I am the LORD. I bring the tall tree down and make the low tree tall. I dry up the green tree and make the withered tree flourish. I, the LORD, have spoken, and I have done it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_1","027_18_1","EZK","18","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_2","027_18_2","EZK","18","2","2","“What do you people mean by quoting this proverb about the land of Israel: ‘The fathers have eaten sour grapes, and the teeth of the children are set on edge’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_3","027_18_3","EZK","18","3","3","As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, you will no longer quote this proverb in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_4","027_18_4","EZK","18","4","4","Behold, every soul belongs to Me; both father and son are Mine. The soul who sins is the one who will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_5","027_18_5","EZK","18","5","5","Now suppose a man is righteous and does what is just and right: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_6","027_18_6","EZK","18","6","6","He does not eat at the mountain or look to the idols of the house of Israel. He does not defile his neighbor’s wife or approach a woman during her period. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_7","027_18_7","EZK","18","7","7","He does not oppress another, but restores the pledge to the debtor. He does not commit robbery, but gives his bread to the hungry and covers the naked with clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_8","027_18_8","EZK","18","8","8","He does not engage in usury or take excess interest, but he withholds his hand from iniquity and executes true justice between men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_9","027_18_9","EZK","18","9","9","He follows My statutes and faithfully keeps My ordinances. That man is righteous; surely he will live, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_10","027_18_10","EZK","18","10","10","Now suppose that man has a violent son, who sheds blood or does any of these things, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_11","027_18_11","EZK","18","11","11","though the father has done none of them: Indeed, the son eats at the mountain and defiles his neighbor’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_12","027_18_12","EZK","18","12","12","He oppresses the poor and needy; he commits robbery and does not restore a pledge. He lifts his eyes to idols; he commits abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_13","027_18_13","EZK","18","13","13","He engages in usury and takes excess interest. Will this son live? He will not! Since he has committed all these abominations, he will surely die; his blood will be on his own head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_14","027_18_14","EZK","18","14","14","Now suppose this son has a son who sees all the sins his father has committed, considers them, and does not do likewise: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_15","027_18_15","EZK","18","15","15","He does not eat at the mountain or look to the idols of the house of Israel. He does not defile his neighbor’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_16","027_18_16","EZK","18","16","16","He does not oppress another, or retain a pledge, or commit robbery. He gives his bread to the hungry and covers the naked with clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_17","027_18_17","EZK","18","17","17","He withholds his hand from harming the poor and takes no interest or usury. He keeps My ordinances and follows My statutes. Such a man will not die for his father’s iniquity. He will surely live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_18","027_18_18","EZK","18","18","18","As for his father, he will die for his own iniquity, because he practiced extortion, robbed his brother, and did what was wrong among his people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_19","027_18_19","EZK","18","19","19","Yet you may ask, ‘Why shouldn’t the son bear the iniquity of his father?’ Since the son has done what is just and right, carefully observing all My statutes, he will surely live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_20","027_18_20","EZK","18","20","20","The soul who sins is the one who will die. A son will not bear the iniquity of his father, and a father will not bear the iniquity of his son. The righteousness of the righteous man will fall upon him, and the wickedness of the wicked man will fall upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_21","027_18_21","EZK","18","21","21","But if the wicked man turns from all the sins he has committed, keeps all My statutes, and does what is just and right, he will surely live; he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_22","027_18_22","EZK","18","22","22","None of the transgressions he has committed will be held against him. Because of the righteousness he has practiced, he will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_23","027_18_23","EZK","18","23","23","Do I take any pleasure in the death of the wicked? declares the Lord GOD. Wouldn’t I prefer that he turn from his ways and live? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_24","027_18_24","EZK","18","24","24","But if a righteous man turns from his righteousness and practices iniquity, committing the same abominations as the wicked, will he live? None of the righteous acts he did will be remembered. Because of the unfaithfulness and sin he has committed, he will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_25","027_18_25","EZK","18","25","25","Yet you say, ‘The way of the Lord is not just.’ Hear now, O house of Israel: Is it My way that is unjust? Is it not your ways that are unjust? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_26","027_18_26","EZK","18","26","26","If a righteous man turns from his righteousness and practices iniquity, he will die for this. He will die because of the iniquity he has committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_27","027_18_27","EZK","18","27","27","But if a wicked man turns from the wickedness he has committed and does what is just and right, he will save his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_28","027_18_28","EZK","18","28","28","Because he considered and turned from all the transgressions he had committed, he will surely live; he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_29","027_18_29","EZK","18","29","29","Yet the house of Israel says, ‘The way of the Lord is not just.’ Are My ways unjust, O house of Israel? Is it not your ways that are unjust? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_30","027_18_30","EZK","18","30","30","Therefore, O house of Israel, I will judge you, each according to his ways, declares the Lord GOD. Repent and turn from all your transgressions, so that your iniquity will not become your downfall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_31","027_18_31","EZK","18","31","31","Cast away from yourselves all the transgressions you have committed, and fashion for yourselves a new heart and a new spirit. Why should you die, O house of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK18_32","027_18_32","EZK","18","32","32","For I take no pleasure in anyone’s death, declares the Lord GOD. So repent and live! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_1","027_19_1","EZK","19","1","1","“As for you, take up a lament for the princes of Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_2","027_19_2","EZK","19","2","2","and say: ‘What was your mother? A lioness among the lions! She lay down among the young lions; she reared her cubs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_3","027_19_3","EZK","19","3","3","She brought up one of her cubs, and he became a young lion. After learning to tear his prey, he devoured men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_4","027_19_4","EZK","19","4","4","When the nations heard of him, he was trapped in their pit. With hooks they led him away to the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_5","027_19_5","EZK","19","5","5","When she saw that she had waited in vain, that her hope was lost, she took another of her cubs and made him a young lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_6","027_19_6","EZK","19","6","6","He prowled among the lions, and became a young lion. After learning to tear his prey, he devoured men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_7","027_19_7","EZK","19","7","7","He broke down their strongholds and devastated their cities. The land and everything in it shuddered at the sound of his roaring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_8","027_19_8","EZK","19","8","8","Then the nations set out against him from the provinces on every side. They spread their net over him; he was trapped in their pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_9","027_19_9","EZK","19","9","9","With hooks they caged him and brought him to the king of Babylon. They brought him into captivity so that his roar was heard no longer on the mountains of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_10","027_19_10","EZK","19","10","10","Your mother was like a vine in your vineyard, planted by the water; it was fruitful and full of branches because of the abundant waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_11","027_19_11","EZK","19","11","11","It had strong branches, fit for a ruler’s scepter. It towered high above the thick branches, conspicuous for its height and for its dense foliage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_12","027_19_12","EZK","19","12","12","But it was uprooted in fury, cast down to the ground, and the east wind dried up its fruit. Its strong branches were stripped off and they withered; the fire consumed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_13","027_19_13","EZK","19","13","13","Now it is planted in the wilderness, in a dry and thirsty land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK19_14","027_19_14","EZK","19","14","14","Fire has gone out from its main branch and devoured its fruit; on it no strong branch remains fit for a ruler’s scepter.’ This is a lament and shall be used as a lament.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_1","027_20_1","EZK","20","1","1","In the seventh year, on the tenth day of the fifth month, some of the elders of Israel came to inquire of the LORD, and they sat down before me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_2","027_20_2","EZK","20","2","2","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_3","027_20_3","EZK","20","3","3","“Son of man, speak to the elders of Israel and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: Have you come to inquire of Me? As surely as I live, I will not be consulted by you, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_4","027_20_4","EZK","20","4","4","Will you judge them, will you judge them, son of man? Confront them with the abominations of their fathers ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_5","027_20_5","EZK","20","5","5","and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: On the day I chose Israel, I swore an oath to the descendants of the house of Jacob and made Myself known to them in the land of Egypt. With an uplifted hand I said to them, ‘I am the LORD your God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_6","027_20_6","EZK","20","6","6","On that day I swore to bring them out of the land of Egypt into a land that I had searched out for them, a land flowing with milk and honey, the glory of all lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_7","027_20_7","EZK","20","7","7","And I said to them: ‘Each of you must throw away the abominations before his eyes, and you must not defile yourselves with the idols of Egypt. I am the LORD your God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_8","027_20_8","EZK","20","8","8","But they rebelled against Me and refused to listen. None of them cast away the abominations before their eyes, and they did not forsake the idols of Egypt. So I resolved to pour out My wrath upon them and vent My anger against them in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_9","027_20_9","EZK","20","9","9","But I acted for the sake of My name, that it should not be profaned in the eyes of the nations among whom they were living, in whose sight I had revealed Myself to Israel by bringing them out of the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_10","027_20_10","EZK","20","10","10","So I brought them out of the land of Egypt and led them into the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_11","027_20_11","EZK","20","11","11","And I gave them My statutes and made known to them My ordinances—for the man who does these things will live by them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_12","027_20_12","EZK","20","12","12","I also gave them My Sabbaths as a sign between us, so that they would know that I am the LORD who sanctifies them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_13","027_20_13","EZK","20","13","13","Yet the house of Israel rebelled against Me in the wilderness. They did not follow My statutes and they rejected My ordinances—though the man who does these things will live by them—and they utterly profaned My Sabbaths. Then I resolved to pour out My wrath upon them and put an end to them in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_14","027_20_14","EZK","20","14","14","But I acted for the sake of My name, so that it would not be profaned in the eyes of the nations in whose sight I had brought them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_15","027_20_15","EZK","20","15","15","Moreover, with an uplifted hand I swore to them in the wilderness that I would not bring them into the land that I had given them—a land flowing with milk and honey, the glory of all lands— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_16","027_20_16","EZK","20","16","16","because they kept rejecting My ordinances, refusing to walk in My statutes, and profaning My Sabbaths; for their hearts continually went after their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_17","027_20_17","EZK","20","17","17","Yet I looked on them with pity and did not destroy them or bring them to an end in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_18","027_20_18","EZK","20","18","18","In the wilderness I said to their children: ‘Do not walk in the statutes of your fathers or keep their ordinances or defile yourselves with their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_19","027_20_19","EZK","20","19","19","I am the LORD your God; walk in My statutes, keep My ordinances, and practice them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_20","027_20_20","EZK","20","20","20","Keep My Sabbaths holy, that they may be a sign between us, so that you may know that I am the LORD your God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_21","027_20_21","EZK","20","21","21","But the children rebelled against Me. They did not walk in My statutes or carefully observe My ordinances—though the man who does these things will live by them—and they profaned My Sabbaths. So I resolved to pour out My wrath upon them and vent My anger against them in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_22","027_20_22","EZK","20","22","22","But I withheld My hand and acted for the sake of My name, so that it would not be profaned in the eyes of the nations in whose sight I had brought them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_23","027_20_23","EZK","20","23","23","However, with an uplifted hand I swore to them in the wilderness that I would scatter them among the nations and disperse them throughout the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_24","027_20_24","EZK","20","24","24","For they did not practice My ordinances, but they rejected My statutes and profaned My Sabbaths, fixing their eyes on the idols of their fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_25","027_20_25","EZK","20","25","25","I also gave them over to statutes that were not good and ordinances by which they could not live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_26","027_20_26","EZK","20","26","26","And I pronounced them unclean through their gifts—the sacrifice of every firstborn in the fire—so that I might devastate them, in order that they would know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_27","027_20_27","EZK","20","27","27","Therefore, son of man, speak to the house of Israel, and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: In this way also your fathers blasphemed Me by their unfaithfulness against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_28","027_20_28","EZK","20","28","28","When I brought them into the land that I swore to give them and they saw any high hill or leafy tree, there they offered their sacrifices, presented offerings that provoked Me, sent up their fragrant incense, and poured out their drink offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_29","027_20_29","EZK","20","29","29","So I asked them: ‘What is this high place to which you go?’ (And to this day it is called Bamah.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_30","027_20_30","EZK","20","30","30","Therefore tell the house of Israel that this is what the Lord GOD says: Will you defile yourselves the way your fathers did, prostituting yourselves with their abominations? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_31","027_20_31","EZK","20","31","31","When you offer your gifts, sacrificing your sons in the fire, you continue to defile yourselves with all your idols to this day. So should I be consulted by you, O house of Israel? As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, I will not be consulted by you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_32","027_20_32","EZK","20","32","32","When you say, ‘Let us be like the nations, like the peoples of the lands, serving wood and stone,’ what you have in mind will never come to pass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_33","027_20_33","EZK","20","33","33","As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, with a strong hand, an outstretched arm, and outpoured wrath I will rule over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_34","027_20_34","EZK","20","34","34","With a strong hand, an outstretched arm, and outpoured wrath I will bring you out from the peoples and gather you from the lands to which you have been scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_35","027_20_35","EZK","20","35","35","And I will bring you into the wilderness of the nations, where I will enter into judgment with you face to face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_36","027_20_36","EZK","20","36","36","Just as I entered into judgment with your fathers in the wilderness of the land of Egypt, so I will enter into judgment with you, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_37","027_20_37","EZK","20","37","37","I will make you pass under the rod and will bring you into the bond of the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_38","027_20_38","EZK","20","38","38","And I will purge you of those who rebel and transgress against Me. I will bring them out of the land in which they dwell, but they will not enter the land of Israel. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_39","027_20_39","EZK","20","39","39","And as for you, O house of Israel, this is what the Lord GOD says: Go and serve your idols, every one of you. But afterward, you will surely listen to Me, and you will no longer defile My holy name with your gifts and idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_40","027_20_40","EZK","20","40","40","For on My holy mountain, the high mountain of Israel, declares the Lord GOD, there the whole house of Israel, all of them, will serve Me in the land. There I will accept them and will require your offerings and choice gifts, along with all your holy sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_41","027_20_41","EZK","20","41","41","When I bring you from the peoples and gather you from the lands to which you have been scattered, I will accept you as a pleasing aroma. And I will show My holiness through you in the sight of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_42","027_20_42","EZK","20","42","42","Then you will know that I am the LORD, when I bring you into the land of Israel, the land that I swore to give your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_43","027_20_43","EZK","20","43","43","There you will remember your ways and all the deeds with which you have defiled yourselves, and you will loathe yourselves for all the evils you have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_44","027_20_44","EZK","20","44","44","Then you will know, O house of Israel, that I am the LORD, when I have dealt with you for the sake of My name and not according to your wicked ways and corrupt acts, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_45","027_20_45","EZK","20","45","45","Now the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_46","027_20_46","EZK","20","46","46","“Son of man, set your face toward the south, preach against it, and prophesy against the forest of the Negev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_47","027_20_47","EZK","20","47","47","Say to the forest of the Negev: Hear the word of the LORD! This is what the Lord GOD says: I am about to ignite in you a fire, and it will devour all your trees, both green and dry. The blazing flame will not be quenched, and by it every face from south to north will be scorched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_48","027_20_48","EZK","20","48","48","Then all people will see that I, the LORD, have kindled it; it will not be quenched.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK20_49","027_20_49","EZK","20","49","49","Then I said, “Ah, Lord GOD, they are saying of me, ‘Is he not just telling parables?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_1","027_21_1","EZK","21","1","1","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_2","027_21_2","EZK","21","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against Jerusalem and preach against the sanctuaries. Prophesy against the land of Israel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_3","027_21_3","EZK","21","3","3","and tell her that this is what the LORD says: ‘I am against you, and I will draw My sword from its sheath and cut off from you both the righteous and the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_4","027_21_4","EZK","21","4","4","Because I will cut off both the righteous and the wicked, My sword will be unsheathed against everyone from south to north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_5","027_21_5","EZK","21","5","5","Then all flesh will know that I, the LORD, have taken My sword from its sheath, not to return it again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_6","027_21_6","EZK","21","6","6","But you, son of man, groan! Groan before their eyes with a broken heart and bitter grief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_7","027_21_7","EZK","21","7","7","And when they ask, ‘Why are you groaning?’ you are to say, ‘Because of the news that is coming. Every heart will melt, and every hand will go limp. Every spirit will faint, and every knee will turn to water.’ Yes, it is coming and it will surely happen, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_8","027_21_8","EZK","21","8","8","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_9","027_21_9","EZK","21","9","9","“Son of man, prophesy and tell them that this is what the Lord says: ‘A sword, a sword, sharpened and polished— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_10","027_21_10","EZK","21","10","10","it is sharpened for the slaughter, polished to flash like lightning! Should we rejoice in the scepter of My son? The sword despises every such stick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_11","027_21_11","EZK","21","11","11","The sword is appointed to be polished, to be grasped in the hand. It is sharpened and polished, to be placed in the hand of the slayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_12","027_21_12","EZK","21","12","12","Cry out and wail, O son of man, for the sword is wielded against My people; it is against all the princes of Israel! They are tossed to the sword with My people; therefore strike your thigh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_13","027_21_13","EZK","21","13","13","Surely testing will come! And what if even the scepter, which the sword despises, does not continue?’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_14","027_21_14","EZK","21","14","14","‘So then, son of man, prophesy and strike your hands together. Let the sword strike two times, even three. It is a sword that slays, a sword of great slaughter closing in on every side! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_15","027_21_15","EZK","21","15","15","So that their hearts may melt and many may stumble, I have appointed at all their gates a sword for slaughter. Yes, it is ready to flash like lightning; it is drawn for slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_16","027_21_16","EZK","21","16","16","Slash to the right; set your blade to the left—wherever your blade is directed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_17","027_21_17","EZK","21","17","17","I too will strike My hands together, and I will satisfy My wrath.’ I, the LORD, have spoken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_18","027_21_18","EZK","21","18","18","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_19","027_21_19","EZK","21","19","19","“Now you, son of man, mark out two roads for the sword of the king of Babylon to take, both starting from the same land. And make a signpost where the road branches off to each city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_20","027_21_20","EZK","21","20","20","Mark out one road for the sword to come against Rabbah of the Ammonites, and another against Judah into fortified Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_21","027_21_21","EZK","21","21","21","For the king of Babylon stands at the fork in the road, at the junction of the two roads, to seek an omen: He shakes the arrows, he consults the idols, he examines the liver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_22","027_21_22","EZK","21","22","22","In his right hand appears the portent for Jerusalem, where he is to set up battering rams, to call for the slaughter, to lift a battle cry, to direct the battering rams against the gates, to build a ramp, and to erect a siege wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_23","027_21_23","EZK","21","23","23","It will seem like a false omen to the eyes of those who have sworn allegiance to him, but it will draw attention to their guilt and take them captive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_24","027_21_24","EZK","21","24","24","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because you have drawn attention to your guilt, exposing your transgressions, so that your sins are revealed in all your deeds—because you have come to remembrance—you shall be taken in hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_25","027_21_25","EZK","21","25","25","And you, O profane and wicked prince of Israel, the day has come for your final punishment.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_26","027_21_26","EZK","21","26","26","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Remove the turban, and take off the crown. Things will not remain as they are: Exalt the lowly and bring low the exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_27","027_21_27","EZK","21","27","27","A ruin, a ruin, I will make it a ruin! And it will not be restored until the arrival of Him to whom it belongs, to whom I have assigned the right of judgment.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_28","027_21_28","EZK","21","28","28","Now prophesy, son of man, and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says concerning the Ammonites and their contempt: ‘A sword! A sword is drawn for slaughter, polished to consume, to flash like lightning— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_29","027_21_29","EZK","21","29","29","while they offer false visions for you and lying divinations about you—to be placed on the necks of the wicked who are slain, whose day has come, the time of their final punishment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_30","027_21_30","EZK","21","30","30","Return the sword to its sheath! In the place where you were created, in the land of your origin, I will judge you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_31","027_21_31","EZK","21","31","31","I will pour out My anger upon you; I will breathe the fire of My fury against you; I will hand you over to brutal men, skilled in destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK21_32","027_21_32","EZK","21","32","32","You will be fuel for the fire. Your blood will stain your own land. You will not be remembered, for I, the LORD, have spoken.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_1","027_22_1","EZK","22","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_2","027_22_2","EZK","22","2","2","“As for you, son of man, will you judge her? Will you pass judgment on the city of bloodshed? Then confront her with all her abominations ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_3","027_22_3","EZK","22","3","3","and tell her that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘O city who brings her own doom by shedding blood within her walls and making idols to defile herself, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_4","027_22_4","EZK","22","4","4","you are guilty of the blood you have shed, and you are defiled by the idols you have made. You have brought your days to a close and have come to the end of your years. Therefore I have made you a reproach to the nations and a mockery to all the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_5","027_22_5","EZK","22","5","5","Those near and far will mock you, O infamous city, full of turmoil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_6","027_22_6","EZK","22","6","6","See how every prince of Israel within you has used his power to shed blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_7","027_22_7","EZK","22","7","7","Father and mother are treated with contempt. Within your walls the foreign resident is exploited, the fatherless and the widow are oppressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_8","027_22_8","EZK","22","8","8","You have despised My holy things and profaned My Sabbaths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_9","027_22_9","EZK","22","9","9","Among you are slanderous men bent on bloodshed; within you are those who eat on the mountain shrines and commit acts of indecency. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_10","027_22_10","EZK","22","10","10","In you they have uncovered the nakedness of their fathers; in you they violate women during their menstrual impurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_11","027_22_11","EZK","22","11","11","One man commits an abomination with his neighbor’s wife; another wickedly defiles his daughter-in-law; and yet another violates his sister, his own father’s daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_12","027_22_12","EZK","22","12","12","In you they take bribes to shed blood. You engage in usury, take excess interest, and extort your neighbors. But Me you have forgotten, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_13","027_22_13","EZK","22","13","13","Now look, I strike My hands together against your unjust gain and against the blood you have shed in your midst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_14","027_22_14","EZK","22","14","14","Will your courage endure or your hands be strong in the day I deal with you? I, the LORD, have spoken, and I will act. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_15","027_22_15","EZK","22","15","15","I will disperse you among the nations and scatter you throughout the lands; I will purge your uncleanness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_16","027_22_16","EZK","22","16","16","And when you have defiled yourself in the eyes of the nations, then you will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_17","027_22_17","EZK","22","17","17","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_18","027_22_18","EZK","22","18","18","“Son of man, the house of Israel has become dross to Me. All of them are copper, tin, iron, and lead inside the furnace; they are but the dross of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_19","027_22_19","EZK","22","19","19","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because all of you have become dross, behold, I will gather you into Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_20","027_22_20","EZK","22","20","20","Just as one gathers silver, copper, iron, lead, and tin into the furnace to melt with a fiery blast, so I will gather you in My anger and wrath, leave you there, and melt you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_21","027_22_21","EZK","22","21","21","Yes, I will gather you together and blow on you with the fire of My wrath, and you will be melted within the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_22","027_22_22","EZK","22","22","22","As silver is melted in a furnace, so you will be melted within the city. Then you will know that I, the LORD, have poured out My wrath upon you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_23","027_22_23","EZK","22","23","23","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_24","027_22_24","EZK","22","24","24","“Son of man, say to her, ‘In the day of indignation, you are a land that has not been cleansed, upon which no rain has fallen.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_25","027_22_25","EZK","22","25","25","The conspiracy of the princes in her midst is like a roaring lion tearing its prey. They devour the people, seize the treasures and precious things, and multiply the widows within her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_26","027_22_26","EZK","22","26","26","Her priests do violence to My law and profane My holy things. They make no distinction between the holy and the common, and they fail to distinguish between the clean and the unclean. They disregard My Sabbaths, so that I am profaned among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_27","027_22_27","EZK","22","27","27","Her officials within her are like wolves tearing their prey, shedding blood, and destroying lives for dishonest gain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_28","027_22_28","EZK","22","28","28","Her prophets whitewash these deeds by false visions and lying divinations, saying, ‘This is what the Lord GOD says,’ when the LORD has not spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_29","027_22_29","EZK","22","29","29","The people of the land have practiced extortion and committed robbery. They have oppressed the poor and needy and have exploited the foreign resident without justice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_30","027_22_30","EZK","22","30","30","I searched for a man among them to repair the wall and stand in the gap before Me on behalf of the land, so that I should not destroy it. But I found no one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK22_31","027_22_31","EZK","22","31","31","So I have poured out My indignation upon them and consumed them with the fire of My fury. I have brought their ways down upon their own heads, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_1","027_23_1","EZK","23","1","1","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_2","027_23_2","EZK","23","2","2","“Son of man, there were two women, daughters of the same mother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_3","027_23_3","EZK","23","3","3","and they played in Egypt, prostituting themselves from their youth. Their breasts were fondled there, and their virgin bosoms caressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_4","027_23_4","EZK","23","4","4","The older was named Oholah, and her sister was named Oholibah. They became Mine and gave birth to sons and daughters. As for their identities, Oholah is Samaria, and Oholibah is Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_5","027_23_5","EZK","23","5","5","Oholah prostituted herself while she was still Mine. She lusted after her lovers, the Assyrians—warriors ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_6","027_23_6","EZK","23","6","6","clothed in blue, governors and commanders, all desirable young men, horsemen mounted on steeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_7","027_23_7","EZK","23","7","7","She offered sexual favors to all the elite of Assyria. She defiled herself with all the idols of those for whom she lusted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_8","027_23_8","EZK","23","8","8","She did not give up the prostitution she began in Egypt, when men slept with her in her youth, caressed her virgin bosom, and poured out their lust upon her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_9","027_23_9","EZK","23","9","9","Therefore I delivered her into the hands of her lovers, the Assyrians for whom she lusted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_10","027_23_10","EZK","23","10","10","They exposed her nakedness, seized her sons and daughters, and put her to the sword. Thus she became a byword among women, and they executed judgment against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_11","027_23_11","EZK","23","11","11","Her sister Oholibah saw this, yet in her lust and prostitution she was more depraved than her sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_12","027_23_12","EZK","23","12","12","She too lusted after the Assyrians—governors and commanders, warriors dressed in splendor, horsemen riding on steeds, all desirable young men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_13","027_23_13","EZK","23","13","13","And I saw that she too had defiled herself; both of them had taken the same path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_14","027_23_14","EZK","23","14","14","But Oholibah carried her prostitution even further. She saw the men portrayed on the wall, images of the Chaldeans, engraved in vermilion, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_15","027_23_15","EZK","23","15","15","wearing belts on their waists and flowing turbans on their heads; all of them looked like officers of the Babylonians in Chaldea, the land of their birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_16","027_23_16","EZK","23","16","16","At the sight of them, she lusted for them and sent messengers to them in Chaldea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_17","027_23_17","EZK","23","17","17","Then the Babylonians came to her, to the bed of love, and in their lust they defiled her. But after she had been defiled by them, she turned away in disgust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_18","027_23_18","EZK","23","18","18","When Oholibah openly prostituted herself and exposed her nakedness, I turned away from her in disgust, just as I had turned away from her sister. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_19","027_23_19","EZK","23","19","19","Yet she multiplied her promiscuity, remembering the days of her youth, when she had prostituted herself in the land of Egypt ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_20","027_23_20","EZK","23","20","20","and lusted after their lovers, whose genitals were like those of donkeys and whose emission was like that of stallions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_21","027_23_21","EZK","23","21","21","So you revisited the indecency of your youth, when the Egyptians caressed your bosom and pressed your young breasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_22","027_23_22","EZK","23","22","22","Therefore, Oholibah, this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will incite your lovers against you, those from whom you turned away in disgust. And I will bring them against you from every side— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_23","027_23_23","EZK","23","23","23","the Babylonians and all the Chaldeans, the men of Pekod, Shoa, and Koa, and all the Assyrians with them—all desirable young men, governors and commanders, officers and men of renown, mounted on horses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_24","027_23_24","EZK","23","24","24","They will come against you with a host of peoples, with weapons, chariots, and wagons. They will array themselves against you on every side with buckler and shield and helmet. I will delegate judgment to them, and they will punish you according to their own standards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_25","027_23_25","EZK","23","25","25","And I will set My jealous rage against you, and they will deal with you in fury. They will cut off your noses and ears, and your survivors will fall by the sword. They will seize your sons and daughters, and your remnant will be consumed by fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_26","027_23_26","EZK","23","26","26","They will strip off your clothes and take your fine jewelry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_27","027_23_27","EZK","23","27","27","So I will put an end to your indecency and prostitution, which began in the land of Egypt, and you will not lift your eyes to them or remember Egypt anymore.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_28","027_23_28","EZK","23","28","28","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Surely I will deliver you into the hands of those you hate, from whom you turned away in disgust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_29","027_23_29","EZK","23","29","29","They will treat you with hatred, take all for which you have worked, and leave you naked and bare, so that the shame of your prostitution will be exposed. Your indecency and promiscuity ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_30","027_23_30","EZK","23","30","30","have brought these things upon you, because you have prostituted yourself with the nations and defiled yourself with their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_31","027_23_31","EZK","23","31","31","Because you have followed the path of your sister, I will put her cup into your hand.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_32","027_23_32","EZK","23","32","32","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘You will drink your sister’s cup, a cup deep and wide. It will bring scorn and derision, for it holds so much. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_33","027_23_33","EZK","23","33","33","You will be filled with drunkenness and grief, with a cup of devastation and desolation, the cup of your sister Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_34","027_23_34","EZK","23","34","34","You will drink it and drain it; you will dash it to pieces, and tear your breasts. For I have spoken,’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_35","027_23_35","EZK","23","35","35","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because you have forgotten Me and have cast Me behind your back, you must bear the consequences of your indecency and prostitution.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_36","027_23_36","EZK","23","36","36","Then the LORD said to me: “Son of man, will you pass judgment against Oholah and Oholibah? Then declare to them their abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_37","027_23_37","EZK","23","37","37","For they have committed adultery, and blood is on their hands. They have committed adultery with their idols. They have even sacrificed their children, whom they bore to Me, in the fire as food for their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_38","027_23_38","EZK","23","38","38","They have also done this to Me: On that very same day, they defiled My sanctuary and profaned My Sabbaths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_39","027_23_39","EZK","23","39","39","On the very day they slaughtered their children for their idols, they entered My sanctuary to profane it. Yes, they did this inside My house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_40","027_23_40","EZK","23","40","40","Furthermore, you sisters sent messengers for men who came from afar; and behold, when they arrived, you bathed for them, painted your eyes, and adorned yourself with jewelry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_41","027_23_41","EZK","23","41","41","You sat on a couch of luxury with a table spread before it, on which you had set My incense and My oil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_42","027_23_42","EZK","23","42","42","accompanied by the sound of a carefree crowd. Drunkards were brought in from the desert along with men from the rabble, who put bracelets on your wrists and beautiful crowns on your head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_43","027_23_43","EZK","23","43","43","Then I said of her who had grown old in adulteries: ‘Now let them use her as a prostitute, for that is all she is!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_44","027_23_44","EZK","23","44","44","And they slept with her as with a prostitute; they slept with Oholah and Oholibah, those lewd women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_45","027_23_45","EZK","23","45","45","But righteous men will sentence them to the punishment of those who commit adultery and bloodshed, because they are adulteresses with blood on their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_46","027_23_46","EZK","23","46","46","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Bring a mob against them and consign them to terror and plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_47","027_23_47","EZK","23","47","47","The mob will stone them and cut them down with their swords. They will kill their sons and daughters and burn down their houses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_48","027_23_48","EZK","23","48","48","So I will put an end to indecency in the land, and all the women will be admonished not to imitate your behavior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK23_49","027_23_49","EZK","23","49","49","They will repay you for your indecency, and you will bear the consequences of your sins of idolatry. Then you will know that I am the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_1","027_24_1","EZK","24","1","1","In the ninth year, on the tenth day of the tenth month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_2","027_24_2","EZK","24","2","2","“Son of man, write down today’s date, for on this very day the king of Babylon has laid siege to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_3","027_24_3","EZK","24","3","3","Now speak a parable to this rebellious house and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Put the pot on the fire; put it on and pour in the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_4","027_24_4","EZK","24","4","4","Put in the pieces of meat, every good piece—thigh and shoulder—fill it with choice bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_5","027_24_5","EZK","24","5","5","Take the choicest of the flock and pile the fuel beneath it. Bring it to a boil and cook the bones in it.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_6","027_24_6","EZK","24","6","6","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Woe to the city of bloodshed, to the pot now rusted, whose rust will not come off! Empty it piece by piece; cast no lots for its contents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_7","027_24_7","EZK","24","7","7","For the blood she shed is still within her; she poured it out on the bare rock; she did not pour it on the ground to cover it with dust. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_8","027_24_8","EZK","24","8","8","In order to stir up wrath and take vengeance, I have placed her blood on the bare rock, so that it would not be covered.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_9","027_24_9","EZK","24","9","9","Yes, this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Woe to the city of bloodshed! I, too, will pile the kindling high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_10","027_24_10","EZK","24","10","10","Pile on the logs and kindle the fire; cook the meat well and mix in the spices; let the bones be burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_11","027_24_11","EZK","24","11","11","Set the empty pot on its coals until it becomes hot and its copper glows. Then its impurity will melt within; its rust will be consumed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_12","027_24_12","EZK","24","12","12","It has frustrated every effort; its thick rust has not been removed, even by the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_13","027_24_13","EZK","24","13","13","Because of the indecency of your uncleanness I tried to cleanse you, but you would not be purified from your filthiness. You will not be pure again until My wrath against you has subsided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_14","027_24_14","EZK","24","14","14","I, the LORD, have spoken; the time is coming, and I will act. I will not refrain or show pity, nor will I relent. I will judge you according to your ways and deeds,’ declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_15","027_24_15","EZK","24","15","15","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_16","027_24_16","EZK","24","16","16","“Son of man, behold, I am about to take away the desire of your eyes with a fatal blow. But you must not mourn or weep or let your tears flow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_17","027_24_17","EZK","24","17","17","Groan quietly; do not mourn for the dead. Put on your turban and strap your sandals on your feet; do not cover your lips or eat the bread of mourners.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_18","027_24_18","EZK","24","18","18","So I spoke to the people in the morning, and in the evening my wife died. And the next morning I did as I had been commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_19","027_24_19","EZK","24","19","19","Then the people asked me, “Won’t you tell us what these things you are doing mean to us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_20","027_24_20","EZK","24","20","20","So I answered them, “The word of the LORD came to me, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_21","027_24_21","EZK","24","21","21","Tell the house of Israel that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I am about to desecrate My sanctuary, the pride of your power, the desire of your eyes, and the delight of your soul. And the sons and daughters you left behind will fall by the sword.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_22","027_24_22","EZK","24","22","22","Then you will do as I have done: You will not cover your lips or eat the bread of mourners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_23","027_24_23","EZK","24","23","23","Your turbans will remain on your heads and your sandals on your feet. You will not mourn or weep, but you will waste away because of your sins, and you will groan among yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_24","027_24_24","EZK","24","24","24","‘Thus Ezekiel will be a sign for you; you will do everything that he has done. When this happens, you will know that I am the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_25","027_24_25","EZK","24","25","25","And you, son of man, know that on the day I take away their stronghold, their pride and joy—the desire of their eyes which uplifted their souls—and their sons and daughters as well, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_26","027_24_26","EZK","24","26","26","on that day a fugitive will come and tell you the news. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK24_27","027_24_27","EZK","24","27","27","On that day your mouth will be opened to him who has escaped; you will speak and no longer be mute. So you will be a sign to them, and they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_1","027_25_1","EZK","25","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_2","027_25_2","EZK","25","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against the Ammonites and prophesy against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_3","027_25_3","EZK","25","3","3","Tell the Ammonites to hear the word of the Lord GOD, for this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because you exclaimed, “Aha!” when My sanctuary was profaned, when the land of Israel was laid waste, and when the house of Judah went into exile, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_4","027_25_4","EZK","25","4","4","therefore I will indeed give you as a possession to the people of the East. They will set up their camps and pitch their tents among you. They will eat your fruit and drink your milk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_5","027_25_5","EZK","25","5","5","I will make Rabbah a pasture for camels, and Ammon a resting place for sheep. Then you will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_6","027_25_6","EZK","25","6","6","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because you clapped your hands and stomped your feet and rejoiced over the land of Israel with a heart full of contempt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_7","027_25_7","EZK","25","7","7","therefore I will indeed stretch out My hand against you and give you as plunder to the nations. I will cut you off from the peoples and exterminate you from the countries. I will destroy you, and you will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_8","027_25_8","EZK","25","8","8","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because Moab and Seir said, “Look, the house of Judah is like all the other nations,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_9","027_25_9","EZK","25","9","9","therefore I will indeed expose the flank of Moab beginning with its frontier cities—Beth-jeshimoth, Baal-meon, and Kiriathaim—the glory of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_10","027_25_10","EZK","25","10","10","I will give it along with the Ammonites as a possession to the people of the East, so that the Ammonites will no longer be remembered among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_11","027_25_11","EZK","25","11","11","So I will execute judgments on Moab, and they will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_12","027_25_12","EZK","25","12","12","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because Edom acted vengefully against the house of Judah, and in so doing incurred grievous guilt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_13","027_25_13","EZK","25","13","13","therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: I will stretch out My hand against Edom and cut off from it both man and beast. I will make it a wasteland, and from Teman to Dedan they will fall by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_14","027_25_14","EZK","25","14","14","I will take My vengeance on Edom by the hand of My people Israel, and they will deal with Edom according to My anger and wrath. Then they will know My vengeance, declares the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_15","027_25_15","EZK","25","15","15","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Because the Philistines acted in vengeance, taking vengeance with malice of soul to destroy Judah with ancient hostility, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_16","027_25_16","EZK","25","16","16","therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I will stretch out My hand against the Philistines, and I will cut off the Cherethites and destroy the remnant along the coast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK25_17","027_25_17","EZK","25","17","17","I will execute great vengeance against them with furious reproof. Then they will know that I am the LORD, when I lay My vengeance upon them.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_1","027_26_1","EZK","26","1","1","In the eleventh month of the twelfth year, on the first day of the month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_2","027_26_2","EZK","26","2","2","“Son of man, because Tyre has said of Jerusalem, ‘Aha! The gate to the nations is broken; it has swung open to me; now that she lies in ruins I will be filled,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_3","027_26_3","EZK","26","3","3","therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, O Tyre, I am against you, and I will raise up many nations against you, as the sea brings up its waves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_4","027_26_4","EZK","26","4","4","They will destroy the walls of Tyre and demolish her towers. I will scrape the soil from her and make her a bare rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_5","027_26_5","EZK","26","5","5","She will become a place to spread nets in the sea, for I have spoken, declares the Lord GOD. She will become plunder for the nations, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_6","027_26_6","EZK","26","6","6","and the villages on her mainland will be slain by the sword. Then they will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_7","027_26_7","EZK","26","7","7","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, I will bring against Tyre from the north Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, king of kings, with horses and chariots, with cavalry and a great company of troops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_8","027_26_8","EZK","26","8","8","He will slaughter the villages of your mainland with the sword; he will set up siege works against you, build a ramp to your walls, and raise his shields against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_9","027_26_9","EZK","26","9","9","He will direct the blows of his battering rams against your walls and tear down your towers with his axes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_10","027_26_10","EZK","26","10","10","His multitude of horses will cover you in their dust. When he enters your gates as an army entering a breached city, your walls will shake from the noise of cavalry, wagons, and chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_11","027_26_11","EZK","26","11","11","The hooves of his horses will trample all your streets. He will slaughter your people with the sword, and your mighty pillars will fall to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_12","027_26_12","EZK","26","12","12","They will plunder your wealth and pillage your merchandise. They will demolish your walls, tear down your beautiful homes, and throw your stones and timber and soil into the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_13","027_26_13","EZK","26","13","13","So I will silence the sound of your songs, and the music of your lyres will no longer be heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_14","027_26_14","EZK","26","14","14","I will make you a bare rock, and you will become a place to spread the fishing nets. You will never be rebuilt, for I, the LORD, have spoken, declares the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_15","027_26_15","EZK","26","15","15","This is what the Lord GOD says to Tyre: ‘Will not the coastlands quake at the sound of your downfall, when the wounded groan at the slaughter in your midst? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_16","027_26_16","EZK","26","16","16","All the princes of the sea will descend from their thrones, remove their robes, and strip off their embroidered garments. Clothed with terror, they will sit on the ground, trembling every moment, appalled over you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_17","027_26_17","EZK","26","17","17","Then they will lament for you, saying, “How you have perished, O city of renown inhabited by seafaring men—she who was powerful on the sea, along with her people, who imposed terror on all peoples! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_18","027_26_18","EZK","26","18","18","Now the coastlands tremble on the day of your downfall; the islands in the sea are dismayed by your demise.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_19","027_26_19","EZK","26","19","19","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘When I make you a desolate city like other deserted cities, and when I raise up the deep against you so that the mighty waters cover you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_20","027_26_20","EZK","26","20","20","then I will bring you down with those who descend to the Pit, to the people of antiquity. I will make you dwell in the earth below like the ancient ruins, with those who descend to the Pit, so that you will no longer be inhabited or set in splendor in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK26_21","027_26_21","EZK","26","21","21","I will make you an object of horror, and you will be no more. You will be sought, but will never be found,’ declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_1","027_27_1","EZK","27","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_2","027_27_2","EZK","27","2","2","“Now you, son of man, take up a lament for Tyre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_3","027_27_3","EZK","27","3","3","Tell Tyre, who dwells at the gateway to the sea, merchant of the peoples on many coasts, that this is what the Lord GOD says: You have said, O Tyre, ‘I am perfect in beauty.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_4","027_27_4","EZK","27","4","4","Your borders are in the heart of the seas; your builders perfected your beauty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_5","027_27_5","EZK","27","5","5","They constructed all your planking with cypress from Senir. They took a cedar from Lebanon to make a mast for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_6","027_27_6","EZK","27","6","6","Of oaks from Bashan they made your oars; of wood from the coasts of Cyprus they made your deck, inlaid with ivory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_7","027_27_7","EZK","27","7","7","Of embroidered fine linen from Egypt they made your sail, which served as your banner. Of blue and purple from the coasts of Elishah they made your awning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_8","027_27_8","EZK","27","8","8","The men of Sidon and Arvad were your oarsmen. Your men of skill, O Tyre, were there as your captains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_9","027_27_9","EZK","27","9","9","The elders of Gebal were aboard as shipwrights, repairing your leaks. All the ships of the sea and their sailors came alongside to barter for your merchandise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_10","027_27_10","EZK","27","10","10","Men of Persia, Lydia, and Put served as warriors in your army. They hung their shields and helmets on your walls; they gave you splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_11","027_27_11","EZK","27","11","11","Men of Arvad and Helech manned your walls all around, and the men of Gammad were in your towers. They hung their shields around your walls; they perfected your beauty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_12","027_27_12","EZK","27","12","12","Tarshish was your merchant because of your great wealth of goods; they exchanged silver, iron, tin, and lead for your wares. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_13","027_27_13","EZK","27","13","13","Javan, Tubal, and Meshech were your merchants. They exchanged slaves and bronze utensils for your merchandise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_14","027_27_14","EZK","27","14","14","The men of Beth-togarmah exchanged horses, war horses, and mules for your wares. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_15","027_27_15","EZK","27","15","15","The men of Dedan were your clients; many coastlands were your market; they paid you with ivory tusks and ebony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_16","027_27_16","EZK","27","16","16","Aram was your customer because of your many products; they exchanged turquoise, purple, embroidered work, fine linen, coral, and rubies for your wares. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_17","027_27_17","EZK","27","17","17","Judah and the land of Israel traded with you; they exchanged wheat from Minnith, cakes and honey, oil and balm for your merchandise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_18","027_27_18","EZK","27","18","18","Because of your many products and your great wealth of goods, Damascus traded with you wine from Helbon, wool from Zahar, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_19","027_27_19","EZK","27","19","19","and casks of wine from Izal for your wares. Wrought iron, cassia, and sweet cane were exchanged for your merchandise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_20","027_27_20","EZK","27","20","20","Dedan was your merchant in saddlecloths for riding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_21","027_27_21","EZK","27","21","21","Arabia and all the princes of Kedar were your customers, trading in lambs, rams, and goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_22","027_27_22","EZK","27","22","22","The merchants of Sheba and Raamah traded with you; for your wares they exchanged gold, the finest of all spices, and precious stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_23","027_27_23","EZK","27","23","23","Haran, Canneh, and Eden traded with you, and so did the merchants of Sheba, Asshur, and Chilmad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_24","027_27_24","EZK","27","24","24","In your marketplace they traded with you fine garments of blue, embroidered work, and multicolored rugs with cords tightly twisted and knotted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_25","027_27_25","EZK","27","25","25","The ships of Tarshish carried your merchandise. And you were filled with heavy cargo in the heart of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_26","027_27_26","EZK","27","26","26","Your oarsmen have brought you onto the high seas, but the east wind will shatter you in the heart of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_27","027_27_27","EZK","27","27","27","Your wealth, wares, and merchandise, your sailors, captains, and shipwrights, your merchants and all the warriors within you, with all the other people on board, will sink into the heart of the sea on the day of your downfall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_28","027_27_28","EZK","27","28","28","The countryside will shake when your sailors cry out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_29","027_27_29","EZK","27","29","29","All who handle the oars will abandon their ships. The sailors and all the captains of the sea will stand on the shore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_30","027_27_30","EZK","27","30","30","They will raise their voices for you and cry out bitterly. They will throw dust on their heads and roll in ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_31","027_27_31","EZK","27","31","31","They will shave their heads for you and wrap themselves in sackcloth. They will weep over you with anguish of soul and bitter mourning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_32","027_27_32","EZK","27","32","32","As they wail and mourn over you, they will take up a lament for you: ‘Who was ever like Tyre, silenced in the middle of the sea? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_33","027_27_33","EZK","27","33","33","When your wares went out to sea, you satisfied many nations. You enriched the kings of the earth with your abundant wealth and merchandise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_34","027_27_34","EZK","27","34","34","Now you are shattered by the seas in the depths of the waters; your merchandise and the people among you have gone down with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_35","027_27_35","EZK","27","35","35","All the people of the coastlands are appalled over you. Their kings shudder with fear; their faces are contorted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK27_36","027_27_36","EZK","27","36","36","Those who trade among the nations hiss at you; you have come to a horrible end and will be no more.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_1","027_28_1","EZK","28","1","1","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_2","027_28_2","EZK","28","2","2","“Son of man, tell the ruler of Tyre that this is what the Lord GOD says: Your heart is proud, and you have said, ‘I am a god; I sit in the seat of gods in the heart of the sea.’ Yet you are a man and not a god, though you have regarded your heart as that of a god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_3","027_28_3","EZK","28","3","3","Behold, you are wiser than Daniel; no secret is hidden from you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_4","027_28_4","EZK","28","4","4","By your wisdom and understanding you have gained your wealth and amassed gold and silver for your treasuries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_5","027_28_5","EZK","28","5","5","By your great skill in trading you have increased your wealth, but your heart has grown proud because of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_6","027_28_6","EZK","28","6","6","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Because you regard your heart as the heart of a god, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_7","027_28_7","EZK","28","7","7","behold, I will bring foreigners against you, the most ruthless of nations. They will draw their swords against the beauty of your wisdom and will defile your splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_8","027_28_8","EZK","28","8","8","They will bring you down to the Pit, and you will die a violent death in the heart of the seas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_9","027_28_9","EZK","28","9","9","Will you still say, ‘I am a god,’ in the presence of those who slay you? You will be only a man, not a god, in the hands of those who wound you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_10","027_28_10","EZK","28","10","10","You will die the death of the uncircumcised at the hands of foreigners. For I have spoken, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_11","027_28_11","EZK","28","11","11","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_12","027_28_12","EZK","28","12","12","“Son of man, take up a lament for the king of Tyre and tell him that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘You were the seal of perfection, full of wisdom and perfect in beauty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_13","027_28_13","EZK","28","13","13","You were in Eden, the garden of God. Every kind of precious stone adorned you: ruby, topaz, and diamond, beryl, onyx, and jasper, sapphire, turquoise, and emerald. Your mountings and settings were crafted in gold, prepared on the day of your creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_14","027_28_14","EZK","28","14","14","You were anointed as a guardian cherub, for I had ordained you. You were on the holy mountain of God; you walked among the fiery stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_15","027_28_15","EZK","28","15","15","From the day you were created you were blameless in your ways—until wickedness was found in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_16","027_28_16","EZK","28","16","16","By the vastness of your trade, you were filled with violence, and you sinned. So I drove you in disgrace from the mountain of God, and I banished you, O guardian cherub, from among the fiery stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_17","027_28_17","EZK","28","17","17","Your heart grew proud of your beauty; you corrupted your wisdom because of your splendor; so I cast you to the earth; I made you a spectacle before kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_18","027_28_18","EZK","28","18","18","By the multitude of your iniquities and the dishonesty of your trading you have profaned your sanctuaries. So I made fire come from within you, and it consumed you. I reduced you to ashes on the ground in the eyes of all who saw you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_19","027_28_19","EZK","28","19","19","All the nations who know you are appalled over you. You have come to a horrible end and will be no more.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_20","027_28_20","EZK","28","20","20","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_21","027_28_21","EZK","28","21","21","“Son of man, set your face against Sidon and prophesy against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_22","027_28_22","EZK","28","22","22","And you are to declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, I am against you, O Sidon, and I will be glorified within you. They will know that I am the LORD when I execute judgments against her and demonstrate My holiness through her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_23","027_28_23","EZK","28","23","23","I will send a plague against her and shed blood in her streets; the slain will fall within her, while the sword is against her on every side. Then they will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_24","027_28_24","EZK","28","24","24","For the people of Israel will no longer face a pricking brier or a painful thorn from all around them who treat them with contempt. Then they will know that I am the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_25","027_28_25","EZK","28","25","25","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘When I gather the house of Israel from the peoples among whom they have been scattered, I will show Myself holy among them in the sight of the nations. Then they will dwell in their own land, which I have given to My servant Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK28_26","027_28_26","EZK","28","26","26","And there they will dwell securely, build houses, and plant vineyards. They will dwell securely when I execute judgments against all those around them who treat them with contempt. Then they will know that I am the LORD their God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_1","027_29_1","EZK","29","1","1","In the tenth year, on the twelfth day of the tenth month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_2","027_29_2","EZK","29","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against Pharaoh king of Egypt and prophesy against him and against all Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_3","027_29_3","EZK","29","3","3","Speak to him and tell him that this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I am against you, O Pharaoh king of Egypt, O great monster who lies among his rivers, who says, ‘The Nile is mine; I made it myself.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_4","027_29_4","EZK","29","4","4","But I will put hooks in your jaws and cause the fish of your streams to cling to your scales. I will haul you up out of your rivers, and all the fish of your streams will cling to your scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_5","027_29_5","EZK","29","5","5","I will leave you in the desert, you and all the fish of your streams. You will fall on the open field and will not be taken away or gathered for burial. I have given you as food to the beasts of the earth and the birds of the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_6","027_29_6","EZK","29","6","6","Then all the people of Egypt will know that I am the LORD. For you were only a staff of reeds to the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_7","027_29_7","EZK","29","7","7","When Israel took hold of you with their hands, you splintered, tearing all their shoulders; when they leaned on you, you broke, and their backs were wrenched. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_8","027_29_8","EZK","29","8","8","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: I will bring a sword against you and cut off from you man and beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_9","027_29_9","EZK","29","9","9","The land of Egypt will become a desolate wasteland. Then they will know that I am the LORD. Because you said, ‘The Nile is mine; I made it,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_10","027_29_10","EZK","29","10","10","therefore I am against you and against your rivers. I will turn the land of Egypt into a ruin, a desolate wasteland from Migdol to Syene, and as far as the border of Cush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_11","027_29_11","EZK","29","11","11","No foot of man or beast will pass through, and it will be uninhabited for forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_12","027_29_12","EZK","29","12","12","I will make the land of Egypt a desolation among desolate lands, and her cities will lie desolate for forty years among the ruined cities. And I will disperse the Egyptians among the nations and scatter them throughout the countries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_13","027_29_13","EZK","29","13","13","For this is what the Lord GOD says: At the end of forty years I will gather the Egyptians from the nations to which they were scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_14","027_29_14","EZK","29","14","14","I will restore Egypt from captivity and bring them back to the land of Pathros, the land of their origin. There they will be a lowly kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_15","027_29_15","EZK","29","15","15","Egypt will be the lowliest of kingdoms and will never again exalt itself above the nations. For I will diminish Egypt so that it will never again rule over the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_16","027_29_16","EZK","29","16","16","Egypt will never again be an object of trust for the house of Israel, but will remind them of their iniquity in turning to the Egyptians. Then they will know that I am the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_17","027_29_17","EZK","29","17","17","In the twenty-seventh year, on the first day of the first month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_18","027_29_18","EZK","29","18","18","“Son of man, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon caused his army to labor strenuously against Tyre. Every head was made bald and every shoulder made raw. But he and his army received no wages from Tyre for the labor they expended on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_19","027_29_19","EZK","29","19","19","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: I will give the land of Egypt to Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, who will carry off its wealth, seize its spoil, and remove its plunder. This will be the wages for his army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_20","027_29_20","EZK","29","20","20","I have given him the land of Egypt as the reward for his labor, because it was done for Me, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK29_21","027_29_21","EZK","29","21","21","In that day I will cause a horn to sprout for the house of Israel, and I will open your mouth to speak among them. Then they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_1","027_30_1","EZK","30","1","1","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_2","027_30_2","EZK","30","2","2","“Son of man, prophesy and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: Wail, ‘Alas for that day!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_3","027_30_3","EZK","30","3","3","For the day is near, the Day of the LORD is near. It will be a day of clouds, a time of doom for the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_4","027_30_4","EZK","30","4","4","A sword will come against Egypt, and there will be anguish in Cush when the slain fall in Egypt, its wealth is taken away, and its foundations are torn down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_5","027_30_5","EZK","30","5","5","Cush, Put, and Lud, and all the various peoples, as well as Libya and the men of the covenant land, will fall with Egypt by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_6","027_30_6","EZK","30","6","6","For this is what the LORD says: The allies of Egypt will fall, and her proud strength will collapse. From Migdol to Syene they will fall by the sword within her, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_7","027_30_7","EZK","30","7","7","They will be desolate among desolate lands, and their cities will lie among ruined cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_8","027_30_8","EZK","30","8","8","Then they will know that I am the LORD when I set fire to Egypt and all her helpers are shattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_9","027_30_9","EZK","30","9","9","On that day messengers will go out from Me in ships to frighten Cush out of complacency. Anguish will come upon them on the day of Egypt’s doom. For it is indeed coming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_10","027_30_10","EZK","30","10","10","This is what the Lord GOD says: I will put an end to the hordes of Egypt by the hand of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_11","027_30_11","EZK","30","11","11","He and his people with him, the most ruthless of the nations, will be brought in to destroy the land. They will draw their swords against Egypt and fill the land with the slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_12","027_30_12","EZK","30","12","12","I will make the streams dry up and sell the land to the wicked. By the hands of foreigners I will bring desolation upon the land and everything in it. I, the LORD, have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_13","027_30_13","EZK","30","13","13","This is what the Lord GOD says: I will destroy the idols and put an end to the images in Memphis. There will no longer be a prince in Egypt, and I will instill fear in that land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_14","027_30_14","EZK","30","14","14","I will lay waste Pathros, set fire to Zoan, and execute judgment on Thebes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_15","027_30_15","EZK","30","15","15","I will pour out My wrath on Pelusium, the stronghold of Egypt, and cut off the crowds of Thebes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_16","027_30_16","EZK","30","16","16","I will set fire to Egypt, Pelusium will writhe in anguish, Thebes will be split open, and Memphis will face daily distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_17","027_30_17","EZK","30","17","17","The young men of On and Pi-beseth will fall by the sword, and those cities will go into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_18","027_30_18","EZK","30","18","18","The day will be darkened in Tahpanhes when I break the yoke of Egypt and her proud strength comes to an end. A cloud will cover her, and her daughters will go into captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_19","027_30_19","EZK","30","19","19","So I will execute judgment on Egypt, and they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_20","027_30_20","EZK","30","20","20","In the eleventh year, on the seventh day of the first month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_21","027_30_21","EZK","30","21","21","“Son of man, I have broken the arm of Pharaoh king of Egypt. See, it has not been bound up for healing, or splinted for strength to hold the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_22","027_30_22","EZK","30","22","22","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I am against Pharaoh king of Egypt. I will break his arms, both the strong one and the one already broken, and will make the sword fall from his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_23","027_30_23","EZK","30","23","23","I will disperse the Egyptians among the nations and scatter them throughout the lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_24","027_30_24","EZK","30","24","24","I will strengthen the arms of Babylon’s king and place My sword in his hand, but I will break the arms of Pharaoh, who will groan before him like a mortally wounded man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_25","027_30_25","EZK","30","25","25","I will strengthen the arms of Babylon’s king, but Pharaoh’s arms will fall limp. Then they will know that I am the LORD, when I place My sword in the hand of Babylon’s king, and he wields it against the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK30_26","027_30_26","EZK","30","26","26","I will disperse the Egyptians among the nations and scatter them throughout the lands. Then they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_1","027_31_1","EZK","31","1","1","In the eleventh year, on the first day of the third month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_2","027_31_2","EZK","31","2","2","“Son of man, say to Pharaoh king of Egypt and to his multitude: ‘Who can be compared to your greatness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_3","027_31_3","EZK","31","3","3","Look at Assyria, a cedar in Lebanon, with beautiful branches that shaded the forest. It towered on high; its top was among the clouds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_4","027_31_4","EZK","31","4","4","The waters made it grow; the deep springs made it tall, directing their streams all around its base and sending their channels to all the trees of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_5","027_31_5","EZK","31","5","5","Therefore it towered higher than all the trees of the field. Its branches multiplied, and its boughs grew long as it spread them out because of the abundant waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_6","027_31_6","EZK","31","6","6","All the birds of the air nested in its branches, and all the beasts of the field gave birth beneath its boughs; all the great nations lived in its shade. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_7","027_31_7","EZK","31","7","7","It was beautiful in its greatness, in the length of its limbs, for its roots extended to abundant waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_8","027_31_8","EZK","31","8","8","The cedars in the garden of God could not rival it; the cypresses could not compare with its branches, nor the plane trees match its boughs. No tree in the garden of God could compare with its beauty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_9","027_31_9","EZK","31","9","9","I made it beautiful with its many branches, the envy of all the trees of Eden, which were in the garden of God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_10","027_31_10","EZK","31","10","10","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Since it became great in height and set its top among the clouds, and it grew proud on account of its height, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_11","027_31_11","EZK","31","11","11","I delivered it into the hand of the ruler of the nations, for him to deal with it according to its wickedness. I have banished it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_12","027_31_12","EZK","31","12","12","Foreigners, the most ruthless of the nations, cut it down and left it. Its branches have fallen on the mountains and in every valley; its boughs lay broken in all the earth’s ravines. And all the peoples of the earth left its shade and abandoned it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_13","027_31_13","EZK","31","13","13","All the birds of the air nested on its fallen trunk, and all the beasts of the field lived among its boughs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_14","027_31_14","EZK","31","14","14","This happened so that no other trees by the waters would become great in height and set their tops among the clouds, and no other well-watered trees would reach them in height. For they have all been consigned to death, to the depths of the earth, among the mortals who descend to the Pit.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_15","027_31_15","EZK","31","15","15","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘On the day it was brought down to Sheol, I caused mourning. I covered the deep because of it; I held back its rivers; its abundant waters were restrained. I made Lebanon mourn for it, and all the trees of the field fainted because of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_16","027_31_16","EZK","31","16","16","I made the nations quake at the sound of its downfall, when I cast it down to Sheol with those who descend to the Pit. Then all the trees of Eden, the choicest and best of Lebanon, all the well-watered trees, were consoled in the earth below. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_17","027_31_17","EZK","31","17","17","They too descended with it to Sheol, to those slain by the sword. As its allies they had lived in its shade among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK31_18","027_31_18","EZK","31","18","18","Who then is like you in glory and greatness among the trees of Eden? You also will be brought down to the depths of the earth to be with the trees of Eden. You will lie among the uncircumcised, with those slain by the sword. This is Pharaoh and all his multitude, declares the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_1","027_32_1","EZK","32","1","1","In the twelfth year, on the first day of the twelfth month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_2","027_32_2","EZK","32","2","2","“Son of man, take up a lament for Pharaoh king of Egypt and say to him: ‘You are like a lion among the nations; you are like a monster in the seas. You thrash about in your rivers, churning up the waters with your feet and muddying the streams.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_3","027_32_3","EZK","32","3","3","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will spread My net over you with a company of many peoples, and they will draw you up in My net. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_4","027_32_4","EZK","32","4","4","I will abandon you on the land and hurl you into the open field. I will cause all the birds of the air to settle upon you, and all the beasts of the earth to eat their fill of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_5","027_32_5","EZK","32","5","5","I will put your flesh on the mountains and fill the valleys with your remains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_6","027_32_6","EZK","32","6","6","I will drench the land with the flow of your blood, all the way to the mountains—the ravines will be filled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_7","027_32_7","EZK","32","7","7","When I extinguish you, I will cover the heavens and darken their stars. I will cover the sun with a cloud, and the moon will not give its light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_8","027_32_8","EZK","32","8","8","All the shining lights in the heavens I will darken over you, and I will bring darkness upon your land,’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_9","027_32_9","EZK","32","9","9","‘I will trouble the hearts of many peoples, when I bring about your destruction among the nations, in countries you do not know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_10","027_32_10","EZK","32","10","10","I will cause many peoples to be appalled over you, and their kings will shudder in horror because of you when I brandish My sword before them. On the day of your downfall each of them will tremble every moment for his life.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_11","027_32_11","EZK","32","11","11","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘The sword of the king of Babylon will come against you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_12","027_32_12","EZK","32","12","12","I will make your hordes fall by the swords of the mighty, the most ruthless of all nations. They will ravage the pride of Egypt and all her multitudes will be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_13","027_32_13","EZK","32","13","13","I will slaughter all her cattle beside the abundant waters. No human foot will muddy them again, and no cattle hooves will disturb them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_14","027_32_14","EZK","32","14","14","Then I will let her waters settle and will make her rivers flow like oil,’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_15","027_32_15","EZK","32","15","15","‘When I make the land of Egypt a desolation and empty it of all that filled it, when I strike down all who live there, then they will know that I am the LORD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_16","027_32_16","EZK","32","16","16","This is the lament they will chant for her; the daughters of the nations will chant it. Over Egypt and all her multitudes they will chant it, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_17","027_32_17","EZK","32","17","17","In the twelfth year, on the fifteenth day of the month, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_18","027_32_18","EZK","32","18","18","“Son of man, wail for the multitudes of Egypt, and consign her and the daughters of the mighty nations to the depths of the earth with those who descend to the Pit: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_19","027_32_19","EZK","32","19","19","Whom do you surpass in beauty? Go down and be placed with the uncircumcised! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_20","027_32_20","EZK","32","20","20","They will fall among those slain by the sword. The sword is appointed! Let them drag her away along with all her multitudes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_21","027_32_21","EZK","32","21","21","Mighty chiefs will speak from the midst of Sheol about Egypt and her allies: ‘They have come down and lie with the uncircumcised, with those slain by the sword.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_22","027_32_22","EZK","32","22","22","Assyria is there with her whole company; her graves are all around her. All of them are slain, fallen by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_23","027_32_23","EZK","32","23","23","Her graves are set in the depths of the Pit, and her company is all around her grave. All of them are slain, fallen by the sword—those who once spread terror in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_24","027_32_24","EZK","32","24","24","Elam is there with all her multitudes around her grave. All of them are slain, fallen by the sword—those who went down uncircumcised to the earth below, who once spread their terror in the land of the living. They bear their disgrace with those who descend to the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_25","027_32_25","EZK","32","25","25","Among the slain they prepare a resting place for Elam with all her hordes, with her graves all around her. All of them are uncircumcised, slain by the sword, although their terror was once spread in the land of the living. They bear their disgrace with those who descend to the Pit. They are placed among the slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_26","027_32_26","EZK","32","26","26","Meshech and Tubal are there with all their multitudes, with their graves all around them. All of them are uncircumcised, slain by the sword, because they spread their terror in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_27","027_32_27","EZK","32","27","27","They do not lie down with the fallen warriors of old, who went down to Sheol with their weapons of war, whose swords were placed under their heads, whose shields rested on their bones, although the terror of the mighty was once in the land of the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_28","027_32_28","EZK","32","28","28","But you too will be shattered and lie down among the uncircumcised, with those slain by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_29","027_32_29","EZK","32","29","29","Edom is there, and all her kings and princes, who despite their might are laid among those slain by the sword. They lie down with the uncircumcised, with those who descend to the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_30","027_32_30","EZK","32","30","30","All the leaders of the north and all the Sidonians are there; they went down in disgrace with the slain, despite the terror of their might. They lie uncircumcised with those slain by the sword and bear their shame with those who descend to the Pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_31","027_32_31","EZK","32","31","31","Pharaoh will see them and be comforted over all his multitude—Pharaoh and all his army, slain by the sword, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK32_32","027_32_32","EZK","32","32","32","For I will spread My terror in the land of the living, so that Pharaoh and all his multitude will be laid to rest among the uncircumcised, with those slain by the sword, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_1","027_33_1","EZK","33","1","1","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_2","027_33_2","EZK","33","2","2","“Son of man, speak to your people and tell them: ‘Suppose I bring the sword against a land, and the people of that land choose a man from among them, appointing him as their watchman, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_3","027_33_3","EZK","33","3","3","and he sees the sword coming against that land and blows the ram’s horn to warn the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_4","027_33_4","EZK","33","4","4","Then if anyone hears the sound of the horn but fails to heed the warning, and the sword comes and takes him away, his blood will be on his own head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_5","027_33_5","EZK","33","5","5","Since he heard the sound of the horn but failed to heed the warning, his blood will be on his own head. If he had heeded the warning, he would have saved his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_6","027_33_6","EZK","33","6","6","But if the watchman sees the sword coming and fails to blow the horn to warn the people, and the sword comes and takes away a life, then that one will be taken away in his iniquity, but I will hold the watchman accountable for his blood.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_7","027_33_7","EZK","33","7","7","As for you, O son of man, I have made you a watchman for the house of Israel; so hear the word from My mouth and give them the warning from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_8","027_33_8","EZK","33","8","8","If I say to the wicked, ‘O wicked man, you will surely die,’ but you do not speak out to dissuade him from his way, then that wicked man will die in his iniquity, yet I will hold you accountable for his blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_9","027_33_9","EZK","33","9","9","But if you warn the wicked man to turn from his way, and he does not turn from it, he will die in his iniquity, but you will have saved your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_10","027_33_10","EZK","33","10","10","Now as for you, son of man, tell the house of Israel that this is what they have said: ‘Our transgressions and our sins are heavy upon us, and we are wasting away because of them! How can we live?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_11","027_33_11","EZK","33","11","11","Say to them: ‘As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, I take no pleasure in the death of the wicked, but rather that the wicked should turn from their ways and live. Turn! Turn from your evil ways! For why should you die, O house of Israel?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_12","027_33_12","EZK","33","12","12","Therefore, son of man, say to your people: ‘The righteousness of the righteous man will not deliver him in the day of his transgression; neither will the wickedness of the wicked man cause him to stumble on the day he turns from his wickedness. Nor will the righteous man be able to survive by his righteousness on the day he sins.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_13","027_33_13","EZK","33","13","13","If I tell the righteous man that he will surely live, but he then trusts in his righteousness and commits iniquity, then none of his righteous works will be remembered; he will die because of the iniquity he has committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_14","027_33_14","EZK","33","14","14","But if I tell the wicked man, ‘You will surely die,’ and he turns from his sin and does what is just and right— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_15","027_33_15","EZK","33","15","15","if he restores a pledge, makes restitution for what he has stolen, and walks in the statutes of life without practicing iniquity—then he will surely live; he will not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_16","027_33_16","EZK","33","16","16","None of the sins he has committed will be held against him. He has done what is just and right; he will surely live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_17","027_33_17","EZK","33","17","17","Yet your people say, ‘The way of the Lord is not just.’ But it is their way that is not just. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_18","027_33_18","EZK","33","18","18","If a righteous man turns from his righteousness and commits iniquity, he will die for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_19","027_33_19","EZK","33","19","19","But if a wicked man turns from his wickedness and does what is just and right, he will live because of this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_20","027_33_20","EZK","33","20","20","Yet you say, ‘The way of the Lord is not just.’ But I will judge each of you according to his ways, O house of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_21","027_33_21","EZK","33","21","21","In the twelfth year of our exile, on the fifth day of the tenth month, a fugitive from Jerusalem came to me and reported, “The city has been taken!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_22","027_33_22","EZK","33","22","22","Now the evening before the fugitive arrived, the hand of the LORD was upon me, and He opened my mouth before the man came to me in the morning. So my mouth was opened and I was no longer mute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_23","027_33_23","EZK","33","23","23","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_24","027_33_24","EZK","33","24","24","“Son of man, those living in the ruins in the land of Israel are saying, ‘Abraham was only one man, yet he possessed the land. But we are many; surely the land has been given to us as a possession.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_25","027_33_25","EZK","33","25","25","Therefore tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘You eat meat with the blood in it, lift up your eyes to your idols, and shed blood. Should you then possess the land? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_26","027_33_26","EZK","33","26","26","You have relied on your swords, you have committed detestable acts, and each of you has defiled his neighbor’s wife. Should you then possess the land?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_27","027_33_27","EZK","33","27","27","Tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘As surely as I live, those in the ruins will fall by the sword, those in the open field I will give to be devoured by wild animals, and those in the strongholds and caves will die by plague. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_28","027_33_28","EZK","33","28","28","I will make the land a desolate waste, and the pride of her strength will come to an end. The mountains of Israel will become desolate, so that no one will pass through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_29","027_33_29","EZK","33","29","29","Then they will know that I am the LORD, when I have made the land a desolate waste because of all the abominations they have committed.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_30","027_33_30","EZK","33","30","30","As for you, son of man, your people are talking about you near the city walls and in the doorways of their houses. One speaks to another, each saying to his brother, ‘Come and hear the message that has come from the LORD!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_31","027_33_31","EZK","33","31","31","So My people come to you as usual, sit before you, and hear your words; but they do not put them into practice. Although they express love with their mouths, their hearts pursue dishonest gain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_32","027_33_32","EZK","33","32","32","Indeed, you are to them like a singer of love songs with a beautiful voice, who skillfully plays an instrument. They hear your words but do not put them into practice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK33_33","027_33_33","EZK","33","33","33","So when it comes to pass—and surely it will come—then they will know that a prophet has been among them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_1","027_34_1","EZK","34","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_2","027_34_2","EZK","34","2","2","“Son of man, prophesy against the shepherds of Israel. Prophesy and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Woe to the shepherds of Israel, who only feed themselves! Should not the shepherds feed their flock? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_3","027_34_3","EZK","34","3","3","You eat the fat, wear the wool, and butcher the fattened sheep, but you do not feed the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_4","027_34_4","EZK","34","4","4","You have not strengthened the weak, healed the sick, bound up the injured, brought back the strays, or searched for the lost. Instead, you have ruled them with violence and cruelty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_5","027_34_5","EZK","34","5","5","They were scattered for lack of a shepherd, and when they were scattered they became food for all the wild beasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_6","027_34_6","EZK","34","6","6","My flock went astray on all the mountains and every high hill. They were scattered over the face of all the earth, with no one to search for them or seek them out.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_7","027_34_7","EZK","34","7","7","Therefore, you shepherds, hear the word of the LORD: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_8","027_34_8","EZK","34","8","8","‘As surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, because My flock lacks a shepherd and has become prey and food for every wild beast, and because My shepherds did not search for My flock but fed themselves instead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_9","027_34_9","EZK","34","9","9","therefore, you shepherds, hear the word of the LORD!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_10","027_34_10","EZK","34","10","10","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, I am against the shepherds, and I will demand from them My flock and remove them from tending the flock, so that they can no longer feed themselves. For I will deliver My flock from their mouths, and it will no longer be food for them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_11","027_34_11","EZK","34","11","11","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Behold, I Myself will search for My flock and seek them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_12","027_34_12","EZK","34","12","12","As a shepherd looks for his scattered sheep when he is among the flock, so I will look for My flock. I will rescue them from all the places to which they were scattered on a day of clouds and darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_13","027_34_13","EZK","34","13","13","I will bring them out from the peoples, gather them from the countries, and bring them into their own land. I will feed them on the mountains of Israel, in the ravines, and in all the settlements of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_14","027_34_14","EZK","34","14","14","I will feed them in good pasture, and the lofty mountains of Israel will be their grazing land. There they will lie down in a good grazing land; they will feed in rich pasture on the mountains of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_15","027_34_15","EZK","34","15","15","I will tend My flock and make them lie down, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_16","027_34_16","EZK","34","16","16","I will seek the lost, bring back the strays, bind up the broken, and strengthen the weak; but the sleek and strong I will destroy. I will shepherd them with justice.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_17","027_34_17","EZK","34","17","17","This is what the Lord GOD says to you, My flock: ‘I will judge between one sheep and another, between the rams and the goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_18","027_34_18","EZK","34","18","18","Is it not enough for you to feed on the good pasture? Must you also trample the rest of the pasture with your feet? Is it not enough for you to drink the clear waters? Must you also muddy the rest with your feet? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_19","027_34_19","EZK","34","19","19","Why must My flock feed on what your feet have trampled, and drink what your feet have muddied?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_20","027_34_20","EZK","34","20","20","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says to them: ‘Behold, I Myself will judge between the fat sheep and the lean sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_21","027_34_21","EZK","34","21","21","Since you shove with flank and shoulder, butting all the weak ones with your horns until you have scattered them abroad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_22","027_34_22","EZK","34","22","22","I will save My flock, and they will no longer be prey. I will judge between one sheep and another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_23","027_34_23","EZK","34","23","23","I will appoint over them one shepherd, My servant David, and he will feed them. He will feed them and be their shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_24","027_34_24","EZK","34","24","24","I, the LORD, will be their God, and My servant David will be a prince among them. I, the LORD, have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_25","027_34_25","EZK","34","25","25","I will make with them a covenant of peace and rid the land of wild animals, so that they may dwell securely in the wilderness and sleep in the forest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_26","027_34_26","EZK","34","26","26","I will make them and the places around My hill a blessing. I will send down showers in season—showers of blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_27","027_34_27","EZK","34","27","27","The trees of the field will give their fruit, and the land will yield its produce; My flock will be secure in their land. Then they will know that I am the LORD, when I have broken the bars of their yoke and delivered them from the hands that enslaved them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_28","027_34_28","EZK","34","28","28","They will no longer be prey for the nations, and the beasts of the earth will not consume them. They will dwell securely, and no one will frighten them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_29","027_34_29","EZK","34","29","29","And I will raise up for them a garden of renown, and they will no longer be victims of famine in the land or bear the scorn of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_30","027_34_30","EZK","34","30","30","Then they will know that I, the LORD their God, am with them, and that they, the house of Israel, are My people,’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK34_31","027_34_31","EZK","34","31","31","‘You are My flock, the sheep of My pasture, My people, and I am your God,’ declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_1","027_35_1","EZK","35","1","1","Moreover, the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_2","027_35_2","EZK","35","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against Mount Seir and prophesy against it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_3","027_35_3","EZK","35","3","3","and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I am against you, O Mount Seir. I will stretch out My hand against you and make you a desolate waste. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_4","027_35_4","EZK","35","4","4","I will turn your cities into ruins, and you will become a desolation. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_5","027_35_5","EZK","35","5","5","Because you harbored an ancient hatred and delivered the Israelites over to the sword in the time of their disaster at the final stage of their punishment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_6","027_35_6","EZK","35","6","6","therefore as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, I will give you over to bloodshed and it will pursue you. Since you did not hate bloodshed, it will pursue you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_7","027_35_7","EZK","35","7","7","I will make Mount Seir a desolate waste and will cut off from it those who come and go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_8","027_35_8","EZK","35","8","8","I will fill its mountains with the slain; those killed by the sword will fall on your hills, in your valleys, and in all your ravines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_9","027_35_9","EZK","35","9","9","I will make you a perpetual desolation, and your cities will not be inhabited. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_10","027_35_10","EZK","35","10","10","Because you have said, ‘These two nations and countries will be ours, and we will possess them,’ even though the LORD was there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_11","027_35_11","EZK","35","11","11","therefore as surely as I live, declares the Lord GOD, I will treat you according to the anger and jealousy you showed in your hatred against them, and I will make Myself known among them when I judge you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_12","027_35_12","EZK","35","12","12","Then you will know that I, the LORD, have heard every contemptuous word you uttered against the mountains of Israel when you said, ‘They are desolate; they are given to us to devour!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_13","027_35_13","EZK","35","13","13","You boasted against Me with your mouth and multiplied your words against Me. I heard it Myself! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_14","027_35_14","EZK","35","14","14","This is what the Lord GOD says: While the whole earth rejoices, I will make you desolate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK35_15","027_35_15","EZK","35","15","15","As you rejoiced when the inheritance of the house of Israel became desolate, so will I do to you. You will become a desolation, O Mount Seir, and so will all of Edom. Then they will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_1","027_36_1","EZK","36","1","1","“And you, son of man, prophesy to the mountains of Israel and say: O mountains of Israel, hear the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_2","027_36_2","EZK","36","2","2","This is what the Lord GOD says: Because the enemy has said of you, ‘Aha! The ancient heights have become our possession,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_3","027_36_3","EZK","36","3","3","therefore prophesy and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: Because they have made you desolate and have trampled you on every side, so that you became a possession of the rest of the nations and were taken up in slander by the lips of their talkers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_4","027_36_4","EZK","36","4","4","therefore, O mountains of Israel, hear the word of the Lord GOD. This is what the Lord GOD says to the mountains and hills, to the ravines and valleys, to the desolate ruins and abandoned cities, which have become a spoil and a mockery to the rest of the nations around you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_5","027_36_5","EZK","36","5","5","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Surely in My burning zeal I have spoken against the rest of the nations, and against all Edom, who took My land as their own possession with wholehearted joy and utter contempt, so that its pastureland became plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_6","027_36_6","EZK","36","6","6","Therefore, prophesy concerning the land of Israel and tell the mountains and hills, the ravines and valleys, that this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I have spoken in My burning zeal because you have endured the reproach of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_7","027_36_7","EZK","36","7","7","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: I have sworn with an uplifted hand that surely the nations around you will endure reproach of their own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_8","027_36_8","EZK","36","8","8","But you, O mountains of Israel, will produce branches and bear fruit for My people Israel, for they will soon come home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_9","027_36_9","EZK","36","9","9","For behold, I am on your side; I will turn toward you, and you will be tilled and sown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_10","027_36_10","EZK","36","10","10","I will multiply the people upon you—the house of Israel in its entirety. The cities will be inhabited and the ruins rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_11","027_36_11","EZK","36","11","11","I will fill you with people and animals, and they will multiply and be fruitful. I will make you as inhabited as you once were, and I will make you prosper more than before. Then you will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_12","027_36_12","EZK","36","12","12","Yes, I will cause My people Israel to walk upon you; they will possess you, and you will be their inheritance, and you will no longer deprive them of their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_13","027_36_13","EZK","36","13","13","For this is what the Lord GOD says: Because people say to you, ‘You devour men and deprive your nation of its children,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_14","027_36_14","EZK","36","14","14","therefore you will no longer devour men or deprive your nation of its children, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_15","027_36_15","EZK","36","15","15","I will no longer allow the taunts of the nations to be heard against you, and you will no longer endure the reproach of the peoples or cause your nation to stumble, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_16","027_36_16","EZK","36","16","16","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_17","027_36_17","EZK","36","17","17","“Son of man, when the people of Israel lived in their land, they defiled it by their own ways and deeds. Their behavior before Me was like the uncleanness of a woman’s impurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_18","027_36_18","EZK","36","18","18","So I poured out My wrath upon them because of the blood they had shed on the land, and because they had defiled it with their idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_19","027_36_19","EZK","36","19","19","I dispersed them among the nations, and they were scattered throughout the lands. I judged them according to their ways and deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_20","027_36_20","EZK","36","20","20","And wherever they went among the nations, they profaned My holy name, because it was said of them, ‘These are the people of the LORD, yet they had to leave His land.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_21","027_36_21","EZK","36","21","21","But I had concern for My holy name, which the house of Israel had profaned among the nations to which they had gone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_22","027_36_22","EZK","36","22","22","Therefore tell the house of Israel that this is what the Lord GOD says: It is not for your sake that I will act, O house of Israel, but for My holy name, which you profaned among the nations to which you went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_23","027_36_23","EZK","36","23","23","I will show the holiness of My great name, which has been profaned among the nations—the name you have profaned among them. Then the nations will know that I am the LORD, declares the Lord GOD, when I show My holiness in you before their eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_24","027_36_24","EZK","36","24","24","For I will take you from among the nations and gather you out of all the countries, and I will bring you back into your own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_25","027_36_25","EZK","36","25","25","I will also sprinkle clean water on you, and you will be clean. I will cleanse you from all your impurities and all your idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_26","027_36_26","EZK","36","26","26","I will give you a new heart and put a new spirit within you; I will remove your heart of stone and give you a heart of flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_27","027_36_27","EZK","36","27","27","And I will put My Spirit within you and cause you to walk in My statutes and to carefully observe My ordinances. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_28","027_36_28","EZK","36","28","28","Then you will live in the land that I gave your forefathers; you will be My people, and I will be your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_29","027_36_29","EZK","36","29","29","I will save you from all your uncleanness. I will summon the grain and make it plentiful, and I will not bring famine upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_30","027_36_30","EZK","36","30","30","I will also make the fruit of the trees and the crops of the field plentiful, so that you will no longer bear reproach among the nations on account of famine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_31","027_36_31","EZK","36","31","31","Then you will remember your evil ways and wicked deeds, and you will loathe yourselves for your iniquities and abominations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_32","027_36_32","EZK","36","32","32","It is not for your sake that I will act, declares the Lord GOD—let it be known to you. Be ashamed and disgraced for your ways, O house of Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_33","027_36_33","EZK","36","33","33","This is what the Lord GOD says: On the day I cleanse you from all your iniquities, I will cause the cities to be resettled and the ruins to be rebuilt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_34","027_36_34","EZK","36","34","34","The desolate land will be cultivated instead of lying desolate in the sight of all who pass through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_35","027_36_35","EZK","36","35","35","Then they will say, ‘This land that was desolate has become like the garden of Eden. The cities that were once ruined, desolate, and destroyed are now fortified and inhabited.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_36","027_36_36","EZK","36","36","36","Then the nations around you that remain will know that I, the LORD, have rebuilt what was destroyed, and I have replanted what was desolate. I, the LORD, have spoken, and I will do it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_37","027_36_37","EZK","36","37","37","This is what the Lord GOD says: Once again I will hear the plea of the house of Israel and do for them this: I will multiply their people like a flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK36_38","027_36_38","EZK","36","38","38","Like the numerous flocks for sacrifices at Jerusalem during her appointed feasts, so the ruined cities will be filled with flocks of people. Then they will know that I am the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_1","027_37_1","EZK","37","1","1","The hand of the LORD was upon me, and He brought me out by His Spirit and set me down in the middle of the valley, and it was full of bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_2","027_37_2","EZK","37","2","2","He led me all around among them, and I saw a great many bones on the floor of the valley, and indeed, they were very dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_3","027_37_3","EZK","37","3","3","Then He asked me, “Son of man, can these bones come to life?” “O Lord GOD,” I replied, “only You know.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_4","027_37_4","EZK","37","4","4","And He said to me, “Prophesy concerning these bones and tell them, ‘Dry bones, hear the word of the LORD! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_5","027_37_5","EZK","37","5","5","This is what the Lord GOD says to these bones: I will cause breath to enter you, and you will come to life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_6","027_37_6","EZK","37","6","6","I will attach tendons to you and make flesh grow upon you and cover you with skin. I will put breath within you so that you will come to life. Then you will know that I am the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_7","027_37_7","EZK","37","7","7","So I prophesied as I had been commanded. And as I prophesied, there was suddenly a noise, a rattling, and the bones came together, bone to bone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_8","027_37_8","EZK","37","8","8","As I looked on, tendons appeared on them, flesh grew, and skin covered them; but there was no breath in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_9","027_37_9","EZK","37","9","9","Then He said to me, “Prophesy to the breath; prophesy, son of man, and tell the breath that this is what the Lord GOD says: Come from the four winds, O breath, and breathe into these slain, so that they may live!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_10","027_37_10","EZK","37","10","10","So I prophesied as He had commanded me, and the breath entered them, and they came to life and stood on their feet—a vast army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_11","027_37_11","EZK","37","11","11","Then He said to me, “Son of man, these bones are the whole house of Israel. Look, they are saying, ‘Our bones are dried up, and our hope has perished; we are cut off.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_12","027_37_12","EZK","37","12","12","Therefore prophesy and tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘O My people, I will open your graves and bring you up from them, and I will bring you back to the land of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_13","027_37_13","EZK","37","13","13","Then you, My people, will know that I am the LORD, when I open your graves and bring you up from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_14","027_37_14","EZK","37","14","14","I will put My Spirit in you and you will live, and I will settle you in your own land. Then you will know that I, the LORD, have spoken, and I will do it, declares the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_15","027_37_15","EZK","37","15","15","Again the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_16","027_37_16","EZK","37","16","16","“And you, son of man, take a single stick and write on it: ‘Belonging to Judah and to the Israelites associated with him.’ Then take another stick and write on it: ‘Belonging to Joseph—the stick of Ephraim—and to all the house of Israel associated with him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_17","027_37_17","EZK","37","17","17","Then join them together into one stick, so that they become one in your hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_18","027_37_18","EZK","37","18","18","When your people ask you, ‘Won’t you explain to us what you mean by these?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_19","027_37_19","EZK","37","19","19","you are to tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will take the stick of Joseph, which is in the hand of Ephraim, and the tribes of Israel associated with him, and I will put them together with the stick of Judah. I will make them into a single stick, and they will become one in My hand.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_20","027_37_20","EZK","37","20","20","When the sticks on which you write are in your hand and in full view of the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_21","027_37_21","EZK","37","21","21","you are to tell them that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I will take the Israelites out of the nations to which they have gone, and I will gather them from all around and bring them into their own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_22","027_37_22","EZK","37","22","22","I will make them one nation in the land, on the mountains of Israel, and one king will rule over all of them. Then they will no longer be two nations and will never again be divided into two kingdoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_23","027_37_23","EZK","37","23","23","They will no longer defile themselves with their idols or detestable images, or with any of their transgressions. I will save them from all their apostasies by which they sinned, and I will cleanse them. Then they will be My people, and I will be their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_24","027_37_24","EZK","37","24","24","My servant David will be king over them, and there will be one shepherd for all of them. They will follow My ordinances and keep and observe My statutes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_25","027_37_25","EZK","37","25","25","They will live in the land that I gave to My servant Jacob, where your fathers lived. They will live there forever with their children and grandchildren, and My servant David will be their prince forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_26","027_37_26","EZK","37","26","26","And I will make a covenant of peace with them; it will be an everlasting covenant. I will establish them and multiply them, and I will set My sanctuary among them forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_27","027_37_27","EZK","37","27","27","My dwelling place will be with them; I will be their God, and they will be My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK37_28","027_37_28","EZK","37","28","28","Then the nations will know that I the LORD sanctify Israel, when My sanctuary is among them forever.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_1","027_38_1","EZK","38","1","1","And the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_2","027_38_2","EZK","38","2","2","“Son of man, set your face against Gog of the land of Magog, the chief prince of Meshech and Tubal. Prophesy against him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_3","027_38_3","EZK","38","3","3","and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I am against you, O Gog, chief prince of Meshech and Tubal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_4","027_38_4","EZK","38","4","4","I will turn you around, put hooks in your jaws, and bring you out with all your army—your horses, your horsemen in full armor, and a great company armed with shields and bucklers, all brandishing their swords. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_5","027_38_5","EZK","38","5","5","Persia, Cush, and Put will accompany them, all with shields and helmets, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_6","027_38_6","EZK","38","6","6","as well as Gomer with all its troops, and Beth-togarmah from the far north with all its troops—the many nations with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_7","027_38_7","EZK","38","7","7","Get ready; prepare yourself, you and all your company gathered around you; you will be their guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_8","027_38_8","EZK","38","8","8","After a long time you will be summoned. In the latter years you will enter a land that has recovered from war, whose people were gathered from many nations to the mountains of Israel, which had long been desolate. They had been brought out from the nations, and all now dwell securely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_9","027_38_9","EZK","38","9","9","You and all your troops, and many peoples with you will go up, advancing like a thunderstorm; you will be like a cloud covering the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_10","027_38_10","EZK","38","10","10","This is what the Lord GOD says: On that day, thoughts will arise in your mind, and you will devise an evil plan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_11","027_38_11","EZK","38","11","11","You will say, ‘I will go up against a land of unwalled villages; I will come against a quiet people who dwell securely, all of them living without walls or bars or gates— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_12","027_38_12","EZK","38","12","12","in order to seize the spoil and carry off the plunder, to turn a hand against the desolate places now inhabited and against a people gathered from the nations, who have acquired livestock and possessions and who live at the center of the land.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_13","027_38_13","EZK","38","13","13","Sheba and Dedan and the merchants of Tarshish with all its villages will ask, ‘Have you come to capture the plunder? Have you assembled your hordes to carry away loot, to make off with silver and gold, to take cattle and goods, to seize great spoil?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_14","027_38_14","EZK","38","14","14","Therefore prophesy, son of man, and tell Gog that this is what the Lord GOD says: On that day when My people Israel are dwelling securely, will you not take notice of this? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_15","027_38_15","EZK","38","15","15","And you will come from your place out of the far north—you and many peoples with you, all riding horses—a mighty horde, a huge army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_16","027_38_16","EZK","38","16","16","You will advance against My people Israel like a cloud covering the land. It will happen in the latter days, O Gog, that I will bring you against My land, so that the nations may know Me when I show Myself holy in you before their eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_17","027_38_17","EZK","38","17","17","This is what the Lord GOD says: Are you the one of whom I have spoken in former days through My servants, the prophets of Israel, who in those times prophesied for years that I would bring you against them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_18","027_38_18","EZK","38","18","18","Now on that day when Gog comes against the land of Israel, declares the Lord GOD, My wrath will flare up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_19","027_38_19","EZK","38","19","19","In My zeal and fiery rage I proclaim that on that day there will be a great earthquake in the land of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_20","027_38_20","EZK","38","20","20","The fish of the sea, the birds of the air, the beasts of the field, every creature that crawls upon the ground, and all mankind on the face of the earth will tremble at My presence. The mountains will be thrown down, the cliffs will collapse, and every wall will fall to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_21","027_38_21","EZK","38","21","21","And I will summon a sword against Gog on all My mountains, declares the Lord GOD, and every man’s sword will be against his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_22","027_38_22","EZK","38","22","22","I will execute judgment upon him with plague and bloodshed. I will pour out torrents of rain, hailstones, fire, and sulfur on him and on his troops and on the many nations with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK38_23","027_38_23","EZK","38","23","23","I will magnify and sanctify Myself, and I will reveal Myself in the sight of many nations. Then they will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_1","027_39_1","EZK","39","1","1","“As for you, O son of man, prophesy against Gog and declare that this is what the Lord GOD says: Behold, I am against you, O Gog, chief prince of Meshech and Tubal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_2","027_39_2","EZK","39","2","2","I will turn you around, drive you along, bring you up from the far north, and send you against the mountains of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_3","027_39_3","EZK","39","3","3","Then I will strike the bow from your left hand and dash down the arrows from your right hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_4","027_39_4","EZK","39","4","4","On the mountains of Israel you will fall—you and all your troops and the nations with you. I will give you as food to every kind of ravenous bird and wild beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_5","027_39_5","EZK","39","5","5","You will fall in the open field, for I have spoken, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_6","027_39_6","EZK","39","6","6","I will send fire on Magog and on those who dwell securely in the coastlands, and they will know that I am the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_7","027_39_7","EZK","39","7","7","So I will make My holy name known among My people Israel and will no longer allow it to be profaned. Then the nations will know that I am the LORD, the Holy One in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_8","027_39_8","EZK","39","8","8","Yes, it is coming, and it will surely happen, declares the Lord GOD. This is the day of which I have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_9","027_39_9","EZK","39","9","9","Then those who dwell in the cities of Israel will go out, kindle fires, and burn up the weapons—the bucklers and shields, the bows and arrows, the clubs and spears. For seven years they will use them for fuel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_10","027_39_10","EZK","39","10","10","They will not gather wood from the countryside or cut it from the forests, for they will use the weapons for fuel. They will loot those who looted them and plunder those who plundered them, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_11","027_39_11","EZK","39","11","11","And on that day I will give Gog a burial place in Israel, the Valley of the Travelers, east of the Sea. It will block those who travel through, because Gog and all his hordes will be buried there. So it will be called the Valley of Hamon-gog. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_12","027_39_12","EZK","39","12","12","For seven months the house of Israel will be burying them in order to cleanse the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_13","027_39_13","EZK","39","13","13","All the people of the land will bury them, and it will bring them renown on the day I display My glory, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_14","027_39_14","EZK","39","14","14","And men will be employed to continually pass through the land to cleanse it by burying the invaders who remain on the ground. At the end of the seven months they will begin their search. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_15","027_39_15","EZK","39","15","15","As they pass through the land, anyone who sees a human bone will set up a pillar next to it, until the gravediggers have buried it in the Valley of Hamon-gog. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_16","027_39_16","EZK","39","16","16","(Even the city will be named Hamonah.) And so they will cleanse the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_17","027_39_17","EZK","39","17","17","And as for you, son of man, this is what the Lord GOD says: Call out to every kind of bird and to every beast of the field: ‘Assemble and come together from all around to the sacrificial feast that I am preparing for you, a great feast on the mountains of Israel. There you will eat flesh and drink blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_18","027_39_18","EZK","39","18","18","You will eat the flesh of the mighty and drink the blood of the princes of the earth as though they were rams, lambs, goats, and bulls—all the fattened animals of Bashan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_19","027_39_19","EZK","39","19","19","At the sacrifice I am preparing, you will eat fat until you are gorged and drink blood until you are drunk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_20","027_39_20","EZK","39","20","20","And at My table you will eat your fill of horses and riders, of mighty men and warriors of every kind,’ declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_21","027_39_21","EZK","39","21","21","I will display My glory among the nations, and all the nations will see the judgment that I execute and the hand that I lay upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_22","027_39_22","EZK","39","22","22","From that day forward the house of Israel will know that I am the LORD their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_23","027_39_23","EZK","39","23","23","And the nations will know that the house of Israel went into exile for their iniquity, because they were unfaithful to Me. So I hid My face from them and delivered them into the hands of their enemies, so that they all fell by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_24","027_39_24","EZK","39","24","24","I dealt with them according to their uncleanness and transgressions, and I hid My face from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_25","027_39_25","EZK","39","25","25","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: Now I will restore Jacob from captivity and will have compassion on the whole house of Israel, and I will be jealous for My holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_26","027_39_26","EZK","39","26","26","They will forget their disgrace and all the treachery they committed against Me, when they dwell securely in their land, with no one to frighten them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_27","027_39_27","EZK","39","27","27","When I bring them back from the peoples and gather them out of the lands of their enemies, I will show My holiness in them in the sight of many nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_28","027_39_28","EZK","39","28","28","Then they will know that I am the LORD their God, when I regather them to their own land, not leaving any of them behind after their exile among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK39_29","027_39_29","EZK","39","29","29","And I will no longer hide My face from them, for I will pour out My Spirit on the house of Israel, declares the Lord GOD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_1","027_40_1","EZK","40","1","1","In the twenty-fifth year of our exile, at the beginning of the year, on the tenth day of the month—in the fourteenth year after Jerusalem had been struck down—on that very day the hand of the LORD was upon me, and He took me there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_2","027_40_2","EZK","40","2","2","In visions of God He took me to the land of Israel and set me on a very high mountain, on whose southern slope was a structure that resembled a city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_3","027_40_3","EZK","40","3","3","So He took me there, and I saw a man whose appearance was like bronze. He was standing in the gateway with a linen cord and a measuring rod in his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_4","027_40_4","EZK","40","4","4","“Son of man,” he said to me, “look with your eyes, hear with your ears, and pay attention to everything I am going to show you, for that is why you have been brought here. Report to the house of Israel everything you see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_5","027_40_5","EZK","40","5","5","And I saw a wall surrounding the temple area. Now the length of the measuring rod in the man’s hand was six long cubits (each measuring a cubit and a handbreadth), and he measured the wall to be one rod thick and one rod high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_6","027_40_6","EZK","40","6","6","Then he came to the gate facing east and climbed its steps. He measured the threshold of the gate to be one rod deep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_7","027_40_7","EZK","40","7","7","Each gate chamber was one rod long and one rod wide, and there were five cubits between the gate chambers. The inner threshold of the gate by the portico facing inward was one rod deep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_8","027_40_8","EZK","40","8","8","Then he measured the portico of the gateway inside; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_9","027_40_9","EZK","40","9","9","it was eight cubits deep, and its jambs were two cubits thick. And the portico of the gateway faced the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_10","027_40_10","EZK","40","10","10","There were three gate chambers on each side of the east gate, each with the same measurements, and the gateposts on either side also had the same measurements. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_11","027_40_11","EZK","40","11","11","And he measured the width of the gateway entrance to be ten cubits, and its length was thirteen cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_12","027_40_12","EZK","40","12","12","In front of each gate chamber was a wall one cubit high, and the gate chambers were six cubits square. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_13","027_40_13","EZK","40","13","13","Then he measured the gateway from the roof of one gate chamber to the roof of the opposite one; the distance was twenty-five cubits from doorway to doorway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_14","027_40_14","EZK","40","14","14","Next he measured the gateposts to be sixty cubits high. The gateway extended around to the gatepost of the courtyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_15","027_40_15","EZK","40","15","15","And the distance from the entrance of the gateway to the far end of its inner portico was fifty cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_16","027_40_16","EZK","40","16","16","The gate chambers and their side pillars had beveled windows all around the inside of the gateway. The porticos also had windows all around on the inside. Each side pillar was decorated with palm trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_17","027_40_17","EZK","40","17","17","Then he brought me into the outer court, and there were chambers and a pavement laid out all around the court. Thirty chambers faced the pavement, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_18","027_40_18","EZK","40","18","18","which flanked the gateways and corresponded to the length of the gates; this was the lower pavement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_19","027_40_19","EZK","40","19","19","Then he measured the distance from the front of the lower gateway to the outside of the inner court; it was a hundred cubits on the east side as well as on the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_20","027_40_20","EZK","40","20","20","He also measured the length and width of the gateway of the outer court facing north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_21","027_40_21","EZK","40","21","21","Its three gate chambers on each side, its side pillars, and its portico all had the same measurements as the first gate: fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_22","027_40_22","EZK","40","22","22","Its windows, portico, and palm trees had the same measurements as those of the gate facing east. Seven steps led up to it, with its portico opposite them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_23","027_40_23","EZK","40","23","23","There was a gate to the inner court facing the north gate, just as there was on the east. He measured the distance from gateway to gateway to be a hundred cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_24","027_40_24","EZK","40","24","24","Then he led me to the south side, and I saw a gateway facing south. He measured its side pillars and portico, and they had the same measurements as the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_25","027_40_25","EZK","40","25","25","Both the gateway and its portico had windows all around, like the other windows. It was fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_26","027_40_26","EZK","40","26","26","Seven steps led up to it, and its portico was opposite them; it had palm trees on its side pillars, one on each side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_27","027_40_27","EZK","40","27","27","The inner court also had a gate facing south, and he measured the distance from gateway to gateway toward the south to be a hundred cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_28","027_40_28","EZK","40","28","28","Next he brought me into the inner court through the south gate, and he measured the south gate; it had the same measurements as the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_29","027_40_29","EZK","40","29","29","Its gate chambers, side pillars, and portico had the same measurements as the others. Both the gateway and its portico had windows all around; it was fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_30","027_40_30","EZK","40","30","30","(The porticoes around the inner court were twenty-five cubits long and five cubits deep.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_31","027_40_31","EZK","40","31","31","Its portico faced the outer court, and its side pillars were decorated with palm trees. Eight steps led up to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_32","027_40_32","EZK","40","32","32","And he brought me to the inner court on the east side, and he measured the gateway; it had the same measurements as the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_33","027_40_33","EZK","40","33","33","Its gate chambers, side pillars, and portico had the same measurements as the others. Both the gateway and its portico had windows all around. It was fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_34","027_40_34","EZK","40","34","34","Its portico faced the outer court, and its side pillars were decorated with palm trees on each side. Eight steps led up to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_35","027_40_35","EZK","40","35","35","Then he brought me to the north gate and measured it. It had the same measurements as the others, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_36","027_40_36","EZK","40","36","36","as did its gate chambers, side pillars, and portico. It also had windows all around. It was fifty cubits long and twenty-five cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_37","027_40_37","EZK","40","37","37","Its portico faced the outer court, and its side pillars were decorated with palm trees on each side. Eight steps led up to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_38","027_40_38","EZK","40","38","38","There was a chamber with a doorway by the portico in each of the inner gateways. There the burnt offering was to be washed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_39","027_40_39","EZK","40","39","39","Inside the portico of the gateway were two tables on each side, on which the burnt offerings, sin offerings, and guilt offerings were to be slaughtered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_40","027_40_40","EZK","40","40","40","Outside, as one goes up to the entrance of the north gateway, there were two tables on one side and two more tables on the other side of the gate’s portico. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_41","027_40_41","EZK","40","41","41","So there were four tables inside the gateway and four outside—eight tables in all—on which the sacrifices were to be slaughtered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_42","027_40_42","EZK","40","42","42","There were also four tables of dressed stone for the burnt offering, each a cubit and a half long, a cubit and a half wide, and a cubit high. On these were placed the utensils used to slaughter the burnt offerings and the other sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_43","027_40_43","EZK","40","43","43","The double-pronged hooks, each a handbreadth long, were fastened all around the inside of the room, and the flesh of the offering was to be placed on the tables. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_44","027_40_44","EZK","40","44","44","Outside the inner gate, within the inner court, were two chambers, one beside the north gate and facing south, and another beside the south gate and facing north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_45","027_40_45","EZK","40","45","45","Then the man said to me: “The chamber that faces south is for the priests who keep charge of the temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_46","027_40_46","EZK","40","46","46","and the chamber that faces north is for the priests who keep charge of the altar. These are the sons of Zadok, the only Levites who may approach the LORD to minister before Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_47","027_40_47","EZK","40","47","47","Next he measured the court. It was square, a hundred cubits long and a hundred cubits wide. And the altar was in front of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_48","027_40_48","EZK","40","48","48","Then he brought me to the portico of the temple and measured the side pillars of the portico to be five cubits on each side. The width of the gateway was fourteen cubits and its sidewalls were three cubits on either side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK40_49","027_40_49","EZK","40","49","49","The portico was twenty cubits wide and twelve cubits deep, and ten steps led up to it. There were columns by the side pillars, one on each side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_1","027_41_1","EZK","41","1","1","Then the man brought me into the outer sanctuary and measured the side pillars to be six cubits wide on each side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_2","027_41_2","EZK","41","2","2","The width of the entrance was ten cubits, and the sides of the entrance were five cubits on each side. He also measured the length of the outer sanctuary to be forty cubits, and the width to be twenty cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_3","027_41_3","EZK","41","3","3","And he went into the inner sanctuary and measured the side pillars at the entrance to be two cubits wide. The entrance was six cubits wide, and the walls on each side were seven cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_4","027_41_4","EZK","41","4","4","Then he measured the room adjacent to the inner sanctuary to be twenty cubits long and twenty cubits wide. And he said to me, “This is the Most Holy Place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_5","027_41_5","EZK","41","5","5","Next he measured the wall of the temple to be six cubits thick, and the width of each side room around the temple was four cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_6","027_41_6","EZK","41","6","6","The side rooms were arranged one above another in three levels of thirty rooms each. There were ledges all around the wall of the temple to serve as supports for the side rooms, so that the supports would not be fastened into the wall of the temple itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_7","027_41_7","EZK","41","7","7","The side rooms surrounding the temple widened at each successive level, because the structure surrounding the temple ascended by stages corresponding to the narrowing of the temple wall as it rose upward. And so a stairway went up from the lowest story to the highest, through the middle one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_8","027_41_8","EZK","41","8","8","I saw that the temple had a raised base all around it, forming the foundation of the side rooms. It was the full length of a rod, six long cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_9","027_41_9","EZK","41","9","9","The outer wall of the side rooms was five cubits thick, and the open area between the side rooms of the temple ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_10","027_41_10","EZK","41","10","10","and the outer chambers was twenty cubits wide all around the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_11","027_41_11","EZK","41","11","11","The side rooms opened into this area, with one entrance on the north and another on the south. The open area was five cubits wide all around. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_12","027_41_12","EZK","41","12","12","Now the building that faced the temple courtyard on the west was seventy cubits wide, and the wall of the building was five cubits thick all around, with a length of ninety cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_13","027_41_13","EZK","41","13","13","Then he measured the temple to be a hundred cubits long, and the temple courtyard and the building with its walls were also a hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_14","027_41_14","EZK","41","14","14","The width of the temple courtyard on the east, including the front of the temple, was a hundred cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_15","027_41_15","EZK","41","15","15","Next he measured the length of the building facing the temple courtyard at the rear of the temple, including its galleries on each side; it was a hundred cubits. The outer sanctuary, the inner sanctuary, and the porticoes facing the court, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_16","027_41_16","EZK","41","16","16","as well as the thresholds and the beveled windows and the galleries all around with their three levels opposite the threshold, were overlaid with wood on all sides. They were paneled from the ground to the windows, and the windows were covered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_17","027_41_17","EZK","41","17","17","In the space above the outside of the entrance to the inner sanctuary on all the walls, spaced evenly around the inner and outer sanctuary, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_18","027_41_18","EZK","41","18","18","were alternating carved cherubim and palm trees. Each cherub had two faces: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_19","027_41_19","EZK","41","19","19","the face of a man was toward the palm tree on one side, and the face of a young lion was toward the palm tree on the other side. They were carved all the way around the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_20","027_41_20","EZK","41","20","20","Cherubim and palm trees were carved on the wall of the outer sanctuary from the floor to the space above the entrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_21","027_41_21","EZK","41","21","21","The outer sanctuary had a rectangular doorframe, and the doorframe of the sanctuary was similar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_22","027_41_22","EZK","41","22","22","There was an altar of wood three cubits high and two cubits square. Its corners, base, and sides were of wood. And the man told me, “This is the table that is before the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_23","027_41_23","EZK","41","23","23","Both the outer sanctuary and the inner sanctuary had double doors, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_24","027_41_24","EZK","41","24","24","and each door had two swinging panels. There were two panels for one door and two for the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_25","027_41_25","EZK","41","25","25","Cherubim and palm trees like those on the walls were carved on the doors of the outer sanctuary, and there was a wooden canopy outside, on the front of the portico. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK41_26","027_41_26","EZK","41","26","26","There were beveled windows and palm trees on the sidewalls of the portico. The side rooms of the temple also had canopies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_1","027_42_1","EZK","42","1","1","Then the man led me out northward into the outer court, and he brought me to the group of chambers opposite the temple courtyard and the outer wall on the north side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_2","027_42_2","EZK","42","2","2","The building with the door facing north was a hundred cubits long and fifty cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_3","027_42_3","EZK","42","3","3","Gallery faced gallery in three levels opposite the twenty cubits that belonged to the inner court and opposite the pavement that belonged to the outer court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_4","027_42_4","EZK","42","4","4","In front of the chambers was an inner walkway ten cubits wide and a hundred cubits long. Their doors were on the north. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_5","027_42_5","EZK","42","5","5","Now the upper chambers were smaller because the galleries took more space from the chambers on the lower and middle floors of the building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_6","027_42_6","EZK","42","6","6","For they were arranged in three stories, and unlike the courts, they had no pillars. So the upper chambers were set back further than the lower and middle floors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_7","027_42_7","EZK","42","7","7","An outer wall in front of the chambers was fifty cubits long and ran parallel to the chambers and the outer court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_8","027_42_8","EZK","42","8","8","For the chambers on the outer court were fifty cubits long, while those facing the temple were a hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_9","027_42_9","EZK","42","9","9","And below these chambers was the entrance on the east side as one enters them from the outer court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_10","027_42_10","EZK","42","10","10","On the south side along the length of the wall of the outer court were chambers adjoining the courtyard and opposite the building, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_11","027_42_11","EZK","42","11","11","with a passageway in front of them, just like the chambers that were on the north. They had the same length and width, with similar exits and dimensions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_12","027_42_12","EZK","42","12","12","And corresponding to the doors of the chambers that were facing south, there was a door in front of the walkway that was parallel to the wall extending eastward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_13","027_42_13","EZK","42","13","13","Then the man said to me, “The north and south chambers facing the temple courtyard are the holy chambers where the priests who approach the LORD will eat the most holy offerings. There they will place the most holy offerings—the grain offerings, the sin offerings, and the guilt offerings—for the place is holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_14","027_42_14","EZK","42","14","14","Once the priests have entered the holy area, they must not go out into the outer court until they have left behind the garments in which they minister, for these are holy. They are to put on other clothes before they approach the places that are for the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_15","027_42_15","EZK","42","15","15","Now when the man had finished measuring the interior of the temple area, he led me out by the gate that faced east, and he measured the area all around: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_16","027_42_16","EZK","42","16","16","With a measuring rod he measured the east side to be five hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_17","027_42_17","EZK","42","17","17","He measured the north side to be five hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_18","027_42_18","EZK","42","18","18","He measured the south side to be five hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_19","027_42_19","EZK","42","19","19","And he came around and measured the west side to be five hundred cubits long. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK42_20","027_42_20","EZK","42","20","20","So he measured the area on all four sides. It had a wall all around, five hundred cubits long and five hundred cubits wide, to separate the holy from the common. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_1","027_43_1","EZK","43","1","1","Then the man brought me back to the gate that faces east, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_2","027_43_2","EZK","43","2","2","and I saw the glory of the God of Israel coming from the east. His voice was like the roar of many waters, and the earth shone with His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_3","027_43_3","EZK","43","3","3","The vision I saw was like the vision I had seen when He came to destroy the city and like the visions I had seen by the River Kebar. I fell facedown, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_4","027_43_4","EZK","43","4","4","and the glory of the LORD entered the temple through the gate facing east. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_5","027_43_5","EZK","43","5","5","Then the Spirit lifted me up and brought me into the inner court, and the glory of the LORD filled the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_6","027_43_6","EZK","43","6","6","While the man was standing beside me, I heard someone speaking to me from inside the temple, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_7","027_43_7","EZK","43","7","7","and He said to me, “Son of man, this is the place of My throne and the place for the soles of My feet, where I will dwell among the Israelites forever. The house of Israel will never again defile My holy name—neither they nor their kings—by their prostitution and by the funeral offerings for their kings at their deaths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_8","027_43_8","EZK","43","8","8","When they placed their threshold next to My threshold and their doorposts beside My doorposts, with only a wall between Me and them, they defiled My holy name by the abominations they committed. Therefore I have consumed them in My anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_9","027_43_9","EZK","43","9","9","Now let them remove far from Me their prostitution and the funeral offerings for their kings, and I will dwell among them forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_10","027_43_10","EZK","43","10","10","As for you, son of man, describe the temple to the people of Israel, so that they may be ashamed of their iniquities. Let them measure the plan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_11","027_43_11","EZK","43","11","11","and if they are ashamed of all they have done, then make known to them the design of the temple—its arrangement and its exits and entrances—its whole design along with all its statutes, forms, and laws. Write it down in their sight, so that they may keep its complete design and all its statutes and may carry them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_12","027_43_12","EZK","43","12","12","This is the law of the temple: All its surrounding territory on top of the mountain will be most holy. Yes, this is the law of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_13","027_43_13","EZK","43","13","13","These are the measurements of the altar in long cubits (a cubit and a handbreadth): Its gutter shall be a cubit deep and a cubit wide, with a rim of one span around its edge. And this is the height of the altar: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_14","027_43_14","EZK","43","14","14","The space from the gutter on the ground to the lower ledge shall be two cubits, and the ledge one cubit wide. The space from the smaller ledge to the larger ledge shall be four cubits, and the ledge one cubit wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_15","027_43_15","EZK","43","15","15","The altar hearth shall be four cubits high, and four horns shall project upward from the hearth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_16","027_43_16","EZK","43","16","16","The altar hearth shall be square at its four corners, twelve cubits long and twelve cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_17","027_43_17","EZK","43","17","17","The ledge shall also be square, fourteen cubits long and fourteen cubits wide, with a rim of half a cubit and a gutter of a cubit all around it. The steps of the altar shall face east.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_18","027_43_18","EZK","43","18","18","Then He said to me: “Son of man, this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘These are the statutes for the altar on the day it is constructed, so that burnt offerings may be sacrificed on it and blood may be splattered on it: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_19","027_43_19","EZK","43","19","19","You are to give a young bull from the herd as a sin offering to the Levitical priests who are of the family of Zadok, who approach Me to minister before Me, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_20","027_43_20","EZK","43","20","20","You are to take some of its blood and put it on the four horns of the altar, on the four corners of the ledge, and all around the rim; thus you will cleanse the altar and make atonement for it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_21","027_43_21","EZK","43","21","21","Then you are to take away the bull for the sin offering and burn it in the appointed part of the temple area outside the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_22","027_43_22","EZK","43","22","22","On the second day you are to present an unblemished male goat as a sin offering, and the altar is to be cleansed as it was with the bull. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_23","027_43_23","EZK","43","23","23","When you have finished the purification, you are to present a young, unblemished bull and an unblemished ram from the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_24","027_43_24","EZK","43","24","24","You must present them before the LORD; the priests are to sprinkle salt on them and sacrifice them as a burnt offering to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_25","027_43_25","EZK","43","25","25","For seven days you are to provide a male goat daily for a sin offering; you are also to provide a young bull and a ram from the flock, both unblemished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_26","027_43_26","EZK","43","26","26","For seven days the priests are to make atonement for the altar and cleanse it; so they shall consecrate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK43_27","027_43_27","EZK","43","27","27","At the end of these days, from the eighth day on, the priests are to present your burnt offerings and peace offerings on the altar. Then I will accept you, declares the Lord GOD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_1","027_44_1","EZK","44","1","1","The man then brought me back to the outer gate of the sanctuary that faced east, but it was shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_2","027_44_2","EZK","44","2","2","And the LORD said to me, “This gate is to remain shut. It shall not be opened, and no man shall enter through it, because the LORD, the God of Israel, has entered through it. Therefore it will remain shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_3","027_44_3","EZK","44","3","3","Only the prince himself may sit inside the gateway to eat in the presence of the LORD. He must enter by way of the portico of the gateway and go out the same way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_4","027_44_4","EZK","44","4","4","Then the man brought me to the front of the temple by way of the north gate. I looked and saw the glory of the LORD filling His temple, and I fell facedown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_5","027_44_5","EZK","44","5","5","The LORD said to me: “Son of man, pay attention; look carefully with your eyes and listen closely with your ears to everything I tell you concerning all the statutes and laws of the house of the LORD. Take careful note of the entrance to the temple, along with all the exits of the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_6","027_44_6","EZK","44","6","6","Tell the rebellious house of Israel that this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘I have had enough of all your abominations, O house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_7","027_44_7","EZK","44","7","7","In addition to all your other abominations, you brought in foreigners uncircumcised in both heart and flesh to occupy My sanctuary; you defiled My temple when you offered My food—the fat and the blood; you broke My covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_8","027_44_8","EZK","44","8","8","And you have not kept charge of My holy things, but have appointed others to keep charge of My sanctuary for you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_9","027_44_9","EZK","44","9","9","This is what the Lord GOD says: No foreigner uncircumcised in heart and flesh may enter My sanctuary—not even a foreigner who lives among the Israelites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_10","027_44_10","EZK","44","10","10","Surely the Levites who wandered away from Me when Israel went astray, and who wandered away from Me after their idols, will bear the consequences of their iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_11","027_44_11","EZK","44","11","11","Yet they shall be ministers in My sanctuary, having charge of the gates of the temple and ministering there. They shall slaughter the burnt offerings and other sacrifices for the people and stand before them to minister to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_12","027_44_12","EZK","44","12","12","Because they ministered before their idols and became a stumbling block of iniquity to the house of Israel, therefore I swore with an uplifted hand concerning them that they would bear the consequences of their iniquity, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_13","027_44_13","EZK","44","13","13","They must not approach Me to serve Me as priests or come near any of My holy things or the most holy things. They will bear the shame of the abominations they have committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_14","027_44_14","EZK","44","14","14","Yet I will appoint them to keep charge of all the work for the temple and everything to be done in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_15","027_44_15","EZK","44","15","15","But the Levitical priests, who are descended from Zadok and who kept charge of My sanctuary when the Israelites went astray from Me, are to approach Me to minister before Me. They will stand before Me to offer Me fat and blood, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_16","027_44_16","EZK","44","16","16","They alone shall enter My sanctuary and draw near to My table to minister before Me. They will keep My charge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_17","027_44_17","EZK","44","17","17","When they enter the gates of the inner court, they are to wear linen garments; they must not wear anything made of wool when they minister at the gates of the inner court or inside the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_18","027_44_18","EZK","44","18","18","They are to wear linen turbans on their heads and linen undergarments around their waists. They must not wear anything that makes them perspire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_19","027_44_19","EZK","44","19","19","When they go out to the outer court, to the people, they are to take off the garments in which they have ministered, leave them in the holy chambers, and dress in other clothes so that they do not transmit holiness to the people with their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_20","027_44_20","EZK","44","20","20","They must not shave their heads or let their hair grow long, but must carefully trim their hair. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_21","027_44_21","EZK","44","21","21","No priest may drink wine before he enters the inner court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_22","027_44_22","EZK","44","22","22","And they shall not marry a widow or a divorced woman, but must marry a virgin of the descendants of the house of Israel, or a widow of a priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_23","027_44_23","EZK","44","23","23","They are to teach My people the difference between the holy and the common and show them how to discern between the clean and the unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_24","027_44_24","EZK","44","24","24","In any dispute, they shall officiate as judges and judge according to My ordinances. They must keep My laws and statutes regarding all My appointed feasts, and they must keep My Sabbaths holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_25","027_44_25","EZK","44","25","25","A priest must not defile himself by going near a dead person. However, for a father, a mother, a son, a daughter, a brother, or an unmarried sister, he may do so, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_26","027_44_26","EZK","44","26","26","and after he is cleansed, he must count off seven days for himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_27","027_44_27","EZK","44","27","27","And on the day he goes into the sanctuary, into the inner court, to minister in the sanctuary, he must present his sin offering, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_28","027_44_28","EZK","44","28","28","In regard to their inheritance, I am their inheritance. You are to give them no possession in Israel, for I am their possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_29","027_44_29","EZK","44","29","29","They shall eat the grain offerings, the sin offerings, and the guilt offerings. Everything in Israel devoted to the LORD will belong to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_30","027_44_30","EZK","44","30","30","The best of all the firstfruits and of every contribution from all your offerings will belong to the priests. You are to give your first batch of dough to the priest, so that a blessing may rest upon your homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK44_31","027_44_31","EZK","44","31","31","The priests may not eat any bird or animal found dead or torn by wild beasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_1","027_45_1","EZK","45","1","1","“When you divide the land by lot as an inheritance, you are to set aside a portion for the LORD, a holy portion of the land 25,000 cubits long and 20,000 cubits wide. This entire tract of land will be holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_2","027_45_2","EZK","45","2","2","Within this area there is to be a section for the sanctuary 500 cubits square, with 50 cubits around it for open land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_3","027_45_3","EZK","45","3","3","From this holy portion, you are to measure off a length of 25,000 cubits and a width of 10,000 cubits, and in it will be the sanctuary, the Most Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_4","027_45_4","EZK","45","4","4","It will be a holy portion of the land to be used by the priests who minister in the sanctuary, who draw near to minister before the LORD. It will be a place for their houses, as well as a holy area for the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_5","027_45_5","EZK","45","5","5","An adjacent area 25,000 cubits long and 10,000 cubits wide shall belong to the Levites who minister in the temple; it will be their possession for towns in which to live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_6","027_45_6","EZK","45","6","6","As the property of the city, you are to set aside an area 5,000 cubits wide and 25,000 cubits long, adjacent to the holy district. It will belong to the whole house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_7","027_45_7","EZK","45","7","7","Now the prince will have the area bordering each side of the area formed by the holy district and the property of the city, extending westward from the western side and eastward from the eastern side, running lengthwise from the western boundary to the eastern boundary and parallel to one of the tribal portions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_8","027_45_8","EZK","45","8","8","This land will be his possession in Israel. And My princes will no longer oppress My people, but will give the rest of the land to the house of Israel according to their tribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_9","027_45_9","EZK","45","9","9","For this is what the Lord GOD says: ‘Enough, O princes of Israel! Cease your violence and oppression, and do what is just and right. Stop dispossessing My people, declares the Lord GOD.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_10","027_45_10","EZK","45","10","10","You must use honest scales, a just ephah, and a just bath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_11","027_45_11","EZK","45","11","11","The ephah and the bath shall be the same quantity so that the bath will contain a tenth of a homer, and the ephah a tenth of a homer; the homer will be the standard measure for both. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_12","027_45_12","EZK","45","12","12","The shekel will consist of twenty gerahs. Twenty shekels plus twenty-five shekels plus fifteen shekels will equal one mina. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_13","027_45_13","EZK","45","13","13","This is the contribution you are to offer: a sixth of an ephah from each homer of wheat, and a sixth of an ephah from each homer of barley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_14","027_45_14","EZK","45","14","14","The prescribed portion of oil, measured by the bath, is a tenth of a bath from each cor (a cor consists of ten baths or one homer, since ten baths are equivalent to a homer). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_15","027_45_15","EZK","45","15","15","And one sheep shall be given from each flock of two hundred from the well-watered pastures of Israel. These are for the grain offerings, burnt offerings, and peace offerings, to make atonement for the people, declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_16","027_45_16","EZK","45","16","16","All the people of the land must participate in this contribution for the prince in Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_17","027_45_17","EZK","45","17","17","And it shall be the prince’s part to provide the burnt offerings, grain offerings, and drink offerings for the feasts, New Moons, and Sabbaths—for all the appointed feasts of the house of Israel. He will provide the sin offerings, grain offerings, burnt offerings, and peace offerings to make atonement for the house of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_18","027_45_18","EZK","45","18","18","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘On the first day of the first month you are to take a young bull without blemish and purify the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_19","027_45_19","EZK","45","19","19","And the priest is to take some of the blood from the sin offering and put it on the doorposts of the temple, on the four corners of the ledge of the altar, and on the gateposts of the inner court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_20","027_45_20","EZK","45","20","20","You must do the same thing on the seventh day of the month for anyone who strays unintentionally or in ignorance. In this way you will make atonement for the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_21","027_45_21","EZK","45","21","21","On the fourteenth day of the first month you are to observe the Passover, a feast of seven days, during which unleavened bread shall be eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_22","027_45_22","EZK","45","22","22","On that day the prince shall provide a bull as a sin offering for himself and for all the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_23","027_45_23","EZK","45","23","23","Each day during the seven days of the feast, he shall provide seven bulls and seven rams without blemish as a burnt offering to the LORD, along with a male goat for a sin offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_24","027_45_24","EZK","45","24","24","He shall also provide as a grain offering an ephah for each bull and an ephah for each ram, along with a hin of olive oil for each ephah of grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK45_25","027_45_25","EZK","45","25","25","During the seven days of the feast that begins on the fifteenth day of the seventh month, he is to make the same provision for sin offerings, burnt offerings, grain offerings, and oil.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_1","027_46_1","EZK","46","1","1","“This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘The gate of the inner court that faces east must be kept shut during the six days of work, but on the Sabbath day and on the day of the New Moon it shall be opened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_2","027_46_2","EZK","46","2","2","The prince is to enter from the outside through the portico of the gateway and stand by the gatepost, while the priests sacrifice his burnt offerings and peace offerings. He is to bow in worship at the threshold of the gate and then depart, but the gate must not be shut until evening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_3","027_46_3","EZK","46","3","3","On the Sabbaths and New Moons the people of the land are also to bow in worship before the LORD at the entrance to that gateway. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_4","027_46_4","EZK","46","4","4","The burnt offering that the prince presents to the LORD on the Sabbath day shall be six unblemished male lambs and an unblemished ram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_5","027_46_5","EZK","46","5","5","The grain offering with the ram shall be one ephah, and the grain offering with the lambs shall be as much as he is able, along with a hin of oil per ephah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_6","027_46_6","EZK","46","6","6","On the day of the New Moon he shall offer a young, unblemished bull, six lambs, and a ram without blemish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_7","027_46_7","EZK","46","7","7","He is to provide a grain offering of an ephah with the bull, an ephah with the ram, and as much as he is able with the lambs, along with a hin of oil per ephah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_8","027_46_8","EZK","46","8","8","When the prince enters, he shall go in through the portico of the gateway, and he shall go out the same way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_9","027_46_9","EZK","46","9","9","When the people of the land come before the LORD at the appointed feasts, whoever enters by the north gate to worship must go out by the south gate, and whoever enters by the south gate must go out by the north gate. No one is to return through the gate by which he entered, but each must go out by the opposite gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_10","027_46_10","EZK","46","10","10","When the people enter, the prince shall go in with them, and when they leave, he shall leave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_11","027_46_11","EZK","46","11","11","At the festivals and appointed feasts, the grain offering shall be an ephah with a bull, an ephah with a ram, and as much as one is able to give with the lambs, along with a hin of oil per ephah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_12","027_46_12","EZK","46","12","12","When the prince makes a freewill offering to the LORD, whether a burnt offering or a peace offering, the gate facing east must be opened for him. He is to offer his burnt offering or peace offering just as he does on the Sabbath day. Then he shall go out, and the gate must be closed after he goes out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_13","027_46_13","EZK","46","13","13","And you shall provide an unblemished year-old lamb as a daily burnt offering to the LORD; you are to offer it every morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_14","027_46_14","EZK","46","14","14","You are also to provide with it every morning a grain offering of a sixth of an ephah with a third of a hin of oil to moisten the fine flour—a grain offering to the LORD. This is a permanent statute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_15","027_46_15","EZK","46","15","15","Thus they shall provide the lamb, the grain offering, and the oil every morning as a regular burnt offering.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_16","027_46_16","EZK","46","16","16","This is what the Lord GOD says: ‘If the prince gives a gift to any of his sons as an inheritance, it will belong to his descendants. It will become their property by inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_17","027_46_17","EZK","46","17","17","But if he gives a gift from his inheritance to one of his servants, it will belong to that servant until the year of freedom; then it will revert to the prince. His inheritance belongs only to his sons; it shall be theirs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_18","027_46_18","EZK","46","18","18","The prince must not take any of the inheritance of the people by evicting them from their property. He is to provide an inheritance for his sons from his own property, so that none of My people will be displaced from his property.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_19","027_46_19","EZK","46","19","19","Then the man brought me through the entrance at the side of the gate into the holy chambers facing north, which belonged to the priests, and he showed me a place there at the far western end ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_20","027_46_20","EZK","46","20","20","and said to me, “This is the place where the priests shall boil the guilt offering and the sin offering, and where they shall bake the grain offering, so that they do not bring them into the outer court and transmit holiness to the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_21","027_46_21","EZK","46","21","21","Then he brought me into the outer court and led me around to its four corners, and I saw a separate court in each of its corners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_22","027_46_22","EZK","46","22","22","In the four corners of the outer court there were enclosed courts, each forty cubits long and thirty cubits wide. Each of the four corner areas had the same dimensions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_23","027_46_23","EZK","46","23","23","Around the inside of each of the four courts was a row of masonry with ovens built at the base of the walls on all sides. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK46_24","027_46_24","EZK","46","24","24","And he said to me, “These are the kitchens where those who minister at the temple will cook the sacrifices offered by the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_1","027_47_1","EZK","47","1","1","Then the man brought me back to the entrance of the temple, and I saw water flowing from under the threshold of the temple toward the east (for the temple faced east). The water was coming down from under the south side of the temple, south of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_2","027_47_2","EZK","47","2","2","Next he brought me out through the north gate and led me around the outside to the outer gate facing east, and there I saw the water trickling out from the south side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_3","027_47_3","EZK","47","3","3","As the man went eastward with a measuring line in his hand, he measured off a thousand cubits and led me through ankle-deep water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_4","027_47_4","EZK","47","4","4","Then he measured off a thousand cubits and led me through knee-deep water. Again he measured a thousand cubits and led me through waist-deep water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_5","027_47_5","EZK","47","5","5","Once again he measured off a thousand cubits, but now it was a river that I could not cross, because the water had risen and was deep enough for swimming—a river that could not be crossed on foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_6","027_47_6","EZK","47","6","6","“Son of man, do you see this?” he asked. Then he led me back to the bank of the river. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_7","027_47_7","EZK","47","7","7","When I arrived, I saw a great number of trees along both banks of the river. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_8","027_47_8","EZK","47","8","8","And he said to me, “This water flows out to the eastern region and goes down into the Arabah. When it empties into the Dead Sea, the water there becomes fresh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_9","027_47_9","EZK","47","9","9","Wherever the river flows, there will be swarms of living creatures and a great number of fish, because it flows there and makes the waters fresh; so wherever the river flows, everything will flourish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_10","027_47_10","EZK","47","10","10","Fishermen will stand by the shore; from En-gedi to En-eglaim they will spread their nets to catch fish of many kinds, like the fish of the Great Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_11","027_47_11","EZK","47","11","11","But the swamps and marshes will not become fresh; they will be left for salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_12","027_47_12","EZK","47","12","12","Along both banks of the river, fruit trees of all kinds will grow. Their leaves will not wither, and their fruit will not fail. Each month they will bear fruit, because the water from the sanctuary flows to them. Their fruit will be used for food and their leaves for healing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_13","027_47_13","EZK","47","13","13","This is what the Lord GOD says: “These are the boundaries by which you are to divide the land as an inheritance among the twelve tribes of Israel; Joseph shall receive two portions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_14","027_47_14","EZK","47","14","14","You are to divide it equally among them. Because I swore with an uplifted hand to give it to your forefathers, this land will fall to you as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_15","027_47_15","EZK","47","15","15","This shall be the boundary of the land: On the north side it will extend from the Great Sea by way of Hethlon through Lebo-hamath to Zedad, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_16","027_47_16","EZK","47","16","16","Berothah, and Sibraim (which is on the border between Damascus and Hamath), as far as Hazer-hatticon, which is on the border of Hauran. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_17","027_47_17","EZK","47","17","17","So the border will run from the Sea to Hazar-enan, along the northern border of Damascus, with the territory of Hamath to the north. This will be the northern boundary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_18","027_47_18","EZK","47","18","18","On the east side the border will run between Hauran and Damascus, along the Jordan between Gilead and the land of Israel, to the Eastern Sea and as far as Tamar. This will be the eastern boundary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_19","027_47_19","EZK","47","19","19","On the south side it will run from Tamar to the waters of Meribath-kadesh, and along the Brook of Egypt to the Great Sea. This will be the southern boundary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_20","027_47_20","EZK","47","20","20","And on the west side, the Great Sea will be the boundary up to a point opposite Lebo-hamath. This will be the western boundary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_21","027_47_21","EZK","47","21","21","You are to divide this land among yourselves according to the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_22","027_47_22","EZK","47","22","22","You shall allot it as an inheritance for yourselves and for the foreigners who dwell among you and who have children. You are to treat them as native-born Israelites; along with you, they shall be allotted an inheritance among the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK47_23","027_47_23","EZK","47","23","23","In whatever tribe a foreigner dwells, you are to assign his inheritance there,” declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_1","027_48_1","EZK","48","1","1","“Now these are the names of the tribes: At the northern frontier, Dan will have one portion bordering the road of Hethlon to Lebo-hamath and running on to Hazar-enan on the border of Damascus with Hamath to the north, and extending from the east side to the west side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_2","027_48_2","EZK","48","2","2","Asher will have one portion bordering the territory of Dan from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_3","027_48_3","EZK","48","3","3","Naphtali will have one portion bordering the territory of Asher from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_4","027_48_4","EZK","48","4","4","Manasseh will have one portion bordering the territory of Naphtali from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_5","027_48_5","EZK","48","5","5","Ephraim will have one portion bordering the territory of Manasseh from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_6","027_48_6","EZK","48","6","6","Reuben will have one portion bordering the territory of Ephraim from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_7","027_48_7","EZK","48","7","7","Judah will have one portion bordering the territory of Reuben from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_8","027_48_8","EZK","48","8","8","Bordering the territory of Judah, from east to west, will be the portion you are to set apart. It will be 25,000 cubits wide, and the length of a tribal portion from east to west. In the center will be the sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_9","027_48_9","EZK","48","9","9","The special portion you set apart to the LORD shall be 25,000 cubits long and 10,000 cubits wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_10","027_48_10","EZK","48","10","10","This will be the holy portion for the priests. It will be 25,000 cubits long on the north side, 10,000 cubits wide on the west side, 10,000 cubits wide on the east side, and 25,000 cubits long on the south side. In the center will be the sanctuary of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_11","027_48_11","EZK","48","11","11","It will be for the consecrated priests, the descendants of Zadok, who kept My charge and did not go astray as the Levites did when the Israelites went astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_12","027_48_12","EZK","48","12","12","It will be a special portion for them set apart from the land, a most holy portion adjacent to the territory of the Levites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_13","027_48_13","EZK","48","13","13","Bordering the territory of the priests, the Levites shall have an area 25,000 cubits long and 10,000 cubits wide. The whole length will be 25,000 cubits, and the width 10,000 cubits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_14","027_48_14","EZK","48","14","14","They must not sell or exchange any of it, and they must not transfer this best part of the land, for it is holy to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_15","027_48_15","EZK","48","15","15","The remaining area, 5,000 cubits wide and 25,000 cubits long, will be for common use by the city, for houses, and for pastureland. The city will be in the center of it ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_16","027_48_16","EZK","48","16","16","and will have these measurements: 4,500 cubits on the north side, 4,500 cubits on the south side, 4,500 cubits on the east side, and 4,500 cubits on the west side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_17","027_48_17","EZK","48","17","17","The pastureland of the city will extend 250 cubits to the north, 250 cubits to the south, 250 cubits to the east, and 250 cubits to the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_18","027_48_18","EZK","48","18","18","The remainder of the length bordering the holy portion and running adjacent to it will be 10,000 cubits on the east side and 10,000 cubits on the west side. Its produce will supply food for the workers of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_19","027_48_19","EZK","48","19","19","The workers of the city who cultivate it will come from all the tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_20","027_48_20","EZK","48","20","20","The entire portion will be a square, 25,000 cubits by 25,000 cubits. You are to set apart the holy portion, along with the city property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_21","027_48_21","EZK","48","21","21","The remaining area on both sides of the holy portion and of the property of the city will belong to the prince. He will own the land adjacent to the tribal portions, extending eastward from the 25,000 cubits of the holy district toward the eastern border, and westward from the 25,000 cubits to the western border. And in the center of them will be the holy portion and the sanctuary of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_22","027_48_22","EZK","48","22","22","So the Levitical property and the city property will lie in the center of the area belonging to the prince—the area between the borders of Judah and Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_23","027_48_23","EZK","48","23","23","As for the rest of the tribes: Benjamin will have one portion extending from the east side to the west side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_24","027_48_24","EZK","48","24","24","Simeon will have one portion bordering the territory of Benjamin from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_25","027_48_25","EZK","48","25","25","Issachar will have one portion bordering the territory of Simeon from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_26","027_48_26","EZK","48","26","26","Zebulun will have one portion bordering the territory of Issachar from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_27","027_48_27","EZK","48","27","27","And Gad will have one portion bordering the territory of Zebulun from east to west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_28","027_48_28","EZK","48","28","28","The southern border of Gad will run from Tamar to the waters of Meribath-kadesh, then along the Brook of Egypt and out to the Great Sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_29","027_48_29","EZK","48","29","29","This is the land you are to allot as an inheritance to the tribes of Israel, and these will be their portions,” declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_30","027_48_30","EZK","48","30","30","“These will be the exits of the city: Beginning on the north side, which will be 4,500 cubits long, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_31","027_48_31","EZK","48","31","31","the gates of the city will be named after the tribes of Israel. On the north side there will be three gates: the gate of Reuben, the gate of Judah, and the gate of Levi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_32","027_48_32","EZK","48","32","32","On the east side, which will be 4,500 cubits long, there will be three gates: the gate of Joseph, the gate of Benjamin, and the gate of Dan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_33","027_48_33","EZK","48","33","33","On the south side, which will be 4,500 cubits long, there will be three gates: the gate of Simeon, the gate of Issachar, and the gate of Zebulun. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_34","027_48_34","EZK","48","34","34","And on the west side, which will be 4,500 cubits long, there will be three gates: the gate of Gad, the gate of Asher, and the gate of Naphtali. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EK48_35","027_48_35","EZK","48","35","35","The perimeter of the city will be 18,000 cubits, and from that day on the name of the city will be: THE LORD IS THERE.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_1","028_1_1","DAN","1","1","1","In the third year of the reign of Jehoiakim king of Judah, Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon came to Jerusalem and besieged it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_2","028_1_2","DAN","1","2","2","And the Lord delivered into his hand Jehoiakim king of Judah, along with some of the articles from the house of God. He carried these off to the land of Shinar, to the house of his god, where he put them in the treasury of his god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_3","028_1_3","DAN","1","3","3","Then the king ordered Ashpenaz, the chief of his court officials, to bring in some Israelites from the royal family and the nobility— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_4","028_1_4","DAN","1","4","4","young men without blemish, handsome, gifted in all wisdom, knowledgeable, quick to understand, and qualified to serve in the king’s palace—and to teach them the language and literature of the Chaldeans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_5","028_1_5","DAN","1","5","5","The king assigned them daily provisions of the royal food and wine. They were to be trained for three years, after which they were to enter the king’s service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_6","028_1_6","DAN","1","6","6","Among these young men were some from Judah: Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_7","028_1_7","DAN","1","7","7","The chief official gave them new names: To Daniel he gave the name Belteshazzar; to Hananiah, Shadrach; to Mishael, Meshach; and to Azariah, Abednego. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_8","028_1_8","DAN","1","8","8","But Daniel made up his mind that he would not defile himself with the king’s food or wine. So he asked the chief official for permission not to defile himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_9","028_1_9","DAN","1","9","9","Now God had granted Daniel favor and compassion from the chief official, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_10","028_1_10","DAN","1","10","10","but he said to Daniel, “I fear my lord the king, who has assigned your food and drink. For why should he see your faces looking thinner than those of the other young men your age? You would endanger my head before the king!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_11","028_1_11","DAN","1","11","11","Then Daniel said to the steward whom the chief official had appointed over Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_12","028_1_12","DAN","1","12","12","“Please test your servants for ten days. Let us be given only vegetables to eat and water to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_13","028_1_13","DAN","1","13","13","Then compare our appearances with those of the young men who are eating the royal food, and deal with your servants according to what you see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_14","028_1_14","DAN","1","14","14","So he consented to this and tested them for ten days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_15","028_1_15","DAN","1","15","15","And at the end of ten days, they looked healthier and better nourished than all the young men who were eating the king’s food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_16","028_1_16","DAN","1","16","16","So the steward continued to withhold their choice food and the wine they were to drink, and he gave them vegetables instead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_17","028_1_17","DAN","1","17","17","To these four young men God gave knowledge and understanding in every kind of literature and wisdom. And Daniel had insight into all kinds of visions and dreams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_18","028_1_18","DAN","1","18","18","Now at the end of the time specified by the king, the chief official presented them to Nebuchadnezzar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_19","028_1_19","DAN","1","19","19","And the king spoke with them, and among all the young men he found no one equal to Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah. So they entered the king’s service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_20","028_1_20","DAN","1","20","20","In every matter of wisdom and understanding about which the king consulted them, he found them ten times better than all the magicians and enchanters in his entire kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN1_21","028_1_21","DAN","1","21","21","And Daniel remained there until the first year of King Cyrus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_1","028_2_1","DAN","2","1","1","In the second year of his reign, Nebuchadnezzar had dreams that troubled his spirit, and sleep escaped him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_2","028_2_2","DAN","2","2","2","So the king gave orders to summon the magicians, enchanters, sorcerers, and astrologers to explain his dreams. When they came and stood before the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_3","028_2_3","DAN","2","3","3","he said to them, “I have had a dream, and my spirit is anxious to understand it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_4","028_2_4","DAN","2","4","4","Then the astrologers answered the king in Aramaic, “O king, may you live forever! Tell your servants the dream, and we will give the interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_5","028_2_5","DAN","2","5","5","The king replied to the astrologers, “My word is final: If you do not tell me the dream and its interpretation, you will be cut into pieces and your houses will be reduced to rubble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_6","028_2_6","DAN","2","6","6","But if you tell me the dream and its interpretation, you will receive from me gifts and rewards and great honor. So tell me the dream and its interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_7","028_2_7","DAN","2","7","7","They answered a second time, “Let the king tell the dream to his servants, and we will give the interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_8","028_2_8","DAN","2","8","8","The king replied, “I know for sure that you are stalling for time because you see that my word is final. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_9","028_2_9","DAN","2","9","9","If you do not tell me the dream, there is only one decree for you. You have conspired to speak before me false and fraudulent words, hoping the situation will change. Therefore tell me the dream, and I will know that you can give me its interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_10","028_2_10","DAN","2","10","10","The astrologers answered the king, “No one on earth can do what the king requests! No king, however great and powerful, has ever asked anything like this of any magician, enchanter, or astrologer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_11","028_2_11","DAN","2","11","11","What the king requests is so difficult that no one can tell it to him except the gods, whose dwelling is not with mortals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_12","028_2_12","DAN","2","12","12","This response made the king so angry and furious that he gave orders to destroy all the wise men of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_13","028_2_13","DAN","2","13","13","So the decree went out that the wise men were to be executed, and men went to look for Daniel and his friends to execute them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_14","028_2_14","DAN","2","14","14","When Arioch, the commander of the king’s guard, went out to execute the wise men of Babylon, Daniel responded with discretion and tact. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_15","028_2_15","DAN","2","15","15","“Why is the decree from the king so harsh?” he asked. Then Arioch explained the situation to Daniel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_16","028_2_16","DAN","2","16","16","So Daniel went in and asked the king to give him some time, so that he could give him the interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_17","028_2_17","DAN","2","17","17","Then Daniel returned to his house and explained the matter to his friends Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_18","028_2_18","DAN","2","18","18","urging them to plead for mercy from the God of heaven concerning this mystery, so that Daniel and his friends would not be killed with the rest of the wise men of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_19","028_2_19","DAN","2","19","19","During the night, the mystery was revealed to Daniel in a vision, and he blessed the God of heaven ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_20","028_2_20","DAN","2","20","20","and declared: “Blessed be the name of God forever and ever, for wisdom and power belong to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_21","028_2_21","DAN","2","21","21","He changes the times and seasons; He removes kings and establishes them. He gives wisdom to the wise and knowledge to the discerning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_22","028_2_22","DAN","2","22","22","He reveals the deep and hidden things; He knows what lies in darkness, and light dwells with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_23","028_2_23","DAN","2","23","23","To You, O God of my fathers, I give thanks and praise, because You have given me wisdom and power. And now You have made known to me what we have requested, for You have made known to us the dream of the king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_24","028_2_24","DAN","2","24","24","Therefore Daniel went to Arioch, whom the king had appointed to destroy the wise men of Babylon, and said to him, “Do not execute the wise men of Babylon! Bring me before the king, and I will give him the interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_25","028_2_25","DAN","2","25","25","Arioch hastily brought Daniel before the king and said to him, “I have found a man among the exiles from Judah who will tell the king the interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_26","028_2_26","DAN","2","26","26","The king responded to Daniel, whose name was Belteshazzar, “Are you able to tell me what I saw in the dream, as well as its interpretation?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_27","028_2_27","DAN","2","27","27","Daniel answered the king, “No wise man, enchanter, medium, or magician can explain to the king the mystery of which he inquires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_28","028_2_28","DAN","2","28","28","But there is a God in heaven who reveals mysteries, and He has made known to King Nebuchadnezzar what will happen in the latter days. Your dream and the visions that came into your mind as you lay on your bed were these: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_29","028_2_29","DAN","2","29","29","As you lay on your bed, O king, your thoughts turned to the future, and the Revealer of Mysteries made known to you what will happen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_30","028_2_30","DAN","2","30","30","And to me this mystery has been revealed, not because I have more wisdom than any man alive, but in order that the interpretation might be made known to the king, and that you may understand the thoughts of your mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_31","028_2_31","DAN","2","31","31","As you, O king, were watching, a great statue appeared. A great and dazzling statue stood before you, and its form was awesome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_32","028_2_32","DAN","2","32","32","The head of the statue was pure gold, its chest and arms were silver, its belly and thighs were bronze, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_33","028_2_33","DAN","2","33","33","its legs were iron, and its feet were part iron and part clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_34","028_2_34","DAN","2","34","34","As you watched, a stone was cut out, but not by human hands. It struck the statue on its feet of iron and clay, and crushed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_35","028_2_35","DAN","2","35","35","Then the iron, clay, bronze, silver, and gold were shattered and became like chaff on the threshing floor in summer. The wind carried them away, and not a trace of them could be found. But the stone that had struck the statue became a great mountain and filled the whole earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_36","028_2_36","DAN","2","36","36","This was the dream; now we will tell the king its interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_37","028_2_37","DAN","2","37","37","You, O king, are the king of kings, to whom the God of heaven has given sovereignty, power, strength, and glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_38","028_2_38","DAN","2","38","38","Wherever the sons of men or beasts of the field or birds of the air dwell, He has given them into your hand and has made you ruler over them all. You are that head of gold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_39","028_2_39","DAN","2","39","39","But after you, there will arise another kingdom, inferior to yours. Next, a third kingdom, one of bronze, will rule the whole earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_40","028_2_40","DAN","2","40","40","Finally, there will be a fourth kingdom as strong as iron; for iron shatters and crushes all things, and like iron that crushes all things, it will shatter and crush all the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_41","028_2_41","DAN","2","41","41","And just as you saw that the feet and toes were made partly of fired clay and partly of iron, so this will be a divided kingdom, yet some of the strength of iron will be in it—just as you saw the iron mixed with clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_42","028_2_42","DAN","2","42","42","And as the toes of the feet were partly iron and partly clay, so this kingdom will be partly strong and partly brittle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_43","028_2_43","DAN","2","43","43","As you saw the iron mixed with clay, so the peoples will mix with one another but will not hold together any more than iron mixes with clay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_44","028_2_44","DAN","2","44","44","In the days of those kings, the God of heaven will set up a kingdom that will never be destroyed, nor will it be left to another people. It will shatter all these kingdoms and bring them to an end, but will itself stand forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_45","028_2_45","DAN","2","45","45","And just as you saw a stone being cut out of the mountain without human hands, and it shattered the iron, bronze, clay, silver, and gold, so the great God has told the king what will happen in the future. The dream is true, and its interpretation is trustworthy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_46","028_2_46","DAN","2","46","46","At this, King Nebuchadnezzar fell on his face, paid homage to Daniel, and ordered that an offering and incense be presented to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_47","028_2_47","DAN","2","47","47","The king said to Daniel, “Your God is truly the God of gods and Lord of kings, the Revealer of Mysteries, since you were able to reveal this mystery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_48","028_2_48","DAN","2","48","48","Then the king promoted Daniel and gave him many generous gifts. He made him ruler over the entire province of Babylon and chief administrator over all the wise men of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN2_49","028_2_49","DAN","2","49","49","And at Daniel’s request, the king appointed Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego to manage the province of Babylon, while Daniel remained in the king’s court. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_1","028_3_1","DAN","3","1","1","King Nebuchadnezzar made a golden statue sixty cubits high and six cubits wide, and he set it up on the plain of Dura in the province of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_2","028_3_2","DAN","3","2","2","Then King Nebuchadnezzar sent word to assemble the satraps, prefects, governors, advisers, treasurers, judges, magistrates, and all the other officials of the provinces to attend the dedication of the statue he had set up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_3","028_3_3","DAN","3","3","3","So the satraps, prefects, governors, advisers, treasurers, judges, magistrates, and all the rulers of the provinces assembled for the dedication of the statue that King Nebuchadnezzar had set up, and they stood before it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_4","028_3_4","DAN","3","4","4","Then the herald loudly proclaimed, “O people of every nation and language, this is what you are commanded: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_5","028_3_5","DAN","3","5","5","As soon as you hear the sound of the horn, flute, zither, lyre, harp, pipes, and all kinds of music, you must fall down and worship the golden statue that King Nebuchadnezzar has set up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_6","028_3_6","DAN","3","6","6","And whoever does not fall down and worship will immediately be thrown into the blazing fiery furnace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_7","028_3_7","DAN","3","7","7","Therefore, as soon as all the people heard the sound of the horn, flute, zither, lyre, harp, and all kinds of music, the people of every nation and language would fall down and worship the golden statue that King Nebuchadnezzar had set up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_8","028_3_8","DAN","3","8","8","At this time some astrologers came forward and maliciously accused the Jews, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_9","028_3_9","DAN","3","9","9","saying to King Nebuchadnezzar, “O king, may you live forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_10","028_3_10","DAN","3","10","10","You, O king, have issued a decree that everyone who hears the sound of the horn, flute, zither, lyre, harp, pipes, and all kinds of music must fall down and worship the golden statue, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_11","028_3_11","DAN","3","11","11","and that whoever does not fall down and worship will be thrown into the blazing fiery furnace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_12","028_3_12","DAN","3","12","12","But there are some Jews you have appointed to manage the province of Babylon—Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego—who have ignored you, O king, and have refused to serve your gods or worship the golden statue you have set up.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_13","028_3_13","DAN","3","13","13","Then Nebuchadnezzar, furious with rage, summoned Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego. So these men were brought before the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_14","028_3_14","DAN","3","14","14","and Nebuchadnezzar said to them, “Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego, is it true that you do not serve my gods or worship the golden statue I have set up? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_15","028_3_15","DAN","3","15","15","Now when you hear the sound of the horn, flute, zither, lyre, harp, pipes, and all kinds of music, if you are ready to fall down and worship the statue I have made, very good. But if you refuse to worship, you will be thrown at once into the blazing fiery furnace. Then what god will be able to deliver you from my hands?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_16","028_3_16","DAN","3","16","16","Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego replied to the king, “O Nebuchadnezzar, we have no need to answer you in this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_17","028_3_17","DAN","3","17","17","If the God whom we serve exists, then He is able to deliver us from the blazing fiery furnace and from your hand, O king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_18","028_3_18","DAN","3","18","18","But even if He does not, let it be known to you, O king, that we will not serve your gods or worship the golden statue you have set up.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_19","028_3_19","DAN","3","19","19","At this, Nebuchadnezzar was filled with rage, and the expression on his face changed toward Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego. He gave orders to heat the furnace seven times hotter than usual, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_20","028_3_20","DAN","3","20","20","and he commanded some mighty men of valor in his army to tie up Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego and throw them into the blazing fiery furnace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_21","028_3_21","DAN","3","21","21","So they were tied up, wearing robes, trousers, turbans, and other clothes, and they were thrown into the blazing fiery furnace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_22","028_3_22","DAN","3","22","22","The king’s command was so urgent and the furnace so hot that the fiery flames killed the men who carried up Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_23","028_3_23","DAN","3","23","23","And these three men, Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego, firmly bound, fell into the blazing fiery furnace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_24","028_3_24","DAN","3","24","24","Suddenly King Nebuchadnezzar jumped up in amazement and asked his advisers, “Did we not throw three men, firmly bound, into the fire?” “Certainly, O king,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_25","028_3_25","DAN","3","25","25","“Look!” he exclaimed. “I see four men, unbound and unharmed, walking around in the fire—and the fourth looks like a son of the gods!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_26","028_3_26","DAN","3","26","26","Then Nebuchadnezzar approached the door of the blazing fiery furnace and called out, “Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego, servants of the Most High God, come out!” So Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego came out of the fire, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_27","028_3_27","DAN","3","27","27","and when the satraps, prefects, governors, and royal advisers had gathered around, they saw that the fire had no effect on the bodies of these men. Not a hair of their heads was singed, their robes were unaffected, and there was no smell of fire on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_28","028_3_28","DAN","3","28","28","Nebuchadnezzar declared, “Blessed be the God of Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego, who has sent His angel and delivered His servants who trusted in Him. They violated the king’s command and risked their lives rather than serve or worship any god except their own God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_29","028_3_29","DAN","3","29","29","Therefore I decree that the people of any nation or language who say anything offensive against the God of Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego will be cut into pieces and their houses reduced to rubble. For there is no other god who can deliver in this way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN3_30","028_3_30","DAN","3","30","30","Then the king promoted Shadrach, Meshach, and Abednego in the province of Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_1","028_4_1","DAN","4","1","1","King Nebuchadnezzar, To the people of every nation and language who dwell in all the earth: May your prosperity be multiplied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_2","028_4_2","DAN","4","2","2","I am pleased to declare the signs and wonders that the Most High God has performed for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_3","028_4_3","DAN","4","3","3","How great are His signs, how mighty His wonders! His kingdom is an eternal kingdom; His dominion endures from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_4","028_4_4","DAN","4","4","4","I, Nebuchadnezzar, was at ease in my house and flourishing in my palace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_5","028_4_5","DAN","4","5","5","I had a dream, and it frightened me; while I was in my bed, the images and visions in my mind alarmed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_6","028_4_6","DAN","4","6","6","So I issued a decree that all the wise men of Babylon be brought before me to interpret the dream for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_7","028_4_7","DAN","4","7","7","When the magicians, enchanters, astrologers, and diviners came in, I told them the dream, but they could not interpret it for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_8","028_4_8","DAN","4","8","8","But at last, into my presence came Daniel (whose name is Belteshazzar after the name of my god, and in whom is the spirit of the holy gods). And I told him the dream: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_9","028_4_9","DAN","4","9","9","“O Belteshazzar, chief of the magicians, I know that the spirit of the holy gods is in you and that no mystery baffles you. So explain to me the visions I saw in my dream, and their interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_10","028_4_10","DAN","4","10","10","In these visions of my mind as I was lying in bed, I saw this come to pass: There was a tree in the midst of the land, and its height was great. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_11","028_4_11","DAN","4","11","11","The tree grew large and strong; its top reached the sky, and it was visible to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_12","028_4_12","DAN","4","12","12","Its leaves were beautiful, its fruit was abundant, and upon it was food for all. Under it the beasts of the field found shelter, in its branches the birds of the air nested, and from it every creature was fed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_13","028_4_13","DAN","4","13","13","As I lay on my bed, I also saw in the visions of my mind a watcher, a holy one, coming down from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_14","028_4_14","DAN","4","14","14","He called out in a loud voice: ‘Cut down the tree and chop off its branches; strip off its leaves and scatter its fruit. Let the beasts flee from under it, and the birds from its branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_15","028_4_15","DAN","4","15","15","But leave the stump with its roots in the ground, with a band of iron and bronze around it, in the tender grass of the field. Let him be drenched with the dew of heaven and graze with the beasts on the grass of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_16","028_4_16","DAN","4","16","16","Let his mind be changed from that of a man, and let him be given the mind of a beast till seven times pass him by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_17","028_4_17","DAN","4","17","17","This decision is the decree of the watchers, the verdict declared by the holy ones, so that the living will know that the Most High rules over the kingdom of mankind and gives it to whom He wishes, setting over it the lowliest of men.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_18","028_4_18","DAN","4","18","18","This is the dream that I, King Nebuchadnezzar, saw. Now, Belteshazzar, tell me the interpretation, because none of the wise men of my kingdom can interpret it for me. But you are able, because the spirit of the holy gods is in you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_19","028_4_19","DAN","4","19","19","For a time, Daniel, who was also known as Belteshazzar, was perplexed, and his thoughts alarmed him. So the king said, “Belteshazzar, do not let the dream or its interpretation alarm you.” “My lord,” replied Belteshazzar, “may the dream apply to those who hate you, and its interpretation to your enemies! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_20","028_4_20","DAN","4","20","20","The tree you saw that grew large and strong, whose top reached the sky and was visible to all the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_21","028_4_21","DAN","4","21","21","whose foliage was beautiful and whose fruit was abundant, providing food for all, under which the beasts of the field lived, and in whose branches the birds of the air nested— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_22","028_4_22","DAN","4","22","22","you, O king, are that tree! For you have become great and strong; your greatness has grown to reach the sky, and your dominion extends to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_23","028_4_23","DAN","4","23","23","And you, O king, saw a watcher, a holy one, coming down from heaven and saying: ‘Cut down the tree and destroy it, but leave the stump with its roots in the ground, with a band of iron and bronze around it, in the tender grass of the field. Let him be drenched with the dew of heaven, and graze with the beasts of the field till seven times pass him by.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_24","028_4_24","DAN","4","24","24","This is the interpretation, O king, and this is the decree that the Most High has issued against my lord the king: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_25","028_4_25","DAN","4","25","25","You will be driven away from mankind, and your dwelling will be with the beasts of the field. You will feed on grass like an ox and be drenched with the dew of heaven, and seven times shall pass you by, until you acknowledge that the Most High rules over the kingdom of mankind and gives it to whom He wishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_26","028_4_26","DAN","4","26","26","As for the command to leave the stump of the tree with its roots, your kingdom will be restored to you as soon as you acknowledge that Heaven rules. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_27","028_4_27","DAN","4","27","27","Therefore, may my advice be pleasing to you, O king. Break away from your sins by doing what is right, and from your iniquities by showing mercy to the oppressed. Perhaps there will be an extension of your prosperity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_28","028_4_28","DAN","4","28","28","All this happened to King Nebuchadnezzar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_29","028_4_29","DAN","4","29","29","Twelve months later, as he was walking on the roof of the royal palace of Babylon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_30","028_4_30","DAN","4","30","30","the king exclaimed, “Is this not Babylon the Great, which I myself have built as a royal residence by the might of my power and for the glory of my majesty?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_31","028_4_31","DAN","4","31","31","While the words were still in the king’s mouth, a voice came from heaven: “It is decreed to you, King Nebuchadnezzar, that the kingdom has departed from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_32","028_4_32","DAN","4","32","32","You will be driven away from mankind to live with the beasts of the field, and you will feed on grass like an ox. And seven times will pass you by, until you acknowledge that the Most High rules over the kingdom of mankind and gives it to whom He wishes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_33","028_4_33","DAN","4","33","33","At that moment the sentence against Nebuchadnezzar was fulfilled. He was driven away from mankind. He ate grass like an ox, and his body was drenched with the dew of heaven, until his hair grew like the feathers of an eagle and his nails like the claws of a bird. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_34","028_4_34","DAN","4","34","34","But at the end of those days I, Nebuchadnezzar, looked up to heaven, and my sanity was restored to me. Then I praised the Most High, and I honored and glorified Him who lives forever: “For His dominion is an everlasting dominion, and His kingdom endures from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_35","028_4_35","DAN","4","35","35","All the peoples of the earth are counted as nothing, and He does as He pleases with the army of heaven and the peoples of the earth. There is no one who can restrain His hand or say to Him, ‘What have You done?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_36","028_4_36","DAN","4","36","36","At the same time my sanity was restored, my honor and splendor returned to me for the glory of my kingdom. My advisers and nobles sought me out, and I was restored to my throne, and surpassing greatness was added to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN4_37","028_4_37","DAN","4","37","37","Now I, Nebuchadnezzar, praise and exalt and glorify the King of heaven, for all His works are true and all His ways are just. And He is able to humble those who walk in pride. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_1","028_5_1","DAN","5","1","1","Later, King Belshazzar held a great feast for a thousand of his nobles, and he drank wine with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_2","028_5_2","DAN","5","2","2","Under the influence of the wine, Belshazzar gave orders to bring in the gold and silver vessels that Nebuchadnezzar his father had taken from the temple in Jerusalem, so that the king could drink from them, along with his nobles, his wives, and his concubines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_3","028_5_3","DAN","5","3","3","Thus they brought in the gold vessels that had been taken from the temple, the house of God in Jerusalem, and the king drank from them, along with his nobles, his wives, and his concubines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_4","028_5_4","DAN","5","4","4","As they drank the wine, they praised their gods of gold and silver, bronze and iron, wood and stone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_5","028_5_5","DAN","5","5","5","At that moment the fingers of a human hand appeared and wrote on the plaster of the wall, near the lampstand in the royal palace. As the king watched the hand that was writing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_6","028_5_6","DAN","5","6","6","his face grew pale and his thoughts so alarmed him that his hips gave way and his knees knocked together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_7","028_5_7","DAN","5","7","7","The king called out for the enchanters, astrologers, and diviners to be brought in, and he said to these wise men of Babylon, “Whoever reads this inscription and tells me its interpretation will be clothed in purple and have a gold chain placed around his neck, and he will be made the third highest ruler in the kingdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_8","028_5_8","DAN","5","8","8","So all the king’s wise men came in, but they could not read the inscription or interpret it for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_9","028_5_9","DAN","5","9","9","Then King Belshazzar became even more terrified, his face grew even more pale, and his nobles were bewildered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_10","028_5_10","DAN","5","10","10","Hearing the outcry of the king and his nobles, the queen entered the banquet hall. “O king, may you live forever!” she said. “Do not let your thoughts terrify you, or your face grow pale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_11","028_5_11","DAN","5","11","11","There is a man in your kingdom who has the spirit of the holy gods in him. In the days of your father he was found to have insight, intelligence, and wisdom like that of the gods. Your father, King Nebuchadnezzar, appointed him chief of the magicians, enchanters, astrologers, and diviners. Your own father, the king, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_12","028_5_12","DAN","5","12","12","did this because Daniel, the one he named Belteshazzar, was found to have an extraordinary spirit, as well as knowledge, understanding, and the ability to interpret dreams, explain riddles, and solve difficult problems. Summon Daniel, therefore, and he will give you the interpretation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_13","028_5_13","DAN","5","13","13","So Daniel was brought before the king, who asked him, “Are you Daniel, one of the exiles my father the king brought from Judah? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_14","028_5_14","DAN","5","14","14","I have heard that the spirit of the gods is in you, and that you have insight, intelligence, and extraordinary wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_15","028_5_15","DAN","5","15","15","Now the wise men and enchanters were brought before me to read this inscription and interpret it for me, but they could not give its interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_16","028_5_16","DAN","5","16","16","But I have heard about you, that you are able to give interpretations and solve difficult problems. Therefore, if you can read this inscription and give me its interpretation, you will be clothed in purple and have a gold chain placed around your neck, and you will be made the third highest ruler in the kingdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_17","028_5_17","DAN","5","17","17","In response, Daniel said to the king, “You may keep your gifts for yourself and give your rewards to someone else. Nevertheless, I will read the inscription for the king and interpret it for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_18","028_5_18","DAN","5","18","18","As for you, O king, the Most High God gave your father Nebuchadnezzar sovereignty and greatness, glory and honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_19","028_5_19","DAN","5","19","19","Because of the greatness that He bestowed on him, the people of every nation and language trembled in fear before him. He killed whom he wished and kept alive whom he wished; he exalted whom he wished and humbled whom he wished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_20","028_5_20","DAN","5","20","20","But when his heart became arrogant and his spirit was hardened with pride, he was deposed from his royal throne, and his glory was taken from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_21","028_5_21","DAN","5","21","21","He was driven away from mankind, and his mind was like that of a beast. He lived with the wild donkeys and ate grass like an ox, and his body was drenched with the dew of heaven until he acknowledged that the Most High God rules over the kingdom of mankind, setting over it whom He wishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_22","028_5_22","DAN","5","22","22","But you his son, O Belshazzar, have not humbled your heart, even though you knew all this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_23","028_5_23","DAN","5","23","23","Instead, you have exalted yourself against the Lord of heaven. The vessels from His house were brought to you, and as you drank wine from them with your nobles, wives, and concubines, you praised your gods of silver and gold, bronze and iron, wood and stone, which cannot see or hear or understand. But you have failed to glorify the God who holds in His hand your very breath and all your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_24","028_5_24","DAN","5","24","24","Therefore He sent the hand that wrote the inscription. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_25","028_5_25","DAN","5","25","25","Now this is the inscription that was written: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, PARSIN. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_26","028_5_26","DAN","5","26","26","And this is the interpretation of the message: MENE means that God has numbered the days of your reign and brought it to an end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_27","028_5_27","DAN","5","27","27","TEKEL means that you have been weighed on the scales and found deficient. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_28","028_5_28","DAN","5","28","28","PERES means that your kingdom has been divided and given over to the Medes and Persians.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_29","028_5_29","DAN","5","29","29","Then Belshazzar gave the command, and they clothed Daniel in purple, placed a gold chain around his neck, and proclaimed him the third highest ruler in the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_30","028_5_30","DAN","5","30","30","That very night Belshazzar king of the Chaldeans was slain, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN5_31","028_5_31","DAN","5","31","31","and Darius the Mede received the kingdom at the age of sixty-two. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_1","028_6_1","DAN","6","1","1","Now it pleased Darius to appoint 120 satraps to rule throughout the kingdom, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_2","028_6_2","DAN","6","2","2","and over them three administrators, including Daniel, to whom these satraps were accountable so that the king would not suffer loss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_3","028_6_3","DAN","6","3","3","Soon, by his extraordinary spirit, Daniel distinguished himself among the administrators and satraps. So the king planned to set him over the whole kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_4","028_6_4","DAN","6","4","4","Thus the administrators and satraps sought a charge against Daniel concerning the kingdom, but they could find no charge or corruption, because he was trustworthy, and no negligence or corruption was found in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_5","028_6_5","DAN","6","5","5","Finally these men said, “We will never find any charge against this Daniel unless we find something against him concerning the law of his God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_6","028_6_6","DAN","6","6","6","So the administrators and satraps went together to the king and said, “O King Darius, may you live forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_7","028_6_7","DAN","6","7","7","All the royal administrators, prefects, satraps, advisers, and governors have agreed that the king should establish an ordinance and enforce a decree that for thirty days anyone who petitions any god or man except you, O king, will be thrown into the den of lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_8","028_6_8","DAN","6","8","8","Therefore, O king, establish the decree and sign the document so that it cannot be changed—in accordance with the law of the Medes and Persians, which cannot be repealed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_9","028_6_9","DAN","6","9","9","Therefore King Darius signed the written decree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_10","028_6_10","DAN","6","10","10","Now when Daniel learned that the document had been signed, he went into his house, where the windows of his upper room opened toward Jerusalem, and three times a day he got down on his knees, prayed, and gave thanks to his God, just as he had done before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_11","028_6_11","DAN","6","11","11","Then these men went as a group and found Daniel petitioning and imploring his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_12","028_6_12","DAN","6","12","12","So they approached the king and asked about his royal decree: “Did you not sign a decree that for thirty days any man who petitions any god or man except you, O king, will be thrown into the den of lions?” The king replied, “According to the law of the Medes and Persians the order stands, and it cannot be repealed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_13","028_6_13","DAN","6","13","13","Then they told the king, “Daniel, one of the exiles from Judah, shows no regard for you, O king, or for the decree that you have signed. He still makes his petition three times a day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_14","028_6_14","DAN","6","14","14","As soon as the king heard this, he was deeply distressed and set his mind on delivering Daniel, and he labored until sundown to rescue him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_15","028_6_15","DAN","6","15","15","Then the men approached the king together and said to him, “Remember, O king, that by the law of the Medes and Persians no decree or ordinance established by the king can be changed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_16","028_6_16","DAN","6","16","16","So the king gave the order, and they brought Daniel and threw him into the den of lions. The king said to Daniel, “May your God, whom you serve continually, deliver you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_17","028_6_17","DAN","6","17","17","A stone was brought and placed over the mouth of the den, and the king sealed it with his own signet ring and with the rings of his nobles, so that nothing concerning Daniel could be changed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_18","028_6_18","DAN","6","18","18","Then the king went to his palace and spent the night fasting. No entertainment was brought before him, and sleep fled from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_19","028_6_19","DAN","6","19","19","At the first light of dawn, the king got up and hurried to the den of lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_20","028_6_20","DAN","6","20","20","When he reached the den, he cried out in a voice of anguish, “O Daniel, servant of the living God, has your God, whom you serve continually, been able to deliver you from the lions?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_21","028_6_21","DAN","6","21","21","Then Daniel replied, “O king, may you live forever! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_22","028_6_22","DAN","6","22","22","My God sent His angel and shut the mouths of the lions. They have not hurt me, for I was found innocent in His sight, and I have done no wrong against you, O king.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_23","028_6_23","DAN","6","23","23","The king was overjoyed and gave orders to lift Daniel out of the den, and when Daniel was lifted out of the den, no wounds whatsoever were found on him, because he had trusted in his God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_24","028_6_24","DAN","6","24","24","At the command of the king, the men who had falsely accused Daniel were brought and thrown into the den of lions—they and their children and wives. And before they had reached the bottom of the den, the lions overpowered them and crushed all their bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_25","028_6_25","DAN","6","25","25","Then King Darius wrote to the people of every nation and language throughout the land: “May your prosperity abound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_26","028_6_26","DAN","6","26","26","I hereby decree that in every part of my kingdom, men are to tremble in fear before the God of Daniel: For He is the living God, and He endures forever; His kingdom will never be destroyed, and His dominion will never end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_27","028_6_27","DAN","6","27","27","He delivers and rescues; He performs signs and wonders in the heavens and on the earth, for He has rescued Daniel from the power of the lions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN6_28","028_6_28","DAN","6","28","28","So Daniel prospered during the reign of Darius and the reign of Cyrus the Persian. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_1","028_7_1","DAN","7","1","1","In the first year of the reign of Belshazzar over Babylon, Daniel had a dream, and visions passed through his mind as he lay on his bed. He wrote down the dream, and this is the summary of his account. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_2","028_7_2","DAN","7","2","2","Daniel declared: “In my vision in the night I looked, and suddenly the four winds of heaven were churning up the great sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_3","028_7_3","DAN","7","3","3","Then four great beasts came up out of the sea, each one different from the others: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_4","028_7_4","DAN","7","4","4","The first beast was like a lion, and it had the wings of an eagle. I watched until its wings were torn off and it was lifted up from the ground and made to stand on two feet like a man and given the mind of a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_5","028_7_5","DAN","7","5","5","Suddenly another beast appeared, which looked like a bear. It was raised up on one of its sides, and it had three ribs in its mouth between its teeth. So it was told, ‘Get up and gorge yourself on flesh!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_6","028_7_6","DAN","7","6","6","Next, as I watched, suddenly another beast appeared. It was like a leopard, and on its back it had four wings like those of a bird. The beast also had four heads, and it was given authority to rule. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_7","028_7_7","DAN","7","7","7","After this, as I watched in my vision in the night, suddenly a fourth beast appeared, and it was terrifying—dreadful and extremely strong—with large iron teeth. It devoured and crushed; then it trampled underfoot whatever was left. It was different from all the beasts before it, and it had ten horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_8","028_7_8","DAN","7","8","8","While I was contemplating the horns, suddenly another horn, a little one, came up among them, and three of the first horns were uprooted before it. This horn had eyes like those of a man and a mouth that spoke words of arrogance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_9","028_7_9","DAN","7","9","9","As I continued to watch, thrones were set in place, and the Ancient of Days took His seat. His clothing was white as snow, and the hair of His head was like pure wool. His throne was flaming with fire, and its wheels were all ablaze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_10","028_7_10","DAN","7","10","10","A river of fire was flowing, coming out from His presence. Thousands upon thousands attended Him, and myriads upon myriads stood before Him. The court was convened, and the books were opened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_11","028_7_11","DAN","7","11","11","Then I kept watching because of the arrogant words the horn was speaking. As I continued to watch, the beast was slain, and its body was destroyed and thrown into the blazing fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_12","028_7_12","DAN","7","12","12","As for the rest of the beasts, their dominion was removed, but they were granted an extension of life for a season and a time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_13","028_7_13","DAN","7","13","13","In my vision in the night I continued to watch, and I saw One like the Son of Man coming with the clouds of heaven. He approached the Ancient of Days and was led into His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_14","028_7_14","DAN","7","14","14","And He was given dominion, glory, and kingship, that the people of every nation and language should serve Him. His dominion is an everlasting dominion that will not pass away, and His kingdom is one that will never be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_15","028_7_15","DAN","7","15","15","I, Daniel, was grieved in my spirit, and the visions in my mind alarmed me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_16","028_7_16","DAN","7","16","16","I approached one of those who were standing there, and I asked him the true meaning of all this. So he told me the interpretation of these things: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_17","028_7_17","DAN","7","17","17","‘These four great beasts are four kings who will arise from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_18","028_7_18","DAN","7","18","18","But the saints of the Most High will receive the kingdom and possess it forever—yes, forever and ever.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_19","028_7_19","DAN","7","19","19","Then I wanted to know the true meaning of the fourth beast, which was different from all the others—extremely terrifying—devouring and crushing with iron teeth and bronze claws, then trampling underfoot whatever was left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_20","028_7_20","DAN","7","20","20","I also wanted to know about the ten horns on its head and the other horn that came up, before which three of them fell—the horn whose appearance was more imposing than the others, with eyes and with a mouth that spoke words of arrogance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_21","028_7_21","DAN","7","21","21","As I watched, this horn was waging war against the saints and prevailing against them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_22","028_7_22","DAN","7","22","22","until the Ancient of Days arrived and pronounced judgment in favor of the saints of the Most High, and the time came for them to possess the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_23","028_7_23","DAN","7","23","23","This is what he said: ‘The fourth beast is a fourth kingdom that will appear on the earth, different from all the other kingdoms, and it will devour the whole earth, trample it down, and crush it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_24","028_7_24","DAN","7","24","24","And the ten horns are ten kings who will rise from this kingdom. After them another king, different from the earlier ones, will rise and subdue three kings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_25","028_7_25","DAN","7","25","25","He will speak out against the Most High and oppress the saints of the Most High, intending to change the appointed times and laws; and the saints will be given into his hand for a time, and times, and half a time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_26","028_7_26","DAN","7","26","26","But the court will convene, and his dominion will be taken away and completely destroyed forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_27","028_7_27","DAN","7","27","27","Then the sovereignty, dominion, and greatness of the kingdoms under all of heaven will be given to the people, the saints of the Most High. His kingdom will be an everlasting kingdom, and all rulers will serve and obey Him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN7_28","028_7_28","DAN","7","28","28","Thus ends the matter. As for me, Daniel, my thoughts troubled me greatly, and my face turned pale. But I kept the matter to myself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_1","028_8_1","DAN","8","1","1","In the third year of the reign of King Belshazzar, a vision appeared to me, Daniel, subsequent to the one that had appeared to me earlier. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_2","028_8_2","DAN","8","2","2","And in the vision I saw myself in the citadel of Susa, in the province of Elam. I saw in the vision that I was beside the Ulai Canal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_3","028_8_3","DAN","8","3","3","Then I lifted up my eyes and saw a ram with two horns standing beside the canal. The horns were long, but one was longer than the other, and the longer one grew up later. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_4","028_8_4","DAN","8","4","4","I saw the ram charging toward the west and the north and the south. No animal could stand against him, and there was no deliverance from his power. He did as he pleased and became great. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_5","028_8_5","DAN","8","5","5","As I was contemplating all this, suddenly a goat with a prominent horn between his eyes came out of the west, crossing the surface of the entire earth without touching the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_6","028_8_6","DAN","8","6","6","He came toward the two-horned ram I had seen standing beside the canal and rushed at him with furious power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_7","028_8_7","DAN","8","7","7","I saw him approach the ram in a rage against him, and he struck the ram and shattered his two horns. The ram was powerless to stand against him, and the goat threw him to the ground and trampled him, and no one could deliver the ram from his power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_8","028_8_8","DAN","8","8","8","Thus the goat became very great, but at the height of his power, his large horn was broken off, and four prominent horns came up in its place, pointing toward the four winds of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_9","028_8_9","DAN","8","9","9","From one of these horns a little horn emerged and grew extensively toward the south and the east and toward the Beautiful Land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_10","028_8_10","DAN","8","10","10","It grew as high as the host of heaven, and it cast down some of the host and some of the stars to the earth and trampled them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_11","028_8_11","DAN","8","11","11","It magnified itself, even to the Prince of the host; it removed His daily sacrifice and overthrew the place of His sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_12","028_8_12","DAN","8","12","12","And in the rebellion, the host and the daily sacrifice were given over to the horn, and it flung truth to the ground and prospered in whatever it did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_13","028_8_13","DAN","8","13","13","Then I heard a holy one speaking, and another holy one said to him, “How long until the fulfillment of the vision of the daily sacrifice, the rebellion that causes desolation, and the surrender of the sanctuary and of the host to be trampled?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_14","028_8_14","DAN","8","14","14","He said to me, “It will take 2,300 evenings and mornings; then the sanctuary will be properly restored.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_15","028_8_15","DAN","8","15","15","While I, Daniel, was watching the vision and trying to understand it, there stood before me one having the appearance of a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_16","028_8_16","DAN","8","16","16","And I heard the voice of a man calling from between the banks of the Ulai: “Gabriel, explain the vision to this man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_17","028_8_17","DAN","8","17","17","As he came near to where I stood, I was terrified and fell facedown. “Son of man,” he said to me, “understand that the vision concerns the time of the end.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_18","028_8_18","DAN","8","18","18","While he was speaking with me, I fell into a deep sleep, with my face to the ground. Then he touched me, helped me to my feet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_19","028_8_19","DAN","8","19","19","and said, “Behold, I will make known to you what will happen in the latter time of wrath, because it concerns the appointed time of the end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_20","028_8_20","DAN","8","20","20","The two-horned ram that you saw represents the kings of Media and Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_21","028_8_21","DAN","8","21","21","The shaggy goat represents the king of Greece, and the large horn between his eyes is the first king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_22","028_8_22","DAN","8","22","22","The four horns that replaced the broken one represent four kingdoms that will rise from that nation but will not have the same power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_23","028_8_23","DAN","8","23","23","In the latter part of their reign, when the rebellion has reached its full measure, an insolent king, skilled in intrigue, will come to the throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_24","028_8_24","DAN","8","24","24","His power will be great, but it will not be his own. He will cause terrible destruction and succeed in whatever he does. He will destroy the mighty men along with the holy people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_25","028_8_25","DAN","8","25","25","Through his craft and by his hand, he will cause deceit to prosper, and in his own mind he will make himself great. In a time of peace he will destroy many, and he will even stand against the Prince of princes. Yet he will be broken off, but not by human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_26","028_8_26","DAN","8","26","26","The vision of the evenings and the mornings that has been spoken is true. Now you must seal up the vision, for it concerns the distant future.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN8_27","028_8_27","DAN","8","27","27","I, Daniel, was exhausted and lay ill for days. Then I got up and went about the king’s business. I was confounded by the vision; it was beyond understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_1","028_9_1","DAN","9","1","1","In the first year of Darius son of Xerxes, a Mede by descent, who was made ruler over the kingdom of the Chaldeans— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_2","028_9_2","DAN","9","2","2","in the first year of his reign, I, Daniel, understood from the sacred books, according to the word of the LORD to Jeremiah the prophet, that the desolation of Jerusalem would last seventy years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_3","028_9_3","DAN","9","3","3","So I turned my attention to the Lord God to seek Him by prayer and petition, with fasting, sackcloth, and ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_4","028_9_4","DAN","9","4","4","And I prayed to the LORD my God and confessed, “O, Lord, the great and awesome God, who keeps His covenant of loving devotion to those who love Him and keep His commandments, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_5","028_9_5","DAN","9","5","5","we have sinned and done wrong. We have acted wickedly and rebelled. We have turned away from Your commandments and ordinances. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_6","028_9_6","DAN","9","6","6","We have not listened to Your servants the prophets, who spoke in Your name to our kings, leaders, fathers, and all the people of the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_7","028_9_7","DAN","9","7","7","To You, O Lord, belongs righteousness, but this day we are covered with shame—the men of Judah, the people of Jerusalem, and all Israel near and far, in all the countries to which You have driven us because of our unfaithfulness to You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_8","028_9_8","DAN","9","8","8","O LORD, we are covered with shame—our kings, our leaders, and our fathers—because we have sinned against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_9","028_9_9","DAN","9","9","9","To the Lord our God belong compassion and forgiveness, even though we have rebelled against Him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_10","028_9_10","DAN","9","10","10","and have not obeyed the voice of the LORD our God to walk in His laws, which He set before us through His servants the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_11","028_9_11","DAN","9","11","11","All Israel has transgressed Your law and turned away, refusing to obey Your voice; so the oath and the curse written in the Law of Moses the servant of God has been poured out on us, because we have sinned against You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_12","028_9_12","DAN","9","12","12","You have carried out the words spoken against us and against our rulers by bringing upon us a great disaster. For under all of heaven, nothing has ever been done like what has been done to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_13","028_9_13","DAN","9","13","13","Just as it is written in the Law of Moses, all this disaster has come upon us, yet we have not sought the favor of the LORD our God by turning from our iniquities and giving attention to Your truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_14","028_9_14","DAN","9","14","14","Therefore the LORD has kept the calamity in store and brought it upon us. For the LORD our God is righteous in all He does; yet we have not obeyed His voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_15","028_9_15","DAN","9","15","15","Now, O Lord our God, who brought Your people out of the land of Egypt with a mighty hand, and who made for Yourself a name renowned to this day, we have sinned; we have acted wickedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_16","028_9_16","DAN","9","16","16","O Lord, in keeping with all Your righteous acts, I pray that Your anger and wrath may turn away from Your city Jerusalem, Your holy mountain; for because of our sins and the iniquities of our fathers, Jerusalem and Your people are a reproach to all around us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_17","028_9_17","DAN","9","17","17","So now, our God, hear the prayers and petitions of Your servant. For Your sake, O Lord, cause Your face to shine upon Your desolate sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_18","028_9_18","DAN","9","18","18","Incline Your ear, O my God, and hear; open Your eyes and see the desolation of the city that bears Your name. For we are not presenting our petitions before You because of our righteous acts, but because of Your great compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_19","028_9_19","DAN","9","19","19","O Lord, listen! O Lord, forgive! O Lord, hear and act! For Your sake, O my God, do not delay, because Your city and Your people bear Your name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_20","028_9_20","DAN","9","20","20","While I was speaking, praying, confessing my sin and that of my people Israel, and presenting my petition before the LORD my God concerning His holy mountain— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_21","028_9_21","DAN","9","21","21","while I was still praying, Gabriel, the man I had seen in the earlier vision, came to me in swift flight about the time of the evening sacrifice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_22","028_9_22","DAN","9","22","22","He instructed me and spoke with me, saying: “O Daniel, I have come now to give you insight and understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_23","028_9_23","DAN","9","23","23","At the beginning of your petitions, an answer went out, and I have come to tell you, for you are highly precious. So consider the message and understand the vision: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_24","028_9_24","DAN","9","24","24","Seventy weeks are decreed for your people and your holy city to stop their transgression, to put an end to sin, to make atonement for iniquity, to bring in everlasting righteousness, to seal up vision and prophecy, and to anoint the Most Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_25","028_9_25","DAN","9","25","25","Know and understand this: From the issuance of the decree to restore and rebuild Jerusalem until the Messiah, the Prince, there will be seven weeks and sixty-two weeks. It will be rebuilt with streets and a trench, but in times of distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_26","028_9_26","DAN","9","26","26","Then after the sixty-two weeks the Messiah will be cut off and will have nothing. Then the people of the prince who is to come will destroy the city and the sanctuary. The end will come like a flood, and until the end there will be war; desolations have been decreed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN9_27","028_9_27","DAN","9","27","27","And he will confirm a covenant with many for one week, but in the middle of the week he will put an end to sacrifice and offering. And on the wing of the temple will come the abomination that causes desolation, until the decreed destruction is poured out upon him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_1","028_10_1","DAN","10","1","1","In the third year of Cyrus king of Persia, a message was revealed to Daniel, who was called Belteshazzar. The message was true, and it concerned a great conflict. And the understanding of the message was given to him in a vision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_2","028_10_2","DAN","10","2","2","In those days I, Daniel, was mourning for three full weeks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_3","028_10_3","DAN","10","3","3","I ate no rich food, no meat or wine entered my mouth, and I did not anoint myself with oil until the three weeks were completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_4","028_10_4","DAN","10","4","4","On the twenty-fourth day of the first month, as I was standing on the bank of the great river, the Tigris, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_5","028_10_5","DAN","10","5","5","I lifted up my eyes, and behold, there was a certain man dressed in linen, with a belt of fine gold from Uphaz around his waist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_6","028_10_6","DAN","10","6","6","His body was like beryl, his face like the brilliance of lightning, his eyes like flaming torches, his arms and legs like the gleam of polished bronze, and his voice like the sound of a multitude. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_7","028_10_7","DAN","10","7","7","Only I, Daniel, saw the vision; the men with me did not see it, but a great terror fell upon them, and they ran and hid themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_8","028_10_8","DAN","10","8","8","So I was left alone, gazing at this great vision. No strength remained in me; my face grew deathly pale, and I was powerless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_9","028_10_9","DAN","10","9","9","I heard the sound of his words, and as I listened, I fell into a deep sleep, with my face to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_10","028_10_10","DAN","10","10","10","Suddenly, a hand touched me and set me trembling on my hands and knees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_11","028_10_11","DAN","10","11","11","He said to me, “Daniel, you are a man who is highly precious. Consider carefully the words that I am about to say to you. Stand up, for I have now been sent to you.” And when he had said this to me, I stood up trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_12","028_10_12","DAN","10","12","12","“Do not be afraid, Daniel,” he said, “for from the first day that you purposed to understand and to humble yourself before your God, your words were heard, and I have come in response to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_13","028_10_13","DAN","10","13","13","However, the prince of the kingdom of Persia opposed me for twenty-one days. Then Michael, one of the chief princes, came to help me, for I had been left there with the kings of Persia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_14","028_10_14","DAN","10","14","14","Now I have come to explain to you what will happen to your people in the latter days, for the vision concerns those days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_15","028_10_15","DAN","10","15","15","While he was speaking these words to me, I set my face toward the ground and became speechless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_16","028_10_16","DAN","10","16","16","And suddenly one with the likeness of a man touched my lips, and I opened my mouth and said to the one standing before me, “My lord, because of the vision, I am overcome with anguish, and I have no strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_17","028_10_17","DAN","10","17","17","How can I, your servant, speak with you, my lord? Now I have no strength, nor is any breath left in me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_18","028_10_18","DAN","10","18","18","Again the one with the likeness of a man touched me and strengthened me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_19","028_10_19","DAN","10","19","19","“Do not be afraid, you who are highly precious,” he said. “Peace be with you! Be strong now; be very strong!” As he spoke with me, I was strengthened and said, “Speak, my lord, for you have strengthened me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_20","028_10_20","DAN","10","20","20","“Do you know why I have come to you?” he said. “I must return at once to fight against the prince of Persia, and when I have gone forth, behold, the prince of Greece will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN10_21","028_10_21","DAN","10","21","21","But first I will tell you what is inscribed in the Book of Truth. Yet no one has the courage to support me against these, except Michael your prince. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_1","028_11_1","DAN","11","1","1","“And I, in the first year of Darius the Mede, stood up to strengthen and protect him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_2","028_11_2","DAN","11","2","2","Now then, I will tell you the truth: Three more kings will arise in Persia, and then a fourth, who will be far richer than all the others. By the power of his wealth, he will stir up everyone against the kingdom of Greece. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_3","028_11_3","DAN","11","3","3","Then a mighty king will arise, who will rule with great authority and do as he pleases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_4","028_11_4","DAN","11","4","4","But as soon as he is established, his kingdom will be broken up and parceled out toward the four winds of heaven. It will not go to his descendants, nor will it have the authority with which he ruled, because his kingdom will be uprooted and given to others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_5","028_11_5","DAN","11","5","5","The king of the South will grow strong, but one of his commanders will grow even stronger and will rule his own kingdom with great authority. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_6","028_11_6","DAN","11","6","6","After some years they will form an alliance, and the daughter of the king of the South will go to the king of the North to seal the agreement. But his daughter will not retain her position of power, nor will his strength endure. At that time she will be given up, along with her royal escort and her father and the one who supported her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_7","028_11_7","DAN","11","7","7","But one from her family line will rise up in his place, come against the army of the king of the North, and enter his fortress, fighting and prevailing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_8","028_11_8","DAN","11","8","8","He will take even their gods captive to Egypt, with their metal images and their precious vessels of silver and gold. For some years he will stay away from the king of the North, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_9","028_11_9","DAN","11","9","9","who will invade the realm of the king of the South and then return to his own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_10","028_11_10","DAN","11","10","10","But his sons will stir up strife and assemble a great army, which will advance forcefully, sweeping through like a flood, and will again carry the battle as far as his fortress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_11","028_11_11","DAN","11","11","11","In a rage, the king of the South will march out to fight the king of the North, who will raise a large army, but it will be delivered into the hand of his enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_12","028_11_12","DAN","11","12","12","When the army is carried off, the king of the South will be proud in heart and will cast down tens of thousands, but he will not triumph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_13","028_11_13","DAN","11","13","13","For the king of the North will raise another army, larger than the first, and after some years he will advance with a great army and many supplies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_14","028_11_14","DAN","11","14","14","In those times many will rise up against the king of the South. Violent ones among your own people will exalt themselves in fulfillment of the vision, but they will fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_15","028_11_15","DAN","11","15","15","Then the king of the North will come, build up a siege ramp, and capture a fortified city. The forces of the South will not stand; even their best troops will not be able to resist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_16","028_11_16","DAN","11","16","16","The invader will do as he pleases, and no one will stand against him. He will establish himself in the Beautiful Land, with destruction in his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_17","028_11_17","DAN","11","17","17","He will resolve to come with the strength of his whole kingdom, and will reach an agreement with the king of the South. He will give him a daughter in marriage in order to overthrow the kingdom, but his plan will not succeed or help him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_18","028_11_18","DAN","11","18","18","Then he will turn his face to the coastlands and capture many of them. But a commander will put an end to his reproach and will turn it back upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_19","028_11_19","DAN","11","19","19","After this, he will turn back toward the fortresses of his own land, but he will stumble and fall and be no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_20","028_11_20","DAN","11","20","20","In his place one will arise who will send out a tax collector for the glory of the kingdom; but within a few days he will be destroyed, though not in anger or in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_21","028_11_21","DAN","11","21","21","In his place a despicable person will arise; royal honors will not be given to him, but he will come in a time of peace and seize the kingdom by intrigue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_22","028_11_22","DAN","11","22","22","Then a flood of forces will be swept away before him and destroyed, along with a prince of the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_23","028_11_23","DAN","11","23","23","After an alliance is made with him, he will act deceitfully; for he will rise to power with only a few people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_24","028_11_24","DAN","11","24","24","In a time of peace, he will invade the richest provinces and do what his fathers and forefathers never did. He will lavish plunder, loot, and wealth on his followers, and he will plot against the strongholds—but only for a time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_25","028_11_25","DAN","11","25","25","And with a large army he will stir up his power and his courage against the king of the South, who will mobilize a very large and powerful army but will not withstand the plots devised against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_26","028_11_26","DAN","11","26","26","Those who eat from his provisions will seek to destroy him; his army will be swept away, and many will fall slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_27","028_11_27","DAN","11","27","27","And the two kings, with their hearts bent on evil, will speak lies at the same table, but to no avail, for still the end will come at the appointed time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_28","028_11_28","DAN","11","28","28","The king of the North will return to his land with great wealth, but his heart will be set against the holy covenant; so he will do damage and return to his own land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_29","028_11_29","DAN","11","29","29","At the appointed time he will invade the South again, but this time will not be like the first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_30","028_11_30","DAN","11","30","30","Ships of Kittim will come against him, and he will lose heart. Then he will turn back and rage against the holy covenant and do damage. So he will return and show favor to those who forsake the holy covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_31","028_11_31","DAN","11","31","31","His forces will rise up and desecrate the temple fortress. They will abolish the daily sacrifice and set up the abomination of desolation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_32","028_11_32","DAN","11","32","32","With flattery he will corrupt those who violate the covenant, but the people who know their God will firmly resist him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_33","028_11_33","DAN","11","33","33","Those with insight will instruct many, though for a time they will fall by sword or flame, or be captured or plundered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_34","028_11_34","DAN","11","34","34","Now when they fall, they will be granted a little help, but many will join them insincerely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_35","028_11_35","DAN","11","35","35","Some of the wise will fall so that they may be refined, purified, and made spotless until the time of the end, for it will still come at the appointed time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_36","028_11_36","DAN","11","36","36","Then the king will do as he pleases and will exalt and magnify himself above every god, and he will speak monstrous things against the God of gods. He will be successful until the time of wrath is completed, for what has been decreed must be accomplished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_37","028_11_37","DAN","11","37","37","He will show no regard for the gods of his fathers, nor for the one desired by women, nor for any other god, because he will magnify himself above them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_38","028_11_38","DAN","11","38","38","And in their place, he will honor a god of fortresses—a god his fathers did not know—with gold, silver, precious stones, and riches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_39","028_11_39","DAN","11","39","39","He will attack the strongest fortresses with the help of a foreign god and will greatly honor those who acknowledge him, making them rulers over many and distributing the land for a price. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_40","028_11_40","DAN","11","40","40","At the time of the end, the king of the South will engage him in battle, but the king of the North will storm out against him with chariots, horsemen, and many ships, invading many countries and sweeping through them like a flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_41","028_11_41","DAN","11","41","41","He will also invade the Beautiful Land, and many countries will fall. But these will be delivered from his hand: Edom, Moab, and the leaders of the Ammonites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_42","028_11_42","DAN","11","42","42","He will extend his power over many countries, and not even the land of Egypt will escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_43","028_11_43","DAN","11","43","43","He will gain control of the treasures of gold and silver and over all the riches of Egypt, and the Libyans and Cushites will also submit to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_44","028_11_44","DAN","11","44","44","But news from the east and the north will alarm him, and he will go out with great fury to destroy many and devote them to destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN11_45","028_11_45","DAN","11","45","45","He will pitch his royal tents between the sea and the beautiful holy mountain, but he will meet his end with no one to help him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_1","028_12_1","DAN","12","1","1","“At that time Michael, the great prince who stands watch over your people, will rise up. There will be a time of distress, the likes of which will not have occurred from the beginning of nations until that time. But at that time your people—everyone whose name is found written in the book—will be delivered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_2","028_12_2","DAN","12","2","2","And many who sleep in the dust of the earth will awake, some to everlasting life, but others to shame and everlasting contempt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_3","028_12_3","DAN","12","3","3","Then the wise will shine like the brightness of the heavens, and those who lead many to righteousness will shine like the stars forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_4","028_12_4","DAN","12","4","4","But you, Daniel, shut up these words and seal the book until the time of the end. Many will roam to and fro, and knowledge will increase.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_5","028_12_5","DAN","12","5","5","Then I, Daniel, looked and saw two others standing there, one on this bank of the river and one on the opposite bank. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_6","028_12_6","DAN","12","6","6","One of them said to the man dressed in linen, who was above the waters of the river, “How long until the fulfillment of these wonders?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_7","028_12_7","DAN","12","7","7","And the man dressed in linen, who was above the waters of the river, raised his right hand and his left hand toward heaven, and I heard him swear by Him who lives forever, saying, “It will be for a time, and times, and half a time. When the power of the holy people has finally been shattered, all these things will be completed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_8","028_12_8","DAN","12","8","8","I heard, but I did not understand. So I asked, “My lord, what will be the outcome of these things?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_9","028_12_9","DAN","12","9","9","“Go on your way, Daniel,” he replied, “for the words are closed up and sealed until the time of the end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_10","028_12_10","DAN","12","10","10","Many will be purified, made spotless, and refined, but the wicked will continue to act wickedly. None of the wicked will understand, but the wise will understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_11","028_12_11","DAN","12","11","11","And from the time the daily sacrifice is abolished and the abomination of desolation set up, there will be 1,290 days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_12","028_12_12","DAN","12","12","12","Blessed is he who waits and reaches the end of the 1,335 days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("DN12_13","028_12_13","DAN","12","13","13","But as for you, go on your way until the end. You will rest, and then you will arise to your inheritance at the end of the days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_1","029_1_1","HOS","1","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Hosea son of Beeri in the days of Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah, kings of Judah, and of Jeroboam son of Jehoash, king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_2","029_1_2","HOS","1","2","2","When the LORD first spoke through Hosea, He told him, “Go, take a prostitute as your wife and have children of adultery, because this land is flagrantly prostituting itself by departing from the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_3","029_1_3","HOS","1","3","3","So Hosea went and married Gomer daughter of Diblaim, and she conceived and bore him a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_4","029_1_4","HOS","1","4","4","Then the LORD said to Hosea, “Name him Jezreel, for soon I will bring the bloodshed of Jezreel upon the house of Jehu, and I will put an end to the kingdom of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_5","029_1_5","HOS","1","5","5","And on that day I will break the bow of Israel in the Valley of Jezreel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_6","029_1_6","HOS","1","6","6","Gomer again conceived and gave birth to a daughter, and the LORD said to Hosea, “Name her Lo-ruhamah, for I will no longer have compassion on the house of Israel, that I should ever forgive them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_7","029_1_7","HOS","1","7","7","Yet I will have compassion on the house of Judah, and I will save them—not by bow or sword or war, not by horses and cavalry, but by the LORD their God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_8","029_1_8","HOS","1","8","8","After she had weaned Lo-ruhamah, Gomer conceived and gave birth to a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_9","029_1_9","HOS","1","9","9","And the LORD said, “Name him Lo-ammi, for you are not My people, and I am not your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_10","029_1_10","HOS","1","10","10","Yet the number of the Israelites will be like the sand of the sea, which cannot be measured or counted. And it will happen that in the very place where it was said to them, ‘You are not My people,’ they will be called ‘sons of the living God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS1_11","029_1_11","HOS","1","11","11","Then the people of Judah and of Israel will be gathered together, and they will appoint for themselves one leader, and will go up out of the land. For great will be the day of Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_1","029_2_1","HOS","2","1","1","“Say of your brothers, ‘My people,’ and of your sisters, ‘My loved one.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_2","029_2_2","HOS","2","2","2","Rebuke your mother, rebuke her, for she is not My wife, and I am not her husband. Let her remove the adultery from her face and the unfaithfulness from between her breasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_3","029_2_3","HOS","2","3","3","Otherwise, I will strip her naked and expose her like the day of her birth. I will make her like a desert and turn her into a parched land, and I will let her die of thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_4","029_2_4","HOS","2","4","4","I will have no compassion on her children, because they are the children of adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_5","029_2_5","HOS","2","5","5","For their mother has played the harlot and has conceived them in disgrace. For she thought, ‘I will go after my lovers, who give me bread and water, wool and linen, oil and drink.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_6","029_2_6","HOS","2","6","6","Therefore, behold, I will hedge up her path with thorns; I will enclose her with a wall, so she cannot find her way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_7","029_2_7","HOS","2","7","7","She will pursue her lovers but not catch them; she will seek them but not find them. Then she will say, ‘I will return to my first husband, for then I was better off than now.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_8","029_2_8","HOS","2","8","8","For she does not acknowledge that it was I who gave her grain, new wine, and oil, who lavished on her silver and gold—which they crafted for Baal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_9","029_2_9","HOS","2","9","9","Therefore I will take back My grain in its time and My new wine in its season; I will take away My wool and linen, which were given to cover her nakedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_10","029_2_10","HOS","2","10","10","And then I will expose her lewdness in the sight of her lovers, and no one will deliver her out of My hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_11","029_2_11","HOS","2","11","11","I will put an end to all her exultation: her feasts, New Moons, and Sabbaths—all her appointed feasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_12","029_2_12","HOS","2","12","12","I will destroy her vines and fig trees, which she thinks are the wages paid by her lovers. So I will make them into a thicket, and the beasts of the field will devour them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_13","029_2_13","HOS","2","13","13","I will punish her for the days of the Baals when she burned incense to them, when she adorned herself with rings and jewelry, and went after her lovers. But Me she forgot,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_14","029_2_14","HOS","2","14","14","“Therefore, behold, I will allure her and lead her to the wilderness, and speak to her tenderly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_15","029_2_15","HOS","2","15","15","There I will give back her vineyards and make the Valley of Achor into a gateway of hope. There she will respond as she did in the days of her youth, as in the day she came up out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_16","029_2_16","HOS","2","16","16","In that day,” declares the LORD, “you will call Me ‘my Husband,’ and no longer call Me ‘my Master.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_17","029_2_17","HOS","2","17","17","For I will remove from her lips the names of the Baals; no longer will their names be invoked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_18","029_2_18","HOS","2","18","18","On that day I will make a covenant for them with the beasts of the field and the birds of the air and the creatures that crawl on the ground. And I will abolish bow and sword and battle in the land, and will make them lie down in safety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_19","029_2_19","HOS","2","19","19","So I will betroth you to Me forever; I will betroth you in righteousness and justice, in loving devotion and compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_20","029_2_20","HOS","2","20","20","And I will betroth you in faithfulness, and you will know the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_21","029_2_21","HOS","2","21","21","“On that day I will respond—” declares the LORD—“I will respond to the heavens, and they will respond to the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_22","029_2_22","HOS","2","22","22","And the earth will respond to the grain, to the new wine and oil, and they will respond to Jezreel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS2_23","029_2_23","HOS","2","23","23","And I will sow her as My own in the land, and I will have compassion on ‘No Compassion.’ I will say to those called ‘Not My People,’ ‘You are My people,’ and they will say, ‘You are my God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS3_1","029_3_1","HOS","3","1","1","Then the LORD said to me, “Go show love to your wife again, though she is loved by another and is an adulteress. Love her as the LORD loves the Israelites, though they turn to other gods and love to offer raisin cakes to idols.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS3_2","029_3_2","HOS","3","2","2","So I bought her for fifteen shekels of silver and a homer and a lethech of barley. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS3_3","029_3_3","HOS","3","3","3","Then I said to her, “You must live with me for many days; you must not be promiscuous or belong to another, and I will do the same for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS3_4","029_3_4","HOS","3","4","4","For the Israelites must live many days without king or prince, without sacrifice or sacred pillar, and without ephod or idol. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS3_5","029_3_5","HOS","3","5","5","Afterward, the people of Israel will return and seek the LORD their God and David their king. They will come trembling to the LORD and to His goodness in the last days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_1","029_4_1","HOS","4","1","1","Hear the word of the LORD, O children of Israel, for the LORD has a case against the people of the land: “There is no truth, no loving devotion, and no knowledge of God in the land! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_2","029_4_2","HOS","4","2","2","Cursing and lying, murder and stealing, and adultery are rampant; one act of bloodshed follows another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_3","029_4_3","HOS","4","3","3","Therefore the land mourns, and all who dwell in it will waste away with the beasts of the field and the birds of the air; even the fish of the sea disappear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_4","029_4_4","HOS","4","4","4","But let no man contend; let no man offer reproof; for your people are like those who contend with a priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_5","029_4_5","HOS","4","5","5","You will stumble by day, and the prophet will stumble with you by night; so I will destroy your mother— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_6","029_4_6","HOS","4","6","6","My people are destroyed for lack of knowledge. Because you have rejected knowledge, I will also reject you as My priests. Since you have forgotten the law of your God, I will also forget your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_7","029_4_7","HOS","4","7","7","The more they multiplied, the more they sinned against Me; they exchanged their Glory for a thing of disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_8","029_4_8","HOS","4","8","8","They feed on the sins of My people and set their hearts on iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_9","029_4_9","HOS","4","9","9","And it shall be like people, like priest. I will punish both of them for their ways and repay them for their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_10","029_4_10","HOS","4","10","10","They will eat but not be satisfied; they will be promiscuous but not multiply. For they have abandoned the LORD to give themselves ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_11","029_4_11","HOS","4","11","11","to promiscuity, wine, and new wine, which take away understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_12","029_4_12","HOS","4","12","12","My people consult their wooden idols, and their divining rods inform them. For a spirit of prostitution leads them astray and they have played the harlot against their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_13","029_4_13","HOS","4","13","13","They sacrifice on the mountaintops and burn offerings on the hills, under oak, poplar, and terebinth, because their shade is pleasant. And so your daughters turn to prostitution and your daughters-in-law to adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_14","029_4_14","HOS","4","14","14","I will not punish your daughters when they prostitute themselves, nor your daughters-in-law when they commit adultery. For the men themselves go off with prostitutes and offer sacrifices with shrine prostitutes. So a people without understanding will come to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_15","029_4_15","HOS","4","15","15","Though you prostitute yourself, O Israel, may Judah avoid such guilt! Do not journey to Gilgal, do not go up to Beth-aven, and do not swear on oath, ‘As surely as the LORD lives!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_16","029_4_16","HOS","4","16","16","For Israel is as obstinate as a stubborn heifer. Can the LORD now shepherd them like lambs in an open meadow? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_17","029_4_17","HOS","4","17","17","Ephraim is joined to idols; leave him alone! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_18","029_4_18","HOS","4","18","18","When their liquor is gone, they turn to prostitution; their rulers dearly love disgrace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS4_19","029_4_19","HOS","4","19","19","The whirlwind has wrapped them in its wings, and their sacrifices will bring them shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_1","029_5_1","HOS","5","1","1","“Hear this, O priests! Take heed, O house of Israel! Give ear, O royal house! For this judgment is against you because you have been a snare at Mizpah, a net spread out on Tabor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_2","029_5_2","HOS","5","2","2","The rebels are deep in slaughter; but I will chastise them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_3","029_5_3","HOS","5","3","3","I know all about Ephraim, and Israel is not hidden from Me. For now, O Ephraim, you have turned to prostitution; Israel is defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_4","029_5_4","HOS","5","4","4","Their deeds do not permit them to return to their God, for a spirit of prostitution is within them, and they do not know the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_5","029_5_5","HOS","5","5","5","Israel’s arrogance testifies against them; Israel and Ephraim stumble in their iniquity; even Judah stumbles with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_6","029_5_6","HOS","5","6","6","They go with their flocks and herds to seek the LORD, but they do not find Him; He has withdrawn Himself from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_7","029_5_7","HOS","5","7","7","They have been unfaithful to the LORD; for they have borne illegitimate children. Now the New Moon will devour them along with their land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_8","029_5_8","HOS","5","8","8","Blow the ram’s horn in Gibeah, the trumpet in Ramah; raise the battle cry in Beth-aven: Lead on, O Benjamin! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_9","029_5_9","HOS","5","9","9","Ephraim will be laid waste on the day of rebuke. Among the tribes of Israel I proclaim what is certain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_10","029_5_10","HOS","5","10","10","The princes of Judah are like those who move boundary stones; I will pour out My fury upon them like water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_11","029_5_11","HOS","5","11","11","Ephraim is oppressed, crushed in judgment, for he is determined to follow worthless idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_12","029_5_12","HOS","5","12","12","So I am like a moth to Ephraim, and like decay to the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_13","029_5_13","HOS","5","13","13","When Ephraim saw his sickness and Judah his wound, then Ephraim turned to Assyria and sent to the great king. But he cannot cure you or heal your wound. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_14","029_5_14","HOS","5","14","14","For I am like a lion to Ephraim and like a young lion to the house of Judah. I, even I, will tear them to pieces and then go away. I will carry them off where no one can rescue them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS5_15","029_5_15","HOS","5","15","15","Then I will return to My place until they admit their guilt and seek My face; in their affliction they will earnestly seek Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_1","029_6_1","HOS","6","1","1","Come, let us return to the LORD. For He has torn us to pieces, but He will heal us; He has wounded us, but He will bind up our wounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_2","029_6_2","HOS","6","2","2","After two days He will revive us; on the third day He will raise us up, that we may live in His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_3","029_6_3","HOS","6","3","3","So let us know—let us press on to know the LORD. As surely as the sun rises, He will appear; He will come to us like the rain, like the spring showers that water the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_4","029_6_4","HOS","6","4","4","What shall I do with you, O Ephraim? What shall I do with you, O Judah? For your loyalty is like a morning mist, like the early dew that vanishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_5","029_6_5","HOS","6","5","5","Therefore I have hewn them by the prophets; I have slain them by the words of My mouth, and My judgments go forth like lightning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_6","029_6_6","HOS","6","6","6","For I desire mercy, not sacrifice, and the knowledge of God rather than burnt offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_7","029_6_7","HOS","6","7","7","But they, like Adam, have transgressed the covenant; there they were unfaithful to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_8","029_6_8","HOS","6","8","8","Gilead is a city of evildoers, tracked with footprints of blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_9","029_6_9","HOS","6","9","9","Like raiders who lie in ambush, so does a band of priests; they murder on the way to Shechem; surely they have committed atrocities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_10","029_6_10","HOS","6","10","10","In the house of Israel I have seen a horrible thing: Ephraim practices prostitution there, and Israel is defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS6_11","029_6_11","HOS","6","11","11","Also for you, O Judah, a harvest is appointed, when I restore My people from captivity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_1","029_7_1","HOS","7","1","1","When I heal Israel, the iniquity of Ephraim will be exposed, as well as the crimes of Samaria. For they practice deceit and thieves break in; bandits raid in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_2","029_7_2","HOS","7","2","2","But they fail to consider in their hearts that I remember all their evil. Now their deeds are all around them; they are before My face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_3","029_7_3","HOS","7","3","3","They delight the king with their evil, and the princes with their lies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_4","029_7_4","HOS","7","4","4","They are all adulterers, like an oven heated by a baker who needs not stoke the fire from the kneading to the rising of the dough. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_5","029_7_5","HOS","7","5","5","The princes are inflamed with wine on the day of our king; so he joins hands with those who mock him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_6","029_7_6","HOS","7","6","6","For they prepare their heart like an oven while they lie in wait; all night their anger smolders; in the morning it blazes like a flaming fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_7","029_7_7","HOS","7","7","7","All of them are hot as an oven, and they devour their rulers. All their kings fall; not one of them calls upon Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_8","029_7_8","HOS","7","8","8","Ephraim mixes with the nations; Ephraim is an unturned cake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_9","029_7_9","HOS","7","9","9","Foreigners consume his strength, but he does not notice. Even his hair is streaked with gray, but he does not know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_10","029_7_10","HOS","7","10","10","Israel’s arrogance testifies against them, yet they do not return to the LORD their God; despite all this, they do not seek Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_11","029_7_11","HOS","7","11","11","So Ephraim has become like a silly, senseless dove—calling out to Egypt, then turning to Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_12","029_7_12","HOS","7","12","12","As they go, I will spread My net over them; I will bring them down like birds of the air. I will chastise them when I hear them flocking together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_13","029_7_13","HOS","7","13","13","Woe to them, for they have strayed from Me! Destruction to them, for they have rebelled against Me! Though I would redeem them, they speak lies against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_14","029_7_14","HOS","7","14","14","They do not cry out to Me from their hearts when they wail upon their beds. They slash themselves for grain and new wine, but turn away from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_15","029_7_15","HOS","7","15","15","Although I trained and strengthened their arms, they plot evil against Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS7_16","029_7_16","HOS","7","16","16","They turn, but not to the Most High; they are like a faulty bow. Their leaders will fall by the sword for the cursing of their tongue; for this they will be ridiculed in the land of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_1","029_8_1","HOS","8","1","1","Put the ram’s horn to your lips! An eagle looms over the house of the LORD, because the people have transgressed My covenant and rebelled against My law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_2","029_8_2","HOS","8","2","2","Israel cries out to Me, “O our God, we know You!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_3","029_8_3","HOS","8","3","3","But Israel has rejected good; an enemy will pursue him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_4","029_8_4","HOS","8","4","4","They set up kings, but not by Me. They make princes, but without My approval. With their silver and gold they make themselves idols, to their own destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_5","029_8_5","HOS","8","5","5","He has rejected your calf, O Samaria. My anger burns against them. How long will they be incapable of innocence? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_6","029_8_6","HOS","8","6","6","For this thing is from Israel—a craftsman made it, and it is not God. It will be broken to pieces, that calf of Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_7","029_8_7","HOS","8","7","7","For they sow the wind, and they shall reap the whirlwind. There is no standing grain; what sprouts fails to yield flour. Even if it should produce, the foreigners would swallow it up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_8","029_8_8","HOS","8","8","8","Israel is swallowed up! Now they are among the nations like a worthless vessel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_9","029_8_9","HOS","8","9","9","For they have gone up to Assyria like a wild donkey on its own. Ephraim has hired lovers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_10","029_8_10","HOS","8","10","10","Though they hire allies among the nations, I will now round them up, and they will begin to diminish under the oppression of the king of princes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_11","029_8_11","HOS","8","11","11","Though Ephraim multiplied the altars for sin, they became his altars for sinning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_12","029_8_12","HOS","8","12","12","Though I wrote for them the great things of My law, they regarded them as something strange. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_13","029_8_13","HOS","8","13","13","Though they offer sacrifices as gifts to Me, and though they eat the meat, the LORD does not accept them. Now He will remember their iniquity and punish their sins: They will return to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS8_14","029_8_14","HOS","8","14","14","Israel has forgotten his Maker and built palaces; Judah has multiplied its fortified cities. But I will send fire upon their cities, and it will consume their citadels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_1","029_9_1","HOS","9","1","1","Do not rejoice, O Israel, with exultation like the nations, for you have played the harlot against your God; you have made love for hire on every threshing floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_2","029_9_2","HOS","9","2","2","The threshing floor and winepress will not feed them, and the new wine will fail them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_3","029_9_3","HOS","9","3","3","They will not remain in the land of the LORD; Ephraim will return to Egypt and eat unclean food in Assyria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_4","029_9_4","HOS","9","4","4","They will not pour out wine offerings to the LORD, and their sacrifices will not please Him, but will be to them like the bread of mourners; all who eat will be defiled. For their bread will be for themselves; it will not enter the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_5","029_9_5","HOS","9","5","5","What will you do on the appointed day, on the day of the LORD’s feast? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_6","029_9_6","HOS","9","6","6","For even if they flee destruction, Egypt will gather them and Memphis will bury them. Their precious silver will be taken over by thistles, and thorns will overrun their tents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_7","029_9_7","HOS","9","7","7","The days of punishment have come; the days of retribution have arrived—let Israel know it. The prophet is called a fool, and the inspired man insane, because of the greatness of your iniquity and hostility. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_8","029_9_8","HOS","9","8","8","The prophet is Ephraim’s watchman, along with my God, yet the snare of the fowler lies on all his paths. Hostility is in the house of his God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_9","029_9_9","HOS","9","9","9","They have deeply corrupted themselves as in the days of Gibeah; He will remember their guilt; He will punish their sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_10","029_9_10","HOS","9","10","10","I found Israel like grapes in the wilderness. I saw your fathers as the firstfruits of the fig tree in its first season. But they went to Baal-peor, and consecrated themselves to Shame; so they became as detestable as the thing they loved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_11","029_9_11","HOS","9","11","11","Ephraim’s glory will fly away like a bird, with no birth, no pregnancy, and no conception. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_12","029_9_12","HOS","9","12","12","Even if they raise their children, I will bereave them of each one. Yes, woe be to them when I turn away from them! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_13","029_9_13","HOS","9","13","13","I have seen Ephraim, like Tyre, planted in a meadow. But Ephraim will bring out his children for slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_14","029_9_14","HOS","9","14","14","Give them, O LORD—what will You give? Give them wombs that miscarry and breasts that dry up! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_15","029_9_15","HOS","9","15","15","All their evil appears at Gilgal, for there I hated them. I will drive them from My house for the wickedness of their deeds. I will no longer love them; all their leaders are rebellious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_16","029_9_16","HOS","9","16","16","Ephraim is struck down; their root is withered; they cannot bear fruit. Even if they bear children, I will slay the darlings of their wombs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS9_17","029_9_17","HOS","9","17","17","My God will reject them because they have not obeyed Him; and they shall be wanderers among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_1","029_10_1","HOS","10","1","1","Israel was a luxuriant vine, yielding fruit for himself. The more his fruit increased, the more he increased the altars. The better his land produced, the better he made the sacred pillars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_2","029_10_2","HOS","10","2","2","Their hearts are devious; now they must bear their guilt. The LORD will break down their altars and demolish their sacred pillars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_3","029_10_3","HOS","10","3","3","Surely now they will say, “We have no king, for we do not revere the LORD. What can a king do for us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_4","029_10_4","HOS","10","4","4","They speak mere words; with false oaths they make covenants. So judgment springs up like poisonous weeds in the furrows of a field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_5","029_10_5","HOS","10","5","5","The people of Samaria will fear for the calf of Beth-aven. Indeed, its people will mourn over it with its idolatrous priests—those who rejoiced in its glory—for it has been taken from them into exile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_6","029_10_6","HOS","10","6","6","Yes, it will be carried to Assyria as tribute to the great king. Ephraim will be seized with shame; Israel will be ashamed of its wooden idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_7","029_10_7","HOS","10","7","7","Samaria will be carried off with her king like a twig on the surface of the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_8","029_10_8","HOS","10","8","8","The high places of Aven will be destroyed—it is the sin of Israel; thorns and thistles will overgrow their altars. Then they will say to the mountains, “Cover us!” and to the hills, “Fall on us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_9","029_10_9","HOS","10","9","9","Since the days of Gibeah you have sinned, O Israel, and there you have remained. Did not the battle in Gibeah overtake the sons of iniquity? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_10","029_10_10","HOS","10","10","10","I will chasten them when I please; nations will be gathered against them to put them in bondage for their double transgression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_11","029_10_11","HOS","10","11","11","Ephraim is a well-trained heifer that loves to thresh; but I will place a yoke on her fair neck. I will harness Ephraim, Judah will plow, and Jacob will break the hard ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_12","029_10_12","HOS","10","12","12","Sow for yourselves righteousness and reap the fruit of loving devotion; break up your unplowed ground. For it is time to seek the LORD until He comes and sends righteousness upon you like rain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_13","029_10_13","HOS","10","13","13","You have plowed wickedness and reaped injustice; you have eaten the fruit of lies. Because you have trusted in your own way and in the multitude of your mighty men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_14","029_10_14","HOS","10","14","14","the roar of battle will rise against your people, so that all your fortresses will be demolished as Shalman devastated Beth-arbel in the day of battle, when mothers were dashed to pieces along with their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS10_15","029_10_15","HOS","10","15","15","Thus it will be done to you, O Bethel, because of your great wickedness. When the day dawns, the king of Israel will be utterly cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_1","029_11_1","HOS","11","1","1","When Israel was a child, I loved him, and out of Egypt I called My son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_2","029_11_2","HOS","11","2","2","But the more I called Israel, the farther they departed from Me. They sacrificed to the Baals and burned incense to carved images. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_3","029_11_3","HOS","11","3","3","It was I who taught Ephraim to walk, taking them by the arms, but they never realized that it was I who healed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_4","029_11_4","HOS","11","4","4","I led them with cords of kindness, with ropes of love; I lifted the yoke from their necks and bent down to feed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_5","029_11_5","HOS","11","5","5","Will they not return to the land of Egypt and be ruled by Assyria because they refused to repent? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_6","029_11_6","HOS","11","6","6","A sword will flash through their cities; it will destroy the bars of their gates and consume them in their own plans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_7","029_11_7","HOS","11","7","7","My people are bent on turning from Me. Though they call to the Most High, He will by no means exalt them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_8","029_11_8","HOS","11","8","8","How could I give you up, O Ephraim? How could I surrender you, O Israel? How could I make you like Admah? How could I treat you like Zeboiim? My heart is turned within Me; My compassion is stirred! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_9","029_11_9","HOS","11","9","9","I will not execute the full fury of My anger; I will not destroy Ephraim again. For I am God and not man—the Holy One among you—and I will not come in wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_10","029_11_10","HOS","11","10","10","They will walk after the LORD; He will roar like a lion. When He roars, His children will come trembling from the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_11","029_11_11","HOS","11","11","11","They will come trembling like birds from Egypt and like doves from the land of Assyria. Then I will settle them in their homes, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS11_12","029_11_12","HOS","11","12","12","Ephraim surrounds Me with lies, the house of Israel with deceit; but Judah still walks with God and is faithful to the Holy One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_1","029_12_1","HOS","12","1","1","Ephraim feeds on the wind and pursues the east wind all day long; he multiplies lies and violence; he makes a covenant with Assyria and sends olive oil to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_2","029_12_2","HOS","12","2","2","The LORD has a charge to bring against Judah. He will punish Jacob according to his ways and repay him according to his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_3","029_12_3","HOS","12","3","3","In the womb he grasped his brother’s heel, and in his vigor he wrestled with God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_4","029_12_4","HOS","12","4","4","Yes, he struggled with the angel and prevailed; he wept and sought His favor; he found Him at Bethel and spoke with Him there— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_5","029_12_5","HOS","12","5","5","the LORD God of Hosts, the LORD is His name of renown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_6","029_12_6","HOS","12","6","6","But you must return to your God; maintain love and justice, and always wait on your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_7","029_12_7","HOS","12","7","7","A merchant loves to defraud with dishonest scales in his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_8","029_12_8","HOS","12","8","8","And Ephraim boasts: “How rich I have become! I have found wealth for myself. In all my labors, they can find in me no iniquity that is sinful.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_9","029_12_9","HOS","12","9","9","But I am the LORD your God ever since the land of Egypt. I will again make you dwell in tents, as in the days of the appointed feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_10","029_12_10","HOS","12","10","10","I spoke through the prophets and multiplied their visions; I gave parables through the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_11","029_12_11","HOS","12","11","11","Is there iniquity in Gilead? They will surely come to nothing. Do they sacrifice bulls in Gilgal? Indeed, their altars will be heaps of stones in the furrows of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_12","029_12_12","HOS","12","12","12","Jacob fled to the land of Aram and Israel worked for a wife—for a wife he tended sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_13","029_12_13","HOS","12","13","13","But by a prophet the LORD brought Israel out of Egypt, and by a prophet he was preserved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS12_14","029_12_14","HOS","12","14","14","Ephraim has provoked bitter anger, so his Lord will leave his bloodguilt upon him and repay him for his contempt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_1","029_13_1","HOS","13","1","1","When Ephraim spoke, there was trembling; he was exalted in Israel. But he incurred guilt through Baal, and he died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_2","029_13_2","HOS","13","2","2","Now they sin more and more and make for themselves cast images, idols skillfully made from their silver, all of them the work of craftsmen. People say of them, “They offer human sacrifice and kiss the calves!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_3","029_13_3","HOS","13","3","3","Therefore they will be like the morning mist, like the early dew that vanishes, like chaff blown from a threshing floor, like smoke through an open window. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_4","029_13_4","HOS","13","4","4","Yet I am the LORD your God ever since the land of Egypt; you know no God but Me, for there is no Savior besides Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_5","029_13_5","HOS","13","5","5","I knew you in the wilderness, in the land of drought. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_6","029_13_6","HOS","13","6","6","When they had pasture, they became satisfied; when they were satisfied, their hearts became proud, and as a result they forgot Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_7","029_13_7","HOS","13","7","7","So like a lion I will pounce on them; like a leopard I will lurk by the path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_8","029_13_8","HOS","13","8","8","Like a bear robbed of her cubs I will attack them, and I will tear open their chests. There I will devour them like a lion, like a wild beast tearing them apart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_9","029_13_9","HOS","13","9","9","You are destroyed, O Israel, because you are against Me—against your helper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_10","029_13_10","HOS","13","10","10","Where is your king now to save you in all your cities, and the rulers to whom you said, “Give me a king and princes”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_11","029_13_11","HOS","13","11","11","So in My anger I gave you a king, and in My wrath I took him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_12","029_13_12","HOS","13","12","12","The iniquity of Ephraim is bound up; his sin is stored up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_13","029_13_13","HOS","13","13","13","Labor pains come upon him, but he is an unwise son. When the time arrives, he fails to present himself at the opening of the womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_14","029_13_14","HOS","13","14","14","I will ransom them from the power of Sheol; I will redeem them from Death. Where, O Death, are your plagues? Where, O Sheol, is your sting? Compassion is hidden from My eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_15","029_13_15","HOS","13","15","15","Although he flourishes among his brothers, an east wind will come—a wind from the LORD rising up from the desert. His fountain will fail, and his spring will run dry. The wind will plunder his treasury of every precious article. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS13_16","029_13_16","HOS","13","16","16","Samaria will bear her guilt because she has rebelled against her God. They will fall by the sword; their little ones will be dashed to pieces, and their pregnant women ripped open. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_1","029_14_1","HOS","14","1","1","Return, O Israel, to the LORD your God, for you have stumbled by your iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_2","029_14_2","HOS","14","2","2","Bring your confessions and return to the LORD. Say to Him: “Take away all our iniquity and receive us graciously, that we may present the fruit of our lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_3","029_14_3","HOS","14","3","3","Assyria will not save us, nor will we ride on horses. We will never again say, ‘Our gods!’ to the work of our own hands. For in You the fatherless find compassion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_4","029_14_4","HOS","14","4","4","I will heal their apostasy; I will freely love them, for My anger has turned away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_5","029_14_5","HOS","14","5","5","I will be like the dew to Israel; he will blossom like the lily and take root like the cedars of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_6","029_14_6","HOS","14","6","6","His shoots will sprout, and his splendor will be like the olive tree, his fragrance like the cedars of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_7","029_14_7","HOS","14","7","7","They will return and dwell in his shade; they will grow grain and blossom like the vine. His renown will be like the wine of Lebanon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_8","029_14_8","HOS","14","8","8","O Ephraim, what have I to do anymore with idols? It is I who answer and watch over him. I am like a flourishing cypress; your fruit comes from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HS14_9","029_14_9","HOS","14","9","9","Whoever is wise, let him understand these things; whoever is discerning, let him know them. For the ways of the LORD are right, and the righteous walk in them but the rebellious stumble in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_1","030_1_1","JOL","1","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Joel son of Pethuel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_2","030_1_2","JOL","1","2","2","Hear this, O elders; and give ear, all who dwell in the land. Has anything like this ever happened in your days or in the days of your fathers? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_3","030_1_3","JOL","1","3","3","Tell it to your children; let your children tell it to their children, and their children to the next generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_4","030_1_4","JOL","1","4","4","What the devouring locust has left, the swarming locust has eaten; what the swarming locust has left, the young locust has eaten; and what the young locust has left, the destroying locust has eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_5","030_1_5","JOL","1","5","5","Wake up, you drunkards, and weep; wail, all you drinkers of wine, because of the sweet wine, for it has been cut off from your mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_6","030_1_6","JOL","1","6","6","For a nation has invaded My land, powerful and without number; its teeth are the teeth of a lion, and its fangs are the fangs of a lioness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_7","030_1_7","JOL","1","7","7","It has laid waste My grapevine and splintered My fig tree. It has stripped off the bark and thrown it away; the branches have turned white. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_8","030_1_8","JOL","1","8","8","Wail like a virgin dressed in sackcloth, grieving for the husband of her youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_9","030_1_9","JOL","1","9","9","Grain and drink offerings have been cut off from the house of the LORD; the priests are in mourning, those who minister before the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_10","030_1_10","JOL","1","10","10","The field is ruined; the land mourns. For the grain is destroyed, the new wine is dried up, and the oil fails. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_11","030_1_11","JOL","1","11","11","Be dismayed, O farmers, wail, O vinedressers, over the wheat and barley, because the harvest of the field has perished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_12","030_1_12","JOL","1","12","12","The grapevine is dried up, and the fig tree is withered; the pomegranate, palm, and apple—all the trees of the orchard—are withered. Surely the joy of mankind has dried up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_13","030_1_13","JOL","1","13","13","Put on sackcloth and lament, O priests; wail, O ministers of the altar. Come, spend the night in sackcloth, O ministers of my God, because the grain and drink offerings are withheld from the house of your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_14","030_1_14","JOL","1","14","14","Consecrate a fast; proclaim a solemn assembly! Gather the elders and all the residents of the land to the house of the LORD your God, and cry out to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_15","030_1_15","JOL","1","15","15","Alas for the day! For the Day of the LORD is near, and it will come as destruction from the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_16","030_1_16","JOL","1","16","16","Has not the food been cut off before our very eyes—joy and gladness from the house of our God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_17","030_1_17","JOL","1","17","17","The seeds lie shriveled beneath the clods; the storehouses are in ruins; the granaries are broken down, for the grain has withered away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_18","030_1_18","JOL","1","18","18","How the cattle groan! The herds wander in confusion because they have no pasture. Even the flocks of sheep are suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_19","030_1_19","JOL","1","19","19","To You, O LORD, I call, for fire has consumed the open pastures and flames have scorched all the trees of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL1_20","030_1_20","JOL","1","20","20","Even the beasts of the field pant for You, for the streams of water have dried up, and fire has consumed the open pastures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_1","030_2_1","JOL","2","1","1","Blow the ram’s horn in Zion; sound the alarm on My holy mountain! Let all who dwell in the land tremble, for the Day of the LORD is coming; indeed, it is near— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_2","030_2_2","JOL","2","2","2","a day of darkness and gloom, a day of clouds and blackness. Like the dawn overspreading the mountains a great and strong army appears, such as never was of old, nor will ever be in ages to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_3","030_2_3","JOL","2","3","3","Before them a fire devours, and behind them a flame scorches. The land before them is like the Garden of Eden, but behind them, it is like a desert wasteland—surely nothing will escape them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_4","030_2_4","JOL","2","4","4","Their appearance is like that of horses, and they gallop like swift steeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_5","030_2_5","JOL","2","5","5","With a sound like that of chariots they bound over the mountaintops, like the crackling of fire consuming stubble, like a mighty army deployed for battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_6","030_2_6","JOL","2","6","6","Nations writhe in horror before them; every face turns pale. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_7","030_2_7","JOL","2","7","7","They charge like mighty men; they scale the walls like men of war. Each one marches in formation, not swerving from the course. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_8","030_2_8","JOL","2","8","8","They do not jostle one another; each proceeds in his path. They burst through the defenses, never breaking ranks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_9","030_2_9","JOL","2","9","9","They storm the city; they run along the wall; they climb into houses, entering through windows like thieves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_10","030_2_10","JOL","2","10","10","Before them the earth quakes; the heavens tremble. The sun and moon grow dark, and the stars lose their brightness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_11","030_2_11","JOL","2","11","11","The LORD raises His voice in the presence of His army. Indeed, His camp is very large, for mighty are those who obey His command. For the Day of the LORD is great and very dreadful. Who can endure it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_12","030_2_12","JOL","2","12","12","“Yet even now,” declares the LORD, “return to Me with all your heart, with fasting, weeping, and mourning.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_13","030_2_13","JOL","2","13","13","So rend your hearts and not your garments, and return to the LORD your God. For He is gracious and compassionate, slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion. And He relents from sending disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_14","030_2_14","JOL","2","14","14","Who knows? He may turn and relent and leave a blessing behind Him—grain and drink offerings for the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_15","030_2_15","JOL","2","15","15","Blow the ram’s horn in Zion, consecrate a fast, proclaim a sacred assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_16","030_2_16","JOL","2","16","16","Gather the people, sanctify the congregation, assemble the aged, gather the children, even those nursing at the breast. Let the bridegroom leave his room, and the bride her chamber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_17","030_2_17","JOL","2","17","17","Let the priests who minister before the LORD weep between the portico and the altar, saying, “Spare Your people, O LORD, and do not make Your heritage a reproach, an object of scorn among the nations. Why should they say among the peoples, ‘Where is their God?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_18","030_2_18","JOL","2","18","18","Then the LORD became jealous for His land, and He spared His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_19","030_2_19","JOL","2","19","19","And the LORD answered His people: “Behold, I will send you grain, new wine, and oil, and by them you will be satisfied. I will never again make you a reproach among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_20","030_2_20","JOL","2","20","20","The northern army I will drive away from you, banishing it to a barren and desolate land, its front ranks into the Eastern Sea, and its rear guard into the Western Sea. And its stench will rise; its foul odor will ascend. For He has done great things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_21","030_2_21","JOL","2","21","21","Do not be afraid, O land; rejoice and be glad, for the LORD has done great things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_22","030_2_22","JOL","2","22","22","Do not be afraid, O beasts of the field, for the open pastures have turned green, the trees bear their fruit, and the fig tree and vine yield their best. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_23","030_2_23","JOL","2","23","23","Be glad, O children of Zion, and rejoice in the LORD your God, for He has given you the autumn rains for your vindication. He sends you showers, both autumn and spring rains, as before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_24","030_2_24","JOL","2","24","24","The threshing floors will be full of grain, and the vats will overflow with new wine and oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_25","030_2_25","JOL","2","25","25","I will repay you for the years eaten by locusts—the swarming locust, the young locust, the destroying locust, and the devouring locust—My great army that I sent against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_26","030_2_26","JOL","2","26","26","You will have plenty to eat, until you are satisfied. You will praise the name of the LORD your God, who has worked wonders for you. My people will never again be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_27","030_2_27","JOL","2","27","27","Then you will know that I am present in Israel and that I am the LORD your God, and there is no other. My people will never again be put to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_28","030_2_28","JOL","2","28","28","And afterward, I will pour out My Spirit on all people. Your sons and daughters will prophesy, your old men will dream dreams, your young men will see visions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_29","030_2_29","JOL","2","29","29","Even on My menservants and maidservants, I will pour out My Spirit in those days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_30","030_2_30","JOL","2","30","30","I will show wonders in the heavens and on the earth, blood and fire and columns of smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_31","030_2_31","JOL","2","31","31","The sun will be turned to darkness and the moon to blood before the coming of the great and awesome Day of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL2_32","030_2_32","JOL","2","32","32","And everyone who calls on the name of the LORD will be saved; for on Mount Zion and in Jerusalem there will be deliverance, as the LORD has promised, among the remnant called by the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_1","030_3_1","JOL","3","1","1","“Yes, in those days and at that time, when I restore Judah and Jerusalem from captivity, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_2","030_3_2","JOL","3","2","2","I will gather all the nations and bring them down to the Valley of Jehoshaphat. There I will enter into judgment against them concerning My people, My inheritance, Israel, whom they have scattered among the nations as they divided up My land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_3","030_3_3","JOL","3","3","3","They cast lots for My people; they bartered a boy for a prostitute and sold a girl for wine to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_4","030_3_4","JOL","3","4","4","Now what do you have against Me, O Tyre, Sidon, and all the regions of Philistia? Are you rendering against Me a recompense? If you retaliate against Me, I will swiftly and speedily return your recompense upon your heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_5","030_3_5","JOL","3","5","5","For you took My silver and gold and carried off My finest treasures to your temples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_6","030_3_6","JOL","3","6","6","You sold the people of Judah and Jerusalem to the Greeks, to send them far from their homeland. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_7","030_3_7","JOL","3","7","7","Behold, I will rouse them from the places to which you sold them; I will return your recompense upon your heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_8","030_3_8","JOL","3","8","8","I will sell your sons and daughters into the hands of the people of Judah, and they will sell them to the Sabeans—to a distant nation.” Indeed, the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_9","030_3_9","JOL","3","9","9","Proclaim this among the nations: “Prepare for war; rouse the mighty men; let all the men of war advance and attack! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_10","030_3_10","JOL","3","10","10","Beat your plowshares into swords and your pruning hooks into spears. Let the weak say, ‘I am strong!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_11","030_3_11","JOL","3","11","11","Come quickly, all you surrounding nations, and gather yourselves. Bring down Your mighty ones, O LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_12","030_3_12","JOL","3","12","12","Let the nations be roused and advance to the Valley of Jehoshaphat, for there I will sit down to judge all the nations on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_13","030_3_13","JOL","3","13","13","Swing the sickle, for the harvest is ripe. Come, trample the grapes, for the winepress is full; the wine vats overflow because their wickedness is great. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_14","030_3_14","JOL","3","14","14","Multitudes, multitudes in the valley of decision! For the Day of the LORD is near in the valley of decision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_15","030_3_15","JOL","3","15","15","The sun and moon will grow dark, and the stars will no longer shine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_16","030_3_16","JOL","3","16","16","The LORD will roar from Zion and raise His voice from Jerusalem; heaven and earth will tremble. But the LORD will be a refuge for His people, a stronghold for the people of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_17","030_3_17","JOL","3","17","17","Then you will know that I am the LORD your God, who dwells in Zion, My holy mountain. Jerusalem will be holy, never again to be overrun by foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_18","030_3_18","JOL","3","18","18","And in that day the mountains will drip with sweet wine, and the hills will flow with milk. All the streams of Judah will run with water, and a spring will flow from the house of the LORD to water the Valley of Acacias. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_19","030_3_19","JOL","3","19","19","Egypt will become desolate, and Edom a desert wasteland, because of the violence done to the people of Judah, in whose land they shed innocent blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_20","030_3_20","JOL","3","20","20","But Judah will be inhabited forever, and Jerusalem from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JL3_21","030_3_21","JOL","3","21","21","For I will avenge their blood, which I have not yet avenged.” For the LORD dwells in Zion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_1","031_1_1","AMO","1","1","1","These are the words of Amos, who was among the sheepherders of Tekoa—what he saw concerning Israel two years before the earthquake, in the days when Uzziah was king of Judah and Jeroboam son of Jehoash was king of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_2","031_1_2","AMO","1","2","2","He said: “The LORD roars from Zion and raises His voice from Jerusalem; the pastures of the shepherds mourn, and the summit of Carmel withers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_3","031_1_3","AMO","1","3","3","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Damascus, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they threshed Gilead with sledges of iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_4","031_1_4","AMO","1","4","4","So I will send fire upon the house of Hazael to consume the citadels of Ben-hadad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_5","031_1_5","AMO","1","5","5","I will break down the gates of Damascus; I will cut off the ruler from the Valley of Aven and the one who wields the scepter in Beth-eden. The people of Aram will be exiled to Kir,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_6","031_1_6","AMO","1","6","6","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Gaza, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they exiled a whole population, delivering them up to Edom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_7","031_1_7","AMO","1","7","7","So I will send fire upon the walls of Gaza, to consume its citadels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_8","031_1_8","AMO","1","8","8","I will cut off the ruler of Ashdod and the one who wields the scepter in Ashkelon. I will turn My hand against Ekron, and the remnant of the Philistines will perish,” says the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_9","031_1_9","AMO","1","9","9","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Tyre, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they delivered up a whole congregation of exiles to Edom and broke a covenant of brotherhood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_10","031_1_10","AMO","1","10","10","So I will send fire upon the walls of Tyre to consume its citadels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_11","031_1_11","AMO","1","11","11","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Edom, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because he pursued his brother with the sword and stifled all compassion; his anger raged continually, and his fury flamed incessantly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_12","031_1_12","AMO","1","12","12","So I will send fire upon Teman to consume the citadels of Bozrah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_13","031_1_13","AMO","1","13","13","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of the Ammonites, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they ripped open the pregnant women of Gilead in order to enlarge their territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_14","031_1_14","AMO","1","14","14","So I will kindle a fire in the walls of Rabbah to consume its citadels amid war cries on the day of battle and a violent wind on the day of tempest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM1_15","031_1_15","AMO","1","15","15","Their king will go into exile—he and his princes together,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_1","031_2_1","AMO","2","1","1","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Moab, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because he burned to lime the bones of Edom’s king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_2","031_2_2","AMO","2","2","2","So I will send fire against Moab to consume the citadels of Kerioth. Moab will die in tumult, amid war cries and the sound of the ram’s horn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_3","031_2_3","AMO","2","3","3","I will cut off the ruler of Moab and kill all the officials with him,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_4","031_2_4","AMO","2","4","4","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Judah, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they reject the Law of the LORD and fail to keep His statutes; they are led astray by the lies in which their fathers walked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_5","031_2_5","AMO","2","5","5","So I will send fire upon Judah to consume the citadels of Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_6","031_2_6","AMO","2","6","6","This is what the LORD says: “For three transgressions of Israel, even four, I will not revoke My judgment, because they sell the righteous for silver and the needy for a pair of sandals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_7","031_2_7","AMO","2","7","7","They trample on the heads of the poor as on the dust of the earth; they push the needy out of their way. A man and his father have relations with the same girl and so profane My holy name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_8","031_2_8","AMO","2","8","8","They lie down beside every altar on garments taken in pledge. And in the house of their God, they drink wine obtained through fines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_9","031_2_9","AMO","2","9","9","Yet it was I who destroyed the Amorite before them, though his height was like that of the cedars, and he was as strong as the oaks. Yet I destroyed his fruit above and his roots below. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_10","031_2_10","AMO","2","10","10","And I brought you up from the land of Egypt and led you forty years in the wilderness, that you might take possession of the land of the Amorite. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_11","031_2_11","AMO","2","11","11","I raised up prophets from your sons and Nazirites from your young men. Is this not true, O children of Israel?” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_12","031_2_12","AMO","2","12","12","“But you made the Nazirites drink wine and commanded the prophets not to prophesy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_13","031_2_13","AMO","2","13","13","Behold, I am about to crush you in your place as with a cart full of grain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_14","031_2_14","AMO","2","14","14","Escape will fail the swift, the strong will not prevail by his strength, and the mighty will not save his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_15","031_2_15","AMO","2","15","15","The archer will not stand his ground, the fleet of foot will not escape, and the horseman will not save his life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM2_16","031_2_16","AMO","2","16","16","Even the bravest of mighty men will flee naked on that day,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_1","031_3_1","AMO","3","1","1","Hear this word that the LORD has spoken against you, O children of Israel, against the whole family that I brought up out of the land of Egypt: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_2","031_3_2","AMO","3","2","2","“Only you have I known from all the families of the earth; therefore I will punish you for all your iniquities.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_3","031_3_3","AMO","3","3","3","Can two walk together without agreeing where to go? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_4","031_3_4","AMO","3","4","4","Does a lion roar in the forest when he has no prey? Does a young lion growl in his den if he has caught nothing? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_5","031_3_5","AMO","3","5","5","Does a bird land in a snare where no bait has been set? Does a trap spring from the ground when it has nothing to catch? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_6","031_3_6","AMO","3","6","6","If a ram’s horn sounds in a city, do the people not tremble? If calamity comes to a city, has not the LORD caused it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_7","031_3_7","AMO","3","7","7","Surely the Lord GOD does nothing without revealing His plan to His servants the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_8","031_3_8","AMO","3","8","8","The lion has roared—who will not fear? The Lord GOD has spoken—who will not prophesy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_9","031_3_9","AMO","3","9","9","Proclaim to the citadels of Ashdod and to the citadels of Egypt: “Assemble on the mountains of Samaria; see the great unrest in the city and the acts of oppression in her midst.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_10","031_3_10","AMO","3","10","10","“For they know not how to do right,” declares the LORD. “They store up violence and destruction in their citadels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_11","031_3_11","AMO","3","11","11","Therefore this is what the Lord GOD says: “An enemy will surround the land; he will pull down your strongholds and plunder your citadels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_12","031_3_12","AMO","3","12","12","This is what the LORD says: “As the shepherd snatches from the mouth of the lion two legs or a piece of an ear, so the Israelites dwelling in Samaria will be rescued having just the corner of a bed or the cushion of a couch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_13","031_3_13","AMO","3","13","13","Hear and testify against the house of Jacob, declares the Lord GOD, the God of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_14","031_3_14","AMO","3","14","14","On the day I punish Israel for their transgressions, I will visit destruction on the altars of Bethel; the horns of the altar will be cut off, and they will fall to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM3_15","031_3_15","AMO","3","15","15","I will tear down the winter house along with the summer house; the houses of ivory will also perish, and the great houses will come to an end,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_1","031_4_1","AMO","4","1","1","Hear this word, you cows of Bashan on Mount Samaria, you women who oppress the poor and crush the needy, who say to your husbands, “Bring us more to drink.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_2","031_4_2","AMO","4","2","2","The Lord GOD has sworn by His holiness: “Behold, the days are coming when you will be taken away with hooks, and your posterity with fishhooks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_3","031_4_3","AMO","4","3","3","You will go out through broken walls, each one straight ahead of her, and you will be cast out toward Harmon,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_4","031_4_4","AMO","4","4","4","“Go to Bethel and transgress; rebel even more at Gilgal! Bring your sacrifices every morning, your tithes every three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_5","031_4_5","AMO","4","5","5","Offer leavened bread as a thank offering, and loudly proclaim your freewill offerings. For that is what you children of Israel love to do,” declares the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_6","031_4_6","AMO","4","6","6","“I afflicted all your cities with cleanness of teeth and all your towns with lack of bread, yet you did not return to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_7","031_4_7","AMO","4","7","7","“I also withheld the rain from you when the harvest was three months away. I sent rain on one city but withheld it from another. One field received rain; another without rain withered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_8","031_4_8","AMO","4","8","8","People staggered from city to city for water to drink, but they were not satisfied; yet you did not return to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_9","031_4_9","AMO","4","9","9","“I struck you with blight and mildew in your growing gardens and vineyards; the locust devoured your fig and olive trees, yet you did not return to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_10","031_4_10","AMO","4","10","10","“I sent plagues among you like those of Egypt; I killed your young men with the sword, along with your captured horses. I filled your nostrils with the stench of your camp, yet you did not return to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_11","031_4_11","AMO","4","11","11","“Some of you I overthrew as I overthrew Sodom and Gomorrah, and you were like a firebrand snatched from a blaze, yet you did not return to Me,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_12","031_4_12","AMO","4","12","12","“Therefore, that is what I will do to you, O Israel, and since I will do this to you, prepare to meet your God, O Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM4_13","031_4_13","AMO","4","13","13","For behold, He who forms the mountains, who creates the wind and reveals His thoughts to man, who turns the dawn to darkness and strides on the heights of the earth—the LORD, the God of Hosts, is His name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_1","031_5_1","AMO","5","1","1","Hear this word, O house of Israel, this lamentation I take up against you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_2","031_5_2","AMO","5","2","2","“Fallen is Virgin Israel, never to rise again. She lies abandoned on her land, with no one to raise her up.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_3","031_5_3","AMO","5","3","3","This is what the Lord GOD says: “The city that marches out a thousand strong will have but a hundred left, and the one that marches out a hundred strong will have but ten left in the house of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_4","031_5_4","AMO","5","4","4","For this is what the LORD says to the house of Israel: “Seek Me and live! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_5","031_5_5","AMO","5","5","5","Do not seek Bethel or go to Gilgal; do not journey to Beersheba, for Gilgal will surely go into exile, and Bethel will come to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_6","031_5_6","AMO","5","6","6","Seek the LORD and live, or He will sweep like fire through the house of Joseph; it will devour everything, with no one at Bethel to extinguish it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_7","031_5_7","AMO","5","7","7","There are those who turn justice into wormwood and cast righteousness to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_8","031_5_8","AMO","5","8","8","He who made the Pleiades and Orion, who turns darkness into dawn and darkens day into night, who summons the waters of the sea and pours them over the face of the earth—the LORD is His name— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_9","031_5_9","AMO","5","9","9","He flashes destruction on the strong, so that fury comes upon the stronghold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_10","031_5_10","AMO","5","10","10","There are those who hate the one who reproves in the gate and despise him who speaks with integrity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_11","031_5_11","AMO","5","11","11","Therefore, because you trample on the poor and exact from him a tax of grain, you will never live in the stone houses you have built; you will never drink the wine from the lush vineyards you have planted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_12","031_5_12","AMO","5","12","12","For I know that your transgressions are many and your sins are numerous. You oppress the righteous by taking bribes; you deprive the poor of justice in the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_13","031_5_13","AMO","5","13","13","Therefore, the prudent keep silent in such times, for the days are evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_14","031_5_14","AMO","5","14","14","Seek good, not evil, so that you may live. And the LORD, the God of Hosts, will be with you, as you have claimed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_15","031_5_15","AMO","5","15","15","Hate evil and love good; establish justice in the gate. Perhaps the LORD, the God of Hosts, will be gracious to the remnant of Joseph.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_16","031_5_16","AMO","5","16","16","Therefore this is what the LORD, the God of Hosts, the Lord, says: “There will be wailing in all the public squares and cries of ‘Alas! Alas!’ in all the streets. The farmer will be summoned to mourn, and the mourners to wail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_17","031_5_17","AMO","5","17","17","There will be wailing in all the vineyards, for I will pass through your midst,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_18","031_5_18","AMO","5","18","18","Woe to you who long for the Day of the LORD! What will the Day of the LORD be for you? It will be darkness and not light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_19","031_5_19","AMO","5","19","19","It will be like a man who flees from a lion, only to encounter a bear, or who enters his house and rests his hand against the wall, only to be bitten by a snake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_20","031_5_20","AMO","5","20","20","Will not the Day of the LORD be darkness and not light, even gloom with no brightness in it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_21","031_5_21","AMO","5","21","21","“I hate, I despise your feasts! I cannot stand the stench of your solemn assemblies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_22","031_5_22","AMO","5","22","22","Even though you offer Me burnt offerings and grain offerings, I will not accept them; for your peace offerings of fattened cattle I will have no regard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_23","031_5_23","AMO","5","23","23","Take away from Me the noise of your songs! I will not listen to the music of your harps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_24","031_5_24","AMO","5","24","24","But let justice roll on like a river, and righteousness like an ever-flowing stream. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_25","031_5_25","AMO","5","25","25","Did you bring Me sacrifices and offerings forty years in the wilderness, O house of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_26","031_5_26","AMO","5","26","26","You have taken along Sakkuth your king and Kaiwan your star god, the idols you made for yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM5_27","031_5_27","AMO","5","27","27","Therefore I will send you into exile beyond Damascus,” says the LORD, whose name is the God of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_1","031_6_1","AMO","6","1","1","Woe to those at ease in Zion and those secure on Mount Samaria, the distinguished ones of the foremost nation, to whom the house of Israel comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_2","031_6_2","AMO","6","2","2","Cross over to Calneh and see; go from there to the great Hamath; then go down to Gath of the Philistines. Are you better than these kingdoms? Is their territory larger than yours? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_3","031_6_3","AMO","6","3","3","You dismiss the day of calamity and bring near a reign of violence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_4","031_6_4","AMO","6","4","4","You lie on beds inlaid with ivory, and lounge upon your couches. You dine on lambs from the flock and calves from the stall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_5","031_6_5","AMO","6","5","5","You improvise songs on the harp like David and invent your own musical instruments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_6","031_6_6","AMO","6","6","6","You drink wine by the bowlful and anoint yourselves with the finest oils, but you fail to grieve over the ruin of Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_7","031_6_7","AMO","6","7","7","Therefore, you will now go into exile as the first of the captives, and your feasting and lounging will come to an end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_8","031_6_8","AMO","6","8","8","The Lord GOD has sworn by Himself—the LORD, the God of Hosts, has declared: “I abhor Jacob’s pride and detest his citadels, so I will deliver up the city and everything in it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_9","031_6_9","AMO","6","9","9","And if there are ten men left in one house, they too will die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_10","031_6_10","AMO","6","10","10","And when the relative who is to burn the bodies picks them up to remove them from the house, he will call to one inside, “Is anyone else with you?” “None,” that person will answer. “Silence,” the relative will retort, “for the name of the LORD must not be invoked.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_11","031_6_11","AMO","6","11","11","For the LORD gives a command: “The great house will be smashed to pieces, and the small house to rubble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_12","031_6_12","AMO","6","12","12","“Do horses gallop on the cliffs? Does one plow the sea with oxen? But you have turned justice into poison and the fruit of righteousness into wormwood— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_13","031_6_13","AMO","6","13","13","you who rejoice in Lo-debar and say, ‘Did we not take Karnaim by our own strength?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM6_14","031_6_14","AMO","6","14","14","For behold, I will raise up a nation against you, O house of Israel,” declares the LORD, the God of Hosts, “and they will oppress you from Lebo-hamath to the Brook of the Arabah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_1","031_7_1","AMO","7","1","1","This is what the Lord GOD showed me: He was preparing swarms of locusts just after the king’s harvest, as the late spring crop was coming up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_2","031_7_2","AMO","7","2","2","And when the locusts had eaten every green plant in the land, I said, “Lord GOD, please forgive! How will Jacob survive, since he is so small?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_3","031_7_3","AMO","7","3","3","So the LORD relented from this plan. “It will not happen,” He said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_4","031_7_4","AMO","7","4","4","This is what the Lord GOD showed me: The Lord GOD was calling for judgment by fire. It consumed the great deep and devoured the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_5","031_7_5","AMO","7","5","5","Then I said, “Lord GOD, please stop! How will Jacob survive, since he is so small?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_6","031_7_6","AMO","7","6","6","So the LORD relented from this plan. “It will not happen either,” said the Lord GOD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_7","031_7_7","AMO","7","7","7","This is what He showed me: Behold, the Lord was standing by a wall true to plumb, with a plumb line in His hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_8","031_7_8","AMO","7","8","8","“Amos, what do you see?” asked the LORD. “A plumb line,” I replied. “Behold,” said the Lord, “I am setting a plumb line among My people Israel; I will no longer spare them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_9","031_7_9","AMO","7","9","9","The high places of Isaac will be deserted, and the sanctuaries of Israel will be laid waste; and I will rise up against the house of Jeroboam with My sword.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_10","031_7_10","AMO","7","10","10","Then Amaziah the priest of Bethel sent word to Jeroboam king of Israel, saying, “Amos has conspired against you in the midst of the house of Israel. The land cannot bear all his words, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_11","031_7_11","AMO","7","11","11","for this is what Amos has said: ‘Jeroboam will die by the sword, and Israel will surely go into exile, away from their homeland.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_12","031_7_12","AMO","7","12","12","And Amaziah said to Amos, “Go away, you seer! Flee to the land of Judah; earn your bread there and do your prophesying there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_13","031_7_13","AMO","7","13","13","But never prophesy at Bethel again, because it is the sanctuary of the king and the temple of the kingdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_14","031_7_14","AMO","7","14","14","“I was not a prophet,” Amos replied, “nor was I the son of a prophet; rather, I was a herdsman and a tender of sycamore-fig trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_15","031_7_15","AMO","7","15","15","But the LORD took me from following the flock and said to me, ‘Go, prophesy to My people Israel.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_16","031_7_16","AMO","7","16","16","Now, therefore, hear the word of the LORD. You say: ‘Do not prophesy against Israel; do not preach against the house of Isaac.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM7_17","031_7_17","AMO","7","17","17","Therefore this is what the LORD says: ‘Your wife will become a prostitute in the city, and your sons and daughters will fall by the sword. Your land will be divided by a measuring line, and you yourself will die on pagan soil. And Israel will surely go into exile, away from their homeland.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_1","031_8_1","AMO","8","1","1","This is what the Lord GOD showed me: I saw a basket of summer fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_2","031_8_2","AMO","8","2","2","“Amos, what do you see?” He asked. “A basket of summer fruit,” I replied. So the LORD said to me, “The end has come for My people Israel; I will no longer spare them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_3","031_8_3","AMO","8","3","3","“In that day,” declares the Lord GOD, “the songs of the temple will turn to wailing. Many will be the corpses, strewn in silence everywhere!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_4","031_8_4","AMO","8","4","4","Hear this, you who trample the needy, who do away with the poor of the land, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_5","031_8_5","AMO","8","5","5","asking, “When will the New Moon be over, that we may sell grain? When will the Sabbath end, that we may market wheat? Let us reduce the ephah and increase the shekel; let us cheat with dishonest scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_6","031_8_6","AMO","8","6","6","Let us buy the poor with silver and the needy for a pair of sandals, selling even the chaff with the wheat!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_7","031_8_7","AMO","8","7","7","The LORD has sworn by the Pride of Jacob: “I will never forget any of their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_8","031_8_8","AMO","8","8","8","Will not the land quake for this, and all its dwellers mourn? All of it will swell like the Nile; it will surge and then subside like the Nile in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_9","031_8_9","AMO","8","9","9","And in that day, declares the Lord GOD, I will make the sun go down at noon, and I will darken the earth in the daytime. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_10","031_8_10","AMO","8","10","10","I will turn your feasts into mourning and all your songs into lamentation. I will cause everyone to wear sackcloth and every head to be shaved. I will make it like a time of mourning for an only son, and its outcome like a bitter day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_11","031_8_11","AMO","8","11","11","Behold, the days are coming, declares the Lord GOD, when I will send a famine on the land—not a famine of bread or a thirst for water, but a famine of hearing the words of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_12","031_8_12","AMO","8","12","12","People will stagger from sea to sea and roam from north to east, seeking the word of the LORD, but they will not find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_13","031_8_13","AMO","8","13","13","In that day the lovely young women—the young men as well—will faint from thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM8_14","031_8_14","AMO","8","14","14","Those who swear by the guilt of Samaria and say, ‘As surely as your god lives, O Dan,’ or, ‘As surely as the way of Beersheba lives’—they will fall, never to rise again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_1","031_9_1","AMO","9","1","1","I saw the Lord standing beside the altar, and He said: “Strike the tops of the pillars so that the thresholds shake. Topple them on the heads of all the people, and I will kill the rest with the sword. None of those who flee will get away; none of the fugitives will escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_2","031_9_2","AMO","9","2","2","Though they dig down to Sheol, from there My hand will take them; and though they climb up to heaven, from there I will pull them down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_3","031_9_3","AMO","9","3","3","Though they hide themselves atop Carmel, there I will track them and seize them; and though they hide from Me at the bottom of the sea, there I will command the serpent to bite them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_4","031_9_4","AMO","9","4","4","Though they are driven by their enemies into captivity, there I will command the sword to slay them. I will fix My eyes upon them for harm and not for good.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_5","031_9_5","AMO","9","5","5","The Lord GOD of Hosts, He who touches the earth and it melts, and all its dwellers mourn—all the land rises like the Nile, then sinks like the river of Egypt— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_6","031_9_6","AMO","9","6","6","He builds His upper rooms in the heavens and founds His vault upon the earth. He summons the waters of the sea and pours them over the face of the earth. The LORD is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_7","031_9_7","AMO","9","7","7","“Are you not like the Cushites to Me, O children of Israel?” declares the LORD. “Did I not bring Israel up from the land of Egypt, the Philistines from Caphtor, and the Arameans from Kir? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_8","031_9_8","AMO","9","8","8","Surely the eyes of the Lord GOD are on the sinful kingdom, and I will destroy it from the face of the earth. Yet I will not utterly destroy the house of Jacob,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_9","031_9_9","AMO","9","9","9","“For surely I will give the command, and I will shake the house of Israel among all the nations as grain is sifted in a sieve; but not a pebble will reach the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_10","031_9_10","AMO","9","10","10","All the sinners among My people will die by the sword—all those who say, ‘Disaster will never draw near or confront us.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_11","031_9_11","AMO","9","11","11","“In that day I will restore the fallen tent of David. I will repair its gaps, restore its ruins, and rebuild it as in the days of old, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_12","031_9_12","AMO","9","12","12","that they may possess the remnant of Edom and all the nations that bear My name,” declares the LORD, who will do this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_13","031_9_13","AMO","9","13","13","“Behold, the days are coming,” declares the LORD, “when the plowman will overtake the reaper and the treader of grapes, the sower of seed. The mountains will drip with sweet wine, with which all the hills will flow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_14","031_9_14","AMO","9","14","14","I will restore My people Israel from captivity; they will rebuild and inhabit the ruined cities. They will plant vineyards and drink their wine; they will make gardens and eat their fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AM9_15","031_9_15","AMO","9","15","15","I will firmly plant them in their own land, never again to be uprooted from the land that I have given them,” says the LORD your God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_1","032_1_1","OBA","1","1","1","This is the vision of Obadiah: This is what the Lord GOD says about Edom—We have heard a message from the LORD; an envoy has been sent among the nations to say, “Rise up, and let us go to battle against her!”— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_2","032_1_2","OBA","1","2","2","“Behold, I will make you small among the nations; you will be deeply despised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_3","032_1_3","OBA","1","3","3","The pride of your heart has deceived you, O dwellers in the clefts of the rocks whose habitation is the heights, who say in your heart, ‘Who can bring me down to the ground?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_4","032_1_4","OBA","1","4","4","Though you soar like the eagle and make your nest among the stars, even from there I will bring you down,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_5","032_1_5","OBA","1","5","5","“If thieves came to you, if robbers by night—oh, how you will be ruined—would they not steal only what they wanted? If grape gatherers came to you, would they not leave some gleanings? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_6","032_1_6","OBA","1","6","6","But how Esau will be pillaged, his hidden treasures sought out! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_7","032_1_7","OBA","1","7","7","All the men allied with you will drive you to the border; the men at peace with you will deceive and overpower you. Those who eat your bread will set a trap for you without your awareness of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_8","032_1_8","OBA","1","8","8","In that day, declares the LORD, will I not destroy the wise men of Edom and the men of understanding in the mountains of Esau? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_9","032_1_9","OBA","1","9","9","Then your mighty men, O Teman, will be terrified, so that everyone in the mountains of Esau will be cut down in the slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_10","032_1_10","OBA","1","10","10","Because of the violence against your brother Jacob, you will be covered with shame and cut off forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_11","032_1_11","OBA","1","11","11","On the day you stood aloof while strangers carried off his wealth and foreigners entered his gate and cast lots for Jerusalem, you were just like one of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_12","032_1_12","OBA","1","12","12","But you should not gloat in that day, your brother’s day of misfortune, nor rejoice over the people of Judah in the day of their destruction, nor boast proudly in the day of their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_13","032_1_13","OBA","1","13","13","You should not enter the gate of My people in the day of their disaster, nor gloat over their affliction in the day of their disaster, nor loot their wealth in the day of their disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_14","032_1_14","OBA","1","14","14","Nor should you stand at the crossroads to cut off their fugitives, nor deliver up their survivors in the day of their distress. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_15","032_1_15","OBA","1","15","15","For the Day of the LORD is near for all the nations. As you have done, it will be done to you; your recompense will return upon your own head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_16","032_1_16","OBA","1","16","16","For as you drank on My holy mountain, so all the nations will drink continually. They will drink and gulp it down; they will be as if they had never existed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_17","032_1_17","OBA","1","17","17","But on Mount Zion there will be deliverance, and it will be holy, and the house of Jacob will reclaim their possession. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_18","032_1_18","OBA","1","18","18","Then the house of Jacob will be a blazing fire, and the house of Joseph a burning flame; but the house of Esau will be stubble—Jacob will set it ablaze and consume it. Therefore no survivor will remain from the house of Esau.” For the LORD has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_19","032_1_19","OBA","1","19","19","Those from the Negev will possess the mountains of Esau; those from the foothills will possess the land of the Philistines. They will occupy the fields of Ephraim and Samaria, and Benjamin will possess Gilead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_20","032_1_20","OBA","1","20","20","And the exiles of this host of the Israelites will possess the land of the Canaanites as far as Zarephath; and the exiles from Jerusalem who are in Sepharad will possess the cities of the Negev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("OB1_21","032_1_21","OBA","1","21","21","The deliverers will ascend Mount Zion to rule over the mountains of Esau. And the kingdom will belong to the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_1","033_1_1","JON","1","1","1","Now the word of the LORD came to Jonah son of Amittai, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_2","033_1_2","JON","1","2","2","“Get up! Go to the great city of Nineveh and preach against it, because its wickedness has come up before Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_3","033_1_3","JON","1","3","3","Jonah, however, got up to flee to Tarshish, away from the presence of the LORD. He went down to Joppa and found a ship bound for Tarshish. So he paid the fare and went aboard to sail for Tarshish, away from the presence of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_4","033_1_4","JON","1","4","4","Then the LORD hurled a great wind upon the sea, and such a violent storm arose that the ship was in danger of breaking apart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_5","033_1_5","JON","1","5","5","The sailors were afraid, and each cried out to his own god. And they threw the ship’s cargo into the sea to lighten the load. But Jonah had gone down to the lowest part of the vessel, where he lay down and fell into a deep sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_6","033_1_6","JON","1","6","6","The captain approached him and said, “How can you sleep? Get up and call upon your God. Perhaps this God will consider us, so that we may not perish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_7","033_1_7","JON","1","7","7","“Come!” said the sailors to one another. “Let us cast lots to find out who is responsible for this calamity that is upon us.” So they cast lots, and the lot fell on Jonah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_8","033_1_8","JON","1","8","8","“Tell us now,” they demanded, “who is to blame for this calamity that is upon us? What is your occupation, and where have you come from? What is your country, and who are your people?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_9","033_1_9","JON","1","9","9","“I am a Hebrew,” replied Jonah. “I worship the LORD, the God of the heavens, who made the sea and the dry land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_10","033_1_10","JON","1","10","10","Then the men were even more afraid and said to him, “What have you done?” The men knew that he was fleeing from the presence of the LORD, because he had told them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_11","033_1_11","JON","1","11","11","Now the sea was growing worse and worse, so they said to Jonah, “What must we do to you to calm this sea for us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_12","033_1_12","JON","1","12","12","“Pick me up,” he answered, “and cast me into the sea, so it may quiet down for you. For I know that I am to blame for this violent storm that has come upon you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_13","033_1_13","JON","1","13","13","Nevertheless, the men rowed hard to get back to dry land, but they could not, for the sea was raging against them more and more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_14","033_1_14","JON","1","14","14","So they cried out to the LORD: “Please, O LORD, do not let us perish on account of this man’s life! Do not charge us with innocent blood! For You, O LORD, have done as You pleased.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_15","033_1_15","JON","1","15","15","Then they picked up Jonah and cast him into the sea, and the raging sea grew calm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_16","033_1_16","JON","1","16","16","Then the men feared the LORD greatly, and they offered a sacrifice to the LORD and made vows to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH1_17","033_1_17","JON","1","17","17","Now the LORD had appointed a great fish to swallow Jonah, and Jonah spent three days and three nights in the belly of the fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_1","033_2_1","JON","2","1","1","From inside the fish, Jonah prayed to the LORD his God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_2","033_2_2","JON","2","2","2","saying: “In my distress I called to the LORD, and He answered me. From the belly of Sheol I called for help, and You heard my voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_3","033_2_3","JON","2","3","3","For You cast me into the deep, into the heart of the seas, and the current swirled about me; all Your breakers and waves swept over me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_4","033_2_4","JON","2","4","4","At this, I said, ‘I have been banished from Your sight; yet I will look once more toward Your holy temple.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_5","033_2_5","JON","2","5","5","The waters engulfed me to take my life; the watery depths closed around me; the seaweed wrapped around my head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_6","033_2_6","JON","2","6","6","To the roots of the mountains I descended; the earth beneath me barred me in forever! But You raised my life from the pit, O LORD my God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_7","033_2_7","JON","2","7","7","As my life was fading away, I remembered the LORD. My prayer went up to You, to Your holy temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_8","033_2_8","JON","2","8","8","Those who cling to worthless idols forsake His loving devotion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_9","033_2_9","JON","2","9","9","But I, with the voice of thanksgiving, will sacrifice to You. I will fulfill what I have vowed. Salvation is from the LORD!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH2_10","033_2_10","JON","2","10","10","And the LORD commanded the fish, and it vomited Jonah onto dry land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_1","033_3_1","JON","3","1","1","Then the word of the LORD came to Jonah a second time: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_2","033_3_2","JON","3","2","2","“Get up! Go to the great city of Nineveh and proclaim to it the message that I give you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_3","033_3_3","JON","3","3","3","This time Jonah got up and went to Nineveh, in accordance with the word of the LORD. Now Nineveh was an exceedingly great city, requiring a three-day journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_4","033_3_4","JON","3","4","4","On the first day of his journey, Jonah set out into the city and proclaimed, “Forty more days and Nineveh will be overturned!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_5","033_3_5","JON","3","5","5","And the Ninevites believed God. They proclaimed a fast and dressed in sackcloth, from the greatest of them to the least. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_6","033_3_6","JON","3","6","6","When word reached the king of Nineveh, he got up from his throne, took off his royal robe, covered himself with sackcloth, and sat in ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_7","033_3_7","JON","3","7","7","Then he issued a proclamation in Nineveh: “By the decree of the king and his nobles: Let no man or beast, herd or flock, taste anything at all. They must not eat or drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_8","033_3_8","JON","3","8","8","Furthermore, let both man and beast be covered with sackcloth, and have everyone call out earnestly to God. Let each one turn from his evil ways and from the violence in his hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_9","033_3_9","JON","3","9","9","Who knows? God may turn and relent; He may turn from His fierce anger, so that we will not perish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH3_10","033_3_10","JON","3","10","10","When God saw their actions—that they had turned from their evil ways—He relented from the disaster He had threatened to bring upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_1","033_4_1","JON","4","1","1","Jonah, however, was greatly displeased, and he became angry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_2","033_4_2","JON","4","2","2","So he prayed to the LORD, saying, “O LORD, is this not what I said while I was still in my own country? This is why I was so quick to flee toward Tarshish. I knew that You are a gracious and compassionate God, slow to anger, abounding in loving devotion—One who relents from sending disaster. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_3","033_4_3","JON","4","3","3","And now, O LORD, please take my life from me, for it is better for me to die than to live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_4","033_4_4","JON","4","4","4","But the LORD replied, “Have you any right to be angry?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_5","033_4_5","JON","4","5","5","Then Jonah left the city and sat down east of it, where he made himself a shelter and sat in its shade to see what would happen to the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_6","033_4_6","JON","4","6","6","So the LORD God appointed a vine, and it grew up to provide shade over Jonah’s head to ease his discomfort, and Jonah was greatly pleased with the plant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_7","033_4_7","JON","4","7","7","When dawn came the next day, God appointed a worm that attacked the plant so that it withered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_8","033_4_8","JON","4","8","8","As the sun was rising, God appointed a scorching east wind, and the sun beat down on Jonah’s head so that he grew faint and wished to die, saying, “It is better for me to die than to live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_9","033_4_9","JON","4","9","9","Then God asked Jonah, “Have you any right to be angry about the plant?” “I do,” he replied. “I am angry enough to die!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_10","033_4_10","JON","4","10","10","But the LORD said, “You cared about the plant, which you neither tended nor made grow. It sprang up in a night and perished in a night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JH4_11","033_4_11","JON","4","11","11","So should I not care about the great city of Nineveh, which has more than 120,000 people who cannot tell their right hand from their left, and many cattle as well?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_1","034_1_1","MIC","1","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Micah the Moreshite in the days of Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah, kings of Judah—what he saw regarding Samaria and Jerusalem: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_2","034_1_2","MIC","1","2","2","Hear, O peoples, all of you; listen, O earth, and everyone in it! May the Lord GOD bear witness against you, the Lord from His holy temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_3","034_1_3","MIC","1","3","3","For behold, the LORD comes forth from His dwelling place; He will come down and tread on the high places of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_4","034_1_4","MIC","1","4","4","The mountains will melt beneath Him, and the valleys will split apart, like wax before the fire, like water rushing down a slope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_5","034_1_5","MIC","1","5","5","All this is for the transgression of Jacob and the sins of the house of Israel. What is the transgression of Jacob? Is it not Samaria? And what is the high place of Judah? Is it not Jerusalem? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_6","034_1_6","MIC","1","6","6","Therefore I will make Samaria a heap of rubble in the open field, a planting area for a vineyard. I will pour her stones into the valley and expose her foundations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_7","034_1_7","MIC","1","7","7","All her carved images will be smashed to pieces; all her wages will be burned in the fire, and I will destroy all her idols. Since she collected the wages of a prostitute, they will be used again on a prostitute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_8","034_1_8","MIC","1","8","8","Because of this I will lament and wail; I will walk barefoot and naked. I will howl like a jackal and mourn like an ostrich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_9","034_1_9","MIC","1","9","9","For her wound is incurable; it has reached even Judah; it has approached the gate of my people, as far as Jerusalem itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_10","034_1_10","MIC","1","10","10","Do not tell it in Gath; do not weep at all. Roll in the dust in Beth-leaphrah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_11","034_1_11","MIC","1","11","11","Depart in shameful nakedness, O dwellers of Shaphir. The dwellers of Zaanan will not come out. Beth-ezel is in mourning; its support is taken from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_12","034_1_12","MIC","1","12","12","For the dwellers of Maroth pined for good, but calamity came down from the LORD, even to the gate of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_13","034_1_13","MIC","1","13","13","Harness your chariot horses, O dweller of Lachish. You were the beginning of sin to the Daughter of Zion, for the transgressions of Israel were found in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_14","034_1_14","MIC","1","14","14","Therefore, send farewell gifts to Moresheth-gath; the houses of Achzib will prove deceptive to the kings of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_15","034_1_15","MIC","1","15","15","I will again bring a conqueror against you, O dweller of Mareshah. The glory of Israel will come to Adullam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC1_16","034_1_16","MIC","1","16","16","Shave yourselves bald and cut off your hair in mourning for your precious children; make yourselves as bald as an eagle, for they will go from you into exile. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_1","034_2_1","MIC","2","1","1","Woe to those who devise iniquity and plot evil on their beds! At morning’s light they accomplish it because the power is in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_2","034_2_2","MIC","2","2","2","They covet fields and seize them; they take away houses. They deprive a man of his home, a fellow man of his inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_3","034_2_3","MIC","2","3","3","Therefore this is what the LORD says: “I am planning against this nation a disaster from which you cannot free your necks. Then you will not walk so proudly, for it will be a time of calamity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_4","034_2_4","MIC","2","4","4","In that day they will take up a proverb against you and taunt you with this bitter lamentation: ‘We are utterly ruined! He has changed the portion of my people. How He has removed it from me! He has allotted our fields to traitors.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_5","034_2_5","MIC","2","5","5","Therefore, you will have no one in the assembly of the LORD to divide the land by lot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_6","034_2_6","MIC","2","6","6","“Do not preach,” they preach. “Do not preach these things; disgrace will not overtake us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_7","034_2_7","MIC","2","7","7","Should it be said, O house of Jacob, “Is the Spirit of the LORD impatient? Are these the things He does?” Do not My words bring good to him who walks uprightly? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_8","034_2_8","MIC","2","8","8","But of late My people have risen up like an enemy: You strip off the splendid robe from unsuspecting passersby like men returning from battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_9","034_2_9","MIC","2","9","9","You drive the women of My people from their pleasant homes. You take away My blessing from their children forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_10","034_2_10","MIC","2","10","10","Arise and depart, for this is not your place of rest, because its defilement brings destruction—a grievous destruction! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_11","034_2_11","MIC","2","11","11","If a man of wind were to come and say falsely, “I will preach to you of wine and strong drink,” he would be just the preacher for this people! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_12","034_2_12","MIC","2","12","12","I will surely gather all of you, O Jacob; I will collect the remnant of Israel. I will bring them together like sheep in a pen, like a flock in the midst of its pasture—a noisy throng. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC2_13","034_2_13","MIC","2","13","13","One who breaks open the way will go up before them; they will break through the gate, and go out by it. Their King will pass through before them, the LORD as their leader. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_1","034_3_1","MIC","3","1","1","Then I said: “Hear now, O leaders of Jacob, you rulers of the house of Israel. Should you not know justice? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_2","034_3_2","MIC","3","2","2","You hate good and love evil. You tear the skin from my people and strip the flesh from their bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_3","034_3_3","MIC","3","3","3","You eat the flesh of my people after stripping off their skin and breaking their bones. You chop them up like flesh for the cooking pot, like meat in a cauldron.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_4","034_3_4","MIC","3","4","4","Then they will cry out to the LORD, but He will not answer them. At that time He will hide His face from them because of the evil they have done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_5","034_3_5","MIC","3","5","5","This is what the LORD says: “As for the prophets who lead My people astray, who proclaim peace while they chew with their teeth, but declare war against one who puts nothing in their mouths: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_6","034_3_6","MIC","3","6","6","Therefore night will come over you without visions, and darkness without divination. The sun will set on these prophets, and the daylight will turn black over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_7","034_3_7","MIC","3","7","7","Then the seers will be ashamed and the diviners will be disgraced. They will all cover their mouths because there is no answer from God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_8","034_3_8","MIC","3","8","8","As for me, however, I am filled with power by the Spirit of the LORD, with justice and courage, to declare to Jacob his transgression and to Israel his sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_9","034_3_9","MIC","3","9","9","Now hear this, O leaders of the house of Jacob and rulers of the house of Israel, who despise justice and pervert all that is right, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_10","034_3_10","MIC","3","10","10","who build Zion with bloodshed and Jerusalem with iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_11","034_3_11","MIC","3","11","11","Her leaders judge for a bribe, her priests teach for a price, and her prophets practice divination for money. Yet they lean upon the LORD, saying, “Is not the LORD among us? No disaster can come upon us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC3_12","034_3_12","MIC","3","12","12","Therefore, because of you, Zion will be plowed like a field, Jerusalem will become a heap of rubble, and the temple mount a wooded ridge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_1","034_4_1","MIC","4","1","1","In the last days the mountain of the house of the LORD will be established as the chief of the mountains; it will be raised above the hills, and the peoples will stream to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_2","034_4_2","MIC","4","2","2","And many nations will come and say: “Come, let us go up to the mountain of the LORD, to the house of the God of Jacob. He will teach us His ways, so that we may walk in His paths.” For the law will go forth from Zion and the word of the LORD from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_3","034_4_3","MIC","4","3","3","Then He will judge between many peoples and arbitrate for strong nations far and wide. Then they will beat their swords into plowshares and their spears into pruning hooks. Nation will no longer take up the sword against nation, nor will they train anymore for war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_4","034_4_4","MIC","4","4","4","And each man will sit under his own vine and under his own fig tree, with no one to frighten him. For the mouth of the LORD of Hosts has spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_5","034_4_5","MIC","4","5","5","Though all the nations may walk in the name of their gods, yet we will walk in the name of the LORD our God forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_6","034_4_6","MIC","4","6","6","“On that day,” declares the LORD, “I will gather the lame; I will assemble the outcast, even those whom I have afflicted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_7","034_4_7","MIC","4","7","7","And I will make the lame into a remnant, the outcast into a strong nation. Then the LORD will rule over them in Mount Zion from that day and forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_8","034_4_8","MIC","4","8","8","And you, O watchtower of the flock, O stronghold of the Daughter of Zion—the former dominion will be restored to you; sovereignty will come to the Daughter of Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_9","034_4_9","MIC","4","9","9","Why do you now cry aloud? Is there no king among you? Has your counselor perished so that anguish grips you like a woman in labor? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_10","034_4_10","MIC","4","10","10","Writhe in agony, O Daughter of Zion, like a woman in labor. For now you will leave the city and camp in the open fields. You will go to Babylon; there you will be rescued; there the LORD will redeem you from the hand of your enemies! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_11","034_4_11","MIC","4","11","11","But now many nations have assembled against you, saying, “Let her be defiled, and let us feast our eyes on Zion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_12","034_4_12","MIC","4","12","12","But they do not know the thoughts of the LORD or understand His plan, for He has gathered them like sheaves to the threshing floor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC4_13","034_4_13","MIC","4","13","13","Rise and thresh, O Daughter of Zion, for I will give you horns of iron and hooves of bronze to break to pieces many peoples. Then you will devote their gain to the LORD, their wealth to the Lord of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_1","034_5_1","MIC","5","1","1","Now, O daughter of troops, mobilize your troops; for a siege is laid against us! With a rod they will strike the cheek of the judge of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_2","034_5_2","MIC","5","2","2","But you, Bethlehem Ephrathah, who are small among the clans of Judah, out of you will come forth for Me One to be ruler over Israel—One whose origins are of old, from the days of eternity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_3","034_5_3","MIC","5","3","3","Therefore Israel will be abandoned until she who is in labor has given birth; then the rest of His brothers will return to the children of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_4","034_5_4","MIC","5","4","4","He will stand and shepherd His flock in the strength of the LORD, in the majestic name of the LORD His God. And they will dwell securely, for then His greatness will extend to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_5","034_5_5","MIC","5","5","5","And He will be our peace when Assyria invades our land and tramples our citadels. We will raise against it seven shepherds, even eight leaders of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_6","034_5_6","MIC","5","6","6","And they will rule the land of Assyria with the sword, and the land of Nimrod with the blade drawn. So He will deliver us when Assyria invades our land and marches into our borders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_7","034_5_7","MIC","5","7","7","Then the remnant of Jacob will be in the midst of many peoples like dew from the LORD, like showers on the grass, which do not wait for man or linger for mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_8","034_5_8","MIC","5","8","8","Then the remnant of Jacob will be among the nations, in the midst of many peoples, like a lion among the beasts of the forest, like a young lion among flocks of sheep, which tramples and tears as it passes through, with no one to rescue them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_9","034_5_9","MIC","5","9","9","Your hand will be lifted over your foes, and all your enemies will be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_10","034_5_10","MIC","5","10","10","“In that day,” declares the LORD, “I will remove your horses from among you and wreck your chariots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_11","034_5_11","MIC","5","11","11","I will remove the cities of your land and tear down all your strongholds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_12","034_5_12","MIC","5","12","12","I will cut the sorceries from your hand, and you will have no fortune-tellers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_13","034_5_13","MIC","5","13","13","I will also cut off the carved images and sacred pillars from among you, so that you will no longer bow down to the work of your own hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_14","034_5_14","MIC","5","14","14","I will root out the Asherah poles from your midst and demolish your cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC5_15","034_5_15","MIC","5","15","15","I will take vengeance in anger and wrath upon the nations that have not obeyed Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_1","034_6_1","MIC","6","1","1","Hear now what the LORD says: “Arise, plead your case before the mountains, and let the hills hear your voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_2","034_6_2","MIC","6","2","2","Hear, O mountains, the LORD’s indictment, you enduring foundations of the earth. For the LORD has a case against His people, and He will argue it against Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_3","034_6_3","MIC","6","3","3","‘My people, what have I done to you? Testify against Me how I have wearied you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_4","034_6_4","MIC","6","4","4","For I brought you up from the land of Egypt and redeemed you from the house of slavery. I sent Moses before you, as well as Aaron and Miriam. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_5","034_6_5","MIC","6","5","5","My people, remember what Balak king of Moab counseled and what Balaam son of Beor answered. Remember your journey from Shittim to Gilgal, so that you may acknowledge the righteousness of the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_6","034_6_6","MIC","6","6","6","With what shall I come before the LORD when I bow before the God on high? Should I come to Him with burnt offerings, with year-old calves? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_7","034_6_7","MIC","6","7","7","Would the LORD be pleased with thousands of rams, with ten thousand rivers of oil? Shall I present my firstborn for my transgression, the fruit of my body for the sin of my soul? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_8","034_6_8","MIC","6","8","8","He has shown you, O man, what is good. And what does the LORD require of you but to act justly, to love mercy, and to walk humbly with your God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_9","034_6_9","MIC","6","9","9","The voice of the LORD calls out to the city (and it is sound wisdom to fear Your name): “Heed the rod and the One who ordained it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_10","034_6_10","MIC","6","10","10","Can I forget any longer, O house of the wicked, the treasures of wickedness and the short ephah, which is accursed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_11","034_6_11","MIC","6","11","11","Can I excuse dishonest scales or bags of false weights? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_12","034_6_12","MIC","6","12","12","For the wealthy of the city are full of violence, and its residents speak lies; their tongues are deceitful in their mouths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_13","034_6_13","MIC","6","13","13","Therefore I am striking you severely, to ruin you because of your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_14","034_6_14","MIC","6","14","14","You will eat but not be satisfied, and your hunger will remain with you. What you acquire, you will not preserve; and what you save, I will give to the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_15","034_6_15","MIC","6","15","15","You will sow but not reap; you will press olives but not anoint yourselves with oil; you will tread grapes but not drink the wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC6_16","034_6_16","MIC","6","16","16","You have kept the statutes of Omri and all the practices of Ahab’s house; you have followed their counsel. Therefore I will make you a desolation, and your inhabitants an object of contempt; you will bear the scorn of the nations.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_1","034_7_1","MIC","7","1","1","Woe is me! For I am like one gathering summer fruit at the gleaning of the vineyard; there is no cluster to eat, no early fig that I crave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_2","034_7_2","MIC","7","2","2","The godly man has perished from the earth; there is no one upright among men. They all lie in wait for blood; they hunt one another with a net. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_3","034_7_3","MIC","7","3","3","Both hands are skilled at evil; the prince and the judge demand a bribe. When the powerful utters his evil desire, they all conspire together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_4","034_7_4","MIC","7","4","4","The best of them is like a brier; the most upright is sharper than a hedge of thorns. The day for your watchmen has come, the day of your visitation. Now is the time of their confusion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_5","034_7_5","MIC","7","5","5","Do not rely on a friend; do not trust in a companion. Seal the doors of your mouth from her who lies in your arms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_6","034_7_6","MIC","7","6","6","For a son dishonors his father, a daughter rises against her mother, and a daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law. A man’s enemies are the members of his own household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_7","034_7_7","MIC","7","7","7","But as for me, I will look to the LORD; I will wait for the God of my salvation. My God will hear me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_8","034_7_8","MIC","7","8","8","Do not gloat over me, my enemy! Though I have fallen, I will arise; though I sit in darkness, the LORD will be my light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_9","034_7_9","MIC","7","9","9","Because I have sinned against Him, I must endure the rage of the LORD, until He argues my case and executes justice for me. He will bring me into the light; I will see His righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_10","034_7_10","MIC","7","10","10","Then my enemy will see and will be covered with shame—she who said to me, “Where is the LORD your God?” My eyes will see her; at that time she will be trampled like mud in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_11","034_7_11","MIC","7","11","11","The day for rebuilding your walls will come—the day for extending your boundary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_12","034_7_12","MIC","7","12","12","On that day they will come to you from Assyria and the cities of Egypt, even from Egypt to the Euphrates, from sea to sea and mountain to mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_13","034_7_13","MIC","7","13","13","Then the earth will become desolate because of its inhabitants, as the fruit of their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_14","034_7_14","MIC","7","14","14","Shepherd with Your staff Your people, the flock of Your inheritance. They live alone in a woodland, surrounded by pastures. Let them graze in Bashan and Gilead, as in the days of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_15","034_7_15","MIC","7","15","15","As in the days when you came out of Egypt, I will show My wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_16","034_7_16","MIC","7","16","16","Nations will see and be ashamed, deprived of all their might. They will put their hands over their mouths, and their ears will become deaf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_17","034_7_17","MIC","7","17","17","They will lick the dust like a snake, like reptiles slithering on the ground. They will come trembling from their strongholds in the presence of the LORD our God; they will tremble in fear of You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_18","034_7_18","MIC","7","18","18","Who is a God like You, who pardons iniquity and passes over the transgression of the remnant of His inheritance—who does not retain His anger forever, because He delights in loving devotion? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_19","034_7_19","MIC","7","19","19","He will again have compassion on us; He will vanquish our iniquities. You will cast out all our sins into the depths of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MC7_20","034_7_20","MIC","7","20","20","You will show faithfulness to Jacob and loving devotion to Abraham, as You swore to our fathers from the days of old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_1","035_1_1","NAM","1","1","1","This is the burden against Nineveh, the book of the vision of Nahum the Elkoshite: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_2","035_1_2","NAM","1","2","2","The LORD is a jealous and avenging God; the LORD is avenging and full of wrath. The LORD takes vengeance on His foes and reserves wrath for His enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_3","035_1_3","NAM","1","3","3","The LORD is slow to anger and great in power; the LORD will by no means leave the guilty unpunished. His path is in the whirlwind and storm, and clouds are the dust beneath His feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_4","035_1_4","NAM","1","4","4","He rebukes the sea and dries it up; He makes all the rivers run dry. Bashan and Carmel wither, and the flower of Lebanon wilts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_5","035_1_5","NAM","1","5","5","The mountains quake before Him, and the hills melt away; the earth trembles at His presence—the world and all its dwellers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_6","035_1_6","NAM","1","6","6","Who can withstand His indignation? Who can endure His burning anger? His wrath is poured out like fire; even rocks are shattered before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_7","035_1_7","NAM","1","7","7","The LORD is good, a stronghold in the day of distress; He cares for those who trust in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_8","035_1_8","NAM","1","8","8","But with an overwhelming flood He will make an end of Nineveh and pursue His enemies into darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_9","035_1_9","NAM","1","9","9","Whatever you plot against the LORD, He will bring to an end. Affliction will not rise up a second time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_10","035_1_10","NAM","1","10","10","For they will be entangled as with thorns and consumed like the drink of a drunkard—like stubble that is fully dry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_11","035_1_11","NAM","1","11","11","From you, O Nineveh, comes forth a plotter of evil against the LORD, a counselor of wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_12","035_1_12","NAM","1","12","12","This is what the LORD says: “Though they are allied and numerous, yet they will be cut down and pass away. Though I have afflicted you, O Judah, I will afflict you no longer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_13","035_1_13","NAM","1","13","13","For I will now break their yoke from your neck and tear away your shackles.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_14","035_1_14","NAM","1","14","14","The LORD has issued a command concerning you, O Nineveh: “There will be no descendants to carry on your name. I will cut off the carved image and cast idol from the house of your gods; I will prepare your grave, for you are contemptible.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM1_15","035_1_15","NAM","1","15","15","Look to the mountains—the feet of one who brings good news, who proclaims peace! Celebrate your feasts, O Judah; fulfill your vows. For the wicked will never again march through you; they will be utterly cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_1","035_2_1","NAM","2","1","1","One who scatters advances against you, O Nineveh. Guard the fortress! Watch the road! Brace yourselves! Summon all your strength! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_2","035_2_2","NAM","2","2","2","For the LORD will restore the splendor of Jacob like the splendor of Israel, though destroyers have laid them waste and ruined the branches of their vine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_3","035_2_3","NAM","2","3","3","The shields of his mighty men are red; the valiant warriors are dressed in scarlet. The fittings of the chariots flash like fire on the day they are prepared, and the spears of cypress have been brandished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_4","035_2_4","NAM","2","4","4","The chariots dash through the streets; they rush around the plazas, appearing like torches, darting about like lightning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_5","035_2_5","NAM","2","5","5","He summons his nobles; they stumble as they advance. They race to its wall; the protective shield is set in place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_6","035_2_6","NAM","2","6","6","The river gates are thrown open and the palace collapses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_7","035_2_7","NAM","2","7","7","It is decreed that the city be exiled and carried away; her maidservants moan like doves, and beat upon their breasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_8","035_2_8","NAM","2","8","8","Nineveh has been like a pool of water throughout her days, but now it is draining away. “Stop! Stop!” they cry, but no one turns back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_9","035_2_9","NAM","2","9","9","“Plunder the silver! Plunder the gold!” There is no end to the treasure, an abundance of every precious thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_10","035_2_10","NAM","2","10","10","She is emptied! Yes, she is desolate and laid waste! Hearts melt, knees knock, bodies tremble, and every face grows pale! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_11","035_2_11","NAM","2","11","11","Where is the lions’ lair or the feeding ground of the young lions, where the lion and lioness prowled with their cubs, with nothing to frighten them away? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_12","035_2_12","NAM","2","12","12","The lion mauled enough for its cubs and strangled prey for the lioness. It filled its dens with the kill, and its lairs with mauled prey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM2_13","035_2_13","NAM","2","13","13","“Behold, I am against you,” declares the LORD of Hosts. “I will reduce your chariots to cinders, and the sword will devour your young lions. I will cut off your prey from the earth, and the voices of your messengers will no longer be heard.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_1","035_3_1","NAM","3","1","1","Woe to the city of blood, full of lies, full of plunder, never without prey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_2","035_3_2","NAM","3","2","2","The crack of the whip, the rumble of the wheel, galloping horse and bounding chariot! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_3","035_3_3","NAM","3","3","3","Charging horseman, flashing sword, shining spear; heaps of slain, mounds of corpses, dead bodies without end—they stumble over their dead— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_4","035_3_4","NAM","3","4","4","because of the many harlotries of the harlot, the seductive mistress of sorcery, who betrays nations by her prostitution and clans by her witchcraft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_5","035_3_5","NAM","3","5","5","“Behold, I am against you,” declares the LORD of Hosts. “I will lift your skirts over your face. I will show your nakedness to the nations and your shame to the kingdoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_6","035_3_6","NAM","3","6","6","I will pelt you with filth and treat you with contempt; I will make a spectacle of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_7","035_3_7","NAM","3","7","7","Then all who see you will recoil from you and say, ‘Nineveh is devastated; who will grieve for her?’ Where can I find comforters for you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_8","035_3_8","NAM","3","8","8","Are you better than Thebes, stationed by the Nile with water around her, whose rampart was the sea, whose wall was the water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_9","035_3_9","NAM","3","9","9","Cush and Egypt were her boundless strength; Put and Libya were her allies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_10","035_3_10","NAM","3","10","10","Yet she became an exile; she went into captivity. Her infants were dashed to pieces at the head of every street. They cast lots for her dignitaries, and all her nobles were bound in chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_11","035_3_11","NAM","3","11","11","You too will become drunk; you will go into hiding and seek refuge from the enemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_12","035_3_12","NAM","3","12","12","All your fortresses are fig trees with the first ripe figs; when shaken, they fall into the mouth of the eater! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_13","035_3_13","NAM","3","13","13","Look at your troops—they are like your women! The gates of your land are wide open to your enemies; fire consumes their bars. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_14","035_3_14","NAM","3","14","14","Draw your water for the siege; strengthen your fortresses. Work the clay and tread the mortar; repair the brick kiln! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_15","035_3_15","NAM","3","15","15","There the fire will devour you; the sword will cut you down and consume you like a young locust. Make yourself many like the young locust; make yourself many like the swarming locust! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_16","035_3_16","NAM","3","16","16","You have multiplied your merchants more than the stars of the sky. The young locust strips the land and flies away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_17","035_3_17","NAM","3","17","17","Your guards are like the swarming locust, and your scribes like clouds of locusts that settle on the walls on a cold day. When the sun rises, they fly away, and no one knows where. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_18","035_3_18","NAM","3","18","18","O king of Assyria, your shepherds slumber; your officers sleep. Your people are scattered on the mountains with no one to gather them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("NM3_19","035_3_19","NAM","3","19","19","There is no healing for your injury; your wound is severe. All who hear the news of you applaud your downfall, for who has not experienced your constant cruelty? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_1","036_1_1","HAB","1","1","1","This is the burden that Habakkuk the prophet received in a vision: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_2","036_1_2","HAB","1","2","2","How long, O LORD, must I call for help but You do not hear, or cry out to You, “Violence!” but You do not save? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_3","036_1_3","HAB","1","3","3","Why do You make me see iniquity? Why do You tolerate wrongdoing? Destruction and violence are before me. Strife is ongoing, and conflict abounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_4","036_1_4","HAB","1","4","4","Therefore the law is paralyzed, and justice never goes forth. For the wicked hem in the righteous, so that justice is perverted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_5","036_1_5","HAB","1","5","5","“Look at the nations and observe—be utterly astounded! For I am doing a work in your days that you would never believe even if someone told you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_6","036_1_6","HAB","1","6","6","For behold, I am raising up the Chaldeans—that ruthless and impetuous nation which marches through the breadth of the earth to seize dwellings not their own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_7","036_1_7","HAB","1","7","7","They are dreaded and feared; from themselves they derive justice and sovereignty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_8","036_1_8","HAB","1","8","8","Their horses are swifter than leopards, fiercer than wolves of the night. Their horsemen charge ahead, and their cavalry comes from afar. They fly like a vulture, swooping down to devour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_9","036_1_9","HAB","1","9","9","All of them come bent on violence; their hordes advance like the east wind; they gather prisoners like sand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_10","036_1_10","HAB","1","10","10","They scoff at kings and make rulers an object of scorn. They laugh at every fortress and build up siege ramps to seize it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_11","036_1_11","HAB","1","11","11","Then they sweep by like the wind and pass through. They are guilty; their own strength is their god.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_12","036_1_12","HAB","1","12","12","Are You not from everlasting, O LORD, my God, my Holy One? We will not die. O LORD, You have appointed them to execute judgment; O Rock, You have established them for correction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_13","036_1_13","HAB","1","13","13","Your eyes are too pure to look upon evil, and You cannot tolerate wrongdoing. So why do You tolerate the faithless? Why are You silent while the wicked swallow up those more righteous than themselves? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_14","036_1_14","HAB","1","14","14","You have made men like the fish of the sea, like creeping things that have no ruler. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_15","036_1_15","HAB","1","15","15","The foe pulls all of them up with a hook; he catches them in his dragnet, and gathers them in his fishing net; so he rejoices gladly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_16","036_1_16","HAB","1","16","16","Therefore he sacrifices to his dragnet and burns incense to his fishing net, for by these things his portion is sumptuous and his food is rich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK1_17","036_1_17","HAB","1","17","17","Will he, therefore, empty his net and continue to slay nations without mercy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_1","036_2_1","HAB","2","1","1","I will stand at my guard post and station myself on the ramparts. I will watch to see what He will say to me, and how I should answer when corrected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_2","036_2_2","HAB","2","2","2","Then the LORD answered me: “Write down this vision and clearly inscribe it on tablets, so that a herald may run with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_3","036_2_3","HAB","2","3","3","For the vision awaits an appointed time; it testifies of the end and does not lie. Though it lingers, wait for it, since it will surely come and will not delay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_4","036_2_4","HAB","2","4","4","Look at the proud one; his soul is not upright—but the righteous will live by faith— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_5","036_2_5","HAB","2","5","5","and wealth indeed betrays him. He is an arrogant man never at rest. He enlarges his appetite like Sheol, and like Death, he is never satisfied. He gathers all the nations to himself and collects all the peoples as his own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_6","036_2_6","HAB","2","6","6","Will not all of these take up a taunt against him, speaking with mockery and derision: ‘Woe to him who amasses what is not his and makes himself rich with many loans! How long will this go on?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_7","036_2_7","HAB","2","7","7","Will not your creditors suddenly arise and those who disturb you awaken? Then you will become their prey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_8","036_2_8","HAB","2","8","8","Because you have plundered many nations, the remnant of the people will plunder you—because of your bloodshed against man and your violence against the land, the city, and all their dwellers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_9","036_2_9","HAB","2","9","9","Woe to him who builds his house by unjust gain, to place his nest on high and escape the hand of disaster! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_10","036_2_10","HAB","2","10","10","You have plotted shame for your house by cutting off many peoples and forfeiting your life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_11","036_2_11","HAB","2","11","11","For the stones will cry out from the wall, and the rafters will echo it from the woodwork. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_12","036_2_12","HAB","2","12","12","Woe to him who builds a city with bloodshed and establishes a town by iniquity! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_13","036_2_13","HAB","2","13","13","Is it not indeed from the LORD of Hosts that the labor of the people only feeds the fire, and the nations weary themselves in vain? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_14","036_2_14","HAB","2","14","14","For the earth will be filled with the knowledge of the glory of the LORD as the waters cover the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_15","036_2_15","HAB","2","15","15","Woe to him who gives drink to his neighbors, pouring it from the wineskin until they are drunk, in order to gaze at their nakedness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_16","036_2_16","HAB","2","16","16","You will be filled with shame instead of glory. You too must drink and expose your uncircumcision! The cup in the LORD’s right hand will come around to you, and utter disgrace will cover your glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_17","036_2_17","HAB","2","17","17","For your violence against Lebanon will overwhelm you, and the destruction of animals will terrify you, because of your bloodshed against men and your violence against the land, the city, and all their dwellers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_18","036_2_18","HAB","2","18","18","What use is an idol, that a craftsman should carve it—or an image, a teacher of lies? For its maker trusts in his own creation; he makes idols that cannot speak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_19","036_2_19","HAB","2","19","19","Woe to him who says to wood, ‘Awake!’ or to silent stone, ‘Arise!’ Can it give guidance? Behold, it is overlaid with gold and silver, yet there is no breath in it at all.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK2_20","036_2_20","HAB","2","20","20","But the LORD is in His holy temple; let all the earth be silent before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_1","036_3_1","HAB","3","1","1","This is a prayer of Habakkuk the prophet, according to Shigionoth: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_2","036_3_2","HAB","3","2","2","O LORD, I have heard the report of You; I stand in awe, O LORD, of Your deeds. Revive them in these years; make them known in these years. In Your wrath, remember mercy! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_3","036_3_3","HAB","3","3","3","God came from Teman, and the Holy One from Mount Paran. Selah His glory covered the heavens, and His praise filled the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_4","036_3_4","HAB","3","4","4","His radiance was like the sunlight; rays flashed from His hand, where His power is hidden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_5","036_3_5","HAB","3","5","5","Plague went before Him, and fever followed in His steps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_6","036_3_6","HAB","3","6","6","He stood and measured the earth; He looked and startled the nations; the ancient mountains crumbled; the perpetual hills collapsed. His ways are everlasting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_7","036_3_7","HAB","3","7","7","I saw the tents of Cushan in distress; the curtains of Midian were trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_8","036_3_8","HAB","3","8","8","Were You angry at the rivers, O LORD? Was Your wrath against the streams? Did You rage against the sea when You rode on Your horses, on Your chariots of salvation? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_9","036_3_9","HAB","3","9","9","You brandished Your bow; You called for many arrows. Selah You split the earth with rivers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_10","036_3_10","HAB","3","10","10","The mountains saw You and quaked; torrents of water swept by. The deep roared with its voice and lifted its hands on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_11","036_3_11","HAB","3","11","11","Sun and moon stood still in their places at the flash of Your flying arrows, at the brightness of Your shining spear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_12","036_3_12","HAB","3","12","12","You marched across the earth with fury; You threshed the nations in wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_13","036_3_13","HAB","3","13","13","You went forth for the salvation of Your people, to save Your anointed. You crushed the head of the house of the wicked and stripped him from head to toe. Selah ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_14","036_3_14","HAB","3","14","14","With his own spear You pierced his head, when his warriors stormed out to scatter us, gloating as though ready to secretly devour the weak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_15","036_3_15","HAB","3","15","15","You trampled the sea with Your horses, churning the great waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_16","036_3_16","HAB","3","16","16","I heard and trembled within; my lips quivered at the sound. Decay entered my bones; I trembled where I stood. Yet I must wait patiently for the day of distress to come upon the people who invade us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_17","036_3_17","HAB","3","17","17","Though the fig tree does not bud and no fruit is on the vines, though the olive crop fails and the fields produce no food, though the sheep are cut off from the fold and no cattle are in the stalls, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_18","036_3_18","HAB","3","18","18","yet I will exult in the LORD; I will rejoice in the God of my salvation! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HK3_19","036_3_19","HAB","3","19","19","GOD the Lord is my strength; He makes my feet like those of a deer; He makes me walk upon the heights! For the choirmaster. With stringed instruments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_1","037_1_1","ZEP","1","1","1","This is the word of the LORD that came to Zephaniah son of Cushi, the son of Gedaliah, the son of Amariah, the son of Hezekiah, in the days of Josiah son of Amon king of Judah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_2","037_1_2","ZEP","1","2","2","“I will completely sweep away everything from the face of the earth,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_3","037_1_3","ZEP","1","3","3","“I will sweep away man and beast; I will sweep away the birds of the air, and the fish of the sea, and the idols with their wicked worshipers. I will cut off mankind from the face of the earth,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_4","037_1_4","ZEP","1","4","4","“I will stretch out My hand against Judah and against all who dwell in Jerusalem. I will cut off from this place every remnant of Baal, the names of the idolatrous and pagan priests— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_5","037_1_5","ZEP","1","5","5","those who bow on the rooftops to worship the host of heaven, those who bow down and swear by the LORD but also swear by Milcom, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_6","037_1_6","ZEP","1","6","6","and those who turn back from following the LORD, neither seeking the LORD nor inquiring of Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_7","037_1_7","ZEP","1","7","7","Be silent in the presence of the Lord GOD, for the Day of the LORD is near. Indeed, the LORD has prepared a sacrifice; He has consecrated His guests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_8","037_1_8","ZEP","1","8","8","“On the Day of the LORD’s sacrifice I will punish the princes, the sons of the king, and all who are dressed in foreign apparel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_9","037_1_9","ZEP","1","9","9","On that day I will punish all who leap over the threshold, who fill the house of their master with violence and deceit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_10","037_1_10","ZEP","1","10","10","On that day,” declares the LORD, “a cry will go up from the Fish Gate, a wail from the Second District, and a loud crashing from the hills. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_11","037_1_11","ZEP","1","11","11","Wail, O dwellers of the Hollow, for all your merchants will be silenced; all who weigh out silver will be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_12","037_1_12","ZEP","1","12","12","And at that time I will search Jerusalem with lamps and punish the men settled in complacency, who say to themselves, ‘The LORD will do nothing, either good or bad.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_13","037_1_13","ZEP","1","13","13","Their wealth will be plundered and their houses laid waste. They will build houses but not inhabit them, and plant vineyards but never drink their wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_14","037_1_14","ZEP","1","14","14","The great Day of the LORD is near—near and coming quickly. Listen, the Day of the LORD! Then the cry of the mighty will be bitter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_15","037_1_15","ZEP","1","15","15","That day will be a day of wrath, a day of trouble and distress, a day of destruction and desolation, a day of darkness and gloom, a day of clouds and blackness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_16","037_1_16","ZEP","1","16","16","a day of horn blast and battle cry against the fortified cities, and against the high corner towers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_17","037_1_17","ZEP","1","17","17","I will bring such distress on mankind that they will walk like the blind, because they have sinned against the LORD. Their blood will be poured out like dust and their flesh like dung. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP1_18","037_1_18","ZEP","1","18","18","Neither their silver nor their gold will be able to deliver them on the Day of the LORD’s wrath. The whole earth will be consumed by the fire of His jealousy.” For indeed, He will make a sudden end of all who dwell on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_1","037_2_1","ZEP","2","1","1","Gather yourselves, gather together, O shameful nation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_2","037_2_2","ZEP","2","2","2","before the decree takes effect and the day passes like chaff, before the burning anger of the LORD comes upon you, before the Day of the LORD’s anger comes upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_3","037_2_3","ZEP","2","3","3","Seek the LORD, all you humble of the earth who carry out His justice. Seek righteousness; seek humility. Perhaps you will be sheltered on the day of the LORD’s anger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_4","037_2_4","ZEP","2","4","4","For Gaza will be abandoned, and Ashkelon left in ruins. Ashdod will be driven out at noon, and Ekron will be uprooted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_5","037_2_5","ZEP","2","5","5","Woe to the dwellers of the seacoast, O nation of the Cherethites! The word of the LORD is against you, O Canaan, land of the Philistines: “I will destroy you, and no one will be left.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_6","037_2_6","ZEP","2","6","6","So the seacoast will become a land of pastures, with wells for shepherds and folds for sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_7","037_2_7","ZEP","2","7","7","The coast will belong to the remnant of the house of Judah; there they will find pasture. They will lie down in the evening among the houses of Ashkelon, for the LORD their God will attend to them and restore their captives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_8","037_2_8","ZEP","2","8","8","“I have heard the reproach of Moab and the insults of the Ammonites, who have taunted My people and threatened their borders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_9","037_2_9","ZEP","2","9","9","Therefore, as surely as I live,” declares the LORD of Hosts, the God of Israel, “surely Moab will be like Sodom and the Ammonites like Gomorrah—a place of weeds and salt pits, a perpetual wasteland. The remnant of My people will plunder them; the remainder of My nation will dispossess them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_10","037_2_10","ZEP","2","10","10","This they shall have in return for their pride, for taunting and mocking the people of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_11","037_2_11","ZEP","2","11","11","The LORD will be terrifying to them when He starves all the gods of the earth. Then the nations of every shore will bow in worship to Him, each in its own place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_12","037_2_12","ZEP","2","12","12","“You too, O Cushites, will be slain by My sword.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_13","037_2_13","ZEP","2","13","13","And He will stretch out His hand against the north and destroy Assyria; He will make Nineveh a desolation, as dry as a desert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_14","037_2_14","ZEP","2","14","14","Herds will lie down in her midst, creatures of every kind. Both the desert owl and screech owl will roost atop her pillars. Their calls will sound from the window, but desolation will lie on the threshold, for He will expose the beams of cedar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP2_15","037_2_15","ZEP","2","15","15","This carefree city that dwells securely, that thinks to herself: “I am it, and there is none besides me,” what a ruin she has become, a resting place for beasts. Everyone who passes by her hisses and shakes his fist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_1","037_3_1","ZEP","3","1","1","Woe to the city of oppressors, rebellious and defiled! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_2","037_3_2","ZEP","3","2","2","She heeded no voice; she accepted no correction. She does not trust in the LORD; she has not drawn near to her God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_3","037_3_3","ZEP","3","3","3","Her princes are roaring lions; her judges are evening wolves, leaving nothing for the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_4","037_3_4","ZEP","3","4","4","Her prophets are reckless, faithless men. Her priests profane the sanctuary; they do violence to the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_5","037_3_5","ZEP","3","5","5","The LORD within her is righteous; He does no wrong. He applies His justice morning by morning; He does not fail at dawn, yet the unjust know no shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_6","037_3_6","ZEP","3","6","6","“I have cut off the nations; their corner towers are destroyed. I have made their streets deserted with no one to pass through. Their cities are laid waste, with no man, no inhabitant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_7","037_3_7","ZEP","3","7","7","I said, ‘Surely you will fear Me and accept correction.’ Then her dwelling place would not be cut off despite all for which I punished her. But they rose early to corrupt all their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_8","037_3_8","ZEP","3","8","8","Therefore wait for Me,” declares the LORD, “until the day I rise to testify. For My decision is to gather nations, to assemble kingdoms, to pour out upon them My indignation—all My burning anger. For all the earth will be consumed by the fire of My jealousy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_9","037_3_9","ZEP","3","9","9","For then I will restore pure lips to the peoples, that all may call upon the name of the LORD and serve Him shoulder to shoulder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_10","037_3_10","ZEP","3","10","10","From beyond the rivers of Cush My worshipers, My scattered people, will bring Me an offering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_11","037_3_11","ZEP","3","11","11","On that day you will not be put to shame for any of the deeds by which you have transgressed against Me. For then I will remove from among you those who rejoice in their pride, and you will never again be haughty on My holy mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_12","037_3_12","ZEP","3","12","12","But I will leave within you a meek and humble people, and they will trust in the name of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_13","037_3_13","ZEP","3","13","13","The remnant of Israel will no longer do wrong or speak lies, nor will a deceitful tongue be found in their mouths. But they will feed and lie down, with no one to make them tremble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_14","037_3_14","ZEP","3","14","14","Sing for joy, O Daughter of Zion; shout aloud, O Israel! Be glad and rejoice with all your heart, O Daughter of Jerusalem! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_15","037_3_15","ZEP","3","15","15","The LORD has taken away your punishment; He has turned back your enemy. Israel’s King, the LORD, is among you; no longer will you fear any harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_16","037_3_16","ZEP","3","16","16","On that day they will say to Jerusalem: “Do not fear, O Zion; do not let your hands fall limp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_17","037_3_17","ZEP","3","17","17","The LORD your God is among you; He is mighty to save. He will rejoice over you with gladness; He will quiet you with His love; He will rejoice over you with singing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_18","037_3_18","ZEP","3","18","18","“I will gather those among you who grieve over the appointed feasts, so that you will no longer suffer reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_19","037_3_19","ZEP","3","19","19","Behold, at that time, I will deal with all who afflict you. I will save the lame and gather the scattered; and I will appoint praise and fame for the disgraced throughout the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZP3_20","037_3_20","ZEP","3","20","20","At that time I will bring you in; yes, at that time I will gather you. For I will give you fame and praise among all the peoples of the earth when I restore your captives before your very eyes,” says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_1","038_1_1","HAG","1","1","1","In the second year of the reign of Darius, on the first day of the sixth month, the word of the LORD came through Haggai the prophet to Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and to Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, stating ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_2","038_1_2","HAG","1","2","2","that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “These people say, ‘The time has not yet come to rebuild the house of the LORD.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_3","038_1_3","HAG","1","3","3","Then the word of the LORD came through Haggai the prophet, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_4","038_1_4","HAG","1","4","4","“Is it a time for you yourselves to live in your paneled houses, while this house lies in ruins?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_5","038_1_5","HAG","1","5","5","Now this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Consider carefully your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_6","038_1_6","HAG","1","6","6","You have planted much but harvested little. You eat but never have enough. You drink but never have your fill. You put on clothes but never get warm. You earn wages to put into a bag pierced through.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_7","038_1_7","HAG","1","7","7","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Consider carefully your ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_8","038_1_8","HAG","1","8","8","Go up into the hills, bring down lumber, and build the house, so that I may take pleasure in it and be glorified, says the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_9","038_1_9","HAG","1","9","9","You expected much, but behold, it amounted to little. And what you brought home, I blew away. Why? declares the LORD of Hosts. Because My house still lies in ruins, while each of you is busy with his own house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_10","038_1_10","HAG","1","10","10","Therefore, on account of you the heavens have withheld their dew and the earth has withheld its crops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_11","038_1_11","HAG","1","11","11","I have summoned a drought on the fields and on the mountains, on the grain, new wine, and oil, and on whatever the ground yields, on man and beast, and on all the labor of your hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_12","038_1_12","HAG","1","12","12","Then Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel and Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, as well as all the remnant of the people, obeyed the voice of the LORD their God and the words of the prophet Haggai, because the LORD their God had sent him. So the people feared the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_13","038_1_13","HAG","1","13","13","Haggai, the messenger of the LORD, delivered the message of the LORD to the people: “I am with you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_14","038_1_14","HAG","1","14","14","So the LORD stirred the spirit of Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and the spirit of Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, as well as the spirit of all the remnant of the people. And they came and began the work on the house of the LORD of Hosts, their God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG1_15","038_1_15","HAG","1","15","15","on the twenty-fourth day of the sixth month, in the second year of King Darius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_1","038_2_1","HAG","2","1","1","On the twenty-first day of the seventh month, the word of the LORD came through Haggai the prophet, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_2","038_2_2","HAG","2","2","2","“Speak to Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and to Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest, and also to the remnant of the people. Ask them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_3","038_2_3","HAG","2","3","3","‘Who is left among you who saw this house in its former glory? How does it look to you now? Does it not appear to you like nothing in comparison?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_4","038_2_4","HAG","2","4","4","But now be strong, O Zerubbabel, declares the LORD. Be strong, O Joshua son of Jehozadak, the high priest. And be strong, all you people of the land, declares the LORD. Work! For I am with you, declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_5","038_2_5","HAG","2","5","5","This is the promise I made to you when you came out of Egypt. And My Spirit remains among you; do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_6","038_2_6","HAG","2","6","6","For this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Once more, in a little while, I will shake the heavens and the earth, the sea and the dry land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_7","038_2_7","HAG","2","7","7","I will shake all the nations, and they will come with all their treasures, and I will fill this house with glory, says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_8","038_2_8","HAG","2","8","8","The silver is Mine, and the gold is Mine, declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_9","038_2_9","HAG","2","9","9","The latter glory of this house will be greater than the former, says the LORD of Hosts. And in this place I will provide peace, declares the LORD of Hosts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_10","038_2_10","HAG","2","10","10","On the twenty-fourth day of the ninth month, in the second year of Darius, the word of the LORD came to Haggai the prophet, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_11","038_2_11","HAG","2","11","11","“This is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Ask the priests for a ruling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_12","038_2_12","HAG","2","12","12","If a man carries consecrated meat in the fold of his garment, and it touches bread, stew, wine, oil, or any other food, does that item become holy?’” “No,” replied the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_13","038_2_13","HAG","2","13","13","So Haggai asked, “If one who is defiled by contact with a corpse touches any of these, does it become defiled?” “Yes, it becomes defiled,” the priests answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_14","038_2_14","HAG","2","14","14","Then Haggai replied, “So it is with this people and this nation before Me, declares the LORD, and so it is with every work of their hands; whatever they offer there is defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_15","038_2_15","HAG","2","15","15","Now consider carefully from this day forward: Before one stone was placed on another in the temple of the LORD, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_16","038_2_16","HAG","2","16","16","from that time, when one came expecting a heap of twenty ephahs of grain, there were but ten. When one came to the winepress to draw out fifty baths, there were but twenty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_17","038_2_17","HAG","2","17","17","I struck you—all the work of your hands—with blight, mildew, and hail, but you did not turn to Me, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_18","038_2_18","HAG","2","18","18","Consider carefully from this day forward—from the twenty-fourth day of the ninth month, the day the foundation of the LORD’s temple was laid—consider carefully: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_19","038_2_19","HAG","2","19","19","Is there still seed in the barn? The vine, the fig, the pomegranate, and the olive tree have not yet yielded fruit. But from this day on, I will bless you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_20","038_2_20","HAG","2","20","20","For the second time that day, the twenty-fourth day of the month, the word of the LORD came to Haggai, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_21","038_2_21","HAG","2","21","21","“Tell Zerubbabel governor of Judah that I am about to shake the heavens and the earth: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_22","038_2_22","HAG","2","22","22","I will overturn royal thrones and destroy the power of the kingdoms of the nations. I will overturn chariots and their riders; horses and their riders will fall, each by the sword of his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HG2_23","038_2_23","HAG","2","23","23","On that day, declares the LORD of Hosts, I will take you, My servant, Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, declares the LORD, and I will make you like My signet ring, for I have chosen you, declares the LORD of Hosts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_1","039_1_1","ZEC","1","1","1","In the eighth month of the second year of Darius, the word of the LORD came to the prophet Zechariah son of Berechiah, the son of Iddo, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_2","039_1_2","ZEC","1","2","2","“The LORD was very angry with your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_3","039_1_3","ZEC","1","3","3","So tell the people that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Return to Me, declares the LORD of Hosts, and I will return to you, says the LORD of Hosts.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_4","039_1_4","ZEC","1","4","4","Do not be like your fathers, to whom the former prophets proclaimed that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Turn now from your evil ways and deeds.’ But they did not listen or pay attention to Me, declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_5","039_1_5","ZEC","1","5","5","Where are your fathers now? And the prophets, do they live forever? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_6","039_1_6","ZEC","1","6","6","But did not My words and My statutes, which I commanded My servants the prophets, overtake your fathers? They repented and said, ‘Just as the LORD of Hosts purposed to do to us according to our ways and deeds, so He has done to us.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_7","039_1_7","ZEC","1","7","7","On the twenty-fourth day of the eleventh month, the month of Shebat, in the second year of Darius, the word of the LORD came to the prophet Zechariah son of Berechiah, the son of Iddo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_8","039_1_8","ZEC","1","8","8","I looked out into the night and saw a man riding on a red horse. He was standing among the myrtle trees in the hollow, and behind him were red, sorrel, and white horses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_9","039_1_9","ZEC","1","9","9","“What are these, my lord?” I asked. And the angel who was speaking with me replied, “I will show you what they are.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_10","039_1_10","ZEC","1","10","10","Then the man standing among the myrtle trees explained, “They are the ones the LORD has sent to patrol the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_11","039_1_11","ZEC","1","11","11","And the riders answered the angel of the LORD who was standing among the myrtle trees, “We have patrolled the earth, and behold, all the earth is at rest and tranquil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_12","039_1_12","ZEC","1","12","12","Then the angel of the LORD said, “How long, O LORD of Hosts, will You withhold mercy from Jerusalem and the cities of Judah, with which You have been angry these seventy years?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_13","039_1_13","ZEC","1","13","13","So the LORD spoke kind and comforting words to the angel who was speaking with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_14","039_1_14","ZEC","1","14","14","Then the angel who was speaking with me said, “Proclaim this word: This is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘I am very jealous for Jerusalem and Zion, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_15","039_1_15","ZEC","1","15","15","but I am fiercely angry with the nations that are at ease. For I was a little angry, but they have added to the calamity.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_16","039_1_16","ZEC","1","16","16","Therefore this is what the LORD says: ‘I will return to Jerusalem with mercy, and there My house will be rebuilt, declares the LORD of Hosts, and a measuring line will be stretched out over Jerusalem.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_17","039_1_17","ZEC","1","17","17","Proclaim further that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘My cities will again overflow with prosperity; the LORD will again comfort Zion and choose Jerusalem.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_18","039_1_18","ZEC","1","18","18","Then I looked up and saw four horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_19","039_1_19","ZEC","1","19","19","So I asked the angel who was speaking with me, “What are these?” And he told me, “These are the horns that have scattered Judah, Israel, and Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_20","039_1_20","ZEC","1","20","20","Then the LORD showed me four craftsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC1_21","039_1_21","ZEC","1","21","21","“What are these coming to do?” I asked. And He replied, “These are the horns that scattered Judah so that no one could raise his head; but the craftsmen have come to terrify them and throw down these horns of the nations that have lifted up their horns against the land of Judah to scatter it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_1","039_2_1","ZEC","2","1","1","Then I lifted up my eyes and saw a man with a measuring line in his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_2","039_2_2","ZEC","2","2","2","“Where are you going?” I asked. “To measure Jerusalem,” he replied, “and to determine its width and length.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_3","039_2_3","ZEC","2","3","3","Then the angel who was speaking with me went forth, and another angel came forward to meet him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_4","039_2_4","ZEC","2","4","4","and said to him, “Run and tell that young man: ‘Jerusalem will be a city without walls because of the multitude of men and livestock within it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_5","039_2_5","ZEC","2","5","5","For I will be a wall of fire around it, declares the LORD, and I will be the glory within it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_6","039_2_6","ZEC","2","6","6","“Get up! Get up! Flee from the land of the north,” declares the LORD, “for I have scattered you like the four winds of heaven,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_7","039_2_7","ZEC","2","7","7","“Get up, O Zion! Escape, you who dwell with the Daughter of Babylon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_8","039_2_8","ZEC","2","8","8","For this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “After His Glory has sent Me against the nations that have plundered you—for whoever touches you touches the apple of His eye— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_9","039_2_9","ZEC","2","9","9","I will surely wave My hand over them, so that they will become plunder for their own servants. Then you will know that the LORD of Hosts has sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_10","039_2_10","ZEC","2","10","10","“Shout for joy and be glad, O Daughter of Zion, for I am coming to dwell among you,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_11","039_2_11","ZEC","2","11","11","“On that day many nations will join themselves to the LORD, and they will become My people. I will dwell among you, and you will know that the LORD of Hosts has sent Me to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_12","039_2_12","ZEC","2","12","12","And the LORD will take possession of Judah as His portion in the Holy Land, and He will once again choose Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC2_13","039_2_13","ZEC","2","13","13","Be silent before the LORD, all people, for He has roused Himself from His holy dwelling.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_1","039_3_1","ZEC","3","1","1","Then the angel showed me Joshua the high priest standing before the angel of the LORD, with Satan standing at his right hand to accuse him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_2","039_3_2","ZEC","3","2","2","And the LORD said to Satan: “The LORD rebukes you, Satan! Indeed, the LORD, who has chosen Jerusalem, rebukes you! Is not this man a firebrand snatched from the fire?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_3","039_3_3","ZEC","3","3","3","Now Joshua was dressed in filthy garments as he stood before the angel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_4","039_3_4","ZEC","3","4","4","So the angel said to those standing before him, “Take off his filthy clothes!” Then he said to Joshua, “See, I have removed your iniquity, and I will clothe you with splendid robes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_5","039_3_5","ZEC","3","5","5","Then I said, “Let them put a clean turban on his head.” So a clean turban was placed on his head, and they clothed him, as the angel of the LORD stood by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_6","039_3_6","ZEC","3","6","6","Then the angel of the LORD gave this charge to Joshua: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_7","039_3_7","ZEC","3","7","7","“This is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘If you walk in My ways and keep My instructions, then you will govern My house and will also have charge of My courts; and I will give you a place among these who are standing here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_8","039_3_8","ZEC","3","8","8","Hear now, O high priest Joshua, you and your companions seated before you, who are indeed a sign. For behold, I am going to bring My servant, the Branch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_9","039_3_9","ZEC","3","9","9","See the stone I have set before Joshua; on that one stone are seven eyes. Behold, I will engrave on it an inscription, declares the LORD of Hosts, and I will remove the iniquity of this land in a single day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC3_10","039_3_10","ZEC","3","10","10","On that day, declares the LORD of Hosts, you will each invite your neighbor to sit under your own vine and fig tree.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_1","039_4_1","ZEC","4","1","1","Then the angel who was speaking with me returned and woke me, as a man is awakened from his sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_2","039_4_2","ZEC","4","2","2","“What do you see?” he asked. “I see a solid gold lampstand,” I replied, “with a bowl at the top and seven lamps on it, with seven spouts to the lamps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_3","039_4_3","ZEC","4","3","3","There are also two olive trees beside it, one on the right side of the bowl and the other on its left.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_4","039_4_4","ZEC","4","4","4","“What are these, my lord?” I asked the angel who was speaking with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_5","039_4_5","ZEC","4","5","5","“Do you not know what they are?” replied the angel. “No, my lord,” I answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_6","039_4_6","ZEC","4","6","6","So he said to me, “This is the word of the LORD to Zerubbabel: Not by might nor by power, but by My Spirit, says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_7","039_4_7","ZEC","4","7","7","What are you, O great mountain? Before Zerubbabel you will become a plain. Then he will bring forth the capstone accompanied by shouts of ‘Grace, grace to it!’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_8","039_4_8","ZEC","4","8","8","Then the word of the LORD came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_9","039_4_9","ZEC","4","9","9","“The hands of Zerubbabel have laid the foundation of this house, and his hands will complete it. Then you will know that the LORD of Hosts has sent me to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_10","039_4_10","ZEC","4","10","10","For who has despised the day of small things? But these seven eyes of the LORD, which scan the whole earth, will rejoice when they see the plumb line in the hand of Zerubbabel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_11","039_4_11","ZEC","4","11","11","Then I asked the angel, “What are the two olive trees on the right and left of the lampstand?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_12","039_4_12","ZEC","4","12","12","And I questioned him further, “What are the two olive branches beside the two gold pipes from which the golden oil pours?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_13","039_4_13","ZEC","4","13","13","“Do you not know what these are?” he inquired. “No, my lord,” I replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC4_14","039_4_14","ZEC","4","14","14","So he said, “These are the two anointed ones who are standing beside the Lord of all the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_1","039_5_1","ZEC","5","1","1","Again I lifted up my eyes and saw before me a flying scroll. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_2","039_5_2","ZEC","5","2","2","“What do you see?” asked the angel. “I see a flying scroll,” I replied, “twenty cubits long and ten cubits wide.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_3","039_5_3","ZEC","5","3","3","Then he told me, “This is the curse that is going out over the face of all the land, for according to one side of the scroll, every thief will be removed; and according to the other side, every perjurer will be removed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_4","039_5_4","ZEC","5","4","4","I will send it out, declares the LORD of Hosts, and it will enter the house of the thief and the house of him who swears falsely by My name. It will remain inside his house and destroy it, down to its timbers and stones.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_5","039_5_5","ZEC","5","5","5","Then the angel who was speaking with me came forward and told me, “Now lift up your eyes and see what is approaching.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_6","039_5_6","ZEC","5","6","6","“What is it?” I asked. And he replied, “A measuring basket is going forth.” Then he continued, “This is their iniquity in all the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_7","039_5_7","ZEC","5","7","7","And behold, the cover of lead was raised, and there was a woman sitting inside the basket. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_8","039_5_8","ZEC","5","8","8","“This is Wickedness,” he said. And he shoved her down into the basket, pushing down the lead cover over its opening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_9","039_5_9","ZEC","5","9","9","Then I lifted up my eyes and saw two women approaching, with the wind in their wings. Their wings were like those of a stork, and they lifted up the basket between heaven and earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_10","039_5_10","ZEC","5","10","10","“Where are they taking the basket?” I asked the angel who was speaking with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC5_11","039_5_11","ZEC","5","11","11","“To build a house for it in the land of Shinar,” he told me. “And when it is ready, the basket will be set there on its pedestal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_1","039_6_1","ZEC","6","1","1","And again I lifted up my eyes and saw four chariots coming out from between two mountains—mountains of bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_2","039_6_2","ZEC","6","2","2","The first chariot had red horses, the second black horses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_3","039_6_3","ZEC","6","3","3","the third white horses, and the fourth dappled horses—all of them strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_4","039_6_4","ZEC","6","4","4","So I inquired of the angel who was speaking with me, “What are these, my lord?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_5","039_6_5","ZEC","6","5","5","And the angel told me, “These are the four spirits of heaven, going forth from their station before the Lord of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_6","039_6_6","ZEC","6","6","6","The one with the black horses is going toward the land of the north, the one with the white horses toward the west, and the one with the dappled horses toward the south.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_7","039_6_7","ZEC","6","7","7","As the strong horses went out, they were eager to go and patrol the earth; and the LORD said, “Go and patrol the earth.” So they patrolled the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_8","039_6_8","ZEC","6","8","8","Then the LORD summoned me and said, “Behold, those going to the land of the north have given rest to My Spirit in the land of the north.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_9","039_6_9","ZEC","6","9","9","The word of the LORD also came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_10","039_6_10","ZEC","6","10","10","“Take an offering from the exiles—from Heldai, Tobijah, and Jedaiah, who have arrived from Babylon—and go that same day to the house of Josiah son of Zephaniah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_11","039_6_11","ZEC","6","11","11","Take silver and gold, make an ornate crown, and set it on the head of the high priest, Joshua son of Jehozadak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_12","039_6_12","ZEC","6","12","12","And you are to tell him that this is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Here is a man whose name is the Branch, and He will branch out from His place and build the temple of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_13","039_6_13","ZEC","6","13","13","Yes, He will build the temple of the LORD; He will be clothed in splendor and will sit on His throne and rule. And He will be a priest on His throne, and there will be peaceful counsel between the two.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_14","039_6_14","ZEC","6","14","14","The crown will reside in the temple of the LORD as a memorial to Helem, Tobijah, Jedaiah, and the gracious son of Zephaniah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC6_15","039_6_15","ZEC","6","15","15","Even those far away will come and build the temple of the LORD, and you will know that the LORD of Hosts has sent Me to you. This will happen if you diligently obey the voice of the LORD your God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_1","039_7_1","ZEC","7","1","1","In the fourth year of King Darius, the word of the LORD came to Zechariah on the fourth day of the ninth month, the month of Chislev. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_2","039_7_2","ZEC","7","2","2","Now the people of Bethel had sent Sharezer and Regem-melech, along with their men, to plead before the LORD ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_3","039_7_3","ZEC","7","3","3","by asking the priests of the house of the LORD of Hosts, as well as the prophets, “Should I weep and fast in the fifth month, as I have done these many years?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_4","039_7_4","ZEC","7","4","4","Then the word of the LORD of Hosts came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_5","039_7_5","ZEC","7","5","5","“Ask all the people of the land and the priests, ‘When you fasted and mourned in the fifth and seventh months for these seventy years, was it really for Me that you fasted? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_6","039_7_6","ZEC","7","6","6","And when you were eating and drinking, were you not doing so simply for yourselves? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_7","039_7_7","ZEC","7","7","7","Are these not the words that the LORD proclaimed through the earlier prophets, when Jerusalem and its surrounding towns were populous and prosperous, and the Negev and the foothills were inhabited?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_8","039_7_8","ZEC","7","8","8","Then the word of the LORD came to Zechariah, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_9","039_7_9","ZEC","7","9","9","“This is what the LORD of Hosts says: ‘Administer true justice. Show loving devotion and compassion to one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_10","039_7_10","ZEC","7","10","10","Do not oppress the widow or the fatherless, the foreigner or the poor. And do not plot evil in your hearts against one another.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_11","039_7_11","ZEC","7","11","11","But they refused to pay attention and turned a stubborn shoulder; they stopped up their ears from hearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_12","039_7_12","ZEC","7","12","12","They made their hearts like flint and would not listen to the law or to the words that the LORD of Hosts had sent by His Spirit through the earlier prophets. Therefore great anger came from the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_13","039_7_13","ZEC","7","13","13","And just as I had called and they would not listen, so when they called I would not listen, says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC7_14","039_7_14","ZEC","7","14","14","But I scattered them with a whirlwind among all the nations that they had not known, and the land was left desolate behind them so that no one could come or go. Thus they turned the pleasant land into a desolation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_1","039_8_1","ZEC","8","1","1","Again the word of the LORD of Hosts came to me, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_2","039_8_2","ZEC","8","2","2","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “I am jealous for Zion with great zeal; I am jealous for her with great fervor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_3","039_8_3","ZEC","8","3","3","This is what the LORD says: “I will return to Zion and dwell in Jerusalem. Then Jerusalem will be called the City of Truth, and the mountain of the LORD of Hosts will be called the Holy Mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_4","039_8_4","ZEC","8","4","4","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Old men and old women will again sit along the streets of Jerusalem, each with a staff in hand because of great age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_5","039_8_5","ZEC","8","5","5","And the streets of the city will be filled with boys and girls playing there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_6","039_8_6","ZEC","8","6","6","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “If this is impossible in the eyes of the remnant of this people in these days, should it also be impossible in My eyes?” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_7","039_8_7","ZEC","8","7","7","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “I will save My people from the land of the east and from the land of the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_8","039_8_8","ZEC","8","8","8","I will bring them back to dwell in Jerusalem, where they will be My people, and I will be their faithful and righteous God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_9","039_8_9","ZEC","8","9","9","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Let your hands be strong, you who now hear these words spoken by the prophets who were present when the foundations were laid to rebuild the temple, the house of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_10","039_8_10","ZEC","8","10","10","For before those days neither man nor beast received wages, nor was there safety from the enemy for anyone who came or went, for I had turned every man against his neighbor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_11","039_8_11","ZEC","8","11","11","But now I will not treat the remnant of this people as I did in the past,” declares the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_12","039_8_12","ZEC","8","12","12","“For the seed will be prosperous, the vine will yield its fruit, the ground will yield its produce, and the skies will give their dew. To the remnant of this people I will give all these things as an inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_13","039_8_13","ZEC","8","13","13","As you have been a curse among the nations, O house of Judah and house of Israel, so I will save you, and you will be a blessing. Do not be afraid; let your hands be strong.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_14","039_8_14","ZEC","8","14","14","For this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Just as I resolved to bring disaster upon you when your fathers provoked Me to anger, and I did not relent,” says the LORD of Hosts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_15","039_8_15","ZEC","8","15","15","“so now I have resolved to do good again to Jerusalem and Judah. Do not be afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_16","039_8_16","ZEC","8","16","16","These are the things you must do: Speak truth to one another, render true and sound judgments in your gates, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_17","039_8_17","ZEC","8","17","17","do not plot evil in your hearts against your neighbor, and do not love to swear falsely, for I hate all these things,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_18","039_8_18","ZEC","8","18","18","Then the word of the LORD of Hosts came to me, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_19","039_8_19","ZEC","8","19","19","“This is what the LORD of Hosts says: The fasts of the fourth, the fifth, the seventh, and the tenth months will become times of joy and gladness, cheerful feasts for the house of Judah. Therefore you are to love both truth and peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_20","039_8_20","ZEC","8","20","20","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “Peoples will yet come—the residents of many cities— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_21","039_8_21","ZEC","8","21","21","and the residents of one city will go to another, saying: ‘Let us go at once to plead before the LORD and to seek the LORD of Hosts. I myself am going.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_22","039_8_22","ZEC","8","22","22","And many peoples and strong nations will come to seek the LORD of Hosts in Jerusalem and to plead before the LORD.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC8_23","039_8_23","ZEC","8","23","23","This is what the LORD of Hosts says: “In those days ten men from the nations of every tongue will tightly grasp the robe of a Jew, saying, ‘Let us go with you, for we have heard that God is with you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_1","039_9_1","ZEC","9","1","1","This is the burden of the word of the LORD against the land of Hadrach and Damascus its resting place—for the eyes of men and of all the tribes of Israel are upon the LORD— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_2","039_9_2","ZEC","9","2","2","and also against Hamath, which borders it, as well as Tyre and Sidon, though they are very shrewd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_3","039_9_3","ZEC","9","3","3","Tyre has built herself a fortress; she has heaped up silver like dust, and gold like the dirt of the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_4","039_9_4","ZEC","9","4","4","Behold, the Lord will impoverish her and cast her wealth into the sea, and she will be consumed by fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_5","039_9_5","ZEC","9","5","5","Ashkelon will see and fear; Gaza will writhe in agony, as will Ekron, for her hope will wither. There will cease to be a king in Gaza, and Ashkelon will be uninhabited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_6","039_9_6","ZEC","9","6","6","A mixed race will occupy Ashdod, and I will cut off the pride of the Philistines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_7","039_9_7","ZEC","9","7","7","I will remove the blood from their mouths and the abominations from between their teeth. Then they too will become a remnant for our God; they will become like a clan in Judah, and Ekron will be like the Jebusites. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_8","039_9_8","ZEC","9","8","8","But I will camp around My house because of an army, because of those who march to and fro, and never again will an oppressor overrun My people, for now I keep watch with My own eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_9","039_9_9","ZEC","9","9","9","Rejoice greatly, O Daughter of Zion! Shout in triumph, O Daughter of Jerusalem! See, your King comes to you, righteous and victorious, humble and riding on a donkey, on a colt, the foal of a donkey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_10","039_9_10","ZEC","9","10","10","And I will cut off the chariot from Ephraim and the horse from Jerusalem, and the bow of war will be broken. Then He will proclaim peace to the nations. His dominion will extend from sea to sea, and from the Euphrates to the ends of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_11","039_9_11","ZEC","9","11","11","As for you, because of the blood of My covenant, I will release your prisoners from the waterless pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_12","039_9_12","ZEC","9","12","12","Return to your stronghold, O prisoners of hope; even today I declare that I will restore to you double. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_13","039_9_13","ZEC","9","13","13","For I will bend Judah as My bow and fit it with Ephraim. I will rouse your sons, O Zion, against the sons of Greece. I will make you like the sword of a mighty man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_14","039_9_14","ZEC","9","14","14","Then the LORD will appear over them, and His arrow will go forth like lightning. The Lord GOD will sound the ram’s horn and advance in the whirlwinds of the south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_15","039_9_15","ZEC","9","15","15","The LORD of Hosts will shield them. They will destroy and conquer with slingstones; they will drink and roar as with wine. And they will be filled like sprinkling bowls, drenched like the corners of the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_16","039_9_16","ZEC","9","16","16","On that day the LORD their God will save them as the flock of His people; for like jewels in a crown they will sparkle over His land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC9_17","039_9_17","ZEC","9","17","17","How lovely they will be, and how beautiful! Grain will make the young men flourish, and new wine, the young women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_1","039_10_1","ZEC","10","1","1","Ask the LORD for rain in springtime; the LORD makes the storm clouds, and He will give everyone showers of rain and crops in the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_2","039_10_2","ZEC","10","2","2","For idols speak deceit and diviners see illusions; they tell false dreams and offer empty comfort. Therefore the people wander like sheep, oppressed for lack of a shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_3","039_10_3","ZEC","10","3","3","“My anger burns against the shepherds, and I will punish the leaders. For the LORD of Hosts attends to His flock, the house of Judah; He will make them like His royal steed in battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_4","039_10_4","ZEC","10","4","4","The cornerstone will come from Judah, the tent peg from him, as well as the battle bow and every ruler together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_5","039_10_5","ZEC","10","5","5","They will be like mighty men in battle, trampling the enemy in the mire of the streets. They will fight because the LORD is with them, and they will put the horsemen to shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_6","039_10_6","ZEC","10","6","6","I will strengthen the house of Judah and save the house of Joseph. I will restore them because I have compassion on them, and they will be as though I had not rejected them. For I am the LORD their God, and I will answer them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_7","039_10_7","ZEC","10","7","7","Ephraim will be like a mighty man, and their hearts will be glad as with wine. Their children will see it and be joyful; their hearts will rejoice in the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_8","039_10_8","ZEC","10","8","8","I will whistle for them to gather, for I have redeemed them; and they will be as numerous as they once were. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_9","039_10_9","ZEC","10","9","9","Though I sow them among the nations, they will remember Me in distant lands; they and their children will live and return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_10","039_10_10","ZEC","10","10","10","I will bring them back from Egypt and gather them from Assyria. I will bring them to Gilead and Lebanon until no more room is found for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_11","039_10_11","ZEC","10","11","11","They will pass through the sea of distress and strike the waves of the sea; all the depths of the Nile will dry up. The pride of Assyria will be brought down, and the scepter of Egypt will depart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC10_12","039_10_12","ZEC","10","12","12","I will strengthen them in the LORD, and in His name they will walk,” declares the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_1","039_11_1","ZEC","11","1","1","Open your doors, O Lebanon, that the fire may consume your cedars! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_2","039_11_2","ZEC","11","2","2","Wail, O cypress, for the cedar has fallen; the majestic trees are ruined! Wail, O oaks of Bashan, for the dense forest has been cut down! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_3","039_11_3","ZEC","11","3","3","Listen to the wailing of the shepherds, for their glory is in ruins. Listen to the roaring of the young lions, for the thickets of the Jordan are destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_4","039_11_4","ZEC","11","4","4","This is what the LORD my God says: “Pasture the flock marked for slaughter, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_5","039_11_5","ZEC","11","5","5","whose buyers slaughter them without remorse. Those who sell them say, ‘Blessed be the LORD, for I am rich!’ Even their own shepherds have no compassion on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_6","039_11_6","ZEC","11","6","6","For I will no longer have compassion on the people of the land, declares the LORD, but behold, I will cause each man to fall into the hands of his neighbor and his king, who will devastate the land, and I will not deliver it from their hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_7","039_11_7","ZEC","11","7","7","So I pastured the flock marked for slaughter, especially the afflicted of the flock. Then I took for myself two staffs, calling one Favor and the other Union, and I pastured the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_8","039_11_8","ZEC","11","8","8","And in one month I dismissed three shepherds. My soul grew impatient with the flock, and their souls also detested me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_9","039_11_9","ZEC","11","9","9","Then I said, “I will no longer shepherd you. Let the dying die, and the perishing perish; and let those who remain devour one another’s flesh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_10","039_11_10","ZEC","11","10","10","Next I took my staff called Favor and cut it in two, revoking the covenant I had made with all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_11","039_11_11","ZEC","11","11","11","It was revoked on that day, and so the afflicted of the flock who were watching me knew that it was the word of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_12","039_11_12","ZEC","11","12","12","Then I told them, “If it seems right to you, give me my wages; but if not, keep them.” So they weighed out my wages, thirty pieces of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_13","039_11_13","ZEC","11","13","13","And the LORD said to me, “Throw it to the potter”—this magnificent price at which they valued me. So I took the thirty pieces of silver and threw them to the potter in the house of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_14","039_11_14","ZEC","11","14","14","Then I cut in two my second staff called Union, breaking the brotherhood between Judah and Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_15","039_11_15","ZEC","11","15","15","And the LORD said to me: “Take up once more the equipment of a foolish shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_16","039_11_16","ZEC","11","16","16","For behold, I will raise up a shepherd in the land who will neither care for the lost, nor seek the young, nor heal the broken, nor sustain the healthy, but he will devour the flesh of the choice sheep and tear off their hooves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC11_17","039_11_17","ZEC","11","17","17","Woe to the worthless shepherd, who deserts the flock! May a sword strike his arm and his right eye! May his arm be completely withered and his right eye utterly blinded!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_1","039_12_1","ZEC","12","1","1","This is the burden of the word of the LORD concerning Israel. Thus declares the LORD, who stretches out the heavens and lays the foundation of the earth, who forms the spirit of man within him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_2","039_12_2","ZEC","12","2","2","“Behold, I will make Jerusalem a cup of drunkenness to all the surrounding peoples. Judah will be besieged, as well as Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_3","039_12_3","ZEC","12","3","3","On that day, when all the nations of the earth gather against her, I will make Jerusalem a heavy stone for all the peoples; all who would heave it away will be severely injured. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_4","039_12_4","ZEC","12","4","4","On that day, declares the LORD, I will strike every horse with panic, and every rider with madness. I will keep a watchful eye on the house of Judah, but I will strike with blindness all the horses of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_5","039_12_5","ZEC","12","5","5","Then the leaders of Judah will say in their hearts: ‘The people of Jerusalem are my strength, for the LORD of Hosts is their God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_6","039_12_6","ZEC","12","6","6","On that day I will make the clans of Judah like a firepot in a woodpile, like a flaming torch among the sheaves; they will consume all the peoples around them on the right and on the left, while the people of Jerusalem remain secure there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_7","039_12_7","ZEC","12","7","7","The LORD will save the tents of Judah first, so that the glory of the house of David and of the people of Jerusalem may not be greater than that of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_8","039_12_8","ZEC","12","8","8","On that day the LORD will defend the people of Jerusalem, so that the weakest among them will be like David, and the house of David will be like God, like the angel of the LORD going before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_9","039_12_9","ZEC","12","9","9","So on that day I will set out to destroy all the nations that come against Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_10","039_12_10","ZEC","12","10","10","Then I will pour out on the house of David and on the people of Jerusalem a spirit of grace and prayer, and they will look on Me, the One they have pierced. They will mourn for Him as one mourns for an only child, and grieve bitterly for Him as one grieves for a firstborn son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_11","039_12_11","ZEC","12","11","11","On that day the wailing in Jerusalem will be as great as the wailing of Hadad-rimmon in the plain of Megiddo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_12","039_12_12","ZEC","12","12","12","The land will mourn, each clan on its own: the clan of the house of David and their wives, the clan of the house of Nathan and their wives, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_13","039_12_13","ZEC","12","13","13","the clan of the house of Levi and their wives, the clan of Shimei and their wives, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC12_14","039_12_14","ZEC","12","14","14","and all the remaining clans and their wives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_1","039_13_1","ZEC","13","1","1","“On that day a fountain will be opened to the house of David and the people of Jerusalem, to cleanse them from sin and impurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_2","039_13_2","ZEC","13","2","2","And on that day, declares the LORD of Hosts, I will erase the names of the idols from the land, and they will no longer be remembered. I will also remove the prophets and the spirit of impurity from the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_3","039_13_3","ZEC","13","3","3","And if anyone still prophesies, his father and mother who bore him will say to him, ‘You shall not remain alive, because you have spoken falsely in the name of the LORD.’ When he prophesies, his father and mother who bore him will pierce him through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_4","039_13_4","ZEC","13","4","4","And on that day every prophet who prophesies will be ashamed of his vision, and he will not put on a hairy cloak in order to deceive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_5","039_13_5","ZEC","13","5","5","He will say, ‘I am not a prophet; I work the land, for I was purchased as a servant in my youth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_6","039_13_6","ZEC","13","6","6","If someone asks him, ‘What are these wounds on your chest?’ he will answer, ‘These are the wounds I received in the house of my friends.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_7","039_13_7","ZEC","13","7","7","Awake, O sword, against My Shepherd, against the man who is My Companion, declares the LORD of Hosts. Strike the Shepherd, and the sheep will be scattered, and I will turn My hand against the little ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_8","039_13_8","ZEC","13","8","8","And in all the land, declares the LORD, two-thirds will be cut off and perish, but a third will be left in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC13_9","039_13_9","ZEC","13","9","9","This third I will bring through the fire; I will refine them like silver and test them like gold. They will call on My name, and I will answer them. I will say, ‘They are My people,’ and they will say, ‘The LORD is our God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_1","039_14_1","ZEC","14","1","1","Behold, a day of the LORD is coming when your plunder will be divided in your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_2","039_14_2","ZEC","14","2","2","For I will gather all the nations for battle against Jerusalem, and the city will be captured, the houses looted, and the women ravished. Half of the city will go into exile, but the rest of the people will not be removed from the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_3","039_14_3","ZEC","14","3","3","Then the LORD will go out to fight against those nations, as He fights in the day of battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_4","039_14_4","ZEC","14","4","4","On that day His feet will stand on the Mount of Olives, east of Jerusalem, and the Mount of Olives will be split in two from east to west, forming a great valley, with half the mountain moving to the north and half to the south. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_5","039_14_5","ZEC","14","5","5","You will flee by My mountain valley, for it will extend to Azal. You will flee as you fled from the earthquake in the days of Uzziah king of Judah. Then the LORD my God will come, and all the holy ones with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_6","039_14_6","ZEC","14","6","6","On that day there will be no light, no cold or frost. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_7","039_14_7","ZEC","14","7","7","It will be a unique day known only to the LORD, without day or night; but when evening comes, there will be light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_8","039_14_8","ZEC","14","8","8","And on that day living water will flow out from Jerusalem, half of it toward the Eastern Sea and the other half toward the Western Sea, in summer and winter alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_9","039_14_9","ZEC","14","9","9","On that day the LORD will become King over all the earth—the LORD alone, and His name alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_10","039_14_10","ZEC","14","10","10","All the land from Geba to Rimmon south of Jerusalem will be turned into a plain, but Jerusalem will be raised up and will remain in her place, from the Benjamin Gate to the site of the First Gate to the Corner Gate, and from the Tower of Hananel to the royal winepresses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_11","039_14_11","ZEC","14","11","11","People will live there, and never again will there be an utter destruction. So Jerusalem will dwell securely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_12","039_14_12","ZEC","14","12","12","And this will be the plague with which the LORD strikes all the peoples who have warred against Jerusalem: Their flesh will rot while they stand on their feet, their eyes will rot in their sockets, and their tongues will rot in their mouths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_13","039_14_13","ZEC","14","13","13","On that day a great panic from the LORD will come upon them, so that each will seize the hand of another, and the hand of one will rise against the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_14","039_14_14","ZEC","14","14","14","Judah will also fight at Jerusalem, and the wealth of all the surrounding nations will be collected—gold, silver, and apparel in great abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_15","039_14_15","ZEC","14","15","15","And a similar plague will strike the horses and mules, camels and donkeys, and all the animals in those camps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_16","039_14_16","ZEC","14","16","16","Then all the survivors from the nations that came against Jerusalem will go up year after year to worship the King, the LORD of Hosts, and to celebrate the Feast of Tabernacles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_17","039_14_17","ZEC","14","17","17","And should any of the families of the earth not go up to Jerusalem to worship the King, the LORD of Hosts, then the rain will not fall on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_18","039_14_18","ZEC","14","18","18","And if the people of Egypt will not go up and enter in, then the rain will not fall on them; this will be the plague with which the LORD strikes the nations who do not go up to celebrate the Feast of Tabernacles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_19","039_14_19","ZEC","14","19","19","This will be the punishment of Egypt and of all the nations that do not go up to celebrate the Feast of Tabernacles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_20","039_14_20","ZEC","14","20","20","On that day, HOLY TO THE LORD will be inscribed on the bells of the horses, and the cooking pots in the house of the LORD will be like the sprinkling bowls before the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ZC14_21","039_14_21","ZEC","14","21","21","Indeed, every pot in Jerusalem and Judah will be holy to the LORD of Hosts, and all who sacrifice will come and take some pots and cook in them. And on that day there will no longer be a Canaanite in the house of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_1","040_1_1","MAL","1","1","1","This is the burden of the word of the LORD to Israel through Malachi: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_2","040_1_2","MAL","1","2","2","“I have loved you,” says the LORD. But you ask, “How have You loved us?” “Was not Esau Jacob’s brother?” declares the LORD. “Yet Jacob I have loved, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_3","040_1_3","MAL","1","3","3","but Esau I have hated, and I have made his mountains a wasteland and left his inheritance to the desert jackals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_4","040_1_4","MAL","1","4","4","Though Edom may say, “We have been devastated, but we will rebuild the ruins,” this is what the LORD of Hosts says: “They may build, but I will demolish. They will be called the Land of Wickedness, and a people with whom the LORD is indignant forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_5","040_1_5","MAL","1","5","5","You will see this with your own eyes, and you yourselves will say, ‘The LORD is great—even beyond the borders of Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_6","040_1_6","MAL","1","6","6","“A son honors his father, and a servant his master. But if I am a father, where is My honor? And if I am a master, where is your fear of Me?” says the LORD of Hosts to you priests who despise My name. “But you ask, ‘How have we despised Your name?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_7","040_1_7","MAL","1","7","7","By presenting defiled food on My altar. But you ask, ‘How have we defiled You?’ By saying that the table of the LORD is contemptible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_8","040_1_8","MAL","1","8","8","When you offer blind animals for sacrifice, is it not wrong? And when you present the lame and sick ones, is it not wrong? Try offering them to your governor! Would he be pleased with you or show you favor?” asks the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_9","040_1_9","MAL","1","9","9","“But ask now for God’s favor. Will He be gracious? Since this has come from your hands, will He show you favor?” asks the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_10","040_1_10","MAL","1","10","10","“Oh, that one of you would shut the temple doors, so that you would no longer kindle useless fires on My altar! I take no pleasure in you,” says the LORD of Hosts, “and I will accept no offering from your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_11","040_1_11","MAL","1","11","11","For My name will be great among the nations, from where the sun rises to where it sets. In every place, incense and pure offerings will be presented in My name, because My name will be great among the nations,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_12","040_1_12","MAL","1","12","12","“But you profane it when you say, ‘The table of the Lord is defiled, and as for its fruit, its food is contemptible.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_13","040_1_13","MAL","1","13","13","You also say: ‘Oh, what a nuisance!’ And you turn up your nose at it,” says the LORD of Hosts. “You bring offerings that are stolen, lame, or sick! Should I accept these from your hands?” asks the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML1_14","040_1_14","MAL","1","14","14","“But cursed is the deceiver who has an acceptable male in his flock and vows to give it, but sacrifices a defective animal to the Lord. For I am a great King,” says the LORD of Hosts, “and My name is to be feared among the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_1","040_2_1","MAL","2","1","1","“And now this decree is for you, O priests: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_2","040_2_2","MAL","2","2","2","If you do not listen, and if you do not take it to heart to honor My name,” says the LORD of Hosts, “I will send a curse among you, and I will curse your blessings. Yes, I have already begun to curse them, because you are not taking it to heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_3","040_2_3","MAL","2","3","3","Behold, I will rebuke your descendants, and I will spread dung on your faces, the waste from your feasts, and you will be carried off with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_4","040_2_4","MAL","2","4","4","Then you will know that I have sent you this commandment so that My covenant with Levi may continue,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_5","040_2_5","MAL","2","5","5","“My covenant with him was one of life and peace, which I gave to him; it called for reverence, and he revered Me and stood in awe of My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_6","040_2_6","MAL","2","6","6","True instruction was in his mouth, and nothing false was found on his lips. He walked with Me in peace and uprightness, and he turned many from iniquity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_7","040_2_7","MAL","2","7","7","For the lips of a priest should preserve knowledge, and people should seek instruction from his mouth, because he is the messenger of the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_8","040_2_8","MAL","2","8","8","But you have departed from the way, and your instruction has caused many to stumble. You have violated the covenant of Levi,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_9","040_2_9","MAL","2","9","9","“So I in turn have made you despised and humiliated before all the people, because you have not kept My ways, but have shown partiality in matters of the law.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_10","040_2_10","MAL","2","10","10","Do we not all have one Father? Did not one God create us? Why then do we break faith with one another so as to profane the covenant of our fathers? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_11","040_2_11","MAL","2","11","11","Judah has broken faith; an abomination has been committed in Israel and in Jerusalem. For Judah has profaned the LORD’s beloved sanctuary by marrying the daughter of a foreign god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_12","040_2_12","MAL","2","12","12","As for the man who does this, may the LORD cut off from the tents of Jacob everyone who is awake and aware—even if he brings an offering to the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_13","040_2_13","MAL","2","13","13","And this is another thing you do: You cover the altar of the LORD with tears, with weeping and groaning, because He no longer regards your offerings or receives them gladly from your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_14","040_2_14","MAL","2","14","14","Yet you ask, “Why?” It is because the LORD has been a witness between you and the wife of your youth, against whom you have broken faith, though she is your companion and your wife by covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_15","040_2_15","MAL","2","15","15","Has not the LORD made them one, having a portion of the Spirit? And why one? Because He seeks godly offspring. So guard yourselves in your spirit and do not break faith with the wife of your youth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_16","040_2_16","MAL","2","16","16","“For I hate divorce,” says the LORD, the God of Israel. “He who divorces his wife covers his garment with violence,” says the LORD of Hosts. So guard yourselves in your spirit and do not break faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML2_17","040_2_17","MAL","2","17","17","You have wearied the LORD with your words; yet you ask, “How have we wearied Him?” By saying, “All who do evil are good in the sight of the LORD, and in them He delights,” or, “Where is the God of justice?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_1","040_3_1","MAL","3","1","1","“Behold, I will send My messenger, who will prepare the way before Me. Then the Lord whom you seek will suddenly come to His temple—the Messenger of the covenant, in whom you delight—see, He is coming,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_2","040_3_2","MAL","3","2","2","But who can endure the day of His coming? And who can stand when He appears? For He will be like a refiner’s fire, like a launderer’s soap. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_3","040_3_3","MAL","3","3","3","And He will sit as a refiner and purifier of silver; He will purify the sons of Levi and refine them like gold and silver. Then they will present offerings to the LORD in righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_4","040_3_4","MAL","3","4","4","Then the offerings of Judah and Jerusalem will please the LORD, as in days of old and years gone by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_5","040_3_5","MAL","3","5","5","“Then I will draw near to you for judgment. And I will be a swift witness against sorcerers and adulterers and perjurers, against oppressors of the widowed and fatherless, and against those who defraud laborers of their wages and deny justice to the foreigner but do not fear Me,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_6","040_3_6","MAL","3","6","6","“Because I, the LORD, do not change, you descendants of Jacob have not been destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_7","040_3_7","MAL","3","7","7","Yet from the days of your fathers, you have turned away from My statutes and have not kept them. Return to Me, and I will return to you,” says the LORD of Hosts. “But you ask, ‘How can we return?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_8","040_3_8","MAL","3","8","8","Will a man rob God? Yet you are robbing Me! But you ask, ‘How do we rob You?’ In tithes and offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_9","040_3_9","MAL","3","9","9","You are cursed with a curse, yet you—the whole nation—are still robbing Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_10","040_3_10","MAL","3","10","10","Bring the full tithe into the storehouse, so that there may be food in My house. Test Me in this,” says the LORD of Hosts. “See if I will not open the windows of heaven and pour out for you blessing without measure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_11","040_3_11","MAL","3","11","11","I will rebuke the devourer for you, so that it will not destroy the fruits of your land, and the vine in your field will not fail to produce fruit,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_12","040_3_12","MAL","3","12","12","“Then all the nations will call you blessed, for you will be a land of delight,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_13","040_3_13","MAL","3","13","13","“Your words against Me have been harsh,” says the LORD. “Yet you ask, ‘What have we spoken against You?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_14","040_3_14","MAL","3","14","14","You have said, ‘It is futile to serve God. What have we gained by keeping His requirements and walking mournfully before the LORD of Hosts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_15","040_3_15","MAL","3","15","15","So now we call the arrogant blessed. Not only do evildoers prosper, they even test God and escape.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_16","040_3_16","MAL","3","16","16","At that time those who feared the LORD spoke with one another, and the LORD listened and heard them. So a scroll of remembrance was written before Him regarding those who feared the LORD and honored His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_17","040_3_17","MAL","3","17","17","“They will be Mine,” says the LORD of Hosts, “on the day when I prepare My treasured possession. And I will spare them as a man spares his own son who serves him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML3_18","040_3_18","MAL","3","18","18","So you will again distinguish between the righteous and the wicked, between those who serve God and those who do not.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_1","040_4_1","MAL","4","1","1","“For behold, the day is coming, burning like a furnace, when all the arrogant and every evildoer will be stubble; the day is coming when I will set them ablaze,” says the LORD of Hosts. “Not a root or branch will be left to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_2","040_4_2","MAL","4","2","2","“But for you who fear My name, the sun of righteousness will rise with healing in its wings, and you will go out and leap like calves from the stall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_3","040_4_3","MAL","4","3","3","Then you will trample the wicked, for they will be ashes under the soles of your feet on the day I am preparing,” says the LORD of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_4","040_4_4","MAL","4","4","4","“Remember the law of My servant Moses, the statutes and ordinances I commanded him for all Israel at Horeb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_5","040_4_5","MAL","4","5","5","Behold, I will send you Elijah the prophet before the coming of the great and awesome Day of the LORD. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("ML4_6","040_4_6","MAL","4","6","6","And he will turn the hearts of the fathers to their children, and the hearts of the children to their fathers. Otherwise, I will come and strike the land with a curse.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_1","070_1_1","MAT","1","1","1","This is the record of the genealogy of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_2","070_1_2","MAT","1","2","2","Abraham was the father of Isaac, Isaac the father of Jacob, and Jacob the father of Judah and his brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_3","070_1_3","MAT","1","3","3","Judah was the father of Perez and Zerah by Tamar, Perez the father of Hezron, and Hezron the father of Ram. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_4","070_1_4","MAT","1","4","4","Ram was the father of Amminadab, Amminadab the father of Nahshon, and Nahshon the father of Salmon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_5","070_1_5","MAT","1","5","5","Salmon was the father of Boaz by Rahab, Boaz the father of Obed by Ruth, Obed the father of Jesse, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_6","070_1_6","MAT","1","6","6","and Jesse the father of David the king. Next: David the king was the father of Solomon by Uriah’s wife, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_7","070_1_7","MAT","1","7","7","Solomon the father of Rehoboam, Rehoboam the father of Abijah, and Abijah the father of Asa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_8","070_1_8","MAT","1","8","8","Asa was the father of Jehoshaphat, Jehoshaphat the father of Joram, and Joram the father of Uzziah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_9","070_1_9","MAT","1","9","9","Uzziah was the father of Jotham, Jotham the father of Ahaz, and Ahaz the father of Hezekiah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_10","070_1_10","MAT","1","10","10","Hezekiah was the father of Manasseh, Manasseh the father of Amon, Amon the father of Josiah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_11","070_1_11","MAT","1","11","11","and Josiah the father of Jeconiah and his brothers at the time of the exile to Babylon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_12","070_1_12","MAT","1","12","12","After the exile to Babylon: Jeconiah was the father of Shealtiel, Shealtiel the father of Zerubbabel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_13","070_1_13","MAT","1","13","13","Zerubbabel the father of Abiud, Abiud the father of Eliakim, and Eliakim the father of Azor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_14","070_1_14","MAT","1","14","14","Azor was the father of Zadok, Zadok the father of Achim, and Achim the father of Eliud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_15","070_1_15","MAT","1","15","15","Eliud was the father of Eleazar, Eleazar the father of Matthan, Matthan the father of Jacob, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_16","070_1_16","MAT","1","16","16","and Jacob the father of Joseph, the husband of Mary, of whom was born Jesus, who is called Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_17","070_1_17","MAT","1","17","17","In all, then, there were fourteen generations from Abraham to David, fourteen from David to the exile to Babylon, and fourteen from the exile to the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_18","070_1_18","MAT","1","18","18","This is how the birth of Jesus Christ came about: His mother Mary was pledged in marriage to Joseph, but before they came together, she was found to be with child through the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_19","070_1_19","MAT","1","19","19","Because Joseph her husband was a righteous man and was unwilling to disgrace her publicly, he resolved to divorce her quietly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_20","070_1_20","MAT","1","20","20","But after he had pondered these things, an angel of the Lord appeared to him in a dream and said, “Joseph, son of David, do not be afraid to embrace Mary as your wife, for the One conceived in her is from the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_21","070_1_21","MAT","1","21","21","She will give birth to a Son, and you are to give Him the name Jesus, because He will save His people from their sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_22","070_1_22","MAT","1","22","22","All this took place to fulfill what the Lord had said through the prophet: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_23","070_1_23","MAT","1","23","23","“Behold, the virgin will be with child and will give birth to a son, and they will call Him Immanuel” (which means, “God with us”). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_24","070_1_24","MAT","1","24","24","When Joseph woke up, he did as the angel of the Lord had commanded him and embraced Mary as his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT1_25","070_1_25","MAT","1","25","25","But he had no union with her until she gave birth to her firstborn Son. And he gave Him the name Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_1","070_2_1","MAT","2","1","1","After Jesus was born in Bethlehem in Judea, during the time of King Herod, Magi from the east arrived in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_2","070_2_2","MAT","2","2","2","asking, “Where is the One who has been born King of the Jews? We saw His star in the east and have come to worship Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_3","070_2_3","MAT","2","3","3","When Herod the king heard this, he was disturbed, and all Jerusalem with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_4","070_2_4","MAT","2","4","4","And when he had assembled all the chief priests and scribes of the people, he asked them where the Christ was to be born. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_5","070_2_5","MAT","2","5","5","“In Bethlehem in Judea,” they replied, “for this is what the prophet has written: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_6","070_2_6","MAT","2","6","6","‘But you, Bethlehem, in the land of Judah, are by no means least among the rulers of Judah, for out of you will come a ruler who will be the shepherd of My people Israel.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_7","070_2_7","MAT","2","7","7","Then Herod called the Magi secretly and learned from them the exact time the star had appeared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_8","070_2_8","MAT","2","8","8","And sending them to Bethlehem, he said: “Go and search carefully for the Child, and when you find Him, report to me, so that I too may go and worship Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_9","070_2_9","MAT","2","9","9","After they had heard the king, they went on their way, and the star they had seen in the east went ahead of them until it stood over the place where the Child was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_10","070_2_10","MAT","2","10","10","When they saw the star, they rejoiced with great delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_11","070_2_11","MAT","2","11","11","On coming to the house, they saw the Child with His mother Mary, and they fell down and worshiped Him. Then they opened their treasures and presented Him with gifts of gold and frankincense and myrrh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_12","070_2_12","MAT","2","12","12","And having been warned in a dream not to return to Herod, they withdrew to their country by another route. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_13","070_2_13","MAT","2","13","13","When the Magi had gone, an angel of the Lord appeared to Joseph in a dream. “Get up!” he said. “Take the Child and His mother and flee to Egypt. Stay there until I tell you, for Herod is going to search for the Child to kill Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_14","070_2_14","MAT","2","14","14","So he got up, took the Child and His mother by night, and withdrew to Egypt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_15","070_2_15","MAT","2","15","15","where he stayed until the death of Herod. This fulfilled what the Lord had spoken through the prophet: “Out of Egypt I called My Son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_16","070_2_16","MAT","2","16","16","When Herod saw that he had been outwitted by the Magi, he was filled with rage. Sending orders, he put to death all the boys in Bethlehem and its vicinity who were two years old and under, according to the time he had learned from the Magi. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_17","070_2_17","MAT","2","17","17","Then what was spoken through the prophet Jeremiah was fulfilled: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_18","070_2_18","MAT","2","18","18","“A voice is heard in Ramah, lamentation and weeping and great mourning, Rachel weeping for her children and refusing to be comforted, because they are no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_19","070_2_19","MAT","2","19","19","After Herod died, an angel of the Lord appeared in a dream to Joseph in Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_20","070_2_20","MAT","2","20","20","“Get up!” he said. “Take the Child and His mother and go to the land of Israel, for those seeking the Child’s life are now dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_21","070_2_21","MAT","2","21","21","So Joseph got up, took the Child and His mother, and went to the land of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_22","070_2_22","MAT","2","22","22","But when he learned that Archelaus was reigning in Judea in place of his father Herod, he was afraid to go there. And having been warned in a dream, he withdrew to the district of Galilee, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT2_23","070_2_23","MAT","2","23","23","and he went and lived in a town called Nazareth. So was fulfilled what was spoken through the prophets: “He will be called a Nazarene.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_1","070_3_1","MAT","3","1","1","In those days John the Baptist came, preaching in the wilderness of Judea ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_2","070_3_2","MAT","3","2","2","and saying, “Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is near.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_3","070_3_3","MAT","3","3","3","This is he who was spoken of through the prophet Isaiah: “A voice of one calling in the wilderness, ‘Prepare the way for the Lord, make straight paths for Him.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_4","070_3_4","MAT","3","4","4","John wore a garment of camel’s hair and a leather belt around his waist. His food was locusts and wild honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_5","070_3_5","MAT","3","5","5","People went out to him from Jerusalem and all Judea and the whole region around the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_6","070_3_6","MAT","3","6","6","Confessing their sins, they were baptized by him in the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_7","070_3_7","MAT","3","7","7","But when John saw many of the Pharisees and Sadducees coming to his place of baptism, he said to them, “You brood of vipers, who warned you to flee from the coming wrath? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_8","070_3_8","MAT","3","8","8","Produce fruit, then, in keeping with repentance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_9","070_3_9","MAT","3","9","9","And do not presume to say to yourselves, ‘We have Abraham as our father.’ For I tell you that out of these stones God can raise up children for Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_10","070_3_10","MAT","3","10","10","The axe lies ready at the root of the trees, and every tree that does not produce good fruit will be cut down and thrown into the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_11","070_3_11","MAT","3","11","11","I baptize you with water for repentance, but after me will come One more powerful than I, whose sandals I am not worthy to carry. He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_12","070_3_12","MAT","3","12","12","His winnowing fork is in His hand, and He will clear His threshing floor and gather His wheat into the barn; but He will burn up the chaff with unquenchable fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_13","070_3_13","MAT","3","13","13","At that time Jesus came from Galilee to the Jordan to be baptized by John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_14","070_3_14","MAT","3","14","14","But John tried to prevent Him, saying, “I need to be baptized by You, and do You come to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_15","070_3_15","MAT","3","15","15","“Let it be so now,” Jesus replied. “It is fitting for us to fulfill all righteousness in this way.” Then John permitted Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_16","070_3_16","MAT","3","16","16","As soon as Jesus was baptized, He went up out of the water. Suddenly the heavens were opened to Him, and He saw the Spirit of God descending like a dove and resting on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT3_17","070_3_17","MAT","3","17","17","And a voice from heaven said, “This is My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_1","070_4_1","MAT","4","1","1","Then Jesus was led by the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted by the devil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_2","070_4_2","MAT","4","2","2","After fasting forty days and forty nights, He was hungry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_3","070_4_3","MAT","4","3","3","The tempter came to Him and said, “If You are the Son of God, tell these stones to become bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_4","070_4_4","MAT","4","4","4","But Jesus answered, “It is written: ‘Man shall not live on bread alone, but on every word that comes from the mouth of God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_5","070_4_5","MAT","4","5","5","Then the devil took Him to the holy city and set Him on the pinnacle of the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_6","070_4_6","MAT","4","6","6","“If You are the Son of God,” he said, “throw Yourself down. For it is written: ‘He will command His angels concerning You, and they will lift You up in their hands, so that You will not strike Your foot against a stone.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_7","070_4_7","MAT","4","7","7","Jesus replied, “It is also written: ‘Do not put the Lord your God to the test.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_8","070_4_8","MAT","4","8","8","Again, the devil took Him to a very high mountain and showed Him all the kingdoms of the world and their glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_9","070_4_9","MAT","4","9","9","“All this I will give You,” he said, “if You will fall down and worship me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_10","070_4_10","MAT","4","10","10","“Get behind Me, Satan!” Jesus told him. “For it is written: ‘Worship the Lord your God and serve Him only.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_11","070_4_11","MAT","4","11","11","Then the devil left Him, and angels came and ministered to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_12","070_4_12","MAT","4","12","12","When Jesus heard that John had been imprisoned, He withdrew to Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_13","070_4_13","MAT","4","13","13","Leaving Nazareth, He went and lived in Capernaum, which is by the sea in the region of Zebulun and Naphtali, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_14","070_4_14","MAT","4","14","14","to fulfill what was spoken through the prophet Isaiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_15","070_4_15","MAT","4","15","15","“Land of Zebulun and land of Naphtali, the Way of the Sea, beyond the Jordan, Galilee of the Gentiles— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_16","070_4_16","MAT","4","16","16","the people living in darkness have seen a great light; on those living in the land of the shadow of death, a light has dawned.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_17","070_4_17","MAT","4","17","17","From that time on Jesus began to preach, “Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is near.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_18","070_4_18","MAT","4","18","18","As Jesus was walking beside the Sea of Galilee, He saw two brothers, Simon called Peter and his brother Andrew. They were casting a net into the sea, for they were fishermen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_19","070_4_19","MAT","4","19","19","“Come, follow Me,” Jesus said, “and I will make you fishers of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_20","070_4_20","MAT","4","20","20","And at once they left their nets and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_21","070_4_21","MAT","4","21","21","Going on from there, He saw two other brothers, James son of Zebedee and his brother John. They were in a boat with their father Zebedee, mending their nets. Jesus called them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_22","070_4_22","MAT","4","22","22","and immediately they left the boat and their father and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_23","070_4_23","MAT","4","23","23","Jesus went throughout Galilee, teaching in their synagogues, preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every disease and sickness among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_24","070_4_24","MAT","4","24","24","News about Him spread all over Syria, and people brought to Him all who were ill with various diseases, those suffering acute pain, the demon-possessed, those having seizures, and the paralyzed, and He healed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT4_25","070_4_25","MAT","4","25","25","Large crowds followed Him, having come from Galilee, the Decapolis, Jerusalem, Judea, and beyond the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_1","070_5_1","MAT","5","1","1","When Jesus saw the crowds, He went up on the mountain and sat down. His disciples came to Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_2","070_5_2","MAT","5","2","2","and He began to teach them, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_3","070_5_3","MAT","5","3","3","“Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_4","070_5_4","MAT","5","4","4","Blessed are those who mourn, for they will be comforted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_5","070_5_5","MAT","5","5","5","Blessed are the meek, for they will inherit the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_6","070_5_6","MAT","5","6","6","Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for they will be filled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_7","070_5_7","MAT","5","7","7","Blessed are the merciful, for they will be shown mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_8","070_5_8","MAT","5","8","8","Blessed are the pure in heart, for they will see God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_9","070_5_9","MAT","5","9","9","Blessed are the peacemakers, for they will be called sons of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_10","070_5_10","MAT","5","10","10","Blessed are those who are persecuted because of righteousness, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_11","070_5_11","MAT","5","11","11","Blessed are you when people insult you, persecute you, and falsely say every evil thing against you because of Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_12","070_5_12","MAT","5","12","12","Rejoice and be glad, because great is your reward in heaven, for in the same way they persecuted the prophets before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_13","070_5_13","MAT","5","13","13","You are the salt of the earth. But if the salt loses its savor, how can it be made salty again? It is no longer good for anything, except to be thrown out and trampled by men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_14","070_5_14","MAT","5","14","14","You are the light of the world. A city on a hill cannot be hidden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_15","070_5_15","MAT","5","15","15","Neither do people light a lamp and put it under a basket. Instead, they set it on a stand, and it gives light to everyone in the house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_16","070_5_16","MAT","5","16","16","In the same way, let your light shine before men, that they may see your good deeds and glorify your Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_17","070_5_17","MAT","5","17","17","Do not think that I have come to abolish the Law or the Prophets. I have not come to abolish them, but to fulfill them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_18","070_5_18","MAT","5","18","18","For I tell you truly, until heaven and earth pass away, not a single jot, not a stroke of a pen, will disappear from the Law until everything is accomplished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_19","070_5_19","MAT","5","19","19","So then, whoever breaks one of the least of these commandments and teaches others to do likewise will be called least in the kingdom of heaven; but whoever practices and teaches them will be called great in the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_20","070_5_20","MAT","5","20","20","For I tell you that unless your righteousness exceeds that of the scribes and Pharisees, you will never enter the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_21","070_5_21","MAT","5","21","21","You have heard that it was said to the ancients, ‘Do not murder’ and ‘Anyone who murders will be subject to judgment.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_22","070_5_22","MAT","5","22","22","But I tell you that anyone who is angry with his brother without cause will be subject to judgment. Again, anyone who says to his brother, ‘Raca,’ will be subject to the Sanhedrin. But anyone who says, ‘You fool!’ will be subject to the fire of hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_23","070_5_23","MAT","5","23","23","So if you are offering your gift at the altar and there remember that your brother has something against you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_24","070_5_24","MAT","5","24","24","leave your gift there before the altar. First go and be reconciled to your brother; then come and offer your gift. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_25","070_5_25","MAT","5","25","25","Reconcile quickly with your adversary, while you are still on the way to court. Otherwise, he may hand you over to the judge, and the judge may hand you over to the officer, and you may be thrown into prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_26","070_5_26","MAT","5","26","26","Truly I tell you, you will not get out until you have paid the last penny. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_27","070_5_27","MAT","5","27","27","You have heard that it was said, ‘Do not commit adultery.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_28","070_5_28","MAT","5","28","28","But I tell you that anyone who looks at a woman to lust after her has already committed adultery with her in his heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_29","070_5_29","MAT","5","29","29","If your right eye causes you to sin, gouge it out and throw it away. It is better for you to lose one part of your body than for your whole body to be thrown into hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_30","070_5_30","MAT","5","30","30","And if your right hand causes you to sin, cut it off and throw it away. It is better for you to lose one part of your body than for your whole body to be cast into hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_31","070_5_31","MAT","5","31","31","It has also been said, ‘Whoever divorces his wife must give her a certificate of divorce.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_32","070_5_32","MAT","5","32","32","But I tell you that whoever divorces his wife, except for sexual immorality, brings adultery upon her. And he who marries a divorced woman commits adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_33","070_5_33","MAT","5","33","33","Again, you have heard that it was said to the ancients, ‘Do not break your oath, but fulfill your vows to the Lord.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_34","070_5_34","MAT","5","34","34","But I tell you not to swear at all: either by heaven, for it is God’s throne; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_35","070_5_35","MAT","5","35","35","or by the earth, for it is His footstool; or by Jerusalem, for it is the city of the great King. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_36","070_5_36","MAT","5","36","36","Nor should you swear by your head, for you cannot make a single hair white or black. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_37","070_5_37","MAT","5","37","37","Simply let your ‘Yes’ be ‘Yes,’ and your ‘No,’ ‘No.’ Anything more comes from the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_38","070_5_38","MAT","5","38","38","You have heard that it was said, ‘Eye for eye and tooth for tooth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_39","070_5_39","MAT","5","39","39","But I tell you not to resist an evil person. If someone slaps you on the right cheek, turn to him the other also; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_40","070_5_40","MAT","5","40","40","if someone wants to sue you and take your tunic, let him have your cloak as well; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_41","070_5_41","MAT","5","41","41","and if someone forces you to go one mile, go with him two miles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_42","070_5_42","MAT","5","42","42","Give to the one who asks you, and do not turn away from the one who wants to borrow from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_43","070_5_43","MAT","5","43","43","You have heard that it was said, ‘Love your neighbor’ and ‘Hate your enemy.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_44","070_5_44","MAT","5","44","44","But I tell you, love your enemies, bless those who curse you, do good to those who hate you, and pray for those who mistreat you and persecute you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_45","070_5_45","MAT","5","45","45","that you may be sons of your Father in heaven. He causes His sun to rise on the evil and the good, and sends rain on the righteous and the unrighteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_46","070_5_46","MAT","5","46","46","If you love those who love you, what reward will you get? Do not even tax collectors do the same? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_47","070_5_47","MAT","5","47","47","And if you greet only your friends, what are you doing more than others? Do not even the tax collectors do the same? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT5_48","070_5_48","MAT","5","48","48","Be perfect, therefore, as your Father in heaven is perfect. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_1","070_6_1","MAT","6","1","1","“Be careful not to perform your acts of charity before men to be seen by them. If you do, you will have no reward from your Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_2","070_6_2","MAT","6","2","2","So when you give to the needy, do not sound a trumpet before you, as the hypocrites do in the synagogues and on the streets, to be honored by men. Truly I tell you, they already have their full reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_3","070_6_3","MAT","6","3","3","But when you give to the needy, do not let your left hand know what your right hand is doing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_4","070_6_4","MAT","6","4","4","so that your giving may be in secret. And your Father, who sees what is done in secret, will Himself reward you openly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_5","070_6_5","MAT","6","5","5","And when you pray, do not be like the hypocrites. For they love to pray standing in the synagogues and on the street corners to be seen by men. Truly I tell you, they already have their full reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_6","070_6_6","MAT","6","6","6","But when you pray, go into your inner room, shut your door, and pray to your Father, who is unseen. And your Father, who sees what is done in secret, will reward you openly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_7","070_6_7","MAT","6","7","7","And when you pray, do not babble on like pagans, for they think that by their many words they will be heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_8","070_6_8","MAT","6","8","8","Do not be like them, for your Father knows what you need before you ask Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_9","070_6_9","MAT","6","9","9","So then, this is how you should pray: ‘Our Father in heaven, hallowed be Your name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_10","070_6_10","MAT","6","10","10","Your kingdom come, Your will be done, on earth as it is in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_11","070_6_11","MAT","6","11","11","Give us this day our daily bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_12","070_6_12","MAT","6","12","12","And forgive us our debts, as we also forgive our debtors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_13","070_6_13","MAT","6","13","13","And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from the evil one. For Yours is the kingdom and the power and the glory forever. Amen.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_14","070_6_14","MAT","6","14","14","For if you forgive men their trespasses, your heavenly Father will also forgive you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_15","070_6_15","MAT","6","15","15","But if you do not forgive men their trespasses, neither will your Father forgive yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_16","070_6_16","MAT","6","16","16","When you fast, do not be somber like the hypocrites, for they disfigure their faces to show men they are fasting. Truly I tell you, they already have their full reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_17","070_6_17","MAT","6","17","17","But when you fast, anoint your head and wash your face, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_18","070_6_18","MAT","6","18","18","so that your fasting will not be obvious to men, but only to your Father, who is unseen. And your Father, who sees what is done in secret, will reward you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_19","070_6_19","MAT","6","19","19","Do not store up for yourselves treasures on earth, where moth and rust destroy, and where thieves break in and steal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_20","070_6_20","MAT","6","20","20","But store up for yourselves treasures in heaven, where moth and rust do not destroy, and where thieves do not break in and steal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_21","070_6_21","MAT","6","21","21","For where your treasure is, there your heart will be also. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_22","070_6_22","MAT","6","22","22","The eye is the lamp of the body. If your eyes are good, your whole body will be full of light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_23","070_6_23","MAT","6","23","23","But if your eyes are bad, your whole body will be full of darkness. If then the light within you is darkness, how great is that darkness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_24","070_6_24","MAT","6","24","24","No one can serve two masters: Either he will hate the one and love the other, or he will be devoted to the one and despise the other. You cannot serve both God and money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_25","070_6_25","MAT","6","25","25","Therefore I tell you, do not worry about your life, what you will eat and drink; or about your body, what you will wear. Is not life more than food, and the body more than clothes? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_26","070_6_26","MAT","6","26","26","Look at the birds of the air: They do not sow or reap or gather into barns, and yet your heavenly Father feeds them. Are you not much more valuable than they? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_27","070_6_27","MAT","6","27","27","Who of you by worrying can add a single hour to his life? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_28","070_6_28","MAT","6","28","28","And why do you worry about clothes? Consider how the lilies of the field grow: They do not labor or spin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_29","070_6_29","MAT","6","29","29","Yet I tell you that not even Solomon in all his glory was adorned like one of these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_30","070_6_30","MAT","6","30","30","If that is how God clothes the grass of the field, which is here today and tomorrow is thrown into the furnace, will He not much more clothe you, O you of little faith? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_31","070_6_31","MAT","6","31","31","Therefore do not worry, saying, ‘What shall we eat?’ or ‘What shall we drink?’ or ‘What shall we wear?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_32","070_6_32","MAT","6","32","32","For the Gentiles strive after all these things, and your heavenly Father knows that you need them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_33","070_6_33","MAT","6","33","33","But seek first the kingdom of God and His righteousness, and all these things will be added unto you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT6_34","070_6_34","MAT","6","34","34","Therefore do not worry about tomorrow, for tomorrow will worry about the things of itself. Today has enough trouble of its own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_1","070_7_1","MAT","7","1","1","“Do not judge, or you will be judged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_2","070_7_2","MAT","7","2","2","For with the same judgment you pronounce, you will be judged, and with the measure you use, it will be measured to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_3","070_7_3","MAT","7","3","3","Why do you look at the speck in your brother’s eye but fail to notice the beam in your own eye? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_4","070_7_4","MAT","7","4","4","How can you say to your brother, ‘Let me take the speck out of your eye,’ while there is still a beam in your own eye? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_5","070_7_5","MAT","7","5","5","You hypocrite! First take the beam out of your own eye, and then you will see clearly to remove the speck from your brother’s eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_6","070_7_6","MAT","7","6","6","Do not give dogs what is holy; do not throw your pearls before swine. If you do, they may trample them under their feet, and then turn and tear you to pieces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_7","070_7_7","MAT","7","7","7","Ask, and it will be given to you; seek, and you will find; knock, and the door will be opened to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_8","070_7_8","MAT","7","8","8","For everyone who asks receives; he who seeks finds; and to him who knocks, the door will be opened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_9","070_7_9","MAT","7","9","9","Which of you, if his son asks for bread, will give him a stone? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_10","070_7_10","MAT","7","10","10","And if he asks for a fish, will give him a snake? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_11","070_7_11","MAT","7","11","11","So if you who are evil know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more will your Father in heaven give good things to those who ask Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_12","070_7_12","MAT","7","12","12","In everything, then, do to others as you would have them do to you. For this is the essence of the Law and the Prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_13","070_7_13","MAT","7","13","13","Enter through the narrow gate. For wide is the gate and broad is the way that leads to destruction, and many enter through it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_14","070_7_14","MAT","7","14","14","But small is the gate and narrow the way that leads to life, and only a few find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_15","070_7_15","MAT","7","15","15","Beware of false prophets. They come to you in sheep’s clothing, but inwardly they are ravenous wolves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_16","070_7_16","MAT","7","16","16","By their fruit you will recognize them. Are grapes gathered from thornbushes, or figs from thistles? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_17","070_7_17","MAT","7","17","17","Likewise, every good tree bears good fruit, but a bad tree bears bad fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_18","070_7_18","MAT","7","18","18","A good tree cannot bear bad fruit, and a bad tree cannot bear good fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_19","070_7_19","MAT","7","19","19","Every tree that does not bear good fruit is cut down and thrown into the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_20","070_7_20","MAT","7","20","20","So then, by their fruit you will recognize them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_21","070_7_21","MAT","7","21","21","Not everyone who says to Me, ‘Lord, Lord,’ will enter the kingdom of heaven, but only he who does the will of My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_22","070_7_22","MAT","7","22","22","Many will say to Me on that day, ‘Lord, Lord, did we not prophesy in Your name, and in Your name drive out demons and perform many miracles?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_23","070_7_23","MAT","7","23","23","Then I will tell them plainly, ‘I never knew you; depart from Me, you workers of lawlessness!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_24","070_7_24","MAT","7","24","24","Therefore everyone who hears these words of Mine and acts on them I will liken to a wise man who built his house on the rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_25","070_7_25","MAT","7","25","25","The rain fell, the torrents raged, and the winds blew and beat against that house; yet it did not fall, because its foundation was on the rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_26","070_7_26","MAT","7","26","26","But everyone who hears these words of Mine and does not act on them is like a foolish man who built his house on sand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_27","070_7_27","MAT","7","27","27","The rain fell, the torrents raged, and the winds blew and beat against that house, and it fell—and great was its collapse!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_28","070_7_28","MAT","7","28","28","When Jesus had finished saying these things, the crowds were astonished at His teaching, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT7_29","070_7_29","MAT","7","29","29","because He taught as one who had authority, and not as the scribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_1","070_8_1","MAT","8","1","1","When Jesus came down from the mountain, large crowds followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_2","070_8_2","MAT","8","2","2","Suddenly a leper came and knelt before Him, saying, “Lord, if You are willing, You can make me clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_3","070_8_3","MAT","8","3","3","Jesus reached out His hand and touched the man. “I am willing,” He said. “Be clean!” And immediately his leprosy was cleansed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_4","070_8_4","MAT","8","4","4","Then Jesus instructed him, “See that you don’t tell anyone. But go, show yourself to the priest and offer the gift prescribed by Moses, as a testimony to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_5","070_8_5","MAT","8","5","5","When Jesus had entered Capernaum, a centurion came and pleaded with Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_6","070_8_6","MAT","8","6","6","“Lord, my servant lies at home, paralyzed and in terrible agony.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_7","070_8_7","MAT","8","7","7","“I will go and heal him,” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_8","070_8_8","MAT","8","8","8","The centurion answered, “Lord, I am not worthy to have You come under my roof. But just say the word, and my servant will be healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_9","070_8_9","MAT","8","9","9","For I myself am a man under authority, with soldiers under me. I tell one to go, and he goes, and another to come, and he comes. I tell my servant to do something, and he does it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_10","070_8_10","MAT","8","10","10","When Jesus heard this, He marveled and said to those following Him, “Truly I tell you, I have not found even in Israel such great faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_11","070_8_11","MAT","8","11","11","I say to you that many will come from the east and the west to share the banquet with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob in the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_12","070_8_12","MAT","8","12","12","But the sons of the kingdom will be thrown into the outer darkness, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_13","070_8_13","MAT","8","13","13","Then Jesus said to the centurion, “Go! As you have believed, so will it be done for you.” And his servant was healed at that very hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_14","070_8_14","MAT","8","14","14","When Jesus arrived at Peter’s house, He saw Peter’s mother-in-law sick in bed with a fever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_15","070_8_15","MAT","8","15","15","So He touched her hand, and the fever left her, and she got up and began to serve Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_16","070_8_16","MAT","8","16","16","When evening came, many who were demon-possessed were brought to Jesus, and He drove out the spirits with a word and healed all the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_17","070_8_17","MAT","8","17","17","This was to fulfill what was spoken through the prophet Isaiah: “He took up our infirmities and carried our diseases.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_18","070_8_18","MAT","8","18","18","When Jesus saw large crowds around Him, He gave orders to cross to the other side of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_19","070_8_19","MAT","8","19","19","And one of the scribes came to Him and said, “Teacher, I will follow You wherever You go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_20","070_8_20","MAT","8","20","20","Jesus replied, “Foxes have dens and birds of the air have nests, but the Son of Man has no place to lay His head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_21","070_8_21","MAT","8","21","21","Another of His disciples requested, “Lord, first let me go and bury my father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_22","070_8_22","MAT","8","22","22","But Jesus told him, “Follow Me, and let the dead bury their own dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_23","070_8_23","MAT","8","23","23","When He got into the boat, His disciples followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_24","070_8_24","MAT","8","24","24","Suddenly a violent storm came up on the sea, so that the boat was engulfed by the waves. But Jesus was sleeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_25","070_8_25","MAT","8","25","25","Then the disciples went and woke Him, saying, “Lord, save us! We are perishing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_26","070_8_26","MAT","8","26","26","“You of little faith,” Jesus replied, “why are you so afraid?” Then He got up and rebuked the winds and the sea, and it was perfectly calm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_27","070_8_27","MAT","8","27","27","The men were amazed and asked, “What kind of man is this? Even the winds and the sea obey Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_28","070_8_28","MAT","8","28","28","When Jesus arrived on the other side in the region of the Gergesenes, He was met by two demon-possessed men coming from the tombs. They were so violent that no one could pass that way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_29","070_8_29","MAT","8","29","29","“What do You want with us, Jesus, Son of God?” they shouted. “Have You come here to torture us before the appointed time?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_30","070_8_30","MAT","8","30","30","In the distance a large herd of pigs was feeding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_31","070_8_31","MAT","8","31","31","So the demons begged Jesus, “If You drive us out, permit us to go off into the herd of pigs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_32","070_8_32","MAT","8","32","32","“Go!” He told them. So they came out and went into the herd of pigs, and the whole herd of pigs rushed down the steep bank into the sea and died in the waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_33","070_8_33","MAT","8","33","33","Those tending the pigs ran off into the town and reported all this, including the account of the demon-possessed men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT8_34","070_8_34","MAT","8","34","34","Then the whole town went out to meet Jesus. And when they saw Him, they begged Him to leave their region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_1","070_9_1","MAT","9","1","1","Jesus got into a boat, crossed over, and came to His own town. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_2","070_9_2","MAT","9","2","2","Just then some men brought to Him a paralytic lying on a mat. When Jesus saw their faith, He said to the paralytic, “Take courage, son; your sins are forgiven you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_3","070_9_3","MAT","9","3","3","On seeing this, some of the scribes said to themselves, “This man is blaspheming!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_4","070_9_4","MAT","9","4","4","But Jesus knew what they were thinking and said, “Why do you harbor evil in your hearts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_5","070_9_5","MAT","9","5","5","Which is easier: to say, ‘Your sins are forgiven,’ or to say, ‘Get up and walk’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_6","070_9_6","MAT","9","6","6","But so that you may know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins...” Then He said to the paralytic, “Get up, pick up your mat, and go home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_7","070_9_7","MAT","9","7","7","And the man got up and went home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_8","070_9_8","MAT","9","8","8","When the crowds saw this, they marveled and glorified God, who had given such authority to men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_9","070_9_9","MAT","9","9","9","As Jesus went on from there, He saw a man named Matthew sitting at the tax booth. “Follow Me,” He told him, and Matthew got up and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_10","070_9_10","MAT","9","10","10","Later, as Jesus was dining at Matthew’s house, many tax collectors and sinners came and ate with Him and His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_11","070_9_11","MAT","9","11","11","When the Pharisees saw this, they asked His disciples, “Why does your Teacher eat with tax collectors and sinners?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_12","070_9_12","MAT","9","12","12","On hearing this, Jesus said to them, “It is not the healthy who need a doctor, but the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_13","070_9_13","MAT","9","13","13","But go and learn what this means: ‘I desire mercy, not sacrifice.’ For I have not come to call the righteous, but sinners, to repentance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_14","070_9_14","MAT","9","14","14","Then John’s disciples came to Jesus and asked, “Why is it that we and the Pharisees fast so often, but Your disciples do not fast?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_15","070_9_15","MAT","9","15","15","Jesus replied, “How can the guests of the bridegroom mourn while He is with them? But the time will come when the bridegroom will be taken from them; then they will fast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_16","070_9_16","MAT","9","16","16","No one sews a patch of unshrunk cloth on an old garment. For the patch will pull away from the garment, and a worse tear will result. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_17","070_9_17","MAT","9","17","17","Neither do men pour new wine into old wineskins. If they do, the skins will burst, the wine will spill, and the wineskins will be ruined. Instead, they pour new wine into new wineskins, and both are preserved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_18","070_9_18","MAT","9","18","18","While Jesus was saying these things, a synagogue leader came and knelt before Him. “My daughter has just died,” he said. “But come and place Your hand on her, and she will live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_19","070_9_19","MAT","9","19","19","So Jesus got up and went with him, along with His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_20","070_9_20","MAT","9","20","20","Suddenly a woman who had suffered from bleeding for twelve years came up behind Him and touched the fringe of His cloak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_21","070_9_21","MAT","9","21","21","She said to herself, “If only I touch His cloak, I will be healed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_22","070_9_22","MAT","9","22","22","Jesus turned around and saw her. “Take courage, daughter,” He said, “your faith has healed you.” And the woman was healed from that very hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_23","070_9_23","MAT","9","23","23","When Jesus entered the house of the synagogue leader, He saw the flute players and the noisy crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_24","070_9_24","MAT","9","24","24","“Go away,” He told them. “The girl is not dead, but asleep.” And they laughed at Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_25","070_9_25","MAT","9","25","25","After the crowd had been put outside, Jesus went in and took the girl by the hand, and she got up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_26","070_9_26","MAT","9","26","26","And the news about this spread throughout that region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_27","070_9_27","MAT","9","27","27","As Jesus went on from there, two blind men followed Him, crying out, “Have mercy on us, Son of David!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_28","070_9_28","MAT","9","28","28","After Jesus had entered the house, the blind men came to Him. “Do you believe that I am able to do this?” He asked. “Yes, Lord,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_29","070_9_29","MAT","9","29","29","Then He touched their eyes and said, “According to your faith will it be done to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_30","070_9_30","MAT","9","30","30","And their eyes were opened. Jesus warned them sternly, “See that no one finds out about this!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_31","070_9_31","MAT","9","31","31","But they went out and spread the news about Him throughout the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_32","070_9_32","MAT","9","32","32","As they were leaving, a demon-possessed man who was mute was brought to Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_33","070_9_33","MAT","9","33","33","And when the demon had been driven out, the man began to speak. The crowds were amazed and said, “Nothing like this has ever been seen in Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_34","070_9_34","MAT","9","34","34","But the Pharisees said, “It is by the prince of demons that He drives out demons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_35","070_9_35","MAT","9","35","35","Jesus went through all the towns and villages, teaching in their synagogues, preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every disease and sickness among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_36","070_9_36","MAT","9","36","36","When He saw the crowds, He was moved with compassion for them, because they were harassed and helpless, like sheep without a shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_37","070_9_37","MAT","9","37","37","Then He said to His disciples, “The harvest is plentiful, but the workers are few. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT9_38","070_9_38","MAT","9","38","38","Ask the Lord of the harvest, therefore, to send out workers into His harvest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_1","070_10_1","MAT","10","1","1","And calling His twelve disciples to Him, Jesus gave them authority over unclean spirits, so that they could drive them out and heal every disease and sickness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_2","070_10_2","MAT","10","2","2","These are the names of the twelve apostles: first Simon, called Peter, and his brother Andrew; James son of Zebedee, and his brother John; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_3","070_10_3","MAT","10","3","3","Philip and Bartholomew; Thomas and Matthew the tax collector; James son of Alphaeus, and Lebbaeus called Thaddaeus; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_4","070_10_4","MAT","10","4","4","Simon the Zealot, and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_5","070_10_5","MAT","10","5","5","These twelve Jesus sent out with the following instructions: “Do not go onto the road of the Gentiles or enter any town of the Samaritans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_6","070_10_6","MAT","10","6","6","Go rather to the lost sheep of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_7","070_10_7","MAT","10","7","7","As you go, preach this message: ‘The kingdom of heaven is near.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_8","070_10_8","MAT","10","8","8","Heal the sick, cleanse the lepers, drive out demons. Freely you have received; freely give. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_9","070_10_9","MAT","10","9","9","Do not take along any gold or silver or copper in your belts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_10","070_10_10","MAT","10","10","10","Take no bag for the road, or second tunic, or sandals, or staffs; for the worker is worthy of his provisions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_11","070_10_11","MAT","10","11","11","Whatever town or village you enter, find out who is worthy there and stay at his house until you move on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_12","070_10_12","MAT","10","12","12","As you enter the home, greet its occupants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_13","070_10_13","MAT","10","13","13","If the home is worthy, let your peace rest on it, but if it is not, let your peace return to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_14","070_10_14","MAT","10","14","14","And if anyone will not welcome you or heed your words, shake the dust off your feet when you leave that home or town. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_15","070_10_15","MAT","10","15","15","Truly I tell you, it will be more bearable for Sodom and Gomorrah on the day of judgment than for that town. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_16","070_10_16","MAT","10","16","16","Behold, I am sending you out like sheep among wolves; therefore be as shrewd as snakes and as innocent as doves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_17","070_10_17","MAT","10","17","17","But beware of men, for they will hand you over to their councils and flog you in their synagogues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_18","070_10_18","MAT","10","18","18","On My account you will be brought before governors and kings as witnesses to them and to the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_19","070_10_19","MAT","10","19","19","But when they hand you over, do not worry about how to respond or what to say. In that hour you will be given what to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_20","070_10_20","MAT","10","20","20","For it will not be you speaking, but the Spirit of your Father speaking through you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_21","070_10_21","MAT","10","21","21","Brother will betray brother to death, and a father his child; children will rise against their parents and have them put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_22","070_10_22","MAT","10","22","22","You will be hated by everyone because of My name, but the one who perseveres to the end will be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_23","070_10_23","MAT","10","23","23","When they persecute you in one town, flee to another. Truly I tell you, you will not reach all the towns of Israel before the Son of Man comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_24","070_10_24","MAT","10","24","24","A disciple is not above his teacher, nor a servant above his master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_25","070_10_25","MAT","10","25","25","It is enough for a disciple to be like his teacher, and a servant like his master. If the head of the house has been called Beelzebul, how much more the members of his household! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_26","070_10_26","MAT","10","26","26","So do not be afraid of them. For there is nothing concealed that will not be disclosed, and nothing hidden that will not be made known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_27","070_10_27","MAT","10","27","27","What I tell you in the dark, speak in the daylight; what is whispered in your ear, proclaim from the housetops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_28","070_10_28","MAT","10","28","28","Do not be afraid of those who kill the body but cannot kill the soul. Instead, fear the One who can destroy both soul and body in hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_29","070_10_29","MAT","10","29","29","Are not two sparrows sold for a penny? Yet not one of them will fall to the ground apart from the will of your Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_30","070_10_30","MAT","10","30","30","And even the very hairs of your head are all numbered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_31","070_10_31","MAT","10","31","31","So do not be afraid; you are worth more than many sparrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_32","070_10_32","MAT","10","32","32","Therefore everyone who confesses Me before men, I will also confess him before My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_33","070_10_33","MAT","10","33","33","But whoever denies Me before men, I will also deny him before My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_34","070_10_34","MAT","10","34","34","Do not assume that I have come to bring peace to the earth; I have not come to bring peace, but a sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_35","070_10_35","MAT","10","35","35","For I have come to turn ‘a man against his father, a daughter against her mother, a daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_36","070_10_36","MAT","10","36","36","A man’s enemies will be the members of his own household.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_37","070_10_37","MAT","10","37","37","Anyone who loves his father or mother more than Me is not worthy of Me; anyone who loves his son or daughter more than Me is not worthy of Me; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_38","070_10_38","MAT","10","38","38","and anyone who does not take up his cross and follow Me is not worthy of Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_39","070_10_39","MAT","10","39","39","Whoever finds his life will lose it, and whoever loses his life for My sake will find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_40","070_10_40","MAT","10","40","40","He who receives you receives Me, and he who receives Me receives the One who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_41","070_10_41","MAT","10","41","41","Whoever receives a prophet because he is a prophet will receive a prophet’s reward, and whoever receives a righteous man because he is a righteous man will receive a righteous man’s reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT10_42","070_10_42","MAT","10","42","42","And if anyone gives even a cup of cold water to one of these little ones because he is My disciple, truly I tell you, he will never lose his reward.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_1","070_11_1","MAT","11","1","1","After Jesus had finished instructing His twelve disciples, He went on from there to teach and preach in their cities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_2","070_11_2","MAT","11","2","2","Meanwhile John heard in prison about the works of Christ, and he sent two of his disciples ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_3","070_11_3","MAT","11","3","3","to ask Him, “Are You the One who was to come, or should we look for someone else?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_4","070_11_4","MAT","11","4","4","Jesus replied, “Go back and report to John what you hear and see: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_5","070_11_5","MAT","11","5","5","The blind receive sight, the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, the deaf hear, the dead are raised, and the good news is preached to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_6","070_11_6","MAT","11","6","6","Blessed is the one who does not fall away on account of Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_7","070_11_7","MAT","11","7","7","As John’s disciples were leaving, Jesus began to speak to the crowds about John: “What did you go out into the wilderness to see? A reed swaying in the wind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_8","070_11_8","MAT","11","8","8","Otherwise, what did you go out to see? A man dressed in fine clothes? Look, those who wear fine clothing are found in kings’ palaces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_9","070_11_9","MAT","11","9","9","What then did you go out to see? A prophet? Yes, I tell you, and more than a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_10","070_11_10","MAT","11","10","10","For this is the one about whom it is written: ‘Behold, I will send My messenger ahead of You, who will prepare Your way before You.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_11","070_11_11","MAT","11","11","11","Truly I tell you, among those born of women there has risen no one greater than John the Baptist. Yet even the least in the kingdom of heaven is greater than he. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_12","070_11_12","MAT","11","12","12","From the days of John the Baptist until now, the kingdom of heaven has been subject to violence, and the violent lay claim to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_13","070_11_13","MAT","11","13","13","For all the Prophets and the Law prophesied until John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_14","070_11_14","MAT","11","14","14","And if you are willing to accept it, he is the Elijah who was to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_15","070_11_15","MAT","11","15","15","He who has ears to hear, let him hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_16","070_11_16","MAT","11","16","16","To what can I compare this generation? They are like children sitting in the marketplaces and calling out to one another: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_17","070_11_17","MAT","11","17","17","‘We played the flute for you, and you did not dance; we sang a dirge for you, and you did not mourn.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_18","070_11_18","MAT","11","18","18","For John came neither eating nor drinking, and they say, ‘He has a demon!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_19","070_11_19","MAT","11","19","19","The Son of Man came eating and drinking, and they say, ‘Look at this glutton and drunkard, a friend of tax collectors and sinners!’ But wisdom is vindicated by her children.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_20","070_11_20","MAT","11","20","20","Then Jesus began to denounce the cities in which most of His miracles had been performed, because they did not repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_21","070_11_21","MAT","11","21","21","“Woe to you, Chorazin! Woe to you, Bethsaida! For if the miracles that were performed in you had been performed in Tyre and Sidon, they would have repented long ago in sackcloth and ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_22","070_11_22","MAT","11","22","22","But I tell you, it will be more bearable for Tyre and Sidon on the day of judgment than for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_23","070_11_23","MAT","11","23","23","And you, Capernaum, which is lifted up to heaven, will be brought down to Hades! For if the miracles that were performed in you had been performed in Sodom, it would have remained to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_24","070_11_24","MAT","11","24","24","But I tell you that it will be more bearable for Sodom on the day of judgment than for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_25","070_11_25","MAT","11","25","25","At that time Jesus declared, “I praise You, Father, Lord of heaven and earth, because You have hidden these things from the wise and learned, and revealed them to little children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_26","070_11_26","MAT","11","26","26","Yes, Father, for this was well-pleasing in Your sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_27","070_11_27","MAT","11","27","27","All things have been entrusted to Me by My Father. No one knows the Son except the Father, and no one knows the Father except the Son and those to whom the Son chooses to reveal Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_28","070_11_28","MAT","11","28","28","Come to Me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_29","070_11_29","MAT","11","29","29","Take My yoke upon you and learn from Me, for I am gentle and humble in heart, and you will find rest for your souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT11_30","070_11_30","MAT","11","30","30","For My yoke is easy and My burden is light.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_1","070_12_1","MAT","12","1","1","At that time Jesus went through the grainfields on the Sabbath. His disciples were hungry and began to pick the heads of grain and eat them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_2","070_12_2","MAT","12","2","2","When the Pharisees saw this, they said to Him, “Look, Your disciples are doing what is unlawful on the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_3","070_12_3","MAT","12","3","3","Jesus replied, “Have you not read what David did when he and his companions were hungry? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_4","070_12_4","MAT","12","4","4","He entered the house of God, and he and his companions ate the consecrated bread, which was not lawful for them to eat, but only for the priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_5","070_12_5","MAT","12","5","5","Or haven’t you read in the Law that on the Sabbath the priests in the temple break the Sabbath and yet are innocent? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_6","070_12_6","MAT","12","6","6","But I tell you that One greater than the temple is here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_7","070_12_7","MAT","12","7","7","If only you had known the meaning of ‘I desire mercy, not sacrifice,’ you would not have condemned the innocent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_8","070_12_8","MAT","12","8","8","For the Son of Man is Lord of the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_9","070_12_9","MAT","12","9","9","Moving on from there, Jesus entered their synagogue, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_10","070_12_10","MAT","12","10","10","and a man with a withered hand was there. In order to accuse Jesus, they asked Him, “Is it lawful to heal on the Sabbath?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_11","070_12_11","MAT","12","11","11","He replied, “If one of you has a sheep and it falls into a pit on the Sabbath, will he not take hold of it and lift it out? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_12","070_12_12","MAT","12","12","12","How much more valuable is a man than a sheep! Therefore it is lawful to do good on the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_13","070_12_13","MAT","12","13","13","Then Jesus said to the man, “Stretch out your hand.” So he stretched it out, and it was restored to full use, just like the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_14","070_12_14","MAT","12","14","14","But the Pharisees went out and plotted how they might kill Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_15","070_12_15","MAT","12","15","15","Aware of this, Jesus withdrew from that place. Large crowds followed Him, and He healed them all, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_16","070_12_16","MAT","12","16","16","warning them not to make Him known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_17","070_12_17","MAT","12","17","17","This was to fulfill what was spoken through the prophet Isaiah: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_18","070_12_18","MAT","12","18","18","“Here is My Servant, whom I have chosen, My beloved, in whom My soul delights. I will put My Spirit on Him, and He will proclaim justice to the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_19","070_12_19","MAT","12","19","19","He will not quarrel or cry out; no one will hear His voice in the streets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_20","070_12_20","MAT","12","20","20","A bruised reed He will not break, and a smoldering wick He will not extinguish, till He leads justice to victory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_21","070_12_21","MAT","12","21","21","In His name the nations will put their hope.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_22","070_12_22","MAT","12","22","22","Then a demon-possessed man who was blind and mute was brought to Jesus, and He healed the man so that the blind and mute man could both speak and see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_23","070_12_23","MAT","12","23","23","The crowds were astounded and asked, “Could this be the Son of David?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_24","070_12_24","MAT","12","24","24","But when the Pharisees heard this, they said, “Only by Beelzebul, the prince of demons, does this man drive out demons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_25","070_12_25","MAT","12","25","25","Knowing their thoughts, Jesus said to them, “Every kingdom divided against itself will be laid waste, and every city or household divided against itself will not stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_26","070_12_26","MAT","12","26","26","If Satan drives out Satan, he is divided against himself. How then can his kingdom stand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_27","070_12_27","MAT","12","27","27","And if I drive out demons by Beelzebul, by whom do your sons drive them out? So then, they will be your judges. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_28","070_12_28","MAT","12","28","28","But if I drive out demons by the Spirit of God, then the kingdom of God has come upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_29","070_12_29","MAT","12","29","29","Or again, how can anyone enter a strong man’s house and steal his possessions, unless he first ties up the strong man? Then he can plunder his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_30","070_12_30","MAT","12","30","30","He who is not with Me is against Me, and he who does not gather with Me scatters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_31","070_12_31","MAT","12","31","31","Therefore I tell you, every sin and blasphemy will be forgiven men, but the blasphemy against the Spirit will not be forgiven men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_32","070_12_32","MAT","12","32","32","Whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man will be forgiven, but whoever speaks against the Holy Spirit will not be forgiven, either in the present age or in the one to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_33","070_12_33","MAT","12","33","33","Make a tree good and its fruit will be good, or make a tree bad and its fruit will be bad, for a tree is known by its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_34","070_12_34","MAT","12","34","34","You brood of vipers, how can you who are evil say anything good? For out of the overflow of the heart the mouth speaks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_35","070_12_35","MAT","12","35","35","The good man brings good things out of his good store of treasure, and the evil man brings evil things out of his evil store of treasure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_36","070_12_36","MAT","12","36","36","But I tell you that men will give an account on the day of judgment for every careless word they have spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_37","070_12_37","MAT","12","37","37","For by your words you will be acquitted, and by your words you will be condemned.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_38","070_12_38","MAT","12","38","38","Then some of the scribes and Pharisees said, “Teacher, we want to see a sign from You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_39","070_12_39","MAT","12","39","39","Jesus replied, “A wicked and adulterous generation demands a sign, but none will be given it except the sign of the prophet Jonah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_40","070_12_40","MAT","12","40","40","For as Jonah was three days and three nights in the belly of the great fish, so the Son of Man will be three days and three nights in the heart of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_41","070_12_41","MAT","12","41","41","The men of Nineveh will stand at the judgment with this generation and condemn it; for they repented at the preaching of Jonah, and now One greater than Jonah is here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_42","070_12_42","MAT","12","42","42","The Queen of the South will rise at the judgment with this generation and condemn it; for she came from the ends of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon, and now One greater than Solomon is here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_43","070_12_43","MAT","12","43","43","When an unclean spirit comes out of a man, it passes through arid places seeking rest and does not find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_44","070_12_44","MAT","12","44","44","Then it says, ‘I will return to the house I left.’ On its return, it finds the house vacant, swept clean, and put in order. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_45","070_12_45","MAT","12","45","45","Then it goes and brings with it seven other spirits more wicked than itself, and they go in and dwell there. And the final plight of that man is worse than the first. So will it be with this wicked generation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_46","070_12_46","MAT","12","46","46","While Jesus was still speaking to the crowds, His mother and brothers stood outside, wanting to speak to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_47","070_12_47","MAT","12","47","47","Someone told Him, “Look, Your mother and brothers are standing outside, wanting to speak to You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_48","070_12_48","MAT","12","48","48","But Jesus replied, “Who is My mother, and who are My brothers?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_49","070_12_49","MAT","12","49","49","Pointing to His disciples, He said, “Here are My mother and My brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT12_50","070_12_50","MAT","12","50","50","For whoever does the will of My Father in heaven is My brother and sister and mother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_1","070_13_1","MAT","13","1","1","That same day Jesus went out of the house and sat by the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_2","070_13_2","MAT","13","2","2","Such large crowds gathered around Him that He got into the boat and sat down, while all the people stood on the shore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_3","070_13_3","MAT","13","3","3","And He told them many things in parables, saying, “A farmer went out to sow his seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_4","070_13_4","MAT","13","4","4","And as he was sowing, some seed fell along the path, and the birds came and devoured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_5","070_13_5","MAT","13","5","5","Some fell on rocky ground, where it did not have much soil. It sprang up quickly because the soil was shallow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_6","070_13_6","MAT","13","6","6","But when the sun rose, the seedlings were scorched, and they withered because they had no root. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_7","070_13_7","MAT","13","7","7","Other seed fell among thorns, which grew up and choked the seedlings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_8","070_13_8","MAT","13","8","8","Still other seed fell on good soil and produced a crop—a hundredfold, sixtyfold, or thirtyfold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_9","070_13_9","MAT","13","9","9","He who has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_10","070_13_10","MAT","13","10","10","Then the disciples came to Jesus and asked, “Why do You speak to the people in parables?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_11","070_13_11","MAT","13","11","11","He replied, “The knowledge of the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven has been given to you, but not to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_12","070_13_12","MAT","13","12","12","Whoever has will be given more, and he will have an abundance. Whoever does not have, even what he has will be taken away from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_13","070_13_13","MAT","13","13","13","This is why I speak to them in parables: ‘Though seeing, they do not see; though hearing, they do not hear or understand.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_14","070_13_14","MAT","13","14","14","In them the prophecy of Isaiah is fulfilled: ‘You will be ever hearing but never understanding; you will be ever seeing but never perceiving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_15","070_13_15","MAT","13","15","15","For this people’s heart has grown callous; they hardly hear with their ears, and they have closed their eyes. Otherwise they might see with their eyes, hear with their ears, understand with their hearts, and turn, and I would heal them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_16","070_13_16","MAT","13","16","16","But blessed are your eyes because they see, and your ears because they hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_17","070_13_17","MAT","13","17","17","For truly I tell you, many prophets and righteous men longed to see what you see but did not see it, and to hear what you hear but did not hear it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_18","070_13_18","MAT","13","18","18","Consider, then, the parable of the sower: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_19","070_13_19","MAT","13","19","19","When anyone hears the message of the kingdom but does not understand it, the evil one comes and snatches away what was sown in his heart. This is the seed sown along the path. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_20","070_13_20","MAT","13","20","20","The seed sown on rocky ground is the one who hears the word and at once receives it with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_21","070_13_21","MAT","13","21","21","But since he has no root, he remains for only a season. When trouble or persecution comes because of the word, he quickly falls away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_22","070_13_22","MAT","13","22","22","The seed sown among the thorns is the one who hears the word, but the worries of this life and the deceitfulness of wealth choke the word, and it becomes unfruitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_23","070_13_23","MAT","13","23","23","But the seed sown on good soil is the one who hears the word and understands it. He indeed bears fruit and produces a crop—a hundredfold, sixtyfold, or thirtyfold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_24","070_13_24","MAT","13","24","24","Jesus put before them another parable: “The kingdom of heaven is like a man who sowed good seed in his field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_25","070_13_25","MAT","13","25","25","But while everyone was asleep, his enemy came and sowed weeds among the wheat, and slipped away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_26","070_13_26","MAT","13","26","26","When the wheat sprouted and bore grain, then the weeds also appeared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_27","070_13_27","MAT","13","27","27","The owner’s servants came to him and said, ‘Sir, didn’t you sow good seed in your field? Where then did the weeds come from?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_28","070_13_28","MAT","13","28","28","‘An enemy did this,’ he replied. So the servants asked him, ‘Do you want us to go and pull them up?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_29","070_13_29","MAT","13","29","29","‘No,’ he said, ‘if you pull the weeds now, you might uproot the wheat with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_30","070_13_30","MAT","13","30","30","Let both grow together until the harvest. At that time I will tell the harvesters: First collect the weeds and tie them in bundles to be burned; then gather the wheat into my barn.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_31","070_13_31","MAT","13","31","31","He put before them another parable: “The kingdom of heaven is like a mustard seed that a man took and planted in his field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_32","070_13_32","MAT","13","32","32","Although it is the smallest of all seeds, yet it grows into the largest of garden plants and becomes a tree, so that the birds of the air come and nest in its branches.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_33","070_13_33","MAT","13","33","33","He told them still another parable: “The kingdom of heaven is like leaven that a woman took and mixed into three measures of flour, until all of it was leavened.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_34","070_13_34","MAT","13","34","34","Jesus spoke all these things to the crowds in parables. He did not tell them anything without using a parable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_35","070_13_35","MAT","13","35","35","So was fulfilled what was spoken through the prophet: “I will open My mouth in parables; I will utter things hidden since the foundation of the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_36","070_13_36","MAT","13","36","36","Then Jesus dismissed the crowds and went into the house. His disciples came to Him and said, “Explain to us the parable of the weeds in the field.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_37","070_13_37","MAT","13","37","37","He replied, “The One who sows the good seed is the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_38","070_13_38","MAT","13","38","38","The field is the world, and the good seed represents the sons of the kingdom. The weeds are the sons of the evil one, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_39","070_13_39","MAT","13","39","39","and the enemy who sows them is the devil. The harvest is the end of the age, and the harvesters are angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_40","070_13_40","MAT","13","40","40","As the weeds are collected and burned in the fire, so will it be at the end of this age. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_41","070_13_41","MAT","13","41","41","The Son of Man will send out His angels, and they will weed out of His kingdom every cause of sin and all who practice lawlessness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_42","070_13_42","MAT","13","42","42","And they will throw them into the fiery furnace, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_43","070_13_43","MAT","13","43","43","Then the righteous will shine like the sun in the kingdom of their Father. He who has ears to hear, let him hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_44","070_13_44","MAT","13","44","44","Again, the kingdom of heaven is like treasure hidden in a field. When a man found it, he hid it again, and in his joy he went and sold all he had and bought that field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_45","070_13_45","MAT","13","45","45","Again, the kingdom of heaven is like a merchant in search of fine pearls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_46","070_13_46","MAT","13","46","46","When he found one very precious pearl, he went away and sold all he had and bought it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_47","070_13_47","MAT","13","47","47","Once again, the kingdom of heaven is like a net that was cast into the sea and caught all kinds of fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_48","070_13_48","MAT","13","48","48","When it was full, the men pulled it ashore. Then they sat down and sorted the good fish into containers, but threw the bad away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_49","070_13_49","MAT","13","49","49","So will it be at the end of the age: The angels will come and separate the wicked from the righteous ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_50","070_13_50","MAT","13","50","50","and throw them into the fiery furnace, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_51","070_13_51","MAT","13","51","51","Have you understood all these things?” Jesus asked them. “Yes, Lord,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_52","070_13_52","MAT","13","52","52","Then He told them, “For this reason, every scribe who has been discipled in the kingdom of heaven is like a homeowner who brings out of his storeroom new treasures as well as old.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_53","070_13_53","MAT","13","53","53","When Jesus had finished these parables, He withdrew from that place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_54","070_13_54","MAT","13","54","54","Coming to His hometown, He taught the people in their synagogue, and they were astonished. “Where did this man get such wisdom and miraculous powers?” they asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_55","070_13_55","MAT","13","55","55","“Isn’t this the carpenter’s son? Isn’t His mother’s name Mary, and aren’t His brothers James, Joses, Simon, and Judas? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_56","070_13_56","MAT","13","56","56","Aren’t all His sisters with us as well? Where then did this man get all these things?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_57","070_13_57","MAT","13","57","57","And they took offense at Him. But Jesus said to them, “Only in his hometown and in his own household is a prophet without honor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT13_58","070_13_58","MAT","13","58","58","And He did not do many miracles there, because of their unbelief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_1","070_14_1","MAT","14","1","1","At that time Herod the tetrarch heard the reports about Jesus ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_2","070_14_2","MAT","14","2","2","and said to his servants, “This is John the Baptist; he has risen from the dead! That is why miraculous powers are at work in him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_3","070_14_3","MAT","14","3","3","Now Herod had arrested John and bound him and put him in prison on account of Herodias, his brother Philip’s wife, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_4","070_14_4","MAT","14","4","4","because John had been telling him, “It is not lawful for you to have her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_5","070_14_5","MAT","14","5","5","Although Herod wanted to kill John, he was afraid of the people, because they regarded John as a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_6","070_14_6","MAT","14","6","6","When Herod’s birthday was being celebrated, however, the daughter of Herodias danced before them and pleased Herod ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_7","070_14_7","MAT","14","7","7","so much that he promised with an oath to give to her whatever she asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_8","070_14_8","MAT","14","8","8","Prompted by her mother, she said, “Give me here on a platter the head of John the Baptist.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_9","070_14_9","MAT","14","9","9","The king was grieved, but because of his oaths and his guests, he ordered that her wish be granted ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_10","070_14_10","MAT","14","10","10","and sent to have John beheaded in the prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_11","070_14_11","MAT","14","11","11","John’s head was brought in on a platter and presented to the girl, who carried it to her mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_12","070_14_12","MAT","14","12","12","Then John’s disciples came and took his body and buried it. And they went and informed Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_13","070_14_13","MAT","14","13","13","When Jesus heard about John, He withdrew by boat privately to a solitary place. But the crowds found out about it and followed Him on foot from the towns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_14","070_14_14","MAT","14","14","14","When Jesus stepped ashore and saw a large crowd, He had compassion on them and healed their sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_15","070_14_15","MAT","14","15","15","When evening came, His disciples came to Him and said, “This is a desolate place, and the hour is already late. Dismiss the crowds so they can go to the villages and buy themselves some food.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_16","070_14_16","MAT","14","16","16","“They do not need to go away,” Jesus replied. “You give them something to eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_17","070_14_17","MAT","14","17","17","“We have here only five loaves of bread and two fish,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_18","070_14_18","MAT","14","18","18","“Bring them here to Me,” Jesus said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_19","070_14_19","MAT","14","19","19","And He directed the crowds to sit down on the grass. Taking the five loaves and the two fish and looking up to heaven, He spoke a blessing. Then He broke the loaves and gave them to the disciples, and the disciples gave them to the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_20","070_14_20","MAT","14","20","20","They all ate and were satisfied, and the disciples picked up twelve basketfuls of broken pieces that were left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_21","070_14_21","MAT","14","21","21","About five thousand men were fed, besides women and children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_22","070_14_22","MAT","14","22","22","Immediately Jesus made the disciples get into the boat and go on ahead of Him to the other side, while He dismissed the crowds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_23","070_14_23","MAT","14","23","23","After He had dismissed them, He went up on the mountain by Himself to pray. When evening came, He was there alone, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_24","070_14_24","MAT","14","24","24","but the boat was already in the middle of the sea, buffeted by the waves because the wind was against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_25","070_14_25","MAT","14","25","25","During the fourth watch of the night, Jesus went out to them, walking on the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_26","070_14_26","MAT","14","26","26","When the disciples saw Him walking on the sea, they were terrified. “It’s a ghost!” they said, and cried out in fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_27","070_14_27","MAT","14","27","27","But Jesus spoke up at once: “Take courage! It is I. Do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_28","070_14_28","MAT","14","28","28","“Lord, if it is You,” Peter replied, “command me to come to You on the water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_29","070_14_29","MAT","14","29","29","“Come,” said Jesus. Then Peter got down out of the boat and walked on the water to go toward Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_30","070_14_30","MAT","14","30","30","But when he saw the strength of the wind, he was afraid and, beginning to sink, cried out, “Lord, save me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_31","070_14_31","MAT","14","31","31","Immediately Jesus reached out His hand and took hold of Peter. “You of little faith,” He said, “why did you doubt?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_32","070_14_32","MAT","14","32","32","And when they had climbed back into the boat, the wind died down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_33","070_14_33","MAT","14","33","33","Then those who were in the boat came and worshiped Him, saying, “Truly You are the Son of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_34","070_14_34","MAT","14","34","34","When they had crossed over, they came to the land of Gennesaret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_35","070_14_35","MAT","14","35","35","And when the men of that place recognized Jesus, they sent word to all the surrounding region. People brought all the sick to Him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT14_36","070_14_36","MAT","14","36","36","and begged Him just to let them touch the fringe of His cloak. And all who touched Him were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_1","070_15_1","MAT","15","1","1","Then some scribes and Pharisees came to Jesus from Jerusalem and asked, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_2","070_15_2","MAT","15","2","2","“Why do Your disciples break the tradition of the elders? They do not wash their hands before they eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_3","070_15_3","MAT","15","3","3","Jesus replied, “And why do you break the command of God for the sake of your tradition? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_4","070_15_4","MAT","15","4","4","For God commanded, saying, ‘Honor your father and mother’ and ‘Anyone who curses his father or mother must be put to death.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_5","070_15_5","MAT","15","5","5","But you say that if anyone says to his father or mother, ‘Whatever you would have received from me is a gift devoted to God,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_6","070_15_6","MAT","15","6","6","then he need not honor his father or mother with it. Thus you nullify the commandment of God for the sake of your tradition. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_7","070_15_7","MAT","15","7","7","You hypocrites! Isaiah prophesied correctly about you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_8","070_15_8","MAT","15","8","8","‘These people draw near to Me with their mouths, and they honor Me with their lips, but their hearts are far from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_9","070_15_9","MAT","15","9","9","They worship Me in vain; they teach as doctrine the precepts of men.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_10","070_15_10","MAT","15","10","10","Jesus called the crowd to Him and said, “Listen and understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_11","070_15_11","MAT","15","11","11","A man is not defiled by what enters his mouth, but by what comes out of it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_12","070_15_12","MAT","15","12","12","Then His disciples came to Him and said, “Are You aware that the Pharisees were offended when they heard this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_13","070_15_13","MAT","15","13","13","But Jesus replied, “Every plant that My heavenly Father has not planted will be pulled up by its roots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_14","070_15_14","MAT","15","14","14","Disregard them! They are blind guides. If a blind man leads a blind man, both will fall into a pit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_15","070_15_15","MAT","15","15","15","Peter said to Him, “Explain this parable to us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_16","070_15_16","MAT","15","16","16","“Do you still not understand?” Jesus asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_17","070_15_17","MAT","15","17","17","“Do you not yet realize that whatever enters the mouth goes into the stomach and then is eliminated? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_18","070_15_18","MAT","15","18","18","But the things that come out of the mouth come from the heart, and these things defile a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_19","070_15_19","MAT","15","19","19","For out of the heart come evil thoughts, murder, adultery, sexual immorality, theft, false testimony, and slander. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_20","070_15_20","MAT","15","20","20","These are what defile a man, but eating with unwashed hands does not defile him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_21","070_15_21","MAT","15","21","21","Leaving that place, Jesus withdrew to the district of Tyre and Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_22","070_15_22","MAT","15","22","22","And a Canaanite woman from that region came to Him, crying out, “Lord, Son of David, have mercy on me! My daughter is miserably possessed by a demon.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_23","070_15_23","MAT","15","23","23","But Jesus did not answer a word. So His disciples came and urged Him, “Send her away, for she keeps crying out after us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_24","070_15_24","MAT","15","24","24","He answered, “I was sent only to the lost sheep of the house of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_25","070_15_25","MAT","15","25","25","The woman came and knelt before Him. “Lord, help me!” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_26","070_15_26","MAT","15","26","26","But Jesus replied, “It is not right to take the children’s bread and toss it to the dogs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_27","070_15_27","MAT","15","27","27","“Yes, Lord,” she said, “even the dogs eat the crumbs that fall from their master’s table.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_28","070_15_28","MAT","15","28","28","“O woman,” Jesus answered, “your faith is great! Let it be done for you as you desire.” And her daughter was healed from that very hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_29","070_15_29","MAT","15","29","29","Moving on from there, Jesus went along the Sea of Galilee. Then He went up on a mountain and sat down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_30","070_15_30","MAT","15","30","30","Large crowds came to Him, bringing the lame, the blind, the mute, the crippled, and many others, and laid them at Jesus' feet, and He healed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_31","070_15_31","MAT","15","31","31","The crowds were amazed when they saw the mute speaking, the crippled restored, the lame walking, and the blind seeing. And they glorified the God of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_32","070_15_32","MAT","15","32","32","Then Jesus called His disciples to Him and said, “I have compassion for this crowd, because they have already been with Me three days and have nothing to eat. I do not want to send them away hungry, or they may faint along the way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_33","070_15_33","MAT","15","33","33","His disciples replied, “Where in this desolate place could we find enough bread to feed such a large crowd?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_34","070_15_34","MAT","15","34","34","“How many loaves do you have?” Jesus asked. “Seven,” they replied, “and a few small fish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_35","070_15_35","MAT","15","35","35","And He commanded the crowd to sit down on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_36","070_15_36","MAT","15","36","36","Taking the seven loaves and the fish, He gave thanks and broke them. Then He gave them to His disciples, and the disciples gave them to the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_37","070_15_37","MAT","15","37","37","They all ate and were satisfied, and the disciples picked up seven basketfuls of broken pieces that were left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_38","070_15_38","MAT","15","38","38","A total of four thousand men were fed, besides women and children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT15_39","070_15_39","MAT","15","39","39","After Jesus had dismissed the crowds, He got into the boat and went to the region of Magdala. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_1","070_16_1","MAT","16","1","1","Then the Pharisees and Sadducees came and tested Jesus by asking Him to show them a sign from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_2","070_16_2","MAT","16","2","2","But He replied, “When evening comes, you say, ‘The weather will be fair, for the sky is red,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_3","070_16_3","MAT","16","3","3","and in the morning, ‘Today it will be stormy, for the sky is red and overcast.’ You hypocrites! You know how to interpret the appearance of the sky, but not the signs of the times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_4","070_16_4","MAT","16","4","4","A wicked and adulterous generation demands a sign, but none will be given it except the sign of the prophet Jonah.” Then He left them and went away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_5","070_16_5","MAT","16","5","5","When they crossed to the other side, His disciples forgot to take bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_6","070_16_6","MAT","16","6","6","“Watch out!” Jesus told them. “Beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and Sadducees.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_7","070_16_7","MAT","16","7","7","They discussed this among themselves and concluded, “It is because we did not bring any bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_8","070_16_8","MAT","16","8","8","Aware of their conversation, Jesus said to them, “You of little faith, why are you debating among yourselves about having brought no bread? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_9","070_16_9","MAT","16","9","9","Do you still not understand? Do you not remember the five loaves for the five thousand, and how many basketfuls you gathered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_10","070_16_10","MAT","16","10","10","Or the seven loaves for the four thousand, and how many basketfuls you gathered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_11","070_16_11","MAT","16","11","11","How do you not understand that I was not telling you about bread, but to beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and Sadducees?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_12","070_16_12","MAT","16","12","12","Then they understood that He was not telling them to beware of the leaven used in bread, but of the teaching of the Pharisees and Sadducees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_13","070_16_13","MAT","16","13","13","When Jesus came to the region of Caesarea Philippi, He questioned His disciples: “Who do people pronounce Me, the Son of Man, to be?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_14","070_16_14","MAT","16","14","14","They replied, “Some say John the Baptist; others say Elijah; and still others, Jeremiah or one of the prophets.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_15","070_16_15","MAT","16","15","15","“But what about you?” Jesus asked. “Who do you say I am?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_16","070_16_16","MAT","16","16","16","Simon Peter answered, “You are the Christ, the Son of the living God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_17","070_16_17","MAT","16","17","17","Jesus replied, “Blessed are you, Simon son of Jonah! For this was not revealed to you by flesh and blood, but by My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_18","070_16_18","MAT","16","18","18","And I tell you that you are Peter, and on this rock I will build My church, and the gates of Hades will not prevail against it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_19","070_16_19","MAT","16","19","19","I will give you the keys of the kingdom of heaven. Whatever you bind on earth will be bound in heaven, and whatever you loose on earth will be loosed in heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_20","070_16_20","MAT","16","20","20","Then He commanded His disciples not to tell anyone that He was Jesus the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_21","070_16_21","MAT","16","21","21","From that time on Jesus began to show His disciples that He must go to Jerusalem and suffer many things at the hands of the elders, chief priests, and scribes, and that He must be killed and on the third day be raised to life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_22","070_16_22","MAT","16","22","22","Peter took Him aside and began to rebuke Him. “Far be it from You, Lord!” he said. “This shall never happen to You!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_23","070_16_23","MAT","16","23","23","But Jesus turned and said to Peter, “Get behind Me, Satan! You are a stumbling block to Me. For you do not have in mind the things of God, but the things of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_24","070_16_24","MAT","16","24","24","Then Jesus told His disciples, “If anyone wants to come after Me, he must deny himself and take up his cross and follow Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_25","070_16_25","MAT","16","25","25","For whoever wants to save his life will lose it, but whoever loses his life for My sake will find it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_26","070_16_26","MAT","16","26","26","What does it profit a man if he gains the whole world, yet forfeits his soul? Or what can a man give in exchange for his soul? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_27","070_16_27","MAT","16","27","27","For the Son of Man will come in His Father’s glory with His angels, and then He will repay each one according to what he has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT16_28","070_16_28","MAT","16","28","28","Truly I tell you, some who are standing here will not taste death before they see the Son of Man coming in His kingdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_1","070_17_1","MAT","17","1","1","After six days Jesus took with Him Peter, James, and John the brother of James, and led them up a high mountain by themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_2","070_17_2","MAT","17","2","2","There He was transfigured before them. His face shone like the sun, and His clothes became as white as the light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_3","070_17_3","MAT","17","3","3","Suddenly Moses and Elijah appeared before them, talking with Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_4","070_17_4","MAT","17","4","4","Peter said to Jesus, “Lord, it is good for us to be here. If You wish, we will put up three shelters—one for You, one for Moses, and one for Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_5","070_17_5","MAT","17","5","5","While Peter was still speaking, a bright cloud enveloped them, and a voice from the cloud said, “This is My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased. Listen to Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_6","070_17_6","MAT","17","6","6","When the disciples heard this, they fell facedown in terror. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_7","070_17_7","MAT","17","7","7","Then Jesus came over and touched them. “Get up,” He said. “Do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_8","070_17_8","MAT","17","8","8","And when they looked up, they saw no one except Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_9","070_17_9","MAT","17","9","9","As they were coming down the mountain, Jesus commanded them, “Do not tell anyone about this vision until the Son of Man has risen from the dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_10","070_17_10","MAT","17","10","10","His disciples asked Him, “Why then do the scribes say that Elijah must come first?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_11","070_17_11","MAT","17","11","11","Jesus replied, “Elijah does indeed come first, and he will restore all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_12","070_17_12","MAT","17","12","12","But I tell you that Elijah has already come, and they did not recognize him, but have done to him whatever they wished. In the same way, the Son of Man will suffer at their hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_13","070_17_13","MAT","17","13","13","Then the disciples understood that He was speaking to them about John the Baptist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_14","070_17_14","MAT","17","14","14","When they came to the crowd, a man came up to Jesus and knelt before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_15","070_17_15","MAT","17","15","15","“Lord, have mercy on my son,” he said. “He has seizures and is suffering terribly. He often falls into the fire or into the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_16","070_17_16","MAT","17","16","16","I brought him to Your disciples, but they could not heal him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_17","070_17_17","MAT","17","17","17","“O unbelieving and perverse generation!” Jesus replied. “How long must I remain with you? How long must I put up with you? Bring the boy here to Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_18","070_17_18","MAT","17","18","18","Then Jesus rebuked the demon, and it came out of the boy, and he was healed from that moment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_19","070_17_19","MAT","17","19","19","Afterward the disciples came to Jesus privately and asked, “Why couldn’t we drive it out?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_20","070_17_20","MAT","17","20","20","“Because of your unbelief,” Jesus answered. “For truly I tell you, if you have faith the size of a mustard seed, you can say to this mountain, ‘Move from here to there,’ and it will move. Nothing will be impossible for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_21","070_17_21","MAT","17","21","21","But this kind does not go out except by prayer and fasting.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_22","070_17_22","MAT","17","22","22","While they were staying together in Galilee, Jesus told them, “The Son of Man is about to be delivered into the hands of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_23","070_17_23","MAT","17","23","23","They will kill Him, and on the third day He will be raised to life.” And the disciples were deeply grieved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_24","070_17_24","MAT","17","24","24","After they had arrived in Capernaum, the collectors of the two-drachma tax came to Peter and asked, “Does your Teacher pay the two drachmas?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_25","070_17_25","MAT","17","25","25","“Yes,” he answered. When Peter entered the house, Jesus preempted him. “What do you think, Simon?” He asked. “From whom do the kings of the earth collect customs and taxes: from their own sons, or from others?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_26","070_17_26","MAT","17","26","26","“From others,” Peter answered. “Then the sons are exempt,” Jesus said to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT17_27","070_17_27","MAT","17","27","27","“But so that we may not offend them, go to the sea, cast a hook, and take the first fish you catch. When you open its mouth, you will find a four-drachma coin. Take it and give it to them for My tax and yours.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_1","070_18_1","MAT","18","1","1","At that time the disciples came to Jesus and asked, “Who then is the greatest in the kingdom of heaven?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_2","070_18_2","MAT","18","2","2","Jesus invited a little child to stand among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_3","070_18_3","MAT","18","3","3","“Truly I tell you,” He said, “unless you change and become like little children, you will never enter the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_4","070_18_4","MAT","18","4","4","Therefore, whoever humbles himself like this little child is the greatest in the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_5","070_18_5","MAT","18","5","5","And whoever welcomes a little child like this in My name welcomes Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_6","070_18_6","MAT","18","6","6","But if anyone causes one of these little ones who believe in Me to stumble, it would be better for him to have a large millstone hung around his neck and to be drowned in the depths of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_7","070_18_7","MAT","18","7","7","Woe to the world for the causes of sin. These stumbling blocks must come, but woe to that man through whom they come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_8","070_18_8","MAT","18","8","8","If your hand or your foot causes you to sin, cut it off and throw it away. It is better for you to enter life lame or crippled than to have two hands and two feet and be thrown into the eternal fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_9","070_18_9","MAT","18","9","9","And if your eye causes you to sin, gouge it out and throw it away. It is better for you to enter life with one eye than to have two eyes and be thrown into the fire of hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_10","070_18_10","MAT","18","10","10","See that you do not look down on any of these little ones. For I tell you that their angels in heaven always see the face of My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_11","070_18_11","MAT","18","11","11","For the Son of Man came to save the lost. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_12","070_18_12","MAT","18","12","12","What do you think? If a man has a hundred sheep and one of them goes astray, does he not leave the ninety-nine on the hills and go out to search for the one that is lost? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_13","070_18_13","MAT","18","13","13","And if he finds it, truly I tell you, he rejoices more over that one sheep than over the ninety-nine that did not go astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_14","070_18_14","MAT","18","14","14","In the same way, your Father in heaven is not willing that any of these little ones should perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_15","070_18_15","MAT","18","15","15","If your brother sins against you, go and confront him privately. If he listens to you, you have won your brother over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_16","070_18_16","MAT","18","16","16","But if he will not listen, take one or two others along, so that ‘every matter may be established by the testimony of two or three witnesses.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_17","070_18_17","MAT","18","17","17","If he refuses to listen to them, tell it to the church. And if he refuses to listen even to the church, regard him as you would a pagan or a tax collector. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_18","070_18_18","MAT","18","18","18","Truly I tell you, whatever you bind on earth will be bound in heaven, and whatever you loose on earth will be loosed in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_19","070_18_19","MAT","18","19","19","Again, I tell you truly that if two of you on the earth agree about anything you ask for, it will be done for you by My Father in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_20","070_18_20","MAT","18","20","20","For where two or three gather together in My name, there am I with them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_21","070_18_21","MAT","18","21","21","Then Peter came to Jesus and asked, “Lord, how many times shall I forgive my brother who sins against me? Up to seven times?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_22","070_18_22","MAT","18","22","22","Jesus answered, “I tell you, not just seven times, but seventy-seven times! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_23","070_18_23","MAT","18","23","23","Because of this, the kingdom of heaven is like a king who wanted to settle accounts with his servants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_24","070_18_24","MAT","18","24","24","As he began the settlements, a debtor owing ten thousand talents was brought to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_25","070_18_25","MAT","18","25","25","Since the man was unable to pay, the master ordered that he be sold to pay his debt, along with his wife and children and everything he owned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_26","070_18_26","MAT","18","26","26","Then the servant fell on his knees before him. ‘Master, have patience with me,’ he begged, ‘and I will pay back everything.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_27","070_18_27","MAT","18","27","27","His master had compassion on him, forgave his debt, and released him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_28","070_18_28","MAT","18","28","28","But when that servant went out, he found one of his fellow servants who owed him a hundred denarii. He grabbed him and began to choke him, saying, ‘Pay back what you owe me!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_29","070_18_29","MAT","18","29","29","So his fellow servant fell down at his feet and begged him, ‘Have patience with me, and I will pay you back.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_30","070_18_30","MAT","18","30","30","But he refused. Instead, he went and had the man thrown into prison until he could pay his debt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_31","070_18_31","MAT","18","31","31","When his fellow servants saw what had happened, they were greatly distressed, and they went and recounted all of this to their master. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_32","070_18_32","MAT","18","32","32","Then the master summoned him and said, ‘You wicked servant! I forgave all your debt because you begged me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_33","070_18_33","MAT","18","33","33","Shouldn’t you have had mercy on your fellow servant, just as I had on you?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_34","070_18_34","MAT","18","34","34","In anger his master turned him over to the jailers to be tortured, until he should repay all that was owed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT18_35","070_18_35","MAT","18","35","35","That is how My heavenly Father will treat each of you unless you forgive your brother his trespasses from your heart.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_1","070_19_1","MAT","19","1","1","When Jesus had finished saying these things, He left Galilee and went into the region of Judea beyond the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_2","070_19_2","MAT","19","2","2","Large crowds followed Him, and He healed them there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_3","070_19_3","MAT","19","3","3","Then the Pharisees came and tested Him by asking, “Is it lawful for a man to divorce his wife for any reason?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_4","070_19_4","MAT","19","4","4","Jesus answered, “Have you not read that from the beginning the Creator ‘made them male and female,’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_5","070_19_5","MAT","19","5","5","and said, ‘For this reason a man will leave his father and mother and be joined to his wife, and the two will become one flesh’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_6","070_19_6","MAT","19","6","6","So they are no longer two, but one flesh. Therefore what God has joined together, let man not separate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_7","070_19_7","MAT","19","7","7","“Why then,” they asked, “did Moses order a man to give his wife a certificate of divorce and send her away?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_8","070_19_8","MAT","19","8","8","Jesus replied, “Moses permitted you to divorce your wives because of your hardness of heart. But it was not this way from the beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_9","070_19_9","MAT","19","9","9","Now I tell you that whoever divorces his wife, except for sexual immorality, and marries another woman commits adultery. And he who marries a divorced woman commits adultery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_10","070_19_10","MAT","19","10","10","His disciples said to Him, “If this is the case between a man and his wife, it is better not to marry.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_11","070_19_11","MAT","19","11","11","“Not everyone can accept this word,” He replied, “but only those to whom it has been given. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_12","070_19_12","MAT","19","12","12","For there are eunuchs who were born that way; others were made that way by men; and still others live like eunuchs for the sake of the kingdom of heaven. The one who can accept this should accept it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_13","070_19_13","MAT","19","13","13","Then little children were brought to Jesus for Him to place His hands on them and pray for them. And the disciples rebuked those who brought them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_14","070_19_14","MAT","19","14","14","But Jesus said, “Let the little children come to Me, and do not hinder them! For the kingdom of heaven belongs to such as these.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_15","070_19_15","MAT","19","15","15","And after He had placed His hands on them, He went on from there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_16","070_19_16","MAT","19","16","16","Just then a man came up to Jesus and inquired, “Good Teacher, what good thing must I do to obtain eternal life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_17","070_19_17","MAT","19","17","17","“Why do you call Me good?” Jesus replied. “There is no one who is good but God. If you want to enter life, keep the commandments.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_18","070_19_18","MAT","19","18","18","“Which ones?” the man asked. Jesus answered, “‘Do not murder, do not commit adultery, do not steal, do not bear false witness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_19","070_19_19","MAT","19","19","19","honor your father and mother, and love your neighbor as yourself.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_20","070_19_20","MAT","19","20","20","“All these I have kept from my youth,” said the young man. “What do I still lack?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_21","070_19_21","MAT","19","21","21","Jesus told him, “If you want to be perfect, go, sell your possessions and give to the poor, and you will have treasure in heaven. Then come, follow Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_22","070_19_22","MAT","19","22","22","When the young man heard this, he went away in sorrow, because he had great wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_23","070_19_23","MAT","19","23","23","Then Jesus said to His disciples, “Truly I tell you, it is hard for a rich man to enter the kingdom of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_24","070_19_24","MAT","19","24","24","Again I tell you, it is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_25","070_19_25","MAT","19","25","25","When His disciples heard this, they were greatly astonished and asked, “Who then can be saved?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_26","070_19_26","MAT","19","26","26","Jesus looked at them and said, “With man this is impossible, but with God all things are possible.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_27","070_19_27","MAT","19","27","27","“Look,” Peter replied, “we have left everything to follow You. What then will there be for us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_28","070_19_28","MAT","19","28","28","Jesus said to them, “Truly I tell you, in the renewal of all things, when the Son of Man sits on His glorious throne, you who have followed Me will also sit on twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_29","070_19_29","MAT","19","29","29","And everyone who has left houses or brothers or sisters or father or mother or wife or children or fields for the sake of My name will receive a hundredfold and will inherit eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT19_30","070_19_30","MAT","19","30","30","But many who are first will be last, and the last will be first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_1","070_20_1","MAT","20","1","1","“For the kingdom of heaven is like a landowner who went out early in the morning to hire workers for his vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_2","070_20_2","MAT","20","2","2","He agreed to pay them a denarius for the day and sent them into his vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_3","070_20_3","MAT","20","3","3","About the third hour he went out and saw others standing in the marketplace doing nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_4","070_20_4","MAT","20","4","4","‘You also go into my vineyard,’ he said, ‘and I will pay you whatever is right.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_5","070_20_5","MAT","20","5","5","So they went. He went out again about the sixth hour and the ninth hour and did the same thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_6","070_20_6","MAT","20","6","6","About the eleventh hour he went out and found still others standing idle. ‘Why have you been standing here all day long doing nothing?’ he asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_7","070_20_7","MAT","20","7","7","‘Because no one has hired us,’ they answered. So he told them, ‘You also go into my vineyard, and you will receive whatever is right.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_8","070_20_8","MAT","20","8","8","When evening came, the owner of the vineyard said to his foreman, ‘Call the workers and pay them their wages, starting with the last ones hired and moving on to the first.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_9","070_20_9","MAT","20","9","9","The workers who were hired about the eleventh hour came and each received a denarius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_10","070_20_10","MAT","20","10","10","So when the original workers came, they assumed they would receive more. But each of them also received a denarius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_11","070_20_11","MAT","20","11","11","On receiving their pay, they began to grumble against the landowner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_12","070_20_12","MAT","20","12","12","‘These men who were hired last worked only one hour,’ they said, ‘and you have made them equal to us who have borne the burden and the scorching heat of the day.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_13","070_20_13","MAT","20","13","13","But he answered one of them, ‘Friend, I am not being unfair to you. Did you not agree with me on one denarius? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_14","070_20_14","MAT","20","14","14","Take your pay and go. I want to give this last man the same as I gave you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_15","070_20_15","MAT","20","15","15","Do I not have the right to do as I please with what is mine? Or are you envious because I am generous?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_16","070_20_16","MAT","20","16","16","So the last will be first, and the first will be last. For many are called, but few are chosen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_17","070_20_17","MAT","20","17","17","As Jesus was going up to Jerusalem, He took the twelve disciples aside and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_18","070_20_18","MAT","20","18","18","“Look, we are going up to Jerusalem, and the Son of Man will be delivered over to the chief priests and scribes. They will condemn Him to death ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_19","070_20_19","MAT","20","19","19","and will deliver Him over to the Gentiles to be mocked and flogged and crucified. And on the third day He will rise again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_20","070_20_20","MAT","20","20","20","Then the mother of Zebedee’s sons came to Jesus with her sons and knelt down to make a request of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_21","070_20_21","MAT","20","21","21","“What do you want?” He inquired. She answered, “Declare that in Your kingdom one of these two sons of mine may sit at Your right hand, and the other at Your left.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_22","070_20_22","MAT","20","22","22","“You do not know what you are asking,” Jesus replied. “Can you drink the cup I am going to drink or be baptized with the baptism with which I am baptized?” “We can,” the brothers answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_23","070_20_23","MAT","20","23","23","“You will indeed drink My cup and be baptized with the baptism with which I am baptized,” Jesus said. “But to sit at My right or left is not Mine to grant. These seats belong to those for whom My Father has prepared them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_24","070_20_24","MAT","20","24","24","When the ten heard about this, they were indignant with the two brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_25","070_20_25","MAT","20","25","25","But Jesus called them aside and said, “You know that the rulers of the Gentiles lord it over them, and their superiors exercise authority over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_26","070_20_26","MAT","20","26","26","But it shall not be this way among you. Instead, whoever wants to become great among you must be your servant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_27","070_20_27","MAT","20","27","27","and whoever wants to be first among you must be your slave— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_28","070_20_28","MAT","20","28","28","just as the Son of Man did not come to be served, but to serve, and to give His life as a ransom for many.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_29","070_20_29","MAT","20","29","29","As they were leaving Jericho, a large crowd followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_30","070_20_30","MAT","20","30","30","And there were two blind men sitting beside the road. When they heard that Jesus was passing by, they cried out, “Have mercy on us, Lord, Son of David!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_31","070_20_31","MAT","20","31","31","The crowd admonished them to be silent, but they cried out all the louder, “Have mercy on us, Lord, Son of David!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_32","070_20_32","MAT","20","32","32","Jesus stopped and called them. “What do you want Me to do for you?” He asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_33","070_20_33","MAT","20","33","33","“Lord,” they answered, “let our eyes be opened.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT20_34","070_20_34","MAT","20","34","34","Moved with compassion, Jesus touched their eyes, and at once they received their sight and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_1","070_21_1","MAT","21","1","1","As they approached Jerusalem and came to Bethphage on the Mount of Olives, Jesus sent out two disciples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_2","070_21_2","MAT","21","2","2","saying to them, “Go into the village opposite you, and at once you will find a donkey tied there, with her colt beside her. Untie them and bring them to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_3","070_21_3","MAT","21","3","3","If anyone questions you, tell him that the Lord needs them, and he will send them right away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_4","070_21_4","MAT","21","4","4","All this took place to fulfill what was spoken through the prophet: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_5","070_21_5","MAT","21","5","5","“Say to the Daughter of Zion, ‘See, your King comes to you, gentle and riding on a donkey, on a colt, the foal of a donkey.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_6","070_21_6","MAT","21","6","6","So the disciples went and did as Jesus had directed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_7","070_21_7","MAT","21","7","7","They brought the donkey and the colt and laid their cloaks on them, and Jesus sat on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_8","070_21_8","MAT","21","8","8","A massive crowd spread their cloaks on the road, while others cut branches from the trees and spread them on the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_9","070_21_9","MAT","21","9","9","The crowds that went ahead of Him and those that followed were shouting: “Hosanna to the Son of David!” “Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord!” “Hosanna in the highest!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_10","070_21_10","MAT","21","10","10","When Jesus had entered Jerusalem, the whole city was stirred and asked, “Who is this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_11","070_21_11","MAT","21","11","11","The crowds replied, “This is Jesus, the prophet from Nazareth in Galilee.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_12","070_21_12","MAT","21","12","12","Then Jesus entered the temple of God and drove out all who were buying and selling there. He overturned the tables of the money changers and the seats of those selling doves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_13","070_21_13","MAT","21","13","13","And He declared to them, “It is written: ‘My house will be called a house of prayer.’ But you have made it ‘a den of robbers.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_14","070_21_14","MAT","21","14","14","The lame and the blind came to Him at the temple, and He healed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_15","070_21_15","MAT","21","15","15","But the chief priests and scribes were indignant when they saw the wonders He performed and the children shouting in the temple courts, “Hosanna to the Son of David!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_16","070_21_16","MAT","21","16","16","“Do You hear what these children are saying?” they asked. “Yes,” Jesus answered. “Have you never read: ‘From the mouths of children and infants You have ordained praise’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_17","070_21_17","MAT","21","17","17","Then He left them and went out of the city to Bethany, where He spent the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_18","070_21_18","MAT","21","18","18","In the morning, as Jesus was returning to the city, He was hungry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_19","070_21_19","MAT","21","19","19","Seeing a fig tree by the road, He went up to it but found nothing on it except leaves. “May you never bear fruit again!” He said. And immediately the tree withered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_20","070_21_20","MAT","21","20","20","When the disciples saw this, they marveled and asked, “How did the fig tree wither so quickly?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_21","070_21_21","MAT","21","21","21","“Truly I tell you,” Jesus replied, “if you have faith and do not doubt, not only will you do what was done to the fig tree, but even if you say to this mountain, ‘Be lifted up and thrown into the sea,’ it will happen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_22","070_21_22","MAT","21","22","22","If you believe, you will receive whatever you ask for in prayer.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_23","070_21_23","MAT","21","23","23","When Jesus returned to the temple courts and began to teach, the chief priests and elders of the people came up to Him. “By what authority are You doing these things?” they asked. “And who gave You this authority?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_24","070_21_24","MAT","21","24","24","“I will also ask you one question,” Jesus replied, “and if you answer Me, I will tell you by what authority I am doing these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_25","070_21_25","MAT","21","25","25","What was the source of John’s baptism? Was it from heaven or from men?” They deliberated among themselves and said, “If we say, ‘From heaven,’ He will ask, ‘Why then did you not believe him?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_26","070_21_26","MAT","21","26","26","But if we say, ‘From men,’ we are afraid of the people, for they all regard John as a prophet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_27","070_21_27","MAT","21","27","27","So they answered, “We do not know.” And Jesus replied, “Neither will I tell you by what authority I am doing these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_28","070_21_28","MAT","21","28","28","But what do you think? There was a man who had two sons. He went to the first one and said, ‘Son, go and work today in my vineyard.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_29","070_21_29","MAT","21","29","29","‘I will not,’ he replied. But later he changed his mind and went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_30","070_21_30","MAT","21","30","30","Then the man went to the second son and told him the same thing. ‘I will, sir,’ he said. But he did not go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_31","070_21_31","MAT","21","31","31","Which of the two did the will of his father?” “The first,” they answered. Jesus said to them, “Truly I tell you, the tax collectors and prostitutes are entering the kingdom of God before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_32","070_21_32","MAT","21","32","32","For John came to you in the way of righteousness, and you did not believe him, but the tax collectors and prostitutes did. And even after you saw this, you did not repent and believe him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_33","070_21_33","MAT","21","33","33","Listen to another parable: There was a landowner who planted a vineyard. He put a wall around it, dug a winepress in it, and built a tower. Then he rented it out to some tenants and went away on a journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_34","070_21_34","MAT","21","34","34","When the harvest time drew near, he sent his servants to the tenants to collect his share of the fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_35","070_21_35","MAT","21","35","35","But the tenants seized his servants. They beat one, killed another, and stoned a third. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_36","070_21_36","MAT","21","36","36","Again, he sent other servants, more than the first group. But the tenants did the same to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_37","070_21_37","MAT","21","37","37","Finally, he sent his son to them. ‘They will respect my son,’ he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_38","070_21_38","MAT","21","38","38","But when the tenants saw the son, they said to one another, ‘This is the heir. Come, let us kill him and take his inheritance.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_39","070_21_39","MAT","21","39","39","So they seized him and threw him out of the vineyard and killed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_40","070_21_40","MAT","21","40","40","Therefore, when the owner of the vineyard returns, what will he do to those tenants?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_41","070_21_41","MAT","21","41","41","“He will bring those wretches to a wretched end,” they replied, “and will rent out the vineyard to other tenants who will give him his share of the fruit at harvest time.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_42","070_21_42","MAT","21","42","42","Jesus said to them, “Have you never read in the Scriptures: ‘The stone the builders rejected has become the cornerstone. This is from the Lord, and it is marvelous in our eyes’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_43","070_21_43","MAT","21","43","43","Therefore I tell you that the kingdom of God will be taken away from you and given to a people who will produce its fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_44","070_21_44","MAT","21","44","44","He who falls on this stone will be broken to pieces, but he on whom it falls will be crushed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_45","070_21_45","MAT","21","45","45","When the chief priests and Pharisees heard His parables, they knew that Jesus was speaking about them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT21_46","070_21_46","MAT","21","46","46","Although they wanted to arrest Him, they were afraid of the crowds, because the people regarded Him as a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_1","070_22_1","MAT","22","1","1","Once again, Jesus spoke to them in parables: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_2","070_22_2","MAT","22","2","2","“The kingdom of heaven is like a king who prepared a wedding banquet for his son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_3","070_22_3","MAT","22","3","3","He sent his servants to call those he had invited to the banquet, but they refused to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_4","070_22_4","MAT","22","4","4","Again, he sent other servants and said, ‘Tell those who have been invited that I have prepared my dinner. My oxen and fattened cattle have been killed, and everything is ready. Come to the wedding banquet.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_5","070_22_5","MAT","22","5","5","But they paid no attention and went away, one to his field, another to his business. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_6","070_22_6","MAT","22","6","6","The rest seized his servants, mistreated them, and killed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_7","070_22_7","MAT","22","7","7","When he heard this, the king was enraged, and he sent his troops to destroy those murderers and burn their city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_8","070_22_8","MAT","22","8","8","Then he said to his servants, ‘The wedding banquet is ready, but those I invited were not worthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_9","070_22_9","MAT","22","9","9","Go therefore to the crossroads and invite to the banquet as many as you can find.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_10","070_22_10","MAT","22","10","10","So the servants went out into the streets and gathered everyone they could find, both evil and good, and the wedding hall was filled with guests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_11","070_22_11","MAT","22","11","11","But when the king came in to see the guests, he spotted a man who was not dressed in wedding clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_12","070_22_12","MAT","22","12","12","‘Friend,’ he asked, ‘how did you get in here without wedding clothes?’ But the man was speechless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_13","070_22_13","MAT","22","13","13","Then the king told the servants, ‘Tie him hand and foot, take him away, and throw him into the outer darkness, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_14","070_22_14","MAT","22","14","14","For many are called, but few are chosen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_15","070_22_15","MAT","22","15","15","Then the Pharisees went out and conspired to trap Jesus in His words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_16","070_22_16","MAT","22","16","16","They sent their disciples to Him along with the Herodians. “Teacher,” they said, “we know that You are honest and that You teach the way of God in accordance with the truth. You seek favor from no one, because You pay no attention to external appearance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_17","070_22_17","MAT","22","17","17","So tell us what You think: Is it lawful to pay taxes to Caesar or not?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_18","070_22_18","MAT","22","18","18","But Jesus knew their evil intent and said, “You hypocrites, why are you testing Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_19","070_22_19","MAT","22","19","19","Show Me the coin used for the tax.” And they brought Him a denarius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_20","070_22_20","MAT","22","20","20","“Whose image is this,” He asked, “and whose inscription?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_21","070_22_21","MAT","22","21","21","“Caesar’s,” they answered. So Jesus told them, “Give to Caesar what is Caesar’s, and to God what is God’s.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_22","070_22_22","MAT","22","22","22","And when they heard this, they were amazed. So they left Him and went away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_23","070_22_23","MAT","22","23","23","That same day the Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to Jesus and questioned Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_24","070_22_24","MAT","22","24","24","“Teacher,” they said, “Moses declared that if a man dies without having children, his brother is to marry the widow and raise up offspring for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_25","070_22_25","MAT","22","25","25","Now there were seven brothers among us. The first one married and died without having children. So he left his wife to his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_26","070_22_26","MAT","22","26","26","The same thing happened to the second and third brothers, down to the seventh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_27","070_22_27","MAT","22","27","27","And last of all, the woman also died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_28","070_22_28","MAT","22","28","28","In the resurrection, then, whose wife will she be of the seven? For all of them were married to her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_29","070_22_29","MAT","22","29","29","Jesus answered, “You are mistaken because you do not know the Scriptures or the power of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_30","070_22_30","MAT","22","30","30","In the resurrection, people will neither marry nor be given in marriage. Instead, they will be like the angels of God in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_31","070_22_31","MAT","22","31","31","But concerning the resurrection of the dead, have you not read what God said to you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_32","070_22_32","MAT","22","32","32","‘I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob’? He is not the God of the dead, but of the living.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_33","070_22_33","MAT","22","33","33","When the crowds heard this, they were astonished at His teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_34","070_22_34","MAT","22","34","34","And when the Pharisees heard that Jesus had silenced the Sadducees, they themselves gathered together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_35","070_22_35","MAT","22","35","35","One of them, an expert in the law, tested Him with a question: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_36","070_22_36","MAT","22","36","36","“Teacher, which commandment is the greatest in the Law?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_37","070_22_37","MAT","22","37","37","Jesus declared, “‘Love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your mind.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_38","070_22_38","MAT","22","38","38","This is the first and greatest commandment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_39","070_22_39","MAT","22","39","39","And the second is like it: ‘Love your neighbor as yourself.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_40","070_22_40","MAT","22","40","40","All the Law and the Prophets hang on these two commandments.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_41","070_22_41","MAT","22","41","41","While the Pharisees were assembled, Jesus questioned them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_42","070_22_42","MAT","22","42","42","“What do you think about the Christ? Whose son is He?” “David’s,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_43","070_22_43","MAT","22","43","43","Jesus said to them, “How then does David in the Spirit call Him ‘Lord’? For he says: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_44","070_22_44","MAT","22","44","44","‘The Lord said to my Lord, “Sit at My right hand until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_45","070_22_45","MAT","22","45","45","So if David calls Him ‘Lord,’ how can He be David’s son?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT22_46","070_22_46","MAT","22","46","46","No one was able to answer a word, and from that day on no one dared to question Him any further. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_1","070_23_1","MAT","23","1","1","Then Jesus spoke to the crowds and to His disciples: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_2","070_23_2","MAT","23","2","2","“The scribes and Pharisees sit in Moses’ seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_3","070_23_3","MAT","23","3","3","So observe and practice everything they tell you to observe. But do not do what they do, for they do not practice what they preach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_4","070_23_4","MAT","23","4","4","They tie up heavy, burdensome loads and lay them on men’s shoulders, but they themselves are not willing to lift a finger to move them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_5","070_23_5","MAT","23","5","5","All their deeds are done for men to see. They broaden their phylacteries and lengthen the tassels of their garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_6","070_23_6","MAT","23","6","6","They love the places of honor at banquets, the chief seats in the synagogues, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_7","070_23_7","MAT","23","7","7","the greetings in the marketplaces, and the title of ‘Rabbi, Rabbi’ by which they are addressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_8","070_23_8","MAT","23","8","8","But you are not to be called ‘Rabbi,’ for you have one Teacher, the Christ, and you are all brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_9","070_23_9","MAT","23","9","9","And do not call anyone on earth your father, for you have one Father, who is in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_10","070_23_10","MAT","23","10","10","Nor are you to be called instructors, for you have one Instructor, the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_11","070_23_11","MAT","23","11","11","The greatest among you shall be your servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_12","070_23_12","MAT","23","12","12","For whoever exalts himself will be humbled, and whoever humbles himself will be exalted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_13","070_23_13","MAT","23","13","13","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You defraud widows of their houses, and for a show make lengthy prayers. Therefore you will receive greater condemnation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_14","070_23_14","MAT","23","14","14","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You shut the kingdom of heaven in men’s faces. You yourselves do not enter, nor will you let in those who wish to enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_15","070_23_15","MAT","23","15","15","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You traverse land and sea to win a single convert, and when he becomes one, you make him twice as much a son of hell as you are. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_16","070_23_16","MAT","23","16","16","Woe to you, blind guides! You say, ‘If anyone swears by the temple, it means nothing; but if anyone swears by the gold of the temple, he is bound by his oath.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_17","070_23_17","MAT","23","17","17","You blind fools! Which is greater: the gold, or the temple that makes it sacred? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_18","070_23_18","MAT","23","18","18","And you say, ‘If anyone swears by the altar, it means nothing; but if anyone swears by the gift on it, he is bound by his oath.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_19","070_23_19","MAT","23","19","19","You are foolish and blind! Which is greater: the gift, or the altar that makes it sacred? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_20","070_23_20","MAT","23","20","20","So then, he who swears by the altar swears by it and by everything on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_21","070_23_21","MAT","23","21","21","And he who swears by the temple swears by it and by the One who dwells in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_22","070_23_22","MAT","23","22","22","And he who swears by heaven swears by God’s throne and by the One who sits on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_23","070_23_23","MAT","23","23","23","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You pay tithes of mint, dill, and cumin. But you have disregarded the weightier matters of the law: justice, mercy, and faithfulness. You should have practiced the latter, without neglecting the former. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_24","070_23_24","MAT","23","24","24","You blind guides! You strain out a gnat but swallow a camel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_25","070_23_25","MAT","23","25","25","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You clean the outside of the cup and dish, but inside they are full of greed and unrighteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_26","070_23_26","MAT","23","26","26","Blind Pharisee! First clean the inside of the cup and dish, so that the outside may become clean as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_27","070_23_27","MAT","23","27","27","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You are like whitewashed tombs, which look beautiful on the outside but on the inside are full of dead men’s bones and every kind of impurity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_28","070_23_28","MAT","23","28","28","In the same way, on the outside you appear to be righteous, but on the inside you are full of hypocrisy and wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_29","070_23_29","MAT","23","29","29","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! You build tombs for the prophets and decorate the monuments of the righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_30","070_23_30","MAT","23","30","30","And you say, ‘If we had lived in the days of our fathers, we would not have been partners with them in shedding the blood of the prophets.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_31","070_23_31","MAT","23","31","31","So you testify against yourselves that you are the sons of those who murdered the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_32","070_23_32","MAT","23","32","32","Fill up, then, the measure of the sin of your fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_33","070_23_33","MAT","23","33","33","You snakes! You brood of vipers! How will you escape the sentence of hell? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_34","070_23_34","MAT","23","34","34","Because of this, I am sending you prophets and wise men and teachers. Some of them you will kill and crucify, and others you will flog in your synagogues and persecute from town to town. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_35","070_23_35","MAT","23","35","35","And so upon you will come all the righteous blood shed on earth, from the blood of righteous Abel to the blood of Zechariah son of Berechiah, whom you murdered between the temple and the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_36","070_23_36","MAT","23","36","36","Truly I tell you, all these things will come upon this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_37","070_23_37","MAT","23","37","37","O Jerusalem, Jerusalem, who kills the prophets and stones those sent to her, how often I have longed to gather your children together, as a hen gathers her chicks under her wings, but you were unwilling! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_38","070_23_38","MAT","23","38","38","Look, your house is left to you desolate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT23_39","070_23_39","MAT","23","39","39","For I tell you that you will not see Me again until you say, ‘Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_1","070_24_1","MAT","24","1","1","As Jesus left the temple and was walking away, His disciples came up to Him to point out its buildings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_2","070_24_2","MAT","24","2","2","“Do you see all these things?” Jesus replied. “Truly I tell you, not one stone here will be left on another; every one will be thrown down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_3","070_24_3","MAT","24","3","3","While Jesus was sitting on the Mount of Olives, the disciples came to Him privately. “Tell us,” they said, “when will these things happen, and what will be the sign of Your coming and of the end of the age?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_4","070_24_4","MAT","24","4","4","Jesus answered, “See to it that no one deceives you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_5","070_24_5","MAT","24","5","5","For many will come in My name, claiming, ‘I am the Christ,’ and will deceive many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_6","070_24_6","MAT","24","6","6","You will hear of wars and rumors of wars, but see to it that you are not alarmed. All these things must happen, but the end is still to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_7","070_24_7","MAT","24","7","7","Nation will rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom. There will be famines, pestilences, and earthquakes in various places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_8","070_24_8","MAT","24","8","8","All these are the beginning of birth pains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_9","070_24_9","MAT","24","9","9","Then they will deliver you over to be persecuted and killed, and you will be hated by all nations because of My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_10","070_24_10","MAT","24","10","10","At that time many will fall away and will betray and hate one another, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_11","070_24_11","MAT","24","11","11","and many false prophets will arise and deceive many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_12","070_24_12","MAT","24","12","12","Because of the multiplication of wickedness, the love of most will grow cold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_13","070_24_13","MAT","24","13","13","But the one who perseveres to the end will be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_14","070_24_14","MAT","24","14","14","And this gospel of the kingdom will be preached in all the world as a testimony to all nations, and then the end will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_15","070_24_15","MAT","24","15","15","So when you see standing in the holy place ‘the abomination of desolation,’ spoken of by the prophet Daniel (let the reader understand), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_16","070_24_16","MAT","24","16","16","then let those who are in Judea flee to the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_17","070_24_17","MAT","24","17","17","Let no one on the housetop come down to retrieve anything from his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_18","070_24_18","MAT","24","18","18","And let no one in the field return for his garments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_19","070_24_19","MAT","24","19","19","How miserable those days will be for pregnant and nursing mothers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_20","070_24_20","MAT","24","20","20","Pray that your flight will not occur in the winter or on the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_21","070_24_21","MAT","24","21","21","For at that time there will be great tribulation, unmatched from the beginning of the world until now, and never to be seen again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_22","070_24_22","MAT","24","22","22","If those days had not been cut short, nobody would be saved. But for the sake of the elect, those days will be cut short. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_23","070_24_23","MAT","24","23","23","At that time, if anyone says to you, ‘Look, here is the Christ!’ or ‘There He is!’ do not believe it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_24","070_24_24","MAT","24","24","24","For false Christs and false prophets will appear and perform great signs and wonders to deceive even the elect, if that were possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_25","070_24_25","MAT","24","25","25","See, I have told you in advance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_26","070_24_26","MAT","24","26","26","So if they tell you, ‘There He is in the wilderness,’ do not go out, or, ‘Here He is in the inner rooms,’ do not believe it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_27","070_24_27","MAT","24","27","27","For just as the lightning comes from the east and flashes as far as the west, so will be the coming of the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_28","070_24_28","MAT","24","28","28","For wherever there is a carcass, there the vultures will gather. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_29","070_24_29","MAT","24","29","29","Immediately after the tribulation of those days: ‘The sun will be darkened, and the moon will not give its light; the stars will fall from the sky, and the powers of the heavens will be shaken.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_30","070_24_30","MAT","24","30","30","At that time the sign of the Son of Man will appear in heaven, and all the tribes of the earth will mourn. They will see the Son of Man coming on the clouds of heaven with power and great glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_31","070_24_31","MAT","24","31","31","And He will send out His angels with a loud trumpet call, and they will gather His elect from the four winds, from one end of the heavens to the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_32","070_24_32","MAT","24","32","32","Now learn this lesson from the fig tree: As soon as its branches become tender and sprout leaves, you know that summer is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_33","070_24_33","MAT","24","33","33","So also, when you see all these things, you will know that He is near, right at the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_34","070_24_34","MAT","24","34","34","Truly I tell you, this generation will not pass away until all these things have happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_35","070_24_35","MAT","24","35","35","Heaven and earth will pass away, but My words will never pass away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_36","070_24_36","MAT","24","36","36","No one knows about that day or hour, not even the angels in heaven, but only My Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_37","070_24_37","MAT","24","37","37","As it was in the days of Noah, so will it be at the coming of the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_38","070_24_38","MAT","24","38","38","For in the days before the flood, people were eating and drinking, marrying and giving in marriage, up to the day Noah entered the ark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_39","070_24_39","MAT","24","39","39","And they were oblivious until the flood came and swept them all away. So will it be at the coming of the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_40","070_24_40","MAT","24","40","40","Two men will be in the field: one will be taken and the other left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_41","070_24_41","MAT","24","41","41","Two women will be grinding at the mill: one will be taken and the other left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_42","070_24_42","MAT","24","42","42","Therefore keep watch, because you do not know the hour in which your Lord will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_43","070_24_43","MAT","24","43","43","But understand this: If the homeowner had known in which watch of the night the thief was coming, he would have kept watch and would not have let his house be broken into. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_44","070_24_44","MAT","24","44","44","For this reason, you also must be ready, because the Son of Man will come at an hour you do not expect. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_45","070_24_45","MAT","24","45","45","Who then is the faithful and wise servant, whom his master has put in charge of his household, to give the others their food at the proper time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_46","070_24_46","MAT","24","46","46","Blessed is that servant whose master finds him doing so when he returns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_47","070_24_47","MAT","24","47","47","Truly I tell you, he will put him in charge of all his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_48","070_24_48","MAT","24","48","48","But suppose that servant is wicked and says in his heart, ‘My master will be a long time in coming.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_49","070_24_49","MAT","24","49","49","And he begins to beat his fellow servants and to eat and drink with drunkards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_50","070_24_50","MAT","24","50","50","The master of that servant will come on a day he does not expect and at an hour he does not anticipate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT24_51","070_24_51","MAT","24","51","51","Then he will cut him to pieces and assign him a place with the hypocrites, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_1","070_25_1","MAT","25","1","1","“At that time the kingdom of heaven will be like ten virgins who took their lamps and went out to meet the bridegroom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_2","070_25_2","MAT","25","2","2","Five of them were wise, and five were foolish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_3","070_25_3","MAT","25","3","3","Those who were foolish took their lamps but did not take along any extra oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_4","070_25_4","MAT","25","4","4","But the wise ones took oil in flasks along with their lamps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_5","070_25_5","MAT","25","5","5","When the bridegroom was delayed, they all became drowsy and fell asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_6","070_25_6","MAT","25","6","6","At midnight the cry rang out: ‘Behold, the bridegroom is coming! Come out to meet him!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_7","070_25_7","MAT","25","7","7","Then all the virgins woke up and trimmed their lamps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_8","070_25_8","MAT","25","8","8","The foolish ones said to the wise, ‘Give us some of your oil; our lamps are going out.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_9","070_25_9","MAT","25","9","9","‘No,’ said the wise ones, ‘or there may not be enough for both us and you. Instead, go to those who sell oil and buy some for yourselves.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_10","070_25_10","MAT","25","10","10","But while they were on their way to buy it, the bridegroom arrived. Those who were ready went in with him to the wedding banquet, and the door was shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_11","070_25_11","MAT","25","11","11","Later the other virgins arrived and said, ‘Lord, lord, open the door for us!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_12","070_25_12","MAT","25","12","12","But he replied, ‘Truly I tell you, I do not know you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_13","070_25_13","MAT","25","13","13","Therefore keep watch, because you do not know the day or the hour when the Son of Man comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_14","070_25_14","MAT","25","14","14","For it is just like a man going on a journey, who called his servants and entrusted them with his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_15","070_25_15","MAT","25","15","15","To one he gave five talents, to another two talents, and to another one talent—each according to his own ability. And he went on his journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_16","070_25_16","MAT","25","16","16","The servant who had received the five talents went at once and put them to work and made five more talents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_17","070_25_17","MAT","25","17","17","Likewise, the one with the two talents also gained two more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_18","070_25_18","MAT","25","18","18","But the servant who had received the one talent went off, dug a hole in the ground, and hid his master’s money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_19","070_25_19","MAT","25","19","19","After a long time the master of those servants returned and settled accounts with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_20","070_25_20","MAT","25","20","20","The servant who had received the five talents came and presented five more. ‘Master,’ he said, ‘you entrusted me with five talents. See, I have gained five more besides them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_21","070_25_21","MAT","25","21","21","His master replied, ‘Well done, good and faithful servant! You have been faithful with a few things; I will put you in charge of many things. Enter into the joy of your master!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_22","070_25_22","MAT","25","22","22","The servant who had received the two talents also came and said, ‘Master, you entrusted me with two talents. See, I have gained two more besides them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_23","070_25_23","MAT","25","23","23","His master replied, ‘Well done, good and faithful servant! You have been faithful with a few things; I will put you in charge of many things. Enter into the joy of your master!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_24","070_25_24","MAT","25","24","24","Finally, the servant who had received the one talent came and said, ‘Master, I knew that you are a hard man, reaping where you have not sown and gathering where you have not scattered seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_25","070_25_25","MAT","25","25","25","So I was afraid and went out and hid your talent in the ground. See, you have what belongs to you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_26","070_25_26","MAT","25","26","26","‘You wicked, lazy servant!’ replied his master. ‘You knew that I reap where I have not sown and gather where I have not scattered seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_27","070_25_27","MAT","25","27","27","Then you should have deposited my money with the bankers, and on my return I would have received it back with interest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_28","070_25_28","MAT","25","28","28","Therefore take the talent from him and give it to the one who has ten talents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_29","070_25_29","MAT","25","29","29","For everyone who has will be given more, and he will have an abundance. But the one who does not have, even what he has will be taken away from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_30","070_25_30","MAT","25","30","30","And throw that worthless servant into the outer darkness, where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_31","070_25_31","MAT","25","31","31","When the Son of Man comes in His glory, and all the holy angels with Him, He will sit on His glorious throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_32","070_25_32","MAT","25","32","32","All the nations will be gathered before Him, and He will separate the people one from another, as a shepherd separates the sheep from the goats. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_33","070_25_33","MAT","25","33","33","He will place the sheep on His right and the goats on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_34","070_25_34","MAT","25","34","34","Then the King will say to those on His right, ‘Come, you who are blessed by My Father, inherit the kingdom prepared for you from the foundation of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_35","070_25_35","MAT","25","35","35","For I was hungry and you gave Me something to eat, I was thirsty and you gave Me something to drink, I was a stranger and you took Me in, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_36","070_25_36","MAT","25","36","36","I was naked and you clothed Me, I was sick and you looked after Me, I was in prison and you visited Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_37","070_25_37","MAT","25","37","37","Then the righteous will answer Him, ‘Lord, when did we see You hungry and feed You, or thirsty and give You something to drink? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_38","070_25_38","MAT","25","38","38","When did we see You a stranger and take You in, or naked and clothe You? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_39","070_25_39","MAT","25","39","39","When did we see You sick or in prison and visit You?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_40","070_25_40","MAT","25","40","40","And the King will reply, ‘Truly I tell you, whatever you did for one of the least of these brothers of Mine, you did for Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_41","070_25_41","MAT","25","41","41","Then He will say to those on His left, ‘Depart from Me, you who are cursed, into the eternal fire prepared for the devil and his angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_42","070_25_42","MAT","25","42","42","For I was hungry and you gave Me nothing to eat, I was thirsty and you gave Me nothing to drink, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_43","070_25_43","MAT","25","43","43","I was a stranger and you did not take Me in, I was naked and you did not clothe Me, I was sick and in prison and you did not look after Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_44","070_25_44","MAT","25","44","44","And they too will reply, ‘Lord, when did we see You hungry or thirsty or a stranger or naked or sick or in prison, and did not minister to You?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_45","070_25_45","MAT","25","45","45","Then the King will answer, ‘Truly I tell you, whatever you did not do for one of the least of these, you did not do for Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT25_46","070_25_46","MAT","25","46","46","And they will go away into eternal punishment, but the righteous into eternal life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_1","070_26_1","MAT","26","1","1","When Jesus had finished saying all these things, He told His disciples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_2","070_26_2","MAT","26","2","2","“You know that the Passover is two days away, and the Son of Man will be handed over to be crucified.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_3","070_26_3","MAT","26","3","3","At that time the chief priests, scribes, and elders of the people assembled in the courtyard of the high priest, whose name was Caiaphas, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_4","070_26_4","MAT","26","4","4","and they conspired to arrest Jesus covertly and kill Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_5","070_26_5","MAT","26","5","5","“But not during the feast,” they said, “or there may be a riot among the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_6","070_26_6","MAT","26","6","6","While Jesus was in Bethany in the home of Simon the Leper, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_7","070_26_7","MAT","26","7","7","a woman came to Him with an alabaster jar of expensive perfume, which she poured on His head as He reclined at the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_8","070_26_8","MAT","26","8","8","When His disciples saw this, they were indignant and asked, “Why this waste? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_9","070_26_9","MAT","26","9","9","This perfume could have been sold at a high price, and the money given to the poor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_10","070_26_10","MAT","26","10","10","Aware of this, Jesus asked, “Why are you bothering this woman? She has done a beautiful deed to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_11","070_26_11","MAT","26","11","11","The poor you will always have with you, but you will not always have Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_12","070_26_12","MAT","26","12","12","By pouring this perfume on Me, she has prepared My body for burial. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_13","070_26_13","MAT","26","13","13","Truly I tell you, wherever this gospel is preached in all the world, what she has done will also be told in memory of her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_14","070_26_14","MAT","26","14","14","Then one of the Twelve, the one called Judas Iscariot, went to the chief priests ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_15","070_26_15","MAT","26","15","15","and asked, “What are you willing to give me if I hand Him over to you?” And they set out for him thirty pieces of silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_16","070_26_16","MAT","26","16","16","So from then on Judas looked for an opportunity to betray Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_17","070_26_17","MAT","26","17","17","On the first day of the Feast of Unleavened Bread, the disciples came to Jesus and asked, “Where do You want us to prepare for You to eat the Passover?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_18","070_26_18","MAT","26","18","18","He answered, “Go into the city to a certain man and tell him that the Teacher says, ‘My time is near. I will keep the Passover with My disciples at your house.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_19","070_26_19","MAT","26","19","19","So the disciples did as Jesus had directed them and prepared the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_20","070_26_20","MAT","26","20","20","When evening came, Jesus was reclining with the Twelve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_21","070_26_21","MAT","26","21","21","And while they were eating, He said to them, “Truly I tell you, one of you will betray Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_22","070_26_22","MAT","26","22","22","They were deeply grieved and began to ask Him one after another, “Surely not I, Lord?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_23","070_26_23","MAT","26","23","23","Jesus answered, “The one who has dipped his hand into the bowl with Me will betray Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_24","070_26_24","MAT","26","24","24","The Son of Man will go just as it is written about Him, but woe to that man by whom He is betrayed. It would be better for him if he had not been born.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_25","070_26_25","MAT","26","25","25","Then Judas, who would betray Him, said, “Surely not I, Rabbi?” Jesus answered, “You have said it yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_26","070_26_26","MAT","26","26","26","While they were eating, Jesus took bread, gave thanks and broke it, and gave it to the disciples, saying, “Take and eat; this is My body.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_27","070_26_27","MAT","26","27","27","Then He took the cup, gave thanks, and gave it to them, saying, “Drink from it, all of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_28","070_26_28","MAT","26","28","28","This is My blood of the new covenant, which is poured out for many for the forgiveness of sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_29","070_26_29","MAT","26","29","29","I tell you, I will not drink of this fruit of the vine from now on until that day when I drink it anew with you in My Father’s kingdom.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_30","070_26_30","MAT","26","30","30","And when they had sung a hymn, they went out to the Mount of Olives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_31","070_26_31","MAT","26","31","31","Then Jesus said to them, “This very night you will all fall away on account of Me. For it is written: ‘I will strike the Shepherd, and the sheep of the flock will be scattered.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_32","070_26_32","MAT","26","32","32","But after I have risen, I will go ahead of you into Galilee.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_33","070_26_33","MAT","26","33","33","Peter said to Him, “Even if all fall away on account of You, I never will.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_34","070_26_34","MAT","26","34","34","“Truly I tell you,” Jesus declared, “this very night, before the rooster crows, you will deny Me three times.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_35","070_26_35","MAT","26","35","35","Peter replied, “Even if I have to die with You, I will never deny You.” And all the other disciples said the same thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_36","070_26_36","MAT","26","36","36","Then Jesus went with His disciples to a place called Gethsemane, and He told them, “Sit here while I go over there and pray.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_37","070_26_37","MAT","26","37","37","He took with Him Peter and the two sons of Zebedee and began to be sorrowful and deeply distressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_38","070_26_38","MAT","26","38","38","Then Jesus said to them, “My soul is consumed with sorrow to the point of death. Stay here and keep watch with Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_39","070_26_39","MAT","26","39","39","Going a little farther, He fell facedown and prayed, “My Father, if it is possible, let this cup pass from Me. Yet not as I will, but as You will.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_40","070_26_40","MAT","26","40","40","Then Jesus returned to the disciples and found them sleeping. “Were you not able to keep watch with Me for one hour?” He asked Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_41","070_26_41","MAT","26","41","41","“Watch and pray so that you will not enter into temptation. For the spirit is willing, but the body is weak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_42","070_26_42","MAT","26","42","42","A second time He went away and prayed, “My Father, if this cup cannot pass from Me unless I drink it, may Your will be done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_43","070_26_43","MAT","26","43","43","And Jesus returned and found them sleeping again, for their eyes were heavy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_44","070_26_44","MAT","26","44","44","So He left them and went away once more and prayed a third time, saying the same thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_45","070_26_45","MAT","26","45","45","Then He returned to His disciples and said, “Are you still sleeping and resting? Look, the hour is near, and the Son of Man is betrayed into the hands of sinners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_46","070_26_46","MAT","26","46","46","Rise, let us go! See, My betrayer is approaching!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_47","070_26_47","MAT","26","47","47","While Jesus was still speaking, Judas, one of the Twelve, arrived, accompanied by a large crowd armed with swords and clubs, sent from the chief priests and elders of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_48","070_26_48","MAT","26","48","48","Now the betrayer had arranged a signal with them: “The One I kiss is the man; arrest Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_49","070_26_49","MAT","26","49","49","Going directly to Jesus, he said, “Greetings, Rabbi!” and kissed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_50","070_26_50","MAT","26","50","50","“Friend,” Jesus replied, “why have you come?” Then the men stepped forward, seized Jesus, and arrested Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_51","070_26_51","MAT","26","51","51","At this, one of Jesus’ companions drew his sword and struck the servant of the high priest, cutting off his ear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_52","070_26_52","MAT","26","52","52","“Put your sword back in its place,” Jesus said to him. “For all who draw the sword will perish by the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_53","070_26_53","MAT","26","53","53","Are you not aware that I can call on My Father right now, and He will at once put at My disposal more than twelve legions of angels? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_54","070_26_54","MAT","26","54","54","But how then would the Scriptures be fulfilled that say it must happen this way?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_55","070_26_55","MAT","26","55","55","At that time Jesus said to the crowd, “Have you come out with swords and clubs to arrest Me as you would an outlaw? Every day I sat with you teaching in the temple courts, and you did not arrest Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_56","070_26_56","MAT","26","56","56","But this has all happened so that the writings of the prophets would be fulfilled.” Then all the disciples deserted Him and fled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_57","070_26_57","MAT","26","57","57","Those who had arrested Jesus led Him away to the house of Caiaphas the high priest, where the scribes and elders had gathered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_58","070_26_58","MAT","26","58","58","But Peter followed Him at a distance, right up to the courtyard of the high priest. And he went in and sat down with the guards to see the outcome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_59","070_26_59","MAT","26","59","59","Now the chief priests, the elders, and the whole Sanhedrin were seeking false testimony against Jesus in order to put Him to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_60","070_26_60","MAT","26","60","60","But they did not find any. Even though many false witnesses came forward, they found none. Finally two false witnesses came forward ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_61","070_26_61","MAT","26","61","61","and declared, “This man said, ‘I am able to destroy the temple of God and rebuild it in three days.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_62","070_26_62","MAT","26","62","62","So the high priest stood up and asked Him, “Have You no answer? What are these men testifying against You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_63","070_26_63","MAT","26","63","63","But Jesus remained silent. Then the high priest said to Him, “I charge You under oath by the living God: Tell us if You are the Christ, the Son of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_64","070_26_64","MAT","26","64","64","“You have said it yourself,” Jesus answered. “But I say to all of you, from now on you will see the Son of Man sitting at the right hand of Power and coming on the clouds of heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_65","070_26_65","MAT","26","65","65","At this, the high priest tore his clothes and declared, “He has blasphemed! Why do we need any more witnesses? Look, now you have heard His blasphemy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_66","070_26_66","MAT","26","66","66","What do you think?” “He deserves to die,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_67","070_26_67","MAT","26","67","67","Then they spit in His face and struck Him. Others slapped Him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_68","070_26_68","MAT","26","68","68","and said, “Prophesy to us, Christ! Who hit You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_69","070_26_69","MAT","26","69","69","Meanwhile, Peter was sitting out in the courtyard, and a servant girl came up to him. “You also were with Jesus the Galilean,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_70","070_26_70","MAT","26","70","70","But he denied it before them all: “I do not know what you are talking about.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_71","070_26_71","MAT","26","71","71","When Peter had gone out to the gateway, another servant girl saw him and said to the people there, “This man was also with Jesus of Nazareth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_72","070_26_72","MAT","26","72","72","And again he denied it with an oath: “I do not know the man!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_73","070_26_73","MAT","26","73","73","After a little while, those standing nearby came up to Peter. “Surely you are one of them,” they said, “for your accent gives you away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_74","070_26_74","MAT","26","74","74","At that he began to curse and swear to them, “I do not know the man!” And immediately a rooster crowed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT26_75","070_26_75","MAT","26","75","75","Then Peter remembered the word that Jesus had spoken to him: “Before the rooster crows, you will deny Me three times.” And he went outside and wept bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_1","070_27_1","MAT","27","1","1","When morning came, all the chief priests and elders of the people conspired against Jesus to put Him to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_2","070_27_2","MAT","27","2","2","They bound Him, led Him away, and handed Him over to Pontius Pilate the governor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_3","070_27_3","MAT","27","3","3","When Judas, who had betrayed Him, saw that Jesus was condemned, he was filled with remorse and returned the thirty pieces of silver to the chief priests and elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_4","070_27_4","MAT","27","4","4","“I have sinned by betraying innocent blood,” he said. “What is that to us?” they replied. “You bear the responsibility.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_5","070_27_5","MAT","27","5","5","So Judas threw the silver into the temple and left. Then he went away and hanged himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_6","070_27_6","MAT","27","6","6","The chief priests picked up the pieces of silver and said, “It is unlawful to put this into the treasury, since it is blood money.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_7","070_27_7","MAT","27","7","7","After conferring together, they used the money to buy the potter’s field as a burial place for foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_8","070_27_8","MAT","27","8","8","That is why it has been called the Field of Blood to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_9","070_27_9","MAT","27","9","9","Then what was spoken through Jeremiah the prophet was fulfilled: “They took the thirty pieces of silver, the price set on Him by the people of Israel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_10","070_27_10","MAT","27","10","10","and they gave them for the potter’s field, as the Lord had commanded me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_11","070_27_11","MAT","27","11","11","Meanwhile Jesus stood before the governor, who questioned Him: “Are You the King of the Jews?” “You have said so,” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_12","070_27_12","MAT","27","12","12","And when He was accused by the chief priests and elders, He gave no answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_13","070_27_13","MAT","27","13","13","Then Pilate asked Him, “Do You not hear how many charges they are bringing against You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_14","070_27_14","MAT","27","14","14","But Jesus gave no answer, not even to a single charge, much to the governor’s amazement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_15","070_27_15","MAT","27","15","15","Now it was the governor’s custom at the feast to release to the crowd a prisoner of their choosing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_16","070_27_16","MAT","27","16","16","At that time they were holding a notorious prisoner named Barabbas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_17","070_27_17","MAT","27","17","17","So when the crowd had assembled, Pilate asked them, “Which one do you want me to release to you: Barabbas, or Jesus who is called Christ?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_18","070_27_18","MAT","27","18","18","For he knew it was out of envy that they had handed Jesus over to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_19","070_27_19","MAT","27","19","19","While Pilate was sitting on the judgment seat, his wife sent him this message: “Have nothing to do with that innocent man, for I have suffered terribly in a dream today because of Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_20","070_27_20","MAT","27","20","20","But the chief priests and elders persuaded the crowds to ask for Barabbas and to have Jesus put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_21","070_27_21","MAT","27","21","21","“Which of the two do you want me to release to you?” asked the governor. “Barabbas,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_22","070_27_22","MAT","27","22","22","“What then should I do with Jesus who is called Christ?” Pilate asked. They all answered, “Crucify Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_23","070_27_23","MAT","27","23","23","“Why?” asked the governor. “What evil has He done?” But they shouted all the louder, “Crucify Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_24","070_27_24","MAT","27","24","24","When Pilate saw that he was accomplishing nothing, but that instead a riot was breaking out, he took water and washed his hands before the crowd. “I am innocent of this righteous man’s blood,” he said. “You bear the responsibility.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_25","070_27_25","MAT","27","25","25","All the people answered, “His blood be on us and on our children!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_26","070_27_26","MAT","27","26","26","So Pilate released Barabbas to them. But he had Jesus flogged, and handed Him over to be crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_27","070_27_27","MAT","27","27","27","Then the governor’s soldiers took Jesus into the Praetorium and gathered the whole company around Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_28","070_27_28","MAT","27","28","28","They stripped Him and put a scarlet robe on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_29","070_27_29","MAT","27","29","29","And they twisted together a crown of thorns and set it on His head. They put a staff in His right hand, knelt down before Him, and mocked Him, saying, “Hail, King of the Jews!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_30","070_27_30","MAT","27","30","30","Then they spit on Him and took the staff and struck Him on the head repeatedly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_31","070_27_31","MAT","27","31","31","After they had mocked Him, they removed the robe and put His own clothes back on Him. Then they led Him away to crucify Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_32","070_27_32","MAT","27","32","32","Along the way they found a man from Cyrene, named Simon, and they forced him to carry the cross of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_33","070_27_33","MAT","27","33","33","And when they came to a place called Golgotha, which means The Place of the Skull, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_34","070_27_34","MAT","27","34","34","they offered Him sour wine to drink, mixed with gall; but after tasting it, He refused to drink it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_35","070_27_35","MAT","27","35","35","When they had crucified Him, they divided up His garments by casting lots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_36","070_27_36","MAT","27","36","36","And sitting down, they kept watch over Him there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_37","070_27_37","MAT","27","37","37","Above His head they posted the written charge against Him: THIS IS JESUS, THE KING OF THE JEWS. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_38","070_27_38","MAT","27","38","38","Two robbers were crucified with Him, one on His right and the other on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_39","070_27_39","MAT","27","39","39","And those who passed by heaped abuse on Him, shaking their heads ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_40","070_27_40","MAT","27","40","40","and saying, “You who are going to destroy the temple and rebuild it in three days, save Yourself! If You are the Son of God, come down from the cross!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_41","070_27_41","MAT","27","41","41","In the same way, the chief priests, scribes, elders, and Pharisees mocked Him, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_42","070_27_42","MAT","27","42","42","“He saved others, but He cannot save Himself. If He is the King of Israel, let Him come down now from the cross, and we will believe in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_43","070_27_43","MAT","27","43","43","He trusts in God. Let God deliver Him now if He wants Him. For He said, ‘I am the Son of God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_44","070_27_44","MAT","27","44","44","In the same way, even the robbers who were crucified with Him berated Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_45","070_27_45","MAT","27","45","45","From the sixth hour until the ninth hour darkness came over all the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_46","070_27_46","MAT","27","46","46","About the ninth hour Jesus cried out in a loud voice, “Eli, Eli, lima sabachthani?” which means, “My God, My God, why have You forsaken Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_47","070_27_47","MAT","27","47","47","When some of those standing there heard this, they said, “He is calling Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_48","070_27_48","MAT","27","48","48","One of them quickly ran and brought a sponge. He filled it with sour wine, put it on a reed, and held it up for Jesus to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_49","070_27_49","MAT","27","49","49","But the others said, “Leave Him alone. Let us see if Elijah comes to save Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_50","070_27_50","MAT","27","50","50","When Jesus had cried out again in a loud voice, He yielded up His spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_51","070_27_51","MAT","27","51","51","At that moment the veil of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom. The earth quaked, and the rocks were split. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_52","070_27_52","MAT","27","52","52","The tombs broke open, and the bodies of many saints who had fallen asleep were raised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_53","070_27_53","MAT","27","53","53","After Jesus’ resurrection, when they had come out of the tombs, they entered the holy city and appeared to many people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_54","070_27_54","MAT","27","54","54","When the centurion and those with him who were guarding Jesus saw the earthquake and all that had happened, they were terrified and said, “Truly this was the Son of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_55","070_27_55","MAT","27","55","55","And many women were there, watching from a distance. They had followed Jesus from Galilee to minister to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_56","070_27_56","MAT","27","56","56","Among them were Mary Magdalene, Mary the mother of James and Joses, and the mother of Zebedee’s sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_57","070_27_57","MAT","27","57","57","When it was evening, there came a rich man from Arimathea named Joseph, who himself was a disciple of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_58","070_27_58","MAT","27","58","58","He went to Pilate to ask for the body of Jesus, and Pilate ordered that the body be given to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_59","070_27_59","MAT","27","59","59","So Joseph took the body, wrapped it in a clean linen cloth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_60","070_27_60","MAT","27","60","60","and placed it in his own new tomb that he had cut into the rock. Then he rolled a great stone across the entrance to the tomb and went away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_61","070_27_61","MAT","27","61","61","Mary Magdalene and the other Mary were sitting there opposite the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_62","070_27_62","MAT","27","62","62","The next day, the one after Preparation Day, the chief priests and Pharisees assembled before Pilate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_63","070_27_63","MAT","27","63","63","“Sir,” they said, “we remember that while He was alive that deceiver said, ‘After three days I will rise again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_64","070_27_64","MAT","27","64","64","So give the order that the tomb be secured until the third day. Otherwise, His disciples may come by night and steal Him away and tell the people He has risen from the dead. And this last deception would be worse than the first.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_65","070_27_65","MAT","27","65","65","“You have a guard,” Pilate said. “Go, make the tomb as secure as you know how.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT27_66","070_27_66","MAT","27","66","66","So they went and secured the tomb by sealing the stone and posting the guard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_1","070_28_1","MAT","28","1","1","After the Sabbath, at dawn on the first day of the week, Mary Magdalene and the other Mary went to see the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_2","070_28_2","MAT","28","2","2","Suddenly there was a great earthquake, for an angel of the Lord descended from heaven, rolled away the stone from the entrance, and sat on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_3","070_28_3","MAT","28","3","3","His appearance was like lightning, and his clothes were white as snow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_4","070_28_4","MAT","28","4","4","The guards trembled in fear of him and became like dead men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_5","070_28_5","MAT","28","5","5","But the angel said to the women, “Do not be afraid, for I know that you are looking for Jesus, who was crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_6","070_28_6","MAT","28","6","6","He is not here; He has risen, just as He said! Come, see the place where the Lord lay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_7","070_28_7","MAT","28","7","7","Then go quickly and tell His disciples, ‘He has risen from the dead and is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him.’ See, I have told you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_8","070_28_8","MAT","28","8","8","So they hurried out from the tomb in fear and great joy, and ran to tell His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_9","070_28_9","MAT","28","9","9","And as they were going to tell His disciples, suddenly Jesus met them and said, “Greetings!” They came to Him, grasped His feet, and worshiped Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_10","070_28_10","MAT","28","10","10","“Do not be afraid,” said Jesus. “Go and tell My brothers to go to Galilee. There they will see Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_11","070_28_11","MAT","28","11","11","While the women were on their way, some of the guards went into the city and reported to the chief priests all that had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_12","070_28_12","MAT","28","12","12","And after the chief priests had met with the elders and formed a plan, they gave the soldiers a large sum of money ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_13","070_28_13","MAT","28","13","13","and instructed them: “You are to say, ‘His disciples came by night and stole Him away while we were asleep.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_14","070_28_14","MAT","28","14","14","If this report reaches the governor, we will satisfy him and keep you out of trouble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_15","070_28_15","MAT","28","15","15","So the guards took the money and did as they were instructed. And this account has been circulated among the Jews to this very day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_16","070_28_16","MAT","28","16","16","Meanwhile, the eleven disciples went to Galilee, to the mountain Jesus had designated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_17","070_28_17","MAT","28","17","17","When they saw Him, they worshiped Him, but some doubted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_18","070_28_18","MAT","28","18","18","Then Jesus came to them and said, “All authority in heaven and on earth has been given to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_19","070_28_19","MAT","28","19","19","Therefore go and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MT28_20","070_28_20","MAT","28","20","20","and teaching them to obey all that I have commanded you. And surely I am with you always, even to the end of the age. Amen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_1","071_1_1","MRK","1","1","1","This is the beginning of the gospel of Jesus Christ, the Son of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_2","071_1_2","MRK","1","2","2","As it is written in the prophets: “Behold, I will send My messenger ahead of You, who will prepare Your way before You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_3","071_1_3","MRK","1","3","3","“A voice of one calling in the wilderness, ‘Prepare the way for the Lord, make straight paths for Him.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_4","071_1_4","MRK","1","4","4","John came baptizing in the wilderness, preaching a baptism of repentance for the forgiveness of sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_5","071_1_5","MRK","1","5","5","People went out to him from all of Jerusalem and the countryside of Judea. Confessing their sins, they were all baptized by him in the Jordan River. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_6","071_1_6","MRK","1","6","6","John was clothed in camel’s hair, with a leather belt around his waist. His food was locusts and wild honey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_7","071_1_7","MRK","1","7","7","And he proclaimed: “After me will come One more powerful than I, the straps of whose sandals I am not worthy to stoop down and untie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_8","071_1_8","MRK","1","8","8","I indeed baptize you with water, but He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_9","071_1_9","MRK","1","9","9","In those days Jesus came from Nazareth in Galilee and was baptized by John in the Jordan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_10","071_1_10","MRK","1","10","10","As soon as Jesus came up out of the water, He saw the heavens breaking open and the Spirit descending on Him like a dove. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_11","071_1_11","MRK","1","11","11","And a voice came from heaven: “You are My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_12","071_1_12","MRK","1","12","12","At once the Spirit drove Jesus into the wilderness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_13","071_1_13","MRK","1","13","13","and He was there in the wilderness for forty days, being tempted by Satan. He was with the wild animals, and the angels ministered to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_14","071_1_14","MRK","1","14","14","After the arrest of John, Jesus went into Galilee and proclaimed the gospel of the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_15","071_1_15","MRK","1","15","15","“The time is fulfilled,” He said, “and the kingdom of God is near. Repent and believe in the gospel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_16","071_1_16","MRK","1","16","16","As Jesus was walking beside the Sea of Galilee, He saw Simon and his brother Andrew. They were casting a net into the sea, for they were fishermen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_17","071_1_17","MRK","1","17","17","“Come, follow Me,” Jesus said, “and I will make you fishers of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_18","071_1_18","MRK","1","18","18","And at once they left their nets and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_19","071_1_19","MRK","1","19","19","Going on a little farther from there, He saw James son of Zebedee and his brother John. They were in a boat, mending their nets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_20","071_1_20","MRK","1","20","20","Immediately Jesus called them, and they left their father Zebedee in the boat with the hired men and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_21","071_1_21","MRK","1","21","21","Then Jesus and His companions went to Capernaum, and right away Jesus entered the synagogue on the Sabbath and began to teach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_22","071_1_22","MRK","1","22","22","The people were astonished at His teaching, because He taught as one who had authority, and not as the scribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_23","071_1_23","MRK","1","23","23","Now a man with an unclean spirit cried out in the synagogue: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_24","071_1_24","MRK","1","24","24","“Let us alone! What do You want with us, Jesus of Nazareth? Have You come to destroy us? I know who You are—the Holy One of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_25","071_1_25","MRK","1","25","25","But Jesus rebuked the spirit. “Be silent!” He said. “Come out of him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_26","071_1_26","MRK","1","26","26","At this, the unclean spirit threw the man into convulsions and came out with a loud shriek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_27","071_1_27","MRK","1","27","27","All the people were amazed and began to ask one another, “What is this? What new teaching is this that with authority He commands even the unclean spirits, and they obey Him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_28","071_1_28","MRK","1","28","28","And the news about Jesus spread quickly through the whole region of Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_29","071_1_29","MRK","1","29","29","As soon as Jesus and His companions had left the synagogue, they went with James and John to the home of Simon and Andrew. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_30","071_1_30","MRK","1","30","30","Simon’s mother-in-law was sick in bed with a fever, and they promptly told Jesus about her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_31","071_1_31","MRK","1","31","31","So He went to her, took her by the hand, and helped her up. Immediately the fever left her, and she began to serve them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_32","071_1_32","MRK","1","32","32","That evening, after sunset, people brought to Jesus all the sick and demon-possessed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_33","071_1_33","MRK","1","33","33","and the whole town gathered at the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_34","071_1_34","MRK","1","34","34","And He healed many who were ill with various diseases and drove out many demons. But He would not allow the demons to speak, because they knew who He was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_35","071_1_35","MRK","1","35","35","Early in the morning, while it was still dark, Jesus got up and went out to a solitary place to pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_36","071_1_36","MRK","1","36","36","Simon and his companions went to look for Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_37","071_1_37","MRK","1","37","37","and when they found Him, they said, “Everyone is looking for You!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_38","071_1_38","MRK","1","38","38","But Jesus answered, “Let us go on to the neighboring towns so I can preach there as well, for that is why I have come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_39","071_1_39","MRK","1","39","39","So He went throughout Galilee, preaching in their synagogues and driving out demons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_40","071_1_40","MRK","1","40","40","Then a leper came to Jesus, begging and kneeling before Him and saying to Him: “If You are willing, You can make me clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_41","071_1_41","MRK","1","41","41","Moved with compassion, Jesus reached out His hand and touched the man. “I am willing,” He said. “Be clean!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_42","071_1_42","MRK","1","42","42","And when He had said this, immediately the leprosy left him, and the man was cleansed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_43","071_1_43","MRK","1","43","43","Jesus promptly sent him away with a stern warning: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_44","071_1_44","MRK","1","44","44","“See that you don’t tell anyone. But go, show yourself to the priest and present the offering Moses prescribed for your cleansing, as a testimony to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK1_45","071_1_45","MRK","1","45","45","But the man went out and openly began to proclaim and spread the news. Consequently, Jesus could no longer enter a town in plain view, but He stayed out in solitary places. Yet people came to Him from every quarter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_1","071_2_1","MRK","2","1","1","A few days later Jesus went back to Capernaum. And when the people heard that He was home, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_2","071_2_2","MRK","2","2","2","immediately they gathered in such large numbers that there was no more room, not even outside the door, as Jesus spoke the word to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_3","071_2_3","MRK","2","3","3","Then a paralytic was brought to Him, carried by four men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_4","071_2_4","MRK","2","4","4","Since they were unable to get to Jesus through the crowd, they uncovered the roof above Him, made an opening, and lowered the paralytic on his mat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_5","071_2_5","MRK","2","5","5","When Jesus saw their faith, He said to the paralytic, “Son, your sins are forgiven you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_6","071_2_6","MRK","2","6","6","But some of the scribes were sitting there and thinking in their hearts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_7","071_2_7","MRK","2","7","7","“Why does this man speak such blasphemies? Who can forgive sins but God alone?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_8","071_2_8","MRK","2","8","8","At once Jesus knew in His spirit that they were thinking this way within themselves. “Why are you thinking these things in your hearts?” He asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_9","071_2_9","MRK","2","9","9","“Which is easier: to say to a paralytic, ‘Your sins are forgiven,’ or to say, ‘Get up, pick up your mat, and walk’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_10","071_2_10","MRK","2","10","10","But so that you may know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins...” He said to the paralytic, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_11","071_2_11","MRK","2","11","11","“I tell you, get up, pick up your mat, and go home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_12","071_2_12","MRK","2","12","12","And immediately the man got up, picked up his mat, and walked out in front of them all. As a result, they were all astounded and glorified God, saying, “We have never seen anything like this!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_13","071_2_13","MRK","2","13","13","Once again Jesus went out beside the sea. All the people came to Him, and He taught them there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_14","071_2_14","MRK","2","14","14","As He was walking along, He saw Levi son of Alphaeus sitting at the tax booth. “Follow Me,” He told him, and Levi got up and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_15","071_2_15","MRK","2","15","15","While Jesus was dining at Levi’s house, many tax collectors and sinners were eating with Him and His disciples—for there were many who followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_16","071_2_16","MRK","2","16","16","When the scribes and Pharisees saw Jesus eating with these people, they asked His disciples, “Why does He eat and drink with tax collectors and sinners?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_17","071_2_17","MRK","2","17","17","On hearing this, Jesus told them, “It is not the healthy who need a doctor, but the sick. I have not come to call the righteous, but sinners, to repentance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_18","071_2_18","MRK","2","18","18","Now the disciples of John and of the Pharisees were often fasting. So people came to Jesus and asked, “Why don’t Your disciples fast like John’s disciples and those of the Pharisees?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_19","071_2_19","MRK","2","19","19","Jesus replied, “How can the guests of the bridegroom fast while He is with them? As long as He is with them, they cannot fast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_20","071_2_20","MRK","2","20","20","But the time will come when the bridegroom will be taken from them; then they will fast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_21","071_2_21","MRK","2","21","21","No one sews a patch of unshrunk cloth on an old garment. If he does, the new piece will pull away from the old, and a worse tear will result. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_22","071_2_22","MRK","2","22","22","And no one pours new wine into old wineskins. If he does, the new wine will burst the skins, the wine will spill out, and the wineskins will be ruined. Instead, new wine is poured into new wineskins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_23","071_2_23","MRK","2","23","23","One Sabbath Jesus was passing through the grainfields, and His disciples began to pick the heads of grain as they walked along. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_24","071_2_24","MRK","2","24","24","So the Pharisees said to Him, “Look, why are they doing what is unlawful on the Sabbath?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_25","071_2_25","MRK","2","25","25","Jesus replied, “Have you never read what David did when he and his companions were hungry and in need? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_26","071_2_26","MRK","2","26","26","During the high priesthood of Abiathar, he entered the house of God and ate the consecrated bread, which was lawful only for the priests. And he gave some to his companions as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_27","071_2_27","MRK","2","27","27","Then Jesus declared, “The Sabbath was made for man, not man for the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK2_28","071_2_28","MRK","2","28","28","Therefore, the Son of Man is Lord even of the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_1","071_3_1","MRK","3","1","1","Once again Jesus entered the synagogue, and a man with a withered hand was there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_2","071_3_2","MRK","3","2","2","In order to accuse Jesus, they were watching to see if He would heal on the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_3","071_3_3","MRK","3","3","3","Then Jesus said to the man with the withered hand, “Stand up among us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_4","071_3_4","MRK","3","4","4","And He asked them, “Which is lawful on the Sabbath: to do good or to do evil, to save life or to destroy it?” But they were silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_5","071_3_5","MRK","3","5","5","Jesus looked around at them with anger and sorrow at their hardness of heart. Then He said to the man, “Stretch out your hand.” So he stretched it out, and it was restored, as sound as the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_6","071_3_6","MRK","3","6","6","At this, the Pharisees went out and began plotting with the Herodians how they might kill Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_7","071_3_7","MRK","3","7","7","So Jesus withdrew with His disciples to the sea, accompanied by a large crowd from Galilee, Judea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_8","071_3_8","MRK","3","8","8","Jerusalem, Idumea, the region beyond the Jordan, and the vicinity of Tyre and Sidon. The large crowd came to Him when they heard what great things He was doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_9","071_3_9","MRK","3","9","9","Jesus asked His disciples to have a boat ready for Him so that the crowd would not crush Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_10","071_3_10","MRK","3","10","10","For He had healed so many that all who had diseases were pressing forward to touch Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_11","071_3_11","MRK","3","11","11","And when the unclean spirits saw Him, they fell down before Him and cried out, “You are the Son of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_12","071_3_12","MRK","3","12","12","But He warned them sternly not to make Him known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_13","071_3_13","MRK","3","13","13","Then Jesus went up on the mountain and called for those He wanted, and they came to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_14","071_3_14","MRK","3","14","14","He appointed twelve of them to accompany Him, to be sent out to preach, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_15","071_3_15","MRK","3","15","15","and to have authority to heal sicknesses and to drive out demons: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_16","071_3_16","MRK","3","16","16","Simon (whom He named Peter), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_17","071_3_17","MRK","3","17","17","James son of Zebedee and his brother John (whom He named Boanerges, meaning “Sons of Thunder”), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_18","071_3_18","MRK","3","18","18","Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, James son of Alphaeus, Thaddaeus, Simon the Zealot, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_19","071_3_19","MRK","3","19","19","and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_20","071_3_20","MRK","3","20","20","Then they went into a house, and once again a crowd gathered, so that they could not even eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_21","071_3_21","MRK","3","21","21","When His family heard about this, they went out to take custody of Him, saying, “He is out of His mind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_22","071_3_22","MRK","3","22","22","And the scribes who had come down from Jerusalem were saying, “He is possessed by Beelzebul,” and, “By the prince of the demons He drives out demons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_23","071_3_23","MRK","3","23","23","So Jesus called them together and began to speak to them in parables: “How can Satan drive out Satan? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_24","071_3_24","MRK","3","24","24","If a kingdom is divided against itself, it cannot stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_25","071_3_25","MRK","3","25","25","If a house is divided against itself, it cannot stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_26","071_3_26","MRK","3","26","26","And if Satan is divided and rises against himself, he cannot stand; his end has come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_27","071_3_27","MRK","3","27","27","No one can enter a strong man’s house to steal his possessions unless he first ties up the strong man. Then he can plunder his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_28","071_3_28","MRK","3","28","28","Truly I tell you, the sons of men will be forgiven all sins and blasphemies, as many as they utter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_29","071_3_29","MRK","3","29","29","But whoever blasphemes against the Holy Spirit will never be forgiven; he is subject to eternal judgment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_30","071_3_30","MRK","3","30","30","Jesus made this statement because they were saying, “He has an unclean spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_31","071_3_31","MRK","3","31","31","Then Jesus’ brothers and mother came and stood outside. They sent someone in to summon Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_32","071_3_32","MRK","3","32","32","and a crowd was sitting around Him. “Look,” He was told, “Your mother and brothers and sisters are outside, asking for You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_33","071_3_33","MRK","3","33","33","But Jesus replied, “Who is My mother, or who are My brothers?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_34","071_3_34","MRK","3","34","34","Looking at those seated in a circle around Him, He said, “Here are My mother and My brothers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK3_35","071_3_35","MRK","3","35","35","For whoever does the will of God is My brother and sister and mother.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_1","071_4_1","MRK","4","1","1","Once again Jesus began to teach beside the sea, and such a large crowd gathered around Him that He got into the boat and sat in it, while all the people crowded along the shore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_2","071_4_2","MRK","4","2","2","And He taught them many things in parables, and in His teaching He said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_3","071_4_3","MRK","4","3","3","“Listen! A farmer went out to sow his seed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_4","071_4_4","MRK","4","4","4","And as he was sowing, some seed fell along the path, and the birds came and devoured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_5","071_4_5","MRK","4","5","5","Some fell on rocky ground, where it did not have much soil. It sprang up quickly because the soil was shallow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_6","071_4_6","MRK","4","6","6","But when the sun rose, the seedlings were scorched, and they withered because they had no root. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_7","071_4_7","MRK","4","7","7","Other seed fell among thorns, which grew up and choked the seedlings, and they yielded no crop. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_8","071_4_8","MRK","4","8","8","Still other seed fell on good soil, where it sprouted, grew up, and produced a crop—one bearing thirtyfold, another sixtyfold, and another a hundredfold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_9","071_4_9","MRK","4","9","9","Then Jesus said, “He who has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_10","071_4_10","MRK","4","10","10","As soon as Jesus was alone with the Twelve and those around Him, they asked Him about the parable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_11","071_4_11","MRK","4","11","11","He replied, “To know the mystery of the kingdom of God has been given to you, but to those on the outside everything is expressed in parables, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_12","071_4_12","MRK","4","12","12","so that, ‘they may be ever seeing but never perceiving, and ever hearing but never understanding; otherwise they might turn and be forgiven their sins.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_13","071_4_13","MRK","4","13","13","Then Jesus said to them, “Do you not understand this parable? Then how will you understand any of the parables? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_14","071_4_14","MRK","4","14","14","The farmer sows the word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_15","071_4_15","MRK","4","15","15","Some are like the seeds along the path, where the word is sown. As soon as they hear it, Satan comes and takes away the word that was sown in their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_16","071_4_16","MRK","4","16","16","Some are like the seeds sown on rocky ground. They hear the word and at once receive it with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_17","071_4_17","MRK","4","17","17","But they themselves have no root, and they remain for only a season. When trouble or persecution comes because of the word, they quickly fall away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_18","071_4_18","MRK","4","18","18","Others are like the seeds sown among the thorns. They hear the word, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_19","071_4_19","MRK","4","19","19","but the worries of this life, the deceitfulness of wealth, and the desire for other things come in and choke the word, and it becomes unfruitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_20","071_4_20","MRK","4","20","20","Still others are like the seeds sown on good soil. They hear the word, receive it, and produce a crop—thirtyfold, sixtyfold, or a hundredfold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_21","071_4_21","MRK","4","21","21","Jesus also said to them, “Does anyone bring in a lamp to put it under a basket or under a bed? Doesn’t he set it on a stand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_22","071_4_22","MRK","4","22","22","For there is nothing hidden that will not be disclosed, and nothing concealed that will not be brought to light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_23","071_4_23","MRK","4","23","23","If anyone has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_24","071_4_24","MRK","4","24","24","He went on to say, “Pay attention to what you hear. With the measure you use, it will be measured to you, and even more will be added to you who hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_25","071_4_25","MRK","4","25","25","For whoever has will be given more. But whoever does not have, even what he has will be taken away from him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_26","071_4_26","MRK","4","26","26","Jesus also said, “The kingdom of God is like a man who scatters seed on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_27","071_4_27","MRK","4","27","27","Night and day he sleeps and wakes, and the seed sprouts and grows, though he knows not how. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_28","071_4_28","MRK","4","28","28","For all by itself the earth produces a crop—first the stalk, then the head, then grain that ripens within. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_29","071_4_29","MRK","4","29","29","And as soon as the grain is ripe, he swings the sickle, because the harvest has come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_30","071_4_30","MRK","4","30","30","Then He asked, “To what can we compare the kingdom of God? With what parable shall we illustrate it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_31","071_4_31","MRK","4","31","31","It is like a mustard seed, which is the smallest of all seeds sown upon the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_32","071_4_32","MRK","4","32","32","But after it is planted, it grows to be the largest of all garden plants and puts forth great branches, so that the birds of the air nest in its shade.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_33","071_4_33","MRK","4","33","33","With many such parables Jesus spoke the word to them, to the extent that they could understand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_34","071_4_34","MRK","4","34","34","He did not tell them anything without using a parable. But privately He explained everything to His own disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_35","071_4_35","MRK","4","35","35","When that evening came, He said to His disciples, “Let us cross to the other side.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_36","071_4_36","MRK","4","36","36","After they had dismissed the crowd, they took Jesus with them, since He was already in the boat. And there were other little boats with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_37","071_4_37","MRK","4","37","37","Soon a violent windstorm came up, and the waves were breaking over the boat, so that it was being swamped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_38","071_4_38","MRK","4","38","38","But Jesus was in the stern, sleeping on the cushion. So they woke Him and said, “Teacher, don’t You care that we are perishing?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_39","071_4_39","MRK","4","39","39","Then Jesus got up and rebuked the wind and the sea. “Silence!” He commanded. “Be still!” And the wind died down, and it was perfectly calm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_40","071_4_40","MRK","4","40","40","“Why are you so afraid?” He asked. “How do you still have no faith?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK4_41","071_4_41","MRK","4","41","41","Overwhelmed with fear, they asked one another, “Who then is this, that even the wind and the sea obey Him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_1","071_5_1","MRK","5","1","1","On the other side of the sea, they arrived in the region of the Gadarenes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_2","071_5_2","MRK","5","2","2","As soon as Jesus got out of the boat, He was met by a man with an unclean spirit, who was coming from the tombs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_3","071_5_3","MRK","5","3","3","This man had been living in the tombs and could not be restrained, even with chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_4","071_5_4","MRK","5","4","4","Though he was often bound with chains and shackles, he had broken the chains and shattered the shackles. Now there was no one with the strength to subdue him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_5","071_5_5","MRK","5","5","5","Night and day in the mountains and in the tombs he kept crying out and cutting himself with stones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_6","071_5_6","MRK","5","6","6","When the man saw Jesus from a distance, he ran and fell on his knees before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_7","071_5_7","MRK","5","7","7","And he shouted in a loud voice, “What do You want with me, Jesus, Son of the Most High God? I beg You before God not to torture me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_8","071_5_8","MRK","5","8","8","For Jesus had already declared, “Come out of this man, you unclean spirit!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_9","071_5_9","MRK","5","9","9","“What is your name?” Jesus asked. “My name is Legion,” he replied, “for we are many.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_10","071_5_10","MRK","5","10","10","And he begged Jesus repeatedly not to send them out of that region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_11","071_5_11","MRK","5","11","11","There on the nearby hillside a large herd of pigs was feeding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_12","071_5_12","MRK","5","12","12","So all the demons begged Jesus, “Send us to the pigs, so that we may enter them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_13","071_5_13","MRK","5","13","13","So Jesus immediately gave them permission, and the unclean spirits came out and went into the pigs, and the herd of about two thousand rushed down the steep bank into the sea and drowned in the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_14","071_5_14","MRK","5","14","14","Those tending the pigs ran off and reported this in the town and countryside, and the people went out to see what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_15","071_5_15","MRK","5","15","15","When they came to Jesus, they saw the man who had been possessed by the legion of demons sitting there, clothed and in his right mind; and they were afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_16","071_5_16","MRK","5","16","16","Those who had seen it described what had happened to the demon-possessed man and also to the pigs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_17","071_5_17","MRK","5","17","17","And the people began to beg Jesus to leave their region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_18","071_5_18","MRK","5","18","18","As He was getting into the boat, the man who had been possessed by the demons begged to go with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_19","071_5_19","MRK","5","19","19","But Jesus would not allow him. “Go home to your own people,” He said, “and tell them how much the Lord has done for you, and what mercy He has shown you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_20","071_5_20","MRK","5","20","20","So the man went away and began to proclaim throughout the Decapolis how much Jesus had done for him. And everyone was amazed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_21","071_5_21","MRK","5","21","21","When Jesus had again crossed by boat to the other side, a large crowd gathered around Him beside the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_22","071_5_22","MRK","5","22","22","And behold, a synagogue leader named Jairus arrived, and seeing Jesus, he fell at His feet ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_23","071_5_23","MRK","5","23","23","and pleaded with Him urgently, “My little daughter is near death. Please come and place Your hands on her so that she will be healed, and she will live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_24","071_5_24","MRK","5","24","24","So Jesus went with him, and a large crowd followed and pressed around Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_25","071_5_25","MRK","5","25","25","And a woman was there who had suffered from bleeding for twelve years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_26","071_5_26","MRK","5","26","26","She had borne much agony under the care of many physicians and had spent all she had, but to no avail. Instead, her condition had only grown worse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_27","071_5_27","MRK","5","27","27","When the woman heard about Jesus, she came up through the crowd behind Him and touched His cloak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_28","071_5_28","MRK","5","28","28","For she kept saying, “If only I touch His garments, I will be healed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_29","071_5_29","MRK","5","29","29","Immediately her bleeding stopped, and she sensed in her body that she was healed of her affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_30","071_5_30","MRK","5","30","30","At once Jesus was aware that power had gone out from Him. Turning to the crowd, He asked, “Who touched My garments?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_31","071_5_31","MRK","5","31","31","His disciples answered, “You can see the crowd pressing in on You, and yet You ask, ‘Who touched Me?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_32","071_5_32","MRK","5","32","32","But He kept looking around to see who had done this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_33","071_5_33","MRK","5","33","33","Then the woman, knowing what had happened to her, came and fell down before Him trembling in fear, and she told Him the whole truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_34","071_5_34","MRK","5","34","34","“Daughter,” said Jesus, “your faith has healed you. Go in peace and be free of your affliction.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_35","071_5_35","MRK","5","35","35","While He was still speaking, messengers from the house of Jairus arrived and said, “Your daughter is dead; why bother the Teacher anymore?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_36","071_5_36","MRK","5","36","36","But Jesus overheard their conversation and immediately said to Jairus, “Do not be afraid; just believe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_37","071_5_37","MRK","5","37","37","And He did not allow anyone to accompany Him except Peter, James, and John the brother of James. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_38","071_5_38","MRK","5","38","38","When He arrived at the house of the synagogue leader, Jesus saw the commotion and the people weeping and wailing loudly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_39","071_5_39","MRK","5","39","39","He went inside and asked, “Why all this commotion and weeping? The child is not dead, but asleep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_40","071_5_40","MRK","5","40","40","And they laughed at Him. After He had put them all outside, He took the child’s father and mother and His own companions, and went in where the child was lying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_41","071_5_41","MRK","5","41","41","Taking her by the hand, Jesus said, “Talitha koumi!” which means, “Little girl, I say to you, get up!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_42","071_5_42","MRK","5","42","42","Immediately the girl got up and began to walk around (she was twelve years old). And they were utterly astounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK5_43","071_5_43","MRK","5","43","43","Then Jesus gave strict orders that no one should know about this, and He told them to give her something to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_1","071_6_1","MRK","6","1","1","Jesus went on from there and came to His hometown, accompanied by His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_2","071_6_2","MRK","6","2","2","When the Sabbath came, He began to teach in the synagogue, and many who heard Him were astonished. “Where did this man get these ideas?” they asked. “What is this wisdom He has been given? And how can He perform such miracles? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_3","071_6_3","MRK","6","3","3","Isn’t this the carpenter, the son of Mary and the brother of James, Joses, Judas, and Simon? Aren’t His sisters here with us as well?” And they took offense at Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_4","071_6_4","MRK","6","4","4","Then Jesus said to them, “Only in his hometown, among his relatives, and in his own household is a prophet without honor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_5","071_6_5","MRK","6","5","5","So He could not perform any miracles there, except to lay His hands on a few of the sick and heal them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_6","071_6_6","MRK","6","6","6","And He was amazed at their unbelief. And He went around from village to village, teaching the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_7","071_6_7","MRK","6","7","7","Then Jesus called the Twelve to Him and began to send them out two by two, giving them authority over unclean spirits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_8","071_6_8","MRK","6","8","8","He instructed them to take nothing but a staff for the journey—no bag, no bread, no money in their belts— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_9","071_6_9","MRK","6","9","9","and to wear sandals, but not a second tunic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_10","071_6_10","MRK","6","10","10","And He told them, “When you enter a house, stay there until you leave that area. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_11","071_6_11","MRK","6","11","11","If anyone will not welcome you or listen to you, shake the dust off your feet when you leave that place, as a testimony against them. Truly I tell you, it will be more bearable for Sodom and Gomorrah on the day of judgment than for that town.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_12","071_6_12","MRK","6","12","12","So they set out and preached that the people should repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_13","071_6_13","MRK","6","13","13","They also drove out many demons and healed many of the sick, anointing them with oil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_14","071_6_14","MRK","6","14","14","Now King Herod heard about this (for Jesus’ name had become well known) and he said, “John the Baptist has risen from the dead! That is why miraculous powers are at work in him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_15","071_6_15","MRK","6","15","15","Others were saying, “He is Elijah,” and still others, “He is a prophet, like one of the prophets of old.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_16","071_6_16","MRK","6","16","16","But when Herod heard this, he said, “This is John, whom I beheaded; he has risen from the dead!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_17","071_6_17","MRK","6","17","17","For Herod himself had ordered that John be arrested and bound and imprisoned, on account of his brother Philip’s wife Herodias, whom Herod had married. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_18","071_6_18","MRK","6","18","18","For John had been telling Herod, “It is not lawful for you to have your brother’s wife!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_19","071_6_19","MRK","6","19","19","So Herodias held a grudge against John and wanted to kill him. But she had been unable, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_20","071_6_20","MRK","6","20","20","because Herod feared John and protected him, knowing that he was a righteous and holy man. When he heard John’s words, he did much of what he said; and he listened to him gladly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_21","071_6_21","MRK","6","21","21","On Herod’s birthday, her opportunity arose. Herod held a banquet for his nobles and military commanders and the leading men of Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_22","071_6_22","MRK","6","22","22","When the daughter of Herodias came and danced, she pleased Herod and his guests, and the king said to the girl, “Ask me for whatever you wish, and I will give it to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_23","071_6_23","MRK","6","23","23","And he swore to her, “Whatever you ask of me, I will give you, up to half my kingdom!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_24","071_6_24","MRK","6","24","24","Then she went out and asked her mother, “What should I request?” And her mother answered, “The head of John the Baptist.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_25","071_6_25","MRK","6","25","25","At once the girl hurried back to the king with her request: “I want you to give me the head of John the Baptist on a platter immediately.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_26","071_6_26","MRK","6","26","26","The king was consumed with sorrow, but because of his oaths and his guests, he did not want to refuse her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_27","071_6_27","MRK","6","27","27","So without delay, the king commanded that John’s head be brought in. He sent an executioner, who went and beheaded him in the prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_28","071_6_28","MRK","6","28","28","The man brought John’s head on a platter and presented it to the girl, who gave it to her mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_29","071_6_29","MRK","6","29","29","When John’s disciples heard about this, they came and took his body and placed it in a tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_30","071_6_30","MRK","6","30","30","Meanwhile, the apostles gathered around Jesus and brought Him news of all they had done and taught. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_31","071_6_31","MRK","6","31","31","And He said to them, “Come with Me privately to a solitary place, and let us rest for a while.” For many people were coming and going, and they did not even have time to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_32","071_6_32","MRK","6","32","32","So they went away in the boat by themselves to a solitary place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_33","071_6_33","MRK","6","33","33","But many people saw them leaving and recognized Him. They ran together on foot from all the towns and arrived before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_34","071_6_34","MRK","6","34","34","When Jesus stepped ashore and saw a large crowd, He had compassion on them, because they were like sheep without a shepherd. And He began to teach them many things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_35","071_6_35","MRK","6","35","35","By now the hour was already late. So the disciples came to Jesus and said, “This is a desolate place, and the hour is already late. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_36","071_6_36","MRK","6","36","36","Dismiss the crowd so they can go to the surrounding countryside and villages and buy themselves food, for they have nothing to eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_37","071_6_37","MRK","6","37","37","But Jesus told them, “You give them something to eat.” They asked Him, “Should we go out and spend two hundred denarii to give all of them bread to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_38","071_6_38","MRK","6","38","38","“Go and see how many loaves you have,” He told them. And after checking, they said, “Five—and two fish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_39","071_6_39","MRK","6","39","39","Then Jesus directed them to have the people sit in groups on the green grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_40","071_6_40","MRK","6","40","40","So they sat down in groups of hundreds and fifties. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_41","071_6_41","MRK","6","41","41","Taking the five loaves and the two fish and looking up to heaven, Jesus spoke a blessing and broke the loaves. Then He gave them to His disciples to set before the people. And He divided the two fish among them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_42","071_6_42","MRK","6","42","42","They all ate and were satisfied, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_43","071_6_43","MRK","6","43","43","and the disciples picked up twelve basketfuls of broken pieces of bread and fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_44","071_6_44","MRK","6","44","44","And there were five thousand men who had eaten the loaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_45","071_6_45","MRK","6","45","45","Immediately Jesus made His disciples get into the boat and go on ahead of Him to Bethsaida, while He dismissed the crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_46","071_6_46","MRK","6","46","46","After bidding them farewell, He went up on the mountain to pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_47","071_6_47","MRK","6","47","47","When evening came, the boat was in the middle of the sea, and Jesus was alone on land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_48","071_6_48","MRK","6","48","48","He could see that the disciples were straining to row, because the wind was against them. About the fourth watch of the night, Jesus went out to them, walking on the sea. He intended to pass by them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_49","071_6_49","MRK","6","49","49","but when they saw Him walking on the sea, they cried out, thinking He was a ghost— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_50","071_6_50","MRK","6","50","50","for they all saw Him and were terrified. But Jesus spoke up at once: “Take courage! It is I. Do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_51","071_6_51","MRK","6","51","51","Then He climbed into the boat with them, and the wind died down. And the disciples were utterly astounded beyond measure, and were marveling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_52","071_6_52","MRK","6","52","52","For they had not understood about the loaves because their hearts had been hardened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_53","071_6_53","MRK","6","53","53","When they had crossed over, they came to the land of Gennesaret and moored the boat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_54","071_6_54","MRK","6","54","54","As soon as they got out of the boat, the people recognized Jesus ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_55","071_6_55","MRK","6","55","55","and ran through that whole surrounding region, carrying the sick on mats to wherever they heard He was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK6_56","071_6_56","MRK","6","56","56","And wherever He went—villages and towns and countrysides—they laid the sick in the marketplaces and begged Him just to let them touch the fringe of His cloak. And all who touched Him were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_1","071_7_1","MRK","7","1","1","Then the Pharisees and some of the scribes who had come from Jerusalem gathered around Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_2","071_7_2","MRK","7","2","2","And seeing some of His disciples eating with hands that were defiled (that is, unwashed), they found fault. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_3","071_7_3","MRK","7","3","3","Now in holding to the tradition of the elders, the Pharisees and all the Jews do not eat until they wash their hands ceremonially. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_4","071_7_4","MRK","7","4","4","And on returning from the market, they do not eat unless they wash. And there are many other traditions for them to observe, including the washing of cups, pitchers, kettles, and couches for dining. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_5","071_7_5","MRK","7","5","5","So the Pharisees and scribes questioned Jesus: “Why do Your disciples not walk according to the tradition of the elders? Instead, they eat with unwashed hands.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_6","071_7_6","MRK","7","6","6","Jesus answered them, “Isaiah prophesied correctly about you hypocrites, as it is written: ‘These people honor Me with their lips, but their hearts are far from Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_7","071_7_7","MRK","7","7","7","They worship Me in vain; they teach as doctrine the precepts of men.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_8","071_7_8","MRK","7","8","8","You have disregarded the commandment of God to keep the tradition of men—the washing of pitchers and cups, and many other similar things you do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_9","071_7_9","MRK","7","9","9","He went on to say, “You neatly set aside the command of God to maintain your own tradition. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_10","071_7_10","MRK","7","10","10","For Moses said, ‘Honor your father and your mother’ and ‘Anyone who curses his father or mother must be put to death.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_11","071_7_11","MRK","7","11","11","But you say that if a man says to his father or mother, ‘Whatever you would have received from me is Corban’ (that is, a gift devoted to God), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_12","071_7_12","MRK","7","12","12","he is no longer permitted to do anything for his father or mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_13","071_7_13","MRK","7","13","13","Thus you nullify the word of God by the tradition you have handed down. And you do so in many such matters.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_14","071_7_14","MRK","7","14","14","Once again Jesus called the whole crowd to Him and said, “All of you, listen to Me and understand: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_15","071_7_15","MRK","7","15","15","Nothing that enters a man from the outside can defile him; but the things that come out of a man, these are what defile him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_16","071_7_16","MRK","7","16","16","If anyone has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_17","071_7_17","MRK","7","17","17","After Jesus had left the crowd and gone into the house, His disciples inquired about the parable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_18","071_7_18","MRK","7","18","18","“Are you still so dull?” He asked. “Do you not understand? Nothing that enters a man from the outside can defile him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_19","071_7_19","MRK","7","19","19","because it does not enter his heart, but it goes into the stomach and then is eliminated, thus purifying all foods.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_20","071_7_20","MRK","7","20","20","He continued: “What comes out of a man, that is what defiles him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_21","071_7_21","MRK","7","21","21","For from within the hearts of men come evil thoughts, adultery, sexual immorality, murder, theft, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_22","071_7_22","MRK","7","22","22","greed, wickedness, deceit, debauchery, envy, slander, arrogance, and foolishness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_23","071_7_23","MRK","7","23","23","All these evils come from within, and these are what defile a man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_24","071_7_24","MRK","7","24","24","Jesus left that place and went to the region of Tyre and Sidon. Not wanting anyone to know He was there, He entered a house, but was unable to escape their notice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_25","071_7_25","MRK","7","25","25","For a woman whose little daughter had an unclean spirit heard about Jesus, and she came and fell at His feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_26","071_7_26","MRK","7","26","26","Now she was a Greek woman of Syrophoenician origin, and she kept asking Jesus to drive the demon out of her daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_27","071_7_27","MRK","7","27","27","“First let the children have their fill,” Jesus said. “For it is not right to take the children’s bread and toss it to the dogs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_28","071_7_28","MRK","7","28","28","“Yes, Lord,” she replied, “for even the dogs under the table eat the children’s crumbs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_29","071_7_29","MRK","7","29","29","Then Jesus told her, “Because of this answer, you may go. The demon has left your daughter.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_30","071_7_30","MRK","7","30","30","And she went home and found the demon was gone, and her daughter was lying on the bed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_31","071_7_31","MRK","7","31","31","Then Jesus left the region of Tyre and Sidon and went toward the Sea of Galilee and into the region of the Decapolis. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_32","071_7_32","MRK","7","32","32","Some people brought to Him a man who was deaf and hardly able to speak, and they begged Jesus to place His hand on him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_33","071_7_33","MRK","7","33","33","So Jesus took him aside privately, away from the crowd, and put His fingers into the man’s ears. Then He spit and touched the man’s tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_34","071_7_34","MRK","7","34","34","And looking up to heaven, He sighed deeply and said to him, “Ephphatha!” (which means, “Be opened!”). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_35","071_7_35","MRK","7","35","35","Immediately the man’s ears were opened and his tongue was released, and he began to speak plainly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_36","071_7_36","MRK","7","36","36","Jesus ordered them not to tell anyone. But the more He ordered them, the more widely they proclaimed it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK7_37","071_7_37","MRK","7","37","37","The people were utterly astonished and said, “He has done all things well! He makes even the deaf hear and the mute speak!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_1","071_8_1","MRK","8","1","1","In those days the crowd became very large, and they had nothing to eat. Jesus called His disciples to Him and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_2","071_8_2","MRK","8","2","2","“I have compassion for this crowd, because they have already been with Me three days and have nothing to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_3","071_8_3","MRK","8","3","3","If I send them home hungry, they will faint along the way. For some of them have come a great distance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_4","071_8_4","MRK","8","4","4","His disciples replied, “Where in this desolate place could anyone find enough bread to feed all these people?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_5","071_8_5","MRK","8","5","5","“How many loaves do you have?” Jesus asked. “Seven,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_6","071_8_6","MRK","8","6","6","And He instructed the crowd to sit down on the ground. Then He took the seven loaves, gave thanks and broke them, and gave them to His disciples to set before the people. And they distributed them to the crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_7","071_8_7","MRK","8","7","7","They also had a few small fish, and Jesus blessed them and ordered that these be set before them as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_8","071_8_8","MRK","8","8","8","The people ate and were satisfied, and the disciples picked up seven basketfuls of broken pieces that were left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_9","071_8_9","MRK","8","9","9","And about four thousand men who had eaten were present. And when Jesus had dismissed the crowd, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_10","071_8_10","MRK","8","10","10","He immediately got into the boat with His disciples and went to the district of Dalmanutha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_11","071_8_11","MRK","8","11","11","Then the Pharisees came and began to argue with Jesus, testing Him by demanding from Him a sign from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_12","071_8_12","MRK","8","12","12","Jesus sighed deeply in His spirit and said, “Why does this generation seek after a sign? Truly I tell you, no sign will be given to this generation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_13","071_8_13","MRK","8","13","13","And He left them, got back into the boat, and crossed to the other side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_14","071_8_14","MRK","8","14","14","Now the disciples had forgotten to take bread, except for one loaf they had with them in the boat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_15","071_8_15","MRK","8","15","15","“Watch out!” He cautioned them. “Beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and of Herod.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_16","071_8_16","MRK","8","16","16","So they began to discuss this with one another, saying, “It is because we have no bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_17","071_8_17","MRK","8","17","17","Aware of their conversation, Jesus asked them, “Why are you debating about having no bread? Do you still not see or understand? Do you still have such hard hearts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_18","071_8_18","MRK","8","18","18","‘Having eyes, do you not see? And having ears, do you not hear?’ And do you not remember? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_19","071_8_19","MRK","8","19","19","When I broke the five loaves for the five thousand, how many basketfuls of broken pieces did you collect?” “Twelve,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_20","071_8_20","MRK","8","20","20","“And when I broke the seven loaves for the four thousand, how many basketfuls of broken pieces did you collect?” “Seven,” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_21","071_8_21","MRK","8","21","21","Then He asked them, “How do you still not understand?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_22","071_8_22","MRK","8","22","22","When He arrived at Bethsaida, some people brought a blind man and begged Jesus to touch him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_23","071_8_23","MRK","8","23","23","So He took the blind man by the hand and led him out of the village. Then He spit on the man’s eyes and placed His hands on him, asking if he could see anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_24","071_8_24","MRK","8","24","24","The man looked up and said, “I can see the people, but they look like trees walking around.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_25","071_8_25","MRK","8","25","25","Once again Jesus placed His hands on the man’s eyes and made him look up, and his sight was restored, and he could see everything clearly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_26","071_8_26","MRK","8","26","26","Jesus sent him home and said, “Do not go back or tell anyone in the village.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_27","071_8_27","MRK","8","27","27","Then Jesus and His disciples went on to the villages around Caesarea Philippi. On the way, He questioned His disciples: “Who do people say I am?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_28","071_8_28","MRK","8","28","28","They replied, “Some say John the Baptist; others say Elijah; and still others, one of the prophets.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_29","071_8_29","MRK","8","29","29","“But what about you?” Jesus asked. “Who do you say I am?” Peter answered, “You are the Christ.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_30","071_8_30","MRK","8","30","30","And Jesus warned them not to tell anyone about Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_31","071_8_31","MRK","8","31","31","Then He began to teach them that the Son of Man must suffer many things and be rejected by the elders, chief priests, and scribes, and that He must be killed and after three days rise again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_32","071_8_32","MRK","8","32","32","He spoke this message quite frankly, and Peter took Him aside and began to rebuke Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_33","071_8_33","MRK","8","33","33","But Jesus, turning and looking at His disciples, rebuked Peter and said, “Get behind Me, Satan! For you do not have in mind the things of God, but the things of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_34","071_8_34","MRK","8","34","34","Then Jesus called the crowd to Him along with His disciples, and He told them, “If anyone wants to follow after Me, he must deny himself and take up his cross and follow Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_35","071_8_35","MRK","8","35","35","For whoever wants to save his life will lose it, but whoever loses his life for My sake and for the gospel will save it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_36","071_8_36","MRK","8","36","36","What shall it profit a man if he gains the whole world yet forfeits his soul? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_37","071_8_37","MRK","8","37","37","Or what can a man give in exchange for his soul? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK8_38","071_8_38","MRK","8","38","38","If anyone is ashamed of Me and My words in this adulterous and sinful generation, the Son of Man will also be ashamed of him when He comes in His Father’s glory with the holy angels.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_1","071_9_1","MRK","9","1","1","Then Jesus said to them, “Truly I tell you, there are some standing here who will not taste death before they see the kingdom of God arrive with power.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_2","071_9_2","MRK","9","2","2","After six days Jesus took with Him Peter, James, and John, and led them up a high mountain by themselves. There He was transfigured before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_3","071_9_3","MRK","9","3","3","His clothes became radiantly white as snow, brighter than any launderer on earth could bleach them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_4","071_9_4","MRK","9","4","4","And Elijah and Moses appeared before them, talking with Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_5","071_9_5","MRK","9","5","5","Peter said to Jesus, “Rabbi, it is good for us to be here. Let us put up three shelters—one for You, one for Moses, and one for Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_6","071_9_6","MRK","9","6","6","For they were all so terrified that Peter did not know what else to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_7","071_9_7","MRK","9","7","7","Then a cloud appeared and enveloped them, and a voice came from the cloud: “This is My beloved Son. Listen to Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_8","071_9_8","MRK","9","8","8","Suddenly, when they looked around, they saw no one with them except Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_9","071_9_9","MRK","9","9","9","As they were coming down the mountain, Jesus admonished them not to tell anyone what they had seen until the Son of Man had risen from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_10","071_9_10","MRK","9","10","10","So they kept this matter to themselves, discussing what it meant to rise from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_11","071_9_11","MRK","9","11","11","And they asked Jesus, “Why do the scribes say that Elijah must come first?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_12","071_9_12","MRK","9","12","12","He replied, “Elijah does indeed come first, and he restores all things. Why then is it written that the Son of Man must suffer many things and be rejected? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_13","071_9_13","MRK","9","13","13","But I tell you that Elijah has indeed come, and they have done to him whatever they wished, just as it is written about him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_14","071_9_14","MRK","9","14","14","When Jesus returned to the other disciples, He saw a large crowd around them, and scribes arguing with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_15","071_9_15","MRK","9","15","15","As soon as all the people saw Jesus, they were filled with awe and ran to greet Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_16","071_9_16","MRK","9","16","16","“What are you disputing with them?” He asked the scribes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_17","071_9_17","MRK","9","17","17","Someone in the crowd replied, “Teacher, I brought You my son, who has a spirit that makes him mute. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_18","071_9_18","MRK","9","18","18","Whenever it seizes him, it throws him to the ground. He foams at the mouth, gnashes his teeth, and becomes rigid. I asked Your disciples to drive it out, but they were unable.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_19","071_9_19","MRK","9","19","19","“O unbelieving generation!” Jesus replied. “How long must I remain with you? How long must I put up with you? Bring the boy to Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_20","071_9_20","MRK","9","20","20","So they brought him, and seeing Jesus, the spirit immediately threw the boy into a convulsion. He fell to the ground and rolled around, foaming at the mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_21","071_9_21","MRK","9","21","21","Jesus asked the boy’s father, “How long has this been with him?” “From childhood,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_22","071_9_22","MRK","9","22","22","“It often throws him into the fire or into the water, trying to kill him. But if You can do anything, have compassion on us and help us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_23","071_9_23","MRK","9","23","23","“If you can believe!” said Jesus. “All things are possible to him who believes!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_24","071_9_24","MRK","9","24","24","Immediately the boy’s father cried out with tears, “Lord, I do believe; help my unbelief!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_25","071_9_25","MRK","9","25","25","When Jesus saw that a crowd had come running, He rebuked the unclean spirit. “You mute and deaf spirit,” He said, “I command you to come out and never enter him again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_26","071_9_26","MRK","9","26","26","After shrieking and convulsing him violently, the spirit came out. The boy became like a corpse, so that many said, “He is dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_27","071_9_27","MRK","9","27","27","But Jesus took him by the hand and helped him to his feet, and he stood up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_28","071_9_28","MRK","9","28","28","After Jesus had gone into the house, His disciples asked Him privately, “Why couldn’t we drive it out?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_29","071_9_29","MRK","9","29","29","Jesus answered, “This kind cannot come out, except by prayer and fasting.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_30","071_9_30","MRK","9","30","30","Going on from there, they passed through Galilee. But Jesus did not want anyone to know, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_31","071_9_31","MRK","9","31","31","because He was teaching His disciples. He told them, “The Son of Man will be delivered into the hands of men. They will kill Him, and on the third day He will rise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_32","071_9_32","MRK","9","32","32","But they did not understand this statement, and they were afraid to ask Him about it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_33","071_9_33","MRK","9","33","33","Then Jesus came to Capernaum. While He was in the house, He asked them, “What were you discussing among yourselves on the way?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_34","071_9_34","MRK","9","34","34","But they were silent, for on the way they had been arguing about which of them was the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_35","071_9_35","MRK","9","35","35","Sitting down, Jesus called the Twelve and said, “If anyone wants to be first, he must be the last of all and the servant of all.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_36","071_9_36","MRK","9","36","36","Then He had a little child stand among them. Taking the child in His arms, He said to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_37","071_9_37","MRK","9","37","37","“Whoever welcomes one of these little children in My name welcomes Me, and whoever welcomes Me welcomes not only Me, but the One who sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_38","071_9_38","MRK","9","38","38","John said to Him, “Teacher, we saw someone who does not follow You driving out demons in Your name, and we forbade him, because he does not accompany us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_39","071_9_39","MRK","9","39","39","“Do not stop him,” Jesus replied. “For no one who performs a miracle in My name can turn around and speak evil of Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_40","071_9_40","MRK","9","40","40","For whoever is not against you is for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_41","071_9_41","MRK","9","41","41","Indeed, if anyone gives you even a cup of water in My name because you are Christ’s, truly I tell you, he will never lose his reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_42","071_9_42","MRK","9","42","42","But if anyone causes one of these little ones who believe in Me to stumble, it would be better for him to have a millstone hung around his neck and to be thrown into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_43","071_9_43","MRK","9","43","43","If your hand causes you to sin, cut it off. It is better for you to enter life crippled than to have two hands and go into hell, into the unquenchable fire, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_44","071_9_44","MRK","9","44","44","where ‘their worm never dies, and the fire is never quenched.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_45","071_9_45","MRK","9","45","45","If your foot causes you to sin, cut it off. It is better for you to enter life lame than to have two feet and be thrown into hell, into the unquenchable fire, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_46","071_9_46","MRK","9","46","46","where ‘their worm never dies, and the fire is never quenched.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_47","071_9_47","MRK","9","47","47","And if your eye causes you to sin, pluck it out. It is better for you to enter the kingdom of God with one eye than to have two eyes and be thrown into the fire of hell, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_48","071_9_48","MRK","9","48","48","where ‘their worm never dies, and the fire is never quenched.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_49","071_9_49","MRK","9","49","49","For everyone will be salted with fire, and every sacrifice will be salted with salt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK9_50","071_9_50","MRK","9","50","50","Salt is good, but if the salt loses its saltiness, with what will you season it? Have salt among yourselves, and be at peace with one another.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_1","071_10_1","MRK","10","1","1","Then Jesus left that place and went into the region of Judea, beyond the Jordan. Again the crowds came to Him and He taught them, as was His custom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_2","071_10_2","MRK","10","2","2","Some Pharisees came to test Him. “Is it lawful for a man to divorce his wife?” they inquired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_3","071_10_3","MRK","10","3","3","“What did Moses command you?” He replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_4","071_10_4","MRK","10","4","4","They answered, “Moses permitted a man to write his wife a certificate of divorce and send her away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_5","071_10_5","MRK","10","5","5","But Jesus told them, “Moses wrote this commandment for you because of your hardness of heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_6","071_10_6","MRK","10","6","6","However, from the beginning of creation, ‘God made them male and female.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_7","071_10_7","MRK","10","7","7","‘For this reason a man will leave his father and mother and be united to his wife, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_8","071_10_8","MRK","10","8","8","and the two will become one flesh.’ So they are no longer two, but one flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_9","071_10_9","MRK","10","9","9","Therefore what God has joined together, let man not separate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_10","071_10_10","MRK","10","10","10","When they were back inside the house, His disciples asked Jesus about this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_11","071_10_11","MRK","10","11","11","So He told them, “Whoever divorces his wife and marries another woman commits adultery against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_12","071_10_12","MRK","10","12","12","And if a woman divorces her husband and marries another man, she commits adultery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_13","071_10_13","MRK","10","13","13","Now people were bringing the little children to Jesus for Him to place His hands on them, and the disciples rebuked those who brought them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_14","071_10_14","MRK","10","14","14","But when Jesus saw this, He was indignant and told them, “Let the little children come to Me, and do not hinder them! For the kingdom of God belongs to such as these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_15","071_10_15","MRK","10","15","15","Truly I tell you, anyone who does not receive the kingdom of God like a little child will never enter it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_16","071_10_16","MRK","10","16","16","And He took the children in His arms, placed His hands on them, and blessed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_17","071_10_17","MRK","10","17","17","As Jesus started on His way, a man ran up and knelt before Him. “Good Teacher,” he asked, “what must I do to inherit eternal life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_18","071_10_18","MRK","10","18","18","“Why do you call Me good?” Jesus replied. “No one is good except God alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_19","071_10_19","MRK","10","19","19","You know the commandments: ‘Do not commit adultery, do not murder, do not steal, do not bear false witness, do not cheat others, honor your father and mother.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_20","071_10_20","MRK","10","20","20","“Teacher,” he replied, “all these I have kept from my youth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_21","071_10_21","MRK","10","21","21","Jesus looked at him, loved him, and said to him, “There is one thing you lack: Go, sell everything you own and give to the poor, and you will have treasure in heaven. Then come, take up the cross, and follow Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_22","071_10_22","MRK","10","22","22","But the man was saddened by these words and went away in sorrow, because he had great wealth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_23","071_10_23","MRK","10","23","23","Then Jesus looked around and said to His disciples, “How hard it is for the rich to enter the kingdom of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_24","071_10_24","MRK","10","24","24","And the disciples were amazed at His words. But Jesus said to them again, “Children, how hard it is for those who trust in riches to enter the kingdom of God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_25","071_10_25","MRK","10","25","25","It is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_26","071_10_26","MRK","10","26","26","They were even more astonished and said to one another, “Who then can be saved?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_27","071_10_27","MRK","10","27","27","Jesus looked at them and said, “With man this is impossible, but not with God. For all things are possible with God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_28","071_10_28","MRK","10","28","28","Peter began to say to Him, “Look, we have left everything and followed You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_29","071_10_29","MRK","10","29","29","“Truly I tell you,” Jesus replied, “no one who has left home or brothers or sisters or mother or father or wife or children or fields for My sake and for the gospel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_30","071_10_30","MRK","10","30","30","will fail to receive a hundredfold in the present age—houses and brothers and sisters and mothers and children and fields, along with persecutions—and in the age to come, eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_31","071_10_31","MRK","10","31","31","But many who are first will be last, and the last will be first.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_32","071_10_32","MRK","10","32","32","As they were going up the road to Jerusalem, Jesus was walking ahead of them. The disciples were amazed, but as they followed, they were afraid. Again Jesus took the Twelve aside and began to tell them what was going to happen to Him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_33","071_10_33","MRK","10","33","33","“Look, we are going up to Jerusalem, and the Son of Man will be delivered over to the chief priests and scribes. They will condemn Him to death and will deliver Him over to the Gentiles, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_34","071_10_34","MRK","10","34","34","who will mock Him and flog Him and spit on Him and kill Him. And on the third day He will rise again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_35","071_10_35","MRK","10","35","35","Then James and John, the sons of Zebedee, came to Jesus and declared, “Teacher, we want You to do for us whatever we ask.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_36","071_10_36","MRK","10","36","36","“What do you want Me to do for you?” He inquired. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_37","071_10_37","MRK","10","37","37","They answered, “Grant that one of us may sit at Your right hand and the other at Your left in Your glory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_38","071_10_38","MRK","10","38","38","“You do not know what you are asking,” Jesus replied. “Can you drink the cup I will drink, and be baptized with the baptism I will undergo?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_39","071_10_39","MRK","10","39","39","“We can,” the brothers answered. “You will indeed drink the cup that I drink,” Jesus said, “and you will be baptized with the baptism that I undergo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_40","071_10_40","MRK","10","40","40","But to sit at My right and left is not Mine to grant. These seats belong to those for whom they have been prepared.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_41","071_10_41","MRK","10","41","41","When the ten heard about this, they became indignant with James and John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_42","071_10_42","MRK","10","42","42","So Jesus called them together and said, “You know that those regarded as rulers of the Gentiles lord it over them, and their superiors exercise authority over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_43","071_10_43","MRK","10","43","43","But it shall not be this way among you. Instead, whoever wants to become great among you must be your servant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_44","071_10_44","MRK","10","44","44","and whoever wants to be first must be the slave of all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_45","071_10_45","MRK","10","45","45","For even the Son of Man did not come to be served, but to serve, and to give His life as a ransom for many.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_46","071_10_46","MRK","10","46","46","Next, they came to Jericho. And as Jesus and His disciples were leaving Jericho with a large crowd, a blind man named Bartimaeus, the son of Timaeus, was sitting beside the road begging. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_47","071_10_47","MRK","10","47","47","When he heard that it was Jesus of Nazareth, he began to cry out, “Jesus, Son of David, have mercy on me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_48","071_10_48","MRK","10","48","48","Many people admonished him to be silent, but he cried out all the louder, “Son of David, have mercy on me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_49","071_10_49","MRK","10","49","49","Jesus stopped and asked for him to be called over. So they called the blind man. “Take courage!” they said. “Get up! He is calling for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_50","071_10_50","MRK","10","50","50","Throwing off his cloak, Bartimaeus rose up and came to Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_51","071_10_51","MRK","10","51","51","“What do you want Me to do for you?” Jesus asked. “Rabboni,” said the blind man, “let me see again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK10_52","071_10_52","MRK","10","52","52","“Go,” said Jesus, “your faith has healed you.” And immediately he received his sight and followed Jesus along the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_1","071_11_1","MRK","11","1","1","As they approached Jerusalem and came to Bethphage and Bethany at the Mount of Olives, Jesus sent out two of His disciples ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_2","071_11_2","MRK","11","2","2","and said to them, “Go into the village ahead of you, and as soon as you enter it, you will find a colt tied there, on which no one has sat. Untie it and bring it here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_3","071_11_3","MRK","11","3","3","If anyone asks, ‘Why are you doing this?’ tell him, ‘The Lord needs it,’ and he will send it here immediately.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_4","071_11_4","MRK","11","4","4","So they went and found a colt outside in the street, tied at a doorway. They untied it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_5","071_11_5","MRK","11","5","5","and some who were standing there asked, “Why are you untying the colt?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_6","071_11_6","MRK","11","6","6","The disciples answered as Jesus had commanded them, and the people gave them permission. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_7","071_11_7","MRK","11","7","7","Then they led the colt to Jesus and threw their cloaks over it, and He sat on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_8","071_11_8","MRK","11","8","8","Many in the crowd spread their cloaks on the road, while others cut branches from the trees and spread them on the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_9","071_11_9","MRK","11","9","9","The ones who went ahead and those who followed were shouting: “Hosanna!” “Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_10","071_11_10","MRK","11","10","10","“Blessed is the kingdom of our father David that is coming in the name of the Lord!” “Hosanna in the highest!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_11","071_11_11","MRK","11","11","11","Then Jesus entered Jerusalem and went into the temple courts. He looked around at everything, but since it was already late, He went out to Bethany with the Twelve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_12","071_11_12","MRK","11","12","12","The next day, when they had left Bethany, Jesus was hungry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_13","071_11_13","MRK","11","13","13","Seeing in the distance a fig tree in leaf, He went to see if there was any fruit on it. But when He reached it, He found nothing on it except leaves, since it was not the season for figs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_14","071_11_14","MRK","11","14","14","Then Jesus said to the tree, “May no one ever eat of your fruit again.” And His disciples heard this statement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_15","071_11_15","MRK","11","15","15","When they arrived in Jerusalem, Jesus entered the temple courts and began to drive out those who were buying and selling there. He overturned the tables of the money changers and the seats of those selling doves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_16","071_11_16","MRK","11","16","16","And He would not allow anyone to carry merchandise through the temple courts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_17","071_11_17","MRK","11","17","17","Then Jesus began to teach them, and He declared, “Is it not written: ‘My house will be called a house of prayer for all the nations’? But you have made it ‘a den of robbers.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_18","071_11_18","MRK","11","18","18","When the chief priests and scribes heard this, they looked for a way to kill Him. For they were afraid of Him, because the whole crowd was astonished at His teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_19","071_11_19","MRK","11","19","19","And when evening came, Jesus went out of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_20","071_11_20","MRK","11","20","20","As they were walking back in the morning, they saw the fig tree withered from its roots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_21","071_11_21","MRK","11","21","21","Peter remembered it and said, “Look, Rabbi! The fig tree You cursed has withered.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_22","071_11_22","MRK","11","22","22","“Have faith in God,” Jesus said to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_23","071_11_23","MRK","11","23","23","“For truly I tell you that if anyone says to this mountain, ‘Be lifted up and thrown into the sea,’ and has no doubt in his heart but believes that it will happen, whatever he says will be done for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_24","071_11_24","MRK","11","24","24","Therefore I tell you, whatever you ask for in prayer, believe that you have received it, and it will be yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_25","071_11_25","MRK","11","25","25","And when you stand to pray, if you hold anything against another, forgive it, so that your Father in heaven will forgive your trespasses as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_26","071_11_26","MRK","11","26","26","But if you do not forgive, neither will your Father in heaven forgive your trespasses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_27","071_11_27","MRK","11","27","27","After their return to Jerusalem, Jesus was walking in the temple courts, and the chief priests, scribes, and elders came up to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_28","071_11_28","MRK","11","28","28","“By what authority are You doing these things?” they asked. “And who gave You the authority to do them?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_29","071_11_29","MRK","11","29","29","“I will also ask you one question,” Jesus replied, “and if you answer Me, I will tell you by what authority I am doing these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_30","071_11_30","MRK","11","30","30","John’s baptism—was it from heaven or from men? Answer Me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_31","071_11_31","MRK","11","31","31","They deliberated among themselves: “If we say, ‘From heaven,’ He will ask, ‘Why then did you not believe him?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_32","071_11_32","MRK","11","32","32","But if we say, ‘From men’...” they were afraid of the people, for they all held that John truly was a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK11_33","071_11_33","MRK","11","33","33","So they answered, “We do not know.” And Jesus replied, “Neither will I tell you by what authority I am doing these things.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_1","071_12_1","MRK","12","1","1","Then Jesus began to speak to them in parables: “A man planted a vineyard. He put a wall around it, dug a wine vat, and built a watchtower. Then he rented it out to some tenants and went away on a journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_2","071_12_2","MRK","12","2","2","At harvest time, he sent a servant to the tenants to collect his share of the fruit of the vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_3","071_12_3","MRK","12","3","3","But they seized the servant, beat him, and sent him away empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_4","071_12_4","MRK","12","4","4","Then he sent them another servant, and casting stones they struck him over the head and sent him away, treating him shamefully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_5","071_12_5","MRK","12","5","5","He sent still another, and this one they killed. He sent many others; some they beat and others they killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_6","071_12_6","MRK","12","6","6","Finally, having his one beloved son, he sent him to them last. ‘They will respect my son,’ he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_7","071_12_7","MRK","12","7","7","But the tenants said to one another, ‘This is the heir. Come, let us kill him, and the inheritance will be ours.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_8","071_12_8","MRK","12","8","8","So they seized the son, killed him, and threw him out of the vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_9","071_12_9","MRK","12","9","9","What then will the owner of the vineyard do? He will come and kill those tenants, and will give the vineyard to others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_10","071_12_10","MRK","12","10","10","Have you never read this Scripture: ‘The stone the builders rejected has become the cornerstone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_11","071_12_11","MRK","12","11","11","This is from the Lord, and it is marvelous in our eyes’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_12","071_12_12","MRK","12","12","12","At this, the leaders sought to arrest Jesus, for they knew that He had spoken this parable against them. But fearing the crowd, they left Him and went away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_13","071_12_13","MRK","12","13","13","Later, they sent some of the Pharisees and Herodians to catch Jesus in His words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_14","071_12_14","MRK","12","14","14","“Teacher,” they said, “we know that You are honest and seek favor from no one. Indeed, You are impartial and teach the way of God in accordance with the truth. Is it lawful to pay taxes to Caesar or not? Should we pay them or not?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_15","071_12_15","MRK","12","15","15","But Jesus saw through their hypocrisy and said, “Why are you testing Me? Bring Me a denarius to inspect.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_16","071_12_16","MRK","12","16","16","So they brought it, and He asked them, “Whose image is this? And whose inscription?” “Caesar’s,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_17","071_12_17","MRK","12","17","17","In response Jesus told them, “Give to Caesar what is Caesar’s, and to God what is God’s.” And they marveled at Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_18","071_12_18","MRK","12","18","18","Then the Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to Jesus and questioned Him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_19","071_12_19","MRK","12","19","19","“Teacher, Moses wrote for us that if a man’s brother dies and leaves a wife but no children, the man is to marry his brother’s widow and raise up offspring for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_20","071_12_20","MRK","12","20","20","Now there were seven brothers. The first one married and died, leaving no children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_21","071_12_21","MRK","12","21","21","Then the second one married the widow, but he also died and left no children. And the third did likewise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_22","071_12_22","MRK","12","22","22","In this way, none of the seven who had her left any children. And last of all, the woman died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_23","071_12_23","MRK","12","23","23","In the resurrection, then, whose wife will she be? For all seven were married to her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_24","071_12_24","MRK","12","24","24","Jesus answered them, “Aren’t you mistaken, because you do not know the Scriptures or the power of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_25","071_12_25","MRK","12","25","25","When the dead rise, they will neither marry nor be given in marriage. Instead, they will be like the angels in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_26","071_12_26","MRK","12","26","26","But concerning the dead rising, have you not read about the burning bush in the Book of Moses, how God told him, ‘I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_27","071_12_27","MRK","12","27","27","He is not the God of the dead, but the God of the living. Therefore you are badly mistaken!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_28","071_12_28","MRK","12","28","28","Now one of the scribes had come up and heard their debate. Noticing how well Jesus had answered them, he asked Him, “Which commandment is the most important of all?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_29","071_12_29","MRK","12","29","29","Jesus replied, “This is the most important of all the commandments: ‘Hear, O Israel, the Lord our God, the Lord is One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_30","071_12_30","MRK","12","30","30","Love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your mind and with all your strength.’ This is the first commandment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_31","071_12_31","MRK","12","31","31","The second, like it, is this: ‘Love your neighbor as yourself.’ No other commandment is greater than these.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_32","071_12_32","MRK","12","32","32","“Right, Teacher,” the scribe replied. “You have stated correctly that God is One and there is no other but Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_33","071_12_33","MRK","12","33","33","and to love Him with all your heart and with all your understanding and with all your soul and with all your strength, and to love your neighbor as yourself. This is more important than all burnt offerings and sacrifices.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_34","071_12_34","MRK","12","34","34","When Jesus saw that the man had answered wisely, He said, “You are not far from the kingdom of God.” And no one dared to question Him any further. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_35","071_12_35","MRK","12","35","35","While Jesus was teaching in the temple courts, He asked, “How can the scribes say that the Christ is the Son of David? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_36","071_12_36","MRK","12","36","36","Speaking by the Holy Spirit, David himself declared: ‘The Lord said to my Lord, “Sit at My right hand until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_37","071_12_37","MRK","12","37","37","Therefore David himself calls Him ‘Lord.’ So how can He be David’s son?” And the large crowd listened to Him with delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_38","071_12_38","MRK","12","38","38","In His teaching Jesus also said to them, “Watch out for the scribes. They like to walk around in long robes, to receive greetings in the marketplaces, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_39","071_12_39","MRK","12","39","39","and to have the chief seats in the synagogues and the places of honor at banquets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_40","071_12_40","MRK","12","40","40","They defraud widows of their houses, and for a show make lengthy prayers. These men will receive greater condemnation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_41","071_12_41","MRK","12","41","41","As Jesus was sitting opposite the treasury, He watched the crowd putting money into it. And many rich people put in large amounts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_42","071_12_42","MRK","12","42","42","Then one poor widow came and put in two small copper coins, which amounted to a small fraction of a denarius. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_43","071_12_43","MRK","12","43","43","Jesus called His disciples to Him and said, “Truly I tell you, this poor widow has put more than all the others into the treasury. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK12_44","071_12_44","MRK","12","44","44","For they all contributed out of their surplus, but she out of her poverty has put in all she had to live on.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_1","071_13_1","MRK","13","1","1","As Jesus was leaving the temple, one of His disciples said to Him, “Teacher, look at the magnificent stones and buildings!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_2","071_13_2","MRK","13","2","2","“Do you see all these great buildings?” Jesus replied. “Not one stone will be left on another; every one will be thrown down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_3","071_13_3","MRK","13","3","3","While Jesus was sitting on the Mount of Olives opposite the temple, Peter, James, John, and Andrew asked Him privately, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_4","071_13_4","MRK","13","4","4","“Tell us, when will these things happen? And what will be the sign that they are about to be fulfilled?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_5","071_13_5","MRK","13","5","5","In response, Jesus began by telling them, “See to it that no one deceives you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_6","071_13_6","MRK","13","6","6","For many will come in My name, claiming, ‘I am He,’ and will deceive many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_7","071_13_7","MRK","13","7","7","When you hear of wars and rumors of wars, do not be alarmed. For these things must happen, but the end is still to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_8","071_13_8","MRK","13","8","8","Nation will rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom. There will be earthquakes in various places, as well as famines and riots. These are the beginning of birth pains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_9","071_13_9","MRK","13","9","9","So be on your guard. For you will be delivered over to the councils and beaten in the synagogues. On My account you will stand before governors and kings as witnesses to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_10","071_13_10","MRK","13","10","10","And the gospel must first be proclaimed to all the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_11","071_13_11","MRK","13","11","11","But when they arrest you and hand you over, do not worry beforehand or premeditate what to say. Instead, speak whatever you are given at that time, for it will not be you speaking, but the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_12","071_13_12","MRK","13","12","12","Brother will betray brother to death, and a father his child. Children will rise against their parents and have them put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_13","071_13_13","MRK","13","13","13","You will be hated by everyone because of My name, but the one who perseveres to the end will be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_14","071_13_14","MRK","13","14","14","So when you see the abomination of desolation, spoken of by Daniel the prophet, standing where it should not be (let the reader understand), then let those who are in Judea flee to the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_15","071_13_15","MRK","13","15","15","Let no one on the housetop go back inside the house to retrieve anything from his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_16","071_13_16","MRK","13","16","16","And let no one in the field return for his cloak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_17","071_13_17","MRK","13","17","17","How miserable those days will be for pregnant and nursing mothers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_18","071_13_18","MRK","13","18","18","Pray that your flight will not occur in the winter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_19","071_13_19","MRK","13","19","19","For those will be days of tribulation unmatched from the beginning of God’s creation until now, and never to be seen again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_20","071_13_20","MRK","13","20","20","If the Lord had not cut short those days, nobody would be saved. But for the sake of the elect, whom He has chosen, He has cut them short. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_21","071_13_21","MRK","13","21","21","At that time if anyone says to you, ‘Look, here is the Christ!’ or ‘There He is!’ do not believe it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_22","071_13_22","MRK","13","22","22","For false Christs and false prophets will appear and perform signs and wonders that would deceive even the elect, if that were possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_23","071_13_23","MRK","13","23","23","So be on your guard; see, I have told you everything in advance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_24","071_13_24","MRK","13","24","24","But in those days, after that tribulation: ‘The sun will be darkened, and the moon will not give its light; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_25","071_13_25","MRK","13","25","25","the stars will fall from the sky, and the powers of the heavens will be shaken.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_26","071_13_26","MRK","13","26","26","At that time they will see the Son of Man coming in the clouds with great power and glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_27","071_13_27","MRK","13","27","27","And He will send out His angels to gather His elect from the four winds, from the ends of the earth to the ends of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_28","071_13_28","MRK","13","28","28","Now learn this lesson from the fig tree: As soon as its branches become tender and sprout leaves, you know that summer is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_29","071_13_29","MRK","13","29","29","So also, when you see these things happening, know that He is near, right at the door. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_30","071_13_30","MRK","13","30","30","Truly I tell you, this generation will not pass away until all these things have happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_31","071_13_31","MRK","13","31","31","Heaven and earth will pass away, but My words will never pass away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_32","071_13_32","MRK","13","32","32","No one knows about that day or hour, not even the angels in heaven, nor the Son, but only the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_33","071_13_33","MRK","13","33","33","Be on your guard, stay alert, and pray! For you do not know when the appointed time will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_34","071_13_34","MRK","13","34","34","It is like a man going on a journey who left his house, put each servant in charge of his own task, and instructed the doorkeeper to keep watch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_35","071_13_35","MRK","13","35","35","Therefore keep watch, because you do not know when the master of the house will return—whether in the evening, at midnight, when the rooster crows, or in the morning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_36","071_13_36","MRK","13","36","36","Otherwise, he may arrive without notice and find you sleeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK13_37","071_13_37","MRK","13","37","37","And what I say to you, I say to everyone: Keep watch!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_1","071_14_1","MRK","14","1","1","Now the Passover and the Feast of Unleavened Bread were two days away, and the chief priests and scribes were looking for a covert way to arrest Jesus and kill Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_2","071_14_2","MRK","14","2","2","“But not during the feast,” they said, “or there may be a riot among the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_3","071_14_3","MRK","14","3","3","While Jesus was in Bethany reclining at the table in the home of Simon the Leper, a woman came with an alabaster jar of expensive perfume, made of pure nard. She broke open the jar and poured it on Jesus’ head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_4","071_14_4","MRK","14","4","4","Some of those present, however, expressed their indignation to one another and said, “Why this waste of perfume? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_5","071_14_5","MRK","14","5","5","It could have been sold for over three hundred denarii and the money given to the poor.” And they scolded her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_6","071_14_6","MRK","14","6","6","But Jesus said, “Leave her alone; why are you bothering her? She has done a beautiful deed to Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_7","071_14_7","MRK","14","7","7","The poor you will always have with you, and you can help them whenever you want. But you will not always have Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_8","071_14_8","MRK","14","8","8","She has done what she could to anoint My body in advance of My burial. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_9","071_14_9","MRK","14","9","9","And truly I tell you, wherever this gospel is preached in all the world, what she has done will also be told in memory of her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_10","071_14_10","MRK","14","10","10","Then Judas Iscariot, one of the Twelve, went to the chief priests to betray Jesus to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_11","071_14_11","MRK","14","11","11","They were delighted to hear this, and they promised to give him money. So Judas began to look for an opportunity to betray Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_12","071_14_12","MRK","14","12","12","On the first day of the Feast of Unleavened Bread, when the Passover lamb was to be sacrificed, Jesus’ disciples asked Him, “Where do You want us to prepare for You to eat the Passover?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_13","071_14_13","MRK","14","13","13","So He sent two of His disciples and told them, “Go into the city, and a man carrying a jug of water will meet you. Follow him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_14","071_14_14","MRK","14","14","14","and whichever house he enters, say to the owner, ‘The Teacher asks: Where is the guest room, where I may eat the Passover with My disciples?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_15","071_14_15","MRK","14","15","15","And he will show you a large upper room, furnished and ready. Make preparations for us there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_16","071_14_16","MRK","14","16","16","So His disciples left and went into the city, where they found everything as Jesus had described. And they prepared the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_17","071_14_17","MRK","14","17","17","When evening came, Jesus arrived with the Twelve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_18","071_14_18","MRK","14","18","18","And while they were reclining and eating, Jesus said, “Truly I tell you, one of you who is eating with Me will betray Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_19","071_14_19","MRK","14","19","19","They began to be grieved and to ask Him one after another, “Surely not I?” And another said, “Is it I?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_20","071_14_20","MRK","14","20","20","He answered, “It is one of the Twelve—the one who is dipping his hand into the bowl with Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_21","071_14_21","MRK","14","21","21","The Son of Man will go just as it is written about Him, but woe to that man by whom He is betrayed! It would be better for him if he had not been born.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_22","071_14_22","MRK","14","22","22","While they were eating, Jesus took bread, spoke a blessing and broke it, and gave it to the disciples, saying, “Take and eat; this is My body.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_23","071_14_23","MRK","14","23","23","Then He took the cup, gave thanks, and gave it to them, and they all drank from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_24","071_14_24","MRK","14","24","24","He said to them, “This is My blood of the new covenant, which is poured out for many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_25","071_14_25","MRK","14","25","25","Truly I tell you, I will no longer drink of the fruit of the vine until that day when I drink it anew in the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_26","071_14_26","MRK","14","26","26","And when they had sung a hymn, they went out to the Mount of Olives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_27","071_14_27","MRK","14","27","27","Then Jesus said to them, “You will all fall away on account of Me this night, for it is written: ‘I will strike the Shepherd, and the sheep will be scattered.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_28","071_14_28","MRK","14","28","28","But after I have risen, I will go ahead of you into Galilee.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_29","071_14_29","MRK","14","29","29","Peter declared, “Even if all fall away, I never will.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_30","071_14_30","MRK","14","30","30","“Truly I tell you,” Jesus replied, “this very night, before the rooster crows twice, you will deny Me three times.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_31","071_14_31","MRK","14","31","31","But Peter kept insisting all the more, “Even if I have to die with You, I will never deny You.” And all the others said the same thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_32","071_14_32","MRK","14","32","32","Then they came to a place called Gethsemane, and Jesus told His disciples, “Sit here while I pray.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_33","071_14_33","MRK","14","33","33","He took with Him Peter, James, and John, and began to be deeply troubled and distressed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_34","071_14_34","MRK","14","34","34","Then He said to them, “My soul is consumed with sorrow to the point of death. Stay here and keep watch.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_35","071_14_35","MRK","14","35","35","Going a little farther, He fell to the ground and prayed that, if it were possible, the hour would pass from Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_36","071_14_36","MRK","14","36","36","“Abba, Father,” He said, “all things are possible for You. Take this cup from Me. Yet not what I will, but what You will.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_37","071_14_37","MRK","14","37","37","Then Jesus returned and found them sleeping. “Simon, are you asleep?” He asked. “Were you not able to keep watch for one hour? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_38","071_14_38","MRK","14","38","38","Watch and pray so that you will not enter into temptation. For the spirit is willing, but the body is weak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_39","071_14_39","MRK","14","39","39","Again He went away and prayed, saying the same thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_40","071_14_40","MRK","14","40","40","And again Jesus returned and found them sleeping—for their eyes were heavy. And they did not know what to answer Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_41","071_14_41","MRK","14","41","41","When Jesus returned the third time, He said, “Are you still sleeping and resting? That is enough! The hour has come. Look, the Son of Man is betrayed into the hands of sinners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_42","071_14_42","MRK","14","42","42","Rise, let us go. See, My betrayer is approaching!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_43","071_14_43","MRK","14","43","43","While Jesus was still speaking, Judas, one of the Twelve, arrived, accompanied by a large crowd armed with swords and clubs, sent from the chief priests, scribes, and elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_44","071_14_44","MRK","14","44","44","Now the betrayer had arranged a signal with them: “The One I kiss is the man; arrest Him and lead Him away securely.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_45","071_14_45","MRK","14","45","45","Going directly to Jesus, he said, “Rabbi, Rabbi!” and kissed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_46","071_14_46","MRK","14","46","46","Then the men seized Jesus and arrested Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_47","071_14_47","MRK","14","47","47","And one of the bystanders drew his sword and struck the servant of the high priest, cutting off his ear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_48","071_14_48","MRK","14","48","48","Jesus asked the crowd, “Have you come out with swords and clubs to arrest Me as you would an outlaw? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_49","071_14_49","MRK","14","49","49","Every day I was with you, teaching in the temple courts, and you did not arrest Me. But this has happened that the Scriptures would be fulfilled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_50","071_14_50","MRK","14","50","50","Then everyone deserted Him and fled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_51","071_14_51","MRK","14","51","51","One young man who had been following Jesus was wearing a linen cloth around his body. The young men caught hold of him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_52","071_14_52","MRK","14","52","52","but he pulled free of the linen cloth and ran away from them naked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_53","071_14_53","MRK","14","53","53","They led Jesus away to the high priest, and all the chief priests, elders, and scribes assembled with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_54","071_14_54","MRK","14","54","54","Peter followed Him at a distance, right into the courtyard of the high priest. And he sat with the officers and warmed himself by the fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_55","071_14_55","MRK","14","55","55","Now the chief priests and the whole Sanhedrin were seeking testimony against Jesus to put Him to death, but they did not find any. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_56","071_14_56","MRK","14","56","56","For many bore false witness against Jesus, but their testimony was inconsistent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_57","071_14_57","MRK","14","57","57","Then some men stood up and testified falsely against Him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_58","071_14_58","MRK","14","58","58","“We heard Him say, ‘I will destroy this man-made temple, and in three days I will build another that is made without hands.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_59","071_14_59","MRK","14","59","59","But even their testimony was inconsistent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_60","071_14_60","MRK","14","60","60","So the high priest stood up before them and questioned Jesus, “Have You no answer? What are these men testifying against You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_61","071_14_61","MRK","14","61","61","But Jesus remained silent and made no reply. Again the high priest questioned Him, “Are You the Christ, the Son of the Blessed One?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_62","071_14_62","MRK","14","62","62","“I am,” said Jesus, “and you will see the Son of Man sitting at the right hand of Power and coming with the clouds of heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_63","071_14_63","MRK","14","63","63","At this, the high priest tore his clothes and declared, “Why do we need any more witnesses? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_64","071_14_64","MRK","14","64","64","You have heard the blasphemy. What is your verdict?” And they all condemned Him as deserving of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_65","071_14_65","MRK","14","65","65","Then some of them began to spit on Him. They blindfolded Him, struck Him with their fists, and said to Him, “Prophesy!” And the officers kept striking Him with the palms of their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_66","071_14_66","MRK","14","66","66","While Peter was in the courtyard below, one of the servant girls of the high priest came down ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_67","071_14_67","MRK","14","67","67","and saw him warming himself there. She looked at Peter and said, “You also were with Jesus the Nazarene.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_68","071_14_68","MRK","14","68","68","But he denied it. “I do not know or even understand what you are talking about,” he said. Then he went out to the gateway, and the rooster crowed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_69","071_14_69","MRK","14","69","69","There the servant girl saw him again and said to those standing nearby, “This man is one of them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_70","071_14_70","MRK","14","70","70","But he denied it again. After a little while, those standing nearby said once more to Peter, “Surely you are one of them, for you too are a Galilean and your speech is similar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_71","071_14_71","MRK","14","71","71","But he began to curse and swear, “I do not know this man of whom you speak!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK14_72","071_14_72","MRK","14","72","72","And the rooster crowed a second time. Then Peter remembered the word that Jesus had spoken to him: “Before the rooster crows twice, you will deny Me three times.” And he broke down and wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_1","071_15_1","MRK","15","1","1","Early in the morning, the chief priests, elders, scribes, and the whole Sanhedrin devised a plan. They bound Jesus, led Him away, and handed Him over to Pilate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_2","071_15_2","MRK","15","2","2","So Pilate questioned Him, “Are You the King of the Jews?” “You have said so,” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_3","071_15_3","MRK","15","3","3","And the chief priests began to accuse Him of many things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_4","071_15_4","MRK","15","4","4","Then Pilate questioned Him again, “Have You no answer? Look how many charges they are testifying against You!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_5","071_15_5","MRK","15","5","5","But to Pilate’s amazement, Jesus made no further reply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_6","071_15_6","MRK","15","6","6","Now it was Pilate’s custom at the feast to release to the people a prisoner of their choosing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_7","071_15_7","MRK","15","7","7","And a man named Barabbas was imprisoned with his fellow rebels who had committed murder during the insurrection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_8","071_15_8","MRK","15","8","8","So the crowd cried out and began asking Pilate to keep his custom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_9","071_15_9","MRK","15","9","9","“Do you want me to release to you the King of the Jews?” Pilate asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_10","071_15_10","MRK","15","10","10","For he knew it was out of envy that the chief priests had handed Jesus over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_11","071_15_11","MRK","15","11","11","But the chief priests stirred up the crowd to have him release Barabbas to them instead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_12","071_15_12","MRK","15","12","12","So Pilate asked them again, “What then do you want me to do with the One you call the King of the Jews?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_13","071_15_13","MRK","15","13","13","And they shouted back, “Crucify Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_14","071_15_14","MRK","15","14","14","“Why?” asked Pilate. “What evil has He done?” But they shouted all the louder, “Crucify Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_15","071_15_15","MRK","15","15","15","And wishing to satisfy the crowd, Pilate released Barabbas to them. But he had Jesus flogged, and handed Him over to be crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_16","071_15_16","MRK","15","16","16","Then the soldiers led Jesus away into the palace (that is, the Praetorium) and called the whole company together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_17","071_15_17","MRK","15","17","17","They dressed Him in a purple robe, twisted together a crown of thorns, and set it on His head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_18","071_15_18","MRK","15","18","18","And they began to salute Him: “Hail, King of the Jews!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_19","071_15_19","MRK","15","19","19","They kept striking His head with a staff and spitting on Him. And they knelt down and bowed before Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_20","071_15_20","MRK","15","20","20","After they had mocked Him, they removed the purple robe and put His own clothes back on Him. Then they led Him out to crucify Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_21","071_15_21","MRK","15","21","21","Now Simon of Cyrene, the father of Alexander and Rufus, was passing by on his way in from the country, and the soldiers forced him to carry the cross of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_22","071_15_22","MRK","15","22","22","They brought Jesus to a place called Golgotha, which means The Place of the Skull. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_23","071_15_23","MRK","15","23","23","There they offered Him wine to drink mixed with myrrh, but He did not take it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_24","071_15_24","MRK","15","24","24","And they crucified Him. They also divided His garments by casting lots to decide what each of them would take. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_25","071_15_25","MRK","15","25","25","It was the third hour when they crucified Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_26","071_15_26","MRK","15","26","26","And the charge inscribed against Him read: THE KING OF THE JEWS. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_27","071_15_27","MRK","15","27","27","Along with Jesus, they crucified two robbers, one on His right and one on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_28","071_15_28","MRK","15","28","28","So the Scripture was fulfilled that says, “And He was numbered with the transgressors.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_29","071_15_29","MRK","15","29","29","And those who passed by heaped abuse on Him, shaking their heads and saying, “Aha! You who are going to destroy the temple and rebuild it in three days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_30","071_15_30","MRK","15","30","30","come down from the cross and save Yourself!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_31","071_15_31","MRK","15","31","31","In the same way, the chief priests and scribes mocked Him among themselves, saying, “He saved others, but He cannot save Himself! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_32","071_15_32","MRK","15","32","32","Let the Christ, the King of Israel, come down now from the cross, so that we may see and believe Him!” And even those who were crucified with Him berated Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_33","071_15_33","MRK","15","33","33","From the sixth hour until the ninth hour darkness came over all the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_34","071_15_34","MRK","15","34","34","At the ninth hour, Jesus cried out in a loud voice, “Eloi, Eloi, lima sabachthani?” which means, “My God, My God, why have You forsaken Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_35","071_15_35","MRK","15","35","35","When some of those standing nearby heard this, they said, “Behold, He is calling Elijah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_36","071_15_36","MRK","15","36","36","And someone ran and filled a sponge with sour wine. He put it on a reed and held it up for Jesus to drink, saying, “Leave Him alone. Let us see if Elijah comes to take Him down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_37","071_15_37","MRK","15","37","37","But Jesus let out a loud cry and breathed His last. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_38","071_15_38","MRK","15","38","38","And the veil of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_39","071_15_39","MRK","15","39","39","When the centurion standing there in front of Jesus saw how He had cried out and breathed His last, he said, “Truly this man was the Son of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_40","071_15_40","MRK","15","40","40","And there were also women watching from a distance. Among them were Mary Magdalene, Mary the mother of James the younger and of Joses, and Salome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_41","071_15_41","MRK","15","41","41","These women had followed Jesus and ministered to Him while He was in Galilee, and there were many other women who had come up to Jerusalem with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_42","071_15_42","MRK","15","42","42","Now it was already evening. Since it was Preparation Day (that is, the day before the Sabbath), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_43","071_15_43","MRK","15","43","43","Joseph of Arimathea, a prominent Council member who himself was waiting for the kingdom of God, boldly went to Pilate to ask for the body of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_44","071_15_44","MRK","15","44","44","Pilate was surprised to hear that Jesus was already dead, so he summoned the centurion to ask if this was so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_45","071_15_45","MRK","15","45","45","When Pilate had confirmed it with the centurion, he granted the body to Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_46","071_15_46","MRK","15","46","46","So Joseph bought a linen cloth, took down the body of Jesus, wrapped it in the cloth, and placed it in a tomb that had been cut out of the rock. Then he rolled a stone against the entrance to the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK15_47","071_15_47","MRK","15","47","47","Mary Magdalene and Mary the mother of Joses saw where His body was placed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_1","071_16_1","MRK","16","1","1","When the Sabbath was over, Mary Magdalene, Mary the mother of James, and Salome bought spices so they could go and anoint the body of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_2","071_16_2","MRK","16","2","2","Very early on the first day of the week, just after sunrise, they went to the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_3","071_16_3","MRK","16","3","3","They were asking one another, “Who will roll away the stone from the entrance of the tomb?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_4","071_16_4","MRK","16","4","4","But when they looked up, they saw that the stone had been rolled away, even though it was extremely large. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_5","071_16_5","MRK","16","5","5","When they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_6","071_16_6","MRK","16","6","6","But he said to them, “Do not be alarmed. You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here! See the place where they put Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_7","071_16_7","MRK","16","7","7","But go, tell His disciples and Peter, ‘He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him, just as He told you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_8","071_16_8","MRK","16","8","8","So the women left the tomb and ran away, trembling and bewildered. And in their fear they did not say a word to anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_9","071_16_9","MRK","16","9","9","Early on the first day of the week, after Jesus had risen, He appeared first to Mary Magdalene, from whom He had driven out seven demons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_10","071_16_10","MRK","16","10","10","She went and told those who had been with Him, who were mourning and weeping. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_11","071_16_11","MRK","16","11","11","And when they heard that Jesus was alive and she had seen Him, they did not believe it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_12","071_16_12","MRK","16","12","12","After this, Jesus appeared in a different form to two of them as they walked along in the country. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_13","071_16_13","MRK","16","13","13","And they went back and reported it to the rest, but they did not believe them either. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_14","071_16_14","MRK","16","14","14","Later, as they were eating, Jesus appeared to the Eleven and rebuked them for their unbelief and hardness of heart, because they did not believe those who had seen Him after He had risen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_15","071_16_15","MRK","16","15","15","And He said to them, “Go into all the world and preach the gospel to every creature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_16","071_16_16","MRK","16","16","16","Whoever believes and is baptized will be saved, but whoever does not believe will be condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_17","071_16_17","MRK","16","17","17","And these signs will accompany those who believe: In My name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_18","071_16_18","MRK","16","18","18","they will pick up snakes, and if they drink any deadly poison, it will not harm them; they will lay their hands on the sick, and they will be made well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_19","071_16_19","MRK","16","19","19","After the Lord had spoken to them, He was taken up into heaven and sat down at the right hand of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("MK16_20","071_16_20","MRK","16","20","20","And they went out and preached everywhere, and the Lord worked through them, confirming His word by the signs that accompanied it. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_1","072_1_1","LUK","1","1","1","Many have undertaken to compose an account of the things that have been fulfilled among us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_2","072_1_2","LUK","1","2","2","just as they were handed down to us by the initial eyewitnesses and servants of the word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_3","072_1_3","LUK","1","3","3","Therefore, having carefully investigated everything from the beginning, it seemed good also to me to write an orderly account for you, most excellent Theophilus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_4","072_1_4","LUK","1","4","4","so that you may know the certainty of the things you have been taught. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_5","072_1_5","LUK","1","5","5","In the time of Herod king of Judea there was a priest named Zechariah, who belonged to the priestly division of Abijah, and whose wife Elizabeth was a descendant of Aaron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_6","072_1_6","LUK","1","6","6","Both of them were righteous in the sight of God, walking blamelessly in all the commandments and decrees of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_7","072_1_7","LUK","1","7","7","But they had no children, because Elizabeth was barren, and they were both well along in years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_8","072_1_8","LUK","1","8","8","One day while Zechariah’s division was on duty and he was serving as priest before God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_9","072_1_9","LUK","1","9","9","he was chosen by lot, according to the custom of the priesthood, to enter the temple of the Lord and burn incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_10","072_1_10","LUK","1","10","10","And at the hour of the incense offering, the whole congregation was praying outside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_11","072_1_11","LUK","1","11","11","Just then an angel of the Lord appeared to Zechariah, standing at the right side of the altar of incense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_12","072_1_12","LUK","1","12","12","When Zechariah saw him, he was startled and gripped with fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_13","072_1_13","LUK","1","13","13","But the angel said to him, “Do not be afraid, Zechariah, because your prayer has been heard. Your wife Elizabeth will bear you a son, and you are to give him the name John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_14","072_1_14","LUK","1","14","14","He will be a joy and delight to you, and many will rejoice at his birth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_15","072_1_15","LUK","1","15","15","for he will be great in the sight of the Lord. He shall never take wine or strong drink, and he will be filled with the Holy Spirit even from his mother’s womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_16","072_1_16","LUK","1","16","16","Many of the sons of Israel he will turn back to the Lord their God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_17","072_1_17","LUK","1","17","17","And he will go on before the Lord in the spirit and power of Elijah, to turn the hearts of the fathers to their children and the disobedient to the wisdom of the righteous—to make ready a people prepared for the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_18","072_1_18","LUK","1","18","18","“How can I be sure of this?” Zechariah asked the angel. “I am an old man, and my wife is well along in years.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_19","072_1_19","LUK","1","19","19","“I am Gabriel,” replied the angel. “I stand in the presence of God, and I have been sent to speak to you and to bring you this good news. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_20","072_1_20","LUK","1","20","20","And now you will be silent and unable to speak until the day this comes to pass, because you did not believe my words, which will be fulfilled at their proper time.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_21","072_1_21","LUK","1","21","21","Meanwhile, the people were waiting for Zechariah and wondering why he took so long in the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_22","072_1_22","LUK","1","22","22","When he came out and was unable to speak to them, they realized he had seen a vision in the temple. He kept making signs to them but remained unable to speak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_23","072_1_23","LUK","1","23","23","And when the days of his service were complete, he returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_24","072_1_24","LUK","1","24","24","After these days, his wife Elizabeth became pregnant and for five months remained in seclusion. She declared, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_25","072_1_25","LUK","1","25","25","“The Lord has done this for me. In these days He has shown me favor and taken away my disgrace among the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_26","072_1_26","LUK","1","26","26","In the sixth month, God sent the angel Gabriel to a town in Galilee called Nazareth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_27","072_1_27","LUK","1","27","27","to a virgin pledged in marriage to a man named Joseph, who was of the house of David. And the virgin’s name was Mary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_28","072_1_28","LUK","1","28","28","The angel appeared to her and said, “Greetings, you who are highly favored! The Lord is with you. Blessed are you among women!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_29","072_1_29","LUK","1","29","29","When she saw this, Mary was greatly troubled at his words and wondered what kind of greeting this might be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_30","072_1_30","LUK","1","30","30","So the angel told her, “Do not be afraid, Mary, for you have found favor with God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_31","072_1_31","LUK","1","31","31","Behold, you will conceive and give birth to a son, and you are to give Him the name Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_32","072_1_32","LUK","1","32","32","He will be great and will be called the Son of the Most High. The Lord God will give Him the throne of His father David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_33","072_1_33","LUK","1","33","33","and He will reign over the house of Jacob forever. His kingdom will never end!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_34","072_1_34","LUK","1","34","34","“How can this be,” Mary asked the angel, “since I am a virgin?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_35","072_1_35","LUK","1","35","35","The angel replied, “The Holy Spirit will come upon you, and the power of the Most High will overshadow you. So the Holy One to be born will be called the Son of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_36","072_1_36","LUK","1","36","36","Look, even Elizabeth your relative has conceived a son in her old age, and she who was called barren is in her sixth month. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_37","072_1_37","LUK","1","37","37","For no word from God will ever fail.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_38","072_1_38","LUK","1","38","38","“I am the Lord’s servant,” Mary answered. “May it happen to me according to your word.” Then the angel left her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_39","072_1_39","LUK","1","39","39","In those days Mary got ready and hurried to a town in the hill country of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_40","072_1_40","LUK","1","40","40","where she entered the home of Zechariah and greeted Elizabeth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_41","072_1_41","LUK","1","41","41","When Elizabeth heard Mary’s greeting, the baby leaped in her womb, and Elizabeth was filled with the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_42","072_1_42","LUK","1","42","42","In a loud voice she exclaimed, “Blessed are you among women, and blessed is the fruit of your womb! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_43","072_1_43","LUK","1","43","43","And why am I so honored, that the mother of my Lord should come to me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_44","072_1_44","LUK","1","44","44","For as soon as the sound of your greeting reached my ears, the baby in my womb leaped for joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_45","072_1_45","LUK","1","45","45","Blessed is she who has believed that the Lord’s word to her will be fulfilled.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_46","072_1_46","LUK","1","46","46","Then Mary said: “My soul magnifies the Lord, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_47","072_1_47","LUK","1","47","47","and my spirit rejoices in God my Savior! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_48","072_1_48","LUK","1","48","48","For He has looked with favor on the humble state of His servant. From now on all generations will call me blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_49","072_1_49","LUK","1","49","49","For the Mighty One has done great things for me. Holy is His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_50","072_1_50","LUK","1","50","50","His mercy extends to those who fear Him, from generation to generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_51","072_1_51","LUK","1","51","51","He has performed mighty deeds with His arm; He has scattered those who are proud in the thoughts of their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_52","072_1_52","LUK","1","52","52","He has brought down rulers from their thrones, but has exalted the humble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_53","072_1_53","LUK","1","53","53","He has filled the hungry with good things, but has sent the rich away empty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_54","072_1_54","LUK","1","54","54","He has helped His servant Israel, remembering to be merciful, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_55","072_1_55","LUK","1","55","55","as He promised to our fathers, to Abraham and his descendants forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_56","072_1_56","LUK","1","56","56","Mary stayed with Elizabeth for about three months and then returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_57","072_1_57","LUK","1","57","57","When the time came for Elizabeth to have her child, she gave birth to a son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_58","072_1_58","LUK","1","58","58","Her neighbors and relatives heard that the Lord had shown her great mercy, and they rejoiced with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_59","072_1_59","LUK","1","59","59","On the eighth day, when they came to circumcise the child, they were going to name him after his father Zechariah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_60","072_1_60","LUK","1","60","60","But his mother replied, “No! He shall be called John.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_61","072_1_61","LUK","1","61","61","They said to her, “There is no one among your relatives who bears this name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_62","072_1_62","LUK","1","62","62","So they made signs to his father to find out what he wanted to name the child. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_63","072_1_63","LUK","1","63","63","Zechariah asked for a tablet and wrote, “His name is John.” And they were all amazed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_64","072_1_64","LUK","1","64","64","Immediately Zechariah’s mouth was opened and his tongue was released, and he began to speak, praising God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_65","072_1_65","LUK","1","65","65","All their neighbors were filled with awe, and people throughout the hill country of Judea were talking about these events. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_66","072_1_66","LUK","1","66","66","And all who heard this wondered in their hearts and asked, “What then will this child become?” And the Lord’s hand was with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_67","072_1_67","LUK","1","67","67","Then his father Zechariah was filled with the Holy Spirit and prophesied: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_68","072_1_68","LUK","1","68","68","“Blessed be the Lord, the God of Israel, because He has visited and redeemed His people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_69","072_1_69","LUK","1","69","69","He has raised up a horn of salvation for us in the house of His servant David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_70","072_1_70","LUK","1","70","70","as He spoke through His holy prophets, those of ages past, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_71","072_1_71","LUK","1","71","71","salvation from our enemies and from the hand of all who hate us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_72","072_1_72","LUK","1","72","72","to show mercy to our fathers and to remember His holy covenant, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_73","072_1_73","LUK","1","73","73","the oath He swore to our father Abraham, to grant us ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_74","072_1_74","LUK","1","74","74","deliverance from the hands of our enemies, that we may serve Him without fear, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_75","072_1_75","LUK","1","75","75","in holiness and righteousness before Him all the days of our lives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_76","072_1_76","LUK","1","76","76","And you, child, will be called a prophet of the Most High; for you will go on before the presence of the Lord to prepare the way for Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_77","072_1_77","LUK","1","77","77","to give to His people the knowledge of salvation through the forgiveness of their sins, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_78","072_1_78","LUK","1","78","78","because of the tender mercy of our God, by which the Dawn has visited us from on high, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_79","072_1_79","LUK","1","79","79","to shine on those who live in darkness and in the shadow of death, to guide our feet into the path of peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK1_80","072_1_80","LUK","1","80","80","And the child grew and became strong in spirit; and he lived in the wilderness until the time of his public appearance to Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_1","072_2_1","LUK","2","1","1","Now in those days a decree went out from Caesar Augustus that a census should be taken of the whole empire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_2","072_2_2","LUK","2","2","2","This was the first census to take place while Quirinius was governor of Syria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_3","072_2_3","LUK","2","3","3","And everyone went to his own town to register. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_4","072_2_4","LUK","2","4","4","So Joseph also went up from Nazareth in Galilee to Judea, to the city of David called Bethlehem, since he was from the house and line of David. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_5","072_2_5","LUK","2","5","5","He went there to register with Mary, who was pledged to him in marriage and was expecting a child. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_6","072_2_6","LUK","2","6","6","While they were there, the time came for her Child to be born. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_7","072_2_7","LUK","2","7","7","And she gave birth to her firstborn, a Son. She wrapped Him in swaddling cloths and laid Him in the manger, because there was no room for them in the inn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_8","072_2_8","LUK","2","8","8","And there were shepherds residing in the fields nearby, keeping watch over their flocks by night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_9","072_2_9","LUK","2","9","9","And behold, an angel of the Lord stood before them, and the glory of the Lord shone around them, and they were terrified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_10","072_2_10","LUK","2","10","10","But the angel said to them, “Do not be afraid! For behold, I bring you good news of great joy that will be for all the people: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_11","072_2_11","LUK","2","11","11","Today in the city of David a Savior has been born to you. He is Christ the Lord! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_12","072_2_12","LUK","2","12","12","And this will be the sign to you: You will find a baby wrapped in swaddling cloths and lying in a manger.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_13","072_2_13","LUK","2","13","13","And suddenly there appeared with the angel a great multitude of the heavenly host, praising God and saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_14","072_2_14","LUK","2","14","14","“Glory to God in the highest, and on earth peace, good will toward men!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_15","072_2_15","LUK","2","15","15","When the angels had left them and gone into heaven, the shepherds said to one another, “Let us go to Bethlehem and see this thing that has happened, which the Lord has made known to us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_16","072_2_16","LUK","2","16","16","So they hurried off and found Mary and Joseph and the Baby, who was lying in the manger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_17","072_2_17","LUK","2","17","17","After they had seen the Child, they spread widely the message they had received about Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_18","072_2_18","LUK","2","18","18","And all who heard it were amazed at what the shepherds said to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_19","072_2_19","LUK","2","19","19","But Mary treasured up all these things and pondered them in her heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_20","072_2_20","LUK","2","20","20","The shepherds returned, glorifying and praising God for all they had heard and seen, which was just as the angel had told them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_21","072_2_21","LUK","2","21","21","When the eight days before His circumcision had passed, He was named Jesus, the name the angel had given Him before He was conceived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_22","072_2_22","LUK","2","22","22","And when the time of purification according to the Law of Moses was complete, His parents brought Him to Jerusalem to present Him to the Lord ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_23","072_2_23","LUK","2","23","23","(as it is written in the Law of the Lord: “Every firstborn male shall be consecrated to the Lord”), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_24","072_2_24","LUK","2","24","24","and to offer the sacrifice specified in the Law of the Lord: “A pair of turtledoves or two young pigeons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_25","072_2_25","LUK","2","25","25","Now there was a man in Jerusalem named Simeon, who was righteous and devout. He was waiting for the consolation of Israel, and the Holy Spirit was upon him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_26","072_2_26","LUK","2","26","26","The Holy Spirit had revealed to him that he would not see death before he had seen the Lord’s Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_27","072_2_27","LUK","2","27","27","Led by the Spirit, he went into the temple courts. And when the parents brought in the child Jesus to do for Him what was customary under the Law, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_28","072_2_28","LUK","2","28","28","Simeon took Him in his arms and blessed God, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_29","072_2_29","LUK","2","29","29","“Sovereign Lord, as You have promised, You now dismiss Your servant in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_30","072_2_30","LUK","2","30","30","For my eyes have seen Your salvation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_31","072_2_31","LUK","2","31","31","which You have prepared in the sight of all people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_32","072_2_32","LUK","2","32","32","a light for revelation to the Gentiles, and for glory to Your people Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_33","072_2_33","LUK","2","33","33","And Joseph and the Child’s mother were amazed at what was spoken about Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_34","072_2_34","LUK","2","34","34","Then Simeon blessed them and said to His mother Mary: “Behold, this Child is appointed to cause the rise and fall of many in Israel, and to be a sign that will be spoken against, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_35","072_2_35","LUK","2","35","35","so that the thoughts of many hearts will be revealed—and a sword will pierce your soul as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_36","072_2_36","LUK","2","36","36","There was also a prophetess named Anna, the daughter of Phanuel, of the tribe of Asher, who was well along in years. She had been married for seven years, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_37","072_2_37","LUK","2","37","37","and then was a widow to the age of eighty-four. She never left the temple, but worshiped night and day, fasting and praying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_38","072_2_38","LUK","2","38","38","Coming forward at that moment, she gave thanks to the Lord and spoke about the Child to all who were waiting for redemption in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_39","072_2_39","LUK","2","39","39","When Jesus’ parents had done everything required by the Law of the Lord, they returned to Galilee, to their own town of Nazareth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_40","072_2_40","LUK","2","40","40","And the Child grew and became strong in spirit. He was filled with wisdom, and the grace of God was upon Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_41","072_2_41","LUK","2","41","41","Every year His parents went to Jerusalem for the Feast of the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_42","072_2_42","LUK","2","42","42","And when He was twelve years old, they went up to Jerusalem according to the custom of the Feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_43","072_2_43","LUK","2","43","43","When those days were over and they were returning home, the boy Jesus remained behind in Jerusalem, but Joseph and His mother were unaware He had stayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_44","072_2_44","LUK","2","44","44","Assuming He was in their company, they traveled on for a day before they began to look for Him among their relatives and friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_45","072_2_45","LUK","2","45","45","When they could not find Him, they returned to Jerusalem to search for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_46","072_2_46","LUK","2","46","46","Finally, after three days they found Him in the temple courts, sitting among the teachers, listening to them and asking them questions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_47","072_2_47","LUK","2","47","47","And all who heard Him were astounded at His understanding and His answers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_48","072_2_48","LUK","2","48","48","When His parents saw Him, they were astonished. “Child, why have You done this to us?” His mother asked. “Your father and I have been anxiously searching for You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_49","072_2_49","LUK","2","49","49","“Why were you looking for Me?” He asked. “Did you not know that I had to be in My Father’s house?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_50","072_2_50","LUK","2","50","50","But they did not understand the statement He was making to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_51","072_2_51","LUK","2","51","51","Then He went down to Nazareth with them and was obedient to them. But His mother treasured up all these things in her heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK2_52","072_2_52","LUK","2","52","52","And Jesus grew in wisdom and stature, and in favor with God and man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_1","072_3_1","LUK","3","1","1","In the fifteenth year of the reign of Tiberius Caesar, while Pontius Pilate was governor of Judea, Herod tetrarch of Galilee, his brother Philip tetrarch of Ituraea and Trachonitis, and Lysanias tetrarch of Abilene, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_2","072_3_2","LUK","3","2","2","during the high priesthood of Annas and Caiaphas, the word of God came to John son of Zechariah in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_3","072_3_3","LUK","3","3","3","He went into all the region around the Jordan, preaching a baptism of repentance for the forgiveness of sins, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_4","072_3_4","LUK","3","4","4","as it is written in the book of the words of Isaiah the prophet: “A voice of one calling in the wilderness, ‘Prepare the way for the Lord, make straight paths for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_5","072_3_5","LUK","3","5","5","Every valley shall be filled in, and every mountain and hill made low. The crooked ways shall be made straight, and the rough ways smooth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_6","072_3_6","LUK","3","6","6","And all humanity will see God’s salvation.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_7","072_3_7","LUK","3","7","7","Then John said to the crowds coming out to be baptized by him, “You brood of vipers, who warned you to flee from the coming wrath? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_8","072_3_8","LUK","3","8","8","Produce fruit, then, in keeping with repentance. And do not begin to say to yourselves, ‘We have Abraham as our father.’ For I tell you that out of these stones God can raise up children for Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_9","072_3_9","LUK","3","9","9","The axe lies ready at the root of the trees, and every tree that does not produce good fruit will be cut down and thrown into the fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_10","072_3_10","LUK","3","10","10","The crowds asked him, “What then should we do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_11","072_3_11","LUK","3","11","11","John replied, “Whoever has two tunics should share with him who has none, and whoever has food should do the same.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_12","072_3_12","LUK","3","12","12","Even tax collectors came to be baptized. “Teacher,” they asked, “what should we do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_13","072_3_13","LUK","3","13","13","“Collect no more than you are authorized,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_14","072_3_14","LUK","3","14","14","Then some soldiers asked him, “And what should we do?” “Do not take money by force or false accusation,” he said. “Be content with your wages.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_15","072_3_15","LUK","3","15","15","The people were waiting expectantly and were all wondering in their hearts if John could be the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_16","072_3_16","LUK","3","16","16","John answered all of them: “I baptize you with water, but One more powerful than I will come, the straps of whose sandals I am not worthy to untie. He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit and with fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_17","072_3_17","LUK","3","17","17","His winnowing fork is in His hand, and He will clear His threshing floor and gather the wheat into His barn; but He will burn up the chaff with unquenchable fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_18","072_3_18","LUK","3","18","18","With these and many other exhortations, John proclaimed the good news to the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_19","072_3_19","LUK","3","19","19","But when he rebuked Herod the tetrarch regarding his brother’s wife Herodias and all the evils he had done, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_20","072_3_20","LUK","3","20","20","Herod added this to them all: He locked John up in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_21","072_3_21","LUK","3","21","21","When all the people were being baptized, Jesus was baptized too. And as He was praying, heaven was opened, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_22","072_3_22","LUK","3","22","22","and the Holy Spirit descended on Him in a bodily form like a dove. And a voice came from heaven, saying, “You are My beloved Son; in You I am well pleased.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_23","072_3_23","LUK","3","23","23","Jesus Himself was about thirty years old when He began His ministry. He was regarded as the son of Joseph, the son of Heli, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_24","072_3_24","LUK","3","24","24","the son of Matthat, the son of Levi, the son of Melchi, the son of Janna, the son of Joseph, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_25","072_3_25","LUK","3","25","25","the son of Mattathias, the son of Amos, the son of Nahum, the son of Esli, the son of Naggai, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_26","072_3_26","LUK","3","26","26","the son of Maath, the son of Mattathias, the son of Semei, the son of Josech, the son of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_27","072_3_27","LUK","3","27","27","the son of Joanan, the son of Rhesa, the son of Zerubbabel, the son of Shealtiel, the son of Neri, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_28","072_3_28","LUK","3","28","28","the son of Melchi, the son of Addi, the son of Cosam, the son of Elmodam, the son of Er, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_29","072_3_29","LUK","3","29","29","the son of Jose, the son of Eliezer, the son of Jorim, the son of Matthat, the son of Levi, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_30","072_3_30","LUK","3","30","30","the son of Simeon, the son of Judah, the son of Joseph, the son of Jonan, the son of Eliakim, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_31","072_3_31","LUK","3","31","31","the son of Melea, the son of Mainan, the son of Mattatha, the son of Nathan, the son of David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_32","072_3_32","LUK","3","32","32","the son of Jesse, the son of Obed, the son of Boaz, the son of Salmon, the son of Nahshon, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_33","072_3_33","LUK","3","33","33","the son of Amminadab, the son of Aram, the son of Hezron, the son of Perez, the son of Judah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_34","072_3_34","LUK","3","34","34","the son of Jacob, the son of Isaac, the son of Abraham, the son of Terah, the son of Nahor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_35","072_3_35","LUK","3","35","35","the son of Serug, the son of Reu, the son of Peleg, the son of Eber, the son of Shelah, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_36","072_3_36","LUK","3","36","36","the son of Cainan, the son of Arphaxad, the son of Shem, the son of Noah, the son of Lamech, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_37","072_3_37","LUK","3","37","37","the son of Methuselah, the son of Enoch, the son of Jared, the son of Mahalalel, the son of Cainan, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK3_38","072_3_38","LUK","3","38","38","the son of Enosh, the son of Seth, the son of Adam, the son of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_1","072_4_1","LUK","4","1","1","Then Jesus, full of the Holy Spirit, returned from the Jordan and was led by the Spirit into the wilderness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_2","072_4_2","LUK","4","2","2","where for forty days He was tempted by the devil. He ate nothing during those days, and afterward, when they had ended, He was hungry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_3","072_4_3","LUK","4","3","3","The devil said to Him, “If You are the Son of God, tell this stone to become bread.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_4","072_4_4","LUK","4","4","4","But Jesus answered, “It is written: ‘Man shall not live on bread alone, but on every word of God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_5","072_4_5","LUK","4","5","5","Then the devil led Him up to a high mountain and showed Him in an instant all the kingdoms of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_6","072_4_6","LUK","4","6","6","“I will give You authority over all these kingdoms and all their glory,” he said. “For it has been relinquished to me, and I can give it to anyone I wish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_7","072_4_7","LUK","4","7","7","So if You worship me, it will all be Yours.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_8","072_4_8","LUK","4","8","8","But Jesus answered, “Get behind Me, Satan! It is written: ‘Worship the Lord your God and serve Him only.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_9","072_4_9","LUK","4","9","9","Then the devil led Him to Jerusalem and set Him on the pinnacle of the temple. “If You are the Son of God,” he said, “throw Yourself down from here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_10","072_4_10","LUK","4","10","10","For it is written: ‘He will command His angels concerning You to guard You carefully, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_11","072_4_11","LUK","4","11","11","and they will lift You up in their hands, so that You will not strike Your foot against a stone.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_12","072_4_12","LUK","4","12","12","But Jesus answered, “It also says, ‘Do not put the Lord your God to the test.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_13","072_4_13","LUK","4","13","13","When the devil had finished every temptation, he left Him until an opportune time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_14","072_4_14","LUK","4","14","14","Jesus returned to Galilee in the power of the Spirit, and the news about Him spread throughout the surrounding region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_15","072_4_15","LUK","4","15","15","He taught in their synagogues and was glorified by everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_16","072_4_16","LUK","4","16","16","Then Jesus came to Nazareth, where He had been brought up. As was His custom, He entered the synagogue on the Sabbath. And when He stood up to read, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_17","072_4_17","LUK","4","17","17","the scroll of Isaiah the prophet was handed to Him. Unrolling it, He found the place where it was written: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_18","072_4_18","LUK","4","18","18","“The Spirit of the Lord is on Me, because He has anointed Me to preach good news to the poor. He has sent Me to heal the brokenhearted, to proclaim liberty to the captives and recovery of sight to the blind, to release the oppressed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_19","072_4_19","LUK","4","19","19","to proclaim the year of the Lord’s favor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_20","072_4_20","LUK","4","20","20","Then He rolled up the scroll, returned it to the attendant, and sat down. The eyes of everyone in the synagogue were fixed on Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_21","072_4_21","LUK","4","21","21","and He began by saying, “Today this Scripture is fulfilled in your hearing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_22","072_4_22","LUK","4","22","22","All spoke well of Him and marveled at the gracious words that came from His lips. “Isn’t this the son of Joseph?” they asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_23","072_4_23","LUK","4","23","23","Jesus said to them, “Surely you will quote this proverb to Me: ‘Physician, heal yourself! Do here in Your hometown what we have heard that You did in Capernaum.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_24","072_4_24","LUK","4","24","24","Then He added, “Truly I tell you, no prophet is accepted in his hometown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_25","072_4_25","LUK","4","25","25","But I tell you truthfully that there were many widows in Israel in the time of Elijah, when the sky was shut for three and a half years and great famine swept over all the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_26","072_4_26","LUK","4","26","26","Yet Elijah was not sent to any of them, but to the widow of Zarephath in Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_27","072_4_27","LUK","4","27","27","And there were many lepers in Israel in the time of Elisha the prophet. Yet not one of them was cleansed—only Naaman the Syrian.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_28","072_4_28","LUK","4","28","28","On hearing this, all the people in the synagogue were enraged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_29","072_4_29","LUK","4","29","29","They got up, drove Him out of the town, and led Him to the brow of the hill on which the town was built, in order to throw Him over the cliff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_30","072_4_30","LUK","4","30","30","But Jesus passed through the crowd and went on His way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_31","072_4_31","LUK","4","31","31","Then He went down to Capernaum, a town in Galilee, and on the Sabbath He began to teach the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_32","072_4_32","LUK","4","32","32","They were astonished at His teaching, because His message had authority. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_33","072_4_33","LUK","4","33","33","In the synagogue there was a man possessed by the spirit of an unclean demon. He cried out in a loud voice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_34","072_4_34","LUK","4","34","34","“Ha! What do You want with us, Jesus of Nazareth? Have You come to destroy us? I know who You are—the Holy One of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_35","072_4_35","LUK","4","35","35","But Jesus rebuked the demon. “Be silent!” He said. “Come out of him!” At this, the demon threw the man down before them all and came out without harming him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_36","072_4_36","LUK","4","36","36","All the people were overcome with amazement and asked one another, “What is this message? With authority and power He commands the unclean spirits, and they come out!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_37","072_4_37","LUK","4","37","37","And the news about Jesus spread throughout the surrounding region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_38","072_4_38","LUK","4","38","38","After Jesus had left the synagogue, He went to the home of Simon, whose mother-in-law was suffering from a high fever. So they appealed to Jesus on her behalf, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_39","072_4_39","LUK","4","39","39","and He stood over her and rebuked the fever, and it left her. And she got up at once and began to serve them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_40","072_4_40","LUK","4","40","40","At sunset, all who were ill with various diseases were brought to Jesus, and laying His hands on each one, He healed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_41","072_4_41","LUK","4","41","41","Demons also came out of many people, crying out, “You are the Christ, the Son of God!” But He rebuked the demons and would not allow them to speak, because they knew He was the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_42","072_4_42","LUK","4","42","42","At daybreak, Jesus went out to a solitary place, and the crowds were looking for Him. They came to Him and tried to keep Him from leaving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_43","072_4_43","LUK","4","43","43","But Jesus told them, “I must preach the good news of the kingdom of God to the other towns as well, because that is why I was sent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK4_44","072_4_44","LUK","4","44","44","And He continued to preach in the synagogues of Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_1","072_5_1","LUK","5","1","1","On one occasion, while Jesus was standing by the Lake of Gennesaret with the crowd pressing in on Him to hear the word of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_2","072_5_2","LUK","5","2","2","He saw two boats at the edge of the lake. The fishermen had left them and were washing their nets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_3","072_5_3","LUK","5","3","3","Jesus got into the boat belonging to Simon and asked him to put out a little from shore. And sitting down, He taught the people from the boat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_4","072_5_4","LUK","5","4","4","When Jesus had finished speaking, He said to Simon, “Put out into deep water and let down your nets for a catch.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_5","072_5_5","LUK","5","5","5","“Master,” Simon replied, “we have worked hard all night without catching anything. But because You say so, I will let down the net.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_6","072_5_6","LUK","5","6","6","When they had done so, they caught such a large number of fish that their net began to tear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_7","072_5_7","LUK","5","7","7","So they signaled to their partners in the other boat to come and help them, and they came and filled both boats so full that they began to sink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_8","072_5_8","LUK","5","8","8","When Simon Peter saw this, he fell at Jesus’ knees. “Go away from me, Lord,” he said, “for I am a sinful man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_9","072_5_9","LUK","5","9","9","For he and his companions were astonished at the catch of fish they had taken, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_10","072_5_10","LUK","5","10","10","and so were his partners James and John, the sons of Zebedee. “Do not be afraid,” Jesus said to Simon. “From now on you will catch men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_11","072_5_11","LUK","5","11","11","And when they had brought their boats ashore, they left everything and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_12","072_5_12","LUK","5","12","12","While Jesus was in one of the towns, a man came along who was covered with leprosy. When he saw Jesus, he fell facedown and begged Him, “Lord, if You are willing, You can make me clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_13","072_5_13","LUK","5","13","13","Jesus reached out His hand and touched the man. “I am willing,” He said. “Be clean!” And immediately the leprosy left him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_14","072_5_14","LUK","5","14","14","“Do not tell anyone,” Jesus instructed him. “But go, show yourself to the priest and present the offering Moses prescribed for your cleansing, as a testimony to them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_15","072_5_15","LUK","5","15","15","But the news about Jesus spread all the more, and great crowds came to hear Him and to be healed by Him of their sicknesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_16","072_5_16","LUK","5","16","16","Yet He frequently withdrew to the wilderness to pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_17","072_5_17","LUK","5","17","17","One day Jesus was teaching, and the Pharisees and teachers of the law were sitting there. People had come from Jerusalem and from every village of Galilee and Judea, and the power of the Lord was present for Him to heal the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_18","072_5_18","LUK","5","18","18","Just then some men came carrying a paralyzed man on a mat. They tried to bring him inside to set him before Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_19","072_5_19","LUK","5","19","19","but they could not find a way through the crowd. So they went up on the roof and lowered him on his mat through the tiles into the middle of the crowd, right in front of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_20","072_5_20","LUK","5","20","20","When Jesus saw their faith, He said to the man, “Friend, your sins are forgiven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_21","072_5_21","LUK","5","21","21","But the scribes and Pharisees began thinking to themselves, “Who is this man who speaks blasphemy? Who can forgive sins but God alone?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_22","072_5_22","LUK","5","22","22","Knowing what they were thinking, Jesus replied, “Why are you thinking these things in your hearts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_23","072_5_23","LUK","5","23","23","Which is easier: to say, ‘Your sins are forgiven,’ or to say, ‘Get up and walk’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_24","072_5_24","LUK","5","24","24","But so that you may know that the Son of Man has authority on the earth to forgive sins ” He said to the paralytic, “I tell you, get up, pick up your mat, and go home.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_25","072_5_25","LUK","5","25","25","And immediately the man stood up before them, took what he had been lying on, and went home glorifying God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_26","072_5_26","LUK","5","26","26","Everyone was taken with amazement and glorified God. They were filled with awe and said, “We have seen remarkable things today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_27","072_5_27","LUK","5","27","27","After this, Jesus went out and saw a tax collector named Levi sitting at the tax booth. “Follow Me,” He told him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_28","072_5_28","LUK","5","28","28","and Levi got up, left everything, and followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_29","072_5_29","LUK","5","29","29","Then Levi hosted a great banquet for Jesus at his house. A large crowd of tax collectors was there, along with others who were eating with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_30","072_5_30","LUK","5","30","30","But their scribes and the Pharisees complained to Jesus’ disciples, “Why do you eat and drink with tax collectors and sinners?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_31","072_5_31","LUK","5","31","31","Jesus answered, “It is not the healthy who need a doctor, but the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_32","072_5_32","LUK","5","32","32","I have not come to call the righteous, but sinners, to repentance.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_33","072_5_33","LUK","5","33","33","Then they said to Him, “Why do John’s disciples and those of the Pharisees frequently fast and pray, but Yours keep on eating and drinking?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_34","072_5_34","LUK","5","34","34","Jesus replied, “Can you make the guests of the bridegroom fast while He is with them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_35","072_5_35","LUK","5","35","35","But the time will come when the bridegroom will be taken from them; then they will fast.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_36","072_5_36","LUK","5","36","36","He also told them a parable: “No one sews a piece of cloth from a new garment onto an old one. If he does, he will tear the new garment as well, and the patch from the new will not match the old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_37","072_5_37","LUK","5","37","37","And no one pours new wine into old wineskins. If he does, the new wine will burst the wineskins, the wine will spill, and the wineskins will be ruined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_38","072_5_38","LUK","5","38","38","Instead, new wine is poured into new wineskins, and both are preserved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK5_39","072_5_39","LUK","5","39","39","And no one after drinking old wine immediately wants new, for he says, ‘The old is better.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_1","072_6_1","LUK","6","1","1","On the second chief Sabbath, Jesus was passing through the grainfields, and His disciples began to pick the heads of grain, rub them in their hands, and eat them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_2","072_6_2","LUK","6","2","2","But some of the Pharisees asked, “Why are you doing what is unlawful to do on the Sabbath?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_3","072_6_3","LUK","6","3","3","Jesus replied, “Have you not read what David did when he and his companions were hungry? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_4","072_6_4","LUK","6","4","4","He entered the house of God, took the consecrated bread and also gave it to his companions, and ate what is lawful only for the priests to eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_5","072_6_5","LUK","6","5","5","Then Jesus declared, “The Son of Man is Lord even of the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_6","072_6_6","LUK","6","6","6","On another Sabbath Jesus entered the synagogue and was teaching, and a man was there whose right hand was withered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_7","072_6_7","LUK","6","7","7","Looking for an accusation against Jesus, the scribes and Pharisees were watching Him closely to see if He would heal on the Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_8","072_6_8","LUK","6","8","8","But Jesus knew their thoughts and said to the man with the withered hand, “Get up and stand among us.” So he got up and stood there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_9","072_6_9","LUK","6","9","9","Then Jesus said to them, “I ask you one thing: Is it lawful on the Sabbath to do good or to do evil, to save life or to destroy it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_10","072_6_10","LUK","6","10","10","And after looking around at all of them, He said to the man, “Stretch out your hand.” He did so, and it was restored as sound as the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_11","072_6_11","LUK","6","11","11","But the scribes and Pharisees were filled with rage and began to discuss with one another what they might do to Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_12","072_6_12","LUK","6","12","12","In those days Jesus went out to the mountain to pray, and He spent the night in prayer to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_13","072_6_13","LUK","6","13","13","When daylight came, He called His disciples to Him and chose twelve of them, whom He also designated as apostles: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_14","072_6_14","LUK","6","14","14","Simon, whom He named Peter, and his brother Andrew; James and John; Philip and Bartholomew; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_15","072_6_15","LUK","6","15","15","Matthew and Thomas; James son of Alphaeus and Simon called the Zealot; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_16","072_6_16","LUK","6","16","16","Judas son of James, and Judas Iscariot, who became a traitor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_17","072_6_17","LUK","6","17","17","Then Jesus came down with them and stood on a level place. A crowd of His disciples was there, along with a great number of people from all over Judea, Jerusalem, and the seacoast of Tyre and Sidon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_18","072_6_18","LUK","6","18","18","They had come to hear Him and to be healed of their diseases, along with those troubled by unclean spirits. And they were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_19","072_6_19","LUK","6","19","19","The entire crowd was trying to touch Him, because power was coming from Him and healing them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_20","072_6_20","LUK","6","20","20","Looking up at His disciples, Jesus said: “Blessed are you who are poor, for yours is the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_21","072_6_21","LUK","6","21","21","Blessed are you who hunger now, for you will be filled. Blessed are you who weep now, for you will laugh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_22","072_6_22","LUK","6","22","22","Blessed are you when people hate you, and when they exclude you and insult you and reject your name as evil because of the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_23","072_6_23","LUK","6","23","23","Rejoice in that day and leap for joy, because great is your reward in heaven. For their fathers treated the prophets in the same way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_24","072_6_24","LUK","6","24","24","But woe to you who are rich, for you have already received your comfort. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_25","072_6_25","LUK","6","25","25","Woe to you who are well fed, for you will hunger. Woe to you who laugh now, for you will mourn and weep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_26","072_6_26","LUK","6","26","26","Woe to you when men speak well of you, for their fathers treated the false prophets in the same way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_27","072_6_27","LUK","6","27","27","But to those of you who will listen, I say: Love your enemies, do good to those who hate you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_28","072_6_28","LUK","6","28","28","bless those who curse you, pray for those who mistreat you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_29","072_6_29","LUK","6","29","29","If someone strikes you on one cheek, turn to him the other also. And if someone takes your cloak, do not withhold your tunic as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_30","072_6_30","LUK","6","30","30","Give to everyone who asks you, and if anyone takes what is yours, do not demand it back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_31","072_6_31","LUK","6","31","31","Do to others as you would have them do to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_32","072_6_32","LUK","6","32","32","If you love those who love you, what credit is that to you? Even sinners love those who love them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_33","072_6_33","LUK","6","33","33","If you do good to those who do good to you, what credit is that to you? For even sinners do the same. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_34","072_6_34","LUK","6","34","34","And if you lend to those from whom you expect repayment, what credit is that to you? For even sinners lend to sinners, expecting to be repaid in full. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_35","072_6_35","LUK","6","35","35","But love your enemies, do good to them, and lend to them, expecting nothing in return. Then your reward will be great, and you will be sons of the Most High; for He is kind to the ungrateful and wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_36","072_6_36","LUK","6","36","36","Therefore be merciful, just as your Father is merciful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_37","072_6_37","LUK","6","37","37","Do not judge, and you will not be judged. Do not condemn, and you will not be condemned. Forgive, and you will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_38","072_6_38","LUK","6","38","38","Give, and it will be given to you. A good measure, pressed down, shaken together, and running over will be poured into your lap. For with the same measure you use, it will be measured back to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_39","072_6_39","LUK","6","39","39","Jesus also told them a parable: “Can a blind man lead a blind man? Will they not both fall into a pit? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_40","072_6_40","LUK","6","40","40","A disciple is not above his teacher, but everyone who is fully trained will be like his teacher. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_41","072_6_41","LUK","6","41","41","Why do you look at the speck in your brother’s eye but fail to notice the beam in your own eye? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_42","072_6_42","LUK","6","42","42","Or how can you say, ‘Brother, let me take the speck out of your eye,’ while you yourself fail to see the beam in your own eye? You hypocrite! First take the beam out of your own eye, and then you will see clearly to remove the speck from your brother’s eye. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_43","072_6_43","LUK","6","43","43","No good tree bears bad fruit, nor does a bad tree bear good fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_44","072_6_44","LUK","6","44","44","For each tree is known by its own fruit. Indeed, figs are not gathered from thornbushes, nor grapes from brambles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_45","072_6_45","LUK","6","45","45","The good man brings good things out of the good treasure of his heart, and the evil man brings evil things out of the evil treasure of his heart. For out of the overflow of the heart, the mouth speaks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_46","072_6_46","LUK","6","46","46","Why do you call Me ‘Lord, Lord,’ but do not do what I say? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_47","072_6_47","LUK","6","47","47","I will show you what he is like who comes to Me and hears My words and acts on them: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_48","072_6_48","LUK","6","48","48","He is like a man building a house, who dug down deep and laid his foundation on the rock. When the flood came, the torrent crashed against that house but could not shake it, because its foundation was on the rock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK6_49","072_6_49","LUK","6","49","49","But the one who hears My words and does not act on them is like a man who built his house on ground without a foundation. The torrent crashed against that house, and immediately it fell—and great was its destruction!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_1","072_7_1","LUK","7","1","1","When Jesus had concluded His discourse in the hearing of the people, He went to Capernaum. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_2","072_7_2","LUK","7","2","2","There a highly valued servant of a centurion was sick and about to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_3","072_7_3","LUK","7","3","3","When the centurion heard about Jesus, he sent some Jewish elders to ask Him to come and heal his servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_4","072_7_4","LUK","7","4","4","They came to Jesus and pleaded with Him earnestly, “This man is worthy to have You grant this, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_5","072_7_5","LUK","7","5","5","for he loves our nation and has built our synagogue.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_6","072_7_6","LUK","7","6","6","So Jesus went with them. But when He was not far from the house, the centurion sent friends with the message: “Lord, do not trouble Yourself, for I am not worthy to have You come under my roof. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_7","072_7_7","LUK","7","7","7","That is why I did not consider myself worthy to come to You. But just say the word, and my servant will be healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_8","072_7_8","LUK","7","8","8","For I myself am a man under authority, with soldiers under me. I tell one to go, and he goes, and another to come, and he comes. I tell my servant to do something, and he does it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_9","072_7_9","LUK","7","9","9","When Jesus heard this, He marveled at the centurion. Turning to the crowd following Him, He said, “I tell you, not even in Israel have I found such great faith.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_10","072_7_10","LUK","7","10","10","And when the messengers returned to the house, they found the ailing servant in good health. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_11","072_7_11","LUK","7","11","11","Soon afterward, Jesus went to a town called Nain. Many of His disciples went with Him, accompanied by a large crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_12","072_7_12","LUK","7","12","12","As He approached the town gate, He saw a dead man being carried out, the only son of his mother, and she was a widow. And a large crowd from the town was with her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_13","072_7_13","LUK","7","13","13","When the Lord saw her, He had compassion on her and said, “Do not weep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_14","072_7_14","LUK","7","14","14","Then He went up and touched the coffin, and those carrying it stood still. “Young man,” He said, “I tell you, get up!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_15","072_7_15","LUK","7","15","15","And the dead man sat up and began to speak! Then Jesus gave him back to his mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_16","072_7_16","LUK","7","16","16","A sense of awe swept over all of them, and they glorified God. “A great prophet has appeared among us!” they said. “God has visited His people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_17","072_7_17","LUK","7","17","17","And the news about Jesus spread throughout Judea and all the surrounding region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_18","072_7_18","LUK","7","18","18","Then John’s disciples informed him about all these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_19","072_7_19","LUK","7","19","19","So John called two of his disciples and sent them to ask Jesus, “Are You the One who was to come, or should we look for someone else?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_20","072_7_20","LUK","7","20","20","When the men came to Jesus, they said, “John the Baptist sent us to ask, ‘Are You the One who was to come, or should we look for someone else?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_21","072_7_21","LUK","7","21","21","Now at that very hour Jesus healed many people of their diseases, afflictions, and evil spirits, and He gave sight to many who were blind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_22","072_7_22","LUK","7","22","22","So Jesus replied, “Go back and report to John what you have seen and heard: The blind receive sight, the lame walk, the lepers are cleansed, the deaf hear, the dead are raised, and the good news is preached to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_23","072_7_23","LUK","7","23","23","Blessed is the one who does not fall away on account of Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_24","072_7_24","LUK","7","24","24","After John’s messengers had left, Jesus began to speak to the crowds about John: “What did you go out into the wilderness to see? A reed swaying in the wind? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_25","072_7_25","LUK","7","25","25","Otherwise, what did you go out to see? A man dressed in fine clothes? Look, those who wear elegant clothing and live in luxury are found in palaces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_26","072_7_26","LUK","7","26","26","What then did you go out to see? A prophet? Yes, I tell you, and more than a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_27","072_7_27","LUK","7","27","27","This is the one about whom it is written: ‘Behold, I will send My messenger ahead of You, who will prepare Your way before You.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_28","072_7_28","LUK","7","28","28","For I tell you, among those born of women there is no one greater prophet than John the Baptist, yet even the least in the kingdom of God is greater than he.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_29","072_7_29","LUK","7","29","29","All the people who heard this, even the tax collectors, acknowledged God’s justice. For they had received the baptism of John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_30","072_7_30","LUK","7","30","30","But the Pharisees and experts in the law rejected God’s purpose for themselves, because they had not been baptized by John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_31","072_7_31","LUK","7","31","31","“To what, then, can I compare the men of this generation? What are they like? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_32","072_7_32","LUK","7","32","32","They are like children sitting in the marketplace and calling out to one another: ‘We played the flute for you, and you did not dance; we sang a dirge for you, and you did not weep.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_33","072_7_33","LUK","7","33","33","For John the Baptist came neither eating bread nor drinking wine, and you say, ‘He has a demon!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_34","072_7_34","LUK","7","34","34","The Son of Man came eating and drinking, and you say, ‘Look at this glutton and drunkard, a friend of tax collectors and sinners!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_35","072_7_35","LUK","7","35","35","But wisdom is vindicated by all her children.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_36","072_7_36","LUK","7","36","36","Then one of the Pharisees invited Jesus to eat with him, and He entered the Pharisee’s house and reclined at the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_37","072_7_37","LUK","7","37","37","When a sinful woman from that town learned that Jesus was dining there, she brought an alabaster jar of perfume. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_38","072_7_38","LUK","7","38","38","As she stood behind Him at His feet weeping, she began to wet His feet with her tears and wipe them with her hair. Then she kissed His feet and anointed them with the perfume. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_39","072_7_39","LUK","7","39","39","When the Pharisee who had invited Jesus saw this, he said to himself, “If this man were a prophet, He would know who this is and what kind of woman is touching Him—for she is a sinner!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_40","072_7_40","LUK","7","40","40","But Jesus answered him, “Simon, I have something to tell you.” “Tell me, Teacher,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_41","072_7_41","LUK","7","41","41","“Two men were debtors to a certain moneylender. One owed him five hundred denarii, and the other fifty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_42","072_7_42","LUK","7","42","42","When they were unable to repay him, he forgave both of them. Tell Me, which one, then, will love him more?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_43","072_7_43","LUK","7","43","43","“I suppose the one who was forgiven more,” Simon replied. “You have judged correctly,” Jesus said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_44","072_7_44","LUK","7","44","44","And turning toward the woman, He said to Simon, “Do you see this woman? When I entered your house, you did not give Me water for My feet, but she wet My feet with her tears and wiped them with the hair of her head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_45","072_7_45","LUK","7","45","45","You did not greet Me with a kiss, but she has not stopped kissing My feet since I arrived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_46","072_7_46","LUK","7","46","46","You did not anoint My head with oil, but she has anointed My feet with perfume. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_47","072_7_47","LUK","7","47","47","Therefore I tell you, her many sins have been forgiven, for she has loved much. But he who has been forgiven little loves little.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_48","072_7_48","LUK","7","48","48","Then Jesus said to her, “Your sins are forgiven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_49","072_7_49","LUK","7","49","49","But those at the table began to say to themselves, “Who is this who even forgives sins?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK7_50","072_7_50","LUK","7","50","50","And Jesus told the woman, “Your faith has saved you; go in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_1","072_8_1","LUK","8","1","1","Soon afterward, Jesus traveled from one town and village to another, preaching and proclaiming the good news of the kingdom of God. The Twelve were with Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_2","072_8_2","LUK","8","2","2","as well as some women who had been healed of evil spirits and infirmities: Mary called Magdalene, from whom seven demons had gone out, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_3","072_8_3","LUK","8","3","3","Joanna the wife of Herod’s household manager Chuza, Susanna, and many others. These women were ministering to them out of their own means. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_4","072_8_4","LUK","8","4","4","While a large crowd was gathering and people were coming to Jesus from town after town, He told them this parable: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_5","072_8_5","LUK","8","5","5","“A farmer went out to sow his seed. And as he was sowing, some seed fell along the path, where it was trampled, and the birds of the air devoured it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_6","072_8_6","LUK","8","6","6","Some fell on rocky ground, and when it came up, the seedlings withered because they had no moisture. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_7","072_8_7","LUK","8","7","7","Other seed fell among thorns, which grew up with it and choked the seedlings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_8","072_8_8","LUK","8","8","8","Still other seed fell on good soil, where it sprang up and produced a crop—a hundredfold.” As Jesus said this, He called out, “He who has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_9","072_8_9","LUK","8","9","9","Then His disciples asked Him what this parable meant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_10","072_8_10","LUK","8","10","10","He replied, “The knowledge of the mysteries of the kingdom of God has been given to you, but to others I speak in parables, so that, ‘though seeing, they may not see; though hearing, they may not understand.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_11","072_8_11","LUK","8","11","11","Now this is the meaning of the parable: The seed is the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_12","072_8_12","LUK","8","12","12","The seeds along the path are those who hear, but the devil comes and takes away the word from their hearts, so that they may not believe and be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_13","072_8_13","LUK","8","13","13","The seeds on rocky ground are those who hear the word and receive it with joy, but they have no root. They believe for a season, but in the time of testing, they fall away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_14","072_8_14","LUK","8","14","14","The seeds that fell among the thorns are those who hear, but as they go on their way, they are choked by the worries, riches, and pleasures of this life, and their fruit does not mature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_15","072_8_15","LUK","8","15","15","But the seeds on good soil are those with a noble and good heart, who hear the word, cling to it, and by persevering produce a crop. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_16","072_8_16","LUK","8","16","16","No one lights a lamp and covers it with a jar or puts it under a bed. Instead, he sets it on a stand, so those who enter can see the light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_17","072_8_17","LUK","8","17","17","For there is nothing hidden that will not be disclosed, and nothing concealed that will not be made known and brought to light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_18","072_8_18","LUK","8","18","18","Pay attention, therefore, to how you listen. Whoever has will be given more, but whoever does not have, even what he thinks he has will be taken away from him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_19","072_8_19","LUK","8","19","19","Then Jesus’ mother and brothers came to see Him, but they were unable to reach Him because of the crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_20","072_8_20","LUK","8","20","20","He was told, “Your mother and brothers are standing outside, wanting to see You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_21","072_8_21","LUK","8","21","21","But He replied, “My mother and brothers are those who hear the word of God and carry it out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_22","072_8_22","LUK","8","22","22","One day Jesus said to His disciples, “Let us cross to the other side of the lake.” So He got into a boat with them and set out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_23","072_8_23","LUK","8","23","23","As they sailed, He fell asleep, and a windstorm came down on the lake, so that the boat was being swamped, and they were in great danger. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_24","072_8_24","LUK","8","24","24","The disciples went and woke Him, saying, “Master, Master, we are perishing!” Then Jesus arose and rebuked the wind and the raging waters, and they subsided, and all was calm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_25","072_8_25","LUK","8","25","25","“Where is your faith?” He asked. Frightened and amazed, they asked one another, “Who is this? He commands even the winds and the water, and they obey Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_26","072_8_26","LUK","8","26","26","Then they sailed to the region of the Gadarenes, across the lake from Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_27","072_8_27","LUK","8","27","27","When Jesus stepped ashore, He was met by a man from the town who had been demon-possessed for a long time. This man had not worn clothing or lived in a house, but he stayed in the tombs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_28","072_8_28","LUK","8","28","28","When the man saw Jesus, he cried out and fell down before Him, shouting in a loud voice, “What do You want with me, Jesus, Son of the Most High God? I beg You not to torture me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_29","072_8_29","LUK","8","29","29","For Jesus had commanded the unclean spirit to come out of the man. Many times it had seized him, and though he was bound with chains and shackles, he had broken the chains and been driven by the demon into solitary places. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_30","072_8_30","LUK","8","30","30","“What is your name?” Jesus asked. “Legion,” he replied, because many demons had gone into him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_31","072_8_31","LUK","8","31","31","And he kept begging Jesus not to order them to go into the Abyss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_32","072_8_32","LUK","8","32","32","There on the hillside a large herd of pigs was feeding. So the demons begged Jesus to let them enter the pigs, and He gave them permission. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_33","072_8_33","LUK","8","33","33","Then the demons came out of the man and went into the pigs, and the herd rushed down the steep bank into the lake and was drowned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_34","072_8_34","LUK","8","34","34","When those tending the pigs saw what had happened, they ran off and reported this in the town and countryside. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_35","072_8_35","LUK","8","35","35","So the people went out to see what had happened. They came to Jesus and found the man whom the demons had left, sitting at Jesus’ feet, clothed and in his right mind; and they were afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_36","072_8_36","LUK","8","36","36","Meanwhile, those who had seen it reported how the demon-possessed man had been healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_37","072_8_37","LUK","8","37","37","Then all the people of the region of the Gadarenes asked Jesus to depart from them, because great fear had taken hold of them. So He got into the boat and started back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_38","072_8_38","LUK","8","38","38","The man whom the demons had left begged to go with Jesus. But Jesus sent him away, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_39","072_8_39","LUK","8","39","39","“Return home and describe how much God has done for you.” So the man went away and proclaimed all over the town how much Jesus had done for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_40","072_8_40","LUK","8","40","40","When Jesus returned, the crowd welcomed Him, for they had all been waiting for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_41","072_8_41","LUK","8","41","41","Just then a synagogue leader named Jairus came and fell at Jesus’ feet. He begged Him to come to his house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_42","072_8_42","LUK","8","42","42","because his only daughter, who was about twelve, was dying. As Jesus went with him, the crowds pressed around Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_43","072_8_43","LUK","8","43","43","including a woman who had suffered from bleeding for twelve years. She had spent all her money on physicians, but no one was able to heal her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_44","072_8_44","LUK","8","44","44","She came up behind Jesus and touched the fringe of His cloak, and immediately her bleeding stopped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_45","072_8_45","LUK","8","45","45","“Who touched Me?” Jesus asked. But they all denied it. “Master,” said Peter and those with him, “the people are crowding and pressing against You, and You say, ‘Who touched Me?’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_46","072_8_46","LUK","8","46","46","But Jesus declared, “Someone touched Me, for I know that power has gone out from Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_47","072_8_47","LUK","8","47","47","Then the woman, seeing that she could not escape notice, came trembling and fell down before Him. In the presence of all the people, she explained why she had touched Him and how she had immediately been healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_48","072_8_48","LUK","8","48","48","“Take courage, daughter,” said Jesus, “your faith has healed you. Go in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_49","072_8_49","LUK","8","49","49","While He was still speaking, someone arrived from the house of the synagogue leader. “Your daughter is dead,” he told Jairus. “Do not bother the Teacher.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_50","072_8_50","LUK","8","50","50","But Jesus overheard them and said to Jairus, “Do not be afraid; just believe, and she will be healed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_51","072_8_51","LUK","8","51","51","When He entered the house, He did not allow anyone to go in except Peter, John, James, and the child’s father and mother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_52","072_8_52","LUK","8","52","52","Meanwhile, everyone was weeping and mourning for her. But Jesus said, “Stop weeping; she is not dead but asleep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_53","072_8_53","LUK","8","53","53","And they laughed at Him, knowing that she was dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_54","072_8_54","LUK","8","54","54","But Jesus sent them all outside, took her by the hand, and called out, “Child, get up!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_55","072_8_55","LUK","8","55","55","Her spirit returned, and at once she got up. And He directed that she be given something to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK8_56","072_8_56","LUK","8","56","56","Her parents were astounded, but Jesus ordered them not to tell anyone what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_1","072_9_1","LUK","9","1","1","Then Jesus called the Twelve together and gave them power and authority over all demons, and power to cure diseases. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_2","072_9_2","LUK","9","2","2","And He sent them out to proclaim the kingdom of God and to heal the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_3","072_9_3","LUK","9","3","3","“Take nothing for the journey,” He told them, “no staffs, no bag, no bread, no money, no second tunic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_4","072_9_4","LUK","9","4","4","Whatever house you enter, stay there until you leave that area. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_5","072_9_5","LUK","9","5","5","If anyone does not welcome you, shake the dust off your feet when you leave that town, as a testimony against them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_6","072_9_6","LUK","9","6","6","So they set out and went from village to village, preaching the gospel and healing people everywhere. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_7","072_9_7","LUK","9","7","7","When Herod the tetrarch heard about all that was being done by Him, he was perplexed. For some were saying that John had risen from the dead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_8","072_9_8","LUK","9","8","8","others that Elijah had appeared, and still others that a prophet of old had arisen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_9","072_9_9","LUK","9","9","9","“I beheaded John,” Herod said, “but who is this man I hear such things about?” And he kept trying to see Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_10","072_9_10","LUK","9","10","10","Then the apostles returned and reported to Jesus all that they had done. Taking them away privately, He withdrew to a deserted place of the city called Bethsaida. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_11","072_9_11","LUK","9","11","11","But the crowds found out and followed Him. He welcomed them and spoke to them about the kingdom of God, and He healed those who needed healing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_12","072_9_12","LUK","9","12","12","As the day neared its end, the Twelve came to Jesus and said, “Dismiss the crowd so they can go to the surrounding villages and countryside for lodging and provisions. For we are in a desolate place here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_13","072_9_13","LUK","9","13","13","But Jesus told them, “You give them something to eat.” “We have only five loaves of bread and two fish,” they answered, “unless we go and buy food for all these people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_14","072_9_14","LUK","9","14","14","(There were about five thousand men.) He told His disciples, “Have them sit down in groups of fifty each.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_15","072_9_15","LUK","9","15","15","They did so, and everyone was seated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_16","072_9_16","LUK","9","16","16","Taking the five loaves and the two fish and looking up to heaven, Jesus spoke a blessing and broke them. Then He gave them to the disciples to set before the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_17","072_9_17","LUK","9","17","17","They all ate and were satisfied, and the disciples picked up twelve basketfuls of broken pieces that were left over. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_18","072_9_18","LUK","9","18","18","One day as Jesus was praying in private and the disciples were with Him, He questioned them: “Who do the crowds say I am?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_19","072_9_19","LUK","9","19","19","They replied, “Some say John the Baptist; others say Elijah; and still others, that a prophet of old has arisen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_20","072_9_20","LUK","9","20","20","“But what about you?” Jesus asked. “Who do you say I am?” Peter answered, “The Christ of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_21","072_9_21","LUK","9","21","21","Jesus strictly warned them not to tell this to anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_22","072_9_22","LUK","9","22","22","“The Son of Man must suffer many things,” He said. “He must be rejected by the elders, chief priests, and scribes, and He must be killed and on the third day rise again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_23","072_9_23","LUK","9","23","23","Then Jesus said to all of them, “If anyone wants to come after Me, he must deny himself and take up his cross and follow Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_24","072_9_24","LUK","9","24","24","For whoever wants to save his life will lose it, but whoever loses his life for My sake will save it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_25","072_9_25","LUK","9","25","25","What does it profit a man to gain the whole world, yet lose or forfeit his very self? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_26","072_9_26","LUK","9","26","26","If anyone is ashamed of Me and My words, the Son of Man will be ashamed of him when He comes in His glory and in the glory of the Father and of the holy angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_27","072_9_27","LUK","9","27","27","But I tell you truly, some who are standing here will not taste death before they see the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_28","072_9_28","LUK","9","28","28","About eight days after Jesus had said these things, He took with Him Peter, John, and James, and went up on a mountain to pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_29","072_9_29","LUK","9","29","29","And as He was praying, the appearance of His face changed, and His clothes became radiantly white. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_30","072_9_30","LUK","9","30","30","Suddenly two men, Moses and Elijah, began talking with Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_31","072_9_31","LUK","9","31","31","They appeared in glory and spoke about His departure, which He was about to accomplish at Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_32","072_9_32","LUK","9","32","32","Meanwhile Peter and his companions were overcome by sleep, but when they awoke, they saw Jesus’ glory and the two men standing with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_33","072_9_33","LUK","9","33","33","As Moses and Elijah were leaving, Peter said to Jesus, “Master, it is good for us to be here. Let us put up three shelters—one for You, one for Moses, and one for Elijah.” (He did not know what he was saying.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_34","072_9_34","LUK","9","34","34","While Peter was speaking, a cloud appeared and enveloped them, and they were afraid as they entered the cloud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_35","072_9_35","LUK","9","35","35","And a voice came from the cloud, saying, “This is My beloved Son. Listen to Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_36","072_9_36","LUK","9","36","36","After the voice had spoken, only Jesus was present with them. The disciples kept this to themselves, and in those days they did not tell anyone what they had seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_37","072_9_37","LUK","9","37","37","The next day, when they came down from the mountain, Jesus was met by a large crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_38","072_9_38","LUK","9","38","38","Suddenly a man in the crowd cried out, “Teacher, I beg You to look at my son, for he is my only child. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_39","072_9_39","LUK","9","39","39","A spirit keeps seizing him, and he screams abruptly. It throws him into convulsions so that he foams at the mouth. It keeps mauling him and rarely departs from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_40","072_9_40","LUK","9","40","40","I begged Your disciples to drive it out, but they were unable.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_41","072_9_41","LUK","9","41","41","“O unbelieving and perverse generation!” Jesus replied. “How long must I remain with you and put up with you? Bring your son here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_42","072_9_42","LUK","9","42","42","Even while the boy was approaching, the demon slammed him to the ground in a convulsion. But Jesus rebuked the unclean spirit, healed the boy, and gave him back to his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_43","072_9_43","LUK","9","43","43","And they were all astonished at the greatness of God. While everyone was marveling at all that Jesus had done, He said to His disciples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_44","072_9_44","LUK","9","44","44","“Let these words sink into your ears: The Son of Man is about to be delivered into the hands of men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_45","072_9_45","LUK","9","45","45","But they did not understand this statement. It was veiled from them so that they could not comprehend it, and they were afraid to ask Him about it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_46","072_9_46","LUK","9","46","46","Then an argument started among the disciples as to which of them would be the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_47","072_9_47","LUK","9","47","47","But Jesus, seeing the thoughts of their hearts, had a little child stand beside Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_48","072_9_48","LUK","9","48","48","And He said to them, “Whoever welcomes this little child in My name welcomes Me, and whoever welcomes Me welcomes the One who sent Me. For whoever is the least among all of you, he will be the greatest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_49","072_9_49","LUK","9","49","49","“Master,” said John, “we saw someone driving out demons in Your name, and we tried to stop him, because he does not accompany us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_50","072_9_50","LUK","9","50","50","“Do not stop him,” Jesus replied, “for whoever is not against us is for us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_51","072_9_51","LUK","9","51","51","As the day of His ascension approached, Jesus resolutely set out for Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_52","072_9_52","LUK","9","52","52","He sent messengers on ahead, who went into a village of the Samaritans to make arrangements for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_53","072_9_53","LUK","9","53","53","But the people there refused to welcome Him, because He was heading for Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_54","072_9_54","LUK","9","54","54","When His disciples James and John saw this, they asked, “Lord, do You want us to call down fire from heaven to consume them, just as Elijah did?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_55","072_9_55","LUK","9","55","55","But Jesus turned and rebuked them and said, “You do not know what kind of spirit you are. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_56","072_9_56","LUK","9","56","56","For the Son of Man did not come to destroy the lives of men, but to save them.” And He and His disciples went on to another village. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_57","072_9_57","LUK","9","57","57","As they were walking along the road, someone said to Jesus, “Lord, I will follow You wherever You go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_58","072_9_58","LUK","9","58","58","Jesus replied, “Foxes have dens and birds of the air have nests, but the Son of Man has no place to lay His head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_59","072_9_59","LUK","9","59","59","Then He said to another man, “Follow Me.” The man replied, “Lord, first let me go and bury my father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_60","072_9_60","LUK","9","60","60","But Jesus told him, “Let the dead bury their own dead. You, however, go and proclaim the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_61","072_9_61","LUK","9","61","61","Still another said, “I will follow You, Lord; but first let me bid farewell to my family.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK9_62","072_9_62","LUK","9","62","62","Then Jesus declared, “No one who puts his hand to the plow and then looks back is fit for the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_1","072_10_1","LUK","10","1","1","After this, the Lord appointed seventy others and sent them two by two ahead of Him to every town and place He was about to visit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_2","072_10_2","LUK","10","2","2","Therefore He told them, “The harvest is plentiful, but the workers are few. Ask the Lord of the harvest, therefore, to send out workers into His harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_3","072_10_3","LUK","10","3","3","Go! I am sending you out like lambs among wolves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_4","072_10_4","LUK","10","4","4","Carry no purse or bag or sandals. Do not greet anyone along the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_5","072_10_5","LUK","10","5","5","Whatever house you enter, begin by saying, ‘Peace to this house.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_6","072_10_6","LUK","10","6","6","If a man of peace is there, your peace will rest on him; if not, it will return to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_7","072_10_7","LUK","10","7","7","Stay at the same house, eating and drinking whatever you are offered. For the worker is worthy of his wages. Do not move around from house to house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_8","072_10_8","LUK","10","8","8","If you enter a town and they welcome you, eat whatever is set before you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_9","072_10_9","LUK","10","9","9","Heal the sick who are there and tell them, ‘The kingdom of God is near you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_10","072_10_10","LUK","10","10","10","But if you enter a town and they do not welcome you, go into the streets and declare, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_11","072_10_11","LUK","10","11","11","‘Even the dust of your town that clings to us, we wipe off as a testimony against you. Yet be sure of this: The kingdom of God is near to you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_12","072_10_12","LUK","10","12","12","I tell you, it will be more bearable on that day for Sodom than for that town. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_13","072_10_13","LUK","10","13","13","Woe to you, Chorazin! Woe to you, Bethsaida! For if the miracles that were performed in you had been performed in Tyre and Sidon, they would have repented long ago, sitting in sackcloth and ashes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_14","072_10_14","LUK","10","14","14","But it will be more bearable for Tyre and Sidon at the judgment than for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_15","072_10_15","LUK","10","15","15","And you, Capernaum, who are exalted to heaven, will be brought down to Hades! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_16","072_10_16","LUK","10","16","16","Whoever listens to you listens to Me; whoever rejects you rejects Me; and whoever rejects Me rejects the One who sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_17","072_10_17","LUK","10","17","17","The seventy returned with joy and said, “Lord, even the demons submit to us in Your name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_18","072_10_18","LUK","10","18","18","So He told them, “I saw Satan fall like lightning from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_19","072_10_19","LUK","10","19","19","Behold, I am giving you authority to tread on snakes and scorpions, and over all the power of the enemy. Nothing will harm you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_20","072_10_20","LUK","10","20","20","Nevertheless, do not rejoice that the spirits submit to you, but rejoice that your names are written in heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_21","072_10_21","LUK","10","21","21","At that time Jesus rejoiced in the Spirit and declared, “I praise You, Father, Lord of heaven and earth, because You have hidden these things from the wise and learned, and revealed them to little children. Yes, Father, for this was well-pleasing in Your sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_22","072_10_22","LUK","10","22","22","And turning to the disciples, He said, “All things have been entrusted to Me by My Father. No one knows who the Son is except the Father, and no one knows who the Father is except the Son and those to whom the Son chooses to reveal Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_23","072_10_23","LUK","10","23","23","Then Jesus turned to the disciples and said privately, “Blessed are the eyes that see what you see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_24","072_10_24","LUK","10","24","24","For I tell you that many prophets and kings desired to see what you see but did not see it, and to hear what you hear but did not hear it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_25","072_10_25","LUK","10","25","25","One day an expert in the law stood up to test Him. “Teacher,” he asked, “what must I do to inherit eternal life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_26","072_10_26","LUK","10","26","26","“What is written in the Law?” Jesus replied. “How do you read it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_27","072_10_27","LUK","10","27","27","He answered, “‘Love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your strength and with all your mind’ and ‘Love your neighbor as yourself.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_28","072_10_28","LUK","10","28","28","“You have answered correctly,” Jesus said. “Do this and you will live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_29","072_10_29","LUK","10","29","29","But wanting to justify himself, he asked Jesus, “And who is my neighbor?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_30","072_10_30","LUK","10","30","30","Jesus took up this question and said, “A man was going down from Jerusalem to Jericho when he fell into the hands of robbers. They stripped him, beat him, and went away, leaving him half dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_31","072_10_31","LUK","10","31","31","Now by chance a priest was going down the same road, but when he saw him, he passed by on the other side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_32","072_10_32","LUK","10","32","32","So too, when a Levite came to that spot and saw him, he passed by on the other side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_33","072_10_33","LUK","10","33","33","But a Samaritan on a journey came upon him, and when he saw him, he had compassion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_34","072_10_34","LUK","10","34","34","He went to him and bandaged his wounds, pouring on oil and wine. Then he put him on his own animal, brought him to an inn, and took care of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_35","072_10_35","LUK","10","35","35","The next day when he departed he took out two denarii and gave them to the innkeeper. ‘Take care of him,’ he said, ‘and on my return I will repay you for any additional expense.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_36","072_10_36","LUK","10","36","36","So which of these three do you think was a neighbor to the man who fell into the hands of robbers?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_37","072_10_37","LUK","10","37","37","“The one who showed him mercy,” replied the expert in the law. Then Jesus told him, “Go and do likewise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_38","072_10_38","LUK","10","38","38","As they traveled along, Jesus entered a village where a woman named Martha welcomed Him into her home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_39","072_10_39","LUK","10","39","39","She had a sister named Mary, who sat at Jesus’ feet listening to His message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_40","072_10_40","LUK","10","40","40","But Martha was distracted by all the preparations to be made. She came to Jesus and said, “Lord, do You not care that my sister has left me to serve alone? Tell her to help me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_41","072_10_41","LUK","10","41","41","“Martha, Martha,” Jesus replied, “you are worried and troubled about many things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK10_42","072_10_42","LUK","10","42","42","But only one thing is necessary. Mary has chosen the good portion, and it will not be taken away from her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_1","072_11_1","LUK","11","1","1","One day in a place where Jesus had just finished praying, one of His disciples requested, “Lord, teach us to pray, just as John taught his disciples.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_2","072_11_2","LUK","11","2","2","So Jesus told them, “When you pray, say: ‘Our Father in heaven, hallowed be Your name. Your kingdom come, Your will be done, on earth as it is in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_3","072_11_3","LUK","11","3","3","Give us each day our daily bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_4","072_11_4","LUK","11","4","4","And forgive us our sins, for we also forgive everyone who sins against us. And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from the evil one.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_5","072_11_5","LUK","11","5","5","Then Jesus said to them, “Suppose one of you goes to his friend at midnight and says, ‘Friend, lend me three loaves of bread, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_6","072_11_6","LUK","11","6","6","because a friend has come to me on a journey, and I have nothing to set before him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_7","072_11_7","LUK","11","7","7","And suppose the one inside answers, ‘Do not bother me. My door is already shut, and my children and I are in bed. I cannot get up to give you anything.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_8","072_11_8","LUK","11","8","8","I tell you, even though he will not get up to provide for him because of his friendship, yet because of the man’s persistence, he will get up and give him as much as he needs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_9","072_11_9","LUK","11","9","9","So I tell you: Ask, and it will be given to you; seek, and you will find; knock, and the door will be opened to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_10","072_11_10","LUK","11","10","10","For everyone who asks receives; he who seeks finds; and to him who knocks, the door will be opened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_11","072_11_11","LUK","11","11","11","What father among you, if his son asks for bread, will give him a stone? Or if he asks for a fish, will give him a snake instead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_12","072_11_12","LUK","11","12","12","Or if he asks for an egg, will give him a scorpion? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_13","072_11_13","LUK","11","13","13","So if you who are evil know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more will your Father in heaven give the Holy Spirit to those who ask Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_14","072_11_14","LUK","11","14","14","One day Jesus was driving out a demon that was mute. And when the demon was gone, the man who had been mute spoke. The crowds were amazed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_15","072_11_15","LUK","11","15","15","but some of them said, “It is by Beelzebul, the prince of the demons, that He drives out demons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_16","072_11_16","LUK","11","16","16","And others tested Him by demanding a sign from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_17","072_11_17","LUK","11","17","17","Knowing their thoughts, Jesus said to them, “Every kingdom divided against itself will be laid waste, and a house divided against a house will fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_18","072_11_18","LUK","11","18","18","If Satan is divided against himself, how can his kingdom stand? After all, you say that I drive out demons by Beelzebul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_19","072_11_19","LUK","11","19","19","And if I drive out demons by Beelzebul, by whom do your sons drive them out? So then, they will be your judges. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_20","072_11_20","LUK","11","20","20","But if I drive out demons by the finger of God, then the kingdom of God has come upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_21","072_11_21","LUK","11","21","21","When a strong man, fully armed, guards his house, his possessions are secure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_22","072_11_22","LUK","11","22","22","But when someone stronger attacks and overpowers him, he takes away the armor in which the man trusted, and then he divides up his plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_23","072_11_23","LUK","11","23","23","He who is not with Me is against Me, and he who does not gather with Me scatters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_24","072_11_24","LUK","11","24","24","When an unclean spirit comes out of a man, it passes through arid places seeking rest and does not find it. Then it says, ‘I will return to the house I left.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_25","072_11_25","LUK","11","25","25","On its return, it finds the house swept clean and put in order. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_26","072_11_26","LUK","11","26","26","Then it goes and brings seven other spirits more wicked than itself, and they go and dwell there. And the final plight of that man is worse than the first.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_27","072_11_27","LUK","11","27","27","As Jesus was saying these things, a woman in the crowd raised her voice and said, “Blessed is the womb that bore You, and blessed are the breasts that nursed You!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_28","072_11_28","LUK","11","28","28","But He replied, “Blessed rather are those who hear the word of God and obey it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_29","072_11_29","LUK","11","29","29","As the crowds were increasing, Jesus said, “This is a wicked generation. It seeks a sign, but none will be given it except the sign of Jonah the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_30","072_11_30","LUK","11","30","30","For as Jonah was a sign to the Ninevites, so the Son of Man will be a sign to this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_31","072_11_31","LUK","11","31","31","The Queen of the South will rise at the judgment with the men of this generation and condemn them; for she came from the ends of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon, and now One greater than Solomon is here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_32","072_11_32","LUK","11","32","32","The men of Nineveh will stand at the judgment with this generation and condemn it; for they repented at the preaching of Jonah, and now One greater than Jonah is here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_33","072_11_33","LUK","11","33","33","No one lights a lamp and puts it in a cellar or under a basket. Instead, he sets it on a stand, so those who enter can see the light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_34","072_11_34","LUK","11","34","34","The eye is the lamp of the body. So when your eyes are good, your whole body also is full of light. But when they are bad, your body is full of darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_35","072_11_35","LUK","11","35","35","Be careful, then, that the light within you is not darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_36","072_11_36","LUK","11","36","36","So if your whole body is full of light, with no part of it in darkness, you will be radiant, as though a lamp were shining on you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_37","072_11_37","LUK","11","37","37","As Jesus was speaking, a Pharisee invited Him to dine with him; so He went in and reclined at the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_38","072_11_38","LUK","11","38","38","But the Pharisee was surprised to see that Jesus did not first wash before the meal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_39","072_11_39","LUK","11","39","39","Then the Lord said, “Now you Pharisees clean the outside of the cup and dish, but inside you are full of greed and wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_40","072_11_40","LUK","11","40","40","You fools! Did not the One who made the outside make the inside as well? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_41","072_11_41","LUK","11","41","41","But give as alms the things that are within you, and behold, everything will be clean for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_42","072_11_42","LUK","11","42","42","Woe to you Pharisees! For you pay tithes of mint, rue, and every herb, but you disregard justice and the love of God. You should have practiced the latter without neglecting the former. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_43","072_11_43","LUK","11","43","43","Woe to you Pharisees! For you love the chief seats in the synagogues and the greetings in the marketplaces. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_44","072_11_44","LUK","11","44","44","Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, you hypocrites! For you are like unmarked graves, which men walk over without even noticing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_45","072_11_45","LUK","11","45","45","One of the experts in the law told Him, “Teacher, when You say these things, You insult us as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_46","072_11_46","LUK","11","46","46","“Woe to you as well, experts in the law!” He replied. “For you weigh men down with heavy burdens, but you yourselves will not lift a finger to lighten their load. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_47","072_11_47","LUK","11","47","47","Woe to you! For you build tombs for the prophets, but it was your fathers who killed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_48","072_11_48","LUK","11","48","48","So you bear witness and consent to the deeds of your fathers: They killed the prophets, and you build their tombs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_49","072_11_49","LUK","11","49","49","Because of this, the wisdom of God said, ‘I will send them prophets and apostles; some of them they will kill and others they will persecute.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_50","072_11_50","LUK","11","50","50","As a result, this generation will be charged with the blood of all the prophets that has been shed since the foundation of the world, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_51","072_11_51","LUK","11","51","51","from the blood of Abel to the blood of Zechariah, who was killed between the altar and the sanctuary. Yes, I tell you, all of it will be charged to this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_52","072_11_52","LUK","11","52","52","Woe to you experts in the law! For you have taken away the key to knowledge. You yourselves have not entered, and you have hindered those who were entering.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_53","072_11_53","LUK","11","53","53","As Jesus said these things to them, the scribes and Pharisees began to oppose Him bitterly and to ply Him with questions about many things, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK11_54","072_11_54","LUK","11","54","54","lying in wait for Him and seeking to catch Him in something He might say, so that they might accuse Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_1","072_12_1","LUK","12","1","1","In the meantime, a crowd of many thousands had gathered, so that they were trampling one another. Jesus began to speak first to His disciples: “Beware of the leaven of the Pharisees, which is hypocrisy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_2","072_12_2","LUK","12","2","2","There is nothing concealed that will not be disclosed, and nothing hidden that will not be made known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_3","072_12_3","LUK","12","3","3","What you have spoken in the dark will be heard in the daylight, and what you have whispered in the inner rooms will be proclaimed from the housetops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_4","072_12_4","LUK","12","4","4","I tell you, My friends, do not be afraid of those who kill the body and after that can do no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_5","072_12_5","LUK","12","5","5","But I will show you whom you should fear: Fear the One who, after you have been killed, has authority to throw you into hell. Yes, I tell you, fear Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_6","072_12_6","LUK","12","6","6","Are not five sparrows sold for two pennies? Yet not one of them is forgotten by God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_7","072_12_7","LUK","12","7","7","And even the very hairs of your head are all numbered. So do not be afraid; you are worth more than many sparrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_8","072_12_8","LUK","12","8","8","I tell you, everyone who confesses Me before men, the Son of Man will also confess him before the angels of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_9","072_12_9","LUK","12","9","9","But whoever denies Me before men will be denied before the angels of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_10","072_12_10","LUK","12","10","10","And everyone who speaks a word against the Son of Man will be forgiven, but whoever blasphemes against the Holy Spirit will not be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_11","072_12_11","LUK","12","11","11","When you are brought before synagogues, rulers, and authorities, do not worry about how to defend yourselves or what to say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_12","072_12_12","LUK","12","12","12","For at that time the Holy Spirit will teach you what you should say.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_13","072_12_13","LUK","12","13","13","Someone in the crowd said to Him, “Teacher, tell my brother to divide the inheritance with me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_14","072_12_14","LUK","12","14","14","But Jesus replied, “Man, who appointed Me judge or executor between you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_15","072_12_15","LUK","12","15","15","And He said to them, “Watch out! Guard yourselves against greed, for one’s life does not consist in the abundance of his possessions.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_16","072_12_16","LUK","12","16","16","Then He told them a parable: “The ground of a certain rich man produced an abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_17","072_12_17","LUK","12","17","17","So he thought to himself, ‘What shall I do, since I have nowhere to store my crops?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_18","072_12_18","LUK","12","18","18","Then he said, ‘This is what I will do: I will tear down my barns and will build bigger ones, and there I will store up all my crops and my goods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_19","072_12_19","LUK","12","19","19","Then I will say to myself, “You have plenty of good things laid up for many years. Take it easy. Eat, drink, and be merry!”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_20","072_12_20","LUK","12","20","20","But God said to him, ‘You fool! This very night your life will be required of you. Then who will own what you have accumulated?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_21","072_12_21","LUK","12","21","21","This is how it will be for anyone who stores up treasure for himself but is not rich toward God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_22","072_12_22","LUK","12","22","22","Then Jesus said to His disciples, “Therefore I tell you, do not worry about your life, what you will eat, or about your body, what you will wear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_23","072_12_23","LUK","12","23","23","Life is more than food, and the body more than clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_24","072_12_24","LUK","12","24","24","Consider the ravens: They do not sow or reap, they have no storehouse or barn; yet God feeds them. How much more valuable you are than the birds! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_25","072_12_25","LUK","12","25","25","Who of you by worrying can add a single hour to his life? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_26","072_12_26","LUK","12","26","26","So if you cannot do such a small thing, why do you worry about the rest? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_27","072_12_27","LUK","12","27","27","Consider how the lilies grow: They do not labor or spin. Yet I tell you, not even Solomon in all his glory was adorned like one of these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_28","072_12_28","LUK","12","28","28","If that is how God clothes the grass of the field, which is here today and tomorrow is thrown into the furnace, how much more will He clothe you, O you of little faith! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_29","072_12_29","LUK","12","29","29","And do not be concerned about what you will eat or drink. Do not worry about it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_30","072_12_30","LUK","12","30","30","For the Gentiles of the world strive after all these things, and your Father knows that you need them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_31","072_12_31","LUK","12","31","31","But seek the kingdom of God, and all these things will be added unto you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_32","072_12_32","LUK","12","32","32","Do not be afraid, little flock, for your Father is pleased to give you the kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_33","072_12_33","LUK","12","33","33","Sell your possessions and give to the poor. Provide yourselves with purses that will not wear out, an inexhaustible treasure in heaven, where no thief approaches and no moth destroys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_34","072_12_34","LUK","12","34","34","For where your treasure is, there your heart will be also. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_35","072_12_35","LUK","12","35","35","Be dressed for service and keep your lamps burning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_36","072_12_36","LUK","12","36","36","Then you will be like servants waiting for their master to return from the wedding banquet, so that when he comes and knocks, they can open the door for him at once. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_37","072_12_37","LUK","12","37","37","Blessed are those servants whom the master finds on watch when he returns. Truly I tell you, he will dress himself to serve and will have them recline at the table, and he himself will come and wait on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_38","072_12_38","LUK","12","38","38","Even if he comes in the second or third watch of the night and finds them alert, those servants will be blessed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_39","072_12_39","LUK","12","39","39","But understand this: If the homeowner had known at what hour the thief was coming, he would have kept watch and would not have let his house be broken into. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_40","072_12_40","LUK","12","40","40","Therefore you also must be ready, because the Son of Man will come at an hour you do not expect.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_41","072_12_41","LUK","12","41","41","“Lord,” said Peter, “are You addressing this parable to us, or to everyone else as well?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_42","072_12_42","LUK","12","42","42","And the Lord answered, “Who then is the faithful and wise manager, whom the master puts in charge of his servants to give them their portion at the proper time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_43","072_12_43","LUK","12","43","43","Blessed is that servant whose master finds him doing so when he returns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_44","072_12_44","LUK","12","44","44","Truly I tell you, he will put him in charge of all his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_45","072_12_45","LUK","12","45","45","But suppose that servant says in his heart, ‘My master will be a long time in coming,’ and he begins to beat the menservants and maidservants, and to eat and drink and get drunk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_46","072_12_46","LUK","12","46","46","The master of that servant will come on a day he does not expect and at an hour he does not anticipate. Then he will cut him to pieces and assign him a place with the unbelievers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_47","072_12_47","LUK","12","47","47","That servant who knows his master’s will but does not get ready or follow his instructions will be beaten with many blows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_48","072_12_48","LUK","12","48","48","But the one who unknowingly does things worthy of punishment will be beaten with few blows. From everyone who has been given much, much will be required; and from him who has been entrusted with much, even more will be demanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_49","072_12_49","LUK","12","49","49","I have come to bring fire to the earth, and how I wish it were already kindled! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_50","072_12_50","LUK","12","50","50","But I have a baptism to undergo, and how distressed I am until it is accomplished! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_51","072_12_51","LUK","12","51","51","Do you think that I have come to bring peace to the earth? No, I tell you, but division. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_52","072_12_52","LUK","12","52","52","From now on, five in one household will be divided, three against two and two against three. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_53","072_12_53","LUK","12","53","53","They will be divided, father against son and son against father, mother against daughter and daughter against mother, mother-in-law against daughter-in-law and daughter-in-law against mother-in-law.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_54","072_12_54","LUK","12","54","54","Then Jesus said to the crowds, “As soon as you see a cloud rising from the west, you say, ‘A shower is coming,’ and that is what happens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_55","072_12_55","LUK","12","55","55","And when the south wind blows, you say, ‘It will be hot,’ and it is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_56","072_12_56","LUK","12","56","56","You hypocrites! You know how to interpret the appearance of the earth and sky. Why can’t you interpret the present time? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_57","072_12_57","LUK","12","57","57","And why don’t you judge for yourselves what is right? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_58","072_12_58","LUK","12","58","58","Make every effort to reconcile with your adversary while you are on your way to the magistrate. Otherwise, he may drag you off to the judge, and the judge may hand you over to the officer, and the officer may throw you into prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK12_59","072_12_59","LUK","12","59","59","I tell you, you will not get out until you have paid the very last penny.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_1","072_13_1","LUK","13","1","1","At that time some of those present told Jesus about the Galileans whose blood Pilate had mixed with their sacrifices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_2","072_13_2","LUK","13","2","2","To this Jesus replied, “Do you think that these Galileans were worse sinners than all the other Galileans, because they suffered this way? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_3","072_13_3","LUK","13","3","3","No, I tell you. But unless you repent, you too will all perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_4","072_13_4","LUK","13","4","4","Or those eighteen who were killed when the tower of Siloam collapsed on them: Do you think that they were more sinful than all the others living in Jerusalem? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_5","072_13_5","LUK","13","5","5","No, I tell you. But unless you repent, you too will all perish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_6","072_13_6","LUK","13","6","6","Then Jesus told this parable: “A man had a fig tree that was planted in his vineyard. He went to look for fruit on it but did not find any. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_7","072_13_7","LUK","13","7","7","So he said to the keeper of the vineyard, ‘Look, for the past three years I have come to search for fruit on this fig tree and haven’t found any. Cut it down! Why should it use up the soil?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_8","072_13_8","LUK","13","8","8","‘Sir,’ the man replied, ‘leave it alone again this year, until I dig around it and fertilize it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_9","072_13_9","LUK","13","9","9","If it bears fruit, fine. But if not, you can cut it down next year.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_10","072_13_10","LUK","13","10","10","One Sabbath Jesus was teaching in one of the synagogues, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_11","072_13_11","LUK","13","11","11","and a woman there had been disabled by a spirit for eighteen years. She was hunched over and could not stand up straight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_12","072_13_12","LUK","13","12","12","When Jesus saw her, He called her over and said, “Woman, you are set free from your disability.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_13","072_13_13","LUK","13","13","13","Then He placed His hands on her, and immediately she straightened up and began to glorify God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_14","072_13_14","LUK","13","14","14","But the synagogue leader was indignant that Jesus had healed on the Sabbath. “There are six days for work,” he told the crowd. “So come and be healed on those days and not on the Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_15","072_13_15","LUK","13","15","15","“You hypocrites!” the Lord replied. “Does not each of you on the Sabbath untie his ox or donkey from the stall and lead it to water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_16","072_13_16","LUK","13","16","16","Then should not this daughter of Abraham, whom Satan has kept bound for eighteen long years, be released from her bondage on the Sabbath day?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_17","072_13_17","LUK","13","17","17","When Jesus said this, all His adversaries were humiliated. And the whole crowd rejoiced at all the glorious things He was doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_18","072_13_18","LUK","13","18","18","Then Jesus asked, “What is the kingdom of God like? To what can I compare it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_19","072_13_19","LUK","13","19","19","It is like a mustard seed that a man tossed into his garden. It grew and became a great tree, and the birds of the air nested in its branches.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_20","072_13_20","LUK","13","20","20","Again He asked, “To what can I compare the kingdom of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_21","072_13_21","LUK","13","21","21","It is like leaven that a woman took and mixed into three measures of flour, until all of it was leavened.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_22","072_13_22","LUK","13","22","22","Then Jesus traveled throughout the towns and villages, teaching as He made His way toward Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_23","072_13_23","LUK","13","23","23","“Lord,” someone asked Him, “will only a few people be saved?” Jesus answered, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_24","072_13_24","LUK","13","24","24","“Make every effort to enter through the narrow gate. For many, I tell you, will try to enter and will not be able. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_25","072_13_25","LUK","13","25","25","After the master of the house gets up and shuts the door, you will stand outside knocking and saying, ‘Lord, Lord, open the door for us.’ But he will reply, ‘I do not know where you are from.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_26","072_13_26","LUK","13","26","26","Then you will say, ‘We ate and drank with you, and you taught in our streets.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_27","072_13_27","LUK","13","27","27","And he will answer, ‘I tell you, I do not know where you are from. Depart from me, all you evildoers.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_28","072_13_28","LUK","13","28","28","There will be weeping and gnashing of teeth when you see Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, and all the prophets in the kingdom of God, but you yourselves are thrown out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_29","072_13_29","LUK","13","29","29","People will come from east and west and north and south, and will recline at the table in the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_30","072_13_30","LUK","13","30","30","And indeed, some who are last will be first, and some who are first will be last.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_31","072_13_31","LUK","13","31","31","On that very day, some Pharisees came to Jesus and told Him, “Leave this place and get away, because Herod wants to kill You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_32","072_13_32","LUK","13","32","32","But Jesus replied, “Go tell that fox, ‘Look, I will keep driving out demons and healing people today and tomorrow, and on the third day I will reach My goal.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_33","072_13_33","LUK","13","33","33","Nevertheless, I must keep going today and tomorrow and the next day, for it is not admissible for a prophet to perish outside of Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_34","072_13_34","LUK","13","34","34","O Jerusalem, Jerusalem, who kills the prophets and stones those sent to her, how often I have longed to gather your children together as a hen gathers her chicks under her wings, but you were unwilling! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK13_35","072_13_35","LUK","13","35","35","Look, your house is left to you desolate. And I tell you that you will not see Me again until you say, ‘Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_1","072_14_1","LUK","14","1","1","One Sabbath, Jesus went to eat in the home of a leading Pharisee, and those in attendance were watching Him closely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_2","072_14_2","LUK","14","2","2","Right there before Him was a man with dropsy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_3","072_14_3","LUK","14","3","3","So Jesus asked the experts in the law and the Pharisees, “Is it lawful to heal on the Sabbath?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_4","072_14_4","LUK","14","4","4","But they remained silent. Then Jesus took hold of the man, healed him, and sent him on his way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_5","072_14_5","LUK","14","5","5","And He asked them, “Which of you whose son or ox falls into a pit on the Sabbath day will not immediately pull him out?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_6","072_14_6","LUK","14","6","6","And they were unable to answer these questions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_7","072_14_7","LUK","14","7","7","When Jesus noticed how the guests chose the places of honor, He told them a parable: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_8","072_14_8","LUK","14","8","8","“When you are invited to a wedding banquet, do not sit in the place of honor, in case someone more distinguished than you has been invited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_9","072_14_9","LUK","14","9","9","Then the host who invited both of you will come and tell you, ‘Give this man your seat.’ And in humiliation, you will have to take the last place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_10","072_14_10","LUK","14","10","10","But when you are invited, go and sit in the last place, so that your host will come and tell you, ‘Friend, move up to a better place.’ Then you will be honored in front of those at the table with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_11","072_14_11","LUK","14","11","11","For everyone who exalts himself will be humbled, and the one who humbles himself will be exalted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_12","072_14_12","LUK","14","12","12","Then Jesus said to the man who had invited Him, “When you host a dinner or a banquet, do not invite your friends or brothers or relatives or rich neighbors. Otherwise, they may invite you in return, and you will be repaid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_13","072_14_13","LUK","14","13","13","But when you host a banquet, invite the poor, the crippled, the lame, and the blind, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_14","072_14_14","LUK","14","14","14","and you will be blessed. Since they cannot repay you, you will be repaid at the resurrection of the righteous.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_15","072_14_15","LUK","14","15","15","When one of those reclining with Him heard this, he said to Jesus, “Blessed is he who will eat at the feast in the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_16","072_14_16","LUK","14","16","16","But Jesus replied, “A certain man prepared a great banquet and invited many guests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_17","072_14_17","LUK","14","17","17","When it was time for the banquet, he sent his servant to tell those who had been invited, ‘Come, for everything is now ready.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_18","072_14_18","LUK","14","18","18","But one after another they all began to make excuses. The first one said, ‘I have bought a field, and I need to go and see it. Please excuse me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_19","072_14_19","LUK","14","19","19","Another said, ‘I have bought five yoke of oxen, and I am going to try them out. Please excuse me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_20","072_14_20","LUK","14","20","20","Still another said, ‘I have married a wife, so I cannot come.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_21","072_14_21","LUK","14","21","21","That servant returned and reported all this to his master. Then the owner of the house became angry and said to his servant, ‘Go out quickly into the streets and alleys of the city, and bring in the poor, the crippled, the lame, and the blind.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_22","072_14_22","LUK","14","22","22","‘Sir,’ the servant replied, ‘it has been done as you ordered, and there is still room.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_23","072_14_23","LUK","14","23","23","So the master told his servant, ‘Go out to the highways and hedges and compel them to come in, so that my house will be full. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_24","072_14_24","LUK","14","24","24","For I tell you, not one of those men who were invited will taste my banquet. For many are called, but few are chosen.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_25","072_14_25","LUK","14","25","25","Now large crowds were traveling with Jesus, and He turned and said to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_26","072_14_26","LUK","14","26","26","“If anyone comes to Me and does not hate his father and mother and wife and children and brothers and sisters—yes, even his own life—he cannot be My disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_27","072_14_27","LUK","14","27","27","And whoever does not carry his cross and follow Me cannot be My disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_28","072_14_28","LUK","14","28","28","Which of you, wishing to build a tower, does not first sit down and count the cost to see if he has the resources to complete it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_29","072_14_29","LUK","14","29","29","Otherwise, if he lays the foundation and is unable to finish the work, everyone who sees it will ridicule him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_30","072_14_30","LUK","14","30","30","saying, ‘This man could not finish what he started to build.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_31","072_14_31","LUK","14","31","31","Or what king on his way to war with another king does not first sit down and consider whether he can engage with ten thousand men the one coming against him with twenty thousand? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_32","072_14_32","LUK","14","32","32","And if he is unable, he will send a delegation while the other king is still far off, to ask for terms of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_33","072_14_33","LUK","14","33","33","In the same way, any one of you who does not give up everything he has cannot be My disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_34","072_14_34","LUK","14","34","34","Salt is good, but if the salt loses its savor, with what will it be seasoned? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK14_35","072_14_35","LUK","14","35","35","It is fit neither for the soil nor for the manure pile, and it is thrown out. He who has ears to hear, let him hear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_1","072_15_1","LUK","15","1","1","Now all the tax collectors and sinners were gathering around to listen to Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_2","072_15_2","LUK","15","2","2","So the Pharisees and scribes began to grumble: “This man welcomes sinners and eats with them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_3","072_15_3","LUK","15","3","3","Then Jesus told them this parable: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_4","072_15_4","LUK","15","4","4","“What man among you, if he has a hundred sheep and loses one of them, does not leave the ninety-nine in the pasture and go after the one that is lost, until he finds it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_5","072_15_5","LUK","15","5","5","And when he finds it, he joyfully puts it on his shoulders, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_6","072_15_6","LUK","15","6","6","comes home, and calls together his friends and neighbors to tell them, ‘Rejoice with me, for I have found my lost sheep!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_7","072_15_7","LUK","15","7","7","I tell you that in the same way there will be more joy in heaven over one sinner who repents than over ninety-nine righteous ones who do not need to repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_8","072_15_8","LUK","15","8","8","Or what woman who has ten silver coins and loses one of them does not light a lamp, sweep her house, and search carefully until she finds it? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_9","072_15_9","LUK","15","9","9","And when she finds it, she calls together her friends and neighbors to say, ‘Rejoice with me, for I have found my lost coin.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_10","072_15_10","LUK","15","10","10","In the same way, I tell you, there is joy in the presence of God’s angels over one sinner who repents.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_11","072_15_11","LUK","15","11","11","Then Jesus said, “There was a man who had two sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_12","072_15_12","LUK","15","12","12","The younger son said to him, ‘Father, give me my share of the estate.’ So he divided his property between them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_13","072_15_13","LUK","15","13","13","After a few days, the younger son got everything together and journeyed to a distant country, where he squandered his wealth in wild living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_14","072_15_14","LUK","15","14","14","After he had spent all he had, a severe famine swept through that country, and he began to be in need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_15","072_15_15","LUK","15","15","15","So he went and hired himself out to a citizen of that country, who sent him into his fields to feed the pigs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_16","072_15_16","LUK","15","16","16","He longed to fill his belly with the pods the pigs were eating, but no one would give him a thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_17","072_15_17","LUK","15","17","17","Finally he came to his senses and said, ‘How many of my father’s hired servants have plenty of food, but I am starving to death! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_18","072_15_18","LUK","15","18","18","I will get up and go back to my father and say to him, “Father, I have sinned against heaven and against you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_19","072_15_19","LUK","15","19","19","I am no longer worthy to be called your son. Make me like one of your hired servants.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_20","072_15_20","LUK","15","20","20","So he got up and went to his father. But while he was still in the distance, his father saw him and was filled with compassion. He ran to his son, embraced him, and kissed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_21","072_15_21","LUK","15","21","21","The son declared, ‘Father, I have sinned against heaven and against you. I am no longer worthy to be called your son.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_22","072_15_22","LUK","15","22","22","But the father said to his servants, ‘Bring the best robe and put it on him. Put a ring on his finger and sandals on his feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_23","072_15_23","LUK","15","23","23","Bring the fattened calf and kill it. Let us feast and celebrate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_24","072_15_24","LUK","15","24","24","For this son of mine was dead and is alive again! He was lost and is found!’ So they began to celebrate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_25","072_15_25","LUK","15","25","25","Meanwhile the older son was in the field, and as he approached the house, he heard music and dancing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_26","072_15_26","LUK","15","26","26","So he called one of the servants and asked what was going on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_27","072_15_27","LUK","15","27","27","‘Your brother has returned,’ he said, ‘and your father has killed the fattened calf, because he has him back safe and sound.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_28","072_15_28","LUK","15","28","28","The older son became angry and refused to go in. So his father came out and pleaded with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_29","072_15_29","LUK","15","29","29","But he answered his father, ‘Look, all these years I have served you and never disobeyed a commandment of yours. Yet you never gave me even a young goat so I could celebrate with my friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_30","072_15_30","LUK","15","30","30","But when this son of yours returns from squandering your wealth with prostitutes, you kill the fattened calf for him!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_31","072_15_31","LUK","15","31","31","‘Son, you are always with me,’ the father said, ‘and all that is mine is yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK15_32","072_15_32","LUK","15","32","32","But it was fitting to celebrate and be glad, because this brother of yours was dead and is alive again; he was lost and is found.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_1","072_16_1","LUK","16","1","1","Jesus also said to His disciples, “There was a rich man whose manager was accused of wasting his possessions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_2","072_16_2","LUK","16","2","2","So he called him in to ask, ‘What is this I hear about you? Turn in an account of your management, for you cannot be manager any longer.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_3","072_16_3","LUK","16","3","3","The manager said to himself, ‘What shall I do, now that my master is taking away my position? I am too weak to dig and too ashamed to beg. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_4","072_16_4","LUK","16","4","4","I know what I will do so that after my removal from management, people will welcome me into their homes.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_5","072_16_5","LUK","16","5","5","And he called in each one of his master’s debtors. ‘How much do you owe my master?’ he asked the first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_6","072_16_6","LUK","16","6","6","‘A hundred measures of olive oil,’ he answered. ‘Take your bill,’ said the manager, ‘sit down quickly, and write fifty.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_7","072_16_7","LUK","16","7","7","Then he asked another, ‘And how much do you owe?’ ‘A hundred measures of wheat,’ he replied. ‘Take your bill and write eighty,’ he told him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_8","072_16_8","LUK","16","8","8","The master commended the dishonest manager because he had acted shrewdly. For the sons of this age are more shrewd in dealing with their own kind than are the sons of light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_9","072_16_9","LUK","16","9","9","I tell you, use worldly wealth to make friends for yourselves so that when you fail, they will welcome you into eternal dwellings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_10","072_16_10","LUK","16","10","10","Whoever is faithful with very little will also be faithful with much, and whoever is dishonest with very little will also be dishonest with much. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_11","072_16_11","LUK","16","11","11","So if you have not been faithful with worldly wealth, who will entrust you with true riches? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_12","072_16_12","LUK","16","12","12","And if you have not been faithful with the belongings of another, who will give you belongings of your own? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_13","072_16_13","LUK","16","13","13","No servant can serve two masters. Either he will hate the one and love the other, or he will be devoted to the one and despise the other. You cannot serve both God and money.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_14","072_16_14","LUK","16","14","14","The Pharisees, who were lovers of money, heard all of this and were scoffing at Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_15","072_16_15","LUK","16","15","15","So He said to them, “You are the ones who justify yourselves before men, but God knows your hearts. For what is prized among men is detestable before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_16","072_16_16","LUK","16","16","16","The Law and the Prophets were proclaimed until John. Since that time, the gospel of the kingdom of God is being preached, and everyone is forcing his way into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_17","072_16_17","LUK","16","17","17","But it is easier for heaven and earth to pass away than for a single stroke of a pen to drop out of the Law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_18","072_16_18","LUK","16","18","18","Anyone who divorces his wife and marries another woman commits adultery, and everyone who marries a divorced woman commits adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_19","072_16_19","LUK","16","19","19","Now there was a rich man dressed in purple and fine linen, who lived each day in joyous splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_20","072_16_20","LUK","16","20","20","And a beggar named Lazarus lay at his gate, covered with sores ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_21","072_16_21","LUK","16","21","21","and longing to be fed with the crumbs that fell from the rich man’s table. Even the dogs came and licked his sores. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_22","072_16_22","LUK","16","22","22","One day the beggar died and was carried by the angels to Abraham’s side. And the rich man also died and was buried. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_23","072_16_23","LUK","16","23","23","In Hades, where he was in torment, he looked up and saw Abraham from afar, with Lazarus by his side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_24","072_16_24","LUK","16","24","24","So he cried out, ‘Father Abraham, have mercy on me and send Lazarus to dip the tip of his finger in water and cool my tongue. For I am in agony in this fire.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_25","072_16_25","LUK","16","25","25","But Abraham answered, ‘Child, remember that during your lifetime you received your good things, while Lazarus received bad things. But now he is comforted here, while you are in agony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_26","072_16_26","LUK","16","26","26","And besides all this, a great chasm has been fixed between us and you, so that even those who wish cannot cross from here to you, nor can anyone cross from there to us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_27","072_16_27","LUK","16","27","27","‘Then I beg you, father,’ he said, ‘send Lazarus to my father’s house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_28","072_16_28","LUK","16","28","28","for I have five brothers. Let him warn them, so that they will not also end up in this place of torment.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_29","072_16_29","LUK","16","29","29","But Abraham replied, ‘They have Moses and the Prophets; let your brothers listen to them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_30","072_16_30","LUK","16","30","30","‘No, father Abraham,’ he said, ‘but if someone is sent to them from the dead, they will repent.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK16_31","072_16_31","LUK","16","31","31","Then Abraham said to him, ‘If they do not listen to Moses and the Prophets, they will not be persuaded even if someone rises from the dead.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_1","072_17_1","LUK","17","1","1","Jesus said to the disciples, “It is inevitable that stumbling blocks will come, but woe to the one through whom they come! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_2","072_17_2","LUK","17","2","2","It would be better for him to have a large millstone hung around his neck and to be thrown into the sea than to cause one of these little ones to stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_3","072_17_3","LUK","17","3","3","Watch yourselves. If your brother sins against you, rebuke him; and if he repents, forgive him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_4","072_17_4","LUK","17","4","4","Even if he sins against you seven times in a day, and returns seven times in that day to say, ‘I repent,’ you must forgive him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_5","072_17_5","LUK","17","5","5","The apostles said to the Lord, “Increase our faith!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_6","072_17_6","LUK","17","6","6","And the Lord answered, “If you have faith the size of a mustard seed, you can say to this mulberry tree, ‘Be uprooted and planted in the sea,’ and it will obey you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_7","072_17_7","LUK","17","7","7","Which of you whose servant comes in from plowing or shepherding in the field will say, ‘Come at once and sit down to eat’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_8","072_17_8","LUK","17","8","8","Instead, won’t he tell him, ‘Prepare my meal and dress yourself to serve me while I eat and drink, and afterward you may eat and drink’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_9","072_17_9","LUK","17","9","9","Does he thank the servant because he did what he was told? I think not. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_10","072_17_10","LUK","17","10","10","So you also, when you have done everything commanded of you, should say, ‘We are unworthy servants; we have only done our duty.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_11","072_17_11","LUK","17","11","11","While Jesus was on His way to Jerusalem, He was passing between Samaria and Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_12","072_17_12","LUK","17","12","12","As He entered one of the villages, He was met by ten lepers. They stood at a distance ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_13","072_17_13","LUK","17","13","13","and raised their voices, shouting, “Jesus, Master, have mercy on us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_14","072_17_14","LUK","17","14","14","When Jesus saw them, He said, “Go, show yourselves to the priests.” And as they were on their way, they were cleansed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_15","072_17_15","LUK","17","15","15","When one of them saw that he was healed, he came back, praising God in a loud voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_16","072_17_16","LUK","17","16","16","He fell facedown at Jesus’ feet in thanksgiving to Him—and he was a Samaritan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_17","072_17_17","LUK","17","17","17","“Were not all ten cleansed?” Jesus asked. “Where then are the other nine? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_18","072_17_18","LUK","17","18","18","Was no one found except this foreigner to return and give glory to God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_19","072_17_19","LUK","17","19","19","Then Jesus said to him, “Rise and go; your faith has made you well!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_20","072_17_20","LUK","17","20","20","When asked by the Pharisees when the kingdom of God would come, Jesus replied, “The kingdom of God will not come with observable signs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_21","072_17_21","LUK","17","21","21","Nor will people say, ‘Look, here it is,’ or ‘There it is.’ For you see, the kingdom of God is in your midst.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_22","072_17_22","LUK","17","22","22","Then He said to the disciples, “The time is coming when you will long to see one of the days of the Son of Man, but you will not see it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_23","072_17_23","LUK","17","23","23","People will tell you, ‘Look, there He is!’ or ‘Look, here He is!’ Do not go out or chase after them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_24","072_17_24","LUK","17","24","24","For just as the lightning flashes and lights up the sky from one end to the other, so will be the Son of Man in His day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_25","072_17_25","LUK","17","25","25","But first He must suffer many things and be rejected by this generation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_26","072_17_26","LUK","17","26","26","Just as it was in the days of Noah, so also will it be in the days of the Son of Man: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_27","072_17_27","LUK","17","27","27","People were eating and drinking, marrying and being given in marriage, up to the day Noah entered the ark. Then the flood came and destroyed them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_28","072_17_28","LUK","17","28","28","It was the same in the days of Lot: People were eating and drinking, buying and selling, planting and building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_29","072_17_29","LUK","17","29","29","But on the day Lot left Sodom, fire and sulfur rained down from heaven and destroyed them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_30","072_17_30","LUK","17","30","30","It will be just like that on the day the Son of Man is revealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_31","072_17_31","LUK","17","31","31","On that day, let no one on the housetop come down to retrieve his possessions. Likewise, let no one in the field return for anything he has left behind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_32","072_17_32","LUK","17","32","32","Remember Lot’s wife! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_33","072_17_33","LUK","17","33","33","Whoever tries to save his life will lose it, but whoever loses his life will preserve it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_34","072_17_34","LUK","17","34","34","I tell you, on that night two people will be in one bed: one will be taken and the other left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_35","072_17_35","LUK","17","35","35","Two women will be grinding grain together: one will be taken and the other left.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK17_37","072_17_37","LUK","17","37","37","“Where, Lord?” they asked. Jesus answered, “Wherever there is a carcass, there the vultures will gather.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_1","072_18_1","LUK","18","1","1","Then Jesus told them a parable about the need to pray at all times and not lose heart: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_2","072_18_2","LUK","18","2","2","“In a certain town there was a judge who neither feared God nor respected men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_3","072_18_3","LUK","18","3","3","And there was a widow in that town who kept appealing to him, ‘Give me justice against my adversary.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_4","072_18_4","LUK","18","4","4","For a while he refused, but later he said to himself, ‘Though I neither fear God nor respect men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_5","072_18_5","LUK","18","5","5","yet because this widow keeps pestering me, I will give her justice. Otherwise, she will wear me out with her perpetual requests.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_6","072_18_6","LUK","18","6","6","And the Lord said, “Listen to the words of the unjust judge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_7","072_18_7","LUK","18","7","7","Will not God bring about justice for His elect who cry out to Him day and night? Will He delay in helping them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_8","072_18_8","LUK","18","8","8","I tell you, He will promptly carry out justice on their behalf. Nevertheless, when the Son of Man comes, will He find faith on earth?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_9","072_18_9","LUK","18","9","9","To some who trusted in their own righteousness and viewed others with contempt, He also told this parable: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_10","072_18_10","LUK","18","10","10","“Two men went up to the temple to pray. One was a Pharisee and the other a tax collector. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_11","072_18_11","LUK","18","11","11","The Pharisee stood by himself and prayed, ‘God, I thank You that I am not like other men—swindlers, evildoers, adulterers—or even like this tax collector. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_12","072_18_12","LUK","18","12","12","I fast twice a week and pay tithes of all that I acquire.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_13","072_18_13","LUK","18","13","13","But the tax collector stood at a distance, unwilling even to lift up his eyes to heaven. Instead, he beat his breast and said, ‘God, have mercy on me, a sinner!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_14","072_18_14","LUK","18","14","14","I tell you, this man, rather than the Pharisee, went home justified. For everyone who exalts himself will be humbled, but the one who humbles himself will be exalted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_15","072_18_15","LUK","18","15","15","Now people were even bringing their babies to Jesus for Him to place His hands on them. And when the disciples saw this, they rebuked those who brought them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_16","072_18_16","LUK","18","16","16","But Jesus called the children to Him and said, “Let the little children come to Me, and do not hinder them! For the kingdom of God belongs to such as these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_17","072_18_17","LUK","18","17","17","Truly I tell you, anyone who does not receive the kingdom of God like a little child will never enter it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_18","072_18_18","LUK","18","18","18","Then a certain ruler asked Him, “Good Teacher, what must I do to inherit eternal life?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_19","072_18_19","LUK","18","19","19","“Why do you call Me good?” Jesus replied. “No one is good except God alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_20","072_18_20","LUK","18","20","20","You know the commandments: ‘Do not commit adultery, do not murder, do not steal, do not bear false witness, honor your father and mother.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_21","072_18_21","LUK","18","21","21","“All these I have kept from my youth,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_22","072_18_22","LUK","18","22","22","On hearing this, Jesus told him, “You still lack one thing: Sell everything you own and give to the poor, and you will have treasure in heaven. Then come, follow Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_23","072_18_23","LUK","18","23","23","But when the ruler heard this, he became very sad, because he was extremely wealthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_24","072_18_24","LUK","18","24","24","Seeing the man’s sadness, Jesus said, “How hard it is for the rich to enter the kingdom of God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_25","072_18_25","LUK","18","25","25","Indeed, it is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_26","072_18_26","LUK","18","26","26","Those who heard this asked, “Who then can be saved?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_27","072_18_27","LUK","18","27","27","But Jesus said, “What is impossible with man is possible with God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_28","072_18_28","LUK","18","28","28","“Look,” said Peter, “we have left all we had to follow You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_29","072_18_29","LUK","18","29","29","“Truly I tell you,” Jesus replied, “no one who has left home or wife or brothers or parents or children for the sake of the kingdom of God ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_30","072_18_30","LUK","18","30","30","will fail to receive many times more in this age—and in the age to come, eternal life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_31","072_18_31","LUK","18","31","31","Then Jesus took the Twelve aside and said to them, “Look, we are going up to Jerusalem, and everything the prophets have written about the Son of Man will be fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_32","072_18_32","LUK","18","32","32","He will be delivered over to the Gentiles and will be mocked and insulted and spit upon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_33","072_18_33","LUK","18","33","33","They will flog Him and kill Him, and on the third day He will rise again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_34","072_18_34","LUK","18","34","34","But the disciples did not understand any of these things. The meaning was hidden from them, and they did not comprehend what He was saying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_35","072_18_35","LUK","18","35","35","As Jesus drew near to Jericho, a blind man was sitting beside the road, begging. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_36","072_18_36","LUK","18","36","36","When he heard the crowd going by, he asked what was happening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_37","072_18_37","LUK","18","37","37","“Jesus of Nazareth is passing by,” they told him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_38","072_18_38","LUK","18","38","38","So he called out, “Jesus, Son of David, have mercy on me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_39","072_18_39","LUK","18","39","39","Those who led the way admonished him to be silent, but he cried out all the louder, “Son of David, have mercy on me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_40","072_18_40","LUK","18","40","40","Jesus stopped and directed that the man be brought to Him. When he had come near, Jesus asked him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_41","072_18_41","LUK","18","41","41","“What do you want Me to do for you?” “Lord,” he said, “let me see again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_42","072_18_42","LUK","18","42","42","“Receive your sight!” Jesus replied. “Your faith has healed you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK18_43","072_18_43","LUK","18","43","43","Immediately he received his sight and followed Jesus, glorifying God. And all the people, when they saw it, gave praise to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_1","072_19_1","LUK","19","1","1","Then Jesus entered Jericho and was passing through. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_2","072_19_2","LUK","19","2","2","And there was a man named Zacchaeus, a chief tax collector, who was very wealthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_3","072_19_3","LUK","19","3","3","He was trying to see who Jesus was, but could not see over the crowd because he was small in stature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_4","072_19_4","LUK","19","4","4","So he ran on ahead and climbed a sycamore tree to see Him, since Jesus was about to pass that way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_5","072_19_5","LUK","19","5","5","When Jesus came to that place, He looked up and saw him and said, “Zacchaeus, hurry down, for I must stay at your house today.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_6","072_19_6","LUK","19","6","6","So Zacchaeus hurried down and welcomed Him joyfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_7","072_19_7","LUK","19","7","7","And all who saw this began to grumble, saying, “He has gone to be the guest of a sinful man!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_8","072_19_8","LUK","19","8","8","But Zacchaeus stood up and said to the Lord, “Look, Lord, half of my possessions I give to the poor, and if I have cheated anyone, I will repay it fourfold.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_9","072_19_9","LUK","19","9","9","Jesus said to him, “Today salvation has come to this house, because this man too is a son of Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_10","072_19_10","LUK","19","10","10","For the Son of Man came to seek and to save the lost.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_11","072_19_11","LUK","19","11","11","While the people were listening to this, Jesus proceeded to tell them a parable, because He was near Jerusalem and they thought the kingdom of God would appear imminently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_12","072_19_12","LUK","19","12","12","So He said, “A man of noble birth went to a distant country to lay claim to his kingship and then return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_13","072_19_13","LUK","19","13","13","Beforehand, he called ten of his servants and gave them ten minas. ‘Conduct business with this until I return,’ he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_14","072_19_14","LUK","19","14","14","But his subjects hated him and sent a delegation after him to say, ‘We do not want this man to rule over us.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_15","072_19_15","LUK","19","15","15","When he returned from procuring his kingship, he summoned the servants to whom he had given the money, to find out what each one had earned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_16","072_19_16","LUK","19","16","16","The first servant came forward and said, ‘Master, your mina has produced ten more minas.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_17","072_19_17","LUK","19","17","17","His master replied, ‘Well done, good servant! Because you have been faithful in a very small matter, you shall have authority over ten cities.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_18","072_19_18","LUK","19","18","18","The second servant came and said, ‘Master, your mina has made five minas.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_19","072_19_19","LUK","19","19","19","And to this one he said, ‘You shall have authority over five cities.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_20","072_19_20","LUK","19","20","20","Then another servant came and said, ‘Master, here is your mina, which I have laid away in a piece of cloth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_21","072_19_21","LUK","19","21","21","For I was afraid of you, because you are a harsh man. You withdraw what you did not deposit and reap what you did not sow.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_22","072_19_22","LUK","19","22","22","His master replied, ‘You wicked servant, I will judge you by your own words. So you knew that I am a harsh man, withdrawing what I did not deposit and reaping what I did not sow? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_23","072_19_23","LUK","19","23","23","Why then did you not deposit my money in the bank, and upon my return I could have collected it with interest?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_24","072_19_24","LUK","19","24","24","Then he told those standing by, ‘Take the mina from him and give it to the one who has ten minas.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_25","072_19_25","LUK","19","25","25","‘Master,’ they said, ‘he already has ten!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_26","072_19_26","LUK","19","26","26","He replied, ‘I tell you that everyone who has will be given more; but the one who does not have, even what he has will be taken away from him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_27","072_19_27","LUK","19","27","27","And these enemies of mine who were unwilling for me to rule over them, bring them here and slay them in front of me.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_28","072_19_28","LUK","19","28","28","After Jesus had said this, He went on ahead, going up to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_29","072_19_29","LUK","19","29","29","As He approached Bethphage and Bethany at the Mount of Olives, He sent out two of His disciples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_30","072_19_30","LUK","19","30","30","saying, “Go into the village ahead of you, and as you enter it, you will find a colt tied there, on which no one has ever sat. Untie it and bring it here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_31","072_19_31","LUK","19","31","31","If anyone asks, ‘Why are you untying it?’ tell him, ‘The Lord needs it.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_32","072_19_32","LUK","19","32","32","So those who were sent went out and found it just as Jesus had told them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_33","072_19_33","LUK","19","33","33","As they were untying the colt, its owners asked, “Why are you untying the colt?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_34","072_19_34","LUK","19","34","34","“The Lord needs it,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_35","072_19_35","LUK","19","35","35","Then they led the colt to Jesus, threw their cloaks over it, and put Jesus on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_36","072_19_36","LUK","19","36","36","As He rode along, the people spread their cloaks on the road. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_37","072_19_37","LUK","19","37","37","And as He approached the descent from the Mount of Olives, the whole multitude of disciples began to praise God joyfully in a loud voice for all the miracles they had seen: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_38","072_19_38","LUK","19","38","38","“Blessed is the King who comes in the name of the Lord!” “Peace in heaven and glory in the highest!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_39","072_19_39","LUK","19","39","39","But some of the Pharisees in the crowd said to Him, “Teacher, rebuke Your disciples!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_40","072_19_40","LUK","19","40","40","“I tell you,” He answered, “if they remain silent, the very stones will cry out.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_41","072_19_41","LUK","19","41","41","As Jesus approached Jerusalem and saw the city, He wept over it ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_42","072_19_42","LUK","19","42","42","and said, “If only you, even you, had known on this day what would bring you peace! But now it is hidden from your eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_43","072_19_43","LUK","19","43","43","For the days will come upon you when your enemies will barricade you and surround you and hem you in on every side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_44","072_19_44","LUK","19","44","44","They will level you to the ground—you and the children within your walls. They will not leave one stone on another, because you did not recognize the time of your visitation from God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_45","072_19_45","LUK","19","45","45","Then Jesus entered the temple courts and began to drive out those who were selling and buying there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_46","072_19_46","LUK","19","46","46","He declared to them, “It is written: ‘My house is a house of prayer.’ But you have made it ‘a den of robbers.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_47","072_19_47","LUK","19","47","47","Jesus was teaching at the temple every day, but the chief priests, scribes, and leaders of the people were intent on killing Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK19_48","072_19_48","LUK","19","48","48","Yet they could not find a way to do so, because all the people hung on His words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_1","072_20_1","LUK","20","1","1","One day as Jesus was teaching the people in the temple courts and proclaiming the gospel, the priests and scribes, together with the elders, came up to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_2","072_20_2","LUK","20","2","2","“Tell us,” they said, “by what authority are You doing these things, and who gave You this authority?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_3","072_20_3","LUK","20","3","3","“I will also ask you one question,” Jesus replied. “Tell Me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_4","072_20_4","LUK","20","4","4","John’s baptism—was it from heaven, or from men?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_5","072_20_5","LUK","20","5","5","They deliberated among themselves and said, “If we say, ‘From heaven,’ He will ask, ‘Why did you not believe him?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_6","072_20_6","LUK","20","6","6","But if we say, ‘From men,’ all the people will stone us, for they are convinced that John was a prophet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_7","072_20_7","LUK","20","7","7","So they answered that they did not know where it was from. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_8","072_20_8","LUK","20","8","8","And Jesus replied, “Neither will I tell you by what authority I am doing these things.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_9","072_20_9","LUK","20","9","9","Then He proceeded to tell the people this parable: “A man planted a vineyard, rented it out to some tenants, and went away for a long time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_10","072_20_10","LUK","20","10","10","At harvest time, he sent a servant to the tenants to collect his share of the fruit of the vineyard. But the tenants beat the servant and sent him away empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_11","072_20_11","LUK","20","11","11","So he sent another servant, but they beat him and treated him shamefully, sending him away empty-handed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_12","072_20_12","LUK","20","12","12","Then he sent a third, but they wounded him and threw him out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_13","072_20_13","LUK","20","13","13","‘What shall I do?’ asked the owner of the vineyard. ‘I will send my beloved son. Perhaps they will respect him when they see him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_14","072_20_14","LUK","20","14","14","But when the tenants saw the son, they discussed it among themselves and said, ‘This is the heir. Come, let us kill him, and the inheritance will be ours.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_15","072_20_15","LUK","20","15","15","So they threw him out of the vineyard and killed him. What then will the owner of the vineyard do to them? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_16","072_20_16","LUK","20","16","16","He will come and kill those tenants and give the vineyard to others.” And when the people heard this, they said, “May such a thing never happen!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_17","072_20_17","LUK","20","17","17","But Jesus looked directly at them and said, “Then what is the meaning of that which is written: ‘The stone the builders rejected has become the cornerstone’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_18","072_20_18","LUK","20","18","18","Everyone who falls on this stone will be broken to pieces, but he on whom it falls will be crushed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_19","072_20_19","LUK","20","19","19","When the chief priests and scribes realized that Jesus had spoken this parable against them, they sought to arrest Him that very hour. But they were afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_20","072_20_20","LUK","20","20","20","So they watched Him closely and sent spies who pretended to be sincere. They were hoping to catch Him in His words in order to hand Him over to the rule and authority of the governor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_21","072_20_21","LUK","20","21","21","“Teacher,” they inquired, “we know that You speak and teach correctly. You show no partiality but teach the way of God in accordance with the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_22","072_20_22","LUK","20","22","22","Is it lawful for us to pay taxes to Caesar or not?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_23","072_20_23","LUK","20","23","23","But Jesus saw through their duplicity and said to them, “Why do you test Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_24","072_20_24","LUK","20","24","24","Show Me a denarius. Whose image and inscription are on it?” “Caesar’s,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_25","072_20_25","LUK","20","25","25","So Jesus told them, “Give to Caesar what is Caesar’s, and to God what is God’s.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_26","072_20_26","LUK","20","26","26","And they were unable to trap Him in His words before the people. And amazed at His answer, they fell silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_27","072_20_27","LUK","20","27","27","Then some of the Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to question Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_28","072_20_28","LUK","20","28","28","“Teacher,” they said, “Moses wrote for us that if a man’s brother dies and leaves a wife but no children, the man is to marry his brother’s widow and raise up offspring for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_29","072_20_29","LUK","20","29","29","Now there were seven brothers. The first one married a wife but died childless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_30","072_20_30","LUK","20","30","30","Then the second took her as wife, and he died childless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_31","072_20_31","LUK","20","31","31","And the third married the widow, and in the same way all seven died, leaving no children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_32","072_20_32","LUK","20","32","32","And last of all, the woman died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_33","072_20_33","LUK","20","33","33","So then, in the resurrection, whose wife will she be? For all seven were married to her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_34","072_20_34","LUK","20","34","34","Jesus answered, “The sons of this age marry and are given in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_35","072_20_35","LUK","20","35","35","But those who are considered worthy to share in the age to come and in the resurrection from the dead will neither marry nor be given in marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_36","072_20_36","LUK","20","36","36","In fact, they can no longer die, because they are like the angels. And since they are sons of the resurrection, they are sons of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_37","072_20_37","LUK","20","37","37","Even Moses demonstrates that the dead are raised, in the passage about the burning bush. For he calls the Lord ‘the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_38","072_20_38","LUK","20","38","38","He is not the God of the dead, but of the living, for to Him all are alive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_39","072_20_39","LUK","20","39","39","Some of the scribes answered, “Teacher, You have spoken well!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_40","072_20_40","LUK","20","40","40","And they did not dare to question Him any further. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_41","072_20_41","LUK","20","41","41","Then Jesus declared, “How can it be said that the Christ is the Son of David? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_42","072_20_42","LUK","20","42","42","For David himself says in the book of Psalms: ‘The Lord said to my Lord, “Sit at My right hand ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_43","072_20_43","LUK","20","43","43","until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_44","072_20_44","LUK","20","44","44","Thus David calls Him ‘Lord.’ So how can He be David’s son?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_45","072_20_45","LUK","20","45","45","In the hearing of all the people, Jesus said to His disciples, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_46","072_20_46","LUK","20","46","46","“Beware of the scribes. They like to walk around in long robes, and they love the greetings in the marketplaces, the chief seats in the synagogues, and the places of honor at banquets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK20_47","072_20_47","LUK","20","47","47","They defraud widows of their houses, and for a show make lengthy prayers. These men will receive greater condemnation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_1","072_21_1","LUK","21","1","1","Then Jesus looked up and saw the rich putting their gifts into the treasury, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_2","072_21_2","LUK","21","2","2","and He saw a poor widow put in two small copper coins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_3","072_21_3","LUK","21","3","3","“Truly I tell you,” He said, “this poor widow has put in more than all the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_4","072_21_4","LUK","21","4","4","For they all contributed to God out of their surplus, but she out of her poverty has put in all she had to live on.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_5","072_21_5","LUK","21","5","5","As some of the disciples were remarking how the temple was adorned with beautiful stones and consecrated gifts, Jesus said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_6","072_21_6","LUK","21","6","6","“As for what you see here, the time will come when not one stone will be left on another; every one will be thrown down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_7","072_21_7","LUK","21","7","7","“Teacher,” they asked, “when will these things happen? And what will be the sign that they are about to take place?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_8","072_21_8","LUK","21","8","8","Jesus answered, “See to it that you are not deceived. For many will come in My name, claiming, ‘I am He,’ and, ‘The time is near.’ Therefore do not follow them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_9","072_21_9","LUK","21","9","9","When you hear of wars and rebellions, do not be alarmed. These things must happen first, but the end is not imminent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_10","072_21_10","LUK","21","10","10","Then He told them, “Nation will rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_11","072_21_11","LUK","21","11","11","There will be great earthquakes in various places, famines and pestilences, along with fearful sights and great signs from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_12","072_21_12","LUK","21","12","12","But before all this, they will seize you and persecute you. On account of My name they will deliver you to the synagogues and prisons, and they will bring you before kings and governors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_13","072_21_13","LUK","21","13","13","This will be your opportunity to serve as witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_14","072_21_14","LUK","21","14","14","So make up your mind not to worry beforehand how to defend yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_15","072_21_15","LUK","21","15","15","For I will give you speech and wisdom that none of your adversaries will be able to contradict or resist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_16","072_21_16","LUK","21","16","16","You will be betrayed even by parents and relatives and friends and brothers, and some of you will be put to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_17","072_21_17","LUK","21","17","17","And you will be hated by everyone because of My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_18","072_21_18","LUK","21","18","18","Yet not even a hair of your head will perish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_19","072_21_19","LUK","21","19","19","By your patient endurance you will gain your souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_20","072_21_20","LUK","21","20","20","But when you see Jerusalem surrounded by armies, you will know that her desolation is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_21","072_21_21","LUK","21","21","21","Then let those who are in Judea flee to the mountains, let those in the city get out, and let those in the country stay out of the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_22","072_21_22","LUK","21","22","22","For these are the days of vengeance, to fulfill all that is written. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_23","072_21_23","LUK","21","23","23","How miserable those days will be for pregnant and nursing mothers! For there will be great distress upon the land and wrath against this people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_24","072_21_24","LUK","21","24","24","They will fall by the edge of the sword and be led captive into all the nations. And Jerusalem will be trodden down by the Gentiles, until the times of the Gentiles are fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_25","072_21_25","LUK","21","25","25","There will be signs in the sun and moon and stars, and on the earth dismay among the nations, bewildered by the roaring of the sea and the surging of the waves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_26","072_21_26","LUK","21","26","26","Men will faint from fear and anxiety over what is coming upon the earth, for the powers of the heavens will be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_27","072_21_27","LUK","21","27","27","At that time they will see the Son of Man coming in a cloud with power and great glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_28","072_21_28","LUK","21","28","28","When these things begin to happen, stand up and lift up your heads, because your redemption is drawing near.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_29","072_21_29","LUK","21","29","29","Then Jesus told them a parable: “Look at the fig tree and all the trees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_30","072_21_30","LUK","21","30","30","When they sprout leaves, you can see for yourselves and know that summer is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_31","072_21_31","LUK","21","31","31","So also, when you see these things happening, know that the kingdom of God is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_32","072_21_32","LUK","21","32","32","Truly I tell you, this generation will not pass away until all these things have happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_33","072_21_33","LUK","21","33","33","Heaven and earth will pass away, but My words will never pass away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_34","072_21_34","LUK","21","34","34","But watch yourselves, or your hearts will be weighed down by dissipation, drunkenness, and the worries of life—and that day will spring upon you suddenly like a snare. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_35","072_21_35","LUK","21","35","35","For it will come upon all who dwell on the face of all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_36","072_21_36","LUK","21","36","36","So keep watch at all times, and pray that you may be deemed worthy to escape all that is about to happen and to stand before the Son of Man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_37","072_21_37","LUK","21","37","37","Every day Jesus taught at the temple, but every evening He went out to spend the night on the Mount of Olives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK21_38","072_21_38","LUK","21","38","38","And early in the morning all the people would come to hear Him at the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_1","072_22_1","LUK","22","1","1","Now the Feast of Unleavened Bread, called the Passover, was approaching, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_2","072_22_2","LUK","22","2","2","and the chief priests and scribes were looking for a way to put Jesus to death, for they feared the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_3","072_22_3","LUK","22","3","3","Then Satan entered Judas Iscariot, who was one of the Twelve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_4","072_22_4","LUK","22","4","4","And Judas went to discuss with the chief priests and temple officers how he might betray Jesus to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_5","072_22_5","LUK","22","5","5","They were delighted and agreed to give him money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_6","072_22_6","LUK","22","6","6","Judas consented, and began to look for an opportunity to betray Jesus to them in the absence of a crowd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_7","072_22_7","LUK","22","7","7","Then came the day of Unleavened Bread on which the Passover lamb was to be sacrificed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_8","072_22_8","LUK","22","8","8","Jesus sent Peter and John, saying, “Go and make preparations for us to eat the Passover.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_9","072_22_9","LUK","22","9","9","“Where do You want us to prepare it?” they asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_10","072_22_10","LUK","22","10","10","He answered, “When you enter the city, a man carrying a jug of water will meet you. Follow him to the house he enters, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_11","072_22_11","LUK","22","11","11","and say to the owner of that house, ‘The Teacher asks: Where is the guest room, where I may eat the Passover with My disciples?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_12","072_22_12","LUK","22","12","12","And he will show you a large upper room, already furnished. Make preparations there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_13","072_22_13","LUK","22","13","13","So they went and found it just as Jesus had told them. And they prepared the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_14","072_22_14","LUK","22","14","14","When the hour had come, Jesus reclined at the table with His twelve apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_15","072_22_15","LUK","22","15","15","And He said to them, “I have eagerly desired to eat this Passover with you before My suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_16","072_22_16","LUK","22","16","16","For I tell you that I will not eat it again until it is fulfilled in the kingdom of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_17","072_22_17","LUK","22","17","17","After taking the cup, He gave thanks and said, “Take this and divide it among yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_18","072_22_18","LUK","22","18","18","For I tell you that I will not drink of the fruit of the vine until the kingdom of God comes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_19","072_22_19","LUK","22","19","19","And He took the bread, gave thanks and broke it, and gave it to them, saying, “This is My body, given for you; do this in remembrance of Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_20","072_22_20","LUK","22","20","20","In the same way, after supper He took the cup, saying, “This cup is the new covenant in My blood, which is poured out for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_21","072_22_21","LUK","22","21","21","Look! The hand of My betrayer is with Mine on the table. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_22","072_22_22","LUK","22","22","22","Indeed, the Son of Man will go as it has been determined, but woe to that man who betrays Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_23","072_22_23","LUK","22","23","23","Then they began to question among themselves which of them was going to do this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_24","072_22_24","LUK","22","24","24","A dispute also arose among the disciples as to which of them should be considered the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_25","072_22_25","LUK","22","25","25","So Jesus declared, “The kings of the Gentiles lord it over them, and those in authority over them call themselves benefactors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_26","072_22_26","LUK","22","26","26","But you shall not be like them. Instead, the greatest among you should be like the youngest, and the one who leads like the one who serves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_27","072_22_27","LUK","22","27","27","For who is greater, the one who reclines at the table or the one who serves? Is it not the one who reclines? But I am among you as one who serves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_28","072_22_28","LUK","22","28","28","You are the ones who have stood by Me in My trials. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_29","072_22_29","LUK","22","29","29","And I bestow on you a kingdom, just as My Father has bestowed one on Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_30","072_22_30","LUK","22","30","30","so that you may eat and drink at My table and sit on thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_31","072_22_31","LUK","22","31","31","And the Lord said, “Simon, Simon, Satan has asked to sift all of you like wheat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_32","072_22_32","LUK","22","32","32","But I have prayed for you, Simon, that your faith will not fail. And when you have turned back, strengthen your brothers.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_33","072_22_33","LUK","22","33","33","“Lord,” said Peter, “I am ready to go with You even to prison and to death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_34","072_22_34","LUK","22","34","34","But Jesus replied, “I tell you, Peter, the rooster will certainly not crow today before you have denied three times that you know Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_35","072_22_35","LUK","22","35","35","Then Jesus asked them, “When I sent you out without purse or bag or sandals, did you lack anything?” “Nothing,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_36","072_22_36","LUK","22","36","36","“Now, however,” He told them, “the one with a purse should take it, and likewise a bag; and the one without a sword should sell his cloak and buy one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_37","072_22_37","LUK","22","37","37","For I tell you that this Scripture must yet be fulfilled in Me: ‘And He was numbered with the transgressors.’ For what is written about Me is reaching its fulfillment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_38","072_22_38","LUK","22","38","38","So they said, “Look, Lord, here are two swords.” “That is enough,” He answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_39","072_22_39","LUK","22","39","39","Jesus went out as usual to the Mount of Olives, and His disciples followed Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_40","072_22_40","LUK","22","40","40","When He came to the place, He told them, “Pray that you will not enter into temptation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_41","072_22_41","LUK","22","41","41","And He withdrew about a stone’s throw beyond them, where He knelt down and prayed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_42","072_22_42","LUK","22","42","42","“Father, if You are willing, take this cup from Me. Yet not My will, but Yours be done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_43","072_22_43","LUK","22","43","43","Then an angel from heaven appeared to Him and strengthened Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_44","072_22_44","LUK","22","44","44","And in His anguish, He prayed more earnestly, and His sweat became like drops of blood falling to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_45","072_22_45","LUK","22","45","45","When Jesus rose from prayer and returned to the disciples, He found them asleep, exhausted from sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_46","072_22_46","LUK","22","46","46","“Why are you sleeping?” He asked. “Get up and pray so that you will not enter into temptation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_47","072_22_47","LUK","22","47","47","While He was still speaking, a crowd arrived, led by the man called Judas, one of the Twelve. He approached Jesus to kiss Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_48","072_22_48","LUK","22","48","48","But Jesus asked him, “Judas, are you betraying the Son of Man with a kiss?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_49","072_22_49","LUK","22","49","49","Those around Jesus saw what was about to happen and said to Him, “Lord, should we strike with our swords?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_50","072_22_50","LUK","22","50","50","And one of them struck the servant of the high priest, cutting off his right ear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_51","072_22_51","LUK","22","51","51","But Jesus answered, “No more of this!” And He touched the man’s ear and healed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_52","072_22_52","LUK","22","52","52","Then Jesus said to the chief priests, temple officers, and elders who had come for Him, “Have you come out with swords and clubs as you would against an outlaw? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_53","072_22_53","LUK","22","53","53","Every day I was with you in the temple courts, and you did not lay a hand on Me. But this hour belongs to you and to the power of darkness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_54","072_22_54","LUK","22","54","54","Then they seized Jesus, led Him away, and took Him into the house of the high priest. And Peter followed at a distance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_55","072_22_55","LUK","22","55","55","When those present had kindled a fire in the middle of the courtyard and sat down together, Peter sat down among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_56","072_22_56","LUK","22","56","56","A servant girl saw him seated in the firelight and looked intently at him. “This man also was with Him,” she said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_57","072_22_57","LUK","22","57","57","But Peter denied Him. “Woman, I do not know Him,” he said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_58","072_22_58","LUK","22","58","58","A short time later, someone else saw him and said, “You also are one of them.” But Peter said, “Man, I am not.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_59","072_22_59","LUK","22","59","59","About an hour later, another man insisted, “Certainly this man was with Him, for he too is a Galilean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_60","072_22_60","LUK","22","60","60","“Man, I do not know what you are talking about,” Peter replied. And immediately, while he was still speaking, the rooster crowed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_61","072_22_61","LUK","22","61","61","And the Lord turned and looked at Peter. Then Peter remembered the word that the Lord had spoken to him: “Before the rooster crows, you will deny Me three times.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_62","072_22_62","LUK","22","62","62","And Peter went outside and wept bitterly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_63","072_22_63","LUK","22","63","63","The men who were holding Jesus began to mock Him and beat Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_64","072_22_64","LUK","22","64","64","They blindfolded Him and kept striking Him in the face and demanding, “Prophesy! Who hit You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_65","072_22_65","LUK","22","65","65","And they said many other blasphemous things against Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_66","072_22_66","LUK","22","66","66","At daybreak the council of the elders of the people, both the chief priests and scribes, met together. They led Jesus into their Sanhedrin and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_67","072_22_67","LUK","22","67","67","“If You are the Christ, tell us.” Jesus answered, “If I tell you, you will not believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_68","072_22_68","LUK","22","68","68","And if I ask you a question, you will not answer Me nor release Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_69","072_22_69","LUK","22","69","69","But from now on the Son of Man will be seated at the right hand of the power of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_70","072_22_70","LUK","22","70","70","So they all asked, “Are You then the Son of God?” He replied, “You say that I am.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK22_71","072_22_71","LUK","22","71","71","“Why do we need any more testimony?” they declared. “We have heard it for ourselves from His own lips.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_1","072_23_1","LUK","23","1","1","Then the whole council rose and led Jesus away to Pilate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_2","072_23_2","LUK","23","2","2","And they began to accuse Him, saying, “We found this man subverting the nation, forbidding payment of taxes to Caesar, and proclaiming Himself to be Christ, a King.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_3","072_23_3","LUK","23","3","3","So Pilate asked Him, “Are You the King of the Jews?” “You have said so,” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_4","072_23_4","LUK","23","4","4","Then Pilate said to the chief priests and the crowds, “I find no basis for a charge against this man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_5","072_23_5","LUK","23","5","5","But they kept insisting, “He stirs up the people all over Judea with His teaching. He began in Galilee and has come all the way here.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_6","072_23_6","LUK","23","6","6","When Pilate heard of Galilee, he asked if the man was a Galilean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_7","072_23_7","LUK","23","7","7","And learning that Jesus was under Herod’s jurisdiction, he sent Him to Herod, who himself was in Jerusalem at that time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_8","072_23_8","LUK","23","8","8","When Herod saw Jesus, he was greatly pleased. He had wanted to see Him for a long time, because he had heard many things about Him and was hoping to see Him perform a miracle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_9","072_23_9","LUK","23","9","9","Herod questioned Jesus at great length, but He gave no answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_10","072_23_10","LUK","23","10","10","Meanwhile, the chief priests and scribes stood there, vehemently accusing Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_11","072_23_11","LUK","23","11","11","And even Herod and his soldiers ridiculed and mocked Him. Dressing Him in a fine robe, they sent Him back to Pilate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_12","072_23_12","LUK","23","12","12","That day Pilate and Herod became friends; before this time they had been enemies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_13","072_23_13","LUK","23","13","13","Then Pilate called together the chief priests, the rulers, and the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_14","072_23_14","LUK","23","14","14","and said to them, “You brought me this man as one who was inciting the people to rebellion. I have examined Him here in your presence and found Him not guilty of your charges against Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_15","072_23_15","LUK","23","15","15","Neither has Herod, for I sent you back to him. As you can see, He has done nothing deserving of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_16","072_23_16","LUK","23","16","16","Therefore I will punish Him and release Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_17","072_23_17","LUK","23","17","17","Now Pilate was obliged to release to the people one prisoner at the feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_18","072_23_18","LUK","23","18","18","But they all cried out in unison: “Away with this man! Release Barabbas to us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_19","072_23_19","LUK","23","19","19","(Barabbas had been imprisoned for an insurrection in the city, and for murder.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_20","072_23_20","LUK","23","20","20","Wanting to release Jesus, Pilate addressed them again, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_21","072_23_21","LUK","23","21","21","but they kept shouting, “Crucify Him! Crucify Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_22","072_23_22","LUK","23","22","22","A third time he said to them, “What evil has this man done? I have found in Him no offense worthy of death. So after I punish Him, I will release Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_23","072_23_23","LUK","23","23","23","But they were insistent, demanding with loud voices for Jesus to be crucified. And their clamor and that of the chief priests prevailed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_24","072_23_24","LUK","23","24","24","So Pilate sentenced that their demand be met. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_25","072_23_25","LUK","23","25","25","As they had requested, he released the one imprisoned for insurrection and murder, and he handed Jesus over to their will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_26","072_23_26","LUK","23","26","26","As the soldiers led Him away, they seized Simon of Cyrene on his way in from the country, and they put the cross on him to carry behind Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_27","072_23_27","LUK","23","27","27","A great number of people followed Him, including women who kept mourning and wailing for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_28","072_23_28","LUK","23","28","28","But Jesus turned to them and said, “Daughters of Jerusalem, do not weep for Me, but weep for yourselves and for your children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_29","072_23_29","LUK","23","29","29","Look, the days are coming when people will say, ‘Blessed are the barren women, the wombs that never bore, and breasts that never nursed!’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_30","072_23_30","LUK","23","30","30","At that time ‘they will say to the mountains, “Fall on us!” and to the hills, “Cover us!”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_31","072_23_31","LUK","23","31","31","For if men do these things while the tree is green, what will happen when it is dry?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_32","072_23_32","LUK","23","32","32","Two others, who were criminals, were also led away to be executed with Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_33","072_23_33","LUK","23","33","33","When they came to the place called The Skull, they crucified Him there, along with the criminals, one on His right and the other on His left. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_34","072_23_34","LUK","23","34","34","Then Jesus said, “Father, forgive them, for they do not know what they are doing.” And they divided up His garments by casting lots. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_35","072_23_35","LUK","23","35","35","The people stood watching, and the rulers with them sneered at Him, saying, “He saved others; let Him save Himself if He is the Christ, the Chosen One of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_36","072_23_36","LUK","23","36","36","The soldiers also mocked Him and came up to offer Him sour wine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_37","072_23_37","LUK","23","37","37","“If You are the King of the Jews,” they said, “save Yourself!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_38","072_23_38","LUK","23","38","38","Above Him was posted an inscription written in Greek, Latin, and Hebrew: THIS IS THE KING OF THE JEWS. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_39","072_23_39","LUK","23","39","39","One of the criminals who hung there heaped abuse on Him. “If You are the Christ,” he said, “save Yourself and us!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_40","072_23_40","LUK","23","40","40","But the other one rebuked him, saying, “Do you not even fear God, since you are under the same judgment? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_41","072_23_41","LUK","23","41","41","We are punished justly, for we are receiving what our actions deserve. But this man has done nothing wrong.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_42","072_23_42","LUK","23","42","42","Then he said to Jesus, “Lord, remember me when You come into Your kingdom!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_43","072_23_43","LUK","23","43","43","And Jesus said to him, “Truly I tell you, today you will be with Me in Paradise.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_44","072_23_44","LUK","23","44","44","It was now about the sixth hour, and darkness came over all the land until the ninth hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_45","072_23_45","LUK","23","45","45","The sun was darkened, and the veil of the temple was torn down the middle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_46","072_23_46","LUK","23","46","46","Then Jesus called out in a loud voice, “Father, into Your hands I commit My Spirit.” And when He had said this, He breathed His last. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_47","072_23_47","LUK","23","47","47","When the centurion saw what had happened, he gave glory to God, saying, “Surely this was a righteous man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_48","072_23_48","LUK","23","48","48","And when all the people who had gathered for this spectacle saw what had happened, they returned home beating their breasts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_49","072_23_49","LUK","23","49","49","But all those who knew Jesus, including the women who had followed Him from Galilee, stood at a distance watching these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_50","072_23_50","LUK","23","50","50","Now there was a Council member named Joseph, a good and righteous man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_51","072_23_51","LUK","23","51","51","who had not consented to their decision or action. He was from the Judean town of Arimathea and himself was waiting for the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_52","072_23_52","LUK","23","52","52","He went to Pilate to ask for the body of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_53","072_23_53","LUK","23","53","53","Then he took it down, wrapped it in a linen cloth, and placed it in a tomb cut into the rock, where no one had yet been laid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_54","072_23_54","LUK","23","54","54","It was Preparation Day, and the Sabbath was beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_55","072_23_55","LUK","23","55","55","The women who had come with Jesus from Galilee followed, and they saw the tomb and how His body was placed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK23_56","072_23_56","LUK","23","56","56","Then they returned to prepare spices and perfumes. And they rested on the Sabbath, according to the commandment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_1","072_24_1","LUK","24","1","1","On the first day of the week, very early in the morning, they and certain other women with them came to the tomb, bringing the spices they had prepared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_2","072_24_2","LUK","24","2","2","They found the stone rolled away from the tomb, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_3","072_24_3","LUK","24","3","3","but when they entered, they did not find the body of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_4","072_24_4","LUK","24","4","4","While they were puzzling over this, suddenly two men in radiant apparel stood beside them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_5","072_24_5","LUK","24","5","5","As the women bowed their faces to the ground in terror, the two men asked them, “Why do you look for the living among the dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_6","072_24_6","LUK","24","6","6","He is not here; He has risen! Remember how He told you while He was still in Galilee: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_7","072_24_7","LUK","24","7","7","‘The Son of Man must be delivered into the hands of sinful men, and be crucified, and on the third day rise again.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_8","072_24_8","LUK","24","8","8","Then they remembered His words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_9","072_24_9","LUK","24","9","9","And when they returned from the tomb, they reported all these things to the Eleven and to all the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_10","072_24_10","LUK","24","10","10","It was Mary Magdalene, Joanna, Mary the mother of James, and the other women with them who told this to the apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_11","072_24_11","LUK","24","11","11","But their words seemed like nonsense to them, and they did not believe the women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_12","072_24_12","LUK","24","12","12","Peter, however, got up and ran to the tomb. And after bending down and seeing only the linen cloths lying there, he went away, wondering to himself what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_13","072_24_13","LUK","24","13","13","That same day two of them were going to a village called Emmaus, about seven miles from Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_14","072_24_14","LUK","24","14","14","They were talking with each other about everything that had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_15","072_24_15","LUK","24","15","15","And as they talked and deliberated, Jesus Himself came up and walked along with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_16","072_24_16","LUK","24","16","16","But their eyes were kept from recognizing Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_17","072_24_17","LUK","24","17","17","He asked them, “What are you discussing so intently as you walk along with sadness on your faces?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_18","072_24_18","LUK","24","18","18","The one named Cleopas asked Him, “Are You the only visitor to Jerusalem who does not know the things that have happened there in recent days?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_19","072_24_19","LUK","24","19","19","“What things?” He asked. “The events involving Jesus of Nazareth,” they answered. “This man was a prophet, powerful in speech and action before God and all the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_20","072_24_20","LUK","24","20","20","Our chief priests and rulers delivered Him up to the sentence of death, and they crucified Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_21","072_24_21","LUK","24","21","21","But we were hoping He was the One who would redeem Israel. And besides all this, today is the third day since these things took place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_22","072_24_22","LUK","24","22","22","Furthermore, some of our women astounded us. They were at the tomb early, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_23","072_24_23","LUK","24","23","23","but they did not find His body. They came and told us they had seen a vision of angels, who said that Jesus was alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_24","072_24_24","LUK","24","24","24","Then some of our companions went to the tomb and found it just as the women had described. But Him they did not see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_25","072_24_25","LUK","24","25","25","Then Jesus said to them, “O foolish ones, and slow of heart to believe all that the prophets have spoken! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_26","072_24_26","LUK","24","26","26","Was it not necessary for the Christ to suffer these things and then to enter His glory?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_27","072_24_27","LUK","24","27","27","And beginning with Moses and all the Prophets, He explained to them what was written in all the Scriptures about Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_28","072_24_28","LUK","24","28","28","As they approached the village where they were headed, He seemed to be going farther. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_29","072_24_29","LUK","24","29","29","But they pleaded with Him, “Stay with us, for it is nearly evening and the day is almost over.” So He went in to stay with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_30","072_24_30","LUK","24","30","30","While He was reclining at the table with them, He took bread, spoke a blessing and broke it, and gave it to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_31","072_24_31","LUK","24","31","31","Then their eyes were opened and they recognized Jesus—and He disappeared from their sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_32","072_24_32","LUK","24","32","32","They asked each other, “Were not our hearts burning within us as He spoke with us on the road and opened the Scriptures to us?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_33","072_24_33","LUK","24","33","33","And they got up that very hour and returned to Jerusalem. There they found the Eleven and those with them, gathered together ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_34","072_24_34","LUK","24","34","34","and saying, “The Lord has indeed risen and has appeared to Simon!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_35","072_24_35","LUK","24","35","35","Then the two told what had happened on the road, and how they had recognized Jesus in the breaking of the bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_36","072_24_36","LUK","24","36","36","While they were describing these events, Jesus Himself stood among them and said, “Peace be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_37","072_24_37","LUK","24","37","37","But they were startled and frightened, thinking they had seen a spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_38","072_24_38","LUK","24","38","38","“Why are you troubled,” Jesus asked, “and why do doubts arise in your hearts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_39","072_24_39","LUK","24","39","39","Look at My hands and My feet. It is I Myself. Touch Me and see—for a spirit does not have flesh and bones, as you see I have.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_40","072_24_40","LUK","24","40","40","And when He had said this, He showed them His hands and feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_41","072_24_41","LUK","24","41","41","While they were still in disbelief because of their joy and amazement, He asked them, “Do you have anything here to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_42","072_24_42","LUK","24","42","42","So they gave Him a piece of broiled fish and some honeycomb, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_43","072_24_43","LUK","24","43","43","and He took them and ate them in front of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_44","072_24_44","LUK","24","44","44","Jesus said to them, “These are the words I spoke to you while I was still with you: Everything must be fulfilled that is written about Me in the Law of Moses, the Prophets, and the Psalms.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_45","072_24_45","LUK","24","45","45","Then He opened their minds to understand the Scriptures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_46","072_24_46","LUK","24","46","46","And He told them, “This is what is written: And thus it is necessary that the Christ will suffer and rise from the dead on the third day, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_47","072_24_47","LUK","24","47","47","and in His name repentance and forgiveness of sins will be proclaimed to all nations, beginning in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_48","072_24_48","LUK","24","48","48","You are witnesses of these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_49","072_24_49","LUK","24","49","49","And behold, I am sending the promise of My Father upon you. But remain in the city of Jerusalem until you have been clothed with power from on high.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_50","072_24_50","LUK","24","50","50","When Jesus had led them out as far as Bethany, He lifted up His hands and blessed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_51","072_24_51","LUK","24","51","51","While He was blessing them, He left them and was carried up into heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_52","072_24_52","LUK","24","52","52","And they worshiped Him and returned to Jerusalem with great joy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("LK24_53","072_24_53","LUK","24","53","53","praising and blessing God continually in the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_1","073_1_1","JHN","1","1","1","In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_2","073_1_2","JHN","1","2","2","He was with God in the beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_3","073_1_3","JHN","1","3","3","Through Him all things were made, and without Him nothing was made that has been made. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_4","073_1_4","JHN","1","4","4","In Him was life, and that life was the light of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_5","073_1_5","JHN","1","5","5","The Light shines in the darkness, and the darkness has not overcome it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_6","073_1_6","JHN","1","6","6","There came a man who was sent from God. His name was John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_7","073_1_7","JHN","1","7","7","He came as a witness to testify about the Light, so that through him everyone might believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_8","073_1_8","JHN","1","8","8","He himself was not the Light, but he came to testify about the Light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_9","073_1_9","JHN","1","9","9","The true Light, who gives light to everyone, was coming into the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_10","073_1_10","JHN","1","10","10","He was in the world, and though the world was made through Him, the world did not recognize Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_11","073_1_11","JHN","1","11","11","He came to His own, and His own did not receive Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_12","073_1_12","JHN","1","12","12","But to all who did receive Him, to those who believed in His name, He gave the right to become children of God— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_13","073_1_13","JHN","1","13","13","children born not of blood, nor of the desire or will of man, but born of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_14","073_1_14","JHN","1","14","14","The Word became flesh and made His dwelling among us. We have seen His glory, the glory of the one and only Son from the Father, full of grace and truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_15","073_1_15","JHN","1","15","15","John testified concerning Him. He cried out, saying, “This is He of whom I said, ‘He who comes after me has surpassed me because He was before me.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_16","073_1_16","JHN","1","16","16","From His fullness we have all received grace upon grace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_17","073_1_17","JHN","1","17","17","For the law was given through Moses; grace and truth came through Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_18","073_1_18","JHN","1","18","18","No one has ever seen God, but the one and only Son, who is at the Father’s side, has made Him known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_19","073_1_19","JHN","1","19","19","And this was John’s testimony when the Jews of Jerusalem sent priests and Levites to ask him, “Who are you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_20","073_1_20","JHN","1","20","20","He did not refuse to confess, but openly declared, “I am not the Christ.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_21","073_1_21","JHN","1","21","21","“Then who are you?” they inquired. “Are you Elijah?” He said, “I am not.” “Are you the Prophet?” He answered, “No.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_22","073_1_22","JHN","1","22","22","So they said to him, “Who are you? We need an answer for those who sent us. What do you say about yourself?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_23","073_1_23","JHN","1","23","23","John replied in the words of Isaiah the prophet: “I am a voice of one calling in the wilderness, ‘Make straight the way for the Lord.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_24","073_1_24","JHN","1","24","24","Then those whom the Pharisees had sent ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_25","073_1_25","JHN","1","25","25","asked him, “Why then do you baptize, if you are not the Christ, nor Elijah, nor the Prophet?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_26","073_1_26","JHN","1","26","26","“I baptize with water,” John replied, “but among you stands One you do not know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_27","073_1_27","JHN","1","27","27","He is the One who comes after me, who is preferred before me, the straps of whose sandals I am not worthy to untie.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_28","073_1_28","JHN","1","28","28","All this happened at Bethany beyond the Jordan, where John was baptizing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_29","073_1_29","JHN","1","29","29","The next day John saw Jesus coming toward him and said, “Look, the Lamb of God, who takes away the sin of the world! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_30","073_1_30","JHN","1","30","30","This is He of whom I said, ‘A man who comes after me has surpassed me because He was before me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_31","073_1_31","JHN","1","31","31","I myself did not know Him, but the reason I came baptizing with water was that He might be revealed to Israel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_32","073_1_32","JHN","1","32","32","Then John testified, “I saw the Spirit descending from heaven like a dove and resting on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_33","073_1_33","JHN","1","33","33","I myself did not know Him, but the One who sent me to baptize with water told me, ‘The man on whom you see the Spirit descend and rest is He who will baptize with the Holy Spirit.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_34","073_1_34","JHN","1","34","34","I have seen and testified that this is the Son of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_35","073_1_35","JHN","1","35","35","The next day John was there again with two of his disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_36","073_1_36","JHN","1","36","36","When he saw Jesus walking by, he said, “Look, the Lamb of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_37","073_1_37","JHN","1","37","37","And when the two disciples heard him say this, they followed Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_38","073_1_38","JHN","1","38","38","Jesus turned and saw them following. “What do you want?” He asked. They said to Him, “Rabbi” (which means Teacher), “where are You staying?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_39","073_1_39","JHN","1","39","39","“Come and see,” He replied. So they went and saw where He was staying, and spent that day with Him. It was about the tenth hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_40","073_1_40","JHN","1","40","40","Andrew, Simon Peter’s brother, was one of the two who heard John’s testimony and followed Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_41","073_1_41","JHN","1","41","41","He first found his brother Simon and told him, “We have found the Messiah” (which is translated as Christ). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_42","073_1_42","JHN","1","42","42","Andrew brought him to Jesus, who looked at him and said, “You are Simon son of Jonah. You will be called Cephas” (which is translated as Peter). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_43","073_1_43","JHN","1","43","43","The next day Jesus decided to set out for Galilee. Finding Philip, He told him, “Follow Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_44","073_1_44","JHN","1","44","44","Now Philip was from Bethsaida, the same town as Andrew and Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_45","073_1_45","JHN","1","45","45","Philip found Nathanael and told him, “We have found the One Moses wrote about in the Law, the One the prophets foretold—Jesus of Nazareth, the son of Joseph.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_46","073_1_46","JHN","1","46","46","“Can anything good come from Nazareth?” Nathanael asked. “Come and see,” said Philip. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_47","073_1_47","JHN","1","47","47","When Jesus saw Nathanael approaching, He said of him, “Here is a true Israelite, in whom there is no deceit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_48","073_1_48","JHN","1","48","48","“How do You know me?” Nathanael asked. Jesus replied, “Before Philip called you, I saw you under the fig tree.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_49","073_1_49","JHN","1","49","49","“Rabbi,” Nathanael answered, “You are the Son of God! You are the King of Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_50","073_1_50","JHN","1","50","50","Jesus said to him, “Do you believe just because I said to you, ‘I saw you under the fig tree’? You will see greater things than these.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN1_51","073_1_51","JHN","1","51","51","Then He declared, “Truly, truly, I tell you, from now on you will all see heaven open and the angels of God ascending and descending on the Son of Man.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_1","073_2_1","JHN","2","1","1","On the third day a wedding took place at Cana in Galilee. Jesus’ mother was there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_2","073_2_2","JHN","2","2","2","and Jesus and His disciples had also been invited to the wedding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_3","073_2_3","JHN","2","3","3","When the wine ran out, Jesus’ mother said to Him, “They have no more wine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_4","073_2_4","JHN","2","4","4","“Woman, what is that to you and to Me?” Jesus replied. “My hour has not yet come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_5","073_2_5","JHN","2","5","5","His mother said to the servants, “Do whatever He tells you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_6","073_2_6","JHN","2","6","6","Now six stone water jars had been set there for the Jewish rites of purification. Each could hold from twenty to thirty gallons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_7","073_2_7","JHN","2","7","7","Jesus told the servants, “Fill the jars with water.” So they filled them to the brim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_8","073_2_8","JHN","2","8","8","“Now draw some out,” He said, “and take it to the master of the banquet.” They did so, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_9","073_2_9","JHN","2","9","9","and the master of the banquet tasted the water that had been turned into wine. He did not know where it was from, but the servants who had drawn the water knew. Then he called the bridegroom aside ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_10","073_2_10","JHN","2","10","10","and said, “Everyone serves the fine wine first, and then the cheap wine after the guests are drunk. But you have saved the fine wine until now!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_11","073_2_11","JHN","2","11","11","Jesus performed this, the first of His signs, at Cana in Galilee. He thus revealed His glory, and His disciples believed in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_12","073_2_12","JHN","2","12","12","After this, He went down to Capernaum with His mother and brothers and His disciples, and they stayed there a few days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_13","073_2_13","JHN","2","13","13","When the Jewish Passover was near, Jesus went up to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_14","073_2_14","JHN","2","14","14","In the temple courts He found men selling cattle, sheep, and doves, and money changers seated at their tables. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_15","073_2_15","JHN","2","15","15","So He made a whip out of cords and drove all from the temple courts, both sheep and cattle. He poured out the coins of the money changers and overturned their tables. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_16","073_2_16","JHN","2","16","16","To those selling doves He said, “Get these out of here! How dare you turn My Father’s house into a marketplace!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_17","073_2_17","JHN","2","17","17","His disciples remembered that it is written: “Zeal for Your house will consume Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_18","073_2_18","JHN","2","18","18","On account of this, the Jews demanded, “What sign can You show us to prove Your authority to do these things?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_19","073_2_19","JHN","2","19","19","Jesus answered, “Destroy this temple, and in three days I will raise it up again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_20","073_2_20","JHN","2","20","20","“This temple took forty-six years to build,” the Jews replied, “and You are going to raise it up in three days?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_21","073_2_21","JHN","2","21","21","But Jesus was speaking about the temple of His body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_22","073_2_22","JHN","2","22","22","After He was raised from the dead, His disciples remembered that He had said this. Then they believed the Scripture and the word that Jesus had spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_23","073_2_23","JHN","2","23","23","While He was in Jerusalem at the Passover Feast, many people saw the signs He was doing and believed in His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_24","073_2_24","JHN","2","24","24","But Jesus did not entrust Himself to them, for He knew them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN2_25","073_2_25","JHN","2","25","25","He did not need any testimony about man, for He knew what was in a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_1","073_3_1","JHN","3","1","1","Now there was a man of the Pharisees named Nicodemus, a leader of the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_2","073_3_2","JHN","3","2","2","He came to Jesus at night and said, “Rabbi, we know that You are a teacher who has come from God. For no one could perform the signs You are doing if God were not with him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_3","073_3_3","JHN","3","3","3","Jesus replied, “Truly, truly, I tell you, no one can see the kingdom of God unless he is born again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_4","073_3_4","JHN","3","4","4","“How can a man be born when he is old?” Nicodemus asked. “Can he enter his mother’s womb a second time to be born?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_5","073_3_5","JHN","3","5","5","Jesus answered, “Truly, truly, I tell you, no one can enter the kingdom of God unless he is born of water and the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_6","073_3_6","JHN","3","6","6","Flesh is born of flesh, but spirit is born of the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_7","073_3_7","JHN","3","7","7","Do not be amazed that I said, ‘You must be born again.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_8","073_3_8","JHN","3","8","8","The wind blows where it wishes. You hear its sound, but you do not know where it comes from or where it is going. So it is with everyone born of the Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_9","073_3_9","JHN","3","9","9","“How can this be?” Nicodemus asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_10","073_3_10","JHN","3","10","10","“You are Israel’s teacher,” said Jesus, “and you do not understand these things? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_11","073_3_11","JHN","3","11","11","Truly, truly, I tell you, we speak of what we know, and we testify to what we have seen, and yet you people do not accept our testimony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_12","073_3_12","JHN","3","12","12","If I have told you about earthly things and you do not believe, how will you believe if I tell you about heavenly things? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_13","073_3_13","JHN","3","13","13","No one has ascended into heaven except the One who descended from heaven—the Son of Man, who is in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_14","073_3_14","JHN","3","14","14","Just as Moses lifted up the snake in the wilderness, so the Son of Man must be lifted up, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_15","073_3_15","JHN","3","15","15","that everyone who believes in Him may not perish, but may have eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_16","073_3_16","JHN","3","16","16","For God so loved the world that He gave His one and only Son, that everyone who believes in Him shall not perish but have eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_17","073_3_17","JHN","3","17","17","For God did not send His Son into the world to condemn the world, but to save the world through Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_18","073_3_18","JHN","3","18","18","Whoever believes in Him is not condemned, but whoever does not believe has already been condemned, because he has not believed in the name of God’s one and only Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_19","073_3_19","JHN","3","19","19","And this is the verdict: The Light has come into the world, but men loved the darkness rather than the Light because their deeds were evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_20","073_3_20","JHN","3","20","20","Everyone who does evil hates the Light, and does not come into the Light for fear that his deeds will be exposed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_21","073_3_21","JHN","3","21","21","But whoever practices the truth comes into the Light, so that it may be seen clearly that what he has done has been accomplished in God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_22","073_3_22","JHN","3","22","22","After this, Jesus and His disciples went into the Judean countryside, where He spent some time with them and baptized. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_23","073_3_23","JHN","3","23","23","Now John was also baptizing at Aenon near Salem, because the water was plentiful there, and people kept coming to be baptized. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_24","073_3_24","JHN","3","24","24","(For John had not yet been thrown into prison.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_25","073_3_25","JHN","3","25","25","Then a dispute arose between John’s disciples and a certain Jew over the issue of ceremonial washing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_26","073_3_26","JHN","3","26","26","So John’s disciples came to him and said, “Look, Rabbi, the One who was with you beyond the Jordan, the One you testified about—He is baptizing, and everyone is going to Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_27","073_3_27","JHN","3","27","27","John replied, “A man can receive only what is given him from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_28","073_3_28","JHN","3","28","28","You yourselves can testify that I said, ‘I am not the Christ, but am sent ahead of Him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_29","073_3_29","JHN","3","29","29","The bride belongs to the bridegroom. The friend of the bridegroom stands and listens for him, and is overjoyed to hear the bridegroom’s voice. That joy is mine, and it is now complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_30","073_3_30","JHN","3","30","30","He must increase; I must decrease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_31","073_3_31","JHN","3","31","31","The One who comes from above is above all. The one who is from the earth belongs to the earth and speaks as one from the earth. The One who comes from heaven is above all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_32","073_3_32","JHN","3","32","32","He testifies to what He has seen and heard, yet no one accepts His testimony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_33","073_3_33","JHN","3","33","33","Whoever accepts His testimony has certified that God is truthful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_34","073_3_34","JHN","3","34","34","For the One whom God has sent speaks the words of God, for God gives the Spirit without limit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_35","073_3_35","JHN","3","35","35","The Father loves the Son and has placed all things in His hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN3_36","073_3_36","JHN","3","36","36","Whoever believes in the Son has eternal life. Whoever rejects the Son will not see life. Instead, the wrath of God remains on him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_1","073_4_1","JHN","4","1","1","When the Lord realized that the Pharisees were aware that Jesus was gaining and baptizing more disciples than John ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_2","073_4_2","JHN","4","2","2","(although it was not Jesus who baptized, but His disciples), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_3","073_4_3","JHN","4","3","3","He left Judea and went away to Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_4","073_4_4","JHN","4","4","4","Now He had to pass through Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_5","073_4_5","JHN","4","5","5","So He came to a town of Samaria called Sychar, near the plot of ground that Jacob had given to his son Joseph. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_6","073_4_6","JHN","4","6","6","Since Jacob’s well was there, Jesus, weary from His journey, sat down by the well. It was about the sixth hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_7","073_4_7","JHN","4","7","7","When a Samaritan woman came to draw water, Jesus said to her, “Give Me a drink.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_8","073_4_8","JHN","4","8","8","(His disciples had gone into the town to buy food.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_9","073_4_9","JHN","4","9","9","“You are a Jew,” said the woman. “How can You ask for a drink from me, a Samaritan woman?” (For Jews do not associate with Samaritans.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_10","073_4_10","JHN","4","10","10","Jesus answered, “If you knew the gift of God and who is asking you for a drink, you would have asked Him, and He would have given you living water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_11","073_4_11","JHN","4","11","11","“Sir,” the woman replied, “You have nothing to draw with and the well is deep. Where then will You get this living water? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_12","073_4_12","JHN","4","12","12","Are You greater than our father Jacob, who gave us this well and drank from it himself, as did his sons and his livestock?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_13","073_4_13","JHN","4","13","13","Jesus said to her, “Everyone who drinks this water will be thirsty again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_14","073_4_14","JHN","4","14","14","But whoever drinks the water I give him will never thirst. Indeed, the water I give him will become in him a fount of water springing up to eternal life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_15","073_4_15","JHN","4","15","15","The woman said to Him, “Sir, give me this water so that I will not get thirsty and have to keep coming here to draw water.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_16","073_4_16","JHN","4","16","16","Jesus told her, “Go, call your husband and come back.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_17","073_4_17","JHN","4","17","17","“I have no husband,” the woman replied. Jesus said to her, “You are correct to say that you have no husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_18","073_4_18","JHN","4","18","18","In fact, you have had five husbands, and the man you now have is not your husband. You have spoken truthfully.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_19","073_4_19","JHN","4","19","19","“Sir,” the woman said, “I see that You are a prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_20","073_4_20","JHN","4","20","20","Our fathers worshiped on this mountain, but you Jews say that the place where one must worship is in Jerusalem.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_21","073_4_21","JHN","4","21","21","“Believe Me, woman,” Jesus replied, “a time is coming when you will worship the Father neither on this mountain nor in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_22","073_4_22","JHN","4","22","22","You worship what you do not know; we worship what we do know, for salvation is from the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_23","073_4_23","JHN","4","23","23","But a time is coming and has now come when the true worshipers will worship the Father in spirit and in truth, for the Father is seeking such as these to worship Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_24","073_4_24","JHN","4","24","24","God is Spirit, and His worshipers must worship Him in spirit and in truth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_25","073_4_25","JHN","4","25","25","The woman said, “I know that Messiah” (called Christ) “is coming. When He comes, He will explain everything to us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_26","073_4_26","JHN","4","26","26","Jesus answered, “I who speak to you am He.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_27","073_4_27","JHN","4","27","27","Just then His disciples returned and were surprised that He was speaking with a woman. But no one asked Him, “What do You want from her?” or “Why are You talking with her?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_28","073_4_28","JHN","4","28","28","Then the woman left her water jar, went back into the town, and said to the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_29","073_4_29","JHN","4","29","29","“Come, see a man who told me everything I ever did. Could this be the Christ?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_30","073_4_30","JHN","4","30","30","So they left the town and made their way toward Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_31","073_4_31","JHN","4","31","31","Meanwhile the disciples urged Him, “Rabbi, eat something.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_32","073_4_32","JHN","4","32","32","But He told them, “I have food to eat that you know nothing about.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_33","073_4_33","JHN","4","33","33","So the disciples asked one another, “Could someone have brought Him food?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_34","073_4_34","JHN","4","34","34","Jesus explained, “My food is to do the will of Him who sent Me and to finish His work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_35","073_4_35","JHN","4","35","35","Do you not say, ‘There are still four months until the harvest’? I tell you, lift up your eyes and look at the fields, for they are ripe for harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_36","073_4_36","JHN","4","36","36","Already the reaper draws his wages and gathers a crop for eternal life, so that both the sower and the reaper may rejoice together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_37","073_4_37","JHN","4","37","37","For in this case the saying ‘One sows and another reaps’ is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_38","073_4_38","JHN","4","38","38","I sent you to reap what you have not worked for; others have done the hard work, and now you have taken up their labor.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_39","073_4_39","JHN","4","39","39","Many of the Samaritans from that town believed in Jesus because of the woman’s testimony, “He told me everything I ever did.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_40","073_4_40","JHN","4","40","40","So when the Samaritans came to Him, they asked Him to stay with them, and He stayed two days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_41","073_4_41","JHN","4","41","41","And many more believed because of His message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_42","073_4_42","JHN","4","42","42","They said to the woman, “We now believe not only because of your words; we have heard for ourselves, and we know that this man truly is the Christ, the Savior of the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_43","073_4_43","JHN","4","43","43","After two days, Jesus left and went to Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_44","073_4_44","JHN","4","44","44","Now He Himself had testified that a prophet has no honor in his own hometown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_45","073_4_45","JHN","4","45","45","Yet when He arrived, the Galileans welcomed Him. They had seen all the great things He had done in Jerusalem at the feast, for they had gone there as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_46","073_4_46","JHN","4","46","46","So once again Jesus came to Cana in Galilee, where He had turned the water into wine. And there was a royal official whose son lay sick at Capernaum. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_47","073_4_47","JHN","4","47","47","When he heard that Jesus had come from Judea to Galilee, he went and begged Him to come down and heal his son, who was about to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_48","073_4_48","JHN","4","48","48","Jesus said to him, “Unless you people see signs and wonders, you will never believe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_49","073_4_49","JHN","4","49","49","“Sir,” the official said, “come down before my child dies.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_50","073_4_50","JHN","4","50","50","“Go,” said Jesus. “Your son will live.” The man took Jesus at His word and departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_51","073_4_51","JHN","4","51","51","And while he was still on the way, his servants met him with the news: “Your boy is alive.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_52","073_4_52","JHN","4","52","52","So he inquired as to the hour when his son had recovered, and they told him, “The fever left him yesterday at the seventh hour.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_53","073_4_53","JHN","4","53","53","Then the father realized that this was the very hour in which Jesus had told him, “Your son will live.” And he and all his household believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN4_54","073_4_54","JHN","4","54","54","This was now the second sign that Jesus performed after coming from Judea into Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_1","073_5_1","JHN","5","1","1","Some time later came the feast of the Jews, and Jesus went up to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_2","073_5_2","JHN","5","2","2","Now there is in Jerusalem near the Sheep Gate a pool with five covered colonnades, which in Hebrew is called Bethesda. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_3","073_5_3","JHN","5","3","3","On these walkways lay a great number of the sick, the blind, the lame, and the paralyzed, awaiting the moving of the water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_4","073_5_4","JHN","5","4","4","For from time to time an angel descended into the pool and stirred the water. As soon as the water was stirred, the first to enter the pool would be healed of his disease. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_5","073_5_5","JHN","5","5","5","One man there had been an invalid for thirty-eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_6","073_5_6","JHN","5","6","6","When Jesus saw him lying there and realized that he had spent a long time in this condition, He asked him, “Do you want to get well?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_7","073_5_7","JHN","5","7","7","“Sir,” the invalid replied, “I have no one to help me into the pool when the water is stirred. While I am on my way, someone else goes in before me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_8","073_5_8","JHN","5","8","8","Then Jesus told him, “Get up, pick up your mat, and walk.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_9","073_5_9","JHN","5","9","9","Immediately the man was made well, and he picked up his mat and began to walk. Now this happened on the Sabbath day, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_10","073_5_10","JHN","5","10","10","so the Jews said to the man who had been healed, “This is the Sabbath! It is unlawful for you to carry your mat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_11","073_5_11","JHN","5","11","11","But he answered, “The man who made me well told me, ‘Pick up your mat and walk.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_12","073_5_12","JHN","5","12","12","“Who is this man who told you to pick up your mat and walk?” they asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_13","073_5_13","JHN","5","13","13","But the man who was healed did not know who it was, for Jesus had slipped away while the crowd was there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_14","073_5_14","JHN","5","14","14","Afterward, Jesus found the man at the temple and said to him, “See, you have been made well. Stop sinning, or something worse may happen to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_15","073_5_15","JHN","5","15","15","And the man went away and told the Jews that it was Jesus who had made him well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_16","073_5_16","JHN","5","16","16","Now because Jesus was doing these things on the Sabbath, the Jews began to persecute Him and were seeking to kill Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_17","073_5_17","JHN","5","17","17","But Jesus answered them, “To this very day My Father is at His work, and I too am working.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_18","073_5_18","JHN","5","18","18","Because of this, the Jews tried all the harder to kill Him. Not only was He breaking the Sabbath, but He was even calling God His own Father, making Himself equal with God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_19","073_5_19","JHN","5","19","19","So Jesus replied, “Truly, truly, I tell you, the Son can do nothing by Himself, unless He sees the Father doing it. For whatever the Father does, the Son also does. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_20","073_5_20","JHN","5","20","20","The Father loves the Son and shows Him all He does. And to your amazement, He will show Him even greater works than these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_21","073_5_21","JHN","5","21","21","For just as the Father raises the dead and gives them life, so also the Son gives life to whom He wishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_22","073_5_22","JHN","5","22","22","Furthermore, the Father judges no one, but has assigned all judgment to the Son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_23","073_5_23","JHN","5","23","23","so that all may honor the Son just as they honor the Father. Whoever does not honor the Son does not honor the Father who sent Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_24","073_5_24","JHN","5","24","24","Truly, truly, I tell you, whoever hears My word and believes Him who sent Me has eternal life and will not come under judgment. Indeed, he has crossed over from death to life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_25","073_5_25","JHN","5","25","25","Truly, truly, I tell you, the hour is coming and has now come when the dead will hear the voice of the Son of God, and those who hear will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_26","073_5_26","JHN","5","26","26","For as the Father has life in Himself, so also He has granted the Son to have life in Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_27","073_5_27","JHN","5","27","27","And He has given Him authority to execute judgment, because He is the Son of Man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_28","073_5_28","JHN","5","28","28","Do not be amazed at this, for the hour is coming when all who are in their graves will hear His voice ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_29","073_5_29","JHN","5","29","29","and come out—those who have done good to the resurrection of life, and those who have done evil to the resurrection of judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_30","073_5_30","JHN","5","30","30","I can do nothing by Myself; I judge only as I hear. And My judgment is just, because I do not seek My own will, but the will of the Father who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_31","073_5_31","JHN","5","31","31","If I testify about Myself, My testimony is not valid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_32","073_5_32","JHN","5","32","32","There is another who testifies about Me, and I know that His testimony about Me is valid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_33","073_5_33","JHN","5","33","33","You have sent to John, and he has testified to the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_34","073_5_34","JHN","5","34","34","Even though I do not accept human testimony, I say these things so that you may be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_35","073_5_35","JHN","5","35","35","John was a lamp that burned and gave light, and you were willing for a season to bask in his light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_36","073_5_36","JHN","5","36","36","But I have testimony more substantial than that of John. For the works that the Father has given Me to accomplish—the very works I am doing—testify about Me that the Father has sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_37","073_5_37","JHN","5","37","37","And the Father who sent Me has Himself testified about Me. You have never heard His voice nor seen His form, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_38","073_5_38","JHN","5","38","38","nor does His word abide in you, because you do not believe the One He sent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_39","073_5_39","JHN","5","39","39","You pore over the Scriptures because you presume that by them you possess eternal life. These are the very words that testify about Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_40","073_5_40","JHN","5","40","40","yet you refuse to come to Me to have life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_41","073_5_41","JHN","5","41","41","I do not accept glory from men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_42","073_5_42","JHN","5","42","42","but I know you, that you do not have the love of God within you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_43","073_5_43","JHN","5","43","43","I have come in My Father’s name, and you have not received Me; but if someone else comes in his own name, you will receive him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_44","073_5_44","JHN","5","44","44","How can you believe if you accept glory from one another, yet do not seek the glory that comes from the only God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_45","073_5_45","JHN","5","45","45","Do not think that I will accuse you before the Father. Your accuser is Moses, in whom you have put your hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_46","073_5_46","JHN","5","46","46","If you had believed Moses, you would believe Me, because he wrote about Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN5_47","073_5_47","JHN","5","47","47","But since you do not believe what he wrote, how will you believe what I say?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_1","073_6_1","JHN","6","1","1","After this, Jesus crossed to the other side of the Sea of Galilee (that is, the Sea of Tiberias). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_2","073_6_2","JHN","6","2","2","A large crowd followed Him because they saw His signs He was performing on the sick. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_3","073_6_3","JHN","6","3","3","Then Jesus went up on the mountain and sat down with His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_4","073_6_4","JHN","6","4","4","Now the Jewish Feast of the Passover was near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_5","073_6_5","JHN","6","5","5","When Jesus looked up and saw a large crowd coming toward Him, He said to Philip, “Where can we buy bread for these people to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_6","073_6_6","JHN","6","6","6","But He was asking this to test him, for He knew what He was about to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_7","073_6_7","JHN","6","7","7","Philip answered, “Two hundred denarii would not buy enough bread for each of them to have a small piece.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_8","073_6_8","JHN","6","8","8","One of His disciples, Andrew, Simon Peter’s brother, said to Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_9","073_6_9","JHN","6","9","9","“Here is a boy with five barley loaves and two small fish. But what difference will these make among so many?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_10","073_6_10","JHN","6","10","10","“Have the people sit down,” Jesus said. Now there was plenty of grass in that place, so the men sat down, about five thousand of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_11","073_6_11","JHN","6","11","11","Then Jesus took the loaves, gave thanks, and distributed them to the disciples, and the disciples to those who were seated—and the fish—as much as they wanted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_12","073_6_12","JHN","6","12","12","And when everyone was full, He said to His disciples, “Gather the pieces that are left over, so that nothing will be wasted.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_13","073_6_13","JHN","6","13","13","So they collected them and filled twelve baskets with the pieces of the five barley loaves left over by those who had eaten. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_14","073_6_14","JHN","6","14","14","When the people saw the sign that Jesus had performed, they began to say, “Truly this is the Prophet who is to come into the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_15","073_6_15","JHN","6","15","15","Then Jesus, realizing that they were about to come and make Him king by force, withdrew to a mountain by Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_16","073_6_16","JHN","6","16","16","When evening came, His disciples went down to the sea, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_17","073_6_17","JHN","6","17","17","got into a boat, and started across the sea to Capernaum. It was already dark, and Jesus had not gone out to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_18","073_6_18","JHN","6","18","18","A strong wind was blowing, and the sea grew agitated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_19","073_6_19","JHN","6","19","19","When they had rowed about three or four miles, they saw Jesus approaching the boat, walking on the sea—and they were terrified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_20","073_6_20","JHN","6","20","20","But Jesus spoke up: “It is I; do not be afraid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_21","073_6_21","JHN","6","21","21","Then they were willing to take Him into the boat, and at once the boat reached the shore where they were heading. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_22","073_6_22","JHN","6","22","22","The next day, the crowd that had remained on the other side of the sea realized that no other boat had been there except the one that His disciples had entered, and that Jesus had not boarded it with His disciples, but they had gone away alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_23","073_6_23","JHN","6","23","23","Then other boats, which were from Tiberias, landed near the place where the people had eaten the bread after the Lord had given thanks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_24","073_6_24","JHN","6","24","24","So when the crowd saw that neither Jesus nor His disciples were there, they got into the boats and went to Capernaum to look for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_25","073_6_25","JHN","6","25","25","When they found Him on the other side of the sea, they asked Him, “Rabbi, when did You get here?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_26","073_6_26","JHN","6","26","26","Jesus replied, “Truly, truly, I tell you, it is not because you saw these signs that you are looking for Me, but because you ate the loaves and had your fill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_27","073_6_27","JHN","6","27","27","Do not work for food that perishes, but for food that endures to eternal life, which the Son of Man will give you. For on Him God the Father has placed His seal of approval.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_28","073_6_28","JHN","6","28","28","Then they inquired, “What must we do to perform the works of God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_29","073_6_29","JHN","6","29","29","Jesus replied, “The work of God is this: to believe in the One He has sent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_30","073_6_30","JHN","6","30","30","So they asked Him, “What sign then will You perform, so that we may see it and believe You? What will You do? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_31","073_6_31","JHN","6","31","31","Our fathers ate the manna in the wilderness, as it is written: ‘He gave them bread from heaven to eat.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_32","073_6_32","JHN","6","32","32","Jesus said to them, “Truly, truly, I tell you, it was not Moses who gave you the bread from heaven, but it is My Father who gives you the true bread from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_33","073_6_33","JHN","6","33","33","For the bread of God is He who comes down from heaven and gives life to the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_34","073_6_34","JHN","6","34","34","“Sir,” they said, “give us this bread at all times.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_35","073_6_35","JHN","6","35","35","Jesus answered, “I am the bread of life. Whoever comes to Me will never hunger, and whoever believes in Me will never thirst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_36","073_6_36","JHN","6","36","36","But as I stated, you have seen Me and still you do not believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_37","073_6_37","JHN","6","37","37","Everyone the Father gives Me will come to Me, and the one who comes to Me I will never drive away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_38","073_6_38","JHN","6","38","38","For I have come down from heaven, not to do My own will, but to do the will of Him who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_39","073_6_39","JHN","6","39","39","And this is the will of the Father who sent Me, that I shall lose none of those He has given Me, but raise them up at the last day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_40","073_6_40","JHN","6","40","40","And it is the will of Him who sent Me that everyone who looks to the Son and believes in Him shall have eternal life, and I will raise him up at the last day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_41","073_6_41","JHN","6","41","41","At this, the Jews began to grumble about Jesus because He had said, “I am the bread that came down from heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_42","073_6_42","JHN","6","42","42","They were asking, “Is this not Jesus, the son of Joseph, whose father and mother we know? How then can He say, ‘I have come down from heaven’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_43","073_6_43","JHN","6","43","43","“Stop grumbling among yourselves,” Jesus therefore replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_44","073_6_44","JHN","6","44","44","“No one can come to Me unless the Father who sent Me draws him, and I will raise him up at the last day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_45","073_6_45","JHN","6","45","45","It is written in the Prophets: ‘And they will all be taught by God.’ Therefore everyone who has heard the Father and learned from Him comes to Me— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_46","073_6_46","JHN","6","46","46","not that anyone has seen the Father except the One who is from God; only He has seen the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_47","073_6_47","JHN","6","47","47","Truly, truly, I tell you, he who believes in Me has eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_48","073_6_48","JHN","6","48","48","I am the bread of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_49","073_6_49","JHN","6","49","49","Your fathers ate the manna in the wilderness, yet they died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_50","073_6_50","JHN","6","50","50","This is the bread that comes down from heaven, so that anyone may eat of it and not die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_51","073_6_51","JHN","6","51","51","I am the living bread that came down from heaven. If anyone eats of this bread, he will live forever. And this bread, which I will give for the life of the world, is My flesh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_52","073_6_52","JHN","6","52","52","At this, the Jews began to argue among themselves, “How can this man give us His flesh to eat?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_53","073_6_53","JHN","6","53","53","So Jesus said to them, “Truly, truly, I tell you, unless you eat the flesh and drink the blood of the Son of Man, you have no life in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_54","073_6_54","JHN","6","54","54","Whoever eats My flesh and drinks My blood has eternal life, and I will raise him up at the last day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_55","073_6_55","JHN","6","55","55","For My flesh is truly food, and My blood is truly drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_56","073_6_56","JHN","6","56","56","Whoever eats My flesh and drinks My blood remains in Me, and I in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_57","073_6_57","JHN","6","57","57","Just as the living Father sent Me and I live because of the Father, so also the one who feeds on Me will live because of Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_58","073_6_58","JHN","6","58","58","This is the bread that came down from heaven. Unlike your fathers, who ate the manna and died, the one who eats this bread will live forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_59","073_6_59","JHN","6","59","59","Jesus said this while teaching in the synagogue in Capernaum. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_60","073_6_60","JHN","6","60","60","On hearing it, many of His disciples said, “This is a difficult teaching. Who can accept it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_61","073_6_61","JHN","6","61","61","Aware that His disciples were grumbling about this teaching, Jesus asked them, “Does this offend you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_62","073_6_62","JHN","6","62","62","Then what will happen if you see the Son of Man ascend to where He was before? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_63","073_6_63","JHN","6","63","63","The Spirit gives life; the flesh profits nothing. The words I speak to you are spirit and they are life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_64","073_6_64","JHN","6","64","64","However, there are some of you who do not believe.” (For Jesus had known from the beginning which of them did not believe and who would betray Him.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_65","073_6_65","JHN","6","65","65","Then Jesus said, “This is why I told you that no one can come to Me unless My Father has granted it to him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_66","073_6_66","JHN","6","66","66","From that time on many of His disciples turned back and no longer walked with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_67","073_6_67","JHN","6","67","67","So Jesus asked the Twelve, “Do you want to leave too?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_68","073_6_68","JHN","6","68","68","Simon Peter replied, “Lord, to whom would we go? You have the words of eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_69","073_6_69","JHN","6","69","69","We believe and know that You are the Christ, the Son of the living God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_70","073_6_70","JHN","6","70","70","Jesus answered them, “Have I not chosen you, the Twelve? Yet one of you is a devil!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN6_71","073_6_71","JHN","6","71","71","He was speaking about Judas Iscariot, the son of Simon. For although Judas was one of the Twelve, he was later to betray Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_1","073_7_1","JHN","7","1","1","After this, Jesus traveled throughout Galilee. He did not want to travel in Judea, because the Jews there were trying to kill Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_2","073_7_2","JHN","7","2","2","However, the Jewish Feast of Tabernacles was near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_3","073_7_3","JHN","7","3","3","So Jesus’ brothers said to Him, “Leave here and go to Judea, so that Your disciples there may see the works You are doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_4","073_7_4","JHN","7","4","4","For no one who wants to be known publicly acts in secret. Since You are doing these things, show Yourself to the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_5","073_7_5","JHN","7","5","5","For even His own brothers did not believe in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_6","073_7_6","JHN","7","6","6","Therefore Jesus told them, “Although your time is always at hand, My time has not yet come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_7","073_7_7","JHN","7","7","7","The world cannot hate you, but it hates Me, because I testify that its works are evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_8","073_7_8","JHN","7","8","8","Go up to the feast on your own. I am not yet going up to this feast, because My time has not yet come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_9","073_7_9","JHN","7","9","9","Having said this to them, Jesus remained in Galilee. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_10","073_7_10","JHN","7","10","10","But after His brothers had gone up to the feast, He also went—not publicly, but in secret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_11","073_7_11","JHN","7","11","11","So the Jews were looking for Him at the feast and asking, “Where is He?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_12","073_7_12","JHN","7","12","12","Many in the crowds were whispering about Him. Some said, “He is a good man.” But others replied, “No, He deceives the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_13","073_7_13","JHN","7","13","13","Yet no one would speak publicly about Him for fear of the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_14","073_7_14","JHN","7","14","14","About halfway through the feast, Jesus went up to the temple courts and began to teach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_15","073_7_15","JHN","7","15","15","The Jews were amazed and asked, “How did this man attain such learning without having studied?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_16","073_7_16","JHN","7","16","16","“My teaching is not My own,” Jesus replied. “It comes from Him who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_17","073_7_17","JHN","7","17","17","If anyone desires to do His will, he will know whether My teaching is from God or whether I speak on My own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_18","073_7_18","JHN","7","18","18","He who speaks on his own authority seeks his own glory, but He who seeks the glory of the One who sent Him is a man of truth; in Him there is no falsehood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_19","073_7_19","JHN","7","19","19","Has not Moses given you the law? Yet not one of you keeps it. Why are you trying to kill Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_20","073_7_20","JHN","7","20","20","“You have a demon,” the crowd replied. “Who is trying to kill You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_21","073_7_21","JHN","7","21","21","Jesus answered them, “I did one miracle, and you are all amazed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_22","073_7_22","JHN","7","22","22","But because Moses gave you circumcision, you circumcise a boy on the Sabbath (not that it is from Moses, but from the patriarchs.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_23","073_7_23","JHN","7","23","23","If a boy can be circumcised on the Sabbath so that the law of Moses will not be broken, why are you angry with Me for making the whole man well on the Sabbath? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_24","073_7_24","JHN","7","24","24","Stop judging by outward appearances, and start judging justly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_25","073_7_25","JHN","7","25","25","Then some of the people of Jerusalem began to say, “Isn’t this the man they are trying to kill? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_26","073_7_26","JHN","7","26","26","Yet here He is, speaking publicly, and they are not saying anything to Him. Have the rulers truly recognized that this is the Christ? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_27","073_7_27","JHN","7","27","27","But we know where this man is from. When the Christ comes, no one will know where He is from.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_28","073_7_28","JHN","7","28","28","Then Jesus, still teaching in the temple courts, cried out, “You know Me, and you know where I am from. I have not come of My own accord, but He who sent Me is true. You do not know Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_29","073_7_29","JHN","7","29","29","but I know Him, because I am from Him and He sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_30","073_7_30","JHN","7","30","30","So they tried to seize Him, but no one laid a hand on Him, because His hour had not yet come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_31","073_7_31","JHN","7","31","31","Many in the crowd, however, believed in Him and said, “When the Christ comes, will He perform more signs than this man?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_32","073_7_32","JHN","7","32","32","When the Pharisees heard the crowd whispering these things about Jesus, they and the chief priests sent officers to arrest Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_33","073_7_33","JHN","7","33","33","So Jesus said, “I am with you only a little while longer, and then I am going to the One who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_34","073_7_34","JHN","7","34","34","You will look for Me, but you will not find Me; and where I am, you cannot come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_35","073_7_35","JHN","7","35","35","At this, the Jews said to one another, “Where does He intend to go that we will not find Him? Will He go where the Jews are dispersed among the Greeks, and teach the Greeks? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_36","073_7_36","JHN","7","36","36","What does He mean by saying, ‘You will look for Me, but you will not find Me,’ and, ‘Where I am, you cannot come’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_37","073_7_37","JHN","7","37","37","On the last and greatest day of the feast, Jesus stood up and called out in a loud voice, “If anyone is thirsty, let him come to Me and drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_38","073_7_38","JHN","7","38","38","Whoever believes in Me, as the Scripture has said: ‘Streams of living water will flow from within him.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_39","073_7_39","JHN","7","39","39","He was speaking about the Spirit, whom those who believed in Him were later to receive. For the Holy Spirit had not yet been given, because Jesus had not yet been glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_40","073_7_40","JHN","7","40","40","On hearing these words, many of the people therefore said, “This is truly the Prophet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_41","073_7_41","JHN","7","41","41","Others declared, “This is the Christ.” But still others asked, “How can the Christ come from Galilee? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_42","073_7_42","JHN","7","42","42","Doesn’t the Scripture say that the Christ will come from the line of David and from Bethlehem, the village where David lived?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_43","073_7_43","JHN","7","43","43","So there was division in the crowd because of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_44","073_7_44","JHN","7","44","44","Some of them wanted to seize Him, but no one laid a hand on Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_45","073_7_45","JHN","7","45","45","Then the officers returned to the chief priests and Pharisees, who asked them, “Why didn’t you bring Him in?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_46","073_7_46","JHN","7","46","46","“Never has anyone spoken like this man!” the officers answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_47","073_7_47","JHN","7","47","47","“Have you also been deceived?” replied the Pharisees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_48","073_7_48","JHN","7","48","48","“Have any of the rulers or Pharisees believed in Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_49","073_7_49","JHN","7","49","49","But this crowd that does not know the law—they are under a curse.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_50","073_7_50","JHN","7","50","50","Nicodemus, who had gone to Jesus by night and who himself was one of them, asked, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_51","073_7_51","JHN","7","51","51","“Does our law convict a man without first hearing from him to determine what he has done?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_52","073_7_52","JHN","7","52","52","“Aren’t you also from Galilee?” they replied. “Look into it, and you will see that no prophet comes out of Galilee.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN7_53","073_7_53","JHN","7","53","53","Then each went to his own home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_1","073_8_1","JHN","8","1","1","But Jesus went to the Mount of Olives. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_2","073_8_2","JHN","8","2","2","Early in the morning He went back into the temple courts. All the people came to Him, and He sat down to teach them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_3","073_8_3","JHN","8","3","3","The scribes and Pharisees, however, brought to Him a woman caught in adultery. They made her stand before them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_4","073_8_4","JHN","8","4","4","and to test Him they said, “Teacher, this woman was caught in the act of adultery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_5","073_8_5","JHN","8","5","5","In the Law Moses commanded us to stone such a woman. So what do You say?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_6","073_8_6","JHN","8","6","6","They said this to test Him, in order to have a basis for accusing Him. But Jesus bent down and began to write on the ground with His finger, not taking notice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_7","073_8_7","JHN","8","7","7","When they continued to question Him, He straightened up and said to them, “Let him who is without sin among you be the first to cast a stone at her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_8","073_8_8","JHN","8","8","8","And again He bent down and wrote on the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_9","073_8_9","JHN","8","9","9","When they heard this and were convicted by their consciences, they began to go away one by one, beginning with the older ones, until only Jesus was left, with the woman standing there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_10","073_8_10","JHN","8","10","10","Then Jesus straightened up and saw no one but the woman. And He asked her, “Where are your accusers? Has no one condemned you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_11","073_8_11","JHN","8","11","11","“No one, Lord,” she answered. “Then neither do I condemn you,” Jesus declared. “Go and sin no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_12","073_8_12","JHN","8","12","12","Once again, Jesus spoke to the people and said, “I am the light of the world. Whoever follows Me will never walk in the darkness, but will have the light of life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_13","073_8_13","JHN","8","13","13","So the Pharisees said to Him, “You are testifying about Yourself; Your testimony is not valid.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_14","073_8_14","JHN","8","14","14","Jesus replied, “Even if I testify about Myself, My testimony is valid, because I know where I came from and where I am going. But you do not know where I came from or where I am going. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_15","073_8_15","JHN","8","15","15","You judge according to the flesh; I judge no one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_16","073_8_16","JHN","8","16","16","But even if I do judge, My judgment is true, because I am not alone; I am with the Father who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_17","073_8_17","JHN","8","17","17","Even in your own Law it is written that the testimony of two men is valid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_18","073_8_18","JHN","8","18","18","I am One who testifies about Myself, and the Father, who sent Me, also testifies about Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_19","073_8_19","JHN","8","19","19","“Where is Your Father?” they asked Him. “You do not know Me or My Father,” Jesus answered. “If you knew Me, you would know My Father as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_20","073_8_20","JHN","8","20","20","Jesus spoke these words while teaching in the temple courts, near the treasury. Yet no one seized Him, because His hour had not yet come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_21","073_8_21","JHN","8","21","21","Again Jesus said to them, “I am going away, and you will look for Me, but you will die in your sin. Where I am going, you cannot come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_22","073_8_22","JHN","8","22","22","So the Jews began to ask, “Will He kill Himself, since He says, ‘Where I am going, you cannot come’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_23","073_8_23","JHN","8","23","23","Then He told them, “You are from below; I am from above. You are of this world; I am not of this world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_24","073_8_24","JHN","8","24","24","That is why I told you that you would die in your sins. For unless you believe that I am He, you will die in your sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_25","073_8_25","JHN","8","25","25","“Who are You?” they asked. “Just what I have been telling you from the beginning,” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_26","073_8_26","JHN","8","26","26","“I have much to say about you and much to judge. But the One who sent Me is truthful, and what I have heard from Him, I tell the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_27","073_8_27","JHN","8","27","27","They did not understand that He was telling them about the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_28","073_8_28","JHN","8","28","28","So Jesus said, “When you have lifted up the Son of Man, then you will know that I am He, and that I do nothing on My own, but speak exactly what My Father has taught Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_29","073_8_29","JHN","8","29","29","He who sent Me is with Me. The Father has not left Me alone, because I always do what pleases Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_30","073_8_30","JHN","8","30","30","As Jesus spoke these things, many believed in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_31","073_8_31","JHN","8","31","31","So He said to the Jews who had believed Him, “If you continue in My word, you are truly My disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_32","073_8_32","JHN","8","32","32","Then you will know the truth, and the truth will set you free.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_33","073_8_33","JHN","8","33","33","“We are Abraham’s descendants,” they answered. “We have never been slaves to anyone. How can You say we will be set free?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_34","073_8_34","JHN","8","34","34","Jesus replied, “Truly, truly, I tell you, everyone who sins is a slave to sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_35","073_8_35","JHN","8","35","35","A slave does not remain in the house forever, but a son remains forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_36","073_8_36","JHN","8","36","36","So if the Son sets you free, you will be free indeed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_37","073_8_37","JHN","8","37","37","I know you are Abraham’s descendants, but you are trying to kill Me because My word has no place within you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_38","073_8_38","JHN","8","38","38","I speak of what I have seen in the presence of My Father, and you do what you have seen from your father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_39","073_8_39","JHN","8","39","39","“Abraham is our father,” they replied. “If you were children of Abraham,” said Jesus, “you would do the works of Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_40","073_8_40","JHN","8","40","40","But now you are trying to kill Me, a man who has told you the truth that I heard from God. Abraham never did such a thing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_41","073_8_41","JHN","8","41","41","You are doing the works of your father.” “We are not illegitimate children,” they declared. “Our only Father is God Himself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_42","073_8_42","JHN","8","42","42","Jesus said to them, “If God were your Father, you would love Me, for I have come here from God. I have not come on My own, but He sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_43","073_8_43","JHN","8","43","43","Why do you not understand what I am saying? It is because you are unable to accept My message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_44","073_8_44","JHN","8","44","44","You belong to your father, the devil, and you want to carry out his desires. He was a murderer from the beginning, refusing to stand in the truth, because there is no truth in him. When he lies, he speaks his native language, because he is a liar and the father of lies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_45","073_8_45","JHN","8","45","45","But because I speak the truth, you do not believe Me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_46","073_8_46","JHN","8","46","46","Which of you can prove Me guilty of sin? If I speak the truth, why do you not believe Me? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_47","073_8_47","JHN","8","47","47","Whoever belongs to God hears the words of God. The reason you do not hear is that you do not belong to God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_48","073_8_48","JHN","8","48","48","The Jews answered Him, “Are we not right to say that You are a Samaritan and You have a demon?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_49","073_8_49","JHN","8","49","49","“I do not have a demon,” Jesus replied, “but I honor My Father, and you dishonor Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_50","073_8_50","JHN","8","50","50","I do not seek My own glory. There is One who seeks it, and He is the Judge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_51","073_8_51","JHN","8","51","51","Truly, truly, I tell you, if anyone keeps My word, he will never see death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_52","073_8_52","JHN","8","52","52","“Now we know that You have a demon!” declared the Jews. “Abraham died, and so did the prophets, yet You say that anyone who keeps Your word will never taste death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_53","073_8_53","JHN","8","53","53","Are You greater than our father Abraham? He died, as did the prophets. Who do You claim to be?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_54","073_8_54","JHN","8","54","54","Jesus answered, “If I glorify Myself, My glory means nothing. The One who glorifies Me is My Father, of whom you say ‘He is our God.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_55","073_8_55","JHN","8","55","55","You do not know Him, but I know Him. If I said I did not know Him, I would be a liar like you. But I do know Him, and I keep His word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_56","073_8_56","JHN","8","56","56","Your father Abraham rejoiced that he would see My day. He saw it and was glad.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_57","073_8_57","JHN","8","57","57","Then the Jews said to Him, “You are not yet fifty years old, and You have seen Abraham?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_58","073_8_58","JHN","8","58","58","“Truly, truly, I tell you,” Jesus declared, “before Abraham was born, I am!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN8_59","073_8_59","JHN","8","59","59","At this, they picked up stones to throw at Him. But Jesus was hidden and went out of the temple area, going through the midst of them. And so He passed by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_1","073_9_1","JHN","9","1","1","Now as Jesus was passing by, He saw a man blind from birth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_2","073_9_2","JHN","9","2","2","and His disciples asked Him, “Rabbi, who sinned, this man or his parents, that he was born blind?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_3","073_9_3","JHN","9","3","3","Jesus answered, “Neither this man nor his parents sinned, but this happened so that the works of God would be displayed in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_4","073_9_4","JHN","9","4","4","While it is daytime, I must do the works of Him who sent Me. Night is coming, when no one can work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_5","073_9_5","JHN","9","5","5","While I am in the world, I am the light of the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_6","073_9_6","JHN","9","6","6","When Jesus had said this, He spit on the ground, made some mud, and applied it to the eyes of the blind man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_7","073_9_7","JHN","9","7","7","Then He told him, “Go, wash in the Pool of Siloam” (which means “Sent”). So the man went and washed, and came back seeing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_8","073_9_8","JHN","9","8","8","At this, his neighbors and those who had formerly seen him blind began to ask, “Isn’t this the man who used to sit and beg?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_9","073_9_9","JHN","9","9","9","Some claimed that he was, but others said, “He just looks like him.” But the man kept saying, “I am the one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_10","073_9_10","JHN","9","10","10","“How were your eyes opened?” they asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_11","073_9_11","JHN","9","11","11","He answered, “The man they call Jesus made some mud and anointed my eyes, and He told me to go to the Pool of Siloam and wash. So I went and washed and received my sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_12","073_9_12","JHN","9","12","12","“Where is He?” they asked. “I do not know,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_13","073_9_13","JHN","9","13","13","They brought to the Pharisees the man who had been blind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_14","073_9_14","JHN","9","14","14","Now the day on which Jesus had made the mud and opened his eyes was a Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_15","073_9_15","JHN","9","15","15","So the Pharisees also asked him how he had received his sight. The man answered, “He put mud on my eyes, and I washed, and now I can see.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_16","073_9_16","JHN","9","16","16","Because of this, some of the Pharisees said, “This man is not from God, for He does not keep the Sabbath.” But others said, “How can a sinful man perform such signs?” And there was division among them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_17","073_9_17","JHN","9","17","17","So once again they asked the man who had been blind, “What do you say about Him, since it was your eyes He opened?” “He is a prophet,” the man replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_18","073_9_18","JHN","9","18","18","The Jews still did not believe that the man had been blind and had received his sight until they summoned his parents ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_19","073_9_19","JHN","9","19","19","and asked, “Is this your son, the one you say was born blind? So how is it that he can now see?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_20","073_9_20","JHN","9","20","20","His parents answered, “We know he is our son, and we know he was born blind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_21","073_9_21","JHN","9","21","21","But how he can now see or who opened his eyes, we do not know. He is of age. Ask him. He can speak for himself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_22","073_9_22","JHN","9","22","22","His parents said this because they were afraid of the Jews. For the Jews had already determined that anyone who confessed Jesus as the Christ would be put out of the synagogue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_23","073_9_23","JHN","9","23","23","That was why his parents said, “He is old enough. Ask him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_24","073_9_24","JHN","9","24","24","So a second time they called for the man who had been blind and said, “Give glory to God! We know that this man is a sinner.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_25","073_9_25","JHN","9","25","25","He answered, “Whether He is a sinner I do not know. There is one thing I do know: I was blind, but now I see!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_26","073_9_26","JHN","9","26","26","“What did He do to you?” they asked again. “How did He open your eyes?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_27","073_9_27","JHN","9","27","27","He replied, “I already told you, and you did not listen. Why do you want to hear it again? Do you also want to become His disciples?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_28","073_9_28","JHN","9","28","28","Then they heaped insults on him and said, “You are His disciple; we are disciples of Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_29","073_9_29","JHN","9","29","29","We know that God spoke to Moses, but we do not know where this man is from.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_30","073_9_30","JHN","9","30","30","“That is remarkable indeed!” the man said. “You do not know where He is from, and yet He opened my eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_31","073_9_31","JHN","9","31","31","We know that God does not listen to sinners, but He does listen to the one who worships Him and does His will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_32","073_9_32","JHN","9","32","32","Never before has anyone heard of opening the eyes of a man born blind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_33","073_9_33","JHN","9","33","33","If this man were not from God, He could do no such thing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_34","073_9_34","JHN","9","34","34","They replied, “You were born in utter sin, and you are instructing us?” And they threw him out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_35","073_9_35","JHN","9","35","35","When Jesus heard that they had thrown him out, He found the man and said, “Do you believe in the Son of God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_36","073_9_36","JHN","9","36","36","“Who is He, Sir?” he replied. “Tell me so that I may believe in Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_37","073_9_37","JHN","9","37","37","“You have already seen Him,” Jesus answered. “He is the One speaking with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_38","073_9_38","JHN","9","38","38","“Lord, I believe,” he said. And he worshiped Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_39","073_9_39","JHN","9","39","39","Then Jesus declared, “For judgment I have come into this world, so that the blind may see and those who see may become blind.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_40","073_9_40","JHN","9","40","40","Some of the Pharisees who were with Him heard this, and they asked Him, “Are we blind too?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN9_41","073_9_41","JHN","9","41","41","“If you were blind,” Jesus replied, “you would not be guilty of sin. But since you say, ‘We see,’ your guilt remains.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_1","073_10_1","JHN","10","1","1","“Truly, truly, I tell you, whoever does not enter the sheepfold by the gate, but climbs in some other way, is a thief and a robber. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_2","073_10_2","JHN","10","2","2","But the one who enters by the gate is the shepherd of the sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_3","073_10_3","JHN","10","3","3","The gatekeeper opens the gate for him, and the sheep listen for his voice. He calls his own sheep by name and leads them out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_4","073_10_4","JHN","10","4","4","When he has brought out his own sheep, he goes on ahead of them, and his sheep follow him because they know his voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_5","073_10_5","JHN","10","5","5","But they will never follow a stranger; in fact, they will flee from him because they do not recognize his voice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_6","073_10_6","JHN","10","6","6","Jesus spoke to them using this illustration, but they did not understand what He was telling them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_7","073_10_7","JHN","10","7","7","So He said to them again, “Truly, truly, I tell you, I am the gate for the sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_8","073_10_8","JHN","10","8","8","All who came were thieves and robbers, but the sheep did not listen to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_9","073_10_9","JHN","10","9","9","I am the gate. If anyone enters through Me, he will be saved. He will come in and go out and find pasture. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_10","073_10_10","JHN","10","10","10","The thief comes only to steal and kill and destroy. I have come that they may have life, and have it in all its fullness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_11","073_10_11","JHN","10","11","11","I am the good shepherd. The good shepherd lays down His life for the sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_12","073_10_12","JHN","10","12","12","The hired hand is not the shepherd, and the sheep are not his own. When he sees the wolf coming, he abandons the sheep and runs away. Then the wolf pounces on them and scatters the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_13","073_10_13","JHN","10","13","13","The man runs away because he is a hired servant and is unconcerned for the sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_14","073_10_14","JHN","10","14","14","I am the good shepherd. I know My sheep and My sheep know Me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_15","073_10_15","JHN","10","15","15","just as the Father knows Me and I know the Father. And I lay down My life for the sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_16","073_10_16","JHN","10","16","16","I have other sheep that are not of this fold. I must bring them in as well, and they will listen to My voice. Then there will be one flock and one shepherd. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_17","073_10_17","JHN","10","17","17","The reason My Father loves Me is that I lay down My life in order to take it up again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_18","073_10_18","JHN","10","18","18","No one takes it from Me, but I lay it down of My own accord. I have authority to lay it down and authority to take it up again. This charge I have received from My Father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_19","073_10_19","JHN","10","19","19","Therefore there was again division among the Jews because of Jesus’ message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_20","073_10_20","JHN","10","20","20","Many of them said, “He is demon-possessed and insane. Why would you listen to Him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_21","073_10_21","JHN","10","21","21","But others replied, “These are not the words of a man possessed by a demon. Can a demon open the eyes of the blind?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_22","073_10_22","JHN","10","22","22","At that time the Feast of Dedication took place in Jerusalem. It was winter, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_23","073_10_23","JHN","10","23","23","and Jesus was walking in the temple courts in Solomon’s Colonnade. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_24","073_10_24","JHN","10","24","24","So the Jews gathered around Him and demanded, “How long will You keep us in suspense? If You are the Christ, tell us plainly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_25","073_10_25","JHN","10","25","25","“I already told you,” Jesus replied, “but you did not believe. The works I do in My Father’s name testify on My behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_26","073_10_26","JHN","10","26","26","But because you are not My sheep, you refuse to believe, just as I said to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_27","073_10_27","JHN","10","27","27","My sheep listen to My voice; I know them, and they follow Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_28","073_10_28","JHN","10","28","28","I give them eternal life, and they will never perish. No one can snatch them out of My hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_29","073_10_29","JHN","10","29","29","My Father who has given them to Me is greater than all. No one can snatch them out of My Father’s hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_30","073_10_30","JHN","10","30","30","I and the Father are one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_31","073_10_31","JHN","10","31","31","At this, the Jews again picked up stones to stone Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_32","073_10_32","JHN","10","32","32","But Jesus responded, “I have shown you many good works from My Father. For which of these do you stone Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_33","073_10_33","JHN","10","33","33","“We are not stoning You for any good work,” said the Jews, “but for blasphemy, because You, who are a man, declare Yourself to be God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_34","073_10_34","JHN","10","34","34","Jesus replied, “Is it not written in your Law: ‘I have said you are gods’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_35","073_10_35","JHN","10","35","35","If he called them gods to whom the word of God came—and the Scripture cannot be broken— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_36","073_10_36","JHN","10","36","36","then what about the One whom the Father sanctified and sent into the world? How then can you accuse Me of blasphemy for stating that I am the Son of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_37","073_10_37","JHN","10","37","37","If I am not doing the works of My Father, then do not believe Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_38","073_10_38","JHN","10","38","38","But if I am doing them, even though you do not believe Me, believe the works themselves, so that you may know and believe that the Father is in Me, and I am in Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_39","073_10_39","JHN","10","39","39","At this, they tried again to seize Him, but He escaped their grasp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_40","073_10_40","JHN","10","40","40","Then Jesus went back across the Jordan to the place where John had first been baptizing, and He stayed there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_41","073_10_41","JHN","10","41","41","Many came to Him and said, “Although John never performed a sign, everything he said about this man was true.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN10_42","073_10_42","JHN","10","42","42","And many in that place believed in Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_1","073_11_1","JHN","11","1","1","At this time a man named Lazarus was sick. He lived in Bethany, the village of Mary and her sister Martha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_2","073_11_2","JHN","11","2","2","(Mary, whose brother Lazarus was sick, was to anoint the Lord with perfume and wipe His feet with her hair.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_3","073_11_3","JHN","11","3","3","So the sisters sent word to Jesus, “Lord, the one You love is sick.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_4","073_11_4","JHN","11","4","4","When Jesus heard this, He said, “This sickness will not end in death. No, it is for the glory of God, so that the Son of God may be glorified through it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_5","073_11_5","JHN","11","5","5","Now Jesus loved Martha and her sister and Lazarus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_6","073_11_6","JHN","11","6","6","So on hearing that Lazarus was sick, He stayed where He was for two days, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_7","073_11_7","JHN","11","7","7","and then He said to the disciples, “Let us go back to Judea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_8","073_11_8","JHN","11","8","8","“Rabbi,” they replied, “the Jews just tried to stone You, and You are going back there?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_9","073_11_9","JHN","11","9","9","Jesus answered, “Are there not twelve hours of daylight? If anyone walks in the daytime, he will not stumble, because he sees by the light of this world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_10","073_11_10","JHN","11","10","10","But if anyone walks at night, he will stumble, because he has no light.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_11","073_11_11","JHN","11","11","11","After He had said this, He told them, “Our friend Lazarus has fallen asleep, but I am going there to wake him up.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_12","073_11_12","JHN","11","12","12","His disciples replied, “Lord, if he is sleeping, he will get better.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_13","073_11_13","JHN","11","13","13","They thought that Jesus was talking about actual sleep, but He was speaking about the death of Lazarus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_14","073_11_14","JHN","11","14","14","So Jesus told them plainly, “Lazarus is dead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_15","073_11_15","JHN","11","15","15","and for your sake I am glad I was not there, so that you may believe. But let us go to him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_16","073_11_16","JHN","11","16","16","Then Thomas called Didymus said to his fellow disciples, “Let us also go, so that we may die with Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_17","073_11_17","JHN","11","17","17","When Jesus arrived, He found that Lazarus had already spent four days in the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_18","073_11_18","JHN","11","18","18","Now Bethany was near Jerusalem, a little less than two miles away, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_19","073_11_19","JHN","11","19","19","and many of the Jews had come to the women around Martha and Mary to console them in the loss of their brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_20","073_11_20","JHN","11","20","20","So when Martha heard that Jesus was coming, she went out to meet Him, but Mary stayed at home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_21","073_11_21","JHN","11","21","21","Martha said to Jesus, “Lord, if You had been here, my brother would not have died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_22","073_11_22","JHN","11","22","22","But even now I know that God will give You whatever You ask of Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_23","073_11_23","JHN","11","23","23","“Your brother will rise again,” Jesus told her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_24","073_11_24","JHN","11","24","24","Martha replied, “I know that he will rise again in the resurrection at the last day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_25","073_11_25","JHN","11","25","25","Jesus said to her, “I am the resurrection and the life. Whoever believes in Me will live, even though he dies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_26","073_11_26","JHN","11","26","26","And everyone who lives and believes in Me will never die. Do you believe this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_27","073_11_27","JHN","11","27","27","“Yes, Lord,” she answered, “I believe that You are the Christ, the Son of God, who was to come into the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_28","073_11_28","JHN","11","28","28","After Martha had said this, she went back and called her sister Mary aside to tell her, “The Teacher is here and is asking for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_29","073_11_29","JHN","11","29","29","And when Mary heard this, she got up quickly and went to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_30","073_11_30","JHN","11","30","30","Now Jesus had not yet entered the village, but was at the place where Martha had met Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_31","073_11_31","JHN","11","31","31","When the Jews who were in the house consoling Mary saw how quickly she got up and went out, they followed her, saying that she was going to the tomb to mourn there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_32","073_11_32","JHN","11","32","32","When Mary came to Jesus and saw Him, she fell at His feet and said, “Lord, if You had been here, my brother would not have died.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_33","073_11_33","JHN","11","33","33","When Jesus saw her weeping, and the Jews who had come with her also weeping, He was deeply moved in spirit and troubled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_34","073_11_34","JHN","11","34","34","“Where have you put him?” He asked. “Come and see, Lord,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_35","073_11_35","JHN","11","35","35","Jesus wept. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_36","073_11_36","JHN","11","36","36","Then the Jews said, “See how He loved him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_37","073_11_37","JHN","11","37","37","But some of them asked, “Could not this man who opened the eyes of the blind also have kept Lazarus from dying?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_38","073_11_38","JHN","11","38","38","Jesus, once again deeply moved, came to the tomb. It was a cave with a stone laid across the entrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_39","073_11_39","JHN","11","39","39","“Take away the stone,” Jesus said. “Lord, by now he stinks,” said Martha, the sister of the dead man. “It has already been four days.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_40","073_11_40","JHN","11","40","40","Jesus replied, “Did I not tell you that if you believed, you would see the glory of God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_41","073_11_41","JHN","11","41","41","So they took away the stone from where the dead man was lying. Then Jesus lifted His eyes upward and said, “Father, I thank You that You have heard Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_42","073_11_42","JHN","11","42","42","I knew that You always hear Me, but I say this for the benefit of the people standing here, so they may believe that You sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_43","073_11_43","JHN","11","43","43","After Jesus had said this, He called out in a loud voice, “Lazarus, come out!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_44","073_11_44","JHN","11","44","44","The man who had been dead came out with his hands and feet bound in strips of linen, and his face wrapped in a cloth. “Unwrap him and let him go,” Jesus told them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_45","073_11_45","JHN","11","45","45","Therefore many of the Jews who had come to Mary, and had seen what Jesus did, believed in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_46","073_11_46","JHN","11","46","46","But some of them went to the Pharisees and told them what Jesus had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_47","073_11_47","JHN","11","47","47","Then the chief priests and Pharisees convened the Sanhedrin and said, “What are we to do? This man is performing many signs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_48","073_11_48","JHN","11","48","48","If we let Him go on like this, everyone will believe in Him, and then the Romans will come and take away both our place and our nation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_49","073_11_49","JHN","11","49","49","But one of them, named Caiaphas, who was high priest that year, said to them, “You know nothing at all! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_50","073_11_50","JHN","11","50","50","You do not realize that it is better for us that one man die for the people than that the whole nation perish.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_51","073_11_51","JHN","11","51","51","Caiaphas did not say this on his own. Instead, as high priest that year, he was prophesying that Jesus would die for the nation, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_52","073_11_52","JHN","11","52","52","and not only for the nation, but also for the scattered children of God, to gather them together into one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_53","073_11_53","JHN","11","53","53","So from that day on they plotted together to kill Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_54","073_11_54","JHN","11","54","54","As a result, Jesus no longer went about publicly among the Jews, but He withdrew to a town called Ephraim in an area near the wilderness. And He spent time there with His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_55","073_11_55","JHN","11","55","55","Now the Jewish Passover was near, and many people went up from the country to Jerusalem to purify themselves before the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_56","073_11_56","JHN","11","56","56","They kept looking for Jesus and asking one another as they stood in the temple courts, “What do you think? Will He come to the feast at all?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN11_57","073_11_57","JHN","11","57","57","But the chief priests and Pharisees had given an order that anyone who knew where He was must report it, so that they could arrest Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_1","073_12_1","JHN","12","1","1","Six days before the Passover, Jesus came to Bethany, the hometown of Lazarus who had died, whom He had raised from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_2","073_12_2","JHN","12","2","2","So they hosted a dinner for Jesus there. Martha served, and Lazarus was among those reclining at the table with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_3","073_12_3","JHN","12","3","3","Then Mary took about a pint of expensive perfume, made of pure nard, and she anointed Jesus’ feet and wiped them with her hair. And the house was filled with the fragrance of the perfume. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_4","073_12_4","JHN","12","4","4","But one of His disciples, Judas Iscariot, son of Simon, who was going to betray Him, asked, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_5","073_12_5","JHN","12","5","5","“Why wasn’t this perfume sold for three hundred denarii and the money given to the poor?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_6","073_12_6","JHN","12","6","6","Judas did not say this because he cared about the poor, but because he was a thief. As keeper of the money bag, he used to take from what was put into it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_7","073_12_7","JHN","12","7","7","“Leave her alone,” Jesus replied. “She has kept this perfume in preparation for the day of My burial. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_8","073_12_8","JHN","12","8","8","The poor you will always have with you, but you will not always have Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_9","073_12_9","JHN","12","9","9","Meanwhile a large crowd of Jews learned that Jesus was there. And they came not only because of Him, but also to see Lazarus, whom He had raised from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_10","073_12_10","JHN","12","10","10","So the chief priests made plans to kill Lazarus as well, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_11","073_12_11","JHN","12","11","11","for on account of him many of the Jews were deserting them and believing in Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_12","073_12_12","JHN","12","12","12","The next day a great crowd that had come to the feast heard that Jesus was coming to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_13","073_12_13","JHN","12","13","13","They took palm branches and went out to meet Him, crying out: “Hosanna!” “Blessed is He who comes in the name of the Lord!” “Blessed is the King of Israel!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_14","073_12_14","JHN","12","14","14","Finding a young donkey, Jesus sat on it, as it is written: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_15","073_12_15","JHN","12","15","15","“Do not be afraid, O Daughter of Zion. See, your King is coming, seated on the colt of a donkey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_16","073_12_16","JHN","12","16","16","At first His disciples did not understand these things, but after Jesus was glorified they remembered what had been done to Him, and they realized that these very things had also been written about Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_17","073_12_17","JHN","12","17","17","Meanwhile, many people who had been with Jesus when He called Lazarus from the tomb and raised him from the dead continued to testify. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_18","073_12_18","JHN","12","18","18","That is also why the crowd went out to meet Him, because they heard that He had performed this sign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_19","073_12_19","JHN","12","19","19","Then the Pharisees said to one another, “You can see that this is doing you no good. Look how the whole world has gone after Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_20","073_12_20","JHN","12","20","20","Now there were some Greeks among those who went up to worship at the feast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_21","073_12_21","JHN","12","21","21","They came to Philip, who was from Bethsaida in Galilee, and requested of him, “Sir, we want to see Jesus.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_22","073_12_22","JHN","12","22","22","Philip relayed this appeal to Andrew, and both of them went and told Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_23","073_12_23","JHN","12","23","23","But Jesus replied, “The hour has come for the Son of Man to be glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_24","073_12_24","JHN","12","24","24","Truly, truly, I tell you, unless a kernel of wheat falls to the ground and dies, it remains only a seed. But if it dies, it bears much fruit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_25","073_12_25","JHN","12","25","25","Whoever loves his life will lose it, but whoever hates his life in this world will keep it for eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_26","073_12_26","JHN","12","26","26","If anyone serves Me, he must follow Me; and where I am, My servant will be as well. If anyone serves Me, the Father will honor him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_27","073_12_27","JHN","12","27","27","Now My soul is troubled, and what shall I say? ‘Father, save Me from this hour’? No, it is for this purpose that I have come to this hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_28","073_12_28","JHN","12","28","28","Father, glorify Your name!” Then a voice came from heaven: “I have glorified it, and I will glorify it again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_29","073_12_29","JHN","12","29","29","The crowd standing there heard it and said that it had thundered. Others said that an angel had spoken to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_30","073_12_30","JHN","12","30","30","In response, Jesus said, “This voice was not for My benefit, but yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_31","073_12_31","JHN","12","31","31","Now judgment is upon this world; now the prince of this world will be cast out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_32","073_12_32","JHN","12","32","32","And I, when I am lifted up from the earth, will draw everyone to Myself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_33","073_12_33","JHN","12","33","33","He said this to indicate the kind of death He was going to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_34","073_12_34","JHN","12","34","34","The crowd replied, “We have heard from the Law that the Christ will remain forever. So how can You say that the Son of Man must be lifted up? Who is this Son of Man?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_35","073_12_35","JHN","12","35","35","Then Jesus told them, “For a little while longer, the Light will be with you. Walk while you have the Light, so that darkness will not overtake you. The one who walks in the darkness does not know where he is going. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_36","073_12_36","JHN","12","36","36","While you have the Light, believe in the Light, so that you may become sons of light.” After Jesus had spoken these things, He went away and was hidden from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_37","073_12_37","JHN","12","37","37","Although Jesus had performed so many signs in their presence, they still did not believe in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_38","073_12_38","JHN","12","38","38","This was to fulfill the word of Isaiah the prophet: “Lord, who has believed our message? And to whom has the arm of the Lord been revealed?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_39","073_12_39","JHN","12","39","39","For this reason they were unable to believe. For again, Isaiah says: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_40","073_12_40","JHN","12","40","40","“He has blinded their eyes and hardened their hearts, so that they cannot see with their eyes, and understand with their hearts, and turn, and I would heal them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_41","073_12_41","JHN","12","41","41","Isaiah said these things when he saw Jesus’ glory and spoke about Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_42","073_12_42","JHN","12","42","42","Nevertheless, many of the leaders believed in Him. But because of the Pharisees they did not confess Him, for fear that they would be put out of the synagogue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_43","073_12_43","JHN","12","43","43","For they loved praise from men more than praise from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_44","073_12_44","JHN","12","44","44","Then Jesus cried out, “Whoever believes in Me does not believe in Me alone, but in the One who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_45","073_12_45","JHN","12","45","45","And whoever sees Me sees the One who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_46","073_12_46","JHN","12","46","46","I have come into the world as a light, so that no one who believes in Me should remain in darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_47","073_12_47","JHN","12","47","47","As for anyone who hears My words and does not believe, I do not judge him. For I have not come to judge the world, but to save the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_48","073_12_48","JHN","12","48","48","There is a judge for the one who rejects Me and does not receive My words: The word that I have spoken will judge him on the last day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_49","073_12_49","JHN","12","49","49","I have not spoken on My own, but the Father who sent Me has commanded Me what to say and how to say it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN12_50","073_12_50","JHN","12","50","50","And I know that His command leads to eternal life. So I speak exactly what the Father has told Me to say.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_1","073_13_1","JHN","13","1","1","It was now just before the Passover Feast, and Jesus knew that His hour had come to leave this world and return to the Father. Having loved His own who were in the world, He loved them to the very end. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_2","073_13_2","JHN","13","2","2","By the time the evening meal had ended, the devil had already put into the heart of Judas, the son of Simon Iscariot, to betray Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_3","073_13_3","JHN","13","3","3","Jesus knew that the Father had delivered all things into His hands, and that He had come from God and was returning to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_4","073_13_4","JHN","13","4","4","So He got up from the supper, laid aside His outer garments, and wrapped a towel around His waist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_5","073_13_5","JHN","13","5","5","After that, He poured water into a basin and began to wash the disciples’ feet and dry them with the towel that was around Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_6","073_13_6","JHN","13","6","6","He came to Simon Peter, who asked Him, “Lord, are You going to wash my feet?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_7","073_13_7","JHN","13","7","7","Jesus replied, “You do not realize now what I am doing, but later you will understand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_8","073_13_8","JHN","13","8","8","“Never shall You wash my feet!” Peter told Him. Jesus answered, “Unless I wash you, you have no part with Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_9","073_13_9","JHN","13","9","9","“Then, Lord,” Simon Peter replied, “not only my feet, but my hands and my head as well!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_10","073_13_10","JHN","13","10","10","Jesus told him, “Whoever has already bathed needs only to wash his feet, and he will be completely clean. And you are clean, though not all of you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_11","073_13_11","JHN","13","11","11","For He knew who would betray Him. That is why He said, “Not all of you are clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_12","073_13_12","JHN","13","12","12","When Jesus had washed their feet and put on His outer garments, He reclined with them again and asked, “Do you know what I have done for you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_13","073_13_13","JHN","13","13","13","You call Me Teacher and Lord, and rightly so, because I am. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_14","073_13_14","JHN","13","14","14","So if I, your Lord and Teacher, have washed your feet, you also should wash one another’s feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_15","073_13_15","JHN","13","15","15","I have set you an example so that you should do as I have done for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_16","073_13_16","JHN","13","16","16","Truly, truly, I tell you, no servant is greater than his master, nor is a messenger greater than the one who sent him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_17","073_13_17","JHN","13","17","17","If you know these things, you will be blessed if you do them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_18","073_13_18","JHN","13","18","18","I am not speaking about all of you; I know whom I have chosen. But this is to fulfill the Scripture: ‘The one who shares bread with Me has lifted up his heel against Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_19","073_13_19","JHN","13","19","19","I am telling you now before it happens, so that when it comes to pass, you will believe that I am He. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_20","073_13_20","JHN","13","20","20","Truly, truly, I tell you, whoever receives the one I send receives Me, and whoever receives Me receives the One who sent Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_21","073_13_21","JHN","13","21","21","After Jesus had said this, He became troubled in spirit and testified, “Truly, truly, I tell you, one of you will betray Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_22","073_13_22","JHN","13","22","22","The disciples looked at one another, perplexed as to which of them He meant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_23","073_13_23","JHN","13","23","23","One of His disciples, the one whom Jesus loved, was reclining at His side. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_24","073_13_24","JHN","13","24","24","So Simon Peter motioned to him to ask Jesus which one He was talking about. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_25","073_13_25","JHN","13","25","25","Falling back upon Jesus, he asked, “Lord, who is it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_26","073_13_26","JHN","13","26","26","Jesus answered, “It is the one to whom I give this morsel after I have dipped it.” Then He dipped the morsel and gave it to Judas Iscariot, the son of Simon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_27","073_13_27","JHN","13","27","27","And when Judas had taken the morsel, Satan entered into him. Then Jesus said to Judas, “What you are about to do, do quickly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_28","073_13_28","JHN","13","28","28","But no one at the table knew why Jesus had said this to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_29","073_13_29","JHN","13","29","29","Since Judas kept the money bag, some thought that Jesus was telling him to buy what was needed for the feast, or to give something to the poor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_30","073_13_30","JHN","13","30","30","As soon as he had received the morsel, Judas went out into the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_31","073_13_31","JHN","13","31","31","When Judas had gone out, Jesus said, “Now the Son of Man is glorified, and God is glorified in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_32","073_13_32","JHN","13","32","32","If God is glorified in Him, God will also glorify the Son in Himself—and will glorify Him at once. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_33","073_13_33","JHN","13","33","33","Little children, I am with you only a little while longer. You will look for Me, and as I said to the Jews, so now I say to you: ‘Where I am going, you cannot come.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_34","073_13_34","JHN","13","34","34","A new commandment I give you: Love one another. As I have loved you, so you also must love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_35","073_13_35","JHN","13","35","35","By this everyone will know that you are My disciples, if you love one another.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_36","073_13_36","JHN","13","36","36","“Lord, where are You going?” Simon Peter asked. Jesus answered, “Where I am going, you cannot follow Me now, but you will follow Me later.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_37","073_13_37","JHN","13","37","37","“Lord,” said Peter, “why can’t I follow You now? I will lay down my life for You.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN13_38","073_13_38","JHN","13","38","38","“Will you lay down your life for Me?” Jesus replied. “Truly, truly, I tell you, before the rooster crows, you will deny Me three times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_1","073_14_1","JHN","14","1","1","“Do not let your hearts be troubled. You believe in God; believe in Me as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_2","073_14_2","JHN","14","2","2","In My Father’s house are many rooms. If it were not so, would I have told you that I am going there to prepare a place for you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_3","073_14_3","JHN","14","3","3","And if I go, I will prepare a place for you. I will come back and welcome you into My presence, so that you also may be where I am. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_4","073_14_4","JHN","14","4","4","You know the place where I am going and you know the way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_5","073_14_5","JHN","14","5","5","“Lord,” said Thomas, “we do not know where You are going, so how can we know the way?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_6","073_14_6","JHN","14","6","6","Jesus answered, “I am the way and the truth and the life. No one comes to the Father except through Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_7","073_14_7","JHN","14","7","7","If you had known Me, you would know My Father as well. From now on you do know Him and have seen Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_8","073_14_8","JHN","14","8","8","Philip said to Him, “Lord, show us the Father, and that will be enough for us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_9","073_14_9","JHN","14","9","9","Jesus replied, “Philip, I have been with you all this time, and still you do not know Me? Anyone who has seen Me has seen the Father. How can you say, ‘Show us the Father’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_10","073_14_10","JHN","14","10","10","Do you not believe that I am in the Father and the Father is in Me? The words I say to you, I do not speak on My own. Instead, it is the Father dwelling in Me, performing His works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_11","073_14_11","JHN","14","11","11","Believe Me that I am in the Father and the Father is in Me—or at least believe Me on account of the works themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_12","073_14_12","JHN","14","12","12","Truly, truly, I tell you, whoever believes in Me will also do the works that I am doing. He will do even greater things than these, because I am going to My Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_13","073_14_13","JHN","14","13","13","And I will do whatever you ask in My name, so that the Father may be glorified in the Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_14","073_14_14","JHN","14","14","14","If you ask Me for anything in My name, I will do it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_15","073_14_15","JHN","14","15","15","If you love Me, keep My commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_16","073_14_16","JHN","14","16","16","And I will ask the Father, and He will give you another Advocate to abide with you forever— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_17","073_14_17","JHN","14","17","17","the Spirit of truth. The world cannot receive Him, because it neither sees Him nor knows Him. But you do know Him, for He abides with you and will be in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_18","073_14_18","JHN","14","18","18","I will not leave you as orphans; I will come to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_19","073_14_19","JHN","14","19","19","In a little while the world will see Me no more, but you will see Me. Because I live, you also will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_20","073_14_20","JHN","14","20","20","On that day you will know that I am in My Father, and you are in Me, and I am in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_21","073_14_21","JHN","14","21","21","Whoever has My commandments and keeps them is the one who loves Me. The one who loves Me will be loved by My Father, and I will love him and reveal Myself to him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_22","073_14_22","JHN","14","22","22","Judas (not Iscariot) asked Him, “Lord, why are You going to reveal Yourself to us and not to the world?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_23","073_14_23","JHN","14","23","23","Jesus replied, “If anyone loves Me, he will keep My word. My Father will love him, and We will come to him and make Our home with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_24","073_14_24","JHN","14","24","24","Whoever does not love Me does not keep My words. The word that you hear is not My own, but it is from the Father who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_25","073_14_25","JHN","14","25","25","All this I have spoken to you while I am still with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_26","073_14_26","JHN","14","26","26","But the Advocate, the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in My name, will teach you all things and will remind you of everything I have told you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_27","073_14_27","JHN","14","27","27","Peace I leave with you; My peace I give to you. I do not give to you as the world gives. Do not let your hearts be troubled; do not be afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_28","073_14_28","JHN","14","28","28","You heard Me say, ‘I am going away, and I am coming back to you.’ If you loved Me, you would rejoice that I am going to the Father, because My Father is greater than I. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_29","073_14_29","JHN","14","29","29","And now I have told you before it happens, so that when it does happen, you will believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_30","073_14_30","JHN","14","30","30","I will not speak with you much longer, for the prince of this world is coming, and he has no claim on Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN14_31","073_14_31","JHN","14","31","31","But I do exactly what the Father has commanded Me, so that the world may know that I love the Father. Get up! Let us go on from here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_1","073_15_1","JHN","15","1","1","“I am the true vine, and My Father is the keeper of the vineyard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_2","073_15_2","JHN","15","2","2","He cuts off every branch in Me that bears no fruit, and every branch that does bear fruit, He prunes to make it even more fruitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_3","073_15_3","JHN","15","3","3","You are already clean because of the word I have spoken to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_4","073_15_4","JHN","15","4","4","Remain in Me, and I will remain in you. Just as no branch can bear fruit by itself unless it remains in the vine, neither can you bear fruit unless you remain in Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_5","073_15_5","JHN","15","5","5","I am the vine and you are the branches. The one who remains in Me, and I in him, will bear much fruit. For apart from Me you can do nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_6","073_15_6","JHN","15","6","6","If anyone does not remain in Me, he is like a branch that is thrown away and withers. Such branches are gathered up, thrown into the fire, and burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_7","073_15_7","JHN","15","7","7","If you remain in Me and My words remain in you, then you will ask whatever you wish, and it will be done for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_8","073_15_8","JHN","15","8","8","This is to My Father’s glory, that you bear much fruit, proving yourselves to be My disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_9","073_15_9","JHN","15","9","9","As the Father has loved Me, so have I loved you. Remain in My love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_10","073_15_10","JHN","15","10","10","If you keep My commandments, you will remain in My love, just as I have kept My Father’s commandments and remain in His love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_11","073_15_11","JHN","15","11","11","I have told you these things so that My joy may abide in you and your joy may be complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_12","073_15_12","JHN","15","12","12","This is My commandment, that you love one another as I have loved you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_13","073_15_13","JHN","15","13","13","Greater love has no one than this, that he lay down his life for his friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_14","073_15_14","JHN","15","14","14","You are My friends if you do whatever I command you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_15","073_15_15","JHN","15","15","15","No longer do I call you servants, for a servant does not understand what his master is doing. But I have called you friends, because everything I have learned from My Father I have made known to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_16","073_15_16","JHN","15","16","16","You did not choose Me, but I chose you. And I appointed you to go and bear fruit—fruit that will remain—so that whatever you ask the Father in My name, He will give you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_17","073_15_17","JHN","15","17","17","This is My command to you: Love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_18","073_15_18","JHN","15","18","18","If the world hates you, understand that it hated Me first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_19","073_15_19","JHN","15","19","19","If you were of the world, it would love you as its own. Instead, the world hates you, because you are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_20","073_15_20","JHN","15","20","20","Remember the word that I spoke to you: ‘No servant is greater than his master.’ If they persecuted Me, they will persecute you as well; if they kept My word, they will keep yours as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_21","073_15_21","JHN","15","21","21","But they will treat you like this because of My name, since they do not know the One who sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_22","073_15_22","JHN","15","22","22","If I had not come and spoken to them, they would not be guilty of sin. Now, however, they have no excuse for their sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_23","073_15_23","JHN","15","23","23","Whoever hates Me hates My Father as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_24","073_15_24","JHN","15","24","24","If I had not done among them the works that no one else did, they would not be guilty of sin; but now they have seen and hated both Me and My Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_25","073_15_25","JHN","15","25","25","But this is to fulfill what is written in their Law: ‘They hated Me without reason.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_26","073_15_26","JHN","15","26","26","When the Advocate comes, whom I will send to you from the Father—the Spirit of truth who proceeds from the Father—He will testify about Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN15_27","073_15_27","JHN","15","27","27","And you also must testify, because you have been with Me from the beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_1","073_16_1","JHN","16","1","1","“I have told you these things so that you will not fall away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_2","073_16_2","JHN","16","2","2","They will put you out of the synagogues. In fact, a time is coming when anyone who kills you will think he is offering a service to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_3","073_16_3","JHN","16","3","3","They will do these things because they have not known the Father or Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_4","073_16_4","JHN","16","4","4","But I have told you these things so that when the hour comes, you will remember that I told you about them. I did not tell you these things from the beginning, because I was with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_5","073_16_5","JHN","16","5","5","Now, however, I am going to Him who sent Me; yet none of you asks Me, ‘Where are You going?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_6","073_16_6","JHN","16","6","6","Instead, your hearts are filled with sorrow because I have told you these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_7","073_16_7","JHN","16","7","7","But I tell you the truth, it is for your benefit that I am going away. Unless I go away, the Advocate will not come to you; but if I go, I will send Him to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_8","073_16_8","JHN","16","8","8","And when He comes, He will convict the world in regard to sin and righteousness and judgment: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_9","073_16_9","JHN","16","9","9","in regard to sin, because they do not believe in Me; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_10","073_16_10","JHN","16","10","10","in regard to righteousness, because I am going to My Father and you will no longer see Me; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_11","073_16_11","JHN","16","11","11","and in regard to judgment, because the prince of this world has been condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_12","073_16_12","JHN","16","12","12","I still have much to tell you, but you cannot yet bear to hear it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_13","073_16_13","JHN","16","13","13","However, when the Spirit of truth comes, He will guide you into all truth. For He will not speak on His own, but He will speak what He hears, and He will declare to you what is to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_14","073_16_14","JHN","16","14","14","He will glorify Me by taking from what is Mine and disclosing it to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_15","073_16_15","JHN","16","15","15","Everything that belongs to the Father is Mine. That is why I said that the Spirit will take from what is Mine and disclose it to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_16","073_16_16","JHN","16","16","16","In a little while you will not see Me, and then after a little while you will see Me, because I am going away to the Father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_17","073_16_17","JHN","16","17","17","Then some of His disciples asked one another, “Why is He telling us, ‘In a little while you will not see Me, and then after a little while you will see Me’ and ‘Because I am going to the Father’?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_18","073_16_18","JHN","16","18","18","They kept asking, “Why is He saying, ‘a little while’? We do not understand what He is saying.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_19","073_16_19","JHN","16","19","19","Aware that they wanted to question Him, Jesus said to them, “Are you asking one another why I said, ‘In a little while you will not see Me, and then after a little while you will see Me’? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_20","073_16_20","JHN","16","20","20","Truly, truly, I tell you, you will weep and wail while the world rejoices. You will grieve, but your grief will turn to joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_21","073_16_21","JHN","16","21","21","A woman has pain in childbirth because her time has come; but when she brings forth her child, she forgets her anguish because of her joy that a child has been born into the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_22","073_16_22","JHN","16","22","22","So also you have sorrow now, but I will see you again and your hearts will rejoice, and no one will take away your joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_23","073_16_23","JHN","16","23","23","In that day you will no longer ask Me anything. Truly, truly, I tell you, whatever you ask the Father in My name, He will give you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_24","073_16_24","JHN","16","24","24","Until now you have not asked for anything in My name. Ask and you will receive, so that your joy may be complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_25","073_16_25","JHN","16","25","25","I have spoken these things to you in figures of speech. But an hour is coming when I will no longer speak to you this way, but will tell you plainly about the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_26","073_16_26","JHN","16","26","26","In that day you will ask in My name. I am not saying that I will ask the Father on your behalf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_27","073_16_27","JHN","16","27","27","For the Father Himself loves you, because you have loved Me and have believed that I came from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_28","073_16_28","JHN","16","28","28","I came from the Father and entered the world. In turn, I will leave the world and go to the Father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_29","073_16_29","JHN","16","29","29","His disciples said to Him, “See, now You are speaking plainly and without figures of speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_30","073_16_30","JHN","16","30","30","Now we understand that You know all things and that You have no need for anyone to question You. Because of this, we believe that You came from God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_31","073_16_31","JHN","16","31","31","“Do you finally believe?” Jesus replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_32","073_16_32","JHN","16","32","32","“Look, an hour is coming and has already come when you will be scattered, each to his own home, and you will leave Me all alone. Yet I am not alone, because the Father is with Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN16_33","073_16_33","JHN","16","33","33","I have told you these things so that in Me you may have peace. In the world you will have tribulation. But take courage; I have overcome the world!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_1","073_17_1","JHN","17","1","1","When Jesus had spoken these things, He lifted up His eyes to heaven and said, “Father, the hour has come. Glorify Your Son, that Your Son may also glorify You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_2","073_17_2","JHN","17","2","2","For You granted Him authority over all people, so that He will give eternal life to all those You have given Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_3","073_17_3","JHN","17","3","3","Now this is eternal life, that they may know You, the only true God, and Jesus Christ, whom You have sent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_4","073_17_4","JHN","17","4","4","I have glorified You on earth. I have accomplished the work You gave Me to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_5","073_17_5","JHN","17","5","5","And now, Father, glorify Me in Your presence with the glory I had with You before the world existed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_6","073_17_6","JHN","17","6","6","I have revealed Your name to those You have given Me out of the world. They were Yours; You gave them to Me, and they have kept Your word. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_7","073_17_7","JHN","17","7","7","Now they know that everything You have given Me comes from You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_8","073_17_8","JHN","17","8","8","For I have given them the words You gave Me, and they have received them. They knew with certainty that I came from You, and they believed that You sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_9","073_17_9","JHN","17","9","9","I ask on their behalf. I do not ask on behalf of the world, but on behalf of those You have given Me; for they are Yours. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_10","073_17_10","JHN","17","10","10","All I have is Yours, and all You have is Mine; and in them I have been glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_11","073_17_11","JHN","17","11","11","I will no longer be in the world, but they are in the world, and I am coming to You. Holy Father, protect them by Your name, the name You gave Me, so that they may be one as We are one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_12","073_17_12","JHN","17","12","12","While I was with them in the world, I protected and preserved by Your name those You gave Me. Not one of them has been lost, except the son of destruction, so that the Scripture would be fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_13","073_17_13","JHN","17","13","13","But now I am coming to You; and I am saying these things while I am in the world, so that they may have My joy fulfilled within them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_14","073_17_14","JHN","17","14","14","I have given them Your word and the world has hated them. For they are not of the world, just as I am not of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_15","073_17_15","JHN","17","15","15","I am not asking that You take them out of the world, but that You keep them from the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_16","073_17_16","JHN","17","16","16","They are not of the world, just as I am not of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_17","073_17_17","JHN","17","17","17","Sanctify them by Your truth; Your word is truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_18","073_17_18","JHN","17","18","18","As You sent Me into the world, I have also sent them into the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_19","073_17_19","JHN","17","19","19","For them I sanctify Myself, so that they too may be sanctified by the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_20","073_17_20","JHN","17","20","20","I am not asking on behalf of them alone, but also on behalf of those who will believe in Me through their message, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_21","073_17_21","JHN","17","21","21","that all of them may be one, as You, Father, are in Me, and I am in You. May they also be one in Us, so that the world may believe that You sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_22","073_17_22","JHN","17","22","22","I have given them the glory You gave Me, so that they may be one as We are one— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_23","073_17_23","JHN","17","23","23","I in them and You in Me—that they may be perfectly united and that the world may know that You sent Me and have loved them just as You have loved Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_24","073_17_24","JHN","17","24","24","Father, I want those You have given Me to be with Me where I am, that they may see the glory You gave Me because You loved Me before the foundation of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_25","073_17_25","JHN","17","25","25","Righteous Father, although the world has not known You, I know You, and they know that You sent Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN17_26","073_17_26","JHN","17","26","26","And I have made Your name known to them and will continue to make it known, so that the love You have for Me may be in them, and I in them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_1","073_18_1","JHN","18","1","1","After Jesus had spoken these words, He went out with His disciples across the Kidron Valley, where they entered a garden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_2","073_18_2","JHN","18","2","2","Now Judas His betrayer also knew the place, because Jesus had often met there with His disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_3","073_18_3","JHN","18","3","3","So Judas brought a band of soldiers and officers from the chief priests and Pharisees. They arrived at the garden carrying lanterns, torches, and weapons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_4","073_18_4","JHN","18","4","4","Jesus, knowing all that was coming upon Him, stepped forward and asked them, “Whom are you seeking?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_5","073_18_5","JHN","18","5","5","“Jesus of Nazareth,” they answered. Jesus said, “I am He.” And Judas His betrayer was standing there with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_6","073_18_6","JHN","18","6","6","When Jesus said, “I am He,” they drew back and fell to the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_7","073_18_7","JHN","18","7","7","So He asked them again, “Whom are you seeking?” “Jesus of Nazareth,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_8","073_18_8","JHN","18","8","8","“I told you that I am He,” Jesus replied. “So if you are looking for Me, let these men go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_9","073_18_9","JHN","18","9","9","This was to fulfill the word He had spoken: “I have not lost one of those You have given Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_10","073_18_10","JHN","18","10","10","Then Simon Peter drew his sword and struck the servant of the high priest, cutting off his right ear. The servant’s name was Malchus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_11","073_18_11","JHN","18","11","11","“Put your sword back in its sheath!” Jesus said to Peter. “Shall I not drink the cup the Father has given Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_12","073_18_12","JHN","18","12","12","Then the band of soldiers, with its commander and the officers of the Jews, arrested Jesus and bound Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_13","073_18_13","JHN","18","13","13","They led Him away first to Annas, who was the father-in-law of Caiaphas, the high priest that year. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_14","073_18_14","JHN","18","14","14","Caiaphas was the one who had advised the Jews that it would be better if one man perished for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_15","073_18_15","JHN","18","15","15","Now Simon Peter and the other disciple were following Jesus. Since that disciple was known to the high priest, he also went with Jesus into the courtyard of the high priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_16","073_18_16","JHN","18","16","16","But Peter stood outside at the door. Then the disciple who was known to the high priest went out and spoke to the doorkeeper, and brought Peter in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_17","073_18_17","JHN","18","17","17","At this, the servant girl watching the door said to Peter, “Aren’t you also one of this man’s disciples?” “I am not,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_18","073_18_18","JHN","18","18","18","Because it was cold, the servants and officers were standing around a charcoal fire they had made to keep warm. And Peter was standing with them, warming himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_19","073_18_19","JHN","18","19","19","Meanwhile, the high priest questioned Jesus about His disciples and His teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_20","073_18_20","JHN","18","20","20","“I have spoken openly to the world,” Jesus answered. “I always taught in the synagogues and at the temple, where the Jews always come together. I said nothing in secret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_21","073_18_21","JHN","18","21","21","Why are you asking Me? Ask those who heard My message. Surely they know what I said.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_22","073_18_22","JHN","18","22","22","When Jesus had said this, one of the officers standing nearby slapped Him in the face and said, “Is this how You answer the high priest?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_23","073_18_23","JHN","18","23","23","Jesus replied, “If I said something wrong, testify as to what was wrong. But if I spoke correctly, why did you strike Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_24","073_18_24","JHN","18","24","24","Then Annas sent Him, still bound, to Caiaphas the high priest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_25","073_18_25","JHN","18","25","25","Simon Peter was still standing and warming himself. So they asked him, “Aren’t you also one of His disciples?” He denied it and said, “I am not.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_26","073_18_26","JHN","18","26","26","One of the high priest’s servants, a relative of the man whose ear Peter had cut off, asked, “Didn’t I see you with Him in the garden?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_27","073_18_27","JHN","18","27","27","Peter denied it once more, and immediately a rooster crowed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_28","073_18_28","JHN","18","28","28","Then they led Jesus away from Caiaphas into the Praetorium. By now it was early morning, and the Jews did not enter the Praetorium, to avoid being defiled and unable to eat the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_29","073_18_29","JHN","18","29","29","So Pilate went out to them and asked, “What accusation are you bringing against this man?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_30","073_18_30","JHN","18","30","30","“If He were not a criminal,” they replied, “we would not have handed Him over to you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_31","073_18_31","JHN","18","31","31","“You take Him and judge Him by your own law,” Pilate told them. “We are not permitted to execute anyone,” the Jews then replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_32","073_18_32","JHN","18","32","32","This was to fulfill the word that Jesus had spoken to indicate the kind of death He was going to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_33","073_18_33","JHN","18","33","33","Pilate went back into the Praetorium, summoned Jesus, and asked Him, “Are You the King of the Jews?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_34","073_18_34","JHN","18","34","34","“Are you saying this on your own,” Jesus asked him, “or did others tell you about Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_35","073_18_35","JHN","18","35","35","“Am I a Jew?” Pilate replied. “Your own people and chief priests handed You over to me. What have You done?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_36","073_18_36","JHN","18","36","36","Jesus answered, “My kingdom is not of this world; if it were, My servants would fight to prevent My arrest by the Jews. But now My kingdom is not of this realm.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_37","073_18_37","JHN","18","37","37","“Then You are a king!” Pilate said. “You say that I am a king,” Jesus answered. “For this reason I was born and have come into the world, to testify to the truth. Everyone who belongs to the truth listens to My voice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_38","073_18_38","JHN","18","38","38","“What is truth?” Pilate asked. And having said this, he went out again to the Jews and told them, “I find no basis for a charge against Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_39","073_18_39","JHN","18","39","39","But it is your custom that I release to you one prisoner at the Passover. So then, do you want me to release to you the King of the Jews?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN18_40","073_18_40","JHN","18","40","40","“Not this man,” they all shouted, “but Barabbas!” (Now Barabbas was an insurrectionist.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_1","073_19_1","JHN","19","1","1","Then Pilate took Jesus and had Him flogged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_2","073_19_2","JHN","19","2","2","The soldiers twisted together a crown of thorns, set it on His head, and dressed Him in a purple robe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_3","073_19_3","JHN","19","3","3","And they kept saying, “Hail, King of the Jews!” and slapping Him in the face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_4","073_19_4","JHN","19","4","4","Once again Pilate came out and said to the Jews, “Look, I am bringing Him out to you to let you know that I find no basis for a charge against Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_5","073_19_5","JHN","19","5","5","When Jesus came out wearing the crown of thorns and the purple robe, Pilate said to them, “Here is the man!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_6","073_19_6","JHN","19","6","6","As soon as the chief priests and officers saw Him, they shouted, “Crucify Him! Crucify Him!” “You take Him and crucify Him,” Pilate replied, “for I find no basis for a charge against Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_7","073_19_7","JHN","19","7","7","“We have a law,” answered the Jews, “and according to our law He must die, because He declared Himself to be the Son of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_8","073_19_8","JHN","19","8","8","When Pilate heard this statement, he was even more afraid, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_9","073_19_9","JHN","19","9","9","and he went back into the Praetorium. “Where are You from?” he asked. But Jesus gave no answer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_10","073_19_10","JHN","19","10","10","So Pilate said to Him, “Do You refuse to speak to me? Do You not know that I have authority to crucify You and authority to release You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_11","073_19_11","JHN","19","11","11","Jesus answered, “You would have no authority over Me if it were not given to you from above. Therefore the one who handed Me over to you is guilty of greater sin.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_12","073_19_12","JHN","19","12","12","From then on, Pilate tried to release Him, but the Jews kept crying out, “If you release this man, you are no friend of Caesar. Anyone who declares himself a king is defying Caesar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_13","073_19_13","JHN","19","13","13","When Pilate heard these words, he brought Jesus out and sat on the judgment seat at a place called the Stone Pavement, which in Hebrew is Gabbatha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_14","073_19_14","JHN","19","14","14","It was the day of Preparation for the Passover, about the sixth hour. And Pilate said to the Jews, “Here is your King!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_15","073_19_15","JHN","19","15","15","At this, they shouted, “Away with Him! Away with Him! Crucify Him!” “Shall I crucify your King?” Pilate asked. “We have no king but Caesar,” replied the chief priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_16","073_19_16","JHN","19","16","16","Then Pilate handed Jesus over to be crucified, and the soldiers took Him and led Him away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_17","073_19_17","JHN","19","17","17","Carrying His own cross, He went out to a place called The Place of the Skull, which in Hebrew is called Golgotha. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_18","073_19_18","JHN","19","18","18","There they crucified Him, and with Him two others, one on each side, with Jesus in the middle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_19","073_19_19","JHN","19","19","19","Pilate also had a notice posted on the cross. It read: JESUS OF NAZARETH, THE KING OF THE JEWS. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_20","073_19_20","JHN","19","20","20","Many of the Jews read this sign, because the place where Jesus was crucified was near the city, and it was written in Hebrew, Greek, and Latin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_21","073_19_21","JHN","19","21","21","So the chief priests of the Jews said to Pilate, “Do not write, ‘The King of the Jews,’ but only that He said, ‘I am the King of the Jews.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_22","073_19_22","JHN","19","22","22","Pilate answered, “What I have written, I have written.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_23","073_19_23","JHN","19","23","23","When the soldiers had crucified Jesus, they divided His garments into four parts, one for each soldier, with the tunic remaining. It was seamless, woven in one piece from top to bottom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_24","073_19_24","JHN","19","24","24","So they said to one another, “Let us not tear it. Instead, let us cast lots to see who will get it.” This was to fulfill the Scripture: “They divided My garments among them, and cast lots for My clothing.” So that is what the soldiers did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_25","073_19_25","JHN","19","25","25","Near the cross of Jesus stood His mother and her sister, as well as Mary the wife of Clopas and Mary Magdalene. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_26","073_19_26","JHN","19","26","26","When Jesus saw His mother and the disciple whom He loved standing nearby, He said to His mother, “Woman, here is your son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_27","073_19_27","JHN","19","27","27","Then He said to the disciple, “Here is your mother.” So from that hour, this disciple took her into his home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_28","073_19_28","JHN","19","28","28","After this, seeing that everything had now been accomplished, and to fulfill the Scripture, Jesus said, “I am thirsty.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_29","073_19_29","JHN","19","29","29","A jar of sour wine was sitting there. So they soaked a sponge in the wine, put it on a stalk of hyssop, and lifted it to His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_30","073_19_30","JHN","19","30","30","When Jesus had received the sour wine, He said, “It is finished.” And bowing His head, He yielded up His spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_31","073_19_31","JHN","19","31","31","It was the day of Preparation, and the next day was a High Sabbath. In order that the bodies would not remain on the cross during the Sabbath, the Jews asked Pilate to have the legs broken and the bodies removed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_32","073_19_32","JHN","19","32","32","So the soldiers came and broke the legs of the first man who had been crucified with Jesus, and those of the other. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_33","073_19_33","JHN","19","33","33","But when they came to Jesus and saw that He was already dead, they did not break His legs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_34","073_19_34","JHN","19","34","34","Instead, one of the soldiers pierced His side with a spear, and immediately blood and water flowed out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_35","073_19_35","JHN","19","35","35","The one who saw it has testified to this, and his testimony is true. He knows that he is telling the truth, so that you may believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_36","073_19_36","JHN","19","36","36","Now these things happened so that the Scripture would be fulfilled: “Not one of His bones will be broken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_37","073_19_37","JHN","19","37","37","And, as another Scripture says: “They will look on the One they have pierced.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_38","073_19_38","JHN","19","38","38","Afterward, Joseph of Arimathea, who was a disciple of Jesus (but secretly for fear of the Jews), asked Pilate to let him remove the body of Jesus. Pilate gave him permission, so he came and removed the body of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_39","073_19_39","JHN","19","39","39","Nicodemus, who had previously come to Jesus at night, also brought a mixture of myrrh and aloes, about seventy-five pounds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_40","073_19_40","JHN","19","40","40","So they took the body of Jesus and wrapped it in linen cloths with the spices, according to the Jewish burial custom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_41","073_19_41","JHN","19","41","41","Now there was a garden in the place where Jesus was crucified, and in the garden a new tomb in which no one had yet been laid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN19_42","073_19_42","JHN","19","42","42","And because it was the Jewish day of Preparation and the tomb was nearby, they placed Jesus there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_1","073_20_1","JHN","20","1","1","Early on the first day of the week, while it was still dark, Mary Magdalene went to the tomb and saw that the stone had been removed from the entrance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_2","073_20_2","JHN","20","2","2","So she came running to Simon Peter and the other disciple, the one whom Jesus loved. “They have taken the Lord out of the tomb,” she said, “and we do not know where they have put Him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_3","073_20_3","JHN","20","3","3","Then Peter and the other disciple set out for the tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_4","073_20_4","JHN","20","4","4","The two were running together, but the other disciple outran Peter and reached the tomb first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_5","073_20_5","JHN","20","5","5","He bent down and looked in at the linen cloths lying there, but he did not go in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_6","073_20_6","JHN","20","6","6","Simon Peter arrived just after him. He entered the tomb and saw the linen cloths lying there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_7","073_20_7","JHN","20","7","7","The cloth that had been around Jesus’ head was rolled up, lying separate from the linen cloths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_8","073_20_8","JHN","20","8","8","Then the other disciple, who had reached the tomb first, also went in. And he saw and believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_9","073_20_9","JHN","20","9","9","For they still did not understand from the Scripture that Jesus had to rise from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_10","073_20_10","JHN","20","10","10","Then the disciples returned to their homes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_11","073_20_11","JHN","20","11","11","But Mary stood outside the tomb weeping. And as she wept, she bent down to look into the tomb, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_12","073_20_12","JHN","20","12","12","and she saw two angels in white sitting where the body of Jesus had lain, one at the head and the other at the feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_13","073_20_13","JHN","20","13","13","“Woman, why are you weeping?” they asked. “Because they have taken my Lord away,” she said, “and I do not know where they have put Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_14","073_20_14","JHN","20","14","14","When she had said this, she turned around and saw Jesus standing there. But she did not recognize that it was Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_15","073_20_15","JHN","20","15","15","“Woman, why are you weeping?” Jesus asked. “Whom are you seeking?” Thinking He was the gardener, she said, “Sir, if you have carried Him off, tell me where you have put Him, and I will get Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_16","073_20_16","JHN","20","16","16","Jesus said to her, “Mary.” She turned and said to Him, “Rabboni!” (which means “Teacher”). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_17","073_20_17","JHN","20","17","17","“Do not cling to Me,” Jesus said, “for I have not yet ascended to My Father. But go and tell My brothers, ‘I am ascending to My Father and your Father, to My God and your God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_18","073_20_18","JHN","20","18","18","Mary Magdalene went and announced to the disciples that she had seen the Lord. And she told them what He had said to her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_19","073_20_19","JHN","20","19","19","It was the first day of the week, and that very evening, while the disciples were gathered together with the doors locked for fear of the Jews, Jesus came and stood among them. “Peace be with you!” He said to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_20","073_20_20","JHN","20","20","20","After He had said this, He showed them His hands and His side. The disciples rejoiced when they saw the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_21","073_20_21","JHN","20","21","21","Again Jesus said to them, “Peace be with you. As the Father has sent Me, so also I am sending you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_22","073_20_22","JHN","20","22","22","When He had said this, He breathed on them and said, “Receive the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_23","073_20_23","JHN","20","23","23","If you forgive anyone his sins, they are forgiven; if you withhold forgiveness from anyone, it is withheld.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_24","073_20_24","JHN","20","24","24","Now Thomas called Didymus, one of the Twelve, was not with the disciples when Jesus came. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_25","073_20_25","JHN","20","25","25","So the other disciples told him, “We have seen the Lord!” But he replied, “Unless I see the nail marks in His hands, and put my finger where the nails have been, and put my hand into His side, I will never believe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_26","073_20_26","JHN","20","26","26","Eight days later, His disciples were once again inside with the doors locked, and Thomas was with them. Jesus came and stood among them and said, “Peace be with you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_27","073_20_27","JHN","20","27","27","Then Jesus said to Thomas, “Put your finger here and look at My hands. Reach out your hand and put it into My side. Stop doubting and believe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_28","073_20_28","JHN","20","28","28","Thomas replied, “My Lord and my God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_29","073_20_29","JHN","20","29","29","Jesus said to him, “Because you have seen Me, you have believed; blessed are those who have not seen and yet have believed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_30","073_20_30","JHN","20","30","30","Jesus performed many other signs in the presence of His disciples, which are not written in this book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN20_31","073_20_31","JHN","20","31","31","But these are written so that you may believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God, and that by believing you may have life in His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_1","073_21_1","JHN","21","1","1","Later, by the Sea of Tiberias, Jesus again revealed Himself to the disciples. He made Himself known in this way: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_2","073_21_2","JHN","21","2","2","Simon Peter, Thomas called Didymus, Nathanael from Cana in Galilee, the sons of Zebedee, and two other disciples were together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_3","073_21_3","JHN","21","3","3","Simon Peter told them, “I am going fishing.” “We will go with you,” they said. So they went out and immediately got into the boat, but caught nothing that night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_4","073_21_4","JHN","21","4","4","Early in the morning, Jesus stood on the shore, but the disciples did not recognize that it was Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_5","073_21_5","JHN","21","5","5","So He called out to them, “Children, do you have any fish?” “No,” they answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_6","073_21_6","JHN","21","6","6","He told them, “Cast the net on the right side of the boat, and you will find some.” So they cast it there, and they were unable to haul it in because of the great number of fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_7","073_21_7","JHN","21","7","7","Then the disciple whom Jesus loved said to Peter, “It is the Lord!” As soon as Simon Peter heard that it was the Lord, he put on his outer garment (for he had removed it) and jumped into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_8","073_21_8","JHN","21","8","8","The other disciples came ashore in the boat. They dragged in the net full of fish, for they were not far from land, only about a hundred yards. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_9","073_21_9","JHN","21","9","9","When they landed, they saw a charcoal fire there with fish on it, and some bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_10","073_21_10","JHN","21","10","10","Jesus told them, “Bring some of the fish you have just caught.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_11","073_21_11","JHN","21","11","11","So Simon Peter went aboard and dragged the net ashore. It was full of large fish, 153, but even with so many, the net was not torn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_12","073_21_12","JHN","21","12","12","“Come, have breakfast,” Jesus said to them. None of the disciples dared to ask Him, “Who are You?” They knew it was the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_13","073_21_13","JHN","21","13","13","Jesus then came and took the bread and gave it to them, and He did the same with the fish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_14","073_21_14","JHN","21","14","14","This was now the third time that Jesus appeared to His disciples after He was raised from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_15","073_21_15","JHN","21","15","15","When they had finished eating, Jesus asked Simon Peter, “Simon son of Jonah, do you love Me more than these?” “Yes, Lord,” he answered, “You know I love You.” Jesus replied, “Feed My lambs.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_16","073_21_16","JHN","21","16","16","Jesus asked a second time, “Simon son of Jonah, do you love Me?” “Yes, Lord,” he answered, “You know I love You.” Jesus told him, “Shepherd My sheep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_17","073_21_17","JHN","21","17","17","Jesus asked a third time, “Simon son of Jonah, do you love Me?” Peter was deeply hurt that Jesus had asked him a third time, “Do you love Me?” “Lord, You know all things,” he replied. “You know I love You.” Jesus said to him, “Feed My sheep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_18","073_21_18","JHN","21","18","18","Truly, truly, I tell you, when you were young, you dressed yourself and walked where you wanted; but when you are old, you will stretch out your hands, and someone else will dress you and lead you where you do not want to go.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_19","073_21_19","JHN","21","19","19","Jesus said this to indicate the kind of death by which Peter would glorify God. And after He had said this, He told him, “Follow Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_20","073_21_20","JHN","21","20","20","Peter turned and saw the disciple whom Jesus loved following them. He was the one who had leaned back against Jesus at the supper to ask, “Lord, who is going to betray You?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_21","073_21_21","JHN","21","21","21","When Peter saw him, he asked, “Lord, what about him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_22","073_21_22","JHN","21","22","22","Jesus answered, “If I want him to remain until I return, what is that to you? You follow Me!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_23","073_21_23","JHN","21","23","23","Because of this, the rumor spread among the brothers that this disciple would not die. However, Jesus did not say that he would not die, but only, “If I want him to remain until I return, what is that to you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_24","073_21_24","JHN","21","24","24","This is the disciple who testifies to these things and who has written them down. And we know that his testimony is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JN21_25","073_21_25","JHN","21","25","25","There are many more things that Jesus did. If all of them were written down, I suppose that not even the world itself would have space for the books that would be written. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_1","074_1_1","ACT","1","1","1","In my first book, O Theophilus, I wrote about all that Jesus began to do and to teach, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_2","074_1_2","ACT","1","2","2","until the day He was taken up to heaven, after giving instructions through the Holy Spirit to the apostles He had chosen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_3","074_1_3","ACT","1","3","3","After His suffering, He presented Himself to them with many convincing proofs that He was alive. He appeared to them over a span of forty days and spoke about the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_4","074_1_4","ACT","1","4","4","And while they were gathered together, He commanded them: “Do not leave Jerusalem, but wait for the gift the Father promised, which you have heard Me discuss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_5","074_1_5","ACT","1","5","5","For John baptized with water, but in a few days you will be baptized with the Holy Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_6","074_1_6","ACT","1","6","6","So when they came together, they asked Him, “Lord, will You at this time restore the kingdom to Israel?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_7","074_1_7","ACT","1","7","7","Jesus replied, “It is not for you to know times or seasons that the Father has fixed by His own authority. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_8","074_1_8","ACT","1","8","8","But you will receive power when the Holy Spirit comes upon you, and you will be witnesses to Me in Jerusalem, and in all Judea and Samaria, and to the ends of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_9","074_1_9","ACT","1","9","9","After He had said this, they watched as He was taken up, and a cloud hid Him from their sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_10","074_1_10","ACT","1","10","10","They were looking intently into the sky as He was going, when suddenly two men dressed in white stood beside them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_11","074_1_11","ACT","1","11","11","“Men of Galilee,” they said, “why do you stand here looking into the sky? This same Jesus, who has been taken from you into heaven, will come back in the same way you have seen Him go into heaven.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_12","074_1_12","ACT","1","12","12","Then they returned to Jerusalem from the Mount of Olives, which is near the city, a Sabbath day’s journey away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_13","074_1_13","ACT","1","13","13","When they arrived, they went to the upper room where they were staying: Peter and James, John and Andrew, Philip and Thomas, Bartholomew and Matthew, James son of Alphaeus, Simon the Zealot, and Judas son of James. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_14","074_1_14","ACT","1","14","14","With one accord they all continued in prayer and petition, along with the women and Mary the mother of Jesus, and with His brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_15","074_1_15","ACT","1","15","15","In those days Peter stood up among the disciples (a gathering of about a hundred and twenty) and said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_16","074_1_16","ACT","1","16","16","“Brothers, this Scripture had to be fulfilled that the Holy Spirit foretold through the mouth of David concerning Judas, who became a guide for those who arrested Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_17","074_1_17","ACT","1","17","17","He was one of our number and shared in this ministry.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_18","074_1_18","ACT","1","18","18","(Now with the reward for his wickedness Judas bought a field; there he fell headlong and burst open in the middle, and all his intestines spilled out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_19","074_1_19","ACT","1","19","19","This became known to all who lived in Jerusalem, so they called that field in their own language Akeldama, that is, Field of Blood.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_20","074_1_20","ACT","1","20","20","“For it is written in the book of Psalms: ‘May his place be deserted; let there be no one to dwell in it,’ and, ‘May another take his position.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_21","074_1_21","ACT","1","21","21","Therefore it is necessary to choose one of the men who have accompanied us the whole time the Lord Jesus went in and out among us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_22","074_1_22","ACT","1","22","22","beginning from John’s baptism until the day Jesus was taken up from us. For one of these must become a witness with us of His resurrection.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_23","074_1_23","ACT","1","23","23","So they proposed two men: Joseph called Barsabas (also known as Justus) and Matthias. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_24","074_1_24","ACT","1","24","24","And they prayed, “Lord, You know everyone’s heart. Show us which of these two You have chosen ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_25","074_1_25","ACT","1","25","25","to receive a portion in this ministry and apostleship that Judas abandoned to go to his rightful place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC1_26","074_1_26","ACT","1","26","26","Then they cast lots, and the lot fell to Matthias. So he was added to the eleven apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_1","074_2_1","ACT","2","1","1","When the day of Pentecost came, they were all with one accord in one place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_2","074_2_2","ACT","2","2","2","Suddenly a sound like a mighty rushing wind came from heaven and filled the whole house where they were sitting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_3","074_2_3","ACT","2","3","3","They saw tongues like flames of fire that separated and came to rest on each of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_4","074_2_4","ACT","2","4","4","And they were all filled with the Holy Spirit and began to speak in other tongues as the Spirit enabled them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_5","074_2_5","ACT","2","5","5","Now there were dwelling in Jerusalem God-fearing Jews from every nation under heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_6","074_2_6","ACT","2","6","6","And when this sound rang out, a crowd came together in bewilderment, because each one heard them speaking his own language. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_7","074_2_7","ACT","2","7","7","Astounded and amazed, they asked one another, “Are not all these who are speaking Galileans? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_8","074_2_8","ACT","2","8","8","How is it then that each of us hears them in his own native language? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_9","074_2_9","ACT","2","9","9","Parthians, Medes, and Elamites; residents of Mesopotamia, Judea and Cappadocia, Pontus and Asia, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_10","074_2_10","ACT","2","10","10","Phrygia and Pamphylia, Egypt and the parts of Libya near Cyrene; visitors from Rome, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_11","074_2_11","ACT","2","11","11","both Jews and converts to Judaism; Cretans and Arabs—we hear them declaring the wonders of God in our own tongues!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_12","074_2_12","ACT","2","12","12","Astounded and perplexed, they asked one another, “What does this mean?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_13","074_2_13","ACT","2","13","13","But others mocked them and said, “They are drunk on new wine!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_14","074_2_14","ACT","2","14","14","Then Peter stood up with the Eleven, lifted up his voice, and addressed the crowd: “Men of Judea and all who dwell in Jerusalem, let this be known to you, and listen carefully to my words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_15","074_2_15","ACT","2","15","15","These men are not drunk, as you suppose. It is only the third hour of the day! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_16","074_2_16","ACT","2","16","16","No, this is what was spoken by the prophet Joel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_17","074_2_17","ACT","2","17","17","‘In the last days, God says, I will pour out My Spirit on all people. Your sons and daughters will prophesy, your young men will see visions, your old men will dream dreams. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_18","074_2_18","ACT","2","18","18","Even on My menservants and maidservants I will pour out My Spirit in those days, and they will prophesy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_19","074_2_19","ACT","2","19","19","I will show wonders in the heavens above and signs on the earth below, blood and fire and billows of smoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_20","074_2_20","ACT","2","20","20","The sun will be turned to darkness, and the moon to blood, before the coming of the great and glorious Day of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_21","074_2_21","ACT","2","21","21","And everyone who calls on the name of the Lord will be saved.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_22","074_2_22","ACT","2","22","22","Men of Israel, listen to this message: Jesus of Nazareth was a man certified by God to you by miracles, wonders, and signs, which God did among you through Him, as you yourselves know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_23","074_2_23","ACT","2","23","23","He was delivered up by God’s set plan and foreknowledge, and you, by the hands of the lawless, took and put Him to death by nailing Him to the cross. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_24","074_2_24","ACT","2","24","24","But God raised Him from the dead, releasing Him from the agony of death, because it was impossible for death to keep Him in its grip. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_25","074_2_25","ACT","2","25","25","David says about Him: ‘I saw the Lord always before me; because He is at my right hand, I will not be shaken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_26","074_2_26","ACT","2","26","26","Therefore my heart is glad and my tongue rejoices; my body also will dwell in hope, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_27","074_2_27","ACT","2","27","27","because You will not abandon my soul to Hades, nor will You let Your Holy One see decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_28","074_2_28","ACT","2","28","28","You have made known to me the paths of life; You will fill me with joy in Your presence.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_29","074_2_29","ACT","2","29","29","Brothers, I can tell you with confidence that the patriarch David died and was buried, and his tomb is with us to this day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_30","074_2_30","ACT","2","30","30","But he was a prophet and knew that God had promised him on oath that from his descendants according to the flesh He would raise up the Christ to seat Him on his throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_31","074_2_31","ACT","2","31","31","Foreseeing this, David spoke about the resurrection of the Christ, that His soul was not abandoned to Hades, nor did His body see decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_32","074_2_32","ACT","2","32","32","God has raised this Jesus to life, to which we are all witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_33","074_2_33","ACT","2","33","33","Exalted, then, to the right hand of God, He has received from the Father the promised Holy Spirit and has poured out what you now see and hear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_34","074_2_34","ACT","2","34","34","For David did not ascend into heaven, but he himself says: ‘The Lord said to my Lord, “Sit at My right hand ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_35","074_2_35","ACT","2","35","35","until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet.”’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_36","074_2_36","ACT","2","36","36","Therefore let all Israel know with certainty that God has made this Jesus, whom you crucified, both Lord and Christ!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_37","074_2_37","ACT","2","37","37","When the people heard this, they were cut to the heart and asked Peter and the other apostles, “Brothers, what shall we do?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_38","074_2_38","ACT","2","38","38","Peter replied, “Repent and be baptized, every one of you, in the name of Jesus Christ for the forgiveness of sins, and you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_39","074_2_39","ACT","2","39","39","This promise belongs to you and your children and to all who are far off—to all whom the Lord our God will call to Himself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_40","074_2_40","ACT","2","40","40","With many other words he testified, and he urged them, “Be saved from this corrupt generation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_41","074_2_41","ACT","2","41","41","Those who gladly embraced his message were baptized, and about three thousand were added to the believers that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_42","074_2_42","ACT","2","42","42","They devoted themselves to the apostles’ teaching and to the fellowship, to the breaking of bread and to prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_43","074_2_43","ACT","2","43","43","A sense of awe came over everyone, and the apostles performed many wonders and signs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_44","074_2_44","ACT","2","44","44","All the believers were together and had everything in common. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_45","074_2_45","ACT","2","45","45","Selling their possessions and goods, they shared with anyone who was in need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_46","074_2_46","ACT","2","46","46","With one accord they continued to meet daily in the temple courts and to break bread from house to house, sharing their meals with gladness and sincerity of heart, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC2_47","074_2_47","ACT","2","47","47","praising God and enjoying the favor of all the people. And the Lord added to the church daily those who were being saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_1","074_3_1","ACT","3","1","1","One afternoon Peter and John were going up together to the temple at the hour of prayer, the ninth hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_2","074_3_2","ACT","3","2","2","And a man who was lame from birth was being carried to the temple gate called Beautiful, where he was put every day to beg from those entering the temple courts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_3","074_3_3","ACT","3","3","3","When he saw Peter and John about to enter, he asked them for money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_4","074_3_4","ACT","3","4","4","Peter looked directly at him, as did John. “Look at us!” said Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_5","074_3_5","ACT","3","5","5","So the man gave them his attention, expecting to receive something from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_6","074_3_6","ACT","3","6","6","But Peter said, “Silver or gold I do not have, but what I have I give you: In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, get up and walk!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_7","074_3_7","ACT","3","7","7","Taking him by the right hand, Peter helped him up, and at once the man’s feet and ankles were made strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_8","074_3_8","ACT","3","8","8","He sprang to his feet and began to walk. Then he went with them into the temple courts, walking and leaping and praising God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_9","074_3_9","ACT","3","9","9","When all the people saw him walking and praising God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_10","074_3_10","ACT","3","10","10","they recognized him as the man who used to sit begging at the Beautiful Gate of the temple, and they were filled with wonder and amazement at what had happened to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_11","074_3_11","ACT","3","11","11","While the lame man who had been healed clung to Peter and John, all the people were astonished and ran to them in the walkway called Solomon’s Colonnade. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_12","074_3_12","ACT","3","12","12","And when Peter saw this, he addressed the people: “Men of Israel, why are you surprised by this? Why do you stare at us as if by our own power or godliness we had made this man walk? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_13","074_3_13","ACT","3","13","13","The God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, the God of our fathers, has glorified His servant Jesus. You handed Him over and rejected Him before Pilate, even though he had decided to release Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_14","074_3_14","ACT","3","14","14","You rejected the Holy and Righteous One and asked that a murderer be released to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_15","074_3_15","ACT","3","15","15","You killed the Author of life, but God raised Him from the dead, and we are witnesses of this fact. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_16","074_3_16","ACT","3","16","16","By faith in the name of Jesus, this man whom you see and know has been made strong. It is Jesus’ name and the faith that comes through Him that has given him this complete healing in your presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_17","074_3_17","ACT","3","17","17","And now, brothers, I know that you acted in ignorance, as did your leaders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_18","074_3_18","ACT","3","18","18","But in this way God has fulfilled what He foretold through all His prophets, saying that the Christ would suffer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_19","074_3_19","ACT","3","19","19","Repent, then, and turn back, so that your sins may be wiped away, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_20","074_3_20","ACT","3","20","20","that times of refreshing may come from the presence of the Lord, and that He may send Jesus, the Christ, who has been appointed for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_21","074_3_21","ACT","3","21","21","Heaven must take Him in until the time comes for the restoration of all things, which God announced long ago through all His holy prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_22","074_3_22","ACT","3","22","22","For Moses said to the fathers, ‘The Lord your God will raise up for you a prophet like me from among your brothers. You must listen to Him in everything He tells you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_23","074_3_23","ACT","3","23","23","Everyone who does not listen to Him will be completely cut off from among his people.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_24","074_3_24","ACT","3","24","24","Indeed, all the prophets from Samuel on, as many as have spoken, have proclaimed these days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_25","074_3_25","ACT","3","25","25","And you are sons of the prophets and of the covenant God made with our fathers when He said to Abraham, ‘Through your offspring all the families of the earth will be blessed.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC3_26","074_3_26","ACT","3","26","26","When God raised up His servant Jesus, He sent Him first to you to bless you by turning each of you from your wicked ways.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_1","074_4_1","ACT","4","1","1","While Peter and John were speaking to the people, the priests and the captain of the temple guard and the Sadducees came up to them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_2","074_4_2","ACT","4","2","2","greatly disturbed that they were teaching the people and proclaiming in Jesus the resurrection of the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_3","074_4_3","ACT","4","3","3","They seized Peter and John, and because it was evening, they put them in custody until the next day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_4","074_4_4","ACT","4","4","4","But many who heard the message believed, and the number of men grew to about five thousand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_5","074_4_5","ACT","4","5","5","The next day the rulers, elders, and scribes assembled in Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_6","074_4_6","ACT","4","6","6","along with Annas the high priest, Caiaphas, John, Alexander, and many others from the high priest’s family. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_7","074_4_7","ACT","4","7","7","They had Peter and John brought in and began to question them: “By what power or what name did you do this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_8","074_4_8","ACT","4","8","8","Then Peter, filled with the Holy Spirit, said to them, “Rulers and elders of the people of Israel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_9","074_4_9","ACT","4","9","9","If we are being examined today about a kind service to a man who was lame, to determine how he was healed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_10","074_4_10","ACT","4","10","10","then let this be known to all of you and to all the people of Israel: It is by the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, whom you crucified but whom God raised from the dead, that this man stands before you healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_11","074_4_11","ACT","4","11","11","This Jesus is ‘the stone you builders rejected, which has become the cornerstone.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_12","074_4_12","ACT","4","12","12","Salvation exists in no one else, for there is no other name given to men by which we must be saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_13","074_4_13","ACT","4","13","13","When they saw the boldness of Peter and John and realized that they were unschooled, ordinary men, they marveled and took note that these men had been with Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_14","074_4_14","ACT","4","14","14","And seeing the man who had been healed standing there with them, they had nothing to say in response. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_15","074_4_15","ACT","4","15","15","So they ordered them to leave the Sanhedrin and then conferred together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_16","074_4_16","ACT","4","16","16","“What shall we do with these men?” they asked. “It is clear to everyone living in Jerusalem that a remarkable miracle has occurred through them, and we cannot deny it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_17","074_4_17","ACT","4","17","17","But to keep this message from spreading any further among the people, we must strictly warn them not to speak to anyone in this name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_18","074_4_18","ACT","4","18","18","Then they called them in again and commanded them not to speak or teach at all in the name of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_19","074_4_19","ACT","4","19","19","But Peter and John replied, “Judge for yourselves whether it is right in God’s sight to listen to you rather than God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_20","074_4_20","ACT","4","20","20","For we cannot stop speaking about what we have seen and heard.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_21","074_4_21","ACT","4","21","21","After further threats they let them go. They could not find a way to punish them, because all the people were glorifying God for what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_22","074_4_22","ACT","4","22","22","For the man who was miraculously healed was over forty years old. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_23","074_4_23","ACT","4","23","23","On their release, Peter and John returned to their own people and reported everything that the chief priests and elders had said to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_24","074_4_24","ACT","4","24","24","When the believers heard this, they lifted up their voices to God with one accord. “Sovereign Lord,” they said, “You are God, who made the heaven and the earth and the sea and everything in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_25","074_4_25","ACT","4","25","25","You spoke through the mouth of Your servant David: ‘Why do the nations rage and the peoples plot in vain? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_26","074_4_26","ACT","4","26","26","The kings of the earth take their stand and the rulers gather together against the Lord and against His Anointed One.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_27","074_4_27","ACT","4","27","27","In fact, Herod and Pontius Pilate conspired with the Gentiles and the people of Israel against Your holy servant Jesus, whom You anointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_28","074_4_28","ACT","4","28","28","They carried out what Your hand and will had decided beforehand would happen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_29","074_4_29","ACT","4","29","29","And now, Lord, consider their threats, and enable Your servants to speak Your word with complete boldness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_30","074_4_30","ACT","4","30","30","as You stretch out Your hand to heal and perform signs and wonders through the name of Your holy servant Jesus.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_31","074_4_31","ACT","4","31","31","After they had prayed, their meeting place was shaken, and they were all filled with the Holy Spirit and spoke the word of God boldly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_32","074_4_32","ACT","4","32","32","The multitude of believers was one in heart and soul. No one claimed that any of their possessions was his own, but they shared everything they owned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_33","074_4_33","ACT","4","33","33","With great power the apostles continued to give their testimony about the resurrection of the Lord Jesus. And abundant grace was upon them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_34","074_4_34","ACT","4","34","34","There were no needy ones among them, because those who owned lands or houses would sell their property, bring the proceeds from the sales, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_35","074_4_35","ACT","4","35","35","and lay them at the apostles’ feet for distribution to anyone as he had need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_36","074_4_36","ACT","4","36","36","Joses, a Levite from Cyprus, whom the apostles called Barnabas (meaning Son of Encouragement), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC4_37","074_4_37","ACT","4","37","37","sold a field he owned, brought the money, and laid it at the apostles’ feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_1","074_5_1","ACT","5","1","1","Now a man named Ananias, together with his wife Sapphira, also sold a piece of property. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_2","074_5_2","ACT","5","2","2","With his wife’s full knowledge, he kept back some of the proceeds for himself, but brought a portion and laid it at the apostles’ feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_3","074_5_3","ACT","5","3","3","Then Peter said, “Ananias, how is it that Satan has filled your heart to lie to the Holy Spirit and withhold some of the proceeds from the land? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_4","074_5_4","ACT","5","4","4","Did it not belong to you before it was sold? And after it was sold, was it not at your disposal? How could you conceive such a deed in your heart? You have not lied to men, but to God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_5","074_5_5","ACT","5","5","5","On hearing these words, Ananias fell down and died. And great fear came over all who heard what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_6","074_5_6","ACT","5","6","6","Then the young men stepped forward, wrapped up his body, and carried him out and buried him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_7","074_5_7","ACT","5","7","7","About three hours later his wife also came in, unaware of what had happened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_8","074_5_8","ACT","5","8","8","“Tell me,” said Peter, “is this the price you and your husband got for the land?” “Yes,” she answered, “that is the price.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_9","074_5_9","ACT","5","9","9","“How could you agree to test the Spirit of the Lord?” Peter replied. “Look, the feet of the men who buried your husband are at the door, and they will carry you out also.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_10","074_5_10","ACT","5","10","10","At that instant she fell down at his feet and died. Then the young men came in and, finding her dead, carried her out and buried her beside her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_11","074_5_11","ACT","5","11","11","And great fear came over the whole church and all who heard about these events. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_12","074_5_12","ACT","5","12","12","The apostles performed many signs and wonders among the people, and with one accord the believers gathered together in Solomon’s Colonnade. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_13","074_5_13","ACT","5","13","13","Although the people regarded them highly, no one else dared to join them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_14","074_5_14","ACT","5","14","14","Yet more and more believers were brought to the Lord—large numbers of both men and women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_15","074_5_15","ACT","5","15","15","As a result, people brought the sick into the streets and laid them on cots and mats, so that at least Peter’s shadow might fall on some of them as he passed by. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_16","074_5_16","ACT","5","16","16","Crowds also gathered from the towns around Jerusalem, bringing the sick and those tormented by unclean spirits, and all of them were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_17","074_5_17","ACT","5","17","17","Then the high priest and all his associates, who belonged to the party of the Sadducees, were filled with jealousy. They went out ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_18","074_5_18","ACT","5","18","18","and arrested the apostles and put them in the public jail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_19","074_5_19","ACT","5","19","19","But during the night an angel of the Lord opened the doors of the jail and brought them out, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_20","074_5_20","ACT","5","20","20","“Go, stand in the temple courts and tell the people the full message of this new life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_21","074_5_21","ACT","5","21","21","At daybreak the apostles entered the temple courts as they had been told and began to teach the people. When the high priest and his associates arrived, they convened the Sanhedrin—the full assembly of the elders of Israel—and sent to the jail for the apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_22","074_5_22","ACT","5","22","22","But on arriving at the jail, the officers did not find them there. So they returned with the report: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_23","074_5_23","ACT","5","23","23","“We indeed found the jail securely locked, with the guards posted before the doors; but when we opened them, we found no one inside.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_24","074_5_24","ACT","5","24","24","When the high priest and the captain of the temple guard and the chief priests heard this account, they were perplexed as to what was happening. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_25","074_5_25","ACT","5","25","25","Then someone came in and announced, “Look, the men you put in jail are standing in the temple courts teaching the people!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_26","074_5_26","ACT","5","26","26","At that point, the captain went with the officers and brought the apostles—but not by force, for fear the people would stone them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_27","074_5_27","ACT","5","27","27","They brought them in and made them stand before the Sanhedrin, where the high priest interrogated them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_28","074_5_28","ACT","5","28","28","“Did we not give you strict orders not to teach in this name?” he asked. “Yet you have filled Jerusalem with your teaching and are determined to make us responsible for this man’s blood.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_29","074_5_29","ACT","5","29","29","But Peter and the other apostles replied, “We must obey God rather than men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_30","074_5_30","ACT","5","30","30","The God of our fathers raised up Jesus, whom you had killed by hanging Him on a tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_31","074_5_31","ACT","5","31","31","God exalted Him to His right hand as Prince and Savior, in order to grant repentance and forgiveness of sins to Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_32","074_5_32","ACT","5","32","32","We are His witnesses of these things, and so is the Holy Spirit, whom God has given to those who obey Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_33","074_5_33","ACT","5","33","33","When the Council members heard this, they were enraged, and they resolved to put the apostles to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_34","074_5_34","ACT","5","34","34","But a Pharisee named Gamaliel, a teacher of the law who was honored by all the people, stood up in the Sanhedrin and ordered that the apostles be put outside for a short time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_35","074_5_35","ACT","5","35","35","“Men of Israel,” he said, “consider carefully what you are about to do to these men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_36","074_5_36","ACT","5","36","36","Some time ago Theudas rose up, claiming to be somebody, and about four hundred men rallied to him. He was killed, all his followers were dispersed, and it all came to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_37","074_5_37","ACT","5","37","37","After him, Judas the Galilean appeared in the days of the census and drew away many people after him. He too perished, and all his followers were scattered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_38","074_5_38","ACT","5","38","38","So in the present case I advise you: Leave these men alone. Let them go! For if their purpose or endeavor is of human origin, it will fail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_39","074_5_39","ACT","5","39","39","But if it is from God, you cannot stop them. You may even find yourselves fighting against God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_40","074_5_40","ACT","5","40","40","At this, they yielded to Gamaliel. They called the apostles in and had them flogged. Then they ordered them not to speak in the name of Jesus, and released them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_41","074_5_41","ACT","5","41","41","The apostles left the Sanhedrin, rejoicing that they had been counted worthy of suffering disgrace for the name of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC5_42","074_5_42","ACT","5","42","42","Every day, in the temple courts and from house to house, they did not stop teaching and proclaiming the good news that Jesus is the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_1","074_6_1","ACT","6","1","1","In those days when the disciples were increasing in number, the Grecian Jews among them began to grumble against the Hebraic Jews because their widows were being overlooked in the daily distribution of food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_2","074_6_2","ACT","6","2","2","So the Twelve summoned all the disciples and said, “It is unacceptable for us to neglect the word of God in order to wait on tables. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_3","074_6_3","ACT","6","3","3","Therefore, brothers, select from among you seven men confirmed to be full of the Holy Spirit and wisdom. We will assign this responsibility to them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_4","074_6_4","ACT","6","4","4","and will devote ourselves to prayer and to the ministry of the word.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_5","074_6_5","ACT","6","5","5","This proposal pleased the whole group. They chose Stephen, a man full of faith and of the Holy Spirit, as well as Philip, Prochorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas, and Nicolas from Antioch, a convert to Judaism. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_6","074_6_6","ACT","6","6","6","They presented these seven to the apostles, who prayed and laid their hands on them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_7","074_6_7","ACT","6","7","7","So the word of God continued to spread. The number of disciples in Jerusalem grew rapidly, and a great number of priests became obedient to the faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_8","074_6_8","ACT","6","8","8","Now Stephen, who was full of faith and power, was performing great wonders and signs among the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_9","074_6_9","ACT","6","9","9","But resistance arose from what was called the Synagogue of the Freedmen, including Cyrenians, Alexandrians, and men from the provinces of Cilicia and Asia. They disputed with Stephen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_10","074_6_10","ACT","6","10","10","but they could not stand up to his wisdom or the Spirit by whom he spoke. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_11","074_6_11","ACT","6","11","11","Then they prompted some men to say, “We heard Stephen speak words of blasphemy against Moses and against God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_12","074_6_12","ACT","6","12","12","So they stirred up the people, elders, and scribes and confronted Stephen. They seized him and brought him before the Sanhedrin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_13","074_6_13","ACT","6","13","13","where they presented false witnesses who said, “This man never stops speaking blasphemies against this holy place and against the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_14","074_6_14","ACT","6","14","14","For we have heard him say that Jesus of Nazareth will destroy this place and change the customs that Moses handed down to us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC6_15","074_6_15","ACT","6","15","15","All who were sitting in the Sanhedrin looked intently at Stephen, and they saw that his face was like the face of an angel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_1","074_7_1","ACT","7","1","1","Then the high priest asked Stephen, “Are these charges true?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_2","074_7_2","ACT","7","2","2","And Stephen declared: “Brothers and fathers, listen to me! The God of glory appeared to our father Abraham while he was still in Mesopotamia, before he lived in Haran, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_3","074_7_3","ACT","7","3","3","and told him, ‘Leave your country and your kindred and go to the land I will show you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_4","074_7_4","ACT","7","4","4","So Abraham left the land of the Chaldeans and settled in Haran. After his father died, God brought him out of that place and into this land where you are now living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_5","074_7_5","ACT","7","5","5","He gave him no inheritance here, not even a foot of ground. But God promised to give possession of the land to Abraham and his descendants, even though he did not yet have a child. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_6","074_7_6","ACT","7","6","6","God told him that his descendants would be foreigners in a strange land, and that they would be enslaved and mistreated four hundred years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_7","074_7_7","ACT","7","7","7","‘But I will punish the nation that enslaves them,’ God said, ‘and afterward they will come forth and worship Me in this place.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_8","074_7_8","ACT","7","8","8","Then God gave Abraham the covenant of circumcision, and Abraham became the father of Isaac and circumcised him on the eighth day. And Isaac became the father of Jacob, and Jacob of the twelve patriarchs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_9","074_7_9","ACT","7","9","9","Because the patriarchs were jealous of Joseph, they sold him as a slave into Egypt. But God was with him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_10","074_7_10","ACT","7","10","10","and rescued him from all his troubles. He granted Joseph favor and wisdom in the sight of Pharaoh king of Egypt, who appointed him ruler over Egypt and all his household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_11","074_7_11","ACT","7","11","11","Then famine and great suffering swept across the land of Egypt and Canaan, and our fathers could not find food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_12","074_7_12","ACT","7","12","12","When Jacob heard that there was grain in Egypt, he sent our fathers on their first visit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_13","074_7_13","ACT","7","13","13","On their second visit, Joseph revealed his identity to his brothers, and his family became known to Pharaoh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_14","074_7_14","ACT","7","14","14","Then Joseph sent for his father Jacob and all his relatives, seventy-five in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_15","074_7_15","ACT","7","15","15","So Jacob went down to Egypt, where he and our fathers died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_16","074_7_16","ACT","7","16","16","Their bones were carried back to Shechem and placed in the tomb that Abraham had bought from the sons of Hamor of Shechem for a price he paid in silver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_17","074_7_17","ACT","7","17","17","As the time drew near for God to fulfill His promise to Abraham, our people in Egypt increased greatly in number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_18","074_7_18","ACT","7","18","18","Then another king, who knew nothing of Joseph, arose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_19","074_7_19","ACT","7","19","19","He exploited our people and oppressed our fathers, forcing them to abandon their infants so they would die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_20","074_7_20","ACT","7","20","20","At that time Moses was born, and he was beautiful in the sight of God. For three months he was nurtured in his father’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_21","074_7_21","ACT","7","21","21","When he was set outside, Pharaoh’s daughter took him and brought him up as her own son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_22","074_7_22","ACT","7","22","22","So Moses was educated in all the wisdom of the Egyptians and was powerful in speech and action. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_23","074_7_23","ACT","7","23","23","When Moses was forty years old, he decided to visit his brothers, the children of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_24","074_7_24","ACT","7","24","24","And when he saw one of them being mistreated, Moses went to his defense and avenged him by striking down the Egyptian who was oppressing him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_25","074_7_25","ACT","7","25","25","He assumed his brothers would understand that God was using him to deliver them, but they did not. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_26","074_7_26","ACT","7","26","26","The next day he came upon two Israelites who were fighting, and he urged them to make peace, saying, ‘Men, you are brothers. Why are you mistreating each other?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_27","074_7_27","ACT","7","27","27","But the man who was abusing his neighbor pushed Moses aside and said, ‘Who made you ruler and judge over us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_28","074_7_28","ACT","7","28","28","Do you want to kill me as you killed the Egyptian yesterday?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_29","074_7_29","ACT","7","29","29","At this remark, Moses fled to the land of Midian, where he lived as a foreigner and had two sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_30","074_7_30","ACT","7","30","30","After forty years had passed, an angel of the Lord appeared to Moses in the flames of a burning bush in the desert near Mount Sinai. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_31","074_7_31","ACT","7","31","31","When Moses saw it, he marveled at the sight. As he approached to look more closely, the voice of the Lord came to him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_32","074_7_32","ACT","7","32","32","‘I am the God of your fathers, the God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob.’ Moses trembled with fear and did not dare to look. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_33","074_7_33","ACT","7","33","33","Then the Lord said to him, ‘Take off your sandals, for the place where you are standing is holy ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_34","074_7_34","ACT","7","34","34","I have indeed seen the oppression of My people in Egypt. I have heard their groaning and have come down to deliver them. Now come, I will send you back to Egypt.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_35","074_7_35","ACT","7","35","35","This Moses, whom they had rejected with the words, ‘Who made you ruler and judge?’ is the one whom God sent to be their ruler and redeemer through the angel who appeared to him in the bush. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_36","074_7_36","ACT","7","36","36","He led them out and performed wonders and signs in the land of Egypt, at the Red Sea, and for forty years in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_37","074_7_37","ACT","7","37","37","This is the same Moses who told the Israelites, ‘The Lord our God will raise up for you a prophet like me from among your brothers.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_38","074_7_38","ACT","7","38","38","He was in the assembly in the wilderness with the angel who spoke to him on Mount Sinai, and with our fathers. And he received a living word to pass on to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_39","074_7_39","ACT","7","39","39","But our fathers refused to obey him. Instead, they rejected him and in their heart turned back to Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_40","074_7_40","ACT","7","40","40","They said to Aaron, ‘Make us gods who will go before us! As for this Moses who led us out of the land of Egypt, we do not know what has happened to him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_41","074_7_41","ACT","7","41","41","At that time they made a calf and offered a sacrifice to the idol, rejoicing in the works of their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_42","074_7_42","ACT","7","42","42","But God turned away from them and gave them over to the worship of the host of heaven, as it is written in the book of the prophets: ‘Did you bring Me sacrifices and offerings forty years in the wilderness, O house of Israel? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_43","074_7_43","ACT","7","43","43","You have taken along the tabernacle of Molech and the star of your god Remphan, the idols you made to worship. Therefore I will send you into exile beyond Babylon.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_44","074_7_44","ACT","7","44","44","Our fathers had the tabernacle of the Testimony with them in the wilderness. It was constructed exactly as God had directed Moses, according to the pattern he had seen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_45","074_7_45","ACT","7","45","45","And our fathers who received it brought it in with Joshua when they dispossessed the nations God drove out before them. It remained until the time of David, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_46","074_7_46","ACT","7","46","46","who found favor in the sight of God and asked to provide a dwelling place for the God of Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_47","074_7_47","ACT","7","47","47","But it was Solomon who built the house for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_48","074_7_48","ACT","7","48","48","However, the Most High does not dwell in temples made by human hands. As the prophet says: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_49","074_7_49","ACT","7","49","49","‘Heaven is My throne and the earth is My footstool. What kind of house will you build for Me, says the Lord, or where will My place of repose be? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_50","074_7_50","ACT","7","50","50","Has not My hand made all these things?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_51","074_7_51","ACT","7","51","51","You stiff-necked people with uncircumcised heart and ears! You always resist the Holy Spirit, just as your fathers did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_52","074_7_52","ACT","7","52","52","Which of the prophets did your fathers fail to persecute? They even killed those who foretold the coming of the Righteous One. And now you are His betrayers and murderers— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_53","074_7_53","ACT","7","53","53","you who received the law ordained by angels, yet have not kept it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_54","074_7_54","ACT","7","54","54","On hearing this, the members of the Sanhedrin were enraged, and they gnashed their teeth at him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_55","074_7_55","ACT","7","55","55","But Stephen, full of the Holy Spirit, looked intently into heaven and saw the glory of God and Jesus standing at the right hand of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_56","074_7_56","ACT","7","56","56","“Look,” he said, “I see heaven open and the Son of Man standing at the right hand of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_57","074_7_57","ACT","7","57","57","At this they covered their ears, cried out in a loud voice, and rushed together at him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_58","074_7_58","ACT","7","58","58","They dragged him out of the city and began to stone him. Meanwhile the witnesses laid their garments at the feet of a young man named Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_59","074_7_59","ACT","7","59","59","While they were stoning him, Stephen appealed, “Lord Jesus, receive my spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC7_60","074_7_60","ACT","7","60","60","Falling on his knees, he cried out in a loud voice, “Lord, do not hold this sin against them.” And when he had said this, he fell asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_1","074_8_1","ACT","8","1","1","And Saul was there, giving approval to Stephen’s death. On that day a great persecution broke out against the church in Jerusalem, and all except the apostles were scattered throughout Judea and Samaria. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_2","074_8_2","ACT","8","2","2","God-fearing men buried Stephen and mourned deeply over him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_3","074_8_3","ACT","8","3","3","But Saul began to destroy the church. Going from house to house, he dragged off men and women and put them in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_4","074_8_4","ACT","8","4","4","Those who had been scattered preached the word wherever they went. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_5","074_8_5","ACT","8","5","5","Philip went down to a city in Samaria and proclaimed the Christ to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_6","074_8_6","ACT","8","6","6","The crowds all paid close attention to Philip’s message and to the signs they saw him perform. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_7","074_8_7","ACT","8","7","7","With loud shrieks, unclean spirits came out of many who were possessed, and many of the paralyzed and lame were healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_8","074_8_8","ACT","8","8","8","So there was great joy in that city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_9","074_8_9","ACT","8","9","9","Prior to that time, a man named Simon had practiced sorcery in the city and astounded the people of Samaria. He claimed to be someone great, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_10","074_8_10","ACT","8","10","10","and from the least to the greatest they heeded his words and said, “This man is the great power of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_11","074_8_11","ACT","8","11","11","They paid close attention to him because he had astounded them for a long time with his sorcery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_12","074_8_12","ACT","8","12","12","But when they believed Philip as he preached the gospel of the kingdom of God and the name of Jesus Christ, they were baptized, both men and women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_13","074_8_13","ACT","8","13","13","Even Simon himself believed and was baptized. He followed Philip closely and was astounded by the miracles and signs he observed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_14","074_8_14","ACT","8","14","14","When the apostles in Jerusalem heard that Samaria had received the word of God, they sent Peter and John to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_15","074_8_15","ACT","8","15","15","On their arrival, they prayed for them to receive the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_16","074_8_16","ACT","8","16","16","For the Holy Spirit had not yet fallen upon any of them; they had simply been baptized into the name of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_17","074_8_17","ACT","8","17","17","Then Peter and John laid their hands on them, and they received the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_18","074_8_18","ACT","8","18","18","When Simon saw that the Holy Spirit was given through the laying on of the apostles’ hands, he offered them money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_19","074_8_19","ACT","8","19","19","“Give me this power as well,” he said, “so that everyone on whom I lay my hands may receive the Holy Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_20","074_8_20","ACT","8","20","20","But Peter replied, “May your silver perish with you, because you thought you could buy the gift of God with money! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_21","074_8_21","ACT","8","21","21","You have no part or share in our ministry, because your heart is not right in the sight of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_22","074_8_22","ACT","8","22","22","Repent, therefore, of your wickedness, and pray to God. Perhaps He will forgive you for the intent of your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_23","074_8_23","ACT","8","23","23","For I see that you are poisoned by bitterness and captive to iniquity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_24","074_8_24","ACT","8","24","24","Then Simon answered, “Pray to the Lord for me, so that nothing you have said may happen to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_25","074_8_25","ACT","8","25","25","And after Peter and John had testified and spoken the word of the Lord, they returned to Jerusalem, preaching the gospel in many of the Samaritan villages. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_26","074_8_26","ACT","8","26","26","Now an angel of the Lord said to Philip, “Get up and go south to the desert road that goes down from Jerusalem to Gaza.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_27","074_8_27","ACT","8","27","27","So he started out, and on his way he met an Ethiopian eunuch, a court official in charge of the entire treasury of Candace, the queen of the Ethiopians. He had gone to Jerusalem to worship, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_28","074_8_28","ACT","8","28","28","and on his return was sitting in his chariot reading Isaiah the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_29","074_8_29","ACT","8","29","29","The Spirit said to Philip, “Go over to that chariot and stay by it.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_30","074_8_30","ACT","8","30","30","So Philip ran up and heard the man reading Isaiah the prophet. “Do you understand what you are reading?” Philip asked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_31","074_8_31","ACT","8","31","31","“How can I,” he said, “unless someone guides me?” And he invited Philip to come up and sit with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_32","074_8_32","ACT","8","32","32","The eunuch was reading this passage of Scripture: “He was led like a sheep to the slaughter, and as a lamb before the shearer is silent, so He did not open His mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_33","074_8_33","ACT","8","33","33","In His humiliation He was deprived of justice. Who can recount His descendants? For His life was removed from the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_34","074_8_34","ACT","8","34","34","“Tell me,” said the eunuch, “who is the prophet talking about, himself or someone else?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_35","074_8_35","ACT","8","35","35","Then Philip began with this very Scripture and told him the good news about Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_36","074_8_36","ACT","8","36","36","As they traveled along the road and came to some water, the eunuch said, “Look, here is water! What is there to prevent me from being baptized?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_38","074_8_38","ACT","8","38","38","And Philip gave orders to stop the chariot. Then both Philip and the eunuch went down into the water, and Philip baptized him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_39","074_8_39","ACT","8","39","39","When they came up out of the water, the Spirit of the Lord carried Philip away, and the eunuch saw him no more, but went on his way rejoicing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC8_40","074_8_40","ACT","8","40","40","But Philip appeared at Azotus and traveled through that region, preaching the gospel in all the towns until he came to Caesarea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_1","074_9_1","ACT","9","1","1","Meanwhile, Saul was still breathing out murderous threats against the disciples of the Lord. He approached the high priest ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_2","074_9_2","ACT","9","2","2","and requested letters to the synagogues in Damascus, so that if he found any men or women belonging to the Way, he could bring them as prisoners to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_3","074_9_3","ACT","9","3","3","As Saul drew near to Damascus on his journey, suddenly a light from heaven flashed around him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_4","074_9_4","ACT","9","4","4","He fell to the ground and heard a voice say to him, “Saul, Saul, why do you persecute Me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_5","074_9_5","ACT","9","5","5","“Who are You, Lord?” Saul asked. “I am Jesus, whom you are persecuting,” replied the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_6","074_9_6","ACT","9","6","6","“Now get up and go into the city, and you will be told what you must do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_7","074_9_7","ACT","9","7","7","The men traveling with Saul stood there speechless. They heard the voice but did not see anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_8","074_9_8","ACT","9","8","8","Saul got up from the ground, but when he opened his eyes he could not see a thing. So they led him by the hand into Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_9","074_9_9","ACT","9","9","9","For three days he was without sight, and he did not eat or drink anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_10","074_9_10","ACT","9","10","10","In Damascus there was a disciple named Ananias. The Lord spoke to him in a vision, “Ananias!” “Here I am, Lord,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_11","074_9_11","ACT","9","11","11","“Get up!” the Lord told him. “Go to the house of Judas on Straight Street and ask for a man from Tarsus named Saul, for he is praying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_12","074_9_12","ACT","9","12","12","In a vision he has seen a man named Ananias come and place a hand on him to restore his sight.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_13","074_9_13","ACT","9","13","13","But Ananias answered, “Lord, many people have told me about this man and all the harm he has done to Your saints in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_14","074_9_14","ACT","9","14","14","And now he is here with authority from the chief priests to arrest all who call on Your name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_15","074_9_15","ACT","9","15","15","“Go!” said the Lord. “This man is My chosen instrument to carry My name before the Gentiles and their kings, and before the people of Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_16","074_9_16","ACT","9","16","16","I will show him how much he must suffer for My name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_17","074_9_17","ACT","9","17","17","So Ananias went to the house, and when he arrived, he placed his hands on Saul. “Brother Saul,” he said, “the Lord, who appeared to you on the road as you were coming here, has sent me so that you may see again and be filled with the Holy Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_18","074_9_18","ACT","9","18","18","At that instant, something like scales fell from Saul’s eyes, and his sight was restored. He got up and was baptized, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_19","074_9_19","ACT","9","19","19","and after taking some food, he regained his strength. And Saul spent several days with the disciples in Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_20","074_9_20","ACT","9","20","20","Saul promptly began to proclaim Christ in the synagogues, declaring, “He is the Son of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_21","074_9_21","ACT","9","21","21","All who heard him were astounded and asked, “Isn’t this the man who wreaked havoc in Jerusalem on those who call on this name? And hasn’t he come here to take them as prisoners to the chief priests?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_22","074_9_22","ACT","9","22","22","But Saul was empowered all the more, and he confounded the Jews living in Damascus by proving that Jesus is the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_23","074_9_23","ACT","9","23","23","After many days had passed, the Jews conspired to kill him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_24","074_9_24","ACT","9","24","24","but Saul learned of their plot. Day and night they watched the city gates in order to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_25","074_9_25","ACT","9","25","25","One night, however, the disciples took him and lowered him in a basket through a window in the wall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_26","074_9_26","ACT","9","26","26","When Saul arrived in Jerusalem, he tried to join the disciples, but they were all afraid of him, not believing that he was a disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_27","074_9_27","ACT","9","27","27","Then Barnabas brought him to the apostles and described how Saul had seen the Lord, who had spoken to him on the road to Damascus, and how Saul had spoken boldly in that city in the name of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_28","074_9_28","ACT","9","28","28","So Saul stayed with them, moving about freely in Jerusalem and speaking boldly in the name of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_29","074_9_29","ACT","9","29","29","He talked and debated with the Grecian Jews, but they tried to kill him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_30","074_9_30","ACT","9","30","30","When the brothers learned of this, they took him down to Caesarea and sent him off to Tarsus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_31","074_9_31","ACT","9","31","31","Then the churches throughout Judea, Galilee, and Samaria experienced a time of peace. They grew in strength and numbers, living in the fear of the Lord and the encouragement of the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_32","074_9_32","ACT","9","32","32","As Peter traveled throughout the area, he went to visit the saints in Lydda. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_33","074_9_33","ACT","9","33","33","There he found a man named Aeneas who had been paralyzed and bedridden for eight years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_34","074_9_34","ACT","9","34","34","“Aeneas,” Peter said to him, “Jesus Christ heals you! Get up and put away your mat.” Immediately Aeneas got up, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_35","074_9_35","ACT","9","35","35","and all who lived in Lydda and Sharon saw him and turned to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_36","074_9_36","ACT","9","36","36","In Joppa there was a disciple named Tabitha (which is translated as Dorcas), who was always occupied with works of kindness and charity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_37","074_9_37","ACT","9","37","37","At that time, however, she became sick and died, and her body was washed and placed in an upper room. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_38","074_9_38","ACT","9","38","38","Since Lydda was near Joppa, the disciples, hearing that Peter was there, sent to urge him, “Come to them without delay.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_39","074_9_39","ACT","9","39","39","So Peter got up and went with them. On his arrival, they took him to the upper room. All the widows stood around him, weeping and showing him the tunics and other clothing that Dorcas had made while she was still with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_40","074_9_40","ACT","9","40","40","Then Peter sent them all out of the room. He knelt down and prayed, and turning toward her body, he said, “Tabitha, get up!” She opened her eyes, and seeing Peter, she sat up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_41","074_9_41","ACT","9","41","41","Peter took her by the hand and helped her up. Then he called the saints and widows and presented her to them alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_42","074_9_42","ACT","9","42","42","This became known all over Joppa, and many people believed in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC9_43","074_9_43","ACT","9","43","43","And Peter stayed for several days in Joppa with a tanner named Simon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_1","074_10_1","ACT","10","1","1","At Caesarea there was a man named Cornelius, a centurion in what was called the Italian Regiment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_2","074_10_2","ACT","10","2","2","He and all his household were devout and God-fearing. He gave generously to the people and prayed to God regularly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_3","074_10_3","ACT","10","3","3","One day at about the ninth hour, he had a clear vision of an angel of God who came to him and said, “Cornelius!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_4","074_10_4","ACT","10","4","4","Cornelius stared at him in fear and asked, “What is it, Lord?” The angel answered, “Your prayers and gifts to the poor have ascended as a memorial offering before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_5","074_10_5","ACT","10","5","5","Now send men to Joppa to call for Simon who is called Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_6","074_10_6","ACT","10","6","6","He is staying with Simon the tanner, whose house is by the sea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_7","074_10_7","ACT","10","7","7","When the angel who spoke to him had gone, Cornelius called two of his servants and a devout soldier from among his attendants. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_8","074_10_8","ACT","10","8","8","He explained what had happened and sent them to Joppa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_9","074_10_9","ACT","10","9","9","The next day at about the sixth hour, as the men were approaching the city on their journey, Peter went up on the roof to pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_10","074_10_10","ACT","10","10","10","He became hungry and wanted something to eat, but while the meal was being prepared, he fell into a trance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_11","074_10_11","ACT","10","11","11","He saw heaven open and something like a large sheet being let down to earth to him, bound at its four corners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_12","074_10_12","ACT","10","12","12","It contained all kinds of four-footed animals of the earth, wild beasts, and reptiles, as well as birds of the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_13","074_10_13","ACT","10","13","13","Then a voice said to him: “Get up, Peter, kill and eat!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_14","074_10_14","ACT","10","14","14","“No, Lord!” Peter answered. “I have never eaten anything impure or unclean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_15","074_10_15","ACT","10","15","15","The voice spoke to him a second time: “Do not call anything impure that God has made clean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_16","074_10_16","ACT","10","16","16","This happened three times, and again the sheet was taken back up into heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_17","074_10_17","ACT","10","17","17","While Peter was puzzling over the meaning of the vision, the men sent by Cornelius found Simon’s house and approached the gate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_18","074_10_18","ACT","10","18","18","They called out to ask if Simon called Peter was staying there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_19","074_10_19","ACT","10","19","19","As Peter continued to reflect on the vision, the Spirit said to him, “Behold, men are looking for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_20","074_10_20","ACT","10","20","20","So get up! Go downstairs and accompany them without hesitation, because I have sent them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_21","074_10_21","ACT","10","21","21","So Peter went down to the men and said, “Here am I, the one you are looking for. Why have you come?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_22","074_10_22","ACT","10","22","22","“Cornelius the centurion has sent us,” they said. “He is a righteous and God-fearing man with a good reputation among the whole Jewish nation. A holy angel instructed him to request your presence in his home so he could hear a message from you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_23","074_10_23","ACT","10","23","23","So Peter invited them in as his guests. And the next day he went with them, accompanied by some of the brothers from Joppa. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_24","074_10_24","ACT","10","24","24","The following day they arrived in Caesarea, where Cornelius was expecting them and had called together his relatives and close friends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_25","074_10_25","ACT","10","25","25","As Peter was about to enter, Cornelius met him and fell at his feet to worship him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_26","074_10_26","ACT","10","26","26","But Peter helped him up. “Stand up,” he said, “I am only a man myself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_27","074_10_27","ACT","10","27","27","As Peter talked with him, he went inside and found many people gathered together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_28","074_10_28","ACT","10","28","28","He said to them, “You know how unlawful it is for a Jew to associate with a foreigner or visit him. But God has shown me that I should not call any man impure or unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_29","074_10_29","ACT","10","29","29","So when I was invited, I came without objection. I ask, then, why have you sent for me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_30","074_10_30","ACT","10","30","30","Cornelius answered: “Four days ago I was in my house fasting and praying at this, the ninth hour. Suddenly a man in radiant clothing stood before me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_31","074_10_31","ACT","10","31","31","and said, ‘Cornelius, your prayer has been heard, and your gifts to the poor have been remembered before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_32","074_10_32","ACT","10","32","32","Therefore send to Joppa for Simon, who is called Peter. He is a guest in the home of Simon the tanner, by the sea. He will speak to you when he arrives.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_33","074_10_33","ACT","10","33","33","So I sent for you immediately, and you were kind enough to come. Now then, we are all here in the presence of God to listen to everything God has instructed you to tell us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_34","074_10_34","ACT","10","34","34","Then Peter began to speak: “I now truly understand that God does not show favoritism, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_35","074_10_35","ACT","10","35","35","but welcomes those from every nation who fear Him and do what is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_36","074_10_36","ACT","10","36","36","He has sent this message to the people of Israel, proclaiming the gospel of peace through Jesus Christ, who is Lord of all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_37","074_10_37","ACT","10","37","37","You yourselves know what has happened throughout Judea, beginning in Galilee with the baptism that John proclaimed: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_38","074_10_38","ACT","10","38","38","how God anointed Jesus of Nazareth with the Holy Spirit and with power, and how Jesus went around doing good and healing all who were oppressed by the devil, because God was with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_39","074_10_39","ACT","10","39","39","We are witnesses of all that He did, both in the land of the Jews and in Jerusalem. And although they put Him to death by hanging Him on a tree, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_40","074_10_40","ACT","10","40","40","God raised Him up on the third day and caused Him to be seen— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_41","074_10_41","ACT","10","41","41","not by all the people, but by the witnesses God had chosen beforehand, by us who ate and drank with Him after He rose from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_42","074_10_42","ACT","10","42","42","And He commanded us to preach to the people and to testify that He is the One appointed by God to judge the living and the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_43","074_10_43","ACT","10","43","43","All the prophets testify about Him that everyone who believes in Him receives forgiveness of sins through His name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_44","074_10_44","ACT","10","44","44","While Peter was still speaking these words, the Holy Spirit fell upon all who heard his message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_45","074_10_45","ACT","10","45","45","All the circumcised believers who had accompanied Peter were astounded that the gift of the Holy Spirit had been poured out even on the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_46","074_10_46","ACT","10","46","46","For they heard them speaking in tongues and exalting God. Then Peter said, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_47","074_10_47","ACT","10","47","47","“Can anyone withhold the water to baptize these people? They have received the Holy Spirit just as we have!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC10_48","074_10_48","ACT","10","48","48","So he ordered that they be baptized in the name of the Lord. Then they asked him to stay for a few days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_1","074_11_1","ACT","11","1","1","The apostles and brothers throughout Judea soon heard that the Gentiles also had received the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_2","074_11_2","ACT","11","2","2","So when Peter went up to Jerusalem, the circumcised believers took issue with him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_3","074_11_3","ACT","11","3","3","and said, “You visited uncircumcised men and ate with them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_4","074_11_4","ACT","11","4","4","But Peter began and explained to them the whole sequence of events: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_5","074_11_5","ACT","11","5","5","“I was in the city of Joppa praying, and in a trance I saw a vision of something like a large sheet being let down from heaven by its four corners, and it came right down to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_6","074_11_6","ACT","11","6","6","I looked at it closely and saw four-footed animals of the earth, wild beasts, reptiles, and birds of the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_7","074_11_7","ACT","11","7","7","Then I heard a voice saying to me, ‘Get up, Peter, kill and eat.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_8","074_11_8","ACT","11","8","8","‘No, Lord,’ I said, ‘for nothing impure or unclean has ever entered my mouth.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_9","074_11_9","ACT","11","9","9","But the voice spoke to me from heaven a second time, ‘Do not call anything impure that God has made clean.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_10","074_11_10","ACT","11","10","10","This happened three times, and everything was drawn back up into heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_11","074_11_11","ACT","11","11","11","Just then three men sent to me from Caesarea stopped at the house where I was staying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_12","074_11_12","ACT","11","12","12","The Spirit told me to accompany them without hesitation. These six brothers also went with me, and we entered the man’s home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_13","074_11_13","ACT","11","13","13","He told us how he had seen an angel standing in his house and saying, ‘Send men to Joppa for Simon who is called Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_14","074_11_14","ACT","11","14","14","He will convey to you a message by which you and all your household will be saved.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_15","074_11_15","ACT","11","15","15","As I began to speak, the Holy Spirit fell upon them, just as He had fallen upon us at the beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_16","074_11_16","ACT","11","16","16","Then I remembered the word of the Lord, how He said, ‘John baptized with water, but you will be baptized with the Holy Spirit.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_17","074_11_17","ACT","11","17","17","So if God gave them the same gift He gave us who believed in the Lord Jesus Christ, who was I to hinder the work of God?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_18","074_11_18","ACT","11","18","18","When they heard this, they had no further objections, and they glorified God, saying, “So then, God has granted even the Gentiles repentance unto life.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_19","074_11_19","ACT","11","19","19","Meanwhile those scattered by the persecution that began with Stephen traveled as far as Phoenicia, Cyprus, and Antioch, speaking the message only to Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_20","074_11_20","ACT","11","20","20","But some of them, men from Cyprus and Cyrene, went to Antioch and began speaking to the Greeks, proclaiming the good news about the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_21","074_11_21","ACT","11","21","21","The hand of the Lord was with them, and a great number of people believed and turned to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_22","074_11_22","ACT","11","22","22","When news of this reached the ears of the church in Jerusalem, they sent out Barnabas, that he should go to Antioch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_23","074_11_23","ACT","11","23","23","When he arrived and saw the grace of God, he rejoiced and encouraged them all to abide in the Lord with all their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_24","074_11_24","ACT","11","24","24","Barnabas was a good man, full of the Holy Spirit and faith, and a great number of people were brought to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_25","074_11_25","ACT","11","25","25","Then Barnabas went to Tarsus to look for Saul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_26","074_11_26","ACT","11","26","26","and when he found him, he brought him back to Antioch. So for a full year they met together with the church and taught large numbers of people. The disciples were first called Christians at Antioch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_27","074_11_27","ACT","11","27","27","In those days some prophets came down from Jerusalem to Antioch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_28","074_11_28","ACT","11","28","28","One of them named Agabus stood up and predicted through the Spirit that a great famine would sweep across the whole world. (This happened under Claudius Caesar.) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_29","074_11_29","ACT","11","29","29","So the disciples, each according to his ability, decided to send relief to the brothers living in Judea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC11_30","074_11_30","ACT","11","30","30","This they did, sending their gifts to the elders with Barnabas and Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_1","074_12_1","ACT","12","1","1","About that time, King Herod reached out to harm some who belonged to the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_2","074_12_2","ACT","12","2","2","He had James, the brother of John, put to death with the sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_3","074_12_3","ACT","12","3","3","And seeing that this pleased the Jews, Herod proceeded to seize Peter during the Feast of Unleavened Bread. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_4","074_12_4","ACT","12","4","4","He arrested him and put him in prison, handing him over to be guarded by four squads of four soldiers each. Herod intended to bring him out to the people after the Passover. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_5","074_12_5","ACT","12","5","5","So Peter was kept in prison, but the church was earnestly praying to God for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_6","074_12_6","ACT","12","6","6","On the night before Herod was to bring him to trial, Peter was sleeping between two soldiers, bound with two chains, with sentries standing guard at the entrance to the prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_7","074_12_7","ACT","12","7","7","Suddenly an angel of the Lord appeared and a light shone in the cell. He tapped Peter on the side and woke him up, saying, “Get up quickly.” And the chains fell off his wrists. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_8","074_12_8","ACT","12","8","8","“Get dressed and put on your sandals,” said the angel. Peter did so, and the angel told him, “Wrap your cloak around you and follow me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_9","074_12_9","ACT","12","9","9","So Peter followed him out, but he was unaware that what the angel was doing was real. He thought he was only seeing a vision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_10","074_12_10","ACT","12","10","10","They passed the first and second guards and came to the iron gate leading to the city, which opened for them by itself. When they had gone outside and walked the length of one block, the angel suddenly left him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_11","074_12_11","ACT","12","11","11","Then Peter came to himself and said, “Now I know for sure that the Lord has sent His angel and rescued me from Herod’s grasp and from everything the Jewish people were anticipating.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_12","074_12_12","ACT","12","12","12","And when he had realized this, he went to the house of Mary the mother of John, also called Mark, where many people had gathered together and were praying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_13","074_12_13","ACT","12","13","13","Peter knocked at the outer gate, and a servant girl named Rhoda came to answer it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_14","074_12_14","ACT","12","14","14","When she recognized Peter’s voice, she was so overjoyed that she forgot to open the gate, but ran inside and announced, “Peter is standing at the gate!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_15","074_12_15","ACT","12","15","15","“You are out of your mind,” they told her. But when she kept insisting it was so, they said, “It must be his angel.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_16","074_12_16","ACT","12","16","16","But Peter kept on knocking, and when they opened the door and saw him, they were astounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_17","074_12_17","ACT","12","17","17","Peter motioned with his hand for silence, and he described how the Lord had brought him out of the prison. “Send word to James and to the brothers,” he said, and he left for another place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_18","074_12_18","ACT","12","18","18","At daybreak there was no small commotion among the soldiers as to what had become of Peter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_19","074_12_19","ACT","12","19","19","After Herod had searched for him unsuccessfully, he examined the guards and ordered that they be executed. Then he went down from Judea to Caesarea and spent some time there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_20","074_12_20","ACT","12","20","20","Now Herod was in a furious dispute with the people of Tyre and Sidon, and they convened before him. Having secured the support of Blastus, the king’s chamberlain, they asked for peace, because their region depended on the king’s country for food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_21","074_12_21","ACT","12","21","21","On the appointed day, Herod donned his royal robes, sat on his throne, and addressed the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_22","074_12_22","ACT","12","22","22","And they began to shout, “This is the voice of a god, not a man!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_23","074_12_23","ACT","12","23","23","Immediately, because Herod did not give glory to God, an angel of the Lord struck him down, and he was eaten by worms and died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_24","074_12_24","ACT","12","24","24","But the word of God continued to spread and multiply. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC12_25","074_12_25","ACT","12","25","25","When Barnabas and Saul had fulfilled their mission to Jerusalem, they returned, bringing with them John, also called Mark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_1","074_13_1","ACT","13","1","1","Now in the church at Antioch there were certain prophets and teachers: Barnabas, Simeon called Niger, Lucius of Cyrene, Manaen (who had been brought up with Herod the tetrarch), and Saul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_2","074_13_2","ACT","13","2","2","While they were worshiping the Lord and fasting, the Holy Spirit said, “Set apart for Me Barnabas and Saul for the work to which I have called them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_3","074_13_3","ACT","13","3","3","And after they had fasted and prayed, they laid their hands on them and sent them off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_4","074_13_4","ACT","13","4","4","So Barnabas and Saul, sent forth by the Holy Spirit, went down to Seleucia and sailed from there to Cyprus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_5","074_13_5","ACT","13","5","5","When they arrived at Salamis, they proclaimed the word of God in the Jewish synagogues. And John was with them as their helper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_6","074_13_6","ACT","13","6","6","They traveled through the island as far as Paphos, where they found a Jewish sorcerer and false prophet named Bar-Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_7","074_13_7","ACT","13","7","7","an attendant of the proconsul, Sergius Paulus. The proconsul, a man of intelligence, summoned Barnabas and Saul because he wanted to hear the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_8","074_13_8","ACT","13","8","8","But Elymas the sorcerer (for that is what his name means) opposed them and tried to turn the proconsul from the faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_9","074_13_9","ACT","13","9","9","Then Saul, who was also called Paul, filled with the Holy Spirit, looked directly at Elymas ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_10","074_13_10","ACT","13","10","10","and said, “O child of the devil and enemy of all righteousness, you are full of all kinds of deceit and trickery! Will you never stop perverting the straight ways of the Lord? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_11","074_13_11","ACT","13","11","11","Now look, the hand of the Lord is against you, and for a time you will be blind and unable to see the light of the sun.” Immediately mist and darkness fell over him, and he groped about, seeking someone to lead him by the hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_12","074_13_12","ACT","13","12","12","When the proconsul saw what had happened, he believed, for he was astonished at the teaching about the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_13","074_13_13","ACT","13","13","13","After setting sail from Paphos, Paul and his companions came to Perga in Pamphylia, where John left them to return to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_14","074_13_14","ACT","13","14","14","And from Perga, they traveled inland to Pisidian Antioch, where they entered the synagogue on the Sabbath and sat down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_15","074_13_15","ACT","13","15","15","After the reading from the Law and the Prophets, the synagogue leaders sent word to them: “Brothers, if you have a word of encouragement for the people, please speak.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_16","074_13_16","ACT","13","16","16","Paul stood up, motioned with his hand, and began to speak: “Men of Israel and you Gentiles who fear God, listen to me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_17","074_13_17","ACT","13","17","17","The God of the people chose our fathers. He made them into a great people during their stay in Egypt, and with an uplifted arm He led them out of that land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_18","074_13_18","ACT","13","18","18","He endured their conduct for about forty years in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_19","074_13_19","ACT","13","19","19","And having vanquished seven nations in Canaan, He gave their land to His people as their inheritance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_20","074_13_20","ACT","13","20","20","All this took about 450 years. After this, God gave them judges until the time of Samuel the prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_21","074_13_21","ACT","13","21","21","Then the people asked for a king, and God gave them Saul son of Kish, from the tribe of Benjamin, who ruled forty years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_22","074_13_22","ACT","13","22","22","After removing Saul, He raised up David as their king and testified about him: ‘I have found David son of Jesse a man after My own heart; he will carry out My will in its entirety.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_23","074_13_23","ACT","13","23","23","From the descendants of this man, God has brought to Israel salvation, as He promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_24","074_13_24","ACT","13","24","24","Before the arrival of Jesus, John preached a baptism of repentance to Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_25","074_13_25","ACT","13","25","25","As John was completing his course, he said, ‘Who do you suppose I am? I am not that One. But there is One coming after me whose sandals I am not worthy to untie.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_26","074_13_26","ACT","13","26","26","Brothers, children of Abraham, and you Gentiles who fear God, it is to you that this message of salvation has been sent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_27","074_13_27","ACT","13","27","27","The people of Jerusalem and their rulers did not recognize Jesus, yet in condemning Him they fulfilled the words of the prophets that are read every Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_28","074_13_28","ACT","13","28","28","And though they found no ground for a death sentence, they asked Pilate to have Him executed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_29","074_13_29","ACT","13","29","29","When they had carried out all that was written about Him, they took Him down from the tree and laid Him in a tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_30","074_13_30","ACT","13","30","30","But God raised Him from the dead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_31","074_13_31","ACT","13","31","31","and for many days He was seen by those who had accompanied Him from Galilee to Jerusalem. They are His witnesses to our people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_32","074_13_32","ACT","13","32","32","And now we proclaim to you the good news: What God promised our fathers ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_33","074_13_33","ACT","13","33","33","He has fulfilled for us, their children, by raising up Jesus. As it is written in the second Psalm: ‘You are My Son; today I have become Your Father.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_34","074_13_34","ACT","13","34","34","In fact, God raised Him from the dead, never to see decay. As He has said: ‘I will give you the holy and sure blessings promised to David.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_35","074_13_35","ACT","13","35","35","So also, He says in another Psalm: ‘You will not let Your Holy One see decay.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_36","074_13_36","ACT","13","36","36","For when David had served God’s purpose in his own generation, he fell asleep. His body was buried with his fathers and saw decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_37","074_13_37","ACT","13","37","37","But the One whom God raised from the dead did not see decay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_38","074_13_38","ACT","13","38","38","Therefore let it be known to you, brothers, that through Jesus the forgiveness of sins is proclaimed to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_39","074_13_39","ACT","13","39","39","Through Him everyone who believes is justified from everything from which you could not be justified by the law of Moses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_40","074_13_40","ACT","13","40","40","Watch out, then, that what was spoken by the prophets does not happen to you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_41","074_13_41","ACT","13","41","41","‘Look, you scoffers, wonder and perish! For I am doing a work in your days that you would never believe, even if someone told you.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_42","074_13_42","ACT","13","42","42","As the Jews were leaving the synagogue, the Gentiles urged Paul and Barnabas to continue this message on the next Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_43","074_13_43","ACT","13","43","43","After the synagogue was dismissed, many of the Jews and devout converts to Judaism followed Paul and Barnabas, who spoke to them and urged them to continue in the grace of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_44","074_13_44","ACT","13","44","44","On the following Sabbath, nearly the whole city gathered to hear the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_45","074_13_45","ACT","13","45","45","But when the Jews saw the crowds, they were filled with jealousy, and they blasphemously opposed and contradicted what Paul was saying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_46","074_13_46","ACT","13","46","46","Then Paul and Barnabas answered them boldly: “It was necessary to speak the word of God to you first. But since you reject it and do not consider yourselves worthy of eternal life, we now turn to the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_47","074_13_47","ACT","13","47","47","For this is what the Lord has commanded us: ‘I have made you a light for the Gentiles, to bring salvation to the ends of the earth.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_48","074_13_48","ACT","13","48","48","When the Gentiles heard this, they rejoiced and glorified the word of the Lord, and all who were appointed for eternal life believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_49","074_13_49","ACT","13","49","49","And the word of the Lord spread throughout that region. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_50","074_13_50","ACT","13","50","50","The Jews, however, incited the religious women of prominence and the leading men of the city. They stirred up persecution against Paul and Barnabas and drove them out of their district. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_51","074_13_51","ACT","13","51","51","So they shook the dust off their feet in protest against them and went to Iconium. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC13_52","074_13_52","ACT","13","52","52","And the disciples were filled with joy and with the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_1","074_14_1","ACT","14","1","1","At Iconium, Paul and Barnabas went as usual into the Jewish synagogue, where they spoke so well that a great number of Jews and Greeks believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_2","074_14_2","ACT","14","2","2","But the unbelieving Jews stirred up the Gentiles and poisoned their minds against the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_3","074_14_3","ACT","14","3","3","So Paul and Barnabas spent considerable time there, speaking boldly for the Lord, who affirmed the message of His grace by enabling them to perform signs and wonders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_4","074_14_4","ACT","14","4","4","The people of the city were divided. Some sided with the Jews, and others with the apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_5","074_14_5","ACT","14","5","5","But when the Gentiles and Jews, together with their rulers, set out to mistreat and stone them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_6","074_14_6","ACT","14","6","6","they found out about it and fled to the Lycaonian cities of Lystra and Derbe and to the surrounding region, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_7","074_14_7","ACT","14","7","7","where they continued to preach the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_8","074_14_8","ACT","14","8","8","In Lystra there sat a man crippled in his feet, who was lame from birth and had never walked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_9","074_14_9","ACT","14","9","9","This man was listening to the words of Paul, who looked intently at him and saw that he had faith to be healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_10","074_14_10","ACT","14","10","10","In a loud voice Paul called out, “Stand up on your feet!” And the man jumped up and began to walk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_11","074_14_11","ACT","14","11","11","When the crowds saw what Paul had done, they lifted up their voices in the Lycaonian language: “The gods have come down to us in human form!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_12","074_14_12","ACT","14","12","12","Barnabas they called Zeus, and Paul they called Hermes, because he was the chief speaker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_13","074_14_13","ACT","14","13","13","The priest of Zeus, whose temple was just outside their city, brought bulls and wreaths to the city gates, hoping to offer a sacrifice along with the crowds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_14","074_14_14","ACT","14","14","14","But when the apostles Barnabas and Paul found out about this, they tore their clothes and rushed into the crowd, shouting, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_15","074_14_15","ACT","14","15","15","“Men, why are you doing this? We too are only men, human like you. We are bringing you good news that you should turn from these worthless things to the living God, who made heaven and earth and sea and everything in them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_16","074_14_16","ACT","14","16","16","In past generations, He let all nations go their own way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_17","074_14_17","ACT","14","17","17","Yet He has not left Himself without testimony to His goodness: He gives you rain from heaven and fruitful seasons, filling our hearts with food and gladness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_18","074_14_18","ACT","14","18","18","Even with these words, Paul and Barnabas could hardly stop the crowds from sacrificing to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_19","074_14_19","ACT","14","19","19","Then some Jews arrived from Antioch and Iconium and won over the crowds. They stoned Paul and dragged him outside the city, presuming he was dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_20","074_14_20","ACT","14","20","20","But after the disciples had gathered around him, he got up and went back into the city. And the next day he left with Barnabas for Derbe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_21","074_14_21","ACT","14","21","21","They preached the gospel to that city and made many disciples. Then they returned to Lystra, Iconium, and Antioch, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_22","074_14_22","ACT","14","22","22","strengthening the souls of the disciples and encouraging them to continue in the faith. “We must endure many hardships to enter the kingdom of God,” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_23","074_14_23","ACT","14","23","23","Paul and Barnabas appointed elders for them in each church, praying and fasting as they entrusted them to the Lord, in whom they had believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_24","074_14_24","ACT","14","24","24","After passing through Pisidia, they came to Pamphylia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_25","074_14_25","ACT","14","25","25","And when they had spoken the word in Perga, they went down to Attalia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_26","074_14_26","ACT","14","26","26","From Attalia they sailed to Antioch, where they had been commended to the grace of God for the work they had just completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_27","074_14_27","ACT","14","27","27","When they arrived, they gathered the church together and reported all that God had done through them, and how He had opened the door of faith to the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC14_28","074_14_28","ACT","14","28","28","And they spent a long time there with the disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_1","074_15_1","ACT","15","1","1","Then some men came down from Judea and were teaching the brothers, “Unless you are circumcised according to the custom of Moses, you cannot be saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_2","074_15_2","ACT","15","2","2","Therefore after engaging these men in sharp debate, Paul and Barnabas were appointed, along with some other believers, to go up to Jerusalem to see the apostles and elders about this question. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_3","074_15_3","ACT","15","3","3","Sent on their way by the church, they passed through Phoenicia and Samaria, recounting the conversion of the Gentiles and bringing great joy to all the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_4","074_15_4","ACT","15","4","4","On their arrival in Jerusalem, they were welcomed by the church and apostles and elders, to whom they reported all that God had done through them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_5","074_15_5","ACT","15","5","5","But some believers from the party of the Pharisees stood up and declared, “The Gentiles must be circumcised and required to obey the law of Moses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_6","074_15_6","ACT","15","6","6","So the apostles and elders met to look into this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_7","074_15_7","ACT","15","7","7","After much debate, Peter got up and said to them, “Brothers, you know that in the early days God made a choice among us that the Gentiles would hear from my lips the message of the gospel and believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_8","074_15_8","ACT","15","8","8","And God, who knows the heart, showed His approval by giving the Holy Spirit to them, just as He did to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_9","074_15_9","ACT","15","9","9","He made no distinction between us and them, for He cleansed their hearts by faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_10","074_15_10","ACT","15","10","10","Now then, why do you test God by placing on the necks of the disciples a yoke that neither we nor our fathers have been able to bear? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_11","074_15_11","ACT","15","11","11","On the contrary, we believe it is through the grace of the Lord Jesus that we are saved, just as they are.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_12","074_15_12","ACT","15","12","12","The whole assembly fell silent as they listened to Barnabas and Paul describing the signs and wonders God had done among the Gentiles through them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_13","074_15_13","ACT","15","13","13","When they had finished speaking, James declared, “Brothers, listen to me! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_14","074_15_14","ACT","15","14","14","Simon has told us how God first visited the Gentiles to take from them a people to be His own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_15","074_15_15","ACT","15","15","15","The words of the prophets agree with this, as it is written: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_16","074_15_16","ACT","15","16","16","‘After this I will return and rebuild the fallen tent of David. Its ruins I will rebuild, and I will restore it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_17","074_15_17","ACT","15","17","17","so that the remnant of men may seek the Lord, and all the Gentiles who are called by My name, says the Lord who does all these things.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_18","074_15_18","ACT","15","18","18","Known for ages to God are all His works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_19","074_15_19","ACT","15","19","19","It is my judgment, therefore, that we should not cause trouble for the Gentiles who are turning to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_20","074_15_20","ACT","15","20","20","Instead, we should write and tell them to abstain from food polluted by idols, from sexual immorality, from the meat of strangled animals, and from blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_21","074_15_21","ACT","15","21","21","For Moses has been proclaimed in every city from ancient times and is read in the synagogues on every Sabbath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_22","074_15_22","ACT","15","22","22","Then the apostles and elders, with the whole church, decided to select men from among them to send to Antioch with Paul and Barnabas. They chose Judas called Barsabbas and Silas, two leaders among the brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_23","074_15_23","ACT","15","23","23","and sent them with this letter: The apostles, elders, and brothers, To the brothers among the Gentiles in Antioch, Syria, and Cilicia: Greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_24","074_15_24","ACT","15","24","24","It has come to our attention that some went out from us without our authorization and unsettled you, troubling your minds by saying that you must be circumcised and keep the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_25","074_15_25","ACT","15","25","25","So we all agreed to send chosen men to you along with our beloved Barnabas and Paul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_26","074_15_26","ACT","15","26","26","men who have risked their lives for the name of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_27","074_15_27","ACT","15","27","27","Therefore we are sending Judas and Silas to tell you in person the same things we are writing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_28","074_15_28","ACT","15","28","28","It seemed good to the Holy Spirit and to us not to burden you with anything beyond these essential requirements: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_29","074_15_29","ACT","15","29","29","You must abstain from food sacrificed to idols, from blood, from the meat of strangled animals, and from sexual immorality. You will do well to avoid these things. Farewell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_30","074_15_30","ACT","15","30","30","So the men were sent off and went to Antioch, where they assembled the congregation and delivered the letter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_31","074_15_31","ACT","15","31","31","When the people read it, they rejoiced at its encouraging message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_32","074_15_32","ACT","15","32","32","Judas and Silas, who themselves were prophets, said much to encourage and strengthen the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_33","074_15_33","ACT","15","33","33","After spending some time there, they were sent off by the brothers in peace to return to the apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_35","074_15_35","ACT","15","35","35","But Paul and Barnabas remained at Antioch, along with many others, teaching and preaching the word of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_36","074_15_36","ACT","15","36","36","Some time later Paul said to Barnabas, “Let us go back and visit our brothers in every town where we proclaimed the word of the Lord, to see how they are doing.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_37","074_15_37","ACT","15","37","37","Barnabas wanted to take John called Mark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_38","074_15_38","ACT","15","38","38","But Paul thought it best not to take him, because he had deserted them in Pamphylia and had not accompanied them in the work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_39","074_15_39","ACT","15","39","39","Their disagreement was so sharp that they parted company. Barnabas took Mark and sailed for Cyprus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_40","074_15_40","ACT","15","40","40","but Paul chose Silas and left, commended by the brothers to the grace of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC15_41","074_15_41","ACT","15","41","41","And he traveled through Syria and Cilicia, strengthening the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_1","074_16_1","ACT","16","1","1","Paul came to Derbe and then to Lystra, where he found a disciple named Timothy, the son of a believing Jewish woman and a Greek father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_2","074_16_2","ACT","16","2","2","The brothers in Lystra and Iconium spoke well of him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_3","074_16_3","ACT","16","3","3","Paul wanted Timothy to accompany him, so he took him and circumcised him on account of the Jews in that area, for they all knew that his father was a Greek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_4","074_16_4","ACT","16","4","4","As they went from town to town, they delivered the decisions handed down by the apostles and elders in Jerusalem for the people to obey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_5","074_16_5","ACT","16","5","5","So the churches were strengthened in the faith and grew daily in numbers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_6","074_16_6","ACT","16","6","6","After the Holy Spirit had prevented them from speaking the word in the province of Asia, they traveled through the region of Phrygia and Galatia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_7","074_16_7","ACT","16","7","7","And when they came to the border of Mysia, they tried to enter Bithynia, but the Spirit would not permit them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_8","074_16_8","ACT","16","8","8","So they passed by Mysia and went down to Troas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_9","074_16_9","ACT","16","9","9","During the night, Paul had a vision of a man of Macedonia standing and pleading with him, “Come over to Macedonia and help us.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_10","074_16_10","ACT","16","10","10","As soon as Paul had seen the vision, we got ready to leave for Macedonia, concluding that the Lord had called us to preach the gospel to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_11","074_16_11","ACT","16","11","11","Therefore we sailed from Troas straight to Samothrace, and the following day on to Neapolis. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_12","074_16_12","ACT","16","12","12","From there we went to the Roman colony of Philippi, the leading city of that district of Macedonia. And we stayed there several days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_13","074_16_13","ACT","16","13","13","On the Sabbath we went outside the city along the river, where it was customary to find a place of prayer. After sitting down, we spoke to the women who had gathered there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_14","074_16_14","ACT","16","14","14","Among those listening was a woman named Lydia, a dealer in purple cloth from the city of Thyatira, who was a worshiper of God. The Lord opened her heart to respond to Paul’s message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_15","074_16_15","ACT","16","15","15","And when she and her household had been baptized, she urged us, “If you consider me a believer in the Lord, come and stay at my house.” And she persuaded us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_16","074_16_16","ACT","16","16","16","One day as we were going to the place of prayer, we were met by a slave girl with a spirit of divination, who earned a large income for her masters by fortune-telling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_17","074_16_17","ACT","16","17","17","This girl followed Paul and the rest of us, shouting, “These men are servants of the Most High God, who are proclaiming to us the way of salvation!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_18","074_16_18","ACT","16","18","18","She continued this for many days. Eventually Paul grew so aggravated that he turned and said to the spirit, “In the name of Jesus Christ I command you to come out of her!” And the spirit left her at that very moment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_19","074_16_19","ACT","16","19","19","When the girl’s owners saw that their hope of making money was gone, they seized Paul and Silas and dragged them before the authorities in the marketplace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_20","074_16_20","ACT","16","20","20","They brought them to the magistrates and said, “These men are Jews and are throwing our city into turmoil ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_21","074_16_21","ACT","16","21","21","by promoting customs that are unlawful for us Romans to adopt or practice.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_22","074_16_22","ACT","16","22","22","The crowd joined in the attack against Paul and Silas, and the magistrates ordered that they be stripped and beaten with rods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_23","074_16_23","ACT","16","23","23","And after striking them with many blows, they threw them into prison and ordered the jailer to guard them securely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_24","074_16_24","ACT","16","24","24","On receiving this order, he placed them in the inner cell and fastened their feet in the stocks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_25","074_16_25","ACT","16","25","25","About midnight Paul and Silas were praying and singing hymns to God, and the other prisoners were listening to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_26","074_16_26","ACT","16","26","26","Suddenly a strong earthquake shook the foundations of the prison. At once all the doors flew open and everyone’s chains came loose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_27","074_16_27","ACT","16","27","27","When the jailer woke up and saw the prison doors open, he drew his sword and was about to kill himself, presuming that the prisoners had escaped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_28","074_16_28","ACT","16","28","28","But Paul called out in a loud voice, “Do not harm yourself! We are all here!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_29","074_16_29","ACT","16","29","29","Calling for lights, the jailer rushed in and fell trembling before Paul and Silas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_30","074_16_30","ACT","16","30","30","Then he brought them out and asked, “Sirs, what must I do to be saved?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_31","074_16_31","ACT","16","31","31","They replied, “Believe in the Lord Jesus Christ and you will be saved, you and your household.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_32","074_16_32","ACT","16","32","32","Then Paul and Silas spoke the word of the Lord to him and to everyone in his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_33","074_16_33","ACT","16","33","33","At that hour of the night, the jailer took them and washed their wounds. And without delay, he and all his household were baptized. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_34","074_16_34","ACT","16","34","34","Then he brought them into his home and set a meal before them. So he and all his household rejoiced that they had come to believe in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_35","074_16_35","ACT","16","35","35","When daylight came, the magistrates sent their officers with the order: “Release those men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_36","074_16_36","ACT","16","36","36","The jailer informed Paul: “The magistrates have sent orders to release you. Now you may go on your way in peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_37","074_16_37","ACT","16","37","37","But Paul said to the officers, “They beat us publicly without a trial and threw us into prison, even though we are Roman citizens. And now do they want to send us away secretly? Absolutely not! Let them come themselves and escort us out!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_38","074_16_38","ACT","16","38","38","So the officers relayed this message to the magistrates, who were alarmed to hear that Paul and Silas were Roman citizens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_39","074_16_39","ACT","16","39","39","They came to appease them and led them out, requesting that they leave the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC16_40","074_16_40","ACT","16","40","40","After Paul and Silas came out of the prison, they went to Lydia’s house to see the brothers and encourage them. Then they left the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_1","074_17_1","ACT","17","1","1","When they had passed through Amphipolis and Apollonia, they came to Thessalonica, where there was a Jewish synagogue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_2","074_17_2","ACT","17","2","2","As was his custom, Paul went into the synagogue, and on three Sabbaths he reasoned with them from the Scriptures, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_3","074_17_3","ACT","17","3","3","explaining and proving that the Christ had to suffer and rise from the dead. “This Jesus I am proclaiming to you is the Christ,” he declared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_4","074_17_4","ACT","17","4","4","Some of the Jews were persuaded and joined Paul and Silas, along with a large number of God-fearing Greeks and quite a few leading women. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_5","074_17_5","ACT","17","5","5","The Jews, however, brought in some troublemakers they took from the marketplace, formed a mob, and sent the city into an uproar. They raided Jason’s house in search of Paul and Silas, hoping to bring them out to the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_6","074_17_6","ACT","17","6","6","But when they could not find them, they dragged Jason and some other brothers before the city officials, shouting, “These men who have turned the world upside down have now come here, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_7","074_17_7","ACT","17","7","7","and Jason has welcomed them into his home. They are all defying Caesar’s decrees, saying that there is another king, named Jesus!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_8","074_17_8","ACT","17","8","8","On hearing this, the crowd and city officials were greatly disturbed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_9","074_17_9","ACT","17","9","9","And they collected bond from Jason and the others and then released them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_10","074_17_10","ACT","17","10","10","As soon as night had fallen, the brothers sent Paul and Silas away to Berea. On arriving there, they went into the Jewish synagogue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_11","074_17_11","ACT","17","11","11","Now the Bereans were more noble-minded than the Thessalonians, for they received the message with great eagerness and examined the Scriptures every day to see if these teachings were true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_12","074_17_12","ACT","17","12","12","As a result, many of them believed, along with quite a few prominent Greek women and men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_13","074_17_13","ACT","17","13","13","But when the Jews from Thessalonica learned that Paul was also proclaiming the word of God in Berea, they went there themselves to incite the crowds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_14","074_17_14","ACT","17","14","14","The brothers immediately sent Paul away as if to the coast, but Silas and Timothy remained in Berea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_15","074_17_15","ACT","17","15","15","Those who escorted Paul brought him to Athens and then returned with instructions for Silas and Timothy to join him as soon as possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_16","074_17_16","ACT","17","16","16","While Paul was waiting for them in Athens, he was deeply disturbed in his spirit to see that the city was full of idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_17","074_17_17","ACT","17","17","17","So he reasoned in the synagogue with the Jews and God-fearing Gentiles, and in the marketplace with those he met each day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_18","074_17_18","ACT","17","18","18","Some Epicurean and Stoic philosophers also began to debate with him. Some of them asked, “What is this babbler trying to say?” Others said, “He seems to be advocating foreign gods.” They said this because Paul was proclaiming the good news of Jesus and the resurrection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_19","074_17_19","ACT","17","19","19","So they took Paul and brought him to the Areopagus, where they asked him, “May we know what this new teaching is that you are presenting? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_20","074_17_20","ACT","17","20","20","For you are bringing some strange notions to our ears, and we want to know what they mean.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_21","074_17_21","ACT","17","21","21","Now all the Athenians and foreigners who lived there spent their time doing nothing more than hearing and articulating new ideas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_22","074_17_22","ACT","17","22","22","Then Paul stood up in the meeting of the Areopagus and said, “Men of Athens, I see that in every way you are very religious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_23","074_17_23","ACT","17","23","23","For as I walked around and examined your objects of worship, I even found an altar with this inscription: TO AN UNKNOWN GOD. Therefore Him whom you worship as something unknown, I now proclaim to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_24","074_17_24","ACT","17","24","24","The God who made the world and everything in it is the Lord of heaven and earth and does not live in temples made by human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_25","074_17_25","ACT","17","25","25","Nor is He served by the hands of men, as if He needed anything, because He Himself gives everyone life and breath and everything else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_26","074_17_26","ACT","17","26","26","From one blood He made every nation of men, that they should inhabit the whole earth; and He determined their appointed times and the boundaries of their lands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_27","074_17_27","ACT","17","27","27","The Lord intended that they would seek Him and perhaps reach out for Him and find Him, though He is not far from each one of us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_28","074_17_28","ACT","17","28","28","‘For in Him we live and move and have our being.’ As some of your own poets have said, ‘We are His offspring.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_29","074_17_29","ACT","17","29","29","Therefore, being offspring of God, we should not think that the Divine Being is like gold or silver or stone, an image formed by man’s skill and imagination. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_30","074_17_30","ACT","17","30","30","Although God overlooked the ignorance of earlier times, He now commands all people everywhere to repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_31","074_17_31","ACT","17","31","31","For He has set a day when He will judge the world with justice by the Man He has appointed. He has given proof of this to everyone by raising Him from the dead.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_32","074_17_32","ACT","17","32","32","When they heard about the resurrection of the dead, some began to mock him, but others said, “We want to hear you again on this topic.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_33","074_17_33","ACT","17","33","33","At that, Paul left the Areopagus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC17_34","074_17_34","ACT","17","34","34","But some joined him and believed, including Dionysius the Areopagite, a woman named Damaris, and others who were with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_1","074_18_1","ACT","18","1","1","After this, Paul left Athens and went to Corinth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_2","074_18_2","ACT","18","2","2","There he found a Jew named Aquila, a native of Pontus, who had recently come from Italy with his wife Priscilla because Claudius had ordered all the Jews to leave Rome. Paul went to visit them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_3","074_18_3","ACT","18","3","3","and he stayed and worked with them because they were tentmakers by trade, just as he was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_4","074_18_4","ACT","18","4","4","Every Sabbath he reasoned in the synagogue, trying to persuade Jews and Greeks alike. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_5","074_18_5","ACT","18","5","5","And when Silas and Timothy came down from Macedonia, Paul was compelled by the Spirit, testifying to the Jews that Jesus is the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_6","074_18_6","ACT","18","6","6","But when they opposed and insulted him, he shook out his garments and told them, “Your blood be on your own heads! I am innocent of it. From now on I will go to the Gentiles.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_7","074_18_7","ACT","18","7","7","So Paul left the synagogue and went next door to the house of Justus, a worshiper of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_8","074_18_8","ACT","18","8","8","Crispus, the synagogue leader, and his whole household believed in the Lord. And many of the Corinthians who heard the message believed and were baptized. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_9","074_18_9","ACT","18","9","9","One night the Lord spoke to Paul in a vision: “Do not be afraid; keep on speaking; do not be silent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_10","074_18_10","ACT","18","10","10","For I am with you and no one will lay a hand on you, because I have many people in this city.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_11","074_18_11","ACT","18","11","11","So Paul stayed for a year and a half, teaching the word of God among the Corinthians. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_12","074_18_12","ACT","18","12","12","While Gallio was proconsul of Achaia, the Jews coordinated an attack on Paul and brought him before the judgment seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_13","074_18_13","ACT","18","13","13","“This man is persuading the people to worship God in ways contrary to the law,” they said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_14","074_18_14","ACT","18","14","14","But just as Paul was about to speak, Gallio told the Jews, “If this matter involved a wrongdoing or vicious crime, O Jews, it would be reasonable for me to hear your complaint. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_15","074_18_15","ACT","18","15","15","But since it is a dispute about words and names and your own law, settle it yourselves. For I refuse to be a judge of such things.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_16","074_18_16","ACT","18","16","16","And he drove them away from the judgment seat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_17","074_18_17","ACT","18","17","17","At this, all the Greeks seized Sosthenes the synagogue leader and beat him in front of the judgment seat. But none of this was of concern to Gallio. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_18","074_18_18","ACT","18","18","18","Paul remained in Corinth for quite some time before saying goodbye to the brothers. He had his head shaved in Cenchrea to keep a vow he had made, and then he sailed for Syria, accompanied by Priscilla and Aquila. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_19","074_18_19","ACT","18","19","19","When he reached Ephesus, Paul left Priscilla and Aquila. He himself went into the synagogue there and reasoned with the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_20","074_18_20","ACT","18","20","20","When they asked him to stay with them for a while longer, he declined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_21","074_18_21","ACT","18","21","21","But as he left, he said, “I must by all means keep this coming feast in Jerusalem, but I will come back to you if God is willing.” And he set sail from Ephesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_22","074_18_22","ACT","18","22","22","When Paul had landed at Caesarea, he went up and greeted the church at Jerusalem. Then he went down to Antioch. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_23","074_18_23","ACT","18","23","23","After Paul had spent some time in Antioch, he traveled from place to place throughout the region of Galatia and Phrygia, strengthening all the disciples. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_24","074_18_24","ACT","18","24","24","Meanwhile a Jew named Apollos, a native of Alexandria, came to Ephesus. He was an eloquent man, well versed in the Scriptures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_25","074_18_25","ACT","18","25","25","He had been instructed in the way of the Lord and was fervent in spirit. He spoke and taught accurately about the Lord, though he knew only the baptism of John. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_26","074_18_26","ACT","18","26","26","And he began to speak boldly in the synagogue. When Aquila and Priscilla heard him, they took him aside and explained to him the way of God more accurately. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_27","074_18_27","ACT","18","27","27","When Apollos resolved to cross over to Achaia, the brothers encouraged him and wrote to the disciples there to welcome him. On his arrival, he was a great help to those who by grace had believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC18_28","074_18_28","ACT","18","28","28","For he powerfully refuted the Jews in public debate, proving from the Scriptures that Jesus is the Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_1","074_19_1","ACT","19","1","1","While Apollos was at Corinth, Paul passed through the interior and came to Ephesus. There he found some disciples ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_2","074_19_2","ACT","19","2","2","and asked them, “Did you receive the Holy Spirit when you became believers?” “No,” they answered, “we have not even heard that there is a Holy Spirit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_3","074_19_3","ACT","19","3","3","“Into what, then, were you baptized?” Paul asked. “The baptism of John,” they replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_4","074_19_4","ACT","19","4","4","Paul explained: “John’s baptism was indeed a baptism of repentance. He told the people to believe in the One coming after him, that is, in Christ Jesus.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_5","074_19_5","ACT","19","5","5","On hearing this, they were baptized into the name of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_6","074_19_6","ACT","19","6","6","And when Paul laid his hands on them, the Holy Spirit came upon them, and they spoke in tongues and prophesied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_7","074_19_7","ACT","19","7","7","There were about twelve men in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_8","074_19_8","ACT","19","8","8","Then Paul went into the synagogue and spoke boldly there for three months, arguing persuasively about the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_9","074_19_9","ACT","19","9","9","But when some of them stubbornly refused to believe and publicly maligned the Way, Paul took his disciples and left the synagogue to conduct daily discussions in the lecture hall of a man named Tyrannus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_10","074_19_10","ACT","19","10","10","This continued for two years, so that everyone who lived in the province of Asia, Jews and Greeks alike, heard the word of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_11","074_19_11","ACT","19","11","11","God did extraordinary miracles through the hands of Paul, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_12","074_19_12","ACT","19","12","12","so that even handkerchiefs and aprons that had touched him were brought to the sick, and the diseases and evil spirits left them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_13","074_19_13","ACT","19","13","13","Now there were some itinerant Jewish exorcists who tried to invoke the name of the Lord Jesus over those with evil spirits. They would say, “I command you by Jesus, whom Paul proclaims.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_14","074_19_14","ACT","19","14","14","Seven sons of Sceva, a Jewish chief priest, were doing this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_15","074_19_15","ACT","19","15","15","But one day the evil spirit responded, “Jesus I know, and I know about Paul, but who are you?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_16","074_19_16","ACT","19","16","16","Then the man with the evil spirit jumped on them and overpowered them. The attack was so violent that they ran out of the house naked and wounded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_17","074_19_17","ACT","19","17","17","This became known to all the Jews and Greeks living in Ephesus, and fear came over all of them. So the name of the Lord Jesus was held in high honor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_18","074_19_18","ACT","19","18","18","Many who had believed now came forward, confessing and disclosing their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_19","074_19_19","ACT","19","19","19","And a number of those who had practiced magic arts brought their books and burned them in front of everyone. When the value of the books was calculated, the total came to fifty thousand drachmas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_20","074_19_20","ACT","19","20","20","So the word of the Lord powerfully continued to spread and prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_21","074_19_21","ACT","19","21","21","After these things had happened, Paul resolved in the Spirit to go to Jerusalem, passing through Macedonia and Achaia. “After I have been there,” he said, “I must see Rome as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_22","074_19_22","ACT","19","22","22","He sent two of his helpers, Timothy and Erastus, to Macedonia, while he stayed for a time in the province of Asia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_23","074_19_23","ACT","19","23","23","About that time there arose a great disturbance about the Way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_24","074_19_24","ACT","19","24","24","It began with a silversmith named Demetrius who made silver shrines of Artemis, bringing much business to the craftsmen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_25","074_19_25","ACT","19","25","25","Demetrius assembled the craftsmen, along with the workmen in related trades. “Men,” he said, “you know that this business is our source of prosperity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_26","074_19_26","ACT","19","26","26","And you can see and hear that not only in Ephesus, but in nearly the whole province of Asia, this Paul has persuaded a great number of people to turn away. He says that man-made gods are no gods at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_27","074_19_27","ACT","19","27","27","There is danger not only that our business will fall into disrepute, but also that the temple of the great goddess Artemis will be discredited and her majesty deposed—she who is worshiped by all the province of Asia and the whole world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_28","074_19_28","ACT","19","28","28","When the men heard this, they were enraged and began shouting, “Great is Artemis of the Ephesians!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_29","074_19_29","ACT","19","29","29","Soon the whole city was in disarray. They rushed together into the theatre, dragging with them Gaius and Aristarchus, Paul’s traveling companions from Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_30","074_19_30","ACT","19","30","30","Paul wanted to go before the assembly, but the disciples would not allow him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_31","074_19_31","ACT","19","31","31","Even some of Paul’s friends who were officials of the province of Asia sent word to him, begging him not to venture into the theatre. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_32","074_19_32","ACT","19","32","32","Meanwhile the assembly was in turmoil. Some were shouting one thing and some another, and most of them did not even know why they were there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_33","074_19_33","ACT","19","33","33","The Jews in the crowd pushed Alexander forward, and he motioned for silence so he could make his defense to the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_34","074_19_34","ACT","19","34","34","But when they realized that he was a Jew, they all shouted in unison for about two hours: “Great is Artemis of the Ephesians!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_35","074_19_35","ACT","19","35","35","Finally the city clerk quieted the crowd and declared, “Men of Ephesus, doesn’t everyone know that the city of Ephesus is guardian of the temple of the great goddess Artemis and of her image, which fell from heaven? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_36","074_19_36","ACT","19","36","36","Since these things are undeniable, you ought to be calm and not do anything rash. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_37","074_19_37","ACT","19","37","37","For you have brought these men here, though they have neither robbed our temple nor blasphemed your goddess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_38","074_19_38","ACT","19","38","38","So if Demetrius and his fellow craftsmen have a complaint against anyone, the courts are open and proconsuls are available. Let them bring charges against one another there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_39","074_19_39","ACT","19","39","39","But if you are seeking anything concerning other matters, it must be settled in a legal assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_40","074_19_40","ACT","19","40","40","For we are in jeopardy of being charged with rioting for today’s events, and we have no justification to account for this commotion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC19_41","074_19_41","ACT","19","41","41","After he had said this, he dismissed the assembly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_1","074_20_1","ACT","20","1","1","When the uproar had ended, Paul sent for the disciples. And he said goodbye to them and left for Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_2","074_20_2","ACT","20","2","2","After traveling through that area and speaking many words of encouragement, he arrived in Greece, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_3","074_20_3","ACT","20","3","3","where he stayed three months. And when the Jews formed a plot against him as he was about to sail for Syria, he decided to go back through Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_4","074_20_4","ACT","20","4","4","Paul was accompanied into the province of Asia by Sopater from Berea, Aristarchus and Secundus from Thessalonica, Gaius from Derbe, Timothy, and Tychicus and Trophimus from the province of Asia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_5","074_20_5","ACT","20","5","5","These men went on ahead and waited for us in Troas. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_6","074_20_6","ACT","20","6","6","And after the Feast of Unleavened Bread, we sailed from Philippi, and five days later we rejoined them in Troas, where we stayed seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_7","074_20_7","ACT","20","7","7","On the first day of the week, the disciples came together to break bread. Since Paul was ready to leave the next day, he talked to them and kept on speaking until midnight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_8","074_20_8","ACT","20","8","8","Now there were many lamps in the upper room where we were gathered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_9","074_20_9","ACT","20","9","9","And a certain young man named Eutychus, seated in the window, was sinking into a deep sleep as Paul talked on and on. When he was sound asleep, he fell from the third story and was picked up dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_10","074_20_10","ACT","20","10","10","But Paul went down, threw himself on the young man, and embraced him. “Do not be alarmed!” he said. “He is still alive!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_11","074_20_11","ACT","20","11","11","Then Paul went back upstairs, broke bread, and ate. And after speaking until daybreak, he departed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_12","074_20_12","ACT","20","12","12","And the people were greatly relieved to take the boy home alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_13","074_20_13","ACT","20","13","13","We went to the ship and sailed to Assos, where we were to take Paul aboard. He had arranged this because he was going there on foot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_14","074_20_14","ACT","20","14","14","And when he met us at Assos, we took him aboard and went on to Mitylene. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_15","074_20_15","ACT","20","15","15","Sailing on from there, we arrived the next day opposite Chios. The day after that we arrived at Samos. And after remaining at Trogyllium, on the following day we came to Miletus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_16","074_20_16","ACT","20","16","16","Paul had decided to sail past Ephesus to avoid spending time in the province of Asia, because he was in a hurry to reach Jerusalem, if possible, by the day of Pentecost. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_17","074_20_17","ACT","20","17","17","From Miletus, Paul sent to Ephesus for the elders of the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_18","074_20_18","ACT","20","18","18","When they came to him, he said, “You know how I lived the whole time I was with you, from the first day I arrived in the province of Asia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_19","074_20_19","ACT","20","19","19","I served the Lord with great humility and with many tears, especially in the trials that came upon me through the plots of the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_20","074_20_20","ACT","20","20","20","I did not shrink back from declaring anything that was helpful to you as I taught you publicly and from house to house, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_21","074_20_21","ACT","20","21","21","testifying to Jews and Greeks alike about repentance to God and faith in our Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_22","074_20_22","ACT","20","22","22","And now, compelled by the Spirit, I am going to Jerusalem, not knowing what will happen to me there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_23","074_20_23","ACT","20","23","23","I only know that in town after town the Holy Spirit warns that chains and afflictions await me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_24","074_20_24","ACT","20","24","24","But I consider my life of no value to me, if only I may finish my course with joy and complete the ministry I have received from the Lord Jesus—the ministry of testifying to the good news of God’s grace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_25","074_20_25","ACT","20","25","25","Now I know that none of you among whom I have preached the kingdom of God will see my face again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_26","074_20_26","ACT","20","26","26","Therefore I testify to you this day that I am innocent of the blood of all men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_27","074_20_27","ACT","20","27","27","For I did not shrink back from declaring to you the whole will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_28","074_20_28","ACT","20","28","28","Therefore keep watch over yourselves and the entire flock of which the Holy Spirit has made you overseers. Be shepherds of the church of the Lord and of God, which He purchased with His own blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_29","074_20_29","ACT","20","29","29","For I know this, that after my departure, savage wolves will come in among you and will not spare the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_30","074_20_30","ACT","20","30","30","Even from your own number, men will rise up and distort the truth to draw away disciples after them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_31","074_20_31","ACT","20","31","31","Therefore be alert and remember that for three years I never stopped warning each of you night and day with tears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_32","074_20_32","ACT","20","32","32","And now I commit you, brothers, to God and to the word of His grace, which can build you up and give you an inheritance among all who are sanctified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_33","074_20_33","ACT","20","33","33","I have not coveted anyone’s silver or gold or clothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_34","074_20_34","ACT","20","34","34","You yourselves know that these hands of mine have ministered to my own needs and those of my companions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_35","074_20_35","ACT","20","35","35","In everything, I showed you that by this kind of hard work we must help the weak, remembering the words of the Lord Jesus Himself: ‘It is more blessed to give than to receive.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_36","074_20_36","ACT","20","36","36","When Paul had said this, he knelt down with all of them and prayed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_37","074_20_37","ACT","20","37","37","They all wept openly as they embraced Paul and kissed him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC20_38","074_20_38","ACT","20","38","38","They were especially grieved by his statement that they would never see his face again. Then they accompanied him to the ship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_1","074_21_1","ACT","21","1","1","After we had torn ourselves away from them, we sailed directly to Cos, and the next day on to Rhodes, and from there to Patara. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_2","074_21_2","ACT","21","2","2","Finding a ship crossing over to Phoenicia, we boarded it and set sail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_3","074_21_3","ACT","21","3","3","After sighting Cyprus and passing south of it, we sailed on to Syria and landed at Tyre, where the ship was to unload its cargo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_4","074_21_4","ACT","21","4","4","We sought out disciples in Tyre and stayed with them seven days. Through the Spirit they kept telling Paul not to go up to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_5","074_21_5","ACT","21","5","5","But when our time there had ended, we set out on our journey. All the disciples, with their wives and children, accompanied us out of the city and knelt down on the beach to pray with us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_6","074_21_6","ACT","21","6","6","And after we had said our farewells, we went aboard the ship, and they returned home. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_7","074_21_7","ACT","21","7","7","When we had finished our voyage from Tyre, we landed at Ptolemais, where we greeted the brothers and stayed with them for a day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_8","074_21_8","ACT","21","8","8","Leaving the next day, Paul and his companions went on to Caesarea and stayed at the home of Philip the evangelist, who was one of the Seven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_9","074_21_9","ACT","21","9","9","He had four unmarried daughters who prophesied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_10","074_21_10","ACT","21","10","10","After we had been there several days, a prophet named Agabus came down from Judea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_11","074_21_11","ACT","21","11","11","Coming over to us, he took Paul’s belt, bound his own feet and hands, and said, “The Holy Spirit says: ‘In this way the Jews of Jerusalem will bind the owner of this belt and hand him over to the Gentiles.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_12","074_21_12","ACT","21","12","12","When we heard this, we and the people there pleaded with Paul not to go up to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_13","074_21_13","ACT","21","13","13","Then Paul answered, “Why are you weeping and breaking my heart? I am ready not only to be bound, but also to die in Jerusalem for the name of the Lord Jesus.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_14","074_21_14","ACT","21","14","14","When he would not be dissuaded, we quieted down and said, “The Lord’s will be done.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_15","074_21_15","ACT","21","15","15","After these days, we packed up and went on to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_16","074_21_16","ACT","21","16","16","Some of the disciples from Caesarea accompanied us, and they took us to stay at the home of Mnason the Cypriot, an early disciple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_17","074_21_17","ACT","21","17","17","When we arrived in Jerusalem, the brothers welcomed us joyfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_18","074_21_18","ACT","21","18","18","The next day Paul went in with us to see James, and all the elders were present. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_19","074_21_19","ACT","21","19","19","Paul greeted them and recounted one by one the things that God had done among the Gentiles through his ministry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_20","074_21_20","ACT","21","20","20","When they heard this, they glorified the Lord. Then they said to Paul, “You see, brother, how many thousands of Jews have believed, and all of them are zealous for the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_21","074_21_21","ACT","21","21","21","But they are under the impression that you teach all the Jews who live among the Gentiles to forsake Moses, telling them not to circumcise their children or observe our customs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_22","074_21_22","ACT","21","22","22","What then should we do? Certainly a multitude will gather, for they will hear that you have come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_23","074_21_23","ACT","21","23","23","Therefore do what we advise you. There are four men with us who have taken a vow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_24","074_21_24","ACT","21","24","24","Take these men, purify yourself along with them, and pay their expenses so they can have their heads shaved. Then everyone will know that there is no truth to these rumors about you, but that you also live in obedience to the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_25","074_21_25","ACT","21","25","25","As for the Gentile believers, we have written to them our decision that they should observe no such thing, except that they must abstain from food sacrificed to idols, from blood, from the meat of strangled animals, and from sexual immorality.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_26","074_21_26","ACT","21","26","26","So the next day Paul took the men and purified himself along with them. Then he entered the temple to give notice of the date when their purification would be complete and the offering would be made for each of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_27","074_21_27","ACT","21","27","27","When the seven days were almost over, some Jews from the province of Asia saw Paul at the temple. They stirred up the whole crowd and seized him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_28","074_21_28","ACT","21","28","28","crying out, “Men of Israel, help us! This is the man who teaches everyone everywhere against our people and against our law and against this place. Furthermore, he has brought Greeks into the temple and defiled this holy place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_29","074_21_29","ACT","21","29","29","For they had seen Trophimus the Ephesian with him in the city, and they assumed that Paul had brought him into the temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_30","074_21_30","ACT","21","30","30","The whole city was stirred up, and the people rushed together. They seized Paul and dragged him out of the temple, and at once the gates were shut. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_31","074_21_31","ACT","21","31","31","While they were trying to kill him, the commander of the Roman regiment received a report that all Jerusalem was in turmoil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_32","074_21_32","ACT","21","32","32","Immediately he took some soldiers and centurions and ran down to the crowd. When the people saw the commander and the soldiers, they stopped beating Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_33","074_21_33","ACT","21","33","33","The commander came up and arrested Paul, ordering that he be bound with two chains. Then he asked who he was and what he had done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_34","074_21_34","ACT","21","34","34","Some in the crowd were crying out one thing, and some another. And since the commander could not get at the truth because of the uproar, he ordered that Paul be brought into the barracks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_35","074_21_35","ACT","21","35","35","When Paul reached the steps, he had to be carried by the soldiers because of the violence of the mob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_36","074_21_36","ACT","21","36","36","For the crowd that followed him kept shouting, “Away with him!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_37","074_21_37","ACT","21","37","37","As they were about to take Paul into the barracks, he asked the commander, “May I speak to you?” “Do you speak Greek?” he replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_38","074_21_38","ACT","21","38","38","“Aren’t you the Egyptian who incited a rebellion some time ago and led four thousand members of the Assassins into the wilderness?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_39","074_21_39","ACT","21","39","39","But Paul answered, “I am a Jew from Tarsus in Cilicia, a citizen of no ordinary city. Now I beg you to allow me to speak to the people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC21_40","074_21_40","ACT","21","40","40","Having received permission, Paul stood on the steps and motioned to the crowd. A great hush came over the crowd, and he addressed them in Hebrew: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_1","074_22_1","ACT","22","1","1","“Brothers and fathers, listen now to my defense before you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_2","074_22_2","ACT","22","2","2","When they heard him speak to them in Hebrew, they became even more silent. Then Paul declared, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_3","074_22_3","ACT","22","3","3","“I am indeed a Jew, born in Tarsus of Cilicia, but raised in this city. I was educated at the feet of Gamaliel in strict conformity to the law of our fathers. I was just as zealous for God as any of you are today. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_4","074_22_4","ACT","22","4","4","I persecuted this Way even to the death, detaining both men and women and throwing them into prison, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_5","074_22_5","ACT","22","5","5","as the high priest and the whole Council can testify about me. I even obtained letters from them to their brothers in Damascus, and I was on my way to apprehend these people and bring them to Jerusalem to be punished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_6","074_22_6","ACT","22","6","6","About noon as I was approaching Damascus, suddenly a bright light from heaven flashed around me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_7","074_22_7","ACT","22","7","7","I fell to the ground and heard a voice say to me, ‘Saul, Saul, why do you persecute Me?’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_8","074_22_8","ACT","22","8","8","‘Who are You, Lord?’ I asked. ‘I am Jesus of Nazareth, whom you are persecuting,’ He replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_9","074_22_9","ACT","22","9","9","My companions saw the light and were terrified, but they could not understand the voice of the One speaking to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_10","074_22_10","ACT","22","10","10","Then I asked, ‘What should I do, Lord?’ ‘Get up and go into Damascus,’ He told me. ‘There you will be told all that you have been appointed to do.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_11","074_22_11","ACT","22","11","11","Because the brilliance of the light had blinded me, my companions led me by the hand into Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_12","074_22_12","ACT","22","12","12","There a man named Ananias, a devout observer of the law who was highly regarded by all the Jews living there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_13","074_22_13","ACT","22","13","13","came and stood beside me. ‘Brother Saul,’ he said, ‘receive your sight.’ And at that moment I could see him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_14","074_22_14","ACT","22","14","14","Then he said, ‘The God of our fathers has appointed you to know His will and to see the Righteous One and to hear His voice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_15","074_22_15","ACT","22","15","15","You will be His witness to everyone of what you have seen and heard. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_16","074_22_16","ACT","22","16","16","And now what are you waiting for? Get up, be baptized, and wash your sins away, calling on the name of the Lord.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_17","074_22_17","ACT","22","17","17","Later, when I had returned to Jerusalem and was praying at the temple, I fell into a trance ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_18","074_22_18","ACT","22","18","18","and saw the Lord saying to me, ‘Hurry! Leave Jerusalem quickly, because the people here will not accept your testimony about Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_19","074_22_19","ACT","22","19","19","‘Lord,’ I answered, ‘they know very well that in one synagogue after another I imprisoned and beat those who believed in You. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_20","074_22_20","ACT","22","20","20","And when the blood of Your witness Stephen was shed, I stood there giving my approval to his death and watching over the garments of those who killed him.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_21","074_22_21","ACT","22","21","21","Then He said to me, ‘Go! I will send you far away to the Gentiles.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_22","074_22_22","ACT","22","22","22","The crowd listened to Paul until he made this statement. Then they lifted up their voices and shouted, “Rid the earth of him! He is not fit to live!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_23","074_22_23","ACT","22","23","23","As they were crying out and throwing off their cloaks and tossing dust into the air, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_24","074_22_24","ACT","22","24","24","the commander ordered that Paul be brought into the barracks. He directed that Paul be flogged and interrogated to determine the reason for this outcry against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_25","074_22_25","ACT","22","25","25","But as he stretched him out to strap him down, Paul said to the centurion standing there, “Is it lawful for you to flog a Roman citizen without a trial?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_26","074_22_26","ACT","22","26","26","On hearing this, the centurion went and reported it to the commander. “Consider what you are about to do,” he said. “This man is a Roman citizen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_27","074_22_27","ACT","22","27","27","The commander went to Paul and asked, “Tell me, are you a Roman citizen?” “Yes,” he answered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_28","074_22_28","ACT","22","28","28","“I paid a high price for my citizenship,” said the commander. “But I was born a citizen,” Paul replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_29","074_22_29","ACT","22","29","29","At once those who were about to interrogate Paul stepped back, and the commander himself was alarmed when he realized that he had put a Roman citizen in chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC22_30","074_22_30","ACT","22","30","30","The next day the commander, wanting to learn the real reason Paul was accused by the Jews, released him from the bonds and ordered the chief priests and their whole Sanhedrin to assemble. Then he brought Paul down and had him stand before them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_1","074_23_1","ACT","23","1","1","Paul looked directly at the Sanhedrin and said, “Brothers, I have conducted myself before God in all good conscience to this day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_2","074_23_2","ACT","23","2","2","At this, the high priest Ananias ordered those standing near Paul to strike him on the mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_3","074_23_3","ACT","23","3","3","Then Paul said to him, “God will strike you, you whitewashed wall! You sit here to judge me according to the law, yet you yourself violate the law by commanding that I be struck.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_4","074_23_4","ACT","23","4","4","But those standing nearby said, “How dare you insult the high priest of God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_5","074_23_5","ACT","23","5","5","“Brothers,” Paul replied, “I was not aware that he was the high priest, for it is written: ‘Do not speak evil about the ruler of your people.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_6","074_23_6","ACT","23","6","6","Then Paul, knowing that some of them were Sadducees and others Pharisees, called out in the Sanhedrin, “Brothers, I am a Pharisee, the son of a Pharisee. It is because of my hope in the resurrection of the dead that I am on trial.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_7","074_23_7","ACT","23","7","7","As soon as he had said this, a dispute broke out between the Pharisees and Sadducees, and the assembly was divided. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_8","074_23_8","ACT","23","8","8","For the Sadducees say that there is neither a resurrection nor angels nor spirits, but the Pharisees acknowledge them all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_9","074_23_9","ACT","23","9","9","A great clamor arose, and some scribes from the party of the Pharisees got up and contended sharply, “We find nothing wrong with this man. If a spirit or an angel has spoken to him, let us not fight against God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_10","074_23_10","ACT","23","10","10","The dispute grew so violent that the commander was afraid they would tear Paul to pieces. He ordered the soldiers to go down and remove him by force and bring him into the barracks. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_11","074_23_11","ACT","23","11","11","The following night the Lord stood near Paul and said, “Take courage, Paul! As you have testified about Me in Jerusalem, so also you must testify in Rome.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_12","074_23_12","ACT","23","12","12","When daylight came, some of the Jews formed a conspiracy and bound themselves with an oath not to eat or drink until they had killed Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_13","074_23_13","ACT","23","13","13","More than forty of them were involved in this plot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_14","074_23_14","ACT","23","14","14","They went to the chief priests and elders and said, “We have bound ourselves with a solemn oath not to eat anything until we have killed Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_15","074_23_15","ACT","23","15","15","Now then, you and the Sanhedrin petition the commander to bring him down to you tomorrow on the pretext of examining his case more carefully. We are ready to kill him on the way.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_16","074_23_16","ACT","23","16","16","But when the son of Paul’s sister heard about the plot, he went into the barracks and told Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_17","074_23_17","ACT","23","17","17","Then Paul called one of the centurions and said, “Take this young man to the commander; he has something to tell him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_18","074_23_18","ACT","23","18","18","So the centurion took him to the commander and said, “Paul the prisoner sent and asked me to bring this young man to you. He has something to tell you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_19","074_23_19","ACT","23","19","19","The commander took the young man by the hand, drew him aside, and asked, “What do you need to tell me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_20","074_23_20","ACT","23","20","20","He answered, “The Jews have agreed to ask you to bring Paul to the Sanhedrin tomorrow on the pretext of acquiring more information about him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_21","074_23_21","ACT","23","21","21","Do not let them persuade you, because more than forty men are waiting to ambush him. They have bound themselves with an oath not to eat or drink until they have killed him; they are ready now, awaiting your consent.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_22","074_23_22","ACT","23","22","22","So the commander dismissed the young man and instructed him, “Do not tell anyone that you have reported this to me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_23","074_23_23","ACT","23","23","23","Then he called two of his centurions and said, “Prepare two hundred soldiers, seventy horsemen, and two hundred spearmen to go to Caesarea in the third hour of the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_24","074_23_24","ACT","23","24","24","Provide mounts for Paul to take him safely to Governor Felix.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_25","074_23_25","ACT","23","25","25","And he wrote the following letter: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_26","074_23_26","ACT","23","26","26","Claudius Lysias, To His Excellency, Governor Felix: Greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_27","074_23_27","ACT","23","27","27","This man was seized by the Jews, and they were about to kill him when I came with my troops to rescue him. For I had learned that he is a Roman citizen, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_28","074_23_28","ACT","23","28","28","and since I wanted to know their charges against him, I brought him down to their Sanhedrin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_29","074_23_29","ACT","23","29","29","I found that the accusation involved questions about their own law, but there was no charge worthy of death or imprisonment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_30","074_23_30","ACT","23","30","30","When I was informed that there was a plot by the Jews against the man, I sent him to you at once. I also instructed his accusers to present their case against him before you. Farewell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_31","074_23_31","ACT","23","31","31","So the soldiers followed their orders and brought Paul by night to Antipatris. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_32","074_23_32","ACT","23","32","32","The next day they returned to the barracks and let the horsemen go on with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_33","074_23_33","ACT","23","33","33","When the horsemen arrived in Caesarea, they delivered the letter to the governor and presented Paul to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_34","074_23_34","ACT","23","34","34","The governor read the letter and asked what province Paul was from. Learning that he was from Cilicia, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC23_35","074_23_35","ACT","23","35","35","he said, “I will hear your case when your accusers arrive.” Then he ordered that Paul be kept under guard in Herod’s Praetorium. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_1","074_24_1","ACT","24","1","1","Five days later the high priest Ananias came down with the elders and a lawyer named Tertullus, who presented to the governor their case against Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_2","074_24_2","ACT","24","2","2","When Paul had been called in, Tertullus opened the prosecution: “Because of you, we have enjoyed a lasting peace, and your foresight has brought worthy reforms to this nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_3","074_24_3","ACT","24","3","3","In every way and everywhere, most excellent Felix, we acknowledge this with all gratitude. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_4","074_24_4","ACT","24","4","4","But in order not to delay you any further, I beg your indulgence to hear us briefly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_5","074_24_5","ACT","24","5","5","We have found this man to be a pestilence, stirring up dissension among the Jews all over the world. He is a ringleader of the sect of the Nazarenes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_6","074_24_6","ACT","24","6","6","and he even tried to desecrate the temple; so we seized him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_8","074_24_8","ACT","24","8","8","By examining him yourself, you will be able to learn the truth about all our charges against him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_9","074_24_9","ACT","24","9","9","The Jews concurred, asserting that these charges were true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_10","074_24_10","ACT","24","10","10","When the governor motioned for Paul to speak, he began his response: “Knowing that you have been a judge over this nation for many years, I gladly make my defense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_11","074_24_11","ACT","24","11","11","You can verify for yourself that no more than twelve days ago I went up to worship in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_12","074_24_12","ACT","24","12","12","Yet my accusers did not find me debating with anyone in the temple or riling up a crowd in the synagogues or in the city. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_13","074_24_13","ACT","24","13","13","Nor can they prove any of their charges against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_14","074_24_14","ACT","24","14","14","I do confess to you, however, that I worship the God of our fathers according to the Way, which they call a sect. I believe everything that is written throughout the Law and the Prophets, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_15","074_24_15","ACT","24","15","15","and I have the same hope in God that they themselves cherish, that there will be a resurrection of the dead—of both the righteous and the wicked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_16","074_24_16","ACT","24","16","16","In this hope, I strive always to maintain a clear conscience before God and man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_17","074_24_17","ACT","24","17","17","After several years, then, I returned to Jerusalem to bring alms to my people and to present offerings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_18","074_24_18","ACT","24","18","18","At the time they found me in the temple, I was ceremonially clean and was not inciting a crowd or an uproar. But there are some Jews from the province of Asia ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_19","074_24_19","ACT","24","19","19","who ought to appear before you and bring charges, if they have anything against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_20","074_24_20","ACT","24","20","20","Otherwise, let these men state for themselves any crime they found in me when I stood before the Sanhedrin, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_21","074_24_21","ACT","24","21","21","unless it was this one thing I called out as I stood in their presence: ‘It is concerning the resurrection of the dead that I am being tried by you today.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_22","074_24_22","ACT","24","22","22","On hearing these things Felix, who was well informed about the Way, adjourned the hearing and said, “When Lysias the commander comes, I will decide your case.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_23","074_24_23","ACT","24","23","23","He ordered the centurion to keep Paul under guard, but to allow him some freedom and permit his friends to come and minister to his needs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_24","074_24_24","ACT","24","24","24","After several days, Felix returned with his wife Drusilla, who was a Jewess. He sent for Paul and listened to him speak about faith in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_25","074_24_25","ACT","24","25","25","As Paul expounded on righteousness, self-control, and the coming judgment, Felix became frightened and said, “You may go for now. When I find the time, I will call for you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_26","074_24_26","ACT","24","26","26","At the same time, he was hoping that Paul would offer him a bribe to release him. So he sent for Paul frequently and talked with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC24_27","074_24_27","ACT","24","27","27","After two years had passed, Felix was succeeded by Porcius Festus. And wishing to do the Jews a favor, Felix left Paul in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_1","074_25_1","ACT","25","1","1","Three days after his arrival in the province, Festus went up from Caesarea to Jerusalem, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_2","074_25_2","ACT","25","2","2","where the high priest and Jewish leaders presented their case against Paul. They urged Festus ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_3","074_25_3","ACT","25","3","3","to grant them a concession against Paul by summoning him to Jerusalem, because they were preparing an ambush to kill him along the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_4","074_25_4","ACT","25","4","4","But Festus replied, “Paul is being held in Caesarea, and I myself am going there soon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_5","074_25_5","ACT","25","5","5","So if this man has done anything wrong, let some of your leaders come down with me and accuse him there.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_6","074_25_6","ACT","25","6","6","After spending more than ten days with them, Festus went down to Caesarea. The next day he sat on the judgment seat and ordered that Paul be brought in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_7","074_25_7","ACT","25","7","7","When Paul arrived, the Jews who had come down from Jerusalem stood around him, laying against Paul many serious charges that they could not prove. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_8","074_25_8","ACT","25","8","8","Then Paul made his defense: “I have committed no offense against the law of the Jews or against the temple or against Caesar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_9","074_25_9","ACT","25","9","9","But Festus, wishing to do the Jews a favor, said to Paul, “Are you willing to go up to Jerusalem to stand trial before me on these charges?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_10","074_25_10","ACT","25","10","10","Paul replied, “I am standing before the judgment seat of Caesar, where I ought to be tried. I have done nothing wrong to the Jews, as you yourself know very well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_11","074_25_11","ACT","25","11","11","If, however, I am guilty of anything worthy of death, I do not refuse to die. But if there is no truth to their accusations against me, no one has the right to hand me over to them. I appeal to Caesar!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_12","074_25_12","ACT","25","12","12","Then Festus conferred with his council and replied, “You have appealed to Caesar. To Caesar you will go!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_13","074_25_13","ACT","25","13","13","After several days had passed, King Agrippa and Bernice came down to Caesarea to pay their respects to Festus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_14","074_25_14","ACT","25","14","14","Since he was staying several days, Festus laid out Paul’s case before the king: “There is a certain man whom Felix left in prison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_15","074_25_15","ACT","25","15","15","While I was in Jerusalem, the chief priests and elders of the Jews presented their case and requested a judgment against him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_16","074_25_16","ACT","25","16","16","I told them that it is not the Roman custom to hand a man over to die before he has had an opportunity to face his accusers and defend himself against their charges. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_17","074_25_17","ACT","25","17","17","So when they came here with me, I did not delay. The next day I sat on the judgment seat and ordered that the man be brought in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_18","074_25_18","ACT","25","18","18","But when his accusers rose to speak, they did not charge him with anything I had expected. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_19","074_25_19","ACT","25","19","19","They only had some contentions with him regarding their own religion and a certain Jesus who had died, but whom Paul affirmed to be alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_20","074_25_20","ACT","25","20","20","Since I was at a loss as to how to investigate this matter, I asked if he was willing to go to Jerusalem and be tried there on these charges. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_21","074_25_21","ACT","25","21","21","But when Paul appealed to be held over for the decision of the Emperor, I ordered that he be held until I could send him to Caesar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_22","074_25_22","ACT","25","22","22","Then Agrippa said to Festus, “I would like to hear this man myself.” “Tomorrow you will hear him,” Festus declared. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_23","074_25_23","ACT","25","23","23","The next day Agrippa and Bernice came with great pomp and entered the auditorium, along with the commanders and leading men of the city. And Festus ordered that Paul be brought in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_24","074_25_24","ACT","25","24","24","Then Festus said, “King Agrippa and all who are present with us, you see this man. The whole Jewish community has petitioned me about him, both here and in Jerusalem, crying out that he ought not to live any longer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_25","074_25_25","ACT","25","25","25","But I found he had done nothing worthy of death, and since he has now appealed to the Emperor, I decided to send him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_26","074_25_26","ACT","25","26","26","I have nothing definite to write to our sovereign about him. Therefore I have brought him before all of you, and especially before you, King Agrippa, so that after this inquiry I may have something to write. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC25_27","074_25_27","ACT","25","27","27","For it seems unreasonable to me to send on a prisoner without specifying the charges against him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_1","074_26_1","ACT","26","1","1","Agrippa said to Paul, “You have permission to speak for yourself.” Then Paul stretched out his hand and began his defense: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_2","074_26_2","ACT","26","2","2","“King Agrippa, I consider myself fortunate to stand before you today to defend myself against all the accusations of the Jews, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_3","074_26_3","ACT","26","3","3","especially since you are acquainted with all the Jewish customs and controversies. I beg you, therefore, to listen to me patiently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_4","074_26_4","ACT","26","4","4","Surely all the Jews know how I have lived from my earliest childhood among my own people in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_5","074_26_5","ACT","26","5","5","They have known me for a long time and can testify, if they are willing, that I lived as a Pharisee, adhering to the strictest sect of our religion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_6","074_26_6","ACT","26","6","6","And now I stand on trial because of my hope in the promise that God made to our fathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_7","074_26_7","ACT","26","7","7","the promise our twelve tribes are hoping to see fulfilled as they earnestly serve God day and night. It is because of this hope, O King Agrippa, that I am accused by the Jews. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_8","074_26_8","ACT","26","8","8","Why would any of you consider it incredible that God raises the dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_9","074_26_9","ACT","26","9","9","So then, I too was convinced that I ought to do all I could to oppose the name of Jesus of Nazareth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_10","074_26_10","ACT","26","10","10","And that is what I did in Jerusalem. With authority from the chief priests I put many of the saints in prison, and when they were condemned to death, I cast my vote against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_11","074_26_11","ACT","26","11","11","I frequently had them punished in the synagogues, and I tried to make them blaspheme. In my raging fury against them, I even went to foreign cities to persecute them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_12","074_26_12","ACT","26","12","12","In this pursuit I was on my way to Damascus with the authority and commission of the chief priests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_13","074_26_13","ACT","26","13","13","About noon, O king, as I was on the road, I saw a light from heaven, brighter than the sun, shining around me and my companions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_14","074_26_14","ACT","26","14","14","We all fell to the ground, and I heard a voice say to me in Hebrew, ‘Saul, Saul, why do you persecute Me? It is hard for you to kick against the goads.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_15","074_26_15","ACT","26","15","15","‘Who are You, Lord?’ I asked. ‘I am Jesus, whom you are persecuting,’ He replied. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_16","074_26_16","ACT","26","16","16","‘But get up and stand on your feet. For I have appeared to you to appoint you as a servant and as a witness of what you have seen and what I will show you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_17","074_26_17","ACT","26","17","17","I will rescue you from your own people and from the Gentiles. I am sending you to them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_18","074_26_18","ACT","26","18","18","to open their eyes, so that they may turn from darkness to light and from the power of Satan to God, that they may receive forgiveness of sins and an inheritance among those sanctified by faith in Me.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_19","074_26_19","ACT","26","19","19","So then, King Agrippa, I was not disobedient to the heavenly vision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_20","074_26_20","ACT","26","20","20","First to those in Damascus and Jerusalem, then to everyone throughout the region of Judea, and then to the Gentiles, I declared that they should repent and turn to God, performing deeds worthy of their repentance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_21","074_26_21","ACT","26","21","21","For this reason the Jews seized me in the temple courts and tried to kill me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_22","074_26_22","ACT","26","22","22","But I have had God’s help to this day, and I stand here to testify to small and great alike. I am saying nothing beyond what the prophets and Moses said would happen: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_23","074_26_23","ACT","26","23","23","that the Christ would suffer, and as the first to rise from the dead, would proclaim light to our people and to the Gentiles.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_24","074_26_24","ACT","26","24","24","At this stage of Paul’s defense, Festus exclaimed in a loud voice, “You are insane, Paul! Your great learning is driving you to madness!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_25","074_26_25","ACT","26","25","25","But he answered, “I am not insane, most excellent Festus; I am speaking words of truth and sobriety. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_26","074_26_26","ACT","26","26","26","For the king knows about these matters, and I can speak freely to him. I am confident that none of this has escaped his notice, because it was not done in a corner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_27","074_26_27","ACT","26","27","27","King Agrippa, do you believe the prophets? I know you do.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_28","074_26_28","ACT","26","28","28","Then Agrippa said to Paul, “Can you persuade me in such a short time to become a Christian?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_29","074_26_29","ACT","26","29","29","“Short time or long,” Paul replied, “I wish to God that not only you but all who hear me this day may become what I am, except for these chains.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_30","074_26_30","ACT","26","30","30","When he had spoken these things, the king and the governor rose, along with Bernice and those seated with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_31","074_26_31","ACT","26","31","31","On their way out, they said to one another, “This man has done nothing worthy of death or imprisonment.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC26_32","074_26_32","ACT","26","32","32","And Agrippa said to Festus, “This man could have been released if he had not appealed to Caesar.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_1","074_27_1","ACT","27","1","1","When it was decided that we would sail for Italy, Paul and some other prisoners were handed over to a centurion named Julius, who belonged to the Imperial Regiment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_2","074_27_2","ACT","27","2","2","We boarded an Adramyttian ship about to sail for ports along the coast of Asia, and we put out to sea. Aristarchus, a Macedonian from Thessalonica, was with us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_3","074_27_3","ACT","27","3","3","The next day we landed at Sidon, and Julius treated Paul with consideration, allowing him to visit his friends and receive their care. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_4","074_27_4","ACT","27","4","4","After putting out from there, we sailed to the lee of Cyprus because the winds were against us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_5","074_27_5","ACT","27","5","5","And when we had sailed across the open sea off the coast of Cilicia and Pamphylia, we came to Myra in Lycia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_6","074_27_6","ACT","27","6","6","There the centurion found an Alexandrian ship sailing for Italy and put us on board. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_7","074_27_7","ACT","27","7","7","After sailing slowly for many days, we arrived off Cnidus. When the wind impeded us, we sailed to the lee of Crete, opposite Salmone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_8","074_27_8","ACT","27","8","8","After we had moved along the coast with difficulty, we came to a place called Fair Havens, near the town of Lasea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_9","074_27_9","ACT","27","9","9","By now much time had passed, and the voyage had already become dangerous because it was after the Fast. So Paul advised them, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_10","074_27_10","ACT","27","10","10","“Men, I can see that our voyage will be filled with disaster and great loss, not only to ship and cargo, but to our own lives as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_11","074_27_11","ACT","27","11","11","But contrary to Paul’s advice, the centurion was persuaded by the pilot and by the owner of the ship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_12","074_27_12","ACT","27","12","12","Since the harbor was unsuitable to winter in, the majority decided to sail on, hoping that somehow they could reach Phoenix to winter there. Phoenix was a harbor in Crete facing both southwest and northwest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_13","074_27_13","ACT","27","13","13","When a gentle south wind began to blow, they thought they had their opportunity. So they weighed anchor and sailed along, hugging the coast of Crete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_14","074_27_14","ACT","27","14","14","But it was not long before a cyclone called the Northeaster swept down across the island. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_15","074_27_15","ACT","27","15","15","Unable to head into the wind, the ship was caught up. So we gave way and let ourselves be driven along. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_16","074_27_16","ACT","27","16","16","Passing to the lee of a small island called Clauda, we barely managed to secure the lifeboat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_17","074_27_17","ACT","27","17","17","After hoisting it up, the crew used ropes to undergird the ship. And fearing that they would run aground on the sandbars of Syrtis, they lowered the sea anchor and were driven along. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_18","074_27_18","ACT","27","18","18","We were tossed so violently that the next day the men began to jettison the cargo. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_19","074_27_19","ACT","27","19","19","On the third day, we threw the ship’s tackle overboard with our own hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_20","074_27_20","ACT","27","20","20","When neither sun nor stars appeared for many days and the great storm continued to batter us, we abandoned all hope of being saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_21","074_27_21","ACT","27","21","21","After the men had gone a long time without food, Paul stood up among them and said, “Men, you should have followed my advice not to sail from Crete. Then you would have averted this disaster and loss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_22","074_27_22","ACT","27","22","22","But now I urge you to keep up your courage, because you will not experience any loss of life, but only of the ship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_23","074_27_23","ACT","27","23","23","For just last night an angel of the God to whom I belong and whom I serve stood beside me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_24","074_27_24","ACT","27","24","24","and said, ‘Do not be afraid, Paul; you must stand before Caesar. And look, God has granted you the lives of all who sail with you.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_25","074_27_25","ACT","27","25","25","So take courage, men, for I believe God that it will happen just as He told me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_26","074_27_26","ACT","27","26","26","However, we must run aground on some island.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_27","074_27_27","ACT","27","27","27","On the fourteenth night we were still being driven across the Adriatic Sea. About midnight the sailors sensed they were approaching land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_28","074_27_28","ACT","27","28","28","They took soundings and found that the water was twenty fathoms deep. Going a little farther, they took another set of soundings that read fifteen fathoms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_29","074_27_29","ACT","27","29","29","Fearing that we would run aground on the rocks, they dropped four anchors from the stern and prayed for daybreak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_30","074_27_30","ACT","27","30","30","Meanwhile, the sailors attempted to escape from the ship. Pretending to lower anchors from the bow, they let the lifeboat down into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_31","074_27_31","ACT","27","31","31","But Paul said to the centurion and the soldiers, “Unless these men remain with the ship, you cannot be saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_32","074_27_32","ACT","27","32","32","So the soldiers cut the ropes to the lifeboat and set it adrift. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_33","074_27_33","ACT","27","33","33","Right up to daybreak, Paul kept urging them all to eat: “Today is your fourteenth day in constant suspense, without taking any food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_34","074_27_34","ACT","27","34","34","So for your own preservation, I urge you to eat something, because not a single hair of your head will be lost.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_35","074_27_35","ACT","27","35","35","After he had said this, Paul took bread and gave thanks to God in front of them all. Then he broke it and began to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_36","074_27_36","ACT","27","36","36","They were all encouraged and took some food themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_37","074_27_37","ACT","27","37","37","In all, there were 276 of us on board. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_38","074_27_38","ACT","27","38","38","After the men had eaten their fill, they lightened the ship by throwing the grain into the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_39","074_27_39","ACT","27","39","39","When daylight came, they did not recognize the land, but they sighted a bay with a sandy beach, where they decided to run the ship aground if possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_40","074_27_40","ACT","27","40","40","Cutting away the anchors, they left them in the sea as they loosened the ropes that held the rudders. Then they hoisted the foresail to the wind and made for the beach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_41","074_27_41","ACT","27","41","41","But the ship struck a sandbar and ran aground. The bow stuck fast and would not move, and the stern was being broken up by the pounding of the waves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_42","074_27_42","ACT","27","42","42","The soldiers planned to kill the prisoners so none of them could swim to freedom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_43","074_27_43","ACT","27","43","43","But the centurion, wanting to spare Paul’s life, thwarted their plan. He commanded those who could swim to jump overboard first and get to land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC27_44","074_27_44","ACT","27","44","44","The rest were to follow on planks and various parts of the ship. In this way everyone was brought safely to land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_1","074_28_1","ACT","28","1","1","Once we were safely ashore, we learned that the island was called Malta. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_2","074_28_2","ACT","28","2","2","The islanders showed us extraordinary kindness. They kindled a fire and welcomed all of us because it was raining and cold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_3","074_28_3","ACT","28","3","3","Paul gathered a bundle of sticks, and as he laid them on the fire, a viper, driven out by the heat, fastened itself to his hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_4","074_28_4","ACT","28","4","4","When the islanders saw the creature hanging from his hand, they said to one another, “Surely this man is a murderer. Although he was saved from the sea, Justice has not allowed him to live.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_5","074_28_5","ACT","28","5","5","But Paul shook the creature off into the fire and suffered no ill effects. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_6","074_28_6","ACT","28","6","6","The islanders were expecting him to swell up or suddenly drop dead. But after waiting a long time and seeing nothing unusual happen to him, they changed their minds and said he was a god. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_7","074_28_7","ACT","28","7","7","Nearby stood an estate belonging to Publius, the chief official of the island. He welcomed us and entertained us hospitably for three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_8","074_28_8","ACT","28","8","8","The father of Publius was sick in bed, suffering from fever and dysentery. Paul went in to see him, and after praying and placing his hands on him, he healed the man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_9","074_28_9","ACT","28","9","9","After this had happened, the rest of the sick on the island came and were cured as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_10","074_28_10","ACT","28","10","10","The islanders honored us in many ways and supplied our needs when we were ready to sail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_11","074_28_11","ACT","28","11","11","After three months we set sail in an Alexandrian ship that had wintered in the island. It had the Twin Brothers as a figurehead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_12","074_28_12","ACT","28","12","12","Putting in at Syracuse, we stayed there three days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_13","074_28_13","ACT","28","13","13","From there we sailed around and came to Rhegium. After one day, a south wind came up, and on the second day we arrived at Puteoli. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_14","074_28_14","ACT","28","14","14","There we found some brothers who invited us to spend the week with them. And so we came to Rome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_15","074_28_15","ACT","28","15","15","The brothers there had heard about us and traveled as far as the Forum of Appius and the Three Taverns to meet us. When Paul saw them, he was encouraged and gave thanks to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_16","074_28_16","ACT","28","16","16","When we arrived in Rome, the centurion delivered up the prisoners to the captain of the guard, but Paul was permitted to stay by himself, with a soldier to guard him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_17","074_28_17","ACT","28","17","17","After three days, Paul called together the leaders of the Jews. When they had gathered, he said to them, “Brothers, although I have done nothing against our people or the customs of our fathers, I was taken prisoner in Jerusalem and handed over to the Romans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_18","074_28_18","ACT","28","18","18","They examined me and wanted to release me, because there was no basis for a death sentence against me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_19","074_28_19","ACT","28","19","19","But when the Jews objected, I was compelled to appeal to Caesar, even though I have no charge to bring against my nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_20","074_28_20","ACT","28","20","20","So for this reason I have called to see you and speak with you. It is because of the hope of Israel that I am bound with this chain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_21","074_28_21","ACT","28","21","21","The leaders replied, “We have not received any letters about you from Judea, nor have any of the brothers from there reported or even mentioned anything bad about you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_22","074_28_22","ACT","28","22","22","But we consider your views worth hearing, because we know that people everywhere are speaking against this sect.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_23","074_28_23","ACT","28","23","23","So they set a day to meet with Paul, and many people came to the place he was staying. He expounded to them from morning to evening, testifying about the kingdom of God and persuading them about Jesus from the Law of Moses and the Prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_24","074_28_24","ACT","28","24","24","Some of them were convinced by what he said, but others refused to believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_25","074_28_25","ACT","28","25","25","They disagreed among themselves and began to leave after Paul had made this final statement: “The Holy Spirit was right when He spoke to our fathers through Isaiah the prophet: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_26","074_28_26","ACT","28","26","26","‘Go to this people and say, “You will be ever hearing but never understanding; you will be ever seeing but never perceiving.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_27","074_28_27","ACT","28","27","27","For this people’s heart has grown callous; they hardly hear with their ears, and they have closed their eyes. Otherwise they might see with their eyes, hear with their ears, understand with their hearts, and turn, and I would heal them.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_28","074_28_28","ACT","28","28","28","Be advised, therefore, that God’s salvation has been sent to the Gentiles, and they will listen!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_29","074_28_29","ACT","28","29","29","And when he had said these things, the Jews went away, disputing sharply among themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_30","074_28_30","ACT","28","30","30","Paul stayed there two full years in his own rented house, welcoming all who came to visit him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("AC28_31","074_28_31","ACT","28","31","31","Boldly and freely he proclaimed the kingdom of God and taught about the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_1","075_1_1","ROM","1","1","1","Paul, a servant of Jesus Christ, called to be an apostle, and set apart for the gospel of God— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_2","075_1_2","ROM","1","2","2","the gospel He promised beforehand through His prophets in the Holy Scriptures, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_3","075_1_3","ROM","1","3","3","regarding His Son, who was a descendant of David according to the flesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_4","075_1_4","ROM","1","4","4","and who through the Spirit of holiness was declared with power to be the Son of God by His resurrection from the dead: Jesus Christ our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_5","075_1_5","ROM","1","5","5","Through Him and on behalf of His name, we received grace and apostleship to call all those among the Gentiles to the obedience that comes from faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_6","075_1_6","ROM","1","6","6","And you also are among those who are called to belong to Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_7","075_1_7","ROM","1","7","7","To all in Rome who are loved by God and called to be saints: Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_8","075_1_8","ROM","1","8","8","First, I thank my God through Jesus Christ for all of you, because your faith is being proclaimed all over the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_9","075_1_9","ROM","1","9","9","God, whom I serve with my spirit in preaching the gospel of His Son, is my witness how constantly I remember you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_10","075_1_10","ROM","1","10","10","in my prayers at all times, asking that now at last by God’s will I may succeed in coming to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_11","075_1_11","ROM","1","11","11","For I long to see you so that I may impart to you some spiritual gift to strengthen you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_12","075_1_12","ROM","1","12","12","that is, that you and I may be mutually encouraged by each other’s faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_13","075_1_13","ROM","1","13","13","I do not want you to be unaware, brothers, how often I planned to come to you (but have been prevented from visiting until now), in order that I might have a harvest among you, just as I have had among the other Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_14","075_1_14","ROM","1","14","14","I am obligated both to Greeks and non-Greeks, both to the wise and the foolish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_15","075_1_15","ROM","1","15","15","That is why I am so eager to preach the gospel also to you who are in Rome. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_16","075_1_16","ROM","1","16","16","I am not ashamed of the gospel of Christ, because it is the power of God for salvation to everyone who believes, first to the Jew, then to the Greek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_17","075_1_17","ROM","1","17","17","For the gospel reveals the righteousness of God that comes by faith from start to finish, just as it is written: “The righteous will live by faith.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_18","075_1_18","ROM","1","18","18","The wrath of God is being revealed from heaven against all the godlessness and wickedness of men who suppress the truth by their wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_19","075_1_19","ROM","1","19","19","For what may be known about God is plain to them, because God has made it plain to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_20","075_1_20","ROM","1","20","20","For since the creation of the world God’s invisible qualities, His eternal power and divine nature, have been clearly seen, being understood from His workmanship, so that men are without excuse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_21","075_1_21","ROM","1","21","21","For although they knew God, they neither glorified Him as God nor gave thanks to Him, but they became futile in their thinking and darkened in their foolish hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_22","075_1_22","ROM","1","22","22","Although they claimed to be wise, they became fools, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_23","075_1_23","ROM","1","23","23","and exchanged the glory of the immortal God for images of mortal man and birds and animals and reptiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_24","075_1_24","ROM","1","24","24","Therefore God gave them over in the desires of their hearts to impurity for the dishonoring of their bodies with one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_25","075_1_25","ROM","1","25","25","They exchanged the truth of God for a lie, and worshiped and served the creature rather than the Creator, who is forever worthy of praise! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_26","075_1_26","ROM","1","26","26","For this reason God gave them over to dishonorable passions. Even their women exchanged natural relations for unnatural ones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_27","075_1_27","ROM","1","27","27","Likewise, the men abandoned natural relations with women and burned with lust for one another. Men committed indecent acts with other men, and received in themselves the due penalty for their error. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_28","075_1_28","ROM","1","28","28","Furthermore, since they did not see fit to acknowledge God, He gave them up to a depraved mind, to do what ought not to be done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_29","075_1_29","ROM","1","29","29","They have become filled with every kind of wickedness, sexual immorality, evil, greed, and depravity. They are full of envy, murder, strife, deceit, and malice. They are gossips, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_30","075_1_30","ROM","1","30","30","slanderers, God-haters, insolent, arrogant, and boastful. They invent new forms of evil; they disobey their parents. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_31","075_1_31","ROM","1","31","31","They are senseless, faithless, heartless, unforgiving, merciless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM1_32","075_1_32","ROM","1","32","32","Although they know God’s righteous decree that those who do such things are worthy of death, they not only continue to do these things, but also approve of those who practice them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_1","075_2_1","ROM","2","1","1","You, therefore, have no excuse, you who pass judgment on another. For on whatever grounds you judge the other, you are condemning yourself, because you who pass judgment do the same things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_2","075_2_2","ROM","2","2","2","And we know that God’s judgment against those who do such things is based on truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_3","075_2_3","ROM","2","3","3","So when you, O man, pass judgment on others, yet do the same things, do you think you will escape God’s judgment? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_4","075_2_4","ROM","2","4","4","Or do you disregard the riches of His kindness, tolerance, and patience, not realizing that God’s kindness leads you to repentance? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_5","075_2_5","ROM","2","5","5","But because of your hard and unrepentant heart, you are storing up wrath against yourself for the day of wrath, revelation, and God’s righteous judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_6","075_2_6","ROM","2","6","6","God “will repay each one according to his deeds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_7","075_2_7","ROM","2","7","7","To those who by perseverance in doing good seek glory, honor, and immortality, He will give eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_8","075_2_8","ROM","2","8","8","But for those who are self-seeking and who reject the truth and follow wickedness, there will be anger and wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_9","075_2_9","ROM","2","9","9","There will be trouble and distress for every human being who does evil, first for the Jew, then for the Greek; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_10","075_2_10","ROM","2","10","10","but glory, honor, and peace for everyone who does good, first for the Jew, then for the Greek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_11","075_2_11","ROM","2","11","11","For God does not show favoritism. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_12","075_2_12","ROM","2","12","12","All who sin apart from the law will also perish apart from the law, and all who sin under the law will be judged by the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_13","075_2_13","ROM","2","13","13","For it is not the hearers of the law who are righteous before God, but it is the doers of the law who will be declared righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_14","075_2_14","ROM","2","14","14","Indeed, when Gentiles, who do not have the law, do by nature what the law requires, they are a law to themselves, even though they do not have the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_15","075_2_15","ROM","2","15","15","So they show that the work of the law is written on their hearts, their consciences also bearing witness, and their thoughts either accusing or defending them ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_16","075_2_16","ROM","2","16","16","on the day when God will judge men’s secrets through Jesus Christ, as proclaimed by my gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_17","075_2_17","ROM","2","17","17","Behold, you call yourself a Jew. You rely on the law and boast in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_18","075_2_18","ROM","2","18","18","And you know His will and approve of what is superior because you are instructed by the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_19","075_2_19","ROM","2","19","19","And you are convinced that you are a guide for the blind, a light for those in darkness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_20","075_2_20","ROM","2","20","20","an instructor of the foolish, a teacher of infants, because you have in the law the embodiment of knowledge and truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_21","075_2_21","ROM","2","21","21","You, then, who teach others, do you not teach yourself? You who preach against stealing, do you steal? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_22","075_2_22","ROM","2","22","22","You who forbid adultery, do you commit adultery? You who abhor idols, do you rob temples? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_23","075_2_23","ROM","2","23","23","You who boast in the law, do you dishonor God by breaking the law? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_24","075_2_24","ROM","2","24","24","As it is written: “God’s name is blasphemed among the Gentiles because of you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_25","075_2_25","ROM","2","25","25","Circumcision has value if you observe the law, but if you break the law, your circumcision has become uncircumcision. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_26","075_2_26","ROM","2","26","26","If a man who is not circumcised keeps the requirements of the law, will not his uncircumcision be regarded as circumcision? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_27","075_2_27","ROM","2","27","27","The one who is physically uncircumcised yet keeps the law will condemn you who, even though you have the written code and circumcision, are a lawbreaker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_28","075_2_28","ROM","2","28","28","A man is not a Jew because he is one outwardly, nor is circumcision only outward and physical. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM2_29","075_2_29","ROM","2","29","29","No, a man is a Jew because he is one inwardly, and circumcision is a matter of the heart, by the Spirit, not by the written code. Such a man’s praise does not come from men, but from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_1","075_3_1","ROM","3","1","1","What, then, is the advantage of being a Jew? Or what is the value of circumcision? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_2","075_3_2","ROM","3","2","2","Much in every way. First of all, they have been entrusted with the very words of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_3","075_3_3","ROM","3","3","3","What if some did not have faith? Will their lack of faith nullify God’s faithfulness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_4","075_3_4","ROM","3","4","4","Certainly not! Let God be true and every man a liar. As it is written: “So that You may be proved right when You speak and victorious when You judge.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_5","075_3_5","ROM","3","5","5","But if our unrighteousness highlights the righteousness of God, what shall we say? That God is unjust to inflict His wrath on us? I am speaking in human terms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_6","075_3_6","ROM","3","6","6","Certainly not! In that case, how could God judge the world? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_7","075_3_7","ROM","3","7","7","For if my falsehood accentuates God’s truthfulness, to the increase of His glory, why am I still condemned as a sinner? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_8","075_3_8","ROM","3","8","8","Why not say, as some slanderously claim that we say, “Let us do evil that good may result”? Their condemnation is deserved! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_9","075_3_9","ROM","3","9","9","What then? Are we any better? Not at all. For we have already made the charge that Jews and Greeks alike are all under sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_10","075_3_10","ROM","3","10","10","As it is written: “There is no one righteous, not even one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_11","075_3_11","ROM","3","11","11","There is no one who understands, no one who seeks God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_12","075_3_12","ROM","3","12","12","All have turned away, they have together become worthless; there is no one who does good, not even one.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_13","075_3_13","ROM","3","13","13","“Their throats are open graves; their tongues practice deceit.” “The venom of vipers is on their lips.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_14","075_3_14","ROM","3","14","14","“Their mouths are full of cursing and bitterness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_15","075_3_15","ROM","3","15","15","“Their feet are swift to shed blood; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_16","075_3_16","ROM","3","16","16","ruin and misery lie in their wake, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_17","075_3_17","ROM","3","17","17","and the way of peace they have not known.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_18","075_3_18","ROM","3","18","18","“There is no fear of God before their eyes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_19","075_3_19","ROM","3","19","19","Now we know that whatever the law says, it says to those who are under the law, so that every mouth may be silenced and the whole world held accountable to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_20","075_3_20","ROM","3","20","20","Therefore no one will be justified in His sight by works of the law. For the law merely brings awareness of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_21","075_3_21","ROM","3","21","21","But now, apart from the law, the righteousness of God has been revealed, as attested by the Law and the Prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_22","075_3_22","ROM","3","22","22","And this righteousness from God comes through faith in Jesus Christ to all and upon all who believe. There is no distinction, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_23","075_3_23","ROM","3","23","23","for all have sinned and fall short of the glory of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_24","075_3_24","ROM","3","24","24","and are justified freely by His grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_25","075_3_25","ROM","3","25","25","God presented Him as an atoning sacrifice in His blood through faith, in order to demonstrate His righteousness, because in His forbearance He had passed over the sins committed beforehand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_26","075_3_26","ROM","3","26","26","He did this to demonstrate His righteousness at the present time, so as to be just and to justify the one who has faith in Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_27","075_3_27","ROM","3","27","27","Where, then, is boasting? It is excluded. On what principle? On that of works? No, but on that of faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_28","075_3_28","ROM","3","28","28","Therefore we maintain that a man is justified by faith apart from works of the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_29","075_3_29","ROM","3","29","29","Is God the God of Jews only? Is He not the God of Gentiles too? Yes, of Gentiles too, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_30","075_3_30","ROM","3","30","30","since there is only one God, who will justify the circumcised by faith and the uncircumcised through that same faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM3_31","075_3_31","ROM","3","31","31","Do we, then, nullify the law by this faith? Certainly not! Instead, we uphold the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_1","075_4_1","ROM","4","1","1","What then shall we say that Abraham, our forefather according to the flesh, has discovered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_2","075_4_2","ROM","4","2","2","If Abraham was indeed justified by works, he had something to boast about, but not before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_3","075_4_3","ROM","4","3","3","For what does the Scripture say? “Abraham believed God, and it was credited to him as righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_4","075_4_4","ROM","4","4","4","Now the wages of the worker are not credited as a gift, but as an obligation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_5","075_4_5","ROM","4","5","5","However, to the one who does not work, but believes in Him who justifies the ungodly, his faith is credited as righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_6","075_4_6","ROM","4","6","6","And David speaks likewise of the blessedness of the man to whom God credits righteousness apart from works: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_7","075_4_7","ROM","4","7","7","“Blessed are they whose lawless acts are forgiven, whose sins are covered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_8","075_4_8","ROM","4","8","8","Blessed is the man whose sin the Lord will never count against him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_9","075_4_9","ROM","4","9","9","Is this blessing only on the circumcised, or also on the uncircumcised? We have been saying that Abraham’s faith was credited to him as righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_10","075_4_10","ROM","4","10","10","In what context was it credited? Was it after his circumcision, or before? It was not after, but before. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_11","075_4_11","ROM","4","11","11","And he received the sign of circumcision as a seal of the righteousness that he had by faith while he was still uncircumcised. So then, he is the father of all who believe but are not circumcised, in order that righteousness might be credited to them as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_12","075_4_12","ROM","4","12","12","And he is also the father of the circumcised who not only are circumcised, but who also walk in the footsteps of the faith that our father Abraham had before he was circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_13","075_4_13","ROM","4","13","13","For the promise to Abraham and his offspring that he would be heir of the world was not given through the law, but through the righteousness that comes by faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_14","075_4_14","ROM","4","14","14","For if those who live by the law are heirs, faith is useless and the promise is worthless, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_15","075_4_15","ROM","4","15","15","because the law brings wrath. For where there is no law, there is no transgression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_16","075_4_16","ROM","4","16","16","Therefore, the promise comes by faith, so that it may rest on grace and may be guaranteed to all Abraham’s offspring—not only to those who are of the law, but also to those who are of the faith of Abraham. He is the father of us all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_17","075_4_17","ROM","4","17","17","As it is written: “I have made you a father of many nations.” He is our father in the presence of God, in whom he believed, the God who gives life to the dead and calls into being what does not yet exist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_18","075_4_18","ROM","4","18","18","Against all hope, Abraham in hope believed and so became the father of many nations, just as he had been told, “So shall your offspring be.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_19","075_4_19","ROM","4","19","19","Without weakening in his faith, he acknowledged neither the decrepitness of his body (since he was about a hundred years old) nor the lifelessness of Sarah’s womb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_20","075_4_20","ROM","4","20","20","Yet he did not waver through disbelief in the promise of God, but was strengthened in his faith and gave glory to God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_21","075_4_21","ROM","4","21","21","being fully persuaded that God was able to do what He had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_22","075_4_22","ROM","4","22","22","This is why “it was credited to him as righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_23","075_4_23","ROM","4","23","23","Now the words “it was credited to him” were written not only for Abraham, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_24","075_4_24","ROM","4","24","24","but also for us, to whom righteousness will be credited—for us who believe in Him who raised Jesus our Lord from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM4_25","075_4_25","ROM","4","25","25","He was delivered over to death for our trespasses and was raised to life for our justification. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_1","075_5_1","ROM","5","1","1","Therefore, since we have been justified through faith, we have peace with God through our Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_2","075_5_2","ROM","5","2","2","through whom we have gained access by faith into this grace in which we stand. And we rejoice in the hope of the glory of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_3","075_5_3","ROM","5","3","3","Not only that, but we also rejoice in our sufferings, because we know that suffering produces perseverance; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_4","075_5_4","ROM","5","4","4","perseverance, character; and character, hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_5","075_5_5","ROM","5","5","5","And hope does not disappoint us, because God has poured out His love into our hearts through the Holy Spirit, whom He has given us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_6","075_5_6","ROM","5","6","6","For at the right time, while we were still powerless, Christ died for the ungodly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_7","075_5_7","ROM","5","7","7","Very rarely will anyone die for a righteous man, though for a good man someone might possibly dare to die. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_8","075_5_8","ROM","5","8","8","But God proves His love for us in this: While we were still sinners, Christ died for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_9","075_5_9","ROM","5","9","9","Therefore, since we have now been justified by His blood, how much more shall we be saved from wrath through Him! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_10","075_5_10","ROM","5","10","10","For if, when we were enemies of God, we were reconciled to Him through the death of His Son, how much more, having been reconciled, shall we be saved through His life! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_11","075_5_11","ROM","5","11","11","Not only that, but we also rejoice in God through our Lord Jesus Christ, through whom we have now received reconciliation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_12","075_5_12","ROM","5","12","12","Therefore, just as sin entered the world through one man, and death through sin, so also death was passed on to all men, because all sinned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_13","075_5_13","ROM","5","13","13","For sin was in the world before the law was given; but sin is not taken into account when there is no law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_14","075_5_14","ROM","5","14","14","Nevertheless, death reigned from Adam until Moses, even over those who did not sin in the way that Adam transgressed. He is a pattern of the One to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_15","075_5_15","ROM","5","15","15","But the gift is not like the trespass. For if the many died by the trespass of the one man, how much more did God’s grace and the gift that came by the grace of the one man, Jesus Christ, abound to the many! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_16","075_5_16","ROM","5","16","16","Again, the gift is not like the result of the one man’s sin: The judgment that followed one sin brought condemnation, but the gift that followed many trespasses brought justification. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_17","075_5_17","ROM","5","17","17","For if, by the trespass of the one man, death reigned through that one man, how much more will those who receive the abundance of grace and of the gift of righteousness reign in life through the one man, Jesus Christ! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_18","075_5_18","ROM","5","18","18","So then, just as one trespass brought condemnation for all men, so also one act of righteousness brought justification and life for all men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_19","075_5_19","ROM","5","19","19","For just as through the disobedience of the one man the many were made sinners, so also through the obedience of the one man the many will be made righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_20","075_5_20","ROM","5","20","20","The law came in so that the trespass would increase; but where sin increased, grace increased all the more, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM5_21","075_5_21","ROM","5","21","21","so that, just as sin reigned in death, so also grace might reign through righteousness to bring eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_1","075_6_1","ROM","6","1","1","What then shall we say? Shall we continue in sin so that grace may increase? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_2","075_6_2","ROM","6","2","2","Certainly not! How can we who died to sin live in it any longer? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_3","075_6_3","ROM","6","3","3","Or aren’t you aware that all of us who were baptized into Christ Jesus were baptized into His death? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_4","075_6_4","ROM","6","4","4","We were therefore buried with Him through baptism into death, in order that, just as Christ was raised from the dead through the glory of the Father, we too may walk in newness of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_5","075_6_5","ROM","6","5","5","For if we have been united with Him like this in His death, we will certainly also be united with Him in His resurrection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_6","075_6_6","ROM","6","6","6","We know that our old self was crucified with Him so that the body of sin might be rendered powerless, that we should no longer be slaves to sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_7","075_6_7","ROM","6","7","7","For anyone who has died has been freed from sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_8","075_6_8","ROM","6","8","8","Now if we died with Christ, we believe that we will also live with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_9","075_6_9","ROM","6","9","9","For we know that since Christ was raised from the dead, He cannot die again; death no longer has dominion over Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_10","075_6_10","ROM","6","10","10","The death He died, He died to sin once for all; but the life He lives, He lives to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_11","075_6_11","ROM","6","11","11","So you too must count yourselves dead to sin, but alive to God in Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_12","075_6_12","ROM","6","12","12","Therefore do not let sin reign in your mortal body so that you obey it in its desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_13","075_6_13","ROM","6","13","13","Do not present the parts of your body to sin as instruments of wickedness, but present yourselves to God as those who have been brought from death to life; and present the parts of your body to Him as instruments of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_14","075_6_14","ROM","6","14","14","For sin shall not be your master, because you are not under law, but under grace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_15","075_6_15","ROM","6","15","15","What then? Shall we sin because we are not under law, but under grace? Certainly not! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_16","075_6_16","ROM","6","16","16","Do you not know that when you offer yourselves as obedient slaves, you are slaves to the one you obey, whether you are slaves to sin leading to death, or to obedience leading to righteousness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_17","075_6_17","ROM","6","17","17","But thanks be to God that, though you once were slaves to sin, you wholeheartedly obeyed the form of teaching to which you were committed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_18","075_6_18","ROM","6","18","18","You have been set free from sin and have become slaves to righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_19","075_6_19","ROM","6","19","19","I am speaking in human terms because of the weakness of your flesh. Just as you used to offer the parts of your body in slavery to impurity and to escalating wickedness, so now offer them in slavery to righteousness leading to holiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_20","075_6_20","ROM","6","20","20","For when you were slaves to sin, you were free of obligation to righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_21","075_6_21","ROM","6","21","21","What fruit did you reap at that time from the things of which you are now ashamed? The outcome of those things is death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_22","075_6_22","ROM","6","22","22","But now that you have been set free from sin and have become slaves to God, the fruit you reap leads to holiness, and the outcome is eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM6_23","075_6_23","ROM","6","23","23","For the wages of sin is death, but the gift of God is eternal life in Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_1","075_7_1","ROM","7","1","1","Do you not know, brothers (for I am speaking to those who know the law), that the law has authority over a man only as long as he lives? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_2","075_7_2","ROM","7","2","2","For instance, a married woman is bound by law to her husband as long as he lives. But if her husband dies, she is released from the law of marriage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_3","075_7_3","ROM","7","3","3","So then, if she is joined to another man while her husband is still alive, she is called an adulteress; but if her husband dies, she is free from that law and is not an adulteress if she marries another man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_4","075_7_4","ROM","7","4","4","Therefore, my brothers, you also died to the law through the body of Christ, that you might belong to another, to Him who was raised from the dead, in order that we might bear fruit to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_5","075_7_5","ROM","7","5","5","For when we lived according to the flesh, the sinful passions aroused by the law were at work in our bodies, bearing fruit for death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_6","075_7_6","ROM","7","6","6","But now, having died to what bound us, we have been released from the law, so that we serve in the new way of the Spirit, and not in the old way of the written code. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_7","075_7_7","ROM","7","7","7","What then shall we say? Is the law sin? Certainly not! Indeed, I would not have been mindful of sin if not for the law. For I would not have been aware of coveting if the law had not said, “Do not covet.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_8","075_7_8","ROM","7","8","8","But sin, seizing its opportunity through the commandment, produced in me every kind of covetous desire. For apart from the law, sin is dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_9","075_7_9","ROM","7","9","9","Once I was alive apart from the law; but when the commandment came, sin sprang to life and I died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_10","075_7_10","ROM","7","10","10","So I discovered that the very commandment that was meant to bring life actually brought death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_11","075_7_11","ROM","7","11","11","For sin, seizing its opportunity through the commandment, deceived me and through the commandment put me to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_12","075_7_12","ROM","7","12","12","So then, the law is holy, and the commandment is holy, righteous, and good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_13","075_7_13","ROM","7","13","13","Has that which is good, then, become death to me? Certainly not! But in order that sin might be exposed as sin, it produced death in me through what was good, so that through the commandment sin might become utterly sinful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_14","075_7_14","ROM","7","14","14","We know that the law is spiritual; but I am unspiritual, sold as a slave to sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_15","075_7_15","ROM","7","15","15","I do not understand what I do. For what I want to do, I do not do. But what I hate, I do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_16","075_7_16","ROM","7","16","16","And if I do what I do not want to do, I admit that the law is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_17","075_7_17","ROM","7","17","17","In that case, it is no longer I who do it, but it is sin living in me that does it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_18","075_7_18","ROM","7","18","18","I know that nothing good lives in me, that is, in my flesh; for I have the desire to do what is good, but I cannot discover how to carry it out. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_19","075_7_19","ROM","7","19","19","For I do not do the good I want to do. Instead, I keep on doing the evil I do not want to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_20","075_7_20","ROM","7","20","20","And if I do what I do not want, it is no longer I who do it, but it is sin living in me that does it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_21","075_7_21","ROM","7","21","21","So this is the principle I have discovered: When I want to do good, evil is right there with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_22","075_7_22","ROM","7","22","22","For in my inner being I delight in God’s law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_23","075_7_23","ROM","7","23","23","But I see another law at work in my body, warring against the law of my mind and holding me captive to the law of sin that dwells within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_24","075_7_24","ROM","7","24","24","What a wretched man I am! Who will rescue me from this body of death? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM7_25","075_7_25","ROM","7","25","25","I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord! So then, with my mind I serve the law of God, but with my flesh I serve the law of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_1","075_8_1","ROM","8","1","1","Therefore there is now no condemnation for those who are in Christ Jesus, who do not walk according to the flesh but according to the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_2","075_8_2","ROM","8","2","2","For in Christ Jesus the law of the Spirit of life set me free from the law of sin and death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_3","075_8_3","ROM","8","3","3","For what the law was powerless to do in that it was weakened by the flesh, God did by sending His own Son in the likeness of sinful man, as an offering for sin. He thus condemned sin in the flesh, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_4","075_8_4","ROM","8","4","4","so that the righteous standard of the law might be fulfilled in us, who do not walk according to the flesh but according to the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_5","075_8_5","ROM","8","5","5","Those who live according to the flesh set their minds on the things of the flesh; but those who live according to the Spirit set their minds on the things of the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_6","075_8_6","ROM","8","6","6","The mind of the flesh is death, but the mind of the Spirit is life and peace, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_7","075_8_7","ROM","8","7","7","because the mind of the flesh is hostile to God: It does not submit to God’s law, nor can it do so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_8","075_8_8","ROM","8","8","8","Those controlled by the flesh cannot please God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_9","075_8_9","ROM","8","9","9","You, however, are controlled not by the flesh, but by the Spirit, if the Spirit of God lives in you. And if anyone does not have the Spirit of Christ, he does not belong to Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_10","075_8_10","ROM","8","10","10","But if Christ is in you, your body is dead because of sin, yet your spirit is alive because of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_11","075_8_11","ROM","8","11","11","And if the Spirit of Him who raised Jesus from the dead is living in you, He who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies through His Spirit, who lives in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_12","075_8_12","ROM","8","12","12","Therefore, brothers, we have an obligation, but it is not to the flesh, to live according to it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_13","075_8_13","ROM","8","13","13","For if you live according to the flesh, you will die; but if by the Spirit you put to death the deeds of the body, you will live. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_14","075_8_14","ROM","8","14","14","For all who are led by the Spirit of God are sons of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_15","075_8_15","ROM","8","15","15","For you did not receive a spirit of slavery that returns you to fear, but you received the Spirit of adoption to sonship, by whom we cry, “Abba! Father!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_16","075_8_16","ROM","8","16","16","The Spirit Himself testifies with our spirit that we are God’s children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_17","075_8_17","ROM","8","17","17","And if we are children, then we are heirs: heirs of God and co-heirs with Christ—if indeed we suffer with Him, so that we may also be glorified with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_18","075_8_18","ROM","8","18","18","I consider that our present sufferings are not comparable to the glory that will be revealed in us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_19","075_8_19","ROM","8","19","19","The creation waits in eager expectation for the revelation of the sons of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_20","075_8_20","ROM","8","20","20","For the creation was subjected to futility, not by its own will, but because of the One who subjected it, in hope ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_21","075_8_21","ROM","8","21","21","that the creation itself will be set free from its bondage to decay and brought into the glorious freedom of the children of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_22","075_8_22","ROM","8","22","22","We know that the whole creation has been groaning together in the pains of childbirth until the present time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_23","075_8_23","ROM","8","23","23","Not only that, but we ourselves, who have the firstfruits of the Spirit, groan inwardly as we wait eagerly for our adoption as sons, the redemption of our bodies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_24","075_8_24","ROM","8","24","24","For in this hope we were saved; but hope that is seen is no hope at all. Why would one hope for what he can already see? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_25","075_8_25","ROM","8","25","25","But if we hope for what we do not yet see, we wait for it patiently. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_26","075_8_26","ROM","8","26","26","In the same way, the Spirit helps us in our weaknesses. For we do not know how we ought to pray, but the Spirit Himself intercedes for us with groans too deep for words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_27","075_8_27","ROM","8","27","27","And He who searches our hearts knows the mind of the Spirit, because the Spirit intercedes for the saints according to the will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_28","075_8_28","ROM","8","28","28","And we know that all things work together for the good of those who love Him, who are called according to His purpose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_29","075_8_29","ROM","8","29","29","For those God foreknew, He also predestined to be conformed to the image of His Son, so that He would be the firstborn among many brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_30","075_8_30","ROM","8","30","30","And those He predestined, He also called; those He called, He also justified; those He justified, He also glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_31","075_8_31","ROM","8","31","31","What then shall we say in response to these things? If God is for us, who can be against us? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_32","075_8_32","ROM","8","32","32","He who did not spare His own Son but gave Him up for us all, how will He not also, along with Him, freely give us all things? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_33","075_8_33","ROM","8","33","33","Who will bring any charge against God’s elect? It is God who justifies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_34","075_8_34","ROM","8","34","34","Who is there to condemn us? For Christ, who died, and more than that was raised to life, is at the right hand of God—and He is interceding for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_35","075_8_35","ROM","8","35","35","Who shall separate us from the love of Christ? Shall trouble or distress or persecution or famine or nakedness or danger or sword? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_36","075_8_36","ROM","8","36","36","As it is written: “For Your sake we face death all day long; we are considered as sheep to be slaughtered.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_37","075_8_37","ROM","8","37","37","No, in all these things we are more than conquerors through Him who loved us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_38","075_8_38","ROM","8","38","38","For I am convinced that neither death nor life, neither angels nor principalities nor powers, neither the present nor the future, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM8_39","075_8_39","ROM","8","39","39","neither height nor depth, nor anything else in all creation, will be able to separate us from the love of God that is in Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_1","075_9_1","ROM","9","1","1","I speak the truth in Christ; I am not lying, as confirmed by my conscience in the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_2","075_9_2","ROM","9","2","2","I have deep sorrow and unceasing anguish in my heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_3","075_9_3","ROM","9","3","3","For I could wish that I myself were cursed and cut off from Christ for the sake of my brothers, my own flesh and blood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_4","075_9_4","ROM","9","4","4","the people of Israel. Theirs is the adoption as sons; theirs the divine glory and the covenants; theirs the giving of the law, the temple worship, and the promises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_5","075_9_5","ROM","9","5","5","Theirs are the patriarchs, and from them proceeds the human descent of Christ, who is God over all, forever worthy of praise! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_6","075_9_6","ROM","9","6","6","It is not as though God’s word has failed. For not all who are descended from Israel are Israel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_7","075_9_7","ROM","9","7","7","Nor because they are Abraham’s descendants are they all his children. On the contrary, “Through Isaac your offspring will be reckoned.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_8","075_9_8","ROM","9","8","8","So it is not the children of the flesh who are God’s children, but it is the children of the promise who are regarded as offspring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_9","075_9_9","ROM","9","9","9","For this is what the promise stated: “At the appointed time I will return, and Sarah will have a son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_10","075_9_10","ROM","9","10","10","Not only that, but Rebecca’s children were conceived by one man, our father Isaac. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_11","075_9_11","ROM","9","11","11","Yet before the twins were born or had done anything good or evil, in order that God’s plan of election might stand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_12","075_9_12","ROM","9","12","12","not by works but by Him who calls, she was told, “The older will serve the younger.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_13","075_9_13","ROM","9","13","13","So it is written: “Jacob I loved, but Esau I hated.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_14","075_9_14","ROM","9","14","14","What then shall we say? Is God unjust? Certainly not! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_15","075_9_15","ROM","9","15","15","For He says to Moses: “I will have mercy on whom I have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I have compassion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_16","075_9_16","ROM","9","16","16","So then, it does not depend on man’s desire or effort, but on God’s mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_17","075_9_17","ROM","9","17","17","For the Scripture says to Pharaoh: “I raised you up for this very purpose, that I might display My power in you, and that My name might be proclaimed in all the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_18","075_9_18","ROM","9","18","18","Therefore God has mercy on whom He wants to have mercy, and He hardens whom He wants to harden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_19","075_9_19","ROM","9","19","19","One of you will say to me, “Why does God still find fault? For who can resist His will?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_20","075_9_20","ROM","9","20","20","But who are you, O man, to talk back to God? Shall what is formed say to Him who formed it, “Why did You make me like this?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_21","075_9_21","ROM","9","21","21","Does not the potter have the right to make from the same lump of clay one vessel for special occasions and another for common use? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_22","075_9_22","ROM","9","22","22","What if God, intending to show His wrath and make His power known, bore with great patience the vessels of His wrath, prepared for destruction? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_23","075_9_23","ROM","9","23","23","What if He did this to make the riches of His glory known to the vessels of His mercy, whom He prepared in advance for glory— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_24","075_9_24","ROM","9","24","24","including us, whom He has called not only from the Jews, but also from the Gentiles? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_25","075_9_25","ROM","9","25","25","As He says in Hosea: “I will call them ‘My People’ who are not My people, and I will call her ‘My Beloved’ who is not My beloved,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_26","075_9_26","ROM","9","26","26","and, “It will happen that in the very place where it was said to them, ‘You are not My people,’ they will be called ‘sons of the living God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_27","075_9_27","ROM","9","27","27","Isaiah cries out concerning Israel: “Though the number of the Israelites is like the sand of the sea, only the remnant will be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_28","075_9_28","ROM","9","28","28","For the Lord will carry out His sentence thoroughly and decisively in righteousness, because He will cut short the matter on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_29","075_9_29","ROM","9","29","29","It is just as Isaiah foretold: “Unless the Lord of Hosts had left us descendants, we would have become like Sodom, we would have resembled Gomorrah.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_30","075_9_30","ROM","9","30","30","What then will we say? That the Gentiles, who did not pursue righteousness, have obtained it, a righteousness that is by faith; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_31","075_9_31","ROM","9","31","31","but Israel, who pursued a law of righteousness, has not attained it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_32","075_9_32","ROM","9","32","32","Why not? Because their pursuit was not by faith, but as if it were by works of the law. For they stumbled over the stumbling stone, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM9_33","075_9_33","ROM","9","33","33","as it is written: “See, I lay in Zion a stone of stumbling and a rock of offense; and the one who believes in Him will never be put to shame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_1","075_10_1","ROM","10","1","1","Brothers, my heart’s desire and prayer to God for the Israelites is for their salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_2","075_10_2","ROM","10","2","2","For I testify about them that they are zealous for God, but not on the basis of knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_3","075_10_3","ROM","10","3","3","Because they were ignorant of God’s righteousness and sought to establish their own, they did not submit to God’s righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_4","075_10_4","ROM","10","4","4","For Christ is the end of the law, to bring righteousness to everyone who believes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_5","075_10_5","ROM","10","5","5","For concerning the righteousness that is by the law, Moses writes: “The man who does these things will live by them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_6","075_10_6","ROM","10","6","6","But the righteousness that is by faith says: “Do not say in your heart, ‘Who will ascend into heaven?’ (that is, to bring Christ down) ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_7","075_10_7","ROM","10","7","7","or, ‘Who will descend into the Abyss?’ (that is, to bring Christ up from the dead).” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_8","075_10_8","ROM","10","8","8","But what does it say? “The word is near you; it is in your mouth and in your heart,” that is, the word of faith we are proclaiming: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_9","075_10_9","ROM","10","9","9","that if you confess with your mouth, “Jesus is Lord,” and believe in your heart that God raised Him from the dead, you will be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_10","075_10_10","ROM","10","10","10","For with your heart you believe and are justified, and with your mouth you confess and are saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_11","075_10_11","ROM","10","11","11","It is just as the Scripture says: “Anyone who believes in Him will never be put to shame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_12","075_10_12","ROM","10","12","12","For there is no difference between Jew and Greek: The same Lord is Lord of all, and gives richly to all who call on Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_13","075_10_13","ROM","10","13","13","for, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord will be saved.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_14","075_10_14","ROM","10","14","14","How then will they call on the One in whom they have not believed? And how will they believe in the One of whom they have not heard? And how will they hear without someone to preach? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_15","075_10_15","ROM","10","15","15","And how will they preach unless they are sent? As it is written: “How beautiful are the feet of those who bring good news of peace, who bring good news of good things!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_16","075_10_16","ROM","10","16","16","But not all of them welcomed the good news. For Isaiah says, “Lord, who has believed our message?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_17","075_10_17","ROM","10","17","17","Consequently, faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_18","075_10_18","ROM","10","18","18","But I ask, did they not hear? Indeed they did: “Their voice has gone out into all the earth, their words to the ends of the world.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_19","075_10_19","ROM","10","19","19","I ask instead, did Israel not understand? First, Moses says: “I will make you jealous by those who are not a nation; I will make you angry by a nation without understanding.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_20","075_10_20","ROM","10","20","20","And Isaiah boldly says: “I was found by those who did not seek Me; I revealed Myself to those who did not ask for Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM10_21","075_10_21","ROM","10","21","21","But as for Israel he says: “All day long I have held out My hands to a disobedient and obstinate people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_1","075_11_1","ROM","11","1","1","I ask then, did God reject His people? Certainly not! I am an Israelite myself, a descendant of Abraham, from the tribe of Benjamin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_2","075_11_2","ROM","11","2","2","God did not reject His people, whom He foreknew. Do you not know what the Scripture says about Elijah, how he appealed to God against Israel, saying, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_3","075_11_3","ROM","11","3","3","“Lord, they have killed Your prophets and torn down Your altars. I am the only one left, and they are seeking my life as well”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_4","075_11_4","ROM","11","4","4","And what was the divine reply to him? “I have reserved for Myself seven thousand men who have not bowed the knee to Baal.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_5","075_11_5","ROM","11","5","5","In the same way, at the present time there is a remnant chosen by grace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_6","075_11_6","ROM","11","6","6","And if it is by grace, then it is no longer by works. Otherwise, grace would no longer be grace. But if it is by works, then it is no longer by grace. Otherwise, work would no longer be work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_7","075_11_7","ROM","11","7","7","What then? What Israel was seeking, it failed to obtain, but the elect did. The others were hardened, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_8","075_11_8","ROM","11","8","8","as it is written: “God gave them a spirit of stupor, eyes that could not see, and ears that could not hear, to this very day.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_9","075_11_9","ROM","11","9","9","And David says: “May their table become a snare and a trap, a stumbling block and a retribution to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_10","075_11_10","ROM","11","10","10","May their eyes be darkened so they cannot see, and their backs be bent forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_11","075_11_11","ROM","11","11","11","I ask then, did they stumble so as to fall beyond recovery? Certainly not! However, because of their trespass, salvation has come to the Gentiles to make Israel jealous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_12","075_11_12","ROM","11","12","12","But if their trespass means riches for the world, and their failure means riches for the Gentiles, how much greater riches will their fullness bring! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_13","075_11_13","ROM","11","13","13","I am speaking to you Gentiles. Inasmuch as I am the apostle to the Gentiles, I magnify my ministry ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_14","075_11_14","ROM","11","14","14","in the hope that I may provoke my own people to jealousy and save some of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_15","075_11_15","ROM","11","15","15","For if their rejection is the reconciliation of the world, what will their acceptance be but life from the dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_16","075_11_16","ROM","11","16","16","If the first part of the dough is holy, so is the whole batch; if the root is holy, so are the branches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_17","075_11_17","ROM","11","17","17","Now if some branches have been broken off, and you, a wild olive shoot, have been grafted in among the others to share in the nourishment of the olive root, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_18","075_11_18","ROM","11","18","18","do not boast over those branches. If you do, remember this: You do not support the root, but the root supports you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_19","075_11_19","ROM","11","19","19","You will say then, “Branches were broken off so that I could be grafted in.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_20","075_11_20","ROM","11","20","20","That is correct: They were broken off because of unbelief, but you stand by faith. Do not be arrogant, but be afraid. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_21","075_11_21","ROM","11","21","21","For if God did not spare the natural branches, He will certainly not spare you either. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_22","075_11_22","ROM","11","22","22","Take notice, therefore, of the kindness and severity of God: severity to those who fell, but kindness to you, if you continue in His kindness. Otherwise you also will be cut off. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_23","075_11_23","ROM","11","23","23","And if they also do not persist in unbelief, they will be grafted in, for God is able to graft them in again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_24","075_11_24","ROM","11","24","24","For if you were cut from a wild olive tree, and contrary to nature were grafted into one that is cultivated, how much more readily will these, the natural branches, be grafted into their own olive tree! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_25","075_11_25","ROM","11","25","25","I do not want you to be ignorant of this mystery, brothers, so that you will not be conceited: A hardening in part has come to Israel, until the full number of the Gentiles has come in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_26","075_11_26","ROM","11","26","26","And so all Israel will be saved, as it is written: “The Deliverer will come from Zion; He will remove godlessness from Jacob. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_27","075_11_27","ROM","11","27","27","And this is My covenant with them when I take away their sins.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_28","075_11_28","ROM","11","28","28","Regarding the gospel, they are enemies on your account; but regarding election, they are loved on account of the patriarchs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_29","075_11_29","ROM","11","29","29","For God’s gifts and His call are irrevocable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_30","075_11_30","ROM","11","30","30","For just as you who formerly disobeyed God have now received mercy through their disobedience, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_31","075_11_31","ROM","11","31","31","so they too have now disobeyed, in order that they too may receive mercy through the mercy shown to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_32","075_11_32","ROM","11","32","32","For God has consigned everyone to disobedience so that He may have mercy on everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_33","075_11_33","ROM","11","33","33","O, the depth of the riches of the wisdom and knowledge of God! How unsearchable are His judgments, and untraceable His ways! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_34","075_11_34","ROM","11","34","34","“Who has known the mind of the Lord? Or who has been His counselor?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_35","075_11_35","ROM","11","35","35","“Who has first given to God, that God should repay him?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM11_36","075_11_36","ROM","11","36","36","For from Him and through Him and to Him are all things. To Him be the glory forever! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_1","075_12_1","ROM","12","1","1","Therefore I urge you, brothers, on account of God’s mercy, to offer your bodies as living sacrifices, holy and pleasing to God, which is your spiritual service of worship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_2","075_12_2","ROM","12","2","2","Do not be conformed to this world, but be transformed by the renewing of your mind. Then you will be able to test and approve what is the good, pleasing, and perfect will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_3","075_12_3","ROM","12","3","3","For by the grace given me I say to every one of you: Do not think of yourself more highly than you ought, but think of yourself with sober judgment, according to the measure of faith God has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_4","075_12_4","ROM","12","4","4","Just as each of us has one body with many members, and not all members have the same function, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_5","075_12_5","ROM","12","5","5","so in Christ we who are many are one body, and each member belongs to one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_6","075_12_6","ROM","12","6","6","We have different gifts according to the grace given us. If one’s gift is prophecy, let him use it in proportion to his faith; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_7","075_12_7","ROM","12","7","7","if it is serving, let him serve; if it is teaching, let him teach; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_8","075_12_8","ROM","12","8","8","if it is encouraging, let him encourage; if it is giving, let him give generously; if it is leading, let him lead with diligence; if it is showing mercy, let him do it cheerfully. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_9","075_12_9","ROM","12","9","9","Love must be sincere. Detest what is evil; cling to what is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_10","075_12_10","ROM","12","10","10","Be devoted to one another in brotherly love. Outdo yourselves in honoring one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_11","075_12_11","ROM","12","11","11","Do not let your zeal subside; keep your spiritual fervor, serving the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_12","075_12_12","ROM","12","12","12","Be joyful in hope, patient in affliction, persistent in prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_13","075_12_13","ROM","12","13","13","Share with the saints who are in need. Practice hospitality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_14","075_12_14","ROM","12","14","14","Bless those who persecute you. Bless and do not curse. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_15","075_12_15","ROM","12","15","15","Rejoice with those who rejoice; weep with those who weep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_16","075_12_16","ROM","12","16","16","Live in harmony with one another. Do not be proud, but associate with the lowly. Do not be conceited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_17","075_12_17","ROM","12","17","17","Do not repay anyone evil for evil. Carefully consider what is right in the eyes of everybody. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_18","075_12_18","ROM","12","18","18","If it is possible on your part, live at peace with everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_19","075_12_19","ROM","12","19","19","Do not avenge yourselves, beloved, but leave room for God’s wrath. For it is written: “Vengeance is Mine; I will repay, says the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_20","075_12_20","ROM","12","20","20","Therefore, “If your enemy is hungry, feed him; if he is thirsty, give him a drink. For in so doing, you will heap burning coals on his head.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM12_21","075_12_21","ROM","12","21","21","Do not be overcome by evil, but overcome evil with good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_1","075_13_1","ROM","13","1","1","Everyone must submit himself to the governing authorities, for there is no authority except that which is from God. The authorities that exist have been appointed by God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_2","075_13_2","ROM","13","2","2","Consequently, whoever resists authority is opposing what God has set in place, and those who do so will bring judgment on themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_3","075_13_3","ROM","13","3","3","For rulers are not a terror to good works, but to bad. Do you want to be unafraid of the one in authority? Then do what is right, and you will have his approval. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_4","075_13_4","ROM","13","4","4","For he is God’s servant for your good. But if you do wrong, be afraid, for he does not carry the sword in vain. He is God’s servant, an agent of retribution to the wrongdoer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_5","075_13_5","ROM","13","5","5","Therefore it is necessary to submit to authority, not only to avoid punishment, but also as a matter of conscience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_6","075_13_6","ROM","13","6","6","This is also why you pay taxes. For the authorities are God’s servants, who devote themselves to their work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_7","075_13_7","ROM","13","7","7","Therefore pay everyone what you owe him: taxes to whom taxes are due, revenue to whom revenue is due, respect to whom respect is due, honor to whom honor is due. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_8","075_13_8","ROM","13","8","8","Be indebted to no one, except to one another in love. For he who loves his neighbor has fulfilled the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_9","075_13_9","ROM","13","9","9","The commandments “Do not commit adultery,” “Do not murder,” “Do not steal,” “Do not covet,” and any other commandments, are summed up in this one decree: “Love your neighbor as yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_10","075_13_10","ROM","13","10","10","Love does no wrong to its neighbor. Therefore love is the fulfillment of the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_11","075_13_11","ROM","13","11","11","And do this, understanding the occasion. The hour has come for us to wake up from our slumber, for our salvation is nearer now than when we first believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_12","075_13_12","ROM","13","12","12","The night is nearly over; the day has drawn near. So let us lay aside the deeds of darkness and put on the armor of light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_13","075_13_13","ROM","13","13","13","Let us behave decently, as in the daytime, not in carousing and drunkenness, not in sexual immorality and debauchery, not in dissension and jealousy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM13_14","075_13_14","ROM","13","14","14","Instead, clothe yourselves with the Lord Jesus Christ, and make no provision for the desires of the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_1","075_14_1","ROM","14","1","1","Accept him whose faith is weak, without passing judgment on his opinions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_2","075_14_2","ROM","14","2","2","For one person has faith to eat all things, while another, who is weak, eats only vegetables. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_3","075_14_3","ROM","14","3","3","The one who eats everything must not belittle the one who does not, and the one who does not eat everything must not judge the one who does, for God has accepted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_4","075_14_4","ROM","14","4","4","Who are you to judge someone else’s servant? To his own master he stands or falls. And he will stand, for God is able to make him stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_5","075_14_5","ROM","14","5","5","One person regards a certain day above the others, while someone else considers every day alike. Each one should be fully convinced in his own mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_6","075_14_6","ROM","14","6","6","He who observes a special day does so to the Lord. And he who does not observe the day, to the Lord he does not observe it. He who eats does so to the Lord, for he gives thanks to God; and he who abstains does so to the Lord and gives thanks to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_7","075_14_7","ROM","14","7","7","For none of us lives to himself alone, and none of us dies to himself alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_8","075_14_8","ROM","14","8","8","If we live, we live to the Lord, and if we die, we die to the Lord. So whether we live or die, we belong to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_9","075_14_9","ROM","14","9","9","For this reason Christ died and rose and returned to life, that He might be the Lord of both the dead and the living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_10","075_14_10","ROM","14","10","10","Why, then, do you judge your brother? Or why do you belittle your brother? For we will all stand before the judgment seat of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_11","075_14_11","ROM","14","11","11","It is written: “As surely as I live, says the Lord, every knee will bow before Me; every tongue will confess to God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_12","075_14_12","ROM","14","12","12","So then, each of us will give an account of himself to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_13","075_14_13","ROM","14","13","13","Therefore let us stop judging one another. Instead, make up your mind not to put any stumbling block or obstacle in your brother’s way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_14","075_14_14","ROM","14","14","14","I am convinced and fully persuaded in the Lord Jesus that nothing is unclean in itself. But if anyone regards something as unclean, then for him it is unclean. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_15","075_14_15","ROM","14","15","15","If your brother is distressed by what you eat, you are no longer acting in love. Do not by your eating destroy your brother, for whom Christ died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_16","075_14_16","ROM","14","16","16","Do not allow what you consider good, then, to be spoken of as evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_17","075_14_17","ROM","14","17","17","For the kingdom of God is not a matter of eating and drinking, but of righteousness, peace, and joy in the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_18","075_14_18","ROM","14","18","18","For whoever serves Christ in these things is pleasing to God and approved by men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_19","075_14_19","ROM","14","19","19","So then, let us pursue what leads to peace and to mutual edification. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_20","075_14_20","ROM","14","20","20","Do not destroy the work of God for the sake of food. All food is clean, but it is wrong for a man to let his eating be a stumbling block. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_21","075_14_21","ROM","14","21","21","It is better not to eat meat or drink wine or to do anything to cause your brother to stumble or to be hindered or weakened. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_22","075_14_22","ROM","14","22","22","Keep your belief about such matters between yourself and God. Blessed is the one who does not condemn himself by what he approves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM14_23","075_14_23","ROM","14","23","23","But the one who has doubts is condemned if he eats, because his eating is not from faith; and everything that is not from faith is sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_1","075_15_1","ROM","15","1","1","We who are strong ought to bear with the shortcomings of the weak and not to please ourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_2","075_15_2","ROM","15","2","2","Each of us should please his neighbor for his good, to build him up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_3","075_15_3","ROM","15","3","3","For even Christ did not please Himself, but as it is written: “The insults of those who insult You have fallen on Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_4","075_15_4","ROM","15","4","4","For what was written in the past was written for our instruction, so that through endurance and the encouragement of the Scriptures, we might have hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_5","075_15_5","ROM","15","5","5","Now may the God who gives endurance and encouragement grant you harmony with one another in Christ Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_6","075_15_6","ROM","15","6","6","so that with one mind and one voice you may glorify the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_7","075_15_7","ROM","15","7","7","Accept one another, then, just as Christ accepted you, in order to bring glory to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_8","075_15_8","ROM","15","8","8","Now I tell you that Christ Jesus has become a servant of the circumcised on behalf of God’s truth, to confirm the promises made to the patriarchs, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_9","075_15_9","ROM","15","9","9","so that the Gentiles may glorify God for His mercy. As it is written: “Therefore I will praise You among the Gentiles; I will sing hymns to Your name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_10","075_15_10","ROM","15","10","10","Again, it says: “Rejoice, O Gentiles, with His people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_11","075_15_11","ROM","15","11","11","And again: “Praise the Lord, all you Gentiles, and extol Him, all you peoples.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_12","075_15_12","ROM","15","12","12","And once more, Isaiah says: “The Root of Jesse will appear, One who will arise to rule over the Gentiles; in Him the Gentiles will put their hope.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_13","075_15_13","ROM","15","13","13","Now may the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace as you believe in Him, so that you may overflow with hope by the power of the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_14","075_15_14","ROM","15","14","14","I myself am convinced, my brothers, that you yourselves are full of goodness, brimming with knowledge, and able to instruct others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_15","075_15_15","ROM","15","15","15","However, brothers, I have written you a bold reminder on some points, because of the grace God has given me ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_16","075_15_16","ROM","15","16","16","to be a minister of Jesus Christ to the Gentiles in the priestly service of the gospel of God, so that the Gentiles might become an offering acceptable to God, sanctified by the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_17","075_15_17","ROM","15","17","17","Therefore I exult in Christ Jesus in my service to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_18","075_15_18","ROM","15","18","18","I will not presume to speak of anything except what Christ has accomplished through me in leading the Gentiles to obedience by word and deed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_19","075_15_19","ROM","15","19","19","by the power of signs and wonders, and by the power of the Spirit of God. So from Jerusalem all the way around to Illyricum, I have fully proclaimed the gospel of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_20","075_15_20","ROM","15","20","20","In this way I have aspired to preach the gospel where Christ was not known, so that I would not be building on someone else’s foundation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_21","075_15_21","ROM","15","21","21","Rather, as it is written: “Those who were not told about Him will see, and those who have not heard will understand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_22","075_15_22","ROM","15","22","22","That is why I have often been hindered from coming to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_23","075_15_23","ROM","15","23","23","But now that there are no further opportunities for me in these regions, and since I have longed for many years to visit you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_24","075_15_24","ROM","15","24","24","I hope to come to see you on my way to Spain. And after I have enjoyed your company for a while, you can equip me for my journey. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_25","075_15_25","ROM","15","25","25","Now, however, I am on my way to Jerusalem to serve the saints there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_26","075_15_26","ROM","15","26","26","For Macedonia and Achaia were pleased to make a contribution for the poor among the saints in Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_27","075_15_27","ROM","15","27","27","They were pleased to do it, and indeed they owe it to them. For if the Gentiles have shared in their spiritual blessings, they are obligated to minister to them with material blessings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_28","075_15_28","ROM","15","28","28","So after I have completed this service and have safely delivered this bounty to them, I will set off to Spain by way of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_29","075_15_29","ROM","15","29","29","I know that when I come to you, I will come in the fullness of the blessing of the gospel of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_30","075_15_30","ROM","15","30","30","Now I urge you, brothers, by our Lord Jesus Christ and by the love of the Spirit, to join me in my struggle by praying to God for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_31","075_15_31","ROM","15","31","31","Pray that I may be delivered from the unbelievers in Judea, and that my service in Jerusalem may be acceptable to the saints there, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_32","075_15_32","ROM","15","32","32","so that by God’s will I may come to you with joy and together with you be refreshed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM15_33","075_15_33","ROM","15","33","33","The God of peace be with all of you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_1","075_16_1","ROM","16","1","1","I commend to you our sister Phoebe, a servant of the church in Cenchrea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_2","075_16_2","ROM","16","2","2","Welcome her in the Lord in a manner worthy of the saints, and assist her with anything she may need from you. For she has been a great help to many people, including me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_3","075_16_3","ROM","16","3","3","Greet Prisca and Aquila, my fellow workers in Christ Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_4","075_16_4","ROM","16","4","4","who have risked their lives for me. Not only I but all the churches of the Gentiles are grateful to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_5","075_16_5","ROM","16","5","5","Greet also the church that meets at their house. Greet my beloved Epenetus, who was the first convert to Christ in Achaia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_6","075_16_6","ROM","16","6","6","Greet Mary, who has worked very hard for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_7","075_16_7","ROM","16","7","7","Greet Andronicus and Junia, my fellow countrymen and fellow prisoners. They are outstanding among the apostles, and they were in Christ before I was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_8","075_16_8","ROM","16","8","8","Greet Amplias, my beloved in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_9","075_16_9","ROM","16","9","9","Greet Urbanus, our fellow worker in Christ, and my beloved Stachys. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_10","075_16_10","ROM","16","10","10","Greet Apelles, who is approved in Christ. Greet those who belong to the household of Aristobulus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_11","075_16_11","ROM","16","11","11","Greet Herodion, my fellow countryman. Greet those from the household of Narcissus who are in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_12","075_16_12","ROM","16","12","12","Greet Tryphena and Tryphosa, women who have worked hard in the Lord. Greet my beloved Persis, who has worked very hard in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_13","075_16_13","ROM","16","13","13","Greet Rufus, chosen in the Lord, and his mother, who has been a mother to me as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_14","075_16_14","ROM","16","14","14","Greet Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermas, Patrobas, Hermes, and the brothers with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_15","075_16_15","ROM","16","15","15","Greet Philologus and Julia, Nereus and his sister, and Olympas and all the saints with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_16","075_16_16","ROM","16","16","16","Greet one another with a holy kiss. The churches of Christ send you greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_17","075_16_17","ROM","16","17","17","Now I urge you, brothers, to watch out for those who create divisions and obstacles that are contrary to the teaching you have learned. Turn away from them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_18","075_16_18","ROM","16","18","18","For such people are not serving our Lord Jesus Christ, but their own appetites. By smooth talk and flattery they deceive the hearts of the naive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_19","075_16_19","ROM","16","19","19","Everyone has heard about your obedience, so I rejoice over you. But I want you to be wise indeed about what is good and innocent about what is evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_20","075_16_20","ROM","16","20","20","The God of peace will soon crush Satan under your feet. The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_21","075_16_21","ROM","16","21","21","Timothy, my fellow worker, sends you greetings, as do Lucius, Jason, and Sosipater, my fellow countrymen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_22","075_16_22","ROM","16","22","22","I, Tertius, who wrote down this letter, greet you in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_23","075_16_23","ROM","16","23","23","Gaius, who has hosted me and all the church, sends you greetings. Erastus, the city treasurer, sends you greetings, as does our brother Quartus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_24","075_16_24","ROM","16","24","24","May the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you all. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_25","075_16_25","ROM","16","25","25","Now to Him who is able to strengthen you by my gospel and by the proclamation of Jesus Christ, according to the revelation of the mystery concealed for ages past ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_26","075_16_26","ROM","16","26","26","but now revealed and made known through the writings of the prophets by the command of the eternal God, in order to lead all nations to the obedience that comes from faith— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RM16_27","075_16_27","ROM","16","27","27","to the only wise God be glory forever through Jesus Christ! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_1","076_1_1","1CO","1","1","1","Paul, called to be an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, and our brother Sosthenes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_2","076_1_2","1CO","1","2","2","To the church of God in Corinth, to those sanctified in Christ Jesus and called to be holy, together with all those everywhere who call on the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, their Lord and ours: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_3","076_1_3","1CO","1","3","3","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_4","076_1_4","1CO","1","4","4","I always thank my God for you because of the grace He has given you in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_5","076_1_5","1CO","1","5","5","For in Him you have been enriched in every way, in all speech and all knowledge, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_6","076_1_6","1CO","1","6","6","because our testimony about Christ was confirmed in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_7","076_1_7","1CO","1","7","7","Therefore you do not lack any spiritual gift as you eagerly await the revelation of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_8","076_1_8","1CO","1","8","8","He will sustain you to the end, so that you will be blameless on the day of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_9","076_1_9","1CO","1","9","9","God, who has called you into fellowship with His Son Jesus Christ our Lord, is faithful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_10","076_1_10","1CO","1","10","10","I appeal to you, brothers, in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, that all of you agree together, so that there may be no divisions among you and that you may be united in mind and conviction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_11","076_1_11","1CO","1","11","11","My brothers, some from Chloe’s household have informed me that there are quarrels among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_12","076_1_12","1CO","1","12","12","What I mean is this: Individuals among you are saying, “I follow Paul,” “I follow Apollos,” “I follow Cephas,” or “I follow Christ.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_13","076_1_13","1CO","1","13","13","Is Christ divided? Was Paul crucified for you? Were you baptized into the name of Paul? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_14","076_1_14","1CO","1","14","14","I thank God that I did not baptize any of you except Crispus and Gaius, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_15","076_1_15","1CO","1","15","15","so no one can say that I baptized into my name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_16","076_1_16","1CO","1","16","16","Yes, I also baptized the household of Stephanas; beyond that I do not remember if I baptized anyone else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_17","076_1_17","1CO","1","17","17","For Christ did not send me to baptize, but to preach the gospel, not with words of wisdom, lest the cross of Christ be emptied of its power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_18","076_1_18","1CO","1","18","18","For the message of the cross is foolishness to those who are perishing, but to us who are being saved it is the power of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_19","076_1_19","1CO","1","19","19","For it is written: “I will destroy the wisdom of the wise; the intelligence of the intelligent I will frustrate.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_20","076_1_20","1CO","1","20","20","Where is the wise man? Where is the scribe? Where is the philosopher of this age? Has not God made foolish the wisdom of this world? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_21","076_1_21","1CO","1","21","21","For since in the wisdom of God the world through its wisdom did not know Him, God was pleased through the foolishness of what was preached to save those who believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_22","076_1_22","1CO","1","22","22","Jews demand a sign and Greeks search for wisdom, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_23","076_1_23","1CO","1","23","23","but we preach Christ crucified, a stumbling block to Jews and foolishness to Greeks, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_24","076_1_24","1CO","1","24","24","but to those who are called, both Jews and Greeks, Christ the power of God and the wisdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_25","076_1_25","1CO","1","25","25","For the foolishness of God is wiser than man’s wisdom, and the weakness of God is stronger than man’s strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_26","076_1_26","1CO","1","26","26","Brothers, consider the time of your calling: Not many of you were wise by human standards; not many were powerful; not many were of noble birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_27","076_1_27","1CO","1","27","27","But God chose the foolish things of the world to shame the wise; God chose the weak things of the world to shame the strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_28","076_1_28","1CO","1","28","28","He chose the lowly and despised things of the world, and the things that are not, to nullify the things that are, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_29","076_1_29","1CO","1","29","29","so that no one may boast in His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_30","076_1_30","1CO","1","30","30","It is because of Him that you are in Christ Jesus, who has become for us wisdom from God: our righteousness, holiness, and redemption. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C11_31","076_1_31","1CO","1","31","31","Therefore, as it is written: “Let him who boasts boast in the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_1","076_2_1","1CO","2","1","1","When I came to you, brothers, I did not come with eloquence or wisdom as I proclaimed to you the testimony about God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_2","076_2_2","1CO","2","2","2","For I resolved to know nothing while I was with you except Jesus Christ and Him crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_3","076_2_3","1CO","2","3","3","I came to you in weakness and fear, and with much trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_4","076_2_4","1CO","2","4","4","My message and my preaching were not with persuasive words of human wisdom, but with a demonstration of the Spirit’s power, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_5","076_2_5","1CO","2","5","5","so that your faith would not rest on men’s wisdom, but on God’s power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_6","076_2_6","1CO","2","6","6","Among the mature, however, we speak a message of wisdom—but not the wisdom of this age or of the rulers of this age, who are coming to nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_7","076_2_7","1CO","2","7","7","No, we speak of the mysterious and hidden wisdom of God, which He destined for our glory before time began. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_8","076_2_8","1CO","2","8","8","None of the rulers of this age understood it. For if they had, they would not have crucified the Lord of glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_9","076_2_9","1CO","2","9","9","Rather, as it is written: “No eye has seen, no ear has heard, no heart has imagined, what God has prepared for those who love Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_10","076_2_10","1CO","2","10","10","But God has revealed it to us by His Spirit. The Spirit searches all things, even the deep things of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_11","076_2_11","1CO","2","11","11","For who among men knows the thoughts of man except his own spirit within him? So too, no one knows the thoughts of God except the Spirit of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_12","076_2_12","1CO","2","12","12","We have not received the spirit of the world, but the Spirit who is from God, that we may understand what God has freely given us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_13","076_2_13","1CO","2","13","13","And this is what we speak, not in words taught us by human wisdom, but in words taught by the Holy Spirit, expressing spiritual truths in spiritual words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_14","076_2_14","1CO","2","14","14","The natural man does not accept the things that come from the Spirit of God. For they are foolishness to him, and he cannot understand them, because they are spiritually discerned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_15","076_2_15","1CO","2","15","15","The spiritual man judges all things, but he himself is not subject to anyone’s judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C12_16","076_2_16","1CO","2","16","16","“For who has known the mind of the Lord, so as to instruct Him?” But we have the mind of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_1","076_3_1","1CO","3","1","1","Brothers, I could not address you as spiritual, but as worldly—as infants in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_2","076_3_2","1CO","3","2","2","I gave you milk, not solid food, for you were not yet ready for solid food. In fact, you are still not ready, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_3","076_3_3","1CO","3","3","3","for you are still worldly. For since there is jealousy and dissension and division among you, are you not worldly? Are you not walking in the way of man? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_4","076_3_4","1CO","3","4","4","For when one of you says, “I follow Paul,” and another, “I follow Apollos,” are you not of the flesh? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_5","076_3_5","1CO","3","5","5","Who then is Paul? And who is Apollos? They are servants through whom you believed, as the Lord has assigned to each his role. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_6","076_3_6","1CO","3","6","6","I planted the seed and Apollos watered it, but God made it grow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_7","076_3_7","1CO","3","7","7","So neither he who plants nor he who waters is anything, but only God, who makes things grow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_8","076_3_8","1CO","3","8","8","He who plants and he who waters are one in purpose, and each will be rewarded according to his own labor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_9","076_3_9","1CO","3","9","9","For we are God’s fellow workers; you are God’s field, God’s building. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_10","076_3_10","1CO","3","10","10","By the grace God has given me, I laid a foundation as an expert builder, and someone else is building on it. But each one must be careful how he builds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_11","076_3_11","1CO","3","11","11","For no one can lay a foundation other than the one already laid, which is Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_12","076_3_12","1CO","3","12","12","If anyone builds on this foundation using gold, silver, precious stones, wood, hay, or straw, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_13","076_3_13","1CO","3","13","13","his workmanship will be evident, because the Day will bring it to light. It will be revealed with fire, and the fire will prove the quality of each man’s work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_14","076_3_14","1CO","3","14","14","If what he has built survives, he will receive a reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_15","076_3_15","1CO","3","15","15","If it is burned up, he will suffer loss. He himself will be saved, but only as if through the flames. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_16","076_3_16","1CO","3","16","16","Do you not know that you yourselves are God’s temple, and that God’s Spirit dwells in you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_17","076_3_17","1CO","3","17","17","If anyone destroys God’s temple, God will destroy him; for God’s temple is holy, and you are that temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_18","076_3_18","1CO","3","18","18","Let no one deceive himself. If any of you thinks he is wise in this age, he should become a fool, so that he may become wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_19","076_3_19","1CO","3","19","19","For the wisdom of this world is foolishness in God’s sight. As it is written: “He catches the wise in their craftiness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_20","076_3_20","1CO","3","20","20","And again, “The Lord knows that the thoughts of the wise are futile.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_21","076_3_21","1CO","3","21","21","Therefore, stop boasting in men. All things are yours, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_22","076_3_22","1CO","3","22","22","whether Paul or Apollos or Cephas or the world or life or death or the present or the future. All of them belong to you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C13_23","076_3_23","1CO","3","23","23","and you belong to Christ, and Christ belongs to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_1","076_4_1","1CO","4","1","1","So then, men ought to regard us as servants of Christ and stewards of the mysteries of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_2","076_4_2","1CO","4","2","2","Now it is required of stewards that they be found faithful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_3","076_4_3","1CO","4","3","3","I care very little, however, if I am judged by you or by any human court. In fact, I do not even judge myself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_4","076_4_4","1CO","4","4","4","My conscience is clear, but that does not vindicate me. It is the Lord who judges me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_5","076_4_5","1CO","4","5","5","Therefore judge nothing before the appointed time; wait until the Lord comes. He will bring to light what is hidden in darkness and will expose the motives of men’s hearts. At that time each will receive his praise from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_6","076_4_6","1CO","4","6","6","Brothers, I have applied these things to myself and Apollos for your benefit, so that you may learn from us not to think beyond what is written. Then you will not take pride in one man over another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_7","076_4_7","1CO","4","7","7","For who makes you so superior? What do you have that you did not receive? And if you did receive it, why do you boast as though you did not? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_8","076_4_8","1CO","4","8","8","Already you have all you want. Already you have become rich. Without us, you have become kings. How I wish you really were kings, so that we might be kings with you! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_9","076_4_9","1CO","4","9","9","For it seems to me that God has displayed us apostles at the end of the procession, like prisoners appointed for death. We have become a spectacle to the whole world, to angels as well as to men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_10","076_4_10","1CO","4","10","10","We are fools for Christ, but you are wise in Christ. We are weak, but you are strong. You are honored, but we are dishonored. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_11","076_4_11","1CO","4","11","11","To this very hour we are hungry and thirsty, we are poorly clothed, we are brutally treated, we are homeless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_12","076_4_12","1CO","4","12","12","We work hard with our own hands. When we are vilified, we bless; when we are persecuted, we endure it; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_13","076_4_13","1CO","4","13","13","when we are slandered, we answer gently. Up to this moment we have become the scum of the earth, the refuse of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_14","076_4_14","1CO","4","14","14","I am not writing this to shame you, but to warn you as my beloved children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_15","076_4_15","1CO","4","15","15","Even if you have ten thousand guardians in Christ, you do not have many fathers; for in Christ Jesus I became your father through the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_16","076_4_16","1CO","4","16","16","Therefore I urge you to imitate me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_17","076_4_17","1CO","4","17","17","That is why I have sent you Timothy, my beloved and faithful child in the Lord. He will remind you of my way of life in Christ, which is exactly what I teach everywhere in every church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_18","076_4_18","1CO","4","18","18","Some of you have become arrogant, as if I were not coming to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_19","076_4_19","1CO","4","19","19","But I will come to you shortly, if the Lord is willing, and then I will find out not only what these arrogant people are saying, but what power they have. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_20","076_4_20","1CO","4","20","20","For the kingdom of God is not a matter of talk but of power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C14_21","076_4_21","1CO","4","21","21","Which do you prefer? Shall I come to you with a rod, or in love and with a gentle spirit? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_1","076_5_1","1CO","5","1","1","It is actually reported that there is sexual immorality among you, and of a kind that is not even named among pagans: A man has his father’s wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_2","076_5_2","1CO","5","2","2","And you are proud! Shouldn’t you rather have been stricken with grief and have removed from your fellowship the man who did this? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_3","076_5_3","1CO","5","3","3","Although I am absent from you in body, I am present with you in spirit, and I have already pronounced judgment on the one who did this, just as if I were present. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_4","076_5_4","1CO","5","4","4","When you are assembled in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ and I am with you in spirit, along with the power of our Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_5","076_5_5","1CO","5","5","5","hand this man over to Satan for the destruction of the flesh, so that his spirit may be saved on the Day of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_6","076_5_6","1CO","5","6","6","Your boasting is not good. Do you not know that a little leaven works through the whole batch of dough? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_7","076_5_7","1CO","5","7","7","Get rid of the old leaven, that you may be a new unleavened batch, as you really are. For Christ, our Passover lamb, has been sacrificed for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_8","076_5_8","1CO","5","8","8","Therefore let us keep the feast, not with the old bread, leavened with malice and wickedness, but with the unleavened bread of sincerity and of truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_9","076_5_9","1CO","5","9","9","I wrote you in my letter not to associate with sexually immoral people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_10","076_5_10","1CO","5","10","10","I was not including the sexually immoral of this world, or the greedy or swindlers or idolaters. In that case you would have to leave this world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_11","076_5_11","1CO","5","11","11","But now I am writing you not to associate with anyone who claims to be a brother but is sexually immoral or greedy, an idolater or a verbal abuser, a drunkard or a swindler. With such a man do not even eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_12","076_5_12","1CO","5","12","12","What business of mine is it to judge those outside the church? Are you not to judge those inside? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C15_13","076_5_13","1CO","5","13","13","God will judge those outside. “Expel the wicked man from among you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_1","076_6_1","1CO","6","1","1","If any of you has a grievance against another, how dare he go to law before the unrighteous instead of before the saints! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_2","076_6_2","1CO","6","2","2","Do you not know that the saints will judge the world? And if you are to judge the world, are you not competent to judge trivial cases? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_3","076_6_3","1CO","6","3","3","Do you not know that we will judge angels? How much more the things of this life! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_4","076_6_4","1CO","6","4","4","So if you need to settle everyday matters, do you appoint as judges those of no standing in the church? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_5","076_6_5","1CO","6","5","5","I say this to your shame. Is there really not even one among you wise enough to arbitrate between his brothers? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_6","076_6_6","1CO","6","6","6","Instead, one brother goes to law against another, and this in front of unbelievers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_7","076_6_7","1CO","6","7","7","The very fact that you have lawsuits among you means that you are thoroughly defeated already. Why not rather be wronged? Why not rather be cheated? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_8","076_6_8","1CO","6","8","8","Instead, you yourselves cheat and do wrong, even against your own brothers! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_9","076_6_9","1CO","6","9","9","Do you not know that the wicked will not inherit the kingdom of God? Do not be deceived: Neither the sexually immoral, nor idolaters, nor adulterers, nor men who submit to or perform homosexual acts, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_10","076_6_10","1CO","6","10","10","nor the covetous, nor thieves, nor drunkards, nor verbal abusers, nor swindlers, will inherit the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_11","076_6_11","1CO","6","11","11","And that is what some of you were. But you were washed, you were sanctified, you were justified, in the name of the Lord Jesus and by the Spirit of our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_12","076_6_12","1CO","6","12","12","“Everything is permissible for me,” but not everything is beneficial. “Everything is permissible for me,” but I will not be mastered by anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_13","076_6_13","1CO","6","13","13","“Food for the stomach and the stomach for food,” but God will destroy them both. The body is not intended for sexual immorality, but for the Lord, and the Lord for the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_14","076_6_14","1CO","6","14","14","By His power God raised the Lord from the dead, and He will raise us also. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_15","076_6_15","1CO","6","15","15","Do you not know that your bodies are members of Christ? Shall I then take the members of Christ and unite them with a prostitute? Never! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_16","076_6_16","1CO","6","16","16","Don’t you know that he who unites himself with a prostitute is one with her in body? For it is said, “The two will become one flesh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_17","076_6_17","1CO","6","17","17","But he who unites himself with the Lord is one with Him in spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_18","076_6_18","1CO","6","18","18","Flee from sexual immorality. Every other sin a man can commit is outside his body, but he who sins sexually sins against his own body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_19","076_6_19","1CO","6","19","19","Do you not know that your body is a temple of the Holy Spirit who is in you, whom you have received from God? You are not your own; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C16_20","076_6_20","1CO","6","20","20","you were bought at a price. Therefore glorify God with your body and with your spirit, which belong to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_1","076_7_1","1CO","7","1","1","Now for the matters about which you wrote me: It is good to abstain from sexual relations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_2","076_7_2","1CO","7","2","2","But because there is so much sexual immorality, each man should have his own wife, and each woman her own husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_3","076_7_3","1CO","7","3","3","The husband should render the affection due to his wife, and likewise the wife to her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_4","076_7_4","1CO","7","4","4","The wife does not have authority over her own body, but the husband. Likewise the husband does not have authority over his own body, but the wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_5","076_7_5","1CO","7","5","5","Do not deprive each other, except by mutual consent and for a time, so you may devote yourselves to fasting and to prayer. Then come together again, so that Satan will not tempt you through your lack of self-control. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_6","076_7_6","1CO","7","6","6","I say this as a concession, not as a command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_7","076_7_7","1CO","7","7","7","For I wish that all men were as I am. But each man has his own gift from God, one in this way and another in that. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_8","076_7_8","1CO","7","8","8","Now to the unmarried and widows I say this: It is good for them to remain unmarried, as I am. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_9","076_7_9","1CO","7","9","9","But if they cannot control themselves, let them marry. For it is better to marry than to burn with passion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_10","076_7_10","1CO","7","10","10","To the married I give this command (not I, but the Lord): A wife must not separate from her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_11","076_7_11","1CO","7","11","11","But if she does, she must remain unmarried or else be reconciled to her husband. And a husband must not divorce his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_12","076_7_12","1CO","7","12","12","To the rest I say this (I, not the Lord): If a brother has an unbelieving wife and she is willing to live with him, he must not divorce her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_13","076_7_13","1CO","7","13","13","And if a woman has an unbelieving husband and he is willing to live with her, she must not divorce him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_14","076_7_14","1CO","7","14","14","For the unbelieving husband is sanctified through his believing wife, and the unbelieving wife is sanctified through her believing husband. Otherwise your children would be unclean, but now they are holy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_15","076_7_15","1CO","7","15","15","But if the unbeliever leaves, let him go. The believing brother or sister is not bound in such cases. God has called us to live in peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_16","076_7_16","1CO","7","16","16","How do you know, wife, whether you will save your husband? Or how do you know, husband, whether you will save your wife? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_17","076_7_17","1CO","7","17","17","Regardless, each one should lead the life that God has assigned to him and to which the Lord has called him. This is what I prescribe in all the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_18","076_7_18","1CO","7","18","18","Was a man already circumcised when he was called? He should not become uncircumcised. Was a man still uncircumcised when called? He should not be circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_19","076_7_19","1CO","7","19","19","Circumcision is nothing and uncircumcision is nothing. Keeping God’s commandments is what counts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_20","076_7_20","1CO","7","20","20","Each one should remain in the situation he was in when he was called. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_21","076_7_21","1CO","7","21","21","Were you a slave when you were called? Do not let it concern you—but if you can gain your freedom, take the opportunity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_22","076_7_22","1CO","7","22","22","For he who was a slave when he was called by the Lord is the Lord’s freedman. Conversely, he who was a free man when he was called is Christ’s slave. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_23","076_7_23","1CO","7","23","23","You were bought at a price; do not become slaves of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_24","076_7_24","1CO","7","24","24","Brothers, each one should remain in the situation he was in when God called him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_25","076_7_25","1CO","7","25","25","Now about virgins, I have no command from the Lord, but I give a judgment as one who by the Lord’s mercy is trustworthy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_26","076_7_26","1CO","7","26","26","Because of the present crisis, I think it is good for a man to remain as he is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_27","076_7_27","1CO","7","27","27","Are you committed to a wife? Do not seek to be released. Are you free of commitment? Do not look for a wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_28","076_7_28","1CO","7","28","28","But if you do marry, you have not sinned. And if a virgin marries, she has not sinned. But those who marry will face troubles in this life, and I want to spare you this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_29","076_7_29","1CO","7","29","29","What I am saying, brothers, is that the time is short. From now on those who have wives should live as if they had none; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_30","076_7_30","1CO","7","30","30","those who weep, as if they did not; those who are joyful, as if they were not; those who make a purchase, as if they had nothing; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_31","076_7_31","1CO","7","31","31","and those who use the things of this world, as if not dependent on them. For this world in its present form is passing away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_32","076_7_32","1CO","7","32","32","I want you to be free from concern. The unmarried man is concerned about the work of the Lord, how he will please the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_33","076_7_33","1CO","7","33","33","But the married man is concerned about the affairs of this world, how he will please his wife. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_34","076_7_34","1CO","7","34","34","And there is a difference between the wife and the virgin. The unmarried woman is concerned about the work of the Lord, how she can be holy in both body and spirit. But the married woman is concerned about the affairs of this world, how she will please her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_35","076_7_35","1CO","7","35","35","I am saying this for your own good, not to restrict you, but in order to promote proper decorum and undivided devotion to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_36","076_7_36","1CO","7","36","36","However, if someone thinks he is acting inappropriately toward his betrothed, and if she is beyond her youth and they ought to marry, let him do as he wishes; he is not sinning; they should get married. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_37","076_7_37","1CO","7","37","37","But the man who is firmly established in his heart and under no constraint, with control over his will and resolve in his heart not to marry the virgin, he will do well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_38","076_7_38","1CO","7","38","38","So then, he who marries her does well, but he who does not marry her does even better. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_39","076_7_39","1CO","7","39","39","A wife is bound by law to her husband as long as he lives. But if her husband dies, she is free to marry anyone she wishes, as long as he belongs to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C17_40","076_7_40","1CO","7","40","40","In my judgment, however, she is happier if she remains as she is. And I think that I too have the Spirit of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_1","076_8_1","1CO","8","1","1","Now about food sacrificed to idols: We know that we all have knowledge. Knowledge puffs up, but love builds up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_2","076_8_2","1CO","8","2","2","The one who thinks he knows something does not yet know as he ought to know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_3","076_8_3","1CO","8","3","3","But the one who loves God is known by God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_4","076_8_4","1CO","8","4","4","So about eating food sacrificed to idols: We know that an idol is nothing at all in the world, and that there is no other God but one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_5","076_8_5","1CO","8","5","5","For even if there are so-called gods, whether in heaven or on earth (as there are many so-called gods and lords), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_6","076_8_6","1CO","8","6","6","yet for us there is but one God, the Father, from whom all things came and for whom we exist. And there is but one Lord, Jesus Christ, through whom all things came and through whom we exist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_7","076_8_7","1CO","8","7","7","But not everyone has this knowledge. Some people with consciousness of the idol still eat such food as if it were sacrificed to an idol. And since their conscience is weak, it is defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_8","076_8_8","1CO","8","8","8","But food does not bring us closer to God: We are no better if we do not eat, and no worse if we do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_9","076_8_9","1CO","8","9","9","Be careful, however, that your freedom does not become a stumbling block to the weak. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_10","076_8_10","1CO","8","10","10","For if someone with a weak conscience sees you who are well informed eating in an idol’s temple, will he not be encouraged to eat food sacrificed to idols? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_11","076_8_11","1CO","8","11","11","Should this weak brother, for whom Christ died, be destroyed by your knowledge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_12","076_8_12","1CO","8","12","12","By sinning against your brothers in this way and wounding their weak conscience, you sin against Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C18_13","076_8_13","1CO","8","13","13","Therefore, if what I eat causes my brother to stumble, I will never eat meat again, so that I will not cause him to stumble. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_1","076_9_1","1CO","9","1","1","Am I not an apostle? Am I not free? Have I not seen Jesus Christ our Lord? Are you yourselves not my workmanship in the Lord? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_2","076_9_2","1CO","9","2","2","Even if I am not an apostle to others, surely I am to you. For you are the seal of my apostleship in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_3","076_9_3","1CO","9","3","3","This is my defense to those who scrutinize me: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_4","076_9_4","1CO","9","4","4","Have we no right to food and to drink? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_5","076_9_5","1CO","9","5","5","Have we no right to take along a believing wife, as do the other apostles and the Lord’s brothers and Cephas? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_6","076_9_6","1CO","9","6","6","Or are Barnabas and I the only apostles who must work for a living? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_7","076_9_7","1CO","9","7","7","Who serves as a soldier at his own expense? Who plants a vineyard and does not eat of its fruit? Or who tends a flock and does not drink of its milk? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_8","076_9_8","1CO","9","8","8","Do I say this from a human perspective? Doesn’t the Law say the same thing? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_9","076_9_9","1CO","9","9","9","For it is written in the Law of Moses: “Do not muzzle an ox while it is treading out the grain.” Is it about oxen that God is concerned? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_10","076_9_10","1CO","9","10","10","Isn’t He actually speaking on our behalf? Indeed, this was written for us, because when the plowman plows and the thresher threshes, they should also expect to share in the harvest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_11","076_9_11","1CO","9","11","11","If we have sown spiritual seed among you, is it too much for us to reap a material harvest from you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_12","076_9_12","1CO","9","12","12","If others have this right to your support, shouldn’t we have it all the more? But we did not exercise this right. Instead, we put up with anything rather than hinder the gospel of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_13","076_9_13","1CO","9","13","13","Do you not know that those who work in the temple eat of its food, and those who serve at the altar partake of its offerings? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_14","076_9_14","1CO","9","14","14","In the same way, the Lord has prescribed that those who preach the gospel should receive their living from the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_15","076_9_15","1CO","9","15","15","But I have not used any of these rights. And I am not writing this to suggest that something be done for me. Indeed, I would rather die than let anyone nullify my boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_16","076_9_16","1CO","9","16","16","Yet when I preach the gospel, I have no reason to boast, because I am obligated to preach. Woe to me if I do not preach the gospel! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_17","076_9_17","1CO","9","17","17","If my preaching is voluntary, I have a reward. But if it is not voluntary, I am still entrusted with a responsibility. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_18","076_9_18","1CO","9","18","18","What then is my reward? That in preaching the gospel I may offer the gospel of Christ free of charge, and so not use up my rights in preaching it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_19","076_9_19","1CO","9","19","19","Though I am free of obligation to anyone, I make myself a slave to everyone, to win as many as possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_20","076_9_20","1CO","9","20","20","To the Jews I became like a Jew, to win the Jews. To those under the law I became like one under the law, to win those under the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_21","076_9_21","1CO","9","21","21","To those without the law I became like one without the law (though I am not outside the law of God but am under the law of Christ), to win those without the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_22","076_9_22","1CO","9","22","22","To the weak I became like one who is weak, to win the weak. I have become all things to all people so that by all possible means I might save some. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_23","076_9_23","1CO","9","23","23","I do this for the sake of the gospel, so that I may share in its blessings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_24","076_9_24","1CO","9","24","24","Do you not know that in a race all the runners run, but only one receives the prize? Run in such a way as to take the prize. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_25","076_9_25","1CO","9","25","25","Everyone who competes in the games trains with strict discipline. They do it for a crown that is perishable, but we do it for a crown that is imperishable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_26","076_9_26","1CO","9","26","26","Therefore I do not run aimlessly; I do not fight like I am beating the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C19_27","076_9_27","1CO","9","27","27","No, I discipline my body and make it my slave, so that after I have preached to others, I myself will not be disqualified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_1","076_10_1","1CO","10","1","1","Now I do not want you to be unaware, brothers, that our forefathers were all under the cloud, and that they all passed through the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_2","076_10_2","1CO","10","2","2","They were all baptized into Moses in the cloud and in the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_3","076_10_3","1CO","10","3","3","They all ate the same spiritual food ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_4","076_10_4","1CO","10","4","4","and drank the same spiritual drink; for they drank from the spiritual rock that accompanied them, and that rock was Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_5","076_10_5","1CO","10","5","5","Nevertheless, God was not pleased with most of them, for they were struck down in the wilderness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_6","076_10_6","1CO","10","6","6","These things took place as examples to keep us from craving evil things as they did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_7","076_10_7","1CO","10","7","7","Do not be idolaters, as some of them were. As it is written: “The people sat down to eat and to drink, and got up to indulge in revelry.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_8","076_10_8","1CO","10","8","8","We should not commit sexual immorality, as some of them did, and in one day twenty-three thousand of them died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_9","076_10_9","1CO","10","9","9","We should not test Christ, as some of them also did, and were killed by snakes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_10","076_10_10","1CO","10","10","10","And do not complain, as also some of them did, and were killed by the destroying angel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_11","076_10_11","1CO","10","11","11","Now all these things happened to them as examples and were written down as warnings for us, on whom the fulfillment of the ages has come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_12","076_10_12","1CO","10","12","12","So the one who thinks he is standing firm should be careful not to fall. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_13","076_10_13","1CO","10","13","13","No temptation has seized you except what is common to man. And God is faithful; He will not let you be tempted beyond what you can bear. But when you are tempted, He will also provide an escape, so that you can stand up under it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_14","076_10_14","1CO","10","14","14","Therefore, my beloved, flee from idolatry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_15","076_10_15","1CO","10","15","15","I speak to reasonable people; judge for yourselves what I say. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_16","076_10_16","1CO","10","16","16","Is not the cup of blessing that we bless a participation in the blood of Christ? And is not the bread that we break a participation in the body of Christ? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_17","076_10_17","1CO","10","17","17","Because there is one loaf, we who are many are one body; for we all partake of the one loaf. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_18","076_10_18","1CO","10","18","18","Consider the people of Israel: Are not those who eat the sacrifices fellow partakers in the altar? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_19","076_10_19","1CO","10","19","19","Am I suggesting, then, that an idol is anything, or that food sacrificed to an idol is anything? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_20","076_10_20","1CO","10","20","20","No, but the sacrifices of pagans are offered to demons, not to God. And I do not want you to be participants with demons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_21","076_10_21","1CO","10","21","21","You cannot drink the cup of the Lord and the cup of demons too; you cannot partake in the table of the Lord and the table of demons too. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_22","076_10_22","1CO","10","22","22","Are we trying to provoke the Lord to jealousy? Are we stronger than He? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_23","076_10_23","1CO","10","23","23","“Everything is permissible for me,” but not everything is beneficial. “Everything is permissible for me,” but not everything is edifying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_24","076_10_24","1CO","10","24","24","No one should seek his own good, but each one should seek the good of others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_25","076_10_25","1CO","10","25","25","Eat anything sold in the meat market without raising questions of conscience, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_26","076_10_26","1CO","10","26","26","for, “The earth is the Lord’s, and the fullness thereof.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_27","076_10_27","1CO","10","27","27","If an unbeliever invites you to a meal and you want to go, eat anything set before you without raising questions of conscience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_28","076_10_28","1CO","10","28","28","But if someone tells you, “This food was offered to idols,” then do not eat it, for the sake of the one who told you and for the sake of conscience—for the earth is the Lord’s, and the fullness thereof— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_29","076_10_29","1CO","10","29","29","the other one’s conscience, I mean, not your own. For why should my freedom be determined by someone else’s conscience? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_30","076_10_30","1CO","10","30","30","If I partake in the meal with thankfulness, why am I denounced because of that for which I give thanks? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_31","076_10_31","1CO","10","31","31","So whether you eat or drink or whatever you do, do it all to the glory of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_32","076_10_32","1CO","10","32","32","Do not become a stumbling block, whether to Jews or Greeks or the church of God— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C110_33","076_10_33","1CO","10","33","33","as I also try to please everyone in all I do. For I am not seeking my own good, but the good of many, that they may be saved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_1","076_11_1","1CO","11","1","1","You are to imitate me, just as I imitate Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_2","076_11_2","1CO","11","2","2","Now I commend you, brothers, for remembering me in everything and for maintaining the traditions, just as I passed them on to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_3","076_11_3","1CO","11","3","3","But I want you to understand that the head of every man is Christ, and the head of the woman is man, and the head of Christ is God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_4","076_11_4","1CO","11","4","4","Every man who prays or prophesies with his head covered dishonors his head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_5","076_11_5","1CO","11","5","5","And every woman who prays or prophesies with her head uncovered dishonors her head, for it is just as if her head were shaved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_6","076_11_6","1CO","11","6","6","If a woman does not cover her head, she should have her hair cut off. And if it is shameful for a woman to have her hair cut or shaved off, she should cover her head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_7","076_11_7","1CO","11","7","7","A man ought not to cover his head, since he is the image and glory of God; but woman is the glory of man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_8","076_11_8","1CO","11","8","8","For man did not come from woman, but woman from man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_9","076_11_9","1CO","11","9","9","Neither was man created for woman, but woman for man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_10","076_11_10","1CO","11","10","10","For this reason a woman ought to have a sign of authority on her head, because of the angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_11","076_11_11","1CO","11","11","11","In the Lord, however, man is not independent of woman, nor is woman independent of man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_12","076_11_12","1CO","11","12","12","For just as woman came from man, so also man is born of woman. But everything comes from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_13","076_11_13","1CO","11","13","13","Judge for yourselves: Is it proper for a woman to pray to God with her head uncovered? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_14","076_11_14","1CO","11","14","14","Doesn’t nature itself teach you that if a man has long hair, it is a disgrace to him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_15","076_11_15","1CO","11","15","15","but that if a woman has long hair, it is her glory? For long hair is given as a covering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_16","076_11_16","1CO","11","16","16","If anyone is inclined to dispute this, we have no other practice, nor do the churches of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_17","076_11_17","1CO","11","17","17","In the following instructions I have no praise to offer, because your gatherings do more harm than good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_18","076_11_18","1CO","11","18","18","First of all, I hear that when you come together as a church, there are divisions among you, and in part I believe it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_19","076_11_19","1CO","11","19","19","And indeed, there must be differences among you to show which of you are approved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_20","076_11_20","1CO","11","20","20","Now then, when you come together, it is not the Lord’s Supper you eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_21","076_11_21","1CO","11","21","21","For as you eat, each of you goes ahead without sharing his meal. While one remains hungry, another gets drunk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_22","076_11_22","1CO","11","22","22","Don’t you have your own homes in which to eat and drink? Or do you despise the church of God and humiliate those who have nothing? What can I say to you? Shall I praise you for this? No, I will not! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_23","076_11_23","1CO","11","23","23","For I received from the Lord what I also passed on to you: The Lord Jesus, on the night He was betrayed, took bread, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_24","076_11_24","1CO","11","24","24","and when He had given thanks, He broke it and said, “Take and eat. This is My body, which is broken for you; do this in remembrance of Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_25","076_11_25","1CO","11","25","25","In the same way, after supper He took the cup, saying, “This cup is the new covenant in My blood; do this, as often as you drink it, in remembrance of Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_26","076_11_26","1CO","11","26","26","For as often as you eat this bread and drink this cup, you proclaim the Lord’s death until He comes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_27","076_11_27","1CO","11","27","27","Therefore, whoever eats this bread or drinks the cup of the Lord in a manner unworthy of the Lord will be guilty of sinning against the body and blood of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_28","076_11_28","1CO","11","28","28","Each one must examine himself before he eats of the bread and drinks of the cup. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_29","076_11_29","1CO","11","29","29","For anyone who eats and drinks unworthily, without recognizing the body of the Lord, eats and drinks judgment on himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_30","076_11_30","1CO","11","30","30","That is why many among you are weak and sick, and a number of you have fallen asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_31","076_11_31","1CO","11","31","31","Now if we judged ourselves properly, we would not come under judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_32","076_11_32","1CO","11","32","32","But when we are judged by the Lord, we are being disciplined so that we will not be condemned with the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_33","076_11_33","1CO","11","33","33","So, my brothers, when you come together to eat, wait for one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C111_34","076_11_34","1CO","11","34","34","If anyone is hungry, he should eat at home, so that when you come together it will not result in judgment. And when I come, I will give instructions about the remaining matters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_1","076_12_1","1CO","12","1","1","Now about spiritual gifts, brothers, I do not want you to be uninformed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_2","076_12_2","1CO","12","2","2","You know that when you were pagans, you were influenced and led astray to mute idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_3","076_12_3","1CO","12","3","3","Therefore I inform you that no one who is speaking by the Spirit of God calls Jesus accursed, and no one can call Jesus Lord, except by the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_4","076_12_4","1CO","12","4","4","There are different gifts, but the same Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_5","076_12_5","1CO","12","5","5","There are different ministries, but the same Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_6","076_12_6","1CO","12","6","6","There are different ways of working, but the same God works all things in all people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_7","076_12_7","1CO","12","7","7","Now to each one the manifestation of the Spirit is given for the common good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_8","076_12_8","1CO","12","8","8","To one there is given through the Spirit the message of wisdom, to another the message of knowledge by the same Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_9","076_12_9","1CO","12","9","9","to another faith by the same Spirit, to another gifts of healing by that same Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_10","076_12_10","1CO","12","10","10","to another the working of miracles, to another prophecy, to another distinguishing between spirits, to another speaking in various tongues, and to still another the interpretation of tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_11","076_12_11","1CO","12","11","11","All these are the work of one and the same Spirit, who apportions them to each one as He determines. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_12","076_12_12","1CO","12","12","12","The body is a unit, though it is composed of many parts. And although its parts are many, they all form one body. So it is with Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_13","076_12_13","1CO","12","13","13","For in one Spirit we were all baptized into one body, whether Jews or Greeks, slave or free, and we were all given into one Spirit to drink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_14","076_12_14","1CO","12","14","14","For the body does not consist of one part, but of many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_15","076_12_15","1CO","12","15","15","If the foot should say, “Because I am not a hand, I do not belong to the body,” that would not make it any less a part of the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_16","076_12_16","1CO","12","16","16","And if the ear should say, “Because I am not an eye, I do not belong to the body,” that would not make it any less a part of the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_17","076_12_17","1CO","12","17","17","If the whole body were an eye, where would the sense of hearing be? If the whole body were an ear, where would the sense of smell be? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_18","076_12_18","1CO","12","18","18","But in fact, God has arranged the members of the body, every one of them, according to His design. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_19","076_12_19","1CO","12","19","19","If they were all one part, where would the body be? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_20","076_12_20","1CO","12","20","20","As it is, there are many parts, but one body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_21","076_12_21","1CO","12","21","21","The eye cannot say to the hand, “I do not need you.” Nor can the head say to the feet, “I do not need you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_22","076_12_22","1CO","12","22","22","On the contrary, the parts of the body that seem to be weaker are indispensable, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_23","076_12_23","1CO","12","23","23","and the parts we consider less honorable, we treat with greater honor. And our unpresentable parts are treated with special modesty, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_24","076_12_24","1CO","12","24","24","whereas our presentable parts have no such need. But God has composed the body and has given greater honor to the parts that lacked it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_25","076_12_25","1CO","12","25","25","so that there should be no division in the body, but that its members should have mutual concern for one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_26","076_12_26","1CO","12","26","26","If one part suffers, every part suffers with it; if one part is honored, every part rejoices with it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_27","076_12_27","1CO","12","27","27","Now you are the body of Christ, and each of you is a member of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_28","076_12_28","1CO","12","28","28","And in the church God has appointed first of all apostles, second prophets, third teachers, then workers of miracles, and those with gifts of healing, helping, administration, and various tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_29","076_12_29","1CO","12","29","29","Are all apostles? Are all prophets? Are all teachers? Do all work miracles? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_30","076_12_30","1CO","12","30","30","Do all have gifts of healing? Do all speak in tongues? Do all interpret? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C112_31","076_12_31","1CO","12","31","31","But eagerly desire the better gifts. And now I will show you the most excellent way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_1","076_13_1","1CO","13","1","1","If I speak in the tongues of men and of angels, but have not love, I am only a ringing gong or a clanging cymbal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_2","076_13_2","1CO","13","2","2","If I have the gift of prophecy and can fathom all mysteries and all knowledge, and if I have absolute faith so as to move mountains, but have not love, I am nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_3","076_13_3","1CO","13","3","3","If I give all I possess to the poor and surrender my body to be burned, but have not love, I gain nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_4","076_13_4","1CO","13","4","4","Love is patient, love is kind. It does not envy, it does not boast, it is not proud. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_5","076_13_5","1CO","13","5","5","It is not rude, it is not self-seeking, it is not easily angered, it keeps no account of wrongs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_6","076_13_6","1CO","13","6","6","Love takes no pleasure in evil, but rejoices in the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_7","076_13_7","1CO","13","7","7","It bears all things, believes all things, hopes all things, endures all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_8","076_13_8","1CO","13","8","8","Love never fails. But where there are prophecies, they will cease; where there are tongues, they will be restrained; where there is knowledge, it will be dismissed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_9","076_13_9","1CO","13","9","9","Now we know in part and we prophesy in part, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_10","076_13_10","1CO","13","10","10","but when the perfect comes, the partial passes away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_11","076_13_11","1CO","13","11","11","When I was a child, I talked like a child, I thought like a child, I reasoned like a child. When I became a man, I set aside childish ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_12","076_13_12","1CO","13","12","12","Now we see but a dim reflection as in a mirror; then we shall see face to face. Now I know in part; then I shall know fully, even as I am fully known. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C113_13","076_13_13","1CO","13","13","13","And now these three remain: faith, hope, and love; but the greatest of these is love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_1","076_14_1","1CO","14","1","1","Earnestly pursue love and eagerly desire spiritual gifts, especially the gift of prophecy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_2","076_14_2","1CO","14","2","2","For he who speaks in a tongue does not speak to men, but to God. Indeed, no one understands him; he utters mysteries in the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_3","076_14_3","1CO","14","3","3","But he who prophesies speaks to men for their edification, encouragement, and comfort. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_4","076_14_4","1CO","14","4","4","The one who speaks in a tongue edifies himself, but the one who prophesies edifies the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_5","076_14_5","1CO","14","5","5","I wish that all of you could speak in tongues, but I would rather have you prophesy. For he who prophesies is greater than one who speaks in tongues, unless he interprets so that the church may be edified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_6","076_14_6","1CO","14","6","6","Now, brothers, if I come to you speaking in tongues, how will I benefit you, unless I bring you some revelation or knowledge or prophecy or teaching? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_7","076_14_7","1CO","14","7","7","Even in the case of lifeless instruments, such as the flute or harp, how will anyone recognize the tune they are playing unless the notes are distinct? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_8","076_14_8","1CO","14","8","8","Again, if the trumpet sounds a muffled call, who will prepare for battle? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_9","076_14_9","1CO","14","9","9","So it is with you. Unless you speak intelligible words with your tongue, how will anyone know what you are saying? You will just be speaking into the air. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_10","076_14_10","1CO","14","10","10","Assuredly, there are many different languages in the world, yet none of them is without meaning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_11","076_14_11","1CO","14","11","11","If, then, I do not know the meaning of someone’s language, I am a foreigner to the speaker, and he is a foreigner to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_12","076_14_12","1CO","14","12","12","It is the same with you. Since you are eager to have spiritual gifts, strive to excel in gifts that build up the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_13","076_14_13","1CO","14","13","13","Therefore, the one who speaks in a tongue should pray that he may interpret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_14","076_14_14","1CO","14","14","14","For if I pray in a tongue, my spirit prays, but my mind is unfruitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_15","076_14_15","1CO","14","15","15","What then shall I do? I will pray with my spirit, but I will also pray with my mind. I will sing with my spirit, but I will also sing with my mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_16","076_14_16","1CO","14","16","16","Otherwise, if you speak a blessing in spirit, how can someone who is uninstructed say “Amen” to your thanksgiving, since he does not know what you are saying? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_17","076_14_17","1CO","14","17","17","You may be giving thanks well enough, but the other one is not edified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_18","076_14_18","1CO","14","18","18","I thank my God that I speak in tongues more than all of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_19","076_14_19","1CO","14","19","19","But in the church, I would rather speak five coherent words to instruct others than ten thousand words in a tongue. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_20","076_14_20","1CO","14","20","20","Brothers, stop thinking like children. In regard to evil be infants, but in your thinking be mature. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_21","076_14_21","1CO","14","21","21","It is written in the Law: “By strange tongues and foreign lips I will speak to this people, but even then they will not listen to Me, says the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_22","076_14_22","1CO","14","22","22","Tongues, then, are a sign, not for believers, but for unbelievers. Prophecy, however, is for believers, not for unbelievers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_23","076_14_23","1CO","14","23","23","So if the whole church comes together and everyone speaks in tongues, and some who are uninstructed or some unbelievers come in, will they not say that you are out of your minds? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_24","076_14_24","1CO","14","24","24","But if an unbeliever or uninstructed person comes in while everyone is prophesying, he will be convicted and called to account by all, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_25","076_14_25","1CO","14","25","25","and so the secrets of his heart will be made known. So he will fall facedown and worship God, proclaiming, “God is truly among you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_26","076_14_26","1CO","14","26","26","What then shall we say, brothers? When you come together, each one of you has a psalm or a teaching, a tongue, a revelation, or an interpretation. All of these must be done to build up the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_27","076_14_27","1CO","14","27","27","If anyone speaks in a tongue, two, or at most three, should speak in turn, and someone must interpret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_28","076_14_28","1CO","14","28","28","But if there is no interpreter, he should remain silent in the church and speak only to himself and God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_29","076_14_29","1CO","14","29","29","Two or three prophets should speak, and the others should weigh carefully what is said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_30","076_14_30","1CO","14","30","30","And if a revelation comes to someone who is seated, the first speaker should stop. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_31","076_14_31","1CO","14","31","31","For you can all prophesy in turn so that everyone may be instructed and encouraged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_32","076_14_32","1CO","14","32","32","The spirits of prophets are subject to prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_33","076_14_33","1CO","14","33","33","For God is not a God of disorder, but of peace—as in all the churches of the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_34","076_14_34","1CO","14","34","34","Your women are to be silent in the churches. They are not permitted to speak, but must be in submission, as the law says. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_35","076_14_35","1CO","14","35","35","If they wish to inquire about something, they are to ask their own husbands at home; for it is dishonorable for a woman to speak in the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_36","076_14_36","1CO","14","36","36","Did the word of God originate with you? Or are you the only ones it has reached? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_37","076_14_37","1CO","14","37","37","If anyone considers himself a prophet or spiritual person, let him acknowledge that what I am writing you is the Lord’s command. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_38","076_14_38","1CO","14","38","38","But if anyone is ignorant, let him be ignorant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_39","076_14_39","1CO","14","39","39","So, brothers, be eager to prophesy, and do not forbid speaking in tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C114_40","076_14_40","1CO","14","40","40","But everything must be done in a proper and orderly manner. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_1","076_15_1","1CO","15","1","1","Now, brothers, I want to remind you of the gospel I preached to you, which you received, and in which you stand firm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_2","076_15_2","1CO","15","2","2","By this gospel you are saved, if you hold firmly to the word I preached to you. Otherwise, you have believed in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_3","076_15_3","1CO","15","3","3","For what I received I passed on to you as of first importance: that Christ died for our sins according to the Scriptures, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_4","076_15_4","1CO","15","4","4","that He was buried, that He was raised on the third day according to the Scriptures, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_5","076_15_5","1CO","15","5","5","and that He appeared to Cephas and then to the Twelve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_6","076_15_6","1CO","15","6","6","After that, He appeared to more than five hundred brothers at once, most of whom are still living, though some have fallen asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_7","076_15_7","1CO","15","7","7","Then He appeared to James, then to all the apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_8","076_15_8","1CO","15","8","8","And last of all He appeared to me also, as to one of untimely birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_9","076_15_9","1CO","15","9","9","For I am the least of the apostles and am unworthy to be called an apostle, because I persecuted the church of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_10","076_15_10","1CO","15","10","10","But by the grace of God I am what I am, and His grace to me was not in vain. No, I worked harder than all of them—yet not I, but the grace of God that was with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_11","076_15_11","1CO","15","11","11","Whether, then, it was I or they, this is what we preach, and this is what you believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_12","076_15_12","1CO","15","12","12","But if it is preached that Christ has been raised from the dead, how can some of you say that there is no resurrection of the dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_13","076_15_13","1CO","15","13","13","If there is no resurrection of the dead, then not even Christ has been raised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_14","076_15_14","1CO","15","14","14","And if Christ has not been raised, our preaching is worthless, and so is your faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_15","076_15_15","1CO","15","15","15","In that case, we are also exposed as false witnesses about God. For we have testified about God that He raised Christ from the dead, but He did not raise Him if in fact the dead are not raised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_16","076_15_16","1CO","15","16","16","For if the dead are not raised, then not even Christ has been raised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_17","076_15_17","1CO","15","17","17","And if Christ has not been raised, your faith is futile; you are still in your sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_18","076_15_18","1CO","15","18","18","Then those also who have fallen asleep in Christ have perished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_19","076_15_19","1CO","15","19","19","If our hope in Christ is for this life alone, we are to be pitied more than all men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_20","076_15_20","1CO","15","20","20","But Christ has indeed been raised from the dead and has become the firstfruits of those who have fallen asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_21","076_15_21","1CO","15","21","21","For since death came through a man, the resurrection of the dead comes also through a man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_22","076_15_22","1CO","15","22","22","For as in Adam all die, so in Christ all will be made alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_23","076_15_23","1CO","15","23","23","But each in his own turn: Christ the firstfruits; then at His coming, those who belong to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_24","076_15_24","1CO","15","24","24","Then the end will come, when He hands over the kingdom to God the Father after He has destroyed all dominion, authority, and power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_25","076_15_25","1CO","15","25","25","For He must reign until He has put all His enemies under His feet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_26","076_15_26","1CO","15","26","26","The last enemy to be destroyed is death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_27","076_15_27","1CO","15","27","27","For “God has put everything under His feet.” Now when it says that everything has been put under Him, this clearly does not include the One who put everything under Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_28","076_15_28","1CO","15","28","28","And when all things have been subjected to Him, then the Son Himself will also be made subject to Him who put all things under Him, so that God may be all in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_29","076_15_29","1CO","15","29","29","If these things are not so, what will those do who are baptized for the dead? If the dead are not raised at all, why are people baptized for the dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_30","076_15_30","1CO","15","30","30","And why do we endanger ourselves every hour? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_31","076_15_31","1CO","15","31","31","I face death every day, as surely as I boast about you in Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_32","076_15_32","1CO","15","32","32","If I fought wild beasts in Ephesus for human motives, what did I gain? If the dead are not raised, “Let us eat and drink, for tomorrow we die.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_33","076_15_33","1CO","15","33","33","Do not be deceived: “Bad company corrupts good character.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_34","076_15_34","1CO","15","34","34","Sober up as you ought, and stop sinning; for some of you are ignorant of God. I say this to your shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_35","076_15_35","1CO","15","35","35","But someone will ask, “How are the dead raised? With what kind of body will they come?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_36","076_15_36","1CO","15","36","36","You fool! What you sow does not come to life unless it dies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_37","076_15_37","1CO","15","37","37","And what you sow is not the body that will be, but just a seed, perhaps of wheat or something else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_38","076_15_38","1CO","15","38","38","But God gives it a body as He has designed, and to each kind of seed He gives its own body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_39","076_15_39","1CO","15","39","39","Not all flesh is the same: Men have one kind of flesh, animals have another, fish another, and birds another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_40","076_15_40","1CO","15","40","40","There are also heavenly bodies and earthly bodies. But the splendor of the heavenly bodies is of one degree, and the splendor of the earthly bodies is of another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_41","076_15_41","1CO","15","41","41","The sun has one degree of splendor, the moon another, and the stars another; and star differs from star in splendor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_42","076_15_42","1CO","15","42","42","So will it be with the resurrection of the dead: What is sown is perishable; it is raised imperishable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_43","076_15_43","1CO","15","43","43","It is sown in dishonor; it is raised in glory. It is sown in weakness; it is raised in power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_44","076_15_44","1CO","15","44","44","It is sown a natural body; it is raised a spiritual body. There is a natural body; there is also a spiritual body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_45","076_15_45","1CO","15","45","45","So it is written: “The first man Adam became a living being;” the last Adam a life-giving spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_46","076_15_46","1CO","15","46","46","The spiritual, however, was not first, but the natural, and then the spiritual. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_47","076_15_47","1CO","15","47","47","The first man was of the dust of the earth; the second man is the Lord from heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_48","076_15_48","1CO","15","48","48","As was the earthly man, so also are those who are of the earth; and as is the heavenly man, so also are those who are of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_49","076_15_49","1CO","15","49","49","And just as we have borne the likeness of the earthly man, so also let us bear the likeness of the heavenly man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_50","076_15_50","1CO","15","50","50","Now I declare to you, brothers, that flesh and blood cannot inherit the kingdom of God, nor does the perishable inherit the imperishable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_51","076_15_51","1CO","15","51","51","Listen, I tell you a mystery: We will not all sleep, but we will all be changed— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_52","076_15_52","1CO","15","52","52","in an instant, in the twinkling of an eye, at the last trumpet. For the trumpet will sound, the dead will be raised imperishable, and we will be changed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_53","076_15_53","1CO","15","53","53","For the perishable must be clothed with the imperishable, and the mortal with immortality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_54","076_15_54","1CO","15","54","54","When the perishable has been clothed with the imperishable and the mortal with immortality, then the saying that is written will come to pass: “Death has been swallowed up in victory.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_55","076_15_55","1CO","15","55","55","“Where, O Death, is your sting? Where, O Hades, is your victory?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_56","076_15_56","1CO","15","56","56","The sting of death is sin, and the power of sin is the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_57","076_15_57","1CO","15","57","57","But thanks be to God, who gives us the victory through our Lord Jesus Christ! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C115_58","076_15_58","1CO","15","58","58","Therefore, my beloved brothers, be steadfast and immovable. Always excel in the work of the Lord, because you know that your labor in the Lord is not in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_1","076_16_1","1CO","16","1","1","Now about the collection for the saints, you are to do as I directed the churches of Galatia: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_2","076_16_2","1CO","16","2","2","On the first day of every week, each of you should set aside a portion of his income, saving it up, so that when I come no collections will be needed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_3","076_16_3","1CO","16","3","3","Then, on my arrival, I will send letters with those you recommend to carry your gift to Jerusalem. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_4","076_16_4","1CO","16","4","4","And if it is advisable for me to go also, they can travel with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_5","076_16_5","1CO","16","5","5","After I go through Macedonia, however, I will come to you; for I will be going through Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_6","076_16_6","1CO","16","6","6","Perhaps I will stay with you awhile, or even spend the winter, so that you can help me on my journey, wherever I go. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_7","076_16_7","1CO","16","7","7","For I do not want to see you now only in passing; I hope to spend some time with you, if the Lord permits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_8","076_16_8","1CO","16","8","8","But I will stay in Ephesus until Pentecost, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_9","076_16_9","1CO","16","9","9","because a great door for effective work has opened to me, even though many oppose me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_10","076_16_10","1CO","16","10","10","If Timothy comes, see to it that he has nothing to fear while he is with you, for he is doing the work of the Lord, just as I am. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_11","076_16_11","1CO","16","11","11","No one, then, should treat him with contempt. Send him on his way in peace so that he can return to me, for I am expecting him along with the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_12","076_16_12","1CO","16","12","12","Now about our brother Apollos: I strongly urged him to go to you with the brothers. He was not at all inclined to go now, but he will go when he has the opportunity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_13","076_16_13","1CO","16","13","13","Be on the alert. Stand firm in the faith. Be men of courage. Be strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_14","076_16_14","1CO","16","14","14","Do everything in love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_15","076_16_15","1CO","16","15","15","You know that Stephanas and his household were the first converts in Achaia, and they have devoted themselves to the service of the saints. Now I urge you, brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_16","076_16_16","1CO","16","16","16","to submit to such as these, and to every fellow worker and laborer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_17","076_16_17","1CO","16","17","17","I am glad that Stephanas, Fortunatus, and Achaicus have arrived, because they have supplied what was lacking from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_18","076_16_18","1CO","16","18","18","For they refreshed my spirit and yours as well. Show your appreciation, therefore, to such men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_19","076_16_19","1CO","16","19","19","The churches in the province of Asia send you greetings. Aquila and Priscilla greet you warmly in the Lord, and so does the church that meets at their house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_20","076_16_20","1CO","16","20","20","All the brothers here send you greetings. Greet one another with a holy kiss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_21","076_16_21","1CO","16","21","21","This greeting is in my own hand—Paul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_22","076_16_22","1CO","16","22","22","If anyone does not love the Lord Jesus Christ, let him be under a curse. Come, O Lord! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_23","076_16_23","1CO","16","23","23","The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C116_24","076_16_24","1CO","16","24","24","My love be with all of you in Christ Jesus. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_1","077_1_1","2CO","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, and Timothy our brother, To the church of God in Corinth, together with all the saints throughout Achaia: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_2","077_1_2","2CO","1","2","2","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_3","077_1_3","2CO","1","3","3","Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Father of compassion and the God of all comfort, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_4","077_1_4","2CO","1","4","4","who comforts us in all our troubles, so that we can comfort those in any trouble with the comfort we ourselves have received from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_5","077_1_5","2CO","1","5","5","For just as the sufferings of Christ overflow to us, so also through Christ our comfort overflows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_6","077_1_6","2CO","1","6","6","If we are afflicted, it is for your comfort and salvation, which accomplishes in you patient endurance of the same sufferings we experience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_7","077_1_7","2CO","1","7","7","And our hope for you is sure; if we are comforted, it is for your comfort and salvation, because we know that just as you share in our sufferings, so also you will share in our comfort. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_8","077_1_8","2CO","1","8","8","We do not want you to be unaware, brothers, of the hardships we encountered in the province of Asia. We were under a burden far beyond our ability to endure, so that we despaired even of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_9","077_1_9","2CO","1","9","9","Indeed, we felt we were under the sentence of death, in order that we would not trust in ourselves, but in God, who raises the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_10","077_1_10","2CO","1","10","10","He has delivered us from such a deadly peril, and He continues to deliver us. In Him we have placed our hope that He will yet again deliver us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_11","077_1_11","2CO","1","11","11","as you help us by your prayers. Then many will give thanks on your behalf for the favor shown us in answer to their prayers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_12","077_1_12","2CO","1","12","12","For this is our boast: Our conscience testifies that we have conducted ourselves in the world, and especially in relation to you, in the integrity and sincerity that are from God—not in worldly wisdom, but in the grace of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_13","077_1_13","2CO","1","13","13","For we do not write you anything that is beyond your ability to read and understand. And I hope that you will understand us completely, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_14","077_1_14","2CO","1","14","14","as you have already understood us in part, that you may boast of us just as we will boast of you in the day of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_15","077_1_15","2CO","1","15","15","Confident of this, I planned to visit you first, so that you might receive a double blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_16","077_1_16","2CO","1","16","16","I wanted to visit you on my way to Macedonia, and to return to you from Macedonia, and then to have you help me on my way to Judea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_17","077_1_17","2CO","1","17","17","When I planned this, did I do it carelessly? Or do I make my plans by human standards, so as to say “Yes, yes” and also “No, no”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_18","077_1_18","2CO","1","18","18","But as surely as God is faithful, our message to you was not “Yes” and “No.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_19","077_1_19","2CO","1","19","19","For the Son of God, Jesus Christ, who was proclaimed among you by me and Silvanus and Timothy, was not “Yes” and “No,” but in Him it has always been “Yes.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_20","077_1_20","2CO","1","20","20","For all the promises of God are “Yes” in Christ. And so in Him, our “Amen” is spoken to the glory of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_21","077_1_21","2CO","1","21","21","Now it is God who establishes both us and you in Christ. He anointed us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_22","077_1_22","2CO","1","22","22","placed His seal on us, and put His Spirit in our hearts as a pledge of what is to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_23","077_1_23","2CO","1","23","23","I call God as my witness that it was in order to spare you that I did not return to Corinth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C21_24","077_1_24","2CO","1","24","24","Not that we lord it over your faith, but we are fellow workers with you for your joy, because it is by faith that you stand firm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_1","077_2_1","2CO","2","1","1","So I made up my mind not to make another painful visit to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_2","077_2_2","2CO","2","2","2","For if I grieve you, who is left to cheer me but those whom I have grieved? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_3","077_2_3","2CO","2","3","3","I wrote to you as I did so that on my arrival I would not be grieved by those who ought to make me rejoice. I had confidence in all of you, that you would share my joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_4","077_2_4","2CO","2","4","4","For through many tears I wrote you out of great distress and anguish of heart, not to grieve you but to let you know how much I love you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_5","077_2_5","2CO","2","5","5","Now if anyone has caused grief, he has not grieved me but all of you—to some degree, not to overstate it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_6","077_2_6","2CO","2","6","6","The punishment imposed on him by the majority is sufficient for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_7","077_2_7","2CO","2","7","7","So instead, you ought to forgive and comfort him, so that he will not be overwhelmed by excessive sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_8","077_2_8","2CO","2","8","8","Therefore I urge you to reaffirm your love for him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_9","077_2_9","2CO","2","9","9","My purpose in writing you was to see if you would stand the test and be obedient in everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_10","077_2_10","2CO","2","10","10","If you forgive anyone, I also forgive him. And if I have forgiven anything, I have forgiven it in the presence of Christ for your sake, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_11","077_2_11","2CO","2","11","11","in order that Satan should not outwit us. For we are not unaware of his schemes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_12","077_2_12","2CO","2","12","12","Now when I went to Troas to preach the gospel of Christ and a door stood open for me in the Lord, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_13","077_2_13","2CO","2","13","13","I had no peace in my spirit, because I did not find my brother Titus there. So I said goodbye to them and went on to Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_14","077_2_14","2CO","2","14","14","But thanks be to God, who always leads us triumphantly as captives in Christ and through us spreads everywhere the fragrance of the knowledge of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_15","077_2_15","2CO","2","15","15","For we are to God the sweet aroma of Christ among those who are being saved and those who are perishing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_16","077_2_16","2CO","2","16","16","To the one we are an odor that brings death, to the other a fragrance that brings life. And who is qualified for such a task? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C22_17","077_2_17","2CO","2","17","17","For we are not like others, who peddle the word of God for profit. On the contrary, in Christ we speak before God with sincerity, as men sent from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_1","077_3_1","2CO","3","1","1","Are we beginning to commend ourselves again? Do we need, like some people, letters of recommendation to you or from you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_2","077_3_2","2CO","3","2","2","You yourselves are our letter, inscribed on our hearts, known and read by everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_3","077_3_3","2CO","3","3","3","It is clear that you are a letter from Christ, the result of our ministry, written not with ink but with the Spirit of the living God, not on tablets of stone but on tablets of human hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_4","077_3_4","2CO","3","4","4","Such confidence before God is ours through Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_5","077_3_5","2CO","3","5","5","Not that we are competent in ourselves to claim that anything comes from us, but our competence comes from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_6","077_3_6","2CO","3","6","6","And He has qualified us as ministers of a new covenant, not of the letter but of the Spirit; for the letter kills, but the Spirit gives life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_7","077_3_7","2CO","3","7","7","Now if the ministry of death, which was engraved in letters on stone, came with such glory that the Israelites could not gaze at the face of Moses because of its fleeting glory, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_8","077_3_8","2CO","3","8","8","will not the ministry of the Spirit be even more glorious? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_9","077_3_9","2CO","3","9","9","For if the ministry of condemnation was glorious, how much more glorious is the ministry of righteousness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_10","077_3_10","2CO","3","10","10","Indeed, what was once glorious has no glory now in comparison to the glory that surpasses it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_11","077_3_11","2CO","3","11","11","For if what was fading away came with glory, how much greater is the glory of that which endures! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_12","077_3_12","2CO","3","12","12","Therefore, since we have such a hope, we are very bold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_13","077_3_13","2CO","3","13","13","We are not like Moses, who would put a veil over his face to keep the Israelites from gazing at the end of what was fading away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_14","077_3_14","2CO","3","14","14","But their minds were closed. For to this day the same veil remains at the reading of the old covenant. It has not been lifted, because only in Christ can it be removed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_15","077_3_15","2CO","3","15","15","And even to this day when Moses is read, a veil covers their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_16","077_3_16","2CO","3","16","16","But whenever anyone turns to the Lord, the veil is taken away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_17","077_3_17","2CO","3","17","17","Now the Lord is the Spirit, and where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is freedom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C23_18","077_3_18","2CO","3","18","18","And we, who with unveiled faces all reflect the glory of the Lord, are being transformed into His image with intensifying glory, which comes from the Lord, who is the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_1","077_4_1","2CO","4","1","1","Therefore, since God in His mercy has given us this ministry, we do not lose heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_2","077_4_2","2CO","4","2","2","Instead, we have renounced secret and shameful ways. We do not practice deceit, nor do we distort the word of God. On the contrary, by open proclamation of the truth, we commend ourselves to every man’s conscience in the sight of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_3","077_4_3","2CO","4","3","3","And even if our gospel is veiled, it is veiled to those who are perishing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_4","077_4_4","2CO","4","4","4","The god of this age has blinded the minds of unbelievers, so that the light of the gospel of the glory of Christ, who is the image of God, might not dawn upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_5","077_4_5","2CO","4","5","5","For we do not proclaim ourselves, but Christ Jesus as Lord, and ourselves as your servants for Jesus’ sake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_6","077_4_6","2CO","4","6","6","For God, who said, “Let light shine out of darkness,” made His light shine in our hearts to give us the light of the knowledge of the glory of God in the face of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_7","077_4_7","2CO","4","7","7","Now we have this treasure in jars of clay to show that this surpassingly great power is from God and not from us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_8","077_4_8","2CO","4","8","8","We are hard pressed on all sides, but not crushed; perplexed, but not in despair; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_9","077_4_9","2CO","4","9","9","persecuted, but not forsaken; struck down, but not destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_10","077_4_10","2CO","4","10","10","We always carry around in our body the death of the Lord Jesus, so that the life of Jesus may also be revealed in our body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_11","077_4_11","2CO","4","11","11","For we who are alive are always consigned to death for Jesus’ sake, so that the life of Jesus may also be revealed in our mortal body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_12","077_4_12","2CO","4","12","12","So then, death is at work in us, but life is at work in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_13","077_4_13","2CO","4","13","13","And in keeping with what is written, “I believed, therefore I have spoken,” we who have the same spirit of faith also believe and therefore speak, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_14","077_4_14","2CO","4","14","14","knowing that the One who raised the Lord Jesus will also raise us through Jesus and present us with you in His presence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_15","077_4_15","2CO","4","15","15","All this is for your benefit, so that the grace that is extending to more and more people may cause thanksgiving to overflow, to the glory of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_16","077_4_16","2CO","4","16","16","Therefore we do not lose heart. Though our outer self is wasting away, yet the inner self is being renewed day by day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_17","077_4_17","2CO","4","17","17","For our light and momentary affliction is producing for us an eternal weight of glory that is far beyond comparison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C24_18","077_4_18","2CO","4","18","18","So we fix our eyes not on what is seen, but on what is unseen. For what is seen is temporary, but what is unseen is eternal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_1","077_5_1","2CO","5","1","1","For we know that if the earthly tent we live in is dismantled, we have a building from God, an eternal house in heaven, not built by human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_2","077_5_2","2CO","5","2","2","For in this tent we groan, longing to be clothed with our heavenly dwelling, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_3","077_5_3","2CO","5","3","3","because when we are clothed, we will not be found naked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_4","077_5_4","2CO","5","4","4","For while we are in this tent, we groan under our burdens, because we do not wish to be unclothed but clothed, so that our mortality may be swallowed up by life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_5","077_5_5","2CO","5","5","5","And it is God who has prepared us for this very purpose and has given us the Spirit as a pledge of what is to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_6","077_5_6","2CO","5","6","6","Therefore we are always confident, although we know that while we are at home in the body, we are away from the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_7","077_5_7","2CO","5","7","7","For we walk by faith, not by sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_8","077_5_8","2CO","5","8","8","We are confident, then, and would prefer to be away from the body and at home with the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_9","077_5_9","2CO","5","9","9","So we aspire to please Him, whether we are at home in this body or away from it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_10","077_5_10","2CO","5","10","10","For we must all appear before the judgment seat of Christ, that each one may receive his due for the things done in the body, whether good or bad. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_11","077_5_11","2CO","5","11","11","Therefore, since we know what it means to fear the Lord, we try to persuade men. What we are is clear to God, and I hope it is clear to your conscience as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_12","077_5_12","2CO","5","12","12","For we are not commending ourselves to you again. Instead, we are giving you an occasion to be proud of us, so that you can answer those who take pride in appearances rather than in the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_13","077_5_13","2CO","5","13","13","If we are out of our mind, it is for God; if we are of sound mind, it is for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_14","077_5_14","2CO","5","14","14","For Christ’s love compels us, because we are convinced that if One died for all, therefore all died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_15","077_5_15","2CO","5","15","15","And He died for all, that those who live should no longer live for themselves, but for Him who died for them and was raised again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_16","077_5_16","2CO","5","16","16","So from now on we regard no one according to the flesh. Although we once regarded Christ in this way, we do so no longer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_17","077_5_17","2CO","5","17","17","Therefore if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation. The old has passed away. Behold, all things have become new! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_18","077_5_18","2CO","5","18","18","All this is from God, who reconciled us to Himself through Jesus Christ and gave us the ministry of reconciliation: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_19","077_5_19","2CO","5","19","19","that God was reconciling the world to Himself in Christ, not counting men’s trespasses against them. And He has committed to us the message of reconciliation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_20","077_5_20","2CO","5","20","20","Therefore we are ambassadors for Christ, as though God were making His appeal through us. We implore you on behalf of Christ: Be reconciled to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C25_21","077_5_21","2CO","5","21","21","For God made Him who knew no sin to be sin on our behalf, so that in Him we might become the righteousness of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_1","077_6_1","2CO","6","1","1","As God’s fellow workers, then, we urge you not to receive God’s grace in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_2","077_6_2","2CO","6","2","2","For He says: “In the time of favor I heard you, and in the day of salvation I helped you.” Behold, now is the time of favor; now is the day of salvation! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_3","077_6_3","2CO","6","3","3","We put no obstacle in anyone’s way, so that no one can discredit our ministry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_4","077_6_4","2CO","6","4","4","Rather, as servants of God we commend ourselves in every way: in great endurance; in troubles, hardships, and calamities; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_5","077_6_5","2CO","6","5","5","in beatings, imprisonments, and riots; in labor, sleepless nights, and hunger; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_6","077_6_6","2CO","6","6","6","in purity, knowledge, patience, and kindness; in the Holy Spirit and in sincere love; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_7","077_6_7","2CO","6","7","7","in truthful speech and in the power of God; with the weapons of righteousness in the right hand and in the left; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_8","077_6_8","2CO","6","8","8","through glory and dishonor, slander and praise; viewed as imposters, yet genuine; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_9","077_6_9","2CO","6","9","9","unknown, yet well-known; dying, and yet we live on; punished, yet not killed; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_10","077_6_10","2CO","6","10","10","sorrowful, yet always rejoicing; poor, yet making many rich; having nothing, and yet possessing everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_11","077_6_11","2CO","6","11","11","We have spoken freely to you, Corinthians. Our hearts are open wide. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_12","077_6_12","2CO","6","12","12","It is not our affection, but yours, that is restrained. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_13","077_6_13","2CO","6","13","13","As a fair exchange—I speak as to my children—open wide your hearts also. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_14","077_6_14","2CO","6","14","14","Do not be unequally yoked with unbelievers. For what partnership can righteousness have with wickedness? Or what fellowship does light have with darkness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_15","077_6_15","2CO","6","15","15","What harmony is there between Christ and Belial? Or what does a believer have in common with an unbeliever? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_16","077_6_16","2CO","6","16","16","What agreement can exist between the temple of God and idols? For you are the temple of the living God. As God has said: “I will dwell with them and walk among them, and I will be their God, and they will be My people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_17","077_6_17","2CO","6","17","17","“Therefore come out from among them and be separate, says the Lord. Touch no unclean thing, and I will receive you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C26_18","077_6_18","2CO","6","18","18","And: “I will be a Father to you, and you will be My sons and daughters, says the Lord Almighty.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_1","077_7_1","2CO","7","1","1","Therefore, beloved, since we have these promises, let us cleanse ourselves from everything that defiles body and spirit, perfecting holiness in the fear of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_2","077_7_2","2CO","7","2","2","Make room for us in your hearts. We have wronged no one, we have corrupted no one, we have exploited no one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_3","077_7_3","2CO","7","3","3","I do not say this to condemn you. I have said before that you so occupy our hearts that we live and die together with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_4","077_7_4","2CO","7","4","4","Great is my confidence in you; great is my pride in you; I am filled with encouragement; in all our troubles my joy overflows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_5","077_7_5","2CO","7","5","5","For when we arrived in Macedonia, our bodies had no rest, but we were pressed from every direction—conflicts on the outside, fears within. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_6","077_7_6","2CO","7","6","6","But God, who comforts the downcast, comforted us by the arrival of Titus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_7","077_7_7","2CO","7","7","7","and not only by his arrival, but also by the comfort he had received from you. He told us about your longing, your mourning, and your zeal for me, so that I rejoiced all the more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_8","077_7_8","2CO","7","8","8","Even if I caused you sorrow by my letter, I do not regret it. Although I did regret it—for I see that my letter caused you sorrow, but only for a short time— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_9","077_7_9","2CO","7","9","9","yet now I rejoice, not because you were made sorrowful, but because your sorrow led you to repentance. For you felt the sorrow that God had intended, and so were not harmed in any way by us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_10","077_7_10","2CO","7","10","10","Godly sorrow brings repentance that leads to salvation without regret, but worldly sorrow brings death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_11","077_7_11","2CO","7","11","11","Consider what this godly sorrow of yours has produced in you: what earnestness, what eagerness to clear yourselves, what indignation, what alarm, what longing, what zeal, what vindication! In every way you have proved yourselves to be innocent in this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_12","077_7_12","2CO","7","12","12","So even though I wrote to you, it was not on account of the one who did wrong or the one who was harmed, but rather that your earnestness on our behalf would be made clear to you in the sight of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_13","077_7_13","2CO","7","13","13","On account of this, we are encouraged. And in your encouragement, we were even more delighted by the joy of Titus. For his spirit has been refreshed by all of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_14","077_7_14","2CO","7","14","14","Indeed, I was not embarrassed by anything I had boasted to him about you. But just as everything we said to you was true, so our boasting to Titus has proved to be true as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_15","077_7_15","2CO","7","15","15","And his affection for you is even greater when he remembers that you were all obedient as you welcomed him with fear and trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C27_16","077_7_16","2CO","7","16","16","I rejoice that I can have complete confidence in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_1","077_8_1","2CO","8","1","1","Now, brothers, we want you to know about the grace that God has given the churches of Macedonia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_2","077_8_2","2CO","8","2","2","In the terrible ordeal they suffered, their abundant joy and deep poverty overflowed into rich generosity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_3","077_8_3","2CO","8","3","3","For I testify that they gave according to their ability and even beyond it. Of their own accord, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_4","077_8_4","2CO","8","4","4","they earnestly pleaded with us for the privilege of sharing in this service to the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_5","077_8_5","2CO","8","5","5","And not only did they do as we expected, but they gave themselves first to the Lord and then to us, through the will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_6","077_8_6","2CO","8","6","6","So we urged Titus to help complete your act of grace, just as he had started it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_7","077_8_7","2CO","8","7","7","But just as you excel in everything—in faith, in speech, in knowledge, in complete earnestness, and in your love for us—see that you also excel in this grace of giving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_8","077_8_8","2CO","8","8","8","I am not giving a command, but I am testing the sincerity of your love through the earnestness of others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_9","077_8_9","2CO","8","9","9","For you know the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ, that though He was rich, yet for your sake He became poor, so that you through His poverty might become rich. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_10","077_8_10","2CO","8","10","10","And this is my opinion about what is helpful for you in this matter: Last year you were the first not only to give, but even to have such a desire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_11","077_8_11","2CO","8","11","11","Now finish the work, so that you may complete it with the same eager desire, according to your means. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_12","077_8_12","2CO","8","12","12","For if the eagerness is there, the gift is acceptable according to what one has, not according to what he does not have. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_13","077_8_13","2CO","8","13","13","It is not our intention that others may be relieved while you are burdened, but that there may be equality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_14","077_8_14","2CO","8","14","14","At the present time, your surplus will meet their need, so that in turn their surplus will meet your need. This way there will be equality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_15","077_8_15","2CO","8","15","15","As it is written: “He who gathered much had no excess, and he who gathered little had no shortfall.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_16","077_8_16","2CO","8","16","16","But thanks be to God, who put into the heart of Titus the same devotion I have for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_17","077_8_17","2CO","8","17","17","For not only did he welcome our appeal, but he is eagerly coming to you of his own volition. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_18","077_8_18","2CO","8","18","18","Along with Titus we are sending the brother who is praised by all the churches for his work in the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_19","077_8_19","2CO","8","19","19","More than that, this brother was chosen by the churches to accompany us with the gracious gift we administer to honor the Lord Himself and to show our eagerness to help. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_20","077_8_20","2CO","8","20","20","We want to avoid any criticism of the way we administer this generous gift. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_21","077_8_21","2CO","8","21","21","We are taking great care to do what is right, not only in the eyes of the Lord, but also in the eyes of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_22","077_8_22","2CO","8","22","22","And we are sending along with them our brother who has proven his earnestness to us many times and in many ways, and now even more so by his great confidence in you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_23","077_8_23","2CO","8","23","23","As for Titus, he is my partner and fellow worker among you. As for our brothers, they are messengers of the churches, the glory of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C28_24","077_8_24","2CO","8","24","24","In full view of the churches, then, show these men the proof of your love and the reason for our boasting about you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_1","077_9_1","2CO","9","1","1","Now about the service to the saints, there is no need for me to write to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_2","077_9_2","2CO","9","2","2","For I know your eagerness to help, and I have been boasting to the Macedonians that since last year you in Achaia were prepared to give. And your zeal has stirred most of them to do likewise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_3","077_9_3","2CO","9","3","3","But I am sending the brothers in order that our boasting about you in this matter should not prove empty, but that you will be prepared, just as I said. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_4","077_9_4","2CO","9","4","4","Otherwise, if any Macedonians come with me and find you unprepared, we—to say nothing of you—would be ashamed of having been so confident in our boasting. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_5","077_9_5","2CO","9","5","5","So I thought it necessary to urge the brothers to visit you beforehand and make arrangements for the generous gift that was announced. This way, your gift will be prepared generously and not begrudgingly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_6","077_9_6","2CO","9","6","6","Remember this: Whoever sows sparingly will also reap sparingly, and whoever sows generously will also reap generously. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_7","077_9_7","2CO","9","7","7","Each one should give what he decides in his heart to give, not out of regret or compulsion. For God loves a cheerful giver. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_8","077_9_8","2CO","9","8","8","And God is able to make all grace abound to you, so that in all things, at all times, having all that you need, you will abound in every good work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_9","077_9_9","2CO","9","9","9","As it is written: “He has scattered abroad His gifts to the poor; His righteousness endures forever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_10","077_9_10","2CO","9","10","10","Now may He who supplies seed to the sower and bread for food supply and multiply your store of seed and increase the harvest of your righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_11","077_9_11","2CO","9","11","11","May you be enriched in every way to be generous on every occasion, so that through us your generosity may produce thanksgiving to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_12","077_9_12","2CO","9","12","12","For this ministry of service is not only supplying the needs of the saints, but is also overflowing in many expressions of thanksgiving to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_13","077_9_13","2CO","9","13","13","Because of the proof this ministry provides, the saints will glorify God for your obedient confession of the gospel of Christ, and for the generosity of your contribution to them and to all the others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_14","077_9_14","2CO","9","14","14","And their prayers for you will express their affection for you, because of the surpassing grace God has given you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C29_15","077_9_15","2CO","9","15","15","Thanks be to God for His indescribable gift! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_1","077_10_1","2CO","10","1","1","Now by the mildness and gentleness of Christ, I appeal to you—I, Paul, who am humble when face to face with you, but bold when away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_2","077_10_2","2CO","10","2","2","I beg you that when I come I may not need to be as bold as I expect toward those who presume that we live according to the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_3","077_10_3","2CO","10","3","3","For though we live in the flesh, we do not wage war according to the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_4","077_10_4","2CO","10","4","4","The weapons of our warfare are not the weapons of the flesh. Instead, they have divine power to demolish strongholds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_5","077_10_5","2CO","10","5","5","We demolish arguments and every presumption set up against the knowledge of God; and we take captive every thought to make it obedient to Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_6","077_10_6","2CO","10","6","6","And we will be ready to punish every act of disobedience, as soon as your obedience is complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_7","077_10_7","2CO","10","7","7","You are looking at outward appearances. If anyone is confident that he belongs to Christ, he should remind himself that we belong to Christ just as much as he belongs to Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_8","077_10_8","2CO","10","8","8","For even if I boast somewhat excessively about the authority the Lord gave us for building you up rather than tearing you down, I will not be ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_9","077_10_9","2CO","10","9","9","I do not want to seem to be trying to frighten you by my letters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_10","077_10_10","2CO","10","10","10","For some say, “His letters are weighty and forceful, but his physical presence is unimpressive, and his speaking is of no account.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_11","077_10_11","2CO","10","11","11","Such people should consider that what we are in our letters when absent, we will be in our actions when present. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_12","077_10_12","2CO","10","12","12","We do not dare to classify or compare ourselves with some who commend themselves. When they measure themselves by themselves and compare themselves with themselves, they show their ignorance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_13","077_10_13","2CO","10","13","13","We, however, will not boast beyond our limits, but only within the field of influence that God has assigned to us—a field that reaches even to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_14","077_10_14","2CO","10","14","14","We are not overstepping our bounds, as if we had not come to you. Indeed, we were the first to reach you with the gospel of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_15","077_10_15","2CO","10","15","15","Neither do we boast beyond our limits in the labors of others. But we hope that as your faith increases, our area of influence among you will greatly increase as well, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_16","077_10_16","2CO","10","16","16","so that we can preach the gospel in the regions beyond you. Then we will not be boasting in the work already done in another man’s territory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_17","077_10_17","2CO","10","17","17","Rather, “Let him who boasts boast in the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C210_18","077_10_18","2CO","10","18","18","For it is not the one who commends himself who is approved, but the one whom the Lord commends. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_1","077_11_1","2CO","11","1","1","I hope you will put up with a little of my foolishness, but you are already doing that. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_2","077_11_2","2CO","11","2","2","I am jealous for you with a godly jealousy. For I promised you to one husband, to present you as a pure virgin to Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_3","077_11_3","2CO","11","3","3","I am afraid, however, that just as Eve was deceived by the serpent’s cunning, your minds may be led astray from the simplicity that is in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_4","077_11_4","2CO","11","4","4","For if someone comes and proclaims a Jesus other than the One we proclaimed, or if you receive a different spirit than the One you received, or a different gospel than the one you accepted, you put up with it very easily. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_5","077_11_5","2CO","11","5","5","I consider myself in no way inferior to those “super-apostles.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_6","077_11_6","2CO","11","6","6","Although I am not a polished speaker, I am certainly not lacking in knowledge. We have been made known to you in every way possible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_7","077_11_7","2CO","11","7","7","Was it a sin for me to humble myself in order to exalt you, because I preached the gospel of God to you free of charge? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_8","077_11_8","2CO","11","8","8","I robbed other churches by accepting their support in order to serve you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_9","077_11_9","2CO","11","9","9","And when I was with you and in need, I was not a burden to anyone; for the brothers who came from Macedonia supplied my needs. I have refrained from being a burden to you in any way, and I will continue to do so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_10","077_11_10","2CO","11","10","10","As surely as the truth of Christ is in me, this boasting of mine will not be silenced in the regions of Achaia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_11","077_11_11","2CO","11","11","11","Why? Because I do not love you? God knows I do! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_12","077_11_12","2CO","11","12","12","But I will keep on doing what I am doing, in order to undercut those who want an opportunity to be regarded as our equals in the things of which they boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_13","077_11_13","2CO","11","13","13","For such men are false apostles, deceitful workers, masquerading as apostles of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_14","077_11_14","2CO","11","14","14","And no wonder, for Satan himself masquerades as an angel of light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_15","077_11_15","2CO","11","15","15","It is not surprising, then, if his servants masquerade as servants of righteousness. Their end will correspond to their actions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_16","077_11_16","2CO","11","16","16","I repeat: Let no one take me for a fool. But if you do, then receive me as a fool, so that I too may boast a little. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_17","077_11_17","2CO","11","17","17","In this confident boasting of mine, I am not speaking as the Lord would, but as a fool. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_18","077_11_18","2CO","11","18","18","Since many are boasting according to the flesh, I too will boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_19","077_11_19","2CO","11","19","19","For you gladly put up with fools, since you are so wise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_20","077_11_20","2CO","11","20","20","In fact, you even put up with anyone who enslaves you or exploits you or takes advantage of you or exalts himself or strikes you in the face. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_21","077_11_21","2CO","11","21","21","To my shame I concede that we were too weak for that! Speaking as a fool, however, I can match what anyone else dares to boast about. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_22","077_11_22","2CO","11","22","22","Are they Hebrews? So am I. Are they Israelites? So am I. Are they descendants of Abraham? So am I. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_23","077_11_23","2CO","11","23","23","Are they servants of Christ? (I am speaking as if I were out of my mind.) I am so much more: in harder labor, in worse beatings, in more imprisonments, in frequent danger of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_24","077_11_24","2CO","11","24","24","Five times I received from the Jews the forty lashes minus one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_25","077_11_25","2CO","11","25","25","Three times I was beaten with rods, once I was stoned, three times I was shipwrecked. I spent a night and a day in the open sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_26","077_11_26","2CO","11","26","26","In my frequent journeys, I have been in danger from rivers and from bandits, in danger from my countrymen and from the Gentiles, in danger in the city and in the country, in danger on the sea and among false brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_27","077_11_27","2CO","11","27","27","in labor and toil and often without sleep, in hunger and thirst and often without food, in cold and exposure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_28","077_11_28","2CO","11","28","28","Apart from these external trials, I face daily the pressure of my concern for all the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_29","077_11_29","2CO","11","29","29","Who is weak, and I am not weak? Who is led into sin, and I do not burn with grief? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_30","077_11_30","2CO","11","30","30","If I must boast, I will boast of the things that show my weakness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_31","077_11_31","2CO","11","31","31","The God and Father of the Lord Jesus Christ, who is forever worthy of praise, knows that I am not lying. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_32","077_11_32","2CO","11","32","32","In Damascus, the governor under King Aretas secured the city of the Damascenes wishing to arrest me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C211_33","077_11_33","2CO","11","33","33","But I was lowered in a basket through a window in the wall and escaped his grasp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_1","077_12_1","2CO","12","1","1","Surely it is not beneficial for me to boast, yet I will go on to visions and revelations from the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_2","077_12_2","2CO","12","2","2","I know a man in Christ who fourteen years ago was caught up to the third heaven. Whether it was in the body or out of it I do not know, but God knows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_3","077_12_3","2CO","12","3","3","And I know that this man—whether in the body or out of it I do not know, but God knows— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_4","077_12_4","2CO","12","4","4","was caught up to Paradise. The things he heard were inexpressible, things that man is not permitted to tell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_5","077_12_5","2CO","12","5","5","I will boast about such a man, but I will not boast about myself, except in my weaknesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_6","077_12_6","2CO","12","6","6","Even if I wanted to boast, I would not be a fool, because I would be speaking the truth. But I refrain, so no one will credit me with more than he sees in me or hears from me, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_7","077_12_7","2CO","12","7","7","or because of these surpassingly great revelations. So to keep me from becoming conceited, I was given a thorn in my flesh, a messenger of Satan, to torment me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_8","077_12_8","2CO","12","8","8","Three times I pleaded with the Lord to take it away from me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_9","077_12_9","2CO","12","9","9","But He said to me, “My grace is sufficient for you, for My power is perfected in weakness.” Therefore I will boast all the more gladly in my weaknesses, so that the power of Christ may rest on me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_10","077_12_10","2CO","12","10","10","That is why, for the sake of Christ, I delight in weaknesses, in insults, in hardships, in persecutions, in difficulties. For when I am weak, then I am strong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_11","077_12_11","2CO","12","11","11","I have become a fool in my boasting, but you drove me to it. In fact, you should have commended me, since I am in no way inferior to those “super-apostles,” even though I am nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_12","077_12_12","2CO","12","12","12","The marks of a true apostle—signs, wonders, and miracles—were performed among you with great perseverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_13","077_12_13","2CO","12","13","13","In what way were you inferior to the other churches, except that I was not a burden to you? Forgive me this wrong! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_14","077_12_14","2CO","12","14","14","See, I am ready to come to you a third time, and I will not be a burden to you, because I am not seeking your possessions, but you. For children should not have to save up for their parents, but parents for their children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_15","077_12_15","2CO","12","15","15","And for the sake of your souls, I will most gladly spend my money and myself, even if the more I love you, the less you love me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_16","077_12_16","2CO","12","16","16","Be that as it may, I was not a burden to you; but crafty as I am, I caught you by trickery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_17","077_12_17","2CO","12","17","17","Did I exploit you by anyone I sent you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_18","077_12_18","2CO","12","18","18","I urged Titus to visit you, and I sent our brother with him. Did Titus exploit you in any way? Did we not walk in the same Spirit and follow in the same footsteps? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_19","077_12_19","2CO","12","19","19","Do you still think that we are making a defense to you? We speak before God in Christ, and all of this, beloved, is to build you up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_20","077_12_20","2CO","12","20","20","For I am afraid that when I come, I may not find you as I wish, and you may not find me as you wish. I fear that there may be quarrels, jealousies, rage, rivalry, slander, gossip, arrogance, and disorder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C212_21","077_12_21","2CO","12","21","21","I am afraid that when I come again, my God will humble me before you, and I will be grieved over many who have sinned earlier and have not repented of their acts of impurity, sexual immorality, and debauchery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_1","077_13_1","2CO","13","1","1","This is the third time I am coming to you. “Every matter must be established by the testimony of two or three witnesses.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_2","077_13_2","2CO","13","2","2","I already warned you the second time I was with you. So now in my absence I write to warn those who sinned earlier and everyone else: If I return, I will not spare anyone, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_3","077_13_3","2CO","13","3","3","since you are demanding proof that Christ is speaking through me. He is not weak in dealing with you, but is powerful among you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_4","077_13_4","2CO","13","4","4","For although He was indeed crucified in weakness, yet He lives by God’s power. For we are also weak in Him, yet by God’s power we will live with Him concerning you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_5","077_13_5","2CO","13","5","5","Examine yourselves to see whether you are in the faith; test yourselves. Do you not realize that Jesus Christ is in you—unless you actually fail the test? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_6","077_13_6","2CO","13","6","6","And I hope you will realize that we have not failed the test. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_7","077_13_7","2CO","13","7","7","Now I pray to God that you will not do anything wrong—not that we will appear to have stood the test, but that you will do what is right, even if we appear to have failed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_8","077_13_8","2CO","13","8","8","For we cannot do anything against the truth, but only for the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_9","077_13_9","2CO","13","9","9","In fact, we rejoice when we are weak but you are strong, and our prayer is for your perfection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_10","077_13_10","2CO","13","10","10","This is why I write these things while absent, so that when I am present I will not need to be severe in my use of the authority that the Lord gave me for building you up, not for tearing you down. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_11","077_13_11","2CO","13","11","11","Finally, brothers, rejoice! Aim for perfect harmony, encourage one another, be of one mind, live in peace. And the God of love and peace will be with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_12","077_13_12","2CO","13","12","12","Greet one another with a holy kiss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_13","077_13_13","2CO","13","13","13","All the saints send you greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("C213_14","077_13_14","2CO","13","14","14","The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the fellowship of the Holy Spirit be with all of you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_1","078_1_1","GAL","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle—sent not from men nor by man, but by Jesus Christ and God the Father, who raised Him from the dead— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_2","078_1_2","GAL","1","2","2","and all the brothers with me, To the churches of Galatia: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_3","078_1_3","GAL","1","3","3","Grace and peace to you from God the Father and our Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_4","078_1_4","GAL","1","4","4","who gave Himself for our sins to rescue us from the present evil age, according to the will of our God and Father, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_5","078_1_5","GAL","1","5","5","to whom be glory forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_6","078_1_6","GAL","1","6","6","I am amazed how quickly you are deserting the One who called you by the grace of Christ and are turning to a different gospel— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_7","078_1_7","GAL","1","7","7","which is not even a gospel. Evidently some people are troubling you and trying to distort the gospel of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_8","078_1_8","GAL","1","8","8","But even if we or an angel from heaven should preach a gospel contrary to the one we preached to you, let him be under a curse! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_9","078_1_9","GAL","1","9","9","As we have said before, so now I say again: If anyone is preaching to you a gospel contrary to the one you received, let him be under a curse! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_10","078_1_10","GAL","1","10","10","Am I now seeking the approval of men, or of God? Or am I striving to please men? For if I were still trying to please men, I would not be a servant of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_11","078_1_11","GAL","1","11","11","But I want you to know, brothers, that the gospel I preached was not devised by man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_12","078_1_12","GAL","1","12","12","I did not receive it from any man, nor was I taught it; rather, I received it by revelation from Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_13","078_1_13","GAL","1","13","13","For you have heard of my former way of life in Judaism, how severely I persecuted the church of God and tried to destroy it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_14","078_1_14","GAL","1","14","14","I was advancing in Judaism beyond many of my contemporaries and was extremely zealous for the traditions of my fathers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_15","078_1_15","GAL","1","15","15","But when God, who set me apart from my mother’s womb and called me by His grace, was pleased ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_16","078_1_16","GAL","1","16","16","to reveal His Son in me so that I might preach Him among the Gentiles, I did not rush to consult with flesh and blood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_17","078_1_17","GAL","1","17","17","nor did I go up to Jerusalem to the apostles who came before me, but I went into Arabia and later returned to Damascus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_18","078_1_18","GAL","1","18","18","Only after three years did I go up to Jerusalem to confer with Peter, and I stayed with him fifteen days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_19","078_1_19","GAL","1","19","19","But I saw none of the other apostles except James, the Lord’s brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_20","078_1_20","GAL","1","20","20","I assure you before God that what I am writing to you is no lie. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_21","078_1_21","GAL","1","21","21","Later I went to the regions of Syria and Cilicia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_22","078_1_22","GAL","1","22","22","I was personally unknown, however, to the churches of Judea that are in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_23","078_1_23","GAL","1","23","23","They only heard the account: “The man who formerly persecuted us is now preaching the faith he once tried to destroy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL1_24","078_1_24","GAL","1","24","24","And they glorified God because of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_1","078_2_1","GAL","2","1","1","Fourteen years later I went up again to Jerusalem, accompanied by Barnabas. I took Titus along also. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_2","078_2_2","GAL","2","2","2","I went in response to a revelation and set before them the gospel that I preach among the Gentiles. But I spoke privately to those recognized as leaders, for fear that I was running or had already run in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_3","078_2_3","GAL","2","3","3","Yet not even Titus, who was with me, was compelled to be circumcised, even though he was a Greek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_4","078_2_4","GAL","2","4","4","This issue arose because some false brothers had come in under false pretenses to spy on our freedom in Christ Jesus, in order to enslave us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_5","078_2_5","GAL","2","5","5","We did not give in to them for a moment, so that the truth of the gospel would remain with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_6","078_2_6","GAL","2","6","6","But as for the highly esteemed—whatever they were makes no difference to me; God does not show favoritism—those leaders added nothing to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_7","078_2_7","GAL","2","7","7","On the contrary, they saw that I had been entrusted to preach the gospel to the uncircumcised, just as Peter had been to the circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_8","078_2_8","GAL","2","8","8","For the One who was at work in Peter’s apostleship to the circumcised was also at work in my apostleship to the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_9","078_2_9","GAL","2","9","9","And recognizing the grace that I had been given, James, Cephas, and John—those reputed to be pillars—gave me and Barnabas the right hand of fellowship, so that we should go to the Gentiles, and they to the circumcised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_10","078_2_10","GAL","2","10","10","They only asked us to remember the poor, the very thing I was eager to do. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_11","078_2_11","GAL","2","11","11","When Peter came to Antioch, however, I opposed him to his face, because he stood condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_12","078_2_12","GAL","2","12","12","For before certain men came from James, he used to eat with the Gentiles. But when they arrived, he began to draw back and separate himself, for fear of those in the circumcision group. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_13","078_2_13","GAL","2","13","13","The other Jews joined him in his hypocrisy, so that by their hypocrisy even Barnabas was led astray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_14","078_2_14","GAL","2","14","14","When I saw that they were not walking in line with the truth of the gospel, I said to Peter in front of them all, “If you, who are a Jew, live like a Gentile and not like a Jew, how can you compel the Gentiles to live like Jews?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_15","078_2_15","GAL","2","15","15","We who are Jews by birth and not Gentile “sinners” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_16","078_2_16","GAL","2","16","16","know that a man is not justified by works of the law, but by faith in Jesus Christ. So we, too, have believed in Christ Jesus, that we may be justified by faith in Christ and not by works of the law, because by works of the law no one will be justified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_17","078_2_17","GAL","2","17","17","But if, while we seek to be justified in Christ, we ourselves are found to be sinners, does that make Christ a minister of sin? Certainly not! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_18","078_2_18","GAL","2","18","18","If I rebuild what I have already torn down, I prove myself to be a lawbreaker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_19","078_2_19","GAL","2","19","19","For through the law I died to the law so that I might live to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_20","078_2_20","GAL","2","20","20","I have been crucified with Christ, and I no longer live, but Christ lives in me. The life I live in the body, I live by faith in the Son of God, who loved me and gave Himself up for me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL2_21","078_2_21","GAL","2","21","21","I do not set aside the grace of God. For if righteousness comes through the law, then Christ died for nothing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_1","078_3_1","GAL","3","1","1","O foolish Galatians! Who has bewitched you not to obey the truth? Before your very eyes Jesus Christ was clearly portrayed among you as crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_2","078_3_2","GAL","3","2","2","I would like to learn just one thing from you: Did you receive the Spirit by works of the law, or by hearing with faith? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_3","078_3_3","GAL","3","3","3","Are you so foolish? After starting in the Spirit, are you now finishing in the flesh? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_4","078_3_4","GAL","3","4","4","Have you suffered so much for nothing, if it really was for nothing? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_5","078_3_5","GAL","3","5","5","Does God lavish His Spirit on you and work miracles among you because you practice the law, or because you hear and believe? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_6","078_3_6","GAL","3","6","6","So also, “Abraham believed God, and it was credited to him as righteousness.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_7","078_3_7","GAL","3","7","7","Understand, then, that those who have faith are sons of Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_8","078_3_8","GAL","3","8","8","The Scripture foresaw that God would justify the Gentiles by faith, and foretold the gospel to Abraham: “All nations will be blessed through you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_9","078_3_9","GAL","3","9","9","So those who have faith are blessed along with Abraham, the man of faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_10","078_3_10","GAL","3","10","10","All who rely on works of the law are under a curse. For it is written: “Cursed is everyone who does not continue to do everything written in the Book of the Law.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_11","078_3_11","GAL","3","11","11","Now it is clear that no one is justified before God by the law, because, “The righteous will live by faith.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_12","078_3_12","GAL","3","12","12","The law, however, is not based on faith; on the contrary, “The man who does these things will live by them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_13","078_3_13","GAL","3","13","13","Christ redeemed us from the curse of the law by becoming a curse for us. For it is written: “Cursed is everyone who is hung on a tree.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_14","078_3_14","GAL","3","14","14","He redeemed us in order that the blessing promised to Abraham would come to the Gentiles in Christ Jesus, so that by faith we might receive the promise of the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_15","078_3_15","GAL","3","15","15","Brothers, let me put this in human terms. Even a human covenant, once it is ratified, cannot be canceled or amended. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_16","078_3_16","GAL","3","16","16","The promises were spoken to Abraham and to his seed. The Scripture does not say, “and to seeds,” meaning many, but “and to your seed,” meaning One, who is Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_17","078_3_17","GAL","3","17","17","What I mean is this: The law that came 430 years later does not revoke the covenant previously established by God in Christ, so as to nullify the promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_18","078_3_18","GAL","3","18","18","For if the inheritance depends on the law, then it no longer depends on a promise; but God freely granted it to Abraham through a promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_19","078_3_19","GAL","3","19","19","Why then was the law given? It was added because of transgressions, until the arrival of the seed to whom the promise referred. It was administered through angels by a mediator. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_20","078_3_20","GAL","3","20","20","A mediator is unnecessary, however, for only one party; but God is one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_21","078_3_21","GAL","3","21","21","Is the law, then, opposed to the promises of God? Certainly not! For if a law had been given that could impart life, then righteousness would certainly have come from the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_22","078_3_22","GAL","3","22","22","But the Scripture pronounces all things confined by sin, so that by faith in Jesus Christ the promise might be given to those who believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_23","078_3_23","GAL","3","23","23","Before this faith came, we were held in custody under the law, locked up until faith should be revealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_24","078_3_24","GAL","3","24","24","So the law became our guardian to lead us to Christ, that we might be justified by faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_25","078_3_25","GAL","3","25","25","Now that faith has come, we are no longer under a guardian. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_26","078_3_26","GAL","3","26","26","You are all sons of God through faith in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_27","078_3_27","GAL","3","27","27","For all of you who were baptized into Christ have clothed yourselves with Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_28","078_3_28","GAL","3","28","28","There is neither Jew nor Greek, slave nor free, male nor female, for you are all one in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL3_29","078_3_29","GAL","3","29","29","And if you belong to Christ, then you are Abraham’s seed and heirs according to the promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_1","078_4_1","GAL","4","1","1","What I am saying is that as long as the heir is a child, he is no different from a slave, although he is the owner of everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_2","078_4_2","GAL","4","2","2","He is subject to guardians and trustees until the date set by his father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_3","078_4_3","GAL","4","3","3","So also, when we were children, we were enslaved under the basic principles of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_4","078_4_4","GAL","4","4","4","But when the time had fully come, God sent His Son, born of a woman, born under the law, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_5","078_4_5","GAL","4","5","5","to redeem those under the law, that we might receive our adoption as sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_6","078_4_6","GAL","4","6","6","And because you are sons, God sent the Spirit of His Son into your hearts, crying out, “Abba, Father!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_7","078_4_7","GAL","4","7","7","So you are no longer a slave, but a son; and since you are a son, you are also an heir of God through Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_8","078_4_8","GAL","4","8","8","Formerly, when you did not know God, you were slaves to those who by nature are not gods. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_9","078_4_9","GAL","4","9","9","But now that you know God, or rather are known by God, how is it that you are turning back to those weak and worthless principles? Do you wish to be enslaved by them all over again? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_10","078_4_10","GAL","4","10","10","You are observing special days and months and seasons and years! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_11","078_4_11","GAL","4","11","11","I fear for you, that my efforts for you may have been in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_12","078_4_12","GAL","4","12","12","I beg you, brothers, become like me, for I became like you. You have done me no wrong. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_13","078_4_13","GAL","4","13","13","You know that it was because of an illness that I first preached the gospel to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_14","078_4_14","GAL","4","14","14","And although my illness was a trial to me, you did not despise or reject me. Instead, you welcomed me as if I were an angel of God, as if I were Christ Jesus Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_15","078_4_15","GAL","4","15","15","What then has become of your blessing? For I can testify that, if it were possible, you would have torn out your eyes and given them to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_16","078_4_16","GAL","4","16","16","Have I now become your enemy by telling you the truth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_17","078_4_17","GAL","4","17","17","Those people are zealous for you, but not in a good way. Instead, they want to isolate you from us, so that you may be zealous for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_18","078_4_18","GAL","4","18","18","Nevertheless, it is good to be zealous if it serves a noble purpose—at any time, and not only when I am with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_19","078_4_19","GAL","4","19","19","My little children, for whom I am again in the pains of childbirth until Christ is formed in you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_20","078_4_20","GAL","4","20","20","how I wish I could be with you now and change my tone, because I am perplexed about you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_21","078_4_21","GAL","4","21","21","Tell me, you who want to be under the law, do you not understand what the law says? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_22","078_4_22","GAL","4","22","22","For it is written that Abraham had two sons, one by the slave woman and the other by the free woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_23","078_4_23","GAL","4","23","23","His son by the slave woman was born according to the flesh, but his son by the free woman was born through the promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_24","078_4_24","GAL","4","24","24","These things serve as illustrations, for the women represent two covenants. One covenant is from Mount Sinai and bears children into slavery: This is Hagar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_25","078_4_25","GAL","4","25","25","For Hagar stands for Mount Sinai in Arabia and corresponds to the present-day Jerusalem, and she is in slavery with her children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_26","078_4_26","GAL","4","26","26","But the Jerusalem above is free, and she is the mother of us all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_27","078_4_27","GAL","4","27","27","For it is written: “Rejoice, O barren woman, who bears no children; break forth and cry aloud, you who have never travailed; because more are the children of the desolate woman than of her who has a husband.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_28","078_4_28","GAL","4","28","28","Now we, brothers, like Isaac, are children of promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_29","078_4_29","GAL","4","29","29","At that time, however, the son born by the flesh persecuted the son born by the Spirit. It is the same now. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_30","078_4_30","GAL","4","30","30","But what does the Scripture say? “Expel the slave woman and her son, for the slave woman’s son will never share in the inheritance with the free woman’s son.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL4_31","078_4_31","GAL","4","31","31","Therefore, brothers, we are not children of the slave woman, but of the free woman. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_1","078_5_1","GAL","5","1","1","In the freedom with which Christ has set us free, stand firm, then, and do not be encumbered once more by a yoke of slavery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_2","078_5_2","GAL","5","2","2","Take notice: I, Paul, tell you that if you let yourselves be circumcised, Christ will be of no value to you at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_3","078_5_3","GAL","5","3","3","Again I testify to every man who gets himself circumcised that he is obligated to obey the whole law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_4","078_5_4","GAL","5","4","4","You who are trying to be justified by the law have been severed from Christ; you have fallen away from grace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_5","078_5_5","GAL","5","5","5","But by faith we eagerly await through the Spirit the hope of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_6","078_5_6","GAL","5","6","6","For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision nor uncircumcision has any value. All that matters is faith expressing itself through love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_7","078_5_7","GAL","5","7","7","You were running so well. Who has obstructed you from obeying the truth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_8","078_5_8","GAL","5","8","8","Such persuasion does not come from the One who calls you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_9","078_5_9","GAL","5","9","9","A little leaven works through the whole batch of dough. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_10","078_5_10","GAL","5","10","10","I am confident in the Lord that you will take no other view. The one who is troubling you will bear the judgment, whoever he may be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_11","078_5_11","GAL","5","11","11","Now, brothers, if I am still preaching circumcision, why am I still being persecuted? In that case the offense of the cross has been abolished. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_12","078_5_12","GAL","5","12","12","As for those who are agitating you, I wish they would proceed to emasculate themselves! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_13","078_5_13","GAL","5","13","13","For you, brothers, were called to freedom; but do not use your freedom as an opportunity for the flesh. Rather, serve one another in love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_14","078_5_14","GAL","5","14","14","The entire law is fulfilled in a single decree: “Love your neighbor as yourself.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_15","078_5_15","GAL","5","15","15","But if you keep on biting and devouring one another, watch out, or you will be consumed by one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_16","078_5_16","GAL","5","16","16","So I say, walk by the Spirit, and you will not gratify the desires of the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_17","078_5_17","GAL","5","17","17","For the flesh craves what is contrary to the Spirit, and the Spirit what is contrary to the flesh. They are opposed to each other, so that you do not do what you want. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_18","078_5_18","GAL","5","18","18","But if you are led by the Spirit, you are not under the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_19","078_5_19","GAL","5","19","19","The acts of the flesh are obvious: adultery, sexual immorality, impurity, and debauchery; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_20","078_5_20","GAL","5","20","20","idolatry and sorcery; hostilities, quarrels, jealousies, and rage; rivalries, divisions, factions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_21","078_5_21","GAL","5","21","21","envy, and murders; drunkenness, orgies, and the like. I warn you, as I did before, that those who practice such things will not inherit the kingdom of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_22","078_5_22","GAL","5","22","22","But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_23","078_5_23","GAL","5","23","23","gentleness, and self-control. Against such things there is no law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_24","078_5_24","GAL","5","24","24","Those who belong to Christ have crucified the flesh with its passions and desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_25","078_5_25","GAL","5","25","25","Since we live by the Spirit, let us walk in step with the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL5_26","078_5_26","GAL","5","26","26","Let us not become conceited, provoking and envying one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_1","078_6_1","GAL","6","1","1","Brothers, if someone is caught in a trespass, you who are spiritual should restore him with a spirit of gentleness. But watch yourself, or you also may be tempted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_2","078_6_2","GAL","6","2","2","Carry one another’s burdens, and in this way you will fulfill the law of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_3","078_6_3","GAL","6","3","3","If anyone thinks he is something when he is nothing, he deceives himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_4","078_6_4","GAL","6","4","4","Each one should test his own work. Then he will have reason to boast in himself alone, and not in someone else. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_5","078_6_5","GAL","6","5","5","For each one should carry his own load. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_6","078_6_6","GAL","6","6","6","Nevertheless, the one who receives instruction in the word must share in all good things with his instructor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_7","078_6_7","GAL","6","7","7","Do not be deceived: God is not to be mocked. Whatever a man sows, he will reap in return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_8","078_6_8","GAL","6","8","8","The one who sows to please his flesh, from the flesh will reap destruction; but the one who sows to please the Spirit, from the Spirit will reap eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_9","078_6_9","GAL","6","9","9","Let us not grow weary in well-doing, for in due time we will reap a harvest if we do not give up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_10","078_6_10","GAL","6","10","10","Therefore, as we have opportunity, let us do good to everyone, and especially to the family of faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_11","078_6_11","GAL","6","11","11","See what large letters I am using to write to you with my own hand! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_12","078_6_12","GAL","6","12","12","Those who want to make a good impression outwardly are trying to compel you to be circumcised. They only do this to avoid persecution for the cross of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_13","078_6_13","GAL","6","13","13","For the circumcised do not even keep the law themselves, yet they want you to be circumcised that they may boast in your flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_14","078_6_14","GAL","6","14","14","But as for me, may I never boast, except in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, through which the world has been crucified to me, and I to the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_15","078_6_15","GAL","6","15","15","For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision nor uncircumcision means anything. What counts is a new creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_16","078_6_16","GAL","6","16","16","Peace and mercy to all who walk by this rule, even to the Israel of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_17","078_6_17","GAL","6","17","17","From now on let no one cause me trouble, for I bear on my body the marks of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("GL6_18","078_6_18","GAL","6","18","18","The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit, brothers. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_1","079_1_1","EPH","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, To the saints in Ephesus, the faithful in Christ Jesus: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_2","079_1_2","EPH","1","2","2","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_3","079_1_3","EPH","1","3","3","Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who has blessed us in Christ with every spiritual blessing in the heavenly realms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_4","079_1_4","EPH","1","4","4","For He chose us in Him before the foundation of the world to be holy and blameless in His presence. In love ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_5","079_1_5","EPH","1","5","5","He predestined us for adoption as His sons through Jesus Christ, according to the good pleasure of His will, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_6","079_1_6","EPH","1","6","6","to the praise of His glorious grace, by which He has bestowed favor upon us in the Beloved One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_7","079_1_7","EPH","1","7","7","In Him we have redemption through His blood, the forgiveness of our trespasses, according to the riches of His grace ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_8","079_1_8","EPH","1","8","8","that He lavished on us with all wisdom and understanding. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_9","079_1_9","EPH","1","9","9","And He has made known to us the mystery of His will according to His good pleasure, which He purposed in Christ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_10","079_1_10","EPH","1","10","10","as a plan for the fullness of time, to bring all things in heaven and on earth together in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_11","079_1_11","EPH","1","11","11","In Him we were also chosen as God’s own, having been predestined according to the plan of Him who works out everything by the counsel of His will, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_12","079_1_12","EPH","1","12","12","in order that we, who were the first to hope in Christ, would be for the praise of His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_13","079_1_13","EPH","1","13","13","And in Him you also—having heard the word of truth, the gospel of your salvation—believed and were sealed with the promised Holy Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_14","079_1_14","EPH","1","14","14","who is the pledge of our inheritance until the redemption of those who are God’s possession, to the praise of His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_15","079_1_15","EPH","1","15","15","For this reason, ever since I heard about your faith in the Lord Jesus and your love for all the saints, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_16","079_1_16","EPH","1","16","16","I have not stopped giving thanks for you, remembering you in my prayers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_17","079_1_17","EPH","1","17","17","that the God of our Lord Jesus Christ, the glorious Father, may give you a spirit of wisdom and revelation in your knowledge of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_18","079_1_18","EPH","1","18","18","I ask that the eyes of your heart may be enlightened, so that you may know the hope of His calling, the riches of His glorious inheritance in the saints, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_19","079_1_19","EPH","1","19","19","and the surpassing greatness of His power to us who believe. These are in accordance with the working of His mighty strength, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_20","079_1_20","EPH","1","20","20","which He exerted in Christ when He raised Him from the dead and seated Him at His right hand in the heavenly realms, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_21","079_1_21","EPH","1","21","21","far above all rule and authority, power and dominion, and every name that is named, not only in the present age but also in the one to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_22","079_1_22","EPH","1","22","22","And God put everything under His feet and made Him head over everything for the church, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP1_23","079_1_23","EPH","1","23","23","which is His body, the fullness of Him who fills all in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_1","079_2_1","EPH","2","1","1","And you were dead in your trespasses and sins, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_2","079_2_2","EPH","2","2","2","in which you used to walk when you conformed to the ways of this world and of the ruler of the power of the air, the spirit who is now at work in the sons of disobedience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_3","079_2_3","EPH","2","3","3","All of us also lived among them at one time, fulfilling the cravings of our flesh and indulging its desires and thoughts. Like the rest, we were by nature children of wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_4","079_2_4","EPH","2","4","4","But because of His great love for us, God, who is rich in mercy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_5","079_2_5","EPH","2","5","5","made us alive with Christ even when we were dead in our trespasses. It is by grace you have been saved! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_6","079_2_6","EPH","2","6","6","And God raised us up with Christ and seated us with Him in the heavenly realms in Christ Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_7","079_2_7","EPH","2","7","7","in order that in the coming ages He might display the surpassing riches of His grace, demonstrated by His kindness to us in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_8","079_2_8","EPH","2","8","8","For it is by grace you have been saved through faith, and this not from yourselves; it is the gift of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_9","079_2_9","EPH","2","9","9","not by works, so that no one can boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_10","079_2_10","EPH","2","10","10","For we are God’s workmanship, created in Christ Jesus to do good works, which God prepared in advance as our way of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_11","079_2_11","EPH","2","11","11","Therefore remember that formerly you who are Gentiles in the flesh and called uncircumcised by the so-called circumcision (that done in the body by human hands)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_12","079_2_12","EPH","2","12","12","remember that at that time you were separate from Christ, alienated from the commonwealth of Israel, and strangers to the covenants of the promise, without hope and without God in the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_13","079_2_13","EPH","2","13","13","But now in Christ Jesus you who once were far away have been brought near through the blood of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_14","079_2_14","EPH","2","14","14","For He Himself is our peace, who has made the two one and has torn down the dividing wall of hostility ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_15","079_2_15","EPH","2","15","15","by abolishing in His flesh the law of commandments and decrees. He did this to create in Himself one new man out of the two, thus making peace ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_16","079_2_16","EPH","2","16","16","and reconciling both of them to God in one body through the cross, by which He put to death their hostility. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_17","079_2_17","EPH","2","17","17","He came and preached peace to you who were far away and to those who were near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_18","079_2_18","EPH","2","18","18","For through Him we both have access to the Father by one Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_19","079_2_19","EPH","2","19","19","Therefore you are no longer strangers and foreigners, but fellow citizens with the saints and members of God’s household, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_20","079_2_20","EPH","2","20","20","built on the foundation of the apostles and prophets, with Jesus Christ Himself as the cornerstone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_21","079_2_21","EPH","2","21","21","In Him the whole building is fitted together and grows into a holy temple in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP2_22","079_2_22","EPH","2","22","22","And in Him you too are being built together into a dwelling place for God in His Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_1","079_3_1","EPH","3","1","1","For this reason I, Paul, the prisoner of Christ Jesus for the sake of you Gentiles... ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_2","079_3_2","EPH","3","2","2","Surely you have heard about the stewardship of God’s grace that was given to me for you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_3","079_3_3","EPH","3","3","3","that is, the mystery made known to me by revelation, as I have already written briefly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_4","079_3_4","EPH","3","4","4","In reading this, then, you will be able to understand my insight into the mystery of Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_5","079_3_5","EPH","3","5","5","which was not made known to men in other generations as it has now been revealed by the Spirit to God’s holy apostles and prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_6","079_3_6","EPH","3","6","6","This mystery is that through the gospel the Gentiles are fellow heirs, fellow members of the body, and fellow partakers of His promise in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_7","079_3_7","EPH","3","7","7","I became a servant of this gospel by the gift of God’s grace, given me through the working of His power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_8","079_3_8","EPH","3","8","8","Though I am less than the least of all the saints, this grace was given me: to preach among the Gentiles the unsearchable riches of Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_9","079_3_9","EPH","3","9","9","and to illuminate for everyone the stewardship of this mystery, which for ages past was kept hidden in God, who created all things through Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_10","079_3_10","EPH","3","10","10","His purpose was that now, through the church, the manifold wisdom of God should be made known to the rulers and authorities in the heavenly realms, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_11","079_3_11","EPH","3","11","11","according to the eternal purpose that He accomplished in Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_12","079_3_12","EPH","3","12","12","In Him and through faith in Him we may enter God’s presence with boldness and confidence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_13","079_3_13","EPH","3","13","13","So I ask you not to be discouraged because of my sufferings for you, which are your glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_14","079_3_14","EPH","3","14","14","... for this reason I bow my knees before the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_15","079_3_15","EPH","3","15","15","from whom every family in heaven and on earth derives its name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_16","079_3_16","EPH","3","16","16","I ask that out of the riches of His glory He may strengthen you with power through His Spirit in your inner being, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_17","079_3_17","EPH","3","17","17","so that Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith. Then you, being rooted and grounded in love, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_18","079_3_18","EPH","3","18","18","will have power, together with all the saints, to comprehend the length and width and depth and height ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_19","079_3_19","EPH","3","19","19","of the love of Christ, and to know this love that surpasses knowledge, that you may be filled with all the fullness of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_20","079_3_20","EPH","3","20","20","Now to Him who is able to do immeasurably more than all we ask or imagine, according to His power that is at work within us, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP3_21","079_3_21","EPH","3","21","21","to Him be the glory in the church in Christ Jesus throughout all generations, forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_1","079_4_1","EPH","4","1","1","As a prisoner in the Lord, then, I urge you to walk in a manner worthy of the calling you have received: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_2","079_4_2","EPH","4","2","2","with all humility and gentleness, with patience, bearing with one another in love, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_3","079_4_3","EPH","4","3","3","and with diligence to preserve the unity of the Spirit through the bond of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_4","079_4_4","EPH","4","4","4","There is one body and one Spirit, just as you were called to one hope when you were called; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_5","079_4_5","EPH","4","5","5","one Lord, one faith, one baptism; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_6","079_4_6","EPH","4","6","6","one God and Father of all, who is over all and through all and in us all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_7","079_4_7","EPH","4","7","7","Now to each one of us grace has been given according to the measure of the gift of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_8","079_4_8","EPH","4","8","8","This is why it says: “When He ascended on high, He led captives away, and gave gifts to men.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_9","079_4_9","EPH","4","9","9","What does “He ascended” mean, except that He also descended first to the lower parts of the earth? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_10","079_4_10","EPH","4","10","10","He who descended is the very One who ascended above all the heavens, in order to fill all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_11","079_4_11","EPH","4","11","11","And it was He who gave some to be apostles, some to be prophets, some to be evangelists, and some to be pastors and teachers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_12","079_4_12","EPH","4","12","12","to equip the saints for works of ministry and to build up the body of Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_13","079_4_13","EPH","4","13","13","until we all reach unity in the faith and in the knowledge of the Son of God, as we mature to the full measure of the stature of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_14","079_4_14","EPH","4","14","14","Then we will no longer be infants, tossed about by the waves and carried around by every wind of teaching and by the clever cunning of men in their deceitful scheming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_15","079_4_15","EPH","4","15","15","Instead, speaking the truth in love, we will in all things grow up into Christ Himself, who is the head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_16","079_4_16","EPH","4","16","16","From Him the whole body, fitted and held together by every supporting ligament, grows and builds itself up in love through the work of each individual part. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_17","079_4_17","EPH","4","17","17","So I tell you this, and insist on it in the Lord, that you must no longer walk as the other Gentiles do, in the futility of their thinking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_18","079_4_18","EPH","4","18","18","They are darkened in their understanding and alienated from the life of God because of the ignorance that is in them due to the hardness of their hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_19","079_4_19","EPH","4","19","19","Having lost all sense of shame, they have given themselves over to sensuality for the practice of every kind of impurity, with a craving for more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_20","079_4_20","EPH","4","20","20","But this is not the way you came to know Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_21","079_4_21","EPH","4","21","21","Surely you heard of Him and were taught in Him—in keeping with the truth that is in Jesus— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_22","079_4_22","EPH","4","22","22","to put off your former way of life, your old self, which is being corrupted by its deceitful desires; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_23","079_4_23","EPH","4","23","23","to be renewed in the spirit of your minds; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_24","079_4_24","EPH","4","24","24","and to put on the new self, created to be like God in true righteousness and holiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_25","079_4_25","EPH","4","25","25","Therefore each of you must put off falsehood and speak truthfully to his neighbor, for we are all members of one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_26","079_4_26","EPH","4","26","26","“Be angry, yet do not sin.” Do not let the sun set upon your anger, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_27","079_4_27","EPH","4","27","27","and do not give the devil a foothold. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_28","079_4_28","EPH","4","28","28","He who has been stealing must steal no longer, but must work, doing good with his hands, that he may have something to share with the one in need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_29","079_4_29","EPH","4","29","29","Let no unwholesome talk come out of your mouths, but only what is helpful for building up the one in need and bringing grace to those who listen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_30","079_4_30","EPH","4","30","30","And do not grieve the Holy Spirit of God, in whom you were sealed for the day of redemption. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_31","079_4_31","EPH","4","31","31","Get rid of all bitterness, rage and anger, outcry and slander, along with every form of malice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP4_32","079_4_32","EPH","4","32","32","Be kind and tenderhearted to one another, forgiving each other just as in Christ God forgave us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_1","079_5_1","EPH","5","1","1","Be imitators of God, therefore, as beloved children, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_2","079_5_2","EPH","5","2","2","and walk in love, just as Christ loved us and gave Himself up for us as a fragrant sacrificial offering to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_3","079_5_3","EPH","5","3","3","But among you, as is proper among the saints, there must not be even a hint of sexual immorality, or of any kind of impurity, or of greed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_4","079_5_4","EPH","5","4","4","Nor should there be obscenity, foolish talk, or crude joking, which are out of character, but rather thanksgiving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_5","079_5_5","EPH","5","5","5","For of this you can be sure: No immoral, impure, or greedy person (that is, an idolater) has any inheritance in the kingdom of Christ and of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_6","079_5_6","EPH","5","6","6","Let no one deceive you with empty words, for because of such things the wrath of God is coming on the sons of disobedience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_7","079_5_7","EPH","5","7","7","Therefore do not be partakers with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_8","079_5_8","EPH","5","8","8","For you were once darkness, but now you are light in the Lord. Walk as children of light, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_9","079_5_9","EPH","5","9","9","for the fruit of the Spirit consists in all goodness, righteousness, and truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_10","079_5_10","EPH","5","10","10","Test and prove what pleases the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_11","079_5_11","EPH","5","11","11","Have no fellowship with the fruitless deeds of darkness, but rather expose them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_12","079_5_12","EPH","5","12","12","For it is shameful even to mention what the disobedient do in secret. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_13","079_5_13","EPH","5","13","13","But everything exposed by the light becomes visible, for everything that is illuminated becomes a light itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_14","079_5_14","EPH","5","14","14","So it is said: “Wake up, O sleeper, rise up from the dead, and Christ will shine on you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_15","079_5_15","EPH","5","15","15","Pay careful attention, then, to how you walk, not as unwise but as wise, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_16","079_5_16","EPH","5","16","16","redeeming the time, because the days are evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_17","079_5_17","EPH","5","17","17","Therefore do not be foolish, but understand what the Lord’s will is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_18","079_5_18","EPH","5","18","18","Do not get drunk on wine, which leads to reckless indiscretion. Instead, be filled with the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_19","079_5_19","EPH","5","19","19","Speak to one another with psalms, hymns, and spiritual songs. Sing and make music in your hearts to the Lord, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_20","079_5_20","EPH","5","20","20","always giving thanks to God the Father for everything in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_21","079_5_21","EPH","5","21","21","Submit to one another out of reverence for Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_22","079_5_22","EPH","5","22","22","Wives, submit to your husbands as to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_23","079_5_23","EPH","5","23","23","For the husband is the head of the wife as Christ is the head of the church, and He is the Savior of the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_24","079_5_24","EPH","5","24","24","Now as the church submits to Christ, so also wives should submit to their husbands in everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_25","079_5_25","EPH","5","25","25","Husbands, love your wives, just as Christ loved the church and gave Himself up for her ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_26","079_5_26","EPH","5","26","26","to sanctify her, cleansing her by the washing with water through the word, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_27","079_5_27","EPH","5","27","27","and to present her to Himself as a glorious church, without stain or wrinkle or any such blemish, but holy and blameless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_28","079_5_28","EPH","5","28","28","In the same way, husbands ought to love their wives as their own bodies. He who loves his wife loves himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_29","079_5_29","EPH","5","29","29","Indeed, no one ever hated his own body, but he nourishes and cherishes it, just as the Lord does the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_30","079_5_30","EPH","5","30","30","For we are members of His body—of His flesh and of His bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_31","079_5_31","EPH","5","31","31","“For this reason a man will leave his father and mother and be united to his wife, and the two will become one flesh.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_32","079_5_32","EPH","5","32","32","This mystery is profound, but I am speaking about Christ and the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP5_33","079_5_33","EPH","5","33","33","Nevertheless, each one of you also must love his wife as he loves himself, and the wife must respect her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_1","079_6_1","EPH","6","1","1","Children, obey your parents in the Lord, for this is right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_2","079_6_2","EPH","6","2","2","“Honor your father and mother” (which is the first commandment with a promise), ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_3","079_6_3","EPH","6","3","3","“that it may go well with you and that you may have a long life on the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_4","079_6_4","EPH","6","4","4","Fathers, do not provoke your children to wrath; instead, bring them up in the discipline and instruction of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_5","079_6_5","EPH","6","5","5","Slaves, obey your earthly masters with respect and fear and sincerity of heart, just as you would obey Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_6","079_6_6","EPH","6","6","6","And do this not only to please them while they are watching, but as servants of Christ, doing the will of God from your heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_7","079_6_7","EPH","6","7","7","Serve with good will, as to the Lord and not to men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_8","079_6_8","EPH","6","8","8","because you know that the Lord will reward each one for whatever good he does, whether he is slave or free. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_9","079_6_9","EPH","6","9","9","And masters, do the same for your slaves. Give up your use of threats, because you know that your Master is in heaven, and there is no favoritism with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_10","079_6_10","EPH","6","10","10","Finally, my brothers, be strong in the Lord and in His mighty power. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_11","079_6_11","EPH","6","11","11","Put on the full armor of God, so that you can make your stand against the devil’s schemes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_12","079_6_12","EPH","6","12","12","For our struggle is not against flesh and blood, but against the rulers, against the authorities, against the powers of this world’s darkness, and against the spiritual forces of evil in the heavenly realms. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_13","079_6_13","EPH","6","13","13","Therefore take up the full armor of God, so that when the day of evil comes, you will be able to stand your ground, and having done everything, to stand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_14","079_6_14","EPH","6","14","14","Stand firm then, with the belt of truth buckled around your waist, with the breastplate of righteousness arrayed, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_15","079_6_15","EPH","6","15","15","and with your feet fitted with the readiness of the gospel of peace. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_16","079_6_16","EPH","6","16","16","In addition to all this, take up the shield of faith, with which you can extinguish all the flaming arrows of the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_17","079_6_17","EPH","6","17","17","And take the helmet of salvation and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_18","079_6_18","EPH","6","18","18","Pray in the Spirit at all times, with every kind of prayer and petition. To this end, stay alert with all perseverance in your prayers for all the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_19","079_6_19","EPH","6","19","19","Pray also for me, that whenever I open my mouth, words may be given me so that I will boldly make known the mystery of the gospel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_20","079_6_20","EPH","6","20","20","for which I am an ambassador in chains. Pray that I may proclaim it fearlessly, as I should. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_21","079_6_21","EPH","6","21","21","Tychicus, the beloved brother and faithful servant in the Lord, will tell you everything, so that you also may know about me and what I am doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_22","079_6_22","EPH","6","22","22","I have sent him to you for this very purpose, that you may know about us, and that he may encourage your hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_23","079_6_23","EPH","6","23","23","Peace to the brothers and love with faith from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("EP6_24","079_6_24","EPH","6","24","24","Grace to all who love our Lord Jesus Christ with an undying love. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_1","080_1_1","PHP","1","1","1","Paul and Timothy, servants of Jesus Christ, To all the saints in Christ Jesus at Philippi, together with the overseers and deacons: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_2","080_1_2","PHP","1","2","2","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_3","080_1_3","PHP","1","3","3","I thank my God every time I remember you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_4","080_1_4","PHP","1","4","4","In every prayer for all of you, I always pray with joy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_5","080_1_5","PHP","1","5","5","because of your partnership in the gospel from the first day until now, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_6","080_1_6","PHP","1","6","6","being confident of this, that He who began a good work in you will carry it on to completion until the day of Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_7","080_1_7","PHP","1","7","7","It is right for me to feel this way about all of you, since I have you in my heart. For in my chains and in my defense and confirmation of the gospel, you are all partners in grace with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_8","080_1_8","PHP","1","8","8","God is my witness how I long for all of you with the affection of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_9","080_1_9","PHP","1","9","9","And this is my prayer: that your love may abound more and more in knowledge and depth of insight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_10","080_1_10","PHP","1","10","10","so that you may be able to test and prove what is best and may be pure and blameless for the day of Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_11","080_1_11","PHP","1","11","11","filled with the fruits of righteousness that come through Jesus Christ, to the glory and praise of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_12","080_1_12","PHP","1","12","12","Now I want you to know, brothers, that my circumstances have actually served to advance the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_13","080_1_13","PHP","1","13","13","As a result, it has become clear throughout the whole palace guard and to everyone else that I am in chains for Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_14","080_1_14","PHP","1","14","14","And most of the brothers, confident in the Lord by my chains, now dare more greatly to speak the word without fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_15","080_1_15","PHP","1","15","15","It is true that some preach Christ out of envy and rivalry, but others out of goodwill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_16","080_1_16","PHP","1","16","16","The former preach Christ out of selfish ambition, not sincerely, supposing that they can add to the distress of my chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_17","080_1_17","PHP","1","17","17","The latter do so in love, knowing that I am appointed for the defense of the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_18","080_1_18","PHP","1","18","18","What then is the issue? Just this: that in every way, whether by false motives or true, Christ is preached. And in this I rejoice. Yes, and I will continue to rejoice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_19","080_1_19","PHP","1","19","19","because I know that through your prayers and the provision of the Spirit of Jesus Christ, my distress will turn out for my deliverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_20","080_1_20","PHP","1","20","20","I eagerly expect and hope that I will in no way be ashamed, but will have complete boldness so that now as always Christ will be exalted in my body, whether by life or by death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_21","080_1_21","PHP","1","21","21","For to me, to live is Christ, and to die is gain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_22","080_1_22","PHP","1","22","22","But if I go on living in the body, this will mean fruitful labor for me. So what shall I choose? I do not know. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_23","080_1_23","PHP","1","23","23","I am torn between the two. I desire to depart and be with Christ, which is far better. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_24","080_1_24","PHP","1","24","24","But it is more necessary for you that I remain in the body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_25","080_1_25","PHP","1","25","25","Convinced of this, I know that I will remain and will continue with all of you for your progress and joy in the faith, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_26","080_1_26","PHP","1","26","26","so that through my coming to you again your exultation in Christ Jesus will resound on account of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_27","080_1_27","PHP","1","27","27","Nevertheless, conduct yourselves in a manner worthy of the gospel of Christ. Then, whether I come and see you or only hear about you in my absence, I will know that you stand firm in one spirit, contending side by side for the faith of the gospel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_28","080_1_28","PHP","1","28","28","without being frightened in any way by those who oppose you. This is indeed a clear sign of their destruction but of your salvation, and it is from God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_29","080_1_29","PHP","1","29","29","For it has been granted to you on behalf of Christ not only to believe in Him, but also to suffer for Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP1_30","080_1_30","PHP","1","30","30","since you are encountering the same struggle you saw I had, and now hear that I still have. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_1","080_2_1","PHP","2","1","1","Therefore if you have any encouragement in Christ, if any comfort from His love, if any fellowship with the Spirit, if any affection and compassion, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_2","080_2_2","PHP","2","2","2","then make my joy complete by being like-minded, having the same love, being united in spirit and purpose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_3","080_2_3","PHP","2","3","3","Do nothing out of selfish ambition or empty pride, but in humility consider others more important than yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_4","080_2_4","PHP","2","4","4","Each of you should look not only to your own interests, but also to the interests of others. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_5","080_2_5","PHP","2","5","5","Let this mind be in you which was also in Christ Jesus: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_6","080_2_6","PHP","2","6","6","Who, existing in the form of God, did not consider equality with God something to be grasped, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_7","080_2_7","PHP","2","7","7","but emptied Himself, taking the form of a servant, being made in human likeness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_8","080_2_8","PHP","2","8","8","And being found in appearance as a man, He humbled Himself and became obedient to death—even death on a cross. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_9","080_2_9","PHP","2","9","9","Therefore God exalted Him to the highest place and gave Him the name above all names, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_10","080_2_10","PHP","2","10","10","that at the name of Jesus every knee should bow, in heaven and on earth and under the earth, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_11","080_2_11","PHP","2","11","11","and every tongue confess that Jesus Christ is Lord, to the glory of God the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_12","080_2_12","PHP","2","12","12","Therefore, my beloved, just as you have always obeyed, not only in my presence, but now even more in my absence, continue to work out your salvation with fear and trembling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_13","080_2_13","PHP","2","13","13","For it is God who works in you to will and to act on behalf of His good purpose. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_14","080_2_14","PHP","2","14","14","Do everything without complaining or arguing, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_15","080_2_15","PHP","2","15","15","so that you may be blameless and pure, children of God without fault in a crooked and perverse generation, in which you shine as lights in the world ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_16","080_2_16","PHP","2","16","16","as you hold forth the word of life, in order that I may boast on the day of Christ that I did not run or labor in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_17","080_2_17","PHP","2","17","17","But even if I am being poured out like a drink offering on the sacrifice and service of your faith, I am glad and rejoice with all of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_18","080_2_18","PHP","2","18","18","So you too should be glad and rejoice with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_19","080_2_19","PHP","2","19","19","Now I hope in the Lord Jesus to send Timothy to you soon, that I also may be cheered when I learn how you are doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_20","080_2_20","PHP","2","20","20","I have nobody else like him who will genuinely care for your needs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_21","080_2_21","PHP","2","21","21","For all the others look after their own interests, not those of Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_22","080_2_22","PHP","2","22","22","But you know Timothy’s proven worth, that as a child with his father he has served with me to advance the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_23","080_2_23","PHP","2","23","23","So I hope to send him as soon as I see what happens with me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_24","080_2_24","PHP","2","24","24","And I trust in the Lord that I myself will come soon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_25","080_2_25","PHP","2","25","25","But I thought it necessary to send back to you Epaphroditus, my brother, fellow worker, and fellow soldier, who is also your messenger and minister to my needs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_26","080_2_26","PHP","2","26","26","For he has been longing for all of you and is distressed because you heard he was ill. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_27","080_2_27","PHP","2","27","27","He was sick indeed, nearly unto death. But God had mercy on him, and not only on him but also on me, to spare me sorrow upon sorrow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_28","080_2_28","PHP","2","28","28","Therefore I am all the more eager to send him, so that when you see him again you may rejoice, and I may be less anxious. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_29","080_2_29","PHP","2","29","29","Welcome him in the Lord with great joy, and honor men like him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP2_30","080_2_30","PHP","2","30","30","because he nearly died for the work of Christ, disregarding his life to make up for your deficit of service to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_1","080_3_1","PHP","3","1","1","Finally, my brothers, rejoice in the Lord. It is no trouble for me to write the same things to you again, and it is a safeguard for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_2","080_3_2","PHP","3","2","2","Watch out for those dogs, those workers of evil, those mutilators of the flesh! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_3","080_3_3","PHP","3","3","3","For it is we who are the circumcision, we who worship by the Spirit of God, who glory in Christ Jesus, and who put no confidence in the flesh— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_4","080_3_4","PHP","3","4","4","though I myself could have such confidence. If anyone else thinks he has grounds for confidence in the flesh, I have more: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_5","080_3_5","PHP","3","5","5","circumcised on the eighth day, of the people of Israel, of the tribe of Benjamin; a Hebrew of Hebrews; as to the law, a Pharisee; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_6","080_3_6","PHP","3","6","6","as to zeal, persecuting the church; as to righteousness in the law, faultless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_7","080_3_7","PHP","3","7","7","But whatever was gain to me I count as loss for the sake of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_8","080_3_8","PHP","3","8","8","More than that, I count all things as loss compared to the surpassing excellence of knowing Christ Jesus my Lord, for whom I have lost all things. I consider them rubbish, that I may gain Christ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_9","080_3_9","PHP","3","9","9","and be found in Him, not having my own righteousness from the law, but that which is through faith in Christ, the righteousness from God on the basis of faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_10","080_3_10","PHP","3","10","10","I want to know Christ and the power of His resurrection and the fellowship of His sufferings, being conformed to Him in His death, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_11","080_3_11","PHP","3","11","11","and so, somehow, to attain to the resurrection from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_12","080_3_12","PHP","3","12","12","Not that I have already obtained all this, or have already been made perfect, but I press on to take hold of that for which Christ Jesus took hold of me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_13","080_3_13","PHP","3","13","13","Brothers, I do not consider myself yet to have taken hold of it. But one thing I do: Forgetting what is behind and straining toward what is ahead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_14","080_3_14","PHP","3","14","14","I press on toward the goal to win the prize of God’s heavenly calling in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_15","080_3_15","PHP","3","15","15","All of us who are mature should embrace this point of view. And if you think differently about some issue, God will reveal this to you as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_16","080_3_16","PHP","3","16","16","Nevertheless, we must live up to the standard we have already attained, being of the same mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_17","080_3_17","PHP","3","17","17","Join one another in following my example, brothers, and carefully observe those who walk according to the pattern we set for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_18","080_3_18","PHP","3","18","18","For as I have often told you before, and now say again even with tears: Many live as enemies of the cross of Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_19","080_3_19","PHP","3","19","19","Their end is destruction, their god is their belly, and their glory is in their shame. Their minds are set on earthly things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_20","080_3_20","PHP","3","20","20","But our citizenship is in heaven, and we eagerly await a Savior from there, the Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP3_21","080_3_21","PHP","3","21","21","who, by the power that enables Him to subject all things to Himself, will transform our lowly bodies to be like His glorious body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_1","080_4_1","PHP","4","1","1","Therefore, my brothers, whom I love and long for, my joy and crown, that is how you must stand firm in the Lord, my beloved. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_2","080_4_2","PHP","4","2","2","I urge Euodia and Syntyche to agree with each other in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_3","080_4_3","PHP","4","3","3","Yes, and I ask you, my true yokefellow, to help these women who have contended side by side with me for the gospel, along with Clement and the rest of my fellow workers, whose names are in the Book of Life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_4","080_4_4","PHP","4","4","4","Rejoice in the Lord always. I will say it again: Rejoice! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_5","080_4_5","PHP","4","5","5","Let your gentleness be apparent to all. The Lord is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_6","080_4_6","PHP","4","6","6","Be anxious for nothing, but in everything, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving, present your requests to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_7","080_4_7","PHP","4","7","7","And the peace of God, which surpasses all understanding, will guard your hearts and your minds in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_8","080_4_8","PHP","4","8","8","Finally, brothers, whatever is true, whatever is honorable, whatever is right, whatever is pure, whatever is lovely, whatever is admirable—if anything is excellent or praiseworthy—think on these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_9","080_4_9","PHP","4","9","9","Whatever you have learned or received or heard from me, or seen in me, put it into practice. And the God of peace will be with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_10","080_4_10","PHP","4","10","10","Now I rejoice greatly in the Lord that at last you have revived your concern for me. You were indeed concerned, but you had no opportunity to show it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_11","080_4_11","PHP","4","11","11","I am not saying this out of need, for I have learned to be content regardless of my circumstances. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_12","080_4_12","PHP","4","12","12","I know how to live humbly, and I know how to abound. In any and every situation I have learned the secret of being filled and being hungry, of having plenty and having need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_13","080_4_13","PHP","4","13","13","I can do all things through Christ who gives me strength. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_14","080_4_14","PHP","4","14","14","Nevertheless, you have done well to share in my affliction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_15","080_4_15","PHP","4","15","15","And as you Philippians know, in the early days of the gospel, when I left Macedonia, no church but you partnered with me in the matter of giving and receiving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_16","080_4_16","PHP","4","16","16","For even while I was in Thessalonica, you provided for my needs again and again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_17","080_4_17","PHP","4","17","17","Not that I am seeking a gift, but I am looking for the fruit that may be credited to your account. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_18","080_4_18","PHP","4","18","18","I have all I need and more, now that I have received your gifts from Epaphroditus. They are a fragrant offering, an acceptable sacrifice, well-pleasing to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_19","080_4_19","PHP","4","19","19","And my God will supply all your needs according to His glorious riches in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_20","080_4_20","PHP","4","20","20","To our God and Father be glory forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_21","080_4_21","PHP","4","21","21","Greet all the saints in Christ Jesus. The brothers who are with me send you greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_22","080_4_22","PHP","4","22","22","All the saints send you greetings, especially those from the household of Caesar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PP4_23","080_4_23","PHP","4","23","23","The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with you all. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_1","081_1_1","COL","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, and Timothy our brother, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_2","081_1_2","COL","1","2","2","To the saints and faithful brothers in Christ at Colossae: Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_3","081_1_3","COL","1","3","3","We always thank the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ when we pray for you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_4","081_1_4","COL","1","4","4","because we have heard about your faith in Christ Jesus and your love for all the saints— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_5","081_1_5","COL","1","5","5","the faith and love proceeding from the hope stored up for you in heaven, of which you have already heard in the word of truth, the gospel ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_6","081_1_6","COL","1","6","6","that has come to you. All over the world this gospel is bearing fruit and growing, just as it has been doing among you since the day you heard it and truly understood the grace of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_7","081_1_7","COL","1","7","7","You also learned it from Epaphras, our beloved fellow servant, who is a faithful minister of Christ on your behalf, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_8","081_1_8","COL","1","8","8","and who also informed us of your love in the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_9","081_1_9","COL","1","9","9","For this reason, since the day we heard about you, we have not stopped praying for you and asking God to fill you with the knowledge of His will in all spiritual wisdom and understanding, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_10","081_1_10","COL","1","10","10","so that you may walk in a manner worthy of the Lord and may please Him in every way: bearing fruit in every good work, growing in the knowledge of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_11","081_1_11","COL","1","11","11","being strengthened with all power according to His glorious might so that you may have full endurance and patience, and joyfully ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_12","081_1_12","COL","1","12","12","giving thanks to the Father, who has qualified us to share in the inheritance of the saints in the light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_13","081_1_13","COL","1","13","13","He has rescued us from the dominion of darkness and brought us into the kingdom of His beloved Son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_14","081_1_14","COL","1","14","14","in whom we have redemption, the forgiveness of sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_15","081_1_15","COL","1","15","15","The Son is the image of the invisible God, the firstborn over all creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_16","081_1_16","COL","1","16","16","For in Him all things were created, things in heaven and on earth, visible and invisible, whether thrones or dominions or rulers or authorities. All things were created through Him and for Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_17","081_1_17","COL","1","17","17","He is before all things, and in Him all things hold together. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_18","081_1_18","COL","1","18","18","And He is the head of the body, the church; He is the beginning and firstborn from among the dead, so that in all things He may have preeminence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_19","081_1_19","COL","1","19","19","For God was pleased to have all His fullness dwell in Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_20","081_1_20","COL","1","20","20","and through Him to reconcile to Himself all things, whether things on earth or things in heaven, by making peace through the blood of His cross. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_21","081_1_21","COL","1","21","21","Once you were alienated from God and were hostile in your minds, engaging in evil deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_22","081_1_22","COL","1","22","22","But now He has reconciled you by Christ’s physical body through death to present you holy, unblemished, and blameless in His presence— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_23","081_1_23","COL","1","23","23","if you continue in your faith, established and firm, not moved from the hope of the gospel you heard, which has been proclaimed to every creature under heaven, and of which I, Paul, have become a servant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_24","081_1_24","COL","1","24","24","Now I rejoice in my sufferings for you, and I fill up in my flesh what is lacking in regard to Christ’s afflictions for the sake of His body, which is the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_25","081_1_25","COL","1","25","25","I became its servant by the commission God gave me to fully proclaim to you the word of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_26","081_1_26","COL","1","26","26","the mystery that was hidden for ages and generations but is now revealed to His saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_27","081_1_27","COL","1","27","27","To them God has chosen to make known among the Gentiles the glorious riches of this mystery, which is Christ in you, the hope of glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_28","081_1_28","COL","1","28","28","We proclaim Him, admonishing and teaching everyone with all wisdom, so that we may present everyone perfect in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL1_29","081_1_29","COL","1","29","29","To this end I also labor, striving with all His energy working powerfully within me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_1","081_2_1","COL","2","1","1","For I want you to know how much I am struggling for you and for those at Laodicea, and for all who have not met me face to face, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_2","081_2_2","COL","2","2","2","that they may be encouraged in heart, knit together in love, and filled with the full riches of complete understanding, so that they may know the mystery of God, both of the Father and of Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_3","081_2_3","COL","2","3","3","in whom are hidden all the treasures of wisdom and knowledge. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_4","081_2_4","COL","2","4","4","I say this so that no one will deceive you by smooth rhetoric. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_5","081_2_5","COL","2","5","5","For although I am absent from you in body, I am present with you in spirit, and I delight to see your orderly condition and firm faith in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_6","081_2_6","COL","2","6","6","Therefore, just as you have received Christ Jesus as Lord, continue to walk in Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_7","081_2_7","COL","2","7","7","rooted and built up in Him, established in the faith as you were taught, and overflowing in it with thankfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_8","081_2_8","COL","2","8","8","See to it that no one takes you captive through philosophy and empty deception, which are based on human tradition and the spiritual forces of the world rather than on Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_9","081_2_9","COL","2","9","9","For in Christ all the fullness of the Deity dwells in bodily form. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_10","081_2_10","COL","2","10","10","And you have been made complete in Christ, who is the head over every ruler and authority. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_11","081_2_11","COL","2","11","11","In Him you were also circumcised, in the putting off of your sinful nature, with the circumcision performed by Christ and not by human hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_12","081_2_12","COL","2","12","12","And having been buried with Him in baptism, you were raised with Him through your faith in the power of God, who raised Him from the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_13","081_2_13","COL","2","13","13","When you were dead in your trespasses and in the uncircumcision of your sinful nature, God made you alive with Christ. He forgave us all our trespasses, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_14","081_2_14","COL","2","14","14","having canceled the debt ascribed to us in the decrees that stood against us. He took it away, nailing it to the cross! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_15","081_2_15","COL","2","15","15","And having disarmed the powers and authorities, He made a public spectacle of them, triumphing over them by the cross. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_16","081_2_16","COL","2","16","16","Therefore let no one judge you by what you eat or drink, or with regard to a feast, a New Moon, or a Sabbath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_17","081_2_17","COL","2","17","17","These are a shadow of the things to come, but the body that casts it belongs to Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_18","081_2_18","COL","2","18","18","Do not let anyone who delights in false humility and the worship of angels disqualify you with speculation about what he has not seen. Such a person is puffed up without basis by his unspiritual mind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_19","081_2_19","COL","2","19","19","He has lost connection to the head, from whom the whole body, supported and knit together by its joints and ligaments, grows as God causes it to grow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_20","081_2_20","COL","2","20","20","If you have died with Christ to the spiritual forces of the world, why, as though you still belonged to the world, do you submit to its regulations: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_21","081_2_21","COL","2","21","21","“Do not handle, do not taste, do not touch!”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_22","081_2_22","COL","2","22","22","These will all perish with use, because they are based on human commands and teachings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL2_23","081_2_23","COL","2","23","23","Such restrictions indeed have an appearance of wisdom, with their self-prescribed worship, their false humility, and their harsh treatment of the body; but they are of no value against the indulgence of the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_1","081_3_1","COL","3","1","1","Therefore, since you have been raised with Christ, strive for the things above, where Christ is seated at the right hand of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_2","081_3_2","COL","3","2","2","Set your minds on things above, not on earthly things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_3","081_3_3","COL","3","3","3","For you died, and your life is now hidden with Christ in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_4","081_3_4","COL","3","4","4","When Christ, who is our life, appears, then you also will appear with Him in glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_5","081_3_5","COL","3","5","5","Put to death, therefore, the components of your earthly nature: sexual immorality, impurity, lust, evil desires, and greed, which is idolatry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_6","081_3_6","COL","3","6","6","Because of these, the wrath of God is coming on the sons of disobedience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_7","081_3_7","COL","3","7","7","When you lived among them, you also used to walk in these ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_8","081_3_8","COL","3","8","8","But now you must put aside all such things as these: anger, rage, malice, slander, and filthy language from your lips. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_9","081_3_9","COL","3","9","9","Do not lie to one another, since you have taken off the old self with its practices, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_10","081_3_10","COL","3","10","10","and have put on the new self, which is being renewed in knowledge in the image of its Creator. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_11","081_3_11","COL","3","11","11","Here there is no Greek or Jew, circumcised or uncircumcised, barbarian, Scythian, slave, or free, but Christ is all and is in all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_12","081_3_12","COL","3","12","12","Therefore, as the elect of God, holy and beloved, clothe yourselves with hearts of compassion, kindness, humility, gentleness, and patience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_13","081_3_13","COL","3","13","13","Bear with one another and forgive any complaint you may have against someone else. Forgive as Christ forgave you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_14","081_3_14","COL","3","14","14","And over all these virtues put on love, which is the bond of perfect unity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_15","081_3_15","COL","3","15","15","Let the peace of God rule in your hearts, for to this you were called as members of one body. And be thankful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_16","081_3_16","COL","3","16","16","Let the word of Christ richly dwell within you as you teach and admonish one another with all wisdom, and as you sing psalms, hymns, and spiritual songs with gratitude in your hearts to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_17","081_3_17","COL","3","17","17","And whatever you do, in word or deed, do it all in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving thanks to God the Father through Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_18","081_3_18","COL","3","18","18","Wives, submit to your husbands, as is fitting in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_19","081_3_19","COL","3","19","19","Husbands, love your wives and do not be harsh with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_20","081_3_20","COL","3","20","20","Children, obey your parents in everything, for this is pleasing to the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_21","081_3_21","COL","3","21","21","Fathers, do not provoke your children, so they will not become discouraged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_22","081_3_22","COL","3","22","22","Slaves, obey your earthly masters in everything, not only to please them while they are watching, but with sincerity of heart and fear of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_23","081_3_23","COL","3","23","23","And whatever you do, work at it with your whole being, as for the Lord and not for men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_24","081_3_24","COL","3","24","24","because you know that you will receive an inheritance from the Lord as your reward. For it is the Lord Christ you are serving. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL3_25","081_3_25","COL","3","25","25","But whoever does wrong will be repaid for his wrong, and there is no favoritism. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_1","081_4_1","COL","4","1","1","Masters, supply your slaves with what is right and fair, since you know that you also have a Master in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_2","081_4_2","COL","4","2","2","Devote yourselves to prayer, being watchful and thankful, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_3","081_4_3","COL","4","3","3","as you pray also for us, that God may open to us a door for the word, so that we may proclaim the mystery of Christ, for which I am in chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_4","081_4_4","COL","4","4","4","Pray that I may declare it clearly, as I should. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_5","081_4_5","COL","4","5","5","Act wisely toward outsiders, redeeming the time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_6","081_4_6","COL","4","6","6","Let your speech always be gracious, seasoned with salt, so that you may know how to answer everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_7","081_4_7","COL","4","7","7","Tychicus will tell you all the news about me. He is a beloved brother, a faithful minister, and a fellow servant in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_8","081_4_8","COL","4","8","8","I have sent him to you for this very purpose, that he may know about you, and that he may encourage your hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_9","081_4_9","COL","4","9","9","With him I am sending Onesimus, our faithful and beloved brother, who is one of you. They will tell you about everything here. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_10","081_4_10","COL","4","10","10","My fellow prisoner Aristarchus sends you greetings, as does Mark the cousin of Barnabas. You have already received instructions about him: If he comes to you, welcome him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_11","081_4_11","COL","4","11","11","Jesus, who is called Justus, also sends greetings. These are the only Jews among my fellow workers for the kingdom of God, and they have been a comfort to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_12","081_4_12","COL","4","12","12","Epaphras, who is one of you and a servant of Christ, sends you greetings. He is always wrestling in prayer for you, so that you may stand mature and complete in the full will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_13","081_4_13","COL","4","13","13","For I testify about him that he has great zeal for you and for those at Laodicea and Hierapolis. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_14","081_4_14","COL","4","14","14","Luke, the beloved physician, and Demas send you greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_15","081_4_15","COL","4","15","15","Greet the brothers in Laodicea, as well as Nymphas and the church that meets at his house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_16","081_4_16","COL","4","16","16","After this letter has been read among you, make sure that it is also read in the church of the Laodiceans, and that you in turn read the letter from Laodicea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_17","081_4_17","COL","4","17","17","Tell Archippus: “See to it that you complete the ministry you have received in the Lord.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("CL4_18","081_4_18","COL","4","18","18","This greeting is in my own hand—Paul. Remember my chains. Grace be with you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_1","082_1_1","1TH","1","1","1","Paul, Silvanus, and Timothy, To the church of the Thessalonians in God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ: Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_2","082_1_2","1TH","1","2","2","We always thank God for all of you, remembering you in our prayers ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_3","082_1_3","1TH","1","3","3","and continually recalling before our God and Father your work of faith, your labor of love, and your enduring hope in our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_4","082_1_4","1TH","1","4","4","Brothers who are beloved by God, we know that He has chosen you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_5","082_1_5","1TH","1","5","5","because our gospel came to you not only in word, but also in power, in the Holy Spirit, and with great conviction—just as you know we lived among you for your sake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_6","082_1_6","1TH","1","6","6","And you became imitators of us and of the Lord when you welcomed the message with the joy of the Holy Spirit, in spite of your great suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_7","082_1_7","1TH","1","7","7","As a result, you have become examples to all the believers in Macedonia and Achaia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_8","082_1_8","1TH","1","8","8","For not only did the message of the Lord ring out from you to Macedonia and Achaia, but your faith in God has gone out to every place, so that we have no need to say anything more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_9","082_1_9","1TH","1","9","9","For they themselves report what kind of welcome you gave us, and how you turned to God from idols to serve the living and true God ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H11_10","082_1_10","1TH","1","10","10","and to await His Son from heaven, whom He raised from the dead—Jesus our deliverer from the coming wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_1","082_2_1","1TH","2","1","1","You yourselves know, brothers, that our visit to you was not in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_2","082_2_2","1TH","2","2","2","As you are aware, we had already endured suffering and shameful treatment in Philippi. But in the face of strong opposition, we were bold in our God to speak to you the gospel of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_3","082_2_3","1TH","2","3","3","For our appeal does not arise from deceit or ulterior motives or trickery. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_4","082_2_4","1TH","2","4","4","Instead, we speak as those approved by God to be entrusted with the gospel, not in order to please men but God, who examines our hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_5","082_2_5","1TH","2","5","5","As you know, we never used words of flattery or any pretext for greed. God is our witness! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_6","082_2_6","1TH","2","6","6","Nor did we seek praise from you or from anyone else, although as apostles of Christ we had authority to demand it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_7","082_2_7","1TH","2","7","7","On the contrary, we were gentle among you, like a nursing mother caring for her children. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_8","082_2_8","1TH","2","8","8","We cared so deeply that we were delighted to share with you not only the gospel of God, but our own lives as well. That is how beloved you have become to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_9","082_2_9","1TH","2","9","9","Surely you recall, brothers, our labor and toil. We worked night and day so that we would not be a burden to anyone while we proclaimed to you the gospel of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_10","082_2_10","1TH","2","10","10","You are witnesses, and so is God, of how holy, righteous, and blameless our conduct was among you who believed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_11","082_2_11","1TH","2","11","11","For you know that we treated each of you as a father treats his own children— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_12","082_2_12","1TH","2","12","12","encouraging you, comforting you, and urging you to walk in a manner worthy of God, who calls you into His own kingdom and glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_13","082_2_13","1TH","2","13","13","And we continually thank God because, when you received the word of God that you heard from us, you accepted it not as the word of men, but as the true word of God—the word which is now at work in you who believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_14","082_2_14","1TH","2","14","14","For you, brothers, became imitators of the churches of God in Judea that are in Christ Jesus. You suffered from your own countrymen the very things they suffered from the Jews, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_15","082_2_15","1TH","2","15","15","who killed both the Lord Jesus and their own prophets, and drove us out as well. They are displeasing to God and hostile to all men, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_16","082_2_16","1TH","2","16","16","hindering us from telling the Gentiles how they may be saved. As a result, they continue to heap up their sins to full capacity; the utmost wrath has come upon them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_17","082_2_17","1TH","2","17","17","Brothers, although we were torn away from you for a short time (in person, not in heart), our desire to see you face to face was even more intense. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_18","082_2_18","1TH","2","18","18","Therefore we wanted to come to you—indeed I, Paul, tried again and again—but Satan obstructed us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_19","082_2_19","1TH","2","19","19","After all, who is our hope, our joy, our crown of boasting, if it is not you yourselves in the presence of our Lord Jesus at His coming? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H12_20","082_2_20","1TH","2","20","20","You are indeed our glory and our joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_1","082_3_1","1TH","3","1","1","So when we could bear it no longer, we were willing to be left on our own in Athens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_2","082_3_2","1TH","3","2","2","We sent Timothy, our brother and minister for God, and our fellow worker in the gospel of Christ, to strengthen and encourage you in your faith, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_3","082_3_3","1TH","3","3","3","so that none of you would be shaken by these trials. For you know that we are destined for this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_4","082_3_4","1TH","3","4","4","Indeed, when we were with you, we kept warning you that we would suffer persecution; and as you know, it has come to pass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_5","082_3_5","1TH","3","5","5","For this reason, when I could bear it no longer, I sent to find out about your faith, for fear that the tempter had somehow tempted you and caused our labor to be in vain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_6","082_3_6","1TH","3","6","6","But just now, Timothy has returned from his visit with the good news about your faith, your love, and the fond memories you have preserved, longing to see us just as we long to see you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_7","082_3_7","1TH","3","7","7","For this reason, brothers, in all our persecution and distress, we have been reassured about you, because of your faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_8","082_3_8","1TH","3","8","8","For now we can go on living, as long as you are standing firm in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_9","082_3_9","1TH","3","9","9","How can we adequately thank God for you in return for our great joy over you in His presence? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_10","082_3_10","1TH","3","10","10","Night and day we pray most earnestly that we may see you face to face and supply what is lacking from your faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_11","082_3_11","1TH","3","11","11","Now may our God and Father Himself, and our Lord Jesus Christ, direct our way to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_12","082_3_12","1TH","3","12","12","And may the Lord cause you to increase and overflow with love for one another and for everyone else, just as our love for you overflows, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H13_13","082_3_13","1TH","3","13","13","so that He may establish your hearts in blamelessness and holiness before our God and Father at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ with all His saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_1","082_4_1","1TH","4","1","1","Finally, brothers, we ask and encourage you in the Lord Jesus to live in a way that is pleasing to God, just as you have received from us. So you should do so all the more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_2","082_4_2","1TH","4","2","2","For you know the instructions we gave you by the authority of the Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_3","082_4_3","1TH","4","3","3","For it is God’s will that you should be holy: You must abstain from sexual immorality; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_4","082_4_4","1TH","4","4","4","each of you must know how to control his own body in holiness and honor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_5","082_4_5","1TH","4","5","5","not in lustful passion like the Gentiles who do not know God; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_6","082_4_6","1TH","4","6","6","and no one should ever violate or exploit his brother in this regard, because the Lord will avenge all such acts, as we have already told you and solemnly warned you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_7","082_4_7","1TH","4","7","7","For God has not called us to impurity, but to holiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_8","082_4_8","1TH","4","8","8","Anyone, then, who rejects this command does not reject man but God, the very One who has given you His Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_9","082_4_9","1TH","4","9","9","Now about brotherly love, you do not need anyone to write to you, because you yourselves have been taught by God to love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_10","082_4_10","1TH","4","10","10","And you are indeed showing this love to all the brothers throughout Macedonia. But we urge you, brothers, to excel more and more ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_11","082_4_11","1TH","4","11","11","and to aspire to live quietly, to attend to your own matters, and to work with your own hands, as we instructed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_12","082_4_12","1TH","4","12","12","Then you will behave properly toward outsiders, without being dependent on anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_13","082_4_13","1TH","4","13","13","Brothers, we do not want you to be uninformed about those who sleep in death, so that you will not grieve like the rest, who are without hope. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_14","082_4_14","1TH","4","14","14","For since we believe that Jesus died and rose again, we also believe that God will bring with Jesus those who have fallen asleep in Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_15","082_4_15","1TH","4","15","15","By the word of the Lord, we declare to you that we who are alive and remain until the coming of the Lord will by no means precede those who have fallen asleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_16","082_4_16","1TH","4","16","16","For the Lord Himself will descend from heaven with a loud command, with the voice of an archangel, and with the trumpet of God, and the dead in Christ will be the first to rise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_17","082_4_17","1TH","4","17","17","After that, we who are alive and remain will be caught up together with them in the clouds to meet the Lord in the air. And so we will always be with the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H14_18","082_4_18","1TH","4","18","18","Therefore encourage one another with these words. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_1","082_5_1","1TH","5","1","1","Now about the times and seasons, brothers, we do not need to write to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_2","082_5_2","1TH","5","2","2","For you are fully aware that the Day of the Lord will come like a thief in the night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_3","082_5_3","1TH","5","3","3","For while people are saying, “Peace and security,” destruction will come upon them suddenly, like labor pains on a pregnant woman, and they will not escape. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_4","082_5_4","1TH","5","4","4","But you, brothers, are not in the darkness so that this day should overtake you like a thief. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_5","082_5_5","1TH","5","5","5","You are all sons of the light and sons of the day; we do not belong to the night or to the darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_6","082_5_6","1TH","5","6","6","So then, let us not sleep as the others do, but let us remain awake and sober. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_7","082_5_7","1TH","5","7","7","For those who sleep, sleep at night; and those who get drunk, get drunk at night. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_8","082_5_8","1TH","5","8","8","But since we belong to the day, let us be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love, and the helmet of our hope of salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_9","082_5_9","1TH","5","9","9","For God has not appointed us to suffer wrath, but to obtain salvation through our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_10","082_5_10","1TH","5","10","10","He died for us so that, whether we are awake or asleep, we may live together with Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_11","082_5_11","1TH","5","11","11","Therefore encourage and build one another up, just as you are already doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_12","082_5_12","1TH","5","12","12","But we ask you, brothers, to acknowledge those who work diligently among you, who preside over you in the Lord and give you instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_13","082_5_13","1TH","5","13","13","In love, hold them in highest regard because of their work. Live in peace with one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_14","082_5_14","1TH","5","14","14","And we urge you, brothers, to admonish the unruly, encourage the fainthearted, help the weak, and be patient with everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_15","082_5_15","1TH","5","15","15","Make sure that no one repays evil for evil. Always pursue what is good for one another and for all people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_16","082_5_16","1TH","5","16","16","Rejoice at all times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_17","082_5_17","1TH","5","17","17","Pray without ceasing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_18","082_5_18","1TH","5","18","18","Give thanks in every circumstance, for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_19","082_5_19","1TH","5","19","19","Do not extinguish the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_20","082_5_20","1TH","5","20","20","Do not treat prophecies with contempt, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_21","082_5_21","1TH","5","21","21","but test all things. Hold fast to what is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_22","082_5_22","1TH","5","22","22","Abstain from every form of evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_23","082_5_23","1TH","5","23","23","Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify you completely, and may your entire spirit, soul, and body be kept blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_24","082_5_24","1TH","5","24","24","The One who calls you is faithful, and He will do it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_25","082_5_25","1TH","5","25","25","Brothers, pray for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_26","082_5_26","1TH","5","26","26","Greet all the brothers with a holy kiss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_27","082_5_27","1TH","5","27","27","I charge you before the Lord to have this letter read to all the holy brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H15_28","082_5_28","1TH","5","28","28","The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_1","083_1_1","2TH","1","1","1","Paul, Silvanus, and Timothy, To the church of the Thessalonians in God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_2","083_1_2","2TH","1","2","2","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_3","083_1_3","2TH","1","3","3","We are obligated to thank God for you all the time, brothers, as is fitting, because your faith is growing more and more, and your love for one another is increasing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_4","083_1_4","2TH","1","4","4","That is why we boast among God’s churches about your perseverance and faith in the face of all the persecution and affliction you are enduring. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_5","083_1_5","2TH","1","5","5","All this is clear evidence of God’s righteous judgment. And so you will be counted worthy of the kingdom of God, for which you are suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_6","083_1_6","2TH","1","6","6","After all, it is only right for God to repay with affliction those who afflict you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_7","083_1_7","2TH","1","7","7","and to grant relief to you who are oppressed and to us as well. This will take place when the Lord Jesus is revealed from heaven with His mighty angels ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_8","083_1_8","2TH","1","8","8","in blazing fire, inflicting vengeance on those who do not know God and do not obey the gospel of our Lord Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_9","083_1_9","2TH","1","9","9","They will suffer the penalty of eternal destruction, separated from the presence of the Lord and the glory of His might, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_10","083_1_10","2TH","1","10","10","on the day He comes to be glorified in His saints and regarded with wonder by all who have believed, including you who have believed our testimony. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_11","083_1_11","2TH","1","11","11","To this end, we always pray for you, that our God will count you worthy of His calling, and that He will powerfully fulfill your every good desire and work of faith, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H21_12","083_1_12","2TH","1","12","12","so that the name of our Lord Jesus will be glorified in you, and you in Him, according to the grace of our God and of the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_1","083_2_1","2TH","2","1","1","Now concerning the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ and our being gathered together to Him, we ask you, brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_2","083_2_2","2TH","2","2","2","not to be easily disconcerted or alarmed by any spirit or message or letter seeming to be from us, alleging that the Day of Christ has already come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_3","083_2_3","2TH","2","3","3","Let no one deceive you in any way, for it will not come until the rebellion occurs and the man of sin—the son of destruction—is revealed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_4","083_2_4","2TH","2","4","4","He will oppose and exalt himself above every so-called god or object of worship. So he will seat himself as God in the temple of God, proclaiming himself to be God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_5","083_2_5","2TH","2","5","5","Do you not remember that I told you these things while I was still with you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_6","083_2_6","2TH","2","6","6","And you know what is now restraining him, so that he may be revealed at the proper time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_7","083_2_7","2TH","2","7","7","For the mystery of lawlessness is already at work, but the one who now restrains it will continue until he is taken out of the way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_8","083_2_8","2TH","2","8","8","And then the lawless one will be revealed, whom the Lord will consume with the breath of His mouth and annihilate by the majesty of His arrival. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_9","083_2_9","2TH","2","9","9","The coming of the lawless one will be accompanied by the working of Satan, with every kind of power, sign, and false wonder, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_10","083_2_10","2TH","2","10","10","and with every wicked deception directed against those who are perishing, because they refused the love of the truth that would have saved them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_11","083_2_11","2TH","2","11","11","For this reason God will send them a powerful delusion so that they believe the lie, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_12","083_2_12","2TH","2","12","12","in order that judgment may come upon all who have disbelieved the truth and delighted in wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_13","083_2_13","2TH","2","13","13","But we should always thank God for you, brothers who are loved by the Lord, because God has chosen you from the beginning to be saved by the sanctification of the Spirit and by faith in the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_14","083_2_14","2TH","2","14","14","To this He called you through our gospel, so that you may share in the glory of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_15","083_2_15","2TH","2","15","15","Therefore, brothers, stand firm and cling to the traditions we taught you, whether by speech or by letter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_16","083_2_16","2TH","2","16","16","Now may our Lord Jesus Christ Himself and our God and Father, who by grace has loved us and given us eternal comfort and good hope, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H22_17","083_2_17","2TH","2","17","17","encourage your hearts and strengthen you in every good word and deed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_1","083_3_1","2TH","3","1","1","Finally, brothers, pray for us, that the word of the Lord may spread quickly and be held in honor, just as it was with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_2","083_3_2","2TH","3","2","2","And pray that we may be delivered from wicked and evil men; for not everyone holds to the faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_3","083_3_3","2TH","3","3","3","But the Lord is faithful, and He will strengthen you and guard you from the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_4","083_3_4","2TH","3","4","4","And we have confidence in the Lord that you are doing and will continue to do what we command you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_5","083_3_5","2TH","3","5","5","May the Lord direct your hearts into God’s love and Christ’s perseverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_6","083_3_6","2TH","3","6","6","Now we command you, brothers, in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, to keep away from any brother who leads an undisciplined life that is not in keeping with the tradition you received from us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_7","083_3_7","2TH","3","7","7","For you yourselves know how you ought to imitate us, because we were not undisciplined among you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_8","083_3_8","2TH","3","8","8","nor did we eat anyone’s food without paying for it. Instead, in labor and toil, we worked night and day so that we would not be a burden to any of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_9","083_3_9","2TH","3","9","9","Not that we lack this right, but we wanted to offer ourselves as an example for you to imitate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_10","083_3_10","2TH","3","10","10","For even while we were with you, we gave you this command: “If anyone is unwilling to work, he shall not eat.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_11","083_3_11","2TH","3","11","11","Yet we hear that some of you are leading undisciplined lives and accomplishing nothing but being busybodies. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_12","083_3_12","2TH","3","12","12","We command and urge such people by our Lord Jesus Christ to begin working quietly to earn their own living. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_13","083_3_13","2TH","3","13","13","But as for you, brothers, do not grow weary in well-doing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_14","083_3_14","2TH","3","14","14","Take note of anyone who does not obey the instructions we have given in this letter. Do not associate with him, so that he may be ashamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_15","083_3_15","2TH","3","15","15","Yet do not regard him as an enemy, but warn him as a brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_16","083_3_16","2TH","3","16","16","Now may the Lord of peace Himself give you peace at all times and in every way. The Lord be with all of you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_17","083_3_17","2TH","3","17","17","This greeting is in my own hand—Paul. This is my mark in every letter; it is the way I write. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("H23_18","083_3_18","2TH","3","18","18","The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with all of you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_1","084_1_1","1TI","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the command of God our Savior and of the Lord Jesus Christ our hope, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_2","084_1_2","1TI","1","2","2","To Timothy, my true child in the faith: Grace, mercy, and peace from God our Father and Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_3","084_1_3","1TI","1","3","3","As I urged you on my departure to Macedonia, you should stay on at Ephesus to instruct certain men not to teach false doctrines ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_4","084_1_4","1TI","1","4","4","or devote themselves to myths and endless genealogies, which promote speculation rather than the stewardship of God’s work, which is by faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_5","084_1_5","1TI","1","5","5","The goal of our instruction is the love that comes from a pure heart, a clear conscience, and a sincere faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_6","084_1_6","1TI","1","6","6","Some have strayed from these ways and turned aside to empty talk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_7","084_1_7","1TI","1","7","7","They want to be teachers of the law, but they do not understand what they are saying or that which they so confidently assert. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_8","084_1_8","1TI","1","8","8","Now we know that the law is good, if one uses it legitimately. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_9","084_1_9","1TI","1","9","9","We realize that law is not enacted for the righteous, but for the lawless and rebellious, for the ungodly and sinful, for the unholy and profane, for killers of father or mother, for murderers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_10","084_1_10","1TI","1","10","10","for the sexually immoral, for homosexuals, for slave traders and liars and perjurers, and for anyone else who is averse to sound teaching ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_11","084_1_11","1TI","1","11","11","that agrees with the glorious gospel of the blessed God, with which I have been entrusted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_12","084_1_12","1TI","1","12","12","And I thank Christ Jesus our Lord, who has strengthened me, that He considered me faithful and appointed me to service. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_13","084_1_13","1TI","1","13","13","I was formerly a blasphemer, a persecutor, and a violent man; yet because I had acted in ignorance and unbelief, I was shown mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_14","084_1_14","1TI","1","14","14","And the grace of our Lord overflowed to me, along with the faith and love that are in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_15","084_1_15","1TI","1","15","15","This is a trustworthy saying, worthy of full acceptance: Christ Jesus came into the world to save sinners, of whom I am the worst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_16","084_1_16","1TI","1","16","16","But for this very reason I was shown mercy, so that in me, the worst of sinners, Jesus Christ might display all His patience as an example to those who would believe in Him for eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_17","084_1_17","1TI","1","17","17","Now to the King eternal, immortal, and invisible, the only wise God, be honor and glory forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_18","084_1_18","1TI","1","18","18","Timothy, my child, I entrust you with this command in keeping with the previous prophecies about you, so that by them you may fight the good fight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_19","084_1_19","1TI","1","19","19","holding on to faith and a good conscience, which some have rejected and thereby shipwrecked their faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T11_20","084_1_20","1TI","1","20","20","Among them are Hymenaeus and Alexander, whom I have handed over to Satan to be taught not to blaspheme. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_1","084_2_1","1TI","2","1","1","First of all, then, I urge that petitions, prayers, intercessions, and thanksgiving be offered for everyone— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_2","084_2_2","1TI","2","2","2","for kings and all those in authority—so that we may lead tranquil and quiet lives in all godliness and dignity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_3","084_2_3","1TI","2","3","3","For this is good and pleasing in the sight of God our Savior, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_4","084_2_4","1TI","2","4","4","who wants everyone to be saved and to come to the knowledge of the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_5","084_2_5","1TI","2","5","5","For there is one God, and there is one mediator between God and men, the man Christ Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_6","084_2_6","1TI","2","6","6","who gave Himself as a ransom for all—the testimony that was given at just the right time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_7","084_2_7","1TI","2","7","7","For this reason I was appointed as a preacher, an apostle, and a faithful and true teacher of the Gentiles. I am telling the truth in Christ; I am not lying about anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_8","084_2_8","1TI","2","8","8","Therefore I want the men everywhere to pray, lifting up holy hands, without anger or dissension. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_9","084_2_9","1TI","2","9","9","Likewise, I want the women to adorn themselves with respectable apparel, with modesty, and with self-control, not with braided hair or gold or pearls or expensive clothes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_10","084_2_10","1TI","2","10","10","but with good deeds, as is proper for women who profess to worship God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_11","084_2_11","1TI","2","11","11","A woman must learn in quietness and full submissiveness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_12","084_2_12","1TI","2","12","12","I do not permit a woman to teach or to exercise authority over a man; she is to remain quiet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_13","084_2_13","1TI","2","13","13","For Adam was formed first, and then Eve. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_14","084_2_14","1TI","2","14","14","And it was not Adam who was deceived, but the woman who was deceived and fell into transgression. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T12_15","084_2_15","1TI","2","15","15","Women, however, will be saved through childbearing, if they continue in faith, love, and holiness, with self-control. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_1","084_3_1","1TI","3","1","1","This is a trustworthy saying: If anyone aspires to be an overseer, he desires a noble task. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_2","084_3_2","1TI","3","2","2","An overseer, then, must be above reproach, the husband of but one wife, temperate, self-controlled, respectable, hospitable, able to teach, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_3","084_3_3","1TI","3","3","3","not dependent on wine, not violent, not greedy for money, but gentle, peaceable, and free of the love of money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_4","084_3_4","1TI","3","4","4","An overseer must manage his own household well and keep his children under control, with complete dignity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_5","084_3_5","1TI","3","5","5","For if someone does not know how to manage his own household, how can he care for the church of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_6","084_3_6","1TI","3","6","6","He must not be a recent convert, or he may become conceited and fall under the same condemnation as the devil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_7","084_3_7","1TI","3","7","7","Furthermore, he must have a good reputation with outsiders, so that he will not fall into disgrace and into the snare of the devil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_8","084_3_8","1TI","3","8","8","Deacons likewise must be dignified, not double-tongued or given to much wine or greedy for money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_9","084_3_9","1TI","3","9","9","They must hold to the mystery of the faith with a clear conscience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_10","084_3_10","1TI","3","10","10","Additionally, they must first be tested. Then, if they are above reproach, let them serve as deacons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_11","084_3_11","1TI","3","11","11","In the same way, the women must be dignified, not slanderers, but temperate and faithful in all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_12","084_3_12","1TI","3","12","12","A deacon must be the husband of but one wife, a good manager of his children and of his own household. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_13","084_3_13","1TI","3","13","13","For those who have served well as deacons acquire for themselves a high standing and great confidence in the faith that is in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_14","084_3_14","1TI","3","14","14","Although I hope to come to you soon, I am writing you these things ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_15","084_3_15","1TI","3","15","15","in case I am delayed, so that you will know how each one must conduct himself in God’s household, which is the church of the living God, the pillar and foundation of the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T13_16","084_3_16","1TI","3","16","16","By common confession, the mystery of godliness is great: God appeared in the flesh, was vindicated by the Spirit, was seen by angels, was proclaimed among the nations, was believed in throughout the world, was taken up in glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_1","084_4_1","1TI","4","1","1","Now the Spirit expressly states that in later times some will abandon the faith to follow deceitful spirits and the teachings of demons, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_2","084_4_2","1TI","4","2","2","influenced by the hypocrisy of liars, whose consciences are seared with a hot iron. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_3","084_4_3","1TI","4","3","3","They will prohibit marriage and require abstinence from certain foods that God has created to be received with thanksgiving by those who believe and know the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_4","084_4_4","1TI","4","4","4","For every creation of God is good, and nothing that is received with thanksgiving should be rejected, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_5","084_4_5","1TI","4","5","5","because it is sanctified by the word of God and prayer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_6","084_4_6","1TI","4","6","6","By pointing out these things to the brothers, you will be a good servant of Jesus Christ, nourished by the words of faith and sound instruction that you have followed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_7","084_4_7","1TI","4","7","7","But reject irreverent, silly myths. Instead, train yourself for godliness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_8","084_4_8","1TI","4","8","8","For physical exercise is of limited value, but godliness is valuable in every way, holding promise for the present life and for the one to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_9","084_4_9","1TI","4","9","9","This is a trustworthy saying, worthy of full acceptance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_10","084_4_10","1TI","4","10","10","To this end we both labor and suffer reproach, because we have set our hope on the living God, who is the Savior of everyone, and especially of those who believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_11","084_4_11","1TI","4","11","11","Command and teach these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_12","084_4_12","1TI","4","12","12","Let no one despise your youth, but set an example for the believers in speech, in conduct, in love, in spirit, in faith, in purity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_13","084_4_13","1TI","4","13","13","Until I come, devote yourself to the public reading of Scripture, to exhortation, and to teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_14","084_4_14","1TI","4","14","14","Do not neglect the gift that is in you, which was given you through the prophecy spoken over you at the laying on of the hands of the elders. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_15","084_4_15","1TI","4","15","15","Be diligent in these matters and absorbed in them, so that your progress will be evident to all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T14_16","084_4_16","1TI","4","16","16","Pay close attention to your life and to your teaching. Persevere in these things, for by so doing you will save both yourself and those who hear you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_1","084_5_1","1TI","5","1","1","Do not rebuke an older man, but appeal to him as to a father. Treat younger men as brothers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_2","084_5_2","1TI","5","2","2","older women as mothers, and younger women as sisters, with absolute purity. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_3","084_5_3","1TI","5","3","3","Honor the widows who are truly widows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_4","084_5_4","1TI","5","4","4","But if a widow has children or grandchildren, they must first learn to show godliness to their own family and repay their parents, for this is pleasing in the sight of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_5","084_5_5","1TI","5","5","5","The widow who is truly in need and left all alone puts her hope in God and continues night and day in her petitions and prayers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_6","084_5_6","1TI","5","6","6","But she who lives for pleasure is dead even while she is still alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_7","084_5_7","1TI","5","7","7","Give these instructions to the believers, so that they will be above reproach. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_8","084_5_8","1TI","5","8","8","If anyone does not provide for his own, and especially his own household, he has denied the faith and is worse than an unbeliever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_9","084_5_9","1TI","5","9","9","A widow should be enrolled if she is at least sixty years old, faithful to her husband, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_10","084_5_10","1TI","5","10","10","and well known for good deeds such as bringing up children, entertaining strangers, washing the feet of the saints, imparting relief to the afflicted, and devoting herself to every good work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_11","084_5_11","1TI","5","11","11","But refuse to enroll younger widows. For when their passions draw them away from Christ, they will want to marry, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_12","084_5_12","1TI","5","12","12","and thus will incur judgment because they are setting aside their first faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_13","084_5_13","1TI","5","13","13","At the same time they will also learn to be idle, going from house to house and being not only idle, but also gossips and busybodies, discussing things they should not mention. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_14","084_5_14","1TI","5","14","14","So I advise the younger widows to marry, have children, and manage their households, denying the adversary occasion for slander. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_15","084_5_15","1TI","5","15","15","For some have already turned aside to follow Satan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_16","084_5_16","1TI","5","16","16","If any believing man or believing woman has dependent widows, they must assist them and not allow the church to be burdened, so that it can help the widows who are truly in need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_17","084_5_17","1TI","5","17","17","Elders who lead effectively are worthy of double honor, especially those who work hard at preaching and teaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_18","084_5_18","1TI","5","18","18","For the Scripture says, “Do not muzzle an ox while it is treading out the grain,” and, “The worker is worthy of his wages.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_19","084_5_19","1TI","5","19","19","Do not entertain an accusation against an elder, except on the testimony of two or three witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_20","084_5_20","1TI","5","20","20","Those who persist in sin should be rebuked in front of everyone, so that the others will stand in fear of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_21","084_5_21","1TI","5","21","21","I solemnly charge you before God and the Lord Jesus Christ and the elect angels to maintain these principles without bias, and to do nothing out of partiality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_22","084_5_22","1TI","5","22","22","Do not be too quick in the laying on of hands and thereby share in the sins of others. Keep yourself pure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_23","084_5_23","1TI","5","23","23","Stop drinking only water and use a little wine instead, because of your stomach and your frequent ailments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_24","084_5_24","1TI","5","24","24","The sins of some men are obvious, going ahead of them to judgment; but the sins of others do not surface until later. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T15_25","084_5_25","1TI","5","25","25","In the same way, good deeds are obvious, and even the ones that are inconspicuous cannot remain hidden. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_1","084_6_1","1TI","6","1","1","All who are under the yoke of slavery should regard their masters as fully worthy of honor, so that God’s name and our teaching will not be discredited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_2","084_6_2","1TI","6","2","2","Those who have believing masters should not show disrespect because they are brothers, but should serve them all the more, since those receiving their good service are beloved believers. Teach and encourage these principles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_3","084_6_3","1TI","6","3","3","If anyone teaches another doctrine and disagrees with the sound words of our Lord Jesus Christ and with godly teaching, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_4","084_6_4","1TI","6","4","4","he is conceited and understands nothing. Instead, he has an unhealthy interest in controversies and disputes about words, out of which come envy, strife, abusive talk, evil suspicions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_5","084_6_5","1TI","6","5","5","and constant friction between men of depraved mind who are devoid of the truth. These men regard godliness as a means of gain. Withdraw yourself from such. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_6","084_6_6","1TI","6","6","6","Of course, godliness with contentment is great gain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_7","084_6_7","1TI","6","7","7","For we brought nothing into the world, so certainly we cannot carry anything out of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_8","084_6_8","1TI","6","8","8","But if we have food and clothing, we will be content with these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_9","084_6_9","1TI","6","9","9","Those who want to be rich, however, fall into temptation and become ensnared by many foolish and harmful desires that plunge them into ruin and destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_10","084_6_10","1TI","6","10","10","For the love of money is the root of all kinds of evil. By craving it, some have wandered away from the faith and pierced themselves with many sorrows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_11","084_6_11","1TI","6","11","11","But you, O man of God, flee from these things and pursue righteousness, godliness, faith, love, perseverance, and gentleness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_12","084_6_12","1TI","6","12","12","Fight the good fight of the faith. Take hold of the eternal life to which you were called when you made the good confession before many witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_13","084_6_13","1TI","6","13","13","I charge you in the presence of God, who gives life to all things, and of Christ Jesus, who made the good confession in His testimony before Pontius Pilate: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_14","084_6_14","1TI","6","14","14","Keep this commandment without stain or reproach until the appearance of our Lord Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_15","084_6_15","1TI","6","15","15","which the blessed and only Sovereign One—the King of kings and Lord of lords—will bring about in His own time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_16","084_6_16","1TI","6","16","16","He alone is immortal and dwells in unapproachable light. No one has ever seen Him, nor can anyone see Him. To Him be honor and eternal dominion! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_17","084_6_17","1TI","6","17","17","Instruct those who are rich in the present age not to be conceited and not to put their hope in the uncertainty of wealth, but in the living God, who richly provides all things for us to enjoy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_18","084_6_18","1TI","6","18","18","Instruct them to do good, to be rich in good works, and to be generous and ready to share, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_19","084_6_19","1TI","6","19","19","treasuring up for themselves a firm foundation for the future, so that they may take hold of eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_20","084_6_20","1TI","6","20","20","O Timothy, guard what has been entrusted to you. Avoid irreverent, empty chatter and the opposing arguments of so-called “knowledge,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T16_21","084_6_21","1TI","6","21","21","which some have professed and thus swerved away from the faith. Grace be with you all. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_1","085_1_1","2TI","1","1","1","Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God, according to the promise of life in Christ Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_2","085_1_2","2TI","1","2","2","To Timothy, my beloved child: Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and Christ Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_3","085_1_3","2TI","1","3","3","I thank God, whom I serve with a clear conscience as did my forefathers, as I constantly remember you night and day in my prayers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_4","085_1_4","2TI","1","4","4","Recalling your tears, I long to see you so that I may be filled with joy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_5","085_1_5","2TI","1","5","5","I am reminded of your sincere faith, which first dwelt in your grandmother Lois and your mother Eunice, and I am convinced is in you as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_6","085_1_6","2TI","1","6","6","For this reason I remind you to fan into flame the gift of God, which is in you through the laying on of my hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_7","085_1_7","2TI","1","7","7","For God has not given us a spirit of fear, but of power, love, and self-control. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_8","085_1_8","2TI","1","8","8","So do not be ashamed of the testimony of our Lord, or of me, His prisoner. Instead, join me in suffering for the gospel by the power of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_9","085_1_9","2TI","1","9","9","He has saved us and called us to a holy calling, not because of our works, but by His own purpose and by the grace He granted us in Christ Jesus before time began. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_10","085_1_10","2TI","1","10","10","And now He has revealed this grace through the appearing of our Savior, Jesus Christ, who has abolished death and illuminated the way to life and immortality through the gospel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_11","085_1_11","2TI","1","11","11","to which I was appointed as a preacher, an apostle, and a teacher of the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_12","085_1_12","2TI","1","12","12","For this reason, even though I suffer as I do, I am not ashamed; for I know whom I have believed, and I am convinced that He is able to guard what I have entrusted to Him for that day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_13","085_1_13","2TI","1","13","13","Hold on to the pattern of sound teaching you have heard from me, with the faith and love that are in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_14","085_1_14","2TI","1","14","14","Guard the treasure entrusted to you, with the help of the Holy Spirit who dwells in us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_15","085_1_15","2TI","1","15","15","You know that everyone in the Province of Asia has deserted me, including Phygelus and Hermogenes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_16","085_1_16","2TI","1","16","16","May the Lord grant mercy to the household of Onesiphorus, because he has often refreshed me and was unashamed of my chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_17","085_1_17","2TI","1","17","17","Indeed, when he arrived in Rome, he searched very diligently until he found me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T21_18","085_1_18","2TI","1","18","18","May the Lord grant Onesiphorus His mercy on that day. You know very well how much he ministered to me in Ephesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_1","085_2_1","2TI","2","1","1","You therefore, my child, be strong in the grace that is in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_2","085_2_2","2TI","2","2","2","And the things that you have heard me say among many witnesses, entrust these to faithful men who will be qualified to teach others as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_3","085_2_3","2TI","2","3","3","Endure hardship, therefore, like a good soldier of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_4","085_2_4","2TI","2","4","4","A soldier refrains from entangling himself in civilian affairs, in order to please the one who enlisted him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_5","085_2_5","2TI","2","5","5","Likewise, a competitor does not receive the crown unless he competes according to the rules. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_6","085_2_6","2TI","2","6","6","The hardworking farmer should be the first to partake of the crops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_7","085_2_7","2TI","2","7","7","Consider what I am saying, for the Lord will give you insight into all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_8","085_2_8","2TI","2","8","8","Remember Jesus Christ, raised from the dead, descended from David, as proclaimed by my gospel, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_9","085_2_9","2TI","2","9","9","for which I suffer to the extent of being chained like a criminal. But the word of God cannot be chained! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_10","085_2_10","2TI","2","10","10","For this reason I endure all things for the sake of the elect, so that they too may obtain the salvation that is in Christ Jesus, with eternal glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_11","085_2_11","2TI","2","11","11","This is a trustworthy saying: If we died with Him, we will also live with Him; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_12","085_2_12","2TI","2","12","12","if we endure, we will also reign with Him; if we deny Him, He will also deny us; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_13","085_2_13","2TI","2","13","13","if we are faithless, He remains faithful; He cannot deny Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_14","085_2_14","2TI","2","14","14","Remind the believers of these things, charging them before the Lord to avoid quarreling over words, which succeeds only in leading the listeners to ruin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_15","085_2_15","2TI","2","15","15","Make every effort to present yourself approved to God, an unashamed workman who accurately handles the word of truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_16","085_2_16","2TI","2","16","16","But avoid irreverent, empty chatter, which will only lead to more ungodliness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_17","085_2_17","2TI","2","17","17","and the talk of such men will spread like gangrene. Among them are Hymenaeus and Philetus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_18","085_2_18","2TI","2","18","18","who have deviated from the truth. They say that the resurrection has already occurred, and they undermine the faith of some. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_19","085_2_19","2TI","2","19","19","Nevertheless, God’s firm foundation stands, bearing this seal: “The Lord knows those who are His,” and, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord must turn away from iniquity.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_20","085_2_20","2TI","2","20","20","A large house contains not only vessels of gold and silver, but also of wood and clay. Some indeed are for honorable use, but others are for common use. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_21","085_2_21","2TI","2","21","21","So if anyone cleanses himself of what is unfit, he will be a vessel for honor: sanctified, useful to the Master, and prepared for every good work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_22","085_2_22","2TI","2","22","22","Flee from youthful passions and pursue righteousness, faith, love, and peace, together with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_23","085_2_23","2TI","2","23","23","But reject foolish and ignorant speculation, for you know that it breeds quarreling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_24","085_2_24","2TI","2","24","24","And a servant of the Lord must not be quarrelsome, but must be kind to everyone, able to teach, and forbearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_25","085_2_25","2TI","2","25","25","He must gently reprove those who oppose him, in the hope that God may grant them repentance leading to a knowledge of the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T22_26","085_2_26","2TI","2","26","26","Then they will come to their senses and escape the snare of the devil, who has taken them captive to his will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_1","085_3_1","2TI","3","1","1","But understand this: In the last days terrible times will come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_2","085_3_2","2TI","3","2","2","For men will be lovers of themselves, lovers of money, boastful, arrogant, abusive, disobedient to their parents, ungrateful, unholy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_3","085_3_3","2TI","3","3","3","unloving, unforgiving, slanderous, without self-control, brutal, without love of good, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_4","085_3_4","2TI","3","4","4","traitorous, reckless, conceited, lovers of pleasure rather than lovers of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_5","085_3_5","2TI","3","5","5","having a form of godliness but denying its power. Turn away from such as these! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_6","085_3_6","2TI","3","6","6","They are the kind who worm their way into households and captivate vulnerable women who are weighed down with sins and led astray by various passions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_7","085_3_7","2TI","3","7","7","who are always learning but never able to come to a knowledge of the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_8","085_3_8","2TI","3","8","8","Just as Jannes and Jambres opposed Moses, so also these men oppose the truth. They are depraved in mind and disqualified from the faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_9","085_3_9","2TI","3","9","9","But they will not advance much further. For just like Jannes and Jambres, their folly will be plain to everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_10","085_3_10","2TI","3","10","10","You, however, have observed my teaching, my conduct, my purpose, my faith, my patience, my love, my perseverance, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_11","085_3_11","2TI","3","11","11","my persecutions, and the sufferings that came upon me in Antioch, Iconium, and Lystra. What persecutions I endured! Yet the Lord rescued me from all of them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_12","085_3_12","2TI","3","12","12","Indeed, all who desire to live godly lives in Christ Jesus will be persecuted, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_13","085_3_13","2TI","3","13","13","while evil men and imposters go from bad to worse, deceiving and being deceived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_14","085_3_14","2TI","3","14","14","But as for you, continue in the things you have learned and firmly believed, since you know from whom you have learned them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_15","085_3_15","2TI","3","15","15","From infancy you have known the Holy Scriptures, which are able to make you wise for salvation through faith in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_16","085_3_16","2TI","3","16","16","All Scripture is God-breathed and is useful for instruction, for conviction, for correction, and for training in righteousness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T23_17","085_3_17","2TI","3","17","17","so that the man of God may be complete, fully equipped for every good work. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_1","085_4_1","2TI","4","1","1","I charge you, therefore, in the presence of God and of the Lord Jesus Christ, who will judge the living and the dead, and in view of His appearing and His kingdom: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_2","085_4_2","2TI","4","2","2","Preach the word; be prepared in season and out of season; reprove, rebuke, and encourage with every form of patient instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_3","085_4_3","2TI","4","3","3","For the time will come when men will not tolerate sound doctrine, but with itching ears they will gather around themselves teachers to suit their own desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_4","085_4_4","2TI","4","4","4","So they will turn their ears away from the truth and turn aside to myths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_5","085_4_5","2TI","4","5","5","But you, be sober in all things, endure hardship, do the work of an evangelist, fulfill your ministry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_6","085_4_6","2TI","4","6","6","For I am already being poured out like a drink offering, and the time of my departure is at hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_7","085_4_7","2TI","4","7","7","I have fought the good fight, I have finished the race, I have kept the faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_8","085_4_8","2TI","4","8","8","From now on there is laid up for me the crown of righteousness, which the Lord, the righteous Judge, will award to me on that day—and not only to me, but to all who crave His appearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_9","085_4_9","2TI","4","9","9","Make every effort to come to me quickly, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_10","085_4_10","2TI","4","10","10","because Demas, in his love of this world, has deserted me and gone to Thessalonica. Crescens has gone to Galatia, and Titus to Dalmatia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_11","085_4_11","2TI","4","11","11","Only Luke is with me. Get Mark and bring him with you, because he is useful to me in the ministry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_12","085_4_12","2TI","4","12","12","Tychicus, however, I have sent to Ephesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_13","085_4_13","2TI","4","13","13","When you come, bring the cloak that I left with Carpus at Troas, and my scrolls, especially the parchments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_14","085_4_14","2TI","4","14","14","Alexander the coppersmith did great harm to me. May the Lord repay him according to his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_15","085_4_15","2TI","4","15","15","You too should beware of him, for he has vigorously opposed our message. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_16","085_4_16","2TI","4","16","16","At my first defense, no one stood with me, but everyone deserted me. May it not be charged against them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_17","085_4_17","2TI","4","17","17","But the Lord stood by me and strengthened me, so that through me the message would be fully proclaimed, and all the Gentiles would hear it. So I was delivered from the mouth of the lion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_18","085_4_18","2TI","4","18","18","And the Lord will rescue me from every evil action and bring me safely into His heavenly kingdom. To Him be the glory forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_19","085_4_19","2TI","4","19","19","Greet Prisca and Aquila, as well as the household of Onesiphorus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_20","085_4_20","2TI","4","20","20","Erastus has remained at Corinth, and Trophimus I left sick in Miletus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_21","085_4_21","2TI","4","21","21","Make every effort to come to me before winter. Eubulus sends you greetings, as do Pudens, Linus, Claudia, and all the brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("T24_22","085_4_22","2TI","4","22","22","The Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Grace be with you all. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_1","086_1_1","TIT","1","1","1","Paul, a servant of God and an apostle of Jesus Christ for the faith of God’s elect and their knowledge of the truth that leads to godliness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_2","086_1_2","TIT","1","2","2","in the hope of eternal life, which God, who cannot lie, promised before time began. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_3","086_1_3","TIT","1","3","3","In His own time He has made His word evident in the proclamation entrusted to me by the command of God our Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_4","086_1_4","TIT","1","4","4","To Titus, my true child in our common faith: Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ our Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_5","086_1_5","TIT","1","5","5","The reason I left you in Crete was that you would set in order what was unfinished and appoint elders in every town, as I directed you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_6","086_1_6","TIT","1","6","6","An elder must be blameless, the husband of but one wife, having children who are believers and who are not open to accusation of indiscretion or insubordination. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_7","086_1_7","TIT","1","7","7","As God’s steward, an overseer must be above reproach—not self-willed, not quick-tempered, not given to drunkenness, not violent, not greedy for money. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_8","086_1_8","TIT","1","8","8","Instead, he must be hospitable, a lover of good, self-controlled, upright, holy, and disciplined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_9","086_1_9","TIT","1","9","9","He must hold firmly to the faithful word as it was taught, so that he can encourage others by sound teaching and refute those who contradict it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_10","086_1_10","TIT","1","10","10","For many are rebellious and full of empty talk and deception, especially those of the circumcision, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_11","086_1_11","TIT","1","11","11","who must be silenced. For the sake of dishonorable gain, they undermine entire households and teach things they should not. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_12","086_1_12","TIT","1","12","12","As one of their own prophets has said, “Cretans are always liars, evil beasts, lazy gluttons.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_13","086_1_13","TIT","1","13","13","This testimony is true. Therefore rebuke them sternly, so that they will be sound in the faith ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_14","086_1_14","TIT","1","14","14","and will pay no attention to Jewish myths or to the commands of men who have rejected the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_15","086_1_15","TIT","1","15","15","To the pure, all things are pure; but to the defiled and unbelieving, nothing is pure. Indeed, both their minds and their consciences are defiled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT1_16","086_1_16","TIT","1","16","16","They profess to know God, but by their actions they deny Him. They are detestable, disobedient, and unfit for any good deed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_1","086_2_1","TIT","2","1","1","But as for you, speak the things that are consistent with sound doctrine. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_2","086_2_2","TIT","2","2","2","Older men are to be temperate, dignified, self-controlled, and sound in faith, love, and perseverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_3","086_2_3","TIT","2","3","3","Older women, likewise, are to be reverent in their behavior, not slanderers or addicted to much wine, but teachers of good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_4","086_2_4","TIT","2","4","4","In this way they can train the young women to love their husbands and children, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_5","086_2_5","TIT","2","5","5","to be self-controlled, pure, managers of their households, kind, and submissive to their own husbands, so that the word of God will not be discredited. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_6","086_2_6","TIT","2","6","6","In the same way, urge the younger men to be self-controlled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_7","086_2_7","TIT","2","7","7","In everything, show yourself to be an example by doing good works. In your teaching show integrity, dignity, incorruptibility, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_8","086_2_8","TIT","2","8","8","and wholesome speech that is above reproach, so that anyone who opposes us will be ashamed, having nothing bad to say about us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_9","086_2_9","TIT","2","9","9","Slaves are to submit to their own masters in everything, to be well-pleasing, not argumentative, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_10","086_2_10","TIT","2","10","10","not stealing from them, but showing all good faith, so that in every respect they will adorn the teaching about God our Savior. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_11","086_2_11","TIT","2","11","11","For the saving grace of God has appeared to everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_12","086_2_12","TIT","2","12","12","It instructs us to renounce ungodliness and worldly passions, and to live sensible, upright, and godly lives in the present age, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_13","086_2_13","TIT","2","13","13","as we await the blessed hope and glorious appearance of our great God and Savior Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_14","086_2_14","TIT","2","14","14","He gave Himself for us to redeem us from all lawlessness and to purify for Himself a people for His own possession, zealous for good deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT2_15","086_2_15","TIT","2","15","15","Speak these things as you encourage and rebuke with all authority. Let no one despise you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_1","086_3_1","TIT","3","1","1","Remind the believers to submit to rulers and authorities, to be obedient and ready for every good work, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_2","086_3_2","TIT","3","2","2","to malign no one, and to be peaceable and gentle, showing full consideration to everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_3","086_3_3","TIT","3","3","3","For at one time we too were foolish, disobedient, misled, and enslaved to all sorts of desires and pleasures—living in malice and envy, being hated and hating one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_4","086_3_4","TIT","3","4","4","But when the kindness of God our Savior and His love for mankind appeared, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_5","086_3_5","TIT","3","5","5","He saved us, not by the righteous deeds we had done, but according to His mercy, through the washing of new birth and renewal by the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_6","086_3_6","TIT","3","6","6","This is the Spirit He poured out on us abundantly through Jesus Christ our Savior, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_7","086_3_7","TIT","3","7","7","so that, having been justified by His grace, we would become heirs with the hope of eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_8","086_3_8","TIT","3","8","8","This saying is trustworthy. And I want you to emphasize these things, so that those who have believed God will take care to devote themselves to good deeds. These things are excellent and profitable for the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_9","086_3_9","TIT","3","9","9","But avoid foolish controversies, genealogies, arguments, and quarrels about the law, because these things are pointless and worthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_10","086_3_10","TIT","3","10","10","Reject a divisive man after a first and second admonition, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_11","086_3_11","TIT","3","11","11","knowing that such a man is corrupt and sinful; he is self-condemned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_12","086_3_12","TIT","3","12","12","As soon as I send Artemas or Tychicus to you, make every effort to come to me at Nicopolis, because I have decided to winter there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_13","086_3_13","TIT","3","13","13","Do your best to equip Zenas the lawyer and Apollos, so that they will have everything they need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_14","086_3_14","TIT","3","14","14","And our people must also learn to devote themselves to good works in order to meet the pressing needs of others, so that they will not be unfruitful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("TT3_15","086_3_15","TIT","3","15","15","All who are with me send you greetings. Greet those who love us in the faith. Grace be with all of you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_1","087_1_1","PHM","1","1","1","Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy our brother, To Philemon our beloved fellow worker, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_2","087_1_2","PHM","1","2","2","to Apphia our beloved, to Archippus our fellow soldier, and to the church that meets at your house: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_3","087_1_3","PHM","1","3","3","Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_4","087_1_4","PHM","1","4","4","I always thank my God, remembering you in my prayers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_5","087_1_5","PHM","1","5","5","because I hear about your faith in the Lord Jesus and your love for all the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_6","087_1_6","PHM","1","6","6","I pray that your partnership in the faith may become effective as you fully acknowledge every good thing that is ours in Christ Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_7","087_1_7","PHM","1","7","7","We take great joy and encouragement in your love, because you, brother, have refreshed the hearts of the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_8","087_1_8","PHM","1","8","8","So although in Christ I am bold enough to order you to do what is proper, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_9","087_1_9","PHM","1","9","9","I prefer to appeal on the basis of love. For I, Paul, am now aged, and a prisoner of Jesus Christ as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_10","087_1_10","PHM","1","10","10","I appeal to you for my child Onesimus, whose father I became while I was in my chains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_11","087_1_11","PHM","1","11","11","Formerly he was useless to you, but now he has become useful both to you and to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_12","087_1_12","PHM","1","12","12","I am sending back for you to receive him who is my very heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_13","087_1_13","PHM","1","13","13","I would have liked to keep him with me, so that on your behalf he could minister to me in my chains for the gospel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_14","087_1_14","PHM","1","14","14","But I did not want to do anything without your consent, so that your goodness will not be out of compulsion, but by your own free will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_15","087_1_15","PHM","1","15","15","For perhaps this is why he was separated from you for a while, so that you might have him back for good— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_16","087_1_16","PHM","1","16","16","no longer as a slave, but better than a slave, as a beloved brother. He is especially beloved to me, but even more so to you, both in person and in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_17","087_1_17","PHM","1","17","17","So if you consider me a partner, receive him as you would receive me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_18","087_1_18","PHM","1","18","18","But if he has wronged you in any way or owes you anything, charge it to my account. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_19","087_1_19","PHM","1","19","19","I, Paul, write this with my own hand. I will repay it—not to mention that you owe me your very self. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_20","087_1_20","PHM","1","20","20","Yes, brother, let me have some benefit from you in the Lord. Refresh my heart in the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_21","087_1_21","PHM","1","21","21","Confident of your obedience, I write to you, knowing that you will do even more than I ask. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_22","087_1_22","PHM","1","22","22","In the meantime, prepare a guest room for me, because I hope that through your prayers I will be restored to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_23","087_1_23","PHM","1","23","23","Epaphras, my fellow prisoner in Christ Jesus, sends you greetings, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_24","087_1_24","PHM","1","24","24","as do Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, and Luke, my fellow workers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("PM1_25","087_1_25","PHM","1","25","25","The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_1","088_1_1","HEB","1","1","1","On many past occasions and in many different ways, God spoke to our fathers through the prophets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_2","088_1_2","HEB","1","2","2","But in these last days He has spoken to us by His Son, whom He appointed heir of all things, and through whom He made the universe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_3","088_1_3","HEB","1","3","3","The Son is the radiance of God’s glory and the exact representation of His nature, upholding all things by His powerful word. After He had provided purification for our sins, He sat down at the right hand of the Majesty on high. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_4","088_1_4","HEB","1","4","4","So He became as far superior to the angels as the name He has inherited is excellent beyond theirs. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_5","088_1_5","HEB","1","5","5","For to which of the angels did God ever say: “You are My Son; today I have become Your Father”? Or again: “I will be His Father, and He will be My Son”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_6","088_1_6","HEB","1","6","6","And again, when God brings His firstborn into the world, He says: “Let all God’s angels worship Him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_7","088_1_7","HEB","1","7","7","Now about the angels He says: “He makes His angels winds, His servants flames of fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_8","088_1_8","HEB","1","8","8","But about the Son He says: “Your throne, O God, endures forever and ever, and justice is the scepter of Your kingdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_9","088_1_9","HEB","1","9","9","You have loved righteousness and hated wickedness; therefore God, Your God, has anointed You above Your companions with the oil of joy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_10","088_1_10","HEB","1","10","10","And: “In the beginning, O Lord, You laid the foundations of the earth, and the heavens are the work of Your hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_11","088_1_11","HEB","1","11","11","They will perish, but You remain; they will all wear out like a garment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_12","088_1_12","HEB","1","12","12","You will roll them up like a robe; they will be changed; but You remain the same, and Your years will never end.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_13","088_1_13","HEB","1","13","13","Yet to which of the angels did God ever say: “Sit at My right hand until I make Your enemies a footstool for Your feet”? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB1_14","088_1_14","HEB","1","14","14","Are not the angels ministering spirits sent to serve those who will inherit salvation? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_1","088_2_1","HEB","2","1","1","We must pay closer attention, therefore, to what we have heard, so that we do not drift away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_2","088_2_2","HEB","2","2","2","For if the message spoken by angels was binding, and every transgression and disobedience received its just punishment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_3","088_2_3","HEB","2","3","3","how shall we escape if we neglect such a great salvation? This salvation was first announced by the Lord, was confirmed to us by those who heard Him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_4","088_2_4","HEB","2","4","4","and was affirmed by God through signs, wonders, various miracles, and gifts of the Holy Spirit distributed according to His will. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_5","088_2_5","HEB","2","5","5","For it is not to angels that He has subjected the world to come, about which we are speaking. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_6","088_2_6","HEB","2","6","6","But somewhere it is testified in these words: “What is man that You are mindful of him, or the son of man that You care for him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_7","088_2_7","HEB","2","7","7","You made him a little lower than the angels; You crowned him with glory and honor, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_8","088_2_8","HEB","2","8","8","and placed everything under his feet.” When God subjected all things to him, He left nothing outside of his control. Yet at present we do not see everything subject to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_9","088_2_9","HEB","2","9","9","But we see Jesus, who was made a little lower than the angels, now crowned with glory and honor because He suffered death, so that by the grace of God He might taste death for everyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_10","088_2_10","HEB","2","10","10","In bringing many sons to glory, it was fitting for God, for whom and through whom all things exist, to make the author of their salvation perfect through suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_11","088_2_11","HEB","2","11","11","For both the One who sanctifies and those who are sanctified are of the same family. So Jesus is not ashamed to call them brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_12","088_2_12","HEB","2","12","12","He says: “I will proclaim Your name to My brothers; I will sing Your praises in the assembly.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_13","088_2_13","HEB","2","13","13","And again: “I will put My trust in Him.” And once again: “Here am I, and the children God has given Me.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_14","088_2_14","HEB","2","14","14","Now since the children have flesh and blood, He too shared in their humanity, so that by His death He might destroy him who holds the power of death, that is, the devil, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_15","088_2_15","HEB","2","15","15","and free those who all their lives were held in slavery by their fear of death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_16","088_2_16","HEB","2","16","16","For surely it is not the angels He helps, but the descendants of Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_17","088_2_17","HEB","2","17","17","For this reason He had to be made like His brothers in every way, so that He might become a merciful and faithful high priest in service to God, in order to make atonement for the sins of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB2_18","088_2_18","HEB","2","18","18","Because He Himself suffered when He was tempted, He is able to help those who are being tempted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_1","088_3_1","HEB","3","1","1","Therefore, holy brothers, who share in the heavenly calling, set your focus on Jesus Christ, the apostle and high priest whom we confess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_2","088_3_2","HEB","3","2","2","He was faithful to the One who appointed Him, just as Moses was faithful in all God’s house. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_3","088_3_3","HEB","3","3","3","For Jesus has been counted worthy of greater glory than Moses, just as the builder of a house has greater honor than the house itself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_4","088_3_4","HEB","3","4","4","And every house is built by someone, but God is the builder of everything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_5","088_3_5","HEB","3","5","5","Now Moses was faithful as a servant in all God’s house, testifying to what would be spoken later. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_6","088_3_6","HEB","3","6","6","But Christ is faithful as the Son over God’s house. And we are His house, if we hold firmly to the end our confidence and the hope of which we boast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_7","088_3_7","HEB","3","7","7","Therefore, as the Holy Spirit says: “Today, if you hear His voice, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_8","088_3_8","HEB","3","8","8","do not harden your hearts, as you did in the rebellion, in the day of testing in the wilderness, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_9","088_3_9","HEB","3","9","9","where your fathers tested and tried Me, and for forty years saw My works. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_10","088_3_10","HEB","3","10","10","Therefore I was angry with that generation, and I said, ‘Their hearts are always going astray, and they have not known My ways.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_11","088_3_11","HEB","3","11","11","So I swore on oath in My anger, ‘They shall never enter My rest.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_12","088_3_12","HEB","3","12","12","See to it, brothers, that none of you has a wicked heart of unbelief that turns away from the living God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_13","088_3_13","HEB","3","13","13","But exhort one another daily, as long as it is called today, so that none of you may be hardened by sin’s deceitfulness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_14","088_3_14","HEB","3","14","14","We have come to share in Christ if we hold firmly to the end the assurance we had at first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_15","088_3_15","HEB","3","15","15","As it has been said: “Today, if you hear His voice, do not harden your hearts, as you did in the rebellion.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_16","088_3_16","HEB","3","16","16","For some heard and rebelled, but not all those Moses led out of Egypt. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_17","088_3_17","HEB","3","17","17","And with whom was God angry for forty years? Was it not with those who sinned, whose bodies fell in the wilderness? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_18","088_3_18","HEB","3","18","18","And to whom did He swear that they would never enter His rest? Was it not to those who disobeyed? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB3_19","088_3_19","HEB","3","19","19","So we see that it was because of their unbelief that they were unable to enter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_1","088_4_1","HEB","4","1","1","Therefore, while the promise of entering His rest still stands, let us be careful that none of you be deemed to have fallen short of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_2","088_4_2","HEB","4","2","2","For we also received the good news just as they did; but the message they heard was of no value to them, since they did not share the faith of those who comprehended it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_3","088_4_3","HEB","4","3","3","Now we who have believed enter that rest. As for the others, it is just as God has said: “So I swore on oath in My anger, ‘They shall never enter My rest.’” And yet His works have been finished since the foundation of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_4","088_4_4","HEB","4","4","4","For somewhere He has spoken about the seventh day in this manner: “And on the seventh day God rested from all His works.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_5","088_4_5","HEB","4","5","5","And again, as He says in the passage above: “They shall never enter My rest.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_6","088_4_6","HEB","4","6","6","Since, then, it remains for some to enter His rest, and since those who formerly heard the good news did not enter because of their disobedience, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_7","088_4_7","HEB","4","7","7","God again designated a certain day as “Today,” when a long time later He spoke through David as was just stated: “Today, if you hear His voice, do not harden your hearts.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_8","088_4_8","HEB","4","8","8","For if Joshua had given them rest, God would not have spoken later about another day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_9","088_4_9","HEB","4","9","9","There remains, then, a Sabbath rest for the people of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_10","088_4_10","HEB","4","10","10","For whoever enters God’s rest also rests from his own work, just as God did from His. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_11","088_4_11","HEB","4","11","11","Let us, therefore, make every effort to enter that rest, so that no one will fall by following the same pattern of disobedience. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_12","088_4_12","HEB","4","12","12","For the word of God is living and active. Sharper than any double-edged sword, it pierces even to dividing soul and spirit, joints and marrow. It judges the thoughts and intentions of the heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_13","088_4_13","HEB","4","13","13","Nothing in all creation is hidden from God’s sight; everything is uncovered and exposed before the eyes of Him to whom we must give account. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_14","088_4_14","HEB","4","14","14","Therefore, since we have a great high priest who has passed through the heavens, Jesus the Son of God, let us hold firmly to what we profess. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_15","088_4_15","HEB","4","15","15","For we do not have a high priest who is unable to sympathize with our weaknesses, but we have one who was tempted in every way that we are, yet was without sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB4_16","088_4_16","HEB","4","16","16","Let us then approach the throne of grace with confidence, so that we may receive mercy and find grace to help us in our time of need. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_1","088_5_1","HEB","5","1","1","Every high priest is appointed from among men to represent them in matters relating to God, to offer gifts and sacrifices for sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_2","088_5_2","HEB","5","2","2","He is able to deal gently with those who are ignorant and misguided, since he himself is beset by weakness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_3","088_5_3","HEB","5","3","3","That is why he is obligated to offer sacrifices for his own sins, as well as for the sins of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_4","088_5_4","HEB","5","4","4","No one takes this honor upon himself; he must be called by God, just as Aaron was. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_5","088_5_5","HEB","5","5","5","So also Christ did not take upon Himself the glory of becoming a high priest, but He was called by the One who said to Him: “You are My Son; today I have become Your Father.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_6","088_5_6","HEB","5","6","6","And in another passage God says: “You are a priest forever in the order of Melchizedek.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_7","088_5_7","HEB","5","7","7","During the days of Jesus’ earthly life, He offered up prayers and petitions with loud cries and tears to the One who could save Him from death, and He was heard because of His reverence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_8","088_5_8","HEB","5","8","8","Although He was a Son, He learned obedience from what He suffered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_9","088_5_9","HEB","5","9","9","And having been made perfect, He became the source of eternal salvation to all who obey Him ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_10","088_5_10","HEB","5","10","10","and was designated by God as high priest in the order of Melchizedek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_11","088_5_11","HEB","5","11","11","We have much to say about this, but it is hard to explain, because you are dull of hearing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_12","088_5_12","HEB","5","12","12","Although by this time you ought to be teachers, you need someone to reteach you the basic principles of God’s word. You need milk, not solid food! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_13","088_5_13","HEB","5","13","13","For everyone who lives on milk is still an infant, inexperienced in the message of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB5_14","088_5_14","HEB","5","14","14","But solid food is for the mature, who by constant use have trained their senses to distinguish good from evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_1","088_6_1","HEB","6","1","1","Therefore let us leave the elementary teachings about Christ and go on to maturity, not laying again the foundation of repentance from dead works, and of faith in God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_2","088_6_2","HEB","6","2","2","instruction about baptisms, the laying on of hands, the resurrection of the dead, and eternal judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_3","088_6_3","HEB","6","3","3","And this we will do, if God permits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_4","088_6_4","HEB","6","4","4","It is impossible for those who have once been enlightened, who have tasted the heavenly gift, who have shared in the Holy Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_5","088_6_5","HEB","6","5","5","who have tasted the goodness of the word of God and the powers of the coming age— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_6","088_6_6","HEB","6","6","6","and then have fallen away—to be restored to repentance, because they themselves are crucifying the Son of God all over again and subjecting Him to open shame. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_7","088_6_7","HEB","6","7","7","For land that drinks in the rain often falling on it and that produces a crop useful to those for whom it is tended receives the blessing of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_8","088_6_8","HEB","6","8","8","But land that produces thorns and thistles is worthless, and its curse is imminent. In the end it will be burned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_9","088_6_9","HEB","6","9","9","Even though we speak like this, beloved, we are convinced of better things in your case—things that accompany salvation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_10","088_6_10","HEB","6","10","10","For God is not unjust. He will not forget your work and the labor of love you have shown for His name as you have ministered to the saints and continue to do so. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_11","088_6_11","HEB","6","11","11","We want each of you to show this same diligence to the very end, in order to make your hope sure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_12","088_6_12","HEB","6","12","12","Then you will not be sluggish, but will imitate those who through faith and patience inherit what has been promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_13","088_6_13","HEB","6","13","13","When God made His promise to Abraham, since He had no one greater to swear by, He swore by Himself, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_14","088_6_14","HEB","6","14","14","saying, “I will surely bless you and multiply your descendants.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_15","088_6_15","HEB","6","15","15","And so Abraham, after waiting patiently, obtained the promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_16","088_6_16","HEB","6","16","16","Men indeed swear by someone greater than themselves, and their oath serves as a confirmation to end all argument. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_17","088_6_17","HEB","6","17","17","So when God wanted to make the unchanging nature of His purpose very clear to the heirs of the promise, He guaranteed it with an oath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_18","088_6_18","HEB","6","18","18","Thus by two unchangeable things in which it is impossible for God to lie, we who have fled to take hold of the hope set before us may be strongly encouraged. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_19","088_6_19","HEB","6","19","19","We have this hope as an anchor for the soul, firm and secure. It enters the inner sanctuary behind the curtain, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB6_20","088_6_20","HEB","6","20","20","where Jesus our forerunner has entered on our behalf. He has become a high priest forever in the order of Melchizedek. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_1","088_7_1","HEB","7","1","1","This Melchizedek was king of Salem and priest of God Most High. He met Abraham returning from the slaughter of the kings and blessed him, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_2","088_7_2","HEB","7","2","2","and Abraham apportioned to him a tenth of everything. First, his name means “king of righteousness.” Then also, “king of Salem” means “king of peace.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_3","088_7_3","HEB","7","3","3","Without father or mother or genealogy, without beginning of days or end of life, like the Son of God, he remains a priest for all time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_4","088_7_4","HEB","7","4","4","Consider how great Melchizedek was: Even the patriarch Abraham gave him a tenth of the plunder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_5","088_7_5","HEB","7","5","5","Now the law commands the sons of Levi who become priests to collect a tenth from the people—that is, from their brothers—though they too are descended from Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_6","088_7_6","HEB","7","6","6","But Melchizedek, who did not trace his descent from Levi, collected a tenth from Abraham and blessed him who had the promises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_7","088_7_7","HEB","7","7","7","And indisputably, the lesser is blessed by the greater. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_8","088_7_8","HEB","7","8","8","In the case of the Levites, mortal men collect the tenth; but in the case of Melchizedek, it is affirmed that he lives on. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_9","088_7_9","HEB","7","9","9","And so to speak, Levi, who collects the tenth, paid the tenth through Abraham. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_10","088_7_10","HEB","7","10","10","For when Melchizedek met Abraham, Levi was still in the loin of his ancestor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_11","088_7_11","HEB","7","11","11","Now if perfection could have been attained through the Levitical priesthood (for on this basis the people received the law), why was there still need for another priest to appear—one in the order of Melchizedek and not in the order of Aaron? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_12","088_7_12","HEB","7","12","12","For when the priesthood is changed, the law must be changed as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_13","088_7_13","HEB","7","13","13","He of whom these things are said belonged to a different tribe, from which no one has ever served at the altar. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_14","088_7_14","HEB","7","14","14","For it is clear that our Lord descended from Judah, a tribe as to which Moses said nothing about priesthood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_15","088_7_15","HEB","7","15","15","And this point is even more clear if another priest like Melchizedek appears, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_16","088_7_16","HEB","7","16","16","one who has become a priest not by a law of succession, but by the power of an indestructible life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_17","088_7_17","HEB","7","17","17","For it is testified: “You are a priest forever in the order of Melchizedek.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_18","088_7_18","HEB","7","18","18","So the former commandment is set aside because it was weak and useless ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_19","088_7_19","HEB","7","19","19","(for the law made nothing perfect), and a better hope is introduced, by which we draw near to God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_20","088_7_20","HEB","7","20","20","And none of this happened without an oath. For others became priests without an oath, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_21","088_7_21","HEB","7","21","21","but Jesus became a priest with an oath by the One who said to Him: “The Lord has sworn and will not change His mind: ‘You are a priest forever in the order of Melchizedek.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_22","088_7_22","HEB","7","22","22","Because of this oath, Jesus has become the guarantee of a better covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_23","088_7_23","HEB","7","23","23","Now there have been many other priests, since death prevented them from continuing in office. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_24","088_7_24","HEB","7","24","24","But because Jesus lives forever, He has a permanent priesthood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_25","088_7_25","HEB","7","25","25","Therefore He is able to save completely those who draw near to God through Him, since He always lives to intercede for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_26","088_7_26","HEB","7","26","26","Such a high priest truly befits us—One who is holy, innocent, undefiled, set apart from sinners, and exalted above the heavens. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_27","088_7_27","HEB","7","27","27","Unlike the other high priests, He does not need to offer daily sacrifices, first for His own sins and then for the sins of the people; He sacrificed for sin once for all when He offered up Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB7_28","088_7_28","HEB","7","28","28","For the law appoints as high priests men who are weak; but the oath, which came after the law, appointed the Son, who has been made perfect forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_1","088_8_1","HEB","8","1","1","The point of what we are saying is this: We do have such a high priest, who sat down at the right hand of the throne of the Majesty in heaven, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_2","088_8_2","HEB","8","2","2","and who ministers in the sanctuary and true tabernacle set up by the Lord, not by man. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_3","088_8_3","HEB","8","3","3","And since every high priest is appointed to offer both gifts and sacrifices, it was necessary for this One also to have something to offer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_4","088_8_4","HEB","8","4","4","For if He were on earth, He would not be a priest, since there are already priests who offer gifts according to the law. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_5","088_8_5","HEB","8","5","5","The place where they serve is a copy and shadow of what is in heaven. This is why Moses was warned when he was about to build the tabernacle: “See to it that you make everything according to the pattern shown you on the mountain.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_6","088_8_6","HEB","8","6","6","Now, however, Jesus has received a much more excellent ministry, just as the covenant He mediates is better and is founded on better promises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_7","088_8_7","HEB","8","7","7","For if that first covenant had been without fault, no place would have been sought for a second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_8","088_8_8","HEB","8","8","8","But God found fault with the people and said: “Behold, the days are coming, declares the Lord, when I will make a new covenant with the house of Israel and with the house of Judah. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_9","088_8_9","HEB","8","9","9","It will not be like the covenant I made with their fathers when I took them by the hand to lead them out of the land of Egypt, because they did not abide by My covenant, and I disregarded them, declares the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_10","088_8_10","HEB","8","10","10","For this is the covenant I will make with the house of Israel after those days, declares the Lord. I will put My laws in their minds and inscribe them on their hearts. And I will be their God, and they will be My people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_11","088_8_11","HEB","8","11","11","No longer will each one teach his neighbor or his brother, saying, ‘Know the Lord,’ because they will all know Me, from the least of them to the greatest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_12","088_8_12","HEB","8","12","12","For I will forgive their iniquities and will remember their sins and lawless acts no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB8_13","088_8_13","HEB","8","13","13","By speaking of a new covenant, He has made the first one obsolete; and what is obsolete and aging will soon disappear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_1","088_9_1","HEB","9","1","1","Now even the first covenant had regulations for worship and also an earthly sanctuary. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_2","088_9_2","HEB","9","2","2","A tabernacle was prepared. In its first room were the lampstand, the table, and the consecrated bread. This was called the Holy Place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_3","088_9_3","HEB","9","3","3","Behind the second curtain was a room called the Most Holy Place, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_4","088_9_4","HEB","9","4","4","containing the golden altar of incense and the gold-covered ark of the covenant. Inside the ark were the gold jar of manna, Aaron’s staff that had budded, and the stone tablets of the covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_5","088_9_5","HEB","9","5","5","Above the ark were the cherubim of glory, overshadowing the mercy seat. But we cannot discuss these things in detail now. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_6","088_9_6","HEB","9","6","6","When everything had been prepared in this way, the priests entered regularly into the first room to perform their sacred duties. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_7","088_9_7","HEB","9","7","7","But only the high priest entered the second room, and then only once a year, and never without blood, which he offered for himself and for the sins the people had committed in ignorance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_8","088_9_8","HEB","9","8","8","By this arrangement the Holy Spirit was showing that the way into the Most Holy Place had not yet been disclosed as long as the first tabernacle was still standing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_9","088_9_9","HEB","9","9","9","It is an illustration for the present time, because the gifts and sacrifices being offered were unable to cleanse the conscience of the worshiper. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_10","088_9_10","HEB","9","10","10","They consist only in food and drink and special washings and external regulations imposed until the time of reform. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_11","088_9_11","HEB","9","11","11","But when Christ came as high priest of the good things to come, He went through the greater and more perfect tabernacle that is not made by hands and is not a part of this creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_12","088_9_12","HEB","9","12","12","He did not enter by the blood of goats and calves, but He entered the Most Holy Place once for all by His own blood, thus securing eternal redemption. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_13","088_9_13","HEB","9","13","13","For if the blood of bulls and goats and the ashes of a heifer sprinkled on those who are ceremonially unclean sanctify them so that their bodies are clean, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_14","088_9_14","HEB","9","14","14","how much more will the blood of Christ, who through the eternal Spirit offered Himself unblemished to God, purify your consciences from works of death, so that we may serve the living God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_15","088_9_15","HEB","9","15","15","Therefore Christ is the mediator of a new covenant, so that those who are called may receive the promised eternal inheritance, now that He has died to redeem them from the transgressions committed under the first covenant. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_16","088_9_16","HEB","9","16","16","In the case of a will, it is necessary to establish the death of the one who made it, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_17","088_9_17","HEB","9","17","17","because a will does not take effect until the one who made it has died; it cannot be executed while he is still alive. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_18","088_9_18","HEB","9","18","18","That is why even the first covenant was not put into effect without blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_19","088_9_19","HEB","9","19","19","For when Moses had proclaimed every commandment of the law to all the people, he took the blood of calves and goats, along with water, scarlet wool, and hyssop, and sprinkled the scroll and all the people, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_20","088_9_20","HEB","9","20","20","saying, “This is the blood of the covenant, which God has commanded you to keep.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_21","088_9_21","HEB","9","21","21","In the same way, he sprinkled with blood the tabernacle and all the vessels used in worship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_22","088_9_22","HEB","9","22","22","According to the law, in fact, nearly everything must be purified with blood, and without the shedding of blood there is no forgiveness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_23","088_9_23","HEB","9","23","23","So it was necessary for the copies of the heavenly things to be purified with these sacrifices, but the heavenly things themselves with better sacrifices than these. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_24","088_9_24","HEB","9","24","24","For Christ did not enter a man-made copy of the true sanctuary, but He entered heaven itself, now to appear on our behalf in the presence of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_25","088_9_25","HEB","9","25","25","Nor did He enter heaven to offer Himself again and again, as the high priest enters the Most Holy Place every year with blood that is not his own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_26","088_9_26","HEB","9","26","26","Otherwise, Christ would have had to suffer repeatedly since the foundation of the world. But now He has appeared once for all at the end of the ages to do away with sin by the sacrifice of Himself. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_27","088_9_27","HEB","9","27","27","Just as man is appointed to die once, and after that to face judgment, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB9_28","088_9_28","HEB","9","28","28","so also Christ was offered once to bear the sins of many; and He will appear a second time, not to bear sin, but to bring salvation to those who eagerly await Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_1","088_10_1","HEB","10","1","1","For the law is only a shadow of the good things to come, not the realities themselves. The same sacrifices offered year after year can never make perfect those who draw near to worship. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_2","088_10_2","HEB","10","2","2","If it could, would not the offerings have ceased? For the worshipers would have been cleansed once for all, and would no longer have felt the guilt of their sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_3","088_10_3","HEB","10","3","3","Instead, those sacrifices are an annual reminder of sins, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_4","088_10_4","HEB","10","4","4","because it is impossible for the blood of bulls and goats to take away sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_5","088_10_5","HEB","10","5","5","Therefore, when Christ came into the world, He said: “Sacrifice and offering You did not desire, but a body You prepared for Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_6","088_10_6","HEB","10","6","6","In burnt offerings and sin offerings You took no delight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_7","088_10_7","HEB","10","7","7","Then I said, ‘Here I am, it is written about Me in the scroll: I have come to do Your will, O God.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_8","088_10_8","HEB","10","8","8","In the passage above He says, “Sacrifice and offering, burnt offerings and sin offerings You did not desire, nor did You delight in them” (although they are offered according to the law). ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_9","088_10_9","HEB","10","9","9","Then He adds, “Here I am, I have come to do Your will, O God.” He takes away the first to establish the second. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_10","088_10_10","HEB","10","10","10","And by that will, we have been sanctified through the sacrifice of the body of Jesus Christ once for all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_11","088_10_11","HEB","10","11","11","Day after day every priest stands to minister and to offer again and again the same sacrifices, which can never take away sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_12","088_10_12","HEB","10","12","12","But when this Priest had offered for all time one sacrifice for sins, He sat down at the right hand of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_13","088_10_13","HEB","10","13","13","Since that time, He waits for His enemies to be made a footstool for His feet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_14","088_10_14","HEB","10","14","14","because by a single offering He has made perfect for all time those who are being sanctified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_15","088_10_15","HEB","10","15","15","The Holy Spirit also testifies to us about this. First He says: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_16","088_10_16","HEB","10","16","16","“This is the covenant I will make with them after those days, declares the Lord. I will put My laws in their hearts and inscribe them on their minds.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_17","088_10_17","HEB","10","17","17","Then He adds: “Their sins and lawless acts I will remember no more.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_18","088_10_18","HEB","10","18","18","And where these have been forgiven, an offering for sin is no longer needed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_19","088_10_19","HEB","10","19","19","Therefore, brothers, since we have confidence to enter the Most Holy Place by the blood of Jesus, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_20","088_10_20","HEB","10","20","20","by the new and living way opened for us through the curtain of His body, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_21","088_10_21","HEB","10","21","21","and since we have a great priest over the house of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_22","088_10_22","HEB","10","22","22","let us draw near with a sincere heart in full assurance of faith, having our hearts sprinkled to cleanse us from a guilty conscience and our bodies washed with pure water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_23","088_10_23","HEB","10","23","23","Let us hold resolutely to the hope we profess, for He who promised is faithful. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_24","088_10_24","HEB","10","24","24","And let us consider how to spur one another on to love and good deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_25","088_10_25","HEB","10","25","25","Let us not neglect meeting together, as some have made a habit, but let us encourage one another, and all the more as you see the Day approaching. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_26","088_10_26","HEB","10","26","26","If we deliberately go on sinning after we have received the knowledge of the truth, no further sacrifice for sins remains, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_27","088_10_27","HEB","10","27","27","but only a fearful expectation of judgment and of raging fire that will consume all adversaries. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_28","088_10_28","HEB","10","28","28","Anyone who rejected the law of Moses died without mercy on the testimony of two or three witnesses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_29","088_10_29","HEB","10","29","29","How much more severely do you think one deserves to be punished who has trampled on the Son of God, profaned the blood of the covenant that sanctified him, and insulted the Spirit of grace? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_30","088_10_30","HEB","10","30","30","For we know Him who said, “Vengeance is Mine; I will repay, says the Lord,” and again, “The Lord will judge His people.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_31","088_10_31","HEB","10","31","31","It is a fearful thing to fall into the hands of the living God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_32","088_10_32","HEB","10","32","32","Remember the early days that you were in the light. In those days, you endured a great conflict in the face of suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_33","088_10_33","HEB","10","33","33","Sometimes you were publicly exposed to ridicule and persecution; at other times you were partners with those who were so treated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_34","088_10_34","HEB","10","34","34","You sympathized with me in my chains and joyfully accepted the confiscation of your property, knowing that you yourselves had a better and permanent possession in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_35","088_10_35","HEB","10","35","35","So do not throw away your confidence; it holds a great reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_36","088_10_36","HEB","10","36","36","You need to persevere, so that after you have done the will of God, you will receive what He has promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_37","088_10_37","HEB","10","37","37","For, “In just a little while, He who is coming will come and will not delay. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_38","088_10_38","HEB","10","38","38","But the righteous will live by faith; and if he shrinks back, I will take no pleasure in him.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB10_39","088_10_39","HEB","10","39","39","But we are not of those who shrink back and are destroyed, but of those who have faith and preserve their souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_1","088_11_1","HEB","11","1","1","Now faith is the assurance of what we hope for and the certainty of what we do not see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_2","088_11_2","HEB","11","2","2","This is why the ancients were commended. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_3","088_11_3","HEB","11","3","3","By faith we understand that the universe was formed at God’s command, so that what is seen was not made out of what was visible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_4","088_11_4","HEB","11","4","4","By faith Abel offered God a better sacrifice than Cain did. By faith he was commended as righteous when God gave approval to his gifts. And by faith he still speaks, even though he is dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_5","088_11_5","HEB","11","5","5","By faith Enoch was taken up so that he did not see death: “He could not be found, because God had taken him away.” For before he was taken, he was commended as one who pleased God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_6","088_11_6","HEB","11","6","6","And without faith it is impossible to please God, because anyone who approaches Him must believe that He exists and that He rewards those who earnestly seek Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_7","088_11_7","HEB","11","7","7","By faith Noah, when warned about things not yet seen, in godly fear built an ark to save his family. By faith he condemned the world and became heir of the righteousness that comes by faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_8","088_11_8","HEB","11","8","8","By faith Abraham, when called to go to the place he would later receive as his inheritance, obeyed and went, without knowing where he was going. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_9","088_11_9","HEB","11","9","9","By faith he dwelt in the promised land as a stranger in a foreign country. He lived in tents, as did Isaac and Jacob, who were heirs with him of the same promise. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_10","088_11_10","HEB","11","10","10","For he was looking forward to the city with foundations, whose architect and builder is God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_11","088_11_11","HEB","11","11","11","By faith Sarah, even though she was beyond the proper age, received power and was enabled to conceive a child, because she considered Him faithful who had promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_12","088_11_12","HEB","11","12","12","And so from one man, and he as good as dead, came descendants as numerous as the stars in the sky and as countless as the sand on the seashore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_13","088_11_13","HEB","11","13","13","All these people died in faith, without having received the things they were promised. However, they saw them and welcomed them from afar. And they acknowledged that they were strangers and exiles on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_14","088_11_14","HEB","11","14","14","Now those who say such things show that they are seeking a country of their own. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_15","088_11_15","HEB","11","15","15","If they had been thinking of the country they had left, they would have had opportunity to return. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_16","088_11_16","HEB","11","16","16","Instead, they were longing for a better country, a heavenly one. Therefore God is not ashamed to be called their God, for He has prepared a city for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_17","088_11_17","HEB","11","17","17","By faith Abraham, when he was tested, offered up Isaac on the altar. He who had received the promises was ready to offer his one and only son, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_18","088_11_18","HEB","11","18","18","even though God had said to him, “Through Isaac your offspring will be reckoned.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_19","088_11_19","HEB","11","19","19","Abraham reasoned that God could raise the dead, and in a sense, he did receive Isaac back from death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_20","088_11_20","HEB","11","20","20","By faith Isaac blessed Jacob and Esau concerning the future. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_21","088_11_21","HEB","11","21","21","By faith Jacob, when he was dying, blessed each of Joseph’s sons and worshiped as he leaned on the top of his staff. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_22","088_11_22","HEB","11","22","22","By faith Joseph, when his end was near, spoke about the exodus of the Israelites and gave instructions about his bones. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_23","088_11_23","HEB","11","23","23","By faith Moses’ parents hid him for three months after his birth, because they saw that he was a beautiful child, and they were unafraid of the king’s edict. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_24","088_11_24","HEB","11","24","24","By faith Moses, when he was grown, refused to be called the son of Pharaoh’s daughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_25","088_11_25","HEB","11","25","25","He chose to suffer oppression with God’s people rather than to experience the fleeting enjoyment of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_26","088_11_26","HEB","11","26","26","He valued disgrace for Christ above the treasures of Egypt, for he was looking ahead to his reward. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_27","088_11_27","HEB","11","27","27","By faith Moses left Egypt, not fearing the king’s anger; he persevered because he saw Him who is invisible. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_28","088_11_28","HEB","11","28","28","By faith he kept the Passover and the sprinkling of blood, so that the destroyer of the firstborn would not touch Israel’s own firstborn. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_29","088_11_29","HEB","11","29","29","By faith the people passed through the Red Sea as on dry land; but when the Egyptians tried to follow, they were drowned. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_30","088_11_30","HEB","11","30","30","By faith the walls of Jericho fell, after the people had marched around them for seven days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_31","088_11_31","HEB","11","31","31","By faith the prostitute Rahab, because she welcomed the spies in peace, did not perish with those who were disobedient. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_32","088_11_32","HEB","11","32","32","And what more shall I say? Time will not allow me to tell of Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jephthah, David, Samuel, and the prophets, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_33","088_11_33","HEB","11","33","33","who through faith conquered kingdoms, administered justice, and gained what was promised; who shut the mouths of lions, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_34","088_11_34","HEB","11","34","34","quenched the raging fire, and escaped the edge of the sword; who gained strength from weakness, became mighty in battle, and put foreign armies to flight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_35","088_11_35","HEB","11","35","35","Women received back their dead, raised to life again. Others were tortured and refused their release, so that they might gain a better resurrection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_36","088_11_36","HEB","11","36","36","Still others endured mocking and flogging, and even chains and imprisonment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_37","088_11_37","HEB","11","37","37","They were stoned, they were sawed in two, they were put to the test, they were put to death by the sword. They went around in sheepskins and goatskins, destitute, oppressed, and mistreated. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_38","088_11_38","HEB","11","38","38","The world was not worthy of them. They wandered in deserts and mountains, and hid in caves and holes in the ground. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_39","088_11_39","HEB","11","39","39","These were all commended for their faith, yet they did not receive what was promised. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB11_40","088_11_40","HEB","11","40","40","God had planned something better for us, so that together with us they would be made perfect. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_1","088_12_1","HEB","12","1","1","Therefore, since we are surrounded by such a great cloud of witnesses, let us throw off every encumbrance and the sin that so easily entangles, and let us run with endurance the race set out for us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_2","088_12_2","HEB","12","2","2","Let us fix our eyes on Jesus, the author and perfecter of our faith, who for the joy set before Him endured the cross, scorning its shame, and sat down at the right hand of the throne of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_3","088_12_3","HEB","12","3","3","Consider Him who endured such hostility from sinners, so that you will not grow weary and lose heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_4","088_12_4","HEB","12","4","4","In your struggle against sin, you have not yet resisted to the point of shedding your blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_5","088_12_5","HEB","12","5","5","And you have forgotten the exhortation that addresses you as sons: “My son, do not take lightly the discipline of the Lord, and do not lose heart when He rebukes you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_6","088_12_6","HEB","12","6","6","For the Lord disciplines the one He loves, and He chastises every son He receives.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_7","088_12_7","HEB","12","7","7","Endure suffering as discipline; God is treating you as sons. For what son is not disciplined by his father? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_8","088_12_8","HEB","12","8","8","If you do not experience discipline like everyone else, then you are illegitimate children and not true sons. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_9","088_12_9","HEB","12","9","9","Furthermore, we have all had earthly fathers who disciplined us, and we respected them. Should we not much more submit to the Father of our spirits and live? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_10","088_12_10","HEB","12","10","10","Our fathers disciplined us for a short time as they thought best, but God disciplines us for our good, so that we may share in His holiness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_11","088_12_11","HEB","12","11","11","No discipline seems enjoyable at the time, but painful. Later on, however, it yields a harvest of righteousness and peace to those who have been trained by it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_12","088_12_12","HEB","12","12","12","Therefore strengthen your limp hands and weak knees. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_13","088_12_13","HEB","12","13","13","Make straight paths for your feet, so that the lame may not be disabled, but rather healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_14","088_12_14","HEB","12","14","14","Pursue peace with everyone, as well as holiness, without which no one will see the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_15","088_12_15","HEB","12","15","15","See to it that no one falls short of the grace of God, and that no root of bitterness springs up to cause trouble and defile many. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_16","088_12_16","HEB","12","16","16","See to it that no one is sexually immoral, or is godless like Esau, who for a single meal sold his birthright. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_17","088_12_17","HEB","12","17","17","For you know that afterward, when he wanted to inherit the blessing, he was rejected. He could find no ground for repentance, though he sought the blessing with tears. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_18","088_12_18","HEB","12","18","18","For you have not come to a mountain that can be touched and that is burning with fire; to blackness, darkness, and storm; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_19","088_12_19","HEB","12","19","19","to a trumpet blast or to a voice that made its hearers beg that no further word be spoken. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_20","088_12_20","HEB","12","20","20","For they could not bear what was commanded: “If even an animal touches the mountain, it must be stoned.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_21","088_12_21","HEB","12","21","21","The sight was so terrifying that even Moses said, “I am trembling with fear.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_22","088_12_22","HEB","12","22","22","Instead, you have come to Mount Zion, to the city of the living God, the heavenly Jerusalem. You have come to myriads of angels ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_23","088_12_23","HEB","12","23","23","in joyful assembly, to the congregation of the firstborn, enrolled in heaven. You have come to God the Judge of all, to the spirits of the righteous made perfect, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_24","088_12_24","HEB","12","24","24","to Jesus the mediator of a new covenant, and to the sprinkled blood that speaks a better word than the blood of Abel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_25","088_12_25","HEB","12","25","25","See to it that you do not refuse Him who speaks. For if the people did not escape when they refused Him who warned them on earth, how much less will we escape if we reject Him who warns us from heaven? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_26","088_12_26","HEB","12","26","26","At that time His voice shook the earth, but now He has promised, “Once more I will shake not only the earth, but heaven as well.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_27","088_12_27","HEB","12","27","27","The words “Once more” signify the removal of what can be shaken—that is, created things—so that the unshakable may remain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_28","088_12_28","HEB","12","28","28","Therefore, since we are receiving an unshakable kingdom, let us be filled with gratitude, and so worship God acceptably with reverence and godly fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB12_29","088_12_29","HEB","12","29","29","“For our God is a consuming fire.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_1","088_13_1","HEB","13","1","1","Continue in brotherly love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_2","088_13_2","HEB","13","2","2","Do not neglect to show hospitality to strangers, for by so doing some people have entertained angels without knowing it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_3","088_13_3","HEB","13","3","3","Remember those in prison as if you were bound with them, and those who are mistreated as if you were suffering with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_4","088_13_4","HEB","13","4","4","Marriage should be honored by all and the marriage bed kept undefiled; but God will judge the sexually immoral and adulterers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_5","088_13_5","HEB","13","5","5","Keep your lives free from the love of money and be content with what you have, for God has said: “Never will I leave you, never will I forsake you.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_6","088_13_6","HEB","13","6","6","So we say with confidence: “The Lord is my helper; I will not be afraid. What can man do to me?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_7","088_13_7","HEB","13","7","7","Remember your leaders who spoke the word of God to you. Consider the outcome of their way of life and imitate their faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_8","088_13_8","HEB","13","8","8","Jesus Christ is the same yesterday and today and forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_9","088_13_9","HEB","13","9","9","Do not be carried away by all kinds of strange teachings, for it is good for the heart to be strengthened by grace and not by foods of no value to those devoted to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_10","088_13_10","HEB","13","10","10","We have an altar from which those who serve at the tabernacle have no right to eat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_11","088_13_11","HEB","13","11","11","Although the high priest brings the blood of animals into the Holy Place as a sacrifice for sin, the bodies are burned outside the camp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_12","088_13_12","HEB","13","12","12","And so Jesus also suffered outside the city gate, to sanctify the people by His own blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_13","088_13_13","HEB","13","13","13","Therefore let us go to Him outside the camp, bearing the disgrace He bore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_14","088_13_14","HEB","13","14","14","For here we do not have a permanent city, but we are looking for the city that is to come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_15","088_13_15","HEB","13","15","15","Through Jesus, therefore, let us continually offer to God a sacrifice of praise, the fruit of lips that confess His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_16","088_13_16","HEB","13","16","16","And do not neglect to do good and to share with others, for with such sacrifices God is pleased. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_17","088_13_17","HEB","13","17","17","Obey your leaders and submit to them, for they watch over your souls as those who must give an account. To this end, allow them to lead with joy and not with grief, for that would be of no advantage to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_18","088_13_18","HEB","13","18","18","Pray for us; we are convinced that we have a clear conscience and desire to live honorably in every way. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_19","088_13_19","HEB","13","19","19","And I especially urge you to pray that I may be restored to you soon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_20","088_13_20","HEB","13","20","20","Now may the God of peace, who through the blood of the eternal covenant brought back from the dead our Lord Jesus, that great Shepherd of the sheep, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_21","088_13_21","HEB","13","21","21","equip you with every good work to do His will. And may He accomplish in you what is pleasing in His sight through Jesus Christ, to whom be glory forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_22","088_13_22","HEB","13","22","22","I urge you, brothers, to bear with my word of exhortation, for I have only written to you briefly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_23","088_13_23","HEB","13","23","23","Be aware that our brother Timothy has been released. If he arrives soon, I will come with him to see you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_24","088_13_24","HEB","13","24","24","Greet all your leaders and all the saints. Those from Italy send you greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("HB13_25","088_13_25","HEB","13","25","25","Grace be with all of you. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_1","089_1_1","JAS","1","1","1","James, a servant of God and of the Lord Jesus Christ, To the twelve tribes of the Dispersion: Greetings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_2","089_1_2","JAS","1","2","2","Consider it pure joy, my brothers, when you encounter trials of many kinds, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_3","089_1_3","JAS","1","3","3","because you know that the testing of your faith develops perseverance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_4","089_1_4","JAS","1","4","4","Allow perseverance to finish its work, so that you may be mature and complete, not lacking anything. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_5","089_1_5","JAS","1","5","5","Now if any of you lacks wisdom, he should ask God, who gives generously to all without finding fault, and it will be given to him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_6","089_1_6","JAS","1","6","6","But he must ask in faith, without doubting, because he who doubts is like a wave of the sea, blown and tossed by the wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_7","089_1_7","JAS","1","7","7","That man should not expect to receive anything from the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_8","089_1_8","JAS","1","8","8","He is a double-minded man, unstable in all his ways. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_9","089_1_9","JAS","1","9","9","The brother in humble circumstances should exult in his high position. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_10","089_1_10","JAS","1","10","10","But the one who is rich should exult in his low position, because he will pass away like a flower of the field. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_11","089_1_11","JAS","1","11","11","For the sun rises with scorching heat and withers the plant; its flower falls and its beauty is lost. So too, the rich man will fade away in the midst of his pursuits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_12","089_1_12","JAS","1","12","12","Blessed is the man who perseveres under trial, because when he has stood the test, he will receive the crown of life that the Lord has promised to those who love Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_13","089_1_13","JAS","1","13","13","When tempted, no one should say, “God is tempting me.” For God cannot be tempted by evil, nor does He tempt anyone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_14","089_1_14","JAS","1","14","14","But each one is tempted when by his own evil desires he is lured away and enticed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_15","089_1_15","JAS","1","15","15","Then after desire has conceived, it gives birth to sin; and sin, when it is full-grown, gives birth to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_16","089_1_16","JAS","1","16","16","Do not be deceived, my beloved brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_17","089_1_17","JAS","1","17","17","Every good and perfect gift is from above, coming down from the Father of the heavenly lights, with whom there is no change or shifting shadow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_18","089_1_18","JAS","1","18","18","He chose to give us birth through the word of truth, that we would be a kind of firstfruits of His creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_19","089_1_19","JAS","1","19","19","So then, my beloved brothers, everyone should be quick to listen, slow to speak, and slow to anger, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_20","089_1_20","JAS","1","20","20","for man’s anger does not bring about the righteousness that God desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_21","089_1_21","JAS","1","21","21","Therefore, get rid of all moral filth and every expression of evil, and humbly accept the word planted in you, which can save your souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_22","089_1_22","JAS","1","22","22","Be doers of the word, and not hearers only. Otherwise, you are deceiving yourselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_23","089_1_23","JAS","1","23","23","For anyone who hears the word but does not carry it out is like a man who looks at his face in a mirror, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_24","089_1_24","JAS","1","24","24","and after observing himself goes away and immediately forgets what he looks like. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_25","089_1_25","JAS","1","25","25","But the one who looks intently into the perfect law of freedom, and continues to do so—not being a forgetful hearer, but an effective doer—he will be blessed in what he does. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_26","089_1_26","JAS","1","26","26","If anyone among you considers himself religious and yet does not bridle his tongue, he deceives his heart and his religion is worthless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM1_27","089_1_27","JAS","1","27","27","Pure and undefiled religion before our God and Father is this: to care for orphans and widows in their distress, and to keep oneself from being polluted by the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_1","089_2_1","JAS","2","1","1","My brothers, as you hold out your faith in our glorious Lord Jesus Christ, do not show favoritism. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_2","089_2_2","JAS","2","2","2","Suppose a man comes into your meeting wearing a gold ring and fine clothes, and a poor man in shabby clothes also comes in. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_3","089_2_3","JAS","2","3","3","If you lavish attention on the man in fine clothes and say, “Here is a seat of honor,” but say to the poor man, “You must stand” or “Sit here under my footstool,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_4","089_2_4","JAS","2","4","4","have you not discriminated among yourselves and become judges with evil thoughts? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_5","089_2_5","JAS","2","5","5","Listen, my beloved brothers: Has not God chosen the poor of this world to be rich in faith and to inherit the kingdom He promised those who love Him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_6","089_2_6","JAS","2","6","6","But you have dishonored the poor. Is it not the rich who oppress you and drag you into court? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_7","089_2_7","JAS","2","7","7","Are they not the ones who blaspheme the noble name by which you have been called? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_8","089_2_8","JAS","2","8","8","If you really fulfill the royal law stated in Scripture, “Love your neighbor as yourself,” you are doing well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_9","089_2_9","JAS","2","9","9","But if you show favoritism, you sin and are convicted by the law as transgressors. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_10","089_2_10","JAS","2","10","10","Whoever keeps the whole law but stumbles at just one point is guilty of breaking all of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_11","089_2_11","JAS","2","11","11","For He who said, “Do not commit adultery,” also said, “Do not murder.” If you do not commit adultery, but do commit murder, you have become a lawbreaker. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_12","089_2_12","JAS","2","12","12","Speak and act as those who are going to be judged by the law that gives freedom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_13","089_2_13","JAS","2","13","13","For judgment without mercy will be shown to anyone who has not been merciful. Mercy triumphs over judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_14","089_2_14","JAS","2","14","14","What good is it, my brothers, if someone claims to have faith, but has no deeds? Can such faith save him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_15","089_2_15","JAS","2","15","15","Suppose a brother or sister is without clothes and daily food. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_16","089_2_16","JAS","2","16","16","If one of you tells him, “Go in peace; stay warm and well fed,” but does not provide for his physical needs, what good is that? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_17","089_2_17","JAS","2","17","17","So too, faith by itself, if it does not result in action, is dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_18","089_2_18","JAS","2","18","18","But someone will say, “You have faith and I have deeds.” Show me your faith apart from your deeds, and I will show you my faith by my deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_19","089_2_19","JAS","2","19","19","You believe that God is one. Good for you! Even the demons believe that—and shudder. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_20","089_2_20","JAS","2","20","20","O foolish man, do you want evidence that faith without deeds is dead? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_21","089_2_21","JAS","2","21","21","Was not our father Abraham justified by what he did when he offered his son Isaac on the altar? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_22","089_2_22","JAS","2","22","22","You see that his faith was working with his actions, and his faith was perfected by what he did. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_23","089_2_23","JAS","2","23","23","And the Scripture was fulfilled that says, “Abraham believed God, and it was credited to him as righteousness,” and he was called a friend of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_24","089_2_24","JAS","2","24","24","As you can see, then, a man is justified by his deeds and not by faith alone. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_25","089_2_25","JAS","2","25","25","In the same way, was not even Rahab the prostitute justified by her actions when she welcomed the spies and sent them off on another route? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM2_26","089_2_26","JAS","2","26","26","For as the body without the spirit is dead, so faith without deeds is dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_1","089_3_1","JAS","3","1","1","Not many of you should become teachers, my brothers, because you know that we who teach will be judged more strictly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_2","089_3_2","JAS","3","2","2","We all stumble in many ways. If anyone is never at fault in what he says, he is a perfect man, able to control his whole body. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_3","089_3_3","JAS","3","3","3","Indeed, when we put bits into the mouths of horses to make them obey us, we can guide the whole animal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_4","089_3_4","JAS","3","4","4","Consider ships as well. Although they are so large and are driven by strong winds, they are steered by a very small rudder wherever the pilot is inclined. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_5","089_3_5","JAS","3","5","5","In the same way, the tongue is a small part of the body, but it boasts of great things. Consider how small a spark sets a great forest ablaze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_6","089_3_6","JAS","3","6","6","The tongue also is a fire, a world of wickedness among the parts of the body. It pollutes the whole person, sets the course of his life on fire, and is itself set on fire by hell. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_7","089_3_7","JAS","3","7","7","All kinds of animals, birds, reptiles, and creatures of the sea are being tamed and have been tamed by man, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_8","089_3_8","JAS","3","8","8","but no man can tame the tongue. It is an unruly evil, full of deadly poison. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_9","089_3_9","JAS","3","9","9","With the tongue we bless our God and Father, and with it we curse men, who have been made in God’s likeness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_10","089_3_10","JAS","3","10","10","Out of the same mouth come blessing and cursing. My brothers, this should not be! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_11","089_3_11","JAS","3","11","11","Can both fresh water and salt water flow from the same spring? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_12","089_3_12","JAS","3","12","12","My brothers, can a fig tree grow olives, or a grapevine bear figs? In the same way, no spring can produce both salt water and fresh water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_13","089_3_13","JAS","3","13","13","Who is wise and understanding among you? Let him show it by his good conduct, by deeds done in the humility that comes from wisdom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_14","089_3_14","JAS","3","14","14","But if you harbor bitter jealousy and selfish ambition in your hearts, do not boast in it or deny the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_15","089_3_15","JAS","3","15","15","Such wisdom does not come from above, but is earthly, unspiritual, demonic. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_16","089_3_16","JAS","3","16","16","For where jealousy and selfish ambition exist, there will be disorder and every evil practice. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_17","089_3_17","JAS","3","17","17","But the wisdom from above is first of all pure, then peace-loving, gentle, accommodating, full of mercy and good fruit, impartial, and sincere. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM3_18","089_3_18","JAS","3","18","18","Peacemakers who sow in peace reap the fruit of righteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_1","089_4_1","JAS","4","1","1","What causes conflicts and quarrels among you? Don’t they come from the passions at war within you? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_2","089_4_2","JAS","4","2","2","You crave what you do not have; you kill and covet, but are unable to obtain it. You quarrel and fight. You do not have, because you do not ask. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_3","089_4_3","JAS","4","3","3","And when you do ask, you do not receive, because you ask with wrong motives, that you may squander it on your pleasures. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_4","089_4_4","JAS","4","4","4","You adulterers and adulteresses! Do you not know that friendship with the world is hostility toward God? Therefore, whoever chooses to be a friend of the world renders himself an enemy of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_5","089_4_5","JAS","4","5","5","Or do you think the Scripture says without reason that the Spirit who dwells in us yearns with envy? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_6","089_4_6","JAS","4","6","6","But He gives us more grace. This is why it says: “God opposes the proud, but gives grace to the humble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_7","089_4_7","JAS","4","7","7","Submit yourselves, then, to God. Resist the devil, and he will flee from you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_8","089_4_8","JAS","4","8","8","Draw near to God, and He will draw near to you. Cleanse your hands, you sinners, and purify your hearts, you double-minded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_9","089_4_9","JAS","4","9","9","Grieve, mourn, and weep. Turn your laughter to mourning, and your joy to gloom. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_10","089_4_10","JAS","4","10","10","Humble yourselves before the Lord, and He will exalt you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_11","089_4_11","JAS","4","11","11","Brothers, do not slander one another. Anyone who speaks against his brother and judges him speaks against the law and judges it. And if you judge the law, you are not a practitioner of the law, but a judge of it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_12","089_4_12","JAS","4","12","12","There is only one Lawgiver, the One who is able to save and destroy. But who are you to judge the other? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_13","089_4_13","JAS","4","13","13","Come now, you who say, “Today and tomorrow let us go to this or that city, spend a year there, carry on business, and make a profit.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_14","089_4_14","JAS","4","14","14","You do not even know what will happen tomorrow! What is your life? You are a mist that appears for a little while and then vanishes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_15","089_4_15","JAS","4","15","15","Instead, you ought to say, “If the Lord is willing, let us live and do this or that.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_16","089_4_16","JAS","4","16","16","As it is, you boast in your proud intentions. All such boasting is evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM4_17","089_4_17","JAS","4","17","17","Anyone, then, who knows the right thing to do, yet fails to do it, is guilty of sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_1","089_5_1","JAS","5","1","1","Come now, you who are rich, weep and wail over the misery to come upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_2","089_5_2","JAS","5","2","2","Your riches have rotted and moths have eaten your clothes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_3","089_5_3","JAS","5","3","3","Your gold and silver are corroded. Their corrosion will testify against you and consume your flesh like fire. You have hoarded treasure in the last days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_4","089_5_4","JAS","5","4","4","Look, the wages you withheld from the workmen who mowed your fields are crying out against you. The cries of the harvesters have reached the ears of the Lord of Hosts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_5","089_5_5","JAS","5","5","5","You have lived on earth in luxury and self-indulgence. You have fattened your hearts as in the day of slaughter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_6","089_5_6","JAS","5","6","6","You have condemned and murdered the righteous, who did not resist you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_7","089_5_7","JAS","5","7","7","Be patient, then, brothers, until the Lord’s coming. See how the farmer awaits the precious fruit of the soil—how patient he is for the fall and spring rains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_8","089_5_8","JAS","5","8","8","You, too, be patient and strengthen your hearts, because the Lord’s coming is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_9","089_5_9","JAS","5","9","9","Do not complain about one another, brothers, so that you will not be judged. Look, the Judge is standing at the door! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_10","089_5_10","JAS","5","10","10","My brothers, as an example of patience in affliction, take the prophets who spoke in the name of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_11","089_5_11","JAS","5","11","11","See how blessed we consider those who have persevered. You have heard of Job’s perseverance and have seen the outcome from the Lord. He is full of compassion and mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_12","089_5_12","JAS","5","12","12","Above all, my brothers, do not swear, not by heaven or earth or by any other oath. Simply let your “Yes” be yes, and your “No,” no, so that you will not fall into hypocrisy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_13","089_5_13","JAS","5","13","13","Is any one of you suffering? He should pray. Is anyone cheerful? He should sing praises. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_14","089_5_14","JAS","5","14","14","Is any one of you sick? He should call the elders of the church to pray over him and anoint him with oil in the name of the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_15","089_5_15","JAS","5","15","15","And the prayer offered in faith will restore the one who is sick. The Lord will raise him up. If he has sinned, he will be forgiven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_16","089_5_16","JAS","5","16","16","Confess your trespasses to each other and pray for each other so that you may be healed. The prayer of a righteous man has great power to prevail. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_17","089_5_17","JAS","5","17","17","Elijah was a man just like us. He prayed earnestly that it would not rain, and it did not rain on the land for three and a half years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_18","089_5_18","JAS","5","18","18","Again he prayed, and the heavens gave rain, and the earth yielded its crops. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_19","089_5_19","JAS","5","19","19","Brothers, if one of you should wander from the truth and someone should bring him back, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JM5_20","089_5_20","JAS","5","20","20","consider this: Whoever turns a sinner from the error of his way will save a soul from death and cover over a multitude of sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_1","090_1_1","1PE","1","1","1","Peter, an apostle of Jesus Christ, To the elect who are exiles of the Dispersion throughout Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia, and Bithynia, chosen ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_2","090_1_2","1PE","1","2","2","according to the foreknowledge of God the Father and sanctified by the Spirit for obedience to Jesus Christ and sprinkling by His blood: Grace and peace be yours in abundance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_3","090_1_3","1PE","1","3","3","Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ! By His great mercy He has given us new birth into a living hope through the resurrection of Jesus Christ from the dead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_4","090_1_4","1PE","1","4","4","and into an inheritance that is imperishable, undefiled, and unfading, reserved in heaven for you, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_5","090_1_5","1PE","1","5","5","who through faith are shielded by God’s power for the salvation that is ready to be revealed in the last time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_6","090_1_6","1PE","1","6","6","In this you greatly rejoice, though now for a little while you may have had to suffer grief in various trials ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_7","090_1_7","1PE","1","7","7","so that the proven character of your faith—more precious than gold, which perishes even though refined by fire—may result in praise, honor, and glory at the revelation of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_8","090_1_8","1PE","1","8","8","Though you have not known Him, you love Him; and though you do not see Him now, you believe in Him and rejoice with an inexpressible and glorious joy, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_9","090_1_9","1PE","1","9","9","now that you are receiving the goal of your faith, the salvation of your souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_10","090_1_10","1PE","1","10","10","Concerning this salvation, the prophets who foretold the grace to come to you searched and investigated carefully, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_11","090_1_11","1PE","1","11","11","trying to determine the time and setting to which the Spirit of Christ in them was pointing when He predicted the sufferings of Christ and the glories to follow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_12","090_1_12","1PE","1","12","12","It was revealed to them that they were not serving themselves, but you, when they foretold the things now announced by those who preached the gospel to you by the Holy Spirit sent from heaven. Even angels long to look into these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_13","090_1_13","1PE","1","13","13","Therefore prepare your minds for action. Be sober-minded. Set your hope fully on the grace to be given you at the revelation of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_14","090_1_14","1PE","1","14","14","As obedient children, do not conform to the passions of your former ignorance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_15","090_1_15","1PE","1","15","15","But just as He who called you is holy, so be holy in all you do, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_16","090_1_16","1PE","1","16","16","for it is written: “Be holy, because I am holy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_17","090_1_17","1PE","1","17","17","Since you call on a Father who judges each one’s work impartially, conduct yourselves in reverent fear during your stay as foreigners. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_18","090_1_18","1PE","1","18","18","For you know that it was not with perishable things such as silver or gold that you were redeemed from the empty way of life you inherited from your forefathers, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_19","090_1_19","1PE","1","19","19","but with the precious blood of Christ, a lamb without blemish or spot. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_20","090_1_20","1PE","1","20","20","He was known before the foundation of the world, but was revealed in the last times for your sake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_21","090_1_21","1PE","1","21","21","Through Him you believe in God, who raised Him from the dead and glorified Him; and so your faith and hope are in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_22","090_1_22","1PE","1","22","22","Since you have purified your souls by obedience to the truth through the Spirit so that you have a genuine love for your brothers, love one another deeply, from a pure heart. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_23","090_1_23","1PE","1","23","23","For you have been born again, not of perishable seed, but of imperishable, through the living and forever enduring word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_24","090_1_24","1PE","1","24","24","For, “All flesh is like grass, and all the glory of man like the flowers of the field; the grass withers and the flowers fall, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P11_25","090_1_25","1PE","1","25","25","but the word of the Lord stands forever.” And this is the word that was proclaimed to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_1","090_2_1","1PE","2","1","1","Rid yourselves, therefore, of all malice, deceit, hypocrisy, envy, and slander. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_2","090_2_2","1PE","2","2","2","Like newborn babies, crave pure spiritual milk, so that by it you may grow, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_3","090_2_3","1PE","2","3","3","if indeed you have tasted that the Lord is good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_4","090_2_4","1PE","2","4","4","As you come to Him, the living stone, rejected by men but chosen and precious in God’s sight, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_5","090_2_5","1PE","2","5","5","you also, like living stones, are being built into a spiritual house, a holy priesthood, offering spiritual sacrifices acceptable to God through Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_6","090_2_6","1PE","2","6","6","For it stands in Scripture: “See, I lay in Zion a stone, a chosen and precious cornerstone; and the one who believes in Him will never be put to shame.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_7","090_2_7","1PE","2","7","7","To you who believe, then, this stone is precious. But to those who are disobedient, “The stone the builders rejected has become the cornerstone,” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_8","090_2_8","1PE","2","8","8","and, “A stone of stumbling and a rock of offense.” They stumble because they disobey the word—and to this they were appointed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_9","090_2_9","1PE","2","9","9","But you are a chosen people, a royal priesthood, a holy nation, a people for God’s own possession, to proclaim the virtues of Him who called you out of darkness into His marvelous light. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_10","090_2_10","1PE","2","10","10","Once you were not a people, but now you are the people of God; once you had not received mercy, but now you have received mercy. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_11","090_2_11","1PE","2","11","11","Beloved, I urge you, as foreigners and exiles, to abstain from the desires of the flesh, which war against your soul. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_12","090_2_12","1PE","2","12","12","Conduct yourselves with such honor among the Gentiles that, though they slander you as evildoers, they may see your good deeds and glorify God on the day He visits us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_13","090_2_13","1PE","2","13","13","Therefore submit yourselves for the Lord’s sake to every human institution, whether to the king as the supreme authority, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_14","090_2_14","1PE","2","14","14","or to governors as those sent by him to punish those who do wrong and to praise those who do right. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_15","090_2_15","1PE","2","15","15","For it is God’s will that by doing good you should silence the ignorance of foolish men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_16","090_2_16","1PE","2","16","16","Live in freedom, but do not use your freedom as a cover-up for evil; live as servants of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_17","090_2_17","1PE","2","17","17","Treat everyone with high regard: Love the brotherhood of believers, fear God, honor the king. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_18","090_2_18","1PE","2","18","18","Servants, submit yourselves to your masters with all respect, not only to those who are good and gentle, but even to those who are unreasonable. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_19","090_2_19","1PE","2","19","19","For if anyone endures the pain of unjust suffering because he is conscious of God, this is to be commended. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_20","090_2_20","1PE","2","20","20","How is it to your credit if you are beaten for doing wrong and you endure it? But if you suffer for doing good and you endure it, this is commendable before God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_21","090_2_21","1PE","2","21","21","For to this you were called, because Christ also suffered for us, leaving you an example, that you should follow in His footsteps: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_22","090_2_22","1PE","2","22","22","“He committed no sin, and no deceit was found in His mouth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_23","090_2_23","1PE","2","23","23","When they heaped abuse on Him, He did not retaliate; when He suffered, He made no threats, but entrusted Himself to Him who judges justly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_24","090_2_24","1PE","2","24","24","He Himself bore our sins in His body on the tree, so that we might die to sin and live to righteousness. “By His stripes you are healed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P12_25","090_2_25","1PE","2","25","25","For “you were like sheep going astray,” but now you have returned to the Shepherd and Overseer of your souls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_1","090_3_1","1PE","3","1","1","Wives, in the same way, submit yourselves to your husbands, so that even if they refuse to believe the word, they will be won over without words by the behavior of their wives ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_2","090_3_2","1PE","3","2","2","when they see your pure and reverent demeanor. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_3","090_3_3","1PE","3","3","3","Your beauty should not come from outward adornment, such as braided hair or gold jewelry or fine clothes, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_4","090_3_4","1PE","3","4","4","but from the inner disposition of your heart, the unfading beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is precious in God’s sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_5","090_3_5","1PE","3","5","5","For this is how the holy women of the past adorned themselves. They put their hope in God and were submissive to their husbands, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_6","090_3_6","1PE","3","6","6","just as Sarah obeyed Abraham and called him lord. And you are her children if you do what is right and refuse to give way to fear. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_7","090_3_7","1PE","3","7","7","Husbands, in the same way, dwell with your wives in an understanding manner. Treat them with honor as a delicate vessel and as fellow heirs of the gracious gift of life, so that your prayers will not be hindered. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_8","090_3_8","1PE","3","8","8","Finally, all of you, be like-minded and sympathetic, love as brothers, be tenderhearted and courteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_9","090_3_9","1PE","3","9","9","Do not repay evil with evil or insult with insult, but with blessing, knowing that to this you were called so that you may inherit a blessing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_10","090_3_10","1PE","3","10","10","For, “Whoever would love life and see good days must keep his tongue from evil and his lips from deceitful speech. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_11","090_3_11","1PE","3","11","11","He must turn from evil and do good; he must seek peace and pursue it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_12","090_3_12","1PE","3","12","12","For the eyes of the Lord are on the righteous, and His ears are inclined to their prayer. But the face of the Lord is against those who do evil.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_13","090_3_13","1PE","3","13","13","Who can harm you if you are imitators of what is good? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_14","090_3_14","1PE","3","14","14","But even if you should suffer for what is right, you are blessed. “Do not fear what they fear; do not be shaken.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_15","090_3_15","1PE","3","15","15","But in your hearts sanctify the Lord God. Always be prepared to give a defense to everyone who asks you the reason for the hope that is in you. But respond with gentleness and respect, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_16","090_3_16","1PE","3","16","16","keeping a clear conscience, so that those who slander you as evildoers may be put to shame by your good behavior in Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_17","090_3_17","1PE","3","17","17","For it is better, if it is God’s will, to suffer for doing good than for doing evil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_18","090_3_18","1PE","3","18","18","For Christ also suffered for sins once for all, the righteous for the unrighteous, to bring you to God. He was put to death in the body but made alive in the Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_19","090_3_19","1PE","3","19","19","in whom He also went and preached to the spirits in prison ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_20","090_3_20","1PE","3","20","20","who disobeyed long ago when God waited patiently in the days of Noah while the ark was being built. In the ark a few people, only eight souls, were saved through water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_21","090_3_21","1PE","3","21","21","And this water symbolizes the baptism that now saves us also—not the removal of dirt from the body, but the pledge of a clear conscience toward God—through the resurrection of Jesus Christ, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P13_22","090_3_22","1PE","3","22","22","who has gone into heaven and is at the right hand of God, with angels, authorities, and powers subject to Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_1","090_4_1","1PE","4","1","1","Therefore, since Christ suffered for us in His body, arm yourselves with the same resolve, because anyone who has suffered in his body is done with sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_2","090_4_2","1PE","4","2","2","Consequently, he does not live out his remaining time on earth for human passions, but for the will of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_3","090_4_3","1PE","4","3","3","For we have spent enough of our past lifetime carrying out the same desires as the Gentiles: living in debauchery, lust, drunkenness, orgies, carousing, and detestable idolatry. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_4","090_4_4","1PE","4","4","4","Because of this, they consider it strange of you not to plunge with them into the same flood of reckless indiscretion, and they heap abuse on you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_5","090_4_5","1PE","4","5","5","But they will have to give an account to Him who is ready to judge the living and the dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_6","090_4_6","1PE","4","6","6","That is why the gospel was preached even to those who are now dead, so that they might be judged as men in the flesh, but live according to God in the spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_7","090_4_7","1PE","4","7","7","The end of all things is near. Therefore be clear-minded and sober, so that you can pray. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_8","090_4_8","1PE","4","8","8","Above all, love one another deeply, because love will cover over a multitude of sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_9","090_4_9","1PE","4","9","9","Show hospitality to one another without complaining. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_10","090_4_10","1PE","4","10","10","As good stewards of the manifold grace of God, each of you should use whatever gift he has received to serve one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_11","090_4_11","1PE","4","11","11","If anyone speaks, he should speak as one conveying the words of God. If anyone serves, he should serve with the strength God provides, so that in all things God may be glorified through Jesus Christ, to whom be the glory and the power forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_12","090_4_12","1PE","4","12","12","Beloved, do not be surprised at the fiery trial that has come upon you, as though something strange were happening to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_13","090_4_13","1PE","4","13","13","But rejoice that you share in the sufferings of Christ, so that you may be overjoyed at the revelation of His glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_14","090_4_14","1PE","4","14","14","If you are insulted for the name of Christ, you are blessed, because the Spirit of glory and of God rests on you. Indeed, on their part He is blasphemed, but on your part He is glorified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_15","090_4_15","1PE","4","15","15","Indeed, none of you should suffer as a murderer or thief or wrongdoer, or even as a meddler. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_16","090_4_16","1PE","4","16","16","But if you suffer as a Christian, do not be ashamed, but glorify God in this matter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_17","090_4_17","1PE","4","17","17","For it is time for judgment to begin with the family of God; and if it begins with us, what will the outcome be for those who disobey the gospel of God? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_18","090_4_18","1PE","4","18","18","And, “If it is hard for the righteous to be saved, what will become of the ungodly and the sinner?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P14_19","090_4_19","1PE","4","19","19","So then, those who suffer according to God’s will should entrust their souls to their faithful Creator and continue to do good. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_1","090_5_1","1PE","5","1","1","As a fellow elder, a witness of Christ’s sufferings, and a partaker of the glory to be revealed, I appeal to the elders among you: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_2","090_5_2","1PE","5","2","2","Be shepherds of God’s flock that is among you, watching over them not out of compulsion, but willingly; not out of greed, but out of eagerness; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_3","090_5_3","1PE","5","3","3","not lording it over those entrusted to you, but being examples to the flock. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_4","090_5_4","1PE","5","4","4","And when the Chief Shepherd appears, you will receive the crown of glory that will never fade away. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_5","090_5_5","1PE","5","5","5","Young men, in the same way, submit yourselves to your elders. And all of you, clothe yourselves with humility, being subject to one another, because, “God opposes the proud, but gives grace to the humble.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_6","090_5_6","1PE","5","6","6","Humble yourselves, therefore, under God’s mighty hand, so that in due time He may exalt you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_7","090_5_7","1PE","5","7","7","Cast all your anxiety on Him, because He cares for you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_8","090_5_8","1PE","5","8","8","Be sober-minded and alert. Your adversary the devil prowls around like a roaring lion, seeking someone to devour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_9","090_5_9","1PE","5","9","9","Resist him, standing firm in your faith and in the knowledge that your brothers throughout the world are undergoing the same kinds of suffering. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_10","090_5_10","1PE","5","10","10","And after you have suffered for a little while, the God of all grace, who has called you to His eternal glory in Christ Jesus, will Himself restore you, secure you, strengthen you, and establish you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_11","090_5_11","1PE","5","11","11","To Him be the glory and the power forever and ever. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_12","090_5_12","1PE","5","12","12","Through Silvanus, whom I regard as a faithful brother, I have written to you briefly, encouraging you and testifying that this is the true grace of God. Stand firm in it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_13","090_5_13","1PE","5","13","13","The church in Babylon, chosen together with you, sends you greetings, as does my son Mark. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P15_14","090_5_14","1PE","5","14","14","Greet one another with a kiss of love. Peace to all of you who are in Christ Jesus. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_1","091_1_1","2PE","1","1","1","Simon Peter, a servant and apostle of Jesus Christ, To those who through the righteousness of our God and Savior Jesus Christ have received a faith as precious as ours: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_2","091_1_2","2PE","1","2","2","Grace and peace be multiplied to you through the knowledge of God and of Jesus our Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_3","091_1_3","2PE","1","3","3","His divine power has given us everything we need for life and godliness through the knowledge of Him who called us by His own glory and excellence. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_4","091_1_4","2PE","1","4","4","Through these He has given us His precious and magnificent promises, so that through them you may become partakers of the divine nature, now that you have escaped the corruption in the world caused by evil desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_5","091_1_5","2PE","1","5","5","For this very reason, make every effort to add to your faith virtue; and to virtue, knowledge; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_6","091_1_6","2PE","1","6","6","and to knowledge, self-control; and to self-control, perseverance; and to perseverance, godliness; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_7","091_1_7","2PE","1","7","7","and to godliness, brotherly kindness; and to brotherly kindness, love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_8","091_1_8","2PE","1","8","8","For if you possess these qualities and continue to grow in them, they will keep you from being ineffective and unproductive in your knowledge of our Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_9","091_1_9","2PE","1","9","9","But whoever lacks these traits is nearsighted to the point of blindness, having forgotten that he has been cleansed from his past sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_10","091_1_10","2PE","1","10","10","Therefore, brothers, strive to make your calling and election sure. For if you practice these things you will never stumble, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_11","091_1_11","2PE","1","11","11","and you will receive a lavish reception into the eternal kingdom of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_12","091_1_12","2PE","1","12","12","Therefore I will not neglect to remind you of these things, even though you know them and are established in the truth you now have. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_13","091_1_13","2PE","1","13","13","I think it is right to refresh your memory as long as I live in the tent of my body, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_14","091_1_14","2PE","1","14","14","because I know that this tent will soon be laid aside, as our Lord Jesus Christ has made clear to me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_15","091_1_15","2PE","1","15","15","And I will make every effort to ensure that after my departure, you will be able to recall these things at all times. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_16","091_1_16","2PE","1","16","16","For we did not follow cleverly devised fables when we made known to you the power and coming of our Lord Jesus Christ, but we were eyewitnesses of His majesty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_17","091_1_17","2PE","1","17","17","For He received honor and glory from God the Father when the voice came to Him from the Majestic Glory, saying, “This is My beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_18","091_1_18","2PE","1","18","18","And we ourselves heard this voice from heaven when we were with Him on the holy mountain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_19","091_1_19","2PE","1","19","19","We also have the word of the prophets as confirmed beyond doubt. And you will do well to pay attention to it, as to a lamp shining in a dark place, until the day dawns and the morning star rises in your hearts. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_20","091_1_20","2PE","1","20","20","Above all, you must understand that no prophecy of Scripture comes from one’s own interpretation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P21_21","091_1_21","2PE","1","21","21","For no such prophecy was ever brought forth by the will of man, but holy men spoke from God as they were carried along by the Holy Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_1","091_2_1","2PE","2","1","1","Now there were also false prophets among the people, just as there will be false teachers among you. They will secretly introduce destructive heresies, even denying the Master who bought them—bringing swift destruction on themselves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_2","091_2_2","2PE","2","2","2","Many will follow in their depravity, and because of them the way of truth will be defamed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_3","091_2_3","2PE","2","3","3","In their greed, these false teachers will exploit you with deceptive words. The longstanding verdict against them remains in force, and their destruction will not sleep. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_4","091_2_4","2PE","2","4","4","For if God did not spare the angels when they sinned, but cast them deep into hell, placing them in chains of darkness to be held for judgment; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_5","091_2_5","2PE","2","5","5","if He did not spare the ancient world when He brought the flood on its ungodly people, but preserved Noah, a preacher of righteousness, among the eight; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_6","091_2_6","2PE","2","6","6","if He condemned the cities of Sodom and Gomorrah to destruction, reducing them to ashes as an example of what is coming on the ungodly; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_7","091_2_7","2PE","2","7","7","and if He rescued Lot, a righteous man distressed by the depraved conduct of the lawless ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_8","091_2_8","2PE","2","8","8","(for that righteous man, living among them day after day, was tormented in his righteous soul by the lawless deeds he saw and heard)— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_9","091_2_9","2PE","2","9","9","if all this is so, then the Lord knows how to rescue the godly from trials and to hold the unrighteous for punishment on the day of judgment. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_10","091_2_10","2PE","2","10","10","Such punishment is specially reserved for those who indulge the corrupt desires of the flesh and despise authority. Bold and self-willed, they are unafraid to slander glorious beings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_11","091_2_11","2PE","2","11","11","Yet not even angels, though greater in strength and power, dare to bring such slanderous charges against them before the Lord. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_12","091_2_12","2PE","2","12","12","These men are like irrational animals, creatures of instinct, born to be captured and destroyed. They blaspheme in matters they do not understand, and like such creatures, they will be destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_13","091_2_13","2PE","2","13","13","They will receive the wages of their wickedness. They consider it a pleasure to carouse in broad daylight. They are blots and blemishes, reveling in their deception as they feast with you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_14","091_2_14","2PE","2","14","14","Their eyes are full of adultery; their desire for sin is never satisfied; they seduce the unstable. They are accursed children with hearts trained in greed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_15","091_2_15","2PE","2","15","15","They have left the straight way and wandered off to follow the way of Balaam son of Bosor, who loved the wages of wickedness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_16","091_2_16","2PE","2","16","16","But he was rebuked for his transgression by a donkey, otherwise without speech, that spoke with a man’s voice and restrained the prophet’s madness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_17","091_2_17","2PE","2","17","17","These men are springs without water and clouds driven by a storm. Blackest darkness is forever reserved for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_18","091_2_18","2PE","2","18","18","With lofty but empty words, they appeal to the sensual passions of the flesh and entice those who have truly escaped from others who live in error. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_19","091_2_19","2PE","2","19","19","They promise them freedom, while they themselves are slaves to depravity. For a man is a slave to whatever has mastered him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_20","091_2_20","2PE","2","20","20","If indeed they have escaped the corruption of the world through the knowledge of the Lord and Savior Jesus Christ, only to be entangled and overcome by it again, their final condition is worse than it was at first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_21","091_2_21","2PE","2","21","21","It would have been better for them not to have known the way of righteousness than to have known it and then to turn away from the holy commandment passed on to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P22_22","091_2_22","2PE","2","22","22","Of them the proverbs are true: “A dog returns to its vomit,” and, “A sow that is washed goes back to her wallowing in the mud.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_1","091_3_1","2PE","3","1","1","Beloved, this is now my second letter to you. Both of them are reminders to stir you to wholesome thinking ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_2","091_3_2","2PE","3","2","2","by recalling what was foretold by the holy prophets and commanded by our Lord and Savior through your apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_3","091_3_3","2PE","3","3","3","Most importantly, you must understand that in the last days scoffers will come, following their own evil desires. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_4","091_3_4","2PE","3","4","4","“Where is the promise of His coming?” they will ask. “Ever since our fathers fell asleep, everything continues as it has from the beginning of creation.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_5","091_3_5","2PE","3","5","5","But they deliberately overlook the fact that long ago by God’s word the heavens existed and the earth was formed out of water and by water, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_6","091_3_6","2PE","3","6","6","through which the world of that time perished in the flood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_7","091_3_7","2PE","3","7","7","And by His word, the present heavens and earth are reserved for fire, being kept for the day of judgment and destruction of ungodly men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_8","091_3_8","2PE","3","8","8","Beloved, do not let this one thing escape your notice: With the Lord a day is like a thousand years, and a thousand years are like a day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_9","091_3_9","2PE","3","9","9","The Lord is not slow in keeping His promise as some understand slowness, but is patient with us, not wanting anyone to perish but everyone to come to repentance. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_10","091_3_10","2PE","3","10","10","But the Day of the Lord will come like a thief in the night. The heavens will disappear with a roar, the elements will be destroyed by fire, and the earth and its works will be burned up. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_11","091_3_11","2PE","3","11","11","Since everything will be destroyed, then, what kind of people ought you to be? You ought to conduct yourselves in holiness and godliness ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_12","091_3_12","2PE","3","12","12","as you anticipate and hasten the coming of the day of God, when the heavens will be destroyed by fire and the elements will melt in the heat. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_13","091_3_13","2PE","3","13","13","But in keeping with God’s promise, we are looking forward to a new heaven and a new earth, where righteousness dwells. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_14","091_3_14","2PE","3","14","14","Therefore, beloved, as you anticipate these things, make every effort to be found at peace—spotless and blameless in His sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_15","091_3_15","2PE","3","15","15","Consider also that our Lord’s patience brings salvation, just as our beloved brother Paul also wrote you with the wisdom God gave him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_16","091_3_16","2PE","3","16","16","He writes this way in all his letters, speaking in them about such matters. Some parts of his letters are hard to understand, which ignorant and unstable people distort, as they do the rest of the Scriptures, to their own destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_17","091_3_17","2PE","3","17","17","Therefore, beloved, since you already know these things, be on your guard so that you will not be carried away by the error of the lawless and fall from your secure standing. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("P23_18","091_3_18","2PE","3","18","18","But grow in the grace and knowledge of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. To Him be the glory both now and to the day of eternity. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_1","092_1_1","1JN","1","1","1","That which was from the beginning, which we have heard, which we have seen with our own eyes, which we have gazed upon and touched with our own hands—this is the Word of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_2","092_1_2","1JN","1","2","2","And this is the life that was revealed; we have seen it and testified to it, and we proclaim to you the eternal life that was with the Father and was revealed to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_3","092_1_3","1JN","1","3","3","We proclaim to you what we have seen and heard, so that you also may have fellowship with us. And this fellowship of ours is with the Father and with His Son, Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_4","092_1_4","1JN","1","4","4","We write these things to you so that our joy may be complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_5","092_1_5","1JN","1","5","5","And this is the message we have heard from Him and announce to you: God is light, and in Him there is no darkness at all. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_6","092_1_6","1JN","1","6","6","If we say we have fellowship with Him yet walk in the darkness, we lie and do not practice the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_7","092_1_7","1JN","1","7","7","But if we walk in the light as He is in the light, we have fellowship with one another, and the blood of Jesus Christ His Son cleanses us from all sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_8","092_1_8","1JN","1","8","8","If we say we have no sin, we deceive ourselves, and the truth is not in us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_9","092_1_9","1JN","1","9","9","If we confess our sins, He is faithful and just to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all unrighteousness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J11_10","092_1_10","1JN","1","10","10","If we say we have not sinned, we make Him out to be a liar, and His word is not in us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_1","092_2_1","1JN","2","1","1","My little children, I am writing these things to you so that you will not sin. But if anyone does sin, we have an advocate before the Father—Jesus Christ, the Righteous One. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_2","092_2_2","1JN","2","2","2","He Himself is the atoning sacrifice for our sins, and not only for ours but also for the sins of the whole world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_3","092_2_3","1JN","2","3","3","By this we can be sure that we have come to know Him: if we keep His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_4","092_2_4","1JN","2","4","4","If anyone says, “I know Him,” but does not keep His commandments, he is a liar, and the truth is not in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_5","092_2_5","1JN","2","5","5","But if anyone keeps His word, the love of God has been truly perfected in him. By this we know that we are in Him: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_6","092_2_6","1JN","2","6","6","Whoever claims to abide in Him must walk as Jesus walked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_7","092_2_7","1JN","2","7","7","Brothers, I am not writing to you a new commandment, but an old one, which you have had from the beginning. This commandment is the message you have heard from the beginning. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_8","092_2_8","1JN","2","8","8","Then again, I am also writing to you a new commandment, which is true in Him and also in you. For the darkness is fading and the true light is already shining. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_9","092_2_9","1JN","2","9","9","If anyone claims to be in the light but hates his brother, he is still in the darkness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_10","092_2_10","1JN","2","10","10","Whoever loves his brother remains in the light, and there is no cause of stumbling in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_11","092_2_11","1JN","2","11","11","But whoever hates his brother is in the darkness and walks in the darkness. He does not know where he is going, because the darkness has blinded his eyes. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_12","092_2_12","1JN","2","12","12","I am writing to you, little children, because your sins have been forgiven through His name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_13","092_2_13","1JN","2","13","13","I am writing to you, fathers, because you know Him who is from the beginning. I am writing to you, young men, because you have overcome the evil one. I am writing to you, children, because you know the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_14","092_2_14","1JN","2","14","14","I have written to you, fathers, because you know Him who is from the beginning. I have written to you, young men, because you are strong, and the word of God abides in you, and you have overcome the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_15","092_2_15","1JN","2","15","15","Do not love the world or anything in the world. If anyone loves the world, the love of the Father is not in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_16","092_2_16","1JN","2","16","16","For all that is in the world—the desires of the flesh, the desires of the eyes, and the pride of life—is not from the Father but from the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_17","092_2_17","1JN","2","17","17","The world is passing away, along with its desires; but whoever does the will of God remains forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_18","092_2_18","1JN","2","18","18","Children, it is the last hour; and just as you have heard that the antichrist is coming, so now many antichrists have appeared. This is how we know it is the last hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_19","092_2_19","1JN","2","19","19","They went out from us, but they did not belong to us. For if they had belonged to us, they would have remained with us. But their departure made it clear that none of them belonged to us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_20","092_2_20","1JN","2","20","20","You, however, have an anointing from the Holy One, and you know all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_21","092_2_21","1JN","2","21","21","I have not written to you because you lack knowledge of the truth, but because you have it, and because no lie comes from the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_22","092_2_22","1JN","2","22","22","Who is the liar, if it is not the one who denies that Jesus is the Christ? This is the antichrist, who denies the Father and the Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_23","092_2_23","1JN","2","23","23","Whoever denies the Son does not have the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_24","092_2_24","1JN","2","24","24","As for you, then, let what you have heard from the beginning remain in you. If it does, you will also remain in the Son and in the Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_25","092_2_25","1JN","2","25","25","And this is the promise that He Himself made to us: eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_26","092_2_26","1JN","2","26","26","I have written these things to you about those who are trying to deceive you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_27","092_2_27","1JN","2","27","27","And as for you, the anointing you received from Him remains in you, and you do not need anyone to teach you. But just as the same true and genuine anointing teaches you about all things, so you must remain in Him as you have been taught. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_28","092_2_28","1JN","2","28","28","And now, little children, remain in Christ, so that when He appears, we may be confident and unashamed before Him at His coming. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J12_29","092_2_29","1JN","2","29","29","If you know that He is righteous, you also know that everyone who practices righteousness has been born of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_1","092_3_1","1JN","3","1","1","Behold what manner of love the Father has given to us, that we should be called children of God. The reason the world does not know us is that it did not know Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_2","092_3_2","1JN","3","2","2","Beloved, we are now children of God, and what we will be has not yet been revealed. We know that when Christ appears, we will be like Him, for we will see Him as He is. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_3","092_3_3","1JN","3","3","3","And everyone who has this hope in Him purifies himself, just as Christ is pure. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_4","092_3_4","1JN","3","4","4","Everyone who practices sin practices lawlessness as well. Indeed, sin is lawlessness. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_5","092_3_5","1JN","3","5","5","But you know that Christ appeared to take away our sins, and in Him there is no sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_6","092_3_6","1JN","3","6","6","No one who remains in Him keeps on sinning. No one who continues to sin has seen Him or known Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_7","092_3_7","1JN","3","7","7","Little children, let no one deceive you: The one who practices righteousness is righteous, just as Christ is righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_8","092_3_8","1JN","3","8","8","The one who practices sin is of the devil, because the devil has been sinning from the very start. This is why the Son of God was revealed, to destroy the works of the devil. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_9","092_3_9","1JN","3","9","9","Anyone born of God refuses to practice sin, because God’s seed abides in him; he cannot go on sinning, because he has been born of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_10","092_3_10","1JN","3","10","10","By this the children of God are distinguished from the children of the devil: Anyone who does not practice righteousness is not of God, nor is anyone who does not love his brother. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_11","092_3_11","1JN","3","11","11","This is the message you have heard from the beginning: We should love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_12","092_3_12","1JN","3","12","12","Do not be like Cain, who belonged to the evil one and murdered his brother. And why did Cain slay him? Because his own deeds were evil, while those of his brother were righteous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_13","092_3_13","1JN","3","13","13","So do not be surprised, my brothers, if the world hates you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_14","092_3_14","1JN","3","14","14","We know that we have passed from death to life, because we love our brothers. The one who does not love his brother remains in death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_15","092_3_15","1JN","3","15","15","Everyone who hates his brother is a murderer, and you know that eternal life does not reside in a murderer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_16","092_3_16","1JN","3","16","16","By this we know what love is: Jesus laid down His life for us, and we ought to lay down our lives for our brothers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_17","092_3_17","1JN","3","17","17","If anyone with earthly possessions sees his brother in need, but withholds his compassion from him, how can the love of God abide in him? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_18","092_3_18","1JN","3","18","18","My little children, let us love not in word and speech, but in action and truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_19","092_3_19","1JN","3","19","19","And by this we know that we belong to the truth, and assure our hearts in His presence: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_20","092_3_20","1JN","3","20","20","Even if our hearts condemn us, God is greater than our hearts, and He knows all things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_21","092_3_21","1JN","3","21","21","Beloved, if our hearts do not condemn us, we have confidence before God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_22","092_3_22","1JN","3","22","22","and we will receive from Him whatever we ask, because we keep His commandments and do what is pleasing in His sight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_23","092_3_23","1JN","3","23","23","And this is His commandment: that we should believe in the name of His Son, Jesus Christ, and we should love one another just as He commanded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J13_24","092_3_24","1JN","3","24","24","Whoever keeps His commandments remains in God, and God in him. And by this we know that He remains in us: by the Spirit He has given us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_1","092_4_1","1JN","4","1","1","Beloved, do not believe every spirit, but test the spirits to see whether they are from God. For many false prophets have gone out into the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_2","092_4_2","1JN","4","2","2","By this you will know the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesses that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is from God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_3","092_4_3","1JN","4","3","3","and every spirit that does not confess that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is not from God. This is the spirit of the antichrist, which you have heard is coming and which is already in the world at this time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_4","092_4_4","1JN","4","4","4","You, little children, are from God and have overcome them, because greater is He who is in you than he who is in the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_5","092_4_5","1JN","4","5","5","They are of the world. That is why they speak from the world’s perspective, and the world listens to them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_6","092_4_6","1JN","4","6","6","We are from God. Whoever knows God listens to us; whoever is not from God does not listen to us. That is how we know the Spirit of truth and the spirit of deception. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_7","092_4_7","1JN","4","7","7","Beloved, let us love one another, because love comes from God. Everyone who loves has been born of God and knows God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_8","092_4_8","1JN","4","8","8","Whoever does not love does not know God, because God is love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_9","092_4_9","1JN","4","9","9","This is how God’s love was revealed among us: God sent His one and only Son into the world, so that we might live through Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_10","092_4_10","1JN","4","10","10","And love consists in this: not that we loved God, but that He loved us and sent His Son as the atoning sacrifice for our sins. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_11","092_4_11","1JN","4","11","11","Beloved, if God so loved us, we also ought to love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_12","092_4_12","1JN","4","12","12","No one has ever seen God; but if we love one another, God remains in us, and His love is perfected in us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_13","092_4_13","1JN","4","13","13","By this we know that we remain in Him, and He in us: He has given us of His Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_14","092_4_14","1JN","4","14","14","And we have seen and testify that the Father has sent His Son to be the Savior of the world. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_15","092_4_15","1JN","4","15","15","If anyone confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God abides in him, and he in God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_16","092_4_16","1JN","4","16","16","And we have come to know and believe the love that God has for us. God is love; whoever abides in love abides in God, and God in him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_17","092_4_17","1JN","4","17","17","In this way, love has been perfected among us, so that we may have confidence on the day of judgment; for in this world we are just like Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_18","092_4_18","1JN","4","18","18","There is no fear in love, but perfect love drives out fear, because fear involves punishment. The one who fears has not been perfected in love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_19","092_4_19","1JN","4","19","19","We love Him because He first loved us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_20","092_4_20","1JN","4","20","20","If anyone says, “I love God,” but hates his brother, he is a liar. For anyone who does not love his brother, whom he has seen, how can he love God, whom he has not seen? ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J14_21","092_4_21","1JN","4","21","21","And we have this commandment from Him: Whoever loves God must love his brother as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_1","092_5_1","1JN","5","1","1","Everyone who believes that Jesus is the Christ has been born of God, and everyone who loves the Father also loves those born of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_2","092_5_2","1JN","5","2","2","By this we know that we love the children of God: when we love God and keep His commandments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_3","092_5_3","1JN","5","3","3","For this is the love of God, that we keep His commandments. And His commandments are not burdensome, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_4","092_5_4","1JN","5","4","4","because everyone born of God overcomes the world. And this is the victory that has overcome the world: our faith. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_5","092_5_5","1JN","5","5","5","Who then overcomes the world? Only he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_6","092_5_6","1JN","5","6","6","This is the One who came by water and blood, Jesus Christ—not by water alone, but by water and blood. And it is the Spirit who testifies to this, because the Spirit is the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_7","092_5_7","1JN","5","7","7","For there are three that testify: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_8","092_5_8","1JN","5","8","8","the Spirit, the water, and the blood—and these three are in agreement. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_9","092_5_9","1JN","5","9","9","Even if we accept human testimony, the testimony of God is greater. For this is the testimony that God has given about His Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_10","092_5_10","1JN","5","10","10","Whoever believes in the Son of God has this testimony within him; whoever does not believe God has made Him out to be a liar, because he has not believed in the testimony that God has given about His Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_11","092_5_11","1JN","5","11","11","And this is that testimony: God has given us eternal life, and this life is in His Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_12","092_5_12","1JN","5","12","12","Whoever has the Son has life; whoever does not have the Son of God does not have life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_13","092_5_13","1JN","5","13","13","I have written these things to you who believe in the name of the Son of God, so that you may know that you have eternal life and that you may believe in the name of the Son of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_14","092_5_14","1JN","5","14","14","And this is the confidence that we have before Him: If we ask anything according to His will, He hears us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_15","092_5_15","1JN","5","15","15","And if we know that He hears us in whatever we ask, we know that we already possess what we have asked of Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_16","092_5_16","1JN","5","16","16","If anyone sees his brother committing a sin not leading to death, he should ask God, who will give life to those who commit this kind of sin. There is a sin that leads to death; I am not saying he should ask regarding that sin. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_17","092_5_17","1JN","5","17","17","All unrighteousness is sin, yet there is sin that does not lead to death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_18","092_5_18","1JN","5","18","18","We know that anyone born of God does not keep on sinning; the one who was born of God protects himself, and the evil one cannot touch him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_19","092_5_19","1JN","5","19","19","We know that we are of God, and that the whole world is under the power of the evil one. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_20","092_5_20","1JN","5","20","20","And we know that the Son of God has come and has given us understanding, so that we may know Him who is true; and we are in Him who is true—in His Son Jesus Christ. He is the true God and eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J15_21","092_5_21","1JN","5","21","21","Little children, keep yourselves from idols. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_1","093_1_1","2JN","1","1","1","The elder, To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_2","093_1_2","2JN","1","2","2","because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_3","093_1_3","2JN","1","3","3","Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_4","093_1_4","2JN","1","4","4","I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_5","093_1_5","2JN","1","5","5","And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_6","093_1_6","2JN","1","6","6","And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_7","093_1_7","2JN","1","7","7","For many deceivers have entered into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_8","093_1_8","2JN","1","8","8","Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for, but that you may be fully rewarded. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_9","093_1_9","2JN","1","9","9","Anyone who transgresses without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in the teaching of Christ has both the Father and the Son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_10","093_1_10","2JN","1","10","10","If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_11","093_1_11","2JN","1","11","11","Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_12","093_1_12","2JN","1","12","12","I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face, so that our joy may be complete. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J21_13","093_1_13","2JN","1","13","13","The children of your elect sister send you greetings. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_1","094_1_1","3JN","1","1","1","The elder, To the beloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_2","094_1_2","3JN","1","2","2","Beloved, I pray that in every way you may prosper and enjoy good health, as your soul also prospers. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_3","094_1_3","3JN","1","3","3","For I was overjoyed when the brothers came and testified about your devotion to the truth, in which you continue to walk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_4","094_1_4","3JN","1","4","4","I have no greater joy than to hear that my children are walking in truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_5","094_1_5","3JN","1","5","5","Beloved, you are faithful in what you are doing for the brothers and for those who are strangers to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_6","094_1_6","3JN","1","6","6","They have testified to the church about your love. You will do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_7","094_1_7","3JN","1","7","7","For they went out on behalf of the Name, accepting nothing from the Gentiles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_8","094_1_8","3JN","1","8","8","Therefore we ought to receive such men, so that we may be fellow workers for the truth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_9","094_1_9","3JN","1","9","9","I have written to the church about this, but Diotrephes, who loves to be first, will not accept our instruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_10","094_1_10","3JN","1","10","10","So if I come, I will call attention to his malicious slander against us. And unsatisfied with that, he refuses to welcome the brothers and forbids those who want to do so, even putting them out of the church. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_11","094_1_11","3JN","1","11","11","Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good. The one who does good is of God; the one who does evil has not seen God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_12","094_1_12","3JN","1","12","12","Demetrius has received a good testimony from everyone, and from the truth itself. We also testify for him, and you know that our testimony is true. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_13","094_1_13","3JN","1","13","13","I have many things to write, but I would prefer not to do so with pen and ink. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("J31_14","094_1_14","3JN","1","14","14","Instead, I hope to see you soon and speak with you face to face. Peace to you. The friends here send you greetings. Greet each of our friends there by name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_1","095_1_1","JUD","1","1","1","Jude, a servant of Jesus Christ and a brother of James, To those who are called, sanctified by God the Father, and kept in Jesus Christ: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_2","095_1_2","JUD","1","2","2","Mercy, peace, and love be multiplied to you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_3","095_1_3","JUD","1","3","3","Beloved, although I made every effort to write to you about the salvation we share, I felt it necessary to write and urge you to contend earnestly for the faith entrusted once for all to the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_4","095_1_4","JUD","1","4","4","For certain men have crept in among you unnoticed—ungodly ones who were designated long ago for condemnation. They turn the grace of our God into a license for immorality, and they deny God our only Master and the Lord Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_5","095_1_5","JUD","1","5","5","Although you are fully aware of this, I want to remind you that after the Lord had delivered His people out of the land of Egypt, He destroyed those who did not believe. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_6","095_1_6","JUD","1","6","6","And the angels who did not stay within their own domain but abandoned their proper dwelling—these He has kept in eternal chains under darkness, bound for judgment on that great day. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_7","095_1_7","JUD","1","7","7","In like manner, Sodom and Gomorrah and the cities around them, who indulged in sexual immorality and pursued strange flesh, are on display as an example of those who sustain the punishment of eternal fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_8","095_1_8","JUD","1","8","8","Yet in the same way these dreamers defile their bodies, reject authority, and slander glorious beings. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_9","095_1_9","JUD","1","9","9","But even the archangel Michael, when he disputed with the devil over the body of Moses, did not presume to bring a slanderous charge against him, but said, “The Lord rebuke you!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_10","095_1_10","JUD","1","10","10","These men, however, slander what they do not understand, and like irrational animals, they will be destroyed by the things they do instinctively. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_11","095_1_11","JUD","1","11","11","Woe to them! They have traveled the path of Cain; they have rushed headlong into the error of Balaam; they have perished in Korah’s rebellion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_12","095_1_12","JUD","1","12","12","These men are hidden reefs in your love feasts, shamelessly feasting with you but shepherding only themselves. They are clouds without water, carried along by the wind; fruitless trees in autumn, twice dead after being uprooted. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_13","095_1_13","JUD","1","13","13","They are wild waves of the sea, foaming up their own shame; wandering stars, for whom blackest darkness has been reserved forever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_14","095_1_14","JUD","1","14","14","Enoch, the seventh from Adam, also prophesied about them: “Behold, the Lord is coming with myriads of His holy ones ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_15","095_1_15","JUD","1","15","15","to execute judgment on everyone, and to convict all the ungodly among them of every ungodly act of wickedness and every harsh word spoken against Him by ungodly sinners.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_16","095_1_16","JUD","1","16","16","These men are discontented grumblers, following after their own lusts; their mouths spew arrogance; they flatter others for their own advantage. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_17","095_1_17","JUD","1","17","17","But you, beloved, remember what was foretold by the apostles of our Lord Jesus Christ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_18","095_1_18","JUD","1","18","18","when they said to you, “In the last times there will be scoffers who will follow after their own ungodly desires.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_19","095_1_19","JUD","1","19","19","These are the ones who cause divisions, who are worldly and devoid of the Spirit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_20","095_1_20","JUD","1","20","20","But you, beloved, by building yourselves up in your most holy faith and praying in the Holy Spirit, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_21","095_1_21","JUD","1","21","21","keep yourselves in the love of God as you await the mercy of our Lord Jesus Christ to bring you eternal life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_22","095_1_22","JUD","1","22","22","And indeed, have mercy on some, making a distinction; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_23","095_1_23","JUD","1","23","23","save others with fear by snatching them from the fire, hating even the clothing stained by the flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_24","095_1_24","JUD","1","24","24","Now to Him who is able to keep them from stumbling and to present them unblemished in His glorious presence, with great joy— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("JD1_25","095_1_25","JUD","1","25","25","to the only wise God our Savior be glory, majesty, dominion and authority both now and for all eternity. Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_1","096_1_1","REV","1","1","1","This is the revelation of Jesus Christ, which God gave Him to show His servants what must soon come to pass. He made it known by sending His angel to His servant John, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_2","096_1_2","REV","1","2","2","who testifies to everything he saw. This is the word of God and the testimony of Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_3","096_1_3","REV","1","3","3","Blessed is the one who reads aloud the words of this prophecy, and blessed are those who hear and obey what is written in it, because the time is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_4","096_1_4","REV","1","4","4","John, To the seven churches in the province of Asia: Grace and peace to you from God who is and was and is to come, and from the seven spirits before His throne, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_5","096_1_5","REV","1","5","5","and from Jesus Christ, the faithful witness, the firstborn from the dead, and the ruler of the kings of the earth. To Him who loves us and has washed us from our sins by His blood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_6","096_1_6","REV","1","6","6","who has made us to be a kingdom, priests to His God and Father—to Him be the glory and power forever and ever! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_7","096_1_7","REV","1","7","7","Behold, He is coming with the clouds, and every eye will see Him—even those who pierced Him. And all the tribes of the earth will mourn because of Him. So shall it be! Amen. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_8","096_1_8","REV","1","8","8","“I am the Alpha and the Omega,” says the Lord God, who is and was and is to come—the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_9","096_1_9","REV","1","9","9","I, John, your brother and partner in the tribulation and kingdom and perseverance that are in Jesus, was on the island of Patmos because of the word of God and my testimony about Jesus Christ. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_10","096_1_10","REV","1","10","10","On the Lord’s day I was in the Spirit, and I heard behind me a loud voice like a trumpet, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_11","096_1_11","REV","1","11","11","saying, “Write on a scroll what you see and send it to the seven churches: to Ephesus, Smyrna, Pergamum, Thyatira, Sardis, Philadelphia, and Laodicea.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_12","096_1_12","REV","1","12","12","And there I turned to see the voice that was speaking with me. And having turned, I saw seven golden lampstands, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_13","096_1_13","REV","1","13","13","and among the seven lampstands was One like the Son of Man, dressed in a long robe, with a golden sash around His chest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_14","096_1_14","REV","1","14","14","The hair of His head was white like wool, as white as snow, and His eyes were like a blazing fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_15","096_1_15","REV","1","15","15","His feet were like polished bronze refined in a furnace, and His voice was like the roar of many waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_16","096_1_16","REV","1","16","16","He held in His right hand seven stars, and a sharp double-edged sword came from His mouth. His face was like the sun shining at its brightest. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_17","096_1_17","REV","1","17","17","When I saw Him, I fell at His feet like a dead man. But He placed His right hand on me and said, “Do not be afraid. I am the First and the Last, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_18","096_1_18","REV","1","18","18","the Living One. I was dead, and behold, now I am alive forever and ever. Amen. And I hold the keys of Death and of Hades. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_19","096_1_19","REV","1","19","19","Therefore write down the things you have seen, the things that are, and the things that will happen after this. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV1_20","096_1_20","REV","1","20","20","This is the mystery of the seven stars you saw in My right hand and of the seven golden lampstands: The seven stars are the angels of the seven churches, and the seven lampstands are the seven churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_1","096_2_1","REV","2","1","1","“To the angel of the church in Ephesus write: These are the words of Him who holds the seven stars in His right hand and walks among the seven golden lampstands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_2","096_2_2","REV","2","2","2","I know your deeds, your labor, and your perseverance. I know that you cannot tolerate those who are evil, and you have tested and exposed as liars those who falsely claim to be apostles. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_3","096_2_3","REV","2","3","3","Without growing weary, you have persevered and endured many things for the sake of My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_4","096_2_4","REV","2","4","4","But I have this against you: You have abandoned your first love. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_5","096_2_5","REV","2","5","5","Therefore, keep in mind how far you have fallen. Repent and perform the deeds you did at first. But if you do not repent, I will come to you quickly and remove your lampstand from its place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_6","096_2_6","REV","2","6","6","But you have this to your credit: You hate the works of the Nicolaitans, which I also hate. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_7","096_2_7","REV","2","7","7","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. To the one who overcomes, I will grant the right to eat from the tree of life in the Paradise of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_8","096_2_8","REV","2","8","8","To the angel of the church in Smyrna write: These are the words of the First and the Last, who died and returned to life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_9","096_2_9","REV","2","9","9","I know your works and your affliction and your poverty—though you are rich! And I am aware of the slander of those who falsely claim to be Jews, but are in fact a synagogue of Satan. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_10","096_2_10","REV","2","10","10","Do not fear what you are about to suffer. Behold, the devil is about to throw some of you into prison to test you, and you will suffer tribulation for ten days. Be faithful even unto death, and I will give you the crown of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_11","096_2_11","REV","2","11","11","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. The one who overcomes will not be harmed by the second death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_12","096_2_12","REV","2","12","12","To the angel of the church in Pergamum write: These are the words of the One who holds the sharp, double-edged sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_13","096_2_13","REV","2","13","13","I know your works and where you live, where the throne of Satan sits. Yet you hold to My name and did not deny your faith in Me in the days of My faithful witness Antipas, who was killed among you where Satan dwells. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_14","096_2_14","REV","2","14","14","But I have a few things against you, because some of you hold to the teaching of Balaam, who taught Balak to place a stumbling block before the Israelites so they would eat food sacrificed to idols and commit sexual immorality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_15","096_2_15","REV","2","15","15","In the same way, some of you also hold to the teaching of the Nicolaitans. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_16","096_2_16","REV","2","16","16","Therefore repent! Otherwise I will come to you shortly and wage war against them with the sword of My mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_17","096_2_17","REV","2","17","17","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. To the one who overcomes, I will give the hidden manna. I will also give him a white stone inscribed with a new name, known only to the one who receives it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_18","096_2_18","REV","2","18","18","To the angel of the church in Thyatira write: These are the words of the Son of God, whose eyes are like a blazing fire and whose feet are like polished bronze. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_19","096_2_19","REV","2","19","19","I know your deeds—your love, your faith, your service, your perseverance—and your latest deeds are greater than your first. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_20","096_2_20","REV","2","20","20","But I have this against you: You tolerate that woman Jezebel, who calls herself a prophetess. By her teaching she misleads My servants to be sexually immoral and to eat food sacrificed to idols. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_21","096_2_21","REV","2","21","21","Even though I have given her time to repent of her immorality, she is unwilling. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_22","096_2_22","REV","2","22","22","Behold, I will cast her onto a bed of sickness, and those who commit adultery with her will suffer great tribulation unless they repent of her deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_23","096_2_23","REV","2","23","23","Then I will strike her children dead, and all the churches will know that I am the One who searches minds and hearts, and I will repay each of you according to your deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_24","096_2_24","REV","2","24","24","But I say to the rest of you in Thyatira, who do not hold to her teaching and have not learned the so-called deep things of Satan: I will place no further burden upon you ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_25","096_2_25","REV","2","25","25","than to hold fast to what you have until I come. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_26","096_2_26","REV","2","26","26","And to the one who overcomes and continues in My work until the end, I will give authority over the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_27","096_2_27","REV","2","27","27","He will rule them with an iron scepter and shatter them like pottery—just as I have received authority from My Father. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_28","096_2_28","REV","2","28","28","And I will give him the morning star. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV2_29","096_2_29","REV","2","29","29","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_1","096_3_1","REV","3","1","1","“To the angel of the church in Sardis write: These are the words of the One who holds the seven spirits of God and the seven stars. I know your deeds; you have a reputation for being alive, yet you are dead. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_2","096_3_2","REV","3","2","2","Wake up and strengthen what remains, which is about to die; for I have found your deeds incomplete in the sight of My God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_3","096_3_3","REV","3","3","3","Remember, then, what you have received and heard. Keep it and repent. If you do not wake up, I will come upon you like a thief, and you will not know the hour when I will come upon you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_4","096_3_4","REV","3","4","4","But you do have a few people in Sardis who have not soiled their garments, and because they are worthy, they will walk with Me in white. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_5","096_3_5","REV","3","5","5","Like them, he who overcomes will be dressed in white. And I will never blot out his name from the Book of Life, but I will confess his name before My Father and His angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_6","096_3_6","REV","3","6","6","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_7","096_3_7","REV","3","7","7","To the angel of the church in Philadelphia write: These are the words of the One who is holy and true, who holds the key of David. What He opens no one can shut (except Him who opens) and no one can open. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_8","096_3_8","REV","3","8","8","I know your deeds. Behold, I have placed before you an open door, which no one can shut. I know that you have only a little strength, yet you have kept My word and have not denied My name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_9","096_3_9","REV","3","9","9","As for those who belong to the synagogue of Satan, who claim to be Jews but are liars instead, I will make them come and bow down at your feet, and they will know that I love you. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_10","096_3_10","REV","3","10","10","Because you have kept My command to persevere, I will also keep you from the hour of testing that is about to come upon the whole world, to test those who dwell on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_11","096_3_11","REV","3","11","11","I am coming soon. Hold fast to what you have, so that no one will take your crown. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_12","096_3_12","REV","3","12","12","The one who overcomes I will make a pillar in the temple of My God, and he will never again leave it. Upon him I will write the name of My God, and the name of the city of My God (the new Jerusalem that comes down out of heaven from My God), and My new name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_13","096_3_13","REV","3","13","13","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_14","096_3_14","REV","3","14","14","To the angel of the church in Laodicea write: These are the words of the Amen, the faithful and true Witness, the Originator of God’s creation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_15","096_3_15","REV","3","15","15","I know your deeds; you are neither cold nor hot. How I wish you were one or the other! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_16","096_3_16","REV","3","16","16","So because you are lukewarm—neither hot nor cold—I am about to vomit you out of My mouth! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_17","096_3_17","REV","3","17","17","You say, ‘I am rich; I have grown wealthy and need nothing.’ But you do not realize that you are wretched, pitiful, poor, blind, and naked. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_18","096_3_18","REV","3","18","18","I counsel you to buy from Me gold refined by fire so that you may become rich, white garments so that you may be clothed and your shameful nakedness not exposed, and salve to anoint your eyes so that you may see. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_19","096_3_19","REV","3","19","19","Those I love, I rebuke and discipline. Therefore be earnest and repent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_20","096_3_20","REV","3","20","20","Behold, I stand at the door and knock. If anyone hears My voice and opens the door, I will come in and dine with him, and he with Me. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_21","096_3_21","REV","3","21","21","To the one who overcomes, I will grant the right to sit with Me on My throne, just as I overcame and sat down with My Father on His throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV3_22","096_3_22","REV","3","22","22","He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_1","096_4_1","REV","4","1","1","After this I looked and saw a door standing open in heaven. And the voice I had previously heard speak to me like a trumpet was saying, “Come up here, and I will show you what must happen after these things.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_2","096_4_2","REV","4","2","2","And at once I was in the Spirit, and I saw a throne standing in heaven, with someone seated on it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_3","096_4_3","REV","4","3","3","He looked like jasper and carnelian, and a rainbow that gleamed like an emerald encircled the throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_4","096_4_4","REV","4","4","4","Surrounding the throne were twenty-four other thrones, and on these thrones sat twenty-four elders dressed in white, with golden crowns on their heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_5","096_4_5","REV","4","5","5","From the throne came flashes of lightning, rumblings, and peals of thunder. Before the throne burned seven torches of fire. These are the seven spirits of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_6","096_4_6","REV","4","6","6","And before the throne was something like a sea of glass, as clear as crystal. In the center, around the throne, were four living creatures, covered with eyes in front and back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_7","096_4_7","REV","4","7","7","The first living creature was like a lion, the second like a calf, the third had the face of a man, and the fourth was like an eagle in flight. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_8","096_4_8","REV","4","8","8","And each of the four living creatures had six wings and was covered with eyes all around and within. Day and night they never stop saying: “Holy, Holy, Holy, is the Lord God Almighty, who was and is and is to come!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_9","096_4_9","REV","4","9","9","And whenever the living creatures give glory, honor, and thanks to the One seated on the throne, who lives forever and ever, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_10","096_4_10","REV","4","10","10","the twenty-four elders fall down before the One seated on the throne, and they worship Him who lives forever and ever. They cast their crowns before the throne, saying: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV4_11","096_4_11","REV","4","11","11","“Worthy are You, our Lord and God, the Holy One, to receive glory and honor and power, for You created all things; by Your will they exist and were created.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_1","096_5_1","REV","5","1","1","Then I saw a scroll in the right hand of the One seated on the throne. It had writing on both sides and was sealed with seven seals. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_2","096_5_2","REV","5","2","2","And I saw a mighty angel proclaiming in a loud voice, “Who is worthy to break the seals and open the scroll?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_3","096_5_3","REV","5","3","3","But no one in heaven above or on earth or under the earth was able to open the scroll or look inside it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_4","096_5_4","REV","5","4","4","And I began to weep bitterly, because no one was found worthy to open the scroll or look inside it. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_5","096_5_5","REV","5","5","5","Then one of the elders said to me, “Do not weep! Behold, the Lion of the tribe of Judah, the Root of David, has triumphed to open the scroll and its seven seals.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_6","096_5_6","REV","5","6","6","Then I saw a Lamb who appeared to have been slain, standing in the center of the throne, encircled by the four living creatures and the elders. The Lamb had seven horns and seven eyes, which represent the seven spirits of God sent out into all the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_7","096_5_7","REV","5","7","7","And He came and took the scroll from the right hand of the One seated on the throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_8","096_5_8","REV","5","8","8","When He had taken the scroll, the four living creatures and the twenty-four elders fell down before the Lamb. Each one had a harp, and they were holding golden bowls full of incense, which are the prayers of the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_9","096_5_9","REV","5","9","9","And they sang a new song: “Worthy are You to take the scroll and open its seals, because You were slain, and by Your blood You purchased us for God from every tribe and tongue and people and nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_10","096_5_10","REV","5","10","10","You have made them to be kings and priests to serve our God, and they will reign upon the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_11","096_5_11","REV","5","11","11","Then I looked, and I heard the voices of many angels encircling the throne and the living creatures and the elders, and their number was myriads of myriads and thousands of thousands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_12","096_5_12","REV","5","12","12","In a loud voice they were saying: “Worthy is the Lamb who was slain, to receive power and riches and wisdom and strength and honor and glory and blessing!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_13","096_5_13","REV","5","13","13","And I heard every creature in heaven and on earth and under the earth and in the sea, and all that is in them, saying: “To Him who sits on the throne and to the Lamb be praise and honor and glory and power forever and ever. Amen!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV5_14","096_5_14","REV","5","14","14","And the four living creatures said, “Amen,” and the elders fell down and worshiped. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_1","096_6_1","REV","6","1","1","Then I watched as the Lamb opened one of the seven seals, and I heard one of the four living creatures say in a voice like thunder, “Come and see!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_2","096_6_2","REV","6","2","2","So I saw a white horse, and its rider held a bow. And he was given a crown, and he rode out to overcome and conquer. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_3","096_6_3","REV","6","3","3","And when the Lamb opened the second seal, I heard the second living creature say, “Come!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_4","096_6_4","REV","6","4","4","Then another horse went forth. It was bright red, and its rider was granted permission to take away peace from the earth and to make men slay one another. And he was given a great sword. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_5","096_6_5","REV","6","5","5","And when the Lamb opened the third seal, I heard the third living creature say, “Come and see!” And I saw a black horse, and its rider held in his hand a pair of scales. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_6","096_6_6","REV","6","6","6","And I heard a voice from among the four living creatures, saying, “A quart of wheat for a denarius, and three quarts of barley for a denarius, and do not harm the oil and wine.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_7","096_6_7","REV","6","7","7","And when the Lamb opened the fourth seal, I heard the fourth living creature say, “Come and see!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_8","096_6_8","REV","6","8","8","Then I saw a pale green horse. Its rider’s name was Death, and Hades followed close behind. And he was given authority over a fourth of the earth, to kill by sword, by famine, by plague, and by the beasts of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_9","096_6_9","REV","6","9","9","And when the Lamb opened the fifth seal, I saw under the altar the souls of those who had been slain for the word of God and for the testimony of the Lamb that they had upheld. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_10","096_6_10","REV","6","10","10","And they cried out in a loud voice, “How long, O Lord, holy and true, until You judge those who dwell upon the earth and avenge our blood?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_11","096_6_11","REV","6","11","11","Then each of them was given a white robe and told to rest a little while longer until the full number of their fellow servants, their brothers, were killed, just as they had been killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_12","096_6_12","REV","6","12","12","And I watched as the Lamb opened the sixth seal, and there was a great earthquake, and the sun became black like sackcloth of goat hair, and the whole moon turned blood red, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_13","096_6_13","REV","6","13","13","and the stars of the sky fell to the earth like unripe figs dropping from a tree shaken by a great wind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_14","096_6_14","REV","6","14","14","The sky receded like a scroll being rolled up, and every mountain and island was moved from its place. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_15","096_6_15","REV","6","15","15","Then the kings of the earth, the nobles, the commanders, the rich, the mighty, and every slave and free man hid in the caves and among the rocks of the mountains. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_16","096_6_16","REV","6","16","16","And they said to the mountains and the rocks, “Fall on us and hide us from the face of the One seated on the throne, and from the wrath of the Lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV6_17","096_6_17","REV","6","17","17","For the great day of Their wrath has come, and who is able to withstand it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_1","096_7_1","REV","7","1","1","And after this I saw four angels standing at the four corners of the earth, holding back its four winds so that no wind would blow on land or sea or on any tree. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_2","096_7_2","REV","7","2","2","And I saw another angel ascending from the east, with the seal of the living God. And he called out in a loud voice to the four angels who had been given power to harm the land and the sea: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_3","096_7_3","REV","7","3","3","“Do not harm the land or sea or trees until we have placed a seal on the foreheads of the servants of our God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_4","096_7_4","REV","7","4","4","And I heard the number of those who were sealed, 144,000 from all the tribes of Israel: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_5","096_7_5","REV","7","5","5","From the tribe of Judah 12,000 were sealed, from the tribe of Reuben 12,000, from the tribe of Gad 12,000, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_6","096_7_6","REV","7","6","6","from the tribe of Asher 12,000, from the tribe of Naphtali 12,000, from the tribe of Manasseh 12,000, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_7","096_7_7","REV","7","7","7","from the tribe of Simeon 12,000, from the tribe of Levi 12,000, from the tribe of Issachar 12,000, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_8","096_7_8","REV","7","8","8","from the tribe of Zebulun 12,000, from the tribe of Joseph 12,000, and from the tribe of Benjamin 12,000. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_9","096_7_9","REV","7","9","9","After this I looked and saw a multitude too large to count, from every nation and tribe and people and tongue, standing before the throne and before the Lamb. They were wearing white robes and holding palm branches in their hands. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_10","096_7_10","REV","7","10","10","And they cried out in a loud voice: “Salvation to our God, who sits on the throne, and to the Lamb!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_11","096_7_11","REV","7","11","11","And all the angels stood around the throne and around the elders and the four living creatures. And they fell facedown before the throne and worshiped God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_12","096_7_12","REV","7","12","12","saying, “Amen! Blessing and glory and wisdom and thanks and honor and power and strength be to our God forever and ever! Amen.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_13","096_7_13","REV","7","13","13","Then one of the elders addressed me: “These in white robes,” he asked, “who are they, and where have they come from?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_14","096_7_14","REV","7","14","14","“Sir,” I answered, “you know.” So he replied, “These are the ones who have come out of the great tribulation; they have washed their robes and made them white in the blood of the Lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_15","096_7_15","REV","7","15","15","For this reason, they are before the throne of God and serve Him day and night in His temple; and the One seated on the throne will spread His tabernacle over them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_16","096_7_16","REV","7","16","16","‘Never again will they hunger, and never will they thirst; nor will the sun beat down upon them, nor any scorching heat.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV7_17","096_7_17","REV","7","17","17","For the Lamb in the center of the throne shepherds them. ‘He will lead them to springs of living water,’ and ‘God will wipe away every tear from their eyes.’” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_1","096_8_1","REV","8","1","1","When the Lamb opened the seventh seal, there was silence in heaven for about half an hour. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_2","096_8_2","REV","8","2","2","And I saw the seven angels who stand before God, and they were given seven trumpets. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_3","096_8_3","REV","8","3","3","Then another angel, who had a golden censer, came and stood at the altar. He was given much incense to offer, along with the prayers of all the saints, on the golden altar before the throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_4","096_8_4","REV","8","4","4","And the smoke of the incense, together with the prayers of the saints, rose up before God from the hand of the angel. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_5","096_8_5","REV","8","5","5","Then the angel took the censer, filled it with fire from the altar, and hurled it to the earth; and there were peals of thunder, rumblings, flashes of lightning, and an earthquake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_6","096_8_6","REV","8","6","6","And the seven angels with the seven trumpets prepared to sound them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_7","096_8_7","REV","8","7","7","Then the first angel sounded his trumpet, and hail and fire mixed with blood were hurled down upon the earth. A third of the earth was burned up, along with a third of the trees and all the green grass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_8","096_8_8","REV","8","8","8","Then the second angel sounded his trumpet, and something like a great burning mountain was thrown into the sea. A third of the sea turned to blood, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_9","096_8_9","REV","8","9","9","a third of the living creatures in the sea died, and a third of the ships were destroyed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_10","096_8_10","REV","8","10","10","Then the third angel sounded his trumpet, and a great star burning like a torch fell from heaven and landed on a third of the rivers and on the springs of water. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_11","096_8_11","REV","8","11","11","The name of the star is Wormwood. A third of the waters turned bitter like wormwood oil, and many people died from the bitter waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_12","096_8_12","REV","8","12","12","Then the fourth angel sounded his trumpet, and a third of the sun and moon and stars were struck. A third of the stars were darkened, a third of the day was without light, and a third of the night as well. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV8_13","096_8_13","REV","8","13","13","And as I observed, I heard an eagle flying overhead, calling in a loud voice, “Woe! Woe! Woe to those who dwell on the earth, because of the trumpet blasts about to be sounded by the remaining three angels!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_1","096_9_1","REV","9","1","1","Then the fifth angel sounded his trumpet, and I saw a star that had fallen from heaven to earth, and it was given the key to the pit of the Abyss. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_2","096_9_2","REV","9","2","2","The star opened the pit of the Abyss, and smoke rose out of it like the smoke of a burning furnace, and the sun and the air were darkened by the smoke from the pit. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_3","096_9_3","REV","9","3","3","And out of the smoke, locusts descended on the earth, and they were given power like that of the scorpions of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_4","096_9_4","REV","9","4","4","They were told not to harm the grass of the earth or any plant or tree, but only those who did not have the seal of God on their foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_5","096_9_5","REV","9","5","5","The locusts were not given power to kill them, but only to torment them for five months, and their torment was like the stinging of a scorpion. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_6","096_9_6","REV","9","6","6","In those days men will seek death and will not find it; they will long to die, but death will escape them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_7","096_9_7","REV","9","7","7","And the locusts looked like horses prepared for battle, with something like crowns of gold on their heads; and their faces were like the faces of men. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_8","096_9_8","REV","9","8","8","They had hair like that of women, and teeth like those of lions. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_9","096_9_9","REV","9","9","9","They also had thoraxes like breastplates of iron, and the sound of their wings was like the roar of many horses and chariots rushing into battle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_10","096_9_10","REV","9","10","10","They had tails with stingers like scorpions, which had the power to injure people for five months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_11","096_9_11","REV","9","11","11","They were ruled by a king, the angel of the Abyss. His name in Hebrew is Abaddon, and in Greek it is Apollyon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_12","096_9_12","REV","9","12","12","The first woe has passed. Behold, two woes are still to follow. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_13","096_9_13","REV","9","13","13","Then the sixth angel sounded his trumpet, and I heard a voice from the four horns of the golden altar before God ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_14","096_9_14","REV","9","14","14","saying to the sixth angel with the trumpet, “Release the four angels who are bound at the great river Euphrates.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_15","096_9_15","REV","9","15","15","So the four angels who had been prepared for this hour and day and month and year were released to kill a third of mankind. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_16","096_9_16","REV","9","16","16","And the number of mounted troops was a hundred million; I heard their number. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_17","096_9_17","REV","9","17","17","Now the horses and riders in my vision looked like this: The riders had breastplates the colors of fire, sapphire, and sulfur. The heads of the horses were like the heads of lions, and out of their mouths proceeded fire, smoke, and sulfur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_18","096_9_18","REV","9","18","18","A third of mankind was killed by the three plagues of fire, smoke, and sulfur that proceeded from their mouths. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_19","096_9_19","REV","9","19","19","For the power of the horses was in their mouths and in their tails; indeed, their tails were like snakes, having heads with which to inflict harm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_20","096_9_20","REV","9","20","20","Now the rest of mankind who were not killed by these plagues still did not repent of the works of their hands. They did not stop worshiping demons and idols of gold, silver, bronze, stone, and wood, which cannot see or hear or walk. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV9_21","096_9_21","REV","9","21","21","Furthermore, they did not repent of their murder, sorcery, sexual immorality, and theft. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_1","096_10_1","REV","10","1","1","Then I saw a mighty angel coming down from heaven, wrapped in a cloud, with a rainbow above his head. His face was like the sun, and his legs were like pillars of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_2","096_10_2","REV","10","2","2","He held in his hand a scroll, which lay open. He placed his right foot on the sea and his left foot on the land. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_3","096_10_3","REV","10","3","3","Then he cried out in a loud voice like the roar of a lion. And when he cried out, the seven thunders sounded their voices. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_4","096_10_4","REV","10","4","4","When the seven thunders had spoken, I was about to put it in writing. But I heard a voice from heaven saying, “Seal up what the seven thunders have said, and do not write it down.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_5","096_10_5","REV","10","5","5","Then the angel I had seen standing on the sea and on the land lifted up his right hand to heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_6","096_10_6","REV","10","6","6","And he swore by Him who lives forever and ever, who created heaven and everything in it, the earth and everything in it, and the sea and everything in it: “There will be no more delay! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_7","096_10_7","REV","10","7","7","But in the days of the voice of the seventh angel, when he begins to sound his trumpet, the mystery of God will be fulfilled, just as He proclaimed to His servants the prophets.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_8","096_10_8","REV","10","8","8","Then the voice that I had heard from heaven spoke to me again, saying, “Go, take the small scroll that lies open in the hand of the angel standing on the sea and on the land.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_9","096_10_9","REV","10","9","9","And I went to the angel and said, “Give me the small scroll.” “Take it and eat it,” he said. “It will make your stomach bitter, but in your mouth it will be as sweet as honey.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_10","096_10_10","REV","10","10","10","So I took the scroll from the angel’s hand and ate it, and it was as sweet as honey in my mouth. But when I had eaten it, my stomach turned bitter. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV10_11","096_10_11","REV","10","11","11","And they told me, “You must prophesy again about many peoples and nations and tongues and kings.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_1","096_11_1","REV","11","1","1","Then I was given a measuring rod like a staff and was told, “Go and measure the temple of God and the altar, and count the number of worshipers there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_2","096_11_2","REV","11","2","2","But exclude the courtyard outside the temple. Do not measure it, because it has been given over to the nations, and they will trample the holy city for 42 months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_3","096_11_3","REV","11","3","3","And I will empower my two witnesses, and they will prophesy for 1,260 days, clothed in sackcloth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_4","096_11_4","REV","11","4","4","These witnesses are the two olive trees and the two lampstands that stand before the Lord of the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_5","096_11_5","REV","11","5","5","If anyone wants to harm them, fire proceeds from their mouths and devours their enemies. In this way, anyone who wants to harm them must be killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_6","096_11_6","REV","11","6","6","These witnesses have power to shut the sky so that no rain will fall during the days of their prophecy, and power to turn the waters into blood and to strike the earth with every kind of plague as often as they wish. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_7","096_11_7","REV","11","7","7","When the two witnesses have finished their testimony, the beast that comes up from the Abyss will wage war with them, and will overpower and kill them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_8","096_11_8","REV","11","8","8","Their bodies will lie in the street of the great city—figuratively called Sodom and Egypt—where their Lord was also crucified. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_9","096_11_9","REV","11","9","9","For three and a half days all peoples and tribes and tongues and nations will view their bodies and will not permit them to be laid in a tomb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_10","096_11_10","REV","11","10","10","And those who dwell on the earth will gloat over them, and will celebrate and give one another gifts, because these two prophets had tormented them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_11","096_11_11","REV","11","11","11","But after the three and a half days, the breath of life from God entered the two witnesses, and they stood on their feet, and great fear fell upon those who saw them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_12","096_11_12","REV","11","12","12","And I heard a loud voice from heaven saying, “Come up here.” And they went up to heaven in a cloud as their enemies watched them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_13","096_11_13","REV","11","13","13","And in that day there was a great earthquake, and a tenth of the city collapsed. Seven thousand were killed in the quake, and the rest were terrified and gave glory to the God of heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_14","096_11_14","REV","11","14","14","The second woe has passed. Behold, the third woe is coming shortly. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_15","096_11_15","REV","11","15","15","Then the seventh angel sounded his trumpet, and loud voices called out in heaven: “The kingdom of the world has become the kingdom of our Lord and of His Christ, and He will reign forever and ever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_16","096_11_16","REV","11","16","16","And the twenty-four elders who sit on their thrones before God fell on their faces and worshiped God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_17","096_11_17","REV","11","17","17","saying: “We give thanks to You, O Lord God Almighty, the One who is and who was, because You have taken Your great power and have begun to reign. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_18","096_11_18","REV","11","18","18","The nations were enraged, and Your wrath has come. The time has come to judge the dead and to reward Your servants the prophets, as well as the saints and those who fear Your name, both small and great—and to destroy those who destroy the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV11_19","096_11_19","REV","11","19","19","Then the temple of God in heaven was opened, and the ark of the covenant of the Lord appeared in His temple. And there were flashes of lightning, and rumblings, and peals of thunder, and a great hailstorm. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_1","096_12_1","REV","12","1","1","And a great sign appeared in heaven: a woman clothed in the sun, with the moon under her feet and a crown of twelve stars on her head. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_2","096_12_2","REV","12","2","2","She was pregnant and crying out in the pain and agony of giving birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_3","096_12_3","REV","12","3","3","Then another sign appeared in heaven: a huge red dragon with seven heads, ten horns, and seven royal crowns on his heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_4","096_12_4","REV","12","4","4","His tail swept a third of the stars from the sky, hurling them to the earth. And the dragon stood before the woman who was about to give birth, ready to devour her child as soon as she gave birth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_5","096_12_5","REV","12","5","5","And she gave birth to a son, a male child, who will rule all the nations with an iron scepter. And her child was caught up to God and to His throne. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_6","096_12_6","REV","12","6","6","And the woman fled into the wilderness, where God had prepared a place for her to be nourished for 1,260 days. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_7","096_12_7","REV","12","7","7","Then a war broke out in heaven: Michael and his angels fought against the dragon, and the dragon and his angels fought back. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_8","096_12_8","REV","12","8","8","But the dragon was not strong enough, and no longer was any place found in heaven for him and his angels. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_9","096_12_9","REV","12","9","9","And the great dragon was hurled down—that ancient serpent called the devil and Satan, the deceiver of the whole world. He was hurled to the earth, and his angels with him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_10","096_12_10","REV","12","10","10","And I heard a loud voice in heaven saying: “Now have come the salvation and the power and the kingdom of our God, and the authority of His Christ. For the accuser of our brothers has been thrown down—he who accuses them day and night before our God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_11","096_12_11","REV","12","11","11","They have conquered him by the blood of the Lamb and by the word of their testimony. And they did not love their lives so as to shy away from death. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_12","096_12_12","REV","12","12","12","Therefore rejoice, O heavens, and you who dwell in them! But woe to the earth and the sea; with great fury the devil has come down to you, knowing he has only a short time.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_13","096_12_13","REV","12","13","13","And when the dragon saw that he had been thrown to the earth, he pursued the woman who had given birth to the male child. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_14","096_12_14","REV","12","14","14","But the woman was given two wings of a great eagle to fly from the presence of the serpent to her place in the wilderness, where she was nourished for a time, and times, and half a time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_15","096_12_15","REV","12","15","15","Then from his mouth the serpent spewed water like a river to overtake the woman and sweep her away in the torrent. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_16","096_12_16","REV","12","16","16","But the earth helped the woman and opened its mouth to swallow up the river that the dragon had poured from his mouth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV12_17","096_12_17","REV","12","17","17","And the dragon was enraged at the woman and went to make war with the rest of her children, who keep the commandments of God and hold to the testimony of Jesus. And I stood on the shore of the sea. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_1","096_13_1","REV","13","1","1","Then I saw a beast with ten horns and seven heads rising out of the sea. There were ten royal crowns on its horns and blasphemous names on its heads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_2","096_13_2","REV","13","2","2","The beast I saw was like a leopard, with the feet of a bear and the mouth of a lion. And the dragon gave the beast his power and his throne and great authority. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_3","096_13_3","REV","13","3","3","One of the heads of the beast appeared to have been mortally wounded. But the mortal wound was healed, and the whole world marveled and followed the beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_4","096_13_4","REV","13","4","4","They worshiped the dragon who had given authority to the beast, and they worshiped the beast, saying, “Who is like the beast, and who can wage war against it?” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_5","096_13_5","REV","13","5","5","The beast was given a mouth to speak arrogant and blasphemous words, and authority to make war for 42 months. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_6","096_13_6","REV","13","6","6","And the beast opened its mouth to speak blasphemy against God and to slander His name and His tabernacle—those who dwell in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_7","096_13_7","REV","13","7","7","Then the beast was permitted to wage war against the saints and to conquer them, and it was given authority over every tribe and people and tongue and nation. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_8","096_13_8","REV","13","8","8","And all who dwell on the earth will worship the beast—all whose names have not been written from the foundation of the world in the Book of Life belonging to the Lamb who was slain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_9","096_13_9","REV","13","9","9","He who has an ear, let him hear: ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_10","096_13_10","REV","13","10","10","“If anyone is destined for captivity, there he will go; if anyone kills by the sword, by the sword he must be killed.” Here is a call for the perseverance and faith of the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_11","096_13_11","REV","13","11","11","Then I saw another beast rising out of the earth. This beast had two horns like a lamb, but spoke like a dragon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_12","096_13_12","REV","13","12","12","And this beast exercised all the authority of the first beast and caused the earth and those who dwell in it to worship the first beast, whose mortal wound had been healed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_13","096_13_13","REV","13","13","13","And the second beast performed great signs, even causing fire from heaven to come down upon the earth in the presence of the people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_14","096_13_14","REV","13","14","14","Because of the signs it was given to perform on behalf of the first beast, it deceived my own people who dwell on the earth, telling them to make an image to the beast that had been wounded by the sword and yet had lived. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_15","096_13_15","REV","13","15","15","The second beast was permitted to give breath to the image of the first beast, so that the image could speak and cause all who refused to worship it to be killed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_16","096_13_16","REV","13","16","16","And the second beast required all people, small and great, rich and poor, free and slave, to receive a mark on their right hand or on their forehead, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_17","096_13_17","REV","13","17","17","so that no one could buy or sell unless he had the mark—the name of the beast or the number of its name. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV13_18","096_13_18","REV","13","18","18","Here is a call for wisdom: Let the one who has insight calculate the number of the beast, for it is the number of a man, and that number is 666. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_1","096_14_1","REV","14","1","1","Then I looked and saw the Lamb standing on Mount Zion, and with Him 144,000 who had His name and His Father’s name written on their foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_2","096_14_2","REV","14","2","2","And I heard a sound from heaven like the roar of many waters and the loud rumbling of thunder. And the sound I heard was like harpists strumming their harps. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_3","096_14_3","REV","14","3","3","And they sang a new song before the throne and before the four living creatures and the elders. And no one could learn the song except the 144,000 who had been redeemed from the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_4","096_14_4","REV","14","4","4","These are the ones who have not been defiled with women, for they are virgins. They follow the Lamb wherever He goes. They have been redeemed by Jesus from among men as firstfruits to God and to the Lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_5","096_14_5","REV","14","5","5","And no lie was found in their mouths, for they are blameless. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_6","096_14_6","REV","14","6","6","Then I saw an angel flying overhead, with the eternal gospel to proclaim to those who dwell on the earth—to every nation and tribe and tongue and people. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_7","096_14_7","REV","14","7","7","And he said in a loud voice, “Fear the Lord and give Him glory, because the hour of His judgment has come. Worship the One who made the heavens and the earth and the sea and the springs of waters.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_8","096_14_8","REV","14","8","8","Then a second angel followed, saying, “Fallen is Babylon the great, who has made all the nations drink the wine of the passion of her immorality.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_9","096_14_9","REV","14","9","9","And a third angel followed them, calling out in a loud voice, “If anyone worships the beast and its image and receives its mark on his forehead or on his hand, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_10","096_14_10","REV","14","10","10","he too will drink the wine of God’s anger, poured undiluted into the cup of His wrath. And he will be tormented in fire and sulfur in the presence of the holy angels and of the Lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_11","096_14_11","REV","14","11","11","And the smoke of their torment rises forever and ever. Day and night there is no rest for those who worship the beast and its image, or for anyone who receives the mark of its name.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_12","096_14_12","REV","14","12","12","Here is a call for the perseverance of the saints, who keep the commandments of God and the faith of Jesus. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_13","096_14_13","REV","14","13","13","And I heard a voice from heaven telling me to write, “Blessed are the dead—those who die in the Lord from this moment on.” “Yes,” says the Spirit, “they will rest from their labors, and their deeds will follow them.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_14","096_14_14","REV","14","14","14","And I looked and saw a white cloud, and seated on the cloud was One like the Son of Man, with a golden crown on His head and a sharp sickle in His hand. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_15","096_14_15","REV","14","15","15","Then another angel came out of the temple, crying out in a loud voice to the One seated on the cloud, “Swing Your sickle and reap, because the time has come to harvest, for the crop of the earth is ripe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_16","096_14_16","REV","14","16","16","So the One seated on the cloud swung His sickle over the earth, and the earth was harvested. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_17","096_14_17","REV","14","17","17","Then another angel came out of the temple in heaven, and he too had a sharp sickle. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_18","096_14_18","REV","14","18","18","Still another angel, with authority over the fire, came from the altar and called out with a loud cry to the angel with the sharp sickle, “Swing your sharp sickle and gather the clusters of grapes from the vine of the earth, because its grapes are ripe.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_19","096_14_19","REV","14","19","19","So the angel swung his sickle over the earth and gathered the grapes of the earth, and he threw them into the great winepress of God’s wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV14_20","096_14_20","REV","14","20","20","And the winepress was trodden outside the city, and the blood that flowed from it rose as high as the bridles of the horses for a distance of 1,600 stadia. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_1","096_15_1","REV","15","1","1","Then I saw another great and marvelous sign in heaven: seven angels with the seven final plagues, with which the wrath of God is completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_2","096_15_2","REV","15","2","2","And I saw something like a sea of glass mixed with fire, beside which stood those who had conquered the beast and its image and the number of its name. They were holding harps from God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_3","096_15_3","REV","15","3","3","and they sang the song of God’s servant Moses and of the Lamb: “Great and wonderful are Your works, O Lord God Almighty! Just and true are Your ways, O King of the nations! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_4","096_15_4","REV","15","4","4","Who will not fear You, O Lord, and glorify Your name? For You alone are holy. All nations will come and worship before You, for Your righteous acts have been revealed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_5","096_15_5","REV","15","5","5","After this I looked, and the temple—the tabernacle of the Testimony—was opened in heaven. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_6","096_15_6","REV","15","6","6","And out of the temple came the seven angels with the seven plagues, dressed in clean and bright linen and girded with golden sashes around their chests. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_7","096_15_7","REV","15","7","7","Then one of the four living creatures gave the seven angels seven golden bowls full of the wrath of God, who lives forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV15_8","096_15_8","REV","15","8","8","And the temple was filled with smoke from the glory of God and from His power; and no one could enter the temple until the seven plagues of the seven angels were completed. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_1","096_16_1","REV","16","1","1","Then I heard a loud voice from the temple saying to the seven angels, “Go, pour out on the earth the seven bowls of God’s wrath.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_2","096_16_2","REV","16","2","2","So the first angel went and poured out his bowl on the earth, and loathsome, malignant sores broke out on those who had the mark of the beast and worshiped its image. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_3","096_16_3","REV","16","3","3","And the second angel poured out his bowl into the sea, and it turned to blood like that of the dead, and every living thing in the sea died. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_4","096_16_4","REV","16","4","4","And the third angel poured out his bowl into the rivers and springs of water, and they turned to blood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_5","096_16_5","REV","16","5","5","And I heard the angel of the waters say: “Righteous are You, O Holy One, who is and was, because You have brought these judgments. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_6","096_16_6","REV","16","6","6","For they have spilled the blood of saints and prophets, and You have given them blood to drink, as they deserve.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_7","096_16_7","REV","16","7","7","And I heard the altar reply: “Yes, Lord God Almighty, true and just are Your judgments.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_8","096_16_8","REV","16","8","8","Then the fourth angel poured out his bowl on the sun, and it was given power to scorch the people with fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_9","096_16_9","REV","16","9","9","And the people were scorched by intense heat, and men cursed the name of God, who had authority over these plagues. Yet they did not repent and give Him glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_10","096_16_10","REV","16","10","10","And the fifth angel poured out his bowl on the throne of the beast, and its kingdom was plunged into darkness, and men began to gnaw their tongues in anguish ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_11","096_16_11","REV","16","11","11","and curse the God of heaven for their pains and sores. Yet they did not repent of their deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_12","096_16_12","REV","16","12","12","And the sixth angel poured out his bowl on the great river Euphrates, and its water was dried up to prepare the way for the kings of the East. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_13","096_16_13","REV","16","13","13","And I saw three unclean spirits that looked like frogs coming out of the mouths of the dragon, the beast, and the false prophet. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_14","096_16_14","REV","16","14","14","These are demonic spirits that perform signs and go out to all the kings of the earth, to assemble them for battle on that great day of God the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_15","096_16_15","REV","16","15","15","“Behold, I am coming like a thief. Blessed is the one who remains awake and clothed, so that he will not go naked and let his shame be exposed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_16","096_16_16","REV","16","16","16","And they assembled the kings in the place that in Hebrew is called Armageddon. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_17","096_16_17","REV","16","17","17","Then the seventh angel poured out his bowl into the air, and a loud voice came from the throne in the temple of heaven, saying, “It is done!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_18","096_16_18","REV","16","18","18","And there were flashes of lightning, and peals of thunder, and rumblings, and a great earthquake the likes of which had not occurred since men were upon the earth—so mighty was the great quake. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_19","096_16_19","REV","16","19","19","The great city was split into three parts, and the cities of the nations collapsed. And God remembered Babylon the great and gave her the cup of the wine of the fury of His wrath. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_20","096_16_20","REV","16","20","20","Then every island fled, and no mountain could be found. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV16_21","096_16_21","REV","16","21","21","And great hailstones weighing almost a hundred pounds each rained down on them from above. And men cursed God for the plague of hail, because it was so horrendous. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_1","096_17_1","REV","17","1","1","Then one of the seven angels with the seven bowls came and said to me, “Come, I will show you the punishment of the great prostitute, who sits on many waters. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_2","096_17_2","REV","17","2","2","The kings of the earth were immoral with her, and those who dwell on the earth were intoxicated with the wine of her immorality.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_3","096_17_3","REV","17","3","3","And the angel carried me away in the Spirit into a wilderness, where I saw a woman sitting on a scarlet beast that was covered with blasphemous names and had seven heads and ten horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_4","096_17_4","REV","17","4","4","The woman was dressed in purple and scarlet, and adorned with gold and precious stones and pearls. She held in her hand a golden cup full of abominations and the impurities of her sexual immorality. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_5","096_17_5","REV","17","5","5","And on her forehead a mysterious name was written: BABYLON THE GREAT, THE MOTHER OF PROSTITUTES AND OF THE ABOMINATIONS OF THE EARTH. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_6","096_17_6","REV","17","6","6","I could see that the woman was drunk with the blood of the saints and witnesses for Jesus. And I was utterly amazed at the sight of her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_7","096_17_7","REV","17","7","7","“Why are you so amazed?” said the angel. “I will tell you the mystery of the woman and of the beast that carries her, which has the seven heads and ten horns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_8","096_17_8","REV","17","8","8","The beast that you saw—it was, and now is no more, but is about to come up out of the Abyss and go to its destruction. And those who dwell on the earth whose names were not written in the Book of Life from the foundation of the world will marvel when they see the beast that was, and is not, and yet will be. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_9","096_17_9","REV","17","9","9","This calls for a mind with wisdom. The seven heads are seven mountains on which the woman sits. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_10","096_17_10","REV","17","10","10","There are also seven kings. Five have fallen, one is, and the other has not yet come. But when he does come, he must remain for only a little while. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_11","096_17_11","REV","17","11","11","The beast that was, and now is not, is an eighth king, who belongs to the other seven and is going into destruction. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_12","096_17_12","REV","17","12","12","The ten horns you saw are ten kings who have not yet received a kingdom, but will receive one hour of authority as kings, along with the beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_13","096_17_13","REV","17","13","13","These kings have one purpose: to yield their power and authority to the beast. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_14","096_17_14","REV","17","14","14","They will make war against the Lamb, and the Lamb will triumph over them, because He is Lord of lords and King of kings; and He will be accompanied by His called and chosen and faithful ones.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_15","096_17_15","REV","17","15","15","Then the angel said to me, “The waters you saw, where the prostitute was seated, are peoples and multitudes and nations and tongues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_16","096_17_16","REV","17","16","16","And the ten horns and the beast that you saw will hate the prostitute. They will leave her desolate and naked, and will eat her flesh and burn her with fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_17","096_17_17","REV","17","17","17","For God has put it into their hearts to carry out His purpose by uniting to give their kingdom to the beast, until the words of God are fulfilled. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV17_18","096_17_18","REV","17","18","18","And the woman you saw is the great city that rules over the kings of the earth.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_1","096_18_1","REV","18","1","1","After this I saw another angel descending from heaven with great authority, and the earth was illuminated by his glory. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_2","096_18_2","REV","18","2","2","And he cried out in a mighty voice: “Fallen is Babylon the great! She has become a lair for demons and a haunt for every unclean spirit and every unclean and detestable bird. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_3","096_18_3","REV","18","3","3","All the nations have drunk the wine of the passion of her immorality. The kings of the earth were immoral with her, and the merchants of the earth have grown wealthy from the extravagance of her luxury.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_4","096_18_4","REV","18","4","4","Then I heard another voice from heaven say: “Come out of her, My people, so that you will not share in her sins or contract any of her plagues. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_5","096_18_5","REV","18","5","5","For her sins are piled up to heaven, and God has remembered her iniquities. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_6","096_18_6","REV","18","6","6","Give back to her as she has done to others; pay her back double for what she has done; mix her a double portion in her own cup. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_7","096_18_7","REV","18","7","7","As much as she has glorified herself and lived in luxury, give her the same measure of torment and grief. In her heart she says, ‘I sit as queen; I am not a widow and will never see grief.’ ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_8","096_18_8","REV","18","8","8","Therefore her plagues will come in one day—death and grief and famine—and she will be consumed by fire, for mighty is the Lord God who judges her.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_9","096_18_9","REV","18","9","9","Then the kings of the earth who committed sexual immorality and lived in luxury with her will weep and wail at the sight of the smoke rising from the fire that consumes her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_10","096_18_10","REV","18","10","10","In fear of her torment, they will stand at a distance and cry out: “Woe, woe to the great city, the mighty city of Babylon! For in a single hour your judgment has come.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_11","096_18_11","REV","18","11","11","And the merchants of the earth will weep and mourn over her, because there is no one left to buy their cargo— ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_12","096_18_12","REV","18","12","12","cargo of gold, silver, precious stones, and pearls; of fine linen, purple, silk, and scarlet; of all kinds of citron wood and every article of ivory, precious wood, bronze, iron, and marble; ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_13","096_18_13","REV","18","13","13","of cinnamon, incense, myrrh, and frankincense; of wine, olive oil, fine flour, and wheat; of cattle, sheep, horses, and carriages; of bodies and souls of slaves. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_14","096_18_14","REV","18","14","14","And they will say: “The fruit of your soul’s desire has departed from you; all your luxury and splendor have vanished, never to be seen again.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_15","096_18_15","REV","18","15","15","The merchants who sold these things and gained their wealth from her will stand at a distance, in fear of her torment. They will weep and mourn, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_16","096_18_16","REV","18","16","16","saying: “Woe, woe to the great city, clothed in fine linen and purple and scarlet, adorned with gold and precious stones and pearls! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_17","096_18_17","REV","18","17","17","For in a single hour such fabulous wealth has been destroyed!” Every shipmaster, passenger, and sailor, and all who make their living from the sea, will stand at a distance ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_18","096_18_18","REV","18","18","18","and cry out at the sight of the smoke rising from the fire that consumes her. “What city was ever like this great city?” they will exclaim. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_19","096_18_19","REV","18","19","19","Then they will throw dust on their heads as they weep and mourn and cry out: “Woe, woe to the great city, where all who had ships on the sea were enriched by her wealth! For in a single hour she has been destroyed.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_20","096_18_20","REV","18","20","20","Rejoice over her, O heaven, and you saints and apostles and prophets, because God has pronounced for you His judgment against her. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_21","096_18_21","REV","18","21","21","Then a mighty angel picked up a stone the size of a great millstone and cast it into the sea, saying: “With such violence the great city of Babylon will be cast down, never to be seen again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_22","096_18_22","REV","18","22","22","And the sound of harpists and musicians, of flute players and trumpeters, will never ring out in you again. Nor will any craftsmen of any trade be found in you again, nor the sound of a millstone be heard in you again. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_23","096_18_23","REV","18","23","23","The light of a lamp will never shine in you again, and the voices of a bride and bridegroom will never call out in you again. For your merchants were the great ones of the earth, because all the nations were deceived by your sorcery.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV18_24","096_18_24","REV","18","24","24","And there was found in her the blood of prophets and saints, and of all who had been slain on the earth. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_1","096_19_1","REV","19","1","1","After this I heard a sound like the roar of a great multitude in heaven, shouting: “Hallelujah! Salvation and glory and power belong to our God! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_2","096_19_2","REV","19","2","2","For His judgments are true and just. He has judged the great prostitute who corrupted the earth with her immorality. He has avenged the blood of His servants that was poured out by her hand.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_3","096_19_3","REV","19","3","3","And a second time they called out: “Hallelujah! Her smoke rises forever and ever.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_4","096_19_4","REV","19","4","4","And the twenty-four elders and the four living creatures fell down and worshiped God who sits on the throne, saying: “Amen, Hallelujah!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_5","096_19_5","REV","19","5","5","Then a voice came from the throne, saying: “Praise our God, all you who serve Him, and those who fear Him, small and great alike!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_6","096_19_6","REV","19","6","6","And I heard a sound like the roar of a great multitude, like the rushing of many waters, and like a mighty rumbling of thunder, crying out: “Hallelujah! For the Lord our God the Almighty reigns. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_7","096_19_7","REV","19","7","7","Let us rejoice and be glad and give Him the glory. For the marriage of the Lamb has come, and His bride has made herself ready. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_8","096_19_8","REV","19","8","8","She was given clothing of fine linen, bright and pure.” For the fine linen she wears is the righteous acts of the saints. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_9","096_19_9","REV","19","9","9","Then the angel told me to write, “Blessed are those who are invited to the marriage supper of the Lamb.” And he said to me, “These are the true words of God.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_10","096_19_10","REV","19","10","10","So I fell at his feet to worship him. But he told me, “Do not do that! I am a fellow servant with you and your brothers who rely on the testimony of Jesus. Worship God! For the testimony of Jesus is the spirit of prophecy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_11","096_19_11","REV","19","11","11","Then I saw heaven standing open, and there before me was a white horse. And its rider is called Faithful and True. With righteousness He judges and wages war. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_12","096_19_12","REV","19","12","12","He has eyes like blazing fire, and many royal crowns on His head. He has names written on Him, and a name written that only He Himself knows. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_13","096_19_13","REV","19","13","13","He is dressed in a robe dipped in blood, and His name is The Word of God. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_14","096_19_14","REV","19","14","14","The armies of heaven, dressed in fine linen, white and pure, follow Him on white horses. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_15","096_19_15","REV","19","15","15","And from His mouth proceeds a sharp double-edged sword with which to strike down the nations, and He will rule them with an iron scepter. He treads the winepress of the fury of the wrath of God the Almighty. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_16","096_19_16","REV","19","16","16","And He has a name written on His robe and on His thigh: KING OF KINGS AND LORD OF LORDS. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_17","096_19_17","REV","19","17","17","Then I saw an angel standing in the sun, and he cried out in a loud voice to all the birds flying overhead, “Come, gather together for the great supper of God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_18","096_19_18","REV","19","18","18","so that you may eat the flesh of kings and commanders and mighty men, of horses and riders, of everyone both slave and free, both small and great.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_19","096_19_19","REV","19","19","19","Then I saw the beast and the kings of the earth with their armies assembled to wage war against the One seated on the horse, and against His army. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_20","096_19_20","REV","19","20","20","But the beast was captured along with the false prophet, who on its behalf had performed signs deceiving those who had the mark of the beast and worshiped its image. Both the beast and the false prophet were thrown alive into the fiery lake of burning sulfur. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV19_21","096_19_21","REV","19","21","21","And the rest were killed with the sword that proceeded from the mouth of the One seated on the horse. And all the birds gorged themselves on their flesh. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_1","096_20_1","REV","20","1","1","Then I saw an angel coming down from heaven with the key to the Abyss, holding in his hand a great chain. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_2","096_20_2","REV","20","2","2","He seized the dragon, that ancient serpent who is the devil and Satan, he who deceives the whole world, and bound him for a thousand years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_3","096_20_3","REV","20","3","3","And he threw him into the Abyss, shut it, and sealed it over him, so that he could not deceive the nations until the thousand years were complete. And after that, he must be released for a brief period of time. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_4","096_20_4","REV","20","4","4","Then I saw the thrones, and those seated on them had been given authority to judge. And I saw the souls of those who had been beheaded for their testimony of Jesus and for the word of God, and those who had not worshiped the beast or its image, and had not received its mark on their foreheads or hands. And they came to life and reigned with Christ for the thousand years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_5","096_20_5","REV","20","5","5","The rest of the dead did not come back to life until the thousand years were complete. This is the first resurrection. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_6","096_20_6","REV","20","6","6","Blessed and holy are those who share in the first resurrection! The second death has no power over them, but they will be priests of God and of Christ, and will reign with Him for a thousand years. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_7","096_20_7","REV","20","7","7","When the thousand years are complete, Satan will be released from his prison, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_8","096_20_8","REV","20","8","8","and will go out to deceive the nations in the four corners of the earth—Gog and Magog—to assemble them for battle. Their number is like the sand of the seashore. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_9","096_20_9","REV","20","9","9","And they marched across the broad expanse of the earth and surrounded the camp of the saints and the beloved city. But fire came down from God out of heaven and consumed them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_10","096_20_10","REV","20","10","10","And the devil who had deceived them was thrown into the lake of fire and sulfur, into which the beast and the false prophet had already been thrown. There they will be tormented day and night forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_11","096_20_11","REV","20","11","11","Then I saw a great white throne and the One seated on it. Earth and heaven fled from His presence, and no place was found for them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_12","096_20_12","REV","20","12","12","And I saw the dead, great and small, standing before the throne. And books were opened, and one of them was the Book of Life. And the dead were judged according to their deeds, as recorded in the books. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_13","096_20_13","REV","20","13","13","The sea gave up its dead, and Death and Hades gave up their dead, and each one was judged according to his deeds. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_14","096_20_14","REV","20","14","14","Then Death and Hades were thrown into the lake of fire. This is the second death—the lake of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV20_15","096_20_15","REV","20","15","15","And if anyone was found whose name was not written in the Book of Life, he was thrown into the lake of fire. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_1","096_21_1","REV","21","1","1","Then I saw a new heaven and a new earth, for the first heaven and earth had passed away, and the sea was no more. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_2","096_21_2","REV","21","2","2","I saw the holy city, the new Jerusalem, coming down out of heaven from God, prepared as a bride adorned for her husband. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_3","096_21_3","REV","21","3","3","And I heard a loud voice from heaven saying: “Behold, the dwelling place of God is with man, and He will dwell with them. They will be His people, and God Himself will be with them. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_4","096_21_4","REV","21","4","4","‘He will wipe away every tear from their eyes,’ and there will be no more death or mourning or crying or pain, for the former things have passed away.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_5","096_21_5","REV","21","5","5","And the One seated on the throne said, “Behold, I make all things new.” Then He said to me, “Write this down, for these words are true and faithful.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_6","096_21_6","REV","21","6","6","And He told me, “It is done! I am the Alpha and the Omega, the Beginning and the End. To the thirsty I will give freely from the spring of the water of life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_7","096_21_7","REV","21","7","7","The one who overcomes will inherit all things, and I will be his God, and he will be My son. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_8","096_21_8","REV","21","8","8","But to the cowardly and unbelieving and sinful and abominable and murderers and sexually immoral and sorcerers and idolaters and all liars, their place will be in the lake that burns with fire and sulfur. This is the second death.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_9","096_21_9","REV","21","9","9","Then one of the seven angels with the seven bowls full of the seven final plagues came and said to me, “Come, I will show you the bride, the wife of the Lamb.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_10","096_21_10","REV","21","10","10","And he carried me away in the Spirit to a mountain great and high, and showed me the great holy city of Jerusalem coming down out of heaven from God, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_11","096_21_11","REV","21","11","11","shining with the glory of God. Its radiance was like a most precious jewel, like a jasper, as clear as crystal. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_12","096_21_12","REV","21","12","12","The city had a great and high wall with twelve gates inscribed with the names of the twelve tribes of Israel, and twelve angels at the gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_13","096_21_13","REV","21","13","13","There were three gates on the east, three on the north, three on the south, and three on the west. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_14","096_21_14","REV","21","14","14","The wall of the city had twelve foundations bearing the names of the twelve apostles of the Lamb. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_15","096_21_15","REV","21","15","15","The angel who spoke with me had a golden measuring rod to measure the city and its gates and walls. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_16","096_21_16","REV","21","16","16","The city lies foursquare, with its width the same as its length. And he measured the city with the rod, and all its dimensions were equal—12,000 stadia in length and width and height. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_17","096_21_17","REV","21","17","17","And he measured its wall to be 144 cubits, by the human measure the angel was using. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_18","096_21_18","REV","21","18","18","The wall was made of jasper, and the city itself of pure gold, as pure as glass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_19","096_21_19","REV","21","19","19","The foundations of the city walls were adorned with every kind of precious stone: The first foundation was jasper, the second sapphire, the third chalcedony, the fourth emerald, ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_20","096_21_20","REV","21","20","20","the fifth sardonyx, the sixth carnelian, the seventh chrysolite, the eighth beryl, the ninth topaz, the tenth chrysoprase, the eleventh jacinth, and the twelfth amethyst. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_21","096_21_21","REV","21","21","21","And the twelve gates were twelve pearls, with each gate consisting of a single pearl. The main street of the city was pure gold, as clear as glass. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_22","096_21_22","REV","21","22","22","But I saw no temple in the city, because the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are its temple. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_23","096_21_23","REV","21","23","23","And the city has no need of sun or moon to shine on it, because the glory of God illuminates the city, and the Lamb is its lamp. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_24","096_21_24","REV","21","24","24","By its light the nations will walk, and into it the kings of the earth will bring their glory and the honor of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_25","096_21_25","REV","21","25","25","Its gates will never be shut at the end of the day, because there will be no night there. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_26","096_21_26","REV","21","26","26","And into the city will be brought the glory and honor of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV21_27","096_21_27","REV","21","27","27","But nothing unclean will ever enter it, nor anyone who practices an abomination or a lie, but only those whose names are written in the Lamb’s Book of Life. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_1","096_22_1","REV","22","1","1","Then the angel showed me a pure river of the water of life, as clear as crystal, flowing from the throne of God and of the Lamb ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_2","096_22_2","REV","22","2","2","down the middle of the main street of the city. On either side of the river stood a tree of life, bearing twelve kinds of fruit and yielding a fresh crop for each month. And the leaves of the tree are for the healing of the nations. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_3","096_22_3","REV","22","3","3","No longer will there be any curse. The throne of God and of the Lamb will be within the city, and His servants will worship Him. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_4","096_22_4","REV","22","4","4","They will see His face, and His name will be on their foreheads. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_5","096_22_5","REV","22","5","5","There will be no more night in the city, and they will have no need for the light of a lamp or of the sun. For the Lord God will shine on them, and they will reign forever and ever. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_6","096_22_6","REV","22","6","6","Then the angel said to me, “These words are faithful and true. The Lord, the God of the spirits of the prophets, has sent His angel to show His servants what must soon take place.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_7","096_22_7","REV","22","7","7","“Behold, I am coming soon. Blessed is the one who keeps the words of prophecy in this book.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_8","096_22_8","REV","22","8","8","And I, John, am the one who heard and saw these things. And when I had heard and seen them, I fell down to worship at the feet of the angel who had shown me these things. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_9","096_22_9","REV","22","9","9","But he said to me, “Do not do that! I am a fellow servant with you and your brothers the prophets, and with those who keep the words of this book. Worship God!” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_10","096_22_10","REV","22","10","10","Then he told me, “Do not seal up the words of prophecy in this book, because the time is near. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_11","096_22_11","REV","22","11","11","Let the unrighteous continue to be unrighteous, and the vile continue to be vile; let the righteous continue to practice righteousness, and the holy continue to be holy.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_12","096_22_12","REV","22","12","12","“Behold, I am coming soon, and My reward is with Me, to give to each one according to what he has done. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_13","096_22_13","REV","22","13","13","I am the Alpha and the Omega, the First and the Last, the Beginning and the End.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_14","096_22_14","REV","22","14","14","Blessed are those who do His commandments, so that they may have the right to the tree of life and may enter the city by its gates. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_15","096_22_15","REV","22","15","15","But outside are the dogs, the sorcerers, the sexually immoral, the murderers, the idolaters, and everyone who loves and practices falsehood. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_16","096_22_16","REV","22","16","16","“I, Jesus, have sent My angel to give you this testimony for the churches. I am the Root and the Offspring of David, the bright Morning Star.” ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_17","096_22_17","REV","22","17","17","The Spirit and the bride say, “Come!” Let the one who hears say, “Come!” And let the one who is thirsty come, and the one who desires the water of life drink freely. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_18","096_22_18","REV","22","18","18","I testify to everyone who hears the words of prophecy in this book: If anyone adds to them, God will add to him the plagues described in this book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_19","096_22_19","REV","22","19","19","And if anyone takes away from the words of this book of prophecy, may God take away his share in the tree of life and the holy city, which are described in this book. ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_20","096_22_20","REV","22","20","20","He who testifies to these things says, “Yes, I am coming soon.” Amen. Yes, come, Lord Jesus! ");
INSERT INTO engmsb_vpl VALUES ("RV22_21","096_22_21","REV","22","21","21","The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with all the saints. Amen. ");
